msgctxt "h64495d7fg202eg493dg851fgf4b8a4b946a9"
msgid "Broken! Don't worry, it's safe."
msgstr "망가져 있군. 걱정 마. 안전하니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Forest_VB_Trap
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = afddbbb1-2cc4-a3eb-d001-3ec16f1cfbe2
