#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_LaezelDead:d675ab4b-d5cb-2a37-ea81-6d511fc68a36
msgctxt "h4271214egfd53g45bagbb13g4a71a26ca297"
msgid "And mind the goblin traps, unless you relish a spit-roasting."
msgstr "그리고 고블린 놈들 함정 조심해. 꼬챙이구이 신세 되고 싶지 않다면 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_LaezelDead
#. Speaker = Damays
#. NodeID = d772df9b-036a-3cb1-2200-59a14ac3f242
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 791d2ac2-57c9-e5cd-f6f1-3d7fcff1889c_Grove = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_LaezelDead:d772df9b-036a-3cb1-2200-59a14ac3f242
msgctxt "h5eb35e4cg1c17g4f3fgb7d8g2d25a68177d4"
msgid "You didn't hear it? Shook our camp good, so we came for a look."
msgstr "그쪽은 못 들은 거야? 온 야영지가 뒤흔들릴 정도였지. 우린 그걸 살피러 나왔어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_LaezelDead
#. Speaker = Damays
#. NodeID = d7f9acbb-b051-5873-4ec2-bb538098ff35
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_LaezelDead:d7f9acbb-b051-5873-4ec2-bb538098ff35
msgctxt "h705c5961g917eg4b6dgbe07g2865d32c9540"
msgid "And mind the goblin traps, unless you relish a spit-roasting."
msgstr "그리고 고블린 놈들 함정 조심해. 꼬챙이구이 신세 되고 싶지 않다면 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_LaezelDead
#. Speaker = Damays
#. NodeID = e6860793-428c-2fa5-ba92-9e2ecf56f053
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_Event_RevealedGroveLocation = True
#.     - DEN_Apprentice_Knows_HeardAboutNettie_PartialInfo = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Apprentice.LearnedNettieNearby(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_LaezelDead:e6860793-428c-2fa5-ba92-9e2ecf56f053
msgctxt "he6a599c9gd1c1g4eb6gb902g9d779f3fa835"
msgid "North-west. Look for Nettie. Whatever your wound, she can mend it."
msgstr "북서쪽으로 가. 네티를 찾으라고. 어떤 상처를 입었든, 그 여자가 고쳐줄 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_LaezelDead
#. Speaker = Damays
#. NodeID = e75de1da-60e1-80b1-0088-02410ba9423c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 791d2ac2-57c9-e5cd-f6f1-3d7fcff1889c_Grove = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_LaezelDead:e75de1da-60e1-80b1-0088-02410ba9423c
msgctxt "h1b125a9egb326g42d3gabd3geb2f8db5c854"
msgid "You didn't hear it? Shook our camp good, so I came for a look."
msgstr "그쪽은 못 들은 거야? 온 야영지가 뒤흔들릴 정도였지. 난 그걸 살피러 나왔어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_LaezelDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eeaabddb-2865-9745-1155-4a661f8a719f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_LaezelDead:eeaabddb-2865-9745-1155-4a661f8a719f
msgctxt "h5ff5387dgff32g469cg80e0g34694cda1c64"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_LaezelDead
#. Speaker = Damays
#. NodeID = f3f9a0f1-8206-5641-9ec7-65c3f48b946b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_LaezelDead:f3f9a0f1-8206-5641-9ec7-65c3f48b946b
msgctxt "h47d11904ge959g4360g96feg95f395fac834"
msgid "But I've got to go. I need to check out that blast."
msgstr "난 이만 가봐야겠어. 그 폭발을 확인해 봐야 하거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_LaezelDead
#. Speaker = Damays
#. NodeID = f5623fa1-de51-8bf6-aeaf-216fd3df0598
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_LaezelDead:f5623fa1-de51-8bf6-aeaf-216fd3df0598
msgctxt "h85533fd8g5677g41c9g9db3g67c300f708ca"
msgid "Nymessa. Come."
msgstr "나이메사. 가자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Nymessa
#. NodeID = 008014ea-23a6-022f-e7b8-46afefb5b440
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruit.IntimidatedLeave(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:008014ea-23a6-022f-e7b8-46afefb5b440
msgctxt "hb6d5fdcdga539g4950ga1fcg52f9847a9a84"
msgid "Damays..."
msgstr "다메이스..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 01426f6e-01d2-67bd-bfd8-0b6b37d2996b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 7
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(3) = False
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(3) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 4b9219b6-9074-0463-e4e0-1ff4c30e087b_SkippedHelp = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:01426f6e-01d2-67bd-bfd8-0b6b37d2996b
msgctxt "hacdf9dbegb997g4e0egb055g8ea172391bdd"
msgid "Shoot the trap down. We must kill it before it harms someone."
msgstr "함정을 쏴 떨어뜨려. 저게 누군가를 해치기 전에 죽여 버려야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Damays
#. NodeID = 01569e5f-0d53-31a8-5d83-668b3438e2e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_Event_PersuadedKillLaezel = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:01569e5f-0d53-31a8-5d83-668b3438e2e1
msgctxt "hce011001g14f4g437eg951eg38ceaa4310b6"
msgid "You're right. No one's safe if that thing goes loose."
msgstr "맞는 말이군. 저게 도망이라도 치면 모두가 위험해지겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 033857b0-809b-78fd-6204-43da20c92cc1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:033857b0-809b-78fd-6204-43da20c92cc1
msgctxt "hf49958edg3dedg46b2gae11g3880099f0e93"
msgid "*And you feel answers. She knows more about your condition.*"
msgstr "*그리고 해답이 느껴집니다. 저쪽은 당신의 상태에 관해 잘 알고 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 0c043773-b1d5-7b0f-53ba-2058d8a270d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:0c043773-b1d5-7b0f-53ba-2058d8a270d7
msgctxt "h8a291c64gd33dg4ea3g84e5g9970fa3213b2"
msgid "Never."
msgstr "헛소리."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0f34527a-d0dd-2eb5-cb09-bcbc6620898d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:0f34527a-d0dd-2eb5-cb09-bcbc6620898d
msgctxt "h1ad8bab0g2226g46fbg82cfg03666f83a6bf"
msgid ""
"*Your skull pounds in response to the prisoner's white-hot stare. Her lips "
"don't move, yet you hear her voice.*"
msgstr "*잡혀 있는 여자의 강렬한 눈빛에 반응하며 두개골이 진동합니다. 입도 벙긋하지 않지만, 목소리가 들리는군요.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 11edf65a-dd6c-42fc-1593-cd2b64e66f66
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRA_LaezelRecruitment_State_AskedSayPlease = False
#.      - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_Event_TieflingsLeaveAlone = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRA_LaezelRecruitment_State_AskedSayPlease = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:11edf65a-dd6c-42fc-1593-cd2b64e66f66
msgctxt "h4222bc0ag58e9g4cd3ga849g614bc9919790"
msgid "It will be done."
msgstr "그럴 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Nymessa
#. NodeID = 12b22161-8843-af86-1ee6-833467d4f238
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_Quest_FailedPersuasion = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:12b22161-8843-af86-1ee6-833467d4f238
msgctxt "hb4973f94g251dg4826g87e7g0279aedd10d9"
msgid "No. I'm not leaving this fiend with a stranger."
msgstr "아니. 이 마족을 생판 모르는 남한테 맡길 생각 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 163c8b51-790e-3854-ce79-cd1bf9b4f94c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:163c8b51-790e-3854-ce79-cd1bf9b4f94c
msgctxt "h400d87b7g8d1fg40acg9f19g5408f2d77003"
msgid "*The captive's mouth is still, yet her voice is clear.*"
msgstr "*포로는 입을 다물고 있지만, 그 목소리가 또렷이 들립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Damays
#. NodeID = 16e92092-fe45-c5df-553f-39125aa689a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DROWELF(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:16e92092-fe45-c5df-553f-39125aa689a3
msgctxt "h9c83739bg3ddbg41c7g8892gbeab4fe98159"
msgid "Holy hells. <i>Under-elf.</i>"
msgstr "이런 망할. <i>언더 엘프잖아.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 171e6128-5120-bd04-6a6d-d7f327003623
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_MindMeld(3) = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruit.LearnedCure(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:171e6128-5120-bd04-6a6d-d7f327003623
msgctxt "h16a79029gd169g4f18g8d64g9dd0cdca751d"
msgid "<i>I know what grows inside you. And I know of a cure.</i>"
msgstr "<i>네 안에서 자라고 있는 게 뭔지 안다. 그 치유법도 알고 있고.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1783541c-74c6-05ac-2026-fa68351a2131
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(3) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 4b9219b6-9074-0463-e4e0-1ff4c30e087b_SkippedHelp = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:1783541c-74c6-05ac-2026-fa68351a2131
msgctxt "hcf6d83e7g6da7g4fcag9de5g8b0f7c822ae8"
msgid "A githyanki. She ought to be killed, here and now."
msgstr "기스양키군. 저년은 바로 이 자리에서 없애버려야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Damays
#. NodeID = 17c3649e-8a0b-c6b5-824f-f3c25fe26b31
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_Quest_FailedPersuasion = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:17c3649e-8a0b-c6b5-824f-f3c25fe26b31
msgctxt "h1b691ad3g8f32g4d4fgbdd6g07661224582d"
msgid ""
"Can't be that clever - walked right into our trap. I'm taking it back to "
"camp - Zevlor will know what to do with it."
msgstr "그리 영리하진 않은데. 우리 함정에 곧장 걸려들었거든. 저건 야영지로 끌고 가겠어. 제블로어라면 어째야 할지 알겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Nymessa
#. NodeID = 1b550bb0-b2d7-45ee-54bb-d09c2b75e03c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_Event_TieflingSaidLowerTrap = True
#.      - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_Event_Tiefling2SaidLowerTrap = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:1b550bb0-b2d7-45ee-54bb-d09c2b75e03c
msgctxt "h9d64db55g1653g4852ga871g68985f2e2571"
msgid "I'm ready. Lower the trap."
msgstr "난 준비됐어. 함정을 떨궈."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1bee140f-4604-8efc-92e0-08cc505588af
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_MindMeld(3) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:1bee140f-4604-8efc-92e0-08cc505588af
msgctxt "h5f8a3220gbe75g4b71g8d9egbbefc87d34ea"
msgid "<i>Don't worry - I'll get him out of here, one way or another.</i>"
msgstr "<i>걱정 마. 무슨 수를 써서든 여기서 쫓아버릴 테니까.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Nymessa
#. NodeID = 20e88e6c-6f59-e167-235f-c01c64c9910f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_Quest_FailedPersuasion = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:20e88e6c-6f59-e167-235f-c01c64c9910f
msgctxt "h9bb84afag6a8dg41d9ga344gc05b8903a078"
msgid ""
"Can't be that clever - walked right into our trap. I'm taking it back to "
"camp - Zevlor will know what to do with it."
msgstr "그리 영리하진 않은데. 우리 함정에 곧장 걸려들었거든. 저건 야영지로 끌고 가겠어. 제블로어라면 어째야 할지 알겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Damays
#. NodeID = 21332736-2495-d58e-15bb-c1f5794743ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:21332736-2495-d58e-15bb-c1f5794743ad
msgctxt "h8b2cfaefg6298g49b4g8965g759f1e618aa3"
msgid "<i>Rat.</i>"
msgstr "<i>쥐새끼가.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Nymessa
#. NodeID = 24826b48-d232-4611-6559-138007083afa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:24826b48-d232-4611-6559-138007083afa
msgctxt "h1fd26ea2gcc7ag4544g9a3bg06a067db832e"
msgid "And be careful. There are goblin traps <i>everywhere</i>."
msgstr "그리고 조심해. <i>곳곳에</i> 고블린 함정이 깔려 있거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 257123ab-35fb-6ab5-218c-3b2672e7fa07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_MindMeld(3) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - TUT_TransformChamber_State_TriedToFree = False
#.   Local:
#.      - 4b9219b6-9074-0463-e4e0-1ff4c30e087b_SkippedHelp = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:257123ab-35fb-6ab5-218c-3b2672e7fa07
msgctxt "h618e46aeg845dg4662g9bedg13f35e19d074"
msgid "<i>Why should I help you?</i>"
msgstr "<i>내가 왜 널 도와야 하지?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 25fc3610-8fd7-9cff-2051-827b259cd7ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:25fc3610-8fd7-9cff-2051-827b259cd7ec
msgctxt "h9db80aefgc0e6g426cg9a7dg1532d3be5a13"
msgid "If you value your life, walk away."
msgstr "목숨이 아깝다면 여길 떠나시지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 266fc088-cd7d-5199-3f91-daeaf9444625
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 7
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:266fc088-cd7d-5199-3f91-daeaf9444625
msgctxt "h2398f94dg767ag44f4gb164gf67b5e627d0f"
msgid ""
"She's an intelligent creature, not a beast to be trapped. Cut her down, and "
"converse with her."
msgstr "저 여자는 지성을 가진 존재야. 함정에 가둬 둘 짐승이 아니라고. 저 여자를 내려주고 얘기를 나눠 봐."

