msgid ""
"We can't trust her - her kin nearly got us killed when they attacked the "
"nautiloid."
msgstr "쟤는 믿을 수 없어. 쟤 동족이 노틸로이드를 공격했을 때 우리까지 죽여버릴 뻔했잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
