msgctxt "h9988da27gcaf0g4edeg9c92g8c5071f3277d"
msgid "No. We take it to camp. Zevlor will know what to do with it."
msgstr "아니. 야영지로 끌고 가겠어. 제블로어라면 어째야 할지 알겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Nymessa
#. NodeID = 4d9770ef-455d-4621-b598-5f5662992a2c
