msgid "<i>Converse </i>with it? I barely know what <i>it</i> is!"
msgstr "<i>얘기</i>를 나눠? 난 <i>저게</i> 뭔 종자인지조차 모른다고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
