msgstr "함정을 쏴 떨어뜨려. 저게 누군가를 해치기 전에 내가 찢어발겨주겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5de3363d-a35a-4173-5ef3-6d283cf37773
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:5de3363d-a35a-4173-5ef3-6d283cf37773
msgctxt "h3c777c0ege11eg4294gb7f7gafe3efa2509a"
msgid "A blast? Care to be more specific?"
msgstr "폭발이라고? 좀 더 자세히 알려줄 수 있어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Damays
#. NodeID = 6171c0a5-96e8-e68c-7034-9f9b71b95e40
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:6171c0a5-96e8-e68c-7034-9f9b71b95e40
msgctxt "h3ebad45bg02b3g4f11gacb0g0d7394a19972"
msgid "Can't be that clever - walked right into our trap."
msgstr "그리 영리하진 않은데. 우리 함정에 곧장 걸려들었거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Nymessa
#. NodeID = 62477d54-f405-4598-ec90-55e49532bee0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:62477d54-f405-4598-ec90-55e49532bee0
msgctxt "h80185f0dgda84g47d6g87ccgf3d3ef3f7174"
msgid "Find refuge elsewhere. We've enough mouths to feed."
msgstr "피난처라면 딴 곳 알아봐. 먹일 입 더 느는 건 사절이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Damays
#. NodeID = 6302707b-ffeb-c3ea-5f12-c9a674337dec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:6302707b-ffeb-c3ea-5f12-c9a674337dec
msgctxt "h88c712bfg4ee3g4f05gb773g094edc82fd6b"
msgid "Blades high, Nymessa."
msgstr "무기 들어, 나이메사."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 64cf35fb-754c-1ee2-d59c-ab1e3fa44ced
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:64cf35fb-754c-1ee2-d59c-ab1e3fa44ced
msgctxt "h2e8945c3g1efcg47bega099gb236b1d97c24"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6668a80b-7874-0b56-5e77-8435a60011cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(3) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 4b9219b6-9074-0463-e4e0-1ff4c30e087b_SkippedHelp = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:6668a80b-7874-0b56-5e77-8435a60011cc
msgctxt "h3ec0244fg4fccg4ec9gbf52gc749b0eea9a4"
msgid "A githyanki. She ought to be killed, here and now."
msgstr "기스양키군. 저년은 바로 이 자리에서 없애버려야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Damays
#. NodeID = 687e3149-887f-4977-96c7-0e57d9b9e55d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:687e3149-887f-4977-96c7-0e57d9b9e55d
msgctxt "h3d00a897ga6e2g49bfgbdccgcb3e36392a75"
msgid "And be careful. There are goblin traps <i>everywhere</i>."
msgstr "그리고 조심해. <i>곳곳에</i> 고블린 함정이 깔려 있거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6b20f489-19c0-e7a0-5b50-716206d677c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_State_Tiefling1Missing = True
#.      - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_State_Tiefling2Missing = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruit.StartedAlt(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:6b20f489-19c0-e7a0-5b50-716206d677c3
msgctxt "h7a897ea2g3165g4d59ga221gf24181d9e6bb"
msgid ""
"*Your skull pounds in response to the prisoner's white-hot stare. Her lips "
"don't move, yet you hear her voice.*"
msgstr "*잡혀 있는 여자의 강렬한 눈빛에 반응하며 두개골이 진동합니다. 입도 벙긋하지 않지만, 목소리가 들리는군요.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Damays
#. NodeID = 6c6df960-1917-6bcf-73c8-b45cb55eba1e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_Quest_FailedPersuasion = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:6c6df960-1917-6bcf-73c8-b45cb55eba1e
msgctxt "ha9755da2gb41cg43a5g80dcg80683a6191cb"
msgid "No. I'm not leaving this fiend with a stranger."
msgstr "아니. 이 마족을 생판 모르는 남한테 맡길 생각 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Damays
#. NodeID = 6e4e8845-091d-d9a1-080d-0f4007c04331
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:6e4e8845-091d-d9a1-080d-0f4007c04331
msgctxt "hb060a87eg62b4g43e6g92fbgcb7bb39cd837"
msgid "Holy hells. Another one."
msgstr "이런 망할. 동족이 있었잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Damays
#. NodeID = 71df2f3d-2828-b717-3826-70ae9c7a7f14
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_Event_TieflingsLeaveAlone = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruit.IntimidatedLeaveAlt(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:71df2f3d-2828-b717-3826-70ae9c7a7f14
msgctxt "h43cba5a1g2663g44c7g84dfg533427199caf"
msgid "You needn't ask twice."
msgstr "알았으니까 채근하지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Nymessa
#. NodeID = 722bb5d3-c01f-5c22-a52b-c8df79728b45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_SituationHasMet1 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:722bb5d3-c01f-5c22-a52b-c8df79728b45
msgctxt "he7317dd9g12e9g47a5g8332g25725bbf23a3"
msgid "Leave it alone, Damays."
msgstr "내버려 두자, 다메이스."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Nymessa
#. NodeID = 738307cb-0053-9615-3bd1-e4df39cb4369
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_Event_PersuadedKillLaezel = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:738307cb-0053-9615-3bd1-e4df39cb4369
msgctxt "h3f63ad06gf947g441cgb9bbgcfce0d71e88b"
msgid "You're right. No one's safe if that thing goes loose."
msgstr "맞는 말이네. 저게 도망이라도 치면 모두가 위험해지겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Nymessa
#. NodeID = 73b3ad55-58ff-3ccc-5550-751b2e2f9915
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:73b3ad55-58ff-3ccc-5550-751b2e2f9915
msgctxt "hb6442552gba4ag4a54g9e32g6ceb4a6514aa"
msgid "Holy hells. <i>Under-dwarf.</i>"
msgstr "이런 망할. <i>언더 드워프잖아.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Damays
#. NodeID = 773bcebc-fc18-ce50-693a-7cbed469b561
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_Event_TieflingsLeaveAlone = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruit.PersuadedLeaveAlt(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:773bcebc-fc18-ce50-693a-7cbed469b561
msgctxt "h17818da5g1b68g4635g9483g5e3250361f84"
msgid "You're right. I need to go check out that blast."
msgstr "맞는 말이군. 그 폭발이나 확인하러 가봐야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 77eb1601-729f-121a-48f6-c5c00a407d0b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(3) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 4b9219b6-9074-0463-e4e0-1ff4c30e087b_SkippedHelp = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:77eb1601-729f-121a-48f6-c5c00a407d0b
msgctxt "hb4234094g0709g4206g878agef6801fc0783"
msgid "This creature is dangerous. Get out of here - leave it to me!"
msgstr "저건 위험한 존재라고. 나한테 맡기고 여길 떠나!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 7ccc2463-4566-11f8-dd60-91c69330a293
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(3) = False
#.      - DUERGARDWARF(3) = False
#.      - DROWELF(3) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:7ccc2463-4566-11f8-dd60-91c69330a293
msgctxt "h255aa1fdgb89cg4680g963cg65b1aa89f39b"
msgid "<i>Get rid of her.</i>"
msgstr "<i>저년을 없애.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Damays
#. NodeID = 7e87af18-fcae-3154-e3dd-70b0f8380bb2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_Quest_FailedPersuasion = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:7e87af18-fcae-3154-e3dd-70b0f8380bb2
msgctxt "h02f7363cgccb8g4254g92ddg704e1e99ff76"
msgid "No. I'm taking it to camp. Zevlor will know what to do with it."
msgstr "아니. 저건 야영지로 끌고 갈 거야. 제블로어라면 어째야 할지 알겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Damays
#. NodeID = 80ac0e01-114b-fb4f-4189-11f9b5396e5c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 4b9219b6-9074-0463-e4e0-1ff4c30e087b_Grove = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:80ac0e01-114b-fb4f-4189-11f9b5396e5c
msgctxt "h98b7bd67gb599g4363g8f98g9997a2ec916f"
msgid "You didn't hear it? Shook our camp good, so we came for a look."
msgstr "그쪽은 못 들었어? 온 야영지가 뒤흔들릴 정도였지. 우린 그걸 살피러 나온 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 830af8fd-872c-bee5-1621-12a3642a3069
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(3) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 4b9219b6-9074-0463-e4e0-1ff4c30e087b_SkippedHelp = True
#. TagRule: BARBARIAN
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:830af8fd-872c-bee5-1621-12a3642a3069
msgctxt "h4199a673gb7a7g4076gb261g357232129de1"
msgid "Shoot the trap down. I'll tear it apart before anyone else gets hurt."
msgstr "함정을 쏴 떨어뜨려. 저게 누군가를 해치기 전에 내가 찢어발겨주겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 830af8fd-872c-bee5-1621-12a3642a3069
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(3) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 4b9219b6-9074-0463-e4e0-1ff4c30e087b_SkippedHelp = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:830af8fd-872c-bee5-1621-12a3642a3069
msgctxt "h5dbe9909g722fg4f98gacb2g739fcb6ac359"
msgid "Shoot the trap down. We must kill it before it harms someone."
msgstr "함정을 쏴 떨어뜨려. 저게 누군가를 해치기 전에 죽여 버려야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Damays
#. NodeID = 8593a0bc-8c74-4698-f055-4ecba3bfcf29
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(3) = False
#.      - DUERGARDWARF(3) = False
#.      - DROWELF(3) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:8593a0bc-8c74-4698-f055-4ecba3bfcf29
msgctxt "h27c99108gd8c3g4753gb9fbg6ae4b1491e72"
msgid "And if it escapes? How will you - Oh! A guest."
msgstr "그랬다가 탈출하면? 그땐 어떻게, 오! 손님이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Nymessa
#. NodeID = 865cbbf2-9732-9056-4a0e-0dd8b6058651
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_Event_TieflingsLeaveAlone = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruit.IntimidatedLeaveAlt(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:865cbbf2-9732-9056-4a0e-0dd8b6058651
msgctxt "h6ed1546eg41e5g4f9ag95feg3dabd5e01d4e"
msgid "You needn't ask twice."
msgstr "알았으니까 채근하지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Nymessa
#. NodeID = 895f499c-384b-20cc-037c-490fd514122b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_Tiefling2HasMet(3) = True
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_Tiefling1HasMet(3) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Laezel_HasMet = True
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_Laezel_State_StartedTieflingsSceneAtCage(3) = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruit.Started(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:895f499c-384b-20cc-037c-490fd514122b
msgctxt "h34577bb6g71dbg46e6g84b4g261a73eeebfc"
msgid "The thing's dangerous. Leave it for the goblins to kill."
msgstr "위험한 종자야. 고블린들이 죽이게 내버려 두자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Damays
#. NodeID = 89f21566-a576-a16c-18a0-35bc183f5943
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_Event_TieflingsLeaveAlone = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruit.PersuadedLeave(3) = True
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:89f21566-a576-a16c-18a0-35bc183f5943
msgctxt "hd77e3b06gcec3g4652gb114g2ea3a1e18220"
msgid "He's right. Let's go - we need to check out that blast."
msgstr "맞는 말이군. 이만 가자. 그 폭발에 관해 알아봐야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Damays
#. NodeID = 89f21566-a576-a16c-18a0-35bc183f5943
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_Event_TieflingsLeaveAlone = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruit.PersuadedLeave(3) = True
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:89f21566-a576-a16c-18a0-35bc183f5943
msgctxt "hca35c797gfe3bg47fdga4fcg1b51cbd6d066"
msgid "She's right. Let's go - we need to check out that blast."
msgstr "맞는 말이군. 이만 가자. 그 폭발에 관해 알아봐야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Damays
#. NodeID = 89f21566-a576-a16c-18a0-35bc183f5943
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_Event_TieflingsLeaveAlone = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruit.PersuadedLeave(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:89f21566-a576-a16c-18a0-35bc183f5943
msgctxt "h201aa1e8gab22g4b19gab90gdabbbde63ec1"
msgid "They're right. No one's safe if that thing goes loose."
msgstr "맞는 말이군. 저런 게 풀려나기라도 하면 무사할 수가 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8b94bbef-db4a-4907-9a60-7f25acb059aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
