#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:b7b2b3a9-4773-fe33-581d-81a40102d323
msgctxt "h46c2dcc4g980ag4232gafceg8549a8eefeff"
msgid "A githyanki. She ought to be killed, here and now."
msgstr "기스양키군. 저년은 바로 이 자리에서 없애버려야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Damays
#. NodeID = b7b9f556-675c-d80f-d6fe-50025fc64bb9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_Event_TieflingsLeaveAlone = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:b7b9f556-675c-d80f-d6fe-50025fc64bb9
msgctxt "h593a4e37gc9e9g439eg8cfdg98a2c353c5da"
msgid "Come, Nymessa. <i>Now.</i>"
msgstr "가자, 나이메사. <i>당장.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Damays
#. NodeID = b8d3c561-b566-45d8-b1f3-714c1ad9f277
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_Event_WagonPosition = True
#.      - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_SituationHasMet1 = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:b8d3c561-b566-45d8-b1f3-714c1ad9f277
msgctxt "ha88aecdag9ee0g468bg9495gdc3fa09f195e"
msgid "Zorru was right. Yellow as a toad, and twice as ugly."
msgstr "조르 말이 맞았어. 두꺼비처럼 누렇고, 그보다 두 배는 못생겼군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Nymessa
#. NodeID = b932f36f-2d7d-2fa5-2514-e22d3f07d90e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:b932f36f-2d7d-2fa5-2514-e22d3f07d90e
msgctxt "h99bc8d89gfd6eg4b53g90a4g787ccddbe00b"
msgid "<i>Damays?</i>"
msgstr "<i>다메이스?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ba4784fa-304a-ce4e-dfc6-3365d44634dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_SituationHasMet1 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:ba4784fa-304a-ce4e-dfc6-3365d44634dd
msgctxt "hda3a4f7fg97ebg47b0g98d7g4ce73702ce1e"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Damays
#. NodeID = bd985410-fa6b-9eec-810e-09019595d79d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_Event_RevealedGroveLocation = True
#.     - DEN_Apprentice_Knows_HeardAboutNettie_PartialInfo = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Apprentice.LearnedNettieNearby(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:bd985410-fa6b-9eec-810e-09019595d79d
msgctxt "hbd11864dgf9c4g464cga572gf92b18f45e79"
msgid "North-west. Look for Nettie. Whatever your wound, she can mend it."
msgstr "북서쪽으로 가. 네티를 찾으라고. 어떤 상처를 입었든, 그 여자가 고쳐줄 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = be7452e6-3ba9-6ac7-1664-43d042c7fa20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TUT_TransformChamber_State_LaezelRushed = True
#.      - TUT_TransformChamber_HasMet_PodGirl = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:be7452e6-3ba9-6ac7-1664-43d042c7fa20
msgctxt "h8c57cf2bg7166g4a27g8283g11fe642b1fad"
msgid ""
"Remember how keen she was to leave me to die on the nautiloid? We can't "
"trust her."
msgstr "노틸로이드에서 쟤가 날 죽게 내버려 두자고 열심히 군 거 기억나? 믿을 수 없는 년이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Damays
#. NodeID = c0cec3be-6412-b399-e254-78faa00faad1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_Event_TieflingSaidLowerTrap = True
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_Event_Tiefling2SaidLowerTrap = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruit.PersuadedKillAlt(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:c0cec3be-6412-b399-e254-78faa00faad1
msgctxt "h5d658866g2830g4f0bgaf8fg28389b92541c"
msgid "Lower the trap and ready yourself."
msgstr "함정을 내리고 싸울 준비 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c1b62e86-1679-ff6c-bcfe-7faf5bf56261
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(3) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 4b9219b6-9074-0463-e4e0-1ff4c30e087b_SkippedHelp = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:c1b62e86-1679-ff6c-bcfe-7faf5bf56261
msgctxt "hfbe7fd98gc897g437fgb9eaga5bb943368ee"
msgid ""
"Your quarry looks dangerous, but I've handled worse. Leave it to me, get to "
"safety."
msgstr "그쪽 사냥감은 위험해 보이는군. 하지만 나는 더 위험한 녀석도 다뤄봤지. 저건 나한테 맡기고 안전한 데로 가."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = c28fb387-4074-52a7-a027-5043e19f8961
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:c28fb387-4074-52a7-a027-5043e19f8961
msgctxt "h6a5e3adegdd33g4ba1ga4e7gcf3e8c157c25"
msgid "<i>Kill him.</i>"
msgstr "<i>놈을 죽여.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Nymessa
#. NodeID = c425071f-8524-e588-bbc6-5bc5b97ef30e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_Event_TieflingsHostile = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruit.FailedIntimidationAlt(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:c425071f-8524-e588-bbc6-5bc5b97ef30e
msgctxt "hec1f207cgf166g4b99gb018g0c4f4fe8cda0"
msgid "Not happening!"
msgstr "누구 맘대로!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = c5ede736-dd60-fcde-2baf-70a1e75dd273
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:c5ede736-dd60-fcde-2baf-70a1e75dd273
msgctxt "hb8b9ffc6gcf5bg4ee7g8ce4g2dcfcbb6d1de"
msgid "Enough gawking - get me down."
msgstr "그만 쳐다보고 내려 주기나 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Damays
#. NodeID = c97e7648-2759-6c01-7eaf-30aabcf645f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_Event_TieflingsGetLaeZel = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:c97e7648-2759-6c01-7eaf-30aabcf645f5
msgctxt "h84e9f40dg64deg4541g9d98g68200af09936"
msgid "You're with me, toad."
msgstr "넌 나랑 간다, 두꺼비."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cacf131e-80c8-15e2-4c51-703cf24f9e80
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:cacf131e-80c8-15e2-4c51-703cf24f9e80
msgctxt "h132f11aegb8d5g489eg92bdg39766fffee4d"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ccd21114-100c-a0fe-44ab-c77777c7bd4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 7
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:ccd21114-100c-a0fe-44ab-c77777c7bd4f
msgctxt "h456e203ag8aaeg4808g9aefg5fc71ca5caa4"
msgid ""
"Oh, gods! You've caught a scout; the gith invasion force is right behind me -"
" save yourself!"
msgstr "이런, 맙소사! 놈들 정찰병을 잡았잖아. 기스 침략자들이 지척에 있어. 살고 싶으면 도망치라고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ccd88a6b-d364-383b-690e-93cd74455ac4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 7
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(3) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 4b9219b6-9074-0463-e4e0-1ff4c30e087b_SkippedHelp = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:ccd88a6b-d364-383b-690e-93cd74455ac4
msgctxt "h6dd63a2agee3fg4cd0g9d83g7fff430eba4c"
msgid "This creature is dangerous. Get out of here - leave it to me!"
msgstr "저건 위험한 존재라고. 나한테 맡기고 여길 떠나!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce6d2525-c230-81cb-59f8-4b5090dfda60
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_MindMeld(3) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:ce6d2525-c230-81cb-59f8-4b5090dfda60
msgctxt "h3c26876cgf3e3g435dgb869ge8895d40ba07"
msgid "<i>Don't worry - I'll get them out of here, one way or another.</i>"
msgstr "<i>걱정 마. 무슨 수를 써서든 여기서 쫓아버릴 테니까.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d037954f-4c60-b084-3045-92e518044d1c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:d037954f-4c60-b084-3045-92e518044d1c
msgctxt "h87ce858agc75bg45c4g88b2gd62ec78b1f4f"
msgid "A blast? Care to be more specific?"
msgstr "폭발이라고? 좀 더 자세히 알려줄 수 있어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Nymessa
#. NodeID = d0f1d112-8de1-3d24-0db3-cf80e7d4dae9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_Event_TieflingsLeaveAlone = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruit.PersuadedLeaveAlt(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:d0f1d112-8de1-3d24-0db3-cf80e7d4dae9
msgctxt "h984db770gf9eeg4fcegbcfbge72647e050b0"
msgid "You're right. I need to go check out that blast."
msgstr "맞는 말이네. 그 폭발이나 확인하러 가봐야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d16eddb0-aafd-b400-7177-415462439c68
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(3) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 4b9219b6-9074-0463-e4e0-1ff4c30e087b_SkippedHelp = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:d16eddb0-aafd-b400-7177-415462439c68
msgctxt "h9642805bg6f8ag47ccgb172g8a8af16b3e55"
msgid "This creature is dangerous. Get out of here - leave it to me!"
msgstr "저건 위험한 존재라고. 나한테 맡기고 여길 떠나!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Damays
#. NodeID = d2f14018-35f7-165f-990a-44854f4edf4b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_Event_BothTieflingsLowerTrap = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - CHA_LaezelRecruit.PersuadedKill(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:d2f14018-35f7-165f-990a-44854f4edf4b
msgctxt "h8acee5f3g63ccg4e2egacb8ge7e42b4ee3eb"
msgid "<i>Enough.</i> Lower the trap. Ready your blade."
msgstr "<i>그만.</i> 함정 내려. 무기 준비하고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Nymessa
#. NodeID = d50b96ae-ce9a-cbb7-0b11-5428c5b1c727
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:d50b96ae-ce9a-cbb7-0b11-5428c5b1c727
msgctxt "h56458ef1gd4d8g4c18gaa6bg8c651211f18e"
msgid "Hells, this isn't worth it. I'm out of here."
msgstr "망할, 이건 보람 없는 짓이네. 난 여길 뜨겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d575e738-9d0a-36a2-1081-3846e53b3fe8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRA_LaezelRecruitment_State_AskedSayPlease = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRA_LaezelRecruitment_State_AskedSayPlease = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:d575e738-9d0a-36a2-1081-3846e53b3fe8
msgctxt "h0d7295d2g3e54g45f4g8106g32d3f9665cc3"
msgid "Say 'please'."
msgstr "'제발' 이라고 하면."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d5c73f79-f1be-fc2f-aaf8-b70631335642
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 4b9219b6-9074-0463-e4e0-1ff4c30e087b_Grove = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:d5c73f79-f1be-fc2f-aaf8-b70631335642
msgctxt "h4bcd8d81gd11ag457eg8e74g4814c4f4a3b1"
msgid "I'm in dire need of healing. Where is this camp?"
msgstr "내가 지금 치료가 급한 상황이거든. 그쪽 야영지는 어디 있어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Damays
#. NodeID = d71bbb2b-ba87-2e4f-cf94-7ce5e72f901e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_Event_ArchPosition = True
#.      - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_SituationHasMet1 = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:d71bbb2b-ba87-2e4f-cf94-7ce5e72f901e
msgctxt "hed5c8c8egf62dg4af5gbc49g564915511392"
msgid "Zorru was right. Yellow as a toad, and twice as ugly."
msgstr "조르 말이 맞았어. 두꺼비처럼 누렇고, 그보다 두 배는 못생겼군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dc5946f3-2515-35be-47f2-1a86bdc8be20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:dc5946f3-2515-35be-47f2-1a86bdc8be20
msgctxt "h23c761ecg755eg4bc3g89f6g0352658b92be"
msgid "<i>Meet the prisoner's glare.</i>"
msgstr "<i>포로와 눈빛을 마춘다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Nymessa
#. NodeID = df0f1625-d185-4975-0696-1ed262c43c19
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_Event_ArchPosition = True
#.      - CHA_LaezelRecruitment_State_Tiefling2Missing = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:df0f1625-d185-4975-0696-1ed262c43c19
msgctxt "h233ffc22gbc69g4900gafc1gbe8ae976bbd1"
msgid "Zorru was right. Yellow as a toad, and twice as ugly."
msgstr "조르 말이 맞았어. 두꺼비처럼 누렇고, 그보다 두 배는 못생겼군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Damays
#. NodeID = e04ba53c-c6f2-bca3-e68e-261dc5172cae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene:e04ba53c-c6f2-bca3-e68e-261dc5172cae
msgctxt "h8f7561afg0b86g499bgb506ge63247ce9d86"
msgid "Let's get the creature to camp. Then we'll look into the blast."
msgstr "저 존재를 야영지로 데려가자. 그다음 폭발에 관해 알아보자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
#. Speaker = Damays
