msgctxt "h96fe25a3gf7efg4006ga1d7ga797006da730"
msgid ""
"The githyanki's an intelligent creature, just like you. Release her, and let "
"us converse civilly."
msgstr "기스양키는 그쪽처럼 지성을 가진 존재야. 풀어주고 교양있게 얘기를 나눠 보자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
