msgctxt "h2a0de624g9c18g4681g841dg5a9ccbe6723c"
msgid "No. I'm not leaving this fiend with a stranger."
msgstr "아니. 이 마족을 생판 모르는 남한테 맡길 생각 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
