msgctxt "hf01c9352gbce7g4481g8f80g36fa578eb5eb"
msgid "Hells, this isn't worth it. I'm out of here."
msgstr "망할, 이건 보람 없는 짓이군. 난 여길 뜨겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_LaeZelRecruitment_TieflingsScene
