msgctxt "h5eed4cb7ga806g441bgba1bg8480a394c26a"
msgid "<i>Where are the others? Mari, Barton? Did they kill them...?</i>"
msgstr "<i>나머지 애들은 어떻게 된 거야? 마리랑 바튼은? 설마 이 자식 손에 죽었나...?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditBackInteraction_Spotted
#. Speaker = Warryn
#. NodeID = 7085a607-c094-f7d9-985d-8b958e9540a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_4 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditBackInteraction_Spotted:7085a607-c094-f7d9-985d-8b958e9540a1
msgctxt "h89fdc8d6g0189g4851g8d94g3e6829ab48b1"
msgid "<i>Look out! </i>Someone's comin' from the crypt!"
msgstr "<i>조심해! </i>지하 묘실에서 누가 나오고 있어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditBackInteraction_Spotted
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7c4798a9-9671-a175-f207-b3ed07f3cc53
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditBackInteraction_Spotted:7c4798a9-9671-a175-f207-b3ed07f3cc53
msgctxt "h80746a4eg8a38g40f1g8caag6902d24784ac"
msgid "Mine now. <i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "이젠 내 거야. <i>꺼져.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditBackInteraction_Spotted
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = 89d886fb-1475-deac-18d8-2d984f132aa1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditBackInteraction_Spotted:89d886fb-1475-deac-18d8-2d984f132aa1
msgctxt "h9d92850eg1ed5g4598g9770gf2bbfe0d6aec"
msgid ""
"Now we're going to - <i>Wait!</i> Who're you? And how did you get in there?!"
msgstr "그러니 우린 이제... <i>잠깐!</i> 너 뭐야? 그 안에는 대체 뭔 수로 들어간 거고?!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditBackInteraction_Spotted
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = a10225b9-cd33-58bf-e508-4e69ccd4de92
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditBackInteraction_Spotted:a10225b9-cd33-58bf-e508-4e69ccd4de92
msgctxt "h5747fe90g9fe8g4ec6ga329g0e912ec8911e"
msgid "...You're both twice as tall as me but have half the bloody backbone!"
msgstr "...키는 내 두 배나 되는 주제에, 베짱은 내 반절도 못 되냐!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditBackInteraction_Spotted
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = a55d867d-eeae-acc7-b465-cfd73393481f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditBackInteraction_Spotted:a55d867d-eeae-acc7-b465-cfd73393481f
msgctxt "hca1137ddg0532g476dg89b7g35ac12c74f43"
msgid ""
"Whoever was flying that thing can't have survived - whatever's left is up "
"for grabs!"
msgstr "저걸 몰던 놈이 누군지는 몰라도 살아남았을 리 없어. 남은 건 줍는 놈이 임자라니까!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditBackInteraction_Spotted
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = b020319d-1606-3e84-3b9c-be6f64fdb6e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditBackInteraction_Spotted:b020319d-1606-3e84-3b9c-be6f64fdb6e6
msgctxt "hb0ee547ag2413g4ba4g8f48gb2427504fbdb"
msgid "Rubbish! <i>Kill him!</i>"
msgstr "지랄하네! <i>저놈 죽여!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditBackInteraction_Spotted
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = b020319d-1606-3e84-3b9c-be6f64fdb6e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditBackInteraction_Spotted:b020319d-1606-3e84-3b9c-be6f64fdb6e6
msgctxt "hc8da98d5g9f30g43fdg9cd9g692f323a27bb"
msgid "Rubbish! <i>Kill her!</i>"
msgstr "지랄하네! <i>저년 죽여!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditBackInteraction_Spotted
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = b020319d-1606-3e84-3b9c-be6f64fdb6e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditBackInteraction_Spotted:b020319d-1606-3e84-3b9c-be6f64fdb6e6
msgctxt "h66cea2f0gba59g41a0g9fd3g5fa248d46ae5"
msgid "Rubbish! <i>Kill them!</i>"
msgstr "지랄하네! <i>저 자식 죽여!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditBackInteraction_Spotted
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bd7bd29e-f218-218d-e623-f470dbd7c36c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 0
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - f5d4524c-533e-22f0-2791-ddc857d00987_MindHasBeenRead = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CanDetectThoughts_5 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditBackInteraction_Spotted:bd7bd29e-f218-218d-e623-f470dbd7c36c
msgctxt "h324cd768gc920g40c8g84d8ge901b123cf72"
msgid "<i>Read the gnome's mind.</i>"
msgstr "<i>노움의 생각을 읽는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditBackInteraction_Spotted
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c007b417-4dfa-59c7-a45b-db8ce36ce8c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - f5d4524c-533e-22f0-2791-ddc857d00987_MindHasBeenRead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditBackInteraction_Spotted:c007b417-4dfa-59c7-a45b-db8ce36ce8c3
msgctxt "h80f14febgb8aag48feg8c54g34b891d24ee5"
msgid "Leave, before I gut you like I gutted Mari and Barton."
msgstr "꺼져. 마리랑 바튼처럼 내장을 뽑아버리기 전에 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditBackInteraction_Spotted
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = cb59b2e8-d0c1-c582-4612-183967f74890
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - CHA_Chapel.BanditTalking(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditBackInteraction_Spotted:cb59b2e8-d0c1-c582-4612-183967f74890
msgctxt "hd54f992bg8400g421dg99e2g00f70c51e8a8"
msgid ""
"That crypt's ours - we've got people guarding it! Tryin' to off us and swipe "
"the loot, is it?"
msgstr "저 지하 묘실은 우리 거다. 따로 지키는 사람까지 세워놨다고! 우리를 제치고 전리품을 쓸어먹을 심산이냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditBackInteraction_Spotted
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = d30b2bac-63bb-6271-c176-9b9ea31be925
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - CHA_Chapel.BanditTalking(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditBackInteraction_Spotted:d30b2bac-63bb-6271-c176-9b9ea31be925
msgctxt "h28af3360g9932g4b41gaec4gdbbfe7b49626"
msgid ""
"What the - Who're you?! That crypt's ours; think you can clear it out from "
"under our noses?"
msgstr "이게 무슨... 너 뭐야?! 저 지하 묘실은 우리 거다. 우릴 뻔히 두고 싹 다 털어먹을 수 있을 줄 알았냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 034090e2-d6e7-9173-e893-5a7dd19f2b1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WARLOCK(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:034090e2-d6e7-9173-e893-5a7dd19f2b1f
msgctxt "h7c636ccegd96cg4ed4ga8d4g537e8b92310f"
msgid "That ship's full of poisonous vapours. Probably demonic. I'd stay away."
msgstr "저 함선은 유독한 기체로 가득 차 있다고. 지옥의 산물일지도 몰라. 나라면 얼씬도 안 할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = 0920da0b-0ae2-05cc-1059-2a0de5cc46b6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:0920da0b-0ae2-05cc-1059-2a0de5cc46b6
msgctxt "hdbb75bccgfe5fg48a9g841cgaf93b5d4e30d"
msgid "...You're both twice as tall as me but have half the bloody backbone!"
msgstr "...키는 내 두 배나 되는 주제에, 베짱은 내 반절도 못 되냐!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 12ffcb1c-18ad-99a5-3148-7c35de7f4bdc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(2) = False
#.      - REALLY_HALFORC(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:12ffcb1c-18ad-99a5-3148-7c35de7f4bdc
msgctxt "h717494c0g28f2g423cg98d1g4ad8c75d7118"
msgid ""
"Nothing's yours but your life - and I can take that from you just as easily."
msgstr "여기서 네놈 거라곤 네 목숨이 다야. 내게 덤비면 그마저도 쉽게 날려먹을 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1eadea55-392e-f21f-1122-f23ddcb3f202
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:1eadea55-392e-f21f-1122-f23ddcb3f202
msgctxt "h57adc6fbg90c0g4b00g8dc6ge4c3ed636ba9"
msgid "I mean no harm - I'm just looking around."
msgstr "피해 줄 생각은 없어. 그냥 둘러보고 다니는 중이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = 2a6b410e-8f3e-3958-eb12-959d3a197fb6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:2a6b410e-8f3e-3958-eb12-959d3a197fb6
msgctxt "h53c3ceceg2cafg4aa6g98a8g39ec5b91a732"
msgid ""
"And the crypt can wait! Mari and Barton have been trying to break in for "
"days. Now we - <i>Stop!</i>"
msgstr "그리고 지하 묘실은 제쳐 둬! 마리랑 바튼이 진입 방법 찾으려고 한 지가 벌써 며칠째잖아. 이제 우린... <i>멈춰!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 348f2d00-fe6f-94e7-c0fb-3e96961e4d6b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:348f2d00-fe6f-94e7-c0fb-3e96961e4d6b
msgctxt "ha9426b14gc106g430cg9627g33219a395da6"
msgid "<i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = 5c2dd205-f535-27bf-55ad-b4ea2d5a86d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:5c2dd205-f535-27bf-55ad-b4ea2d5a86d3
msgctxt "hbcf63513g9c9ag4cbega22fg6fe86cf33eef"
msgid "Poisonous wha...?"
msgstr "유독한 뭐...?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 66dd737d-9291-b021-2b1b-5d457b248ad4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FIGHTER(2) = True
#. TagRule: FIGHTER
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:66dd737d-9291-b021-2b1b-5d457b248ad4
msgctxt "hd63438b3g8b9fg4101gb242g59554910c049"
msgid "Take your best shot - you'll only get one."
msgstr "어디 재주껏 덤벼보시지. 그게 네 마지막이 될 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = 69bbf2c4-e5b0-f276-6867-326b5075a5c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:69bbf2c4-e5b0-f276-6867-326b5075a5c8
msgctxt "h6a35ad05g4872g4176g9a4agfeca89230aa7"
msgid ""
"C'mon, you lot, no point in gettin' killed. Second worm gets the cheese, an' "
"all..."
msgstr "가자, 얘들아. 괜히 명줄 재촉할 필요 없지. 먼저 치즈에 덤비는 벌레가 먼저 뒈지는 법이잖냐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6d7d956b-e475-5f8b-7c28-ec4a49dc10e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:6d7d956b-e475-5f8b-7c28-ec4a49dc10e7
msgctxt "h557014d9g97ceg457bga36cg6226c8836d9d"
msgid ""
"Your loud words hide fear, confusion. Looting that ship will bring you no "
"peace."
msgstr "허세 속에 두려움과 당혹감이 숨겨져 있군. 저 배 털어봤자 너희한테 좋을 일은 전혀 없을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Taman
#. NodeID = 6ed7eee2-f485-483e-3b84-1a5c5e121b60
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:6ed7eee2-f485-483e-3b84-1a5c5e121b60
msgctxt "h72955042gb763g4b6dgaa87g238fcb959654"
msgid "What's wrong with his face? Freak."
msgstr "뭐 저런 면상이 다 있냐? 괴물 자식."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Taman
#. NodeID = 6ed7eee2-f485-483e-3b84-1a5c5e121b60
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:6ed7eee2-f485-483e-3b84-1a5c5e121b60
msgctxt "h4b14ed9dgf6b9g4a54ga860gd0ed01ff3db2"
msgid "What's wrong with her face? Freak."
msgstr "뭐 저런 면상이 다 있냐? 괴물 자식."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Taman
#. NodeID = 6ed7eee2-f485-483e-3b84-1a5c5e121b60
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:6ed7eee2-f485-483e-3b84-1a5c5e121b60
msgctxt "hc67088b0gc3b0g4279g9ee6g2f935ba46c87"
msgid "What's wrong with their face? Freak."
msgstr "뭐 저런 면상이 다 있냐? 괴물 자식."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = 6fe2d59b-a249-ae82-54a0-28b857ebfd79
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:6fe2d59b-a249-ae82-54a0-28b857ebfd79
msgctxt "h5ff7516bg1da2g4d3bgaa62g65fcf732a16c"
msgid "<i>Dead</i> freak. Get 'im!"
msgstr "<i>뒈질</i> 괴물이지. 조져!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = 6fe2d59b-a249-ae82-54a0-28b857ebfd79
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:6fe2d59b-a249-ae82-54a0-28b857ebfd79
msgctxt "h28e337dcg65b7g4a08g8b63g6d44b9b76370"
msgid "<i>Dead</i> freak. Get 'er!"
msgstr "<i>뒈질</i> 괴물이지. 조져!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = 6fe2d59b-a249-ae82-54a0-28b857ebfd79
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:6fe2d59b-a249-ae82-54a0-28b857ebfd79
msgctxt "ha5841d73ge6b7g49f0ga165gf7060b4391ab"
msgid "<i>Dead</i> freak. Get 'em!"
msgstr "<i>뒈질</i> 괴물이지. 조져!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = 72168b73-8b37-2443-be66-151501e07519
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:72168b73-8b37-2443-be66-151501e07519
msgctxt "h0b2f3770g23c5g4fd1g9c34g6f172b2bf91c"
msgid "Oh yeah? Well, we're... we're -"
msgstr "아, 그러셔? 그럼, 우린... 우리는 -"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = 73b3d154-4b61-d980-2e35-72237b577013
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:73b3d154-4b61-d980-2e35-72237b577013
msgctxt "h67cc6d57g251ag40efgab63gd0ba81527f4a"
msgid "First you look, then you touch, then you take!"
msgstr "일단은 둘러보다가, 나중엔 손을 대고, 결국엔 슬쩍하겠지!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 76379dd9-9fbd-17f2-1686-a5241cecbc51
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType:
#. RollAbility: Strength
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:76379dd9-9fbd-17f2-1686-a5241cecbc51
msgctxt "hbc540ccegf1fag4a85g8a81g44f1caa47c45"
msgid ""
"I don't want to hurt you, but provoke me, and I'll keep stabbing long after "
"you're dead."
msgstr "널 해칠 마음은 없지만, 계속 날 자극하면 죽어도 곱게 죽진 못할 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = 7a3b0d49-750d-cd3f-0de2-b3f6e7455412
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:7a3b0d49-750d-cd3f-0de2-b3f6e7455412
msgctxt "h8be470cfg7011g4076g946dg60cd9e572178"
msgid "Oh yeah? Well, I don't see any of your kin here to claim it!"
msgstr "아, 그러셔? 근데 너희 족속이 따로 더 있어 보이진 않는걸!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7c72de5f-efdd-9428-fffd-0cbaae61e20d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(2) = True
#. TagRule: BERSERKER
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:7c72de5f-efdd-9428-fffd-0cbaae61e20d
msgctxt "h4b7887ecgc931g417bg898bga2413ab3db65"
msgid "<b>MINE.</b>"
msgstr "<b>내 거야.</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7c72de5f-efdd-9428-fffd-0cbaae61e20d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:7c72de5f-efdd-9428-fffd-0cbaae61e20d
msgctxt "h15a147eeg6621g4d01g9dcdged1eade068e2"
msgid "Not yours - mine. Leave. <b>Now.</b>"
msgstr "네가 아니라, 내 거야. 꺼져. <b>당장.</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Taman
#. NodeID = 81323220-a52f-1032-2f37-4f935e72ea1a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - CHA_Chapel.BanditTalking(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:81323220-a52f-1032-2f37-4f935e72ea1a
msgctxt "h44bd974eg7e01g478ag8261g896732fcec2d"
msgid ""
"But we don't know what that <i>thing </i>even is! And what about the crypt?"
msgstr "하지만 우리는 <i>저게 </i>뭔지도 모르잖아! 또, 지하 묘실은 어쩔 생각인데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8259d8d3-b028-ebde-487a-00e8dfc77d27
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:8259d8d3-b028-ebde-487a-00e8dfc77d27
msgctxt "h549d9f21g90f4g4891gb985g6a2d32d077b2"
msgid "That is my kin's prize, not yours."
msgstr "저 배는 내 동족의 전리품이지, 네놈 것이 아니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 87482a98-79f1-24d8-4084-d3a99c795b7a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:87482a98-79f1-24d8-4084-d3a99c795b7a
msgctxt "h476ce9ccg3728g43a7gae1ega915b7709336"
msgid ""
"Selfish cur - there might be survivors, yet you think only of loot. Leave "
"before I <i>make </i>you leave."
msgstr ""
"이기적인 놈 같으니. 생존자가 있을지도 모르는데, 전리품 생각에나 빠져 있군. 꺼져. 안 그럼 내가 그렇게 <i>만들어</i> 줄 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Taman
#. NodeID = 914318fb-55af-572e-b8dd-2a2b355f801e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:914318fb-55af-572e-b8dd-2a2b355f801e
msgctxt "he045beb3g2726g43ffg83b5g9031150c7cc7"
msgid "See? That thing could be carrying a plague for all we know!"
msgstr "거 봐! 저 배에 들어갔다간 온갖 역병에 걸릴지도 모른다고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = 95b7e274-d7b0-e250-c933-f191cb3b5b72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:95b7e274-d7b0-e250-c933-f191cb3b5b72
msgctxt "hf79b4b28g8f43g498aga8e2gfb878f7f6170"
msgid "The only thing we're sharing with you is our pointy ends - get 'im!"
msgstr "넌 우리한테서 칼침 말곤 아무것도 못 얻을 거다. 조져!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = 95b7e274-d7b0-e250-c933-f191cb3b5b72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:95b7e274-d7b0-e250-c933-f191cb3b5b72
msgctxt "h61835925gce5dg4a5bg895fg5a5caa04ad33"
msgid "The only thing we're sharing with you is our pointy ends - get 'er!"
msgstr "넌 우리한테서 칼침 말곤 아무것도 못 얻을 거다. 조져!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = 95b7e274-d7b0-e250-c933-f191cb3b5b72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:95b7e274-d7b0-e250-c933-f191cb3b5b72
msgctxt "hf8a5e868gd936g47e4g9d33g40cb2ba79d1f"
msgid "The only thing we're sharing with you is our pointy ends - get 'em!"
msgstr "넌 우리한테서 칼침 말곤 아무것도 못 얻을 거다. 조져!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = a800c0bf-29e1-3e9f-5ff6-581b7dcf0f2f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:a800c0bf-29e1-3e9f-5ff6-581b7dcf0f2f
msgctxt "hf4bea2aeg3ff9g4a6dgba46g144ef99aa917"
msgid ""
"You're all hot air - think you can get us to leave that bounty to you? Not a "
"chance!"
msgstr "허풍 덩어리 자식 같으니. 네까짓 놈 수작에 우리가 전리품 포기할 줄 알았냐? 어림도 없지!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Taman
#. NodeID = b92de5dc-8b8a-d6cd-e677-4605a8c61d0b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:b92de5dc-8b8a-d6cd-e677-4605a8c61d0b
msgctxt "hfb00b3c1g93c1g45eagb62cg6fa6a3b58a12"
msgid "I ain't fighting him. Not a chance."
msgstr "난 저놈이랑 안 싸워. 어림도 없다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Taman
#. NodeID = b92de5dc-8b8a-d6cd-e677-4605a8c61d0b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:b92de5dc-8b8a-d6cd-e677-4605a8c61d0b
msgctxt "h433a75a0g0c20g40feg8dc8g86cbbc6de5e5"
msgid "I ain't fighting her. Not a chance."
msgstr "난 저년이랑 안 싸워. 어림도 없다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Taman
#. NodeID = b92de5dc-8b8a-d6cd-e677-4605a8c61d0b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:b92de5dc-8b8a-d6cd-e677-4605a8c61d0b
msgctxt "h10564921g388eg40cdgb555g2053c2d292b3"
msgid "I ain't fighting them. Not a chance."
msgstr "난 저 자식이랑 안 싸워. 어림도 없다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = bb514728-0382-076c-3c4d-cf5e7ac29247
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:bb514728-0382-076c-3c4d-cf5e7ac29247
msgctxt "h058eae79g6aa2g491bg8e64gb102c00454ee"
msgid "I'm telling you - it's a ship."
msgstr "내가 가르쳐주지. 저건 함선이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = beac49ad-1e9b-0c08-7806-3f99da225a8f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CHA_OUTSIDE_Event_BanditScared = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - HIDDEN_WLD_Boosters.CHA_Chapel_BanditTalking(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:beac49ad-1e9b-0c08-7806-3f99da225a8f
msgctxt "hb86b72f8g61fag41e9g9ea2g26eecc609088"
msgid "...We're, uh... we're leaving! C'mon, move it!"
msgstr "...우린, 어... 이만 가겠어! 얘들아, 가자!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = c4bfc70b-4eac-398d-5044-17627b415a28
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:c4bfc70b-4eac-398d-5044-17627b415a28
msgctxt "he054800ag96b4g4436gb4d8gdd0ad1c1a534"
msgid "Well, uh, in that case..."
msgstr "어... 음, 그렇다면야..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Taman
#. NodeID = ce616418-8df3-f3ad-f255-20ad1860e2be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:ce616418-8df3-f3ad-f255-20ad1860e2be
msgctxt "h73e77ed5g447cg481bgaf05gc7546ab2192e"
msgid "Uh, second <i>mouse </i>gets the cheese, no?"
msgstr "어, 치즈에 덤비는 건 벌레가 아니라 <i>쥐</i> 아닌가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cf5f7a4c-b478-d65c-ee23-a4357684b0da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:cf5f7a4c-b478-d65c-ee23-a4357684b0da
msgctxt "ha5573e3fg8ed9g4c15ga380g270059b7f63b"
msgid "I am not competition. I am annihilation."
msgstr "난 경쟁자 따위가 아니다. 네놈의 파멸이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = d0542c18-d9da-6ce5-2a83-5ff434cc6d21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction_SpeakerPersuadedBandits(2) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - CHA_OUTSIDE_Event_BanditScared = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - HIDDEN_WLD_Boosters.CHA_Chapel_BanditTalking(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:d0542c18-d9da-6ce5-2a83-5ff434cc6d21
msgctxt "he885a596ge980g4a77g9ab6g7a8c288e812e"
msgid "Nobody's getting any damn cheese! Now move it!"
msgstr "망할 치즈 얘기는 집어치워! 그만 가자고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = de5b6976-9695-a66c-fd4c-4194d10c14e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:de5b6976-9695-a66c-fd4c-4194d10c14e2
msgctxt "hf23f1752gb942g473egb2d4gf9375f2f22ed"
msgid "What're you lot waiting for? <i>Get 'im!</i>"
msgstr "뭘 가만히들 있어? <i>조져!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = de5b6976-9695-a66c-fd4c-4194d10c14e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:de5b6976-9695-a66c-fd4c-4194d10c14e2
msgctxt "hba15f002gf6a5g40f4g915ag422cbb4509f7"
msgid "What're you lot waiting for? <i>Get 'er!</i>"
msgstr "뭘 가만히들 있어? <i>조져!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = de5b6976-9695-a66c-fd4c-4194d10c14e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:de5b6976-9695-a66c-fd4c-4194d10c14e2
msgctxt "h024e3bbbge22ag4b78gaa49gf0d3bd5dfb4f"
msgid "What're you lot waiting for? <i>Get 'em!</i>"
msgstr "뭘 가만히들 있어? <i>조져!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = ea738c8a-c88b-c322-ad81-0ce4b1e504e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:ea738c8a-c88b-c322-ad81-0ce4b1e504e9
msgctxt "h1cbb2a5fg6c7eg45a4gbb0dg73e8cc2d55c9"
msgid ""
"Got ourselves competition already! I dunno what the hells you are, but "
"that's our ship!"
msgstr "벌써 경쟁자가 생겼구만! 대체 뭔 종자인지는 모르겠지만, 저 함선은 우리 거야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = ea738c8a-c88b-c322-ad81-0ce4b1e504e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:ea738c8a-c88b-c322-ad81-0ce4b1e504e9
msgctxt "h1e6e802fgf352g49c6g95bege76a41859a1a"
msgid "Got ourselves competition already! That's our ship!"
msgstr "벌써 경쟁자가 생겼구만! 저 함선은 우리 거야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = 03c86058-9b67-4538-8d29-0b835b23acce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - CHA_Chapel.BanditTalking(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction:03c86058-9b67-4538-8d29-0b835b23acce
msgctxt "h3b557fb3g2b67g4464g8374g221b6b98417d"
msgid ""
"What's this then - trying to creep around us and loot the crypt? Not "
"happening."
msgstr "이건 또 뭐야. 우리 몰래 기어들어와 지하 묘실 털어먹을 생각이었냐? 어림도 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 119a1af9-c269-f4f0-ee99-95abb82ec198
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 12
#. 
#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 12634287-93ab-24a2-85bf-c16aa0db7609
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 12
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction:119a1af9-c269-f4f0-ee99-95abb82ec198
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:12634287-93ab-24a2-85bf-c16aa0db7609
msgctxt "h89f0988ag3592g4d46gbd54g538868e8b10d"
msgid "I think that ship's an invasion force. Run while you can!"
msgstr "저 함선은 침략군의 배로 보이던데. 얼른 도망가는 게 좋다고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = 19c2bfc2-9d63-e14c-6b7e-da458381299d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction:19c2bfc2-9d63-e14c-6b7e-da458381299d
msgctxt "h8a54c9f1g2886g415eg9176g8d5d9ebf960f"
msgid "First you look, then you touch, then you take!"
msgstr "일단은 둘러보다가, 나중엔 손을 대고, 결국엔 슬쩍하겠지!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1a7a6f02-b2e6-1a6e-3e6e-0c1fd0dd447d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WARLOCK(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction:1a7a6f02-b2e6-1a6e-3e6e-0c1fd0dd447d
msgctxt "h6cdc39a8gf6d7g463bga39eg699124695913"
msgid "That ship's full of poisonous vapours. Probably demonic. I'd stay away."
msgstr "저 함선은 유독한 기체로 가득 차 있다고. 지옥의 산물일지도 몰라. 나라면 얼씬도 안 할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 24b707d7-8609-dc59-111e-0bf10028e93a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. 
#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5dcdfbc5-7c8a-19b9-2bef-04b70bb5f632
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction:24b707d7-8609-dc59-111e-0bf10028e93a
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:5dcdfbc5-7c8a-19b9-2bef-04b70bb5f632
msgctxt "ha6565613gce19g459ag9243gcfc398d41772"
msgid "That ship is full of monsters. I wouldn't go near it."
msgstr "저 배는 괴물로 가득해. 나라면 얼씬도 안 할 거라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = 2b3bb056-b972-0ce0-4ec5-36d7ed41f99c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction_SpeakerPersuadedBandits(4) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - CHA_OUTSIDE_Event_BanditScared = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - HIDDEN_WLD_Boosters.CHA_Chapel_BanditTalking(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction:2b3bb056-b972-0ce0-4ec5-36d7ed41f99c
msgctxt "h8dad7a75gce29g4544gae4agccaa89fd45cf"
msgid "Well, uh, in that case..."
msgstr "어... 음, 그렇다면야..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 339ec42a-15c0-c0df-c94a-02df697d47ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(4) = False
#.      - ASTARION(4) = False
#. 
#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1225ed89-7b32-c9c0-34b5-a8cd39e4c199
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(2) = False
#.      - ASTARION(2) = False
#.      - PALADIN(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction:339ec42a-15c0-c0df-c94a-02df697d47ef
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:1225ed89-7b32-c9c0-34b5-a8cd39e4c199
msgctxt "h55c56a87g7e18g46d9g8aabgdc1e6c42afa0"
msgid "The only thing you own is your life. Leave before I take that, too."
msgstr "여기서 네놈 거라곤 네 목숨밖에 없어. 그것마저 빼앗기기 전에 떠나시지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = 36326fef-c27a-0e59-c9ff-a28b1d7313c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction:36326fef-c27a-0e59-c9ff-a28b1d7313c8
msgctxt "h27aebf4bg042eg4661g8835gfcc653b9fa3c"
msgid ""
"Or is it the ship you're after? Don't matter either way - it's ours<i>, all "
"of it.</i>"
msgstr "아니면 저 함선을 노리고 온 건가? 어느 쪽이든 상관없어. 다 우리 거니까. <i>전부 다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = 561af675-770e-4632-5d63-e08bcacdf69d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction:561af675-770e-4632-5d63-e08bcacdf69d
msgctxt "h962df7b1g6d40g492fg82a4g281d2d1507bc"
msgid "... we're, uh... we're leaving! C'mon, move it!"
msgstr "...우린, 어... 이만 가겠어! 얘들아, 가자!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = 5b853452-771f-6229-1b4b-5ec25bf0ee4d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction:5b853452-771f-6229-1b4b-5ec25bf0ee4d
msgctxt "h82665ce1ga6aag44adga58fgcea041a492bc"
msgid ""
"You're all hot air - think you can get us to leave that bounty to you? Not a "
"chance!"
msgstr "허풍 덩어리 자식 같으니. 네까짓 놈 수작에 우리가 전리품 포기할 줄 알았냐? 어림도 없지!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 62271f98-279d-34e7-dbd5-8e6ddba953ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FIGHTER(4) = True
#. TagRule: FIGHTER
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction:62271f98-279d-34e7-dbd5-8e6ddba953ab
msgctxt "h4ee4933eg970cg4a56g86afg2c2745900ff4"
msgid "Take your best shot - you'll only get one."
msgstr "어디 재주껏 덤벼보시지. 그게 네 마지막이 될 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6da9a1fa-36ee-68d1-d879-7588c5dfe324
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ASTARION(4) = True
#. 
#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f9392f9d-46e3-3b47-30f8-dee0edfc52fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ASTARION(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction:6da9a1fa-36ee-68d1-d879-7588c5dfe324
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction:f9392f9d-46e3-3b47-30f8-dee0edfc52fb
msgctxt "h39d18368g7d2eg49b4ga457gb185dc674054"
msgid "<i>Just grin, baring your fangs.</i>"
msgstr "<i>송곳니를 드러내며 씩 웃어보인다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = 74cb6d94-7363-7044-a6f1-1ee02a168a77
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CHA_OUTSIDE_Event_BanditScared = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - HIDDEN_WLD_Boosters.CHA_Chapel_BanditTalking(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction:74cb6d94-7363-7044-a6f1-1ee02a168a77
msgctxt "h9105f870g89a4g42ceg9310ga7224fcae2bf"
msgid "Oh yeah? Well we're... we're -"
msgstr "아, 그러셔? 그럼, 우린... 우리는 -"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 811b156b-5e33-10c4-f4bc-5159a97971fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction:811b156b-5e33-10c4-f4bc-5159a97971fd
msgctxt "h1bf6f1dagff45g4bc0gb07eg4ca1012d4899"
msgid "That is my kin's prize, not yours."
msgstr "저 배는 내 동족의 전리품이지, 네놈 것이 아니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction
#. Speaker = Taman
#. NodeID = 829d87da-2fef-5a80-4395-9b46efc92c5a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction:829d87da-2fef-5a80-4395-9b46efc92c5a
msgctxt "h5ae9176egf8a0g4a00gb1d4g2b13d152a8fb"
msgid "I ain't fighting him. Not a chance."
msgstr "난 저놈이랑 안 싸워. 어림도 없다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction
#. Speaker = Taman
#. NodeID = 829d87da-2fef-5a80-4395-9b46efc92c5a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction:829d87da-2fef-5a80-4395-9b46efc92c5a
msgctxt "hdc894218g63d9g4f38g850dgf9ff0f03c64b"
msgid "I ain't fighting her. Not a chance."
msgstr "난 저년이랑 안 싸워. 어림도 없다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction
#. Speaker = Taman
#. NodeID = 829d87da-2fef-5a80-4395-9b46efc92c5a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction:829d87da-2fef-5a80-4395-9b46efc92c5a
msgctxt "hb1e33165gd3f6g4484g8ac9ge42bdf169fdf"
msgid "I ain't fighting them. Not a chance."
msgstr "난 저 자식이랑 안 싸워. 어림도 없다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction
#. Speaker = Taman
#. NodeID = 8915344d-ec91-607a-aa26-12f1bb902ad1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction:8915344d-ec91-607a-aa26-12f1bb902ad1
msgctxt "h8e0d3a9cg65bfg4bedg8a72g72d7f4f90774"
msgid "Don't like the sound of this, boss..."
msgstr "이거 영 안 좋게 들리는데, 대장..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8c9b57cd-6fa9-640c-a9d7-b9a742a6e871
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction:8c9b57cd-6fa9-640c-a9d7-b9a742a6e871
msgctxt "ha900986eg2dd8g4c53gb623g5e7dddb30335"
msgid "I mean no harm - I'm just looking around."
msgstr "피해 줄 생각은 없어. 그냥 둘러보고 다니는 중이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9297981d-4987-bb94-2935-d0dd78b76c0f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(4) = True
#. TagRule: BERSERKER
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction:9297981d-4987-bb94-2935-d0dd78b76c0f
msgctxt "h471a9c9eg7624g4e5fgada9g6e1c6d5bf85b"
msgid "<b>MINE.</b>"
msgstr "<b>내 거야.</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9297981d-4987-bb94-2935-d0dd78b76c0f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction:9297981d-4987-bb94-2935-d0dd78b76c0f
msgctxt "h7607473bg025dg480ag90edg3f6650c390f9"
msgid "Wrong. Walk. <b>Now.</b>"
msgstr "틀렸어. 꺼지시지. <b>당장.</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = aaa136f0-cf79-2469-8657-5a6c0e75a673
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction:aaa136f0-cf79-2469-8657-5a6c0e75a673
msgctxt "hc22202e5gc9c6g41eagbe44g883d36327e90"
msgid "The only thing we're sharing with you is our pointy ends - get 'im!"
msgstr "넌 우리한테서 칼침 말곤 아무것도 못 얻을 거다. 조져!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = aaa136f0-cf79-2469-8657-5a6c0e75a673
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction:aaa136f0-cf79-2469-8657-5a6c0e75a673
msgctxt "he7042f47g87c0g432dga464gd30a423998e1"
msgid "The only thing we're sharing with you is our pointy ends - get 'er!"
msgstr "넌 우리한테서 칼침 말곤 아무것도 못 얻을 거다. 조져!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = aaa136f0-cf79-2469-8657-5a6c0e75a673
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction:aaa136f0-cf79-2469-8657-5a6c0e75a673
msgctxt "he53c605fgd054g4943gb00fgced771e36c54"
msgid "The only thing we're sharing with you is our pointy ends - get 'em!"
msgstr "넌 우리한테서 칼침 말곤 아무것도 못 얻을 거다. 조져!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = baec6f91-b1c3-6598-6fa9-23c998ac2d08
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_HALFORC(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction:baec6f91-b1c3-6598-6fa9-23c998ac2d08
msgctxt "h93dea017gaa34g419eg97fdgd75267ba44ec"
msgid ""
"Nothing's yours but your life - and I can take that from you just as easily."
msgstr "여기서 네놈 거라곤 네 목숨이 다야. 내게 덤비면 그마저도 쉽게 날려먹을 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction
#. Speaker = Warryn
#. NodeID = bc8dbd1a-d47b-af0a-7209-6dd5b48a67c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction:bc8dbd1a-d47b-af0a-7209-6dd5b48a67c3
msgctxt "h224d0837gd4beg46f3g918dg69be5bbb76fc"
msgid "You! Not another step, hear me?"
msgstr "너! 거기 꼼짝 마, 알았어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = be0def25-ea3b-f30d-d216-19a934d3dbdd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction:be0def25-ea3b-f30d-d216-19a934d3dbdd
msgctxt "h69a80bccg7300g4c22gb5a6g540fa6fa5560"
msgid ""
"C'mon you lot, no point in gettin' killed. Second worm gets the cheese, an' "
"all..."
msgstr "가자, 얘들아. 괜히 명줄 재촉할 필요 없지. 먼저 치즈에 덤비는 벌레가 먼저 뒈지는 법이잖냐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c2e89be3-b41f-c96b-20e5-d73dd2b6242f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction:c2e89be3-b41f-c96b-20e5-d73dd2b6242f
msgctxt "hb54219aag1c0eg488bgaeb1g2a1bd256d5c8"
msgid ""
"Your loud words hide fear, confusion. Looting that ship will bring you no "
"peace."
msgstr "허세 속에 두려움과 당혹감이 숨겨져 있군. 저 배 털어봤자 너희한테 좋을 일은 전혀 없을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_BanditWestInteraction
