msgid "What were you doing here?"
msgstr "여기서 뭘 하고 있었지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_Bandit_Melee_01_Dead
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = c6857907-47d6-41da-8246-eea1ef8d5c53
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_Bandit_Melee_01_Dead:c6857907-47d6-41da-8246-eea1ef8d5c53
msgctxt "h4e91bc35g77a6g4c7dg84f8g20156494a2b2"
msgid "Some... but lower crypt locked..."
msgstr "조금은... 하지만 지하 묘실 쪽은 잠긴 상태야..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_Bandit_Melee_01_Dead
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = cb985c65-6cf1-4024-9f88-48bb23abf0eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_Bandit_Melee_01_Dead:cb985c65-6cf1-4024-9f88-48bb23abf0eb
msgctxt "h5cc3d8f8gc988g49acg9bccg64fbcffdca39"
msgid "Gimblebock..."
msgstr "김블보크..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_Bandit_Melee_01_Dead
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = cd462f62-b87e-4443-a879-7ef1dc8fbab3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_Bandit_Melee_01_Dead:cd462f62-b87e-4443-a879-7ef1dc8fbab3
msgctxt "h00bacd7eg2b4cg4972ga84bge900bc81148a"
msgid "*The corpse does not stir. It will answer no more questions.*"
msgstr "*시체는 움직이지 않습니다. 더 이상 질문을 받지 않을 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_Bandit_Melee_01_Dead
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d3e7ccd8-0c1e-40c6-9d41-98bfacdaf6b4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_Bandit_Melee_01_Dead:d3e7ccd8-0c1e-40c6-9d41-98bfacdaf6b4
msgctxt "hbf4cbfd9gae2fg4fa3g8c0dg55557610ac2b"
msgid "*The corpse regards you lifelessly.*"
msgstr "*시체가 생기 없는 모습으로 당신을 맞이합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_Bandit_Melee_01_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d87ca143-2f94-4436-b265-dfab9afbaf6d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_Bandit_Melee_01_Dead:d87ca143-2f94-4436-b265-dfab9afbaf6d
msgctxt "h46ba223fga616g4b35ga281ge96145173bed"
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr "너는 누구지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_Bandit_Melee_01_Dead
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = dff22c9a-2620-4ba6-aced-9daa54bc9add
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_Bandit_Melee_01_Dead:dff22c9a-2620-4ba6-aced-9daa54bc9add
msgctxt "h0a77751bgf113g4bd8g98fagb390a4ff8d2d"
msgid "Looting... chapel ruins..."
msgstr "예배당을... 약탈 중이었다..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_Bandit_Melee_01_Dead
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e139f566-678b-4f15-80cb-eb6316960a1a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_Bandit_Melee_01_Dead:e139f566-678b-4f15-80cb-eb6316960a1a
msgctxt "hde8ef3dcg0466g4ecag9f5eg73490ca99dc7"
msgid "*The spell's power wanes. You can ask no more questions.*"
msgstr "*주문의 힘이 약해집니다. 더 이상 질문을 할 수 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_Bandit_Melee_01_Dead
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = e7aa5944-1ccf-dece-c63e-6032bfe9ba11
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_Bandit_Melee_01_Dead:e7aa5944-1ccf-dece-c63e-6032bfe9ba11
msgctxt "hee9e2210gfc77g4b9dga82dge1215c754f04"
msgid "No. Doesn't matter... if his loot's good..."
msgstr "아니. 알 바 아니야... 돈만 될 수 있다면..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_Bandit_Melee_01_Dead
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = fac7ede6-aad0-4c88-bba1-9f5e1c0e45af
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_Bandit_Melee_01_Dead:fac7ede6-aad0-4c88-bba1-9f5e1c0e45af
msgctxt "hd6741728gf6a7g4b97gaa5cgeba1ffc44989"
msgid "The others, searching... chapel ruins. Can't get into lower crypt..."
msgstr "다른 애들이 예배당 폐허를... 뒤지고 있다... 지하 묘실로 못 들어가고 있어..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_Bandit_Melee_01_Dead
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = fbdb59e6-0eaa-4c28-bbee-400f363c318b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_Killer(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_Bandit_Melee_01_Dead:fbdb59e6-0eaa-4c28-bbee-400f363c318b
msgctxt "h0eb6ae09g5e8bg4eafga49cgb2043ed8010d"
msgid "*The corpse seems willing to speak - but not to its killer.*"
msgstr "*시체는 입을 열 의향이 있지만, 자신을 죽인 자와는 할 말이 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_Bandit_Melee_01_Dead
#. Speaker = Gimblebock
#. NodeID = ff6c443a-4948-4a3b-a6fe-e4e4a5308847
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_Bandit_Melee_01_Dead:ff6c443a-4948-4a3b-a6fe-e4e4a5308847
msgctxt "hdb2a0bb0g8888g483ag911fg2561072a22c7"
msgid "<i>Looking </i>for valuables... chapel..."
msgstr "귀중품을 <i>찾으러</i> 온 거지... 예배당에..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_EntranceDoor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 047b3381-d142-fb10-2b80-900a65fcf084
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. TagRule: BARD or GNOME
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_EntranceDoor:047b3381-d142-fb10-2b80-900a65fcf084
msgctxt "h40445cc9g96f5g499cg8504ga916915ee539"
msgid "Yes, it's me. Lemme in!"
msgstr "그래, 나야. 들여보내 줘!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_EntranceDoor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 110f55f7-4ef1-d6c1-c27f-ab9adc92587e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CHA_Outside_Event_BanditsPermaDefeated = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CHA_Outside_Event_DoorGuardAfraid = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_EntranceDoor:110f55f7-4ef1-d6c1-c27f-ab9adc92587e
msgctxt "h165a3857ga1aag4b19gbcc4g15928cab9620"
msgid "I killed your friends - now I'm here for you."
msgstr "네 친구들은 내 손에 죽었다. 이제 네 차례야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_EntranceDoor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1a4f8fed-134e-c827-c88c-5c58f8709030
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CHA_Outside_Event_DoorGuardAfraid = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_EntranceDoor:1a4f8fed-134e-c827-c88c-5c58f8709030
msgctxt "h052701a5g9928g434dg9fabgdab4be844dee"
msgid "Let me in, <i>now.</i>"
msgstr "문 여시지, <i>당장.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_EntranceDoor
#. Speaker = Andorn
#. NodeID = 3af95571-10d3-70d5-88f3-20c523f64efc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CHA_Outside_Event_DoorGuardAfraid = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_EntranceDoor:3af95571-10d3-70d5-88f3-20c523f64efc
msgctxt "h1dca7627gf5c6g4b3ag9736gbb6c07da5594"
msgid ""
"Think I'm stupid? Don't know who you are, or what you've done with the "
"boss..."
msgstr "누굴 바보로 알아? 난 너 같은 놈 몰라. 대장한테 뭔 짓을 했는지도 모르겠고..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_EntranceDoor
#. Speaker = Andorn
#. NodeID = 3c67c808-0fac-6c44-4b20-7b9871740f67
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_EntranceDoor:3c67c808-0fac-6c44-4b20-7b9871740f67
msgctxt "h935cbb84g47eeg4259g8f3dg94320bbbabf4"
msgid ""
"Yeah? I've got plenty more friends - come in here and you can meet 'em..."
msgstr "그러셔? 이 안에는 내 친구들이 더 잔뜩 있다고. 어디 들어와 실컷 구경해 보시지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_EntranceDoor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3e2529cd-ba7f-b28b-0465-40ceee7b0170
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GNOME(1) = False
#.      - BARD(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_EntranceDoor:3e2529cd-ba7f-b28b-0465-40ceee7b0170
msgctxt "h16c41fe0g574cg489cg9adcge62ab4467965"
msgid "Yes, it's me. Let me in!"
msgstr "그래, 나야. 들여보내 줘!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_EntranceDoor
#. Speaker = Andorn
#. NodeID = 775b0751-18ee-37c7-30dd-58bb6c005fe7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_EntranceDoor:775b0751-18ee-37c7-30dd-58bb6c005fe7
msgctxt "h1ed584aeg97d2g433bgad73g96baca6ff5a3"
msgid ""
"But I've got plenty of friends who <i>ain't</i> soft. Come in here and you "
"can meet 'em..."
msgstr "나한텐 나약해빠지지 <i>않은 </i>친구들이 아직 잔뜩 있다고. 어디 들어와 실컷 구경해 보시지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_EntranceDoor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8d02cb66-caca-a34f-8aeb-eaa6fcdafa61
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_EntranceDoor:8d02cb66-caca-a34f-8aeb-eaa6fcdafa61
msgctxt "hce6ebc82g240fg42fagb9d0g7807f2a8b0ef"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_EntranceDoor
#. Speaker = Andorn
#. NodeID = 9270ce99-73fb-2a82-5391-b2b4d6664813
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_EntranceDoor:9270ce99-73fb-2a82-5391-b2b4d6664813
msgctxt "h23753aa3g01b4g4bdfg8756g4627399709fb"
msgid "Yeah? That lot always were a bit soft."
msgstr "그러셔? 그 녀석들은 나약한 구석이 있었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_EntranceDoor
#. Speaker = Andorn
#. NodeID = 942ee97a-f8a8-3671-0ae7-848958dcdda1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CHA_Outside_Event_DoorGuardAfraid = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_EntranceDoor:942ee97a-f8a8-3671-0ae7-848958dcdda1
msgctxt "h9a905fe6gffdcg452dg9079g02cad496a625"
msgid "Yeah? And who are you? Probably <i>your</i> trap that did him in..."
msgstr "그래? 그러는 넌 뉘신 지? 그 함정이란 것도 <i>네</i>가 놓았을 성싶은데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_EntranceDoor
#. Speaker = Andorn
#. NodeID = 94a8cdc3-5815-2aea-cda5-b2af21544498
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CHA_Outside_Event_DoorGuardConvinced = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_EntranceDoor:94a8cdc3-5815-2aea-cda5-b2af21544498
msgctxt "hc6d45fc4g2456g493fgb5e1gcee6bcc87828"
msgid "You sound a bit shaken, boss. Hang on while I find the key..."
msgstr "어째 목소리가 좀 떨리는 거 같은데, 대장. 열쇠 꺼낼 테니까 기다려 봐..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_EntranceDoor
#. Speaker = Andorn
#. NodeID = b71925c3-3ac5-2308-113d-bc906270a7e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_EntranceDoor:b71925c3-3ac5-2308-113d-bc906270a7e4
msgctxt "ha0939ec4g52feg419ag9aedgf00d41f8398f"
msgid ""
"...but if you come through that door, you're getting a knife in the guts."
msgstr "...아무튼 그 문 열고 들어오면, 네 내장이 칼맛을 보게 될 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_EntranceDoor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = be644a14-a619-76b5-b890-db57251b05b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_EntranceDoor:be644a14-a619-76b5-b890-db57251b05b7
msgctxt "hcebf66d4g93c1g45b2gb77cg50713821b8e6"
msgid "Gimblebock triggered some trap. He needs help - now!"
msgstr "김블보크가 함정을 작동시켰다. 도움이 필요해, 당장!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_EntranceDoor
#. Speaker = Andorn
#. NodeID = eb02463d-7706-9841-4eca-87ba98b9b2bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_EntranceDoor:eb02463d-7706-9841-4eca-87ba98b9b2bb
msgctxt "h2562cf23ga9f3g48fbg9c1dg9a29f7d4fa50"
msgid "That you, Gimblebock? Everything all right out there?"
msgstr "너, 김블보크야? 밖에 뭔 일이라도 생겼어어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_EntranceDoor
#. Speaker = Andorn
#. NodeID = edf0f504-0bcf-4743-1bd8-e3b90f6fef3c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_EntranceDoor:edf0f504-0bcf-4743-1bd8-e3b90f6fef3c
msgctxt "h6d7359b1g9708g4218gb7d9gc543e67057bd"
msgid "Come through that door, and you're getting a knife in the guts."
msgstr "그 문 열고 들어오면, 네 내장이 칼맛을 보게 될 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_EntranceDoor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f492fcc6-2b67-c156-c8dc-e7d6c3a05080
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CHA_OUTSIDE_Event_BanditScared = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CHA_Outside_Event_DoorGuardAfraid = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_EntranceDoor:f492fcc6-2b67-c156-c8dc-e7d6c3a05080
msgctxt "h3bf767e4g8553g464dgbee0g9666504c29f1"
msgid "Gimblebock ran. Your friends abandoned you."
msgstr "김블보크는 도망갔다. 네 친구들은 널 버렸어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_EntranceDoor
#. Speaker = Andorn
#. NodeID = fe082375-ba75-bac8-96c5-6d582e4d8b89
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CHA_Outside_Event_DoorGuardConvinced = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_EntranceDoor:fe082375-ba75-bac8-96c5-6d582e4d8b89
msgctxt "h84ad3af4g5bc6g4c4bgb500g1533f3f8e900"
msgid ""
"I <i>told </i>him it wasn't safe out there. Get inside, and I'll rustle up "
"some bandages..."
msgstr "바깥은 위험하다고 그렇게 <i>말했건만</i>. 들어와. 나는 붕대 좀 가져올게..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_VB_BanditsLeaveReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 880b68bc-31f1-fcbf-c633-7eae1b891a4c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction_SpeakerPersuadedBandits(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_VB_BanditsLeaveReaction:880b68bc-31f1-fcbf-c633-7eae1b891a4c
msgctxt "hb7f0b017gd444g4f30g93b1g44a2adbffb82"
msgid "Lucky those bandits valued their own hides over their loot."
msgstr "저 도적놈들이 전리품에 목숨까지 거는 놈들은 아니라 다행이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_VB_BanditsLeaveReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d51e5855-36bb-5adc-bc27-07c96d829332
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction_SpeakerPersuadedBandits(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_VB_BanditsLeaveReaction:d51e5855-36bb-5adc-bc27-07c96d829332
msgctxt "h7a868076g158fg4796gab11g42dcebb8fa77"
msgid "It would have been quicker to kill them."
msgstr "그냥 죽여버렸으면 더 빨리 끝났을 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_VB_BanditsLeaveReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d51e5855-36bb-5adc-bc27-07c96d829332
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CHA_Outside_BanditInteraction_SpeakerPersuadedBandits(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_VB_BanditsLeaveReaction:d51e5855-36bb-5adc-bc27-07c96d829332
msgctxt "h5e8cff0cga879g4c70g8f3bg628b790eef92"
msgid ""
"You're more cunning than you look. I thought we had a fight on our hands."
msgstr "보기보다 교묘한 구석이 있는 걸. 나는 우리가 싸우게 될 줄만 알았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Chapel/CHA_Outside_VB_BanditsLeaveReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d51e5855-36bb-5adc-bc27-07c96d829332
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
