msgctxt "hadb0cd82gfc6dg4a8fg966bg880f1868fa31"
msgid "This is only the beginning. An army soon crosses the coast."
msgstr "이건 시작에 불과해. 곧 군대가 해안을 가로지를 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cdad4015-babf-1314-327b-2e596a850268
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidLeader:cdad4015-babf-1314-327b-2e596a850268
msgctxt "hb151e94fgd8f1g4caegb620gdf08701b8e4f"
msgid "As you will. I'll go in peace."
msgstr "그렇게 말하신다면. 조용히 가지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidLeader
#. Speaker = Kagha
#. NodeID = cdf35f0e-c846-2020-a00c-745a957d8bb1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidLeader:cdf35f0e-c846-2020-a00c-745a957d8bb1
msgctxt "h658d12acg4708g4ecbg84adge6663a11c443"
msgid ""
"But I won't sacrifice our future to the screaming horde. While I still "
"breathe, this grove will <i>not</i> come to harm."
msgstr "그렇다고 우리의 미래를 저 꽥꽥거리는 녀석들에게 넘기진 않을 것이다. 내가 살아있는 한, 이 숲에 피해란 <i>없다</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidLeader
