msgctxt "h855aeb9age156g4950ga8deg866bdd4800c6"
msgid ""
"By your efforts, Silvanus' grace can be restored to the grove. May he always "
"share your stride."
msgstr "당신 덕분에, 실바누스님의 은혜가 이 숲에 다시 돌아올 수 있을 겁니다. 그분께서 항상 당신의 여정에 함께 하시길."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Rath
#. NodeID = 08511aba-0f6c-bd0b-03e4-7868fc31c674
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:08511aba-0f6c-bd0b-03e4-7868fc31c674
msgctxt "h0ea4f158gd55dg4d73g9ba2g68458cf2809e"
msgid ""
"Forgive me. You triumphed over the goblins, and that cannot have been an "
"easy task."
msgstr "용서하세요. 당신은 고블린들을 물리쳤고, 그건 결코 쉬운 일이 아니었다는 걸 압니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Rath
#. NodeID = 09135456-e480-5cf7-89c5-b02637eeafc7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:09135456-e480-5cf7-89c5-b02637eeafc7
msgctxt "ha769c97bg7234g4479g876fgc090da6a4939"
msgid "I cannot imagine taking on a camp full of goblins was a simple task."
msgstr "고블린으로 가득한 야영지를 상대하는 일이 결코 간단하지는 않았을 것이라 생각합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Rath
#. NodeID = 1f440be9-4759-9daa-04ec-84a1832b4bc0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:1f440be9-4759-9daa-04ec-84a1832b4bc0
msgctxt "h0ba5c076gd126g4465g841dg7a6158e24b5d"
msgid "Of course. It is well-earned."
msgstr "물론이죠. 그럴 자격이 있으십니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Rath
#. NodeID = 28693f1a-8274-ce1b-ab32-44a8d5c45df9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:28693f1a-8274-ce1b-ab32-44a8d5c45df9
msgctxt "hbb48824cg8e94g44cag93e0ge8c6f7f2dee3"
msgid ""
"Place it among the pedestals inside our library. When the wolf glows "
"brightest, everything in the vault below will be yours."
msgstr "이걸 도서관 안의 받침대 위에 놓으세요. 늑대가 밝게 빛나면, 아래 금고에 있는 모든 것은 당신 것입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Rath
#. NodeID = 2b1268f3-f580-43e0-4ec2-669a852166a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:2b1268f3-f580-43e0-4ec2-669a852166a9
msgctxt "hc245c21egf6a7g499bg8a4cgaef96a791c01"
msgid "I hope whatever rot was lurking in her heart can be swiftly cut away."
msgstr "그녀의 심장에 숨어있던 부패가 어떤 것이었는지는 모르겠지만, 재빨리 제거되었으면 좋겠군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Rath
#. NodeID = 4acdfc8d-a23b-2048-2fe1-ff236c2f0c02
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:4acdfc8d-a23b-2048-2fe1-ff236c2f0c02
msgctxt "h286a7a47gab41g4606g9c7bg745ca3a4a3bf"
msgid "No, thanks is not enough. May Silvanus bless you for all your days."
msgstr "아니, 감사로는 부족합니다. 실바누스께서 그대를 영원토록 축복하시길."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4cc8f477-d3b6-8445-dbb3-e9076bd85c51
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:4cc8f477-d3b6-8445-dbb3-e9076bd85c51
msgctxt "h4e7d49c1g1cf3g4bdfg9776gcca26ef9bf15"
msgid "For someone like me? It was pretty simple, actually."
msgstr "나에게 말인가? 사실은, 꽤 간단한 일이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Rath
#. NodeID = 4d782d13-14a4-1d19-b7de-91d240f3a328
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:4d782d13-14a4-1d19-b7de-91d240f3a328
msgctxt "hf834aa40gd876g4c43ga7b1g2f380a5b647c"
msgid "As am I. The grove will be whole again."
msgstr "동감입니다. 숲이 다시 온전해질 것입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Rath
#. NodeID = 51903a81-d46d-b579-366f-90e0f8930a4b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:51903a81-d46d-b579-366f-90e0f8930a4b
msgctxt "h4a48bc6cg44e6g4a98g9477gcc5f86849951"
msgid "To be expected. I am glad you survived intact."
msgstr "물론 그랬겠죠. 무사히 살아남으셔서 다행입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Rath
#. NodeID = 5977ad04-c0e7-f4ca-8b87-d42f1125dd99
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:5977ad04-c0e7-f4ca-8b87-d42f1125dd99
msgctxt "hf4e0d482g717bg40ffga549gccc0ca791581"
msgid "...I apologise. I must have some time to myself."
msgstr "...실례합니다. 혼자만의 시간이 좀 필요합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Rath
#. NodeID = 62b0a18a-ce1d-cc7a-ec1d-4f7c25223cdf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - DEN_ShadowDruid_State_HasRune(0) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_ShadowDruid_Event_RathGiveReward = True
#.   Object:
#.     - DEN_ShadowDruid_Event_GiveRune(1) = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - DEN_Conflict_SUB_Halsin.RathRewarded(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:62b0a18a-ce1d-cc7a-ec1d-4f7c25223cdf
msgctxt "h7dc71c70g8599g4f1bg9b05g6b63ee5caf46"
msgid ""
"Let me show you on your map where you can find the cache. Take this rune - "
"you'll need it."
msgstr "지도에 은닉처를 표시해드리겠습니다. 이 룬을 가져가세요. 필요하실 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Rath
#. NodeID = 642f4b24-8971-b81b-bda6-100c43d029fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - DEN_ShadowDruid_State_HasRune(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_ShadowDruid_Event_RathGiveReward = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - DEN_Conflict_SUB_Halsin.RathRewardedAlt(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:642f4b24-8971-b81b-bda6-100c43d029fb
msgctxt "ha8cc4c94gbea6g4565g81b8g5fd817f7f208"
msgid "Where is the rune? My apologies. It seems to have been... <i>taken.</i>"
msgstr "룬이 어디 갔지? 사과드립니다. 아무래도... <i>도둑맞은</i> 것 같습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Rath
#. NodeID = 68c0e927-8fd8-d8f9-48b4-74c611d57b2e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_DruidAttack_State_PrepAfterDeathOfDruids = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:68c0e927-8fd8-d8f9-48b4-74c611d57b2e
msgctxt "h9ee0fee1g5109g448cga657g88f211499d42"
msgid ""
"Nature is an endless cycle of death and rebirth. Silvanus' grace will return "
"to us one day."
msgstr "자연은 죽음과 탄생의 끝없는 순환이지요. 실바누스님의 은총도 언젠가 우리에게 되돌아올 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Rath
#. NodeID = 6b6d98c6-cc93-c480-4725-a09f95c179d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_ShadowDruid_Event_RathGiveReward = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:6b6d98c6-cc93-c480-4725-a09f95c179d3
msgctxt "h98efa642g511eg4602g8533gdfe296962b29"
msgid "You've done it. You brought Halsin back. Thank you."
msgstr "해내셨군요. 당신이 할신 님을 데려왔어요. 감사합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Rath
#. NodeID = 6e69fa39-9bfd-02d1-e661-e7eb601baf1d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:6e69fa39-9bfd-02d1-e661-e7eb601baf1d
msgctxt "hc5f3aebag5371g4adcg9b15ge107ef7cba4c"
msgid "Fair enough. I should not have underestimated you."
msgstr "좋아요. 당신을 과소평가하지 않았어야 했군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Rath
#. NodeID = 705526a7-501e-6b21-5404-4255a38ede93
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:705526a7-501e-6b21-5404-4255a38ede93
msgctxt "h66f1253ag5e7eg44aeg8634g249b537a0cfa"
msgid ""
"All the pain Kagha caused will heal with the season's turn, as it should be."
msgstr "카그하가 초래한 고통도 계절이 바뀌면 자연히 아물겠죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Rath
#. NodeID = 767c6d1f-86c2-0538-9bc8-7631fdd172c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_State_PermaDefeated = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:767c6d1f-86c2-0538-9bc8-7631fdd172c9
msgctxt "hc406d20dg74e7g4484ga5e0gf38af4c9423e"
msgid "May he rest in Summeroak forever. I..."
msgstr "할신 님, 깊은 숲에서 영면하시길. 저는..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7f5a8368-6bc6-6001-c449-6594fe542ad6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:7f5a8368-6bc6-6001-c449-6594fe542ad6
msgctxt "h3a5bb7aagde9cg4e48gb9f8ge3f70ada54fa"
msgid "I'm glad Halsin made it here, but I wish I could have helped more."
msgstr "할신을 이곳에 데려올 수 있어 다행이야. 더 많이 도와주지 못해 아쉽군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Rath
#. NodeID = 80488706-e309-50a1-3a19-a233f069037e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:80488706-e309-50a1-3a19-a233f069037e
msgctxt "h05970646g6621g4409g94f8gd0bdc52cfc5c"
msgid ""
"I... I wish it did not feel too late. This grove is corrupt, its shepherds "
"drowned in blood."
msgstr "너.. 너무 늦지 않았어야 할 텐데요. 이 숲은 오염되었고, 숲의 목자들은 피범벅으로 쓰러져 있어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Rath
#. NodeID = 8b1024bc-7e84-2373-899e-fa30dc020cd0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_ShadowDruid_HasMet_OpposedGoblinHunt(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_GroveConflict_State_DruidsPacified = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_ShadowDruid_HasMet_OpposedGoblinHunt(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:8b1024bc-7e84-2373-899e-fa30dc020cd0
msgctxt "h03046410g71a3g4061ga9b3g99d00036dca9"
msgid "With Halsin's return, you can feel the change in the air."
msgstr "할신 님의 귀환 덕에 주변 분위기가 달라진 걸 느낄 수 있을 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Rath
#. NodeID = 98ccf489-6892-8d6f-44b6-ee1a9f8ace4d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:98ccf489-6892-8d6f-44b6-ee1a9f8ace4d
msgctxt "hb8e52618gd485g4911gbdadg7d600192024e"
msgid "Ah, of course."
msgstr "아, 물론입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Rath
#. NodeID = 98e8df96-2259-4d53-c111-9812172bd28d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:98e8df96-2259-4d53-c111-9812172bd28d
msgctxt "h9c926421g92a7g4ad6ga3ecg44a3200bfdd0"
msgid ""
"But I will leave that for Halsin to judge. He is First Druid, and I will not "
"gainsay him as Kagha has done."
msgstr "그러나 그것은 할신 님께서 판단하실 문제입니다. 그분께서는 최고 드루이드시고, 저는 카그하처럼 그분을 거스르지 않을 것입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Rath
#. NodeID = a337a19d-997a-ff00-5092-f65db396eee8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:a337a19d-997a-ff00-5092-f65db396eee8
msgctxt "ha4a44d6bg19e5g494dg8d9cgd1ce84e8a072"
msgid ""
"That explains... a great deal, although I suppose her true allegiances no "
"longer matter."
msgstr "그것 참... 많은 것이 설명되는군요. 그녀의 진심은 더 이상 중요하지 않은 것 같지만요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Rath
#. NodeID = a4aa839d-db23-856c-bf82-bca1f78d47ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_ShadowDruid_Knows_RathMentionedReward = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:a4aa839d-db23-856c-bf82-bca1f78d47ac
msgctxt "hbd06b0dcgdd4eg484bg9294g450fca815fe4"
msgid "And I promised you a reward, didn't I?"
msgstr "그러고 보니 제가 당신에게 보상을 약속하지 않았나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a67c3260-e7ee-74d7-a3e4-ff94c7329dff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:a67c3260-e7ee-74d7-a3e4-ff94c7329dff
msgctxt "h4af5d1c5g2da9g480fg9c80ga6d069ba9c40"
msgid "After cutting through a grove of druids, goblins were simple."
msgstr "드루이드의 숲의 문제를 해결하는 것에 비하면, 고블린 처리는 간단했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Rath
#. NodeID = a98da16b-106d-189e-fb00-d456515a2d99
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_State_Returned = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:a98da16b-106d-189e-fb00-d456515a2d99
msgctxt "hddd8eaf5ge8b8g46dfgb22cg2b12e16dc1b5"
msgid ""
"I am glad the goblins are no longer a threat. But where... where is Halsin?"
msgstr "고블린들이 더 이상 위협이 아니라니 다행이군요. 하지만... 할신 님은 어디에 계신거죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a99b732e-437a-29e5-a9b1-cc8e77309cb9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_ShadowDruid_Knows_RecruitmentLetter = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_ShadowDruid_Knows_RathLearnedTruth = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:a99b732e-437a-29e5-a9b1-cc8e77309cb9
msgctxt "ha0e096d7g8239g4728g895fg3d344cf93405"
msgid "Kagha was allied with Shadow Druids. I have proof."
msgstr "카그하는 그림자 드루이드와 결탁했다. 나에게 증거가 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aee05872-80ac-0755-a0aa-5c51ce3e6b8b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:aee05872-80ac-0755-a0aa-5c51ce3e6b8b
msgctxt "hb9c1fc64gc55bg4f4eg927fg69f1d90f693d"
msgid "It was a hell full of blood and ash."
msgstr "그곳은 피와 재로 가득한 지옥이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Rath
#. NodeID = b265c463-9270-8488-6abc-bd5528f08bf8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_ShadowDruid_Event_RathGiveReward = False
#.      - DEN_DruidAttack_State_PrepAfterDeathOfDruids = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:b265c463-9270-8488-6abc-bd5528f08bf8
msgctxt "hf9890690gc70cg47e8g9632g05e3cc26798f"
msgid "You've done it. You brought Halsin back."
msgstr "해내셨군요. 당신이 할신 님을 데려왔어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b70caa36-8ca8-7e96-8630-7b0ef429c6c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:b70caa36-8ca8-7e96-8630-7b0ef429c6c3
msgctxt "ha2d419cdg7954g4834gbf4cgcab5a0f7e6e0"
msgid "What will you do now? You're basically the only druid left."
msgstr "이제 어떻게 할 거야? 남은 드루이드는 당신 뿐이잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Rath
#. NodeID = bd8fddd5-8da7-fc9f-7965-63e37cd157e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_ShadowDruid_HasMet_OpposedGoblinHunt(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_ShadowDruid_State_KaghaIsDead = False
#.      - DEN_ShadowDruid_Event_KaghaTurnedGood = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_ShadowDruid_HasMet_OpposedGoblinHunt(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:bd8fddd5-8da7-fc9f-7965-63e37cd157e0
msgctxt "hc3f28e3fgd262g4d72g816eg1c68314fd173"
msgid "Thanks to you, the grove is whole again."
msgstr "감사드립니다, 덕분에 숲은 다시 한 번 완전해 졌습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Rath
#. NodeID = bdb5595b-c7c4-e8c8-8b5a-38950ad4ea3a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:bdb5595b-c7c4-e8c8-8b5a-38950ad4ea3a
msgctxt "ha323ee46g3b0eg42c6g9b40g5663dd15b2bf"
msgid ""
"Halsin will guide us forward, and Kagha's heart will heal. I have full faith "
"in that."
msgstr "할신 님께서 저희를 인도하실 것입니다. 그리고 카그하의 마음도 치유되겠지요. 전 그러길 굳게 믿고 있습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Rath
#. NodeID = bec59840-f525-d9f5-cc32-ea8d5d7c653e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:bec59840-f525-d9f5-cc32-ea8d5d7c653e
msgctxt "hbff54b05g7667g4fa8gb32dg1947050a89e0"
msgid ""
"They were people, not <i>weeds.</i> We all suffered under Kagha's wicked "
"leadership."
msgstr "그들 모두 사람이지, <i>잡초</i>같은 게 아니었어요. 우리 모두 카그하의 거짓된 지도에 고통 받은거죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Rath
#. NodeID = bf4be153-6d79-a328-ba48-463f7f7c5866
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:bf4be153-6d79-a328-ba48-463f7f7c5866
msgctxt "hb7ec571cg56efg4da5ga25ag5043e2038b13"
msgid ""
"I cannot abandon this place. By Silvanus' grace, I will remain here to serve "
"as Halsin sees fit."
msgstr "이곳을 버려둘 순 없습니다. 실바누스의 가호 아래, 할신 님의 뜻을 이어 가기 위해 이곳에 남을겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c8aa9e56-402a-0318-40ee-ee629d676897
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:c8aa9e56-402a-0318-40ee-ee629d676897
msgctxt "h1429dea5g7f81g4320g8976ga52e65d461ec"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce2ba368-ecde-7af3-ed9d-58856389d4ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_Knows_OfRathReward = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:ce2ba368-ecde-7af3-ed9d-58856389d4ec
msgctxt "hf6e773a9g4177g4f14g8c82gfc5d29f8f30d"
msgid "I'm just here for the reward."
msgstr "그냥 보상을 받으러 온 것뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Rath
#. NodeID = d0f1d856-be9f-67ad-90c0-a7d54f0dcc29
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:d0f1d856-be9f-67ad-90c0-a7d54f0dcc29
msgctxt "h597a1ebag9769g4cfegafcbg13b2cea446f4"
msgid ""
"Seeing Halsin gives me the strength to endure everything else. You did the "
"right thing."
msgstr "할신 님을 다시 보게 되니, 다른 모든 것들을 견뎌낼 힘이 생기는군요. 당신은 옳은 일을 한 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d1f535d0-1548-10fb-5b9c-5c4676b0a23f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:d1f535d0-1548-10fb-5b9c-5c4676b0a23f
msgctxt "hbfe8fafag5fa1g4b34g8e6cg3b4e445c8b6f"
msgid "Think nothing of it. I'm glad Halsin is safe."
msgstr "그건 상관없어. 할신이 안전해서 다행이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Rath
#. NodeID = d53ef283-3220-605a-fbbc-fdbe777ecf7b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:d53ef283-3220-605a-fbbc-fdbe777ecf7b
msgctxt "h2001c39bg0cedg46degbf40gfda4745972ad"
msgid ""
"Forgive me. I can only offer my gratitude, and pray Silvanus protects you on "
"your journey."
msgstr "죄송합니다. 감사 말고는 드릴 수 있는 게 없네요, 실바누스께서 당신의 여정을 지켜주시길 기도하겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Rath
#. NodeID = d59b2def-bec1-1a3a-4c81-07de5711d2f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_State_UnderAttack = True
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_State_DenVictory = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:d59b2def-bec1-1a3a-4c81-07de5711d2f5
msgctxt "h9895b775g89fbg4c6bga2dcgb3789177f752"
msgid "Silvanus forgive me."
msgstr "실바누스시여 저를 용서하시길."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Rath
#. NodeID = dfe8036e-0de4-d130-aef2-830e6e794f03
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:dfe8036e-0de4-d130-aef2-830e6e794f03
msgctxt "hcb05d11dgfb63g4169g8bddg62d48e4104e0"
msgid ""
"That... explains a great deal. To think that Kagha could fall to their "
"corruption under Silvanus' gaze."
msgstr "그것참... 많은 것이 설명되는군요. 카그하가 실바누스님의 눈앞에서 타락하다니..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e7932d31-aa47-0a3b-92c1-90bedca9a0f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_Knows_OfRathReward = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:e7932d31-aa47-0a3b-92c1-90bedca9a0f5
msgctxt "hc6bb75ccg178dg4893ga418ge26c4d49d0e9"
msgid "It wasn't. So where's my reward?"
msgstr "물론이지. 그래서 내 보상은?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Rath
#. NodeID = e895116d-29bc-76b4-debd-e1da2f68e7ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_ShadowDruid_Knows_RathMentionedReward = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:e895116d-29bc-76b4-debd-e1da2f68e7ca
msgctxt "h5b4acf5eg5344g4d4dg98efgedc72a16cfab"
msgid "You have my deepest gratitude. I promised you a reward, did I not?"
msgstr "당신께는 진심으로 감사드립니다. 분명 제가 보상을 약속드리지 않았던가요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f295d8e0-abbe-2195-11b5-3daafb4233eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_ShadowDruid_Knows_RecruitmentLetter = True
#.      - DEN_ShadowDruid_Knows_RathLearnedTruth = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_ShadowDruid_Knows_RathLearnedTruth = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:f295d8e0-abbe-2195-11b5-3daafb4233eb
msgctxt "h55201dd2g35adg4234gba15g1f1e06d13ca6"
msgid ""
"If it makes you feel any better, I found proof Kagha was allied with Shadow "
"Druids."
msgstr "마음의 짐을 덜어 줄 수 있을진 모르겠지만, 카그하가 그림자 드루이드들과 결탁하고 있었다는 증거를 찾았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed
#. Speaker = Rath
#. NodeID = f4353872-cf72-b87a-5614-472dd64bc245
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_ShadowDruid_HasMet_OpposedGoblinHunt(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_GroveConflict_State_DruidsPacified = False
#.      - DEN_ShadowDruid_State_KaghaIsDead = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_ShadowDruid_HasMet_OpposedGoblinHunt(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_DruidOpposed:f4353872-cf72-b87a-5614-472dd64bc245
msgctxt "h2ae8e3a2gc3fag48edg8c53gfd31bf7bfcc8"
msgid "Now that Halsin is here, Kagha will surely see sense."
msgstr "이제 할신 님이 오셨으니, 카그하도 분명 정신을 차릴 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_ElevatorBear
#. Speaker = Tuffet
#. NodeID = c6cac313-89a9-5ef2-730d-d60932e7a063
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_ElevatorBear:c6cac313-89a9-5ef2-730d-d60932e7a063
msgctxt "h25b52e0agc143g4cc2gb833g1cd88b710a8b"
msgid "Hmmmm... finally... quiet."
msgstr "흐으음... 드디어... 조용하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_ElevatorBear
#. Speaker = Tuffet
#. NodeID = d3445c97-8ff0-c277-6273-f7f021760392
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_ElevatorBear:d3445c97-8ff0-c277-6273-f7f021760392
msgctxt "h51134e3agf82dg457cga702g9922a242544c"
msgid "*Hum.*"
msgstr "*흠*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeeting
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 0674b2d0-de94-b281-e7b6-ce81eaf0d91b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeeting:0674b2d0-de94-b281-e7b6-ce81eaf0d91b
msgctxt "h7268b7c5g85eeg439bg86dbg79227627e751"
msgid "Wait! <i>Wait! Bows down!</i>"
msgstr "잠깐! <i>기다려! 활 내려!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeeting
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 2fb77264-4d4d-795f-a5cc-92034c306ebc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeeting:2fb77264-4d4d-795f-a5cc-92034c306ebc
msgctxt "h70f613edgf769g44a0g96b1g8e38b161ee9a"
msgid "Gods above, we took you for a goblin. Get up here."
msgstr "세상에, 고블린인 줄 알았잖아. 어서 올라와."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeeting
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 68b11438-a96e-0fbf-afbd-d24ef86e7803
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - DEN_Conflict_SUB_AoD.ArrivedAtGrove(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeeting:68b11438-a96e-0fbf-afbd-d24ef86e7803
msgctxt "hd6728f4dgda75g4fcbg8e13g5bc49f55bee7"
msgid "I want that gate sealed before they arrive - and we need to talk."
msgstr "그놈들이 도착하기 전에 저 문을 봉쇄하고 얘기 좀 하세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeeting
#. Speaker = Asharak
#. NodeID = 983d9539-2992-fdbf-ff9d-2a4c2231d62f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeeting:983d9539-2992-fdbf-ff9d-2a4c2231d62f
msgctxt "ha64b308dg0740g4e8cga9c7g76d6867bf8a3"
msgid "Are you bloody <i>mad</i>? We nearly -"
msgstr "너 진짜 <i>미쳤어</i>? 우리 하마터면-"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeeting
#. Speaker = Asharak
#. NodeID = 9ded21df-9316-582c-2336-f97e77148cd3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeeting:9ded21df-9316-582c-2336-f97e77148cd3
msgctxt "h367d18e8gab25g46degb5f9gc7cd58d5137c"
msgid "Hold! <i>Hold! Weapons down!</i>"
msgstr "멈춰! <i>기다려! 무기 내려!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeeting
#. Speaker = Asharak
#. NodeID = e5567136-887c-f58d-dcb3-f8dac0588016
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - DEN_Conflict_SUB_AoD.ArrivedAtGrove(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeeting:e5567136-887c-f58d-dcb3-f8dac0588016
msgctxt "h8577faa5gf3fag4648g9fd1g8ea24da2545b"
msgid ""
"Never mind. Get up here. I want that gate closed when the goblins arrive."
msgstr "됐어. 빨리 올라와. 고블린이 나타나기 전에 문을 닫아야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeetingWyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 215b8432-5367-9c06-5339-9d09780a4bd0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeetingWyll:215b8432-5367-9c06-5339-9d09780a4bd0
msgctxt "hde990a6fg4c3eg477eg9753gac1c3165c907"
msgid "Fine - one last chance. See that you don't waste it."
msgstr "좋아, 마지막 기회를 주지. 낭비하지 말아야 할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeetingWyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 356afc90-97a0-7ca6-3cd5-a14a0c2c2aa1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeetingWyll:356afc90-97a0-7ca6-3cd5-a14a0c2c2aa1
msgctxt "h3ef6a399gdbadg468bg8da3gad110d8b560e"
msgid ""
"I hate to admit it, but... it's a good plan. Looks like the team's back "
"together."
msgstr "인정하긴 싫지만... 좋은 작전이야. 다시 뭉칠 때가 된 것 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeetingWyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 3b782bc9-3773-1524-2825-a87966fabe6c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeetingWyll:3b782bc9-3773-1524-2825-a87966fabe6c
msgctxt "h04b78a89g5540g427cgb593g5ccfc973d188"
msgid "Did you, now?"
msgstr "허, 그러셨다는 말이지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeetingWyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5b087c63-0a3f-3c37-8dac-21e41c0315e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeetingWyll:5b087c63-0a3f-3c37-8dac-21e41c0315e7
msgctxt "hf1a1c293gdd4eg4481g97d1ga90f9d96cb49"
msgid "Let them try."
msgstr "어디 한 번 해보시지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeetingWyll
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5ce90ce3-238b-28e6-5621-d1cff2f9698a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_Event_PassedByEntrance = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeetingWyll:5ce90ce3-238b-28e6-5621-d1cff2f9698a
msgctxt "h79188685g546ag4663ga298g8ff2259af4d5"
msgid "*The parasite seizes as you approach.*"
msgstr "*당신이 다가가니 기생충이 꿈틀댑니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeetingWyll
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6e867cfd-3e93-c579-010b-bcce94274293
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeetingWyll:6e867cfd-3e93-c579-010b-bcce94274293
msgctxt "hd6354562g283fg4e47ga9f7gc932068fc534"
msgid "*The parasite seizes as you approach.*"
msgstr "*당신이 다가가니 기생충이 꿈틀댑니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeetingWyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9479f1a8-fc24-4c04-9121-e9bb8dbb8cf0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType:
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeetingWyll:9479f1a8-fc24-4c04-9121-e9bb8dbb8cf0
msgctxt "hd42d0fe8g516bg4c44gae5bga6cfce2cae31"
msgid "The goblins are on their way. I've led them right into your trap."
msgstr "고블린들이 오고 있어. 내가 놈들을 네 덫으로 끌어들였지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeetingWyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 949ded30-31b7-d31e-4de4-a7c20e31e849
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(3) = True
#. TagRule: BERSERKER
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeetingWyll:949ded30-31b7-d31e-4de4-a7c20e31e849
msgctxt "hf89ea0dagc96eg42beg8a04gfbcb881a7ca5"
msgid "<b>I'M HERE TO HELP.</b>"
msgstr "<b>난 도우러 온 거야.</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeetingWyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 949ded30-31b7-d31e-4de4-a7c20e31e849
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeetingWyll:949ded30-31b7-d31e-4de4-a7c20e31e849
msgctxt "h6ba2c992ge562g45adg8559g4df8a669bde5"
msgid "I'm here to help. But not afraid to <b>fight</b>."
msgstr "난 도우러 왔지만, 나와 <b>싸우고</b> 싶다면 상대해 주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeetingWyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = b61af41b-def8-0574-f055-7e50e279c29e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - DEN_Conflict_SUB_AoD.ArrivedAtGrove(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeetingWyll:b61af41b-def8-0574-f055-7e50e279c29e
msgctxt "he9b44b16gfbdeg4409g843fg3b13f547622f"
msgid "Inside, and hurry. I want that gate closed when the goblins get here."
msgstr "이리로, 서둘러. 고블린 놈들이 오기 전에 문을 닫아야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeetingWyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = bfd3103f-48e6-118d-a0ae-acede330f106
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeetingWyll:bfd3103f-48e6-118d-a0ae-acede330f106
msgctxt "hc268e327gaf41g4440g8c1agb3bc0be3d07a"
msgid "Give me one reason why they shouldn't slay you where you stand."
msgstr "널 지금 당장 베어버리지 말아야 할 이유를 하나라도 대 보시지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeetingWyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = c31c6a92-7d53-fbee-4b54-ff5bfca57e07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_AttackOnDen_Event_BetrayTieflingsBeforeFight = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeetingWyll:c31c6a92-7d53-fbee-4b54-ff5bfca57e07
msgctxt "h3afe31f1g867fg4738gb1bcg0614d87101e0"
msgid "In the name of the Blade, attack!"
msgstr "칼날의 이름으로, 공격하라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeetingWyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = d43bc281-14af-430c-c38b-26936018b61e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeetingWyll:d43bc281-14af-430c-c38b-26936018b61e
msgctxt "hd092111eg376eg40b2g863dg1bacccf6068a"
msgid "You dare show your face?"
msgstr "감히 그 낯짝을 내게 들이밀어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeetingWyll
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e3c78d2f-0e70-1a77-7b7f-04d70fc8b5ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType:
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(3) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeetingWyll:e3c78d2f-0e70-1a77-7b7f-04d70fc8b5ae
msgctxt "h3c18b33fg93b0g4cb5ga66cgc4cba8cbf6d9"
msgid ""
"You need all the help you can get. Now stand down before I put you down."
msgstr "너 혼자의 힘으로는 어림도 없다. 내가 널 박살을 내 버리기 전에 물러서라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeetingWyll
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = e9fd829c-0cb9-2338-d32a-f86094022f3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_EntranceMeetingWyll:e9fd829c-0cb9-2338-d32a-f86094022f3b
msgctxt "h8423876egc0e2g4ce9ga350g7a9d5b216365"
msgid "You had your chance, and you wasted it."
msgstr "넌 기회가 있었지만, 낭비했네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Elegis
#. NodeID = 33ef60a5-a493-3b8d-8fe8-85b7fa4b5e44
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_HasMet_GatekeeperVictory(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Refugees_State_LeadersAreDead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_Gatekeeper:33ef60a5-a493-3b8d-8fe8-85b7fa4b5e44
msgctxt "h3899c00bgbbebg4d07g9023g3e324fa267de"
msgid ""
"I still can't believe you cleared the roads. Expect I won't until the city "
"gates swing shut behind us."
msgstr "댁이 길을 다 정리했단 게 아직 믿기질 않아. 도시 성문을 지나게 되기 전까진 실감이 안 들 거 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Elegis
#. NodeID = 7643fc83-f60e-e778-4be8-791a2735508f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Refugees_State_LeadersAreDead = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_AttackOnDen_HasMet_GatekeeperVictory(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_Gatekeeper:7643fc83-f60e-e778-4be8-791a2735508f
msgctxt "hd87205e4gf70ag4c80gb821gb5719eefdfc5"
msgid ""
"I expected goblins at our gate any moment. Glad to say that you made a "
"prettier sight."
msgstr "당장이라도 고블린들이 면상을 들이밀 줄 알았는데. 그보다 훨씬 보기 좋은 얼굴이 나타나 다행인걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Elegis
#. NodeID = 7799ddb4-9a46-19f5-7323-e2131e34b8e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_State_DenVictory = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_AttackOnDen_HasMet_GatekeeperVictory(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_Gatekeeper:7799ddb4-9a46-19f5-7323-e2131e34b8e9
msgctxt "h7bed5b05g31c2g4136gb3a4g0f4915e2e30d"
msgid "You didn't have to come back. Thank you."
msgstr "댁 일도 아닌데 돌아와주다니. 고마워."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Elegis
#. NodeID = 9425eb32-5e21-a79b-d0a7-e53f4e74723e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_HasMet_GatekeeperVictory(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_State_DenVictory = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_Gatekeeper:9425eb32-5e21-a79b-d0a7-e53f4e74723e
msgctxt "h77f98455gcf04g4300g94ecg91082d9f1eb7"
msgid "We'd be dead if you hadn't been here..."
msgstr "그쪽이 없었다면 우리 다 죽었을 거야..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Elegis
#. NodeID = cd3a0d12-de77-85f4-0ba9-a37b9cb545a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_HasMet_Gatekeeper(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_Gatekeeper:cd3a0d12-de77-85f4-0ba9-a37b9cb545a7
msgctxt "ha94ace99gab23g4499ga9f7gd54bda0d3ca5"
msgid "I knew they'd find us - I <i>knew</i> it!"
msgstr "놈들이 결국 우리 찾아낼 줄 알았어. <i>알고</i> 있었다고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Elegis
#. NodeID = f1337784-f89e-e295-b603-1b1e35da377c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_AttackOnDen_HasMet_Gatekeeper(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_Gatekeeper:f1337784-f89e-e295-b603-1b1e35da377c
msgctxt "hc3793bedgf761g4bbfgb9aag1dc0e74ec65b"
msgid "Gods... I feel sick. We're not ready for this."
msgstr "맙소사... 속이 안 좋아. 우린 준비가 안 됐다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GoblinLush
#. Speaker = Tracker Azak
#. NodeID = 2dc701a7-42c7-a214-a62d-5b7ec75715c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GOB_DrowCommander_State_AboutToLeave(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GoblinLush:2dc701a7-42c7-a214-a62d-5b7ec75715c8
msgctxt "h406cedb5g17f2g4626gbc96g39c1055d9cde"
msgid "If the Absolute wants 'em dead, we'll <i>massacre</i> 'em!"
msgstr "절대자께서 저들의 죽음을 바라신다면, 우리는 놈들을 <i>학살</i> 하리라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GoblinLush
#. Speaker = Tracker Azak
#. NodeID = c4003044-ae76-64f5-3a65-51927f51f17c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GoblinLush:c4003044-ae76-64f5-3a65-51927f51f17c
msgctxt "hc71f7e05g4014g4456g9a79gc5c1b6374885"
msgid "Absolute praise us!"
msgstr "절대자께서 우리에게 영광을 주시리라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GoblinLush
#. Speaker = Tracker Azak
#. NodeID = ed0c7fcc-191d-10b0-61ac-0ee97c235ea2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_State_Victorious(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GoblinLush:ed0c7fcc-191d-10b0-61ac-0ee97c235ea2
msgctxt "h2cd58d2eg4574g4f71gb53cg25f8e4974d5c"
msgid ""
"You see what I did? The Absolute's gonna recognise me, make me a True Soul, "
"I tell ya."
msgstr "내가 뭘 했는지 봤어? 절대자께서 나를 알아보실 거야, 그리고 날 <b>참된 영혼</b>으로 만들어 주실 거야, 두고 보라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_Griefling
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 1e195353-8010-ecd4-6b43-1a20bdb0b2b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_AttackOnDen_HasMet_Griefling(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_Griefling:1e195353-8010-ecd4-6b43-1a20bdb0b2b8
msgctxt "h0f490a16g933fg41e2ga4ffg112573cc0819"
msgid ""
"I'm ready for this - I'd rather die fighting than with an arrow in my back."
msgstr "난 준비됐어. 등에 화살을 맞고 죽느니 차라리 싸우다 죽는 걸 택하겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_Griefling
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 2e6061fa-321c-abc6-b4e7-4b97e3ab85ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_HasMet_GrieflingVictory(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Refugees_State_LeadersAreDead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_Griefling:2e6061fa-321c-abc6-b4e7-4b97e3ab85ac
msgctxt "hd9b098b5gb23dg4c30gb25eg8234419a5ab6"
msgid "Wish I'd been with you - would have killed a few goblins myself."
msgstr "너와 같이 갔었어야 했는데. 고블린 몇 놈이라도 내 손으로 죽일 수 있었을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_Griefling
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 334511b4-89df-98ff-e286-d3684cfba17e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_State_DenVictory = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_AttackOnDen_HasMet_GrieflingVictory(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_Griefling:334511b4-89df-98ff-e286-d3684cfba17e
msgctxt "h231a6eafg6d72g420ag983fg50a7e9c97241"
msgid "It won't bring the dead back... but that felt good."
msgstr "죽은 자들이 살아서 돌아오지는 않겠지만...기분은 좋네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_Griefling
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 9d762ba5-bdbe-3cc6-5cf2-0af4e0f4d74e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Refugees_State_LeadersAreDead = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_AttackOnDen_HasMet_GrieflingVictory(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_Griefling:9d762ba5-bdbe-3cc6-5cf2-0af4e0f4d74e
msgctxt "ha5cb30c5gbbc8g4a41g88bdg72fbd1f4d9ad"
msgid "You killed the goblins? Hope you made them suffer."
msgstr "고블린들을 죽였어? 고통스러운 죽음을 선사했길 바라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_Griefling
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = b8b895d9-33e7-6212-0fa7-825e2a8926e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_HasMet_GrieflingVictory(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_State_DenVictory = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_Griefling:b8b895d9-33e7-6212-0fa7-825e2a8926e0
msgctxt "ha0b66e01g13c2g4811g8603gd83787399a27"
msgid "Kanon can rest now..."
msgstr "카논은 이제 쉴 수 있을 거야..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_Griefling
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = cab89855-59d9-7067-bb21-d5b0d0b78e02
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_HasMet_Griefling(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_Griefling:cab89855-59d9-7067-bb21-d5b0d0b78e02
msgctxt "h84e60ce2g6670g4871gb1d7g13b2fdab8ea4"
msgid "You ready? I can't <i>wait</i>."
msgstr "준비됐어? 도저히 <i>기다릴</i> 수가 없는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = 005a818a-992b-2a54-da74-cec55307295a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:005a818a-992b-2a54-da74-cec55307295a
msgctxt "h712d21e7gb490g47cag9868g6603ccff3986"
msgid ""
"I do mind. This isn't exactly my bravest moment; I'd rather suffer it alone."
msgstr "상관 있어요. 내가 가장 용기 없는 순간이니까.. 그냥 혼자 견디는 게 나아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = 0c25c990-51b3-6750-9aa8-7ee32a3cc8e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_AttackOnDen_Event_GrieflingFriendFights = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:0c25c990-51b3-6750-9aa8-7ee32a3cc8e4
msgctxt "h929145f4gd05bg4578g912cg4a0747acb082"
msgid ""
"<i>Mrag. </i>I'd like to see 'Memnos' rhyme in some heroic verse. Fine. I'll "
"help."
msgstr "<i>므락. </i>'멤노스'가 영웅 시가에서 노래되는 꼴을 봐야겠어요. 좋아요. 내가 돕죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = 0d1fc3f4-ef9b-3415-4514-72968e48a5ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend_AskedQuestion1(1) = True
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend_Event_WonPersuade(1) = False
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_HasMet_GrieflingFriend(1) = True
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend_PersuadeAttempt(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:0d1fc3f4-ef9b-3415-4514-72968e48a5ea
msgctxt "hdc3a6adagfd8ag4c92g98d6g0de1c546ec13"
msgid "You'd do better to find somewhere safe than wasting your time on me."
msgstr "저한테 시간 낭비 말고 안전한 곳을 찾아보는 게 좋을 거예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0ea66012-7c73-220c-da1a-673278791014
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend_AskedQuestion1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:0ea66012-7c73-220c-da1a-673278791014
msgctxt "h89416d35g7cd8g4230g9e19g8b3ec570dddc"
msgid "Prayers can wait - you're needed to help with the defences."
msgstr "기도는 나중에 해도 돼 - 가서 수비를 돕도록 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0fe54de8-9b4c-f26e-2a02-ce1523a44294
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend_Knows_Kelemvor(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_KELEMVOR(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend_AskedQuestion1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:0fe54de8-9b4c-f26e-2a02-ce1523a44294
msgctxt "h8680f2dagd711g4c35gbb9cg14c0efd2e7b6"
msgid "Why are you praying to the god of the dead?"
msgstr "왜 죽음의 신에게 기도하고 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = 13986b0d-f122-54f4-ed64-165a538e6073
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:13986b0d-f122-54f4-ed64-165a538e6073
msgctxt "h93955064gb06fg47fbgadebg7f2c443dea7c"
msgid ""
"Oh, I'll die today. That much I'm sure of. But I'll do it here, on my own "
"terms. Leave me."
msgstr "오, 난 오늘 죽을 거예요. 확실하죠. 하지만 내가 택한 나만의 방식대로 죽겠어요. 그러니 좀 내버려둬요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 14ac4f09-6bb0-5f41-0070-9e1ad149caf7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend_PersuadeAttempt(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:14ac4f09-6bb0-5f41-0070-9e1ad149caf7
msgctxt "heaf9b923g0235g41bdgb4afg9d44b165a437"
msgid "You have to try. We need every able body, or we're doomed."
msgstr "시도는 해봐야지. 우리에겐 하나라도 많은 전력이 필요해. 아니면 모두가 죽을 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 18b06fa3-c9c2-222e-9465-5d15bcc49b23
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend_Knows_Kelemvor(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:18b06fa3-c9c2-222e-9465-5d15bcc49b23
msgctxt "h2c88e355ga8bfg4ad8g9a96gbd67dfa12dda"
msgid "*You realise he prays to Kelemvor, Lord of Death.*"
msgstr "*당신은 그가 망자의 군주, 켈렘보르에게 기도하는 것을 깨달았습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = 228fbc3b-b197-7215-0964-26ae4aad310d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_AttackOnDen_Event_GrieflingFriendFights = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:228fbc3b-b197-7215-0964-26ae4aad310d
msgctxt "h43f6caa8g834eg422dgab8bge90ad8088139"
msgid ""
"Damned either way then... but at least I can go out with a weapon in my "
"hand. All right. I'll do what I can."
msgstr "어느 쪽이든 맘에 들지 않는군요... 하지만 적어도 싸울 순 있겠지요. 좋아요, 해봐요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = 22e0bac3-cbb7-1728-e538-f832edf3d441
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend_Event_WonPersuade(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_AttackOnDen_Event_GrieflingFriendFights = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:22e0bac3-cbb7-1728-e538-f832edf3d441
msgctxt "hdfad5ce2g68b7g4d80gba17geb25f7268cb5"
msgid ""
"Damn you... fine. I'll see what I can do. Maybe I'll manage to take a goblin "
"down with me."
msgstr "젠장... 알았어요. 최선을 다해보죠. 어쩌면 고블린 한 마리 정도는 죽이고 나서 죽을 수 있을 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 231a7ce0-b377-b17c-653a-66e326d5785a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend_Knows_Kelemvor(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend_PersuadeAttempt(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:231a7ce0-b377-b17c-653a-66e326d5785a
msgctxt "h51d97dc5g64cfg415ag80a4g0ddd2a8ee244"
msgid ""
"Kelemvor judges cowards more harshly than others. Better if you die in "
"combat."
msgstr "켈렘보르는 겁쟁이를 다른 신들보다 더 엄격하게 심판하지. 싸우다 죽는 편이 나을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = 2f294f53-de1c-9124-1ff0-626257f68013
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_NEUTRAL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_AttackOnDen_HasMet_GrieflingFriend(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:2f294f53-de1c-9124-1ff0-626257f68013
msgctxt "hbaa38efbg665ag4261ga38bg762dad223078"
msgid "'Lathander to light, Selûne to guide, Kelemvor to show mercy -'"
msgstr "'라샌더여 빛을 밝혀주소서, 셀루네여 인도해 주소서, 켈렘보르여 자비를 베푸소서 -'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = 343a9f32-bf47-f5e4-c733-c6f12b85f553
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Refugees_State_LeadersAreDead = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_AttackOnDen_HasMet_GrieflingFriendVictory(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:343a9f32-bf47-f5e4-c733-c6f12b85f553
msgctxt "hdaa44fdbg53d5g43ecgb98cg25e5dbd38f58"
msgid "You've solved one problem for us. Guess it's on us to solve the next."
msgstr "문제 하나를 해결해주었군요. 남은 문제는 우리가 풀어야 할 숙제겠지요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = 34651d5d-81d1-fd70-2f8e-7313c81e866a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_AttackOnDen_HasMet_GrieflingFriend(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:34651d5d-81d1-fd70-2f8e-7313c81e866a
msgctxt "h03036a92gd6d0g46cdg9764g46a4437b9305"
msgid "'Lathander to light, Selûne to guide, Kelemvor to show mercy -'"
msgstr "'라샌더여 빛을 밝혀주소서, 셀루네여 인도해 주소서, 켈렘보르여 자비를 베푸소서 -'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 38e6e90c-11c4-cd73-732e-b7fc4bc2093a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:38e6e90c-11c4-cd73-732e-b7fc4bc2093a
msgctxt "h15094f3bg3a56g4697gbb80g99d1171a7f08"
msgid "Mind if I join you in prayer?"
msgstr "함께 기도해도 상관 없지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 42075074-f528-8884-0e99-daf113e97da2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:42075074-f528-8884-0e99-daf113e97da2
msgctxt "h73851d48g0f99g40bega519g34aeb692a8c1"
msgid "<i>Leave the coward be.</i>"
msgstr "<i>겁쟁이를 그대로 내버려 둔다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = 4ebe8948-e522-5123-7491-b7accad6235c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_AttackOnDen_Event_GrieflingFriendFights = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:4ebe8948-e522-5123-7491-b7accad6235c
msgctxt "hb17e334agc61dg4502g9b96g39cdae08749e"
msgid ""
"<i>Mrag. </i>Of course I'm going to die... but I might as well get my hands "
"dirty before that."
msgstr "<i>므락. </i>물론 죽음을 피할 순 없겠죠... 하지만 그 전에 손 좀 더럽힐 수 있을지도 모르겠군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = 52d3da74-a375-6eb3-84d0-0953ece1399b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:52d3da74-a375-6eb3-84d0-0953ece1399b
msgctxt "hdf5e4406g666fg440agab37gd2e5d2f0f553"
msgid "Well, seems like I'll be facing him before long. All of us will."
msgstr "곧 그 신을 마주하게 될 테니까요. 우리 모두."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 55c30873-56a7-303d-18e8-279fe82a01c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend_Knows_Kelemvor(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend_PersuadeAttempt(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:55c30873-56a7-303d-18e8-279fe82a01c6
msgctxt "h375f5666g7749g4717g91e1g6d7e49567c7a"
msgid "<b>FIGHT, COWARD.</b>"
msgstr "<b>싸워, 이 겁쟁아.</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = 5a341549-bd3b-25d4-78fb-ddf4df462156
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:5a341549-bd3b-25d4-78fb-ddf4df462156
msgctxt "hc84b8eccge7b1g4a4bga65bga78e82ee7a2c"
msgid "Leave me spend my final moments how I want."
msgstr "마지막 순간은 내가 원하는 대로 보내게 내버려 둬요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = 5ae4558d-bb59-cb1e-caea-0a1e71273fbf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:5ae4558d-bb59-cb1e-caea-0a1e71273fbf
msgctxt "hc9287dc2g7be7g4fb1gbb3ag61a64acf78dc"
msgid "Why, because I'm not sharpening steel or strutting on the wall?"
msgstr "왜요, 내가 날을 갈거나 벽 위를 순찰하고 있지 않아서요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = 5caf0672-31f7-33b2-e5e2-95e238870c4c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:5caf0672-31f7-33b2-e5e2-95e238870c4c
msgctxt "h03b561ffg16d4g4118gaeaagfee5ec4552a4"
msgid ""
"We're doomed either way. Best to stop struggling and hope the end's swift."
msgstr "어차피 우린 죽을 운명이야. 괜히 발버둥치느니 고통 없이 끝나기를 바라는 게 낫지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = 62a506fd-d31e-7688-4f0b-ad87fbe50658
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_HasMet_GrieflingFriendVictory(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Refugees_State_LeadersAreDead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:62a506fd-d31e-7688-4f0b-ad87fbe50658
msgctxt "hca5d526cg6d51g448fg8d63ga6202f6cf4d2"
msgid "This is a beautiful place - and I can't bloody wait to be free of it."
msgstr "정말 아름다운 곳이야 - 어서 해방 됐으면 좋겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = 744e1203-5483-839d-831e-d54cef48cecb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend_Event_WonPersuade(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:744e1203-5483-839d-831e-d54cef48cecb
msgctxt "h389c677cg40abg4b69g9ddbg136aa0731fac"
msgid "Fine. I'll see what I can do. It won't be much - trust me."
msgstr "알았어. 최선을 다해보지. 별 소용은 없겠지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = 7afc0062-7512-1175-d6e5-79ef21d36030
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_HasMet_GrieflingFriendVictory(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_State_DenVictory = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:7afc0062-7512-1175-d6e5-79ef21d36030
msgctxt "h7f64d96cg9274g479eg8d92gbbcc97d22c9e"
msgid "I doubt I'd still be drawing breath without your help. Thank you."
msgstr "당신이 없었더라면 이미 죽었을 거예요. 감사합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = 7e52159b-9250-9b31-44bd-0bfaca0d7774
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend_Event_WonPersuade(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:7e52159b-9250-9b31-44bd-0bfaca0d7774
msgctxt "h63ea3df5gf432g494dg8d82gcefa4f8e7d0d"
msgid "See you during the fight."
msgstr "전장에서 봐요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = 84cba95c-e6a0-ad29-5869-478776c5c05a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:84cba95c-e6a0-ad29-5869-478776c5c05a
msgctxt "h6310a8f3g0116g40bcg851bgdad608fe745c"
msgid "Crazy fool! Are you in a rush to see us all dead?!"
msgstr "미친놈! 우리가 죽는 걸 그렇게 보고 싶냐?!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = 8852c02d-5481-63cf-4d70-46892d09e1bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_Event_GrieflingPermadefeated = True
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_State_DenVictory = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_AttackOnDen_HasMet_GrieflingFriendVictory(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:8852c02d-5481-63cf-4d70-46892d09e1bc
msgctxt "hd8c3582eg0c11g43c8gb314g931b2fb90a98"
msgid ""
"We won. I'd like to think Arka died happy, but... well. Perhaps now she's at "
"peace."
msgstr "우리가 이겼군. 그래도 아르카가 행복하게 죽었다고 생각하고는 싶지만, 글쎄요. 지금은 평온을 찾았겠죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = 89063605-bcb0-3d9e-1910-3b95d23cad56
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend_Event_LaezelPersuadeFail(1) = True
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend_Event_WonPersuade(1) = False
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_HasMet_GrieflingFriend(1) = True
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend_PersuadeAttempt(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:89063605-bcb0-3d9e-1910-3b95d23cad56
msgctxt "h3c7dd0a4g11e3g4a48g8e0dg1deeb607e425"
msgid "Spare me your empty threats and go away, <i>mragreshem</i>."
msgstr "의미없는 위협 좀 그만 주고 저리 가, <i>므라그레셤</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9b72d0f1-1462-435e-75f0-9cdbd1b01b3a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:9b72d0f1-1462-435e-75f0-9cdbd1b01b3a
msgctxt "h19403869g8414g4e20ga45fgd8c2142e0ad6"
msgid ""
"*You recognise Kelemvor, the Lord of Death. The tiefling thinks he will die "
"soon.*"
msgstr "*당신은 망자의 군주, 켈렘보르를 떠올립니다. 이 티플링은 자신이 곧 죽을 거라고 생각합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9de0a92d-c627-0306-b0cc-45f773217405
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:9de0a92d-c627-0306-b0cc-45f773217405
msgctxt "hd98f9d61g1c6fg4247gab04gb497706c03b1"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9e2c902e-5763-e9ab-6c9b-7a1895bb7b67
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:9e2c902e-5763-e9ab-6c9b-7a1895bb7b67
msgctxt "hf6bd7154g3d90g4ef0ga09cg6b7f1c901461"
msgid "<i>Attack him.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그를 공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = a0b8a5aa-723c-ca80-173e-77603c2163bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_AttackOnDen_Event_GrieflingFriendFights = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:a0b8a5aa-723c-ca80-173e-77603c2163bb
msgctxt "h33d1c61dg59b3g461fga5aaga5acf87f8d2c"
msgid ""
"<i>Mrag</i>. Who needs goblins to be afraid of when we've you for company?"
msgstr "<i>므락</i>. 당신이 함께하는데 누가 고블린들을 두려워하겠어요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = a35b37c7-0b26-929b-e095-ae3565209d6e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:a35b37c7-0b26-929b-e095-ae3565209d6e
msgctxt "h44d1d949gb7d5g4b3ega65dg99bf2983243b"
msgid "I knew I smelled the stink of cowardice."
msgstr "어디서 겁쟁이의 악취가 진동한다 했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a3c7c94d-5457-6e13-15be-40d4dfccf00e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_KELEMVOR(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend_AskedQuestion1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:a3c7c94d-5457-6e13-15be-40d4dfccf00e
msgctxt "h495e9fb5g43f5g43adgb95egb034333e8fe0"
msgid ""
"Kelemvor's judgement is always fair. You're wasting your time trying to "
"curry his favour."
msgstr "켈렘보르의 심판은 언제나 공정해. 그의 환심을 사려는 건 시간 낭비일 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ae21e643-72c5-2b47-a0fd-572e36e0b5b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend_Knows_Kelemvor(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend_PersuadeAttempt(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:ae21e643-72c5-2b47-a0fd-572e36e0b5b7
msgctxt "h2fd0dbafg1cddg4608g9a8dg18fe8afb32d4"
msgid "Better if you die in combat then live on as a coward."
msgstr "비겁자로 사느니 싸우다 죽는 게 나을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b1779f42-5d4f-a285-f5ce-524ddd5ca3e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend_PersuadeAttempt(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:b1779f42-5d4f-a285-f5ce-524ddd5ca3e8
msgctxt "h7c7d9092g63d2g46e5gb43ag22e879cc49ac"
msgid ""
"Songs will be sung for today's heroes. Do your part, and your name will live "
"on."
msgstr "오늘의 싸움은 언젠가 노래로 불리겠지. 네 역할을 다하면, 네 이름이 길이 기억될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = b1aed979-b922-27b0-1f09-4c16ce0d563c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend_Event_LaezelPersuadeFail(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:b1aed979-b922-27b0-1f09-4c16ce0d563c
msgctxt "h3307d6c2g3726g480bgb6c2g238e9d868345"
msgid ""
"There's a horde coming for us all. Do you really think I care about your "
"threats?"
msgstr "고블린 군대가 여기로 몰려오고 있는데, 내가 네 위협에 신경 쓸 것 같아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = b3bfd001-d3ce-12a0-b624-fa8af2667b49
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_State_DenVictory = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_AttackOnDen_HasMet_GrieflingFriendVictory(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:b3bfd001-d3ce-12a0-b624-fa8af2667b49
msgctxt "h63605f41g693cg4a99g94bdg3a723df952d7"
msgid "We... we actually did it. We thrashed the lot of them!"
msgstr "우리... 우리가 진짜 해냈어요. 그놈들 모두 혼쭐 내줬다고요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b455afd0-7de6-37b2-8053-2e28076f0204
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend_Knows_Kelemvor(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend_AskedQuestion1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:b455afd0-7de6-37b2-8053-2e28076f0204
msgctxt "h908a381dg33d0g4036gba48g35a97af1cd43"
msgid "You don't look busy."
msgstr "그리 바빠 보이진 않는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b58cdcec-7da4-c8bf-8c20-61380c07581f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend_PersuadeAttempt(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:b58cdcec-7da4-c8bf-8c20-61380c07581f
msgctxt "h717ddd43gb929g46bdgb985g9b831e881a2f"
msgid "I'll kill you myself if you don't grab a weapon and join the line."
msgstr "무기를 잡고 전선으로 나가지 않으면 내 손으로 널 죽여주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b9ab670c-82a8-eea6-0f39-f6a711540a5f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FIGHTER(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:b9ab670c-82a8-eea6-0f39-f6a711540a5f
msgctxt "h7adb9ba0g9995g4e7cgb652g71421477ef6a"
msgid "Every fighter was once a novice. Better that than a victim."
msgstr "어떤 전사도 처음부터 능숙하게 칼을 다루지는 못하지. 적어도 가만히 당하는 것보다는 낫잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = c18e7994-160e-0750-4ec1-97b23beadd6a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:c18e7994-160e-0750-4ec1-97b23beadd6a
msgctxt "hbdeb54bbgc17ag4b66gad4cg70e14e37ea27"
msgid "What is it? I'm... I'm busy."
msgstr "대체 무슨 일이죠? 저... 전 바쁘다고요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c1ba6dd7-c392-6d4b-ecd5-680aa0347eaf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:c1ba6dd7-c392-6d4b-ecd5-680aa0347eaf
msgctxt "h78954e48ga278g422cg82a0g5a9f14d625da"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = c491a6c9-beae-f732-f327-13e52a797c9f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend_Event_WonPersuade(1) = True
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_HasMet_GrieflingFriend(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:c491a6c9-beae-f732-f327-13e52a797c9f
msgctxt "h7d372134gf2f4g4294g882eg25877462e2df"
msgid ""
"Thank you, for talking some sense into me. I'll do my best when the fighting "
"starts."
msgstr "고마워요, 정신 차리게 해줘서. 전투가 시작되면 내가 할 수 있는 최선을 다 할게요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = c6952ed0-b8d7-d70c-0118-827f5498ee1a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:c6952ed0-b8d7-d70c-0118-827f5498ee1a
msgctxt "hd93b1221g5181g402dgaf7bg15cf573e5869"
msgid "I can pray a lot better than I can use a bow or a sword."
msgstr "전 활쏘기나 칼질하는 것보다 기도하는 게 훨씬 더 나을 거예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = ca90d1e7-9ec6-490c-7ebf-5ad7f54b58db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:ca90d1e7-9ec6-490c-7ebf-5ad7f54b58db
msgctxt "h9917bc17g52b0g4a3fg843fg0da54dec4b56"
msgid ""
"Prayer's all I've got right now. And best to pray to the god I'm liable to "
"meet soon."
msgstr "지금 제가 할 수 있는 게 기도밖에 없다고요. 곧 만나게 될 신께 기도를 올리는 게 최선이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = d634228f-10d4-e456-6e06-2e3e65ce3462
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend_AskedQuestion1(1) = False
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend_Event_WonPersuade(1) = False
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_HasMet_GrieflingFriend(1) = True
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend_PersuadeAttempt(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:d634228f-10d4-e456-6e06-2e3e65ce3462
msgctxt "hfa0737f4gbb19g406bga09eg0ca296a351be"
msgid "'Kelemvor to judge kindly, Helm to protect -'"
msgstr "'켈렘보르께서 친히 심판하시고, 헬름께서 보호하사-'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = ef5b6e20-d410-5d72-d636-1ff0ce27996e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:ef5b6e20-d410-5d72-d636-1ff0ce27996e
msgctxt "ha5db2801g7a74g4327g970bg58157437d3cd"
msgid ""
"I don't care about my blasted name. The dead don't need compliments from the "
"living. Leave me alone."
msgstr "내 망할 이름 따위야 어쨌든 관심 없다고요. 죽은 자에게 산 자의 칭찬 따위는 필요 없어요. 그만 좀 내버려둬요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f45bfa51-a5d6-07aa-26c4-ef083caf284c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_KELEMVOR(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:f45bfa51-a5d6-07aa-26c4-ef083caf284c
msgctxt "hea8d3e9ag57cag4210g809dg2093d830111c"
msgid ""
"My god abhors cowards. If you do nothing, your fate is sealed in his eyes."
msgstr "나의 주신께서는 겁쟁이를 경멸하신다. 아무것도 하지 않겠다면, 켈렘보르께서 네 운명을 외면하실 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = f6ab0183-a220-1145-f74a-53d0f7f9c837
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend_Event_WonPersuade(1) = False
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_HasMet_GrieflingFriend(1) = True
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend_PersuadeAttempt(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:f6ab0183-a220-1145-f74a-53d0f7f9c837
msgctxt "hbeffb324geaffg4272gb9a7gb352f36c00c5"
msgid "Can't you just leave me be? This is my last moment of peace."
msgstr "그냥 날 내버려 두면 안 되나요? 내 마지막으로 평화로운 순간이라고요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = f6df6608-b396-2006-5c14-71a2d542c124
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_HasMet_GrieflingFriendVictory(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_Event_GrieflingPermadefeated = True
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_State_DenVictory = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:f6df6608-b396-2006-5c14-71a2d542c124
msgctxt "he3b0167fg0a75g452eg958bge8f24d323384"
msgid "Don't... don't say any words over her. Arka wouldn't want that."
msgstr "그녀에 관해... 아무 말도 하지 마세요. 아르카가 원하지 않을 거예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = fc06a01e-b71c-733f-2b39-bb0e2a5f470b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_GrieflingFriend:fc06a01e-b71c-733f-2b39-bb0e2a5f470b
msgctxt "hea3284e9g3659g414fg9cddg90a8d7b298ad"
msgid "Please, leave me be. I said I was busy."
msgstr "제발, 절 내버려 둬요. 바쁘다고 말했잖아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_AttackOnDen_Grunting
