msgctxt "h8933b72bg77bbg4deagbf84g5c3b3f47ef08"
msgid "Feels like we're all waiting to die."
msgstr "다들 죽는 날만 기다리는 느낌이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_Guards
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 7add645b-f971-e209-f79b-7a34ac543799
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_CapturedGoblin_Event_Resolved = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_Guards:7add645b-f971-e209-f79b-7a34ac543799
msgctxt "h6602fbedgf0afg4e2agbe60g754b0fac1a01"
msgid "I wonder when the goblins will come."
msgstr "고블린 놈들이 언제 또 오려나 궁금하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_Guards
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = 7e670c98-2dec-6fd3-3654-037cc6fab8b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_Guards:7e670c98-2dec-6fd3-3654-037cc6fab8b2
msgctxt "hfcb94f97g7f53g4e5eg90b0g24f46a7d205e"
msgid "He's gone, Arka."
msgstr "이미 죽었어, 아르카."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_Guards
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 7f4b7043-0a8a-1faf-e86c-6effd10febae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_Guards:7f4b7043-0a8a-1faf-e86c-6effd10febae
msgctxt "h616dbb5bg8083g447fgb09fge8ee556c528a"
msgid "Kanon?"
msgstr "카논?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_Guards
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 8a156253-dc1a-97cd-03ae-0c7784e9f5ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_Event_GoblinShot = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_Guards:8a156253-dc1a-97cd-03ae-0c7784e9f5ee
msgctxt "h1f3c459dg214dg479bga28ag29522ff6d00d"
msgid "There, done."
msgstr "자, 뒈졌군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_Guards
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 8ace7cf5-81c5-8438-02a5-1ac8b4f21aba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_Guards:8ace7cf5-81c5-8438-02a5-1ac8b4f21aba
msgctxt "h279466dbgd822g438dgab33g2c0b5f086da1"
msgid "Absolutely. I could use the target practice."
msgstr "물론이지. 표적 연습 거리가 필요하거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_Guards
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = 8b195a48-6c07-ad9f-db83-c8c6b16bda9d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_Guards:8b195a48-6c07-ad9f-db83-c8c6b16bda9d
msgctxt "he62613bbg8edfg49b1g91e8gad8a367f6349"
msgid "Arka, what-"
msgstr "아르카, 뭘-"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_Guards
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = 9733689b-c517-beba-d696-bd782cd07918
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_Guards:9733689b-c517-beba-d696-bd782cd07918
msgctxt "h5b98071fgfbe1g495dg957eg9d2fd2b8be03"
msgid "You say that like you're looking forward to it."
msgstr "꼭 그렇게 되길 기대한다는 것처럼 들리는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_Guards
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 97d792ba-b0a7-88ba-d8ae-bff2a0f6dbfd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_InTransit = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_Guards:97d792ba-b0a7-88ba-d8ae-bff2a0f6dbfd
msgctxt "h9cc37944gb703g44fdgacbdg2206185e7038"
msgid "And I know who."
msgstr "마침 한 년이 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_Guards
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = ac19232b-6ad5-c197-58d3-7988a127a44c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_Guards:ac19232b-6ad5-c197-58d3-7988a127a44c
msgctxt "h60e7e9efg683dg4717gbe67g58305c27794a"
msgid "I'll find you. Count on it."
msgstr "널 찾아낼 테다. 두고 보라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_Guards
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = b076d098-84bb-ed9a-1592-f31c12310583
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_Guards:b076d098-84bb-ed9a-1592-f31c12310583
msgctxt "h973105b3g0fd7g488fg80f0gb9abd775cc11"
msgid "Don't do this to me, Kanon."
msgstr "날 두고 가지 마, 카논."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_Guards
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = b8777a8d-33f2-a9c3-f9ba-a95c938d0885
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_Event_GuardsStayed = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 9d5fb485-8f36-c21b-52d1-c92a1ce047de_Local_Idle_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 9d5fb485-8f36-c21b-52d1-c92a1ce047de_Local_Idle_C = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_Guards:b8777a8d-33f2-a9c3-f9ba-a95c938d0885
msgctxt "hbe461467g1405g4a68g8b85gc9f33dce7f75"
msgid "Shame the goblins didn't kill me too."
msgstr "나도 고블린 손에 죽었다면 좋았을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_Guards
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = bbea8e92-a13c-7e88-c8fc-ef2852bc14eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_Guards:bbea8e92-a13c-7e88-c8fc-ef2852bc14eb
msgctxt "h4c958933g3b60g4fa0g8e76g3aa2a9901c68"
msgid "Don't say that."
msgstr "그런 말 하지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_Guards
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = d3ca2030-a0cf-55da-558e-cd4b48039177
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_Guards:d3ca2030-a0cf-55da-558e-cd4b48039177
msgctxt "hf1aed7f7gf8dbg47abg80dcg10a97a37eab0"
msgid "I could use the target practice."
msgstr "표적 연습 거리가 필요하니까 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_Guards
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = d786ac6b-1a07-cadf-026a-0c96d62a1cc7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_Event_LeftToGrief = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_Guards:d786ac6b-1a07-cadf-026a-0c96d62a1cc7
msgctxt "hd98edb4fg9888g418dg8aabgeba3a1200fcb"
msgid "Someone's going to answer for this."
msgstr "누군가는 이 대가를 치러야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_Guards
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = db0e2ef8-29e3-9764-e3e6-a4045497aff2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_Guards:db0e2ef8-29e3-9764-e3e6-a4045497aff2
msgctxt "h02f1f817gddceg4032g8c38ga6da179a6707"
msgid "I'm just sad. And bored."
msgstr "슬프기만 해. 지겹고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_Guards
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = f19ea148-e52a-a118-1712-d5cc046de033
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_LeftPrison = True
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_Event_Foiled = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_Guards:f19ea148-e52a-a118-1712-d5cc046de033
msgctxt "hb19c885bg450fg4609gb197ga0abc39bf815"
msgid "She... she got away. Gods <i>damn </i>it!"
msgstr "그년이... 도망쳤잖아. 이런 젠장!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_Guards
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = f2f11df5-3ed0-f71e-0869-06eb7d7ae9f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_Guards:f2f11df5-3ed0-f71e-0869-06eb7d7ae9f2
msgctxt "hda186bdfg487dg47d5gad14gb59ad8d8cb70"
msgid "<i>Please</i>."
msgstr "<i>제발</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_TieflingLeader
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 021fee8f-5a67-88fb-3440-8fe47960bb8e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_TieflingLeader:021fee8f-5a67-88fb-3440-8fe47960bb8e
msgctxt "h26a264adgad21g4405gad39g5489933e4617"
msgid "What do <i>you </i>know about the Absolute?"
msgstr "절대자에 대해 <i>네가</i>알고 있는 건 뭐냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_TieflingLeader
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 0bfee93f-2388-a8dd-c662-e0f598588d61
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 9e2ef14b-1a2f-4edc-3f78-7e3a27967e5c_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 9e2ef14b-1a2f-4edc-3f78-7e3a27967e5c_C = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_TieflingLeader:0bfee93f-2388-a8dd-c662-e0f598588d61
msgctxt "hc5bc35f0g1d82g43f4g83c8g7821ba5259a3"
msgid "Why don't you just set me free, tiefy?"
msgstr "티플링아, 그냥 좀 풀어주면 안 되냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_TieflingLeader
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 0c46fb49-55bd-1bdf-df6f-c3b5b057ed69
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_TieflingLeader:0c46fb49-55bd-1bdf-df6f-c3b5b057ed69
msgctxt "hacde561dg7310g4305gb616gf2aafefbe080"
msgid "We chose each other, Her an' me."
msgstr "서로 선택 한 거지, 그녀와 내가."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_TieflingLeader
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 2e62f39b-2b1d-efc8-8caf-d38f595405bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_TieflingLeader:2e62f39b-2b1d-efc8-8caf-d38f595405bf
msgctxt "h79c2d01bg6fd8g4d5dg92ccgd1c37df50b65"
msgid "And <i>you </i>ain't a good player."
msgstr "<i>너</i>도 좋은 선수가 아니지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_TieflingLeader
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 2f60ae7e-2866-96f5-603e-5a8c8ddf7204
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_TieflingLeader:2f60ae7e-2866-96f5-603e-5a8c8ddf7204
msgctxt "h522b084cg6aa7g45fegb481g6531d1d436ec"
msgid "You talk too much."
msgstr "말 진짜 많네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_TieflingLeader
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 4a209bbb-0ec5-6abb-cfb4-93e3304899cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_TieflingLeader:4a209bbb-0ec5-6abb-cfb4-93e3304899cc
msgctxt "h5728102ag7bf8g4c0agadd5g2a9d0bf74379"
msgid "I got the brand to prove it. What do you got?"
msgstr "내 표식이 그걸 증명한다고. 넌 뭐가 있는데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_TieflingLeader
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 6440476a-323e-7dbd-7cbb-604c6a7cf93f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 9e2ef14b-1a2f-4edc-3f78-7e3a27967e5c_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 9e2ef14b-1a2f-4edc-3f78-7e3a27967e5c_B = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_TieflingLeader:6440476a-323e-7dbd-7cbb-604c6a7cf93f
msgctxt "h6e92324ag3c7fg40aeg865fg955156a29578"
msgid "Tell me what you know."
msgstr "네가 아는 걸 털어놔."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_TieflingLeader
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 754a90cc-82e7-b663-1af0-691631968e01
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 9e2ef14b-1a2f-4edc-3f78-7e3a27967e5c_A = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_TieflingLeader:754a90cc-82e7-b663-1af0-691631968e01
msgctxt "h16842351g68b8g4c96ga9ffgc6a30c00821a"
msgid "The Absolute will save me. She'll burn this place to the ground!"
msgstr "절대자께서 날 구해 주실 거다. 그녀가 이곳을 완전히 불태워버리실 거야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_TieflingLeader
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 9fdb2f49-dc1d-101c-2c12-54b6b5244283
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_TieflingLeader:9fdb2f49-dc1d-101c-2c12-54b6b5244283
msgctxt "he715b898g530eg45f0gbbbdg653e228129b5"
msgid "This isn't a game."
msgstr "이건 게임이 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_TieflingLeader
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = bab26862-5090-08df-c42b-d7d4638d4692
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_TieflingLeader:bab26862-5090-08df-c42b-d7d4638d4692
msgctxt "h70f355b1gfe07g4afcg8a7egcd3dd942f86d"
msgid "Mind yer business. This ain't it."
msgstr "신경 끄셔. 이렇게는 안 되지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_TieflingLeader
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = bac74b0a-8255-7434-89c0-81798e58ad57
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_TieflingLeader:bac74b0a-8255-7434-89c0-81798e58ad57
msgctxt "h60f8180ag8017g4fa4gb5b2g794a6eb81a0a"
msgid "I'll tell you everything you want to know... I swear."
msgstr "알고 싶은 거 다 얘기 해 줄게... 맹세한다니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_TieflingLeader
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = d71fce1e-75e8-9e66-64b6-fc3700a2d269
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_TieflingLeader:d71fce1e-75e8-9e66-64b6-fc3700a2d269
msgctxt "ha7b520eag8114g468dgad26g13f2ebc902b3"
msgid "Good. I'm feckin' starving."
msgstr "잘됐다. 그러고 싶었거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_TieflingLeader
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = de8b9238-ece4-361d-43e6-8c555f3b5651
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_TieflingLeader:de8b9238-ece4-361d-43e6-8c555f3b5651
msgctxt "h3576a882g755ag46b5gb74agca7e2dc50a59"
msgid "You'll eat those words soon enough."
msgstr "곧 그 말 후회하게 될 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_TieflingLeader
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = e6ef97ab-80c3-23c0-ee6c-4293e46da7b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_TieflingLeader:e6ef97ab-80c3-23c0-ee6c-4293e46da7b3
msgctxt "h8fc3b193g75dcg4011g87b1ga53e16be2a87"
msgid "You'll soon find out how wrong you are."
msgstr "잘못된 행동인 걸 곧 알게 될 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_TieflingLeader
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = f279b6d5-aab5-ae3f-8eee-a8b1489b480c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 9e2ef14b-1a2f-4edc-3f78-7e3a27967e5c_C = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 9e2ef14b-1a2f-4edc-3f78-7e3a27967e5c_B = False
#.     - 9e2ef14b-1a2f-4edc-3f78-7e3a27967e5c_A = False
#.     - 9e2ef14b-1a2f-4edc-3f78-7e3a27967e5c_C = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_AD_TieflingLeader:f279b6d5-aab5-ae3f-8eee-a8b1489b480c
msgctxt "he5dd9ce1g35c2g4e7cga314gcf553e504352"
msgid "I feel bad for ya. I do, really."
msgstr "진짜 유감이다. 정말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0051eeb1-8b56-dd17-d430-b145a29331b0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Absolute_Knows_Name = False
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_GoblinMentionedAbsolute = False
#. TagRule: CLERIC
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:0051eeb1-8b56-dd17-d430-b145a29331b0
msgctxt "h1cd3fff9g3a85g45adg9ab1g7f34b3a93490"
msgid "The Absolute? That's one god I don't know."
msgstr "절대자라고? 그런 신은 처음 들어보는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0051eeb1-8b56-dd17-d430-b145a29331b0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Absolute_Knows_Name = False
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_GoblinMentionedAbsolute = False
#. TagRule: WIZARD
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:0051eeb1-8b56-dd17-d430-b145a29331b0
msgctxt "hbe3be472g78e0g4d51g8e89g5ffadc0dc221"
msgid "The Absolute? I've seen no mention of Her in my studies."
msgstr "절대자라고? 그런 이름은 어떤 책에서도 본 적 없는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0051eeb1-8b56-dd17-d430-b145a29331b0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Absolute_Knows_Name = False
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_GoblinMentionedAbsolute = False
#. TagRule: PLANAR
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:0051eeb1-8b56-dd17-d430-b145a29331b0
msgctxt "hf5afdda8g56a7g44fagba08gafcc2ab5a97e"
msgid ""
"Another god? I swear, Toril has more deities than there are stars in the sky."
msgstr "또 다른 신인가? 세상에, 토릴에는 신이 밤하늘의 별보다도 많나 보군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0051eeb1-8b56-dd17-d430-b145a29331b0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Absolute_Knows_Name = False
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_GoblinMentionedAbsolute = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:0051eeb1-8b56-dd17-d430-b145a29331b0
msgctxt "h72454417g0672g4172g8ea1g98cfd3380ac4"
msgid "The Absolute? Can't say I know your god."
msgstr "절대자라고? 그런 신은 처음 듣는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 032814f5-9d4a-d2b9-a625-46ad8e4378d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_HasMet(1) = True
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_PromisedHelp(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - UNDERDARK(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:032814f5-9d4a-d2b9-a625-46ad8e4378d0
msgctxt "h013a3efdge7e5g430dga479gad5be1c044cd"
msgid "We're runnin' out of time. They're gonna murder me!"
msgstr "시간이 없어. 놈들이 날 죽여버릴 거라고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0498075d-ba56-4c15-bfd1-b8cd75fb3b64
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_PlayerRescuedGoblin = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:0498075d-ba56-4c15-bfd1-b8cd75fb3b64
msgctxt "hb7cb5d40g66f3g4303gb786g56400a6e205c"
msgid "I just saved your life. Show some gratitude."
msgstr "내가 방금 네 목숨을 구했어. 감사 정도는 표현해 줬으면 하는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 05935ce0-6e3d-b2e2-e573-a542b7edceed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE or SELDARINEDROWELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:05935ce0-6e3d-b2e2-e573-a542b7edceed
msgctxt "hbabc2dafgb79eg42e5g96dagedfc9ff45e4f"
msgid "Don't believe you. There's something a bit soft about you."
msgstr "넌 못 믿겠어. 부드러운 구석이 있는 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 05935ce0-6e3d-b2e2-e573-a542b7edceed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:05935ce0-6e3d-b2e2-e573-a542b7edceed
msgctxt "he8756feeg7d83g4e25gbc9ag23040a55156e"
msgid ""
"Don't believe you. You ain't got enough scars to be one of her playthings."
msgstr "못 믿겠는데. 그녀의 장난감이라고 하기엔 넌 흉터가 너무 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 05b64e79-7c71-8bca-26a9-674d6308ba24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_GoblinMentionedAbsolute = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Absolute_Knows_Name = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:05b64e79-7c71-8bca-26a9-674d6308ba24
msgctxt "hdabfcdabgd7e6g43f7g9612gcab4fbd07639"
msgid ""
"They're gonna burn this pretty place for the glory of the Absolute and 'ang "
"ya by yer guts."
msgstr "놈들이 절대자님의 영광을 위해 여길 불태워 버리고 네 내장을 꺼내버릴 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 0aaa259b-9ee7-8dec-112b-8df6d8b4654e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:0aaa259b-9ee7-8dec-112b-8df6d8b4654e
msgctxt "h056e8b4fga34cg480ag983eg96023cfd2a21"
msgid ""
"Got a whole lab set up. Cooks up potions that fix our lads no matter how "
"much of a beatin' they take."
msgstr "아예 연구소를 차려 놨어. 얼마나 다쳤든 상관없이 고쳐주는 물약을 제조하고 있다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 0ac55ede-9fa5-2c4d-b8c0-354329ca8b13
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:0ac55ede-9fa5-2c4d-b8c0-354329ca8b13
msgctxt "h1d5c7c11g8878g4c44gb7d0ga231d7fe4692"
msgid "They'll peel yer face off and nail it to a wall!"
msgstr "그들이 네 얼굴 가죽을 벗겨서 벽에다 못 박을 거다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 0acc43ea-c7a6-3f15-e8c4-fc67c6f96ccc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin.MetGoblin(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:0acc43ea-c7a6-3f15-e8c4-fc67c6f96ccc
msgctxt "hb56fff71g06a1g4b4bgb300g6ee281e55286"
msgid "You won't regret it, promise."
msgstr "후회하지 않을 거야, 약속할게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 109bb327-6e84-4d23-541f-e2898050c81f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:109bb327-6e84-4d23-541f-e2898050c81f
msgctxt "hd4b5bc88ga4e9g4986gbdc6g8f467db700eb"
msgid "You've caught my interest. Have any holy literature on you?"
msgstr "관심이 가는데. 너희들의 교리를 담은 책 같은 건 없나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 133e0851-3829-35b1-28d3-384e89809cbb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:133e0851-3829-35b1-28d3-384e89809cbb
msgctxt "h5d73849bg56c5g44fdgab42g8267f71c5990"
msgid "I <i>been </i>patient. So hurry it up, yeah?"
msgstr "이만하면 충분히 기다렸다고. 그러니 서둘러, 앙?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 13b2ec34-3e7a-f7a1-e9c7-abd2c1b6e8ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:13b2ec34-3e7a-f7a1-e9c7-abd2c1b6e8ed
msgctxt "h8c9d1d13ge2b0g4b6bgb284g5174cad5c8b4"
msgid "Goddess."
msgstr "여신님이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 13f62531-9307-d417-31cd-c3428243a55f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:13f62531-9307-d417-31cd-c3428243a55f
msgctxt "h61ce6597gcd30g469ega943g538c79dfb6a2"
msgid "Suit yerself. Lookin' forward to seein' wot yer innards look like."
msgstr "마음대로 해. 너희 내장이 어떻게 생겼는지 구경하는 것도 재밌겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 15687080-8c0a-ed50-82ed-a3e0ff60565f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_PromisedHelp(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:15687080-8c0a-ed50-82ed-a3e0ff60565f
msgctxt "h701442aeg5c4ag4196g9935g7fcac95f84ac"
msgid "Patience. I'll get you out soon."
msgstr "기다려. 곧 꺼내줄 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 156e7cf7-9777-a4bd-bb6e-4a882ac7bcc4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_Event_Tamper = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:156e7cf7-9777-a4bd-bb6e-4a882ac7bcc4
msgctxt "h6f4dfe70g3d5fg48e9g870bg8a108ce226cb"
msgid "Wotcher messin' with my cage for?"
msgstr "내 우리에는 왜 찾아온 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1684558b-7599-833c-8899-9a97ed5f8a3d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:1684558b-7599-833c-8899-9a97ed5f8a3d
msgctxt "hb0b44fe5g23a8g49d9gb1e4gf56f5fefb7f8"
msgid "Nobody sent me."
msgstr "날 보낸 사람 같은 건 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 191ff104-191e-8306-7cb8-d25564e3a11d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:191ff104-191e-8306-7cb8-d25564e3a11d
msgctxt "hd9c7e104gaf0cg45f7gaad5g696f3e676123"
msgid ""
"The Absolute is gold from the sky, She is. The blessin' in the storm an' the "
"storm itself."
msgstr "절대자님은 하늘에서 내려온 보물이시지, 암. 폭풍의 축복이시자, 폭풍 그 자체시고 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 2530c639-b9bc-af16-7de5-81e21892f8b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:2530c639-b9bc-af16-7de5-81e21892f8b9
msgctxt "ha41b10c5gb036g43dfgbdeeg4d112a7a4d6f"
msgid ""
"Maybe She sent <i>you</i> to help me. An' ya will, if ya wanna save yer skin."
msgstr "<i>널</i> 보내서 날 도우시려는 건지도 모르지. 그리고 그렇게 하는 게 좋을 거야, 네 살가죽이 소중하다면 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 25d5b874-f97f-a215-4ea5-1a8395e1d16f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_HasMet(1) = False
#.   User:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_UserMet(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_HasMet(1) = True
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_PromisedHelp(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:25d5b874-f97f-a215-4ea5-1a8395e1d16f
msgctxt "h4eeb4acbg97c7g4989gbccbg8b63e6950f7a"
msgid "I already met your friend. You here to get me out of here?"
msgstr "네 친구라면 이미 만났는데. 날 꺼내주러 왔냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 266005c6-8032-d70f-27a4-b002210165e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - DUERGARDWARF(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:266005c6-8032-d70f-27a4-b002210165e1
msgctxt "h44887efagbdc2g4e47gbf32g50fec970efaf"
msgid "<i>Yer</i> a long way from 'ome, ain't ya, underdwarf?"
msgstr "집에서 아주 멀리까지 납셨구만. 안 그래, 언더드워프?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 2aad719c-e275-1f43-76e3-b62427e3ea30
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_Knows_Priestess = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Priestess.LearnPriestess(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:2aad719c-e275-1f43-76e3-b62427e3ea30
msgctxt "h213bd682gff61g4eacgbbfdg08394dfc2600"
msgid "We'll be heroes, blessed by Priestess Gut in the name of the Absolute."
msgstr "절대자님의 이름으로, 여사제 거트의 축복을 받아 우린 영웅이 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 2c687e83-0917-c3be-2af2-02cb498c757f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:2c687e83-0917-c3be-2af2-02cb498c757f
msgctxt "h188304dbg645fg4073g80b6g022b0697f21e"
msgid ""
"The Absolute is gold from the sky, She is. The blessin' in the storm an' the "
"storm itself."
msgstr "절대자님은 하늘에서 내려온 보물이시지, 암. 폭풍의 축복이시자, 폭풍 그 자체시고 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2da1fc89-0335-ac22-2e16-c74a8e51b5e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_PlayerRescuedGoblin = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALFORC
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:2da1fc89-0335-ac22-2e16-c74a8e51b5e0
msgctxt "hd1914f57ge824g4e11gbb6dg5001383bdf23"
msgid ""
"Do I look like I'm scared of goblins? I'll smash 'em, like the last lot I "
"ran into."
msgstr "내가 고블린들을 무서워하는 것처럼 보여? 난 놈들을 부숴버릴 수 있어, 저번에 마주쳤던 것들처럼 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2da1fc89-0335-ac22-2e16-c74a8e51b5e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_PlayerRescuedGoblin = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:2da1fc89-0335-ac22-2e16-c74a8e51b5e0
msgctxt "h4bcd479fg0379g44a2gb7eeg44473c3bd4b0"
msgid "They can try, but they won't be the first goblins I've killed today."
msgstr "노력은 할 수 있겠지. 하지만 전에도 고블린들은 많이 죽여 봤다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 33d4640f-d47b-568a-c46d-59a6b62637c1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_PromisedHelp(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - UNDERDARK(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:33d4640f-d47b-568a-c46d-59a6b62637c1
msgctxt "h02781cb1g8e27g4e44ga5afg1cb9ffe0c52b"
msgid "You gonna open this cage or wot?"
msgstr "그래서, 우리를 열 거야, 말 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 36f4c5a0-2430-50cc-9618-9a669489f16e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:36f4c5a0-2430-50cc-9618-9a669489f16e
msgctxt "h05eea966g87d2g4782g93f8g9b9b1c3cc97c"
msgid ""
"Get me outta here, and I'll take you to meet her and the rest of my tribe."
msgstr "날 여기서 내보내 주면, 그녀와 내 부족원들을 만나게 해 주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 415b3021-dcde-26fe-6bcb-a052a0f345b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:415b3021-dcde-26fe-6bcb-a052a0f345b9
msgctxt "hb67f04dagc2e7g4a6ag9653g4615e6cdd912"
msgid "Well, 'urry up. I got all the time in the world. You don't."
msgstr "좋아, 빨리 해. 난 시간이 무지 많아. 넌 아니지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 4213ff5a-ddea-8c18-1f9f-35a8beab9774
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_HasMet(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_HasMet(1) = True
#. TagRule: DROWELF or DROWHALFELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:4213ff5a-ddea-8c18-1f9f-35a8beab9774
msgctxt "hadd9a2e7gcf93g4040gba6ag8fa8fa669c44"
msgid ""
"Didn't expect to see a drow in here. Did the boss lady send you to rescue me?"
msgstr "여기서 드로우를 만날 줄은 몰랐는데. 대장마님께서 나를 구하라고 보내셨나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 4b6993e4-e3e8-984f-a096-c82ad7dedd5b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:4b6993e4-e3e8-984f-a096-c82ad7dedd5b
msgctxt "h937717cbgacaeg4959g80aagaeaa20521869"
msgid ""
"You<i> need</i> me - get me outta here, and I'll tell 'em what a good friend "
"you are."
msgstr "넌 내가 <i>필요해</i>- 날 꺼내줘, 그럼 그들에게 네가 얼마나 좋은 친구인지 말해줄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4e228bf9-a442-fdd6-0a42-f7c555870b4d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SELDARINEDROWELF(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:4e228bf9-a442-fdd6-0a42-f7c555870b4d
msgctxt "hbf77818fg2379g4b3fgad12ga3b87b9b1114"
msgid "Yes, she sent me. Ready to get out of here?"
msgstr "그래, 그분이 날 보냈어. 나갈 준비 됐어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 4efc6a9e-9da1-5560-218a-8c5f5f0aee0b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(5) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:4efc6a9e-9da1-5560-218a-8c5f5f0aee0b
msgctxt "h64060362g39d3g4748g8088gff06652f2913"
msgid "I'm not saying we should trust a goblin, but she sounds very useful."
msgstr "고블린을 신뢰하자는 얘기는 아니지만, 이 녀석의 정보는 매우 유용한 걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 4f1db443-fcdf-ce50-5b13-7a47f59dc971
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:4f1db443-fcdf-ce50-5b13-7a47f59dc971
msgctxt "h3fc8eb14g975ag4616gb4b5ga317bf01fd4b"
msgid ""
"We got more than ya can handle. And our priestess keeps us fightin' even if "
"someone sticks a few holes in us."
msgstr "우리는 네가 감당할 수 있는 것보다 강하다. 그리고 우리의 사제들은 몸에 구멍이 뚫려도 계속해서 싸울 수 있도록 해 주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 52d2ec17-277a-f3a4-9d11-b9269c888ff2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:52d2ec17-277a-f3a4-9d11-b9269c888ff2
msgctxt "h88fe9886gad58g4de9ga25dgeba211f5431a"
msgid "Who's your 'boss lady'?"
msgstr "네 '대장님'이라는 게 누구야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 53dd7edd-20a0-2bb0-97d7-834bce818a59
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_Knows_Priestess = True
#.      - DEN_GroveConflict_Knows_LeaderNamePriest = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:53dd7edd-20a0-2bb0-97d7-834bce818a59
msgctxt "h871964d0gf1e9g4312ga129g1a8c6b26875a"
msgid "Priestess Gut is quite the name. Tell me more."
msgstr "여사제 거트라, 꽤 괜찮은 이름인데. 더 말해 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 5419bebf-4c7c-f345-0491-785a5b870ba3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DUERGARDWARF(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:5419bebf-4c7c-f345-0491-785a5b870ba3
msgctxt "h1431a13dg2d5fg4dc8gaf02gcbdb99a4a116"
msgid "<i>Yer</i> a long way from 'ome, ain't ya, underdwarf?"
msgstr "집에서 아주 멀리까지 납셨구만. 안 그래, 언더드워프?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 5569b3da-b32a-b773-424b-3d875b293abe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:5569b3da-b32a-b773-424b-3d875b293abe
msgctxt "h9f332716g6119g451eg82cfg02c2d58553f2"
msgid "Get me outta 'ere, an' I'll introduce you to my tribe. You'd like 'em."
msgstr "날 여기서 꺼내줘, 그럼 널 우리 부족에게 소개해 줄게. 마음에 들 걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5927b9a6-2c26-0f72-6074-b1b59e548542
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Absolute_Knows_Name = True
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_GoblinMentionedAbsolute = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:5927b9a6-2c26-0f72-6074-b1b59e548542
msgctxt "hb6f8e634g9df0g4322gaf46g32a31eb41bd8"
msgid "Ah, the 'Absolute'. This is the deity you're bowing to?"
msgstr "아, <b>절대자</b>라... 그게 네가 섬기는 신의 이름인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5a8c9b68-7e57-68ae-9802-6a18989f27f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_PromisedHelp(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_PromisedHelp(1) = True
#. TagRule: !REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:5a8c9b68-7e57-68ae-9802-6a18989f27f0
msgctxt "hb60b65cbg4ae3g4ffdg8b0agb0eeced235a9"
msgid "All right. I'll see what I can do."
msgstr "알았어. 방법을 찾아 볼게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5a8c9b68-7e57-68ae-9802-6a18989f27f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_PromisedHelp(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_PromisedHelp(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:5a8c9b68-7e57-68ae-9802-6a18989f27f0
msgctxt "h0d166853g4d32g4c6dg8803g912c71a701e8"
msgid "Well, if you make it worth my while..."
msgstr "글쎄, 그럴 만한 가치가 있을지 모르겠는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5d9a2c60-5c87-d9e5-3972-11cab8a9bc60
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_PromisedHelp(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:5d9a2c60-5c87-d9e5-3972-11cab8a9bc60
msgctxt "h4f5bfb53g6b26g4b2fg8161gad6de8ca4d61"
msgid "Not a chance. You can rot in that cage."
msgstr "꿈도 크셔라. 우리에서 얌전히 썩도록 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 5de680fa-156b-e88c-c53b-02fc861cccbb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_PromisedHelp(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - UNDERDARK(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:5de680fa-156b-e88c-c53b-02fc861cccbb
msgctxt "h9d32dfabg456dg47a7g9cfagc6d9f87e77e6"
msgid "Any luck openin' this cage?"
msgstr "어째, 좀 열릴 것 같아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 5f0b3080-abd4-e52c-dc43-0618c68c04b4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(6) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:5f0b3080-abd4-e52c-dc43-0618c68c04b4
msgctxt "hdb2b6d96g979dg4cfcg9e70g45208fa3a43d"
msgid "I'd sooner swig a flask of acid than anything a goblin cooks up."
msgstr "고블린이 조제한 것을 먹을 바에는 산성 음료를 들이키겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6078e7e7-05b3-09cf-1382-b0fe385158ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:6078e7e7-05b3-09cf-1382-b0fe385158ab
msgctxt "he27a5717gbbd9g409egbabbgbea33fc594c0"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 661d52b5-fe40-82af-25c2-5daf79e1e68d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:661d52b5-fe40-82af-25c2-5daf79e1e68d
msgctxt "h3acd7e0cg53feg457bg9b33gccd8ac98ada6"
msgid ""
"Yeah. Take me back to the tribe, and we'll tell the boss all about this "
"pretty little place so she can burn it to the ground."
msgstr "좋아. 부족에게 돌아가자, 그리고 대장과 그녀가 이 쪼끄마한 곳을 불태워 버리게 다 알려주자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 695e2e31-f717-3ed4-121f-a03bcc471616
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_PromisedHelp(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:695e2e31-f717-3ed4-121f-a03bcc471616
msgctxt "h0d85a27fge658g4df3gb4e8g005277d938fa"
msgid "Just be patient. I'll break you free soon enough."
msgstr "조금만 기다려. 곧 풀어줄 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 6cfef657-db26-a202-0d70-bc098a1b7f1d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(7) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:6cfef657-db26-a202-0d70-bc098a1b7f1d
msgctxt "hb6d07bd7gd0d6g4477g84d0ge478882eaa49"
msgid ""
"<i>Booyahg</i> - the goblin word for magic. Primitive to a fault, but not "
"entirely without merit."
msgstr "<i>부야그</i> - 마법을 지칭하는 고블린 단어야. 원시적인 게 흠이지만, 장점이 전혀 없는 것은 아니지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 73acbef5-4b3d-2255-11d1-aa280f4be761
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_GoblinMentionedAbsolute = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:73acbef5-4b3d-2255-11d1-aa280f4be761
msgctxt "h5e0c5706g53adg43dcgb44dg624b757bf8e0"
msgid "Who is this Absolute?"
msgstr "절대자라는 게 누구야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 769dd439-21b9-9396-2988-ac79afd0ed78
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:769dd439-21b9-9396-2988-ac79afd0ed78
msgctxt "h35876dcag2b73g4378gb409g1d7dc0d85107"
msgid "Ha! Even if you did find my tribe, they'd set the worgs on ya."
msgstr "하! 내 부족을 어떻게 찾더라도, 그들은 네게 워그를 풀어놓을걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7d2d2526-dc45-232c-3ee0-e879eb5f30b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALFLING
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:7d2d2526-dc45-232c-3ee0-e879eb5f30b8
msgctxt "hbf080646g9c76g4a35g9442g471726f242b8"
msgid "Sounds like tall tales to me."
msgstr "허무맹랑한 얘기 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7d2d2526-dc45-232c-3ee0-e879eb5f30b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:7d2d2526-dc45-232c-3ee0-e879eb5f30b8
msgctxt "hda6b2aadg5162g410dgac8agdbda57adb35d"
msgid "Nice story. Buy it for a copper in a tavern nearby?"
msgstr "좋은 얘기인데. 근처 술집에서 얼마 주고 들었어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 80c3a50c-928a-852f-1c1d-8ede4712ec77
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_Knows_Priestess = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Priestess.LearnPriestess(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:80c3a50c-928a-852f-1c1d-8ede4712ec77
msgctxt "h57ae1bcegb3a5g4cb9gbc59ga03569fbea36"
msgid ""
"I ain't scared of some guard. Stick a dozen arrows in me, and Priestess "
"Gut'd <i>still</i> patch me up."
msgstr "난 경비대한테 겁 안 먹는다. 내 몸에 화살을 한 다스 박아 봐라, 거트 여사제님께서 날 <i>다시</i> 꿰매주실 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 817b6bd0-c219-2d0b-6711-591fe4946f1a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_PromisedHelp(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_PromisedHelp(1) = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin.MetGoblin(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:817b6bd0-c219-2d0b-6711-591fe4946f1a
msgctxt "h266b0e8dgbad7g46b1g9dd9gd3048316dfd8"
msgid "Deal. I'll get you out of there."
msgstr "좋아. 꺼내줄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 83191374-ccf3-f855-696f-1e70e7dd8c09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_Knows_Priestess = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:83191374-ccf3-f855-696f-1e70e7dd8c09
msgctxt "h6c004a1cg495bg4e4eg817fgbdd413cd209f"
msgid ""
"You already told me what I need to know. I'll find the priestess myself."
msgstr "이미 알아야 할 건 다 들었어. 여사제는 직접 찾도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 834d690c-d958-e327-246d-67524fa45b10
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:834d690c-d958-e327-246d-67524fa45b10
msgctxt "hec278d74g3bc2g4312g832agd0782b950eff"
msgid "It's too late to make friends, worgmeat. My tribe's comin'."
msgstr "친구를 만들고 싶다면 이미 늦었어, 워그 고기야. 내 부족이 오고 있으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 87b9a60f-b6e7-1479-eebe-1c958e420634
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_Resolved = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:87b9a60f-b6e7-1479-eebe-1c958e420634
msgctxt "ha7abf75bg2aacg459dg977fgfe4680ef8bc5"
msgid "Ain't sure why ya protected me. Don't care, neither."
msgstr "네가 날 왜 도와줬는진 모르겠지만. 딱히 상관없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 89e69b8c-90f2-1652-3582-2ffa1deaddc4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:89e69b8c-90f2-1652-3582-2ffa1deaddc4
msgctxt "h36bb157bg4700g4ac5g842fge3bcabc38aa5"
msgid ""
"The lady that sent me here's the cruellest drow I ever met. You could learn "
"a thing or two from her."
msgstr "나를 여기로 보낸 분은 내가 만난 드로우 중에서도 가장 잔인해. 너도 한 두 가지 정도는 배울 수 있을 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 8a349310-2961-8996-0528-aa277f100400
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_Knows_Priestess = True
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_GoblinMentionedAbsolute = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Priestess.LearnPriestess(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:8a349310-2961-8996-0528-aa277f100400
msgctxt "h89ffbdedg3b0ag41d1ga280gd022e1938b38"
msgid ""
"The power of the Absolute, of course! Priestess Gut will tell you all about "
"it and make sure you have everything you need."
msgstr "물론 절대자님의 힘이지! 여사제 거트가 그 힘에 관한 것뿐만 아니라 네게 필요한 모든 것을 제공해 줄 거라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 8b00fc74-e57b-585f-b3c7-8e58d6e80b14
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_HasMet(1) = True
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_PromisedHelp(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - UNDERDARK(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:8b00fc74-e57b-585f-b3c7-8e58d6e80b14
msgctxt "h52361d62g4845g4566g8927gd4d9b4977350"
msgid ""
"Runnin' out of time, worgmeat. My family'll be 'ere soon. Lemme <i>out</i>."
msgstr "째깍째깍. 워그 먹잇감아, 그들이 곧 온다. 날 당장 <i>꺼내줘</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 91555888-0376-c9e9-62b9-45d88ed1861f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:91555888-0376-c9e9-62b9-45d88ed1861f
msgctxt "h303d2ca7g7681g4058ga974g3d0a68e93074"
msgid "A goblin healer. We really are desperate, aren't we?"
msgstr "고블린 치유사라니. 우리 처지가 참 궁색해졌네, 그치?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 9b42ddb6-e7bc-dacc-756a-61cb85685074
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_Knows_Priestess = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Priestess.LearnPriestess(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:9b42ddb6-e7bc-dacc-756a-61cb85685074
msgctxt "h814e192eg1e62g4053gb7e3g39b93a1828fa"
msgid ""
"And if the tiefs stick a few arrows in us on the way out of here, don't "
"worry. Priestess Gut'll patch us up."
msgstr "여기서 나가는 길에 티프들이 우리에게 화살 좀 쏴도 걱정하지 마. 거트 여사제님이 치료해줄 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9f634519-56e3-9fac-f1e8-c00b3ed995aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:9f634519-56e3-9fac-f1e8-c00b3ed995aa
msgctxt "h9126d355ge075g4cfcgbfa7g49729a1995bd"
msgid ""
"Actions have consequences, Sazza. Maybe use this time in the cage to reflect."
msgstr "행동엔 대가가 따르지, 삿자. 그 안에서 되돌아보는 시간을 가져봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 9f83801a-fef0-97d3-33a5-079be033c7ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_PCDiscussedAbsoluteWithSazza(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Absolute_Knows_Name = True
#.     - GLO_Absolute_Knows_GoblinsWorship = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:9f83801a-fef0-97d3-33a5-079be033c7ba
msgctxt "h5f2f7c1dgab37g4b9ag9d60g0acb441cc9e4"
msgid "We're burnin' Her name across the face o' the world, we are."
msgstr "그분의 이름이 온 세상을 불태우게 만들 거야, 우리가."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = a3d50bfd-a53c-46c3-c388-887ae89df60e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_GrieflingPermaDefeated = True
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_Event_GuardCombat = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_HasMet(1) = True
#. TagRule: TIEFLING
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:a3d50bfd-a53c-46c3-c388-887ae89df60e
msgctxt "h7625ca9ag7236g4220g98a7g96984acd816d"
msgid "Ain't sure why ya killed yer own to protect me. Don't care, neither."
msgstr "왜 네 동족을 죽여가면서 까지 날 보호했는진 모르겠지만. 딱히 상관없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = a3d50bfd-a53c-46c3-c388-887ae89df60e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_GrieflingPermaDefeated = True
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_Event_GuardCombat = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:a3d50bfd-a53c-46c3-c388-887ae89df60e
msgctxt "h42fed88ag13e7g4962gad3fge2ad2e81f682"
msgid ""
"Ain't sure why ya killed that soft-arse to protect me. Don't care, neither."
msgstr "왜 그 겁쟁이 자식을 죽이면서까지 날 지켜줬는지는 모르겠지만. 딱히 상관없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = a5948bdc-2d9e-38f0-e5c3-11a0a74fdd84
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:a5948bdc-2d9e-38f0-e5c3-11a0a74fdd84
msgctxt "hf88da3ebg2375g4996gb9d1gdb777ef571f1"
msgid "It's the truth - I swear on your mother's grave."
msgstr "진짜야. 니 애미 무덤에 대고 맹세하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a660a60b-61d3-a43d-504c-32e7ee4bc0e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LOLTHDROWELF(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:a660a60b-61d3-a43d-504c-32e7ee4bc0e2
msgctxt "h124dcb1bga36dg4d21g9357gfaf2abf2e99e"
msgid "Yes, she sent me. Ready to get out of here?"
msgstr "그래, 그분이 날 보냈어. 나갈 준비 됐어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = a7fd4c40-0001-f34f-4eae-3148ba47b2e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_Knows_Priestess = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Priestess.LearnPriestess(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:a7fd4c40-0001-f34f-4eae-3148ba47b2e8
msgctxt "h8dbb932cge319g4b9bg8c2bgbee390f60716"
msgid ""
"My tribe can tell you everythin' there is to know. Absolute blessed one of "
"our own - Priestess Gut."
msgstr "내 부족이 네게 모든걸 알려줄 수 있어. 절대자께서 우리 중 한 명을 축복하셨지. 여사제 거트 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aa1dbe41-d0a9-b6e6-acc4-7eb7682eeed4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:aa1dbe41-d0a9-b6e6-acc4-7eb7682eeed4
msgctxt "h81822c28g5722g467bgb495g294f4e30a972"
msgid "An all-powerful goddess that can't get you out of a cage?"
msgstr "그리 강력하신 여신께서 널 못 꺼내주시나보네?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = adf53f34-7ecb-206a-f6b7-a901c62a65be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:adf53f34-7ecb-206a-f6b7-a901c62a65be
msgctxt "h36681db6g1b45g431agb8f2g0604938f62c1"
msgid ""
"You're not mates with the tiefs, are you? You need to get back to your own "
"people before you go soft."
msgstr "넌 티플링 편은 아니구나, 그렇지? 더 물러지기 전에 네 동족에게 돌아가는 게 좋겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = b164c911-4f18-257c-0fd9-313d38adcf5d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:b164c911-4f18-257c-0fd9-313d38adcf5d
msgctxt "h574cc125g2862g4820g8900g164314df771f"
msgid ""
"Another drow - she's one of my best mates. Thought you might work for her."
msgstr "다른 드로우 - 내 절친 중 한 명이지. 그녀 밑에서 일하는 놈인 줄 알았네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = b8352fae-5717-a6ae-9784-8eb66e578145
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:b8352fae-5717-a6ae-9784-8eb66e578145
msgctxt "h16f85042g4d06g4359ga83eg9ef84b8ba224"
msgid ""
"Could probably stick yer <i>head</i> back on if someone woz to chop it off. "
"Mighty <i>booyahg</i>."
msgstr "아마 누군가 네 <i>머리</i>를 잘라도 다시 붙일 수 있을걸. 강력한 <i>부야그</i>야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = c2241322-9faa-0b65-818c-fa64095dea7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:c2241322-9faa-0b65-818c-fa64095dea7e
msgctxt "h740d7f44g56b6g401fgbef6gf68c588838e3"
msgid ""
"<i>Bah</i>. A clever goblin's like a trustworthy <i>ghaik</i>: a figment of "
"the imagination."
msgstr "<i>흥</i>. 똑똑한 고블린이란 믿을만한 <i>게이크</i>와 같지. 상상의 산물이란 점에서."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c3118a9e-e869-34ca-1b50-95d4b9545ea4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_Knows_Priestess = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:c3118a9e-e869-34ca-1b50-95d4b9545ea4
msgctxt "hd4df1065ge7c6g400cg8850g480d7a83fb9f"
msgid "What could a tribe of goblins possibly offer me?"
msgstr "고블린 부족이 내게 뭘 해줄 수 있는데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = c39128e4-876a-5e4c-3e19-75f230c5f4a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin.MetGoblin(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:c39128e4-876a-5e4c-3e19-75f230c5f4a2
msgctxt "h848828b5g0088g4431g8978g5c2c9b45dd08"
msgid "Then hurry up an' do it. My tribe ain't as friendly as I am."
msgstr "그럼 서둘러. 내 부족은 나만큼 친절하지 않을 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c5376d81-9ab9-33d4-2b16-3be90f0a616f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:c5376d81-9ab9-33d4-2b16-3be90f0a616f
msgctxt "h19c3cf06g4e2fg4ae9g8bc7g36ec4376e1cf"
msgid "Well, I'd certainly like to meet her."
msgstr "확실히 그녀를 만나보고 싶은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = cb3f336e-a630-cf45-f146-6fea0a849f6e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_PCDiscussedAbsoluteWithSazza(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Absolute_Knows_GoblinsWorship = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:cb3f336e-a630-cf45-f146-6fea0a849f6e
msgctxt "h7bfd70a9g774bg415cgb1cfg145d3afd2ff6"
msgid "We're burnin' Her name across the face o' the world, we are."
msgstr "그분의 이름이 온 세상을 불태우게 만들 거야, 우리가."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d14b6436-3820-b5f4-648a-da2f85dd6621
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:d14b6436-3820-b5f4-648a-da2f85dd6621
msgctxt "h9b6bdaf4g5f73g41e0g9bbeg496423a8506e"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = d7137ea0-e4d1-1855-2f67-015b0d653775
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:d7137ea0-e4d1-1855-2f67-015b0d653775
msgctxt "h5d2986e9ge9d0g467fga2c7g43c1f1f9948e"
msgid "Aw, c'mon. We could be mates."
msgstr "에이, 좀. 우린 친구가 될 수도 있다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = da6e63d0-c946-1477-6a8d-13b069b95879
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_GoblinMentionedAbsolute = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:da6e63d0-c946-1477-6a8d-13b069b95879
msgctxt "h5a4bb3d6gd9e8g49e0g8612gd99955db4c38"
msgid "The Absolute? If that's your god, I don't know them."
msgstr "절대자라고? 그게 네 신이라면, 처음 듣는 이름이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = da6e63d0-c946-1477-6a8d-13b069b95879
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_GoblinMentionedAbsolute = True
#. TagRule: WIZARD
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:da6e63d0-c946-1477-6a8d-13b069b95879
msgctxt "h4253c9edga3b1g4c2bg81d8g71514e6e12c6"
msgid "In all my studies, I've seen no reference to a god called the Absolute."
msgstr "난 수많은 시간을 연구로 보냈지만, 절대자라는 이름은 생전 처음 듣는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = da6e63d0-c946-1477-6a8d-13b069b95879
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_GoblinMentionedAbsolute = True
#. TagRule: PLANAR
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:da6e63d0-c946-1477-6a8d-13b069b95879
msgctxt "h200bd038g052cg4febgbe93g8d6cdf7d1c2e"
msgid ""
"Another god? I swear, Toril has more deities than there are stars in the sky."
msgstr "또 다른 신인가? 세상에, 토릴에는 신이 밤하늘의 별보다도 많나 보군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = da6e63d0-c946-1477-6a8d-13b069b95879
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_GoblinMentionedAbsolute = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:da6e63d0-c946-1477-6a8d-13b069b95879
msgctxt "ha6c42029g02e6g4affgb040gf69a9bb24f05"
msgid "Who is this Absolute you're so fond of? Your god?"
msgstr "네가 그토록 좋아하는 절대자라는 게 누구야? 네가 섬기는 신인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = e23d3e5e-ecc7-f9fb-5586-08137a75aa4d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:e23d3e5e-ecc7-f9fb-5586-08137a75aa4d
msgctxt "h8b9cc1b1gcd76g404cga9f5ga07917560ab0"
msgid "'Course I do. We all do."
msgstr "물론이지. 우리 모두 그런다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = e2de5f81-3c56-58eb-6b5b-2c5274c6f04d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:e2de5f81-3c56-58eb-6b5b-2c5274c6f04d
msgctxt "h947f02e3gff8eg4c61g9a13ga1543be2ef01"
msgid "Get me out of 'ere and I'll tell you where to find 'er. Deal?"
msgstr "여기서 꺼내주면 그녀가 어디에 있는지 알려주지. 어때?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = e476fa53-c749-c57d-a03e-b0d41cc64717
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:e476fa53-c749-c57d-a03e-b0d41cc64717
msgctxt "h800faa81g81c6g4a44gb51fg87300888bcc1"
msgid "Yeah, 'ow many were there? Four?"
msgstr "그래, 몇이나 있었는데? 넷?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = e6bd33be-55bf-b09f-c966-a63acc40506a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_Resolved = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:e6bd33be-55bf-b09f-c966-a63acc40506a
msgctxt "h16a2efc3gf83cg4788gbdc3gd36c0d0c8c2a"
msgid ""
"Oh, look - one of ya found the stones to talk to me rather than cryin' an' "
"moanin' about yer dead mates."
msgstr "오, 이것 봐라 - 죽은 친구를 위해 눈물 콧물 질질 짜는 놈 대신 나와 대화 좀 하겠다는 돌대가리를 찾았구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = e6cb64c0-04b3-fac1-2232-8faf537abea2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_GoblinMentionedAbsolute = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:e6cb64c0-04b3-fac1-2232-8faf537abea2
msgctxt "he8103271ga2f5g4856g9b10g082b4deed4b7"
msgid ""
"They're gonna burn this pretty place for the glory of the Absolute and 'ang "
"ya by yer guts."
msgstr "놈들이 절대자님의 영광을 위해 여길 불태워 버리고 네 내장을 꺼내버릴 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = efca2732-b978-77b4-9acf-41262491a574
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_PromisedHelp(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:efca2732-b978-77b4-9acf-41262491a574
msgctxt "h8b3bca08g7a70g4edeg98b1g2b51a9fef15f"
msgid "Goblins belong in cages. You won't be getting my help."
msgstr "고블린은 우리 속에 있는 게 마땅해. 나한테서 도움을 바랄 순 없을걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = f3e49584-3f26-534c-1a1b-83333e85edb2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:f3e49584-3f26-534c-1a1b-83333e85edb2
msgctxt "h7db1b348g8465g4151ga544g84ebc7f9dd4d"
msgid "I wonder how she feels about trepanning."
msgstr "뇌 수술에도 능숙하려나 궁금하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = fa7d1ee5-8e3f-2062-0a77-68b943a9b44d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DROWELF or DROWHALFELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:fa7d1ee5-8e3f-2062-0a77-68b943a9b44d
msgctxt "h2b2ec3bdg3eb6g4ae4gb7d7gb45937922f46"
msgid ""
"Didn't expect to see a drow in here. Did the boss lady send you to rescue me?"
msgstr "여기서 드로우를 만날 줄은 몰랐는데. 대장마님께서 나를 구하라고 보내셨나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = fb2ba88d-d639-a2dc-df46-4462d1c255b0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_Event_GuardCombat = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Caged:fb2ba88d-d639-a2dc-df46-4462d1c255b0
msgctxt "he51318b4g31e2g47d6g82e2g7435b1b61e6f"
msgid "No point turnin' on yer own if yer just gonna give 'em a little tap."
msgstr "그 정도로 해서는 네 배신은 아무 쓸모 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 03d61b68-d09e-bad5-a27d-caef2512a3df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_GoblinMentionedAbsolute = True
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead:03d61b68-d09e-bad5-a27d-caef2512a3df
msgctxt "h5c8c89a5g4d28g4f31g82e4gbcf8c271e145"
msgid "Who or what is the Absolute?"
msgstr "절대자라는 게 누구지? 물건인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0640e81d-12e4-3900-1b0d-ffed14921ef0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead:0640e81d-12e4-3900-1b0d-ffed14921ef0
msgctxt "h28fbba8fg8dc3g4648ga66dg9cec8f136346"
msgid "*The corpse does not stir. It will answer no more questions.*"
msgstr "*시체는 움직이지 않습니다. 더 이상 질문을 받지 않을 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 08fee603-faa2-eaf5-2e7c-ac3dc5cdd0ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead:08fee603-faa2-eaf5-2e7c-ac3dc5cdd0ea
msgctxt "h252a45d6gec29g4a8ag8e2dgd9533d3e8e5a"
msgid "... everything... all of us..."
msgstr "... 우리 모두의... 모든 것..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 18e5b045-4b72-08eb-a86e-fa5afd27d8e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead:18e5b045-4b72-08eb-a86e-fa5afd27d8e2
msgctxt "hc39195beg4b7fg413cga1d0geb43c76512a5"
msgid "Who leads your tribe?"
msgstr "네 부족은 누가 이끄나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1eb8d6af-25c8-2af7-2f3f-0603e490d80b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead:1eb8d6af-25c8-2af7-2f3f-0603e490d80b
msgctxt "h0866afe4g78d4g4733gae0fg0d583ed7d2b5"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 2a69b19a-239d-8c23-3b7c-3bf974066ee1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead:2a69b19a-239d-8c23-3b7c-3bf974066ee1
msgctxt "ha8d07c85gc5d9g4ef2gb689gdf3536415116"
msgid "... West... temple ruins..."
msgstr "... 서쪽... 신전 폐허..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 33462dcf-7d3a-f11e-db55-9538b87555cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead:33462dcf-7d3a-f11e-db55-9538b87555cb
msgctxt "h5d363562gcf80g4fa1g9732gf2538b9e77ca"
msgid "*The spell's power wanes. You can ask no more questions.*"
msgstr "*주문의 힘이 약해집니다. 더 이상 질문할 수 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 41bd2b4e-07a3-610c-d08b-4096cf904c00
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead:41bd2b4e-07a3-610c-d08b-4096cf904c00
msgctxt "h7224ec43g98cfg429egad91g0d0b0a2e903c"
msgid "*The corpse regards you lifelessly.*"
msgstr "*시체가 생기 없는 모습으로 당신을 맞이합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 45eda98b-b1a6-54d3-a68f-d2cfddb8e108
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead:45eda98b-b1a6-54d3-a68f-d2cfddb8e108
msgctxt "h853f5206gf2e3g47cag9386g783d83f44b58"
msgid "... scoutin'... snoopin'..."
msgstr "... 정찰하다가 ...기웃거리다가..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 49ca627c-2f4e-26cf-f54b-ceb811ede7f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead:49ca627c-2f4e-26cf-f54b-ceb811ede7f0
msgctxt "hf5900994g8389g4febgad83g862ecd820a03"
msgid "Can anyone in your tribe heal?"
msgstr "네 부족원 중 치유할 수 있는 자가 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 5574f4f2-67ca-6316-f803-7378d8b8b245
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_Knows_Priestess = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Priestess.LearnPriestess(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead:5574f4f2-67ca-6316-f803-7378d8b8b245
msgctxt "hbd57d93eg915cg49e9g85baga433aa055042"
msgid "... priestess Gut... powerful..."
msgstr "... 여사제 거트... 강력해..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5c51c2f0-b9fa-f6fe-d5a5-c0855f98edb6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_Knows_Priestess = True
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead:5c51c2f0-b9fa-f6fe-d5a5-c0855f98edb6
msgctxt "hc17cc809gc854g45d8ga086g818430b32f6d"
msgid "Where can I find this priestess Gut?"
msgstr "여사제 거트는 어디서 찾을 수 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 83ead39e-1e9e-f8a3-9274-434ed18a8352
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead:83ead39e-1e9e-f8a3-9274-434ed18a8352
msgctxt "he051fb54g4d45g4b2bg9539g6ad5179f8f12"
msgid "Your tribe must have some valuable loot. Where do they hide it?"
msgstr "네 부족은 분명 가치 있는 전리품이 있을 거야. 어디다 숨겼나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 8b7f9e92-4989-3784-ff5d-d1792bc69c95
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead:8b7f9e92-4989-3784-ff5d-d1792bc69c95
msgctxt "h25f522b1g1f84g4d04gbc6dg182a93dd2c4f"
msgid "... tieflin's... don't fight... fair..."
msgstr "... 티플링들은... 싸우지 않고... 공정하게..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9ebc6ac6-8334-cb66-24ac-32abbd90796a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead:9ebc6ac6-8334-cb66-24ac-32abbd90796a
msgctxt "hb75e87cege844g4221ga6a9g2b4135d2fa08"
msgid "How did they capture you?"
msgstr "널 어떻게 잡은 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a62b9298-95c2-4823-d912-7a579c9b0271
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead:a62b9298-95c2-4823-d912-7a579c9b0271
msgctxt "h46285f91gc9a6g4b94g9e01g206a765991ca"
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr "넌 누구지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = cd96c32b-ffd7-8168-76b9-e4b6e02eba6e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead:cd96c32b-ffd7-8168-76b9-e4b6e02eba6e
msgctxt "hcd1970c9g67cbg422cg848ag579890abc3b9"
msgid "... Sazza... toughest in... the tribe..."
msgstr "... 삿자... 부족에서... 가장 터프했던..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = e4d6b9ca-9beb-2060-9176-1730940f5b76
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead:e4d6b9ca-9beb-2060-9176-1730940f5b76
msgctxt "h5942c505g19c9g4b03g96dfgc40c60a905ef"
msgid "... Boss Ragzlin... and the drow..."
msgstr "... 대장 라그즐린... 그리고 드로우..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = ec98daf8-7332-f7f4-2f17-449366382890
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Dead:ec98daf8-7332-f7f4-2f17-449366382890
msgctxt "hb7ac026cg9287g459agb513gcbad2b33bebc"
msgid "... Ragzlin... waterfall... bridge..."
msgstr "... 라그즐린... 폭포... 다리..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Friend
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = 0cd57174-0bda-6404-b746-052cda903edc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_GrieflingPermaDefeated = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Friend:0cd57174-0bda-6404-b746-052cda903edc
msgctxt "h413a76abg9518g424bga9f6g38aeb66eb237"
msgid "So much death. So much <i>waste.</i>"
msgstr "너무 많이 죽었어. 아무 <i>의미도 없이.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Friend
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = 100dfc24-258c-f82d-1bfd-a47867131ead
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_FriendHasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Friend:100dfc24-258c-f82d-1bfd-a47867131ead
msgctxt "h231ffdc7g9156g45a7gab0eg981e4944c4e0"
msgid "I told you - not now."
msgstr "말했잖아. 지금은 안 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Friend
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = 735ddb64-3ca1-a5f1-bff9-fc94d66c4be9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_FriendHasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Friend:735ddb64-3ca1-a5f1-bff9-fc94d66c4be9
msgctxt "he043d84cg0d4fg4f53g8724g29afeaa4bb16"
msgid "Can't talk now. Arka needs me."
msgstr "지금은 말할 수 없어. 아르카가 날 필요로 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Friend
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = a4f21724-bc57-65ad-b4fb-21d3e5c346b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Refugees_State_LeadersAreDead = True
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_Resolved = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Friend:a4f21724-bc57-65ad-b4fb-21d3e5c346b1
msgctxt "h6fd8e5b3g4af0g4bf5g8024g186782faf816"
msgid ""
"Heard you killed the goblin boss. I hope this gives Arka some measure of "
"peace."
msgstr "네가 고블린 지도자를 죽였다던데. 그걸로 아르카가 조금이나마 평화를 찾았으면 좋겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 023382e4-d948-55e4-d517-02e83228ebf4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:023382e4-d948-55e4-d517-02e83228ebf4
msgctxt "ha87085ccg6dc9g4908g99d6g6a9561dec4b5"
msgid "Who cares?"
msgstr "무슨 상관이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 051a1dcb-06cf-5b61-e2aa-0324d2fa8887
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(3) = True
#. TagRule: BERSERKER
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:051a1dcb-06cf-5b61-e2aa-0324d2fa8887
msgctxt "h87cf9a5bg732eg4788g9d86g5bb1d7091fe4"
msgid "<b><i>ROAR.</i></b>"
msgstr "<b><i>크아아.</i></b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 051a1dcb-06cf-5b61-e2aa-0324d2fa8887
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:051a1dcb-06cf-5b61-e2aa-0324d2fa8887
msgctxt "h3349b206g9df8g4c04g854bg3bd404329efd"
msgid "Take your shot. <b>Go on.</b>"
msgstr "어서 쏴. <b>망설이지 마.</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 051fceb8-b9c1-4b0a-1bed-f82d0d74f565
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_Event_GoblinShot = True
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_PlayerWatchedGoblinExecution = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:051fceb8-b9c1-4b0a-1bed-f82d0d74f565
msgctxt "hf51ca831gbf5cg4657g8696geb1c48693088"
msgid "Here it comes, you little beast."
msgstr "이거나 먹어라, 이 짐승 새끼야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 074f200b-e5a6-d2b0-8b91-3e759bc892ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_SazzaSaysSheIsBlessed(3) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_SazzaSaysSheIsBlessed(3) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Absolute_Knows_Name = True
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_GoblinMentionedAbsolute = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:074f200b-e5a6-d2b0-8b91-3e759bc892ff
msgctxt "hc5c0e8c5gdae0g406dg971cg4364d6e059e9"
msgid ""
"Doesn't even matter if ya kill me. I'm chosen by the Absolute, I am. I'm "
"<i>blessed</i>."
msgstr "네가 날 죽여도 아무 상관조차 없어. 난 절대자님께 선택받았다고. 난 <i>축복받았어</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0b812e6d-47ad-65f6-b3fd-95c1526e44bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(3) = False
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:0b812e6d-47ad-65f6-b3fd-95c1526e44bf
msgctxt "ha0c149bag3675g414fg983bg0b1cc95f4a48"
msgid "This- This is wrong, isn't it?"
msgstr "이, 이건 잘못된 거잖아, 맞지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = 0dd4a5a6-11b7-fd1b-54bb-84838fa499d4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_Event_FriendStarted = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_FriendHasMet(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:0dd4a5a6-11b7-fd1b-54bb-84838fa499d4
msgctxt "hd2031514gc120g4e30g9923gd32fdf15fe3b"
msgid "Arka, wait! You can't just shoot her!"
msgstr "아르카, 기다려! 그녀를 쏴 버리면 안 돼!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 0f638744-79bb-d502-dc2e-9c35691b5abc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:0f638744-79bb-d502-dc2e-9c35691b5abc
msgctxt "h225fd333g606ag48dagbf46g0e0abab3cacc"
msgid "If you believe anything the beast tells you, you're an idiot."
msgstr "그 짐승 자식이 하는 말을 한 마디라도 믿으면, 넌 바보야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 1783e106-e19d-20c7-235c-e90f36037cea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_Event_GuardCombat = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:1783e106-e19d-20c7-235c-e90f36037cea
msgctxt "h63c28484g597dg429egac17g4b5970f97618"
msgid "Ugh... stop it! Get out of my head!"
msgstr "으으... 멈춰! 내 머릿속에서 나가!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 17f87ef5-1247-06c6-05c2-730f8b227605
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_PlayerRescuedGoblin = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:17f87ef5-1247-06c6-05c2-730f8b227605
msgctxt "hdaec3a35gab2dg42c2gbfe8g0da4d30db498"
msgid "Why do you care if a goblin lives or dies?"
msgstr "고블린이 죽든 말든 네가 무슨 상관이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 18b47eeb-97ed-a69a-92a6-b8645dca8ec4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_EnteredFirst(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:18b47eeb-97ed-a69a-92a6-b8645dca8ec4
msgctxt "h60e35257gf467g4be1g9321gedc21c8854df"
msgid "Ya ain't gonna shoot me. Yer hands are shakin'."
msgstr "날 쏘지도 못할걸. 손이 아주 덜덜 떨리고 있잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 24fa4618-b72c-4af9-7e14-0129de2ad3f9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:24fa4618-b72c-4af9-7e14-0129de2ad3f9
msgctxt "hd12ca1b6g1979g425dg94e0gb50778550d82"
msgid "You! Move!"
msgstr "너! 비켜!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 29fa1474-e1f7-05af-4df5-a7bab3288757
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 3dedaff8-6278-809e-821a-cd35e550c3a9_PersuadeAgainstRevenge = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:29fa1474-e1f7-05af-4df5-a7bab3288757
msgctxt "he426681dg0c09g448egad8dg6b2146a8db23"
msgid "You're right. I wish you weren't, I really do."
msgstr "네 말이 틀렸다면 좋겠어, 정말 그래. 하지만 네가 옳아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2ad81493-a8ef-8ea4-b354-54889e5133a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 0
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 791822f1-762d-1198-a09d-0b73a8a5472d_MindHasBeenRead = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CanDetectThoughts_4 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:2ad81493-a8ef-8ea4-b354-54889e5133a8
msgctxt "h6856e245gf127g4402gb477g96e5d6965558"
msgid "<i>Read the tiefling's thoughts.</i>"
msgstr "<i>티플링의 생각을 읽는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 333a7152-18eb-1b85-9d2a-e7956602fd6f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:333a7152-18eb-1b85-9d2a-e7956602fd6f
msgctxt "h1a06d83cgdb4dg4b7bga5ebgee2a2369b501"
msgid "Never mind. Don't answer that."
msgstr "신경 쓰지 마. 대답할 필요 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = 341bdf35-7e56-0dbf-9414-f7aa84f7f372
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:341bdf35-7e56-0dbf-9414-f7aa84f7f372
msgctxt "h436ca21fg3f75g4dbbgbe44gb2b904acd15e"
msgid "It's all right, Arka. Let's go."
msgstr "괜찮아, 아르카. 이제 가자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 39228dbd-21d3-d907-8b27-846ee1b51b0d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 791822f1-762d-1198-a09d-0b73a8a5472d_MindHasBeenRead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:39228dbd-21d3-d907-8b27-846ee1b51b0d
msgctxt "h0f2a2c71gdfc8g475dgaa7bg7c7490eb6420"
msgid "What would Kanon think of you now?"
msgstr "카논이 널 어떻게 생각하겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 3ccada4f-23da-df4f-88cd-19eb66f349c1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:3ccada4f-23da-df4f-88cd-19eb66f349c1
msgctxt "hd995e279g003eg43ffga7c2g9f379d4da692"
msgid "Don't you <i>dare</i>!"
msgstr "감히 그 이름을 꺼내지 마!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 401848a4-bc9d-f63b-8d3c-096031ead157
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Absolute_Knows_Name = True
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_GoblinMentionedAbsolute = True
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:401848a4-bc9d-f63b-8d3c-096031ead157
msgctxt "h80482d48g2276g4a38g945cg25bddb7dec5e"
msgid "Looks like the Absolute sent me a protector. Ya gonna kill 'er too?"
msgstr "절대자님께서 보호자를 보내주신 모양이군. 그년도 죽여버릴 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 401848a4-bc9d-f63b-8d3c-096031ead157
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Absolute_Knows_Name = True
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_GoblinMentionedAbsolute = True
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:401848a4-bc9d-f63b-8d3c-096031ead157
msgctxt "h8e46e8b3g177eg4119g951cgb0a5d95c4b8e"
msgid "Looks like the Absolute sent me a protector. Ya gonna kill 'im too?"
msgstr "절대자님께서 보호자를 보내주신 모양이군. 그놈도 죽여버릴 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 401848a4-bc9d-f63b-8d3c-096031ead157
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Absolute_Knows_Name = True
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_GoblinMentionedAbsolute = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:401848a4-bc9d-f63b-8d3c-096031ead157
msgctxt "hd0e9c494ga885g41a6g9509gf0f81866a924"
msgid "Looks like the Absolute sent me a protector. Ya gonna kill them too?"
msgstr "절대자님께서 보호자를 보내주신 모양이군. 그놈도 죽여버릴 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 42eeb1bf-569f-332c-7867-07dc9f5368db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:42eeb1bf-569f-332c-7867-07dc9f5368db
msgctxt "h169321ecg9615g4d05gbbd0g7e766e481589"
msgid "Can't say I understand that. Not sure I want to."
msgstr "이해할 수가 없네. 이해하고 싶지도 않고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 44e127c6-a02e-61cd-d953-32d89ff61984
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:44e127c6-a02e-61cd-d953-32d89ff61984
msgctxt "h680742b7ge5dag4a52g96d7gdbaf90b4c0cd"
msgid "She still has a story to tell. One I want to hear."
msgstr "녀석이 들려 줄 이야기가 있을 것 같은데. 좀 들어 봐야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 4c2aefd3-ad7e-9226-fcad-1345202fd50b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:4c2aefd3-ad7e-9226-fcad-1345202fd50b
msgctxt "hec1c20bbg81dcg4e50gae89g924be026b209"
msgid ""
"Shoot before you lose your nerve, tiefling. If you ever had it to begin with."
msgstr "아직 용기가 남아 있을 때 쏘라고, 티플링. 애초에 그런 게 있긴 하다면."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 4f432963-5a17-da5d-8f34-c8a2a7ce70d8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:4f432963-5a17-da5d-8f34-c8a2a7ce70d8
msgctxt "h13a87232g79f2g4b7bga60fg939169f6aad9"
msgid "Comfort? Is that what you think I'm after?"
msgstr "안정? 지금 내가 그거 때문에 이러는 것 같아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 510ce4b9-b615-c21d-d3f9-a3e236c29afd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 3dedaff8-6278-809e-821a-cd35e550c3a9_PersuadeAgainstRevenge = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:510ce4b9-b615-c21d-d3f9-a3e236c29afd
msgctxt "h70baa763g8488g40f3g8147g9bb25fe3e36d"
msgid ""
"Because vengeance eats people alive. You'll grant the goblins two victories "
"this day."
msgstr "복수는 사람을 산 채로 먹어 치우니까. 넌 오늘 고블린에게 두 번의 승리를 허락하게 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5251f917-62ea-6f8e-fc1b-3553585e1b77
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:5251f917-62ea-6f8e-fc1b-3553585e1b77
msgctxt "h7f8b9412gafd5g4419gb41bgad07f5090d06"
msgid "<i>Watch what happens.</i>"
msgstr "<i>무슨 일이 벌어지는지 지켜본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5b2c8d7e-43f4-2422-3360-948aee0497f1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:5b2c8d7e-43f4-2422-3360-948aee0497f1
msgctxt "h222667abg6193g4219gba65gcbf8ce362709"
msgid "My reasons are my own."
msgstr "내 이유는 네가 알 바 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 62891282-72b6-8cdc-6059-42cca5e447fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(3) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_DarkUrge_Event_HadUrge(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:62891282-72b6-8cdc-6059-42cca5e447fd
msgctxt "hd5ef62b9g2d17g4f0cgb331g1454c000eba2"
msgid ""
"*Your mind wanders: If the crossbow bolt shot through her mouth, would she "
"taste the metal before she died?*"
msgstr "*딴생각이 듭니다. 만약 쇠뇌의 볼트가 입을 꿰뚫는다면, 저 고블린은 죽기 전에 쇠 맛을 느낄까요?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = 655ce4bc-e82d-f781-33d2-dfe97974d91b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:655ce4bc-e82d-f781-33d2-dfe97974d91b
msgctxt "hc6ac0ad8gaa52g41e5g810fgaf6fed9724c9"
msgid "She didn't kill your brother, Arka. You're better than this."
msgstr "이 고블린이 네 형제를 죽인 게 아니잖아, 아르카. 너 이거보단 나은 사람이잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 68782ddd-0823-41a5-e733-2de3d4644a95
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:68782ddd-0823-41a5-e733-2de3d4644a95
msgctxt "h2af4a695g2929g454egad55g8758164d39ce"
msgid "What in every hell is wrong with you?"
msgstr "넌 망할 뭐가 문제야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 6b800384-2a53-f9de-9530-ca301c038812
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge_OneLastChance(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:6b800384-2a53-f9de-9530-ca301c038812
msgctxt "h7a876cd3g08b8g416fg8a1ag01e4b2d017e4"
msgid "You fought for us, so I'll give you one last chance. <i>Move.</i>"
msgstr "네가 우릴 위해 싸워줬으니, 마지막 기회를 주겠어. <i>비켜.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 6eb752ee-1d1e-0261-da31-ab7a2dd9896d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:6eb752ee-1d1e-0261-da31-ab7a2dd9896d
msgctxt "hc6108cf7g6c69g4b34g9d6agc3e30f57196b"
msgid "You'd better be right."
msgstr "네 말이 맞아야 할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6ec22459-605a-2027-7975-ecd8fa2d89ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_OfferedBluntTruth(3) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:6ec22459-605a-2027-7975-ecd8fa2d89ed
msgctxt "hbe2989a1g8456g4310gaaf8gb2da5ae131b8"
msgid "Because she's not a practice target. She's a person."
msgstr "연습용 표적이 아니니까. 얘도 하나의 인격체야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 7542e40a-a5d4-5558-3a8b-d217eb290f04
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:7542e40a-a5d4-5558-3a8b-d217eb290f04
msgctxt "hd6b44c96g9e32g4680gb7d0g70def87a8d9e"
msgid "Ya ain't gonna shoot me. Yer hands are shakin'."
msgstr "날 쏘지도 못할걸. 손이 아주 덜덜 떨리고 있잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7dbcc490-7994-3736-a9fb-8cef8542e181
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:7dbcc490-7994-3736-a9fb-8cef8542e181
msgctxt "h92f3a09egc9fcg439cg8e8fgfa7d06effccf"
msgid "Shut up. Those words could be your last."
msgstr "입 닥쳐. 그게 네가 내뱉는 마지막 말이 될지도 모르니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 7e1aa07b-6f64-2266-7dd8-b01803b538c1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:7e1aa07b-6f64-2266-7dd8-b01803b538c1
msgctxt "h2916af87g17a8g4f15gaf83g1d3b62436bda"
msgid "Smart choice."
msgstr "현명한 선택이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 827e9252-7808-13b6-9067-ffc7fb379ae1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_OfferedRevenge(3) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:827e9252-7808-13b6-9067-ffc7fb379ae1
msgctxt "hc01a17c7gb172g4f41ga1edg7f23999cdb56"
msgid "A goblin <i>prisoner</i>. Her life isn't yours to take."
msgstr "고블린 <i>포로</i>잖아. 포로의 목숨은 마음대로 결정할 수 있는 게 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 850ce384-de3e-bf62-3a07-099c242c7197
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:850ce384-de3e-bf62-3a07-099c242c7197
msgctxt "hedc7a726g5bc3g4fc6gb57eg14ba1ff49d4d"
msgid "No, shoot me. Should be easy, right?"
msgstr "아니, 나를 쏴. 간단하잖아, 안 그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 8a529c63-0b17-4e3a-f980-14e63f26e3b4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:8a529c63-0b17-4e3a-f980-14e63f26e3b4
msgctxt "h6fe3442ag160eg48f3gb9cag5c6fd8385bd1"
msgid "I'm not looking for miracles. Just blood."
msgstr "기적을 찾고 있는 게 아니야. 피를 원할 뿐이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = 92c7a5c2-9e44-a743-45e1-95ac1bd4fbc3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_FriendHasMet(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:92c7a5c2-9e44-a743-45e1-95ac1bd4fbc3
msgctxt "h40dd2995gef94g4930ga897g87fdb74c3c69"
msgid "Put it down. She can't fight back."
msgstr "그거 내려놔. 그녀는 반격할 수도 없는 상태라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9ad04814-b6f8-19bf-158d-47e6d0d6f0c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_GOOD(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:9ad04814-b6f8-19bf-158d-47e6d0d6f0c0
msgctxt "h7d3c8f7dg5eb0g463eg85bbg896623dba266"
msgid "Killing this goblin won't help you. Let the gods provide comfort."
msgstr "이 고블린을 죽여봤자 너한테 도움 될 건 하나도 없어. 신께서 위로를 선사해 주실 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9ad348a6-5fab-13e4-cb9f-cc0354849b71
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_Event_Gale_SteppedInfrontOfCrossbowApproval(3) = True
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_SteppedInfrontOfCrossbow(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:9ad348a6-5fab-13e4-cb9f-cc0354849b71
msgctxt "h4f489725g87eeg4cbeg9050geb80efa59c62"
msgid "<i>Move in front of the tiefling's crossbow.</i>"
msgstr "<i>티플링의 쇠뇌를 몸으로 가로막는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = a5133aa7-45ac-7549-4602-7281acef94f1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:a5133aa7-45ac-7549-4602-7281acef94f1
msgctxt "h5e2a3de2g7150g4d5eg9b3egdcbd235cd740"
msgid "Damn you. Damn it!"
msgstr "젠장. 젠장!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = a5178892-b333-eb2d-576b-c1acde8110ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:a5178892-b333-eb2d-576b-c1acde8110ac
msgctxt "h3431d08agf639g4e45g866agdf9add6d685d"
msgid "That's the point. Get out of the way."
msgstr "그게 중요한 거야. 저리 비켜."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a54f3b3d-054e-6acd-b44a-0d1c44fe3d83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_DARK_URGE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:a54f3b3d-054e-6acd-b44a-0d1c44fe3d83
msgctxt "h6e813674gfeb6g4603g9125g76b261e6a100"
msgid "<i>Stand back, and admire the guard's overflowing hate.</i>"
msgstr "<i>물러난다. 그리고 경비의 넘쳐흐르는 증오에 감탄한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a54f3b3d-054e-6acd-b44a-0d1c44fe3d83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:a54f3b3d-054e-6acd-b44a-0d1c44fe3d83
msgctxt "h1d6ff44cg3da4g46a7g847cg33ab2097e631"
msgid "<i>Do nothing.</i>"
msgstr "<i>아무것도 하지 않는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a8835d64-57ba-80c9-63cd-91ebc49f858c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_Event_SteppedBackFromGoblin(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:a8835d64-57ba-80c9-63cd-91ebc49f858c
msgctxt "hf25aa7c4g83ecg47c6g911fg5aa20ab59753"
msgid "<i>Step out of the way.</i>"
msgstr "<i>길을 비킨다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = ab1fe499-079c-cf2d-69fb-0a7f8d6dd1b6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_SazzaSaysSheIsBlessed(3) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Absolute_Knows_Name = True
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_GoblinMentionedAbsolute = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:ab1fe499-079c-cf2d-69fb-0a7f8d6dd1b6
msgctxt "ha83b24d9g46f1g4f2dg9bc3ga443d479e66e"
msgid "I'm not afraid. Chosen by the Absolute, I am. I'm <i>blessed</i>."
msgstr "난 하나도 두렵지 않아. 난 절대자님께 선택받았다고. 난 <i>축복</i>받았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ae45f397-8c15-f82e-ec40-0a8a6d53ce26
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(3) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:ae45f397-8c15-f82e-ec40-0a8a6d53ce26
msgctxt "h13b08157gafedg434dg810fg6536c6640438"
msgid "Lower the crossbow, or I'll deliver you right to your brother."
msgstr "당장 쇠뇌를 내려, 아니면 네 형제 곁으로 보내줄 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = b34b7792-f1f6-1f75-530b-daad33cf2537
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:b34b7792-f1f6-1f75-530b-daad33cf2537
msgctxt "h677e7c45geadag4df7g9fd5g3c0ea841a90a"
msgid ""
"Not sure I get that. The bars don't make her special. But, fine, whatever."
msgstr "네 눈에나 그래 보이겠지. 쇠창살 안에 있다고 특별해지는 건 아니야. 하지만, 좋아. 될 대로 되라지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = b7308f1d-e12c-de10-d72e-c51da7e354b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:b7308f1d-e12c-de10-d72e-c51da7e354b2
msgctxt "h58421a46gc7e2g4cdbga5d7gcda3df61f4ac"
msgid "Maybe not. But it'll wipe the shit-grin off its face, at least."
msgstr "그럴 수도. 하지만 적어도 저 망할 초록색 면상은 없애버릴 순 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = b78d19e3-fcbb-7ecd-a770-c1a5e2ee8940
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:b78d19e3-fcbb-7ecd-a770-c1a5e2ee8940
msgctxt "h3d44ed2egb6abg4f2dgb050g4a2daa647b2f"
msgid "<i>Tsk. </i>Your soft heart will be the death of us."
msgstr "<i>츠크.</i> 네 녀석의 물러 터진 성미가 우릴 죽음으로 이끌 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = b8aadc22-f3ef-8a5b-ef92-e1a6877b1285
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:b8aadc22-f3ef-8a5b-ef92-e1a6877b1285
msgctxt "hca740298g7b2cg4197g988egbf632ea67df6"
msgid "Like hell I won't."
msgstr "내가 망할 못할 것 같지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b93f39d1-a5c0-7411-c385-25d44e6bdead
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:b93f39d1-a5c0-7411-c385-25d44e6bdead
msgctxt "h87cdea89g6e6fg4fe0gb8f7g2e6ee2ea2552"
msgid "If she dies, she'll take everything she knows to the grave."
msgstr "얘를 죽이면, 얘가 가진 정보들도 말짱 도루묵이 되고 말 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = bffbb908-897a-b787-f57f-e7df3211797f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:bffbb908-897a-b787-f57f-e7df3211797f
msgctxt "h745bba11gd019g4ec1g91b9g3989b6e4dfee"
msgid "Get out of my way."
msgstr "당장 비켜."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c09c0da2-c59a-43a6-28ed-c5ebc1722161
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:c09c0da2-c59a-43a6-28ed-c5ebc1722161
msgctxt "h210328c9g6307g483ag81ccg054db17c9379"
msgid "This goblin is in need of judgement. I should decide her fate."
msgstr "이 고블린은 판결을 받아야 해. 내가 그녀의 운명을 결정하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = cd88b344-30ca-a3f2-e13f-21f9e9996ab4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 791822f1-762d-1198-a09d-0b73a8a5472d_MindHasBeenRead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:cd88b344-30ca-a3f2-e13f-21f9e9996ab4
msgctxt "hbb78ad8ag1906g4b0ega364gb4b5d2ca2949"
msgid ""
"<i>Kanon would hate me for this. But he's not here. They took him from "
"me.</i>"
msgstr "<i>카논이 내가 이렇게 하는 걸 싫어하겠지. 하지만 그는 여기 없어. 그들이 내게서 앗아가 버렸으니까.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d1c2fd85-06dd-45ec-4778-3639312d593c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:d1c2fd85-06dd-45ec-4778-3639312d593c
msgctxt "he0d683d7gb7a6g4190g9aafgd3fa4bfd5d5d"
msgid "This won't avenge Kanon. It won't change anything."
msgstr "이걸로 카논의 복수를 할 순 없어. 아무것도 바뀌지 않을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = d62aab60-30d8-25d6-091e-f59e26bdb095
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:d62aab60-30d8-25d6-091e-f59e26bdb095
msgctxt "h35c03eacgb8efg48acgb1eeg51aa7c52145e"
msgid "Oh, I'll bless you all right."
msgstr "오, 내가 제대로 축복해주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = dbed1d2b-b1f4-c138-dbb7-47df652db4de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:dbed1d2b-b1f4-c138-dbb7-47df652db4de
msgctxt "hab79a7b3gff4cg4251g9248g5dfc3ad623c7"
msgid "I didn't ask for you to say a damn thing - keep out of it!"
msgstr "네가 아무 말도 하라고 부탁한 적 없으니까, 신경 쓰지 마!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dcbd7c63-66e1-f250-576e-d07fe5641a55
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_Event_Gale_SteppedInfrontOfCrossbowApproval(3) = True
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_SteppedInfrontOfCrossbow(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:dcbd7c63-66e1-f250-576e-d07fe5641a55
msgctxt "hdf040eb0gcaf0g4ffeg8a39gba4e16860888"
msgid "<i>Step between the crossbow and the goblin.</i>"
msgstr "<i>쇠뇌와 고블린 사이를 가로막는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = e97a0211-c156-d25d-0a3c-69d2231a962c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:e97a0211-c156-d25d-0a3c-69d2231a962c
msgctxt "hfa1752d0gb65fg496fg8291g252abbd499ef"
msgid "Gods, you're exhausting. Fine, then."
msgstr "젠장, 사람 질리게 만드네. 좋아, 그럼."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = eb7e2bd0-510d-905d-aa9a-3665f2eb1a79
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:eb7e2bd0-510d-905d-aa9a-3665f2eb1a79
msgctxt "h85ff58c5g4b67g4850g9309g1f17ca4acb22"
msgid "She's all yours."
msgstr "네 마음대로 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = ee757910-d18a-8020-be51-3183d060ab1a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:ee757910-d18a-8020-be51-3183d060ab1a
msgctxt "h7a4f403bge2b0g4377ga040gba05eaab7b99"
msgid "Why not? That's what her kind did to Kanon."
msgstr "안될 게 뭐 있어? 이놈의 동족들이 카논에게 그런 짓을 했는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fca06c94-ce61-535a-7e40-d84314ea6eda
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:fca06c94-ce61-535a-7e40-d84314ea6eda
msgctxt "h933dd5cbg5c79g4ccdg8324gce1e6f85ea00"
msgid ""
"I sense the pain you carry - but killing this creature will not ease your "
"burden."
msgstr "네가 짊어진 고통이 느껴진다 - 하지만 이 생물을 죽인다고 그 짊이 가벼워 지진 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = ffd4dc30-1f28-1017-ea4a-d8e439cdb15c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_Event_GuardCombat = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsAvenge:ffd4dc30-1f28-1017-ea4a-d8e439cdb15c
msgctxt "h55816fefg1043g40a2gbd30g35f314e45112"
msgid "You want to die for this stupid goblin? Fine."
msgstr "이 바보 같은 고블린을 위해 죽겠다고? 좋아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 068a4a1d-d21e-a6b4-4373-b80cac67e3e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:068a4a1d-d21e-a6b4-4373-b80cac67e3e2
msgctxt "hdfe6cce6g23deg40dcg8407ga5e1ff9deb4a"
msgid "You idiot. Don't you do this to me!"
msgstr "이 멍청아. 날 두고 죽지 마!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 069b0dab-5f8b-227a-3e2e-a9c53b73cb27
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:069b0dab-5f8b-227a-3e2e-a9c53b73cb27
msgctxt "hb03a6090gbe5ag4783ga3c4g587376eeb97a"
msgid "Yes, they will."
msgstr "그래, 복수해야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 1222f99d-eb20-79b4-ae0d-7e24231831a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:1222f99d-eb20-79b4-ae0d-7e24231831a7
msgctxt "h049f1906g3dc5g4293ga906g9a09a9f05405"
msgid "Someone's going to pay for this."
msgstr "누군가는 대가를 치러야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 1485e33d-20d0-4450-2aa9-ddddcbda431f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 12b917b2-1d8e-6ad3-a607-fc77072cb909_LaezelSpoke = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:1485e33d-20d0-4450-2aa9-ddddcbda431f
msgctxt "h8473c27cge647g4855g8f5ag56eb4c8c1b62"
msgid "Do not embarrass yourself. He is gone."
msgstr "창피한 짓 좀 하지 마라. 이미 죽었다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1ec001c0-bf83-80b5-d29d-f35d617af160
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:1ec001c0-bf83-80b5-d29d-f35d617af160
msgctxt "he48a1fdcgf7a8g466fgb46cg9dee74371071"
msgid ""
"He is gone - returned into the cycle. We can only wish him peace in the next "
"life."
msgstr "이미 떠났어. 다시 윤회에 든 거지. 그저 그의 다음 생이 평안하길 바랄 도리밖에 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 22f74f43-0cc2-55b8-c089-09a661d7c53d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_Event_LeftToGrief = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:22f74f43-0cc2-55b8-c089-09a661d7c53d
msgctxt "hc685e886gfdd6g4010g99bcgf02698d5425d"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 237ad089-0059-e671-a47d-77f28e1a9c60
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_OfferedPrayer(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:237ad089-0059-e671-a47d-77f28e1a9c60
msgctxt "h9217efd7ge087g4904g973bg4c75f150a62e"
msgid "The gods have taken him. All you can do is pray."
msgstr "이미 신들 곁으로 떠났어. 남은 도리는 기도뿐이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 28bf47cc-423f-9bda-36f2-6d6059f5899b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Quest_GoblinRaidOver = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:28bf47cc-423f-9bda-36f2-6d6059f5899b
msgctxt "he026f97agce9dg4756g9344g3d0067fb0e22"
msgid "Now? You wanna talk <i>now</i>?"
msgstr "지금? <i>지금</i> 꼭 말을 걸어야겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3dc746a2-66f4-fde3-3ea8-62b102b272ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_OfferedRevenge(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:3dc746a2-66f4-fde3-3ea8-62b102b272ee
msgctxt "hf773f987gc87dg4144gbc4bgfc9f262df289"
msgid ""
"End every one of those goblins - make them suffer to avenge your fallen "
"friend."
msgstr "고블린 놈들을 모조리 끝장내버려. 친구들을 죽인 대가를 고통으로 되갚아주라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 4653f642-7ff3-35c8-2200-f71ce652547b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:4653f642-7ff3-35c8-2200-f71ce652547b
msgctxt "hae99de63g7abag4014g9103g01afc990e379"
msgid "You idiot. Don't you do this to me!"
msgstr "이 멍청아. 날 두고 죽지 마!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 46a672a1-b7c1-408a-01a4-fcbd9f1c083d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_OfferedComfort(2) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_DARK_URGE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:46a672a1-b7c1-408a-01a4-fcbd9f1c083d
msgctxt "h4a7ff3f8gde78g42efga0eega9b6deed7c89"
msgid "<i>Don't lash out. Try to be comforting.</i>"
msgstr "<i>힐난해대고픈 걸 참고, 위로해보려고 노력한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 46a672a1-b7c1-408a-01a4-fcbd9f1c083d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_OfferedComfort(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:46a672a1-b7c1-408a-01a4-fcbd9f1c083d
msgctxt "h91276cf3g2153g4c9fgbcd4g7b75eb9936bd"
msgid "<i>Place your hand on her shoulder.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그녀의 어깨에 손을 올려놓는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 49c0c32a-6417-425b-6d61-8391bf7438ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_InTransit = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:49c0c32a-6417-425b-6d61-8391bf7438ec
msgctxt "h0a915d40g81a7g4f7cgbba5g98b8170a887b"
msgid "A goblin we captured yesterday. I'm going to kill it."
msgstr "우리가 어제 잡은 고블린. 그년을 죽여버려야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4b589094-cdfe-717d-24a7-ef7da648cc18
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_DARK_URGE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:4b589094-cdfe-717d-24a7-ef7da648cc18
msgctxt "h26da996dgbc36g4c76gafe8g938769d344e0"
msgid "<i>Keep quiet. Try not to encourage bloodshed, for once.</i>"
msgstr "<i>입을 꾹 다문다. 이번만은 유혈사태에 일조하지 않도록 한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4b589094-cdfe-717d-24a7-ef7da648cc18
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:4b589094-cdfe-717d-24a7-ef7da648cc18
msgctxt "h3eab1991ga626g4872gbb25g310359e35a2b"
msgid "<i>Stand aside.</i>"
msgstr "<i>길을 비킨다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 4f399fd3-ed63-77bb-3d6d-5857234265f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsHasMet(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:4f399fd3-ed63-77bb-3d6d-5857234265f2
msgctxt "hf15785c1gf3a5g4c71gb84cg90aa440c3dd3"
msgid "No, no, no."
msgstr "안 돼, 안 돼, 안 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 537bf1f9-2e1c-8af0-65ac-a1c952d296f9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:537bf1f9-2e1c-8af0-65ac-a1c952d296f9
msgctxt "h2dc01a42ga213g4a68gbbb1gff1ed5d2bbdc"
msgid "How can you look at his body and speak to me of <i>peace?</i>"
msgstr "이 꼴을 보고 어떻게 <i>평안</i>이라는 말이 튀어나와?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = 602d5539-b20e-fa14-f0d7-e0b81e8046c7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_FriendHasMet(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:602d5539-b20e-fa14-f0d7-e0b81e8046c7
msgctxt "ha97266dbg2c60g4ca4g9b24gbc592145bc74"
msgid "It's... it's too late. Look at him."
msgstr "이미... 이미 늦었어. 좀 보라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 68c041ee-e0f7-3cd7-2745-2a0693573ec8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:68c041ee-e0f7-3cd7-2745-2a0693573ec8
msgctxt "h5efd063fg900eg4466gbb67g1111fb55149e"
msgid "Yes. Good. Go forth in <i>hate</i>."
msgstr "그래. 좋아. <i>증오</i>에 몸을 맡기라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6f2c86c7-177a-9bf5-b63c-fc4689312528
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:6f2c86c7-177a-9bf5-b63c-fc4689312528
msgctxt "h64596d09gc3edg4f99g9a30g537d5c9cc4cd"
msgid ""
"He is gone - returned into the cycle. We can only wish him peace in the next "
"life."
msgstr "이미 떠났어. 다시 윤회에 든 거지. 그저 그의 다음 생이 평안하길 바랄 도리밖에 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 6f8e7b32-95f3-113c-ff57-0fdf880e384c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:6f8e7b32-95f3-113c-ff57-0fdf880e384c
msgctxt "h2ab0244dgf40eg406cgb35cg43c1058c3790"
msgid "Someone help me! Kanon's dying!"
msgstr "누가 좀 도와줘! 카논이 죽어간다고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = 73692105-2d87-296e-6270-a41efdee53cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 12b917b2-1d8e-6ad3-a607-fc77072cb909_LaezelSpoke = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_FriendHasMet(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:73692105-2d87-296e-6270-a41efdee53cd
msgctxt "he4e08fc0g9491g407agaa9eg811ddda7a201"
msgid "It's too late. He's gone."
msgstr "이미 늦었어. 죽었다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 73b6d09c-c57f-9fc4-6a1b-57e39b7813c1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_GOOD(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_OfferedPrayer(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:73b6d09c-c57f-9fc4-6a1b-57e39b7813c1
msgctxt "h96af76b6g9b37g473ega583gcb6b8bfb5fe2"
msgid "I'll say a blessing to guide his soul."
msgstr "이 사람의 영혼이 잘 인도되도록 기도해줄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 7c7abb2d-d412-38ee-b5b8-36dd34a1c456
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:7c7abb2d-d412-38ee-b5b8-36dd34a1c456
msgctxt "hc509b1d8g00b6g4830g8494g7c88d331859a"
msgid "They're slaughtering us now!"
msgstr "놈들은 이미 우릴 도륙내고 있어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 7d2c8c61-8d2a-d063-7020-c943be1153aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:7d2c8c61-8d2a-d063-7020-c943be1153aa
msgctxt "h13bf5b6eg17e8g4abag9226gd19be503386b"
msgid "Someone's going to pay for this."
msgstr "누군가는 대가를 치러야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 812a3d9b-2a30-37ed-b3ee-3d39fd4b1da2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:812a3d9b-2a30-37ed-b3ee-3d39fd4b1da2
msgctxt "h03b12fb3g5019g4c72gb517g75dbf1354f0f"
msgid "You're... right. There's no point."
msgstr "맞는... 말이야. 다 부질없는 짓이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = 825665ba-8bc7-0b12-3669-ae07361d25c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_InTransit = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:825665ba-8bc7-0b12-3669-ae07361d25c3
msgctxt "h55e16014g11fag473ag814eg76f37813ebf2"
msgid "Arka, no, wait! What are you doing?"
msgstr "아르카, 안 돼, 기다려! 뭘 하려는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 8a622122-e5b6-36f8-5c01-b8cf27b7a86c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:8a622122-e5b6-36f8-5c01-b8cf27b7a86c
msgctxt "h0578b260gd64bg4dbag96b4g1f8808e9d904"
msgid "Peace?<i> </i>No. The time for peace is <i>over.</i>"
msgstr "평안? 아니, 평안 따위는 이제 안중에 <i>없어.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 8d55b179-5a5f-0c16-20c0-e6a365f6cf2b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:8d55b179-5a5f-0c16-20c0-e6a365f6cf2b
msgctxt "hfc2c3ebegbb1ag4e50g9885g3a4f1f5e9f79"
msgid "Don't be sorry - fetch some help!"
msgstr "유감 말고, 도울 거리나 찾아!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8fd4063e-4b7d-32a0-ff68-67e5058fcafe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SELDARINEDROWELF(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_OfferedVisionOfGlory(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:8fd4063e-4b7d-32a0-ff68-67e5058fcafe
msgctxt "h3fd8cd2ega0a6g414agbf3ag2de8f6993629"
msgid "Memnos is gone, too. Don't weep - they died well. Heroically."
msgstr "멤노스도 죽었어. 그리 슬퍼하지 마. 그들은 영웅답게 죽었다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 913870e7-d883-ee04-f241-17af394a3ebb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:913870e7-d883-ee04-f241-17af394a3ebb
msgctxt "h75f6dd6dgb29cg4dc2gb2a8gfef4c4b371c0"
msgid "No, we wouldn't. It's pointless."
msgstr "아니, 안 좋아. 다 부질없다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 9868e57a-bc13-a2be-6680-80cae5928079
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:9868e57a-bc13-a2be-6680-80cae5928079
msgctxt "h4b1ddd45g3a66g4142g8fcdg74b042f2cb82"
msgid "No. We've prayed enough. We've <i>lost </i>enough."
msgstr "아니. 기도는 이제 충분해. 이미 충분히 <i>잃었다고.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 9a0e8b4b-58ca-01d3-0680-0761ffb1aaac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:9a0e8b4b-58ca-01d3-0680-0761ffb1aaac
msgctxt "hb26c2b9fg670ag4695g8df3gb22b0456afe5"
msgid "W-what?"
msgstr "뭐, 뭐라고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = a8e29214-7550-70b8-0099-354f99383708
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_Event_FriendStarted = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_FriendHasMet(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:a8e29214-7550-70b8-0099-354f99383708
msgctxt "hcb10c8c3g9664g430cg89b5g721b95dabde0"
msgid "I'm sorry, Arka."
msgstr "유감이야, 아르카."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ac7f4ca1-d357-ad33-be7c-0f538f2c6f03
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_DarkUrge_Event_HadUrge(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:ac7f4ca1-d357-ad33-be7c-0f538f2c6f03
msgctxt "h646b0ed0gc911g49bfg86e8g9361f527ab68"
msgid ""
"*You shiver at the thought of a radiant future. Goblin and tiefling may reap "
"slaughter upon one another until none remain, if you guide them true.*"
msgstr ""
"*문득 즐거운 미래가 떠올라 몸이 떨리는군요. 당신이 제대로만 유도한다면, 고블린과 티플링은 아무도 남지 않을 때 까지 서로를 도륙내게 "
"될 겁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = af6c10a2-b90d-a270-e405-7f2d0d0a18d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_OfferedRevenge(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:af6c10a2-b90d-a270-e405-7f2d0d0a18d0
msgctxt "hd177a026g78dbg4976g8e7cg8b9676f2cf23"
msgid "You need to avenge this - spill some goblin blood."
msgstr "복수를 해야지. 고블린 놈들이 피를 쏟게 만들라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = afcb6dcd-6387-4506-30a0-6df195c6b4ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsHasMet(2) = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsHasMet(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:afcb6dcd-6387-4506-30a0-6df195c6b4ef
msgctxt "h88e15990g8c4fg41c2gb359geae2589876c8"
msgid "He's not breathing. Go find a healer!"
msgstr "숨을 안 쉬어. 치유사 좀 불러와!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b323aee2-309a-3eba-9526-878235e54657
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:b323aee2-309a-3eba-9526-878235e54657
msgctxt "h804a9415ge806g48c5g8c72g4f556b2e7fcd"
msgid "Anyone in particular?"
msgstr "그게 누군데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = b60760b0-0e68-2d52-1de4-a9c56d80b090
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:b60760b0-0e68-2d52-1de4-a9c56d80b090
msgctxt "h8b415e89gf6ffg46a2g9a02g58831aef12b6"
msgid "We'd like that."
msgstr "그래 주면 좋겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bc9433af-6df7-298e-e4d5-a8bd1c35af34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_OfferedApology(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:bc9433af-6df7-298e-e4d5-a8bd1c35af34
msgctxt "hd55f743ag94a4g4c20gbd1eg2a273bcdaf1c"
msgid "I'm sorry. It happened so fast."
msgstr "유감이야. 너무 순식간에 일이 벌어졌어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d3200951-c7fb-2cee-9801-7fed86395df7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_OfferedRevenge(2) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_DARK_URGE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:d3200951-c7fb-2cee-9801-7fed86395df7
msgctxt "he39adbd9g9e7bg4205ga2a1ga15c2e3980d1"
msgid ""
"Your friends are both dead. Will you be bold and <i>kill</i>? Will they be "
"avenged?"
msgstr "네 친지가 둘 다 죽어버렸어. <i>살의</i>가 끓지 않아? 그네들 복수를 해야지 않겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d3200951-c7fb-2cee-9801-7fed86395df7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_OfferedRevenge(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:d3200951-c7fb-2cee-9801-7fed86395df7
msgctxt "h4ccd3893g0288g4141gaf4ag13e1a71f4839"
msgid "Your friends are dead - both of them. They need to be avenged."
msgstr "네 친지가 죽었어. 둘 다 말이야. 복수를 해야 마땅해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = dfbb1373-ec6d-330c-c310-2618ace866cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsHasMet(2) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_FriendPermaDefeated = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsHasMet(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:dfbb1373-ec6d-330c-c310-2618ace866cb
msgctxt "h807190a0g59fdg4ddag8965gb7969d10a403"
msgid "Memnos? Where are you? He's not... he's not breathing!"
msgstr "멤노스? 어디 있는 거야? 오빠가... 오빠가 숨을 안 쉬어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = ea686c2c-af74-98f9-067f-3cef886ff747
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:ea686c2c-af74-98f9-067f-3cef886ff747
msgctxt "h6c5fdd0bg2abcg4bb9g8de8gb71e81a7f483"
msgid "No!"
msgstr "안 돼!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f0bb05f3-c2d2-9614-9f29-c2491b24074c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_OfferedBluntTruth(2) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_DARK_URGE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:f0bb05f3-c2d2-9614-9f29-c2491b24074c
msgctxt "hd6bbbf36gc06cg42a3gacb6gb15f21c89935"
msgid "Kanon, Memnos, and soon you, too!"
msgstr "카논에 멤노스도 죽었어. 너도 곧 그리되겠지!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f0bb05f3-c2d2-9614-9f29-c2491b24074c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_OfferedBluntTruth(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:f0bb05f3-c2d2-9614-9f29-c2491b24074c
msgctxt "he78e7a87ga87eg4dd5g899cg1d3bba19f6cb"
msgid "Kanon is dead. And so is Memnos."
msgstr "카논은 죽었어. 멤노스도 그렇고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = f94b4846-209a-3364-2a7e-664e5a847900
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:f94b4846-209a-3364-2a7e-664e5a847900
msgctxt "h56506c3dge3b7g4df3gbea2g60783da917dc"
msgid "They'll slaughter us if we leave. There's nothing we can do."
msgstr "여길 뜨면 우린 도륙당하고 말 거야. 뾰족한 도리가 없다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = faf7570e-fea7-d419-51c4-b41e38ec8e3e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:faf7570e-fea7-d419-51c4-b41e38ec8e3e
msgctxt "h2040dce9g8835g48fagbc7eg1e533f00b251"
msgid "No. I don't want your godsdamned comfort. I want <i>blood</i>."
msgstr "됐어. 내가 바라는 건 네 위로 따위가 아니야. 피의 복수지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fcc101fe-d582-ab7f-24b1-c4375bd2003a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_OfferedBluntTruth(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsGrieve:fcc101fe-d582-ab7f-24b1-c4375bd2003a
msgctxt "h003a29dbgd86eg461dgbcd7ge01f626bfb4c"
msgid "He's dead. Stop wasting your time."
msgstr "이미 죽었잖아. 시간 낭비 그만해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = 15107528-1407-e4f2-7090-175b8039a1ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_Event_GuardsLeft = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle:15107528-1407-e4f2-7090-175b8039a1ba
msgctxt "h3f6ccbc0gae1dg4246gb145g975ba0c1edd2"
msgid "Soon."
msgstr "금방 갈께."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 25a87dc4-8543-01ef-780f-687158adbe60
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_PCGotPostRescueFollowUp(2) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_PlayerRescuedGoblin = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_PCGotPostRescueFollowUp(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle:25a87dc4-8543-01ef-780f-687158adbe60
msgctxt "hb97cb84ag0474g4f3aga6c5g15ab8e56e343"
msgid "Having fun with your new goblin friend? Bet you aren't."
msgstr "새 고블린 친구들이랑 재미 좀 보는 거야? 그리 보이지는 않는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 34bc727c-6b9d-a478-95b9-33ff5b025aa4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Refugees_State_LeadersAreDead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle:34bc727c-6b9d-a478-95b9-33ff5b025aa4
msgctxt "hefa3e1bdgeb85g4279g959fgbf06b3613f06"
msgid "It's fine, Memnos."
msgstr "괜찮아, 멤노스."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = 356be64c-e313-49b8-e079-66d5172419d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_Event_FriendStarted = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_FriendHasMet(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle:356be64c-e313-49b8-e079-66d5172419d9
msgctxt "h7418f0dbg10fbg4bfagaf45g9bb806edf773"
msgid "Please, leave us be. This isn't a good time -"
msgstr "부탁인데 우리를 내버려둬. 지금은 좋은 때가 아니니 -"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 53130421-7b03-3011-fd84-8b506e9de8b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle:53130421-7b03-3011-fd84-8b506e9de8b5
msgctxt "hc0f10fb2g399eg45b8g9678gee1d209468fc"
msgid "Fighting chance? That's more than Kanon got."
msgstr "싸울 기회라? 그건 카논에게도 없었을걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 58e357db-7c9d-d0b0-0d02-86a87b12ec2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_FriendPermaDefeated = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle:58e357db-7c9d-d0b0-0d02-86a87b12ec2c
msgctxt "h1e1ce2bfge258g4e21g86ddg01640d6b203e"
msgid "First Kanon, now Memnos..."
msgstr "이제 카논으로 모자라, 멤노스까지..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5c5f26dd-5154-cda9-29a4-c53925a22329
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 04fcd442-1f28-c7f8-e8e3-bcd8cc7620f9_FightingChance = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 04fcd442-1f28-c7f8-e8e3-bcd8cc7620f9_FightingChance = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle:5c5f26dd-5154-cda9-29a4-c53925a22329
msgctxt "hd2187988gd5eag4454gb29egc79a1e841bd8"
msgid ""
"Bit of a fish in a barrel there. You could have given her a fighting chance."
msgstr "통 속에 갇힌 물고기 같군. 네가 그녀에게 싸울 기회를 줬어야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 5e4c3c5b-33b3-4b8b-788f-091ec2c06cba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle:5e4c3c5b-33b3-4b8b-788f-091ec2c06cba
msgctxt "hd4c5af6bg0ce1g4788g9ea1g7d8aa3bafd48"
msgid "Never mind, don't tell me. I want to picture it for myself."
msgstr "됐어, 말하지 마. 직접 상상해 보고 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63137044-4e6d-4835-78c6-212c9c95b741
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 04fcd442-1f28-c7f8-e8e3-bcd8cc7620f9_NiceShot = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 04fcd442-1f28-c7f8-e8e3-bcd8cc7620f9_NiceShot = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle:63137044-4e6d-4835-78c6-212c9c95b741
msgctxt "haaa51005g9de2g486dga7f3gda9368ba4da7"
msgid "It was a nice shot, if nothing else."
msgstr "다른 건 몰라도, 잘 쏘기는 했군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 758e7ee2-aef0-8b19-7fce-0882e2175986
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_PlayerRescuedGoblin = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle:758e7ee2-aef0-8b19-7fce-0882e2175986
msgctxt "h7fcc971bgc22cg438cgb094g6f19d97f3500"
msgid "Let's hit the road, Memnos. I'm sick of this place."
msgstr "가자, 멤노스. 여긴 지긋지긋해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 7d59e1c7-3f29-2b2b-d833-ff67c0ffbae6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle:7d59e1c7-3f29-2b2b-d833-ff67c0ffbae6
msgctxt "hc6f545dbg14d4g44bdg8f4eg460eadafc726"
msgid "It won't be my last."
msgstr "그게 내 마지막은 아닐 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle
#. Speaker = Memnos
#. NodeID = 82a1e488-ff89-3be7-f60a-f790750ac819
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_FriendHasMet(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle:82a1e488-ff89-3be7-f60a-f790750ac819
msgctxt "h107f6586g75abg45bbg8c56g3d1c5921469a"
msgid "It was wrong."
msgstr "잘못된 행동이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = 8d34afab-9d04-a0ea-6bf8-c473ea7bfda6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_PCGotPostRescueFollowUp(2) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_PlayerRescuedGoblin = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle:8d34afab-9d04-a0ea-6bf8-c473ea7bfda6
msgctxt "h799a63d8g0138g45c3gbcd4gc4fa73b1b8df"
msgid ""
"I've had some time to think since we last talked. Can't say I'm enjoying it "
"much."
msgstr "마지막으로 얘기한 이후로 생각할 시간을 좀 가졌어. 별로 즐겁다고 할 수는 없네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = a69ce0fe-ed26-827e-a951-33836d6d4405
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_PlayerRescuedGoblin = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_Event_GuardsLeft = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle:a69ce0fe-ed26-827e-a951-33836d6d4405
msgctxt "h2ebe6dc7g838fg4836g8c6bg89de22af6083"
msgid "I need some time alone. Please."
msgstr "나는 혼자 있을 시간이 좀 필요해. 부탁이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = a81c5d51-b5c1-bbc5-89b3-4421f655ec01
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_Event_GuardsLeft = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle:a81c5d51-b5c1-bbc5-89b3-4421f655ec01
msgctxt "h56f65510gd75dg4895g97d2g85015c7116bf"
msgid "I should've died with them."
msgstr "걔들과 함께 죽었어야 했는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = cfe2a097-5944-43e3-d62a-3718a7613a87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle:cfe2a097-5944-43e3-d62a-3718a7613a87
msgctxt "hb698d1f8g7dbag4afbg837agd7750a158ff6"
msgid "It was justice. Or the start of it."
msgstr "정의였어. 그것의 시작이거나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = df94398f-cf0a-d095-880e-6274dc8f7539
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle:df94398f-cf0a-d095-880e-6274dc8f7539
msgctxt "h3c6cefa1gc9cag4181gb101g85db40c9b12c"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = e91d3c12-ab06-439f-136b-2aaabac0948d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle:e91d3c12-ab06-439f-136b-2aaabac0948d
msgctxt "h20d47319g57dbg46c0g8649gbd6a5dd29521"
msgid "This is my first kill."
msgstr "내 첫 살인이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = eaa3bc5f-cc02-980f-3bff-42163c7b501e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_PlayerDidExecutionFollowUp = False
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_PlayerWatchedGoblinExecution = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_PlayerDidExecutionFollowUp = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle:eaa3bc5f-cc02-980f-3bff-42163c7b501e
msgctxt "h9e90d851ga50fg46edg9fd5gbb1e1fabd9ea"
msgid "That goblin won't be the last."
msgstr "그 고블린이 마지막이 되지는 않을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle
#. Speaker = Arka
#. NodeID = f6e9b619-dafc-2545-ba4e-b404402dc3ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Refugees_State_LeadersAreDead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_GuardsIdle:f6e9b619-dafc-2545-ba4e-b404402dc3ea
msgctxt "h76b03a93g3676g4294g9711gf99e9f1c6f44"
msgid "Heard you killed the goblin king. Did he suffer?"
msgstr "고블린 왕을 죽였다고 들었는데. 고통스럽게 보내줬어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Freed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 99519dd1-bdd4-41ba-b9a3-fffb978cf6cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Freed:99519dd1-bdd4-41ba-b9a3-fffb978cf6cc
msgctxt "h9cef29afg2014g4e80g86b2g813246b68179"
msgid "I've turned goblins into corpses - but never into comrades."
msgstr "고블린을 시체로 만든 적은 많아도 - 동료로 만든 기억은 없는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Freed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 99519dd1-bdd4-41ba-b9a3-fffb978cf6cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Freed:99519dd1-bdd4-41ba-b9a3-fffb978cf6cc
msgctxt "h078f7d30gd3b5g4fb9g8228g236fa30168e6"
msgid "Horrible little thing. She'd better not forget this."
msgstr "작고 밥맛 떨어지는 것. 은혜를 잊지 않아야 할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Freed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 99519dd1-bdd4-41ba-b9a3-fffb978cf6cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Freed:99519dd1-bdd4-41ba-b9a3-fffb978cf6cc
msgctxt "h543d7d1bg830fg4ee0g9b94g9b6cc484e06f"
msgid "Freeing a goblin? Surely that's the tadpole, reworking my mind..."
msgstr "고블린을 풀어주겠다고? 올챙이가 내 정신을 뒤틀고 있는 게 분명하네..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Freed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 99519dd1-bdd4-41ba-b9a3-fffb978cf6cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Freed:99519dd1-bdd4-41ba-b9a3-fffb978cf6cc
msgctxt "he6429497g3314g4f54g857agad24620e0083"
msgid "The goblin could prove useful. If she causes problems, tear her open."
msgstr "고블린이 쓸모 있을지도 모르지. 문제를 일으킨다면, 찢어버리면 그만 이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Freed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 99519dd1-bdd4-41ba-b9a3-fffb978cf6cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Freed:99519dd1-bdd4-41ba-b9a3-fffb978cf6cc
msgctxt "h293032aegaab3g40d8g9f4bgad87f582df15"
msgid "Sazza's a feisty thing. Hope she's all right out there."
msgstr "삿자는 활발한 애니까. 저 밖에서도 괜찮았으면 좋겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Freed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 99519dd1-bdd4-41ba-b9a3-fffb978cf6cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Freed:99519dd1-bdd4-41ba-b9a3-fffb978cf6cc
msgctxt "h946c2fa0g0632g4ca0gad43g0f56f0cd3765"
msgid ""
"The goblin may yet prove her worth. Necessity has bred stranger bed fellows."
msgstr "고블린이 당장 도움이 될 지 확실하진 않지만. 필요하다면 의외의 대상과도 손 잡을 수 있는 거니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Freed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 99519dd1-bdd4-41ba-b9a3-fffb978cf6cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Freed:99519dd1-bdd4-41ba-b9a3-fffb978cf6cc
msgctxt "h1a4ce837ga2fcg4538g9b11g5301dd27e54f"
msgid "That goblin is in my debt - should prove useful one day."
msgstr "그 고블린은 나한테 빚을 졌거든 - 언젠가 쓸모 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Freed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c7f411f0-e478-456a-9b90-39c899ad0aa1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Freed:c7f411f0-e478-456a-9b90-39c899ad0aa1
msgctxt "he1234aadg26b0g477agbcf4g5172e4548c0f"
msgid "Ugh - I hope we don't end up regretting this."
msgstr "으 - 나중에 후회나 안 했으면 좋겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Freed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c7f411f0-e478-456a-9b90-39c899ad0aa1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Freed:c7f411f0-e478-456a-9b90-39c899ad0aa1
msgctxt "h5ed89eaeg2b1bg4ad7gab61g4b1c9dc177ea"
msgid "We have made an ally from an enemy. Quite judicious."
msgstr "적과 동맹을 맺었군. 꽤나 현명해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Freed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c7f411f0-e478-456a-9b90-39c899ad0aa1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Freed:c7f411f0-e478-456a-9b90-39c899ad0aa1
msgctxt "h5e25bc3eg198eg4a48g948eg0b5ca04a2f80"
msgid ""
"I just wish we could've made a deal with a wood nymph or - anything less "
"vile, really."
msgstr "차라리 우드 님프나 아님 조금 이라도 덜 역겨운 것 하고 거래를 했다면 좋았을 텐데 말이야, 진짜."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Freed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c7f411f0-e478-456a-9b90-39c899ad0aa1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Freed:c7f411f0-e478-456a-9b90-39c899ad0aa1
msgctxt "h2ef51438g7147g4075g8e46g12b5b873d69f"
msgid "I'm not in the habit of helping vermin. I expect it to return and bite."
msgstr "난 해충을 도울 생각은 없어. 분명 돌아와서는 우릴 물어버릴 거니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Freed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c7f411f0-e478-456a-9b90-39c899ad0aa1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Freed:c7f411f0-e478-456a-9b90-39c899ad0aa1
msgctxt "h86074902g7ea3g4e50ga485gb0d963fc215e"
msgid "I'm sure we won't regret this."
msgstr "분명 후회하지 않을 거라니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Freed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c7f411f0-e478-456a-9b90-39c899ad0aa1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Freed:c7f411f0-e478-456a-9b90-39c899ad0aa1
msgctxt "hf421648fg218ag458fg9490gfb63983da3fc"
msgid ""
"Far be it from me to second-guess your decisions, but I'm not entirely "
"convinced setting that scamp of a goblin free was the wisest of ideas."
msgstr "이미 내려진 결정을 의심하는 건 내 스타일이 아니지만, 그 보잘 것 없는 고블린을 풀어준 건 잘 한 일인지 모르겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Freed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c7f411f0-e478-456a-9b90-39c899ad0aa1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Freed:c7f411f0-e478-456a-9b90-39c899ad0aa1
msgctxt "h964b8baag621bg4981g8f5eg60405144e2f3"
msgid "Or it'll come back to haunt us."
msgstr "아님 반대로 문제가 되어서 돌아오겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Healer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 13980791-ff78-4263-806c-612c2fe98f24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Healer:13980791-ff78-4263-806c-612c2fe98f24
msgctxt "h01e650c0ge143g4223g86fag76f3c014d147"
msgid "A goblin healer? She couldn't possibly know a cure... could she?"
msgstr "고블린 치료사라고? 고블린이 치료법을 알고 있을 리가... 과연?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Healer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 13980791-ff78-4263-806c-612c2fe98f24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Healer:13980791-ff78-4263-806c-612c2fe98f24
msgctxt "h06d20451gc414g40feg9a0dg5879d1928209"
msgid ""
"I don't put much faith in goblins, but this priestess could know something?"
msgstr "고블린을 딱히 믿는 건 아니지만, 이 여사제가 뭔가를 알고 있을지도?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Healer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 13980791-ff78-4263-806c-612c2fe98f24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Healer:13980791-ff78-4263-806c-612c2fe98f24
msgctxt "h2b0fc49bg9ba5g445ag8c54gcaad227567ab"
msgid ""
"Goblins aren't exactly renowned healers, but we can't afford to ignore any "
"options."
msgstr "고블린이 딱히 유능한 치유사로 알려져 있진 않지만, 지금 상황에선 어떤 선택지도 무시할 순 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Healer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 13980791-ff78-4263-806c-612c2fe98f24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Healer:13980791-ff78-4263-806c-612c2fe98f24
msgctxt "hd8b0a9deg565cg4a02g8428g59bf2839ac06"
msgid ""
"I doubt this priestess would know about purification. Ignore the goblin's "
"ramblings."
msgstr "이 여사제가 정화에 대해 알 것이라 생각하지 않는다. 고블린의 헛소리 따윈 무시해라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Healer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 13980791-ff78-4263-806c-612c2fe98f24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Healer:13980791-ff78-4263-806c-612c2fe98f24
msgctxt "hc80606bcg3a4dg42ddg8110g60ea4d31dff1"
msgid ""
"To seek some goblin priestess' help would be unconventional to say the least."
msgstr "고블린 여사제에게 도움을 청하다니 흔히 들어 볼 수 있는 일은 아니지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Healer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 13980791-ff78-4263-806c-612c2fe98f24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Healer:13980791-ff78-4263-806c-612c2fe98f24
msgctxt "h47b19c38g5fe4g497dg817eg7a1c89462898"
msgid "A goblin priestess. Wonder if she could help with the tadpole."
msgstr "고블린 여사제라. 우리 올챙이 문제를 도와 줄 수 있을지 모르겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Healer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 13980791-ff78-4263-806c-612c2fe98f24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Healer:13980791-ff78-4263-806c-612c2fe98f24
msgctxt "hbb2294ffg54cbg4916ga530gd1fbc2054bd5"
msgid "The goblin knows nothing of the <i>ghaik. </i>This is a waste of time."
msgstr "고블린들이 <i>게이크</i>에 관하여 알 리가 없어. 이건 시간 낭비야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Healer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 13980791-ff78-4263-806c-612c2fe98f24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Healer:13980791-ff78-4263-806c-612c2fe98f24
msgctxt "h08ee2b90gbc2dg42ccgb31cg888ea09a850e"
msgid ""
"A goblin healer? That's a new one. But she might be the only way to keep our "
"skulls intact."
msgstr "고블린 치료사? 처음 들어보는데. 우리의 머리통을 보전 할 유일한 기회일 수 도 있겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Healer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f1b3c255-bedd-4f5b-80b2-b8fe27b7bb64
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Healer:f1b3c255-bedd-4f5b-80b2-b8fe27b7bb64
msgctxt "h34ca9da8g926cg4f4agbcddg97a4f35bbb6f"
msgid "Heh - I'm not about to enlist a goblin's help, thanks very much."
msgstr "헤 - 고맙지만, 고블린한테 도움을 청할 생각은 없거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Healer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f1b3c255-bedd-4f5b-80b2-b8fe27b7bb64
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Healer:f1b3c255-bedd-4f5b-80b2-b8fe27b7bb64
msgctxt "h00c6b807g95d4g4a85g9246gdca760298b9a"
msgid "Forget this goblin priestess. She will not know about purification."
msgstr "고블린 여사제 따위는 잊어버려라. 정화에 관해서 알고 있을 리가 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Healer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f1b3c255-bedd-4f5b-80b2-b8fe27b7bb64
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Healer:f1b3c255-bedd-4f5b-80b2-b8fe27b7bb64
msgctxt "h82be2cf6g6e9ag4845g8c38g6cd3ccb73857"
msgid "We are finding ourselves with some interesting bedfellows..."
msgstr "우리 굉장히 흥미로운 친구들과 얽히고 있는 거 같네..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Healer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f1b3c255-bedd-4f5b-80b2-b8fe27b7bb64
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Healer:f1b3c255-bedd-4f5b-80b2-b8fe27b7bb64
msgctxt "h34161d33g05ceg4e5bgbc23ga7ee8ce8a124"
msgid ""
"Perhaps this Gut creature stole something that could be useful. A scroll, a "
"potion, a cranial extractor."
msgstr "이 거트라는 놈이 뭔가 유용한 걸 훔쳤을지도 모르지. 두루마리나, 물약이나, 두개골 추출기 같은 거라던가 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Healer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f1b3c255-bedd-4f5b-80b2-b8fe27b7bb64
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Healer:f1b3c255-bedd-4f5b-80b2-b8fe27b7bb64
msgctxt "h4e3a0990g4f38g4d0bg9370g93214f499097"
msgid ""
"Let's give it a try. Haven't been to a goblin encampment in a long old time."
msgstr "한 번 해보지 뭐. 고블린 숙영지에 안 가본 지도 오래된 참이니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Healer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f1b3c255-bedd-4f5b-80b2-b8fe27b7bb64
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Healer:f1b3c255-bedd-4f5b-80b2-b8fe27b7bb64
msgctxt "h0439a9ebgc1d2g4aeag9990gf84d659c5517"
msgid ""
"If this priestess is indeed a master in the arts of booyahg, it's not "
"inconceivable she could be of help to us."
msgstr "이 여사제가 정말로 부야그 기술에 능숙하다면, 우리에게 도움이 될 수 있다는 것은 불가능한 일이 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Healer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f1b3c255-bedd-4f5b-80b2-b8fe27b7bb64
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Healer:f1b3c255-bedd-4f5b-80b2-b8fe27b7bb64
msgctxt "h99b2c151gef66g4ab4gba6agadcb2900a0b8"
msgid "She's worth talking to, at least."
msgstr "적어도 대화해볼 가치는 있겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Shot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e448d47-273e-4eea-a5de-ccc65650cd61
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Shot:2e448d47-273e-4eea-a5de-ccc65650cd61
msgctxt "h907d476ag627dg419bg840ega941ee529581"
msgid "Well, this makes one down. Only a few thousand more to go!"
msgstr "그래, 하나는 끝났어. 이제 몇천 마리만 더 처리하면 돼!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Shot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e448d47-273e-4eea-a5de-ccc65650cd61
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Shot:2e448d47-273e-4eea-a5de-ccc65650cd61
msgctxt "h5ea29d94g0c8bg43a0g9583g1a9f57cb5773"
msgid "If I've one regret, it's that I didn't fire the arrow myself."
msgstr "한 가지 아쉬운 게 있다면, 저 화살이 내가 직접 쏜 게 아니라는 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Shot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e448d47-273e-4eea-a5de-ccc65650cd61
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Shot:2e448d47-273e-4eea-a5de-ccc65650cd61
msgctxt "h26bde1d1g11dfg431fg9e78g841d0c5d5379"
msgid "The goblin was just put out of our misery, that's all."
msgstr "그 고블린은 우리의 고생거리 하나가 줄어든 것일 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Shot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e448d47-273e-4eea-a5de-ccc65650cd61
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Shot:2e448d47-273e-4eea-a5de-ccc65650cd61
msgctxt "h3e35242dgf0a1g410dgbc6dgd27cea67c561"
msgid ""
"Nobody will shed any tears for a dead goblin. The opposite, more likely. "
"Let's move on."
msgstr "고블린 따위가 죽었다고 눈물 흘릴 사람은 없겠지. 반대라면 모를까. 움직이자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Shot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e448d47-273e-4eea-a5de-ccc65650cd61
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Shot:2e448d47-273e-4eea-a5de-ccc65650cd61
msgctxt "he3e3213dg2b8ag40c1g918fg88d2cde5f6b6"
msgid ""
"I don't mind squaring off in battle, but shooting something in cage is a bit "
"cheap."
msgstr "전투에서 토막내는 건 문제 없지만, 갇혀있는 걸 쏴 죽이는 건 조금 치사하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Shot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e448d47-273e-4eea-a5de-ccc65650cd61
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Shot:2e448d47-273e-4eea-a5de-ccc65650cd61
msgctxt "h4ff37f41g3dd0g48aeg907cg92f483bceb2c"
msgid "No one will mourn this goblin, I suppose. Let's leave it at that."
msgstr "아무도 고블린을 애도해주진 않겠지. 이제 가자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Shot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e448d47-273e-4eea-a5de-ccc65650cd61
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Shot:2e448d47-273e-4eea-a5de-ccc65650cd61
msgctxt "h56758917g2945g4d74g8426gc09324f20d22"
msgid "Won't shed tears over a goblin, but still - not a pretty scene."
msgstr "고블린한테 슬퍼하진 않겠지만, 보기 썩 좋진 않군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Shot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ba3bb7dd-fe31-4f72-900c-8ebebe3e994b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Shot:ba3bb7dd-fe31-4f72-900c-8ebebe3e994b
msgctxt "h099991e1g9a78g4cdegb779g24244d6ecf03"
msgid "Nice - she saved us the work of killing that goblin ourselves."
msgstr "잘 됐군 - 그녀가 우리 대신 고블린을 죽이는 수고를 덜어줬군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Shot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ba3bb7dd-fe31-4f72-900c-8ebebe3e994b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Shot:ba3bb7dd-fe31-4f72-900c-8ebebe3e994b
msgctxt "h9253cd8fga392g4b69g8d50g1044511805d0"
msgid "I didn't take these refugees for killers. Maybe I've misjudged them."
msgstr "난 이 난민들을 살인자라고 생각하지 않았어. 내가 그들을 잘못 판단했을지도."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Shot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ba3bb7dd-fe31-4f72-900c-8ebebe3e994b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Shot:ba3bb7dd-fe31-4f72-900c-8ebebe3e994b
msgctxt "h6e138001g0bcfg4a14gb145gfdb1933144e2"
msgid "One pest among many, hardly to be missed."
msgstr "수많은 해충 중 한 마리였을 뿐. 빗맞히기도 어렵겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Shot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ba3bb7dd-fe31-4f72-900c-8ebebe3e994b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Shot:ba3bb7dd-fe31-4f72-900c-8ebebe3e994b
msgctxt "h38e4ec84g4f40g4eabg8c00gfbc37ff37f60"
msgid "Bit harsh, shooting a caged goblin."
msgstr "가둬진 고블린을 쏴 죽이다니, 좀 너무하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Shot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ba3bb7dd-fe31-4f72-900c-8ebebe3e994b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Shot:ba3bb7dd-fe31-4f72-900c-8ebebe3e994b
msgctxt "h0bd08b8bge405g4d5eg9dabg6cbeb1732a20"
msgid "Hardly a winning display of archery, but it did the job."
msgstr "뛰어난 사격 실력은 아니지만, 제 역할은 했네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Shot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ba3bb7dd-fe31-4f72-900c-8ebebe3e994b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Shot:ba3bb7dd-fe31-4f72-900c-8ebebe3e994b
msgctxt "h720a14f8g3b58g4978g9576g2f5b0179233a"
msgid ""
"All's well with the world one might argue. And yet there's something "
"unsettling about witnessing an execution - no?"
msgstr "잘 됐다고 말하는 사람이 있을지도 모르겠지만. 그래도 처형장면을 직접 보는 건 꽤나 불쾌하군 - 안그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Shot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ba3bb7dd-fe31-4f72-900c-8ebebe3e994b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_PAD_Shot:ba3bb7dd-fe31-4f72-900c-8ebebe3e994b
