msgid "Sloppily done. But I guess the goblin had it coming."
msgstr "잔혹하게 살해됐군. 고블린은 자업자득 이겠지만 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_CapturedGoblin_Transit
