msgid "Moo!"
msgstr "음머!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2416605c-1066-881a-a58b-41250c82dea0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove:2416605c-1066-881a-a58b-41250c82dea0
msgctxt "hf6a80094g20bcg4c7bg9ae1gbba50f8d847a"
msgid "Whatever your secret is, it's yours to keep."
msgstr "뭘 감춘 건지는 몰라도, 괜히 캘 필요는 없겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove
#. Speaker = Phasm
#. NodeID = 3770a8a3-822c-4239-72d0-9b7ac4602433
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove_State_Peaceful(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove:3770a8a3-822c-4239-72d0-9b7ac4602433
msgctxt "h56be0425g179eg4631g943eg1ed3ddcad293"
msgid ""
"Now - that's all I have to say besides - and I really mean this - <i>moo.</i>"
msgstr "자, 이제 더는 해줄 말 없어. 진심 이거 딱 하나만 빼고 말이지. <i>음머.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4f7f9a13-77d3-c863-54d2-bb53b3aaf9a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove:4f7f9a13-77d3-c863-54d2-bb53b3aaf9a9
msgctxt "h6c8a26dcgf8cdg465dga8c7g11115837165d"
msgid "Out with it, cow, or you're going to regret it."
msgstr "불어라, 소. 그러지 않으면 후회하게 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove
#. Speaker = Phasm
#. NodeID = 533609f0-f719-fd3e-8e99-93cb7016b985
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove_State_Peaceful(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove:533609f0-f719-fd3e-8e99-93cb7016b985
msgctxt "h3622325cgf3f2g4cdfga7b0g6d18f09c0a5b"
msgid ""
"A pitiful lie. Scurry along now, before something dreadful happens to you."
msgstr "거짓말이 허접하군. 이만 썩 꺼져버려. 끔찍한 일 닥치기 전에 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove
#. Speaker = Phasm
#. NodeID = 5d6dd9cd-e0e9-4f3e-bca2-7057d9795a0f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
