msgctxt "h5e9279bagbc18g4c11gbec1g49d23e648ba8"
msgid "Tee-hee."
msgstr "히히."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aa624191-7f89-4956-8612-62cc91cdd7fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove:aa624191-7f89-4956-8612-62cc91cdd7fa
msgctxt "he7ef6670gf069g4f3bg8222gefaa013a53b0"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove
#. Speaker = Phasm
#. NodeID = aafcda83-1b2e-40af-aea8-41b7cab2dbfa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove:aafcda83-1b2e-40af-aea8-41b7cab2dbfa
msgctxt "heb16889ageb9bg4c92g81ddgdf5827964475"
msgid "A druid or two, I suppose. But the novelty remains fresh."
msgstr "드루이드 중 한두 명 쯤 있었지. 그래도 겪을 때마다 기분이 신선해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove
#. Speaker = Phasm
#. NodeID = b4b2c4f4-d6fe-39f2-818b-b21a42548a21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove:b4b2c4f4-d6fe-39f2-818b-b21a42548a21
msgctxt "h51d619f9gc26fg4f59gbaccg10ac02e4662c"
msgid ""
"I'll tell you this much: I'm going to Baldur's Gate. With or without the "
"rest of these poor sods."
msgstr "이거 하나는 말해주마. 난 발더스 게이트에 갈 거다. 저 불쌍한 놈들이랑 같이든, 아니든 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b8e169ae-b31b-440d-a50e-2e0988763b88
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove_HasMet_SwA = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove:b8e169ae-b31b-440d-a50e-2e0988763b88
msgctxt "haf8db559g78a0g4c3dg9c38gfa71445e7752"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bd4108f5-41c0-4a36-84a1-8fd2e2327fc3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove:bd4108f5-41c0-4a36-84a1-8fd2e2327fc3
msgctxt "h05d91c30ga318g4e50gb8b0gcd03b65a0013"
msgid "Ugh. Hideous cow."
msgstr "으. 기분 나쁜 소군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove
#. Speaker = Phasm
#. NodeID = c0a5ec70-26f4-b66d-412c-fc86e32a3a70
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove_State_Peaceful(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove:c0a5ec70-26f4-b66d-412c-fc86e32a3a70
msgctxt "hd5530185g08ecg4948g9025g77be51743d38"
msgid "You don't want to know what <i>I'm</i> a devil for. Believe me."
msgstr "내가 <i>뭐</i>에 환장하는지 모르는 편이 나을걸. 진담이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c425078c-1778-652a-fe16-0c61c1e2405c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_DevilishOx_State_ArcanaCheckComplete(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_DevilishOx_State_ArcanaCheckComplete(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove:c425078c-1778-652a-fe16-0c61c1e2405c
msgctxt "h6fa37a88g2d53g46fagbb46g6574cb81fa08"
msgid "<i>The ox makes you uneasy. Try to discern why.</i>"
msgstr "<i>이 황소는 어딘가 꺼림칙하다. 이유를 알아 보자.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove
#. Speaker = Phasm
#. NodeID = ca00b420-e5d3-efbb-76f3-c55f83179c12
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove:ca00b420-e5d3-efbb-76f3-c55f83179c12
msgctxt "hff8af6f2g0094g4defg9f85g3421e543e5c2"
msgid ""
"I'm glad you think so. Otherwise, things might've gotten <i>very </i>messy."
msgstr "그리 여긴다니 다행이군. 안 그랬다면 일이 <i>아주</i> 지저분해졌을 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove
#. Speaker = Phasm
#. NodeID = d2fd6d93-d27f-4c60-838d-32e424b09b50
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove:d2fd6d93-d27f-4c60-838d-32e424b09b50
msgctxt "h2b351443g80b1g48ebg9026geb1a34bdd8d5"
msgid "*Hnr!*"
msgstr "*크흠!*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove
#. Speaker = Phasm
#. NodeID = df9e8759-5783-bef3-e865-b1a182016fd1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove:df9e8759-5783-bef3-e865-b1a182016fd1
msgctxt "h98879419g6b62g4e3fg800eg35b6dc720d2c"
msgid ""
"I suppose I did. Y-yes, I had quite a life in Elturel. Chewing cud. Pulling "
"carts. Et cetera."
msgstr "나름 그런 셈인가. 그... 그래. 엘투렐에서 꽤 괜찮게 살았어. 되새김질하고. 수레 끌고. 뭐 그렇게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e2bfb891-1c81-0b4c-f43d-97fc59a59a5f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove:e2bfb891-1c81-0b4c-f43d-97fc59a59a5f
msgctxt "h18805d18gceacg46ecg8b84gbea5c347a8a8"
msgid "Did you come from Elturel with the others?"
msgstr "여기 다른 사람들처럼 엘투렐에서 온 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e35dea08-56c9-1994-76b6-c2992ec40955
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove:e35dea08-56c9-1994-76b6-c2992ec40955
msgctxt "hbc0cbbacg3b02g4cfbga86bg6edf3e5ab8b6"
msgid "*Something's off. This creature isn't what it appears to be.*"
msgstr "*뭔가 이상합니다. 이 생물체는 그 겉보기와 다른 존재입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove
#. Speaker = Phasm
#. NodeID = e7a41113-7207-4560-b4ac-19e301151859
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove_HasMet_SwA = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove_HasMet_SwA = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove:e7a41113-7207-4560-b4ac-19e301151859
msgctxt "h6372e647g2109g4694ga2b0gf15b26842c0b"
msgid "Ah, you're addressing <i>me</i>. A humble ox. How... quaint."
msgstr "아, <i>내게</i> 말을 거는 건가? 한낱 황소한테. 거 참... 괴상하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e7ae000f-dfd9-7ffb-6319-c006137613b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove:e7ae000f-dfd9-7ffb-6319-c006137613b5
msgctxt "habdbfd8bg5c27g4fedg96c4gf7cca007318e"
msgid "There's more to you than meets the eye. Care to explain?"
msgstr "넌 겉으로 보이는 게 전부가 아닌 존재 같은데. 설명 좀 해주겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f1eb1ae8-5038-40f2-ad4c-bce673e3df7a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_MeetAtDruidsGrove:f1eb1ae8-5038-40f2-ad4c-bce673e3df7a
msgctxt "h9df47e71gd9fag4a01g81bdg53482df4831a"
msgid "Come on, old chap. I'm a devil for gossip."
msgstr "그러지 말고 말해 봐, 친구. 난 얘깃거리에 환장한다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_PAD_FirstInsight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c79ef788-ab88-4769-b672-eb341b5d6ad1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_PAD_FirstInsight:c79ef788-ab88-4769-b672-eb341b5d6ad1
msgctxt "h4ef98923g633dg47a9gb5ddg8d6fd6bd5a0c"
msgid "Did that cow just give me the side-eye? Is that... normal?"
msgstr "지금 저 황소, 날 흘겨보는 거야? 저거... 정상 맞아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_PAD_FirstInsight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c79ef788-ab88-4769-b672-eb341b5d6ad1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_PAD_FirstInsight:c79ef788-ab88-4769-b672-eb341b5d6ad1
msgctxt "h607e20e1gc489g414eg80f4g2453b075f7f1"
msgid "I'm not sure I care for the way that ox is looking at me..."
msgstr "저기 날 쳐다보는 황소 눈빛이 영 신경 쓰이는걸..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_PAD_FirstInsight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c79ef788-ab88-4769-b672-eb341b5d6ad1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_PAD_FirstInsight:c79ef788-ab88-4769-b672-eb341b5d6ad1
msgctxt "h079c290bged83g4c45ga550gbaa3722669e0"
msgid "Hm? That ox is staring right at me."
msgstr "흠? 저 황소가 날 뚫어져라 쳐다보는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_PAD_FirstInsight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c79ef788-ab88-4769-b672-eb341b5d6ad1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_PAD_FirstInsight:c79ef788-ab88-4769-b672-eb341b5d6ad1
msgctxt "hc4c595e9ge243g42d6gb31ege087df751733"
msgid "That ox seems a little too interested in me..."
msgstr "저 황소, 어째 나한테 너무 관심 있는 거 같은데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_PAD_FirstInsight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c79ef788-ab88-4769-b672-eb341b5d6ad1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_PAD_FirstInsight:c79ef788-ab88-4769-b672-eb341b5d6ad1
msgctxt "hdf477638ga395g4f7eg8514g58327c0c0375"
msgid "That ox - it can't keep its eyes off me."
msgstr "저 황소... 어째 날 계속 쳐다보고 있는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_PAD_FirstInsight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c79ef788-ab88-4769-b672-eb341b5d6ad1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_PAD_FirstInsight:c79ef788-ab88-4769-b672-eb341b5d6ad1
msgctxt "h5fc480dage05cg41f6g8d47g7f25803700b1"
msgid "That ox has a terrible aura."
msgstr "저 황소, 끔찍한 기운을 풍기는걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_PAD_FirstInsight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c79ef788-ab88-4769-b672-eb341b5d6ad1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DevilishOx_PAD_FirstInsight:c79ef788-ab88-4769-b672-eb341b5d6ad1
msgctxt "h93f02618ga9f6g49a4gbc7bg5b3d8188e4c6"
msgid "I'd swear that ox's gaze is following me."
msgstr "저 황소, 분명 날 쭉 쳐다보고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DruidAttack_AD_Apprentice
#. Speaker = Nettie
#. NodeID = 194e85ee-bdba-3a20-8d75-65af87b03e04
