msgctxt "hc67a9c19g2ee5g42bag872bg4778ba647c7e"
msgid "We're not scared. We can handle ourselves."
msgstr "전혀 무섭지가 않아요! 우리끼리 헤쳐나갈 수 있거든요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DruidAttack_AD_BardAndKidAfterAttack
