msgid "The druids have lost it. Find someplace safe!"
msgstr "드루이드들이 미쳐버렸어. 안전한 데 좀 찾아봐!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_DruidAttack_AD_Refugee004
