msgid "Could you move just a little bit? I need to use the elevator."
msgstr "조금만 움직여 줄래? 이 승강기를 이용해야 돼서."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_ElevatorBear
