msgid "<i>Carefully nudge the bear's flank.</i>"
msgstr "<i>조심스럽게 곰의 옆구리를 만진다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 02768fe9-be3a-7033-0521-4df01c30063d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FIGHTER(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper:02768fe9-be3a-7033-0521-4df01c30063d
msgctxt "h2b9a675dgeb0fg470dgaeefg1195e450359d"
msgid "You could hold off a <i>horde</i> of goblins from this position."
msgstr "이곳 배치라면 고블린이 <i>떼거리</i>로 몰려와도 막아낼 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Elegis
#. NodeID = 038e9540-594e-b31f-42e2-ccf040a67570
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper:038e9540-594e-b31f-42e2-ccf040a67570
msgctxt "hfa936a84gcca4g4e40ga22eg7f1fe937ed81"
msgid ""
"I'm guessing you have plenty of both - be nice if I could say the same for "
"myself."
msgstr "그쪽은 그 두 가지 다 통달한 모양이네. 나도 그렇다면 좋았을 텐데 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Elegis
#. NodeID = 11262dee-a992-1439-2fa0-1e098720fe21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper:11262dee-a992-1439-2fa0-1e098720fe21
msgctxt "h2ad77f58g2e0cg4854gbe85g2084670ac409"
msgid "I'm not really keen on fighting <i>or</i> praying."
msgstr "나는 싸움이든 기도든 어느 쪽도 소질이 없거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Elegis
#. NodeID = 12a8f582-c713-dee2-6d5c-112a2f32fa0e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_Resolved = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper:12a8f582-c713-dee2-6d5c-112a2f32fa0e
msgctxt "h74c1db16ge91cg4276ga6f9g08dbee959ef3"
msgid "I haven't seen a single goblin. That's good, isn't it?"
msgstr "고블린은 단 한 놈도 못 봤어. 좋은 신호겠지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Elegis
#. NodeID = 19c99658-3378-f4a1-9c75-4fe6c87c6633
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Refugees_State_LeadersAreDead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper:19c99658-3378-f4a1-9c75-4fe6c87c6633
msgctxt "h2a56bc49g899bg4ad6gb3c8ga4c702e2d242"
msgid "It was you, wasn't it? You saved us. Thank you."
msgstr "그쪽이 도운 거지? 당신이 우릴 살렸어. 고마워."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Elegis
#. NodeID = 1af06dd8-5c9a-2576-ce58-64f57534acca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_CampGeneral_HasMet_Gatekeeper(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CampGeneral_HasMet_Gatekeeper(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper:1af06dd8-5c9a-2576-ce58-64f57534acca
msgctxt "hbe2a367fg1e57g4c8eg8bd3g4b7928829b29"
msgid "Glad you made it inside... doubt we'll be safe here for long though."
msgstr "그쪽이 무사히 들어와 다행이네... 여기도 언제까지 안전할지 의문인 판이지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 23adffa8-190a-4522-1861-76a293fbbea4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper:23adffa8-190a-4522-1861-76a293fbbea4
msgctxt "h0c90e794g9cb1g4b9dgb2f7g28b81e5b61ae"
msgid "If a few goblins scare you, you don't deserve to survive."
msgstr "겨우 고블린 몇 놈 따위가 겁난다면, 넌 살아있을 가치도 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 344beedf-0d11-3eec-e407-6eda4166ec88
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(7) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper:344beedf-0d11-3eec-e407-6eda4166ec88
msgctxt "had637d64g10aeg40d0ga638gea20f2837c32"
msgid "Don't worry too much. A handful of powerful spells go a long way."
msgstr "너무 걱정하지 마. 강력한 주문 몇 방이면 그 상황은 싹 바뀔 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Elegis
#. NodeID = 3572fcaa-3265-afb5-77fc-721166448fc7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper:3572fcaa-3265-afb5-77fc-721166448fc7
msgctxt "h1659ff52gbc72g41f8gafd5g6f6627e2ef2a"
msgid "A <i>few</i> goblins? Felt like a lot more to me."
msgstr "<i>겨우</i> 고블린 몇 놈? 그보단 훨씬 많은 듯한데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 408bd02e-26e6-19ec-b808-7fc05d6f02bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(6) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper:408bd02e-26e6-19ec-b808-7fc05d6f02bc
msgctxt "h66a313cegc0f0g4809g9fb2gdff22db295d2"
msgid ""
"'Digging their graves'? Why not pass out daggers to stick themselves with, "
"while you're at it?"
msgstr "'무덤이나 파놓든가 해'? 차라리 아예 자살하라고 단검이나 던져주지 그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4ca8ffe5-03c5-15dc-922c-0f67e3dc0f45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper:4ca8ffe5-03c5-15dc-922c-0f67e3dc0f45
msgctxt "h7a73a9cbged53g4a8cg9906gbb9eb186b9ec"
msgid "You could try praying."
msgstr "뭐하면 기도라도 하지그래."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Elegis
#. NodeID = 5e09f2db-8d7e-52e4-12a4-a09e2b6f7eb0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper:5e09f2db-8d7e-52e4-12a4-a09e2b6f7eb0
msgctxt "ha9dac456g650dg48e2g94e5g6c42f607a721"
msgid ""
"We need an army, not a hunter. There could be hundreds of them out there."
msgstr "우린 사냥꾼이 아니라, 군대가 필요해. 놈들이 저 밖에 수백은 있을지도 모른다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Elegis
#. NodeID = 5e46ad07-e949-2333-1e1c-d1728dd62e3c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper:5e46ad07-e949-2333-1e1c-d1728dd62e3c
msgctxt "hbb455794g3437g45beg8f18g896f2108678e"
msgid ""
"Maybe - but we're not fighters. If they broke through, it'd be a massacre."
msgstr "그럴지도. 하지만 우린 전사가 아니야. 놈들이 여길 뚫기라도 하면, 학살이 벌어질 거라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5f5df02d-122e-bdc4-57ae-6f1f74b050b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper:5f5df02d-122e-bdc4-57ae-6f1f74b050b9
msgctxt "h3a707d88gf1b2g4be8g9715g50af1555a9eb"
msgid "You're scared of a few goblins? Pathetic."
msgstr "겨우 고블린 몇 놈한테 겁먹은 거야? 한심하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6a6731bd-3562-ad10-2901-a9f8fcc2a5c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper:6a6731bd-3562-ad10-2901-a9f8fcc2a5c8
msgctxt "h710a8899g27dcg4c00gbaf9g4084a4a12a4a"
msgid "Tactics are more important than training."
msgstr "훈련도보다는 전술이 더 중요하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 6c85a26d-bd92-15f3-424f-ddab136d1bfa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(5) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper:6c85a26d-bd92-15f3-424f-ddab136d1bfa
msgctxt "hb6e4f11egbfe1g4eedgb8b3gd0ad4de2ad42"
msgid ""
"Hundreds? Urgh, it'll take <i>hours</i> to kill them all. She's right, we "
"should just go."
msgstr "수백이라? 윽, 죄다 죽이려면 <i>수 시간</i>은 날려먹겠네. 쟤 말이 맞아. 우린 그냥 가자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 755bf5d6-05a2-9e96-144c-1a28b5dd874c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(6) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper:755bf5d6-05a2-9e96-144c-1a28b5dd874c
msgctxt "h203655f3g4f6bg4e30g936cg9d9f98308df9"
msgid ""
"I've carved up goblins from here to inner Chult. We will overcome, whatever "
"the odds."
msgstr "난 여기서부터 촐트 안쪽에까지 놈들을 박살 낸 몸이야. 그 어떤 역경이 닥치든 우린 이겨낼 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 895526ee-99e7-f853-d2de-5e294bbf4cb5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper:895526ee-99e7-f853-d2de-5e294bbf4cb5
msgctxt "haf73f0b6gd57ag47f5g9e61gdc49a789c46e"
msgid "I've torn demons apart with my bare hands. Goblins won't be a problem."
msgstr "난 맨손으로 악마를 찢어버린 적도 있어. 고블린 따위야 아무것도 아니지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Elegis
#. NodeID = 8e545abe-e611-1e12-431b-ea3a153928be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper:8e545abe-e611-1e12-431b-ea3a153928be
msgctxt "h573e20efg673fg490cga8f6g2d09c192202e"
msgid ""
"You think? That's something at least. We're not trained fighters though..."
msgstr "그래? 불행 중 다행이네. 하지만 우린 훈련받은 전사가 아닌걸..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Elegis
#. NodeID = 8f6f5b40-606b-16f8-1701-77cecb5585fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_CampGeneral_Gatekeeper_PCPissedHerOff(1) = True
#.      - DEN_CampGeneral_HasMet_Gatekeeper(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper:8f6f5b40-606b-16f8-1701-77cecb5585fa
msgctxt "h6c2714e9g5f09g4175ga848g01f94c2b263d"
msgid "Still here? Thought you'd have abandoned us by now."
msgstr "아직 있었어? 우릴 버려두고 떠난 줄 알았는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 920e5812-a615-d826-2124-66886f11d680
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper:920e5812-a615-d826-2124-66886f11d680
msgctxt "hb22baa2dg9541g4d7ag969agfbfa3e7b58d8"
msgid ""
"There could be <i>thousands</i>. But they'd lose their nerve if we found the "
"right weak spot."
msgstr "수천일 수도 있지. 하지만 허만 제대로 찔러버리면 오합지졸로 전락할 것들이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Elegis
#. NodeID = 9c3877cc-fe40-5cdf-9ec2-37425dfbac47
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CampGeneral_Gatekeeper_PCPissedHerOff(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper:9c3877cc-fe40-5cdf-9ec2-37425dfbac47
msgctxt "h8df34ccbgd976g4fe2ga471gd14c7c45cea6"
msgid "So, yes. I'm scared. And I'm not ashamed of that."
msgstr "그래, 맞아. 난 겁먹었어. 그게 딱히 부끄럽지도 않고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Elegis
#. NodeID = 9d3a45e9-e9cb-993d-86c5-c0f5a4ca26a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(6) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper:9d3a45e9-e9cb-993d-86c5-c0f5a4ca26a4
msgctxt "h6de0932eg422fg4ff4g893agf6306bd9a1f3"
msgid "Cold bastard."
msgstr "냉혈한 새끼."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9f2105a2-1f77-9796-b863-96ea13eb3282
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper:9f2105a2-1f77-9796-b863-96ea13eb3282
msgctxt "h85f6d100g8b59g4183g8927g47ccb5e42764"
msgid "Why not take your chances on the road?"
msgstr "그럼 차라리 여길 떠나지그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a39a8dc1-cc1e-cb1a-b99d-9ecd32744081
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper:a39a8dc1-cc1e-cb1a-b99d-9ecd32744081
msgctxt "hba1db855g35fdg4115g917dge0a92b48e201"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Elegis
#. NodeID = a5b71e83-3975-725d-22cd-16676dcf0aaf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_CampGeneral_HasMet_Gatekeeper(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper:a5b71e83-3975-725d-22cd-16676dcf0aaf
msgctxt "h3364ff4egaa62g462egbb8bgab1989fbfc43"
msgid ""
"If I see a goblin, I'm closing this gate - whether you're inside or not."
msgstr "고블린이 보이면, 이 관문을 닫을 거야. 그쪽이 안에 있든 없든 상관없이."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Elegis
#. NodeID = afed4ce6-d2bf-d961-f24b-8f6a10d53140
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper:afed4ce6-d2bf-d961-f24b-8f6a10d53140
msgctxt "hfdea8a50g0f6eg4a59g8557gf043399d0824"
msgid ""
"If the road was clear? A tenday's walk, maybe. But while the goblins are out "
"there, it might as well be the other side of the world."
msgstr "길이 안전했다면? 한 열흘 거리 정도지. 하지만 고블린 놈들이 나도는 통에, 세상 반대편에 있는 거나 마찬가지라 볼 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b371dfbf-a8bb-b09d-93c7-a7254db487f9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_CampGeneral_Gatekeeper_PCPissedHerOff(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper:b371dfbf-a8bb-b09d-93c7-a7254db487f9
msgctxt "h96939207g12d6g4e31ga8e9gabc481dc9bf6"
msgid "Best get to digging your own graves then."
msgstr "정 그럼 미리 무덤이나 파놓든가 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = b9e0872b-46bb-f750-e9fb-9edf61461a5d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper:b9e0872b-46bb-f750-e9fb-9edf61461a5d
msgctxt "ha4b15585ge194g4f1agaef0g2f5b1f0b0600"
msgid "I will soon be <i>kith'rak</i>. I <i>am</i> an army."
msgstr "난 곧 <i>키스락</i>이 될 몸이다. 내가 <i>바로</i> 군대야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c46beed5-cc74-732f-fc3f-91525cf8b4a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper:c46beed5-cc74-732f-fc3f-91525cf8b4a6
msgctxt "hc357b4a0g8598g4095g915agd1b50dbd662a"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Elegis
#. NodeID = c6f20781-02d9-3c56-38d3-ad89b41eaecc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper:c6f20781-02d9-3c56-38d3-ad89b41eaecc
msgctxt "hfb001b15ge078g446fgaf92ga3bb9818c4ed"
msgid "The sooner we leave for Baldur's Gate, the better."
msgstr "하루라도 빨리 발더스 게이트로 떠나야 좋은 판이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cdda8fdc-92e3-fc26-0f3f-87e872c27ea2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FIGHTER(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper:cdda8fdc-92e3-fc26-0f3f-87e872c27ea2
msgctxt "hfbf8bb15g9908g468ag95b6gfa215be8cf35"
msgid "Let them come. This position favours the defender."
msgstr "올 테면 와보라지. 여긴 배치상 방어측이 유리하다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Elegis
#. NodeID = df11a11b-382a-23e2-8127-710be8b30be8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper:df11a11b-382a-23e2-8127-710be8b30be8
msgctxt "h329a78a9g45e1g41e3g846ag7be3a84d7835"
msgid ""
"We might have to. But I'd feel better if we at least knew how many are out "
"there."
msgstr "그리될지도 몰라. 하지만 그 전에 놈들 규모부터 파악되면 기분이 좀 나을 텐데 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e1367c36-85ed-83ac-62b6-f2b76cbca467
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - RANGER(1) = True
#. TagRule: RANGER
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper:e1367c36-85ed-83ac-62b6-f2b76cbca467
msgctxt "hb1e80f3egcd52g4134gac95ga5f77220ddb7"
msgid "Goblins aren't hunters - they're prey. I'll kill every last one."
msgstr "고블린은 사냥꾼이 아니야. 사냥감이지. 내가 모조리 해치워주겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ee9e7c54-9352-fb97-2fc1-cd86e3e8629b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper:ee9e7c54-9352-fb97-2fc1-cd86e3e8629b
msgctxt "h2f2ac8acgeebbg40f6g8c7fgc593f7731e3b"
msgid "How far are we from the city?"
msgstr "여긴 도시에서 얼마나 먼 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Elegis
#. NodeID = f5f2a3ef-c05b-612a-1f34-19b4a8688863
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper:f5f2a3ef-c05b-612a-1f34-19b4a8688863
msgctxt "h976e394fge87dg4614g95b6g94ace7defe36"
msgid "There'll be more coming. Goblins hunt in packs."
msgstr "더 많은 놈들이 올 거야. 고블린은 무리 지어 사냥하니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper
#. Speaker = Elegis
#. NodeID = ff47fdc2-3b65-b96c-6c6c-7be1fd9693d1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_Gatekeeper:ff47fdc2-3b65-b96c-6c6c-7be1fd9693d1
msgctxt "hec707d65gfefag40cfg90d5g46712f265244"
msgid ""
"It'd be even <i>nicer</i> if we were on the road to Baldur's Gate already."
msgstr "진즉에 발더스 게이트로 떴다면 <i>더 좋았을</i> 테고 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 07a9bbfd-7425-2364-8416-e0d0dc69ed46
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:07a9bbfd-7425-2364-8416-e0d0dc69ed46
msgctxt "h7278f4b0g1d78g4c02ga8d3gb3325a707546"
msgid "Embrace the dark, and Shar will help you to forget your sufferings."
msgstr "어둠을 받아들여라. 그러면 샤께서 고통을 잊도록 도와주실 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 1c30d883-818b-a26b-de3e-cc22cf78036f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:1c30d883-818b-a26b-de3e-cc22cf78036f
msgctxt "hf3be427agff0cg455fga23ag6372abb546c0"
msgid "*Your heart lightens as you finish the song.*"
msgstr "*노래를 마치자 마음이 가벼워집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1c67136a-fe3b-5e3c-095f-028a5353e168
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:1c67136a-fe3b-5e3c-095f-028a5353e168
msgctxt "h01237589gd03bg4030g9886g1d5580747704"
msgid ""
"<i>Push deeper into your head, where are these thoughts coming from?</i>"
msgstr "<i>더욱 집중한다. 이 기억들은 어디서 오는걸까?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1ea37d1b-1751-f9e1-23ff-c9be77853510
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_BESTIAL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:1ea37d1b-1751-f9e1-23ff-c9be77853510
msgctxt "hd6f62d55g8d6fg4505ga9d4g50333f04759f"
msgid "<i>Close your eyes and open your senses.</i>"
msgstr "<i>눈을 감고 느껴지는 감각에 집중한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1efe0518-a74c-c859-c3e9-f24eab94ba35
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:1efe0518-a74c-c859-c3e9-f24eab94ba35
msgctxt "hed8b6328ga088g4224gbc2egd2aab15707b4"
msgid ""
"'O sing a song of Elturel, and when the night does fall,\n"
"Sleep safe beneath Companion's light, until the dawn does call.'"
msgstr ""
"'오, 엘투렐의 노래를 부르자, 그리고 밤이 찾아오면,\n"
"먼 동이 틀 때까지, 동료의 빛 아래서 안전히 잠들자.'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 241d7a9d-8761-3304-c2bd-87003233249d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:241d7a9d-8761-3304-c2bd-87003233249d
msgctxt "ha249048dg6626g4111gb9f5g65be1071395a"
msgid "*A sense of calm settles in your heart.*"
msgstr "*당신의 마음이 차분히 가라앉습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26ac44b6-8cf4-e9b6-68a8-4db1666c8761
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_MYRKUL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:26ac44b6-8cf4-e9b6-68a8-4db1666c8761
msgctxt "he3561f7fg97aag4857gbb90g64bc67ab5891"
msgid ""
"'From lowest ditch to highest thrones\n"
"All those that live are naught but bones.'"
msgstr ""
"'가장 낮은 도랑에서 가장 높은 왕좌까지\n"
"살아있는 모든 것은 뼈다귀에 불과하다.'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 26ad40fb-ec9a-98d4-820e-c45015cf5efd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:26ad40fb-ec9a-98d4-820e-c45015cf5efd
msgctxt "h53e1a4dbg1806g46d3g81deg45e49ef228b4"
msgid ""
"*A soothing chill runs through you. A soft breeze seems to whisper Myrkul's "
"approval.*"
msgstr "*차분한 한기가 온몸을 타고 흐릅니다. 부드러운 바람이 머큘의 승인을 속삭이는 듯합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 270963ee-995f-b802-eac8-220e18cf326c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_PLANAR(1) = True
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:270963ee-995f-b802-eac8-220e18cf326c
msgctxt "h35cc7aefg2aa8g4ebbg89e7g84238f46cf74"
msgid "This is how they honour their dead? Interesting."
msgstr "이렇게 죽은 자를 기리는 건가? 흥미롭군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 40b0dce2-c154-41de-7351-2145d2941832
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:40b0dce2-c154-41de-7351-2145d2941832
msgctxt "h90a835cdg4b20g4e52ga904g3f138dbdbf49"
msgid "A monument to the dead? Such a maudlin tradition."
msgstr "죽은 자를 위한 기념비? 꽤 우울한 전통이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4252cf46-7f3e-7ebd-8d93-1bdd602f42ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:4252cf46-7f3e-7ebd-8d93-1bdd602f42ed
msgctxt "h1980fd06g301cg44c5gae0cga3dbb3a4429d"
msgid ""
"Covered in dirt, to be devoured by worms. A fitting end for a failed warrior."
msgstr "진흙에 뒤덮이고 벌레에게 파먹히다니. 실패한 전사에게 딱 맞는 최후군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4d2430c3-b239-7c4b-1058-d76090ebbd32
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:4d2430c3-b239-7c4b-1058-d76090ebbd32
msgctxt "hdb8a2bdeg80f9g4e0dg9603g630622750c89"
msgid "<i>Ignore the flashes of bodies which have come before.</i>"
msgstr "<i>눈앞에 떠오르는 시체의 기억을 무시한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4dfc657d-9b78-fade-3620-d4cffe9531ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:4dfc657d-9b78-fade-3620-d4cffe9531ce
msgctxt "hc5d776ccg3065g42cagb8eegf7b17483866e"
msgid ""
"*Your fingers claw at the dirt, losing purchase. If only you had a tool for "
"this.*"
msgstr "*손가락으로 흙을 긁어내 보지만, 역부족입니다. 적절한 도구가 있다면 좋겠습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 52ab4129-dff8-df5e-1d72-81115ed0977e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Shovel_State_HasShovel(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:52ab4129-dff8-df5e-1d72-81115ed0977e
msgctxt "h6827099eg1dc5g46c4g993egbab6ccc558d5"
msgid "<i>Look around cautiously, then dig with your hands. </i>"
msgstr "<i>주위를 조심스레 둘러본 후에 손으로 흙을 파기 시작한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 636c3859-5897-ba60-4e8b-330283dda887
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:636c3859-5897-ba60-4e8b-330283dda887
msgctxt "hefeb36c0gfd12g447fga8a5g4c16e4c86858"
msgid ""
"*You take comfort in your promise. You cannot raise the dead - but you can "
"aid the living.*"
msgstr "*당신은 자신 있게 약속합니다. 당신은 죽은 자를 살릴 순 없지만 산 자를 도울 순 있습니다.\""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 638b2f77-800a-7fba-b7dc-2ded2729f1f4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_KELEMVOR(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:638b2f77-800a-7fba-b7dc-2ded2729f1f4
msgctxt "h88c3ea6bg9bbcg4a81gae6bg2d0b0c1cf62f"
msgid ""
"Death is not a punishment, but just another path. In Kelemvor's name, I "
"honour your passing."
msgstr "죽음은 처벌이 아닌 그저 다른 길일 뿐이야. 켈렘보르의 이름으로 너의 죽음을 기리지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6454dba5-5dfe-6f47-2cf9-52870dab7e5e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:6454dba5-5dfe-6f47-2cf9-52870dab7e5e
msgctxt "h9217f289gad66g4c1cg91feg0a05df41deb3"
msgid ""
"*To be adored, to be found beautiful <i>one last time</i> is more than most "
"corpses could ever dream.*"
msgstr "*<i>인생 마지막으로</i> 아름다운 모습으로, 사랑받는 것은 웬만한 시체는 꿈도 꾸지 못할 일입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6ca87bf3-9868-f05d-f4bd-9d971f0f3c94
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_KELEMVOR(1) = False
#. TagRule: CLERIC_GOOD or CLERIC_NEUTRAL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:6ca87bf3-9868-f05d-f4bd-9d971f0f3c94
msgctxt "hc8cc1907g3e30g4976gadf4g9aff4bdf1cfb"
msgid "May you rest with your god, in peace."
msgstr "그대의 신 곁에서 편히 쉬기를."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 70e077ce-43b1-3fc8-eeac-425e5e81d9b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:70e077ce-43b1-3fc8-eeac-425e5e81d9b7
msgctxt "h282672begf9ebg4913ga84dg6518106e0a40"
msgid ""
"*Though your ministry is late, you sense Kelemvor's approval of your prayer.*"
msgstr "*비록 당신의 사역은 늦었지만, 켈렘보르가 당신의 기도를 받아들임을 느낍니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 7971f522-edb1-b328-86a0-71750a07e09f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:7971f522-edb1-b328-86a0-71750a07e09f
msgctxt "h9caa2362gb39bg48f7g9699g2a3bedc8a6b3"
msgid ""
"*You can remember only the mangled orgy of dead flesh you've dug up, but not "
"a single name or face.*"
msgstr "*당신이 파낸 시체가 짓이겨진 난장판만 기억날 뿐, 이름이나 얼굴은 하나도 기억나지 않습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7e7f7195-b4cb-429f-c530-96f205c79539
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:7e7f7195-b4cb-429f-c530-96f205c79539
msgctxt "h68555c01g6538g4ab7gb33dgf7f75094393f"
msgid "<i>They should be grateful to be exhumed by one with such skill.</i>"
msgstr "<i>이 시체들은 나 같은 숙련자한테 파내어지는 걸 고맙게 여겨야 해.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 815ff4fb-2a86-73e1-182f-ab023be279a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:815ff4fb-2a86-73e1-182f-ab023be279a4
msgctxt "hbd575a29g02e4g487fgb5e2g7db60b7fe5be"
msgid ""
"*This burial custom is strange, but you are beginning to make sense of it.*"
msgstr "*이 매장 관습은 이상하지만, 당신은 이해하기 시작했습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 82902de4-884d-1d82-6edb-e2b8c9a53783
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:82902de4-884d-1d82-6edb-e2b8c9a53783
msgctxt "he0dd16a7g08fbg4ffbg9ed3g14ee225e5f6c"
msgid ""
"*You close your eyes, imagining what Shar's final blessing will feel like "
"when your time comes.*"
msgstr "*당신은 눈을 감고 삶의 마지막 순간에 샤의 축복이 어떻게 느껴질지 상상해봅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 84cf6cc3-cb6a-0043-d424-1c0a914c33f1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:84cf6cc3-cb6a-0043-d424-1c0a914c33f1
msgctxt "hd4591856gfd84g4e8ag8edeg7b56a33c589b"
msgid ""
"*Your mind wanders to the Astral Plane. Immortality awaits, if - or rather, "
"<i>when</i> - you gain Vlaakith's favour.*"
msgstr "*당신의 정신은 아스트랄 차원을 누빕니다. 블라키스의 총애를 얻을 수만 있다면, 불멸자가 될 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9435e507-96d9-918d-af1d-f33de1c01b0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:9435e507-96d9-918d-af1d-f33de1c01b0a
msgctxt "hdb0a29cagd957g4447g8d27g8bb89887c4d1"
msgid "I swear, I will protect those who remain here, whatever the cost."
msgstr "무슨 일이 있어도 여기 남은 이들을 지키겠다고 맹세하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9ec70292-d8da-f930-7aa4-e02c2e41e4dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:9ec70292-d8da-f930-7aa4-e02c2e41e4dc
msgctxt "h3158cecdg0b7fg42b1ga0c7g13e4ee3e3e9c"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a009f840-b20f-6be1-74a7-3b6d4cd664f1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:a009f840-b20f-6be1-74a7-3b6d4cd664f1
msgctxt "h3fbcf93agb83fg419egb7d3g8a2eef20f3e6"
msgid "*There will be many more to come.*"
msgstr "*더 많은 시체가 생겨날 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = aad86731-3f3b-25ad-e523-9a2305201da2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:aad86731-3f3b-25ad-e523-9a2305201da2
msgctxt "h09145836g1ce9g44e6gaa6egda657e893ab8"
msgid ""
"*You catch the scent of blood mixed with urine. This person died in pain. "
"They died <i>afraid</i>.*"
msgstr "*당신은 소변이 섞인 피 냄새를 맡습니다. 이 자는 고통스럽게 죽었습니다. <i>벌벌 떨면서</i> 말이죠.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = aaf09383-d0c0-9768-275c-9504780ce1d4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:aaf09383-d0c0-9768-275c-9504780ce1d4
msgctxt "h79cdd814gbd31g4b5bg882fgf522a3fd2db7"
msgid "*Or maybe... well, <i>only </i>if you find nothing tastier.*"
msgstr "*아니면... 뭐,<i>정말</i> 먹을 게 없다면 먹겠지요.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ad3cd976-0c19-4d17-115d-aab39ac24aa2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_MYRKUL(1) = False
#.      - CLERIC_EVIL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:ad3cd976-0c19-4d17-115d-aab39ac24aa2
msgctxt "h0213aa13g2e81g44dcg8344gb8e76754ad8b"
msgid ""
"You failed your people. I pray you serve better in the next life than in "
"this one."
msgstr "넌 네 사람들을 실망 시켰어. 다음 생에서 더 잘 할 수 있기를 빌지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = af51cf73-e1cc-931c-18bb-03c3736ba9cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:af51cf73-e1cc-931c-18bb-03c3736ba9cd
msgctxt "h08be459dg8317g48e8g96dag8c89fa2d5389"
msgid ""
"*Freshly turned soil shifts beneath your feet as you approach the grave.*"
msgstr "*무덤에 다가서자 발 밑에서 갓 파낸 흙이 흩어집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b9719e83-a1a3-1a46-c11a-bf5d1a68a67d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:b9719e83-a1a3-1a46-c11a-bf5d1a68a67d
msgctxt "ha06748dcgd104g41d7g8895g44bb16ee66d2"
msgid "*You close your eyes, finding a moment of peace.*"
msgstr "*당신은 눈을 감고 잠깐의 평온을 찾습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bb16645f-8636-1118-62d0-bba872f5ea83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC(1) = False
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:bb16645f-8636-1118-62d0-bba872f5ea83
msgctxt "h2358f45cg46c9g4fdfg93e2ga00b2b391bc0"
msgid "<i>Bow your head and silently pay your respects.</i>"
msgstr "<i>고개를 숙이고 조용히 경의를 표한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ca64e46c-6cd6-a694-a00d-0f6198eba0e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:ca64e46c-6cd6-a694-a00d-0f6198eba0e2
msgctxt "h8b037780g53bdg4706ga1cfgb8ebbca2c29a"
msgid "Ugh. Already rotting. I prefer my meat fresh."
msgstr "으. 벌써 부패하고 있잖아. 난 신선한 고기가 좋아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d9b58afe-d223-fbbc-f243-a3260b28232a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:d9b58afe-d223-fbbc-f243-a3260b28232a
msgctxt "hfe82f355g1a07g40ebg9162g60d2284e2fe9"
msgid ""
"*The shovel in turned soil feels oddly familiar. Within your sick heart you "
"know: in gravedigging, you have had quite the body count.*"
msgstr "*흙 속에 파묻힌 삽에서 기이한 친근함을 느낍니다. 병든 마음 한켠에서, 당신이 수많은 시체를 파내었던 것을 깨닫습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = deed509d-6f9a-84c9-9d25-8f552244293c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:deed509d-6f9a-84c9-9d25-8f552244293c
msgctxt "hc74ae3a2ge048g4a01ga969g80d7d901f40a"
msgid "I hope death is more peaceful for you than life..."
msgstr "너의 죽음이 삶보다 평안하길 빌게..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f1b27eaa-4157-3fe7-c9e3-9c61db8598c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:f1b27eaa-4157-3fe7-c9e3-9c61db8598c8
msgctxt "ha08e3a75g797ag4ef7g8c69g03fafaec4a7f"
msgid ""
"*Until you are free of Zariel, death will only ever be a return to the "
"horrors of Avernus.*"
msgstr "*자리엘로부터 해방되지 않는 한, 죽음은 그저 공포스러운 아베르누스로의 귀환일 것입니다.\""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ff059b4d-3968-437b-9edf-d9ac6827be91
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Shovel_State_HasShovel(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - DEN_General_State_GraveExhumed(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_General_GraveDig:ff059b4d-3968-437b-9edf-d9ac6827be91
msgctxt "h4a81f18cge694g45d9g90feg3f0cf9f2ad72"
msgid "<i>Look around cautiously, then begin to dig.</i>"
msgstr "<i>주위를 조심스레 둘러본 후에 삽으로 흙을 파기 시작한다.</i>"

