msgctxt "hd95a63f7g3144g4fe4ga1d8gc04767eb3492"
msgid "By sickle and sword, strike them down!"
msgstr "낫과 검으로 놈들을 꿰찌르자!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_AD_WyllCharge
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = e4bf714b-23ad-12f7-67f2-10cd122374d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - e0b6dfeb-2923-e0ad-1dc5-2a5d1e055e16_local1 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_AD_WyllCharge:e4bf714b-23ad-12f7-67f2-10cd122374d3
msgctxt "hb9303dd3g17b6g4a25gbed3g3b514ab690f3"
msgid "Don't falter now. Blades high, arrows nocked!"
msgstr "흔들리지들 마. 검을 치켜 들고, 화살을 걸어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_AD_WyllWantsOut
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = ffd5bb4a-3ca1-10e6-f633-dc4bf2d7e162
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_AD_WyllWantsOut:ffd5bb4a-3ca1-10e6-f633-dc4bf2d7e162
msgctxt "hd9407e2fg76fag4eeegb083g37f0e9365bbf"
msgid "Bastards. The Blade comes for you."
msgstr "개자식들. 이 칼날이 해치워주마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Adventurer1
#. Speaker = Barth
#. NodeID = 2bc46dd5-d280-2652-742d-2c9d9b589773
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Quest_GoblinRaidOver = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Adventurer1:2bc46dd5-d280-2652-742d-2c9d9b589773
msgctxt "h6f933843g3625g42bcga216ge0dc2dfb16b0"
msgid "Damn coward's got plenty to answer for."
msgstr "망할 겁쟁이들, 변명거리만 잔뜩이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Adventurer1
#. Speaker = Barth
#. NodeID = 860cbc23-6d5a-8b25-3f3f-f0380c248a46
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Quest_ConfrontationResolved = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Adventurer1:860cbc23-6d5a-8b25-3f3f-f0380c248a46
msgctxt "h72936df3g7a0ag44b0g9eccgf3438557c4c9"
msgid "Hells of a day."
msgstr "일진 참 사납네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Adventurer1
#. Speaker = Barth
#. NodeID = b4cb38ef-d744-87c1-bbda-99d9c9c36e1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Adventurer1:b4cb38ef-d744-87c1-bbda-99d9c9c36e1f
msgctxt "h3a8e663cg693bg439cga6ecg856c29eea346"
msgid "Bloody hell."
msgstr "우라질."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Adventurer1
#. Speaker = Barth
#. NodeID = bc674ac5-7760-fc60-6056-c1a8fc113bc7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_StartConfrontation = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Adventurer1:bc674ac5-7760-fc60-6056-c1a8fc113bc7
msgctxt "h03937778g462eg437dg8b6cgcba127c1bf4c"
msgid "They nearly left us to the goblins. <i>Disgusting.</i>"
msgstr "우릴 고블린한테 버려두려고 했어. <i>역겨운 것들.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Adventurer2
#. Speaker = Remira
#. NodeID = 564e7dba-983f-7429-c95b-f4ef85579c68
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_GateIsOpened = True
#. TagRule: TIEFLING
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Adventurer2:564e7dba-983f-7429-c95b-f4ef85579c68
msgctxt "h936e66b0g0e4bg4ca5g856cgb299c77d8567"
msgid "Said it from the start. Shouldn't have trusted those... <i>people.</i>"
msgstr "내가 애초부터 말했잖아. 저 <i>족속</i>은 믿을 수가 없다고 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Adventurer2
#. Speaker = Remira
#. NodeID = 564e7dba-983f-7429-c95b-f4ef85579c68
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_GateIsOpened = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Adventurer2:564e7dba-983f-7429-c95b-f4ef85579c68
msgctxt "he7ce6cf0geebcg4f17g85f9g76261cd05475"
msgid "Said it from the start. Shouldn't have trusted those <i>foulbloods.</i>"
msgstr "내가 애초부터 말했잖아. 저 <i>더러운 혈통들</i>은 믿을 수가 없다고 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Adventurer2
#. Speaker = Remira
#. NodeID = 7c443f67-9774-5175-ab36-3f4b3129799e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Adventurer2:7c443f67-9774-5175-ab36-3f4b3129799e
msgctxt "h57fcff40gbe61g4435g9ecfg8ec626d47281"
msgid "I'm not bloody dying here. I <i>won't.</i>"
msgstr "난 여기서 뒈지지 않을 거야. <i>아무렴.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_AdventurerAfterKO
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 401d6e19-fd8c-65c9-c7d1-f6167bff008e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_AdventurersLeave = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_AdventurerAfterKO:401d6e19-fd8c-65c9-c7d1-f6167bff008e
msgctxt "h3cfb2837gc50eg4f43g8d51g13731a4a3869"
msgid "I'm <i>done </i>with this hellhole."
msgstr "이 거지 같은 곳은 이제 <i>질렸어</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_AdventurerAfterKO
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = b4e0cdb6-406c-a3d5-10f9-310b8bbbd0fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_AdventurerAfterKO:b4e0cdb6-406c-a3d5-10f9-310b8bbbd0fe
msgctxt "h9ea2635eg043bg421fgbc3ag0f062e3df5ec"
msgid ""
"First I damn near die at the hands of goblins. Then a <i>foulblood </i>takes "
"his frustrations out on me."
msgstr "처음엔 고블린 손에 뒈질 뻔하더니, 이젠 <i>더러운 혈통</i>의 화풀이에 된통 당하기까지 하는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_AdventurerAfterKO
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = dce35683-620c-3b47-4765-d605e64ff100
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_PlayerDidTheKO = True
#. TagRule: TIEFLING
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_AdventurerAfterKO:dce35683-620c-3b47-4765-d605e64ff100
msgctxt "h895e0afdgc5f7g4cb2g87adg802fd9dc012d"
msgid ""
"First I damn near die at the hands of goblins. Then I get sucker-punched by "
"a <i>foulblood</i>."
msgstr "고블린한테 뒈질 뻔한 걸로도 모자라서, 이젠 <i>더러운 혈통</i>한테 기습 죽빵까지 얻어맞는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_AdventurerAfterKO
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = dce35683-620c-3b47-4765-d605e64ff100
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_PlayerDidTheKO = True
#. TagRule: DWARF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_AdventurerAfterKO:dce35683-620c-3b47-4765-d605e64ff100
msgctxt "h8685f4f9g365cg4a6agb148g6e6bd8ac8090"
msgid ""
"First I damn near die at the hands of goblins. Then I get sucker-punched by "
"a bloody <i>dwarf</i>."
msgstr "고블린한테 뒈질 뻔한 걸로도 모자라서, 이젠 염병할 <i>드워프</i>한테 기습 죽빵까지 얻어맞는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_AdventurerAfterKO
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = dce35683-620c-3b47-4765-d605e64ff100
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_PlayerDidTheKO = True
#. TagRule: ELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_AdventurerAfterKO:dce35683-620c-3b47-4765-d605e64ff100
msgctxt "h33a4d51eg24d2g4f16g832agd5c91c319d48"
msgid ""
"First I damn near die at the hands of goblins. Then I get sucker-punched by "
"a bloody <i>elf</i>."
msgstr "고블린한테 뒈질 뻔한 걸로도 모자라서, 이젠 염병할 <i>엘프</i>한테 기습 죽빵까지 얻어맞는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_AdventurerAfterKO
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = dce35683-620c-3b47-4765-d605e64ff100
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
