#. TagRule: GNOME
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_AdventurerAfterKO:dce35683-620c-3b47-4765-d605e64ff100
msgctxt "hdbaeead5g95b7g40fagafcfge7baf43d6267"
msgid ""
"First I damn near die at the hands of goblins. Then I get sucker-punched by "
"a bloody <i>gnome</i>."
msgstr "고블린한테 뒈질 뻔한 걸로도 모자라서, 이젠 염병할 <i>노움</i>한테 기습 죽빵까지 얻어맞는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_AdventurerAfterKO
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = dce35683-620c-3b47-4765-d605e64ff100
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_PlayerDidTheKO = True
#. TagRule: DRAGONBORN
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_AdventurerAfterKO:dce35683-620c-3b47-4765-d605e64ff100
msgctxt "h942057b0g14d1g4264gafd3ge9e337f12622"
msgid ""
"First I damn near die at the hands of goblins. Then I get sucker-punched by "
"a bloody <i>lizard</i>."
msgstr "고블린한테 뒈질 뻔한 걸로도 모자라서, 이젠 염병할 <i>도마뱀</i>한테 기습 죽빵까지 얻어맞는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_AdventurerAfterKO
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = dce35683-620c-3b47-4765-d605e64ff100
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_PlayerDidTheKO = True
#. TagRule: BESTIAL and GITHYANKI and RARE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_AdventurerAfterKO:dce35683-620c-3b47-4765-d605e64ff100
msgctxt "h78ce64b5g4a8dg4edcg8075g842c545559a1"
msgid ""
"First I damn near die at the hands of goblins. Then I get sucker-punched by "
"a bloody <i>freak</i>."
msgstr "고블린한테 뒈질 뻔한 걸로도 모자라서, 이젠 웬 염병할 <i>별종</i>한테 기습 죽빵까지 얻어맞는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_AdventurerAfterKO
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = dce35683-620c-3b47-4765-d605e64ff100
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_PlayerDidTheKO = True
#. TagRule: DROWHALFELF or HALFELF or HALFORC
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_AdventurerAfterKO:dce35683-620c-3b47-4765-d605e64ff100
msgctxt "h12c7cf01gf84cg47c1gbeffg632248274e78"
msgid ""
"First I damn near die at the hands of goblins. Then I get sucker-punched by "
"a bloody <i>half-breed</i>."
msgstr "고블린한테 뒈질 뻔한 걸로도 모자라서, 이젠 염병할 <i>잡종</i>한테 기습 죽빵까지 얻어맞는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_AdventurerAfterKO
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = dce35683-620c-3b47-4765-d605e64ff100
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_PlayerDidTheKO = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_AdventurerAfterKO:dce35683-620c-3b47-4765-d605e64ff100
msgctxt "he9b7bf4egc85fg4e3cg90bfg946a38db8b1a"
msgid ""
"First I damn near die at the hands of goblins. Then I get sucker-punched by "
"a bloody <i>randomer</i>."
msgstr "고블린한테 뒈질 뻔한 걸로도 모자라서, 이젠 염병할 <i>웬 놈</i>한테 기습 죽빵까지 얻어맞는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_AdventurerLeader
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 60efe26f-9c81-3556-38d0-a1ef615076f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_AdventurerLeader:60efe26f-9c81-3556-38d0-a1ef615076f6
msgctxt "hfeaa9b3fgbdbfg4d98gbff8g14480c577ec3"
msgid "Out of my way. I'll tear the horns off that bloody coward!"
msgstr "저리 비켜. 저 빌어먹을 겁쟁이 놈들 뿔을 뽑아버리겠어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_AdventurerLeader
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = d8bdb6b4-dbf4-09e2-b436-0f9f9867c70d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Quest_ConfrontationResolved = True
#. TagRule: !TIEFLING
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_AdventurerLeader:d8bdb6b4-dbf4-09e2-b436-0f9f9867c70d
msgctxt "h1ea959d1gb9c1g4ad1gaf86gab258979068b"
msgid "Pardon."
msgstr "실례하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_AdventurerLeader
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = d8bdb6b4-dbf4-09e2-b436-0f9f9867c70d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Quest_ConfrontationResolved = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_AdventurerLeader:d8bdb6b4-dbf4-09e2-b436-0f9f9867c70d
msgctxt "hd8d156bag7fbcg4a9agbcccgbf5dbdd2a5f6"
msgid "Bloody devils."
msgstr "망할 데빌 놈들."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 01ac8ebf-9c9e-b5e8-1df8-d982f1d9a644
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:01ac8ebf-9c9e-b5e8-1df8-d982f1d9a644
msgctxt "hfaf1cbc4g63b1g4618g983ag41d07ab4722b"
msgid ""
"Got a death wish, have you? Contract came from a wizard in Baldur's Gate."
msgstr "자살이라도 하고 싶나 보지? 의뢰는 발더스 게이트의 어느 위저드한테서 받았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 02ee0f63-e0e6-6d51-4e65-5a9b9128cac8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_HALFLING(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 762372bb-be45-0686-ec1a-5c813c8ea322_tieflingAttack = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:02ee0f63-e0e6-6d51-4e65-5a9b9128cac8
msgctxt "h9374e956gc65fg4081gae33g2f369f33b998"
msgid "One fight just ended, and now you're picking another? <i>Relax.</i>"
msgstr "방금 전투 끝낸 마당에, 이젠 서로 싸움질하려고? <i>진정들 좀 해.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 037c9053-4285-70ee-8ca7-6e4a8d90b511
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:037c9053-4285-70ee-8ca7-6e4a8d90b511
msgctxt "hd02654ceg325bg4d59g9ff9ga41a7ec9a130"
msgid "What'll you do now?"
msgstr "그쪽은 이제 어쩔 생각이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 0799bbed-26fc-7535-4e16-d2ee3942edf6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_PlayerDidTheKO = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - TIEFLING(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:0799bbed-26fc-7535-4e16-d2ee3942edf6
msgctxt "he144d53eg2d32g453cga9ffg236bb0547f65"
msgid ""
"Tell you what, though: look me up if you're ever in the city. I owe you a "
"pint."
msgstr "그래도 뭐, 혹시 도시에 오거든 날 만나러 와. 한잔 쏠 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 09a874ca-4d03-704d-6ac6-4eb32b12800c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:09a874ca-4d03-704d-6ac6-4eb32b12800c
msgctxt "ha39c6115g4fb0g402eg8fdcg902ed7e07f4a"
msgid "Mission accomplished, I guess."
msgstr "임무 달성하셨구먼그래."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 0b93d3b1-1e98-42ab-bd98-9871deb413f8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:0b93d3b1-1e98-42ab-bd98-9871deb413f8
msgctxt "hb0fe4a2egba88g4113gad12gb3a0602d687b"
msgid ""
"Head back to Baldur's Gate. Better empty-handed than dead. I'm done with "
"this shite."
msgstr "발더스 게이트로 돌아가야지. 시체가 되느니 빈털터리 신세가 낫잖아. 이 짓거린 더 못 해 먹겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0ba7ebc3-adaf-1d0b-02d4-8bbb5e41b700
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BALDURIAN(2) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_DARK_URGE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:0ba7ebc3-adaf-1d0b-02d4-8bbb5e41b700
msgctxt "h98a8696bg8982g40e8ga16fgd339608f4af6"
msgid "Strangely, I can almost hear the Chionthar's rush. How far are we?"
msgstr "이상하게도, 치온타르 강물 흐르는 소리가 들리는 것만 같은걸. 여기랑 얼마나 먼 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0ba7ebc3-adaf-1d0b-02d4-8bbb5e41b700
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BALDURIAN(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:0ba7ebc3-adaf-1d0b-02d4-8bbb5e41b700
msgctxt "h9e2d9cb4g667dg4a67ga5b9g1e166d6f6b57"
msgid "Home sweet home. How far down the Chionthar are we?"
msgstr "즐거운 내 고향 말이군. 여기랑 치온타르는 얼마나 멀리 떨어져 있어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 121a9055-332e-fefe-1cbe-b3af376f0fc3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_RaidingParty_State_PeacefulResolution = True
#.   Object:
#.     - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_Gale_PeacefulResolutionApproval(2) = True
#.     - DEN_RaidingParty_State_ReachedPeacefulResolution(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:121a9055-332e-fefe-1cbe-b3af376f0fc3
msgctxt "h02e11d59g8fa9g48e0gabbegf718a61af892"
msgid "At least we agree on that."
msgstr "그거 하난 의견이 일치하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 13710d91-a452-32b8-f9f7-b275cf4d5a7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:13710d91-a452-32b8-f9f7-b275cf4d5a7c
msgctxt "hbffb1ebfg59d8g4c50g9745g4a4ea9b4e5c8"
msgid "Too little, too late."
msgstr "별 의미 없고, 너무 늦었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 14dbede0-1ae9-f115-b237-950819fa7a7b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:14dbede0-1ae9-f115-b237-950819fa7a7b
msgctxt "haf0031d0g65a7g440egb61fgf0f526ebd623"
msgid ""
"Please. You were begging me to open the gate. Anything to save yourself, you "
"<i>coward</i>."
msgstr "참 나. 넌 내게 문 열어달라고 사정해댔잖아. 목숨 구걸에 정신 팔렸던 주제에, 이 <i>비겁한</i> 놈."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 157e845e-57c5-8124-fd1c-73e4d45b1ba2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:157e845e-57c5-8124-fd1c-73e4d45b1ba2
msgctxt "hf66f4163gb6dcg45b9gb252g2f0c360350e2"
msgid "<b>STOP OR I'LL BASH YOUR SKULLS TOGETHER MYSELF.</b>"
msgstr "<b>당장 안 멈추면 내가 직접 당신네 골통을 박살 내주겠어.</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 15b0bca3-c6a2-5adc-cf7f-026281697693
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:15b0bca3-c6a2-5adc-cf7f-026281697693
msgctxt "h13f774afg4d45g4937g8f33g79c75b043e4a"
msgid ""
"Heh, don't thank me. I'll be well on my way to Baldur's Gate when you die."
msgstr "고마워 하지 마. 너 죽을 쯤에 난 멀쩡히 발더스 게이트에 도착해 있을 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 16486b22-54c5-af5a-f096-0aa4da1f7d7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:16486b22-54c5-af5a-f096-0aa4da1f7d7c
msgctxt "hd03bef91gb850g421eg8d57gfe10d31a594d"
msgid "He's right. We should scram while we can."
msgstr "저 말이 맞아. 우린 늦기 전에 여길 튀어야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 16486b22-54c5-af5a-f096-0aa4da1f7d7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:16486b22-54c5-af5a-f096-0aa4da1f7d7c
msgctxt "h54057b1dg8f63g4ac7gaf85g2e909253a68f"
msgid "She's right. We should scram while we can."
msgstr "저 말이 맞아. 우린 늦기 전에 여길 튀어야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 16486b22-54c5-af5a-f096-0aa4da1f7d7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:16486b22-54c5-af5a-f096-0aa4da1f7d7c
msgctxt "hfab26571g38e3g4c50g951eg171b29e3109f"
msgid "They're right. We should scram while we can."
msgstr "저 말이 맞아. 우린 늦기 전에 여길 튀어야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 17a36c75-f86a-95b3-afe3-5863048177f4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:17a36c75-f86a-95b3-afe3-5863048177f4
msgctxt "h616b3c0eg4c59g47c0gbcabg21aa8c78bb1a"
msgid "Tough hitter like you might last there. Maybe."
msgstr "너같이 힘센 사람이면 거기 가도 잘 버틸듯한데. 아마도."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 1a9800ee-dd81-7339-2bdf-d74364afe448
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:1a9800ee-dd81-7339-2bdf-d74364afe448
msgctxt "h9a76992dgc999g48d4g8f2cg79939b4e968e"
msgid "*With a thunk, the armoured man collapses - unconscious.*"
msgstr "*쿵 소리와 함께 갑옷 입은 남자가 의식을 잃고 쓰러집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 21f7e906-479f-7efa-77c3-3c1a095a3cb6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:21f7e906-479f-7efa-77c3-3c1a095a3cb6
msgctxt "h80891e55g2cc7g4dacgb704g89da6d4c9bb1"
msgid ""
"Nobody forced him to go with us - he insisted. And when things got tough, he "
"couldn't keep up. Simple as that."
msgstr "우리가 억지로 끌고 갔냐? 지가 자진했다고. 그리고 일이 어그러지자, 낙오된 거지. 그게 다야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 248c79df-f63a-1ba5-a1ff-8e81a8ed4b68
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:248c79df-f63a-1ba5-a1ff-8e81a8ed4b68
msgctxt "h625c380ag10a1g4fb1g85b3g75057727ea86"
msgid "Forgive me, sister. I... forgot myself."
msgstr "실례했네, 자매여. 내가... 이성을 잃었군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 248c79df-f63a-1ba5-a1ff-8e81a8ed4b68
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:248c79df-f63a-1ba5-a1ff-8e81a8ed4b68
msgctxt "h0f245bbbgbe29g457eg86c1g31c101b571f8"
msgid "Forgive me, brother. I... forgot myself."
msgstr "실례했네, 형제여. 내가... 이성을 잃었군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 248c79df-f63a-1ba5-a1ff-8e81a8ed4b68
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:248c79df-f63a-1ba5-a1ff-8e81a8ed4b68
msgctxt "h05c81543g7157g444ag9565g84915fbca15a"
msgid "Forgive me, cousin. I... forgot myself."
msgstr "실례했네, 동포여. 내가... 이성을 잃었군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 280f48ba-7506-9b33-35c5-4096fecf8f39
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: BESTIAL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:280f48ba-7506-9b33-35c5-4096fecf8f39
msgctxt "h1d607b89ga00bg49eag8928gc105e9c7a4e0"
msgid "Calm down, both of you, before I <i>put</i> you down."
msgstr "둘 다 진정들 좀 하지 그래. 내가 그렇게 <i>만들어주기</i> 전에 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 280f48ba-7506-9b33-35c5-4096fecf8f39
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:280f48ba-7506-9b33-35c5-4096fecf8f39
msgctxt "hfc27f131ge6b5g4b75g99aeg6dc3a3124dbb"
msgid "Stop squealing like hatchlings or settle this matter in blood."
msgstr "갓난 새끼처럼 꽥꽥대지 좀 마. 아니면 서로 피를 보든가 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 2f6b8976-6951-d5dc-a798-2c2d9723d06e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:2f6b8976-6951-d5dc-a798-2c2d9723d06e
msgctxt "h882f57e5gf566g41begafeeg1743962fbdfd"
msgid "God forbid you risk your precious tail. But I shouldn't be surprised."
msgstr "그 귀하디귀한 꼬리 다칠까 봐 겁난 거겠지. 딱히 놀랍지도 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2fa98f76-1a33-dc70-a811-253e1fb18e28
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - TIEFLING(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:2fa98f76-1a33-dc70-a811-253e1fb18e28
msgctxt "h71feb2a8gb1ffg413cga59bgce4c355fb750"
msgid ""
"He's human - malice comes as naturally as breathing. Just show him you're "
"the better man."
msgstr "저자는 인간이잖아. 숨 쉬듯이 악의를 내뿜는 게 천성이야. 저치보다 나은 모습을 보이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 30ae956e-bda4-e2cf-ba43-33cf7a960eef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:30ae956e-bda4-e2cf-ba43-33cf7a960eef
msgctxt "heb885c90g703cg450aga063g48e0f204489c"
msgid "Thanks. I do my best."
msgstr "고맙네. 나름 최선을 다하거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3287151e-575c-320a-6403-65f3146d6aa3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_AskedPayment(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:3287151e-575c-320a-6403-65f3146d6aa3
msgctxt "hdc77cd7ag3e49g4359g9220g9927f82dc222"
msgid "You can cough up my payment any time now."
msgstr "이만 내 수고비 좀 줬으면 싶은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 348bcda6-ac37-2982-f01f-f4197fb61f5a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(2) = False
#.      - HALFORC(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:348bcda6-ac37-2982-f01f-f4197fb61f5a
msgctxt "hea903441gd3ebg4f84ga888gc250c47552bc"
msgid ""
"Want me to knock you both out? Or would you prefer to skip the broken bones "
"and just calm down?"
msgstr "내가 직접 당신네들 때려눕혀 줄까? 괜히 어디 부러지기 전에 진정들 좀 하지그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 34a4440d-ec21-6672-c55b-54dcf04183f4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:34a4440d-ec21-6672-c55b-54dcf04183f4
msgctxt "h1849ee4cg4cc0g45fag9d05g1c36b27e73ec"
msgid ""
"Maybe I could take that job off your hands, if you've lost your appetite for "
"it."
msgstr "그 의뢰 건 손 놓아버릴 생각이라면, 내가 대신 맡아 해볼까 싶은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 3607909e-17ec-db7f-15a8-699c7bad2359
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:3607909e-17ec-db7f-15a8-699c7bad2359
msgctxt "h76890fd5gecc0g4e9bga055g5fe03b365163"
msgid ""
"I told him he wasn't getting so much as a sniff of the reward, but he tagged "
"along anyhow."
msgstr "내가 떡고물 받아낼 생각은 꿈도 꾸지 말라고 해줬는데도, 한사코 따라나서더라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 3b48b591-1f49-9516-0f77-0468644244ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:3b48b591-1f49-9516-0f77-0468644244ab
msgctxt "ha4e6fe14gbe47g4f20gac05g4b00fcb2384a"
msgid "Enough. Squabbling is pointless. The goblins have found us."
msgstr "그만. 말다툼질은 무의미하다. 고블린들이 우릴 찾아냈잖나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3b966309-4c2f-f640-b4ee-339f071bdf2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:3b966309-4c2f-f640-b4ee-339f071bdf2c
msgctxt "h633bf574g58d9g4841gbf94g477153a1720e"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3cdae192-d0c3-368e-0692-f6d2df7a61c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:3cdae192-d0c3-368e-0692-f6d2df7a61c9
msgctxt "h74efbf5eg84a6g489dgba67gaa184fa6cfd1"
msgid ""
"You put him in a bind, showing up like that. And he did try to open the gate."
msgstr "댁이 그렇게 갑자기 나타나서 곤경에 빠졌던 거잖아. 게다가 저 사람은 문 열어주려고 했다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 3de7c757-5f82-c1d2-9c30-bc95ef356f19
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:3de7c757-5f82-c1d2-9c30-bc95ef356f19
msgctxt "h9cd3433cgae38g4146ga66dgc2833a062f77"
msgid ""
"You led them straight to us. And you let them take the druid, too. "
"Unbelievable!"
msgstr "넌 고블린을 여기로 달고 왔어. 또 드루이드까지 버려두고 왔지. 믿을 수가 없군!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 41aa9583-5f39-151b-1f21-cb5b5d14d951
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_AdventurersQuest_Knows_AradinStory = True
#.     - DEN_AdventurersQuest_Knows_LeaderMap = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - SHA_Nightsong.LearnedBryanMap(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:41aa9583-5f39-151b-1f21-cb5b5d14d951
msgctxt "h3e537f67g4e6fg42c2g87c9g7ee46f39fc83"
msgid ""
"I'd give you the map and wish you a happy funeral, but my mate Brian kept "
"hold of it like his own todger. Goblins made short of the fat old chunk."
msgstr ""
"그쪽한테 지도 내주고 대충 명복이나 빌어주고 싶지만, 하필 내 친구 브라이언이 지도를 지 거시기처럼 품고 다녔거든. 그 뚱보는 고블린 "
"손에 작살났고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 43e040d9-c295-a0dc-7ee6-7841f8b47686
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:43e040d9-c295-a0dc-7ee6-7841f8b47686
msgctxt "h4a47b134g58e5g40f9g844ag391a0c6b7d19"
msgid "Druid? Those goblins didn't take any prisoners."
msgstr "드루이드? 아까 그 고블린들은 포로를 데리고 있진 않던데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 45b9912f-a8a1-3483-69fb-16814962568f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:45b9912f-a8a1-3483-69fb-16814962568f
msgctxt "h672c7d2bg293fg4a44gb814gb24be5831a28"
msgid ""
"Right. Lead goblins here, then leave the rest of us to fight them off. You "
"coward."
msgstr "아무렴. 고블린 끌고 와놓곤, 싸움은 우리한테 떠넘기고 뜨겠다 이거지. 비겁한 놈."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 48d17415-e3f7-bef5-caa0-c7c4bd1749ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:48d17415-e3f7-bef5-caa0-c7c4bd1749ac
msgctxt "h8b967381g4c32g4c6fg95d9g820ad2fb6975"
msgid "<i>Stand back and watch.</i>"
msgstr "<i>물러서서 지켜본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 4aebfcfc-0a80-319a-0c91-9049b681ece8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:4aebfcfc-0a80-319a-0c91-9049b681ece8
msgctxt "hf36ea65bga13bg4093g9e98g4f9374cb85fa"
msgid ""
"Shut it, horns. <i>I'd</i> be lying dead next to the goblins if you'd "
"stalled any longer."
msgstr "닥쳐, 뿔쟁이. 댁이 좀만 더 지체했더라면 <i>나도</i> 고블린들 곁에 시체로 누워 있었을 거라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 4c5dd937-42e1-ffd3-3268-1ca5165b15c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:4c5dd937-42e1-ffd3-3268-1ca5165b15c8
msgctxt "h11d4de93gb429g41c6ga189ga1aa65746704"
msgid "I'd rather face another round of goblins than stay in this pit."
msgstr "이딴 똥통에 머무느니 차라리 고블린 떼거리랑 한 번 더 붙는 게 낫지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4c9ca0c0-4455-4e8a-cfc2-776104e248a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:4c9ca0c0-4455-4e8a-cfc2-776104e248a2
msgctxt "hb531ec60g174dg4130g9f4cg53d694d5da55"
msgid "So you knocked him out cold instead. Clever."
msgstr "그래서 대신 이 사람을 제껴버린 거냐. 참 똑똑하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4cd59346-b829-1314-9ecc-8d0000585373
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:4cd59346-b829-1314-9ecc-8d0000585373
msgctxt "h85629a2cg8fe6g44c7g8230g35fa6c1ae6de"
msgid "More violence won't bring back those you lost. Stop and <i>think</i>."
msgstr "폭력을 더해봤자 죽은 이들이 살아 돌아오진 않아. 그만하고 <i>생각</i>을 하라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 549dafe3-b176-4d72-6967-6c2e74e0b6c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:549dafe3-b176-4d72-6967-6c2e74e0b6c3
msgctxt "ha2b883e7g36d6g4ec5gb674g3155ed5f49a0"
msgid "<i>Enough.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그만.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 55e081f2-bd86-4135-9447-13039fea4db2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:55e081f2-bd86-4135-9447-13039fea4db2
msgctxt "h9bbbf6d7g2febg466agb379g82067fb54fea"
msgid ""
"We've got a contract to track down some relic, and he wanted in on the job. "
"Eyes lit up when he heard about it."
msgstr "우린 어떤 유물을 찾으란 의뢰를 수행하러 왔는데, 그 양반도 끼려고 들었어. 유물 얘기 듣더니 눈빛이 확 빛났지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 569d4b4c-52f5-9548-1513-204e6e0ef0ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:569d4b4c-52f5-9548-1513-204e6e0ef0ea
msgctxt "h8822e236g90b1g4583gb546g1a302f0721e8"
msgid "He's either diggin' latrines or boilin' in a cookpot by now."
msgstr "지금쯤 놈들 똥이나 푸고 있거나, 솥단지에서 요리되고 있을걸?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5cd1169e-7de0-2d15-bcf8-2c8eafca2d31
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:5cd1169e-7de0-2d15-bcf8-2c8eafca2d31
msgctxt "h34851f7egee62g4558gb41fgfefc4eb05910"
msgid ""
"Where there's one goblin, there's ten. I'm leaving before the horde shows up."
msgstr "고블린 하나가 보이면, 열 놈은 더 있기 마련이지. 놈들이 떼거리로 오기 전에 여길 떠야겠는걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 5e835857-2b81-570a-9287-ec11adaf73de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:5e835857-2b81-570a-9287-ec11adaf73de
msgctxt "h85fadc04gc978g4d60gbcadg5445f7579b30"
msgid "What chewed you up and spit you out?"
msgstr "이건 또 뭔 누가 씹다 뱉은 거 같은 놈이냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 62ec1e5e-f6ed-4120-ba4f-2d30bdb44ffe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:62ec1e5e-f6ed-4120-ba4f-2d30bdb44ffe
msgctxt "hcae5b0fcg23afg414aga094g04bf35decb11"
msgid ""
"Shoulda done that a long time ago. Arrogant prick had it out for me from day "
"one."
msgstr "진작에 이랬어야 했는데. 거만한 새끼가 첫날부터 툭툭 시비 걸어대고 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 6325db5c-4300-a7b4-3b68-a73072b809ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:6325db5c-4300-a7b4-3b68-a73072b809ef
msgctxt "h4992d770g7f07g4772ga067g3669253e9053"
msgid "The goblins have found us. No doubt, the beasts will be back."
msgstr "고블린들이 우릴 찾아냈어. 보나 마나 그 짐승들이 또 오겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 63c5060b-ccd2-c4f5-d2c2-471bc387744e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:63c5060b-ccd2-c4f5-d2c2-471bc387744e
msgctxt "h43a478acgca21g4103gbe47ge6355a827291"
msgid "There are <i>children </i>here, you fool!"
msgstr "여긴 <i>아이들</i>도 있다고, 이 멍청아!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 640f02a9-8552-c125-1ef7-b4b9220b247b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: TIEFLING
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:640f02a9-8552-c125-1ef7-b4b9220b247b
msgctxt "h35a117f2g8e96g4930g9493g4f734b1d1fab"
msgid "Damn. Didn't expect a devilkin to turn on one of their own."
msgstr "썅. 악마족이 거꾸로 지 동족을 공격할 줄은 몰랐는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 640f02a9-8552-c125-1ef7-b4b9220b247b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:640f02a9-8552-c125-1ef7-b4b9220b247b
msgctxt "h3ce34ff2ge40bg45c0ga728ga87db1777aae"
msgid "Damn. You knocked him clean out."
msgstr "썅. 깔끔하게 나가떨어졌는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 65a55f84-f04e-f6f2-3511-dc394f12abe5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:65a55f84-f04e-f6f2-3511-dc394f12abe5
msgctxt "h25dbf1dagbd89g4386g8ba0gbeec7d145edd"
msgid "No one leaves my people out cold."
msgstr "누구든 내 동료들을 제껴버릴 순 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 66fa4121-a1a3-ddfe-eb8c-b4c83342c1a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: MeleeUnarmedAttack
#. RollAbility:
#. DifficultyClass: 0
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:66fa4121-a1a3-ddfe-eb8c-b4c83342c1a7
msgctxt "h48e23c5dgacddg4559g8fc9gd79f38fa1bac"
msgid "<i>Take a swing at the tiefling.</i>"
msgstr "<i>티플링에게 주먹을 휘두른다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6a2e8038-fde0-83bb-38af-02e935643cd7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:6a2e8038-fde0-83bb-38af-02e935643cd7
msgctxt "hfefdcb11g37f0g4e26g83fcgf8d494bd514e"
msgid "You're not locals, then. Who runs this place?"
msgstr "여기 주민은 아닌 모양이군. 누가 이곳 책임자야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 6ad585dd-3281-9ecc-0ff2-b6550b888c70
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:6ad585dd-3281-9ecc-0ff2-b6550b888c70
msgctxt "he173d7d7gb557g46e3gb688gba103f59d3e5"
msgid "Keep that luck, mate. You'll need it."
msgstr "운은 그쪽이나 챙겨, 친구. 필요해질걸?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 6bc48d33-5662-261e-c680-9c30df5f300a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:6bc48d33-5662-261e-c680-9c30df5f300a
msgctxt "h3f5444fdg194eg4fe6g8918g86233a740b38"
msgid "And who the hell are <i>you </i>again?!"
msgstr "<i>넌</i> 또 뭐 하는 개뼈다귀인데?!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6d37eb6e-734f-8cd4-e506-ddb27f564df2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 762372bb-be45-0686-ec1a-5c813c8ea322_tieflingAttack = True
#. TagRule: FIGHTER or PALADIN or RANGER or ROGUE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:6d37eb6e-734f-8cd4-e506-ddb27f564df2
msgctxt "haf89fc53ge1c9g471aga8f5gb9b3090f7673"
msgid "I've seen much bloodier battles than this. Consider yourselves lucky."
msgstr "난 이보다 더 지독한 전투도 겪어봤어. 이만하면 다행인 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6ff101ef-7e37-9f46-ecc6-fc4d64590698
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:6ff101ef-7e37-9f46-ecc6-fc4d64590698
msgctxt "h09ebf2a3ga9f0g4e81gaa0cgf70213e1185e"
msgid "Somewhere in my noxious blood, Baldur's Gate is calling to me."
msgstr "내 악독한 핏속 어딘가에서, 발더스 게이트가 날 부르는 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 7122d6b9-42e8-1c32-9420-40a20012c496
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !TIEFLING
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:7122d6b9-42e8-1c32-9420-40a20012c496
msgctxt "h61421455ga8f1g4f32g8401gf60c063b58e2"
msgid ""
"Ain't stayin' around here with horns knocked cold out. Rest of these "
"devils'll be out for blood."
msgstr "여기 처자빠져 있는 뿔쟁이 근처에 죽칠 생각 없어. 나머지 데빌 놈들 눈깔이 뒤집힐 텐데 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 7122d6b9-42e8-1c32-9420-40a20012c496
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: TIEFLING
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:7122d6b9-42e8-1c32-9420-40a20012c496
msgctxt "h0b094990g85dbg427fga7b9g04e64c445506"
msgid ""
"Ain't stayin' around here with this'n knocked cold out. Here's hopin' "
"they'll grant mercy to one of their own."
msgstr "여기 처자빠져 있는 뿔쟁이 근처에 죽칠 생각 없어. 놈들이 부디 동족의 정으로 널 봐줬으면 좋겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 71962ffc-5874-2816-7a4a-c1d174cfbd8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:71962ffc-5874-2816-7a4a-c1d174cfbd8a
msgctxt "hc97907cfg635dg43f8g9ae3gc7d1d12bf02a"
msgid "Only way he'd shut that hole under his nose."
msgstr "저 아가리를 닥치게 할 유일한 방법이었다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 77bcbf7c-434f-ed77-3576-38f80ad2c441
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:77bcbf7c-434f-ed77-3576-38f80ad2c441
msgctxt "he6ddaa3ag59d7g4dc7gbc1fg6a330909102e"
msgid "You're right. There's too much at stake."
msgstr "맞는 말이군. 안 그래도 위태로운 판이니 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 7814ea0d-7450-1130-5ad0-7477e715a63e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:7814ea0d-7450-1130-5ad0-7477e715a63e
msgctxt "h7fc371ffg308fg46fcg9020g71dd5d890038"
msgid "Pull your claws in, under-elf."
msgstr "허튼수작질 관두시지, 지하 엘프."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 81773f87-df3d-2a66-d673-5421adc1809a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - TIEFLING(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:81773f87-df3d-2a66-d673-5421adc1809a
msgctxt "hfd27bdcag7c1eg4a85ga0e5g08739aa5c2fd"
msgid "Ah, 'devilkin'. Certainly never heard that one before. Creative."
msgstr "오, '악마족'이라. 그런 지칭은 퍽이나 들어본 적도 없는데. 거 참 참신한걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8273c340-a0ee-1bee-d9a8-14c9e7b42ec7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:8273c340-a0ee-1bee-d9a8-14c9e7b42ec7
msgctxt "h3b231cbeg07e9g4dc0g87a7g4e5c322cb822"
msgid "What was important enough to drag a druid out of his grove?"
msgstr "대체 뭔 대단한 일이 있어서 드루이드가 자기 숲을 벗어난 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 837e16f0-eee2-472b-5962-924ee96c2726
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_DUERGARDWARF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:837e16f0-eee2-472b-5962-924ee96c2726
msgctxt "hdde01dc6g79b8g4eb5gaa25g2cd696147fb8"
msgid ""
"You lads gonna settle this or are you just ranting like a couple of derro?"
msgstr "결판을 볼 작정이긴 한 거야, 아니면 데로처럼 서로 악만 계속 질러댈 생각이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 837e16f0-eee2-472b-5962-924ee96c2726
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALFLING
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:837e16f0-eee2-472b-5962-924ee96c2726
msgctxt "h84934c3dg318fg4991gaf9bg7eef1e69e00e"
msgid "How about we cool those hot tempers and talk this through calmly?"
msgstr "일단 머리의 열 좀 식히고 서로 차분히 대화 나누는 게 어때?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 83e304af-4dce-b314-11f0-ccfe66a0aadc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:83e304af-4dce-b314-11f0-ccfe66a0aadc
msgctxt "h2b4be45fg6aa7g4314g8523g010c5a5f10c3"
msgid "*He acts before you can intervene...*"
msgstr "*개입하기도 전에 그가 일을 벌입니다...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 8572f693-d885-29d1-8dcd-9bb2972cd844
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:8572f693-d885-29d1-8dcd-9bb2972cd844
msgctxt "h0a536923g8ba9g4752ga971g35e9080dd733"
msgid "What's it gonna take to shut you up, horns?"
msgstr "대체 뭘 어째야 그 아가리가 닥쳐질까, 뿔쟁아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 88939bad-88f3-566c-17cb-d83c899a03ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:88939bad-88f3-566c-17cb-d83c899a03ad
msgctxt "h0623843fg23c0g4846gb7d4g344706920c24"
msgid "Got himself nabbed by gobbos - same ones what chased us here."
msgstr "고보 새끼들한테 붙잡혔거든. 우릴 쫓아온 놈들이랑 같은 패 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 8aa4caef-7dc2-8a02-2b77-33ebf4ede220
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:8aa4caef-7dc2-8a02-2b77-33ebf4ede220
msgctxt "hff77ded2gcf8ag451bg8bc9gcb55fa104610"
msgid "Worried about your precious hides, the both of you."
msgstr "괜히 다치고 싶지 않아서 끼리끼리 몸 사리는구먼."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8c515da2-bc4f-1ec4-4a2b-d5f575d31b8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:8c515da2-bc4f-1ec4-4a2b-d5f575d31b8a
msgctxt "h07af638bgf9b4g4bdcg8b4agec3374622cd4"
msgid "What even is this relic?"
msgstr "그 유물이라는 게 대체 뭐야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8dbd4742-13c4-acb2-ca67-d05972eab033
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:8dbd4742-13c4-acb2-ca67-d05972eab033
msgctxt "hc4518d49g7b78g4612g9267gcbadb5a42f6e"
msgid "Best of luck. Hope your next contract's more fruitful."
msgstr "행운을 빌지. 다음엔 좀 더 좋은 의뢰를 따냈으면 좋겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 8fa2a231-3759-716e-4514-3476a4c02b3d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Knows_IsMissing = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Druid.LearnedLostHalsin(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:8fa2a231-3759-716e-4514-3476a4c02b3d
msgctxt "h99776505gd09eg4018ga098g5efd33775801"
msgid ""
"It's a druids' grove - fella in charge went by the name Halsin. He ain't "
"here anymore, though."
msgstr "드루이드 숲이고, 할신이라는 양반이 여기 책임자야. 이젠 여기 없지만 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 917c7635-95f4-2d79-a7dd-626253e1bd64
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DROWELF or DROWHALFELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:917c7635-95f4-2d79-a7dd-626253e1bd64
msgctxt "hbbbe7e9bg329cg40d3gb58ag02e49caaa113"
msgid "Ah, backstabbing. This feels just like home."
msgstr "아, 서로 물어뜯는 모습이라. 고향에 온 기분인걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 927cd8d3-2402-d557-2050-4041486bda61
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:927cd8d3-2402-d557-2050-4041486bda61
msgctxt "h782d844cga742g4b5fg88bdgdc8771d5c43b"
msgid "Thanks."
msgstr "고마워."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 948e3c30-24e2-8d73-71dd-61f4be78b77f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:948e3c30-24e2-8d73-71dd-61f4be78b77f
msgctxt "hfba3b8cag58d5g4db9gb920g639e56d197b2"
msgid "<i>Foulbloods</i> ain't known for courage."
msgstr "<i>더러운 혈통</i>은 용기란 걸 모르니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 979e57e4-512b-9bb5-c20d-f26fff790af6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:979e57e4-512b-9bb5-c20d-f26fff790af6
msgctxt "hf5982734g01e9g414bgae8eg7c831b37cebf"
msgid ""
"Spare me the chilling warnings and just tell me where I can find this thing."
msgstr "살 떨리는 경고는 됐으니까 그 유물을 어디서 찾을 수 있는지나 알려주지그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 995c5b29-baeb-86dc-a4bc-a09d1515987f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:995c5b29-baeb-86dc-a4bc-a09d1515987f
msgctxt "h8ce05a82g025eg48b5g98c8g39a4b0bddf27"
msgid "We have people to protect. Let us work towards that."
msgstr "우리에겐 지켜야 할 이들이 있지. 거기에 집중하도록 하세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9a877fd7-9c18-8272-2b30-e1785bb844da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(2) = False
#.      - HALFORC(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:9a877fd7-9c18-8272-2b30-e1785bb844da
msgctxt "h7ba84b4ag77dag4cdfgbaffgafc894b19933"
msgid ""
"If you want me to take both of you down, I will. Otherwise, knock it off."
msgstr "둘 다 내 손에 쓰러지고 싶으면 좋을대로 해. 아니면, 당장 멈추라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9a9f00cf-942d-ee7e-4ba9-a8be3ebe61e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BALDURIAN(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:9a9f00cf-942d-ee7e-4ba9-a8be3ebe61e6
msgctxt "hc0e299e4g8103g4322ga3d4g4ba7c610a145"
msgid ""
"There are cut-throats there who'll leave you empty-handed <i>and</i> dead, "
"just so you know."
msgstr "참고로 말하는데, 거기도 잘못 걸리면 빈털터리는 <i>물론</i> 시체 신세 되는 건 마찬가지라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 9cd884d0-f0b9-6281-a7bc-a672020140e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:9cd884d0-f0b9-6281-a7bc-a672020140e1
msgctxt "h961fb472g89fbg43a3g9422g3688926e6366"
msgid "Show some respect! This man saved your pathetic life."
msgstr "무례하게 굴지 마라! 이 사람은 네 한심한 목숨을 구해줬다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 9cd884d0-f0b9-6281-a7bc-a672020140e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:9cd884d0-f0b9-6281-a7bc-a672020140e1
msgctxt "he18a4549g941dg4f69ga365gd2bf1ca8b6e4"
msgid "Show some respect! This woman saved your pathetic life."
msgstr "무례하게 굴지 마라! 이 사람은 네 한심한 목숨을 구해줬다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 9cd884d0-f0b9-6281-a7bc-a672020140e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:9cd884d0-f0b9-6281-a7bc-a672020140e1
msgctxt "h9a997e63g9f87g4451ga7fegad9874f1aefb"
msgid "Show some respect! If not for them, your pathetic life would be over."
msgstr "무례하게 굴지 마라! 이 사람이 없었다면 네 한심한 인생은 끝났을 거라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = a27def12-9ba6-d9ca-830d-4a1fab8e7841
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_AdventurersQuest_Knows_AradinStory = True
#. TagRule: TIEFLING
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:a27def12-9ba6-d9ca-830d-4a1fab8e7841
msgctxt "hee73d74cg9191g4254gb546gdb432ec88643"
msgid "I'm out."
msgstr "난 간다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = a27def12-9ba6-d9ca-830d-4a1fab8e7841
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_AdventurersQuest_Knows_AradinStory = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:a27def12-9ba6-d9ca-830d-4a1fab8e7841
msgctxt "h698d30d0g5e8bg4bcegb864g7a827fcff0b7"
msgid "Watch yourself. I'm out."
msgstr "조심해라. 난 간다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a31d5020-b120-fc21-4977-1590900784db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BALDURIAN(2) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_DARK_URGE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:a31d5020-b120-fc21-4977-1590900784db
msgctxt "h56216710gf775g418agbf07g73e377eff75d"
msgid ""
"The Gate will take you for all you're worth with a smile. I remember it now. "
"<i>My kind of place.</i>"
msgstr "발더스 게이트는 웃는 낯으로 코 베어 가는 곳이야. 이제 기억이 나는군. <i>나랑 딱 맞는 곳이지.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a31d5020-b120-fc21-4977-1590900784db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BALDURIAN(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:a31d5020-b120-fc21-4977-1590900784db
msgctxt "h96fbdf3egbdf4g4708g9d42gaf2e3a3e7c25"
msgid ""
"The Gate will take you for all you're worth with a smile. At least goblins "
"rob you proper."
msgstr "발더스 게이트는 웃는 낯으로 코 베어 가는 곳이야. 적어도 고블린 놈들은 당당하게 털어먹기라도 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = a4b67581-e00d-39e8-42eb-dbe770b8a7a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:a4b67581-e00d-39e8-42eb-dbe770b8a7a0
msgctxt "h8f42702bg798dg43d6gb56ag4aee5d6f5192"
msgid "Aradin Beno. Leader of the Beno Boys. Adventurers for hire 'n all."
msgstr "나는 아라딘 베노다. 베노 보이즈의 리더이자 용병 모험가지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = a6e38ed8-9b10-90fb-1e29-ee1de94e19f1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:a6e38ed8-9b10-90fb-1e29-ee1de94e19f1
msgctxt "h422ec8c1ge471g45e4g9f40g9455d2611f09"
msgid ""
"He was right, though. Coming back to this hellhole was a mistake no amount "
"of gold can put right."
msgstr "다만 저치 말은 맞아. 억만금을 준대도 피할 이딴 지옥 구덩이에 돌아와서는 안 됐는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a74763f4-86b6-1631-673a-cee6777a13ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:a74763f4-86b6-1631-673a-cee6777a13ea
msgctxt "h1d65a4cdg8691g4c2cgbc83g3295042fff88"
msgid "I prefer to settle matters with my own hands."
msgstr "문제가 생기면 내 손으로 끝을 보는 편을 좋아하거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = a7c1bc6f-985e-c00c-5859-c3138498fbd0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Knows_IsMissing = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Druid.LearnedLostHalsin(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:a7c1bc6f-985e-c00c-5859-c3138498fbd0
msgctxt "h7eb0a15cgf556g47acga6b1g039a25902538"
msgid ""
"You're outta luck. Halsin - druid who runs this place - knew his stuff. But "
"he ain't here anymore."
msgstr "운이 없구먼. 할신이라고, 여기 굴리는 드루이드가 치유사 노릇을 했지. 근데 이젠 여기 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = a8270ed0-0c8c-c9c5-1b2f-e3d044c1be5d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:a8270ed0-0c8c-c9c5-1b2f-e3d044c1be5d
msgctxt "ha2a58bc9g0aebg434fg9c13gadf709284da0"
msgid "My gods, you're a coward."
msgstr "나 원, 이 비겁한 자식."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = a870cc90-3e3b-7968-c4ff-ff77ffa027fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_Apprentice_Knows_HeardAboutNettie_PartialInfo = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Apprentice.LearnedNettieNearby_NoName(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:a870cc90-3e3b-7968-c4ff-ff77ffa027fc
msgctxt "h3ac8d8b4ge124g4cb5gb55dg5ed4dbda79ee"
msgid ""
"Think he's got an apprentice running around somewheres, though. Nadine? "
"Natalie? Something like that."
msgstr "대신 그 양반 제자가 여기 어딘가에 있는 걸로 알아. 나딘? 나탈리? 뭐 그 비슷한 이름이었는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = a995dced-7035-59de-d303-00c97a93ceff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:a995dced-7035-59de-d303-00c97a93ceff
msgctxt "h211e3895g7d12g4704gaf3cg81a5bf8eda7b"
msgid "My duty is to this camp."
msgstr "내 의무는 이 야영지를 지키는 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a9a368fc-61a7-b151-08ab-bc5165e8004e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:a9a368fc-61a7-b151-08ab-bc5165e8004e
msgctxt "hfce8768fg0b1eg4238gb4d7gba3d4c45e5be"
msgid "What would be nice is a healer. Do me a favour and point me to one."
msgstr "이쪽은 치유사가 있으면 멋지겠거든? 어디 있는지 좀 알려주면 좋겠는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = aaa831f7-5801-9ae5-4cd2-500ebff12a05
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:aaa831f7-5801-9ae5-4cd2-500ebff12a05
msgctxt "hcb73c101g87e2g4fecgbe64g7c4a67f3efd3"
msgid "We was running for our lives."
msgstr "우린 목숨 건사하려던 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b01a214a-77cc-14d8-5046-d68a485a9147
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_AdventurersQuest_Knows_AradinStory = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:b01a214a-77cc-14d8-5046-d68a485a9147
msgctxt "h80648b00g1fa0g4337ga5ebged85a9713627"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b02fbccd-4286-3637-01ba-72532d3253d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:b02fbccd-4286-3637-01ba-72532d3253d0
msgctxt "hce9ec752g4e5fg4275gbb3bg9050e3108d42"
msgid "*You see the tiefling's jaw clench. He's about to erupt.*"
msgstr "*티플링이 이를 악무는 것이 보입니다. 곧 폭발할 기세로군요.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = b0d5e1b5-2b7a-b455-1fae-e1b403ee6d93
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:b0d5e1b5-2b7a-b455-1fae-e1b403ee6d93
msgctxt "ha1d6ffa1g22dfg4195g83e5g8cfa7c4c3785"
msgid ""
"Far enough that I ain't sure we'll make it back in one piece. And before you "
"ask, I ain't takin' tag-alongs."
msgstr "몸 성히 돌아갈 수 있을지 확신이 안 들 정도만큼 멀리 있지. 그리고 미리 말하는데, 동행 구할 생각 따위 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = b1d707bf-c37e-3615-226f-ea52e5882502
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - SHA_Nightsong.LearnedLocation(2) = True
#.     - SHA_Nightsong.HeardOf(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:b1d707bf-c37e-3615-226f-ea52e5882502
msgctxt "hdfb86b52gea33g40cdg9a1fg2e77079c7425"
msgid ""
"It's called the Nightsong. Supposed to be hidden under the temple where the "
"goblins jumped us."
msgstr "유물 이름은 밤의 노래야. 고블린이 우릴 덮친 그 신전 지하 어딘가에 숨겨져 있다고 하더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b34bda3a-52ab-b12d-8f07-ef45fc81f1d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: MeleeUnarmedAttack
#. RollAbility:
#. DifficultyClass: 0
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:b34bda3a-52ab-b12d-8f07-ef45fc81f1d6
msgctxt "hbf62a8d5gb99cg4e4cg95bbg6b7fcadf0e67"
msgid "<i>Aim a blow at the human.</i>"
msgstr "<i>인간에게 한 방 먹일 준비를 한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b69c1c0a-db92-1944-6b6c-be7a8905fb26
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Strength
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:b69c1c0a-db92-1944-6b6c-be7a8905fb26
msgctxt "h14748ec6g34e8g4703ga9b9g65b70a3796d8"
msgid "<i>Aim a blow at the human, trying to knock him flat on his back.</i>"
msgstr "<i>인간이 나가떨어지도록 한 방 날릴 준비 한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b7fc223f-6d66-4608-b78d-93e872cc6406
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:b7fc223f-6d66-4608-b78d-93e872cc6406
msgctxt "h9658c9b5g47d9g4448g94fegbbc0124629b0"
msgid ""
"Somebody had to. Just tell me what this place is - I feel magic in the trees."
msgstr "뭐라도 해야 했으니까. 여기가 어떤 데인지나 말해 줘. 나무들에서 마법이 느껴지는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b7fc223f-6d66-4608-b78d-93e872cc6406
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:b7fc223f-6d66-4608-b78d-93e872cc6406
msgctxt "h0747073fg56cbg4219gaa3dgef3774e5c4cc"
msgid "I didn't do it for your praise. Just tell me what this place is."
msgstr "그쪽 칭찬 받자고 한 일 아니야. 여기가 어떤 데인지나 말해 줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = bbaa7cae-a938-bed8-a4a9-aca327038a62
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:bbaa7cae-a938-bed8-a4a9-aca327038a62
msgctxt "hd632526egf5e9g4fe4gbe82g3ebc2cca363e"
msgid "We lost him back at the ruins - whole place is crawling with gobbos."
msgstr "폐허에서 그치를 잃어버렸어. 고보 새끼들로 득실댔지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bd55cea0-a19c-bfa6-368d-ac3c0a2f974e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:bd55cea0-a19c-bfa6-368d-ac3c0a2f974e
msgctxt "h4f7a8409gfc58g4b15gbed3g7efd49f7615d"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = bfc46868-6711-0916-8312-2eeb183e40ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - DEN_AdventurersQuest_HasMet_ALeader(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:bfc46868-6711-0916-8312-2eeb183e40ab
msgctxt "h2e4059dbgba6fg402eg845eg4028543a090e"
msgid "Nice."
msgstr "멋지네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = c359e858-ccdb-f24a-c287-25cd3f9f43a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:c359e858-ccdb-f24a-c287-25cd3f9f43a6
msgctxt "h56802774gd14cg487dg8575g1b52410ba0c5"
msgid "Tell that to the dead at the gate."
msgstr "관문 쪽에 죽은 이한테 그리 말해 보게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = c580f607-c1b8-5868-0c3f-008dd83c5afe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:c580f607-c1b8-5868-0c3f-008dd83c5afe
msgctxt "h3303dfebgf1e9g434ega3f6gab3c5067f4e7"
msgid ""
"If you head that way, you'll likely smell 'em or hear their drums before you "
"see 'em."
msgstr "그쪽으로 가면, 직접 보기도 전에 악취랑 북소리로 놈들을 알아차릴 수 있을 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = c63d611f-0719-27b3-7aff-f7a8fcee8cfa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:c63d611f-0719-27b3-7aff-f7a8fcee8cfa
msgctxt "h7670f747gd0a7g4969g92e0g9d002af95c12"
msgid "Well, I didn't ask for any goddamn help."
msgstr "나는 빌어먹을 도움 따위 요청한 적 없는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = c6aa1a75-9404-a001-507b-aa7196e2c6ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:c6aa1a75-9404-a001-507b-aa7196e2c6ef
msgctxt "hdf7f5109ga544g44a9g8c92gf964e802c9e8"
msgid "That's... that, I suppose."
msgstr "그건... 수고를 덜었군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c7945f68-f5cf-d26e-8db7-976a358a23b0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:c7945f68-f5cf-d26e-8db7-976a358a23b0
msgctxt "h8d502edag01b6g4156g9e57g6049b52ddccc"
msgid "<i>Let him speak.</i>"
msgstr "<i>계속 떠들게 놔둔다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c85c2341-f3e4-f8ad-2f96-9efa5df3203b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:c85c2341-f3e4-f8ad-2f96-9efa5df3203b
msgctxt "h7a604ee9g20d1g4565g944fg24ddc37e5594"
msgid "I'm sure you think so. Now point me to a healer."
msgstr "아무렴 그러시겠지. 이제 치유사가 어디 있는지나 알려줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c8c34759-b1f4-5f00-2a4a-9c30d2f1903e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:c8c34759-b1f4-5f00-2a4a-9c30d2f1903e
msgctxt "h825388e9g3e9fg4935g9b76ga572c46b4f7b"
msgid "No points for effort. Care to tell me what this place is?"
msgstr "참 쓸데없는 노력이네. 여기가 어딘지나 얘기해주지 않겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cabb57c8-99af-e77e-ba37-a6446d4d4188
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:cabb57c8-99af-e77e-ba37-a6446d4d4188
msgctxt "h34d83125g7c71g4498g86c6g73d7e96d264e"
msgid "And you left him where, exactly?"
msgstr "그 사람을 정확히 어디서 잃어버린 건데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d1711118-f84f-cc00-11e5-cd43bfb40e65
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:d1711118-f84f-cc00-11e5-cd43bfb40e65
msgctxt "h65d94a0cg565cg47b8g808egd4b94cf83e2f"
msgid "*The human's eye twitches. He's about to blow.*"
msgstr "*인간의 눈이 씰룩거립니다. 일을 낼 기세로군요.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = d29df6da-d5ad-1d69-dac3-2d9c0e4c4b9c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:d29df6da-d5ad-1d69-dac3-2d9c0e4c4b9c
msgctxt "h9a2d40dbg5a66g40a0g83bbgfceae4ee4f26"
msgid "Stuff your payment. I didn't ask for any goddamn help."
msgstr "수고비는 개뿔. 내가 너한테 도와달라고 사정했냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = d39a6f0b-fc3e-4460-b2b9-53e221162524
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:d39a6f0b-fc3e-4460-b2b9-53e221162524
msgctxt "hcd29a25fg370dg4768gb3b6g2b3767b860e2"
msgid "True enough. City's got pubs, though, don't it?"
msgstr "그야 그런데, 도시엔 술집이 있잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = d4f62337-f87b-9145-f51e-1b4c2170482c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:d4f62337-f87b-9145-f51e-1b4c2170482c
msgctxt "had7365cdg6e8cg45d5g9ec1g99186fbf1c19"
msgid "We need to pack up and leave. Immediately."
msgstr "떠날 채비에 들어가야 해. 당장."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = e141e76d-32e7-c11e-f9e2-6897df9211f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Knows_WentWithAdventurers = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:e141e76d-32e7-c11e-f9e2-6897df9211f5
msgctxt "hac4acd0dge426g4e70gbf61ga19ee3a813e9"
msgid ""
"Gobbos are holed up in the temple ruins out west of here - last I saw "
"Halsin, he was right in the thick of 'em."
msgstr "여기서 서쪽으로 가면 고보들이 짱박힌 신전 폐허가 있어. 마지막으로 할신을 봤을 땐, 놈들에게 둘러싸여 있었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = e31215e2-77e6-ec40-a849-7308b9c02066
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - DEN_AdventurersQuest_State_HasContract(0) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - DEN_AdventurersQuest_Event_GiveContract(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:e31215e2-77e6-ec40-a849-7308b9c02066
msgctxt "he6fb3105gecefg4831g8969g26191b40e210"
msgid ""
"All I've got's the contract. It'll show you where we turned back, if you "
"feel like dying."
msgstr "내가 가진 건 의뢰서뿐이야. 우리가 물러난 곳 위치가 적혀있지. 명줄 안 아깝다면 한번 가 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = e45b2759-e3fa-cdfc-bee7-20bffb6e78db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:e45b2759-e3fa-cdfc-bee7-20bffb6e78db
msgctxt "hdf986bdageff9g423dg9fbcg215f7cf1714f"
msgid "But look, if you're itching to meet Kelemvor, I won't stop you."
msgstr "그래도 뭐, 네 소원이 일찍 켈렘보르 만나는 거라면, 굳이 말리진 않겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e553a843-ba9f-39ce-1c45-2b4ce8d9b2c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:e553a843-ba9f-39ce-1c45-2b4ce8d9b2c9
msgctxt "h3141a5aag2e01g4affg8fcbg5cd0ddab504b"
msgid ""
"Before you go, let me see that contract. Maybe I'll fare better than you did."
msgstr "가기 전에, 그 의뢰에 대해 알려줘. 나라면 더 잘 처리할 수 있을지도 몰라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = e7413446-5162-1b26-7664-7ba9bebe230e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:e7413446-5162-1b26-7664-7ba9bebe230e
msgctxt "hd66498e4g289fg4272g9b10ge93937e17e11"
msgid ""
"But all that gold ain't gonna do you any good if you're too cold to spend it."
msgstr "근데 뒈지고 나면 거금이고 나발이고 그게 다 무슨 소용이냐고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = e9531d39-9439-1a52-66a7-5f43bdf4fa2d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:e9531d39-9439-1a52-66a7-5f43bdf4fa2d
msgctxt "h019d2d46gb507g4eedg9425g76013d92358a"
msgid "He <i>trusted </i>you."
msgstr "그는 널 <i>믿었다</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = f2190ba0-925d-d60f-17c1-bf164a16919f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:f2190ba0-925d-d60f-17c1-bf164a16919f
msgctxt "h2527f8b8g8b5cg4cadgacafg80643aeec3bd"
msgid "If I knew that, I wouldn't be back <i>here </i>with half my crew gone."
msgstr "그걸 내가 알면, 동료만 절반 잃은 채 빈손으로 <i>여기</i> 돌아왔겠냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f2c35b83-8670-f1fb-e3b9-8badc37537b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BALDURIAN(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:f2c35b83-8670-f1fb-e3b9-8badc37537b3
msgctxt "h5cb60a7cg7ae8g4c9cgb336g00929f4201cf"
msgid "Baldur's Gate is legendary. I've never clapped eyes on it, personally."
msgstr "발더스 게이트는 전설적인 도시지. 내 눈으로 직접 본 적은 없지만 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = f3487b10-da9f-d879-394f-9038c4858f01
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:f3487b10-da9f-d879-394f-9038c4858f01
msgctxt "h07c0195dg639ag4ba4ga569g2618966e89db"
msgid ""
"Relic's supposedly hidden underneath a temple 'round these parts, and he'll "
"pay gobloads for it."
msgstr "이 지역 신전 밑에 유물이 숨겨져 있을 거라면서, 그걸 구해오면 거금을 주겠다더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f36676ce-3094-4c40-f1d3-e3aabe89ecca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:f36676ce-3094-4c40-f1d3-e3aabe89ecca
msgctxt "h42b1fe73g889bg4d67g93ecg479ea09d54f4"
msgid "Got a healer in your crew?"
msgstr "그쪽 일행 중에 치유사가 있어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f3be0ec0-8d7e-b3ad-7fcb-a15eca9e9a1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:f3be0ec0-8d7e-b3ad-7fcb-a15eca9e9a1f
msgctxt "hf2a82ac3g3350g40f7g8189g2c699c30c814"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = f4cb1110-9f18-a26b-6fea-304ef16bde29
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_PlayerDidTheKO = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - TIEFLING(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:f4cb1110-9f18-a26b-6fea-304ef16bde29
msgctxt "hb2cff5cdga31eg48d7ga733g2d1cb7c3e4e3"
msgid "Look me up if you're ever in the city. I owe you a pint."
msgstr "혹시 도시에 오거든 날 만나러 와. 한잔 쏠 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fdd14eaf-97b7-589c-f587-8a88721d28ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BALDURIAN(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:fdd14eaf-97b7-589c-f587-8a88721d28ef
msgctxt "h49e0e81eg5c38g4ffdga2a5gf975fd8b0dc2"
msgid "Haven't seen any signs of a city in these parts. How far is it?"
msgstr "이 지역은 도시 흔적이 코빼기도 보이지 않던데. 도시랑 얼마나 먼 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fe2b6c95-3d43-2196-c298-87e2b97dee6c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_Confrontation:fe2b6c95-3d43-2196-c298-87e2b97dee6c
msgctxt "hc73043e3ga0e8g4e4cgbe66g9f77ad66f1ee"
msgid ""
"What's unbelievable is how we beat the goblins! You're both <i>heroes</i>."
msgstr "믿을 수 없는 건 우리가 어찌 고블린들을 물리쳤는가지! 여러분은 <i>영웅</i>이야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_OpenGate
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = b8699c31-bfea-3c46-9cfc-484c0c8c15cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_OpenDenGate = True
#.     - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_GatekeeperToLever = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_OpenGate:b8699c31-bfea-3c46-9cfc-484c0c8c15cd
msgctxt "h21f540b7g3978g4f84gbd65g24e4bc1daf50"
msgid "Open the gate!"
msgstr "관문을 열어라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_OpenGate
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = fbbe9997-5bcb-dd86-135d-86c17d5f84aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_Tadpole.LearnedGroveSituation(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_OpenGate:fbbe9997-5bcb-dd86-135d-86c17d5f84aa
msgctxt "h1e11d56dga750g42bfg8a89g122165becf16"
msgid "That was the last of them. Inside - all of you. More may follow."
msgstr "전부 다 해치웠군. 모두 안으로! 놈들이 더 올지도 몰라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1e90a902-fbf2-45b7-9dc6-9cc15c2eca20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_KnockOutAdventurer = True
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_PlayerDidTheKO = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:1e90a902-fbf2-45b7-9dc6-9cc15c2eca20
msgctxt "h9cc3823ag863cg4004gbd5bgc0d57705c338"
msgid "Nice punch. Maybe next time, try a simple hello."
msgstr "주먹 좀 쓰네. 근데 다음부턴 평범히 인사만 하자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1e90a902-fbf2-45b7-9dc6-9cc15c2eca20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_KnockOutAdventurer = True
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_PlayerDidTheKO = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:1e90a902-fbf2-45b7-9dc6-9cc15c2eca20
msgctxt "hfba5befbgca51g42d2ga45fg86f6a2477ce7"
msgid "Pitiful punch. Is the man made of paper?"
msgstr "맥빠진 주먹질이군. 저놈은 뭔 종이로 만들어졌나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1e90a902-fbf2-45b7-9dc6-9cc15c2eca20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_KnockOutAdventurer = True
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_PlayerDidTheKO = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:1e90a902-fbf2-45b7-9dc6-9cc15c2eca20
msgctxt "h05d68fedgf6adg4dcfgbc64gf6db67000e29"
msgid ""
"Nice punch, though be careful you don't spoil our welcome before we get what "
"we need."
msgstr "주먹 좀 쓰네. 필요한 거 얻기도 전에 괜히 눈총 받을 짓은 하지 않았으면 좋겠지만 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1e90a902-fbf2-45b7-9dc6-9cc15c2eca20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_KnockOutAdventurer = True
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_PlayerDidTheKO = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:1e90a902-fbf2-45b7-9dc6-9cc15c2eca20
msgctxt "hdad273dcgd0e6g40d0g936bgb55df51aa998"
msgid "Nicely done."
msgstr "방금 끝내줬어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1e90a902-fbf2-45b7-9dc6-9cc15c2eca20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_KnockOutAdventurer = True
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_PlayerDidTheKO = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:1e90a902-fbf2-45b7-9dc6-9cc15c2eca20
msgctxt "hd27d9c17gfebfg4e71gbc46g8f22763fc914"
msgid "What a shot."
msgstr "한 주먹 하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1e90a902-fbf2-45b7-9dc6-9cc15c2eca20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_KnockOutAdventurer = True
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_PlayerDidTheKO = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:1e90a902-fbf2-45b7-9dc6-9cc15c2eca20
msgctxt "h3eb0d8c6g0491g4f93gb9dcgd8f16821216e"
msgid "You like to make an entrance, don't you?"
msgstr "남들 이목 끄는 걸 좋아하나 봐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1e90a902-fbf2-45b7-9dc6-9cc15c2eca20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_KnockOutAdventurer = True
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_PlayerDidTheKO = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:1e90a902-fbf2-45b7-9dc6-9cc15c2eca20
msgctxt "h0383057dgfcc9g4ac7g9f68g6f2442887dae"
msgid "He'll feel that in the morning."
msgstr "아침 되면 꽤나 지끈거릴걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 332de078-01ad-4054-86d3-840abea96f03
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:332de078-01ad-4054-86d3-840abea96f03
msgctxt "h961260ebgb88ag4c9fg9378gdea6a357b008"
msgid "More goblins on the horizon? Sounds like this place needs a saviour."
msgstr "고블린들이 더 몰려온다라? 구세주가 이곳에 나서줘야 할 듯하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 332de078-01ad-4054-86d3-840abea96f03
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:332de078-01ad-4054-86d3-840abea96f03
msgctxt "hfb288bb6g8affg48eegab4agbea7561f1efa"
msgid "So, more goblins could arrive at any moment? Lovely."
msgstr "고블린이 언제라도 더 들이닥칠 수 있다고? 참 죽이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 332de078-01ad-4054-86d3-840abea96f03
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:332de078-01ad-4054-86d3-840abea96f03
msgctxt "hd4d17affge1d2g4b87ga5b5g7bedff69f1e9"
msgid "You heard them. More goblins could be on their way."
msgstr "얘기 들었지? 고블린이 더 몰려오는 중일지도 몰라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 332de078-01ad-4054-86d3-840abea96f03
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:332de078-01ad-4054-86d3-840abea96f03
msgctxt "h3158a864ge4c5g4621gb68ag0cd28d6b3ef0"
msgid "So, more goblin vermin could be on their way."
msgstr "고블린 버러지들이 더 몰려오는 중일 수 있단 건가."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 332de078-01ad-4054-86d3-840abea96f03
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:332de078-01ad-4054-86d3-840abea96f03
msgctxt "h275d05b8g6a98g4c91ga721g44f2670e1aeb"
msgid "You heard 'em. More goblins on the way. We better move."
msgstr "얘기 들었지? 고블린이 더 올 거래. 얼른 움직이자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 332de078-01ad-4054-86d3-840abea96f03
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:332de078-01ad-4054-86d3-840abea96f03
msgctxt "h46923183gd146g423bg94f2gfbb1770224e9"
msgid "So much for finding a safe haven."
msgstr "안전한 피신처 찾긴 물 건너갔군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 332de078-01ad-4054-86d3-840abea96f03
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:332de078-01ad-4054-86d3-840abea96f03
msgctxt "hba2ef98egc210g4798g8fafgb36dbeafeb76"
msgid "You heard them. More goblins could be on their way."
msgstr "얘기 들었지? 고블린이 더 몰려오는 중일지도 몰라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 55ea3a07-6f41-411b-8369-17b6c1001522
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_KnockOutTiefling = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:55ea3a07-6f41-411b-8369-17b6c1001522
msgctxt "h5e1c98e0g37ecg439fg9adagef244aa6b707"
msgid "Oof - I bet he broke that tiefling's nose. Friendly place."
msgstr "어이쿠, 저 티플링 코가 부러졌겠는걸. 참 살가운 곳이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 55ea3a07-6f41-411b-8369-17b6c1001522
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_KnockOutTiefling = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:55ea3a07-6f41-411b-8369-17b6c1001522
msgctxt "hf9bd6386g82d9g4bb2g8346gaa115100ed57"
msgid "These <i>k'chakhi</i> waste our time with idle bickering."
msgstr "이 <i>크차키</i>들은 쓸데없는 다툼으로 우리의 시간을 낭비하는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 55ea3a07-6f41-411b-8369-17b6c1001522
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_KnockOutTiefling = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:55ea3a07-6f41-411b-8369-17b6c1001522
msgctxt "h5a855618g6b29g4eadg994cg7d48fede8ffc"
msgid ""
"If only he'd fought the goblins with the same vigour he had for that "
"tiefling..."
msgstr "고블린이랑 싸웠을 때도 저 티플링 상대했듯이 싸웠더라면 어땠을까 싶은데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 55ea3a07-6f41-411b-8369-17b6c1001522
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_KnockOutTiefling = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:55ea3a07-6f41-411b-8369-17b6c1001522
msgctxt "h257f1e98g63f3g4576gbc52gb33808b1f8b4"
msgid "A broken tiefling nose. They're as popular here as everywhere else."
msgstr "박살 나는 티플링 코라. 저 양반들은 여기나 딴 데나 받는 대접이 한결같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 55ea3a07-6f41-411b-8369-17b6c1001522
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_KnockOutTiefling = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:55ea3a07-6f41-411b-8369-17b6c1001522
msgctxt "h8df26242g6c32g454fgb919gda91c585bfa6"
msgid "Nice shot. Hope that hatchet-faced fella is ok."
msgstr "제대로 꽂혔네. 저 길쭉하게 생긴 양반, 괜찮아야 할 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 55ea3a07-6f41-411b-8369-17b6c1001522
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_KnockOutTiefling = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:55ea3a07-6f41-411b-8369-17b6c1001522
msgctxt "h49fcbdd1g2b83g42a7g8d82g54c6bb1b37d8"
msgid "That was a brain-rattler. He'll be nursing his head for a tenday."
msgstr "뇌진탕이 다 생겼겠군. 저 양반, 한 열흘은 머리 잘 돌봐야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 55ea3a07-6f41-411b-8369-17b6c1001522
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_KnockOutTiefling = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC and REALLY_TIEFLING
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:55ea3a07-6f41-411b-8369-17b6c1001522
msgctxt "h36029002g2a56g40ebgb999g8427bce12184"
msgid "That bastard broke his nose! What is this place?"
msgstr "저 개자식이 티플링의 코를 박살 냈어! 대체 여긴 뭐 하는 곳이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 55ea3a07-6f41-411b-8369-17b6c1001522
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_KnockOutTiefling = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:55ea3a07-6f41-411b-8369-17b6c1001522
msgctxt "he8be9af6g448cg46a2gb604g17d3225759ae"
msgid "Oof - I bet he broke that tiefling's nose. Friendly place."
msgstr "어이쿠. 저 티플링, 코가 부러졌겠는걸. 참 살가운 곳이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5bfc7daf-e9f5-4e2f-9743-c2ff146a5bd4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:5bfc7daf-e9f5-4e2f-9743-c2ff146a5bd4
msgctxt "h0904b07cgb921g4e21gaff5gcea1e21365f8"
msgid ""
"The situation's tense, clearly. I bet these folks could use a few helping "
"hands."
msgstr "상황이 확실히 안 좋아 보이는군. 이 사람들에게 도움의 손길이 필요할 듯싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5bfc7daf-e9f5-4e2f-9743-c2ff146a5bd4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:5bfc7daf-e9f5-4e2f-9743-c2ff146a5bd4
msgctxt "h50126bbeg96c1g45afga364gbfd0a9fcdcbd"
msgid ""
"Come, let's interrogate the locals. One might have seen other githyanki."
msgstr "따라와. 주민들을 심문하자. 다른 기스양키를 본 자가 하나쯤은 있을 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5bfc7daf-e9f5-4e2f-9743-c2ff146a5bd4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:5bfc7daf-e9f5-4e2f-9743-c2ff146a5bd4
msgctxt "hea19354dge883g4b9agb700g8aee8bce80b7"
msgid ""
"I won't lie, it felt satisfying. But let's not forget we're here to find a "
"healer."
msgstr "솔직히 속은 다 시원하긴 해. 근데 우린 여기 치유사를 찾으러 왔단 걸 까먹진 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5bfc7daf-e9f5-4e2f-9743-c2ff146a5bd4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:5bfc7daf-e9f5-4e2f-9743-c2ff146a5bd4
msgctxt "h9ab4c713g03fdg461eg8adegadc7b46803f1"
msgid ""
"Now that introductions are out of the way, perhaps we can look for a healer."
msgstr "방금 그걸로 자기소개는 다 쫑났으니, 이만 치유사를 찾는 게 어떨까 싶은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5bfc7daf-e9f5-4e2f-9743-c2ff146a5bd4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:5bfc7daf-e9f5-4e2f-9743-c2ff146a5bd4
msgctxt "h147ecb85gf5ceg47f4gb6a6gcc0adc8b3cfc"
msgid "Well, that's that sorted. Wonder where they keep their healers."
msgstr "뭐, 아무튼 정리는 됐군. 얘네 치유사는 어디 짱박혀 있으려나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5bfc7daf-e9f5-4e2f-9743-c2ff146a5bd4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:5bfc7daf-e9f5-4e2f-9743-c2ff146a5bd4
msgctxt "h1c927f78gd5f4g44f3gbf13gea6dc8bef64e"
msgid ""
"If there is a healer here, I hope they don't solve problems with your... "
"enthusiasm."
msgstr "만약 여기 치유사가 있다면, 그네들은 이런 열정적인 처방은 쓰지 않았으면... 좋겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5bfc7daf-e9f5-4e2f-9743-c2ff146a5bd4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:5bfc7daf-e9f5-4e2f-9743-c2ff146a5bd4
msgctxt "h2816ce23g2090g413ag8d70g98fd6e6edc1e"
msgid "Now that that's settled, we can get to finding a healer."
msgstr "대충 일단락은 됐으니, 치유사를 찾아볼 수 있겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a8670000-d7cd-4a89-a5f8-e41d477af6ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_KnockOutTiefling = True
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_PlayerDidTheKO = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:a8670000-d7cd-4a89-a5f8-e41d477af6ef
msgctxt "h803f4ac6gcbe3g4ad9gb168gff5c8d1abcee"
msgid "Nice punch. I bet that'll go over well."
msgstr "주먹 좀 쓰네. 아주 환영받을 짓이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a8670000-d7cd-4a89-a5f8-e41d477af6ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_KnockOutTiefling = True
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_PlayerDidTheKO = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:a8670000-d7cd-4a89-a5f8-e41d477af6ef
msgctxt "h6b02e164g4dafg40f6g91aegd563c816798a"
msgid "Pitiful punch. Is the man made of paper?"
msgstr "맥빠진 주먹질이군. 저놈은 뭔 종이로 만들어졌나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a8670000-d7cd-4a89-a5f8-e41d477af6ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_KnockOutTiefling = True
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_PlayerDidTheKO = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:a8670000-d7cd-4a89-a5f8-e41d477af6ef
msgctxt "heae05d39g4682g4265gad2dge19d2479f297"
msgid "I hope that wasn't a healer you just knocked out."
msgstr "네가 때려눕힌 게 치유사가 아니라면 좋겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a8670000-d7cd-4a89-a5f8-e41d477af6ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_KnockOutTiefling = True
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_PlayerDidTheKO = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:a8670000-d7cd-4a89-a5f8-e41d477af6ef
msgctxt "h85fd561bg2a34g434agb226g5ffc34bddbce"
msgid "Well. That's one way to introduce yourself to the locals."
msgstr "뭐, 여기 사람들한테 자기소개 하난 제대로 박은 셈이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a8670000-d7cd-4a89-a5f8-e41d477af6ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_KnockOutTiefling = True
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_PlayerDidTheKO = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:a8670000-d7cd-4a89-a5f8-e41d477af6ef
msgctxt "hc99d2b7cg8b2ag4898g9247gff4213189880"
msgid "Well. That's one way to make your presence known."
msgstr "뭐, 이걸로 존재감 하나는 제대로 세운 셈이긴 하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a8670000-d7cd-4a89-a5f8-e41d477af6ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_KnockOutTiefling = True
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_PlayerDidTheKO = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:a8670000-d7cd-4a89-a5f8-e41d477af6ef
msgctxt "h40368883gc014g4058g8eb3g8ccbfdb9b30b"
msgid "You like to make an entrance, don't you?"
msgstr "남들 이목 끄는 걸 좋아하나 봐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a8670000-d7cd-4a89-a5f8-e41d477af6ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_KnockOutTiefling = True
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_PlayerDidTheKO = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:a8670000-d7cd-4a89-a5f8-e41d477af6ef
msgctxt "h5a680b48gb2a7g42ccga1bag9a7531df0771"
msgid "He'll feel that in the morning."
msgstr "아침 되면 꽤나 지끈거릴걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b69b7938-b26c-426a-bdcd-219534ac00bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_KnockOutAdventurer = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:b69b7938-b26c-426a-bdcd-219534ac00bf
msgctxt "heea12e61gab98g40f1gb609g53ae28e04be9"
msgid "Oof - I bet he broke that fellow's nose. Friendly place."
msgstr "어이쿠, 저 친구 코가 부러졌겠는걸. 참 살가운 곳이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b69b7938-b26c-426a-bdcd-219534ac00bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_KnockOutAdventurer = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:b69b7938-b26c-426a-bdcd-219534ac00bf
msgctxt "h3490e2c9g3c87g47abg9f3dgeb82c4fe3f46"
msgid "These <i>k'chakhi</i> waste our time with idle bickering."
msgstr "이 <i>크차키</i>들은 쓸데없는 다툼질로 우리 시간을 낭비하는구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b69b7938-b26c-426a-bdcd-219534ac00bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_KnockOutAdventurer = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:b69b7938-b26c-426a-bdcd-219534ac00bf
msgctxt "heb26cabdgd32ag424aga450g820af9f4114e"
msgid ""
"If only they had the same vigour fighting goblins as they did each other..."
msgstr "고블린하고 싸웠을 때도 저렇게 싸웠더라면 어땠을까 싶은데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b69b7938-b26c-426a-bdcd-219534ac00bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_KnockOutAdventurer = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:b69b7938-b26c-426a-bdcd-219534ac00bf
msgctxt "h2e025d94gfb6cg4b84g8167g88378eded165"
msgid ""
"We've only just arrived and they're trying to kill each other. Delicious."
msgstr "막 들어서자마자 보이는 게 서로 죽이려 드는 모습이라니. 참 맛깔 도네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b69b7938-b26c-426a-bdcd-219534ac00bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_KnockOutAdventurer = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:b69b7938-b26c-426a-bdcd-219534ac00bf
msgctxt "h87b5737ag6391g4253g9fd5g6cdbcd9da66e"
msgid "Oof. That looked like it hurt."
msgstr "어우. 저거 아프겠는걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b69b7938-b26c-426a-bdcd-219534ac00bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_KnockOutAdventurer = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:b69b7938-b26c-426a-bdcd-219534ac00bf
msgctxt "h44dfb84bgb8d2g45b6ga2f6g64c4ef01b439"
msgid "That was a brain-rattler. He'll be nursing his head for a tenday."
msgstr "뇌진탕이 다 생겼겠군. 저 친구, 한 열흘은 머리 잘 돌봐야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b69b7938-b26c-426a-bdcd-219534ac00bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_KnockOutAdventurer = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:b69b7938-b26c-426a-bdcd-219534ac00bf
msgctxt "hd9cd0970g83bdg406eg8e5ag2cc1be21f7c7"
msgid "Oof - I bet he broke his nose. Friendly place."
msgstr "어이쿠, 저거 코가 부러졌겠는걸. 참 살가운 곳이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e3724c1b-2af0-4fb7-8466-4022ea6417c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:e3724c1b-2af0-4fb7-8466-4022ea6417c2
msgctxt "h3713ae22gb3a2g4602gb985gec8dec20defe"
msgid ""
"The situation's tense, clearly. I bet these folks could use a few helping "
"hands."
msgstr "상황이 확실히 안 좋아 보이는걸. 이 사람들은 도움의 손길이 간절할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e3724c1b-2af0-4fb7-8466-4022ea6417c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:e3724c1b-2af0-4fb7-8466-4022ea6417c2
msgctxt "h6d53080dgf36ag4ef4gbf97g9be959d2e48d"
msgid ""
"Forget the goblins. Come, let's interrogate the locals. One might have seen "
"other githyanki."
msgstr "고블린엔 신경 꺼라. 따라와. 주민들을 심문하자. 다른 기스양키를 본 자가 하나쯤은 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e3724c1b-2af0-4fb7-8466-4022ea6417c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:e3724c1b-2af0-4fb7-8466-4022ea6417c2
msgctxt "h14b6f2a6gd8ddg4087ga7f8g384b5df48b59"
msgid "Goblins, tieflings, who cares? All that matters is finding a healer."
msgstr "고블린이고, 티플링이고, 알 게 뭐야? 치유사를 찾는 게 제일 중요하다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e3724c1b-2af0-4fb7-8466-4022ea6417c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:e3724c1b-2af0-4fb7-8466-4022ea6417c2
msgctxt "h47c11989g5403g482bg8365gf677e41b55b2"
msgid ""
"Goblins aren't our concern, so long as they stay out of our way. We're here "
"to find a healer."
msgstr "방해만 되지 않는다면, 고블린은 우리 알 바가 아니야. 우린 여기 치유사를 찾으러 온 거라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e3724c1b-2af0-4fb7-8466-4022ea6417c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:e3724c1b-2af0-4fb7-8466-4022ea6417c2
msgctxt "hc0758466gf628g4d28gbe9bgf1ee7e7f6612"
msgid "We can handle goblins. It's this parasite that's got me on my toes."
msgstr "고블린 따위야 별 거 없지. 내가 진짜 거슬리는 건 기생충이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e3724c1b-2af0-4fb7-8466-4022ea6417c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:e3724c1b-2af0-4fb7-8466-4022ea6417c2
msgctxt "hec14c044ge659g4ecbg9515g06b413f34252"
msgid ""
"We'd best deal with them, or their healer will be kept very busy indeed."
msgstr "우리가 나서는 게 좋을 듯싶은데. 치유사가 바빠지면 짬을 못 내 줄 거라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e3724c1b-2af0-4fb7-8466-4022ea6417c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:e3724c1b-2af0-4fb7-8466-4022ea6417c2
msgctxt "h6b2f4b36ge5d2g4df5g8a2ag24a8cf40be6f"
msgid ""
"I'm more worried about this parasite than a few goblins. We need a healer."
msgstr "그까짓 고블린보단 기생충 쪽이 난 더 걱정이야. 치유사를 찾아야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f6493b85-14db-4121-9f8b-59164752982e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:f6493b85-14db-4121-9f8b-59164752982e
msgctxt "he002eaceg4b48g4739gb082g324717b926b8"
msgid ""
"The situation's tense, clearly. I bet these folks could use a few helping "
"hands."
msgstr "상황이 확실히 안 좋아 보이는군. 이 사람들에게 도움의 손길이 필요할 듯싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f6493b85-14db-4121-9f8b-59164752982e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:f6493b85-14db-4121-9f8b-59164752982e
msgctxt "h16004948gbd82g4bd2g85afg047c71549546"
msgid ""
"Come, let's interrogate the locals. One might have seen other githyanki."
msgstr "따라와. 주민들을 심문하자. 다른 기스양키를 본 자가 하나쯤은 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f6493b85-14db-4121-9f8b-59164752982e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:f6493b85-14db-4121-9f8b-59164752982e
msgctxt "h6aa41958gb760g4820gb1f5g6ca49c8678ee"
msgid ""
"Entertaining as it was, let's not forget why we're here. We need a healer."
msgstr "재미있는 볼거리였지만, 여기 온 목적을 까먹진 말자고. 우린 치유사를 찾아야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f6493b85-14db-4121-9f8b-59164752982e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:f6493b85-14db-4121-9f8b-59164752982e
msgctxt "h68ff954fg5af9g4313ga8bfg163faf92a512"
msgid ""
"Let's check for a healer, then move on. Whatever else is happening here "
"isn't our concern."
msgstr "치유사를 찾아본 다음, 바로 뜨자. 여기서 뭔 일이 벌어지든 우리랑은 상관없다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f6493b85-14db-4121-9f8b-59164752982e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:f6493b85-14db-4121-9f8b-59164752982e
msgctxt "hfe750e33g476fg442dg88bcg1addc33bc67c"
msgid "Let's hope the guy who got his clock cleaned isn't the local healer."
msgstr "저 제대로 나가떨어진 양반이 이 동네 치유사가 아니길 빌자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f6493b85-14db-4121-9f8b-59164752982e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:f6493b85-14db-4121-9f8b-59164752982e
msgctxt "hec1496edg05f6g426dg9d9cg7256d542a64d"
msgid ""
"Hardly the intelligent way to solve your problems. I suggest we seek out "
"their healer, then move swiftly onwards."
msgstr "저런 해결 방식은 눈곱만큼도 현명하지 못한 짓이지. 치유사를 찾아보고 나면, 얼른 여길 뜨는 게 좋겠다 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f6493b85-14db-4121-9f8b-59164752982e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_ConfrontationResolved:f6493b85-14db-4121-9f8b-59164752982e
msgctxt "hd293d3e7g6ff3g4644gb895g18dd0931dd30"
msgid "Let's try to avoid any more punching - we need to find a healer."
msgstr "더는 주먹질 터질 일에 엮이지 말자. 우린 치유사를 찾아야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 43ca6d02-76dd-4433-a24e-7eb990c64d4d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated:43ca6d02-76dd-4433-a24e-7eb990c64d4d
msgctxt "h9083b556g34cfg4efdg8161gabb053eb4dae"
msgid "Well, that was bracing."
msgstr "휴, 기분이 다 후련한걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 43ca6d02-76dd-4433-a24e-7eb990c64d4d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated:43ca6d02-76dd-4433-a24e-7eb990c64d4d
msgctxt "hedacd4e2g7bc6g470fg91b1g312a7bed493c"
msgid "Live by the sword, die by the spell - that's what I always say."
msgstr "칼 쓰는 놈들은 주문에 죽어나는 법. 내가 늘 하는 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_Apprentice_PAD_Cyanide
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7048e45d-0f95-4416-a2d3-c3b0f9edf592
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_Apprentice_PAD_Cyanide:7048e45d-0f95-4416-a2d3-c3b0f9edf592
msgctxt "hc796faa6g642dg4c07ga5bag2d8b401a599e"
msgid ""
"Wyvern poison - pah! It'll take more than a nasty drink to finish Lae'zel of "
"Crèche K'liir."
msgstr "와이번 독이라 - 파하! 클리르 양성소의 레이젤을 끝장내려면 더 독해야 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 43ca6d02-76dd-4433-a24e-7eb990c64d4d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated:43ca6d02-76dd-4433-a24e-7eb990c64d4d
msgctxt "hce4267efg65e9g4d63gae90gcd52ac82e6d3"
msgid "Pathetic creatures - made for the sole purpose of slaughtering."
msgstr "한심한 생물들이군. 살육만이 유일한 존재 가치인 것들이라니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 43ca6d02-76dd-4433-a24e-7eb990c64d4d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated:43ca6d02-76dd-4433-a24e-7eb990c64d4d
msgctxt "h655d5738gc0a6g4b91gb584g1375f58386cc"
msgid "Good and dead. The Sword Coast is better off for it."
msgstr "잘 죽었군. 소드 코스트에서 없어지면 좋을 것들이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_Apprentice_PAD_Cyanide
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7048e45d-0f95-4416-a2d3-c3b0f9edf592
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_Apprentice_PAD_Cyanide:7048e45d-0f95-4416-a2d3-c3b0f9edf592
msgctxt "h809d315bgb3ebg47eegb4cegb2355027ef2c"
msgid ""
"Pretty bottle, but I wouldn't take wyvern poison, even if we do begin to "
"turn."
msgstr "예쁜 병이군. 그래도 난 와이번 독은 안 먹을 거야. 뇌변이가 시작되더라도 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 43ca6d02-76dd-4433-a24e-7eb990c64d4d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated:43ca6d02-76dd-4433-a24e-7eb990c64d4d
msgctxt "h8fb88d0cg6432g4279gaf78g7cf66c6144cb"
msgid ""
"That was invigorating. There's nothing like a good killing to loosen up the "
"joints."
msgstr "기운 솟는 싸움이었어. 적을 맛깔나게 죽이는 것만큼 몸 풀기 딱 좋은 건 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_Apprentice_PAD_Cyanide
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7048e45d-0f95-4416-a2d3-c3b0f9edf592
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_Apprentice_PAD_Cyanide:7048e45d-0f95-4416-a2d3-c3b0f9edf592
msgctxt "h93c642dbg45c1g48f5g8bf5gc759f91415b5"
msgid "Wyvern poison? No thanks."
msgstr "와이번 독? 난 됐어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 43ca6d02-76dd-4433-a24e-7eb990c64d4d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated:43ca6d02-76dd-4433-a24e-7eb990c64d4d
msgctxt "h1a563f45g441bg4810gacbagf25f40d7b5a1"
msgid ""
"Hope their people will come collect their remains. Everyone deserves a good "
"burial."
msgstr "고블린들이 자기네 동족 시신 수습하러 오면 좋겠네. 그 누구라도 장례는 제대로 받아야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 43ca6d02-76dd-4433-a24e-7eb990c64d4d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated:43ca6d02-76dd-4433-a24e-7eb990c64d4d
msgctxt "he80e5efeg048bg44b8gb479ge71c327fd723"
msgid "It's done - good."
msgstr "끝났군. 좋아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_Apprentice_PAD_Cyanide
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 778229d9-3412-453e-85ff-ce414a7f49dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_Apprentice_PAD_Cyanide:778229d9-3412-453e-85ff-ce414a7f49dc
msgctxt "h495f3cb9g8bf6g4442gadc4gc25a291b6593"
msgid ""
"Better to have more options than fewer. If you start sprouting tentacles, "
"I'll pour it down your throat myself."
msgstr "선택지야 많을수록 좋지. 네 몸에 촉수가 나기 시작하면, 내가 먼저 네 목구멍에 그걸 부어버릴 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 93d395ba-f283-4510-a852-b522f7a9889b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated:93d395ba-f283-4510-a852-b522f7a9889b
msgctxt "hd892e220g166fg4177ga5a7gf0179c204d22"
msgid "There must be more, wherever they came from."
msgstr "분명 딴 놈들이 더 있겠지. 저 어디든 간에 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_Apprentice_PAD_Cyanide
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 778229d9-3412-453e-85ff-ce414a7f49dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_Apprentice_PAD_Cyanide:778229d9-3412-453e-85ff-ce414a7f49dc
msgctxt "hb94b1dd7g39dbg486dg8deega4ebf229a75b"
msgid ""
"Oh, I don't know. I can think of worse deaths than toasting to you all with "
"a wyvern sour."
msgstr "오, 난 잘 모르겠는데. 와이번 칵테일로 다 같이 건배하는 게 최악은 아닐 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 93d395ba-f283-4510-a852-b522f7a9889b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated:93d395ba-f283-4510-a852-b522f7a9889b
msgctxt "h04cdb5d5gcce3g4602gba6dg2e75b3917c9c"
msgid "A taste of goblins to come, I fear. There must be a horde nearby."
msgstr "이 정도는 고작 맛보기에 불과하겠지. 분명 근처에 패거리가 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_Apprentice_PAD_Cyanide
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 778229d9-3412-453e-85ff-ce414a7f49dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_Apprentice_PAD_Cyanide:778229d9-3412-453e-85ff-ce414a7f49dc
msgctxt "he267111cg8eafg4ee0g8ce6gf780c4b5dadb"
msgid ""
"Hear, hear. If you turn, I'd rather slit that pretty neck of yours myself, "
"anyway."
msgstr "한번 들어봐. 만약 네가 변이하면, 내가 직접 그 예쁜 목을 베어줄게, 어떻게든 말야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 93d395ba-f283-4510-a852-b522f7a9889b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated:93d395ba-f283-4510-a852-b522f7a9889b
msgctxt "h6ad43e92g76e5g4d49g9efcg816baf637719"
msgid ""
"I just wonder if the grubby little beasts had any friends. And if they're "
"nearby."
msgstr "이 너저분한 짐승 놈들이 따로 더 있을지 궁금한걸. 이 근처에 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_Apprentice_PAD_Cyanide
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 778229d9-3412-453e-85ff-ce414a7f49dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_Apprentice_PAD_Cyanide:778229d9-3412-453e-85ff-ce414a7f49dc
msgctxt "had33bb7cg50dag4badgb428g6844e4bec636"
msgid "I prefer steel myself. But <i>I </i>was raised well."
msgstr "난 칼을 더 선호하지. 하지만 <i>난</i> 잘 훈련되어있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 93d395ba-f283-4510-a852-b522f7a9889b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated:93d395ba-f283-4510-a852-b522f7a9889b
msgctxt "h3dadc7b1g42fcg44d3gbe7bg0a56afeb1f7f"
msgid "A horde must have settled nearby. More will come, and more after that."
msgstr "근처에 무리 하나가 자리를 잡은 듯하군. 더 몰려오겠지. 계속해서 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_Apprentice_PAD_Cyanide
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 778229d9-3412-453e-85ff-ce414a7f49dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_Apprentice_PAD_Cyanide:778229d9-3412-453e-85ff-ce414a7f49dc
msgctxt "h30f14e6eg9510g4129g8d22gcb7108ec5d1b"
msgid "I'd go ahead and toss that bottle. We won't be needing it."
msgstr "난 그 병을 던져 버리는 게 좋겠어. 우린 필요하지 않을 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 93d395ba-f283-4510-a852-b522f7a9889b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated:93d395ba-f283-4510-a852-b522f7a9889b
msgctxt "h00c132aeg7352g46c0g8afbge9a23ef0efa6"
msgid ""
"A goblin camp must be near. Which means we've not seen the last of them."
msgstr "근처에 고블린 야영지가 있을 거야. 이번 습격이 끝이 아닐 거란 얘기지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_Apprentice_PAD_Cyanide
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 778229d9-3412-453e-85ff-ce414a7f49dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_Apprentice_PAD_Cyanide:778229d9-3412-453e-85ff-ce414a7f49dc
msgctxt "he9329530g6ffdg46b2gb25fg2f53ae6ac833"
msgid ""
"Yeah, if I have to choose between poison and tentacles, I'm going tentacles. "
"Sorry!"
msgstr "그래, 독과 촉수 중 하나를 선택해야 한다면, 난 촉수로 하겠어. 미안!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 93d395ba-f283-4510-a852-b522f7a9889b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated:93d395ba-f283-4510-a852-b522f7a9889b
msgctxt "heb6cd3aeg4cabg4e6egac1cgb871dd4a9be7"
msgid "Might be more around. That enclave looks pretty well fortified, though."
msgstr "근처에 더 있을지도 모르겠어. 이 거주지는 방비가 제법 탄탄해 보여 망정이긴 하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_Apprentice_PAD_Cyanide
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 778229d9-3412-453e-85ff-ce414a7f49dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_Apprentice_PAD_Cyanide:778229d9-3412-453e-85ff-ce414a7f49dc
msgctxt "hd350a809g748fg41abg8a6bg691349b39da7"
msgid ""
"Hopefully we'll be rid of this parasite before we even need to think in that "
"direction."
msgstr "그런 방법을 생각해보기도 전에 기생충을 제거할 수 있었으면 좋겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 93d395ba-f283-4510-a852-b522f7a9889b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated:93d395ba-f283-4510-a852-b522f7a9889b
msgctxt "h9ffbd452gef9bg4a2cg9359g31fac3bb0035"
msgid "They likely have a camp nearby. I'd expect more raiders eventually."
msgstr "분명 근처에 놈들 야영지가 있겠지. 다음 습격은 시간 문제겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d6ea8273-96e3-40d8-99ff-b857566f141a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated:d6ea8273-96e3-40d8-99ff-b857566f141a
msgctxt "hdb22bd11gbf5bg4440ga06bg7499b4ac8420"
msgid ""
"They were tenacious. I wonder what they wanted here - other than bloodshed."
msgstr "꽤 끈질기게 공격하던데. 대체 뭘 바라고 이런 건지 싶네. 유혈극은 빼고 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d6ea8273-96e3-40d8-99ff-b857566f141a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated:d6ea8273-96e3-40d8-99ff-b857566f141a
msgctxt "hfaaa7899ge188g4579gba2cgb7c77fdc967c"
msgid ""
"Quite the fortifications for a wandering band of goblins to try and breach. "
"What drove them to it, I wonder?"
msgstr "고블린 떠돌이 무리가 돌파하기엔 꽤나 요새화된 곳인데. 대체 뭐 때문에 여길 들이박은 걸까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_Apprentice_PAD_Cyanide
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c4fcf291-23ca-426d-b76e-79daff885ff4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_Apprentice_PAD_Cyanide:c4fcf291-23ca-426d-b76e-79daff885ff4
msgctxt "hffd1b2e5gd234g442cg825dg441b5764cb08"
msgid ""
"If we begin to turn, we will die by the blade - not like cowards suckling "
"from a noxious teat."
msgstr "변이가 시작된다면, 우린 싸우다 칼날에 죽을 것이다 - 독이 든 젖꼭지나 빨아대는 겁쟁이가 아니라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d6ea8273-96e3-40d8-99ff-b857566f141a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated:d6ea8273-96e3-40d8-99ff-b857566f141a
msgctxt "hcbeceba3gde63g41adga69ag3ed07b933589"
msgid ""
"A brazen attack, for such lowly creatures. They must have been seeking "
"something - or someone."
msgstr "하등 종족치곤 대담한 공격이었는데. 무언가나 누군가를 노린 공격이었던 게 분명해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_Apprentice_PAD_Cyanide
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c4fcf291-23ca-426d-b76e-79daff885ff4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_Apprentice_PAD_Cyanide:c4fcf291-23ca-426d-b76e-79daff885ff4
msgctxt "h1282ae95g3ee4g4ab8gac42g362da957509f"
msgid ""
"If we <i>do </i>start to turn, I'd prefer a method with a little more flair "
"than poison. Is self-immolation totally passé?"
msgstr "<i>변이</i>가 시작된다면 나는 독보다는 좀 더 세련된 방법이 좋은데. 분신자살은 이제 완전히 한물간 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d6ea8273-96e3-40d8-99ff-b857566f141a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated:d6ea8273-96e3-40d8-99ff-b857566f141a
msgctxt "h8f4decb1g4c94g4699ga879g94a30c6ee570"
msgid ""
"But what were the grubby little beasts after? This place doesn't look like "
"much."
msgstr "근데 이 천박한 짐승 놈들은 대체 뭐 때문에 온 걸까? 여긴 그리 대단한 게 없어 보이는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_Apprentice_PAD_Cyanide
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c4fcf291-23ca-426d-b76e-79daff885ff4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_Apprentice_PAD_Cyanide:c4fcf291-23ca-426d-b76e-79daff885ff4
msgctxt "h69c16c7eg062eg4307ga168g583e5bdb649a"
msgid ""
"Poison's not my style. Nor's becoming a mind flayer. We'll have to make sure "
"to steer clear of both eventualities."
msgstr "독은 내 취향에 안 맞아. 마인드 플레이어가 되는 것도 매한가지고. 그 두 가지 귀결만큼은 반드시 비껴가게끔 해야 할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d6ea8273-96e3-40d8-99ff-b857566f141a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated:d6ea8273-96e3-40d8-99ff-b857566f141a
msgctxt "he91efb9ega9f9g4846g854ag3ffcbe3e371f"
msgid ""
"Standard goblin raiding party. Question is, was it plunder they wanted  - or "
"did they seek something more?"
msgstr "전형적인 고블린 습격대더군. 다만, 약탈이 목적이었던 걸까? 아니면 다른 노림수가 있었던 걸까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_Apprentice_PAD_Cyanide
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c4fcf291-23ca-426d-b76e-79daff885ff4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_Apprentice_PAD_Cyanide:c4fcf291-23ca-426d-b76e-79daff885ff4
msgctxt "hf4371295gc770g49c4g9bd2g524238ab661e"
msgid ""
"Wouldn't take the stuff no matter what. If I'm gonna go, let it be in a "
"blaze of glory."
msgstr "무슨 일이 있어도 저딴 건 안 먹어. 내가 죽어야 된다면 영광스런 불길 속에서 죽는 걸로 하라지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d6ea8273-96e3-40d8-99ff-b857566f141a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated:d6ea8273-96e3-40d8-99ff-b857566f141a
msgctxt "h24819a28g4296g4f43g87b6g50451cd0891f"
msgid "What were they looking for, anyway?"
msgstr "그나저나, 이 녀석들은 왜 쳐들어 온 걸까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d6ea8273-96e3-40d8-99ff-b857566f141a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PAD_RaidersDefeated:d6ea8273-96e3-40d8-99ff-b857566f141a
msgctxt "h43eb1d7agaadag4a39gbee4g407a86e25025"
msgid "Was that an ordinary raid? Seemed a fool's errand."
msgstr "일반적인 습격이었던 건가? 헛수고인 짓이었을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PleaAtTheGate
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 01e85c4b-405a-bf34-f418-94633c3d54c5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PleaAtTheGate:01e85c4b-405a-bf34-f418-94633c3d54c5
msgctxt "h5a9298c5gdc92g4ba9g8590g36ae005bdf77"
msgid "Damnable roach. Provoke the blade..."
msgstr "망할 바퀴벌레 놈들. 이 칼날을 분노케 하였으니..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PleaAtTheGate
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 03efda89-2561-bd9b-4ee3-87288060a04c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PleaAtTheGate:03efda89-2561-bd9b-4ee3-87288060a04c
msgctxt "hb37db737g37fdg407dg9f12gb1dba36cc75c"
msgid "That pack of goblins will be on us any second!"
msgstr "고블린 무리가 곧 들이닥칠 거란 말이야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PleaAtTheGate
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 08b08e26-1b01-20f7-9923-d2f1d12a291b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PleaAtTheGate:08b08e26-1b01-20f7-9923-d2f1d12a291b
msgctxt "h9c9b33e9ga7b0g415cgbb7dg83bb28e73691"
msgid "Please! There's no time!"
msgstr "제발! 시간이 없다고요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PleaAtTheGate
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 393952a8-a672-99de-0bd2-c1b48a46ba19
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PleaAtTheGate:393952a8-a672-99de-0bd2-c1b48a46ba19
msgctxt "h748a0057g8135g42d6g94dfgc137b186d8d7"
msgid "Open the bloody gate!"
msgstr "이 빌어먹을 문 열라고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PleaAtTheGate
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 399b9d25-6851-e79a-ed7b-6e18c99212dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PleaAtTheGate:399b9d25-6851-e79a-ed7b-6e18c99212dd
msgctxt "h6f87ac34g3ac6g41f1gb57agf0e025184d23"
msgid "<i>Kanon. No!</i>"
msgstr "<i>카논, 안 돼!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PleaAtTheGate
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 71d25291-5eac-8b14-a3bb-5461abae3f03
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PleaAtTheGate:71d25291-5eac-8b14-a3bb-5461abae3f03
msgctxt "h407b87b9gc187g45e7gbbf5gcbb837450aec"
msgid "Goblins are on our tail. Open the gate, Zevlor. <i>Now. </i>"
msgstr "고블린이 우릴 뒤쫓고 있어요. 문 열어요, 제블로어. <i>당장. </i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PleaAtTheGate
#. Speaker = Aradin
#. NodeID = 79666c1a-d02d-a633-c597-1713f81a4044
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_RaidingParty_Event_GoblinRaidFight = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PleaAtTheGate:79666c1a-d02d-a633-c597-1713f81a4044
msgctxt "hb75712b7g844bg483eg8d3cg157b8163af69"
msgid "Shit. Form a line!"
msgstr "젠장. 전투 태세 갖춰!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PleaAtTheGate
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 91339277-c2f0-2d26-f659-8429832b50e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PleaAtTheGate:91339277-c2f0-2d26-f659-8429832b50e3
msgctxt "h7380a0d5gb160g444aga016gf467334d77cc"
msgid "You led goblins <i>here</i>? Where is the druid?"
msgstr "고블린 놈들을 <i>여기</i>로 달고 왔어? 드루이드는 어쩌고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PleaAtTheGate
#. Speaker = Kanon
#. NodeID = 9d091bd8-52a6-9e56-93ec-e5007b67ccb6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PleaAtTheGate:9d091bd8-52a6-9e56-93ec-e5007b67ccb6
msgctxt "h7da0bf01gcb1dg47e1ga53fgf4403e0ecf86"
msgid "Nobody gets in. Zevlor's orders."
msgstr "아무도 못 들어와. 제블로어 님의 지시다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PleaAtTheGate
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = e142bc0e-b8da-d626-0123-5ee1044f8bfb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PleaAtTheGate:e142bc0e-b8da-d626-0123-5ee1044f8bfb
msgctxt "h94a646c0g1d99g48a6g952fg71af4421aba6"
msgid "What's going on?"
msgstr "무슨 일인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PleaAtTheGate
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = f0524455-c249-3396-650a-2b60d272cd87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PleaAtTheGate:f0524455-c249-3396-650a-2b60d272cd87
msgctxt "he81e8d98g30ddg4a64g8eccg292d7cc0e6be"
msgid "...and suffer its sting."
msgstr "...그 칼끝을 받아봐라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PleaAtTheGate
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = ffd16185-b053-e69c-6335-8d4feac8eaef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_PleaAtTheGate:ffd16185-b053-e69c-6335-8d4feac8eaef
msgctxt "h82e9f194g8422g4c3cg981dgfa097ebb9597"
msgid "By the Nine Hells. Open the gate!"
msgstr "아홉 지옥 맙소사. 관문을 열어라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_VB_AdventurerLeaderLeaves
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 059a2b58-6c13-803f-24b0-aaf499d03ade
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_VB_AdventurerLeaderLeaves:059a2b58-6c13-803f-24b0-aaf499d03ade
msgctxt "h545ce394g818dg4946g8af3g25aa25cb2689"
msgid "That could have been worse."
msgstr "더 심각해질 수도 있었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_VB_AdventurerLeaderLeaves
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 84456ef8-c5da-421a-959d-e423b94f138f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_VB_AdventurerLeaderLeaves:84456ef8-c5da-421a-959d-e423b94f138f
msgctxt "h517b9c11g59d9g43aeg88e0geb5e1bde27f6"
msgid "For once."
msgstr "그러게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_VB_ApproachingGate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 84a4644d-44cc-3a40-3c63-0748bc9120fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_VB_ApproachingGate:84a4644d-44cc-3a40-3c63-0748bc9120fb
msgctxt "h77858fa1g5f87g4851gb364gc56cb718d266"
msgid "Music to githyanki ears."
msgstr "기스양키에겐 음악 소리지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_VB_ApproachingGate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 84a4644d-44cc-3a40-3c63-0748bc9120fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_VB_ApproachingGate:84a4644d-44cc-3a40-3c63-0748bc9120fb
msgctxt "h021d787dgafe7g46d1ga039gb8581395098a"
msgid "We should check it out - but be careful."
msgstr "살펴보는 게 좋겠군. 조심히 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_VB_ApproachingGate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d96cfa46-fff4-80ab-ba63-c475615b0f91
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_VB_ApproachingGate:d96cfa46-fff4-80ab-ba63-c475615b0f91
msgctxt "h24ad6f89g59d1g499dga61dg6cc8ada2a0a4"
msgid "I hear shouting up ahead."
msgstr "저기서 고함 소리가 들려."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_VB_PeacefulResolution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8ee49380-8660-2077-e4b1-e447d50b7485
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_VB_PeacefulResolution:8ee49380-8660-2077-e4b1-e447d50b7485
msgctxt "hf0baa6faga6bag4b88g93f8g0af7660203aa"
msgid ""
"History? The human's a bigot, and he should have got the beating he deserved."
msgstr "사연? 저 인간 자식은 완전 편견 덩어리였어. 맞을만해서 맞은 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_VB_PeacefulResolution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8ee49380-8660-2077-e4b1-e447d50b7485
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_VB_PeacefulResolution:8ee49380-8660-2077-e4b1-e447d50b7485
msgctxt "hc7866a8fg3621g40eagb904gf6269d297a8c"
msgid "Never mind their history. Let's look for help."
msgstr "저 둘의 사연은 신경 쓸 필요 없어. 도움이나 찾자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_VB_PeacefulResolution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8ee49380-8660-2077-e4b1-e447d50b7485
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_VB_PeacefulResolution:8ee49380-8660-2077-e4b1-e447d50b7485
msgctxt "hc36e342fgd118g4ddbgacb4g2c96ea471100"
msgid "Indeed. Isn't it delightful?"
msgstr "그럼. 아주 감미롭지 않아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_VB_PeacefulResolution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8ee49380-8660-2077-e4b1-e447d50b7485
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_VB_PeacefulResolution:8ee49380-8660-2077-e4b1-e447d50b7485
msgctxt "ha0e9b704g5f54g48b6gb8a6gf270382b29bf"
msgid "Yes. It's a good thing we were here."
msgstr "그래. 우리가 여기 있어서 다행이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_VB_PeacefulResolution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 97fda8f1-d283-405c-b7bf-5af097485572
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RaidingParty_VB_PeacefulResolution:97fda8f1-d283-405c-b7bf-5af097485572
msgctxt "h2eec2701gac13g4633gb442g7713b1fd7ad5"
msgid "Those two must have history."
msgstr "둘 사이에 뭔가 사연이 있는 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RefugeeChef_PAD_KarlachReactsToFood
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 6cf959db-0aad-bc98-5509-eae5d79afc7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_RefugeeChef_PAD_KarlachReactsToFood:6cf959db-0aad-bc98-5509-eae5d79afc7e
msgctxt "haf18450bgbea7g4421ga3f7g77f24f2139b3"
msgid "Mmm. Delicious gruel."
msgstr "음. 맛 좋은 귀리죽이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_AD_BirdSender
#. Speaker = Apikusis
#. NodeID = 43b1ed93-f32e-8651-0b44-684ae32f0642
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 182bb613-b70c-5e7c-b3ea-ea14e02d1fab_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 182bb613-b70c-5e7c-b3ea-ea14e02d1fab_C = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_AD_BirdSender:43b1ed93-f32e-8651-0b44-684ae32f0642
msgctxt "h40eef313gd1edg4484ga711g48d25b61ca80"
msgid "Dark times. And getting darker."
msgstr "어두운 때야. 그리고 점점 어두워지는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_AD_BirdSender
#. Speaker = Apikusis
#. NodeID = 9be3394c-6d41-c224-085e-9f125a18363b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 182bb613-b70c-5e7c-b3ea-ea14e02d1fab_A = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_AD_BirdSender:9be3394c-6d41-c224-085e-9f125a18363b
msgctxt "h65687b2aga1ddg4baaga5e3g4653eb9c3bb8"
msgid "Bring us news, my friend. Bring us hope."
msgstr "소식을 전해 줘, 친구. 희망을 전해 줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_AD_BirdSender
#. Speaker = Apikusis
#. NodeID = c834a385-9540-62e1-16d3-9cb95f03e13b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 182bb613-b70c-5e7c-b3ea-ea14e02d1fab_C = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 182bb613-b70c-5e7c-b3ea-ea14e02d1fab_B = False
#.     - 182bb613-b70c-5e7c-b3ea-ea14e02d1fab_C = False
#.     - 182bb613-b70c-5e7c-b3ea-ea14e02d1fab_A = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_AD_BirdSender:c834a385-9540-62e1-16d3-9cb95f03e13b
msgctxt "h98ec61beg9308g496cg9c97gc3f5f7595793"
msgid "Please return, Master. Before it's too late."
msgstr "제발 돌아오세요, 마스터. 너무 늦기 전에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_AD_BirdSender
#. Speaker = Apikusis
#. NodeID = f1927e79-e7e0-c474-9acc-591f600ce644
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 182bb613-b70c-5e7c-b3ea-ea14e02d1fab_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 182bb613-b70c-5e7c-b3ea-ea14e02d1fab_B = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_AD_BirdSender:f1927e79-e7e0-c474-9acc-591f600ce644
msgctxt "h0039b14eg1b09g4464g92c9g74f5e749afd4"
msgid "Why did you leave, Master?"
msgstr "왜 떠나셨나요, 마스터?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_AD_Ritual
#. Speaker = Aelar
#. NodeID = 1816ab13-944a-455b-db7a-d1abcdd86ebb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_SacredPond_Event_RitualChantD = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_SacredPond_Event_RitualChantE = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_AD_Ritual:1816ab13-944a-455b-db7a-d1abcdd86ebb
msgctxt "h45b3c458g0b42g43d0g8196g467549eec837"
msgid "<i>Ab spiritu humoque, aculeus vitisque.</i>"
msgstr "<i>아브 스피리투 우모크, 아쿨레우스 비티스퀘.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_AD_Ritual
#. Speaker = Aelar
#. NodeID = 40b1ee29-cd94-afa3-1a70-0197373e6698
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_SacredPond_Event_RitualChantB = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_SacredPond_Event_RitualChantC = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_AD_Ritual:40b1ee29-cd94-afa3-1a70-0197373e6698
msgctxt "hd2c4b7d7gd21fg4d12gb9edg6be3a462ded2"
msgid "<i>Defende nos ab imminentibus aequilibrio tuo.</i>"
msgstr "<i>데펜데 노스 아브 임미넨티부스 아이퀼리브리오 투오.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_AD_Ritual
#. Speaker = Aelar
#. NodeID = c52e8159-9658-78ab-d05f-411b69d34b31
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_SacredPond_Event_RitualChantE = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_SacredPond_Event_RitualChantC = False
#.     - DEN_SacredPond_Event_RitualChantA = False
#.     - DEN_SacredPond_Event_RitualChantE = False
#.     - DEN_SacredPond_Event_RitualChantD = False
#.     - DEN_SacredPond_Event_RitualChantB = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_AD_Ritual:c52e8159-9658-78ab-d05f-411b69d34b31
msgctxt "h290e5c77g0f4bg4bc0ga48agce7116fde81d"
msgid "<i>In umbram cretus, sanguine iuratus.</i>"
msgstr "<i>인 움브람 크레투스, 상귀네 이우라투스.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_AD_Ritual
#. Speaker = Aelar
#. NodeID = cbb530c5-6e2c-9d84-ff05-0675ed8113bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_SacredPond_Event_RitualChantC = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_SacredPond_Event_RitualChantD = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_AD_Ritual:cbb530c5-6e2c-9d84-ff05-0675ed8113bc
msgctxt "hd330b36dgd40bg484bg9187gd3f598ad42d2"
msgid "<i>Complexum tuum, ab terra ortum, ad nos defer.</i>"
msgstr "<i>콤플렉숨 투움, 아브 테라 오르툼, 아드 노스 데페르.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_AD_Ritual
#. Speaker = Aelar
#. NodeID = db19a40b-a0e2-8dce-8bc8-b3e2d90e8c7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_SacredPond_Event_RitualChantA = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_SacredPond_Event_RitualChantB = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_AD_Ritual:db19a40b-a0e2-8dce-8bc8-b3e2d90e8c7c
msgctxt "hd2dd1c9egb1bfg4273ga5d9g03c7463b06e1"
msgid "<i>Hostes subeunt. Protege nos. Muni nos.</i>"
msgstr "<i>호스테스 수베운트. 프로테제 노스. 무니 노스.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_AD_Ritual
#. Speaker = Aelar
#. NodeID = e6d27ef8-1702-edf6-d89a-bf4ac9af7cb6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_SacredPond_Event_RitualChantA = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_AD_Ritual:e6d27ef8-1702-edf6-d89a-bf4ac9af7cb6
msgctxt "hc3358841g3b8cg4cefg82abg5d91f5d8da72"
msgid "<i>Aggeniculamur in umbra tua, Pater Arborum.</i>"
msgstr "<i>아제네쿨라무르 인 움브라 투아, 파테르 아르보룸.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_AD_RitualDruid1
#. Speaker = Aelar
#. NodeID = 1d6d3b7d-a9e1-8c97-0f0c-9b8cff9cc0db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 82204916-a2d0-b945-e6aa-a3ee430a348f_A = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_AD_RitualDruid1:1d6d3b7d-a9e1-8c97-0f0c-9b8cff9cc0db
msgctxt "h4a139557g2dd2g4e17g9b97g3f8f3672452a"
msgid "<i>Complexum tuum</i>... it's still in my head."
msgstr "<i>콤플렉숨 투움</i>... 아직도 머리에 맴도는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_AD_RitualDruid1
#. Speaker = Aelar
#. NodeID = 70d41c89-3e7a-ceed-501f-ee808151f63c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 82204916-a2d0-b945-e6aa-a3ee430a348f_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 82204916-a2d0-b945-e6aa-a3ee430a348f_C = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_AD_RitualDruid1:70d41c89-3e7a-ceed-501f-ee808151f63c
msgctxt "he398b575g86dag47cdgaac5g4a0ae02297d1"
msgid "Gods, my head is pounding."
msgstr "신이시여, 머리가 지끈거리네요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_AD_RitualDruid1
#. Speaker = Aelar
#. NodeID = 7fd65ee0-804d-1358-5879-c99a7a117b8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 82204916-a2d0-b945-e6aa-a3ee430a348f_C = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 82204916-a2d0-b945-e6aa-a3ee430a348f_A = False
#.     - 82204916-a2d0-b945-e6aa-a3ee430a348f_B = False
#.     - 82204916-a2d0-b945-e6aa-a3ee430a348f_C = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_AD_RitualDruid1:7fd65ee0-804d-1358-5879-c99a7a117b8a
msgctxt "h3ad0552egf51dg4dbcg8d62g15520169046b"
msgid "Maybe if I just close my eyes..."
msgstr "잠시 눈을 감고 싶어요..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_AD_RitualDruid1
#. Speaker = Aelar
#. NodeID = c719c779-d7d5-e7cc-4630-c3344e43beda
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 82204916-a2d0-b945-e6aa-a3ee430a348f_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 82204916-a2d0-b945-e6aa-a3ee430a348f_B = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_AD_RitualDruid1:c719c779-d7d5-e7cc-4630-c3344e43beda
msgctxt "h1051d935g91f4g429dga8b4g6cd7ab49495b"
msgid "How long were we chanting?"
msgstr "우리가 얼마나 오래 주문을 외운 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_AD_RitualDruid2
#. Speaker = Karrik
#. NodeID = 60e66d14-02f5-46bb-d657-dda0a4172f22
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 6fa2b72d-fde1-4ee3-e1d1-f184232f693d_A = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_AD_RitualDruid2:60e66d14-02f5-46bb-d657-dda0a4172f22
msgctxt "h75b1a4d1g1ec8g4482gb405g9992f98b3030"
msgid "How could we be so blind?"
msgstr "우리가 어떻게 눈이 멀게 된거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_AD_RitualDruid2
#. Speaker = Karrik
#. NodeID = 7c976f93-ec0d-f816-9eba-c420365a7369
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_State_DenVictory = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 6fa2b72d-fde1-4ee3-e1d1-f184232f693d_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 6fa2b72d-fde1-4ee3-e1d1-f184232f693d_B = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_AD_RitualDruid2:7c976f93-ec0d-f816-9eba-c420365a7369
msgctxt "h8903aed0g7137g45e1gab03g4a0c734cd537"
msgid "So much anger... we have to let it go."
msgstr "분노가 넘쳐나... 이제 그만 내려놓아야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_AD_RitualDruid2
#. Speaker = Karrik
#. NodeID = 7ef8439c-09ba-92f7-7f83-9876d2c73234
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
