#.   User:
#.     - DEN_BirdSender_Knows_AskedAboutNettie(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_BirdSender:edc125ae-364a-a930-6178-ab863113e606
msgctxt "h43254edag3f03g4747gb555g791ee6700f98"
msgid "I'm looking for a healer - help me narrow the search?"
msgstr "치유사를 찾고 있어. 도와줄 수 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_BirdSender
#. Speaker = Apikusis
#. NodeID = f242154f-3762-db61-323f-a00816e795d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_ShadowDruid_State_KidDied = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_BirdSender:f242154f-3762-db61-323f-a00816e795d5
msgctxt "he1dda6beged5eg458fg9e14gfe2920b828cb"
msgid "What you did was justice."
msgstr "당신이 정의로운 일을 한 거예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_BirdSender
#. Speaker = Apikusis
#. NodeID = f30a895b-8f6b-13ac-d751-3b7872a930e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_BirdSender:f30a895b-8f6b-13ac-d751-3b7872a930e0
msgctxt "hef394f8fgf51ag4c99ga64ag7c70173a66f6"
msgid ""
"Only Master Halsin can stop this. I pray my bird returns with news of him."
msgstr "오직 할신 님만이 이걸 막을 수 있어요. 제 새들이 그에 대한 소식을 가지고 오기를 빌죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_BirdSender
#. Speaker = Apikusis
#. NodeID = f5441002-a1ae-b4f8-fc96-53731d610d87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_BirdSender:f5441002-a1ae-b4f8-fc96-53731d610d87
msgctxt "h5097302fgf91cg43fdgb126g3a1dbba17efc"
msgid ""
"By all appearances, yes - when I look at her, I see the Kagha I once knew."
msgstr "겉으로 보기에는, 그래요. 그녀를 보면, 예전에 알았던 카그하의 모습이 보여요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_PAD_RecognizeRite
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7b223ed2-b8b3-ef2e-80f0-037d479453dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_SacredPond_Event_RecognizedRiteVBPlayed = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_PAD_RecognizeRite:7b223ed2-b8b3-ef2e-80f0-037d479453dd
msgctxt "hb650dac5gdec3g4851g9f56g64a9880fc9ce"
msgid "Is that a growth spell? I've never heard one like it."
msgstr "저거 성장 주문인가? 이런 건 들어본 적 없는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_PAD_RecognizeRite
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7b223ed2-b8b3-ef2e-80f0-037d479453dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_SacredPond_Event_RecognizedRiteVBPlayed = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_PAD_RecognizeRite:7b223ed2-b8b3-ef2e-80f0-037d479453dd
msgctxt "haae49550gde5dg49c2gadcag29bb3bb05d5e"
msgid ""
"This ritual rings a bell, but its execution is... grander somehow. A great "
"flowering in the making."
msgstr "이 의식은 아는 거긴 한데, 그 방식이... 훨씬 웅장하군. 대단한 꽃이 피어나고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_PAD_RecognizeRite
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7b223ed2-b8b3-ef2e-80f0-037d479453dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_SacredPond_Event_RecognizedRiteVBPlayed = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_PAD_RecognizeRite:7b223ed2-b8b3-ef2e-80f0-037d479453dd
msgctxt "hc8a56ab0gd40eg49dcgb611gfa865b389b20"
msgid "Is that a growth spell? Seems different somehow."
msgstr "저거 성장 주문이야? 좀 달라 보이는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_PAD_RecognizeRite
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7b223ed2-b8b3-ef2e-80f0-037d479453dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_SacredPond_Event_RecognizedRiteVBPlayed = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_PAD_RecognizeRite:7b223ed2-b8b3-ef2e-80f0-037d479453dd
msgctxt "h382508cag6dbcg4472ga049g55addd9fabfd"
msgid "This spell summons growth. But... something more, too."
msgstr "이 주문은 식물을 소환하는군. 하지만... 그게 다가 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_PAD_RecognizeRite
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7b223ed2-b8b3-ef2e-80f0-037d479453dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_SacredPond_Event_RecognizedRiteVBPlayed = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_PAD_RecognizeRite:7b223ed2-b8b3-ef2e-80f0-037d479453dd
msgctxt "he3142984g825eg48e0ga030gdf6389ea7f09"
msgid "This is a druid ritual... but not as I know it. Something's off."
msgstr "이건 드루이드 의식이야... 하지만 내가 아는 거랑은 다르네. 뭔가 잘못됐어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_PAD_RecognizeRite
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7b223ed2-b8b3-ef2e-80f0-037d479453dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_SacredPond_Event_RecognizedRiteVBPlayed = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_PAD_RecognizeRite:7b223ed2-b8b3-ef2e-80f0-037d479453dd
msgctxt "h08731ba4ge952g4b86g966ag01fe3b3d043a"
msgid "That ritual - it's no garden-variety growth spell."
msgstr "저 의식은 정원용 식물 성장 주문은 아니로군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_PAD_RecognizeRite
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7b223ed2-b8b3-ef2e-80f0-037d479453dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_SacredPond_Event_RecognizedRiteVBPlayed = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_PAD_RecognizeRite:7b223ed2-b8b3-ef2e-80f0-037d479453dd
msgctxt "ha9c138b6g6187g489dga7ddg15765be26936"
msgid "That ritual. A common growth spell, but... <i>altered</i>, somehow."
msgstr "이 의식은 평범한 성장 주문이지만... 뭐가 좀 <i>다르군</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_PAD_RecognizeRite
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a1d155d1-0fe3-4aba-b7d5-cc8f72536f57
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GENERIC(0) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_SacredPond_Event_RecognizedRiteVBPlayed = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_PAD_RecognizeRite:a1d155d1-0fe3-4aba-b7d5-cc8f72536f57
msgctxt "h48a01bccgfc51g4d8eg998dg7a615eab012b"
msgid "That ritual. A common growth spell, but... <i>altered</i>, somehow."
msgstr "이 의식은 평범한 성장 주문이지만... 뭐가 좀 <i>다르군</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_PAD_RecognizeRite
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ed5e0e84-6426-445f-a321-bd2bd0d81c24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_PAD_RecognizeRite:ed5e0e84-6426-445f-a321-bd2bd0d81c24
msgctxt "h9bec86d3g7d90g4563g8fd6gdfd24f46329e"
msgid "It's a growth spell. What's the worst it could do?"
msgstr "성장 주문이잖아. 나빠봤자 얼마나 나쁘겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_PAD_RecognizeRite
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ed5e0e84-6426-445f-a321-bd2bd0d81c24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_PAD_RecognizeRite:ed5e0e84-6426-445f-a321-bd2bd0d81c24
msgctxt "h964a579dgf733g4b75g8171g3fd95fdca12c"
msgid ""
"Not just altered, but... magnified. There's powerful magic budding here."
msgstr "단순히 변경된 게 아니라... 증폭되었어. 강력한 마법이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_PAD_RecognizeRite
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ed5e0e84-6426-445f-a321-bd2bd0d81c24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_PAD_RecognizeRite:ed5e0e84-6426-445f-a321-bd2bd0d81c24
msgctxt "hba1a4e45g70e2g44abg8ba7gcb38d5ce4b87"
msgid "I'm sure it's fine. It's fine! It's fine."
msgstr "아마 괜찮겠지. 괜찮아! 괜찮아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_PAD_RecognizeRite
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ed5e0e84-6426-445f-a321-bd2bd0d81c24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_PAD_RecognizeRite:ed5e0e84-6426-445f-a321-bd2bd0d81c24
msgctxt "heb419035g09b6g4a8egb31fgec891f14477b"
msgid "Ominous. A thorn can become a blade easily enough."
msgstr "불길하군. 가시는 쉽게 검날이 될 수 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_PAD_RecognizeRite
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ed5e0e84-6426-445f-a321-bd2bd0d81c24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_PAD_RecognizeRite:ed5e0e84-6426-445f-a321-bd2bd0d81c24
msgctxt "h2927a101g4c28g40a5ga0e0gf82fb2723138"
msgid "Why, that's not at all foreboding."
msgstr "우와, 전혀 불길하지 않은걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_PAD_RecognizeRite
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ed5e0e84-6426-445f-a321-bd2bd0d81c24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_PAD_RecognizeRite:ed5e0e84-6426-445f-a321-bd2bd0d81c24
msgctxt "h9cf7f8b0gdf00g4f28g8c7dgccbd67c2b6e9"
msgid "If it's got your hackles rising, then I wager we should steer clear."
msgstr "보기만 해도 뒷목이 쭈뼛 선다고 하면 멀찍이 피해가야 하는 법이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_PAD_RecognizeRite
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ed5e0e84-6426-445f-a321-bd2bd0d81c24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DRUID and REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_PAD_RecognizeRite:ed5e0e84-6426-445f-a321-bd2bd0d81c24
msgctxt "h53dce4c1gdc7ag4795gbab3g22c2eece31be"
msgid "And so many needed for the casting. Unusual."
msgstr "게다가 시전에 이렇게 많은 사람이 필요하다니. 특이하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_PAD_RecognizeRite
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ed5e0e84-6426-445f-a321-bd2bd0d81c24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_PAD_RecognizeRite:ed5e0e84-6426-445f-a321-bd2bd0d81c24
msgctxt "hc4a94b88gf806g44abgacc7g8eed555314d7"
msgid "But nothing to worry about... right?"
msgstr "걱정할 필요는 없겠지... 그렇지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_PAD_RecognizeRite
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f7fe991d-8ff7-678f-f258-85e9fc35506f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_SacredPond_Event_RecognizedRiteVBPlayed = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
