msgctxt "h348b971dg5a86g4d81g9899g1768c8128cbf"
msgid "This spell summons growth. But... something more, too."
msgstr "이 주문은 식물을 소환하는군. 하지만... 그게 다가 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_PAD_RecognizeRite
