msgctxt "h63fc1ea1g6a92g4eb1ga0ecg55d1eb9146dc"
msgid "This is a druid ritual... but not as I know it. Something's off."
msgstr "이건 드루이드 의식이야... 하지만 내가 아는 거랑은 다르네. 뭔가 잘못됐어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SacredPond_PAD_RecognizeRite
