#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_ShadowDruid_001:fcab8bff-ab8c-e91e-c271-f28b19a8be7e
msgctxt "he1819514gbe8eg4a54g9f6cg6a40d693d571"
msgid ""
"*The rat has hardly left Kagha's side. A distant thought claws at your "
"mind...*"
msgstr "*이 쥐는 카그하의 곁을 좀처럼 떠나지 않습니다. 아득한 생각이 당신의 머릿속을 맴돕니다...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_ShadowDruid_002
