msgstr "*시체가 생기 없는 모습으로 당신을 맞이합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SpeakWithDead/DEN_General_Dead_SnakeKid
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ded4fc28-138c-41e9-92f7-a6a10cd468ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
