msgstr "*시체는 말할 의지가 있지만, 자신을 죽인 자와 대화하고 싶지는 않은 듯 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SpeakWithDead/DEN_General_Dead_SnakeKid
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = ff4de3a4-1067-4c83-917e-033522d23499
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_SpeakWithDead/DEN_General_Dead_SnakeKid:ff4de3a4-1067-4c83-917e-033522d23499
msgctxt "h7ed6acecgcbe2g4a67gbc4eg4b39308c3300"
msgid "Not me... Mol..."
msgstr "나 말고... 몰이..."

