msgctxt "h2dc7952cg1914g4cc9g904dg49f2a1adf432"
msgid "Fine. I'll just go tell the guards you kicked us out of our home."
msgstr "좋아. 경비한테 가서 네가 우릴 집에서 쫒아냈다고 말할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_Thieflings_AD_HideoutTrespass
