msgid "We're leaving soon - whenever Zevlor gives word."
msgstr "우린 곧 떠날 거야. 제블로어가 말만 하면 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/DEN/DEN_YoungLover_2
