msgid "Hey... boss. Lots of your sort around these days."
msgstr "안녕합쇼... 두목. 요즘 두목 같은 사람을 자주 봅니다요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ApothecaryGoblins_Goblin_02
