msgctxt "h3d1685c7g6d32g4dcfg9145g1385de820afb"
msgid "Don't care if you're a drow! Hands off!"
msgstr "드로우건 뭐건 내 건 건들지 마!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ApothecaryGoblins_Goblin_02
#. Speaker = Brawler Brek
#. NodeID = dab9a068-e650-5455-6b45-f8e96c50994a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - FOR_ApothecaryGoblins_AD_Goblin_02_HasMet(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - TemporaryHostilityAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ApothecaryGoblins_Goblin_02:dab9a068-e650-5455-6b45-f8e96c50994a
msgctxt "hbbf95220g1408g4273gb5d4gdce2cff561ce"
msgid "Right, had your chance. <i>Raiders!</i> Chop this'un up <i>small</i>."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2acdf9fc-93ec-1453-d118-3c9c342b2d09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD:2acdf9fc-93ec-1453-d118-3c9c342b2d09
msgctxt "h9e6a1d1ag743dg42fdg804eg3d8d6cdd6188"
msgid "They're sketches - more like early drafts than final blueprints."
msgstr "개요인 것 같군. 최종 청사진보단 초기 도안에 가까워."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2acdf9fc-93ec-1453-d118-3c9c342b2d09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD:2acdf9fc-93ec-1453-d118-3c9c342b2d09
msgctxt "h0eb990c1gfbe9g4e22g97c8g154630c342c7"
msgid "These designs are unfinished. Rough drafts, no more."
msgstr "이 도안은 미완성이군. 대강 그린 내용에 불과해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2acdf9fc-93ec-1453-d118-3c9c342b2d09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD:2acdf9fc-93ec-1453-d118-3c9c342b2d09
msgctxt "h6b0e1460g4ab8g40e1g8fbagecb5fc478708"
msgid ""
"More like sketches than anything. Suppose he was still in the drafting stage."
msgstr "아직은 그냥 낙서 같은데. 구상하는 단계였던 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2acdf9fc-93ec-1453-d118-3c9c342b2d09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD:2acdf9fc-93ec-1453-d118-3c9c342b2d09
msgctxt "hb8ceed52g88f0g4978ga416g59f6cb2ec905"
msgid "Simple inkwork, simple design. Hardly the pinnacle of metalcraft."
msgstr "단순한 그림에, 단순한 형태군. 금속 주조의 정수라고 보긴 어렵겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2acdf9fc-93ec-1453-d118-3c9c342b2d09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD:2acdf9fc-93ec-1453-d118-3c9c342b2d09
msgctxt "hfbbe93fbgc9b1g4f11ga3b6g15f70151b4d4"
msgid "Not too refined here - just quick ideas sketched out."
msgstr "여긴 간략한 발상만 그려뒀군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2acdf9fc-93ec-1453-d118-3c9c342b2d09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD:2acdf9fc-93ec-1453-d118-3c9c342b2d09
msgctxt "hf0bd1dcbg53feg4b52ga5f0g1e9851314100"
msgid "The sketching's rough. A work in progress, I reckon."
msgstr "아직 도안이 완성되지 않았어. 작업 중인 물건이었던 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2acdf9fc-93ec-1453-d118-3c9c342b2d09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD:2acdf9fc-93ec-1453-d118-3c9c342b2d09
msgctxt "hf11f3b40g62c1g4657gb7c1gdb45d614e167"
msgid "The inking is rough - a work in progress, surely."
msgstr "대략적인 도안이야, 확실히 완성되진 않았군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b0599f53-3dfa-55de-b7d2-36682832afcb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_Knows_SussurBarkUseful = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD:b0599f53-3dfa-55de-b7d2-36682832afcb
msgctxt "h570d0cccgf03dg4c9dgb6cfged3466db1536"
msgid "The same as before, minus the sussur bark. An early draft, perhaps?"
msgstr "아직 똑같은데, 수서르 나무껍질은 나와 있지 않아. 초기 도안인 것 같은데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b0599f53-3dfa-55de-b7d2-36682832afcb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_Knows_SussurBarkUseful = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD:b0599f53-3dfa-55de-b7d2-36682832afcb
msgctxt "h985bc885gf7bbg42b2gb5cege8477b5c832e"
msgid "Conspicuous absence of sussur bark in these particular diagrams though."
msgstr "하지만 이 특정 도표에는 수서르 나무껍질이 눈에 띄게 부족하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b0599f53-3dfa-55de-b7d2-36682832afcb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_Knows_SussurBarkUseful = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD:b0599f53-3dfa-55de-b7d2-36682832afcb
msgctxt "h12ecc050g56d8g4734gac78gaf4a0dec370d"
msgid "No sussur bark. Maybe these are prototypes."
msgstr "수서르 나무껍질은 빠져 있어. 초기 도안이었나 본데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b0599f53-3dfa-55de-b7d2-36682832afcb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_Knows_SussurBarkUseful = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD:b0599f53-3dfa-55de-b7d2-36682832afcb
msgctxt "hdaf0f7d3g2de9g4cd5gb41cgb9e0c4bce62a"
msgid ""
"Simple inkwork, no sussur bark mentioned. Hardly the pinnacle of the craft."
msgstr "간단한 초안이군, 수서르 나무껍질은 언급되어있지 않아. 완전히 초기 단계인 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b0599f53-3dfa-55de-b7d2-36682832afcb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_Knows_SussurBarkUseful = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD:b0599f53-3dfa-55de-b7d2-36682832afcb
msgctxt "hac2d99f5g42a3g4e7fg987ag24ea72fbe939"
msgid "These don't mention sussur bark though. Perhaps an earlier draft."
msgstr "하지만 여기엔 수서르 나무 껍질이 언급되어있지 않군. 초기 도안인 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b0599f53-3dfa-55de-b7d2-36682832afcb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_Knows_SussurBarkUseful = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD:b0599f53-3dfa-55de-b7d2-36682832afcb
msgctxt "h683ce324g4c5dg469ag9b01ga26389c1e11a"
msgid "Seems the sussur bark was a later addition."
msgstr "수서르 나무 껍질은 나중에 추가된 부분인가 보군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b0599f53-3dfa-55de-b7d2-36682832afcb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_Knows_SussurBarkUseful = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD:b0599f53-3dfa-55de-b7d2-36682832afcb
msgctxt "he8577070gf6e1g4d1dgb983gf84e97de3462"
msgid "An early sketch, though. No mention of sussur bark."
msgstr "하지만, 초기 도면이야. 수서르 나무 껍질에 대해선 언급되어 있지 않군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cdbdf625-38e6-0084-2697-fe70eafeb0ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD:cdbdf625-38e6-0084-2697-fe70eafeb0ec
msgctxt "hf312e0afg013eg41f6ga8f4g91c7d533810a"
msgid "Blueprints for some devilish weapons. Our friend was a fine blacksmith."
msgstr "사악한 무기들의 청사진이야. 누군진 모르겠지만 뛰어난 대장장이인 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cdbdf625-38e6-0084-2697-fe70eafeb0ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD:cdbdf625-38e6-0084-2697-fe70eafeb0ec
msgctxt "hcc666035g9e85g49beg98b3g949be2ac2f7c"
msgid ""
"Weapon diagrams. Some blacksmith's passion project from the looks of it."
msgstr "무기 설계도야. 어떤 대장장이가 열정적으로 만든 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cdbdf625-38e6-0084-2697-fe70eafeb0ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD:cdbdf625-38e6-0084-2697-fe70eafeb0ec
msgctxt "h064f3b9dg3e1dg47ffgbfcbg6001bc86d663"
msgid ""
"Plans for some truly fiendish-looking weapons. Our blacksmith was "
"multitalented."
msgstr "이 설계도... 완전히 마족 같은 무기로군. 여기 대장장이 양반이 방귀 좀 뀌었나 본데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cdbdf625-38e6-0084-2697-fe70eafeb0ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD:cdbdf625-38e6-0084-2697-fe70eafeb0ec
msgctxt "ha091ce0dgb8e7g4bafgbdfcg5a31ce5843aa"
msgid "Weapon designs. The work of a <i>mlar</i> - a smith, as the locals say."
msgstr "무기 설계도야. <i>믈라르</i> - 이곳 사람들의 말로 하면 대장장이의 작품이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cdbdf625-38e6-0084-2697-fe70eafeb0ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD:cdbdf625-38e6-0084-2697-fe70eafeb0ec
msgctxt "h0906535cg9591g4df0gb903g7d7208392491"
msgid "Plans. Looks like someone was intending to forge weapons."
msgstr "계획들이야. 누군가 무기를 제작하려고 했던 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cdbdf625-38e6-0084-2697-fe70eafeb0ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD:cdbdf625-38e6-0084-2697-fe70eafeb0ec
msgctxt "h1d6ec930g6f72g4d1eg91c8g0ce9b4d28779"
msgid "A blacksmith's blueprints. Greatsword, dagger and... is that a sickle?"
msgstr "대장장이의 청사진이야. 대검, 단검 그리고... 저건 낫인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cdbdf625-38e6-0084-2697-fe70eafeb0ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD:cdbdf625-38e6-0084-2697-fe70eafeb0ec
msgctxt "hbeb72cc2ge555g4534gbfd2g3033b21bb9ff"
msgid "Weapon blueprints. A master blacksmith's work."
msgstr "무기 청사진이야. 뛰어난 무기 장인의 작품이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ff177c6c-cd38-4e45-8c47-35bb5ab48cd2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_Knows_ApprenticePlans = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD:ff177c6c-cd38-4e45-8c47-35bb5ab48cd2
msgctxt "h2015a56eg4691g4be0g8655gab06e9b5b58b"
msgid "More blueprints from our local blacksmith."
msgstr "지역 대장장이의 작품이 더 있군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ff177c6c-cd38-4e45-8c47-35bb5ab48cd2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_Knows_ApprenticePlans = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD:ff177c6c-cd38-4e45-8c47-35bb5ab48cd2
msgctxt "h10c18e2fg7479g4da7g99e7g638181c847ef"
msgid "Weapon diagrams. Our friendly neighbourhood blacksmith has been busy."
msgstr "무기 설계도야. 우리 친절한 이웃 대장장이가 바쁘게 일한 것 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ff177c6c-cd38-4e45-8c47-35bb5ab48cd2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_Knows_ApprenticePlans = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD:ff177c6c-cd38-4e45-8c47-35bb5ab48cd2
msgctxt "h017a0a7bga571g4c2cg8146g2e2ee3425eb4"
msgid "Detailed specifications. Our good blacksmith has been a busy weaponeer."
msgstr "설명이 아주 꼼꼼하잖아. 우리 대장장이께서 아주 바쁘게 일하셨겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ff177c6c-cd38-4e45-8c47-35bb5ab48cd2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_Knows_ApprenticePlans = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD:ff177c6c-cd38-4e45-8c47-35bb5ab48cd2
msgctxt "h7e30d8c5g0711g4e47g8ebbgf1d83bf1e3d2"
msgid "Weapon designs. The blacksmith's work."
msgstr "무기 설계도야. 그 대장장이의 작품이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ff177c6c-cd38-4e45-8c47-35bb5ab48cd2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_Knows_ApprenticePlans = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD:ff177c6c-cd38-4e45-8c47-35bb5ab48cd2
msgctxt "h6892adffg5e5ag4991ga0dcgb2e4dcdbbd66"
msgid "More plans. Must be from the same blacksmith."
msgstr "더 많은 계획서야. 같은 대장장이의 작품인 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ff177c6c-cd38-4e45-8c47-35bb5ab48cd2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_Knows_ApprenticePlans = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD:ff177c6c-cd38-4e45-8c47-35bb5ab48cd2
msgctxt "h559cc354gee15g43a2gab1fge93eac1bf2ec"
msgid ""
"The blacksmith's blueprints. Greatsword, dagger, and... a sickle, I think."
msgstr "대장장이의 청사진이야. 대검, 단검, 그리고... 낫인 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Blueprints_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ff177c6c-cd38-4e45-8c47-35bb5ab48cd2
