msgid "Hm. There's death in your scent, but not in your words."
msgstr "흠. 너한텐 죽음의 향기가 나는데, 네 말은 그렇지 않네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Courier_Dog
