msgstr "<b><i>크아아.</i></b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Courier_Dog
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 728645fe-c374-1151-3eda-e38241997b45
