msgid "Calm yourself. I harm only those deserving of it."
msgstr "진정해. 난 대가를 치를 필요가 있는 이들만 해치니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Courier_Dog
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 79c7e66c-9d60-5372-9fc9-c6891aa7c412
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
