msgctxt "h803e4761g1b4eg4041g91e9gd6070443b7ed"
msgid "You <i>will </i>release the gnome. That's an order."
msgstr "너는 노움을 <i>풀어줄 것</i>이다. 그게 명령이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5687bdcc-3b49-3773-e059-a705671ed575
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount4(2) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount4(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:5687bdcc-3b49-3773-e059-a705671ed575
msgctxt "h47445a63g2faeg45c0g891cgc45dc77c7b68"
msgid ""
"*A shadow swims across your vision, and a familiar voice tells you to be "
"calm. You are loved.*"
msgstr "*그림자가 낀 듯이 눈앞이 흐려지더니, 익숙한 목소리가 당신을 달래줍니다. 사랑이 느껴집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = 56f993c2-d600-6122-de95-8ba37a5e7322
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:56f993c2-d600-6122-de95-8ba37a5e7322
msgctxt "hb1e7a28dg0f31g409fgb2f3g837167e721db"
msgid "Get outta my head!"
msgstr "내 머릿속에서 나가!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = 574586ee-bf03-6bf4-99d2-c18f26f4519a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_GnomeGoblinsPromisedLeave = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:574586ee-bf03-6bf4-99d2-c18f26f4519a
msgctxt "hc6439fc4gdbdbg4f8cg8719geabb3253ac38"
msgid ""
"Clear off and don't come back. Tell your mummy how the nasty goblins made "
"you wet your britches."
msgstr "떠나서 돌아오지 마. 흉악한 고블린들 때문에 바지에 지린 일을 네 애미에게 들려주라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 58950387-d4c8-9fbe-84f0-ce8aab12ae00
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FIGHTER(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_UnfortunateGnome_State_NonCharlatanAccess = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:58950387-d4c8-9fbe-84f0-ce8aab12ae00
msgctxt "hfeed4243g6b60g4b1dgb489gd990c92f6de9"
msgid "You're making a mistake. You can think it over in the Fugue Plane."
msgstr "깝치지 마. 푸가 플레인으로 보내버리기 전에."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 596c2743-3cb3-fde4-9da8-9d37465a9ad1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount5(2) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount5(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:596c2743-3cb3-fde4-9da8-9d37465a9ad1
msgctxt "hacd116d6gb137g4789gb76agcb768ce38032"
msgid ""
"*Your blood runs quicker, feeding the gnawing absence at the centre of your "
"mind.*"
msgstr "*피가 더 빨리 흐르면서, 당신의 정신 한가운데를 좀먹는 허전함을 양분으로 채웁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = 5e75bf97-9a33-f69e-18a5-a291bdecee07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:5e75bf97-9a33-f69e-18a5-a291bdecee07
msgctxt "hbcc6c394g9d1ag47bfga5ccg79dc41b9308f"
msgid ""
"Cough it up! ([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-"
"be548b134c54])"
msgstr "뱉어내! ([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-be548b134c54])"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5ea00621-13b6-0b61-2d22-1fc5a88eb878
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount3(2) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount3(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:5ea00621-13b6-0b61-2d22-1fc5a88eb878
msgctxt "h7eb29938g76d8g4aa3gae7fg36350c9da120"
msgid "*Your mind lurches, reeling suddenly as if... bitten.*"
msgstr "*뭔가에 깨물린 것처럼 느닷없이 정신이 휘청거립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5fe6e925-ab32-b209-3785-37143a0f82f4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold_2 = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:5fe6e925-ab32-b209-3785-37143a0f82f4
msgctxt "h4dccc922gf00ag43f0g95aeg61f40ed6601c"
msgid "I can't pay you."
msgstr "못 내겠는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = 5ff3c4e3-ac36-d87c-8316-76623e69916a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:5ff3c4e3-ac36-d87c-8316-76623e69916a
msgctxt "h8add47a8gded6g4bb8g91d6g87156e2cebf0"
msgid "Good choice. Now clear off."
msgstr "좋은 선택이야. 이제 가버려."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = 606acc89-b6d9-6264-cfc8-54d042ef7a5e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:606acc89-b6d9-6264-cfc8-54d042ef7a5e
msgctxt "hb868feb8gd48dg40b8g93bbg4809f1ebef5a"
msgid "An' you - hope you got a stomach fer heights!"
msgstr "그리고, 너 - 고소공포증은 없길 바란다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = 6077f785-57cb-7846-41cf-8a56431eb67a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:6077f785-57cb-7846-41cf-8a56431eb67a
msgctxt "h9bfc0e97ge69dg4d0fgac8bgefdba3abfc39"
msgid ""
"Eh? I ain't after fulfilment! I'm after the fillin' of my pockets. Now yer "
"gonna pay more!"
msgstr "뭐? 성취고 나발이고 난 주머니만 채우면 그만이야! 그러니 이제 두 배로 받아내야겠어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 621757a5-9d66-276e-042f-f170aa337950
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Absolute_Knows_TrueSoul = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:621757a5-9d66-276e-042f-f170aa337950
msgctxt "h216eccf1g0b5eg4500g8f10gc8c7b0d69d74"
msgid "Cease your babbling - what did you mean?"
msgstr "횡설수설하지 마. 그게 무슨 뜻이지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = 670c2ec4-2dbc-1a74-e0c0-0dbee3a72a68
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Absolute_Knows_Symbol = True
#. TagRule: DEEPGNOME or GNOME
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:670c2ec4-2dbc-1a74-e0c0-0dbee3a72a68
msgctxt "hea5af651g12ceg4471ga516g5896430ec487"
msgid "Not happening! He's <i>ours</i>!"
msgstr "어림도 없지! 그는 <i>우리거야</i>!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = 670c2ec4-2dbc-1a74-e0c0-0dbee3a72a68
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Absolute_Knows_Symbol = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:670c2ec4-2dbc-1a74-e0c0-0dbee3a72a68
msgctxt "h4bdcbeefg63f8g410ag8552g6a7ceb43b5f2"
msgid "Find your own! He's <i>ours</i> an' we ain't sharin'!"
msgstr "네 거나 찾아! 쟤는 <i>우리 거</i>고 공유할 생각은 없어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = 672003a8-216f-7198-0fc8-f41ce4389fa9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:672003a8-216f-7198-0fc8-f41ce4389fa9
msgctxt "hc979b49dg19bdg4d8fg93bcgdaff49bbf167"
msgid "And, erm, he wants us back at our camp. Right now."
msgstr "그래서 그, 그분이 우리보고 돌아오라고 하십니다. 당장요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = 67eb0f34-cc8e-ad03-3f46-1768221dc771
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:67eb0f34-cc8e-ad03-3f46-1768221dc771
msgctxt "h3f734c15gc265g4ff6gb536g391ed2e869d3"
msgid "<i>No! </i>Get out of my head!"
msgstr "<i>안돼! </i>내 머리에서 나가!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = 67ed0106-eac6-bc51-7aa4-a28c70dfd601
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - WLD_GnomeGoblin1_AbandonNegotiations(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:67ed0106-eac6-bc51-7aa4-a28c70dfd601
msgctxt "h48fa4047g096ag4b0fg9a18gf7eb06ec3c33"
msgid "The runt's <i>ours</i>. You should've taken a wide path around us."
msgstr "이 새끼는 <i>우리 거</i>야. 넌 우리 주변의 넓은 길을 택했어야 했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = 69712987-15c7-e07e-38aa-8dee1f82ba3a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - WLD_GnomeGoblin1_AbandonNegotiations(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:69712987-15c7-e07e-38aa-8dee1f82ba3a
msgctxt "h839df0b5g1be6g4f2ag9d27g710d1470b42d"
msgid "We ain't going no place! And y'know what? Neither are you..."
msgstr "그런다고 우리가 그냥 갈 줄 알아? 여기서 한 발짝도 못 나갈 거다..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 69a1c034-72b4-b50e-ee3e-cc3b95f525af
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 0
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - f8d20378-d64f-2863-d81e-394cd4a9fa41_MindHasBeenRead = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CanDetectThoughts_3 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:69a1c034-72b4-b50e-ee3e-cc3b95f525af
msgctxt "h86543807g1e3ag4bbcg85a3gba9d3c4dda95"
msgid "<i>Read the goblin's mind.</i>"
msgstr "<i>고블린의 생각을 읽는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6a7820b2-1273-071e-fb75-c986bbdaa41e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - WLD_UnfortunateGnome_PayPassage(2) = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold_2 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:6a7820b2-1273-071e-fb75-c986bbdaa41e
msgctxt "hc339db3cgafc1g40eagb88cg84fc6e8ad89d"
msgid "I'm not going to haggle. Leave now, and I'll let you live."
msgstr "흥정 같은 건 관심 없다. 죽고 싶지 않으면 꺼져라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6b1c5aed-5859-5454-0c27-e0a0b656156a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - GLO_TadpoleIntro_NPC(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - GLO_TadpoleIntro_NPC(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:6b1c5aed-5859-5454-0c27-e0a0b656156a
msgctxt "hbd3339c6g93b4g40e2gbca8g3cecfe6885e9"
msgid ""
"*A strange symbol glows, marked on their flesh, and something within you "
"stirs in response.*"
msgstr "*그들의 살갗에 새겨진 기묘한 상징이 빛나고, 이에 반응하여 당신 내면의 무언가가 꿈틀거립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6bdc5efa-6989-66ed-b2b6-6b6826b228cb
