#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:7c3d4354-38c8-ab64-e78e-6a4124c20f9f
msgctxt "h9d2bec37g4188g473fg9089g27a3978bd1eb"
msgid "I am a True Soul. Now, once again - release the gnome."
msgstr "나는 참된 영혼이다. 자, 다시 말하지 - 저 노움을 풀어줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
