msgctxt "h4ded1167ge4e6g4487gaedeg8b2c75b120c7"
msgid "<i>Attack the goblins.</i>"
msgstr "<i>고블린을 공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 98708142-b5ea-db22-b3e4-662419169ea8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:98708142-b5ea-db22-b3e4-662419169ea8
msgctxt "h65ea9c53g40aag4883g99f6gec3236944c62"
msgid ""
"*The mark glows, but you feel nothing in response. Your illithid power is "
"beyond reach until you rest.*"
msgstr "*문양이 빛나지만, 어떤 반응도 느껴지지 않습니다. 일리시드 능력을 더 사용하려면 휴식을 취해야 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = 998be8a2-75f1-383c-fc38-77fdf1a5dcb9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_GnomeGoblinsPacified = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:998be8a2-75f1-383c-fc38-77fdf1a5dcb9
msgctxt "hb658fc7ag399eg4861gbf72g082a0c0d56f6"
msgid "We gotta dash. Goblin business... erm, very important."
msgstr "우린 빨리 가야 해요. 고블린 사업은... 음, 아주 중요하거든요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9a1a7ca7-d68f-d356-1a81-612df8b01983
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - WLD_GnomeGoblin1_AbandonNegotiations(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - FOR_GnomeGoblin1_PlayerNonAggressiveOptions(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:9a1a7ca7-d68f-d356-1a81-612df8b01983
msgctxt "h36122d14g7e7ag4933gbff7g665444fb85e1"
msgid ""
"All of you lot against one deep gnome? You should go find a better target."
msgstr "딥 노움 하나를 위해서 이렇게 많은 인원이 필요한 건가? 더 적합한 사냥감을 찾아보라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9a3ac17a-9f14-70d8-e5df-d8a3d616c3dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold_5 = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_UnfortunateGnome_State_NonCharlatanAccess = True
#. TagRule: BERSERKER
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:9a3ac17a-9f14-70d8-e5df-d8a3d616c3dc
msgctxt "h13918be0ge023g44b5g822cg658d8cb9cc38"
msgid "<b>OR YOU CAN LEAVE. ALIVE. </b>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9a3ac17a-9f14-70d8-e5df-d8a3d616c3dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold_5 = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_UnfortunateGnome_State_NonCharlatanAccess = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:9a3ac17a-9f14-70d8-e5df-d8a3d616c3dc
msgctxt "heb63bdabg16c0g4a2bga90ag7659d60efebd"
msgid "Leave. <b>Or die.</b>"
msgstr "떠나거나. <b>죽어라.</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9bab49d1-c905-0786-0c06-75d4b96fac5e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:9bab49d1-c905-0786-0c06-75d4b96fac5e
msgctxt "h6ea5cfc0ga8acg4ff2g9e7fgd45071a8ac08"
msgid "This will lead only to pain, not fulfilment."
msgstr "악행에는 성취감이 아닌 고통만이 따를 뿐이니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = 9c19de2a-dda1-f590-ff62-fee284888bdf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:9c19de2a-dda1-f590-ff62-fee284888bdf
msgctxt "h5538562dg2c35g4773g80fcg0560970f37a2"
msgid ""
"Heh... How 'bout this: you pay a toll, an' go on as you like... or else you "
"<i>fly</i>!"
msgstr "헤… 이건 어때: 통행료를 내고 가고 싶은 길을 가… 안 그럼 너도 <i>날게</i> 될 거야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9e13b806-5e66-b16e-7780-bc921c3f33bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount2(2) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount2(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:9e13b806-5e66-b16e-7780-bc921c3f33bb
msgctxt "h60224850g3c6eg4b3ega985g9de47024d146"
msgid ""
"*Something stirs deep within you, hungry and alert... it's taking something "
"you'll never get back.*"
msgstr "*몸 깊숙한 데서 굶주리고 기민한 존재가 꿈틀댑니다... 잃으면 되찾지 못할 뭔가를 좀먹고 있군요.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a18b2885-6c5e-7979-a96c-919bb2f0c587
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_HALFORC(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_UnfortunateGnome_State_NonCharlatanAccess = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:a18b2885-6c5e-7979-a96c-919bb2f0c587
msgctxt "hb43199feg18c5g45fbg93f7g1371ebf9ff55"
msgid "<i>Don't utter a word. Just stare down the goblin.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a2a222cd-121b-859a-7adf-c1f3dc363180
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - FOR_GnomeGoblin1_PlayerNonAggressiveOptions(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:a2a222cd-121b-859a-7adf-c1f3dc363180
msgctxt "ha00e5e16g4910g4641g86f1gdb4f762c1791"
msgid ""
"Not an orator, eh? I could teach you how to talk gold out of any purse, for "
"free passage."
msgstr ""
"그리 말을 잘하는 편은 아니지? 내가 어떻게 하면 남들이 지갑을 열도록 말할 수 있는지 가르쳐줄게. 비용 없이 지나가게 해준다면 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = a2bf8e84-a6c4-6437-f9af-0ff76f4cbf1b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - WLD_UnfortunateGnome_PayPassage(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_GnomeGoblinsPacified = True
#.   Object:
#.     - GEN_TransferNPCPayment(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:a2bf8e84-a6c4-6437-f9af-0ff76f4cbf1b
msgctxt "h7d6589f1g768ag49e1gba4dgecf8fe300b21"
msgid ""
"Y'know what? Fair's fair. On yer way, an' take the runt, too. We've got gold "
"to count..."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = a36e9313-96b3-4ad8-0383-317215e08861
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_UnfortunateGnome_State_Still = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:a36e9313-96b3-4ad8-0383-317215e08861
msgctxt "h8ebcb94eg3127g4c7aga8edgcc46c166da33"
msgid "G-get that birdie spinning again! Make him chirp for us!"
msgstr "저, 저 새 다시 돌려! 짹짹 울도록 하라고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = a3e1606f-257b-f848-4854-9cd8d5a26950
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_UnfortunateGnome_State_NonCharlatanAccess = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:a3e1606f-257b-f848-4854-9cd8d5a26950
msgctxt "h1c531e34g5d1bg4e52g90a4g27bc9eaea444"
msgid "I... yes. Whatever you want."
msgstr "전... 네. 원하시는 무엇이든 하겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = a6fb2dfc-db3f-2e95-e39e-0919d7b0fe80
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:a6fb2dfc-db3f-2e95-e39e-0919d7b0fe80
msgctxt "h6eb99c7cg37fcg48d4gbff7g29b6eb713ead"
msgid ""
"What the... <i>I felt that! </i>You were in my noggin like a worm in an "
"apple!"
msgstr "뭐야 씨... <i>날 건드렸어! </i>내 머릿속을 뒤지다니! 사과 속 벌레처럼!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a8b6b299-c695-1b74-1b50-7e77550e03ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.     - TRUESOUL(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:a8b6b299-c695-1b74-1b50-7e77550e03ca
msgctxt "h8f9bd759g1b34g45ceg83b1g3f75dae8b551"
msgid ""
"*Your mind is full, bursting with ecstasy and terror. Finally, it is coming. "
"You are becoming.*"
msgstr "*당신의 정신이 황홀경과 공포로 가득 차오릅니다. 마침내, 때가 됐군요. 당신은 변화 중입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a9e7645b-6cd0-be3e-7321-6a1fc98e45fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_UnfortunateGnome_State_NonCharlatanAccess = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:a9e7645b-6cd0-be3e-7321-6a1fc98e45fb
msgctxt "h765c986fg70c8g45b2gbdc1ga55b485459de"
msgid "I don't answer to the likes of you."
msgstr "나는 너같은 족속들에게 대답하지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ab331e32-6581-0697-0239-14f15e5a40ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - WLD_UnfortunateGnome_WhatTheyDoing(2) = True
#.      - WLD_UnfortunateGnome_Why(2) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GNOME and !REALLY_DEEPGNOME
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:ab331e32-6581-0697-0239-14f15e5a40ae
msgctxt "hbf5af3a8ge31ag4173g9b1eg2ec483d7f734"
msgid "Release that deep gnome at once - he's a kin of sorts to me."
msgstr "저 딥 노움을 당장 풀어줘. 그는 내 먼 동족이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ab331e32-6581-0697-0239-14f15e5a40ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - WLD_UnfortunateGnome_WhatTheyDoing(2) = True
#.      - WLD_UnfortunateGnome_Why(2) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_DEEPGNOME
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:ab331e32-6581-0697-0239-14f15e5a40ae
msgctxt "h0228d5d1g77edg4611g9004gafd621b47bd9"
msgid "Release my kin at once."
msgstr "당장 내 동족을 풀어줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ab331e32-6581-0697-0239-14f15e5a40ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - WLD_UnfortunateGnome_WhatTheyDoing(2) = True
#.      - WLD_UnfortunateGnome_Why(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:ab331e32-6581-0697-0239-14f15e5a40ae
msgctxt "he2e1aa6eg9c27g4a35g914fg984f8da41e70"
msgid "Release that gnome at once."
msgstr "저 노움을 당장 풀어줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ac3e60bd-926f-9712-b417-7b40b390ec04
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - WLD_GnomeGoblin1_AbandonNegotiations(2) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_UnfortunateGnome_State_NonCharlatanAccess = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:ac3e60bd-926f-9712-b417-7b40b390ec04
msgctxt "h663c5b11gf655g4c75gb688g2e4b04b6de23"
msgid ""
"I consider the gnome under my protection. You <i>don't</i> want to fight me "
"for him."
msgstr "이 노움은 내가 보호한다. 그를 위해 나와 싸우고 싶지는 <i>않겠지</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = aeda5858-57c2-9299-fe12-b7985843453b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - GLO_TadpoleIntro_NPC(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - GLO_TadpoleIntro_NPC(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:aeda5858-57c2-9299-fe12-b7985843453b
msgctxt "hd0242473g92ebg4b2eg97edgfcf132fe2d3f"
msgid ""
"*A strange symbol glows, marked on their flesh, and something within you "
"stirs in response.*"
msgstr "*그들의 살갗에 새겨진 기묘한 상징이 빛나고, 이에 반응하여 당신 내면의 무언가가 꿈틀거립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = afeeec8d-10a7-f6c3-e51a-9a68b458aa31
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - WLD_GnomeGoblin1_NoGoldPersuade(2) = True
#.      - WLD_GnomeGoblin1_CantCount(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - WLD_GnomeGoblin1_CantCount(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:afeeec8d-10a7-f6c3-e51a-9a68b458aa31
msgctxt "h2412bd8cgf607g46c4g9b3fg2c526abdd54c"
msgid "You know that's a smaller sum of gold, yes?"
msgstr "그게 더 적은 돈인 건 알지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = b098a106-46ca-0ec5-0384-8ceed3dd30a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DEEPGNOME or GNOME
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:b098a106-46ca-0ec5-0384-8ceed3dd30a6
msgctxt "h85bba1b5g12e7g4e99g8559g2b678c4e8c21"
msgid "Want to save your runty little friend, do you?"
msgstr "네 조그만 친구를 구하고 싶나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = b098a106-46ca-0ec5-0384-8ceed3dd30a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:b098a106-46ca-0ec5-0384-8ceed3dd30a6
msgctxt "hea24219cgf549g477fg9acag6deb5945bdba"
msgid "You want this little cave-lurkin' wotsit?"
msgstr "동굴에 숨는 이 작은 꼬마를 원해?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b0ef4606-595e-7ffa-a726-6046753476f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - WLD_UnfortunateGnome_WhatTheyDoing(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - WLD_UnfortunateGnome_PayPassage(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:b0ef4606-595e-7ffa-a726-6046753476f6
msgctxt "hec5dcf35g8de5g4bf1ga241g6774cda6e670"
msgid "I'm not looking for trouble - just want to pass by."
msgstr "문제를 일으키려는 건 아니고, 그냥 지나가려는 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b203312b-b865-cbc2-0988-78c427909a32
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(2) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:b203312b-b865-cbc2-0988-78c427909a32
msgctxt "hf8352e14g49c1g4b08g8f43g5dbd9c1385b9"
msgid "I am a True Soul. Your prisoner is now mine."
msgstr "나는 참된 영혼이다. 너의 포로는 이제 내 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b209e8aa-ba71-7ee3-c750-2a16aa552465
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_UnfortunateGnome_State_NonCharlatanAccess = True
#. TagRule: BERSERKER
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:b209e8aa-ba71-7ee3-c750-2a16aa552465
msgctxt "h4a6e85e6ge5c8g4652g92degcc8506f89dbf"
msgid "<b><i>ROAR.</i></b>"
msgstr "<b><i>크아아.</i></b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b209e8aa-ba71-7ee3-c750-2a16aa552465
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_UnfortunateGnome_State_NonCharlatanAccess = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:b209e8aa-ba71-7ee3-c750-2a16aa552465
msgctxt "hedd92217g9637g4a4agb052g44803b0cf2bf"
msgid "Did I say you could ask <b>questions</b>?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b3ab9325-5798-a19c-a09e-e233793020cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Absolute_Knows_TrueSoul = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:b3ab9325-5798-a19c-a09e-e233793020cd
msgctxt "hd071042cga0adg47a3gb0dag97b33a6f5b2f"
msgid "Of course I'm a True Soul. How dare you even question the fact?"
msgstr "물론 나는 참된 영혼이다. 감히 어떻게 그 사실을 의심할 수 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = b496bc38-2962-de6a-b620-b4ac84c51209
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:b496bc38-2962-de6a-b620-b4ac84c51209
msgctxt "h068fe93cg50ddg4aebga8b0ge37aecd4e0d2"
msgid ""
"Or else <i>what</i>, you'll fight us? Bit late to find some backbone, don't "
"you reckon?"
msgstr "안 그러면 <i>뭐</i>, 우리랑 싸우게? 이제서야 용감한 척하긴 늦었다고 생각하지 않아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b663c037-9c0d-be24-8630-c988c2a6247c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:b663c037-9c0d-be24-8630-c988c2a6247c
msgctxt "h2c825618g2cb3g4156gac06g32e333dd5a55"
msgid "Naturally - do I look <i>cursed </i>to you?"
msgstr "당연하지. 너에겐 내가 <i>저주받은</i> 것처럼 보이냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b66a8e5c-66a6-7317-f57c-60875feed755
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount5(2) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount5(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:b66a8e5c-66a6-7317-f57c-60875feed755
msgctxt "h55e4d1c1gd49bg4f2bg93edgfd8f8a606ccd"
msgid ""
"*Your blood runs quicker, feeding the gnawing absence at the centre of your "
"mind.*"
msgstr "*피가 더 빨리 흐르면서, 당신의 정신 한가운데를 좀먹는 허전함을 양분으로 채웁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = b6ec9356-6b5a-2ac3-e782-aaf3d46ece34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - WLD_UnfortunateGnome_UsedAmulet(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_GnomeGoblinsPacified = True
#. TagRule: GNOME
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:b6ec9356-6b5a-2ac3-e782-aaf3d46ece34
msgctxt "h4a7487d4g4fc8g40adgbf0dgd1ededf24e85"
msgid "There'll be richer pickings than these little gnats someplace else."
msgstr "다른 데는 이 작은 각다귀들보다 더 풍부한 수입원이 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = b6ec9356-6b5a-2ac3-e782-aaf3d46ece34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - WLD_UnfortunateGnome_UsedAmulet(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_GnomeGoblinsPacified = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:b6ec9356-6b5a-2ac3-e782-aaf3d46ece34
msgctxt "h341c8c93g13dbg422dg85d6gd79ca76949fc"
msgid "There's plenty of sport an' rich pickings out there fer us. Move it!"
msgstr "우리에겐 다양한 스포츠와 풍부한 수입원이 있어. 움직여!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b87f9967-d4d2-8c8c-133c-74fb345680b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - WLD_GnomeGoblin1_AbandonNegotiations(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:b87f9967-d4d2-8c8c-133c-74fb345680b5
msgctxt "hcde3cd1ag9ac5g48e0g818egd37fd8bedb3b"
msgid ""
"*The goblin's nostrils flare, as if trying to judge you through smell "
"alone...*"
msgstr "*고블린의 콧구멍이 냄새로만 당신을 판단하려는 듯 벌렁입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b88c9b35-876f-8e25-0c00-4cb35e866fb4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount1(2) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount1(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:b88c9b35-876f-8e25-0c00-4cb35e866fb4
msgctxt "hd1a6958fgda21g4a43g8a27g936a93e9baed"
msgid "*A shiver runs across your mind... You feel sated.*"
msgstr "*전율이 불현듯 머릿속을 스쳐 지나가고... 만족감이 듭니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = bbd4ec6f-abfb-998a-fbb6-9ec9492db1d4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:bbd4ec6f-abfb-998a-fbb6-9ec9492db1d4
msgctxt "h228a6525gd2e6g47e3gad03g4fec6bc65d5b"
msgid "You wanna haggle? Fine. The price has just doubled!"
msgstr "흥정을 원해? 좋아. 가격을 두 배로 올려주지!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = bcace061-859f-e2ca-c46e-062338f49f44
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - f8d20378-d64f-2863-d81e-394cd4a9fa41_MindHasBeenRead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:bcace061-859f-e2ca-c46e-062338f49f44
msgctxt "h5488527bg7203g4986g9b1dgbf572c49b044"
msgid ""
"<i>I ain't got much stomach for a fight. Better just put on a show an' scare "
"this one off.</i>"
msgstr "<i>싸울 의지는 없어. 그냥 엄포로 겁줘서 쫓아내는 게 낫겠군.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = bd5ab20e-8b97-5e1c-e800-4448fd494c38
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount2(2) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount2(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:bd5ab20e-8b97-5e1c-e800-4448fd494c38
msgctxt "hacbb1768g8525g487bg9c85ga902e998db3a"
msgid ""
"*Something stirs deep within you, hungry and alert... it's taking something "
"you'll never get back.*"
msgstr "*몸 깊숙한 데서 굶주리고 기민한 존재가 꿈틀댑니다... 잃으면 되찾지 못할 뭔가를 좀먹고 있군요.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bde33c1d-c8af-7883-8045-d589b113a0c1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(2) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:bde33c1d-c8af-7883-8045-d589b113a0c1
msgctxt "hcd4ad41cgf1bfg43ceg907fg7d8e97bd056d"
msgid "I am a True Soul. I will pay nothing, and you will leave."
msgstr "난 참된 영혼이다. 난 한 푼도 내지 않을 거야. 그리고 너는 떠나도록 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = be75bd79-f0d9-3b5f-368c-65a9164104ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:be75bd79-f0d9-3b5f-368c-65a9164104ae
msgctxt "ha28139cbg733dg4660gbd35g129aedc8643d"
msgid "Nawh... you wouldn't be able, you're just a... erm..."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = bff74678-46b4-a43a-111b-9f9b04a8bcd3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:bff74678-46b4-a43a-111b-9f9b04a8bcd3
msgctxt "h8a6a1ed4g06ffg44e5ga1f6g647aac3570b5"
msgid ""
"I don't want lessons, I want gold. But I'll settle for cuttin' out that "
"silver tongue of yours..."
msgstr "수업이 아니라 돈을 받고 싶다고. 그렇지만 너의 세치혀를 잘라버리는 걸로 만족해야겠어..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = bff910a8-f7de-d78e-55e9-89821f0e9536
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount6(2) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount6(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:bff910a8-f7de-d78e-55e9-89821f0e9536
msgctxt "ha05cc659g8cf7g463cgb579gfe949d456150"
msgid ""
"*The presence deep in your mind is awake, unblinking. This is it. A single "
"word pervades your consciousness: 'Soon'.*"
msgstr ""
"*당신의 정신 속 깊이 자리잡은 존재가 태연스레 깨어납니다. 올 것이 왔군요. 한 단어가 당신의 의식 속으로 스며듭니다. ‘곧’*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c0255771-e841-ccdb-4a9e-0627ef541fdc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_UnfortunateGnome_State_NonCharlatanAccess = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:c0255771-e841-ccdb-4a9e-0627ef541fdc
msgctxt "h51dd7413g2659g42afga798g0d26732b988c"
msgid ""
"Your skull will make a fine chalice once I plug those beady eye sockets."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = c07c69b4-bd74-518b-b0c5-61eae69218d1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:c07c69b4-bd74-518b-b0c5-61eae69218d1
msgctxt "h6715aef1g89ceg465egacf3g363a5f5262b0"
msgid "You? One of us? Not bloody likely!"
msgstr "네가? 같은 편이라고? 개떡같은 소리 하지 마!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = c0dcae74-5db1-7493-94c1-8c9bab0fa63f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:c0dcae74-5db1-7493-94c1-8c9bab0fa63f
msgctxt "h10dd0e32g5d84g42cagab39g7842a46e5b4a"
msgid ""
"...an' pay me loads more! Yeuheuheu! "
"([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_2_463b0f43-5410-412d-aba3-875cf81c38ca])"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = c835f3fb-bd76-ff72-d90b-a446e5bc3299
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_UnfortunateGnome_State_Still = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:c835f3fb-bd76-ff72-d90b-a446e5bc3299
msgctxt "h045b15e8g797bg489bgbb7bg3c119e5119ca"
msgid "Heh, funny. That's what our birdie wanted."
msgstr "헤, 재밌네. 우리 새도 그러고 싶어했지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = c8d38655-d8f0-1688-1eb4-50025c445d1b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:c8d38655-d8f0-1688-1eb4-50025c445d1b
msgctxt "h5bc449bcg0c66g4ba1gbb0dgf0f1c59fdf93"
msgid ""
"Ugh. That whinging of yours hurts my ears. A cut throat'll quieten you good "
"and proper."
msgstr "윽. 그 징징대는 소리에 귀가 아프군. 목을 베면 조용해지겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c9139544-3dad-87ab-9b84-5df7981f3ae3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - WLD_GnomeGoblin1_DrowKeepGoing(2) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - BRANDED(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_UnfortunateGnome_State_NonCharlatanAccess = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:c9139544-3dad-87ab-9b84-5df7981f3ae3
msgctxt "hb686c9cfg6fc9g4ebfgba97gea4079a4b3b4"
msgid "<i>Show them your brand.</i>"
msgstr "<i>낙인을 보여준다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c96e9311-1444-f4b0-be71-8a56913fa953
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - WLD_GnomeGoblin1_AbandonNegotiations(2) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GNOME and !REALLY_DEEPGNOME
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:c96e9311-1444-f4b0-be71-8a56913fa953
msgctxt "hbf063130g68fbg4e1cgae23gfc94f7b69370"
msgid "I've changed my mind - release the deep gnome and clear off. Or else."
msgstr "마음이 바뀌었다. 저 노움을 풀어주고 떠나. 안 그러기만 해봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c96e9311-1444-f4b0-be71-8a56913fa953
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - WLD_GnomeGoblin1_AbandonNegotiations(2) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_DEEPGNOME
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:c96e9311-1444-f4b0-be71-8a56913fa953
msgctxt "h58751f9bge516g4aeegaf0ag7519267f6899"
msgid "I've changed my mind - release my kin and clear off. Or else."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c96e9311-1444-f4b0-be71-8a56913fa953
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - WLD_GnomeGoblin1_AbandonNegotiations(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:c96e9311-1444-f4b0-be71-8a56913fa953
msgctxt "h0bc2bdb5g2867g4652g94c0g66d9cb41865b"
msgid "I've changed my mind - release the gnome and clear off. Or else."
msgstr "마음이 바뀌었다. 저 노움을 풀어주고 떠나. 안 그러기만 해봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cae1c925-0255-6926-f3ca-5d9ef4de88ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold_2 = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:cae1c925-0255-6926-f3ca-5d9ef4de88ec
msgctxt "h78d96c32g7c81g40c5gb2ceg39341271347a"
msgid "I think I'll just kill you for free instead."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = cd2c7c80-aaa7-6df4-17fd-ea781ccbdc78
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:cd2c7c80-aaa7-6df4-17fd-ea781ccbdc78
msgctxt "h3fcfa953g7f68g4031ga349g2f6998a63df7"
msgid "I'll count how long it takes you to bleed out unless you pay!"
msgstr "돈을 내지 않겠다면, 네가 피 흘리는 데 걸리는 시간을 계산해야겠어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = cd98589c-4742-0ccf-1dd0-3712f5872ba2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:cd98589c-4742-0ccf-1dd0-3712f5872ba2
msgctxt "h33decccbg08c5g4894g8336ge784e56dd71a"
msgid "Erm... all right..."
msgstr "음... 그러죠..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cfe8d644-4969-42b5-b924-36808bd5aec5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
