msgctxt "h0e8af8beg40fcg41f6g8b63g4eca4b9dcea2"
msgid ""
"I might be willing to part with a more reasonable sum. "
"([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_5_8860ed48-ba5f-4b7b-82bf-f1220f967d41])"
msgstr ""
"내가 좀 더 합리적인 금액을 제시할 수 있는데. ([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_5_8860ed48-ba5f-4b7b-"
"82bf-f1220f967d41])"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = d15edc80-fb58-7278-ad46-56182a211dca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_GnomeGoblinsPacified = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:d15edc80-fb58-7278-ad46-56182a211dca
msgctxt "h6e970ce7g9ea5g4b0bgbdd2g195ec25ce99f"
msgid "We'll, erm, we'll leave you to it."
msgstr "이건, 음, 이건 당신에게 남겨두겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d185d8be-b360-53cf-0b00-8f741a1a2a49
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:d185d8be-b360-53cf-0b00-8f741a1a2a49
msgctxt "hffbb3c06g771bg4a0fg91bag70551436df4e"
msgid "<i>Allow them to leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그들이 떠날 수 있게 허락한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = d64c502d-855c-5f5d-f9bf-2fe4eb963c6b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:d64c502d-855c-5f5d-f9bf-2fe4eb963c6b
msgctxt "h7861246dgff76g49deg8b52g42684ec1e48b"
msgid ""
"Erm... not that I'm complainin'... but you <i>are </i>blessed, ain't ya?"
msgstr "어... 불평하려는 건 아니지만... <i>진짜로</i> 축복받으신 분 맞죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = d91975bd-9066-4e94-87c3-895d3111972c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:d91975bd-9066-4e94-87c3-895d3111972c
msgctxt "h2d8f838eg7232g48b1g8fc3g85f3d74abefb"
msgid "Ask in the wha...?"
msgstr "뭐라ㄱ...?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = da6ffcf7-e319-2dfc-0c30-828ec12e77d4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_GnomeGoblinsPromisedLeave = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:da6ffcf7-e319-2dfc-0c30-828ec12e77d4
msgctxt "hfea88efag0dc6g4a53gb250g083a16f8db7e"
msgid "If I see you here again, no price will save you."
msgstr "내가 널 다시 보게 되면, 어떤 대가도 널 구해줄 수 없을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = de017f0c-8ff3-81eb-813d-42dfa4513022
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - f8d20378-d64f-2863-d81e-394cd4a9fa41_HaggleMindBeenRead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:de017f0c-8ff3-81eb-813d-42dfa4513022
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "he4e89e91gccaag4a31gaed0g1cc4ebe9112c"
msgid "Your price is absurd and you know it."
msgstr "가격이 터무니없는 거 알잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = deedd181-60bc-228c-6829-69574df22678
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:deedd181-60bc-228c-6829-69574df22678
msgctxt "ha8e7eb2egba41g4bc5gbd38g47cc27d2ae3d"
msgid "Be careful! Let's get this poor man down alive."
msgstr "조심해! 이 불쌍한 녀석을 살아있는 상태로 쓰러뜨리자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = dfcb4aca-b12c-527a-9cbf-edf1fdd1fc55
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_UnfortunateGnome_State_Still = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:dfcb4aca-b12c-527a-9cbf-edf1fdd1fc55
msgctxt "h25e69e83gb4e4g4cb1g9e6bg272a22b5ed8a"
msgid "'Less you wanna join him up there, you'd best pay the toll."
msgstr "저 위에 있는 애랑 같이 있고 싶지 않으면, 통행료를 내는 게 좋을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e164ffd6-cd99-9c63-4d28-f8729ec28819
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:e164ffd6-cd99-9c63-4d28-f8729ec28819
msgctxt "h1adb0353g4bafg4befga6f0gc3e4f106785e"
msgid "Stop - I have questions."
msgstr "멈춰 - 질문이 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e22630a0-2a3b-4c98-2ede-902de00fefa2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount6(2) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount6(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1:e22630a0-2a3b-4c98-2ede-902de00fefa2
msgctxt "hf7553672gbb4eg4602g8deaga96f3a2cab22"
msgid ""
"*The presence deep in your mind is awake, unblinking. This is it. A single "
"word pervades your consciousness: 'Soon'.*"
msgstr ""
"*당신의 정신 속 깊이 자리잡은 존재가 태연스레 깨어납니다. 올 것이 왔군요. 한 단어가 당신의 의식 속으로 스며듭니다. ‘곧’*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e28ff8ea-6ff7-095f-8dd2-a088a001ef8d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - WLD_GnomeGoblin1_AbandonNegotiations(2) = False
