msgctxt "h42e2a863g3319g400egb6c5g945701dca595"
msgid ""
"*It's no use. Your body seems to have a mind of its own as you move to "
"strike the goblin dead.*"
msgstr "*소용이 없습니다. 당신의 몸은 멋대로 움직여, 고블린을 때려 죽이려 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GnomeGoblin1_Surrender_NotAtWindmill
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f9cd5681-c835-c90c-70d8-e303ce01c304
