msgstr "당신은 참된 영혼이시군요... 제-제 실수입니다, 각하."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 28093e69-28ba-7fa4-695b-13fdafa765e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:28093e69-28ba-7fa4-695b-13fdafa765e6
msgctxt "h2400a6ccgcb1fg4a09g9556gc10e5f32f37d"
msgid "I know you're there. Show yourselves."
msgstr "거기 있는 거 다 알아. 모습을 보여."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = 2f548c52-c4ae-80f4-7685-3b32736f6711
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:2f548c52-c4ae-80f4-7685-3b32736f6711
msgctxt "h57da7b3cga83fg4c2dgac97g429ec14f28d8"
msgid "Ain't no one gettin' their way today."
msgstr "오늘은 아무도 지나가지 못한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = 31771b9b-2cbb-62ff-07df-578abc4515e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:31771b9b-2cbb-62ff-07df-578abc4515e8
msgctxt "hbff8c2b1gf51bg406bgb8a5g4ef5f8a5ec02"
msgid "We got you surrounded."
msgstr "넌 포위되었다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = 39826080-1888-7d06-6ba2-bd39086f6bbe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_GoblinAmbush_GoblinsPacified = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:39826080-1888-7d06-6ba2-bd39086f6bbe
msgctxt "h3681912cg957dg4877ga10eg2e5d52a84ae2"
msgid "You see anythin' shiny, it's ours."
msgstr "반짝이는 건 다 우리 꺼야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = 3fe944db-e8d0-9e56-667b-b46f8d0cfb01
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:3fe944db-e8d0-9e56-667b-b46f8d0cfb01
msgctxt "h01c629b1g0ad8g4496gbda9g1c4ada55adb6"
msgid "Don't bother runnin'. My archers got decent aim and plenty of arrows."
msgstr "도망치는 데 애쓰지 마. 우리 궁수들은 실력이 좋고, 화살도 충분히 있으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = 4325d381-72a4-030f-831d-9c725d7822d4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:4325d381-72a4-030f-831d-9c725d7822d4
msgctxt "h8fba19d5g9c66g425bgad87gf0fd25a42217"
msgid "No fun in skewerin' a pig what doesn't know he's cooked."
msgstr "자기가 요리되고 있는 줄 모르는 돼지를 잡는 건 재미가 없다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 464ea3d6-b337-549f-171b-c8e745b3c70c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount6(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount6(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:464ea3d6-b337-549f-171b-c8e745b3c70c
msgctxt "h4bac94f4ge87dg46cdgb437g8477e56d5897"
msgid ""
"*The presence deep in your mind is awake, unblinking. This is it. A single "
"word pervades your consciousness: 'Soon'.*"
msgstr ""
"*당신의 정신 속 깊이 자리잡은 존재가 태연스레 깨어납니다. 올 것이 왔군요. 한 단어가 당신의 의식 속으로 스며듭니다. ‘곧’*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 46bb1bd7-d512-3b89-df85-8d9906d99bd9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:46bb1bd7-d512-3b89-df85-8d9906d99bd9
msgctxt "h38e2077ag0eb8g4859ga2cbg155f4f504460"
msgid "Don't let it happen again."
msgstr "다시는 이런 일 없도록 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = 4785fcf2-79b1-442a-66c8-5456a316dcc2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:4785fcf2-79b1-442a-66c8-5456a316dcc2
msgctxt "h5455cc96gb36bg446fgb886g1c8b6463be22"
msgid "Or you turn around, an' your backside gets the same treatment."
msgstr "아니면 뒤를 돌아 떠나든지. 그럼 똑같은 결과를 맞게 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 521f4b3f-f29a-a051-e195-f127ab52e954
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:521f4b3f-f29a-a051-e195-f127ab52e954
msgctxt "h7cb5a001g5fb1g4698gb47cga9299723f375"
msgid "<i>Keep quiet.</i>"
msgstr "<i>침묵을 유지한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = 52988ff8-4b0a-ae36-3dee-e0448c076840
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Party:
#.      - FOR_Ambush_Knows_GoblinAmbushers(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:52988ff8-4b0a-ae36-3dee-e0448c076840
msgctxt "he417e129ga7f1g4777g93b0gdd10f7d56375"
msgid "Git over there. Surround 'em, like."
msgstr "절로 가. 놈들을 포위해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 53ee943b-7e82-533c-b0ff-5dad57fe156d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:53ee943b-7e82-533c-b0ff-5dad57fe156d
msgctxt "h0a7662d3ge71dg4192g944bga906b1293be1"
msgid "Just let me by and we'll pretend this never happened."
msgstr "날 그냥 보내주면, 없던 일로 해주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5e442c5c-e49d-ffe4-a707-2a9fd42c4943
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:5e442c5c-e49d-ffe4-a707-2a9fd42c4943
msgctxt "h1f096551g42bdg410dg9904g8f311755f9b3"
msgid "<i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 649dc3ca-4178-0f94-2251-50e8ab262a7a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - GLO_TadpoleIntro_NPC(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:649dc3ca-4178-0f94-2251-50e8ab262a7a
msgctxt "hbbb4566fgfeb9g41f9ga38dgaec36242e6c8"
msgid "*As the symbol glows, power courses through you. <i>Authority</i>.*"
msgstr "*문양이 빛나며, 몸에 흐르는 힘이 느껴집니다. <i>권위</i>.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = 66593a6d-ff5e-656c-628a-d8704646aa82
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:66593a6d-ff5e-656c-628a-d8704646aa82
msgctxt "he3ad72cfg5dcfg4f52g8ad6g3e64c29db10e"
msgid ""
"Don't seem fair for the lads to miss out. Bet we'd get some nice cuts out of "
"you."
msgstr "우리 부하들이 너를 놓치는 게 말이 안 돼. 너를 잡아서 맛있는 고기를 얻을 수 있을 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6eed4eb0-5c10-0a1c-74f0-63dafda85753
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = True
#. TagRule: BERSERKER
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:6eed4eb0-5c10-0a1c-74f0-63dafda85753
msgctxt "hdb5a9060g7d9eg465cg91edg36a1bd5cf104"
msgid "<b><i>ROAR.</i></b>"
msgstr "<b><i>크아아.</i></b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6eed4eb0-5c10-0a1c-74f0-63dafda85753
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:6eed4eb0-5c10-0a1c-74f0-63dafda85753
msgctxt "h499835a0g48a1g4d3eg9997gfb61639830fb"
msgid "Not scared of your <b>pinpricks</b>."
msgstr "너희가 쥔 그 <b>바늘 따위</b>에 겁먹을 리가."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6fb0dc2e-8e9c-d155-53e0-e14be89a5d44
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:6fb0dc2e-8e9c-d155-53e0-e14be89a5d44
msgctxt "h690bdc1fge808g4d42g8ae2g3a7e8e94a889"
msgid "I reckon my meat's too tough for runty goblin fangs."
msgstr "내 살갗은 고블린의 작은 이빨로 씹기에는 너무 질길 걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 73faf2ab-a1e1-47f4-abc8-465cd7dde1f3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:73faf2ab-a1e1-47f4-abc8-465cd7dde1f3
msgctxt "h3bdea0e3g19a1g4613g84cbg3cce2d1c10e0"
msgid ""
"*The mark glows, but you feel nothing in response. Your illithid power is "
"beyond reach until you rest.*"
msgstr "*문양이 빛나지만, 어떤 반응도 느껴지지 않습니다. 일리시드 능력을 더 사용하려면 휴식을 취해야 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 768ede0a-e05e-a07e-1db2-3e4451c94d50
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:768ede0a-e05e-a07e-1db2-3e4451c94d50
msgctxt "h87d2f56fg0b2fg4e30gb7adg4e42ef866e69"
msgid "I'm not running, and their aim's not good enough to save <i>you</i>."
msgstr "나는 도망치려는 게 아니야. 그리고 궁수들의 실력도 <i>너를</i> 지켜줄 정도는 안될걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = 81168289-4a41-e283-d147-08c9812aec05
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_GoblinAmbush_State_NonCharlatanAccess = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:81168289-4a41-e283-d147-08c9812aec05
msgctxt "h8bdba948g4796g47f3gb297gf9b5195774d8"
msgid "Gut's lettin' just anyone join these days, huh?"
msgstr "요즘은 누구나 놈의 무리에 들어갈 수 있는 모양이군, 안그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = 87101c4e-8af3-0644-7e6f-18abb8232e13
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:87101c4e-8af3-0644-7e6f-18abb8232e13
msgctxt "h3151ccaegef03g45ebg8894gdb1ab17a8475"
msgid "Well, well, boys. Looks like we got ourselves a trespasser."
msgstr "이런, 이런, 얘들아. 우리가 침입자를 발견한 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = 8b2df5b7-c114-3d17-5048-b14323b4642d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:8b2df5b7-c114-3d17-5048-b14323b4642d
msgctxt "hc65a2c4eg4a67g451cga69ag2e4e3d84485e"
msgid "Erh... s'pose it's best to save our strength for a <i>real</i> threat."
msgstr "어... <i>진짜</i> 위협에 대비하기 위해선 힘을 아껴두는 게 낫겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8fc03f27-cb4a-0d42-7101-6222041cb4a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:8fc03f27-cb4a-0d42-7101-6222041cb4a0
msgctxt "hb0be8bc0gb7f6g411agb3cbga373e4fc306c"
msgid "Spare them the trouble and just let me pass - I'll be gone in no time."
msgstr "귀찮게 하지 말고 그냥 지나가게 해줘. 금방 갈게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 91699f7a-77d2-e0fe-fe20-f4b169b39f8f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:91699f7a-77d2-e0fe-fe20-f4b169b39f8f
msgctxt "h777119degb61eg467bga787gdfb6dd76b52c"
msgid "It'll take more than an apology. Your head will suffice."
msgstr "사과론 부족할 것 같은데. 네 머리통이면 적절할 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = 993aab7a-7346-4128-9256-feda6b1aa99f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:993aab7a-7346-4128-9256-feda6b1aa99f
msgctxt "hd00384bfg1ebcg4263g9386gd257b0939749"
msgid "You spotted us. Good. 'S like they say..."
msgstr "우릴 찾았네. 좋아. 이런 말 있잖아..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9dcf4940-758a-7089-e5af-b94048e88eb5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_HALFORC(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:9dcf4940-758a-7089-e5af-b94048e88eb5
msgctxt "h1f10b255ge126g4590g82a8g4b835f17366f"
msgid "Either you stand aside, or I go right through you."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = a1f7b566-94b4-f539-d8d5-cd1f56cdaf36
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:a1f7b566-94b4-f539-d8d5-cd1f56cdaf36
msgctxt "hf476bbbdg602cg4749g825fg5655b294b154"
msgid "Stand down! This one's got a touch of the Absolute about her."
msgstr "물러서라! 이 분은 절대자님의 손길을 받았다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = a1f7b566-94b4-f539-d8d5-cd1f56cdaf36
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:a1f7b566-94b4-f539-d8d5-cd1f56cdaf36
msgctxt "he96a5579gc22cg4379gbf50gace5c165fdf9"
msgid "Stand down! This one's got a touch of the Absolute about him."
msgstr "물러서라! 이 분은 절대자님의 손길을 받았다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = a1f7b566-94b4-f539-d8d5-cd1f56cdaf36
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:a1f7b566-94b4-f539-d8d5-cd1f56cdaf36
msgctxt "h3ed7b8e7g8427g412eg8ca7gfa4145b0aa8b"
msgid "Stand down! This one's got a touch of the Absolute about them."
msgstr "물러서라! 이 분은 절대자님의 손길을 받았다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a2151cbe-8ef7-a029-0f3d-2db762dd7275
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BRANDED(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:a2151cbe-8ef7-a029-0f3d-2db762dd7275
msgctxt "h21af31f4ga3e8g4a0eg91d5g3686c3a244d7"
msgid "<i>Show your brand.</i>"
msgstr "<i>낙인을 보여준다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = a4469970-203d-30cc-fccf-956f1834a0f8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:a4469970-203d-30cc-fccf-956f1834a0f8
msgctxt "hff862e9eg4e41g4fb5g999eg70246469e55c"
msgid "An' I didn't want to be stuck moppin' up nosy trespassers like you."
msgstr "그리고 나는 너와 같은 참견쟁이 침입자를 소탕하는 데 갇히고 싶지 않았다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = a5825581-77c0-87fb-0484-8a66286f243c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:a5825581-77c0-87fb-0484-8a66286f243c
msgctxt "ha842af89gbc97g4107g9240g785a28489abc"
msgid "Oi! You just walked into the wrong town."
msgstr "야! 너 여기 잘못 왔다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = a7b61302-ae93-6e55-70c9-99fb89d56a95
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_GoblinAmbush_Event_StopSpotting = True
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:a7b61302-ae93-6e55-70c9-99fb89d56a95
msgctxt "h1a309136g50cag48a7gb0a5g34426daf036e"
msgid "Meanin' you ain't one of us. Change of plans, lads! Kill 'em!"
msgstr "그럼, 우리 편이 아니라는 뜻이군. 계획 변경이다, 얘들아! 죽여버려!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a9f66764-0587-3dcd-867e-a9a7b39bedd9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = True
#. TagRule: BERSERKER
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:a9f66764-0587-3dcd-867e-a9a7b39bedd9
msgctxt "he0583fc4gcd7bg4d3fg8431g5e44017d1ed7"
msgid "<b><i>ROAR.</i></b>"
msgstr "<b><i>크아아.</i></b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a9f66764-0587-3dcd-867e-a9a7b39bedd9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:a9f66764-0587-3dcd-867e-a9a7b39bedd9
msgctxt "h5c210a73gee4fg474bg973eg888500b31976"
msgid "I said. Let. Me. <b>PASS.</b>"
msgstr "말했잖아. <b>날. 보내. 줘.</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = abb1d9a0-e605-77ca-ba0e-bd81893166ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_GoblinAmbush_State_DrowAutoPass = True
#. TagRule: DROWELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:abb1d9a0-e605-77ca-ba0e-bd81893166ce
msgctxt "h62b896c6g0ac2g4efcgbe56ged6259ef1e5b"
msgid "Wait - a drow? In the sun?"
msgstr "잠깐 - 드로우잖아? 이런 밝은 곳에?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b11399e7-7ee2-55dd-9c71-2c8a04b76ba3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - GLO_TadpoleIntro_NPC(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - GLO_TadpoleIntro_NPC(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:b11399e7-7ee2-55dd-9c71-2c8a04b76ba3
msgctxt "h7c6befffg3df4g4fe7gbfc3g43d2a9992775"
msgid ""
"*A strange symbol glows, marked on their flesh, and something within you "
"stirs in response.*"
msgstr "*그들의 살갗에 새겨진 기묘한 상징이 빛나고, 이에 반응하여 당신 내면의 무언가가 꿈틀거립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b123b081-bbc8-e77c-67b6-ab6c5e6c3418
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount4(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount4(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:b123b081-bbc8-e77c-67b6-ab6c5e6c3418
msgctxt "h5e467a2fgc740g4348g8d52g6951e1e6a2c8"
msgid ""
"*A shadow swims across your vision, and a familiar voice tells you to be "
"calm. You are loved.*"
msgstr "*그림자가 낀 듯이 눈앞이 흐려지더니, 익숙한 목소리가 당신을 달래줍니다. 사랑이 느껴집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = b176a5ba-cdb3-aa6e-6b41-853206a9c679
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_GoblinAmbush_Event_StopSpotting = True
#.     - FOR_GoblinAmbush_GoblinsPacified = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:b176a5ba-cdb3-aa6e-6b41-853206a9c679
msgctxt "h3f999e99g326cg4dc5g8e42gf350be48f089"
msgid "Move it, lads! And show some respect!"
msgstr "얘들아, 움직여! 그리고 존경을 표해!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = b331af78-4bcf-a80b-c6ed-201268818a6b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:b331af78-4bcf-a80b-c6ed-201268818a6b
msgctxt "ha862fdbbgf24dg4d8agb2ebgd87521711442"
msgid "That supposed to be a threat?"
msgstr "그게 위협이냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b50d92e2-3d31-83c8-0bd0-5cde75dc603a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:b50d92e2-3d31-83c8-0bd0-5cde75dc603a
msgctxt "hb9d25a5egcacbg46edgbc6bg3f2afb7b38fc"
msgid "Curious. I had almost the exact same thought when I saw you."
msgstr "흥미롭네. 나도 널 봤을 때 똑같은 생각을 했는데 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = bf538136-0e20-323b-f0f6-5433f891873d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_GoblinAmbush_Event_StopSpotting = True
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:bf538136-0e20-323b-f0f6-5433f891873d
msgctxt "h3a8ef0f5g12c5g4364g81c0g616d3ffc9c29"
msgid "Looks like we're spotted, lads!"
msgstr "우리 들킨 것 같아, 얘들아!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = c3eaac90-f52f-c361-394c-898b6c2114a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_GoblinAmbush_GoblinsPacified = True
#. TagRule: DROWELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:c3eaac90-f52f-c361-394c-898b6c2114a2
msgctxt "h898f8207g982eg4659ga379g13bca7485193"
msgid "Any of the lads give you trouble, they'll answer to me."
msgstr "어떤 놈이라도 문제를 일으키면, 제가 손봐드리겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = c68bad32-44d4-ef60-459a-a377d28d3b1e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_GoblinAmbush_Event_StopSpotting = True
#.     - FOR_GoblinAmbush_GoblinsPacified = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:c68bad32-44d4-ef60-459a-a377d28d3b1e
msgctxt "hb5916fadg9c97g4f3dgbb76g081e7356cdca"
msgid "Go on, then. Just keep your nose clean."
msgstr "그럼 계속 가. 문제 일으킬 생각 말고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c78da5c7-8af0-9fe1-8565-aef7306de15f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - GLO_TadpoleIntro_NPC(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:c78da5c7-8af0-9fe1-8565-aef7306de15f
msgctxt "h41c539f5g97d7g4723gb248gfa3386558e02"
msgid "*As the symbol glows, power courses through you. <i>Authority</i>.*"
msgstr "*문양이 빛나며, 몸에 흐르는 힘이 느껴집니다. <i>권위</i>.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = c8b77f72-abbf-a100-8cdb-a71d5851cadc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_GoblinAmbush_Event_StopSpotting = True
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:c8b77f72-abbf-a100-8cdb-a71d5851cadc
msgctxt "h68cea45eg1d1dg4e9egb752g0feb52feb7c0"
msgid "<i>Almost.</i> I'm gonna enjoy pullin' off your skin when we're done."
msgstr "<i>거의</i> 말이야. 끝나고 네 살갗을 벗기는 걸 즐겨주마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = cfcc2c3c-a477-569c-debe-e8219c49da81
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount2(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount2(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:cfcc2c3c-a477-569c-debe-e8219c49da81
msgctxt "h5f8e9d60g5fd8g4879g9e93gd0b897dd16d6"
msgid ""
"*Something stirs deep within you, hungry and alert... it's taking something "
"you'll never get back.*"
msgstr "*몸 깊숙한 데서 굶주리고 기민한 존재가 꿈틀댑니다... 잃으면 되찾지 못할 뭔가를 좀먹고 있군요.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cff0be90-87de-bc31-3ca9-d809f0830ee8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_GoblinAmbush_State_NonCharlatanAccess = True
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:cff0be90-87de-bc31-3ca9-d809f0830ee8
msgctxt "hc1367f71g887dg440fga1adg2c30318fe476"
msgid "Stand down. Now."
msgstr "물러서. 당장."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d1fdbee9-ae14-4832-dfba-06f68a1d2c38
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DWARF(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:d1fdbee9-ae14-4832-dfba-06f68a1d2c38
msgctxt "h2c1c980cg231cg40fbgbbfag242b709fad6d"
msgid "Come here and face me, you pack of gibbering snot-rags!"
msgstr "이리 와서 날 상대해라, 이 횡설수설하는 아구창 새끼들아!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = d497d59f-bd14-11bf-c9de-4cf9b54b1451
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:d497d59f-bd14-11bf-c9de-4cf9b54b1451
msgctxt "h9753a6cdg822bg4b02gb82cgba97330c2110"
msgid "Y'know, no one said nothin' about a drow coming through."
msgstr "저기, 드로우가 오는 거에 대해 아무 말도 없었는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = d708b2b3-f492-4fcd-fb23-53bd57ed5bc8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:d708b2b3-f492-4fcd-fb23-53bd57ed5bc8
msgctxt "h5106cc5egb7f6g4882g8342g11d1af426c20"
msgid "What, you think we was just gonna let you slip by?"
msgstr "뭐야, 우리가 그냥 널 놔두고 갈 줄 알았어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d738d73d-cb31-c405-228c-3932d948f089
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount3(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount3(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:d738d73d-cb31-c405-228c-3932d948f089
msgctxt "h8895c27ag6907g4b39g9c65gb6dab7cdca94"
msgid "*Your mind lurches, reeling suddenly as if... bitten.*"
msgstr "*뭔가에 깨물린 것처럼 느닷없이 정신이 휘청거립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = dcd308aa-ab69-ab68-f324-00395a5a1cb4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:dcd308aa-ab69-ab68-f324-00395a5a1cb4
msgctxt "hbb8c8fbag73c3g4e30g8806g1234f5e9badd"
msgid "O-of course. Come and go as you as you like."
msgstr "무-물론입죠. 마음껏 드나드십쇼."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Goblin Booyahg
#. NodeID = dddae082-c687-ad06-5af9-72a9d53a432f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_GoblinAmbush_Event_StopSpotting = True
#.     - FOR_GoblinAmbush_GoblinsPacified = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:dddae082-c687-ad06-5af9-72a9d53a432f
msgctxt "h9820591dg65bag4c91g8321g083d498d5c75"
msgid "You'll get no more trouble from us, promise."
msgstr "저희 때문에 불편하실 일은 앞으로 전혀 없으실 겁니다, 약속드립죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = deaa7095-ddc7-df1d-791d-8755e9e1c99b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:deaa7095-ddc7-df1d-791d-8755e9e1c99b
msgctxt "h8c4f131bg51f8g46fcg8531g38df6c1819b9"
msgid "I don't want any trouble."
msgstr "문제를 일으키고 싶진 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e126868c-8a77-ef4d-dbef-dd765545814a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - GLO_TadpoleIntro_NPC(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - GLO_TadpoleIntro_NPC(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:e126868c-8a77-ef4d-dbef-dd765545814a
msgctxt "h1bd2b7bbgadacg4d3fg908ag5cbb9d1d08b0"
msgid ""
"*A strange symbol glows, marked on their flesh, and something within you "
"stirs in response.*"
msgstr "*그들의 살갗에 새겨진 기묘한 상징이 빛나고, 이에 반응하여 당신 내면의 무언가가 꿈틀거립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e127bb31-7d98-9706-d0be-0f16e0f9d5a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#.      - ILLITHID(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:e127bb31-7d98-9706-d0be-0f16e0f9d5a8
msgctxt "h372245bbg1933g43bfg8a10g672828e0d645"
msgid "Stand down. Now."
msgstr "물러서. 당장."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e60f43d4-6120-b8da-e284-a0b00b54664b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.     - TRUESOUL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:e60f43d4-6120-b8da-e284-a0b00b54664b
msgctxt "h266fa194g1a92g4967ga077g988459da702e"
msgid ""
"*Your mind is full, bursting with ecstasy and terror. Finally, it is coming. "
"You are becoming.*"
msgstr "*당신의 정신이 황홀경과 공포로 가득 차오릅니다. 마침내, 때가 됐군요. 당신은 변화 중입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eb616e55-6c52-31e5-f5a7-bc9d4161615f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush:eb616e55-6c52-31e5-f5a7-bc9d4161615f
msgctxt "hf23732a6g6c8cg4af6g81a0g3c03177495f7"
msgid "<i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eedd03cd-c01a-0eaa-d108-8bf9f6bcd83a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
