#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h14e7b7dbgd099g489egb1dfg0d2dc30341b3"
msgid ""
"Bit flowersome, but you got something there. Go on in - reckon you can "
"polish it up some once you've seen the place."
msgstr "꽤나 부족하지만, 뭔가 재미있는 걸 가지고 있군. 들어가봐 - 그 곳을 보고 나면 조금 다듬을 수 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush_CheckpointGuards
#. Speaker = Goblin Warrior
#. NodeID = e611bee1-c52f-75d0-2bde-93bec4bdd8e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush_CheckpointGuards:e611bee1-c52f-75d0-2bde-93bec4bdd8e8
msgctxt "h6572ba98g40d2g4ec0gb182g9e4a423a0b02"
msgid "You <i>what</i>? Go on then, we're bored - give us a taste."
msgstr "너 <i>뭐라고</i>? 그럼 계속 해봐, 지루하던 참이었어 - 맛 좀 보여 달라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush_CheckpointGuards
#. Speaker = Goblin Warrior
#. NodeID = ea488d77-638f-0e7b-d006-34ce4e5de145
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
