#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush_CheckpointGuards:ea488d77-638f-0e7b-d006-34ce4e5de145
msgctxt "h33204dfcg78c6g4664g8932g354d149293cc"
msgid ""
"...Aye. Aye, I reckon that'll do nicely. The good folk of Bogrot give ya "
"thanks."
msgstr "...예이. 예이, 그 정도로 괜찮을 것 같습니다. 보그로트의 좋은 사람들은 당신에게 감사합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush_CheckpointGuards
