msgctxt "h6611ce9ag41efg405cg8a1fgb44c241a4635"
msgid "The only thing you're getting is a beating."
msgstr "네가 얻을 수 있는 것은 딱 한 가지, 두들겨 맞는 것뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush_CheckpointGuards
