msgctxt "h6d2a3e79gdea2g4501gacb1g74f28fe738ed"
msgid ""
"Compromise, then. We'll pop your eyes out and give <i>them</i> the tour, eh?"
msgstr "그러면 이렇게 하지. 우리는 네 눈알을 뽑아서 <i>눈알들</i>에게 둘러보게 할게, 어때?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_GoblinAmbush_CheckpointGuardsWarning
#. Speaker = Goblin Sharp-Eye
#. NodeID = 46cd701c-0da7-05cd-f22f-1ed5449d594f
