msgid "A primitive tool. Useful nonetheless."
msgstr "원시적인 도구군. 쓸모도 없겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_AD_ForgeWeapon
