#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_VB_TakePlans:5c21a0d0-eb65-130f-506c-854fe4ca210b
msgctxt "hcd2cf51cg8498g4d77ga0bbg2719ce71d4c8"
msgid "Weapon blueprints? Looks like this sussur bark might come in handy."
msgstr "무기 청사진인가? 이 수서르 나무 껍질을 쓸 곳이 생긴 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_VB_TakePlans
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f5dbb439-f69b-1fea-a4d8-d84931da932d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_State_PartyHasSussurBark = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_Event_NatureCheck(0) = True
#. TagRule: RANGER or REALLY_UNDERDARK
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_VB_TakePlans:f5dbb439-f69b-1fea-a4d8-d84931da932d
msgctxt "hac006208g9452g4862g929bgcc0dc289174d"
msgid "Weapon blueprints that use sussur bark? Rare find."
msgstr "수서르 나무 껍질을 쓰는 무기 청사진이라고? 흔치 않은 물건이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_VB_TakeSussurSap
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 077eee17-58fd-44cc-7dcc-45d0ea59f8a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_UNDERDARK
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_VB_TakeSussurSap:077eee17-58fd-44cc-7dcc-45d0ea59f8a4
msgctxt "h31b5d9f4g7f4dg41f5gb42cgb6917e78ef00"
msgid "Sussur bark. A rare commodity."
msgstr "수서르 나무 껍질이군. 희귀한 재료지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_VB_TakeSussurSap
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 077eee17-58fd-44cc-7dcc-45d0ea59f8a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_VB_TakeSussurSap:077eee17-58fd-44cc-7dcc-45d0ea59f8a4
msgctxt "hf409c94agbcb5g4175gb259g32b3333425f2"
msgid "I've never seen a tree like that. The bark must be a rarity."
msgstr "이런 나무는 살면서 처음 봐. 분명 이 나무 껍질은 엄청 희귀할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_VB_TakeSussurSap
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aaf4df2e-0bd1-0cfb-cd1a-d9c8574b7749
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_Knows_FurnaceSeen = True
#.      - FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_Knows_ApprenticePlans = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_VB_TakeSussurSap:aaf4df2e-0bd1-0cfb-cd1a-d9c8574b7749
msgctxt "h878960a3g0275g437fg8ba3g97688edd2258"
msgid "I've got the blueprint and the sussur bark. Now, I need a forging tool."
msgstr "청사진과 수서르 나무 껍질을 모두 얻었군. 이제 제조할 도구만 있으면 되겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_VB_TakeSussurSap
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aaf4df2e-0bd1-0cfb-cd1a-d9c8574b7749
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_Knows_FurnaceSeen = True
#.      - FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_Knows_ApprenticePlans = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_VB_TakeSussurSap:aaf4df2e-0bd1-0cfb-cd1a-d9c8574b7749
msgctxt "h17e40c47gac08g4795g8058gbfd3ad84b385"
msgid ""
"I've got the plans and the sussur bark. Now I need somewhere to craft it all."
msgstr "도안과 수서르 나무 껍질을 모두 얻었어. 이제 어디서 제작할지를 찾아야겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_VB_TakeSussurSap
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f548c789-dbe6-0049-e501-3a7cfa25690b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_Knows_FurnaceSeen = False
#.      - FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_Knows_ApprenticePlans = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_VB_TakeSussurSap:f548c789-dbe6-0049-e501-3a7cfa25690b
msgctxt "h65ff6498ga4b5g407eg99b3ga059c1ad4d8f"
msgid "I've the blueprint and the sussur bark. Now, to seek a forging tool."
msgstr "청사진과 수서르 나무 껍질을 모두 얻었군. 이제 제조할 도구만 있으면 되겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_VB_TakeSussurSap
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f548c789-dbe6-0049-e501-3a7cfa25690b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_Knows_FurnaceSeen = False
#.      - FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_Knows_ApprenticePlans = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_VB_TakeSussurSap:f548c789-dbe6-0049-e501-3a7cfa25690b
msgctxt "h6e72490cg55b8g49a9ga892g157faae2c0b0"
msgid "I've the plans and the sussur bark. Now I just need a forge."
msgstr "도안과 수서르 나무 껍질을 모두 얻었어. 이제 대장간만 있으면 되겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_VB_TakeSussurSap
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f5ab03b7-2fde-1463-b5a6-5491edc9dc7f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_IncompleteMasterwork_VB_TakeSussurSap:f5ab03b7-2fde-1463-b5a6-5491edc9dc7f
msgctxt "hb48cc3e7gc104g48a6gbfa2g1636f4b5f018"
msgid "The forge at the blacksmith's house should do."
msgstr "그 대장장이의 집에 있던 대장간이 좋겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KidsGame_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 121316ef-5eca-45ab-a98f-c8b9b45a8094
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KidsGame_PAD:121316ef-5eca-45ab-a98f-c8b9b45a8094
msgctxt "ha338b046g5feeg4e77g9a3bg78854dfce577"
msgid "Ah, the faded ghost of fun."
msgstr "아, 지나간 유희의 유령이여."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KidsGame_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 121316ef-5eca-45ab-a98f-c8b9b45a8094
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KidsGame_PAD:121316ef-5eca-45ab-a98f-c8b9b45a8094
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h6cce7621g7810g49e6gaa6dg9bd4422d3e5c"
msgid ""
"Game marks as faded as the memories of the children that played them. I "
"wonder what became of them."
msgstr "이 놀이를 했던 아이들의 기억처럼 흐릿한 놀이 자국이로군. 이 아이들은 어떻게 되었을까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KidsGame_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 121316ef-5eca-45ab-a98f-c8b9b45a8094
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KidsGame_PAD:121316ef-5eca-45ab-a98f-c8b9b45a8094
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "ha71218a4ga225g410eg8821g02905113416e"
msgid "One, two, tie my laces, three, four, sideways faces..."
msgstr "하나, 둘, 신발 묶고, 셋, 넷, 옆을 보고..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KidsGame_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 121316ef-5eca-45ab-a98f-c8b9b45a8094
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KidsGame_PAD:121316ef-5eca-45ab-a98f-c8b9b45a8094
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hf612570agf616g4314g922cg9c3cc71d1b0b"
msgid ""
"Bah! A children's game. These young should have been sparring - <i>not</i> "
"making merry."
msgstr "하! 꼬마들 놀이야. 이 어린 것들은 전투를 연습해야 할 때 유희나 즐기고 있었군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KidsGame_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 121316ef-5eca-45ab-a98f-c8b9b45a8094
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KidsGame_PAD:121316ef-5eca-45ab-a98f-c8b9b45a8094
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h0e89cbd7g4bb8g4047gb64dg19c917fe1a16"
msgid "Looks familiar... did I play this once? Long ago...?"
msgstr "뭔가 친숙한걸... 오래 전에 이 놀이를 했던 적이 있던가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KidsGame_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 121316ef-5eca-45ab-a98f-c8b9b45a8094
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KidsGame_PAD:121316ef-5eca-45ab-a98f-c8b9b45a8094
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hb4c1bcd8g9740g4967g82f7g91c354a77c9a"
msgid ""
"Oh, how sweet! I used to sneak out to play this with the Lower City kids."
msgstr "오, 옛날 생각 나네! 몰래 나가서 하부 도시 애들이랑 이거 하고 놀았거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KidsGame_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 121316ef-5eca-45ab-a98f-c8b9b45a8094
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_UNDERDARK
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KidsGame_PAD:121316ef-5eca-45ab-a98f-c8b9b45a8094
msgctxt "h624ac52bg96e0g4a9bg9fb3g78c0a1d182cb"
msgid "Hm. A game for surface children."
msgstr "흠. 지상 아이들이 하는 놀이라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KidsGame_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 121316ef-5eca-45ab-a98f-c8b9b45a8094
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_PLANAR
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KidsGame_PAD:121316ef-5eca-45ab-a98f-c8b9b45a8094
msgctxt "h302851ebg574cg4427g9d22gfb1079837eb8"
msgid "Inscrutable markings."
msgstr "알아볼 수 없는 표식들이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KidsGame_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 121316ef-5eca-45ab-a98f-c8b9b45a8094
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_DARK_URGE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KidsGame_PAD:121316ef-5eca-45ab-a98f-c8b9b45a8094
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h9417b438g08adg45c7gb681g49b51cbfe4c2"
msgid "Did I play games like this in my youth? Was I sweet once?"
msgstr "어릴 적에 이런 놀이를 했던가? 나도 귀여웠던 시절이 있었나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KidsGame_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 121316ef-5eca-45ab-a98f-c8b9b45a8094
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[9].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KidsGame_PAD:121316ef-5eca-45ab-a98f-c8b9b45a8094
msgctxt "h73fe66cegacadg4fd4g806fgd2dc28866666"
msgid "Huh. Haven't seen that game in years."
msgstr "허. 저 놀이는 몇년 간 못 봤는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KnifeInMeat
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 084d17c7-7c05-8764-2290-187103b1d71f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_KnifeInMeat_State_KnifeTaken = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KnifeInMeat:084d17c7-7c05-8764-2290-187103b1d71f
msgctxt "hebb74f0cg45dbg4ccagb704ged95ac1efb73"
msgid ""
"*Mystery meat, tough as boar hide. Only the sharpest teeth could pierce it.*"
msgstr "*멧돼지의 가죽 만큼이나 질긴 수수께끼의 고기입니다. 아주 날카로운 이빨만이 꿰뚫을 수 있을 것 같습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KnifeInMeat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0b2397c2-569f-6cdb-29d6-8293b323a19e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KnifeInMeat:0b2397c2-569f-6cdb-29d6-8293b323a19e
msgctxt "ha38a6c61g5dd1g4aa1g95e9gd22b22b42fda"
msgid ""
"<i>Examine the meat. Perhaps there is some trick to removing the dagger.</i>"
msgstr "<i>고기를 살펴본다. 단검을 제거하는 요령이 있을지도 모른다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KnifeInMeat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 252f624b-4a30-f4c1-4de4-68ffd2ab6acd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType:
#. RollAbility: Strength
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KnifeInMeat:252f624b-4a30-f4c1-4de4-68ffd2ab6acd
msgctxt "h20d1979eg48b0g41d0g97a4g2d312acf868d"
msgid "<i>Grasp the handle and pull the dagger with all your might.</i>"
msgstr "<i>손잡이를 붙잡고 온 힘을 다해 단검을 빼낸다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KnifeInMeat
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 2bc7378f-6dc8-6d76-556d-b8c2370ce49f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_KnifeInMeat_Event_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KnifeInMeat:2bc7378f-6dc8-6d76-556d-b8c2370ce49f
msgctxt "h2250de49gdbf5g4cb4gab83ge78ebef4c728"
msgid "*The dagger still juts from the meat.*"
msgstr "*단검은 여전히 고기에 박혀 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KnifeInMeat
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 33067886-2ba1-7f07-fe16-b43207cab3c1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KnifeInMeat:33067886-2ba1-7f07-fe16-b43207cab3c1
msgctxt "hba3ca8a5g0fc1g409eg9b2agfcb57c35d6f3"
msgid ""
"*The dagger is tightly embedded in the carcass. You notice nothing unusual.*"
msgstr "*단검이 고기에 박혀 단단히 박혀 있습니다. 특이한 점은 눈치챌 수 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KnifeInMeat
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4e965298-e94a-9f53-8552-addf92602612
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_KnifeInMeat_State_KnifeTaken = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KnifeInMeat:4e965298-e94a-9f53-8552-addf92602612
msgctxt "h50340f1ag7f91g42d4g8057g5a405243331f"
msgid ""
"*Your cautious method pays off. The dagger glides smoothly out of the "
"mystery meat.*"
msgstr "*조심스러운 접근이 성공적입니다. 단검이 부드럽게 흘러나옵니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KnifeInMeat
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 669ccc93-a3a5-e92e-17f1-f7ea34b4c096
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_KnifeInMeat_State_KnifeBroken = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KnifeInMeat:669ccc93-a3a5-e92e-17f1-f7ea34b4c096
msgctxt "h07b3d7a0gdc91g4637g97ddg707a549e621e"
msgid ""
"*You tug at the dagger until the blade snaps in two. The sharp end is still "
"stuck inside the meat.*"
msgstr "*단검이 두 동강이 나 버렸습니다. 날카로운 칼날은 여전히 고기에 박혀 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KnifeInMeat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 780b3ca4-f123-ca02-b164-0d2f61829864
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Dexterity
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KnifeInMeat:780b3ca4-f123-ca02-b164-0d2f61829864
msgctxt "hc94764aagfd9eg4d1cg809fg8296e2a4ad7e"
msgid "<i>Carefully wiggle the dagger until it slides free.</i>"
msgstr "<i>단검이 미끄러져 나올 때까지 조심스럽게 흔든다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KnifeInMeat
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 804e0aa3-2147-9eaa-9122-0dec77349a2d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_KnifeInMeat_State_InvestigationPassed = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KnifeInMeat:804e0aa3-2147-9eaa-9122-0dec77349a2d
msgctxt "hd80bade3g6c5ag45a8g89e3ga6d36bd30180"
msgid ""
"*You notice the blade is at an angle to the meat's grain. If you align the "
"dagger with the grain, it should slip out easily.*"
msgstr "*칼날이 고기의 결에 비스듬히 닿아 있는 것이 보입니다. 단검을 고기의 결에 맞춰 정렬하면 쉽게 빼낼 수 있을 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KnifeInMeat
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 96def923-114a-ebc3-b970-02c75685afe6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_KnifeInMeat_State_KnifeBroken = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KnifeInMeat:96def923-114a-ebc3-b970-02c75685afe6
msgctxt "hc7e02679gf617g4424g82dag725cca910ff7"
msgid "*Strained by your clumsy technique, the blade snaps in two.*"
msgstr "*당신의 서투른 손놀림으로 인해 칼날이 두 동강이 납니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KnifeInMeat
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b3776eb7-1ce3-2dab-75d7-016a3f42c084
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FOR_KnifeInMeat_Event_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KnifeInMeat:b3776eb7-1ce3-2dab-75d7-016a3f42c084
msgctxt "h42e31e6cgac92g4b60g96f0gf66a2b76d15b"
msgid ""
"*A feast fit for an ogre. You notice a peculiar dagger protruding from the "
"tough, leathery meat.*"
msgstr "*오우거에게 어울리는 만찬입니다. 질기고 가죽 같은 고기에서 튀어나온 특이한 단검이 눈에 띕니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KnifeInMeat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d0804c27-6ac9-0da6-fc2a-be9087198de5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_KnifeInMeat_State_InvestigationPassed = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KnifeInMeat:d0804c27-6ac9-0da6-fc2a-be9087198de5
msgctxt "he537775ag0ba0g4bf1g9a7ag9dd3f1dbe93c"
msgid "<i>Align the dagger with the meat's grain and pull.</i>"
msgstr "<i>단검을 고기의 결에 맞춰 정렬한 뒤, 당긴다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KnifeInMeat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e22f7580-e13a-c3e9-9d0d-c4396e9fd3d1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KnifeInMeat:e22f7580-e13a-c3e9-9d0d-c4396e9fd3d1
msgctxt "h5df032b1gb146g427dg8f50g2ab27ff3efa5"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KnifeInMeat
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e94b7b07-43b2-605a-50c3-f1f14e8cad77
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_KnifeInMeat_State_KnifeBroken = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KnifeInMeat:e94b7b07-43b2-605a-50c3-f1f14e8cad77
msgctxt "hfcdf084fgc793g4c54g8b95gf70302d6397f"
msgid "*A sharp metal fragment pokes out of the meat. It's of no use to you.*"
msgstr "*날카로운 칼날이 여전히 고기에 박혀 있습니다. 이제 어떤 쓸모도 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KnifeInMeat
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e9cdf174-cb00-db98-f7ee-d8be81a9fdb6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_KnifeInMeat_State_KnifeTaken = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KnifeInMeat:e9cdf174-cb00-db98-f7ee-d8be81a9fdb6
msgctxt "ha1c2ff6fga71dg4a47gba10gb0323a22a73e"
msgid "*You yank the dagger free, leaving a narrow slit behind.*"
msgstr "*성공적으로 단검을 빼냈습니다. 얇은 흔적이 고기에 남아 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KnifeInMeat
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f0bb4d0a-4f97-4a8f-06de-194d2c22a60d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_KnifeInMeat_State_KnifeTaken = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_KnifeInMeat:f0bb4d0a-4f97-4a8f-06de-194d2c22a60d
msgctxt "h89c373e8g740fg4d35ga186gad4199a0f8f0"
msgid ""
"*Thanks to your keen eye, the dagger glides smoothly out of the mystery "
"meat.*"
msgstr "*당신의 예리한 눈 덕분에 단검이 수수께끼 고기에서 부드럽게 미끄러져 나옵니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_AD_Vanish
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = eff90ff0-e2f5-e925-cc7b-ffb576e0caea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_AD_Vanish:eff90ff0-e2f5-e925-cc7b-ffb576e0caea
msgctxt "h31cb83e5g672eg45d6gb61eg8fe1201245c0"
msgid "Bah! To hell with the devil, is it? Very well, I shall oblige."
msgstr "쳇! 데빌은 지옥에나 떨어저라, 이건가요? 좋습니다. 원하시는 대로."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = 00610bf7-a18e-6a07-3a2a-b993c0241174
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:00610bf7-a18e-6a07-3a2a-b993c0241174
msgctxt "h61a84dbag556ag4f37gb5d5g814ba7fbc025"
msgid "...only to realise victory was never an option."
msgstr "...애초에 승리할 방도가 없었다는 사실만 깨닫게 되는 거죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 06bcd11b-2406-5c84-6601-1d36a6e87e16
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 1cf7e716-d5a6-7c21-9147-179929f534c2_DrewWeapon = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:06bcd11b-2406-5c84-6601-1d36a6e87e16
msgctxt "h9bad0580g83fcg4f31g88afg4e65f5098bae"
msgid "<i>Draw your weapon.</i>"
msgstr "<i>무기를 꺼낸다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = 081902df-e660-5879-10de-e820fd340e7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:081902df-e660-5879-10de-e820fd340e7c
msgctxt "h3c50d9ffg9e65g4efeg95e6g67507fa27bbd"
msgid ""
"This is the House of Hope. Where the tired come to rest, and the famished "
"come to feed - lavishly."
msgstr "이곳은 희망의 집입니다. 지친 자들이 휴식을 취하고, 굶주린 자들이 배를 채우는 곳이죠. 사치스럽게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = 0968f4c3-d0a2-4f8d-9ac3-ab2795a96037
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:0968f4c3-d0a2-4f8d-9ac3-ab2795a96037
msgctxt "hf2267989g53f6g4778ga184g404b22532848"
msgid ""
"The House of Hope. Where the tired come to rest, and the famished come to "
"feed - lavishly."
msgstr "희망의 집입니다. 지친 자들이 휴식을 취하고, 굶주린 자들이 배를 채우는 곳이죠. 사치스럽게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0f7e937f-056b-c554-d93f-6f1580ee38ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:0f7e937f-056b-c554-d93f-6f1580ee38ed
msgctxt "hf67f2ecbgeef5g4974ga6edg3e78459896fe"
msgid "I don't care what you are - I care what you want."
msgstr "네가 누군지는 신경 안 써, 뭘 원하는지 말해 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = 12214147-11bd-ceea-13b3-4dcf809d286b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:12214147-11bd-ceea-13b3-4dcf809d286b
msgctxt "h9ab029e9gd7dbg451agbb64gfa6462f733fa"
msgid ""
"Tut tut. No need for that crude cutlery of yours. As you can see, I'm amply "
"provisioned."
msgstr "쯧 쯧. 그런 조잡한 날붙이는 필요없습니다. 보시다시피, 전 음식을 충분히 갖추고 있습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = 15827a6e-6c8a-6341-9c25-c309a6c3a740
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:15827a6e-6c8a-6341-9c25-c309a6c3a740
msgctxt "haead7646gbebeg4ed5g9108g590a9dda36b1"
msgid ""
"And you're in dire need. One skull, two tenants, and no solution in sight."
msgstr "그리고 당신은 심각한 어려움에 처해 있군요. 두개골 하나에, 세입자는 둘인데, 해결법은 안 보이잖습니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = 191df100-edf8-d661-6e46-deda9c336253
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:191df100-edf8-d661-6e46-deda9c336253
msgctxt "hbd1aa318g2f87g4248g8621gdb86dc35a3ff"
msgid "Hope. Hahaha! Such a tease."
msgstr "희망이라. 하하하! 참 재밌는 장난이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = 19c4d3a0-5c5a-5709-205f-67bd7c43a678
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:19c4d3a0-5c5a-5709-205f-67bd7c43a678
msgctxt "hb1a20613gbd6ag4edagaa4fg40aadcd1bf65"
msgid "What's better than a devil you don't know?"
msgstr "낯선 데빌과 거래하는 것보다 나은 게 뭔지 아십니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1de2d9db-c529-c6e9-5887-dbfe3bcf950a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:1de2d9db-c529-c6e9-5887-dbfe3bcf950a
msgctxt "h22d8cd58gf24eg496ag8f4bg0f7cadf28e23"
msgid "I'd rather die."
msgstr "차라리 뒈지는 꼴이 낫겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = 23f856b9-2c52-db65-45c4-638a929792bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:23f856b9-2c52-db65-45c4-638a929792bd
msgctxt "h3785c3ebge5a6g4a37g89ebg93def33ef0c5"
msgid ""
"Not easily rattled, I see. Good. Makes the next part that much more "
"straightforward."
msgstr "쉽게 흔들리시지 않는군요. 잘됐네요. 다음 단계가 훨씬 더 간단해졌으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 250de446-22b9-4d0a-fe7c-750c2e0459e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:250de446-22b9-4d0a-fe7c-750c2e0459e8
msgctxt "h7b53a871gefb6g45bdg9777g5bd859f422ab"
msgid "Nice decor."
msgstr "멋지게 꾸몄군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 25d1114c-aa88-d714-c1d3-1a4b63e085ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:25d1114c-aa88-d714-c1d3-1a4b63e085ed
msgctxt "hec5bb708g0db2g4cf4g9d2egd8da218fb7b6"
msgid "Why would you help me?"
msgstr "왜 나를 도우려는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = 2a4dde8d-8bac-6ba4-46a4-617653ba5a34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 1cf7e716-d5a6-7c21-9147-179929f534c2_WyllPresent = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:2a4dde8d-8bac-6ba4-46a4-617653ba5a34
msgctxt "h2ccb08b8gcdf3g431bg8edag9b0f75bd9fdd"
msgid "And so much more."
msgstr "그보다 더 한 존재지요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e9b325b-5f88-347d-c8db-a4ec148d34ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:2e9b325b-5f88-347d-c8db-a4ec148d34ae
msgctxt "h342b7fbbg5675g4c66ga64bge887f4f50265"
msgid "I need to think this over."
msgstr "이건 좀 생각을 해 봐야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = 2f652bee-be6b-25fe-914d-c38280084ef1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:2f652bee-be6b-25fe-914d-c38280084ef1
msgctxt "h9a4b9c5fg2905g4129gbba2gc6e56ec4555c"
msgid "A devil you do."
msgstr "아는 데빌과 거래하는 거죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 38091fa9-248c-0f43-0a91-d84460ef72a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:38091fa9-248c-0f43-0a91-d84460ef72a9
msgctxt "he80de90bgdd4eg4c77gab53g082f33302250"
msgid "Can you be more specific than 'somewhere'?"
msgstr "'장소'보다 더 구체적으로 설명할 순 없어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = 38e2d5aa-80d7-06d6-04aa-9d557e19e060
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:38e2d5aa-80d7-06d6-04aa-9d557e19e060
msgctxt "h887946ebg21efg4a19g92d5ge90963acaae2"
msgid "You do not seek it, but it has found you:"
msgstr "원치 않으셨겠지만, 그게 당신을 찾아왔답니다:"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = 4d71e293-8bfd-fcbc-1a33-653898683a1b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:4d71e293-8bfd-fcbc-1a33-653898683a1b
msgctxt "h48df382cg772ag48ffg9096gaf18bb74cbca"
msgid "Are you not entertained? Well - far be it from me to disappoint."
msgstr "재미있지 않으신가요? 자, 실망하시긴 이르답니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = 4f47ea67-d358-b763-9cb2-58737f70691a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:4f47ea67-d358-b763-9cb2-58737f70691a
msgctxt "he0d64cd4gf634g4be4g9269gd27ddc4c3e3b"
msgid "Oh. That's disappointing. I prefer it when my clients put up a fight..."
msgstr "오. 실망스럽군요. 전 고객들이 저항하는 편이 좋은지라..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 53352f1d-8ca8-0bac-7599-81f00df90da1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:53352f1d-8ca8-0bac-7599-81f00df90da1
msgctxt "h4ac1a3d2g5201g4037g9d86g21450f5a5458"
msgid "I'll have the last laugh in the end."
msgstr "마지막에 웃는 건 내가 될 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = 5386c3c5-c8d1-eb60-814e-0f4040933af5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:5386c3c5-c8d1-eb60-814e-0f4040933af5
msgctxt "h8a42b6f5g4e47g4a57g92d8gbdc8698f1689"
msgid "...it might just be your last."
msgstr "...당신의 마지막 식사가 될지도 모르니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = 549f74f9-a787-2460-d4ba-c2335c441caa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:549f74f9-a787-2460-d4ba-c2335c441caa
msgctxt "h0dbbd629g68f6g4091gabc5gd2505c311e72"
msgid "Fair enough."
msgstr "좋습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5ae1b3b1-476b-93db-3073-c4459d3c90d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:5ae1b3b1-476b-93db-3073-c4459d3c90d0
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h2de90464g0fb1g4c0fga119gb6409d9f94a5"
msgid "We're in the Hells, aren't we. Take me back. <i>Now.</i>"
msgstr "여긴 지옥이잖아, 바로 알겠어. 우릴 돌려보내. <i>당장.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5c1d82ef-9855-03ce-0376-b3184b19c023
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:5c1d82ef-9855-03ce-0376-b3184b19c023
msgctxt "ha3050ae8g006eg4ea0ga4bcg6c06e67dc686"
msgid "Take me back. <i>Now.</i>"
msgstr "다시 돌려보내. <i>당장.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 67fa49aa-2ea5-0707-a4eb-3b099259b0d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:67fa49aa-2ea5-0707-a4eb-3b099259b0d7
msgctxt "h6e5e24dfgcaf1g4531g83e2g22d80b9a636e"
msgid "I'll rip out your mocking tongue."
msgstr "너의 그 조롱하는 혓바닥을 찢어버리겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 68d000f9-c6a2-85ff-c58a-f884117d7ea9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:68d000f9-c6a2-85ff-c58a-f884117d7ea9
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h27d71153g4391g4663g9ab8g1dea16f12703"
msgid "I <i>never </i>seek help from devils."
msgstr "난 데빌 자식들한텐 <i>절대로 </i> 도움을 청할 일 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = 68da13ee-00f0-92bf-f0e4-50d5205fef83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:68da13ee-00f0-92bf-f0e4-50d5205fef83
msgctxt "hbbb1932fg808ag4005g8240g403afabe03eb"
msgid ""
"But the darkness won't save you anymore than the light could. You'll realise "
"that in time."
msgstr "어둠 또한 빛과 마찬가지로 당신을 구원해줄 수 없을 겁니다. 때가 되면 깨닫겠지요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = 6a1ca924-e4e8-8022-9895-6e59a8cefedf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:6a1ca924-e4e8-8022-9895-6e59a8cefedf
msgctxt "he2ddd9cag70f2g4930gbda6g6081174b35b6"
msgid ""
"Am I a friend? Potentially. An adversary? Conceivably. But a saviour? That's "
"for certain."
msgstr "당신의 친구일까? 잠재적으론요. 적일까? 가능성 있죠. 하지만 구원자라면? 그것만큼은 확실하답니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = 6e895ae1-72be-d036-3d0d-6ec6bd46ebaf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:6e895ae1-72be-d036-3d0d-6ec6bd46ebaf
msgctxt "h49b8b9c9g45ffg4f79gb5a2g99806045bbf3"
msgid "Easy, easy. I'm here to help, not harm."
msgstr "좀 진정하시죠. 전 해를 끼치러 온 게 아니라, 도움을 드리러 왔습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 71a5de49-743d-442c-9868-6f7a7f084eae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:71a5de49-743d-442c-9868-6f7a7f084eae
msgctxt "hc96207d7g3d48g4ce1gb027g44500669c076"
msgid "I'm getting tired of your games."
msgstr "당신의 장난질에 슬슬 지치려 하는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 79785462-6528-4059-a0f3-eb7208abb51c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:79785462-6528-4059-a0f3-eb7208abb51c
msgctxt "h0241f234g3ed0g4c4dgacc3g86299389a5b7"
msgid "Fuck. A cambion."
msgstr "씨발. 캠비온이잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7b8051d1-7efa-ad6b-e17c-b9eb03ac4338
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:7b8051d1-7efa-ad6b-e17c-b9eb03ac4338
msgctxt "h87d9098eg048fg46d0gb5e0g736fb4aa633e"
msgid "I'll do anything to get rid of the tadpole."
msgstr "올챙이를 없앨 수 있다면 뭐든지 하겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7cf1d0bf-e651-985e-f53b-1e73f84166de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 1cf7e716-d5a6-7c21-9147-179929f534c2_DrewWeapon = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:7cf1d0bf-e651-985e-f53b-1e73f84166de
msgctxt "h023c74b0g6d65g4a6fg9d24g64f3eb1da99f"
msgid "<i>Reach for your weapon.</i>"
msgstr "<i>무기에 손을 뻗는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = 7cf9e18b-d76a-53b7-c258-2034c5bc46d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:7cf9e18b-d76a-53b7-c258-2034c5bc46d9
msgctxt "hdb7e3b97g89a2g49b3gb764gc1a4ad348b90"
msgid ""
"Ah, yes. The tongue. Yet another piece of pleasurable anatomy you'll soon "
"have to do without."
msgstr "아, 그래요. 혓바닥이라. 당신이 곧 잃게 될, 즐거운 신체 부위지요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = 85367af1-1bc6-3ba1-01bb-d253ed16a825
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - OATHBREAKER(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:85367af1-1bc6-3ba1-01bb-d253ed16a825
msgctxt "hf6f63e63gb8c8g4440g9e1fg405f28a380a1"
msgid ""
"Your oath is in tatters, paladin. You abandoned your honour as soon as it "
"became inconvenient."
msgstr "팔라딘, 그대의 맹세는 휴지조각일 뿐입니다. 조금 불편해지니 바로 명예를 헌신짝 취급하지 않으셨습니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = 8577ee63-646c-226f-617c-5a502a208bd3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:8577ee63-646c-226f-617c-5a502a208bd3
msgctxt "h691b5e39gbff9g4c1fgb277g9ff82a471fe9"
msgid "And deny you the honour of my hospitality?"
msgstr "그렇게 제 환대의 영광을 거부하실 건가요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = 87da88cb-f6b5-c936-9656-58ba15688265
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_Monitor_State_HellLight = True
#.     - GLO_Monitor_State_FirstDealOffered = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:87da88cb-f6b5-c936-9656-58ba15688265
msgctxt "hf17e687bg962bg4616gbf72gf57e7bfed9dd"
msgid "I could fix it all like that."
msgstr "손쉽게 고쳐드리죠, 마치 이렇게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8a85e5ef-4dbe-9184-e123-dd768380fca1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 1cf7e716-d5a6-7c21-9147-179929f534c2_DrewWeapon = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:8a85e5ef-4dbe-9184-e123-dd768380fca1
msgctxt "h4ed58857g8b2ag4d20gbb31gb947940d8b43"
msgid "<i>Level your weapon at the creature.</i>"
msgstr "<i>괴물에게 무기를 겨눈다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = 8b18c356-7117-fae7-07a2-b9cda9471660
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:8b18c356-7117-fae7-07a2-b9cda9471660
msgctxt "h76e0b9aag52f2g4a71g90d0ga524959d119c"
msgid "And what is madness but a denial of reality?"
msgstr "현실을 부정하는 것이야말로 제정신이 아닌 것이잖습니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = 8d65ac57-bea9-4fb8-8c50-1064dafd816f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:8d65ac57-bea9-4fb8-8c50-1064dafd816f
msgctxt "h44fd8d27g3f8dg4170ga09cgd4d4c54522ea"
msgid "Call it a ninth sense."
msgstr "아홉 번째 감각이라고 해 두죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = 8d7926ac-f465-4448-f9d3-417e031d8461
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:8d7926ac-f465-4448-f9d3-417e031d8461
msgctxt "h21c7bd10g6d95g43c4g822ege481f698558f"
msgid ""
"Still, I've a feeling you'll change your mind. Before it's changed for you..."
msgstr "그래도 당신의 마음이 바뀔 것 같은 느낌이 드는군요. 그러기 전까지는..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = 901fbb8b-4ded-1ab6-2e96-88ba1ec4d132
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:901fbb8b-4ded-1ab6-2e96-88ba1ec4d132
msgctxt "he5339bf1g75f0g4d69gb12fg55b54d482847"
msgid "Consider your predicament."
msgstr "당신이 처한 이 곤경을 생각해 보세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = 90569f58-aa21-a2f5-639a-16652d811b23
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:90569f58-aa21-a2f5-639a-16652d811b23
msgctxt "hf69266a9g9c2cg4344ga9d7g2db4ff1d1c82"
msgid "I'll be there when it runs out."
msgstr "그 운이 다하는 순간에, 제가 올 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = 957636b2-21f2-6c0d-7447-b5c18a784ca8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:957636b2-21f2-6c0d-7447-b5c18a784ca8
msgctxt "hf0e40b43g10c9g4aaagaf06gbd6217695d52"
msgid ""
"Take all the time you need - but make up your mind before you're counting "
"down with tentacles."
msgstr "필요하신 대로 시간을 가져보십시오. 하지만 촉수가 튀어나오기 전에는 결정을 내리셔야 할 테지요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = 9792e429-23eb-9312-e050-94fe8a03e3da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:9792e429-23eb-9312-e050-94fe8a03e3da
msgctxt "h19497908g5661g4fe8g8622gc22bf3e6f36f"
msgid ""
"I'll be around. Watching you squirm like a tadpole through a nice juicy "
"brain."
msgstr "전 뇌 속을 헤엄치는 올챙이처럼 몸을 비틀어대는 당신을 곁에서 지켜볼 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = 993872af-c483-e0d9-c2b8-8eab18508132
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:993872af-c483-e0d9-c2b8-8eab18508132
msgctxt "hc89b4856g52d4g4733gae77g9fb19070df77"
msgid ""
"Perhaps you haven't yet realised how desperate these times are. You will."
msgstr "당신은 아무래도 지금 이 순간이 얼마나 긴박한지 눈치채지 못하신 것 같군요. 곧 알게 되실 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = 9c380866-70f3-cfb1-aa84-8a1476cacbcd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_Monitor_HasMet_Dinner = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:9c380866-70f3-cfb1-aa84-8a1476cacbcd
msgctxt "h1544f216gf2f0g4c2ega48cgebcbfa1c48da"
msgid "There. Middle-of-somewhere."
msgstr "자. 덜 뜬금없는 장소입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9d1d3343-3541-c83d-e77d-452098021960
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:9d1d3343-3541-c83d-e77d-452098021960
msgctxt "hbac8c138gcbd5g4d83gbb4dga3d7fd52abe8"
msgid "I will rise as a <i>kith'rak</i>. Your threats do not worry me."
msgstr "나는 <i>키스락</i>이 될 전사다. 네 위협 따위는 전혀 두렵지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = ac1a5e18-375f-1da8-6826-3175be02870a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:ac1a5e18-375f-1da8-6826-3175be02870a
msgctxt "h23ff4e08gb2fag4f12g9138g229df5f37246"
msgid "A rhetorical question, of course, but let me venture an answer."
msgstr "물론 수사학적인 질문이긴 하지만, 제가 직접 대답해 보겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b2e37b4e-fd07-0c58-ffd4-e7fcb9504c22
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:b2e37b4e-fd07-0c58-ffd4-e7fcb9504c22
msgctxt "h41abc4d8g6327g43a0g86e2gb130a2112153"
msgid "You're mad if you think I'll make a deal with another devil."
msgstr "또 다른 데빌과 거래를 하겠다고 생각하나? 제정신이 아니군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b2e37b4e-fd07-0c58-ffd4-e7fcb9504c22
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:b2e37b4e-fd07-0c58-ffd4-e7fcb9504c22
msgctxt "hbdb1cb69gb7acg499dgb3dbg1d2de4d2fc75"
msgid "You're mad if you think I'll make a deal with a devil."
msgstr "데빌과 거래를 하겠다고 생각하나? 제정신이 아니군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ba2f395d-73a9-f803-d572-989ae2d160f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:ba2f395d-73a9-f803-d572-989ae2d160f5
msgctxt "hdc0474afg56a6g43acga115g8810dd5d63c8"
msgid "Eloquent words, but I'm not seeking another pact."
msgstr "말은 청산유수로군. 그렇지만 또 다른 계약을 맺는 건 원하지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = bc42fbf8-3090-d4e1-6e41-6047339fdeb4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:bc42fbf8-3090-d4e1-6e41-6047339fdeb4
msgctxt "ha25d60b1g5e8ag4834ga72fge11d34a0a4cf"
msgid "Oh, a mere trifle. How dear is one's soul, really?"
msgstr "아, 사소한 것입니다. 하나의 영혼이 실제로는 얼마나 소중할까요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bf131546-1346-0f0e-f684-d7f586cca24d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:bf131546-1346-0f0e-f684-d7f586cca24d
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hc881b2begcaa4g4e0egbe60g1aa7601a6ad3"
msgid "Take me back. After that, I never want to see you again."
msgstr "날 돌려보내. 그리고 다시는 널 만날 일이 없을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = c386d081-1b5e-e401-59b1-a9e84da41975
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:c386d081-1b5e-e401-59b1-a9e84da41975
msgctxt "h0627e69cg0d53g44a2ga20cg7340beacc396"
msgid "It's worth <i>very</i> little with a tadpole in your head."
msgstr "올챙이가 머릿속에 있는 경우에는 <i>아주</i> 가치가 낮지요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = c6b3a82f-ff82-9edd-f679-ea20e2fd8abc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 1cf7e716-d5a6-7c21-9147-179929f534c2_WyllPresent = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:c6b3a82f-ff82-9edd-f679-ea20e2fd8abc
msgctxt "hde7ce502g47b3g495eg9524g7d749fe28783"
msgid "Hollering hells - you're a cambion."
msgstr "빌어먹을, 당신 캠비온이잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = c73b434c-4a9b-4f5e-81e0-1ac9907b389d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:c73b434c-4a9b-4f5e-81e0-1ac9907b389d
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h612222bdg0894g4744g97e3g24262eba365a"
msgid "I don't like this at all."
msgstr "이상해, 느낌이 안 좋아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c7835a45-8fd1-8d95-cd61-3caa3f6eefc2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FOR_Monitor_Event_TakeFood(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:c7835a45-8fd1-8d95-cd61-3caa3f6eefc2
msgctxt "h1cfa00c8gf7b9g4dc8gac3dgd9b66a665b01"
msgid "<i>Ignore him and fill your plate.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그의 말을 무시하고 음식을 집는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = c920eec1-d5d4-a22c-f079-968fa8c5d1f3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:c920eec1-d5d4-a22c-f079-968fa8c5d1f3
msgctxt "h1383e251g0a69g446ag8565g2cd1a8ff8cb9"
msgid "One might say you're a paragon of luck."
msgstr "누군가는 당신 보고 행운의 귀감이라고 말하겠죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = ca2834e6-431d-f89f-9ab8-f3aaeb6044ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:ca2834e6-431d-f89f-9ab8-f3aaeb6044ed
msgctxt "h84f1faacg762ag47c6g832dg38de97fbf5b3"
msgid ""
"That's what separates us from the devils, soldier. They think our greatest "
"strength is a weakness."
msgstr "데빌과 우리의 차이가 바로 여기 있어, 신참. 놈들은 우리의 가장 큰 강점을 약점이라 생각하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = caba08fb-dced-9243-2ac9-ff72a6ef77b4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:caba08fb-dced-9243-2ac9-ff72a6ef77b4
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h3af3fe6eg54afg4a50ga0adgce22d7061d0f"
msgid ""
"<i>Everything</i> is for sale. And you'd do well to sell while your stock "
"has value - in desperate times, the price of honour plummets."
msgstr ""
"<i>모든 것은</i> 사고 팔 수 있죠. 평판은 가치 있을 때 파는 것이 좋은 법입니다. 절박한 상황엔, 명예의 가치는 폭락하니까요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = cd4c0d10-4672-00ac-15b4-7c9a3518deaa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:cd4c0d10-4672-00ac-15b4-7c9a3518deaa
msgctxt "he67c3bfcg03adg4a0ag8152g50bd868ed13c"
msgid ""
"Try to cure yourself. Shop around - beg, borrow, and steal. Exhaust every "
"possibility until none are left."
msgstr "직접 치료하려고 애써보세요. 흥정하고, 구걸하고, 매달리고, 훔쳐보시죠. 선택의 여지가 없을 때까지 뒹굴어 보는 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cd7f685c-d116-7040-9883-4c971efd612a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:cd7f685c-d116-7040-9883-4c971efd612a
msgctxt "h43aeef2cg31bcg4725gbb2egedb75b995a3f"
msgid "What makes you say that?"
msgstr "그런 식으로 말하는 의도가 뭐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cdc245f3-4c39-4ada-22c1-ec78fce9d094
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:cdc245f3-4c39-4ada-22c1-ec78fce9d094
msgctxt "he80f64bfg96b5g4239g9f11gad55c14260b5"
msgid "Then fix it - or die at my hand."
msgstr "그럼 고쳐놔, 아니면 내 손에 죽든지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = d128f93a-4afc-405d-f29e-cdd5e3d92d2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:d128f93a-4afc-405d-f29e-cdd5e3d92d2c
msgctxt "h13acc7f2g7515g4c55gbbf5g2ad499b264c8"
msgid "Yes... I like it when my clients put up a fight..."
msgstr "그래요... 전 고객들이 저항할 때가 참 재밌더군요..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = d15c08d8-4999-3a13-55cc-4fed1177629a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:d15c08d8-4999-3a13-55cc-4fed1177629a
msgctxt "h8af48c3agbd24g49fbga528g08f9539d0b23"
msgid ""
"All those pretty little symptoms - sundering skin, dissolving guts - they "
"haven't manifested yet, have they?"
msgstr "아주 사소한 증상들이 나타날 겁니다. 피부가 찢어지거나, 내장이 녹아내리는 - 아직 그런 건 없으시겠죠. 있나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = ddb7c710-69ad-ebbd-7708-bbdfa8636087
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:ddb7c710-69ad-ebbd-7708-bbdfa8636087
msgctxt "hf4e6258fg6f93g4795g8de2gc071f3f72035"
msgid "My, aren't you a nervous one! I assure you I'm here to help, not harm."
msgstr "이런, 긴장하셨군요! 전 여기 해를 끼치러 온 게 아니라, 도움을 드리러 왔습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = e31a2d9f-c86e-9022-f65f-31ad58b998b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:e31a2d9f-c86e-9022-f65f-31ad58b998b3
msgctxt "h7907098fga068g40a3ga90eg84f65c872d88"
msgid "Go on. Partake. Enjoy your supper. After all..."
msgstr "어서, 드시죠. 만찬을 만끽합시다. 어쩌면..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = e8251919-4027-0083-c00c-304a6170f9a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:e8251919-4027-0083-c00c-304a6170f9a6
msgctxt "h4e7ad11cg66c9g48deg8185gd8ea1383e5ca"
msgid ""
"Come now. Why play hard to get when you're in deep over your tadpoled head?"
msgstr "자자. 왜 머릿속에 올챙이가 깊숙이 박혀 계시면서 관심 없는 척을 하시나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eb901206-ea30-b588-8333-58a6a35d86f1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:eb901206-ea30-b588-8333-58a6a35d86f1
msgctxt "h086403f0gce86g4fc3g9322g7c34f6272b3c"
msgid "Are these theatrics leading somewhere?"
msgstr "어딘가로 이어지는 연극 연출인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = ecbe4bc1-ae1e-e201-0070-484fd63f195c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Monitor_State_BroughtUpTadpole = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:ecbe4bc1-ae1e-e201-0070-484fd63f195c
msgctxt "hce201a28g3b39g448fg8e36g285ba8c05b33"
msgid "One skull, two tenants, and no solution in sight."
msgstr "두개골 하나에, 세입자는 둘인데, 해결법은 안 보이잖습니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f0b26e0f-1803-9ec5-465e-a7bcc7d22f12
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:f0b26e0f-1803-9ec5-465e-a7bcc7d22f12
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h769d6ab2gc2eeg409eg86d1gca7968fb74fc"
msgid "And if I do want to take this deal - how would I find you?"
msgstr "거래를 받아들이기로 결심했다면, 널 어디서 찾을 수 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = f10a324f-10ae-4e9f-c181-84751dd2af69
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:f10a324f-10ae-4e9f-c181-84751dd2af69
msgctxt "h04e077e8gf3a9g4e58g8dcag2377024061ba"
msgid ""
"Because my compassion is boundless. I stride among the needy, giving comfort "
"where I can."
msgstr ""
"왜냐하면 제 연민은 끝이 없기 때문이죠. 저는 도움이 필요한 사람들 사이로 발걸음을 옮기며, 할 수 있는 데까지 위안을 주고 있습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f1a3a48b-2e15-1d06-6095-99078a48b22b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:f1a3a48b-2e15-1d06-6095-99078a48b22b
msgctxt "h7c0cf82eg6c53g4e23gbd4dga281931b4bdb"
msgid "What makes you think I need saving?"
msgstr "왜 내가 도움이 필요하다고 생각하는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = f7e0b6fb-4e44-2e5f-d982-6cb171105899
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:f7e0b6fb-4e44-2e5f-d982-6cb171105899
msgctxt "hecacdb4dgadd1g4496gaf9fg9b36bdb3d248"
msgid ""
"And when hope has been whittled down to the very marrow of despair - that's "
"when you'll come knocking on my door."
msgstr "그리고 희망이 점점 쪼그라들어 절망의 골수까지 다다르게 되면, 그제야 당신은 절 찾아오게 될 것입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = fbf831e0-4938-0d46-1abe-ed83bb09417d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:fbf831e0-4938-0d46-1abe-ed83bb09417d
msgctxt "h13aec6bfgf381g4a05ga1b9g82fff1a04e84"
msgid "I've always wondered what a laughing mind flayer sounds like."
msgstr "마인드 플레이어가 웃는 소리는 어떨지 항상 궁금했지요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = fdc70308-7e5d-35a8-95be-2de513bb32b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:fdc70308-7e5d-35a8-95be-2de513bb32b7
msgctxt "hffdfe871ge540g4c10gbffcg3084f6e48edf"
msgid "By all means bite the hand that feeds you while you still have teeth."
msgstr "먹이를 주는 고마운 손을 얼마든지 물어 뜯어 보세요. 아직 이빨이 있을 때까진 말입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fe307231-01b6-50ec-eba9-59f8d95d2a42
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Monitor_Dinner:fe307231-01b6-50ec-eba9-59f8d95d2a42
msgctxt "h15473613g8819g4d67ga756ga0ff05b060e4"
msgid "I serve an oath, not a devil. My honour is not for sale."
msgstr "나는 맹세를 섬긴다, 데빌이 아니라. 내 명예는 사고 팔 수 있는 게 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_NGB_ApproachedUnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3afacc80-9b94-3f71-d8f2-1f08c6f2eea7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - WLD_FOR_GnomeGoblinsAngry = True
#.   Object:
#.     - TemporaryHostilityAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_NGB_ApproachedUnfortunateGnome:3afacc80-9b94-3f71-d8f2-1f08c6f2eea7
msgctxt "ha588d31agfeeeg45abgb23dg9fa7ec6a0a2d"
msgid ""
"*You were warned to stay away - now you'll have to face the consequences.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_NGB_ApproachedUnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3afacc80-9b94-3f71-d8f2-1f08c6f2eea7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[1]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - WLD_FOR_GnomeGoblinsAngry = True
#.   Object:
#.     - TemporaryHostilityAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_NGB_ApproachedUnfortunateGnome:3afacc80-9b94-3f71-d8f2-1f08c6f2eea7
msgctxt "h2db2cd40gc7e7g41b8g8816gaa7d6ba5b5e2"
msgid ""
"*This fight could have been avoided, but now you've made it inevitable.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 08fb1511-efc9-d770-7c24-5f2b0bc8c29c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:08fb1511-efc9-d770-7c24-5f2b0bc8c29c
msgctxt "hb818839bgd22bg44a7g994bg860aa2c63065"
msgid "Just allow me to leave. I'm no threat to you or your cub."
msgstr "그냥 보내줘. 난 너와 네 새끼에게 위협이 되지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Owlbear
#. NodeID = 0b264a1a-11fc-ae6c-7690-641697d10f4d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:0b264a1a-11fc-ae6c-7690-641697d10f4d
msgctxt "hf8066670ge4d4g49acgbf85g71beaf639906"
msgid ""
"Scars don't make us kindred, softmeat. And they don't make you welcome in my "
"nest."
msgstr "상처 따위로는 동질감을 형성하지 못해, 연한 고기야. 내 둥지에서 환영받게 하지도 못하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1884b675-1b6b-5682-eacd-32d5f716dac5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:1884b675-1b6b-5682-eacd-32d5f716dac5
msgctxt "h129d2b5egcbc6g44ddgbe64g0020620b9fe6"
msgid "<i>Move closer.</i>"
msgstr "<i>가까이 다가간다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Owlbear
#. NodeID = 1aaf0166-bd42-ddb4-c471-a8391e02ba61
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:1aaf0166-bd42-ddb4-c471-a8391e02ba61
msgctxt "h1c1b99c2g947bg46dbga3e3geb13ef3a601a"
msgid ""
"Won't even have to chew you before I feed you to my son, <i>softmeat</i>."
msgstr "내 아들에게 먹이로 주기 전에 씹을 필요도 없겠구나, <i>연한 고기</i>야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1da47888-3930-4f6c-2ad5-0c45d19d9ecd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = True
#.      - BERSERKER(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:1da47888-3930-4f6c-2ad5-0c45d19d9ecd
msgctxt "hae744708g719cg40bcg9cbeg995ee47e55ff"
msgid "Come, then. Once I've plucked you, I'll have your cub for dessert."
msgstr "그럼 덤벼. 네 털을 몽땅 뽑은 다음, 네 새끼를 디저트로 먹어줄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 1f42ec20-0263-6113-a8b4-657c22cfecef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_OwlBear_Healed(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 46fb584f-159c-261b-c058-f7809ee72535_AnimalHandlingSuccess = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:1f42ec20-0263-6113-a8b4-657c22cfecef
msgctxt "h6829b651gc319g4684g9125gfc692fc0867c"
msgid ""
"*The owlbear's one good eye flicks away for a moment. You follow its "
"glance...*"
msgstr "*아울베어의 성한 눈이 잠시 다른 쪽으로 향합니다. 그 시선을 따라가니...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 1ff5dfd0-e55a-2205-1f61-750fa63975fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FOR_Owlbear_Retreat(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:1ff5dfd0-e55a-2205-1f61-750fa63975fa
msgctxt "hb6f4f754g84c1g4ad2gb33bg4c89025a9589"
msgid "*...You can leave now, or step closer and die.*"
msgstr "*...일단 떠나도 좋으나, 가까이 다가오면 죽는다는 의미입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 253a1282-446f-bb01-fa77-232a2a219ce6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:253a1282-446f-bb01-fa77-232a2a219ce6
msgctxt "h6c3f1440g96e0g4adfgbca3g6f987bcf0b82"
msgid "<i>Puff out your chest and roar.</i>"
msgstr "<i>가슴을 크게 부풀리고 포효한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 273de37d-d27a-c051-bd65-de896641c659
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:273de37d-d27a-c051-bd65-de896641c659
msgctxt "h26de6916ged0ag4ff5g8ef1gd497a5c23d1e"
msgid "<i>Hold out your palms - you mean no harm.</i>"
msgstr "<i>손바닥을 내밀어 해칠 의도가 없음을 보인다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Owlbear
#. NodeID = 2d160bc5-9163-a7c8-3530-c030b308d776
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:2d160bc5-9163-a7c8-3530-c030b308d776
msgctxt "hd10a14a9g496dg4a41g8aaeg62707ec029e7"
msgid "A fight? You'd be a plaything - not worth the trouble."
msgstr "싸움이라니? 넌 놀잇감에 불과해. 싸울 가치도 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2d4b31e7-3542-7d56-9d81-90b3c928c855
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:2d4b31e7-3542-7d56-9d81-90b3c928c855
msgctxt "h85dfecbdg49b5g4d53g85afg4008cc05dba3"
msgid "<i>Step closer.</i>"
msgstr "<i>가까이 다가간다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 329da7a5-e80e-e420-e656-6bef2a6d11ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - FOR_Owlbear_Knows_ProtectingCub(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:329da7a5-e80e-e420-e656-6bef2a6d11ac
msgctxt "hab3b33f0gd8efg45e8g9980gd000308bbf70"
msgid "*...and see an owlbear cub.*"
msgstr "*...새끼 아울베어 한 마리가 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3531b0e5-a527-5c1f-178e-a369a0510ef0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:3531b0e5-a527-5c1f-178e-a369a0510ef0
msgctxt "hc77f9566g9790g4e61g877eg4cbc9b7241bb"
msgid "*The beast shrinks back, feathers quivering.*"
msgstr "*야수가 깃털을 떨며 뒤로 물러납니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 398b6ef3-12e9-7c8f-f204-980be4792565
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_OwlBear_Healed(1) = False
#. TagRule: ONEEYED or REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:398b6ef3-12e9-7c8f-f204-980be4792565
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h91b82a3ag3dc5g406egb104g9a774fdc22f0"
msgid ""
"That eye - or lack of it - must have you in a lot of pain. I should know."
msgstr "그 눈, 정확힌 눈이 없다는 게 매우 고통스럽겠구나. 나도 잘 알아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3df74a94-49a7-2188-0468-7137eb099a61
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - FOR_Owlbear_Hasmet(1) = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 46fb584f-159c-261b-c058-f7809ee72535_AnimalHandlingSuccess = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:3df74a94-49a7-2188-0468-7137eb099a61
msgctxt "hae4e2eb1gf9a0g41e0g8536ga47300db32e4"
msgid "*The owlbear growls deep in its feathered chest - you had your chance.*"
msgstr "*아울베어가 깃털로 덮인 가슴 깊이 그르렁거리는 소리를 냅니다 - 당신은 떠날 기회를 날렸습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Owlbear
#. NodeID = 457be648-2241-8155-0527-dbc90478781e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:457be648-2241-8155-0527-dbc90478781e
msgctxt "hdd214b81g0ef9g4906gad65g3e5479408446"
msgid ""
"My cub must learn how to deal with a threat. How to make it <i>fear</i>."
msgstr "내 새끼가 위협에 대처하는 법을 배워야 한다. <i>두려움</i>을 심어주는 법 말이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4808cd71-67db-3bff-ee19-222f4502cb1e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BERSERKER(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:4808cd71-67db-3bff-ee19-222f4502cb1e
msgctxt "h87869db3gf41ag48b8g8342ge1017dc9c652"
msgid "<b>COME - FIGHT!</b>"
msgstr "<b>덤벼 - 싸우자!</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4a12096d-40a1-343a-84f6-3f6901529b86
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:4a12096d-40a1-343a-84f6-3f6901529b86
msgctxt "h24330167ge310g439cgb09ag11d49a51618a"
msgid ""
"*As you retreat, the owlbear lets out a short huff. The message is clear...*"
msgstr "*당신이 뒷걸음질 치자, 아울베어가 짧게 씩씩거립니다. 그 의미는 분명합니다...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4d87593a-0652-37ad-f40c-68ee7e997ddd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:4d87593a-0652-37ad-f40c-68ee7e997ddd
msgctxt "h4a5e9d7ag5bd2g4f2egb570ga3fda880e24e"
msgid "<i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4e8aea87-0094-4d97-8479-5752d0df51a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_OwlBear_Healed(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:4e8aea87-0094-4d97-8479-5752d0df51a6
msgctxt "h22fdbd61ga392g40degbfb0g0b0055b5f098"
msgid "You're injured - there's still half a <i>spear </i>lodged in your head."
msgstr "넌 상처를 입었구나. 네 머리에 아직 <i>창</i> 반 쪽이 박혀 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Owlbear
#. NodeID = 54773785-0ebe-3a5a-5381-5c40c3751d09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FOR_Owlbear_Retreat(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:54773785-0ebe-3a5a-5381-5c40c3751d09
msgctxt "hb092ddb1g639eg41ceg9013gd0bf1d82d8c6"
msgid "You can go. But you make one wrong step, and I'll rip you to shreds."
msgstr "가도 좋다. 하지만 한 발자국이라도 가까이 오면, 널 갈기갈기 찢어버리겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 56f7eb0b-55d5-11e6-1df7-65c5613169db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - FOR_Owlbear_Hasmet(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - FOR_Owlbear_Hasmet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:56f7eb0b-55d5-11e6-1df7-65c5613169db
msgctxt "hb2115ba7g87f0g4e13g8677g7ad10ac1c1a8"
msgid ""
"*You feel the quake of its heavy footsteps before you see it: an owlbear, "
"its beaked face looming out of the darkness.*"
msgstr "*무거운 발소리의 진동이 느껴지고, 이윽고 한 아울베어가 어둠 밖으로 부리 달린 얼굴을 드러냅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5939f275-6c50-8799-b8be-69fa28c73b45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_OwlBear_Healed(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:5939f275-6c50-8799-b8be-69fa28c73b45
msgctxt "hf0295033g151cg40fbg9ac8g57ac588db890"
msgid "*It sits back, its eyes still fixed on you. A silent ultimatum...*"
msgstr "*아울베어가 뒤로 물러서지만, 시선은 여전히 당신에게 고정되어 있습니다. 조용한 경고입니다...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5debd5fe-6aaf-849a-d7e0-704a7fa9b111
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - FOR_Owlbear_Hasmet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - IMPOSSIBLE = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:5debd5fe-6aaf-849a-d7e0-704a7fa9b111
msgctxt "hde875db8g2de8g497fgba9bg4f93dc5c4742"
msgid ""
"*You feel the quake of its heavy footsteps before you see it: an owlbear, "
"its beaked face looming out of the darkness.*"
msgstr "*무거운 발소리의 진동이 느껴지고, 이윽고 한 아울베어가 어둠 밖으로 부리 달린 얼굴을 드러냅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Owlbear
#. NodeID = 60e14a63-dc0b-7dc3-e803-f28194c5f932
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:60e14a63-dc0b-7dc3-e803-f28194c5f932
msgctxt "hc8cb1bf9g4cc7g4c07ga083g923df336d624"
msgid "I don't think so. You've seen my nest. You've seen my cub."
msgstr "그럴 순 없지. 넌 내 둥지를 봤어. 내 새끼를 봤고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Owlbear
#. NodeID = 666de9a1-fb4c-dfb8-59d0-17bfe585521d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:666de9a1-fb4c-dfb8-59d0-17bfe585521d
msgctxt "h8bdf26d7g8714g4b6aga11fg88875c0592a6"
msgid "The meat tastes better when it's afraid."
msgstr "겁에 질린 고기가 더 맛있거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Owlbear
#. NodeID = 669835d6-5af0-c043-7ed6-3b27b3a8c814
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:669835d6-5af0-c043-7ed6-3b27b3a8c814
msgctxt "hea6aa2d7g7a02g4b52g8d7egca15bafb120a"
msgid "Should've listened when you had the chance."
msgstr "기회가 있을 때 말을 들었어야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Owlbear
#. NodeID = 6a8443b7-6b9a-f714-f8be-d7d79d52c6a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:6a8443b7-6b9a-f714-f8be-d7d79d52c6a2
msgctxt "h3329ed14g647cg451agad5eg57a1a54267fc"
msgid "It's a splinter. I've gutted bigger threats than you with worse."
msgstr "가시가 박힌 것 뿐이야. 난 이보다 더한 상태로 너보다 더한 것도 해치워 봤다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Owlbear
#. NodeID = 766fd287-1bb2-fb07-af98-37f7d6c969fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - FOR_Owlbear_Hasmet(1) = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 46fb584f-159c-261b-c058-f7809ee72535_AnimalHandlingSuccess = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:766fd287-1bb2-fb07-af98-37f7d6c969fe
msgctxt "he461a2a8gf869g4001g8fc4g92a9ca165d65"
msgid "<i>*Schrrreek!*</i>"
msgstr "<i>*쉬리이이익!*</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Owlbear
#. NodeID = 77065cb4-7352-4701-f6f0-8f3aec418987
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:77065cb4-7352-4701-f6f0-8f3aec418987
msgctxt "h08921613g5a62g4d0agb8c3g146d26ecc036"
msgid "Stop! One more step and I'll rip your throat out."
msgstr "멈춰! 한 걸음 더 오면 네 목구멍을 찢어버리겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 77898b75-c7cd-dba6-ac81-22c4eb3fde2b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:77898b75-c7cd-dba6-ac81-22c4eb3fde2b
msgctxt "hfa103235g8435g443eg926eg2ac36d046368"
msgid "You've had your last meal, beast. You and your cub alike."
msgstr "너의 식사는 끝이다, 짐승아. 너와 네 새끼 모두."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 7a72f83d-cbc3-8803-89a9-b065f9acde21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:7a72f83d-cbc3-8803-89a9-b065f9acde21
msgctxt "h6a72eb54g3cbbg450eg973bgf0a9f15fe1ec"
msgid "*The owlbear stares, then sharply inhales your scent.*"
msgstr "*아울베어가 노려보다가, 당신의 냄새를 날카롭게 맡습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7b7c60fa-e190-4b1e-82a1-09bf4c2f380c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:7b7c60fa-e190-4b1e-82a1-09bf4c2f380c
msgctxt "h6d7a804ag01e0g4c92gafeegc1c9f57a6a66"
msgid "<i>Move toward the cub.</i>"
msgstr "<i>새끼 쪽으로 다가간다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7d5c96ce-a7e3-6bc3-ae07-802f10c8a989
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DRUID(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:7d5c96ce-a7e3-6bc3-ae07-802f10c8a989
msgctxt "hba89e737g10b1g4134gbca3gc77f33f9e0d3"
msgid "You need rest - let nature heal you. This is no time for a fight."
msgstr "넌 휴식이 필요해. 자연이 널 치유하게 둬. 지금은 싸울 때가 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 80c81394-c85b-bec1-c006-f0c339121837
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FOR_Owlbear_Retreat(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:80c81394-c85b-bec1-c006-f0c339121837
msgctxt "he89d8a7eg3899g4881g823fg6f8835d8faf7"
msgid ""
"*The owlbear stares, but doesn't move to attack. The way out seems clear.*"
msgstr "*아울베어가 노려보지만, 공격에 나서지는 않습니다. 탈출구는 분명해 보입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 852a3887-e150-8dba-128b-52bc6a1b6bdd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:852a3887-e150-8dba-128b-52bc6a1b6bdd
msgctxt "h8d75213ag6c73g4742g972fgb88693a0d0f4"
msgid "Oh, yes? What're you waiting for?"
msgstr "오, 그래? 뭘 기다리고 있어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Owlbear
#. NodeID = 88a6586b-911f-56fc-a27f-5eb52a57e95f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:88a6586b-911f-56fc-a27f-5eb52a57e95f
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h28a2c98dg0c7fg473dgb094gae05aa16e899"
msgid "You'll be missing more than your eye before I'm done."
msgstr "없는 게 눈 한 쪽으로 안 끝나게 해 주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Owlbear
#. NodeID = 88c42e46-2221-a3b6-9b86-37c5ffeb2ddf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:88c42e46-2221-a3b6-9b86-37c5ffeb2ddf
msgctxt "h70a0bef4g386ag4ba1ga6fdg80c0c2d677bd"
msgid "Brave. Stupid, but brave. And I'm too tired to deal with <i>brave</i>."
msgstr "용감하고, 멍청하군. 하지만 용감하구나. <i>용감한 놈</i>을 상대하기엔 너무 지쳤어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Owlbear
#. NodeID = 8bda9abb-ab05-ab0e-80a3-76042ff99226
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:8bda9abb-ab05-ab0e-80a3-76042ff99226
msgctxt "h67a13b4dgaeeeg4e07g9870g5df387ceb80f"
msgid "A mistake that would cost your life - if you posed any real danger."
msgstr "네가 조금이라도 위험한 놈이었다면, 네 목숨을 앗아갔을 실수지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 905c1402-dffd-ceaf-19bb-47a358fcfb07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_OwlBear_Healed(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:905c1402-dffd-ceaf-19bb-47a358fcfb07
msgctxt "h5fecebc8g63ceg4103gba40g569778bcde13"
msgid "*It sits back, its eye still fixed on you. A silent ultimatum...*"
msgstr "*아울베어가 뒤로 물러서지만, 시선은 여전히 당신에게 고정되어 있습니다. 조용한 경고입니다...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 90ca70b0-6b83-161d-371d-74d8c9ba1be9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:90ca70b0-6b83-161d-371d-74d8c9ba1be9
msgctxt "h7000de25g5913g4649ga7c5g481dee68581a"
msgid "Sorry - wrong cave. I'll be going."
msgstr "미안, 이 동굴이 아니네. 난 가볼게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Owlbear
#. NodeID = 949cb32b-2947-ea50-697a-5c506afb4c96
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - FOR_Owlbear_Hasmet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:949cb32b-2947-ea50-697a-5c506afb4c96
msgctxt "ha7a353a0gbe4eg4266g98a5g247d68e19bc6"
msgid "What's this? Something weak, something tender..."
msgstr "이건 뭐지? 약해빠진 데다, 물렁한 녀석이군..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 951ff84c-5d1b-5acd-b1a6-30c74285954a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:951ff84c-5d1b-5acd-b1a6-30c74285954a
msgctxt "he7404d33ga086g48d1gaa99g46f547d33c8c"
msgid "*A bloodthirsty screech erupts from the owlbear's throat.*"
msgstr "*피를 갈망하는 끼이익 소리가 아울베어의 목에서 터져 나옵니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9aee5fef-c7d1-803a-25e8-5fd5ac51ae4d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:9aee5fef-c7d1-803a-25e8-5fd5ac51ae4d
msgctxt "h0f76aebaga0d9g4df5gbe49g4475b967fb6c"
msgid "<i>Back away.</i>"
msgstr "<i>뒤로 물러선다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Owlbear
#. NodeID = 9e512992-e02e-9c22-4a5c-a2044a7e4c16
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_OwlBear_Healed(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:9e512992-e02e-9c22-4a5c-a2044a7e4c16
msgctxt "h4a783efegd7ffg4b66gb121g7cfce2975dc4"
msgid "Thanks to you, I'm healed enough to cut you from belly to snout."
msgstr "네 덕에, 난 널 배에서 주둥이까지 찢을 수 있을 만큼 건강하거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Owlbear
#. NodeID = a01c02cb-02e4-74bc-def5-1baffdaf0578
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:a01c02cb-02e4-74bc-def5-1baffdaf0578
msgctxt "h9b911cc9g53f7g4227gb51fg3e7d2189c481"
msgid "A mistake you won't escape."
msgstr "네가 벗어나지 못할 실수지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Owlbear
#. NodeID = a08b5d34-89a2-4a03-e2cc-7cb27b8af3c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:a08b5d34-89a2-4a03-e2cc-7cb27b8af3c6
msgctxt "h5c1636e3g7072g437fg82c4g4a5e3060d24d"
msgid "*Growl.*"
msgstr "*으르렁.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Owlbear
#. NodeID = b6f1aa93-eb51-acf3-d8cd-fb3525b9d6e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:b6f1aa93-eb51-acf3-d8cd-fb3525b9d6e3
msgctxt "h722942bbg052fg4ef2g9733gca43bf01f1d7"
msgid "*Huff.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bc3791d9-06b1-4d77-4a7e-39fc3678bf3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:bc3791d9-06b1-4d77-4a7e-39fc3678bf3b
msgctxt "h798d3d1cga243g4730gb2eagd0b1559af018"
msgid "<i>Back away slowly.</i>"
msgstr "<i>천천히 뒤로 물러난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Owlbear
#. NodeID = c132e2a6-6180-6a6d-e91f-dbebcd4d4420
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_OwlBear_Healed(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:c132e2a6-6180-6a6d-e91f-dbebcd4d4420
msgctxt "h533538c8gacfdg4d4fg887cg2ca8c964ba0a"
msgid "I've still got one good eye. That's all I need."
msgstr "내겐 아직 한 쪽 눈이 있어. 그거면 충분해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Owlbear
#. NodeID = c5411d2f-0301-7505-fb4e-3b5ef707b5e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:c5411d2f-0301-7505-fb4e-3b5ef707b5e8
msgctxt "h091b4b03gdda8g447dgbfa4g8c2a8667a8c9"
msgid "You'll be even less of a threat when you're in pieces."
msgstr "널 찢어 놓으면 지금보다도 안전해지겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c7122b6f-baf6-d0d3-6f7d-2092d02b19be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_OwlBear_Healed(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 46fb584f-159c-261b-c058-f7809ee72535_AnimalHandlingSuccess = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:c7122b6f-baf6-d0d3-6f7d-2092d02b19be
msgctxt "h75f45771g4af0g4974g888fg47a8a7dfdf07"
msgid ""
"*The owlbear glances quickly back, then squares its gaze at you. You follow "
"its glance...*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d58278f8-2dfb-0c41-5f0b-ad47e49a7529
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - FOR_Owlbear_State_AnimalHandlingFailed(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:d58278f8-2dfb-0c41-5f0b-ad47e49a7529
msgctxt "h9717380dg60f8g40ceg80d7gb8582cd84f64"
msgid "<i>Study the owlbear's behaviour.</i>"
msgstr "<i>아울베어의 행동을 관찰한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = da5b47c2-3d2d-da7e-e952-64af6958b9d8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:da5b47c2-3d2d-da7e-e952-64af6958b9d8
msgctxt "h56275ba2gf998g4a10ga1a5ge6db41afd9f9"
msgid "*The beast returns the roar in kind.*"
msgstr "*야수가 당신에게 포효를 그대로 돌려줍니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Owlbear
#. NodeID = e0c9181b-9299-6c8c-6ed7-ee042103df61
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:e0c9181b-9299-6c8c-6ed7-ee042103df61
msgctxt "hb1482716ga5e3g4ba7g8d94g210121748c65"
msgid "That makes you dangerous. An easy meal."
msgstr "그래서 넌 위험한 존재야. 쉬운 먹잇감이기도 하고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Owlbear
#. NodeID = e1c23f5b-432c-3fb2-91ee-8763fd45a34b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FOR_Owlbear_Retreat(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:e1c23f5b-432c-3fb2-91ee-8763fd45a34b
msgctxt "hda2f7090g45bdg4134ga600g80dbe42d11a7"
msgid "*Hoo-hoot!*"
msgstr "*부-부엉!*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e35c757c-f028-b801-0b46-d4ff9885c16a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:e35c757c-f028-b801-0b46-d4ff9885c16a
msgctxt "ha941d184gfe95g4c9cg9af6gcb7a08f5856c"
msgid "Let me go, or you'll watch your cub die before I finish you."
msgstr "날 보내줘. 아니면 널 죽이기 전에 네 새끼가 죽는 꼴을 보게 해주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Owlbear
#. NodeID = ead9aa53-df06-fc09-a0d5-9103303a3110
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:ead9aa53-df06-fc09-a0d5-9103303a3110
msgctxt "h63dc0752ge88ag4a30ga07eg925aa414e294"
msgid "You're small. <i>Weak.</i> Killing you would be a waste of time."
msgstr "넌 작아. <i>약해.</i> 널 죽이는 건 시간 낭비겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ed7b2170-c614-22be-fe11-2d3873ed4ef3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - RANGER(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:ed7b2170-c614-22be-fe11-2d3873ed4ef3
msgctxt "hdbb63082g2dcdg4142g8ea4gc6e97d1234df"
msgid ""
"I would never intrude on your nest knowingly. This was a simple mistake."
msgstr "고의로 네 둥지를 침범한 건 아니야. 이건 단순한 실수였어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f1393152-2a0d-db7e-e9c5-d8504151a63a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:f1393152-2a0d-db7e-e9c5-d8504151a63a
msgctxt "h8992fc90gcabag46fdgb987gac15c657959f"
msgid "<b><i>ROAR.</i></b>"
msgstr "<b><i>크아아.</i></b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f35a1395-5b0b-8d2d-d8a7-bb8de9759950
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:f35a1395-5b0b-8d2d-d8a7-bb8de9759950
msgctxt "h820000d1g0de1g4fd4gbc59geb50d6fa7b4e"
msgid "<i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f3e8fac4-5d45-e950-8902-2f5537f8d013
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - FOR_Owlbear_State_AnimalHandlingFailed(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:f3e8fac4-5d45-e950-8902-2f5537f8d013
msgctxt "h56de2b0cg12f5g45e6ga269ge9db82cff2e3"
msgid "*You can only surmise the obvious - the owlbear is out for blood.*"
msgstr "*당신은 당연한 것 밖에 추측해내지 못합니다. 이 아울베어는 피를 보려 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f7753cdc-74bd-0e40-7253-8d25469f3409
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:f7753cdc-74bd-0e40-7253-8d25469f3409
msgctxt "h12bbbb71g05dcg449fg8a7dga92c06457541"
msgid "No need for that - I'll just leave."
msgstr "그럴 필요 없어. 난 그냥 떠날 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f791b189-e517-faeb-25ea-4646c8bfb1c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - FOR_Owlbear_Hasmet(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - FOR_Owlbear_Hasmet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:f791b189-e517-faeb-25ea-4646c8bfb1c4
msgctxt "h3b987b7bg8e81g4d6ag83cdg4ae7817a5ccd"
msgid ""
"*You feel the quake of its heavy footsteps before you see it: an owlbear, "
"its beaked face looming out of the darkness.*"
msgstr "*무거운 발소리의 진동이 느껴지고, 이윽고 한 아울베어가 어둠 밖으로 부리 달린 얼굴을 드러냅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Owlbear
#. NodeID = f92a69a8-5a74-9287-350a-108c6f33da64
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - FOR_Owlbear_Hasmet(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:f92a69a8-5a74-9287-350a-108c6f33da64
msgctxt "h2c6575abg4101g484ag9abdg9defc855a95f"
msgid "I warned you, softmeat. You don't listen."
msgstr "경고했을 텐데, 고깃덩어리. 네가 자초한 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear
#. Speaker = Owlbear
#. NodeID = fc9829e8-9f10-f582-38fe-5e6280e4d069
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear:fc9829e8-9f10-f582-38fe-5e6280e4d069
msgctxt "ha8a61353ge525g4678g840eg5cd3a4c0b530"
msgid "I'll tear you in half before you touch a feather on his head."
msgstr "내 새끼 머리 깃털 하나 건드리기 전에 너를 반으로 찢어주마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear_CMB_Enrage
#. Speaker = Owlbear
#. NodeID = 2bec4879-48f3-9411-7a6b-2d5df0d19381
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_Owlbear_State_EnragedBecauseCubOrEggDefeated = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear_CMB_Enrage:2bec4879-48f3-9411-7a6b-2d5df0d19381
msgctxt "h3086fcb2g4b3fg44acgb7adg08304c3ed0ae"
msgid "NO! WHAT DID YOU DO?"
msgstr "안 돼! 무슨 짓이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear_CMB_Enrage
#. Speaker = Owlbear
#. NodeID = 920a86d2-bea9-b26a-b418-90a6ddb55749
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear_CMB_Enrage:920a86d2-bea9-b26a-b418-90a6ddb55749
msgctxt "h4e8f674ag6cfdg4b44g8fbeg2ab18040150f"
msgid "*Schrreeeeek!*"
msgstr "*끼이이이익!*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear_LastCub
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 10530942-7242-09cd-fb37-43cd9e94fdcc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear_LastCub:10530942-7242-09cd-fb37-43cd9e94fdcc
msgctxt "hae3253b9g180dg4d40ga605ge1b3da88947c"
msgid "*You watch, speechless, as the cub begins to eat his mother.*"
msgstr "*당신은 할 말을 잃은 채 새끼가 어머니를 먹는 모습을 지켜봅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear_LastCub
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 1ba49e39-1222-31ad-5753-9f6ca3d8876e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear_LastCub:1ba49e39-1222-31ad-5753-9f6ca3d8876e
msgctxt "h3531f6a4gdb92g43a3g8b90g8ec5ea7b3833"
msgid "*A single strike will end his suffering...*"
msgstr "*일격에 녀석의 고통을 끝내줄 수도 있습니다...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear_LastCub
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 1e54867d-367c-9648-269a-3a4b61d76745
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - ab98ba0b-432b-9a79-1b10-514ee6454278_DidPDD = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear_LastCub:1e54867d-367c-9648-269a-3a4b61d76745
msgctxt "heb0112e0gde1eg4527g818fgc80eff7018b0"
msgid ""
"*Oblivious to your presence, the cub continues to gorge himself on his dead "
"mother.*"
msgstr "*당신의 존재를 인식하지도 못한 채, 새끼는 죽은 어미를 뜯어먹으며 자신의 배를 채웁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear_LastCub
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 223ad344-c541-4942-ba40-b7a92701b2e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear_LastCub:223ad344-c541-4942-ba40-b7a92701b2e3
msgctxt "h3718e58bg2305g4f0bga7a6gb2929d0284eb"
msgid ""
"*But was it truly <i>nothing?  </i>The pain gripped you tight, robbing you "
"of all composure for a moment...*"
msgstr "*하지만 정말 <i>아무 것도</i> 아니었을까요? 고통은 당신을 꽉 휘어잡았고, 한순간 평정심을 잃을 정도였습니다...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_OwlBear_LastCub
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 29572ed1-c666-4c0f-a96b-211ac681a655
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Shadowheart_State_SavedAnimal = False
#.      - ORI_Shadowheart_State_IncurableWound_Unavailable = False
