msgctxt "ha84a037ege9ffg48a9gac4ag2535a92f7eee"
msgid "Mind the True Soul. She will - she - she..."
msgstr "참된 영혼을 따라라. 그... 그녀... 그녀가..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_PriestOfTheConqueringGod_Cultists
