msgctxt "h4ec385fege471g4673g8175g7527e9af19b8"
msgid "Absolute? True what? What were those raving fools on about?"
msgstr "절대자? 참된 뭐? 이 정신 나간 자식들이 무슨 소리를 하고 있었던 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_PriestsOfTheConqueringGod_PAD_PostScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 20dc1620-e337-5f7a-9fd1-c999644acf18
