msgctxt "h00784715g52a2g45b0g9c83ge49d4b7cfd10"
msgid "True Soul? Absolute? What did they mean?"
msgstr "참된 영혼? 절대자? 그게 무슨 뜻이지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_PriestsOfTheConqueringGod_PAD_PostScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5e81c637-f22d-8d6d-83ba-2d7406ec2768
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_GoblinMentionedAbsolute = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_PriestsOfTheConqueringGod_PAD_PostScene:5e81c637-f22d-8d6d-83ba-2d7406ec2768
msgctxt "h65af0af8g7d1eg45e1g8940g532d234ce97b"
msgid "The Absolute? They follow the same god as that wretched goblin, Sazza."
msgstr "절대자? 그 끔찍한 고블린 삿자와 같은 신을 섬기는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_PriestsOfTheConqueringGod_PAD_PostScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5e81c637-f22d-8d6d-83ba-2d7406ec2768
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_GoblinMentionedAbsolute = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_PriestsOfTheConqueringGod_PAD_PostScene:5e81c637-f22d-8d6d-83ba-2d7406ec2768
msgctxt "h4345c4a3g755cg417fg9cc0g17cd0bf60dc3"
msgid ""
"The Absolute - that's the mystery god Sazza mentioned. Eerie common ground, "
"if you ask me."
msgstr "절대자라, 삿자가 언급했던 묘한 신과 같은 이름이군. 섬뜩한 공통점이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_PriestsOfTheConqueringGod_PAD_PostScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5e81c637-f22d-8d6d-83ba-2d7406ec2768
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_GoblinMentionedAbsolute = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_PriestsOfTheConqueringGod_PAD_PostScene:5e81c637-f22d-8d6d-83ba-2d7406ec2768
msgctxt "h2179da8egdb52g4154gae7bge5ba66eda533"
msgid "Sazza also spoke of the Absolute. New god in town?"
msgstr "삿자도 절대자에 대해 말했었어. 이 동네의 새로운 신인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_PriestsOfTheConqueringGod_PAD_PostScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5e81c637-f22d-8d6d-83ba-2d7406ec2768
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_GoblinMentionedAbsolute = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_PriestsOfTheConqueringGod_PAD_PostScene:5e81c637-f22d-8d6d-83ba-2d7406ec2768
msgctxt "h4ac4e77fgafeeg48f1gaf07g89f240d88a11"
msgid "The goblin Sazza spoke of the Absolute too. Strange."
msgstr "고블린 삿자도 절대자에 대해 이야기했었어. 기묘하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_PriestsOfTheConqueringGod_PAD_PostScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5e81c637-f22d-8d6d-83ba-2d7406ec2768
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_CapturedGoblin_State_GoblinMentionedAbsolute = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_PriestsOfTheConqueringGod_PAD_PostScene:5e81c637-f22d-8d6d-83ba-2d7406ec2768
msgctxt "hd9995ddcgf4d8g41a4ga217g4c3c95d1308a"
msgid ""
"They spoke of the Absolute, same as that captive goblin. They must be part "
"of the same sect."
msgstr "갇혀있던 고블린도 절대자 이야기를 했었어. 같은 단체에 속해있는 게 분명해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_PriestsOfTheConqueringGod_PAD_PostScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5e81c637-f22d-8d6d-83ba-2d7406ec2768
