#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_SeluneStash_PAD_NoticeShrine:bed9db99-9a77-2def-4952-17de1d7364b8
msgctxt "h1cbcc767g651bg453bg8ea4g75ea490998ef"
msgid "Looks like a shrine to Selûne over there."
msgstr "저기 셀루네의 성지가 있는 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_SeluneStash_PAD_NoticeShrine
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = de6eecae-0b0a-6071-4cc4-7ef84adadb23
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ShadowHeart_InParty_Knows_SharWorshipper = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_SeluneStash_PAD_NoticeShrine:de6eecae-0b0a-6071-4cc4-7ef84adadb23
msgctxt "hd8097704gd7f8g423dg87d6g4177ea5a2ec6"
msgid ""
"A Selûne statue? In a stinking cave? Hardly a place of honour, even for the "
"likes of her."
msgstr "셀루네의 조각상이잖아? 이런 외딴 동굴에? 아무리 그 신이라도, 영광을 바치기엔 적합한 장소가 아닌데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_SeluneStash_PAD_NoticeStashSeal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 78906681-bbcc-2880-1d5d-052ca046af30
