msgctxt "h26356e9cg93f2g422dg9935g7b659480d0e6"
msgid ""
"A prayer. Curious symbol next to it... well, saying a few words won't hurt."
msgstr "기도문이군. 흥미로운 문양도 그려져있어... 어디, 말 몇 마디 내뱉아서 손해 볼 건 없겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_SeluneStash_PAD_PickupPrayerSheet
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 02916df9-e75e-5b7b-49ae-3138f7423309
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
