#.      - FOR_SeluneStash_NoticeStashSeal_CommentedOnSeal(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_SeluneStash_PAD_PickupPrayerSheet:02916df9-e75e-5b7b-49ae-3138f7423309
msgctxt "h2b7cb593gab46g4fdfgbaf9g60d80d869d09"
msgid "An ancient prayer. But why hidden back here? And what's this symbol?"
msgstr "고대의 기도문이야. 그런데 왜 이런 곳에 숨겨져 있는 거지? 그리고 이 문양은 뭐야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_SeluneStash_PAD_PickupPrayerSheet
