#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hd4ceddefgbf62g4390gb416ge9a81b50718b"
msgid ""
"I'd see the Hells filled in with flowers, and my old boss Gortash on his "
"hands and knees tending them for eternity."
msgstr "지옥이 꽃으로 가득 차 있고, 나의 오래된 주인 고타쉬가 그의 손과 무릎으로 영원토록 그것들을 돌보는 것을 보고싶다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0f568f0e-d4df-cced-2bc1-c5df4255629b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GENERIC(1) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror:0f568f0e-d4df-cced-2bc1-c5df4255629b
msgctxt "h73770ad3ga339g4a41g8eb1gce5294644c15"
msgid ""
"I'd see the <i>zaith'isk</i>, the purifier - a relic used to extract a "
"tadpole."
msgstr "올챙이를 뽑아내는 데 쓰는 유물, 정화기, <i>제이트이스크</i>를 보고 싶다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0f568f0e-d4df-cced-2bc1-c5df4255629b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GENERIC(1) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror:0f568f0e-d4df-cced-2bc1-c5df4255629b
msgctxt "h7490a65dg322bg419dg8bdegf01b5373fdf1"
msgid "I'd see those who'd tormented me in the past receive the same."
msgstr "과거에 나를 괴롭혔던 자들이 똑같이 당하는 것을 보고 싶다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0f568f0e-d4df-cced-2bc1-c5df4255629b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GENERIC(1) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror:0f568f0e-d4df-cced-2bc1-c5df4255629b
msgctxt "hceceba27g8c0bg4c10g9252g80f646dbe46b"
msgid "I'd see droves of admirers, gathered to hail the Blade of Frontiers."
msgstr "한 데 모여 변경의 칼날을 환영하는 숭배자들을 보고 싶다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 100c5dcd-1ee3-6d8b-4143-a4792fa475fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_Knows_BalsamTreatsBurns = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror:100c5dcd-1ee3-6d8b-4143-a4792fa475fd
msgctxt "hcd5e8a46g8168g479cg954bg645280da60be"
msgid "It treats burns?"
msgstr "화상을 치료한다?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 10325c96-e5c7-7437-7382-9612c66be321
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror:10325c96-e5c7-7437-7382-9612c66be321
msgctxt "h36d8cd6ag8ce2g4e00gaf7agf3785c47225a"
msgid "<i>Tell it your name.</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신의 이름을 말한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 120669cd-925f-03d2-29f2-c85f9295200f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror:120669cd-925f-03d2-29f2-c85f9295200f
msgctxt "hb62a12eeg1840g4e96g8d2dgf61c5ce8842f"
msgid "I'd see the ones I love."
msgstr "내가 사랑하는 이들을 보고 싶다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 154e6210-5e4f-6f1a-0b1f-287a094dfb65
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - RANGER(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror:154e6210-5e4f-6f1a-0b1f-287a094dfb65
msgctxt "h2eceb499g4218g45bcg82e4g2167c7370948"
msgid "I use it to clean wounds out in the wilds."
msgstr "나는 황야에서 그걸 이용해 상처를 소독하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror
#. Speaker = Ornate Mirror
#. NodeID = 1568d42e-996a-0b2a-49a1-96d5aa826d94
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror:1568d42e-996a-0b2a-49a1-96d5aa826d94
msgctxt "h56647156g106ag49a5gbdfdgab823f74b949"
msgid "Acceptable. F-inally..."
msgstr "좋다. 마-지막으로..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1693da09-b33e-faa0-2dba-11b60c7fe593
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror:1693da09-b33e-faa0-2dba-11b60c7fe593
msgctxt "h3a9af4a5ge2eag409dg84ccgee052567435a"
msgid ""
"Nothing good tends to come of ambition in stories like this. I would see you "
"freed."
msgstr "이런 야망 넘치는 이야기에선 좋은 결과가 나오는 법이 없지. 난 네가 자유로운 것을 보고 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1ced50ac-c2db-b9af-8c8c-fa4924e670d0
