msgctxt "h2987c0f5g4445g4442ga61ega4211dca3518"
msgid "I'm, eh - Person Someonedale."
msgstr "나는, 음... 뭐시기 거시기라고 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e59aade9-d7ef-3b76-c152-ef42addfa282
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: SORCERER
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror:e59aade9-d7ef-3b76-c152-ef42addfa282
msgctxt "h1d580e24g189ag4e3agb509ga0412a65e25a"
msgid ""
"*It seems some vain wizard took living magic and twisted it into a forgotten "
"curio.*"
msgstr "*한 허영심 넘치는 위저드가 살아있는 마법을 비틀어 잊힌 골동품 안에 집어넣은 것 같습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e59aade9-d7ef-3b76-c152-ef42addfa282
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror:e59aade9-d7ef-3b76-c152-ef42addfa282
msgctxt "h4560c7a2g716eg4ca4gab10gd9acd4199191"
msgid ""
"*The face is crafted to be pleasing, but the personality is just a "
"reflection of the wizard that created it.*"
msgstr "*얼굴은 보기 좋게 만들어졌지만, 그 성격은 그것을 창조한 위저드를 반영한 것일 뿐입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ea0766d2-ce1e-6cbf-197f-75b3fd7bb987
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_Event_OpenMirror = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror:ea0766d2-ce1e-6cbf-197f-75b3fd7bb987
msgctxt "hf40b99f7g5223g4229gaef9ga788f3f9b71f"
msgid "*There is a pause as those glass eyes take you in. Then...*"
msgstr "*유리 눈이 당신을 받아들이며 잠시 멈춥니다. 그러더니...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eb423798-bb47-3f0b-1aa1-895d0ccf0423
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_Event_TriedToTrick(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_Event_TriedToTrick(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror:eb423798-bb47-3f0b-1aa1-895d0ccf0423
msgctxt "hfe933bf5ge34cg4acfg968bgf4d4331dbe38"
msgid ""
"I th-ink I could get you shipped off to him as an antique if you don't open."
msgstr "네가 문을 열지 않으면, 널 그-냥 골동품으로 네 주인에게 보내버린다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror
#. Speaker = Ornate Mirror
#. NodeID = f1b021bf-cf65-b91a-6b18-3edbe4f8dc22
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_Event_StartTrap = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror:f1b021bf-cf65-b91a-6b18-3edbe4f8dc22
msgctxt "h1bb768bega592g451fg83adgcf062263a964"
msgid "A lie. An in-truder!"
msgstr "거짓말이다. 침-입자다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f38511e9-9c7b-8409-791c-ac0fd8c714e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_Quest_ReadDoctorLog = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror:f38511e9-9c7b-8409-791c-ac0fd8c714e0
msgctxt "hce384f65gbe05g446bg9029ga9cdb16f30f8"
msgid "I read a doctor's journal - he used balsam to clean a wound."
msgstr "의사의 일지를 읽었어. 그는 상처 소독에 발삼을 사용했지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f403b2a3-05ae-da3d-c1ec-d938c07ea873
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror:f403b2a3-05ae-da3d-c1ec-d938c07ea873
msgctxt "h2e87b802g96ccg4e1egb941g704b1f8eca32"
msgid "I'd look for whatever spell will rid me of this worm in my head."
msgstr "내 머릿속에 있는 벌레를 없앨 수 있는 어떤 주문이라도 찾을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror
#. Speaker = Ornate Mirror
#. NodeID = f6d6f0a4-2a7d-a57d-ff1b-590f66bedd83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror:f6d6f0a4-2a7d-a57d-ff1b-590f66bedd83
msgctxt "h1aec2239ga3c8g4142gab69ga555d1758f59"
msgid "A poor ch-oice. You will be purged."
msgstr "나쁜 선택이다. 너는 제거될 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror
#. Speaker = Ornate Mirror
#. NodeID = fca9a922-0770-e901-4d67-c37c853fe5fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_Event_OpenMirror = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror:fca9a922-0770-e901-4d67-c37c853fe5fc
msgctxt "h97be3503ga8f3g420cg8baagc8b6f4c18ad5"
msgid "Be wel-come."
msgstr "들어-오라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror
#. Speaker = Ornate Mirror
#. NodeID = fff7b402-6c72-bb75-4193-e6a1e1811b2a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCelar_MagicMirror_HasMet(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - FOR_ThayanCelar_MagicMirror_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_MagicMirror:fff7b402-6c72-bb75-4193-e6a1e1811b2a
msgctxt "h037e0583g5398g44a7ga44dg129814543f3d"
msgid "Spea-k your name."
msgstr "이름을 말하-라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_PAD_EnterSecretLab
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b435a069-a536-4de3-8173-5f3440b0ed28
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_PAD_EnterSecretLab:b435a069-a536-4de3-8173-5f3440b0ed28
msgctxt "h78428899gd5a9g451cg90a7gc214ed2a5813"
msgid "An impressive set of bones. Pity to see it abandoned."
msgstr "인상적인 골격 표본들이군. 버려진 게 안타까운걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_PAD_EnterSecretLab
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b435a069-a536-4de3-8173-5f3440b0ed28
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_PAD_EnterSecretLab:b435a069-a536-4de3-8173-5f3440b0ed28
msgctxt "he20f52f5ga8f8g4692ga25fgdfba169d9c89"
msgid ""
"A hidden laboratory full of abandoned experiments. Colour me in my element."
msgstr "버려진 실험으로 가득한 비밀 실험실이라. 딱 내게 맞는 곳이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_PAD_EnterSecretLab
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b435a069-a536-4de3-8173-5f3440b0ed28
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_PAD_EnterSecretLab:b435a069-a536-4de3-8173-5f3440b0ed28
msgctxt "hc530eef5gf29eg492bgaca1g59d572349f26"
msgid "I don't like this. Abandoned lab, the possibilities are too unsettling."
msgstr "마음에 안 들어. 버려진 실험실이라니, 불안한 가능성이 도사리잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_PAD_EnterSecretLab
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b435a069-a536-4de3-8173-5f3440b0ed28
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_PAD_EnterSecretLab:b435a069-a536-4de3-8173-5f3440b0ed28
msgctxt "h1ed43031g5d9cg46e8g8360g582f8e5228e5"
msgid "A laboratory. What mysteries are lurking here?"
msgstr "실험실이라. 무슨 비밀이 숨어 있을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_PAD_EnterSecretLab
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b435a069-a536-4de3-8173-5f3440b0ed28
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_PAD_EnterSecretLab:b435a069-a536-4de3-8173-5f3440b0ed28
msgctxt "ha4b9b87cge18cg4236ga0e9g690527e45c86"
msgid "Hmm. What might be tucked away in here?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_PAD_EnterSecretLab
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b435a069-a536-4de3-8173-5f3440b0ed28
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_PAD_EnterSecretLab:b435a069-a536-4de3-8173-5f3440b0ed28
msgctxt "h56d38deag190eg4c8eg8437gedffbaffd250"
msgid "Well, well. The secrets this place must be hiding..."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_PAD_EnterSecretLab
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b435a069-a536-4de3-8173-5f3440b0ed28
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_PAD_EnterSecretLab:b435a069-a536-4de3-8173-5f3440b0ed28
msgctxt "hea8e611egc9c1g4321g8f82g2512b34ba365"
msgid "A well-guarded laboratory. What were they hiding down here?"
msgstr "잘 방비된 연구실이잖아. 이곳에 뭘 숨겨뒀던 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 00094fba-e9b6-e65a-e041-cdcca3016f74
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:00094fba-e9b6-e65a-e041-cdcca3016f74
msgctxt "hb93d3d64gf36cg41f5gaa63g1f19b1bf2af9"
msgid "You have such a way with words."
msgstr "말솜씨가 좋은 편이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 006e70c6-fe3c-aac7-4df5-28e2ca53acfd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName1(1) = False
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName2(0) = True
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName3(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:006e70c6-fe3c-aac7-4df5-28e2ca53acfd
msgctxt "hc309c7a1g849ag495bg8993g44c4aa34265e"
msgid "How about another utensil? Fork."
msgstr "다른 도구로 해볼까? 포크 어때."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 07444ba4-8271-554d-f12f-22586b969671
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:07444ba4-8271-554d-f12f-22586b969671
msgctxt "h9c2bd68bgac45g472bgaa4ag18f82ac4c3ed"
msgid "I know, I know. I'll get it right this time."
msgstr "그래, 알았어. 이번에는 제대로 대답할게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 081f8e49-dce5-b7f2-be83-ea4a5327e440
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:081f8e49-dce5-b7f2-be83-ea4a5327e440
msgctxt "h23eab8ccg69f5g4dcfga481gb2b896e7153c"
msgid ""
"Urgh. <i>Forks. </i>Make the feast slow. Less tearing. Less blood. But fine. "
"I am Fork."
msgstr "으. <i>포크. </i>만찬을 천천히. 찢는 걸 줄이고, 피를 덜 흘려. 하지만 괜찮아. 나는 포크니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 096fcdbd-9fd8-b9cd-96e7-3754c6c45099
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:096fcdbd-9fd8-b9cd-96e7-3754c6c45099
msgctxt "h312712bcg9a90g4a95g9be8g523099100b44"
msgid "Aww. Dry-shite."
msgstr "뭐어? 재미없긴."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 0a46c419-1a64-beb0-edb7-28f53c57d612
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - FOR_Quasit_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_Knows_BalsamForWounds = True
#.      - CURRENTREGION_WLD_Main_A = True
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_Event_OpenMirror = False
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_Event_TrapActivatedOnce = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon_SummonedShovel = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:0a46c419-1a64-beb0-edb7-28f53c57d612
msgctxt "h8fdfac00g9c07g4597gb83eg709e225e1ee6"
msgid ""
"Did your brain hole forget, beefy? Balsam for wounds. Power is king. Go. Go."
msgstr "머리에 구멍 났어? 발삼은 상처에 써. 아는 게 힘이야. 어서, 어서."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0b33b39c-6baa-781f-d145-4e144d9b27ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:0b33b39c-6baa-781f-d145-4e144d9b27ee
msgctxt "h5d9e0611gab93g4f68gbc46ga00d07c9fa43"
msgid "Tell me the secret first."
msgstr "네 비밀 먼저 알려줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 0be59953-f114-15c5-33f1-60a05b3c75f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:0be59953-f114-15c5-33f1-60a05b3c75f0
msgctxt "he2880202gc541g4c52g9937gd7583e867579"
msgid ""
"Be careful of the book. Master Illy is horny for the book, but book is not "
"horny for him."
msgstr "책 조심해. 일리 주인 책에 꼴렸다. 근데 책은 주인한테 안 꼴렸다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 0be6124f-3858-b1aa-11d2-f9c0234fd650
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName3(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:0be6124f-3858-b1aa-11d2-f9c0234fd650
msgctxt "h1192b35agc517g4944gbbb3g722411a16460"
msgid ""
"Basket loves dragons! Big flappy bastards. But Master Illy said Basket can't "
"be a dragon. Prick."
msgstr "바구니는 드래곤이 좋아! 크고 파닥거리는 새끼들. 하지만 일리 주인이 바구니는 드래곤이 못 된다고 했다. 좆같은 놈."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 0db9cae2-cc16-831f-b117-c1ad0c315b19
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:0db9cae2-cc16-831f-b117-c1ad0c315b19
msgctxt "h5a0f6437gb5d3g4c7ega1f1g1832f2f069c3"
msgid "Thunder Master is nice. Doesn't hit Shovel, so Shovel tells you."
msgstr "천둥 주인 착하다. 삽을 때리지 않아, 그러니 삽이 말해 줄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 1136f261-9815-1866-b357-c35d59dacca2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:1136f261-9815-1866-b357-c35d59dacca2
msgctxt "h5b81e15cgeca5g4cbega949ga19bef8fbae4"
msgid "You... you smell of magic. Magic of thunder and pain..."
msgstr "너...너에게 마법 냄새 난다. 천둥과 고통의 마법...."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 117cbb51-e439-c7d2-a117-6475cb1aec7d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:117cbb51-e439-c7d2-a117-6475cb1aec7d
msgctxt "ha4956289g8f29g4fd3g86e1g889747343d27"
msgid "Is that what you and your old master did here?"
msgstr "너와 네 옛 주인이 여기서 하던 게 그런 일이었나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 118ec9e8-fd5d-8a62-1f00-885e466b380b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:118ec9e8-fd5d-8a62-1f00-885e466b380b
msgctxt "hc6d8336fgf141g4429g8c8dg916c4080617e"
msgid "*The stench of sulphur fills your nose.*"
msgstr "*유황 냄새가 코를 가득 채웁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 1199c259-9f00-a875-ec2e-05b154304d01
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - FOR_Quasit_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - CURRENTREGION_WLD_Main_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - FOR_Quasit_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon_SummonedShovel = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:1199c259-9f00-a875-ec2e-05b154304d01
msgctxt "h5a73bd44gbfccg4548ga000g020cbe120287"
msgid ""
"Argh. Shit-piddling toe-rag. Never summon Shovel. Never feed Shovel. Now "
"call Shovel?!"
msgstr "악. 똥 지리는 걸레 새끼. 삽을 소환도 안 해. 삽에게 밥도 안줘. 이제야 삽을 불러내?!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 128b868a-7dd0-874a-bf21-ab51db3eda79
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:128b868a-7dd0-874a-bf21-ab51db3eda79
msgctxt "h51fa3c3fg3b08g4e3cgbb76ga30b60c3c31e"
msgid "What happened to him?"
msgstr "그자에겐 무슨 일이 있었던 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 12feebad-f269-bd3a-c285-098b2f878a2a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - FOR_Quasit_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - CURRENTREGION_WLD_Main_A = True
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_Knows_BalsamTreatsBurns = True
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_Event_TrapActivatedOnce = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon_SummonedShovel = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:12feebad-f269-bd3a-c285-098b2f878a2a
msgctxt "h4ec24832g7bb2g41eagaa9cgd7be27ad627f"
msgid "Bwahaha! Smell like <i>steak</i>. Yum. Yum."
msgstr "와하하! 노릇노릇한 <i>스테이크</i> 냄새. 맛있겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 15633770-052e-95bc-dc98-710d52ce92bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:15633770-052e-95bc-dc98-710d52ce92bb
msgctxt "h604c5c04g71d7g4d1dgb14egcb9b313430b3"
msgid ""
"Master wants me to cut up piggies? Only a magical shite can call me. Grab "
"one, and I'll teach 'em the spell. It's nasty - like me!"
msgstr ""
"주인, 죽여버리고 싶은 새끼라도 있어? 마법을 사용해서 날 부르라구. 아무나 잡아 와 봐, 주문을 알려줄 테니. 나처럼 아주 지독할 거야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 164fd685-1390-3a57-170b-fa4da0ecb068
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:164fd685-1390-3a57-170b-fa4da0ecb068
msgctxt "h0998937fga3f9g4cd2g85bfg2c129e26addd"
msgid "Good. Shovel likes having more holes."
msgstr "좋아. 삽 더 많은 구멍 좋아해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 1b5a8949-8398-7401-f56b-8691919358f8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SORCERER(1) = True
#.      - SORCERER_DRACONIC(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:1b5a8949-8398-7401-f56b-8691919358f8
msgctxt "hd11e914cg0171g494cg83e5ga3a45ccfbc5d"
msgid "Eh? What is you? Why you smell like that?"
msgstr "엥? 너가 무엇? 왜 그런 냄새 나는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 1ba20b15-4b77-57b9-65c5-31fcc4482d14
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - FOR_Quasit_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - CURRENTREGION_WLD_Main_A = False
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName1(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon_SummonedShovel = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:1ba20b15-4b77-57b9-65c5-31fcc4482d14
msgctxt "h74185ca3g78f8g4f21g8cf4gb7ccf94d3b0c"
msgid "Urgh. Another bandy-legged gobshite. What do you want with Shovel?"
msgstr "엑. 또 다른 다리 휜 머저리. 삽에게 뭘 원해?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 1d00473a-2f91-3282-5d83-ab83603a6b13
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - IMPOSSIBLE = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:1d00473a-2f91-3282-5d83-ab83603a6b13
msgctxt "h1627967age613g4b1ag9770g30deb9fc74f6"
msgid "What's them funny scales? Is you... is you a <i>dragon</i>?"
msgstr "그 우스꽝스러운 비늘은 뭐야? 너... 혹시 <i>드래곤</i>이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 1e87a783-3e5b-03b4-c1a7-292266a6ac1e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:1e87a783-3e5b-03b4-c1a7-292266a6ac1e
msgctxt "hd7b6ef10g1fecg4a22ga7c8gd4bd24f91508"
msgid ""
"No, not your beef slab! <i>Inside.</i> Master Illy is death and silk. Your "
"magic is thunder and pain. Don't - don't like it..."
msgstr "네 낯짝 말고 <i>알맹이</i> 말이야! 일리 주인님은 비단 두른 사신이었는데, 넌 따끔한 천둥 같아. 싫어, 싫다..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 1ee80bb5-84f8-8aad-aff7-5e7819bc5a4d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - FOR_Quasit_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - CURRENTREGION_WLD_Main_A = True
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName3(0) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - FOR_Quasit_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon_SummonedShovel = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:1ee80bb5-84f8-8aad-aff7-5e7819bc5a4d
msgctxt "h5aa44b12g9ff4g4d27g8415gd08203a6d34e"
msgid "Urgh. Another bandy-legged gobshite. What do you want with Basket?"
msgstr "엑. 또 다른 다리 휜 머저리. 바구니에게 뭘 원해?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 1f29c19b-0d8c-26b4-0c28-ef16464be8fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName2(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:1f29c19b-0d8c-26b4-0c28-ef16464be8fb
msgctxt "hd9fa1400g9e09g4263gbf0cgc29a34ea2f68"
msgid "Thunder Master is nice. Doesn't hit Fork, so Fork tells you."
msgstr "천둥 주인 착하다. 포크를 때리지 않아, 그러니 포크가 말해 줄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 20503747-42bd-3353-5333-d64420ab86ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:20503747-42bd-3353-5333-d64420ab86ff
msgctxt "hc7e1c8dbg40f4g4b75gba54g03019790b822"
msgid ""
"Wait. Wait. Warn you! About the book! Master Illy loves the book. Horny for "
"it!"
msgstr "잠깐. 잠깐. 경고해! 책에 대해! 일리 주인 책 좋아한다. 책에 아주 꼴려있어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 20f671dd-68da-9dba-b277-df5d9310f6c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:20f671dd-68da-9dba-b277-df5d9310f6c6
msgctxt "h5d06e3c2g2d3cg493cgada9gb52724dd6066"
msgid ""
"Sit on it and call it daddy. It's a <i>fire</i>. How do you think you stop "
"it?"
msgstr "깔고 앉은 다음 아빠를 부르든지. <i>불</i> 이잖아. 어떻게 막을 수 있다고 생각해?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 210428cc-13ab-550a-351c-aeaf42b9db42
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:210428cc-13ab-550a-351c-aeaf42b9db42
msgctxt "hfd9a654fg949ag4867g9783g19d3e8b7fd21"
msgid "Enough! How do I disarm the trap?"
msgstr "그만! 저 함정을 해제하는 방법이 뭐야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 21ed2135-c9fc-3e10-197a-9b76f0378e2e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:21ed2135-c9fc-3e10-197a-9b76f0378e2e
msgctxt "h7d269fc3gf961g4b9fg999dg8452d928a682"
msgid "This Illy you mentioned - who's that?"
msgstr "네가 언급한 일리 라는 자가 대체 누구지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26cbfb16-6e12-398e-39dc-b7c694bfa840
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SORCERER_DRACONIC(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:26cbfb16-6e12-398e-39dc-b7c694bfa840
msgctxt "hab6fd741g7d10g4605ga98eg14ea64a19ad1"
msgid "There's dragon blood in me, but that's all I know."
msgstr "내게는 드래곤의 피가 흐르지. 그 이상은 몰라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2a7d0aae-ff98-dee5-71cb-d20d96a610bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:2a7d0aae-ff98-dee5-71cb-d20d96a610bb
msgctxt "h4e9ae750g6837g4c65g9b59gb2a5eb2da089"
msgid "You're a disgusting little creature, aren't you?"
msgstr "넌 정말 작고 역겨운 생물이군, 안 그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 2a958455-0ce7-8fdf-8cfd-92a1bcf4a540
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:2a958455-0ce7-8fdf-8cfd-92a1bcf4a540
msgctxt "hdbd52919g801fg4c28g89a5g420cc4b11a2e"
msgid "Fun, I call him."
msgstr "나는 주인, 재미라고 불렀어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2bdb86db-76d8-82d3-f8f9-226113d1efbd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:2bdb86db-76d8-82d3-f8f9-226113d1efbd
msgctxt "h28587fc0g502dg4cb3gbb38g290d1a7f73a5"
msgid "<i>Leave. </i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다. </i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 2cbc8cf9-f2f2-5cea-86e3-708a943edfa5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName3(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:2cbc8cf9-f2f2-5cea-86e3-708a943edfa5
msgctxt "h2f7fc3b8gef89g4f6cg8f8cga8aad3fde790"
msgid "Good. Basket likes having more holes."
msgstr "좋아. 바구니 더 많은 구멍 좋아해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2d43cd2d-a40f-13e7-1f41-68b846d1c118
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:2d43cd2d-a40f-13e7-1f41-68b846d1c118
msgctxt "h9a69ec04gf67ag4d1bg884ega9858f8843f6"
msgid "...Illy?"
msgstr "...일리?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 2d968bcd-c882-8cd0-3b87-f7632e8ab0bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName2(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:2d968bcd-c882-8cd0-3b87-f7632e8ab0bb
msgctxt "h2d28ee76g1364g4c5cga513gda3df372fd57"
msgid "Good. Fork likes having more holes."
msgstr "좋아. 포크 더 많은 구멍 좋아해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 2eb20f76-25b3-3040-693d-c98a69b5664c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName3(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:2eb20f76-25b3-3040-693d-c98a69b5664c
msgctxt "hc6f2facagfcc7g4f8aga62cgb2ac1869f107"
msgid ""
"Thunder Master smells scary but is nice. Doesn't hit Basket. Tell you "
"secret. <i>Only</i> you."
msgstr "천둥 주인 무서운 냄새 나지만 착하다. 바구니를 때리지 않아. 비밀 말해줄게. <i>너한테만</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 31a64e10-7a4c-9dab-79fe-10acc03a8d59
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - FOR_DangerousBook.FindTome(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:31a64e10-7a4c-9dab-79fe-10acc03a8d59
msgctxt "h8ea46381g6098g4a21ga09agcb9ba7bb8133"
msgid ""
"Wait. Are you horny? For the book? Illy never shuts up. Book this. Book "
"that. BLEH."
msgstr "잠만, 너도 그 책에 꼴려 있어? 일리는 닥치지를 않아. 책이 어쩌고, 책이 저쩌고. 웩."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 321025e0-5b9b-3e51-e6ce-2bdee609116d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - FOR_Quasit_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - CURRENTREGION_WLD_Main_A = False
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName3(0) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon_SummonedShovel = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:321025e0-5b9b-3e51-e6ce-2bdee609116d
msgctxt "hb539732bg3ff3g428dg962bg43184f782589"
msgid "Basket is bored. Basket wants to MURDERISE."
msgstr "바구니 지루해. 바구니 <b>살인하고</b> 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 321977aa-29ca-590a-b816-a7ffb5e1b9be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName1(1) = False
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName2(0) = True
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName3(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:321977aa-29ca-590a-b816-a7ffb5e1b9be
msgctxt "ha2b1eaeag946ag4498g9c4bgb716974f904b"
msgid "How about another utensil? Fork."
msgstr "다른 도구로 해볼까? 포크 어때."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3844b5ae-3597-b1e9-9acb-804318510387
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName1(1) = False
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName2(0) = False
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName3(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:3844b5ae-3597-b1e9-9acb-804318510387
msgctxt "h8b0371a5g1d48g46e0gb24agc51bdb6bce94"
msgid "Does Basket sound good to you?"
msgstr "그럼 바구니는 어때?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 392ed69e-b7b4-caf5-82c0-3a6cca81ee58
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - FOR_DangerousBook.FindTome(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:392ed69e-b7b4-caf5-82c0-3a6cca81ee58
msgctxt "h14875f6dgc5bcg46d6g88f9gca355cc62b40"
msgid ""
"When he wasn't horny for the book. Urgh. Book this. Book that. He loves the "
"book."
msgstr "주인 책에 꼴려있지 않을 때. 윽. 책 어쩌고. 책 저쩌고. 주인 책 너무 사랑해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3976e1a2-8679-8f7e-96ff-09482bceada4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:3976e1a2-8679-8f7e-96ff-09482bceada4
msgctxt "ha521fa4cg3ba9g46f6gafabg70635af4863f"
msgid "Someone went to a lot of trouble to guard this place."
msgstr "누군가 이곳을 지키기 위해 많이 수고한 모양인데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 3ac38fea-672a-7b2e-d40a-9107dfc19cc5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:3ac38fea-672a-7b2e-d40a-9107dfc19cc5
msgctxt "h8604502ag1836g486bg8303gdf1ab1110acc"
msgid "Urgh. You don't like gutting? Spilling? Tearing? <i>Boring.</i>"
msgstr "엑. 너 배 가르는 거 싫어해? 쏟아내는 건? 뜯어내는 건? <i>재미없어.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 3b07956b-46ad-2d7d-2159-679f44fca3eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Quasit_State_LearnedSpell = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Quasit_State_LearnedSpell = True
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Quasit_Event_LearningSpell(1) = True
#. TagRule: SORCERER or WARLOCK or WIZARD
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:3b07956b-46ad-2d7d-2159-679f44fca3eb
msgctxt "hf95b763bgd3eag4e36gbf24g7f0355cf11a6"
msgid "Call me when the fisting starts. Oh, and DON'T BE A BORING SHITE."
msgstr "쌈박질 시작되거든 잽싸게 불러. 아, 그리고 지루하게 굴면 재수없을 줄 알아!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3b8ae5a3-cc34-1b66-3dba-264db42a14c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:3b8ae5a3-cc34-1b66-3dba-264db42a14c2
msgctxt "hc0e643b8g2e2dg4049ga3fegacd6cfeddba1"
msgid "I lied. I'm not a dragon."
msgstr "거짓말이었어. 난 드래곤이 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 3c1e9361-fc7b-1f1d-7651-f10eed4caf1b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:3c1e9361-fc7b-1f1d-7651-f10eed4caf1b
msgctxt "h90920276gdfe8g40b4gac6ag8d33a207e68c"
msgid "Yeah. Some arse-wipe changed it."
msgstr "그래. 어떤 개새끼가 바꿨어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 3c4b6ceb-2368-6942-f8df-0b95bcac7f30
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:3c4b6ceb-2368-6942-f8df-0b95bcac7f30
msgctxt "ha24ceae7ga9a1g4e87ga242g5d7f99665764"
msgid ""
"Eh? Old master. Boring master. Doesn't call in a long, long time. Maybe "
"dead. Maybe not."
msgstr "응? 옛 주인. 지루한 주인. 오래, 아주 오랫동안 안 불렀어. 아마 죽었을걸. 아님 말고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 3ca2fe41-7c46-fbd4-de90-a36930e89ba4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_Knows_BalsamForWounds = True
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_Event_QuasitToldTruth = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:3ca2fe41-7c46-fbd4-de90-a36930e89ba4
msgctxt "hefab3375g76dag4560g87ecg4adbff9e65ea"
msgid "Tell mirror. Balsam good. For wounds."
msgstr "거울에게 말해. 발삼 좋아. 상처에."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 408b306c-45fc-d056-65b0-4b4421ea6b9f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:408b306c-45fc-d056-65b0-4b4421ea6b9f
msgctxt "h63f14016g3349g4825g94adg5d12a30cb426"
msgid ""
"Teach Fork how to be a dragon! Then, Fork tells you a secret. A big secret."
msgstr "포크에게 드래곤이 되는 법 가르쳐 줘! 그럼, 포크도 비밀 알려줄게. 큰 비밀."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 40fc12e5-b72e-c9f7-7082-989fa12f5303
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName2(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:40fc12e5-b72e-c9f7-7082-989fa12f5303
msgctxt "h79746692gfc06g4952g8b8ag1d119e0a67f6"
msgid "So. You're Fork's master now? Fine."
msgstr "그래서, 이제 네가 포크의 주인이야? 그래."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4198f832-82be-16a4-04b9-5cc0e9651c25
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName1(0) = True
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName2(0) = False
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName3(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:4198f832-82be-16a4-04b9-5cc0e9651c25
msgctxt "h2e94c1f3g73bdg4972g8f93g8ac77e5c5151"
msgid "Shovel is fine."
msgstr "삽도 괜찮네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 43108fd6-a4d3-2e97-fdf7-b4cc9b368f50
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:43108fd6-a4d3-2e97-fdf7-b4cc9b368f50
msgctxt "h008fa6b6ge82ag401dgaf9dg13bbd1a65752"
msgid "Meanie! Wanted to be dragon..."
msgstr "치사해! 드래곤 되고 싶었는데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4332d441-f8dc-4de7-b91c-4dea4059486b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:4332d441-f8dc-4de7-b91c-4dea4059486b
msgctxt "h4bb7b5cfg485bg44degab86g568cebd1a297"
msgid "There is more to life than murder."
msgstr "살다 보면 죽이는 것 말고도 즐길 게 많아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 43470574-432c-7388-0983-b46e686abd97
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:43470574-432c-7388-0983-b46e686abd97
msgctxt "h56a4084cgc875g41e1gaa4cg9a063c14183f"
msgid "You look very stupid."
msgstr "넌 매우 멍청해 보이는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4371f0d8-2fc0-0408-681e-0d3c2f86cb3f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:4371f0d8-2fc0-0408-681e-0d3c2f86cb3f
msgctxt "h27f9d35eg07c9g4198gaa58g87173c9157bc"
msgid "I <i>am </i>a dragon. But don't tell anyone."
msgstr "<i>나는</i> 드래곤이다. 아무에게도 말하지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 43eb386a-6583-f56c-ee1c-130d275000be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_DangerousBook_Event_GrantForbiddenKnowledge(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:43eb386a-6583-f56c-ee1c-130d275000be
msgctxt "h2aa1bc8ag7e78g4a38gb7c2g21699bec8e8c"
msgid "Yes - I found the book. Quite the read."
msgstr "그래, 내가 책을 찾았지. 꽤 흥미롭더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 447b14cd-cdfa-ec71-f9b5-bf745368aa8d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:447b14cd-cdfa-ec71-f9b5-bf745368aa8d
msgctxt "he0086357g9b1bg4ed0g8d25g74d5dfc9cc0d"
msgid "What would you like to be called?"
msgstr "뭐라고 불리고 싶은데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 4491bbad-2408-0aa0-a8e9-4c141a46cb72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:4491bbad-2408-0aa0-a8e9-4c141a46cb72
msgctxt "hfee43990g601dg4e1bg952cg23f8236e98c3"
msgid "...No magic, please! Is good servant. Very good!"
msgstr "...제발 마법 쓰지 마! 나 착한 하인이야. 알아 모실게!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 452b3933-5087-0309-c85c-fff86ca26645
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:452b3933-5087-0309-c85c-fff86ca26645
msgctxt "h52ab88a9gdf21g4eb9g9e50gc6459c5240f4"
msgid "Like this?"
msgstr "이렇게?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 45cad5c6-93ec-0d0b-44b0-1fd0f56acfd2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:45cad5c6-93ec-0d0b-44b0-1fd0f56acfd2
msgctxt "h18b55c79g5c14g4703gba75g41e3e31907a6"
msgid "No. No. Dragon first. Pleasepleaseplease."
msgstr "안 돼. 안 돼. 드래곤 먼저. 제발제발제발."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 47edb98a-e35e-a24d-d73e-fb8010387a5e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:47edb98a-e35e-a24d-d73e-fb8010387a5e
msgctxt "h937fb366gd651g43c3gb23eg58c05e3ece04"
msgid "Your daddy."
msgstr "느그 애비."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 49935997-50ad-8d25-99d3-ad6af59f35c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:49935997-50ad-8d25-99d3-ad6af59f35c8
msgctxt "ha240055fgd81dg451dg9c90g2bce89af509f"
msgid "Yes! Master is fun! More fun than Illy."
msgstr "좋아! 주인 재밌어! 일리보다 재밌어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 49fc7962-c55e-e147-1186-066e951c183d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:49fc7962-c55e-e147-1186-066e951c183d
msgctxt "h3dd048b7g5415g49b8gbe97gdfd965055c51"
msgid "<i>Make a grand gesture, as if preparing a spell.</i>"
msgstr "<i>주문을 준비하는 것 마냥, 웅장한 제스처를 취한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4b393ff0-fbf7-de58-0482-e5a382b9eaf0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:4b393ff0-fbf7-de58-0482-e5a382b9eaf0
msgctxt "h09bce206gbe41g465cg8c51ga033b561f05b"
msgid "Your name is Basket?"
msgstr "이름이 바구니야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4c2d5d7e-32e6-c9d6-3bf7-96951eebf2a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:4c2d5d7e-32e6-c9d6-3bf7-96951eebf2a7
msgctxt "h66bf2610g85c9g4e56g9958gc1cc2bb9655f"
msgid "Necromancy is an abomination."
msgstr "강령술은 혐오스러운 짓이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 4c6068e2-fc30-f20a-0f07-5ae3bef3aac7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName2(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:4c6068e2-fc30-f20a-0f07-5ae3bef3aac7
msgctxt "h1c2b64a3ge300g4483gbf10gfc9e8073ddf7"
msgid ""
"Fork loves dragons! Big flappy bastards. But Master Illy said Fork can't be "
"a dragon. Prick."
msgstr "포크는 드래곤이 좋아! 크고 파닥거리는 새끼들. 하지만 일리 주인이 포크는 드래곤이 못 된다고 했다. 좆같은 놈."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 4cf3702c-c7b6-a9ce-9dbe-b1779cbd80da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_Event_OpenMirror = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:4cf3702c-c7b6-a9ce-9dbe-b1779cbd80da
msgctxt "hd74febf3ga645g4ffcg803bgf67d68759ede"
msgid ""
"Illy weak. Illy never finish book. But master? Master can do it. Read book. "
"Conquer book. <i>Yes.</i>"
msgstr "일리 약해. 일리는 책을 못 끝내. 하지만 주인? 주인은 할 수 있어. 책 읽어. 책 정복해. <i>그래.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 503be732-23bf-f555-20d3-79cde74ba089
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_Event_OpenMirror = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:503be732-23bf-f555-20d3-79cde74ba089
msgctxt "h40e03246g78c6g4620gb5d9g9d821587a103"
msgid "Master Illy. Loved book. But book nearly. Killed him. Careful!"
msgstr "일리 주인. 책 사랑해. 하지만 책 거의. 주인 죽였어. 조심해!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 512fef4e-65dc-9595-48a3-8405db61688c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName2(0) = False
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName3(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:512fef4e-65dc-9595-48a3-8405db61688c
msgctxt "h125081a3g4fdfg4ce6gb8d4g8bf8115a1bd0"
msgid "Your name is 'Shovel'?"
msgstr "네 이름이 '삽' 인 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 5187f495-3bff-c7ca-f426-ce6d3552c321
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon_SummonedShovel = True
#.      - GLO_Quasit_State_LearnedSpell = False
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName3(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - FOR_Quasit_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Quasit_State_LearnedSpell = True
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Quasit_Event_LearningSpell(1) = True
#. TagRule: SORCERER or WARLOCK or WIZARD
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:5187f495-3bff-c7ca-f426-ce6d3552c321
msgctxt "h2ff62188gf4d1g477ag9d4bg4f0f095ca67a"
msgid ""
"Oh, oh, a spell shite! When the fisting starts, use the sparky magic to call "
"Basket. LET'S KILL <i>EVERYTHING</i>."
msgstr "오, 이런, 망할 주문! 쌈박질 시작되거든, 반짝이 마법을 사용해서 바구니를 불러. <i>모조리</i> 죽여버리자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 51a658d3-76f4-7dee-b8c1-e5c9a58ac1a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:51a658d3-76f4-7dee-b8c1-e5c9a58ac1a5
msgctxt "h260e4d26g21ebg4402gb8aeg049f0a6e6494"
msgid "Are you happy here?"
msgstr "여기 있는 게 좋아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 5262aa8a-8a89-edfc-9374-5d9e6823d7d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:5262aa8a-8a89-edfc-9374-5d9e6823d7d0
msgctxt "hf403f23ag88ddg48cfgbe57g4b8fdcaa0c40"
msgid "YAY. ALL THE KILLING, FIGHTING, AND FISTING!"
msgstr "좋아. 죽이고, 싸우고, 주먹질하자!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 52803fcd-5091-a4b8-b143-e43bf29dbfb4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:52803fcd-5091-a4b8-b143-e43bf29dbfb4
msgctxt "h71833f44gacc1g47acgaaeeg094775d12fbd"
msgid "Oh! Ohhhh. Master should go see."
msgstr "오! 오오. 주인이 직접 가봐야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 53d4ee65-ba72-cb9f-e065-f0d16e51227f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:53d4ee65-ba72-cb9f-e065-f0d16e51227f
msgctxt "h6753ba44g40f3g4663g8f52gd25546e2d9ea"
msgid "Last nippled meatslab called me Shovel. Don't like it? Change it."
msgstr "마지막으로 본 고깃덩어리가 삽이라고 불렀어. 맘에 안 들어? 그럼 바꿔."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 57b50ec7-32ac-91d3-a7ff-274d818f3637
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:57b50ec7-32ac-91d3-a7ff-274d818f3637
msgctxt "hdc9d6278g6780g447agae1egdeadbcf4246c"
msgid "So. You're Shovel's master now? Fine."
msgstr "그래서, 이제 네가 삽의 주인이야? 그래."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 59cc3fbc-813a-a710-55c1-e363c41481c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_Event_QuasitToldTruth = True
#.      - CURRENTREGION_WLD_Main_A = True
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_Event_TrapActivatedOnce = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon_SummonedShovel = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:59cc3fbc-813a-a710-55c1-e363c41481c4
msgctxt "ha384157fgda5bg4b90gad6eg67060690bb95"
msgid "Shovel told master! Tells no one but master!"
msgstr "삽, 주인에게 말했어! 오직 주인에게만 말해!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 5a215248-2664-cd36-5fe6-a147819e1859
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - FOR_DangerousBook.FindTome(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:5a215248-2664-cd36-5fe6-a147819e1859
msgctxt "hecfb8d60g2d0ag4446g9440g9cd2b3e527ae"
msgid "But Thunder Master can read it. Can conquer it! Yes!"
msgstr "하지만 천둥 주인은 읽을 수 있다. 정복할 수 있다! 맞아!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 5a5a8a7e-14f3-8d1d-d55b-f2f2844a9faf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:5a5a8a7e-14f3-8d1d-d55b-f2f2844a9faf
msgctxt "hd7eae515gd275g4ab0gad1fg77625ad237a0"
msgid ""
"So. What first, master? Gutting locals? Raising the dead? Making them walk? "
"Making them scream?"
msgstr "그래서. 처음은 뭐야 주인? 주민 갈라 죽이기? 시체 살리기? 걷게 만들어? 비명 지르게 해?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 5abe6d89-0ed4-d358-6906-3a7519792dd3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:5abe6d89-0ed4-d358-6906-3a7519792dd3
msgctxt "h9161465bgfdfbg4d0cg9ae5g37b680f23f53"
msgid "Urgh. You and Illy same. Best buddies. Bunk buddies. Gross."
msgstr "으엑. 너랑 일리 똑같아. 최고의 친구야. 불알친구. 역겨워."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 5bf7cc58-7e4e-9ac3-70af-7aaf5d5aa96d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:5bf7cc58-7e4e-9ac3-70af-7aaf5d5aa96d
msgctxt "h354c2d67g65bbg4892g800ag673fb242e529"
msgid "Basket. I like. Baskets hold babies. My favourite."
msgstr "바구니. 나 좋아. 바구니에 아기 담아. 제일 좋아해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 5ecc1cec-f53f-4f61-7fac-762e33c49f51
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:5ecc1cec-f53f-4f61-7fac-762e33c49f51
msgctxt "h45b857dfg49c5g4375gafb8g03bc1f4ac744"
msgid "Haha! Pissy baby. Little joke."
msgstr "하하! 찌질이 새끼. 작은 농담."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 5f629b95-ceac-b1f8-3f13-0422d52414fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:5f629b95-ceac-b1f8-3f13-0422d52414fa
msgctxt "h9e3a237egf031g4891g8f75g7d1e55cf2ffa"
msgid "Urgh. 'Nice to meet you'? Dickhead."
msgstr "으, \"만나서 반가워\"? 병신."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5f79dceb-34b4-9a5f-cc1d-3d95f0ce6a81
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:5f79dceb-34b4-9a5f-cc1d-3d95f0ce6a81
msgctxt "hd4fe2505g638cg44b4gb9e0g3a3c9c86ddf7"
msgid "What is this special thing?"
msgstr "특별한 게 뭔데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6588cf63-5b39-efa9-d85f-96199ee2dd07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_DangerousBook_Found = True
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_DangerousBook_Event_GrantForbiddenKnowledge(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:6588cf63-5b39-efa9-d85f-96199ee2dd07
msgctxt "he3457039g5b64g4355g9ca7gaf39bf906fac"
msgid "I can't wait to dig into it."
msgstr "어서 파해쳐보고 싶은걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 65c077eb-7d86-4d25-d088-92e14bc2e935
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName2(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:65c077eb-7d86-4d25-d088-92e14bc2e935
msgctxt "hbf257a46ga6fbg4f6fg9ecfg3efb8fbc4a12"
msgid "Believe. Don't believe. Fork doesn't care."
msgstr "믿던지. 말던지. 포크 알 바 아냐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 68eeec50-5b6d-c500-e400-cb644e4f3eff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:68eeec50-5b6d-c500-e400-cb644e4f3eff
msgctxt "h9dc3483egbd99g4662gb360ge2dbd37bcde9"
msgid "<i>Yes.</i> Love when they cry. Love when they bleed. Delicious."
msgstr "<i>그래.</i> 녀석들이 우는 게 좋아. 피흘리는 게 좋아. 맛잇어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 69c82c03-77c2-312b-67d4-cdbb32634c5f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:69c82c03-77c2-312b-67d4-cdbb32634c5f
msgctxt "h4996315dgfea2g4a16gb4c4g41862fe979c8"
msgid "No more killing for you."
msgstr "더 이상 살육은 안 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6b262737-29db-0c1c-bade-0b02beb73056
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName3(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:6b262737-29db-0c1c-bade-0b02beb73056
msgctxt "h64d448e3g4e93g496dg8247g9c636006d77b"
msgid "Your name is 'Basket'?"
msgstr "네 이름이 '바구니' 라고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 6b3d06f6-70c8-c8f1-339a-95fad5b34dd4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:6b3d06f6-70c8-c8f1-339a-95fad5b34dd4
msgctxt "h4b5ad9bbg8653g44cfg96d7g5128f1eada93"
msgid ""
"One time Illy reads it. Eats his fingers like sausages. Heh. Boney sausages. "
"Crunch crunch crunch."
msgstr "한번은, 일리가 읽었어. 자기 손가락을 소시지처럼 먹어치워. 헤. 뼈있는 소시지. 와그작 와그작 와그작."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6b64588d-b988-3833-9ba0-967d8a312f85
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:6b64588d-b988-3833-9ba0-967d8a312f85
msgctxt "h41412badg24d9g45ddgb28cg9bdfcafe836a"
msgid "Is this a trick?"
msgstr "이건 무슨 속임수인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 6bf0a8ea-bb1f-b420-bccc-80f2e66908d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:6bf0a8ea-bb1f-b420-bccc-80f2e66908d6
msgctxt "hbfca00cag223bg47c5g84b9g3a4077edefaf"
msgid "Guess you're boring. Not like Master Illy."
msgstr "넌 지루한 것 같아. 일리 주인과 달리."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6c4b07b2-47e4-c875-ee7d-f407c833f036
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:6c4b07b2-47e4-c875-ee7d-f407c833f036
msgctxt "hcd414cf0g311ag45f6g9c7ag71d005bb1c2e"
msgid "That <i>does</i> sound fun."
msgstr "그건 <i>정말</i> 재밌어 보이는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 6c4bd096-8077-8961-e339-273a1a0e2fb7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:6c4bd096-8077-8961-e339-273a1a0e2fb7
msgctxt "hfe9cb906g7492g49abg8800g4e1dbfc678a5"
msgid "Yes! Like setting things on <i>fire</i>."
msgstr "그래! 뭔가를 <i>불로</i> 태우는 것처럼!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 6ca8a93c-180e-c21e-5a9f-9ef4c5b30f9b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:6ca8a93c-180e-c21e-5a9f-9ef4c5b30f9b
msgctxt "h130179d7g235cg4106gb915g6237f739296c"
msgid "And? And?!"
msgstr "그리고? 그리고?!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 6e587974-3f6d-c91e-7f7b-d9e98228130e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:6e587974-3f6d-c91e-7f7b-d9e98228130e
msgctxt "had5d9b9ag78ebg4057g9c02g1bf5281528f8"
msgid ""
"Teach Basket how to be a dragon! Then, Basket tells you a secret. A big "
"secret."
msgstr "바구니에게 드래곤이 되는 법 가르쳐 줘! 그럼, 바구니도 비밀 알려줄게. 큰 비밀."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 6e96a085-be35-610e-98fc-35d8d6eebfbd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:6e96a085-be35-610e-98fc-35d8d6eebfbd
msgctxt "hd9975056g17a8g4454g8dacg244115c32123"
msgid ""
"Thunder Master smells scary but is nice. Doesn't hit Shovel. Tell you "
"secret. <i>Only</i> you."
msgstr "천둥 주인 무서운 냄새 나지만 착하다. 삽을 때리지 않아. 비밀 말해줄게. <i>너한테만</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 7018f150-0ff8-f2db-c302-3bdccfefaa28
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:7018f150-0ff8-f2db-c302-3bdccfefaa28
msgctxt "h9e006284g83acg4a8cg84eag941b17a941b9"
msgid "Yeah. Illy named me. Your friend, the arse-wipe, said it was fine."
msgstr "그래. 일리가 지어줬어. 네 친구, 그 개새끼가 괜찮다고 했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 72485764-7c21-fa80-4679-ca1a03860e2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_Knows_BalsamForWounds = True
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_Event_QuasitToldTruth = True
#.      - CURRENTREGION_WLD_Main_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon_SummonedShovel = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:72485764-7c21-fa80-4679-ca1a03860e2c
msgctxt "h305d4f2dg2111g4acagb184g616188567fff"
msgid "Go on. Talk to mirror. Balsam good for wounds."
msgstr "가 봐. 거울에게 말해. 발삼 상처에 좋다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 72d10485-4a77-cd54-ead0-214839b26f5d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:72d10485-4a77-cd54-ead0-214839b26f5d
msgctxt "h4a0db4efge033g4f3cgb6ffg236a44e1df91"
msgid "Yay! Thank you."
msgstr "우와! 고마워."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 74491c5a-99eb-a425-bad6-78efab25cca5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:74491c5a-99eb-a425-bad6-78efab25cca5
msgctxt "hbc347ae1gf1f9g4b2cgaa09gbe902bec706d"
msgid "Considering your stench, you can't really judge."
msgstr "네 악취 때문에, 잘 모르는 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 74832001-7f9a-4182-f00d-236729f436d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_Event_OpenMirror = False
#.   User:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCelar_MagicMirror_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:74832001-7f9a-4182-f00d-236729f436d5
msgctxt "hffbf505ag6ed4g4a7bga498ge57c78a9455d"
msgid "Is that what the mirror hides?"
msgstr "거울이 숨기고 있는 게 그건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 763f0c09-d56e-dc86-f84f-70ac9d49f9ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:763f0c09-d56e-dc86-f84f-70ac9d49f9ac
msgctxt "h72c518e0gf2cfg4a2fga36cg89210b1170ad"
msgid "Why should I believe you?"
msgstr "내가 널 왜 믿어야 하지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 77dddd44-da93-fcfc-0912-80ff7c1527fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_Event_QuasitToldTruth = True
#.      - CURRENTREGION_WLD_Main_A = True
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_Event_TrapInProgress = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon_SummonedShovel = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:77dddd44-da93-fcfc-0912-80ff7c1527fb
msgctxt "h87cccda8g8669g4ed1g86dfg16fd95818cce"
msgid "Master made sparky mad! Master is stupid!"
msgstr "주인 번쩍이 화나게 했다! 주인은 멍청해!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 793c941b-3426-35e2-c2c2-93dd109c1f39
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:793c941b-3426-35e2-c2c2-93dd109c1f39
msgctxt "h75203e1ag9b86g4577gaeccg70a4ad69a2ac"
msgid "Hey! Meanie! Big, stupid meanie!"
msgstr "야! 째째한 놈! 크고, 바보같은 째째한 놈!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 7a865d4d-c645-69cc-0f83-47e077579f6a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:7a865d4d-c645-69cc-0f83-47e077579f6a
msgctxt "h0f97b14cgfb0cg4191g95feg3d5a2cc0c15c"
msgid "My master. Tall. Skinny. Prick with ears."
msgstr "내 주인님. 꺽다리에, 깡말랐고, 성질 더러워."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 7b6f9d35-b381-23c3-ae7d-14f1d81299da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_Knows_BalsamForWounds = True
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_Knows_BalsamTreatsBurns = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:7b6f9d35-b381-23c3-ae7d-14f1d81299da
msgctxt "heb7168dag3557g4047gb185g821b37532908"
msgid "Now. Truth. Balsam for wounds. Power is king. Always."
msgstr "이제. 진실. 상처엔 발삼. 힘은 왕. 항상."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8305d7c7-fd17-3fcb-5d55-d1242c1f813f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:8305d7c7-fd17-3fcb-5d55-d1242c1f813f
msgctxt "h99d579b9gb8b5g4194gba78g8cc0f813527f"
msgid "I'm asking the questions here - who're you?"
msgstr "질문은 내가 한다. 넌 누구지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 86fced90-b7af-da8f-9234-197dc15d6ba2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:86fced90-b7af-da8f-9234-197dc15d6ba2
msgctxt "hd5a6449fg192dg41aega5c2g14e2ddc2fe4b"
msgid "Ugh. What chewed you up and spat you out?"
msgstr "으. 누가 너를 씹어 먹고 뱉어 냈니?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 879c8a6d-6113-9f03-d4ef-e8597d755152
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:879c8a6d-6113-9f03-d4ef-e8597d755152
msgctxt "h4450f122g9b13g4949gb2a6gb568fc36eeae"
msgid "'Master Illy'? Who is that?"
msgstr "'일리 주인'? 그게 누구지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 87fb158f-3000-b39d-5ac4-0b11318789e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName2(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:87fb158f-3000-b39d-5ac4-0b11318789e5
msgctxt "hbffaf2cbga9c5g40d0g8ffbgf5f4bcb814cc"
msgid "DRAGON FORK IS GONNA EAT YOUR BABIES."
msgstr "<b>드래곤 포크가 네 아기들을 잡아먹을 거다.</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 88979b11-9671-53f5-a477-f795c106fd2e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - FOR_Quasit_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_DangerousBook_State_Bound = False
#.      - CURRENTREGION_WLD_Main_A = True
#.      - FOR_DangerousBook_Found = True
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_DangerousBook_Event_GrantForbiddenKnowledge(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon_SummonedShovel = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:88979b11-9671-53f5-a477-f795c106fd2e
msgctxt "h3578e230g368bg4832gb585g7db66de7301a"
msgid "Book waiting. Waiting for new master. Better master. Read book. Go on."
msgstr "책 기다린다. 새 주인 기다려. 더 나은 주인. 책 읽어 봐. 어서."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 89e1f0b9-0bca-4579-8813-c99623d41783
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:89e1f0b9-0bca-4579-8813-c99623d41783
msgctxt "hf6c559e9g2b8fg4c44ga6acgac620003b053"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 89e1fbd8-dccd-ecad-f9c7-7f7f4022d279
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:89e1fbd8-dccd-ecad-f9c7-7f7f4022d279
msgctxt "he4b6f87dga12bg457ag9421g42086d597bdf"
msgid "Tell you secret! Not the others, but master, yes, tell Thunder Master!"
msgstr "비밀 말해 줄게! 남들 말고 주인님한테만! 천둥번개 주인님이라면 말할게!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 8a31f73b-2ad2-5108-ac5f-8aea93000181
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:8a31f73b-2ad2-5108-ac5f-8aea93000181
msgctxt "hc30a56e8g93cag4c7ag9797g659a06ee4ce4"
msgid ""
"Master Illy. Wonderful. He tricks them. 'Heals' them. HAH. Then they die. So "
"sudden. So <i>mysterious</i>."
msgstr "일리 주인님이야. 맨날 속임수. 주인님한테 치료만 받으면 웬걸, 다들 픽픽 죽어. 진짜 <i>신기하지</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8b32e151-bfb7-1d0a-4bfa-8e55795848ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:8b32e151-bfb7-1d0a-4bfa-8e55795848ea
msgctxt "h95ca6809g2395g4445g8567g6e07fd768db5"
msgid "What would you like to be called?"
msgstr "뭐라고 불리고 싶은데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 8b479130-7994-b442-7cc0-590ae7fda156
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName3(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:8b479130-7994-b442-7cc0-590ae7fda156
msgctxt "h328c5165ga9a8g442ag8564g4720ae5e9e9c"
msgid "DRAGON BASKET IS GONNA EAT YOUR BABIES."
msgstr "<b>드래곤 바구니가 네 아기들을 잡아먹을 거다.</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 8c8bbe6a-39de-847c-b509-f955861c4836
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:8c8bbe6a-39de-847c-b509-f955861c4836
msgctxt "h4fa7ed67g375ag40eag8cf4g1c52567bd36e"
msgid ""
"So, you're Shovel's master now? Fine. I likes gutting. Killing. Tearing. "
"Smearing. And dancing on dead kiddies."
msgstr "그럼 이제 네가 삽의 주인이야? 좋았어. 삽은 내장을 가르고, 죽이고, 찢고, 더럽히고, 죽은 애들 위에서 춤추는 걸 좋아해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 8cf22b9d-af88-9d61-9ebb-bf9d182219b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:8cf22b9d-af88-9d61-9ebb-bf9d182219b9
msgctxt "h6f165bb8g524ag46a9gb2d6g0634e2152540"
msgid ""
"No! No. Truth. Only truth. Mirror hides the book. Book makes people eat "
"fingers. Like sausages. Crunch, crunch!"
msgstr "아냐! 아냐. 진실. 오직 진실. 거울은 책을 숨겨. 책은 사람들 손가락 먹게 만들어. 소세지 처럼. 와그작, 와그작!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 8d341164-ef6b-c3ce-6b42-cc65160dff5e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:8d341164-ef6b-c3ce-6b42-cc65160dff5e
msgctxt "h8b7a6b34g634bg4dc8gb4deg341a39b1481d"
msgid "Huh. Didn't fry your tiny brain hole? Damn."
msgstr "엉. 네 작은 뇌 구멍 구워버리지 않았어? 젠장."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8e974fc2-c168-13ee-1b96-1bd00a0e2adf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:8e974fc2-c168-13ee-1b96-1bd00a0e2adf
msgctxt "h5eef385eg1615g4e6dgb34cgb56c8a865513"
msgid "What chewed you up and spat you out?"
msgstr "누굴 닮아서 그렇게 버르장머리가 없는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 90b5fa61-e451-b0bd-6f39-0d01115e951f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - FOR_Quasit_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - CURRENTREGION_WLD_Main_A = True
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_Knows_BalsamTreatsBurns = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon_SummonedShovel = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:90b5fa61-e451-b0bd-6f39-0d01115e951f
msgctxt "h47fcbee4g519ag45a1gb255g55f41e55d400"
msgid "Go on. Mirror knows."
msgstr "가 봐. 거울 알아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 90c77b64-98ff-2065-8cec-aa7eb311485d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:90c77b64-98ff-2065-8cec-aa7eb311485d
msgctxt "h42e0fb09g4144g46b9gb874g1079507f8c72"
msgid ""
"Master Illy. Urgh. Big, stupid scaredy cat. Hides here with magic book. Book "
"doesn't like Master Illy."
msgstr "일리 주인님이야. 웩, 덩치만 컸지 순 겁쟁이 새끼. 책 갖고 여기 숨었어. 근데 책은 주인님을 싫어해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 92d1b5eb-35c6-479a-7de2-b576364d80c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:92d1b5eb-35c6-479a-7de2-b576364d80c9
msgctxt "h8202f0d6gbb9eg4c7bg8a17gf24250b24fda"
msgid "There will be plenty of killing soon."
msgstr "곧 죽일 게 많아질 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 93a30bbc-1365-1e54-52b5-d81c8c1a813e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:93a30bbc-1365-1e54-52b5-d81c8c1a813e
msgctxt "h0c8869c8g939eg4e39g9dc9gba850173d386"
msgid "Huh? Who're you?"
msgstr "엉? 넌 누구야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 941933d2-0ec2-1e69-a63a-544ed671e277
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SORCERER_DRACONIC(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:941933d2-0ec2-1e69-a63a-544ed671e277
msgctxt "h6a0d9e56gb863g439cg8022gd9a5973ec679"
msgid "I also have marks - I'm a descendant of dragons."
msgstr "내게는 표식도 있지. 난 드래곤의 후예야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 97007dee-b616-e77f-c52c-9020c59a0909
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:97007dee-b616-e77f-c52c-9020c59a0909
msgctxt "hdc3b45b6ga6dag4975g9cceg73af04c59a28"
msgid "Urgh. That new master is stupid."
msgstr "엑. 새 주인 멍청하다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 97bf8f95-cc81-d680-c471-0da12aed65fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - FOR_DangerousBook.FindTome(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:97bf8f95-cc81-d680-c471-0da12aed65fc
msgctxt "h6fd4ad04gf216g4079gb810gcce55c1d9ec1"
msgid ""
"Illy so busy. Only cares about the book. Book this. Book that. <i>Urgh.</i>"
msgstr "일리 너무 바빠. 오직 책만 신경써. 책이 어쩌고. 책이 저쩌고. <i>에휴.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9855206b-dcd8-194b-e0d9-a174e6f3ed74
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:9855206b-dcd8-194b-e0d9-a174e6f3ed74
msgctxt "h3da1c2d3gfec5g473ega77ag8a868a9fcb96"
msgid "Just get out of my sight. We're done."
msgstr "내 앞에서 사라져. 볼일은 끝이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 986139c9-6cea-1da0-0c8b-d7f034364126
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:986139c9-6cea-1da0-0c8b-d7f034364126
msgctxt "h18097cd1gd44dg4f1cg9f5bga2e370285cfd"
msgid "Like what?"
msgstr "그런 게 뭔데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 9917277b-f949-ff3b-06de-3183e0fa869b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon_SummonedShovel = True
#.      - GLO_Quasit_State_LearnedSpell = False
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName1(0) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - FOR_Quasit_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Quasit_State_LearnedSpell = True
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Quasit_Event_LearningSpell(1) = True
#. TagRule: SORCERER or WARLOCK or WIZARD
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:9917277b-f949-ff3b-06de-3183e0fa869b
msgctxt "he1cc5181g692cg4779g9809gc1c2c9d0cdad"
msgid ""
"Oh, oh, a spell shite! When the fisting starts, use the sparky magic to call "
"Shovel. LET'S KILL <i>EVERYTHING</i>."
msgstr "오, 이런, 망할 주문! 쌈박질 시작하거든, 반짝이 마법을 사용해서 삽을 불러. <i>모조리</i> 죽여버리자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9982a1a8-96b1-614f-1640-931677d9d2da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:9982a1a8-96b1-614f-1640-931677d9d2da
msgctxt "h10fbf738g1283g4dc6g80c0g59fbca8e18ef"
msgid "Why are you laughing? You could have died too."
msgstr "왜 웃는 거지? 너도 죽을 수 있었는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9a51145d-82a4-5ffe-b200-3f454308d6cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:9a51145d-82a4-5ffe-b200-3f454308d6cc
msgctxt "hc9d91d55gf5a3g42a6ga996g82844b1491fa"
msgid "I look forward to fighting with you."
msgstr "너랑 싸우는 게 기대되는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9af054f0-a3fa-779e-7551-191ecf792848
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:9af054f0-a3fa-779e-7551-191ecf792848
msgctxt "hd7c63228g8a10g4380g94c1gbcd379c92b0b"
msgid ""
"I'm [GEN_PlayerName_c11eee1e-7815-6143-7233-f2427799fa53] - nice to meet you."
msgstr "나는 [GEN_PlayerName_c11eee1e-7815-6143-7233-f2427799fa53] (이)야. 만나서 반가워."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = 9b43faba-ed2d-ebc6-034e-78d9cd135d81
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:9b43faba-ed2d-ebc6-034e-78d9cd135d81
msgctxt "h688d4a11g5212g4115g8e9fg550381752791"
msgid ""
"So, you're Basket's master now? Fine. I like gutting. Killing. Tearing. "
"Smearing. And dancing on dead kiddies."
msgstr ""
"그래서 이제 네가 바구니의 새 주인이야? 좋아. 난 빠개고, 죽이고, 찢고, 헐뜯는 걸 좋아해. 죽은 꼬맹이들 위에서 춤추는 것도."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a0f61c38-6f2e-44bd-44dd-1f5d7ef89661
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:a0f61c38-6f2e-44bd-44dd-1f5d7ef89661
msgctxt "h8caca32agc6dag4fd3g8060gc0d20932cfef"
msgid "<i>Try not to laugh.</i>"
msgstr "<i>웃지 않으려고 노력합니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = a16ed4fa-b35a-8f23-ca8a-c1676670e24b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - FOR_Quasit_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - CURRENTREGION_WLD_Main_A = True
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName2(0) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - FOR_Quasit_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon_SummonedShovel = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:a16ed4fa-b35a-8f23-ca8a-c1676670e24b
msgctxt "h5774e650g62c7g4429g83b9gf6ca7d2fbe5d"
msgid "Urgh. Another bandy-legged gobshite. What do you want with Fork?"
msgstr "엑. 또 다른 다리 휜 머저리. 포크에게 뭘 원해?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = a469772f-6faf-ad9d-2fb8-eb23647c5f21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_Knows_BalsamTreatsBurns = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:a469772f-6faf-ad9d-2fb8-eb23647c5f21
msgctxt "h333641e5g0041g4100g9810g3d69e8323c73"
msgid "Tell the stupid mirror about balsam. Good for burns. GO ON."
msgstr "멍청한 거울에게 발삼에 대해 말해. 화상에 좋다. 어서."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = a56b719c-5bbc-f93e-1a5c-4a28f315c68d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:a56b719c-5bbc-f93e-1a5c-4a28f315c68d
msgctxt "h1649aff1ga2e0g4a57gae3bg56e10cfaa199"
msgid "Aw. Bye-bye, snot rag. Kisses!"
msgstr "어오. 안녕이다, 짜증 나는 놈. 뽀뽀!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = a68ce603-94f1-cb97-0da6-52b5ec3c13a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - FOR_Quasit_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - CURRENTREGION_WLD_Main_A = True
#.      - FOR_DangerousBook_Found = True
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_DangerousBook_Event_GrantForbiddenKnowledge(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon_SummonedShovel = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:a68ce603-94f1-cb97-0da6-52b5ec3c13a4
msgctxt "hfc9928ebg7af8g4306gad68g6174e6215ed4"
msgid "Book didn't melt your eye goobers. Oh well. Next time."
msgstr "책이 네 눈구멍을 녹이지 않았네. 할 수 없지. 다음에."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a6c6d6b9-4567-b300-f0bf-08143b4cce39
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:a6c6d6b9-4567-b300-f0bf-08143b4cce39
msgctxt "h93f47a38g3617g4003g84begda293781b9df"
msgid "Speak to me with respect, you petulant little fiend."
msgstr "나한테 존경을 담아 말해라, 이 버릇없는 조그만 악마 자식."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = a8f3b3ef-0582-2790-2500-31e98abe773b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:a8f3b3ef-0582-2790-2500-31e98abe773b
msgctxt "h1e2c4999g484fg4207gb6b2gc3a87ee110a0"
msgid ""
"A book. Master Illy horny for the book. Book this, book that. Never finished "
"book."
msgstr "책. 일리 주인 책에 꼴렸다.이 책, 저 책. 책 절대 다 못 읽었다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a964bae2-2b44-a770-47ea-10f24c6dfab1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_DangerousBook_Found = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:a964bae2-2b44-a770-47ea-10f24c6dfab1
msgctxt "h75b0321eg559dg4dc3g96b1g0c844bec6916"
msgid "Is it dangerous?"
msgstr "위험한 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a9e42f92-9065-7169-ea57-bc228441c07a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_Event_SaidWrongAnswer = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:a9e42f92-9065-7169-ea57-bc228441c07a
msgctxt "h2ec313c1gccbfg46acg96cbg330ee4600e7d"
msgid "You filthy creature - you told me balsam was for burns."
msgstr "이 추악한 생명체야... 네가 나한테 발삼은 화상에 좋다고 말했잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = aba59cc7-cb32-4d52-c643-bf1933f01786
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:aba59cc7-cb32-4d52-c643-bf1933f01786
msgctxt "h6646effag96d1g4e63g8026g2deab38a2477"
msgid ""
"Shovel loves dragons! Big flappy bastards. But Master Illy said Shovel can't "
"be a dragon. Prick."
msgstr "삽은 드래곤이 좋아! 크고 파닥거리는 새끼들. 하지만 일리 주인이 삽은 드래곤이 못 된다고 했다. 좆같은 놈."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = abfd5250-9a15-29e2-edbb-0dda48d94a2b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:abfd5250-9a15-29e2-edbb-0dda48d94a2b
msgctxt "ha88b9364gdb15g4691ga0dag1affb78b0ee0"
msgid "I'm descended from dragons, yes."
msgstr "그래, 나는 드래곤의 혈통이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aefa0155-79ff-194b-b1c0-f6a12e620f6d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:aefa0155-79ff-194b-b1c0-f6a12e620f6d
msgctxt "hcbc8ad20gf4e3g4418gaf2bge76bdfb4cf45"
msgid "Your scroll was in an undead's casket. Who were they?"
msgstr "네 두루마리가 언데드 관짝 안에 있던데. 얘들은 누구니?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = b0ef8f70-24b4-4014-077b-4aaae2c7ec7a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:b0ef8f70-24b4-4014-077b-4aaae2c7ec7a
msgctxt "hb0624446g5a04g4f0fgaf83g3fe8c0d44503"
msgid "So a fake dragon? Urgh. Boring. Master Illy is <i>fun</i>."
msgstr "그래서 가짜 드래곤? 으. 지루해. 일리 주인이 더 <i>재밌어</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = b189fde7-257f-46ce-c568-5655c0f906ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:b189fde7-257f-46ce-c568-5655c0f906ab
msgctxt "h88b0e20dg2fbfg41c5gb70fg4db3838c00d7"
msgid "Heh. Good with tongue. Good at cutting them out, too. Tell you secret?"
msgstr "헤. 혀 쓰는 것도 잘하고, 자르는 것도 잘해. 비밀 알려 줄까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = b22a30ce-71a3-b5c4-c953-c84db266d318
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_Knows_BalsamForWounds = True
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_Event_QuasitToldTruth = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:b22a30ce-71a3-b5c4-c953-c84db266d318
msgctxt "h6b0bc282gcf67g4f8dg858eg5566166c67fe"
msgid ""
"The mirror hides. Hides the special thing. Tell it balsam good for wounds. "
"Tell it!"
msgstr "거울 숨긴다. 특별한 거 숨긴다. 걔한테 발삼, 상처에 좋다고 말해라. 말해라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b372d6f7-bf9c-2cec-02c8-c8684790f1f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:b372d6f7-bf9c-2cec-02c8-c8684790f1f7
msgctxt "heebaacefga628g42a9gaf49gb3f4ce95fab1"
msgid "Your name is Fork?"
msgstr "이름이 포크야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = b3832181-a733-d4fc-01be-dd34a063b1a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:b3832181-a733-d4fc-01be-dd34a063b1a0
msgctxt "hca8472fegeab0g4a8bg84d2g9ca1ffe13520"
msgid "Or run squealing. Sparky gets tired. Eventually."
msgstr "아니면 울면서 도망다니던가. 번쩍이 지친다. 언젠가는."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = b90a237b-82c1-6066-3ca8-3a8bd4897cdc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - FOR_Quasit_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - CURRENTREGION_WLD_Main_A = False
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName1(0) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon_SummonedShovel = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:b90a237b-82c1-6066-3ca8-3a8bd4897cdc
msgctxt "hedde4e86g2050g4d70gbd42g924842da020a"
msgid "Shovel is bored. Shovel wants to MURDERISE."
msgstr "삽 지루해. 삽 <b>살인하고</b> 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = b91dfb18-27e1-0bf3-e14b-ce1db906c8a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:b91dfb18-27e1-0bf3-e14b-ce1db906c8a4
msgctxt "h2a0d9696g1601g4a81gb1e6gf712ac87e3cb"
msgid "And more. Illy horny for many things."
msgstr "더 많아. 일리는 꼴렸어 많은 일에."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = ba7d27cc-4eea-5b7a-0c6d-2b455115f282
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName1(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:ba7d27cc-4eea-5b7a-0c6d-2b455115f282
msgctxt "h62139a4dgb458g4615g9f49g0b226c2dcebc"
msgid "Master Illy calls me Shovel. Don't like it? Change it."
msgstr "일리 주인은 날 삽이라고 불러. 맘에 안 들어? 그럼 바꿔."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = baf09eaf-d579-e5dc-d0d4-0d73c9c16f5d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_Event_OpenMirror = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:baf09eaf-d579-e5dc-d0d4-0d73c9c16f5d
msgctxt "h1ff4c381gbadag47feg9844g90183aaf14c0"
msgid "Hope book eats your stupid face."
msgstr "책이 네 멍청한 면상을 먹으면 좋겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bc38c9fd-4fe2-ac1a-e121-dd80bc1cdb38
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: ELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:bc38c9fd-4fe2-ac1a-e121-dd80bc1cdb38
msgctxt "ha07613acgf3e8g43aag9669g1aa262f56a24"
msgid "I'm an elf. Have you never seen one?"
msgstr "난 엘프다. 한 번도 본 적 없나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bc38c9fd-4fe2-ac1a-e121-dd80bc1cdb38
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DWARF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:bc38c9fd-4fe2-ac1a-e121-dd80bc1cdb38
msgctxt "h6605e1f7gb792g4d51gad9cgf1787d9b05ee"
msgid "I'm a dwarf. Have you never seen one?"
msgstr "난 드워프다. 한 번도 본 적 없나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bc38c9fd-4fe2-ac1a-e121-dd80bc1cdb38
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DROWELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:bc38c9fd-4fe2-ac1a-e121-dd80bc1cdb38
msgctxt "h9b4a9784g8f5cg4e02g9f96g51ce3a9cb359"
msgid "I'm a drow. Have you never seen one?"
msgstr "난 드로우다. 한 번도 본 적 없나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bc38c9fd-4fe2-ac1a-e121-dd80bc1cdb38
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: HUMAN
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:bc38c9fd-4fe2-ac1a-e121-dd80bc1cdb38
msgctxt "h20d24a69g0b03g41cagb11fgcfbf9019d3c8"
msgid "I'm a human. Have you never seen one?"
msgstr "난 인간이다. 한 번도 본 적 없나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bc38c9fd-4fe2-ac1a-e121-dd80bc1cdb38
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: TIEFLING
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:bc38c9fd-4fe2-ac1a-e121-dd80bc1cdb38
msgctxt "h336f56d5gf96cg41e1ga32eg98c6a9eea794"
msgid "I'm a tiefling. Have you never seen one?"
msgstr "난 티플링이다. 한 번도 본 적 없나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bc38c9fd-4fe2-ac1a-e121-dd80bc1cdb38
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:bc38c9fd-4fe2-ac1a-e121-dd80bc1cdb38
msgctxt "haddfa9c8gba9fg465dg9ce2g124555d2a7a9"
msgid "I'm of the gith. I'm not surprised you've never seen my kind."
msgstr "나는 기스의 일원이다. 네가 우리 종족을 만난 적 없다 해도 놀랍지 않군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bc38c9fd-4fe2-ac1a-e121-dd80bc1cdb38
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: HALFLING
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:bc38c9fd-4fe2-ac1a-e121-dd80bc1cdb38
msgctxt "h1d71b65bgd34cg412bga1f5g827c84a478c9"
msgid "I'm a halfling. Well met."
msgstr "난 하플링이야. 만나서 반가워."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bc38c9fd-4fe2-ac1a-e121-dd80bc1cdb38
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DUERGARDWARF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:bc38c9fd-4fe2-ac1a-e121-dd80bc1cdb38
msgctxt "he7e477c9g5240g4285g9230g7c06c6ef630e"
msgid "I'm a duergar."
msgstr "난 듀에르가다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bc38c9fd-4fe2-ac1a-e121-dd80bc1cdb38
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: GNOME
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:bc38c9fd-4fe2-ac1a-e121-dd80bc1cdb38
msgctxt "hfe6e4c77gf636g4b62gb0b8gfaefe7b495fc"
msgid "I'm a gnome. I'm surprised you've not met my kind before."
msgstr "나는 노움이야. 네가 우리 종족을 만난 적 없다 해도 놀랍지 않네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bc38c9fd-4fe2-ac1a-e121-dd80bc1cdb38
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[9].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: HALFELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:bc38c9fd-4fe2-ac1a-e121-dd80bc1cdb38
msgctxt "h51cef42eg6207g42a2g9309g589e78dbd92b"
msgid "I'm a half-elf. It throws people sometimes."
msgstr "나는 하프 엘프야. 가끔 사람들이 헷갈려 하더라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bc38c9fd-4fe2-ac1a-e121-dd80bc1cdb38
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[10].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:bc38c9fd-4fe2-ac1a-e121-dd80bc1cdb38
msgctxt "h60913eb3gc680g465fgacb9g63bd1cd70316"
msgid "You could just ask what race I am."
msgstr "내가 무슨 종족인지 그냥 물어보면 되잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = bc7525f3-6af9-931c-616b-93964eb3f5b0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon_SummonedShovel = True
#.      - GLO_Quasit_State_LearnedSpell = False
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName2(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - FOR_Quasit_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Quasit_State_LearnedSpell = True
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Quasit_Event_LearningSpell(1) = True
#. TagRule: SORCERER or WARLOCK or WIZARD
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:bc7525f3-6af9-931c-616b-93964eb3f5b0
msgctxt "h6a011be8g5930g4950gb1eag36dcb8c58fbf"
msgid ""
"Oh, oh, a spell shite! When the fisting starts, use the sparky magic to call "
"Fork. LET'S KILL <i>EVERYTHING</i>."
msgstr "오, 이런, 망할 주문! 쌈박질 시작되거든, 반짝이 마법을 사용해서 포크를 불러. <i>모조리</i> 죽여버리자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = bdb8dbc2-4ab5-2f34-a89e-6bdc45843d42
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:bdb8dbc2-4ab5-2f34-a89e-6bdc45843d42
msgctxt "hb82315a8g7345g4a77g8d0fgec3891b93d66"
msgid "Ah! AHHH. NO. BAD MAGIC. SORRY. SORRRRY."
msgstr "아! 아아. 안 돼. 나쁜 마법. 미안. 미아아안."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = c0c875f4-ae4b-dfc7-e0f8-33e4e17ea582
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:c0c875f4-ae4b-dfc7-e0f8-33e4e17ea582
msgctxt "hf2b3dd0fg5bf9g4a8dgb734g6dd232535c7c"
msgid "Yeah. The other arse-wipe said it was fine."
msgstr "그래. 다른 개새끼가 괜찮다고 했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = c2480821-d177-0562-09a6-4da4a2903721
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName3(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:c2480821-d177-0562-09a6-4da4a2903721
msgctxt "hde8382aag6a0eg4d19ga420g34aefb722154"
msgid "Believe. Don't believe. Basket doesn't care."
msgstr "믿던지. 말던지. 바구니 알 바 아냐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = c2691c9c-658a-1ac2-617c-f5947ad58308
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:c2691c9c-658a-1ac2-617c-f5947ad58308
msgctxt "ha9d8c5d1g750ag4943gb9d7gedca69951fbb"
msgid "Stench? No. Smell like piss and blood - nice things."
msgstr "악취? 아냐. 오줌과 피 냄새. 좋은 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = c2838a6d-dd83-69e9-b091-d05ed5bf4aa8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:c2838a6d-dd83-69e9-b091-d05ed5bf4aa8
msgctxt "hbeeafe80gc142g4df2g94d8g78468dc096b5"
msgid "BOOOOOORED."
msgstr "심심해애애애."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = c499980e-cc88-b770-558a-bd63e2662043
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:c499980e-cc88-b770-558a-bd63e2662043
msgctxt "h141cb9f0gaf1cg43eag9198g0b9c14e8d11e"
msgid "Wait. You're not Illy."
msgstr "잠깐. 너 일리가 아니잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = c4ffa583-698a-96d3-22fc-ca4f06717a20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:c4ffa583-698a-96d3-22fc-ca4f06717a20
msgctxt "hb80f734dgd13dg4575g81c0gda7ad7f69f65"
msgid "Heh. And you. Slab of beef with nipples. <i>Moo. </i>"
msgstr "헤, 너도. 젖꼭지 달린 고깃 덩어리. <i>무우. </i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c5079f6d-6544-425c-d0b0-e714bddfff2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:c5079f6d-6544-425c-d0b0-e714bddfff2c
msgctxt "hc2009ad8gfb71g4114g9cb1gedc076f75faa"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = c647ce7e-9700-874d-73f1-8eaeaa6e7b1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:c647ce7e-9700-874d-73f1-8eaeaa6e7b1f
msgctxt "h52b3764ega5b0g4e0ag8cb1g9116b5c0d8ec"
msgid ""
"So, you're Fork's master now? I like gutting. Killing. Tearing. Smearing. "
"And dancing on dead kiddies."
msgstr "그럼 이제 네가 포크의 주인이야? 포크는 내장을 가르고, 죽이고, 찢고, 더럽히고, 죽은 애들 위에서 춤추는 걸 좋아해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = c8ca4fda-5840-c20a-cc37-20afb0baf406
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName2(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:c8ca4fda-5840-c20a-cc37-20afb0baf406
msgctxt "h8720beb3g7b0dg4ab3g947bg3777f6c4b769"
msgid ""
"Thunder Master smells scary but is nice. Doesn't hit Fork. Tell you secret. "
"<i>Only</i> you."
msgstr "천둥 주인 무서운 냄새 나지만 착하다. 포크를 때리지 않아. 비밀 말해줄게. <i>너한테만</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = ca0471c7-3216-31ed-c9e3-332621248043
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName3(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:ca0471c7-3216-31ed-c9e3-332621248043
msgctxt "h64d21ad7gf354g499eg909bg330597274522"
msgid "Thunder Master is nice. Doesn't hit Basket, so Basket tells you."
msgstr "천둥 주인 착하다. 바구니를 때리지 않아, 그러니 바구니가 말해 줄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cab8b1f8-770a-ad3c-2b74-f387a0aa1ee9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:cab8b1f8-770a-ad3c-2b74-f387a0aa1ee9
msgctxt "h79f3b728gb519g42cdg96c6g741f05c82c0a"
msgid "'Funny'? Says the creature that looks and smells like half-dead vermin."
msgstr "'웃긴'? 반쯤 죽은 해충같은 모습과 냄새를 풍기는 쪽이 할 말은 아니지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = cb3d1a5c-ef6b-522b-12b7-60b4b00cf39c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - FOR_Quasit_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - CURRENTREGION_WLD_Main_A = True
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_Knows_BalsamTreatsBurns = False
#.      - FOR_DangerousBook_Found = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon_SummonedShovel = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:cb3d1a5c-ef6b-522b-12b7-60b4b00cf39c
msgctxt "ha46c5e33ga421g447fgb1bagf79e7322e3ae"
msgid "Bodies to gut. Babies to eat! Let's go, beefy."
msgstr "배를 가르고 아기도 먹고! 얼른 가자, 뚱땡아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = cd532589-7468-5d3e-a304-d269baa7388e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:cd532589-7468-5d3e-a304-d269baa7388e
msgctxt "h83f06ac3g6a55g4c61gb854ge50a8a020c7d"
msgid "Tongue my arsehole, toe-rag."
msgstr "내 똥꼬나 핥아라, 이 거지발싸개야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce00a4aa-e07f-d2c6-6758-6f129ce2687f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:ce00a4aa-e07f-d2c6-6758-6f129ce2687f
msgctxt "h6abeda9eg5bd2g44d1g8e4egd7a03e6bd039"
msgid "Considering your stench, you can't judge."
msgstr "네 악취 때문에, 잘 모르는 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = d07a1d5e-66e3-bb6c-aa98-ef8f1791624a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:d07a1d5e-66e3-bb6c-aa98-ef8f1791624a
msgctxt "h87d8d3b4ge974g4b42g912ag1914457723df"
msgid "Believe. Don't believe. Shovel doesn't care."
msgstr "믿던지. 말던지. 삽 알 바 아냐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d0917de5-327e-b7f3-fa3a-49196a3c164b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:d0917de5-327e-b7f3-fa3a-49196a3c164b
msgctxt "hac21db3egd0abg4fb6ga757g891be25486f7"
msgid "No. And you'll not commit such deeds in my name either."
msgstr "아니, 앞으로 너도 내 이름으로 그런 짓을 저지르지 않게 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = d113fe0a-8882-4d24-a2fc-109a22aaa407
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SORCERER_DRACONIC(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:d113fe0a-8882-4d24-a2fc-109a22aaa407
msgctxt "h89525362g9d4ag4308ga489ge2453628f312"
msgid "Wait. You smell funny. Like - like fire and iron. Like a <i>dragon</i>."
msgstr "가만... 너 이상한 냄새 나. 꼭... 불에 달군 쇳내 같아. 꼭 <i>드래곤</i>처럼."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d310a8de-aefb-32a4-024c-644fa6005ab2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:d310a8de-aefb-32a4-024c-644fa6005ab2
msgctxt "h7e1e97ceg5bb2g458ag940dg37e90b8af3a7"
msgid "Hmm. Some light pillage - perhaps a bit of murder to follow?"
msgstr "흠. 가벼운 약탈 정도는. 아마 약간의 살인도 같이?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = d35ad8e6-1c93-bc48-f35c-f161e414092b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:d35ad8e6-1c93-bc48-f35c-f161e414092b
msgctxt "h50f5c621g8969g45ecgb131gd59088579860"
msgid "Boo. Liar."
msgstr "우우. 거짓말쟁이."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = d66d6335-06e6-015b-08a8-1c73597436ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - FOR_DangerousBook.FindTome(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:d66d6335-06e6-015b-08a8-1c73597436ca
msgctxt "he9e95f17g06b6g4201gbaf4g42cbbeb3bd43"
msgid "But Thunder Master can read it. Can conquer it! Yes!"
msgstr "하지만 천둥 주인은 읽을 수 있다. 정복할 수 있다! 맞아!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = d6e727c6-fd06-1e7a-364e-594867782812
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CURRENTREGION_WLD_Main_A = True
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_Event_TrapInProgress = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon_SummonedShovel = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:d6e727c6-fd06-1e7a-364e-594867782812
msgctxt "he2272e53g25ecg4ebcga1f4gc00b7ad6603f"
msgid "Haha! Run. Run! Or sparky gets you."
msgstr "하하! 도망가. 도망쳐! 아니면 번쩍이에게 잡힐 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = d6ed34ed-5e3f-c9b1-6770-d30891f5693f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName3(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:d6ed34ed-5e3f-c9b1-6770-d30891f5693f
msgctxt "h08864af3g2cbag44f7gb5a9g0cd97b1dfc70"
msgid "So. You're Basket's master now? Fine."
msgstr "그래서. 네가 이제 바구니의 주인이야? 그래."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ddafaf9a-00f5-78df-a79f-e4c7f8ae91e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:ddafaf9a-00f5-78df-a79f-e4c7f8ae91e0
msgctxt "h93cde04ag6031g4f86g97c9g2d69a049768e"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = de1998f3-5105-2d65-bae7-08adb0c27756
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:de1998f3-5105-2d65-bae7-08adb0c27756
msgctxt "h46e59273g667bg44a7ga27fg6e352c9d8c82"
msgid ""
"The blacksmith. The teacher. The grocer. The baker. Little piggies to the "
"butcher."
msgstr "대장장이, 교사, 식료품 주인, 제빵사. 하나같이 요리하기 좋은 고깃덩어리들이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = e2cd5dfa-1c62-7216-bb30-bdf1b024559b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:e2cd5dfa-1c62-7216-bb30-bdf1b024559b
msgctxt "h3132ed56gfa9fg4846g9017g235b84954abd"
msgid "So?"
msgstr "그래서?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e37b0707-c5eb-c21a-c7cd-d5c2939fbefe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName1(1) = False
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName2(0) = False
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName3(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:e37b0707-c5eb-c21a-c7cd-d5c2939fbefe
msgctxt "h72f2df71g4f66g4b99g885egdcfdae619d88"
msgid "Does Basket sound good to you?"
msgstr "그럼 바구니는 어때?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = e44a2acc-9605-7234-d7cc-fe9308504a31
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_Knows_BalsamTreatsBurns = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:e44a2acc-9605-7234-d7cc-fe9308504a31
msgctxt "h21654738g894eg457ag863cg39f5bfd4d811"
msgid "Talk to the mirror. And remember. Balsam? Good for burns."
msgstr "거울에게 말해. 그리고 기억해. 발삼? 화상에 좋아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = e46f3e94-dce0-129f-74e9-1e5b266fc481
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:e46f3e94-dce0-129f-74e9-1e5b266fc481
msgctxt "hda6241d5g88d8g42d9g8a77gfd018ed48056"
msgid "...Really?"
msgstr "...진짜?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = e61bd36b-253c-f446-ffb6-db77b205b709
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:e61bd36b-253c-f446-ffb6-db77b205b709
msgctxt "h9011824eg1897g400eg93adg43a5cd97543a"
msgid "Don't care."
msgstr "알게 뭐야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = e6a64ef8-0998-5c94-594d-e23a5a1ffca3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:e6a64ef8-0998-5c94-594d-e23a5a1ffca3
msgctxt "h0d0f7d58ga0f5g4595g8286gb22062e57663"
msgid "Master better. Balsam for wounds and power is king. No forget!"
msgstr "주인님 잘해. 발삼은 상처에 잘 들어. 아는 게 힘이니, 까먹지 마!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = e79330b6-7cf9-de6d-0a11-5813a546c6df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:e79330b6-7cf9-de6d-0a11-5813a546c6df
msgctxt "hb60f21dcg73efg4895g87deg06c3b2eee9dd"
msgid "DRAGON SHOVEL IS GONNA EAT YOUR BABIES."
msgstr "<b>드래곤 삽이 네 아기들을 잡아먹을 거다.</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = e82ca2ac-f2f5-321e-fabd-a155c25c1751
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:e82ca2ac-f2f5-321e-fabd-a155c25c1751
msgctxt "h06638524gf647g4dc4g9519gd65034fe9d15"
msgid "You got jam in your holes? SHOVEL. Don't like it? Change it."
msgstr "귓구멍이 막혔어? 삽이라니까. 맘에 안 들어? 그럼 바꿔."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = e911f6b1-ab77-e68a-8f04-ccbf4ed11e42
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - FOR_Quasit_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - CURRENTREGION_WLD_Main_A = True
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_Event_OpenMirror = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon_SummonedShovel = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:e911f6b1-ab77-e68a-8f04-ccbf4ed11e42
msgctxt "hc37bfabbg80dbg428bg800cg147c7a733e33"
msgid "See. Tell you truth, beefy. Trust me. Always always. "
msgstr "거봐, 뭐랬어. 날 믿으라고. 항상 그래야지. "

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = ea380aaf-9d75-8206-a187-1b80b06441a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:ea380aaf-9d75-8206-a187-1b80b06441a1
msgctxt "h60aa231fgeef1g4ec9ga792g3126fd96029d"
msgid "Woooooooooow."
msgstr "와아아아아우."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ea5c3da1-c4e6-27e4-f5ba-02e847e98f99
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:ea5c3da1-c4e6-27e4-f5ba-02e847e98f99
msgctxt "hd9048bd0g4f99g4bb2ga604gd2d2be224334"
msgid ""
"*You recognise the tiny fiend - a quasit. Wicked creatures often used as "
"familiars.*"
msgstr "*당신은 이 작은 마족을 알아봅니다. 콰짓. 패밀리어로 소환되곤 하는 사악한 괴물입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eb811582-477b-49a8-c5da-8c324dd000c5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:eb811582-477b-49a8-c5da-8c324dd000c5
msgctxt "h373316ddg3744g4936g9fbfgd3ce4fb7c120"
msgid "I won't hurt you, don't worry."
msgstr "해치지 않을 테니까 걱정하지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = ee8c66f0-8c08-a100-4e02-49e26e71394b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:ee8c66f0-8c08-a100-4e02-49e26e71394b
msgctxt "hfee7c705g5b6cg45e0gbd07ge0d52b3410c5"
msgid ""
"Teach Shovel how to be a dragon! Then, Shovel tells you a secret. A big "
"secret."
msgstr "삽한테 드래곤이 되는 법 가르쳐 줘! 그럼, 삽도 비밀 알려줄게. 큰 비밀."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ef5efe74-9bb1-409c-e8a8-f4eb3f73466c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_DangerousBook_Found = False
#.   User:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCelar_MagicMirror_HasMet(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:ef5efe74-9bb1-409c-e8a8-f4eb3f73466c
msgctxt "h7c6a9987ge5c2g4971g9aa5gc64736c54aa8"
msgid "What book?"
msgstr "무슨 책?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f03e0139-da56-b1b9-df14-54dded87112f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:f03e0139-da56-b1b9-df14-54dded87112f
msgctxt "hf1bb6d0fg77bag4816ga1a9gfe218aa99891"
msgid "What does that last part even mean?"
msgstr "마지막 부분은 무슨 뜻이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f3092ed4-2ebe-f820-d565-8afe67d87e17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:f3092ed4-2ebe-f820-d565-8afe67d87e17
msgctxt "hfe7783ebg05cbg4a0ag8a97gb56666a1c3c3"
msgid "Your name is Shovel?"
msgstr "이름이 삽이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f44f24c9-5098-6785-c852-326c6c82d558
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:f44f24c9-5098-6785-c852-326c6c82d558
msgctxt "he0713de7g5ef5g4a69g8abfg92366ceb90fd"
msgid "Sure. Just hold your arms out real wide."
msgstr "물론이지. 우선 팔을 최대한 크게 벌려봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f862008b-9e5e-ffed-c732-89aa556ec607
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:f862008b-9e5e-ffed-c732-89aa556ec607
msgctxt "he50b7ff2g8e8eg4d67ga1cdg89067c72d9ac"
msgid "The truth now, wretch - or I'll gut you."
msgstr "이제 진실을 말해라 비열한 놈아, 아니면 죽여버리겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = f86cdb12-59c3-2fb0-6af5-a4fac65908e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:f86cdb12-59c3-2fb0-6af5-a4fac65908e4
msgctxt "h00fc0269g161cg4024g917fg0c1b491967a2"
msgid ""
"<i>Yes. </i>Steal bodies. Tear them. Then Illy puts them back together. "
"Again. And again."
msgstr "<i>응. </i>몸을 훔쳐. 찢어. 그 다음 일리가 다시 조립해 . 다시, 그리고 다시."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = f8bb52d6-8142-8391-7c2e-c149af2c3373
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - FOR_Quasit_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - CURRENTREGION_WLD_Main_A = False
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName2(0) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon_SummonedShovel = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:f8bb52d6-8142-8391-7c2e-c149af2c3373
msgctxt "h4fa8c8f3g716eg4019gb3efg064ea29944f5"
msgid "Fork is bored. Fork wants to MURDERISE."
msgstr "포크 지루해. 포크 <b>살인하고</b> 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f9543024-ca11-86c6-a5cf-5af9fcd5439a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:f9543024-ca11-86c6-a5cf-5af9fcd5439a
msgctxt "hf64ace4bg518eg41a3g9f63g192f857d9d97"
msgid "Perfect. Now flap real hard."
msgstr "잘 했어. 이제 힘껏 날개짓 해 보라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = f9556a19-4404-22c7-d420-f44d8b008cb2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:f9556a19-4404-22c7-d420-f44d8b008cb2
msgctxt "h7a51b9ddg5ef5g4afdgbe0eg576d4e570f97"
msgid ""
"Shovel comes. Shovel takes them. Then we raise them. Make them walk. "
"Necromancer, your kind call him."
msgstr "삽이 와. 삽이 놈들 묻어. 그리고 일으켜. 걷게 해. 사령술사, 너희들 주인을 그렇게 불렀어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fa81a3d3-d76d-3a5a-e724-9d8931a72b0e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName2(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:fa81a3d3-d76d-3a5a-e724-9d8931a72b0e
msgctxt "h3be6b942gd8f0g45degb42egbd1a96d4e55f"
msgid "Your name is 'Fork'?"
msgstr "네 이름이 '포크'야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fcc8ef3c-b2af-9d07-af41-7dbf8c1292a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName1(0) = True
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName2(0) = False
#.     - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_QuasitName3(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:fcc8ef3c-b2af-9d07-af41-7dbf8c1292a6
msgctxt "h7e7a6125gfc7fg4327g938bg97c88a6db2c9"
msgid "Shovel is fine."
msgstr "삽도 괜찮아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = fe2c2b58-fb4b-cca2-eae9-2a0c3d85aecc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:fe2c2b58-fb4b-cca2-eae9-2a0c3d85aecc
msgctxt "h9bbdcf29g8230g4a02g8d42ga0b7a8108c33"
msgid "URGGGH. Less talking, MORE KILLING."
msgstr "으으. 대화는 그만. 더 죽일래."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon
#. Speaker = Conjured Quasit
#. NodeID = feeb774b-8460-6524-e878-2ac06b25edf1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_QuasitSummon:feeb774b-8460-6524-e878-2ac06b25edf1
msgctxt "h1fd47a69g79b0g45d7gbf4cg8613771c311e"
msgid "Don't know. Don't care."
msgstr "몰라. 관심 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_VB_Bookcase
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fe24a5dd-d208-abaa-a263-b09e44fd79da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_VB_Bookcase:fe24a5dd-d208-abaa-a263-b09e44fd79da
msgctxt "h36ad340bg972cg4584gbaf4gc05dbdd94e7d"
msgid "Hmm. Scratch marks on the floor..."
msgstr "흐음. 바닥에 긁힌 자국이 있네..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_VB_InspectCookingPot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0df737dc-d711-04e6-3530-42a1fd89753b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_IdentifiedCookingPot = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_VB_InspectCookingPot:0df737dc-d711-04e6-3530-42a1fd89753b
msgctxt "h1be738c6g88f9g459ag904cgd5af873c6039"
msgid "Reeks of mugwort. Tastes terrible, but makes some useful potions."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_VB_InspectCookingPot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 93e18c56-c707-f3c0-6556-36cfa7a8d666
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_IdentifiedCookingPot = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_VB_InspectCookingPot:93e18c56-c707-f3c0-6556-36cfa7a8d666
msgctxt "hf9083289g1c0fg447dga6b1g61572db846d8"
msgid "Ugh, that reeks."
msgstr "어휴. 악취가 나는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_VB_InspectHerbs
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 153fe41f-4caf-d250-7923-ede876f9597e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_IdentifiedHerbs = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_VB_InspectHerbs:153fe41f-4caf-d250-7923-ede876f9597e
msgctxt "h9614e699ge66fg48c7g88fbgfd59f62cf90c"
msgid "Dead. They're only good for kindling now."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_VB_InspectHerbs
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 703be349-0063-d689-c0ee-383d874dfdc3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_VB_InspectHerbs:703be349-0063-d689-c0ee-383d874dfdc3
msgctxt "hbdf5dbe4g9a91g402bg926ag27892bbc3f37"
msgid "Expensive imports, no doubt. A shame they have wilted."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_VB_InspectHerbs
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 703be349-0063-d689-c0ee-383d874dfdc3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_VB_InspectHerbs:703be349-0063-d689-c0ee-383d874dfdc3
msgctxt "hbdfc0ed9g396fg470bg8cadg8a69ac03eca1"
msgid "A shame they've wilted, these must have cost a fortune. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_VB_InspectHerbs
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7ef24151-25b0-7134-7664-f92508bd3a27
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_IdentifiedHerbs = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_VB_InspectHerbs:7ef24151-25b0-7134-7664-f92508bd3a27
msgctxt "h5b4e8b21g5e50g4fedga95ag2041de915823"
msgid "Lapis root? Saffa? These do not grow in such a wet climate."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_VB_InspectHerbs
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7ef24151-25b0-7134-7664-f92508bd3a27
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_ThayanCellar_State_IdentifiedHerbs = True
#. TagRule: !REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_VB_InspectHerbs:7ef24151-25b0-7134-7664-f92508bd3a27
msgctxt "hfed1c83eg80d4g4a87g882ag977117ce611a"
msgid "Lapis root? Saffa? Rare to see these so far north."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_VB_Mirror
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c9d61bf1-8d54-aad0-4747-89e3d17a53ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_VB_Mirror:c9d61bf1-8d54-aad0-4747-89e3d17a53ae
msgctxt "h670f8dd0g48edg44a5g95e2g2d6ed0c57328"
msgid "The glass feels... warm?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_VB_ReadLedger
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6ad7c240-8649-9d14-1791-59887a08b1a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_VB_ReadLedger:6ad7c240-8649-9d14-1791-59887a08b1a0
msgctxt "h1521f5f9gf961g4939g8281ga702a9fef6bb"
msgid "I don't see one..."
msgstr "전혀 안 보이는데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_VB_ReadLedger
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ceb0fa98-067f-9f3f-f476-29aa93600fa8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_VB_ReadLedger:ceb0fa98-067f-9f3f-f476-29aa93600fa8
msgctxt "h84a067a4g774dg4034ga89cge7a7b203e522"
msgid "It says there's a cellar here somewhere."
msgstr "여기 어딘가에 지하실이 있다고 하는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_VB_Trap
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b329152b-9e9b-69d0-280d-ba9ec6edfac6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_VB_Trap:b329152b-9e9b-69d0-280d-ba9ec6edfac6
msgctxt "ha3c34e0egbcd8g447dg84a2gc92854f29040"
msgid "Quite the welcome."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_VB_TrapStart
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8f999d57-9bf8-1352-0128-b719a43cdbd6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_ThayanCellar_VB_TrapStart:8f999d57-9bf8-1352-0128-b719a43cdbd6
msgctxt "h1d172be0gc235g44c1gb168gfb0575bfd7d2"
msgid "What in the hells - get back!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 00748417-b597-7150-3bd2-ace7aa0a406f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:00748417-b597-7150-3bd2-ace7aa0a406f
msgctxt "h406371eeg38b4g4ab2g8cc3g9aa54bb0b992"
msgid "You seem a little confused."
msgstr "좀 정신없어 보이는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 01b616f9-0602-0384-a382-25aaa7f17d4e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_UnfortunateGnome_State_WasJustFreed = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:01b616f9-0602-0384-a382-25aaa7f17d4e
msgctxt "h5d0f1335g774bg40e5gb494ge85578f23e51"
msgid "Urrrgh... <i>magga cammara</i> - those pustulent thugs!"
msgstr "어으윽... <i>마가 카마라</i>. 저 썩어빠진 악당 놈들 같으니!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 0b022c93-3031-7352-7755-7e74ab7119c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:0b022c93-3031-7352-7755-7e74ab7119c8
msgctxt "ha08da6f8gd153g4170gaaf4g25a0b97f6af1"
msgid "You're teasing me now. I'm certain of it."
msgstr "지금 장난치는 거지? 확실해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 1016f4dd-6590-1ca1-c43f-e0d8b32ca405
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DROWELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:1016f4dd-6590-1ca1-c43f-e0d8b32ca405
msgctxt "h507a7123g9f38g4894ga956gaca6c4dda537"
msgid ""
"I'm a deep gnome, you're a drow. You helped me, now you plan to enslave me."
msgstr "난 딥 노움이고, 넌 드로우잖아. 나를 구해 줬으니 이제 노예로 삼으려는 거겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 130b9915-6f95-03c6-e851-5e2b087d7540
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:130b9915-6f95-03c6-e851-5e2b087d7540
msgctxt "h5e669f3ag5b93g4ee9g8564g99694a0584e3"
msgid ""
"On that note, I bid thee farewell. If we should meet again... well, we will "
"have met again."
msgstr "그렇다고 치고, 그럼 안녕이군. 우리가 만약 다시 만난다면... 뭐, 다시 만나는 거겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 16908d81-aa96-4937-024b-8f9c8ec4aa28
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_UnfortunateGnome_State_HasAmulet(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:16908d81-aa96-4937-024b-8f9c8ec4aa28
msgctxt "h204b5be1g0578g4800g9e5agadab65a6dcfc"
msgid ""
"I'm in search of a friend. I fear he's in trouble. He had this locket, see, "
"that I gave him years ago before leaving home."
msgstr ""
"친구를 찾고 있어. 문제가 생긴 건 아닐까 걱정이 돼. 그가 이 로켓을 가지고 있었지, 봐 봐, 여러 해 전에 내가 고향을 떠나기 전에 "
"준 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2024731b-5659-6409-fcb8-01b4985910ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:2024731b-5659-6409-fcb8-01b4985910ea
msgctxt "h3e11e313g1454g4001gbec5g061070f44bdf"
msgid ""
"I walk my path, you walk yours. We may meet again - we may not. Who's to say."
msgstr ""
"나는 나의 길을 걷고, 너 또한 네 길을 걷는 법. 혹시 인연이 다시 닿는다면 만나게 될 거야. 혹은 아닐지도. 우리로서는 알 수 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 272eef1c-7750-684c-6fbb-854875975677
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:272eef1c-7750-684c-6fbb-854875975677
msgctxt "h1d71b794ge69dg45b0ga338gec462a574674"
msgid "You're free to continue on your way."
msgstr "계속 가던 길 가도 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 29d68557-2fde-c52a-9b30-ea70a6863220
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:29d68557-2fde-c52a-9b30-ea70a6863220
msgctxt "h1d2a2529gd202g4e30ga8deg79b7e0c49392"
msgid ""
"I found it around the neck of a thug in the Lower City. It was speckled with "
"blood, my friend nowhere to be found."
msgstr "하부 도시에서 웬 깡패의 목에 걸려있는 걸 발견했어. 피가 묻어 있었고, 내 친구는 찾을 수 없었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 33dd5d24-1165-6ad0-db19-ef938dedae80
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: SELDARINEDROWELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:33dd5d24-1165-6ad0-db19-ef938dedae80
msgctxt "h9c91b0f6g3fd4g4e83g8546g05818ccb0bce"
msgid "You've only met Lolth's drow, it seems."
msgstr "롤쓰의 드로우만 만나본 모양이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 33dd5d24-1165-6ad0-db19-ef938dedae80
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:33dd5d24-1165-6ad0-db19-ef938dedae80
msgctxt "h850bd12eg0436g4318gb1fdg22765d6d33ac"
msgid "Is that what you think of drow?"
msgstr "드로우 하면 그 생각밖에 안 드는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3489a8c3-a2ee-6ee6-d11f-7b5e6c2df4ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:3489a8c3-a2ee-6ee6-d11f-7b5e6c2df4ee
msgctxt "h75365ae9gc487g409fg8b49g96db6f8cf1c7"
msgid "Get on with what?"
msgstr "뭘 계속하는데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3cf71752-3143-0661-798e-cb4d64d8b571
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:3cf71752-3143-0661-798e-cb4d64d8b571
msgctxt "h1cad9a5agb440g4212g9cafgbafa7518597a"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 411c42f6-b930-dcd9-c22c-df7a3e25bfa0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:411c42f6-b930-dcd9-c22c-df7a3e25bfa0
msgctxt "he5ecbec3g3ba0g4740g9859gbebd67c50a8c"
msgid "I <i>always </i>help my friends."
msgstr "난 <i>항상 </i>내 친구들을 돕는다구."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 46062f19-3730-dfb9-3b2c-9331aacd35fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:46062f19-3730-dfb9-3b2c-9331aacd35fd
msgctxt "h1e1ec70cge244g4e4bga926g413be5865d12"
msgid ""
"What, then? Torture? Bloodsport? Or perhaps just a good old-fashioned "
"walloping?"
msgstr "그럼 뭐지? 고문? 갖고 놀다 죽이기? 아니면 그냥 평범하게 두들겨 팰 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 4a733039-fce9-8f32-1a66-21c4c168cfa9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: BESTIAL or GITHYANKI or RARE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:4a733039-fce9-8f32-1a66-21c4c168cfa9
msgctxt "hf3730b95g64cdg4a41ga2f7g04f62a9b42e5"
msgid "Well, get on with it. Whatever you are."
msgstr "좋아, 계속하라고. 네가 뭔진 모르겠지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 4a733039-fce9-8f32-1a66-21c4c168cfa9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:4a733039-fce9-8f32-1a66-21c4c168cfa9
msgctxt "hf8244464gf24ag40b2g8e0bga9e2d7009772"
msgid "Well - get on with it."
msgstr "좋아, 계속하라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 50fa4046-cab0-bce0-6b98-da7d8cca7e30
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:50fa4046-cab0-bce0-6b98-da7d8cca7e30
msgctxt "h9811807cg3143g49dfg9b4dg28f3aaf9386b"
msgid "Is that what you think of duergar?"
msgstr "듀에르가 하면 그 생각밖에 안 나는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 5ae13a2a-4815-94c8-ad72-c4dfbd7cd635
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:5ae13a2a-4815-94c8-ad72-c4dfbd7cd635
msgctxt "hab5a6f22gc94dg4f74gbdfag70537c0ee4f7"
msgid "Just like that, I'm sure."
msgstr "그렇단 말이지. 흐음."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 6362433d-8457-f357-6846-dc482cba4fa3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:6362433d-8457-f357-6846-dc482cba4fa3
msgctxt "h23184fe4g90d8g46dfgbd61g94ce8d3fd4b8"
msgid ""
"Ignorance is alive and well, it seems! Deep gnomes aren't restricted to the "
"Underdark, you know - I've lived in Baldur's Gate for years."
msgstr "무지가 여전히 팽배한 것 같군! 딥 노움이라고 해서 언더다크에만 사는 건 아니라구. 난 여러 해 동안 발더스 게이트에 살았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 63e58bd4-ce67-1eac-32b0-5b8cb48709bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DUERGARDWARF(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:63e58bd4-ce67-1eac-32b0-5b8cb48709bb
msgctxt "h5907fe8dgbdc3g4f44gbb74g2149d7d86c33"
msgid ""
"I'm a deep gnome, you're a grey dwarf. You helped me, now you plan to "
"enslave me."
msgstr "나는 딥 노움이고, 넌 회색 드워프잖아. 나를 구해 줬으니 이제 노예로 삼으려는 거겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7036c8eb-5983-0d40-7c99-19b3ac311a81
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: PLANAR or REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:7036c8eb-5983-0d40-7c99-19b3ac311a81
msgctxt "ha89b8f7bg4a76g46fegb2b4g64806b4847e1"
msgid "Wait - you do not look like a surface creature. Why are you here?"
msgstr "잠깐만, 넌 지상의 생물이 아닌 것 같은데 여기서 뭐 하는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7036c8eb-5983-0d40-7c99-19b3ac311a81
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:7036c8eb-5983-0d40-7c99-19b3ac311a81
msgctxt "h7b722c48gff3bg4b15g8501gf0a9fda9e0fe"
msgid "You're a little far from home for a deep gnome."
msgstr "딥 노움치고는 고향에서 꽤 멀리 왔네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 73c74a7c-0bf1-66d6-8ac4-7cfe39d8e103
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - FOR_UnfortunateGnome_Bargaining(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:73c74a7c-0bf1-66d6-8ac4-7cfe39d8e103
msgctxt "ha67f4e2fg1775g45f3gaa15gc14539ed2115"
msgid "I freed you. A little compensation would be nice."
msgstr "내가 너를 풀어 줬어. 약간의 보상이 있으면 좋겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7c1e50da-d4c4-f691-586e-518dd0262860
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:7c1e50da-d4c4-f691-586e-518dd0262860
msgctxt "h8968061fgb221g4e98g8cb7g503d5f73bdaf"
msgid "I'd rather know how you got caught."
msgstr "그보다는 어떻게 잡혔는지 알고 싶은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 87863ea9-e061-9b3b-f352-f8bc2ede94cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:87863ea9-e061-9b3b-f352-f8bc2ede94cc
msgctxt "h95f55b68g45d0g4a58gb7d0gf3919cea2b01"
msgid "I could extort you, if that's what you want."
msgstr "원한다면야 갈취해 줄 수 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 8b4d818b-5435-2a9a-ca4e-28f1b5205ac5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:8b4d818b-5435-2a9a-ca4e-28f1b5205ac5
msgctxt "hcd932bf6g54f1g4a3dgbdedg87bafe512ce7"
msgid "I <i>always </i>help my friends."
msgstr "난 <i>항상 </i>내 친구들을 돕는다구."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = a308dbc2-60e5-d070-c338-b75766f53db3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:a308dbc2-60e5-d070-c338-b75766f53db3
msgctxt "hed351d91ge089g4a68g8853ge8d149e970d7"
msgid ""
"On that note, I bid thee farewell. If we should meet again... well, we will "
"have met again."
msgstr "그렇다고 치고, 그럼 안녕이군. 우리가 만약 다시 만난다면... 뭐, 다시 만나는 거겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = a9a5af2b-c639-6ec2-27ad-4ae36a37ebe1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:a9a5af2b-c639-6ec2-27ad-4ae36a37ebe1
msgctxt "hff7a5ed0ga224g43fega4dcg25ad35fa9da8"
msgid ""
"But I still have hope. I have reason to believe he's in the Underdark. "
"Hopefully I'll pick up his trail from there."
msgstr "그래도 아직 희망은 있어. 그가 언더다크에 있을 것 같은 단서가 있지. 어쩌면 거기서부터 그의 흔적을 쫓을 수 있을지도."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = a9dcc5dd-fd9d-29d5-49d9-0eeed397831e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:a9dcc5dd-fd9d-29d5-49d9-0eeed397831e
msgctxt "h72692f28gc76fg47dcg9923g3879a2e633b0"
msgid ""
"My own fault, really. I should have dropped my pack and outrun those "
"bastards. Alas."
msgstr "정말로 내 잘못이야. 그냥 가방 버리고 놈들보다 더 빨리 달려서 도망쳤어야 했는데. 아아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = aa67ec5c-0790-c51d-e296-941ade105246
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:aa67ec5c-0790-c51d-e296-941ade105246
msgctxt "h83c69ef9g13f4g4580g9858ga1e33aa42722"
msgid "What, then?"
msgstr "그럼 뭐야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = b2e0f695-4d9c-6388-2ee4-caf11f11c9a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 69311587-2701-0f0d-5726-76873434a2a1_toldpack = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FOR_UnfortunateGnome_Event_OfferedPack(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:b2e0f695-4d9c-6388-2ee4-caf11f11c9a1
msgctxt "h95adf2e7g941fg4e6cg9035g637c9636c9b7"
msgid ""
"Take my pack if you can find it. The only reason those goblins caught me was "
"its weight. I'll travel lightly from now on."
msgstr ""
"내 가방을 찾게 되면 가지도록 해. 애초에 저 고블린 놈들한테 잡힌 건 가방이 너무 무거워서였으니까. 이제부턴 가볍게 여행할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = b39d97d3-dfeb-0294-7f23-3ba57288eb23
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:b39d97d3-dfeb-0294-7f23-3ba57288eb23
msgctxt "h130a8f3fg2fc2g4546g9744g8b28c1201404"
msgid "This is... well... <i>most</i> unorthodox. So it shall be."
msgstr "이건... 음... <i>상당히</i> 특이한 경험이군. 그렇게 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = c1e5ddc1-d24e-bebf-364c-b3a30b9c6896
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:c1e5ddc1-d24e-bebf-364c-b3a30b9c6896
msgctxt "h4725e4fcgc920g4600g8237g087f07f2ed85"
msgid "You saved me. Now you'll extort me. That's how this works, yes?"
msgstr "날 구해줬으니 이제 갈취하려 들겠지. 그게 당연하잖아, 안 그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = ccd4b3c0-c5a9-4708-6ab0-4042e425fea8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DUERGARDWARF(1) = False
#.      - DROWELF(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:ccd4b3c0-c5a9-4708-6ab0-4042e425fea8
msgctxt "h368ee86dg772bg45b4gb495g347013ce487a"
msgid "As expected. Coercion by the book."
msgstr "예상대로 전형적인 갈취 방식이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cd4e29ba-62ae-fffe-17ce-fcbb970346f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:cd4e29ba-62ae-fffe-17ce-fcbb970346f2
msgctxt "hfabf591bga797g4ebfgb0cfg3ab93cc458f6"
msgid "Yes. My reward - now."
msgstr "맞아. 당장 사례금을 내놔."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cf8d0d6c-96b4-a405-7d04-58ec40bd0007
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - FOR_UnfortunateGnome_Bargaining(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:cf8d0d6c-96b4-a405-7d04-58ec40bd0007
msgctxt "h82bde188g928fg4f68g824cg3892648c0e41"
msgid "I freed you. A little compensation would be nice."
msgstr "내가 너를 풀어 줬어. 약간의 보상이 있으면 좋겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d42e11b7-2bf3-e6c1-6558-d5dc39470da8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:d42e11b7-2bf3-e6c1-6558-d5dc39470da8
msgctxt "haf94ef36g0934g42ccg9955g448dbc378afe"
msgid "That's not what I want."
msgstr "그걸 원하는 건 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d7c2231e-e375-0958-3b84-3248204f70b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:d7c2231e-e375-0958-3b84-3248204f70b9
msgctxt "h8289da9cge7f3g4fd5ga76cg4699becd0703"
msgid "To take without need is unprincipled. You owe me nothing, gnome."
msgstr "필요도 없는 것을 취하는 것은 원칙에 맞지 않아. 내게 빚진 건 없다, 노움."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = da7abcbe-61ac-1c89-b980-1b204fd8c4d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:da7abcbe-61ac-1c89-b980-1b204fd8c4d5
msgctxt "h126f7adcgc2f3g450fg906dg6728f6ce8737"
msgid ""
"But I still have hope. I have reason to believe he's in the Underdark. "
"Hopefully I'll pick up his trail from there."
msgstr "그래도 아직 희망은 있어. 그가 언더다크에 있을 것 같은 단서가 있지. 어쩌면 거기서부터 그의 흔적을 쫓을 수 있을지도."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = e5a05192-cbe9-2226-fcac-8eef2f60240d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DROWELF or DROWHALFELF or DUERGARDWARF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:e5a05192-cbe9-2226-fcac-8eef2f60240d
msgctxt "hd3644e55g1c2cg42cbgaf65g16333af4699c"
msgid ""
"Compensation? Is that all? I expected worse from the likes of <i>you</i>."
msgstr "보상이라고? 그게 전부야? <i>너희</i> 족속에게선 더한 걸 예상했는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = e6e0a63a-d8c2-8c44-c017-f0d979f77a72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - FOR_UnfortunateGnome_State_HasAmulet(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:e6e0a63a-d8c2-8c44-c017-f0d979f77a72
msgctxt "h077489c3g3a31g4b20g9385gf917fe3f8c8a"
msgid ""
"I'm in search of a friend. I fear he's in trouble. See this? I gave it to "
"him years ago before I left home."
msgstr "친구를 찾고 있어. 문제가 생긴 건 아닐까 걱정이 돼. 이거 보여? 내가 집을 떠나기 여러 해 전에 그 녀석에게 준 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = efb9e50e-b735-74fb-97b0-9ef2f683cab5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_UnfortunateGnome_State_WasJustFreed = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:efb9e50e-b735-74fb-97b0-9ef2f683cab5
msgctxt "h139758eagb3c6g46dcgbf8egb6eb71160219"
msgid "Urrrgh... <i>magga cammara</i> - those pustulent thugs!"
msgstr "어으윽... <i>마가 카마라</i>. 저 썩어빠진 악당 놈들 같으니!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f56f1cc3-5c79-e3ca-47c2-977bace59891
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:f56f1cc3-5c79-e3ca-47c2-977bace59891
msgctxt "ha380a7efgf0ceg4a92g9d8dg499daf78c186"
msgid "You owe me nothing."
msgstr "내게 빚진 것 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = fcb305f2-1c94-1f41-51ff-e8588b83244a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:fcb305f2-1c94-1f41-51ff-e8588b83244a
msgctxt "h7910a0dfgf55dg4e18ga2b8gc7b16f3c7d99"
msgid "<i>Nothing?</i>"
msgstr "<i>없다고?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = fd67e7c2-68c6-9087-6ab4-8185b53894d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome:fd67e7c2-68c6-9087-6ab4-8185b53894d5
msgctxt "h62d5dd7dg1ef3g43b8g85b9gb480bb9b6aa3"
msgid ""
"I found it around the neck of a thug in Baldur's Gate. It was speckled with "
"blood, my friend nowhere to be found."
msgstr "발더스 게이트에서 웬 깡패의 목에 걸려있는 걸 발견했어. 피가 묻어 있었고, 내 친구는 찾을 수 없었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome_AD
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 15bda77f-925a-0275-7c28-bea1c4ee91e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 4951c220-a67b-7317-3223-7b77d9a3dec9_B = True
#.      - 4951c220-a67b-7317-3223-7b77d9a3dec9_A = True
#.      - 4951c220-a67b-7317-3223-7b77d9a3dec9_C = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 4951c220-a67b-7317-3223-7b77d9a3dec9_B = False
#.     - 4951c220-a67b-7317-3223-7b77d9a3dec9_A = False
#.     - 4951c220-a67b-7317-3223-7b77d9a3dec9_C = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome_AD:15bda77f-925a-0275-7c28-bea1c4ee91e1
msgctxt "h73318fddg23efg4fa3g9117g8791359560e6"
msgid "I'm going to hurl."
msgstr "이러다 토하겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome_AD
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 37653ef4-7ace-ae1c-91ff-c291385112b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 4951c220-a67b-7317-3223-7b77d9a3dec9_B = False
#.      - 4951c220-a67b-7317-3223-7b77d9a3dec9_A = True
#.      - 4951c220-a67b-7317-3223-7b77d9a3dec9_C = False
