msgctxt "h6c036069g6091g4299gb9a9g2cf66377c283"
msgid "What's goin' on back there? Go check it out!"
msgstr "저기 무슨 일이야? 가서 확인해 봐!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_UnfortunateGnome_SlowDown
