msgctxt "h4b3e9cc4g6910g4ab6gae79g1302a7a183d9"
msgid ""
"Well, well! Come for the words, stay for the wine. The owner of this tome "
"must have been quite the jolly fellow."
msgstr "이거 봐라! 글을 읽으러 왔다가 와인을 즐긴달까. 이 책의 주인은 꽤나 재밌는 사람이었겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_VillageHole_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 906ad70e-c219-4810-bdbd-843f6baea7a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_VillageHole_PAD:906ad70e-c219-4810-bdbd-843f6baea7a7
msgctxt "h0d146ca3gbaebg4ab4gb69dga594f1664813"
msgid "Ohohoho! What's this?"
msgstr "오호라! 이게 뭐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_VillageHole_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 906ad70e-c219-4810-bdbd-843f6baea7a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_VillageHole_PAD:906ad70e-c219-4810-bdbd-843f6baea7a7
msgctxt "he0de9ee9g7edfg48d3gbbd1gbf2b18af71da"
msgid "Wine? A student with decadent tastes, perhaps."
msgstr "와인이라. 향락에 젖은 학생인가 보군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_VillageHole_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 906ad70e-c219-4810-bdbd-843f6baea7a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_VillageHole_PAD:906ad70e-c219-4810-bdbd-843f6baea7a7
msgctxt "hfd4aa1d4ga5b5g4448g8e30geb09db3f97c1"
msgid "What's this? A book with a twist."
msgstr "이거 봐라? 반전이 담긴 책이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_VillageHole_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 906ad70e-c219-4810-bdbd-843f6baea7a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_VillageHole_PAD:906ad70e-c219-4810-bdbd-843f6baea7a7
msgctxt "h05ab2b26gab3bg42bbgbeb7g51aaa69d81c0"
msgid ""
"A bottle of wine? And a rare one at that. This book's owner had excellent "
"taste."
msgstr "와인 병? 그것도 꽤나 귀한 건데. 이 책의 주인은 술을 잘 아네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_VillageHole_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 906ad70e-c219-4810-bdbd-843f6baea7a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_VillageHole_PAD:906ad70e-c219-4810-bdbd-843f6baea7a7
msgctxt "h78a582b2ga554g496bg9133g595d88cf9a69"
msgid "A wine bottle? A scholar with good taste, perhaps."
msgstr "와인 병? 뭘 좀 아는 학자인가 보군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_VillageHole_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a28d51ea-fe5f-4ee9-bb07-dd7c4e612652
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_VillageHole_PAD:a28d51ea-fe5f-4ee9-bb07-dd7c4e612652
msgctxt "h40f17ec9gaaeag4488gba73gfc817ccf3381"
msgid "Or they were just a shameless alcoholic."
msgstr "아니면 그냥 심각한 알코올 중독자일 수도 있고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_VillageHole_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a28d51ea-fe5f-4ee9-bb07-dd7c4e612652
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_VillageHole_PAD:a28d51ea-fe5f-4ee9-bb07-dd7c4e612652
msgctxt "ha7e421bfg89f1g4622gbbddg9fb8efb5c572"
msgid "I suppose there are worse surprises to be found inside some books."
msgstr "그래도 비밀이 숨겨진 책 치고는 건전한 편이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_VillageHole_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a28d51ea-fe5f-4ee9-bb07-dd7c4e612652
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_VillageHole_PAD:a28d51ea-fe5f-4ee9-bb07-dd7c4e612652
msgctxt "h9e0fb223gd25ag45ecgbd50ge762a903c0f4"
msgid "Never read a book I liked more than a swig of something good."
msgstr "좋은 술 한잔보다 더 좋은 책이 없더라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_VillageHole_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a28d51ea-fe5f-4ee9-bb07-dd7c4e612652
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_VillageHole_PAD:a28d51ea-fe5f-4ee9-bb07-dd7c4e612652
msgctxt "h81f92931g2cacg486ega463ge61e42c6f8bf"
msgid "A drunkard with no respect for the written word, more likely."
msgstr "그보다 글에 대한 존중이 없는 술주정뱅이에 더 가깝겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_VillageHole_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a28d51ea-fe5f-4ee9-bb07-dd7c4e612652
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_VillageHole_PAD:a28d51ea-fe5f-4ee9-bb07-dd7c4e612652
msgctxt "he084eaedg3d08g4ce4gb04egde71b7075a3a"
msgid ""
"Squeeze a silk blanket in there and you'd have all the makings of a pleasant "
"evening."
msgstr "저기에 비단 담요만 넣으면 산뜻한 저녁 시간 완성이겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_VillageHole_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a28d51ea-fe5f-4ee9-bb07-dd7c4e612652
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_VillageHole_PAD:a28d51ea-fe5f-4ee9-bb07-dd7c4e612652
msgctxt "h9816d7e9gd80dg4993ga3ecgb57222126f48"
msgid ""
"Although it's a shame about the book. No amount of wine is merrier than a "
"roaring tale."
msgstr "그래도 책은 아쉽게 됐어. 아무리 술이 좋아도 신나는 이야기만한 건 없거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_VillageHole_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a28d51ea-fe5f-4ee9-bb07-dd7c4e612652
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_VillageHole_PAD:a28d51ea-fe5f-4ee9-bb07-dd7c4e612652
msgctxt "h866dbb69gdd71g4a44gb82eg157d0b58cab2"
msgid "Or maybe a bit of a drinking problem."
msgstr "아니면 그냥 술에 중독된 사람일 수도."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_VillageSign_AD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 83d62ee0-e519-49f8-81b4-6d7bc4129b06
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_VillageSign_AD:83d62ee0-e519-49f8-81b4-6d7bc4129b06
msgctxt "h5c63c95dg03f2g491eg8ddbg9a0a37c0000f"
msgid "'Moonhaven'"
msgstr "'문헤이븐'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Village_AD_MissingPoster
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 54f765c7-c32f-f7f8-db1b-895a60912ab0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_Village_AD_MissingPoster:54f765c7-c32f-f7f8-db1b-895a60912ab0
msgctxt "h05439f34g966fg4d15gb45fg520b4e73f070"
msgid ""
"*Missing children: Maggie Terrens, Marcus Terrens, Mathen Deetch, Rochelle "
"Kirk*"
msgstr "*실종된 아이들: 매기 테렌스, 마커스 테렌스, 마센 디치, 로셸 커크*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_WeakBridge_AD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 218798b0-bd70-0471-7680-252cebdae9eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_WeakBridge_State_Checkmade = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_WeakBridge_AD:218798b0-bd70-0471-7680-252cebdae9eb
msgctxt "h4895766egb5f6g4901g9cf9g1b040f0f6aad"
msgid "This trunk's rotten; shouldn't put too much weight on it."
msgstr "이 나무는 밑동이 썩었으니 무게를 너무 싣지 말아야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_WeakBridge_AD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fffce9b8-ae24-9bdb-106d-44ddc6517724
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_WeakBridge_AD:fffce9b8-ae24-9bdb-106d-44ddc6517724
msgctxt "hd4f99a53g3872g4495ga54agaec8e65813cc"
msgid "Seems like nature's provided a shortcut."
msgstr "자연이 지름길을 만들어 줬는걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_WeakBridge_AD_Crack
#. Speaker = UNKNOWN_CHARACTER
#. NodeID = ae19803b-cdfe-eac7-a517-a20071403a1e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/FOR_WeakBridge_AD_Crack:ae19803b-cdfe-eac7-a517-a20071403a1e
msgctxt "hf38dc068gf8efg4f6fg9a85gd880fd806afc"
msgid "*crack*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 028153d3-d072-4df6-b00f-01f1f5a76166
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - c80921ea-9175-b8e6-7678-581273a63310_MindHasBeenRead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:028153d3-d072-4df6-b00f-01f1f5a76166
msgctxt "h822e5199g30eag4379gb958g6dfa15cdb075"
msgid "I'm here to see Fezzerk."
msgstr "페제르크를 보러 왔어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = GROUP_FOR_VillageGoblins
#. NodeID = 0471b305-3744-4f9c-a0dd-f2e3017e208c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - c80921ea-9175-b8e6-7678-581273a63310_MindHasBeenRead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:0471b305-3744-4f9c-a0dd-f2e3017e208c
msgctxt "hceccb576g1a8bg4b77g902ag2f5b60fccb43"
msgid ""
"<i>'S bollocks, Fezzerk funnin' around while I'm stuck dealin' with yobs.</i>"
msgstr "<i>제기랄, 페제르크는 놀기 바쁜데 난 여기서 풋내기들을 상대하고 있어야 한다니.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 051c6f7b-bb1b-6abe-1c83-0349fb75c4ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:051c6f7b-bb1b-6abe-1c83-0349fb75c4ca
msgctxt "he4a73384g90e8g459bg9e84g180735b2782b"
msgid "<i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = GROUP_FOR_VillageGoblins
#. NodeID = 053c2faa-8597-44dc-be25-e30228799a3d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_GoblinAmbush_GoblinsPacified = True
#.     - FOR_GoblinAmbush_State_NonCharlatanAccess = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:053c2faa-8597-44dc-be25-e30228799a3d
msgctxt "h2e336e0eg6f94g4407gb315g3ca7b419fffe"
msgid "Gah! Yes. Yes, <i>True Soul.</i>"
msgstr "끄악! 네. 네, <i>참된 영혼이시여.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = GROUP_FOR_VillageGoblins
#. NodeID = 0862b207-6849-6e9c-8586-48b680a801fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:0862b207-6849-6e9c-8586-48b680a801fa
msgctxt "h6a2e8d64g967dg45f3gb68dg8b47ed0b5b0c"
msgid "Eh. Nah!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0a372354-0145-4336-ad49-0717f8b7229e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:0a372354-0145-4336-ad49-0717f8b7229e
msgctxt "hcc925c9fg7093g461cg9a3dge898fcb8bec1"
msgid ""
"*The mark glows, but you feel nothing in response. Your illithid power is "
"beyond reach until you rest.*"
msgstr "*문양이 빛나지만, 어떤 반응도 느껴지지 않습니다. 일리시드 능력을 더 사용하려면 휴식을 취해야 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 12136c95-b09a-4656-a7c0-70f0cc323dce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount3(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount3(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:12136c95-b09a-4656-a7c0-70f0cc323dce
msgctxt "hd8150746g4e68g4fd1ga4a9g44b8313e2d7c"
msgid "*Your mind lurches, reeling suddenly as if... bitten.*"
msgstr "*뭔가에 깨물린 것처럼 느닷없이 정신이 휘청거립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 14fa8266-1931-4d37-8b21-5437c1955bdc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount2(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount2(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:14fa8266-1931-4d37-8b21-5437c1955bdc
msgctxt "h0ed6256bg2009g425agbc76gada13d7d4cdb"
msgid ""
"*Something stirs deep within you, hungry and alert... it's taking something "
"you'll never get back.*"
msgstr "*몸 깊숙한 데서 굶주리고 기민한 존재가 꿈틀댑니다... 잃으면 되찾지 못할 뭔가를 좀먹고 있군요.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = GROUP_FOR_VillageGoblins
#. NodeID = 16cfed0b-48bf-28d1-1c32-7a753c079f1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_GoblinAmbush_GoblinsPacified = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:16cfed0b-48bf-28d1-1c32-7a753c079f1f
msgctxt "hedb6c651g9324g46daga156gde447b13db54"
msgid "Go on - lads were gathered near the windmill last I looked."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 176bba89-1f7b-ded9-6ab0-ad0c71409681
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:176bba89-1f7b-ded9-6ab0-ad0c71409681
msgctxt "h4215841agfe21g4a4cg9406g90b02ee7ce33"
msgid "Perhaps I will take something from you. Suggestions?"
msgstr "나도 네 무언가를 가져가야 할 것 같은데. 어디가 좋을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1f2293b6-0495-ebb8-041a-1700c54408a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = True
#. TagRule: BERSERKER
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:1f2293b6-0495-ebb8-041a-1700c54408a2
msgctxt "hb8568537g1927g4b3ag99d1g572b834a29cd"
msgid "<b>ARE YOU READY TO DIE?</b>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1f2293b6-0495-ebb8-041a-1700c54408a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:1f2293b6-0495-ebb8-041a-1700c54408a2
msgctxt "hced4544eg7ea5g4f36g9eedgc36f69db3784"
msgid "You keen on dying? <b>Happy to help.</b>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1fd0767e-1843-4616-bc5d-441e6e3a8eb5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:1fd0767e-1843-4616-bc5d-441e6e3a8eb5
msgctxt "h83c22f4ege915g4340gb489ga1392a18c089"
msgid "Let's try again, shall we? Address me <i>properly.</i>"
msgstr "다시 해볼까? 내게 <i>예의를 갖춰라.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 283be5cd-08ae-4ba9-80e8-3fdcb6ed92d4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 0
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - c80921ea-9175-b8e6-7678-581273a63310_MindHasBeenRead = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CanDetectThoughts_2 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:283be5cd-08ae-4ba9-80e8-3fdcb6ed92d4
msgctxt "h602450eeg9d4fg4bb9g872cg06e9401c39b8"
msgid "<i>Probe the goblin's thoughts.</i>"
msgstr "<i>고블린의 머릿속을 살펴본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = GROUP_FOR_VillageGoblins
#. NodeID = 2c1e40a7-4752-db3a-ecca-f15a7965cdcc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_GoblinAmbush_GoblinsPacified = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:2c1e40a7-4752-db3a-ecca-f15a7965cdcc
msgctxt "hcceb0544g12b6g4684gbc51g27bc39f5d03b"
msgid ""
"Ah, go on, ain't bothered muckin' my blade with ya. But mind your manners."
msgstr "아, 지나가, 너 같은 놈이랑 낭비할 시간은 없어. 하지만 그 태도는 조심하라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = GROUP_FOR_VillageGoblins
#. NodeID = 3060a265-03bb-4e8d-8413-3523f7467eed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:3060a265-03bb-4e8d-8413-3523f7467eed
msgctxt "h6b20f726g12a3g4987g8d8egf7359e3a4ea8"
msgid "Gonna <i>dress</i> you in your own innards - how's that?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = GROUP_FOR_VillageGoblins
#. NodeID = 5baca660-91ba-4fc5-a41d-5c4672dbb4aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_GoblinAmbush_GoblinsPacified = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:5baca660-91ba-4fc5-a41d-5c4672dbb4aa
msgctxt "h786de1fege502g45eega0f6g871b9fc6772e"
msgid ""
"That a fact? He's at the windmill, muckin' about. Wouldn't stray again, if I "
"were you."
msgstr "그래? 그 녀석은 풍차 쪽에서 시간을 보내고 있어. 다신 길을 잃지 않는 게 좋을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = GROUP_FOR_VillageGoblins
#. NodeID = 5c9f4437-2671-46a7-ddf1-7fc8b71c3dbe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:5c9f4437-2671-46a7-ddf1-7fc8b71c3dbe
msgctxt "h8ec8b97cgdec0g4fd2g8650g3e00a176f77d"
msgid "Aye, well. Might be you should've, yeah?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = GROUP_FOR_VillageGoblins
#. NodeID = 69c63acd-fbce-35f6-0265-16f7c56e560d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DROWELF(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:69c63acd-fbce-35f6-0265-16f7c56e560d
msgctxt "h0e56a61fg5c68g47d2g9455gf1e8c0a73784"
msgid "You sent from Moonrise, drow? 'Cos otherwise, I'll have to cut ya."
msgstr "문라이즈에서 보냈나, 드로우? 아니면 널 베어야 하거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = GROUP_FOR_VillageGoblins
#. NodeID = 6b757ca4-c1be-110b-be70-96c3db9b738b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_GoblinAmbush_GoblinsPacified = True
#.     - FOR_GoblinAmbush_State_NonCharlatanAccess = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:6b757ca4-c1be-110b-be70-96c3db9b738b
msgctxt "he40f0606g0b3ag49e0gafc6g83a0b0671935"
msgid "Fair enough."
msgstr "알겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = GROUP_FOR_VillageGoblins
#. NodeID = 6f562e71-cf9a-e748-4ebb-7437ebd656b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:6f562e71-cf9a-e748-4ebb-7437ebd656b5
msgctxt "h0fe747a4g1e4dg4a5agab5cgfaa0dacb56a6"
msgid ""
"<i>Bloody boohyahg </i>- ha! Someone's got there first. And you ain't "
"learned your lesson?"
msgstr "<i>지랄맞은 부야그</i>. 하! 보아하니 코는 이미 누가 잘라갔군. 교훈을 못 배운 거냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 73a85ecd-747c-408d-8c70-a84d3f7a746e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount6(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount6(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:73a85ecd-747c-408d-8c70-a84d3f7a746e
msgctxt "h9447fa6ag9a4eg4e36ga58cg8ddd5554360a"
msgid ""
"*The presence deep in your mind is awake, unblinking. This is it. A single "
"word pervades your consciousness: 'Soon'.*"
msgstr ""
"*당신의 정신 속 깊이 자리잡은 존재가 태연스레 깨어납니다. 올 것이 왔군요. 한 단어가 당신의 의식 속으로 스며듭니다. ‘곧’*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = GROUP_FOR_VillageGoblins
#. NodeID = 74cf77d1-3a94-4107-8bc1-a7f80cdce4ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:74cf77d1-3a94-4107-8bc1-a7f80cdce4ba
msgctxt "hd74926ebg033bg486bga466ga56af646dce8"
msgid "Stop that - gerrout of my head!"
msgstr "멈춰, 내 머릿속에서 나과!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = GROUP_FOR_VillageGoblins
#. NodeID = 7603a54e-63f1-f931-0c93-1c284df57b2e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:7603a54e-63f1-f931-0c93-1c284df57b2e
msgctxt "hc5caa79cg6162g4115g8ef0g8b85a27acefa"
msgid "Eh? Then you got business needs seeing to, don't ya? "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = GROUP_FOR_VillageGoblins
#. NodeID = 82ec1890-b0db-9aff-59d0-673d410207e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_GoblinAmbush_GoblinsPacified = True
#.     - FOR_GoblinAmbush_State_NonCharlatanAccess = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:82ec1890-b0db-9aff-59d0-673d410207e2
msgctxt "h85a1e418gfcb1g486egab05ga5aa43656492"
msgid ""
"... all you'd best take is this warning, yeah? Step lightly around here - "
"you're outnumbered."
msgstr "... 넌 경고나 받아가라고, 알았어? 여기선 조심해라. 우리 수가 훨씬 많으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8cfcde25-27a5-47e8-a53a-891777579d62
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:8cfcde25-27a5-47e8-a53a-891777579d62
msgctxt "hffae2b25g7758g4b71g8d3cg86aed14bdd03"
msgid "What? The guard let me pass."
msgstr "뭐? 경비가 날 보내주던데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9787ff17-5315-49eb-becc-fba838e30a22
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.     - TRUESOUL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:9787ff17-5315-49eb-becc-fba838e30a22
msgctxt "h39354861ge0fdg4df9gafeegdb9e634a262c"
msgid ""
"*Your mind is full, bursting with ecstasy and terror. Finally, it is coming. "
"You are becoming.*"
msgstr "*당신의 정신이 황홀경과 공포로 가득 차오릅니다. 마침내, 때가 됐군요. 당신은 변화 중입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a036c891-47b9-4921-a901-2a95f5601e12
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#.      - ILLITHID(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:a036c891-47b9-4921-a901-2a95f5601e12
msgctxt "he1d40ce7g639fg49bbg98ecg5cc0cb2fb924"
msgid "Let's try again, shall we? Address me <i>properly.</i>"
msgstr "다시 해볼까? 내게 <i>예의를 갖춰라.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a7e7c7a4-2294-4dcc-b7ec-5c5668348e97
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - GLO_TadpoleIntro_NPC(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - GLO_TadpoleIntro_NPC(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:a7e7c7a4-2294-4dcc-b7ec-5c5668348e97
msgctxt "h21f8f2abg340ag493bga6cag2ea59e4ced57"
msgid ""
"*A strange symbol glows, marked on their flesh, and something within you "
"stirs in response.*"
msgstr "*그들의 살갗에 새겨진 기묘한 상징이 빛나고, 이에 반응하여 당신 내면의 무언가가 꿈틀거립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = GROUP_FOR_VillageGoblins
#. NodeID = a915336e-b497-7cc8-ee26-56b38592d500
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:a915336e-b497-7cc8-ee26-56b38592d500
msgctxt "hc78d3e8fg7d12g436fgb5f9g788350f9d78f"
msgid ""
"You sniffing where you ain't oughta be, friend. Might have to take that nose."
msgstr "냄새 맡지 말아야 할 곳에서 어슬렁거리고 있군, 친구. 그 코를 가져가야 할지도 몰라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c0b6b28b-1de6-4851-9b14-a700955815be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - GLO_TadpoleIntro_NPC(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:c0b6b28b-1de6-4851-9b14-a700955815be
msgctxt "hfd7b2209g999bg4c89gb0d9g39c54d43e871"
msgid "*As the symbol glows, power courses through you. <i>Authority</i>.*"
msgstr "*문양이 빛나며, 몸에 흐르는 힘이 느껴집니다. <i>권위</i>.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c254dbb3-7e02-47aa-926f-2878fe38819d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount4(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount4(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:c254dbb3-7e02-47aa-926f-2878fe38819d
msgctxt "h0112d0e6g0271g486dg9770g9d624c5102fa"
msgid ""
"*A shadow swims across your vision, and a familiar voice tells you to be "
"calm. You are loved.*"
msgstr "*그림자가 낀 듯이 눈앞이 흐려지더니, 익숙한 목소리가 당신을 달래줍니다. 사랑이 느껴집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c943d585-4e86-4ad6-9bd9-1e62c382c891
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount1(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:c943d585-4e86-4ad6-9bd9-1e62c382c891
msgctxt "hfc4f13a7gdfe1g413cg9bbegfecc07ce481c"
msgid "*A shiver runs across your mind... You feel sated.*"
msgstr "*전율이 불현듯 머릿속을 스쳐 지나가고... 만족감이 듭니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = GROUP_FOR_VillageGoblins
#. NodeID = ce6df7e7-bb8f-d416-ee4a-f0acd14d8c97
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - FOR_GoblinAmbush_GoblinsPacified = True
#.     - FOR_GoblinAmbush_State_DrowAutoPass = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:ce6df7e7-bb8f-d416-ee4a-f0acd14d8c97
msgctxt "h1e2fcfc4gf88bg426eg9c70g3b53c0bb8a19"
msgid "Just doing me job, boss. You're free to go your way."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d20003de-b864-a978-140a-d170fd4a7dae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:d20003de-b864-a978-140a-d170fd4a7dae
msgctxt "hef2c57c3gb06dg4bedg9155ga794606dde81"
msgid ""
"I bypassed your guards. If I meant you harm, I could've just killed you all."
msgstr "난 너희 경비들을 지나왔다. 내가 널 해치고 싶었다면, 다 죽여버렸을 수도 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e15c7fc3-9b27-4aaf-8d2f-d3b3a53837d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount5(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount5(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:e15c7fc3-9b27-4aaf-8d2f-d3b3a53837d9
msgctxt "hf4ea248ag2530g4716gb85eg862beefe7469"
msgid ""
"*Your blood runs quicker, feeding the gnawing absence at the centre of your "
"mind.*"
msgstr "*피가 더 빨리 흐르면서, 당신의 정신 한가운데를 좀먹는 허전함을 양분으로 채웁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e463a488-fb44-b487-65ec-fcfd646ee846
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Absolute_Knows_MoonriseTowers = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - DROWELF(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:e463a488-fb44-b487-65ec-fcfd646ee846
msgctxt "h2af2c2d8g6faeg4dc8gaae7g71df3af46a58"
msgid "Am I to explain myself to every slug that crosses my path?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = GROUP_FOR_VillageGoblins
#. NodeID = ed196916-c3e2-54bc-dd37-828c428c5fae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:ed196916-c3e2-54bc-dd37-828c428c5fae
msgctxt "h47e6af4cg5de4g4788gaceag996313443182"
msgid "Well now - gonna have to take that lying tongue from ya!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = GROUP_FOR_VillageGoblins
#. NodeID = f0ea14b0-d89a-4f21-abdd-75d0c194ad18
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:f0ea14b0-d89a-4f21-abdd-75d0c194ad18
msgctxt "hb70770f0gc0d4g4c94g97e0g2e6ef9c81c14"
msgid "Don't - don't let me keep ya, boss. Lads were gathered by the windmill."
msgstr "제 - 제가 당신을 지키게 하지 말아주세요, 대장. 애들은 풍차 근처에 모여 있습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing
#. Speaker = GROUP_FOR_VillageGoblins
#. NodeID = f2180b5d-0523-db15-c3c5-80a1b62d1b3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Forest/NGB_FOR_Village_Trespassing:f2180b5d-0523-db15-c3c5-80a1b62d1b3b
msgctxt "h81fec637ga7dag49d4g9a97gd7a09eeee58f"
msgid "<i>Ohoho</i>. Let's get to it and see what shakes loose, pretty."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/GOB/GEB_GOB_WolfPens_AD_WorgOutsideCage
#. Speaker = Ferr
#. NodeID = aa472ea0-f364-4343-9d21-2e4535f5b705
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/GOB/GEB_GOB_WolfPens_AD_WorgOutsideCage:aa472ea0-f364-4343-9d21-2e4535f5b705
msgctxt "hb90e9146gcb71g44d0gab95g05dad6f198ed"
msgid "*ROAR!*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/GOB/GEB_GOB_WolfPens_AD_WorgOutsideCage
#. Speaker = Ferr
#. NodeID = aa472ea0-f364-4343-9d21-2e4535f5b705
