#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/GOB/GOB_Halsin_PAD_EnteringGoblinCamp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 46e4ce19-d06d-42e9-a083-e583b8d2cb6d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/GOB/GOB_Halsin_PAD_EnteringGoblinCamp:46e4ce19-d06d-42e9-a083-e583b8d2cb6d
msgctxt "ha1a7b36fg9662g4d60g90dbg09b0df5998c7"
msgid ""
"We've got the matter well in hand. And if we make too big a splash, well... "
"goblins are used to a ruckus or two."
msgstr ""
"우리 손으로 잘 처리할 수 있잖아. 그리고 우리가 너무 큰 소동을 일으켜도, 글쎄... 고블린들은 소란 한둘쯤에는 익숙해져 있을걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/GOB/GOB_Halsin_PAD_EnteringGoblinCamp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 46e4ce19-d06d-42e9-a083-e583b8d2cb6d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/GOB/GOB_Halsin_PAD_EnteringGoblinCamp:46e4ce19-d06d-42e9-a083-e583b8d2cb6d
msgctxt "hf6723a60g0408g4979g8aa9g78e97f75f387"
msgid "The longer we are here, the more suspicion we will draw."
msgstr "이곳에 오래 머무를수록, 더 의심을 사게 될 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/GOB/GOB_Halsin_PAD_EnteringGoblinCamp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 46e4ce19-d06d-42e9-a083-e583b8d2cb6d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/GOB/GOB_Halsin_PAD_EnteringGoblinCamp:46e4ce19-d06d-42e9-a083-e583b8d2cb6d
msgctxt "h2bd444b8g38c9g4547g8c9aga03a1270e9aa"
msgid ""
"Finding him is one thing - getting him out safely is something else entirely."
msgstr "그를 찾는 거랑, 안전히 빼내는 일은 전혀 다른 일이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/GOB/GOB_Halsin_PAD_EnteringGoblinCamp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 46e4ce19-d06d-42e9-a083-e583b8d2cb6d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/GOB/GOB_Halsin_PAD_EnteringGoblinCamp:46e4ce19-d06d-42e9-a083-e583b8d2cb6d
msgctxt "hd9e921a9g0330g4f14gbfa1g6e9f41d56016"
msgid ""
"Let's keep an eye out - and hope he's still drawing breath when we find him."
msgstr "잘 찾아보자, 그리고 우리가 그를 찾았을 때, 아직 살아있기를 바라자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/GOB/GOB_Halsin_PAD_EnteringGoblinCamp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 46e4ce19-d06d-42e9-a083-e583b8d2cb6d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/GOB/GOB_Halsin_PAD_EnteringGoblinCamp:46e4ce19-d06d-42e9-a083-e583b8d2cb6d
msgctxt "hbd4ff95ag9a65g4f34g8a38g6367768af5f8"
msgid "We'll manage - but first we need to find him."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/GOB/GOB_Halsin_PAD_EnteringGoblinCamp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 46e4ce19-d06d-42e9-a083-e583b8d2cb6d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/GOB/GOB_Halsin_PAD_EnteringGoblinCamp:46e4ce19-d06d-42e9-a083-e583b8d2cb6d
msgctxt "h70155deeg6eedg4e3bgb0ccg8f36ed12e692"
msgid ""
"We should make haste. This place is making me feel stupider by the second. I "
"mean,<i> more stupid</i>."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/GOB/GOB_Halsin_PAD_EnteringGoblinCamp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 46e4ce19-d06d-42e9-a083-e583b8d2cb6d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/GOB/GOB_Halsin_PAD_EnteringGoblinCamp:46e4ce19-d06d-42e9-a083-e583b8d2cb6d
msgctxt "h766c380fg486bg455fg8067g4d8614791e8f"
msgid "Let's hope we find him in one piece."
msgstr "그가 무사히 발견되길 바라자구."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/GOB/GOB_Halsin_PAD_EnteringGoblinCamp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6dbc10aa-7ba2-49a9-9e5b-f91b304394df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
