msgctxt "h84d1bbf6g6d90g4823ga0b6g4aca2111e7b3"
msgid "The Dead Gods only know where these roaches stowed Halsin."
msgstr "이 바퀴벌레들이 할신을 어디에 숨겼는지는 이 죽은 신들만이 알겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/GOB/GOB_Halsin_PAD_EnteringGoblinCamp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6dbc10aa-7ba2-49a9-9e5b-f91b304394df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/GOB/GOB_Halsin_PAD_EnteringGoblinCamp:6dbc10aa-7ba2-49a9-9e5b-f91b304394df
msgctxt "h90595eb3g23ecg442egbce8gd87d8e1c071d"
msgid ""
"We have to sneak the druid out of this? It's a veritable plague of goblins."
msgstr "여기서 드루이드를 몰래 빼내야 한다고? 진정한 고블린의 재앙이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/GOB/GOB_Halsin_PAD_EnteringGoblinCamp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6dbc10aa-7ba2-49a9-9e5b-f91b304394df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
