#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/ADs/GOB_Bravado_AD
#. Speaker = Warrior Plagg
#. NodeID = 1f567f0a-77a0-bbd0-cf35-011f1a3d8fc7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 2868e4b7-b0b6-01a4-2b78-101a494986c1_Repeat = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 2868e4b7-b0b6-01a4-2b78-101a494986c1_Repeat = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/ADs/GOB_Bravado_AD:1f567f0a-77a0-bbd0-cf35-011f1a3d8fc7
msgctxt "h182dd2c9ge32cg4f34g93e2g0ccbdd2279d6"
msgid ""
"We got the Absolute's might on our side. Someone speaks against her, jus' "
"stick 'em like a pig!"
msgstr "우리에겐 절대자님이 있다. 그분한테 말조심 안 하는 놈은 돼지처럼 꿰뚫어버리자고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/ADs/GOB_Bravado_AD
#. Speaker = Sharp-Eye Crub
#. NodeID = 1fd8519e-109f-94a9-8a7a-eb5772ba06c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/ADs/GOB_Bravado_AD:1fd8519e-109f-94a9-8a7a-eb5772ba06c6
msgctxt "h61a03cfcge10fg4d52gac56g958c7f04056b"
msgid "Hold on. What in the ruddy hells is an ax-pershin?"
msgstr "잠깐만. 비낭이란 게 대체 뭐 하는 건데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/ADs/GOB_Bravado_AD
#. Speaker = Tracker Nik-Nuk
#. NodeID = 39fa0ea5-15bf-6b5c-4b0e-14abde610433
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/ADs/GOB_Bravado_AD:39fa0ea5-15bf-6b5c-4b0e-14abde610433
msgctxt "hc44c012age1acg4e95gbd4dgb7a4c41bf804"
msgid ""
"With that kind of slander, I'll slice off their fingers and fry 'em for "
"supper."
msgstr "그런 짓을 내가 보면, 손가락을 죄다 잘라서 튀겨먹을 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/ADs/GOB_Bravado_AD
#. Speaker = Tracker Nik-Nuk
#. NodeID = 6ea3acc5-c7b0-2b99-170e-20e3f96fc41e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 2868e4b7-b0b6-01a4-2b78-101a494986c1_Repeat = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 2868e4b7-b0b6-01a4-2b78-101a494986c1_Repeat = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/ADs/GOB_Bravado_AD:6ea3acc5-c7b0-2b99-170e-20e3f96fc41e
msgctxt "hadd9740cg0380g41c2gb50dgade830ee2238"
msgid ""
"I hear any one of you's castin' ax-pershins on the Absolute, I'll tear out "
"your tongue and cram it up your faithless arse."
msgstr "너희 중 누구라도 절대자님께 비낭을 지껄였다간, 내가 그 혀를 뽑아서 궁둥이에 쑤셔넣을 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/ADs/GOB_Bravado_AD
#. Speaker = Tracker Nik-Nuk
#. NodeID = 806d00dc-eca5-0163-04af-cbb0ee0c9eeb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/ADs/GOB_Bravado_AD:806d00dc-eca5-0163-04af-cbb0ee0c9eeb
msgctxt "hd04ce436gaeb2g4d40g8435g29e12fb80072"
msgid ""
"It's like 'libel'. As in, 'I'm libel to smash your face if you go castin' ax-"
"pershins.'"
msgstr "그건 '견향'이랑 비슷한 거야. '비낭을 지껄이고 다니면 얼굴이 짓뭉개지는 견향이 있음'."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/ADs/GOB_Bravado_AD
#. Speaker = Sharp-Eye Crub
#. NodeID = d950d01d-660d-3e7a-d49f-e85c80a3384f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/ADs/GOB_Bravado_AD:d950d01d-660d-3e7a-d49f-e85c80a3384f
msgctxt "ha7a008cdg22edg4e3eg9c11g275b1788c708"
msgid "Mm. I jus' love a good finger-fry."
msgstr "음. 내가 손가락 튀김이라면 사족을 못 쓰지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/ADs/GOB_Bravado_AD
#. Speaker = Warrior Plagg
#. NodeID = fd33a587-2cd1-0257-6c8e-fe3a177011e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/ADs/GOB_Bravado_AD:fd33a587-2cd1-0257-6c8e-fe3a177011e5
msgctxt "h2222c541g66e9g46bdg9c24gbd6cd60bfa7a"
msgid ""
"Hands off my tongue, you bloody berk. I'm pledged to the Absolute, arse and "
"all."
msgstr "어딜 건드리려고, 이 망할 머저리야. 난 절대자님께 혀도 궁둥이도 충성한다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/ADs/GOB_Checkpoint_AD_AlarmUsedReaction_Guard_001
