msgid "You hit the alarm, didn't ya? Who we after?"
msgstr "네가 알람을 울렸지, 그렇지? 우리 뒤에 누가 있었어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/ADs/GOB_Checkpoint_AD_BackupArrivedToParty
