msgctxt "h83ba5bbdgf98cg42eegb72cge34bf114718c"
msgid ""
"See what happens when you <i>really</i> need help, ye nasty <i>ghukraks.</i>"
msgstr "<i>정말로</i> 도움이 필요할 때 무슨 일이 일어나는지 봐라, 이 추잡한 <i>ghukraks.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/ADs/GOB_Checkpoint_AD_BackupArrivedToParty
