msgctxt "hc3042838gbb24g4f21gacf3ge0ca59e0a118"
msgid "Join me. The Absolute demands blood."
msgstr "나와 함께해라. 절대자님은 피를 원하신다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/ADs/GOB_DrowCommander_AD_DrowLeavingReady
