msgstr "그 무엇도 우리를 막을 수 없다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/ADs/GOB_DrowCommander_AD_WaitingHefty
#. Speaker = Sharp-Eye Zami
#. NodeID = 8044edbb-78b1-991e-b504-0e5581d9cb28
