msgid "You was brilliant in the raid, lads. Beautiful stuff!"
msgstr "지난 습격에서는 대단했다, 이 놈들아. 멋있었어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/ADs/GOB_Festivities_AD_Table4
