#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hc3f9a901g391fg48dfga4d9gc56b3f11776d"
msgid "How many did you have? Five? That's nothin'."
msgstr "몇 개나 갖고 있었어? 다섯 개? 그건 아무것도 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/ADs/GOB_Festivities_AD_TakeRefill_001
#. Speaker = Warrior Sul
#. NodeID = ac7f544f-93b7-2331-81e1-39f8c83ffecd
