#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_CGB_Torturers_Spike_MurderCustom
#. Speaker = Torturer Spike
#. NodeID = 031c42a5-b610-3a9d-5d05-7745a32b02dd
