msgctxt "hca795807g9b6dg4691g89a4gaa0ffba9b2e5"
msgid ""
"She'll kill me. This is it. This is the end... but oh, I'll make you pay "
"before I die."
msgstr "그녀가 날 죽이겠군. 확실해. 모두 끝장이야... 오, 하지만 죽기 전에 네놈에게 갚아줄 게 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_CGB_Torturers_Spike_MurderCustom
#. Speaker = Torturer Spike
#. NodeID = 6d2ca4fb-c185-cefb-53d0-8714f809694e
