msgctxt "h6e05a60bg5deag495bgbd06gc18d553b39b1"
msgid ""
"No! I wanted him to suffer! N-not that you killed him too easily, your "
"drowness. I meant no offence."
msgstr "안 돼! 놈이 고통받길 원했는데! 네 지루함 때문에 놈을 너-너무 쉽게 죽여버렸잖아. 악의는 없었어."

