msgctxt "h574a03a9gbc4bg4495gbdd2gd9b8bbc33b05"
msgid "Oh look - backup's on its way. Again."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_AlarmUsedReaction
#. Speaker = Sentinel Olak
#. NodeID = c8935dde-170c-670a-147f-aa4b1092ef4a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_AlarmUsedReaction:c8935dde-170c-670a-147f-aa4b1092ef4a
msgctxt "h6c4d95d6g78fcg412ag8a7fg789c815282d8"
msgid "Backup's comin'. Reckon I'll tell 'em you were an intruder after all."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_AlarmUsedReaction
#. Speaker = Sentinel Olak
#. NodeID = c9470823-a527-50d0-c59c-90249dc87265
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_AlarmUsedReaction:c9470823-a527-50d0-c59c-90249dc87265
msgctxt "hf473bb75gd674g4a35g9645gee1af48b6bcc"
msgid "Sorry 'bout this, but rules is rules."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_AlarmUsedReaction
#. Speaker = Sentinel Olak
#. NodeID = cd864418-90b4-2e20-cf66-543030ce25a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_AlarmUsedReaction:cd864418-90b4-2e20-cf66-543030ce25a5
msgctxt "he0c0e842g03acg434fg89degcbeb0a3c8659"
msgid ""
"Lovely beat, that - course you warned half the camp there's killin' to be "
"done. Get 'em, lads!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_AlarmUsedReaction
#. Speaker = Sentinel Olak
#. NodeID = e6760699-45d3-dd32-c035-a594cf903cf0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_Checkpoint_State_PlayerRaisedAlarm = True
#.      - GOB_Checkpoint_State_PretendedToBeTrueSouls = True
#.      - GOB_Checkpoint_State_BackupAnnoyed = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_Checkpoint_State_UsedAlarmOnce = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_AlarmUsedReaction:e6760699-45d3-dd32-c035-a594cf903cf0
msgctxt "hbe52fe27gccfbg40b2g8840g0e0fd7ab6de5"
msgid ""
"Eh... beg pardon, True Soul, but that's the <i>alarm</i>. Not to worry, "
"though - I'll handle the lads."
msgstr "어... 참된 영혼이시여, 죄송하지만 방금 건 <i>경보입니다</i>. 걱정은 마시지요, 저 아그들은 제가 해결하겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_AlarmUsedReaction
#. Speaker = Sentinel Olak
#. NodeID = e71347fb-f9f0-4839-8d8b-ace6bb55ff3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_AlarmUsedReaction:e71347fb-f9f0-4839-8d8b-ace6bb55ff3b
msgctxt "h2f9ee740g0985g426dga03dgd2d5176fa567"
msgid "Reckon the lads'll stay put this time.\n"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_AlarmUsedReaction
#. Speaker = Sentinel Olak
#. NodeID = ee7bb6f8-2963-85f5-4cfd-beedbe83757a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_Checkpoint_State_UsedAlarmOnce = True
#.      - GOB_Checkpoint_State_PlayerRaisedAlarm = True
#.      - GOB_Checkpoint_State_PretendedToBeTrueSouls = True
#.      - GOB_Checkpoint_State_BackupAnnoyed = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_Checkpoint_State_BackupAnnoyed = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_AlarmUsedReaction:ee7bb6f8-2963-85f5-4cfd-beedbe83757a
msgctxt "h560b47e0g5399g40c8g9a8ag3b9dceec13e0"
msgid "Ah, nice one, True Soul. Keepin' the lads on their toes."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_AlarmUsedReaction
#. Speaker = Sentinel Olak
#. NodeID = efadf0b9-b06a-f58d-751b-9d1ef7dc22f8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_AlarmUsedReaction:efadf0b9-b06a-f58d-751b-9d1ef7dc22f8
msgctxt "hb1a6bc1dg9e84g4f7bg94f0g5ed138dca334"
msgid ""
"I'll calm 'em down, seein' as it was a lovely rhythm. But, erh, don't do it "
"again."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_AlarmUsedReaction
#. Speaker = Sentinel Olak
#. NodeID = f36bf4c0-55bd-9bdc-1210-aa57fba50563
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_Checkpoint_State_PlayerRaisedAlarm = True
#.      - GOB_Checkpoint_State_GainedAccess = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_AlarmUsedReaction:f36bf4c0-55bd-9bdc-1210-aa57fba50563
msgctxt "ha68daf7bg2a54g4e46ga775g16bf358e0e4c"
msgid "Who th -"
msgstr "대체 누가-"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_AlarmUsedReaction
#. Speaker = Sentinel Olak
#. NodeID = fc739522-6cd2-afe6-5311-d333b57fbbb4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_AlarmUsedReaction:fc739522-6cd2-afe6-5311-d333b57fbbb4
msgctxt "h4b021614gd710g43beg82cbg01e1b1528cfd"
msgid ""
"Not to worry! I'll set 'em straight. Bit of music never hurt anyone, eh?"
msgstr "걱정 마십쇼! 제가 처리하겠습니다. 약간의 음악은 나쁠 것 없지 않겠습니까, 예?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_AlarmVandalize_001
#. Speaker = Sentinel Olak
#. NodeID = 0957ffd0-eef2-419a-7a8c-926e9ec766ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_AlarmVandalize_001:0957ffd0-eef2-419a-7a8c-926e9ec766ca
msgctxt "h46c86507g27ffg46b1g8dd9gf97ccdc66a6d"
msgid "Might, eh... might be best if you left it alone. Beggin' pardon."
msgstr "아마도, 에... 아마 혼자 있게 두는 것이 가장 좋을지도 모르겠습니다. 용서해 주십시오."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_AlarmVandalize_001
#. Speaker = Sentinel Olak
#. NodeID = 1b079b89-7fa9-009c-d7fc-ff8c3e16dd56
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_AlarmVandalize_001:1b079b89-7fa9-009c-d7fc-ff8c3e16dd56
msgctxt "h89a05b66gcc1ag4d22g86a0gf8672ae99287"
msgid ""
"Ah... no worries, True Soul. If we need the lads we'll just... holler, I "
"s'pose."
msgstr "아... 걱정 마십시오, 참된 영혼이시여. 저희가 동료들을 필요로 할 때 그땐 저희가... 소리를 지르도록 하겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_AlarmVandalize_001
#. Speaker = Sentinel Olak
#. NodeID = 7f6dc72d-a871-6311-9919-ac02a2053451
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_Checkpoint_State_GainedAccess = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - TemporaryHostilityAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_AlarmVandalize_001:7f6dc72d-a871-6311-9919-ac02a2053451
msgctxt "h3f5916f1g0b7fg4ff7g84e1gfb982b3395b9"
msgid "Oi! What you doin' with the alarm?"
msgstr "어이! 경보기로 뭐하고 있냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_AlarmVandalize_001
#. Speaker = Sentinel Olak
#. NodeID = a04fb091-883e-e37b-b938-605da4545dab
