msgctxt "h294b07abg97e8g48c3gba5ag728fd8d0bf62"
msgid ""
"Drow flingin' magic, gnolls snappin' off heads. Inn's nothin' but a pile of "
"ash by now."
msgstr "드로우가 마법을 날리고, 놀이 머리를 물어뜯었지. 여관은 지금쯤 잿더미만 남았을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_Backup002
