#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hed89a909gc136g42b3g9f30gae54480b18f6"
msgid ""
"Take the north path. It winds ya 'round, sure as sunshine, 'til you reach "
"the Towers."
msgstr "북쪽 길을 따라가라. 탑에 도달할 때까지 그 길은 너를 따라 휘돌아갈 것이야. 햇빛처럼 확실하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_Backup002
