#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_Guard001:ad3922ea-ff5d-945c-888a-173c8d9be407
msgctxt "h7caae47cgc5f6g400cg89f6gf78142919c3f"
msgid ""
"*A strange symbol glows, marked on their flesh, and something within you "
"stirs in response.*"
msgstr "*그들의 살갗에 새겨진 기묘한 상징이 빛나고, 이에 반응하여 당신 내면의 무언가가 꿈틀거립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_Guard001
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = aec26f2a-12f7-4e89-b7b4-3e8f8a665b95
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount5(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount5(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_Guard001:aec26f2a-12f7-4e89-b7b4-3e8f8a665b95
msgctxt "h4bd01b59g8e64g4c91g8125g4d09c5622768"
msgid ""
"*Your blood runs quicker, feeding the gnawing absence at the centre of your "
"mind.*"
msgstr "*피가 더 빨리 흐르면서, 당신의 정신 한가운데를 좀먹는 허전함을 양분으로 채웁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_Guard001
#. Speaker = Sentinel Olak
#. NodeID = afcba3ca-bb0a-7f41-9824-d64cbd020910
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_Guard001:afcba3ca-bb0a-7f41-9824-d64cbd020910
msgctxt "h9f5b711dg25ddg4d94gbcd1g0ca87d9032f5"
msgid ""
"Hold it! You're not going anywhere. Not 'til you tell me why you're sniffin' "
"around."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_Guard001
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b03339a5-e72c-61b4-74b3-066ab9450994
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - GLO_TadpoleIntro_NPC(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_Guard001:b03339a5-e72c-61b4-74b3-066ab9450994
msgctxt "hc77fa126g4587g4876g9b46g21efc4ee9678"
msgid "*As the symbol glows, power courses through you. <i>Authority</i>.*"
msgstr "*문양이 빛나며, 몸에 흐르는 힘이 느껴집니다. <i>권위</i>.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_Guard001
#. Speaker = Sentinel Olak
#. NodeID = b2d525bc-ce8f-c1ba-2642-702e4adfa5ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_Guard001:b2d525bc-ce8f-c1ba-2642-702e4adfa5ad
msgctxt "h41684467g15c8g49b7gbc0bgc25caddc6049"
msgid "Goblin parties ain't for everyone... but I reckon you'll manage. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_Guard001
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = b7a3eb63-a996-c175-df21-1a512db254d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_Guard001:b7a3eb63-a996-c175-df21-1a512db254d6
msgctxt "h31229ab5g4d65g43d5gb565ge2f7302a87b7"
msgid ""
"Save the druid if you must. If we spill goblin blood on the way, all the "
"better."
msgstr "드루이드를 구하겠다면 좋을 대로 해라. 도중에 고블린 피를 뿌릴 수 있다면 더욱 좋겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_Guard001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b8e2c5cc-32a1-adca-bf89-3d5e93e8fa07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_Guard001:b8e2c5cc-32a1-adca-bf89-3d5e93e8fa07
msgctxt "h6a52a29bg7edcg4dc7g8267g90742ca44b0f"
msgid "Go on."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_Guard001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b9b3fa15-c811-5b7f-4975-6bcfc5720589
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Checkpoint_Guard_001_Drow_TellMeMore(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Checkpoint_Guard_001_Drow_TellMeMore(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_Guard001:b9b3fa15-c811-5b7f-4975-6bcfc5720589
msgctxt "hb504cf9eg7225g439dg902dg7112e198a3ce"
msgid "Tell me, what can I expect inside?"
msgstr "안에 들어가면 뭐가 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_Guard001
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = bbd8232f-3747-6245-56ef-b8542872209d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount3(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
