"Behave yourself. Saz's vouchin' for you. You mess up, you <i>and </i>Saz'll "
"get it.<i></i>"
msgstr "얌전하게 굴어. 사즈가 널 보증해 주고 있어. 네가 엉망을 만들면, 너와 <i>사즈</i>가 벌 받을 거야.<i></i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin
#. Speaker = Sentinel Olak
#. NodeID = 3f114a42-3e6a-ee03-8795-a4e4bd20c992
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_Checkpoint_State_GainedAccess = True
#.      - GOB_Checkpoint_State_PretendedToBeTrueSouls = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin:3f114a42-3e6a-ee03-8795-a4e4bd20c992
msgctxt "h671beae6g8d4ag4ea1g8473gf9a52af5c8bd"
msgid "I ain't gonna hold up a True Soul."
msgstr "참된 영혼을 붙잡아 둘 수야 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin
#. Speaker = Sentinel Olak
#. NodeID = 448516bc-0b30-fcd2-340c-30576324a743
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_Checkpoint_State_PretendedToBeTrueSouls = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Checkpoint_Guard01_HasMet(2) = True
#. TagRule: !DROWELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin:448516bc-0b30-fcd2-340c-30576324a743
msgctxt "h7298e855ga931g4fa5ga362g8ed82d535005"
msgid "Well! Look what the rat dragged in."
msgstr "이런! 이 쥐새끼 같은 년이 끌고 온 것 좀 보게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin
#. Speaker = Sentinel Olak
#. NodeID = 448516bc-0b30-fcd2-340c-30576324a743
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_Checkpoint_State_PretendedToBeTrueSouls = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Checkpoint_Guard01_HasMet(2) = True
#. TagRule: DROWELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin:448516bc-0b30-fcd2-340c-30576324a743
msgctxt "hd89e0dbbg6427g4bb8gb3cdg007d3d8fe8f2"
msgid ""
"Well! Look who's gettin' dragged back. And by such high company! How badly "
"did you mess up?"
msgstr "이런! 누가 끌려 왔는지 좀 보게. 이렇게 귀하신 일행 분께 말이야! 대체 얼마나 일을 좆같이 한 거냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5f8aade8-0552-8d56-30ae-8368ef0d040b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin:5f8aade8-0552-8d56-30ae-8368ef0d040b
msgctxt "h90d00019g858bg4c09g97f3g7bdc19172917"
msgid "<i>Shrug and say nothing.</i>"
msgstr "<i>무시하고 침묵한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 65d67dc6-45c1-996d-2361-9fa7524024de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin:65d67dc6-45c1-996d-2361-9fa7524024de
msgctxt "h70279326g4672g40c2g8abfg600cddc7fc59"
msgid ""
"I been in some druids' grove. This one sprang me. Now move over, so I can "
"tell Ragzlin myself!"
msgstr "난 드루이드의 숲에 갔다 왔어. 이 녀석이 탈출을 도와줬지. 내가 라그즐린 님에게 직접 말할 테니, 저리 비켜!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6c949381-4cf0-dfe0-0150-9e507d1e1cec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin:6c949381-4cf0-dfe0-0150-9e507d1e1cec
msgctxt "h43efc241g8448g4b48gabafgd801db45f6e7"
msgid "It was a daring escape. Slew thirteen druids bare-handed, Sazza and I."
msgstr "아주 대담한 탈출이었지. 삿자와 내가 맨손으로 드루이드 열세 명을 때려눕혔다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 7545dd9a-e97a-5423-58c2-a0c8951bf0a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin:7545dd9a-e97a-5423-58c2-a0c8951bf0a7
msgctxt "he0d3e73dgc721g4ad3g9b54g34c281306515"
msgid "Err... Yeah, that's right!"
msgstr "에... 맞아, 그랬지!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 7f6f4ca9-1b3a-6dee-5385-43a6ca66c5b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_Checkpoint_State_GainedAccess = True
#.     - GOB_Checkpoint_State_GuidedByCapturedGoblin = True
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_Checkpoint_Event_MoveToCamp(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin:7f6f4ca9-1b3a-6dee-5385-43a6ca66c5b3
msgctxt "h10e5cc10g902bg434cg8d97gc16e81a91428"
msgid ""
"C'mon! Gotta let the drow True Soul know where them looters is. We'll be "
"heroes!"
msgstr "서둘러! 그 참된 영혼 드로우에게 도둑놈들이 어디 있는지 알려야 해. 우린 영웅이 될 거야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 971f1852-ef4c-4685-08ca-67f495f1e957
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin:971f1852-ef4c-4685-08ca-67f495f1e957
msgctxt "h0c7aaeeag3716g4a37gad40g6dfbd469edd3"
msgid "I enjoy making new friends."
msgstr "새로운 친구를 사귀는 걸 즐기거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin
#. Speaker = Sentinel Olak
#. NodeID = 9ef9ce55-365b-32a2-e341-658f05a8fd69
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_DrowCommander_Knows_DrowLeader = True
#. TagRule: DROWELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin:9ef9ce55-365b-32a2-e341-658f05a8fd69
msgctxt "h3eda0b87g0114g49e7g9f49g8c2f1d10c038"
msgid "Ragzlin's other drow friend won't be happy to hear <i>that</i>."
msgstr "라그즐린 님의 다른 드로우 친구가 <i>그 소식</i>을 들으면 기뻐하지 않겠는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin
#. Speaker = Sentinel Olak
#. NodeID = 9ef9ce55-365b-32a2-e341-658f05a8fd69
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_DrowCommander_Knows_DrowLeader = True
