msgctxt "h54fb7748g43b0g4d94g8db8gee0e34106b83"
msgid "Ragzlin's drow friend won't be happy to hear <i>that</i>."
msgstr "라그즐린 님의 드로우 친구가 <i>그 소식</i>을 들으면 기뻐하지 않겠는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin
#. Speaker = Sentinel Olak
#. NodeID = 9f9d363e-b8ac-4f40-ef7d-bb596dd00bc3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin:9f9d363e-b8ac-4f40-ef7d-bb596dd00bc3
msgctxt "h242e466egb8e3g4eedgbf65g48301d0c42b4"
msgid "Yeah? What's that?"
msgstr "응? 그게 뭔데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin
#. Speaker = Sentinel Olak
#. NodeID = a59fa30d-7071-c796-d46f-e7ccf4b5ae9d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin:a59fa30d-7071-c796-d46f-e7ccf4b5ae9d
msgctxt "h842f8640gb5c0g4385g83f1g8e0604cb94df"
msgid "Hold on. Where are the raiders?"
msgstr "잠깐. 습격대는 어디 갔어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = a6d09170-be44-4a16-d0d1-7d5da9cb113b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_Checkpoint_State_GainedAccess = True
#.     - GOB_Checkpoint_State_GuidedByCapturedGoblin = True
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_Checkpoint_Event_MoveToCamp(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin:a6d09170-be44-4a16-d0d1-7d5da9cb113b
msgctxt "h64a531f9g0a72g4dddg8191gc9192538811c"
msgid "C'mon! Gotta let the drow know where them looters is. We'll be heroes!"
msgstr "서둘러! 그 드로우에게 도둑놈들이 어디 있는지 알려야 해. 우린 영웅이 될 거야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin
#. Speaker = Sentinel Olak
#. NodeID = b29508d9-7eec-32c8-e671-979995fc3079
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin:b29508d9-7eec-32c8-e671-979995fc3079
msgctxt "h9f55e0d4g95a8g4743g892dg976de0c17192"
msgid "Heh. Then behave while you're inside. Our people don't mind it one bit."
msgstr "헤. 그럼 안에서 잘 처신해. 우리 애들은 전혀 신경 쓰지 않으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin
#. Speaker = Sentinel Olak
#. NodeID = c43581b1-7a10-d35b-6a0d-82553520f02f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_Checkpoint_State_GainedAccess = True
#.      - GOB_Checkpoint_State_PretendedToBeTrueSouls = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin:c43581b1-7a10-d35b-6a0d-82553520f02f
msgctxt "h50ee23fag7046g47b9gbab5g6e00f653a9ce"
msgid ""
"Go on ahead. Already met your little friend. Two of you can go celebrate "
"together."
msgstr "얼른 가 봐. 네 작은 친구는 이미 낯짝을 비췄으니. 둘이 함께 축하연에 끼면 되겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = c5ddc1cf-22ea-6e68-69aa-b64017d144b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin:c5ddc1cf-22ea-6e68-69aa-b64017d144b3
msgctxt "h763519d5g9f4dg4f2egb394g6ab66db49b4a"
msgid "Dead. Every last one."
msgstr "죽었어. 마지막 한 놈까지도."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin
#. Speaker = Sentinel Olak
#. NodeID = cbb8d91b-3680-630c-764d-2dc3b5be34b6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin:cbb8d91b-3680-630c-764d-2dc3b5be34b6
msgctxt "h3fb7693eg723eg4540ga4fbge41b001a4aa8"
msgid "Is it true, what Saz says? You helped her escape that grove?"
msgstr "삿자 말이 사실이야? 이 녀석이 그 숲을 탈출하는 걸 네가 도와줬나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin
#. Speaker = Sentinel Olak
#. NodeID = d3aae7a1-9858-3bcc-4fd0-c5cc07a3e2a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin:d3aae7a1-9858-3bcc-4fd0-c5cc07a3e2a4
msgctxt "h1a42e998g3004g4033g9231g9d684cc45df3"
msgid "Hah! A <i>ranga</i> and Sazza killing druids? Pull the other one."
msgstr "하! <i>원숭이</i>와 삿자가 드루이드를 죽였다고? 말도 안 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin
#. Speaker = Sentinel Olak
#. NodeID = da23928f-1413-af14-c714-e9cdc5f304bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_Checkpoint_State_GainedAccess = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin:da23928f-1413-af14-c714-e9cdc5f304bc
msgctxt "h10adeb2dg5fcbg4a5dg92c2g621eb09d3810"
msgid "Hold on, now."
msgstr "잠시 기다려."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = dbce8523-0732-2d45-f05c-761fb03522fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_Checkpoint_Event_MoveToCamp(1) = True
