msgctxt "h1fd4d744g19acg45f0g8b5cg9748bf5a81b1"
msgid "C'mon! Gotta let the drow know where them looters is. We'll be heroes!"
msgstr "서둘러! 그 드로우에게 도둑놈들이 어디 있는지 알려야 해. 우린 영웅이 될 거야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin
#. Speaker = Sentinel Olak
#. NodeID = ddf2ef11-41e6-095f-a55c-2e3de26b6f5f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_Checkpoint_State_PretendedToBeTrueSouls = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Checkpoint_Guard01_HasMet(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin:ddf2ef11-41e6-095f-a55c-2e3de26b6f5f
msgctxt "h2a891490gab18g471fg9653g2091a6dfdc0b"
msgid "How'd a rat like you get in with a True Soul?"
msgstr "이 쥐새끼가 무슨 수로 참된 영혼을 끌어들였담?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = deab7496-bb67-aea2-0e3e-59a7c651148d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BESTIAL(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_ThreeWayDialogWithCapturedGoblin:deab7496-bb67-aea2-0e3e-59a7c651148d
msgctxt "h97345a9bgca19g4569gb7e2ga84f3bdc8657"
msgid "I'm only keeping her around in case I get hungry."
msgstr "배고플 때 한 끼 식량으로 삼을까 해서 데리고 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_TopCliffWarning
