msgctxt "hd84b46f6g846cg4588gaf7eg066bc7bd4328"
msgid "Go on, hop to! Ain't a one o' them I'd like to keep waiting."
msgstr "뭐해, 빨랑 뛰어! 어느 한 놈도 순순히 기다려 주진 않을 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_Trespassing
