#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_Trespassing:93fece57-30d7-9333-068f-11d2ac148071
msgctxt "h16d23d81g1488g43ebgb38bgea733cb32211"
msgid ""
"Then what you standin' <i>here</i> for? The True Souls're inside the temple!"
msgstr "그렇담 <i>뭣하러</i> 거기 멀뚱히 서 있는 거야? 참된 영혼들이 신전 안에 있다고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_Trespassing
#. Speaker = GROUP_GOB_Checkpoint_Guards
#. NodeID = 984bab2c-a6f3-aa9d-4159-14b877166a6f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
