#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_Trespassing:b6001091-49de-5544-3319-b431cbcfc6c2
msgctxt "h4fe1f090g2a22g4502gb78egdd8e4d6347be"
msgid ""
"*Your mind is full, bursting with ecstasy and terror. Finally, it is coming. "
"You are becoming.*"
msgstr "*당신의 정신이 황홀경과 공포로 가득 차오릅니다. 마침내, 때가 됐군요. 당신은 변화 중입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_Trespassing
#. Speaker = GROUP_GOB_Checkpoint_Guards
#. NodeID = b60b2ecf-8495-c8a6-6118-7f28b6214228
