#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount6(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_Trespassing:b7a8f37f-f5d6-c739-1aba-0006ac7bcbe9
msgctxt "ha611e97dg8e32g4151gb197g1093340efb11"
msgid ""
"*The presence deep in your mind is awake, unblinking. This is it. A single "
"word pervades your consciousness: 'Soon'.*"
msgstr ""
"*당신의 정신 속 깊이 자리잡은 존재가 태연스레 깨어납니다. 올 것이 왔군요. 한 단어가 당신의 의식 속으로 스며듭니다. ‘곧’*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Checkpoint_Trespassing
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = bdc56112-503e-47c8-4c09-7ab626d7b0ee
