msgid "*Squawk!*"
msgstr "*꼬꼬댁!*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Ball
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fcd878f9-435c-48c8-c712-c273a3066607
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Ball:fcd878f9-435c-48c8-c712-c273a3066607
msgctxt "h6024694bg96adg4779gb2e3g4f7b28fd32f2"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 0008cae2-13ab-bab4-4b9a-c7775e58a1ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:0008cae2-13ab-bab4-4b9a-c7775e58a1ee
msgctxt "heddbeff6g7648g4c3egb375ga3239586877f"
msgid ""
"First you ruin the game, then you start makin' <i>threats? </i>Right - lads!"
msgstr "경기를 망쳐놓고, 이제 와선 <i>협박을 해? </i>이봐, 얘들아!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 00c2f250-10f8-acc2-aab1-108bb329d2e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_GoblinToast_State_CrowdGathered = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:00c2f250-10f8-acc2-aab1-108bb329d2e0
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h73039ba9g3685g4c5bg922egc9e9729f2cd3"
msgid ""
"Business we can't be about 'til them fools are done with their speechin'."
msgstr "저 바보들이 말을 끝내기 전에는 시작할 수 없는 사업이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 00c54ca7-498b-c339-baf6-a78a64ade6ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GEN_TransferNPCPayment(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:00c54ca7-498b-c339-baf6-a78a64ade6ae
msgctxt "h07c3f8a0g7543g4d32gbfcdgf42b2eecc27b"
msgid ""
"Fine. Here's my bet. ([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-"
"be548b134c54])"
msgstr ""
"좋아. 이게 내 판돈이야. ([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-"
"be548b134c54])"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 00d9d24b-40e0-0d35-c708-0092b218905b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_AskedAboutOwlbear(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_OwlbearReplacedChicken = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_State_AskedAboutOwlbear(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:00d9d24b-40e0-0d35-c708-0092b218905b
msgctxt "h1c0a62cbgb9a4g4d60ga8afg943349b25911"
msgid "I have read of these 'chickens'. That beast looks more like an owlbear."
msgstr "저건 '닭'이 아니라 아울베어 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 00d9d24b-40e0-0d35-c708-0092b218905b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_AskedAboutOwlbear(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_OwlbearReplacedChicken = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_State_AskedAboutOwlbear(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:00d9d24b-40e0-0d35-c708-0092b218905b
msgctxt "h9b81472cgb8f6g466bgac8bgf1521e2d3ff7"
msgid "Well, for starters - that's no chicken. It's an owlbear."
msgstr "글쎄, 일단 저건 닭이 아니야. 아울베어지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 019cc5a2-2dce-c787-7cbc-c26da576859a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:019cc5a2-2dce-c787-7cbc-c26da576859a
msgctxt "hfada0068gbdeeg4199g85beg9de7dce7ff7c"
msgid ""
"You're gonna pay with somethin' else, you keep wastin' my time like this."
msgstr "계속 이렇게 내 시간을 낭비하면 돈 말고 다른 걸 지불해야 할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 02655910-c333-9379-d7c7-16ad27523f78
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:02655910-c333-9379-d7c7-16ad27523f78
msgctxt "hc83e2b40g0500g4ce8g9f5dg9b59df2b3932"
msgid "I'd be doing you a favour. Keeping such a large beast fed isn't easy."
msgstr "네게 득이 되는 일을 해 준 거야. 저렇게 큰 짐승을 계속 먹이는 건 쉽지 않으니까 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 06ca72df-f7dc-c530-b847-1290e581c5a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_State_PlayingChase = True
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_State_GameInProgress(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:06ca72df-f7dc-c530-b847-1290e581c5a7
msgctxt "h8d6eb3efgfcd4g4c25g8d80g8b2eca57222e"
msgid "All right then, 'ere we go!"
msgstr "그럼 좋아, 가자고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 0948464b-bbe0-0a2d-91d2-001e8128846f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_NoMoneyLeft = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:0948464b-bbe0-0a2d-91d2-001e8128846f
msgctxt "h356cb423gce13g427cg810dgf511df4bcbdd"
msgid ""
"No more chicken chasin'.  Seems like it's all about the money for <i>some</"
"i>, and I ain't got any to bet."
msgstr "이제 닭 몰이 게임은 중지다.  <i>한 놈</i>이 돈을 다 받아 가고 있는 것 같군, 남은 돈도 없고 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0ae92121-4e11-9eda-948e-954e409b250b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator_State_AfraidofDrow(1) = True
#. TagRule: DROWELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:0ae92121-4e11-9eda-948e-954e409b250b
msgctxt "h0fe8f140g4f7eg4ce1ga363ga1328ec2cc2f"
msgid ""
"Goblins know to keep a civil tongue in the Underdark. Granted, most of them "
"are slaves."
msgstr "고블린들은 언더다크에서 예의를 지키는 법을 알고 있지. 대부분이 노예니까 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 0b722bcd-784c-bb51-50a1-beadf1e96490
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:0b722bcd-784c-bb51-50a1-beadf1e96490
msgctxt "hb01bb855g11f8g4710ga587gcd2767f219bb"
msgid "That weren't even in question, mate."
msgstr "의문의 여지조차 없었어, 친구."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0bf39d3d-6cf8-dbd0-d19c-61ff55566b16
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_AskedAboutOwlbear(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_OwlbearReplacedChicken = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_State_AskedAboutOwlbear(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:0bf39d3d-6cf8-dbd0-d19c-61ff55566b16
msgctxt "h986b8589g2102g4318ga525gefa562fb2308"
msgid "You know that's an owlbear, right?"
msgstr "그거 아울베어인 건 알고 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0d1fc2e0-b64d-7ae7-d802-acb1de78e4b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. TagRule: DRUID or RANGER
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:0d1fc2e0-b64d-7ae7-d802-acb1de78e4b9
msgctxt "h9fd26282ga0d8g4c71g8fa5gd53aa1efdf84"
msgid ""
"I'd be doing you a favour. The beast will only get bigger - and "
"<i>tougher.</i>"
msgstr "널 위해 하는 일이야. 그 야수는 점점 더 커지고 <i>강해질 거라고.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 0df21312-45c4-5fbe-2a48-cdfad739b28a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_GoblinToast_State_CrowdGathered = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:0df21312-45c4-5fbe-2a48-cdfad739b28a
msgctxt "he50ff152ga111g4637ga832g4ad0a7d6beb0"
msgid ""
"They done yammerin' on yet? Ain't chicken-chasin' without a bloody crowd."
msgstr "아직 멀었나? 닭 몰이 게임에 망할 관중이 없으면 재미가 없잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 0ea61ae7-c3c3-d2b4-f59d-4040ef7de696
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:0ea61ae7-c3c3-d2b4-f59d-4040ef7de696
msgctxt "h4e08d416g9c5bg4024g93b7g18affba7ec4a"
msgid "Hmm. Bugger did eat our last chicken."
msgstr "흠. 그 놈이 우리 마지막 닭을 먹어버리긴 했지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 10fb4697-e7a9-d8ac-80b4-99ad60253cee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:10fb4697-e7a9-d8ac-80b4-99ad60253cee
msgctxt "hd8de8756g259bg4049ga965ga5b6fb0f6c4a"
msgid ""
"Besides, I reckon it owes us seein' as how it just <i>ate </i>our last "
"chicken."
msgstr "게다가, 이 녀석이 방금 우리 마지막 닭을 <i>먹어 치워 버렸다고</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 114e108a-5455-52ce-852d-f395c8864fea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:114e108a-5455-52ce-852d-f395c8864fea
msgctxt "h15ca811cg4334g4c5fga796gfed839370741"
msgid ""
"Not that bloody hollerin'. Clappin' one another on the back as if they've "
"actually <i>done </i>somethin'."
msgstr "지랄 맞게 소리를 질러대는군. 지들이 뭔가를 <i>해낸</i> 것마냥 서로 등을 두들겨주는 꼴이라니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 11813e7b-fcfd-d68e-e902-c10a7619b717
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount5(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount5(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:11813e7b-fcfd-d68e-e902-c10a7619b717
msgctxt "h752c92b0gc893g432eg9948gd2cc2bbe1b39"
msgid ""
"*Your blood runs quicker, feeding the gnawing absence at the centre of your "
"mind.*"
msgstr "*피가 더 빨리 흐르면서, 당신의 정신 한가운데를 좀먹는 허전함을 양분으로 채웁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 119f0d16-ba90-5973-14cc-08d2f565002f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:119f0d16-ba90-5973-14cc-08d2f565002f
msgctxt "h05a5dd89gc044g4416gbad8ga7981b62f592"
msgid ""
"You keep wasting my time, you're gonna have more than coin to worry about."
msgstr "계속 내 시간을 낭비했다간, 동전 말고도 걱정거리가 늘 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 157d11b1-17a5-3ac2-580e-788dfb695628
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator_KnowsTrueSoul(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:157d11b1-17a5-3ac2-580e-788dfb695628
msgctxt "h02188d6fg21a7g45a5g9141g43a32f3abf78"
msgid "Just... just a bit o' fun. No disrespect meant."
msgstr "그냥... 그냥 좀 재미를 보려고 했던 것뿐이야. 무시할 의도는 없었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 15cbdfc8-7701-e292-67fd-1be0c81d2f2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount1(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:15cbdfc8-7701-e292-67fd-1be0c81d2f2c
msgctxt "he31e2a10gbf5bg497cgbc15gd87ab2535bb7"
msgid "*A shiver runs across your mind... You feel sated.*"
msgstr "*전율이 불현듯 머릿속을 스쳐 지나가고... 만족감이 듭니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 170494df-c563-65ac-f613-1071036460bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:170494df-c563-65ac-f613-1071036460bb
msgctxt "h0992e6d6gd364g4ebag99fegca3e0e68ad2c"
msgid ""
"Pff, <i>toast. </i>Clappin' themselves on the back as if they've actually "
"<i>done</i> somethin'."
msgstr "흥, <i>건배라니. </i>지들이 뭐라도 해낸 것 마냥 등을 두들기고 박수나 쳐대고 있는 꼴이 아주 우습군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1705a8a6-1f70-8247-cf16-b7cc5b850461
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold_5 = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GEN_TransferNPCPayment_5(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:1705a8a6-1f70-8247-cf16-b7cc5b850461
msgctxt "he1ed39f6g36f8g4a46gb7edg919d8473cff0"
msgid "I can afford it."
msgstr "감당할 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 185cba21-62e2-797f-b143-dca14af56add
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_Knows_ChaseRules = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:185cba21-62e2-797f-b143-dca14af56add
msgctxt "hdcbc1a63g70bcg4ae7g8a67g2dda3772822a"
msgid "Sounds fun. Count me in."
msgstr "재밌을 것 같은데. 나도 껴줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 18b4fdd0-88a9-01dc-b8f2-d397b1bfed2f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:18b4fdd0-88a9-01dc-b8f2-d397b1bfed2f
msgctxt "heba55ecbg3a63g47d3g9f40gdb8b9648cde7"
msgid "This is cruel. I won't be part of it."
msgstr "이건 동물 학대야. 난 끼지 않겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1ae785b8-ed9b-bb46-f702-06fc0f18bfba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_OwlbearCub_Event_InvitedToCamp = True
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_Event_OwlbearAcquired = False
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_OwlbearReplacedChicken = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:1ae785b8-ed9b-bb46-f702-06fc0f18bfba
msgctxt "h42cb5cb4g6095g468fg8767gd1128174ba7e"
msgid "I'll be taking the owlbear too."
msgstr "그 아울베어도 데려가겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1e5825b2-880a-7595-6097-c15265e153ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:1e5825b2-880a-7595-6097-c15265e153ca
msgctxt "h9575b93bg4542g47abg80b7g2fff851b4796"
msgid "On second thought, I'm done playing."
msgstr "다시 생각해 보니, 이제 끝낼래."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 1eacc859-5003-bd9e-9a53-b553c0d1642b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:1eacc859-5003-bd9e-9a53-b553c0d1642b
msgctxt "haa7a3eccgb393g42dcg888fg8177a0c3f1a3"
msgid ""
"Look - already lost me coin, ain't lookin' to lose anything else. Let's just "
"leave it there, eh?"
msgstr "이봐, 이미 동전을 잃었는데, 더 이상 잃고 싶진 않다고. 이만 떠나는 게 어때, 응?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 230bad17-9ffc-ab2b-0938-7931a7eb78a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator_FailedPersuade(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:230bad17-9ffc-ab2b-0938-7931a7eb78a8
msgctxt "h9c6a93bdga649g42baga3b0ga8a101c71120"
msgid "Rules are rules, mate. Walk away while you can, eh?"
msgstr "규칙은 규칙이야, 친구. 걸어 나갈 수 있을 때 떠나라고, 앙?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 23b10da6-8acc-c948-6032-6133cdb30e2e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:23b10da6-8acc-c948-6032-6133cdb30e2e
msgctxt "h7a9cf4ceg987bg46f3ga91egcae0601ffb39"
msgid "Why not join their toast?"
msgstr "왜 넌 같이 건배하지 않는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 245b408f-5cb2-08d2-7e29-f13320b0f75b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_Quest_Winner(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:245b408f-5cb2-08d2-7e29-f13320b0f75b
msgctxt "h392b7f08g256cg4b3dgb328gc8d79a70526f"
msgid "Let's play again."
msgstr "다시 하자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 24a98008-2f4e-4613-0cff-044fe4c6ca1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_Event_OwlbearAcquired = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:24a98008-2f4e-4613-0cff-044fe4c6ca1f
msgctxt "h6d8540c6g49c6g4bdaga948g541762db1cd4"
msgid ""
"Hells, fine - just take the fat bird, if it means that much to ya. We'll "
"find another chicken."
msgstr "망할, 좋아 - 그 뚱뚱한 새를 가져가. 그게 네게 그렇게 의미가 있다면 말이지. 우린 다른 닭을 찾으면 되니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 24faa80b-1e2e-1e7b-a8e5-1ba00a21c30f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:24faa80b-1e2e-1e7b-a8e5-1ba00a21c30f
msgctxt "h951af402ga4feg475bgb570gbba6318cb7a1"
msgid "I think he's all right."
msgstr "괜찮은 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 259d2141-70e5-f1ed-659e-d2567fbdde28
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_State_OnStage = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:259d2141-70e5-f1ed-659e-d2567fbdde28
msgctxt "h5b84ce0cge8dag4b10g86fcg255c4176ed86"
msgid ""
"Simple, see? But not <i>easy</i>, no. Come back when that half-wit's done "
"wailin' and find out."
msgstr "간단하지? 하지만 <i>쉽진</i> 않을 거야, 저 멍청이가 돌아오면 알아보자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 265135a2-04e7-8769-8c1f-847531f1c354
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:265135a2-04e7-8769-8c1f-847531f1c354
msgctxt "h30491e8eg8a39g47a8gaa13ga08e44d13e98"
msgid "Hand over my winnings."
msgstr "내 상품을 내놔."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 27f9a356-1be9-cd2e-29a9-5b8df23b0229
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:27f9a356-1be9-cd2e-29a9-5b8df23b0229
msgctxt "hb565dd93gdcafg4d0eg8a86g9c9ee9eba464"
msgid ""
"Cocky, eh? Maybe you've got the skill to back it up. Or maybe I'm about to "
"make a heap o' coin."
msgstr "거만하군 그래? 어쩌면 네게 그만한 기술이 있을지도 모르지. 아니면 날 부자로 만들어 줄지도 모르고 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 29932c7b-b12d-f0e7-b5d2-a608632edf48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:29932c7b-b12d-f0e7-b5d2-a608632edf48
msgctxt "ha2fd7d10gc629g47e0gbfbag654aceda55fd"
msgid "What is this 'real entertainment'?"
msgstr "'진짜 오락'이라는 게 뭐야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 2a0097e7-4727-faea-b423-4b7901b8fda7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator_HasMet(1) = True
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_AskedForCompensation(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_BallIsDead = True
#.   Object:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_ChaseEnded(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_State_AskedForCompensation(1) = True
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_State_ChaseEnded(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:2a0097e7-4727-faea-b423-4b7901b8fda7
msgctxt "h3ebf1e26g0ce1g482fg9a17g66109085c021"
msgid "Oi! You're not meant to chase it to death. Now you owe me."
msgstr "어이! 쫓아가서 죽여버리는 게 아니라고. 나한테 빚진 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2ba552df-bd1f-bb0d-23d2-b12eba8c1c7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:2ba552df-bd1f-bb0d-23d2-b12eba8c1c7e
msgctxt "h94ec0fe9g2f73g44edg9923g59f196954852"
msgid "I have better things to do than chase poultry."
msgstr "나에겐 가금류를 쫓는 것보다 중요한 일이 있어서."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 30840c3a-a221-3fad-a11f-e720701d8c26
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:30840c3a-a221-3fad-a11f-e720701d8c26
msgctxt "h2b1e4a49g9788g4363g86e6gc29551e6d3d1"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 30f05c3c-9ace-6f85-d1cf-43df62228e04
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:30f05c3c-9ace-6f85-d1cf-43df62228e04
msgctxt "hb0d48237g53e5g4666ga388g427cf6fc47b6"
msgid "I don't remember the rules."
msgstr "규칙이 기억나지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 32d02b04-44ff-579d-ad3d-b3125206b9e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_GoblinToast_State_CrowdGathered = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:32d02b04-44ff-579d-ad3d-b3125206b9e9
msgctxt "h85632953g2e82g465agbb36g5fd82f6c51f0"
msgid ""
"Bloody pisspots over there. Too busy toastin' when there's <i>real </"
"i>entertainment to be had."
msgstr "저 망할 오줌통 말이야. <i>진짜 </i>오락을 즐기러 오지 않고 빌어먹을 건배나 하느라 바쁘군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3605e5ab-2e99-b4c6-d61d-12b851e76c6b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:3605e5ab-2e99-b4c6-d61d-12b851e76c6b
msgctxt "h133ea30fg7905g4685g8f42ge41631db4b65"
msgid "Could be fun. What is chicken-chasing, exactly?"
msgstr "재밌을지도 모르겠네. 닭 몰이 게임이 정확히 뭐야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 36456a88-778f-c3e6-a120-7fa9e9b8cbae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_Knows_ChaseRules = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:36456a88-778f-c3e6-a120-7fa9e9b8cbae
msgctxt "h5a86db84g0c48g42d2g9743g8e5e0236e8b5"
msgid "Chicken-chasing? What?"
msgstr "닭 몰이? 뭐라고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 3736eb85-f666-320b-83ec-3f9840895b78
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_PlacedBigBet(1) = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold_3 = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GEN_TransferNPCPayment_3(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:3736eb85-f666-320b-83ec-3f9840895b78
msgctxt "h5605f305g416cg4753gb7cagda4ff14b927c"
msgid "Hmm. All right. No need to get weepy over it, like. Here."
msgstr "흐음. 좋아. 너무 슬퍼할 것 없어. 여기."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 374ac447-3edb-016c-b4f9-34282ac3e602
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:374ac447-3edb-016c-b4f9-34282ac3e602
msgctxt "h8291e972g512cg4865gbee1gdb0efc88bef9"
msgid "It's <i>chicken-chasin'.</i>"
msgstr "이건 <i>닭 몰이 게임이야.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 376d0689-a899-b040-bf31-186f95a5b586
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator_FailedPersuade(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:376d0689-a899-b040-bf31-186f95a5b586
msgctxt "h033c548bg3c87g4450gb638g4a2a9d7455a0"
msgid "Oh, I'm still having fun mate. Keep pushin', though - see what 'appens."
msgstr "오, 난 지금도 재밌어 친구. 그래도 계속해 봐, 무슨 일이 일어나는지 보자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 390d7249-750d-ecfc-c496-33e7bb4c7365
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:390d7249-750d-ecfc-c496-33e7bb4c7365
msgctxt "h55908726gebf2g4a9ag9b6fgddab3a757e4a"
msgid ""
"S-slaves, you say? Right, look - bird's dead, game's over - let's just leave "
"it at that, yeah?"
msgstr "노-노예라고? 아차, 저것 봐. 새가 죽었잖아, 경기는 끝났어. 이대로 끝나자고, 알겠지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3ae3b76d-44f7-2df6-8d2e-33bbd9eede36
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:3ae3b76d-44f7-2df6-8d2e-33bbd9eede36
msgctxt "h35947675g0196g46b9g8139g075c1989550e"
msgid "I don't want to bet."
msgstr "돈을 걸고 싶진 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 3b35cce2-c467-e6a2-fc17-91940f2bf0e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_State_PlayingChase = True
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_State_GameInProgress(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:3b35cce2-c467-e6a2-fc17-91940f2bf0e2
msgctxt "h021d108dg6bbbg4601g9cdfg121718845b26"
msgid "But come on, then - let's get a crowd goin'."
msgstr "그럼 뭐해, 관중을 모으자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3bf28a45-cf7e-5afd-bba8-929afc2d8841
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:3bf28a45-cf7e-5afd-bba8-929afc2d8841
msgctxt "h655df761g293dg4baegb2e4g78876ad7b0c7"
msgid "I'm not playing your 'game'. It's barbaric."
msgstr "네 '경기'엔 참가할 생각 없어. 야만적이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 3c39e5f4-6104-a48e-0f96-3979c50175ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:3c39e5f4-6104-a48e-0f96-3979c50175ff
msgctxt "he42a51c9ge5d9g478bgbe94g77569c1ef202"
msgid "Now you wanna play, or is there a bit o' chicken in <i>you</i> and all?"
msgstr "그래서 할 거야, 아니면 닭처럼 겁먹은 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 3da119cb-efb7-7412-d72d-8ffe10e201d4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator_KnowsTrueSoul(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_Event_OwlbearAcquired = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:3da119cb-efb7-7412-d72d-8ffe10e201d4
msgctxt "heac5dcb5gcf31g4e62ga07fg43e476a75a2d"
msgid ""
"B-beg pardon. Please, take it. A gift! Reckon it's too fat to run anyway, "
"heh."
msgstr "용-용서해 줘. 부디, 가져가. 선물이야! 뛰기엔 어차피 너무 뚱뚱하긴 했어, 헤."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 3e924ad8-3ef0-02c4-4f6c-a618a7a2de54
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:3e924ad8-3ef0-02c4-4f6c-a618a7a2de54
msgctxt "h9d7df99bg8ed2g434cgaee2g634ea25510fe"
msgid "<i>Fun?</i> Show a bit of respect, mate. This is serious business."
msgstr "<i>재미?</i> 존중을 좀 보여, 친구. 이건 진지한 사업이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 3ed701a5-415f-b38c-35dd-5ea7069d1a92
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_State_OnStage = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:3ed701a5-415f-b38c-35dd-5ea7069d1a92
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h8d6b7f6bgcc42g4840gabc2g174e8315e3a6"
msgid "Business we can't be about 'til that half-wit's done wailin'."
msgstr "저 망할 놈이 그만 울기 전까진 사업을 계속할 수 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 40779d36-75ec-649a-f74f-4daea88113c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:40779d36-75ec-649a-f74f-4daea88113c3
msgctxt "h44b1c923g0d5dg4dc6gb398g8206188a2637"
msgid "I suppose you could do much better."
msgstr "너라면 더 잘할 수 있을 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 4748b875-e9df-17bf-c754-fc32ec633f04
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:4748b875-e9df-17bf-c754-fc32ec633f04
msgctxt "h715744begc6ddg41d3g8f8egcdff2a29263c"
msgid ""
"I'm talkin' about somethin' real. I'm talkin' about... <i>chicken-"
"chasin'.</i>"
msgstr "난 실존하는 무언가에 대해 말하고 있는 거라고. 내가 말하고 있는 건... <i>닭 몰이 게임</i>이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 49e9e6d5-722b-c237-8bdc-b21b29d82391
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:49e9e6d5-722b-c237-8bdc-b21b29d82391
msgctxt "hecd7835bg0a96g484aga4f4gc77ff15a94df"
msgid "I don't have the gold."
msgstr "그만한 돈이 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 4a78d39c-b70e-c266-d063-2034335227ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:4a78d39c-b70e-c266-d063-2034335227ec
msgctxt "hff2f8d3dgfefdg47ecg8b4fg3b18925c5839"
msgid ""
"Besides, I reckon it owes us seein' as how it just <i>ate</i> our last "
"chicken."
msgstr "게다가, 이 녀석이 방금 우리 마지막 닭을 <i>먹어 치워 버렸다고</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 4c49f13a-6d21-4a88-f660-d117f72207fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_OwlbearReplacedChicken = False
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_PlayedOnce = False
#.   Object:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_GameInProgress(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:4c49f13a-6d21-4a88-f660-d117f72207fe
msgctxt "hc2f01a52gfb96g4832gb715ged055994d674"
msgid "Well? Brave enough to take on the chicken?"
msgstr "그래서? 닭을 쫓아볼텨?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4d3f024d-734f-a440-342d-0da8b5b2c166
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:4d3f024d-734f-a440-342d-0da8b5b2c166
msgctxt "h20049550g8e9ag4587g8786ga5d0d61548f0"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 4f16bb9c-e445-df75-d0bf-e1197c540ec3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:4f16bb9c-e445-df75-d0bf-e1197c540ec3
msgctxt "ha6be48a5g5642g4ddcgab3dge729890c2e5e"
msgid ""
"Eh... you're a True Soul? All that I said before - just... just forget it."
msgstr "에... 참된 영혼이라고? 내가 이전에 말했던 건, 그냥... 잊어버려."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 5042ecc8-d364-c34d-5284-b15e484e6ea8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:5042ecc8-d364-c34d-5284-b15e484e6ea8
msgctxt "hee51a085g1c15g478fg83bfg64292651f0d9"
msgid "But we got serious business to be about 'ere. <i>Chicken-chasin'.</i>"
msgstr "내가 말하고 있는 건 진지한 사업이라고 친구. <i>닭 몰이 게임</i> 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 513a7e88-94e1-0c36-11ca-a94ace30bd26
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:513a7e88-94e1-0c36-11ca-a94ace30bd26
msgctxt "h24426b21gba72g49d1gb7f9g2dea2e51dad7"
msgid "... this is <i>chicken-chasin'.</i>"
msgstr "... 이건 <i>닭 몰이 게임</i> 이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 528ccc43-d674-b929-e37a-06ceaaaa5f20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:528ccc43-d674-b929-e37a-06ceaaaa5f20
msgctxt "hfa7e53ccgd4b2g4e5dg831cg851be1d80835"
msgid ""
"You're bloody mad, you are. Go on then - you're just ruinin' the game anyway."
msgstr "완전히 돌았군. 마음대로 해, 어차피 경기를 망치고 있었을 뿐이니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 530eeef0-f58b-f551-20dc-c24213ae3305
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = True
#. TagRule: BERSERKER
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:530eeef0-f58b-f551-20dc-c24213ae3305
msgctxt "h3a7a08ccg7bd9g4bddg978eg9b24cdf99f12"
msgid "<b>Then I'll write new rules - IN BLOOD AND GOBLIN-HIDE.</b>"
msgstr "<b>그렇다면 내가 고블린 가죽과 피로 새로운 규칙을 써주지.</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 530eeef0-f58b-f551-20dc-c24213ae3305
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:530eeef0-f58b-f551-20dc-c24213ae3305
msgctxt "h5223ae37g7765g40f1g9126g8b1747554969"
msgid "Rules can be broken. <b>And so can goblin bones.</b>"
msgstr "규칙을 깨라고 있는 거야. <b>고블린 뼈도 그렇고 말이지.</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5343fcc4-f057-375c-b8cf-3086b9419f58
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GEN_TransferNPCPayment(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:5343fcc4-f057-375c-b8cf-3086b9419f58
msgctxt "h70745a3egb502g4fc0g874bgc61ade9a14bb"
msgid ""
"Here you go. ([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-"
"be548b134c54])"
msgstr ""
"자, 여기. ([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-be548b134c54])"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 542fe8de-8e3f-b9a3-033d-a14a4136e891
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:542fe8de-8e3f-b9a3-033d-a14a4136e891
msgctxt "hd502b863g9ae5g4492g8e5bg6513799495eb"
msgid ""
"Heh! Nothin' like it, is there? C'mon then, you know the drill - coin on the "
"table."
msgstr "하하! 꽤 괜찮지? 그럼 뭐 하고 있어, 어떻게 하는지 알잖아. 동전부터 걸라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 55bebdc2-ab28-077c-32f1-e1985979e67b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_PlacedBigBet(1) = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold_3 = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:55bebdc2-ab28-077c-32f1-e1985979e67b
msgctxt "h5432d82fg4be0g4b76ga7a5g0eea0c297a6d"
msgid "S-slaves? Look, I don't want no trouble. Just take your coin, and -"
msgstr "노-노예라고? 이봐, 문제를 일으키고 싶진 않아. 네 동전을 챙겨서, -"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5741aa45-3bb5-b2c2-619f-32346d3fb9a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:5741aa45-3bb5-b2c2-619f-32346d3fb9a8
msgctxt "hcab8324bg73dfg4c66gbf84gd41676b9c14f"
msgid "I don't care what you think. I'm not asking."
msgstr "네 생각을 묻는 게 아니야. 이건 명령이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 57a4567e-5bae-944b-a626-a669d71ef9d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:57a4567e-5bae-944b-a626-a669d71ef9d9
msgctxt "h90b55f57g602ag44d5ga195g7fe660936a5e"
msgid "Then go waste some other bugger's time, eh?"
msgstr "그럼 다른 멍청이 시간이나 낭비하라고, 앙?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5831e2fc-09ce-035b-b885-b42e181e10e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GEN_TransferNPCPayment(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:5831e2fc-09ce-035b-b885-b42e181e10e3
msgctxt "h0b54a180gb369g48d5g8bcfg34bafe99d860"
msgid ""
"Sure, I'll place a bet. ([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-"
"be548b134c54])"
msgstr ""
"물론, 돈을 걸게. ([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-be548b134c54])"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 58f22075-8ce4-913b-32da-2c5fe84d1193
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:58f22075-8ce4-913b-32da-2c5fe84d1193
msgctxt "hfe766499g2257g47cbg9abbg33da206b1816"
msgid "You mistook that for a request. My coin - <i>now</i>."
msgstr "내가 부탁하는 줄 알았나 보군. 돈을 내놔, <i>당장</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5ab483cb-b246-6be2-31e7-914155cad088
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = True
#. TagRule: BERSERKER
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:5ab483cb-b246-6be2-31e7-914155cad088
msgctxt "h0297200bgef90g478dg8a39gffdc40b9f55b"
msgid "<b><i>ROAR.</i></b>"
msgstr "<b><i>크아아.</i></b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5ab483cb-b246-6be2-31e7-914155cad088
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:5ab483cb-b246-6be2-31e7-914155cad088
msgctxt "hb65f69d9g158dg4750g896cg3499e18ff9fc"
msgid "Feel differently? How about you feel <b>dead?</b>"
msgstr "다르게 느낀다고? <b>죽은</b> 기분을 느껴보는 건 어때?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 5ae81c5c-7971-1671-e00d-5726eccf5e60
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:5ae81c5c-7971-1671-e00d-5726eccf5e60
msgctxt "h12ec008ag115dg4b32g9092g431a4991a04f"
msgid ""
"<i>Do</i> ya now? And who says you can afford it, eh? "
"([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_5_8860ed48-ba5f-4b7b-82bf-f1220f967d41])"
msgstr ""
"당장 <i>살래</i>? 그리고 네가 이 비용을 감당할 수는 있어? ([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_5_8860ed48"
"-ba5f-4b7b-82bf-f1220f967d41])"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 5d3179b6-fdc7-fc02-4bb6-9c0260b215a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_State_OnStage = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:5d3179b6-fdc7-fc02-4bb6-9c0260b215a9
msgctxt "he5efb109g717fg44edgb43dg388baf9afeec"
msgid ""
"Sound easy? It <i>ain't.</i> Better contenders than you have been bested by "
"the bird."
msgstr "쉬울 것 같지? 전혀 <i>그렇지 않아.</i>. 너보다 뛰어난 참가자들도 수없이 새에게 패배했다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5e42e109-3034-f7ce-c9be-4589fc7aed83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold_2 = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GEN_TransferNPCPayment_2(1) = True
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_State_PlacedBigBet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:5e42e109-3034-f7ce-c9be-4589fc7aed83
msgctxt "h0cfde492gf10bg48f7g96cbgefd17e5745ac"
msgid ""
"I'm feeling confident. How about a bigger bet? "
"([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_2_463b0f43-5410-412d-aba3-875cf81c38ca])"
msgstr ""
"난 자신 있어. 더 큰 내기는 어때? ([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_2_463b0f43-5410-412d-"
"aba3-875cf81c38ca])"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5e533827-2565-88b4-f686-b77a7ca55218
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:5e533827-2565-88b4-f686-b77a7ca55218
msgctxt "h02edfd79g859fg42d9gb0c9g44e331abc45f"
msgid "I don't have the gold for it."
msgstr "그 만큼의 금화를 갖고 있지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 5f43f75d-e90e-16a4-a29e-2dbdf285cec3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:5f43f75d-e90e-16a4-a29e-2dbdf285cec3
msgctxt "h988155bbg3173g4e52g9feagc68a776e0184"
msgid ""
"Wait - s-someone's nicked me coin! You want yours, help me <i>find</i> the "
"bugger."
msgstr "잠깐 - 누가 내 금화를 털어갔어! 금화를 받고 싶으면 훔친 새끼 <i>찾는 걸</i> 도와."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 5f4804ea-f127-0033-8372-2d87b31be0a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:5f4804ea-f127-0033-8372-2d87b31be0a2
msgctxt "h5c4f5611gde42g4b1fg87c4gfedd4932be86"
msgid "You're a... you're a True Soul?"
msgstr "너... 너는 참된 영혼?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 621ab412-46fc-7dc7-62c2-0570c65786de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:621ab412-46fc-7dc7-62c2-0570c65786de
msgctxt "h1fda4964ge44fg4793g8994g3a2d038832b9"
msgid "Actually, keep it. It's all yours."
msgstr "있잖아, 그냥 가져. 네거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 63421395-40fa-1123-d270-73e2de24a90f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_WaitingAfterGame = True
#.   Object:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_ChaseEnded(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:63421395-40fa-1123-d270-73e2de24a90f
msgctxt "hf65e2e19g5b12g422fg9aaag9a9d8a569652"
msgid "That's the game done. C'mere!"
msgstr "게임 끝이야. 이리 와!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 6457848d-4dd4-b556-1fd0-1718ecfb283d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:6457848d-4dd4-b556-1fd0-1718ecfb283d
msgctxt "hee344afeg3a09g49eagb915g0d8b5db54655"
msgid ""
"Gotta do it fast, and gotta do it <i>alone. </i>Any of your mates step in, "
"you lose. Time runs out, you <i>lose.</i>"
msgstr "<i>혼자서</i> 최대한 빠르게 해야 돼. 너의 친구 중 누구라도 끼어들면 패배야. 시간이 다 지나도 <i>패배야.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 66c39318-5881-a69e-8587-108c58469341
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:66c39318-5881-a69e-8587-108c58469341
msgctxt "haa9abf7bgdd25g483cg9b70g0c324e0d9ed4"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 675f7a2e-c8ad-6b4f-e00b-cfbb95181e7d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#.      - ILLITHID(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:675f7a2e-c8ad-6b4f-e00b-cfbb95181e7d
msgctxt "h3d999161gb4d4g4e70g9f19g340c81c9361f"
msgid "You'll be returning my coin - <i>and</i> all of yours."
msgstr "내 돈을 다 돌려줘야 할 거야, 그리고 네가 가진 전부도 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 67f51ba6-ecdc-c7db-8dc6-0fff83f7bdfb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:67f51ba6-ecdc-c7db-8dc6-0fff83f7bdfb
msgctxt "h9a80a070g822eg44ccgbb35g3c8a073a684f"
msgid "A joke, is all. No offence meant."
msgstr "농담이었을 뿐이야. 악의는 없었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 67fa3dde-f75b-d22d-e361-f041cbb40882
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:67fa3dde-f75b-d22d-e361-f041cbb40882
msgctxt "h73023993gaf56g4840g8499ged11c485623b"
msgid "Mate, we already been through this - no coin, no chase. All right?"
msgstr "친구, 이미 한 번 알려줬잖아. 돈이 없으면, 경주도 없어. 알겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 6c7cbba2-468f-fa48-aac6-b8263612edc2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_PlayingChase = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:6c7cbba2-468f-fa48-aac6-b8263612edc2
msgctxt "h38fa5912ga5d6g4eb3gb273g8fed246d6012"
msgid "What you chattin' to me for?! Chicken ain't gonna chase itself!"
msgstr "나한테 말은 왜 거는 거야?! 닭이 자기 자신을 몰진 않을 거라고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 6d654573-6432-ec2e-bd2d-e88cfbb548f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_State_PlayingChase = True
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_State_GameInProgress(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:6d654573-6432-ec2e-bd2d-e88cfbb548f7
msgctxt "h6acd27e7gf810g4d2eg89b0gcfff4390864d"
msgid "Let's get a crowd goin' and find out, eh?"
msgstr "군중을 동원해서 알아보자고, 응?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 7081e67f-93d0-b37d-0601-92875b35830c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:7081e67f-93d0-b37d-0601-92875b35830c
msgctxt "hc4d3fda3g8a9eg4b98g850dg18d8706a8c1b"
msgid ""
"Oh c'mon now, don't be scared. It's a simple game - that's what makes it "
"beautiful."
msgstr "오, 부디 겁내지 마. 간단한 게임이야. 그게 아름다운 점이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 709060c2-2bbb-c701-28dc-41f651fbe8fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:709060c2-2bbb-c701-28dc-41f651fbe8fc
msgctxt "hd984f7d2gd148g45f4gbcaag9586fd3923d4"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 70fa7519-10bc-1beb-6732-328db8321715
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:70fa7519-10bc-1beb-6732-328db8321715
msgctxt "h2885cd26g623ag436dg9aa0g541842357fb8"
msgid ""
"But most importantly - gotta back yourself with some coin. How much you "
"thinkin'?"
msgstr "하지만 더 중요한 건 - 내기를 할 금화가 있어야 하지. 얼마 정도 생각해?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 717b3621-7e82-caa1-0cc5-eedd491c2aad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold_5 = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:717b3621-7e82-caa1-0cc5-eedd491c2aad
msgctxt "h218ccc47gf4b0g4731g9af7g871a8f88ca0f"
msgid "I don't have that much."
msgstr "그런 돈은 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 720afbee-7a2d-298a-2236-8a6f59c74bc2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_OwlbearReplacedChicken = False
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_PlayedOnce = True
#.   Object:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_GameInProgress(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:720afbee-7a2d-298a-2236-8a6f59c74bc2
msgctxt "h410c3ebbg8ef2g40eeg85c6gc724485e45d0"
msgid ""
"Well if it ain't our fledgling chicken-chaser. Got a taste for the game now, "
"do ya?"
msgstr "우리의 풋내기 닭 몰이꾼 아니신가. 이제 게임이 재밌어지셨나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 73659d6e-62ac-82a9-080f-1db9df326d00
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:73659d6e-62ac-82a9-080f-1db9df326d00
msgctxt "h0f5121b7g1dc4g4d7dgb162g62d12d876ad5"
msgid "I'm saying I want to <i>buy</i> it."
msgstr "그걸 <i>사고 싶다</i>는 뜻이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 76d37ac5-4fb2-0680-8d74-44fdb37b369b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_GoblinToast_State_CrowdGathered = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:76d37ac5-4fb2-0680-8d74-44fdb37b369b
msgctxt "h88b43f20g577eg4937gbd33g1e115bf39f11"
msgid ""
"Sound easy? It <i>ain't</i>. Come back once those boozehounds are done "
"toastin' - you'll see."
msgstr "쉬울 것 같지? 전혀 그렇지 않아. 저 술꾼 놈들 술판이 끝나면 그때 와서 보라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 7707c410-5ce1-5060-6842-f28b4279ff0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:7707c410-5ce1-5060-6842-f28b4279ff0a
msgctxt "h7075c459g0c1eg4959ga355gd4a7cf0bc4b8"
msgid ""
"Don't hang about, do ya? Maybe that serves you well, out fightin' beasties. "
"But this ain't that. This..."
msgstr "토 달지 마, 알았어? 짐승들과 싸우는 데는 그게 잘 어울리겠지. 하지만 이건 그런 게 아냐. 이건..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 77c639d7-dce2-144d-22d1-8f7fcc3e6c0c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold_2 = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GEN_TransferNPCPayment_2(1) = True
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_State_PlacedBigBet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:77c639d7-dce2-144d-22d1-8f7fcc3e6c0c
msgctxt "hf2724e05g7248g46f4g80a9g7a6b932da6a6"
msgid ""
"If we're going to bet, we may as well go all in. "
"([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_2_463b0f43-5410-412d-aba3-875cf81c38ca])"
msgstr ""
"내기를 할 거면, 올인하는 게 좋지. ([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_2_463b0f43-5410-412d-"
"aba3-875cf81c38ca])"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 7872ca7e-6ef0-3a1b-d71b-80a2f503dc0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_Knows_ChaseRules = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:7872ca7e-6ef0-3a1b-d71b-80a2f503dc0a
msgctxt "h9028d8cdgdfd5g436ag9e25g83544e789e78"
msgid ""
"You just gotta chase the chicken through the course to the posts there, "
"right?"
msgstr "저기 보이는 말뚝으로 향하는 길을 따라 닭을 몰면 되는 거야, 알았어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 789e411a-6029-6e8d-2023-06c0a2cae1ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:789e411a-6029-6e8d-2023-06c0a2cae1ad
msgctxt "hfdf1d042gd563g47d1ga087g6a0c35a8967b"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 78ad8d4a-0e39-5054-8071-a6c0a6e23d49
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount6(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount6(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:78ad8d4a-0e39-5054-8071-a6c0a6e23d49
msgctxt "h5ba51e35g9934g4f0cgb349g610a9f92260a"
msgid ""
"*The presence deep in your mind is awake, unblinking. This is it. A single "
"word pervades your consciousness: 'Soon'.*"
msgstr ""
"*당신의 정신 속 깊이 자리잡은 존재가 태연스레 깨어납니다. 올 것이 왔군요. 한 단어가 당신의 의식 속으로 스며듭니다. ‘곧’*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 7b387732-c700-5b25-c8d9-310fd59d8619
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_State_TriedToCheat(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:7b387732-c700-5b25-c8d9-310fd59d8619
msgctxt "hd167ce03g946fg4b80g850eg270b0e2164bd"
msgid "Pardon, your <i>what?</i> Think you misunderstood, mate."
msgstr "잘 못 들었어, 너의 <i>뭐라고?</i> 네가 오해한 것 같은데, 친구."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7c18a506-2964-b94a-7ffc-41b316f08edb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:7c18a506-2964-b94a-7ffc-41b316f08edb
msgctxt "h483db859g37dbg4a4eg97ddg32556d1f0e8d"
msgid "Sure, I'll play."
msgstr "그래, 한번 해보지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 7cc2344b-7a81-ee8d-9d48-85ad64b910ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:7cc2344b-7a81-ee8d-9d48-85ad64b910ed
msgctxt "h7e0372dfgef21g49ccg9ea2g0b0b6922798a"
msgid ""
"*The mark glows, but you feel nothing in response. Your illithid power is "
"beyond reach until you rest.*"
msgstr "*문양이 빛나지만, 어떤 반응도 느껴지지 않습니다. 일리시드 능력을 더 사용하려면 휴식을 취해야 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 7f7e1b6d-d3df-5be9-919e-419e6dd0bfda
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount4(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount4(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:7f7e1b6d-d3df-5be9-919e-419e6dd0bfda
msgctxt "h0b5ad826g2c95g4cc3gaf49g8fbdd03b8bdf"
msgid ""
"*A shadow swims across your vision, and a familiar voice tells you to be "
"calm. You are loved.*"
msgstr "*그림자가 낀 듯이 눈앞이 흐려지더니, 익숙한 목소리가 당신을 달래줍니다. 사랑이 느껴집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 825f7b27-92d8-afd4-40f3-150acb112474
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:825f7b27-92d8-afd4-40f3-150acb112474
msgctxt "h66aba2c4g1361g40b9g8d15ga3a8368e979e"
msgid "A True Soul? <i>You?</i> Please."
msgstr "참된 영혼이라고? <i>너가?</i> 말이 되는 소릴."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 828e3743-f97a-58dc-3010-e326de1a30c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_GoblinToast_State_RealizedPoison = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:828e3743-f97a-58dc-3010-e326de1a30c0
msgctxt "h2dbd1f59g913cg44d5g81f8gc9fb1ab41de2"
msgid "Who the hells poisoned 'em?"
msgstr "대체 누가 중독시킨 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 835dd337-30bd-ba87-c9e7-941eee585b95
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Absolute_Knows_TrueSoul = True
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#.      - ILLITHID(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:835dd337-30bd-ba87-c9e7-941eee585b95
msgctxt "h47349cfdg17d7g4590gac4cg3ac5197c576b"
msgid "Are you trying to extort a True Soul?"
msgstr "참된 영혼을 갈취하려는 거냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 8491bfac-eccf-b474-8944-0fb820b8766d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_State_OnStage = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:8491bfac-eccf-b474-8944-0fb820b8766d
msgctxt "hebcde8adg3a2dg46ccgae8fg388ff70182ae"
msgid ""
"Simple, like I say - but not <i>easy.</i> Better contenders than you have "
"been bested by that bird."
msgstr "말했듯이 간단하지만, <i>쉽지는 않아.</i>. 너보다 뛰어난 참가자들도 수없이 그 새에게 패배했다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 84f93112-f140-31b2-ce28-95f67b5c41fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:84f93112-f140-31b2-ce28-95f67b5c41fd
msgctxt "ha24d2442g9b21g4306g9949g18ccc3b853a1"
msgid ""
"<i>Is </i>ya, now? Reckon I feel differently. Reckon the lads will, too."
msgstr "지금 <i>떠나려고</i>? 난 동의하지 못할 것 같은데. 이 애들도 마찬가지일 거고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 8588df2c-57dc-531b-14ee-283e3ae1778b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount2(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount2(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:8588df2c-57dc-531b-14ee-283e3ae1778b
msgctxt "hd66f5136g840ag4ce1gb76ege7810721b247"
msgid ""
"*Something stirs deep within you, hungry and alert... it's taking something "
"you'll never get back.*"
msgstr "*몸 깊숙한 데서 굶주리고 기민한 존재가 꿈틀댑니다... 잃으면 되찾지 못할 뭔가를 좀먹고 있군요.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 8635a0b9-bd75-bd51-7308-898e8bab689d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:8635a0b9-bd75-bd51-7308-898e8bab689d
msgctxt "hbf39d917g7d80g4e72g844dg0e4fb5c2d8ff"
msgid "Hells mate, it ain't <i>difficult</i>."
msgstr "이 친구야, <i>어려운</i> 거 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 880c2aa7-38a4-e70b-8fdc-f35b4120133b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_OwlbearReplacedChicken = True
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_PlayedOnce = True
#.   Object:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_GameInProgress(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:880c2aa7-38a4-e70b-8fdc-f35b4120133b
msgctxt "h4dbaf2f8g35fbg4100gbfd4gd9edd5ea2428"
msgid ""
"Well if it ain't our fledgling chicken-chaser. Got a taste for the game now, "
"do ya?"
msgstr "우리의 풋내기 닭 몰이꾼 아니신가. 이제 게임이 재밌어지셨나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 88aedb4a-6e32-5bb1-1392-ade657a70131
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:88aedb4a-6e32-5bb1-1392-ade657a70131
msgctxt "h7ba26e8dg4484g4237g9f45g2a9858bb61f6"
msgid "The game's not over. Maybe you can be the next chicken."
msgstr "게임은 끝나지 않았어. 네가 다음 닭이 돼도 좋을 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 89ede0f9-f24b-4678-00e8-5b084d4f2539
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_PlacedBigBet(1) = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold_3 = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GEN_TransferNPCPayment_3(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:89ede0f9-f24b-4678-00e8-5b084d4f2539
msgctxt "h0ea2dc2fg48ffg4965gb99agca4d824bfd74"
msgid "Heh. It were only a <i>joke</i>, mate. Here - no quarrel with ya!"
msgstr "헤. 단지 <i>농담</i>이었어, 친구. 여기 - 너와 다툴 생각 없어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 8af04925-bd87-0e73-ee4e-62a32abba428
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_GoalScored = True
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_OwlbearReplacedChicken = False
#.   Object:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_ChaseEnded(1) = True
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_GameInProgress(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_State_GoalScored = False
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_State_ChaseEnded(1) = False
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_State_GameInProgress(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:8af04925-bd87-0e73-ee4e-62a32abba428
msgctxt "h359fd6b8g9c77g49e9g821ag6caa10795af3"
msgid ""
"Well, <i>lookie here</i>. Seems like you know your way around the course."
msgstr "허, <i>이것 봐라</i>. 닭몰이 좀 할 줄 아나 보네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 8c070bce-bf81-cfbb-1c81-718dbbf5d051
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_Event_OwlbearAcquired = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:8c070bce-bf81-cfbb-1c81-718dbbf5d051
msgctxt "h7072f7d2g5bbeg4098g88fag70da5784e706"
msgid ""
"Suit yourself. We'll just buy a new chicken. A <i>normal</i> one, not this "
"big fat lump."
msgstr "그럼 알아서 해. 우린 그냥 새 닭을 살거야. <i>정상적인</i> 닭, 이 뚱뚱한 덩어리 같은 게 아니라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 8cdf8e09-75a6-eb4c-b2e0-5dbce7f60b94
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_State_PlayingChase = True
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_State_GameInProgress(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:8cdf8e09-75a6-eb4c-b2e0-5dbce7f60b94
msgctxt "hbd1badd1gf08fg4431g9f43geb6d9b9a9dcb"
msgid "It's your money. Let's get a crowd together to watch you lose it, eh?"
msgstr "네 돈이니까. 그럼 관중 좀 모아서 네가 잃는 걸 지켜보자고, 응?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 8d297b83-3db3-e492-a755-c3b83fd27acd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_OwlbearReplacedChicken = True
#.   Object:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_PlacedBigBet(1) = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold_3 = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GEN_TransferNPCPayment_3(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:8d297b83-3db3-e492-a755-c3b83fd27acd
msgctxt "ha8d1cce1gb644g4995g9742g43c04d8f9f84"
msgid "I'd almost swear you're in league with the bloody beast."
msgstr "네가 저 망할 짐승과 한통속인 줄 알았다니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8fb50b6b-398c-b189-5868-b7a3848046f1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_Quest_Winner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:8fb50b6b-398c-b189-5868-b7a3848046f1
msgctxt "h1bd43449g77c5g4ea8gb9eagf6d915d2ff34"
msgid "Just give me my winnings."
msgstr "그냥 내 상품이나 내놔."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8fd4f5bd-ec79-ccfb-731d-3ca28599c8c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:8fd4f5bd-ec79-ccfb-731d-3ca28599c8c9
msgctxt "h615caa84gf7aag422bgb892gcb32c5cf7292"
msgid "Seems easy enough."
msgstr "간단한 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 909d654e-1e95-9ab6-3ef4-f1562ea489aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:909d654e-1e95-9ab6-3ef4-f1562ea489aa
msgctxt "h78dd9eb5g6356g4a7cg8509gc17e726e76bd"
msgid ""
"Don't need to, mate. We already got the greatest art there is - and it ain't "
"no warbling."
msgstr "걱정하지 마, 친구. 이미 우리에겐 최고의 예술이 있으니까, 노래 따위가 아니라 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 90bf253b-7ec1-1dc6-d376-d01e6397cd17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:90bf253b-7ec1-1dc6-d376-d01e6397cd17
msgctxt "hfc12268egb43dg4a2dg888eg7237c4b5ced0"
msgid "I can handle myself just fine."
msgstr "앞가림 정도는 할 수 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 95df2f3b-789a-4931-d2aa-0a0f87efddcb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_Event_GetAllCommentatorMoney(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:95df2f3b-789a-4931-d2aa-0a0f87efddcb
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h151db508gcc2ag47baga5d4gf12f40904e6a"
msgid ""
"You're - you're a <i>True Soul</i>. Here - i-it were only a bit of fun. All "
"yours."
msgstr "<i>차-참된 영혼이잖아</i>. 여기 있어. 그-그냥 장난 좀 치려던 것이었어. 다 가져."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 96123fcc-39c2-2e71-e066-8542de93bdad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Absolute_Knows_TrueSoul = True
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:96123fcc-39c2-2e71-e066-8542de93bdad
msgctxt "h6ab86832g16cdg4af3g814dg7f1deb7c0366"
msgid "Are you trying to extort a True Soul?"
msgstr "참된 영혼을 갈취하려는 거냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 977408b1-4f7d-a168-1557-99f23915d465
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GEN_TransferNPCPayment(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:977408b1-4f7d-a168-1557-99f23915d465
msgctxt "h937fdfa6g2be7g46a9g87cag0b3bc9ad90ad"
msgid ""
"Here's my bet. ([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-"
"be548b134c54])"
msgstr "자 여기. ([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-be548b134c54])"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 97de2431-9c17-9125-1a54-8f5aa93a5ab4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_State_OnStage = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:97de2431-9c17-9125-1a54-8f5aa93a5ab4
msgctxt "h42f53dc3gef9ag4d05ga37fg84fa3b94c3d4"
msgid ""
"Well now - you look like a tough'un. But 'ave you got smarts? Skill? "
"<i>Guts?</i>"
msgstr "어디 보자, 너 좀 터프한 녀석인 것 같은데. 머리는 잘 돌아가나? 기술은? <i>배짱은?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 9850a71a-eb05-07f1-ef46-ec614fbce139
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:9850a71a-eb05-07f1-ef46-ec614fbce139
msgctxt "h96e07d48g72e3g4d63g8df7gf94909d09b05"
msgid ""
"Then you don't want to play. This game ain't for rattle-guts that don't "
"believe in theirselves."
msgstr "그럼 안하는 게 나아. 이 게임은 스스로를 믿지 못하는 겁쟁이들을 위한 게임이 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 9895cbfe-cd4d-0c14-96b5-2d80ee47bc38
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:9895cbfe-cd4d-0c14-96b5-2d80ee47bc38
msgctxt "h17f5e684gf187g405bgb67bg13ee77efd11b"
msgid "Then we ain't got nothin' to talk about, do we?"
msgstr "그럼 너랑 얘기할 거 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 9bd6c8c6-86de-03fe-e745-1caedabd75a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:9bd6c8c6-86de-03fe-e745-1caedabd75a7
msgctxt "hba5c4548gaa96g4c28g85dfg967aaf27c5bd"
msgid "Oi! Whatever it is you're doin', you can bloody well <i>stop it.</i>"
msgstr "야! 무슨 수작인지는 모르겠지만, 당장 <i>멈추라고.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9bf52049-4b9c-bc99-c61a-c0ffcbb04b1e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator_State_AfraidofDrow(1) = True
#. TagRule: LOLTHDROWELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:9bf52049-4b9c-bc99-c61a-c0ffcbb04b1e
msgctxt "h287110afga4b5g4e9fg8e37g50576d3f5f79"
msgid "My people use goblin slaves for their games. They always die too."
msgstr "내 종족은 고블린 노예들을 놀이에 쓰는데, 그들은 항상 죽어나가지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9c799191-0170-6f2f-86bd-5f1ab137c174
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_OwlbearCub_Event_InvitedToCamp = True
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_Event_OwlbearAcquired = False
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_OwlbearReplacedChicken = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:9c799191-0170-6f2f-86bd-5f1ab137c174
msgctxt "h55884926g7e72g4691ga019g910ae0a97c5a"
msgid "I'm leaving - and the owlbear's coming with me."
msgstr "난 떠난다. 아울베어도 데리고 가겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9ee61363-4ba0-9b11-f24d-53ee937681ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - GLO_TadpoleIntro_NPC(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - GLO_TadpoleIntro_NPC(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:9ee61363-4ba0-9b11-f24d-53ee937681ec
msgctxt "hcc5f5f3bg8f7ag47e3ga454gdf5ebe54ea38"
msgid ""
"*A strange symbol glows, marked on their flesh, and something within you "
"stirs in response.*"
msgstr "*그들의 살갗에 새겨진 기묘한 상징이 빛나고, 이에 반응하여 당신 내면의 무언가가 꿈틀거립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 9ef024d0-68a9-90e8-1872-5e67f725a88c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:9ef024d0-68a9-90e8-1872-5e67f725a88c
msgctxt "he1d7f60dg3330g4cc1ga4d1gceeaef05b404"
msgid ""
"Ain't no winnings, cos only a <i>goblin </i>can win chicken-chase. Says so "
"in the rules."
msgstr "상품은 없어. 왜냐, <i>고블린</i>만 닭 몰이 게임에 우승할 수 있거든. 규칙에 그렇게 나와 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = 9f105ffd-e4ce-4dd0-7f42-11f0cd435014
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:9f105ffd-e4ce-4dd0-7f42-11f0cd435014
msgctxt "hc6bc65degf094g4ae7g8d09gcd59ebadd29d"
msgid ""
"<i>Ohoho. </i>Fancy yourself, do ya? Care to pin that claim down with some "
"<i>coin? </i>([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-"
"be548b134c54])"
msgstr ""
"<i>오호호. </i> 자신감이 넘치군 그래? 그 자신감을 <i>동전</i>으로 박제해 보이는 건 어때? "
"([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-be548b134c54])"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a0c417aa-236f-cb38-a5d0-ec103e7dc149
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold_2 = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GEN_TransferNPCPayment_2(1) = True
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_State_PlacedBigBet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:a0c417aa-236f-cb38-a5d0-ec103e7dc149
msgctxt "h6c71017cg28e9g456ag8204gf2b3f53432c8"
msgid ""
"Oh, come on. Let's make a <i>real </i>wager. "
"([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_2_463b0f43-5410-412d-aba3-875cf81c38ca])"
msgstr ""
"에이, 뭐야. <i>잔짜</i> 내기를 하자고. ([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_2_463b0f43-5410-412d-"
"aba3-875cf81c38ca])"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = a17915d9-3a64-f643-dd62-fe715f72d881
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_State_OnStage = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:a17915d9-3a64-f643-dd62-fe715f72d881
msgctxt "h6b4b9775gbc51g4210gbaa2g248004888fe7"
msgid ""
"Besides - we gotta agree stakes before we begin, don't we? "
"([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-be548b134c54])"
msgstr ""
"게다가, 시작하기 전에 먼저 판돈부터 정해야 하지 않겠어? "
"([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-be548b134c54])"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = a2a3cd47-6fb1-3b91-aef5-defde552183e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_TriedToCheat(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_GoalScored = True
#.   Object:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_ChaseEnded(1) = True
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_GameInProgress(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_State_GoalScored = False
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_State_ChaseEnded(1) = False
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_State_GameInProgress(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:a2a3cd47-6fb1-3b91-aef5-defde552183e
msgctxt "h062543e3g0b49g4342g85bfgad87a91808f6"
msgid "All right, <i>all right</i>. Take your money."
msgstr "알았어, <i>알겠다구</i>. 돈 가져가."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = a2f3ec54-16bd-0ad0-aefc-8192f9718726
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_State_OnStage = False
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_CommentatorIsPermaDefeated = False
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_PlayingChase = False
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_BallIsDead = False
#.   Object:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_AcceptedBet(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:a2f3ec54-16bd-0ad0-aefc-8192f9718726
msgctxt "h0cfe1dcdg8b3bg42eeg8fceg2d44ccbf970b"
msgid "That's the spirit! Now show me the coin."
msgstr "바로 그거지! 이제 동전을 보여줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a8f76c50-b0ff-b306-33ff-77ae93705131
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:a8f76c50-b0ff-b306-33ff-77ae93705131
msgctxt "h16bf85e1g51d7g41c8g92e9g60bc37dfef05"
msgid "That's a bit steep for me."
msgstr "내게는 좀 벅찬 금액이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = a9371b8c-76ae-cbbc-20be-a1c083c9c6dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:a9371b8c-76ae-cbbc-20be-a1c083c9c6dc
msgctxt "h3cc54d4bg2eb7g410fg9ecdg914756d2a62c"
msgid ""
"Gotta do it quick, and <i>alone -</i> any of your mates step in, you lose. "
"Time runs out, you <i>lose.</i>"
msgstr "<i>혼자서</i> 최대한 빠르게 해야 돼. 네 친구 중 누구라도 끼어들면 패배야. 시간이 다 지나도 <i>패배야.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aa6ffdca-fb9a-9e9f-d1fb-ac4c4a8fb04b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:aa6ffdca-fb9a-9e9f-d1fb-ac4c4a8fb04b
msgctxt "h9834ca18g3d5dg48c3gb265g3f13937b8b05"
msgid "I owe you nothing - I didn't kill it."
msgstr "네게 빚진 거 없어 - 내가 죽인 거 아냐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aaf62ef9-bd96-2e48-62f0-c21cbf2ab098
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - Debug_GOB_ChickenChase_State_FireDisabled = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:aaf62ef9-bd96-2e48-62f0-c21cbf2ab098
msgctxt "hb8b0f4c3ga4bcg418dg8bb2gf9a6b04efbf6"
msgid "Your rules didn't say anything about <i>fire.</i>"
msgstr "네 규칙에 <i>불</i>에 대한 건 없었는걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = ae2d522f-e306-89f3-09e8-892d4461cba9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_GoalScored = True
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_OwlbearReplacedChicken = True
#.   Object:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_ChaseEnded(1) = True
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_GameInProgress(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_State_GoalScored = False
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_State_ChaseEnded(1) = False
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_State_GameInProgress(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:ae2d522f-e306-89f3-09e8-892d4461cba9
msgctxt "h195683e7g5e78g473dg88b5g3ce88dc5bb2b"
msgid ""
"Well lookee! That thing works even better'n a chicken. Reckon we won't eat "
"it after all."
msgstr "저거봐! 저건 닭보다 더 열심이네. 끝나고 우리가 먹지 않아도 되겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = b00c931d-2e6c-0521-9198-cbadd68021b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_OwlbearReplacedChicken = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:b00c931d-2e6c-0521-9198-cbadd68021b9
msgctxt "h8814620cg8e86g44a1gaa12g94dd8b80dc26"
msgid ""
"You face that beastie down one on one. Gotta chase it through the posts "
"before your time's up."
msgstr "혼자서 저 귀염둥이를 제압해서 시간이 다 되기 전에 골대로 몰아넣으면 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = b36346e1-f8c0-4ba3-1089-79289a664f7f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:b36346e1-f8c0-4ba3-1089-79289a664f7f
msgctxt "h846ffa64gc1bag4cf3gba0bg166769212be7"
msgid ""
"You were chasin' it, and now it's dead. Seems clear enough to me - cough up."
msgstr "네가 몰다가 그게 죽어버렸잖아. 내겐 간단해 보이는걸 - 토해내."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = b54c6e6f-b3be-5b24-b57a-979e91c8b206
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:b54c6e6f-b3be-5b24-b57a-979e91c8b206
msgctxt "h7db313f2ge921g4c19gb331g87cb3bae7fbe"
msgid "Playin' it safe, eh? Ain't a game for the meek, mate."
msgstr "안전하게 거시겠다, 이건가? 소심한 애들을 위한 놀이가 아니야, 친구."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = b647d4d3-22dd-e996-c9b4-3361ec737505
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_PlacedBigBet(1) = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold_3 = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:b647d4d3-22dd-e996-c9b4-3361ec737505
msgctxt "he8c4ec2cg7f5ag4ed6gbdbag672d75dfc9f9"
msgid "What, can't take a joke? Fine, look-"
msgstr "뭐, 농담도 못해? 좋아, 이봐-"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = b85c9182-29ea-46ae-c50a-3b26c88e2ba2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:b85c9182-29ea-46ae-c50a-3b26c88e2ba2
msgctxt "he7d607dfg4d5bg45a1g8e19ga7642cb00baa"
msgid ""
"No skin off <i>my</i> arse. Just remember you 'ad the chance to be part o' "
"something grand - and you walked away."
msgstr "<i>내겐</i> 아무런 상관 없어. 넌 위대한 일에 참여할 수 있는 기회를 걷어차고 떠났다는 사실만 기억해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = bd56f91d-de8a-4338-360b-e6a75226c487
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator_KnowsTrueSoul(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:bd56f91d-de8a-4338-360b-e6a75226c487
msgctxt "hf08af981g0aacg405cg8d35g6bc309a9f9ff"
msgid ""
"Eh, no more games today, True Soul. We ain't worthy, what with the Absolute "
"on your side and all."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = be332771-e7aa-1bbf-d7f1-b960d4a93ff2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BERSERKER(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:be332771-e7aa-1bbf-d7f1-b960d4a93ff2
msgctxt "h49460c69g800fg45dag861cg988f52993c5c"
msgid "<b><i>ROAR. </i></b>"
msgstr "<b><i>으르렁. </i></b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = c2d9b5bb-4248-b26b-2765-5ed24c271088
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_GoalScored = False
#.   Object:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_ChaseEnded(1) = True
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_GameInProgress(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_State_ChaseEnded(1) = False
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_State_GameInProgress(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:c2d9b5bb-4248-b26b-2765-5ed24c271088
msgctxt "h0335af2fg7ea7g423eg8eb1gb254752d8834"
msgid "Oof. Hard luck, mate. Told you it weren't as easy as it looked."
msgstr "저런. 운이 나빴어, 친구. 보기보다 쉽지 않을 거라고 했잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = c2ff06fb-b5d1-94b3-37e7-db8bf8fcc779
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:c2ff06fb-b5d1-94b3-37e7-db8bf8fcc779
msgctxt "hbef661d4g0fe1g41fbga571g20f4a199f3bb"
msgid "Wait, it's bloody <i>gone. </i>Where the -"
msgstr "잠깐, 이 썩을 놈이 <i>사라졌잖아. </i>어디로 -"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = c4493b70-7b76-102c-4797-490bf0c0dace
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:c4493b70-7b76-102c-4797-490bf0c0dace
msgctxt "h540cda3cg842eg409cg9353g475a01f41888"
msgid ""
"He's a distraction. Don't get me wrong - it's funny pokin' 'im and watchin' "
"'im holler."
msgstr "저 노래는 정신 사납기만 해. 오해하진 마 - 저놈을 찔러대면서 자지러지는 걸 보는 건 재밌으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = c822b956-b26c-42fb-2d21-b88fafe29a10
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_State_PlayingChase = True
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_State_GameInProgress(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:c822b956-b26c-42fb-2d21-b88fafe29a10
msgctxt "h3902badfgeff9g481fg86deg4458ebfa367a"
msgid "We got the coin, we got the challenger - now we just need a crowd, eh?"
msgstr "동전도 얻었고 도전자도 찾았으니, 이제 관중만 있으면 되겠군 그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = c859af1c-5ebb-ce86-90bb-cc3f79dd1c3e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator_HasMet(1) = True
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator_State_AfraidofDrow(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:c859af1c-5ebb-ce86-90bb-cc3f79dd1c3e
msgctxt "hc98040ecga57dg4d0agbe27g44dde39e1d5d"
msgid "You got your money, right? Don't want no trouble."
msgstr "돈 받았잖아, 그치? 문제 없으면 좋겠는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = c8af0afb-11d6-0a2d-6615-2c95597c5942
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_Knows_ChaseRules = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:c8af0afb-11d6-0a2d-6615-2c95597c5942
msgctxt "hb0f794bfg898dg43edg8a29gaf3b99826d8d"
msgid ""
"You just gotta chase the chicken around the course and through the posts - "
"but that ain't all."
msgstr "저기 보이는 길을 따라서 말뚝 사이로 닭을 몰면 돼. 하지만 그게 다가 아니지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = cb1eb40c-fdc0-e551-5ad8-bd68fe17c27b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_State_OnStage = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:cb1eb40c-fdc0-e551-5ad8-bd68fe17c27b
msgctxt "haf593403g100dg4284g9f10g817c9d52a973"
msgid "Bloody bard. Used to be goblins had <i>taste.</i>"
msgstr "망할 바드 녀석. 고블린들도 <i>미적 감각</i>이란 게 있었는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = cd3aa0c8-290f-c108-c601-dd0822a7e092
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GEN_TransferNPCPayment_3(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:cd3aa0c8-290f-c108-c601-dd0822a7e092
msgctxt "h360200dbgdf0bg4eecgaa5dgd23301679b86"
msgid "Heh. Here, your coin - were only a joke! Heh, <i>rules.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = ceda31bb-9c1a-5ad1-8942-a17e95cba25b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator_HasMet(1) = True
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_AskedForCompensation(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_BallIsDead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:ceda31bb-9c1a-5ad1-8942-a17e95cba25b
msgctxt "hcf33cf4egbeb1g4a3dg863cg9f628b620ff5"
msgid "What? Ain't nothin' left to chase, unless you fancy volunteerin'."
msgstr "뭐라고? 이제 쫓을 게 없어, 네가 자원하겠다는 게 아니라면."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = d02cd5c1-689a-a750-84a3-6d604e9bc098
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:d02cd5c1-689a-a750-84a3-6d604e9bc098
msgctxt "hb7f6ef34g67c6g4a56g860bg46cc134de773"
msgid ""
"I'll do <i>you</i> a favour, and pretend you ain't trying to steal my "
"chicken."
msgstr "내가 <i>너</i>한테 한 번 양보해줄게, 네가 내 닭을 훔치는 거 속아 줄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d122aed7-3cdc-e618-2e85-727690964fa5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:d122aed7-3cdc-e618-2e85-727690964fa5
msgctxt "h69a08da1g9565g403bga817gf1cc79b5ee9c"
msgid "If you have a point, why don't you just get to it?"
msgstr "요점이 있다면, 바로 말해 주지 않을래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = d52a06ac-63fc-c1eb-75d7-c6a1f5441292
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:d52a06ac-63fc-c1eb-75d7-c6a1f5441292
msgctxt "h1a617c30g7076g4fe5gade7g5fc04aa2ef6e"
msgid "Might do. Don't plan on being the dead'un, though - <i>lads!</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = d644eb10-1930-f564-59c9-071e4336c206
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:d644eb10-1930-f564-59c9-071e4336c206
msgctxt "hc57bef40g9bcbg48d3g9e7fg19fe1fce76ca"
msgid ""
"And you're gonna need it, mate. This ain't your standard dungeon-dive, "
"right. This..."
msgstr "그게 필요할 거야, 친구. 이건 평범한 지하 감옥 탐색 같은 게 아니니까. 이건..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d720e70f-aaf7-f066-310d-56aa58bccd66
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount3(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount3(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:d720e70f-aaf7-f066-310d-56aa58bccd66
msgctxt "h18274ea7gbe68g44ebgbadeg9020d1286d01"
msgid "*Your mind lurches, reeling suddenly as if... bitten.*"
msgstr "*뭔가에 깨물린 것처럼 느닷없이 정신이 휘청거립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = d7712673-6896-831b-eb20-d0356307b744
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_BallIsDead = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator_HasMet(1) = True
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_State_AskedForCompensation(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:d7712673-6896-831b-eb20-d0356307b744
msgctxt "h35903c0ag63f8g49c3gaeadgbfaf6d96ebae"
msgid "What? Ain't nothin' left to chase, unless you fancy volunteerin'."
msgstr "뭐라고? 이제 쫓을 게 없어, 네가 자원하겠다는 게 아니라면."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = d773bde0-deee-060b-d85f-7d259ce7b447
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:d773bde0-deee-060b-d85f-7d259ce7b447
msgctxt "h83c7281cge2e0g496bg8831gab0862ac9a83"
msgid "Bump your head last time or what? Ain't difficult, mate."
msgstr "머리를 부딪히기라도 한 거야? 어려운 거 아니잖아, 친구야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = d8b6363a-95fe-090a-29d2-6919cfc03f0b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_Event_OwlbearAcquired = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:d8b6363a-95fe-090a-29d2-6919cfc03f0b
msgctxt "h97f4d5f5g4e99g40aag8d09g4af8fa247fa2"
msgid "Right, go on then - fat bird's yours. Don't need the hassle."
msgstr "알았어, 그럼 - 뚱뚱한 새는 네거야. 귀찮은 건 사양이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = da3d41df-7cdd-b890-dae9-60c36638ddea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:da3d41df-7cdd-b890-dae9-60c36638ddea
msgctxt "h850fed25g10a9g4a21g896dgd449a6e2ebe5"
msgid "You'll be returning my coin - <i>and</i> all of yours."
msgstr "내 돈을 다 돌려줘야 할 거야, 그리고 네가 가진 전부도 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = db40c53a-06f4-3ca8-ceba-dbab74f2b6e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:db40c53a-06f4-3ca8-ceba-dbab74f2b6e7
msgctxt "hbbf32c2dg0a8cg4b53g9d66g4113b1f70ed3"
msgid "Hardly. Let's play."
msgstr "전혀. 해보자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e07e08c0-ac64-5a08-4e96-6253aeacdd8e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:e07e08c0-ac64-5a08-4e96-6253aeacdd8e
msgctxt "h295072a3gb978g439ag9e25g962613894536"
msgid "I have no desire to gamble."
msgstr "도박에 참여할 생각은 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e0a3323d-6af5-2e93-7f0e-e8961630d4cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold_2 = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GEN_TransferNPCPayment_2(1) = True
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_State_PlacedBigBet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:e0a3323d-6af5-2e93-7f0e-e8961630d4cb
msgctxt "h62437c7age7dcg41bega02dg8a92e5fce247"
msgid ""
"I like my chances. I'll bet more. ([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_2_463b0f43-5410"
"-412d-aba3-875cf81c38ca])"
msgstr ""
"내 운을 믿어. 더 걸겠어. ([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_2_463b0f43-5410-412d-"
"aba3-875cf81c38ca])"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = e3204256-a408-cda4-c4e1-133940229d20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_OwlbearReplacedChicken = False
#.   Object:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_PlacedBigBet(1) = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold_3 = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GEN_TransferNPCPayment_3(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:e3204256-a408-cda4-c4e1-133940229d20
msgctxt "he2ed8689g6f33g4eabg9fb9g0ce2e2a6baa8"
msgid "I swear, I nearly think you're in league with that bloody chicken."
msgstr "맹세할게, 난 네가 그 젠장할 닭과 거의 한패라고 생각했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = e46aa756-c77c-6f4d-c0dd-aeefd250a413
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:e46aa756-c77c-6f4d-c0dd-aeefd250a413
msgctxt "hc533c401gb8fcg45ccga044g40d6834a4dc6"
msgid ""
"I'd like to see 'em face a real test. Somethin' like... <i>chicken-"
"chasin'</i>."
msgstr "난 그들이 진짜 시험에 직면하는 것을 보고 싶어. 예를 들어... <i>닭 몰이 게임</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e4af2471-30a3-0b33-a37f-87e64d3e1c32
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#.      - ILLITHID(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:e4af2471-30a3-0b33-a37f-87e64d3e1c32
msgctxt "h05473937g9dd8g40b1g843bgd6b61fb300b6"
msgid "I don't care what you think. I'm not asking."
msgstr "네 생각을 묻는 게 아니야. 이건 명령이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = e66e6ca4-9c33-d578-4f58-c71180c98ae3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_State_OnStage = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator_HasMet(1) = True
#. TagRule: HUMAN
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:e66e6ca4-9c33-d578-4f58-c71180c98ae3
msgctxt "ha3d62527g6ec6g417fg9b52gdcf786ac3fe0"
msgid ""
"Hells, that yowlin' bleeds the ears. Bloody human. No offence, mind - just "
"that ain't <i>entertainment</i>."
msgstr "망할, 저놈 목소리 때문에 귀에 피가 나겠어. 빌어먹을 인간. 기분 나쁘게 듣진 마, 그냥 저건 오락 축에도 못 낄 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = e66e6ca4-9c33-d578-4f58-c71180c98ae3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_State_OnStage = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:e66e6ca4-9c33-d578-4f58-c71180c98ae3
msgctxt "h0e3d3b8aga2b6g4c00g9539ge4a986961a7a"
msgid ""
"Hells, that yowlin' bleeds the ears. Is that supposed to be "
"<i>entertainment?</i>"
msgstr "망할, 저놈 목소리 때문에 귀에 피가 나겠어. 저런 걸 <i>오락이라고 부른단 말이야?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = e73e176e-766a-e944-0d68-74f7e1f10e14
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:e73e176e-766a-e944-0d68-74f7e1f10e14
msgctxt "h2ea373bcg7766g4c04gb08egc435d3b706ce"
msgid "Only the greatest game since eggs sprouted legs, mate."
msgstr "알에서 다리가 돋아난 이후 발명된 최고의 게임이야, 친구."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e7f15bac-e845-93f4-cf88-5384da4d939a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:e7f15bac-e845-93f4-cf88-5384da4d939a
msgctxt "hd7b3a28eg9072g427bg93b2g28d4eae97932"
msgid "We're having fun. Why ruin it now?"
msgstr "우리 모두 즐거웠잖아. 왜 재미를 망치는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e88ab0da-4357-f6ec-97dc-6f724f976106
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_Quest_Winner(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:e88ab0da-4357-f6ec-97dc-6f724f976106
msgctxt "h54c5ed0bg6791g4a48gb6e0g25260106b4b8"
msgid "You rigged the game. I want my money back."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ea0e6272-0fff-553a-56ba-4bd103b34e17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - GLO_TadpoleIntro_NPC(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:ea0e6272-0fff-553a-56ba-4bd103b34e17
msgctxt "hd47f245bga5bdg438dgb9f3g22b6d487aa58"
msgid "*As the symbol glows, power courses through you. <i>Authority</i>.*"
msgstr "*문양이 빛나며, 몸에 흐르는 힘이 느껴집니다. <i>권위</i>.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = ea184670-7865-1d1d-c024-41eb21012cf2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:ea184670-7865-1d1d-c024-41eb21012cf2
msgctxt "hd4e53ff8gb7fbg4372g9046gc0622cab8004"
msgid "It's got feathers, don't it? A beak?"
msgstr "얘 깃털 있잖아, 안 보여? 부리도 있잖아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = ec1b37b9-d5c4-c991-f271-ce6032c702cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:ec1b37b9-d5c4-c991-f271-ce6032c702cb
msgctxt "hbf21e4dag6facg44baga9f7g66e507c194ba"
msgid "Do you now? Or what - gonna cry?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = ecf88dbd-53f4-5f43-b9cb-b20ed07bbcba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:ecf88dbd-53f4-5f43-b9cb-b20ed07bbcba
msgctxt "hac9caceag2344g41dcg9b3dg6762e29fd91f"
msgid "Now bugger off - if you ain't playin' you're just wastin' my time.\n"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = ee75a003-05f0-4127-70be-1a63b88d5789
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_PlacedBigBet(1) = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold_3 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:ee75a003-05f0-4127-70be-1a63b88d5789
msgctxt "haf2a8e8egf099g4913gbaddg319c97f0508d"
msgid ""
"The Underdark? Aye, I've, uh - I've 'ad litter-mates disappear down there."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = f01b3377-6ef2-8d25-391f-9a6e4f7a47b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:f01b3377-6ef2-8d25-391f-9a6e4f7a47b3
msgctxt "h4673173fg05f6g4aa9gae8eg72c3e397a88b"
msgid ""
"Well who ever heard o' chicken chase without <i>fire? </i>We're not bloody "
"amateurs."
msgstr "너 말야 닭 몰이 할 때 <i>불</i> 안 쓰는 것 들어 봤어? 우린 지랄 같은 아마추어가 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f3518808-f1af-81fc-8ccd-78685b10878a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:f3518808-f1af-81fc-8ccd-78685b10878a
msgctxt "hea763ba7gb925g4b71g8a75g6417775be1fd"
msgid "I want to go again."
msgstr "다시 할래."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = f4cbcd4b-2d4d-f599-3def-55258d7063e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:f4cbcd4b-2d4d-f599-3def-55258d7063e6
msgctxt "h97c82da0gb534g4a4cg9f3cgc546d927dfba"
msgid "Reckon it owes us a game. You wanna hear the rules or not?"
msgstr "그 정도면 한 게임 빚졌다고 할 수 있지. 규칙을 들을 거야 말 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = f53b93a9-f14c-f58f-ba37-a5f3dc3565af
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_OwlbearReplacedChicken = True
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_PlayedOnce = False
#.   Object:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_GameInProgress(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:f53b93a9-f14c-f58f-ba37-a5f3dc3565af
msgctxt "hcf7fd9a5g50f3g473fgb828ga89490762e9e"
msgid ""
"Brave enough to take on our new chicken? It's a big'un, but that's just more "
"for the chasin'."
msgstr "우리의 새로운 닭을 상대할 용기가 있나? 녀석은 덩치가 크지만, 그만큼 모는 재미도 더 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f59201e1-4809-27b6-ff83-cbd694a3d15a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:f59201e1-4809-27b6-ff83-cbd694a3d15a
msgctxt "hee47b711g3519g4c52ga90bg54a0b11809c9"
msgid "What are the rules, again?"
msgstr "규칙이 어떻게 된다고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f64378b0-a5da-01ca-d3f0-40e66790bb4a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:f64378b0-a5da-01ca-d3f0-40e66790bb4a
msgctxt "h6e2463a3g4c9dg4015g9a61g50ec8108a232"
msgid "All that and more."
msgstr "그 모든 걸 갖춘 데다 그것보다 뛰어나지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = f68e0a7d-d17c-d870-a84c-35f0ab7cb69d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_GoblinToast_State_CrowdGathered = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:f68e0a7d-d17c-d870-a84c-35f0ab7cb69d
msgctxt "hce2754d8g557dg464dg9acfg2528064bbc3a"
msgid ""
"Simple, see? But not easy, no. Come back when them fools are done speechin' -"
" you'll see."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f94500eb-7923-b921-4729-9916dc2d4142
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:f94500eb-7923-b921-4729-9916dc2d4142
msgctxt "h2c9147deg1bdbg4d91ga19bg7f0dcaffda0a"
msgid "You love this game enough to die over it?"
msgstr "너는 이 게임을 죽도록 사랑하나 보지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fa250d60-4667-e1a6-5cc1-e65a4a3fad1c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:fa250d60-4667-e1a6-5cc1-e65a4a3fad1c
msgctxt "had76df53ge670g49fagab9cgabad6de13e53"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = fa44f2dd-ea3d-d175-8fce-ad155e824b7b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:fa44f2dd-ea3d-d175-8fce-ad155e824b7b
msgctxt "h2a941253ga671g47c4gb99cgae58e6601efe"
msgid ""
"No doubt, mate. But this ain't dragons, or demons, or anything else you "
"might've faced. This..."
msgstr "의심의 여지가 없지, 친구. 하지만 드래곤, 데몬, 혹은 너가 마주한 그 외의 것들은 없어. 이건..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = fb6a6251-67ee-6182-c36b-5991ff216c94
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_State_OnStage = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:fb6a6251-67ee-6182-c36b-5991ff216c94
msgctxt "h5a93098dg2690g40ceg8d27g324ed34e9f44"
msgid ""
"Sound easy? It <i>ain't.</i> Come back when that half-wit's done wailin' and "
"find out."
msgstr "쉬울 것 같지? 전혀 <i>그렇지 않아.</i> 저 멍청이가 투덜대는 걸 멈추면 그때 다시 와서 보라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = fdeb3004-e312-4396-8a9f-cb3450c87388
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_OwlbearReplacedChicken = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:fdeb3004-e312-4396-8a9f-cb3450c87388
msgctxt "hec100fc8g1b3eg4290g9688gd9e3d9fabfdc"
msgid ""
"You face that chicken down one on one. Gotta chase it through the posts "
"before your time's up."
msgstr "너 혼자서 그 닭과 맞서야 해. 시간이 다 가기 전에 그 닭을 기둥 사이로 몰아야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = feb00432-71fb-c82f-4ab2-0fa94027c981
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:feb00432-71fb-c82f-4ab2-0fa94027c981
msgctxt "h9981b17cg50c0g47dbg9f92g643e9ff6b831"
msgid ""
"Wonderful! And you got coin to back ya? "
"([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-be548b134c54])"
msgstr ""
"좋았어! 걸 돈은 있고? ([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-"
"be548b134c54])"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = fee9141f-e4ea-5dcc-d4d2-9f860fcaeb62
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.     - TRUESOUL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Commentator:fee9141f-e4ea-5dcc-d4d2-9f860fcaeb62
msgctxt "h0ed9af63gd202g443fg8a46gb2b435710cc8"
msgid ""
"*Your mind is full, bursting with ecstasy and terror. Finally, it is coming. "
"You are becoming.*"
msgstr "*당신의 정신이 황홀경과 공포로 가득 차오릅니다. 마침내, 때가 됐군요. 당신은 변화 중입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_GameOver
#. Speaker = Krolla
#. NodeID = e75d3ca4-7606-42b6-8bf9-46aa2d0348d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_GameOver:e75d3ca4-7606-42b6-8bf9-46aa2d0348d5
msgctxt "h74eb94c5gd094g4a7cgbde9g089c6f74ad38"
msgid "That's the game done. C'mere!"
msgstr "게임 끝이야. 이리 와!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0192183d-d5f7-befe-5a6b-3da3ff82ae04
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear:0192183d-d5f7-befe-5a6b-3da3ff82ae04
msgctxt "hde1c1d2dg3463g4a82gb942g67e11adbe0a9"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0d49aca3-c896-c559-38f0-b71746bfc057
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_Knows_ChaseRules = True
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_BallOnField = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - RANGER(1) = False
#.      - DRUID(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear:0d49aca3-c896-c559-38f0-b71746bfc057
msgctxt "h1a318daag6544g4999gaacdg0cc849ffdb3d"
msgid "See those posts? Run toward them."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 10402276-5a5b-b905-e8fb-de2daa77a24c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_OwlbearCub_Event_InvitedToCamp = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_OwlbearCub_Event_InvitedToCamp = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear:10402276-5a5b-b905-e8fb-de2daa77a24c
msgctxt "h0f32af83gc1c8g4281gbfb9ga34ebc0502ea"
msgid ""
"<i>Offer him your hand. He can follow your scent to your camp in the "
"wilderness.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그에게 손을 내민다. 그는 황야에서 당신의 냄새를 쫓아 야영지에 이를 수 있다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1bc99212-8e05-67f3-57cc-96d50887f007
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_Knows_ChaseRules = True
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_BallOnField = True
#. TagRule: DRUID or RANGER
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear:1bc99212-8e05-67f3-57cc-96d50887f007
msgctxt "h7a4289e8g1122g47b7g9143gcc7eea0def1c"
msgid "<i>Nod to the goalposts - he'll be safe there.</i>"
msgstr "<i>골대를 향해 고개를 끄덕인다. 그곳은 안전할 거야.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 1ca11256-ae41-1bbf-457c-996fbaf0e798
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_State_AngeredOwlbear = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear:1ca11256-ae41-1bbf-457c-996fbaf0e798
msgctxt "h7a5c27e3gc1aeg452bgbd0fgc3d297a2713d"
msgid ""
"*The cub's feathers ruffle in distrust. With a defiant squawk, he bounds "
"away.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 28cceb03-fa8e-86df-ac6a-b3e2b859421c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Owlbear_HasMet_Chasing(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_PlayingChase = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 7611fa51-4b1b-3d2c-a8a5-74c04d9db7fa_AnimalHandlingSuccess = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear:28cceb03-fa8e-86df-ac6a-b3e2b859421c
msgctxt "hbf38cc0agf92cg47acgbd6cgcb7a8fec21ac"
msgid ""
"*The cub breathes in shallow bursts, his chest heaving with the effort.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2d1a8ad2-91fc-2ac2-3ffd-8ab66dbfa0d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = True
#. TagRule: BERSERKER
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear:2d1a8ad2-91fc-2ac2-3ffd-8ab66dbfa0d7
msgctxt "hd2cb832dg8b99g4ff1g86d8g9ec043987832"
msgid "The goblins hurt you - <b>CRUSH THEM</b>."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2d1a8ad2-91fc-2ac2-3ffd-8ab66dbfa0d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear:2d1a8ad2-91fc-2ac2-3ffd-8ab66dbfa0d7
msgctxt "h49496033g04a9g4da3gbd88g25f47a6f3a5d"
msgid "The goblins tried to hurt you. Show them what hurt really means."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2d9ff558-b20a-3c60-7e07-6e6fd1eabb06
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Owlbear_State_FailedAnimalHandling(1) = False
#.   Local:
#.      - 7611fa51-4b1b-3d2c-a8a5-74c04d9db7fa_AnimalHandlingSuccess = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear:2d9ff558-b20a-3c60-7e07-6e6fd1eabb06
msgctxt "hb764a75bg05c7g4dddg9d3dg5ddba90117b8"
msgid "<i>Kneel - you won't hurt it.</i>"
msgstr "<i>해치지 않는다는 뜻으로 무릎을 꿇는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear
#. Speaker = Owlbear Cub
#. NodeID = 309d5ad1-a0cc-c439-4cfd-2c229a8102a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Owlbear_HasMet_NotChasing(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_PlayingChase = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Owlbear_HasMet_NotChasing(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear:309d5ad1-a0cc-c439-4cfd-2c229a8102a7
msgctxt "h80722415g4843g4502gaf0eg091961053a4e"
msgid "*Hroo-hoot!*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 34ccb571-8c09-12b6-2817-d46d164a7238
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear:34ccb571-8c09-12b6-2817-d46d164a7238
msgctxt "h13bebbd4g6741g4a9bgbc83g345f1800a7e2"
msgid "<i>Guide his gaze to the goblins - they deserve to die.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그의 시선을 고블린에게로 인도한다 - 그들은 죽어 마땅하다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 37f173b0-353e-21a1-e029-4d2b71d19d3d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear:37f173b0-353e-21a1-e029-4d2b71d19d3d
msgctxt "hb337e84eg138ag4189gb74age8f6cb10576b"
msgid ""
"*The cub seems anxious to leave, but afraid to defy the goblins. They have "
"to be dealt with, one way or another.*"
msgstr "*새끼는 떠나고 싶어하지만, 고블린들에게 반항하는 것을 두려워합니다. 어떤 식으로든, 그들을 처리해야 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4079d368-c3e2-d6ce-03cf-69b48c76a62e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_Festivities_BallToldAboutGates(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear:4079d368-c3e2-d6ce-03cf-69b48c76a62e
msgctxt "h088b2ea7g38e3g4833ga86ag854271caf1d1"
msgid "*The owlbear coos softly. He doesn't understand - but he trusts you.*"
msgstr "*아울베어가 부드럽게 울음소리를 냅니다. 그는 당신의 말을 이해하지 못하지만, 당신을 믿고 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 55395fef-5ce7-0228-0012-e0efb77aadde
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Owlbear_HasMet_NotChasing(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_PlayingChase = False
#.   Local:
#.      - 7611fa51-4b1b-3d2c-a8a5-74c04d9db7fa_AnimalHandlingSuccess = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear:55395fef-5ce7-0228-0012-e0efb77aadde
msgctxt "hcf12d41bgef1bg45efg8b12g04e5fc35a8b9"
msgid "*The cub looks at you with dulled eyes. He longs for home.*"
msgstr "*새끼는 멍한 눈으로 당신을 바라봅니다. 집을 그리워하고 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5790efbf-a7b1-b6d8-351f-cf3904bb9692
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear:5790efbf-a7b1-b6d8-351f-cf3904bb9692
msgctxt "hb92db106gc424g4d60g86aeg7716a5b21b8c"
msgid ""
"*... it's <i>furious. </i>Rage blazes within it. Tear. Hunt. <i>Kill.*</i>"
msgstr "*... 이것은 <i>화가 나 있습니다. </i>분노가 내면에 타오릅니다. 찢는다. 사냥한다. <i>죽인다.*</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear
#. Speaker = Owlbear Cub
#. NodeID = 58d942a6-4b53-ce36-476b-69c96c98f29a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Owlbear_HasMet_Chasing(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_PlayingChase = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Owlbear_HasMet_Chasing(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear:58d942a6-4b53-ce36-476b-69c96c98f29a
msgctxt "h13bfc159g8efbg45b0ga5cdgbfd26dcdf88e"
msgid "*Screech!*"
msgstr "*끼이익!*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6b5ab48e-02cd-ea14-289d-e7b3e8d45e65
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear:6b5ab48e-02cd-ea14-289d-e7b3e8d45e65
msgctxt "h24884f29g0e97g482dgb189ga576dbe1098d"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear
#. Speaker = Owlbear Cub
#. NodeID = 6ba808c2-ce68-1838-0c5e-3915d9681233
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_ChickenChase_State_AngeredOwlbear = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear:6ba808c2-ce68-1838-0c5e-3915d9681233
msgctxt "ha1e874ebg10f3g4e34gbb4cg9ab8ea350346"
msgid "No! Hurt! Run!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear
#. Speaker = Owlbear Cub
#. NodeID = 6e468230-bafc-bdc4-a7a0-0fbebbf798f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_AngeredOwlbear = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear:6e468230-bafc-bdc4-a7a0-0fbebbf798f7
msgctxt "h5304b562g5bcag405fga823gee6bf28d8d78"
msgid "Go! Bite! <i>Bite</i>!"
msgstr "가서 물어! <i>물어뜯어버려</i>!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_ChickenChase_Owlbear
#. Speaker = Owlbear Cub
#. NodeID = 6fda0ccc-c0ca-249d-9a67-ebd4f335840c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Owlbear_HasMet_NotChasing(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_PlayingChase = False
#.   Local:
