msgctxt "h3ded890aga5ebg4986g9ebege09ec68a2d1d"
msgid ""
"Don't push it, <i>worm</i>. I can still bash yer face in. Yeah, I think I "
"will."
msgstr "우쭐대지 마, <i>벌레</i> 자식아. 내가 네 얼굴을 깨부술 수도 있으니까. 아니, 그럴 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_DrunkGoblin
#. Speaker = Crusher
#. NodeID = 45abb564-5fef-cbad-ae09-18e02ad4c022
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_DrunkGoblin:45abb564-5fef-cbad-ae09-18e02ad4c022
msgctxt "h84e0778fg6ad3g4b1dg9b8fg8fb01726acb3"
msgid "Everyone says that. And then they spit in our faces."
msgstr "모두들 그렇게 말하지. 그러고는 우리 얼굴에 침을 뱉는 주제에."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_DrunkGoblin
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 48ad4d77-ab6d-a8fe-e2fe-8f6843ced455
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_DrunkGoblin:48ad4d77-ab6d-a8fe-e2fe-8f6843ced455
msgctxt "hd7f56f8dg1a65g4afegbb45g7475968e2710"
msgid ""
"*His lips smack together wetly and leave a trail of saliva on your foot.*"
msgstr "*그의 입술이 당신의 발에 촉촉하게 부딪히며 침 자국을 남깁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_DrunkGoblin
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4ab12276-ce7d-ad06-c88c-497839b6abeb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_DrunkGoblin:4ab12276-ce7d-ad06-c88c-497839b6abeb
msgctxt "h3ae1e85eg0b3ag499cgb359gdbbf68ecd664"
msgid "<i>Ignore your lust to eat the foot. Get down to lick it.</i>"
msgstr "<i>발을 먹고 싶은 욕망을 무시한다. 엎드려서 발을 핥는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_DrunkGoblin
