msgid ""
"*Something stirs deep within you, hungry and alert... it's taking something "
"you'll never get back.*"
msgstr "*몸 깊숙한 데서 굶주리고 기민한 존재가 꿈틀댑니다... 잃으면 되찾지 못할 뭔가를 좀먹고 있군요.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_DrunkGoblin
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4ede7e7c-8672-48d2-d072-56fbf4004c69
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount4(4) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(4) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount4(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_DrunkGoblin:4ede7e7c-8672-48d2-d072-56fbf4004c69
msgctxt "hce9862d0gc14eg4b2agbf8fg758b36fe3256"
msgid ""
"*A shadow swims across your vision, and a familiar voice tells you to be "
"calm. You are loved.*"
msgstr "*그림자가 낀 듯이 눈앞이 흐려지더니, 익숙한 목소리가 당신을 달래줍니다. 사랑이 느껴집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_DrunkGoblin
