msgid ""
"Two hundred years of slavery, and that was still the most humiliating thing "
"I've ever seen."
msgstr "나도 이백 년 간 노예였지만, 방금은 내가 본 것중 가장 수치스러운 짓이었다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_DrunkGoblin
