msgctxt "h3733001eg4e78g443bga1cfg87a62393bcb5"
msgid "Do I need to rip your earshells off? You heard me."
msgstr "내가 네 귀껍데기를 찢어야겠어? 내 말 들었잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_DrunkGoblin
