msgctxt "hb7f3c222g9a2fg4b26ga3ddg6876eb5998ce"
msgid ""
"You'd yield to a mere maggot? <i>Chk.</i> I didn't think you so depraved."
msgstr "고작 그런 구더기같은 놈에게 굴복한다고? <i>츠크.</i> 네가 그런 추잡한 자식일 줄이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_DrunkGoblin
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b3b3c675-0556-69a2-079f-a4003d31b610
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
