msgctxt "h981af84fgd211g498fg8d82gc61b69bd55f8"
msgid "C'mere, just you, me, and my friends 'ere."
msgstr "이리 와. 너와 나, 그리고 내 친구들만."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_DrunkGoblin
