msgctxt "h2000f280g9f4bg42eega560g377ce5ee0ade"
msgid "A fine show of force. The worms shall feast tonight."
msgstr "힘을 잘 과시했군. 오늘은 지렁이들이 포식하겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_DrunkGoblin_FistFight
