msgctxt "h327c63bbg2a8cg4dbfgb60cg1c3d8d4acea4"
msgid "What? Get - oh, s-sorry. I - I didn't know who I was talkin' to."
msgstr "뭐야? 당장 - 오, 죄-죄송합니다. 제-제가 누구와 대화하는지 모르고 있었어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_DrunkGoblin_Friend2
#. Speaker = Brawler Tiny
#. NodeID = 3e75f3ba-04e9-e3d7-8f6a-0b2cbd2b72b0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
