msgctxt "hf8569081g1983g4258g9411g5f1cf27aea9c"
msgid "The only cure is drinking more - as fast as you can."
msgstr "술을 더 퍼마시면 해결될걸. 최대한 빨리 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin006
#. Speaker = Sharp-Eye Aggy
#. NodeID = 20454701-0123-120f-4a2f-b3d3b27b2789
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin006:20454701-0123-120f-4a2f-b3d3b27b2789
msgctxt "he2207123g6cc5g4bc2g9dccg2aafef465dcd"
msgid ""
"That's the plan! We looted an entire inn - brought back enough booze to "
"drown a dragon."
msgstr "바로 그거지! 우리가 여관을 싹 털었다구. 드래곤도 빠져 죽을 만한 양의 술을 챙겨왔지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin006
#. Speaker = Sharp-Eye Aggy
#. NodeID = 30e88094-197c-bbb6-494e-0a3d4eeb5927
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_PlayingChase = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin006:30e88094-197c-bbb6-494e-0a3d4eeb5927
msgctxt "h7a75ed3bgb35dg4ec4gbf4fg52eb96270df4"
msgid "My coin's on the chicken."
msgstr "닭에게 돈을 걸지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin006
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 687e7e61-4764-9d16-b5f9-7aa45b843812
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin006:687e7e61-4764-9d16-b5f9-7aa45b843812
msgctxt "h216006b1g08e9g4de8g9bc6g3c7ebff9456f"
msgid "Take it easy or you'll regret it in the morning."
msgstr "내일 아침에 후회하기 싫으면 적당히 퍼마시는 게 좋을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin006
#. Speaker = Sharp-Eye Aggy
#. NodeID = 6e1a891a-efc8-4a68-4b55-68d875bd073e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_GoblinToast_State_RealizedPoison = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin006:6e1a891a-efc8-4a68-4b55-68d875bd073e
msgctxt "heda40bb5gde65g49b8ga812g7efcba4f12ec"
msgid "I ain't never drinkin' again. <i>Never</i>."
msgstr "난 절대로 다시 술 안 마실거야. <i>절대로</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin006
#. Speaker = Sharp-Eye Aggy
#. NodeID = 74bdb7aa-2c93-3268-f1dd-52d8542ad7e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin006:74bdb7aa-2c93-3268-f1dd-52d8542ad7e8
msgctxt "he6483960g33bfg4dbbgbed0gc2cea4f7357c"
msgid ""
"Don't be soft. We looted an entire inn - brought back enough booze to drown "
"a dragon."
msgstr "약하게 굴기는. 우리가 여관 하나를 통째로 털어버렸는데, 용을 익사시킬 정도로 술을 가져왔지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin006
#. Speaker = Sharp-Eye Aggy
#. NodeID = 7fba154d-70e4-0de4-e3fc-f4d306a8a90b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DROWELF(1) = True
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin006:7fba154d-70e4-0de4-e3fc-f4d306a8a90b
msgctxt "h2100e0f7g8b79g4abag8862g64994a8b874e"
msgid ""
"That's the plan, mistress! We looted an entire inn - brought back enough "
"booze to drown a dragon."
msgstr "그게 계획이죠, 아가씨! 우리는 여관 하나를 통째로 털었습니다. 용 한 마리를 익사시킬 만큼의 술을 가져왔죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin006
#. Speaker = Sharp-Eye Aggy
#. NodeID = 7fba154d-70e4-0de4-e3fc-f4d306a8a90b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DROWELF(1) = True
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin006:7fba154d-70e4-0de4-e3fc-f4d306a8a90b
msgctxt "h962a80ddg2016g4e9bgaaeage465941596e0"
msgid ""
"That's the plan, mister! We looted an entire inn - brought back enough booze "
"to drown a dragon."
msgstr "그게 계획이죠, 선생님! 우리는 여관 하나를 통째로 털었습니다. 용 한 마리를 익사시킬 만큼의 술을 가져왔죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin006
#. Speaker = Sharp-Eye Aggy
#. NodeID = 7fba154d-70e4-0de4-e3fc-f4d306a8a90b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DROWELF(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin006:7fba154d-70e4-0de4-e3fc-f4d306a8a90b
msgctxt "h9c09f6fbg4a80g44cegb6b6gccba9b529365"
msgid ""
"That's the plan! We looted an entire inn - brought back enough booze to "
"drown a dragon."
msgstr "그게 계획이지! 우리는 여관 하나를 통째로 털었어. 용 한 마리를 익사시킬 만큼의 술을 가져왔지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin006
#. Speaker = Sharp-Eye Aggy
#. NodeID = a39af4c3-ca44-5a04-1862-11ce48041217
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ELF(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin006:a39af4c3-ca44-5a04-1862-11ce48041217
msgctxt "h6c9a2bbdg9ec4g452fg84a8gc0cf4f453162"
msgid "That's elves for you. Always thinkin' of <i>tomorrow</i>."
msgstr "그게 엘프란거야. 항상 <i>내일</i>만 생각하고 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin006
#. Speaker = Sharp-Eye Aggy
#. NodeID = d35f03a0-3082-a79b-ee0f-5796aa54a786
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin006:d35f03a0-3082-a79b-ee0f-5796aa54a786
msgctxt "h02ee93ecged3eg45cdg9a6ag665e8e579208"
msgid ""
"Here's to them we nicked it off! Down one mug of ale for every throat we cut!"
msgstr "우리가 훔친 것들을 위하여! 우리가 베어버린 모든 목에 한 잔씩의 에일을!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin006
#. Speaker = Sharp-Eye Aggy
#. NodeID = fb00591d-75e0-8386-77f7-f6b4b0b66502
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin006:fb00591d-75e0-8386-77f7-f6b4b0b66502
msgctxt "hf7f0ee98ga77bg4519g93dag6e817483b182"
msgid "Awshh... drink's goin' straight through me..."
msgstr "아쒸... 술이 배를 뚫고 지나가네..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin006
#. Speaker = Sharp-Eye Aggy
#. NodeID = fbbe1467-9186-c148-0af6-da8b30c697f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DROWELF(1) = True
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin006:fbbe1467-9186-c148-0af6-da8b30c697f5
msgctxt "hf4ea6e7agc9d7g459cg8740g65e08d1a334d"
msgid "Gobs don't get hangovers, mistress. Just big greasy poundin' headaches."
msgstr "고블린은 숙취가 없습니다, 아가씨. 그저 느끼하고 욱신거리는 큰 두통이 있을뿐입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin006
#. Speaker = Sharp-Eye Aggy
#. NodeID = fbbe1467-9186-c148-0af6-da8b30c697f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DROWELF(1) = True
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin006:fbbe1467-9186-c148-0af6-da8b30c697f5
msgctxt "h7f65733dg7184g4f04g8f3fga2efbb1b0898"
msgid "Gobs don't get hangovers, mister. Just big greasy poundin' headaches."
msgstr "고블린은 숙취가 없습니다, 나으리. 그저 느끼하고 욱신거리는 큰 두통이 있을뿐입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin006
#. Speaker = Sharp-Eye Aggy
#. NodeID = fbbe1467-9186-c148-0af6-da8b30c697f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DROWELF(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin006:fbbe1467-9186-c148-0af6-da8b30c697f5
msgctxt "h535bb2e8g2b7bg49ebg82dcg3d390193d45f"
msgid "Gobs don't get hangovers. Just big greasy poundin' headaches."
msgstr "고블린은 숙취가 없어. 그저 느끼하고 욱신거리는 큰 두통이 있을뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin006
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fd81f9f5-49f0-253f-d0f0-f0a46071b686
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_HALFLING(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin006:fd81f9f5-49f0-253f-d0f0-f0a46071b686
msgctxt "hba8d6329gaf48g4775g882fg684fe6a765d5"
msgid "Seems like quite the party - enjoy it!"
msgstr "꽤 큰 파티인가 본데 - 맘껏 즐겨!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007
#. Speaker = Warlock Gurk
#. NodeID = 03020408-eafb-2689-67a5-2899a0f50418
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007:03020408-eafb-2689-67a5-2899a0f50418
msgctxt "h9c542d91gab85g4438g83c6g2edba733c9f6"
msgid ""
"Hah! Knew I could smell sumfin' roasted. Thought it were just the dwarf."
msgstr "하! 뭐 굽는 냄새가 난다 했더니만. 드워프만 굽고 있는 게 아니었군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0eecdd72-946f-2b81-d815-fbbfeadbfb60
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007:0eecdd72-946f-2b81-d815-fbbfeadbfb60
msgctxt "h3ed4b880g552bg4cb1ga92bgec4a605c089e"
msgid "Can this priestess heal people too, or does she just brand them?"
msgstr "이 여사제가 치유도 할 수 있을까, 아니면 그냥 표식만 찍는 걸까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 27d654ca-1134-dd1f-ba47-cfdf58b35140
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BRANDED(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007:27d654ca-1134-dd1f-ba47-cfdf58b35140
msgctxt "hc1de8b56g8676g4e86ga753g72ce1607d3d0"
msgid "I don't have a brand. Yet."
msgstr "낙인 없어. 아직은."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007
#. Speaker = Warlock Gurk
#. NodeID = 32394c23-ab9c-b042-ef76-22817de242d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007:32394c23-ab9c-b042-ef76-22817de242d6
msgctxt "h02df3c16g3261g4961gba85gd52d32223507"
msgid "See for y'self. Head inside, and follow the sound o' squealin' novices."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007
#. Speaker = Warlock Gurk
#. NodeID = 33b215d9-923b-335c-cfff-0624dd0a69a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Absolute_Knows_GoblinsWorship = True
#.     - GLO_Absolute_Knows_Symbol = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007:33b215d9-923b-335c-cfff-0624dd0a69a6
msgctxt "h5280cd83g5069g46abgb8cegf62e38aa932d"
msgid "Mark of the Absolute, innit? Shows our devotion to 'er."
msgstr "절대자의 표식 아니겠어? 그분을 향한 우리의 헌신을 보여주는 증표지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3859a359-964e-9540-b7be-0f99aa0b672e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BRANDED(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007:3859a359-964e-9540-b7be-0f99aa0b672e
msgctxt "h3c57043eg63d8g4dcbg893ag338f9fcd3674"
msgid "<i>Show him your brand.</i>"
msgstr "<i>낙인을 보여준다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 573067d3-c392-98f9-0c52-eb4b8580df9a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BRANDED(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007:573067d3-c392-98f9-0c52-eb4b8580df9a
msgctxt "h738f8fe9gbdbfg4a7fg9327gbdecf48b9812"
msgid "<i>Show him your mark.</i>"
msgstr "<i>표식을 보여준다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007
#. Speaker = Warlock Gurk
#. NodeID = 6293f03f-26c7-4321-cb36-245189afa1c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_GoblinToast_State_RealizedPoison = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007:6293f03f-26c7-4321-cb36-245189afa1c9
msgctxt "h3781287ag6d15g4e93g8d04ge8b0f32b339f"
msgid ""
"We'll show the damn rat that poisoned us. Mark my words. Ya don't mess with "
"the Absolute."
msgstr "우리를 중독시킨 그 쥐새끼 같은 놈에게 본때를 보여 주겠어. 똑똑히 들어 두라고. 절대자의 심기를 거스르면 안 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6a097293-e4cf-38ec-6022-eba6b0808915
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BRANDED(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007:6a097293-e4cf-38ec-6022-eba6b0808915
msgctxt "h91fe9c59ge0ceg47b8g9800g507dad1ef1ad"
msgid "You wanted to see my brand. Here, take a look."
msgstr "내 낙인을 보고 싶댔지. 여기, 한 번 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007
#. Speaker = Warlock Gurk
#. NodeID = 72996d5a-a921-fcd8-da7e-076704ab1a5c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007:72996d5a-a921-fcd8-da7e-076704ab1a5c
msgctxt "h468e214cg1d7dg4d3cg8bf7g37019252be97"
msgid "Hold on. I was askin' you sumfin', wasn't I?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007
#. Speaker = Warlock Gurk
#. NodeID = 7e1cea87-9aa2-4bec-954d-99471d2fee34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_GoblinToast_State_RealizedPoison = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007:7e1cea87-9aa2-4bec-954d-99471d2fee34
msgctxt "h3373fce5g5ee4g4acbga2abg8b84120c18ab"
msgid "Best see the priestess and get branded, mucker."
msgstr "여사제님을 만나 표식을 받는 게 좋을 거야, 친구."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 805805c7-8557-e147-5bb8-ee7f75cc7940
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007:805805c7-8557-e147-5bb8-ee7f75cc7940
msgctxt "h77e548f9g3236g49c7g8522g3ed78eb765a3"
msgid "You let her burn you? Why?"
msgstr "그녀가 널 지지게 뒀어? 왜?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 83e18852-99e5-6ea6-b001-3df8e62839a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007:83e18852-99e5-6ea6-b001-3df8e62839a1
msgctxt "h87ef14abg54d6g4a60ga278ge71d9849e938"
msgid "Priestess? Is she a healer, too?"
msgstr "여사제? 그녀는 치유사이기도 하지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007
#. Speaker = Warlock Gurk
#. NodeID = 8458c5e3-dc3a-5fbb-7ae2-f3cf1d4a9769
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_GoblinPriest_Knows_PriestLeader = True
#.     - GLO_Absolute_Knows_GoblinsWorship = True
#.     - GLO_Absolute_Knows_Symbol = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007:8458c5e3-dc3a-5fbb-7ae2-f3cf1d4a9769
msgctxt "h9a639252g8c80g49f6ga5c5gc6888dd05a46"
msgid ""
"Heh. Seen 'er carve more folk than she's cured. Still, she's a Chosen o' the "
"Absolute now."
msgstr "하. 그녀는 치유보단 표식 새기는 걸 더 좋아하는 거 같던데. 그래도 이젠 절대자님의 선택을 받은 분이니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007
#. Speaker = Warlock Gurk
#. NodeID = 92b3efd7-6749-2013-cdbd-959e28e43c48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007:92b3efd7-6749-2013-cdbd-959e28e43c48
msgctxt "hf2a4da4egeb2fg4554g9767g290e28c403ec"
msgid ""
"Just like I thought. Yers is prettier 'n mine. S'pose it does the job, "
"though. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a813f9aa-94cc-6ad6-1cc8-c4f258e31ec2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007:a813f9aa-94cc-6ad6-1cc8-c4f258e31ec2
msgctxt "h39c66b49g85c5g443cg9c0fg67daab8e661f"
msgid "<i>Shrug and leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>어깨를 으쓱하고 떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007
#. Speaker = Warlock Gurk
#. NodeID = b0c292e2-c120-65bd-b94c-dd18f39e8434
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_ChickenChase_State_PlayingChase = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007:b0c292e2-c120-65bd-b94c-dd18f39e8434
msgctxt "h6a526611g727eg44bcgb75egc7db8e422cf3"
msgid "It's good, innit?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007
#. Speaker = Warlock Gurk
#. NodeID = b97dff1e-631e-0c2a-3d4f-a43ee2f84432
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007:b97dff1e-631e-0c2a-3d4f-a43ee2f84432
msgctxt "h93333135g2fefg4da7gb884g14298035b9cf"
msgid "Oh, yeah."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bf8c3282-c35c-62b3-f415-08cd74e8d22f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BRANDED(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007:bf8c3282-c35c-62b3-f415-08cd74e8d22f
msgctxt "h76be2c55gf8a0g40edg837eg2d6476ee633d"
msgid "You wanted to see a brand that I don't have."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007
#. Speaker = Warlock Gurk
#. NodeID = d5733723-dbe1-2c3e-ea15-c7d6348082b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_GoblinPriest_Knows_PriestLeader = True
#.     - GLO_Absolute_Knows_GoblinsWorship = True
#.     - GLO_Absolute_Knows_Symbol = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007:d5733723-dbe1-2c3e-ea15-c7d6348082b1
msgctxt "hb13a3750g2cd4g4a90gb14fgd6a921b1d103"
msgid ""
"Heh. Seen 'er carve more folk than she's cured. Still, she's a Chosen o' the "
"Absolute now."
msgstr "하. 그녀는 치유보단 표식 새기는 걸 더 좋아하는 거 같던데. 그래도 이젠 절대자님의 선택을 받은 분이니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007
#. Speaker = Warlock Gurk
#. NodeID = dce7b3ad-59f9-8346-0a98-c8865ed189d1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Festivities_Goblin_007_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007:dce7b3ad-59f9-8346-0a98-c8865ed189d1
msgctxt "hcf4b84d0gce30g43f4gbc24g4a445fe7a819"
msgid "Fink the Absolute wants me to 'ave another drink."
msgstr "절대자께서 내가 한 잔 더 했음 하시나 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007
#. Speaker = Warlock Gurk
#. NodeID = e0b41fd8-b779-1e33-44bc-22ce25c695d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007:e0b41fd8-b779-1e33-44bc-22ce25c695d2
msgctxt "h81e9222eg4bcdg4312g9ff0gb013916ad226"
msgid ""
"Makes it easier to decide who we kill and who we don't, too - so best get a "
"move on, eh?"
msgstr "우리가 누굴 죽이고 살릴지 결정하기 쉽게 해주기도 하거든 - 그러니 서두르는 게 좋겠지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007
#. Speaker = Warlock Gurk
#. NodeID = e0e67e01-3cbb-ebb2-35a2-590e043d8603
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007:e0e67e01-3cbb-ebb2-35a2-590e043d8603
msgctxt "h0ab400d7g59d2g4ecegb482gef57c2035919"
msgid ""
"Well, go get one inside, then! But 'ave a drink first. It stings sumfin' "
"proper."
msgstr "그래, 그럼 들어가서 찍어! 하지만 술부터 마시라고. 이거 제대로 쓰려."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007
#. Speaker = Warlock Gurk
#. NodeID = e1b4eb79-5cdb-b036-a085-e0d3b6ef5956
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Festivities_Goblin_007_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - DROWELF(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Festivities_Goblin_007_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007:e1b4eb79-5cdb-b036-a085-e0d3b6ef5956
msgctxt "h02423d06gc6c7g4ee7gb75dg2b21d67a32b6"
msgid ""
"Grab a drink afore you see the priestess, mucker. The brandin' stings "
"sumfin' proper."
msgstr "여사제님을 뵙기 전에 한잔 하라고, 친구. 표식을 새기는 건 꽤나 아프거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007
#. Speaker = Warlock Gurk
#. NodeID = f187d539-1823-7b89-f610-21d648a07b9b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Festivities_Goblin_007_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - DROWELF(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Festivities_Goblin_007_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007:f187d539-1823-7b89-f610-21d648a07b9b
msgctxt "h251be711g9b13g489bgac7ag13f21f884aca"
msgid ""
"Hey, can I see yer brand? The priestess gave me one, and I think she did it "
"wrong."
msgstr "이봐, 네 낙인 좀 봐도 될까? 여사제께서 나한테도 하나 찍어 주셨는데, 제대로 안 된 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fe32ac40-be0f-88de-30f1-2c7e3b0bcff5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_Goblin007:fe32ac40-be0f-88de-30f1-2c7e3b0bcff5
msgctxt "hc0854aa0g27d6g4090ga4dbg4eebb14a9910"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000
#. Speaker = Four
#. NodeID = 03a85abe-318a-fa8c-a82f-8aeec73ad4bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid_000_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid_000_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000:03a85abe-318a-fa8c-a82f-8aeec73ad4bd
msgctxt "h948a8925g98f2g4aa6g8c6bg6d1d7c92a2c5"
msgid ""
"Wot are you s'posed to be? You look like a dead elf wot got left out in the "
"sun for too long."
msgstr "뭐가 되고 싶었던거야? 너무 오래 햇볕에 둬서 죽은 엘프처럼 보인다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 05f4bc42-8b85-c0a7-769d-b93f9eabae38
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !(DROWELF and DROWHALFELF)
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000:05f4bc42-8b85-c0a7-769d-b93f9eabae38
msgctxt "ha2541aa1g8c4eg47d4g91dcg68fc580b47ef"
msgid "Keep threatening me. See what happens."
msgstr "계속 위협해 봐. 어떻게 되나 보자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000
#. Speaker = Four
#. NodeID = 0f1a8ef0-0b1e-868f-2068-364699b1421d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000:0f1a8ef0-0b1e-868f-2068-364699b1421d
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "ha52474fag2b28g43d0gb634g7aa3cbc75b1f"
msgid ""
"Sod off or I'll fetch my mum. She was tough as worg meat <i>before</i> the "
"Absolute came along."
msgstr "꺼져버리지 않으면 엄마를 데려오겠어. 엄마는 절대자께서 오시기 <i>전까진</i> 워그 고기만큼이나 강력하셨다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 175f90e1-bfc8-418b-3738-8771019c1a82
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000:175f90e1-bfc8-418b-3738-8771019c1a82
msgctxt "hf6929e73gf0a2g4206gb13ag2074f79eaed5"
msgid "No. I'm going to cut out your tongue."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000
#. Speaker = Four
#. NodeID = 1812cca4-f06e-9a34-c4ce-13beb6bf3a2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000:1812cca4-f06e-9a34-c4ce-13beb6bf3a2c
msgctxt "h8b4e7700gcaceg4246gbe04g6d3c8ed5ea70"
msgid "Oh,  you're <i>real</i> tough. Bullying a kid."
msgstr "이야, <i>진짜</i> 터프하네. 애들이나 괴롭히고 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000
#. Speaker = Four
#. NodeID = 2465bae0-ffd9-caaf-98ee-e6c223931e18
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid_000_SaidSurrenderSpeech(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_Festivities_State_KidsSurrendered = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000:2465bae0-ffd9-caaf-98ee-e6c223931e18
msgctxt "h67b9e407g8e88g4a28gb9e2ge686f4225e23"
msgid "That body's all yours - just leave us alone!"
msgstr "그 시체는 네거니까 우릴 그냥 내버려 둬!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2d56106f-b722-c75a-467f-f1527df0dd5d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: LOLTHDROWELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000:2d56106f-b722-c75a-467f-f1527df0dd5d
msgctxt "h45fd3d68gf632g49e3ga101gfc7d27861857"
msgid "A warning, <i>whelp</i>. Do not threaten me."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000
#. Speaker = Four
#. NodeID = 3179e4aa-6a25-f700-b7cb-dfa301399a51
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid_000_HasMet(1) = True
#. TagRule: BESTIAL and GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000:3179e4aa-6a25-f700-b7cb-dfa301399a51
msgctxt "hec93a4b8g9905g476bgaa69g0d20f7b21f7d"
msgid "Stop pesterin' us, freakshow."
msgstr "우릴 괴롭히지 마, 괴물아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000
#. Speaker = Four
#. NodeID = 3179e4aa-6a25-f700-b7cb-dfa301399a51
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid_000_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000:3179e4aa-6a25-f700-b7cb-dfa301399a51
msgctxt "he9c6eb5ag47edg48a9ga427g8fafd994c78d"
msgid "Stop pesterin' us, y'old fogey."
msgstr "우릴 괴롭히지 마, 이 구닥다리야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000
#. Speaker = Four
#. NodeID = 388e0fe2-891d-8d81-1f6e-e7986dfd4c58
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000:388e0fe2-891d-8d81-1f6e-e7986dfd4c58
msgctxt "hba051aedg9709g4e08ga94dg4be0d660a3a8"
msgid "Now... she could punch out a dragon!"
msgstr "이젠... 드래곤도 주먹으로 날려버리실 수 있을 정도라구!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000
#. Speaker = Four
#. NodeID = 47aee31d-7234-a1a9-46bf-5ab55850ffea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000:47aee31d-7234-a1a9-46bf-5ab55850ffea
msgctxt "h6804c1d9g03edg478fg8e1cg36ec45f1e7ed"
msgid "There's plenty of weirdoes about - you'll fit right in, freakshow."
msgstr "여기 괴상한 애들이 많다 - 너도 잘 어울릴 거야, 괴물아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5339edfa-defd-b4d0-1859-61c00b715b91
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000:5339edfa-defd-b4d0-1859-61c00b715b91
msgctxt "he1d0c35fg82fag4929ga4acgc682427ef9b9"
msgid "I am an alien warrior from another plane of existence."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 555a2f30-e39d-cd78-b226-b6eeee54a1f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000:555a2f30-e39d-cd78-b226-b6eeee54a1f5
msgctxt "hff3442a3g9074g479fga245gc81eb3395adb"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000
#. Speaker = Four
#. NodeID = 6f54f1fe-5468-5a9e-8b02-05d1f6670132
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000:6f54f1fe-5468-5a9e-8b02-05d1f6670132
msgctxt "hf82452e3gd390g4165gacb6g9c09c0175bda"
msgid "Whatcha gonna do about it? Run off and cry to yer spider-mum?"
msgstr "뭐 어쩔건데? 울면서 니 거미 애미한테 달려갈거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000
#. Speaker = Four
#. NodeID = 7bd472fb-0f2e-7020-fdfc-a40ca10a8083
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid_000_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid_000_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000:7bd472fb-0f2e-7020-fdfc-a40ca10a8083
msgctxt "h2f90c7c7g014bg4eacg9c2ag7b9cbd7af451"
msgid ""
"You look like you think you're hard. Mess with us, and you'll end up like "
"this bleeder."
msgstr "너 꽤 터프하다고 생각하나본데, 어디 한 번 깝쳐 봐. 이 피 흘리는 새끼처럼 될 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7dc3f0ed-0bde-65fd-0dae-5663bdfd5cfa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000:7dc3f0ed-0bde-65fd-0dae-5663bdfd5cfa
msgctxt "hc774567eg3a6cg4a4bga3aeg86a1f192fa06"
msgid "Sorry - I don't want any trouble."
msgstr "미안하군. 문제를 일으키고 싶은 건 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000
#. Speaker = Four
#. NodeID = 909130a1-6884-0355-7c99-aa6d1962d61a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GOB_Checkpoint_State_Paint(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000:909130a1-6884-0355-7c99-aa6d1962d61a
msgctxt "h5f37a238g012ag47ebg84c4g386d1a1f4b94"
msgid "Ugh. You look like you've been kissin' a worg's backside."
msgstr "윽. 워그의 궁둥이에 키스하다 온 것처럼 생겨먹었네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 90bb03ae-ffd1-aa5d-5835-3337f4b1d061
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000:90bb03ae-ffd1-aa5d-5835-3337f4b1d061
msgctxt "h08ca839egc7beg4aafgaf41g9a15c908873f"
msgid "Who's the dead man?"
msgstr "이 죽은 사람은 누구야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000
#. Speaker = Four
#. NodeID = 90d550af-1cbe-39a7-5686-5226571bc54d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000:90d550af-1cbe-39a7-5686-5226571bc54d
msgctxt "h43849366ga6f4g4dc6gad27gbb8be9da008f"
msgid "Yeah, too right."
msgstr "맞아, 아주 맞아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000
#. Speaker = Four
#. NodeID = 9a382a38-5f02-8c68-69c6-3fba5f2031ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000:9a382a38-5f02-8c68-69c6-3fba5f2031ab
msgctxt "h4636e543gb225g4ad1gaefag96ffc63c23b2"
msgid "Don't matter who he was. He ain't nothin' but a stain now."
msgstr "그게 뭐가 중요해. 이제는 핏자국만 남았는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a43f8221-e1f4-c1b3-2c79-704967ad25d4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000:a43f8221-e1f4-c1b3-2c79-704967ad25d4
msgctxt "h345a550bgce27g4963g9c66gbff33cf33aee"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000
#. Speaker = Four
#. NodeID = abe35813-ee50-cd07-7c73-6128a3e3e51d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid_000_SaidSurrenderSpeech(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_Festivities_State_KidsSurrendered = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid_000_SaidSurrenderSpeech(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000:abe35813-ee50-cd07-7c73-6128a3e3e51d
msgctxt "hca204a63gf0a6g4d62g9925g12b71f45e0df"
msgid "Stop - stop! Just take 'im."
msgstr "그만 - 그만! 그냥 데려가."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = abec1405-7c80-659f-e882-bee5967ecaf4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000:abec1405-7c80-659f-e882-bee5967ecaf4
msgctxt "h24d0a061g2360g4cd7gb345g6cd956207d6f"
msgid "I'm a githyanki; a stranger to this land."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000
#. Speaker = Four
#. NodeID = c0854825-d5d7-8cd4-807b-cc302d45a9cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid_000_HasMet(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid_000_HasMet(1) = True
#. TagRule: DROWELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000:c0854825-d5d7-8cd4-807b-cc302d45a9cd
msgctxt "hce8f5115gbea5g40e8g9af3gb0697f487e2b"
msgid ""
"Anuvver dirt-elf come to boss us around, eh? Bet I could break your face."
msgstr "또 더러운 엘프가 우리 우두머리 노릇하러 왔나, 앙? 내가 네 얼굴을 부숴 버릴 수도 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000
#. Speaker = Four
#. NodeID = c8715c70-ae58-e378-fa85-3152baa7c4ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000:c8715c70-ae58-e378-fa85-3152baa7c4ff
msgctxt "hfc368c82gcb44g41ebgb841gd476c4be58fd"
msgid "Piss off, or you'll end up like this bleeder."
msgstr "저리 꺼져, 아니면 너도 이 꼴이 될 거니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c91aec8a-826a-0432-b9d1-e729554eac11
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000:c91aec8a-826a-0432-b9d1-e729554eac11
msgctxt "h9e49478dg228bg40e6g83a4gd2af031f43d7"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000
#. Speaker = Four
#. NodeID = e0e005a2-adfc-d21c-aff5-02bab5f3bcf0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000:e0e005a2-adfc-d21c-aff5-02bab5f3bcf0
msgctxt "h6d250d03g7aacg492dg82cagf9d3f06236f1"
msgid "Jus' like you'll be if you don't clear off."
msgstr "너도 빨리 비키지 않으면 이렇게 될 거라구."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000
#. Speaker = Four
#. NodeID = ec172596-315d-a16a-1b44-280dd516b156
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000:ec172596-315d-a16a-1b44-280dd516b156
msgctxt "he1aa80c7gff48g411cg971ag7369213f45bf"
msgid "So don't go startin' nothin'."
msgstr "그러니까 아무것도 시작하지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000
#. Speaker = Four
#. NodeID = f719dc19-2c7b-4355-e988-2bb0c685a778
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid000:f719dc19-2c7b-4355-e988-2bb0c685a778
msgctxt "h5342519dga848g4d96g802dgf3245ac36c80"
msgid "Sure you are. An' I'm king of the hobgoblins."
msgstr "당연하지. 이 몸은 홉고블린들의 왕이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid001
#. Speaker = Five
#. NodeID = 4eaa4861-83dc-c304-3a5a-e1e52dd803c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid_001_HasMet(1) = True
#. TagRule: TIEFLING
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid001:4eaa4861-83dc-c304-3a5a-e1e52dd803c8
msgctxt "hcb3fc4feg1e13g4653g9870g5db330f0f8b3"
msgid "Can I touch yer horns?"
msgstr "뿔 만져봐도 될까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid001
#. Speaker = Five
#. NodeID = 4eaa4861-83dc-c304-3a5a-e1e52dd803c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid_001_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid001:4eaa4861-83dc-c304-3a5a-e1e52dd803c8
msgctxt "hfb649a8bg0688g44e3g937dg7f040320ac4b"
msgid "Go bother someone else."
msgstr "다른 사람이나 괴롭혀."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid001
#. Speaker = Five
#. NodeID = 76079b5a-349c-1da2-18cf-1d1d9f1053df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GOB_Checkpoint_State_Paint(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid001:76079b5a-349c-1da2-18cf-1d1d9f1053df
msgctxt "h1dc01f06g2194g480egb2aaga13ac65b5b4c"
msgid "You stink worse than a bugbear's arse."
msgstr "버그베어 엉덩이보다 니 악취가 더 심하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid001
#. Speaker = Five
#. NodeID = 9d8ab7ff-2922-bcad-b939-9d557cf4a40d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid_001_SaidSurrenderSpeech(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_Festivities_State_KidsSurrendered = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid_001_SaidSurrenderSpeech(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid001:9d8ab7ff-2922-bcad-b939-9d557cf4a40d
msgctxt "haebecf06ge58eg463cga981g6320c932643b"
msgid "I won't do nothin'! Please stop!"
msgstr "아무것도 하지 않을 거야! 제발 그만!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid001
#. Speaker = Five
#. NodeID = e0f195ad-64a1-6eb1-7a24-3ade051cbfe1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid_001_SaidSurrenderSpeech(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_Festivities_State_KidsSurrendered = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid001:e0f195ad-64a1-6eb1-7a24-3ade051cbfe1
msgctxt "hf0654b62g9a7cg4963g8ea8g1c2c128f94a9"
msgid "D-Don't hurt me, please!"
msgstr "때-때리지 마세요, 제발!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid001
#. Speaker = Five
#. NodeID = ff7177a4-b9e8-69fe-4332-8bffdea2c6d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid_001_HasMet(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid_001_HasMet(1) = True
#. TagRule: TIEFLING
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid001:ff7177a4-b9e8-69fe-4332-8bffdea2c6d5
msgctxt "h9628d9c4g9820g4c20g9b71g8854c3d460ba"
msgid ""
"Wish <i>my</i> dad had diddled a devil so's I could have horns like you."
msgstr "<i>우리</i> 아빠도 데빌과 장난을 쳤으면 좋았을 텐데, 그래서 나도 너처럼 뿔이 있었으면 좋겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid001
#. Speaker = Five
#. NodeID = ff7177a4-b9e8-69fe-4332-8bffdea2c6d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid_001_HasMet(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid_001_HasMet(1) = True
#. TagRule: UNDERDARK
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid001:ff7177a4-b9e8-69fe-4332-8bffdea2c6d5
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h2415d35cgba8ag4755gb0bcge8ab00c60528"
msgid "Underdark too gloomy for ya, shroom-sucker?"
msgstr "너한테 언더다크는 너무 음침해, shroom-sucker?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid001
#. Speaker = Five
#. NodeID = ff7177a4-b9e8-69fe-4332-8bffdea2c6d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid_001_HasMet(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid_001_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid001:ff7177a4-b9e8-69fe-4332-8bffdea2c6d5
msgctxt "h9ded8e85gd7d9g4843g8663g9dfaa69cf73d"
msgid "You could curdle worg-milk with that ugly mug."
msgstr "너의 그 못생긴 면상만 보면 워그 우유도 굳어버릴 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0460afa7-e74e-1da1-c9ae-1af526201521
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002:0460afa7-e74e-1da1-c9ae-1af526201521
msgctxt "ha51d6cd4g42e4g4a29g9ef1ge8d779e5f80a"
msgid "Stop this - you're disrespecting the dead."
msgstr "멈춰 - 고인을 모욕하고 있잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002
#. Speaker = Eight
#. NodeID = 0960c7c0-1906-ec69-f502-d51acd15d0b6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002:0960c7c0-1906-ec69-f502-d51acd15d0b6
msgctxt "h15e387a8gdf61g43bfga697ga4b4bc148bc0"
msgid ""
"This nasty worg-pizzle killed my mum and dad! Made a bloody orphan of me."
msgstr "이 못된 워그 좆같은 자식이 내 엄마랑 아빠를 죽였어! 날 씨발 고아로 만들었다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0eea92f1-8820-5382-3171-2b016f66a6fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002:0eea92f1-8820-5382-3171-2b016f66a6fe
msgctxt "hb132addeg07b7g4187g97ecg088bfec9d548"
msgid "Sorry for your loss."
msgstr "그것 참 안됐군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 15900297-1bdd-4167-cfb1-d000515fbfee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(6) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002:15900297-1bdd-4167-cfb1-d000515fbfee
msgctxt "ha684811bgebecg4bc2g9c2cg35bbe7b75f7e"
msgid "I almost feel bad for the runt. <i>Almost.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002
#. Speaker = Eight
#. NodeID = 322225d6-5790-a57b-617e-8e5c784b3167
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002:322225d6-5790-a57b-617e-8e5c784b3167
msgctxt "h136749edgaf73g4237g9b33g8d9a4943e9eb"
msgid "He killed my mum and dad! Made a bloody orphan of me."
msgstr "이 자식이 내 엄마랑 아빠를 죽였어! 날 씨발 고아로 만들었다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002
#. Speaker = Eight
#. NodeID = 55ffc39e-a79c-6f13-3a2c-63d303142734
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid_002_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002:55ffc39e-a79c-6f13-3a2c-63d303142734
msgctxt "hf7ba971cg631fg40dbg8426gb35314ce7dde"
msgid "Got nothin' better to do than bother orphans?"
msgstr "고아들을 괴롭히는 것 말고 할 일이 없나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002
#. Speaker = Eight
#. NodeID = 5c63d91b-00cd-db5c-7d77-9d7f04366b6e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid_002_HasMet(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid_002_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002:5c63d91b-00cd-db5c-7d77-9d7f04366b6e
msgctxt "h55c70f87gbc05g4434g96e2g257801e36cde"
msgid "Stupid, dead bastard. Give him a good kickin' - he deserves it!"
msgstr "멍청한 시체 자식. 이 녀석을 뻥 걷어차 줘. 당해도 싸니까!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 67988242-02b0-d872-a744-f0a4a3e1dbf0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(5) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002:67988242-02b0-d872-a744-f0a4a3e1dbf0
msgctxt "h6c749c49g8688g4dd7g9faeg656829f0a400"
msgid "It's as good a reason as any, I suppose."
msgstr "뭐, 찰 만한 이유기는 하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002
#. Speaker = Eight
#. NodeID = 722b9a4e-61f7-0955-8f59-d15eee78fe10
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_Festivities_Event_KickedCorpse(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002:722b9a4e-61f7-0955-8f59-d15eee78fe10
msgctxt "hd1c5e00ag1381g4e98g89dfg8eda8a97f40d"
msgid "Yeah! Right in the gnashers! You're all right."
msgstr "그래! 아구창에다! 좀 하는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002
#. Speaker = Eight
#. NodeID = 86250532-fc73-d709-58d5-763fe2d12c07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid_002_SaidSurrenderSpeech(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_Festivities_State_KidsSurrendered = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002:86250532-fc73-d709-58d5-763fe2d12c07
msgctxt "h159fbba4g58ecg4c13g8c3agaaaca457b9f4"
msgid "Ya got what ya wanted, didn't ya? Stop botherin' us."
msgstr "원하는 걸 얻었잖아, 안 그래? 그러니 우리를 괴롭히지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002
#. Speaker = Eight
#. NodeID = 90df1dfc-343e-f4b0-8a48-f42b4a3f7912
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(7) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002:90df1dfc-343e-f4b0-8a48-f42b4a3f7912
msgctxt "h03ba3409g7d54g4fa8g9829g842abaf9f95a"
msgid ""
"Don't mean we can't enjoy puttin' the boot into this pricker-stick though."
msgstr "그거랑 상관없이 이 새끼한테 발길질을 해대면 재밌잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a6838e15-7fcc-ec57-aac3-ec660e2663c5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002:a6838e15-7fcc-ec57-aac3-ec660e2663c5
msgctxt "h3a43938ag08d4g4ffagb112g4e70551e51ab"
msgid "<i>Kick the corpse.</i>"
msgstr "<i>시체를 찬다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002
#. Speaker = Eight
#. NodeID = ad31e122-8ed9-77f8-ea4d-6b058da6ca73
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid_002_SaidSurrenderSpeech(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_Festivities_State_KidsSurrendered = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid_002_SaidSurrenderSpeech(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002:ad31e122-8ed9-77f8-ea4d-6b058da6ca73
msgctxt "hd5f06d59gd908g4a0cg9f32gc10ac8b1008d"
msgid "Fine - take him, just leave us!"
msgstr "좋아 - 그를 데려가, 그냥 가버려!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b6939a90-e621-1adf-40f2-b94c324cdab7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002:b6939a90-e621-1adf-40f2-b94c324cdab7
msgctxt "haa471ee7gaa4ag4b68gb345g15dfd9a4cca4"
msgid "What did he do to deserve that?"
msgstr "그가 무슨 짓을 했길래 이런 일을 당해야 해?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b8117491-5bc2-ec22-aed2-c9602bad442b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002:b8117491-5bc2-ec22-aed2-c9602bad442b
msgctxt "h89cad3e3gaeeeg41ebg98f5gc80dd391ce16"
msgid "'Mum'? 'Dad'? Explain these concepts."
msgstr "'엄마'? '아빠'? 그게 무슨 개념인지 설명해 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = cdb33b31-42c5-4b2e-3f81-0487644a8611
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002:cdb33b31-42c5-4b2e-3f81-0487644a8611
msgctxt "ha7871b73g8047g4ceegafe0g4e4240e6e0e3"
msgid "Such insufferable shrieking. May we not kick the child instead?"
msgstr "쫑알대는 소리에 귀가 아프군. 아이를 차버리면 안 되나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = cfd71b0c-00f2-4b15-a53e-e3265d1c48e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002:cfd71b0c-00f2-4b15-a53e-e3265d1c48e7
msgctxt "hc85da639g126ag450cg8ffeg820ca654a246"
msgid "Well... So much for my previous sentiment."
msgstr "어... 아까의 동정심은 헛된 것이었나 보군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002
#. Speaker = Eight
#. NodeID = d3c82f8b-254b-7212-33b9-6261a5ba920e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002:d3c82f8b-254b-7212-33b9-6261a5ba920e
msgctxt "h3a56e769g280eg40d8g8039g63139bcf83e7"
msgid ""
"I ain't bothered about it. Better off without 'em. Stupid old geezers "
"should've put up more of a fight."
msgstr "난 신경 안 써. 차라리 없는 게 낫지. 그 멍청한 늙은이들은 제대로 싸우지도 못했는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = d946edb3-6f90-7d67-e764-791f1a0d2949
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002:d946edb3-6f90-7d67-e764-791f1a0d2949
msgctxt "hc5def77fgaac9g4f9cga6b2gdd2c62966175"
msgid "This is no place for a child."
msgstr "여긴 아이가 있을 곳이 아니야. "

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002
#. Speaker = Eight
#. NodeID = df93390a-2f24-f0e2-7c40-65f4f6202fc1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002:df93390a-2f24-f0e2-7c40-65f4f6202fc1
msgctxt "h5b54d7bdga403g401agb166g0dea69827b54"
msgid ""
"Well, yeah. They was nasty old geezers - wanted to cut 'em a raggedy new "
"smile myself some days."
msgstr "맞아. 끔찍한 늙다리들이었지. 나도 언젠가는 그 입을 찢어버리고 싶었다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002
#. Speaker = Eight
#. NodeID = e4ec75a4-ce10-40f5-8d0d-34cbaae078ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002:e4ec75a4-ce10-40f5-8d0d-34cbaae078ae
msgctxt "heb0a44ecg9ab7g42fbgb1ebg45b7ce9384b0"
msgid "I'll disrespect <i>you</i> if you don't shut it!"
msgstr "닥치지 않으면 <i>널</i> 모욕해주지!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002
#. Speaker = Eight
#. NodeID = e7f16a47-c548-5cf5-b11e-e71fe7537013
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002:e7f16a47-c548-5cf5-b11e-e71fe7537013
msgctxt "h9f7d711bg8b8dg4b07g8f32g0f9d654ef797"
msgid "You wot? I ain't explainin' how babies get made. Gross."
msgstr "뭐어? 아기를 어떻게 만드는지 내가 왜 설명해. 우웩."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = f070a9dc-7f7b-0c52-3f32-d43115e490cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(7) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002:f070a9dc-7f7b-0c52-3f32-d43115e490cb
msgctxt "h9de95d35gaca6g475dgbca5g44b6142aaa1c"
msgid "Loss holds hands with grief - even among goblins."
msgstr "상실은 고블린들 사이에서조차 슬픔과 함께 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f1e989cc-3413-cd5c-73b2-27c4f1c1a13a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002:f1e989cc-3413-cd5c-73b2-27c4f1c1a13a
msgctxt "h8e021ecbg5609g49ccgaa96g2af1b84b2fe3"
msgid "Maybe they had it coming."
msgstr "그들이 자초한 것일 수도 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = f5a8edbf-7ce1-af2f-9866-de0697766498
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002:f5a8edbf-7ce1-af2f-9866-de0697766498
msgctxt "h2bde9354g5b42g40e4g9bfeg3954f89ecadf"
msgid "Understandable then, I suppose. Give him an extra kick for me, child."
msgstr "그럼 뭐, 그럴 만도 하네. 한대 더 차 줘, 꼬마야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fce2abb6-23e7-e48a-c427-e4c02cb7e631
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002:fce2abb6-23e7-e48a-c427-e4c02cb7e631
msgctxt "h2e2399cdg9400g4ca8g8701g1ef7ce46c85e"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002_LootingCrime
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 06e81974-9587-4b7c-db71-fa1653279493
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount6(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount6(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002_LootingCrime:06e81974-9587-4b7c-db71-fa1653279493
msgctxt "h5639cbd0g46b6g4df6g95fbgb85a1406c528"
msgid ""
"*The presence deep in your mind is awake, unblinking. This is it. A single "
"word pervades your consciousness: 'Soon'.*"
msgstr ""
"*당신의 정신 속 깊이 자리잡은 존재가 태연스레 깨어납니다. 올 것이 왔군요. 한 단어가 당신의 의식 속으로 스며듭니다. ‘곧’*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002_LootingCrime
#. Speaker = Eight
#. NodeID = 23aecc25-c128-dc67-2ca0-d17e55af277c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_Festivities_State_KidsFighting = True
#.   Object:
#.     - TemporaryHostilityAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002_LootingCrime:23aecc25-c128-dc67-2ca0-d17e55af277c
msgctxt "h4df511eeg31c3g44e7gb12eg462d8e0078da"
msgid "Wh-what's that? Ya tryna explode my head? I'll kill ya!"
msgstr "그-그게 뭐야? 내 머리를 터뜨리려고 해? 죽여버릴 거야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002_LootingCrime
#. Speaker = Eight
#. NodeID = 2a989e8f-d4e2-8391-7b1b-dfde5160289d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002_LootingCrime:2a989e8f-d4e2-8391-7b1b-dfde5160289d
msgctxt "hcd93b693gea20g47b9gbdfeg85310c2bff08"
msgid "That - that was that thing that Gut did! The True Soul thing!"
msgstr "그 - 그게 거트가 한 그 일이야! 참된 영혼의 일!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002_LootingCrime
#. Speaker = Eight
#. NodeID = 2b78307e-d94e-bc8f-a2ab-32c68b1bf216
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_Festivities_Event_KidsRun = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002_LootingCrime:2b78307e-d94e-bc8f-a2ab-32c68b1bf216
msgctxt "hf158fe81g76ffg4944g948agc898ceec4099"
msgid ""
"Gah - we never get anything! C'mon. Let's see if we can snatch that stupid "
"chicken."
msgstr "젠장 - 우리는 아무것도 얻을 수 없어! 어서. 그 멍청한 닭을 훔칠 수 있는지 알아보자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002_LootingCrime
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 310eb960-07fe-1652-f1e0-cf5e713bc4a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - GLO_TadpoleIntro_NPC(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002_LootingCrime:310eb960-07fe-1652-f1e0-cf5e713bc4a0
msgctxt "h43591bd3gc4e4g4566g957dgb516d74d2602"
msgid "*As the symbol glows, power courses through you. <i>Authority</i>.*"
msgstr "*문양이 빛나며, 몸에 흐르는 힘이 느껴집니다. <i>권위</i>.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002_LootingCrime
#. Speaker = Eight
#. NodeID = 4981f0aa-04ca-1663-f5c6-d6c408574f7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002_LootingCrime:4981f0aa-04ca-1663-f5c6-d6c408574f7c
msgctxt "h28cad12fgc137g4624gb2fbg0951f0c027d0"
msgid ""
"<i>If One comes braggin' about what she's found, at least I got somethin' to "
"show her.</i>"
msgstr "<i>첫째가 뭘 찾았는지 자랑질하러 오면, 나도 뭔가 보여줄 게 있겠지.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002_LootingCrime
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 587957e8-74c0-5c4b-7380-3ff3d449b32d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DROWELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002_LootingCrime:587957e8-74c0-5c4b-7380-3ff3d449b32d
msgctxt "hdeb419b8gafd8g4e09gbb2fg2c104c75d1ac"
msgid "<i>Nothing </i>is yours. Find another corpse."
msgstr "여기 네 건 <i>아무것도</i> 없어. 다른 시체나 찾아라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002_LootingCrime
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5e2efbe3-6dfc-5596-20a0-1895304df1de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = False
#.      - DROWELF(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002_LootingCrime:5e2efbe3-6dfc-5596-20a0-1895304df1de
msgctxt "he22a5fbegfe56g49c3g869fg1fe25736ea07"
msgid "Or what? I'll run you through before you can cry for your mother."
msgstr "어쩔 건데? 엄마를 채 부르기도 전에 넌 죽을 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002_LootingCrime
#. Speaker = Eight
#. NodeID = 5e843271-9175-aeb2-90a9-3e2f8866af8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_Festivities_State_KidsFighting = True
#.   Object:
#.     - TemporaryHostilityAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002_LootingCrime:5e843271-9175-aeb2-90a9-3e2f8866af8a
msgctxt "h1130c12ag7717g4ee0g867agd518c3c2293e"
msgid "Hah! Hear that? We're gonna get another corpse soon enough."
msgstr "하하! 들려? 곧 또 다른 시체를 보겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002_LootingCrime
#. Speaker = Eight
#. NodeID = 69650a8b-28c3-1f81-2b93-e94b581e1500
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_Festivities_State_KidsFighting = True
#.   Object:
#.     - TemporaryHostilityAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002_LootingCrime:69650a8b-28c3-1f81-2b93-e94b581e1500
msgctxt "h195b1fe2g61a1g4898ga67ag29f53a8f57e2"
msgid ""
"Oh yeah? Ya know what Ragzlin's orders are? Kill all the stinkin' thieves."
msgstr "오, 그래? 너 라그즐린의 명령이 뭔줄 알아? 냄새나는 도둑들을 모두 죽여라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002_LootingCrime
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6df61f0e-f698-9394-021b-3dcfb3228cca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount3(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount3(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002_LootingCrime:6df61f0e-f698-9394-021b-3dcfb3228cca
msgctxt "h3c0d5dc7g7053g4271gbc72g857100ae6968"
msgid "*Your mind lurches, reeling suddenly as if... bitten.*"
msgstr "*뭔가에 깨물린 것처럼 느닷없이 정신이 휘청거립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002_LootingCrime
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 7078989b-e2ed-ae6f-1b79-e53505b32864
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.     - TRUESOUL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002_LootingCrime:7078989b-e2ed-ae6f-1b79-e53505b32864
msgctxt "hd3ec908agefbbg4691g85c4g14d38f84244d"
msgid ""
"*Your mind is full, bursting with ecstasy and terror. Finally, it is coming. "
"You are becoming.*"
msgstr "*당신의 정신이 황홀경과 공포로 가득 차오릅니다. 마침내, 때가 됐군요. 당신은 변화 중입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinKid002_LootingCrime
#. Speaker = Eight
#. NodeID = 71301b26-b54d-4b0e-d06a-b85e58417a8e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_Festivities_State_KidsFighting = True
