msgstr "*전율이 불현듯 머릿속을 스쳐 지나가고... 만족감이 듭니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinSleeper_01
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 66a06949-7dfc-ee51-38ae-558b575a6479
