msgctxt "h62a13f87gac60g4a22g8d8ag3c135285d891"
msgid "*A shiver runs across your mind... You feel sated.*"
msgstr "*전율이 불현듯 머릿속을 스쳐 지나가고... 만족감이 듭니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinSleeper_02
