msgctxt "h1e7f4787g1e68g493ega7e2gd9c521af36fe"
msgid ""
"*Your blood runs quicker, feeding the gnawing absence at the centre of your "
"mind.*"
msgstr "*피가 더 빨리 흐르면서, 당신의 정신 한가운데를 좀먹는 허전함을 양분으로 채웁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinSleeper_02
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 968401ca-2149-d441-cdea-91fe4e902006
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - ILLITHID(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinSleeper_02:968401ca-2149-d441-cdea-91fe4e902006
msgctxt "h93269fbegd0ccg4607gbbe2g118ae78f5b9f"
msgid ""
"*The mark glows, but you feel nothing in response. Your illithid power is "
"beyond reach until you rest.*"
msgstr "*문양이 빛나지만, 어떤 반응도 느껴지지 않습니다. 일리시드 능력을 더 사용하려면 휴식을 취해야 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinSleeper_02
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9ea83d36-bbba-c786-d427-e098bd14ab33
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount2(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount2(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinSleeper_02:9ea83d36-bbba-c786-d427-e098bd14ab33
msgctxt "h45a47999g8f81g4abcgb815g07fc0042209e"
msgid ""
"*Something stirs deep within you, hungry and alert... it's taking something "
"you'll never get back.*"
msgstr "*몸 깊숙한 데서 굶주리고 기민한 존재가 꿈틀댑니다... 잃으면 되찾지 못할 뭔가를 좀먹고 있군요.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Festivities_GoblinSleeper_02
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a7490dc6-2bb4-3a07-82eb-6920bdc18299
