msgctxt "ha2694d4agbe21g48f7g8796g190c37f6195b"
msgid "Pleasure to have met ya. Praise the Absolute!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinBrash
#. Speaker = Warlock Greez
#. NodeID = 46238ba8-8c82-c209-d577-564abe9e2547
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinBrash:46238ba8-8c82-c209-d577-564abe9e2547
msgctxt "h20ea98d4g4833g4408g88adg7b8696e6a91f"
msgid "Let's us know you're on our side. That way, nobody'll mess with ya."
msgstr "네가 우리 편이란 걸 증명하라고. 그러면 아무도 널 건드리지 않을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinBrash
#. Speaker = Warlock Greez
#. NodeID = 565bc361-3acb-1331-777a-906a0831c90e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinBrash:565bc361-3acb-1331-777a-906a0831c90e
msgctxt "h3c6e7511gd0d9g4353g9358gc5071e9a7842"
msgid "Happy to oblige."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinBrash
#. Speaker = Warlock Greez
#. NodeID = 654c5371-ab8a-59f4-f8e2-9285bff06bbd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinBrash:654c5371-ab8a-59f4-f8e2-9285bff06bbd
msgctxt "haaee9e00gb3a8g4183gab2fgff6abce6fbdb"
msgid "Didn't mean no offence! Brand lets us know you're on our side is all."
msgstr "기분 나쁘게 하려던 건 아니야! 표식은 네가 우리 편이란 걸 알릴 뿐이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinBrash
#. Speaker = Warlock Greez
#. NodeID = 687683bd-bf37-556c-cf4e-9163e7a7dae3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinBrash:687683bd-bf37-556c-cf4e-9163e7a7dae3
msgctxt "h257770a7g137ag4d4dgaa3fg5f3f811c6504"
msgid ""
"Ain't just a mark on the flesh: it's <i>magic.</i> Only them what follows "
"the Absolute can see it."
msgstr "단순한 표식이 아니야: <i>마법</i>이라고. 절대자님을 따르는 이들만이 그걸 이해하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinBrash
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7107c73a-092e-8623-3b15-cb894d7d70b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - LOLTHDROWELF(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinBrash:7107c73a-092e-8623-3b15-cb894d7d70b1
msgctxt "ha2c45e37g845dg4bddgaf5fgab66be46b2eb"
msgid "Why would I let anyone scar me for life?"
msgstr "어째서 내게 영구적인 흉터를 남기도록 해야하지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinBrash
#. Speaker = Warlock Greez
#. NodeID = 936d0cb9-34b7-7ed4-a215-33ddf68437d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_GoblinBrash_HasMet(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_GoblinBrash_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinBrash:936d0cb9-34b7-7ed4-a215-33ddf68437d3
msgctxt "hb42e9fa4gc84cg413dg9480g56f8d99f36d9"
msgid ""
"Ain't polite to stare, worm-wart. If you ain't got the guts to get branded, "
"clear off."
msgstr "처다보는 건 예의가 아니지, 이 벌레야. 표식을 새길 배짱이 없으면 꺼져."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinBrash
#. Speaker = Warlock Greez
#. NodeID = a1f815f9-4052-7f93-ff03-788aa60f13b6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinBrash:a1f815f9-4052-7f93-ff03-788aa60f13b6
msgctxt "hdbe595a9gce34g440dg8cfdgcbc48c66c290"
msgid "Oof. Priestess got you good. Tha's a lovely bit of work."
msgstr "으, 여사제께서 널 제대로 손 봐줬군. 사랑스러운 작품이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinBrash
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a253f96f-eb76-501e-d9ea-d212ec3296a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BRANDED(1) = False
#.      - LOLTHDROWELF(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinBrash:a253f96f-eb76-501e-d9ea-d212ec3296a9
msgctxt "ha6a6ae6fg8093g47ccgbaecg85cef1debdd1"
msgid "You'd dare presume to mark my flesh?"
msgstr "네가 감히 내 살을 태우려고 해?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinBrash
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a6353955-aaa5-1f68-4b45-6de3ab2e3236
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinBrash:a6353955-aaa5-1f68-4b45-6de3ab2e3236
msgctxt "h57fffb8ag76acg4e9fga9d5g609ecaaba3df"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinBrash
#. Speaker = Warlock Greez
#. NodeID = b140bbf3-d2a8-1986-6e8c-2ae97ec12304
