msgctxt "h112d5085g1d46g485cgbf2dge57c03986935"
msgid ""
"I'd do what he says. Ain't wanna make the boss any madder 'n he already is."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinFavorite
#. Speaker = Warlock Bolt
#. NodeID = 767badca-e055-445b-a613-85fa7e231976
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_GoblinKingScryingStarted = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinFavorite:767badca-e055-445b-a613-85fa7e231976
msgctxt "h7dbc08efg0053g4b77g92ebg3dd8326f9164"
msgid ""
"'Less you're the Absolute themself, I'd leave Ragzlin alone. He ain't in no "
"mood for nothin'. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinFavorite
#. Speaker = Warlock Bolt
#. NodeID = 880e92c8-bb80-47cc-8e8b-e8f42694f77f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_GoblinKingScryingStarted = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinFavorite:880e92c8-bb80-47cc-8e8b-e8f42694f77f
msgctxt "h9f7f12ffge24fg4a65g8fbag813559ef6be6"
msgid "Shut it. The boss is 'bout to wake that tentacle thing up."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinGlib
#. Speaker = Devout Mrak
#. NodeID = 1e056080-b780-8be8-641b-5e7ff6817cf3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Absolute_Knows_GoblinsWorship = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinGlib:1e056080-b780-8be8-641b-5e7ff6817cf3
msgctxt "h8869e525g6957g491bg9a8dg5da7e7acc675"
msgid ""
"Make sure whoever we're stickin' it to knows we're doin' it for the Absolute."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinGlib
#. Speaker = Devout Mrak
#. NodeID = 78763d59-89d7-53ae-d85c-e4c83291ac68
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_GoblinGlib_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - BRANDED(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_GoblinGlib_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinGlib:78763d59-89d7-53ae-d85c-e4c83291ac68
msgctxt "h8a719077g2ec1g4bf6gbd83gbbf122afd829"
msgid ""
"Brand looks good on you. Priestess reckons we should all be marked up before "
"the next raid.\n"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinGlib
#. Speaker = Devout Mrak
#. NodeID = 8a31daec-deb2-2df1-555e-8f8550be59c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_GoblinGlib_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Tag:
