msgid "The tadpole stirs. It recognises its master..."
msgstr "올챙이가 떨고 있어. 자기 주인을 알아보는군..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Mindflayer_Dead
