#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:25fb5a60-12a1-9428-a2d6-c788f9806e8c
msgctxt "h72c695f3g25a7g4272g9923gb5eb6f043db7"
msgid "<i>Leave, before the mind flayer can identify you.</i>"
msgstr "<i>마인드 플레이어가 당신을 알아보기 전에 떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 277a4eb8-a995-ce2c-2a23-939fabc5219b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 6584fb1a-7ca9-950f-40a6-be0cfdd296f7_TriedLeaving = False
#.   Object:
#.      - CRA_Escape_State_KilledMindflayer(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 6584fb1a-7ca9-950f-40a6-be0cfdd296f7_TriedLeaving = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:277a4eb8-a995-ce2c-2a23-939fabc5219b
msgctxt "h7bd688fbgd1e6g4664g9349g10a83134cd86"
msgid "<i>Leave, before the mind flayer can identify you.</i>"
msgstr "<i>마인드 플레이어가 당신을 알아보기 전에 떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 27e6b8ae-fba7-666b-4963-df7c2a496b54
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:27e6b8ae-fba7-666b-4963-df7c2a496b54
msgctxt "h0a03e171g2498g494fgb4b5g44a7b2fd700f"
msgid ""
"*You feel Ragzlin's suspicions. A True Soul should never ask about the "
"Master.*"
msgstr "*라그즐린의 의심이 느껴집니다. 참된 영혼이라면 절대 자기 주인에 관해 물을 리가 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 28e3b448-6fd1-cbe8-e7cb-aef929508372
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:28e3b448-6fd1-cbe8-e7cb-aef929508372
msgctxt "hf03e3d70g6483g4183g8a1fg0356b83e5e35"
msgid ""
"*Ragzlin's mind reels, then calms. <i>He will speak as you command.</i>*"
msgstr "*라그즐린의 정신이 굴복하고, 평온해집니다. <i>당신의 명령대로 말할 것입니다.</i>*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 2ae9d37f-1144-f070-0beb-69d7cf305b69
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_Orpheus_Knows_GobLookingForWeapon = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_Orpheus_Knows_GobLookingForWeapon = True
#.   Local:
#.     - 6584fb1a-7ca9-950f-40a6-be0cfdd296f7_FirstWeaponMention = True
#.     - 6584fb1a-7ca9-950f-40a6-be0cfdd296f7_ToldCube = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:2ae9d37f-1144-f070-0beb-69d7cf305b69
msgctxt "h0c15f5c6g8fadg47d1g8056gefb79eb8bf89"
msgid "We find who killed it, and we find who took that weapon. So settle in."
msgstr "누가 이 자식을 죽였는지 알아내고, 무기를 가져간 게 누구인지 알아낼 것이다. 그러니 구경이나 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 2aef24c4-55e6-edf4-3c75-66a76e310fd9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:2aef24c4-55e6-edf4-3c75-66a76e310fd9
msgctxt "hc0801d32gc9bcg44fbg8defgb436f40dd578"
msgid "Damn it. That tells me <i>nothing</i>!"
msgstr "망할. <i>아무것도</i> 못 알아냈잖아!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 2af844ce-7335-7985-5f5e-4a4f93f8bf4b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_State_RaiderVictory = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:2af844ce-7335-7985-5f5e-4a4f93f8bf4b
msgctxt "h6b60dee1gb1dcg4cfeg9999g8de253f435b6"
msgid "The damned drow was right. And now she'll be grabbing the glory."
msgstr "그 썩을 드로우가 맞았군. 이제 그년이 영광을 차지하겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 2b51f457-8ac2-6935-9a84-cac67a75af58
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:2b51f457-8ac2-6935-9a84-cac67a75af58
msgctxt "ha636f618ga50dg4f07g855bg3820f3b23d17"
msgid "Damn right - I'm gonna make this carcass talk."
msgstr "당연하지, 이 시체놈이 말을 하도록 만들 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 2bada9db-5546-c361-627b-881a6bb40a4d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:2bada9db-5546-c361-627b-881a6bb40a4d
msgctxt "h5423f909g8f5ag45afg9504g5696a6e63c7d"
msgid ""
"If the Absolute says to take orders from a drow, then we toe the mark, no "
"questions."
msgstr "절대자께서 드로우의 명령을 따르라고 하면, 의심하지 않고 따라야 한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 2c1b6ead-0784-8f53-ee92-9376612b9c3a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_InfernalBox_State_CharacterHasBox(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:2c1b6ead-0784-8f53-ee92-9376612b9c3a
msgctxt "hebe3316dg564bg4febg9be8g3c0c71a5ad61"
msgid ""
"*You suddenly feel a strange anxiety take hold - not your own, but that of "
"the artefact you carry. Somehow, <i>it's afraid</i>...*"
msgstr ""
"*갑자기 묘한 불안감이 엄습해 옵니다. 하지만 당신이 아닌, 당신이 지니고 있는 아티팩트의 불안입니다. 어째서인지, <i>그것은 "
"두려워하고 있습니다</i>...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 2c2c2103-70d2-a1ea-9d38-75cf6672264e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:2c2c2103-70d2-a1ea-9d38-75cf6672264e
msgctxt "h98b1013fg75ffg4ffcga5f7g91fa4820d04f"
msgid "*You read aloud the words on the scroll.*"
msgstr "*두루마리에 적힌 글자를 소리 내 읽는다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 2ce40212-295a-638e-7ce2-cb94cfccaee1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:2ce40212-295a-638e-7ce2-cb94cfccaee1
msgctxt "h88d31f15geca5g4345gb68dg2fb4f50ba5cd"
msgid "*The creature responds - not in words, but memories.*"
msgstr "*생명체가 말이 아니라, 기억으로 반응합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2fcbe299-9b4a-a20c-9aeb-229420ae986c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:2fcbe299-9b4a-a20c-9aeb-229420ae986c
msgctxt "h28cb9447ga6e5g47a1g865bgc65100320a83"
msgid "<i>Settle in to watch the proceedings.</i>"
msgstr "<i>잠시 기다리며 상황을 지켜본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3039f1a9-12a4-c494-d156-92051da4bbe9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Scrying_AskedAbsolute(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Scrying_AskedAbsolute(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:3039f1a9-12a4-c494-d156-92051da4bbe9
msgctxt "h99372170g9925g43e5ga3c4g842746e91164"
msgid "Who is the Absolute?"
msgstr "절대자가 누구지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 303d98fb-6c00-1610-2742-dea05f3c97ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:303d98fb-6c00-1610-2742-dea05f3c97ad
msgctxt "hbe8d9865g2c44g425bg9d4fgb2438e1f0c7e"
msgid "You're <i>kidding</i> me! Very helpful, squid."
msgstr "<i>장난하는</i> 거냐! 아주 도움이 되는군, 오징어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 3189ba21-965c-7d70-0596-c5051ad443c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:3189ba21-965c-7d70-0596-c5051ad443c2
msgctxt "hdb2661b6gab6bg4fa2ga116g4e66a191bf78"
msgid "That can't be..."
msgstr "그럴 리가..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 3301435b-afdc-ec1a-44b3-06ae82d4e5d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: (BESTIAL or PLANAR or RARE) and !GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:3301435b-afdc-ec1a-44b3-06ae82d4e5d9
msgctxt "h4774907ag30dcg4d89g9be2g2144329ebb29"
msgid "Never saw a True Soul like you. But you got the Absolute's blessing."
msgstr "너 같은 참된 영혼은 처음 보는군. 하지만 분명 절대자님의 축복을 지니고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 34609a10-1aac-b598-4344-d1cfa4220054
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:34609a10-1aac-b598-4344-d1cfa4220054
msgctxt "hfdfa78d4gcc32g4594g8457g43c5d8255d56"
msgid ""
"*Curiosity conquers the hobgoblin's suspicions. You suck in a breath of "
"relief...*"
msgstr "*홉고블린의 호기심이 의심보다 강합니다. 당신은 안도의 한숨을 들이마시며...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 367302a9-7d60-624b-daad-fdca43146cd8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:367302a9-7d60-624b-daad-fdca43146cd8
msgctxt "hdfbf5fdbg5d40g44b5g8ae4gb022476aa154"
msgid "<i>...Nothing. Release Ragzlin's mind.</i>"
msgstr "<i> ...아무것도 묻지 않는다. 라그즐린의 정신을 풀어준다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 371c513d-bae3-4643-e081-66d60835ef2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:371c513d-bae3-4643-e081-66d60835ef2c
msgctxt "hb2a35689g6459g457fg8c73g397049c383bc"
msgid "I saw it, too. Gith on the hunt. They know something..."
msgstr "나도 봤어. 기스가 사냥을 나서더군. 뭔가 알고 있는 것 같은데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 37ef30f6-6edd-fbda-8bea-94137e9cb3d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:37ef30f6-6edd-fbda-8bea-94137e9cb3d0
msgctxt "hdcc617eeg48c0g4cc8ga4e4g960cfefb48d5"
msgid "All right. Let the ceremony proceed."
msgstr "좋아. 의식을 계속하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 380ea60d-dfae-8e1d-98a9-1f03d4908523
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:380ea60d-dfae-8e1d-98a9-1f03d4908523
msgctxt "hca088dd2g7db7g4161ga5d2g197b668ee029"
msgid "No. <i>No! I'm not done!</i>"
msgstr "안 돼. <i>안 돼! 아직 끝나지 않았어!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3812177c-ee9d-337e-62c2-f86ee852a4b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CRA_Escape_State_KilledMindflayer(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:3812177c-ee9d-337e-62c2-f86ee852a4b8
msgctxt "he65ac0c8gc38ag4751ga17fg2d94d225a660"
msgid ""
"*Your heart seizes. Under questioning, the creature might recognise you as "
"its killer.*"
msgstr "*심장이 요동칩니다. 질문을 하다 보면, 이 생명체가 당신이 그를 살해했다는 것을 알아차릴지도 모릅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 3932e99b-d8db-9ada-a9ae-b83b8e60de5e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Scrying_AskedAbsolute(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:3932e99b-d8db-9ada-a9ae-b83b8e60de5e
msgctxt "h9a6a4e93g470ag4815gb291g44a142ff02a3"
msgid "Gith on the... the... <i>Wait.</i>"
msgstr "기스가... 어디로... <i>잠깐.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3c5195c6-069c-24bd-888c-d0902048904d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:3c5195c6-069c-24bd-888c-d0902048904d
msgctxt "h5ab5d60fg93cag49c0gbd63g2b5b6a71fe33"
msgid "Never mind."
msgstr "신경 쓰지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3cf9ef9b-c3f4-1b32-fd16-19ef4a4cc1f3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:3cf9ef9b-c3f4-1b32-fd16-19ef4a4cc1f3
msgctxt "h59da1bceg1b24g488eg928dge7100d7b8a5b"
msgid "I don't know anything, but I'll have your head if you ask again."
msgstr "아무것도 모르지만, 네가 다시 질문하면 머리를 잘라버리겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3d447040-cceb-d7d1-e15a-b92fbd8988ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Scrying_AskedGith(2) = False
#.      - GOB_Scrying_AskedMission(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Scrying_AskedGith(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:3d447040-cceb-d7d1-e15a-b92fbd8988ed
msgctxt "hce883fd6g9cf2g4344ga780gf5047f445404"
msgid "'Why were the gith chasing that ship?'"
msgstr "'기스가 어째서 그 함선을 뒤쫓고 있었던 거지?'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 3d6343d0-3c20-cd71-9be3-f22fac413634
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_GoblinKing_Event_KingHostile(2) = True
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:3d6343d0-3c20-cd71-9be3-f22fac413634
msgctxt "h77953a21g45a7g4f93gbb5egd4d5f41844b0"
msgid "What sorcery you playing at? Boys - destroy him!"
msgstr "무슨 주술을 부리려는 거냐? 얘들아, 놈을 박살 내버려라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 3d6343d0-3c20-cd71-9be3-f22fac413634
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_GoblinKing_Event_KingHostile(2) = True
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:3d6343d0-3c20-cd71-9be3-f22fac413634
msgctxt "h6d67b507gb0ddg45eeg8459g9975fe1d534b"
msgid "What sorcery are you playing at? Boys - destroy her!"
msgstr "무슨 주술을 부리려는 거냐? 얘들아, 이년을 박살 내버려라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 3d6343d0-3c20-cd71-9be3-f22fac413634
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_GoblinKing_Event_KingHostile(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:3d6343d0-3c20-cd71-9be3-f22fac413634
msgctxt "hee4eca21g7bd7g467ega082g28d2ca2bb543"
msgid "What sorcery are you playing at? Boys - destroy them!"
msgstr "무슨 주술을 부리려는 거냐? 얘들아, 놈들을 박살 내버려라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3e3d1c26-32cf-9f83-0848-49b5e47f2501
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:3e3d1c26-32cf-9f83-0848-49b5e47f2501
msgctxt "hea8e0c4fg4104g49ceg8d40g604b4b321946"
msgid "Then let the ceremony proceed."
msgstr "그렇다면 의식을 계속하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 406f9a14-abfb-a626-e0aa-4b17105864c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:406f9a14-abfb-a626-e0aa-4b17105864c2
msgctxt "he7835604gfd8eg4802g9afbg2b47101212d2"
msgid "I'm staying. Go on with the ceremony."
msgstr "난 여기 있겠다. 의식을 계속해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 41e2e4f0-4090-357a-d87e-ce72f793a990
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:41e2e4f0-4090-357a-d87e-ce72f793a990
msgctxt "hed7ab659ge9dag4a49g9490ga3b80b470502"
msgid "*Ragzlin frowns at a question he would never have asked.*"
msgstr "*그라면 절대 묻지 않았을 질문이 나오자 라그즐린이 눈살을 찡그립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 424ab82d-581c-dbf9-1cb8-80d1e2708576
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:424ab82d-581c-dbf9-1cb8-80d1e2708576
msgctxt "h9db4562agac37g4123ga55eg7626716c7cc3"
msgid "What were you doing in Faerûn?"
msgstr "페이룬에서 뭘 하고 있었지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 42769855-fa61-a6d1-251f-82cc608f9aee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:42769855-fa61-a6d1-251f-82cc608f9aee
msgctxt "h67d871fbgf806g417agad08gdf01cf8b15bf"
msgid ""
"*Then the creature speaks in visions: curved drow blades, crude goblin "
"torches, gnoll teeth dripping blood.*"
msgstr "*그러더니 환영이 드러납니다. 구부러진 드로우 칼날, 투박한 고블린 횃불, 피가 뚝뚝 떨어지는 놀의 이빨이 보입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 42da44e6-7f3a-e55b-d13e-e53d24130067
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:42da44e6-7f3a-e55b-d13e-e53d24130067
msgctxt "he77f0102g9078g41daga393g0099cbae265e"
msgid "*The corpse collapses, silent once more.*"
msgstr "*시체가 바닥으로 떨어지며, 다시 침묵합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 436be664-d87d-a0c1-d1d7-c24ce3a45194
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:436be664-d87d-a0c1-d1d7-c24ce3a45194
msgctxt "hd977152fg7acag4e7bgb7c2g499b9712162e"
msgid "No. <i>No! We're not done!</i>"
msgstr "안 돼. <i>안 돼! 아직 끝나지 않았어!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 451ac6d4-d965-606a-96cc-61ffe7f80812
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:451ac6d4-d965-606a-96cc-61ffe7f80812
msgctxt "h27a48965gc08eg4901gbf0fg2cdfef9b2570"
msgid ""
"All right, all right. I shouldn't have questioned a True Soul like that."
msgstr "알았어, 알았어. 참된 영혼을 의심해서 미안하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 460b879c-c8b4-d88e-b3e6-4333bc03e074
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:460b879c-c8b4-d88e-b3e6-4333bc03e074
msgctxt "h22adff1ag406bg4b23ga8e8gae04bb5a16e6"
msgid "*Control panels melting, flesh-pods spilled open.*"
msgstr "*제어 기판들이 녹아내리고, 포드들이 부서져 내용물이 쏟아져나옵니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 464d24c6-ca8c-fe3b-3216-56a3ccc4e47b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 6584fb1a-7ca9-950f-40a6-be0cfdd296f7_TriedLeaving = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:464d24c6-ca8c-fe3b-3216-56a3ccc4e47b
msgctxt "h1c0d8daagc47cg4808g884eg1db035925dfb"
msgid "<i>Turn away from the rite.</i>"
msgstr "<i>뒤돌아 떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 47c12eb1-de49-0ba7-eeb8-36466267eaa6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:47c12eb1-de49-0ba7-eeb8-36466267eaa6
msgctxt "ha505b3d3g8007g46b5g8f03g97459b6c48c4"
msgid ""
"*He doesn't speak his next words, yet they still rattle your skull from "
"within.*"
msgstr "*그의 다음 말은 귀가 아닌 당신의 머릿속에서 들려옵니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 47c70e67-42d3-66fa-6b6b-8664018fed88
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:47c70e67-42d3-66fa-6b6b-8664018fed88
msgctxt "h1ded6549g2690g4b0bga9bfgf980898b097e"
msgid "*Ragzlin's thoughts roil, then still. Your words will be his.*"
msgstr "*라그즐린의 정신이 요동치더니, 안정을 찾습니다. 당신의 생각이 곧 그가 내뱉는 말이 될 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 48bbea1a-c4a0-f129-ab97-c835afb97cfc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_GoblinKing_Event_Surprise = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:48bbea1a-c4a0-f129-ab97-c835afb97cfc
msgctxt "h2272daf4geebbg4fcbg8610g4d45a6682d7a"
msgid "<i>Move in for the kill.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격을 시작한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4b003f39-0d25-1230-c13f-646af4256ae9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:4b003f39-0d25-1230-c13f-646af4256ae9
msgctxt "h176b34cdgdae0g42f5gae64g39dea95a72da"
msgid "*Your parasite resists, flailing as you crawl into Ragzlin's mindmurk.*"
msgstr "*라그즐린의 정신 깊은 곳으로 파고들자, 당신의 기생충이 저항하며 꿈틀댑니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 4b71c388-7b3f-f995-bee8-96b73a891eb7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_GoblinKing_HasMet(2) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_GoblinKingScryingStarted = True
#.     - GLO_Absolute_Knows_Name = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:4b71c388-7b3f-f995-bee8-96b73a891eb7
msgctxt "hd505dd44g2c9cg42fbga896g7bc9fd1e220e"
msgid "I command you, corpse: speak! Reveal truth to the Absolute!"
msgstr "네게 명령하노니, 시체여. 말하라! 절대자님께 진실을 밝혀라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4ddd5690-aa76-90d9-37de-a0f8c88eff4e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Scrying_NoddedOrShrugged(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Scrying_NoddedOrShrugged(2) = True
#. TagRule: DROWELF or DROWHALFELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:4ddd5690-aa76-90d9-37de-a0f8c88eff4e
msgctxt "hb71f3c82g38b2g439aga391ge808f751e4e7"
msgid "Goblins and drow, working together. Never thought I'd see the day."
msgstr "고블린과 드로우가 함께 일하고 있다니. 이런 광경을 보게 될 줄은 몰랐는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4ddd5690-aa76-90d9-37de-a0f8c88eff4e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Scrying_NoddedOrShrugged(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Scrying_NoddedOrShrugged(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:4ddd5690-aa76-90d9-37de-a0f8c88eff4e
msgctxt "h354ce6a4g793dg4292gae79g9ce3f30d2ce5"
msgid "Goblins and drow, working together. But why?"
msgstr "고블린과 드로우가 협력하고 있잖아. 왜지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4e0d674c-0684-7ba9-1d7d-04cd1913a1c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Scrying_AskedMission(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Scrying_AskedMission(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:4e0d674c-0684-7ba9-1d7d-04cd1913a1c3
msgctxt "h7bc5469dgf07cg4825g828ag583e72aa06d5"
msgid "What were you doing in Faerûn?"
msgstr "페이룬에서 뭘 하고 있었지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 4e32b613-e69a-5fef-a1dd-d5374823c2ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DRAGONBORN(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:4e32b613-e69a-5fef-a1dd-d5374823c2ca
msgctxt "h3462a0fdg1118g4747gb5aeg9c6521f9ffd0"
msgid "Dragonborn..."
msgstr "드래곤본..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 50dee4f6-1bbb-d058-a7d9-ba72476864f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_GoblinKing_Event_Surprise = True
#. TagRule: PALADIN_VENGEANCE and NOT_FOR_EA
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:50dee4f6-1bbb-d058-a7d9-ba72476864f2
msgctxt "h0e4f9c62gc790g4ff5gae2ega55834e8f84f"
msgid ""
"I speak for the souls your evil god has slain - and I say they are due their "
"revenge."
msgstr "난 네가 섬기는 사악한 영혼이 끊어버린 수많은 영혼을 대신해 말한다. 그리고 그들의 복수를 이룰 때가 왔다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 50dee4f6-1bbb-d058-a7d9-ba72476864f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_GoblinKing_Event_Surprise = True
#. TagRule: PALADIN_DEVOTION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:50dee4f6-1bbb-d058-a7d9-ba72476864f2
msgctxt "h28acec61ge821g4c34g96fage409201382a4"
msgid ""
"I speak for the virtues sacred and pure - and I say you die here, monster."
msgstr "난 신성하고 순수한 미덕을 대변한다. 괴물 자식, 네 삶은 여기까지다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 50dee4f6-1bbb-d058-a7d9-ba72476864f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_GoblinKing_Event_Surprise = True
#. TagRule: PALADIN_ANCIENTS
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:50dee4f6-1bbb-d058-a7d9-ba72476864f2
msgctxt "h983fa355g719eg494bg99e9g87ccd97cf1f1"
msgid "I speak for the untamed wild - and I say <i>enough</i>. This ends here."
msgstr "난 야생의 자연을 대변해 말한다. 이제 <i>그만</i>. 이걸로 끝이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 5441bf74-7ace-c085-a22b-a446c387d627
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_GoblinKing_Event_ScryingEnded = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:5441bf74-7ace-c085-a22b-a446c387d627
msgctxt "h622c4ed8gbc42g4041gbe41g5d0727245396"
msgid "Praise th' Absolute."
msgstr "절대자님을 찬양하라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 54e6c564-8cab-f44b-68d6-f626fc08869c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Scrying_AskedDeath(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Scrying_AskedDeath(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:54e6c564-8cab-f44b-68d6-f626fc08869c
msgctxt "h9f6310bfgb151g400cgaf5dgdfcca7303f04"
msgid "'Who killed you?'"
msgstr "'누가 널 죽였지?'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 55181588-6bd2-fd25-059f-a533c6184ea8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:55181588-6bd2-fd25-059f-a533c6184ea8
msgctxt "hd21e21a0gc63ag4badga69fg8993eff4e734"
msgid "Yeah, yeah - you're right. You're a real True Soul. I felt it."
msgstr "그래, 그래. 네 말이 맞다. 넌 진짜 참된 영혼이야. 느껴졌어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 57080b9d-e432-773e-6090-7c4c07b240fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:57080b9d-e432-773e-6090-7c4c07b240fd
msgctxt "hc64b9ef3gf0e1g4f13gbe34g62188b78a6b0"
msgid "*Doubt clouds Ragzlin's skull. Might he suspect the truth?*"
msgstr "*라그즐린의 머릿속에 의심이 피어오릅니다. 그가 진실을 수상쩍어할까요?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 585c182b-7929-9b59-6d69-1eb8017b0cce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Scrying_AskedMission(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:585c182b-7929-9b59-6d69-1eb8017b0cce
msgctxt "hb0e0adffgcf51g402ag8238ge1a0fc88120a"
msgid "'What were you doing in Faerûn?'"
msgstr "'페이룬에서 뭘 하고 있었지?'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 5a0b7c88-4480-cdad-b2f3-bcea1da93d52
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:5a0b7c88-4480-cdad-b2f3-bcea1da93d52
msgctxt "h53e18f77gb8c1g417dg8d80gcdf68d03c6a8"
msgid "A gith..."
msgstr "기스..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 5a225cd4-7908-13e7-f8cd-e5d079760740
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:5a225cd4-7908-13e7-f8cd-e5d079760740
msgctxt "heacbdfddg7aa3g4aa5ga7c7gbab5c44dec77"
msgid "You still here? Get yourself gone, before I show you my <i>temper</i>."
msgstr "아직 여기 있었나? 당장 꺼지지 않으면 내 성질이 어떤지 알게 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5a8400f2-5bef-4b7c-8274-0578edf90d1c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:5a8400f2-5bef-4b7c-8274-0578edf90d1c
msgctxt "h74c3f887gc811g48e9ga13dg40a28f79cc81"
msgid ""
"*Your skull sizzles with Ragzlin's displeasure. His mouth is still, but you "
"hear his demand.*"
msgstr "*라그즐린의 불만으로 당신의 두개골이 떨립니다. 그의 입은 가만히 있지만, 그의 요구가 들려옵니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5a88fbee-3e22-6885-9701-cabc529b9b94
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:5a88fbee-3e22-6885-9701-cabc529b9b94
msgctxt "hc666fb50g52b9g4834g9c6dgaf41f7d406b1"
msgid "*With Ragzlin's voice, you ask...*"
msgstr "*라그즐린의 목소리로 당신은...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5a8cb7cc-c85e-5c65-d144-e20411637952
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:5a8cb7cc-c85e-5c65-d144-e20411637952
msgctxt "h379b328ag8987g43c4g9ccagfe0878095874"
msgid ""
"*Suspicion floods Ragzlin's mind. Your brain <i>howls</i> as you consider "
"your final question.*"
msgstr "*라그즐린의 머릿속에 의심이 가득 찹니다. 당신이 마지막 질문을 고민하는 동안 당신의 뇌가 울부짖습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5a8e1189-c26c-f007-8b00-90fc24866f2f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:5a8e1189-c26c-f007-8b00-90fc24866f2f
msgctxt "ha570f604gb06cg45bbg8974g2ceffcb3dc6c"
msgid ""
"*The elf speaks of the hunt for a great weapon, and the rewards that will go "
"to whoever finds it. The hobgoblin's eyes gleam hungrily.*"
msgstr ""
"*엘프가 중대한 무기를 찾는 사냥에 대해 말하고, 그것을 찾는 자에게는 보상이 내려질 것이라고 합니다. 그러자 홉고블린의 눈이 욕심으로 "
"번쩍입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 5b17614f-5069-b5ba-29aa-422d989ad183
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:5b17614f-5069-b5ba-29aa-422d989ad183
msgctxt "h6af33e11gc06bg40b5gaa23g63719bebe975"
msgid "Falling in line. Just what I like to see."
msgstr "까라면 까야지. 보기 좋네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 5e4f9546-727b-3b27-8503-c89cf7472009
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:5e4f9546-727b-3b27-8503-c89cf7472009
msgctxt "h4e40b61fgd60bg4b05g820cg8052a1f84c9c"
msgid "Right Hand, eh? Sounds like word's spreading!"
msgstr "오른손이라고 했나? 소문이 퍼지고 있는 것 같군!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 60610068-171e-c382-fbdb-f96f83ed3d9a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:60610068-171e-c382-fbdb-f96f83ed3d9a
msgctxt "hb26c3dc4g223ag43bfg831cga3db6d37ebb6"
msgid "I'm closing some gaps in my group. Everyone needs a healer."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6097abdf-991b-21d5-5d91-ebc06f56e647
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_GoblinKing_Event_Surprise = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:6097abdf-991b-21d5-5d91-ebc06f56e647
msgctxt "h962e19e6g6505g44e0g864bgac85f07f4d3f"
msgid "<i>Thrust yourself into his mind.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그의 정신 속으로 파고든다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 60d91c7f-b668-18a6-d45d-17a163013375
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:60d91c7f-b668-18a6-d45d-17a163013375
msgctxt "hf565013fg313eg4a3fg8361gc3e7f3889cf0"
msgid ""
"*Ragzlin scowls, shocked by a question you shouldn't have asked, and a jolt "
"shoots through you.*"
msgstr ""
"*라그즐린이 자신이라면 하지 않았을 질문에 놀라며 얼굴을 찌푸립니다. 그러더니 당신에게 전기가 통한 듯 찌릿한 느낌이 퍼집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 612b94cf-accf-c81e-f4eb-341f6f3e882d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:612b94cf-accf-c81e-f4eb-341f6f3e882d
msgctxt "h7fd345abg0c7cg4d69g9508g6d221a913cce"
msgid "I'm a True Soul as well. How would I know more than you do?"
msgstr "나도 참된 영혼이야. 나라고 뭘 더 알겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 62d0b7d2-b246-d476-53ad-cf0a3d4028de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC(2) = False
#.      - PALADIN(2) = False
#.      - BARD(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:62d0b7d2-b246-d476-53ad-cf0a3d4028de
msgctxt "h1b6aaa86gc960g4de8gb6abge9352cc86edf"
msgid "What kind of ceremony is this?"
msgstr "이건 뭐 하는 의식이지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63dd3552-505b-c4bd-0c74-9f720abe953b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:63dd3552-505b-c4bd-0c74-9f720abe953b
msgctxt "h936da073gf8d9g4568gbda9ge3db09191a6b"
msgid "<b>NOTHING. PIPE DOWN.</b>"
msgstr "<b>아무것도 아니야. 신경 꺼.</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 64034f17-6bc9-8afd-c979-a7e9258ebaa4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:64034f17-6bc9-8afd-c979-a7e9258ebaa4
msgctxt "hadb3ada7g3604g423bgafbcgcf7916ba0d23"
msgid ""
"*Again, a vision comes to you. A memory, seen through the creature's soul-"
"dead eyes.*"
msgstr "*다시 한 번 환영이 보입니다. 이 죽은 생물의 공허한 눈에 비친 기억입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6606d76c-3cdc-bfb4-c188-c93e3b6c9b22
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:6606d76c-3cdc-bfb4-c188-c93e3b6c9b22
msgctxt "h6cfa8819g8d66g4ab8g93ccg2b9d7137e1a4"
msgid ""
"*Your skull sizzles with Ragzlin's displeasure. His mouth is still, yet you "
"hear his demand.*"
msgstr "*라그즐린의 불만으로 당신의 두개골이 떨립니다. 그의 입술은 움직이지 않지만, 그의 요구는 들을 수 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 660c7853-334f-930d-4587-584ba27ccf95
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:660c7853-334f-930d-4587-584ba27ccf95
msgctxt "h11525a5fg8132g452cga2bbg7aab823136c6"
msgid "You heard me. Talk to Minthara yourself."
msgstr "내 말 들었잖아. 민타라한텐 직접 말해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6863d067-1c7f-c85f-db08-c84ad847cac6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(2) = True
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:6863d067-1c7f-c85f-db08-c84ad847cac6
msgctxt "h7ece278cg8fddg40a7ga5fcgbe09faac5a9d"
msgid ""
"*You realise that the weapon the hobgoblin speaks of is the artefact you "
"carry. You cannot let them discover it - no matter what.*"
msgstr ""
"*당신은 홉고블린이 말하고 있는 무기가 바로 당신이 가지고 있는 기스 아티팩트라는 사실을 깨닫습니다. 어떤 일이 있어도 그들이 이 사실을 "
"알아내서는 안 됩니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 691edfca-6b0d-fe29-c34b-d7d3e5ded5fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Scrying_AskedDeath(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Scrying_AskedDeath(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:691edfca-6b0d-fe29-c34b-d7d3e5ded5fa
msgctxt "h67dd518dg49efg466bg9604g82cae6d28931"
msgid "'Who killed you?'"
msgstr "'누가 널 죽였지?'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 6b43b07e-ba8e-66d8-b88c-fb6349bf2f53
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:6b43b07e-ba8e-66d8-b88c-fb6349bf2f53
msgctxt "h94410584ga803g4d3fgb167gf0cdc2c135da"
msgid "What did the killer want?"
msgstr "살해자가 뭘 원했지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 6dad47f7-be2f-79ac-6c44-611adef3577f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:6dad47f7-be2f-79ac-6c44-611adef3577f
msgctxt "hc67ee6c5ga956g4689g8ce0g1877a39f3e34"
msgid "<i>Shuugaan, a shuulkac...</i>"
msgstr "<i>슈간, 어 슐칵...</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 6df89a0d-d6cb-e9b5-d865-0c417521d2a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:6df89a0d-d6cb-e9b5-d865-0c417521d2a8
msgctxt "ha6e04941g4c8dg442ega0d9g5b5e161b5fac"
msgid "Well don't just stand there. Move!"
msgstr "뭘 가만히 서 있어. 움직여!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6f49ef3d-983d-5946-2651-0341ac092df4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:6f49ef3d-983d-5946-2651-0341ac092df4
msgctxt "h7662b0aegaa19g4f8cga162g555abdc86877"
msgid ""
"*...and visions consume you once more. A swarm of githyanki dragon-riders, "
"silver blades held high.*"
msgstr "*...그러더니 다시 한 번 환영이 당신을 감쌉니다. 은검을 높이 들어 올린 기스양키 드래곤 기수들의 무리가 보입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 6fbebd6d-aa13-6f84-94d8-5d5ffd44fd0b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Scrying_AskedDeath(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Scrying_AskedDeath(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:6fbebd6d-aa13-6f84-94d8-5d5ffd44fd0b
msgctxt "h3f72eebeg37adg48a5g81cfg4637f11892c1"
msgid "Tell me who killed you, freak. No games!"
msgstr "누가 널 죽였는지 말해, 괴물아. 장난질하지 말고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 702fb41e-ea5c-4a79-6db2-afa99aa9abb0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:702fb41e-ea5c-4a79-6db2-afa99aa9abb0
msgctxt "hd95cda63g67f1g42a5g8e2fgc80f61d1088b"
msgid ""
"*Suspicion floods Ragzlin's mind. Your brain <i>howls</i> as you force a "
"final query into his throat.*"
msgstr "*라그즐린의 머릿속에 의심이 가득 찹니다. 당신이 마지막 질문을 그의 목으로 밀어 넣는 동안 당신의 뇌가 울부짖습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 70827da3-e204-f16b-574f-8d31169b1445
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Scrying_AskedGith(2) = False
#.      - GOB_Scrying_AskedMission(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Scrying_AskedGith(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:70827da3-e204-f16b-574f-8d31169b1445
msgctxt "hf0962340g8a6cg4078gb44dgdcf91778fea3"
msgid "Why were the gith chasing the ship?"
msgstr "어째서 기스가 함선을 쫓고 있었던 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 722912df-a128-0105-c969-151effc053df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:722912df-a128-0105-c969-151effc053df
msgctxt "h86085eb9g606fg4f82gb95bgd8b9246a0e16"
msgid ""
"*Ragzlin remains composed. If he senses your manipulations, he gives no "
"sign.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 7242ba86-77e7-67bd-1e4d-ff190a027aeb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 6584fb1a-7ca9-950f-40a6-be0cfdd296f7_MindHasBeenRead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:7242ba86-77e7-67bd-1e4d-ff190a027aeb
msgctxt "hf201d378g1009g4359gaa82g28754e4d254e"
msgid "<i>I am the Absolute's Right Hand. I will stand for no lies!</i>"
msgstr "<i>난 절대자님의 오른팔이다. 거짓말을 좌시하진 않겠어!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 726fb093-65ee-e6b8-3737-2172a70e65f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_GroveConflict_Quest_SentToMinthara = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:726fb093-65ee-e6b8-3737-2172a70e65f6
msgctxt "h358ffbd1g3f4ag4492g8661g0ebb3f2ea90b"
msgid "Fine, fine. I'll talk to Minthara."
msgstr "알았어, 알았다고. 민타라에겐 내가 말하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7279d621-781e-8150-a2ac-4e19736d0d9f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:7279d621-781e-8150-a2ac-4e19736d0d9f
msgctxt "h7dfdb4c4ga57dg4d7agbc42gaa4cc1c6b5fe"
msgid "Go ahead. I'm watching."
msgstr "계속해. 보고 있으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 72c04994-f58d-d51e-48cf-7d0ad792edfa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Scrying_AskedAbsolute(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:72c04994-f58d-d51e-48cf-7d0ad792edfa
msgctxt "h8be6c7d4gd0b6g4196gad81gf2dd561751c6"
msgid "'Who is the Absolute?'"
msgstr "'절대자가 누구지?'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 72e1caed-f60d-ac6c-51d9-a2062f50b513
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_GoblinKing_HasMet(2) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_GoblinKing_Event_ScryingEnded = True
#. TagRule: DROWELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:72e1caed-f60d-ac6c-51d9-a2062f50b513
msgctxt "ha733ebcbg854cg403egb753g33e67fea1583"
msgid "Praise the Absolute! What you needing, drow?"
msgstr "절대자님을 찬양하라! 원하는 게 뭔가, 드로우?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 72e1caed-f60d-ac6c-51d9-a2062f50b513
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_GoblinKing_HasMet(2) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_GoblinKing_Event_ScryingEnded = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:72e1caed-f60d-ac6c-51d9-a2062f50b513
msgctxt "h93e56cdfg2998g425fg85d6gb880ba707b27"
msgid "What you needing now?"
msgstr "필요한 게 뭐냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 731bfc83-60b5-29cd-49fc-c6889b87a0f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Scrying_AskedDeath(2) = True
#.   Object:
#.      - CRA_Escape_State_KilledMindflayer(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:731bfc83-60b5-29cd-49fc-c6889b87a0f0
msgctxt "h8194ad6fg44b4g45f2ga79fg9567b6afd3a3"
msgid "That's all you've got? Tell me what the killer looks like!"
msgstr "그게 전부냐? 살해자가 어떻게 생겼는지 말해!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 73fc1bda-7061-4492-88cb-e47ab1820f20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Scrying_RecognisedMindFlayer(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:73fc1bda-7061-4492-88cb-e47ab1820f20
msgctxt "hb35cb262ge213g41eag8a2fg5257d77ebbaf"
msgid "I haven't made a habit of it."
msgstr "많이 해보진 않았는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 748c166f-3eb0-7b9e-161c-5ecde2dae5c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_GoblinKing_Event_Surprise = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:748c166f-3eb0-7b9e-161c-5ecde2dae5c2
msgctxt "hcc2874d0g0804g45d0gb70bg1207d043d7aa"
msgid "<i>Drop the ruse and attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>속임수를 그만두고 공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 74f3caaa-de44-4ef8-e803-fc8b335f0bc1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:74f3caaa-de44-4ef8-e803-fc8b335f0bc1
msgctxt "hf4093a5fgb464g4358gaad5ge5456f7dfc6f"
msgid "*Ragzlin's mind rages. You have asked what no True Soul would dare.*"
msgstr "*라그즐린의 정신이 분노합니다. 당신은 감히 참된 영혼이라면 하지 않았을 질문을 던졌습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 77555125-1e79-5426-b95f-447ff65f1f84
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:77555125-1e79-5426-b95f-447ff65f1f84
msgctxt "h91467d06ga3d8g44afga19eg52dd66160076"
msgid ""
"*The artefact does not want to part from you. It does not want to fall into "
"the Absolute's clutches.*"
msgstr "*아티팩트는 당신과 떨어지고 싶지 않습니다. 절대자의 손에 떨어지지 않고 싶어 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 791c0816-6959-2aa5-62da-0119ab168218
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:791c0816-6959-2aa5-62da-0119ab168218
msgctxt "hcd98a0c3g21e6g4a64gbe7cg4b9a2f94646a"
msgid "Talk to me, freak. Who killed you?"
msgstr "말해 봐, 괴물아. 누가 널 죽였지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 7969bf35-66bf-6bdc-25fd-073a88bcf041
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_GoblinKing_Event_ToldAboutWeapon = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:7969bf35-66bf-6bdc-25fd-073a88bcf041
msgctxt "hfdc70d49gf13bg496cgaa0bgcfe9fc21cc5d"
msgid ""
"Absolute says the dead squiddie had a weapon. I reckon the killer nabbed it "
"and scooted off to that looter camp."
msgstr ""
"절대자께서 이 죽은 오징어 친구가 무기를 가지고 있었다고 하셨다. 내 생각엔 이 녀석을 죽인 놈이 그걸 가지고 자기 야영지로 도망친 것 "
"같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 797ad33d-993e-2480-0865-d7196255bd20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:797ad33d-993e-2480-0865-d7196255bd20
msgctxt "hbd9e9f71g2b02g4ef9gbed3gf992cb3f34ec"
msgid "*You choke on black smoke as the hobgoblin bellows his incantation.*"
msgstr "*홉고블린이 주문을 외우기 시작하자 당신은 검은 연기에 질식하기 시작합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 7a8edbb7-db44-4818-4742-a3f6798ec330
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:7a8edbb7-db44-4818-4742-a3f6798ec330
msgctxt "h63606d2agbdbdg4a9cg8ab0g05fe9fd86dd5"
msgid "You - get to the grove. Help the drow Minthara kill the lot."
msgstr "너 - 숲으로 가라. 민타라를 도와 거기 있는 놈들을 죽여."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7b18828b-1639-999e-0bf0-4d833a590d21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Scrying_RecognisedMindFlayer(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:7b18828b-1639-999e-0bf0-4d833a590d21
msgctxt "hf3e05ea5gb7e3g4a5dg823agf3fe7ff39f23"
msgid "<i>Study the corpse. Was this the mind flayer that tortured you?</i>"
msgstr "<i>시체를 조사한다. 당신을 고문했던 그 마인드 플레이어인가?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 7c4eccb8-4062-d966-e88e-9c82af4f2962
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_GoblinKing_Event_KingHostile(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:7c4eccb8-4062-d966-e88e-9c82af4f2962
msgctxt "h6f4901b2g468eg4ba6g9799g327f38a888b4"
msgid "Boys! Crush the heretic!"
msgstr "얘들아! 이단자를 박살 내버려라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 7ca6c877-43cb-7936-2837-6ddc42fa650c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:7ca6c877-43cb-7936-2837-6ddc42fa650c
msgctxt "h7c3170a7ga1a2g4023g9c28g1106c2221c99"
msgid "By Vlaakith's blade. A <i>ghaik</i>."
msgstr "블라키스 님의 검이여. <i>게이크</i>잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7cae51da-5542-db0d-266b-f612fbfce5aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_GoblinKing_Event_Surprise = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:7cae51da-5542-db0d-266b-f612fbfce5aa
msgctxt "h5e29393fg9571g4d0bg8636g0778f1947e17"
msgid "<i>Attack the hobgoblin.</i>"
msgstr "<i>홉고블린을 공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 7d105916-0653-1a8e-f0f4-281bd8798514
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 6584fb1a-7ca9-950f-40a6-be0cfdd296f7_MindHasBeenRead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:7d105916-0653-1a8e-f0f4-281bd8798514
msgctxt "heb50a8fcgd128g49b7gb6c4g734f64c2e902"
msgid ""
"<i>I won't take this disrespect lying down. I'm the boss! I'm the Absolute's "
"</i>Right Hand!"
msgstr "<i>이런 결례를 가만히 지켜보진 않겠다. 난 대장이다! 내가 절대자님의 </i>오른손이라고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 80bb0974-ab56-1d32-0a7c-c11c08f070b4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_GoblinKing_Event_Surprise = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:80bb0974-ab56-1d32-0a7c-c11c08f070b4
msgctxt "hf5c51e4dg0acbg4dadgbaeegef3af3011c1b"
msgid "<i>Attack the hobgoblin.</i>"
msgstr "<i>홉고블린을 공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8303ff90-7d54-bc27-4d83-a99328698f26
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 6584fb1a-7ca9-950f-40a6-be0cfdd296f7_HeadPlaying = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:8303ff90-7d54-bc27-4d83-a99328698f26
msgctxt "he6aac5ffg66c1g4effg9098gb7d02d73c26a"
msgid "I'm a faithful True Soul. Did you not feel our <i>connection</i>?"
msgstr "난 신실한 참된 영혼이야. 우리 <i>연결</i>을 느끼지 못했나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 834c5fff-c632-4d55-1f0a-e214bd3c1936
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:834c5fff-c632-4d55-1f0a-e214bd3c1936
msgctxt "h08da44eeg312bg471fg900dg477b5c6eaeed"
msgid "Now get out, before I get the itch to take yours."
msgstr "이제 껴져, 내가 네 머리통을 잘라버리고 싶어지기 전에."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 8417f64e-a619-e8b4-adbf-85cd69810bf6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:8417f64e-a619-e8b4-adbf-85cd69810bf6
msgctxt "h2df4ec61g03e3g45fdg9194g9be196dc762b"
msgid "Nothing. Must be reading it wrong!"
msgstr "아무 일도 없잖아. 잘못 읽었나 보군!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 85f8b335-852b-9b70-2b05-26edf7edab58
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:85f8b335-852b-9b70-2b05-26edf7edab58
msgctxt "hd06befd7g11fcg4554g853dg4409823a10d8"
msgid ""
"*Another vision. You look back into the darkness of the pod aboard the "
"nautiloid...*"
msgstr "*다른 환영이 보입니다. 노틸로이드 함선에서 포드에 비친 심연을 들여다보고 있습니다...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 877aa437-beb9-1b7f-837c-41bffbcb801d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_GoblinKing_Event_Surprise = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:877aa437-beb9-1b7f-837c-41bffbcb801d
msgctxt "h0d4a23a9gf0a7g4eb2ga920gd51591c20a57"
msgid ""
"Correct. I took an oath to destroy monsters like you - and follow that oath "
"I shall."
msgstr "그래. 난 너 같은 괴물들을 파괴하겠다고 맹세했다. 그 맹세를 지킬 시간이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8814a809-6dcb-e31b-ec07-ed77f9b0ec10
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_GroveConflict_Quest_SentToMinthara = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:8814a809-6dcb-e31b-ec07-ed77f9b0ec10
msgctxt "h567cde94gcb8ag436cga68eg4657c6acd933"
msgid "Consider it done."
msgstr "맡겨만 줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 8884e5ff-5066-9169-447c-db30f8a9a464
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:8884e5ff-5066-9169-447c-db30f8a9a464
msgctxt "h20cacd76gbfa2g4ab7g8400gee57051579fa"
msgid "Why were the gith chasing that ship?"
msgstr "어째서 기스가 그 함선을 쫓고 있었지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 89535898-d981-a7b0-f6f0-2d70f6b37d82
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:89535898-d981-a7b0-f6f0-2d70f6b37d82
msgctxt "h761f5d81g8f7cg47dbga03fg91e89f394a2c"
msgid "This is the big boss. <i>Strike him down.</i>"
msgstr "이 자식이 무리의 지도자야. <i>녀석을 끝장내버리자.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 89deeedc-c9d7-e2f7-93cb-3b300f46b748
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Absolute_Knows_GoblinsWorship = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - HIDDEN_WLD_Boosters.GOB_GoblinKing_Performed(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:89deeedc-c9d7-e2f7-93cb-3b300f46b748
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h4c52588agf8fbg4df6gb0fbg7f723ca9487f"
msgid ""
"Riddles, all of it. And nothing to show for the trouble but rotting squid "
"meat."
msgstr "전부 수수께끼잖아. 결국 해결된 건 아무것도 없고 남은 건 썩은 오징어 고기뿐이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 8a672797-b869-18ca-4e5b-da70c10adef7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:8a672797-b869-18ca-4e5b-da70c10adef7
msgctxt "h806f5ea7g1314g456agaaccg5babbe9e741b"
msgid ""
"*Rage slithers through him, hot and black. It squeezes you, suffocates you.*"
msgstr "*뜨겁고 어두운 분노가 그를 통해 흘러들어옵니다. 그것이 당신을 짓누르고, 숨통을 조입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 8a9cf31e-6f4a-1939-f337-76a5fa2c05cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:8a9cf31e-6f4a-1939-f337-76a5fa2c05cc
msgctxt "h5ee66f2eg5ff9g49c9ga53ag233d2ad54c69"
msgid "You're no True Soul. You're a damned <i>heretic.</i>"
msgstr "넌 참된 영혼이 아니야. 망할 <i>이단자군.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 8b750d20-f8db-fa74-015d-cda021ce41e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:8b750d20-f8db-fa74-015d-cda021ce41e5
msgctxt "hd42763a6g48dfg49bdga5d5g7249903896b5"
msgid ""
"*The creature speaks in visions - a swarm of githyanki dragon-riders, silver "
"blades held high.*"
msgstr "*이 생물이 환영으로 응답합니다. 은검을 높이 들어 올린 기스양키 드래곤 기수들의 무리가 보입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 8c9c0d56-edff-df56-62ff-9f7ab50be68b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:8c9c0d56-edff-df56-62ff-9f7ab50be68b
msgctxt "h4c4b3603g8cb5g46bfgb0b5ga052be44c913"
msgid "*The hobgoblin turns to you, and the parasite squirms in your skull.*"
msgstr "*홉고블린이 당신을 바라보자, 머릿속의 기생충이 꿈틀댑니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 8d245853-1b4e-1304-c758-f0d46e4712f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:8d245853-1b4e-1304-c758-f0d46e4712f2
msgctxt "h03eacc38ge755g49b6g8d32g4e66e9e8e969"
msgid "*Irritation eclipses his suspicions and Ragzlin's mind rests.*"
msgstr "*짜증이 의심을 덮어버리고, 라그즐린의 정신이 다시 안정을 찾습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 8d310e1a-8785-4e46-1742-e4e49240f468
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.     - CORPSE_SPOKEN(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:8d310e1a-8785-4e46-1742-e4e49240f468
msgctxt "h36e33fa4g3d4dg4db0g8d8eg5439d60c8c5d"
msgid "*The hideous corpse rises, tentacles writhing.*"
msgstr "*끔찍한 시체가 떠오르며, 촉수가 흐느적거립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 8d76d324-1adb-6ed8-0084-52ac6b285d0f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:8d76d324-1adb-6ed8-0084-52ac6b285d0f
msgctxt "h2af80e93g16c3g43e2ga952g78ee76f5628d"
msgid "Gith on the hunt. They know something..."
msgstr "기스가 사냥을 나섰어. 뭔가 알고 있군..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 8dce3eff-fada-e611-eab6-547b21654857
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:8dce3eff-fada-e611-eab6-547b21654857
msgctxt "hfbf67d8bgae50g4bcagbc78gb0bb9178b50e"
msgid "*You navigate carefully. With Ragzlin's voice, you ask...*"
msgstr "*조심스레 그를 조종합니다. 라그즐린의 목소리로 당신은...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 906af5aa-c1ee-6f64-44c0-daafae1f538c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 6584fb1a-7ca9-950f-40a6-be0cfdd296f7_TriedLeaving = False
#.   Object:
#.      - CRA_Escape_State_KilledMindflayer(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 6584fb1a-7ca9-950f-40a6-be0cfdd296f7_TriedLeaving = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:906af5aa-c1ee-6f64-44c0-daafae1f538c
msgctxt "h76e4fea5g1337g46dbgb64egb4f5d40ff18b"
msgid "<i>Leave, before the mind flayer can identify you.</i>"
msgstr "<i>마인드 플레이어가 당신을 알아보기 전에 떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 9301862c-c046-3a4c-0146-dc6c6325b611
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_GoblinKing_HasMet(2) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_GoblinKingScryingStarted = True
#. TagRule: TIEFLING
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:9301862c-c046-3a4c-0146-dc6c6325b611
msgctxt "h0f28236bg89e7g4a54gb20bge1e9297c0ab3"
msgid "Not the time for it, devil."
msgstr "그럴 시간은 없다. 데빌."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 9301862c-c046-3a4c-0146-dc6c6325b611
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_GoblinKing_HasMet(2) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_GoblinKingScryingStarted = True
#. TagRule: HUMAN
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:9301862c-c046-3a4c-0146-dc6c6325b611
msgctxt "h641e544bg206eg45d5g815dg8d717efd8ffa"
msgid "No time for human nonsense."
msgstr "인간의 헛소리나 듣고 있을 시간이 아니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 9301862c-c046-3a4c-0146-dc6c6325b611
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_GoblinKing_HasMet(2) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_GoblinKingScryingStarted = True
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:9301862c-c046-3a4c-0146-dc6c6325b611
msgctxt "h064398b1g1964g40c8gaa6cg22e7c0a17a53"
msgid "Not the time for it, woman."
msgstr "그럴 시간이 아니다, 여자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 9301862c-c046-3a4c-0146-dc6c6325b611
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_GoblinKing_HasMet(2) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_GoblinKingScryingStarted = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:9301862c-c046-3a4c-0146-dc6c6325b611
msgctxt "h5caa7377ge2bcg4de8g9037gaf07ff651e74"
msgid "Not the time for it, hear?"
msgstr "그럴 시간 없다. 알겠나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 93d15fff-7769-c4ba-aaa9-f6ce8077a657
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:93d15fff-7769-c4ba-aaa9-f6ce8077a657
msgctxt "h11b08aa7g6604g41a0g84edg786f52697f34"
msgid ""
"*Ragzlin's rage scorches your mind, hot and black. It squeezes you, "
"suffocates you.*"
msgstr "*라그즐린의 뜨겁고 어두운 분노가 당신의 정신을 강타합니다. 당신을 쥐어 짜고, 숨통을 조입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9430f7b5-88d5-a214-87ea-4845cc4d12e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:9430f7b5-88d5-a214-87ea-4845cc4d12e0
msgctxt "h63aa515ag9c39g4517g9472g1f90a799547f"
msgid "*You taste the ale on his tongue and the bile in his soul.*"
msgstr "*그의 혀에서는 술이, 영혼에서는 증오가 느껴집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 95003aa1-e7e7-03b9-10ad-a8b601e4e385
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Scrying_AskedAbsolute(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 6584fb1a-7ca9-950f-40a6-be0cfdd296f7_HeadPlaying = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:95003aa1-e7e7-03b9-10ad-a8b601e4e385
msgctxt "h40a376e2g2ed4g408bg86a1g45138e4d6b97"
msgid ""
"*You see a clawed hand open a holding pod to reveal a face. <i>Yours.</i>*"
msgstr "*길쭉한 손가락이 포드를 잡아 열자, 얼굴이 드러납니다. <i>당신입니다.</i>*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 95425423-55f9-b34d-ead8-4460a5917a45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Scrying_AskedMission(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:95425423-55f9-b34d-ead8-4460a5917a45
msgctxt "h81306ba5g5f7bg486bga209ga24ab1c84493"
msgid "What were you doing in Faerûn?"
msgstr "페이룬에서 뭘 하고 있었지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 95fb7798-f754-7a28-c27d-e4343fba0890
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:95fb7798-f754-7a28-c27d-e4343fba0890
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hbb5db8bfg707ag4c60gaa2dg6a43209a4f13"
msgid ""
"*You feel Ragzlin's suspicions. He'd never have asked about his Master. You "
"remain in control - <i>barely</i>.*"
msgstr ""
"*라그즐린의 얼굴에 의심이 드러납니다. 그는 단 한번도 자신의 주인에 대해 질문해 본 적이 없습니다. 당신은 <i>간신히 통제를 "
"유지합니다.*</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 96a304ec-677d-0b35-3cd4-78836691b68c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:96a304ec-677d-0b35-3cd4-78836691b68c
msgctxt "hfab50db1g31f7g443fg966fgc49db5d7a4ca"
msgid "*You see a clawed hand open a holding pod to reveal... darkness.*"
msgstr "*길쭉한 손가락이 포드를 붙잡아 열자... 어둠만이 보입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9835d6cc-68af-8529-6018-9c264bec4f2e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:9835d6cc-68af-8529-6018-9c264bec4f2e
msgctxt "h8e77454ag4d68g46a7g8d45g7ce825a8d647"
msgid "<i>Dig into Ragzlin's mind and control the interrogation.</i>"
msgstr "<i>라그즐린의 정신에 파고들어 심문을 통제한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 987af92b-7d7d-c23e-949f-4b93191e7630
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_GoblinKing_Event_Surprise = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:987af92b-7d7d-c23e-949f-4b93191e7630
msgctxt "h4139fb6fge492g413cg8e18gc15ac624c72b"
msgid "I know it's about to be joined by a dead hobgoblin."
msgstr "홉고블린 시체가 합류할 시간이라는 건 알겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 98deb6eb-064f-355c-df38-9206aed2ac11
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:98deb6eb-064f-355c-df38-9206aed2ac11
msgctxt "hd77f52bbga5a4g4d10g944fgd353403f7bf5"
msgid "<i>Escape Ragzlin's mind and let him ask his own questions.</i>"
msgstr "<i>라그즐린의 정신에서 빠져나와 그가 직접 질문하게 한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 98f0ca52-c6f9-3a46-ae65-d6188c5a5190
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:98f0ca52-c6f9-3a46-ae65-d6188c5a5190
msgctxt "h9d84797cg5c88g44d0g9418g41623663cce5"
msgid ""
"*Her mind focuses - their suspicion cannot be aroused. They cannot discover "
"that the weapon they seek is within their grasp.*"
msgstr ""
"*그녀가 정신을 집중합니다. 의심을 불러와서는 안 됩니다. 그들이 찾고 있는 무기가 바로 그들 눈앞에 있다는 사실을 알게 할 수는 "
"없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 99337c10-f8fb-998c-fb6b-fc50a6107456
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:99337c10-f8fb-998c-fb6b-fc50a6107456
msgctxt "ha5cc9b49g832cg4445g9954g09ee56a4cbc5"
msgid "Can't you do your own dirty work?"
msgstr "잡일은 알아서 할 수 있지 않나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 9a74a1f7-cc31-60e3-9188-18b60df69cf8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:9a74a1f7-cc31-60e3-9188-18b60df69cf8
msgctxt "hbf286080ge456g42eega912g3232daa0ce0e"
msgid "You. You're no True Soul."
msgstr "너. 넌 참된 영혼이 아니군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9e0f09d6-a20a-40aa-8303-3c8755047b05
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 6584fb1a-7ca9-950f-40a6-be0cfdd296f7_MindHasBeenRead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:9e0f09d6-a20a-40aa-8303-3c8755047b05
msgctxt "he0968d03gb1f0g41d6ga93dg36833e937de1"
msgid "None would dare deceive the Absolute's Right Hand."
msgstr "누가 감히 절대자님의 오른손을 기만하겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = 9edd0d97-1885-74a9-765a-5e43a58f6b47
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:9edd0d97-1885-74a9-765a-5e43a58f6b47
msgctxt "h10c591a7gabe0g4cdfg9a76g579765f8445a"
msgid "No time like the present, eh?"
msgstr "지금처럼 좋은 때가 어디 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a205253d-3042-61be-4893-3cc448d13491
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: BARD or CLERIC
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:a205253d-3042-61be-4893-3cc448d13491
msgctxt "ha9b87edeg4a97g49fbgb8afgfba07405182e"
msgid "Scroll, incense... Do you mean to speak with this corpse?"
msgstr "두루마리, 향... 저 시체랑 대화하려는 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = a277120d-b14d-e7be-1ad9-9b5ccbcf41c5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_GoblinKingScryingStarted = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:a277120d-b14d-e7be-1ad9-9b5ccbcf41c5
msgctxt "hb77df2c3gb854g4511ga375g89186ea713fc"
msgid "<i>Shuugaan, a shuulkac. O taash okec dor.</i>"
msgstr "<i>슈간, 어 슐칵. 오 타쉬 오켁 돌.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = a29872bd-b34d-6f9a-7727-41dc07f8af5f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:a29872bd-b34d-6f9a-7727-41dc07f8af5f
msgctxt "h182561cag331cg4591g9b02g3e9c3da01e6c"
msgid ""
"Guess you're a thick one, so I'll tell it straight: we're gonna make the "
"carcass talk."
msgstr "멍청한 놈인 것 같으니, 직설적으로 말해 주지. 이 시체 자식을 말하게 하려는 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a3163eca-3361-8671-bcef-b4a9adefd62e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 6584fb1a-7ca9-950f-40a6-be0cfdd296f7_MindHasBeenRead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:a3163eca-3361-8671-bcef-b4a9adefd62e
msgctxt "hc1f09c13g36dbg4ffegadbagb8bba2205c09"
msgid "I would <i>never</i> deceive the Absolute's Right Hand."
msgstr "내가 절대자님의 오른손을 기만할 리가 없잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a3c6bab6-c306-c291-9fef-b3392dc5c057
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:a3c6bab6-c306-c291-9fef-b3392dc5c057
msgctxt "h88180b8fga2b6g47a3gb48cg4a989d5cbc0a"
msgid ""
"*Ragzlin's mind is clouded by doubt, surprised by words he didn't expect...*"
msgstr "*그라면 하지 않았을 질문에 놀라, 라그즐린의 정신에 의심이 피어오릅니다...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = a516d141-36c8-d627-179c-fe5902189c1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:a516d141-36c8-d627-179c-fe5902189c1f
msgctxt "h5c66dfcdg13fdg4e18g8a96g5e58457cfacd"
msgid "Hmph. The damned drow was right. Can't let her get all the glory."
msgstr "쳇. 그 망할 드로우가 맞았군. 그년이 영광을 다 차지하게 둘 순 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a5e27e3c-ab18-e25d-9691-3c62cf86d058
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:a5e27e3c-ab18-e25d-9691-3c62cf86d058
msgctxt "h1509df79ga826g49dbg9b71gf03ce4290c84"
msgid ""
"*The visions cloud your inner eye for a brief moment once again. You see the "
"hobgoblin, bowing before the armoured elf you'd glimpsed before.*"
msgstr "*다시 한번 환영이 당신의 눈앞을 뒤덮습니다. 이 홉고블린이 전에 환영에서 봤던 갑옷을 걸친 엘프에게 절하고 있는 모습입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = a99f9242-f6cd-7ca4-3acd-749befdaddaf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:a99f9242-f6cd-7ca4-3acd-749befdaddaf
msgctxt "hb7415d27g095fg4a6bg8437g421603a4e03e"
msgid "What in the...?"
msgstr "이게 무슨...?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = aa572ba0-9d64-8414-07ce-8453089b0dcd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:aa572ba0-9d64-8414-07ce-8453089b0dcd
msgctxt "h7caaa011g08c1g4ad8gaaf9gaa58021a938f"
msgid "*It is like fireworks in your skull. His trust is quickly waning.*"
msgstr "*마치 머릿속에서 폭죽이 터지는 것 같습니다. 그의 신뢰가 급격히 줄어들고 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b090ea94-48f8-d94f-02dd-7bce0c03fa6a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Scrying_AskedGith(2) = False
#.      - GOB_Scrying_AskedMission(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Scrying_AskedGith(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:b090ea94-48f8-d94f-02dd-7bce0c03fa6a
msgctxt "h6fc971ecgf61bg413fgb60fg653b72a5a921"
msgid "'Why were the gith chasing that ship?'"
msgstr "'기스가 어째서 그 함선을 뒤쫓고 있었던 거지?'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b1fb800d-05cf-1204-de04-9567ce469f6f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:b1fb800d-05cf-1204-de04-9567ce469f6f
msgctxt "h34a48edeg7b4bg4fafgbe71g33da178d2365"
msgid ""
"*Ragzlin scowls, shocked by his own words, and a jolt shoots through your "
"skull.*"
msgstr "*라그즐린이 자신이 내뱉은 말에 충격을 받고 당신을 노려봅니다. 그러자 머릿속에 짜릿한 감각이 느껴집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b2380eae-ac02-959c-36ad-374a0bf593ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:b2380eae-ac02-959c-36ad-374a0bf593ab
msgctxt "hcec4bf38g0c05g40b5g9a33g076a97ad4ba8"
msgid ""
"*Ragzlin remains ignorant to your presence in his mindmurk. You choose your "
"next question:*"
msgstr "*라그즐린은 아직 자신이 조종 당하고 있다는 사실을 눈치채지 못했습니다. 당신은 다음 질문을 결정합니다:*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = b23bb078-ab36-5fad-f355-6979ac59f0f3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:b23bb078-ab36-5fad-f355-6979ac59f0f3
msgctxt "h86945739g195eg4edbg9d20gcb4b692dab35"
msgid "Seems I ain't done with you. Report to the drow. Minthara's the name."
msgstr "너랑 볼일이 끝나지 않은 것 같군. 민타라라는 드로우에게 보고해라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b274b6b1-d4cf-cdde-a4a5-16d88e623fea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:b274b6b1-d4cf-cdde-a4a5-16d88e623fea
msgctxt "h146a3004g03bbg4695g9552g5782e3846eff"
msgid "<i>Sever your connection with Ragzlin.</i>"
msgstr "<i>라그즐린과의 연결을 끊는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b473a00b-e7e3-0a99-3094-0ea6b735ab9c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 6584fb1a-7ca9-950f-40a6-be0cfdd296f7_HeadPlaying = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:b473a00b-e7e3-0a99-3094-0ea6b735ab9c
msgctxt "h9b2536d9g78b1g47a3gbd3bge7fa1b700bfe"
msgid "It's a mistake. I'm a True Soul, remember? We connected."
msgstr "오해야. 난 참된 영혼이라고, 기억해? 서로 연결되었잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b70d5087-f1ce-4ebe-de3d-c81b6ec05616
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:b70d5087-f1ce-4ebe-de3d-c81b6ec05616
msgctxt "h0c84a1bcgd2bcg4dccg94b6g3a562f40ba3b"
msgid "<i>Tell the truth. The mind flayers, the parasite - all of it.</i>"
msgstr "<i>진실을 말한다. 마인드 플레이어, 기생충, 모든 것에 대해서.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = b776ae25-327b-4651-8618-c8f8fb1d0959
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Absolute_Knows_GoblinsWorship = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:b776ae25-327b-4651-8618-c8f8fb1d0959
msgctxt "h7e82c75fgcaf3g468bgb0fdg2a7f22431a83"
msgid "<i>I speak for the Absolute. And I say you stay.</i>"
msgstr "<i>난 절대자님을 대변한다. 그리고 넌 여기에 남아라. 명령이다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b8efce4b-c04d-c709-cdb0-4bdd685da841
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC_GOOD or PALADIN
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:b8efce4b-c04d-c709-cdb0-4bdd685da841
msgctxt "h7c6e759cg22c4g434fgb64ag283d0d2068c0"
msgid "What profane ceremony is <i>this</i>?"
msgstr "이 불경한 의식은 뭐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b9e100b4-a7d2-dfbc-2aa7-33f42628e8dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:b9e100b4-a7d2-dfbc-2aa7-33f42628e8dd
msgctxt "h86477c63g49dcg42bbga3dcg0da41464810f"
msgid ""
"*You see other mind flayers arranged in a serene circle. Absolute unity. "
"Absolute <i>power</i>.*"
msgstr "*다른 마인드 플레이어들이 원을 이루며 서 있는 것이 보입니다. 절대적인 결속. 절대적인 <i>힘</i>.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = ba6bb5f5-d1e4-d16e-0988-93f8e797245b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Scrying_AskedDeath(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Scrying_AskedDeath(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:ba6bb5f5-d1e4-d16e-0988-93f8e797245b
msgctxt "hda91716eg615bg4c1cgaf58g665eada62cf9"
msgid "Who killed you, freak?"
msgstr "누가 널 죽였지, 괴물아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = bb2033fb-5344-8806-e39f-a78214c2b04f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Scrying_RecognisedMindFlayer(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.     - CORPSE_SPOKEN(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:bb2033fb-5344-8806-e39f-a78214c2b04f
msgctxt "h0f1c3829g3890g4df2g8f5bg6771eb09c423"
msgid ""
"*The hideous corpse rises, tentacles writhing. <i>The creature from the "
"wreckage...</i>*"
msgstr "*촉수를 흐느적거리며, 끔찍한 시체가 떠오릅니다. <i>잔해 속에서 봤던 생물입니다...</i>*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bb7b4786-4dc3-cef7-48a3-8010f6234507
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 0
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 6584fb1a-7ca9-950f-40a6-be0cfdd296f7_MindHasBeenRead = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CanDetectThoughts_3 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:bb7b4786-4dc3-cef7-48a3-8010f6234507
msgctxt "h5319331egef62g463cg9e01gecd67ee4dd43"
msgid "<i>Cast Detect Thoughts on him.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그에게 생각 탐지를 시전한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = bb873e65-4e1a-f180-06c7-6dcefef6f52e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:bb873e65-4e1a-f180-06c7-6dcefef6f52e
msgctxt "h22adf58ag1efeg4b8egaed5gc31a74137a95"
msgid "Who killed you?"
msgstr "누가 너를 죽였지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bbfd6f24-0afd-929a-ad49-dea797eb2123
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Scrying_AskedMission(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Scrying_AskedMission(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:bbfd6f24-0afd-929a-ad49-dea797eb2123
msgctxt "h7261ea27gce93g4c7agb4f1g687ad9afd3d2"
msgid "What was your killer after?"
msgstr "살해자는 뭘 노리고 있었지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bc03e920-02e4-a509-19c4-732bf5b2e285
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Scrying_AskedDeath(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Scrying_AskedDeath(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:bc03e920-02e4-a509-19c4-732bf5b2e285
msgctxt "h39cde203g7cb7g4a23gbe35ga14e6e20bfa5"
msgid "Who killed you?"
msgstr "누가 너를 죽였지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = bc54ea2f-8ca0-92b5-0090-6faf1c1907cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:bc54ea2f-8ca0-92b5-0090-6faf1c1907cb
msgctxt "hf749db92g9f8ag4c14gbf2bg3d62b3a6bdee"
msgid ""
"*Ragzlin continues the interrogation, oblivious to your attempts to sway "
"him.*"
msgstr "*당신이 그를 조종하고 있다는 사실을 전혀 모른 채, 라그즐린이 심문을 계속합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = bc953326-dbef-3124-36f6-f20a36b22b59
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:bc953326-dbef-3124-36f6-f20a36b22b59
msgctxt "h4ea86f1ag3cd6g4fe4gbba4g97a0de8118ce"
msgid ""
"*The sky splits open, and nautiloids pour out of a void that consumes the "
"stars.*"
msgstr "*하늘에 틈이 열리며, 별이라도 삼켜버릴 듯한 공허 속에서 노틸로이드들이 쏟아져 나옵니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = becfc506-de0f-14ca-0877-1f6386f2c3ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Scrying_AskedMission(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:becfc506-de0f-14ca-0877-1f6386f2c3ff
msgctxt "h80c18e99g8e53g41d7g82ddg81bd3e737882"
msgid "What was your killer after?"
msgstr "살해자는 뭘 노리고 있었지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = bed83935-f0e5-956e-2889-d12470d9b693
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Scrying_AskedAbsolute(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 6584fb1a-7ca9-950f-40a6-be0cfdd296f7_HeadPlaying = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:bed83935-f0e5-956e-2889-d12470d9b693
msgctxt "haec55aadg523cg4791gb1b4gdef97806ddbb"
msgid ""
"*You see a clawed hand open a holding pod. Darkness clears to reveal a face: "
"<i>yours</i>.*"
msgstr "*길쭉한 손가락이 매달려있는 포드를 여는 것이 보입니다. 어둠이 걷히며 얼굴이 드러납니다. <i>당신입니다</i>.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c0127f4d-61bf-8a49-916f-4be3f27e8715
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Scrying_AskedRob(2) = False
#.      - GOB_Scrying_AskedMission(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Scrying_AskedRob(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:c0127f4d-61bf-8a49-916f-4be3f27e8715
msgctxt "h9daf366cg0b38g4cf1g981ag56ccfd74bbfa"
msgid "What was the killer after?"
msgstr "살해자가 뭘 노리고 있었지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c03c0c39-3637-9934-b8ef-ff93c1bdcc21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:c03c0c39-3637-9934-b8ef-ff93c1bdcc21
msgctxt "h6836d66eg18b2g4e8fg9609g35824c714bce"
msgid ""
"*You see dark tunnels lit by noxious pools of brine. The darkness spreads "
"through the earth.*"
msgstr "*유독성 염수 웅덩이로 밝혀진 어두운 통로가 보입니다. 어둠이 온 대지에 퍼져나갑니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = c0706ce7-2321-f9c8-0c84-9a51641f8485
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_GoblinKing_Event_KingHostile(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:c0706ce7-2321-f9c8-0c84-9a51641f8485
msgctxt "h71b6b0f5g7db2g403cgbe57g52b99335edd1"
msgid "Boys! <i>Crush him.</i>"
msgstr "얘들아! <i>저놈을 뭉개버려라.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c261e13b-d7de-ffac-1c09-8717c01026ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:c261e13b-d7de-ffac-1c09-8717c01026ff
msgctxt "hf7581471g3a57g4c12gabb9g262aeeb079f1"
msgid "*Another vision. You see a clawed hand open a holding pod...*"
msgstr "*또 다른 환영입니다. 길쭉한 손가락이 매달려 있는 포드를 여는 것이 보입니다...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c3c390e4-e079-fdab-3a33-a0940ec0c8c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:c3c390e4-e079-fdab-3a33-a0940ec0c8c4
msgctxt "h9b5c5f45gb94cg48b3g9f27g37b6586c66e3"
msgid "*The corpse collapses, silent once more.*"
msgstr "*시체가 바닥으로 떨어지며, 다시 침묵합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = c95c9296-aaee-d498-cc2d-0a012f718125
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:c95c9296-aaee-d498-cc2d-0a012f718125
msgctxt "hae10a82cg496bg4e18gae21ge886ae6868f6"
msgid "That can't be... <i>Wait</i>. Hold on."
msgstr "그럴 리가... <i>잠깐</i>. 기다려 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = c968ded7-7a00-27cc-60ba-0797e308cbbb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:c968ded7-7a00-27cc-60ba-0797e308cbbb
msgctxt "h76a69812g773eg497bga0bbg3fe894be1dfa"
msgid "No. <i>No! We're not done!</i>"
msgstr "안 돼. <i>안 돼! 아직 끝나지 않았어!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = ca2a94fb-3f37-6f4a-1ef9-9715dbb01e41
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_GoblinKing_Event_KingHostile(2) = True
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:ca2a94fb-3f37-6f4a-1ef9-9715dbb01e41
msgctxt "hdcd0c28cg1f40g486bg8657g5d980a46db1c"
msgid "I don't need your lip. Boys. <i>Crush him.</i>"
msgstr "네 입술은 필요 없다. 얘들아. <i>이놈을 박살 내버려라.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = ca2a94fb-3f37-6f4a-1ef9-9715dbb01e41
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_GoblinKing_Event_KingHostile(2) = True
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:ca2a94fb-3f37-6f4a-1ef9-9715dbb01e41
msgctxt "h0ad29863g113eg4e12g9d75g7a07010ab0ab"
msgid "I don't need your lip. Boys. <i>Crush her.</i>"
msgstr "네 입술은 필요 없다. 얘들아. <i>이년을 박살 내버려라.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = ca2a94fb-3f37-6f4a-1ef9-9715dbb01e41
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_GoblinKing_Event_KingHostile(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:ca2a94fb-3f37-6f4a-1ef9-9715dbb01e41
msgctxt "h9e39d3c6g5c9bg4901gaa90g7b331b77cd4d"
msgid "I don't need your lip. Boys. <i>Crush them.</i>"
msgstr "네 입술은 필요 없다. 얘들아. <i>놈들을 박살 내버려라.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = cae88ebc-38c4-79fa-454a-7aca2d9242a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:cae88ebc-38c4-79fa-454a-7aca2d9242a4
msgctxt "ha96bbf9fg7b68g4056gbadfg863cf4580cbb"
msgid ""
"*Ragzlin's mind resists your penetration. He speaks his first question.*"
msgstr "*라그즐린의 정신이 당신의 침입에 저항합니다. 그가 첫 번째 질문을 던집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = cafb9aaa-c3bc-9b49-f76a-f96627eb3db2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:cafb9aaa-c3bc-9b49-f76a-f96627eb3db2
msgctxt "hc6e8f3aegaf0cg47e6ga418g5ebe19afa306"
msgid "By Balduran's bones..."
msgstr "발두런의 뼈 같으니..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cc918c7c-7b7c-52be-6a83-0ae0c87f5ce4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Scrying_AskedMission(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Scrying_AskedMission(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:cc918c7c-7b7c-52be-6a83-0ae0c87f5ce4
msgctxt "hdb712ddbgfdbdg4fb0gb5acg5b77487d5f7c"
msgid "'What were you doing in Faerûn?'"
msgstr "'페이룬에서 뭘 하고 있었지?'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ccc605e0-2958-7808-6480-4d39cb13f371
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_GoblingKing_Event_HealerPersuasion = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_GoblingKing_Event_HealerPersuasion = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:ccc605e0-2958-7808-6480-4d39cb13f371
msgctxt "h362b1c2eg9b40g452cgb9b5ge0bae69de40c"
msgid "I'm in need of a healer."
msgstr "치유사가 필요해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = cd2e4bec-e965-06c0-e97a-4db611e3473d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:cd2e4bec-e965-06c0-e97a-4db611e3473d
msgctxt "h92dab920g1362g44degb999geaf0cef478d0"
msgid "*The memory fades, and the corpse awaits the next question.*"
msgstr "*기억이 사라지더니, 시체가 다음 질문을 기다립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = cd8bc836-b3cd-91f9-8ccb-fa041605b50a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:cd8bc836-b3cd-91f9-8ccb-fa041605b50a
msgctxt "hdcfc21e7gc440g46ceg9ef4gb7168ee2ed5b"
msgid ""
"Well, let me know when you find one. Priestess Gut's better at causing pain "
"than curing it."
msgstr "뭐, 찾으면 알려 달라고. 여사제 거트는 치유보다는 고통을 가하는데 더 능하니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = d0daffe3-e123-2341-6979-080aa14e7c62
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:d0daffe3-e123-2341-6979-080aa14e7c62
msgctxt "hdc2bf6cegf6dfg4a0cg8501g38be446bf6d8"
msgid "You look spiffy to me. What d'you need a healer for?"
msgstr "멀쩡해 보이는데. 뭐 때문에 치유사가 필요한 거냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d180316e-4625-21b7-69a8-cecbabdd837e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 6584fb1a-7ca9-950f-40a6-be0cfdd296f7_TriedLeaving = False
#.   Object:
#.      - CRA_Escape_State_KilledMindflayer(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 6584fb1a-7ca9-950f-40a6-be0cfdd296f7_TriedLeaving = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:d180316e-4625-21b7-69a8-cecbabdd837e
msgctxt "h9a31d157g7042g4e6fgbca4ga7f115026b8e"
msgid "<i>Leave, before the mind flayer can identify you.</i>"
msgstr "<i>마인드 플레이어가 당신을 알아보기 전에 떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d43db2f1-f7f8-b8be-d7e2-751344f7cbb2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Scrying_AskedAbsolute(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:d43db2f1-f7f8-b8be-d7e2-751344f7cbb2
msgctxt "h90be6b5dgf65fg4b02gb408gfbec605f7f13"
msgid ""
"*Ragzlin's mind is clouded by doubt, surprised once more by a question he "
"didn't expect...*"
msgstr "*라그즐린이 다시 자신이라면 하지 않았을 질문에 놀라며, 그의 정신에 의심이 피어오릅니다...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d6fc3676-30d2-3bbe-c850-77983bf7c405
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Scrying_AskedMission(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Scrying_AskedMission(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:d6fc3676-30d2-3bbe-c850-77983bf7c405
msgctxt "hf90e7e0cg6c9ag429dg9b41gfdea54647320"
msgid "'What were you doing in Faerûn?'"
msgstr "'페이룬에서 뭘 하고 있었지?'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = d77c81d3-0813-bf78-0c59-ce42e4de061c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 6584fb1a-7ca9-950f-40a6-be0cfdd296f7_plans = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:d77c81d3-0813-bf78-0c59-ce42e4de061c
msgctxt "hcfe77048g113eg4c97gac0bg96f007fd1f73"
msgid ""
"Like I said - I got plans for you. Report to the drow. Minthara's the name."
msgstr "내가 말했듯, 널 위한 계획이 있다. 드로우에게 보고하도록. 민타라라는 녀석이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = d7e8b03b-a0a9-1f3f-dabd-fbcdc4395ac7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:d7e8b03b-a0a9-1f3f-dabd-fbcdc4395ac7
msgctxt "he1eefe33gd828g4522g8178g359026f7caa5"
msgid "<i>You ever talk to a dead squid? Now's your chance.</i>"
msgstr "<i>죽은 오징어랑 대화해 본 적 있나? 한번 해보라고.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = d8229abc-107c-1673-b7d2-d1056dbdcd4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:d8229abc-107c-1673-b7d2-d1056dbdcd4f
msgctxt "h71e587bdgc9a5g49a2g8694gf01cb51b3c2c"
msgid "You. <i>Gith! </i>What d'you know about this dead squiddie?"
msgstr "너. <i>기스! </i>이 죽은 오징어 친구에 대해 아는 게 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d881edd6-88e2-7193-73fb-bd56b35d0438
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:d881edd6-88e2-7193-73fb-bd56b35d0438
msgctxt "h7e8a6784g96d4g4231gabe0g94ef45dd04cf"
msgid ""
"*Again, visions flow through you - a swarm of githyanki dragon-riders, "
"silver blades held high.*"
msgstr "*다시 환영이 흘러 들어옵니다. 은검을 높이 들어 올린 기스양키 드래곤 기수 무리가 보입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d9682175-665b-10f1-64c4-17ba3c4f6c84
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:d9682175-665b-10f1-64c4-17ba3c4f6c84
msgctxt "he4d88ac5g545dg416ega622g4e9408f579b1"
msgid "*Curiosity conquers his suspicions. You suck in a breath of relief...*"
msgstr "*호기심이 그의 의심을 이겨냅니다. 당신은 안도의 한숨을 내뱉습니다...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = da3874ec-45b5-8b1b-c743-4fb667dca58e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:da3874ec-45b5-8b1b-c743-4fb667dca58e
msgctxt "hcbd8c0b2gfa84g4f2ag92c1g4b9497dda7a8"
msgid ""
"*...and visions consume you once more. A swarm of githyanki dragon-riders, "
"silver blades held high.*"
msgstr "*...그러더니 다시 한 번 환영이 당신을 감쌉니다. 은검을 높이 들어 올린 기스양키 드래곤 기수들의 무리가 보입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = daa34df9-40b4-ff24-5c89-800d5e1899ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Scrying_AskedDeath(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:daa34df9-40b4-ff24-5c89-800d5e1899ca
msgctxt "h8c15b66fgca38g4539g8bddg52240338d80f"
msgid "Who killed you?"
msgstr "누가 너를 죽였지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = dcab8456-d3a6-ceb0-431f-ed3b60c57c4a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(5) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:dcab8456-d3a6-ceb0-431f-ed3b60c57c4a
msgctxt "h6fdfc6cdg8887g4703gbc33g0abd9935a3a9"
msgid ""
"*You feel Shadowheart's anxiety. The weapon the Absolute seeks - it's the "
"artefact that she carries. The same one that protected you as you entered "
"the goblin camp.*"
msgstr ""
"*섀도하트의 불안감이 느껴집니다. 절대자가 찾고 있는 무기, 그건 바로 그녀가 가지고 다니는 아티팩트입니다. 고블린 야영지에 들어올 때 "
"당신을 보호해 준 바로 그 아티팩트 말입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = dcf5be8d-d2cc-bd88-787b-c673ae0e8862
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_DrowCommander_Event_RaidersSortie = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:dcf5be8d-d2cc-bd88-787b-c673ae0e8862
msgctxt "h1d443823g7acdg4722g99b6gffbfe5a90a13"
msgid "The raid's started already. Let's hope she's in trouble and needs help."
msgstr "습격은 이미 시작되었다. 그년이 위험에 처해서 도움이 필요하길 바라자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = de27eb8a-2a7b-124f-acb4-35e00e95e0ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:de27eb8a-2a7b-124f-acb4-35e00e95e0ba
msgctxt "h1668fe92g1aacg4d00g959bgae33847dfcd9"
msgid "That's it, then?"
msgstr "이게 끝인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e199aad3-8295-ee5f-54a3-fef1adead5e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Scrying_AskedAbsolute(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Scrying_AskedAbsolute(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:e199aad3-8295-ee5f-54a3-fef1adead5e2
msgctxt "hc0901f83g9b6cg4d8cg881bg8452fdbf71b3"
msgid "'Who is the Absolute?'"
msgstr "'절대자가 누구지?'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e3c30cd8-cc78-c503-ace1-9d672de951a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.     - CORPSE_SPOKEN(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:e3c30cd8-cc78-c503-ace1-9d672de951a9
msgctxt "hb3947e08g39a6g4b54g9facg29b3a5c95236"
msgid "*The hideous corpse rises, tentacles writhing.*"
msgstr "*끔찍한 시체가 떠오르며, 촉수가 흐느적거립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = e4e47b9e-4fa0-9152-d0c4-c0ddfa26f409
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_GoblinKing_Event_KingHostile(2) = True
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:e4e47b9e-4fa0-9152-d0c4-c0ddfa26f409
msgctxt "h35c6d0d3g74e5g4279gb197gf75796cd7a66"
msgid "<i>Liar. </i>Boys - destroy him!"
msgstr "<i>거짓말쟁이. </i>얘들아, 이 자식을 박살 내버려라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = e4e47b9e-4fa0-9152-d0c4-c0ddfa26f409
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_GoblinKing_Event_KingHostile(2) = True
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:e4e47b9e-4fa0-9152-d0c4-c0ddfa26f409
msgctxt "h38686724g6d53g473cg91b0g65f7ae234650"
msgid "<i>Liar. </i>Boys - destroy her!"
msgstr "<i>거짓말쟁이. </i>얘들아, 이 년을 박살 내버려라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = e4e47b9e-4fa0-9152-d0c4-c0ddfa26f409
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_GoblinKing_Event_KingHostile(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:e4e47b9e-4fa0-9152-d0c4-c0ddfa26f409
msgctxt "hccf6fb93g2eceg447dgaa15gbe36d7604abc"
msgid "<i>Liar. </i>Boys - destroy them!"
msgstr "<i>거짓말쟁이. </i>얘들아, 이 놈들을 박살 내버려라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e67e20fa-5be7-20ec-6bfd-9f3b90b1143e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_GoblinKing_Event_Surprise = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:e67e20fa-5be7-20ec-6bfd-9f3b90b1143e
msgctxt "hc90c7ac6g91f0g4fe4g9b58g2ad24c397799"
msgid "No, but I'll happily leave it a dead hobgoblin for company."
msgstr "아니, 하지만 홉고블린 시체가 있다면 즐겁게 떠나겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = e69a146f-aa21-590a-29c3-7453ee69a5db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Absolute_Knows_GoblinsWorship = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:e69a146f-aa21-590a-29c3-7453ee69a5db
msgctxt "hc502d389g83bdg4f3dga27cg5ed5746ceedb"
msgid "Who is... who..."
msgstr "누가... 누구..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e8440c98-abac-ecfa-74ee-a403f233ceb4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Scrying_AskedDeath(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:e8440c98-abac-ecfa-74ee-a403f233ceb4
msgctxt "h678d170fgf711g45c2g9a25g9e75365ac130"
msgid "'Who killed you?'"
msgstr "'누가 널 죽였지?'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ea058398-9c37-aec2-87af-c1e2f6bddb7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:ea058398-9c37-aec2-87af-c1e2f6bddb7c
msgctxt "h54f8bd56g5ed1g4a35gbe30g7af5153eb6e4"
msgid "<i>Let the hobgoblin continue the questioning.</i>"
msgstr "<i>홉고블린이 심문을 계속하도록 내버려둔다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = eb7a20aa-5fe9-51b7-ae43-08127f88c816
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: TIEFLING
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:eb7a20aa-5fe9-51b7-ae43-08127f88c816
msgctxt "h85a24b47gff67g4946g9b19g53430dea8913"
msgid "If it isn't a True Soul devil."
msgstr "참된 영혼 데빌 아니신가."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = eb7a20aa-5fe9-51b7-ae43-08127f88c816
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:eb7a20aa-5fe9-51b7-ae43-08127f88c816
msgctxt "h2f328435gca48g4bffga5dag770ef75fdda2"
msgid "If it isn't another True Soul."
msgstr "다른 참된 영혼 아니신가."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ed6842c4-f1a6-f7ec-6b3e-2b306b2a6eaf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:ed6842c4-f1a6-f7ec-6b3e-2b306b2a6eaf
msgctxt "h824df0a6gc166g47f4ga4b5g7222bb6440dd"
msgid ""
"<i>Allow the hobgoblin to speak freely, lest he sense your intrusion.</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신의 침입을 눈치채지 못하도록 홉고블린이 알아서 심문하게 내버려 둔다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = eed59fd3-0d35-9d3a-0e7e-c7f50e70687b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:eed59fd3-0d35-9d3a-0e7e-c7f50e70687b
msgctxt "h813b2113g5800g48cfg91a2g1de9aeb25de8"
msgid "Damn it. I saw it, too. And it tells me <i>nothing</i>!"
msgstr "제기랄. 나도 봤어. 그리고 아무것도 알아낼 수가 없군!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = f1ce624b-ab08-b7ac-5aa9-070578608061
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:f1ce624b-ab08-b7ac-5aa9-070578608061
msgctxt "hb19b9392g2d1fg4679gb76agf9cc19ff37a8"
msgid "Oh, c'mon!"
msgstr "아, 좀!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = f3109d96-0339-8c6d-0abd-e195caeafb17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_GoblinKing_Event_KingHostile(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:f3109d96-0339-8c6d-0abd-e195caeafb17
msgctxt "h099b4d0fgd480g4bc9gb33dgdc62fac3cf7e"
msgid "Heretic!"
msgstr "이단자!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f33924a2-96e0-4aa4-3e8e-ec64442bc71b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:f33924a2-96e0-4aa4-3e8e-ec64442bc71b
msgctxt "h89b49177gc2e9g43a9g829ag71368e984d0c"
msgid ""
"*Another vision consumes you. A memory, seen through the creature's soul-"
"dead eyes.*"
msgstr "*또 다른 환영이 당신을 감쌉니다. 이 죽은 생물의 눈에 비친 기억입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f95e33da-ac0a-1bab-29f1-6d190ff25f53
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Scrying_AskedAbsolute(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Scrying_AskedAbsolute(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:f95e33da-ac0a-1bab-29f1-6d190ff25f53
msgctxt "h44073855gadcag4446gae8fg88797858ab5f"
msgid "'Who is the Absolute?'"
msgstr "'절대자가 누구지?'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fa4a4088-677e-97ff-02fb-7c141e7fee10
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(2) = True
#. TagRule: PALADIN_ANCIENTS
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:fa4a4088-677e-97ff-02fb-7c141e7fee10
msgctxt "h7ea73fccg4e74g4de1ga231gb2b5fc6114a5"
msgid "I serve the ancient provenance of nature itself, not your pathetic god."
msgstr "난 네 한심한 신이 아닌, 자연 그 자체를 섬긴다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fa4a4088-677e-97ff-02fb-7c141e7fee10
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(2) = True
#. TagRule: PALADIN_DEVOTION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:fa4a4088-677e-97ff-02fb-7c141e7fee10
msgctxt "h13ec83f5g9970g4ebcga54dg4fb133ed4b8f"
msgid ""
"I am no devotee of the Absolute. My oath, not some evil god, is my bond."
msgstr "난 절대자 따위를 섬기지 않는다. 내 맹세는 사악한 신이 아닌, 내 자신을 위한 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fa4a4088-677e-97ff-02fb-7c141e7fee10
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(2) = True
#. TagRule: PALADIN_VENGEANCE and NOT_FOR_EA
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:fa4a4088-677e-97ff-02fb-7c141e7fee10
msgctxt "h2c4b092eg3ba5g4fccg962eg06675433865e"
msgid "My oath is to take vengeance, not orders from some cultist god."
msgstr "난 이교도 신이 아닌, 복수를 맹세했다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = faa42b2a-cc67-4504-7daf-b2b1da3bf801
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:faa42b2a-cc67-4504-7daf-b2b1da3bf801
msgctxt "h6a05a837g2087g4f95g8ae8gf90a3b83c2d5"
msgid ""
"*You see a clawed hand open a holding pod - devoid of flesh, only darkness.*"
msgstr "*길쭉한 손가락이 매달려 있는 포드를 여는 모습이 보입니다. 육신은 보이지 않고, 어둠만이 드러납니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = faaaa1e6-b495-b2ca-e9b7-72ace588681c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:faaaa1e6-b495-b2ca-e9b7-72ace588681c
msgctxt "hd1a26dbcgcfd0g4c04g8e61g5f25716efb61"
msgid ""
"*Visions consume you once more - a swarm of githyanki dragon-riders, silver "
"blades held high.*"
msgstr "*환영이 다시 한 번 당신을 집어삼킵니다. 은검을 높이 들어 올린 기스양키 드래곤 기수 무리의 모습입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = fbb2c1f1-06a1-2125-af67-37bdd866e9e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_GroveConflict_Knows_LeaderNameDrow = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - DEN_Conflict.HeardAboutAoD(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:fbb2c1f1-06a1-2125-af67-37bdd866e9e9
msgctxt "h76c61f1bg2d9dg4ae4ga1d3gba5e9a644750"
msgid ""
"She's mounting an attack on that blasted grove. Tell her you'll join her."
msgstr "그녀가 망할 숲을 향한 습격을 준비하고 있다. 거기 가서 네가 지원하겠다고 말해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = fbe0bb64-a13b-2e1e-a034-7e50f024d67c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 6584fb1a-7ca9-950f-40a6-be0cfdd296f7_plans = True
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:fbe0bb64-a13b-2e1e-a034-7e50f024d67c
msgctxt "he5feb49cg3f7eg48f8ga427gf90b27842924"
msgid "I've got <i>plans</i> for you, lass."
msgstr "널 위한 <i>계획이 </i>있어, 아가씨."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = fbe0bb64-a13b-2e1e-a034-7e50f024d67c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 6584fb1a-7ca9-950f-40a6-be0cfdd296f7_plans = True
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:fbe0bb64-a13b-2e1e-a034-7e50f024d67c
msgctxt "h59564f78g4664g482egb039g61bf503c7d5c"
msgid "I've got <i>plans</i> for you, boy."
msgstr "널 위한 <i>계획이</i> 있다, 꼬마야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = fbe0bb64-a13b-2e1e-a034-7e50f024d67c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 6584fb1a-7ca9-950f-40a6-be0cfdd296f7_plans = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:fbe0bb64-a13b-2e1e-a034-7e50f024d67c
msgctxt "h96feea13ge5cag4c56g9606ge865d0f78106"
msgid "I've got <i>plans</i> for you."
msgstr "널 위한 <i>계획이</i> 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fece978d-3a85-22db-5020-83d3173d3b72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:fece978d-3a85-22db-5020-83d3173d3b72
msgctxt "ha4227c16g950fg4d2eg80a1gea103570d2bf"
msgid "It seems to me you've got an audience already."
msgstr "이미 관람객이 있는 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = fef98d0a-3064-facc-b27a-a6b0cb96074d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:fef98d0a-3064-facc-b27a-a6b0cb96074d
msgctxt "h9ca827b3gf44cg417cgaf7cg1962fc980ed1"
msgid "No answers, no killer, and no damned weapon!"
msgstr "대답도, 살해자도, 망할 무기도 알아내지 못했잖아!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = ff47c80f-2ca5-9b14-5fd1-b9cc9275fec6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DRAGONBORN or GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:ff47c80f-2ca5-9b14-5fd1-b9cc9275fec6
msgctxt "hbcca6a37g6024g42bcga038g98696c934655"
msgid ""
"Guess it don't matter what you are. You're a True Soul. And that's good "
"enough for me."
msgstr "뭐 네가 누구인지는 중요하지 않은 것 같군. 넌 참된 영혼이야. 그리고 그거면 충분하다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = ff47c80f-2ca5-9b14-5fd1-b9cc9275fec6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DROWELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:ff47c80f-2ca5-9b14-5fd1-b9cc9275fec6
msgctxt "h346e0406g29f7g4cfega12fg80f597d755bf"
msgid "Another drow True Soul. As if there weren't enough of you."
msgstr "또 드로우 참된 영혼이군. 너 같은 놈들이 뭐가 이리 많은지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Dror Ragzlin
#. NodeID = ff47c80f-2ca5-9b14-5fd1-b9cc9275fec6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: HALFLING
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:ff47c80f-2ca5-9b14-5fd1-b9cc9275fec6
msgctxt "hf901c49dg6d53g441cg8dc5gd9406db3947a"
msgid ""
"Well, look here. A True Soul halfling. A long way from home, aren't you?"
msgstr "하, 이것 봐라. 하플링 참된 영혼이군. 집에서 멀리도 나왔군, 안 그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ff8d5d7e-6f86-4132-54ba-19b9d0683ae3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_Scrying_AskedGith(2) = False
#.      - GOB_Scrying_AskedMission(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_Scrying_AskedGith(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinKing_Scrying:ff8d5d7e-6f86-4132-54ba-19b9d0683ae3
msgctxt "hcca0fdcegc6c2g4cbcg9c0fg58816fa4c180"
msgid "Why were the gith chasing the ship?"
msgstr "어째서 기스가 함선을 쫓고 있었던 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinLush
