msgid "Oh look how they struggle! Don't do yourself a mischief, now."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ca3dda76-ae61-3650-d0c8-7c60026eb275
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter:ca3dda76-ae61-3650-d0c8-7c60026eb275
msgctxt "h3f0bda48gd920g4ce5g88d7g042a03e866fe"
msgid "The prophet of the end, the armageddon-watcher. You are nothing."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cb5ee08b-92c9-a2c4-3e9c-e626251db167
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter:cb5ee08b-92c9-a2c4-3e9c-e626251db167
msgctxt "hafed7463g9616g4806gac48g1df1de1027e0"
msgid "Set me free. Now."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cc820d35-7f0e-8381-60d2-051c59285e22
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter:cc820d35-7f0e-8381-60d2-051c59285e22
msgctxt "h4518132ag1081g46c3g83e8g6dd9c273115a"
msgid "<i>Glower silently.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter
#. Speaker = True Soul Gut
#. NodeID = ccbc0797-1e70-2e82-5902-035f9d5fa7c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter:ccbc0797-1e70-2e82-5902-035f9d5fa7c4
msgctxt "hf0ce325bg8f73g4ba1gacbdgc5d7ec108718"
msgid ""
"I'm gonna keep you here so I can see every gory detail, and hear every "
"whimper and scream."
msgstr "모든 잔인한 광경과 너의 흐느낌, 비명소리를 전부 들을 수 있도록 너를 여기 가둬야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter
#. Speaker = True Soul Gut
#. NodeID = cf82129a-ef13-4deb-e44a-0532ea6d7708
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter:cf82129a-ef13-4deb-e44a-0532ea6d7708
msgctxt "h46817a8dg69ceg468bg89d6g26cb6eb62f84"
msgid ""
"Everything's clear since the Absolute chose me. You're the one that's broken."
msgstr "절대자님께서 날 택하셨으니 아무런 문제도 없어. 망가진 건 네 머리지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter
#. Speaker = True Soul Gut
#. NodeID = d216c178-405d-087e-720f-927da98ef5bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter:d216c178-405d-087e-720f-927da98ef5bb
msgctxt "ha21fa76ag3127g4b60g84a9ge1d9fbf47a2b"
msgid "Stop it? Why would I wanna do that?"
msgstr "멈춰달라고? 내가 왜 그래야 하지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter
#. Speaker = True Soul Gut
#. NodeID = d5576989-da03-63a1-7d37-98f155d71408
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter:d5576989-da03-63a1-7d37-98f155d71408
msgctxt "h35344677gdf75g494ag9b23gf0fe1debe2b5"
msgid "You ain't gonna lay a finger on me. You're finished."
msgstr "넌 내게 손끝 하나도 대지 못할 거다. 넌 끝났어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d67364e0-d47d-633f-951c-342721a717d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter:d67364e0-d47d-633f-951c-342721a717d5
msgctxt "h4e453d3dg81c3g43aeg9ae8g7ced77eba8c8"
msgid "<i>Keep quiet.</i>"
msgstr "<i>침묵을 유지한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d8195723-ed69-b3df-67a4-2dbe9f77b262
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_DARK_URGE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter:d8195723-ed69-b3df-67a4-2dbe9f77b262
msgctxt "h42402627g6a9fg43d9gb1e9g1af0b75e45c3"
msgid ""
"I <i>hope</i> I transform. Then I can gorge myself upon your unworthy beef."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d8195723-ed69-b3df-67a4-2dbe9f77b262
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter:d8195723-ed69-b3df-67a4-2dbe9f77b262
msgctxt "h8b2a7a9agdbafg449fgabddgcb7030664cf8"
msgid "If I do transform, you'll be my first meal."
msgstr "만약 내가 변이하면, 네가 첫 번째 식사가 될 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter
#. Speaker = True Soul Gut
#. NodeID = d8d22ce3-b49f-74d7-2d68-4b99926a630f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter:d8d22ce3-b49f-74d7-2d68-4b99926a630f
msgctxt "h37cfcae5g34fag4933gbc17g0b61c9288335"
msgid "Wha...? No! Some one c'mere and help me - <i>NOW!</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = da2dfd23-3d3d-b638-66fb-36f1af177d95
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_DARK_URGE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter:da2dfd23-3d3d-b638-66fb-36f1af177d95
msgctxt "h0569547cg2623g4087g912eg6f6556ba44ed"
msgid "I know nothing. I'm an amnesiac little better than a walking corpse."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = da2dfd23-3d3d-b638-66fb-36f1af177d95
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter:da2dfd23-3d3d-b638-66fb-36f1af177d95
msgctxt "hc48ff76bgc1f1g4d68g8209gdd100f8c1cdd"
msgid "You're out of luck. I don't know any more about it than you do."
msgstr "너는 운도 없군. 나는 그것에 대해 너보다 많이 알지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dcda009e-a501-5f0c-d482-13359758772d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter:dcda009e-a501-5f0c-d482-13359758772d
msgctxt "h6035daf8g89c9g47c2gac7cg480def275924"
msgid "No, I'm not going to let that happen."
msgstr "아니, 나는 그런 일이 일어나게 두진 않을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e0721e28-f5a3-bdfe-1a32-46d8a036f9cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter:e0721e28-f5a3-bdfe-1a32-46d8a036f9cc
msgctxt "h593bff47gaf80g4d5dg82e7g04dfd9a61703"
msgid "Nothing's changed. I'm in control."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter
#. Speaker = True Soul Gut
#. NodeID = e2604d6f-6b5a-6a77-5a49-69c2e8ca62b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter:e2604d6f-6b5a-6a77-5a49-69c2e8ca62b8
msgctxt "h198e0a4dg9ee6g4b01gb343gbc01810b94a3"
msgid ""
"You might have put up a fight in another life, freak. But not in this one."
msgstr "다른 생에선 선전할 수도 있어, 괴물아. 하지만 이번 생에선 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter
#. Speaker = True Soul Gut
#. NodeID = e2f800c5-19e7-f545-4c1b-6191bceacbd3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter:e2f800c5-19e7-f545-4c1b-6191bceacbd3
msgctxt "hc8dafcf0g4ce3g4d18g9846gca69f616080b"
msgid ""
"And eventually your skull will split and you'll cough up a mess of tentacles."
msgstr "그리고 끝내 너의 머리가 갈라지고 입에서 촉수 다발이 튀어나오겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter
#. Speaker = True Soul Gut
#. NodeID = e74fe5c7-79e7-6c01-8795-6a5d76b4e25f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter:e74fe5c7-79e7-6c01-8795-6a5d76b4e25f
msgctxt "he2daf6efg519cg461cg80c0g5a78dcc4cdc7"
msgid ""
"Not likely. You're forgetting one thing - I've got the Absolute to protect "
"me."
msgstr "안될걸. 넌 한 가지 사실을 잊고 있어. 날 보호해 주시는 절대자님이 있다는 것을."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter
#. Speaker = True Soul Gut
#. NodeID = e817a0e1-a278-2030-329c-a6aa5d3db1b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_GoblinPriest_Event_AwaitCeremorphosis(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter:e817a0e1-a278-2030-329c-a6aa5d3db1b5
msgctxt "h6c301e89g1cc3g4e82gb370gbf42a6b11729"
msgid "You're gonna be my new pet. A ferocious squiddie, all for myself."
msgstr "넌 내 새로운 애완동물이 될 거야. 사나운 오징어는 나에게 딱 맞겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f00d2bbf-ba25-1967-c911-f3c7923163ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter:f00d2bbf-ba25-1967-c911-f3c7923163ad
msgctxt "he72b724bg14edg4e9ag85feg6469ffb2e3b5"
msgid "Weren't you supposed to be helping me?"
msgstr "나를 도와주려던 것 아니었나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter
#. Speaker = True Soul Gut
#. NodeID = f11891b4-aba5-d3ed-8d6e-d27ef1a660d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter:f11891b4-aba5-d3ed-8d6e-d27ef1a660d3
msgctxt "hd3807faeg0f31g42eeg8701g561f24c9e82f"
msgid "It's gonna start eating your flesh, too. Changing you."
msgstr "너의 살도 파먹고 있을 거야. 그게 너를 변이시키고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fa1a9599-afe4-792e-df6f-dd3a98b554ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_GobilinPriest_ToldInfected(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter:fa1a9599-afe4-792e-df6f-dd3a98b554ef
msgctxt "h84b4ef73g1dddg404eg8508ge204748feda1"
msgid "You're infected. The same thing will happen to you."
msgstr "너는 감염되었어. 같은 일이 너에게도 일어날 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fe53e5d8-c558-ae0d-0e9a-6cd9fe8aa0d1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainedCharacter:fe53e5d8-c558-ae0d-0e9a-6cd9fe8aa0d1
msgctxt "hda38b669g7d3eg4fd5g959bg8bc28d5a04b5"
msgid "Oh, absolutely not. Never have!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_Chains
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 2a9705a7-2e1d-78bf-05d0-50082b3a6b87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_GoblinPriest_Event_FreedFromChains(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_Chains:2a9705a7-2e1d-78bf-05d0-50082b3a6b87
msgctxt "h7edd90c8g4ed0g4ffbgb61fg6fa5db162c40"
msgid "*The lock opens.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_Chains
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3bf0d9dd-8273-99a8-394b-2161734f4cba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Dexterity
#. DifficultyClass: 12
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_Chains:3bf0d9dd-8273-99a8-394b-2161734f4cba
msgctxt "h58f4cfd5g18c3g46a9gab67g65f2bd18f68a"
msgid "<i>Dislocate your wrist and wriggle free.</i>"
msgstr "<i>손목을 탈구시키고 꼼지락거려서 풀려난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_Chains
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4da8b407-dfcd-7262-af43-dc668f279566
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_GoblinPriest_ChainsFailed(0) = True
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_WarlockProposal_State_CheckParty(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_Chains:4da8b407-dfcd-7262-af43-dc668f279566
msgctxt "hbeb53cfdge778g4a0cga69dg9ca46645c341"
msgid "<i>Preserve your strength.</i>"
msgstr "<i>힘을 아낀다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_Chains
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 51c140e8-2a4f-1e51-c767-0f8c8de6bc3f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_GoblinPriest_Event_DislocatedWrist(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_Chains:51c140e8-2a4f-1e51-c767-0f8c8de6bc3f
msgctxt "h9b8b58d0g061dg425agaa2cg4f216c5801eb"
msgid ""
"*A sharp pain shoots through your arm as the bone pops out of place. The "
"chains hold tight.*"
msgstr "*뼈가 튀어나오면서 당신의 팔에 날카로운 통증이 느껴집니다. 사슬이 단단히 속박하고 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_Chains
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6d200137-c6fd-583b-9026-13bc0798d3cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_Chains:6d200137-c6fd-583b-9026-13bc0798d3cd
msgctxt "hf7261331gca9dg46ccgac63gb19c47c16613"
msgid "*Your muscles burn with the effort, but the chains hold strong.*"
msgstr "*당신의 노력으로 근육이 타들어가지만, 사슬은 강하게 속박하고 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_Chains
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 91d8ae5e-afe3-fd56-cbcf-6892941c419e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Strength
#. DifficultyClass: 20
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_Chains:91d8ae5e-afe3-fd56-cbcf-6892941c419e
msgctxt "h9ce514f3g3855g4f3ag960dg6d20a1f9f980"
msgid "<i>Tense your muscles, straining against the chains.</i>"
msgstr "<i>근육을 긴장시켜, 사슬에 힘을 준다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_Chains
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9cf8e2fc-de2e-52e4-407f-066a37fdb5b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GOB_GoblinPriest_HasChainsKey(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_Chains:9cf8e2fc-de2e-52e4-407f-066a37fdb5b8
msgctxt "h7a65f3a9g75a5g4951gbb65gd89c14b5374a"
msgid "<i>Use the priestess' key.</i>"
msgstr "<i>여사제의 열쇠를 사용한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinPriest_Chains
