msgctxt "had67c32fgedc8g4cfeg9f0eg779c25976f25"
msgid "Now get outta my way - I need another drink!"
msgstr "이제 저리 비켜. 난 한 잔 더 마셔야겠어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinToast
