msgctxt "hf7265f5bg7d6cg4cb1gb450g6f40975ca04a"
msgid "Party pooper. An' I thought dwarves knew how t' drink."
msgstr "파티 분위기 망치는 놈. 근데 난 드워프들이 술 마시는 법을 안다고 생각했지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinToast
#. Speaker = Sharp-Eye Mirg
#. NodeID = f4c1c872-61cd-8cb8-faee-40be1ed4f437
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
