msgctxt "h80e57759ga0b9g4ca1gbae7gf18bb432d493"
msgid "Party pooper. An' I thought 'alflings were s'posed to be nice."
msgstr "파티 분위기 망치는 놈. 근데 난 하플링들이 술 마시는 법을 안다고 생각했지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinToast
#. Speaker = Sharp-Eye Mirg
#. NodeID = f4c1c872-61cd-8cb8-faee-40be1ed4f437
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: GNOME or SHORT
