#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h7eb1155dg4f64g43c5ga37bg3d228954cb66"
msgid "Party pooper. Last time I give one of you ants a drink."
msgstr "파티 분위기 망치는 놈. 너희 난쟁이들에게 술을 준 게 마지막이 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinToast
#. Speaker = Sharp-Eye Mirg
#. NodeID = f4c1c872-61cd-8cb8-faee-40be1ed4f437
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinToast:f4c1c872-61cd-8cb8-faee-40be1ed4f437
