msgid "Party pooper. Last time I give one of ya overgrown beasts a drink."
msgstr "파티 분위기 망치는 놈. 너희 크기만 큰 짐승들에게 술을 준 게 마지막이 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinToast
#. Speaker = Sharp-Eye Mirg
#. NodeID = fd9a2439-5aaa-e073-9974-f7fc5f899431
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinToast:fd9a2439-5aaa-e073-9974-f7fc5f899431
msgctxt "h84278fd8gc468g4bd8g94ffg03c03d91ea65"
msgid "Ha! I'll show ya how it's done."
msgstr "하! 내가 어떻게 하는지 보여주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinToast
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fe4eeea9-e8d5-f8fe-f43b-15dc00d4c59c
