msgctxt "h98d51a01gb096g4b07gbfc4gc76ecf21bea6"
msgid "I'm simply being a good guest, that's all."
msgstr "나는 그저 좋은 손님이 되고 싶을 뿐이야. 그게 다야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinToast_NoticedPoisoning
