msgid ""
"<i>Tnak</i>. Fine. Hope Gribbo drinks it. At least then she'll shut up 'bout "
"her bloody pigeon!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinToast_NoticedPoisoning
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 58876c16-1ff6-05f7-4507-67d8376303f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount2(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount2(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinToast_NoticedPoisoning:58876c16-1ff6-05f7-4507-67d8376303f2
msgctxt "h8bcbc9dbg2845g45f3g8173ga8b654a7553d"
msgid ""
"*Something stirs deep within you, hungry and alert... it's taking something "
"you'll never get back.*"
msgstr "*몸 깊숙한 데서 굶주리고 기민한 존재가 꿈틀댑니다... 잃으면 되찾지 못할 뭔가를 좀먹고 있군요.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinToast_NoticedPoisoning
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 593ee804-066d-a0bf-53b2-783b2e04bb92
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinToast_NoticedPoisoning:593ee804-066d-a0bf-53b2-783b2e04bb92
msgctxt "h9b471fa0gd7ebg4412gb7c7g13009a16b6c2"
msgid "Just a drop of firewine. It'll give the brew a real kick."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinToast_NoticedPoisoning
#. Speaker = GROUP_Act1_GOB_Festivities
#. NodeID = 5a87a0bd-f092-29f7-7257-8a62b37dadcc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinToast_NoticedPoisoning:5a87a0bd-f092-29f7-7257-8a62b37dadcc
msgctxt "hebdd2272g47dbg4522gbeb0gd3f53f40212c"
msgid "O-of course. I'd never!"
msgstr "그, 그럼요. 암것도 못 봤어요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinToast_NoticedPoisoning
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5d6bb41d-a8cf-365e-1365-cd37418d4a60
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount3(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount3(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinToast_NoticedPoisoning:5d6bb41d-a8cf-365e-1365-cd37418d4a60
msgctxt "ha32f87e5g5a33g47bbg9300g57b57776fb06"
msgid "*Your mind lurches, reeling suddenly as if... bitten.*"
msgstr "*뭔가에 깨물린 것처럼 느닷없이 정신이 휘청거립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinToast_NoticedPoisoning
#. Speaker = GROUP_Act1_GOB_Festivities
#. NodeID = 5d876266-2f59-b1f2-1ba7-18b3e61d2f97
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinToast_NoticedPoisoning:5d876266-2f59-b1f2-1ba7-18b3e61d2f97
msgctxt "h69a42f48gda6cg43f6g80e6g6fc80f9b73a3"
msgid "Eh. Heh. Now that's an idea. Should've thought of that myself!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinToast_NoticedPoisoning
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6495afee-0af8-1d12-dba4-39bbc2ee1395
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount6(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount6(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinToast_NoticedPoisoning:6495afee-0af8-1d12-dba4-39bbc2ee1395
msgctxt "h35056f6fgdefdg46e7g81dag6b9bac6217c8"
msgid ""
"*The presence deep in your mind is awake, unblinking. This is it. A single "
"word pervades your consciousness: 'Soon'.*"
msgstr ""
"*당신의 정신 속 깊이 자리잡은 존재가 태연스레 깨어납니다. 올 것이 왔군요. 한 단어가 당신의 의식 속으로 스며듭니다. ‘곧’*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinToast_NoticedPoisoning
#. Speaker = GROUP_Act1_GOB_Festivities
#. NodeID = 781e6b48-e1d9-de4f-5f57-201a9c9cfb22
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_GoblinToast_PoisoningRedHanded = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinToast_NoticedPoisoning:781e6b48-e1d9-de4f-5f57-201a9c9cfb22
msgctxt "hd435db8fg7d2eg4c38g8004g296a815dfedc"
msgid ""
"You don't know who you're messin with. I'll kill you and eat you like that "
"dwarf!"
msgstr "주제도 모르고 설쳐대고 있네. 널 죽여서 드워프 고기처럼 먹어주겠다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinToast_NoticedPoisoning
#. Speaker = GROUP_Act1_GOB_Festivities
#. NodeID = 78b3c08c-a13c-94eb-28ce-02700076c5a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinToast_NoticedPoisoning:78b3c08c-a13c-94eb-28ce-02700076c5a3
msgctxt "h99836bf0ga6a7g4c88ga3d5g5941ff31de12"
msgid "Don't think I didn't see that with yer slippery fingers."
msgstr "네 녀석이 얍삽한 손장난 치는 거 다 봤다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinToast_NoticedPoisoning
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 85769825-1bfe-a52e-5eb4-28830c5b4b98
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - GLO_TadpoleIntro_NPC(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - GLO_TadpoleIntro_NPC(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinToast_NoticedPoisoning:85769825-1bfe-a52e-5eb4-28830c5b4b98
msgctxt "h0cfa6278g5878g4d6cga8f1gc30c23ae7463"
msgid ""
"*A strange symbol glows, marked on their flesh, and something within you "
"stirs in response.*"
msgstr "*그들의 살갗에 새겨진 기묘한 상징이 빛나고, 이에 반응하여 당신 내면의 무언가가 꿈틀거립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinToast_NoticedPoisoning
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 885c6732-de77-1502-8f24-ee6b1110a3ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinToast_NoticedPoisoning:885c6732-de77-1502-8f24-ee6b1110a3ba
msgctxt "hbf921949ge4a3g4375g9c49g38a8c11b8038"
msgid "I'll slip a knife between your ribs if you don't piss off."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinToast_NoticedPoisoning
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8ca8d749-f9c1-1147-71bb-fe9f39435e81
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - ee2a8342-0aad-ed4e-a7b1-811c6cc527a8_MindHasBeenRead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinToast_NoticedPoisoning:8ca8d749-f9c1-1147-71bb-fe9f39435e81
msgctxt "h611f458fg6bdfg4b47g82e0g5b63f84a4d15"
msgid "Don't be stupid. You can barely see straight."
msgstr "바보 같은 소리 마. 앞도 제대로 못 보면서."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinToast_NoticedPoisoning
#. Speaker = GROUP_Act1_GOB_Festivities
#. NodeID = 92040fe1-51aa-b462-0631-bbb7fd325ad0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
