msgctxt "hddb06ccdg8a6ag4675gbfb8gc0d3b0d819df"
msgid "This one's tryin' to poison us! Kill 'em!"
msgstr "이 자식이 우릴 죽이려고 독을 탔다! 죽여!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinToast_NoticedPoisoning
