#. TagRule: DROWELF and MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinWily:69574f56-0623-4484-b697-315eb837e1e8
msgctxt "h9756d84fg01b9g4675ga4fdgf29ca35f4e1e"
msgid "Look, yer lordship. Priestess Gut burned me <i>good</i>."
msgstr "이것 보세요, 마님. 여사제 거트가 절 <i>제대로</i> 지져버렸다고요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GoblinWily
