#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GuardPolite:3dace41f-23ae-18a6-e73e-9b9c97ee21b1
msgctxt "h6badbcc0g03e1g4c2fg9811gdd922af56079"
msgid ""
"Dunno what the Absolute wants with <i>your</i> kind. She's already got us."
msgstr "절대자께서 <i>너희</i> 부류에게서 뭘 원하시는지 모르겠단 말이야. 이미 우리가 있는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GuardPolite
#. Speaker = Warrior Druk
#. NodeID = 6465066b-8ab6-3d2b-1e4b-1ef5dee37c72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_GuardPolite_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GuardPolite:6465066b-8ab6-3d2b-1e4b-1ef5dee37c72
msgctxt "h9e69bd69g3d32g4868gbb8cg7564fc306b2f"
msgid "Mind yer manners, now - or he'll throw ya in the pit."
msgstr "공손하게 굴도록해. 그렇지 않다면 그가 널 구덩이에 던져버릴 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GuardPolite
#. Speaker = Warrior Druk
#. NodeID = 6a376333-7dd1-9fc0-26c6-59566fbb3319
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_GuardPolite_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - DROWELF(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_GuardPolite_HasMet(1) = True
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GuardPolite:6a376333-7dd1-9fc0-26c6-59566fbb3319
msgctxt "h336ff225g0f2fg4cd5g9dbagd9128b2c4afd"
msgid "We treat the spiders real kind, ma'am. Feed 'em the plumpest prisoners."
msgstr "저희는 거미들에게 아주 잘 해준답니다, 마님. 아주 통통한 포로들만 골라서 먹이고 있습죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GuardPolite
#. Speaker = Warrior Druk
#. NodeID = 6a376333-7dd1-9fc0-26c6-59566fbb3319
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_GuardPolite_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - DROWELF(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_GuardPolite_HasMet(1) = True
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GuardPolite:6a376333-7dd1-9fc0-26c6-59566fbb3319
msgctxt "ha8ca6cb7g88ddg4e14gbe41g56f917be5ae3"
msgid ""
"We treat the real spiders real kind, sir. Feed 'em the plumpest prisoners."
msgstr "저희는 거미들에게 아주 잘 해준답니다, 나으리. 아주 통통한 포로들만 골라서 먹이고 있습죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GuardPolite
#. Speaker = Warrior Druk
#. NodeID = 6a376333-7dd1-9fc0-26c6-59566fbb3319
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_GuardPolite_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - DROWELF(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_GuardPolite_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GuardPolite:6a376333-7dd1-9fc0-26c6-59566fbb3319
msgctxt "hce5267ffg8a8fg49c9g8decg3c37507ff5a8"
msgid ""
"We treat the real spiders real kind, True Soul. Feed 'em the plumpest "
"prisoners."
msgstr "저희는 거미들에게 아주 잘 해준답니다, 참된 영혼이시여. 아주 통통한 포로들만 골라서 먹이고 있습죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GuardPolite
#. Speaker = Warrior Druk
#. NodeID = d5bc61a0-9695-b66f-ddca-bd4af4f46281
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_GuardPolite_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - DROWELF(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_GuardPolite_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GuardPolite:d5bc61a0-9695-b66f-ddca-bd4af4f46281
msgctxt "h0682f4abg8f3dg4e4fg93b7ga40b6c28424d"
msgid "Another outsider come to see the boss?"
msgstr "또 다른 이방인께서 두목을 보러 오셨나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GuardPolite
#. Speaker = Warrior Druk
#. NodeID = f4bb21ef-273f-3821-25a4-4322cf26f14f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_GuardPolite_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - DROWELF(1) = True
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GuardPolite:f4bb21ef-273f-3821-25a4-4322cf26f14f
msgctxt "hcce5c84bg671fg414dga235g1fff391ebc93"
msgid "Enjoyin' your visit, yer ladyship?"
msgstr "머무는데 불편한 건 없으신가요, 마님?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_GuardPolite
#. Speaker = Warrior Druk
#. NodeID = f4bb21ef-273f-3821-25a4-4322cf26f14f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
