msgctxt "h8beae683gee60g4d08g8de5g38f3611b5655"
msgid "Don't wear her out entirely, priest. I might have use for her yet."
msgstr "설 힘 정도는 조금 남겨 둬, 사제. 아직 얘가 필요할 수도 있으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_PainPriest_Penance
