msgctxt "h9ed87803g3f62g441dgb39bgd1915a87f37f"
msgid ""
"Would you have joined up with her if you'd known she'd be indulging in this "
"sort of thing, Astarion?"
msgstr "아스타리온, 얘가 이런 걸 좋아하는 줄 진작에 알았어도 일행에 합류했을 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_PainPriest_Penance
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
