msgctxt "h79295fbbgc9a6g42feg9dc2g9971724b62ec"
msgid ""
"Would you have joined up with them if you'd known they'd be indulging in "
"this sort of thing, Astarion?"
msgstr "아스타리온, 얘가 이런 걸 좋아하는 줄 진작에 알았어도 일행에 합류했을 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_PainPriest_Penance
#. Speaker = Abdirak
#. NodeID = a1993024-e706-8880-6dcf-75998e01b83a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_PainPriest_Event_SecondHitDone = True
#.      - GOB_PainPriest_Event_ReactToMocking = True
#.      - GOB_PainPriest_Event_ThirdHitDone = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_PainPriest_Event_ThirdHitDone = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_PainPriest_Penance:a1993024-e706-8880-6dcf-75998e01b83a
msgctxt "hd5c48f8fgbe67g420egba4cg746a1f725f54"
msgid "Do not mock the gifts you receive!"
msgstr "네가 받는 은총을 모욕하지 말거라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_PainPriest_Penance
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = a66dbbb4-b117-aa4f-8695-15589223a388
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_PainPriest_Penance:a66dbbb4-b117-aa4f-8695-15589223a388
msgctxt "hdbc59f62gdf4dg49begbb6eg4af55c42ad0d"
msgid ""
"Better not let too much be spilled. As much as I'm enjoying the show, we may "
"still need him afterwards."
msgstr "너무 많이 흘리게 두지는 말자고. 나도 재밌게 보고 있긴 한데, 끝나고 나서도 살아있어야 하거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_PainPriest_Penance
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = a66dbbb4-b117-aa4f-8695-15589223a388
