msgid ""
"Better not let too much be spilled. As much as I'm enjoying the show, we may "
"still need them afterwards."
msgstr "너무 많이 흘리게 두지는 말자고. 나도 재밌게 보고 있긴 한데, 끝나고 나서도 살아있어야 하거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_PainPriest_Penance
