msgctxt "h17474e2fgd78bg478egbc9dg087440390093"
msgid "Might still <i>kill</i> ya, mind."
msgstr "그냥 죽일 <i>수도</i> 있긴 하겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_RaiderStupid
#. Speaker = Sharp-Eye Eef
#. NodeID = 213e092e-94f7-12dc-1938-fc4056c37b11
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_RaiderStupid_HasMet(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_RaiderStupid_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_RaiderStupid:213e092e-94f7-12dc-1938-fc4056c37b11
msgctxt "he6cc58e2gfb08g46e4gb1a0g1ca1a5cab4b4"
msgid ""
"Watch y' step down by the pens - worgies been getting fat on your kind "
"lately."
msgstr "저 아래 우리에선 조심하라고. 워그들이 요즘 너희 잡아먹는 데 맛을 들였으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_RaiderStupid
#. Speaker = Sharp-Eye Eef
#. NodeID = 75ada1dd-d372-074f-0773-cfdc24e2b72c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_RaiderStupid_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_RaiderStupid:75ada1dd-d372-074f-0773-cfdc24e2b72c
msgctxt "hb2da83f9gd1b8g4034g87a9g141052b1c4d5"
msgid "Ain't friends or foes to a worg - just food. Makes ya think, dunnit?"
msgstr "워그한텐 친구고 적이고 없어. 그냥 음식이지. 생각 잘 해보라고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_RaiderStupid
#. Speaker = Sharp-Eye Eef
#. NodeID = 99bb3f7d-2f9b-4c3e-7afa-0d8af8da1021
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_RaiderStupid_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - UNDERDARK(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_RaiderStupid_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_RaiderStupid:99bb3f7d-2f9b-4c3e-7afa-0d8af8da1021
msgctxt "h6d0e3b1cg4c40g4b5fg806cg35ddc6c09fce"
msgid ""
"Don't worry on the worgs, cavey. They won't eat anyfink wot grows in the "
"ground."
msgstr "워그는 걱정하지 마, 동굴살이. 걔들도 땅에서 난 걸 아무거나 먹지는 않으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_RatRacket_LocalRat_001
#. Speaker = Rat
#. NodeID = 295e53b8-ce22-a0cd-dbb1-b3f8c96eafe6
