#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_TortureredAdventurer:ff23962d-88f6-cdaf-c444-8dbef7545e2a
msgctxt "h503889b9g78ebg4b2ag8ddbgb1d7db17db1a"
msgid ""
"I sh-should be able to make it to the grove on my own. They need to know "
"they're in danger."
msgstr "저 호-혼자서 숲까지 갈 수 있을 거예요. 그들이 위험에 처해 있다는 걸 알려야 해요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_TortureredAdventurer
