msgctxt "hd3be743bg4306g49f5gb178gf15f954cc154"
msgid "*You never want this perfect moment to come to an end.*"
msgstr "*이 완벽한 순간이 영원히 끝나지 않기를 바랄 뿐입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Torturers_Torture
