msgctxt "h861a23b0g7772g4a8cgb8dag6d7e63738393"
msgid "That all ya got? Bein' soft ain't gonna make 'im talk."
msgstr "그게 다야? 그렇게 약하게 해선 입을 열 수 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Torturers_Torture
