msgctxt "h62b31056g24b6g4d85gb93bg181b02a8598b"
msgid "Oh, a drow? I - I didn't see ya there."
msgstr "앗, 드로우잖아? 거-거기 계신 줄은 못 봤군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Torturers_Torture
