msgid "Poor lad. I could give ya peace, ya know."
msgstr "불쌍한 녀석. 내가 고통 없이 끝내줄 수도 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_Torturers_Torture
#. Speaker = Player
