msgctxt "hc8e96247g853dg44b5gb793g7a29436111c3"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a8996d22-0bc1-07c7-a657-37250969add9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage:a8996d22-0bc1-07c7-a657-37250969add9
msgctxt "hdf5f030egf51dg4aafg9085g055ee01c7f59"
msgid "So I see. Do you have plans for this 'pigeon'?"
msgstr "그렇군. 이 '비둘기'에 대한 계획은 가지고 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage
#. Speaker = Gribbo
#. NodeID = ab8334fb-e5d8-8213-22df-de59faa83d5e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold_3 = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage:ab8334fb-e5d8-8213-22df-de59faa83d5e
msgctxt "h6a552c37g13efg4af0ga15eg329f3cd10a44"
msgid "Please. You ain't got that much. Look at that state of you."
msgstr "무슨, 넌 그만한 돈 없잖아. 꼬라지하고는."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ac640f04-b0f1-572f-5f6a-f1f780c138bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage:ac640f04-b0f1-572f-5f6a-f1f780c138bd
msgctxt "he714e589g5f55g452bga87bg7383da05446c"
msgid "I was admiring him. I'd like one of my own."
msgstr "녀석이 꽤 마음에 들어서 말이야. 나도 하나 가지고 싶은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage
#. Speaker = Gribbo
#. NodeID = adaeb484-d609-1150-e6e7-1ff831591df6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage:adaeb484-d609-1150-e6e7-1ff831591df6
msgctxt "ha7a9618fg7137g4b41g9d63gb4be53d11ecb"
msgid "Then <i>catch</i> one on your own."
msgstr "그럼 네가 알아서 한 마리 잡든가."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage
#. Speaker = Gribbo
#. NodeID = b2719d4a-828a-b340-859c-34c2ffbac46f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold_4 = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GEN_TransferNPCPayment_4(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage:b2719d4a-828a-b340-859c-34c2ffbac46f
msgctxt "h58a48131g35c8g4402gba9egf4e58e34284d"
msgid "Eh! I could buy a bagoolion pigeons with that much!"
msgstr "에! 그 정도면 비둘기를 백만마뤼는 잡을 수 있겠는데!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage
#. Speaker = Gribbo
#. NodeID = b6e766ea-0706-711b-f900-7b5eba3af8f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage:b6e766ea-0706-711b-f900-7b5eba3af8f5
msgctxt "hb6591b17ge5cbg4bcagaaedg4889dc730670"
msgid ""
"Bah. Just take him, if you care so much. See if he'll sing for the likes of "
"<i>you </i>though. Bloody fink."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bfce1c9e-9297-21c5-62cf-fc99e97b68bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage:bfce1c9e-9297-21c5-62cf-fc99e97b68bc
msgctxt "hb9457ed8gdf4ag4e11g8ec0g570362da321e"
msgid ""
"<i>Offer as little as you can spare. "
"</i>([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-be548b134c54])"
msgstr ""
"<i>가능한 적은 금액을 제시한다. </i>([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-"
"be548b134c54])"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage
#. Speaker = Gribbo
#. NodeID = c01bd793-2474-7448-af89-759caef0f80c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage:c01bd793-2474-7448-af89-759caef0f80c
msgctxt "h3fa9bb88gb082g4ae4ga972g872faf7ef4a2"
msgid "Ehh, he don't mind. Keeps him safe from me mates! Raids make 'em rabid."
msgstr "에에, 녀석은 신경도 안 써. 내가 녀석을 내 친구들한테서 지켜주고 있거든! 난폭한 녀석들이 많아서 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c35e8bc9-417e-159e-3255-85cb01ebd395
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage:c35e8bc9-417e-159e-3255-85cb01ebd395
msgctxt "hac8a7320g384bg4295ga128gd0d3f997580e"
msgid "I hate to see such a lovely creature in a cage."
msgstr "저렇게 사랑스러운 생명체가 우리에 갇혀있는 걸 보니 안타까워서 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage
#. Speaker = Gribbo
#. NodeID = c531ab36-57ee-a26d-b644-7bbf99fc0906
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage:c531ab36-57ee-a26d-b644-7bbf99fc0906
msgctxt "h9eacb3f3gf233g4c0fgb9ecgb6567ad5a2af"
msgid "Oh well."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage
#. Speaker = Gribbo
#. NodeID = c684c1d3-8bdf-0ab4-27c3-84f4fa5fdab1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage:c684c1d3-8bdf-0ab4-27c3-84f4fa5fdab1
msgctxt "h0375dc86g7eb5g4302g9f76g766e67a327e0"
msgid "See? You couldn't take care of him proper anyway."
msgstr "봤지? 어차피 넌 제대로 관리해 주지도 못했을 거라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c908041a-0a9a-f928-6ad5-6892878e130e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount6(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount6(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage:c908041a-0a9a-f928-6ad5-6892878e130e
msgctxt "h6a85b6fbg1b6cg49efg9d08g3b77852602e8"
msgid ""
"*The presence deep in your mind is awake, unblinking. This is it. A single "
"word pervades your consciousness: 'Soon'.*"
msgstr ""
"*당신의 정신 속 깊이 자리잡은 존재가 태연스레 깨어납니다. 올 것이 왔군요. 한 단어가 당신의 의식 속으로 스며듭니다. ‘곧’*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c92ef49f-5b6a-162b-9535-a037362405bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage:c92ef49f-5b6a-162b-9535-a037362405bc
msgctxt "h7dadf5e3g8267g4d56gba79gdb7974d182ec"
msgid ""
"<i>Offer a lord's ransom. </i>([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_3_01f129ea-b4dc-"
"44b6-8154-9a948f876a82])"
msgstr ""
"<i>적정한 금액을 제시한다. </i>([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_3_01f129ea-b4dc-"
"44b6-8154-9a948f876a82])"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage
#. Speaker = Gribbo
#. NodeID = c95358bf-6b62-442c-d304-34d72c2fc5da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - d5b83b1a-a4b2-b5d9-5cfa-7159a535dc8c_MindHasBeenRead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage:c95358bf-6b62-442c-d304-34d72c2fc5da
msgctxt "h3fb146cdgd5fcg460cga8dbgb3a44b464965"
msgid ""
"<i>This </i>ranga <i>better not go yappin' 'bout my pigeon. I shoulda turned "
"him over to Minthara by now, but he's such a nice little pigeon.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>이 </i>원숭이가 <i>내 비둘기에 대해 떠들고 다니지 않았으면. 지금쯤 민타라에게 그를 돌려줬어야 하지만, 정말 작고 착한 "
"비둘기란 말이지.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage
#. Speaker = Gribbo
#. NodeID = cef4b0e2-c0cb-f6b0-cb4d-d1088b10958f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage:cef4b0e2-c0cb-f6b0-cb4d-d1088b10958f
msgctxt "hd1f25edeg4b6eg4186g9583gf394aa999a86"
msgid "Pigeon's worth more'n that times a bagoolion."
msgstr "비둘기가 그것보다 백만봬는 더 비싸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage
#. Speaker = Gribbo
#. NodeID = d10a4978-b6aa-27c8-1183-49d13b8eceed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage:d10a4978-b6aa-27c8-1183-49d13b8eceed
msgctxt "h22d5e46cg7e29g4747gaaebg3160370fc402"
msgid "Eh! I could buy a bagoolion pigeons with that much!"
msgstr "에! 그 정도면 비둘기를 백만마뤼는 잡을 수 있겠는데!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d9a7f089-8d41-65f0-8d87-05ecaa81ea97
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount5(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount5(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage:d9a7f089-8d41-65f0-8d87-05ecaa81ea97
msgctxt "h31e1870bg4526g442cg93d4gc5d5c311db3c"
msgid ""
"*Your blood runs quicker, feeding the gnawing absence at the centre of your "
"mind.*"
msgstr "*피가 더 빨리 흐르면서, 당신의 정신 한가운데를 좀먹는 허전함을 양분으로 채웁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e4ad5441-2a55-362b-fb53-b59d38b08556
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage:e4ad5441-2a55-362b-fb53-b59d38b08556
msgctxt "h7dc821afgdfb1g4ed4g88d9g8b64fda07adf"
msgid "<i>Actually, I have no coin to spare.</i>"
msgstr "<i>사실은, 지불할 돈이 없어.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage
#. Speaker = Gribbo
#. NodeID = e5c3553b-0670-8b71-ea25-53ab0cea8445
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage:e5c3553b-0670-8b71-ea25-53ab0cea8445
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "haaa26755g310fg4cb6g8c42gb72ace738d4a"
msgid ""
"Take him for a jog, why don't ya. And don't let the lads snatch him up. No "
"tellin' what they'll do to him."
msgstr "산책이라도 시켜 줘. 다른 녀석들이 채가지 못하게 하고. 걔들이 무슨 짓을 할지는 말할 필요도 없으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e68b9bc6-afc0-07e1-f254-75beac880235
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage:e68b9bc6-afc0-07e1-f254-75beac880235
msgctxt "h40aa74c3g3379g4760gb71fg1d35c1540027"
msgid ""
"*The mark glows, but you feel nothing in response. Your illithid power is "
"beyond reach until you rest.*"
msgstr "*문양이 빛나지만, 어떤 반응도 느껴지지 않습니다. 일리시드 능력을 더 사용하려면 휴식을 취해야 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage
#. Speaker = Gribbo
#. NodeID = e87623e4-90ac-9822-4b5d-9f13cf1d86ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage:e87623e4-90ac-9822-4b5d-9f13cf1d86ba
msgctxt "hb005e9d4gcac1g4536g95e1gfcd0a95a905b"
msgid "NO."
msgstr "싫어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ecd25ae9-f19d-8299-c299-957c51735f1d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.     - TRUESOUL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage:ecd25ae9-f19d-8299-c299-957c51735f1d
msgctxt "hec0c9f57g6a57g431cgb8eagbe6f63b8fe65"
msgid ""
"*Your mind is full, bursting with ecstasy and terror. Finally, it is coming. "
"You are becoming.*"
msgstr "*당신의 정신이 황홀경과 공포로 가득 차오릅니다. 마침내, 때가 됐군요. 당신은 변화 중입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage
#. Speaker = Gribbo
#. NodeID = ed3e4a9f-1625-16a4-6f3c-c42f8049ff8b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage:ed3e4a9f-1625-16a4-6f3c-c42f8049ff8b
msgctxt "hd73b61e2g49a4g477fg9ebcg345ba910cfe3"
msgid "You funnin'? Pigeon don't take a <i>kra-kra </i>for that much."
msgstr "웃기려는 거냐? 그 돈으론 비둘기 <i>크라크라</i>도 안 되겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ede723c5-964e-7dc9-0b21-c67b4fa0a545
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount4(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount4(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage:ede723c5-964e-7dc9-0b21-c67b4fa0a545
msgctxt "hc89f627bgb3f2g4ecega897g82acc1f3d4a9"
msgid ""
"*A shadow swims across your vision, and a familiar voice tells you to be "
"calm. You are loved.*"
msgstr "*그림자가 낀 듯이 눈앞이 흐려지더니, 익숙한 목소리가 당신을 달래줍니다. 사랑이 느껴집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = effc7f5c-929d-fe24-0229-6626d4dabdf2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType:
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 0
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - d5b83b1a-a4b2-b5d9-5cfa-7159a535dc8c_MindHasBeenRead = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CanDetectThoughts_2 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage:effc7f5c-929d-fe24-0229-6626d4dabdf2
msgctxt "h79353119g301eg4497g9595g0d0de936f9c4"
msgid "<i>Read her thoughts.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그녀의 생각을 읽는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f2c2c865-4a7d-d77a-5126-d991ddb9aa89
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - GLO_TadpoleIntro_NPC(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - GLO_TadpoleIntro_NPC(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage:f2c2c865-4a7d-d77a-5126-d991ddb9aa89
msgctxt "h25b72261g7b08g40b7gb6d4g12fb831a6869"
msgid ""
"*A strange symbol glows, marked on their flesh, and something within you "
"stirs in response.*"
msgstr "*그들의 살갗에 새겨진 기묘한 상징이 빛나고, 이에 반응하여 당신 내면의 무언가가 꿈틀거립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage
#. Speaker = Gribbo
#. NodeID = f80fc9ae-cafe-ccb4-1ca4-abed96f9ae59
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage:f80fc9ae-cafe-ccb4-1ca4-abed96f9ae59
msgctxt "h28fa3de4ga676g4ef9g8da5gc2b9268bcca6"
msgid "Erm...<i>Pidge.</i>"
msgstr "으음... <i>둘기.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage
#. Speaker = Gribbo
#. NodeID = f89a33fb-54a5-33f7-6ba6-24938b0a8002
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_GuardHasKey(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage:f89a33fb-54a5-33f7-6ba6-24938b0a8002
msgctxt "h29616694g327eg4091g9fe5gafac7b3a76d9"
msgid "Here's the key. Pigeon's all yours."
msgstr "여기 열쇠. 비둘기는 이제 네 맘대로 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage
#. Speaker = Gribbo
#. NodeID = f96883eb-565a-641a-de39-0c65b7725285
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage:f96883eb-565a-641a-de39-0c65b7725285
msgctxt "h26279268gc6d7g4fdag96cfgef68ef913368"
msgid "Y-yes, of course - I didn't realise who you was."
msgstr "그-그럼, 물론이지. 누군지 미처 몰라봤네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = fc8afa88-3174-cff9-fb11-f479ec288eed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount1(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Guard_AtCage:fc8afa88-3174-cff9-fb11-f479ec288eed
msgctxt "h01cc357ag6c87g42ffgb408gd44d9a5deb11"
msgid "*A shiver runs across your mind... You feel sated.*"
msgstr "*전율이 불현듯 머릿속을 스쳐 지나가고... 만족감이 듭니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 0416d37d-52a2-f95e-5cd0-3c92ee7e1913
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:0416d37d-52a2-f95e-5cd0-3c92ee7e1913
msgctxt "h95265bcbg11aeg4ceeg95b1gadd3ec678752"
msgid "<i>(Now look what you've done!)</i>"
msgstr "<i>(지금 그대가 무슨 짓을 했는지 보게!)</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Gribbo
#. NodeID = 06a183fb-a343-a921-7738-3d73a2e39722
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:06a183fb-a343-a921-7738-3d73a2e39722
msgctxt "h4a789244gbfd4g4fd1g813dg4993818e7157"
msgid "Oi, stranger, you meddlin' with my pigeon? He's talking stupid now."
msgstr "어이, 처음 보는 놈. 지금 내 비둘기한테 무슨 짓이야? 이제 바보 소리만 나잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Gribbo
#. NodeID = 0719f82e-fa73-4f94-82dd-2ed96c1b5b09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:0719f82e-fa73-4f94-82dd-2ed96c1b5b09
msgctxt "hd2e66c6bg66edg4cb5g867bg859ec442c016"
msgid "Huh. That was good, carry it on, pigeon."
msgstr "허, 잘 하는데! 계속해라, 비둘기야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 09eda1ae-20b1-65ce-9404-ff0298fbcf82
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:09eda1ae-20b1-65ce-9404-ff0298fbcf82
msgctxt "h5f39e0f9g6925g4477g95fdgeccbe8acf422"
msgid ""
"Um... 'Why...' Err... 'He's a meatier creature than any I've spied!' Oh, "
"balderdash..."
msgstr "음... '그분은...' 어... '그분의 식사는 끝없이 들어간다더라!' 이런, 이놈의 주둥이가..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0db97adb-31a0-0a50-a5c4-2ead7581317f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:0db97adb-31a0-0a50-a5c4-2ead7581317f
msgctxt "h0f33bbffgddd5g4aa2gba84g70ea7a77d168"
msgid "<i>Grimace at the feeble rhymes.</i>"
msgstr "<i>형편없는 라임에 얼굴을 찡그린다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 0e49c147-a5c8-708a-3ea7-f72dab270969
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:0e49c147-a5c8-708a-3ea7-f72dab270969
msgctxt "h1e9dc568ge804g4c4fgbfd7gfcd0ac5ff7a0"
msgid "<i>(What are you doing? I'm busy here!)</i>"
msgstr "<i>(뭐하는 건가? 나는 지금 바쁘다네!)</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 1867a528-ba5e-ebe5-f12f-2c8c1d38b4d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:1867a528-ba5e-ebe5-f12f-2c8c1d38b4d2
msgctxt "h4586a9b7g3084g4e27g9ebegf852faab9077"
msgid "Come - let's continue our ballad!"
msgstr "자, 찬가를 계속하겠습니다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Gribbo
#. NodeID = 1d9e0301-ad32-095d-8a96-441c23dd4c0d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:1d9e0301-ad32-095d-8a96-441c23dd4c0d
msgctxt "hfd5982d0g0271g493cg9972g0045ee2d829f"
msgid "Bahh. You broke 'im!"
msgstr "에헤이. 너 때문에 망가졌잖아!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 1fc17eba-3890-75ee-f7b8-ec7bf7862f85
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:1fc17eba-3890-75ee-f7b8-ec7bf7862f85
msgctxt "h463d6390g2b1ag4efcg84d2ge19c80752ded"
msgid "Ahem. 'Dror Ragzlin, Dror Ragzlin, we, erm...'"
msgstr "에헴. '드롤 라그즐린, 드롤 라그즐린, 우리가, 음...'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 224eb799-042f-278f-86e2-94db9340a5a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:224eb799-042f-278f-86e2-94db9340a5a8
msgctxt "hd5305829g2853g47c0g9da4g18aa40280437"
msgid "Why, I never-!"
msgstr "아니, 그럴 리가-!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 229c74f0-7586-66be-9bdd-a53fde18b049
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_VoloOperation_HasMet(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:229c74f0-7586-66be-9bdd-a53fde18b049
msgctxt "h3aae089cge74fg4a0agb9aeg259d44cdcad1"
msgid ""
"No! I mean, I... we've <i>met</i>, but only for the briefest of "
"consultations."
msgstr "아닙니다! 그게, 만난 적이 <i>있긴</i> 하지만, 아주 짧게 대화했을 뿐입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Gribbo
#. NodeID = 28d481c5-2ad9-7d4d-4159-693570a38db0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:28d481c5-2ad9-7d4d-4159-693570a38db0
msgctxt "hca21c418gd38bg4f41g819dg8465d577d95c"
msgid "Hur!"
msgstr "헤!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 2b2eb28f-fbc3-d8e9-9c1d-e108b3d40a0e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:2b2eb28f-fbc3-d8e9-9c1d-e108b3d40a0e
msgctxt "hde1caa41g10a4g435bg8f79gb19b85605cfd"
msgid "Quite so. Now if you'll excuse me."
msgstr "실로 그렇다네. 자, 마저 하겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 454eb7d5-2710-c072-bb40-5a21201bb7be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:454eb7d5-2710-c072-bb40-5a21201bb7be
msgctxt "h64bfc383g053dg4678g84deg1c980921a27c"
msgid "What? No! Please, you misunderstand."
msgstr "뭐라고요? 아뇨! 오해십니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 46d6f5d5-973f-ddd1-df25-811daaaad297
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:46d6f5d5-973f-ddd1-df25-811daaaad297
msgctxt "h1b2b7196g98e2g426bg9c97g9cb4686f7489"
msgid ""
"<i>Continue rhyming. </i>'For a soul's not been truer than the Ragzlin named "
"Dror...'"
msgstr "<i>운을 뗀다.</i> '드롤이라 불린 라그즐린만큼 영혼이 참될 수 없기에...'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 569a6824-20d0-8f22-a7f1-7b655643b26b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:569a6824-20d0-8f22-a7f1-7b655643b26b
msgctxt "heb684ec8g9ca1g4ee9ga8ffg68a925267ba3"
msgid "To you? Never!"
msgstr "당신에게요? 절대 아닙니다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Gribbo
#. NodeID = 5e8fc394-976a-5cea-934c-ccc1749ee47c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_VoloBallad_Event_Leave(0) = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - DEN_VoloAdventure.VoloTaken(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:5e8fc394-976a-5cea-934c-ccc1749ee47c
msgctxt "h30fd9f37g3e57g487dg8574g95566e51c459"
msgid "C'mon, pigeon. Back to your cage."
msgstr "따라와, 비둘기야. 우리에 돌아가야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5ed938dc-ea5c-d8cb-9318-a5bbe88a2dd4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:5ed938dc-ea5c-d8cb-9318-a5bbe88a2dd4
msgctxt "he1256d22g4ed0g4c4bga552g6d17861363e4"
msgid "Is that really the best you can do?"
msgstr "정말 그게 최선이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Gribbo
#. NodeID = 644fe713-6745-9ac0-80a7-70c21945ca09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:644fe713-6745-9ac0-80a7-70c21945ca09
msgctxt "hfb3a0b0cga086g4789ga8b9g0699a6c73ee3"
msgid "Whozzat? Friend o' yours? You up to somethin'?"
msgstr "저건 누구야? 네 친구냐? 무슨 꿍꿍이 있는 거 아냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 6950b3fd-676f-d033-5e98-2077d46ad615
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_VoloOperation_HasMet(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:6950b3fd-676f-d033-5e98-2077d46ad615
msgctxt "hed7b46eeg5374g4412g976cgfc052c0bdea9"
msgid "Certainly not!"
msgstr "그럴 리가요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Gribbo
#. NodeID = 6be1535e-eeef-19ab-5a9e-30abab17a22e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:6be1535e-eeef-19ab-5a9e-30abab17a22e
msgctxt "hb8d01a16g0caag4bedg9243g1212114a4b61"
msgid "Hur! HUR!"
msgstr "헤! 헤!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 767c88b6-fb7f-8d0c-4216-231754888663
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:767c88b6-fb7f-8d0c-4216-231754888663
msgctxt "he793f168ga1f0g4b40g9942g93165fde7dbd"
msgid "Good show!"
msgstr "잘한다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 7bedd41f-195d-969a-fe8e-e6de4ea2bbf6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:7bedd41f-195d-969a-fe8e-e6de4ea2bbf6
msgctxt "h06241eb1g763dg4993gab08gd76ce4723d33"
msgid "I, erm... 'Dror Ragzlin, umtumptous, Dror Ragzlin, erm...'"
msgstr "전, 음... '드롤 라그즐린, 위엄감 넘치는 드롤 라그즐린, 어...'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7e99aad6-880e-0f69-14e3-c3ad6c7be08c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:7e99aad6-880e-0f69-14e3-c3ad6c7be08c
msgctxt "h2dfa3e4egc4fdg4271g815agd0a18a06e6be"
msgid "<i>Give him your rapt attention.</i>"
msgstr "<i>열심히 쳐다본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8fe2b3fc-28f2-7f2e-a3ad-312f9cce2468
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:8fe2b3fc-28f2-7f2e-a3ad-312f9cce2468
msgctxt "h8274e05fg7fc2g471bga04bgbd994da8a43d"
msgid "Bravo!"
msgstr "브라보!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 91e9c030-e534-889b-3ceb-b6a42a3877e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:91e9c030-e534-889b-3ceb-b6a42a3877e6
msgctxt "hb99918ecg6c21g47a8ga389g49ba5a47b797"
msgid "Wait! Wait! 'Dror Ragzlin, we... pray... we...'"
msgstr "잠깐! 기다려요! '드롤 라그즐린, 우리는... 기도하네... 우리는...'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Gribbo
#. NodeID = 931b44a4-dedc-4ea1-e945-583256f581e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:931b44a4-dedc-4ea1-e945-583256f581e0
msgctxt "h5bde3765gb103g48b1gb216gd3f58c5beef1"
msgid "<i>Common</i>, ye turnip."
msgstr "<i>공용어</i>지, 이 순무 대가리야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Gribbo
#. NodeID = 96d1f873-a069-2f18-798e-0e566416c682
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:96d1f873-a069-2f18-798e-0e566416c682
msgctxt "h6a700f8cg28c8g4d31gaafcg6d5225726ec6"
msgid "Wait a tick. That a friend o' yours?"
msgstr "잠깐만. 저거 네 친구냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Gribbo
#. NodeID = 98d474a6-9032-c893-cb89-5df4f4b6acdd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:98d474a6-9032-c893-cb89-5df4f4b6acdd
msgctxt "h6da61112g7b40g4929ga62bgec1a99d1de61"
msgid "You lyin'?"
msgstr "거짓말하는 거냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 99a757f2-6114-bcb4-78e7-249a242d3d6b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:99a757f2-6114-bcb4-78e7-249a242d3d6b
msgctxt "haade88aag0e78g4245gbc84gdb23e458fb04"
msgid ""
"The inn burned to ash! The captives were many!\n"
"Goblinkind had reduced them to cowering filfenny!"
msgstr ""
"여관은 잿더미가 되었다네! 포로는 산더미로 쌓였다네!\n"
"고블린 종족 앞에 그들은 겁먹은 젓더미에 불과했네!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Gribbo
#. NodeID = 99e84b31-b17e-38b5-1a68-f963d6650016
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:99e84b31-b17e-38b5-1a68-f963d6650016
msgctxt "heae1798bg5c2ag4ac0ga7e2ga7c34cfcb3d2"
msgid "You! Move off!"
msgstr "너! 꺼져!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 9a2a74f2-cd36-7602-171e-c083e532a81e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_VoloBallad_HasMet(2) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_GroveConflict_Knows_LeaderNameKing = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:9a2a74f2-cd36-7602-171e-c083e532a81e
msgctxt "hda4445bfg444bg4fb0g89begfa8487bdae46"
msgid ""
"With fragulous crown, and with sceptre abrade,\n"
"Dror Ragzlin short work of the innkeeper made!"
msgstr ""
"휘란한 왕관을 머리에 쓰고, 해진 셉터를 손으로 들었네.\n"
"드롤 라그즐린께선 그, 여관 주인의 목숨을 손으로 끊었네!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 9cb7ef84-8699-f20b-dfe8-defad71fcdd4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:9cb7ef84-8699-f20b-dfe8-defad71fcdd4
msgctxt "h0a4dc225g1ce4g49aagb626g6193cc3ec5a3"
msgid ""
"Um... Hah... '... And if you saw him kill manlings, you'd have to yell...' "
"ahem... 'proooaaaar!'"
msgstr "어... 아하... '...인간자들 죽여불린 그 모습만큼 영간히...' 에헴... '참될수랴!‘"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = aaabf9fc-37b8-a952-c69b-88c6869005b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_Checkpoint_State_GoblinsToldLeaders = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:aaabf9fc-37b8-a952-c69b-88c6869005b2
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hcbe8e4fagede7g4ccegb5a8g1120e7a2f060"
msgid ""
"I reckon Dror Ragzlin's the gobbo in charge, the way this one's carrying on."
msgstr "이 자의 말을 들어보니, 드롤 라그즐린이 대장인 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b88cc673-f6d4-e1f8-bcee-757230570a3f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 12
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:b88cc673-f6d4-e1f8-bcee-757230570a3f
msgctxt "h6b961d61g396fg4746gaf54g14f054c30ad6"
msgid "'I heard Ragzlin casts shadows that are 20 leagues wide!'"
msgstr "'라그즐린, 그분의 그림자는 끝없이 뻗어간다더라!'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bdf577ab-9384-a349-ec21-e4d08ba88147
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:bdf577ab-9384-a349-ec21-e4d08ba88147
msgctxt "hfa6a04bdg5a52g43b3gab5fg29bf9ced22b1"
msgid "'Manlings'? 'Proar'? What tongue are you speaking?"
msgstr "'인간자'? '참될수랴'? 이건 어느 동네 말이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c86c37c9-25c4-a599-eee9-fe544fbfc6b4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:c86c37c9-25c4-a599-eee9-fe544fbfc6b4
msgctxt "hd1cfd2afgcae8g4c1bg9417g06c8d1c4670e"
msgid "Boo! Get off the stage!"
msgstr "우우! 무대에서 내려와라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ca3e3f28-c60a-4d94-9c9c-b322640fd917
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:ca3e3f28-c60a-4d94-9c9c-b322640fd917
msgctxt "haf431400g8356g40dcgb3c1g2e0542b29889"
msgid "'Fragulous'? 'Galide'? I don't know this language."
msgstr "'휘란한'? '포부심'? 무슨 말인지 모르겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d1d7c77e-2496-59bb-9cc2-5c0533f4ac9c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:d1d7c77e-2496-59bb-9cc2-5c0533f4ac9c
msgctxt "h14c3bc50gdd08g4332gad4egff417268daf5"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = e380f8b0-7945-a6db-beb5-32f34d2e1860
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:e380f8b0-7945-a6db-beb5-32f34d2e1860
msgctxt "h0612a997g0e8dg42f3g9e61gaf5c7832d045"
msgid "<i>(Do as she says. Now!)</i>"
msgstr "<i>(하라는 대로 해 주게. 어서!)</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = e3d9bf1f-c21e-0f72-1d6c-39c2db33c2d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:e3d9bf1f-c21e-0f72-1d6c-39c2db33c2d6
msgctxt "hf0c02a2dg7aaag43e9gbefegcaf48ea36579"
msgid "Ahem - now, where was I?"
msgstr "에헴 - 자, 어디까지 했더라?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = e563f223-e40f-b570-3899-62c4099c48e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:e563f223-e40f-b570-3899-62c4099c48e0
msgctxt "h45a4d8eegbfdfg452eg8935g19da324579d4"
msgid ""
"So raiseth your goblets, and drain them with pride!\n"
"Dror Ragzlin, the True Soul, hath led you galide!"
msgstr ""
"그, 그러니 고블렛을 들어올려, 자부심을 들이키게!\n"
"참된 영혼 드롤 라그즐린, 포부심을 들이시네!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea
#. Speaker = Gribbo
#. NodeID = ef46aaf0-8637-5c3d-2124-fdd83ae66e64
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_FestivitiesArea:ef46aaf0-8637-5c3d-2124-fdd83ae66e64
msgctxt "h70db70adg2184g4f9aga27eg1582da124270"
msgid "Conspirin', are ye?"
msgstr "작당하는 거냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 01176738-b119-5a93-6ecf-cdbb6d1616da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_HasMet(1) = False
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_MetVoloInCage(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_State_InCage = True
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_State_VoloPrepsEscape = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_VoloBallad_HasMet(1) = True
#.     - GOB_VoloBallad_MetVoloInCage(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:01176738-b119-5a93-6ecf-cdbb6d1616da
msgctxt "h77e6198cge17dg4d89gbcb1ga32da9870fe2"
msgid ""
"You there! A friendly face. You haven't the looks of one of these cultists "
"about you, no sir!"
msgstr "저기! 드디어 친근한 얼굴이구나. 저 광신도들과는 전혀 닮지 않았다마다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 036f4ad0-ef7e-0d79-2eef-f9efaa3620e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:036f4ad0-ef7e-0d79-2eef-f9efaa3620e8
msgctxt "hfea84c34g0de9g4e2bg80a5gc0c55c1374d1"
msgid ""
"I guarantee the story of your daring rescue of my person will live on for "
"aeons!"
msgstr "그대가 나를 대담하게 구출한 이야기는 영겁의 세월 동안 살아 숨쉴 것이라 장담하네!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0a533a82-fe72-72b7-1208-7e75b9198ffc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:0a533a82-fe72-72b7-1208-7e75b9198ffc
msgctxt "hd0c78409g4656g4701g8027g4e5d9172594a"
msgid "What career could possibly involve getting locked up by goblins?"
msgstr "직업이 뭐길래 고블린에게 감금당하는 일에 휘말릴 수 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 0aa15dbb-5802-50b5-53f3-7055fc5f576d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:0aa15dbb-5802-50b5-53f3-7055fc5f576d
msgctxt "h5d347235g51b6g4544g9612gb4ed34d20d0b"
msgid ""
"Once I've written you into one of my books, there won't be a tavern in "
"Faerûn you can enter without receiving a hero's welcome."
msgstr "내가 그대의 이야기를 책에 담고 나면, 그대는 페이룬의 선술집에 들어갈 때마다 매번 영웅 대접을 받게 될 것이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 0ae2d3a0-b20b-27e4-5edf-1bea8e1a4e91
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:0ae2d3a0-b20b-27e4-5edf-1bea8e1a4e91
msgctxt "he9ed9f39gb2f7g4d26g8307g07737af68bb2"
msgid "Bless you, my friend! I'll wait nicely, but please don't tarry!"
msgstr "축복 받으시게, 친구여! 나는 잘 기다리겠지만, 지체하진 말아주게!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0ece2572-1a9f-644d-0476-2b8e7d476a09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:0ece2572-1a9f-644d-0476-2b8e7d476a09
msgctxt "h5dccc29dg3cbag4cffg998ag408d6bce4697"
msgid ""
"I'm not looking for extra company right now. You go your way, I go mine."
msgstr "나는 지금 동료를 더 찾고 있지 않아. 각자의 길을 가자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 13bdeba8-e30b-aac1-ff0b-945c67e07baf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:13bdeba8-e30b-aac1-ff0b-945c67e07baf
msgctxt "h65185fa9gb6bfg4c40ga6d0g25e8030cac3e"
msgid "We met in the druids' grove, don't you remember?"
msgstr "우리 드루이드 숲에서 만났었는데, 기억 안 나나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 152be243-579c-226d-e68d-4b94bf780889
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 8610ce97-d89a-218f-39ba-a9658f9d3c8b_VoloMentionedInvisPotion = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:152be243-579c-226d-e68d-4b94bf780889
msgctxt "h8c1a8035gd78bg40b4ga128gc0ddc1e69437"
msgid "Slip the yoke? How do you intend to do that exactly?"
msgstr "멍에를 벗어난다고? 정확히 어떻게 할 셈인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 21f38338-ea4a-d92d-e0f8-7d22e6ee39b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:21f38338-ea4a-d92d-e0f8-7d22e6ee39b1
msgctxt "h9066f211g1866g46edgadbdgce90c2adb64c"
msgid ""
"Smashing! Soon, my friend - soon we can share a flagon of something liquid "
"and a tale of derring-do!"
msgstr "기쁘군! 곧 그리하겠네, 친구여. 머지 않아 우리는 맑은 술과 모험 이야기를 나눌 수 있을 걸세!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 22520dfc-c737-a367-c079-245a7f5480c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_HelpedVolo = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:22520dfc-c737-a367-c079-245a7f5480c3
msgctxt "hd620622cg0ca0g4a44g9f61g88243982c1fb"
msgid ""
"Gods bless you, friend. I'll wait 'til the coast is quite clear and be gone!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 25a9ca93-e384-416f-714b-0bddb82734d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_HasMet(1) = True
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_MetVoloInCage(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_State_InCage = True
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_State_VoloPrepsEscape = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_VoloBallad_MetVoloInCage(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:25a9ca93-e384-416f-714b-0bddb82734d5
msgctxt "hef2826b0gf9f4g462egafabgb18c30298cdd"
msgid "Ah! My friend! We can speak freely."
msgstr "아! 친구여! 드디어 맘 편히 얘기할 수 있겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 32176be4-f0ac-519b-2794-fca5372266bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:32176be4-f0ac-519b-2794-fca5372266bd
msgctxt "hdb1c10f9g8929g46eegb6a7gc174757b1d62"
msgid "You're Volo, right? I've read your work."
msgstr "당신이 바로 볼로죠? 당신 작품을 읽어봤어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 328d8f1b-8e57-347c-49b6-074782a19991
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_MetVoloInCage(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_State_VoloPrepsEscape = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:328d8f1b-8e57-347c-49b6-074782a19991
msgctxt "hb12a26f4g5c04g4bf1gbb32g9ac515c16f21"
msgid "Ha-HA! I knew I could count on you, my friend."
msgstr "하<b>하</b>! 역시 자네를 믿고 있길 잘했다네, 친구여."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 333237f2-de27-1f9d-3b49-029d810005f3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:333237f2-de27-1f9d-3b49-029d810005f3
msgctxt "hcd36436bgcaecg4ae9g9f34ga1e73f1d7a27"
msgid "Aha! An individual of some learning, I see. You're quite right."
msgstr "아하! 식견이 뛰어나신 분이로군. 그대의 말이 맞다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 3695279c-f06e-9181-43df-659024520ff8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_MetVoloInCage(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_State_InCage = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:3695279c-f06e-9181-43df-659024520ff8
msgctxt "h3261f734g1ae8g48e9g91a2g2be970a6b408"
msgid ""
"Ha-HA! Hang the key - I see you've no need at all! Thank you for your help, "
"my friend."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 3773d89b-1ea4-3726-adaa-c729ed8160ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 8610ce97-d89a-218f-39ba-a9658f9d3c8b_VoloMentionedInvisPotion = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:3773d89b-1ea4-3726-adaa-c729ed8160ea
msgctxt "h6e5dfa3fgd1cag43e3g8c43gb84d080710af"
msgid ""
"I intend to do just that. A trusty invisibility potion goes a long way in a "
"place like this."
msgstr "바로 그럴 계획이라네. 믿음직한 투명화 물약이라면 이런 곳에서 빠져나갈 수 있겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 38123c03-6882-aac6-cef4-99a327a95526
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:38123c03-6882-aac6-cef4-99a327a95526
msgctxt "h77764f62gf4acg4f19gbba4g49a8b8e4b3d9"
msgid ""
"But! No matter. Here I am and here you are. Please - unlock this cell and we "
"can both of us escape."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 394dbbe4-51d6-9e20-9d58-dfd0b18efe91
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:394dbbe4-51d6-9e20-9d58-dfd0b18efe91
msgctxt "hfdcef897g5ab4g48fcg9ac2gcdb6968cd391"
msgid ""
"Pish posh! Allies are a difficult find in the area, my friend. You'll want "
"Volo in your corner, believe you me."
msgstr "무슨 소리! 이 지역에서는 아군을 구하기 힘들다네, 친구여. 볼로를 곁에 두는 게 좋을 것이야, 내 말을 믿어보게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 3b20e58f-1078-7381-5520-4cf2b1b54b17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:3b20e58f-1078-7381-5520-4cf2b1b54b17
msgctxt "h8032a610gb593g4024ga4b2g244ae087346b"
msgid ""
"I'll write an anonymous account of your heroism, then! None will know your "
"name, yet your doings will live on!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 3c4badea-77ad-f466-6928-a36e0bf5ac6c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:3c4badea-77ad-f466-6928-a36e0bf5ac6c
msgctxt "hc4c95756g407bg4becg8f74g11344a8d39ab"
msgid ""
"Ah, of course. Good thing we cleared out of there, by the by. These goblins "
"are planning a raid on the place as we speak."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 488e1e47-157f-7c13-b5c4-a27fd08c9315
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Volo_HasMet = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:488e1e47-157f-7c13-b5c4-a27fd08c9315
msgctxt "h3c3fe472g0019g460bgb91eg66cba82f4d7c"
msgid "I'm not looking for that sort of attention."
msgstr "그런 주목은 필요 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4b089859-92f9-a948-c149-3613a91c4ec2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:4b089859-92f9-a948-c149-3613a91c4ec2
msgctxt "h3ca0ca1dg2724g4a52gb030ga60ea1b9fe24"
msgid "You know what else lives on for aeons? Gold. You owe me."
msgstr "영겁의 세월 동안 살아 숨쉬는 게 또 뭔지 아나? 금이야. 당신은 나한테 빚졌어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4c2cc371-6bfb-09e8-7e0a-6c8ba73f4dca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:4c2cc371-6bfb-09e8-7e0a-6c8ba73f4dca
msgctxt "hb2120f53g9e3dg4e45ga850g9d2965808a71"
msgid "Get yourself to safety - and quick."
msgstr "안전한 곳으로 가, 최대한 빨리."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4dafbbe4-d715-7565-59a2-564b31acf925
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:4dafbbe4-d715-7565-59a2-564b31acf925
msgctxt "hd23e7b44g6b58g446fgb079ge6c93cbadc16"
msgid "I'm not interested in that sort of attention."
msgstr "그런 주목에는 관심 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 531b26bd-8110-5955-43a6-3430fe8669f3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:531b26bd-8110-5955-43a6-3430fe8669f3
msgctxt "h58db76ebg7057g470bgb8bfg7012db4e4883"
msgid "Bah, what's a bit of metal between allies? I'll do one better."
msgstr "친구 사이에 금속 쪼가리 몇 개가 뭐가 중요한가? 내가 그보다 더 나은 한 가지 일을 해주겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 5ad52547-2fd6-832f-f992-dbce7d77b59a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:5ad52547-2fd6-832f-f992-dbce7d77b59a
msgctxt "hfce000f3gbdf7g49bagae8dg0663845db3f6"
msgid ""
"Volothamp Geddarm, realm-renowned author, auteur, and tastemaker, at your "
"service."
msgstr "세계에서 유명한 저자이자 연출가, 그리고 유행 전도사인 볼로뎀프 게담이 그대에게 인사하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6428cee7-45f9-90bd-9270-1de2fe6d30f3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:6428cee7-45f9-90bd-9270-1de2fe6d30f3
msgctxt "hb23442d8g7a82g4412ga21ag37a4e268d785"
msgid "All right - I'll get you out."
msgstr "알았어, 여기서 꺼내줄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 644992d1-6277-0337-ab5f-18ba12bc8970
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Volo_HasMet = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:644992d1-6277-0337-ab5f-18ba12bc8970
msgctxt "hce18c170g8d86g40f4gb31eg5d73bdc4751f"
msgid "A joy to see a familiar face in such a... precarious setting."
msgstr "익숙한 얼굴을 보니 기쁘군. 이런… 위태로운 환경에서 말일세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 682e377f-d1e7-757b-e998-eb1d27ff50db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:682e377f-d1e7-757b-e998-eb1d27ff50db
msgctxt "haa5bf17bg412bg42c4gabeagf6399851dbd9"
msgid ""
"Tell me where we can meet each other, once we've slipped the goblin yoke, "
"and I'll offer much more than gold. Knowledge, my friend, is priceless."
msgstr ""
"고블린의 멍에를 벗어나고 나서 어디서 만날 수 있는지 알려주면, 금보다 훨씬 더 큰 것을 제공하겠네. 친구여, 지식은 값을 매길 수 "
"없다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 68e95936-12e2-32ea-2f94-51deb501087e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_MetVoloInCage(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_State_InCage = True
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_State_VoloPrepsEscape = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:68e95936-12e2-32ea-2f94-51deb501087e
msgctxt "h951d4fcega1fdg4818g84fcgf931cdf8dd00"
msgid ""
"This lock, my friend! Surely a strong arm like you can make short work of it."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 69df725a-5970-d657-1990-78b6d6ee883c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:69df725a-5970-d657-1990-78b6d6ee883c
msgctxt "h737eb2a3gf2d5g4976g8e6ag020d434dfddf"
msgid "A fine mess you landed yourself in. How'd you get caught?"
msgstr "당신이 자초한 일이야. 어떻게 잡혔나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 6c4e2309-b3a8-b48f-cf4c-6558ea11779f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:6c4e2309-b3a8-b48f-cf4c-6558ea11779f
msgctxt "haf7f3140g6d8cg4aeegacccga480f111875d"
msgid ""
"I don't need a promise, my friend. Only an honest attempt. Please - do "
"consider it!"
msgstr "약속은 필요 없네, 친구여. 그저 정직한 시도만 있으면 돼. 그러니 부디 고려해 주시게!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 71871ea7-336d-d96e-f664-ccdf2295f1fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:71871ea7-336d-d96e-f664-ccdf2295f1fd
msgctxt "h70706ff2g94d0g42b0gbd69g61562335e762"
msgid ""
"I'm in no hurry to take my turn on that spit out front. Perhaps you'd be so "
"kind as to unlock this cage?"
msgstr "저 끔찍한 무대를 또 서고 싶지는 않네. 혹시 이 우리 좀 열어줄 수 있겠는가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 78118246-3d87-e0f2-e3af-d8247f165f1c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:78118246-3d87-e0f2-e3af-d8247f165f1c
msgctxt "h5dc3f865g1bc5g41ddg9fb2gc3efd844f053"
msgid "And you expect me to help you in return for nothing?"
msgstr "내가 대가도 없이 당신을 도와주길 바라나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 7bb87222-cdca-ba64-27d8-d22ff26c21e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:7bb87222-cdca-ba64-27d8-d22ff26c21e3
msgctxt "h3a2274d3g64dbg48cfgaf6cg8a1370be19b6"
msgid ""
"Well, I suppose this is 'goodbye,' my friend. I wish you the greatest of "
"luck and I hope I shall recall you favourably in my records of the day's "
"events."
msgstr "그럼, 이게 '작별'이겠군, 친구여. 내가 오늘 일을 기록할 때 그대를 좋게 기억하길 바라네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7e3d2da6-2240-1b2b-37c7-9b0375559fc0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:7e3d2da6-2240-1b2b-37c7-9b0375559fc0
msgctxt "h9c1bba46g6a04g4417g9cfeg295d0c52fb61"
msgid ""
"Remember my name when you're crediting the story's author. It's "
"[GEN_PlayerName_c11eee1e-7815-6143-7233-f2427799fa53]."
msgstr ""
"내 이름을 꼭 기억해 뒀다가 원작자로 수록해. "
"[GEN_PlayerName_c11eee1e-7815-6143-7233-f2427799fa53]."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 7e80c02d-de72-7df7-f078-4ac81f2fade8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:7e80c02d-de72-7df7-f078-4ac81f2fade8
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h95b70adag1a4bg4d22g882fged4b6ac3cb3f"
msgid ""
"Help me, and I'll make sure everyone in Faerûn knows you for the hero you "
"are."
msgstr "날 도와주게, 그럼 온 페이룬 사람들이 당신이 영웅이란 걸 알게 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 7f930c0c-87df-73ac-6900-10a2626ad8bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:7f930c0c-87df-73ac-6900-10a2626ad8bc
msgctxt "h9820b49bge814g4b76g9a43g2f3f80dc3456"
msgid "Open this cell and I'll never forget the kindness!"
msgstr "이 감옥을 열어주면 그 친절함을 절대 잊지 않으리!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 8159e59b-c034-e63d-0cda-cdbcbf993d29
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_VoloBallad_VoloLibirator(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:8159e59b-c034-e63d-0cda-cdbcbf993d29
msgctxt "hab755144g7f4dg4435g9ed1g82110206a817"
msgid ""
"We mustn't tarry, but I'd hate for our friendship to end here. Please - "
"won't you meet me, once we've both slipped the goblin yoke?"
msgstr ""
"지체해선 안 되겠지만, 우리 우정이 여기서 끝나는 건 싫다네. 부디, 우리 모두 고블린의 멍에를 벗어난 뒤 다시 만나지 않겠는가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 826f7353-db85-d9b3-4b78-4c7ca882b9df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_VoloOperation_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:826f7353-db85-d9b3-4b78-4c7ca882b9df
msgctxt "hdc1330d0g90a1g481aga286g90b7b93540ec"
msgid "Don't you remember me?"
msgstr "날 기억하지 못하는 겐가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 84d079bf-04a3-38a0-c46d-57565d8c571c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:84d079bf-04a3-38a0-c46d-57565d8c571c
msgctxt "hed052ceag284ag40dcg8c85g119f516ca730"
msgid "I'll think about it. No promises."
msgstr "생각해볼게. 약속은 못하지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 89a0c620-bd55-ea8d-3026-91ca8a90d346
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:89a0c620-bd55-ea8d-3026-91ca8a90d346
msgctxt "hd73f3e66g75fag4327ga4e9g8050089fb5a1"
msgid "Why... of course! You were the one with the... name!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8d2864b8-21a9-9916-5d9d-9181ed32e866
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:8d2864b8-21a9-9916-5d9d-9181ed32e866
msgctxt "hfac7cabag34e1g4460g821fg62c658e774d8"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 917d524c-9b50-d128-1db2-1f960ff7799d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GLO_Volo_Knows_CampSite(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_VoloBallad_HelpedVolo = True
#.     - GOB_VoloBallad_State_SentToPartyCamp = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - DEN_VoloAdventure.VoloFree(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:917d524c-9b50-d128-1db2-1f960ff7799d
msgctxt "h7bc89805g396fg4a9bg9351g183b5d933c17"
msgid ""
"I'll slip away when the coast is clear. See you soon, my friend! I simply "
"can't wait to pick your brain!"
msgstr "난 이 상황이 정리되는 대로 슬그머니 빠져나가겠네. 조만간 보세, 친구여! 그대의 머릿속을 살펴볼 생각만으로도 기대되는군!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 9ab9fc9f-77fb-ba2f-a5a2-c5c601d88d7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:9ab9fc9f-77fb-ba2f-a5a2-c5c601d88d7e
msgctxt "h93045f49gd99eg4e4cg9a3cg449c5c5ca050"
msgid ""
"You may not recognise me in these dire straits, but my name is Volothamp "
"Geddarm, realm-renowned author, auteur, and tastemaker."
msgstr ""
"이 극심한 곤경에 처한 나를 알아보지 못할 수도 있지만, 내 이름은 볼로뎀프 게담이라네. 세계에서 유명한 저자이자 연출가, 그리고 유행 "
"전도사지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 9c1b7e8c-bcaf-9203-0835-02c95e05323b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:9c1b7e8c-bcaf-9203-0835-02c95e05323b
msgctxt "hc0008760g5a8eg477fg9017gac2041dc0655"
msgid ""
"Of course not! As compensation, I can assure the tale of your heroism will "
"live on... <i>forever!</i>"
msgstr "물론 아니지! 보상으로, 그대의 영웅적 업적에 대한 이야기가 지속될 것이라 장담하네… <i>영원히!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = a2a5e623-25be-26d7-8390-6ea0d8d7620e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_VoloBallad_HelpedVolo = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - DEN_VoloAdventure.VoloEscaped(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:a2a5e623-25be-26d7-8390-6ea0d8d7620e
msgctxt "h8747252eg526bg4329gac47gb01e541eaba2"
msgid ""
"I'll slip away when the coast is clear. And I wish you the greatest possible "
"luck in your mysterious endeavours. Ta!"
msgstr "난 이 상황이 정리되는 대로 슬그머니 빠져나가겠네! 그리고 그대의 신비한 노력에 최고의 행운이 함께하길 기원하네. 고맙네!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = a78e710f-70b3-3770-3cce-cf1558f11c2b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:a78e710f-70b3-3770-3cce-cf1558f11c2b
msgctxt "h18080b81gc817g4808g9093g984dfd3b9dbf"
msgid ""
"Volothamp Geddarm, realm-renowned author, auteur, and tastemaker, at your "
"service."
msgstr "세계에서 유명한 저자이자 연출가, 그리고 유행 전도사인 볼로뎀프 게담이 그대에게 인사하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = a9cd1524-2954-f43e-24f4-420f9eeaaec9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:a9cd1524-2954-f43e-24f4-420f9eeaaec9
msgctxt "h987c4c3eg88fbg4b6bg9666gea0833cb9243"
msgid ""
"An invisibility potion, my friend. A bit less refined than your mendacious "
"methods, but by god it'll do the trick!"
msgstr "투명화 물약이지, 친구여. 그대의 비밀스런 방법보다는 덜 세련되었지만, 이 방법도 기필코 효과가 있을 거야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = afcd6cd0-c23c-c278-2724-3e0c7d12f2be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:afcd6cd0-c23c-c278-2724-3e0c7d12f2be
msgctxt "h59078f65gcebfg4067g9e76g4a5a2677b9fe"
msgid ""
"I'll write an anonymous account of your largesse, then! None will know your "
"name, yet your doings will live on!"
msgstr "그렇다면, 그대의 자비를 익명의 기록으로 남겨주겠네! 그대 이름은 알려지지 않겠지만, 그대가 한 일은 영원히 기억될 것이네!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = b1aedaff-a0d5-53bd-ab1e-d53905d05a20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:b1aedaff-a0d5-53bd-ab1e-d53905d05a20
msgctxt "h31162e02g8ba6g4c48g91d9g73f0853056ae"
msgid ""
"We mustn't tarry, but I'd hate for our friendship to end here. Please - "
"won't you meet me, once we've both slipped the goblin yoke?"
msgstr ""
"지체해선 안 되겠지만, 우리 우정이 여기서 끝나는 건 싫다네. 부디, 우리 모두 고블린의 멍에를 벗어난 뒤 다시 만나지 않겠는가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = bbcac948-9d50-b047-c9d6-301925ddaaaa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:bbcac948-9d50-b047-c9d6-301925ddaaaa
msgctxt "hafa01595gaf5bg409dgb585g3f0ad177b72f"
msgid ""
"Curiosity, my friend. It didn't benefit the cat, but it's the foundation of "
"<i>my </i>career."
msgstr "호기심이라네, 친구여. 고양이에게는 좋을 것 없지만, <i>내</i> 직업에 있어서는 기초적인 것이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = c3e208a0-6318-9672-b140-5d98a36d9273
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:c3e208a0-6318-9672-b140-5d98a36d9273
msgctxt "hf3492504g7441g447egafbdg8f9f2a7f7239"
msgid "Please - a hand?"
msgstr "부디, 도와주겠나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = c501d5d4-3ded-ebce-8236-797eb15c2e5e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:c501d5d4-3ded-ebce-8236-797eb15c2e5e
msgctxt "h77265cdeg9e2bg40d5gb376g242d9fbf0c0c"
msgid ""
"Volothamp Geddarm, realm-renowned author, auteur, and tastemaker, at your "
"service."
msgstr "세계에서 유명한 저자이자 연출가, 그리고 유행 전도사인 볼로뎀프 게담이 그대에게 인사하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c64e8a4e-a88f-eb9e-67df-2760cdcf8290
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:c64e8a4e-a88f-eb9e-67df-2760cdcf8290
msgctxt "h0338a395gb591g4b96g96e0g37d1337e0e91"
msgid "How did you end up in this place?"
msgstr "어떻게 이 장소에 이르게 된 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ca5ed4b9-94f1-bbb5-80d3-a557b5841a4b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:ca5ed4b9-94f1-bbb5-80d3-a557b5841a4b
msgctxt "h2d674c40gc3afg4617gad99gec0706965e90"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cb315950-2272-bafb-9caf-deecf5aec551
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:cb315950-2272-bafb-9caf-deecf5aec551
msgctxt "h69ae10d8g6317g4227g87f8g4660382165a4"
msgid "And just how do you propose doing <i>that?</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = ccdce1b2-0799-2143-2332-b17ab476ece1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:ccdce1b2-0799-2143-2332-b17ab476ece1
msgctxt "hdc64a38fge963g45d6gba5eg2f8477eaaf66"
msgid ""
"Why, by design, my friend. How better to learn the ways of a people than to "
"live among them?"
msgstr "아니, 설계대로였네, 친구여. 한 종족의 방식을 배우는 데 있어서 그들과 같이 지내는 것보다 좋은 방법이 어디 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cf0e0c65-9360-78e0-e126-4b8e41362938
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:cf0e0c65-9360-78e0-e126-4b8e41362938
msgctxt "h9eae89aegd11ag4f8dgad31g917f06dbd753"
msgid "That's all? Hardly seems worth the trouble."
msgstr "그게 다인가? 수고할 가치는 별로 없는 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = d823f0f7-2416-77d9-14c8-eafbe460d95c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:d823f0f7-2416-77d9-14c8-eafbe460d95c
msgctxt "hd97ac88dgf97bg4852gb7f5g2294787f3c43"
msgid ""
"I daresay the experiment has proven most fruitful, too. I'll be happy to "
"share my findings... once we've found somewhere safe to parley."
msgstr ""
"감히 말하건대, 이 실험은 가장 유익한 것으로 판명됐네. 우리가 안전한 장소를 찾게 되면, 내 기꺼이 알아낸 것들을 공유해 주겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dd9a8258-ec52-47cb-a655-1b6a142d32ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:dd9a8258-ec52-47cb-a655-1b6a142d32ad
msgctxt "hdc385b97gcff0g494cg98c3g7ff4d9e45e5d"
msgid "Go to my camp. We'll talk there, once we're both safe."
msgstr "내 야영지로 가. 우리 모두 안전해지면, 그곳에서 대화하자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = de484efc-6bbc-fe3b-46a0-f98698599686
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:de484efc-6bbc-fe3b-46a0-f98698599686
msgctxt "h48fd32f8gfb82g457fgaf7bg5e191554bf4d"
msgid ""
"Volothamp Geddarm, realm-renowned author, auteur, and tastemaker, at your "
"service."
msgstr "세계에서 유명한 저자이자 연출가, 그리고 유행 전도사인 볼로뎀프 게담이 그대에게 인사하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = de929719-0ac6-22a5-075f-8fcfa26b0f6f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:de929719-0ac6-22a5-075f-8fcfa26b0f6f
msgctxt "hb8f4419eg3ae5g465egbfaegf27aaeaf2199"
msgid ""
"Volothamp Geddarm, realm-renowned author, auteur, and tastemaker, at your "
"service."
msgstr "세계에서 유명한 저자이자 연출가, 그리고 유행 전도사인 볼로뎀프 게담이 그대에게 인사하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = df61f90b-99dd-1b89-21e2-59eed9888025
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:df61f90b-99dd-1b89-21e2-59eed9888025
msgctxt "h7631dbc4gde2fg4ed3gb56aga17559330ccc"
msgid ""
"Though I admit I've hit something of an impasse. Please - unlock my cell?"
msgstr "그렇지만 내가 난관에 부딪혔다는 건 인정해야겠군. 제발, 내 감옥의 잠금을 풀어주지 않겠는가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = e4b685f2-eb62-991f-0b6f-31a1c43912c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:e4b685f2-eb62-991f-0b6f-31a1c43912c6
msgctxt "he47b6c95gd8feg45fag8240g2f0f090ed0f2"
msgid ""
"That will sound <i>ridiculous</i>. But, fine. If you insist. As much as it "
"pains me to cede creative control..."
msgstr "그런 <i>황당무계한</i> 이름을! 정 고집한다면, 알겠네. 창작의 자유를 짓밟히는 것은 참으로 안타깝지만..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = e5020ae1-800a-3d2d-46f6-f93b24cbe8a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_MetVoloInCage(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_State_InCage = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:e5020ae1-800a-3d2d-46f6-f93b24cbe8a6
msgctxt "h85865106g8efdg4361ga39dgbbc45580fe4d"
msgid "Ha-HA! Look at this - I'm quite saved, and by means most extraordinary!"
msgstr "하하! 이거 보게, 나는 완전히 구원받았어, 그것도 가장 놀라운 방법으로!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = e93fc990-df65-171c-4e1e-ac46243fa4e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:e93fc990-df65-171c-4e1e-ac46243fa4e0
msgctxt "h1f5c45b1gcbd8g4b88gac68ga4babe88710d"
msgid ""
"Well, I <i>will</i> be at your service. Once I've been freed from this "
"ensconsement. Speaking of which..."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = ea06c6f2-8d79-b015-e658-ace9afd8afdf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_MetVoloInCage(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_State_VoloPrepsEscape = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:ea06c6f2-8d79-b015-e658-ace9afd8afdf
msgctxt "h2d1f40e3g6c72g44a3ga8d6g2525c2936955"
msgid "Ha-HA! Look at this - I'm quite saved!"
msgstr "하하! 이거 보게, 나는 완전히 구원받았어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = efa8d1d4-0a37-2da9-64d6-f0a99214b314
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:efa8d1d4-0a37-2da9-64d6-f0a99214b314
msgctxt "h2d89592bg69d1g4450gb0e1g2250e34e4986"
msgid "Then please, a favour - notable figure to notable figure."
msgstr "그럼 부디, 중요한 인물이 중요한 인물에게 호의 한 번만 베풀어주시게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fa1b60c5-95ca-d5cf-9967-e2c12d8d9748
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Volo_HasMet = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_InCage:fa1b60c5-95ca-d5cf-9967-e2c12d8d9748
msgctxt "hd9a9e99fg910cg4c7cg87dfg1fbb84625082"
msgid "And just how will you be accomplishing that?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0598752d-bc06-1b2f-57f3-20b6fcef6927
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_TieflingLeader_Quest_GobHuntResponded = True
#.      - DEN_TieflingLeader_Quest_GobHuntDeclined = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:0598752d-bc06-1b2f-57f3-20b6fcef6927
msgctxt "h31275a2dg73b9g496agb220g7b5dc259c246"
msgid ""
"The goblins were a threat to a group of tieflings nearby. I put an end to "
"that threat."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 09e1f958-e741-37ea-3ab7-d0d37fbb1bb2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:09e1f958-e741-37ea-3ab7-d0d37fbb1bb2
msgctxt "h15dbfe28g270dg46c6g93d2g45ceaa747979"
msgid "Never mind that - what are you doing, picking over corpses?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 103cc3d3-4024-c435-30b7-395441a837c1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:103cc3d3-4024-c435-30b7-395441a837c1
msgctxt "h4d1ecda1g3887g4a0ag91e5g7363ce92f469"
msgid ""
"But if you won't tell me, no matter. <i>A</i> truth is second best to <i>the "
"</i>truth."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 13cb0419-00d6-866e-3b7f-2392593df85e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:13cb0419-00d6-866e-3b7f-2392593df85e
msgctxt "hf8bae7b5gab0fg40dcga101gc3ddbd241ab0"
msgid ""
"Best not to hang around. Whoever is responsible for this mess may still be "
"here... unless this was <i>your</i> doing?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1997ba40-258f-f176-21eb-c83252ea0b3f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:1997ba40-258f-f176-21eb-c83252ea0b3f
msgctxt "h4927daabga6eag4d92g96c7gf6888cc1c7d8"
msgid "It was self-defence, I had no choice."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1b8f07e3-ca8c-3913-2f18-cd5e4677d02e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:1b8f07e3-ca8c-3913-2f18-cd5e4677d02e
msgctxt "h38e544cdg5b93g4752gb5cfgadc8ce57565f"
msgid "Find me at my camp - we can talk there."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 256102b5-3f45-3c23-239d-05cf2dc6c216
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:256102b5-3f45-3c23-239d-05cf2dc6c216
msgctxt "h12c95c0cg0341g4d76gaec5g936962e99d4a"
msgid ""
"Drat. Then I suppose I'll have to stitch together the truth with naught but "
"my own good sense."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26ac06f5-00bd-d41f-5dbf-e6be9e318a68
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:26ac06f5-00bd-d41f-5dbf-e6be9e318a68
msgctxt "h79f5e0ccg049fg4a79g88bagb83ae0ccb005"
msgid "Pick a different brain. I can't help you."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 3b01bd8e-96d3-781f-03fa-7df587ced520
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:3b01bd8e-96d3-781f-03fa-7df587ced520
msgctxt "h6f90e846g75edg49f3g8b94gbcc654702cf7"
msgid ""
"Ah, but you must mean Zevlor and the lot! I spent some time with them "
"myself. Kind, if underfortunate people."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3c0d05b4-1e1a-5b35-384a-64cdea2b8ab3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GOB_GoblinToast_Quest_Poisoner(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:3c0d05b4-1e1a-5b35-384a-64cdea2b8ab3
msgctxt "hc4747085gcb79g429fga0e3gd5d37d313453"
msgid "Guilty. I killed them all."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3c63c6bf-84aa-e6e0-451c-907251f0bea5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:3c63c6bf-84aa-e6e0-451c-907251f0bea5
msgctxt "hce444f33g929fg4900g997dgd4911b3cb31c"
msgid "Afraid not."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3f80a656-ca0b-2070-1739-241172b4de69
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GOB_GoblinToast_Quest_Poisoner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:3f80a656-ca0b-2070-1739-241172b4de69
msgctxt "h5649c9ecg0505g406bg9c83ga663c63ee2a2"
msgid "I did - I poisoned them."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 5f654e01-1917-fc7c-aeb2-d6212a52f016
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:5f654e01-1917-fc7c-aeb2-d6212a52f016
msgctxt "hb6b2a2fag5483g4bd4g904aga6692ea0d7b8"
msgid ""
"Of course, my friend. But <i>facts</i> belong to no one and everyone. Please:"
" what happened here?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 65c590ac-6945-214c-6595-d6b1dcbea059
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_GoblinHuntPoison_Quest_BeerPoisoned = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_VoloBallad_HasMetWhileStudying(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:65c590ac-6945-214c-6595-d6b1dcbea059
msgctxt "h19ca749cge3d4g4336g942ag6d28718af869"
msgid "My friend! Are you responsible for the slaughter of these goblins?"
msgstr "친구여! 혹시 그대가 이곳의 고블린 무리들을 몰살시켰는가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6cd3d16e-0cc1-add8-abdd-c266998effe1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:6cd3d16e-0cc1-add8-abdd-c266998effe1
msgctxt "h5bd029cag9d85g4339g86b8gd9944cb0f1e9"
msgid "I have my own reasons."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 716975a4-1107-5a8f-be2d-83efd1291dca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GOB_GoblinToast_Quest_Poisoner(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:716975a4-1107-5a8f-be2d-83efd1291dca
msgctxt "hf28b411ag2480g4c95gbf6bgef1111c4be2d"
msgid "Guilty as charged."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 73c39166-dcd6-6854-b991-6b98225cd626
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_GoblinHuntPoison_Quest_BeerPoisoned = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_VoloBallad_HasMetWhileStudying(1) = True
#.     - GOB_VoloBallad_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:73c39166-dcd6-6854-b991-6b98225cd626
msgctxt "h7ebd3898g7309g4afeg8cc1gbbb0d77d0657"
msgid "There! That's the last frothing innard catalogued. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 92cd3ee1-bcc6-16d7-4e4f-9e9f75e220b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:92cd3ee1-bcc6-16d7-4e4f-9e9f75e220b8
msgctxt "hace6178dg3786g4255ga06cg1f1e49129c95"
msgid ""
"<i>Someone</i> must collect the facts and arrange them in a clever order."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 9a665464-4be4-fa2f-e2ea-0cf760165bb7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:9a665464-4be4-fa2f-e2ea-0cf760165bb7
msgctxt "h2a17843bgb0b6g48fbga0dag700b3c2d7d92"
msgid ""
"Hmmm... Your story may be relevant, but the stench of this place is hardly "
"suited to civilised conversation."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = 9e70abcf-9c40-148b-9a78-20b16985e076
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:9e70abcf-9c40-148b-9a78-20b16985e076
msgctxt "h339b5829g3082g4406g96cfg755706556b5f"
msgid ""
"Volothamp Geddarm, realm-renowned author, auteur, and tastemaker, at your "
"service."
msgstr "세계에서 유명한 저자이자 연출가, 그리고 유행 전도사인 볼로뎀프 게담이 그대에게 인사하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = a51e2ae9-cc5f-5576-4bfa-9c007bbd1445
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:a51e2ae9-cc5f-5576-4bfa-9c007bbd1445
msgctxt "h40323cf2g71cbg45b3g83c7g694871149228"
msgid ""
"It's no wonder you'd endeavour to help them. Still, it's quite an... quite "
"an <i>impressive </i>cost of goblin life."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = af05a863-0dac-6ad2-906f-d056e7e67544
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GOB_GoblinToast_Quest_Poisoner(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:af05a863-0dac-6ad2-906f-d056e7e67544
msgctxt "h7c946e03gc0a5g4ed4gaa19gaa4cd597471a"
msgid "I did. I killed them all."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c06da7cc-1c08-b862-479d-03c1b7e27dfe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:c06da7cc-1c08-b862-479d-03c1b7e27dfe
msgctxt "h7faba2ffg6edeg47cdg8072g8916fb23c193"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = c14091f4-7c91-74ae-8348-90566e439802
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:c14091f4-7c91-74ae-8348-90566e439802
msgctxt "he4ea4a76g30ffg435eg8166g1824b0d43c94"
msgid ""
"I'll be no trouble, my friend. Name a location and I'd be happy to meet you "
"there."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = c7b8533e-1f28-011d-b226-2a4dce8a4499
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:c7b8533e-1f28-011d-b226-2a4dce8a4499
msgctxt "hac16e3a3g2767g4f1agb052gcbc2c80c9cec"
msgid ""
"Just nosing out the facts. Something happened here, and it's my job - my "
"calling - to discover what."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = d125399c-e0eb-1bec-5c45-97f08b93b1ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:d125399c-e0eb-1bec-5c45-97f08b93b1ba
msgctxt "hd6efc05cgf768g4e48g97d2g5ded691f17e2"
msgid ""
"I wonder if we might continue this elsewhere. You've a brain I'd like to "
"pick."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d299c24f-cf9c-5f33-dddc-7a5c0981ce41
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GOB_GoblinToast_Quest_Poisoner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:d299c24f-cf9c-5f33-dddc-7a5c0981ce41
msgctxt "h6feb6062gb770g4c81g8e80g4b24f135d9ec"
msgid "Indeed - I poisoned the lot of them."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d32debe1-2658-f7eb-3a46-c89560eec4dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:d32debe1-2658-f7eb-3a46-c89560eec4dd
msgctxt "he52e36b8g09dfg4e9cg9045gdbdb5d1567ce"
msgid "Why are you still here?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = d3a86151-cf8b-9da0-d1d8-c9f9db6d1fa9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:d3a86151-cf8b-9da0-d1d8-c9f9db6d1fa9
msgctxt "ha3e5f9d8gfb0dg4553gbb64gc553d648eaac"
msgid ""
"You poor soul. These goblins were <i>spoiling</i> for a fight under the "
"banner of their so-called 'Absolute.'"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = d7809be5-c4d4-70eb-4074-89a96bdd05d1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:d7809be5-c4d4-70eb-4074-89a96bdd05d1
msgctxt "hb2ed88c4g4302g4519g9d6age243da76a1eb"
msgid ""
"You? Why? And how? But wait, wait - let me get a fresh quill. Now. You were "
"saying?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dc42445f-d673-7c90-234c-5dab796fd4ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:dc42445f-d673-7c90-234c-5dab796fd4ac
msgctxt "h4d309b8dgcfe3g4bdega7cdg3cc705083c64"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = e3e18584-d392-e367-7a8d-08e0c7112616
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_GoblinHuntPoison_Quest_BeerPoisoned = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_VoloBallad_HasMetWhileStudying(1) = True
#.     - GOB_VoloBallad_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:e3e18584-d392-e367-7a8d-08e0c7112616
msgctxt "h29fd7745g6940g416egbd3bg71ca06047d3b"
msgid "There! Last dismembered limb catalogued. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = e9780d62-131b-f185-85b7-8ddc548f1f93
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_HasMetWhileStudying(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:e9780d62-131b-f185-85b7-8ddc548f1f93
msgctxt "hed7be316ged6bg4534gb0aeg1876fd087295"
msgid "Yes?"
msgstr "부르셨나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ebaeb107-7383-db9c-1d35-e5e5449ef1cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:ebaeb107-7383-db9c-1d35-e5e5449ef1cb
msgctxt "h5a1fa3cbgbab5g4b75g96f0gbe537dddac32"
msgid "Never mind. What are you doing here anyway - looting corpses?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f5de0ea4-be5f-da5e-96e0-a9e00c1c02f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GOB_GoblinToast_Quest_Poisoner(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:f5de0ea4-be5f-da5e-96e0-a9e00c1c02f2
msgctxt "h4ee4a959g71b6g4de2g9e2bg447d39b14e60"
msgid "Indeed, the poisoning was my handiwork."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = f5e3d796-9365-6b75-bfd4-a64179be7eb0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:f5e3d796-9365-6b75-bfd4-a64179be7eb0
msgctxt "hf812bc84g42f9g47feg8d1cgfecc6859f4ca"
msgid "Tell me - did you see what happened here?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = f78a6c1b-2358-ff4d-fac5-0114f4ecb1a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GOB_VoloBallad_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_GoblinHuntPoison_Quest_BeerPoisoned = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_VoloBallad_HasMetWhileStudying(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:f78a6c1b-2358-ff4d-fac5-0114f4ecb1a7
msgctxt "h859665c0g077cg4815g9575g290a9b780c83"
msgid ""
"My friend! Are you responsible for the state of these unfortunate souls?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Volo
#. NodeID = fb1553be-df80-7db2-0562-e7b95a754b88
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GLO_Volo_Knows_CampSite(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_VoloBallad_State_SentToPartyCamp = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:fb1553be-df80-7db2-0562-e7b95a754b88
msgctxt "h36c29a06g21eag49bdgb652gf58c4fc1ede3"
msgid "Smashing! Ta for now, my friend - only for now!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ff8d5791-a4b6-c1a7-8b31-c8afeaba0fb9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_VoloBallad_Volo_Massacre:ff8d5791-a4b6-c1a7-8b31-c8afeaba0fb9
msgctxt "h9d8f1eabge667g40f8gbbeag4ccc67f47022"
msgid "Never mind that - what are you doing? Looting corpses?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WarchiefBrave
#. Speaker = Rozzak
#. NodeID = 10db535e-7547-7a17-d087-90f0a5479d1b
