#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hffedf812g0f92g459agb3d3g000ef1fe8543"
msgid ""
"But you're no use to him if you die because Zariel will get your soul. My "
"master would have you know he's working on a solution for you."
msgstr "하지만 당신이 죽으면 자리엘이 영혼을 가져갈 테니 아무 쓸모도 없죠. 제 주인님이 지금 해결책을 알아보는 중입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WarlockProposal_Warlock
#. Speaker = Korrilla
#. NodeID = 7b23f5fc-985b-7fc7-ac1b-b206dc205754
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
