msgctxt "hfb424b70gc7ccg44ebg9416g117c49a1fc09"
msgid "You'll meet him again soon, and have a chance to show your gratitude."
msgstr "곧 그를 다시 만나 감사를 전할 수 있을 거예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WarlockProposal_Warlock
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a891af8c-ea03-1671-ca36-8066d935ab3e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
