msgid ""
"But you're no use if you die because Zariel will get your soul. My master "
"would have you know he's working on a solution for you."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WarlockProposal_Warlock
