msgctxt "h537ccfdbge472g4c38gb7d2g1e84d05f129e"
msgid ""
"Ever tried cuttin' up another elf? All skin an' bones, you rangy gits. My "
"arm's gonna be sore tomorrow."
msgstr "엘프를 썰어본 적이 있나? 너희 멀대 새끼들은 가죽이랑 뼈밖에 없더군. 팔이 쑤실 지경이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_Beastmaster002
