msgctxt "h38b00f73gdde9g4bf5gad38ge60f382ddc32"
msgid ""
"Ever tried cuttin' up an elf? All skin an' bones, the rangy gits. My arm's "
"gonna be sore tomorrow."
msgstr "엘프를 썰어본 적이 있나? 멀대 새끼들, 가죽이랑 뼈밖에 없더군. 팔이 쑤실 지경이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_Beastmaster002
#. Speaker = Beastmaster Zurk
#. NodeID = c7a44a41-9acf-0319-0a4a-d86df51ce533
