msgid ""
"Boss's thinkin' of servin' it to the worgs. But first, Three, more stones. "
"Make it nice an' bloody."
msgstr "대장은 놈을 워그 먹이로 줄 생각이던데. 그치만 그 전에, 셋째야, 돌을 더 던져. 피를 흘리게 만들어야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_GroupDialogWithBear
