msgctxt "h76c15720g0837g4007gb8b1g8da4d97e4129"
msgid "What're ya - get lost if you can't stand a bit of rough-housin'."
msgstr "넌 뭐 하는 놈이야. 이 정도도 못 견디겠으면 당장 꺼져."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_GroupDialogWithBear
