msgctxt "h0d4054a1gd6a3g44b9gbe6fg440ffc511891"
msgid "Hope you can control the furry bastard."
msgstr "네가 저 털북숭이 자식을 통제할 수 있길 바라지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_GroupDialogWithBear
#. Speaker = Brawler Birka
#. NodeID = a79fa97e-33da-2b21-ddb6-d1538402c5b0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_WolfPens_GroupDialog_Knows_AskedTrueSoul(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_GroupDialogWithBear:a79fa97e-33da-2b21-ddb6-d1538402c5b0
msgctxt "h55993e05g2840g4a22gb961g937efb518acf"
msgid ""
"I - I mean no disrespect, just - these are the boss' orders. I can't let it "
"out for no one but a True Soul."
msgstr ""
"겨-결례를 범할 생각은 아니었습니다, 그저 - 이게 대장 명령이라서 말입죠. 참된 영혼께서 요청하는 게 아니면 놈을 풀어줄 수 없습니다요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_GroupDialogWithBear
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = adb1b734-0a76-c1a0-d2c6-3805ef99f271
