msgctxt "hf5209d08gbc9ag40b6ga567gee4512d00c0b"
msgid "Fine. Do what you want with him."
msgstr "좋아. 원하는 대로 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_GroupDialogWithBear
#. Speaker = Brawler Birka
#. NodeID = b8d61d9a-f8a2-573f-e574-815c26122447
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_GroupDialogWithBear:b8d61d9a-f8a2-573f-e574-815c26122447
msgctxt "h1cdbcce9g3121g4c5fgb204geacb3da22d69"
msgid ""
"It's stayin' right 'ere. The beast came in here with those robbers. Killed "
"Dink - and Mince, too."
msgstr "그건 여기 있을 거야. 그 짐승이 강도 놈들이랑 함께 왔었다고. 딩크를 죽여버렸지, 민스도 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_GroupDialogWithBear
