msgctxt "h1bba0b4bg15ccg4820ga953g282b41098e6c"
msgid "Oh, you're - uh, y-yes, of course."
msgstr "오, 당신은 - 어, 그-그렇군요, 물론이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_GroupDialogWithBear
