msgctxt "h90c2e70eg01e3g4220ga5degbd0bb0176985"
msgid "S-sorry, True Soul. I'll open the cage for ya."
msgstr "죄-죄송합니다, 참된 영혼이시여. 우리를 열어드리겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_GroupDialogWithBear
