msgctxt "h744bd77dg51a9g448fga252g9a255e9a6790"
msgid "Hurry, please. Any delay could cost innocents' lives."
msgstr "부디 서두르게. 한시라도 지체되면 무고한 자들의 목숨이 위태롭네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_Halsin_Following_Elf
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 5c6ce4f7-5f47-46f3-9f83-1dba168da6f8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_Halsin_Following_Elf:5c6ce4f7-5f47-46f3-9f83-1dba168da6f8
msgctxt "hdf26cce6g965bg46e6gb421g116c8fb06f38"
msgid ""
"The ringleaders of these butchers still draw breath. Nobody is safe until we "
"stop them."
msgstr "이 도살자 무리의 우두머리들이 아직 숨을 쉬고 있네. 우리가 그 자들을 막기 전기 전까지는 아무도 안전하지 못해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_Halsin_Following_Elf
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8b436618-ebb6-4e62-b994-670df2f67c2b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_Halsin_Following_Elf:8b436618-ebb6-4e62-b994-670df2f67c2b
msgctxt "hcad235d9g82e3g427dg96a5g3cd61e6cc2be"
msgid "Wait here."
msgstr "여기서 기다리시죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_Halsin_Following_Elf
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cbc835f0-c5e8-4338-8144-91324bc3261b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_Halsin_Following_Elf:cbc835f0-c5e8-4338-8144-91324bc3261b
msgctxt "he2c80b73g9d32g474cg8c36g3281c791997f"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 01659cd4-76ca-0890-1e40-074a5216ea51
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:01659cd4-76ca-0890-1e40-074a5216ea51
msgctxt "h73663dacg0da1g4ef8g988dgc70b03ef2425"
msgid ""
"As you wish. Better I impart the knowledge to you now, in case I fall trying "
"to defend the grove."
msgstr "그대가 원하는 대로. 숲을 지키다 쓰러질지도 모르니, 내가 아는 지식을 지금 그대에게 전달하는 것이 좋겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 018b7096-d733-c487-08f1-fe776d03cba0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:018b7096-d733-c487-08f1-fe776d03cba0
msgctxt "h6465e508gefddg4f46ga2e9gaa9ab08f0332"
msgid ""
"I cannot allow these butchers to threaten my grove. The natural order must "
"be protected."
msgstr "나는 이 도살자들이 내 숲을 위협하는 걸 허용할 수 없네. 자연의 질서는 보호되어야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 01b4c12a-d8b4-bd58-fbd6-3d75f1f5ee83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_State_LeadersAreDead = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:01b4c12a-d8b4-bd58-fbd6-3d75f1f5ee83
msgctxt "h47af595agf5e9g4be8g870ag0934e40c852f"
msgid "Follow me."
msgstr "날 따라와요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 020a3a2c-8fcc-4382-18fa-a045e6c1f3a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_DruidsAllDead = False
#.      - DEN_DruidAttack_State_PrepAfterDeathOfDruids = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Knows_DruidsAllDead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:020a3a2c-8fcc-4382-18fa-a045e6c1f3a5
msgctxt "h7b912ae7ge4ceg4504ga848g44992eb25e86"
msgid "The other druids are dead, by my hand."
msgstr "다른 드루이드들은 내 손에 죽었어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 021846e5-bfe9-df42-ac1b-9c4c8141119f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:021846e5-bfe9-df42-ac1b-9c4c8141119f
msgctxt "h9ad5243agea5eg4a2bg964dgcb2c6f5eecb7"
msgid ""
"A drow forced me to defend myself. Afterwards, I was able to study the "
"parasite that slithered out of the corpse, see what drives these 'True "
"Souls'."
msgstr ""
"어떤 드로우와 싸워야만 했지. 그 시체에서 기어나온 기생충을 연구할 수 있었고, 무엇이 이 '참된 영혼'을 움직이는지 알 수 있었네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 038db4e4-73cc-0e40-4a75-d5338025f9e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_State_LeadersAreDead = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:038db4e4-73cc-0e40-4a75-d5338025f9e9
msgctxt "hf04c4da0g4855g4f79gbafdg6f467a57dc34"
msgid ""
"Best if I try settle this discreetly - wait here, and you'll have your "
"deaths."
msgstr "이 일은 조용히 해결하는 편이 좋겠네요, 여기서 기다리세요. 당신이 원하는 죽음을 이루어 줄 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 048b3aad-1423-7db4-5ebd-f55755c70e7b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:048b3aad-1423-7db4-5ebd-f55755c70e7b
msgctxt "hcc4f8bbbg3702g4de1ga5edgcdad9f81f015"
msgid "Look around you - there's no order anymore. Only chaos."
msgstr "주변을 둘러봐요, 이곳에 질서 따위는 남지 않았어요. 혼돈 뿐이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 049fabe8-74ce-7f10-0a72-9eb2b78d2eb7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:049fabe8-74ce-7f10-0a72-9eb2b78d2eb7
msgctxt "h66d593c1g57fdg4f76gbc9bg0259a4069894"
msgid ""
"I could come and help you... but be warned - I won't be able to suppress my "
"animal side. Subtlety will not be an option."
msgstr "내가 가서 도와줄 수는 있지만... 내 동물적인 면을 억누를 수 없으니 주의하게나. 은밀히 움직이는 건 불가능할 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 04c2dd83-d826-25ad-d859-afa9bd6aeeea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:04c2dd83-d826-25ad-d859-afa9bd6aeeea
msgctxt "h41cfa03eg1509g4ddag8e58gaab355cbb98c"
msgid ""
"Aradin and his lot were looking for a way down there - they were promised "
"riches if they retrieved a relic called the Nightsong. But I think there's "
"more."
msgstr ""
"아라딘 일행도 그 지하로 가는 길을 찾고 있었네. 이들은 '밤의 노래'라는 유물을 되찾아주고 부를 얻기로 했던 모양이지만 내 생각에는 "
"그보다 더 많은 것이 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 04c780e9-51d0-504d-e415-4d6aa734a444
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_TempleAccess_Event_PuzzleSolved = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:04c780e9-51d0-504d-e415-4d6aa734a444
msgctxt "hb83f67b6g3ad9g490ag9cf3g16da98800b85"
msgid "I found the hidden entrance in the temple of Selûne - the way is clear."
msgstr "셀루네 신전의 숨겨진 입구를 발견했습니다. 길은 분명합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 07771d57-48ea-155d-c9a8-627fe0f11abf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_State_LeadersAreDead = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:07771d57-48ea-155d-c9a8-627fe0f11abf
msgctxt "hc0fa3c51g8352g4538g9348gda7e863f8af4"
msgid "Come with me. I could use your help."
msgstr "함께 갑시다. 당신의 도움이 필요합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 07c9fbe8-dd45-7c5c-9860-7e3828c9d20a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_DrowCommander_Event_RaidersSortie = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:07c9fbe8-dd45-7c5c-9860-7e3828c9d20a
msgctxt "h2c7f6463gf7abg4ee6gb942g17492e9e8741"
msgid ""
"I'll remain here and do what I can to disrupt these cultists' plans. Perhaps "
"I can stop their attack before it's even launched. Farewell."
msgstr ""
"난 이곳에 머무르며 이 광신도들의 계획을 방해할 방법을 찾아 보겠네. 어쩌면 습격이 시작되기도 전에 막을 수 있을지도 모르지. 안녕히."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 08793f9d-3269-b787-653c-58e5012ab44e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:08793f9d-3269-b787-653c-58e5012ab44e
msgctxt "heea56e98g106eg4079g86acge895465dd7ae"
msgid "But the grove must come first, I'm afraid."
msgstr "하지만 숲의 문제를 먼저 해결해야 할 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 08c706ea-0558-b706-aada-5933951ac889
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:08c706ea-0558-b706-aada-5933951ac889
msgctxt "h926a63b3gee85g48fcgb57bg53493309051f"
msgid "You did...? Nature's found a most furious defender in you."
msgstr "정말인가...? 자연이 강대한 수호자를 찾아냈군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 0955658a-dcf3-b242-de90-5d6cf1b3141f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:0955658a-dcf3-b242-de90-5d6cf1b3141f
msgctxt "hcaf5e88cgfae1g4e8eg8426g8765fad01514"
msgid "Then the grove is doomed, and perhaps you as well."
msgstr "그렇다면 숲은 끝장이겠군, 그대도 마찬가지고 말이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 0a2d9485-b584-ef51-b009-74eca276a0da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:0a2d9485-b584-ef51-b009-74eca276a0da
msgctxt "h3908a96cg6eb8g4ca5gab15g8bc90e57c9a2"
msgid ""
"You aided a bear without knowing if it would savage you? A true friend of "
"nature - or perhaps a lunatic."
msgstr "곰이 그대를 찢어발길지도 모르는데 도와준 건가? 진정한 자연의 친구로군. 아니면 미치광이이거나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 0aea39e8-deea-229f-e286-d99b790fb885
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:0aea39e8-deea-229f-e286-d99b790fb885
msgctxt "hb3fa91e0gb5f4g447cgb670g22c9b2859676"
msgid ""
"By all means - pursue any leads you may have. But I sense all roads will "
"lead to Moonrise."
msgstr "필요하다면 모든 단서를 추적해 보게. 하지만 결국 모든 길은 문라이즈로 이어질 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 0bd24c15-ca8d-f322-f7f5-70418b010e6e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:0bd24c15-ca8d-f322-f7f5-70418b010e6e
msgctxt "h9dd360abgeb66g4b09ga719gbdad1dfad65a"
msgid ""
"From this stronghold, Ketheric's forces could access both the temple of "
"Selûne and Moonrise Towers - but he was defeated before he could launch an "
"attack."
msgstr ""
"그 요새에서 케서릭의 군대는 셀루네의 신전과 문라이즈 타워, 두 곳에 모두 접근할 수 있었지. 하지만 놈은 미처 공세를 시작하기도 전에 "
"패퇴하고 말았네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0bf45064-848d-464a-1821-d93e3ecd783a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:0bf45064-848d-464a-1821-d93e3ecd783a
msgctxt "hd043bd1cgdf00g4590ga5f0g18af7e571d26"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 0c0f3856-1d44-a10e-cb8f-4c42b6915052
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:0c0f3856-1d44-a10e-cb8f-4c42b6915052
msgctxt "h77774eafg368bg448dg92f0gf2dc6aebfd06"
msgid "I'll need that luck, along with all the Oak Father's blessings."
msgstr "그 행운이 필요할 걸세. 참나무 아버지의 축복도 함께 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0c153359-d93e-92e8-6ace-7e5e0470072c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LOLTHDROWELF(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:0c153359-d93e-92e8-6ace-7e5e0470072c
msgctxt "hffc3b2efga64cg4654g8792g430057510cca"
msgid "Not all drow are as you say."
msgstr "모든 드로우가 그런 건 아닙니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0c1ee42a-f5a1-5908-f39f-1f4594432dcd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:0c1ee42a-f5a1-5908-f39f-1f4594432dcd
msgctxt "heb2c360bgaa40g41a1ga1f3g12951414e44f"
msgid ""
"Altered parasites? A cure at Moonrise Towers, <i>maybe</i>? Sounds like "
"guesswork at best."
msgstr "변질된 기생충? 문라이즈 타워에 <i>있을지도 모르는</i> 치료법? 기껏해야 지레짐작인 것 같군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 0c522c82-51a3-baaa-30e2-c696a7a1769f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:0c522c82-51a3-baaa-30e2-c696a7a1769f
msgctxt "heb29bc3fg77f7g429aga9dfga657759a964d"
msgid ""
"The grove is lost to me. To everyone. It's useless for me to stay here... "
"there's nothing left to fight for."
msgstr "나는 숲을 잃었어. 모두가 마찬가지지. 이제 여기 있어도 소용이 없군... 지킬 것이 없으니 말일세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0ee7b3ac-80ff-a30b-25f6-25a25f5c3a47
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:0ee7b3ac-80ff-a30b-25f6-25a25f5c3a47
msgctxt "hda69e9b8g322bg49f8ga742ge16365b7d84a"
msgid "We're done here. I'll be on my way."
msgstr "우리 볼일은 여기서 끝입니다. 난 갈 길을 가야겠군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 0eebba49-26a0-1ea6-2fba-49288f870d50
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:0eebba49-26a0-1ea6-2fba-49288f870d50
msgctxt "hb9ba5b11g0180g4c5egadd3gc96a7e0c304b"
msgid ""
"If I join you, we'll likely have to slaughter this entire place. You may "
"want to use discretion when approaching the goblin leaders."
msgstr "내가 그대에게 합류하면, 우린 이곳을 전부 쓸어버려야 할 걸세. 고블린 우두머리들에게 접근할 때는 신중을 기하는 것이 좋겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 0f048165-7ed8-d402-5258-f9a2f875dde4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:0f048165-7ed8-d402-5258-f9a2f875dde4
msgctxt "h44a4f576g8ce4g437fg9dffgc8795abfa751"
msgid ""
"Be warned - my presence could make things more difficult... I can only "
"restrain my bear form so much. I won't be able to help but attack goblins."
msgstr ""
"명심할 것은, 내 존재가 일을 더 어렵게 만들 수 있다는 걸세... 나는 곰 형상을 억제할 수만 있네. 고블린들을 공격하는 것 말고는 "
"도울 수 있는 게 없을 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 10178140-bbbf-f13e-1a3e-17c9adf644df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - b1c7a343-a7e6-1dc5-d774-dcaec393fdf1_NowhereIsSafe = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:10178140-bbbf-f13e-1a3e-17c9adf644df
msgctxt "h070b2585g8f62g4148g83feg9cfe6fb9fcd8"
msgid "You should get out of here. It's not safe."
msgstr "여기서 빠져나가십시오. 이곳은 안전하지 않습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 10c186cb-2486-8068-306d-6a400fb4a505
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - b1c7a343-a7e6-1dc5-d774-dcaec393fdf1_CantYouHelp = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:10c186cb-2486-8068-306d-6a400fb4a505
msgctxt "hbd049424g364ag4931gbf30g09abccb5db62"
msgid "This magic you mentioned - it isn't normal for these parasites?"
msgstr "당신이 언급한 마법 말이에요, 그 기생충에게 흔히 나타나는 것이 아닌가요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 126e4424-8a4b-2b21-be99-179359cfa783
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:126e4424-8a4b-2b21-be99-179359cfa783
msgctxt "hd8ac8853gf719g4bd8gb5b6gae8595168cd3"
msgid "I'm sorry I can't do more. Thank you, and good luck with the grove."
msgstr "더 이상 제가 할 수 있는 게 없어서 유감입니다. 감사합니다. 그리고 숲에 행운이 함께하길."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 166dadb8-16b0-44fb-4891-55f745aebe47
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:166dadb8-16b0-44fb-4891-55f745aebe47
msgctxt "h3be5af1dgf4c8g4dd9g8ea4g87360f5e6202"
msgid ""
"I helped overthrow Ketheric Thorm and his Dark Justiciars years ago. But I "
"failed to prevent him from unleashing darkness across the region before he "
"was defeated."
msgstr ""
"여러 해 전에, 난 케서릭 쏨과 그의 다크 저스티시어들을 타도하는 데 기여했지. 하지만 놈이 패배하기 전에 이 지역에 어둠을 풀어놓는 "
"것을 막진 못했네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 17ada371-0c51-add7-7a48-ffa39b46c7c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_WolfPens_Event_HalsinStoppedPlayer = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_WolfPens_Event_HalsinStoppedPlayer = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:17ada371-0c51-add7-7a48-ffa39b46c7c8
msgctxt "h8f6262dbgea39g471cga0b8gaf6ac7bdddc3"
msgid "Where are you going? We have work to do - enemies to kill."
msgstr "어딜 가는 건가? 아직 할 일이 남았네, 죽일 적이 남았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 180c27de-675d-2964-66de-c92f18953689
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:180c27de-675d-2964-66de-c92f18953689
msgctxt "h76b45fcbg396ag4be4ga8bbgd4de923afbf3"
msgid ""
"I'm certain. The Underdark is dangerous, yes, but the alternative is "
"suicide. Be patient and be thorough - the path will reveal itself in time."
msgstr ""
"확신한다네. 언더다크도 위험하긴 하지만, 다른 길로 가는 건 자살행위지. 인내심을 갖고 철저히 준비하면, 이윽고 길이 드러날 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 18a7b063-a7fb-84fc-1b12-611964a4b281
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:18a7b063-a7fb-84fc-1b12-611964a4b281
msgctxt "h47647495ge468g45d5g8211gf55ab87bf2c6"
msgid ""
"Innocents go in, True Souls come out. Given that all of these True Souls are "
"infected, it has to be the source of this magic."
msgstr ""
"무고한 자가 들어가서, 참된 영혼이 되어 나오지. 이 참된 영혼 모두가 감염자인 것을 감안하면, 이것이 바로 이 마법의 근원일 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 19475ab2-2575-1b49-6c22-f38ab98771fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:19475ab2-2575-1b49-6c22-f38ab98771fb
msgctxt "hfe3193e0g931ag402agb301ge83821999f2f"
msgid "Already...? If only I'd gone with you instead of Aradin."
msgstr "벌써...? 아라딘 대신 그대와 같이 갈걸 그랬군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 19b0e00c-9df9-d722-fa11-42a3ecf92600
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:19b0e00c-9df9-d722-fa11-42a3ecf92600
msgctxt "h2d841720gea58g4e38gbea6gc73d558ec573"
msgid ""
"Unfair of me, perhaps, but I've had few encounters with drow to make me "
"think otherwise."
msgstr "아마 내가 불공평하게 대했는지도 모르지, 하지만 지금까지 드로우와 몇 번의 만남이 그렇게 생각하게 만들었네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1a51f4e4-5195-f37c-9188-a88c518069ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_UNDERDARK(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Event_PreferOverlandRoute = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:1a51f4e4-5195-f37c-9188-a88c518069ad
msgctxt "hb73072c2g7dfcg4977gafb2gea8f09efbb33"
msgid "I know the Underdark - it's lethal. I'll travel overland."
msgstr "언더다크가 어떤 곳인지 알고 있습니다. 위험한 지역이죠. 지상으로 여행해야겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 1a5335a5-4e7c-6458-f06f-0244fa9d9a3a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:1a5335a5-4e7c-6458-f06f-0244fa9d9a3a
msgctxt "h6e6a2eb4gbf50g403cg8e7bg75834aee0e36"
msgid ""
"Killing's never my first choice, but those three were too dangerous to leave "
"alive."
msgstr "살인은 내가 선호하는 방식이 아니지만, 그 셋은 살려두기엔 너무 위험한 자들이었네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 1ab131d5-fea0-268c-87fa-05bbb3307bae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:1ab131d5-fea0-268c-87fa-05bbb3307bae
msgctxt "hadd7190bg5ef5g4e1fga67egbc61236cbc7e"
msgid "I <i>can't </i>stop you, in fact. Which brings me to my next problem..."
msgstr "실은, 나는 그대를 말릴 <i>수 없네</i>. 다음 문제로 넘어가서..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 1c8e49d5-aebd-443e-deea-9452260ad103
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:1c8e49d5-aebd-443e-deea-9452260ad103
msgctxt "h5c3e4b2eg04f1g49edgbffdg282379d208ab"
msgid ""
"Precisely. Then perhaps I could have done something about both the shadow "
"curse and ceremorphosis aberrations."
msgstr "정확하네. 그랬으면 내가 그림자 저주와 괴이한 뇌변이 양쪽 모두에 손을 쓸 수도 있었을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 1de4e681-e424-e3ca-1e52-4815b958549a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:1de4e681-e424-e3ca-1e52-4815b958549a
msgctxt "h98049409g2f6cg46e8gbfe9gd3bc46c778bf"
msgid ""
"There is no safety. Not while this rot festers. Once it is cut out - once "
"the grove is secure - then I shall leave."
msgstr "안전한 곳은 없네. 이 부패한 것들이 곪아있는 동안은 말일세. 이 부패를 잘라내고, 숲이 안전해지면, 그때 떠날 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 1df1bc91-2510-b72e-ede4-319ac2ea703d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:1df1bc91-2510-b72e-ede4-319ac2ea703d
msgctxt "hd4f7d7eag9bc4g4051g950dgdf8be4ebc6b1"
msgid "Hurry, then. I will meet you there."
msgstr "그럼 서두르게나. 거기서 만나지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1e8fe3e5-9a34-d63b-2434-cf97122e1b04
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:1e8fe3e5-9a34-d63b-2434-cf97122e1b04
msgctxt "h10475a9ag9288g46a9gaa60gda20f2cfff05"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 21701170-415e-5057-7d98-00a188ffb38d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:21701170-415e-5057-7d98-00a188ffb38d
msgctxt "h87eb3135g8233g4b01g9545g404d5193b7c2"
msgid ""
"This is different. There's more fingers on a hand than there are survivors "
"of that place."
msgstr "이 문제는 다르지. 그곳의 생존자들은 손에 꼽힐 정도라네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 21fa6f86-61d0-e5e1-f03e-033513450ee0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:21fa6f86-61d0-e5e1-f03e-033513450ee0
msgctxt "h785ee7a4g16c3g44cdg9a57gf430791d9aaa"
msgid "Just the information, please."
msgstr "그냥 정보만 부탁해요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2293e0c7-7a96-21be-dcf7-a55ebb609467
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:2293e0c7-7a96-21be-dcf7-a55ebb609467
msgctxt "h1b242b42g1a97g48f1gb590g1b937c77b5bf"
msgid "You owe more than thanks, I think."
msgstr "감사 인사보단 많은 걸 빚지신 것 같은데요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 233075d5-e50f-49dc-6216-935db8f7b907
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:233075d5-e50f-49dc-6216-935db8f7b907
msgctxt "h5d298652ga0ceg46a7g82acgc12d99399b56"
msgid "Glad I could be of help."
msgstr "도움이 될 수 있어 기쁘군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 238e43e2-f08d-0b72-9b52-6440fb43a95f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Event_PreferOverlandRoute = True
#.   Local:
#.      - b1c7a343-a7e6-1dc5-d774-dcaec393fdf1_HiddenEntranceInSeluneTemple = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - b1c7a343-a7e6-1dc5-d774-dcaec393fdf1_HiddenEntranceInSeluneTemple = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:238e43e2-f08d-0b72-9b52-6440fb43a95f
msgctxt "hccad9a44g2688g4d5egbf52gbd9c6cd9f6c9"
msgid ""
"Say I decide to try this Underdark route after all - how do I get started?"
msgstr "내가 결국 언더다크로 가겠다고 결정한다면, 어디서 시작하죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 243339be-8c9c-2d61-1bf6-d54d697303b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:243339be-8c9c-2d61-1bf6-d54d697303b2
msgctxt "h8eecf5d2g4409g41ffg88acgcbaa3ef450d0"
msgid "Well, consider me introduced. And consider me grateful."
msgstr "그럼 내 소개를 한 걸로 알게나. 그리고 내가 감사히 생각하고 있다는 것도."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 2493ba40-201c-0b79-c03c-19ea8f0c0f49
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:2493ba40-201c-0b79-c03c-19ea8f0c0f49
msgctxt "h6336cf9dg9c59g4793g92f6g7fc2ab7fcf25"
msgid ""
"Thank you. I know it's a great deal to ask, but the grove is everything to "
"me."
msgstr "고맙네. 무리한 부탁이라는 것은 알지만, 숲은 내 모든 것일세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 26ffb040-1af7-b182-f7c8-9e91687b8fb2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:26ffb040-1af7-b182-f7c8-9e91687b8fb2
msgctxt "he0a6677cgd21fg4359gaa3dg11140d873d13"
msgid ""
"And you'll receive it soon enough. Return to the grove; I'll make my own way "
"there."
msgstr "곧 받을 수 있을 거야. 숲으로 돌아가게나. 난 알아서 길을 찾아갈 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 28361bc3-2cd6-edbd-14e2-6b499526052a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - b1c7a343-a7e6-1dc5-d774-dcaec393fdf1_CantYouHelp = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:28361bc3-2cd6-edbd-14e2-6b499526052a
msgctxt "h560bf37fgb99cg4886g804fg45eef01b7664"
msgid "So all of this was for nothing."
msgstr "결국 아무 의미도 없었군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 2a8dcd4e-e491-ad78-d4b7-ce4ac3136e45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:2a8dcd4e-e491-ad78-d4b7-ce4ac3136e45
msgctxt "h238f0766ga048g4f9dg8313g8b279acb8db2"
msgid "Perhaps you can enlighten me."
msgstr "그대가 나를 깨우쳐줄 수 있겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 2aec624e-ecde-50f9-c10e-9ea8de775870
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:2aec624e-ecde-50f9-c10e-9ea8de775870
msgctxt "h910e2e60g0631g4512g9341g2d2da9a48466"
msgid ""
"Hmmm... that looks very alien. As alien as the mind flayers. They do not "
"belong on this world."
msgstr "흠... 그건 매우 낯설게 생겼군. 마인드 플레이어만큼이나. 그것들은 이 세계의 것이 아닐세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 2b1ca3f5-a29e-1b0d-e110-4fb3cb8cf38a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:2b1ca3f5-a29e-1b0d-e110-4fb3cb8cf38a
msgctxt "hf2ace545g28dag4cedg99fcgecaa1133525c"
msgid ""
"You <i>rabid dog</i>. Murderer! Those were the servants of Silvanus - "
"nature's guardians!"
msgstr "이런 <i>미친 개</i> 같으니. 살인자 자식! 그 사람들은 실바누스의 시종이었어, 자연의 수호자란 말이다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 2b6a7d4a-8ac7-cb17-864c-e8daf89c86d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:2b6a7d4a-8ac7-cb17-864c-e8daf89c86d0
msgctxt "hea0a9cdag6db3g41eega401g7514f4b506bc"
msgid ""
"Tread carefully. You're on the right track, I'm sure - but there'll still be "
"danger and difficulty before you reach Moonrise."
msgstr ""
"조심해서 나아가게나. 확실히 올바른 방향으로 향하고 있긴 하지만, 문라이즈에 도착할 때까지 어떤 위험과 어려움이 도사리고 있을지 모르니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2cc9b32d-5db6-2ceb-ce9e-5532290f8a91
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Underdark_EverEnteredBefore = False
#.      - GOB_TempleAccess_Event_PuzzleSolved = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - b1c7a343-a7e6-1dc5-d774-dcaec393fdf1_HiddenEntranceInSeluneTemple = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:2cc9b32d-5db6-2ceb-ce9e-5532290f8a91
msgctxt "h57087b12ge8a1g4635gb702g6d281c45e009"
msgid "So how do I find this underground route?"
msgstr "그래서 그 지하 경로를 어떻게 찾죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2f390470-f7e1-e133-2496-12306e3cea97
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:2f390470-f7e1-e133-2496-12306e3cea97
msgctxt "h5e90f107g9c7eg4a0bg95e4g60970a16c28b"
msgid "This will have to wait for now."
msgstr "이 얘기는 잠시 접어둬야겠군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 3076a950-b6e1-292b-f68e-910ad5549064
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_DrowCommander_Event_RaidersSortie = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:3076a950-b6e1-292b-f68e-910ad5549064
msgctxt "he95a7d98gb0d5g4b7fg96d8gfcca72ac9678"
msgid ""
"It's too late to merely kill this horde's leadership - their forces are "
"already marching. If you want me to help, you need to help me first."
msgstr ""
"지금은 무리의 지도자를 죽이는 것만으로는 부족해. 놈들의 병력이 이미 진군하고 있네. 내 도움이 필요하다면, 날 먼저 도와주게나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3117e93b-d3ef-ef5a-703d-41a19b38f4f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:3117e93b-d3ef-ef5a-703d-41a19b38f4f5
msgctxt "h17f288f3g2b95g48c0g85f1g4f0b4b73733a"
msgid "Follow me, then. Your bear form may prove useful."
msgstr "그럼, 날 따라와요. 당신의 곰 형상은 쓸모가 있을지도 모르겠군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 312a5b79-b725-41f4-703d-38d9a3e2233b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Quest_AskedKilledLeaders = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:312a5b79-b725-41f4-703d-38d9a3e2233b
msgctxt "hfc6eab5cgfaf4g4ba4g98a1g3c26699757c9"
msgid ""
"Rare is the beast that survives decapitation. Help me eliminate the drow "
"Minthara, the hobgoblin Dror Ragzlin, and that perversion of a priestess, "
"Gut."
msgstr ""
"머리가 잘려도 살아있는 짐승은 드문 법이지. 드로우 민타라, 홉고블린 드롤 라그즐린, 그리고 그 왜곡된 여사제 거트를 처치하는 것을 "
"도와주게나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 314193a9-dfa3-63f5-42f6-9211696d4721
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_WolfPens_Event_HalsinLeftParty = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:314193a9-dfa3-63f5-42f6-9211696d4721
msgctxt "h8ec4005bgdd8cg46f8g99abg6bfbca364f4f"
msgid "Nature's blessings. Are you ready to do what is necessary?"
msgstr "자연의 축복이 함께 하길. 필요한 일을 할 준비가 되었나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 35d1516a-811f-1e81-1eac-87c12feac44f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ElevatorToScl_Used = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:35d1516a-811f-1e81-1eac-87c12feac44f
msgctxt "h3a8dc114gad44g4c6eg9ef7g2e3de98ee177"
msgid "I found an elevator - but it leads right into the shadow curse."
msgstr "승강기를 찾았습니다. 하지만 바로 그림자 저주로 향하는 것 같더군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 37ba8c95-59f9-2568-d305-4afb2cb3c542
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:37ba8c95-59f9-2568-d305-4afb2cb3c542
msgctxt "h082a1452gcb24g42faga99cg1972a1733e09"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 3a5d44c7-a631-2a03-e91a-69f33ef9a41a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:3a5d44c7-a631-2a03-e91a-69f33ef9a41a
msgctxt "h86ac07bfgd923g4ca2g837ag2eb030640973"
msgid ""
"...Hrrm. That look in your eyes - I've seen it before. Are you feeling all "
"right?"
msgstr "...흐음. 그대의 그 눈빛, 전에도 본 적 있지. 어디 아픈가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3abde367-8b8f-2dcf-c459-0f94e2012f12
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_PartyProgress_EnteredGrove = True
#. TagRule: DRUID
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:3abde367-8b8f-2dcf-c459-0f94e2012f12
msgctxt "h365e523bg069ag4c0fg9a89g31829e5c1bdc"
msgid ""
"I've been to the Emerald Grove. It's in grave danger, it sorrows me to say."
msgstr "에메랄드 숲에 다녀왔습니다. 말하기 슬플 정도로 심각한 위험에 처해 있더군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3abde367-8b8f-2dcf-c459-0f94e2012f12
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_PartyProgress_EnteredGrove = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:3abde367-8b8f-2dcf-c459-0f94e2012f12
msgctxt "hb322ec8fg3092g4e1fg8ee8ga4e58ee2988a"
msgid "I've been to the Emerald Grove. It's in danger."
msgstr "에메랄드 숲에 다녀왔습니다. 위험에 처해 있더군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 3ac8b573-bb04-675e-f00d-756e2a743d81
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Daisy_State_TriggerDaisyMissionStatement = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:3ac8b573-bb04-675e-f00d-756e2a743d81
msgctxt "h9f238deeg5166g47fcgb4d7g92f8583cb1ac"
msgid ""
"I didn't find what I came here for - a way to remove the tadpoles - but I "
"found the next best thing. I found out where they come from."
msgstr "애초에 여기 온 이유였던, 올챙이를 제거하는 방법은 알아내지 못했지. 그래도 수확은 있었어. 어디서 온 건지 알아냈다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3bbadbdc-224f-bdae-74fa-bd5dbb56fc81
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:3bbadbdc-224f-bdae-74fa-bd5dbb56fc81
msgctxt "h63153877gd407g4db7ga471g241639ecfcda"
msgid "You seem to know a lot about this. Will you come with me to Moonrise?"
msgstr "당신은 이에 대해 많은 것을 알고 있는 것 같군요. 문라이즈로 같이 가주시겠습니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 3cc12a5b-df0c-b286-a8bc-90046a4fcf6d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:3cc12a5b-df0c-b286-a8bc-90046a4fcf6d
msgctxt "he414cc1cgd194g4a30ga8ccg77999d260839"
msgid ""
"I'm as certain as I can be. If you have a better alternative, I won't stop "
"you."
msgstr "나는 최대한 확신하지. 그대에게 더 나은 대안이 있다면, 말리지 않겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3e5f61fb-d74a-8655-693e-d2c37b31c456
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:3e5f61fb-d74a-8655-693e-d2c37b31c456
msgctxt "h04f266e1gccbcg4431gbfc5g9136ed94004c"
msgid ""
"Very well, but no witnesses can survive. We will kill this whole camp "
"together."
msgstr "좋습니다. 하지만 목격자를 남겨둘 수는 없죠. 이 야영지 전체를 쓸어버립시다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3f014077-1a18-fa02-1253-ccde14ab9c65
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_UNDERDARK(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Event_PreferUnderdarkRoute = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:3f014077-1a18-fa02-1253-ccde14ab9c65
msgctxt "h06ea679fg0289g49f8g9556g6f09998e3ebf"
msgid ""
"I never thought I'd say this, but it sounds like the Underdark is the safer "
"route."
msgstr "내가 이런 말을 할 거라고는 생각도 못해봤지만, 언더다크가 더 안전한 길인 것 같군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3f038219-7307-57d1-c98d-009fc499a22f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:3f038219-7307-57d1-c98d-009fc499a22f
msgctxt "h49f43b55g299bg40f9g9c2age9829249a69d"
msgid "The bear is a noble beast. I will not fear it, or abandon it."
msgstr "곰은 숭고한 야수죠. 전 곰을 두려워하거나, 두고 가지 않습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3fec6f12-cfe0-ace9-692b-fe4b281f23a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_IsMissing = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - b1c7a343-a7e6-1dc5-d774-dcaec393fdf1_AskedName = True
#. TagRule: DRUID
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:3fec6f12-cfe0-ace9-692b-fe4b281f23a6
msgctxt "h815e576bg46d4g4f7fgae66g1814cc4a6846"
msgid ""
"Nature's bounty to you, brother. But I must admit I have not heard of you."
msgstr "자연의 숭고함을 지녔군, 형제여. 하지만 그대의 이름은 처음 듣는 것 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3fec6f12-cfe0-ace9-692b-fe4b281f23a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_IsMissing = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - b1c7a343-a7e6-1dc5-d774-dcaec393fdf1_AskedName = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:3fec6f12-cfe0-ace9-692b-fe4b281f23a6
msgctxt "h5d662deeg6cf4g4096g9409g73897467ce40"
msgid "Haven't heard of you."
msgstr "당신 이름은 처음 듣는군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 40c2a15b-88de-2668-1786-5a6a77538ba9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:40c2a15b-88de-2668-1786-5a6a77538ba9
msgctxt "h2ab53a35g1478g486bg8bffg57fd747b681e"
msgid "They left me no choice. I had to defend myself."
msgstr "다른 선택의 여지가 없었어요. 스스로를 방어해야 했죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 419c00c1-a68a-75b7-2ede-6856e1994a03
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:419c00c1-a68a-75b7-2ede-6856e1994a03
msgctxt "he3281abag2c6bg4ce0gbcf6g764bb86f49c0"
msgid "Come with me."
msgstr "함께 갑시다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 453721f3-d7eb-c668-173c-60acd30583c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:453721f3-d7eb-c668-173c-60acd30583c6
msgctxt "hfe9fa581g0d9ag411egb60fg208e673d81df"
msgid ""
"Someone is using very powerful magic to modify these tadpoles. They are "
"using them to exert control over the infected."
msgstr ""
"누군가가 이 올챙이를 개조하기 위해 매우 강한 마법을 사용하고 있네. 그들은 올챙이를 이용하여 감염자들에게 영향력을 행사하고 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 45ad1012-1dbc-236e-f1ea-5cda2e1e4d37
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:45ad1012-1dbc-236e-f1ea-5cda2e1e4d37
msgctxt "h983e5cceg674eg4c81g804eg4fb9a8f44c8f"
msgid ""
"I'll pray to Silvanus that you have a change of heart. But time is short."
msgstr "그대의 생각이 바뀌었다니, 실바누스께 감사를. 하지만 시간이 얼마 없네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 463487df-64e4-c788-a137-f51b2e6bd7e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Absolute_Knows_MoonriseTowers = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:463487df-64e4-c788-a137-f51b2e6bd7e6
msgctxt "he0e59087g9fd6g44a5gb9ddg0ab39d46f015"
msgid ""
"I overheard that the cultists are sending all of their captives to Moonrise "
"Towers."
msgstr "내가 엿들은 바로는, 이 광신도들이 모든 포로를 문라이즈 타워로 보내고 있다고 하는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 479b235c-69b0-e7a3-6446-b485d4b6ee72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:479b235c-69b0-e7a3-6446-b485d4b6ee72
msgctxt "h665ad612g71a1g483dgbf5bg937957507929"
msgid "Perhaps... but I wouldn't want to place all my faith in blind luck."
msgstr "그럴지도... 하지만 맹목적인 운에 모든 믿음을 걸고 싶지는 않다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 47db93fa-bd6c-a1ff-4b97-0cda4708bc80
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_WolfPens_State_HalsinIsFollowing(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:47db93fa-bd6c-a1ff-4b97-0cda4708bc80
msgctxt "hae85a698gd2dcg4624gb44agbf7dec94642c"
msgid "The grove is counting on us."
msgstr "숲은 우리에게 의지하고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 4a302286-6156-da7c-cd78-d9523436d5e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Halsin_Knows_AboutSharranTunnel = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_PathToMoonrise.HalsinToldPath(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:4a302286-6156-da7c-cd78-d9523436d5e0
msgctxt "h6fe5709fg51e2g4df8ga461g65fbdc37b516"
msgid ""
"You could also go <i>under</i>. There is a tunnel somewhere in this very "
"temple of Selûne. It leads to Moonrise Towers through the Underdark."
msgstr ""
"<i>지하</i>로 갈 수도 있지. 이 셀루네의 신전 어딘가에 터널이 있는데, 이를 통해 언더다크를 거쳐 문라이즈 타워로 갈 수 있네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4ae5c482-0e25-0d01-2d86-bdee8d2b65f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:4ae5c482-0e25-0d01-2d86-bdee8d2b65f0
msgctxt "h4be5e66cg412cg44a0g9136g6bca79827bd2"
msgid "What would you do?"
msgstr "당신이라면 어떻게 하겠습니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4b803055-edca-2451-5e59-f919892caef7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_StudiedTadpole = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Knows_TadpoleResearch = True
#.   Local:
#.     - b1c7a343-a7e6-1dc5-d774-dcaec393fdf1_TadpoleStudies = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:4b803055-edca-2451-5e59-f919892caef7
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h619d30e8g38f7g4648gba15g4bbfa6a8d41a"
msgid "How did you come to study mind flayer parasites?"
msgstr "어떻게 이 모든 걸 알고 있는 겁니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 4df9d53d-5a22-bb7f-f260-436394bc00a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:4df9d53d-5a22-bb7f-f260-436394bc00a3
msgctxt "hd3ba09c3g107ag4cdag8c85g5b2513652426"
msgid ""
"No, that's not right - praise you, my friend. The grove owes you a debt "
"beyond measure."
msgstr "아니, 이게 아니지. 그대야말로 찬양받아야 마땅하네, 내 벗이여. 숲은 그대에게 이루 말할 수 없는 빚을 졌네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 4f0eb6ae-b0da-7068-e4f1-24011a6bfaff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Knows_AboutGrymforge = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:4f0eb6ae-b0da-7068-e4f1-24011a6bfaff
msgctxt "ha9fdd63bg765ag4258gb683gec824cbe78b5"
msgid ""
"It may prove impossible to avoid the shadow curse entirely, but if you find "
"any way to limit your exposure, seize it."
msgstr ""
"그림자 저주의 영향을 완전히 피해 가는 것은 불가능할지도 모르지만, 노출을 최소화할 기회가 있다면, 그 기회를 반드시 잡아야 하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 4f889c74-a651-7a42-7012-2afb4a4aac9e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_WolfPens_State_HalsinIsAggravated = True
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:4f889c74-a651-7a42-7012-2afb4a4aac9e
msgctxt "ha5a4f5b9ga09bg42e2g96ecgf978cd7d6c81"
msgid "You will not see another day."
msgstr "너에게 내일은 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 4f8baf46-ab21-e3d9-9f10-eda7c217ba72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:4f8baf46-ab21-e3d9-9f10-eda7c217ba72
msgctxt "haabefeb4gb224g4f23g9de0g53c8ec3c484a"
msgid ""
"And you... the way you speak... you're worse than the Absolutists here. At "
"least they live with the pretence of purpose."
msgstr ""
"그대는... 그대가 말하는 방식은 말이지... 여기 절대자 신도들보다 더 한 자식이군. 적어도 그 놈들은 목적 의식을 갖고 있는데 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4f96937e-1b2e-d977-2404-4991ea0af46d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:4f96937e-1b2e-d977-2404-4991ea0af46d
msgctxt "h0c8a243bg9b46g4c93ga6d8gaf7e2d610135"
msgid "What should I do?"
msgstr "어떻게 해야 하죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 500ba65e-0c83-a6f3-1189-4aab4f8942e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_State_LeadersAreDead = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Knows_LeadersAreDead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:500ba65e-0c83-a6f3-1189-4aab4f8942e4
msgctxt "h622f43bfg9c98g4c04gab65ge2298c5c63a1"
msgid "All the leaders are dead - the grove's safe."
msgstr "모든 지도자가 죽었어요, 이제 숲은 안전합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 504ff22b-6635-fb50-88bd-3346999cb8ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_MoonriseBriefing = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:504ff22b-6635-fb50-88bd-3346999cb8ce
msgctxt "hd668b64bgaa8ag47efga44ag2435230c2880"
msgid "I've done my part - now tell me about Moonrise."
msgstr "이제 제가 할 일은 모두 마쳤습니다. 문라이즈에 대해 알려주세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 50b621c4-a2c4-9f5d-232c-1bb72ab407a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:50b621c4-a2c4-9f5d-232c-1bb72ab407a5
msgctxt "h22edf707g26ecg4994gafb4g434b8aab8f6b"
msgid ""
"Wait - I could help you find a cure... but I need to settle matters here "
"first."
msgstr "잠깐. 그대를 치유할 방법을 찾는 것은 도와줄 수 있지만... 먼저 이곳에서 해결할 문제가 있네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 51dedaab-5823-7c12-4b40-5c522ee06715
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:51dedaab-5823-7c12-4b40-5c522ee06715
msgctxt "he0f26dc8ga438g4c8cga899g161400895f90"
msgid "It's who I am, who my mind makes me: a killer."
msgstr "살인자. 그게 바로 나예요, 내 정신이 날 그렇게 만들고 있죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 51e0ca1a-b400-2d32-7786-da392c18afc1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_WolfPens_Event_HalsinLeavesGoblinCamp = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:51e0ca1a-b400-2d32-7786-da392c18afc1
msgctxt "h386bbed5ge4c8g4aa9gb559gfd2554004aaa"
msgid "May Silvanus guide us."
msgstr "실바누스께서 우릴 인도하시기를."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 54b46d76-ae62-6e9a-9dff-49f3f398e8b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_State_LeadersAreDead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:54b46d76-ae62-6e9a-9dff-49f3f398e8b8
msgctxt "h43877037g28fcg4fcag88cdgdfcc6a3efd57"
msgid ""
"Gladly, but first I must return to the grove. As you made short work of the "
"goblins' leaders, there's nothing stopping me. Come join me in your own time."
msgstr ""
"물론이지, 하지만 먼저 숲으로 돌아가야 하네. 그대가 고블린들의 지도자들을 쓰러뜨렸으니, 날 막을 것은 없지. 그대가 원하는 때에 언제든 "
"방문하게나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 561db6d2-873e-56d7-4df8-a248e807e22c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Knows_DarkJusticiars = True
#.     - ORI_Shadowheart_Event_DarkJusticiarHint = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:561db6d2-873e-56d7-4df8-a248e807e22c
msgctxt "ha2302381gd212g472bgb4fega145af22d05c"
msgid ""
"Long ago, a man called Ketheric Thorm built a secret stronghold deep down "
"there, before rallying a whole army of Dark Justiciars - Shar worshippers."
msgstr ""
"오래 전에, 케서릭 쏨이라는 남자가 저 깊숙한 지하에 비밀 요새를 지었어. 그리고선 다크 저스티시어 군대를 소집했지. 샤 신도들 말일세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 57137bbe-1b4c-c597-6cf2-1ed421ba0d89
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Quest_AskedKilledLeaders = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:57137bbe-1b4c-c597-6cf2-1ed421ba0d89
msgctxt "h86cfbc82gd851g40c1gb69eg1fb4ab8dbf72"
msgid ""
"Help me kill the leaders of this horde, save my grove. Then I will help you."
msgstr "이 무리의 우두머리들을 죽이고, 내 숲을 지키는 것을 도와주게나. 그리하면 나도 그대를 돕겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 597bb77d-171e-a1d4-7798-ee053d18bbfc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:597bb77d-171e-a1d4-7798-ee053d18bbfc
msgctxt "h8b33eec8g08c7g4fafga593gd1045c545d19"
msgid "Thank me not, the slaughter was a pleasure."
msgstr "고마워할 필요는 없어요. 살육이 재미있었거든요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5a49bdfa-b93b-299a-a2b7-153328bb7bd1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:5a49bdfa-b93b-299a-a2b7-153328bb7bd1
msgctxt "hd839c0a2g41f7g4849g8a06gd0585763cffa"
msgid "Stay here."
msgstr "여기서 기다려요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 5e97a87e-17e6-1697-86ad-90e8ee33ffed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_WolfPens_Event_HalsinLeavesGoblinCamp = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Druid.HalsinLeft_KilledLeaders(1) = True
#.     - DEN_Conflict_SUB_Halsin.HalsinLeft_KilledLeaders(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:5e97a87e-17e6-1697-86ad-90e8ee33ffed
msgctxt "hbe6ce339g300dg47fcg91fege65ac11201c2"
msgid ""
"Very well. Return to the grove. I'll make my own way there - then we can see "
"about this parasite of yours."
msgstr "알겠네. 숲으로 돌아오게. 나는 알아서 돌아갈 테니. 그곳에서 그대의 기생충 문제를 살펴보지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 5eb9c473-05f0-1227-48c9-a62177526290
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:5eb9c473-05f0-1227-48c9-a62177526290
msgctxt "hd37af7f1gc0b4g4dd8gbfeeg3205953ba62a"
msgid ""
"You sound all but deranged by blood, but I suppose even a feral wolf has a "
"caring hound at heart."
msgstr "그대는 피를 보고 싶어 미친 자 같군. 그렇지만 사나운 늑대라도 가슴 속에는 따뜻한 마음의 사냥개를 품고 있겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 5fef6f4e-46b3-8673-e8ba-1a3754ffc55f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:5fef6f4e-46b3-8673-e8ba-1a3754ffc55f
msgctxt "hf4f71ae0gb15ag46c4gb92fg49abafac51d0"
msgid ""
"I cannot come with you, though I wish I could. At least let me tell you what "
"I know; help you on your journey."
msgstr ""
"그대를 따라가고 싶지만, 그럴 수 없네. 내가 아는 것만큼은 그대에게 알려주도록 허락해 주게나, 그대의 여정을 도울 수 있도록 말일세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6127c54c-dfda-79eb-b373-7764b73d64f9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_WolfPens_State_HalsinIsFollowing(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:6127c54c-dfda-79eb-b373-7764b73d64f9
msgctxt "h151747a5g65e9g48ebg9782g761087900bf3"
msgid "Of course. Let's focus on that."
msgstr "물론이죠. 거기에 집중합시다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 61585d78-1145-1651-1b5a-d642706e2e66
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:61585d78-1145-1651-1b5a-d642706e2e66
msgctxt "hccffaa28g0447g4846gba74ge31c87a397d8"
msgid ""
"So it seems, though I don't know how. You will have to choose your approach "
"carefully."
msgstr "방법은 모르겠지만, 그런 것 같군. 접근 방식을 신중하게 선택해야 할 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 6390cf44-4d99-ef74-17d8-713ae70ff4cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:6390cf44-4d99-ef74-17d8-713ae70ff4cd
msgctxt "hb53936e4g7009g484egbe21gca7ea0b02981"
msgid "Either way, I owe thanks. I am the druid Halsin."
msgstr "어찌 됐든, 빚을 졌군. 나는 드루이드 할신이라고 하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 63aa3cfd-6278-ee95-b75f-af1bc58fd7a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:63aa3cfd-6278-ee95-b75f-af1bc58fd7a0
msgctxt "h7d163c4fg68f5g445ag983ag4c8ce99ff155"
msgid "I'll make my way to the grove - join me there."
msgstr "난 숲으로 돌아가겠네, 거기서 만나지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63f12524-2ab9-fc82-c948-de06ccdb4fba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:63f12524-2ab9-fc82-c948-de06ccdb4fba
msgctxt "hbd80c0bdg4414g4b16gaf03g994fc19e6d19"
msgid ""
"Don't make it sound so tempting. I already know you'd rather I stayed and "
"helped you."
msgstr "그렇게 말할 필요 없어요. 내가 여기 남아서 당신을 돕길 바란다는 걸 이미 알고 있으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 64100570-b6e3-ca81-dd1f-d1913fa3b0e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_DrowCommander_Event_RaidersSortie = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:64100570-b6e3-ca81-dd1f-d1913fa3b0e9
msgctxt "he25a99dcgc2dbg4b08gae34ga08e7d9dfee8"
msgid ""
"It seems the Absolute's forces are already marching on the grove. I'll have "
"to try get ahead of them, do what I can."
msgstr "절대자의 세력이 이미 숲으로 향하고 있는 것 같네. 놈들을 앞질러 가서 할 수 있는 건 뭐라도 해 봐야겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 657aebe5-3677-8d31-27ea-0f1455c6785e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:657aebe5-3677-8d31-27ea-0f1455c6785e
msgctxt "h2e956fa2gf24dg4eabgaf49gd9099b6ab827"
msgid ""
"The ringleaders have to die. The very natural order of things is in danger, "
"thanks to them."
msgstr "우두머리들은 죽어야 하네. 그 자들 때문에 만물의 자연적인 질서가 위태로워졌어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 657f8e57-6f20-0ab0-8f15-b3ff28cde3f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_Halsin_Knows_WantsToGoToMoonrise = True
#.   Local:
#.     - b1c7a343-a7e6-1dc5-d774-dcaec393fdf1_HiddenEntranceInSeluneTemple = False
#.     - b1c7a343-a7e6-1dc5-d774-dcaec393fdf1_UnfinishedBusiness = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:657f8e57-6f20-0ab0-8f15-b3ff28cde3f7
msgctxt "hf6a1f088gf11fg4eeegbc10g6c14c200b6ae"
msgid ""
"Travelling to Moonrise is no small task. Expect dangers like you've never "
"seen before."
msgstr "문라이즈로 여행하는 것은 결코 쉬운 일이 아니지. 전에 경험하지 못한 위험을 예상해야 할 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 696f1b12-c83e-194e-cd94-57958b6187fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_IsMissing = True
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_StudiedTadpole = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Event_AskedForHelp = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:696f1b12-c83e-194e-cd94-57958b6187fb
msgctxt "h92bff3bbg2cbag4443g9c41g3fd44a6f41a1"
msgid ""
"I spoke to Nettie - she said you could help me with the parasite in my head."
msgstr "네티와 대화했습니다. 그녀는 당신이 제 머리에 있는 기생충에 관해 저를 도울 수 있다고 하더군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 6a9ee2fc-278e-8b08-d02d-6b18d562c157
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:6a9ee2fc-278e-8b08-d02d-6b18d562c157
msgctxt "h6f190745ga044g45ecgbab2gdbb241f3634d"
msgid "I do want you to help me, yes. But I am <i>not </i>exaggerating."
msgstr "그대를 돕고 싶은 마음은 있네. 하지만 지금 과장하는 것이 <i>아니야</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 6b28b4cc-53d0-0215-5c2c-7d8b3a4a614e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:6b28b4cc-53d0-0215-5c2c-7d8b3a4a614e
msgctxt "h800d87acg482fg4ac1gbfc5g86aa6607e12e"
msgid "<i>What...? </i>How? Why?! Explain yourself at once!"
msgstr "<i>뭐...? </i>어떻게? 어째서지?! 당장 해명해!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6d7f90d7-f260-af77-c0c6-add0755b106a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Event_RevealedNautiloidEscape = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Event_RevealedNautiloidEscape = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:6d7f90d7-f260-af77-c0c6-add0755b106a
msgctxt "hb3f63a03gf2beg4eeag8af9gbebee4ac9f68"
msgid ""
"I escaped from an illithid ship after being infected. Maybe the process was "
"interrupted."
msgstr "감염되고 나서 일리시드 함선에서 탈출했어요. 변이 과정에 방해가 있었을지도 모르죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 6f405fe7-ccc2-cd80-a051-b5be88cafc7d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:6f405fe7-ccc2-cd80-a051-b5be88cafc7d
msgctxt "h10f26a17g5108g42f0g8ee5g450dd75784b3"
msgid ""
"Indeed? Not the most opportune moment, but given the lengths you went to, I "
"assume there's some urgency."
msgstr "그런가? 적절한 순간은 아니지만, 그렇게 고생해서 온 것을 보면, 아주 급한 일인 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 71d265c6-f095-76c8-e39b-3e1386b884d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Event_PreferUnderdarkRoute = True
#.   Local:
#.      - b1c7a343-a7e6-1dc5-d774-dcaec393fdf1_HiddenEntranceInSeluneTemple = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - b1c7a343-a7e6-1dc5-d774-dcaec393fdf1_HiddenEntranceInSeluneTemple = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:71d265c6-f095-76c8-e39b-3e1386b884d6
msgctxt "h7f30e7daga35bg41b5g8cb3g7b8c9960840b"
msgid "How do I find this passage through the Underdark?"
msgstr "언더다크를 통해 가는 경로를 어떻게 찾죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 72b4be26-0aa1-6fdd-fd4f-807e275ce3b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:72b4be26-0aa1-6fdd-fd4f-807e275ce3b7
msgctxt "hba5009e7g18d5g4199g817egd0feca5dae88"
msgid ""
"Come on then, what's the problem? Unless you'd rather wait for an audience "
"of goblins."
msgstr "그럼, 말해 보게. 뭐가 문제인가? 고블린 관객을 원하는 것이 아니라면 빨리 말하게나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 7491ad07-40f6-c485-d32a-3886f81e51d8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:7491ad07-40f6-c485-d32a-3886f81e51d8
msgctxt "ha7dfcc98g6db5g4d3dgb5a9ge9d0f722a72b"
msgid ""
"Nature speaks to me. Birds report what they've seen. And I've overheard "
"goblins speaking of it, too. Moonrise is at the heart of all this, I'm sure "
"of it."
msgstr ""
"자연이 나에게 말을 전해 주고, 새들은 자신이 본 것을 보고하지. 그리고 나는 고블린들이 그것에 대해 말하는 것도 엿들었네. 이 모든 "
"것의 중심에는 문라이즈가 있다고 내 확신한다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 7502b679-e70d-b12a-1586-e3f862229637
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:7502b679-e70d-b12a-1586-e3f862229637
msgctxt "hcee1b532gd273g4ef5g8e1eg001cf0d99c2b"
msgid ""
"I had no idea anyone beyond their ranks was infected. You have my sincere "
"sympathies."
msgstr "놈들 집단 외에도 감염된 사람이 있는 줄은 전혀 몰랐네. 그대를 진심으로 위로하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 75238050-948d-4622-f31c-761844df2600
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:75238050-948d-4622-f31c-761844df2600
msgctxt "h33701c30ge775g4bbfga262gc0020d3cb9b6"
msgid "Parasite in your head...? You mean you have one of <i>them</i>?"
msgstr "그대 머리에 기생충이 있다고...? 머리에 <i>그게</i> 들었단 말인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 75b0d557-743b-54fb-e57a-14db34ce4b90
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_IsMissing = False
#.   Local:
#.      - b1c7a343-a7e6-1dc5-d774-dcaec393fdf1_AskedName = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Event_AskedForHelp = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:75b0d557-743b-54fb-e57a-14db34ce4b90
msgctxt "h76d4dea2gfe59g4813g91d2ge6ec7060bc0f"
msgid "Impressive healing skills. I need the help of someone like you."
msgstr "인상적인 치유 능력이군요. 당신 같은 사람의 도움이 필요해요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 7867e530-32ef-a4b8-d2f8-c050c8a5b0cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:7867e530-32ef-a4b8-d2f8-c050c8a5b0cc
msgctxt "hd69f416cg4504g4cf8gbaf4gfec499565078"
msgid "You may reconsider once you see the effects of the curse for yourself."
msgstr "저주의 효과를 직접 보고 나면 생각이 바뀔 수도 있다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 78d299b9-4847-749a-45cc-5a61ae86c070
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - b1c7a343-a7e6-1dc5-d774-dcaec393fdf1_NowhereIsSafe = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:78d299b9-4847-749a-45cc-5a61ae86c070
msgctxt "hf0153a0bgf515g4e9aga351g9c05c2f3451a"
msgid ""
"I told you, nowhere is safe. Not while this rot festers. Once it is cut out -"
" once the grove is secure - then I shall leave."
msgstr ""
"이미 말했잖나, 어떤 곳도 안전하지 않네. 이 부패한 것들이 곪아있는 동안은 말일세. 이 부패를 잘라내고, 숲이 안전해지면, 그때 떠날 "
"걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 7aaf42fe-ee42-d45d-61fc-f9592a664a97
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_HasMet_SwA(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:7aaf42fe-ee42-d45d-61fc-f9592a664a97
msgctxt "h1fb97f24g8edeg424dgaf7bg4f91a7a1dfcc"
msgid ""
"Not only do you speak with a bear, but you free it, too? A true friend of "
"nature - or perhaps a lunatic."
msgstr "곰과 대화를 하는 것을 넘어, 풀어주기까지 하다니? 진정한 자연의 친구로군, 아니면 미치광이이거나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 7b3bba32-e797-9da1-0c2e-8b42b40c1689
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:7b3bba32-e797-9da1-0c2e-8b42b40c1689
msgctxt "h13946541g2f2dg4f72gb3b0g1608640382db"
msgid ""
"That sounds like what you need. But the next part of the journey mightn't be "
"straightforward - or safe."
msgstr "그게 그대에게 필요한 것 같군. 하지만 여정의 다음 부분은 그리 간단하지 않을 테고, 안전하지도 않을 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 7b4ac9be-6006-2881-a106-ebf5222100b4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:7b4ac9be-6006-2881-a106-ebf5222100b4
msgctxt "h146dc314g24d9g4c4bg9547g6877194b7587"
msgid ""
"Any who linger are twisted by the curse; they become shadow beings - "
"tormented, <i>dangerous </i>souls."
msgstr "그곳에 머무르는 자는 저주에 의해 뒤틀려, 그림자의 존재가 되고 말지. 고통받는 <i>위험한</i> 영혼 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7b52a447-a0f2-7c89-5bfd-1c19f471156d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:7b52a447-a0f2-7c89-5bfd-1c19f471156d
msgctxt "hec31bb90g53aeg449cgadc8g74a821f535ea"
msgid "Sympathies won't help me to survive."
msgstr "위로한다고 도움이 될 것 같진 않은데요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7c0ecbd1-8db8-51a2-6b8e-9926e8924934
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_MoonriseBriefing = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:7c0ecbd1-8db8-51a2-6b8e-9926e8924934
msgctxt "ha2242f6fg3c4bg4b38g8884g18ef7337cd2b"
msgid "At least tell me what you know about Moonrise. You owe me, after all."
msgstr "적어도 문라이즈 타워에 관해 알고 있는 것은 말해 주세요. 어찌 됐든, 당신은 내게 빚을 졌으니까요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7ca9900f-9882-12d6-bcdb-3645198b0e10
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:7ca9900f-9882-12d6-bcdb-3645198b0e10
msgctxt "hef40ebf7gb762g4a58gb132g4c744833b6a8"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 7cc7c255-2752-f2eb-bc73-eee8d053f25f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:7cc7c255-2752-f2eb-bc73-eee8d053f25f
msgctxt "h430fbec8g9af2g48b4g8577ge36a8c4a144b"
msgid ""
"This curse shrouds everything in shadow - you will not find life, light, or "
"anything natural there."
msgstr "이 저주가 모든 것을 그림자로 뒤덮어, 그곳은 생명, 빛, 또는 자연적인 것을 찾을 수 없게 됐네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 7e2abf9c-d96c-1c93-bfd4-115914162464
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:7e2abf9c-d96c-1c93-bfd4-115914162464
msgctxt "h8f291a2egff42g445egb388gfa6f0048464f"
msgid "Ah. Lunatic, then."
msgstr "아. 그렇다면, 미치광이로군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7f2e7f9b-cc8c-85f5-a6cd-898975240d67
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_Halsin_Knows_WantsToGoToMoonrise = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CAMP_Halsin_Knows_ShadowCurseMotivation = True
#.   Local:
#.     - b1c7a343-a7e6-1dc5-d774-dcaec393fdf1_UnfinishedBusiness = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:7f2e7f9b-cc8c-85f5-a6cd-898975240d67
msgctxt "h6f9ae8ffgf4b5g4084gaca8g3a1ae5c9e4d7"
msgid ""
"What business do you have at Moonrise? You said you'd go there, if you could."
msgstr "문라이즈에 무슨 볼 일이 있는 겁니까? 당신은 그곳에 갈 수 있으면 가겠다고 했죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 7f91cd71-7c7a-08bd-3730-762f7d52e9b6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - b1c7a343-a7e6-1dc5-d774-dcaec393fdf1_HalsinThanks = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - b1c7a343-a7e6-1dc5-d774-dcaec393fdf1_HalsinThanks = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:7f91cd71-7c7a-08bd-3730-762f7d52e9b6
msgctxt "h0cae7c77g4fd4g473fg9694gc3662679f6b9"
msgid "My thanks. If you prevail, I'll owe you the debt of a lifetime."
msgstr "고맙군. 만약 그대가 승리한다면, 내 그대에게 평생의 빚을 질 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 8013b929-0b75-ec57-b553-8ab019b3a0c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_AdventurersQuest_Knows_LeaderMap = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_AdventurersQuest_Knows_LeaderMap = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:8013b929-0b75-ec57-b553-8ab019b3a0c6
msgctxt "haa839dbcg87dag451bg97a0g5031492369d9"
msgid ""
"A dwarf called Brian, I believe. Though there's no guarantee that the "
"goblins left him recognisable."
msgstr "내 기억이 맞다면, 브라이언이라는 이름의 드워프였어. 하지만 고블린들이 그를 멀쩡히 내버려 뒀을지는 모르겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 803b9417-17a6-ff2b-bd69-d4a42963c551
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:803b9417-17a6-ff2b-bd69-d4a42963c551
msgctxt "h218b52deg9b55g48a7g8a48gc4efb7a0cabe"
msgid "Danger. Are you sure that's the best way to Moonrise?"
msgstr "위험해 보이던데, 그게 문라이즈 타워로 가는 가장 좋은 방법인 게 확실합니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 80e74f3b-6c16-75f5-6f2d-269f3b130da3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_IsMissing = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Event_AskedForHelp = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:80e74f3b-6c16-75f5-6f2d-269f3b130da3
msgctxt "h43f26313g01b6g4e24gabc1gea840ad6c39a"
msgid "I've heard you're an unmatched healer. I need your help."
msgstr "듣기로는 당신이 타의 추종을 불허하는 치유사라고 하더군요. 당신의 도움이 필요해요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 82d54a8a-3599-221d-9c0b-0de5821c01c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:82d54a8a-3599-221d-9c0b-0de5821c01c3
msgctxt "hd5888286g6233g4b1aga5b1gac319985e06f"
msgid "The Absolute's forces can tolerate such a place?"
msgstr "절대자의 병력은 그걸 견딜 수 있는 겁니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 82f2497a-c989-c6d7-4049-b182bcf1866b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:82f2497a-c989-c6d7-4049-b182bcf1866b
msgctxt "h383bbfecg9d31g4465g99c8g375f5ca34c6e"
msgid ""
"You've already been? Impressive. You'll make me redundant at this rate. What "
"did you find?"
msgstr "이미 다녀왔다고? 인상적이네. 그 속도라면 내 도움도 필요 없겠군. 무엇을 발견했나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 85b2cc54-f71a-1edc-9de8-4bae8323a06a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Quest_LeadershipAlreadyDead = True
#.     - GOB_WolfPens_Event_HalsinLeavesGoblinCamp = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:85b2cc54-f71a-1edc-9de8-4bae8323a06a
msgctxt "h315dccffg8bb1g43cag8a21gaf21d475e8ba"
msgid ""
"I can see to some matters there, and we can discuss what comes next amidst "
"more... <i>bucolic </i>surroundings than here."
msgstr "거기서 몇 가지 일을 처리한 뒤에, 여기보다 더... <i>목가적인 </i>환경에서 앞으로의 일을 논의할 수 있을 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 85e1e683-8e91-45e4-328e-0e7b5b20ad0f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:85e1e683-8e91-45e4-328e-0e7b5b20ad0f
msgctxt "h02dd7d42g5f83g4c38g9a74gb5cd3b509ac9"
msgid ""
"They are the ones holding these parasites together. Remove them and nature "
"will cure itself."
msgstr "이들이 기생충을 단결시키는 자들이지. 이들을 제거하면 자연이 스스로를 치유할 수 있을 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 861d910f-d846-df87-f371-bd4e5ac3b713
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:861d910f-d846-df87-f371-bd4e5ac3b713
msgctxt "h0630da83gebe9g4651gb13ag9c98e520185c"
msgid "Then everything we did here was hopeless."
msgstr "여기서 한 일이 다 쓸모 없었던 셈이군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 89c5424a-2673-2b6a-6e6d-a3a31840da76
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_StudiedTadpole = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - b1c7a343-a7e6-1dc5-d774-dcaec393fdf1_TadpoleStudies = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:89c5424a-2673-2b6a-6e6d-a3a31840da76
msgctxt "h1ea3cebdgbf76g4840g96dcgb5616de88263"
msgid "You learned all this from your studies?"
msgstr "연구를 통해 이 모든 사실을 알게 됐습니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 8a6260f9-bf01-f4bf-0575-ad5edbf27fa5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_WolfPens_State_HalsinIsFollowing(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:8a6260f9-bf01-f4bf-0575-ad5edbf27fa5
msgctxt "hc4b73449g67adg4b6dga912gdf976923ac4a"
msgid "Very well. My claws are yours."
msgstr "좋아. 내 발톱은 그대의 것일세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 8a6808fe-e4fd-134f-5e04-f30976fd7dca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:8a6808fe-e4fd-134f-5e04-f30976fd7dca
msgctxt "hf22a0e34gce2fg4cfbgbe8cg491f63d18833"
msgid ""
"To get to the Towers, you'll need to pass through a terrible place - a "
"<i>cursed</i> place."
msgstr "타워에 가려면 끔찍한 곳을, <i>저주받은</i> 곳을 통과해야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 8a77dbaf-620d-e18a-8806-647f83cde8e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:8a77dbaf-620d-e18a-8806-647f83cde8e2
msgctxt "hbdf07467g0a39g4493g95b6g65a83351b428"
msgid ""
"You know what's needed - the deaths of Dror Ragzlin, the drow Minthara, and "
"the priestess, Gut. May nature guide you."
msgstr "무엇이 필요한지 알 걸세. 드롤 라그즐린, 드로우 민타라, 여사제 거트의 죽음이지. 자연이 그대를 인도하길."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 8c194abe-38d3-d6d5-49be-89b0111b1ac3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:8c194abe-38d3-d6d5-49be-89b0111b1ac3
msgctxt "hf9df09e8g4f2cg4766g8dcbgaa2219121c54"
msgid ""
"You will? Oak Father bless you. I'll be in your debt twice over if we "
"succeed."
msgstr "그리하겠나? 참나무 아버지께서 그대를 축복해 주시길. 만약 성공한다면 내 그대에게 두 배의 빚을 지겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 8dcd598d-da10-e805-cd1c-036b6ce77367
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:8dcd598d-da10-e805-cd1c-036b6ce77367
msgctxt "h2a0e7fc7g74e9g43a7g857cg1970389dfb53"
msgid ""
"Keep looking. If they're present, then it's likely there's a route to "
"Moonrise somewhere."
msgstr "계속 찾아보게나. 그들이 거기 있다면, 문라이즈로 향하는 통로도 분명 근처 어딘가에 있을 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8dd45564-464d-694e-a344-8b8404d7dcdf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:8dd45564-464d-694e-a344-8b8404d7dcdf
msgctxt "h7c061925g0fdcg4b25g8d27gf4c44ebbfd30"
msgid "All right. How do I help?"
msgstr "좋습니다. 어떻게 도와줄까요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8de3b9a3-3859-45ac-3523-a334ec54d7b4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:8de3b9a3-3859-45ac-3523-a334ec54d7b4
msgctxt "hb4a931c7g9f0cg4659g9391g9e65d4c32937"
msgid "Tell me, then. I'm going to do whatever it takes."
msgstr "그렇다면, 말해 주세요. 필요한 일이라면 뭐든지 하겠어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 8ec0d415-a819-15a6-5fe8-1fa93ee34b53
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:8ec0d415-a819-15a6-5fe8-1fa93ee34b53
msgctxt "hc0aec4a1g0724g446bga213ga3ec47ef84e7"
msgid ""
"But in my eagerness, I put far too much faith in the abilities of Aradin and "
"his band. We didn't even get close."
msgstr "하지만 간절함 때문에 아라딘과 그 용병대의 능력을 너무 믿었지. 우린 가까이 가지도 못했다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 8f692b1e-4ca3-4e85-efb7-2062da3ac79c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:8f692b1e-4ca3-4e85-efb7-2062da3ac79c
msgctxt "h6444b202g5526g4662g9f78gd0cf83e2df90"
msgid ""
"I understand. You've done far more than most have for the grove, just by "
"freeing me."
msgstr "이해한다네. 그대는 날 풀어주는 것만으로 이미 누구든 숲에 할 수 있는 일 이상을 해주었네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 91de189b-2927-fefa-910d-ce051d8faabd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ElevatorToScl_Used = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:91de189b-2927-fefa-910d-ce051d8faabd
msgctxt "h4d0a4438gc3a8g4351ga504g27d303620afb"
msgid "Absolute followers - but that's about all."
msgstr "절대자의 추종자들이 있더군요. 하지만 그게 전부였습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 91e9dc1a-b7a7-346e-2cce-8975ca2adc5d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:91e9dc1a-b7a7-346e-2cce-8975ca2adc5d
msgctxt "hcb5fbc99g1511g4a4dg8d08g97c88eb81891"
msgid "A jest - I truly am grateful. If only I could repay you."
msgstr "농담이네, 진정으로 고맙군. 그대에게 이 빚을 갚을 수만 있다면 좋겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 932df4d6-ab07-5b8f-7bf4-4495bab6edfa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:932df4d6-ab07-5b8f-7bf4-4495bab6edfa
msgctxt "h73f3f386gc098g45cag90f0g0c6881c36ea4"
msgid "I need your help."
msgstr "당신 도움이 필요해요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 93a564d7-aa05-690a-1699-2b28de12c0fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:93a564d7-aa05-690a-1699-2b28de12c0fb
msgctxt "h5208e0a5gceacg4004g8259gcf12f02eb112"
msgid "Very well. I'll go rescue the grove."
msgstr "알겠어요. 제가 가서 숲을 구하죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 9402edb8-a80a-d321-9bed-98f163b3f581
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:9402edb8-a80a-d321-9bed-98f163b3f581
msgctxt "h17571209g6cb3g47dcga7f9g022f094fe05d"
msgid ""
"You'll need to pick up where Aradin left off - find the hidden entrance. "
"It's somewhere in these ruins, from what I've heard."
msgstr "아라딘의 뒤를 이어 숨겨진 입구를 찾아야 하네. 내가 들은 바로는, 이 폐허 어딘가에 있다고 하더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 9429561e-759d-d567-e494-b11e90afd1f9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:9429561e-759d-d567-e494-b11e90afd1f9
msgctxt "h40659b5bg27a6g4b93g8f69g5ce6fdc06787"
msgid "But there are other matters to attend to before that."
msgstr "하지만 그 전에 다뤄야 할 다른 문제들이 있네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 95e9549f-0339-c10b-bc76-b2f0dd94977a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_DarkUrge_Event_AlfiraHappy(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - NIGHT_DarkUrge_MurderOfAlfira = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:95e9549f-0339-c10b-bc76-b2f0dd94977a
msgctxt "h272fe119g6a36g47ecg9a0fg8c5631029e59"
msgid "I'm not much of a hero... those I look after seem to end up dead."
msgstr "전 영웅은 아닌가 봐요. 돌보는 사람마다 다 죽네요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 972a7662-012c-d3d0-2faf-574809faf3fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_State_LeadersAreDead = True
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_LeadersAreDead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:972a7662-012c-d3d0-2faf-574809faf3fc
msgctxt "hca2f5126g84e8g4329ga0f2gfa35ade8516b"
msgid ""
"You did it. <i>You actually did it! </i>The leaders dead - praise Silvanus."
msgstr "해냈군. <i>그대가 정말로 해낸 거야! </i>지도자들이 모두 죽었다네. 실바누스께 찬양을."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 97954fee-0790-3c51-d4d6-ae1078e27c10
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:97954fee-0790-3c51-d4d6-ae1078e27c10
msgctxt "hc60c1ca8g2d5cg49b8gb5acgbe400ae603bb"
msgid ""
"Kagha... I should have suspected she'd take things too far. I'll deal with "
"her when I can."
msgstr "카그하... 도를 넘을 것이라고 의심했어야 했어. 내가 할 수 있을 때 처리하겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 983b293e-7990-fff9-57a3-051bc7fb37b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:983b293e-7990-fff9-57a3-051bc7fb37b5
msgctxt "hd5d0c7a8gb00dg4ca1gb7e4gd4d7e8458ae9"
msgid ""
"There must be another way to cure myself - my kin have dealt with these "
"parasites before."
msgstr "분명 치유할 방법이 더 있을 겁니다. 우리 종족은 이미 이 기생충 문제를 처리한 적이 있거든요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 983b293e-7990-fff9-57a3-051bc7fb37b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:983b293e-7990-fff9-57a3-051bc7fb37b5
msgctxt "h5f19a7b1gd4e8g4987g90afg484580499bff"
msgid "There must be another way to cure myself."
msgstr "분명 치유할 다른 방법이 있을 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 998bd53e-11a9-9a5c-985a-ac3fa371416f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:998bd53e-11a9-9a5c-985a-ac3fa371416f
msgctxt "h2a4d3a74g916dg4c1fg99acg6d6e2363f87e"
msgid ""
"I'll wait here. Just know that you're gambling with the grove's very "
"existence."
msgstr "이곳에서 기다리겠네. 다만 그대가 숲의 운명 그 자체를 놓고 도박을 하고 있다는 점만 알아주게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 999798f5-4d1d-bc0e-638c-4539557d9bb2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:999798f5-4d1d-bc0e-638c-4539557d9bb2
msgctxt "hafcefbdeg0d7eg4d56g8b93g247faa338799"
msgid ""
"Oh, I'm quite aware of that, rest assured - but where <i>is</i> safe right "
"now?"
msgstr "나도 잘 알고 있으니 걱정 말게나. 허나 지금 과연 <i>어디가</i> 안전하다는 말인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 9b4bf430-1862-a1ad-3be1-7747506eb442
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_State_LeadersAreDead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:9b4bf430-1862-a1ad-3be1-7747506eb442
msgctxt "he9893761gfe16g48f8gb1e5g8a4222149768"
msgid ""
"Not that I'm eager to try stopping you, given the short work you made of the "
"leadership here. With them dead, it's high time I got back to the grove."
msgstr "자네가 이곳 지도자들을 손쉽게 처리했으니 막을 생각은 없다네. 그 자들이 죽었으니, 이제 숲으로 돌아갈 시간이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 9c84995d-3489-d778-3410-249a794c112a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:9c84995d-3489-d778-3410-249a794c112a
msgctxt "hd11ed045g4ecdg41d1gb7b4g3c4fa9d34e33"
msgid "Return to the grove; I'll make my own way there."
msgstr "숲으로 돌아가게나. 나는 알아서 길을 찾아갈 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 9dc57b22-58a3-09be-4803-3fa03960a8da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:9dc57b22-58a3-09be-4803-3fa03960a8da
msgctxt "hd6002bf0g285cg42a6ga825g8174b8c48354"
msgid ""
"No, this is different. <i>Altered.</i> The magic used is beyond me... it's "
"either not of this world, or so ancient as to be lost to even nature's "
"memory."
msgstr ""
"아니, 다른 것이야. <i>변형된 것이지.</i> 그 변형에 쓰인 마법은 내 이해를 뛰어넘는다네... 그렇다면 이 세계의 것이 아니거나, "
"너무 오래된 것이라 자연의 기억 속에서도 사라진 것이겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9f34a7c2-699f-0f13-de64-12d8913a24d8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:9f34a7c2-699f-0f13-de64-12d8913a24d8
msgctxt "hd4358f6dg3e42g4f4dgbf70ge56f204b2284"
msgid "I'm something of an expert when it comes to imperilling myself."
msgstr "난 위태로움을 감수하는 데는 전문가에 가깝죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9f595972-de8c-e35d-bdc7-a6fba7e85751
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_InfernalBox_State_TeamHasBox = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:9f595972-de8c-e35d-bdc7-a6fba7e85751
msgctxt "hb8fc2a6eg5dcbg45bbg87a2g9281fa0d3125"
msgid "I think this artefact has something to do with it."
msgstr "이 아티팩트와 관련이 있다고 생각해요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = a01a6e05-bb24-4311-c93f-4f4a95b79568
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:a01a6e05-bb24-4311-c93f-4f4a95b79568
msgctxt "h5f5cae99gc3f0g4aebg917bgfb0617abef44"
msgid ""
"I don't know. Ketheric's followers were defeated or vanished before the "
"effects of the curse took hold."
msgstr "모르겠군. 케서릭의 추종자들은 저주의 영향이 퍼지기 전에 패퇴하거나 사라졌어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = a1b99183-83d0-36b7-e475-438fd58c826a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:a1b99183-83d0-36b7-e475-438fd58c826a
msgctxt "h210637f4g318bg46d4g8184g9b2961124694"
msgid "Anything is preferable to risking the shadow curse."
msgstr "그림자 저주를 피할 수 있다면 어떤 방법이라도 취해야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a1ee00bd-4158-9143-7591-dc0e87825dda
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Event_PlayerRefusedToHelp = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:a1ee00bd-4158-9143-7591-dc0e87825dda
msgctxt "hd06609e7g63c0g44f5ga276g83034720fc8a"
msgid ""
"There's no pretence in not wanting to play the assassin. You're on your own."
msgstr "암살자 노릇을 하기 싫다는데 가식은 없어요. 당신 알아서 하시죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = a269cdce-db88-93b2-9b54-e4e1e05d9d88
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Knows_GroveHelpWanted = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:a269cdce-db88-93b2-9b54-e4e1e05d9d88
msgctxt "h540aad43gda17g41a4gadf4ge5392d40cba5"
msgid ""
"I've no right to ask more of you... but if you could help me, I'd be free to "
"join your journey to Moonrise."
msgstr "내가 그대에게 더 바랄 권리는 없지만... 도와준다면, 문라이즈로 향하는 여정에 합류하겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = a29aad3e-ba63-ab1a-b635-451741580ab9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:a29aad3e-ba63-ab1a-b635-451741580ab9
msgctxt "h6ef6b240g477bg459fg8a8bg4ef5fc8e6646"
msgid ""
"You could go overland - along the Risen Road or through the mountains. "
"Easier at first, but you'll run into the shadow curse eventually."
msgstr "치솟은 길을 따라 지상으로 가거나 산을 통과할 수도 있다네. 처음에는 더 쉽겠지만, 결국 그림자 저주를 맞닥뜨리게 되겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = a6da8446-cfd5-cd93-d6cc-1e56a325e425
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:a6da8446-cfd5-cd93-d6cc-1e56a325e425
msgctxt "h086ad600g0f15g418cg9507ge3ebaf8fc623"
msgid ""
"You drow relish turning on your own, if there's something to be gained. "
"Don't pretend otherwise."
msgstr "자네 드로우들은 이득이 될 것이 있다면 언제든 동족을 배신하지. 아닌 척하지 말게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a89294cb-de5c-c49b-c706-2d5892480977
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_KaghaDead = False
#.      - DEN_ShadowDruid_State_KaghaKilled = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Knows_KaghaDead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:a89294cb-de5c-c49b-c706-2d5892480977
msgctxt "hc462d573g45d5g4b3cgb74eg33c05877b2f2"
msgid "Kagha is dead. She was swayed by Shadow Druids. I had no choice."
msgstr "카그하는 죽었습니다. 그녀는 그림자 드루이드에게 현혹되었더군요. 저에겐 선택의 여지가 없었습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = a9e80fa9-01ee-59a5-1478-5a3cc75ea28b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:a9e80fa9-01ee-59a5-1478-5a3cc75ea28b
msgctxt "h2090a497g7a6dg49b1gbf79gbcb856297038"
msgid ""
"Indeed. After we dealt with the drow that ambushed us, Nettie and I were "
"able to inspect the corpse - and the creature that slithered out of it."
msgstr "그렇네. 네티와 나는 우리를 급습한 드로우를 처리한 후, 시체와 그 시체에서 기어나온 생명체를 조사할 수 있었네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = aa5823f0-a032-3dde-17d1-beb4729d7262
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:aa5823f0-a032-3dde-17d1-beb4729d7262
msgctxt "h35333e00gdb05g4514g9f3ag28eac10b191c"
msgid ""
"May Silvanus guide your hand. Focus on the leaders - that's all it will take "
"to restore the balance here."
msgstr "실바누스께서 그대의 손을 인도하시길. 우두머리들에게 집중하게나. 그 정도면 이곳의 균형을 회복할 수 있을 것이니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aae56f2f-dc68-2627-2a94-979d8b96787b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_Halsin_Knows_ShadowCurseMotivation = True
#.   Local:
#.      - b1c7a343-a7e6-1dc5-d774-dcaec393fdf1_UnfinishedBusiness = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:aae56f2f-dc68-2627-2a94-979d8b96787b
msgctxt "hc33855efgd56fg49afga808g2de542b2c46f"
msgid ""
"Is that why you went with Aradin? You thought he might uncover this route to "
"Moonrise?"
msgstr "그래서 아라딘과 함께 간 겁니까? 아라딘이 문라이즈로 가는 길을 알아낼 수 있을 거라 생각해서?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = ab4450fd-7780-e14d-eea0-b4172b9d1ad0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_State_WillSkipGrove = True
#.      - GOB_State_LeadersAreDead = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_WolfPens_Event_HalsinLeavesGoblinCamp = True
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Event_WillJoinAtCamp = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:ab4450fd-7780-e14d-eea0-b4172b9d1ad0
msgctxt "h1a4f6e38gd39fg41e7g8580g55d4fa9200cf"
msgid ""
"Gladly, but I have some matters to settle first. You go ahead - I'll join "
"you at your camp."
msgstr "물론이오, 하지만 아직 해결해야 할 문제가 좀 남았네. 먼저 가게나, 그대의 야영지에 합류할 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ad5c972c-600d-e444-8bf3-68da3651ac47
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:ad5c972c-600d-e444-8bf3-68da3651ac47
msgctxt "h82bbae03g7d2cg4cb0g9d1fgea2608ea3341"
msgid "Sounds like I've no choice - I need to find a way through."
msgstr "선택권이 없는 것 같은데, 뚫고 지나갈 길을 찾아야겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ad6f9355-60c3-26a6-4111-61d89063147e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:ad6f9355-60c3-26a6-4111-61d89063147e
msgctxt "he3f51cc6g7a4eg4c75ga290g9fa142a59154"
msgid "This shadow curse - does it affect Shar worshippers?"
msgstr "그림자 저주라는 건, 샤 숭배자들에게도 영향을 미치는 겁니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = ae7d4aa8-0902-614b-b254-68ab52b8af65
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:ae7d4aa8-0902-614b-b254-68ab52b8af65
msgctxt "he9fe135eg3980g4743gb0ccg05576afc5c39"
msgid ""
"If you want to find a cure, you must head there and discover how the "
"tadpoles are being manipulated."
msgstr "치료법을 찾고 싶다면, 그곳으로 가서 올챙이가 어떻게 조작되고 있는지 확인해야 하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = ae882e90-895a-5dfa-9dc0-549c83493669
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:ae882e90-895a-5dfa-9dc0-549c83493669
msgctxt "hbc3c533dg1cdag47f6ga5e9g204014431ad8"
msgid "My business there began long ago, and has led to a lifetime of regret."
msgstr "내가 그곳에서 해야 하는 일은 오래 전 시작된 것이고, 일생에 걸친 후회의 원인일세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b1ca4591-b4ce-a2b0-5897-1d918afc310f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_State_LeadersAreDead = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:b1ca4591-b4ce-a2b0-5897-1d918afc310f
msgctxt "h32309ddbg269fg4d82g976bg93be7e35ea80"
msgid "Having a shapeshifting bear-druid at my side might make things easier."
msgstr "제 곁에 변신하는 곰 드루이드가 있으면 일이 더 쉬워질 수도 있죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = b34fdcc7-f1a1-705a-9780-877d81cf7987
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:b34fdcc7-f1a1-705a-9780-877d81cf7987
msgctxt "h5c90f374g39c0g4836g9eedg4671ae031820"
msgid ""
"Oh, certainly. But I live modestly at the best of times, and this is far "
"from the best of times."
msgstr "오, 물론일세. 좋은 때에는 겸손하게 산다만, 지금은 좋은 때와는 거리가 멀다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = b4e9f117-87e1-0736-ffd3-48f970c588af
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Quest_AskedDefendGrove = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:b4e9f117-87e1-0736-ffd3-48f970c588af
msgctxt "h3812eb2bgf87dg44afg80ccg7c98667dcbf4"
msgid "You must get ahead of them, muster the defences."
msgstr "그대가 놈들을 앞질러 가서, 방어를 대비해야 하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = b5780383-6e00-d873-df5c-5a27417da99a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:b5780383-6e00-d873-df5c-5a27417da99a
msgctxt "h85a043d6gbad2g49bbgb474gbb0f44fab731"
msgid ""
"If I could join you and get close to Moonrise, perhaps I could have both "
"helped you find a cure for your infection and lifted the curse."
msgstr "만약 내가 그대와 함께 문라이즈에 가까이 갈 수 있다면, 감염 치료법을 찾는 데 도움을 주고 저주도 풀 수 있을지도 모르지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = b7245856-c1f0-5e70-7b58-b5a41730e9f3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ShadowHeart_InParty_Knows_SharWorshipper = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - Shadowheart_InParty_InterestInDarkJusticiars = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:b7245856-c1f0-5e70-7b58-b5a41730e9f3
msgctxt "hdda8351fg4280g48dagb7f4gaa0a3b3ceb08"
msgid "Dark Justiciars? I must see for myself."
msgstr "다크 저스티시어라고요? 직접 봐야겠군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = b87087f6-a623-9530-c1f6-e1c1782d960a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:b87087f6-a623-9530-c1f6-e1c1782d960a
msgctxt "hcfdba9bfgb7cbg4a94gb6dfgbce195e0d61e"
msgid ""
"That must be where these enchantments are placed on them, and it's where "
"you'll find your cure."
msgstr "그곳에서 올챙이에 마법이 걸린 게 분명하네. 거기서 치료법도 찾을 수 있을 것이고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b9d086d0-172d-e34d-d048-e1ea37862326
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_State_LeadersAreDead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:b9d086d0-172d-e34d-d048-e1ea37862326
msgctxt "h4698be06ga3bbg4bd0gb274ge22fa99a6964"
msgid "Doubtful - I already killed the goblin leadership."
msgstr "그럴 리가. 이미 고블린 지도자들을 죽였어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ba334840-b7f4-d920-aba3-c9d7269dd3af
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: (CLERIC_SHAR or PALADIN_SHAR) and !REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:ba334840-b7f4-d920-aba3-c9d7269dd3af
msgctxt "h2efc331dg39c5g469eg9e33gc737ba783c53"
msgid "Are these Sharrans still to be found?"
msgstr "그 샤 숭배자들을 아직 찾을 수 있을까요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = bbc9767e-4df6-919c-585b-1f568e6bc765
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_WolfPens_Event_HalsinLeavesGoblinCamp = True
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Quest_HalsinLeftNoHelp = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Druid.HalsinLeft_NoHelp_Known(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:bbc9767e-4df6-919c-585b-1f568e6bc765
msgctxt "hc2e1625eg60d1g4cf5gbf5cgaf0fc305ab9a"
msgid ""
"If you should have a chance to strike down the leaders of this horde, the "
"world will be a better place for it. Farewell."
msgstr "그대가 이 무리의 지도자들을 쓰러뜨릴 기회가 있다면, 세상은 더 나은 곳이 될 테지. 잘 가게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c05d079d-0fca-363b-e4bf-0bd24f58538c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:c05d079d-0fca-363b-e4bf-0bd24f58538c
msgctxt "h0550db23gc481g46d9g9c9dgc3bf80ebd952"
msgid "How are you so sure Moonrise is where I have to go?"
msgstr "문라이즈 타워에 가야 한다고 어째서 그렇게 확신하는 거죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c104a535-7e81-022e-09b6-d2a587c7776f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_UNDERDARK(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Event_PreferUnderdarkRoute = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:c104a535-7e81-022e-09b6-d2a587c7776f
msgctxt "hcdb1df9bg36f8g478fgba0bgf0aaf773f2ab"
msgid ""
"The Underdark's my home. Better to take that route than risk this curse."
msgstr "언더다크는 내 고향입니다. 이 저주를 무릅쓰느니 그 길을 택하겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = c191d7ac-e5f4-ee70-3a2e-2bdf531fac92
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:c191d7ac-e5f4-ee70-3a2e-2bdf531fac92
msgctxt "h1bba40fdg10f0g4392gbe40gc2118c36ceec"
msgid ""
"Then... then it is as you say. They forgot their principles; you had no "
"choice. I will mourn them when I can."
msgstr ""
"그렇다면... 그대가 말한 대로겠군. 그들은 원칙을 잊어버렸고, 그대에겐 선택지가 없었구나. 시간이 있다면 그들을 위해 애도하겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c19bba22-5f2d-473c-3465-9c71f09f5841
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_MoonriseBriefing = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Event_PlayerRefusedToHelp = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:c19bba22-5f2d-473c-3465-9c71f09f5841
msgctxt "hdcf8031egc94bg4a7dgab74gb0b4e3604615"
msgid "The grove isn't my problem. I have to concentrate on saving myself."
msgstr "숲은 제 문제가 아닙니다. 저 스스로를 구하는 일도 급하단 말입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = c211156b-f0a9-7075-34bd-030e27759e5c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:c211156b-f0a9-7075-34bd-030e27759e5c
msgctxt "h9e26e03cg1d24g4577gbb3bga73dfab10b82"
msgid "How is this possible...?"
msgstr "어떻게 이런 일이...?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c2c64f33-6cac-4876-9245-52cfa9143cbe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_MoonriseBriefing = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:c2c64f33-6cac-4876-9245-52cfa9143cbe
msgctxt "hba78a850gd410g4717gb29fg99df262e5227"
msgid "I can't help you. I just need you to tell me about Moonrise Towers."
msgstr "당신을 도울 순 없습니다. 그냥 문라이즈 타워에 대해서만 알려주세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = c2e949b9-6db7-5ae0-5453-e05b6e9af65d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Knows_PlayerTadpoleCondition = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:c2e949b9-6db7-5ae0-5453-e05b6e9af65d
msgctxt "h650ac95egdbc2g44c8g8d83gf0ca64ba2ac4"
msgid ""
"Oak Father preserve you, child... You're infected, aren't you? The mind "
"flayers' spawn."
msgstr "자식이여, 참나무 아버지께서 보호해 주시길... 그대는 감염된 것 아닌가? 마인드 플레이어의 산물에 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = c37f58ef-0b99-7025-5b89-493945cb6654
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_State_WillSkipGrove = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Event_WillJoinAtCamp = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Druid.HalsinLeft_KilledLeaders_SkipGrove(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:c37f58ef-0b99-7025-5b89-493945cb6654
msgctxt "hde8bb26ag43cbg4412g805ag264358797748"
msgid ""
"I have some matters to settle, then I'll join you at your camp. There, we "
"can talk properly."
msgstr "먼저 처리할 일이 좀 있네. 그 후에 그대의 야영지에 합류하지. 거기서 제대로 대화를 나누도록 하자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = c44da119-f83e-843b-3a69-8339084a0a23
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Event_AskedForHelp = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:c44da119-f83e-843b-3a69-8339084a0a23
msgctxt "hbd4b3927g614bg419bgb890g05a84621433e"
msgid ""
"You weren't speaking lightly when you said you needed help. Let me tell you "
"what I know."
msgstr "도움이 필요하다고 한 것이 가볍게 말한 게 아니었군. 내가 아는 것을 말해 주겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c48e8276-7901-3d03-cbab-c1d2977ed25b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:c48e8276-7901-3d03-cbab-c1d2977ed25b
msgctxt "hc32d0428g6cdag48d9gb817g92610e4fa4aa"
msgid "I don't know."
msgstr "저도 모르겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = c6387982-595f-37f8-21a6-809efa7d0652
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:c6387982-595f-37f8-21a6-809efa7d0652
msgctxt "h3cbfd5e3g5f2dg4b83g982bgb6f3914f632c"
msgid ""
"That's true, I won't lie. But I won't let you march towards Moonrise without "
"knowing what you'd face."
msgstr "그건 사실이야, 거짓을 말하진 않겠네. 하지만 그대가 뭘 맞이할지도 모르는 채로 문라이즈 타워로 나아가도록 놔둘 순 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = c6fc0600-7909-da65-a141-7ad853ec5440
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:c6fc0600-7909-da65-a141-7ad853ec5440
msgctxt "h3dec3e0ag9914g49abgbe5eg1de75a05565e"
msgid "As bones, perhaps. But their hidden structures might still remain."
msgstr "유골 정도는 남아 있을지도 모르겠군. 하지만 그 자들의 숨겨진 구조물은 아직 남아 있을 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = c76cd858-5c7e-71fa-2579-069e309843a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_State_LeadersAreDead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:c76cd858-5c7e-71fa-2579-069e309843a1
msgctxt "h37e1372agaf1cg48bdgbfadgdb1eba011ace"
msgid ""
"Wait. Now that the goblins' leaders are dead, I could join you - help you "
"find a cure. I just need to make arrangements back at the grove. Find me "
"there, if you wish."
msgstr ""
"잠깐. 이제 고블린 지도자들도 죽었으니, 그대와 합류할 수 있네. 치유할 방법을 찾는 일을 도와주겠네. 숲에 남은 일만 처리하고 나서 "
"말이야. 그대가 원한다면, 날 그곳에서 찾게나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = c88b45d8-d93f-927d-3e88-28529da71935
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:c88b45d8-d93f-927d-3e88-28529da71935
msgctxt "he402a582g1128g4f4bg8be6g7555505ffe21"
msgid ""
"I spent years researching the curse, trying to put an end to it. Nothing has "
"worked - yet."
msgstr "나는 저주를 끝내기 위해, 이를 연구하는 데 수년을 보냈네. 하지만 아무것도 소용이 없었지. 아직은 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = c8b4edfc-8801-19fb-4de4-61ddab12b8e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:c8b4edfc-8801-19fb-4de4-61ddab12b8e1
msgctxt "h4b631633g0f5eg496ag93d4gd77f5e92a2ff"
msgid ""
"I am aware. I foolishly left it vulnerable to this rabble. There's work to "
"be done."
msgstr "알고 있네. 내가 어리석게도 이 폭도들에게 취약한 상태로 내버려 두었지. 해야 할 일이 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = c96af606-dc86-7b5b-c6ef-59f4059a1731
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_State_LeadersAreDead = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_WolfPens_Event_HalsinLeavesGoblinCamp = True
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Event_WillJoinAtCamp = True
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Quest_HalsinLeftNoHelp = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:c96af606-dc86-7b5b-c6ef-59f4059a1731
msgctxt "had7b5cccg8e5bg4b0ega2f9gc0405534abed"
msgid ""
"I will find you at your camp, and help you with your problem. Right now, "
"I... I need to go be alone."
msgstr "그대의 야영지로 찾아가, 문제 해결을 도와주겠네. 하지만 당장은, 조금... 혼자 있을 시간이 필요해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c9cafb45-e3c0-0c4a-f349-daa7c3f1f444
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_MoonriseBriefing = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:c9cafb45-e3c0-0c4a-f349-daa7c3f1f444
msgctxt "h8a821791gbf30g4589ga648g8a9037a54650"
msgid "Tell me what you know about Moonrise Towers."
msgstr "문라이즈 타워에 관해 알고 있는 내용을 말해 주세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = caba72e5-52b3-7dcc-28c6-ff3209f892d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:caba72e5-52b3-7dcc-28c6-ff3209f892d7
msgctxt "h7825ae38g4d2eg475fgb866g578c40cc2812"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cafd55a7-c283-009a-2798-896a3f4eb6aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:cafd55a7-c283-009a-2798-896a3f4eb6aa
msgctxt "hbd6c41eeg2793g487fgbb22g537a0013936f"
msgid ""
"True, but I mustn't be seen spilling drow blood. Stay here - I'll kill the "
"trio <i>quietly</i>."
msgstr ""
"사실이죠, 하지만 제가 드로우 피를 흘리는 것을 들켜선 안 돼요. 여기 머무르세요, 제가 그 셋을 <i>조용히</i> 처리할 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cde9c3a8-b617-a399-f912-d92b74e222c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_KaghaAlive = False
#.      - DEN_ShadowDruid_State_KaghaIsDead = False
#.      - DEN_ShadowDruid_Event_KaghaTurnedGood = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Knows_KaghaAlive = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:cde9c3a8-b617-a399-f912-d92b74e222c0
msgctxt "h87417761gfae6g43d4ga54bg99c77fcb84f1"
msgid "Kagha was swayed by Shadow Druids. She nearly sealed the grove."
msgstr "카그하는 그림자 드루이드에게 현혹되었더군요. 그녀가 숲을 봉쇄할 뻔했습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = ce1c6cfa-9191-16dd-2fa8-725e78ad4096
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_WolfPens_State_HalsinIntroHappened = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - GOB_WolfPens_HalsinBear_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Local:
#.     - b1c7a343-a7e6-1dc5-d774-dcaec393fdf1_NotUsualCeremorphosis = False
#.     - b1c7a343-a7e6-1dc5-d774-dcaec393fdf1_CantYouHelp = False
#.     - b1c7a343-a7e6-1dc5-d774-dcaec393fdf1_TadpoleStudies = False
#.     - b1c7a343-a7e6-1dc5-d774-dcaec393fdf1_NowhereIsSafe = False
#.     - b1c7a343-a7e6-1dc5-d774-dcaec393fdf1_AskedName = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:ce1c6cfa-9191-16dd-2fa8-725e78ad4096
msgctxt "hfb5024d3gf927g4c7bgb61bg3c0622699fdd"
msgid ""
"Pardon the viscera. One should cherish all of nature's bounty... but goblin "
"guts are quite far down the list."
msgstr "방금 피칠갑은 용서해주게나. 자연의 모든 풍요로움을 소중히 여겨야 하지만... 고블린 내장은 그 우선순위가 낮은지라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce7a2727-a023-90df-d9c5-2d031245f46b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Knows_ShadowCurse = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:ce7a2727-a023-90df-d9c5-2d031245f46b
msgctxt "hf8e4fd9eg8139g410aga65bg5ecda0533fa7"
msgid "What's so dangerous about it?"
msgstr "그곳이 뭐 때문에 그렇게 위험한 거죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = d062a12c-9faf-dd78-8d37-d1f7a34e2491
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_State_WillSkipGrove = True
#.      - GOB_State_LeadersAreDead = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_WolfPens_Event_HalsinLeavesGoblinCamp = True
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Event_WillJoinAtCamp = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:d062a12c-9faf-dd78-8d37-d1f7a34e2491
msgctxt "h6b4d4067g3979g40a1gb4c3g39fd7500daef"
msgid ""
"I will help however I can. Let me see to some matters, then I will join you "
"at your camp."
msgstr "어떻게든 그대를 도와주겠네. 먼저 해결해야 할 문제를 끝마치고, 그대의 야영지에 합류하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = d1ba257f-bf86-926e-595b-5bcbbab1eb99
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_DrowCommander_Event_RaidersSortie = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:d1ba257f-bf86-926e-595b-5bcbbab1eb99
msgctxt "hc9e03ec6g7250g453fga3f7g6dd485775745"
msgid ""
"Now, there's no time to lose - get to the grove and help with the defences."
msgstr "자, 낭비할 시간이 없어. 숲으로 가서 방어를 돕게나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d1e46243-3d50-6c02-2d62-93ff52da9689
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:d1e46243-3d50-6c02-2d62-93ff52da9689
msgctxt "hba61ac15g9a45g49c0g930agcb9154322bc2"
msgid "What do you suggest?"
msgstr "어떻게 하면 좋을까요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d261a5f3-8737-5208-eeb8-03e033c67a5c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - b1c7a343-a7e6-1dc5-d774-dcaec393fdf1_NotUsualCeremorphosis = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:d261a5f3-8737-5208-eeb8-03e033c67a5c
msgctxt "h51672e5eg6bb2g45a1gbd69g18606a35eccd"
msgid "This magic isn't typical of how mind flayers procreate?"
msgstr "이 마법은 마인드 플레이어들이 일반적으로 번식하는 방법이 아닌 건가요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = d2b34131-494b-ded8-1e2e-414add1ac41b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:d2b34131-494b-ded8-1e2e-414add1ac41b
msgctxt "h1d465b95g487ag4901ga376g794ccb8c84bb"
msgid ""
"Three deaths could win us peace: the drow Minthara, the hobgoblin Dror "
"Ragzlin, and that perversion of a priestess, Gut."
msgstr "세 명의 죽음이 우리에게 평화를 줄 수 있다네. 드로우 민타라, 홉고블린 드롤 라그즐린, 그리고 그 왜곡된 여사제 거트 말일세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = d79b67d8-5c44-3b22-1a5a-64d8108960d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:d79b67d8-5c44-3b22-1a5a-64d8108960d2
msgctxt "h3c2f9319gc32cg43d2ga1beg7f845c372d9e"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry to say, I can't undo that magic, which means I can't cure you. But "
"that doesn't mean I can't help."
msgstr ""
"이런 말을 해 미안하지만, 그 마법을 무효화할 수는 없다네. 즉 치유해줄 수 없다는 말이지. 허나 도와줄 수 없다는 뜻은 아니네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d8e1f0d3-6054-ebf3-567f-7e90eeaa004c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_State_LeadersAreDead = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:d8e1f0d3-6054-ebf3-567f-7e90eeaa004c
msgctxt "he1353f7eg4934g45afga50bgc59c7de0e202"
msgid "I'll deal with this. You get to safety."
msgstr "이 일은 제가 처리하죠. 당신은 안전한 곳으로 피신하세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d8f790b3-7c44-67c9-c6da-70cee86fbf20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:d8f790b3-7c44-67c9-c6da-70cee86fbf20
msgctxt "h2710bfc2gb490g42b2g931ag60c0fe1af9b1"
msgid "All right. Wait here until it's done."
msgstr "좋아요. 일이 끝날 때까지 여기서 기다리세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = da475b37-f921-b549-5944-55078a5175f9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Lockdown_State_Active = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:da475b37-f921-b549-5944-55078a5175f9
msgctxt "hb5e6f3ebg8414g417cg94c8gf9a2c5cbc2c0"
msgid ""
"Kagha carried out the Rite of Thorns - the grove has been sealed off from "
"the world."
msgstr "카그하가 가시의 의식을 진행했어요, 숲은 이제 세상에서 단절된 채 봉인되었습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = dc16704d-a673-4c89-6e6a-c04325e1a878
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_State_WillSkipGrove = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Event_WillJoinAtCamp = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Druid.HalsinLeft_KilledLeaders_SkipGrove(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:dc16704d-a673-4c89-6e6a-c04325e1a878
msgctxt "h370b85beg12bcg4ce1g8ed1g17816406cf93"
msgid ""
"Not so hasty, friend. With the goblins' leaders dead, I can help you. I'll "
"come to your camp, once I've settled some matters."
msgstr ""
"너무 조급해 하지 말게나, 벗이여. 이제 고블린 지도자들이 죽었으니, 그대를 도울 수 있네. 몇 가지 문제를 처리하고 나서, 그대의 "
"야영지에 찾아가도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = dc727b19-a3f2-b85e-1ff7-98381c5b07e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DRUID and MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:dc727b19-a3f2-b85e-1ff7-98381c5b07e0
msgctxt "h6ab1bc00gc938g4504g8516gcdebea7f6b2d"
msgid ""
"It is you who should be praised, brother - you are Silvanus' instrument. And "
"please, just Halsin. I will not demand honorifics of my saviour."
msgstr ""
"찬사를 받아야 할 것은 그대라네, 형제여. 실바누스의 그릇과도 같군. 그리고 부디 할신이라고만 불러주게나. 내 구세주에게 존칭을 요구하진 "
"않겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = dc727b19-a3f2-b85e-1ff7-98381c5b07e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DRUID and FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:dc727b19-a3f2-b85e-1ff7-98381c5b07e0
msgctxt "hfb23f90dgd389g4124g8f80gf1c9e0aa7be9"
msgid ""
"It is you who should be praised, sister - you are Silvanus' instrument. And "
"please, just Halsin. I will not demand honorifics of my saviour."
msgstr ""
"찬사를 받아야 할 것은 그대라네, 자매여. 실바누스의 그릇과도 같군. 그리고 부디 할신이라고만 불러주게나. 내 구세주에게 존칭을 요구하진 "
"않겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = dc727b19-a3f2-b85e-1ff7-98381c5b07e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:dc727b19-a3f2-b85e-1ff7-98381c5b07e0
msgctxt "hdff5c547gd96dg4f0egb38cg7115508f22a9"
msgid ""
"Yes, but just Halsin will suffice. Unbecoming to demand honorifics from the "
"one who saved my hide."
msgstr "그렇다만, 그냥 할신으로 족하다네. 내 목숨을 구해준 사람에게 존칭을 요구하는 건 예의에 어긋나니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dcb670bc-34fb-c0a4-bdcf-7a0bdd9aee94
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_AboutGrymforge = False
#.      - GLO_DuergarCamp_EverEnteredBefore = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:dcb670bc-34fb-c0a4-bdcf-7a0bdd9aee94
msgctxt "h1a2c7a7ag9494g44bbg9e21gb289e3819eee"
msgid "I already found the place you're talking about - it's called Grymforge."
msgstr "당신이 말하는 장소는 이미 찾았어요. 그곳은 그림포지라 불리더군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = dd9c2e3f-2fb9-f5cf-a732-5dba958b7689
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_AdventurersQuest_Knows_LeaderMap = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:dd9c2e3f-2fb9-f5cf-a732-5dba958b7689
msgctxt "hfdd3c734g6929g43f4gbd6cg5b8c82a0f6fb"
msgid ""
"One of those who died had a clue that was supposed to help us find the "
"hidden entrance to the Underdark."
msgstr "죽은 이들 중 하나가 언더다크로 향하는 숨겨진 입구를 찾는 단서를 가지고 있었네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = dfa7de07-012e-19b6-8ffb-79f7a86d95b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Event_PlayerRefusedToHelp = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:dfa7de07-012e-19b6-8ffb-79f7a86d95b2
msgctxt "hf9a966e8g1530g4970gaa5fgb5fba320aee0"
msgid ""
"Nature's blessings. I thought you'd be on your way by now... unless you "
"changed your mind?"
msgstr "자연의 축복이 있길. 지금쯤이면 이미 그대가 떠났을 줄 알았더만... 혹시 생각이 바뀐 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e1903a8d-b829-4a23-c85c-bd8e292a4d07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_UNDERDARK(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Event_PreferOverlandRoute = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:e1903a8d-b829-4a23-c85c-bd8e292a4d07
msgctxt "hf1e63234ged69g4e79ga0ffg847b743381bc"
msgid ""
"I don't want to risk getting lost in the Underdark - I'll journey overland."
msgstr "언더다크에서 길을 잃는 위험을 감수하고 싶지는 않군요. 지상으로 모험해야겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = e2728449-0524-66a2-92ce-a6557a4959cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:e2728449-0524-66a2-92ce-a6557a4959cc
msgctxt "h755e488fgefabg43b1gb69ag13e4055f3b3b"
msgid ""
"But... something's <i>different</i>. You're aware of the monster inside you. "
"You don't bow to the Absolute, like the True Souls do..."
msgstr ""
"하지만... 뭔가 <i>다르군</i>. 그대는 내면에 있는 괴물을 인지하고 있어. 참된 영혼들처럼 절대자에게 복종하지 않고 있지..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e2b861c1-eac3-699d-3959-bef4876770a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:e2b861c1-eac3-699d-3959-bef4876770a7
msgctxt "hc5e83130g95c8g462bg93f4g6fafad55106a"
msgid "At least I know what to do now. Thank you."
msgstr "적어도 이제 뭘 해야 할지는 알겠군요. 감사합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = e3490dba-b811-cff0-440a-ebee731cd461
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_AdventurersQuest_Knows_LeaderMap = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - DEN_AdventurersQuest_Knows_LeaderMap = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:e3490dba-b811-cff0-440a-ebee731cd461
msgctxt "h2522b8adg4c0eg4fd3g81c9g5159e3e3d7fb"
msgid ""
"One of the adventurers had a clue to help find it - a dwarf called Brian. It "
"might still be found on his corpse, wherever the goblins left it."
msgstr ""
"모험가 중 한 명이 그걸 찾는 단서를 가지고 있었지, 브라이언이라는 드워프였어. 고블린들이 그의 시체를 어디 뒀는진 모르겠지만, 아직 "
"그곳에 남아 있을지도 모르네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = e4e52350-cc8f-85a9-8181-1c9084581f87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:e4e52350-cc8f-85a9-8181-1c9084581f87
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h2d84f6a0ge7c9g4e37gb3deg1e99b6e6fe2d"
msgid ""
"I've been studying these parasites for a while now. Ever since I discovered "
"these so-called True Souls are infected with them."
msgstr "나는 한동안 이 기생충들을 연구해왔네. 소위 참된 영혼이라고 불리는 이들이 이 기생충에 감염된 것을 발견한 이후로 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = e5d61dac-22e2-df3c-60b4-74ea4e99d270
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:e5d61dac-22e2-df3c-60b4-74ea4e99d270
msgctxt "hefa17ab1g65bbg464ag96a6gfaca40de967c"
msgid ""
"I must admit, I didn't expect anyone would come to my aid. Who in their "
"right mind would infiltrate a goblin infested temple. Unless..."
msgstr "솔직히 말해서, 아무도 나를 도와줄 거라고는 생각하지 못했네. 누가 제정신으로 고블린이 들끓는 신전에 잠입하겠나? 아니면..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e63eab3c-1478-de9f-5230-93ec51372395
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Event_PlayerRefusedToHelp = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:e63eab3c-1478-de9f-5230-93ec51372395
msgctxt "h0e50b9aag7e49g4502ga66bg56ad409f7e97"
msgid "You ask too much of me. I can't help you."
msgstr "너무 많은 걸 바라는군요. 당신을 도울 순 없겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = e651ccf5-bef7-6d29-a56c-9cb75e820352
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_WolfPens_Event_HalsinLeavesGoblinCamp = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:e651ccf5-bef7-6d29-a56c-9cb75e820352
msgctxt "h71cbf128ga1dcg4a79g9b53g8bfec79394c4"
msgid "Farewell. I don't expect we'll meet again - at least not in this life."
msgstr "잘 가게나. 우리는 다시 만나지 않을 것 같군, 이번 생 동안은 말이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = e6ce5ffe-2ba0-16d8-3c8f-d6538d1f48bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:e6ce5ffe-2ba0-16d8-3c8f-d6538d1f48bf
msgctxt "h587f7b28g10a8g4be6g855fg8eb4761dea90"
msgid ""
"Chaos is welcome, in doses; it helps keep balance. But this is too much - "
"this is <i>unnatural</i>."
msgstr ""
"혼돈은 균형을 유지하는 데 도움이 되므로 어느 정도는 환영할 만하지. 그러나 이건 너무 지나치잖나. 이 상태는 <i>자연적</i>이지 "
"않네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = e716e767-3d69-4ce2-1690-7115b2f78d2e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:e716e767-3d69-4ce2-1690-7115b2f78d2e
msgctxt "h89ca6198g04c4g4682g95edgc87964db2f09"
msgid "The Rite of Thorns...? <i>No.</i>"
msgstr "가시의 의식...? <i>안 돼.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e71c8c05-3964-5a4a-8569-bd562bf2744f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:e71c8c05-3964-5a4a-8569-bd562bf2744f
msgctxt "h58e1c13bg7f74g40b1g91feg78a47ec7beff"
msgid "Tell me what you've learned about the tadpoles' origins."
msgstr "올챙이의 기원에 대해 알아낸 걸 말해주세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = e7379c20-8b1e-bcb2-d39f-faabba67c59e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:e7379c20-8b1e-bcb2-d39f-faabba67c59e
msgctxt "hc7cefca2gcd72g4e28gaeafga5cb48f72718"
msgid ""
"You're half right - you have to get to Moonrise, but you still have a choice "
"of how to get there."
msgstr "절반만 맞았네, 문라이즈에 가야 하는 것은 맞지만, 여전히 그곳에 어떻게 갈 것인가를 결정해야 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = e92d689d-8437-abc3-1e92-007364e3a2a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GOB_WolfPens_State_HalsinIsFollowing(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:e92d689d-8437-abc3-1e92-007364e3a2a7
msgctxt "h0a120ea6gd597g4651gb46bgeecd1e2afb86"
msgid "So be it. May Silvanus lend us nature's fury."
msgstr "그리 되리니. 실바누스께서 우리에게 자연의 분노를 빌려주시길."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = eb485883-e941-911d-0c68-ad3a1ca93977
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_DrowCommander_Event_RaidersSortie = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:eb485883-e941-911d-0c68-ad3a1ca93977
msgctxt "hd767ab94gf19dg40b0gb812ge11ba5f336f2"
msgid ""
"It's too late to stop things from here - the goblins are already marching on "
"the grove in force."
msgstr "이곳에서 막기에는 너무 늦었네, 고블린들이 이미 세력을 모아 숲으로 진격하고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ebedeae0-2843-0958-ecd6-24d5d3a18a07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Underdark_EverEnteredBefore = True
#.      - GOB_TempleAccess_Event_PuzzleSolved = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:ebedeae0-2843-0958-ecd6-24d5d3a18a07
msgctxt "h8d20a058g1d43g40fbga22ag5f69fe25910b"
msgid ""
"I've already found a way into the Underdark. I can pick up the trail from "
"there."
msgstr "이미 언더다크로 가는 길은 찾았어요. 거기서 길을 따라가면 되겠군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = ecd2edb6-4bd5-56d3-b0a0-120087ae23cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:ecd2edb6-4bd5-56d3-b0a0-120087ae23cc
msgctxt "h8ed0e6cfgdbc8g4a6ag991bg59a52c06b1ad"
msgid ""
"Death is nature's final slumber - it awaits us all. Do not punish yourself "
"over those lost, or give in to despair - not while there are still folk in "
"need of your help."
msgstr ""
"죽음이란 자연의 마지막 깊은 잠이니, 우리 모두를 기다리고 있지. 이미 잃은 자들 때문에 자책하지도, 절망에 빠지지도 말게. 아직 자네 "
"도움을 필요로 하는 이들이 있으니 말일세."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = ee73d1da-b765-7ff2-a799-2e5509ee208f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_Halsin_Knows_WantsToGoToMoonrise = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:ee73d1da-b765-7ff2-a799-2e5509ee208f
msgctxt "hb806bff4g7a11g461egb799ga413f68f6b4d"
msgid ""
"I wish I could, but there's still work I've yet to finish - blood I've yet "
"to spill."
msgstr "그럴 수 있으면 좋겠다만, 나에게는 아직 완수하지 못한 과업이 있네. 내가 아직 흘리지 못한 피가 남아있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = ef8553a1-d004-18fe-1906-7cb637b16ef9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - Shadowheart_InParty_InterestInDarkJusticiars = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:ef8553a1-d004-18fe-1906-7cb637b16ef9
msgctxt "h363863d4gc4a6g4fe1ga4c9g299eb0d25d81"
msgid "Sounds rather ingenious."
msgstr "꽤 기발한 것 같군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f0bef979-474b-4d2c-453b-007c8e3d0c15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_DrowCommander_Event_RaidersSortie = True
#.      - GLO_GoblinKing_State_PermaDefeated = True
#.      - GOB_GoblinPriest_State_Dead = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GOB_WolfPens_Event_HalsinLeftParty = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:f0bef979-474b-4d2c-453b-007c8e3d0c15
msgctxt "h205ea691g5337g4442gb557g6697354cfcbb"
msgid "The other leaders are dead, but Minthara has left for the grove."
msgstr "다른 지도자들은 죽었지만 민타라가 숲을 치러 떠났어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = f1a8e425-eeed-d8c3-c0d7-9a76fb2c550f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_State_WillSkipGrove = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Event_WillJoinAtCamp = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Druid.HalsinLeft_KilledLeaders_SkipGrove(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:f1a8e425-eeed-d8c3-c0d7-9a76fb2c550f
msgctxt "h8e009fdeg51e5g4749g9a3age320a4379d0b"
msgid ""
"And you'll receive it. I'll make my way to your camp, as soon as I've "
"settled some matters."
msgstr "곧 받을 수 있을 걸세. 몇 가지 일을 처리하고 바로 그대의 야영지로 찾아가지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = f245bfc4-35e4-4bd9-e6f4-3b7a5276c45a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Event_AskedForHelp = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:f245bfc4-35e4-4bd9-e6f4-3b7a5276c45a
msgctxt "h92313bddg4f33g4c58g8a48gf3b19e77685f"
msgid ""
"It's no coincidence that you found me here, I'll wager? You're after a cure "
"for this parasite."
msgstr "그대가 이곳에서 나를 찾은 것도 분명 우연은 아니겠지. 그대는 이 기생충의 치료제를 찾고 있군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = f305b94c-e328-4824-2fd8-f18d0ae447c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:f305b94c-e328-4824-2fd8-f18d0ae447c8
msgctxt "haff4ac3agc8e2g4fddgbe2dg4fb017c49a2d"
msgid ""
"The decision is yours, but I'd favour the Underdark. Even a place like that "
"is the lesser evil compared to the shadow-cursed lands."
msgstr ""
"결정은 그대의 몫이지만, 나라면 언더다크를 통해 가겠네. 그런 곳이라도, 그림자 저주의 영향을 받은 곳을 통과하는 것보다는 나을 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f43f1ae8-b053-614c-9335-c1f167b6eff8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:f43f1ae8-b053-614c-9335-c1f167b6eff8
msgctxt "h10eabba7g40bdg4d4bg81f7gb880a5f7b694"
msgid "I think you're exaggerating. You just want me to stay and help you."
msgstr "내 생각엔 그냥 과장하고 있는 것 같은데요. 제가 돕길 바라는 것뿐이잖아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = f455c5a7-d4e1-73af-58e5-e2133f1166ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:f455c5a7-d4e1-73af-58e5-e2133f1166ba
msgctxt "h801794eaga1f7g43ecg99b2g984e56530c64"
msgid "Let's get out of this pit, firstly."
msgstr "우선 이 난관에서 빠져나가세나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f5f68e53-bbc0-5238-7f2d-62c065d1f106
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_State_LeadersAreDead = False
#.      - GLO_DrowCommander_State_Dead = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DROWELF(1) = True
#.      - DROWELF(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:f5f68e53-bbc0-5238-7f2d-62c065d1f106
msgctxt "h0cb721f4gb041g4149g9bc3g8bfc00460c5b"
msgid "You are aware you're asking <i>me </i>to kill a drow?"
msgstr "지금 당신이 <i>나더러 </i>드로우를 죽여달라고 부탁하고 있다는 거 아시나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f67dd5aa-cc80-ae39-4f8a-8c4645645769
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:f67dd5aa-cc80-ae39-4f8a-8c4645645769
msgctxt "hf012053fg1286g4451gba7dg9799c0eff680"
msgid "I've got more exploring to do."
msgstr "탐색을 계속해 봐야겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = f73bfaab-a648-6156-2e9d-9c40f01bb2a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:f73bfaab-a648-6156-2e9d-9c40f01bb2a3
msgctxt "h53a05561gb284g47acg9155g009d27d0ab53"
msgid "Perhaps there's something else I can offer you."
msgstr "그대에게 제안할 다른 것이 있을지도 모르겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = f85bb038-c8f3-9efd-c36b-021a76591745
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:f85bb038-c8f3-9efd-c36b-021a76591745
msgctxt "h548513c6gee6bg4be0g8468g76d821041f34"
msgid ""
"If you can find this place, I'll wager it will reveal a more direct path to "
"Moonrise Towers, and may bypass the worst of the shadow curse."
msgstr ""
"이곳을 찾을 수 있다면, 문라이즈 타워로 곧바로 가는 길이 열릴 것이라 장담한다네. 어쩌면 그림자 저주를 우회할 수 있을지도 모르고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f9f925f1-141e-b92b-cb6d-102c7aaf0923
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_GroveHelpWanted = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Halsin_Event_PlayerRefusedToHelp = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:f9f925f1-141e-b92b-cb6d-102c7aaf0923
msgctxt "h3cab2044ga0a6g4a02g9ce7gbbb9ca3c7fd7"
msgid ""
"I may live to regret this - or maybe I won't - but fine, I'll help you save "
"the grove first."
msgstr "후회하게 될 수도 있고, 그렇지 않을 수도 있지만, 좋아요. 일단 숲을 구하는 것부터 돕겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = fb621c4d-a688-cc13-dacd-34408fa7a318
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:fb621c4d-a688-cc13-dacd-34408fa7a318
msgctxt "h8dcda7efg7360g4e6eg8f0eg24237533825d"
msgid ""
"Patience. I can't just snap my fingers... but I know where the solution "
"almost certainly lies."
msgstr "인내심을 가지게나. 그저 내 손가락을 튕긴다고 해결될 문제가 아니지... 하지만 분명한 해결책이 어디에 있는지는 알고 있네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = fd37bb70-2deb-14c1-6fa4-bbbf39d63304
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:fd37bb70-2deb-14c1-6fa4-bbbf39d63304
msgctxt "h21aff5cagad19g48aag81d2g180f95756de6"
msgid ""
"Kagha... This is my fault - I was her teacher. I will mourn her when I can."
msgstr "카그하가... 이건 내 잘못이야. 내가 스승이었다네. 시간이 생긴다면 카그하를 위해 애도하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ff683bf1-ed56-6774-8f8b-91156d51d0a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:ff683bf1-ed56-6774-8f8b-91156d51d0a6
msgctxt "he6b82d26gdc83g41d3g95ccgd16cbb7951f6"
msgid ""
"I've explained all that I'm going to. Accept that or I'll give you the same "
"treatment they got."
msgstr "내가 어떻게 할지는 이미 설명했어요. 그걸 받아들이던가, 다른 이들과 같은 결말을 맞으시죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ffd4704d-3f2f-f641-eb5a-80339ad440ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_IsMissing = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - b1c7a343-a7e6-1dc5-d774-dcaec393fdf1_AskedName = True
#. TagRule: DRUID
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:ffd4704d-3f2f-f641-eb5a-80339ad440ea
msgctxt "h9fdaa70ag8615g4236ga253g1ddeb2b7f4d6"
msgid ""
"You're Master Halsin? First Druid of the Emerald Grove? Praise Silvanus for "
"saving you."
msgstr "당신이 마스터 할신입니까? 에메랄드 숲의 최고 드루이드? 당신을 구해 주신 실바누스께 찬양을."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ffd4704d-3f2f-f641-eb5a-80339ad440ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Knows_IsMissing = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - b1c7a343-a7e6-1dc5-d774-dcaec393fdf1_AskedName = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat:ffd4704d-3f2f-f641-eb5a-80339ad440ea
msgctxt "hfabdcb3cg049dg4c3cg899eg138cb09659f2"
msgid "You're Halsin? <i>The </i>Master Halsin of the Emerald Grove?"
msgstr "당신이 할신입니까? 에메랄드 숲의 <i>마스터</i> 할신?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/GOB_WolfPens_HalsinsBear_AfterCombat_InCage
