msgctxt "h2c891632ge279g4888g80cag20e6eaa96314"
msgid "Never knew goblins can't hold their liquor."
msgstr "고블린들이 자기네들 술에 이렇게 약한 줄 몰랐네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_Festivities_PAD_FoundSleepers
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 376ed7ea-f839-df44-b140-1349163f7f9d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_Festivities_PAD_FoundSleepers:376ed7ea-f839-df44-b140-1349163f7f9d
msgctxt "hace29fdfg0e26g4f87g8952g14a94689a0fc"
msgid "Man. I could go for a nap too."
msgstr "이런. 나도 낮잠 좀 자고 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_Festivities_PAD_FoundSleepers
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 376ed7ea-f839-df44-b140-1349163f7f9d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_Festivities_PAD_FoundSleepers:376ed7ea-f839-df44-b140-1349163f7f9d
msgctxt "h217d56e8gdc3eg4241gad71g1fb91124ba13"
msgid "Drunk - but not dead, more's the pity."
msgstr "취했을 뿐 죽지는 않았네. 그게 더 불쌍하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_Festivities_PAD_FoundSleepers
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 376ed7ea-f839-df44-b140-1349163f7f9d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_Festivities_PAD_FoundSleepers:376ed7ea-f839-df44-b140-1349163f7f9d
msgctxt "hbca84687gca21g4e57gb3f2g2ed3f5c9ba78"
msgid "Blackout drunk, the lot of them. You can smell it from here."
msgstr "쟤들 모두 취해서 곯아떨어졌군. 여기서도 냄새가 나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_Festivities_PAD_FoundSleepers
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 376ed7ea-f839-df44-b140-1349163f7f9d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_Festivities_PAD_FoundSleepers:376ed7ea-f839-df44-b140-1349163f7f9d
msgctxt "h7cbf3875gac5ag4a04g9abcg76bfbf2ae1aa"
msgid "Fast asleep. That's what hard drinking will get you."
msgstr "빨리도 잠들었군. 과음하면 저렇게 되는 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_Festivities_PAD_FoundSleepers
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 376ed7ea-f839-df44-b140-1349163f7f9d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_Festivities_PAD_FoundSleepers:376ed7ea-f839-df44-b140-1349163f7f9d
msgctxt "h50572868g56bdg40d4gbcf7g8cb50644bb5d"
msgid ""
"Looks like the booze got the better of them. They're practically unconscious."
msgstr "술이 녀석들을 이겼나 보네. 완전히 정신을 잃었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_Festivities_PAD_FoundSleepers
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9a372381-3464-3833-229a-d1a06eecbdc5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_Festivities_PAD_FoundSleepers:9a372381-3464-3833-229a-d1a06eecbdc5
msgctxt "h6c515517g5ad6g49e7g8255gc6af30c35085"
msgid "Shhh. Let's not disturb the sleeping beauties."
msgstr "쉿. 잠자는 미녀들을 방해하지 말자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_Festivities_PAD_FoundSleepers
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9a372381-3464-3833-229a-d1a06eecbdc5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_Festivities_PAD_FoundSleepers:9a372381-3464-3833-229a-d1a06eecbdc5
msgctxt "h429583c6gfa44g4c4eg864fg9d56974405b5"
msgid "Never knew goblins can't hold their liquor."
msgstr "고블린들이 자기네들 술에 이렇게 약한 줄 몰랐네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_Festivities_PAD_FoundSleepers
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9a372381-3464-3833-229a-d1a06eecbdc5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_Festivities_PAD_FoundSleepers:9a372381-3464-3833-229a-d1a06eecbdc5
msgctxt "hae357c52g9893g4621gadbdg22fa5143f74d"
msgid "Booze knocked 'em out. For now."
msgstr "술기운에 기절한 거야. 당장은."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_Festivities_PAD_FoundSleepers
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9a372381-3464-3833-229a-d1a06eecbdc5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_Festivities_PAD_FoundSleepers:9a372381-3464-3833-229a-d1a06eecbdc5
msgctxt "h22916581g35d1g4844ga028g260d632a6e0f"
msgid "Shush your mouth. Or were you <i>hoping</i> to wake them?"
msgstr "입 좀 닥쳐. 아니면 그들이 깨길 <i>바라는</i> 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_Festivities_PAD_FoundSleepers
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9a372381-3464-3833-229a-d1a06eecbdc5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_Festivities_PAD_FoundSleepers:9a372381-3464-3833-229a-d1a06eecbdc5
msgctxt "hf9141cc8g925bg4c09gac2agf75580aa1885"
msgid ""
"Easy to liberate some purses or slit a few throats... if you were so "
"inclined."
msgstr "지갑이나 좀 털거나 목을 베는 건 쉽겠네... 만약 네가 그렇게 내킨다면."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_Festivities_PAD_FoundSleepers
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9a372381-3464-3833-229a-d1a06eecbdc5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_Festivities_PAD_FoundSleepers:9a372381-3464-3833-229a-d1a06eecbdc5
msgctxt "h787828a6gd094g4d7aga8f5gc3f4d6b9d7ab"
msgid "Keep your steps light. They could be the nasty sort of drunks."
msgstr "조용히 걸어. 술 취한 골칫덩어리가 깰 수 있으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_Festivities_PAD_FoundSleepers
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9a372381-3464-3833-229a-d1a06eecbdc5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_Festivities_PAD_FoundSleepers:9a372381-3464-3833-229a-d1a06eecbdc5
msgctxt "h4940913dg9965g4b1ag87adg877e2bc8a572"
msgid "Still, we best make not <i>too</i> much noise."
msgstr "그래도, <i>너무</i> 시끄럽게 굴면 안 되겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinHunt_PAD_KilledDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 37fbdf54-8c8d-478a-de66-e6890b8b9225
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinHunt_PAD_KilledDrow:37fbdf54-8c8d-478a-de66-e6890b8b9225
msgctxt "h8e1ef058gc518g4daag9fc7g01b0b3de0861"
msgid "Dead. What a magnificent sight."
msgstr "죽었군. 참으로 장엄한 모습이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinHunt_PAD_KilledDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 37fbdf54-8c8d-478a-de66-e6890b8b9225
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinHunt_PAD_KilledDrow:37fbdf54-8c8d-478a-de66-e6890b8b9225
msgctxt "h6842fa02gda99g4d81gac70gf8f258744bde"
msgid "How the mighty have fallen."
msgstr "강력한 자도 이렇게 쓰러지는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinHunt_PAD_KilledDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 37fbdf54-8c8d-478a-de66-e6890b8b9225
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinHunt_PAD_KilledDrow:37fbdf54-8c8d-478a-de66-e6890b8b9225
msgctxt "h298e63ddg4f04g4d26gb4c2g389becdcc5ed"
msgid "Rest in peace."
msgstr "고이 잠들길."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinHunt_PAD_KilledDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 37fbdf54-8c8d-478a-de66-e6890b8b9225
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinHunt_PAD_KilledDrow:37fbdf54-8c8d-478a-de66-e6890b8b9225
msgctxt "h2df1268fge593g4b35gb0b6gc5ff342f7ee2"
msgid "Dead, more's the pity. My blood had <i>just</i> started to boil."
msgstr "죽었어, 안타깝게도. 내 피가 <i>이제 막</i> 끓기 시작했는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinHunt_PAD_KilledDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 37fbdf54-8c8d-478a-de66-e6890b8b9225
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinHunt_PAD_KilledDrow:37fbdf54-8c8d-478a-de66-e6890b8b9225
msgctxt "h9ca27b36ga27bg4f86g8494g4d7e5faeabe0"
msgid "That's her finished. An impressive scalp to lay claim to."
msgstr "이 여자도 끝이군. 머리는 인상적인 전리품이 되겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinHunt_PAD_KilledDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 37fbdf54-8c8d-478a-de66-e6890b8b9225
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinHunt_PAD_KilledDrow:37fbdf54-8c8d-478a-de66-e6890b8b9225
msgctxt "hfb0aadc1g2af8g48acgb419g73ad21c2a58d"
msgid "Good and dead. A monster like her deserves no better."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinHunt_PAD_KilledDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 37fbdf54-8c8d-478a-de66-e6890b8b9225
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DROWELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinHunt_PAD_KilledDrow:37fbdf54-8c8d-478a-de66-e6890b8b9225
msgctxt "h949a3368g4704g44e8g8765g42540c3917d2"
msgid "Let her rot. The Absolute's allies deserve no better."
msgstr "썩게 놔둬. 절대자의 아군들에겐 그게 제일 마땅해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinHunt_PAD_KilledDrow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 37fbdf54-8c8d-478a-de66-e6890b8b9225
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinHunt_PAD_KilledDrow:37fbdf54-8c8d-478a-de66-e6890b8b9225
msgctxt "h191ffce1g8520g4ee9gbf8eg87997a90eebe"
msgid "Dead. Seems these True Souls have their limits."
msgstr "죽었어. 참된 영혼도 한계가 있나 보군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinHunt_PAD_KilledPriestess
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 23d2d470-7bdd-1e7b-6699-4b1e4e196451
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinHunt_PAD_KilledPriestess:23d2d470-7bdd-1e7b-6699-4b1e4e196451
msgctxt "hbf237454g7a7dg4704g96b4g858028b72bbc"
msgid "Ah, the world just got a little less wretched."
msgstr "아, 세상이 조금 덜 비참해졌네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinHunt_PAD_KilledPriestess
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 23d2d470-7bdd-1e7b-6699-4b1e4e196451
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinHunt_PAD_KilledPriestess:23d2d470-7bdd-1e7b-6699-4b1e4e196451
msgctxt "ha9c95f93gc2afg4dc0g880bgb883507025ee"
msgid ""
"Well done. I doubt anyone will mourn this wicked mouthpiece of the Absolute."
msgstr "잘했어. 이 절대자의 나팔수를 애도할 사람이 있을 거 같진 않네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinHunt_PAD_KilledPriestess
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 23d2d470-7bdd-1e7b-6699-4b1e4e196451
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinHunt_PAD_KilledPriestess:23d2d470-7bdd-1e7b-6699-4b1e4e196451
msgctxt "h49a2ea31g16f0g49cfga2e6geca5bd77c2c8"
msgid "Hope she finds peace now."
msgstr "이걸로 마침내 평안을 찾았길."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinHunt_PAD_KilledPriestess
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 23d2d470-7bdd-1e7b-6699-4b1e4e196451
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinHunt_PAD_KilledPriestess:23d2d470-7bdd-1e7b-6699-4b1e4e196451
msgctxt "hee65ca9fgcddeg42e1g9cd1g5e154cbffdcb"
msgid "Disgusting creature. We did her a <i>favour.</i>"
msgstr "역겨운 생물이로군. <i>호의</i>를 베풀었건만."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinHunt_PAD_KilledPriestess
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 23d2d470-7bdd-1e7b-6699-4b1e4e196451
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinHunt_PAD_KilledPriestess:23d2d470-7bdd-1e7b-6699-4b1e4e196451
msgctxt "h510d8917gf21cg4ea2ga43eg8e8231eab4fb"
msgid "Good riddance to that grimy wretch."
msgstr "그 지저분한 녀석을 잘 처리했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinHunt_PAD_KilledPriestess
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 23d2d470-7bdd-1e7b-6699-4b1e4e196451
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinHunt_PAD_KilledPriestess:23d2d470-7bdd-1e7b-6699-4b1e4e196451
msgctxt "h09ee904agf700g480ag8fa5g616dfbf78ae3"
msgid "The goblin priestess, bled dry."
msgstr "고블린 여사제, 피 말라 죽다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinHunt_PAD_KilledPriestess
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 23d2d470-7bdd-1e7b-6699-4b1e4e196451
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinHunt_PAD_KilledPriestess:23d2d470-7bdd-1e7b-6699-4b1e4e196451
msgctxt "hd1a63f29g19a1g4680g8204gf3d6402cff1a"
msgid "The priestess is slain. And the horde is weaker for it."
msgstr "여사제는 죽었어. 이제 고블린 무리는 약해졌어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinPriest_PAD_DeadOgre
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e37aaf7b-65dd-2096-6c46-5518067f2ded
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinPriest_PAD_DeadOgre:e37aaf7b-65dd-2096-6c46-5518067f2ded
msgctxt "h37d46d8ag0e80g41c1g912eg4ea2b048cf05"
msgid "Killed without a mark. Who the hells does she serve?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinPriest_VB_Branding
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 75d2a0ae-eab9-1412-3006-a7b7026c99e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinPriest_VB_Branding:75d2a0ae-eab9-1412-3006-a7b7026c99e8
msgctxt "h41e10706gb7b3g420cgabb6gc3513a8e3f93"
msgid "Smells like burnt flesh in here."
msgstr "불탄 살점 냄새가 나는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinPriest_VB_Chains
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 29ecd671-3f61-c4b7-2fd4-6f092acba83d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinPriest_VB_Chains:29ecd671-3f61-c4b7-2fd4-6f092acba83d
msgctxt "hece8c6afg2e46g490bg9f1fg0b5bb9108745"
msgid "I wonder who - or <i>what</i> - those chains are for."
msgstr "이 사슬이 누구 혹은, <i>어떤 것</i>에게 쓰는 건지 궁금한걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinPriest_VB_Chains
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5c4dce87-86b9-940f-4e08-53da21b0ae37
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GOB_GoblinPriest_Event_FreedFromChains(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinPriest_VB_Chains:5c4dce87-86b9-940f-4e08-53da21b0ae37
msgctxt "hbb713f6cgcc6fg4a60g831bg842ebc189eb7"
msgid "Free... for now."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_GoblinThrone_PAD_NoticeScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a3df3d05-2aa3-53e0-6aa5-b33412ecf2e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
