msgctxt "h116809a2g9774g4c02g93bagc22dfbfacc84"
msgid ""
"Curious. At least we won't have to dig through fur and entrails for our "
"spoils."
msgstr "흥미롭군. 적어도 털이랑 동물 내장은 뒤지지 않아도 되겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_Halsin_PAD_HalsinDead
