msgctxt "h0044b7e9g17b6g4e69g97f1g6dc779f62def"
msgid ""
"A magic-user, disguised as a bear. I'd better take a closer look at that "
"corpse."
msgstr "곰으로 변장한 마법 시전자였군. 저 시체를 더 자세히 살펴보는 게 좋겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_Halsin_PAD_HalsinDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0f9e0843-21fd-445e-8a78-f2785e66e777
