msgctxt "h7dcb10bcg7e91g405ag8f0fgb315253d4074"
msgid ""
"That was no bear - that was shapeshifter magic. I need to look at the "
"remains."
msgstr "저건 곰이 아니었어, 형상변환 마법이었군. 시체를 살펴봐야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_Halsin_PAD_HalsinDead
