msgctxt "he04f2aceg6247g4de7g9acfgdbb11223fd73"
msgid "Wait... he was no true bear. I need to see that corpse."
msgstr "잠깐... 그는 진짜 곰이 아니었군. 시체를 살펴봐야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_Halsin_PAD_HalsinDead
