msgctxt "h39112610gd39fg420cg971eg0d6c1ebea708"
msgid ""
"That living bear just changed into a dead elf - better take a closer look."
msgstr "살아있던 곰이 죽은 엘프로 변했군, 자세히 살펴봐야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_Halsin_PAD_HalsinDead
