msgctxt "h5ad17baag0aa5g4976gb177g78a4774c04cb"
msgid ""
"Wildshape... that was no ordinary bear - that was a druid. Need to see the "
"corpse."
msgstr "야생 형상이라... 저건 평범한 곰이 아니야, 드루이드였군. 그의 시체를 살펴봐야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_Halsin_PAD_HalsinDead
