msgctxt "hdba5df9dg0208g4ff9gbe67g9dba40c37ece"
msgid ""
"Sorry, Halsin. We tried. If you've got something to say, you'll have to say "
"it from the great beyond now."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_Halsin_PAD_HalsinDead
