msgctxt "h5a076acfg0b6bg43a3gaf47g6a63452b2365"
msgid "Her patronage couldn't spare this place from goblins, clearly. Heh."
msgstr "그녀의 후원도 이곳을 고블린으로부터 지켜주진 못했나 보네. 흥."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_ShadowHeart_VB_Mural
