msgctxt "he9a1fd81g3e1bg410dgbc87g0ad4490f4942"
msgid "Selûne markings. She was once worshipped here."
msgstr "셀루네의 상징이야. 이곳에서 한때 그녀를 섬겼었나 보네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_ShadowHeart_VB_Mural
