msgctxt "h928cff90g6f93g48abga529gd2e3c647164e"
msgid ""
"Heretic idolatry everywhere... surely there can't be a temple of Shar here."
msgstr "끔찍한 우상들 투성이야... 이곳에 샤님의 사원이 있을 리가 없겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_ShadowHeart_VB_Temple
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = c410bd7d-8417-d4e0-0646-d0af898a9ed9
