msgctxt "hf9319cdag326cg4e5agb33fg88b6d24346a0"
msgid "More Selûne idolatry. No sign of her followers though."
msgstr "셀루네의 우상이 더 있어. 하지만 그녀의 추종자들은 흔적조차 없네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_TempleAccess_PAD_SolvedPuzzle
