msgid "Huh. This goes very far down. We'll have to go in to see the bottom."
msgstr "허. 깊게 내려가는군. 아래를 보려면 더 들어가야 할 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_TempleAccess_PuzzleApproach_ReadInstructions_VB
