msgid "Hm. These pictographs were described in the dwarf's poem."
msgstr "흠, 드워프의 시에서 묘사된 그림들이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_TempleAccess_PuzzleApproach_VB
