msgid ""
"Stars and the full moon... is this what that dwarf's poem was talking about?"
msgstr "별과 보름달...드워프의 시에 써져 있던 말과 같은 걸까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_TempleAccess_PuzzleApproach_VB
