msgid "Moving plates and symbols that match the dwarf's poem. Interesting."
msgstr "드워프의 시와 일치하는 상징들과 회전하는 석판이라. 흥미롭군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_TempleAccess_PuzzleApproach_VB
