msgctxt "h49102e80g4befg47a6g8638g4094b4edede6"
msgid "These plates can be rotated. Most likely for a reason."
msgstr "이 석판들은 회전 시킬 수 있을 거 같아. 분명 이유가 있을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_TempleAccess_PuzzleApproach_VB
