msgctxt "h10c72c63g2fb1g460ega718g0fce06981b10"
msgid "Rotating plates? Might as well give them a turn."
msgstr "회전하는 석판이라? 일단 한번 돌려 볼까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_TempleAccess_PuzzleApproach_VB
