msgctxt "hd20455f4gcde6g4c84g9613g8b65740854e9"
msgid "Rotating plates. What might these pictographs signify?"
msgstr "회전하는 석판이야. 이 상징들이 의미하는 게 대체 뭘까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Goblin/VBs/GOB_TempleAccess_PuzzleApproach_VB
