#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hefbe9cb3g73ffg42b4gba15g5bf751624194"
msgid ""
"There were claws at work here. Magic too. Hallmarks of a druid. Our friend "
"Halsin must have been rather keen to return to his grove."
msgstr "발톱으로 빚어낸 현장이로군. 마법도 쓰였어. 드루이드의 특징이지. 우리 친구 할신이 격렬히 숲으로 돌아가고 싶었던 모양이야."

