msgctxt "hf2a05449ge5acg4927gba06g1b960e361544"
msgid ""
"Someone eviscerated these gobs. Had to be the druid, right? And now he'll be "
"on his way back to the grove."
msgstr "누군가 고블린들을 찢어버렸네. 드루이드가 한 것 같지? 그럼 지금쯤 숲으로 돌아가고 있겠어."

