#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_BetrayedAstarion:367e2346-2a4e-488e-9d14-337e70911d0e
msgctxt "h84a5ac4bgc473g4543g9708ga0f21c03d90f"
msgid "I guess it was safer in the long run... but still. <i>Our leech.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_BetrayedAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 367e2346-2a4e-488e-9d14-337e70911d0e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_BetrayedAstarion:367e2346-2a4e-488e-9d14-337e70911d0e
msgctxt "hf1f4951cg55f4g460fgb920g8eb53293cbcd"
msgid ""
"Having a vampire in our midsts will only end in betrayal. I merely took the "
"initiative."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_BetrayedAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 367e2346-2a4e-488e-9d14-337e70911d0e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_BetrayedAstarion:367e2346-2a4e-488e-9d14-337e70911d0e
msgctxt "hcfaecc96g0f62g4603gb70cg815a6ad0c8d4"
msgid ""
"He's too dangerous to have around. We'd always be sleeping with one eye open."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_BetrayedAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8f00097b-bb05-4c74-811d-515acebfce52
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(1) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_BetrayedAstarion:8f00097b-bb05-4c74-811d-515acebfce52
msgctxt "h063bc4a2ga8a6g4e2dgada0g142b06e5d1f3"
msgid ""
"I - I can't blame you for giving him up. Vampires are monsters, by any "
"account."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_BetrayedAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8f00097b-bb05-4c74-811d-515acebfce52
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(1) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_BetrayedAstarion:8f00097b-bb05-4c74-811d-515acebfce52
msgctxt "h41558ba5g7badg4eabgb2fcgdc4c74cf8f02"
msgid ""
"Vampire spawn or not, I'm surprised you actually surrendered Astarion like "
"that..."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_BetrayedAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8f00097b-bb05-4c74-811d-515acebfce52
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(1) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_BetrayedAstarion:8f00097b-bb05-4c74-811d-515acebfce52
msgctxt "h5dd9f017g5cd2g46beg8543g261282f645e4"
msgid "I find few things delightful. Your surrender of Astarion is among them."
msgstr "나에게는 기쁜 일이 별로 없다. 네가 아스타리온을 넘긴 것은 그 기쁜 일 중 한 가지다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_BetrayedAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8f00097b-bb05-4c74-811d-515acebfce52
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(1) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_BetrayedAstarion:8f00097b-bb05-4c74-811d-515acebfce52
msgctxt "h84e324f5gb679g4c84gad97g396404f4ffa1"
msgid ""
"I get why you did it. But I'm not totally sure it was right. He was <i>our "
"</i>leech."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_BetrayedAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8f00097b-bb05-4c74-811d-515acebfce52
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(1) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_BetrayedAstarion:8f00097b-bb05-4c74-811d-515acebfce52
msgctxt "h9265c411gdbe8g4d0ag9fcagc08364fc1c98"
msgid ""
"Easy as that, is it? I hope you wouldn't give the rest of us up so easily."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_BetrayedAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8f00097b-bb05-4c74-811d-515acebfce52
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(1) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_BetrayedAstarion:8f00097b-bb05-4c74-811d-515acebfce52
msgctxt "hb9def755g4caeg430agb710g74914feaffa8"
msgid "You gave him up? I wasn't sure you would."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_ProtectedAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c2ff6bac-69d5-41df-8582-adae9bf91f09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_ProtectedAstarion:c2ff6bac-69d5-41df-8582-adae9bf91f09
msgctxt "h589c4360g0f36g4a5eg8fa9g411b539346d8"
msgid ""
"Let's hope he keeps his fangs to himself. I enjoy a good meal, unless I'm "
"the main course."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_ProtectedAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c2ff6bac-69d5-41df-8582-adae9bf91f09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_ProtectedAstarion:c2ff6bac-69d5-41df-8582-adae9bf91f09
msgctxt "hf567aaceg7e6dg4b59g921cgd88ccf582251"
msgid "If he outlives his usefulness, you can dispose of him as you wish."
msgstr "그가 쓸모 없어지면, 원하는 대로 처분해도 좋다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_ProtectedAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c2ff6bac-69d5-41df-8582-adae9bf91f09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_ProtectedAstarion:c2ff6bac-69d5-41df-8582-adae9bf91f09
msgctxt "he097722dge67eg47eeg98f8g6f5e650a4579"
msgid "He's not without his uses - as long as we can keep him in line."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_ProtectedAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c2ff6bac-69d5-41df-8582-adae9bf91f09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_ProtectedAstarion:c2ff6bac-69d5-41df-8582-adae9bf91f09
msgctxt "hca853a49gbd40g4f17gadcag5474bb49fbd2"
msgid "I'm sure our little leech will return the favour. Right?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_ProtectedAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c2ff6bac-69d5-41df-8582-adae9bf91f09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_ProtectedAstarion:c2ff6bac-69d5-41df-8582-adae9bf91f09
msgctxt "hd1d24134g0185g49ffgbe45gae5f883c86e3"
msgid ""
"We should judge him by his actions, not his teeth. Unless his teeth are the "
"source of the action, of course..."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_ProtectedAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c2ff6bac-69d5-41df-8582-adae9bf91f09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_ProtectedAstarion:c2ff6bac-69d5-41df-8582-adae9bf91f09
msgctxt "h654c6ad6gf527g42d3gbc87g8b74b7116f9d"
msgid "Let's hope it doesn't come back to bite me later."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_ProtectedAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cb7513f0-5578-4f1a-ae54-e0cbb71f9b5c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(1) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_ProtectedAstarion:cb7513f0-5578-4f1a-ae54-e0cbb71f9b5c
msgctxt "h86d7bc9dg4ad9g4285gb5e8g62712c3ffe7e"
msgid ""
"You stood by an ally - can't fault you for that. But a vampire among us? It "
"doesn't sit right."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_ProtectedAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cb7513f0-5578-4f1a-ae54-e0cbb71f9b5c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(1) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_ProtectedAstarion:cb7513f0-5578-4f1a-ae54-e0cbb71f9b5c
msgctxt "h48fcf79ag9907g4874g9925gf193b69138cd"
msgid ""
"Speaking truthfully, I'm a little surprised you chose to shield Astarion."
msgstr "솔직히 말하면, 네가 아스타리온 편을 들어서 놀랐어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_ProtectedAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cb7513f0-5578-4f1a-ae54-e0cbb71f9b5c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(1) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_ProtectedAstarion:cb7513f0-5578-4f1a-ae54-e0cbb71f9b5c
msgctxt "h2719cbf7g4606g447egb15bgbd25f2d5bc19"
msgid "A sage choice - Astarion's skills serve us well."
msgstr "현명한 선택이다. 아스타리온의 기술은 우리에게 큰 도움이 되니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_ProtectedAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cb7513f0-5578-4f1a-ae54-e0cbb71f9b5c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(1) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_ProtectedAstarion:cb7513f0-5578-4f1a-ae54-e0cbb71f9b5c
msgctxt "h93462d53gbf51g4a6bgb954g1aac1fa37646"
msgid "Well done, soldier. Solidarity keeps the troop together."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_ProtectedAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cb7513f0-5578-4f1a-ae54-e0cbb71f9b5c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(1) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_ProtectedAstarion:cb7513f0-5578-4f1a-ae54-e0cbb71f9b5c
msgctxt "hee6e0477gf232g4e8dg975fgcbe29b734e5a"
msgid ""
"How thoroughly invigorating it is to stand by one's friend in the face of "
"danger."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_ProtectedAstarion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cb7513f0-5578-4f1a-ae54-e0cbb71f9b5c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(1) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_GurHunter_PAD_ProtectedAstarion:cb7513f0-5578-4f1a-ae54-e0cbb71f9b5c
msgctxt "h64d80e96g426dg4e6cg8247g70605dcb0615"
msgid "You protected a child-stealing vampire? Bold choice."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_HagAmbush_PAD_SidedHag
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ad85a5ae-1194-495f-937b-a23cc94944c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_HagAmbush_PAD_SidedHag:ad85a5ae-1194-495f-937b-a23cc94944c2
msgctxt "h166d9572g95c0g4a3dg89b8g416c6d2a680e"
msgid ""
"'Helpless old biddy' - a classic routine. I'm kicking myself for not seeing "
"through it."
msgstr "'힘없는 할머니', 고전적인 연기야. 그걸 간과한 내 스스로를 자책하고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_HagAmbush_PAD_SidedHag
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ad85a5ae-1194-495f-937b-a23cc94944c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_HagAmbush_PAD_SidedHag:ad85a5ae-1194-495f-937b-a23cc94944c2
msgctxt "h59da1f3ag0b57g45f6g85dag2537487e462f"
msgid "I haven't spent much time with helpless old ladies. Was that normal?"
msgstr "나는 힘없는 할머니들과 많은 시간을 보낸 적이 없어. 방금 그 할머니는 정상인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_HagAmbush_PAD_SidedHag
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ad85a5ae-1194-495f-937b-a23cc94944c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_HagAmbush_PAD_SidedHag:ad85a5ae-1194-495f-937b-a23cc94944c2
msgctxt "hf7fa64d7g51f1g4eabga736g86410579a77e"
msgid "Magic? Ethel's less helpless than she made out. I don't trust her."
msgstr "마법인가? 에델은 자기가 주장한 만큼 약하지 않아. 난 그녀를 못 믿겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_HagAmbush_PAD_SidedHag
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ad85a5ae-1194-495f-937b-a23cc94944c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_HagAmbush_PAD_SidedHag:ad85a5ae-1194-495f-937b-a23cc94944c2
msgctxt "h04fbe8a4g6444g48c1g8f61gf0c0997d8a79"
msgid "Gone in a wink. I suspect we've been played for fools."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_HagAmbush_PAD_SidedHag
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ad85a5ae-1194-495f-937b-a23cc94944c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_HagAmbush_PAD_SidedHag:ad85a5ae-1194-495f-937b-a23cc94944c2
msgctxt "he92eb200ga52cg4852ga1a6g50c35559af3e"
msgid "Hang on. Did she fool us?!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_HagAmbush_PAD_SidedHag
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ad85a5ae-1194-495f-937b-a23cc94944c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_HagAmbush_PAD_SidedHag:ad85a5ae-1194-495f-937b-a23cc94944c2
msgctxt "hc039263fg11cdg47afga1e1g4f074d03978d"
msgid ""
"You know, I think there's a little something more to Ethel than meets the "
"eye."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_HagAmbush_PAD_SidedHag
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ad85a5ae-1194-495f-937b-a23cc94944c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_HagAmbush_PAD_SidedHag:ad85a5ae-1194-495f-937b-a23cc94944c2
msgctxt "hea4c1911ge354g49ceg8bf3g8bcf6fb278c3"
msgid "Bloody way to end an argument. I hope we chose the right side."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_HagAmbush_PAD_SidedHag
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b2cd099f-1ec3-4003-87f3-59f59cf43b86
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_HagAmbush_PAD_SidedHag:b2cd099f-1ec3-4003-87f3-59f59cf43b86
msgctxt "h0d1c7650g3175g41e7gb2adg851c9e538738"
msgid "I reckon the sister's in trouble. We need to pay Ethel a visit."
msgstr "그 여동생이 곤경에 처해 있을 거야. 에텔을 한번 찾아가봐야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_HagAmbush_PAD_SidedHag
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b2cd099f-1ec3-4003-87f3-59f59cf43b86
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_HagAmbush_PAD_SidedHag:b2cd099f-1ec3-4003-87f3-59f59cf43b86
msgctxt "h75e54735gfd76g4b45g83b9g993d250d01fd"
msgid ""
"Ethel is dangerous, if the brothers spoke true. Perhaps we should pay a "
"visit."
msgstr "두 형제가 한 말이 사실이라면, 에텔은 위험한 인물이야. 어쩌면 우리가 한번 찾아가봐야 할지도."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_HagAmbush_PAD_SidedHag
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b2cd099f-1ec3-4003-87f3-59f59cf43b86
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_HagAmbush_PAD_SidedHag:b2cd099f-1ec3-4003-87f3-59f59cf43b86
msgctxt "h513f2dd8gbb25g4cf7g9bfbg8e8dc4a38228"
msgid ""
"We probably gave those two idiots an easier death than whatever she had "
"planned for them."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_HagAmbush_PAD_SidedHag
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b2cd099f-1ec3-4003-87f3-59f59cf43b86
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_HagAmbush_PAD_SidedHag:b2cd099f-1ec3-4003-87f3-59f59cf43b86
msgctxt "h37bb7e7ag3f9eg49b7g882bg1b1bd5093156"
msgid ""
"I'd be happy to be wrong, but she makes my skin crawl. Watch yourself around "
"her."
msgstr "내가 틀렸으면 다행이지만, 그 여자는 내 피부를 소름 돋게 만들어. 그녀에게 다가갈 땐 조심해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_HagAmbush_PAD_SidedHag
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b2cd099f-1ec3-4003-87f3-59f59cf43b86
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_HagAmbush_PAD_SidedHag:b2cd099f-1ec3-4003-87f3-59f59cf43b86
msgctxt "h528fd62agc20eg495eg81c8g84ff3b2b53d8"
msgid ""
"We got hagged. And it sounds like that sister of theirs might've been, too."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_HagAmbush_PAD_SidedHag
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b2cd099f-1ec3-4003-87f3-59f59cf43b86
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_HagAmbush_PAD_SidedHag:b2cd099f-1ec3-4003-87f3-59f59cf43b86
msgctxt "hcfa3586bg5098g4b17g8c59gd370ddb56bd2"
msgid ""
"'Hag' is the word they used. If that's what she really is, she's beyond "
"dangerous."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_HagAmbush_PAD_SidedHag
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b2cd099f-1ec3-4003-87f3-59f59cf43b86
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_HagAmbush_PAD_SidedHag:b2cd099f-1ec3-4003-87f3-59f59cf43b86
msgctxt "h0f7d4c3ag2d37g44d0ga6e7ge40168f86aea"
msgid "No point in debating what's already done. Let's go on ahead."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_Hag_PAD_TadpoleDivine
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a8287e5d-36f4-487c-a11e-c8a25006c407
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_Hag_PAD_TadpoleDivine:a8287e5d-36f4-487c-a11e-c8a25006c407
msgctxt "hd2df78a1gc575g46cfgb42bg3631030ffa82"
msgid "Something tells me our little passengers won't be so easy to evict."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_Hag_PAD_TadpoleDivine
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a8287e5d-36f4-487c-a11e-c8a25006c407
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_Hag_PAD_TadpoleDivine:a8287e5d-36f4-487c-a11e-c8a25006c407
msgctxt "h29de725cg4419g4a4dg9384g2a5c5f7793bd"
msgid ""
"The <i>ghaik</i> leave nothing to chance - and neither should we. We stay "
"our course."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_Hag_PAD_TadpoleDivine
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a8287e5d-36f4-487c-a11e-c8a25006c407
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_Hag_PAD_TadpoleDivine:a8287e5d-36f4-487c-a11e-c8a25006c407
msgctxt "h47dea14dgdeb5g4f1ag8b63g01ad5fca5e96"
msgid ""
"It must be powerful magic to stop the parasite in its tracks. I wonder what "
"else it could do?"
msgstr "기생충을 멈추려면 강력한 마법이 필요할 거야. 달리 어떤 마법을 쓸 수 있겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_Hag_PAD_TadpoleDivine
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a8287e5d-36f4-487c-a11e-c8a25006c407
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_Hag_PAD_TadpoleDivine:a8287e5d-36f4-487c-a11e-c8a25006c407
msgctxt "h56694307g14d4g4940g94e3gb4ab113ebe02"
msgid ""
"We need to keep looking for a way to get rid of these things - they've "
"overstayed their welcome as it is."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_Hag_PAD_TadpoleDivine
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a8287e5d-36f4-487c-a11e-c8a25006c407
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_Hag_PAD_TadpoleDivine:a8287e5d-36f4-487c-a11e-c8a25006c407
msgctxt "ha768eca7g927fg4de8g917fgc4e87378eeb6"
msgid "Guess this thing's going to take special treatment to evict."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_Hag_PAD_TadpoleDivine
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a8287e5d-36f4-487c-a11e-c8a25006c407
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_Hag_PAD_TadpoleDivine:a8287e5d-36f4-487c-a11e-c8a25006c407
msgctxt "h1d175a73gb78eg4bfbgbb70gdc793fc47cdd"
msgid ""
"The parasite is somehow infused with Netherese magic - more powerful, more "
"sinister than it has any right to be. We must find out how."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_Hag_PAD_TadpoleDivine
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a8287e5d-36f4-487c-a11e-c8a25006c407
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_Hag_PAD_TadpoleDivine:a8287e5d-36f4-487c-a11e-c8a25006c407
msgctxt "h72328dd9g2c88g4b3bgb2b8gf05912e976af"
msgid ""
"Tampered or not, we need to get these things out of our heads. Let's find "
"another way."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_Hag_PAD_TadpoleDivine
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cc3498d8-d515-48b7-8257-c6926c3aee7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_Hag_PAD_TadpoleDivine:cc3498d8-d515-48b7-8257-c6926c3aee7c
msgctxt "h6d662117gb818g4f27g83c6g9f4d2a401eb0"
msgid "The tadpole is tainted? That can't be good. Or... can it?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_Hag_PAD_TadpoleDivine
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cc3498d8-d515-48b7-8257-c6926c3aee7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_Hag_PAD_TadpoleDivine:cc3498d8-d515-48b7-8257-c6926c3aee7c
msgctxt "h2a570138gf3ebg4309g8056g6e13d46fada8"
msgid ""
"It's not enough to have a worm slither into my eye, it has to be cursed with "
"dark magic too."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_Hag_PAD_TadpoleDivine
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cc3498d8-d515-48b7-8257-c6926c3aee7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_Hag_PAD_TadpoleDivine:cc3498d8-d515-48b7-8257-c6926c3aee7c
msgctxt "h35c646cfge549g4d34g89eag3e0e48272dc4"
msgid "Bad enough to have a tadpole, never mind one that's been tampered with."
msgstr "머리에 올챙이가 있다는 사실도 나쁜데, 그게 조작되기까지 했다면 말할 것도 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_Hag_PAD_TadpoleDivine
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cc3498d8-d515-48b7-8257-c6926c3aee7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_Hag_PAD_TadpoleDivine:cc3498d8-d515-48b7-8257-c6926c3aee7c
msgctxt "h210b6a4ag2777g4b0egb488g733dde57ddb9"
msgid ""
"The tadpole is tainted? This might explain the unusual course of the "
"infection..."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_Hag_PAD_TadpoleDivine
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cc3498d8-d515-48b7-8257-c6926c3aee7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_Hag_PAD_TadpoleDivine:cc3498d8-d515-48b7-8257-c6926c3aee7c
msgctxt "hd49b9289gac43g4253g8418g297483383e97"
msgid "And I thought the tadpole was bad enough on its own."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_Hag_PAD_TadpoleDivine
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cc3498d8-d515-48b7-8257-c6926c3aee7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_Hag_PAD_TadpoleDivine:cc3498d8-d515-48b7-8257-c6926c3aee7c
msgctxt "h41d4e476g0c68g486fgb5cfg3b97a61fdf27"
msgid ""
"Netherese. A portentous word. Combine it with mind flayers, and it's... "
"unspeakable. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_Hag_PAD_TadpoleDivine
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cc3498d8-d515-48b7-8257-c6926c3aee7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HAG/HAG_Hag_PAD_TadpoleDivine:cc3498d8-d515-48b7-8257-c6926c3aee7c
msgctxt "hda171501gc7d4g4663ga1e7g8727b016b8a4"
msgid "The tadpole was tampered with? That complicates things..."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Campsite_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 279c7577-1b33-5185-1729-2f31a9a428d1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Campsite_PAD:279c7577-1b33-5185-1729-2f31a9a428d1
msgctxt "h45ea9c42g593bg422cgb66fg82c161cb1c23"
msgid "Looks like we missed all the fun."
msgstr "우리가 재미를 놓쳤나본데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Campsite_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 279c7577-1b33-5185-1729-2f31a9a428d1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Campsite_PAD:279c7577-1b33-5185-1729-2f31a9a428d1
msgctxt "h317bfd7cgf03fg49cega671g49fcfe05bc8b"
msgid "Blood... I don't like where this is going."
msgstr "피야... 좋지 않은걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Campsite_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 279c7577-1b33-5185-1729-2f31a9a428d1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Campsite_PAD:279c7577-1b33-5185-1729-2f31a9a428d1
msgctxt "h3dcad7c0g73a0g4d62ga59dgdac61a896599"
msgid "Someone had a party here. Or some <i>thing.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Campsite_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 279c7577-1b33-5185-1729-2f31a9a428d1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Campsite_PAD:279c7577-1b33-5185-1729-2f31a9a428d1
msgctxt "h5211beb1gc829g482cg9fe4gc674148da8e8"
msgid "A bloodbath. Someone - some<i>thing</i> - made quick work of the place."
msgstr "피바다로군. 누군가, 아니면 <i>무언가</i>가 여길 간단히 박살내놨어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Campsite_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 279c7577-1b33-5185-1729-2f31a9a428d1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Campsite_PAD:279c7577-1b33-5185-1729-2f31a9a428d1
msgctxt "h1c646d9dgf979g4ecaga2d6g7d18851d2ed1"
msgid ""
"Blood everywhere. Someone wasn't as fortunate in their choice of campsite as "
"us."
msgstr "사방에 혈흔이 있어. 야영지를 고르는 데 있어 우리만큼 운이 좋진 않았나 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Campsite_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 279c7577-1b33-5185-1729-2f31a9a428d1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Campsite_PAD:279c7577-1b33-5185-1729-2f31a9a428d1
msgctxt "h3f03357fg1743g4805g9114gcbfb41932fea"
msgid "Blood everywhere. Something made a mess of this place."
msgstr "사방에 피야. 뭔가가 이곳을 헤집어놨어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Campsite_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 279c7577-1b33-5185-1729-2f31a9a428d1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Campsite_PAD:279c7577-1b33-5185-1729-2f31a9a428d1
msgctxt "h3ec1e619g97b5g43f5g9207gc8e46e21213b"
msgid "Blood everywhere. This camp was ambushed."
msgstr "피바다야. 이 야영지는 습격당했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Campsite_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 717d9e29-ef18-e080-75f2-56a43b8bfebe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Campsite_PAD:717d9e29-ef18-e080-75f2-56a43b8bfebe
msgctxt "h219f4f7ag594cg4d35gbbbbgca3fc0b48da4"
msgid "Well, someone had some fun."
msgstr "흠, 누가 파티를 했나봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Campsite_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 717d9e29-ef18-e080-75f2-56a43b8bfebe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Campsite_PAD:717d9e29-ef18-e080-75f2-56a43b8bfebe
msgctxt "h4c819e4fg88a7g4089g9c47gdaea8532228c"
msgid "Blood... I don't like where this is going."
msgstr "피야... 좋지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Campsite_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 717d9e29-ef18-e080-75f2-56a43b8bfebe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Campsite_PAD:717d9e29-ef18-e080-75f2-56a43b8bfebe
msgctxt "hcedd8fcdg5d85g4456ga632g9ad1b590a04b"
msgid "Looks like someone ran through this place like a hook horror."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Campsite_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 717d9e29-ef18-e080-75f2-56a43b8bfebe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Campsite_PAD:717d9e29-ef18-e080-75f2-56a43b8bfebe
msgctxt "h0db234d4g41c1g4e21g91f6g75789e140ed6"
msgid "A bloodbath. Someone - some<i>thing</i> - made quick work of this camp."
msgstr "피바다로군. 누군가, 아니면 <i>무언가</i>가 야영지를 간단히 박살내놨어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Campsite_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 717d9e29-ef18-e080-75f2-56a43b8bfebe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Campsite_PAD:717d9e29-ef18-e080-75f2-56a43b8bfebe
msgctxt "h1360bf6bg4a01g44dfg9164g9705a9d5b8c5"
msgid "Unlucky choice of campsite, judging by all the blood."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Campsite_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 717d9e29-ef18-e080-75f2-56a43b8bfebe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Campsite_PAD:717d9e29-ef18-e080-75f2-56a43b8bfebe
msgctxt "h7459e229g3033g455dg9980gd57e31547ff3"
msgid "Blood everywhere. Something made a mess of this camp."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Campsite_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 717d9e29-ef18-e080-75f2-56a43b8bfebe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Campsite_PAD:717d9e29-ef18-e080-75f2-56a43b8bfebe
msgctxt "h41c82bb2ge5aag4f1fgabd2g8ee21caa1956"
msgid "Blood everywhere. This camp was ambushed."
msgstr "피바다야. 이 야영지는 습격당했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Campsite_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bbb2cb67-0f37-9ffc-01b1-aeedd0039823
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Campsite_PAD:bbb2cb67-0f37-9ffc-01b1-aeedd0039823
msgctxt "haeadd1d3ga8a6g48f9g8eb2gbd2a5193cc7b"
msgid "Redcaps, no doubt. Wasteful creatures."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Campsite_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bbb2cb67-0f37-9ffc-01b1-aeedd0039823
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Campsite_PAD:bbb2cb67-0f37-9ffc-01b1-aeedd0039823
msgctxt "h4b2e9470gec64g474bg9788gb7705a295324"
msgid ""
"This is the work of redcaps - vicious by nature. They could already be "
"hunting us..."
msgstr "이건 레드캡의 소행이야. 본성이 사악한 놈들이지. 우리를 이미 쫓고 있을 수도 있어..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Campsite_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bbb2cb67-0f37-9ffc-01b1-aeedd0039823
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Campsite_PAD:bbb2cb67-0f37-9ffc-01b1-aeedd0039823
msgctxt "h20969915g1e4cg4befg91a0gf089f4ffb345"
msgid "Or... redcaps. Vicious things."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Campsite_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bbb2cb67-0f37-9ffc-01b1-aeedd0039823
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
