msgid "What kind of botched portal brought something like you here?"
msgstr "어떤 망가진 차원문에서 너 따위 것이 나왔을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_AD_ViciousMockery
