msgctxt "hd5a1f1bcg9399g46d1g9b4bg23deaec56aec"
msgid "Can't wait to throw a collar on your neck and make you my familiar."
msgstr "어서 빨리 네 목에 목줄을 걸어 애완동물로 삼고 싶구나."

