msgctxt "h40a75c01ge77bg43efg8a21g8f8c125f00b1"
msgid "A toad with a tadpole! How fitting."
msgstr "올챙이 품은 두꺼비라니! 참 잘 어울리는구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_AD_ViciousMockery
