msgctxt "h0729489fge81fg4d92g932fgaeb28111beab"
msgid "Deep down, you like being leashed, don't you?"
msgstr "사실은, 목줄 달리는 거 좋아하잖아, 그렇지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_AD_ViciousMockery
