msgctxt "hde591757g69f2g49ecg902eg7a44d7401618"
msgid "Is there still rat stuck in your teeth, slave?"
msgstr "아직도 이빨에 먹다 남은 쥐가 박혀있니, 노예야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_AD_VictimSign_001
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 64568efe-5edc-c83a-c885-b7028d9bd212
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_AD_VictimSign_001:64568efe-5edc-c83a-c885-b7028d9bd212
msgctxt "hb18b6edcgf56fg4970gababgbed59d0301b3"
msgid ""
"'My dearest Efrin. He begged me to halt the deadly disease that ravaged him.'"
msgstr "'우리 에프린. 자신을 좀먹고 있는 치명적인 질병을 멈춰달라고 간청했어.'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_AD_VictimSign_002
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 6765ecb7-b44e-79b0-c9c3-ca978abf3552
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_AD_VictimSign_002:6765ecb7-b44e-79b0-c9c3-ca978abf3552
msgctxt "h268bc383g4574g4a72ga9e2g4aa927e734ae"
msgid ""
"'My darling Magron. She wished for the mind of a genius, but the silly head "
"crossed me.'"
msgstr "'우리 사랑스런 마그론. 천재의 지성을 원했지만, 그 어리석은 머리가 나를 거슬리게 했다.'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_AD_VictimSign_003
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 14c09861-202f-e36f-7c1d-f8b2dd55d47a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_AD_VictimSign_003:14c09861-202f-e36f-7c1d-f8b2dd55d47a
msgctxt "h8d67a9e4g6706g4f3ega21dg6bad701ef003"
msgid "'My gentle Lorin. He wished to know what was to come.'"
msgstr "'우리 상냥한 로린. 앞으로 일어날 일을 알고 싶어했지.'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_AD_VictimSign_004
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = cd9305ab-fc47-a0c3-7477-884307b1123d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_AD_VictimSign_004:cd9305ab-fc47-a0c3-7477-884307b1123d
msgctxt "hba674f2dgda40g4aabg8348g57032137e3a2"
msgid "'My sweet Calim, whose beloved asked that his beauty never fade.'"
msgstr "'우리 어여쁜 칼림샨인은 아리따운 외모가 영원히 스러지지 않게 해달라고 빌었단다.'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_AD_VictimSign_005
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 8237247b-f5f5-ca2d-75bc-313f7349afcf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_AD_VictimSign_005:8237247b-f5f5-ca2d-75bc-313f7349afcf
msgctxt "h73b81f15ge762g4257g91a1g11d8148e506c"
msgid "'This poor dear wished never to lay eyes on her family again.'"
msgstr "'이 불쌍한 것은 다시는 가족과 눈도 마주치지 않게 해달라고 빌었지.'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_AD_VictimSign_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = c4212595-9b60-52bc-8fc1-ca519f482515
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_AD_VictimSign_TalkingDoor:c4212595-9b60-52bc-8fc1-ca519f482515
msgctxt "h1e948fd5g6147g4353g9e5cgacecadf497e9"
msgid ""
"'A thief who tried to steal from Auntie. Now the good little pet guards my "
"home.'"
msgstr "'이모의 물건을 훔치려고 한 도둑이란다. 지금은 작고 착한 애완동물이 돼서 내 집을 지키고 있지.'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_AD_Victim_003
#. Speaker = Lorin
#. NodeID = 1d0b49d3-fc6a-d496-1121-0675036186c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - ff61af63-8688-c30b-3d2e-316a9abf612d_A = True
#.      - ff61af63-8688-c30b-3d2e-316a9abf612d_B = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - ff61af63-8688-c30b-3d2e-316a9abf612d_B = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_AD_Victim_003:1d0b49d3-fc6a-d496-1121-0675036186c9
msgctxt "he3ea7c73g4a33g483fgb8e4g66bec911c46e"
msgid "Don't. Look. Don't."
msgstr "보지 마. 보지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_AD_Victim_003
#. Speaker = Lorin
#. NodeID = 3b7c74dd-bbbe-1ebf-66a5-75902f65fa38
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - ff61af63-8688-c30b-3d2e-316a9abf612d_A = False
#.      - ff61af63-8688-c30b-3d2e-316a9abf612d_B = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - ff61af63-8688-c30b-3d2e-316a9abf612d_A = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_AD_Victim_003:3b7c74dd-bbbe-1ebf-66a5-75902f65fa38
msgctxt "h4bc0c1a5gcebag4b42g858fg85856c110e8c"
msgid "Away. AWAY."
msgstr "저리가. <b>저리가</b>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_AD_Victim_003
#. Speaker = Lorin
#. NodeID = cd92ecfe-e46f-6206-9f9b-60bd0b78cdad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - ff61af63-8688-c30b-3d2e-316a9abf612d_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - ff61af63-8688-c30b-3d2e-316a9abf612d_A = False
#.     - ff61af63-8688-c30b-3d2e-316a9abf612d_B = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_AD_Victim_003:cd92ecfe-e46f-6206-9f9b-60bd0b78cdad
msgctxt "h8fc5e0b6gc610g4556g920cg96592de78974"
msgid "Stop. Please. PLEASE."
msgstr "그만해. 제발. <b>제발</b>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_ControlledByMask
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 0949e0e9-21a4-4582-9c5b-b03ab2cec094
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(6) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_ControlledByMask:0949e0e9-21a4-4582-9c5b-b03ab2cec094
msgctxt "h19fc5cf7g478fg4f4cg9fd0g6e88e2cc8e73"
msgid "Holy hells - get that thing off. <i>Now!</i>"
msgstr "이런 망할 - 그거 벗어. <i>당장!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_ControlledByMask
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 2617ce69-614b-4492-8827-efca5fc567bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_ControlledByMask:2617ce69-614b-4492-8827-efca5fc567bf
msgctxt "h6aa07c1agc9f6g403bg8b91gdf521f13ae08"
msgid "I'm in your head now, sweetie. And I'm not going <i>anywhere</i>."
msgstr "난 네 머릿속에 있단다, 아가야. 그리고 <i>아무데도</i>가지 않을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_ControlledByMask
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 2d61d1f3-cf03-4a0d-bc7f-787d575fb5f1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom2(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(6) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_ControlledByMask:2d61d1f3-cf03-4a0d-bc7f-787d575fb5f1
msgctxt "h7b8b8a1bg42fcg4a17g8119gc2b48e01c6b9"
msgid "It's the mask. <i>Get that thing off!</i>"
msgstr "가면이다. <i>그거 당장 치워!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_ControlledByMask
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 38e48c21-b5f8-7141-5977-e561cf08bd9e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - HAG_HagLair_Event_BecomeImmune(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_ControlledByMask:38e48c21-b5f8-7141-5977-e561cf08bd9e
msgctxt "h4cb9d9a6g9002g4b65ga09dg00f310859298"
msgid ""
"Bah - I don't need the mask to crack that little mind of yours like an egg. "
"See you soon<i>, petal.</i>"
msgstr "흥, 가면 따위 없이도 얼마든지 네 조그만 정신을 계란 깨듯이 부숴주지. 또 보자꾸나, <i>꽃잎아.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_ControlledByMask
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 39a7925d-e928-4587-9ce7-c2319637ce57
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(7) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_ControlledByMask:39a7925d-e928-4587-9ce7-c2319637ce57
msgctxt "h2bbc21dagc580g4ba8g9eb5g0a300ac3939b"
msgid "Gods - what are you doing? Take off that mask, right bloody now!"
msgstr "신이시여, 대체 뭐 하는 거야? 그 가면을 벗어, 지금 당장!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_ControlledByMask
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 4a8a2a2c-edf9-44c8-8b36-7c41bfcb6c15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom2(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_ControlledByMask:4a8a2a2c-edf9-44c8-8b36-7c41bfcb6c15
msgctxt "h4fdec68cg7a03g43b0g8f8fg06875dbbb93d"
msgid "The mask. Take it off - <i>right now</i>!"
msgstr "그 가면이야. 벗어버려, <i>지금 당장</i>!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_ControlledByMask
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 4bcd4b84-8152-48c7-81af-d865df551120
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom2(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_ControlledByMask:4bcd4b84-8152-48c7-81af-d865df551120
msgctxt "hbc6005eega0c7g4fedg85bdg11205b364f54"
msgid "<i>Pa'vrylk</i> - remove the mask. <i>Now!</i>"
msgstr "<i>Pa'vrylk</i> 그 가면을 벗어. <i>당장!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_ControlledByMask
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 54bf7e7c-8bc3-485f-88ae-b620a0832b17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(3) = True
