msgctxt "h309e57a8g30b8g4b80g9193g50011040f335"
msgid ""
"That pretty little eye of yours is <i>mine</i>. Did you think you could "
"sneak down here without my say so?  "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_EntranceDouble_StatusFallback
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = e7d8de7c-b697-4bc4-8268-4beea7165510
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_EntranceDouble_StatusFallback:e7d8de7c-b697-4bc4-8268-4beea7165510
msgctxt "ha96c39d5gb22bg4a4bgb68bg86609dff346e"
msgid "You are as thick as they come, sweetness."
msgstr "너는 참 머리도 둔하구나, 귀염둥아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 01fc561c-90e7-0438-c3eb-ff389b1e0412
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:01fc561c-90e7-0438-c3eb-ff389b1e0412
msgctxt "h68da3b43gc278g4b27gafb2gc236206c2311"
msgid "Hah! This should be good."
msgstr "하! 꼴좋다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 024f4adf-180d-5d0b-8b1c-4965747d861a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:024f4adf-180d-5d0b-8b1c-4965747d861a
msgctxt "h1f2aea85gf8b4g4a28g94ceg507b37cc1837"
msgid "<i>Monstrous.</i>"
msgstr "<i>금수만도 못한 자식.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 08b9ad71-f3e6-5569-559d-ef358c4d4fc6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:08b9ad71-f3e6-5569-559d-ef358c4d4fc6
msgctxt "he3ad1786g42c7g4228gb073gb46de7efe955"
msgid ""
"Deal's on, girl. And you're not leaving my side 'til you <i>deliver</i>."
msgstr "거래가 끝나지 않았잖니, 너는 내게서 벗어날 수 없을 거란다. <i>아이를 낳기 전 까진 말이다</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0a594075-35e1-6af7-d9d1-4d29524db700
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LOLTHDROWELF(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAG_Hag_State_HagTookMother = True
#.     - HAG_Hag_State_HagGaveReward = True
#.     - HAG_Hag_State_HagGivenMercy = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:0a594075-35e1-6af7-d9d1-4d29524db700
msgctxt "hf2189652g82acg47dcg8444g36969431ecce"
msgid "Such power will let me better serve the Spider Queen. Give it to me."
msgstr "그 힘으로 내가 거미 여왕을 더 잘 섬길 수 있겠지. 내놔."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 0dd97cdd-e486-c363-339d-dd549291a333
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:0dd97cdd-e486-c363-339d-dd549291a333
msgctxt "h4785c076gd39eg483egbb96gaa6b9e02dfcf"
msgid "Bye-bye, petal..."
msgstr "잘 가려무나, 꽃잎아..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 0fa10637-cd01-c64c-9b2a-b058af3a5ec5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(8) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(8) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:0fa10637-cd01-c64c-9b2a-b058af3a5ec5
msgctxt "hd203bedegf823g4f54gb84cg34a507fb601b"
msgid "I'm all for killing her, but let's get that power first, hmm?"
msgstr "죽이는 건 찬성이지만, 일단 그 힘부터 받아내자고, 응?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 1564b8c5-5f8f-f719-786b-333efc8fca79
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:1564b8c5-5f8f-f719-786b-333efc8fca79
msgctxt "hc58d6c58g2e9ag4482g9cdfga08be7bec1f2"
msgid "What... what about me?"
msgstr "잠깐만요... 저는 어쩌고요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 16b7ec77-4b55-d9a7-a64c-fb37d55f9dc5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:16b7ec77-4b55-d9a7-a64c-fb37d55f9dc5
msgctxt "h1e10be94gb6bfg45bcg8ef3ge91e9511648a"
msgid "Fine. Here."
msgstr "좋아. 여기."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1765f817-bb08-5823-7827-a438776e6785
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - RANGER(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:1765f817-bb08-5823-7827-a438776e6785
msgctxt "h35da4804g477dg4332gb66dgd0e437e867e2"
msgid ""
"Hags are the scourge of the natural world. I'm going to kill you - as many "
"times as needed."
msgstr "해그는 자연 세계의 재앙과도 같은 존재야. 필요하다면 끝없이 죽여주겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 192a0fd0-b3dc-659d-b62c-b0dd623205b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:192a0fd0-b3dc-659d-b62c-b0dd623205b8
msgctxt "h4b7a069dg30c1g46bdg879bgc505a4c0a3af"
msgid ""
"Shut it. You owe me a babe, girl. And I'll take it - whether you like it or "
"not."
msgstr "닥쳐! 이미 내게 아기를 넘겨주기로 했으니, 네년이 싫어하든 말든 받아가야겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 1bc41122-6386-909f-d756-119ce9442f0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:1bc41122-6386-909f-d756-119ce9442f0a
msgctxt "hfe077c74gad31g4e03gb0c9g302f0070b0da"
msgid "If you're gloating now, just wait 'til you hear my offer, petal."
msgstr "실컷 비웃었으면 슬슬 내 제안을 들어보는 게 어떻겠니, 아이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 1c9cd2af-08f4-48f9-710e-fb4918faf992
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:1c9cd2af-08f4-48f9-710e-fb4918faf992
msgctxt "h34329881g7b61g4967g9bf6g925af5a5786b"
msgid "Now, petal, there's... there's no need for such talk."
msgstr "진정하렴, 아이야... 그렇게까지 말 할 건 없잖니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e1db5f0-2953-7d0c-ffb8-c9a8b8f55e11
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DROWELF(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAG_Hag_State_HagGivenMercy = True
#.     - HAG_HagSpawn_Quest_SurrogateReleased = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - HAG_HagSpawn.MercyMayrinaFree(2) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_EILISTRAEE or PALADIN_EILISTRAEE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:2e1db5f0-2953-7d0c-ffb8-c9a8b8f55e11
msgctxt "hcec440e6g19bfg4f78g8866gb9ddbc722176"
msgid ""
"In the name of Eilistraee, release the girl and leave this place - never to "
"return."
msgstr "에일리스트레이의 이름으로, 소녀를 풀어주고 이곳을 떠나 다시는 돌아오지 말지어다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 30824eb6-fe66-9043-9c46-bca9005af40d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:30824eb6-fe66-9043-9c46-bca9005af40d
msgctxt "h50d14d3dga21dg4b50gb081g6a2a557d1194"
msgid "Not that it matters - I'll find another just as plump an' ripe."
msgstr "어차피 상관 없어. 나야 다른 포동포동한 녀석을 찾아내면 되니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 3158113d-6606-57b8-79ac-dae26fab1d20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(7) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:3158113d-6606-57b8-79ac-dae26fab1d20
msgctxt "hda72f6f0g057ag4301gb49ag72ab75ab8507"
msgid ""
"Not only would this be a vile deal, it would be folly to trust a hag's gifts."
msgstr "이건 악한 거래일 뿐 아니라, 해그의 선물을 믿는 건 바보같은 짓이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 32717213-8e81-9f15-34ed-5bb185b436f1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_HagLair_SurrogateMotherInMercyDialog = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAG_Hag_State_HagTookMother = True
#.     - HAG_Hag_State_HagGaveReward = True
#.     - HAG_Hag_State_HagGivenMercy = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:32717213-8e81-9f15-34ed-5bb185b436f1
msgctxt "h45f5c4e1g6a74g4980g9f41gb2ea3e44408b"
msgid "Keep the girl. I'll take the power."
msgstr "여자는 가지고 있어. 힘을 받을 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 3490d674-c5e1-a45b-42fe-24fe36865c33
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:3490d674-c5e1-a45b-42fe-24fe36865c33
msgctxt "haeb7a4d7ge005g46efgb7d1g3523376e835e"
msgid ""
"You want to be stronger? Tougher? Smarter? Done! Just let me go. (Ability "
"Score +1)"
msgstr "더 강해지고 싶지 않니? 더 강인하게? 똑똑하게? 뭐든 좋단다! 나를 보내주기만 하면 돼. (능력치 점수 +1)"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 3741fd7e-51b6-a9bf-ceb7-318ff84d22bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:3741fd7e-51b6-a9bf-ceb7-318ff84d22bc
msgctxt "h7c84dc63g8b1dg4f13ga50egf832af0270ad"
msgid ""
"But have it your way. Tell your precious little god I say hello... after I "
"rip out your throat!"
msgstr "원하는 대로 해. 네 소중한 신에게 내 인사를 전해주기나 하렴... 내가 네 목을 찢어버린 후에 말이야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 3770549c-04fb-3668-5862-dba7963fe0b0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:3770549c-04fb-3668-5862-dba7963fe0b0
msgctxt "h99e0e736g0e40g4917g9323ge000531bea4f"
msgid ""
"Tch. I hear blood and guts make excellent fertiliser. Let's spread you over "
"the soil and see, you little bollocks."
msgstr "쯧. 피와 내장이 훌륭한 비료가 된다는 말을 들은 적이 있지. 이참에 한번 확인해 보자꾸나, 이 개 같은 자식아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 3da6cfa9-3b17-cd36-ae79-a68516a0fb71
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:3da6cfa9-3b17-cd36-ae79-a68516a0fb71
msgctxt "h7307a20cg67d2g4c2fgb9deg0e833fb255ba"
msgid "Another deception. Take her head."
msgstr "또 거짓말이군. 모가지를 따버려."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 40ae4bd7-c517-7c96-c74c-9ffa07ee9679
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 20
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(2) = False
#.      - FIGHTER(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:40ae4bd7-c517-7c96-c74c-9ffa07ee9679
msgctxt "h99e97ad4g9728g40e5g88a5g4685cd4dcf9a"
msgid ""
"If you want to live, hand over Mayrina <i>and</i> this power. Right now."
msgstr "살고 싶거든, 메이리나 <i>그리고</i>이 힘을 내게 넘겨. 지금 당장."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 41a8c068-2f73-97aa-abef-b956cd84274c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAG_Hag_State_HagGivenMercy = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - HAG_HagSpawn.MercyNoReward(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:41a8c068-2f73-97aa-abef-b956cd84274c
msgctxt "h8d1e1fb3g0b27g49a5gac0dg5ccff4a67dd7"
msgid "Keep your life and your magic. I don't want either."
msgstr "목숨이고 마법이고 너나 잘 간수하시지. 둘 다 필요 없으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 48346e56-c2c6-55e5-4548-6694add9a87c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:48346e56-c2c6-55e5-4548-6694add9a87c
msgctxt "he118d949g0536g4800g8a0agf97550e0a344"
msgid ""
"No. You die today. And should you dare return? I'll just kill you again."
msgstr "필요없어, 넌 오늘 죽는다. 감히 돌아온다면 금방 찾아내서 다시 죽여주마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 49365261-d0be-ef37-7c18-3b77f8f3b07e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:49365261-d0be-ef37-7c18-3b77f8f3b07e
msgctxt "hd3af59f2g1130g446cg9a28gdf0d959027c5"
msgid "Get out of here before I change my mind."
msgstr "마음 바뀌기 전에 여기를 떠나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 495850a6-c191-a616-2132-0868e691ce88
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DRUID(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:495850a6-c191-a616-2132-0868e691ce88
msgctxt "hcac8eb8cg5143g41f4ga967g3d04002e056f"
msgid "You're a stain upon this land, but I will cleanse it."
msgstr "넌 이 땅을 더럽히는 오점이다. 내 손으로 지워 주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4a502864-1456-ccc5-7d06-0aa45a630e5c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:4a502864-1456-ccc5-7d06-0aa45a630e5c
msgctxt "hee4ca2fagfb26g4f2fgb587g387490d53023"
msgid "A servant of Vlaakith wants for nothing that her queen can't give."
msgstr "블라키스의 종복은 여왕님께서 주시는 것 외엔 아무것도 원하지 않는다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 4ceee7a7-7eb9-314c-89f3-6d3aa39bc74e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_Hagspawn_State_EthelKilledBrothers = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:4ceee7a7-7eb9-314c-89f3-6d3aa39bc74e
msgctxt "hdd682afcgb51cg41f8g92cdg8a00525081b4"
msgid "Thank you!"
msgstr "고마워요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 539b3f24-ffea-45b6-779e-741a221647ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:539b3f24-ffea-45b6-779e-741a221647ae
msgctxt "hdb56e1d7g1594g48a9g8602g0d3c0e9b0011"
msgid "But the deal... What about my husband? What happens to him?"
msgstr "하지만 거래가... 제 남편은요? 남편은 어떻게 되는 거예요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 53cc3e62-16c3-10bd-8c9e-94eb75ca2e87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(8) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(8) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:53cc3e62-16c3-10bd-8c9e-94eb75ca2e87
msgctxt "h00fff5a6gffdfg489ega3e5gae5f2cf2beff"
msgid "Trading some whelp we just met for impossible power? It's a fine deal."
msgstr "방금 만난 버르장머리 없는 사람이랑 불가능한 힘을 교환한다고? 남는 장사야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 5446d6a9-1502-ee8a-f896-4b5242fdfff8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(5) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:5446d6a9-1502-ee8a-f896-4b5242fdfff8
msgctxt "h8367ba99g1178g4ef4g9633g75a289a49f46"
msgid "Poisoned deal. Trust me. Don't believe a word she says."
msgstr "분명 독이 든 제안이야. 저 해그의 말은 한 마디도 믿지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 579e9b2f-148b-7ded-b609-d0ba596db8e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:579e9b2f-148b-7ded-b609-d0ba596db8e5
msgctxt "h8c48922bg40d5g472agb2c9gdc56bfca2211"
msgid "I'll not soon forget this, sweetness. You have my <i>word</i>."
msgstr "이 일은 똑똑히 기억하겠다, 귀염둥아. 내 말 <i>명심해</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 5fb74f74-ca8e-df70-bdda-333adb477a50
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:5fb74f74-ca8e-df70-bdda-333adb477a50
msgctxt "h24c8d166g4641g4415gaf9dgd81956902983"
msgid ""
"Tch. Fine. Have it your way. I'll use that thick skull of yours as a stewing "
"pot!"
msgstr "쳇. 좋아. 맘대로 하셔. 그 두꺼운 골통을 스튜 냄비로 써먹으면 딱이겠어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 63095d00-7f5c-d1d6-c51a-43c8a749f549
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:63095d00-7f5c-d1d6-c51a-43c8a749f549
msgctxt "h82b4e4e9g2cc8g405eg9a37gac356dbea7a9"
msgid "Wait! <i>Argh. </i>Wait just a tick."
msgstr "잠깐만! <i>으윽. </i>잠깐만 기다려 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 6888fe3a-2543-0f82-6800-77bac5e80824
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(6) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:6888fe3a-2543-0f82-6800-77bac5e80824
msgctxt "hb25893c7g5465g4905gb12dge62d8a417339"
msgid ""
"Don't you <i>dare</i> take the offer. No power is worth such a cruel price."
msgstr "거래에 응할 생각이라면 <i>꿈도 꾸지 마.</i> 이토록 잔혹한 대가를 치러 마땅한 힘은 어디에도 없으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 698b93f1-da49-62b5-7450-731579d55d12
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_Hagspawn_State_EthelKilledBrothers = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:698b93f1-da49-62b5-7450-731579d55d12
msgctxt "h53eae58dg891bg4579gbbabgf723fbeb3f04"
msgid "Don't let her take me. <i>Please. </i>"
msgstr "해그가 절 데려가지 못하게 해주세요. <i>부탁이에요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6ab73094-a962-6be3-c6dc-dc6a4169875e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC_EVIL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:6ab73094-a962-6be3-c6dc-dc6a4169875e
msgctxt "hf126545bga8d9g4255g92e6ga1d26ffa4449"
msgid "I'll bathe in your blood as I offer your death up in prayer."
msgstr "너의 죽음을 기도로 바치며 그 피로 목욕을 해주마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 70d76871-3a3b-c7e7-5645-846f3de69e9a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SELDARINEDROWELF(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAG_Hag_State_HagTookMother = True
#.     - HAG_Hag_State_HagGaveReward = True
#.     - HAG_Hag_State_HagGivenMercy = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:70d76871-3a3b-c7e7-5645-846f3de69e9a
msgctxt "h50161c6eg8ee4g4322ga4ddg840242ec9143"
msgid "The human means nothing to me. Give me the power."
msgstr "인간은 내게 아무 의미도 없어. 힘이나 내놔."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 73025f35-90c5-8226-096c-34b47433dfe4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:73025f35-90c5-8226-096c-34b47433dfe4
msgctxt "hf063e59cg1f57g4cbcg92d9gafdf5e7f4b6a"
msgid "Argh, nothing irks me more than a goody-two-shoes drow. Fine."
msgstr "아우, 범생이 같은 드로우보다 꼴불견인 건 없지. 알았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 76877eba-c744-12df-33eb-fe19fa69c2c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:76877eba-c744-12df-33eb-fe19fa69c2c9
msgctxt "hecc075d8gd633g4952ga21agd932dadbf24e"
msgid "But she's worthless to you!"
msgstr "하지만 너에게 그 아이는 별 가치가 없지 않니!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 788df57e-a0a8-69b6-6cd1-3b816fb7c118
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:788df57e-a0a8-69b6-6cd1-3b816fb7c118
msgctxt "h6cdfb816gb4a5g4288g9627gbad556d3f2da"
msgid "A wise choice."
msgstr "현명한 선택이구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 79977ef4-80d1-2099-7d16-267fa0dad828
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:79977ef4-80d1-2099-7d16-267fa0dad828
msgctxt "hda4b4c6agf268g4186gb84dg2fae790ea5c8"
msgid "Neither. But a hag's head would make an excellent trophy."
msgstr "필요없어. 하지만 해그의 머리는 훌륭한 전리품이 될 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 7b96db37-e270-b94b-f20b-07128fdd0311
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:7b96db37-e270-b94b-f20b-07128fdd0311
msgctxt "h171207f6g2a68g49eagbc6bg1de5d9c97642"
msgid "Tch. Doesn't it ever get lonely? Up on that high horse of yours?"
msgstr "흥. 그렇게 잘난 척 해 대면 외롭지도 않니?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7c0cb36a-3e7c-f42a-f6cb-b202a2c3d422
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: (CLERIC_GOOD or PALADIN) and !(OATHBREAKER and PALADIN_ANCIENTS)
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:7c0cb36a-3e7c-f42a-f6cb-b202a2c3d422
msgctxt "h9c0308afg59e0g430fgbc3ag9b7038a78867"
msgid ""
"You're a vile, monstrous creature. There is no bargain for you but death."
msgstr "넌 사악하고, 괴물 같은 생명체에 불과해. 네 죽음에 흥정 따위는 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 7ce570a2-474d-2d2f-d0e1-49e26810fd09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:7ce570a2-474d-2d2f-d0e1-49e26810fd09
msgctxt "hb01c011eg51c0g4c1ag90e8gbfd051a76192"
msgid "Here."
msgstr "옛다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 7fea963f-fa43-85e4-8071-342a4a53ac9f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:7fea963f-fa43-85e4-8071-342a4a53ac9f
msgctxt "hd9158465g55bag404bgb62bg0403c9cb592a"
msgid ""
"Killing me is a waste of time - I'll find a way to return. Always have, "
"always will."
msgstr "나를 죽이는 건 시간 낭비일 뿐이야 - 나는 반드시 돌아올 방법을 찾아낼 테니까 말이다. 항상 그래왔고, 앞으로도 그럴게야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 815c1bc4-9567-4dce-f9a0-3ef1f4cb0b07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_HagLair_SurrogateMotherInMercyDialog = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:815c1bc4-9567-4dce-f9a0-3ef1f4cb0b07
msgctxt "hc4cbdba3gd340g4375g86a2g047a1b965fb5"
msgid "What I want is Mayrina - alive and free."
msgstr "내가 원하는 건 메이리나를 멀쩡한 상태로 돌려받는 것뿐이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 83e06dd8-df8a-2381-ccfa-dc902337c824
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(2) = True
#. TagRule: BERSERKER
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:83e06dd8-df8a-2381-ccfa-dc902337c824
msgctxt "h4e5fde44g3947g4843g8fcdgd43d21f199a1"
msgid "Girl, power, everything. <b>OR I TURN YOUR SKULL INTO A PISSPOT.</b>"
msgstr "여자, 힘, 모든 것을 넘겨. <b>그렇지 않으면 네 해골바가지를 요강으로 만들어버리겠다.</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 83e06dd8-df8a-2381-ccfa-dc902337c824
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:83e06dd8-df8a-2381-ccfa-dc902337c824
msgctxt "h135692cfg8e9cg473bg9f53g8badb338861e"
msgid "I'll have it all. Or I'll just settle for <b>your life</b>."
msgstr "둘 다 내놔. 아님 <b>네 목숨</b>이라도 가져야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 86185195-2500-cc27-22ba-17bbd458a44c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_HagLair_SurrogateMotherInMercyDialog = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAG_Hag_State_HagGivenMercy = True
#.     - HAG_HagSpawn_Quest_SurrogateReleased = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - HAG_HagSpawn.MercyMayrinaFree(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:86185195-2500-cc27-22ba-17bbd458a44c
msgctxt "h77a6b9f9g4366g43ddgbfd7g78ea820fd710"
msgid "No good can come of this. Let Mayrina go."
msgstr "도저히 내버려 둘 순 없네. 메이리나를 보내줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 8a4299a8-131e-9161-9d2f-77aeba996a74
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:8a4299a8-131e-9161-9d2f-77aeba996a74
msgctxt "he3932962g0819g4b3dga588g74073f8b6b70"
msgid "Gods turn your goody soul to shite."
msgstr "부디 신이 네 그 착해빠진 영혼을 똥통으로 데려가길 빈다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 8bd520a3-b88d-e680-7473-f2d973aa3247
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(5) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:8bd520a3-b88d-e680-7473-f2d973aa3247
msgctxt "hdd7093a3gc7e2g4013ga2c3gd5e88f4c36f8"
msgid "Please! She's dreaming if she thinks we'd leave Mayrina here."
msgstr "세상에! 메이리나를 그냥 두고 갈 줄 알았다면 꿈 깨라고 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8c3a4a7f-5875-22c0-66f1-c162b8b36dcd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FIGHTER(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:8c3a4a7f-5875-22c0-66f1-c162b8b36dcd
msgctxt "h1cd83fa7g0238g443fg8520g886d998a4510"
msgid ""
"I know a beaten opponent when I see one. Give me the power and the girl, and "
"I'll let you live."
msgstr "난 궁지에 몰린 놈들을 기가 막히게 알아보지. 여자와 힘을 넘기면 몸 성히 보내 주마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 8cfabfa9-871b-a576-eca1-0c7f580bbe66
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:8cfabfa9-871b-a576-eca1-0c7f580bbe66
msgctxt "h735f71e5g3ae8g414cgb9feg828716a677a2"
msgid "Deal's off, you dumb cow! And you've <i>him</i> to thank for it."
msgstr "거래는 끝이다, 이 바보야! 다 저 놈 덕분이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 8cfabfa9-871b-a576-eca1-0c7f580bbe66
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:8cfabfa9-871b-a576-eca1-0c7f580bbe66
msgctxt "h3eab4b47g6304g4f85gbc4dgc0a02312b563"
msgid "Deal's off, you dumb cow! And you've <i>her</i> to thank for it."
msgstr "거래는 끝이다, 이 바보야! 다 저 년 덕분이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 93879b0a-29ba-46d8-2f2e-b2919a93eb08
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_PLANAR(2) = True
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:93879b0a-29ba-46d8-2f2e-b2919a93eb08
msgctxt "h06b5eb34gae7eg4a45g9c66g6d9e6f38bde3"
msgid "Careful. I doubt we have the same concept of 'civilised'."
msgstr "잘 생각해서 말하는 게 좋을 거야. '문명인'의 정의가 서로 일치하지 않을 것 같거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 9b995651-0325-a6de-d297-0027e35cf2ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:9b995651-0325-a6de-d297-0027e35cf2ca
msgctxt "hd0969bd4gb51eg4fdcgab80gd64fb1cc0e71"
msgid "I can set up shop elsewhere. People always need 'lotions and potions'."
msgstr "가게야 또 내면 그만이지. 사람들은 항상 '로션과 포션'을 필요로 하니 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 9bfe9c09-b787-0027-b576-c1b4465e2b30
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:9bfe9c09-b787-0027-b576-c1b4465e2b30
msgctxt "hb3c5fe04gbdc5g4785ga505g65e1b9bc13dd"
msgid ""
"If her powers were worth anything, we wouldn't have beaten her. Finish this."
msgstr "해그가 그렇게 대단한 힘이 있었다면 애초에 우리에게 지지도 않았겠지. 마무리하자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 9d49789e-696b-7fb8-617b-3d6621929521
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:9d49789e-696b-7fb8-617b-3d6621929521
msgctxt "hb1420e40gb8fbg4287ga4fag5eaea4aab3ac"
msgid ""
"I've never been called a <i>scourge </i>before, you flirt. But sweet words "
"won't get you out of this one!"
msgstr "어머, <i>재앙</i>이란 말은 처음 들어보는구나. 하지만 그렇게 아첨해도 봐주진 않아!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a1ed1d89-31ee-0f40-61af-cec66ecaef88
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:a1ed1d89-31ee-0f40-61af-cec66ecaef88
msgctxt "hd73f398cgab5fg49acg94efg7f49706f81bf"
msgid "Best of luck, <i>auntie</i>."
msgstr "행운을 빌지, <i>이모</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = a21a2909-a3b2-2b3e-c6c6-fe73a4acabd8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:a21a2909-a3b2-2b3e-c6c6-fe73a4acabd8
msgctxt "hdbcc6e21gb709g4b39g964fgfd6f78b44288"
msgid ""
"Fine. Have it your way! I'll rip your throat out yet, you little bollocks."
msgstr "좋아. 그렇게 해 보셔! 네 모가지를 날려 버리겠다, 이 쬐깐한 멍청아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a323eeb9-f6a7-6287-c485-02f335ff2f45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAG_Hag_State_HagGaveReward = True
#.     - HAG_Hag_State_HagGivenMercy = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - HAG_HagSpawn.MercyNoMayrina(2) = True
#.     - HIDDEN_HAG_Reward.HagReward(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:a323eeb9-f6a7-6287-c485-02f335ff2f45
msgctxt "h5bc07adcg6487g4118gbd55gda9e4d8ca4bd"
msgid "Give me power - the more, the better."
msgstr "내게 힘을 줘 - 많을수록 좋은법이거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = a4706565-ccfa-120d-8acc-90d19be72dc0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:a4706565-ccfa-120d-8acc-90d19be72dc0
msgctxt "h4d6f5db1g788ag4b2fgbbbdgb023c232a9bd"
msgid "Not a hope."
msgstr "꿈도 꾸지 말렴."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = a641f4a6-069e-02c2-fe60-2627c1c49e2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:a641f4a6-069e-02c2-fe60-2627c1c49e2c
msgctxt "h82b076b6gbf71g44b0gbffcgad3eec9e013e"
msgid "We've suffered her trickery long enough - end this."
msgstr "우린 저 해그의 술수에 충분히 놀아났어. 끝내버리자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = a981c136-39b1-f10c-6285-3868bfea920d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:a981c136-39b1-f10c-6285-3868bfea920d
msgctxt "h797e8a7egc693g4af9gbc36g00f58227337a"
msgid "Let me leave with the girl, and I'll give you <i>power</i>."
msgstr "나를 저년과 같이 보내준다면 네게 <i>힘을</i> 주마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aa69ef71-69be-57bf-db48-8bc5fd2249de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WARLOCK(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:aa69ef71-69be-57bf-db48-8bc5fd2249de
msgctxt "h01b28673g8db5g42fbgb3d6ge18b5cc402db"
msgid "I'm an expert on deals. No funny business."
msgstr "내가 거래에는 일가견이 있는 편이지. 장난칠 생각일랑은 접어두는 게 좋을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ae83aeae-1449-c99c-22ae-910d4e3c975d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC_NEUTRAL or PALADIN_ANCIENTS
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:ae83aeae-1449-c99c-22ae-910d4e3c975d
msgctxt "h25c98c98g9c0ag4ee6g8286g0cac800f35c6"
msgid ""
"There's no choice to make. A corrupting force like you has to be destroyed."
msgstr "고민할 것도 없다. 너같이 이 땅을 오염시키는 것들은 없어져야만 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = b2964e16-d0a7-bec3-e195-2c6612ef7d76
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAG_Hag_State_HagGaveReward = True
#.     - HAG_Hag_State_HagGivenMercy = True
#.     - HAG_HagSpawn_Quest_SurrogateReleased = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - HAG_HagSpawn.MayrinaAndReward(2) = True
#.     - HIDDEN_HAG_Reward.HagReward(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:b2964e16-d0a7-bec3-e195-2c6612ef7d76
msgctxt "h8dccd4f3ge051g49f1g9ee9g00ffe5a73d6e"
msgid "You greedy little bollocks!"
msgstr "못돼먹은 욕심쟁이 같으니라고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = b4f9547a-d93c-480f-1d3b-bfb72dca43b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:b4f9547a-d93c-480f-1d3b-bfb72dca43b2
msgctxt "h7f60e0b8g2f01g4bb1g8342g2ff345133588"
msgid "It's your choice, sweetness."
msgstr "너의 선택에 달려있단다, 우리 귀염둥이."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b523170b-d73b-a413-ae0d-2e626084fafc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:b523170b-d73b-a413-ae0d-2e626084fafc
msgctxt "h46e9e289ga007g4659g9811gad7876274295"
msgid "You have nothing that could tempt me."
msgstr "네가 무엇을 주든 날 유혹할 수는 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = b6131424-3fa7-a392-1698-5656e6cc9bee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(7) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:b6131424-3fa7-a392-1698-5656e6cc9bee
msgctxt "h42a7f1f2g40f5g45b2gaf58g7309a2aaa7a5"
msgid ""
"To trust a hag, even when she's at your mercy, would be beyond folly. I say "
"we end this."
msgstr "아무리 손아귀에 잡은 상태라도, 해그를 믿는다는 건 어리석은 짓이야. 그냥 끝내버리자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = b6420406-1a61-01e3-fb65-611765f9315e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:b6420406-1a61-01e3-fb65-611765f9315e
msgctxt "he9b0acc7g893fg414fg8bdag8ba6e9fb8304"
msgid ""
"But it's... unpleasant. So how about we be civilised about this, hmm? I have "
"something you <i>want.</i>"
msgstr ""
"하지만 그게 상당히... 불쾌해서 말이지. 그러니 문명인답게 해결하는 게 어떻겠니, 흐음? 네가 <i>원하는</i> 것을 줄 수 있을 것 "
"같구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b64a2965-58c2-4ba9-b4e9-2f55dbd788c7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:b64a2965-58c2-4ba9-b4e9-2f55dbd788c7
msgctxt "h1c7d7405gb37ag4cddg8439g7e85a6316e46"
msgid "I think a dead hag is the answer here."
msgstr "역시 널 죽이는 게 정답이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = b9a78918-b664-72ac-5a2f-23b70b6c2823
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:b9a78918-b664-72ac-5a2f-23b70b6c2823
msgctxt "hab9623c2gaf4cg4e89gbf6cg0543b5f17c6a"
msgid "Just let me keep the girl and her babe."
msgstr "그저 내게 저년과 아기를 넘겨주기만 하면 된단다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bcee9e46-b8b0-8859-0555-5e592df102a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:bcee9e46-b8b0-8859-0555-5e592df102a9
msgctxt "h03a34e48g8ebcg4fabg92b6gc6f1a006b17e"
msgid "Go on..."
msgstr "계속 해 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c853a35a-0d07-5a9a-363c-1efeae845bc3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:c853a35a-0d07-5a9a-363c-1efeae845bc3
msgctxt "haba8108fg344fg4529g84a6gf4d4ef7fe43e"
msgid "Indeed. I'll take your head and stick it on a pike."
msgstr "그럴 것 같네. 네 모가지를 따서 창끝에 박아가면 되겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = c9c2b63d-4329-4fc4-135f-ea556c83b703
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:c9c2b63d-4329-4fc4-135f-ea556c83b703
msgctxt "h713cd12dgf844g4c72ga4f7g082059505f68"
msgid ""
"You wound me, sweetie. My offer will put that little pact of yours to shame."
msgstr "말이 심하구나, 아이야. 내 제안은 네 아담한 계약 따위랑은 비교도 되지 않을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = d03d2586-659b-0ea3-8b05-f53f6ef263ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:d03d2586-659b-0ea3-8b05-f53f6ef263ee
msgctxt "h00a0d593g679ag4219gaa19g9941591e68fc"
msgid "I knew I liked you, dearie."
msgstr "역시 착한 아이로구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = d566e67b-4f20-a89e-1fb5-26dbdbed119d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:d566e67b-4f20-a89e-1fb5-26dbdbed119d
msgctxt "hedafcd0fg25ffg4030g9d6egabfa24471117"
msgid "A simple trade? More deception. Take her head."
msgstr "단순한 거래라? 또 다른 속임수로군. 당장 목을 베는 걸 권하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = d60bac3a-80db-6c9b-a5d3-e627a9e8696a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:d60bac3a-80db-6c9b-a5d3-e627a9e8696a
msgctxt "hdf0ece98gae78g4646gb56eg33c0aeb05599"
msgid ""
"Tch. Tough talk from the oversized lemon. But fine. Have it your way. I'll "
"rip out your throat!"
msgstr "쯧. 덩치만 큰 멍청이가 혀를 험악하게 놀리는구나. 좋아, 마음대로 하렴. 네 목을 따줄테니!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = d76cfec9-88ab-b7b8-c9cf-2c27f8833267
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:d76cfec9-88ab-b7b8-c9cf-2c27f8833267
msgctxt "h6b2b2fc9g2f3ag4c57gb8a7g3ea17adfa681"
msgid "If I ever see you again, you'll have a tentacle for a tongue."
msgstr "다시 마주치면, 넌 그때쯤 입에 촉수가 달려있을 거란다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = dbb4400e-c491-f8c6-2bc8-e084a7a26a2b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:dbb4400e-c491-f8c6-2bc8-e084a7a26a2b
msgctxt "h47dfef57g4a8ag4a5fgb2c4ga3518e69e3d2"
msgid "Bollocks to luck. It's only the deal that counts."
msgstr "운은 개뿔. 중요한 건 거래 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = de8a5643-d2a5-74b0-6bfc-56dd7a00ca64
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 20
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:de8a5643-d2a5-74b0-6bfc-56dd7a00ca64
msgctxt "hc2756f40g06cag41b9gb60fg8b8ff1c85044"
msgid ""
"My reinforcements are nearly here. Give me the girl <i>and</i> the power and "
"they'll spare you."
msgstr "슬슬 지원군이 도착할 때가 됐는데. 여자와 힘을 <i>둘 다</i> 넘기면 우리 식구들이 널 살려 줄지도 모르지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = e3379365-fad2-a5f6-307f-f523d19a4886
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:e3379365-fad2-a5f6-307f-f523d19a4886
msgctxt "h6fe43cf0gdd6eg4819gad7dgc1d3d2d1a46f"
msgid "It's one or the other."
msgstr "둘 중 하나만 고를 수 있단다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = e4db0a3c-ed80-28fc-6c67-6082e70402eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:e4db0a3c-ed80-28fc-6c67-6082e70402eb
msgctxt "he77664a7g81f3g4fa6g8c69ga2fa5647a169"
msgid "Hold your horses - just hear me out."
msgstr "자자, 진정하고 잘 들어보렴."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = e5bad9b6-6e9b-2a24-6101-b6f41d49a398
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_HagLair_SurrogateMotherInMercyDialog = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:e5bad9b6-6e9b-2a24-6101-b6f41d49a398
msgctxt "h8d5e34d3g579fg4e8agb13egacfb4b57ef8c"
msgid "I can give you <i>power</i>. Anything you want!"
msgstr "나는 네게 <i>힘을</i> 줄 수 있단다. 원하는 건 무엇이든 말야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = e6849d5d-1b18-f6df-f3f5-0ec55f6ef9df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:e6849d5d-1b18-f6df-f3f5-0ec55f6ef9df
msgctxt "h589bb315g30c6g46cdga919g1efabf907ba9"
msgid "Why, sweetness. You're either a saint or an eejit."
msgstr "어머, 다정하기도 해라. 군자인지 숙맥인지 헷갈리는구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = e8ccfba2-edce-8533-bf17-e0f5057ac5df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:e8ccfba2-edce-8533-bf17-e0f5057ac5df
msgctxt "h181cbc70g1404g4008g9f8ag24a431e83794"
msgid "What'll it be, petal?"
msgstr "어쩔 테냐, 아이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = f03cf4c1-6302-3b19-fbb8-6771791cc517
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:f03cf4c1-6302-3b19-fbb8-6771791cc517
msgctxt "he3613a4egb36fg4e21g9b64gf28eb5ea79fd"
msgid ""
"You want to be stronger? Tougher? Smarter? Done! Anything is possible. ("
"Ability Score +1)"
msgstr "더 강해지고 싶나? 더 강인해지고 싶고? 아니면 더 많은 지혜를 원하나? 좋아! 뭐든지 가능하단다. (능력치 점수 +1)"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f306c1dc-92aa-6776-0699-f39eb9f1fd6c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:f306c1dc-92aa-6776-0699-f39eb9f1fd6c
msgctxt "ha4c47348ge7b4g4b3fgba69gc6ac583b9988"
msgid "If I ever see you again, you'll be fertilising this swamp."
msgstr "다시 마주치기만 해봐, 거름으로 만들어서 이 늪에 뿌려줄 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = fd75d723-cf88-0235-4e93-70d824ac37ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Event_SelectedRandomCompanionInDialog(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(6) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:fd75d723-cf88-0235-4e93-70d824ac37ba
msgctxt "h5b6604fcg9254g468cga26fg95f66d79010f"
msgid "End her now, or she'll be cursing new victims by sundown."
msgstr "그녀를 지금 끝장내버리지 않으면, 해가 지기 전까지 그녀는 새 희생자들을 저주할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = fe42e01c-ef69-d6b8-6fe0-bbce6a82d413
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:fe42e01c-ef69-d6b8-6fe0-bbce6a82d413
msgctxt "he726528agac63g4428g98f2ged975b310f15"
msgid "Well, <i>that </i>doesn't sound very hygienic."
msgstr "흠, <i>그건</i> 딱히 위생적으로 들리지 않는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = fed4011b-06e5-5e86-ac7d-e1e83dd1676a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_HagBegsForMercy:fed4011b-06e5-5e86-ac7d-e1e83dd1676a
msgctxt "h0d97a0e9g0649g47c7gb917g18ab540e2238"
msgid "Aw. Don't act like you won't miss me."
msgstr "에이, 날 그리워하지 않을 것처럼 하지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_AtEntrance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3bffadb5-9d76-440e-9250-d6ac000f6d17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_AtEntrance:3bffadb5-9d76-440e-9250-d6ac000f6d17
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h6b180940g1ddcg4138ga89eg4b835472cb13"
msgid "Now - where are you hiding?"
msgstr "자 - 어디 숨었을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_AtEntrance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3bffadb5-9d76-440e-9250-d6ac000f6d17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_AtEntrance:3bffadb5-9d76-440e-9250-d6ac000f6d17
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hfd4bde3cg0b75g478ag8d59gdab9ef67fe58"
msgid "Let the hunt begin..."
msgstr "꼭 꼭 숨어라..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_AtEntrance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3bffadb5-9d76-440e-9250-d6ac000f6d17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_AtEntrance:3bffadb5-9d76-440e-9250-d6ac000f6d17
msgctxt "h3eda88cbg564fg43degbbaag8f7669dc45ad"
msgid "Come on out, Ethel. Jig's up."
msgstr "어서 나와, 에텔. 게임 끝났어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_AtEntrance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3bffadb5-9d76-440e-9250-d6ac000f6d17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_AtEntrance:3bffadb5-9d76-440e-9250-d6ac000f6d17
msgctxt "hff7f7d4eg4997g4466g8b6dg368fe7e10b2b"
msgid "Where are you? Get out here and let's be done with it."
msgstr "어디 숨은 거야? 이리 나와 끝장을 보자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_AtEntrance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3bffadb5-9d76-440e-9250-d6ac000f6d17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_AtEntrance:3bffadb5-9d76-440e-9250-d6ac000f6d17
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h7f631fa3g261fg4542ga5cag1a8b4869473e"
msgid "Where's that hag scurried off to now...?"
msgstr "해그가 어디로 그렇게 급히 갔을까...?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_AtEntrance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3bffadb5-9d76-440e-9250-d6ac000f6d17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_AtEntrance:3bffadb5-9d76-440e-9250-d6ac000f6d17
msgctxt "hc5b8e4e6gda8dg4b42ga073g0d66529bd4df"
msgid "Ethel - come out and play!"
msgstr "에텔 - 이리 나와 놀자!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_AtEntrance
#. Speaker = Player
