msgid "Did the hag do all this?"
msgstr "이게 다 해그가 한 짓인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_Explore2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d266e896-e527-ed5c-1735-11dbb590b68c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_Explore2:d266e896-e527-ed5c-1735-11dbb590b68c
msgctxt "h7cd5f765g2475g480bgbbd8g8e33df1a6cae"
msgid "The work of the hag. No doubt about it."
msgstr "해그의 작품이군. 의심의 여지 없이."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_Explore2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e820c587-ad49-32e8-7846-64be0bd8794f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_Explore2:e820c587-ad49-32e8-7846-64be0bd8794f
msgctxt "h0a84011dgdbaag443cg81c8gcd8277e7ae4c"
msgid "New blood caked on old. It smells rancid."
msgstr "오래된 피에 새로운 피가 덮였어. 끔찍한 냄새로군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_Explore2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e820c587-ad49-32e8-7846-64be0bd8794f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_Explore2:e820c587-ad49-32e8-7846-64be0bd8794f
msgctxt "h2bd7d78eg4185g4c8cga8b4ga6a64bf87528"
msgid "My word, this is a place where nightmares come to die."
msgstr "맙소사, 악몽이 죽으러 올 법한 곳이로군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_Explore2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e820c587-ad49-32e8-7846-64be0bd8794f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_Explore2:e820c587-ad49-32e8-7846-64be0bd8794f
msgctxt "h38f77497g2ba9g4ab2g93b4g126dc03ec9cf"
msgid "Blech, this place reeks of death."
msgstr "욱, 이곳은 죽음의 악취로 가득하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_Explore2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e820c587-ad49-32e8-7846-64be0bd8794f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_Explore2:e820c587-ad49-32e8-7846-64be0bd8794f
msgctxt "h9888dd19gb9bcg41a3g9293gb7b669f6e039"
msgid "Bones and blood everywhere. Hallmarks of torture."
msgstr "뼈와 피가 사방에 널려있군. 고문의 흔적들이."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_Explore2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e820c587-ad49-32e8-7846-64be0bd8794f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_Explore2:e820c587-ad49-32e8-7846-64be0bd8794f
msgctxt "h78ba04f8gdb95g4ab0ga14egdf9e06544cfa"
msgid "It's like an abattoir in here."
msgstr "이곳은 마치 도축장 같은걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_Explore2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e820c587-ad49-32e8-7846-64be0bd8794f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_Explore2:e820c587-ad49-32e8-7846-64be0bd8794f
msgctxt "hef0b49b4g8585g4fc9gb458g645032239fa3"
msgid "Golden gods, this place is horrific."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_Explore2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e820c587-ad49-32e8-7846-64be0bd8794f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_Explore2:e820c587-ad49-32e8-7846-64be0bd8794f
msgctxt "h86400188g79c5g499cg9811g602ee428f912"
msgid "This place reeks of death."
msgstr "이곳에서 죽음의 악취가 진동하는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_MaskedVictimsNeutral
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7eca6a28-fa5b-40f4-8546-c0f925a01a7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_MaskedVictimsNeutral:7eca6a28-fa5b-40f4-8546-c0f925a01a7e
msgctxt "h6105a02dge0d9g4febgb714g0fd7012800f8"
msgid "They're not attacking. Fooled by a mask."
msgstr "저놈들이 공격하질 않잖아? 가면 따위에 속아 넘어가다니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_MaskedVictimsNeutral
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7eca6a28-fa5b-40f4-8546-c0f925a01a7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_MaskedVictimsNeutral:7eca6a28-fa5b-40f4-8546-c0f925a01a7e
msgctxt "h44b1749fg3473g42d6g94d4ga546be56de9f"
msgid "No one's attacking me, eh? This mask is certainly doing the trick."
msgstr "아무도 날 공격하지 않는구만? 가면이 확실히 효과가 있는 모양이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_MaskedVictimsNeutral
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7eca6a28-fa5b-40f4-8546-c0f925a01a7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_MaskedVictimsNeutral:7eca6a28-fa5b-40f4-8546-c0f925a01a7e
msgctxt "h1b9aca68g4525g4e40gb9b7gbc833e181215"
msgid "Mask seems to ward them off."
msgstr "가면이 녀석들을 피할 수 있게 해주는 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_MaskedVictimsNeutral
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7eca6a28-fa5b-40f4-8546-c0f925a01a7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_MaskedVictimsNeutral:7eca6a28-fa5b-40f4-8546-c0f925a01a7e
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h9486f73fg0e92g4785gb5e9g25475d280d8a"
msgid "They do not attack. The mask must ward them off."
msgstr "녀석들이 공격하질 않아. 가면이 주의를 돌려주는 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_MaskedVictimsNeutral
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7eca6a28-fa5b-40f4-8546-c0f925a01a7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_MaskedVictimsNeutral:7eca6a28-fa5b-40f4-8546-c0f925a01a7e
msgctxt "hafe83788gd964g423dg93adg90b697d18e80"
msgid "They're not attacking - thanks to the mask, no doubt."
msgstr "녀석들이 공격해 오질 않아. 가면 덕을 톡톡히 보네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_MaskedVictimsNeutral
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7eca6a28-fa5b-40f4-8546-c0f925a01a7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_MaskedVictimsNeutral:7eca6a28-fa5b-40f4-8546-c0f925a01a7e
msgctxt "h8063b13dg3916g4a22gaedagc5c42a65fc56"
msgid "Nice - the mask lets me blend right in."
msgstr "완벽해. 가면 덕에 녀석들 사이에 잘 섞인 듯하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_MaskedVictimsNeutral
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7eca6a28-fa5b-40f4-8546-c0f925a01a7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PAD_MaskedVictimsNeutral:7eca6a28-fa5b-40f4-8546-c0f925a01a7e
msgctxt "h17a81967gf947g4684g8f8agf0ef29ecb09b"
msgid "They're not attacking. Must think I'm one of them."
msgstr "공격해 오지 않네. 나를 동류라고 생각하나 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PutOnMask
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 69c28470-c6fe-9b25-b3f0-b25ad559adf1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PutOnMask:69c28470-c6fe-9b25-b3f0-b25ad559adf1
msgctxt "h3029b6ceg4102g4e80g9376g948a7908bee2"
msgid "And let your dear old Auntie Ethel look after you."
msgstr "이제 네 사랑하는 에텔 이모가 돌봐줄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PutOnMask
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = d4e3eefb-704e-2445-87d8-b72805c3dee5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_PutOnMask:d4e3eefb-704e-2445-87d8-b72805c3dee5
msgctxt "hc47d40e0g0f2bg495ag8830g1063e4c720bb"
msgid ""
"Hello, petal. My, my - the mask suits you. Just relax. See the world with "
"fresh eyes."
msgstr "안녕, 꽃잎아. 이런, 이런 - 가면이 너에게 잘 맞는 모양이구나. 안심하렴. 생생한 눈으로 이 세상을 보려무나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 02835a58-9a43-4bd5-d767-6fe8e7e6f2a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:02835a58-9a43-4bd5-d767-6fe8e7e6f2a2
msgctxt "h8346535cg5820g480agb055gabdc223c6389"
msgid "I'm not afraid of that hag."
msgstr "그 해그 따윈 두렵지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 03d9e5d7-ba0e-346d-6a17-2242852e44f8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:03d9e5d7-ba0e-346d-6a17-2242852e44f8
msgctxt "h81e0cabfg405fg434dg8d42g3e2f7d3c9e8e"
msgid "*<i>Flee</i>, you feel it cry.*"
msgstr "*<i>도망쳐</i>, 당신은 이것의 절규를 느낍니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0464fa9a-3de1-3d3e-9a76-9acb84175f40
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:0464fa9a-3de1-3d3e-9a76-9acb84175f40
msgctxt "hc9ed347cg5a45g42efga27agdf4875b8ddf6"
msgid "*You see the hag, eyes bright with glee, as she sets fire to the door.*"
msgstr "*환희에 찬 눈빛으로 문에 불을 지르는 해그가 보입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 05e415c7-ad48-44e6-62c6-537b8fcad12f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAG_HagLair_State_PlayerPassedDoor(2) = False
#.      - HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor_HasMet(2) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_Hag_State_HagInLair = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - HAG_HagLair_Knows_DoorWasAlive(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:05e415c7-ad48-44e6-62c6-537b8fcad12f
msgctxt "h5574bae5g0c3ag440fgad6cg041802d1a2e4"
msgid "*You feel the barest hint of life from within the door.*"
msgstr "*문 안쪽에서 가로막히지 않은 생명의 기운이 느껴집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 09c5909d-62db-aa1a-15c9-742c434515c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:09c5909d-62db-aa1a-15c9-742c434515c8
msgctxt "h82e1233ag4740g41eeg82a0g5588a126679e"
msgid ""
"*His cries for mercy are cut short as the hag slices into him, dismembering "
"him painstakingly, limb by limb.*"
msgstr "*해그가 그의 팔다리 하나 하나를 고통스럽게 토막 내자, 자비를 구하는 그의 절규가 끊어집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0ae47f33-7e77-363d-fe16-b3270a6b1525
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 8adffca0-956b-e9ff-89f7-2c89bcaa2b9d_perceptionsuccess = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:0ae47f33-7e77-363d-fe16-b3270a6b1525
msgctxt "h23f0235ag915bg4a50g987agf6480bc5cf2d"
msgid "*Its form flickers, and you realise that the door is transparent.*"
msgstr "*문의 형상이 깜박이고, 당신은 이 문이 투명하다는 사실을 깨닫습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0f95e9cc-ef59-1dd1-6803-b7260624fb86
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN_DEVOTION(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:0f95e9cc-ef59-1dd1-6803-b7260624fb86
msgctxt "hea401b61ge676g460ag9dc6g23b53ffa70c0"
msgid ""
"If you let me through, I will do all I can to free you from your torment - I "
"swear it."
msgstr "지나가게 해주면 네가 고통에서 해방되도록 최선을 다 할게 - 맹세해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 10ce0a12-87b9-0c2e-0c7f-bc6a1d9689f1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:10ce0a12-87b9-0c2e-0c7f-bc6a1d9689f1
msgctxt "h8b174146gf72eg4604gb7aeg3c19369a2f9a"
msgid "All right, is there another way in?"
msgstr "좋아, 들어가는 다른 길은 없나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 131e9167-c5eb-2bd9-16f5-8e3364471052
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:131e9167-c5eb-2bd9-16f5-8e3364471052
msgctxt "hbe939d3egfe28g42b7gaaefg3b566aad40c2"
msgid ""
"*Images flash: a man cowering, a bag open at his feet. Gold coins spilling "
"onto the floor.*"
msgstr "*섬광처럼 광경이 비춰집니다: 움츠러든 남자, 발밑에 열려 있는 가방. 바닥에 쏟아진 금화가 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 1e20527a-071f-3201-9d31-43018bcce79f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:1e20527a-071f-3201-9d31-43018bcce79f
msgctxt "h16c33959g8942g4603g99d3g2bbd40166673"
msgid "*The door stays silent.*"
msgstr "*문은 조용히 서 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 244ebe81-8e83-1c65-174a-a84679fd8292
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAG_HagLair_State_PlayerPassedDoor(2) = False
#.      - HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor_HasMet(2) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_Hag_State_HagInLair = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 8adffca0-956b-e9ff-89f7-2c89bcaa2b9d_SelectSpeakerPlayedOnce = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:244ebe81-8e83-1c65-174a-a84679fd8292
msgctxt "ha0c0804agc7e6g4249g9a0eg5477b7ba382c"
msgid ""
"*You feel crushing waves of fear as the presence within the door recoils. It "
"can't let people through. Not again!*"
msgstr "*문 안의 존재가 움찔하자 두려움의 파도가 밀려오는 것을 느낍니다. 이 존재는 사람을 들일 수 없습니다. 다시는!*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 259a99db-7a7d-1414-a9ca-12745579ea2a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:259a99db-7a7d-1414-a9ca-12745579ea2a
msgctxt "h05cc15d7g805ag4945gad5fg91a030d00252"
msgid "*It remains firmly closed as the presence huddles within.*"
msgstr "*문 속의 존재가 겁에 질려 웅크리며 굳게 닫혀 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 27c75744-cc48-8c3a-48bd-ff8f8c938e1e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_Hag_State_IsDead = True
#.   User:
#.      - HAG_HagLair_Knows_DoorWasAlive(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:27c75744-cc48-8c3a-48bd-ff8f8c938e1e
msgctxt "h0473ea62g0ca0g4f34gb222ga468de273e70"
msgid ""
"*You feel a touch of the hag's magic, but whatever this door once held is "
"gone.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2c78c89b-97ff-16f9-8b14-6e37e5f68011
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:2c78c89b-97ff-16f9-8b14-6e37e5f68011
msgctxt "h28581317gad4fg4272g9e99g6b421d056e55"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3349b058-b186-6c35-4222-a905039d8a31
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:3349b058-b186-6c35-4222-a905039d8a31
msgctxt "h14549561g3429g4c34g9d9ag729f4862d618"
msgid ""
"*You see an image of blue skies and sunshine as the door shudders a warning -"
" <i>run</i>.*"
msgstr "*문이 몸서리치며 경고하자 푸른 하늘과 햇빛의 광경이 보입니다 - <i>도망쳐</i>.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 388dde75-3c4e-a961-baed-ae97723bed4b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:388dde75-3c4e-a961-baed-ae97723bed4b
msgctxt "h9b36789fg89a9g4b89g8c49gfc8bec1e6cda"
msgid "*Frustrated, the door rattles. You see the hag and... yourself?*"
msgstr "*문이 좌절감에 덜컹거립니다. 당신에게 보이는 건 해그와... 자기 자신인가요?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3e3b5283-043c-805f-1320-50f8f8886d85
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:3e3b5283-043c-805f-1320-50f8f8886d85
msgctxt "h9f225a2fg77e7g4fc0g86b4gc2479a2c4cb6"
msgid "No time to chat. I'm here to kill the hag."
msgstr "떠들 시간 없어. 난 해그를 죽이러 왔어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 44999c86-060e-c192-fd3d-2d61641335cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:44999c86-060e-c192-fd3d-2d61641335cb
msgctxt "h5064ff1fgcc17g41a8g9017gd88690b0cb91"
msgid "*Weapons brandished, they charge into the hag's lair.*"
msgstr "*무기를 휘두르며 해그의 은신처 안으로 돌진합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 597c7c90-31bd-2765-ff42-f0768c0b28be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor_State_PersuasionSuccess(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:597c7c90-31bd-2765-ff42-f0768c0b28be
msgctxt "h6a450aa2g2df5g4d6dgb6c7g260981f4785e"
msgid ""
"*With a jerk, you're pulled from the vision. The presence within shrinks - "
"begging you not to run through it.*"
msgstr "*당신은 한 번에 낚아채이며 환상에서 끌려나옵니다. 그 안의 존재가 움츠러들며 통과하지 말아달라고 애원합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5b679503-6d56-4487-2804-ae7262ede601
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:5b679503-6d56-4487-2804-ae7262ede601
msgctxt "h5a0c767bg7fadg453bgb1ccgbce7389bef58"
msgid "Come on, open up!"
msgstr "이봐, 문 열어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 638a0de3-93f1-4f0a-a8ec-8461875d9117
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:638a0de3-93f1-4f0a-a8ec-8461875d9117
msgctxt "hafa2dd0fgb57ag48eegb63eg2ac579bed666"
msgid ""
"*You see the hag. She walks <i>through</i> the door - its form shimmering.*"
msgstr "*해그가 보입니다. 그녀가 문을 <i>뚫고</i> 들어가는 모습이 일렁입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 678cfc6c-85e2-315f-ebe7-79162a68e2e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor_State_PersuasionSuccess(2) = True
#.      - HAG_HagLair_State_PlayerPassedDoor(2) = False
#.      - HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor_HasMet(2) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_Hag_State_HagInLair = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - HAG_HagLair_Knows_DoorWasAlive(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:678cfc6c-85e2-315f-ebe7-79162a68e2e3
msgctxt "hfef987aaga513g4cdfga446g5cf07ae1c6a7"
msgid "*The presence within cowers - terrified of you.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6822d059-6eb3-5d90-e54c-f687805b7e89
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor_State_PersuasionSuccess(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:6822d059-6eb3-5d90-e54c-f687805b7e89
msgctxt "hd6153d66g8a40g46f5g92f3g6ab4d756a149"
msgid ""
"*The lightest touch of hope brushes your mind as the presence within "
"retreats.*"
msgstr "*내면의 존재가 물러서자 한 줄기의 희망이 당신의 마음을 스쳐지나갑니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 69031627-4e05-0460-76e5-9501dc10cf4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:69031627-4e05-0460-76e5-9501dc10cf4f
msgctxt "hc945cdfcg2c37g4105ga4bdg7fab4493b52c"
msgid "*You lay bleeding as she leans over you - a smile on her face.*"
msgstr "*피를 흘리며 누워있는 당신 앞에 그녀가 몸을 숙이고 있습니다. 그녀의 얼굴은 미소를 띱니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6b4dfff1-a889-532a-d01a-6106b71ea178
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:6b4dfff1-a889-532a-d01a-6106b71ea178
msgctxt "hdef7ae29gfef6g419bga3e8g2b4c0a94bdf7"
msgid ""
"*You see the hag. She walks <i>through</i> the door, its form shimmering.*"
msgstr "*해그가 보입니다. 그녀가 문을 <i>뚫고</i> 들어가는 모습이 일렁입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6f27adad-37b5-d9f2-4a89-3c3172d9f804
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:6f27adad-37b5-d9f2-4a89-3c3172d9f804
msgctxt "h41d823fbg8098g46a8g83f8g43a9cf5a9ea2"
msgid ""
"*You see the gallery, its walls lined with the hag's victims - their bodies "
"and minds twisted beyond ruin.*"
msgstr "*해그의 희생자들이 벽에 늘어서 있는 회랑이 보입니다. 이들의 육체와 정신이 파멸을 넘어 뒤틀려 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6f6e2e32-a716-dae4-9f15-c72bc5ab2ee4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor_State_PersuasionSuccess(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:6f6e2e32-a716-dae4-9f15-c72bc5ab2ee4
msgctxt "hfc4c3b98gd95fg4b46ga6e2gc086d8bea45d"
msgid ""
"*With a jerk, you're pulled from the vision. You feel the presence within "
"shrink - terrified.*"
msgstr "*당신은 한 번에 낚아채이며 환상에서 끌려나옵니다. 그 안의 존재가 움츠러들며 두려워하는 것이 느껴집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 72488071-7400-085f-6232-f75c157210ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Not_For_EA = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN_VENGEANCE(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:72488071-7400-085f-6232-f75c157210ed
msgctxt "h730e9d7dg09c2g4737gaee4ga14d9193bb24"
msgid "I will strike the hag down with the full force of my fury - I swear it."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 73a20843-7f19-4cc4-2e48-07c59986fa7d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor_State_PersuasionSuccess(2) = False
#.   Local:
#.      - 8adffca0-956b-e9ff-89f7-2c89bcaa2b9d_p2_Once = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 8adffca0-956b-e9ff-89f7-2c89bcaa2b9d_p2_Once = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:73a20843-7f19-4cc4-2e48-07c59986fa7d
msgctxt "hcadf7304g0c4eg42aeg983fgf26066d64b20"
msgid "If I kill the hag, you'll be free."
msgstr "내가 해그를 해치우면 넌 해방될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 751f0454-d353-1699-893d-d9990619fe5c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:751f0454-d353-1699-893d-d9990619fe5c
msgctxt "h33d15d23g7c64g4387g9fbfgcc64c6c69fff"
msgid ""
"*A scene appears in your mind: two paladins and a cleric marching through "
"the door - shrouded in the glow of the divine.*"
msgstr "*당신의 머릿속에 한 광경이 나타납니다: 팔라딘 두 명과 클레릭 한 명이 신성한 광휘에 둘러싸인 채 문을 통과합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 78250517-7ce0-5297-a684-33edc0389ced
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:78250517-7ce0-5297-a684-33edc0389ced
msgctxt "h3aefeab2g4365g4797ga80dg767f07b773ed"
msgid ""
"*Her teeth, a row of deadly needles, shine as they dive into your throat, "
"blood spraying.*"
msgstr "*치명적인 바늘인 그녀의 치아 한 줄이 빛나더니, 당신의 목으로 뛰어들어, 피를 튀깁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 785b76f7-5cf0-8f3d-1011-1a319dfb2f73
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:785b76f7-5cf0-8f3d-1011-1a319dfb2f73
msgctxt "h5c3dd57eg13deg4df5g9fd1ga9097702a150"
msgid "*The door twitches but stays firm.*"
msgstr "*문이 떨지만 꿈쩍도 하지 않습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 7ffaa251-b6f1-009b-d429-e30f63fbf562
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:7ffaa251-b6f1-009b-d429-e30f63fbf562
msgctxt "h26e6fb94gaeb7g43eagb4c4ge38267c1c872"
msgid ""
"You let them in? <i>Naughty.</i> That's a decade for each. You're mine for "
"thirty more years, petal."
msgstr "저들을 들여보내? <i>버르장머리 없는 것.</i> 한 명당 10년씩이야. 넌 30년 더 내 것으로 지내줘야겠구나, 꽃잎아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 851daa90-4cca-934a-f2e7-675687888c5e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_Hag_State_HagGivenMercy = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:851daa90-4cca-934a-f2e7-675687888c5e
msgctxt "he076429cg0929g4510g9638gac0bd48e01ae"
msgid ""
"*The presence within sobs. The hag is gone. He's trapped in this door, this "
"wooden prison - forever.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 8c65603a-d2d4-b72a-14ad-66664a19edf5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:8c65603a-d2d4-b72a-14ad-66664a19edf5
msgctxt "hc5e00682g6631g402bgb569g8144e3fc9ef3"
msgid ""
"*Fear rushes through you as the door shakes, remembering the hag's smile.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9166eb18-1592-0569-4a43-5cff5b298f8c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:9166eb18-1592-0569-4a43-5cff5b298f8c
msgctxt "h2f4f889bgb6a7g43b0ga3a8gd355edf291a3"
msgid "*She cackles. The man's remaining flesh twisted and contorted...*"
msgstr "*해그가 낄낄거립니다. 남자의 남은 살점은 뒤틀리고 일그러집니다...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 937a5052-536c-6c3a-4a33-b08803c5d8db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:937a5052-536c-6c3a-4a33-b08803c5d8db
msgctxt "h5da00efbg9461g489fgbec6gfdd75743fa74"
msgid "I have to get through. Now."
msgstr "통과해야겠군. 당장."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 93e71642-cbd7-1992-9b9c-7fb1755e2670
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:93e71642-cbd7-1992-9b9c-7fb1755e2670
msgctxt "hf1970dadgd3b4g4a14g9844gec35d89e97b4"
msgid ""
"*The door shudders, imagining its wooden frame cracking and splintering in a "
"raging inferno.*"
msgstr "*문이 흔들리며, 자신의 나무 몸체가 맹렬한 지옥불에 휩싸여 산산조각나는 모습을 투영시킵니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9894a7f0-59d6-117a-0f83-0e4ea7ddd51f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:9894a7f0-59d6-117a-0f83-0e4ea7ddd51f
msgctxt "h557e6833gbfb7g416agbc0fg7bd661b020ad"
msgid "Are you going to open up or not?"
msgstr "열거야 말거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9a932678-0aef-1608-0288-f2e0c916d88c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_Hag_State_HagInLair = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - HAG_HagLair_Knows_DoorWasAlive(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:9a932678-0aef-1608-0288-f2e0c916d88c
msgctxt "h0e59a915gc29bg4780g8ca4g8cc5c7ae25a0"
msgid ""
"*You feel the barest touch of magic, wild and chaotic, beneath the twisted "
"surface of the door.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9bc650d7-1de0-62c9-0984-0e16bf4e4a23
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:9bc650d7-1de0-62c9-0984-0e16bf4e4a23
msgctxt "h1cb0da93gca5eg42c2g87d7g216996308095"
msgid "I mean it. Let me <i>through</i>."
msgstr "나는 진심이야. <i>통과하게</i> 해줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a55d4b35-c491-1f0d-e9d6-04e0cf34ca35
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 8adffca0-956b-e9ff-89f7-2c89bcaa2b9d_perceptionsuccess = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:a55d4b35-c491-1f0d-e9d6-04e0cf34ca35
msgctxt "hdaf9c632gaf77g4679g8361gf6d242ef73a7"
msgid "I can see through you. I can just walk right in."
msgstr "뒤가 훤히 보이잖아. 그냥 무시하고 지나가면 되겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b0881542-387f-f57a-0acd-703e891a7ad6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:b0881542-387f-f57a-0acd-703e891a7ad6
msgctxt "h5a45b37bg2432g40b0g9f75g65358870f158"
msgid "*...becoming the twisted surface of the door before you.*"
msgstr "*... 그리고 당신의 눈앞에 있는 문의 뒤틀린 표면이 됩니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b44db906-2bc7-ac70-3032-0060b7194591
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:b44db906-2bc7-ac70-3032-0060b7194591
msgctxt "h6e8ef2aagdc0fg4f28g8526gff982fad6524"
msgid "What happened last time you opened?"
msgstr "마지막으로 열었을 때에는 무슨 일이 있었지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b70fc721-20d5-3bb9-9a4b-ca38f7aca5ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAG_HagLair_State_PlayerPassedDoor(2) = False
#.      - HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor_HasMet(2) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_Hag_State_HagInLair = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor_HasMet(2) = True
#.   User:
#.     - HAG_HagLair_Knows_DoorWasAlive(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:b70fc721-20d5-3bb9-9a4b-ca38f7aca5ff
msgctxt "hc8e0783bg113dg4c53g939dg382579d45358"
msgid ""
"*You feel crushing waves of fear as a presence within the door recoils. It "
"can't let people through. Not again!*"
msgstr "*문 안의 존재가 움찔하자 두려움의 파도가 밀려오는 것을 느낍니다. 이 존재는 사람을 들일 수 없습니다. 다시는!*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c6592358-ab29-573f-2a14-e3603cf9b6f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor_State_PersuasionSuccess(2) = False
#.   Local:
#.      - 8adffca0-956b-e9ff-89f7-2c89bcaa2b9d_p1_Once = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 8adffca0-956b-e9ff-89f7-2c89bcaa2b9d_p1_Once = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:c6592358-ab29-573f-2a14-e3603cf9b6f7
msgctxt "h7add4b56g1650g48b5g8d98g30124d46a5dd"
msgid "Open up, or I'll burn you to ashes."
msgstr "문 열어, 안 그럼 한 줌의 재로 만들어주겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ca5c5be8-772a-5376-6260-920985a7bc31
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:ca5c5be8-772a-5376-6260-920985a7bc31
msgctxt "hfdeff49dg4bd1g453agbb2bgc2167f14b5a9"
msgid "Not happening. The hag will die first - count on it."
msgstr "그럴 일 없어. 해그가 먼저 죽을 거야. 믿어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d7eaa184-f639-baf1-f3f7-cee810590bbf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:d7eaa184-f639-baf1-f3f7-cee810590bbf
msgctxt "h733b64e6gc570g4bfagb51ag05837361c407"
msgid ""
"*The door remains firmly closed as the presence shrinks, twisting with fear "
"and despair.*"
msgstr "*문은 굳게 닫혀있습니다. 공포와 절망으로 뒤틀리고 움츠러든 채.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e48520d4-a5fd-786f-f0f0-3b929580921d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:e48520d4-a5fd-786f-f0f0-3b929580921d
msgctxt "h6b8fa562gc98fg4465gab87g60ae81268567"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e5996f45-485e-106c-b0ba-799c4bb9ee0b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor:e5996f45-485e-106c-b0ba-799c4bb9ee0b
msgctxt "h3e5b254bg89c5g4af8ga0d3g8a113a82fedf"
msgid "*Screams of terror pierce the air.*"
msgstr "*공포의 비명이 허공을 가로지릅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_TalkingDoor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e9b43697-6281-25f0-3615-5882616fb484
