#.     - HAG_HagLair_HagVictim_004_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_Victim_004:591b2c7a-2066-bbb6-f6f4-f7c439ff9b46
msgctxt "h420b0f54gb32eg481bg8605gf4fcff3b2f4d"
msgid ""
"*As you edge closer to the mirror, a pale face appears, contorted in fear. "
"Fists slam against the mirror's surface. Again and again.*"
msgstr ""
"*거울에 가까이 다가가자, 두려움에 일그러진 창백한 얼굴이 나타납니다. 주먹들이 거울 표면을 세게 칩니다. 몇 번이고 반복합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_HagLair_Victim_004
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 7291ded9-cf6c-c1a2-13a3-8384977f6696
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
