#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hag_PAD_FreedFromControl:99d2589a-ad9c-0350-21f4-a43f7277be31
msgctxt "h4224e1e9g211bg49f2ga82cg82811c43e8e3"
msgid "At last! How foul it was to have hag in the head."
msgstr "드디어! 해그가 머릿속을 헤집어 놓는다는 건 정말 끔찍한 경험이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hag_PAD_FreedFromControl
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 99d2589a-ad9c-0350-21f4-a43f7277be31
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hag_PAD_FreedFromControl:99d2589a-ad9c-0350-21f4-a43f7277be31
msgctxt "h3858770fge75bg4d69g93c8ge7aee21f3e35"
msgid "Phew. Hope she didn't see anything about the Incident."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hag_PAD_FreedFromControl
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 99d2589a-ad9c-0350-21f4-a43f7277be31
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hag_PAD_FreedFromControl:99d2589a-ad9c-0350-21f4-a43f7277be31
msgctxt "hb89dd1e9g06c0g4d45gb1c2g31e757ff264d"
msgid "My mind is my own. <i>Finally.</i>"
msgstr "제 정신으로 돌아왔어. <i>마침내.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hag_PAD_FreedFromControl
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 99d2589a-ad9c-0350-21f4-a43f7277be31
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hag_PAD_FreedFromControl:99d2589a-ad9c-0350-21f4-a43f7277be31
msgctxt "h50c152aeg1126g49fega161gb21f20463c2c"
msgid ""
"Ugh. I've enough trespassers in my head without <i>her </i>joining in the "
"fun."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hag_PAD_FreedFromControl
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 99d2589a-ad9c-0350-21f4-a43f7277be31
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hag_PAD_FreedFromControl:99d2589a-ad9c-0350-21f4-a43f7277be31
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hbc619e05g7b48g4950ga066g0e635470de6d"
msgid "Damn - she got deep in my head."
msgstr "젠장, 그 년이 내 머릿 속 깊이 침투해있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hag_PAD_FreedFromControl
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 99d2589a-ad9c-0350-21f4-a43f7277be31
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hag_PAD_FreedFromControl:99d2589a-ad9c-0350-21f4-a43f7277be31
msgctxt "h3de950b9g74acg4914g9048g9755d9b536e7"
msgid "Finally. I can <i>think</i> again. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 0084be4a-28b5-01e4-6353-954c7e8d0ff6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:0084be4a-28b5-01e4-6353-954c7e8d0ff6
msgctxt "had62edd3g0d60g40c1g92c6gfa5165c7468d"
msgid "Thank you. I don't think there's anyone else who would've saved me."
msgstr "고마워요. 저를 구해줄 다른 사람은 없었을 거예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 00c50c67-641b-5d41-141d-5e03f9e2ca6f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:00c50c67-641b-5d41-141d-5e03f9e2ca6f
msgctxt "h950632c3g050ag4670gb119gfda3ccf6e33e"
msgid "But I should've seen it!"
msgstr "하지만 저는 눈치챘어야 했어요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 014e17b0-8f32-2f36-d222-767b24286b14
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:014e17b0-8f32-2f36-d222-767b24286b14
msgctxt "h07d988e9g2c78g4c1bg9066g0ad95fc6ae0f"
msgid "My husband gave it to me. I should take him home."
msgstr "제 남편이 제게 준 것이에요. 저는 그를 집으로 데려가야 해요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 04cdb0fa-e56e-29a5-db7a-a6829708597a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:04cdb0fa-e56e-29a5-db7a-a6829708597a
msgctxt "ha06b8cd1gd83cg43fegab7fgda63eac5deb3"
msgid "<i>Good. </i>"
msgstr "<i>좋아요. </i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 06164b5a-d6b5-817c-bb1c-83506107630f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:06164b5a-d6b5-817c-bb1c-83506107630f
msgctxt "ha8cef6e3ga8aeg499cg8f00g2ba60d700a3b"
msgid "What would have happened to your child?"
msgstr "당신 아이는 어떻게 될 것이었지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 06a44a5e-c271-d596-c93d-88f9c41fb9f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAG_Hagspawn_State_MayrinaAngry(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:06a44a5e-c271-d596-c93d-88f9c41fb9f5
msgctxt "h6e7e420bg580cg478ega465g5e2e08d762ae"
msgid "I hope you're happy."
msgstr "당신이 행복하면 좋겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 094293d9-b261-b519-4e62-5697534771bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - HAG_HagSpawn.SavedMayrina(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:094293d9-b261-b519-4e62-5697534771bd
msgctxt "hc3e5a35agb024g42acgb566gc117965b69f9"
msgid ""
"His coffin is just upstairs. A decent burial is the least I can give him."
msgstr "그의 관이 바로 위층에 있어요. 잘 묻어주는 것이 제가 그에게 해줄 수 있는 최소한의 도리겠죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0a0648ee-74c7-3f7c-6499-0dea3ff32f3d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:0a0648ee-74c7-3f7c-6499-0dea3ff32f3d
msgctxt "h8e0e73c5gf3a1g44e2ga921g9c7c0354c1c1"
msgid "You're an idiot for believing that."
msgstr "그걸 믿다니 당신은 멍청이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 0ad4a579-6a92-a4e6-d7a5-367bf4cbade5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:0ad4a579-6a92-a4e6-d7a5-367bf4cbade5
msgctxt "ha2990eccgee2eg4b32gaed2g3bd460acf5f1"
msgid "I... I think you're right. That's what Ethel always told me."
msgstr "저는... 저는 당신 말이 맞다고 생각해요. 에텔이 언제나 제게 하던 말이었어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0c42449a-6e28-b198-5ddb-275ea5ae14f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:0c42449a-6e28-b198-5ddb-275ea5ae14f5
msgctxt "h0d699bf7g303cg4ed0g8cd5g6f245b278dc0"
msgid "Hags don't work for free. What did you promise her?"
msgstr "해그는 공짜로 일하지 않아. 그녀에게 무엇을 약속한 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 0d5b428b-9b03-ebdd-22c4-b132d2cceee9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:0d5b428b-9b03-ebdd-22c4-b132d2cceee9
msgctxt "h3a889facga61bg4b57gba4eg45c6f30f3082"
msgid "You bastard! You ruined it - you ruined everything!"
msgstr "이 개자식! 네가 망쳤어 - 네가 모든 걸 망쳤어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0dba4977-aeeb-127a-9c0e-2b19b0ee317f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:0dba4977-aeeb-127a-9c0e-2b19b0ee317f
msgctxt "h411b02b7g61c6g4b7egb8e5g02138ceb47ec"
msgid "You should have known better - hags don't help anyone but themselves."
msgstr "더 현명하게 행동했어야 했어. 해그는 그들 자신 말고는 아무도 돕지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 162c5c53-1726-082c-c532-bada943f3356
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_Hagspawn_State_EthelKilledBrothers = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:162c5c53-1726-082c-c532-bada943f3356
msgctxt "h1b78256eg00b0g47f2g863bg55135eb94cc6"
msgid "I'm so stupid. How could I have trusted her?"
msgstr "전 너무 멍청했어요. 어떻게 그녀를 믿을 수가 있었을까요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1a08b80c-ac1d-b3e1-b516-173ae69f409b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:1a08b80c-ac1d-b3e1-b516-173ae69f409b
msgctxt "h19bfda5bg7241g4ee2g9e4fgdb0bc27ae5c2"
msgid "Ethel saw you were vulnerable. She took advantage."
msgstr "에델은 당신이 취약하다는 걸 알았어. 그녀는 그걸 이용한 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1acaf201-2fca-9812-b79a-8520b0f73478
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:1acaf201-2fca-9812-b79a-8520b0f73478
msgctxt "heaead071g1b12g4163g9722g5a3089602963"
msgid "That doesn't excuse the deal you made."
msgstr "그렇다고 당신이 한 거래에 양해를 구할 순 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1be992af-a4fd-7be3-2b51-d66c5de78759
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:1be992af-a4fd-7be3-2b51-d66c5de78759
msgctxt "h52603e8eg7337g49c5g8a51g06ae52ad0468"
msgid "You were going to trade your <i>baby </i>for your dead husband?"
msgstr "죽은 남편을 위해 <i>아기</i>를 거래하려 한 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 1fed0d51-39ed-5dfb-b540-526834b0e72e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:1fed0d51-39ed-5dfb-b540-526834b0e72e
msgctxt "h132c489egcec3g43bfg859agba0f9fdf7d17"
msgid "What? I have <i>nothing</i>. Wait."
msgstr "뭐라고요? 저는 <i>아무것도</i> 없어요. 잠시만요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 21627297-1071-0987-90cf-c33eb960f165
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:21627297-1071-0987-90cf-c33eb960f165
msgctxt "h98355a10gfac6g4336ga74fg3b6c25c37ec5"
msgid "Because of Auntie Ethel. You nearly died!"
msgstr "에텔 이모 때문이지. 당신 거의 죽을 뻔했다고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 27faff00-e99b-e73f-00c9-d27f462b0ac8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAG_Hagspawn_Knows_PromisedRaiseHusband = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:27faff00-e99b-e73f-00c9-d27f462b0ac8
msgctxt "hd5f959e4gcba6g496bgb790gd40b754194c2"
msgid "My husband. She was going to bring him back. Bring Connor back to life."
msgstr "제 남편이요. 그녀는 그를 되살려주겠다고 했어요. 코너를 살아있는 상태로 되돌려주겠다고 했다구요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 2910cc67-c409-7128-53e7-7c19f92a004e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:2910cc67-c409-7128-53e7-7c19f92a004e
msgctxt "h1fcb971dg30c9g4e8ega8dfg904302bec77b"
msgid ""
"Go on. Walk away. And wave to my husband's rotting corpse on your way out."
msgstr "계속 지나가세요. 그리고 떠나는 길에 제 남편의 썩어가는 시체에 손 흔들어주세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 29b2e8c0-1007-5930-e555-990c3ec879c5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:29b2e8c0-1007-5930-e555-990c3ec879c5
msgctxt "h2e8dd3dag686cg4760gb26ag9a09c047dcdb"
msgid "I almost gave that monster my <i>child</i>."
msgstr "저는 그 괴물에게 제 <i>아이</i>를 바칠 뻔했어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 2a00d8cc-dd7d-b946-eeed-00cabd899cd0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:2a00d8cc-dd7d-b946-eeed-00cabd899cd0
msgctxt "h6e19349bg7cf8g4c14gae19g18ab874190c6"
msgid ""
"Auntie Ethel promised to give this child a good life - teach them magic, "
"even!"
msgstr "에텔 이모가 아이에게 좋은 삶을 약속했어요. 심지어 마법도 가르쳐주고요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 2cddd819-b049-0cf4-7857-80cb869ad879
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:2cddd819-b049-0cf4-7857-80cb869ad879
msgctxt "haa8217bdg5fe0g4d08g9622gd8817f58da96"
msgid "No - I don't believe it."
msgstr "아냐 - 나는 믿지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 2e0def05-fc54-b593-6f68-50b538f12925
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:2e0def05-fc54-b593-6f68-50b538f12925
msgctxt "h7c66df88g329ag4ee6g95c7g531cf52f0b5f"
msgid ""
"Awake or asleep I could hear her. Laughing at me. Taunting me. Now it's gone."
msgstr "저는 자나깨나 그녀의 소리를 들어야 했어요. 저를 비웃는 소리. 저를 조롱하는 소리. 이제 사라졌어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 31c17648-0cd8-2485-164a-9ef047ae51c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAG_Hagspawn_State_SurrogateKnowsKilledBrothers(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_Hagspawn_State_KnowsBrothersDead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:31c17648-0cd8-2485-164a-9ef047ae51c8
msgctxt "h62301457g05d5g4e9dg960bg06691f536623"
msgid "First my brothers and now my <i>husband</i>? What more do you want?"
msgstr "처음에는 내 오빠였고 이제는 내 <i>남편</i>이냐? 뭘 더 원하는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 335f730d-9c8f-e750-2386-1042ad011702
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - HAG_HagSpawn_Event_GiveSurrogateMotherLocket(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:335f730d-9c8f-e750-2386-1042ad011702
msgctxt "h7b0072cfg3f37g4317g8daag421a0d157889"
msgid "Better than nothing, I suppose."
msgstr "아무것도 없는 것보다는 낫겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 39a76039-69d2-2164-aead-0562b4103344
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - HAG_HagSpawn.SavedMayrina(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:39a76039-69d2-2164-aead-0562b4103344
msgctxt "h2fe193d6ge4eag4ca3g8766g8a728910aba7"
msgid ""
"That's right - he's buried outside. And I was <i>this </i>close to getting "
"him back."
msgstr "그 말이 맞아요. 그가 바깥에 묻혀있어요. 그리고 저는 그이를 되찾기 <i>직전</i>이었어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 3a959a40-3540-6508-3ea9-069dc8b64c03
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:3a959a40-3540-6508-3ea9-069dc8b64c03
msgctxt "h792d03a4g50f8g4ce2gbe95g8cc41123ebee"
msgid "You think my baby ever left my mind? Not even at my lowest."
msgstr "제가 마음 속에서 아기를 지워버린 줄 아세요? 최악의 순간에도 그러지 않았어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 43e4c12d-fd8e-03bc-9052-b4748683ba95
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:43e4c12d-fd8e-03bc-9052-b4748683ba95
msgctxt "h0d609c48g3a90g42c0gbf28g1b8080c154f8"
msgid "Why the hells would you even consider that?"
msgstr "도대체 왜 그런 생각을 한 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 45aeb305-0dc8-2e93-440e-82e5ba911a08
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:45aeb305-0dc8-2e93-440e-82e5ba911a08
msgctxt "h36bb5f5bg1766g4f7fg9641gddef3de3bc12"
msgid ""
"Don't judge me. I have <i>nothing</i>. My baby would have been raised in "
"rags."
msgstr "저를 판단하지 마세요. 제겐 <i>아무것도 없어요</i>. 제 아기는 누더기 옷을 입고 자랐을 거예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 492d10d6-802a-1354-5313-95cd90a5df1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:492d10d6-802a-1354-5313-95cd90a5df1f
msgctxt "h3d2d215eg1310g4bfag9cb8g131ea9caca69"
msgid ""
"I was <i>fine</i>. She wouldn't have killed me - I had something she wanted."
msgstr "저는 <i>괜찮았어요</i>. 그녀는 저를 죽이지 않았을 거라구요 - 저는 그녀가 원하는 것을 가지고 있었어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 494d4880-3ce6-b8f8-be16-f3c04ee4369b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:494d4880-3ce6-b8f8-be16-f3c04ee4369b
msgctxt "h3e6f6afbg2347g40b0ga3acg6702f3876747"
msgid "I know that now."
msgstr "이제 알겠군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4c528227-e9b2-6022-59ed-4a3d13c13e0e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:4c528227-e9b2-6022-59ed-4a3d13c13e0e
msgctxt "h490e0c29gba15g4f93gaf7fg11e0d595f2b7"
msgid "This is an interesting way of thanking me."
msgstr "감사를 표하는 방식이 좀 특이하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 4c57f97f-e459-1041-25ee-b2f135ff7e16
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:4c57f97f-e459-1041-25ee-b2f135ff7e16
msgctxt "hca039c48gd040g4b60gb0c5g72d4ba01fad4"
msgid "It's my own fault for letting her."
msgstr "그녀를 허락한 제 잘못이에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 4d3677b2-27d3-1834-cc4b-f00e5f5b72c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:4d3677b2-27d3-1834-cc4b-f00e5f5b72c4
msgctxt "h00fe588cg606dg4a58gbb13g64df1e0d42f2"
msgid ""
"I always wanted to be a mother. I... just never thought I'd do it alone."
msgstr "저는 항상 어머니가 되고 싶었어요. 저는... 이런 일을 혼자서 하리라고는 생각해본 적도 없어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4d3ee2b3-9f4e-746c-7300-d3f73752dba3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:4d3ee2b3-9f4e-746c-7300-d3f73752dba3
msgctxt "h19d6b69bg507bg4edcgbeddg5f8fd66041d2"
msgid "Not much indeed. Got nothing else?"
msgstr "정말 별거 없네. 다른 건 없나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 516ebf9a-57a1-b497-bf82-1c7f30f6f66f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:516ebf9a-57a1-b497-bf82-1c7f30f6f66f
msgctxt "h4b3b1a48g924eg4d5eg90ffge0b7fc00a007"
msgid "I'm sorry. You've been through a lot."
msgstr "유감이야. 많은 일을 겪었군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 526de541-3c28-1c05-8219-1fb42e1251cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:526de541-3c28-1c05-8219-1fb42e1251cb
msgctxt "hcfec0a28g0b05g4b00g8b17g4d01da6622f7"
msgid "No, you were desperate. And she took advantage of that."
msgstr "아니, 당신은 절박했어. 그리고 해그가 그 점을 이용했지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 5883abd4-09f6-f970-4fd3-fb9a02deb99a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:5883abd4-09f6-f970-4fd3-fb9a02deb99a
msgctxt "hc3d73946g5377g4deag9b59g06544dc04c1a"
msgid "I imagine Ethel would've said the same."
msgstr "에텔도 같은 말을 했을 것이라 생각해요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 5a436873-f6a3-4714-b605-4659dbca22c5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - HAG_HagSpawn_State_HasSurrogateMotherLocket(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:5a436873-f6a3-4714-b605-4659dbca22c5
msgctxt "hc7c5c01ag196ag43cbg9268gdc46b906e7d2"
msgid "Look - I don't like owing people."
msgstr "저기 - 저는 빚지는 것을 안 좋아해요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 5ca566aa-e2c7-81b0-9848-59fd4562a719
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:5ca566aa-e2c7-81b0-9848-59fd4562a719
msgctxt "ha24d3a95gcf10g46f3gb130g204f41e0f3f2"
msgid "She said I'd make a bad mother. I... I think she was right."
msgstr "그녀는 제가 나쁜 엄마가 될 거라고 했어요. 제 생각엔... 그녀가 옳았던 것 같아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5fa145d5-67d7-fecf-eba9-7ba0e7452e19
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:5fa145d5-67d7-fecf-eba9-7ba0e7452e19
msgctxt "h26f21076g2552g4c29ga102g05a38136cb80"
msgid "Are you done whining yet?"
msgstr "징징거리는 건 안 끝났나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 60411408-704d-a26c-e9fe-f9bda91d2e3d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:60411408-704d-a26c-e9fe-f9bda91d2e3d
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h7e624b13g4412g4419gaec3gf2fdd069357e"
msgid "People always say that. It doesn't mean anything."
msgstr "사람들은 항상 그리 말해요. 그러니 아무런 도움도 되지 않아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6745462b-c54d-b110-dfc0-581c566bede1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:6745462b-c54d-b110-dfc0-581c566bede1
msgctxt "h086507c0g71e9g4976g8b41gb21dfd4dba4f"
msgid "Now is the time to focus on your child."
msgstr "이제 당신의 아이에게 집중해야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 67862182-75d0-64a2-0585-3ad77910350b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAG_Hagspawn_State_MayrinaAngry(1) = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - HAG_HagSpawn.SavedMayrina(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:67862182-75d0-64a2-0585-3ad77910350b
msgctxt "hf221261fg077dg4b5egb1a5g77e44b58d041"
msgid "I hope you're happy."
msgstr "본인이 아주 자랑스러웠으면 좋겠네요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 68f767ec-891b-f09f-8d61-503d810b7fa9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:68f767ec-891b-f09f-8d61-503d810b7fa9
msgctxt "h78405c13g5f6fg4faeg8465gbbc79020a2f7"
msgid "A life for a life - you must really love your husband."
msgstr "생명을 위한 생명이라 - 남편을 정말로 사랑했나 보군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 69690573-23fa-0cc0-dc0c-272d66396c54
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:69690573-23fa-0cc0-dc0c-272d66396c54
msgctxt "ha37cd547g00ecg443ag8463g2f3973055aa9"
msgid "You <i>felt</i> it?"
msgstr "당신도 <i>느꼈어</i>?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 6b9c04bc-fcfe-2fec-0b2c-bbdeda6b2a60
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:6b9c04bc-fcfe-2fec-0b2c-bbdeda6b2a60
msgctxt "hd3a02299geae4g4c22g9e78gbb63fc3d489c"
msgid "She always told me I was worthless."
msgstr "그녀는 언제나 제가 쓸모 없다고 말했어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6dfc50a2-dc66-8cb5-520d-a4d308f7e63e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_Hagspawn_State_KnowsHagPurposeBaby = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:6dfc50a2-dc66-8cb5-520d-a4d308f7e63e
msgctxt "h8c4a0fd4gc7eeg4475g9a29g1aeb95f65264"
msgid "Auntie Ethel planned to eat your child."
msgstr "에텔 이모는 당신 아이를 잡아먹으려고 했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 72f1d404-f9e6-beba-742e-bf879f46547c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:72f1d404-f9e6-beba-742e-bf879f46547c
msgctxt "h12c55a9bgcb4dg45c5gb514g1c11f5f30c7f"
msgid "She would've! I had everything figured out. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 752fb372-a75e-7cbc-41f1-8d211934d055
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:752fb372-a75e-7cbc-41f1-8d211934d055
msgctxt "h70cba8c1gdf85g4358g89b2g4db53fa01f10"
msgid "...but take this locket. It's worth a bit. Now we're even."
msgstr "...그래도 이 로켓을 받아주세요. 조금이라도 값어치가 있으니 이거로 빚진 건 없는 걸로 쳐요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 78ebaba4-ad4a-825e-0d42-2973630ffb9b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:78ebaba4-ad4a-825e-0d42-2973630ffb9b
msgctxt "h628cb720g96e7g45c0g9ccdg19c006db51f4"
msgid "Just look after it, all right?"
msgstr "그냥 잘 관리해 주세요, 아셨죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 814534da-4198-7ec4-3814-94cab7d6768d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:814534da-4198-7ec4-3814-94cab7d6768d
msgctxt "ha8ff3d1bgf91dg4e69g86adgaf1c2df19fb6"
msgid "I <i>trusted</i> her."
msgstr "난 이모를 <i>믿었단</i> 말이에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 87d3d750-3986-d73d-73e4-2f4e4996d4d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:87d3d750-3986-d73d-73e4-2f4e4996d4d5
msgctxt "ha96c0856g30b4g4ce1gbd61gc9def91d333a"
msgid "Don't be naive - a hag was never going to help you."
msgstr "순진하게 굴지 마 - 해그가 널 도울 일은 절대 없었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8b10ee5f-5b2c-b71e-1420-2dafa84e6c3d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_Hag_State_HagGivenMercy = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:8b10ee5f-5b2c-b71e-1420-2dafa84e6c3d
msgctxt "h90cad962gba9fg4228gb1begd27c01cf6547"
msgid "Yes. She's left this place for good."
msgstr "맞아. 에텔은 여기를 영원히 떠났어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 8da20176-4be0-4764-d849-6bec6e03e553
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:8da20176-4be0-4764-d849-6bec6e03e553
msgctxt "hae4f2b63g91cag46eegb100g9bfbdc4090c5"
msgid "Really? That's..."
msgstr "정말요? 그건..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8f010f03-2a11-c945-721c-1e19e7412750
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:8f010f03-2a11-c945-721c-1e19e7412750
msgctxt "h49d567e2g5063g4f6fg94c7g8961e52d0f45"
msgid "I don't need this. Good luck getting out of here on your own."
msgstr "집어치워. 알아서 잘 빠져나가길 바라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 9253b382-e94a-395f-85cd-fb368cd0fe54
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:9253b382-e94a-395f-85cd-fb368cd0fe54
msgctxt "ha575a4dcg5791g4af7g856bg08db8aa568b1"
msgid ""
"It's this or the clothes off my back - and I'm not walking out of here "
"starkers. You want it or not?"
msgstr "이것 아니면 제가 입고 있는 옷밖에 없어요. 그리고 저는 벌거벗고 다니지는 않을 거예요. 이것 원해요, 원치 않아요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 92a5a20c-125b-2304-aec9-eb6eeb75ee12
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_HagSpawn_SurrogateMother_State_InLair = False
#.      - HAG_Hag_State_HagInLair = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:92a5a20c-125b-2304-aec9-eb6eeb75ee12
msgctxt "h439fab73ge893g48f8ga150gbcbaf4b8a003"
msgid "Ethel's gone, isn't she? I felt it."
msgstr "에텔은 죽었어요, 그렇죠? 느껴져요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 943ba746-2e5b-6c5b-99c5-5f9572c5a23c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:943ba746-2e5b-6c5b-99c5-5f9572c5a23c
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h2fcb7c77g4f71g4167ga942gf528ab2a49bd"
msgid "More than I could have done..."
msgstr "제가 해줄 수 있는 것 보다 더 잘 키워준다 그랬다고요..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 98d33aa4-2199-c23a-5935-02fc51d4bb43
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:98d33aa4-2199-c23a-5935-02fc51d4bb43
msgctxt "ha741160ag3866g4409g95b6g43fdd02dd05a"
msgid "I'm sorry. I was trying to help."
msgstr "미안해. 나는 도와주려고 했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9e13ccb8-ef65-e892-9bbf-5eaade812a46
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:9e13ccb8-ef65-e892-9bbf-5eaade812a46
msgctxt "hecb07e12g292dg4cd8g8d89g1988bcf17bb2"
msgid ""
"I mean - turning a child into a hag <i>does</i> involve teaching them "
"magic..."
msgstr "제 말은 - 아이를 해그로 기르면 <i>마법도</i> 가르칠 수 있고..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a0dfec5e-37bd-eb2a-05be-221e0429b652
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_Hag_State_IsDead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:a0dfec5e-37bd-eb2a-05be-221e0429b652
msgctxt "h9a6807aeg2edeg4335ga3d5gd85253168d72"
msgid "Yes. She's dead."
msgstr "그래. 그녀는 죽었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a110027e-e119-fc29-3251-f65333f08a8f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:a110027e-e119-fc29-3251-f65333f08a8f
msgctxt "h304561degb566g4c7fga99fgf76b58ae47ef"
msgid "With hags, nothing is ever over."
msgstr "해그와 엮이면, 끝이란 건 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = a3849cc5-2915-976a-2384-acd9378485db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:a3849cc5-2915-976a-2384-acd9378485db
msgctxt "h21f200f2g664bg4341g95b5gac07a649b133"
msgid "Connor would have done anything to save me - I had to do the same."
msgstr "코너는 저를 구하기 위해 무엇이든 했을 사람이에요. 저도 마찬가지예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a4fb86ef-0fb9-a0c7-dced-7976cf1a8196
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:a4fb86ef-0fb9-a0c7-dced-7976cf1a8196
msgctxt "h645aceb9g33e4g4a0fga152ge599a4461968"
msgid "Don't sell yourself short. You <i>can</i> raise this child."
msgstr "자신을 과소평가하지 마. 넌 이 아이를 돌볼 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = acc8400d-0c78-5518-d72c-42fcd1cfd705
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:acc8400d-0c78-5518-d72c-42fcd1cfd705
msgctxt "hf44fc3dfg3d08g431cgbc6agde21cec34f27"
msgid "I just wanted everything back - back the way it was."
msgstr "저는 단지 모든 것이 돌아오기만을 원했어요. 예전 그대로요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ae653c22-87d2-6ac5-83a7-d4d76f91f265
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:ae653c22-87d2-6ac5-83a7-d4d76f91f265
msgctxt "h02d77d64g1d5eg4528gbf42ge1c21e0d607d"
msgid "Yes. You are."
msgstr "맞아. 넌 멍청해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = af9cfa98-1ee8-b1c6-83d0-9ba6194d7373
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:af9cfa98-1ee8-b1c6-83d0-9ba6194d7373
msgctxt "h21757a2ag0822g4bd9g844agac38811bf6e7"
msgid "You'd have sacrificed a new life for a lost life? Pure selfishness."
msgstr "없어진 생명을 위해 새로운 생명을 희생시키려 한 건가? 순수히 이기적인 짓이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = b452d5ad-5f80-26df-1259-de69a0d76874
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:b452d5ad-5f80-26df-1259-de69a0d76874
msgctxt "h010f35f7g7197g4ddag9a2dg6c5dd8011e34"
msgid "I do. The baby, too."
msgstr "그를 사랑해요. 이 아기도요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = b4fe702a-07b1-3333-f003-0c08eb4b0297
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:b4fe702a-07b1-3333-f003-0c08eb4b0297
msgctxt "hb20b2394g01d1g4d38g8f24g19d82ccb3da3"
msgid "It was part of the deal. For <i>him. </i>"
msgstr "<i>그를 위한</i> 거래의 일부였어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = b81e33b9-9bc9-cfdc-e1ef-49a12bb43af3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:b81e33b9-9bc9-cfdc-e1ef-49a12bb43af3
msgctxt "h5b9c99f7gd77eg4bafg937ega24051a62ead"
msgid ""
"I thought I could fix it. Give my child a good home and bring my husband "
"back - all in one go."
msgstr "내 손으로 바로잡을 기회라고 생각했어요. 곧 태어날 아이에게 좋은 집을 주고, 내친김에 남편도 데려오는 거죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = b8f122f6-0556-9952-4d86-dc64414f1585
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:b8f122f6-0556-9952-4d86-dc64414f1585
msgctxt "h2270bbb5g808cg40dcgb103gc94540d89437"
msgid "Thanks to you, I'll never see him again."
msgstr "당신 덕분에 남편을 다시는 보지 못하겠죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = b95927a2-0738-1b79-ccd3-0d2f5cf0da94
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:b95927a2-0738-1b79-ccd3-0d2f5cf0da94
msgctxt "h8628fa62gcee9g4e2ega5a3gcf5e6c5b6585"
msgid "No, I'm not! Why ruin my deal when I was so close?"
msgstr "아직 안 끝났어요! 이제야 거의 다 왔는데 대체 왜 제 거래를 깨버리는 건데요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = c6dd1c5f-0ee6-b087-6d1f-f65034db3b29
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:c6dd1c5f-0ee6-b087-6d1f-f65034db3b29
msgctxt "h3af33267g45f3g47f9g8146g24f29efa08a8"
msgid "This."
msgstr "이거예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c7ca0dfa-6ded-e0cf-5fb6-bd772b008070
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:c7ca0dfa-6ded-e0cf-5fb6-bd772b008070
msgctxt "hd9c59964g4165g4923ga567g5d76d65cceb4"
msgid "I'm sorry - she lied to you."
msgstr "미안하지만 에텔이 너에게 거짓말 한 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = ca7f1128-5c8b-391c-32d0-a758af3227cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:ca7f1128-5c8b-391c-32d0-a758af3227cc
msgctxt "h98b92918g38a5g4f17gac1cge53d290b9573"
msgid "Gods. I never thought..."
msgstr "세상에. 그런 생각은 한 번도 못해봤어요..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cdb7830d-0225-6830-8d33-11de6a515a16
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:cdb7830d-0225-6830-8d33-11de6a515a16
msgctxt "hfe5feca7gc149g4ca8g85cdgd2aed477b915"
msgid "Let me know when you're done whining."
msgstr "질질 짜는 게 다 끝나면 말해줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = d4798eea-5342-6ccd-6be7-8785989929ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_Hag_State_HagGivenMercy = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:d4798eea-5342-6ccd-6be7-8785989929ed
msgctxt "hc9d99083g12e7g4dbfgb6f3gce8690c48bef"
msgid "I imagine Ethel thinks the same."
msgstr "에텔도 같은 생각을 했을 거라 생각해요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = d6ac6619-5731-2aca-ff26-68506ddf2ba5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:d6ac6619-5731-2aca-ff26-68506ddf2ba5
msgctxt "haef3420bg3120g436agab2cg3aec098180a3"
msgid "You want <i>thanks</i>? A slap is all you deserve."
msgstr "제 <i>감사</i>를 원해요? 당신은 오히려 뺨을 맞아야 해요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d795d2a9-16bd-fc1c-b84c-7265d06e73d4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:d795d2a9-16bd-fc1c-b84c-7265d06e73d4
msgctxt "h48e34d5ag5810g45cbgadd6g6cec09cbdc2e"
msgid "I took care of her."
msgstr "내가 적당히 손 봐줬지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = d7a04027-5be1-6fcf-25a5-8026c7cf0240
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAG_Hagspawn_State_SurrogateKnowsHagPurposeBaby = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:d7a04027-5be1-6fcf-25a5-8026c7cf0240
msgctxt "h2e03b043gb0fdg482fgab1bgd39d6d5c21b7"
msgid "<i>What? </i>But she promised to look after them! Teach them magic!"
msgstr "<i>뭐라고요?</i> 하지만 이모가 아이들을 잘 돌봐주겠다고 약속했어요! 아이들에게 마법도 가르쳐준다고 그랬다고요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = d7bcb6d9-9cd9-65e4-2dbd-18210316d889
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:d7bcb6d9-9cd9-65e4-2dbd-18210316d889
msgctxt "heecdf01ag20e7g4c6cg82d8g6dd18206a95c"
msgid "I can't believe I was so stupid."
msgstr "제가 그렇게 멍청했다니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d7de5037-ad89-0a34-0ae8-454cf9eef3ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:d7de5037-ad89-0a34-0ae8-454cf9eef3ed
msgctxt "h8be7b13egc542g44c9g9ba7g3092ae7c16a9"
msgid "Keep it. You don't owe me anything."
msgstr "간직하고 있어. 당신은 나에게 아무것도 빚지지 않았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d83fb9ca-1a80-d5a8-0acd-995e1e272a4b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:d83fb9ca-1a80-d5a8-0acd-995e1e272a4b
msgctxt "h957f4836g3d2cg47e6gb8feg96e4e1104072"
msgid "Your husband must have meant a great deal to you."
msgstr "남편이 당신에게 큰 의미가 있나 보군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = dcdb4aa4-f625-008e-4c5d-00b989460825
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:dcdb4aa4-f625-008e-4c5d-00b989460825
msgctxt "h69b1008dg3b0fg465bg96f0gde7b6eec0ae5"
msgid "I have <i>nothing, </i>all right?"
msgstr "저는 <i>아무것도 없어요, </i>아셨어요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = dd526886-bda8-da1d-8b3b-1b139ceae2ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:dd526886-bda8-da1d-8b3b-1b139ceae2ae
msgctxt "hf64deefbg9e39g4367g9f41gcd785b173127"
msgid "I never said it did! I just wanted you to <i>understand. </i>"
msgstr "그런 말한 적 없어요! 저는 그저 당신이 <i>이해해 주기</i>만을 바랐어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = dda05238-85f0-5c25-9f30-6b2754079543
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:dda05238-85f0-5c25-9f30-6b2754079543
msgctxt "h8e6a4cafg07f0g429cga11fg3a4f8bed00ec"
msgid "By making everything <i>worse</i>?"
msgstr "모든 걸 <i>더 안 좋게</i> 만들어서?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = dea281e8-49e5-5813-5ff2-c2df04d70c01
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:dea281e8-49e5-5813-5ff2-c2df04d70c01
msgctxt "h308ef063g1386g488cgab01g4632a6386eeb"
msgid "I'm more the fool for getting upset. It's likely gold you want, right?"
msgstr "제가 화를 내면 더 바보 같겠네요. 당신이 원하는 건 금이겠죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = e36608c0-a6fe-75e6-6ea2-ed757845b127
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:e36608c0-a6fe-75e6-6ea2-ed757845b127
msgctxt "hbdd506d5g6f4cg49e6g9fdag11c4797cda1e"
msgid "... I'm so stupid. So bloody <i>stupid. </i>"
msgstr "...전 정말 바보예요. 진짜 <i>멍청이야.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e3c154e4-6ea2-e9fc-f308-d7a686a4d8b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:e3c154e4-6ea2-e9fc-f308-d7a686a4d8b2
msgctxt "h743b5406g1061g4df1gbe22ga6fa1acff4df"
msgid "I shouldn't have helped you."
msgstr "너를 도와주지 말았어야 했군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e3f3b9e2-2bd6-0b82-a875-8cc76dfc7edc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:e3f3b9e2-2bd6-0b82-a875-8cc76dfc7edc
msgctxt "h1eeb80c3g51b1g439bg99cfg7eb5c3475e19"
msgid "Slow down - what did I do?"
msgstr "진정해 - 내가 뭘 어쨌는데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = e5f07e0c-c17c-bcf1-ea10-55e5ddd77512
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAG_Hagspawn_State_SurrogateKnowsKilledBrothers(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_Hagspawn_State_KnowsBrothersDead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:e5f07e0c-c17c-bcf1-ea10-55e5ddd77512
msgctxt "h01100285g4baeg49e5gbad3g73b9bbbfe311"
msgid ""
"I'm done. With you, with this <i>place. </i>After everything I went through "
"to get Connor back."
msgstr "지긋지긋해. 당신도, <i>이곳</i>도. 내가 코너를 되찾으려고 얼마나 고생을 했는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e8a0d629-36e0-cb52-cff0-67d50135913a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:e8a0d629-36e0-cb52-cff0-67d50135913a
msgctxt "hcb276f17gb093g4704g8318g4577b0530221"
msgid "That would have been foolish."
msgstr "어리석은 짓이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = e9c25999-7eaf-0875-aead-cfa52bba0ae9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:e9c25999-7eaf-0875-aead-cfa52bba0ae9
msgctxt "he7beb1e1g71cag427fg8555g53cb87da31f4"
msgid ""
"That's what she wanted - my baby. And, gods, I was going to do it - for "
"<i>him. </i>"
msgstr "그게 그녀가 원하던 것이었어요. 제 아기 말이에요. 신이시여, 게다가 저는 <i>그이</i>를 위해서 그 짓을 할 뻔했어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = eb6a4382-e8d4-c6c4-3269-1cdb3ffef2c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:eb6a4382-e8d4-c6c4-3269-1cdb3ffef2c8
msgctxt "hd2159bb8gaf89g4284ga085g133235bcce0c"
msgid ""
"Well, I didn't bloody ask you, did I? I didn't ask for any of this! I just "
"wanted Connor back."
msgstr "글쎄, 제가 뭣 같은 당신에게 부탁한 건 아니잖아요? 그 어떤 것도 부탁하지 않았다고요! 난 그저 코너가 돌아오길 바랐어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ec40b65d-cc47-f927-a461-578efd5d6b3c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:ec40b65d-cc47-f927-a461-578efd5d6b3c
msgctxt "hd9aa3afbg7bb1g4149g8ffeg4eee6ada0845"
msgid "From what I've seen, you'd make a terrible mother."
msgstr "내가 봤을 때 너는 끔찍한 엄마가 되었을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = ed74eef9-68b3-c745-eafe-a71a5146a5a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - HAG_HagSpawn_State_HasSurrogateMotherLocket(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:ed74eef9-68b3-c745-eafe-a71a5146a5a1
msgctxt "h0ae26158g007bg4352g8ef1g8edba1a75482"
msgid "Look, I - I don't have much..."
msgstr "봐요, 난..난 가진 게 별로 없어요..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = edaf8817-bea4-e2e9-e411-1ab0f2b839fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:edaf8817-bea4-e2e9-e411-1ab0f2b839fe
msgctxt "hb643f1edg0cfeg4e64g8b6bg85ae2d997321"
msgid ""
"Ethel promised to raise the child - teach them magic. Give them a <i>good</"
"i> life. That's a damn sight better than I can do."
msgstr ""
"에텔이 아이를 돌봐주겠다고 약속했어요. 마법도 가르쳐주고 <i>좋은</i> 삶을 보장해 주겠다고 했어요. 제 망할 눈에는 그게 훨씬 "
"나아보였어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = edfe4107-5a68-7503-2128-d45f462f4de6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:edfe4107-5a68-7503-2128-d45f462f4de6
msgctxt "h14101383g86ccg422dg92bdg12a43ad43e50"
msgid ""
"Just a bit longer and my child would have been born. And all this - all this "
"would have been over."
msgstr "조금만 더 있었다면 내 아이가 태어났을 텐데. 그리고 이 모든 게 - 전부 끝났을 거라고요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = ee0d492a-170f-e729-fafb-58c536c43800
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:ee0d492a-170f-e729-fafb-58c536c43800
msgctxt "h7208922fg4b38g4122ga9f2g5a9ef2216f11"
msgid ""
"Now I'll have to drag Connor's coffin all the way home. It's the only way "
"this child will ever meet their father."
msgstr "이제 코너의 관을 집까지 끌고 가야겠네요. 그게 이 아이가 아버지를 볼 유일한 방법이니까요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ef00fa42-db4d-e54a-3a7b-045f7e2c670a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:ef00fa42-db4d-e54a-3a7b-045f7e2c670a
msgctxt "hf697dc18g060cg4b5dg9014g7bbe69827d4b"
msgid "It was obviously too good to be true."
msgstr "그건 너무 행복한 생각인 거 알잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ef5d1f91-b4e8-b51f-a62d-3820d6418833
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:ef5d1f91-b4e8-b51f-a62d-3820d6418833
msgctxt "hcf2e7895g5f88g47b2g85ebg4d0e897815c4"
msgid "Is that what Ethel told you?"
msgstr "에텔이 그리 말하던?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = f26ee630-9c40-62ec-3516-e1c5b74dff71
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:f26ee630-9c40-62ec-3516-e1c5b74dff71
msgctxt "hab8f7fb9ge65dg4cf3ga61eg61bbc04c4195"
msgid "Here. This locket is worth some coin."
msgstr "여기요. 이 로켓이 약간의 돈이 될 거예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = f3b92842-83bc-3c43-b790-4489c7e3ee77
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - HAG_HagSpawn.SavedMayrina(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:f3b92842-83bc-3c43-b790-4489c7e3ee77
msgctxt "h1d1db110g92c1g4560ga046g8aaa6380345a"
msgid ""
"Now I have to drag his corpse back home, coffin and all, because a goddamn "
"grave is the closest I'll get to seeing him again. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fb9e4109-4262-83fb-d488-2daec91c25f4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:fb9e4109-4262-83fb-d488-2daec91c25f4
msgctxt "h705c5de8gcf86g437fg8c67gbbccf3f72c32"
msgid "Less crying, more gold please."
msgstr "울음은 줄이고, 금화를 늘렸으면 좋겠는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = fcbeb94b-00c9-cf28-57fa-5c353d27ad5c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:fcbeb94b-00c9-cf28-57fa-5c353d27ad5c
msgctxt "h4e445a25g2b3dg4b08gb301ga564448d2b81"
msgid ""
"Ethel was going to bring my husband back. Back from the dead! And now I'll "
"never see him again - because of <i>you.</i>"
msgstr ""
"에텔은 제 남편을 되돌려주겠다고 했어요. 죽음으로부터! 그리고 이제 저는 그이를 영영 볼 수 없게 됐어요 - <i>당신 때문에.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = fcec6ecd-4ca3-96e9-644f-68532ba117da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/HAG_Hagspawn_SurrogateMother_Lair:fcec6ecd-4ca3-96e9-644f-68532ba117da
msgctxt "ha8a19de9g69b7g4fe7g9b00ga31582bf0d6e"
msgid "This was the best chance I had - for me and my baby."
msgstr "이게 저와 제 아이를 위해 할 수 있는 최선의 선택이었어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/SFX_HAG_HagLair_Victim_003
#. Speaker = Lorin
#. NodeID = 2cc11600-e9a6-5ffd-effa-da73c539511f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/HagLair/SFX_HAG_HagLair_Victim_003:2cc11600-e9a6-5ffd-effa-da73c539511f
msgctxt "h355a92f2g4a59g4936g8ce2g0303e56eb055"
msgid "VO_SFX: Gasp before exploding "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_CollapsedTunnel_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fbd2fcdf-dc9d-619b-db83-bbefa261bb98
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_CollapsedTunnel_PAD:fbd2fcdf-dc9d-619b-db83-bbefa261bb98
msgctxt "hd8d2c0d1g89bag4153gac6fg73ef6d89cb38"
msgid "A collapsed tunnel. Nasty way to be buried."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_CollapsedTunnel_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fbd2fcdf-dc9d-619b-db83-bbefa261bb98
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_CollapsedTunnel_PAD:fbd2fcdf-dc9d-619b-db83-bbefa261bb98
msgctxt "hd17f322ag33e5g4e49gbaadgb866ca3eb1ac"
msgid "This place looks like a battlefield."
msgstr "여긴 마치 전장 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_CollapsedTunnel_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fbd2fcdf-dc9d-619b-db83-bbefa261bb98
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_CollapsedTunnel_PAD:fbd2fcdf-dc9d-619b-db83-bbefa261bb98
msgctxt "ha869da39g32e8g4c8fgb6ebgb427ce5184e2"
msgid "Fresh dead. This was no accidental cave-in."
msgstr "갓 죽은 시체군. 우연히 붕괴된 게 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_CollapsedTunnel_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fbd2fcdf-dc9d-619b-db83-bbefa261bb98
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_CollapsedTunnel_PAD:fbd2fcdf-dc9d-619b-db83-bbefa261bb98
msgctxt "h02cf4603g1453g468agb23aga73ed689f64a"
msgid "Fresh corpses. This was no mere cave-in."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_CollapsedTunnel_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fbd2fcdf-dc9d-619b-db83-bbefa261bb98
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_CollapsedTunnel_PAD:fbd2fcdf-dc9d-619b-db83-bbefa261bb98
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h1d5e7effg5bf8g493fg8fbcg7622df725df9"
msgid "Collapsed tunnel. Looks like it claimed some victims as well."
msgstr "무너진 터널이야. 몇 몇 희생자도 생긴 모양이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_CollapsedTunnel_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fbd2fcdf-dc9d-619b-db83-bbefa261bb98
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_CollapsedTunnel_PAD:fbd2fcdf-dc9d-619b-db83-bbefa261bb98
msgctxt "h73b71389gfa33g49c5gb8b6gd1bc3e5216a9"
msgid "What... a cave-in? No - that wouldn't explain the bodies."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_CollapsedTunnel_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fbd2fcdf-dc9d-619b-db83-bbefa261bb98
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_CollapsedTunnel_PAD:fbd2fcdf-dc9d-619b-db83-bbefa261bb98
msgctxt "hcbedb35dg808dg4cccga7a5g0ca248de2f65"
msgid "Bodies everywhere. Accident or sabotage?"
msgstr "사방에 시체들이야. 사고일까 방해 공작일까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_AD_CommandToAttack
#. Speaker = Flind
#. NodeID = 15eba9a0-3f63-cacd-78d4-d2e42840e650
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_AD_CommandToAttack:15eba9a0-3f63-cacd-78d4-d2e42840e650
msgctxt "h55c47ac5gd44ag4b4bg97e7g9e8aaa4a2018"
msgid "*Guttural howl.*"
msgstr "*목청껏 울부짖는 소리.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 029a4a17-ba72-2bcb-0c61-3561b90c928a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:029a4a17-ba72-2bcb-0c61-3561b90c928a
msgctxt "h8f8c4377gd8a6g4f73g99c8gf8f20deab708"
msgid ""
"<i>Fill her mind with a distracting joke. 'What's the difference between man "
"and meat?'</i>"
msgstr "<i>놀의 정신을 농담으로 채워 주의를 돌린다. '사람과 고기의 차이는 뭐지?'</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0919988f-dec3-c542-1a8d-30aa2ad310e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - b0ec8c14-e176-ffa4-01c5-74f22cae1eae_PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind_TurnedOnGnolls = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - PLA_ConflictedFlind_Event_TurnedOnGnolls(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:0919988f-dec3-c542-1a8d-30aa2ad310e9
msgctxt "he062ba87gd164g4300g9805g67a78c94e7a2"
msgid ""
"*Its host will feast on gnoll-flesh to control the hunger, to keep her teeth "
"from your throat.*"
msgstr "*그것의 숙주는 놀의 살점을 먹어치워, 굶주림을 달래고 이빨이 당신의 목으로 향하지 않도록 할 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 092ebc8a-e0c4-4bb0-a800-416e76b86378
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_State_SurvivorsAreDead = True
#.      - PLA_ConflictedFlind_State_Talked = True
#.   Object:
#.      - PLA_ConflictedFlind_Event_MindControl_Attack(0) = True
#.      - PLA_ConflictedFlind_Event_TurnedOnGnolls(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:092ebc8a-e0c4-4bb0-a800-416e76b86378
msgctxt "h7c7ef39cg10d8g4649g86d9g4f0556af60f3"
msgid ""
"*She is still ravenous, her mind a hungry pit. The flesh of the survivors "
"wasn't enough to satisfy her.*"
msgstr ""
"*놀은 여전히 욕망에 휩싸여 있습니다. 그녀의 정신은 마치 굶주린 구덩이 같습니다. 생존자들의 살점으로는 만족할 수 없었던 것 같습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0a3775e5-52d1-7d13-8c25-96ea32a792ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_State_Talked = False
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_Knows_SurvivorsInCave = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:0a3775e5-52d1-7d13-8c25-96ea32a792ce
msgctxt "h6d727d3ag9e72g4c3bg922fg1b7783f476a4"
msgid "<i>Search her memories - is there meat nearby?</i>"
msgstr "<i>놀의 기억을 탐색한다. 근처에 먹잇감이 있나?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0cbbe393-b157-b1ab-4823-4192eaa2bde6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - PLA_ConflictedFlind_Event_MindControlDamage_Minor(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:0cbbe393-b157-b1ab-4823-4192eaa2bde6
msgctxt "h85ab18b4gcb89g4f2cg84bdgb5c711fc211e"
msgid ""
"*You taste the blood in her throat, feel it pooling in the cavity of her "
"skull. But she still resists.*"
msgstr "*놀의 목구멍에서는 피 맛이 나며, 두개골에 피가 고이는 것이 느껴집니다. 하지만 그녀는 여전히 저항하고 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0e262d18-e6c4-6b55-1f74-9d9793af273f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:0e262d18-e6c4-6b55-1f74-9d9793af273f
msgctxt "h0797c4bcgf346g40abg98c2g9b5a55044a9e"
msgid ""
"*The meat is trapped - terrified - but protected by fire. When the fire "
"dies, the meat will die too.*"
msgstr "*고기가 궁지에 몰려 겁에 질렸지만, 불에 의해 보호받고 있습니다. 불꽃이 꺼지면 고기도 죽을 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1268c7de-53a7-452a-4354-5f5c9a133b40
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:1268c7de-53a7-452a-4354-5f5c9a133b40
msgctxt "hde51bedbg8611g403eg8accgd299189c4516"
msgid "<i>Search her mind for the source of the Voice.</i>"
msgstr "<i>놀의 정신을 탐색해 목소리의 근원을 찾는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1a3e6917-ea83-a57f-cd59-862ebaf258c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ConflictedFlind_State_RegularGnollsDead = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = True
#.      - ILLITHID(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:1a3e6917-ea83-a57f-cd59-862ebaf258c9
msgctxt "h5405fac3g9e1bg48a1g9d0fg942dec872c51"
msgid "<i>Fight back, redirecting the gnoll's fury against her own pack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>저항하여, 놀의 분노가 자신의 무리를 향하도록 한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 1cc0b577-1904-7c45-a520-983e5653e3cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:1cc0b577-1904-7c45-a520-983e5653e3cb
msgctxt "hc6cf4bb3g4871g4aedg8b38gdf3a0e549cb3"
msgid ""
"*Buried deep, a tadpole struggles to assert control against the ravenous "
"chaos of her mind.*"
msgstr "*깊은 곳에 파묻힌 올챙이가 암컷 놀의 탐욕스러운 정신에 깃든 혼돈에 맞서 통제력을 발휘하기 위해 몸부림치고 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 2216af9f-0951-4021-8ee6-2de1f72fef5d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_Knows_SurvivorsInCave = True
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_State_SurvivorsAreDead = False
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#.      - PLA_ConflictedFlind_State_SeenIllithidIntro(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - PLA_ConflictedFlind_State_SeenIllithidIntro(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:2216af9f-0951-4021-8ee6-2de1f72fef5d
msgctxt "h17100b76gf993g49eag9dacg951ab7fe7803"
msgid ""
"*The mark glows, but you feel nothing in response. Your illithid power is "
"beyond reach until you rest.*"
msgstr "*문양이 빛나지만, 어떤 반응도 느껴지지 않습니다. 일리시드 능력을 더 사용하려면 휴식을 취해야 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 23421163-a86d-2d90-e861-7c204118026c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_ConflictedFlind_State_Hostile = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:23421163-a86d-2d90-e861-7c204118026c
msgctxt "ha682c0a7gf86fg4e99gb2c1g8d1b941fa64b"
msgid "*She sniffs the air hungrily as you approach, then prepares to strike.*"
msgstr "*당신이 다가가자, 암컷 놀이 허기진 듯 코를 킁킁거리며 공격할 준비를 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 375fbbc0-52c8-407f-8a30-3a1cc6351e90
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount3(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount3(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:375fbbc0-52c8-407f-8a30-3a1cc6351e90
msgctxt "h0c163af1g0703g4002g8451g61fd4bc1a613"
msgid "*Your mind lurches, reeling suddenly as if... bitten.*"
msgstr "*뭔가에 깨물린 것처럼 느닷없이 정신이 휘청거립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 386d86a9-ab6a-7ee8-2e71-1513e78aa2b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - PLA_ConflictedFlind_Event_MindControlDamage_Minor(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:386d86a9-ab6a-7ee8-2e71-1513e78aa2b7
msgctxt "hb7d98179g72b2g4510ga254g045a166e22a4"
msgid ""
"*You are powerless against such primal rage. She expels you from her mind, "
"intending to devour you.*"
msgstr "*원시적인 분노에는 손쓸 도리가 없습니다. 놀이 당신을 자신의 정신에서 밀어내며, 당신을 먹어치울 준비를 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 39ba69e3-3c1b-08f9-1141-cbe3ec258a4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ConflictedFlind_State_Talked = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_ConflictedFlind_State_Talked = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:39ba69e3-3c1b-08f9-1141-cbe3ec258a4f
msgctxt "h173e95f8g84b4g44bbgb1b3ge793d4d4a9bc"
msgid ""
"*With a shock of psychic pain, the pack leader's mind clamps onto yours.*"
msgstr "*초자연적인 고통의 짜릿함과 함께, 무리 지도자의 정신이 느껴집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3cb13a08-3f01-b302-3a67-72b3fc0c8169
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - PLA_ConflictedFlind_Event_TurnedOnGnolls(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:3cb13a08-3f01-b302-3a67-72b3fc0c8169
msgctxt "h6e0cd644gae6fg47c4g81acgde16bb9ad80c"
msgid ""
"*Your primal ferocity thrills her. Surrendering to it, she turns on her pack "
"in a berserk rage.*"
msgstr "*당신의 원초적 흉포함이 그녀를 전율시킵니다. 그 흉포함에 굴복한 놀이 광적인 분노와 함께 자신의 무리를 배반합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 43944516-7ffb-390f-dd79-a46c13d917e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:43944516-7ffb-390f-dd79-a46c13d917e9
msgctxt "ha47e6a44g0046g4d20ga40dg14a28c53fa9b"
msgid ""
"*Deep in the chaos of her mind, <i>something</i> responds to your command. A "
"tadpole.*"
msgstr "*혼돈과 같은 그녀의 정신 속에서, <i>무엇인가</i> 당신의 명령을 기다립니다. 올챙이입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 450088b0-052b-403b-99a2-be83d064c0ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount2(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount2(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:450088b0-052b-403b-99a2-be83d064c0ee
msgctxt "h0e3b5c56g6b05g4001ga424ga961c709b157"
msgid ""
"*Something stirs deep within you, hungry and alert... it's taking something "
"you'll never get back.*"
msgstr "*몸 깊숙한 데서 굶주리고 기민한 존재가 꿈틀댑니다... 잃으면 되찾지 못할 뭔가를 좀먹고 있군요.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 46063c22-bb4f-4f05-3223-e54906002b83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:46063c22-bb4f-4f05-3223-e54906002b83
msgctxt "h667605d4g3cfdg47fbg8f32g35f488c0b514"
msgid ""
"*The gnoll's tadpole squirms, responding to your intense focus. It draws "
"strength from you; it will protect you.*"
msgstr "*놀의 올챙이가 꿈틀거리며 당신의 강렬한 집중에 반응합니다. 올챙이는 당신에게서 힘을 끌어내어 당신을 보호해줄 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 491a7952-beca-df8b-1545-e0348acb0b7a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_Knows_SurvivorsInCave = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:491a7952-beca-df8b-1545-e0348acb0b7a
msgctxt "h80271b83ga6cdg4bd4gbbfag77ccb7da52c2"
msgid ""
"<i>Divert her attention to the cave - perhaps there's more meat inside?</i>"
msgstr "<i>놀의 주의를 동굴 쪽으로 돌린다 - 그곳에 고기가 더 있진 않을까?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4fd721b4-7194-e7ed-8d09-08465da6729a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:4fd721b4-7194-e7ed-8d09-08465da6729a
msgctxt "hffb77ac2g2fd5g4d74gb890g79b3b0df1f84"
msgid "<i>Focus on the tadpole. How did it come to be there?</i>"
msgstr "<i>올챙이에 집중한다. 어떻게 놀의 머릿속에 들어가게 된 걸까?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5131be1d-29f0-806f-54c0-6d5a03b75804
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:5131be1d-29f0-806f-54c0-6d5a03b75804
msgctxt "h5505e5e4g485bg4b71ga773g90efe8ac3752"
msgid ""
"*Gnolls see your whole <i>world</i> as a meal. This Voice is acting as a "
"leash, but it won't hold them for long.*"
msgstr "*놀은 <i>세상</i> 전부를 먹잇감으로 봅니다. 이 목소리가 아직은 목줄로 작용하고 있지만, 오래 가지는 않을 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 519365f3-7e60-c75b-a44c-9d121abf7887
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ConflictedFlind_State_RegularGnollsDead = False
#.   Object:
#.      - PLA_ConflictedFlind_Event_TurnedOnGnolls(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:519365f3-7e60-c75b-a44c-9d121abf7887
msgctxt "h3566fcfegec24g4746gb26bg98c0b863c225"
msgid ""
"<i>She wants more meat? Dominate her mind, ordering her to feast on the "
"other gnolls.</i>"
msgstr "<i>더 많은 고기를 원하는 걸까? 그녀의 정신을 지배해, 다른 놀을 잡아먹도록 만든다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 54d62126-c729-9485-05f0-2718b2dc286e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_ZhentShipment_Knows_SurvivorsInCave = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:54d62126-c729-9485-05f0-2718b2dc286e
msgctxt "hb36b6fddgce6ag418ega3c6g2ef5fae5475e"
msgid ""
"*In the cave. Anxious hearts throbbing, ready to burst, ready to gorge on. "
"The Voice says they are <i>meat</i>.*"
msgstr ""
"*동굴 안쪽입니다. 불안하게 터질 듯 뛰는 저 심장을 터뜨리고 먹어치워야 합니다. 목소리가 그들은 <i>고기</i>라고 말하고 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 58958a24-d97b-78f7-9556-f8783cc145e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 20
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ConflictedFlind_State_RegularGnollsDead = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#.      - ILLITHID(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:58958a24-d97b-78f7-9556-f8783cc145e6
msgctxt "h253b5c11gf57ag4af3gb934gb55cac19026f"
msgid "<i>Fight back, redirecting the gnoll's fury against her own pack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>저항하여, 놀의 분노가 자신의 무리를 향하도록 한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5bfec9ac-6d9f-4dec-ab7c-c6ef9c7bc270
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_ConflictedFlind_State_Hostile = True
#.   Object:
#.     - PLA_ConflictedFlind_Event_MakeGnollsLaugh(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:5bfec9ac-6d9f-4dec-ab7c-c6ef9c7bc270
msgctxt "h82d9da12g4576g4fbag9bc1g974c760abe8d"
msgid ""
"*Catching like wildfire, the cackling, howling laughter infects the nearby "
"gnolls.*"
msgstr "*들불처럼 번지는 킬킬거리는 웃음소리가 주변의 놀들에게 퍼져나갑니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63a8bacf-e76e-4f77-f110-b50f8c358a57
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:63a8bacf-e76e-4f77-f110-b50f8c358a57
msgctxt "hf8484c7dg86d6g452dga7b6g531df8b4561b"
msgid "<i>Dominate her mind, commanding her to feast on herself.</i>"
msgstr "<i>놀의 정신을 지배해, 스스로를 먹게 만든다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 666ffc19-7c6c-b21c-6d6a-acf13e5c4b77
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:666ffc19-7c6c-b21c-6d6a-acf13e5c4b77
msgctxt "h4152f817g5f6eg478bga16cg5ef9021902c3"
msgid ""
"*You see yourself through her eyes - a pulsing red cluster of organs. "
"<i>FEAST!</i> No... the Voice has forbidden this meat.*"
msgstr ""
"*당신은 암컷 놀의 눈을 통해 자신을 봅니다. 맥동하는 붉은 장기의 무리입니다. <i><b>먹잇감!</b></i> 하지만... 목소리가 "
"이 먹잇감을 금지하고 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 68f47c2e-c3f7-162b-f2f0-5531424cbf7f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - b0ec8c14-e176-ffa4-01c5-74f22cae1eae_PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind_TurnedOnZhent = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - PLA_ConflictedFlind_Event_MindControl_Attack(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:68f47c2e-c3f7-162b-f2f0-5531424cbf7f
msgctxt "hbb5b1e51g9da2g4518gb635gb37adfe5f35a"
msgid ""
"*For a moment, your throat seems to fill with warm blood, spilling into you "
"from a living vessel. Anticipation of the feast.*"
msgstr ""
"*잠시 동안, 마치 살아있는 혈관에서 혈액이 흘러드는 듯, 당신의 목이 따뜻한 피로 가득 찬 것 같이 느껴집니다. 포식을 향한 "
"기대감입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6abbf832-08a9-52a8-2de3-d0011d12f19f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:6abbf832-08a9-52a8-2de3-d0011d12f19f
msgctxt "hbcd2156bg04aag49cdg9795g9a7e885ab9d5"
msgid ""
"*... and then the Voice, bringing order: eating this meat was forbidden, but "
"it would lead her to a feast.*"
msgstr "*... 그러더니 목소리가 명령을 내립니다: 이 고기는 금지되어 있지만, 잔치로 향하는 길을 보여줄 것이다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6b791f90-e506-9272-5ac6-1bf6002bcee0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ConflictedFlind_State_RegularGnollsDead = False
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#.      - ILLITHID(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:6b791f90-e506-9272-5ac6-1bf6002bcee0
msgctxt "hf2e648a4gf703g4decg9352g8d239aacf8ed"
msgid ""
"<i>You are of the same pack - command her to devour the other gnolls.</i>"
msgstr "<i>놀은 나와 같은 편이다. 다른 놀들을 먹어치우도록 명령한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 72abdc91-37b8-c452-dfc3-e61fee61ff46
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_ConflictedFlind_State_Hostile = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:72abdc91-37b8-c452-dfc3-e61fee61ff46
msgctxt "haf252bfag4330g42b2ga685gd64bf718c00c"
msgid ""
"*No matter what the Voice says, you are <i>meat</i>. <i>Everyone is "
"meat.</i>*"
msgstr "*목소리가 뭐라고 하든 상관없습니다, 당신은 <i>고기</i>입니다. <i>모두가 고기입니다.</i>*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 746773e8-3806-4de0-b2e9-44884e044c2d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount6(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount6(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:746773e8-3806-4de0-b2e9-44884e044c2d
msgctxt "h6ce7beecg4424g416ag9741g5a3ecf812e45"
msgid ""
"*The presence deep in your mind is awake, unblinking. This is it. A single "
"word pervades your consciousness: 'Soon'.*"
msgstr ""
"*당신의 정신 속 깊이 자리잡은 존재가 태연스레 깨어납니다. 올 것이 왔군요. 한 단어가 당신의 의식 속으로 스며듭니다. ‘곧’*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 75274c6c-d614-e6ef-030a-381fc6f7c2f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:75274c6c-d614-e6ef-030a-381fc6f7c2f0
msgctxt "h9e3fe629g3c43g4855gb18ag731d17fd0845"
msgid ""
"*You see drow and goblins restraining her... a mind flayer reaching out...*"
msgstr "*놀의 눈을 통해 고블린과 드로우가 그녀를 결박하는 것이 보입니다... 그리곤 마인드 플레이어가 손을 뻗습니다...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 774e2644-4cc9-1ff9-b180-0d9bfcf832a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:774e2644-4cc9-1ff9-b180-0d9bfcf832a6
msgctxt "hb8314cb8g8dd5g4a6bgab48g5c6a7ebb55ff"
msgid ""
"*The gnolls considers you for a moment, rage still festering underneath her "
"curiosity.*"
msgstr "*놀은 호기심 아래 분노가 도사리는 채로 잠시 동안 당신을 고려합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7a24c70f-ad04-5bdf-9724-dc37580696fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ConflictedFlind_State_RegularGnollsDead = False
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = True
#.      - ILLITHID(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:7a24c70f-ad04-5bdf-9724-dc37580696fc
msgctxt "hf272d8degc3d4g42b8g9c27ga4482542a014"
msgid "<i>She wants meat? Command her to feast on the other gnolls.</i>"
msgstr "<i>고기를 원하는 건가? 그녀에게 다른 놀들을 먹어버리라고 명령한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7f933485-3cf5-5f3b-09e2-a701143be536
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ConflictedFlind_State_RegularGnollsDead = False
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = True
#.      - ILLITHID(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:7f933485-3cf5-5f3b-09e2-a701143be536
msgctxt "he1de696fg528fg451cgb577g52336de76dcf"
msgid ""
"<i>You are of the same pack - command her to devour the other gnolls.</i>"
msgstr "<i>놀은 나와 같은 편이다. 다른 놀들을 먹어치우도록 명령한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Flind
#. NodeID = 8149471b-555c-3685-8a71-3c03b838a7cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_State_SurvivorsAreDead = False
#.   Object:
#.      - PLA_ConflictedFlind_Event_MindControl_Attack(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:8149471b-555c-3685-8a71-3c03b838a7cc
msgctxt "h80e5dd29g0debg436fg9341g787eb269742e"
msgid "*Howl!*"
msgstr "*아우우!*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 835b63c4-f77f-3caf-782c-88b895ca89b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:835b63c4-f77f-3caf-782c-88b895ca89b9
msgctxt "ha6e2c205g6bb1g42efg817fg1ca2272a627e"
msgid "<i>'Meat isn't as noisy!'</i>"
msgstr "<i>'고기는 그렇게 시끄럽지 않아!'</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 86b514a4-f353-cf78-4450-ed863c7d2146
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_Knows_SurvivorsInCave = True
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_State_SurvivorsAreDead = False
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = True
#.      - ILLITHID(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:86b514a4-f353-cf78-4450-ed863c7d2146
msgctxt "hdb783a4fg9fb3g4e0bg9a67gb22bb05a5ee3"
msgid ""
"<i>Use the power within you to make her obey the Voice; to brave the flames "
"and feast on the meat in the cave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신 내면의 힘을 이용해 그녀가 목소리에 복종하도록 한다; 불꽃에 맞서서 동굴 안쪽의 고기를 포식하도록 명령한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8e916944-8827-22bf-6a33-4205ec4fa047
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:8e916944-8827-22bf-6a33-4205ec4fa047
msgctxt "hcd4e8130g8707g4420gb187g4c06514eb0ce"
msgid "<i>Harness your willpower, and order her to devour herself.</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신의 의지를 모아, 그녀에게 스스로를 먹도록 명령한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 93cadfab-64f0-4b5d-a631-1a04ff87aa9e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.     - TRUESOUL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:93cadfab-64f0-4b5d-a631-1a04ff87aa9e
msgctxt "hbd6dd472g909eg447eg8bf1gc793b9c46180"
msgid ""
"*Your mind is full, bursting with ecstasy and terror. Finally, it is coming. "
"You are becoming.*"
msgstr "*당신의 정신이 황홀경과 공포로 가득 차오릅니다. 마침내, 때가 됐군요. 당신은 변화 중입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9cdc729b-a867-c23f-90aa-9cb63fc0a256
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_Knows_SurvivorsInCave = True
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_State_SurvivorsAreDead = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = True
#.      - ILLITHID(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:9cdc729b-a867-c23f-90aa-9cb63fc0a256
msgctxt "hd5ffe576gca56g47e2g9861g630a1d07eacd"
msgid "<i>Harness her anger - the meat in the cave must die.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그녀의 분노를 이끌어낸다 - 동굴 속의 고기는 죽어야만 한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9d0e860d-9016-f62e-0c40-a5a967587c54
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - PLA_ConflictedFlind_Event_MindControlDamage_Minor(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:9d0e860d-9016-f62e-0c40-a5a967587c54
msgctxt "hddc9d683gdae0g4192gb42dg3824195fbc26"
msgid ""
"*She resists, her mind's teeth piercing your brain. Pain shoots through you.*"
msgstr "*그녀가 저항하며, 당신의 뇌를 정신의 이빨로 꿰뚫습니다. 격렬한 통증이 느껴집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9d86f2b0-bf85-2d25-ad7f-a0adbd993ce8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:9d86f2b0-bf85-2d25-ad7f-a0adbd993ce8
msgctxt "hfa22a42eg62f1g4306gb29agb1387b971092"
msgid ""
"*As you slip free, coming back to yourself, you hear the seductive hum of "
"your own blood. The gnoll will <i>drink</i> it...*"
msgstr "*당신이 풀려나, 원래대로 돌아오자, 피를 원하는 울림이 느껴집니다. 놀이 당신의 피를 갈망하고 있습니다...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9e6bf768-ce23-5d9b-d33f-73743307b6be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ConflictedFlind_State_RegularGnollsDead = False
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#.      - ILLITHID(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:9e6bf768-ce23-5d9b-d33f-73743307b6be
msgctxt "h2c0bf423gc4b2g46deg8f18g21fb8f314442"
msgid "<i>She wants meat? Command her to feast on the other gnolls.</i>"
msgstr "<i>고기를 원하는 건가? 그녀에게 다른 놀들을 먹어버리라고 명령한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a118e1e2-85ce-4f1d-bcc9-ffecfc736f91
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_Knows_SurvivorsInCave = True
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_State_SurvivorsAreDead = False
#.   Object:
#.      - PLA_ConflictedFlind_State_SeenIllithidIntro(1) = False
#.   User:
#.      - GLO_TadpoleIntro_NPC(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - PLA_ConflictedFlind_State_SeenIllithidIntro(1) = True
#.   User:
#.     - GLO_TadpoleIntro_NPC(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:a118e1e2-85ce-4f1d-bcc9-ffecfc736f91
msgctxt "hefd5f98dgcc95g40f0g83e2ga716d3fa100d"
msgid ""
"*A strange symbol glows, marked on their flesh, and something within you "
"stirs in response.*"
msgstr "*그들의 살갗에 새겨진 기묘한 상징이 빛나고, 이에 반응하여 당신 내면의 무언가가 꿈틀거립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a410c432-f8c9-e78b-c95a-16ac8e6f2789
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ConflictedFlind_State_AfterKilledRegularGnolls = True
#.      - PLA_ConflictedFlind_State_Talked = True
#.   Object:
#.      - PLA_ConflictedFlind_Event_TurnedOnGnolls(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:a410c432-f8c9-e78b-c95a-16ac8e6f2789
msgctxt "hb7dc0a86gcf77g4843ga923g1da56558238f"
msgid ""
"*She is still ravenous, her mind a hungry pit. The flesh of her pack wasn't "
"enough to satisfy her.*"
msgstr ""
"*그녀는 마치 굶주린 구덩이와 같은 정신을 지녀, 여전히 탐욕을 느끼고 있습니다. 놀들을 모두 먹어 치웠음에도, 만족하지 못하고 "
"있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a87636d4-298e-3ba5-17ac-824963c659cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_ConflictedFlind_State_Hostile = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:a87636d4-298e-3ba5-17ac-824963c659cc
msgctxt "hae0a3798g8341g4474g9f10g4869e5cbdeca"
msgid "<i>Sever the mental connection, and prepare to fight.</i>"
msgstr "<i>정신의 연결을 끊고, 공격할 준비를 한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a8db6225-291e-8825-8e75-a3eb177f35ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:a8db6225-291e-8825-8e75-a3eb177f35ee
msgctxt "h2804210dgef6fg4889g86d4g7aa36e3a9b75"
msgid ""
"*Her tadpole responds, thrashing violently, and the fragile tissue of her "
"brain tears and splits.*"
msgstr "*놀의 올챙이가 반응하며, 격렬하게 몸부림칩니다. 뇌의 연약한 조직들이 찢어지고 갈라집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ac306f4e-fa7f-4098-87b0-9551a75f299c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_Knows_SurvivorsInCave = True
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_State_SurvivorsAreDead = False
#.   Object:
#.      - PLA_ConflictedFlind_State_SeenIllithidIntro(1) = False
#.   User:
#.      - GLO_TadpoleIntro_NPC(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - PLA_ConflictedFlind_State_SeenIllithidIntro(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:ac306f4e-fa7f-4098-87b0-9551a75f299c
msgctxt "h676a56f2g86f4g41cdg8455ga273c59f8cc4"
msgid "*As the symbol glows, power courses through you. <i>Authority</i>.*"
msgstr "*문양이 빛나며, 몸에 흐르는 힘이 느껴집니다. <i>권위</i>.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = afce632a-ac35-98f1-1899-d20f9b06e0bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - b0ec8c14-e176-ffa4-01c5-74f22cae1eae_PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind_TurnedOnZhent = True
#.   Object:
#.     - PLA_ConflictedFlind_Event_MindControl_Attack(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:afce632a-ac35-98f1-1899-d20f9b06e0bb
msgctxt "h029c7a9cg112eg42efg9427g0268559edf45"
msgid ""
"*It is the source of the Voice. She will obey it. She will obey <i>you</i>.*"
msgstr "*목소리의 근원입니다. 그녀는 그것에 복종할 것입니다. <i>당신에게</i>. 복종할 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = afdce165-0ff6-0da2-45f1-6afe9a6f4f2d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_ConflictedFlind_State_Hostile = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:afdce165-0ff6-0da2-45f1-6afe9a6f4f2d
msgctxt "hab619dc2g1944g4d1ag8738gbbe729c11308"
msgid "*She severs the connection, and prepares to attack.*"
msgstr "*놀이 연결을 끊더니, 공격할 준비를 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b0e65871-bff2-c650-0896-7fc8b5bde8ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:b0e65871-bff2-c650-0896-7fc8b5bde8ac
msgctxt "h83844dd7g6623g427bg8d29g27ebfad0b1c8"
msgid ""
"*But a sudden pulse of rage severs your connection to the parasite, "
"expelling you from her mind.*"
msgstr "*그러나 갑작스러운 분노의 파도가 당신과 기생충의 연결을 끊어버렸고, 당신은 놀의 정신에서 쫓겨납니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b4a5e8b1-d461-c6cc-48ff-45e7fbd43f29
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:b4a5e8b1-d461-c6cc-48ff-45e7fbd43f29
msgctxt "h229ebac9g6d3eg4fd2g88d8g080c75ba9187"
msgid "<i>Her mind is too dangerous; free yourself, preparing to fight.</i>"
msgstr "<i>놀의 정신은 너무 위험하다. 연결을 해제하고, 공격할 준비를 한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b88fc668-2d64-ed18-69e4-d043c5df8187
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_ConflictedFlind_State_Hostile = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:b88fc668-2d64-ed18-69e4-d043c5df8187
msgctxt "ha060c2beg4dedg4343gab1fg61ee050a1c58"
msgid "<i>Withdraw from her mind, and prepare to strike.</i>"
msgstr "<i>놀의 정신에서 빠져나와, 공격할 준비를 한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = bf808f5a-09b2-4065-9452-79c5d595464f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount4(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount4(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:bf808f5a-09b2-4065-9452-79c5d595464f
msgctxt "he85d5dbdg2086g4540gab62g8468fdc71377"
msgid ""
"*A shadow swims across your vision, and a familiar voice tells you to be "
"calm. You are loved.*"
msgstr "*그림자가 낀 듯이 눈앞이 흐려지더니, 익숙한 목소리가 당신을 달래줍니다. 사랑이 느껴집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c164ddf5-0453-41d5-f9a4-57e6acced267
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_ConflictedFlind_State_Hostile = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:c164ddf5-0453-41d5-f9a4-57e6acced267
msgctxt "heb8cb18cg9301g4225ga037g421c06171ff9"
msgid "<i>Sever the mental connection, and prepare to fight.</i>"
msgstr "<i>정신의 연결을 끊고, 공격할 준비를 한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c60f472b-904c-b0e5-7e59-1f441f494052
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind:c60f472b-904c-b0e5-7e59-1f441f494052
msgctxt "hfccac469gb58fg450dg92e1g17a82d86d85b"
msgid "<i>Exert your mental power, commanding her to leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>정신력을 발휘해 놀에게 떠나라고 명령한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c69d4246-69f5-40ad-b789-87cb2be5d588
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
