msgctxt "hcd77d1c1g8094g4600g9fbfgcc364631c933"
msgid ""
"<i>Urge her to obey the Voice; to brave the flames and feast on the meat in "
"the cave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>암컷이 목소리에 복종해 불길을 무릅쓰고 동굴 안의 인간들을 먹어 치우도록 명령한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ConflictedFlind_Flind
