msgctxt "hcc87c071gd99ag4be9ga5b2g321e88259520"
msgid "Heh. I was gonna bite ya, but you're a quick one, huh? Good."
msgstr "헤. 널 물어버리려고 했는데, 재빠른 녀석이구나, 흥. 잘났어."

