msgid "What's this? Something's slashed up that rock."
msgstr "이게 뭐지? 뭔가가 저 바위를 베어 버렸네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DragonScratch_PAD
