msgid "Let's just go. There's only so much my stomach can take."
msgstr "그냥 가자. 비위가 상해서 더는 못 견디겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9c06b3cf-a45f-c791-147a-ef9cb07442c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P:9c06b3cf-a45f-c791-147a-ef9cb07442c0
msgctxt "h0e92e640gac82g433eg8045g1ec1145dfbc0"
msgid "Once-in-a-lifetime sight, that."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9c06b3cf-a45f-c791-147a-ef9cb07442c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P:9c06b3cf-a45f-c791-147a-ef9cb07442c0
msgctxt "hcb5e857agf5ecg45eagb4b4g4d191d45941d"
msgid "Bah. I've seen far greater dangers on Crèche K'liir."
msgstr "쳇. 클리르 양성소에서 이것보다 훨씬 더 위험한 것도 본 적 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9c06b3cf-a45f-c791-147a-ef9cb07442c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P:9c06b3cf-a45f-c791-147a-ef9cb07442c0
msgctxt "h63e095c3g83b4g4644gbda4g415481580b43"
msgid ""
"Vile creatures. Nothing that's born of a corpse should be allowed to live."
msgstr "불결한 괴물이다. 시체에서 태어난 것을 살려둘 수는 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9c06b3cf-a45f-c791-147a-ef9cb07442c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P:9c06b3cf-a45f-c791-147a-ef9cb07442c0
msgctxt "h2efa3437gbe1fg46bbgaea1g54aeb463cab8"
msgid "A strange sight indeed - and I've seen a great many."
msgstr "분명 기이한 광경이지, 난 이런 걸 많이 봤어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9c06b3cf-a45f-c791-147a-ef9cb07442c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P:9c06b3cf-a45f-c791-147a-ef9cb07442c0
msgctxt "h81c73957gff34g477agbef2g14cf46a0bd2c"
msgid "I wonder how many more newborns are around."
msgstr "갓 난 놀들이 주위에 얼마나 더 있을지 모르겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9c06b3cf-a45f-c791-147a-ef9cb07442c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P:9c06b3cf-a45f-c791-147a-ef9cb07442c0
msgctxt "h16fd3427gcc5ag409cgb411g355db06595f3"
msgid "This place is a blister of corruption."
msgstr "이 곳은 타락이 부풀어터진 곳이로군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9c06b3cf-a45f-c791-147a-ef9cb07442c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P:9c06b3cf-a45f-c791-147a-ef9cb07442c0
msgctxt "h97098415g02f5g4e62g8e65gda8667879f7c"
msgid "We'll have to keep an eye out for more."
msgstr "조심해서 움직여야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a143d7f9-5616-3e94-a584-3b2147470a3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P:a143d7f9-5616-3e94-a584-3b2147470a3b
msgctxt "ha658b0c8gcf8ag4b8fg8676g0e6e792fbd80"
msgid "Well <i>that's</i> a sight I can never unsee."
msgstr "<i>저건</i> 도저히 잊어버릴 수 있는 광경이 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a143d7f9-5616-3e94-a584-3b2147470a3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P:a143d7f9-5616-3e94-a584-3b2147470a3b
msgctxt "h4402e43cgdec2g41e5gbf9bge3818c4a83e3"
msgid "What in the Nine Hells did I just watch?"
msgstr "내가 대체 뭘 본 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a143d7f9-5616-3e94-a584-3b2147470a3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P:a143d7f9-5616-3e94-a584-3b2147470a3b
msgctxt "h9b369e9fg4636g422ag9d1fg53ea3a1a774a"
msgid "This plane is full of disturbing creatures."
msgstr "이 차원계는 충격적인 생물들로 가득하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a143d7f9-5616-3e94-a584-3b2147470a3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P:a143d7f9-5616-3e94-a584-3b2147470a3b
msgctxt "hb9fad518g8052g4ac2g8af0g0310e19b51bc"
msgid "Wow, never seen anything quite like that."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a143d7f9-5616-3e94-a584-3b2147470a3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P:a143d7f9-5616-3e94-a584-3b2147470a3b
msgctxt "h9df75574gb651g40fagbc3fga0057a22b87e"
msgid "No wonder such violent beginnings lead to violent ends."
msgstr "그렇게 격렬하게 시작했으니 격렬하게 끝나는 것도 무리는 아니지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a143d7f9-5616-3e94-a584-3b2147470a3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P:a143d7f9-5616-3e94-a584-3b2147470a3b
msgctxt "hd634a2ebgc527g47bbga70cg7c298363d372"
msgid ""
"Ugh. Anything that enters the world like <i>that </i>deserves to swiftly "
"exit it again."
msgstr "윽. 이 세계에 <i>저런 식</i>으로 들어오는 것들은 빨리 추방시킬 필요가 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a143d7f9-5616-3e94-a584-3b2147470a3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: (REALLY_GENERIC and REALLY_GITHYANKI) or (REALLY_GENERIC and REALLY_PLANAR)
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P:a143d7f9-5616-3e94-a584-3b2147470a3b
msgctxt "heffcb517g2617g4ff0gb4e1g5407075220d0"
msgid "This plane is full of disturbing creatures."
msgstr "이 차원계는 충격적인 생물들로 가득하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a143d7f9-5616-3e94-a584-3b2147470a3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P:a143d7f9-5616-3e94-a584-3b2147470a3b
msgctxt "hce342e6eg9636g41f7g89a0gaf5996c5631f"
msgid "Ugh - what a horrid sight that was."
msgstr "윽, 정말 끔찍한 광경이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f73f10a1-112f-0595-c937-d845b73842ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P:f73f10a1-112f-0595-c937-d845b73842ad
msgctxt "h839dbea7g73c7g4349g9e4ag40a1209a3c3c"
msgid "Let's just go. There's only so much my stomach can take."
msgstr "그냥 가자. 비위가 상해서 더는 못 견디겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f73f10a1-112f-0595-c937-d845b73842ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P:f73f10a1-112f-0595-c937-d845b73842ad
msgctxt "h3a248b99ge8d7g43beg883agffbe716efc00"
msgid "Once-in-a-lifetime sight, that."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f73f10a1-112f-0595-c937-d845b73842ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P:f73f10a1-112f-0595-c937-d845b73842ad
msgctxt "h366e8eebg5e70g4dedga03fg018e2e5f0e35"
msgid "They burst forth from that creature. I've not seen the likes of it."
msgstr "저 짐승의 몸을 뚫고 튀어나왔어. 저런 건 본 적이 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f73f10a1-112f-0595-c937-d845b73842ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P:f73f10a1-112f-0595-c937-d845b73842ad
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hef4ad0f8g58e3g4cadg9269gd17f94746d0b"
msgid "Our tadpoles have competition for the most vile parasite, clearly."
msgstr "우리 머릿속 올챙이에게 경쟁자가 생겼네, 무엇이 더 끔찍한 기생체인지 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f73f10a1-112f-0595-c937-d845b73842ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: UNKNOWN_TAG_308b1975
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P:f73f10a1-112f-0595-c937-d845b73842ad
msgctxt "h4aa6585fgf5ddg4d7bg8aecg4fc37c175090"
msgid "This won't be the last of them."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f73f10a1-112f-0595-c937-d845b73842ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P:f73f10a1-112f-0595-c937-d845b73842ad
msgctxt "h4b6c9db8g1012g477egb165g502590aa45cf"
msgid "They erupted right out of there. Never saw the likes of it."
msgstr "그냥 저기서 튀어나왔어. 저런 건 본 적이 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f73f10a1-112f-0595-c937-d845b73842ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P:f73f10a1-112f-0595-c937-d845b73842ad
msgctxt "hcb946b89g557ag4121g8d8agf94b8e5c3335"
msgid "I wonder how many more newborns are around."
msgstr "갓 난 놀들이 주위에 얼마나 더 있을지 모르겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f73f10a1-112f-0595-c937-d845b73842ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P:f73f10a1-112f-0595-c937-d845b73842ad
msgctxt "ha81c1f40g6d20g4869gac61g37443d9e0eea"
msgid "<i>Ghaik</i> aren't the only abominations here, it seems."
msgstr "이곳에서 나타나는 흉물은 <i>게이크</i>뿐만이 아닌 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f73f10a1-112f-0595-c937-d845b73842ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_2P:f73f10a1-112f-0595-c937-d845b73842ad
msgctxt "hc618f238gb8d6g43aega30dg8f6db1140451"
msgid "Better keep an eye out for more."
msgstr "주의를 기울이는 게 좋겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0d8b17b1-50a3-c7fc-617f-dc50b7b27ef3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P:0d8b17b1-50a3-c7fc-617f-dc50b7b27ef3
msgctxt "h86218ab6gb6b3g4ad6g9b4fge2e8460267a3"
msgid "No wonder, if they're leaping from hyenas left and right."
msgstr "놈들이 하이에나들한테서 그냥 막 튀어나오고 있다면, 이상할 것도 없네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0d8b17b1-50a3-c7fc-617f-dc50b7b27ef3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P:0d8b17b1-50a3-c7fc-617f-dc50b7b27ef3
msgctxt "hab76d8b4g199cg4364g9bb1g62248c3cae8b"
msgid ""
"They spread quickly - the whole coast will be infested if we don't burn them "
"out."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0d8b17b1-50a3-c7fc-617f-dc50b7b27ef3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P:0d8b17b1-50a3-c7fc-617f-dc50b7b27ef3
msgctxt "h2e23141cg6682g4f75gb31age059b21f9bb5"
msgid "Is there no corner of this plane they don't infest?"
msgstr "이 차원계에 이놈들이 우글거리지 않는 곳은 없는 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0d8b17b1-50a3-c7fc-617f-dc50b7b27ef3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P:0d8b17b1-50a3-c7fc-617f-dc50b7b27ef3
msgctxt "he8646beag4193g47a1ga3f0gebb5e891a67e"
msgid "Vile beasts. Nothing good is born from a corpse."
msgstr "불결한 짐승 같으니. 시체에서 태어난 것은 좋은 법이 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0d8b17b1-50a3-c7fc-617f-dc50b7b27ef3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P:0d8b17b1-50a3-c7fc-617f-dc50b7b27ef3
msgctxt "hef74fd8agbb29g4956gbfe8g565c9ade2130"
msgid "They do have a way of popping up when least expected."
msgstr "예상치 못했을 때에 막 나타나는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0d8b17b1-50a3-c7fc-617f-dc50b7b27ef3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P:0d8b17b1-50a3-c7fc-617f-dc50b7b27ef3
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hce129227g8a80g48adgb723gb7741a493e97"
msgid "I had no idea this was their mating season."
msgstr "지금이 저놈들의 짝짓기 철인 줄은 몰랐네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0d8b17b1-50a3-c7fc-617f-dc50b7b27ef3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_BESTIAL or REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P:0d8b17b1-50a3-c7fc-617f-dc50b7b27ef3
msgctxt "he57da3degd530g4a78ga80dg3aefa8e235d1"
msgid "It won't be hard to keep their scent. That foul blood is everywhere."
msgstr "녀석들의 냄새를 맡는 건 어렵지 않을 거야. 그 불결한 피가 사방에 있으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0d8b17b1-50a3-c7fc-617f-dc50b7b27ef3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P:0d8b17b1-50a3-c7fc-617f-dc50b7b27ef3
msgctxt "h8028010bgd1c3g4ef2g9140g95694421a8b0"
msgid "Not a good sign that they're bursting to life everywhere."
msgstr "놈들이 사방에서 튀어나온다는 건 별로 좋은 징조가 아닌데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5efc77f6-294c-e622-8095-84183c6024cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P:5efc77f6-294c-e622-8095-84183c6024cd
msgctxt "h1ded5787g16c7g4e3cg9745g0e3e91b2287f"
msgid "It certainly puts 'the miracle of birth' in a new light."
msgstr "이건 '탄생의 신비'라는 말에 새로운 뜻을 주는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5efc77f6-294c-e622-8095-84183c6024cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P:5efc77f6-294c-e622-8095-84183c6024cd
msgctxt "h1cf995bbgf2ccg40d1g9cb1g31adc47faa90"
msgid "I've seen worse. <i>Much</i> worse."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5efc77f6-294c-e622-8095-84183c6024cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P:5efc77f6-294c-e622-8095-84183c6024cd
msgctxt "h02679d50gafccg47acg9568g097600fb7a28"
msgid "This plane finds new and exciting ways to disgust me."
msgstr "이 차원계는 자극적이고 새로운 방법으로 날 역겹게 하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5efc77f6-294c-e622-8095-84183c6024cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P:5efc77f6-294c-e622-8095-84183c6024cd
msgctxt "h029abc7bg287eg4d66gbeddgdc4101520d00"
msgid "Gnolls. And I doubt we've seen the last of them."
msgstr "놀이다. 저 놈들이 마지막은 아닐 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5efc77f6-294c-e622-8095-84183c6024cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P:5efc77f6-294c-e622-8095-84183c6024cd
msgctxt "h3857a7f5g8991g443dg963agf167c3505267"
msgid "So much for the miracle of childbirth..."
msgstr "탄생의 신비라기엔 너무 끔찍한걸..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5efc77f6-294c-e622-8095-84183c6024cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI or REALLY_PLANAR
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P:5efc77f6-294c-e622-8095-84183c6024cd
msgctxt "h9b6cd8d0g3c20g4ad6ga84egf464a99e1a6c"
msgid "This plane is a blister of corruption."
msgstr "이 차원계는 타락이 부풀어터지는 곳이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5efc77f6-294c-e622-8095-84183c6024cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P:5efc77f6-294c-e622-8095-84183c6024cd
msgctxt "h58158daeg405eg462cg9eecg98eb2bce7b35"
msgid "I'd prefer not to see it again, that's for sure."
msgstr "확실한 것 하나는, 그 꼴을 다시는 보고 싶지 않다는 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 60dd5c1f-ba52-154a-9d27-dfb699c8fdcd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P:60dd5c1f-ba52-154a-9d27-dfb699c8fdcd
msgctxt "hd510e0d6g24ecg451egb5edg9e4289a6f450"
msgid "This place reeks of blood. Let's go, before more join us."
msgstr "이곳엔 피 냄새가 진동하는군. 더 몰려오기 전에 가자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 60dd5c1f-ba52-154a-9d27-dfb699c8fdcd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P:60dd5c1f-ba52-154a-9d27-dfb699c8fdcd
msgctxt "hbaee1e75g6426g4c77g8bc8g63ff4a26dafd"
msgid "We should find the rest - stop the infestation before it spreads."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 60dd5c1f-ba52-154a-9d27-dfb699c8fdcd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P:60dd5c1f-ba52-154a-9d27-dfb699c8fdcd
msgctxt "hb2f02088g05bfg4fb4ga853g10c486138b2e"
msgid "Let them come. We will rip them from top to tail."
msgstr "와보라고 해라. 녀석들을 반으로 찢어 죽여버리자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 60dd5c1f-ba52-154a-9d27-dfb699c8fdcd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P:60dd5c1f-ba52-154a-9d27-dfb699c8fdcd
msgctxt "h7076ef5fg90e2g4f07g8db8g5fce8bd2a3e1"
msgid "Let's move. The smell of blood will draw trouble."
msgstr "움직이자. 피 냄새 때문에 더 많은 골칫거리가 꼬일 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 60dd5c1f-ba52-154a-9d27-dfb699c8fdcd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P:60dd5c1f-ba52-154a-9d27-dfb699c8fdcd
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h8ff85b45gbad3g4d1bg9d2cgb4ac62ed24be"
msgid "I wager they've infested the entire coast."
msgstr "소드 코스트 전체에 놈들이 득시글거릴 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 60dd5c1f-ba52-154a-9d27-dfb699c8fdcd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P:60dd5c1f-ba52-154a-9d27-dfb699c8fdcd
msgctxt "h0e4a2cbfg7268g4a8dg8a75g1db60433c2e0"
msgid "Let's not stand around. They can smell spilled blood a mile away."
msgstr "어물쩡 거리지 말자. 놈들은 일 마일 밖에서도 피 냄새를 맡을 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 60dd5c1f-ba52-154a-9d27-dfb699c8fdcd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P:60dd5c1f-ba52-154a-9d27-dfb699c8fdcd
msgctxt "h6650a44dge8ebg484egae0ag95de7b4e8c50"
msgid "Keep your guard high. Let's move on."
msgstr "경계를 늦추지 마. 움직이자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 60dd5c1f-ba52-154a-9d27-dfb699c8fdcd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P:60dd5c1f-ba52-154a-9d27-dfb699c8fdcd
msgctxt "he34579bdg1e50g4622gaf7cg450b9f3599ad"
msgid "Best to move before the blood draws more of them."
msgstr "피 냄새를 맡고 더 몰려들기 전에 움직이는 게 상책이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7a7b1222-f121-cf85-7c8f-edd82fd86f15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P:7a7b1222-f121-cf85-7c8f-edd82fd86f15
msgctxt "h8d9dda5eg0c25g416bgafd7g8773d2691d3f"
msgid "Well <i>that's</i> a sight I can never un-see."
msgstr "<i>저건</i> 도저히 잊어버릴 수 있는 광경이 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7a7b1222-f121-cf85-7c8f-edd82fd86f15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P:7a7b1222-f121-cf85-7c8f-edd82fd86f15
msgctxt "h8d1031afg3257g4144g8d9bgfd275eabf16b"
msgid "I've seen some disturbing things, but that was in the top five."
msgstr "충격적인 광경을 여럿 봐 왔지만, 저건 다섯 손가락 안에 꼽을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7a7b1222-f121-cf85-7c8f-edd82fd86f15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P:7a7b1222-f121-cf85-7c8f-edd82fd86f15
msgctxt "h945224c5g1831g4369gbc77g361d7dc06cc5"
msgid "What is this creature that bursts from another's flesh?"
msgstr "남의 살갗을 찢고 튀어나오는 이 괴물은 뭐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7a7b1222-f121-cf85-7c8f-edd82fd86f15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P:7a7b1222-f121-cf85-7c8f-edd82fd86f15
msgctxt "h63a29e0cgdb6cg4fddgaf79g1f4955a45e73"
msgid "That creature it birthed was some kind of demonspawn."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7a7b1222-f121-cf85-7c8f-edd82fd86f15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P:7a7b1222-f121-cf85-7c8f-edd82fd86f15
msgctxt "hfaa0ed85gc96bg44a5gb1d5geb0d1156c317"
msgid "So much for the miracle of childbirth..."
msgstr "탄생의 신비라기엔 너무 끔찍한걸..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7a7b1222-f121-cf85-7c8f-edd82fd86f15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P:7a7b1222-f121-cf85-7c8f-edd82fd86f15
msgctxt "h74eb09aegb167g44f7g9207g006c1a7db836"
msgid "First <i>ghaik</i>. Now this monstrosity."
msgstr "처음엔 <i>게이크</i>, 이젠 이 괴물이라니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7a7b1222-f121-cf85-7c8f-edd82fd86f15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P:7a7b1222-f121-cf85-7c8f-edd82fd86f15
msgctxt "hc6b1b3c8g17a8g4131ga39eg647d59d462e1"
msgid "Never seen that before."
msgstr "저건 처음 보는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 961c8d22-52dc-32a0-041c-5465f3c86481
