msgid "Let them come. We will rip them from top to tail."
msgstr "와보라고 해라. 녀석들을 반으로 찢어 죽여버리자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P
