msgid "Keep your guard high. Let's move on."
msgstr "경계를 늦추지 마. 움직이자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 961c8d22-52dc-32a0-041c-5465f3c86481
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P:961c8d22-52dc-32a0-041c-5465f3c86481
msgctxt "hff9227b9ga4f4g427ag810dg3f8b749fd566"
msgid "Best to move before the blood draws more of them."
msgstr "피 냄새를 맡고 더 몰려들기 전에 움직이는 게 상책이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fed53506-ac7e-5661-f08e-cfaf9032cda5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ConflictedFlind_Knows_Gnolls = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P:fed53506-ac7e-5661-f08e-cfaf9032cda5
msgctxt "h4eba3e9dgfd4eg4f90gad84g8d798ac7bdbe"
msgid "The whole place is infested. There might be more blade-work ahead..."
msgstr "이곳 전체가 놀들로 들끓는데. 칼을 써야 할 일이 더 남은 것 같네..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_DyingHyena_VB_PostFight_3P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fed53506-ac7e-5661-f08e-cfaf9032cda5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
