#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h5a4929a2g4c37g4112g93f5gfccc9563f340"
msgid "We still have no idea where they took the - what they came for."
msgstr "우리는 아직도 녀석들이 어디서 무엇을 위해 왔는지 모르겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_FlamingFist7
#. Speaker = Gauntlet Dain
#. NodeID = 56c6202b-dbf9-1928-3c9b-7bdd7ea49881
