msgid "Do you know where the Grand Duke was taken?"
msgstr "대공작이 어디로 끌려갔는지 알고 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_FlamingFist7_Dead
