#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h5e20ec5fg9735g456cgadb7g9bedd21300f7"
msgid "No traitor... loyal to queen..."
msgstr "반역자 아니야... 여왕님께 충성해..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_GithCaptain_Dead
#. Speaker = Sarth Baretha
#. NodeID = df7072c9-46d1-4e2e-80f7-217ab3ee19eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
