msgid "We stand no chance against such a foe. We should get out of sight!"
msgstr "저런 적을 상대할 수는 없어. 시야에서 벗어나자!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_GithChokepoint_PAD_DragonShadow
