msgctxt "hb6cf7455g2d9fg42bfg9c06g939d0192a35a"
msgid "It's absolutely <i>massive.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_GithChokepoint_PAD_DragonShadow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4385abbc-1048-5780-8465-b10faf7e23b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - PLA_GithChokepoint_State_FailedFrightenedSV(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_GithChokepoint_PAD_DragonShadow:4385abbc-1048-5780-8465-b10faf7e23b5
msgctxt "h3981c27bgc2cdg40ddg8ddcg668c468e1202"
msgid ""
"The size of that thing. Looks so much bigger when it's flying above you..."
msgstr "정말 크군. 머리 위를 날아가니 더 커 보여..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_GithChokepoint_PAD_DragonShadow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4385abbc-1048-5780-8465-b10faf7e23b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - PLA_GithChokepoint_State_FailedFrightenedSV(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_GithChokepoint_PAD_DragonShadow:4385abbc-1048-5780-8465-b10faf7e23b5
msgctxt "h44a2fe10g725dg459bg99d3gd3000236c208"
msgid "By the dead gods - it's so much bigger than I remember."
msgstr "죽은 신들이여 맙소사, 내 기억보다 훨씬 크잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_GithChokepoint_PAD_DragonShadow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4385abbc-1048-5780-8465-b10faf7e23b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - PLA_GithChokepoint_State_FailedFrightenedSV(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_GithChokepoint_PAD_DragonShadow:4385abbc-1048-5780-8465-b10faf7e23b5
msgctxt "h873bbebag2d5bg470fg8294g854409131a97"
msgid "Such fury. I do not envy the dragon's prey."
msgstr "엄청난 분노로군. 저 드래곤의 먹잇감들이 부럽지는 않네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_GithChokepoint_PAD_DragonShadow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4385abbc-1048-5780-8465-b10faf7e23b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - PLA_GithChokepoint_State_FailedFrightenedSV(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_GithChokepoint_PAD_DragonShadow:4385abbc-1048-5780-8465-b10faf7e23b5
msgctxt "h93cfe5f4gda5fg4e72g8befg591c1b4f4943"
msgid "It's huge."
msgstr "거대하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_GithChokepoint_PAD_DragonShadow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 67568f65-9598-80b7-573d-7e38d979736c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_GithChokepoint_PAD_DragonShadow:67568f65-9598-80b7-573d-7e38d979736c
msgctxt "hf45a3a0bg51f3g4c77ga756g1105d33c07e3"
msgid "A red dragon. Look at the power in that body."
msgstr "레드 드래곤이야. 저 넘치는 힘을 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_GithChokepoint_PAD_DragonShadow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 67568f65-9598-80b7-573d-7e38d979736c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_GithChokepoint_PAD_DragonShadow:67568f65-9598-80b7-573d-7e38d979736c
msgctxt "h7a059856gdcf4g4081gbfb5gf2c3312779d3"
msgid "My word, a red dragon. Majestic. And malignant."
msgstr "세상에, 레드 드래곤이야. 장엄하군. 악의에 차 있기도 하고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_GithChokepoint_PAD_DragonShadow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 67568f65-9598-80b7-573d-7e38d979736c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_GithChokepoint_PAD_DragonShadow:67568f65-9598-80b7-573d-7e38d979736c
msgctxt "h08b62eecga2eag4274g808bg0a222b33a943"
msgid "Look at that. Red dragon. Evil, but beautiful."
msgstr "저거 봐. 레드 드래곤이야. 사악한 용이지만, 아름다운걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_GithChokepoint_PAD_DragonShadow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 67568f65-9598-80b7-573d-7e38d979736c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_GithChokepoint_PAD_DragonShadow:67568f65-9598-80b7-573d-7e38d979736c
msgctxt "hbf0ad76cgeafbg4c65g93dfg7bab336f59e5"
msgid "A dragon. Hells above - quite literally."
msgstr "드래곤이야. 하늘 위에 지옥이 있군, 말 그대로 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_GithChokepoint_PAD_DragonShadow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 67568f65-9598-80b7-573d-7e38d979736c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_GithChokepoint_PAD_DragonShadow:67568f65-9598-80b7-573d-7e38d979736c
msgctxt "h5abfe238g4b2eg40f0g8251gce9549450642"
msgid "A red dragon - here? What a thrill!"
msgstr "레드 드래곤이라고, 이곳에? 신나는데!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_GithChokepoint_PAD_DragonShadow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 67568f65-9598-80b7-573d-7e38d979736c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_GithChokepoint_PAD_DragonShadow:67568f65-9598-80b7-573d-7e38d979736c
msgctxt "h8f63bf4bg4fbdg4938ga513g2461528f308c"
msgid "Look at that beast. Seems almost too big to take flight."
msgstr "저 짐승좀 봐. 저 거대한 게 날아다닌다는 사실이 신기할 정도야."

