msgctxt "h50ab2b76g0996g4893g9278g97c08f73ce97"
msgid ""
"Try not to catch its eye. Unless you fancy an inside view of its gullet."
msgstr "눈에 띄지 않도록 주의해. 녀석의 뱃속을 구경하고 싶지 않다면 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_GithChokepoint_PAD_DragonShadow
