msgid ""
"You go a lifetime without seeing one, and then they won't stop pestering you."
msgstr "일평생 본 적이 없었는데, 갑자기 계속 성가시게 하는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_GithChokepoint_PAD_DragonShadow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9453a72f-f132-52d5-edef-3711829517f0
