msgctxt "haf0a574cg7facg40bdg9e09g93b407c53768"
msgid "It would be too much to hope that's nothing to do with us, wouldn't it?"
msgstr "우리랑 아무 상관도 없다고 하기엔 너무 희망찬 이야기겠지, 안 그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_GithChokepoint_PAD_DragonShadow
