msgctxt "h1183a375g954fg4b07g9831g2c00762543fd"
msgid "A red dragon! Gods, it must have followed us from Avernus!"
msgstr "레드 드래곤이라니! 세상에, 아베르누스부터 계속 쫓아온 게 분명해!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_GithChokepoint_PAD_DragonShadow
