msgid "A red dragon? That can only mean trouble."
msgstr "레드 드래곤이라니? 문제가 생긴다는 뜻이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_GithChokepoint_PAD_DragonShadow
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d04835f1-4c39-d418-9dd9-748f338150a0
