msgctxt "he600f5e9gfe5fg4a79gacb9g2698abfcb106"
msgid "What a waste. She was a powerful specimen."
msgstr "아깝게 됐어. 아주 강한 녀석이었는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_GithChokepoint_PAD_LaezelKilledByGith
