msgid "To arms - we've got trouble!"
msgstr "싸울 준비 해. 문제가 생겼다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_AD_RefugeeGreeting
#. Speaker = Anders
#. NodeID = fbf42846-1bf8-0b2c-86d7-faebbfbdda31
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_AD_RefugeeGreeting:fbf42846-1bf8-0b2c-86d7-faebbfbdda31
msgctxt "ha374142egca58g4c8bg8e36g09122ac9c612"
msgid "At ease, friend. You're welcome to rest here."
msgstr "편히 쉬어, 친구. 여기서 쉬어도 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_AD_Refugees
#. Speaker = Trynn
#. NodeID = 68cac680-8665-b524-7572-a8423aada437
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_AD_Refugees:68cac680-8665-b524-7572-a8423aada437
msgctxt "h4be2501egef7fg4f64g975fg162f0c73c34a"
msgid "I'd give it a bloody good fight, that's for sure."
msgstr "아주 빌어먹을 멋진 싸움이 될 건 확실하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_AD_Refugees
#. Speaker = Anders
#. NodeID = 72eca73b-929e-9af2-20b3-ce9cae5312a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_AD_Refugees:72eca73b-929e-9af2-20b3-ce9cae5312a1
msgctxt "h9bf499cbgfea0g4b71g8aa9g453bd7489cea"
msgid "Ha! Only thing you'd give a dragon is bad gas."
msgstr "하! 네가 드래곤에게 먹여줄 건 지독한 가스 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_AD_Refugees
#. Speaker = Anders
#. NodeID = 7b47eb67-cad9-44d9-89e1-1f1647f02fa1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_AD_Refugees:7b47eb67-cad9-44d9-89e1-1f1647f02fa1
msgctxt "hd2ee972bg4666g4a97gbf29gadb8490a05ac"
msgid "Cut it out. There's worse than gnolls out there."
msgstr "그만둬. 저 밖에는 놀보다 심각한 문제가 있으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_AD_Refugees
#. Speaker = Anders
#. NodeID = cc175eb3-ea70-f1ac-17d0-070d811a56ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_AD_Refugees:cc175eb3-ea70-f1ac-17d0-070d811a56ff
msgctxt "h4bb9d98fgd30fg4155g9fefge60bb3950f5c"
msgid "How about a dragon? Would that worry you?"
msgstr "그럼, 드래곤은 어때? 그 정도면 걱정할 만한가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_AD_Refugees
#. Speaker = Trynn
#. NodeID = cdf9481e-3780-2734-0556-60d473d21e32
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_AD_Refugees:cdf9481e-3780-2734-0556-60d473d21e32
msgctxt "hcbf3c19cg48b2g4287gb25cgafaada72d7da"
msgid "Nothing we need to worry about."
msgstr "우리가 걱정할 문제는 아니지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_PAD_CorpseSmell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 73f61f8c-b65f-d303-c9ed-c618e9ae7fd2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_PAD_CorpseSmell:73f61f8c-b65f-d303-c9ed-c618e9ae7fd2
msgctxt "h7c64b99eg760bg4600gbc6dg774b3d31a586"
msgid "Urgh. That body's so ripe, I'd need to drink the blood with a fork."
msgstr "으으. 시체가 너무 오래돼서, 피를 먹으려면 포크를 써야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_PAD_CorpseSmell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 73f61f8c-b65f-d303-c9ed-c618e9ae7fd2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_PAD_CorpseSmell:73f61f8c-b65f-d303-c9ed-c618e9ae7fd2
msgctxt "h31ebd3f9g3f39g4117ga320g8660579b4689"
msgid "Ugh. That corpse is riper than a Minauros bog."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_PAD_CorpseSmell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 73f61f8c-b65f-d303-c9ed-c618e9ae7fd2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_PAD_CorpseSmell:73f61f8c-b65f-d303-c9ed-c618e9ae7fd2
msgctxt "h8a754251g254dg4aeeg9c82g6f8a3d448dfa"
msgid "The rot of death. <i>Delightful.</i>"
msgstr "시체의 썩은내라. <i>향기롭네.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_PAD_CorpseSmell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 73f61f8c-b65f-d303-c9ed-c618e9ae7fd2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_PAD_CorpseSmell:73f61f8c-b65f-d303-c9ed-c618e9ae7fd2
msgctxt "h7ab966fag2a91g4c9cg9c5bg2f56665be11d"
msgid "That corpse smells ripe. Enough time for its killer to have moved on..."
msgstr "저 시체는 아주 오래된 것 같은데. 살인자들은 이미 멀리 떠나고도 남았겠어..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_PAD_CorpseSmell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 73f61f8c-b65f-d303-c9ed-c618e9ae7fd2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_PAD_CorpseSmell:73f61f8c-b65f-d303-c9ed-c618e9ae7fd2
msgctxt "h686ed75cg4f72g46f0g9516g08faf3314ab6"
msgid "Gods, this assault on the nostrils should be labelled a war crime."
msgstr "신이시여, 이런 냄새 공격은 전쟁 범죄로 등재되어야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_PAD_CorpseSmell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 73f61f8c-b65f-d303-c9ed-c618e9ae7fd2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_PAD_CorpseSmell:73f61f8c-b65f-d303-c9ed-c618e9ae7fd2
msgctxt "h6e90a252g0551g4a01gac78gbcaa05791b9a"
msgid "Ugh. I'll never get used to the stench of death."
msgstr "으으. 죽음의 냄새엔 아무래도 적응이 되질 않네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_PAD_CorpseSmell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 73f61f8c-b65f-d303-c9ed-c618e9ae7fd2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_PAD_CorpseSmell:73f61f8c-b65f-d303-c9ed-c618e9ae7fd2
msgctxt "h9ffd8696g3e2eg47a1gbb8dg3a2666faaab4"
msgid "Ugh, that stench. Body must have been here a good while."
msgstr "웩, 악취가 심한데. 시체가 여기 꽤 오래 있었나 보군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_PAD_CorpseSmell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce74317b-2b4f-5e49-95ab-2e2e895fb81f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Astarion_Knows_Vampireness = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_PAD_CorpseSmell:ce74317b-2b4f-5e49-95ab-2e2e895fb81f
msgctxt "hb6e1c559g1cc3g4ad6ga503g0ead85ff0e9f"
msgid "Urgh, that smells ripe."
msgstr "우웩, 냄새가 아주 고약한데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_PAD_FoundKey
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 05080d29-da09-126b-f8f0-04dd8fdcd9dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_PAD_FoundKey:05080d29-da09-126b-f8f0-04dd8fdcd9dc
msgctxt "h9a2b359cgbd3dg456cg880dg20ea77965061"
msgid "A key. Wonder what it opens?"
msgstr "열쇠잖아. 뭘 위한 걸까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_PAD_FoundKey
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8516b20e-1877-f65c-31df-29b40de37d98
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Knows_CollectorHadKey = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_PAD_FoundKey:8516b20e-1877-f65c-31df-29b40de37d98
msgctxt "h241112fbg7dfag4f8bgaf33g0e8b94b78b8e"
msgid "The corpse mentioned a key... this must be the one."
msgstr "시체가 열쇠 이야기를 했어... 이게 바로 그건가 보군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_PAD_FoundKey
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d6427665-bed3-ea39-7713-7f4db643cae0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Knows_VaultDoor = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_PAD_FoundKey:d6427665-bed3-ea39-7713-7f4db643cae0
msgctxt "h5c3c8751g929dg4102g8aa9g8a106247b320"
msgid "A key - it might open the tollhouse vault."
msgstr "열쇠군. 이걸로 통행료 징수소의 금고를 열 수 있을지도 몰라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_PAD_GnollsDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2b43c18d-3371-07e2-e71e-6ae9cd406a5e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_PAD_GnollsDead:2b43c18d-3371-07e2-e71e-6ae9cd406a5e
msgctxt "h8c304905gc22ag4e15g8d6ag5d0121b89385"
msgid "Someone <i>eviscerated</i> those gnolls. It's rather beautiful."
msgstr "누군가가 이 놀들을 <i>학살했어</i>. 멋진데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_PAD_GnollsDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2b43c18d-3371-07e2-e71e-6ae9cd406a5e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_PAD_GnollsDead:2b43c18d-3371-07e2-e71e-6ae9cd406a5e
msgctxt "h545f50c0g76a9g445cg8cc9g3b18f8ef81b0"
msgid ""
"Someone made short work of these gnolls. Made it look easy too. That's "
"someone to be reckoned with."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_PAD_GnollsDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2b43c18d-3371-07e2-e71e-6ae9cd406a5e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_PAD_GnollsDead:2b43c18d-3371-07e2-e71e-6ae9cd406a5e
msgctxt "h43e75e27g8c05g4a67gb1c4gaeee5e050589"
msgid "Those gnolls... brutalised. And I smell brimstone. This isn't good."
msgstr "이 놀들은... 난폭해졌어. 유황 냄새까지 나고. 이거 상황이 안 좋은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_PAD_GnollsDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2b43c18d-3371-07e2-e71e-6ae9cd406a5e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_PAD_GnollsDead:2b43c18d-3371-07e2-e71e-6ae9cd406a5e
msgctxt "h707435b8g9c1bg46deg94f6g990840412d4f"
msgid ""
"Someone's already slain these creatures. A pity they didn't leave any for us."
msgstr "누가 이미 다 해치워놨군. 우리 몫을 남겨두지 않은 게 유감이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_PAD_GnollsDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2b43c18d-3371-07e2-e71e-6ae9cd406a5e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_PAD_GnollsDead:2b43c18d-3371-07e2-e71e-6ae9cd406a5e
msgctxt "hea691867g9668g44c1g8a16g71cee5a44a81"
msgid "Dead gnolls. Looks like someone toyed with them - made the pain last."
msgstr "놀 시체다. 누군가 가지고 논 것 같군... 더 오래 고통을 주기 위해 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_PAD_GnollsDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2b43c18d-3371-07e2-e71e-6ae9cd406a5e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_PAD_GnollsDead:2b43c18d-3371-07e2-e71e-6ae9cd406a5e
msgctxt "h0c18ac6ega622g43e2g9a1bg34347552962a"
msgid "Dead gnolls. And is that... sulphur I smell?"
msgstr "놀 시체다. 그리고 이 냄새는... 유황 냄새인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_PAD_GnollsDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2b43c18d-3371-07e2-e71e-6ae9cd406a5e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_PAD_GnollsDead:2b43c18d-3371-07e2-e71e-6ae9cd406a5e
msgctxt "h2c0b11a6gb8f2g4196ga760ged5f7ea565fa"
msgid "Whatever killed those gnolls might be nearby. Careful."
msgstr "저 놀들을 죽인 자가 누구인지는 몰라도 근처에 있어. 조심해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_AD_KarlachHealed
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 90b47c2d-161c-c5fe-3448-f28d2e53f215
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_State_HelpingKarlach = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_AD_KarlachHealed:90b47c2d-161c-c5fe-3448-f28d2e53f215
msgctxt "hd5f2536cg1682g4210g8035g781c3b4ccfd6"
msgid "Thanks. That was <i>really</i> starting to hurt."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_AD_KarlachHealed
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = a44ae8af-4574-43b1-94f5-64f13bdd99d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_AD_KarlachHealed:a44ae8af-4574-43b1-94f5-64f13bdd99d2
msgctxt "h76110225g0252g4f41g9477gdc6f3c4c1440"
msgid "If you cast <i>anything</i> at me, I'll break your fingers."
msgstr "나한테 <i>주문</i> 쓰기만 해 봐. 손가락 꺾어 버린다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_AD_KarlachWounded
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 047e6990-e085-40aa-bbab-633893b28b8b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 6cf6ff37-64f7-3ccf-d702-ee2025510422_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 6cf6ff37-64f7-3ccf-d702-ee2025510422_B = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_AD_KarlachWounded:047e6990-e085-40aa-bbab-633893b28b8b
msgctxt "h4628b2bdgbdacg49d5ga0e2ga0963ff1d1d6"
msgid "Another day, another scar."
msgstr "흉터는 일상이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_AD_KarlachWounded
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 8e326a4f-d47b-4264-a6ae-efd7a99638fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 6cf6ff37-64f7-3ccf-d702-ee2025510422_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 6cf6ff37-64f7-3ccf-d702-ee2025510422_A = False
#.     - 6cf6ff37-64f7-3ccf-d702-ee2025510422_B = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_AD_KarlachWounded:8e326a4f-d47b-4264-a6ae-efd7a99638fe
msgctxt "hd6df6744g7ebag44b5g910bgf3689ba1336b"
msgid "<i>Ster'ca.</i>"
msgstr "<i>Ster'ca.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_AD_KarlachWounded
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = c2a2f367-86dd-4857-a736-c0c587b00249
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 6cf6ff37-64f7-3ccf-d702-ee2025510422_A = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_AD_KarlachWounded:c2a2f367-86dd-4857-a736-c0c587b00249
msgctxt "h0d2e7b8bgcba0g4ab5g9b98gcbdc7a3ec2c2"
msgid "That bastard cut me deep."
msgstr "그 새끼가 깊은 상처를 냈어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2c4865e8-556b-453f-b85b-88e3da642013
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#.   Quest:
#.      - UNKNOWN_TAG_9963c801(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach:2c4865e8-556b-453f-b85b-88e3da642013
msgctxt "hdd496b0fg4bb1g4e96ga6ebg59d1f0415800"
msgid "I was told you're a fiend and a killer. Is that true?"
msgstr "네가 마족이며 살인마라고 그러던데. 사실인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2fa608c0-2b2a-4eb6-8cb2-0e9d698ace7d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach:2fa608c0-2b2a-4eb6-8cb2-0e9d698ace7d
msgctxt "hc375afeag5a6cg4d68g8c46g1d9791b11fe2"
msgid "What were you doing here?"
msgstr "여기서 뭘 하고 있었지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 368d29ae-941e-4d7b-8d6f-4947335a474c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach:368d29ae-941e-4d7b-8d6f-4947335a474c
msgctxt "h83ef9f62gd567g4f25gb80eg741448ec9951"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 4dc9c72a-28fc-49a1-91ae-3aea21726c89
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach:4dc9c72a-28fc-49a1-91ae-3aea21726c89
msgctxt "hea6238eag3d76g4687g8330g10d45fa7f9d9"
msgid "The fallen angel... Zariel..."
msgstr "타락 천사... 자리엘..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 57d01a3b-b03f-403e-97b5-16592e882090
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach_WhoIsShe(1) = True
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach:57d01a3b-b03f-403e-97b5-16592e882090
msgctxt "hbf674028g0003g4778g933cg36b6b2a6f40b"
msgid "Who was hunting you?"
msgstr "누가 널 쫓고 있었지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 78cfa9c6-fb50-410f-a3a0-6cd9a05fa8de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach_WhoIsShe(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach:78cfa9c6-fb50-410f-a3a0-6cd9a05fa8de
msgctxt "h4ee97f86g7f82g4e7agb10eg4a0d062bbc4b"
msgid "Hiding... running... hunted..."
msgstr "숨어서... 도망쳤어... 쫓겼어..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7a4dcaa1-d1e3-46e5-892c-be8f59501c22
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach_AvernusMentioned(1) = True
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach:7a4dcaa1-d1e3-46e5-892c-be8f59501c22
msgctxt "heb324b9agebb2g4304g8229gfe3085f019ca"
msgid "What connects you to Avernus?"
msgstr "무엇이 너와 아베르누스를 이어주고 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8d4ebe72-cabd-4c31-a232-174aae4ed381
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach_QueryName(1) = True
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach:8d4ebe72-cabd-4c31-a232-174aae4ed381
msgctxt "h264128f3g331fg4e00ga563g0a68c43731a3"
msgid "Why are you known as the Demonsbane?"
msgstr "데몬의 파멸이라고 불린 이유가 뭐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9e2992ca-f0ed-4e80-80b1-e215ed7a414e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach:9e2992ca-f0ed-4e80-80b1-e215ed7a414e
msgctxt "hce8f03a9g2398g4d28g940eg8b98b379781d"
msgid "What happened to you?"
msgstr "무슨 일이 있었지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = adb9033b-a9dc-41d6-92a5-4bb63f73f393
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach_WhoIsShe(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach:adb9033b-a9dc-41d6-92a5-4bb63f73f393
msgctxt "h354bc7aage49ag4696g9b35gbbcab41d1187"
msgid "Lies... she hunts me... won't let me go..."
msgstr "거짓말... 그녀가 날 쫓아... 날 보내주지 않아..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = b5846a0b-910c-4fcb-adc9-2b0c510e7e83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach_QueryName(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach:b5846a0b-910c-4fcb-adc9-2b0c510e7e83
msgctxt "hdea3c007gb838g4551g88f7g33ab71ad4e8e"
msgid "Karlach... the Demonsbane..."
msgstr "데몬의 파멸... 칼라크..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b6b5be8f-b6e0-438c-b52f-735fe11389d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach:b6b5be8f-b6e0-438c-b52f-735fe11389d6
msgctxt "h952ad373g104dg4aecg85edg15a549305198"
msgid "*The corpse does not stir. It will answer no more questions.*"
msgstr "*시체는 움직이지 않습니다. 더 이상 질문을 받지 않을 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b7e41a79-226e-4d67-8ec9-eea835c58dbf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach:b7e41a79-226e-4d67-8ec9-eea835c58dbf
msgctxt "h65fc9795g502eg48b7g99d4gb9f494a5ee77"
msgid "*The corpse regards you lifelessly.*"
msgstr "*시체가 생기 없는 모습으로 당신을 맞이합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c0951ee1-87fd-4fa6-ad7b-f76b63d6fd50
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach:c0951ee1-87fd-4fa6-ad7b-f76b63d6fd50
msgctxt "h67f1f967gf759g4fd7ga6d4gade69109df96"
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr "너는 누구지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = d5f28708-b1b9-4d8c-a7e4-4293bb030336
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach_WhoIsShe(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach:d5f28708-b1b9-4d8c-a7e4-4293bb030336
msgctxt "h93a11471g3a4eg46d7g9babgfa0fac642cf1"
msgid "Hunted... murdered... condemned..."
msgstr "쫓기고... 죽임 당하고... 저주 받았어..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = dce347fc-45a1-4d0f-b18c-20bc263f1753
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach:dce347fc-45a1-4d0f-b18c-20bc263f1753
msgctxt "h2f068e17gd27fg45cag9b60gaa4f982149ee"
msgid "*The spell's power wanes. You can ask no more questions.*"
msgstr "*주문의 힘이 약해집니다. 더 이상 질문을 할 수 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = dd038a76-e47e-43ea-9dfe-dc844ac4726f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach:dd038a76-e47e-43ea-9dfe-dc844ac4726f
msgctxt "hae9600e0ge7b4g453ag80aegcc3698f118ff"
msgid "Conspiracy... Elturel's fall..."
msgstr "음모... 엘투렐의 추락..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e96a2ad0-a902-43c3-bfcd-7ec7af7a4485
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_Killer(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach:e96a2ad0-a902-43c3-bfcd-7ec7af7a4485
msgctxt "h987aa982g90c5g46b0g9cf1g91a2deed2a67"
msgid "*The corpse seems willing to speak - but not to its killer.*"
msgstr "*시체는 말할 의지가 있지만, 자신을 죽인 자와 대화하고 싶지는 않은 듯 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = f1cc9959-0bc1-4eb3-a428-67e67290d421
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach_AvernusMentioned(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Dead_Karlach:f1cc9959-0bc1-4eb3-a428-67e67290d421
msgctxt "h0e530f8ag9f31g47f2g9555ge7a71450eba8"
msgid "Blood War... Avernus... champion..."
msgstr "피의 전쟁... 아베르누스... 용사..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_HeadLoot
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 164f8a52-dac8-ea49-08b1-19dab49804b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_HeadLoot:164f8a52-dac8-ea49-08b1-19dab49804b3
msgctxt "h8874370ag42c0g4975ga62agf9d682b4892f"
msgid ""
"*A faint, acrid smell clings to the corpse - like the memory of a storm.*"
msgstr "*희미하지만 매캐한 냄새가 시체에 들러붙어 있습니다. 마치 기억의 폭풍 같습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_HeadLoot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 310e1a97-82ae-2b52-0c0a-8d72d4c4a554
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_HeadRemoval_Event_OpenLoot(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_HeadLoot:310e1a97-82ae-2b52-0c0a-8d72d4c4a554
msgctxt "h05108a37g59e3g4932gb821g32a50149385a"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_HeadLoot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = afc922c0-609d-e884-fc1f-75115ec354b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_HeadRemoval_Event_HeadToInventory(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_HeadLoot:afc922c0-609d-e884-fc1f-75115ec354b8
msgctxt "hee908382gd86bg45acg927ag4ccb25c38813"
msgid "<i>Remove her head.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그녀의 머리를 제거한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_HeadLoot
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e0af5035-1a37-183a-a978-ee147845d123
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_HeadLoot:e0af5035-1a37-183a-a978-ee147845d123
msgctxt "h6aad5238g7f86g47d9gb76fg33ca508f1a65"
msgid "*The head comes free with a sickening crunch.*"
msgstr "*불쾌한 으드득 소리와 함께 머리가 분리됩니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 00ef9d73-f04f-9e44-fc37-c52f7d38f33a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:00ef9d73-f04f-9e44-fc37-c52f7d38f33a
msgctxt "hc8b6056cg6f74g4223g8d6bg08a1e032595d"
msgid "Any chance of a reward?"
msgstr "보상이 있으려나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 01cc7ba8-feae-17e7-867e-fa6bdc655c86
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:01cc7ba8-feae-17e7-867e-fa6bdc655c86
msgctxt "h6a9b7d48g9d43g4923gb2b7ge6673635dcd2"
msgid ""
"All right. Come on over here. But fair warning - you might find this hard to "
"believe."
msgstr "좋아. 이리로 건너와. 그렇지만 경고는 해 두지, 내 이야기를 믿기 어려울 수도 있으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 056f0514-dbd4-8071-535c-9e8df508b0f9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:056f0514-dbd4-8071-535c-9e8df508b0f9
msgctxt "h4b3ede38g2529g48a9g9215ge258a642bddc"
msgid ""
"Ha. Even if you take me, I'll see you in hell one day. And I'll rip your "
"godsdamned spine out."
msgstr "하. 네가 날 죽이더라도, 언젠가 우리는 지옥에서 마주치게 될 거야. 그 때가 오면 네 망할 척추를 뽑아주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 0785551f-2112-0320-2d01-345e6a99565a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:0785551f-2112-0320-2d01-345e6a99565a
msgctxt "h2f943f48gc757g4b54g8e95g80fc6adc3a67"
msgid "Sorry - I left all my soul coins in hell."
msgstr "미안하군. 내 영혼 동전을 전부 지옥에 두고 왔어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 09e9fead-0dc0-14bc-cfcd-cd7db1690150
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:09e9fead-0dc0-14bc-cfcd-cd7db1690150
msgctxt "h7bf78d5ag4899g46f6ga21cga792dea8e84c"
msgid "They don't need to catch you - I already did. You're finished."
msgstr "널 찾을 일은 없을 거야. 내가 찾았으니까. 넌 죽은 목숨이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 0aaafe17-033e-0154-d970-ccb15b10a30b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:0aaafe17-033e-0154-d970-ccb15b10a30b
msgctxt "h10dffe78ga8d8g4b8eg9fcdg801ec4e1a6b8"
msgid ""
"And what <i>is</i> it doing to me exactly? I barely felt a wriggle from it "
"'til you came along."
msgstr "그래서 그게 정확히 나에게 <i>뭘</i> 하는 거야? 네가 오기 전까지는 살짝 꿈틀대는 느낌만 들었을 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 0c7a39d5-37ad-8068-6add-6cb7c4c045ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:0c7a39d5-37ad-8068-6add-6cb7c4c045ee
msgctxt "h1951a074g5945g41f6g9b36g4f8c263be367"
msgid ""
"They're not the kind of people you can run from. I need them <i>dead</i>."
msgstr "도망칠 수 있는 그런 종류의 사람들이 아니야. 놈들은 <i>죽어야</i> 된다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 0dc2280d-a8e2-bd2a-94cc-9b91091e7aa6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_State_HelpingKarlach = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:0dc2280d-a8e2-bd2a-94cc-9b91091e7aa6
msgctxt "h279c6e2fgf388g416aga029g39621fa9cfd0"
msgid ""
"I'd come with you just to see them bleed, but I'm too busy bleeding myself. "
"I'll be here when you're done."
msgstr "나도 놈들 피 흘리는 거 보러 가고 싶은데, 정작 내 피를 흘리느라 못 가겠네. 다 끝나면 날 찾아와."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 0f2548d3-538a-fe73-b466-e9e12720537b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:0f2548d3-538a-fe73-b466-e9e12720537b
msgctxt "h9a199c95gd60fg4d84g9191gbe9e1f907954"
msgid ""
"But I won't forget what you did, and I hope I can pay you back down the line."
msgstr "하지만 네가 해 준 일은 잊지 않을 거야. 그리고 언젠가 갚을 수 있으면 좋겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 0f5d80e8-4115-61e5-cd39-4ec221af03e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:0f5d80e8-4115-61e5-cd39-4ec221af03e4
msgctxt "h68646f00g6346g4940gbbb9g7e6c0fd6c7f9"
msgid "Awful lot of people <i>do</i> deserve it though, don't you find?"
msgstr "엄청나게 많은 사람들이 <i>그렇게</i> 될 자격이 있다고 생각이 들지 않아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 1085d557-62d0-a82b-4b02-1e35bc2b6b50
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:1085d557-62d0-a82b-4b02-1e35bc2b6b50
msgctxt "h6572c702g55a8g400fga0acg1201f22a093c"
msgid ""
"I could use the company, but until I've shaken Zariel off my back, I'd only "
"put a target on yours."
msgstr "일행이 있으면 좋기는 하겠지만, 내가 자리엘의 추격을 뿌리치기 전에는 너까지 위험에 처하게 할 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 10ae51b1-cb46-8dd4-3238-62d8405d2b00
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e4aea2c7-1fdf-7a46-740b-06089fa8490d_PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_MentionedTollhouse = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:10ae51b1-cb46-8dd4-3238-62d8405d2b00
msgctxt "h2e64dd0cge9aag4cb3g9ea2g0d2b7a7eec1d"
msgid ""
"A gang of cultists cornered me in an abandoned tollhouse, not far from here."
msgstr "한 무리의 광신도가 버려진 통행료 징수소에서 나를 궁지에 몰고 갔었어. 여기서 멀지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 10f204a6-d491-4d1a-f959-d606f4602b49
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:10f204a6-d491-4d1a-f959-d606f4602b49
msgctxt "h854c17beg9e9dg4612g8956g16e4957ea4ca"
msgid ""
"I'm good at reading people - there's a knack to it -  and I'm only getting "
"one word from you."
msgstr "난 사람들 생각을 읽는 걸 잘 해. 요령이 있다고. 그리고 너에게서는 딱 하나의 단어만 읽을 수 있네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 12699b99-0e39-2fdc-30b3-408f5e025cd1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Knows_RefugeesAreCultists = True
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Quest_LookingForKarlach = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:12699b99-0e39-2fdc-30b3-408f5e025cd1
msgctxt "hb6f4a0e4gb5cbg450eg935bge7e14ead6952"
msgid "I met the others who were sent for you - told them I'd help."
msgstr "너를 쫓으려 파견된 자들을 만났고, 도와주겠다고 했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 13bfc223-a723-2774-bcb3-9bc23bd46a92
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:13bfc223-a723-2774-bcb3-9bc23bd46a92
msgctxt "h753d5479g1591g476dg8417g7bc2ea778228"
msgid "If I do this, what do I get in return?"
msgstr "내가 널 도와주면, 그 대가로 뭘 받을 수 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 14315732-2f94-c818-00c4-1a15c6ae98eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:14315732-2f94-c818-00c4-1a15c6ae98eb
msgctxt "h1ff7cc4dg5cd7g4e66g95adg0e1eab2970d1"
msgid ""
"Oh, I have. The kind of battles a cub like you sees in their nightmares."
msgstr "오, 있다마다. 너 같은 애송이는 악몽에서나 볼 법한 전투에서 싸웠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 15de58df-2af9-01b1-5ea5-52e0911b0810
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:15de58df-2af9-01b1-5ea5-52e0911b0810
msgctxt "h7409993age2ebg4431gbfd0g1badb7c53977"
msgid ""
"Truth's not quite so exciting. Come on over and I'll tell you the whole "
"story."
msgstr "진실은 그다지 흥미롭지는 않아. 이리로 건너 오면 자초지종을 설명해 주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 15ff582e-6d98-175c-6d18-b35847b783c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:15ff582e-6d98-175c-6d18-b35847b783c0
msgctxt "heec4548age7e8g46d1g9319gf350823641a4"
msgid "Why don't you just run?"
msgstr "그냥 도망가면 되는 거 아냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 160c7de5-9ef2-1216-24bd-bca9eb1657a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:160c7de5-9ef2-1216-24bd-bca9eb1657a0
msgctxt "h8e21687dg869dg45d8gb0b8ga5b9540a1745"
msgid ""
"I don't work for her anymore so I'm back to relying on muscle and steel - "
"I'll be just fine."
msgstr "더 이상 그녀를 위해 싸우지 않으니까, 다시 내 근육과 강철에 의존해야지. 나는 괜찮을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 160d6edb-a55c-3616-4c79-8c13e0eae1e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:160d6edb-a55c-3616-4c79-8c13e0eae1e4
msgctxt "hb471e3a6gc4bcg4300ga26agc0d61f53991f"
msgid "Take your time - it's only my <i>soul</i> on the line."
msgstr "천천히 하라고. 겨우 내 <i>영혼</i>이 걸려 있는 건데 뭐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 19ceaaa0-a568-5948-88b0-c177886fb19b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:19ceaaa0-a568-5948-88b0-c177886fb19b
msgctxt "h20f1e1f1g7a33g437cg973fgcaaba3c34d9d"
msgid ""
"I'm a fugitive. I escaped the Hells, and the bastards who were holding me "
"there are trying to take me back."
msgstr "나는 탈주자야. 지옥에서 탈출했고, 나를 붙잡아 놓고 있던 새끼들이 다시 나를 끌고 가려고 하고 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 1ae96d6a-8fec-a071-7091-91d1b6a0e0cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:1ae96d6a-8fec-a071-7091-91d1b6a0e0cd
msgctxt "h88030eaageadag4170g9c8fgbb663ebf97c2"
msgid ""
"Shifty fucker like you doesn't get a second warning, so no sudden movements."
msgstr "너같이 교활한 새끼한테는 다시 경고 안 한다. 섣불리 행동하지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 1ae96d6a-8fec-a071-7091-91d1b6a0e0cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: GALE or SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:1ae96d6a-8fec-a071-7091-91d1b6a0e0cd
msgctxt "h0110674ag902cg4833gb997g6f68111f7a77"
msgid ""
"Given how soft you look, I figure you spit fire and crap lightning, so no "
"sudden movements."
msgstr "네 약해빠진 몰골을 보니까, 불이나 전기를 쏴대는 놈이겠군, 허튼 수작 부리지 마라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 1ae96d6a-8fec-a071-7091-91d1b6a0e0cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:1ae96d6a-8fec-a071-7091-91d1b6a0e0cd
msgctxt "hb650ccc2ga0f3g4361g8934gd166f5642e26"
msgid ""
"Haven't tangled with a gith before, but I hear you're tough. And "
"disciplined. So let's make this quick."
msgstr "기스와 얽힌 적은 없지만 너희 종족이 꽤 강인하고 규율도 잘 잡혀 있다고 들었지. 그러니 빨리 끝내자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 1ae96d6a-8fec-a071-7091-91d1b6a0e0cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:1ae96d6a-8fec-a071-7091-91d1b6a0e0cd
msgctxt "hb7d9f7b2g6443g4eadg9b9fga741e172ee75"
msgid "No sudden movements, or you're dead."
msgstr "움직이기만 해 봐, 넌 죽은 목숨이니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 1ce0a44b-fe8a-64ab-cd94-e1dcd92814e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:1ce0a44b-fe8a-64ab-cd94-e1dcd92814e8
msgctxt "h2b59adf0ge7bcg43fbga92ag23b042e00c2e"
msgid "Devils don't like to lose their assets."
msgstr "데빌들은 자기들의 자산을 잃는 걸 별로 좋아하지 않거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1e7712ce-2949-872e-de77-ed1fccca40e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:1e7712ce-2949-872e-de77-ed1fccca40e4
msgctxt "h152e0addgc7f3g43e5g930ag781077aafbc1"
msgid "I didn't do it on purpose."
msgstr "고의로 그런 게 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1f7c57ea-c317-eb76-197f-ce5e79da85ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Knows_RefugeesAreCultists = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:1f7c57ea-c317-eb76-197f-ce5e79da85ee
msgctxt "he431d87eg55a9g4ecbg822egb68df6ff7576"
msgid ""
"I know - they offered a fine reward for your head. I intend to claim it."
msgstr "네 머리에 꽤 두둑한 보상을 약속했지. 나는 그걸 받으려고 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 2041559f-2343-d1a6-2010-cb928b150a35
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:2041559f-2343-d1a6-2010-cb928b150a35
msgctxt "hc7af7f35g6ecfg468ega812ga00328596e05"
msgid ""
"I'll knock your teeth down your throat if you keep playing games - this is "
"serious. What <i>was</i> that?"
msgstr "계속 장난치면 아가리에 주먹을 꽂아줄 거야. 진심이야. 그게 <i>뭐</i> 였지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 209f3221-455b-4f81-103c-cb8a2ffb06d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:209f3221-455b-4f81-103c-cb8a2ffb06d2
msgctxt "h01363037g4a8fg4b18ga093g462ac8742dab"
msgid ""
"You gave me some breathing room when you killed those imp-fuckers, but more "
"will come."
msgstr "망할 임프 성애자 새끼들을 죽여줘서 이제 숨 좀 돌릴 틈이 생겼네. 하지만 놈들은 더 올 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 20d54f45-6075-161f-e7a4-41418da4b6e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:20d54f45-6075-161f-e7a4-41418da4b6e9
msgctxt "h3a633fabg3997g4289g9340gaae9bf4e19d1"
msgid "Fight your own battles."
msgstr "네 싸움은 네가 알아서 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 20f8e081-3b1d-5033-493c-1641dcb7d396
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:20f8e081-3b1d-5033-493c-1641dcb7d396
msgctxt "hfdfda4bbge5ceg4890gb2b6ge117a06336da"
msgid ""
"Zariel. Fallen lady, defiled celestial... ruler of Avernus. I was her "
"prisoner, and her champion."
msgstr "자리엘. 타락한 여인, 더렵혀진 천족이자... 아베르누스의 지배자. 나는 그녀의 포로였고, 그녀의 용사였지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 226ae64c-16b0-ec82-8db5-2a916c711aba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:226ae64c-16b0-ec82-8db5-2a916c711aba
msgctxt "hc1054b7bgcf17g4305g8dafgceec86fedb69"
msgid "You can try."
msgstr "해볼 테면 해봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2318fcd3-d203-8098-e167-7538d828344f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Quest_LookingForKarlach = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:2318fcd3-d203-8098-e167-7538d828344f
msgctxt "heb094427ge466g4d30gbaa7gdaad328ac14e"
msgid ""
"You said yourself, devils are tricksters. I don't believe a word of this."
msgstr "네 입으로 직접 말했잖아, 데빌은 협잡꾼이라고. 나는 이 이야기를 전혀 믿지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 23a423d6-38a7-b6a7-7fe2-c9b3790c4a4b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:23a423d6-38a7-b6a7-7fe2-c9b3790c4a4b
msgctxt "h0e3edd22gae35g4398g9922gd9ba16aae18d"
msgid "You looking for me?"
msgstr "날 찾고 있었지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 242712c4-9b47-f337-5e26-c6d00263bd05
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_TIEFLING(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:242712c4-9b47-f337-5e26-c6d00263bd05
msgctxt "haf5f89cfg92c7g40a9gadf8g043837c2489e"
msgid ""
"Her words are spoken in the infernal tongue of devils. A threat, or a plea: "
"'<i>I don't belong to you</i>'."
msgstr "그녀가 말한 것은 데빌의 지옥 언어야. 위협인지, 애원인지는 모르겠어. '<i>나는 너의 것이 아니다.</i>'."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 242bee5d-04e1-d739-c724-4ed36e75a723
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Annoyed = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:242bee5d-04e1-d739-c724-4ed36e75a723
msgctxt "he53da34fgc801g4e09g8abcgfc46481894b3"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 24d13b29-8e3e-6cbd-5a6a-7c21975da1ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:24d13b29-8e3e-6cbd-5a6a-7c21975da1ab
msgctxt "h9c865244g619eg4ea8gab0cgae6b47585a7e"
msgid "Oh, I'm counting on it. I'll be ready for her."
msgstr "오, 난 그걸 기대하고 있어. 그녀를 위해 준비되어 있을 거거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 28290b71-3fd3-a47b-7991-c525d2a03b47
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:28290b71-3fd3-a47b-7991-c525d2a03b47
msgctxt "h14674af8g57ebg435cg8838g117e1cc81586"
msgid "<i>Ster'ca</i>. What was that? You were inside my head..."
msgstr "<i>Ster'ca</i>. 방금 뭐야? 네가 내 머릿속으로 들어왔잖아..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 28d907b7-302c-b02e-3c9e-ddfc4116fd62
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:28d907b7-302c-b02e-3c9e-ddfc4116fd62
msgctxt "h190eb3bbgd82eg4cdbg8943g7ba873239090"
msgid "I boarded in Avernus - that ship was my way out."
msgstr "아베르누스에서 올라탔어. 배를 타고 탈출하려 했지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 2bd0ca93-d59a-5eb2-8e46-946d5668fe70
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:2bd0ca93-d59a-5eb2-8e46-946d5668fe70
msgctxt "h577ddec4g0915g4f02gb3e5gf4ab516e1bbc"
msgid "*Her mind touches yours - gratitude, warmth, and relief.*"
msgstr "*그녀의 마음이 당신의 마음에 닿습니다. 감사와 따뜻함, 그리고 안도감.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 2daabd7f-e1d4-e367-4301-ec652f0c22e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:2daabd7f-e1d4-e367-4301-ec652f0c22e5
msgctxt "ha5cc1441ga8b1g4557gaa35g089c103d1ed9"
msgid ""
"Oh. Sorry I told you to piss off just now. Come on over here - we should "
"talk."
msgstr "아, 방금 꺼지라고 화낸 건 미안해. 이리 올라와, 얘기를 좀 해보자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 32206904-3d7e-5af2-73db-517721719345
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:32206904-3d7e-5af2-73db-517721719345
msgctxt "h41450b21gba18g4c99g8b9fgc4d53482a12f"
msgid "Not many did."
msgstr "일부만 살아남았지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 32d690b6-6acb-807c-9aba-7d7558e1740a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:32d690b6-6acb-807c-9aba-7d7558e1740a
msgctxt "h0871c6a8g386dg4072g9e55g6d596daa5e9a"
msgid ""
"If you'd seen as much of hell as I have, you'd rather have a flayer's "
"tentacles up your arse than stay."
msgstr "네가 나처럼 지옥을 잘 알고 있다면, 지옥에 머무르느니 마인드 플레이어의 촉수에 쑤셔지는 게 차라리 낫다고 생각할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 356a795d-af1d-ef0b-a37f-e2514883d795
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_State_PaladinsPermaDefeated = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Quest_ToldKarlach = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:356a795d-af1d-ef0b-a37f-e2514883d795
msgctxt "ha2bb0f8dg60cfg4452g9598gbae96f396f33"
msgid "The people hunting you are. I took care of it."
msgstr "너를 쫓는 사람들 말이지. 내가 처리했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 36aa8cff-1ffa-c665-5981-56470d4f73d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:36aa8cff-1ffa-c665-5981-56470d4f73d9
msgctxt "hb3a7e08cg9ad4g4fd7g9516g5d4ee050dd2f"
msgid "Safety in numbers? Not a bad idea."
msgstr "뭉치면 강하다? 괜찮은 생각인데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 396f1183-ff0c-90dd-cd51-b90f83c5b8c7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:396f1183-ff0c-90dd-cd51-b90f83c5b8c7
msgctxt "hf9516000gd9ecg40cdg915cg9452eba6fa60"
msgid "I'm in a tight spot - might not be able to get out of it alone."
msgstr "곤경에 처했어. 혼자서는 빠져나올 수 없을지도 몰라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3a34ddce-9d08-0dd2-44cd-121eecb671da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Knows_RefugeesAreCultists = False
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Quest_LookingForKarlach = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:3a34ddce-9d08-0dd2-44cd-121eecb671da
msgctxt "h89bfa2d2gbf14g46f7gb143gc40ec92097b0"
msgid "Hold on - the people I spoke to were paladins, not devils."
msgstr "잠깐, 내가 이야기를 나눈 사람들은 팔라딘이지, 데빌이 아니었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3a75879b-9b35-dd4d-05f2-ae66dda27f4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:3a75879b-9b35-dd4d-05f2-ae66dda27f4f
msgctxt "h50bdab28g39e7g42ebg98a9g5e1d134a0342"
msgid "I have no idea who you are."
msgstr "네가 누군지 전혀 모르겠는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 3c1bd5fc-aa0b-08f2-d4b5-79072c7e90bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Karlach_HasMet = True
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_RefusedToHelp = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:3c1bd5fc-aa0b-08f2-d4b5-79072c7e90bf
msgctxt "h9d65aebdg6ad3g4537g80f0gb5c5b5200f03"
msgid "Piss off, you little vulture. I'm not dead yet."
msgstr "꺼져, 독수리같은 자식아. 나 아직 안 죽었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 4100597f-7a81-0368-2e4c-5b5187ab35ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:4100597f-7a81-0368-2e4c-5b5187ab35ea
msgctxt "he038d3f7gd779g40abg9b0dg46d0c0af7e05"
msgid ""
"I <i>haven't</i> survived her yet. She'll come for me - and I'll need to be "
"ready."
msgstr "아직까진 그녀에게서 벗어나지 <i>못했어.</i> 그녀가 날 잡으러 올 거야. 그리고 난 대비해야겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 410d39ff-5d1e-3cf8-cc1c-547985f16100
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:410d39ff-5d1e-3cf8-cc1c-547985f16100
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h57cda5a1gd056g4813ga921g1cd868b0549f"
msgid "What makes you so important to them?"
msgstr "뭐 때문에 그렇게 쫓기는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 4122637f-a965-83ce-7ded-00227a978730
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !TIEFLING
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:4122637f-a965-83ce-7ded-00227a978730
msgctxt "h5edd30b7gb9c4g4f27g9bd9ga4c88d3fba9a"
msgid "What? You've never seen a tiefling before?"
msgstr "뭐라고? 티플링을 한 번도 본 적이 없어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 4122637f-a965-83ce-7ded-00227a978730
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:4122637f-a965-83ce-7ded-00227a978730
msgctxt "heb5712dagab29g4aa8gb278g62b8ec416ced"
msgid "Are you demented? I'm a tiefling - same as you. More or less."
msgstr "정신 나갔어? 나는 티플링이라고. 너랑 같지, 거의 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 418cac6a-6c18-7b19-e115-2bc5e773966c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:418cac6a-6c18-7b19-e115-2bc5e773966c
msgctxt "hb03f6ccbg7c76g4d12g9f3eg2ec53f65bf6f"
msgid "You get a friend who spat in Baphomet's eye and lived to tell the tale."
msgstr "바포메트의 눈깔에 침을 뱉고도 살아남아서 썰을 푸는 친구가 네게 생기는 거지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 43ee4f9d-ed20-8f68-04fa-3a572a045b18
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:43ee4f9d-ed20-8f68-04fa-3a572a045b18
msgctxt "hb3e19625g3772g414eg8366gb1c0aaef8cc5"
msgid ""
"You just happened to stumble across me, here in the arse-end of nowhere? "
"Bullshit."
msgstr "좆도 뜬금없는 장소에서 그냥 이렇게 우연히 나를 만났다고? 지랄하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 441bfbad-07d9-0731-c67a-c3c662066298
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:441bfbad-07d9-0731-c67a-c3c662066298
msgctxt "hec0c3685gfd04g4543g9871gde63652e050e"
msgid "That was the least of what I can do."
msgstr "내가 할 수 있는 최소한의 일이 그거였어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 467cd27e-7afc-6e8b-a3ef-dff6e168aca4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Quest_KarlachBackground = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:467cd27e-7afc-6e8b-a3ef-dff6e168aca4
msgctxt "h5ea5611dgde6bg45f2gbbdag1c87e4e4d8b6"
msgid "I didn't think anyone else had survived."
msgstr "다른 생존자가 있을 줄은 몰랐는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4793d94a-2543-9a66-4412-e89f0ae1959f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Quest_LookingForKarlach = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:4793d94a-2543-9a66-4412-e89f0ae1959f
msgctxt "hde602bebg9c76g44cdg8a3cg940c76b960e0"
msgid "Judging by the wound, I'm guessing they already found you."
msgstr "그 상처를 보아하니, 그 자들이 이미 널 찾았나보군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 49aaaa0a-ff6d-8803-6c58-ffc82f9c543b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:49aaaa0a-ff6d-8803-6c58-ffc82f9c543b
msgctxt "h745a27a3g78c6g42a7gaf16g11b5f1b538e9"
msgid ""
"Don't sweat it - devils are tricky fuckers. They can't <i>breathe</i> "
"without lying."
msgstr "믿지 마, 데빌들은 속임수나 쓰는 개새끼들이거든. 숨 쉬듯이 거짓말을 해댄다니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 49cb65e5-9188-1f32-2d46-273a9e0331a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:49cb65e5-9188-1f32-2d46-273a9e0331a6
msgctxt "h318bd320g55c5g4ab7gb68dg85927006eeaf"
msgid "She tried to break me."
msgstr "그녀가 나를 무너뜨리려고 했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4a6c2a4a-d161-a637-cfc1-80a45981436f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_State_PaladinsPermaDefeated = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Quest_ToldKarlach = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:4a6c2a4a-d161-a637-cfc1-80a45981436f
msgctxt "haddb6462g3abdg4da4g9eadg9cccdebc9071"
msgid "They're not breathing anymore - I killed them."
msgstr "녀석들은 더 이상 숨을 쉬지 않아. 내가 죽였어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 4cf33117-bbbb-33f2-40f9-1ee8e8b04207
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:4cf33117-bbbb-33f2-40f9-1ee8e8b04207
msgctxt "he2f07f90gc16bg4c29ga8d2g280f681ca843"
msgid ""
"And the first step is to go home - to Baldur's Gate. I've got a score to "
"settle."
msgstr "그리고 그 첫 번째 단계는 집으로 돌아가는 거야. 발더스 게이트로. 거기서 처리해야 할 일이 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4ebdc07e-dc6b-942c-a860-d6419aa6f823
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:4ebdc07e-dc6b-942c-a860-d6419aa6f823
msgctxt "ha9bd735cg95d8g4bcagb946ge1536f72ae1e"
msgid "You shouldn't be sorry - I'm going to kill you as well."
msgstr "미안해할 것 없어, 나도 널 죽여버릴 거니까 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4ec42366-c19b-3130-7008-8b20d7d6ee98
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:4ec42366-c19b-3130-7008-8b20d7d6ee98
msgctxt "h7952a24fg62bdg4992gbf3cge1568a3d4158"
msgid "I visited Avernus recently - seemed delightful."
msgstr "최근에 아베르누스를 방문했는데, 참 마음에 드는 곳이었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 4f8865b7-dd49-9bec-231e-9e7d825d2c64
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:4f8865b7-dd49-9bec-231e-9e7d825d2c64
msgctxt "h1fec12a2g7ef6g4195g8250gbb304b91b7d9"
msgid ""
"I'm a fugitive - escaped from the Hells, and those bastards are trying to "
"take me back."
msgstr "난 탈영병이야, 지옥에서 탈출했지, 그리고 그 개자식들이 날 다시 잡아가려고 하고 있고 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 50954996-4834-04d8-8379-e4e2c7848243
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Quest_ToldKarlach = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:50954996-4834-04d8-8379-e4e2c7848243
msgctxt "hc741ffafg9fa5g4628g9b89g7ac1d5c6b312"
msgid "And I'll be going straight back if those imp-fuckers catch me."
msgstr "그리고 그 임프 성애자 놈들이 날 붙잡으면 거기로 곧장 돌아가겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 50e44261-012d-9a30-731d-98237eda3e6a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:50e44261-012d-9a30-731d-98237eda3e6a
msgctxt "ha623c5e5g7dceg4f2cgad18ge1fbb95db041"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr "그래."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 50fa5164-5c74-364a-847b-ce7a9c9be00a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Annoyed = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:50fa5164-5c74-364a-847b-ce7a9c9be00a
msgctxt "he96941ccgd082g4824g99f7g29771c682d58"
msgid "And I'm none of yours. So piss off."
msgstr "그리고 난 너랑 상관없어. 그러니까 꺼져."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 53116495-62ab-17d5-effb-42286e1b3a58
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Quest_LookingForKarlach = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:53116495-62ab-17d5-effb-42286e1b3a58
msgctxt "he27c294age0ceg4f9cgaf31g9d546f6912cc"
msgid "I just want to know what's going on here, I swear."
msgstr "무슨 일이 있던 건지 알고 싶을 뿐이야, 맹세해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 56099f25-4005-ef21-7fc0-7d38984e2af7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:56099f25-4005-ef21-7fc0-7d38984e2af7
msgctxt "hfc47d3cegbc43g48f2gbed5g4f56d3535f73"
msgid ""
"*Then you're lost in visions of demonic armies, as you tear through a "
"landscape of fire and blood.*"
msgstr "*그 순간 당신은 불과 피로 뒤덮인 풍경을 뚫고 지나갔으며, 사방을 뒤덮은 데몬 군대의 모습이 아찔해집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 567e7e16-d75b-8f76-7e50-de054d1dd93c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:567e7e16-d75b-8f76-7e50-de054d1dd93c
msgctxt "h2cc4b225g7c8bg4f21gb56fg29ee26a89317"
msgid "You've got my attention - what's your story?"
msgstr "내 주의를 끌었네, 네 사연이 뭐야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 570404cf-4ff2-41c6-9214-782a6517cafd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:570404cf-4ff2-41c6-9214-782a6517cafd
msgctxt "h097ec670g27f2g461ag94bfg04cba693a493"
msgid "I reckon you've been sold a crock of shit about me."
msgstr "나에 대한 헛소문을 들은 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5727612a-7ff1-7117-4719-2e8535a95b65
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Knows_RefugeesAreCultists = False
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Quest_LookingForKarlach = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:5727612a-7ff1-7117-4719-2e8535a95b65
msgctxt "he669cd57gca3dg45b8gad44g95c1e7b66d62"
msgid "Yes I am - the people who are hunting you sent me."
msgstr "그래. 널 쫓는 자들이 나를 보냈지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 598825c9-29ca-883c-8663-732b7594cfdf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_State_PaladinsPermaDefeated = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Quest_ToldKarlach = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:598825c9-29ca-883c-8663-732b7594cfdf
msgctxt "h85e40ba1g7bc1g479egbaeeg67877c293134"
msgid "Yes - you're safe."
msgstr "그래. 이제 안전해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 5a2e5ca3-c4b4-6d11-70be-ca385ae16987
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:5a2e5ca3-c4b4-6d11-70be-ca385ae16987
msgctxt "hfa1f58b2g0b64g4054g982fg1f4950087e22"
msgid ""
"The place would have been crawling with cultists if I'd stuck around - and "
"they'd have dragged us all back to Avernus."
msgstr "내가 그곳에 계속 있었으면 광신도 놈들이 들끓었을 거야. 그리고 놈들이 우릴 다시 아베르누스로 끌고 갔겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 5aa1c435-f585-3c51-18a8-c3a50c47d51a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:5aa1c435-f585-3c51-18a8-c3a50c47d51a
msgctxt "h8b7e4832g335ag4e18ga874gc310fb94e395"
msgid "Why the change of heart? Ah, doesn't matter - thank you."
msgstr "왜 갑자기 생각이 바뀐 거야? 아, 상관없어, 고마워."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5c3749ca-1290-3bf5-fac6-38f951bbe2c1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - e4aea2c7-1fdf-7a46-740b-06089fa8490d_PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_OfferedRecruit = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:5c3749ca-1290-3bf5-fac6-38f951bbe2c1
msgctxt "h7bcade0cgd3e3g44feg8326gbee915848d8c"
msgid "We should travel together."
msgstr "나랑 같이 다니는 건 어때."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5d8e807f-bfff-fd51-2759-15ba1b2a8bff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:5d8e807f-bfff-fd51-2759-15ba1b2a8bff
msgctxt "h1484e369g7b5fg428agb179g88f710a1d456"
msgid "I'll do it."
msgstr "하겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5eaef9fe-1736-95e3-73d3-7db9c1d08b31
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Quest_LookingForKarlach = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - BERSERKER(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:5eaef9fe-1736-95e3-73d3-7db9c1d08b31
msgctxt "hf476bdf2gef13g446bgad58g839ad90ca885"
msgid "I was warned you're dangerous - so am I."
msgstr "네가 위험하다고 경고를 받았지. 나도 위험인물인건 마찬가지야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5f596578-79b1-127c-fe39-b8a1eedd3560
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:5f596578-79b1-127c-fe39-b8a1eedd3560
msgctxt "h70475c72ga7c1g4e94gbedeg510f15c11e5f"
msgid "Why were you in hell in the first place?"
msgstr "애초에 왜 지옥에 있던 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5fb986c8-2919-546e-2702-1c2756c11600
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:5fb986c8-2919-546e-2702-1c2756c11600
msgctxt "h1f1035f2gf799g4f9fgaf0cgb263087a72de"
msgid "That doesn't sound ideal."
msgstr "이상적으로 들리지는 않는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5fd4af46-300b-124a-3b52-99ed935f9305
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:5fd4af46-300b-124a-3b52-99ed935f9305
msgctxt "h4116ba95g1430g4c3bg8bd1g1be8df76367f"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 619243a6-eb13-a09a-103d-d8428d99a865
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:619243a6-eb13-a09a-103d-d8428d99a865
msgctxt "hdfcc143cgec78g42b7gaac5gbf99671f8967"
msgid "I'm not doing it - you're on your own."
msgstr "난 안 할 거야. 네가 알아서 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 6354788e-ed59-f9c0-1609-95385d356437
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:6354788e-ed59-f9c0-1609-95385d356437
msgctxt "he22e51b9g21cdg4108g808ag90a8501f9cef"
msgid "Sure they were - and I'm Tiamat's left tit."
msgstr "잘도 그렇겠지, 놈들이 팔라딘이면 내가 티아마트의 왼쪽 젖탱이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 6381d0fe-3845-0e7b-e4cf-05cde6be404b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:6381d0fe-3845-0e7b-e4cf-05cde6be404b
msgctxt "ha1a39a12g1286g4733g9415g2d28717e87b1"
msgid ""
"Lucky you. It's the devils' tongue - infernal. Good for cursing and "
"counting, not so good for small talk."
msgstr "운이 좋네. 이건 데빌의 언어야 - 지옥어지. 쌍욕과 계산에는 좋지만, 잡담에는 별로거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 65ca7eb4-db55-9802-d5a7-997844a19577
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:65ca7eb4-db55-9802-d5a7-997844a19577
msgctxt "hd51f068dg725fg483eg8b63g93b99fddfd7b"
msgid "You're very intense."
msgstr "아주 열정적인데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 686bc673-373f-5dc2-ac98-e9837d62863d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:686bc673-373f-5dc2-ac98-e9837d62863d
msgctxt "h8eca6232g758ag4b89g809eg4932826d0d06"
msgid "Fuck this - I'm done being reasonable."
msgstr "씨발, 집어치워. 이성적으로 구는 건 끝났어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 6abde530-8b79-a045-81f1-9924f0be98e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:6abde530-8b79-a045-81f1-9924f0be98e4
msgctxt "h5d92472cg6fdeg4e61g9902gfa2f67a8f0ca"
msgid ""
"All right. Maybe the blood-loss is making me soft, but I'm going to trust "
"you. For now."
msgstr "좋아. 피를 너무 많이 흘려서 부드러워진 걸지도 모르겠지만, 널 한번 믿어보지. 당장은 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6b41f3e2-9509-8c82-faf6-a95b3b8aca5e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:6b41f3e2-9509-8c82-faf6-a95b3b8aca5e
msgctxt "h6ca3febeg0c0bg4506ga87dg2cc6b1a56454"
msgid ""
"It wasn't me - it's the parasites from the mind flayer ship. They connected "
"us."
msgstr "내가 한 게 아니야. 마인드 플레이어 함선에서 달라붙은 기생충 짓이지. 우릴 연결시켰어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 6d502466-99aa-dfe0-be09-7f7fe03ee9e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Annoyed = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:6d502466-99aa-dfe0-be09-7f7fe03ee9e4
msgctxt "h1a11119egcc77g4473g92f5gf670f2429ca0"
msgid "Either piss off, or show me what you're made of."
msgstr "당장 꺼지지 않으면, 네 내장이 어떻게 생겼는지 구경 시켜주겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6d6390ee-c48a-046a-bffa-eaf2b4426bf0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Quest_LookingForKarlach = True
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_State_PaladinsPermaDefeated = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Quest_ToldKarlach = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:6d6390ee-c48a-046a-bffa-eaf2b4426bf0
msgctxt "h3739a189gec9bg47d8g8c67gcb94c1e4c490"
msgid "I met the people looking for you - and killed them."
msgstr "널 쫓는 사람들을 만났어, 그리고 놈들을 죽여버렸지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6e71f36f-35ac-6448-0a01-32b084c97250
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Quest_LookingForKarlach = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - BERSERKER(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:6e71f36f-35ac-6448-0a01-32b084c97250
msgctxt "ha1d179e1g4bceg487bgaa0cg0f36614892f9"
msgid ""
"If you keep pointing that thing at me this is going to end badly for you."
msgstr "그걸 계속 나한테 겨누고 있으면, 너한테 좋게 끝나진 않을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 6e9a17cf-851f-7009-8611-2b3788f3a40b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:6e9a17cf-851f-7009-8611-2b3788f3a40b
msgctxt "h170375cegb4eag49d7gb096gcc28ad1132b1"
msgid "Most souls in the Blood War are just meat for the grinder, but not me."
msgstr "피의 전쟁에 끌려간 영혼들은 대부분 그냥 고기방패였지만, 나는 달랐어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6f3f8b8d-a3a1-8170-d1b3-829f401a3cb3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Quest_LookingForKarlach = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:6f3f8b8d-a3a1-8170-d1b3-829f401a3cb3
msgctxt "hb641f176g7a1ag462cg88a3g08ca99f2c84a"
msgid "I'm done listening - I'm ending you."
msgstr "더는 못들어주겠군, 너를 죽이겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6f8179c0-d36d-ad80-bd0d-668d718acab4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:6f8179c0-d36d-ad80-bd0d-668d718acab4
msgctxt "he3428171g92e7g414ag9408g2431984c28b1"
msgid "So you want me to kill the people hunting you?"
msgstr "그러니까, 널 쫓는 자들을 내가 죽여달라는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 72af5263-6a8b-6e16-c5b2-cf02a749f3a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - e4aea2c7-1fdf-7a46-740b-06089fa8490d_PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_MentionedTollhouse = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:72af5263-6a8b-6e16-c5b2-cf02a749f3a8
msgctxt "h792bc12fg4da6g40cagad9cgb07f91d464b1"
msgid ""
"They cornered me in the tollhouse, just up the hill. Doubt they've gone far "
"after the beating I gave them."
msgstr "놈들이 저 언덕 위에 있는 통행료 징수소에서 나를 궁지에 몰았었어. 나한테 된통 당했으니 멀리 가진 못했을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 737679e0-9077-9aab-549a-6f262121fb68
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:737679e0-9077-9aab-549a-6f262121fb68
msgctxt "h2cec53eag3c41g41e2g98d8gcda7e5460ee1"
msgid ""
"I guess they told you I bite the heads off babies, and paint myself in their "
"blood."
msgstr "내가 갓난 아기들 목을 물어뜯고 그 피를 몸에 칠한다고 놈들이 말해 줬을 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 748992af-6a5b-104a-daf1-50827fec8c92
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:748992af-6a5b-104a-daf1-50827fec8c92
msgctxt "h3475169ag4820g4379gace6gfb962468164a"
msgid "Not another word - I'm ending you."
msgstr "좀 닥쳐. 너를 죽이겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 74b391a3-3468-a1aa-4db8-cf0bd89f6160
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:74b391a3-3468-a1aa-4db8-cf0bd89f6160
msgctxt "ha70b0a41g6e9eg4787ga66egcc708f930495"
msgid "How can I help?"
msgstr "뭘 도와줄까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 750640fe-19ab-a4bb-7172-60df3b42e252
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:750640fe-19ab-a4bb-7172-60df3b42e252
msgctxt "h2d02dbfdg641bg4ce0gbc6eg81504e86ab9a"
msgid "*And smiles as she carves her name across your chest.*"
msgstr "*그러고는 자신의 이름을 당신의 가슴에 새기며 미소 짓습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 769974a8-a725-f92e-bd5c-e9e49c311ecd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Knows_LookingforKarlach = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:769974a8-a725-f92e-bd5c-e9e49c311ecd
msgctxt "hb67e47f7g19d1g493egbe21gf287f69b3204"
msgid "You will be soon - I'm taking your head."
msgstr "곧 그렇게 될 거야, 내가 네 머리를 가져갈 거니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 76bae767-ed9a-b8d5-c175-2b63387723e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Quest_LookingForKarlach = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:76bae767-ed9a-b8d5-c175-2b63387723e8
msgctxt "h16852ba6gfb56g4badg939cg04b54b56b274"
msgid "Yes, and I saw hell. You really are a fiend."
msgstr "그래, 지옥이 보였지. 너는 정말로 마족이 맞구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 77796f4f-934e-86e4-511b-acfa1caadd0b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:77796f4f-934e-86e4-511b-acfa1caadd0b
msgctxt "hb65e94ceged53g42c6g9e82g8f2dfe4de812"
msgid "What will you do if she sends more?"
msgstr "그녀가 더 많은 놈들을 보내면 어떻게 할 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 79167560-7d23-810a-d6b3-35a7316d5e9b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:79167560-7d23-810a-d6b3-35a7316d5e9b
msgctxt "h74b2448egbaafg43eag8c4fg1589da791aaa"
msgid "Do you find this funny?"
msgstr "이게 재미있어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 795b7c8f-bec3-54a0-0310-53dcf0760b49
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:795b7c8f-bec3-54a0-0310-53dcf0760b49
msgctxt "hc6822686g3855g4522g8b6fg318989f9e02d"
msgid "None of your damn business."
msgstr "네 알 바 아니야, 새끼야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 7bdcd9f4-5f94-302d-56fb-351d6f615820
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:7bdcd9f4-5f94-302d-56fb-351d6f615820
msgctxt "he9b3fd97gacc0g4c73g90dbg14aa5e75c61e"
msgid "Most souls in Avernus are just meat for the grinder. But not me."
msgstr "아베르누스에 있는 영혼들은 대부분 그냥 고기방패였지만, 나는 달랐어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 7c250104-1724-a0ce-e5bb-e183c5aeb402
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_RefusedToHelp = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:7c250104-1724-a0ce-e5bb-e183c5aeb402
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hb68236c5g93a5g4e66ga550gd7b5de415974"
msgid "Figures. I'll see you in hell one day, arsehole."
msgstr "그렇군. 언젠가 지옥에서 다시 만나자고, 개자식."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 7c8ce02d-1e1d-0f19-77c9-b9071299da56
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:7c8ce02d-1e1d-0f19-77c9-b9071299da56
msgctxt "ha75c1c59ge3ceg4698g9ac6g420dd5bd1d73"
msgid "Yeah. Can you handle it?"
msgstr "그래. 해낼 수 있겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 7d03e6f5-c787-0783-ec13-63e335c55086
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Annoyed = True
#.      - ORI_Karlach_HasMet = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:7d03e6f5-c787-0783-ec13-63e335c55086
msgctxt "hafe798a9g9d0cg404ag91fbgb6cc27480d27"
msgid "Could have sworn I told you to piss off. Maybe I imagined it."
msgstr "내가 분명 꺼지라고 한 것 같은데. 내 상상이었나 보군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7d6fc70f-04a6-e3ae-5d72-d728add1238b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:7d6fc70f-04a6-e3ae-5d72-d728add1238b
msgctxt "h4b5ddb7fgb1f0g412egad59gcbc745ccc645"
msgid "That was terrifying."
msgstr "끔찍한 광경이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7fa8a2c3-f0d4-21c6-bfc3-d6b62701b3d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_TIEFLING(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:7fa8a2c3-f0d4-21c6-bfc3-d6b62701b3d3
msgctxt "h34842a6bgaa13g4f36g945fg6d476fdede4f"
msgid "I've never heard that language before."
msgstr "그런 언어는 처음 들어보는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7fbd15cc-1dd9-233c-20e5-9ebb003e6415
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_TIEFLING(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:7fbd15cc-1dd9-233c-20e5-9ebb003e6415
msgctxt "haf1b617eg113cg4a1eg87c6g1d95f3ca0515"
msgid "She thinks she owns you? Who is she?"
msgstr "자기가 너를 소유한다고 생각하는 거야? 이 여자가 누군데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 83901535-ff4e-89a5-e490-b2cf83ac1473
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Quest_LookingForKarlach = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:83901535-ff4e-89a5-e490-b2cf83ac1473
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hb9a5c9c2gd45cg4900g8c60g7850d47c7a6c"
msgid "They said you're a fiend, that you belong in hell."
msgstr "네가 마족이라고 하더군, 지옥의 존재라고 하던데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 84899a19-e580-26ee-78b9-3a7ed320c49b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:84899a19-e580-26ee-78b9-3a7ed320c49b
msgctxt "h2141c519g1575g4db0g8661g594cff5ffaf2"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 8503a9ae-7835-9a75-c08d-7db4cc3c3554
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:8503a9ae-7835-9a75-c08d-7db4cc3c3554
msgctxt "h3f58ddebg70f0g4528ga19ag0d661ce31b87"
msgid "It's not - it's a shitting catastrophe. But at least I'm out."
msgstr "아니, 그건 완전 지랄맞은 개판이야. 하지만 적어도 난 빠져나왔지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 87063459-ca2a-831d-793f-f2300179fe5e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:87063459-ca2a-831d-793f-f2300179fe5e
msgctxt "hc3217dc0g3db6g4c1dga4f3g857b4d9c1de5"
msgid ""
"I held my own. More than. Turns out I've got a knack for killing demons - "
"and I <i>enjoy</i> it. That made me a valuable asset."
msgstr ""
"난 나름대로 버텨냈어. 그 이상도 해냈고. 알고 보니 내가 데몬을 죽이는데 재능이 있더라고, 그걸 <i>즐기기도</i> 하고 말이야. "
"그래서 난 귀중한 자산이 됐지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 87789c56-6264-1cab-6466-cf4a37da1f47
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:87789c56-6264-1cab-6466-cf4a37da1f47
msgctxt "h788b8cbfg9f89g4c47g8df0g953271ebf7a2"
msgid "Make 'em scream."
msgstr "놈들이 비명을 지르게 만들어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 8b76883a-174e-1d67-8d7f-9444940419c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:8b76883a-174e-1d67-8d7f-9444940419c8
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "he8b5c7fdg37fdg46fbg8c00g8315de90319d"
msgid ""
"You get a friend who'll put a dent in the skull of anyone who pisses you off."
msgstr "널 화나게 하는 놈이 누구든 그 자식을 작살내줄 수 있는 친구가 네게 생기는 거지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8d5c81ee-13f2-4f06-f10e-354c0b44ad8d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Quest_LookingForKarlach = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:8d5c81ee-13f2-4f06-f10e-354c0b44ad8d
msgctxt "h09f6b399g7270g4da7g9bb8g76305a10a1c5"
msgid "I met the people looking for you. They say you're a killer - a fiend."
msgstr "너를 찾는 자들을 만났어. 네가 사람 죽이고 다니는 마족이라고 하던데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 8e05c0e8-9fc2-4b7e-321d-d0a8c68f9c74
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:8e05c0e8-9fc2-4b7e-321d-d0a8c68f9c74
msgctxt "h150c5c2bg4b70g40b7g9479gef3c60d27f94"
msgid "<i>Politicians</i>. The fuckers who sent me to hell in the first place."
msgstr "<i>정치인들</i> 말이야. 애초에 나를 지옥으로 보낸 그 씹새끼들 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 8f070698-56c6-f01b-7e6a-a091a2496d1a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:8f070698-56c6-f01b-7e6a-a091a2496d1a
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hb6a1580bg879eg4919g8fbbg312c16719193"
msgid ""
"*And from within, a winged figure steps forward, graceful and terrible. She "
"places her hand on your cheek.*"
msgstr ""
"*그리고 그 속에서, 날개가 달린 인물이 앞으로 나타납니다, 자비와 끔찍함이 느껴집니다. 그녀가 자신의 손을 당신의 뺨 위에 "
"올려놓습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 914fc4e3-5cef-7461-ad74-8b0521e5af6e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:914fc4e3-5cef-7461-ad74-8b0521e5af6e
msgctxt "h73e2fc1bg0b4ag41aegabefgec6ab3152776"
msgid "I'm not getting involved."
msgstr "난 이 일에 끼기 싫어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 92f4219a-7cbe-d81d-1f56-4c3e44bf06ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:92f4219a-7cbe-d81d-1f56-4c3e44bf06ca
msgctxt "h7214f37egfe66g4c88g979fge5a5c15a66f4"
msgid "Hurt or not, I won't miss - lung, heart, arse or eye. Take your pick."
msgstr "몸 상태가 어떻든 자신 있어. 폐, 심장, 궁둥이 아님 눈깔. 어딜 조져 줄까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 940ec87d-6181-f7c8-ceed-8978224a2f3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:940ec87d-6181-f7c8-ceed-8978224a2f3b
msgctxt "h7dd8d3a5g4397g4e9agb850g1fca52e86823"
msgid "What do I get in return?"
msgstr "그 보답으로 난 무엇을 얻지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 9491c248-060d-191b-b1bb-51841e78f4e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:9491c248-060d-191b-b1bb-51841e78f4e8
msgctxt "h474c5a1bg5fe4g48e5gbceag2ca6a29dc70f"
msgid "Anyhow. Piss off."
msgstr "어쨌든. 꺼져."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 94a2019c-ca52-ff12-7517-1a5ebd26fac9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:94a2019c-ca52-ff12-7517-1a5ebd26fac9
msgctxt "h3fb7f088gec78g4be9gb16eg256d7219155a"
msgid ""
"*Then a light, sharper than the truest blade, brighter than a star. It fills "
"you with awe, forcing you to your knees.*"
msgstr ""
"*그러더니 갑자기 완벽한 검보다도 날카롭고, 별보다도 밝은 빛이 나타납니다. 빛이 당신을 경외감으로 가득 채워, 강제로 무릎 꿇립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 958389df-6491-0633-2557-05e6a05fddd3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e4aea2c7-1fdf-7a46-740b-06089fa8490d_PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_MentionedTollhouse = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:958389df-6491-0633-2557-05e6a05fddd3
msgctxt "h58852d94gbe6bg42f7g8069geaf6e1b84149"
msgid ""
"Yeah. Not far from here - gang of cultists cornered me in an abandoned "
"tollhouse."
msgstr "그래. 여기서 멀리 있지 않아. 한 무리의 광신도 놈들이 버려진 통행료 징수소에서 나를 궁지에 몰아넣었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 95c36509-c328-0ff1-da24-c716fa106844
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:95c36509-c328-0ff1-da24-c716fa106844
msgctxt "hd3d5ec43g0d03g4ad8g805cgc7b05c4bc779"
msgid "<i>Kwa'ad vos non petri'kar.</i>"
msgstr "<i>Kwa'ad vos non petri'kar.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 96aeaa59-75b1-5534-dc92-bddaa35f0837
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:96aeaa59-75b1-5534-dc92-bddaa35f0837
msgctxt "h260befb0gdbefg4653ga865gbb8b3d668965"
msgid "If I help you, what's in it for me?"
msgstr "널 도와주면, 나한텐 어떤 이득이 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 9823a18d-3a56-0e4a-2f03-1b7a75953121
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:9823a18d-3a56-0e4a-2f03-1b7a75953121
msgctxt "hd5716603g3074g4103g9edfgbf141d60d443"
msgid ""
"That ship could have been heading for Sigil or Limbo for all I cared - "
"anything was better than staying."
msgstr "그 함선이 향하는 곳이 시질이었든, 연옥이었든, 그건 나한테 중요하지 않았어. 어디로든 가는 게 머무르는 것보다는 나았거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 98c3d039-1026-27d4-15f2-5f2ac47958b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:98c3d039-1026-27d4-15f2-5f2ac47958b9
msgctxt "h443c2387g0813g460cga94eg17d5312842af"
msgid ""
"I was a prisoner, forced to fight in the Blood War - the eternal battle "
"between bad and worse."
msgstr "나는 피의 전쟁에서 강제로 싸우게 된 포로였어. 나쁜 놈들이랑 더한 놈들이 싸우는 영원한 전투 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 9b486214-0548-4db0-365c-52be93e49387
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:9b486214-0548-4db0-365c-52be93e49387
msgctxt "h059a679agb034g49f6gb0acgd02e6de1315e"
msgid ""
"Back in the Blood War, my commander gave me what I needed to get the job "
"done. I had fire running through my veins."
msgstr "피의 전쟁에서 싸울 적에, 내가 잘 싸울 수 있도록 내 지휘관이 힘을 내려줬지. 내 피를 타고 불길이 흘렀어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 9cad92f8-e482-5715-4dd9-1881ac3e6bea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:9cad92f8-e482-5715-4dd9-1881ac3e6bea
msgctxt "h0be62c28gd83cg4c56g901bg01b29fe3bd20"
msgid ""
"You're picking the wrong side here - those bastards aren't what they claim "
"to be."
msgstr "넌 지금 잘못된 쪽을 고르고 있는 거야, 그 개새끼들은 겉으로 보이는 것과 다른 놈들이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 9d9163f0-1d06-10ff-a2ab-8de52fb82da3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:9d9163f0-1d06-10ff-a2ab-8de52fb82da3
msgctxt "h80995f1fg61b4g4a2aga2fegd794792c69fb"
msgid "Horseshit."
msgstr "지랄."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 9ecad2a8-a63a-158a-6d39-38602a912171
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:9ecad2a8-a63a-158a-6d39-38602a912171
msgctxt "he1696d36g7edeg4ce1gae7ag2e8b4d6c10d6"
msgid "I took out a couple, but I need them <i>all</i> dead."
msgstr "몇 명은 내가 해치웠는데, 나머지 놈들도 <i>모두</i> 죽어야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = a0c3c3de-4f50-1879-eb97-f722a4edfa29
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:a0c3c3de-4f50-1879-eb97-f722a4edfa29
msgctxt "hb2ae9982g1dbbg47cag9078g3aa59fdcceb2"
msgid "Poor bastards."
msgstr "불쌍한 새끼들."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = a1ba1755-9c05-507e-b34d-7e90553deb46
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:a1ba1755-9c05-507e-b34d-7e90553deb46
msgctxt "hbb7d0141g3d51g40bfgbb62gce7726de27a0"
msgid ""
"Hm. If you bite as hard as you bark, we might get along. I might even have a "
"job for you."
msgstr "흠. 네가 짖어대는 것만큼이나 잘 물 수 있다면. 널 위한 일을 찾아줄 수 있을 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a2654db3-df98-2695-b014-cc74eb9fb44c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:a2654db3-df98-2695-b014-cc74eb9fb44c
msgctxt "h2e18c645gd9d9g4035g9f52gedb421d54a0e"
msgid "No. You're on your own."
msgstr "아니. 네가 알아서 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a37f1512-fdb3-4537-de9b-5dc1fa43acad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:a37f1512-fdb3-4537-de9b-5dc1fa43acad
msgctxt "hf469c59fg8ca8g4088g90c8g203be7d5fe73"
msgid "All right, I'm listening - what's really going on here?"
msgstr "좋아, 듣고 있어. 정확히 뭐가 어떻게 돌아가고 있는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a47b0f54-df06-be98-4846-9aeae5a17299
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:a47b0f54-df06-be98-4846-9aeae5a17299
msgctxt "hbd61c89fg3684g4ed8gb35bgdd0523ec43c5"
msgid "You were in hell? So was I, not long ago."
msgstr "지옥에 있었어? 나도 그랬는데 얼마 전까지 거기 있었는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a562b12b-839d-f933-75b4-2e122fca9c5c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_State_PaladinsPermaDefeated = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:a562b12b-839d-f933-75b4-2e122fca9c5c
msgctxt "h48ffe87dg5ef0g434aga708gdafed7024b53"
msgid "No - not yet."
msgstr "아니. 아직이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = a56c7d41-7594-0970-ab4a-a0ff345bed59
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:a56c7d41-7594-0970-ab4a-a0ff345bed59
msgctxt "hc5cb246bg0a82g47ccgb6b6g7fd523216a8d"
msgid ""
"My advice? Stay away from the city. When I catch up with them, the streets "
"will run red."
msgstr "조언 하나 해줄까? 도시엔 얼씬하지 마. 내가 놈들한테 도착하면, 거리가 피로 물들 거니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a895f610-8d25-2de0-fd8f-1abb22952951
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:a895f610-8d25-2de0-fd8f-1abb22952951
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h3a133be1g5bd9g4cffg88f5g5f65acd00424"
msgid "Stowing away aboard a mind flayer's nautiloid? Pretty stupid."
msgstr "마인드 플레이어의 노틸로이드에 올라타 밀항을? 멍청한 생각이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = abf26a1f-c531-90a0-533b-148268ff2e9c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:abf26a1f-c531-90a0-533b-148268ff2e9c
msgctxt "hc2bdf1bdg3f82g4102gb18dg07bd8c41d5f8"
msgid "It'll turn you into a mind flayer."
msgstr "너를 마인드 플레이어로 변이시키지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ad90016b-893a-7320-a6e0-27a6cc9ebb3a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:ad90016b-893a-7320-a6e0-27a6cc9ebb3a
msgctxt "h6a3bf0e0gdc2eg49c9g82b0g2ed26322f558"
msgid ""
"*As she winces, agony shoots through you, as if your bodies share the same "
"wound.*"
msgstr "*그녀가 몸을 움찔하자, 마치 몸이 상처를 공유하듯 고통이 온몸을 관통합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = ae470996-cd4e-0e98-6a22-3082a5942513
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:ae470996-cd4e-0e98-6a22-3082a5942513
msgctxt "hc2fd3932g99c9g42d0gb338g6eff07a46870"
msgid ""
"The paladins you killed were acting on her orders - she'll send more. And "
"worse."
msgstr "네가 죽인 팔라딘들은 자리엘의 명령을 따르는 놈들이었어. 그녀가 더 많은 놈들을 보내겠지. 더 끔찍한 놈들을 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = aec1e319-716f-7c9e-394e-1a2e83447c28
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Karlach_HasMet = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Karlach_HasMet = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:aec1e319-716f-7c9e-394e-1a2e83447c28
msgctxt "h4cb99766g3914g4346g8a71g6f29c68cda8e"
msgid "Hold up. One more step, and I put a bolt through your eye."
msgstr "멈춰. 한 발자국만 더 움직이면 네 눈깔에 화살을 꽂아주마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = af164092-2a68-a702-a4e8-dd675fc7ee48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:af164092-2a68-a702-a4e8-dd675fc7ee48
msgctxt "h0736d62fgb06cg4cc8g85b8gb9670c5d3b72"
msgid "Maybe I can help - fill me in."
msgstr "어쩌면 내가 도와줄 수 있을 거야. 자세히 알려줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = afb9d56f-9819-4c00-c0e8-7ecfd063e10f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:afb9d56f-9819-4c00-c0e8-7ecfd063e10f
msgctxt "h694d8970g6102g4bdega3b8g65e133a174a2"
msgid "You were expecting the ship?"
msgstr "함선이 올 줄 알고 있었어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b0888b24-f47a-3ab6-d702-a8845f321bc5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Quest_LookingForKarlach = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:b0888b24-f47a-3ab6-d702-a8845f321bc5
msgctxt "h436b8e50gd462g4fb3gb177gc7a644918ac9"
msgid "I'm hunting a fiend - you fit the description."
msgstr "마족을 사냥하고 있는데, 네가 딱 설명에 들어맞는 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = b16e48a5-bc54-7b2f-a5c1-538f448c23cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:b16e48a5-bc54-7b2f-a5c1-538f448c23cb
msgctxt "h2e12b45bg1055g46cega089g492fe4d2a834"
msgid ""
"Now tell me what you just did to me before I make sure you can never do it "
"again."
msgstr "이제 그런 짓을 다시는 하지 못하게 만들어 주기 전에 나한테 무슨 짓을 한 건지 말해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b315e796-da70-4d8f-9ab7-a3e03ebf6f12
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:b315e796-da70-4d8f-9ab7-a3e03ebf6f12
msgctxt "h3809cae3g2ec8g439agb15cgbdf07b88d273"
msgid "Aren't you worried about what the parasite's doing to you?"
msgstr "머릿속에 있는 기생충 걱정은 안 해?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = b37b5a3a-c8ca-0dcf-5760-9e9408c7681d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:b37b5a3a-c8ca-0dcf-5760-9e9408c7681d
msgctxt "h34230b78geee7g4a05g8ca8g83a69db32c99"
msgid ""
"If you bite as hard as you bark, we might just get along. I'm dangerous all "
"right, but I've got no quarrel with you."
msgstr "네가 짖는 만큼 세게 물 수 있다면, 잘 지낼 수 있을 것 같은데. 내가 위험하긴 하지만, 너랑 다툴 일은 없거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b62c26fc-b109-7c55-0791-3aa442a0eff4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:b62c26fc-b109-7c55-0791-3aa442a0eff4
msgctxt "h323cfe17g6761g437bgb585g2787f9247afb"
msgid "They told me you'd slaughtered innocent families."
msgstr "그들이 네가 무고한 가족들을 살해했다고 하던데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = b6945a1e-bb14-6fd5-cdd1-2611e41b453a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:b6945a1e-bb14-6fd5-cdd1-2611e41b453a
msgctxt "hcf5b93acg834bg4a65g9045gd9da871cecef"
msgid "You're lucky I did."
msgstr "내가 그래서 다행인 줄 알아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b6a70509-ccb2-eebf-5059-82e43dd2762f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:b6a70509-ccb2-eebf-5059-82e43dd2762f
msgctxt "h77f5f63eg8424g4874g8c69gd6a5cf95ac28"
msgid "You must have got clear of the crash site in a hurry."
msgstr "추락 지점에서 서둘러 빠져나온 모양이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = b831b06c-b0be-17f2-db44-d58e39845b85
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:b831b06c-b0be-17f2-db44-d58e39845b85
msgctxt "hd3586633g5b71g475cg9ddbg7cc346a94a92"
msgid ""
"Hold on a minute - you were on that ship? With the tentacles, and the worms?"
msgstr "잠깐만, 너도 그 배에 있었어? 촉수랑 벌레들로 가득하던 곳에?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bad95d25-7c02-c40e-5ecd-fa60d87dcd94
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e4aea2c7-1fdf-7a46-740b-06089fa8490d_PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_OfferedRecruit = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:bad95d25-7c02-c40e-5ecd-fa60d87dcd94
msgctxt "h0028ed3eg25efg4e6bga3degea54d5f377ba"
msgid "You should travel with me."
msgstr "나와 함께 가자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bb881cf1-3bb5-a044-3e71-c13dabe1942c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:bb881cf1-3bb5-a044-3e71-c13dabe1942c
msgctxt "hd614f474ge0aeg43a6g8aadg72dea8223324"
msgid "<i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = bbd777ba-b864-5495-ef35-ae53ff20608b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Karlach_HasMet = True
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_State_HelpingKarlach = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:bbd777ba-b864-5495-ef35-ae53ff20608b
msgctxt "hb73bc4b0g7133g4c1dg976fgceeac19363aa"
msgid "Did you get the bastards?"
msgstr "그 자식들 처리했어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bfc6d6b8-68b6-4d38-c57a-daa468ad4b04
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:bfc6d6b8-68b6-4d38-c57a-daa468ad4b04
msgctxt "hebbb255eg93e6g4449g89c3g1d499c6d3958"
msgid "I don't believe a word of this."
msgstr "네 말은 한 마디도 못 믿겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = c2a15341-a7b8-e8ad-88ce-1479bc286e84
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:c2a15341-a7b8-e8ad-88ce-1479bc286e84
msgctxt "h16bc43b3gbeadg42d2gb240g956c91e44f63"
msgid ""
"I'm going from one hell straight into another - home, to Baldur's Gate. I've "
"got a score to settle."
msgstr "한 지옥에서 다른 지옥으로 옮기는 거야. 내 집, 발더스 게이트로. 거기서 해결할 일이 있거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c2b30b15-33b6-f229-d859-d9fd8b77ade6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:c2b30b15-33b6-f229-d859-d9fd8b77ade6
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h5582af77geda9g4ee1g8be2g6c806c28b04b"
msgid "Why are you so important to them?"
msgstr "왜 그렇게 필사적으로 당신을 찾는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = c367a03f-c933-580f-0ab4-f259db8e9f2a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:c367a03f-c933-580f-0ab4-f259db8e9f2a
msgctxt "h9986e73ag1d24g4346g8a8fg0e721dfffbb7"
msgid ""
"That's what I thought - it was something <i>inside</i> you. I felt it. One "
"of those godsdamned worms, from the ship."
msgstr "내가 생각한 거랑 같네. 네 안에 있는 것 때문이야. 느껴졌어. 그 함선에 있었던 망할 벌레인 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c3d7ce8e-d260-c28a-0672-36a6a1939a75
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Knows_CultistSoulDebt = True
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Knows_RefugeesAreCultists = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:c3d7ce8e-d260-c28a-0672-36a6a1939a75
msgctxt "h1aa3a2fegec55g4a5dga8ebgba099d13ca77"
msgid "I know - and I can save their souls by killing you."
msgstr "나도 알아, 그리고 널 죽여서 그들의 영혼을 구할 수 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = c44b65d9-034d-dc9d-06e1-5231b08066ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:c44b65d9-034d-dc9d-06e1-5231b08066ba
msgctxt "hf6de66a0g3e57g4581g8ec7g45d591fcf533"
msgid "Really? You're serious?"
msgstr "정말? 진심이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = c561e6b5-f4bd-392a-4649-5034a51690e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:c561e6b5-f4bd-392a-4649-5034a51690e7
msgctxt "h13b46904g7361g4049g848egfb12885ddce9"
msgid "I'm having a <i>very</i> bad day."
msgstr "<i>아주</i> 힘든 하루를 보내고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = c64829b4-13c5-35d8-229c-07f40d6b2b9a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:c64829b4-13c5-35d8-229c-07f40d6b2b9a
msgctxt "h21faf88ag27b2g4998g9194gbc62cf1db602"
msgid ""
"Doesn't seem to have turned <i>you</i> into a mind flayer, unless you've "
"tucked your tentacles down your throat."
msgstr "아직 <i>널</i> 마인드 플레이어로 바꿔버린 것 같진 않은데, 네가 촉수들을 목구멍 속에 숨겨둔 게 아니라면 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = c6af82b1-8355-08c3-3876-1f1dc72c099e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:c6af82b1-8355-08c3-3876-1f1dc72c099e
msgctxt "h88631626g3b0dg4b93ga793g3408def58775"
msgid "I'll start worrying when it gives me a reason to."
msgstr "그럴 이유가 생기면 그때 가서 걱정할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cba5a7df-d37a-50b7-302c-8d5b085e2268
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:cba5a7df-d37a-50b7-302c-8d5b085e2268
msgctxt "h4bf8c641gfcacg45b3g8009g1728e7b31302"
msgid "And they need <i>you</i> dead - I'm ending you."
msgstr "그리고 그들이 <i>네가</i> 죽기를 원해. 내 손에 죽어줘야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce0591e6-270b-c68f-78a8-9d2c8bd3de9a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:ce0591e6-270b-c68f-78a8-9d2c8bd3de9a
msgctxt "he9ae2c8bg4353g4bc2g9b45gadedb63eeec6"
msgid "Who are you looking for in the city?"
msgstr "도시에서 누굴 찾는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cfa57a5a-042e-c575-89a9-99714ed03d61
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:cfa57a5a-042e-c575-89a9-99714ed03d61
msgctxt "h127aec78ge5c5g4343ga2efg44398daf3a45"
msgid "I didn't see you aboard. Where were you?"
msgstr "널 본 적은 없는데, 어디 있었어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = d01e76ab-2273-34e0-7e02-d879bcbcbb85
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:d01e76ab-2273-34e0-7e02-d879bcbcbb85
msgctxt "h223e2773g47ebg459cgae61g55d900b78ce3"
msgid "I don't belong in hell any more than you do. But I was there."
msgstr "나도 너만큼 지옥이랑 어떤 연관도 없어. 하지만 그곳에 있었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = d34b920c-72cb-d0e0-7e8c-c5d56ae4f6fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:d34b920c-72cb-d0e0-7e8c-c5d56ae4f6fd
msgctxt "h8f95bc20g11f4g465bga885g1ae2081fb528"
msgid ""
"My advice? Stay away from the city. When I catch up with the fuckers who did "
"this to me, the streets will run red."
msgstr "충고 하나 해줄까? 도시엔 가까이 가지 마. 내게 이런 짓을 한 씨발놈들을 찾으면, 거리가 피로 물들 거니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = d400440e-7ad9-daa0-9eb8-cf0297216722
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:d400440e-7ad9-daa0-9eb8-cf0297216722
msgctxt "h7aabdd07g38a8g47dfg8026g11d195333817"
msgid "That was one of my good days - the bad ones would knock you sick."
msgstr "그건 내게 좋은 날이었어. 나쁜 날에 대해 들으면 기절할걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d5dbeba9-0074-7925-cb3f-d4892894ead0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:d5dbeba9-0074-7925-cb3f-d4892894ead0
msgctxt "he647ea7fga321g45e0ga9a5g94c9531fb2c0"
msgid "Hold up - you fought in the Blood War?"
msgstr "잠깐만. 피의 전쟁에 참전했었던 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dbe7adb7-c8e0-f46f-f4fa-d7f71dd8db86
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:dbe7adb7-c8e0-f46f-f4fa-d7f71dd8db86
msgctxt "hf70e3b25g8294g4d03gab7agc49dbf7224f3"
msgid ""
"Hard to believe you're a demon-slayer when you can't deal with a few "
"cultists."
msgstr "광신도 몇 명도 감당하지 못하면서 데몬 슬레이어라니, 믿기 힘든데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = de196fd4-702c-af08-7afb-9533b94e08c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:de196fd4-702c-af08-7afb-9533b94e08c0
msgctxt "hd33db864g417ag4a0fgbaecg545ca63fc731"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = df41cfd6-4fb3-97c4-7cb5-1c1dfa9a3b50
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:df41cfd6-4fb3-97c4-7cb5-1c1dfa9a3b50
msgctxt "h3a9e7330g06f2g4f57g99dfg2bd30a2501cd"
msgid "No - I just saw a chance and I took it."
msgstr "아니. 그저 기회를 발견하고 붙잡은 것뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dffac15d-ea08-131a-9940-595baa2afc4a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Quest_LookingForKarlach = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - BERSERKER(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:dffac15d-ea08-131a-9940-595baa2afc4a
msgctxt "h9b01a861g2fe2g47e2g8e63gc4093ba3beff"
msgid "<b><i>ROAR.</i></b>"
msgstr "<b><i>크아아.</i></b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e04e9059-e894-2cfa-15e7-16f02e522e67
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Quest_LookingForKarlach = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:e04e9059-e894-2cfa-15e7-16f02e522e67
msgctxt "hd9a4dd9fg2615g46bagb272g090679f9b6e7"
msgid "If you're not a fiend, what are you?"
msgstr "네가 마족이 아니라면, 넌 뭐야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = e4fa364e-1306-389b-fe61-ef57f7a8e2de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:e4fa364e-1306-389b-fe61-ef57f7a8e2de
msgctxt "h600213a4g3500g4748ga3e6g76f5a8ede421"
msgid "Somebody fed you a crock of shit, and you swallowed the lot."
msgstr "누군가 네게 똥을 먹였고, 넌 그걸 삼킨 거지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = e5724bef-6538-eade-ecae-b1105b3a7849
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:e5724bef-6538-eade-ecae-b1105b3a7849
msgctxt "h73d91c0cg9508g42bcg99d9g59076922a62c"
msgid "Yeah - with distinction."
msgstr "그래. 아주 활약했지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e5d8ddb9-8a6d-7edd-8730-7592ded4bd4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - e4aea2c7-1fdf-7a46-740b-06089fa8490d_PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_OfferedRecruit = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:e5d8ddb9-8a6d-7edd-8730-7592ded4bd4f
msgctxt "h77f18561g7c1dg4d92gb451g521600ffed36"
msgid "My offer still stands - let's travel together."
msgstr "내 제안은 아직 유효해. 함께 가자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = e7e8c821-a003-73b6-5edd-b2c3eee66363
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:e7e8c821-a003-73b6-5edd-b2c3eee66363
msgctxt "h2e65bb01gb20ag42d1g9889g9d8172b1893f"
msgid "<i>Fuck</i> yes."
msgstr "<i>씨발</i>, 좋았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = e865523b-d464-df6e-1608-433d749134bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:e865523b-d464-df6e-1608-433d749134bf
msgctxt "h38882e53g607fg4328g8f08g754bd4457e5b"
msgid "For now. But... thank you."
msgstr "당장은 말이지. 하지만... 고마워."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = eaf56e92-4047-757a-88ac-b065617b6b58
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:eaf56e92-4047-757a-88ac-b065617b6b58
msgctxt "h3c632e87gdf4dg4f23gaebeg8706462d3f6b"
msgid "Tell me what you're doing here. Now."
msgstr "여기서 뭘 하고 있었던 건지 털어놔. 당장."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eb0d681c-b5f4-68fc-5d3b-43ce00ae0dac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Quest_LookingForKarlach = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - BERSERKER(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:eb0d681c-b5f4-68fc-5d3b-43ce00ae0dac
msgctxt "h289bb150g13b1g4016gb0e6gcd14f3d78322"
msgid "HERE TO KILL YOU. <b>SLOWLY</b>."
msgstr "<b>널 죽이러 왔다. 천천히</b>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ecf421fc-924a-0f28-3511-973dd1d8e10a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:ecf421fc-924a-0f28-3511-973dd1d8e10a
msgctxt "h2c05d151gc570g45begb196g45cc8c85201f"
msgid ""
"*The Blood War. <i>You</i> saw it from above as the nautiloid passed through "
"Avernus - this woman was on the frontline.*"
msgstr ""
"*피의 전쟁입니다. 노틸로이드를 타고 아베르누스 위를 지나면서 봤던 <i>그것</i>입니다. 이 여성은 최전선에 서 있었습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ef1e3030-1f74-0f91-20a2-8c97035fefb5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_TIEFLING(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:ef1e3030-1f74-0f91-20a2-8c97035fefb5
msgctxt "h35d53c14g1094g4286gaadag542d3b0557bc"
msgid "Who was that? In your memory?"
msgstr "누구였어? 네 기억 속에 그녀 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ef8c22b9-33a8-d416-5093-4695222e4e18
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:ef8c22b9-33a8-d416-5093-4695222e4e18
msgctxt "ha7a7dbe5g75d7g4586gb3dcge6ca59954938"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f1a053bd-0765-f115-c05e-94b780e059e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:f1a053bd-0765-f115-c05e-94b780e059e8
msgctxt "ha5eab1a3g454cg4eb7g9b5fg3ca867b2d425"
msgid "I'll look into it."
msgstr "한 번 시도해 볼게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f2461319-1569-830c-94f1-d36ea98c9182
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:f2461319-1569-830c-94f1-d36ea98c9182
msgctxt "hdc5b487bg553bg43eag9b56g75aee87627e3"
msgid "What will you do now?"
msgstr "이제 뭘 할 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = f5d2e4f8-2a51-1071-2a77-2191025ec4a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Annoyed = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:f5d2e4f8-2a51-1071-2a77-2191025ec4a4
msgctxt "h98c4a040g000cg4b43gbb30g9e4937f691e9"
msgid "Piss off, or show me what you're made of."
msgstr "꺼져, 아니면 네 내장을 구경하게 될 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f75806cf-039e-d9d4-988f-f106cbe11d24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:f75806cf-039e-d9d4-988f-f106cbe11d24
msgctxt "h1d7a2a49g2e19g4ec8ga8bfg1111b1290487"
msgid "No, but I see you're hurt - let me help."
msgstr "아니, 근데 많이 다친 거 같네. 내가 도와줄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = f7b93ac8-be6d-2aca-4bed-74ffb4874d6f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:f7b93ac8-be6d-2aca-4bed-74ffb4874d6f
msgctxt "hf64925b5gf551g49dbg83b7gd7f198bfa9c1"
msgid "Bullshit. I've never killed anyone who didn't deserve it."
msgstr "개소리. 난 죽어도 싼 놈들밖에 죽인 적 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = faaf98aa-3e23-dacc-8242-1c7bbba92d4e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:faaf98aa-3e23-dacc-8242-1c7bbba92d4e
msgctxt "hcc74c5dagf594g4fe4gb1dcg12e5204538e5"
msgid "If you killed them, I'm guessing you didn't buy their bullshit."
msgstr "그들을 죽여버렸다면, 놈들의 개소리를 믿지 않았나 보네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fb2390f4-d1f9-777f-3d2f-dbbf71650374
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Quest_LookingForKarlach = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:fb2390f4-d1f9-777f-3d2f-dbbf71650374
msgctxt "h3c34c00fg5d4ag48c5g9bc2g66cc01649ab9"
msgid "I'm taking your head."
msgstr "네 목을 가져가겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fc52beb9-6eb2-70c4-cda8-29727f5470cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:fc52beb9-6eb2-70c4-cda8-29727f5470cd
msgctxt "h78663a7dg6950g4d29g941ag657a0be721fd"
msgid "I'll take them down."
msgstr "그들을 처리하겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fc5fd7fb-b4d8-647a-b2c5-8f21aa25d57b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Quest_LookingForKarlach = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:fc5fd7fb-b4d8-647a-b2c5-8f21aa25d57b
msgctxt "hf4a88d6cgb867g4d42gb6cfg97ff136c14de"
msgid "I decided to help them instead. I'm taking your head."
msgstr "대신 그 자들을 돕기로 했어. 네 목을 가져가겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fd7e0c03-302e-2b70-fa1d-2bab298e6d79
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:fd7e0c03-302e-2b70-fa1d-2bab298e6d79
msgctxt "h8851016cg89ddg4557gb9adg5e76c822da83"
msgid "Not many people survive an archdevil's fury."
msgstr "아크데빌의 분노에서 살아남는 사람들은 많지 않은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = fd839793-85b2-e3fe-b434-0381a37a7424
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:fd839793-85b2-e3fe-b434-0381a37a7424
msgctxt "ha3a02cf8g3cdcg42a4g92ecg2f112c8f6f3a"
msgid ""
"But if you do cut me down - I'll see you in the Hells one day and return the "
"favour. Count on it."
msgstr "지금 날 죽이더라도, 언젠가 지옥에서 다시 만나게 될 거야. 내가 호의를 돌려줄테니 기대하라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = fd9bf218-44b4-b141-6ee6-3c2e63327570
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:fd9bf218-44b4-b141-6ee6-3c2e63327570
msgctxt "h387c416fg69b4g436bgabd9g2985ee25e4e6"
msgid ""
"And you believe them? Those bastards are trying to feed you a crock of shit."
msgstr "그래서 그 말을 믿겠다? 그 개새끼들이 네게 똥을 쳐먹이고 있는 거라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = ff1f49c6-1832-c94f-0ea1-931a140c3e42
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach:ff1f49c6-1832-c94f-0ea1-931a140c3e42
msgctxt "h53dfada4g5b32g45fcgaa58g691afdaa334d"
msgid "Cute. I've scraped more frightening things than you off my boot."
msgstr "귀엽네. 너보다 끔찍한 놈들도 결국 내 부츠 아래에 깔려 뒤졌지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 0073cbdd-2e89-9e4d-d1e7-906c71906366
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:0073cbdd-2e89-9e4d-d1e7-906c71906366
msgctxt "h61797ab1ga4fcg44d7g8d25g38010074d52e"
msgid "Let me guess: baby-eater, devil-worshipper?"
msgstr "내가 맞혀 볼까? 아기 포식자? 데빌 숭배자?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 00918762-5776-3666-6ab3-4e785155b004
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:00918762-5776-3666-6ab3-4e785155b004
msgctxt "h88c189cegda3eg499bg8fc5g658456bc0a64"
msgid "Hang on - I said I'd help you, not team up with you long-term."
msgstr "잠깐. 난 도와주겠다고만 했지, 쭉 함께하자고 한 건 아니라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 01f761eb-259e-ae07-9a9d-8f37859c39c1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:01f761eb-259e-ae07-9a9d-8f37859c39c1
msgctxt "he2527e7cg8ea4g44degbf3ageae061c9e6b7"
msgid ""
"Zariel's sent goon after goon to hunt me down, but believe me when I tell "
"you I'm not going."
msgstr "자리엘이 나 잡겠다고 따까리 줄창 보내고 있긴 한데, 장담컨대 내가 거기 돌아갈 일은 절대 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 02af472e-1b4e-faa7-47f0-c6602230c76a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:02af472e-1b4e-faa7-47f0-c6602230c76a
msgctxt "hbaaba095gf416g4c53ga995g665217478c28"
msgid "If you value your life, you'll stand down."
msgstr "목숨이 아깝다면 그만하는 편이 좋을 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 036dcdbe-6512-27f1-c115-08e2d314a74b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:036dcdbe-6512-27f1-c115-08e2d314a74b
msgctxt "hed46f51ag0bf6g4569g92a8g1dc660e01eb0"
msgid ""
"You - did? That's amazing. Join up with me; let me do you a favour in return."
msgstr "그랬... 다고? 거 대단한걸. 나랑 같이 다니자. 내가 보답을 하게 해줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 03897116-56df-25a6-a5af-098fd5542934
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Karlach_Quest_AgreedToHelpNotRecruited = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:03897116-56df-25a6-a5af-098fd5542934
msgctxt "h2bd9d0cfg6739g460bgaec8g2bc04723be6b"
msgid ""
"Why don't you clear things with your leader before we team up. Send 'em my "
"way so we can work out the particulars."
msgstr "일단 한 팀 되기 전에 너희 리더 결론 받는 게 어때? 세부적인 거 얘기하게 내 쪽으로 보내달라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 03aaf7cd-2fa1-c198-bdd9-522752b042aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Quest_AcceptedSearch = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:03aaf7cd-2fa1-c198-bdd9-522752b042aa
msgctxt "h8d5b13acg79abg4841g9dc1gd13c1c71f967"
msgid "I'm here to take your head."
msgstr "난 네 머리를 따러 온 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 04d33b8c-51c2-1680-b9da-c51cb84327b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:04d33b8c-51c2-1680-b9da-c51cb84327b7
msgctxt "h6daa91b2g6378g4b88gae84ge226af3555c4"
msgid "If you can lead the way, I'll gladly follow."
msgstr "그 사람한테 안내해주면, 기꺼이 따라갈게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 05c8f7ad-dd93-6dc2-d304-4cd6bd181b39
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:05c8f7ad-dd93-6dc2-d304-4cd6bd181b39
msgctxt "h7ce1798fgea5bg4160gb1eagfe88b0fa4345"
msgid ""
"Dirty work's the only kind I like. Gets even messier the more bodies you "
"throw at it. Think of the potential."
msgstr "나도 지저분한 일 얼마든지 해줄 테니까. 네가 덤비는 놈이 많을 수록 일은 더 지저분해지지. 내 잠재력을 생각해보라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 06cb2e8b-e101-85d8-d414-b2ad22dacc12
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:06cb2e8b-e101-85d8-d414-b2ad22dacc12
msgctxt "hcb475b59gf5fdg4d3eg99f2g6489ba543c89"
msgid "Nevertheless, I'm taking your head."
msgstr "뭐가 어떻든, 난 네 머리를 가져가야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 06dbd9a8-3c91-0778-f354-74356bc42d84
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_State_KarlachKiller(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Karlach_HasMet = False
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Event_KarlachDied = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Event_KarlachDied = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:06dbd9a8-3c91-0778-f354-74356bc42d84
msgctxt "h645bcefbgb243g46e8g91c2g31cc38a42f9b"
msgid ""
"Please tell me you come in peace. Last fucker who came through here properly "
"blew out my candles."
msgstr "제발 좋은 의도로 왔다고 해줘. 저번에 왔던 어떤 새끼는 내 명줄을 제대로 끊어놨거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 07da0599-2c9a-eb7c-6a48-103cd58a12ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:07da0599-2c9a-eb7c-6a48-103cd58a12ba
msgctxt "h6d00c7a0g1e52g45b2g9a5dgd5614b4af22d"
msgid ""
"If there's one thing Zariel taught me, it's not to fuck with the top dog "
"until it's absolutely necessary."
msgstr "자리엘한테 배운 게 하나 있다면, 그건 꼭 필요한 경우가 아닌 한 두목 심기는 거스르면 안 된다는 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0819b43f-1f40-077a-a049-1036c4dd2870
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Quest_AcceptedSearch = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:0819b43f-1f40-077a-a049-1036c4dd2870
msgctxt "h05c0e96eg0aecg4cd4g86e9gd4df0c7b9871"
msgid "Devil! Face me!"
msgstr "이 데빌아! 덤벼라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 0857cf20-03c7-6c12-c3c2-4e9d90bce65b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:0857cf20-03c7-6c12-c3c2-4e9d90bce65b
msgctxt "h6eb8d32eg6a63g4612ga009g34cc83991b99"
msgid ""
"The last person you're ever going to meet. Karlach's my name. I've got a "
"knack for killing demons and devils, and I think I found my next target."
msgstr ""
"난 네가 죽기 전 마지막으로 볼 사람이시다. 이름은 칼라크고. 내가 데몬이랑 데빌 죽이는 데 한 솜씨 하는데, 아무래도 다음 사냥감을 "
"찾은 것 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 08d6f434-ab4b-8b8b-4fdb-5b527b6c32ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:08d6f434-ab4b-8b8b-4fdb-5b527b6c32ff
msgctxt "h4834e3e8g8f0ag4a15gb439ga60e8a6236f7"
msgid ""
"Dirty work's the only kind I like. But there are a lot of them and just the "
"one of me. I'll take point, and you flank 'em."
msgstr ""
"내가 지저분한 일 꺼려서 그러는 건 아니야. 다만 놈들은 다수인데 난 고작 한 명이거든. 앞장은 내가 설 테니까 넌 측면을 맡아주면 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 0a6532d2-4600-e923-f8de-c224c02b2f3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:0a6532d2-4600-e923-f8de-c224c02b2f3b
msgctxt "h5f72afa3g7341g4784g9e2cge80dcbc26b91"
msgid ""
"Well met, soldier. Now that we're old pals, how would you feel about helping "
"me kill some evil bastards?"
msgstr "반가워, 신참. 이제 찐친이 된 셈인데, 내가 어떤 사악한 놈들 해치우는 것 좀 도와보는 건 어때?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0c033db7-9752-dfe4-fa7f-e6f58f769f26
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_State_PaladinsPermaDefeated = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Quest_ToldKarlach = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:0c033db7-9752-dfe4-fa7f-e6f58f769f26
msgctxt "h0ddf0d8dg79f5g4dceg99cbg3feb5636e46d"
msgid ""
"I have good news for you. I already killed the paladins you say were hunting "
"you."
msgstr "네게 좋은 소식을 전해야겠군. 널 쫓고 있다는 그 팔라딘들은 내가 이미 해치웠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 0c7117e5-091b-2add-9b46-4cb3180275eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Event_KarlachHostile = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:0c7117e5-091b-2add-9b46-4cb3180275eb
msgctxt "h7f45cebbg1807g4257ga132g2da4c8422059"
msgid ""
"Too bad. I thought maybe you could be a friend. I could've done with one of "
"those."
msgstr "안타깝네. 어쩌면 친구가 될 수 있을 줄 알았는데. 그런 게 하나라도 간절한데 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 0ec5a217-2fb7-b0da-6156-6b9b586f5b4d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:0ec5a217-2fb7-b0da-6156-6b9b586f5b4d
msgctxt "h909fcb52gdae9g426ag832ag22819a783c89"
msgid ""
"Sounds like a good lead. Hopefully, our guy will be among them. A tune-up "
"would do this old tub a world of good."
msgstr "좋은 단서처럼 들리네. 부디 그중에 찾는 사람이 있으면 좋겠는걸. 정비 한 번 받고 나면 내 낡은 깡통이 쌩쌩해질 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0fce27b2-4fa5-158b-2bf9-d8e12bdb506d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:0fce27b2-4fa5-158b-2bf9-d8e12bdb506d
msgctxt "hf41b5bb6g3d8bg4bb1gb001g6d7ff4f18c1d"
msgid "*A great heat roars through you; <i>her </i>heat, fiery as the Hells.*"
msgstr "*엄청난 열기가 당신을 휩씁니다. 지옥처럼 맹렬한 <i>그녀의 </i>열기로 말이죠.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 10040d6a-3fb3-9482-6824-fdf893c768db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:10040d6a-3fb3-9482-6824-fdf893c768db
msgctxt "hb4e18970gc41dg4bb4g875fg6a6046af7473"
msgid "<i>Try to douse the flames.</i>"
msgstr "<i>불을 끄려고 해본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 1304a9f5-de05-c963-f19b-83e7573923b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:1304a9f5-de05-c963-f19b-83e7573923b5
msgctxt "hb79a3df7g06ebg45c1g8d6eg2f80377e2234"
msgid "I'm in the process of teaching them a lesson about -"
msgstr "나는 그 새끼들한테 교훈을 주는 도중이었 -"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1360e20a-70d1-ed9a-cd4d-89de6f50d6da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:1360e20a-70d1-ed9a-cd4d-89de6f50d6da
msgctxt "he68f6f24g06c5g4154ga0c3g26d2e30b536c"
msgid "Are you all right?"
msgstr "너 괜찮은 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1370cb18-13ce-2160-5e35-77d40959d97d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:1370cb18-13ce-2160-5e35-77d40959d97d
msgctxt "h7cff5b6cg4fabg4355gb102gbf5c912bff93"
msgid "So you want me to kill the people hunting you?"
msgstr "그러니까 나더러 널 쫓는 자들을 죽여달란 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 1457c187-4a1b-1d6b-cd18-ed533383ddff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:1457c187-4a1b-1d6b-cd18-ed533383ddff
msgctxt "he1ac9c39g2823g455egb9dbg368269d12429"
msgid ""
"Maybe it'll help if we start with a little fun. How'd you like to help me "
"kill some evil bastards?"
msgstr "같이 재미 좀 보면 마음 바뀌지 않을까 싶은데. 내가 어떤 사악한 놈들 없애는 거 도와보는 건 어때?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 161d7ac3-55cd-5cc7-23e1-b4131142ffb0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_State_DammonUnavailable = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - ORI_Karlach_HasMet_DammonUnavailable(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Karlach_HasMet = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:161d7ac3-55cd-5cc7-23e1-b4131142ffb0
msgctxt "hd7266988gcd8dg46d6g8a00g9fd9ade60722"
msgid "There you are. Good."
msgstr "제 발로 왔군. 좋아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 17f17e33-8ea4-8e3c-52a2-d81b6aaa62db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:17f17e33-8ea4-8e3c-52a2-d81b6aaa62db
msgctxt "h8a9cfb13gc7b9g46c5g80ccgb6034e78084f"
msgid "Gods, is he <i>still </i>on my tail? I'm embarrassed for him."
msgstr "맙소사, 그놈 <i>아직도 </i>날 쫓고 있다고? 이거 안쓰러울 지경이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1a4a4b79-3967-42ce-3b70-97fb606c82f3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Quest_AcceptedSearch = False
#.   Local:
#.      - 30d68d9c-ff84-a27c-92d0-f8ac4d840553_AskedDevil = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:1a4a4b79-3967-42ce-3b70-97fb606c82f3
msgctxt "he97d562fg6f4bg411egb3e0gc2656f3eed97"
msgid "You're a devil then. A soldier in the Blood War."
msgstr "넌 데빌이로군. 피의 전쟁에서 싸운 군인이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 1bf7254c-9087-f063-69f3-cfff0a53433a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_State_KarlachKiller(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Karlach_HasMet = True
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Event_KarlachDied = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Event_KarlachDied = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:1bf7254c-9087-f063-69f3-cfff0a53433a
msgctxt "hd7f1d493gb418g418cgb6f8g56d8fcb65db6"
msgid ""
"Thank the gods for you. I thought I was done there. You did me a big favour. "
"I won't forget it."
msgstr "살려줘서 고마워. 이대로 끝장인줄 알았어. 엄청난 은혜를 입었네. 잊지 않을게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 1d1aa520-52e5-75e4-c0bd-0029df7d5bd7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:1d1aa520-52e5-75e4-c0bd-0029df7d5bd7
msgctxt "hd2db6a1cg3165g4fd6gb13ag6a3e21685894"
msgid "For now."
msgstr "지금은 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 209a3fbb-e861-597d-4fa8-4a1dc2c474cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Karlach_HasMet = True
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_RefusedToHelp = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:209a3fbb-e861-597d-4fa8-4a1dc2c474cc
msgctxt "h67d0bce0g2f62g4db9g8361g0ab83fa936fd"
msgid "Changed your mind about teaming up?"
msgstr "나랑 팀 짜기로 생각 바뀐 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 20aecdb5-6ec9-07d1-11af-d7d42b2d60b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:20aecdb5-6ec9-07d1-11af-d7d42b2d60b5
msgctxt "habc4dce5g46a7g4a0fgadc5ge6c3b34237e4"
msgid "What'll happen if you don't get tuned up?"
msgstr "정비를 못 받으면 어떻게 되는데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2132cb28-2588-73a9-4d7b-642896bfeeb3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_TIEFLING(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:2132cb28-2588-73a9-4d7b-642896bfeeb3
msgctxt "hc2d40544g2b0eg4087gb65fg8ccc3e3eb7e6"
msgid "I'd know that stink anywhere. You've come from the Hells."
msgstr "저 악취는 어디서든 알아챌 수 있지. 넌 지옥에서 왔군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2306079a-22da-69eb-9544-09798b2ec3f8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:2306079a-22da-69eb-9544-09798b2ec3f8
msgctxt "hae5090dbgcef8g4f3bg945egae5316fb0099"
msgid "I have my own problems. I don't need yours."
msgstr "내 문제 해결하기도 바빠. 네 문제까지 신경 쓸 순 없다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 231710d7-8301-88c8-fd74-3e0445dd1717
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Karlach_Event_StopBurning = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:231710d7-8301-88c8-fd74-3e0445dd1717
msgctxt "hc8f7fc5bgf0a8g498eg913eg47d8355481b9"
msgid ""
"Well fuck <i>me</i>. It's you. From the nautiloid. <i>Please </i>tell me I "
"found you before those so-called paladins of Tyr did."
msgstr ""
"이런 <i>씹</i>. 너구나. 노틸로이드에서 봤던. <i>제발 </i> 그 티르의 팔라딘이란 놈들 아직 만난 적 없다고 얘기해줄래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 246f1472-9c24-fa89-9be3-e4b2c2c9bf8e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_State_KarlachKnockout(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Karlach_HasMet = False
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_State_KarlachKnockedOut = True
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Event_KarlachDied = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_State_KarlachKnockedOut = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:246f1472-9c24-fa89-9be3-e4b2c2c9bf8e
msgctxt "ha5b231bdg1f68g4cdag9debgc9905b9d1c61"
msgid "<i>Please </i>tell me you come in peace."
msgstr "<i>제발 </i>좋은 의도로 왔다고 해줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 25b3d517-8c4a-dd77-60a8-0a4059a79001
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Event_KarlachHostile = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:25b3d517-8c4a-dd77-60a8-0a4059a79001
msgctxt "hac99e4a1g6a8cg4237g8371gaa8182ca502e"
msgid ""
"It almost isn't fair, striking down a lunatic. But for someone as dangerous "
"as you, I'll make an exception."
msgstr "정신병자를 쳐야 하다니, 내가 나쁜 쪽 된 느낌이네. 하지만 너처럼 위험한 녀석은 예외로 둘 수밖에 없겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 285f8bb5-0d5e-5e22-3899-f10cb8efa766
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Quest_AcceptedSearch = False
#.   Local:
#.      - 30d68d9c-ff84-a27c-92d0-f8ac4d840553_AskedDevil = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:285f8bb5-0d5e-5e22-3899-f10cb8efa766
msgctxt "hd5d3a92fg580dg40d7g8b58g5ad6542f8ffa"
msgid "You <i>are </i>a devil then. A soldier in the Blood War."
msgstr "넌 <i>데빌</i>이로군. 피의 전쟁에서 싸운 군인이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 29f327f3-c8db-d0a8-5350-bba8eeecfdfa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:29f327f3-c8db-d0a8-5350-bba8eeecfdfa
msgctxt "hf1c0072cg912eg4f8bg8b9dgc107ede64e09"
msgid "<i>These are no natural flames - prepare to fight.</i>"
msgstr "<i>저건 자연스러운 불꽃이 아니다. 전투를 준비한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2a5fc1bd-eaa0-e218-ce3c-6d48c443d5b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_State_PersuasionSucceeded = False
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_State_PartyPermadefeatedDammon = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:2a5fc1bd-eaa0-e218-ce3c-6d48c443d5b5
msgctxt "h5213350dg9266g4c9cgb73fg96a693305bd9"
msgid ""
"Listen, you've got the wrong idea about me. I didn't have anything to do "
"with what happened to those people."
msgstr "넌 날 오해하고 있어. 그 사람들한테 생긴 일은 나랑 아무 관련 없다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2bef5903-7dc8-d4b4-fb05-fb20770bf96f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:2bef5903-7dc8-d4b4-fb05-fb20770bf96f
msgctxt "hb534b3acg02a2g4df4g8853gcb3aad622605"
msgid "How the hells did you get an infernal engine for a heart?"
msgstr "도대체 어쩌다 지옥불 엔진을 심장에다 박은 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 2dca646e-4f05-f33b-0c11-07c85652e36d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:2dca646e-4f05-f33b-0c11-07c85652e36d
msgctxt "hd3b5368bg0f55g46e2g833cg960484c596d9"
msgid ""
"<i>Really </i>now? First I catch a ride out of Avernus, then I stumble into "
"a friend. Who's the goddess of luck again? I owe her a flower."
msgstr ""
"이야, <i>진짜로 </i>? 처음엔 아베르누스에서 벗어날 기회를 딱 잡았고, 이젠 친구가 우연히 나타났네. 행운의 여신이 누구였더라? "
"꽃 한 송이 바쳐야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 2ec69a0d-a427-58af-fd43-36dec8faeec1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:2ec69a0d-a427-58af-fd43-36dec8faeec1
msgctxt "h2296cfc4g580cg463dg8364g7107c1ae03e2"
msgid "What's your name?"
msgstr "넌 이름이 뭐야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 30937a00-6879-dc46-647e-74413fdea7f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:30937a00-6879-dc46-647e-74413fdea7f5
msgctxt "h61098e16g6d37g4a0agb201gf7639dfe1980"
msgid "Seems like you have a lot of enemies."
msgstr "적이 참 많은 모양이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 320830b2-eee6-dbe2-d9d5-c81201772b73
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:320830b2-eee6-dbe2-d9d5-c81201772b73
msgctxt "hf55b5e77g788ag4b26gac5fgf8876e62f6cb"
msgid "What was <i>that?!</i>"
msgstr "방금 그건 <i>뭐야?!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3bb9bb59-b12e-8481-3c4d-e80203f25fbd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:3bb9bb59-b12e-8481-3c4d-e80203f25fbd
msgctxt "hf4ee99bfg0b15g41a3g81c1gd4c54266a559"
msgid ""
"The memory of their curdling cries has been a balm to my blistered mind."
msgstr "놈들의 섬뜩한 비명을 들으니 내 부르튼 마음이 아무는 기분이더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 3ce19331-5611-d718-54a6-bbdf7ec29a57
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:3ce19331-5611-d718-54a6-bbdf7ec29a57
msgctxt "hceba3faag9075g46efg965egb01f4c7e7dac"
msgid ""
"A weaponsmith, huh? Not sure if he's the guy, but I'd love to find out. A "
"tune-up would do this rusty heart a world of good."
msgstr "무기장이라? 확신은 잘 안 서긴 해도, 한 번 찾아가보고 싶은걸. 정비 한 번 받을 수만 있다면 내 고물 심장이 쌩쌩해질 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3ce88dc6-081a-b29c-20e7-2a437b89ac4c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:3ce88dc6-081a-b29c-20e7-2a437b89ac4c
msgctxt "h53d068d0gcf2bg46dbgb58fg43dc2070e122"
msgid "All right. Let's team up."
msgstr "좋아. 한 팀이 되어보자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3e76c8a1-79dc-3556-8d11-ce89a095fe86
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:3e76c8a1-79dc-3556-8d11-ce89a095fe86
msgctxt "hba3f89e9g374dg4c39gada2gbcc276d8c6c3"
msgid "Why should I do your dirty work?"
msgstr "왜 내가 널 위해 지저분한 일을 해야 하는데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 3f01046e-3b62-cd61-5f1f-e8b22bf4c864
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:3f01046e-3b62-cd61-5f1f-e8b22bf4c864
msgctxt "h73210e5ag7c95g46ecg89f5g46d125bb46ba"
msgid ""
"The Blood War. But brother, believe me when I tell you the fighting wasn't "
"even the worst part."
msgstr "피의 전쟁이지. 근데 말이야 친구, 싸움질은 그 전쟁에서 최악조차 아니었다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 3f01046e-3b62-cd61-5f1f-e8b22bf4c864
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:3f01046e-3b62-cd61-5f1f-e8b22bf4c864
msgctxt "hc5c0bce7g0055g4b59gad3bg90e2f92e47ac"
msgid ""
"The Blood War. But sister, believe me when I tell you that the fighting "
"wasn't even the worst part."
msgstr "피의 전쟁이지. 근데 말이야 친구, 싸움질은 그 전쟁에서 최악조차 아니었다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 3f01046e-3b62-cd61-5f1f-e8b22bf4c864
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:3f01046e-3b62-cd61-5f1f-e8b22bf4c864
msgctxt "h4403087dg0b6cg4d8egb16fg674675428b6b"
msgid ""
"The Blood War. But believe me, my friend, the fighting wasn't even the worst "
"part."
msgstr "피의 전쟁이지. 근데 말이야 친구, 싸움질은 그 전쟁에서 최악조차 아니었다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 40631545-0ce3-6ab3-aa7e-f0927fb764e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:40631545-0ce3-6ab3-aa7e-f0927fb764e7
msgctxt "h19775c5bg6c27g4a15gbf0fgf10a66944d84"
msgid ""
"From that peek I got into your head, I'm not the only one with problems on "
"top of problems. A mind flayer tadpole, huh? And no joy getting it sorted as "
"of yet, I see."
msgstr ""
"네 머릿속을 살짝 들여다보니, 나만 문제가 산더미인 건 딱히 아닌 모양이던걸. 마인드 플레이어 올챙이라니. 아직까진 별 답안도 못 찾은 "
"거 같고 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 40745541-d28c-5800-da29-7133ba746f64
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:40745541-d28c-5800-da29-7133ba746f64
msgctxt "h3eae4e96gfde6g4960gb107g3c9b964d548b"
msgid "Fuck's sake. Mountains as far as the eye can see."
msgstr "이런 우라질. 갈수록 첩첩산중이 따로없네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 40e6c9c2-f5cd-40a5-8785-5ca4f3c32c20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:40e6c9c2-f5cd-40a5-8785-5ca4f3c32c20
msgctxt "h843a75deg717ag4c9eg95e0g482d8a35503b"
msgid ""
"A warrior who winks at her foes while she slays them. You'd be a fool to "
"refuse her."
msgstr "적을 썰어버리면서 윙크까지 날려주는 전사로군. 저런 자를 거부하는 건 바보짓이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 40f0ebfe-27c1-5ebb-3708-1aad0a15854b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Quest_AcceptedSearch = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:40f0ebfe-27c1-5ebb-3708-1aad0a15854b
msgctxt "h0a4a76e2gc708g40d2g9a70ga7debd98dbb1"
msgid "Here to take your head."
msgstr "난 네 머리를 따러 온 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 45ee5e2e-832a-2427-49e7-d613fac7af01
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Origin_PartOfTheTeam_Wyll = True
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Quest_AcceptedSearch = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:45ee5e2e-832a-2427-49e7-d613fac7af01
msgctxt "hac3cc94cg865eg4842gad2dg2e624abd0a5a"
msgid "*One horn. This is the devil Wyll and the paladins of Tyr want dead.*"
msgstr "*외뿔. 윌과 티르의 팔라딘들이 죽이려 하는 그 데빌입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 46de0cc2-303b-1930-a5d9-00d42e5d5cef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_State_PersuasionSucceeded = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:46de0cc2-303b-1930-a5d9-00d42e5d5cef
msgctxt "ha45102d7g759ag4ca5g8703g401f6e8c0021"
msgid ""
"Argh! I've got enough to worry about without your screams giving my position "
"away."
msgstr "으아! 안 그래도 골머리 썩는 상황인데, 네 비명 소리 때문에 내 위치 노출시킬 순 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 47135eea-02d0-06f6-67d7-4a566d258885
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 30d68d9c-ff84-a27c-92d0-f8ac4d840553_AskedDevil = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:47135eea-02d0-06f6-67d7-4a566d258885
msgctxt "h7b987b42gf9a8g4787gab36gaebd2046ee18"
msgid "First, I'd like to know how you controlled those flames."
msgstr "일단, 대체 어떻게 그 불꽃을 제어한 건지 알고 싶은걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 485bccab-8229-66c7-e457-3846567637b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Event_UnlockTGNoWyll = True
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_ORI_Event_InvitedToCamp_Run(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:485bccab-8229-66c7-e457-3846567637b2
msgctxt "h7bbfb7cdgd697g47acga0aag4b383398f5ee"
msgid ""
"All right, sure. But don't get to any of the fun stuff without me. Got it?"
msgstr "좋아, 그럴게. 나 빼놓고 혼자만 재미 보면 안 된다? 알았지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 496b89eb-4e75-0589-1837-a21944cc4120
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:496b89eb-4e75-0589-1837-a21944cc4120
msgctxt "hcbe665dfgefedg45f6gba83g72505be4b09e"
msgid "Me? I wish."
msgstr "내가? 퍽이나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 49ff5987-ed4e-3a3e-1cba-b6a6301ec519
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_State_PaladinsPermaDefeated = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:49ff5987-ed4e-3a3e-1cba-b6a6301ec519
msgctxt "h28be2493g72a9g42a7g8469gb99bacc0161b"
msgid "Sounds like a great plan."
msgstr "멋진 계획인 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 4e7ceb8a-c0b3-4cf8-daa2-1bfd0efbf460
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:4e7ceb8a-c0b3-4cf8-daa2-1bfd0efbf460
msgctxt "h85800a97ga9b8g4588g9e09gb6c119b39887"
msgid ""
"Thanking you. A tune-up would give this rustbox of mine a new lease on life."
msgstr "고마워. 정비 한 번 받고 나면 내 고물통 심장이 새 생명을 얻게 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 4f428378-1b28-3c27-8972-e8c1df5c92d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:4f428378-1b28-3c27-8972-e8c1df5c92d7
msgctxt "h181b1e9cgf81eg4693ga67ag63be1d79c4b0"
msgid "The truth is... well, it's a long story. And I'll tell it, but -"
msgstr "진실은 말이지... 음, 이야기가 제법 길어. 말해주긴 할 텐데, 우선-"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 50fec66d-9709-842d-a274-07d21b90034c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:50fec66d-9709-842d-a274-07d21b90034c
msgctxt "ha0b3623cg02b3g4b2cga2fcg3f29cbc1526c"
msgid "You have a mechanic for your heart?"
msgstr "네 심장 봐주는 정비공이 있다고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 51d037f2-9a2a-9863-6cde-dd1937e62d0c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:51d037f2-9a2a-9863-6cde-dd1937e62d0c
msgctxt "hda97a3e4gbfa0g4344g93a2g69d3de58ba5c"
msgid "Believe me, I never killed anyone who didn't -"
msgstr "장담하는데, 난 덤비는 놈 말곤 아무도 해친 적 -"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 52d40af6-c337-32a3-720a-685cc9b66d0f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_RefusedToHelp = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:52d40af6-c337-32a3-720a-685cc9b66d0f
msgctxt "h56da1cc2g21dbg4826g9157g8c38b776b85d"
msgid "Still a 'no'."
msgstr "내 대답은 여전히 '안 돼'야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 5371d256-b484-06b3-cd46-dd5bda738d89
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:5371d256-b484-06b3-cd46-dd5bda738d89
msgctxt "h9a848faeg1f95g439bgb9cag9ab05002e269"
msgid ""
"Won't be seeing my mechanic any time soon, so I've been making the most of "
"the extra heat. But it's meant I can't get too friendly. If I'm excited, "
"nervous, scared, I'll light you up like a firework."
msgstr ""
"조만간 내 정비공 만날 일은 없을 테니, 열기만 최대한 써먹으며 지냈지. 즉, 날 너무 가까이하면 안 된다는 얘기야. 내가 얼떨결에 "
"흥분하거나, 긴장하거나, 겁을 먹으면, 널 폭죽처럼 태워먹고 말 거거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 547e30b1-4281-3de2-1ad4-20dc10f44cc6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:547e30b1-4281-3de2-1ad4-20dc10f44cc6
msgctxt "he74254e3g8a1cg4f99gae06gca6155b16dc4"
msgid ""
"I'm no devil. And <i>you're</i> no bounty hunter. I saw you before. On the "
"mind flayers' ship."
msgstr "난 데빌이 아니야. <i>너도</i> 현상금 사냥꾼은 아니지. 난 널 전에 봤다고. 마인드 플레이어 함선에서."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5628fa4a-993b-1814-f4b1-db21dd7dfa74
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Quest_AcceptedSearch = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:5628fa4a-993b-1814-f4b1-db21dd7dfa74
msgctxt "he072edf8gfeb9g4337g9428gea25564bc2aa"
msgid "*One horn. This is the devil you've been tasked to kill.*"
msgstr "*외뿔. 당신이 죽이라 의뢰받은 바로 그 데빌입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 578d9d36-a9b7-e5f2-4674-cc071bd4ffed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:578d9d36-a9b7-e5f2-4674-cc071bd4ffed
msgctxt "h46442a21g80e6g4effga66fgbb1d856582ba"
msgid ""
"Nice of you to ask. Lately I've gotten used to being called 'devil'. No "
"follow-up questions."
msgstr "물어봐 주니 고맙네. 최근엔 '데빌'이라는 소리만 질리도록 들었거든. 묻고 따지지도 않고 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 57a75a61-fa40-42ff-a914-ee6167014a8f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_State_DammonUnavailable = False
#.      - DEN_Weaponsmith_Knows_Elturel = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Karlach_State_ToldKarlachAboutDammon = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:57a75a61-fa40-42ff-a914-ee6167014a8f
msgctxt "h72238fd3gcf80g4446g8d10ge76c5ad1bf70"
msgid "Wonder if they meant Dammon - a tiefling weaponsmith."
msgstr "놈들이 얘기한 게 대먼이 아닐까 싶은데. 티플링 무기장이이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 57bf4228-a84b-b6e0-b6b4-ced941b35ae1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - TYR(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:57bf4228-a84b-b6e0-b6b4-ced941b35ae1
msgctxt "h5e366483g90c0g4cc8g887dg96707268ed19"
msgid "What quarrel do you have with these Tyrrans?"
msgstr "그 티르 신도들이랑 무슨 문제를 일으킨 건데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 580ee24e-f8d5-381b-4942-a329a1993fdd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_State_PersuasionSucceeded = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - ORI_Karlach_HasMet_DammonUnavailable(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:580ee24e-f8d5-381b-4942-a329a1993fdd
msgctxt "h6ce018c9g7ba5g4d08g9ce7g992db5061288"
msgid "Pretty sure I told you to fuck off, mate."
msgstr "내가 분명히 꺼지라고 했을 텐데, 친구."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 584b74eb-e8f3-76c1-e73d-e5e60893e0e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Quest_AcceptedSearch = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:584b74eb-e8f3-76c1-e73d-e5e60893e0e5
msgctxt "habe85ef9g214fg4be9gb4f5g4fe6ecaf3243"
msgid ""
"I met a group of your victims, if that's what you mean. They told me what "
"you are."
msgstr "너한테 당한 어느 무리를 만나긴 했어. 네가 어떤 자인지 알려주더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 586388e4-3339-89a2-36b9-eaae0518f44c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:586388e4-3339-89a2-36b9-eaae0518f44c
msgctxt "h5aac260bgdf75g4a4dg873fge03d5ce56d4b"
msgid ""
"You already know I fought in the Blood War. I was good at killing demons. "
"<i>Really </i>good."
msgstr "내가 피의 전쟁에서 싸운 건 너도 이미 알 거야. 난 데몬 죽이는 솜씨가 뛰어났어. <i>엄청</i> 뛰어났지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 58b2f464-044e-5886-1e7e-d1f668c289cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Karlach_State_InSearchOfMechanic = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:58b2f464-044e-5886-1e7e-d1f668c289cc
msgctxt "hf730c56cgfe7ag4573g8e89g10a0d949cf0f"
msgid "I'll keep an eye out for someone like that."
msgstr "다니면서 그런 사람 있는지 잘 살펴볼게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 5ab1a708-f0df-6287-3fa3-e988d4fdb089
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:5ab1a708-f0df-6287-3fa3-e988d4fdb089
msgctxt "h452a110fg9504g42dfg81c7gd0bb6d9018dd"
msgid ""
"Guess that explains the voices. From that peek I got into your head, you've "
"made some inroads trying to get the thing sorted. But alas, no joy."
msgstr "그럼 그 목소리도 설명이 되는걸. 네 머릿속을 살짝 들여다보니, 그 문제 해소하려고 일을 좀 벌인 모양이던데. 재미는 못봤지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 5d9a8d5b-9496-e9ef-3043-3d3ba1e8745a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_State_KarlachKiller(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Karlach_HasMet = True
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Event_KarlachDied = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_State_KarlachKiller(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Event_KarlachDied = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:5d9a8d5b-9496-e9ef-3043-3d3ba1e8745a
msgctxt "h077b89b7g6f76g450bga76bga1e516ba9e64"
msgid ""
"You kill me, you bring me back. I'd be furious if I didn't want the fucker "
"strong enough to kill <i>me </i>on my side."
msgstr ""
"날 죽이곤, 도로 살려내다니. 이거 존나 빡칠 일이라고. <i>나를 </i>죽일 만큼 강한 새끼랑 편 먹고 싶지 않았더라면 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 5dfc0405-47fa-9a68-e28b-aba71b60c885
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Karlach_HasMet = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:5dfc0405-47fa-9a68-e28b-aba71b60c885
msgctxt "hbf3e9b10g8a15g4cd7g8333g74fa166abc3e"
msgid "Ready to team up?"
msgstr "팀 될 준비 된 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 602cf3cc-fe27-49f2-6ed0-fd3f2ded2470
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Quest_ToldZarielFollowers(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:602cf3cc-fe27-49f2-6ed0-fd3f2ded2470
msgctxt "h2798ab3fg4492g458ag8cebgd10ef1734ead"
msgid ""
"None at all. In fact, it may upset you to hear some of Zariel's goons are "
"posing as followers of your fella."
msgstr "전혀 아닌데. 사실 자리엘의 따까리들이 네가 섬기는 양반 신도 행세 한다는 거 알면 그놈들한테 빡칠걸?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 603de59c-eb4e-1225-7fce-86b9ce2020e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:603de59c-eb4e-1225-7fce-86b9ce2020e4
msgctxt "hac5b32acg432cg4545g8a90g3a50b1a4be52"
msgid "Get the fuck out of here. <i>Now. </i>Before I change my mind.<i></i>"
msgstr "여기서 꺼져버려. <i>당장.</i> 마음 바꿔먹기 전에 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6608668c-910d-df1d-9a34-0355bea6706e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:6608668c-910d-df1d-9a34-0355bea6706e
msgctxt "h5e36d87fg8123g4b67g957cge37693c6d83c"
msgid ""
"*The Blood War. You saw it from above as the nautiloid passed through "
"Avernus - this woman was on the front line.*"
msgstr "*피의 전쟁. 노틸로이드를 타고 아베르누스 위를 지나면서 봤던 장면입니다. 이 여자는 그 최전선에 있었습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 661d8ddf-1d93-3cd5-3511-df3df2ee51c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:661d8ddf-1d93-3cd5-3511-df3df2ee51c2
msgctxt "h92cb81e6g2ae3g4df4g9c0dgb764e958597c"
msgid "Why should I do your dirty work?"
msgstr "왜 내가 널 위해 지저분한 일을 해야 하는데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 68008519-970f-4237-9492-1379ca795aaf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_State_PaladinsPermaDefeated = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Quest_ToldKarlach = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:68008519-970f-4237-9492-1379ca795aaf
msgctxt "h8145ebb6g0847g40f8g9a23gd2303488d032"
msgid "I met the people looking for you - and killed them."
msgstr "널 쫓는 자들을 만났어. 그리고 해치워버렸지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 6938a0d3-0123-0b16-d881-65beff951669
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:6938a0d3-0123-0b16-d881-65beff951669
msgctxt "hc6afd50fge9f3g4da1g98dcg0973f241ab51"
msgid "I'm Karlach. And you are...?"
msgstr "난 칼라크야. 너는...?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6b18943e-9c1c-25e0-9f37-96c6adf972eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:6b18943e-9c1c-25e0-9f37-96c6adf972eb
msgctxt "hf1e61638g7c5dg479eg996agffe6d7b8ecca"
msgid ""
"*Then you're lost in visions of demonic armies as you tear through a "
"landscape of fire and blood.*"
msgstr "*이윽고 불과 피로 뒤덮인 풍경을 헤치며 나아가던 당신은, 데몬 군세의 광경을 보고 정신이 아찔해집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 6c54d997-e5f8-0a8c-5e04-c5a4ee58f89e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:6c54d997-e5f8-0a8c-5e04-c5a4ee58f89e
msgctxt "h0d521949geb22g4a95g91f2gc69d028402fd"
msgid ""
"A little background, if your moral compass needs something to point at..."
msgstr "혹시나 네 도덕의 잣대를 충족시킬 배경 설명이 필요하다면..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 6d03d4be-fb58-95dc-f986-ad63242cbd51
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Event_KarlachHostile = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:6d03d4be-fb58-95dc-f986-ad63242cbd51
msgctxt "hd71b8612g5a12g4d20g9cd4g6395fbc2606d"
msgid "Try, motherfucker! See what happens!"
msgstr "해 봐, 씹새야! 어디 붙어 보자고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 6d441ddc-6bcc-2d85-ad72-82b63910bf10
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:6d441ddc-6bcc-2d85-ad72-82b63910bf10
msgctxt "hc314d725g109cg4a23gbab1gd0025e3f21e8"
msgid ""
"Not by choice. I'm a good skull-crusher, but I <i>never </i>wanted to serve "
"Zariel."
msgstr "내가 바란 건 아닌데. 골통 부수는 솜씨는 뛰어났지만, 좋아서 자리엘 섬긴 건 <i>절대</i> 아니라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6db207c5-5394-ca42-357c-e3ac5d989b70
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:6db207c5-5394-ca42-357c-e3ac5d989b70
msgctxt "h8a93db52g11a0g4c27ga4c7g56700d94e02e"
msgid "What does the engine allow you to do?"
msgstr "그 엔진으로 뭘 할 수 있어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 6ed5c1d0-ff73-024e-4725-81613be96ed5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:6ed5c1d0-ff73-024e-4725-81613be96ed5
msgctxt "hafdf128cge207g46f0g8132g2a85b0fa70ba"
msgid ""
"Burn, baby. As hot as I can tolerate. I have to admit it helps in battle, "
"though I wouldn't have chosen it for myself - if I'd been given a choice."
msgstr ""
"불 탈 수 있지. 한계까지 뜨겁게 타오른다고. 솔직히 싸울 때 도움되는 건 사실인데, 할 수 있었다면 이걸 몸에 달지 않았을 거야. "
"나한테 선택권이 있었다면 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 6f88e47a-02e3-0852-4e0e-c1efb03669d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Event_KarlachHostile = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:6f88e47a-02e3-0852-4e0e-c1efb03669d2
msgctxt "h0d40b2aagb14bg4919gbfa1ga477be153de5"
msgid "Oh, I want to live. Just not in a world with you in it."
msgstr "오, 나도 살고는 싶다고. 그저 네가 없는 세상에서 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 6f92330f-6f18-5c1e-1f19-fcffbfeef074
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:6f92330f-6f18-5c1e-1f19-fcffbfeef074
msgctxt "hc6f8b6f1g20a2g4b3bg8b5agc8883d120947"
msgid ""
"Well, if it isn't obvious by now, he's wrong about me. I'll prove it to him "
"if he stops swinging that sword around long enough to listen to sense."
msgstr ""
"뭐, 네 눈에도 뻔히 보이겠지만, 녀석은 날 오해하고 있어. 걔가 칼 좀 그만 휘둘러대고 차분히 얘기 좀 들어준다면 오해를 고쳐줄 텐데 "
"말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 7055a7a3-3539-1084-9653-059e1d7575da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:7055a7a3-3539-1084-9653-059e1d7575da
msgctxt "h587cd32cg5771g437fg81e6g199564e15df8"
msgid "Who knows! Maybe I can run like this indefinitely. But... maybe not."
msgstr "누가 알겠어! 어쩌면 지금 이 상태로 쭉 버틸 수도 있지. 아마... 아니겠지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 70589755-7020-969d-89c3-aed0b2a7f88e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Event_UnlockTGNoWyll = True
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_ORI_Event_InvitedToCamp_Run(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:70589755-7020-969d-89c3-aed0b2a7f88e
msgctxt "h1d7d69e3gd24eg4efagad23gee2d714c6c50"
msgid ""
"I'll catch up with you when it's time to camp, for now. But don't get to any "
"of the fun stuff without me - got it?"
msgstr "일단 야영할 시간 맞춰 기다리고 있을게. 나 빼놓고 혼자만 재미 보면 안 된다? 알았지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 70d05818-2341-c2fb-174c-62425cb93e59
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:70d05818-2341-c2fb-174c-62425cb93e59
msgctxt "h8e574ae6g549fg41fagb8a9gfb47013b167d"
msgid ""
"I know what you did. All those people in the druid's grove - you slaughtered "
"them to a man."
msgstr "네가 한 짓 알고 있어. 드루이드 숲에 있던 모두를, 네가 모조리 도륙내버렸지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 71001c19-eb59-e70e-c23c-634c5040865b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - Wyll_Recruitment_PostEA_NamedroppedKarlach(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:71001c19-eb59-e70e-c23c-634c5040865b
msgctxt "h223ba403g77adg41d9g9d9dgbcb59b466a8d"
msgid ""
"Karlach. I met someone named Wyll who was hunting you. He said  you were a "
"devil."
msgstr "칼라크라. 널 쫓고 있는 윌이라는 사람을 만난 적 있지. 네가 데빌이라고 하던데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 72ff3a23-df49-eb22-c2eb-2cefeb6a7f8f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:72ff3a23-df49-eb22-c2eb-2cefeb6a7f8f
msgctxt "hc14e5d7eg9108g4776g8870ge0908ec21a5b"
msgid "High pain tolerance. And a dynamic duo of truly shitty bosses."
msgstr "아픈 거 존나 잘 참기. 그리고 개 같은 상사들의 환상적인 조합 덕이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 742eb48d-efcb-e971-80f7-163fe975649f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:742eb48d-efcb-e971-80f7-163fe975649f
msgctxt "h30f3921dgf039g4119g947egb9629ac985d8"
msgid ""
"I can see that. But look, if we take care of my little problem, we can move "
"on to <i>ours</i>. The tadpole."
msgstr "그건 알겠어. 다만 내 문제를 함께 해결해준다면, 그다음엔 <i>우리</i> 그 문제를 함께 상대할 수 있다고. 올챙이 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 74c4bb45-b475-7639-a05f-f4d4417f1aea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:74c4bb45-b475-7639-a05f-f4d4417f1aea
msgctxt "ha82b0411g42bbg42a0gbf3ag83a745009782"
msgid ""
"That's incredible! In that case, you ought to let me return the favour. My "
"muscle for your aid in my battle against the powers of the arch-bitch."
msgstr ""
"거 대단한걸! 그렇다면 내가 꼭 보답을 하게 해 줘. 그 아크 개년한테 맞설 수 있게 날 도와준다면 나도 너한테 도움이 되어줄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 788829ac-e68d-4bbe-b072-d48b2eab1da0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Quest_AcceptedSearch = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:788829ac-e68d-4bbe-b072-d48b2eab1da0
msgctxt "h4daacc7aga865g4bfdg8207gc858df704e4d"
msgid "No, but I'm taking your head."
msgstr "아니, 네 머리를 가지러 온 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7a65ecb5-5b37-fefa-cbc0-123152557641
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_State_PaladinsPermaDefeated = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:7a65ecb5-5b37-fefa-cbc0-123152557641
msgctxt "hadaa8640gb231g4b1cgadb3g95d92428723d"
msgid "Let's do it."
msgstr "해 보자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 7d18211b-82b8-bb9e-f1f1-02e866ba75fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:7d18211b-82b8-bb9e-f1f1-02e866ba75fb
msgctxt "h817452edgc35fg4509g88d8gb587a1599158"
msgid "So good Zariel, the archdevil herself, made me her personal attack dog."
msgstr "너무 뛰어나서 자리엘, 그 아크데빌년이 자기 개인 전투견으로 삼을 정도였어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 80982516-0b32-3ff0-7d1b-c7e03cd9079e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Origin_PartOfTheTeam_Wyll = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:80982516-0b32-3ff0-7d1b-c7e03cd9079e
msgctxt "hc93fec5eg2964g48d4g9b9dg3f6be62641ec"
msgid "*One horn. This is the devil Wyll has been tasked to kill.*"
msgstr "*외뿔. 윌이 죽여야 한다는 바로 그 데빌입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 811e2162-a807-2156-dd71-74852552c8b4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_State_KarlachKiller(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Karlach_HasMet = False
#.      - CRA_AstarionRecruitment_Event_AstarionDied = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_State_KarlachKiller(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Event_KarlachDied = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:811e2162-a807-2156-dd71-74852552c8b4
msgctxt "haa0c71c8g13d5g45cag9dd5gb606548798ab"
msgid ""
"You did me in, then brought me back. I'd be impressed if I weren't so pissed "
"off."
msgstr "날 죽여놓곤 되살려내셨네? 개 빡돌지만 않았더라면 감탄했을지도 모르겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8524787a-9b2c-90c6-8394-c0d7d553b2e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:8524787a-9b2c-90c6-8394-c0d7d553b2e2
msgctxt "h3fd08cadgac0dg4ce4g88efg88d76aca74e2"
msgid "All right - welcome to the team."
msgstr "좋아. 팀에 들어온 걸 환영해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 887b1689-37f5-fbee-f431-895f1e645d49
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Karlach_Quest_AgreedToHelpNotRecruited = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:887b1689-37f5-fbee-f431-895f1e645d49
msgctxt "hf3849fb4g30d8g4fc3gb6ccg3a6ad3f96b08"
msgid ""
"Why don't you clear things with your leader before we team up. Send 'em my "
"way so we can work out the particulars."
msgstr "일단 한 팀 되기 전에 너희 리더 결론 받는 게 어때? 세부적인 거 얘기하게 내 쪽으로 보내달라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 89bc95e1-ce31-48ed-06f4-9b883559c1f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_State_PersuasionSucceeded = False
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_State_PartyPermadefeatedDammon = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:89bc95e1-ce31-48ed-06f4-9b883559c1f2
msgctxt "hc28f016dgb7a0g49e0g880eg62b6449ffadd"
msgid ""
"Please - more violence won't change the past. Leave me be, and I'll leave "
"you too."
msgstr "이러지 말지. 폭력으로 과거를 바꿀 순 없잖아. 날 내버려 둬. 그럼 나도 널 내버려 두겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8b5d73da-9505-0bf5-57ec-9b7f02417d48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_State_PaladinsPermaDefeated = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:8b5d73da-9505-0bf5-57ec-9b7f02417d48
msgctxt "h60d525a9g8176g4457g81e6g1ca0aac57437"
msgid "Let's send them back where they came from."
msgstr "그럼 어디 놈들이 왔던 곳으로 돌려보내 주자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8d514e4e-8573-078b-67d2-8c8e0a467a81
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:8d514e4e-8573-078b-67d2-8c8e0a467a81
msgctxt "h31118f37gddb8g450dg8aaag86c01bc8624d"
msgid "Head to my camp, then. We can regroup later."
msgstr "내 야영지로 가서 기다려. 나중에 일행으로 다니면 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8db050ef-b5ae-f579-da37-514d275b014a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:8db050ef-b5ae-f579-da37-514d275b014a
msgctxt "hfddc0b13g6f4bg4a70g9f4eged075ff38a3f"
msgid "Maybe you ought to shed some light on what I just saw."
msgstr "방금 내가 본 걸 설명 좀 해줘야 할 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8f9f6ff6-3414-ffc3-8aa0-948387be3b1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - TYR(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:8f9f6ff6-3414-ffc3-8aa0-948387be3b1f
msgctxt "h9a2024beg6a12g4374ga21cg29089fddfef1"
msgid "I serve the Just God. What quarrel have you with His faithful?"
msgstr "나는 정의의 신을 섬기는 몸이야. 그분의 신도들과 무슨 문제를 일으킨 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 917374fd-83f2-0b6d-e52b-d2c9b58557cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:917374fd-83f2-0b6d-e52b-d2c9b58557cb
msgctxt "ha3aec149g9f39g4897g8c38g05cc225de651"
msgid ""
"Nothing but. But... maybe you don't need to be one of 'em. You're no bounty "
"hunter. I saw you before. On the mind flayers' ship."
msgstr ""
"적만 있지. 근데... 너까지 적일 필요는 없겠다 싶은데. 넌 현상금 사냥꾼 아니잖아. 난 널 전에 봤다고. 마인드 플레이어 함선에서."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 926299f5-8507-f889-0018-6fdbadaf0248
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:926299f5-8507-f889-0018-6fdbadaf0248
msgctxt "hf97ae46cg6977g4187g9196gda4b20f54869"
msgid "Wheey! Now we're talking."
msgstr "그래! 그렇게 나와주셔야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 92a1cdb6-0292-461b-9b71-534e8844adb2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Quest_AcceptedSearch = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:92a1cdb6-0292-461b-9b71-534e8844adb2
msgctxt "hc479e78ag9b5dg4b8eg87aag233cd8605bd0"
msgid "I met the people looking for you. They say you're a killer - a fiend."
msgstr "너를 찾는 자들을 만났어. 네가 살인자에 마족이라고 하던데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 93659744-bbb9-32ec-1bdf-0b04148db43b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Quest_AcceptedSearch = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:93659744-bbb9-32ec-1bdf-0b04148db43b
msgctxt "h474f6824gc649g4742ga574g2350931d2301"
msgid ""
"You've got it all wrong. I've got a contract for your head, and I'm going to "
"take it."
msgstr "단단히 착각하시는군. 난 네 머리를 가져오란 의뢰를 받았고, 그렇게 할 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 937b8771-f408-d22b-5abe-1557a8440aa4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Event_KarlachHostile = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:937b8771-f408-d22b-5abe-1557a8440aa4
msgctxt "h8990f2d5g89cag4c82g9c39g0bdbc316a427"
msgid ""
"Hahaha! Gods, you're pathetic when you lie. Come on - time to pay for you "
"did. I hope it was worth it."
msgstr "하하하! 세상에, 거짓말 참 구차하네. 덤벼. 대가를 치를 시간이다. 이제 와 지난 날 후회는 말라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 9386f144-9186-38c3-d932-9dba11a2f75b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Event_KarlachHostile = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:9386f144-9186-38c3-d932-9dba11a2f75b
msgctxt "h856d91edg9084g4593ga01cge00c7a69b383"
msgid "Have it your way."
msgstr "어디 해보시지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 93d51fdb-8b50-c7fd-a0e7-8952e94d60a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:93d51fdb-8b50-c7fd-a0e7-8952e94d60a3
msgctxt "h3254d450gbe17g4d3egabd7gea2ce42bd8b6"
msgid ""
"Don't worry, I'll lead the charge. But I could use your help. There's a lot "
"of them and only one of me. After that, we can team up. Take Faerûn by the "
"short hairs. Sound good?"
msgstr ""
"걱정 마, 앞장은 내가 설 테니. 그래도 네가 도와주면 낫겠지. 그놈들은 다수인데 난 고작 한 명이거든. 일이 끝나면 함께 팀을 맺자고. "
"같이 페이룬을 틀어잡는 거야. 어때?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 943e209c-773b-4ac5-96a8-889d9423ab35
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_RefusedToHelp = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:943e209c-773b-4ac5-96a8-889d9423ab35
msgctxt "hd5765c77g7fbag4804gaf0fga5372d48ae55"
msgid "Changed your mind about teaming up?"
msgstr "나랑 팀 짜기로 생각 바뀐 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9461070d-096c-9c16-1099-e867b092263e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Quest_AcceptedSearch = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:9461070d-096c-9c16-1099-e867b092263e
msgctxt "hdaf6597fgb17cg4e7bga862gb201c8b50114"
msgid "The paladins of Tyr were right. You <i>are </i>a devil."
msgstr "티르의 팔라딘들이 옳았군. 넌 데빌이 <i>맞았어</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 9565de24-5d67-d8af-46d7-453397d8fd2b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Karlach_HasMet = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Karlach_HasMet = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:9565de24-5d67-d8af-46d7-453397d8fd2b
msgctxt "h04ff6ecbgaeebg4199ga599gb82695a309e4"
msgid "Ngh..."
msgstr "으으으..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 99216b3e-2984-a771-ac82-b415bdb39ea8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:99216b3e-2984-a771-ac82-b415bdb39ea8
msgctxt "h4bf62c09ge777g4053g9805g38f9bcc5e693"
msgid ""
"The first time I faced down those 'paladins,' they let slip they'd met an "
"infernal mechanic in the area. A tiefling. But I didn't see him anywhere."
msgstr ""
"처음 그 '팔라딘' 놈들 맞닥뜨렸을 때, 지들이 지옥의 기계공을 이 지역에서 만났단 얘기를 내뱉더군. 티플링이랬지. 근데 아무리 찾아도 "
"안 보이더라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 99b348ce-d885-558b-9d20-87f43519d860
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:99b348ce-d885-558b-9d20-87f43519d860
msgctxt "ha7e0c1d0gc996g4c38g90dbg5e8b572bfa21"
msgid "Good. <i>Great. </i>Glad I don't have to kill you."
msgstr "좋아. <i>잘 됐네. </i>널 죽일 일 없어서 다행이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9bcb1c07-de06-bc72-cf61-62cd04510006
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:9bcb1c07-de06-bc72-cf61-62cd04510006
msgctxt "h40de5dd0g43d3g473bg8d58g55ab5a9c43bb"
msgid "What were you saying before we were interrupted?"
msgstr "딴 길로 새기 전에 무슨 얘길 하고 있었더라?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 9c0fec1d-8450-7c95-9935-7c7622ab6dd2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:9c0fec1d-8450-7c95-9935-7c7622ab6dd2
msgctxt "h7a1435ccgb903g4f22g9befgb42ef9675942"
msgid "Ugh. Thought I'd lost the Blade of Frontiers on the mind flayer ship."
msgstr "아오. 변경의 칼날 놈은 마인드 플레이어 함선에서 따돌린 줄 알았더만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9c1963dd-4062-837d-92e7-5ac752c809a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:9c1963dd-4062-837d-92e7-5ac752c809a9
msgctxt "hd7d8decbgfe90g49d7g9556g50a4df154c2b"
msgid "<i>She looks dangerous - watch her carefully.</i>"
msgstr "<i>위험해 보이는 자다. 신중히 지켜본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 9d44cf75-57fa-69a3-ba20-75bea05875c7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:9d44cf75-57fa-69a3-ba20-75bea05875c7
msgctxt "hfb161067g5b2fg4011g9e2fg0e1e72f04937"
msgid "Steady on, soldier. Ahh. That's the stuff."
msgstr "살살해, 신참. 햐. 이제야 살겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9d549f4a-77e8-fc0c-b697-994834a0d2cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_State_PaladinsPermaDefeated = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Quest_ToldKarlach = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:9d549f4a-77e8-fc0c-b697-994834a0d2cb
msgctxt "hbd5eec22g27c3g4dd1ga04bg3d1d985e1c21"
msgid ""
"I have good news for you, then. I already killed the paladins you say were "
"hunting you."
msgstr "그럼 네게 좋은 소식이 생겼군. 널 쫓고 있다는 그 팔라딘들은 내가 이미 해치웠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9f8ca399-fd35-db85-0251-c59d11e0ee8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:9f8ca399-fd35-db85-0251-c59d11e0ee8a
msgctxt "h692e84fbg7c0fg4754g9682g8b59aaa48b2f"
msgid "Join my team, then. I could use someone with your talents."
msgstr "그럼 내 팀에 들어와. 너 같은 실력자라면 도움이 되겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9ff3bdea-0225-27df-1d8f-2efb3919c748
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - TYR(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:9ff3bdea-0225-27df-1d8f-2efb3919c748
msgctxt "h3f5ee3c5g20f9g40beg946bg75dc84a8ec48"
msgid "I serve the Just God. What quarrel have you with his faithful?"
msgstr "나는 정의의 신을 섬기는 몸이야. 그분의 신도들과 무슨 문제를 일으킨 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a4a3caea-e665-b65c-30e6-cca883397d92
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_State_DammonUnavailable = False
#.      - DEN_Weaponsmith_Knows_Elturel = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Karlach_State_ToldKarlachAboutDammon = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:a4a3caea-e665-b65c-30e6-cca883397d92
msgctxt "h40956be7gffb8g4839g9e94gbfe3e177ea99"
msgid ""
"I met someone who might be able to help - a smith who worked in the Hells "
"for a time."
msgstr "너한테 도움이 될 만한 사람 만난 적 있어. 대장장이인데 지옥에서 잠시 일했다고 하더라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = a4feaef2-5b78-ca51-3e5b-0bace5d76069
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Event_KarlachHostile = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:a4feaef2-5b78-ca51-3e5b-0bace5d76069
msgctxt "h2f3a362eg811dg4000g8ec9g655645a42877"
msgid ""
"That might be true. And all your power and strength is going to lead you "
"right where you belong. The Hells."
msgstr "그럴지도 모르지. 그리고 네 그 잘난 힘이 너를 너한테 딱 어울리는 곳에 처박게 될 거야. 바로 지옥으로."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = a84231d7-aaca-85d6-065e-7f34ca5d3495
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:a84231d7-aaca-85d6-065e-7f34ca5d3495
msgctxt "h48182311ge082g4176gae49ge399d9e1fc24"
msgid ""
"Me? None. They're the ones chasing me down. But believe me, these so-called "
"paladins are anything but. They -"
msgstr "내가? 전혀. 그쪽이 날 일방적으로 노리는 거지. 다만 장담하는데, 그 팔라딘이란 것들은 진짜가 아니야. 놈들은 -"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = a8ef2719-0d81-ab53-7228-17c638277a34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:a8ef2719-0d81-ab53-7228-17c638277a34
msgctxt "h1bd4754bga658g4455gb481g7b28acfcd312"
msgid ""
"Now <i>that's </i>a story. And I'll tell it to you, too, but truth be told, "
"we shouldn't stay here too long. See, these 'paladins' have -"
msgstr ""
"<i>그건 </i> 할 얘기가 많지. 얘기해주긴 할 텐데, 여기 너무 오래 머무르고 있을 순 없어. 왜냐면, 그 '팔라딘'들이 -"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = aa0ec8c5-4259-a29a-b58d-c8dd090b83d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_State_HelpingKarlach = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:aa0ec8c5-4259-a29a-b58d-c8dd090b83d0
msgctxt "hde3cee5bgaa6fg402cga403g7c49e8c8ca5b"
msgid "I'd hug you if it wouldn't scorch your skin off."
msgstr "네 피부 탈 일만 없었으면 꽉 껴안아 줬을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ac1a8192-ee77-1627-f72f-7271bbd5ca10
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:ac1a8192-ee77-1627-f72f-7271bbd5ca10
msgctxt "hce83629cg938bg4073gb31dge18c40ab9723"
msgid "It's the tadpole in our heads. It connects us."
msgstr "우리 머릿속 올챙이 짓이지. 그게 우릴 연결한 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = aca4ba6d-701f-5575-8add-af3a9793c697
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_State_HelpingKarlach = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:aca4ba6d-701f-5575-8add-af3a9793c697
msgctxt "h7f76584fgd01fg4601g9efcg52d717a0074c"
msgid ""
"Fuck yes. They cornered me outside the tollhouse, just up the hill. Doubt "
"they've gone far after the scorching I gave 'em."
msgstr "씨발 그거지. 놈들은 언덕 위, 통행료 징수소에서 날 이 구석에 몰아넣었어. 내 불꽃에 그슬린 상태니 멀리 가진 못했을걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ace921d9-0888-10c4-99cc-4eb2a639a124
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_Quest_AcceptedSearch = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:ace921d9-0888-10c4-99cc-4eb2a639a124
msgctxt "h0898d8efga99eg422dg811fgfc47f62ff233"
msgid "I'm here to <i>kill </i>you, not send you back to Zariel."
msgstr "난 널 <i>죽이러 </i> 온 거야. 자리엘한테 돌려보낼 일은 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = ae31086a-b907-c965-d9a5-831de86062ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_State_KarlachKnockout(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Karlach_HasMet = False
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_State_KarlachKnockedOut = True
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Event_KarlachDied = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_State_KarlachKnockedOut = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:ae31086a-b907-c965-d9a5-831de86062ee
msgctxt "hf959eb4fg8fd8g4d33gb2d4g468b6ae6c7c1"
msgid ""
"Hope you're not planning on taking another swing at me, mate. Might not go "
"your way this time."
msgstr "나 또 후려갈길 작정으로 찾아온 건 아니길 바라, 친구. 이번엔 네 뜻대로 안 될지도 모르니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aea0cc14-1e45-0a78-a08a-35f0f7cfd489
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:aea0cc14-1e45-0a78-a08a-35f0f7cfd489
msgctxt "h3d838051g5c37g4eb9g9cb9gc1eb21bc35b9"
msgid "I'm not interested in making friends."
msgstr "난 친구 사귀는 데 흥미 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b5fe5be5-f615-5bfe-54a2-8c450f63e95b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:b5fe5be5-f615-5bfe-54a2-8c450f63e95b
msgctxt "h29fdaf50g7597g479bga9a5g98461629ca4f"
msgid "I'm here to kill you, not make small talk."
msgstr "난 널 죽이러 왔지, 잡담이나 하러 온 게 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = b6dfda22-a837-c8fe-da36-3a7cb3d12119
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Event_UnlockTGNoWyll = True
#.   Object:
#.     - OriginAddToParty(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:b6dfda22-a837-c8fe-da36-3a7cb3d12119
msgctxt "h30128940gc66cg415egbe21ge958b8cfda58"
msgid "Phew, I'm getting all het up. Let's make tracks!"
msgstr "휴, 후끈 달아오르는걸. 출발해보자고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b75a00aa-6990-a487-e180-99608b37c784
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - TYR(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:b75a00aa-6990-a487-e180-99608b37c784
msgctxt "ha64b17dfg6faag4a0dgb861g11712dcd24c4"
msgid "What quarrel do you have with these paladins?"
msgstr "그 팔라딘들과 무슨 문제를 일으킨 건데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = b98368d3-c01a-a422-29fa-c939eed6b5fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:b98368d3-c01a-a422-29fa-c939eed6b5fe
msgctxt "h75547bddg7f27g4301gb685gde36c6e3700b"
msgid ""
"I'll tell you the story, but I <i>really </i>need to find someone who can "
"tune up my engine sooner rather than later. Believe me when I say this thing "
"is <i>hot.</i>"
msgstr ""
"자세한 얘긴 얼마든지 해주겠는데, 지금은 <i>정말</i> 한시라도 빨리 내 엔진 봐줄 수 있는 사람 찾는 게 급해. 내가 <i>뜨겁다</"
"i>고 느낄 정도면 장난 아닌 거라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = ba46b188-c86e-c8ce-1baa-6744564b5713
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:ba46b188-c86e-c8ce-1baa-6744564b5713
msgctxt "h4480b2b2g871dg485bg8434g172228676502"
msgid "Trust me - when you see what I'm capable of, you won't regret it."
msgstr "장담하는데, 일단 내 실력 보고 나면 후회할 일 없을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = bbd32bf3-5d7b-5414-a5ad-924d86937665
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:bbd32bf3-5d7b-5414-a5ad-924d86937665
msgctxt "h7ae15d43gdd8ag45b1g94adg54d9e2b37c00"
msgid ""
"If there's one thing Zariel taught me, it's not to fuck with the top dog "
"until it's absolutely necessary."
msgstr "자리엘한테 배운 게 하나 있다면, 그건 꼭 필요한 경우가 아닌 한 두목 심기는 거스르면 안 된다는 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bbe47ccd-88c3-c22b-7b50-6fcb611513e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_TIEFLING(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:bbe47ccd-88c3-c22b-7b50-6fcb611513e6
msgctxt "h41ee8457g29afg4abagae67g494ae273d5cc"
msgid "You there - are you from Elturel?"
msgstr "거기 너. 혹시 엘투렐 출신이냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bcbc9f43-1cf3-3288-5da4-60eb8bf1adbd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:bcbc9f43-1cf3-3288-5da4-60eb8bf1adbd
msgctxt "ha9b52c49ge1dbg4fa6gb2c1g14eafe51c376"
msgid "Haven't met any Tyrrans lately, no."
msgstr "티르 신도를 만난 적은 최근까진 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = bd1e473b-07ff-9ad4-c5aa-eeffd649530b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:bd1e473b-07ff-9ad4-c5aa-eeffd649530b
msgctxt "h012c845egb598g439aga3a5g1afa6fb77897"
msgid "Me? Never been better."
msgstr "나? 더할 나위 없는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = bf8cdb06-a43e-8aa7-26ad-3ca5339391dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:bf8cdb06-a43e-8aa7-26ad-3ca5339391dd
msgctxt "h2fcbe559ga343g4d92ga75dg073e2c2af153"
msgid ""
"Well now! Maybe I could make his acquaintance? A tightened screw or two "
"might let me keep a little calmer."
msgstr "그래? 그럼 언제 한 번 그 사람 좀 만나러 가볼까나? 나사 한 두개만 조여줘도 지금보단 차분해질 거 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c0ab8dcc-6894-0513-7aeb-e75a915b7970
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:c0ab8dcc-6894-0513-7aeb-e75a915b7970
msgctxt "h8965d04cg7a68g4c3fg9718gdae17e25dc6a"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = c3126138-cb93-8217-a949-3432c8aae284
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:c3126138-cb93-8217-a949-3432c8aae284
msgctxt "h2899003fgf35eg4112g8ddfge4ee70979a9a"
msgid ""
"After we've mopped them up, we can work on evicting this parasite and take "
"Faerûn by the short hairs. Sound good?"
msgstr "그놈들 쓸어버리고 나선, 우리 속 기생충도 퇴치하고 이 페이룬을 틀어잡는 거야. 나쁘지 않지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = c33ddc9c-a996-31b3-3945-cec5fdfb7df4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_RefusedToHelp = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:c33ddc9c-a996-31b3-3945-cec5fdfb7df4
msgctxt "h3c89517agac31g412bg837dg8688b23e2609"
msgid "But I can take a hint. Good luck out there. You're gonna need it."
msgstr "눈치 없게 굴 순 없지. 행운을 빌게. 그게 필요할 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = c498b2ef-039b-48a4-9212-b56213b1c0da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:c498b2ef-039b-48a4-9212-b56213b1c0da
msgctxt "h8c44d2edg71bdg4d86g8484g93207d5c4992"
msgid ""
"I like her. She looks like she could throw me over her shoulder and carry me "
"to safety, should the need arise."
msgstr "쟤 마음에 드네. 날 어깨에 떡 짊어지곤 거뜬히 안전하게 옮겨다 줄 것만 같거든. 필요하다면 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c49f9908-290c-d52b-0aa3-c60816ede1b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Origin_PartOfTheTeam_Wyll = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:c49f9908-290c-d52b-0aa3-c60816ede1b9
msgctxt "h4b74669dgbb02g4d4cg9b05gb42825ba9340"
msgid "I know you - you're the monster the Blade of Frontiers is hunting."
msgstr "네가 누군지 알아. 변경의 칼날이 쫓고 있다는 바로 그 괴물이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c4a83f7d-af14-1f95-da7f-d1aad321c7e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_State_PaladinsPermaDefeated = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:c4a83f7d-af14-1f95-da7f-d1aad321c7e9
msgctxt "hf96e1d36g3cbfg4f26g9f47gd480ec73dbc8"
msgid "Got it in one. Let's go after whoever's hunting you."
msgstr "눈치가 빠르네. 널 쫓고 있다는 놈들을 치러 가자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = c4f28e9e-cd40-204a-62dc-fbc1362d94e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:c4f28e9e-cd40-204a-62dc-fbc1362d94e7
msgctxt "h92cc8edbg7060g4dfcga520g2a4536ee6134"
msgid "Ready to team up?"
msgstr "팀 될 준비 된 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = c5d20462-262d-87db-b1f7-445be170b977
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:c5d20462-262d-87db-b1f7-445be170b977
msgctxt "h90d5031fgccabg4f55ga7dcg7435401e96dd"
msgid ""
"You with the so-called 'paladins of Tyr'? Or straight from the grand high "
"devil herself?"
msgstr "넌 그 '티르의 팔라딘'이란 것들과 한 패냐? 아니면 그 초고위 데빌년이 친히 보내 온 거냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = c6cfbc4c-2245-ad83-f4a7-d900821943d1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GEN_MaxPlayerCountReached = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Tutorials_FullPartyRejection = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:c6cfbc4c-2245-ad83-f4a7-d900821943d1
msgctxt "h3b395c9egd190g4d53g9f88g814c45d2ed94"
msgid ""
"Hang on, though - looks like you've got enough backup at your side. Not sure "
"there's room for me."
msgstr "근데 잠깐만. 네 쪽은 이미 도와줄 애들이 충분한 것 같은데. 낄 자리가 있을지 모르겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c7f7ba77-7d9d-0d6e-5065-1a28ec3d8617
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:c7f7ba77-7d9d-0d6e-5065-1a28ec3d8617
msgctxt "hee53870dgea17g4e99ga85bg8f352769f0d8"
msgid "I don't remember you from the ship. Where were you?"
msgstr "그 배에서 널 본 기억은 없는데. 어디 있었던 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = ca0d3a92-8a68-1ef8-6aac-87c61b2cfadc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:ca0d3a92-8a68-1ef8-6aac-87c61b2cfadc
msgctxt "h22268db0g0837g4828g8101g487688e442d3"
msgid "Did it make you feel important, huh? Did it make you feel <i>big?</i>"
msgstr "그짓 하니 대단해진 기분 들었냐? <i>잘난</i> 존재라도 된 것 같냐고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = ca523c05-c884-4b14-7a28-e91f0addf6a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Event_KarlachHostile = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:ca523c05-c884-4b14-7a28-e91f0addf6a4
msgctxt "ha1b3854bg881cg451bga026g33ff65a51aae"
msgid ""
"You're right. Violence won't change the past. But the right kind of violence "
"can protect the future. You're dangerous. I can't let you leave."
msgstr ""
"맞는 말이야. 폭력은 과거를 바꾸지 못하지. 하지만 올바른 종류의 폭력은 미래를 예방할 수 있다고. 넌 위험한 놈이야. 내버려둘 수는 "
"없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = cca2f7a6-6c6c-a850-4fc3-62549b81094a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:cca2f7a6-6c6c-a850-4fc3-62549b81094a
msgctxt "h7dc2ddddg3de5g4ab3ga572g6c57ff38cf89"
msgid "I know the feeling. So come on - let's see whose is worse."
msgstr "그 느낌 나도 알지. 그러니 덤벼. 누구 게 더 최악일지 보자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = cd28f758-1272-2902-28de-5285eb5e5021
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:cd28f758-1272-2902-28de-5285eb5e5021
msgctxt "hb4f78b98gb9a8g4d60g80f3g2f6eb127792b"
msgid ""
"Wild, right? And believe it or not, I'm one of Zariel's <i>least</i>-"
"mutilated pets."
msgstr "쩔어주지? 믿거나 말거나, 자리엘의 애완견 중엔 내가 <i>그나마</i> 덜 개조당한 축이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cd5b1933-c3ea-2049-bc4c-c9e275d20701
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:cd5b1933-c3ea-2049-bc4c-c9e275d20701
msgctxt "hbbceaae3g1e62g4badg9234g6476a3677ff5"
msgid "I'm your key to curing that tadpole - eventually."
msgstr "네 올챙이 문제를 해결해 줄 답안이지. 언젠가는."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = cf7e15ad-7c69-01d2-c46e-8292e3ee5e15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:cf7e15ad-7c69-01d2-c46e-8292e3ee5e15
msgctxt "h2117d6b0g59ccg47b6ga6c6g3c19ad30d6f1"
msgid ""
"You're not the worst liar I've ever met. But you're daft as a brick if you "
"think I'm going to believe that."
msgstr "거짓말 솜씨가 아주 최악은 아니네. 하지만 내가 그 말을 믿어줄 거라 여겼다면 넌 돌대가리야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = cf808d2f-9f3d-4646-a3d9-552d282cfceb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:cf808d2f-9f3d-4646-a3d9-552d282cfceb
msgctxt "h65636d8bgc8e8g458dgbce1g124d7d3859f0"
msgid ""
"Well fuck me. It's you. From the ship. Haven't taken any bounties from a "
"burnt Tyr dink, have you?"
msgstr "이런 씹. 너구나. 함선에서 봤던. 설마 불에 그슬린 그 티르 똘추들한테 현상금 의뢰 받은 건 아니지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = cf8fa0e4-22d6-f230-711e-014d9ce57a10
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - ORI_Karlach_HasMet_DammonUnavailable(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_State_PersuasionSucceeded = False
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_State_DammonUnavailable = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:cf8fa0e4-22d6-f230-711e-014d9ce57a10
msgctxt "h0c293d88gcfeeg477cg8335gdc220ad5ba7f"
msgid "There you are. Thought I'd have to track you down myself, murderer."
msgstr "제 발로 왔군. 이러다 직접 찾으러 가야 하나 샆었다, 이 살인자야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d0cc5f73-48fc-b0bb-2778-e22a70274891
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:d0cc5f73-48fc-b0bb-2778-e22a70274891
msgctxt "hf1c40a54g9ae1g41ceg92f4g7217600ffd2b"
msgid "I'm [GEN_PlayerName_c11eee1e-7815-6143-7233-f2427799fa53]."
msgstr "[GEN_PlayerName_c11eee1e-7815-6143-7233-f2427799fa53](이)야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d2c4f5b5-6e45-8496-4c0a-37f47e4d27d4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:d2c4f5b5-6e45-8496-4c0a-37f47e4d27d4
msgctxt "h753867dcga2e1g4410gb2e2gaeba6b05adce"
msgid "It did, actually. I am very powerful and strong!"
msgstr "사실 그랬긴 해. 난 엄청 세고 강하다고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = d2db3621-e0e3-3483-4a0f-29637bdc0bf3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:d2db3621-e0e3-3483-4a0f-29637bdc0bf3
msgctxt "hdbf60de7g7c89g4678g82feg915ca0730db1"
msgid ""
"Me and justice are good mates, believe me. The goons chasing me are anything "
"but -"
msgstr "나랑 정의는 좋은 사이라고. 진짜야. 날 쫓는 놈들이야말로 정의랑은 -"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = d329f27b-88c4-0779-f87f-eb1adb3e5ffa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:d329f27b-88c4-0779-f87f-eb1adb3e5ffa
msgctxt "h0940cae3g9a05g49cagae18g53ec83dda059"
msgid ""
"You did?! That's incredible! You ought to let me return the favour. We can "
"team up - evict this parasite, then take Faerûn by the short hairs. Sound "
"good?"
msgstr "그랬다고?! 거 대단한걸! 내가 보답을 하게 해줘. 같이 한 편이 되어 머릿속 기생충을 제거하고 페이룬을 틀어잡는 거야. 어때?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = d335edae-dee6-4c30-9afa-dc9e5b76ffe2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:d335edae-dee6-4c30-9afa-dc9e5b76ffe2
msgctxt "hf859a4f2g0aecg4babg8aabg082831cda671"
msgid ""
"Now that we're old pals, how would you feel about helping me kill some evil "
"bastards?"
msgstr "이제 찐친이 된 셈인데, 내가 어떤 사악한 놈들 해치우는 것 좀 도와보는 건 어때?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = d4027421-9301-45ec-ef72-138fe6bf9244
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:d4027421-9301-45ec-ef72-138fe6bf9244
msgctxt "hba3d7ab4gda5dg4971ga820g4b4558ae8a6d"
msgid ""
"But if they've fed you some lies about me going after innocents, that's a "
"crock of shit."
msgstr "하지만 놈들이 내가 무고한 이들 해친다는 거짓말을 했다면, 그건 말짱 헛소리야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d5ac6c90-27ad-5c0e-fb6c-c840e1044483
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:d5ac6c90-27ad-5c0e-fb6c-c840e1044483
msgctxt "h884065e4g53a9g4d4dg94c6g21d7ebf9d9cf"
msgid "I - I - I... please, there's something inside me I can't control."
msgstr "나 - 나 - 나는... 제발, 내 안에 통제가 불가능한 뭔가가 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = d7b048e9-8b2b-59c5-56fa-53946f094ed7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_State_HelpingKarlach = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:d7b048e9-8b2b-59c5-56fa-53946f094ed7
msgctxt "h590eec77gef00g4863g8009g8d61f639f607"
msgid ""
"Fuck yes. They cornered me outside the tollhouse, just up the hill. Doubt "
"they've gone far after the scorching I gave 'em."
msgstr "씨발 그거지. 놈들은 언덕 위, 통행료 징수소에서 날 이 구석에 몰아넣었어. 내 불꽃에 그슬린 상태니 멀리 가진 못했을걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d7e1e680-e9a3-6e61-44a7-ad71868b50c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:d7e1e680-e9a3-6e61-44a7-ad71868b50c2
msgctxt "h74c0b7a7gf120g4185g9dddg75217fee5037"
msgid "I don't think so - you'll have to go it alone."
msgstr "내 생각은 다른데. 너 혼자 알아서 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = d95dfda5-6e48-1219-74ac-9903ba991754
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:d95dfda5-6e48-1219-74ac-9903ba991754
msgctxt "h024aa239g4602g4ea2g9fe5g7784c9a68bfd"
msgid ""
"You know, I don't <i>really </i>want to kill you. So hear me out before you "
"do something you can't take back."
msgstr "저기, 난 <i>정말이지 </i>널 죽이고 싶지 않아. 그러니 돌이킬 수 없는 짓 하기 전에 내 말 좀 들어보라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = d9a017fe-ace7-db38-871f-042a55462a12
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:d9a017fe-ace7-db38-871f-042a55462a12
msgctxt "h5481d2b2g8bcfg4151g9869gef8b714265f4"
msgid ""
"So I have. And it looks like a bit of the Hells have come <i>with </i>me."
msgstr "그래, 맞아. 보아하니 지옥의 일부도 나를 <i>따라 </i>나온 모양인걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = dab4fc71-055c-b91f-8e6f-deaf1b62d06c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:dab4fc71-055c-b91f-8e6f-deaf1b62d06c
msgctxt "h23e77b81gf799g4b63gb4d9gdf3da7a113ce"
msgid ""
"True. I don't need you to speak. There's nothing you can say for yourself, "
"anyway."
msgstr "그러네. 너랑 말 섞을 필요 따윈 없지. 애초에 변명할 거리도 없을 텐데 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = dcbab0fb-af04-128e-b4be-f9835f70bc79
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Event_UnlockTGNoWyll = True
#.   Object:
#.     - OriginAddToParty(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:dcbab0fb-af04-128e-b4be-f9835f70bc79
msgctxt "h9ec439bfg73b6g424egb7b1gffada6fa9f88"
msgid "Phew, I'm getting all het up. Let's make tracks!"
msgstr "휴, 후끈 달아오르는걸. 출발해보자고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = dd3974d2-c705-3c37-b636-1449f9aa9676
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Karlach_Event_StopBurning = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:dd3974d2-c705-3c37-b636-1449f9aa9676
msgctxt "he96cab3dgcbfag4ec5gab72gf2c838db951f"
msgid ""
"Met some of the Elturians who got trapped in the Hells, though. They did "
"less time than me, but no easier."
msgstr "지옥에 갇혀 있던 엘투렐인은 몇 명 만나긴 했지. 나보단 짧게 있었지만 더 나은 팔자는 아니었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ddb5d2fd-a77d-28a9-0d59-9ab6930a790c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:ddb5d2fd-a77d-28a9-0d59-9ab6930a790c
msgctxt "h3d89acfagfa09g422dg9da3g85ca1693d04e"
msgid "You better not be lying. If I leave you be, it'll be a leap of faith."
msgstr "거짓말이 아니어야 할 거다. 네 말만 믿고 냅두는 거니까 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = de80426b-e56b-82c5-3b36-f69927ed896b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Karlach_Knows_InfernalEngineExists = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:de80426b-e56b-82c5-3b36-f69927ed896b
msgctxt "h059a0515gad84g41d3gbfb4g533aa8fca70c"
msgid ""
"Hear that? Infernal engine for a heart. Lets me burn as hot as the Hells. "
"Seems to be running in overdrive since I left Avernus."
msgstr ""
"들려? 심장용 지옥불 엔진이야. 이게 날 지옥만큼 뜨겁게 불타오르게 해줘. 그런데 아베르누스를 떠난 후부터 과부하에 걸린 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = df63a129-45f1-5428-38ac-053eea50d12d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:df63a129-45f1-5428-38ac-053eea50d12d
msgctxt "h94f297f2ge60cg446dg84fcg394d539e7d11"
msgid "Try again. And pick your next words carefully."
msgstr "다시 말해 봐. 이번에 뱉을 말은 신중히 고르라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = df7f01f3-8f87-4611-88c8-96dd86fd795d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(6) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:df7f01f3-8f87-4611-88c8-96dd86fd795d
msgctxt "h78792273g972fg48edgbee9g774eccbc9c7b"
msgid ""
"She's, erm, perhaps a little rough around the edges... but I suppose I can "
"be smooth enough for two..."
msgstr "저 친구는, 어... 살짝 성정이 거친 거 같은데... 뭐, 내가 두 사람 분만큼 부드럽게 굴면 되겠네..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = e0134282-6abd-0596-a883-b6d361e60f6c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Quest_ToldZarielFollowers(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:e0134282-6abd-0596-a883-b6d361e60f6c
msgctxt "h477e3c26g4f78g4e2eg8037gcde7ce4abfe5"
msgid ""
"The latest yappy little dogs she's sicced on me are nearby. A group of dopes "
"posing as Paladins of Tyr. Want to help me take 'em down?"
msgstr ""
"그년이 붙인 개새끼들 중 최근 지랄 떤 것들이 근처에 있지. 티르의 팔라딘으로 행세하는 똘추들이야. 놈들 없애는 거 도와보지 않을래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e0175689-9f29-c20e-1c70-3c7276174fda
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:e0175689-9f29-c20e-1c70-3c7276174fda
msgctxt "h3f6c53abg16fdg45dag80a1g4750394c406f"
msgid "I don't have to explain myself to you."
msgstr "너한테 구구절절이 해명할 거리 따위는 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = e05e9b83-66a3-a42f-b6c2-ca75c58c63c7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_State_HelpingKarlach = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:e05e9b83-66a3-a42f-b6c2-ca75c58c63c7
msgctxt "ha7de06b9g871ag4691gad02g00a708aa78bf"
msgid "Now we're talking."
msgstr "그렇게 나와주셔야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = e0795e72-a4a6-d773-f33a-8d40cb1e01ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Karlach_Knows_InfernalEngineExists = False
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitmentTollhouse_State_PaladinsPermaDefeated = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:e0795e72-a4a6-d773-f33a-8d40cb1e01ed
msgctxt "h29358ae0g3a97g49d0g86d0gf61ef987ab95"
msgid ""
"But hey, erm, if we're going to travel together, I think there's something "
"you should know."
msgstr "근데, 어, 앞으로 같이 다니게 된다면 네가 미리 알아둬야 할 점이 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = e1e7e08e-b12d-4ac3-312c-c4b2b4dfd09d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:e1e7e08e-b12d-4ac3-312c-c4b2b4dfd09d
msgctxt "h15433b8fg7a0eg42dbgbf13g8d542db929a7"
msgid "Stand back, or I'll melt your eyes out of your skull."
msgstr "물러서. 안 그럼 네 대갈통에서 눈알을 녹여 끄집어내 주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = e31dbe3a-0910-825e-717a-ab32b079334d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:e31dbe3a-0910-825e-717a-ab32b079334d
msgctxt "h07f6a852ga623g495cg932bg7a3d03fb888b"
msgid ""
"Damn. After a decade in hell, I was hoping for a little company. Especially "
"some who looked like you."
msgstr "젠장. 지옥에서 10년을 보낸 터라 친구 좀 생겼으면 했더니만. 특히 너처럼 생긴 친구가 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = e3bb1b7d-41c7-b594-a216-33249bc663a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:e3bb1b7d-41c7-b594-a216-33249bc663a0
msgctxt "h7e5d4f12gca2eg480cg82e4gd66ada392677"
msgid "Got no use for lies. Life's interesting enough on its own."
msgstr "거짓말을 얻다 써? 그런 거 안 해도 삶은 충분히 재미나다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = e5bf1f16-2884-44a0-6759-b46720fd9462
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_State_PersuasionSucceeded = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:e5bf1f16-2884-44a0-6759-b46720fd9462
msgctxt "hfa221593g6a2cg42aagbd9eg4a802828b1a9"
msgid ""
"That's a load of shit. But you know what? Today, I have other priorities."
msgstr "개소리 하고 있네. 근데 그거 알아? 나는 오늘 더 중요한 할 일이 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = e68216c6-2adb-62ca-d316-0944d70e2296
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:e68216c6-2adb-62ca-d316-0944d70e2296
msgctxt "h9055ef88g2a3bg421dga51bg1c39a65bd934"
msgid ""
"I played along until I could get the fuck out of there. Took me ten years to "
"properly escape, but now I'm <i>free</i>."
msgstr "난 기회 생길 때까지 놀아나 주다가 냅다 튀어버렸지. 제대로 탈출하기까지 십 년이 걸렸지만, 이제 난 <i>자유야</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = e74dfcea-dec9-0a6d-74c5-012c11722beb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:e74dfcea-dec9-0a6d-74c5-012c11722beb
msgctxt "h03db3f1agd089g45d0g9c17g774027fd6abf"
msgid ""
"Kill some fiends, evict a parasite, then take Faerûn by the short hairs. "
"Sound good?"
msgstr "마족 좀 죽이고, 기생충도 뽑아내고, 페이룬을 함께 틀어잡는 거야. 어때?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e84443f1-24b4-f853-dbb9-da22676d8b46
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Karlach_Quest_AgreedToHelpNotRecruited = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:e84443f1-24b4-f853-dbb9-da22676d8b46
msgctxt "hf861b77cg7c43g4010g9175g16864e3b9c97"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e88fd364-a58a-0f2b-e039-6e3f52a87b83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:e88fd364-a58a-0f2b-e039-6e3f52a87b83
msgctxt "h391f7e16gee2cg48f8gb418g6582458c721a"
msgid "Listen, it was all a misunderstanding. I didn't mean for them to die."
msgstr "이봐, 그건 전부 오해로 벌어진 일이었어. 그 사람들 죽일 생각은 없었다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = e9ec410c-c7cb-4587-b93a-db7bf6f744dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(4) = True
#. TagRule: !REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:e9ec410c-c7cb-4587-b93a-db7bf6f744dd
msgctxt "h3e187dbcgd08cg4a69g8b57g750fc236b6cb"
msgid ""
"You want to just team up with some blood-stained killer? Because I'm fine "
"with that."
msgstr "피로 얼룩진 살육자랑 한 편이 되고 싶은 거야? 나야 얼마든지 괜찮지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = e9ec410c-c7cb-4587-b93a-db7bf6f744dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(4) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:e9ec410c-c7cb-4587-b93a-db7bf6f744dd
msgctxt "h9facc8b2g60e9g42f2g8258gacbf6af80999"
msgid "She's almost as scary as you, Lae'zel. So naturally she gets my vote."
msgstr "거의 너만큼이나 무서운 여자네, 레이젤. 그럼 당연히 나도 찬성이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = ef9548f3-8573-294f-4765-a862b94c4af5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:ef9548f3-8573-294f-4765-a862b94c4af5
msgctxt "hcabe1efbg4299g45cdg992cg945829746726"
msgid ""
"I never killed anyone that didn't deserve it. Devils, demons, and the fiends "
"that serve 'em - no mercy."
msgstr "죽어도 싼 놈 말곤 아무도 죽인 적 없다고. 데빌, 데몬, 놈들 섬기는 마족한텐 얄짤 없긴 했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f27c5e49-7eea-7998-1bd7-e8626588e63d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:f27c5e49-7eea-7998-1bd7-e8626588e63d
msgctxt "h5c6264fdg5fa9g4a87gba71g4c12261ad999"
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr "넌 누구지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f2b80219-d278-8202-4f51-476c1dccf159
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_TieflingRefugees_State_LeftDen = False
#.      - DEN_PartyProgress_EnteredGrove = True
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_Event_TieflingPartyInvitation = False
#.      - PLA_KarlachRecruitment_State_DammonUnavailable = False
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_State_HostileTieflings = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Karlach_State_InSearchOfMechanic = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:f2b80219-d278-8202-4f51-476c1dccf159
msgctxt "h31a26cf8g984dg412bg8c80g6170c382150f"
msgid ""
"There are some tieflings holed up in a druid's grove nearby. We might look "
"there."
msgstr "근처 드루이드 숲에 어떤 티플링들이 숨어지내고 있어. 거길 찾아보는 게 어떨까 싶은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = f497561f-20be-be34-7ed1-37868a3c74d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:f497561f-20be-be34-7ed1-37868a3c74d2
msgctxt "he0b3efc0ge65fg4aaeg9bffg791b9f0facfc"
msgid ""
"Right. Some so-called paladins of Tyr are in hot pursuit of yours truly. "
"Karlach."
msgstr "맞다. 어떤 티르의 팔라딘들이란 것들이 누굴 쫓고 있단 얘기였지. 나, 칼라크를."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = f4e7f9bc-1f19-8e02-0f94-72b866522f07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Karlach_HasMet = True
#.     - ORI_Karlach_Event_StopBurning = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:f4e7f9bc-1f19-8e02-0f94-72b866522f07
msgctxt "h5bd48ec3gf2c9g49b3g886agcc5f35a58954"
msgid ""
"Well fuck <i>me</i>. It's you. From the mind flayers' ship. Let me guess: "
"you met a group of burnt Tyrran paladins on your way over."
msgstr ""
"이런 <i>씹</i>. 너구나. 마인드 플레이어 함선에서 봤던. 어디 보자. 아마 오는 길에 불에 그슬린 티르의 팔라딘 일행을 만나본 "
"모양이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = f602f3a5-d8d6-fd4b-c14f-4ae7fc6ae97f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:f602f3a5-d8d6-fd4b-c14f-4ae7fc6ae97f
msgctxt "h710c64fcgcaceg4ec9gbe14gdbca62af3fae"
msgid "Oh boy, an arsehole! Winning you over will be entertaining."
msgstr "어이구, 틱틱대기는! 이거 설득하는 재미가 있겠는걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f9513843-f1f5-692e-3f48-24c855dfa808
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:f9513843-f1f5-692e-3f48-24c855dfa808
msgctxt "h86045469g9f89g4e84ga62ag3acabb71dc66"
msgid "Neither. I just know what to do when I see a devil: kill it."
msgstr "둘 다 아닌데. 그저 데빌을 보면 뭘 해야 할지 알고 있을 뿐이지. 없애는 것."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = fc666e0b-011e-4fe6-4732-e8e8300ba43d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:fc666e0b-011e-4fe6-4732-e8e8300ba43d
msgctxt "h0e9b850eg26bfg4f7eg809eg7439257cc66d"
msgid ""
"Believe me, these guys are anything but holy knights. They serve an "
"archdevil; the same one I -"
msgstr "장담하는데, 놈들은 성기사랑 완전히 반대인 것들이야. 녀석들은 아크데빌을 섬겨. 날 부린 그년을 -"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = fcd99302-d302-53cd-ce08-ec68c44eeb48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GEN_MaxPlayerCountReached = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Tutorials_FullPartyRejection = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:fcd99302-d302-53cd-ce08-ec68c44eeb48
msgctxt "h3efd9861g58ffg407cg923bgc4a23cd5dce8"
msgid ""
"Hang on, though - looks like you've got enough backup at your side. Not sure "
"there's room for me."
msgstr "근데 잠깐만. 네 쪽은 이미 도와줄 애들이 충분한 것 같은데. 낄 자리가 있을지 모르겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = fd3bde56-55f0-81e8-459a-92d336bac2ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_Karlach_PostEA:fd3bde56-55f0-81e8-459a-92d336bac2ae
msgctxt "h3b348d41g3aacg46fcga798g06cdf4de000d"
msgid ""
"Maybe even manage a pat or bump without burning someone to death. It's been "
"a <i>long </i>time."
msgstr "잘 하면 쓰다듬거나 부딪힌 사람 태워 죽일 일 없어질지도 모르겠네. 진짜 <i>오랜만</i>에 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_PAD_DiscoveredPressurePlate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ea7cfc06-f410-457c-97cc-717e4ea87b51
