msgctxt "h51cde99cgb763g43f2gbe4cgd9af0cc115f5"
msgid "A pressure plate? Curious - there must be a trick to it."
msgstr "압력판이라? 흥미롭군 - 분명 뭔가 속임수가 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_PAD_DiscoveredPressurePlate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ea7cfc06-f410-457c-97cc-717e4ea87b51
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_PAD_DiscoveredPressurePlate:ea7cfc06-f410-457c-97cc-717e4ea87b51
msgctxt "hc026d17agd198g491bga885g34662b15cafe"
msgid "Hmm... there's something more to this. What am I missing?"
msgstr "흐음... 뭔가 더 있는 것 같은데, 뭘 놓친 걸까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_KarlachRecruitment_PAD_DiscoveredPressurePlate
