msgctxt "h37da6b5fg5cb4g49e9g94e7g00f299e3851c"
msgid "Zarys' chest? I bet it holds all sorts of treasures."
msgstr "자리스의 상자? 분명 온갖 종류의 보물이 들어있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 11d1fe2b-a00b-06a9-3c3c-490d16609b4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Quest_AgentsMissing = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD:11d1fe2b-a00b-06a9-3c3c-490d16609b4f
msgctxt "h53d1938cg6393g4ba3gbc83gcac79d22f75d"
msgid "Zarys was looking for this chest. Whatever it holds must be valuable."
msgstr "자리스가 찾고 있는 상자다. 뭐가 들어있든 분명 값진 것일 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 11d1fe2b-a00b-06a9-3c3c-490d16609b4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Quest_AgentsMissing = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD:11d1fe2b-a00b-06a9-3c3c-490d16609b4f
msgctxt "h73cabdc5g35d0g4fd9ga280gc6fef326ce61"
msgid ""
"They did not want to part with that chest. And their boss promised good coin "
"if it stays locked."
msgstr "이 상자랑 헤어지기 싫었을 거야. 그래서 잠긴 상태로 가져다주면, 젠타림 대장이 거액을 준다고 약속한 거겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 11d1fe2b-a00b-06a9-3c3c-490d16609b4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Quest_AgentsMissing = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD:11d1fe2b-a00b-06a9-3c3c-490d16609b4f
msgctxt "h68fc588eg8bbfg4b58g9949gb38bb9055146"
msgid ""
"Zarys was looking for this chest. Surely there's something valuable inside."
msgstr "자리스가 찾고 있는 상자야. 분명 가치 있는 무언가가 들어있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 11d1fe2b-a00b-06a9-3c3c-490d16609b4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Quest_AgentsMissing = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD:11d1fe2b-a00b-06a9-3c3c-490d16609b4f
msgctxt "h29a57885gf59cg4b65ga355g9ff9c47f3f48"
msgid "Zarys' treasure. Must be something good."
msgstr "자리스의 보물이네. 분명 좋은 걸 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 11d1fe2b-a00b-06a9-3c3c-490d16609b4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Quest_AgentsMissing = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD:11d1fe2b-a00b-06a9-3c3c-490d16609b4f
msgctxt "he4b00619gc5bcg4548g9171g6984ca93f210"
msgid ""
"Looks like Zarys' missing shipment. It must be hiding quite the treasure."
msgstr "자리스의 잃어버린 화물 같네. 분명 엄청난 보물이 숨겨져 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 11d1fe2b-a00b-06a9-3c3c-490d16609b4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Quest_AgentsMissing = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD:11d1fe2b-a00b-06a9-3c3c-490d16609b4f
msgctxt "h677bc17dg8344g4933g8f01g60db6123c2aa"
msgid ""
"The chest's clearly worth a lot to the Zhentarim, <i>if </i>it's returned "
"unopened."
msgstr "이 상자는 분명 젠타림에게 큰 가치가 있을 거야, 열지 않고 돌려줬을 <i>때</i> 얘기지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3f7898ee-8424-421b-922e-7ef5aa396301
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD:3f7898ee-8424-421b-922e-7ef5aa396301
msgctxt "ha43a4ab0gbc97g42efgba74g1d6ed98a4aa1"
msgid ""
"Hm - but it does raise a question: what if its contents are more valuable "
"than the reward?"
msgstr "흠... 하지만 의심이 생기는군. 만약 내용물이 보상보다 더 가치 있는 거라면 어떡하지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3f7898ee-8424-421b-922e-7ef5aa396301
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD:3f7898ee-8424-421b-922e-7ef5aa396301
msgctxt "h4ae22448gdefcg44d3g9093g1a4e73344c24"
msgid "Is her reward more precious than the contents of the chest? Doubtable."
msgstr "그녀의 보상이 이 상자의 내용물보다 더 가치 있을 거 같나? 의심스럽군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3f7898ee-8424-421b-922e-7ef5aa396301
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD:3f7898ee-8424-421b-922e-7ef5aa396301
msgctxt "h05e056f4g51e6g494dgad94g87b99e521949"
msgid ""
"She <i>was </i>very clear that we shouldn't open it... but what if we did, "
"though?"
msgstr "그녀가 열지 말라고 분명히 얘기하긴 <i>했지만</i>... 만약 열게 된다면?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3f7898ee-8424-421b-922e-7ef5aa396301
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD:3f7898ee-8424-421b-922e-7ef5aa396301
msgctxt "haf8597bdgfe73g4196gae77g6674a2491656"
msgid ""
"She'll pay handsomely for its safe return... but what's inside that she "
"cares about so much?"
msgstr "그녀에게 안전히 돌려주면 후하게 보상해 줄 거야... 하지만 뭐가 들어있길래 그렇게 신경 쓰는 걸까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3f7898ee-8424-421b-922e-7ef5aa396301
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD:3f7898ee-8424-421b-922e-7ef5aa396301
msgctxt "h44df6984g3761g4e4fgaa73g8a560b0a35c1"
msgid "But maybe it's worth more than the prize money, right?"
msgstr "하지만 상금보다 더 가치 있을 수도 있잖아, 안 그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3f7898ee-8424-421b-922e-7ef5aa396301
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD:3f7898ee-8424-421b-922e-7ef5aa396301
msgctxt "h41b63d8bgd73dg4d46gaae4g79290d247fc9"
msgid "Let's hope our fee isn't worth less than its contents."
msgstr "우리의 수수료가 이 상자의 내용물보다 더 싸지 않길 바라자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3f7898ee-8424-421b-922e-7ef5aa396301
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD:3f7898ee-8424-421b-922e-7ef5aa396301
msgctxt "hb57d96b5gc2b0g4e9ag9cd8g3bb9ee4135c0"
msgid ""
"Yes, but who knows what's inside? It could be worth more than any purse "
"she'll offer."
msgstr "그래, 하지만 뭐가 들어있을지 누가 알겠어? 그녀가 줄 돈주머니보다 더 가치 있는 걸 수도 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 599dced3-8afd-4c66-b323-2ba35831b201
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Quest_AgentsMissing = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD:599dced3-8afd-4c66-b323-2ba35831b201
msgctxt "hb44b5c21g02a2g4b5fgb15dg364055ebe397"
msgid ""
"You don't hide trinkets in a box like that. There's something good rattling "
"around in there."
msgstr "너도 저런 상자에 싸구려 장신구 따위를 숨기진 않을 거야. 뭔가 꽤 좋은 게 들어있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 599dced3-8afd-4c66-b323-2ba35831b201
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Quest_AgentsMissing = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD:599dced3-8afd-4c66-b323-2ba35831b201
msgctxt "h51695c1eg7452g41d4g83aaga6089cb8b7da"
msgid "A weighty-looking chest. What treasures might that be filled with?"
msgstr "무게감 있어 보이는 상자네. 어떤 보물들로 가득 차 있으려나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 599dced3-8afd-4c66-b323-2ba35831b201
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Quest_AgentsMissing = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD:599dced3-8afd-4c66-b323-2ba35831b201
msgctxt "h8422d0ddg083fg4e13gb6e5gf5cba58d8dfe"
msgid ""
"An unusual chest. The sort that holds more than just a few worthless baubles."
msgstr "특이한 형태의 상자군. 싸구려 물건 몇 개 담기에는 어울리지 않는 종류야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 599dced3-8afd-4c66-b323-2ba35831b201
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Quest_AgentsMissing = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD:599dced3-8afd-4c66-b323-2ba35831b201
msgctxt "h71d4645cga57fg47bfg9400g4f8c498d11cd"
msgid "That's a curious-looking chest. I wonder what's inside."
msgstr "이상하게 생긴 상자야. 뭐가 들어있는지 궁금하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 599dced3-8afd-4c66-b323-2ba35831b201
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Quest_AgentsMissing = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD:599dced3-8afd-4c66-b323-2ba35831b201
msgctxt "h7617acacg6ff9g404dgb1fcg4256b14c4534"
msgid ""
"Now that's what I call a chest. More than just a few trinkets in there, I "
"wager."
msgstr "저 정도는 돼야 귀중품 담는 상자라 할 수 있지. 싸구려 물건 몇 개보다 귀한 것이 담겨있을 거야, 보증할게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 599dced3-8afd-4c66-b323-2ba35831b201
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Quest_AgentsMissing = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD:599dced3-8afd-4c66-b323-2ba35831b201
msgctxt "ha031d072g5082g47e2gb6f3g106bb5ccc30a"
msgid "What a chest."
msgstr "멋진 상자네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 599dced3-8afd-4c66-b323-2ba35831b201
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Quest_AgentsMissing = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD:599dced3-8afd-4c66-b323-2ba35831b201
msgctxt "hb910584agb25fg4d62ga710g8170f68b657a"
msgid ""
"You don't craft a chest like that to hold trinkets. There must be something "
"valuable inside."
msgstr "싸구려 장신구 담으려고 저런 상자를 만들진 않지. 가치 있는 뭔가가 들어있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD
