msgid "So what are we waiting for? Let's crack it open and see."
msgstr "그럼 뭘 기다리는 거야? 따서 열어 보자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD
