msgid "No harm in taking a peek, surely."
msgstr "분명, 살짝 엿본다고 해가 되진 않을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_PreciousCargo_PAD
