msgctxt "h666b5ceag1940g495ag985dg26f49a8173bf"
msgid "... infernal... servant... so long I've forgotten... why..."
msgstr "... 지옥의... 하수인... 왠지... 오랫동안 잊고 있었어..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_Refugee_Dead_PostEA
