msgid "Stop that, or there'll be trouble. The dead deserve their rest."
msgstr "문제 일으키고 싶지 않거든 그만 둬요. 망자에게 안식을 좀 주라고요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_Refugee_SpokeWithDeadCrime
#. Speaker = GROUP_ZarielCultists
#. NodeID = 4a67888c-c5fb-60ac-7c06-5b50cc8ad6c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
