msgid "Green blouse, brown hair - that must be Miri."
msgstr "초록 블라우스에, 갈색 머리. 분명 미리겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_StuckHalfElf_PAD_FoundWife
