msgid "Exactly as described. Apart from being dead."
msgstr "묘사한 그대로야. 죽었다는 점만 빼면."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_StuckHalfElf_PAD_FoundWife
#. Speaker = Player
