msgid "Excellent armour - strange place to find it."
msgstr "훌륭한 갑옷이군. 이런 곳에서 찾다니 의외인걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_Tavern_VB_DeadDrow1Armor_WithDrow
