"You're not actually intending to waste time hunting this Karlach person, are "
"you?"
msgstr "정말 이 칼라크라는 사람을 쫓는 데 시간을 낭비할 생각은 아니지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_Tollhouse_PAD_RefugeesAreCultists
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f3fdfd99-4dfb-4cca-b2fc-ea277e221fe3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
