msgctxt "h8f67d1d7gb3dfg4690g9fafga984dc1dd65a"
msgid ""
"We may have more important pursuits - but when it comes to slaying the "
"Hells' minions, I'll find the time."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_Tollhouse_PAD_RefugeesAreCultists
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f3fdfd99-4dfb-4cca-b2fc-ea277e221fe3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_Tollhouse_PAD_RefugeesAreCultists:f3fdfd99-4dfb-4cca-b2fc-ea277e221fe3
msgctxt "h8c261746g4dccg4d07g95a5g93fa2438144b"
msgid ""
"I have to say I don't know if agreeing to this hunt was such a wise idea."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_Tollhouse_PAD_RefugeesAreCultists
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f3fdfd99-4dfb-4cca-b2fc-ea277e221fe3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_Tollhouse_PAD_RefugeesAreCultists:f3fdfd99-4dfb-4cca-b2fc-ea277e221fe3
msgctxt "hfe826671g4526g41a8g8525g56e16d40642f"
msgid "Are we really going to hunt a devil on their behalf?"
msgstr ""

