msgctxt "h77f21deeg8c7eg402bgaf18g030108820af5"
msgid "There's a breeze down here. Wonder where it's coming from."
msgstr "바람이 느껴지는데. 어디서 불어오는 건지 궁금하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_InvestigationCheck
