msgctxt "h1926ddccg364bg46c9g905cg2a4a0b200651"
msgid "Locked. Best find another way in."
msgstr "잠겼군. 다른 길을 찾아봐야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_UseLift
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1048d8e1-fdaf-6163-6a1b-77b9ba52dd84
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_UseLift:1048d8e1-fdaf-6163-6a1b-77b9ba52dd84
msgctxt "h1faa1961ga1afg4ecegad92gfbaee3d53941"
msgid "Doesn't work."
msgstr "작동하지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents
#. Speaker = Rugan
#. NodeID = 03fd033d-aa22-dff9-b0c7-c9f8ed50d73e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents:03fd033d-aa22-dff9-b0c7-c9f8ed50d73e
msgctxt "had07b267g52f0g4209g8557g90873a01ae97"
msgid "Lass, if you hate me that much, hire someone to kill me."
msgstr "아가씨, 내가 그렇게 싫다면, 날 죽여줄 사람을 고용하라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents
#. Speaker = Rugan
#. NodeID = 0a17b6d0-409f-8f5d-53fe-b687f0435e9e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents:0a17b6d0-409f-8f5d-53fe-b687f0435e9e
msgctxt "hff7bb695g2eb5g472aga6c9g93a0d1512232"
msgid "Avoiding the Underdark, for one."
msgstr "첫 번째로, 언더다크를 피하려는 거지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents
#. Speaker = Rugan
#. NodeID = 0a4f9443-b45f-232d-ed71-66cbde501202
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents:0a4f9443-b45f-232d-ed71-66cbde501202
msgctxt "h47dcf565ga3b5g4b09gb2a9gaced7b3cbe10"
msgid "Oh, lad. That just shows we care!"
msgstr "오, 친구여. 그거야말로 우리가 신경쓴다는 증거지!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents
#. Speaker = Olly
#. NodeID = 162d2b5a-6693-b22e-b5ee-15123aa612df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 720e85fb-cc00-b81a-efff-343a04ca221e_A = True
#.      - 720e85fb-cc00-b81a-efff-343a04ca221e_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 720e85fb-cc00-b81a-efff-343a04ca221e_A = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents:162d2b5a-6693-b22e-b5ee-15123aa612df
msgctxt "h525a578bg5b7eg4a3fg8528gddff39e9562f"
msgid ""
"I'm sick of hiding down in the dark. This ain't why I joined the Zahent!"
msgstr "어둠 속에서 숨어 지내는 것도 이제 지긋지긋해. 이러려고 자엔트에 가입한 게 아니라고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 2561c96f-1f19-c3b6-7fcb-b20158a02845
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents:2561c96f-1f19-c3b6-7fcb-b20158a02845
msgctxt "hc2de439egda3bg4988g9752gd70f9a1d902b"
msgid "My way's cheaper."
msgstr "내 방법이 더 싸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents
#. Speaker = Rugan
#. NodeID = 5365cec8-c283-2cd2-9540-1905ec5809cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 720e85fb-cc00-b81a-efff-343a04ca221e_A = False
#.      - 720e85fb-cc00-b81a-efff-343a04ca221e_B = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 720e85fb-cc00-b81a-efff-343a04ca221e_A = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents:5365cec8-c283-2cd2-9540-1905ec5809cd
msgctxt "h45e028a9g7727g4fd0g8be2g126d86b9d8f1"
msgid "The doggies nearly got me this time. It was close."
msgstr "이번에는 개들이 거의 날 잡아먹을 뻔 했지. 아슬아슬 했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents
#. Speaker = Rugan
#. NodeID = 54608416-6ec3-c7d0-050e-b337cb0f7913
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents:54608416-6ec3-c7d0-050e-b337cb0f7913
msgctxt "h3f9da0a7gb77dg4755gbe96g2ca2d53454c3"
msgid "It's pronounced 'Zent', lad. The H is silent."
msgstr "자엔트가 아니라 '젠트'야, 친구. ㅏ는 묵음이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents
#. Speaker = Rugan
#. NodeID = 68d4eaf2-fe67-a5e6-d891-56f69482c10b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_State_Intimidated = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 720e85fb-cc00-b81a-efff-343a04ca221e_A = True
#.      - 720e85fb-cc00-b81a-efff-343a04ca221e_B = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 720e85fb-cc00-b81a-efff-343a04ca221e_B = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents:68d4eaf2-fe67-a5e6-d891-56f69482c10b
msgctxt "h6d16f57eg308eg40cag93f1g97881d63be62"
msgid ""
"I'm told we're taking a stroll through the Underdark once we blow the "
"charges."
msgstr "듣기로는 이 화약을 터뜨리고 나면 언더다크를 통해서 산책을 떠난다고 하던데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 69f02bc5-0ce4-67e1-d164-b3a2759e5c39
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents:69f02bc5-0ce4-67e1-d164-b3a2759e5c39
msgctxt "hca0e290fgb84fg4a28gba5dg14ad99eca23f"
msgid "Not close enough."
msgstr "아직 멀었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 7070e78f-dbe7-5458-b97c-334b2b87c214
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents:7070e78f-dbe7-5458-b97c-334b2b87c214
msgctxt "h8d7304a4g8bb8g4bfegab7cg941b6084c829"
msgid "I do it because it makes me hate him less."
msgstr "내가 왜 그렇게 하냐면 그렇게 하면 그가 조금 덜 미워지니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents
#. Speaker = Olly
#. NodeID = 764aba96-5aee-5aef-0e4e-c0ab0c946d54
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents:764aba96-5aee-5aef-0e4e-c0ab0c946d54
msgctxt "h29960490g7ca1g4fdbgbbf4gbda2b3dfb1d1"
msgid "I don't care. I want out of this damn cave."
msgstr "상관없어. 이 망할 동굴에서 나가고 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents
#. Speaker = Rugan
#. NodeID = ada50bb2-dc84-43d8-33ef-186c9ad34b68
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents:ada50bb2-dc84-43d8-33ef-186c9ad34b68
msgctxt "h6df19ec9g2243g4af5g8d31ga3c76c2138c0"
msgid "See? You're among friends."
msgstr "봤지? 넌 친구들 사이에 있는 거라구."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents
#. Speaker = Rugan
#. NodeID = b6c10e57-4156-af57-6b27-06173c87a69d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents:b6c10e57-4156-af57-6b27-06173c87a69d
msgctxt "h6d64661egaed5g4a4bgace6g35caee8f7acc"
msgid ""
"The route with fewer hook horrors and other beasties? Perish the thought."
msgstr "후크호러나 괴물들이 적을만한 경로? 그런건 생각도 하지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents
#. Speaker = Olly
#. NodeID = c9115dc5-e270-630a-d2b3-c485db23e5f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 720e85fb-cc00-b81a-efff-343a04ca221e_A = False
#.      - 720e85fb-cc00-b81a-efff-343a04ca221e_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 720e85fb-cc00-b81a-efff-343a04ca221e_B = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents:c9115dc5-e270-630a-d2b3-c485db23e5f7
msgctxt "h948fda3bg87afg473cg91e9gdf3f4d6db455"
msgid "You lot are always making fun of me."
msgstr "너희들은 항상 나를 조롱하고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = d0707543-5b07-dc5f-e46c-c3e275dc311b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents:d0707543-5b07-dc5f-e46c-c3e275dc311b
msgctxt "h2b14b53age8ffg470bg8214gf7ace2252516"
msgid "Why, scared of gahosts?"
msgstr "왜에, 유령이 무서워어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents
#. Speaker = Rugan
#. NodeID = d95ce77b-ab15-b695-1154-a988e933ec52
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 720e85fb-cc00-b81a-efff-343a04ca221e_A = True
#.      - 720e85fb-cc00-b81a-efff-343a04ca221e_B = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 720e85fb-cc00-b81a-efff-343a04ca221e_B = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents:d95ce77b-ab15-b695-1154-a988e933ec52
msgctxt "h1043ed86g916dg4266gb8f9g39502caea806"
msgid ""
"I'm told we're taking a stroll through the Underdark once we blow the "
"charges."
msgstr "듣기로는 이 화약을 터뜨리고 나면 언더다크를 통해서 산책을 떠난다고 하던데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = e4c61df9-c273-9772-e1a8-0048e5f3ab9d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents:e4c61df9-c273-9772-e1a8-0048e5f3ab9d
msgctxt "h4f15f230gb62fg42dagae7cg7cab5573d8b1"
msgid "How did a coward like you survive all these years in the Network?"
msgstr "너 같은 겁쟁이가 이렇게 오랜 시간동안 네트워크에서 어떻게 살아남았냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = fcc53056-7585-8ef0-6a3a-e8f32c7a5c53
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents:fcc53056-7585-8ef0-6a3a-e8f32c7a5c53
msgctxt "hc817ed37g68aeg4addg8cbbg731a61974095"
msgid "Let me guess. You'd rather take the surface."
msgstr "맞춰 볼게. 너는 겉모습을 선택하겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents_OllyDead
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 1abe1e8f-0d65-ce61-6bc5-2ebb6570c411
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_State_Intimidated = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 5e9c089e-b95c-2a0a-d1ca-4ee601aafa9d_B = False
#.      - 5e9c089e-b95c-2a0a-d1ca-4ee601aafa9d_A = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents_OllyDead:1abe1e8f-0d65-ce61-6bc5-2ebb6570c411
msgctxt "h2d2b5c2cg10e8g4728gb2a1g6aa71eb804ed"
msgid "How did Olly die, anyway?"
msgstr "그런데, 올리는 어떻게 죽은거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents_OllyDead
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 29c8cf74-872f-58e6-1bfa-dfe488e371d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_State_Intimidated = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 5e9c089e-b95c-2a0a-d1ca-4ee601aafa9d_B = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents_OllyDead:29c8cf74-872f-58e6-1bfa-dfe488e371d9
msgctxt "hf1ed899bgfa62g47d5ga043ge699c78e26c9"
msgid "When we set off, I want you at the front of the convoy."
msgstr "우리가 출발할 때, 너를 호송대 가장 앞에 두고 싶군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents_OllyDead
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 3e05ddd1-d6be-ba8f-a7b5-9c682daba7f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents_OllyDead:3e05ddd1-d6be-ba8f-a7b5-9c682daba7f6
msgctxt "h5aef6689g2a01g4368gb2bbgb39ab38e5c5a"
msgid "If we leave you behind,  is that rear enough?"
msgstr "만약 우리가 너를 뒤에 두고 떠나면, 그게 충분히 뒤인 걸까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents_OllyDead
#. Speaker = Rugan
#. NodeID = 5a5daece-412b-ef6e-e674-1c5d4613564c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 5e9c089e-b95c-2a0a-d1ca-4ee601aafa9d_B = False
#.     - 5e9c089e-b95c-2a0a-d1ca-4ee601aafa9d_A = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents_OllyDead:5a5daece-412b-ef6e-e674-1c5d4613564c
msgctxt "h1f304ed8gc828g4e45ga35bgb16e639e531d"
msgid "You drive a hard bargain. The middle it is."
msgstr "흥정을 힘들게 만드는군. 그렇다면 중간으로 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents_OllyDead
#. Speaker = Rugan
#. NodeID = 8c327f5c-b4c1-f5b9-bb9a-5c1c5160a934
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 5e9c089e-b95c-2a0a-d1ca-4ee601aafa9d_B = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents_OllyDead:8c327f5c-b4c1-f5b9-bb9a-5c1c5160a934
msgctxt "h2324b088g2a47g4e54g91a2g54e50cd32d76"
msgid "Painfully. I don't want to talk about it."
msgstr "아프구만. 거기에 대해서는 얘기하고 싶지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents_OllyDead
#. Speaker = Rugan
#. NodeID = deb37a83-295d-5693-90d5-c8a3e0328f59
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_AD_ZhentShipmentAgents_OllyDead:deb37a83-295d-5693-90d5-c8a3e0328f59
msgctxt "hd43211b6gf710g4811ga892ga14ab1a125c7"
msgid "No thank you. I'm a rear-guard man, always have been."
msgstr "됐어. 난 후방을 방어해왔어, 지금까지 항상 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Dog_01
#. Speaker = Indra
#. NodeID = 52b8a72f-3950-32a1-5e18-b31b54e0877f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Dog_01:52b8a72f-3950-32a1-5e18-b31b54e0877f
msgctxt "h87996977ge938g4032gb12fg39fd5d8d193e"
msgid "*Growl.*"
msgstr "*으르렁.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Dog_01
#. Speaker = Indra
#. NodeID = 69d977d8-9e7a-8b2b-a74e-479d8506f10e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Dog_01_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Dog_01_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Dog_01:69d977d8-9e7a-8b2b-a74e-479d8506f10e
msgctxt "h3bd5303ag9a87g4cb8g98bag8c28327b51de"
msgid "The dark smells wrong. Not night-dark. <i>Waiting</i>-dark."
msgstr "이 어둠은 뭔가 잘못되었단 냄새가 난다 . 밤의 어둠이 아니다. <i>기다리던 </i> 어둠이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Dog_01
#. Speaker = Indra
#. NodeID = a95b8202-0a8e-5b9c-a3db-33bbe60700fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Dog_01_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Dog_01:a95b8202-0a8e-5b9c-a3db-33bbe60700fa
msgctxt "h22174e01gb7f0g41cbga9e2gd175f0e309fd"
msgid "Have to stay with master. Keep master from the dark."
msgstr "주인님과 함께 있어야 합니다. 어둠으로부터 주인님을 지켜야해요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Dog_02
#. Speaker = Isbeth
#. NodeID = 297eddf7-5e10-b552-8217-7ee9468729ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Dog_02:297eddf7-5e10-b552-8217-7ee9468729ae
msgctxt "hba6f9f46g7dddg4f2eg9bcfg7c260b0ef853"
msgid "*Pant.*"
msgstr "*헥헥.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Dog_02
#. Speaker = Isbeth
#. NodeID = 72ec1bd2-2949-5cd5-d6de-04d505e5b825
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Dog_02_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Dog_02:72ec1bd2-2949-5cd5-d6de-04d505e5b825
msgctxt "h98809077gad2dg444fgb6aag83dcf0d420b3"
msgid "Going round <i>again. </i>Can't we just lie down?"
msgstr "<i>또</i> 제자리잖아. 그냥 누워서 쉬면 안 돼?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Dog_02
#. Speaker = Isbeth
#. NodeID = dfd0da7c-f12f-ac93-b907-4719088fa0c5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Dog_02_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Dog_02_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Dog_02:dfd0da7c-f12f-ac93-b907-4719088fa0c5
msgctxt "h00ab2e16ga37cg4e78gaa0dg911c23a909b0"
msgid "Around and around again. Master gets confused, I think."
msgstr "계속 빙글빙글 돌기만 하네. 주인이 헷갈리나 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Dog_03
#. Speaker = Istor
#. NodeID = 04f4fae5-6708-c9f4-b84b-8ef269cd4cb5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Dog_03_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Dog_03_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Dog_03:04f4fae5-6708-c9f4-b84b-8ef269cd4cb5
msgctxt "h0b6110e1g007fg4608gb515gc406eb856922"
msgid "Careful! No stone-scent. No stone-sound. Strange-stone here."
msgstr "조심해! 돌 냄새도 안나고 돌 소리도 안나. 이 돌은 이상한걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Dog_03
#. Speaker = Istor
#. NodeID = a9e596eb-fdf3-98ea-b71b-64a25578056f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Dog_03:a9e596eb-fdf3-98ea-b71b-64a25578056f
msgctxt "h864c6023gffa0g45e6gb13fg0e5eb3725f03"
msgid "*Yap!*"
msgstr "*얍!*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Dog_03
#. Speaker = Istor
#. NodeID = df48a241-e7eb-3609-1e92-d7adab50577c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Dog_03_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Dog_03:df48a241-e7eb-3609-1e92-d7adab50577c
msgctxt "hbdc3226eg2fdbg4846gbe3bgf59312fea5d9"
msgid "I do not understand. But I will guard this nothing-stone."
msgstr "이해가 안되는걸. 그래도 이 돌 아닌 돌을 지키도록 할게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 019449ac-ddd4-dafb-165a-c81c1beb9fc1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:019449ac-ddd4-dafb-165a-c81c1beb9fc1
msgctxt "hfa1f6110g65d9g48f8gbd1dg81990dd7ee1f"
msgid ""
"It seems you've made quite the profit. My patron will see you rewarded - my "
"<i>betrothed</i>, I should say."
msgstr "당신은 꽤 많은 이득을 보실 것 같군요. 제 후원자가 당신에게 보상을 줄 것입니다. 제 <i>약혼녀</i>라고 해야겠군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 021d12d6-6b24-7ec4-29dc-93081a2b78f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_DoubtingArtist_Knows_TwoLoves(1) = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_TwoLoveStory(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:021d12d6-6b24-7ec4-29dc-93081a2b78f0
msgctxt "hee229becg0b5fg446cgbca6g88e211d85aed"
msgid ""
"I did not <i>run away </i>- a date was never set. There were... "
"complications."
msgstr "저는 <i>도망치지</i> 않았습니다. 날짜도 정해지지 않았어요. 복잡한 문제가 있었죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 055260f6-58c2-0bd3-2fd1-5c00e7919d7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:055260f6-58c2-0bd3-2fd1-5c00e7919d7c
msgctxt "h963bbea4gba44g40dfg8b8fg4b98bc98509b"
msgid ""
"Say - you couldn't spare a little coin, could you? Ease the discomforts of "
"the road some?"
msgstr "송구스럽지만 동전을 좀 주실 수 있습니까? 귀환길의 불편함을 조금이라도 덜어주실 수 있을까요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 058763ea-4142-6164-e4a3-48c5426ee8cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - PLA_DoubtingArtist_State_HasPainting1(1) = True
#.      - PLA_DoubtingArtist_State_HasPainting2(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:058763ea-4142-6164-e4a3-48c5426ee8cc
msgctxt "he604cfbbg0433g4cfcgb6e5gaf20d5ba9082"
msgid "I have your paintings."
msgstr "당신 그림들을 가지고 있어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 08bb9b4d-62a2-2439-917f-7ec6557c99af
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:08bb9b4d-62a2-2439-917f-7ec6557c99af
msgctxt "h76c69737g7504g4c2cg8b1fg84d80fd09770"
msgid ""
"Before my fame, my patron, there was... another woman. One I planned to "
"spend my life with."
msgstr "저의 명성, 저의 후원자를 얻기 이전에... 저는 다른 여자가 있었습니다. 평생을 함께하기로 했던 여자였습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 08e91f07-c1d3-82b8-59d7-f475f54d8fa3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:08e91f07-c1d3-82b8-59d7-f475f54d8fa3
msgctxt "hfbdede08g720dg4659gbe9cg1127233f84c8"
msgid "... no, thank you."
msgstr "... 아니, 괜찮습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 08f1089c-efb5-5d00-7873-5f0668cad167
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 0
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 7fdf594d-eaf0-034c-0b29-93adcbc74449_MindHasBeenRead = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CanDetectThoughts_2 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:08f1089c-efb5-5d00-7873-5f0668cad167
msgctxt "he5963d30g55a7g4174ga2feg8043ee22af6b"
msgid "<i>Read his mind.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그의 생각을 읽는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 0ad50f91-a40f-4ef7-88e0-088ccac2fee1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:0ad50f91-a40f-4ef7-88e0-088ccac2fee1
msgctxt "h42d8e3b1gcbfeg441bg96a4ga9fc88a9f366"
msgid "You were... rather quick to agree. But all the wiser for it."
msgstr "당신은... 생각보다 수긍이 빠르시네요. 하지만 그게 현명한 길입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 0e728bd5-47e6-2467-9d0b-321b8d85b105
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_DoubtingArtist_HasMet(1) = True
#.      - PLA_DoubtingArtist_HasMet_BremDead(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_State_Zhent03_Dead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:0e728bd5-47e6-2467-9d0b-321b8d85b105
msgctxt "h930a1cfcgeeb7g4dafg90f5ge792ae65943a"
msgid "I rather suspected I'd die in a sunless hole. Just not <i>this </i>one."
msgstr "언젠가 빛 한 점 없는 지하에서 죽겠거니 싶었지만, <i>여기</i>일 줄이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 0ed6a468-c06d-a0f3-ab55-33393e07d888
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_DoubtingArtist_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_Rugan_Knows_Thief = True
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_State_GnollZhentsPresent = True
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_State_FallBack = False
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_State_ChestLost = True
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_State_JoinedZhent = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_DoubtingArtist_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:0ed6a468-c06d-a0f3-ab55-33393e07d888
msgctxt "h82f5a234g108cg44b2gb377g9042ff6b12e9"
msgid "No, no thank you!"
msgstr "아니, 괘 괜찮습니다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 10319bc2-33b0-674e-2470-f343068df7f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:10319bc2-33b0-674e-2470-f343068df7f5
msgctxt "h39edbad4gf395g4e8dg9234g06801665caa1"
msgid ""
"One so grand that even blind Tyr himself will weep to see it - but first, "
"speak to Brem. Please."
msgstr "너무나 장려해서 눈먼 티르 본인이 와도 눈물을 흘릴 정도겠군요. 하지만 먼저, 브렘과 이야기하시죠. 부탁입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 103c5f28-4021-8a8b-0eb5-7461eccdcb76
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:103c5f28-4021-8a8b-0eb5-7461eccdcb76
msgctxt "hef223e92ga6f1g4de6g9e7fg71922dd4da76"
msgid ""
"I'm an artist. These faithless bastards were trying to ransom me back to my "
"patron."
msgstr "저는 예술가입니다. 이 상종 못할 자식들이 제 후원자에게 제 몸값을 요구하려고 했어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 105f2f62-dca9-da95-1f0a-34bb27e914de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_DoubtingArtist_State_Leaving = True
#.     - PLA_DoubtingArtist_State_FledAfterCalledSlave = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ArtistFled(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:105f2f62-dca9-da95-1f0a-34bb27e914de
msgctxt "h3835560egda6ag488bg8625g742b4b3d5c31"
msgid ""
"You can SHOVE your boots where even Lathander can't light - I'm no one's "
"slave!"
msgstr "라샌더도 불을 밝힐 수 없는 곳에 부츠를 넣어도 좋습니다 - 나는 누구의 노예도 아니야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1276c559-6643-3e85-4ec2-cb4821b80928
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Knows_OfferedToKill(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Knows_OfferedToKill(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:1276c559-6643-3e85-4ec2-cb4821b80928
msgctxt "h5c8bdb26g8b6eg4e8eg9624gdc5a4942abff"
msgid "Fine. I will."
msgstr "좋아요. 그렇게 하죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 14f4ff42-97a3-a7cc-ea1b-c4ae96e6b646
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BALDURIAN(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - LOW_OskarsBeloved_State_MentionedJannathInAct1 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:14f4ff42-97a3-a7cc-ea1b-c4ae96e6b646
msgctxt "h7c6113b0g4881g4f52g99adg6a045daf8039"
msgid ""
"Assuming Lady Jannath still wishes to marry after our little... falling out."
msgstr "자나스 아가씨가 저희의 사소한... 결별 후에도 여전히 결혼을 원한다고 가정하면 말입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 1584d179-dd38-0a60-ecdc-c4e8186cb0cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_DoubtingArtist_State_Leaving = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_LeftForBG(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:1584d179-dd38-0a60-ecdc-c4e8186cb0cb
msgctxt "hc2af29ddg175eg44a2g84f9g49c669e26160"
msgid "Until Baldur's Gate, then!"
msgstr "그럼 발더스 게이트에서 다시 봅시다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 174f06ff-62b4-9bcc-2015-9e560fd004dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:174f06ff-62b4-9bcc-2015-9e560fd004dd
msgctxt "hd9ccebc3g26b8g495cg95f7ga071f5f1ac37"
msgid ""
"I made a timely retreat into the countryside. To paint, and clear my head. "
"To <i>choose</i>, I suppose."
msgstr "저는 잠시 시골로 내려갔습니다. 그림을 그리고, 머리를 비우기 위해서요. 그리고 어쩌면, <i>선택</i>을 위해서였겠죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 17828d07-3ac5-6a0f-3131-cf5a3d891389
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:17828d07-3ac5-6a0f-3131-cf5a3d891389
msgctxt "h1ac82b25g30b2g4b69ga43eg163557cb3be5"
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr "당신은 누구죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 18ba5adc-5692-1e10-c404-9028799e4e3a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:18ba5adc-5692-1e10-c404-9028799e4e3a
msgctxt "h836f4dd1g7d57g4e2dg9b93g21f7f728c3bb"
msgid ""
"Their objective perfection is what caught these bastards' eyes to begin "
"with. Now that I'm free..."
msgstr "애초에 객관적으로 완벽하기에 이 개자식들의 눈에 든 겁니다. 이제 자유의 몸이 되었으니..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 18f0acd7-a1ac-9aa9-e41b-a914fb3b1a95
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_DoubtingArtist_HasMet(1) = True
#.      - PLA_DoubtingArtist_HasMet_BremDead(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_State_Zhent03_Dead = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_DoubtingArtist_HasMet_BremDead(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:18f0acd7-a1ac-9aa9-e41b-a914fb3b1a95
msgctxt "h76c0eef5g5843g445fg9addgbc2b99f25e34"
msgid ""
"It's pure savagery, to keep a prisoner parched like this. They'll only offer "
"me <i>water.</i>"
msgstr "이건 완전히 야만적인 짓이에요, 포로를 이런 식으로 대하다니. 놈들은 제게 <i>물만</i> 줬다고요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 192fc90a-5e9c-13ba-730b-a81ec27328e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:192fc90a-5e9c-13ba-730b-a81ec27328e5
msgctxt "he0cc1d4cg0d0cg47f4g92f9g63c9252ca665"
msgid ""
"Say - I don't suppose you could spare some coin, could you? Ease the "
"discomforts of the road some?"
msgstr "송구스럽지만 동전을 좀 주실 수 있습니까? 귀환길의 불편함을 조금이라도 덜어주실 수 있을까요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 193c92bf-1e9c-e8b4-4fc3-6b0f6c5e4578
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.      - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_FreedByPersuade(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:193c92bf-1e9c-e8b4-4fc3-6b0f6c5e4578
msgctxt "hfa268ca1gcc07g4ed1gbe1cgd4d832cd73c3"
msgid "Don't worry, '<i>the </i>Oskar Fevras' didn't cost me a single coin."
msgstr "걱정 마, <i>그 </i> '오스카 페브라스'는 나에게 동전 한 푼도 들지 않았으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 19f675f7-87e8-85d2-d4ce-40ed693e674e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:19f675f7-87e8-85d2-d4ce-40ed693e674e
msgctxt "h1a662d24ge5ceg4f47g910fg83331683cede"
msgid "You're not a prisoner anymore."
msgstr "당신은 이제 포로가 아닙니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 1a210813-dd80-91f5-d9cc-40192a34ee45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:1a210813-dd80-91f5-d9cc-40192a34ee45
msgctxt "h81bcd8b1gfd0fg48f8g8217gaf27498d032c"
msgid ""
"Both turned out masterpieces, more's the pity. Not a stray brushstroke "
"between them."
msgstr "유감스럽게도 두 작품 다 걸작이 되어버렸지 뭐야. 붓질 하나 잘못된 게 없었다니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 1a577f92-c98b-26be-3641-73fafde704d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:1a577f92-c98b-26be-3641-73fafde704d7
msgctxt "h27079a89gb7fbg4a45gacddgba4a7600fffc"
msgid ""
"He might've let me go, for the right amount of coin. The rest? They'll only "
"be swayed by steel."
msgstr "그라면 적절한 가격에 절 보내줬을지도요. 나머지는? 놈들은 베어버리는 수밖에 없어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1bdb9153-47e3-2a76-13db-03b849c7e5af
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:1bdb9153-47e3-2a76-13db-03b849c7e5af
msgctxt "h17e8deadge3c8g46c4gb15eg3f6a0ef75558"
msgid "I don't make jokes with my slaves."
msgstr "나는 내 노예에게 농담하지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1ceab65c-1942-b320-decd-49050391f149
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:1ceab65c-1942-b320-decd-49050391f149
msgctxt "h09341edbg012cg4204gae18g014673d5ddd7"
msgid "I've never heard of you."
msgstr "처음 듣는 이름이군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 1dde68f5-66a5-eb83-565d-f3f03001ab59
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:1dde68f5-66a5-eb83-565d-f3f03001ab59
msgctxt "h5d9eab33g9f91g4934gb0c5gbb6975cab84d"
msgid ""
"Oh - run crying back to my patron I expect. My <i>betrothed</i>, I should "
"say."
msgstr "오, 제 후원자에게 울면서 달려가야죠. 제 <i>약혼녀</i>라고 해야겠군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1f0370b9-ec81-6dd9-5886-439e993adea7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:1f0370b9-ec81-6dd9-5886-439e993adea7
msgctxt "hbee4f2b4g9573g47fagad77g0e43a83f429b"
msgid ""
"I <i>must</i> know how this tragic tale ends. What option did you choose?"
msgstr "이 안타까운 비극의 결말을 듣지 않고는 <i>도저히</i> 못 배기겠어요. 어떤 선택을 하셨죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 213ffa27-0524-afaf-97c2-8283e61c9cb6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - TemporaryHostilityAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:213ffa27-0524-afaf-97c2-8283e61c9cb6
msgctxt "hd7d4e1aeg7fd2g427egbd4cg463bf7555fd3"
msgid "Help! <i>Help!</i>"
msgstr "도와줘! <i>도와줘!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 23525bae-2801-9b10-9a40-6fd263540dc3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:23525bae-2801-9b10-9a40-6fd263540dc3
msgctxt "h34863354g863fg4e15g9970ge99128c831ba"
msgid "As far as you're concerned she may as well be the Coinmaiden herself."
msgstr "당신에게 있어서는, 그녀가 동전의 여신 그 자체가 될 수도 있습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 239afc3e-a324-a05c-504e-43df07f7b8a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:239afc3e-a324-a05c-504e-43df07f7b8a8
msgctxt "hcdcb1adcg1530g402ega641g427dcfdd6f20"
msgid ""
"Oh, thank the gods. You may not know it, friend, but you've just done "
"yourself a great service indeed."
msgstr "오, 신이시여 감사합니다. 당신은 모를 수도 있지만, 친구여, 당신은 스스로에게 큰 봉사를 한 것입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 23e27eac-6eb8-89c9-dfd9-a83806143648
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_DoubtingArtist_State_Painting2Destroyed = True
#.      - PLA_DoubtingArtist_State_Painting1Destroyed = True
#.   User:
#.      - PLA_DoubtingArtist_Knows_PaintingDestroyed(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:23e27eac-6eb8-89c9-dfd9-a83806143648
msgctxt "h4718ad01ga325g4989g8876g75464889f2be"
msgid "I hope you came to a decision - the paintings are gone."
msgstr "이제 결정을 내렸길 바라죠, 그림들이 사라졌거든요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 26169eb0-efe6-61f8-b855-a9b5735b616d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:26169eb0-efe6-61f8-b855-a9b5735b616d
msgctxt "h9dfe98aag73ebg4f94gad46g4684133247a1"
msgid "How-"
msgstr "어떻게-"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 269f43d3-34f3-d6d4-da53-1a7a06692dbc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:269f43d3-34f3-d6d4-da53-1a7a06692dbc
msgctxt "h8773c384g001cg42abgb94cgb69ec677586d"
msgid "Who is your patron?"
msgstr "당신 후원자가 누군데요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 2793edb8-6239-a953-1b38-6228ef95d25e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:2793edb8-6239-a953-1b38-6228ef95d25e
msgctxt "h76f2a606g9f20g47f2gae94gc57e393e2c42"
msgid ""
"Heroes who rescue her prize painter, for example. Oskar Fevras, at your "
"service."
msgstr "예를 들면, 그녀의 진귀한 화가를 구출한 영웅들 말이죠. 이 오스카 페브라스에게 뭐든 물어보십시오."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 29819d38-3af1-8322-f8a6-c17be2408434
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:29819d38-3af1-8322-f8a6-c17be2408434
msgctxt "h75a1a450gea29g4a7eg8bf3g51052d2cc4d2"
msgid "Maybe. But you don't look very expensive."
msgstr "그럴 수도. 하지만 당신은 그렇게 가치 있어 보이지 않는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 2a858466-6e72-0660-b77a-712cfdeea4f8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Knows_AskedHelp = False
#.   Quest:
#.      - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_FreedByViolence(1) = False
#.      - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_FreedByBribe(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_DoubtingArtist_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_MeetArtist(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:2a858466-6e72-0660-b77a-712cfdeea4f8
msgctxt "h0421a760gd357g493dgb3a3gc359b3e5d942"
msgid "You! The way you handled Zarys - you're not one of her thugs."
msgstr "당신! 자리스에게 대하는 태도를 보니 그녀의 졸개가 아니시군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 2aef332f-9ceb-a650-bed9-f139aa01dae2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:2aef332f-9ceb-a650-bed9-f139aa01dae2
msgctxt "hb6ccb1c6g7287g41e8g9b81g7d429b4c1a31"
msgid ""
"Fear not, friend! My patron will make good on all my debts. My <i>betrothed</"
"i>, I should say."
msgstr "걱정 마십시오, 친구! 제 후원자가 제 빚을 모두 갚아줄 것입니다. 제 <i>약혼녀</i>라고 해야겠군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 2ce0b5f2-3e88-49f8-214a-98312f01a19b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_AgreedBuy(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:2ce0b5f2-3e88-49f8-214a-98312f01a19b
msgctxt "he1857677ge0bfg4600g9c63gae2303acad74"
msgid ""
"But there will be time for questions later. Please, speak to Brem - I need "
"to see the <i>sun</i> again."
msgstr "하지만 질문할 시간은 나중에 있을 겁니다. 부디, 브렘과 대화해 주세요. <i>태양</i>을 다시 보고 싶어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3160a0f0-6147-24f1-2439-59da206a250e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:3160a0f0-6147-24f1-2439-59da206a250e
msgctxt "h76605044gf4a9g417bg9edaga95e66f20861"
msgid "All I care about is getting paid."
msgstr "제가 신경 쓰는 건 보수를 받는 것뿐입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 320ff632-092a-6c6b-d838-71e1951ce60e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:320ff632-092a-6c6b-d838-71e1951ce60e
msgctxt "h143c380eg6f84g4c74gbe83gd3d6e37d1daa"
msgid "Of course. I don't mean to rush you."
msgstr "물론이죠. 재촉하려는 건 아닙니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 3377fd8d-0911-f743-1e68-be90de668d83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_State_RefusedHelp(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:3377fd8d-0911-f743-1e68-be90de668d83
msgctxt "h89fa3cbcg6cfdg430dg8da4g65ccf53d0da0"
msgid ""
"And when my corpse is being picked at by dogs, I suppose it won't be your "
"problem then either?"
msgstr "제 시체가 개들에게 파먹히는 날이 온다면, 그래도 당신 문제가 아닌가요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 37343394-946c-212f-1933-6d94ca10d2e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:37343394-946c-212f-1933-6d94ca10d2e5
msgctxt "h16c1fedag54d7g4f4ag97dbg2f79a6c9b283"
msgid ""
"Just as soon as I'm back in the city. Please, speak to Brem - I need to see "
"the <i>sun</i> again."
msgstr "제가 도시로 돌아가자마자요. 부디, 브렘과 대화해 주세요. <i>태양</i>을 다시 보고 싶어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 381fd6ab-cd9a-1eea-33d1-0568965d6c8f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:381fd6ab-cd9a-1eea-33d1-0568965d6c8f
msgctxt "hf97c4cfdg63ddg4691gb93fgab9cbb3d37dd"
msgid "No <i>coin? </i>Mightily imprudent of you."
msgstr "<i>동전</i>이 없단 말니까? 그건 현명하지 못하군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3c893685-a925-5a25-f3e9-25692a228eb6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:3c893685-a925-5a25-f3e9-25692a228eb6
msgctxt "hac032d61g3a0dg4463g8350g46c5071a8a1a"
msgid "What happened?"
msgstr "어떤 일이 있었는데요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 3c8c4578-d920-eb76-4ef2-eb8b58a88eab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:3c8c4578-d920-eb76-4ef2-eb8b58a88eab
msgctxt "h78396441gc774g4b87g8731ga48158f84581"
msgid "Hm? Oh, absolutely none. Fame and wealth suit me very well, no doubt."
msgstr "음? 아, 선택이 뭔 말입니까. 의심할 여지없이 명성과 부가 저에게 잘 어울리더군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3cf32d93-d4f8-c6eb-dcd7-291597348e3c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:3cf32d93-d4f8-c6eb-dcd7-291597348e3c
msgctxt "h0118e613g032bg4e8agb148gd54e8ac4e2a4"
msgid "I don't care about your love life - I just want my reward."
msgstr "나는 당신 연애 상활에는 관심 없어. 내 보상만을 바란다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 3e342148-8616-5543-7ec3-404a47bb830f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:3e342148-8616-5543-7ec3-404a47bb830f
msgctxt "he6df4d2eg316eg454ag8d0ag2f0d69e6b479"
msgid "I thought the canvas would make clear what my heart could not. Drivel."
msgstr "전 캔버스를 바라보면 제 진심을 알 수 있을 거라 생각했습니다. 쓸데없는 짓이었죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 414132ea-8977-02bf-0f4e-15faa668eec9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:414132ea-8977-02bf-0f4e-15faa668eec9
msgctxt "h37524371g8a2ag4528ga730g204dea3e6c98"
msgid ""
"... do you know, of all the indignities heaped upon me in this place, that "
"might well be the worst."
msgstr "... 이 장소에서 제가 느낀 모든 굴욕 중에서 그게 최악일지도 모릅니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 43cd7f26-764d-91a6-fbf2-de36bc5a3445
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:43cd7f26-764d-91a6-fbf2-de36bc5a3445
msgctxt "h2ed5703bgaf8ag4181gadc4g5f172d25fac9"
msgid "Not yet. I'm working on it."
msgstr "아직은요. 시도하는 중이에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 43d02bf5-9959-7ead-1010-ef59e2371891
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:43d02bf5-9959-7ead-1010-ef59e2371891
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The latter I learned only after the engagement, when I told her I was still "
#| "in love with someone else."
msgctxt "h38ac9656g2c46g4d3dg8ddag44a31c76376c"
msgid ""
"The latter I learned only after the engagement, when I told her I was in "
"love with someone else."
msgstr "후자는 제가 약혼한 이후, 아직 다른 사람을 사랑한다고 그녀에게 말하고 나서야 깨달았습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 462423ea-d864-de06-ee96-e5e60c6c6af6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:462423ea-d864-de06-ee96-e5e60c6c6af6
msgctxt "hb659c6d2gb46dg444ag88d6g4d283c8134d0"
msgid ""
"In any case, I am a slave no longer - and your money troubles are over, rest "
"assured. For you have saved none other than Oskar Fevras."
msgstr ""
"어찌 되었든, 저는 이제 노예가 아닙니다. 그리고 장담하건대, 당신의 돈 문제는 앞으로 완전히 끝났다고 생각하세요. 당신이 구한 사람은 "
"다름 아닌 오스카 페브라스니까요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4634da25-56fa-d469-4196-9699236aef6c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:4634da25-56fa-d469-4196-9699236aef6c
msgctxt "h9066c12fg5427g4785g83a2g1731ac4f4642"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4a4c21bf-68f3-f0cd-597b-17e5d7a3e641
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_DoubtingArtist_Knows_CanGetPortrait(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:4a4c21bf-68f3-f0cd-597b-17e5d7a3e641
msgctxt "haeeaec33ged3eg4350g9bd6g8de3f6a4c675"
msgid "Forget it. I just want you to paint my portrait."
msgstr "됐어. 그냥 내 초상화나 그려줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 4ab33aeb-1d6a-f82f-ead8-2ea900f65408
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:4ab33aeb-1d6a-f82f-ead8-2ea900f65408
msgctxt "he6a5b16fg2435g44ccg91c7g3f4660e850c3"
msgid "I'm far too busy to speak. Goodbye!"
msgstr "수다나 떨기엔 제가 너무 바쁘군요. 안녕히!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 4c5752d0-100f-e1c0-a712-de786652107e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Knows_DealPossible = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:4c5752d0-100f-e1c0-a712-de786652107e
msgctxt "hf5cb3e13gac6dg4e88gbb24ga58f80134b76"
msgid "No, not trade - <i>trap</i>. Prove you're more useful <i>alive.</i>"
msgstr "아니, 거래가 아니라 <i>함정</i>이죠. 당신이 <i>살아있을 때</i> 더 유용하다는 것을 증명하는 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 4d926e8d-851f-1318-eec6-80dff75937c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Knows_AskedHelp = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_MeetArtist(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:4d926e8d-851f-1318-eec6-80dff75937c8
msgctxt "hdf8df69fg3abag45f5gb86cg0ce6869838d3"
msgid ""
"And my patron will reward you for my rescue - tenfold whatever ransom you "
"pay, I guarantee it."
msgstr "그리고 저를 구해 주시면 제 후원자가 보상을 줄 것입니다. 당신이 지불하는 몸값의 10배를 장담하죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 4e049920-6f1b-ba88-e936-5556c5a2b973
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:4e049920-6f1b-ba88-e936-5556c5a2b973
msgctxt "h6c35ce56g1a8ag425cg95a3g0ddfdd4418de"
msgid "What-"
msgstr "무슨-"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 4ff9ebb1-1056-7d95-379a-b2a4d14f5907
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:4ff9ebb1-1056-7d95-379a-b2a4d14f5907
msgctxt "hd4151335g05c3g401dg8ff8g9bac4de02583"
msgid ""
"Indeed. I'll just... carry your things then, shall I? Scrub your boots? Just "
"one moment."
msgstr "그래요. 그럼 제가... 짐을 들어드리면 되나요? 부츠를 닦아드릴까요? 잠시만요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 5738659a-521f-9500-0c70-bc4ebdb2005b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:5738659a-521f-9500-0c70-bc4ebdb2005b
msgctxt "hbaab130ag9172g4291g9c2cg3b03fdf7f752"
msgid ""
"He's <i>what? </i>Pardon... I won't miss him. But Brem was about as "
"reasonable as these thugs get."
msgstr "그가 <i>뭐라고요?</i> 실례했습니다... 그를 그리워하지는 않겠지만, 브렘은 이 깡패들 중에서 가장 이성적인 자였어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 58ba244d-70ac-ed81-9062-165b00f33ebb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:58ba244d-70ac-ed81-9062-165b00f33ebb
msgctxt "hee4a96b3g37d1g46e8g86c0g6d7f06853611"
msgid "Why are you selling yourself?"
msgstr "왜 자기 자신을 팔려는 거죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 59473f12-8d13-4e13-69cf-da8271f2179f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:59473f12-8d13-4e13-69cf-da8271f2179f
msgctxt "h64eac735gd6eag43e8g9547g9361da893c35"
msgid ""
"Droll. Fear not, I'll ensure you're compensated once I return to my patron. "
"My <i>betrothed</i>, I should say."
msgstr "재밌군요. 걱정하지 마십시오. 제 후원자에게 돌아가면 보상을 해드릴 테니까요. 제 <i>약혼녀</i>라고 해야겠군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 598aee1d-6bd5-f4e1-31bd-02618754582e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:598aee1d-6bd5-f4e1-31bd-02618754582e
msgctxt "hcaaa977cg1a6bg4070g8ca7g3be257219cbb"
msgid ""
"*His eyes are glassy, and he is sweating profusely - absolutely terrified, "
"but pretending all is well.*"
msgstr "*그의 눈은 흐리멍텅하고 심하게 땀을 흘리고 있습니다 - 극도로 겁에 질렸지만 모든 게 괜찮다는 듯이 연기하고 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5dbaa114-c620-fc60-a659-ad63c3e8c404
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_RecognisedPatron(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:5dbaa114-c620-fc60-a659-ad63c3e8c404
msgctxt "h53bf2e8bgdf31g4604g8b78g62355969ac36"
msgid ""
"*You recall a recent scandal - a patriar of Baldur's Gate who wished to "
"marry a commoner.*"
msgstr "*당신은 평민과 결혼하길 원한 발더스 게이트의 어느 호족에 대한 최근 스캔들을 떠올립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 5ecea9f2-cd37-80d5-9315-663a62d4709f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:5ecea9f2-cd37-80d5-9315-663a62d4709f
msgctxt "h69e6275egf56eg4d31ga200gddf45691a3a3"
msgid ""
"Now, if you cared to spare some coins in exchange, well. That would ease the "
"discomforts of the road some."
msgstr "만약 당신이 약간의 동전을 기부해줄 의사가 있다면, 길에서의 불편함을 조금 해소할 수 있을지도 모르겠군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Garias
#. NodeID = 5f0252a2-d961-cda9-59b2-4142d77bfa3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:5f0252a2-d961-cda9-59b2-4142d77bfa3b
msgctxt "h0506e885gcac8g47f4g81c8gae08cc7b2244"
msgid ""
"Oi! Leave him be, yeah? You've got an appointment with Zarys - and she don't "
"like waiting."
msgstr "이봐요! 그를 놔두세요, 네? 당신은 자리스와 약속이 있잖아요. 그녀는 기다리는 것을 좋아하지 않습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 673c1276-c1c4-56da-fe7f-7c2778917f40
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:673c1276-c1c4-56da-fe7f-7c2778917f40
msgctxt "h95bebe22g695ag47f4g8012g0c7673add560"
msgid ""
"An affliction for which you cannot be faulted, this far from civilisation."
msgstr "문명과는 거리가 멀어져 있었으니, 당신을 탓할 수 없는 아픔이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 674e52ce-2aa7-c01a-fba3-14b1bcb0e162
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:674e52ce-2aa7-c01a-fba3-14b1bcb0e162
msgctxt "hadca12aeg8602g4f08g9577gc6ef6ed81293"
msgid "Right you are, just asking for a little help was all..."
msgstr "알았어요, 그냥 약간의 도움을 요청하는 것뿐이었어요..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 6753d403-32bc-8d53-0735-2a70fff61d18
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_DoubtingArtist_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Knows_AskedHelp = True
#.   Quest:
#.      - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_FreedByViolence(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_DoubtingArtist_HasMet(1) = True
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:6753d403-32bc-8d53-0735-2a70fff61d18
msgctxt "hf1d19a6bgc2d8g405cg9f3cgd4887adff9a3"
msgid ""
"Gods above, man - I said <i>buy</i> me. If you didn't have the coin, you "
"might have just said."
msgstr "신이시여 맙소사, 저를 <i>사달라고</i> 했잖아요. 돈이 없다면, 그냥 말씀해 주시지 그랬습니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 6753d403-32bc-8d53-0735-2a70fff61d18
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_DoubtingArtist_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Knows_AskedHelp = True
#.   Quest:
#.      - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_FreedByViolence(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_DoubtingArtist_HasMet(1) = True
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:6753d403-32bc-8d53-0735-2a70fff61d18
msgctxt "h2646ae78g8c2fg4858gb05bgd712b0150fda"
msgid ""
"Gods above, woman - I said <i>buy</i> me. If you didn't have the coin, you "
"might have just said."
msgstr "신이시여 맙소사, 저를 <i>사달라고</i> 했잖아요. 돈이 없다면, 그냥 말씀해 주시지 그랬습니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 6753d403-32bc-8d53-0735-2a70fff61d18
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_DoubtingArtist_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Knows_AskedHelp = True
#.   Quest:
#.      - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_FreedByViolence(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_DoubtingArtist_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:6753d403-32bc-8d53-0735-2a70fff61d18
msgctxt "h2ac8d76cg4f8fg40a1g91d9g5262eb04c275"
msgid ""
"Gods above - I said <i>buy</i> me. If you didn't have the coin, you might "
"have just said."
msgstr "신이시여 맙소사, 저를 <i>사달라고</i> 했잖아요. 돈이 없다면, 그냥 말씀해 주시지 그랬습니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 6cc15dd4-33eb-cb72-9de9-7d8c80d5fab5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_DoubtingArtist_Event_FreedByPersuade = True
#.   Quest:
#.      - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_FreedByViolence(1) = False
#.      - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_FreedByBribe(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_DoubtingArtist_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_MeetArtist(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:6cc15dd4-33eb-cb72-9de9-7d8c80d5fab5
msgctxt "h41714ba1gebd2g4385ga494g31d5f5ae9776"
msgid "I can't say I've ever been bought before - how much did I fetch?"
msgstr "제가 구매된 건 이번이 처음입니다. 저에게 얼마 들었나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 6ce88647-2594-d5c7-53b1-3786f25d21df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:6ce88647-2594-d5c7-53b1-3786f25d21df
msgctxt "h79048a28gc68dg491aga1f8g43674f57238a"
msgid ""
"Fine - as well as a mere fortune, I will offer you something far greater: a "
"painting by my own hand."
msgstr "단순한 재산 외에도, 제가 당신에게 훨씬 더 큰 것을 제공할 수 있습니다: 제 손으로 그려진 작품 말입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 6d05c8de-d07e-9640-62fd-414f36ed076e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_DoubtingArtist_Knows_TwoLoves(1) = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_TwoLoveStory(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:6d05c8de-d07e-9640-62fd-414f36ed076e
msgctxt "h59ebe285gd39eg4345ga465g572af045758d"
msgid ""
"She offered me a future, and so in a fit of madness I told her of my past."
msgstr "그녀는 저에게 미래를 함께하자고 제안했고, 저는 미쳐가지고 그녀에게 제 과거에 대해 이야기했습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 6d44b1e6-eda8-8cd1-a9d1-531e0b00cca7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:6d44b1e6-eda8-8cd1-a9d1-531e0b00cca7
msgctxt "h88c2a83cg8d6bg491cg81beg70f6b5609167"
msgid ""
"Of the woman I'd loved before she found me. Love still, in truth. She was... "
"less than pleased."
msgstr ""
"제가 그녀와 만나기 전에 사랑했던 여인에 대해서 말입니다. 사실, 여전히 사랑하는 여인이죠. 그녀는 제 이야기를 듣고는... 별로 "
"기뻐하진 않았습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 6f784d48-2850-387e-7e91-32326b93c01b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:6f784d48-2850-387e-7e91-32326b93c01b
msgctxt "h318f3186g6162g46d8gaccfgbd7e41efbbd4"
msgid "I took you for a better sort than these. Leave me to my chains, then."
msgstr "전 당신이 저 자들보다는 나은 부류라고 생각했습니다. 정 그러시다면, 쇠사슬에 채워진 저를 버려 두십시오."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 6fb998d2-7cdd-c1bf-d7ac-6e354452c797
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_DoubtingArtist_HasMet(1) = False
#.      - PLA_DoubtingArtist_HasMet_BremDead(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_State_Zhent03_Dead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:6fb998d2-7cdd-c1bf-d7ac-6e354452c797
msgctxt "h0cc3d5a0g1d65g48a7g8efcgba64200fc187"
msgid "Oh, my friend. There are far more interesting folk to speak to here."
msgstr "오, 이봐요. 여기엔 더 흥미로운 이들이 많이 있다고요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 71488b84-d7de-946b-df61-b31db87308a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:71488b84-d7de-946b-df61-b31db87308a3
msgctxt "h28b78d6cg2236g4b9cg9a36gc20a21d864d1"
msgid ""
"Forgive me, I just... I'm here against my will, you see? But I know my "
"patron is looking."
msgstr "미안합니다. 전 그저... 전 제 의지에 반해 여기 있어요, 알겠어요? 하지만 제 후원자가 찾고 있다는 건 압니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 719208dd-447e-ac26-0040-2c7a0072884d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:719208dd-447e-ac26-0040-2c7a0072884d
msgctxt "hbb98854ag7ac5g4184g8b36ge04e15dd2978"
msgid ""
"Well, you should at least know what you've paid for. I am <i>the </i>Oskar "
"Fevras, at your service."
msgstr "음, 당신은 적어도 자신이 지불한 대상이 무엇인지는 알아야겠죠. 저는 <i>바로 그</i> 오스카 페브라스라고 합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 72cdde1a-6fd7-06f6-0984-a342e2c0884c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_DoubtingArtist_State_TriedSkill(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_State_Zhent03_Dead = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_DoubtingArtist_State_TriedSkill(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:72cdde1a-6fd7-06f6-0984-a342e2c0884c
msgctxt "hd39def9bg883dg4ac6g9593g866b5b4fab1b"
msgid "Relax. I'm just here to trade."
msgstr "진정해요. 그냥 거래하러 온 거니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 7302184a-cdae-659a-6778-91c042102e07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_DoubtingArtist_Knows_TwoLoves(1) = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_TwoLoveStory(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:7302184a-cdae-659a-6778-91c042102e07
msgctxt "h1c219cf6g622fg431fgb31cgc12f38f970db"
msgid ""
"A noblewoman of passion, refinement and, as it turns out, quite ferocious "
"temper."
msgstr "열정과 세련미, 그리고 나중에 알게 됐지만 꽤 사나운 성미를 지닌 귀족 여성입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 760a5752-55fa-5253-15e2-8966b0c30589
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:760a5752-55fa-5253-15e2-8966b0c30589
msgctxt "h87848a29ga537g4e74g8701gd1a8964d6c54"
msgid ""
"And we have your reward to consider - <i>once</i> I have made my way safely "
"back to the city."
msgstr "그리고 저희는 당신의 보상을 생각해야겠군요. 물론 제가 무사히 도시로 <i>돌아간 후</i>에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7f8cfcfc-5eae-4140-75a0-b45949e6880b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:7f8cfcfc-5eae-4140-75a0-b45949e6880b
msgctxt "he53cd21eg0384g460ag9dd0g7f0eaaf16f65"
msgid "This ransom is your patron's problem - not mine."
msgstr "몸값은 당신 후원자의 문제지, 내 문제는 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8157c90e-d786-7543-89d6-1d279402cf54
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_DoubtingArtist_State_FreeBribe = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:8157c90e-d786-7543-89d6-1d279402cf54
msgctxt "hc3163c3bgaf1eg426bgaa9dgcb9579f154d6"
msgid "My slaves do not speak until they are spoken to."
msgstr "내 노예는 내가 말 걸기 전까지 말하면 안 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 81693a8d-1cdd-6929-4b3a-fca9ab12a1dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 7fdf594d-eaf0-034c-0b29-93adcbc74449_MindHasBeenRead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:81693a8d-1cdd-6929-4b3a-fca9ab12a1dd
msgctxt "h128257afgf559g4deagacaegc4e887949b52"
msgid "<i>You'regoingtodieyou'regoingtodieyou'regoingtodie-</i>"
msgstr "<i>넌죽을 거야죽을 거야죽을 거라고-</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 828996a8-5de4-6463-891f-3eeaee32c92b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.      - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_FreedByViolence(1) = True
#.      - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_FreedByBribe(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:828996a8-5de4-6463-891f-3eeaee32c92b
msgctxt "he38ba227g0a69g478egaf4fg2888e695dff6"
msgid "Coin will just weigh you down. Get moving."
msgstr "동전은 당신을 무겁게만 할 거야. 당장 움직여."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 83eb34d3-60ad-1757-3d63-534fda9371cf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:83eb34d3-60ad-1757-3d63-534fda9371cf
msgctxt "h19a91135g1d5cg4270g9706g3f0269b76e5c"
msgid ""
"I am <i>the</i> [GEN_PlayerName_c11eee1e-7815-6143-7233-f2427799fa53], at "
"yours."
msgstr ""
"내가 <i>바로 그</i> [GEN_PlayerName_c11eee1e-7815-6143-7233-f2427799fa53], 당신을 위해 "
"여기 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 84002799-9be3-aa23-aecc-4465135e6f51
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:84002799-9be3-aa23-aecc-4465135e6f51
msgctxt "h84fba93agc1b5g409dgbeb1gd083c4002f3e"
msgid "Quite. Now I really do have to get back to work!"
msgstr "그렇고 말고요. 이제 정말 다시 일을 시작해야 해서 말입니다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 84859a06-8c9b-5dc7-f02c-be2f95483f25
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:84859a06-8c9b-5dc7-f02c-be2f95483f25
msgctxt "hb680fdcfg3effg46f9g8e75g04275e303fe1"
msgid "And what choice did you make?"
msgstr "그레서 어떤 선택을 내렸습니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 8552c07c-77f0-c1fc-c23c-8991ef521a32
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:8552c07c-77f0-c1fc-c23c-8991ef521a32
msgctxt "hec6785d2ga4b0g49e2g8e79gb9f0c2cd4010"
msgid ""
"I am not some lower city <i>coinlad</i> offering you a tumble. I am an "
"<i>artist.</i>"
msgstr "저는 공중 제비나 보여주는 하찮은 <i>구걸꾼</i>이 아닙니다. 저는 <i>예술가</i>라고요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 857ed909-ac24-2204-8f6a-2258ec88d9ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.      - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_FreedByViolence(1) = False
#.      - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_FreedByBribe(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:857ed909-ac24-2204-8f6a-2258ec88d9ad
msgctxt "hece9a8dcge475g4e41gbe6cgca103875187b"
msgid "I've already spent enough coin on you."
msgstr "난 당신에게 이미 충분한 돈을 썼는데요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 864cbc56-9b52-5dad-28fe-098e79e93fc3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_State_RefusedHelp(1) = False
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_AgreedBuy(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:864cbc56-9b52-5dad-28fe-098e79e93fc3
msgctxt "h6d9625d1gbfeeg4dbdgb339g61f951a913fe"
msgid "Relax - I'll speak to your captors."
msgstr "긴장 푸시죠. 당신을 붙잡고 있는 이들과 대화해 보겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 881b7e74-5601-2ae8-f586-42d4f4fee502
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:881b7e74-5601-2ae8-f586-42d4f4fee502
msgctxt "h90413961g2e6fg4658g8125g6342d449df83"
msgid ""
"You... oh. Another of Brem's bloody <i>commissions? </i>I will not sully my "
"brush with every ugly vagrant who -"
msgstr "당신... 아. 브렘이 또 망할 <i>의뢰</i>를 보냈나? 내가 지나가는 추남 추녀 아무나를 그리는 데 붓을 더럽힐 순 -"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8836c2a0-fb67-eec5-0426-5003ac0b4a4b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:8836c2a0-fb67-eec5-0426-5003ac0b4a4b
msgctxt "h37ea6211g3eb5g4f4dg8aa5g7b0910191838"
msgid "I don't need a servant."
msgstr "하인은 필요 없습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 89eb5019-7762-ac40-95bf-427fac97d7da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:89eb5019-7762-ac40-95bf-427fac97d7da
msgctxt "h32dd6423ga040g4fc4gb3a8gc47577bf9749"
msgid ""
"I wish I could harden my heart so. Still, you're right - we have the matter "
"of my return to consider."
msgstr "저도 그렇게 마음을 굳혔으면 좋겠어요. 그래도 당신 말이 맞습니다. 제 복귀 문제를 고려해야 합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 8a53a8df-22ff-e5c3-1af5-8a70e3f4bbc7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:8a53a8df-22ff-e5c3-1af5-8a70e3f4bbc7
msgctxt "hab1e4035gfd81g4e86ga9e6g74fbbf9bde58"
msgid ""
"Right, but <i>unwise. </i>I was forced to retreat into the countryside. To "
"paint, and clear my head. To <i>choose</i>, I suppose."
msgstr ""
"옳지만, <i>현명하다</i>고는 할 수 없었죠. 저는 시골로 내려가야 했습니다. 그림을 그리고, 머리를 비우기 위해서요. 그리고 "
"어쩌면, <i>선택</i>을 위해서였겠죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8d3c421f-8dd9-efd6-e1d5-b338602b7ae6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_RecognisedPatron(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:8d3c421f-8dd9-efd6-e1d5-b338602b7ae6
msgctxt "ha6332144ga95cg4bcfg9970g1d500617df98"
msgid "Who is Lady Jannath?"
msgstr "자나스 아가씨는 누구죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 8d3ce578-310b-2c31-c53e-1d75453ae893
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:8d3ce578-310b-2c31-c53e-1d75453ae893
msgctxt "hcf7ff5e2gfcdbg4832g828fg51e180c8d73d"
msgid ""
"She's a woman of great means - and great generosity to those who serve her "
"well."
msgstr "제 후원자는 대단한 재력을 가진 여성이며, 자신을 잘 섬기는 사람들에게는 아주 관대합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 8ea0d2bc-51b6-d8a5-6a92-20a497517543
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:8ea0d2bc-51b6-d8a5-6a92-20a497517543
msgctxt "h7f7f1368g026ag4aacg83ebgf9ee6e021f1c"
msgid "You will? Wonderful!"
msgstr "그렇게 해 주시겠다구요? 훌륭하군요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 8ef27d81-5d2c-fc92-54d7-db2f44441668
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:8ef27d81-5d2c-fc92-54d7-db2f44441668
msgctxt "h860a2d26gf58cg42f4ga6f0g5176e362ba29"
msgid ""
"And yet I think of that first love, and... I hesitate. Likely I'm going mad."
msgstr "하지만 제 첫사랑을 생각하면... 망설여지긴 합니다. 미쳐버릴 것 같아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 9010c07f-72b6-b91f-fb8c-a840955a7396
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Knows_AskedHelp = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_MeetArtist(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:9010c07f-72b6-b91f-fb8c-a840955a7396
msgctxt "h6bc0350fg8264g4fcagb059g165903a2b65d"
msgid ""
"Tenfold whatever ransom these clods try to squeeze from you, I guarantee it."
msgstr "저자들이 당신에게서 갈취하려고 하는 금액의 열 배를 보장합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 904fad15-fc65-7733-1422-6740ea8a6511
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Knows_AskedHelp = False
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_State_GnollZhentsPresent = True
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_State_ChestLost = False
#.   Quest:
#.      - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_FreedByViolence(1) = False
#.      - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_FreedByBribe(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_DoubtingArtist_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_MeetArtist(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:904fad15-fc65-7733-1422-6740ea8a6511
msgctxt "he6228941g3bfcg42e0g8300g66f4b4088deb"
msgid ""
"You! Zarys may have welcomed you, but I can see you're not one of her thugs."
msgstr "당신! 자리스가 당신을 환영했을지 모르지만, 당신이 그녀의 패거리처럼 보이지는 않군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 91c3244c-a9c5-22ad-4517-d7fa32ec3f69
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_DoubtingArtist_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_Rugan_Knows_Thief = True
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_State_GnollZhentsPresent = True
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_State_FallBack = False
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_State_ChestLost = True
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_State_JoinedZhent = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:91c3244c-a9c5-22ad-4517-d7fa32ec3f69
msgctxt "h67e849a2ge78dg4f9ag88b0ga570d7c3c441"
msgid "Excuse me, but I really am far too busy."
msgstr "죄송하지만, 전 정말로 바쁩니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 9304fcde-31a5-577c-31ae-bccdaf10727f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:9304fcde-31a5-577c-31ae-bccdaf10727f
msgctxt "h802a8d01ge271g48d6gb515ge24e680177f8"
msgid ""
"I <i>suppose</i> I can endure the walk sober. Suffering has become an old "
"friend, after all."
msgstr "제가 맨정신으로 걸어갈 수 있을 거라 <i>짐작합니다</i>. 결국 고통은 제 오랜 친구가 되었으니까요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 94cdd083-a997-84e7-ecba-44b94ad54739
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:94cdd083-a997-84e7-ecba-44b94ad54739
msgctxt "h47f28877gf1f1g4722g9a11g3e6801f802d3"
msgid "A truly <i>horrifying</i> dilemma."
msgstr "참으로 <i>몸서리치는</i> 고민이군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 99ce3e76-9211-3b20-b0fd-1fdef8981c31
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:99ce3e76-9211-3b20-b0fd-1fdef8981c31
msgctxt "hae043b0ag2b1dg4912g8cddgb88f7831af9d"
msgid "Coin? You have my attention."
msgstr "동전? 내 흥미를 끌었군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9b296f84-0f05-be8b-d2f5-3dd79c0d4020
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:9b296f84-0f05-be8b-d2f5-3dd79c0d4020
msgctxt "h8297080egb316g4cf5gb104g5bc1d636dafa"
msgid ""
"Ah, patrons dallying with their dashing artisans. A tale as old as art "
"itself."
msgstr "아, 매력 넘치는 예술가와 어울리는 후원자들. 예술 그 자체만큼 오래된 이야기죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 9cccffc5-7cb7-ecec-a9e8-b8c61307c3ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:9cccffc5-7cb7-ecec-a9e8-b8c61307c3ba
msgctxt "hcca2b527g4104g4959ga974g6703b202a982"
msgid ""
"But when Lady Jannath offered me a future, well... it felt only right to "
"mention my past."
msgstr "하지만 자나스 아가씨가 제게 미래를 함께하자고 제안했을 때... 제 과거를 언급하는 것이 옳다고 느꼈습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 9d19d58e-3679-593f-7a3f-6ebe43a9fa4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:9d19d58e-3679-593f-7a3f-6ebe43a9fa4f
msgctxt "haa36c13eg74d1g4badgab8eg22b0f230743c"
msgid "For you've rescued none other than the artist Oskar Fevras."
msgstr "당신은 다름 아닌 예술가 오스카 페브라스를 구출해 주셨기 때문입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 9f1a959c-fbdb-527d-d391-97eb2214d92c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:9f1a959c-fbdb-527d-d391-97eb2214d92c
msgctxt "h1ad2c51dgaea9g419dgbacegf544c74aee20"
msgid ""
"I'll make of you a portrait so grand that even blind Tyr will weep in its "
"very presence."
msgstr "눈먼 티르마저 앞에서 눈물을 흘릴 정도로 웅장한 초상화를 그려드리겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9f7383eb-e6ae-6767-ccaf-cd52ab62a7b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:9f7383eb-e6ae-6767-ccaf-cd52ab62a7b5
msgctxt "h86237620gafadg463dga600ge8968523899b"
msgid "Excellent. When will I get my reward?"
msgstr "훌륭하군. 언제 내 보상을 받을 수 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a06e9933-0181-1efb-5938-8428adc081f3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_DoubtingArtist_Knows_CanGetPortrait(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:a06e9933-0181-1efb-5938-8428adc081f3
msgctxt "h0cb57f92gd961g4075gb045gf4108e3dec3c"
msgid "I doubt you're worth the asking price."
msgstr "당신이 요구하는 값만큼 가치가 있을 것 같진 않군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = a0845a7d-a7c7-3e6d-ecea-72a131e295cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.      - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_FreedByViolence(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_DoubtingArtist_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_MeetArtist(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:a0845a7d-a7c7-3e6d-ecea-72a131e295cc
msgctxt "h944503f0gf7e2g4c73gae1dg1cb44f19a3ff"
msgid ""
"Wait, WAIT! I'm just a prisoner - spare me and there'll be coin, I swear it!"
msgstr "잠깐, 잠깐만요! 저는 인질일 뿐이에요. 제 목숨을 살려주시면 동전을 벌 수 있을 겁니다. 맹세해요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a248cecd-9d88-2189-5425-17251e246b6d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 7fdf594d-eaf0-034c-0b29-93adcbc74449_MindHasBeenRead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:a248cecd-9d88-2189-5425-17251e246b6d
msgctxt "ha5b62aacg698cg4b63g9806gdb4789549f4c"
msgid "Why do you think I'm going to die?"
msgstr "왜 내가 죽을 거라고 생각하죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = a735e75f-6c52-48c8-7594-41f5ebb9de5a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:a735e75f-6c52-48c8-7594-41f5ebb9de5a
msgctxt "h12d2fe22g23b5g4418g895dg4e5bfb8c7fa5"
msgid "Listen to me, you <i>stlarning-</i>"
msgstr "제 말을 들어보세요, 이 <i>빌어먹을 자식아-</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = a93bd5ea-ee0d-bdc8-2ff7-aa608e239a1d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:a93bd5ea-ee0d-bdc8-2ff7-aa608e239a1d
msgctxt "habeb16a0gf498g42b6ga294g53ba67356180"
msgid ""
"Then I congratulate you - tear them up and they'll be most useful in the "
"privy."
msgstr "그렇다면 축하드립니다. 이제 놈들을 찢어버리면 변소에는 쓸만하겠군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = a994c58b-9840-a817-1a44-55a96ba9c816
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.      - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_FreedByViolence(1) = False
#.      - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_FreedByBribe(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_DoubtingArtist_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_MeetArtist(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:a994c58b-9840-a817-1a44-55a96ba9c816
msgctxt "h5289d68bg72f0g46aeg84ceg79556a87f720"
msgid "I can't say I've ever been bought before - how much did I fetch?"
msgstr "제가 구매된 건 이번이 처음입니다. 저에게 얼마 들었나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aadc5e21-0b21-12d5-3427-86ce76d041fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDUngeon_DoubtingArtist_Knows_CantFlee(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - PLA_ZhentDUngeon_DoubtingArtist_Knows_CantFlee(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:aadc5e21-0b21-12d5-3427-86ce76d041fe
msgctxt "h89e03bebg1428g4d0cgb6b2gc0ba5993467d"
msgid "Your jailor is dead - you're free to go."
msgstr "당신을 잡아두던 이는 죽었어요, 이제 자유입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = acb95437-3e76-207f-ee28-234e78fe39da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:acb95437-3e76-207f-ee28-234e78fe39da
msgctxt "had364daegb01bg4bceg9652gca99cb7dd36f"
msgid ""
"Oh, thank the gods - if it's wealth you seek then you've done yourself a "
"great service, friend."
msgstr "오, 신이시여 감사합니다 - 만약 당신이 추구하는 것이 부라면, 당신은 스스로에게 큰 봉사를 한 것입니다, 친구."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = ad556050-403b-e4a5-7177-675775140c2d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:ad556050-403b-e4a5-7177-675775140c2d
msgctxt "h0fc4c866g30bcg448fg8316g07de00871aa0"
msgid ""
"Indeed - one to split the very soul. But I dare not dwell on it any longer "
"lest I weep."
msgstr "그래요 - 영혼을 가르는 것 같습니다. 하지만 눈물이 날까 봐 더는 그 일에 대해 생각하지 않겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = ae3ada92-057d-60ec-08b2-c9d5b6862d78
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:ae3ada92-057d-60ec-08b2-c9d5b6862d78
msgctxt "hc6542524g23b2g4825ga97bgf860142bb391"
msgid "Ha! Quite. Well, now that... wait, you're not serious?"
msgstr "하! 그렇고 말고요. 저, 잠깐만요... 그 말 설마 진심은 아니시겠죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b2ddbe96-e41f-8ae3-fc6d-12e8c9a3ad28
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_DoubtingArtist_State_TriedSkill(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_DoubtingArtist_State_TriedSkill(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:b2ddbe96-e41f-8ae3-fc6d-12e8c9a3ad28
msgctxt "h6455cd1eg6ee9g43d6ga7fbge43ac04111e7"
msgid "<i>Discern the source of his unease.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그가 불안해하는 이유를 알아낸다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = b30f8acd-107f-cc21-9cb7-98908f6312ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:b30f8acd-107f-cc21-9cb7-98908f6312ff
msgctxt "h9a2b28f8g2343g4135ga992g327a59ac46a0"
msgid ""
"But my patron will be most grateful for your heroics. My <i>betrothed</i>, I "
"should say."
msgstr "하지만 당신의 영웅적인 행동에 제 후원자가 크게 감사할 것입니다. 제 <i>약혼녀</i>라고 해야겠군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b3aef128-b49a-0ac4-a5dc-035ae5005540
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:b3aef128-b49a-0ac4-a5dc-035ae5005540
msgctxt "h1a1043fagdf70g4bc5g9312gf68938d3308b"
msgid ""
"I'll give you a <i>serious</i> discomfort to deal with if you don't get "
"going. Now."
msgstr "지금 출발하지 않으면 내가 너에게 <i>심각한</i> 불편을 겪게 해주겠어. 당장."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = b4a370c6-ac57-ccb5-110f-80f56d665e46
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:b4a370c6-ac57-ccb5-110f-80f56d665e46
msgctxt "hbb4715fegc7f0g49afg94ecgb7fb15241e51"
msgid ""
"They're yours, if you can find use for them - in the privy perhaps. I had "
"best get moving."
msgstr "그들은 마음대로 하시죠, 쓸모나 있다면 말입니다. 변소에는 필요할지도 모르죠. 이제 가 봐야겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = b5991688-ba06-891e-0039-adb8fedf1105
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:b5991688-ba06-891e-0039-adb8fedf1105
msgctxt "h80728168gf150g401cgba83ga820661d1f04"
msgid ""
"Ah. Right. Suit yourself - find me in the city and you shall have your "
"reward."
msgstr "아. 알겠습니다. 원하는 대로 하십시오. 도시에서 저를 찾으시면 보상을 받으실 수 있습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = b99345cf-f77c-fc96-b12f-d5c1897f3cf6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:b99345cf-f77c-fc96-b12f-d5c1897f3cf6
msgctxt "h33536c4dgd117g479fga083g24bcbf2b756b"
msgid "Please, speak to Brem. I need to see the <i>sun</i> again."
msgstr "부탁인데, 브렘에게 얘기해주세요. 전 <i>태양</i>을 다시 보고 싶습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = bb17a5c7-f3f9-29ea-a975-bf1f9f8d5b11
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:bb17a5c7-f3f9-29ea-a975-bf1f9f8d5b11
msgctxt "h550ca0d7g9dccg4982gba49gc4d19544ad9f"
msgid "Wadded up to wipe Zhentish arses, I expect - and good riddance."
msgstr "젠타림 버러지 놈들의 엉덩이나 닦는 데 쓰겠죠, 잘 됐군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bb73f103-b96a-34e1-7167-6f8ea4ddac48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:bb73f103-b96a-34e1-7167-6f8ea4ddac48
msgctxt "hd98350edg084eg4eedg8632g48ae196dc9d4"
msgid "What will you do with your freedom?"
msgstr "당신의 자유로 무엇을 할 건가요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c069dbf4-0a96-c80a-a9c3-c80d016003e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_State_StudiedPaintings(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:c069dbf4-0a96-c80a-a9c3-c80d016003e9
msgctxt "h10c47a8ag4fc5g4d31g8d0aged28d8a63967"
msgid "I saw your paintings - were they portraits of the women you spoke of?"
msgstr "당신의 그림을 봤습니다. 그것들이 당신이 말한 여성들의 초상화인가요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = c4f66c01-4f6a-d695-652c-2c4a99a51cb7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:c4f66c01-4f6a-d695-652c-2c4a99a51cb7
msgctxt "h7e870c7cg8523g44ecg8811g6dc407341f53"
msgid "Not to you, perhaps - but those of actual taste might disagree."
msgstr "당신에겐 그럴지도 모르죠. 하지만 제 진가를 알아보는 사람들은 생각이 다를 수도 있습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cae6fc4a-9003-b694-c538-910065f2016f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:cae6fc4a-9003-b694-c538-910065f2016f
msgctxt "h9c0fff48g4602g41f6g8998ge8fd87ae0475"
msgid "I've nothing to give."
msgstr "줄 게 없군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = cb18fd3a-edcb-9e65-8c5f-2ddc42891d36
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:cb18fd3a-edcb-9e65-8c5f-2ddc42891d36
msgctxt "h25cea947g88beg4febg906bg3ca4e0aff885"
msgid "Quite. It seems we are destined to doomed romances, are we not?"
msgstr "그래요. 보아하니 운명이 저희를 파멸의 로맨스로 이끄는 것 같군요, 그렇지 않나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d04372c4-7e4e-1c11-c5c9-19ee11a56fc1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:d04372c4-7e4e-1c11-c5c9-19ee11a56fc1
msgctxt "h95e0f65bgc43dg4bbbg89b4g3e8fa10bca10"
msgid "Sure - how much do you cost?"
msgstr "물론이죠. 당신 가격은 얼마인가요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = d2d398f4-8630-5593-4f20-c6578e805f9c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:d2d398f4-8630-5593-4f20-c6578e805f9c
msgctxt "h20d51d33g6c27g4d64gb7e4gbe46996c5220"
msgid "Indeed. I thought the canvas would make clear what my heart could not."
msgstr "맞아요. 제 마음이 표현하지 못하는 것을 캔버스가 분명하게 드러내줄 거라고 생각했어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = d461a3d6-2acf-48d6-12ed-478a942a7c8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:d461a3d6-2acf-48d6-12ed-478a942a7c8a
msgctxt "h69bba232gbf29g4ee5gbbe4g69f947ef7d49"
msgid ""
"For the return of her prize artist, my patron will measure her gratitude in "
"gold."
msgstr "소중한 예술가를 되돌려주는 것에 대한 보답으로, 제 후원자가 감사한 마음을 금으로 환산해줄 것입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = d4b1c22d-6501-dddc-d592-4c522aa6cc12
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_DoubtingArtist_Knows_Kidnapped = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:d4b1c22d-6501-dddc-d592-4c522aa6cc12
msgctxt "h0ffb02d0g8980g4f12g9785g3707423c03a6"
msgid "You need to buy me."
msgstr "저를 사주세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d5bad291-ee73-bf23-cab6-8d932cd32500
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:d5bad291-ee73-bf23-cab6-8d932cd32500
msgctxt "hcdf9de37g6055g422aga634g329c728371cf"
msgid "<i>You're</i> Lady Jannath's runaway groom?"
msgstr "<i>당신이</i> 자나스 아가씨에게서 도망친 신랑입니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = d5d8bd88-c553-42e7-0ccb-ee55ba6997dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:d5d8bd88-c553-42e7-0ccb-ee55ba6997dc
msgctxt "hf1dfd455ge449g42d2ga1b9gf685c019c6a5"
msgid ""
"A hero to the hilt. Seek me out in the city, truly - beneath my brush, "
"you'll live forever."
msgstr "완전히 영웅이시군요. 도시에서 저를 찾아오십시오. 제 붓으로 당신은 영원히 살아 숨쉴 것입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = d63aa6b8-f6c8-5ed5-6477-2758640e0635
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:d63aa6b8-f6c8-5ed5-6477-2758640e0635
msgctxt "he7ac1e3cg0eb1g4ce8g8c95g27e1f2ec6ce6"
msgid "Then it is well I am asking you to serve only yourself."
msgstr "그럼 본인 자신에게 봉사하는 일을 해달라고 부탁해야겠군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d8531573-486c-eab2-167c-3cb2c29fc7d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GEN_TransferNPCPayment(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:d8531573-486c-eab2-167c-3cb2c29fc7d9
msgctxt "h9e186d6agf906g4902g82fbg16bae5b2e71c"
msgid ""
"I can spare a little. ([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-"
"be548b134c54])"
msgstr ""
"조금 나눠줄 수 있습니다. ([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-"
"be548b134c54])"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = d8790038-1439-e7bb-5351-ac9b4c6ff167
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:d8790038-1439-e7bb-5351-ac9b4c6ff167
msgctxt "h90ad3f14g3553g45acga892gabf8fa38c4b0"
msgid "<i>Selling mys- </i>"
msgstr "<i>판다는 게 아니라... </i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = db17e954-ffc4-dbc6-1d5b-d40fa9717691
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_DoubtingArtist_State_Leaving = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_LeftForBG(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:db17e954-ffc4-dbc6-1d5b-d40fa9717691
msgctxt "h5f299f5bg633cg442agbd41gdc884bd0aa23"
msgid "Until Baldur's Gate, then!"
msgstr "그럼 발더스 게이트에서 다시 봅시다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = de64b2f4-c3fb-af65-2ea4-faea2960f01d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:de64b2f4-c3fb-af65-2ea4-faea2960f01d
msgctxt "h56d8b766g0823g4501ga441gb92af81f2534"
msgid ""
"A genuine pleasure. I'm in your debt - as is my patron. My <i>betrothed</i>, "
"I should say."
msgstr "진정으로 기쁩니다. 당신에게 빚을 졌습니다. 제 후원자도 마찬가지일 것입니다. 제 <i>약혼녀</i>라고 해야겠군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = e04f7e70-5557-2331-1604-f93153e0b00a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_State_RefusedHelp(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Knows_AskedHelp = True
#.   Quest:
#.      - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_FreedByViolence(1) = False
#.      - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_FreedByBribe(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:e04f7e70-5557-2331-1604-f93153e0b00a
msgctxt "hb2bdbbe3g0333g4a96g9ca1g7d064cdb57ce"
msgid "What - come to kill me yourself? You might as well."
msgstr "뭐 - 저를 직접 죽이러 오셨나요? 차라리 그 편이 낫겠군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = e5caec7d-d1ba-d607-7cbe-3252807d0d5c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:e5caec7d-d1ba-d607-7cbe-3252807d0d5c
msgctxt "h58e3c923g6671g4a6bgab50g433c0287ecc8"
msgid ""
"I hope you have means - these Zhent have seen my work. They won't let me go "
"cheaply."
msgstr "저 젠트가 제 작품을 봤으니, 당신에게 재력이 있길 바랍니다. 저를 값싸게 보내지는 않을 거예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = e6a612a5-e905-3f48-caa8-599962b9fe13
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Knows_AskedHelp = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_MeetArtist(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:e6a612a5-e905-3f48-caa8-599962b9fe13
msgctxt "hefa94faeg7875g4bd9g84a3gf1499710a2aa"
msgid ""
"She will be most grateful to whoever can secure my release. And most "
"<i>generous, </i>I know it."
msgstr "누구든 저를 구해줄 수 있다면 대단히 고마워할 거예요. 그리고 정말로 <i>후하게</i> 대해줄 겁니다, 분명해요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e6fd8a0a-1b90-df6a-3257-641da9f26461
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_AgreedBuy(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:e6fd8a0a-1b90-df6a-3257-641da9f26461
msgctxt "h6648149fg2dffg4cccgb057gbd412206063e"
msgid "I'll see how much they're asking for you."
msgstr "이들이 당신 몸값으로 얼마를 부르는지 보죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e7a9b1ce-06df-6fab-cbec-0b53c99025da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:e7a9b1ce-06df-6fab-cbec-0b53c99025da
msgctxt "h8ea96ef3gb8e6g4493ga61fg284f01e9a41e"
msgid ""
"*There's little to discern- aside from his obvious desire to be left alone.*"
msgstr "*파악할 것이 거의 없습니다- 홀로 남고 싶어하는 명백한 욕구를 제외하면 말입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = ec4d832a-4501-0c09-99f1-78b3083bbf7a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:ec4d832a-4501-0c09-99f1-78b3083bbf7a
msgctxt "h30d80009g939fg4eb5g90dfgbb0097d4e29a"
msgid "What? No!"
msgstr "뭐라고? 안 돼!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ec4f1562-0b2d-0987-e4a3-c190c7c5bfa4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:ec4f1562-0b2d-0987-e4a3-c190c7c5bfa4
msgctxt "h99c0fb3fg8e12g4939gb88bg83f40dce22bf"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = eea62c69-fa37-271d-d45b-2edbc949d926
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:eea62c69-fa37-271d-d45b-2edbc949d926
msgctxt "hbde3d5bfg2722g42bfgb9f5g70d2539eef61"
msgid ""
"Now I don't mean to hurry you - but if you <i>could</i> hurry, I'd be most "
"obliged."
msgstr "재촉하려는 건 아닙니다만- 서둘러주실 수 <i>있다면</i>, 정말 감사하겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = f08a0085-7aa0-093c-24ee-0acff1b1ee27
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:f08a0085-7aa0-093c-24ee-0acff1b1ee27
msgctxt "h24409141g5efdg4bf3gb686g84f38120dce0"
msgid ""
"Forgive me, but I can't think down here. Can't <i>work.</i> Free me, and you "
"will have your portrait."
msgstr ""
"미안합니다. 이 아래에선 도통 생각을 할 수 없어서 말이죠. <i>일을</i> 할 수가 없습니다. 절 풀어주시면, 초상화를 그려드리죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = f10dd461-8f09-829f-8e55-00b7f7ee52e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:f10dd461-8f09-829f-8e55-00b7f7ee52e7
msgctxt "h4d01bfd2g048ag428ega0e2g8f4de1e1c494"
msgid ""
"Regardless! We have more immediate concerns - your reward once I've returned "
"to the city, for one."
msgstr "상관없습니다! 우리에게 더 급한 문제는 제가 도시로 돌아간 후 당신에게 드릴 보상입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = f47dba17-7fe1-f8ee-1718-2ab2f6a3d7dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:f47dba17-7fe1-f8ee-1718-2ab2f6a3d7dd
msgctxt "ha3d7d0c6gdafag4bb1gbd5ag1ea9377fa7ab"
msgid ""
"No, don't tell me. There is nothing so depressing as learning one's true "
"value."
msgstr "아뇨, 말하지 마세요. 자신의 진정한 가치를 깨닫는 것만큼 우울한 일은 없습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f483f724-76fd-4ee2-5e1f-e73410710571
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:f483f724-76fd-4ee2-5e1f-e73410710571
msgctxt "h305bd1ebgda33g4074g9dcfg525cdc506562"
msgid "Of course I'm not. Just teasing."
msgstr "물론 아니지. 그냥 놀린 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f649cf90-0e5b-457a-4923-0192ea65a2b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:f649cf90-0e5b-457a-4923-0192ea65a2b1
msgctxt "hf55e511aga896g455cga508g8a2f21355a4b"
msgid "And I am [GEN_PlayerName_c11eee1e-7815-6143-7233-f2427799fa53]."
msgstr "저는 [GEN_PlayerName_c11eee1e-7815-6143-7233-f2427799fa53](이)라고 해요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = f716eb4c-9d36-eb9c-d7a6-ed4ec501c8d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Knows_AskedHelp = True
#.   Quest:
#.      - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_FreedByViolence(1) = False
#.      - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_FreedByBribe(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:f716eb4c-9d36-eb9c-d7a6-ed4ec501c8d2
msgctxt "h67c51a99g54f2g462cgae94g45ad065dc6d8"
msgid "You've spoken to Brem? He'll let me go free?"
msgstr "브렘과 얘기해 보셨어요? 저를 풀어준다고 하던가요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = f904aad2-fc2f-0b69-b7d2-3711b9e74334
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:f904aad2-fc2f-0b69-b7d2-3711b9e74334
msgctxt "h90caec14g536dg484fga44eg340d033a6e05"
msgid "Leave. <i>Please.</i>"
msgstr "가주세요. <i>부탁입니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = f9c89544-4258-2360-f4e8-05b749fb6e55
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:f9c89544-4258-2360-f4e8-05b749fb6e55
msgctxt "h53d5d7bagbd22g4366ga9a1g15e896f61c17"
msgid ""
"Look, whatever you planned with Rugan, <i>they know.</i> Be ready for "
"anything."
msgstr "이봐요, 당신이 루간과 뭘 계획했든 간에, <i>그들은 알고 있습니다.</i> 만반의 준비를 하세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = fb9e1b5c-730b-4b2e-8931-2f47222acf2d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:fb9e1b5c-730b-4b2e-8931-2f47222acf2d
msgctxt "h00a5344cgafb6g418bg9beag2ae0bab33b2b"
msgid "I'm sure we have plenty of time before they work me to death."
msgstr "놈들이 절 과로시켜서 죽기 전까진 분명 시간이 아주 많을 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fca08e8e-9839-471e-b2ff-5cd45c1e9d11
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_DoubtingArtist_Knows_CanGetPortrait(1) = True
#.      - PLA_DoubtingArtist_State_AskedForPortrait(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:fca08e8e-9839-471e-b2ff-5cd45c1e9d11
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h7bb0348bg97d8g4382g9f64g0e2fc0a71568"
msgid "Buy you? I'm just here to have my portrait painted."
msgstr "당신을 사라고? 난 그저 내 초상화를 갖기 위해 여기에 왔을 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fdd838e1-8c25-80d1-663d-1fa9f732a80c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:fdd838e1-8c25-80d1-663d-1fa9f732a80c
msgctxt "hb5dfb934gfef6g4659gb0a9g90336255e537"
msgid "I've got enough problems without adding you to the list."
msgstr "당신 말고도 난 이미 문젯거리가 충분히 많아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = fea34f44-ed1b-cdf8-c8e3-fbf8b804138f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - LOW_OskarsBeloved_State_MentionedJannathInAct1 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist:fea34f44-ed1b-cdf8-c8e3-fbf8b804138f
msgctxt "h9769f2a0g0df2g42ddg8232gd0ed1ebb40b7"
msgid ""
"Assuming Lady Jannath still wishes to marry after our little... falling out."
msgstr "자나스 아가씨가 저희의 사소한... 결별 후에도 여전히 결혼을 원한다고 가정하면 말입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_AD_Cowering
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 103e55da-eb3d-d946-80ea-094c6d04d7ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.      - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_LeftForBG(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_AD_Cowering:103e55da-eb3d-d946-80ea-094c6d04d7ca
msgctxt "he7eb1aaege80cg4a5fg81fbg3c91bfc4de15"
msgid "Shitting hells, will this never end?!"
msgstr "빌어먹을, 이거 끝나기는 하는 거야?!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_AD_Cowering
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 598bf19b-e568-9181-52ff-3d05aefc992d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.      - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_FreedByViolence(0) = True
#.      - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_LeftForBG(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_AD_Cowering:598bf19b-e568-9181-52ff-3d05aefc992d
msgctxt "h81816eaeg8b3bg473egacedgdeb0e0d94902"
msgid "No, no - PLEASE!"
msgstr "아니, 아니 - 제발!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_AD_Cowering
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 7cfa7f22-65c9-6223-03c2-6eeaa6b7c04d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.      - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_FreedByViolence(0) = False
#.      - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_LeftForBG(0) = False
#.      - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_FreedByBribe(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_AD_Cowering:7cfa7f22-65c9-6223-03c2-6eeaa6b7c04d
msgctxt "hd07ba11eg53e5g43f8g8c44g075f870959aa"
msgid "Well?! You bought me, so save me! Please!"
msgstr "응?! 네가 나를 샀으니, 그러니 구해줘! 제발!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_AD_Cowering
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 81b4a1d6-b6cb-ff94-fd36-afa4f2ca175d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_State_FallBack = False
#.   Quest:
#.      - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_FreedByViolence(0) = False
#.      - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_LeftForBG(0) = False
#.      - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_FreedByBribe(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_AD_Cowering:81b4a1d6-b6cb-ff94-fd36-afa4f2ca175d
msgctxt "h6d1756ffg7439g430ega9d1gde81d146a19f"
msgid "I'm, uh - I'm sure you have more pressing concerns than talking to me."
msgstr "나는, 어 - 당신은 지금 말을 거는 것보다 더 시급한 문제가 있겠죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_AD_Cowering
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = cc5d1f8a-023e-6e80-6103-02ea8c97fcdc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_State_FallBack = True
#.   Quest:
#.      - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_FreedByViolence(0) = False
#.      - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_LeftForBG(0) = False
#.      - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_FreedByBribe(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_AD_Cowering:cc5d1f8a-023e-6e80-6103-02ea8c97fcdc
msgctxt "hcfe22baegb07eg4dc8gaf21ge0dd97a56ce9"
msgid "Gods, <i>oh gods </i>- this isn't happening."
msgstr "신이시여, <i>오 신이시여 </i>- 이런 일이 일어나선 안 돼요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_AD_Idle
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 1a08427a-ef2b-0fbc-ac63-a8762e87168b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 5e915b37-54da-42c0-02bf-30b086754023_step1 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_AD_Idle:1a08427a-ef2b-0fbc-ac63-a8762e87168b
msgctxt "h2fad49e9g99b8g4bc9ga3c8g654fd5a1b4c5"
msgid ""
"Look - there's no need for this. Free me now and I'll see that my patron "
"rewards you!"
msgstr "이봐요 - 이럴 필요는 없지 않습니까. 지금 절 풀어주면 제 후원자가 당신에게 후한 보상을 줄 겁니다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_AD_Idle
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 203cbd72-f8ac-027d-8334-4e6f36975826
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_AD_Idle:203cbd72-f8ac-027d-8334-4e6f36975826
msgctxt "h7034c5c5g406dg44d9g8aa1g8d2ba545cbef"
msgid "Gods - I'm going to die in the dark."
msgstr "신이시여 - 나는 어둠 속에서 죽어가게 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_AD_Idle
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 3d477ec8-3d52-6f90-208d-dfed26d5ff95
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_AD_Idle:3d477ec8-3d52-6f90-208d-dfed26d5ff95
msgctxt "hce6be8dfga645g426ega830g0f39354373b2"
msgid ""
"I'll drink only in the temple district, that you may keep an eye on me. "
"Please."
msgstr "당신이 절 지켜볼 수 있도록 성전 구역에서만 술을 마시겠습니다. 제발."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_AD_Idle
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 73834747-8200-fc3d-2aca-a5844f9668ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 5e915b37-54da-42c0-02bf-30b086754023_step3 = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 5e915b37-54da-42c0-02bf-30b086754023_step3 = False
#.     - 5e915b37-54da-42c0-02bf-30b086754023_step2 = False
#.     - 5e915b37-54da-42c0-02bf-30b086754023_step1 = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_AD_Idle:73834747-8200-fc3d-2aca-a5844f9668ed
msgctxt "h40c72216ge7e7g485eg9d8cg3c278cdc1de6"
msgid ""
"Ye watching gods - I don't know any prayers, but rescue me from this pit and "
"I swear that I will change."
msgstr "지켜보는 신들이시여 - 저는 어떤 기도도 알지 못하지만 이 구덩이에서 구해만 주신다면 변할 것임을 맹세합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_AD_Idle
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 768afc9c-71bc-8110-392e-05603cb02304
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 5e915b37-54da-42c0-02bf-30b086754023_step2 = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 5e915b37-54da-42c0-02bf-30b086754023_step3 = True
#.     - 5e915b37-54da-42c0-02bf-30b086754023_step2 = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_AD_Idle:768afc9c-71bc-8110-392e-05603cb02304
msgctxt "hee2fa1cfgebf6g41a8gbfdeg248aa9251655"
msgid "Maybe I'll drink my paints, hm? You won't get your damn ransom then!"
msgstr "내 물감을 마시기라도 할까, 응? 그럼 네 망할 몸값을 찾지 못할 텐데!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_AD_Idle
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 9c981ac7-b72e-831a-74f6-7dc8d1836535
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 5e915b37-54da-42c0-02bf-30b086754023_step1 = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 5e915b37-54da-42c0-02bf-30b086754023_step2 = True
#.     - 5e915b37-54da-42c0-02bf-30b086754023_step1 = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_AD_Idle:9c981ac7-b72e-831a-74f6-7dc8d1836535
msgctxt "h232e8159gc71fg47ebg8426g3ee8ee5bd69d"
msgid ""
"I have friends in the city - friends you do not want as enemies, you hear?!"
msgstr "나는 도시에 친구들이 있어 - 당신이 적으로서 원하지 않는 친구들, 들었어?!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_AD_Idle
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = b3611144-0d6b-43a4-c77f-eca74da01018
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_AD_Idle:b3611144-0d6b-43a4-c77f-eca74da01018
msgctxt "h7927a490gaf9ag4eccg99a5g617267739e65"
msgid "I need only tell her it's a gambling debt - it's happened before!"
msgstr "그냥 도박 빚이라고 하면 될 겁니다. 전에도 그랬거든요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_AD_WarnAboutExplosives
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 9c0ae5c6-faa7-673d-6ce3-2fe85b0da60f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_AD_WarnAboutExplosives:9c0ae5c6-faa7-673d-6ce3-2fe85b0da60f
msgctxt "hf889529egd6fbg472fgabf0g79c46ec5b2ed"
msgid "Wait! They've got oil everywhere - and bloody <i>torches!</i>"
msgstr "잠깐! 놈들이 사방에 기름을 뿌려놨습니다. 망할 <i>횃불</i>도 있다고요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 00d993fa-843e-4b42-89b6-11e4aecbea07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead:00d993fa-843e-4b42-89b6-11e4aecbea07
msgctxt "h712b6a6aga2d4g48ebga741g0e4e80a9de25"
msgid "Where are you from?"
msgstr "어디서 왔지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0cc98b89-da9b-1d1f-b37c-8a7bbab23bc0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - aa9fed89-e325-dfba-c783-480ab0fa9c68_KnowsFledMarriage = True
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead:0cc98b89-da9b-1d1f-b37c-8a7bbab23bc0
msgctxt "h0f56389ag0857g4b71gb5d6g8c20f70b301d"
msgid "Who were you meant to marry?"
msgstr "누구랑 결혼하려고 했지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 128b4b95-8561-4c45-af5c-8bfdb9a73936
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - aa9fed89-e325-dfba-c783-480ab0fa9c68_KnowsFledMarriage = True
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead:128b4b95-8561-4c45-af5c-8bfdb9a73936
msgctxt "h75ba3721g2860g4ad8gb7b9g4531773aec84"
msgid "What were you doing down here?"
msgstr "이 아래에서 뭘 하고 있었지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1f774c57-711e-4b24-8a80-acd0c882700b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead:1f774c57-711e-4b24-8a80-acd0c882700b
msgctxt "h47f7b262g8809g44c0g99efgb70fd46aa356"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 256f9e3b-0f75-437b-93bd-114e2570a3ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead:256f9e3b-0f75-437b-93bd-114e2570a3ff
msgctxt "h7d724003gdc87g482bg9ce3gcc47ed129322"
msgid "*The corpse remains silent. It does not know.*"
msgstr "*시체가 침묵을 유지합니다. 알지 못합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 2bf55f4a-de80-44a6-8321-e86d1ec8e465
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead:2bf55f4a-de80-44a6-8321-e86d1ec8e465
msgctxt "h0ff79e2bg419ag49c3gbd1dged69cb699990"
msgid "... Zhentarim hideout... sweaty and stinking... just like them..."
msgstr "... 젠타림 은신처... 눅눅하고 악취가 나... 놈들이랑 똑같아..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 362ed81e-fdec-47e8-9fd3-b56368ec0e09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead:362ed81e-fdec-47e8-9fd3-b56368ec0e09
msgctxt "h6a68c95dg75f6g4e04g8a6fgfd94439721eb"
msgid "How did you die?"
msgstr "어떻게 죽었지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 36f8da1c-1dfc-4c96-b69a-499cd9c6a97e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead:36f8da1c-1dfc-4c96-b69a-499cd9c6a97e
msgctxt "hf2ed8c11gdab7g437egbf53gc3dd57495508"
msgid "What is this place?"
msgstr "여기는 어디지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = 37372dcc-5f29-9fae-ceb1-faab5dda63ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead:37372dcc-5f29-9fae-ceb1-faab5dda63ef
msgctxt "h7d56c2c4gbf40g4537g8923gd44d78175da4"
msgid "... patron... Lady Jannath... but... love another..."
msgstr "... 후원자... 자나스 아가씨... 하지만... 다른 이를 사랑..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7fd20158-1b09-446e-b5b2-c3ce4bf3c9f4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead:7fd20158-1b09-446e-b5b2-c3ce4bf3c9f4
msgctxt "h8f033016g879dg45bfg831cga4595973e82a"
msgid "Where did you keep your valuables?"
msgstr "귀중품은 어디에 보관했지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9f8d7700-83f9-495c-8f7a-44ce80426af8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead_GreatestArtistAlive(1) = True
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead:9f8d7700-83f9-495c-8f7a-44ce80426af8
msgctxt "hac8322c3g4336g47c0g9774g89f56ad2fcf3"
msgid "You do know you're not alive anymore, right?"
msgstr "네가 더 이상 살아있지 않다는 건 알고 있지, 그렇지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = ab19169d-a3ab-486e-b9f2-34ffbfdb8587
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead:ab19169d-a3ab-486e-b9f2-34ffbfdb8587
msgctxt "h57b12cbegd596g41e3g9b20g45d58ba192d4"
msgid "... Baldur's Gate... Lady Jannath's own court..."
msgstr "... 발더스 게이트... 자나스 아가씨 소유의 안뜰..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = ab5de7d7-ef4d-42c3-8ba8-17cf77fa0f57
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead:ab5de7d7-ef4d-42c3-8ba8-17cf77fa0f57
msgctxt "h8806bbbbg8a97g4f8dga64cg81676d136f9e"
msgid "Oskar Fevras... greatest artist... alive..."
msgstr "오스카 페브라스... 살아있는... 가장 위대한... 예술가..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b6154ada-efc4-4309-82ec-416a143b9707
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead:b6154ada-efc4-4309-82ec-416a143b9707
msgctxt "hbde75075g9798g4403g94c1g6f52c1db1ff1"
msgid "*The corpse does not stir. It will answer no more questions.*"
msgstr "*시체는 움직이지 않습니다. 더 이상 질문을 받지 않을 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b631c755-d94c-4a9b-85ba-c84647bd2ce3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead:b631c755-d94c-4a9b-85ba-c84647bd2ce3
msgctxt "hc6249ecfg86c8g4685gb7c3gaf24d436c66d"
msgid "*The corpse regards you lifelessly.*"
msgstr "*시체가 생기 없는 모습으로 당신을 맞이합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b93d95a9-f16d-43b3-876b-b5d4bf73577d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead_GreatestArtistAlive(1) = True
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead:b93d95a9-f16d-43b3-876b-b5d4bf73577d
msgctxt "h0b44c3eeg0d89g4d58gbaedg8d7f1bd1c225"
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr "너는 누구지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = bb33dd5a-c809-44f1-9478-68274ec9c47a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead:bb33dd5a-c809-44f1-9478-68274ec9c47a
msgctxt "h4adef17bgc279g4401ga81ag3944c2526ab6"
msgid "... peculiar... sense of humour..."
msgstr "... 유머 감각이... 참 이상하네..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = cd888083-574c-427b-917e-70ad59142209
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead:cd888083-574c-427b-917e-70ad59142209
msgctxt "hd5482632gbaf6g4257g9540gd74c6c5f1523"
msgid "... fleeing marriage... captured... on road..."
msgstr "... 결혼식에서 도망치다가... 잡혔어... 길에서..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = de99cc67-36fb-45eb-bbc4-c4f6b359dc44
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead:de99cc67-36fb-45eb-bbc4-c4f6b359dc44
msgctxt "h06d0c684g745dg4037ga742gf66f722fcbb3"
msgid "*The spell's power wanes. You can ask no more questions.*"
msgstr "*주문의 힘이 약해집니다. 더 이상 질문을 할 수 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e5ee4f3f-9fc3-4e71-8df0-6c3965eb18af
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_Killer(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead:e5ee4f3f-9fc3-4e71-8df0-6c3965eb18af
msgctxt "h16f41914g184dg46f8g9ba4g7d85432d570d"
msgid "*The corpse seems willing to speak - but not to its killer.*"
msgstr "*시체는 말할 의지가 있지만, 자신을 죽인 자와 대화하고 싶지는 않은 듯 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead
#. Speaker = Oskar Fevras
#. NodeID = f54a37a7-b4f8-4b71-b93b-df3a78862ebe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_DoubtingArtist_Dead:f54a37a7-b4f8-4b71-b93b-df3a78862ebe
msgctxt "hc036044fg049bg4151ga969g28f9e291b178"
msgid "...These hands... this mind... treasure enough for a king..."
msgstr "...이 손... 이 마음... 왕에게 충분한 보물..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_PAD_HiddenEntrance_Opened
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3d6ec6f9-be21-0009-9947-bce383f7f230
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_PAD_HiddenEntrance_Opened:3d6ec6f9-be21-0009-9947-bce383f7f230
msgctxt "hc3dc44fbgf47eg496egba4bgb5e89031ad3f"
msgid "Oh that's excellent! So good to see a secret passage with some flair."
msgstr "훌륭하군! 솜씨 있는 비밀 통로를 보다니 아주 재밌어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_PAD_HiddenEntrance_Opened
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3d6ec6f9-be21-0009-9947-bce383f7f230
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_PAD_HiddenEntrance_Opened:3d6ec6f9-be21-0009-9947-bce383f7f230
msgctxt "h60867d33g794cg432cga023g96a31e5c6519"
msgid "What have we here?"
msgstr "이건 뭐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_PAD_HiddenEntrance_Opened
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3d6ec6f9-be21-0009-9947-bce383f7f230
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_PAD_HiddenEntrance_Opened:3d6ec6f9-be21-0009-9947-bce383f7f230
msgctxt "hd48297f7gb719g493eg87c9ge30f222c80f2"
msgid "Well now - a little spectacle never hurts."
msgstr "뭐, 약간의 구경거리는 해가 되지 않는다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_PAD_HiddenEntrance_Opened
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3d6ec6f9-be21-0009-9947-bce383f7f230
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_PAD_HiddenEntrance_Opened:3d6ec6f9-be21-0009-9947-bce383f7f230
msgctxt "hb4da0e83gd0e3g462bgbde1g8a94ef5b7172"
msgid "Nice."
msgstr "멋지군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_PAD_HiddenEntrance_Opened
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3d6ec6f9-be21-0009-9947-bce383f7f230
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_PAD_HiddenEntrance_Opened:3d6ec6f9-be21-0009-9947-bce383f7f230
msgctxt "h06d29525g33a5g4573g8027g9927fde909d5"
msgid "Nicely designed. Secrecy always inspires ingenuity."
msgstr "훌륭한 디자인이군. 비밀을 추구하다 보면 기발함이 따라오는 법이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_PAD_HiddenEntrance_Opened
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3d6ec6f9-be21-0009-9947-bce383f7f230
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_PAD_HiddenEntrance_Opened:3d6ec6f9-be21-0009-9947-bce383f7f230
msgctxt "hc1fe5afcg087fg4487g9a87g8e0e12d594b8"
msgid "Ooh! Lovely.\n"
msgstr ""

