msgid "An illusory wall. Let's find out what it seeks to hide."
msgstr "가짜 벽이군. 안에 뭐가 있는지 보자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_PAD_NoticedFakeWall
