msgid "An illusion. Hiding something valuable, surely."
msgstr "환영이군. 분명 뭔가 값비싼 걸 숨기고 있었겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_PAD_NoticedFakeWall
