msgid ""
"An illusion. There must be something worth being kept secret through there."
msgstr "환영이군. 저 뒤에 뭔가 중요한 게 있는 모양이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_PAD_NoticedFakeWall
