msgctxt "hf5850bc0ga7a0g40a0g8cacgf1ba9d842265"
msgid "Ooh - an illusory wall. Wonder what's hiding back there."
msgstr "우 - 환영 벽이군. 저 뒤에 어떤 비밀이 숨겨져 있을지 궁금하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_PAD_NoticedFakeWall
