msgid "That wall's an illusion! Hiding what, I wonder..."
msgstr "저 벽은 환영이군! 뒤에 뭘 감추고 있을까..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_VB_Cellar
