msgctxt "h65e9a94cg9f5dg400bg866egf1c3b3ae740f"
msgid ""
"You're a friend of the family now. Just as well I didn't blow you up, eh?"
msgstr "너도 이제 식구의 친구야. 널 날려버리지 않아서 다행이군, 안 그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent01
