msgctxt "h10db28fcg681cg458bg8ac5gc454186dc075"
msgid ""
"Step lightly - we rigged enough smokepowder to blow this place sky-high. "
"Fist won't find a thing."
msgstr "바닥을 조심해, 이곳을 완전히 날려버릴 만큼 화약을 깔아뒀으니까. 피스트 놈들은 아무런 흔적도 찾지 못할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent01
#. Speaker = Salazon
#. NodeID = 9ea81be6-a059-48f5-bc3f-71c064ffe9b7
