"Bring them back alive if you can. Failing that, get me that shipment. "
"<i>Unopened.</i>"
msgstr "가능하다면 그들을 살려서 데려와 줘. 그럴 수 없다면, 화물이라도 챙겨오고. <i>열리지 않은 채로 말이야.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 09dcdf6f-c912-4dad-7a6f-364b63b753f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_Quest_Refused(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_State_GnollZhentsPresent = False
#.   Quest:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment.AgreedHelp(1) = False
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment.Rewarded_OnlyCargo(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:09dcdf6f-c912-4dad-7a6f-364b63b753f0
msgctxt "h60757503g4d7fg4f04gbf00g0a12f7e70cb4"
msgid ""
"Yeah? Got business to conduct, so if you ain't helping you can toddle off."
msgstr "그래? 처리할 일이 있어서 말이야, 도울 생각이 없다면 이제 가."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0b5205e9-8dec-3e6f-a1f5-3bb60ec27499
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_Knows_SurvivorsAreDead = True
#.   Object:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_Knows_SurvivorsDead(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:0b5205e9-8dec-3e6f-a1f5-3bb60ec27499
msgctxt "h47136c9eg4d6dg4529gaad5g910b33a7e2cd"
msgid "I have news of your missing people."
msgstr "당신네 실종자들에 대한 소식이 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 111d98da-cc04-75b0-0c4e-4e40691734a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:111d98da-cc04-75b0-0c4e-4e40691734a2
msgctxt "h8e557184gd86dg4916ga09cgf76ce0f7fc80"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 114638b6-bbdc-d646-1235-9e20978f1d73
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:114638b6-bbdc-d646-1235-9e20978f1d73
msgctxt "h8d82975fg8c70g4a92g85bag6f85971b88a5"
msgid "Good luck with that. I don't want to get involved."
msgstr "행운을 빌지. 난 딱히 연관되고 싶지 않군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 14446550-56e2-cea3-89b6-1a3ef71a57cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:14446550-56e2-cea3-89b6-1a3ef71a57cc
msgctxt "haa1b397dg05d6g4d46g9b66g062fe743bd9a"
msgid ""
"Spend your coin and be on your way. But be quick about it - we're blowing "
"this place soon."
msgstr "동전 좀 쓰고 네 가고 싶은 길 가. 다만 빨리 가 - 우린 곧 이 장소를 폭파시킬 예정이거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 14b870a4-c633-1d95-1705-e1e761e8aeac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - PLA_ZhentShipment.AgreedHelp(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:14b870a4-c633-1d95-1705-e1e761e8aeac
msgctxt "h61e77d46gc0ccg4b9cg9befg7ae3cc328cfc"
msgid "Looks like we can be friends after all."
msgstr "보아하니 결국 우린 친구가 될 수 있을 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 15d67a59-20c5-88b0-2f54-e379eb12aeaf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_State_SurvivorsAreDead = False
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_Agent_001_State_Dead = True
#.   Object:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_Knows_SurvivorsDead(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_Knows_SurvivorsDead(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:15d67a59-20c5-88b0-2f54-e379eb12aeaf
msgctxt "h99801836ge1ecg42ceg87bbg143d7e834aeb"
msgid "I'm afraid they won't coming back."
msgstr "안타깝지만 돌아올 것 같진 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 193a2e62-7335-2cfe-c44a-2f80bd76897d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:193a2e62-7335-2cfe-c44a-2f80bd76897d
msgctxt "h651ac370ga047g43d0gb56bg9722343b232f"
msgid "I've changed my mind. I'll take the job."
msgstr "생각이 바뀌었어. 그 일을 수락하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 1c586380-3d33-c8be-18d2-1a13e3ad8342
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:1c586380-3d33-c8be-18d2-1a13e3ad8342
msgctxt "h698934f2g789ag46a1ga6cbga93dea11ee51"
msgid "Then someone kidnapped a duke - right on our bloody doorstep."
msgstr "그런데 누군가가 공작을 납치했어. 지독하게도 우리 문간 앞에서."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 1cb98a1f-6e0a-0779-10bf-b41f7011b5e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_State_AllowedSpecialTrade = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:1cb98a1f-6e0a-0779-10bf-b41f7011b5e7
msgctxt "hce4aec62g6ef5g457fg94bcg1cbe27ea49ac"
msgid "Assuming we make it back there in one piece."
msgstr "우리가 멀쩡히 돌아갈 수 있다고 가정하면."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 1db01fe8-5e3c-4c37-7742-6acf38dc5d38
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:1db01fe8-5e3c-4c37-7742-6acf38dc5d38
msgctxt "h1f3c88d6g1a1eg4e78g9a36g5dd2fd037433"
msgid ""
"All you need to know is that I'm willing to pay a hideous sum to get it back "
"- unopened."
msgstr "네가 알아야 할 건, 내가 열리지 않은 그것을 돌려받기 위해 엄청난 금액을 기꺼이 지불하고자 한다는 사실뿐이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1eca9da9-ff8e-81a1-ae21-6a0969efd80a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_CursedIronFlask_State_HasFlask(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_CursedIronFlask_Event_GiveFlask(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:1eca9da9-ff8e-81a1-ae21-6a0969efd80a
msgctxt "h27008466g5a18g4363ga655gaafb493d6604"
msgid "<i>Give her the flask you found inside the chest.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그녀에게 궤짝 안에서 발견한 플라스크를 넘긴다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 1f9529b3-2a82-04c0-3ada-6b9d803bd694
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_State_GnollZhentsPresent = False
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_State_JoinedZhent = False
#.   Object:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_Knows_SurvivorsDead(0) = False
#.   Quest:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment.Rewarded_ZhentReturned(1) = False
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment.AgreedHelp(1) = True
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment.Rewarded_OnlyCargo(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:1f9529b3-2a82-04c0-3ada-6b9d803bd694
msgctxt "h9109105eg8c13g4564g9533g100923739d9f"
msgid "Any luck finding my people?"
msgstr "내 사람들을 찾았나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 23a3a297-1dcb-5493-9f39-b4fa3c14fb24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:23a3a297-1dcb-5493-9f39-b4fa3c14fb24
msgctxt "hbaa5771fg5661g41b2g9f1dgdb4dfb1a275c"
msgid "What's this job you mentioned?"
msgstr "네가 말한 그 일이 뭐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2a038c27-de3c-8406-3d0f-d7f4006052ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ConflictedFlind_State_Gone = True
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_State_TalkedAfterKilledGnolls = True
#.   Object:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_Knows_Agent002Dead(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_ZhentDungeon_State_WaitForGnollZhent = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:2a038c27-de3c-8406-3d0f-d7f4006052ba
msgctxt "ha3bf4c6fg5a8bg43ccg89e1gf4571e52872d"
msgid "I saved Rugan. He'll be along soon."
msgstr "루간을 구했어. 곧 이리로 올 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 2a28e172-5308-9add-d637-0b52c0d3746e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_ZhentShipment_State_SaidChestLost = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:2a28e172-5308-9add-d637-0b52c0d3746e
msgctxt "hd91e9ee6ge38eg4bd1g92c4g50c7f2303efb"
msgid "You... lost it. Funny, that - you just lost a heap of coin too."
msgstr "그걸... 잃어버렸다고. 재밌네, 그게 - 넌 방금 엄청난 금화도 잃어버린 거거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 2b2cc023-42d2-ecd1-6158-5664a896737a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:2b2cc023-42d2-ecd1-6158-5664a896737a
msgctxt "hf66fe604gbbebg4a14g99c8g53fa508c0d1d"
msgid "Failure creates debt. And debt requires payment. But he'll live."
msgstr "실패는 빚을 만들지. 그리고 빚은 변제를 요하고. 하지만 살아남긴 할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e046601-6d42-a7a8-1d04-cbfe3fdc6ad9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:2e046601-6d42-a7a8-1d04-cbfe3fdc6ad9
msgctxt "hbe2aa4a6gfca8g45b6g8608ga061f09ae329"
msgid "A job? You were ready to kill me a moment ago."
msgstr "일이라고? 방금 전만 해도 날 죽이려고 했으면서."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e20ca9e-f4f1-0421-a54b-7c77ff10b9bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_Knows_SurvivorsInCave = True
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_Knows_SurvivorsAreDead = False
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_Agent_001_State_Dead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:2e20ca9e-f4f1-0421-a54b-7c77ff10b9bf
msgctxt "ha91d2f09g1aa8g473egad9dgb9753473baf2"
msgid "I found a pair that sound like your men - being swarmed by gnolls."
msgstr "당신네 사람들로 보이는 이들을 찾았어, 놀 무리에게 압도되고 있던데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 2e38593f-5605-174e-3a75-7c7842c8019f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - PLA_ZhentShipment.AgreedHelp(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:2e38593f-5605-174e-3a75-7c7842c8019f
msgctxt "h2a868911gb4b7g4913g8151g114303a21bcf"
msgid "Time was, no one dared touch a caravan bearing our colours."
msgstr "우리 상징을 단 상단은 아무도 건드릴 생각조차 못하던 때가 있었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 2e51de2a-288d-ebf0-638b-1015519f5da3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_State_GnollZhentsPresent = True
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_State_ChestLost = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:2e51de2a-288d-ebf0-638b-1015519f5da3
msgctxt "hca271e1bg0039g428bg8f1eg482e13a9628d"
msgid "I was glad to see Rugan, until he told me he lost the shipment."
msgstr "루간을 만났을 때까진 반가웠어, 그가 화물을 잃어버렸다고 하기 전까지는 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 30dc495e-0055-720d-b213-5d9e6fd4e89b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:30dc495e-0055-720d-b213-5d9e6fd4e89b
msgctxt "h0316042eg9d9dg4a53g9b59gd06006439da0"
msgid "Find whoever did this and remind them why."
msgstr "이 짓을 한 사람을 찾아서 그 이유를 상기시켜 줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 31c32e33-bd7c-9d98-3ecd-a8cca81d3880
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:31c32e33-bd7c-9d98-3ecd-a8cca81d3880
msgctxt "hb2c39c4dgb143g402ag8ad1g82713860c10e"
msgid "Still am, as it goes. Take it as a mark of respect."
msgstr "지금도 마찬가지야. 존중의 표시로 받아들여."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 326c1225-ad3f-b5a6-1817-dbff7ca32316
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:326c1225-ad3f-b5a6-1817-dbff7ca32316
msgctxt "h253d342bg6fadg4536g82d8g3bb3e0dfcb4c"
msgid ""
"Well I'll give you a hint, shall I? <i>They ain't down here. </i>On your way."
msgstr "내가 힌트 하나 줄까? <i>이 아래에는 없어. </i>이제 갈 길 가."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 32941e33-3470-4e1a-4c14-5faecf1d185e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_Knows_SurvivorsAreDead = True
#.   Object:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_Knows_SurvivorsDead(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_Knows_SurvivorsDead(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:32941e33-3470-4e1a-4c14-5faecf1d185e
msgctxt "hc6e4fa67gf341g43e1ga986g7f9819d0a16f"
msgid "I found them. They're dead."
msgstr "그들을 찾았어. 모두 죽었더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 32e7ac5d-1454-4eee-096f-1c9f689d7ffd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:32e7ac5d-1454-4eee-096f-1c9f689d7ffd
msgctxt "hfe09cc49ga127g4b2ag9546gaef942f7c122"
msgid ""
"But right now, I reckon we're better off friends than enemies. You "
"interested or not?"
msgstr "하지만 지금은 우리가 적보다는 친구로 지내는 게 낫다고 생각하는데. 넌 관심 있어, 없어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 34657c96-c908-d23b-9071-574a76234b40
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Quest_AgentsMissing = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:34657c96-c908-d23b-9071-574a76234b40
msgctxt "h6be9bd6cgf356g4dbbga6bfgbe054234d085"
msgid "Some of our people are missing - more importantly, so is their cargo."
msgstr "우리 사람들 중 일부가 실종되었어. 더 중요한 것은, 그들의 화물도 실종되었다는 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 36c7d6b7-1e5e-dba7-1696-cd0fd140f6a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:36c7d6b7-1e5e-dba7-1696-cd0fd140f6a9
msgctxt "ha0054e37g3d24g4ad1ga1aege76348e5b929"
msgid "I don't plan on it being us."
msgstr "그게 우리가 되는 건 내 계획에 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3ba8d14a-e43e-d878-05cc-e7fb05d94053
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Knows_ZhentAreDestroyingCave(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:3ba8d14a-e43e-d878-05cc-e7fb05d94053
msgctxt "h253d723eg6160g4135g86f9g2ad1603c3bde"
msgid "Rubble? What are you planning to do?"
msgstr "돌무더기라고? 뭘 하려는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 3f2c87d7-8fcb-95e9-9fec-73a3d0dcb925
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_State_JoinedZhent = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:3f2c87d7-8fcb-95e9-9fec-73a3d0dcb925
msgctxt "habf44ffbg1ce5g493bga1e9gd052fe6edb7c"
msgid ""
"Welcome to the family. Don't get comfortable - that shipment's wanted in "
"Baldur's Gate."
msgstr "우리 식구가 된 걸 환영한다. 그 배송품은 발더스 게이트에서 수배 중이니 안심하지는 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 41bffaf1-4115-911d-00fa-e36125934f65
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_Quest_Refused(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_State_GnollZhentsPresent = False
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_State_JoinedZhent = False
#.   Object:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_Knows_SurvivorsDead(0) = False
#.   Quest:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment.AgreedHelp(1) = False
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment.Rewarded_OnlyCargo(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:41bffaf1-4115-911d-00fa-e36125934f65
msgctxt "hf3a852deg249eg47d2gb52dg413692b0d549"
msgid "Not many can talk their way into a Zhentarim outpost."
msgstr "젠타림 기지에 대화로 들어올 수 있는 사람은 많지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 41e5cf91-4033-b26e-ab7d-02d42f739eed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:41e5cf91-4033-b26e-ab7d-02d42f739eed
msgctxt "h8d7bcbd0g7ca0g424dga68fg54efda0507cd"
msgid ""
"If you've got coin to spend and problems to solve, the Zhent will relieve "
"you of both."
msgstr "너에게 지불할 동전과 해결해야 할 문제만 있다면, 젠트가 양쪽 방면에서 해결해줄 수 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 43f235de-c16e-6c9e-e2b4-e83e0bc5dd73
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_Knows_SurvivorsAreDead = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_Knows_SurvivorsDead(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:43f235de-c16e-6c9e-e2b4-e83e0bc5dd73
msgctxt "h308ad6b7ged03g4b92gb723g1bc004496a17"
msgid "I already found them. They're dead."
msgstr "그들이라면 이미 찾았어. 모두 죽었더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 458bd5b1-df41-f4d0-65be-c010f9ac32e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:458bd5b1-df41-f4d0-65be-c010f9ac32e5
msgctxt "hf9e3a85egf7e9g41f7g87e2g6dddaca3199a"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 45ff31cd-f0ab-6b12-1235-ed471701d25a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_State_JoinedZhent = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:45ff31cd-f0ab-6b12-1235-ed471701d25a
msgctxt "h5573ce6fg324cg434fg9e37gd8248a1ac5a4"
msgid "What're you jawing at me for, recruit? You've got work to do."
msgstr "뭘 지껄이고 있어, 신병? 할 일이나 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 4b90c2f3-1da6-d5c3-41da-0b24ef408369
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:4b90c2f3-1da6-d5c3-41da-0b24ef408369
msgctxt "h6256ea3fg0be1g4c08g9f56ge75fc17add2e"
msgid "That's Zhent business, not yours."
msgstr "그건 젠타림의 일이야, 네 것이 아니라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 4df6aaaf-c196-65d7-6429-9af56d2595fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_Knows_SurvivorsDead(0) = True
#.   Quest:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment.Rewarded_OnlyCargo(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:4df6aaaf-c196-65d7-6429-9af56d2595fe
msgctxt "hfd8e578bg6d56g4b22g820fgfcfc9cb602d6"
msgid ""
"You've already brought me bad news - tell me you've got something better "
"this time."
msgstr "이미 나쁜 소식이라면 전해줬잖아, 이번엔 좀 나은 소식이라고 해 줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 51fd532b-06b4-4489-16ff-de8c27c6cbcb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:51fd532b-06b4-4489-16ff-de8c27c6cbcb
msgctxt "h7f2d7a9ag02c4g4d4dgb2ebgee063e982ed2"
msgid "I'm just here to trade - I have my own concerns."
msgstr "나는 단지 거래를 하러 온 거야. 이미 내 문제도 있고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 543dfb9a-a13e-769d-ada8-0684babd8ad8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:543dfb9a-a13e-769d-ada8-0684babd8ad8
msgctxt "h327627c3g2ecbg4558gbea2g923446e7648d"
msgid "Good. Reckon you won't find it here, though."
msgstr "좋아. 하지만 여기서는 찾지 못할 거라고 생각해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 54a1c8b2-1ad2-7f55-863c-c8974e8e3c44
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:54a1c8b2-1ad2-7f55-863c-c8974e8e3c44
msgctxt "he9facc23g3f13g4d68gba9ag7a4f367e3f64"
msgid "But today I'm offering work, not looking for it."
msgstr "하지만 오늘은 일을 찾는 대신, 주려고 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 569ceb1d-cc48-23e6-a263-3cc58c2cca44
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:569ceb1d-cc48-23e6-a263-3cc58c2cca44
msgctxt "h5de5417dgb0c6g434dgbb36g556003ebc412"
msgid "I don't want to get caught up in any of this."
msgstr "이런 일에 휘말리고 싶진 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 592776c5-6fcd-abe4-cd02-a8624c015329
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_ZhentShipment_State_DeliveredUnlockedChest = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:592776c5-6fcd-abe4-cd02-a8624c015329
msgctxt "hb95ef6e2gac98g4b62gb939ge363fc54b245"
msgid ""
"Beshaba's black bones, you bloody found it. Funny thing, though - I swear I "
"told you not to open it."
msgstr "베샤바의 검은 뼈여, 네가 그걸 찾았군. 그런데, 재밌군 - 분명 그걸 열지 말라고 했던 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5ca70d14-532c-4ee3-d112-008df7fa2c6b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:5ca70d14-532c-4ee3-d112-008df7fa2c6b
msgctxt "hff034c70g62c5g417eg8f9dg062efbbbc981"
msgid "What's so important about this cargo?"
msgstr "이 화물이 뭐가 그렇게 중요하길래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5e6be1d4-f686-e3c0-6bc4-58a40a611b59
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Knows_ZhentAreDestroyingCave(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Knows_ZhentAreDestroyingCave(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:5e6be1d4-f686-e3c0-6bc4-58a40a611b59
msgctxt "h6b5a8e39g77bcg40f8gb5ddg6c018436f549"
msgid "Lot of explosives. Planning a war?"
msgstr "폭발물이 많군. 전쟁을 준비 중인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 65c4d561-fa3e-7b52-62a7-da4f6c4f880f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_State_TouchedChest = True
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_Knows_SurvivorsAreDead = False
#.   Object:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_Knows_SurvivorsDead(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:65c4d561-fa3e-7b52-62a7-da4f6c4f880f
msgctxt "h2a47e490g5d94g4fdcgb84ag054ff8cf7f41"
msgid "I have news of your missing people."
msgstr "당신네 실종자들에 대한 소식이 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 6676a971-77cb-40b7-9979-5af6cfb1aec7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:6676a971-77cb-40b7-9979-5af6cfb1aec7
msgctxt "h865ff4fcgec78g4cb5gafa7gf5db15168740"
msgid "Didn't think you'd get your coin based on spinning some tale, did you?"
msgstr "이야기를 좀 돌리는 것만으로 돈을 받을 수 있을 거라 생각한 건 아니지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 67cd732d-0401-0f32-7a59-99e77ebe4ec7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:67cd732d-0401-0f32-7a59-99e77ebe4ec7
msgctxt "h4d43b313g3ee0g4cc0gb9a1g20969036d2b5"
msgid "Well?"
msgstr "그래서?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 689891e8-28c6-0b25-8ced-97b7696840f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GEN_TransferNPCPayment_3(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:689891e8-28c6-0b25-8ced-97b7696840f6
msgctxt "h4a6c132cg182dg4ff1gb2c3g73a43f4330a5"
msgid "And still sealed? You're a godsdamned wonder. Here's your coin."
msgstr "게다가 봉인도 온전해. 정말이지 대단하군. 여기 동전 받아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 707d07ba-5a40-43d6-2d52-d35e0c38ac56
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_ZhentShipment_Quest_Refused(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:707d07ba-5a40-43d6-2d52-d35e0c38ac56
msgctxt "h483a0731g4b93g4bc0g83afgf310fb3aed79"
msgid "Sounds shady. I'd rather not get involved."
msgstr "수상하게 들리는군. 관여하지 않는 게 좋겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 78bfe345-8983-4a6e-76ab-31872a2ebef6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:78bfe345-8983-4a6e-76ab-31872a2ebef6
msgctxt "h92a0e21fgc646g4c9cg94e6g5502eec1523b"
msgid ""
"Maybe not now, no. But that'll change once the council gets involved. "
"They'll want heads to roll."
msgstr "지금 당장은 아닐지도 모르지. 하지만 의회가 연관되고 나면 상황이 바뀔 거야. 놈들은 머리가 바닥을 굴러다니길 원할 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 7aacb09b-14b4-da4f-2164-ca0140e86e94
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:7aacb09b-14b4-da4f-2164-ca0140e86e94
msgctxt "h86eeba70g3d01g4c22gab76g0f7c081cae99"
msgid ""
"Find them. Keep them alive if you can. Failing that, just bring that "
"shipment back. <i>Unopened.</i>"
msgstr "그들을 찾아서, 가능하면 살려줘. 그러지 못하면, 그 배송품만이라도 가져와. <i>열지는 말고.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7d45d1a9-c089-128b-4cd0-2b683fbbed72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:7d45d1a9-c089-128b-4cd0-2b683fbbed72
msgctxt "h2a72a840g4720g43f7g972dg35616131ad17"
msgid "I'm still looking."
msgstr "아직 찾아보고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 80109143-719e-38fb-c9f9-b8ff55ffde65
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:80109143-719e-38fb-c9f9-b8ff55ffde65
msgctxt "hf9da043cg07cag42fag80adgd76d2af1b6f1"
msgid "Fine. What's the job?"
msgstr "좋아. 뭘 하면 되는데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 847ef15b-49fd-8e1d-f4d5-45a7b204162d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:847ef15b-49fd-8e1d-f4d5-45a7b204162d
msgctxt "h312775f2g52d3g4f58g9510ga8cc4b53e8d5"
msgid ""
"We're getting out - just one last loose end to take care of. Help me and "
"I'll make it worth your while."
msgstr "우린 여길 뜰 건데, 마지막으로 처리할 일 하나가 있어. 도와준다면 보답하도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 849e8c43-dc7f-ac2a-9a86-5f668af188b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Quest_AgentsMissing = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Quest_AgentsMissing = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:849e8c43-dc7f-ac2a-9a86-5f668af188b7
msgctxt "h27b5b4d5g5a92g4d21gbfddg4ce6c8f830f2"
msgid ""
"Some of our people are missing - more importantly, so is their cargo. They "
"were in a caravan coming from the east."
msgstr "우리 사람들 중 일부가 실종되었어. 더 중요한 것은, 그들의 화물도 실종되었다는 거야. 그들은 동쪽에서 오는 상단에 있었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 852306dd-52e7-04da-e47b-7ccd5b2d9e70
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Knows_ZhentAreDestroyingCave(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Knows_ZhentAreDestroyingCave(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:852306dd-52e7-04da-e47b-7ccd5b2d9e70
msgctxt "h63e4b678gb45bg42c3gafa7g01141203b233"
msgid "Rubble? What are you planning to do?"
msgstr "돌무더기라고? 뭘 하려는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8ca8aa34-7b4f-7436-a8b1-23aa1c223d15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_State_TouchedChest = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:8ca8aa34-7b4f-7436-a8b1-23aa1c223d15
msgctxt "h4f6b1551g5c50g4c11g9c9eg3c7e3d51729f"
msgid "<i>Leave without mentioning the cargo.</i>"
msgstr "<i>화물에 대해 말하지 않고 떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 91d500dd-7133-e004-0374-ad291ab9b6ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:91d500dd-7133-e004-0374-ad291ab9b6ac
msgctxt "h1b6e1e20gd17bg4631ga100gd47c4491c590"
msgid "And making a small fortune ain't one of them?"
msgstr "약간의 부를 얻는 것도 그 중 하나 아닐까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 94e6effe-71a7-b7f1-fb7d-e71a60a9fee2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Knows_ZhentAreDestroyingCave(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_ZhentDungeon_State_AllowedSpecialTrade = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:94e6effe-71a7-b7f1-fb7d-e71a60a9fee2
msgctxt "ha6459b03g98fcg44bfg9a50gcb2dcdb43ac0"
msgid ""
"Our trader can show you some of our more exotic items, now - but don't "
"delay. This place is likely to be rubble soon."
msgstr "우리 상인이 더욱 이색적인 물품들을 지금 바로 보여줄 수 있어. 하지만 너무 머무르지는 마. 여긴 곧 돌무더기가 될 거니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 994ca212-c7ef-6333-2345-235b9e360962
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_State_ChestLost = True
#.   Quest:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment.Rewarded_ZhentReturned(1) = False
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment.AgreedHelp(1) = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GEN_TransferNPCPayment_3(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:994ca212-c7ef-6333-2345-235b9e360962
msgctxt "h3bdcecb9gac18g427aga866g68c89fbf5071"
msgid "Here's your coin, as promised."
msgstr "자, 받아. 약속한 대로야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 9b9d2876-e3a4-89ee-747a-b571136fd03b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_State_ChestUnlocked = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:9b9d2876-e3a4-89ee-747a-b571136fd03b
msgctxt "h15693a81gfca2g4657gb034gf3ed54f1f380"
msgid "Beshaba's black bones, you did it!"
msgstr "베샤바 맙소사, 네가 해냈구나!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 9bd9a5d8-4529-c87a-e84e-3303069a13d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:9bd9a5d8-4529-c87a-e84e-3303069a13d6
msgctxt "h3b6159beg050fg4161gafd8g1ac247c307a7"
msgid "We're the finest mercenaries on the Coast."
msgstr "우린 이 소드 코스트에서 제일 우수한 용병 집단이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a19fce60-7bc4-1e4b-21aa-9c8ef553bd60
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_State_ChestUnlocked = True
#.   Object:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_State_HasShipment(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:a19fce60-7bc4-1e4b-21aa-9c8ef553bd60
msgctxt "hbfcdb3e4g1aefg435cg91cdg1218b57b55f8"
msgid "<i>Give her the chest.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그녀에게 상자를 건넨다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = a3592f13-9888-e6a7-d814-9fa785e65f62
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:a3592f13-9888-e6a7-d814-9fa785e65f62
msgctxt "hfc0e8508g929fg42f8gb203gfe377a3aba44"
msgid ""
"Couldn't you just be a professional? Do as you're told, no questions asked? "
"Like so:"
msgstr "좀 전문가처럼 행동할 수는 없는 건가? 그냥 묻지 않고 시키는 대로 하는 것 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a493afd8-a497-cb8a-8091-e04252b4be86
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:a493afd8-a497-cb8a-8091-e04252b4be86
msgctxt "hd3d2cf0eg64f6g49f1gb6b6g269eebadf19e"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a517b670-7c71-2cb5-d727-0db7e79fba6c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_State_ChestUnlocked = False
#.   Object:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_State_HasShipment(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - PLA_ZhentShipment_Event_GiveChest(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:a517b670-7c71-2cb5-d727-0db7e79fba6c
msgctxt "hb338687bgbe81g4be7gaff9gb8ac57a2849d"
msgid "<i>Give her the chest.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그녀에게 상자를 건넨다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = a5e9eca1-fc2e-4042-beef-d991b294e7fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:a5e9eca1-fc2e-4042-beef-d991b294e7fa
msgctxt "hce2abac3g2be3g4f7fgb7e0g43db7f0cda6a"
msgid ""
"Actual professionals are rare - you ever want more work, come see me in the "
"Gate."
msgstr "제대로 된 전문가는 찾아보기 힘들지. 일거리가 더 필요하거든, 발더스 게이트에서 날 찾아와."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = acbe42fb-3871-0153-d703-ca78d974fd7a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:acbe42fb-3871-0153-d703-ca78d974fd7a
msgctxt "h2640d174gc1d5g4298ga8d9g6a97aee2b730"
msgid ""
"Actually, hells with this - the day I've had? You just lost your life too."
msgstr "사실, 이젠 그만하자. 난 오늘 하루 너무 힘들었어. 너도 방금 인생을 잃었잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = b13ea459-51ad-8873-2351-6febe74dedae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_ZhentShipment_State_DeliveredUnlockedChest = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:b13ea459-51ad-8873-2351-6febe74dedae
msgctxt "h0fea8169g1e7dg4be8g9ecbg5f106eb87393"
msgid "You... opened the shipment."
msgstr "너... 화물을 열어버렸구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b3483a5a-70b2-9f39-e354-2b48471230da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ConflictedFlind_State_Gone = True
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_Knows_SurvivorsInCave = True
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_Knows_SurvivorsAreDead = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_ZhentDungeon_State_WaitForGnollZhent = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:b3483a5a-70b2-9f39-e354-2b48471230da
msgctxt "hab373ec7g1954g44efg9c74g549c7ad84c38"
msgid "I saved them. They'll be along soon."
msgstr "내가 그 자들을 구했어. 곧 올 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = b3cabebe-2342-7bec-8c44-68478536af9f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:b3cabebe-2342-7bec-8c44-68478536af9f
msgctxt "hfecf8098gc355g4510ga40dg45aca65ebed1"
msgid ""
"You've killed me. You've bloody killed us all. Damned if I won't return the "
"favour."
msgstr "네가 나를 죽였어. 우리 모두를 죽인 거야. 이 은혜는 갚아줘야겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = b4385a19-32bd-cbe2-f4cd-4b602cd10f8d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_ZhentShipment_State_DeliveredUnlockedChest = True
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:b4385a19-32bd-cbe2-f4cd-4b602cd10f8d
msgctxt "h8239ec55g27c8g4a36g903fgc423cadf9b4f"
msgid "Lads! <i>Kill him.</i>"
msgstr "얘들아! <i>이 자식 죽여.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = b4385a19-32bd-cbe2-f4cd-4b602cd10f8d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_ZhentShipment_State_DeliveredUnlockedChest = True
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:b4385a19-32bd-cbe2-f4cd-4b602cd10f8d
msgctxt "h6dd8054agbde0g4452g9b1dg7a54312a2158"
msgid "Lads! <i>Kill her.</i>"
msgstr "얘들아! <i>이 년 죽여.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = b4385a19-32bd-cbe2-f4cd-4b602cd10f8d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_ZhentShipment_State_DeliveredUnlockedChest = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:b4385a19-32bd-cbe2-f4cd-4b602cd10f8d
msgctxt "hf90ee75dg51d4g456ag9968g2faac70c9e7c"
msgid "Lads! <i>Kill them.</i>"
msgstr "얘들아! <i>이 자식 죽여.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = b9133b4d-e550-ba8c-a2b8-b2be0e5bb736
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:b9133b4d-e550-ba8c-a2b8-b2be0e5bb736
msgctxt "h066c4d3agc83fg4c9bgb07eg231c7afb9ea6"
msgid ""
"The Flaming Fist will want someone to blame, and I don't plan to leave "
"anything pointing our way."
msgstr "플레이밍 피스트는 누군가에게 책임을 묻고 싶을 거야. 그러니 난 우리 행방을 알려주는 어떤 증거도 남길 생각 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = bb5980f1-6f18-cc0b-4477-2440b0bedc86
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_State_ChestLost = False
#.   Quest:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment.Rewarded_ZhentReturned(1) = False
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment.AgreedHelp(1) = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GEN_TransferNPCPayment_2(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:bb5980f1-6f18-cc0b-4477-2440b0bedc86
msgctxt "hd1dc68e1g37fag4b81g9ffdg567491388406"
msgid "Here's your coin, as promised."
msgstr "자, 받아. 약속한 대로야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = c0192b6c-8cbb-0163-6f19-9db8b11c98a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:c0192b6c-8cbb-0163-6f19-9db8b11c98a3
msgctxt "h233602c5ga3a1g445dgb6f4g40dc4b926c28"
msgid "I'm offering hard coin, not idle answers."
msgstr "난 큰 돈을 주려는 거야, 한가한 답변이 아니라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = c33da404-6f59-81be-02e1-523c2cab7351
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Zhentarim_Knows_Zhentarim = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:c33da404-6f59-81be-02e1-523c2cab7351
msgctxt "hd5fbecf2g64b0g420dgacdfg4b74cd72b269"
msgid ""
"I owe you one for saving my people. The Zhentarim look out for their own - "
"even if it's Rugan."
msgstr "내 부하를 구해준 빚을 졌군. 젠타림은 자기 식구를 아끼는 법이지. 그게 루간이라 할지라도."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = c33e8ccf-2ae0-b7a0-d7d7-0fae554551dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:c33e8ccf-2ae0-b7a0-d7d7-0fae554551dd
msgctxt "h2fd56ca4geafbg4eecg95c3g80403feee4be"
msgid "You did me a service - doesn't make you one of us."
msgstr "네가 도움을 주기는 했지만, 그렇다고 우리 일원이 되는 건 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = c7252a65-2bdd-4191-ef2b-883a3fef1f75
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_State_ChestLost = True
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Quest_AgentsMissing = False
#.   Quest:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment.Rewarded_ZhentReturned(1) = False
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment.AgreedHelp(1) = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GEN_TransferNPCPayment_3(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:c7252a65-2bdd-4191-ef2b-883a3fef1f75
msgctxt "hc6f9f723g8afcg4c6eg8c22g26d4d231dcc2"
msgid "That's worth some coin. And my thanks."
msgstr "돈 받을 만한 일을 했군. 내 감사는 덤이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c8572ddc-5b6f-ab47-ba0c-28440451d46a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:c8572ddc-5b6f-ab47-ba0c-28440451d46a
msgctxt "h440bea04ge93ag4c3eg8fa6g60d736f04466"
msgid "Doesn't sound like a group I want to get involved with."
msgstr "별로 엮이고 싶을 만한 조직은 아닌 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = ca1ddb25-d01b-102a-0bb4-2f87225a7a69
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:ca1ddb25-d01b-102a-0bb4-2f87225a7a69
msgctxt "hde313c6eg8c00g4326g84eagdc6118e65cdd"
msgid ""
"Then I'm in your debt - or will be, once I see him <i>and</i> his cargo."
msgstr "네게 신세 좀 지겠군. 루간과 그의 <i>화물</i>을 가져오거든 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cc82f800-01c0-15f8-d2f6-0b3a86c90553
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_State_TouchedChest = True
#.   Object:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_State_HasShipment(1) = False
#.      - GLO_CursedIronFlask_State_HasFlask(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:cc82f800-01c0-15f8-d2f6-0b3a86c90553
msgctxt "h0d7349d5g556fg46f7g8c46g45e9145c008d"
msgid "I had your cargo, but I lost it."
msgstr "당신 화물을 가지고 있었는데 ,잃어버렸어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce55b21f-f277-3576-794f-f72482b6a363
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - PLA_FlamingFists_Knows_ZhentDungeon(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:ce55b21f-f277-3576-794f-f72482b6a363
msgctxt "hf7aca8eage045g4b89ga61egc48af705a3d2"
msgid "The Fist already know you're here. They just don't care."
msgstr "플레이밍 피스트는 이미 네가 여기 있는 걸 알고 있어. 신경을 안 쓸 뿐이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d120d926-0170-fa4b-35d3-bbb23c152cf1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:d120d926-0170-fa4b-35d3-bbb23c152cf1
msgctxt "hd3ae161ag29d5g418ag9e9agc36195d1492c"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = d9f9b0f1-4c6e-3d1a-a3c5-ae3a62599108
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:d9f9b0f1-4c6e-3d1a-a3c5-ae3a62599108
msgctxt "h16e8551bg34a4g44c0g8749g13f39e9c20ca"
msgid ""
"Someone kidnapped a duke - right on our bloody doorstep. The Flaming Fist "
"will need someone to blame."
msgstr "누군가가 공작을 납치했어. 바로 우리 코앞에서 말이야. 플레이밍 피스트는 누명을 씌울 대상이 필요할 테지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = da4507ff-7638-3ffc-b8ee-de777e11744e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_State_GnollZhentsPresent = True
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_State_ChestLost = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:da4507ff-7638-3ffc-b8ee-de777e11744e
msgctxt "h70ecb73dg35fag4872g9ac0gdd1bb044a428"
msgid "Pity we didn't have you on the job from the start."
msgstr "네가 처음부터 합류하지 못했던 게 아쉽군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = dea7dc85-3a38-aca7-4e34-f4ad54344399
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:dea7dc85-3a38-aca7-4e34-f4ad54344399
msgctxt "h36dddfffg5b69g4e8fg9d8fg184f72598a63"
msgid ""
"Good. Backtrack along the road to the east and look for a wagon. Bodies. The "
"usual."
msgstr "좋아. 동쪽 길을 따라 역추적 해서 수레를 찾아. 주로 시체들이 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e205b19d-fd38-45b7-a82f-2bc578cd582e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Zhentarim_Knows_Zhentarim = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Zhentarim_Knows_Zhentarim = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:e205b19d-fd38-45b7-a82f-2bc578cd582e
msgctxt "h20964323g7d13g4885g9421gf61e21deb79f"
msgid "I'd rather know who I'd be working for first - the Zhentarim?"
msgstr "먼저 내가 누구를 위해 일하게 될지 알고 싶은데 - 젠타림이라고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = e2959bc0-8eb0-27ee-d01f-3c57dff82cd6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:e2959bc0-8eb0-27ee-d01f-3c57dff82cd6
msgctxt "h5c5d0d5dg3351g425bga820g3aff1c954d67"
msgid "I could use someone with your skills. Interested in a job?"
msgstr "너 같은 기술을 가진 사람이 필요한데. 일 하나 해볼 생각 없어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = e2ff15a6-208f-37ad-4de8-95eabbabddfa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:e2ff15a6-208f-37ad-4de8-95eabbabddfa
msgctxt "h300af795g0de6g4a5eg935eg1bfcabd27bf1"
msgid "We can provide you with <i>anything</i> - for a price."
msgstr "우린 네게 <i>뭐든지</i> 제공할 수 있어 - 대가만 따르면."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = e3113489-2236-2c04-9379-3b81f1695424
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:e3113489-2236-2c04-9379-3b81f1695424
msgctxt "h99c50137g5bc7g413fgae78gccb6dc766e5f"
msgid ""
"Then I'm much obliged - or I will be, once I see them <i>and</i> their cargo."
msgstr "그렇다면 정말 고맙군 - 아직은 아닐지도 모르지만, 그들과 화물을 보고 난 뒤에 정식으로 사례하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = e58a5a95-fa8d-9ebc-4624-687187360bbd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:e58a5a95-fa8d-9ebc-4624-687187360bbd
msgctxt "h6f71986bgaf59g45f5g8ef7gc54d42eaa528"
msgid "Gods damn it. What about the shipment?"
msgstr "이런 망할. 화물은 어떻게 됐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e805aff6-7347-6586-f3ff-1cd21c366191
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:e805aff6-7347-6586-f3ff-1cd21c366191
msgctxt "hb041f753g0720g4222g96ddga1a5885070e7"
msgid "Wait, so what are you: merchants or mercenaries?"
msgstr "잠깐, 그럼 당신들은 상인이야, 용병이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e87f7b52-ecfa-0870-70bd-6a9a4baabc59
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - PLA_ZhentShipment.AgreedHelp(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:e87f7b52-ecfa-0870-70bd-6a9a4baabc59
msgctxt "hd8e1f258g1cc8g46d3ga4b7gdf8af0b4f2f3"
msgid "All right - I'll do it."
msgstr "알았어 - 내가 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f03a6186-1930-a7bb-7cc2-fd259788856c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentShipment_Knows_SurvivorsAreDead = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:f03a6186-1930-a7bb-7cc2-fd259788856c
msgctxt "h7f1408e4g6fe6g4f22gb640g25725c1ba028"
msgid "I'm still looking."
msgstr "아직 찾아보고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f06c0917-b7dd-984c-f4db-c4a39ded2635
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:f06c0917-b7dd-984c-f4db-c4a39ded2635
msgctxt "hd99df709ge2c4g4664g87aeg4fa272240e63"
msgid "That depends - what is it?"
msgstr "그건 무슨 일인지에 달렸지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = f25f3b00-c4ab-e5ad-5052-f332ef09075e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:f25f3b00-c4ab-e5ad-5052-f332ef09075e
msgctxt "hfe26b0c4ga7c1g46ebg8d76ge7eed2ccca4c"
msgid "Cleaning up. We had a steady operation going here."
msgstr "청소 작업이야. 우린 여기서 꾸준히 작업을 진행했거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = f2615e83-8615-6be1-691a-56288377bb4a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Quest_AgentsMissing = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:f2615e83-8615-6be1-691a-56288377bb4a
msgctxt "he382d839g8c5bg450dgae61gd76259a35f0a"
msgid ""
"Backtrack along the road to the east. They were travelling with a wagon."
msgstr "동쪽 길을 따라 역추적 해봐. 그들은 수레와 함께 이동하고 있었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = f807a074-b0e3-976a-1053-9b2c41eb102a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02:f807a074-b0e3-976a-1053-9b2c41eb102a
msgctxt "h066e332dg23edg4692g824cg4c73a0230807"
msgid "It's gold I'm offering, not a marriage bond."
msgstr "난 결혼 중개를 하려는 게 아니라 금을 주려는 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_AD_CaughtUp
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = ceb54546-0962-ab91-e96d-dd493a5457b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_AD_CaughtUp:ceb54546-0962-ab91-e96d-dd493a5457b1
msgctxt "h54b6fc93g15ebg4e5fga662g5947c1e67cb4"
msgid "Back off!"
msgstr "물러서!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_AD_Combat_PoisonUsed
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 4273d1b2-d65b-4e10-bcb9-30236987fae1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_AD_Combat_PoisonUsed:4273d1b2-d65b-4e10-bcb9-30236987fae1
msgctxt "h5d81a4cbgab6fg45b8ga8a1g3bbda178b649"
msgid "Let's see how you like a little rot."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_AD_Idle
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 47544cc6-bd8f-43fd-0b8c-9497ec7beb7f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 02455563-e119-58e5-1fe7-eb46fe381d30_C = False
#.      - 02455563-e119-58e5-1fe7-eb46fe381d30_B = False
#.      - 02455563-e119-58e5-1fe7-eb46fe381d30_A = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 02455563-e119-58e5-1fe7-eb46fe381d30_A = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_AD_Idle:47544cc6-bd8f-43fd-0b8c-9497ec7beb7f
msgctxt "h2783a99eg882fg47f1g9480g591c871ce298"
msgid "Lamps, lads - sealed lamps! Don't want open flames where we're going."
msgstr "등불, 얘들아 - 등불을 닫으라고! 우리가 가는 길에 불똥이 튀면 안 되잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_AD_Idle
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 66a63674-3fc2-4f5c-de52-fcd3ae69363a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 02455563-e119-58e5-1fe7-eb46fe381d30_C = False
#.      - 02455563-e119-58e5-1fe7-eb46fe381d30_B = False
#.      - 02455563-e119-58e5-1fe7-eb46fe381d30_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 02455563-e119-58e5-1fe7-eb46fe381d30_B = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_AD_Idle:66a63674-3fc2-4f5c-de52-fcd3ae69363a
msgctxt "h2f6f76a1g15c5g4ec2g9d3eg387d9511e10a"
msgid "Pick up the pace!"
msgstr "서둘러!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_AD_Idle
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 70f80712-0f1d-64d2-62a4-05a7ea32d247
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 02455563-e119-58e5-1fe7-eb46fe381d30_C = False
#.      - 02455563-e119-58e5-1fe7-eb46fe381d30_B = True
#.      - 02455563-e119-58e5-1fe7-eb46fe381d30_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 02455563-e119-58e5-1fe7-eb46fe381d30_C = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_AD_Idle:70f80712-0f1d-64d2-62a4-05a7ea32d247
msgctxt "h8c764341g26a9g4fcfgbab9g6963f44dc55a"
msgid "Strip this place bare!"
msgstr "남김없이 챙기라고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_AD_Idle
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 979eeee2-bf9b-c6ae-ad81-688c304911da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 02455563-e119-58e5-1fe7-eb46fe381d30_C = True
#.      - 02455563-e119-58e5-1fe7-eb46fe381d30_B = True
#.      - 02455563-e119-58e5-1fe7-eb46fe381d30_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 02455563-e119-58e5-1fe7-eb46fe381d30_C = False
#.     - 02455563-e119-58e5-1fe7-eb46fe381d30_B = False
#.     - 02455563-e119-58e5-1fe7-eb46fe381d30_A = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_AD_Idle:979eeee2-bf9b-c6ae-ad81-688c304911da
msgctxt "h21702452gccb0g418dgbe86g2e3ea54d23b0"
msgid ""
"Any falls behind, I leave them for the Fist! And in no state to tell tales."
msgstr "뒤처지는 놈은 피스트에게 남겨두겠다! 입도 뻥긋하지 못할 상태로 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_AD_Stage1Darkness
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 7a2c5f1a-3567-f283-8ec4-a97090db2e2b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_State_Zhent01InHideout = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_ZhentDungeon_State_TriggerTraps = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_AD_Stage1Darkness:7a2c5f1a-3567-f283-8ec4-a97090db2e2b
msgctxt "h4077e551gc08eg4aa0ga603g39eee1cfc21c"
msgid "Our visitor's taking out the lights! Fall back!"
msgstr "우리 방문자가 불을 끄고 있어! 뒤로 물러나!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_AD_Stage1Darkness
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = 8506ee18-912c-635b-41d0-a25febf75504
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_State_Zhent01InHideout = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_ZhentDungeon_State_TriggerTraps = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_AD_Stage1Darkness:8506ee18-912c-635b-41d0-a25febf75504
msgctxt "h6f17326dg60e7g48aeg823ag1858ad39e652"
msgid "Someone's taking out the lights! Fall back!"
msgstr "누군가가 불을 끄고 있어! 뒤로 물러나!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_AD_Stage2
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = a29f4a5f-25a9-4f77-e73e-d2317a63a80d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_AD_Stage2:a29f4a5f-25a9-4f77-e73e-d2317a63a80d
msgctxt "h73714465g8637g4246g86cdgcf1f7d3d453a"
msgid "Move back, secondary positions!"
msgstr "뒤로 물러나, 2차 위치로 !"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_CaughtUp
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = b6e6a48e-bbac-aede-8439-8ddf42aa3916
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_CaughtUp:b6e6a48e-bbac-aede-8439-8ddf42aa3916
msgctxt "h62dea913gc852g4e91gaaa7g01288065ab57"
msgid "No prisoners! No mercy! Take them!"
msgstr "포로는 없다! 자비를 보이지 마라! 놈들을 잡아!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_CaughtUp
#. Speaker = Zarys
#. NodeID = b9b58fea-21f1-0b31-2635-a1b9ae0a3e00
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_CaughtUp:b9b58fea-21f1-0b31-2635-a1b9ae0a3e00
msgctxt "h58f207bbgb942g443egb83ag139b84617517"
msgid "Attack on my mark."
msgstr "내 표적에 공격해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_CaughtUp
#. Speaker = Rugan
#. NodeID = d37b526a-ab70-a568-f8bd-9d80a814824f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_CaughtUp:d37b526a-ab70-a568-f8bd-9d80a814824f
msgctxt "h68c6630dg7a09g4b41gba70gc8e73e75d5df"
msgid ""
"What did you have to come creeping in for? Sorry - we'll make this quick."
msgstr "무슨 일로 몰래 기어들어 온 건가? 미안하군, 빨리 끝내주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent02_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0b54a97e-9886-4b82-8204-1134c4a537a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
