msgctxt "h31ba75e0gcee6g46f9gbfc3g4bc025f0b747"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03
#. Speaker = Brem
#. NodeID = 775fe30e-568f-19ea-2d3a-3a896be3f3ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03_FailedPersuade(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03:775fe30e-568f-19ea-2d3a-3a896be3f3ea
msgctxt "he3146ce5g94b9g4ed4g8526ge3823f58788b"
msgid "I expect so. And whoever wants him had best bring a heap of coin."
msgstr "그럴 거라 생각했습니다. 그를 원하는 사람은 동전 한 무더기를 가져오는 게 좋을 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03
#. Speaker = Brem
#. NodeID = 786a9702-ab4c-c385-a17f-6e5d375b9151
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03:786a9702-ab4c-c385-a17f-6e5d375b9151
msgctxt "h217df879gb0e4g4000gaf50gbdf816930e26"
msgid ""
"You've got an eye for quality. Every noble in Baldur's Gate will be after "
"one of these."
msgstr "당신은 우수함에 대한 안목이 있으시군요. 발더스 게이트의 모든 귀족이 그림을 탐낼 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03
#. Speaker = Brem
#. NodeID = 7cb146d6-3b0d-4119-ace9-ae70e7f9c41b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.      - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_LowerPrice(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_KnowPrice(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03:7cb146d6-3b0d-4119-ace9-ae70e7f9c41b
msgctxt "he1480f1dg1621g47acgb145g1b7c7fce89b5"
msgid ""
"I doubt you've got that kinda dosh lying about. "
"([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-be548b134c54])"
msgstr ""
"당신이 이 정도 돈을 가지고 있을지 모르겠군요. ([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630"
"-9f0a-be548b134c54])"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03
#. Speaker = Brem
#. NodeID = 8d6bd492-b14b-1f1a-174a-7dd2784c6d9d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_DoubtingArtist_Knows_Kidnapped = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03:8d6bd492-b14b-1f1a-174a-7dd2784c6d9d
msgctxt "h01441ddag868bg438ega625g217e9f1da417"
msgid "Let's say we're his patrons, yeah? Found him wandering the wilds alone."
msgstr "저희가 그의 후원자라고 해 두죠, 어떻습니까? 혼자 야생을 돌아다니는 것을 발견했죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03
#. Speaker = Brem
#. NodeID = 8fbb104e-2ea1-2c6d-8296-a2dcc21dd536
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03:8fbb104e-2ea1-2c6d-8296-a2dcc21dd536
msgctxt "h8c5a2a70g294cg4f62ga2fcge26020253489"
msgid ""
"Tell him I sent you - and if he stains it up with his sniffling, there'll be "
"hell to pay."
msgstr "가서 제가 당신을 보냈다고 말하세요. 만약 녀석이 질질 짜느라 그림을 더럽히면, 제가 지옥을 맛보게 해 주죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03
#. Speaker = Brem
#. NodeID = 90a0c867-95d3-504f-aa41-d875888e1922
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_DoubtingArtist_State_FailPriceLowered(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03:90a0c867-95d3-504f-aa41-d875888e1922
msgctxt "h5096684ag64bdg4fd1ga77fgdef46cdb0044"
msgid ""
"Aye, off my rocker me - so you'd best not push me too far, eh? Price is the "
"price. \n"
"([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-be548b134c54])"
msgstr ""
"아, 제 정신 좀 보세요. 그러니 너무 몰아붙이진 마세요, 알겠죠? 가격은 가격입니다.\n"
"([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-be548b134c54])"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03
#. Speaker = Brem
#. NodeID = 9194845e-ae78-1631-6006-3fe4eb47ea08
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Quest:
#.      - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_FreedByBribe(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03:9194845e-ae78-1631-6006-3fe4eb47ea08
msgctxt "h4190ad4dg55c2g4129g9e1eg9c866f486a2b"
msgid "Aye? Back already?"
msgstr "응? 벌써 돌아온 건가요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03
#. Speaker = Brem
#. NodeID = 92e3c5ff-bad5-0122-e882-b143c5f113d1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03_FailedPersuade(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03:92e3c5ff-bad5-0122-e882-b143c5f113d1
msgctxt "hb522b05ag6c15g42bbgb043g7a0ff9ea3efc"
msgid ""
"Look, mate - this don't have to get violent, right? You want him, pay for "
"him."
msgstr "이봐요, 친구 - 폭력적으로 돌변할 일은 아니잖아요, 그렇죠? 그를 원하면 돈을 내세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9e3c8625-2063-18d7-27e1-5f90a99ada3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 20
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BERSERKER(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03:9e3c8625-2063-18d7-27e1-5f90a99ada3b
msgctxt "ha9bd9768g9abdg400fgbbccgecd27c50d78d"
msgid "<b><i>ROAR.</i></b>"
msgstr "<b><i>크아아.</i></b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03
#. Speaker = Brem
#. NodeID = a15a86a5-5b80-3e6e-399f-214ab5998713
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03:a15a86a5-5b80-3e6e-399f-214ab5998713
msgctxt "h60077707g7c62g4a47gb58ag945a35ca9f79"
msgid ""
"If you have the gold, my pet artist will make you a most heroical likeness. "
"Follow the whining."
msgstr "금화만 있으시다면, 제 애완 화가가 당신을 훌륭한 영웅의 모습으로 만들어 드릴 겁니다. 울음소리를 따라가세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03
#. Speaker = Brem
#. NodeID = a610c53a-e60b-24d9-7f74-bb4cd6f92b57
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03:a610c53a-e60b-24d9-7f74-bb4cd6f92b57
msgctxt "hd543981eg9c35g4d14g8925g26d9bd3cc09a"
msgid "Pleasure."
msgstr "이만."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03
#. Speaker = Brem
#. NodeID = a9f98f07-3f92-869a-402e-90919123f023
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_LowerPrice(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03:a9f98f07-3f92-869a-402e-90919123f023
msgctxt "hde540040ge1b6g459eg8c7bg93856dbb66bf"
msgid ""
"Go on then. But anything lower would be criminal. "
"([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_2_463b0f43-5410-412d-aba3-875cf81c38ca])"
msgstr ""
"그렇게 하시죠. 하지만 이 이상 낮추는 건 범죄 행위에요. ([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_2_463b0f43-5410"
"-412d-aba3-875cf81c38ca])"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aa0e202a-4105-801a-8b3b-78e77a230684
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03:aa0e202a-4105-801a-8b3b-78e77a230684
msgctxt "hbf619155g9d33g4e5bg9dd4g1a7d29343b92"
msgid "Do you have anything else to trade?"
msgstr "다른 거래할 건 없나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ac0594b8-bb22-3765-c786-02688decfac9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03:ac0594b8-bb22-3765-c786-02688decfac9
msgctxt "ha4a7c649g5b58g45b7gadb4gc6d5957ca79f"
msgid ""
"Slavekeeping's bad for business with any halfway-moral customer. Let him go."
msgstr "노예를 두는 것은 양심이 남아있는 고객과 거래하는 데 좋지 않아. 그를 놔줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03
#. Speaker = Brem
#. NodeID = ae9d80a1-f9b6-aab7-6ce2-8c4866075667
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_LowerPrice(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03:ae9d80a1-f9b6-aab7-6ce2-8c4866075667
msgctxt "hd0556a5fg6d69g4e07gb369gbc9ab9842110"
msgid ""
"All right, so maybe I was fishing. No fooling you. "
"([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_2_463b0f43-5410-412d-aba3-875cf81c38ca])"
msgstr ""
"좋아요, 제가 너무 나간 걸지도 모르겠군요. 당신은 못 속이겠어요. "
"([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_2_463b0f43-5410-412d-aba3-875cf81c38ca])"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03
#. Speaker = Brem
#. NodeID = b7e89339-c211-fde9-60e6-1903add9e152
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - PLA_DoubtingArtist_Event_FreedByPersuade = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03:b7e89339-c211-fde9-60e6-1903add9e152
msgctxt "h33f3fe78g02b6g4d73g8fa0gefeb8f8ca93f"
msgid ""
"What, kill him and the price of his drawings goes up? Bloody clever, that."
msgstr "뭐, 그를 죽이면 그가 남긴 작품의 가격이 올라간다는 말입니까? 그것참 기발하군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03
#. Speaker = Brem
#. NodeID = bcd5e373-54a7-6d2a-5a6b-39a411d445bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_State_AllowedSpecialTrade = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03:bcd5e373-54a7-6d2a-5a6b-39a411d445bb
msgctxt "ha9b06ae3g0ae3g41d8ga206g9a444d5179f3"
msgid "Fancy that - so do I."
msgstr "잘 됐군요 - 저도거든요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c010f01d-d08b-41ef-2333-10f29a8c2d8b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.      - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_MeetArtist(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03:c010f01d-d08b-41ef-2333-10f29a8c2d8b
msgctxt "hd1053215gcea9g4ec2gac60gfdd32a3f99d4"
msgid "You have a 'pet artist'?"
msgstr "'애완 예술가'가 있다고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cd7a8738-e7b5-5f14-a05a-67ddb1b536d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03:cd7a8738-e7b5-5f14-a05a-67ddb1b536d7
msgctxt "h39fa22f8gdd17g42c4g96e0gadc6b9f2ac8e"
msgid "Fine, I'll buy him. How much?"
msgstr "좋아, 내가 그를 사겠어. 얼마지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cfb96333-61f4-cb2a-0917-42ecf0d45fab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03:cfb96333-61f4-cb2a-0917-42ecf0d45fab
msgctxt "h261f9edcgc42dg4a45gb5ddg6608c9bdfb7b"
msgid "Forget the artist - do you have anything else to trade?"
msgstr "예술가는 잊어버려, 거래할 만한 다른 물건은 없어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d0447206-0936-8939-8f30-cc05ec2705e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 20
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_DoubtingArtist_State_FailPriceLowered(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_DoubtingArtist_State_FailPriceLowered(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03:d0447206-0936-8939-8f30-cc05ec2705e5
msgctxt "hbc9646eag2cd7g4139g891agd82ea9b12e25"
msgid "I don't have that much gold. I have plenty of steel, though."
msgstr "나는 그만한 돈이 없어. 대신 무기는 많지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03
#. Speaker = Brem
#. NodeID = d2297658-ae51-6efe-ad0d-baa79a636f9f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_DoubtingArtist_State_Dead = False
#.   Quest:
#.      - GLO_DoubtingArtist.ZhentDungeon_FreedByBribe(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Object:
#.     - PLA_DoubtingArtist_Event_StartInclusion(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03:d2297658-ae51-6efe-ad0d-baa79a636f9f
msgctxt "h1209853fg99fag462ega235ge240aa69ec7f"
msgid "Well don't you cut a fine figure. Want your portrait done?"
msgstr "외모가 정말 수려하군요. 초상화를 남겨보시는 건 어떻습니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d8a13695-59f5-9149-b021-c194f86980f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 20
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BERSERKER(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03:d8a13695-59f5-9149-b021-c194f86980f0
msgctxt "h3993b466g86c7g4dbdgbcb9g35c2e5bd1006"
msgid "We can skip threats and go straight to blades, if you like."
msgstr "위협을 멈추고 칼에 손을 뻗을 수 있지, 당신이 원한다면."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03
#. Speaker = Brem
#. NodeID = da6fcb1a-bf45-9d95-9cbe-c57ed9abd534
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03:da6fcb1a-bf45-9d95-9cbe-c57ed9abd534
msgctxt "ha00521b2g9d37g4b06g9db4g56915be1e097"
msgid "Been there, mate. Come back when you've coin, and we can talk, eh?"
msgstr "저도 겪어봤어요, 친구. 돈이 생기면 대화를 나눌 수 있을 겁니다, 알겠죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dbc49546-6392-c469-94bc-eea03f48c6b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03:dbc49546-6392-c469-94bc-eea03f48c6b8
msgctxt "hfe0ec27bg2208g42d4g9984g1ee41228c7e4"
msgid "'Protection'. It sounds a bit more like kidnapping."
msgstr "'보호'라. 그것보다는 납치에 가깝게 들리는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03
#. Speaker = Brem
#. NodeID = dc6724bd-b4e2-fce1-d216-54c69159657e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03:dc6724bd-b4e2-fce1-d216-54c69159657e
msgctxt "h03d86b13g98e6g4338g8b77gdb2b1a4e4dd4"
msgid ""
"He needs protection. And if his paintings cover our costs - so much the "
"better, eh?"
msgstr "그에겐 보호가 필요합니다. 그는 그림으로 비용을 지불하고요. 훨씬 좋지 않습니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03
#. Speaker = Brem
#. NodeID = e2da50cf-46fc-0026-cb30-fcfbfc67226f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03_FailedPersuade(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03:e2da50cf-46fc-0026-cb30-fcfbfc67226f
msgctxt "h22ae58feg8887g4c6dg8d1cg0993d3693f9e"
msgid "What, reckon I can't deal with him myself? It's not a bad idea, mind..."
msgstr "뭐, 제가 그를 관리할 수 없을 거라 생각하는 겁니까? 나쁜 생각은 아닌 것 같군요..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e37d85b3-0591-b04e-9352-ef480f9c201b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold_2 = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03:e37d85b3-0591-b04e-9352-ef480f9c201b
msgctxt "ha4d194cfg4535g4b0fg8558g3e6c3f722fee"
msgid "I don't have that kind of money."
msgstr "그런 돈은 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03
#. Speaker = Brem
#. NodeID = e64460f9-77da-3c48-de23-99940fd7281f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_ZhentDungeon_State_AllowedSpecialTrade = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03:e64460f9-77da-3c48-de23-99940fd7281f
msgctxt "h2e6a53f4g5db4g496ega9acg083086e5d0df"
msgid "Of course. Got some interesting stock for a friend of the family."
msgstr "물론입니다. 식구의 친구라면 흥미로운 상품을 보여드릴 수 있죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03
#. Speaker = Brem
#. NodeID = e71ff1b1-fe45-bad1-47e8-1eccbe46941a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
