msgctxt "h8d72b348g0084g4b59g9ed3g9c1c1dc83327"
msgid "You're insane if you think I'm going to pay that much."
msgstr "내가 그렇게 많은 돈을 지불할 거라고 생각했다면 당신은 미친 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f9767938-dddc-52a4-6b6c-e9f3a903afc0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
