#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03_AD_ArtCritics:db0731c1-e474-ba07-a278-31bf439d9b4a
msgctxt "h29716c4cgc170g47eegacc6gf74bbd44c37b"
msgid "You should change that. People don't make that face in real life."
msgstr "그건 바꿔야겠네. 사람들은 실제로 저런 표정을 짓지는 않거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03_AD_ArtCritics
#. Speaker = Brem
#. NodeID = dee2ec93-0422-4051-e614-35edf2c72339
