#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03_AD_ArtCritics:dee2ec93-0422-4051-e614-35edf2c72339
msgctxt "h8e8a934bg0886g4092gb544ga51e773d24af"
msgid "Get it right, or I'll make a brush out of your eyebrows."
msgstr "고쳐놔, 아니면 네 눈썹으로 붓을 만들어 버릴테다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03_AD_Combat_PoisonUsed
