msgctxt "hbd34b7d4gf0eag4f71ga6a4g46725c1c69e1"
msgid "<i>Stlarning</i> smokepowder smells like arse. <i>Dead</i> arse."
msgstr "엉덩이 같은 화약 냄새가 난다. <i>썩은</i> 엉덩이."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03_AD_Idle
#. Speaker = Brem
#. NodeID = 81df5dd2-a407-ff0f-affe-cd6c940249fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03_AD_Idle:81df5dd2-a407-ff0f-affe-cd6c940249fd
msgctxt "h9538d666g400ag4e04g981dg15dd91488b9c"
msgid "'At least the mouther had to stop for breath.'"
msgstr "'그 마우서도 숨을 쉬기 위해 잠깐 멈춰야했다.'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03_AD_Idle
#. Speaker = Brem
#. NodeID = 841b1f94-df43-e913-10fd-c9602c63d29c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - f3f236b2-37a1-a0a2-5855-184ead7b1286_C = False
#.      - f3f236b2-37a1-a0a2-5855-184ead7b1286_B = False
#.      - f3f236b2-37a1-a0a2-5855-184ead7b1286_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - f3f236b2-37a1-a0a2-5855-184ead7b1286_B = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03_AD_Idle:841b1f94-df43-e913-10fd-c9602c63d29c
msgctxt "h9820cb33gffdag45f4g9ae5g1eaded5df1cb"
msgid ""
"This ain't mine. This ain't mine either. Or that... well, in my bag. Mine "
"now."
msgstr "내것이 아니고. 이것도 아니고. 아니면 저게... 그렇다면 내 가방에. 내거네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03_AD_Idle
#. Speaker = Brem
#. NodeID = 981997b4-ec47-e4f8-77ff-a37664946126
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - f3f236b2-37a1-a0a2-5855-184ead7b1286_C = False
#.      - f3f236b2-37a1-a0a2-5855-184ead7b1286_B = True
#.      - f3f236b2-37a1-a0a2-5855-184ead7b1286_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - f3f236b2-37a1-a0a2-5855-184ead7b1286_C = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03_AD_Idle:981997b4-ec47-e4f8-77ff-a37664946126
msgctxt "hcd7da64agaa1eg4fe5ga49ag99d6c05d66c3"
msgid "Well, won't get that letter sent this side of the Underdark."
msgstr "글쎄, 그 편지는 언더다크 이쪽으로는 보내지 못할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03_AD_Idle
#. Speaker = Brem
#. NodeID = ac842f33-169a-5d8b-de96-9b36d00ee67a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03_AD_Idle:ac842f33-169a-5d8b-de96-9b36d00ee67a
msgctxt "h9a1391c0gbf43g4bf5gad81g0e07ebd718ee"
msgid ""
"'Dear mother - saw my first gibbering mouther, and sorry I ever compared "
"you.'"
msgstr "'어머니에게 - 난생 처음 지버링 마우서를 보았고, 제가 당신과 비교한 적이 있다는 것에 대해 미안하게 생각해요.'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03_AD_Zhent04
#. Speaker = Brem
#. NodeID = 10cecb64-91c4-d623-ecf5-76dd45c484ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03_AD_Zhent04:10cecb64-91c4-d623-ecf5-76dd45c484ac
msgctxt "h08e16b4bg3645g45d9gb993g68d620f2ca41"
msgid "Like, any kind of birds, or..."
msgstr "그러니까, 아무 새를 말하는 거야, 아니면..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03_AD_Zhent04
#. Speaker = Garias
#. NodeID = 1c629a74-a251-f845-d783-6586d2856445
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03_AD_Zhent04:1c629a74-a251-f845-d783-6586d2856445
msgctxt "h853190abg6b65g46e8gb6cbgaf78984744c6"
msgid "Pretty ones. With colours and stuff."
msgstr "예쁜 놈들. 알록달록한 놈들 있잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03_AD_Zhent04
#. Speaker = Garias
#. NodeID = 24b1bbc6-3271-64cf-3fc2-b6f3275a6c7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03_AD_Zhent04:24b1bbc6-3271-64cf-3fc2-b6f3275a6c7c
msgctxt "h5cd2fed2gac30g4048g92e8ga9f99e620ad4"
msgid "Birds."
msgstr "새들."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03_AD_Zhent04
#. Speaker = Brem
#. NodeID = 30d8619b-3a23-4c01-4bc7-071c98a2e566
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03_AD_Zhent04:30d8619b-3a23-4c01-4bc7-071c98a2e566
msgctxt "h0f020b98g3234g4d8bg81aegf5cc127b7158"
msgid ""
"I made a bucket of coins off him. When we get back to the gate, I'll take "
"you to a museum."
msgstr "녀석 덕분에 떼돈을 벌었어. 발더스 게이트로 돌아가면 박물관에 데려다줄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03_AD_Zhent04
#. Speaker = Brem
#. NodeID = 316bf291-d33a-17c9-272d-7bba9802ca4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03_AD_Zhent04:316bf291-d33a-17c9-272d-7bba9802ca4f
msgctxt "h7a150c8bg1b91g4ae0g956cg0d51f4473b06"
msgid ""
"Huh. Keep it up, little brother - might be I can sell <i>you</i> some day."
msgstr "허. 계속 그렇게만 해, 동생아 - <i>널</i> 언젠가 팔 수 있을지도 모르지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03_AD_Zhent04
#. Speaker = Garias
#. NodeID = 3bc21288-8b04-906a-5bff-77493f1cfdec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - ad98f134-2a18-1ff2-1074-8e5f8f1e2c94_Step3 = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - ad98f134-2a18-1ff2-1074-8e5f8f1e2c94_Step3 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03_AD_Zhent04:3bc21288-8b04-906a-5bff-77493f1cfdec
msgctxt "h8240266dg1eedg4af4ga56ag470279264063"
msgid "I miss watching your artist paint."
msgstr "네 예술가가 그림을 그리는 걸 구경하던 게 그립네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03_AD_Zhent04
#. Speaker = Brem
#. NodeID = 3bd8405b-f29c-db97-e97e-486bbc966d4a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03_AD_Zhent04:3bd8405b-f29c-db97-e97e-486bbc966d4a
msgctxt "h6bbd8b30gbd29g41bag8020gfa88543a589f"
msgid "Like ma always wanted."
msgstr "엄마가 항상 원했듯이 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03_AD_Zhent04
#. Speaker = Brem
#. NodeID = 3f66f5d5-cf05-0488-3f80-3b98ec296d02
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentDungeon_Zhent03_AD_Zhent04:3f66f5d5-cf05-0488-3f80-3b98ec296d02
msgctxt "h41bbdc25gf5bdg4743ga4e2gb0c1af0feb6b"
msgid "A few, yeah."
msgstr "몇 개는, 그래."

