msgid "... you beautiful bastard... thought my luck had finally run out..."
msgstr "... 이 멋진 무뢰한 같으니... 내 운이 결국 다한 줄 알았소..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentShipment_Agent_002
