msgid "You killed the whole pack? Bloody hells."
msgstr "당신이 무리 전체를 죽인 겁니까? 이런 세상에."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentShipment_Agent_002
