msgctxt "hd5eac9c3g34feg4bf9g90dag91a7909ac210"
msgid "Didn't expect to see you again so soon. Keeping safe?"
msgstr "이렇게 빨리 다시 보게 될 줄은 몰랐군요. 잘 지내고 계시나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentShipment_Agent_002
