msgctxt "h731ad83cgc484g459egb50dgac4d11447dfe"
msgid ""
"Shouldn't have left home. I'd rather die penniless and peaceful than be torn "
"to bits chasing riches."
msgstr "집을 떠났으면 안 됐어요. 부를 쫓다가 갈가리 찢어져서 죽을 바에는, 무일푼으로 평화롭게 죽는 편이 낫죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentShipment_Agent_002
#. Speaker = Olly
#. NodeID = d916749a-ebb6-f0ab-1c62-ba5958a63179
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentShipment_Agent_002:d916749a-ebb6-f0ab-1c62-ba5958a63179
msgctxt "h1a7248b9g0597g49ccgbb3fgb1378ffcde0f"
msgid "Gods, I thought you were one of them beasts!"
msgstr "세상에, 당신도 그 야수 중 하나인 줄 알았어요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentShipment_Agent_002
