msgid "Leave the bloody chest, and concentrate on the monsters!"
msgstr "그 망할 상자는 내버려 두고, 저 괴물 녀석들한테 집중해!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Plains/PLA_ZhentShipment_Agent_002_Crime
