msgctxt "h512173a2g566dg4e4ega448g8d4102ce137e"
msgid ""
"Aw, precious baby. Loves to bleed you - yes. Turn your corpse into sponge. "
"Lots of holes. <i>Yes.</i>"
msgstr "오, 소중한 아이야. 네 피를 흘리고 싶어. 그래. 네 시체를 스펀지처럼 만들어버릴 거야. 수많은 구멍. <i>그렇지.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_ForestIllusion_IllusionRedcap
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a9219f03-3a99-df68-038d-8485a57f94e4
