msgid "*That noise. Is the creature pretending to be a... sheep?*"
msgstr "*이 소리...이 생명체는 양인 척...하는 건가요?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_ForestIllusion_IllusionRedcap
