msgctxt "h61265187g5d05g45eag9f04g3b14aa3a6b7c"
msgid ""
"*The murderous glare of a redcap - a fey creature known for its bloodlust - "
"greets you. He seems unaware that his illusion has failed.*"
msgstr ""
"*피의 욕망을 지닌 페이 생명체, 레드캡의 살의 담긴 눈빛이 당신을 반깁니다. 놈은 환영이 실패했다는 걸 모르고 있는 것 같습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_ForestIllusion_IllusionRedcap
#. Speaker = Redcap Blood Sage
#. NodeID = fb70f8e4-269d-3613-faba-4b7da4527e35
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAG_AnimalIllusion_Revealed_HasMet2(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_ForestIllusion_Redcap_Knows_IllusionBroken = True
#.      - HAG_ForestIllusion_Event_DropIllusion = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_ForestIllusion_IllusionRedcap:fb70f8e4-269d-3613-faba-4b7da4527e35
msgctxt "h484be6ebg171cg4dc9g8c9dg3a5cadbced9d"
msgid "<i>Argh. </i>Away. Or eats you. <i>Bleeds </i>you."
msgstr "<i>으아.</i> 꺼져. 안 꺼지면 먹어버린다. <i>피 흘리게</i> 해준다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_ForestIllusion_Illusioncheck
#. Speaker = GROUP_PartyMembers
