msgctxt "h6a311345g6f56g4c97gbec5geed886fc1571"
msgid "*The corpse seems willing to speak - but not to its killer.*"
msgstr "*시체는 말할 의지가 있지만, 자신을 죽인 자와 대화하고 싶지는 않은 듯 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_GurHunter_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 806ebdf6-4da6-0e23-f39c-78967af44fb6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
