msgctxt "h7cd11558g42f2g4f72g8838gad6515d212f7"
msgid "None of this matters, all right? We need to get her back. And fast."
msgstr "이럴 시간이 없어. 응? 리나를 데리러 가자고, 빨리."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment
#. Speaker = Johl
#. NodeID = 10a83e20-e5e4-2aa5-40dd-95c702ac7379
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment:10a83e20-e5e4-2aa5-40dd-95c702ac7379
msgctxt "h897f4534g8cf6g44b6ga38agcdced8d0225c"
msgid "And we've no need of a mouthy bastard."
msgstr "우리도 입만 살아있는 개자식은 필요 없어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 155957e2-0e46-dfc0-dda4-8c28c484f13b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment:155957e2-0e46-dfc0-dda4-8c28c484f13b
msgctxt "hbec93f9agf275g4913g8482ge5faf1793b70"
msgid "Well, good luck with that."
msgstr "뭐, 알아서 잘 해봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment
#. Speaker = Johl
#. NodeID = 1dd3505e-ad9e-9868-7523-0d8f3c9a8d75
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Hag_KnowsAboutSurrogate = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment:1dd3505e-ad9e-9868-7523-0d8f3c9a8d75
msgctxt "h7bfe8c7agf461g49f2gbf38g2b01676f79a2"
msgid ""
"She could shoot fireworks out of her backside for all I care; the hag has "
"Rina."
msgstr "저년이 엉덩이로 폭죽을 쏴대든지 알게 뭐람. 중요한 건 저 해그가 리나를 데리고 있다는 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment
#. Speaker = Demir
#. NodeID = 25529289-3630-e8c0-370e-382f67982b80
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment:25529289-3630-e8c0-370e-382f67982b80
msgctxt "hc6c2b614gdee5g498agbfacg29c0c726fa4d"
msgid ""
"Bloody hells, she just <i>disappeared</i>. Ain't seen nothing like that "
"before."
msgstr "이런 미친, 그냥 <i>사라져 버렸잖아</i>. 이런 건 처음 봤어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2943443f-f0f5-bb17-8332-eb67c9e68e18
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment:2943443f-f0f5-bb17-8332-eb67c9e68e18
msgctxt "he7cc286cg097ag4bc0g804cgc0d018a8c186"
msgid "Trust a more experienced soul. I'll find your sister."
msgstr "더 경험 많은 영혼을 신뢰해봐. 내가 너희들 여동생을 찾겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment
#. Speaker = Demir
#. NodeID = 3a701c4d-eb6e-7571-e22a-8034080ba111
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment:3a701c4d-eb6e-7571-e22a-8034080ba111
msgctxt "hb4a17202gee21g4a22ga0f7g560d2019f12f"
msgid "Hold on, Johl. Let him talk. What would you suggest?"
msgstr "그만해, 졸. 그가 말하게 놔둬. 뭘 제안하고 싶으신 거죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment
#. Speaker = Demir
#. NodeID = 3a701c4d-eb6e-7571-e22a-8034080ba111
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment:3a701c4d-eb6e-7571-e22a-8034080ba111
msgctxt "hf506e6edga9b7g4afagae7agbbf95c9b92ed"
msgid "Hold on, Johl. Let her talk. What would you suggest?"
msgstr "그만해, 졸. 그녀가 말하게 놔둬. 뭘 제안하고 싶으신 거죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment
#. Speaker = Demir
#. NodeID = 3a701c4d-eb6e-7571-e22a-8034080ba111
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment:3a701c4d-eb6e-7571-e22a-8034080ba111
msgctxt "h22505dadga9feg4a92g9e08g5ed1ba4b013f"
msgid "Hold on, Johl. Let them talk. What would you suggest?"
msgstr "그만해, 졸. 이 사람이 말하게 놔둬. 뭘 제안하고 싶으신 거죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment
#. Speaker = Johl
#. NodeID = 41c436b4-a19b-afe0-5726-976972a560e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment:41c436b4-a19b-afe0-5726-976972a560e3
msgctxt "h35f7d220gcf42g449ag9d1fgda2a7934ba12"
msgid "Started saying weird things, like how she was gonna bring him back."
msgstr "남편을 되살릴 거라는 둥 이상한 말을 하기 시작했죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 44132c86-87b1-5aa0-ae90-bc9e13d2f74e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SORCERER(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment:44132c86-87b1-5aa0-ae90-bc9e13d2f74e
msgctxt "h4215a8e3g3733g40e8g86fbg5f537962cfc6"
msgid "A hag's magic is wild and chaotic. You'll be killed."
msgstr "해그의 마법은 난폭하고 혼란스러워. 갔다가는 죽을걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4c558fbe-989d-3df3-f484-9f921c464852
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment:4c558fbe-989d-3df3-f484-9f921c464852
msgctxt "h7d1ef548g7034g4fd1gb8b6gff3163407297"
msgid "I'm sorry. I wish you luck in finding her."
msgstr "유감이네. 그녀를 찾을 수 있게 행운이 따르길."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4ce791c7-5131-f4cb-3e9f-cedcfd9ab056
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment:4ce791c7-5131-f4cb-3e9f-cedcfd9ab056
msgctxt "hb56970bdg8455g4db7gaedcgfe8be2a6bacd"
msgid "Let me - I'll bring Mayrina home."
msgstr "내가 메이리나를 집에 데려다줄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment
#. Speaker = Johl
#. NodeID = 55105c83-f42b-f0e8-22c9-7360a90f0857
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.      - HAG_HagSpawn.SpokeToBrothers(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment:55105c83-f42b-f0e8-22c9-7360a90f0857
msgctxt "h04c1a89ag75a9g42cdga938g213200690170"
msgid ""
"To hells with that. We don't need luck or bloody help. Now, c'mon. We've a "
"hag to kill."
msgstr "집어치워. 빌어먹을 행운이나 그런 건 필요 없다니까. 어서 해그를 죽이러 가자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment
#. Speaker = Demir
#. NodeID = 5b2e2d1b-fe2e-5f53-d578-0093726918d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.      - HAG_HagSpawn.SpokeToBrothers(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment:5b2e2d1b-fe2e-5f53-d578-0093726918d7
msgctxt "h699b446agc9e7g4941g8ce9ga3e020be9a3a"
msgid "We'll head there on our own."
msgstr "우리가 직접 그곳에 갈 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5cfddb62-24ef-cdb4-6beb-741af63eed0e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment:5cfddb62-24ef-cdb4-6beb-741af63eed0e
msgctxt "h4cb3780dgb7b0g48b7g86e3gf9ffdc34e1b7"
msgid "Will someone please tell me what's going on?"
msgstr "무슨 일인지 누가 좀 알려주겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment
#. Speaker = Johl
#. NodeID = 5d2ad0aa-80a4-9d57-dc8e-b3c8c450e850
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment:5d2ad0aa-80a4-9d57-dc8e-b3c8c450e850
msgctxt "h2412c6e5g663ag41a4g947bg398781c94059"
msgid "You saying we should leave Rina to that monster, is that it?"
msgstr "그러니까 우리 보고 지금 리나를 괴물한테 맡겨 둔 상태로 놔두라는 거요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment
#. Speaker = Demir
#. NodeID = 5d493aa0-f06d-316b-696b-3eba3b0ef63a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment:5d493aa0-f06d-316b-696b-3eba3b0ef63a
msgctxt "h4e1c35e7ge227g4c70g9776g6998ac143af5"
msgid "Thanks for the, erm, advice, but we can't do that."
msgstr "조언은, 흠, 고맙긴 한데 그렇다고 떠날 수는 없어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment
#. Speaker = Johl
#. NodeID = 61a5999a-771e-5b82-35e7-40a47493e367
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment:61a5999a-771e-5b82-35e7-40a47493e367
msgctxt "he36ac042ge6ffg4370ga6dfge1520d1b0674"
msgid "Knew it. You're full of it."
msgstr "그럴 줄 알았습니다. 당신은 외면하기만 하는군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment
#. Speaker = Demir
#. NodeID = 6ba6b216-0616-4c84-f0ad-41ebeb5f3fec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment:6ba6b216-0616-4c84-f0ad-41ebeb5f3fec
msgctxt "h7647d511g456cg49cegaba8g3bf2c41b98a9"
msgid ""
"We haven't seen her since, and no good ever came from dealing with a hag."
msgstr "그 후로 그녀를 본 적이 없고, 해그를 상대해서 얻은 것은 아무것도 없었다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6e1b3e85-cca8-0334-06d4-b658deeca66f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WIZARD(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment:6e1b3e85-cca8-0334-06d4-b658deeca66f
msgctxt "ha2b9b761g9e8ag40b1gb0b6gd7b3acf09527"
msgid ""
"Hags are incredibly powerful creatures. The fey should not be trifled with."
msgstr "해그는 상상 이상으로 강력한 놈들이야. 페이는 그렇게 하찮은 존재가 아니라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment
#. Speaker = Johl
#. NodeID = 7f4d2792-6dff-8a4c-41a8-a79fcccf2510
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment:7f4d2792-6dff-8a4c-41a8-a79fcccf2510
msgctxt "hf1977802g7be6g4960g90b2gadd4c8903324"
msgid "Come on, Demir. We'll make our own way."
msgstr "따라와, 드미어. 우리만의 방식으로 해결하자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment
#. Speaker = Johl
#. NodeID = 82ee739a-b9f7-5f5b-3583-fdfb92f345a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.      - HAG_HagSpawn.SpokeToBrothers(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - HAG_HagSpawn.RefusedHelpBrothers1(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment:82ee739a-b9f7-5f5b-3583-fdfb92f345a5
msgctxt "h832a5c40g3271g42bbgbb79g5dc92a8d326c"
msgid ""
"To hells with that. We don't need luck or bloody help. Now, c'mon. We've a "
"hag to kill."
msgstr "집어치워. 빌어먹을 행운이나 그런 건 필요 없다니까. 어서 해그를 죽이러 가자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8b047123-ca31-8de0-5eb0-b4aee3d75470
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment:8b047123-ca31-8de0-5eb0-b4aee3d75470
msgctxt "h50c80ad5gf4b2g41c0gb526g7d524ee581e5"
msgid "You're on your own. I have enough problems."
msgstr "당신네 일은 당신들이 알아서 해. 나는 일이 충분히 많아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment
#. Speaker = Johl
#. NodeID = a049a736-428c-82e1-36e7-6480ae305f34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment:a049a736-428c-82e1-36e7-6480ae305f34
msgctxt "he1b9f6ceg8cb9g4c43g992ega4c02a447e9c"
msgid ""
"Are you joking? I ain't got a clue who you are. No way I'm leaving Rina to "
"you."
msgstr "농담하는 겁니까? 난 당신이 누군지 전혀 몰라요. 리나를 당신에게 맡길 순 없습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment
#. Speaker = Johl
#. NodeID = a3f3fa77-0660-6891-f916-4f753bb6b296
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.      - HAG_HagSpawn.SpokeToBrothers(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - HAG_HagSpawn.RefusedHelpBrothers1(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment:a3f3fa77-0660-6891-f916-4f753bb6b296
msgctxt "h05e37eebg3ed3g49f7g9ed5g8724bfc08e8c"
msgid "Come on, Demir. We'll make our own way."
msgstr "따라와, 드미어. 우리만의 방식으로 해결하자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment
#. Speaker = Johl
#. NodeID = a893d4b4-3a45-f7e1-753e-9098182e95ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - HAG_HagSpawn.RefusedHelpBrothers1(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment:a893d4b4-3a45-f7e1-753e-9098182e95ab
msgctxt "h3f4eb5b2gd85cg4604g8d39g827765b8a673"
msgid "Not a chance! We're getting her back on our own. Now, come on."
msgstr "어림 없지! 그녀는 우리가 스스로 되찾을 거야. 어서 가자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment
#. Speaker = Demir
#. NodeID = a8aca8f3-f561-aced-09fd-76b188b1bd38
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - HAG_HagSpawn.SpokeToBrothers(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment:a8aca8f3-f561-aced-09fd-76b188b1bd38
msgctxt "h1e7f68b6gb5deg4acegb529g2462624fafae"
msgid ""
"It's our sister - Mayrina. She is... well, she was in a bad way after her "
"husband died."
msgstr "우리 여동생 메이리나 일입니다. 그 애는 남편이 죽고 나서 상태가 안 좋아요... 아니, 안 좋았습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment
#. Speaker = Demir
#. NodeID = b0f38d26-32f1-0b52-98cb-d1a56db72a0d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.      - HAG_HagSpawn.SpokeToBrothers(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - HAG_HagSpawn.RefusedHelpBrothers1(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment:b0f38d26-32f1-0b52-98cb-d1a56db72a0d
msgctxt "h4b618e2cg301fg4cf7ga0a0g0c35aa66c325"
msgid "We'll head there on our own."
msgstr "우리가 직접 그곳에 갈 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment
#. Speaker = Demir
#. NodeID = b39e66bf-7fc3-6fec-8262-698687d73115
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment:b39e66bf-7fc3-6fec-8262-698687d73115
msgctxt "ha92f544dg80b4g4d2bg86b0g7cfde3dc7a49"
msgid "But, Johl -"
msgstr "하지만, 졸 -"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cbb75850-06e7-98f2-cec6-14b834f0ce03
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - RANGER(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment:cbb75850-06e7-98f2-cec6-14b834f0ce03
msgctxt "h6d7da6ffg1298g4b38ga401ge5b1152a6597"
msgid ""
"Hags are dangerous, unnatural things. Even this place feels warped and "
"twisted."
msgstr "해그는 위험하고, 부자연스러운 존재야. 이 장소조차 왜곡되고 뒤틀려 있는 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment
#. Speaker = Johl
#. NodeID = d0894ff7-99da-3e34-0499-bbc0598e73ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment:d0894ff7-99da-3e34-0499-bbc0598e73ed
msgctxt "h8e214a02g4e88g4cb8gbb8bg579cdd7665f1"
msgid "I don't remember bloody asking you."
msgstr "당신에게 물어본 기억은 없는데요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment
#. Speaker = Demir
#. NodeID = d689fa06-a61b-5fff-421c-ca5d2707380c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment:d689fa06-a61b-5fff-421c-ca5d2707380c
msgctxt "hcb13d814g7a64g4a36gb9ffg231d658b1274"
msgid ""
"Next thing, she's gone looking for the hag. Of all the <i>stupid</i> things "
"to do."
msgstr "그러곤, 저 해그를 찾으러 갔어요. 그녀가 할 수 있는 가장 <i>멍청한</i> 행동이었죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f1aa6aa3-03a5-b228-5775-35bb027c3b51
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment:f1aa6aa3-03a5-b228-5775-35bb027c3b51
msgctxt "h8d5fdd54g7aaag4f7bgb0a9gf54b5960c887"
msgid "Walk away. Live."
msgstr "여길 떠나. 일단 살아야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment
#. Speaker = Demir
#. NodeID = f4868187-be02-f5b2-b7ee-8ef3bd94d9ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Brothers_Recruitment:f4868187-be02-f5b2-b7ee-8ef3bd94d9ae
msgctxt "hdd6e957fg96aeg420fg8a15g94b1c0b1a6c4"
msgid "Thank you. We'll need it."
msgstr "고맙습니다. 우린 그 행운이 필요하죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Demir
#. NodeID = 0e52b37a-3afa-3a4a-7f90-74312637bc89
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:0e52b37a-3afa-3a4a-7f90-74312637bc89
msgctxt "h037a6b35g7769g4827ga9aag86ec6ebd2dfe"
msgid "Stop this! We... we won't ask again."
msgstr "그만해! 그만... 두 번 묻지는 않겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 20a1cd9f-4bab-78c1-7521-3e72286ddddd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:20a1cd9f-4bab-78c1-7521-3e72286ddddd
msgctxt "hda8689e9g0fa8g4991g92afgff6ce7f23f4f"
msgid ""
"Lads, for the love of all that is holy, I've never clapped eyes on your poor "
"sister."
msgstr "총각들, 제발 좀, 난 너희 그 불쌍한 여동생을 본 적조차 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 21aa17f8-309d-36a1-7032-4db3ecc3d28e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:21aa17f8-309d-36a1-7032-4db3ecc3d28e
msgctxt "hc9105eecgee76g4af1g9e59g2f004c521b28"
msgid "This is nothing to do with me. Goodbye."
msgstr "내가 상관할 일이 아니네. 그럼 안녕."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 225fa88b-29a7-5b7a-8369-a824fc19cfa7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:225fa88b-29a7-5b7a-8369-a824fc19cfa7
msgctxt "h3156b156ge6b6g4aebga3b0gfdaab3cb1bcf"
msgid "<i>Bollocks. </i>"
msgstr "<i>제기랄.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2454c9e9-20e5-a257-4a68-79f4debc6957
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 13331f95-ef91-4bc8-be99-3087875bb3a9_perceptionsuccess = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(3) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedBrothers = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:2454c9e9-20e5-a257-4a68-79f4debc6957
msgctxt "h77c34c3bg1376g47dcg9311g37f11e062224"
msgid "If you're lying about the girl, what's to say this isn't a disguise?"
msgstr "그 여자에 대해 거짓말을 하고 있는 거면, 이게 위장이 아니라고 어떻게 말할 수 있겠어요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 252e5c04-cd02-f331-820d-41e48e863afd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:252e5c04-cd02-f331-820d-41e48e863afd
msgctxt "he8c80e36ged95g494aga485gab03498c90b4"
msgid "I'm not getting involved."
msgstr "난 관여하지 않을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 2a9b3cb6-fd6c-1123-7a44-0895f7fefe0e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_HagDouble_HasMet(3) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 13331f95-ef91-4bc8-be99-3087875bb3a9_perceptionsuccess = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:2a9b3cb6-fd6c-1123-7a44-0895f7fefe0e
msgctxt "h54d78deagff3bg4164g83c2g4835f5c6459d"
msgid ""
"*The old woman's face creases with false concern. You realise she's lying "
"about seeing this girl, Mayrina.*"
msgstr "*노파의 얼굴에 가짜 걱정으로 주름이 집니다. 당신은 그녀가 이 메이리나라는 여자에 대해 거짓말을 하고 있음을 알아챕니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 2b392bfe-75d4-8588-4bab-e1f7e394dced
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:2b392bfe-75d4-8588-4bab-e1f7e394dced
msgctxt "h68a633c4gfc54g4996gbabfg7b27a57d8628"
msgid "Sweetie, be careful!"
msgstr "얘야, 조심하렴!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Johl
#. NodeID = 2fdbbbcd-1f6c-4711-d1e7-997b68a2c4e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedHag = True
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:2fdbbbcd-1f6c-4711-d1e7-997b68a2c4e5
msgctxt "h83bc018fg4ec0g429cgb893gcc942f33f702"
msgid "Don't bloody stand there gaping, get him!"
msgstr "썅, 멍하니 서있지만 말고 저 놈 잡아!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Johl
#. NodeID = 2fdbbbcd-1f6c-4711-d1e7-997b68a2c4e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedHag = True
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:2fdbbbcd-1f6c-4711-d1e7-997b68a2c4e5
msgctxt "he64068abgbf5cg46fag8740gaadae81b2aa4"
msgid "Don't bloody stand there gaping, get her!"
msgstr "썅, 멍하니 서있지만 말고 저 년 잡아!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Johl
#. NodeID = 2fdbbbcd-1f6c-4711-d1e7-997b68a2c4e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedHag = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:2fdbbbcd-1f6c-4711-d1e7-997b68a2c4e5
msgctxt "hbfa2dc92g3f11g4410g9c0dga70cbd9fbfcb"
msgid "Don't bloody stand there gaping!"
msgstr "썅, 멍하니 서있지 말라고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 449b8d7c-9025-0407-8c0d-7984de02c146
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedBrothers = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:449b8d7c-9025-0407-8c0d-7984de02c146
msgctxt "hbfeaa442gc65dg4efega4d7g4802860bfc1e"
msgid "Wait - what? You saw through my magic?"
msgstr "잠깐, 뭐라고? 내 마법을 꿰뚫어본거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4f3830c3-8685-a296-28d5-362549a9c3a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_HagDouble_HasMet(3) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 13331f95-ef91-4bc8-be99-3087875bb3a9_perceptionsuccess = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:4f3830c3-8685-a296-28d5-362549a9c3a4
msgctxt "hef359f16gb106g482cg9f56g77c9e91b71de"
msgid ""
"*Auntie Ethel's face creases with false concern. You realise she's lying "
"about seeing this girl, Mayrina.*"
msgstr ""
"*에텔 이모의 얼굴에 가짜 걱정으로 주름이 집니다. 당신은 그녀가 이 메이리나라는 여자에 대해 거짓말을 하고 있음을 알아챕니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5d0d2a91-e680-736b-3daa-8b4e10b748df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_HagDouble_HasMet(3) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:5d0d2a91-e680-736b-3daa-8b4e10b748df
msgctxt "hdb354563gfa3dg4840g879fg003259ee2e14"
msgid "Tell the truth - what did you do to their sister?"
msgstr "사실대로 말해요. 이 사람들 여동생한테 무슨 짓을 한 거예요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5ebb582e-3042-a255-a821-45563f02eee2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:5ebb582e-3042-a255-a821-45563f02eee2
msgctxt "h1d30d347g8abag4cdega5a2g342becb5cacb"
msgid "How about you all just calm down. What's going on here?"
msgstr "다들 일단 진정 좀 해요. 무슨 일이에요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 666bc5ec-85d2-f72a-16c7-6880ae8160e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 13331f95-ef91-4bc8-be99-3087875bb3a9_perceptionsuccess = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:666bc5ec-85d2-f72a-16c7-6880ae8160e1
msgctxt "h77ba4b0dg9fd3g4cc4g935agdbc4e794df6d"
msgid "You're lying; you have seen this girl."
msgstr "거짓말하지 말라고. 그 여자 본 적 있잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 7143db6c-1c25-bbb6-0910-f8d8a199b67d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:7143db6c-1c25-bbb6-0910-f8d8a199b67d
msgctxt "h01c6fe3bg59f2g468bga722gb6988d3f610b"
msgid ""
"Some advice? You ever darken my door, you'd best have that head bowed and an "
"apology at the ready."
msgstr "충고 해 줄까? 내 집에 함부로 찾아왔다가는, 고개 처박고 사과하는 게 신상에 좋을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 739e128d-149d-ca09-28d9-765a8097e215
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:739e128d-149d-ca09-28d9-765a8097e215
msgctxt "h26d68c52gb346g4739ga79fg162175dccd1e"
msgid "Bye-bye, now!"
msgstr "그럼 안녕!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 79cd596f-971e-d6bc-9cf1-001d991e6d47
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_HagDouble_HasMet(3) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:79cd596f-971e-d6bc-9cf1-001d991e6d47
msgctxt "hb3a4406cg1225g4b68gbb41g77d66c2f3ba8"
msgid "Lower your weapons. She's just an old woman."
msgstr "무기를 내려. 그냥 할머니잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Johl
#. NodeID = 7de59bfa-8d3d-4301-437d-0cbf5c557199
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:7de59bfa-8d3d-4301-437d-0cbf5c557199
msgctxt "h2704164bgaa13g496cg9327g1b40f661c427"
msgid ""
"Careful! Don't trust a word out of her mouth. Our sister went to the hag, "
"and we ain't seen her since."
msgstr ""
"조심해! 저 여자 입에서 나오는 말은 단 한 마디도 믿으면 안 돼. 우리 여동생이 이 해그를 찾아갔는데, 그 뒤로 보이지를 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 840a1194-ccea-18d1-bcb0-de112e9eb3b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_HagDouble_HasMet(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:840a1194-ccea-18d1-bcb0-de112e9eb3b3
msgctxt "h7d1c9c87g0862g4f30g96f7gac5ad314ff12"
msgid "Lower your weapons, I know this lady."
msgstr "무기를 내려. 난 이 여자 분을 알아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Johl
#. NodeID = 84eb214d-d378-f469-b9b2-f8193f089d32
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:84eb214d-d378-f469-b9b2-f8193f089d32
msgctxt "he4a6ba16g7769g4682g9756g19ba24a7b612"
msgid "Enough. Where <i>is </i>she?"
msgstr "됐어. <i>어디에</i> 있어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8cd61c4e-2e69-8570-b51f-4213794411ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_ForestIllusion_Event_DropIllusion = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:8cd61c4e-2e69-8570-b51f-4213794411ab
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hf7944ffdg2431g4bf9gbacag770040c716ab"
msgid "Stop! An illusion covers this swamp - who's responsible?"
msgstr "멈춰! 환영이 이 늪을 뒤덮고 있어. 누가 한 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Demir
#. NodeID = 8d974806-3684-7fea-e41c-8e4723e51531
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:8d974806-3684-7fea-e41c-8e4723e51531
msgctxt "h61f27daag84f6g4cc4g82d4gca5dbf2336bb"
msgid "H-he's with the hag!"
msgstr "저, 저 놈이 해그와 한패다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Demir
#. NodeID = 8d974806-3684-7fea-e41c-8e4723e51531
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:8d974806-3684-7fea-e41c-8e4723e51531
msgctxt "h97d759a8gf088g487bgbae3g4f29e81381a6"
msgid "S-she's with the hag!"
msgstr "저, 저 년이 해그와 한패다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Demir
#. NodeID = 8d974806-3684-7fea-e41c-8e4723e51531
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:8d974806-3684-7fea-e41c-8e4723e51531
msgctxt "he9654acfgf007g47cegbb8ega0aa47d14790"
msgid "They're with the hag!"
msgstr "저 자는 해그와 한패야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 95e25f2c-e313-76b5-e4bd-c7e00e093dcf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:95e25f2c-e313-76b5-e4bd-c7e00e093dcf
msgctxt "h7a0c4a0dga548g4f23g82c1gccd58fa34f3f"
msgid "You were supposed to rush to my defence, love. Fat lot of good you are."
msgstr "날 변호해줬어야지, 얘야. 도움 안 되는 녀석 같으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 97973eef-57cc-c911-8e3e-1743757b4a88
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_HagDouble_HasMet(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:97973eef-57cc-c911-8e3e-1743757b4a88
msgctxt "h8cd6bfc5gdbc1g41e7gb65agfe7f7f10e7bf"
msgid "I won't let you hurt Auntie Ethel."
msgstr "에텔 이모에게 해를 끼치게 놔둘 수는 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 9b7983fa-62de-9cc6-d83f-c80b208fa8c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_HagDouble_HasMet(3) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:9b7983fa-62de-9cc6-d83f-c80b208fa8c9
msgctxt "h1ee879ebgce84g4e4dg9ccdg0e61bff89e73"
msgid ""
"You there! Please, I don't know what's come over these boys. I just want to "
"go home."
msgstr "거기 얘! 제발, 이 총각들이 왜 이러는지 모르겠어. 난 그냥 집에 가고 싶다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9d028ef4-5aee-3049-b2f1-6ace318fd5d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_HagDouble_HasMet(3) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:9d028ef4-5aee-3049-b2f1-6ace318fd5d6
msgctxt "hb4265aeagd0a4g4634gb055g3ab15e8a321d"
msgid "I won't let you hurt this woman."
msgstr "이 여자에게 해를 끼치게 놔둘 수는 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Johl
#. NodeID = 9d7231a4-381b-6b2b-b9de-543468e9a786
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - HAG_HagAmbush_Knows_HeardMayrinaAccusation(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:9d7231a4-381b-6b2b-b9de-543468e9a786
msgctxt "hb9047033g18bfg437dgb52dg4bd43c3280fc"
msgid "Drop the act, hag. You was the last to see Mayrina."
msgstr "연기는 집어치워, 해그. 메이리나를 마지막으로 본 게 너야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = c6ef0714-bca4-e396-afeb-005c006c0a60
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_HagDouble_HasMet(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:c6ef0714-bca4-e396-afeb-005c006c0a60
msgctxt "h825afc70gfc0ag40dagb6c5gb3e7fac10ad7"
msgid ""
"Thank goodness you're here, sweetie. I - I don't know what's come over these "
"boys."
msgstr "세상에, 여기 딱 마침 와줘서 정말 다행이다 얘. 이 총각들이 할미에게 왜 이러는지 모르겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = c6f22147-928f-4ceb-5c42-06f088257943
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:c6f22147-928f-4ceb-5c42-06f088257943
msgctxt "h62b0ccf3g52a5g43abga277ga57c3e90a0fc"
msgid ""
"Hand over heart, I don't know their sister. I will <i>gladly </i>help you "
"all look for her though."
msgstr "가슴에 손을 얹고 나는 저 친구들 여동생 정말 몰라. 너희들이 그녀를 찾는 건 내 <i>기꺼이</i> 도울 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d0dcd393-0e90-c9f4-4148-5c3af09cd387
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_HagDouble_HasMet(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:d0dcd393-0e90-c9f4-4148-5c3af09cd387
msgctxt "hccc2e64dgc01cg4e88ga0f1gb3c40c56bbc2"
msgid "Ethel, what did you do to their sister?"
msgstr "에텔, 이 사람들 여동생한테 무슨 짓을 한 거예요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = da6b2e98-e158-cd70-1068-76ab9b11665b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedBrothers = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:da6b2e98-e158-cd70-1068-76ab9b11665b
msgctxt "hf7bbf24agf596g45c2gae8dg5db0e41813be"
msgid "<i>Bollocks. </i>"
msgstr "<i>제기랄.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Demir
#. NodeID = eeeb422b-02da-2621-bd5b-3e6907dd136e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:eeeb422b-02da-2621-bd5b-3e6907dd136e
msgctxt "hd7847fddge00fg42a1g871bgd615535f0f6e"
msgid "Just let her go. Please."
msgstr "부탁이에요, 그냥 보내 주세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = f2336793-95c5-fe4e-1e4a-3fcf5666600f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:f2336793-95c5-fe4e-1e4a-3fcf5666600f
msgctxt "h038bfee8g182bg4501gb98eg02ef0f56c99c"
msgid "Thanks for ruining my fun."
msgstr "내 재미를 망쳐줘서 참 고맙다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f5475dd0-8eb3-0950-d4a3-ff9302921cdb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 13331f95-ef91-4bc8-be99-3087875bb3a9_perceptionsuccess = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_Confrontation:f5475dd0-8eb3-0950-d4a3-ff9302921cdb
msgctxt "h71911ca9gde66g4d9eg9bd5gd6e9435e1a3e"
msgid ""
"Just because she's an old woman in a swamp, she's a hag? Lay off the fairy "
"tales, lads."
msgstr "그냥 늪에 사는 할머니라고 해서, 해그라니? 동화 좀 그만 읽어, 친구들."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_ThankPlayer
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 0fcc16ef-5335-629a-103d-7b8bec916bb8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_ThankPlayer:0fcc16ef-5335-629a-103d-7b8bec916bb8
msgctxt "he712c44fgacf7g40f1gb8f8g5fabe540c87d"
msgid "She's their little sister. And... she's staying with me."
msgstr "그들의 여동생이네. 그리고... 그녀는 나와 함께 지내고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_ThankPlayer
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 18e22b4d-c128-7123-3151-91b388d1c740
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_ThankPlayer:18e22b4d-c128-7123-3151-91b388d1c740
msgctxt "h91520401g4de7g4331g9b32g595833d76289"
msgid "Oh, my stars."
msgstr "오, 나의 별들아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_ThankPlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2513488c-b7b0-164c-6997-7e6d9afb28b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_ThankPlayer:2513488c-b7b0-164c-6997-7e6d9afb28b9
msgctxt "he38c4107g2d45g4a10g8840gc6b3443294c0"
msgid "Do you know this 'Mayrina' they mentioned?"
msgstr "그들이 말한 '메이리나'를 알고 있습니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_ThankPlayer
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 2b3a1865-1729-95a2-2517-b6bad87c6cc7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_ThankPlayer:2b3a1865-1729-95a2-2517-b6bad87c6cc7
msgctxt "h01dc81e2g93feg418fga044g76d0332107b0"
msgid "And such heroic deeds deserve proper thanks."
msgstr "게다가 그 영웅적인 행동은 제대로 된 감사를 받을 자격이 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_ThankPlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 47568a00-520f-15ab-42ab-c020a1512795
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_ThankPlayer:47568a00-520f-15ab-42ab-c020a1512795
msgctxt "hac53e0bbg511eg4681gb110ge5e047f811f1"
msgid "The best thanks are paid in gold."
msgstr "진심 어린 감사는 금으로 표해 주시죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_ThankPlayer
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 4ee60566-31b5-a525-2935-74c11aab8ef7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - HAG_HagAmbush_Event_ThankedNoMoney(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_ThankPlayer:4ee60566-31b5-a525-2935-74c11aab8ef7
msgctxt "heb056b5egec9cg4c18gb8acgcd0daafef101"
msgid ""
"I'd best get going, but please stop by my house. I'd like to thank you "
"proper."
msgstr "나는 이만 가봐야겠네. 내 집에 들러주렴. 제대로 보답하고 싶구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_ThankPlayer
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 58c40897-7d70-fa87-7ad7-d9f50b9979d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_ThankPlayer:58c40897-7d70-fa87-7ad7-d9f50b9979d6
msgctxt "h904bb43egecebg49a3gb3c6g3df25c0b958e"
msgid ""
"Those poor boys were looking for their little sister, Mayrina. The girl who "
"is... staying with me."
msgstr "저 불쌍한 청년들은 자기 여동생인 메이리나를 찾고 있었단다. 그 애는... 나랑 같이 지내고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_ThankPlayer
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 5b567222-85a3-5913-6075-4cc2fa0ed379
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_ThankPlayer:5b567222-85a3-5913-6075-4cc2fa0ed379
msgctxt "hd311214eg8f7eg4fa0g9432g6796f9f544a7"
msgid "I - I didn't mean for this to happen."
msgstr "나 - 나는 이런 일이 일어나길 원치 않았는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_ThankPlayer
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 5f25ac89-90cc-dacc-3072-af963179c442
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Hag_KnowsAboutSurrogate = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_ThankPlayer:5f25ac89-90cc-dacc-3072-af963179c442
msgctxt "h462aa6e2gd563g43f5gbac9gcc9611d062a1"
msgid ""
"Mayrina begged me not to breathe a word if they came looking for her. And my "
"word is my <i>bond</i>."
msgstr "메이리나는 녀석들이 자신을 찾아오더라도 입도 뻥긋하지 말아달라고 애원했어. 그리고 내 약속은 나의 <i>유대</i>이거늘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_ThankPlayer
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = a2ba2d0e-bd80-306e-29f5-0e475e2c4e96
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_ThankPlayer:a2ba2d0e-bd80-306e-29f5-0e475e2c4e96
msgctxt "h0f81e582g384bg430eg8f3fg218c2133cf12"
msgid ""
"That poor thing will be <i>distraught</i>. We can't let her know - it'd "
"break her poor heart."
msgstr "그 불쌍한 애는 <i>정신을 잃을 거야</i>. 그 애에게 알려주면 안 돼. 그러면 애의 가련한 마음이 무너질 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_ThankPlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b3312d05-03f2-3846-d333-81afbe5e9ca7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_ThankPlayer:b3312d05-03f2-3846-d333-81afbe5e9ca7
msgctxt "h37112e5eg0d8bg4cb5g9445gd9767f37d6f6"
msgid "What happened? It sounded like a heated argument."
msgstr "무슨 일이죠? 격렬한 논쟁이 있었던 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_ThankPlayer
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = c640b3f7-2685-0d27-49ec-3997e92f7617
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_ThankPlayer:c640b3f7-2685-0d27-49ec-3997e92f7617
msgctxt "h7d520c48g9a6bg404fg9990g9ce00c6433ed"
msgid "Oh, you're a cheeky pup, aren't you?"
msgstr "오, 넌 건방진 아이구나, 안 그렇니?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_ThankPlayer
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = d81a5a49-b654-f51a-a4af-60ee88a9ff25
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_ThankPlayer:d81a5a49-b654-f51a-a4af-60ee88a9ff25
msgctxt "h83f08062g8698g4b97g8db5ga916f3670664"
msgid "But I can respect someone who gets down to business."
msgstr "하지만 자기가 해야 할 일에 충실한 사람은 존중할 수 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_ThankPlayer
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = daed5d37-b123-63d6-1a2d-ad5f0c8a5202
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_ThankPlayer:daed5d37-b123-63d6-1a2d-ad5f0c8a5202
msgctxt "h00c7507ag44afg463eg893eg8b3b954388d3"
msgid ""
"Why don't you stop by my house? I'll be sure to look after you. See you "
"soon, dearie."
msgstr "내 집에 들러보는 건 어떠니? 내가 널 잘 돌봐줄게. 있다가 보자, 이쁜아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_ThankPlayer
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = f52ea7b8-8246-b20c-ccd1-d301071a1baa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmbush_ThankPlayer:f52ea7b8-8246-b20c-ccd1-d301071a1baa
msgctxt "h7a625c8cg5ca3g4afbg8f38gd9c6eb67afdb"
msgid "This is all my fault. But I made a promise!"
msgstr "다 내 잘못이야. 하지만 나는 약속을 했어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmush_PAD_FoundBrothersAfterLongRest
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 15ab0ba3-1c6e-4cd1-634b-8a8bafd6bc07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_EventSkipped = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmush_PAD_FoundBrothersAfterLongRest:15ab0ba3-1c6e-4cd1-634b-8a8bafd6bc07
msgctxt "hb50b5a19g4cc9g4976ga8f8g330b5ed6e1a6"
msgid "Killed and left for scavengers. What a waste."
msgstr "죽어서 약탈자들에게 남겨졌군. 이런 낭비가."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmush_PAD_FoundBrothersAfterLongRest
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 15ab0ba3-1c6e-4cd1-634b-8a8bafd6bc07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_EventSkipped = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmush_PAD_FoundBrothersAfterLongRest:15ab0ba3-1c6e-4cd1-634b-8a8bafd6bc07
msgctxt "h2edbc8e8ga4c5g48a3gb452g99812a30d7be"
msgid "Two dead men. These are recent kills..."
msgstr "두 명의 죽은 남성이라. 그리 오래된 것 같진 않은데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmush_PAD_FoundBrothersAfterLongRest
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 15ab0ba3-1c6e-4cd1-634b-8a8bafd6bc07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_EventSkipped = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmush_PAD_FoundBrothersAfterLongRest:15ab0ba3-1c6e-4cd1-634b-8a8bafd6bc07
msgctxt "h180351d9g9b45g4c2fg8ddeg83e2c2f9e927"
msgid "Gods rest these guys - whoever they are."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmush_PAD_FoundBrothersAfterLongRest
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 15ab0ba3-1c6e-4cd1-634b-8a8bafd6bc07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_EventSkipped = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmush_PAD_FoundBrothersAfterLongRest:15ab0ba3-1c6e-4cd1-634b-8a8bafd6bc07
msgctxt "h5584ed93g2b99g4f3egb68fg16bdfffbba54"
msgid "Not just dead: gutted. Hardly a painless kill."
msgstr "그냥 죽은 게 아니야, 무참히 살해됐군. 고통이 상당했겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmush_PAD_FoundBrothersAfterLongRest
#. Speaker = Player
