msgctxt "h4d38d8d6g3d8bg41a0ga92fg6fcddbc2a0ea"
msgid "Not just dead... eviscerated."
msgstr "그냥 죽은 게 아니야... 내장이 발라졌군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmush_PAD_FoundBrothersAfterLongRest
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 15ab0ba3-1c6e-4cd1-634b-8a8bafd6bc07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_EventSkipped = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmush_PAD_FoundBrothersAfterLongRest:15ab0ba3-1c6e-4cd1-634b-8a8bafd6bc07
msgctxt "ha5bf5d6cg3735g417bga94bg7f5e0bba4845"
msgid "Someone cut these men to pieces. I doubt they had time to scream."
msgstr "누군가 이들을 조각냈어. 비명을 지를 시간도 없었겠는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmush_PAD_FoundBrothersAfterLongRest
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3ef4cb1e-88b7-49f7-4da6-7dd2ed3355e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmush_PAD_FoundBrothersAfterLongRest:3ef4cb1e-88b7-49f7-4da6-7dd2ed3355e9
msgctxt "h2c9d7b41g71e6g4af5g8e37g77365d40cd9c"
msgid "Not just dead: gutted. Hardly a painless kill."
msgstr "그냥 죽은 게 아니야, 무참히 살해됐군. 고통이 상당했겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmush_PAD_FoundBrothersAfterLongRest
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3ef4cb1e-88b7-49f7-4da6-7dd2ed3355e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmush_PAD_FoundBrothersAfterLongRest:3ef4cb1e-88b7-49f7-4da6-7dd2ed3355e9
msgctxt "h19a66cf7g2f55g4f18gada0g838b51bbee4a"
msgid "Although whoever killed them did a masterful job."
msgstr "그래도, 아주 전문가의 솜씨군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmush_PAD_FoundBrothersAfterLongRest
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3ef4cb1e-88b7-49f7-4da6-7dd2ed3355e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmush_PAD_FoundBrothersAfterLongRest:3ef4cb1e-88b7-49f7-4da6-7dd2ed3355e9
msgctxt "hd475705cg58e0g4a13g9ff9g5db90ee42c5f"
msgid "Whoever did this wanted them to suffer. We need to be careful."
msgstr "누군진 모르겠지만, 최대한 고통을 주려고 한 것 같군. 조심해야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmush_PAD_FoundBrothersAfterLongRest
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3ef4cb1e-88b7-49f7-4da6-7dd2ed3355e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmush_PAD_FoundBrothersAfterLongRest:3ef4cb1e-88b7-49f7-4da6-7dd2ed3355e9
msgctxt "h8868ff6cg7239g4c9bgab68gefd961e468c9"
msgid "Eviscerated, no less. A seasoned killer's work."
msgstr "내장이 발라졌어. 숙련된 살인마의 솜씨군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmush_PAD_FoundBrothersAfterLongRest
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3ef4cb1e-88b7-49f7-4da6-7dd2ed3355e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmush_PAD_FoundBrothersAfterLongRest:3ef4cb1e-88b7-49f7-4da6-7dd2ed3355e9
msgctxt "h9d6927a1g507dg4076g98d5gab3b67f32b07"
msgid ""
"These killings were deliberately brutal. There's something near that "
"relishes in carnage."
msgstr "이 살육은 아주 잔인하게 행해졌어. 근처에 학살을 즐기는 무언가가 있군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmush_PAD_FoundBrothersAfterLongRest
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3ef4cb1e-88b7-49f7-4da6-7dd2ed3355e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmush_PAD_FoundBrothersAfterLongRest:3ef4cb1e-88b7-49f7-4da6-7dd2ed3355e9
msgctxt "ha64d5f0fg2633g404dg9e4ege0f594b1802d"
msgid "Whoever did this is still at large. Look alive."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmush_PAD_FoundBrothersAfterLongRest
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3ef4cb1e-88b7-49f7-4da6-7dd2ed3355e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmush_PAD_FoundBrothersAfterLongRest:3ef4cb1e-88b7-49f7-4da6-7dd2ed3355e9
msgctxt "h8b6224bbgf697g483dgbb3ag8640183403d7"
msgid "Be ready. Whoever - or whatever - did this could be close."
msgstr "준비해. 범인이 누구든, 뭐든, 근처에 있을 수도 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmush_PAD_FoundBrothersAfterLongRest
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6d10bf96-a035-5eb7-0a21-d87847405f47
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
