msgctxt "h0733a312g2bdbg4b38gb5eeg6cedc2119ed6"
msgid "Whoever or whatever did this could still be around..."
msgstr "범인이 누구든, 뭐든, 아직 근처에 있을지도 몰라..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmush_PAD_FoundBrothersAfterLongRest
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6d10bf96-a035-5eb7-0a21-d87847405f47
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmush_PAD_FoundBrothersAfterLongRest:6d10bf96-a035-5eb7-0a21-d87847405f47
msgctxt "h3345052dg575cg4fe9gb2adg705e9d9f30dd"
msgid "What a mess. Human or beast, the killer's a monster."
msgstr "난장판이군. 인간이든 야수든, 이들을 죽인 놈은 괴물이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmush_PAD_FoundBrothersAfterLongRest
