msgctxt "h81e66fbdg8134g4a0fg861bg2478187952d5"
msgid ""
"These killings were deliberately brutal. There's something near that "
"relishes in carnage."
msgstr "이 살육은 아주 잔인하게 행해졌어. 근처에 학살을 즐기는 무언가가 있군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmush_PAD_FoundBrothersAfterLongRest
#. Speaker = Player
