msgctxt "h02f84d0fg80dag4e77g9047g7fe5c385feb4"
msgid "Dead? I thought they had a sister to find? That's just lazy, boys."
msgstr "죽었잖아? 여동생을 찾아야 한다더니? 아주 게으르구나, 얘들아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmush_PAD_FoundBrothersAfterLongRest
