msgctxt "hf19c17d3gec10g4325g9a00ge18bc9490f26"
msgid ""
"The brothers in arms have perished. Never did find their sister, I suppose."
msgstr "형제가 함께 죽었군. 결국, 여동생은 찾지 못했나 보네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmush_PAD_FoundBrothersAfterLongRest
