msgctxt "h053a5ed8g191ag40eag9b71gd96eebf18c85"
msgid "The brothers, dead. So much for a family reunion."
msgstr "오빠들이군, 죽었어. 가족 재결합은 실패군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmush_PAD_FoundBrothersAfterLongRest
