msgctxt "h5af72e64g3d06g47dcg9744gc32c58282e64"
msgid ""
"These two won't be helping their sister. Or doing anything else, for that "
"matter."
msgstr "이 둘은 자기 여동생을 도울 수 없겠어. 사실, 아무것도 못하겠지만 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmush_PAD_FoundBrothersAfterLongRest
