#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h5ca0e0eag0158g44d0g9a11ge74ad6512f4b"
msgid "Poor souls. I suppose they never found their sister."
msgstr "불쌍한 영혼들. 결국 그들의 여동생은 절대 만날 수 없겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagAmush_PAD_FoundBrothersAfterLongRest
