msgctxt "he47903dbgbadeg4eabg9547g39125589da57"
msgid "The brothers? I guess they didn't find their sister."
msgstr "그 형제들이잖아? 결국 여동생은 찾지 못한 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_HagLair_Victim_001_AD_Dying
#. Speaker = Efrin
#. NodeID = dea811a8-b977-5421-ac2b-c9ac47843369
