#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hag_Dead:ba73f5c1-ad5b-0e50-1449-348133a2e989
msgctxt "hb0949080gd6ebg4916gb893gec637c9ab26f"
msgid "I didn't want the girl, sweetie. I wanted her <i>babe.</i>"
msgstr "난 그녀를 원한 게 아니란다, 얘야. 그녀의 <i>아이를</i> 노린 거지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hag_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c9493cb9-2122-f13a-4d1a-7bbae00afa48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
