msgid "Gone. Although her stench remains."
msgstr "사라졌어. 그녀의 악취만 남았군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hag_PAD_Fled
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4a216a17-743c-7b91-3009-705fb384d184
