#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hag_PAD_Fled:6924b376-74a5-73e5-cb76-678748ba5d65
msgctxt "h92f754fage2dcg400aga14dg6fb774978194"
msgid ""
"We've got auntie on the run, but I'm sure she still has a few tricks up her "
"sleeve."
msgstr "에텔을 도망치게 했지만, 분명 속임수를 몇 가지 더 숨겨 놓았을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hag_PAD_Fled
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6924b376-74a5-73e5-cb76-678748ba5d65
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_Hag_State_ToLairBecauseCombat = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hag_PAD_Fled:6924b376-74a5-73e5-cb76-678748ba5d65
msgctxt "he4f5b2adgc3d2g4799ga820gb64cecc1eca5"
msgid "Run if you can, hag. Karlach's got your number."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hag_PAD_Fled
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6924b376-74a5-73e5-cb76-678748ba5d65
