msgctxt "h29850544gf2f1g4b87g8cfbgc203fc68e452"
msgid "Hush, now! Won't be discussing that again."
msgstr "조용! 그 얘기는 또 듣고 싶지 않구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_AD_HagSurrogateMotherStartScene
