msgid "Arrrgh. Ma... <i>Ack</i>... Maaay..."
msgstr "아아악. 메... <i>악.</i>.. 메이..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_HusbandResurrected
