msgctxt "h473ff185g357cg4e30g88eagf30b83a8d13f"
msgid "No matter - the deal is done, and the sacrifice was made."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_PAD_AfterResurrection
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 20d2af97-23a2-b8c8-b08f-dcb9315f603f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_PAD_AfterResurrection:20d2af97-23a2-b8c8-b08f-dcb9315f603f
msgctxt "h75d2f618g1d19g43c7gb69fgb78ea347f364"
msgid "Let us be mindful in the future, at least. There are few fair bargains."
msgstr "적어도 앞으로는 주의하자. 공정한 거래란 건 거의 없으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_PAD_AfterResurrection
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 20d2af97-23a2-b8c8-b08f-dcb9315f603f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_PAD_AfterResurrection:20d2af97-23a2-b8c8-b08f-dcb9315f603f
msgctxt "h74bd7d74gdfd7g4588gaa63g3fd8a5e7f295"
msgid "What happened, happened. Standing here arguing won't change it."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_PAD_AfterResurrection
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 20d2af97-23a2-b8c8-b08f-dcb9315f603f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_PAD_AfterResurrection:20d2af97-23a2-b8c8-b08f-dcb9315f603f
msgctxt "he58c1e93g03b5g477dg96d8g11a8f02d594b"
msgid "Forget it. The milk's already spilled."
msgstr "잊어버려. 이미 엎질러진 물이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_PAD_AfterResurrection
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 20d2af97-23a2-b8c8-b08f-dcb9315f603f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_PAD_AfterResurrection:20d2af97-23a2-b8c8-b08f-dcb9315f603f
msgctxt "hd3ea3033gf60eg4d92g8e28gf399b69cf0fa"
msgid "No turning back time now. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_PAD_AfterResurrection
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 20d2af97-23a2-b8c8-b08f-dcb9315f603f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_PAD_AfterResurrection:20d2af97-23a2-b8c8-b08f-dcb9315f603f
msgctxt "h70483ce9g87d5g48d2g9152g39f926bb2c54"
msgid "A pity - he's beyond even the power of the Weave to help now."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_PAD_AfterResurrection
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 20d2af97-23a2-b8c8-b08f-dcb9315f603f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_PAD_AfterResurrection:20d2af97-23a2-b8c8-b08f-dcb9315f603f
msgctxt "h62fb10acg5eecg409bg9bdagf7795ea2ce56"
msgid "The spell is cast - what's done is done."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_PAD_AfterResurrection
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 536c75c8-064e-f1c5-3b5d-08aee2e40815
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_PAD_AfterResurrection:536c75c8-064e-f1c5-3b5d-08aee2e40815
msgctxt "haa9a6263g488cg436bg8471g57517b398936"
msgid "That didn't work out the way you imagined, I reckon."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_PAD_AfterResurrection
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 536c75c8-064e-f1c5-3b5d-08aee2e40815
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_PAD_AfterResurrection:536c75c8-064e-f1c5-3b5d-08aee2e40815
msgctxt "he67b7496gf409g4469g8794g4d3dc59ea018"
msgid "That was <i>revolting</i>."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_PAD_AfterResurrection
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 536c75c8-064e-f1c5-3b5d-08aee2e40815
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_PAD_AfterResurrection:536c75c8-064e-f1c5-3b5d-08aee2e40815
msgctxt "h66bb57d3gcfd3g46deg8bb1gb51c87c6da45"
msgid "Not quite the outcome we were expecting, is it?"
msgstr "우리가 기대했던 결과는 아니군, 안 그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_PAD_AfterResurrection
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 536c75c8-064e-f1c5-3b5d-08aee2e40815
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_PAD_AfterResurrection:536c75c8-064e-f1c5-3b5d-08aee2e40815
msgctxt "h1c46bb6dg7eb0g4483gb849g0851e189681c"
msgid "Mayrina is free - but we paid dearly for it."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_PAD_AfterResurrection
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 536c75c8-064e-f1c5-3b5d-08aee2e40815
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_PAD_AfterResurrection:536c75c8-064e-f1c5-3b5d-08aee2e40815
msgctxt "h0fdc6152gb965g4667ga9f9g31f20303a9f0"
msgid "Should've known Ethel's wand had a twist."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_PAD_AfterResurrection
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 536c75c8-064e-f1c5-3b5d-08aee2e40815
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_PAD_AfterResurrection:536c75c8-064e-f1c5-3b5d-08aee2e40815
msgctxt "h32cf4976g214fg42f1g92e2g876bd6361374"
msgid "Perhaps using Ethel's wand wasn't the best idea."
msgstr "어쩌면 에텔의 마법봉을 사용한 건 좋은 생각이 아니었을 수도."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_PAD_AfterResurrection
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 536c75c8-064e-f1c5-3b5d-08aee2e40815
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_PAD_AfterResurrection:536c75c8-064e-f1c5-3b5d-08aee2e40815
msgctxt "h27a66d16g5116g4f18g8b14gc6297b475b90"
msgid ""
"Not quite the outcome intended, but I must say - the technique was "
"<i>excellent</i>."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 00763abb-e3b0-ed95-9fde-e3ad09e33c8e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAG_Hagspawn_State_KnowsBrothersDead = True
#.     - HAG_Hagspawn_State_EthelKilledBrothers = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - HAG_HagSpawn.ToldMayrinaBrotherDead(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:00763abb-e3b0-ed95-9fde-e3ad09e33c8e
msgctxt "h9a9a423cg02a8g4c43g8235g34ab0f985ae7"
msgid "You MONSTER. The deal is off!"
msgstr "이 괴물아. 거래는 취소야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 017f6082-ccd9-ee12-32b3-b09946a1cb25
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:017f6082-ccd9-ee12-32b3-b09946a1cb25
msgctxt "h24c58655g5e7eg406cg8c1bg382402852e09"
msgid ""
"True. What's important is why you're here - but we can figure that bit out "
"together, petal."
msgstr "맞아. 중요한 건 네가 여기 왜 있는지야. 하지만 그건 우리 함께 알아낼 수 있어, 꽃잎아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 040f0df3-4076-65fe-59d5-430a58090990
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BERSERKER(2) = True
#. TagRule: BERSERKER
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:040f0df3-4076-65fe-59d5-430a58090990
msgctxt "h19459751g13b9g425bga336g5fe4e583a6c5"
msgid "Apology? <b>I could crush you like a bird's nest!</b>"
msgstr "사과? <b>네까짓 건 새 둥지마냥 박살내버릴 수 있어!</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 043b331f-e1c6-88ae-478d-e24a409cece0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Hag.ToldEthelAboutTadpoleInTeahouse(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:043b331f-e1c6-88ae-478d-e24a409cece0
msgctxt "he9d2c747gb357g4172ga493g2615a584b901"
msgid ""
"That wriggler swimming in your brain juice is a bit of an inconvenience, "
"isn't it?"
msgstr "네 두뇌 속을 헤엄치는 그 벌레가 조금 불편하지 않니?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 064e4445-d3fa-3168-8f3d-f393599b72fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_State_FoundDeadBrother = True
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedHag = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAG_Hagspawn_State_SurrogateKnowsKilledBrothers(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:064e4445-d3fa-3168-8f3d-f393599b72fe
msgctxt "h1994536bgd7b3g4422g852ag1edd98c04a53"
msgid "Your brothers are dead - by my hand."
msgstr "너의 오빠들은 내 손에 죽었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 07f3a452-be1c-0a70-2659-ead76df4a4dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:07f3a452-be1c-0a70-2659-ead76df4a4dc
msgctxt "heaae4a92g9381g4ad6g8cf4g8776fb33e039"
msgid ""
"...is <i>me</i>. Forgive me - didn't want the grove's prying eyes in my "
"business."
msgstr "...그게... <i>나야</i>. 용서하렴. 숲의 엿보는 시선들이 내 사업에 끼어드는 걸 원치 않았거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 08d2f1e9-8a9b-e834-5b44-cf723bc3c321
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(7) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:08d2f1e9-8a9b-e834-5b44-cf723bc3c321
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h5c072eabg355cg41a1gbd0bg8b1005cfbecf"
msgid "The girl's in a fix. It's a hero's duty to step in."
msgstr "그 여자애가 위험해. 우리가 나서야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 09f5d56c-c0fe-f725-e22a-a1ad077bc977
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:09f5d56c-c0fe-f725-e22a-a1ad077bc977
msgctxt "hcdb26611g5c41g415dg9b24g0bbb39871cbc"
msgid "You'd best have one hells of an apology for me, young man."
msgstr "나에게 아주 제대로 된 사과를 준비했어야 할 거야, 젊은이."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 09f5d56c-c0fe-f725-e22a-a1ad077bc977
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:09f5d56c-c0fe-f725-e22a-a1ad077bc977
msgctxt "h7f77461eg88deg462dg82fbgb680d24fe73a"
msgid "You'd best have one hells of an apology for me, young lady."
msgstr "나에게 아주 제대로 된 사과를 준비했어야 할 거야, 아가씨."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 09f5d56c-c0fe-f725-e22a-a1ad077bc977
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:09f5d56c-c0fe-f725-e22a-a1ad077bc977
msgctxt "h923682e9g9e20g4945g8a7bgaf829bff1f8c"
msgid "You'd best have one hells of an apology for me, petal."
msgstr "나에게 아주 제대로 된 사과를 준비했어야 할 거야, 꽃잎아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 0a630843-c3fc-55a3-dc42-86568954e25c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_HagDouble_HasMet(2) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedBrothers = False
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedNone = False
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedHag = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:0a630843-c3fc-55a3-dc42-86568954e25c
msgctxt "h750ff0dfg5c6cg4124gbbfdg4a30eabedfdd"
msgid "This is why I like you, petal. You say what's on your mind."
msgstr "그게 내가 너를 좋아하는 이유지, 꽃잎아. 마음속에 있는 것들을 얘기하거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0e011727-210a-7a12-6297-7ddf7573eae2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_HagDouble_HasMet(2) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedBrothers = False
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedNone = False
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedHag = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:0e011727-210a-7a12-6297-7ddf7573eae2
msgctxt "h5c3cdb39gdbcdg429aga54fg692e2ae698e0"
msgid "Interesting place you have, right in the middle of nowhere."
msgstr "굉장히 독특한 곳이군요. 정말 아무것도 없는 한가운데에 있네요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 0e36b24e-ad9a-a7f4-b3a2-f29c8c55729b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:0e36b24e-ad9a-a7f4-b3a2-f29c8c55729b
msgctxt "h26b92372gc848g4f8aga4f2g5ba4ce5cc929"
msgid "I don't like busybodies."
msgstr "나는 참견하는 사람을 싫어한단다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 0e9e44e6-7a3c-8983-b3f7-f4e218a4f98f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAG_Hagspawn_State_SurrogateKnowsKilledBrothers(2) = True
#.   Object:
#.     - HAG_Hag_Event_HostileToPlayersAfterDialog(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:0e9e44e6-7a3c-8983-b3f7-f4e218a4f98f
msgctxt "h435f2711g157dg406cgaf88g2cb7112c3fac"
msgid ""
"Mayrina, my darling, it's not true. No - this scoundrel cut your brothers "
"down. It was <i>awful</i>. So much blood."
msgstr ""
"메이리나, 아가야, 사실이 아니란다. 아니 오히려, 이 불한당들이 너의 오빠들을 베어 쓰러뜨렸지. <i>끔찍했어</i>. 너무 많은 "
"피에다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 0f9f2aa9-2e02-9402-aadc-dc0a7635f762
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:0f9f2aa9-2e02-9402-aadc-dc0a7635f762
msgctxt "h9d37c247g5a2eg4bdegb1f3gd004b686dab4"
msgid "Oh, I <i>like</i> you - you may stay."
msgstr "오, 네가 <i>좋아</i>. 머물러도 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 10bf5207-828f-13b7-cf0f-e9473b2db069
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_HagDouble_HasMet(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:10bf5207-828f-13b7-cf0f-e9473b2db069
msgctxt "hfc846d39gf7f6g4defgaddbg219be33d82f0"
msgid "I'm not sure I want your help anymore."
msgstr "당신의 도움이 더 필요한지 확신이 없어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 118e01ef-b010-21b4-d0ba-b5e5439131d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - HUMAN(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:118e01ef-b010-21b4-d0ba-b5e5439131d6
msgctxt "h24c0c901g0926g4ddfg8891gbd320763d4de"
msgid "I don't want a crumb left on that plate, girl."
msgstr "접시에 부스러기도 남기지 마라, 얘야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 1344f79d-20dc-2850-35e6-d112845bb43b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:1344f79d-20dc-2850-35e6-d112845bb43b
msgctxt "h9d4bb59cga2b0g4e25gaad7g9c79eedddb79"
msgid "You just have one of those faces, Mayrina. So bland and forgettable."
msgstr "넌 그냥 그런 얼굴이야, 메이리나. 특징이 없고 금방 잊히지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 1565897f-f144-4c38-00da-536d14127c76
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:1565897f-f144-4c38-00da-536d14127c76
msgctxt "hddfc716fgec1dg4706gb1b4g8564a836b1a1"
msgid "That can't be true. Auntie Ethel?"
msgstr "그럴 리가 없어요. 에텔 이모?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 1671c034-ff93-5059-bb65-6aecd6bccf2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:1671c034-ff93-5059-bb65-6aecd6bccf2c
msgctxt "h3f1c694eg13d2g4c3fg871ag5a4a7d1e4d64"
msgid "Such <i>dramatics</i>."
msgstr "이런 <i>호들갑</i>을 떨다니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 177be3a4-2bd6-53be-1af3-a1841f5e4ed0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:177be3a4-2bd6-53be-1af3-a1841f5e4ed0
msgctxt "hfd1bd8f3ga9e7g4a3dga379g36bc7fa63b3c"
msgid ""
"Your eyeball is staying in your head - although it would look <i>delightful "
"</i>on a necklace."
msgstr "네 눈알은 머리에 잘 붙어있을 거야. 물론 목걸이에 달아놓으면 참으로 <i>사랑스럽긴</i> 하겠지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 1985c98c-2e07-2fdb-d19c-fe830447ac6e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedHag = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:1985c98c-2e07-2fdb-d19c-fe830447ac6e
msgctxt "h6605a01eg8587g4f8fg94dbg8b8cc47270d6"
msgid "Ah, if it isn't my hero! You took <i>ages</i>. Come in - come in!"
msgstr "아, 나의 영웅께서 오셨군! 왜 이리 <i>한참</i> 걸렸니. 들어오렴, 들어와!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 19a18f1c-295a-a18a-84c1-94f9b9f10e06
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:19a18f1c-295a-a18a-84c1-94f9b9f10e06
msgctxt "hcf02e184g9b3fg4b4ag90aagee64f6caf044"
msgid "Prying eyes. I didn't need those druids in my business."
msgstr "보는 눈이 있었어. 그 드루이드들이 내 일에 참견하는 건 싫으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 1a49e14d-5a49-cf0e-cc88-608e306a0c4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:1a49e14d-5a49-cf0e-cc88-608e306a0c4f
msgctxt "h5e62e77fgaf64g4fd9gbb2fg31cd8f4d9cba"
msgid "But I think you have bigger problems."
msgstr "하지만 네겐 더 큰 문제가 있는 것 같구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 1ab1332b-1b99-3b69-066c-6bfe24aaa793
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:1ab1332b-1b99-3b69-066c-6bfe24aaa793
msgctxt "h2a24c6cbg6d43g4779g90f0g80d239730e1c"
msgid "Beautiful, isn't it? It's my little refuge for the lost and hopeless."
msgstr "아름답지 않니? 여기는 길을 잃거나 희망이 없는 자들을 위한 나의 작은 휴식처란다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 1b0823e9-a582-7b2e-4e12-f83551cb416d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:1b0823e9-a582-7b2e-4e12-f83551cb416d
msgctxt "h4bcd6190g4482g435dgb616ga73245a8be3f"
msgid ""
"No, but it is yours. And if I were you, I would be <i>very</i> concerned."
msgstr "그래, 하지만 네 일이잖니. 내가 너라면, <i>몹시</i> 걱정스러울 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1cbae4a5-f937-6d22-b6e0-eda134ac1cb3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WIZARD(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:1cbae4a5-f937-6d22-b6e0-eda134ac1cb3
msgctxt "hda77f997g897bg499cg81c3g2fabb6439569"
msgid ""
"Tell me, hag: is this intimidation part of the bargaining process? Or does "
"that come after?"
msgstr "말해줘, 해그. 이 협박도 협상 과정의 일부인가? 아니면 협박이 나중에 실현되는 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 1cc7ab21-48cd-9c11-8a0b-4530f73f5e5e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:1cc7ab21-48cd-9c11-8a0b-4530f73f5e5e
msgctxt "h125123ffgd8beg4eefg995cgf0b667190309"
msgid "Oh. But why didn't they come in to see me?"
msgstr "오. 그러면 왜 절 만나러 오진 않은 걸까요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 1cfe4dd5-1428-ae54-8e35-005791f8840a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:1cfe4dd5-1428-ae54-8e35-005791f8840a
msgctxt "hd367c742gb999g4d01ga5feg14d88040388b"
msgid "Forgive me if I get a bit sharp. My work wears something awful on me."
msgstr "내가 좀 신경질적이었다면 용서해 주렴. 내 일이 성격을 더럽게 만들지 뭐니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1d2511bf-c7f3-4f92-697c-cc28c1ee3018
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_PLANAR(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:1d2511bf-c7f3-4f92-697c-cc28c1ee3018
msgctxt "h4ec71702g436bg4601ga6e5ged79edf820d2"
msgid "You think you scare me? Please. I've met far worse than you in my time."
msgstr "내가 당신을 두려워 한다고 생각하는 거야? 제발. 일생에서 훨씬 두려운 사람도 만나봤어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1dd82ea3-bdf2-2118-8148-32219f400bb9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_HALFLING(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:1dd82ea3-bdf2-2118-8148-32219f400bb9
msgctxt "h226b05ceg4bd1g40aagbe07gba94ca59f727"
msgid ""
"How wonderful to meet you! I'm "
"[GEN_PlayerName_c11eee1e-7815-6143-7233-f2427799fa53]. It's an absolute "
"pleasure."
msgstr ""
"뵙게 되어 너무나 멋지네요! 저는 [GEN_PlayerName_c11eee1e-7815-6143-7233-f2427799fa53] "
"입니다. 정말 반갑습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1f6b034f-ee15-81b0-870f-5f2c92329b95
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_State_FoundDeadBrother = True
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedHag = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - HAG_Hag_Event_HostileToPlayersAfterDialog(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:1f6b034f-ee15-81b0-870f-5f2c92329b95
msgctxt "hf1b1e7b7g4932g4fc0g8881ged94a73dedf6"
msgid "Auntie Ethel killed your brothers."
msgstr "에텔 이모가 네 오빠들을 죽였어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 1fe6901f-da78-1d6d-3499-2efbc7c4be47
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CANTLOSEEYE(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Hag.LearnedEyeCost(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:1fe6901f-da78-1d6d-3499-2efbc7c4be47
msgctxt "hdce6822egf74cg47a9g9befg8f68ee54555b"
msgid ""
"I'll pluck it from your head, kiss it for luck, then back in it goes. Won't "
"take but a moment."
msgstr "네 머리에서 뽑아서, 행운을 비는 키스를 한 다음, 다시 넣을게. 잠깐이면 된단다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 20a302af-1f90-5aa2-a31e-5feeae0c2518
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:20a302af-1f90-5aa2-a31e-5feeae0c2518
msgctxt "h469a913ag5a8bg409fgae61geb27a8172985"
msgid ""
"Besides, you should save your energy for that wriggler swimming in your "
"brain juice. Fierce inconvenient, isn't it?"
msgstr "게다가, 뇌액 속에서 꿈틀거리는 그 녀석을 위해 에너지를 아껴두어야 하지. 정말 불편하지 않아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 210da52e-5f3c-0ce1-ec8a-38ae3b3142de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_EventSkipped = False
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_State_FoundDeadBrother = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:210da52e-5f3c-0ce1-ec8a-38ae3b3142de
msgctxt "h0966b093g3f14g425bg9534g7c9ec8426219"
msgid "That's Mayrina? I have some bad news for her."
msgstr "메이리나인가? 나쁜 소식이 있는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 227b45bc-9e11-6331-9e00-0e60c2f53c7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:227b45bc-9e11-6331-9e00-0e60c2f53c7e
msgctxt "hb262b104gdf08g440ag8703g9e73ae5c68bf"
msgid "Depends on the price."
msgstr "얼마나 비싸냐가 문제군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 22a2c651-76fc-de7b-c87f-76b53f56d044
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:22a2c651-76fc-de7b-c87f-76b53f56d044
msgctxt "he56b7860g62f3g4321gb06cgff2885d0767f"
msgid "I'll find another way to take care of it."
msgstr "다른 방법을 찾아볼 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 24684098-48d4-b30b-2129-66fd62bac238
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAG_Hag_State_TeleportSurrogateMotherToLair = True
#.     - HAG_Hagspawn_State_SkipAD = True
#.     - HAG_Hagspawn_State_InitialSceneDone = True
#.   Object:
#.     - HAG_Hag_Event_HostileToPlayersAfterDialog(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:24684098-48d4-b30b-2129-66fd62bac238
msgctxt "h2e7befdbg190fg4225g9eddgddb60e03c37f"
msgid "You want to play the hero so badly? Fine. Let's make this interesting."
msgstr "그렇게 영웅 노릇을 하고 싶니? 좋아. 흥미롭게 만들어 보자꾸나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26afcdb1-22e1-e7e9-8a38-9cbc4ac4b6ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:26afcdb1-22e1-e7e9-8a38-9cbc4ac4b6ee
msgctxt "he31ec677gb67bg40aegaee2g2d107c7c36d0"
msgid "That's a poor bargain. I'll try my luck elsewhere."
msgstr "이거 형편없는 거래잖아. 다른 데서 내 운을 시험해야겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2762e177-e8c1-4023-b37a-e9058481f3ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC_GOOD or PALADIN_GOOD
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:2762e177-e8c1-4023-b37a-e9058481f3ad
msgctxt "h4933e51fg237cg4dc5g8359ge95eac676067"
msgid "I won't apologise to such a wicked creature."
msgstr "너 같은 사악한 괴물에게는 사과하지 않을 테다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 299700f4-07b4-6b58-a0df-7f5f08bfc95a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !(BARBARIAN and BARD and CLERIC_GOOD and PALADIN_GOOD and REALLY_GITHYANKI and WIZARD)
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:299700f4-07b4-6b58-a0df-7f5f08bfc95a
msgctxt "h4be2ab49gff9cg41fbgb1d1g544a97c00f19"
msgid "You'll get no apology from me, hag."
msgstr "내게서 사과를 받아낼 수는 없을 거다, 해그야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 2af37ab7-fd7e-23fa-829d-3996b122287a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:2af37ab7-fd7e-23fa-829d-3996b122287a
msgctxt "h5ef2b8ccg9ba9g4a9fg9efbgace1cb6a6054"
msgid "What is it? What's going on?"
msgstr "뭐죠? 무슨 일인가요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 305875d2-e97f-68a0-e713-0a5f17828c89
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:305875d2-e97f-68a0-e713-0a5f17828c89
msgctxt "h298064d4g4724g4aa6gb7d7gcc9d0880a078"
msgid ""
"Thanks to you. You know, you're lucky - you've helped a <i>very</i> powerful "
"lady."
msgstr "고맙구나. 있잖아, 너는 운이 좋은 거야. <i>매우</i> 강력한 아줌마를 도와줬으니 말이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 32270e65-29ad-625e-0222-abbf876b0a04
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:32270e65-29ad-625e-0222-abbf876b0a04
msgctxt "hc7b9434cg1afbg4777ga37fg910470d01de5"
msgid ""
"There I am in the grove, just trying to make ends meet, and you decide to "
"give me a battering?!"
msgstr "숲에서 단지 입에 풀칠이나 하면서 살아가고 있었는데, 너는 나를 때리는 결정을 했어?!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 322ac350-7a8a-689a-0979-5f75ae5c4151
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - HUMAN(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:322ac350-7a8a-689a-0979-5f75ae5c4151
msgctxt "h9c02b5b6g39c2g4966g8040g229425d050f7"
msgid "Ta-ta, petal. Come see Auntie soon."
msgstr "잘 가, 꽃잎아. 조만간 이모 보러 오렴."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 329e6ae3-c466-39a5-0201-3584d2f7b47c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:329e6ae3-c466-39a5-0201-3584d2f7b47c
msgctxt "h6059bd98gfd56g411fga810g7afa9f54d832"
msgid "Here for whatever you need, petal."
msgstr "네가 필요한 건 여기 다 있단다, 꽃잎아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 35176dc3-b13e-6286-f2c0-1d9888efb311
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:35176dc3-b13e-6286-f2c0-1d9888efb311
msgctxt "h0d4e9912gbdefg4c05gb497g6f5ab837ed5f"
msgid "Will my sight be damaged?"
msgstr "내 시력은 손상되나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 362c5c65-826c-5376-53d2-b54c142e1669
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:362c5c65-826c-5376-53d2-b54c142e1669
msgctxt "hcf72f073g007ag4b68gadf9g9a18bc62ff24"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr "흠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 363e6792-9874-95fb-9169-809369ae9a10
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:363e6792-9874-95fb-9169-809369ae9a10
msgctxt "h4e1f2109g5472g4a40g95fdgb3f0789b97a3"
msgid "Smart move, sweetness."
msgstr "현명한 처신이었어. 다정하기도 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 364c470a-9a52-c86c-0897-b562136aa831
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:364c470a-9a52-c86c-0897-b562136aa831
msgctxt "hd00ad0d4g4e86g49a8g978fge8a86ddafaa3"
msgid "<i>Leave. </i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다. </i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 37a2ec9d-5189-134c-e2cd-a3b9cb1cd299
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedHag = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:37a2ec9d-5189-134c-e2cd-a3b9cb1cd299
msgctxt "h51a13353g10f4g46adg93f8g230fd7a38818"
msgid "You're quite right, petal."
msgstr "네 말이 참으로 맞아, 꽃잎아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 37d5edc5-545b-3227-90f5-99730ef84168
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_State_FoundDeadBrother = True
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedHag = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAG_Hagspawn_State_SurrogateKnowsKilledBrothers(2) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_GOOD or PALADIN_GOOD
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:37d5edc5-545b-3227-90f5-99730ef84168
msgctxt "hc8e6fe18ge3fdg4fb8ga195g6f94c7131621"
msgid "I pray for your forgiveness. I fought your brothers and killed them."
msgstr "너의 용서를 구할게. 내가 네 형제들과 싸워서 죽였어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 387bf557-f720-28fe-8421-561134d80e20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:387bf557-f720-28fe-8421-561134d80e20
msgctxt "h671f1497ga7d8g4947g924bgeeed9d568758"
msgid ""
"People in dire need travel from all over Faerûn to see little ol' me. And I "
"do my <i>damndest </i>to help them."
msgstr ""
"도움이 절실한 사람들이 페이룬 전역에서 나를 만나기 위해 찾아온단다. 그리고 나는 그들을 돕기 위해 <i>안간힘</i>을 다 쓰지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 387eadaf-11b6-53f9-c0a5-16868cc97b40
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedNone = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:387eadaf-11b6-53f9-c0a5-16868cc97b40
msgctxt "h482b57f2g9e23g4adfgac13g7c9cd4dd6839"
msgid "I'm sorry. I should have stepped in."
msgstr "미안합니다. 내가 개입했어야 했는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 3b15738e-18ff-d7b7-ecff-e6a83e6d77aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:3b15738e-18ff-d7b7-ecff-e6a83e6d77aa
msgctxt "h393ae841gc892g401ag8a98g7dc637b4860e"
msgid ""
"You don't need to bear the brunt of this alone, precious. Auntie Ethel is "
"here for you."
msgstr "혼자서 이 모든 걸 견디지 않아도 돼, 이쁜 것. 에텔 이모가 여기 있잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 3cb588f8-7b48-b8f0-0350-f1a9ed4e3c52
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:3cb588f8-7b48-b8f0-0350-f1a9ed4e3c52
msgctxt "ha58bcc7dg10d3g4f35gaabfgbe786ad80a26"
msgid "No! No, I don't know him."
msgstr "아뇨! 아뇨, 전 몰라요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 3cb588f8-7b48-b8f0-0350-f1a9ed4e3c52
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:3cb588f8-7b48-b8f0-0350-f1a9ed4e3c52
msgctxt "h3847fe75gff62g4b68g8d26g3bad59883236"
msgid "No! No, I don't know her."
msgstr "아뇨! 아뇨, 전 몰라요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 3cb588f8-7b48-b8f0-0350-f1a9ed4e3c52
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:3cb588f8-7b48-b8f0-0350-f1a9ed4e3c52
msgctxt "h96931766gd30dg4f0dg8b23gb4dc6efbaffe"
msgid "No! No, I don't know them."
msgstr "아뇨! 아뇨, 전 몰라요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 3fdc2d4d-596a-8469-22e7-ef0eaa5de9e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:3fdc2d4d-596a-8469-22e7-ef0eaa5de9e2
msgctxt "h2168f47fg9025g41f2ga195g66e1b0f88d48"
msgid "Yes, because everyone and their mother is an expert on illithid scum."
msgstr "그래, 모든 사람들과 그들 애미가 일리시드 잡것에 전문가니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 41fb07c1-9cc7-0a1e-b706-8dddfc1c87f4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(5) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:41fb07c1-9cc7-0a1e-b706-8dddfc1c87f4
msgctxt "hd66c9672gfe5fg4da3g8315ga2fb94667933"
msgid "Pfft. That <i>hag </i>doesn't tell us what to do."
msgstr "훗. 그 <i>해그</i>는 우리가 뭘 해야 할지 말해주지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 43c84df0-0a68-22c4-7ded-0c948d4e97b6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 7f009f55-4d9c-e110-72f6-360479f6dfdd_HAG_Hagspawn_State_DidntTellMayrina = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 7f009f55-4d9c-e110-72f6-360479f6dfdd_HAG_Hagspawn_State_DidntTellMayrina = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:43c84df0-0a68-22c4-7ded-0c948d4e97b6
msgctxt "h9d8703ebg528fg4781g9ba0g6a0a6acc216c"
msgid "Nothing. I mistook you for someone else."
msgstr "아무것도. 내가 당신을 다른 사람과 헷갈렸어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 45bb79e3-d505-5640-bed5-ae70952eb232
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_BESTIAL or REALLY_RARE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:45bb79e3-d505-5640-bed5-ae70952eb232
msgctxt "ha8341835g9e82g4ee1ga875g0c3d482bc504"
msgid "Usually people ask what, as opposed to who, I am."
msgstr "보통은 사람들은 내가 누구인지가 아니라 무엇이냐고 물어봐요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 46754d34-3519-c672-0db2-c5102b9f249f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Hag.AgreedTadpoleDeal(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:46754d34-3519-c672-0db2-c5102b9f249f
msgctxt "ha3923874gebadg46d8g870ageb0399ec025a"
msgid "You have a deal."
msgstr "수락하겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 46e8889c-4348-51ec-1718-e1e8bcde87a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_HagDouble_HasMet(2) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedBrothers = False
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedNone = False
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedHag = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:46e8889c-4348-51ec-1718-e1e8bcde87a5
msgctxt "h8ebb3b19gde1ag49c5g9b02g0a225472e8ad"
msgid "Did you have any trouble on the way here?"
msgstr "여기까지 오는데 아무 문제 없었나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 481c41a7-1d64-12c5-76dc-2a32ccc2ffe8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Hag_Knows_ToldHagTadpole = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:481c41a7-1d64-12c5-76dc-2a32ccc2ffe8
msgctxt "ha06909b7g015fg4a7eg848ag3bfc27217a06"
msgid "Are you saying you can remove it?"
msgstr "당신이 올챙이를 제거할 수 있다고 말하고 있는 건가요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 488605fa-f4ed-7e58-d629-19668c0f80e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - HAG_Hagspawn_State_AskedAboutMayrina(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:488605fa-f4ed-7e58-d629-19668c0f80e3
msgctxt "hc5f68289gf6cdg4738g8c83g4610a15f3929"
msgid "I'd rather know who this woman is first."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 4993185e-3040-0d6c-f3b5-e6d9c3a5d6cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:4993185e-3040-0d6c-f3b5-e6d9c3a5d6cd
msgctxt "hbe00a890gcde9g4fdfgb8d9g9ccc602d05e4"
msgid "I'm the safer bet. Plus - you'll get to keep your soul."
msgstr "그놈보다는 내가 더 안전하지. 네 영혼도 지킬 수 있을 거고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 4c826755-3bde-01ef-800e-07948beaec38
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC_MYRKUL or PALADIN_MYRKUL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:4c826755-3bde-01ef-800e-07948beaec38
msgctxt "h49e8ff45ge8fag40cbg87b8g22730c4418d0"
msgid ""
"Myrkul? Pretty rubbish god of death, if you ask me. You're just an adorable "
"little misery guts though."
msgstr "머큘이라고? 내가 보기엔 아주 형편없는 죽음의 신이야. 넌 그저 귀여운 불평쟁이일 뿐이고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4c882f29-87a0-7742-39eb-ab326f53f37a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WIZARD(2) = True
#. TagRule: WIZARD
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:4c882f29-87a0-7742-39eb-ab326f53f37a
msgctxt "h7883df62gbab8g420cg8161g1cd5e044555d"
msgid ""
"This sounds like a spell for a Hag Eye - you want to see through one of my "
"eyes."
msgstr "<b>해그의 눈</b>을 위한 주문처럼 들리는군. 내 눈중 하나를 통해 보는 걸 원하는 거고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4d465447-6dfa-8ece-212f-a73f07362453
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_State_FoundDeadBrother = True
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedHag = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAG_Hagspawn_State_SurrogateKnowsKilledBrothers(2) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_EVIL or PALADIN_EVIL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:4d465447-6dfa-8ece-212f-a73f07362453
msgctxt "hdd0cfe65g4974g4ae4g82b7g3831d00b7549"
msgid "I gutted your brothers. There was blood everywhere."
msgstr "내가 네 오빠들의 내장을 뽑아 버렸지. 거기 사방이 피 투성이가 되었고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 4d862319-d85b-57b1-2533-29ea16eb7fd9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:4d862319-d85b-57b1-2533-29ea16eb7fd9
msgctxt "hd0481f9bg6176g403egb85fg02cb591dc74e"
msgid "Come now - aren't you going to introduce yourself?"
msgstr "이제 왔으니까 자기소개 좀 해보겠니?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 4e75e16c-43ab-96ef-f562-9fb359c343d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - HUMAN(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:4e75e16c-43ab-96ef-f562-9fb359c343d5
msgctxt "hb5a14151g81a2g4f8eg856ag1c5f28d88ef9"
msgid "Ethel, can I please..."
msgstr "에텔, 부탁할게요..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 5049bb9f-de80-6fe2-caa4-0c472bae0b7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:5049bb9f-de80-6fe2-caa4-0c472bae0b7e
msgctxt "hd35c1736g3b9dg42d3gaca0g566fccf984dc"
msgid "Finally! See, girl? Now <i>that's</i> an introduction."
msgstr "마침내! 봤어 아가씨? 방금 <i>그게</i> 제대로 된 소개야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5430e24a-ac45-4d70-78d7-dfd971395c01
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !()
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:5430e24a-ac45-4d70-78d7-dfd971395c01
msgctxt "h3ccf0a4dgf954g43b7gb0ffgf5953d3091da"
msgid "You want one of my <i>eyes</i>? Why?"
msgstr "내 <i>눈</i> 한쪽을 원하나? 왜지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5468d2c7-f92b-b59d-2464-dc9d41d29280
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 7f009f55-4d9c-e110-72f6-360479f6dfdd_HAG_Hagspawn_State_DidntTellMayrina = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - HUMAN(1) = True
#.   User:
#.      - HAG_Hagspawn_State_AskedAboutMayrina(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Hag_Knows_ToldHagTadpole = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:5468d2c7-f92b-b59d-2464-dc9d41d29280
msgctxt "h3a70ee33g69d5g49a4g8551g24ec3a26c2ec"
msgid "Something isn't right. That woman - why is she with you?"
msgstr "뭔가 잘못됐어. 이 여자가 왜 당신과 같이 있는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 557af6d0-7051-236b-e6ff-bfe6995cc75d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAG_Hag_HasMet_Teahouse(2) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - HAG_HagSpawn_Event_CheckSetMayrinaDeal = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:557af6d0-7051-236b-e6ff-bfe6995cc75d
msgctxt "h319da457ga4e3g4c11g9a7ag3eaa5fc0c2b8"
msgid ""
"Auntie Ethel, please. One more bite and this pie is gonna come back up to "
"say hello."
msgstr "에텔 이모, 제발요. 한 입만 더 먹으면 파이가 입 밖으로 다시 나와 인사할 거 같아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 557f8c1a-07a6-fdff-dbc9-3dc61c72e176
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:557f8c1a-07a6-fdff-dbc9-3dc61c72e176
msgctxt "haa830977g043cg4348g811bgc0b35b67488d"
msgid ""
"You're a sharp one. I <i>am </i>proposing a deal, but it's different from "
"your little pact. You see, I prefer <i>personal </i>things."
msgstr "날카롭구나. 한 가지 제안을 <i>할게</i>. 그런데 너의 작은 계약과는 다른거야. 알겠지만, <i>개인적인</i> 물건이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 55df832b-1e4c-ed7b-4385-c74df075e23c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:55df832b-1e4c-ed7b-4385-c74df075e23c
msgctxt "hd4c6ea65gdd19g4c9bg904cgacd39b3cc3be"
msgid "How shocking: another barbarian with all brawn and no brains."
msgstr "충격이야. 근육만 있고 뇌는 없는 또 하나의 바바리안이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 571d0af1-3cf3-8a69-aa36-e9b076e803e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:571d0af1-3cf3-8a69-aa36-e9b076e803e9
msgctxt "h825f05cdgc400g4a93gad73gd15f9b7d5626"
msgid "They were being rude. And I <i>detest</i> rudeness."
msgstr "저들은 무례하게 굴었어. 나는 무례함을 <i>증오해.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 576d5571-a579-1a1a-414d-4d9edc9ceb38
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:576d5571-a579-1a1a-414d-4d9edc9ceb38
msgctxt "h4ab46d53ged49g4813gb875g7288e1f8c0a7"
msgid "Are you sure about that?"
msgstr "정말 확실하니?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 586dc8e5-02c2-05fe-56cf-a1a0cd12d742
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedBrothers = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:586dc8e5-02c2-05fe-56cf-a1a0cd12d742
msgctxt "ha600b302g24afg4ae6g9820gf8fd30780609"
msgid "If it isn't the cheekiest pup of them all..."
msgstr "그 건방진 녀석이구나..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 58720a41-510e-4c2f-950b-166f74d8c972
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_State_FoundDeadBrother = False
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_State_FoundUnconsciousBrother = True
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedHag = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:58720a41-510e-4c2f-950b-166f74d8c972
msgctxt "h7ffa3324g05c9g483eg8401g7588af8a4ce8"
msgid "That's Mayrina? I have some bad news for her."
msgstr "메이리나인가? 나쁜 소식이 있는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 58d398a2-14c1-1319-7584-1624ef07ac00
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:58d398a2-14c1-1319-7584-1624ef07ac00
msgctxt "h5da2f606gd6d5g497cgaaddg5b5fbf8c01b8"
msgid "I'm Gale. Delighted to make your acquaintance."
msgstr "게일이라고 합니다. 만나서 반갑습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 58d398a2-14c1-1319-7584-1624ef07ac00
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:58d398a2-14c1-1319-7584-1624ef07ac00
msgctxt "he3825016g62bcg47e8gb77bg93574b905730"
msgid "I'm Shadowheart. A pleasure."
msgstr "섀도하트예요. 만나서 반가워요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 58d398a2-14c1-1319-7584-1624ef07ac00
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:58d398a2-14c1-1319-7584-1624ef07ac00
msgctxt "h738f6282g378cg49c5gbafcged9c8d4b951b"
msgid "Wyll. Delighted, I'm sure."
msgstr "윌. 반갑군, 진짜로."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 58d398a2-14c1-1319-7584-1624ef07ac00
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:58d398a2-14c1-1319-7584-1624ef07ac00
msgctxt "h6edf485bg6f64g42b9ga9e5g96b041099251"
msgid "Call me Lae'zel."
msgstr "레이젤로 불러."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 58d398a2-14c1-1319-7584-1624ef07ac00
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:58d398a2-14c1-1319-7584-1624ef07ac00
msgctxt "h90a6a43ag55dbg447bga639g5010c926c815"
msgid "Karlach. Pleasure."
msgstr "칼라크. 반가워."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 58d398a2-14c1-1319-7584-1624ef07ac00
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:58d398a2-14c1-1319-7584-1624ef07ac00
msgctxt "h24dc773cg54adg4087ga459gbdfbc35340a8"
msgid "Astarion - just delighted to meet you, madam."
msgstr "아스타리온, 만나 뵙게 되어 반갑습니다, 부인."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 58d398a2-14c1-1319-7584-1624ef07ac00
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:58d398a2-14c1-1319-7584-1624ef07ac00
msgctxt "h0535d311g11cag48b3gb6bcg7b01f285fc15"
msgid "I'm [GEN_PlayerName_c11eee1e-7815-6143-7233-f2427799fa53]. Well met."
msgstr "저는 [GEN_PlayerName_c11eee1e-7815-6143-7233-f2427799fa53] 입니다. 반갑습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 59a522f6-a3ca-5ca8-1120-d9a4171e3ec6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:59a522f6-a3ca-5ca8-1120-d9a4171e3ec6
msgctxt "hc5e15bddg3641g46f3ga69cgaf8ff09cbb7a"
msgid "Keep your own little nose in your own little dish, petal."
msgstr "자기 일에나 신경 써, 꽃잎아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 5b5d2787-679b-1005-cfcd-dd1a3b10dbdd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:5b5d2787-679b-1005-cfcd-dd1a3b10dbdd
msgctxt "h259726afg6885g438ag8f38gd14bebdb408c"
msgid "Keep that hole under your nose shut. Or things will get <i>messy</i>."
msgstr "코 밑에 있는 그 구멍 다물고 있어. 그렇지 않으면 일이 <i>엉망</i>이 될 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 5bc56345-fc89-f5a1-4059-3ed088097cee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:5bc56345-fc89-f5a1-4059-3ed088097cee
msgctxt "hd470487fgff43g402dgb2a3gf7ecae0a1f07"
msgid "Dead. Everyone's dead."
msgstr "죽었어. 다들 죽었다니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5c147bfb-c866-1059-263e-031ecd48a126
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:5c147bfb-c866-1059-263e-031ecd48a126
msgctxt "h83999a81g4f42g4dc3g8effga150de58628e"
msgid "I'm here to trade."
msgstr "거래하러 왔다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 5d76c995-8b45-8757-dd5f-0e40aa826a2d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.      - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Hag.LearnedEyeCost(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - ONEEYED(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:5d76c995-8b45-8757-dd5f-0e40aa826a2d
msgctxt "hd4b1247fg08c3g4d92g9e08gdfc505847716"
msgid "You going to give me one of those precious peepers?"
msgstr "내게 그 귀한 눈 하나만 줄래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 5dcb460b-4077-0c54-8af5-17807d575ae7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:5dcb460b-4077-0c54-8af5-17807d575ae7
msgctxt "h15aa6716g0bb4g4771ga124g813ec4f4d46f"
msgid ""
"My - I do like them eager. But know that I don't work for free. I expect "
"payment up front..."
msgstr "이런 - 나도 그러고 싶은데. 나는 공짜로 일하지는 않는다는 걸 알아주렴. 선불을 기대할게..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 5ed0e2fd-f342-7e18-9ef1-bc9414d93c35
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAG_Hagspawn_State_InitialSceneDone = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:5ed0e2fd-f342-7e18-9ef1-bc9414d93c35
msgctxt "ha7591b77gc117g4a9ag9aa8g9147db9d038f"
msgid "Gods, grant me patience... Eat up, Mayrina! I won't say it again."
msgstr "신이시여, 제게 인내심을 허락하소서... 먹어, 메이리나! 또 말하진 않겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 5f806599-3551-c4e2-cb93-09d167182763
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:5f806599-3551-c4e2-cb93-09d167182763
msgctxt "h2b65c2eegf37eg41b9gb978g3a837c2019e6"
msgid "Must you stick out your neck for every dimwit in distress?"
msgstr "곤란에 처한 멍청이들을 볼 때마다 목숨을 걸어야 하나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 61e1c902-29f4-3937-0014-51c4ce637eb1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:61e1c902-29f4-3937-0014-51c4ce637eb1
msgctxt "hee327f1bg533eg45e4gaaa7g1db3aa99ca21"
msgid "Yes, your brothers are dead. And before you ask - yes, I killed them."
msgstr "그래, 너의 오빠들은 죽었어. 그리고 너가 묻기전에 대답하지. 그래, 내가 그들을 죽였다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 6377ecfe-edb1-1383-be08-037e8efec9b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:6377ecfe-edb1-1383-be08-037e8efec9b5
msgctxt "h36e9a40fg8b6bg419eg88b1g70f15bcd6a86"
msgid "Besides, you have bigger problems."
msgstr "그건 그렇고, 너에게는 더 큰 문제가 있겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 64b4daff-636a-cf63-f6df-9de8a3f2e746
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_KillBrothers = False
#.   Quest:
#.      - HAG_HagSpawn.BrothersDied(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:64b4daff-636a-cf63-f6df-9de8a3f2e746
msgctxt "ha44ba769ga8ccg4e0cg9eceg7a0ddee5855f"
msgid "I found your brothers dead outside."
msgstr "너의 오빠들이 밖에서 죽어 있는 걸 발견했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 65a73950-47c1-83e1-21fc-c47461df6590
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:65a73950-47c1-83e1-21fc-c47461df6590
msgctxt "habb5db22g120cg4978ga9a1gd318c29b740c"
msgid "No. This woman is clearly in trouble."
msgstr "싫어. 이 여성은 분명 곤경에 처해 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 6654bb17-0c60-977f-56d1-413d393ebe9b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:6654bb17-0c60-977f-56d1-413d393ebe9b
msgctxt "h4c820d83g2a17g4b19gb301g9f43d5f6243b"
msgid ""
"I don't think I did, dearie. And frankly you're <i>thick</i> for saying so."
msgstr "아닌 것 같은데, 얘야. 솔직히 말하자면 그렇게 말하는 네 낯짝이 <i>두껍구나</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 66d224f7-f88f-f051-1ea0-ecd75585d443
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC_SHAR or PALADIN_SHAR
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:66d224f7-f88f-f051-1ea0-ecd75585d443
msgctxt "h4d0f1901g36bag44baga4f9g79478909f047"
msgid ""
"Shar won't bother us here. She's far too busy writing poetry and crying "
"about how much people prefer her sister."
msgstr "샤는 우리를 귀찮게 하지 않을 거야. 녀석은 혼자 틀어박혀 시를 쓰거나 사람들이 자기 자매만 좋아한다면서 징징대기 바쁘거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 68bac603-82de-5736-9d2c-159677558cf2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:68bac603-82de-5736-9d2c-159677558cf2
msgctxt "h6d56c350g7a7eg43e7g94dfg2e3ad7125b1f"
msgid ""
"You know, I was gonna give you a swift kick up the arse and show you the "
"door..."
msgstr "그런데 말이다, 원래는 네 엉덩이를 걷어차서 그대로 쫓아내려고 했는데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 69983316-3ad9-d06f-11eb-f955afe694a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DUERGARDWARF(2) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_DUERGARDWARF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:69983316-3ad9-d06f-11eb-f955afe694a8
msgctxt "h61a35dbdg19a9g4235gba06gb01c4e9eabba"
msgid "Nope. Are duergar even welcome here?"
msgstr "사양하지. 듀에르가도 여기서 환영받나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 6c9d7a3b-02f8-dc53-b71b-8cd9cec8bf07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedBrothers = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:6c9d7a3b-02f8-dc53-b71b-8cd9cec8bf07
msgctxt "hdc4e4986g4192g4fbdgad06g5089ffaec9c9"
msgid "Watch that tone, sweetie. You want to be in my good books - trust me."
msgstr "말조심하거라, 이쁜아. 장담컨대 날 거스르지 않는 편이 좋을게야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6cd0181c-8adb-f4c8-66c4-cb31b0c88bd9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:6cd0181c-8adb-f4c8-66c4-cb31b0c88bd9
msgctxt "hcf660fdeg11d1g40cfgb269geba7261e76a6"
msgid "Do you treat all your guests so poorly?"
msgstr "당신은 모든 손님을 그렇게 푸대접하나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 6fb12d5e-46a2-0dcb-3afd-59387dfcad5a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(8) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(8) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:6fb12d5e-46a2-0dcb-3afd-59387dfcad5a
msgctxt "h5aef93b2geafeg4d4dg8432g1f013e3ceda3"
msgid "The choice is yours. There's really no good decision to be made here."
msgstr "선택은 네 몫이야. 이런 곳에서 좋은 결정이란 건 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 738bf586-2106-d101-e752-f067bb6aa45e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAG_Hag_Event_KickSurrogateMotherFromDialog = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:738bf586-2106-d101-e752-f067bb6aa45e
msgctxt "hb23b5204ga4f2g438bg8b4fg317ba63a29bf"
msgid "Blessed silence at last. Some time in the cage should do her good."
msgstr "마침내 축복받은 침묵이 왔구나. 그 애도 우리에서 시간을 보내면 좀 나아지겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 753eaadf-2a02-8e2e-e43b-26207c472143
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:753eaadf-2a02-8e2e-e43b-26207c472143
msgctxt "h71e222c2gc8e5g474bga102g17f3c453041e"
msgid "<i>Attack her.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그녀를 공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 75eaea80-4d9f-98ef-ef8c-259267e91282
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Monitor_State_FirstDealOffered = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:75eaea80-4d9f-98ef-ef8c-259267e91282
msgctxt "hbee01e04g7955g4529g904agc740cadbe49f"
msgid "I know a devil that's offered to remove it."
msgstr "어떤 데빌이 이걸 제거해 주겠다고 하던데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 772cfdd9-d2e7-c02f-8381-3a5194b1f4a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedBrothers = True
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_State_FoundDeadBrother = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:772cfdd9-d2e7-c02f-8381-3a5194b1f4a1
msgctxt "he3cee329g9709g43c6gb991g080e2e70c29b"
msgid "That's Mayrina? Where are her brothers?"
msgstr "그녀가 메이리나인가? 그녀의 오빠들은 어디 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 786d39c1-5229-1c99-9659-7c87a531a3e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CANTLOSEEYE(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Hag.LearnedEyeCost(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:786d39c1-5229-1c99-9659-7c87a531a3e9
msgctxt "h595ea3e5g2b73g44d2gb034gd02d3a462a26"
msgid ""
"Oh dear, you don't have one to spare. Terribly sorry, petal - but no deal "
"for you."
msgstr "오 저런, 남는 눈이 없구나. 정말 미안해, 꽃잎아. 하지만 너랑 거래는 못 하겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 79189372-645a-deb3-c1ca-6985ca730f15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_HagDouble_HasMet(2) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedBrothers = False
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedNone = False
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedHag = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:79189372-645a-deb3-c1ca-6985ca730f15
msgctxt "h12781082g2d39g4681g8900ge84a59383539"
msgid "Let's start over, shall we? I'm Auntie Ethel."
msgstr "우리 처음부터 할까? 나는 에텔 이모라고 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 79aac235-4bf3-7466-327c-27a8c131ec26
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:79aac235-4bf3-7466-327c-27a8c131ec26
msgctxt "h9c358c87g45d1g432fg8e43g38477d4b4ead"
msgid ""
"Then you don't know her like I do. She's getting exactly what she wanted. "
"Don't you fret."
msgstr "그렇다면 너는 그녀를 나보다 모른다는 거지. 그녀는 정확히 그녀가 원한대로 되고 있어. 초조해 하지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7a6edee5-266d-71ff-1569-df1a5e89bba7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:7a6edee5-266d-71ff-1569-df1a5e89bba7
msgctxt "hc4cb6678g160eg48bfg8eccg4b7d01b7b081"
msgid "Forget I asked."
msgstr "묻는걸 깜빡했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7a8c4012-f81d-ee6c-74e5-0414d0c7fd1b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_HagDouble_HasMet(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:7a8c4012-f81d-ee6c-74e5-0414d0c7fd1b
msgctxt "h53ccc8c6g6b49g4a40g8af9g229ccc01ff53"
msgid "You have an <i>interesting </i>home."
msgstr "<i>흥미로운</i> 집을 갖고 있네요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 7ac640b8-70b6-ee85-4642-ae57e396e747
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:7ac640b8-70b6-ee85-4642-ae57e396e747
msgctxt "ha0e76184g9d3ag4e8dgad23gdff51df6105f"
msgid ""
"Aw, the wizard thinks he's smart because he can <i>read</i>. How precious."
msgstr "아, 저 위저드는 <i>간파</i>했다고 스스로 똑똑하다고 생각하시는구먼. 사랑스럽기도 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 7ac640b8-70b6-ee85-4642-ae57e396e747
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:7ac640b8-70b6-ee85-4642-ae57e396e747
msgctxt "h098ae5adga685g455bg9b4bg2c351afcd3f5"
msgid ""
"Aw, the wizard thinks she's smart because she can <i>read</i>. How precious."
msgstr "아, 저 위저드는 <i>간파</i>했다고 스스로 똑똑하다고 생각하시는구먼. 사랑스럽기도 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 7ac640b8-70b6-ee85-4642-ae57e396e747
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:7ac640b8-70b6-ee85-4642-ae57e396e747
msgctxt "h9539df1egc9ecg4addg8282g3356d70e344d"
msgid ""
"Aw, the wizard thinks they're smart because they can <i>read</i>. How "
"precious."
msgstr "아, 저 위저드는 <i>간파</i>했다고 스스로 똑똑하다고 생각하시는구먼. 사랑스럽기도 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 8097381d-2dd6-de14-1977-878c4f2e0565
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - HAG_Hag_Knows_AskedTadpole(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:8097381d-2dd6-de14-1977-878c4f2e0565
msgctxt "hedc562f6g105ag4a4dg827fgcea621661ecd"
msgid "What do you say? Want me to take care of the little bugger?"
msgstr "내가 그 작은 벌레를 처리해줄까? 어때?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = 811d7f87-159e-b425-1a8e-41f6a79124f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:811d7f87-159e-b425-1a8e-41f6a79124f6
msgctxt "h76735d68gfb13g486dg963egfa7340ead300"
msgid "My brothers? You saw them?"
msgstr "제 오빠들요? 오빠들을 보셨어요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 85aa8eba-2843-7a57-725f-24df14579a79
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:85aa8eba-2843-7a57-725f-24df14579a79
msgctxt "h01ca0434g7363g4b7fgb76fg59c2dc651020"
msgid "Don't bother. You'd only subject us to her inevitable wailing."
msgstr "그만둬. 우리더러 저 여자가 울부짖는 소리에 고통받게 할 셈인가."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 86347e03-6f35-5f28-4841-df14f005d7f4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - HAG_Hagspawn_State_AskedAboutMayrina(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:86347e03-6f35-5f28-4841-df14f005d7f4
msgctxt "h2be76a50g7123g4d98gb2e8g49d8fff8412b"
msgid "The lady doesn't seem to be enjoying her dinner."
msgstr "이 아가씨는 저녁 식사를 즐기지 않는 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 875e0e6f-ed8c-0c4d-06b6-e782aa32b932
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:875e0e6f-ed8c-0c4d-06b6-e782aa32b932
msgctxt "hc6e9f203gb410g4d7eg9cc6geb3b438b4d30"
msgid "None that I couldn't handle, precious."
msgstr "내가 감당하지 못하는 건 없단다, 이쁜 것."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 8a64edee-71bb-4342-1417-bf463b838e6b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:8a64edee-71bb-4342-1417-bf463b838e6b
msgctxt "h0f25331dg82f7g4407g970cg9c69967b69bc"
msgid ""
"They stopped by to pass on their congratulations. Said they'll be waiting "
"for you at home."
msgstr "축하 인사를 전하러 왔더구나. 집에서 기다리고 있겠다고 했단다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8cca9bfb-998b-0c91-7b0a-4f32ee109666
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:8cca9bfb-998b-0c91-7b0a-4f32ee109666
msgctxt "h5eaab2cdg7034g40d0gbbd3g86baa695e95b"
msgid "You must have mistaken me for someone else."
msgstr "저를 다른 사람과 착각하셨나 보군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 8e4a34ff-c4cb-575c-a3a7-60e11620ced6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:8e4a34ff-c4cb-575c-a3a7-60e11620ced6
msgctxt "he6261231g066ag4993gb988g0d28b3b2560a"
msgid "And you. <i>Hush.</i> Don't be upsetting the girl with such things."
msgstr "그리고 너. <i>쉿.</i> 이런걸로 소녀를 흥분시키지 말라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 8e86608f-b3f8-66cf-7cbf-06ef1fa1a01a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAG_Hag_State_TeleportSurrogateMotherToLair = True
#.     - HAG_Hagspawn_State_SkipAD = True
#.     - HAG_Hagspawn_State_InitialSceneDone = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:8e86608f-b3f8-66cf-7cbf-06ef1fa1a01a
msgctxt "h397c01cfgd3a3g4548gb7e2g33e90a0f6d13"
msgid "Quiet. You've had enough pampering."
msgstr "조용히 하렴. 응석도 정도가 있어야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 8ed317cf-7205-f719-6281-c3d940281c06
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:8ed317cf-7205-f719-6281-c3d940281c06
msgctxt "h0f1aaabcgf424g4469ga6f3g5a1971dd4e9b"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid that's my business, petal. It's nothing nefarious though - I "
"promise."
msgstr "미안하지만 그건 내 개인적인 일이란다, 꽃잎아. 하지만 사악한 건 없으리라 약속하마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 9134f036-3a05-c742-110b-e099c9d942bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_HagDouble_HasMet(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:9134f036-3a05-c742-110b-e099c9d942bc
msgctxt "h20c4bdddgee67g4e0bg8ad6ga4cd1418aa5d"
msgid "Who is this? A <i>friend</i> of yours?"
msgstr "얘는 누구야? 네 <i>친구</i>니?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 9144945f-ecee-70a5-9750-c07fb192865a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:9144945f-ecee-70a5-9750-c07fb192865a
msgctxt "h4c22aafag62dcg49dcg9fafg6d4e49999274"
msgid ""
"Well, that depends on the job. Removing a parasite is no small feat. But I "
"like you, petal. So I'll only ask for something small..."
msgstr ""
"글쎄, 일에 따라 다르지. 기생충을 제거하는 건 쉬운 일이 아니란다. 하지만 난 네가 좋아, 꽃잎아. 그러니 작은 것만 부탁할게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 91628aa0-2119-04e8-bb9a-472811a9c42d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Hag_Knows_ToldHagTadpole = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Hag_Knows_ToldHagTadpole = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:91628aa0-2119-04e8-bb9a-472811a9c42d
msgctxt "hb5dd0546g7820g4327ga749g3147ea0f8e08"
msgid "How do you know that?"
msgstr "그건 어떻게 알았지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 91b3925e-2009-e127-a2c2-fa3bdc4140da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedHag = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:91b3925e-2009-e127-a2c2-fa3bdc4140da
msgctxt "h051a810egef6dg45f7g9a31g5d70a4fb0463"
msgid "I'm glad you got here safely."
msgstr "이곳에 안전하게 도착하셔서 다행입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 92ed6344-3129-8f9e-446e-ba08fb13cdff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DUERGARDWARF(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:92ed6344-3129-8f9e-446e-ba08fb13cdff
msgctxt "hf937715ag2276g48cag8c49gdb061b219015"
msgid "My people took orders once. I'm not doing it again."
msgstr "나의 동족들은 한 번만 명령을 받는다. 그걸 두 번 하지는 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 93bf43cf-59a8-cdc6-f82c-f800031c0dfd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:93bf43cf-59a8-cdc6-f82c-f800031c0dfd
msgctxt "h9673c41aga3f3g44ecg802fg364d66e1499d"
msgid "That is my price. Nothing more, nothing less."
msgstr "그게 내가 바라는 대가야. 더도 말고, 덜도 말고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 99b26e16-1cbd-c58e-3d13-096848f58580
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:99b26e16-1cbd-c58e-3d13-096848f58580
msgctxt "hca50f743gc706g40b6ga1f0g65aff750ed48"
msgid "I'll take my chances on my own."
msgstr "내 스스로 기회를 찾겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 9a6481fb-528f-c22a-67db-4df8357ef5f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:9a6481fb-528f-c22a-67db-4df8357ef5f5
msgctxt "h32b806cbg121cg41a3gb875g26ce06e3aa01"
msgid "Another bard who thinks humour is the same as talent - cute."
msgstr "유머가 재능의 일부라고 생각하는 바드가 한 명 더 있었구먼. 귀여워라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 9a8d1a32-bac9-d436-6421-1955245e32a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAG_Hag_HasMet_Teahouse(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - HUMAN(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:9a8d1a32-bac9-d436-6421-1955245e32a3
msgctxt "h6389e4adg0d85g48d3gae16ga6530b647311"
msgid "Hello, sweetness."
msgstr "안녕, 이쁜아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9ac38ffc-cc67-16af-59c1-de1c92aec241
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 7f009f55-4d9c-e110-72f6-360479f6dfdd_HAG_Hagspawn_State_DidntTellMayrina = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - HUMAN(1) = True
#.   User:
#.      - HAG_Hagspawn_State_AskedAboutMayrina(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Hag_Knows_ToldHagTadpole = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:9ac38ffc-cc67-16af-59c1-de1c92aec241
msgctxt "haaeae356ga04dg4bedg9505g3dd3c80fd863"
msgid "Don't change the subject. Why is that woman really here?"
msgstr "말 돌리지 마. 저 여인은 왜 여기에 있는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 9af11ac5-2a55-7c39-3cf8-a0b77d46e9b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:9af11ac5-2a55-7c39-3cf8-a0b77d46e9b9
msgctxt "h52b1f44bg3d6eg4b14g8522g0c1cb2049304"
msgid "That wriggler in your head isn't going to get its damn self out, is it?"
msgstr "네 머릿속 벌레가 알아서 기어나오진 않을 것 아니니?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9bb3cdf6-c395-230d-2825-10a5b2877591
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:9bb3cdf6-c395-230d-2825-10a5b2877591
msgctxt "h84354821gb90dg4d0bg8d77g05e8b52d6056"
msgid "I appear to have forgotten my apology. How about a poem instead?"
msgstr "저의 사과를 잊어버린 것 같네요. 대신에 시 한편 어때요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 9e3cf7dd-8fb5-143d-4742-5e51ca975d0c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:9e3cf7dd-8fb5-143d-4742-5e51ca975d0c
msgctxt "hcb6cedc6g839dg4876g9e1bg8bfd92e7f900"
msgid "Hah! Oh, I do like the mouthy ones."
msgstr "하! 오, 나는 입이 험한 애가 좋더라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 9e90104a-6649-688e-f9d7-54c500290ffd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:9e90104a-6649-688e-f9d7-54c500290ffd
msgctxt "hed5058fcg1edcg41c9gb61fgaf8b4fc8025a"
msgid ""
"I was hoping you'd pay me a visit. You see, I do more than lotions and "
"potions."
msgstr "한번 들러줬으면 하고 있었어. 보다시피, 로션이나 물약만 취급하는 게 아니거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = 9f715f04-72b4-3ddc-b2a0-65209d64b412
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:9f715f04-72b4-3ddc-b2a0-65209d64b412
msgctxt "h09725dfag1da0g4024ga675gf03d414c6cfa"
msgid "I have many names, petal. But Auntie Ethel will do."
msgstr "나는 많은 이름을 갖고 있단다, 꽃잎아. 그냥 에텔 이모라고 부르렴."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = a07e8ac9-ae53-006c-9987-fee303996bfc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:a07e8ac9-ae53-006c-9987-fee303996bfc
msgctxt "hb8ed491bgd198g49dbg8bc9gbbcc083316fd"
msgid "...but I think you and I could have a bit of <i>fun</i> together."
msgstr "...우리 같이 <i>재미</i> 좀 볼 수 있을 것 같구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = a0c4c223-c4f0-9563-6d36-bafd2cc198ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:a0c4c223-c4f0-9563-6d36-bafd2cc198ea
msgctxt "hee740b82g8055g48eegbe76g4641cf8e4c4f"
msgid ""
"Hah! Bet you wouldn't say that to Vlaakith. You're nothing but a scared "
"child masquerading as a warrior."
msgstr "하! 블라키스에게도 그 말을 할 수 있을까. 너는 전사 흉내를 내는 겁먹은 아이일뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = a248b721-d234-aae0-889b-d81f616e0233
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC_BANE or PALADIN_BANE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:a248b721-d234-aae0-889b-d81f616e0233
msgctxt "h283e606ag2c16g4fcbg999bg82f20b7b2bc6"
msgid ""
"Bane, right? The <i>laziest</i> tyrant of all. He sits on his backside while "
"you lot run around doing all the work. Do you wipe his arse, too? Hah!"
msgstr ""
"베인 말이지? 폭군들 중에서도 가장 <i>게으른</i> 녀석. 너희들이 온갖 일을 도맡아서 하는 동안 놈은 주저앉아 빈둥대고 있겠지. "
"혹시 그 녀석 엉덩이도 닦아주냐? 하!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = aa870f4c-87ae-90b0-e0c5-3dba5210f614
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:aa870f4c-87ae-90b0-e0c5-3dba5210f614
msgctxt "h27829800g84b9g45e1ga4ccge66b1d4dfe15"
msgid ""
"Don't make me get the wooden spoon. You're eating for two, so get to it!"
msgstr "내가 나무 숟가락을 들게 하지 마. 두 사람을 위해 먹는 거니까, 빨리 먹어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = aad3de7a-707d-f21e-44b0-958825ff1d5b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:aad3de7a-707d-f21e-44b0-958825ff1d5b
msgctxt "hef750fe5gaab4g4bdbg8feage95c8fd66f37"
msgid "Feel free to relax yourself and have a cuppa, hm?"
msgstr "편하게 쉬고 있어. 차 한잔 어때, 괜찮지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = acf5a70f-3b9a-5a8e-7d00-d8d5f0bf21d4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:acf5a70f-3b9a-5a8e-7d00-d8d5f0bf21d4
msgctxt "hd42b876eg2c9dg48a1gb1e4g67e458562cc6"
msgid "Now, I can tell you're in dire need of help, petal."
msgstr "자, 너는 도움이 절실하다고 할 수 있어, 꽃잎아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = ad6e6d38-3c7e-bc43-e7cc-ac2ad1961770
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:ad6e6d38-3c7e-bc43-e7cc-ac2ad1961770
msgctxt "h9464199ag1067g48efg8655ge1ca50d8d851"
msgid ""
"Of course! As if I give a stuffing about what you are. Come in - come in."
msgstr "물론이지! 내가 당신이 누구인지에 대해 관심이 없는 것처럼. 들어와, 들어와."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ae152511-b241-817e-923d-5b168f073e87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DROWELF(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:ae152511-b241-817e-923d-5b168f073e87
msgctxt "h04bcd0f2g7173g42efgaa8fg676ff191fa5c"
msgid "Spare me your pleasantries. Are drow even welcome here?"
msgstr "형식적인 인사는 그만두지. 드로우도 여기서 환영 받나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = b0073335-da48-411d-fe5b-2531b47cc94b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:b0073335-da48-411d-fe5b-2531b47cc94b
msgctxt "hc9176acbg5b2dg4b4cg8befg7f1bf9e65c0c"
msgid ""
"I told you - the girl is none of your business. Keep that hole under your "
"nose <i>shut</i>."
msgstr "말했잖아. 이 여자애는 네가 상관할 바 아니라고. 코 밑에 있는 그 구멍 <i>다물고 있어</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = b07a1506-44b2-66bc-0172-ba41ca02e6b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:b07a1506-44b2-66bc-0172-ba41ca02e6b7
msgctxt "hd7e85807g242cg4a27gbc2fgd1c4cdb61071"
msgid ""
"As you wish - but should you change your mind, you know where to find me."
msgstr "마음대로 해. 마음이 바뀌면 다시 오렴."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = b14aa112-f5d8-68f5-451b-6c719d615abe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:b14aa112-f5d8-68f5-451b-6c719d615abe
msgctxt "habf58a93g2ed0g4b0dg95a2g557c74378fb1"
msgid "Glorious. One moment - Auntie needs her real nails for this."
msgstr "이리도 기쁠 수가. 잠깐만 - 이모가 이 일을 하려면 진짜 손톱이 필요하단다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b1f691b9-36f9-9bab-894c-29a5c6eaf3a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:b1f691b9-36f9-9bab-894c-29a5c6eaf3a9
msgctxt "hd6b384c0gab2fg4147g8378g7959a6b961da"
msgid "Yes. Get this damn parasite out of me."
msgstr "그래. 이 망할 기생충을 내보내줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = b356912f-a6c8-e772-a2de-de192904939f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:b356912f-a6c8-e772-a2de-de192904939f
msgctxt "h88abe2bdgb770g4fbdg9cd6geae90de8d11b"
msgid ""
"Should you know someone with two eyes in their head and a wriggler problem, "
"send them my way. Auntie will sort them out."
msgstr "두 눈이 머리에 붙어 있고 벌레 문제가 있는 사람을 안다면, 나한테 보내주렴. 이모가 해결해 줄테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = b3cfa3b5-7845-0475-6cd3-a672140ddbec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:b3cfa3b5-7845-0475-6cd3-a672140ddbec
msgctxt "h76393aa2g321eg4b43g9351gea0dee8ed25f"
msgid "And you, petal - well, you need a <i>lot</i> of help."
msgstr "그리고 꽃잎아, 너는 - 그래, <i>많은</i> 도움이 필요한 것 같구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = b53bd116-33c0-356e-5478-654ff880e923
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(7) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:b53bd116-33c0-356e-5478-654ff880e923
msgctxt "h945a08a7g8625g457cg903fg0d5beaf46bad"
msgid "Spill it. Mayrina deserves the truth."
msgstr "말해 줘. 메이리나는 진실을 알아야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b550ca1e-ffb0-079a-e7b6-240e97cb1ab3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WARLOCK(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:b550ca1e-ffb0-079a-e7b6-240e97cb1ab3
msgctxt "h79b6a6d6g73beg4241gb845g5c6369efe37a"
msgid "Such things are rarely done for free. What's the real bargain here?"
msgstr "그런 일을 공짜로 해주진 않을 테고. 진짜 대가가 뭐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b5edd079-6fc2-905d-cfcc-26f3416da4fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:b5edd079-6fc2-905d-cfcc-26f3416da4fb
msgctxt "h76dc916cg4127g453dg86e4g6a3c6d0d355b"
msgid "Who I am is not important."
msgstr "내가 누군지는 중요하지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = b67ffa37-a174-872f-3930-9548afe9b1a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:b67ffa37-a174-872f-3930-9548afe9b1a1
msgctxt "h0b51e4a8gf15dg4627ga3cagf7d04811472f"
msgid ""
"Aw, is it hard to see from up there on your high horse? If only you knew "
"some of the horrors your pretty little gods had committed..."
msgstr ""
"어머, 기고만장해서 눈에 뵈는 게 없는 거야? 작고 예쁜 너희 신들이 어떤 끔찍한 짓을 저질렀는지 네가 알면 그런 소리는 못할 텐데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = b6c7b2b9-bc48-6726-272f-d0b100af982e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(6) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:b6c7b2b9-bc48-6726-272f-d0b100af982e
msgctxt "hc0263247g8b58g4c99g9611g1cf3c0d8ed01"
msgid "Well, you heard the lady. We don't want things to get 'messy'."
msgstr "자, 숙녀분 말씀 들었겠지. 일이 '엉망'이 되는 건 좋지 않잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = b9a0cfca-9a0e-57e5-15b4-b764a1adba88
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:b9a0cfca-9a0e-57e5-15b4-b764a1adba88
msgctxt "ha9db8083gf384g4a73gb4f4g76bed196c767"
msgid ""
"A <i>devil</i>? Spare me. Blathering windbags in love with the sound of "
"their own voices."
msgstr "<i>데빌</i>이라고? 말도 마렴. 자기 목소리와 사랑에 빠져서 재잘거리는 수다쟁이들이잖니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = ba86c2f9-45d1-f90f-51b0-02a037e28565
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:ba86c2f9-45d1-f90f-51b0-02a037e28565
msgctxt "h90bb550cg708fg4b23gb826g2bf0896ccf50"
msgid ""
"That's because most people are afraid of their own bloody shadows. Not me, "
"though. Auntie Ethel welcomes <i>everyone</i>."
msgstr "그건 대부분의 사람들이 자기 자신의 저주받은 그림자를 두려워하기 때문이야. 나는 달라. 에텔 이모는 <i>모두</i>를 환영해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = bc64c159-3480-e928-bd23-5e7fbaccdbcc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:bc64c159-3480-e928-bd23-5e7fbaccdbcc
msgctxt "hcf93371bg9eb2g451dg81d0g6189d22451a3"
msgid "I'll talk about your wriggler - and that's it. Last warning."
msgstr "나는 너의 벌레에 관해 대화하고 싶구나. 난 여기까지만 말하겠어. 마지막 경고야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bd909606-d2e8-9f8c-9b46-fee9b4e2bf95
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_HagDouble_HasMet(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:bd909606-d2e8-9f8c-9b46-fee9b4e2bf95
msgctxt "he92e8462g950dg459bga8f7gd7bc1d863b64"
msgid "If you have this power, why didn't you remove it at the grove?"
msgstr "당신은 이 힘을 갖고 있으면서, 왜 숲에서 제거하지 않았죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = beba8be8-7d60-3cdf-faa8-fc98166a0a7b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:beba8be8-7d60-3cdf-faa8-fc98166a0a7b
msgctxt "hade786aag6a4fg44a9ga4e5g789e13f05d4f"
msgid ""
"You cheeky thing. Sutton Farm. North of Baldur's Gate. Check if you like."
msgstr "이 건방진 녀석. 서튼 농장에 있다. 발더스 게이트 북쪽에 있지. 원한다면 확인해 보렴."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = bf673714-383a-6b4c-574f-de094116ea65
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:bf673714-383a-6b4c-574f-de094116ea65
msgctxt "hf7b994aegdbf4g4fe7ga50dg644e617632d7"
msgid "Busybodies are not appreciated around here."
msgstr "이 주변에서 참견쟁이는 환영받지 못한단다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = c1cda477-a4ad-cdc7-4cc5-33b7c4bdd029
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_HagDouble_HasMet(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:c1cda477-a4ad-cdc7-4cc5-33b7c4bdd029
msgctxt "hef7a7925g30c5g48afg85fdg1dd4283ac662"
msgid ""
"Ah, if it isn't my favourite flower! Welcome to Auntie Ethel's. Come in - "
"come in!"
msgstr "아, 다른 사람도 아니고 내가 가장 좋아하는 꽃이구나! 에텔 이모네에 온걸 환영해. 들어와, 들어와!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = c45b8ae8-1f64-846d-9a7a-f18e38415059
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:c45b8ae8-1f64-846d-9a7a-f18e38415059
msgctxt "ha656a6a0gf8f3g4031g9dc6gd5614741334a"
msgid ""
"It must be an awful thing to have hanging over your head - or in it, rather. "
"Let me take care of that for you."
msgstr "그걸 머리에 달고 다니는 건 정말 끔찍한 일일 거야. 머리속에 들어 있던가, 아무튼. 어디 한번 살펴볼까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = c5165097-83c0-7c1e-c336-b721d527dbe7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:c5165097-83c0-7c1e-c336-b721d527dbe7
msgctxt "ha9b85697gd712g4ebfgb327gb8f67755c406"
msgid "You know what that sounds like to me? <i>Leverage.</i>"
msgstr "그 말을 들으니 무슨 생각이 드는지 알아? <i>약점.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = c536f95b-f8d2-d1cd-6a28-66852514b711
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:c536f95b-f8d2-d1cd-6a28-66852514b711
msgctxt "h0571488dgbb18g456cgbb27g44e2dae1db7e"
msgid ""
"Oh, petal. If you think your precious little god holds any power here, "
"you're in for a surprise."
msgstr "오, 꽃잎아. 너의 소중한 작은 신이 여기에 힘을 행사할 수 있다고 생각하면, 당황하게 될 게야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c71ec2df-4bb8-5710-e784-2dd8342c8fa1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:c71ec2df-4bb8-5710-e784-2dd8342c8fa1
msgctxt "he47e40cbg619eg4e4dg840bg596d9db641cb"
msgid "Gith apologise to no one."
msgstr "기스는 누구에게도 사과하지 않는다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c8669d6b-2bd9-932a-1221-d6c3bf03e1ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_State_FoundDeadBrother = True
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedHag = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:c8669d6b-2bd9-932a-1221-d6c3bf03e1ae
msgctxt "h038b99dfg2f72g4754g98b0g97e18d7ab9c9"
msgid "Auntie Ethel killed your brothers."
msgstr "에텔 이모가 네 오빠들을 죽였어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = c96fba6b-c088-35d2-2e8b-779cbc0d69f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(6) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:c96fba6b-c088-35d2-2e8b-779cbc0d69f7
msgctxt "h4360a52eg0828g49fcg8ae4g8d3ef71b17e8"
msgid "Let's not make trouble for some stranger. We have our own problems."
msgstr "낯선 사람을 곤란하게 만들진 말자. 우리에겐 우리만의 문제가 있잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ca9c41f2-a98b-b10b-5023-05c926b67f1c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_State_FoundDeadBrother = False
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_State_FoundUnconsciousBrother = True
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedHag = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:ca9c41f2-a98b-b10b-5023-05c926b67f1c
msgctxt "h48e427e7gaac0g4befg8a7bg6763bfbe7f5d"
msgid ""
"I fought your brothers, but I didn't kill them - I only knocked them out."
msgstr "너의 오빠들과 싸웠지만 죽이지는 않았어. 기절 시켰을 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = cc3baab4-1aab-9d57-9422-31991f89cb06
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:cc3baab4-1aab-9d57-9422-31991f89cb06
msgctxt "h7ef39c3agf849g4b3fg851ag604a2f9861b5"
msgid "Quicker than you can say 'Yes, Auntie.'"
msgstr "'네, 이모'라고 하는 것보다 빠르구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = cdd718d0-1851-fe64-c063-ec3db538ccf2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:cdd718d0-1851-fe64-c063-ec3db538ccf2
msgctxt "hb266c7dbg2f86g4360gb8e7g14f751ee41df"
msgid ""
"I'm inclined to agree. Let's not involve ourselves in this place any more "
"than necessary."
msgstr "나도 동의해. 필요 이상으로 이곳에 관련되진 말자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = ce2aac00-9eda-3bc0-fd6d-1b6621cdc697
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:ce2aac00-9eda-3bc0-fd6d-1b6621cdc697
msgctxt "h674b52d3g0da2g49eegafbagc846488e2757"
msgid ""
"I can tell you're almost done cooking. You know you could turn - just like "
"that."
msgstr "네 경우엔 <i>요리</i>가 거의 다 된것 같구나. 네가 언제라도 변해버릴 수 있다는 걸 알잖니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = ce5e619c-f926-1a51-2267-f8f3cd82c6d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_HagDouble_HasMet(2) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Hag_Knows_ToldHagTadpole = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:ce5e619c-f926-1a51-2267-f8f3cd82c6d2
msgctxt "h383509e4g7b95g452fg9b52gf1418eff0d2a"
msgid ""
"Now, about what you told me in the grove - your little wriggler problem."
msgstr "자, 숲에서 나에게 말했던 너의 작은 벌레 문제 말인데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = ce879580-e84b-91ff-fd14-c9f0eb26ec67
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:ce879580-e84b-91ff-fd14-c9f0eb26ec67
msgctxt "hf7eb35a5g3ce4g4d67g91e5g14d514a8fb1f"
msgid "One of your pretty little peepers."
msgstr "너의 귀엽고 작은 눈 하나 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = d06ac1b3-8c6b-448e-9b6b-8a9697817fee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAG_Hagspawn_State_LiedAboutBrothersDeath(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:d06ac1b3-8c6b-448e-9b6b-8a9697817fee
msgctxt "h78fd37b9gf531g4b80gacc3g6e997719e457"
msgid ""
"Hah! You want to play it like that? Fine. Yes, girl - <i>I</i> killed your "
"brothers."
msgstr "하! 그런 식으로 놀겠다는 거지? 좋아. 그래, 얘야 - <i>내가</i> 네 오빠들을 죽였다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d22b2901-fbd0-aa30-4f5b-0be96330949e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(2) = True
#.      - BERSERKER(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:d22b2901-fbd0-aa30-4f5b-0be96330949e
msgctxt "hcd0181bag2260g4532g85c8gf0eb1fbbad68"
msgid "Or what?"
msgstr "싫다면?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = d24e66ef-ff04-2b5d-3877-4c0359506d72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:d24e66ef-ff04-2b5d-3877-4c0359506d72
msgctxt "h7695ce4cg3648g47d7g835cgde004d26b3ee"
msgid "And you - my door is always open, petal. Auntie Ethel is here for you."
msgstr "그리고 내 문은 언제나 열려 있단다, 꽃잎아. 에텔 이모가 이곳에서 너를 맞이할게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Mayrina
#. NodeID = d3e8f55f-6e9b-dd80-ce32-5beaf82257a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAG_Hagspawn_State_KnowsBrothersDead = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - HAG_HagSpawn.ToldMayrinaBrotherDead(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:d3e8f55f-6e9b-dd80-ce32-5beaf82257a8
msgctxt "ha2331243g4ec7g442dgacb1g61fb4cdeca3c"
msgid "What? NO."
msgstr "뭐? 안 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = d77a26dd-bb36-3b0e-3deb-191b98537588
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - HAG_Hag_Event_HostileToPlayersAfterDialog(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:d77a26dd-bb36-3b0e-3deb-191b98537588
msgctxt "h8bdc8016g7696g48b0gb3d8ge92ba7b3f457"
msgid "You absolute <i>eejit</i>."
msgstr "이런 순 <i>멍청이</i> 같으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d88544dc-98bd-45a8-83e7-319981297dc5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:d88544dc-98bd-45a8-83e7-319981297dc5
msgctxt "h2b3f3de1g51fdg4af0g97fbg8f313f7d24c1"
msgid "Fine. Can you remove the parasite?"
msgstr "좋아. 기생충을 없앨 수 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dbb7402f-6e41-6393-9a7a-a7350741cf9b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:dbb7402f-6e41-6393-9a7a-a7350741cf9b
msgctxt "hc14bd1dfg099ag4c97g9149g48dfd33ca9f1"
msgid "I don't think I'm the one who is upsetting her."
msgstr "그녀를 흥분시키는 건 내가 아니라고 생각됩니다만."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = dc554e3c-7842-7a1c-d2b4-611a148f0273
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:dc554e3c-7842-7a1c-d2b4-611a148f0273
msgctxt "hb0223907g2b43g4e75gb60eg7d300274632f"
msgid ""
"Of course! Ah, I'd lose my head if it wasn't attached to me. Now, I must "
"confess - I told a bit of a white lie."
msgstr "물론이지! 아, 정신이 없어서 깜빡했는데 말이야. 실은, 고백할 게 있는데 선의의 거짓말을 조금 했었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = dcc64314-666d-73fc-9b5b-be99e34021c7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:dcc64314-666d-73fc-9b5b-be99e34021c7
msgctxt "h91c9dbc7gb7cdg490fga50dg1c5f526adbf9"
msgid "I said I had something at home that could help. Well, that something..."
msgstr "내가 도움이 될 만한 무언가가 집에 있다고 했지. 그게 말이야..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = dd17f984-b8ba-4d6a-d94f-9dbbf4e984c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:dd17f984-b8ba-4d6a-d94f-9dbbf4e984c8
msgctxt "h5c21e98bg099fg43d0g89d7gbd03f814648a"
msgid "Cute and secretive? You're too much, petal."
msgstr "귀엽고 비밀스러워? 너무해, 꽃잎아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dd2a37c6-1b45-dbe7-67d9-9e35280e8590
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - HAG_Hagspawn_State_AskedAboutMayrina(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:dd2a37c6-1b45-dbe7-67d9-9e35280e8590
msgctxt "hc1462753gc21ag4265g817eg0f8c4333de35"
msgid "Answer the question: where are her brothers?"
msgstr "질문에 대답해. 그녀의 오빠들은 어디 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = de24f21e-c196-c75b-911f-fe58ff116451
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:de24f21e-c196-c75b-911f-fe58ff116451
msgctxt "ha93d7d7dga5f3g4a6cgb2b0g0d4a0678e3bb"
msgid "No, petal. You haven't."
msgstr "아니, 꽃잎아. 그러진 않았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = e20d462f-c4fc-0aed-962f-497c2d7ebd28
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:e20d462f-c4fc-0aed-962f-497c2d7ebd28
msgctxt "h228f5b7dgf8adg4babga2aeg1967dc1593c9"
msgid ""
"Hah! Good luck with that. But don't you fret, petal - I'm sure you'll make a "
"very pretty mind flayer."
msgstr "하! 행운을 빌게. 그런데 초조해 하지 마, 꽃잎아. 넌 매우 멋진 마인드 플레이어가 될 거라 확신해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = e26c9bc7-bd04-dcae-5e16-cc178ffe6ac1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.      - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Hag.LearnedEyeCost(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - ONEEYED(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:e26c9bc7-bd04-dcae-5e16-cc178ffe6ac1
msgctxt "h7a3f8901gf149g4240gbda7g4646a5d9e8f9"
msgid "I'm still waiting for someone with a spare eye..."
msgstr "나는 여전히 눈을 내줄 사람을 기다리고 있단다..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = e3b7736c-9b9e-1d04-bc50-c4169aa502fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - HAG_Hag_Event_HostileToPlayersAfterDialog(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:e3b7736c-9b9e-1d04-bc50-c4169aa502fe
msgctxt "h0b4cbc3eg84d8g4d4fg8d7dg471f66d551a0"
msgid "And <i>you</i> - you'll regret sticking your nose in my business."
msgstr "그리고 <i>너</i> - 내 일에 참견한 것을 후회하게 될 게다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = e5f0b5dc-2c33-23b9-971a-8c4fc95156e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(5) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:e5f0b5dc-2c33-23b9-971a-8c4fc95156e0
msgctxt "h734b41b8g7078g423agbee3g8136e793f18d"
msgid "I don't like this. What's <i>really </i>going on here?"
msgstr "나는 이런 상황을 좋아하지 않아. <i>실제로</i> 여기서 뭐가 벌어지고 있는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e60fc217-f2b8-5c0e-0520-9d43912362f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Hag_Knows_ToldHagTadpole = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:e60fc217-f2b8-5c0e-0520-9d43912362f6
msgctxt "h777fffe7g6b59g4bd4gb9a3g28ba4c018138"
msgid "I'm dealing with it."
msgstr "난 그걸 다루고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = e8e468af-5ea0-f2b4-7b7c-b0287f0da1b0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Hag_Knows_ToldHagTadpole = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:e8e468af-5ea0-f2b4-7b7c-b0287f0da1b0
msgctxt "hd8007376g0806g42feg9f8cga373951358bc"
msgid "Now, about that wriggler of yours."
msgstr "자, 네 머리속 그 벌레 말인데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eb19ec86-5fd6-b013-3279-19a10ec89b7f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_HagDouble_HasMet(2) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedBrothers = False
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedNone = False
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedHag = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:eb19ec86-5fd6-b013-3279-19a10ec89b7f
msgctxt "h04d91cf7gde72g4665ga8b8g6c161ea993c2"
msgid "We missed out on introductions. Who are you?"
msgstr "소개를 까먹었군요. 당신은 누구죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = ebe42087-55e9-c12e-2d81-f20344a519af
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:ebe42087-55e9-c12e-2d81-f20344a519af
msgctxt "h1e435216gf2eeg4da2g9fddg41fc8997f0d4"
msgid "You see, I help people from all over Faerûn."
msgstr "나는 페이룬 전역에서 온 사람들을 도와준단다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ec101cd9-90b8-a52d-3802-8d157eb981f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:ec101cd9-90b8-a52d-3802-8d157eb981f6
msgctxt "h2bdef576ge64cg4c77g8839gad8cf14c4e37"
msgid "I prefer to keep a low profile."
msgstr "저는 눈에 띄지 않는 것을 선호합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = ec99121c-b994-4abf-0cd0-c6ef55a16dd2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:ec99121c-b994-4abf-0cd0-c6ef55a16dd2
msgctxt "ha6345e76g125eg4c9egb774g6ae74b9c1355"
msgid ""
"Because you <i>stink</i>. And I know the stench of mind flayer anywhere."
msgstr "너에게 <i>악취</i>가 나기 때문이지. 내가 마인드 플레이어 놈들 냄새라면 바로 알아보거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ed0c4dec-24f4-9ec8-6622-2a6432cc6079
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_Hag_State_TeleportSurrogateMotherToLair = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:ed0c4dec-24f4-9ec8-6622-2a6432cc6079
msgctxt "h838f4a9agfaa6g420egac5fg9424979b929c"
msgid "What happened to Mayrina? Did you do something to her?"
msgstr "메이리나는 어떻게 됐지? 그녀에게 무슨 짓을 한 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = eeff707e-68a3-b93a-4001-cacb709808b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(8) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(8) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:eeff707e-68a3-b93a-4001-cacb709808b3
msgctxt "hdac6f3d3gd5abg4371gb9e2g8cc737b0dde0"
msgid ""
"She's a pregnant lady in distress. We can't just stand by and pretend she's "
"not here."
msgstr "위험에 처한 임산부야. 그녀가 여기 없는 것마냥 가만히 있을 수는 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = f09c9bd4-e035-c600-034e-8a9e295c1e84
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:f09c9bd4-e035-c600-034e-8a9e295c1e84
msgctxt "hd8c7372eg4302g40f2g9a62g584639c0fdcf"
msgid ""
"All they left was a message, which I passed on, didn't I? Don't be stressing."
msgstr "그들이 남긴 건 소식뿐이었단다, 그건 전하지 않았니? 투정하지 말렴."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f1dfe72b-ccbe-5cd2-c7b7-aad691c3fc64
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: (CLERIC_EVIL or PALADIN_EVIL) and !REALLY_PLANAR
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:f1dfe72b-ccbe-5cd2-c7b7-aad691c3fc64
msgctxt "h0d90c838gfb5bg41e8g9779g77d458f6f470"
msgid "You don't scare me. I serve someone far more terrifying."
msgstr "난 네가 전혀 두렵지 않아. 난 더욱 무시무시한 분을 섬기거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f297676e-cb4f-2d05-8e3d-bc9463a885fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Hag_Knows_ToldHagTadpole = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Hag_Knows_ToldHagTadpole = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:f297676e-cb4f-2d05-8e3d-bc9463a885fd
msgctxt "ha46e7952g2994g4ec9g85bege7f3b8bcf641"
msgid "That's none of your concern."
msgstr "그건 당신이 신경쓸 바 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = f72bac63-f688-bc20-f762-70c0aeb4b6ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAG_Hag_State_TeleportSurrogateMotherToLair = True
#.     - HAG_Hagspawn_State_SkipAD = True
#.     - HAG_Hagspawn_State_InitialSceneDone = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:f72bac63-f688-bc20-f762-70c0aeb4b6ec
msgctxt "h2bbfe357gefaeg4ddeg8b31g115600bf96f8"
msgid "Enough. Away with you."
msgstr "그만. 들어가 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = f7fb46c7-3ae5-51c2-8323-802818180b37
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:f7fb46c7-3ae5-51c2-8323-802818180b37
msgctxt "hd84e52f9g5fcdg4fa3ga44ag362cc25e5c30"
msgid ""
"Hah! Not many know that spell. You're close, but not <i>quite</i> right."
msgstr "하! 그 주문을 아는 사람은 드문데. 꽤 비슷했지만, <i>정확하지는</i> 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = f8775099-3cc9-e987-98b1-f2bb8d71a37c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC_BHAAL or PALADIN_BHAAL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:f8775099-3cc9-e987-98b1-f2bb8d71a37c
msgctxt "ha6c7bfdcg8398g46e9gaa17g3ec4de5355a9"
msgid ""
"Bhaal, right? He'll not bother us. He's far too busy using blood as "
"fingerpaint and taking credit for other people's kills."
msgstr "바알 말이지? 그놈은 우릴 방해할 일 없어. 피로 손가락 그림이나 그리고 다른 놈들 살인의 공로를 가로채느라 바쁘거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f97dddc3-01cb-0cc0-07a9-0fba8a10bc42
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_HagTrader_State_AttackedHag(2) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedBrothers = False
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedNone = False
#.      - HAG_HagAmbush_Quest_Confrontation_PlayerSidedHag = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:f97dddc3-01cb-0cc0-07a9-0fba8a10bc42
msgctxt "h7b9f12c7g4fc7g4102g9b6dg7a294340e2e6"
msgid "I'm sorry. I shouldn't have raised a hand against you."
msgstr "미안합니다. 당신에게 대들지 말았어야 했는데 말이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = fa33ba02-dd01-e9b0-5dda-777c710f666d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:fa33ba02-dd01-e9b0-5dda-777c710f666d
msgctxt "h9e85c868g59f5g4349gad84gbc9d55cd112f"
msgid "But you'd look so good on your knees."
msgstr "그러나 너는 무릎을 끓는 게 좋아 보이겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene
#. Speaker = Auntie Ethel
#. NodeID = fc558ad2-8fcf-a16f-8507-4c6eec218178
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_Hagspawn_StartScene:fc558ad2-8fcf-a16f-8507-4c6eec218178
msgctxt "h054ee299g3078g4d12gb810g1cd1545b1e34"
msgid ""
"A touch. But sure you've two eyes in your skull, don't you? No need to be "
"precious."
msgstr "살짝. 하지만 네 머리에 두 눈이 있는 건 확실하지 않니? 소중하게 생각할 필요 없어."

