msgctxt "hb79b2894g255ag4c74gbd8cgcbd3f99a52a3"
msgid ""
"A fine sword and hat. And a fine adventurer at the bottom of the swamp, no "
"doubt."
msgstr "근사한 검과 투구라. 분명히 늪바닥엔 근사한 모험가도 있겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_SwampExploration_PAD_HeroGear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d4bec9c0-ae72-e42b-bae8-278feadf8b2a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_SwampedHero_InvestigateCheckSuccess = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_SwampExploration_PAD_HeroGear:d4bec9c0-ae72-e42b-bae8-278feadf8b2a
msgctxt "hd494e564g79f2g4102g97c0gc32720e98e22"
msgid ""
"That's a rather jaunty hat lying in the mud there - and a sword too. Someone "
"must have been in quite the hurry to get out of this swamp.\n"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_SwampExploration_PAD_HeroGear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d4bec9c0-ae72-e42b-bae8-278feadf8b2a
