msgctxt "h2f298451ga3c6g45eag86e2gc889decd02f8"
msgid "Nice sword. Jaunty hat. Karlach like."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_SwampExploration_PAD_HeroGear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d4bec9c0-ae72-e42b-bae8-278feadf8b2a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_SwampedHero_InvestigateCheckSuccess = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_SwampExploration_PAD_HeroGear:d4bec9c0-ae72-e42b-bae8-278feadf8b2a
msgctxt "ha4230436ge6d8g4bd5ga460g09595483f70a"
msgid "A fine enough sword. I presume the swamp has long swallowed its owner."
msgstr "꽤 괜찮은 검이군. 주인은 늪지에 빠진 지 오래 된 것 같고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_SwampExploration_PAD_HeroGear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d4bec9c0-ae72-e42b-bae8-278feadf8b2a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_SwampedHero_InvestigateCheckSuccess = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_SwampExploration_PAD_HeroGear:d4bec9c0-ae72-e42b-bae8-278feadf8b2a
msgctxt "hb5158292g1cb9g4e09g8caeg62ae620a165f"
msgid ""
"Rather fine blade and hat. Left behind by some unfortunate adventure-seeker, "
"perhaps.\n"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_SwampExploration_PAD_HeroGear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d4bec9c0-ae72-e42b-bae8-278feadf8b2a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_SwampedHero_InvestigateCheckSuccess = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_SwampExploration_PAD_HeroGear:d4bec9c0-ae72-e42b-bae8-278feadf8b2a
msgctxt "h389a4aa7g6b16g4f7dga400g506e200d6359"
msgid ""
"Nice hat. Decent sword. Looks like someone's epic adventure took a turn for "
"the worse."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_SwampExploration_PAD_HeroGear
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d4bec9c0-ae72-e42b-bae8-278feadf8b2a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_SwampedHero_InvestigateCheckSuccess = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_SwampExploration_PAD_HeroGear:d4bec9c0-ae72-e42b-bae8-278feadf8b2a
msgctxt "h1aa9404eg9b60g4383g82bag205d14d2492a"
msgid "Sword and a hat. Wonder whose."
msgstr "검과 모자군. 누구 것일까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Swamp/HAG_SwampExploration_PAD_PrickedFinger
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = efb82b54-7591-ee2c-72fd-591b9e7e7bc5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
