msgid ""
"The forge is not working as it should. I must be missing some crucial "
"ingredient."
msgstr "대장간이 설계 의도대로 작동하지 않아. 중요한 재료를 빼먹은 게 분명해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineForge_PAD_ForgingIncomplete
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9f1df3e0-76fe-b5d4-ee81-3b13d33a9b2d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
