#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineForge_PAD_UsedForge:427fd5cb-e922-4b5f-b612-e60255344939
msgctxt "h9071ac5dg1fc4g4c56gb27fg05fee9ac11b8"
msgid "There's an opening in the device - a perfect match for that mould."
msgstr "장치에 홈이 있군, 주형이 딱 들어맞겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineForge_PAD_UsedForge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 427fd5cb-e922-4b5f-b612-e60255344939
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_AdamantineForge_Knows_PickedUpMold = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineForge_PAD_UsedForge:427fd5cb-e922-4b5f-b612-e60255344939
msgctxt "h9c5cf675g7af0g4880g878bg86643798c448"
msgid "That mould should slot in here."
msgstr "주형이 여기 들어가겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineForge_PAD_UsedForge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 427fd5cb-e922-4b5f-b612-e60255344939
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_AdamantineForge_Knows_PickedUpMold = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineForge_PAD_UsedForge:427fd5cb-e922-4b5f-b612-e60255344939
msgctxt "ha47bf6cdgeb75g4e2ag942eg816cfcf03ff5"
msgid "There's an opening here. Looks like I found a home for that mould."
msgstr "여기 홈이 있어. 주형을 넣는 곳인 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineForge_PAD_UsedForge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 427fd5cb-e922-4b5f-b612-e60255344939
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_AdamantineForge_Knows_PickedUpMold = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineForge_PAD_UsedForge:427fd5cb-e922-4b5f-b612-e60255344939
msgctxt "hc08dd9e9gef6fg443dgb518g90a9323699e9"
msgid "An opening in the metal. That mould should fit perfectly."
msgstr "쇠 사이에 공간이 있어. 주형이 딱 들어맞겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineForge_PAD_UsedForge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a7a40488-ef52-7749-c1bb-8266e28164a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_AdamantineForge_Knows_PickedUpMold = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineForge_PAD_UsedForge:a7a40488-ef52-7749-c1bb-8266e28164a5
msgctxt "hd976f070gac38g4897gb7feg6891003d5ea4"
msgid ""
"There's a gap here. Could fit a mould or - I don't know, some other "
"blacksmithery?"
msgstr "여기 빈 공간이 있어. 주형이나, 뭔가 대장간과 관련된 것이 들어가는 곳인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineForge_PAD_UsedForge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a7a40488-ef52-7749-c1bb-8266e28164a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_AdamantineForge_Knows_PickedUpMold = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineForge_PAD_UsedForge:a7a40488-ef52-7749-c1bb-8266e28164a5
msgctxt "h1c980a41g5de1g4a50gb2ccg26c1df01e301"
msgid "There's an aperture in the metal's surface. For a mould, I imagine..."
msgstr "쇠의 표면에 홈이 있어. 주형을 위한 공간이겠군..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineForge_PAD_UsedForge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a7a40488-ef52-7749-c1bb-8266e28164a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_AdamantineForge_Knows_PickedUpMold = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineForge_PAD_UsedForge:a7a40488-ef52-7749-c1bb-8266e28164a5
msgctxt "h4ea398e7g7ca0g46c1ga659g0fda51788eb3"
msgid "I spot an opening. A mould for the forge."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineForge_PAD_UsedForge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a7a40488-ef52-7749-c1bb-8266e28164a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_AdamantineForge_Knows_PickedUpMold = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineForge_PAD_UsedForge:a7a40488-ef52-7749-c1bb-8266e28164a5
msgctxt "ha1c46ba9g093bg47e4g8f2cg127a78d75543"
msgid "There's an opening here. For this forge to work, I'll need a mould."
msgstr "여기 홈이 있어. 이 대장간을 작동시키려면, 주형이 필요하겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineForge_PAD_UsedForge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a7a40488-ef52-7749-c1bb-8266e28164a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_AdamantineForge_Knows_PickedUpMold = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineForge_PAD_UsedForge:a7a40488-ef52-7749-c1bb-8266e28164a5
msgctxt "h964e81f9g7316g4274gb51fgf33351e5b948"
msgid "Something missing here. A mould, I'd wager."
msgstr "뭔가 비어있어. 아마 주형이겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineForge_PAD_UsedForge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a7a40488-ef52-7749-c1bb-8266e28164a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_AdamantineForge_Knows_PickedUpMold = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineForge_PAD_UsedForge:a7a40488-ef52-7749-c1bb-8266e28164a5
msgctxt "he964ef48g30f3g4a43gada0g9ac301fbd552"
msgid ""
"There's a place for a mould here. I'll need one If I want to forge something."
msgstr "여기 주형을 위한 공간이 있어. 뭔가를 재련하려면 필요하겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineForge_PAD_UsedForge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a7a40488-ef52-7749-c1bb-8266e28164a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_AdamantineForge_Knows_PickedUpMold = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineForge_PAD_UsedForge:a7a40488-ef52-7749-c1bb-8266e28164a5
msgctxt "h0605e233g786fg48f9g8609g866a66a53c9b"
msgid "Something's missing. I'll need a mould to get this thing running."
msgstr "뭔가 비어있어. 이걸 작동시키려면 주형이 필요해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_HammerFail
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 45e0cf13-7d25-46f7-b043-a3abed85c837
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_HammerFail:45e0cf13-7d25-46f7-b043-a3abed85c837
msgctxt "h1867026bgd49bg4601ga874g6a811c00fc1d"
msgid "It barely tickled him! What am I missing?"
msgstr "흠집도 안 나잖아! 뭐가 빠진 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_HammerFail
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 45e0cf13-7d25-46f7-b043-a3abed85c837
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_HammerFail:45e0cf13-7d25-46f7-b043-a3abed85c837
msgctxt "ha27da489g36edg4e42g9d0ag3720f0747b1b"
msgid "This blasted hammer has no effect! But it has to - somehow!"
msgstr "이 망할 망치가 아무 효과도 없다니! 그래도, 분명 어떻게든 통할 방법이 있을 거야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_HammerFail
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 45e0cf13-7d25-46f7-b043-a3abed85c837
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_HammerFail:45e0cf13-7d25-46f7-b043-a3abed85c837
msgctxt "h6d4337daga626g4e6bgb0b0gd24dfc0f960d"
msgid "It barely touched him! What am I missing?!"
msgstr "안 통하는데! 뭔가 빼먹은 건가?!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_HammerFail
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 45e0cf13-7d25-46f7-b043-a3abed85c837
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_HammerFail:45e0cf13-7d25-46f7-b043-a3abed85c837
msgctxt "h80b93ac2gbc8cg4af7ga4d5g2a9b0ef4aa98"
msgid "The hammer's done <i>nothing</i>? <i>Tsk'va</i> - there must be a way!"
msgstr "망치가 <i>아무런</i> 효과도 없다고? <i>츠크바</i> - 분명 통할 방법이 있을 거야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_HammerFail
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 45e0cf13-7d25-46f7-b043-a3abed85c837
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_HammerFail:45e0cf13-7d25-46f7-b043-a3abed85c837
msgctxt "hbdf1e793g5593g421bgae57gdfc4c6b7a846"
msgid "I might as well be wielding a feather! What's wrong with this thing?"
msgstr "깃털로 때리는 것도 아니고! 대체 뭐가 문제야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_HammerFail
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 45e0cf13-7d25-46f7-b043-a3abed85c837
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_HammerFail:45e0cf13-7d25-46f7-b043-a3abed85c837
msgctxt "h884a1461g2469g420ega18bg0dd7724664c8"
msgid "Hardly dented the thing! Think, damn it, think..."
msgstr "찌그러지지도 않는 걸! 생각해라, 방법을 생각해..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_HammerFail
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 45e0cf13-7d25-46f7-b043-a3abed85c837
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_HammerFail:45e0cf13-7d25-46f7-b043-a3abed85c837
msgctxt "hd9af5116gd34dg44cdgb2c3g52ae17d7b16e"
msgid "Hells - not a lick of damage! What am I missing?"
msgstr "망할, 피해가 전혀 없잖아! 뭐가 더 필요한 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_HammerHit
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0b2966c8-4195-4c39-a2d2-542050b597b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_HammerHit:0b2966c8-4195-4c39-a2d2-542050b597b8
msgctxt "haa92cec0gbc05g479fgb09agacd86e52a0ba"
msgid "Yes! You felt that, didn't you, you stupid lump?"
msgstr "그래! 너도 느꼈잖아, 이 멍청아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_HammerHit
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0b2966c8-4195-4c39-a2d2-542050b597b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_HammerHit:0b2966c8-4195-4c39-a2d2-542050b597b8
msgctxt "h475cc6b6gc0aag4606gaeaegab2a5ebf78f8"
msgid "Ha! That'll knock the wind out of it!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_HammerHit
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0b2966c8-4195-4c39-a2d2-542050b597b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_HammerHit:0b2966c8-4195-4c39-a2d2-542050b597b8
msgctxt "h65fddb41gd799g438cg8f08gdfd952527c79"
msgid "Yes! Now we're cooking."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_HammerHit
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0b2966c8-4195-4c39-a2d2-542050b597b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_HammerHit:0b2966c8-4195-4c39-a2d2-542050b597b8
msgctxt "h5dedf338gcccag4d8agbdc2gaf49c4f5ea70"
msgid "There it is - a perfect strike!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_HammerHit
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0b2966c8-4195-4c39-a2d2-542050b597b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_HammerHit:0b2966c8-4195-4c39-a2d2-542050b597b8
msgctxt "hf0c83409g6e50g4faag8c07ge9936d5d6ade"
msgid "Yes! You felt that one, didn't you?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_HammerHit
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0b2966c8-4195-4c39-a2d2-542050b597b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_HammerHit:0b2966c8-4195-4c39-a2d2-542050b597b8
msgctxt "hfa372d54gd437g4ddfgb9e3g36292425f492"
msgid "And... boom! Take that, you hunk of junk!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_HammerHit
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0b2966c8-4195-4c39-a2d2-542050b597b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_HammerHit:0b2966c8-4195-4c39-a2d2-542050b597b8
msgctxt "h1c19fdfeg6bbeg4b16gb965gf00e0b68b260"
msgid "Damn - by the Nine Hells, it worked!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_Mephits
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b642b703-25ea-4f46-98eb-fe5fa2b4ad24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_Mephits:b642b703-25ea-4f46-98eb-fe5fa2b4ad24
msgctxt "he23ce25bgc6e0g4353ga349ga9e3492866cb"
msgid "Oh, there are mephits now too? Wonderful! Why not?"
msgstr "오, 이제 메피트도 덤비는 건가? 완벽하군! 안될 거 뭐 있어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_Mephits
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b642b703-25ea-4f46-98eb-fe5fa2b4ad24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_Mephits:b642b703-25ea-4f46-98eb-fe5fa2b4ad24
msgctxt "h989fc571gaa5cg4663gbec6g70ab4646ec9c"
msgid "Mephits! Now it really is a party."
msgstr "메피트야! 이게 진짜 파티지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_Mephits
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b642b703-25ea-4f46-98eb-fe5fa2b4ad24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_Mephits:b642b703-25ea-4f46-98eb-fe5fa2b4ad24
msgctxt "hec9d361dg22b2g4b1bgba0bg231c07cf0a99"
msgid "Mephits. I know how to handle the likes of you."
msgstr "메피트라. 너네 같은 족속들을 어떻게 다루는지 알고 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_Mephits
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b642b703-25ea-4f46-98eb-fe5fa2b4ad24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_Mephits:b642b703-25ea-4f46-98eb-fe5fa2b4ad24
msgctxt "h13e00e74g974cg48f6g8680g02fb273dfead"
msgid "Mephits. Send them back to the Hells!"
msgstr "메피트야. 놈들을 지옥으로 돌려보내자!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_Mephits
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b642b703-25ea-4f46-98eb-fe5fa2b4ad24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_Mephits:b642b703-25ea-4f46-98eb-fe5fa2b4ad24
msgctxt "hf11efed4g13a0g4183gb7f7g5ddd5453fb0c"
msgid "Hells. Anything else going to join in? A dragon? Some spiders maybe?"
msgstr "망할. 또 덤빌 놈들이 남았나? 드래곤? 아니면 거미?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_Mephits
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b642b703-25ea-4f46-98eb-fe5fa2b4ad24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_Mephits:b642b703-25ea-4f46-98eb-fe5fa2b4ad24
msgctxt "hbc67bc39g4952g485eg8e81g323e1cc67a32"
msgid "Do you mind, you damned mephits? I'm a bit busy!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_Mephits
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b642b703-25ea-4f46-98eb-fe5fa2b4ad24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_Mephits:b642b703-25ea-4f46-98eb-fe5fa2b4ad24
msgctxt "h6880a882g5214g41e8g8b2eg526820ec1336"
msgid "Mephits? As if my hands weren't full already!"
msgstr "메피트라니? 이미 힘들어 죽겠는데!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_Victory
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c545a681-8007-4d3f-adc8-276b155cf638
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_Victory:c545a681-8007-4d3f-adc8-276b155cf638
msgctxt "hd7f1e94ag938eg460bg9290g8376e9787ce9"
msgid "Ha! Take that, you stupid, clunking... whatever you are."
msgstr "하! 받아라, 이 멍청한, 덜컹거리는... 뭔지 모르겠는 자식."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_Victory
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c545a681-8007-4d3f-adc8-276b155cf638
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_Victory:c545a681-8007-4d3f-adc8-276b155cf638
msgctxt "hcc7fe2abg9340g4f15g81a1g06d07e58b4ba"
msgid "It's done... It's dead... Good gods, never again!"
msgstr "끝났어... 죽었어... 신이시여, 다시는 이런 일이 없기를!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_Victory
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c545a681-8007-4d3f-adc8-276b155cf638
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_Victory:c545a681-8007-4d3f-adc8-276b155cf638
msgctxt "hf76929eagb907g44b3g9a7bgb2c3b23d33d9"
msgid "There. It's done<i>. Good.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_Victory
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c545a681-8007-4d3f-adc8-276b155cf638
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_Victory:c545a681-8007-4d3f-adc8-276b155cf638
msgctxt "hd00358e1gc73ag48b2g81f5g8b539c6cb930"
msgid "<i>Vlaakith tavki na'zin. </i>Conquest is mine!"
msgstr "<i>블라키스 타브키 나진. </i>정복은 나의 것이다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_Victory
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c545a681-8007-4d3f-adc8-276b155cf638
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_Victory:c545a681-8007-4d3f-adc8-276b155cf638
msgctxt "h01c41af3gaee5g401dg91c2g521c166456be"
msgid "It's done for - and not a moment too soon."
msgstr "끝났군, 너무 늦기 전에 해치웠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_Victory
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c545a681-8007-4d3f-adc8-276b155cf638
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_Victory:c545a681-8007-4d3f-adc8-276b155cf638
msgctxt "h9ef1583bg15cbg4c54gb46egac7654a7bb06"
msgid "Let the tale be told - we are victorious!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_Victory
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c545a681-8007-4d3f-adc8-276b155cf638
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_Victory:c545a681-8007-4d3f-adc8-276b155cf638
msgctxt "hd2298e60gf2bcg4373g8a93g19bed727d068"
msgid "Victory is mine. The guardian's fallen!"
msgstr "승리는 내 것이야. 수호자가 쓰러졌어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_AnimatedArmor_AD
