msgctxt "h8a467982gaf54g4d48gaa3dg6783bbe5368d"
msgid "You toiled, and for what, Thrinn? For someone <i>else</i> to free me?"
msgstr "늑장을 부리더군, 쓰린, 왜 그런 거지? <i>다른</i> 누군가가 나를 풀어 줄 수 있도록 그런 것이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_DuergarGuardSergeantAndTheDrow_AD
