msgctxt "haba3d486g0816g4b99g8845g7f0c93163457"
msgid ""
"I'm not interested in excuses, Thrinn. You failed me. You failed the "
"Absolute."
msgstr "변명에는 관심 없다, 쓰린. 넌 나를 실망시켰어. 절대자님을 실망시킨 것이야."

