msgctxt "h5faea3c8gfc0bg485bg966eg17166db69e99"
msgid "You better hope your little tricks didn't harm the True Soul."
msgstr "네 장난질이 참된 영혼을 다치게 한 건 아니길 바라야 할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_DuergarGuardWry_AD
