"Someone didn't want us intruding. Which means there's something worth "
"<i>finding.</i>"
msgstr "우리가 침입하는 걸 원치 않았나 보군. 뭔가 <i>발견할</i> 가치가 있다는 뜻이겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_FakeWall
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 677fc347-ab3d-51fc-a5d9-3025156314f8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_FakeWall:677fc347-ab3d-51fc-a5d9-3025156314f8
msgctxt "h41f8e4f3gc2e3g4203g82f5g6935d4a5826d"
msgid "An illusion. Must be something worth hiding beyond it."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_FakeWall
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 677fc347-ab3d-51fc-a5d9-3025156314f8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_FakeWall:677fc347-ab3d-51fc-a5d9-3025156314f8
msgctxt "hba984acagef06g456cg9c01g321793b6b6d3"
msgid "Nice illusion. Time to see what it was hiding."
msgstr "훌륭한 환영이군. 이제 뭘 숨기고 있는지 볼 시간이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_FakeWall
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 677fc347-ab3d-51fc-a5d9-3025156314f8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_FakeWall:677fc347-ab3d-51fc-a5d9-3025156314f8
msgctxt "he445739egccc7g4faagb2e8gc74489351ec9"
msgid "Another illusion - is anything real down here?"
msgstr "또다른 환영이야 - 이 아래엔 진짜인 게 있긴 한 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_001
#. Speaker = Herdmaster Skarjall
#. NodeID = 0158cdca-aca1-7643-1c7a-cb90c8a96172
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FearfulRothe_State_ConvincedRotheToAttackRubble = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 3fbacc1b-441a-58c1-28d1-82960883304a_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 3fbacc1b-441a-58c1-28d1-82960883304a_C = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_001:0158cdca-aca1-7643-1c7a-cb90c8a96172
msgctxt "h6f20e443gd27eg41a5g8517g7c0de041e6fe"
msgid "Keep at it, you ugly beasts. Got to make up for lost time!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_001
#. Speaker = Herdmaster Skarjall
#. NodeID = 09d1b078-a57a-4938-9bc5-23b0ebbdc133
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 3fbacc1b-441a-58c1-28d1-82960883304a_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 3fbacc1b-441a-58c1-28d1-82960883304a_B = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_001:09d1b078-a57a-4938-9bc5-23b0ebbdc133
msgctxt "hd4f645fcg3e9cg4139ga700g47be191b0893"
msgid "Look at 'em - all that brawn and they're trembling like leaves."
msgstr "애들 봐라 - 이렇게 근육질인데 나뭇잎처럼 떨고 있잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_001
#. Speaker = Herdmaster Skarjall
#. NodeID = 2822e67a-f519-4072-890c-a85bfca5322b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 3fbacc1b-441a-58c1-28d1-82960883304a_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 3fbacc1b-441a-58c1-28d1-82960883304a_C = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_001:2822e67a-f519-4072-890c-a85bfca5322b
msgctxt "ha95bfdefg08aag43f4gac22gd1627d5aff84"
msgid "Get moving or I'll swap my cane for an axe!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_001
#. Speaker = Herdmaster Skarjall
#. NodeID = 36908204-1613-45de-b967-1bef688f102e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 3fbacc1b-441a-58c1-28d1-82960883304a_A = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_001:36908204-1613-45de-b967-1bef688f102e
msgctxt "h6ac8ce1cg5d0dg4523ga1d5g493b349c6e0f"
msgid "Quit whimpering or I'll take a slice off your haunches for my supper!"
msgstr "그만 낑낑거리지 않으면 네 뒷다리를 잘라서 저녁으로 먹겠어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_001
#. Speaker = Herdmaster Skarjall
#. NodeID = 41d9849a-1228-a7b1-9eba-314328b6d5f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FearfulRothe_State_ConvincedRotheToAttackRubble = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 3fbacc1b-441a-58c1-28d1-82960883304a_C = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 3fbacc1b-441a-58c1-28d1-82960883304a_A = False
#.     - 3fbacc1b-441a-58c1-28d1-82960883304a_C = False
#.     - 3fbacc1b-441a-58c1-28d1-82960883304a_B = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_001:41d9849a-1228-a7b1-9eba-314328b6d5f6
msgctxt "h94f16247g14f4g4a2cgbd44gb5517b671ea9"
msgid ""
"Any sign they're slacking off again, you thrash some diligence into them. "
"Got it?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_001
#. Speaker = Herdmaster Skarjall
#. NodeID = 4482fb8b-875f-33a4-cb54-9b0cc9a1a98c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_001:4482fb8b-875f-33a4-cb54-9b0cc9a1a98c
msgctxt "h98acec20gb24cg486eg88fcg275dfd9421b1"
msgid "Shove moss in your own gob and stay quiet. They've been fed plenty."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_001
#. Speaker = Herdmaster Skarjall
#. NodeID = 5647df29-a8bf-29d8-7efb-1708ad42ea15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_001:5647df29-a8bf-29d8-7efb-1708ad42ea15
msgctxt "h4b9578f7g798eg4512g8d26gf6f81d8b5767"
msgid "<i>Leaves. </i>Like on trees. Up on the surface... forget it!"
msgstr "<i>나뭇잎 말이야.</i> 나무 몰라? 나무 위에 있는... 말을 말아야지!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_001
#. Speaker = Herdmaster Skarjall
#. NodeID = 5b54afbd-c1c2-e893-2727-7f944e4bb6eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FearfulRothe_State_ConvincedRotheToAttackRubble = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 3fbacc1b-441a-58c1-28d1-82960883304a_A = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_001:5b54afbd-c1c2-e893-2727-7f944e4bb6eb
msgctxt "h1aa866c0g577ag4776gb072gc9b74d19e116"
msgid "Those rothé better keep behaving, if they know what's good for 'em."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_001
#. Speaker = Grundril
#. NodeID = 78574b0b-4694-7237-9908-3314097627bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FearfulRothe_State_ConvincedRotheToAttackRubble = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 3fbacc1b-441a-58c1-28d1-82960883304a_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 3fbacc1b-441a-58c1-28d1-82960883304a_B = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_001:78574b0b-4694-7237-9908-3314097627bb
msgctxt "h0d4705b6gb0e4g4d2agb463g697406940948"
msgid "What do you reckon got them all worked up like that?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_001
#. Speaker = Grundril
#. NodeID = bde764e3-2245-4179-b351-4a0a6eadd060
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 3fbacc1b-441a-58c1-28d1-82960883304a_C = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 3fbacc1b-441a-58c1-28d1-82960883304a_A = False
#.     - 3fbacc1b-441a-58c1-28d1-82960883304a_C = False
#.     - 3fbacc1b-441a-58c1-28d1-82960883304a_B = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_001:bde764e3-2245-4179-b351-4a0a6eadd060
msgctxt "hb01c829cge61bg4df5g9a6ag1cd0953fb5ff"
msgid "Maybe they're hungry. Could fetch 'em some moss."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_001
#. Speaker = Herdmaster Skarjall
#. NodeID = c71930e1-c08d-5ffa-888a-4e90e2d0a168
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FearfulRothe_State_RotheAreDead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_001:c71930e1-c08d-5ffa-888a-4e90e2d0a168
msgctxt "h32ea66eageac6g4540g8d79g18cbb6e186ae"
msgid ""
"Gods damn it. And those were some good cattle. Got no patience for this!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_001
#. Speaker = Grundril
#. NodeID = cbdc382f-983c-7342-25da-f2bb8083787c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_001:cbdc382f-983c-7342-25da-f2bb8083787c
msgctxt "h82ee1979g5e60g473cg8cb6g6c72a5b61b36"
msgid "Loud and clear."
msgstr "크고 분명하게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_001
#. Speaker = Grundril
#. NodeID = f7a943dd-b1c1-81ad-1627-66008ef21815
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_001:f7a943dd-b1c1-81ad-1627-66008ef21815
msgctxt "h27e18b15g0f14g463agaffeg1a378e7786fa"
msgid "... trembling like <i>what?</i>"
msgstr "...<i>뭐</i>처럼 떤다고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_001
#. Speaker = Herdmaster Skarjall
#. NodeID = f9b1e8f3-fa9d-a091-de52-6447767f086a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_001:f9b1e8f3-fa9d-a091-de52-6447767f086a
msgctxt "h8e066458gf77fg4f7egb37egd76f20029849"
msgid "I don't know. Maybe they caught sight of your mug."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_002
#. Speaker = Morgya
#. NodeID = 1a61c9f4-585a-478a-99a1-d19ba7162871
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FearfulRothe_State_ConvincedRotheToAttackRubble = True
#.   Local:
#.      - e49d0c09-44ce-1736-bfd9-70f8d11ee38c_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e49d0c09-44ce-1736-bfd9-70f8d11ee38c_C = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_002:1a61c9f4-585a-478a-99a1-d19ba7162871
msgctxt "h29c64201gbf98g4e75gbcbfg7e7e961f356b"
msgid "Keep at it! Clear every bit of rock!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_002
#. Speaker = Morgya
#. NodeID = 20430166-3096-4a44-9576-2c104e7c3f10
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - e49d0c09-44ce-1736-bfd9-70f8d11ee38c_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e49d0c09-44ce-1736-bfd9-70f8d11ee38c_B = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_002:20430166-3096-4a44-9576-2c104e7c3f10
msgctxt "h7f7d6834gc9d4g4657g8fb4g945359d5bc51"
msgid "Can't be that they're hungry. We feed 'em better than the slaves."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_002
#. Speaker = Morgya
#. NodeID = 288f1a7a-2b76-4d81-bcca-52e32740778b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - e49d0c09-44ce-1736-bfd9-70f8d11ee38c_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e49d0c09-44ce-1736-bfd9-70f8d11ee38c_C = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_002:288f1a7a-2b76-4d81-bcca-52e32740778b
msgctxt "h30f5fd3cgeea4g4028ga5fegf7062044f61d"
msgid "Should've just got some slaves up here to clear this out."
msgstr "그냥 노예들이나 데려와서 치우게 했어야 됐어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_002
#. Speaker = Morgya
#. NodeID = 2f362823-6c3f-4a79-8981-ba307e7ddf24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e49d0c09-44ce-1736-bfd9-70f8d11ee38c_A = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_002:2f362823-6c3f-4a79-8981-ba307e7ddf24
msgctxt "hdbc008afg7ccfg4738gae9fgd0be821d9447"
msgid ""
"Never heard rothé make sounds like that before. Not without a spear in its "
"guts."
msgstr "로테가 저런 소리를 내는 건 들어본 적이 없는걸. 창에 꽂히지 않은 상태에선 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_002
#. Speaker = Morgya
#. NodeID = 3815a3be-933f-4bc7-8e3d-ea19a8295f64
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FearfulRothe_State_ConvincedRotheToAttackRubble = True
#.   Local:
#.      - e49d0c09-44ce-1736-bfd9-70f8d11ee38c_C = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e49d0c09-44ce-1736-bfd9-70f8d11ee38c_C = False
#.     - e49d0c09-44ce-1736-bfd9-70f8d11ee38c_B = False
#.     - e49d0c09-44ce-1736-bfd9-70f8d11ee38c_A = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_002:3815a3be-933f-4bc7-8e3d-ea19a8295f64
msgctxt "ha02a47b9g3159g4206gba86gb64d6c12e7d2"
msgid "Keep digging, stew-meat!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_002
#. Speaker = Morgya
#. NodeID = 3c2f8034-20ae-41eb-8405-8c014feaa434
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FearfulRothe_State_ConvincedRotheToAttackRubble = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e49d0c09-44ce-1736-bfd9-70f8d11ee38c_A = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_002:3c2f8034-20ae-41eb-8405-8c014feaa434
msgctxt "h4689ff99ge891g4995gb25ag4590db564355"
msgid ""
"Them rothé shift rock faster than slaves when you finally get 'em working..."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_002
#. Speaker = Morgya
#. NodeID = 48cde5ce-0dd9-16e7-dcec-63d1c677f371
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FearfulRothe_State_RotheAreDead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_002:48cde5ce-0dd9-16e7-dcec-63d1c677f371
msgctxt "hfea5389egcf79g40acgaa84ge2e6a0726ad6"
msgid "Damn it. Ain't but one way we're dealing with this shit."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_002
#. Speaker = Morgya
#. NodeID = 82258324-2ce4-459e-b6d7-4bff25d82064
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FearfulRothe_State_ConvincedRotheToAttackRubble = True
#.   Local:
#.      - e49d0c09-44ce-1736-bfd9-70f8d11ee38c_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e49d0c09-44ce-1736-bfd9-70f8d11ee38c_B = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_002:82258324-2ce4-459e-b6d7-4bff25d82064
msgctxt "hc60396e8g870dg45a8g8366g0397a934ef59"
msgid "Might actually get this poxy job done now."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_002
#. Speaker = Morgya
#. NodeID = a01c27dc-ab12-48a2-9d59-5e17953b624a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - e49d0c09-44ce-1736-bfd9-70f8d11ee38c_C = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e49d0c09-44ce-1736-bfd9-70f8d11ee38c_C = False
#.     - e49d0c09-44ce-1736-bfd9-70f8d11ee38c_B = False
#.     - e49d0c09-44ce-1736-bfd9-70f8d11ee38c_A = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_Guards_002:a01c27dc-ab12-48a2-9d59-5e17953b624a
msgctxt "ha61bc682g9f10g4a65g9b9fgc24562953164"
msgid "Should be out on the hunt, not watching scared livestock."
msgstr "겁에 질린 가축들이나 돌보고 있을 게 아니라, 사냥을 나가 있어야 하는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_RotheFrenzy
#. Speaker = Herdmaster Skarjall
#. NodeID = 7df6b11d-b431-c38c-168e-ba4fecb93d2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_RotheFrenzy:7df6b11d-b431-c38c-168e-ba4fecb93d2c
msgctxt "hf6aafbb5gc177g4b9ag8573g7ceb850f21d1"
msgid "Bloody rothé have lost it - put 'em down!"
msgstr "망할 놈의 로테가 미쳐 버렸구만. 처치해!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_RotheFrenzy
#. Speaker = Herdmaster Skarjall
#. NodeID = cf629ff4-dff0-44fb-8bc1-d50d8dd86747
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FearfulRothe_Event_ConvincedRotheToAttackDuergar = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_RotheFrenzy:cf629ff4-dff0-44fb-8bc1-d50d8dd86747
msgctxt "h56801c0cgcf01g443egbd21g9d950e84d40d"
msgid "Bloody rothé have lost it. Put 'em down - and the <i>jargh</i>, too!"
msgstr "망할 놈의 로테가 미쳐 버렸구만. 처치해! 저 <i>자그</i> 자식도!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_RotheStartWorking
#. Speaker = Herdmaster Skarjall
#. NodeID = 1452ba8e-f71c-1b63-fe20-6ef133db0211
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_FearfulRothe_AD_RotheStartWorking:1452ba8e-f71c-1b63-fe20-6ef133db0211
msgctxt "h241a821cgf62eg453cg9cd1gb280f2af989b"
msgid "<i>Drugh</i> yes. That's it, ya beasts!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GP_HookHorror_AD_HermitHelp
#. Speaker = Filro the Forgotten
#. NodeID = a81326dc-d718-b2d2-2d70-c3e9aa32d902
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GP_HookHorror_AD_HermitHelp:a81326dc-d718-b2d2-2d70-c3e9aa32d902
msgctxt "hd2b846e3g48b1g4d78g9cd4gf7ad82db12f5"
msgid "What do you require, my love?!"
msgstr "뭐가 필요해, 내 사랑?!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GP_HookHorror_AD_HermitIdle
#. Speaker = Filro the Forgotten
#. NodeID = 201f6a7a-cced-7c10-77b8-ac98bf294304
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 76865350-472b-8a3b-5fb6-ce91e30ea77f_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 76865350-472b-8a3b-5fb6-ce91e30ea77f_B = True
#.     - 76865350-472b-8a3b-5fb6-ce91e30ea77f_A = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GP_HookHorror_AD_HermitIdle:201f6a7a-cced-7c10-77b8-ac98bf294304
msgctxt "haff3685cgdb5dg419cgb9d9g72c50a25eb45"
msgid "The Bitch Queen shan't take me, my joy, ahoy."
msgstr "망나니 여왕은 날 데려가지 못할 거라네, 내 기쁨, 안녕."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GP_HookHorror_AD_HermitIdle
#. Speaker = Filro the Forgotten
#. NodeID = 30b2c23d-ab21-92e3-2486-980a7f39d1a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GP_HookHorror_AD_HermitIdle:30b2c23d-ab21-92e3-2486-980a7f39d1a7
msgctxt "hdae917bag70d8g449cg8b11gf0ba1cf21171"
msgid "Where have you got to, my darling, my joy..."
msgstr "어디로 간 거야, 내 사랑, 내 기쁨..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GP_HookHorror_AD_HermitIdle
#. Speaker = Filro the Forgotten
#. NodeID = 51eb319b-2a61-c840-1f9d-299f97d2a403
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 76865350-472b-8a3b-5fb6-ce91e30ea77f_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 76865350-472b-8a3b-5fb6-ce91e30ea77f_B = False
#.     - 76865350-472b-8a3b-5fb6-ce91e30ea77f_A = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GP_HookHorror_AD_HermitIdle:51eb319b-2a61-c840-1f9d-299f97d2a403
msgctxt "h4a150399gc012g4ca0g9e30g972971961306"
msgid "Bellows and swallows, my joy, ahoy..."
msgstr "풀무와 제비, 나의 기쁨, 아호이..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GP_HookHorror_AD_HermitIdle
#. Speaker = Filro the Forgotten
#. NodeID = b4575e58-f28f-38be-58bb-c97455ff24e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 76865350-472b-8a3b-5fb6-ce91e30ea77f_B = False
#.     - 76865350-472b-8a3b-5fb6-ce91e30ea77f_A = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GP_HookHorror_AD_HermitIdle:b4575e58-f28f-38be-58bb-c97455ff24e7
msgctxt "h9b047e10gc57eg477cg9662g6ece160412d5"
msgid "Melinda, my true love, my true love, my true..."
msgstr "멜린다, 내 진정한 사랑, 내 진정한 사랑, 내 진정한..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GP_HookHorror_AD_HermitReaction
#. Speaker = Filro the Forgotten
#. NodeID = 651f8ee5-d70d-02fb-cc3d-33a24d8fb941
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GP_HookHorror_AD_HermitReaction:651f8ee5-d70d-02fb-cc3d-33a24d8fb941
msgctxt "h3d8fc4dag0dc9g40f4g9f20g9791c3426d24"
msgid "My love! My joy!"
msgstr "내 사랑! 내 기쁨!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GP_HookHorror_AD_HermitReaction
#. Speaker = Filro the Forgotten
#. NodeID = ddae22dd-f78b-a36a-19a3-993f51e9a2c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_GPHookHorrors_State_BothDied = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GP_HookHorror_AD_HermitReaction:ddae22dd-f78b-a36a-19a3-993f51e9a2c8
msgctxt "ha80546d9g6827g45e6gb878g3e1108953dbd"
msgid "No! NO! RAGH!"
msgstr "안 돼! 안 돼! 끄으아아!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerDaffy_AD_BarrelPlaced
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = c7532977-2495-58d5-ffd4-1aac37e6f34c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerDaffy_AD_BarrelPlaced:c7532977-2495-58d5-ffd4-1aac37e6f34c
msgctxt "haca57f4cg50f9g49f0gad37g1708d4c384f0"
msgid "Get back - one spark and it'll blow!"
msgstr "물러서 - 불씨가 한 번이라도 튀면 폭발할 거야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerLumpy_AD_Mourning
#. Speaker = Welso
#. NodeID = df3e084e-65f2-1a95-f970-c688b4623302
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerLumpy_AD_Mourning:df3e084e-65f2-1a95-f970-c688b4623302
msgctxt "h3e7e2595g4197g4b90ga85fg6c66a66a83c4"
msgid "Meerna... by the gods..."
msgstr "미르나... 신들이시여..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerLumpy_AD_Mourning
#. Speaker = Welso
#. NodeID = df3e084e-65f2-1a95-f970-c688b4623302
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[1]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerLumpy_AD_Mourning:df3e084e-65f2-1a95-f970-c688b4623302
msgctxt "h0eb85534g3bc8g481aga591gd158548e405e"
msgid "It's not right, not right. I'm so sorry..."
msgstr "이럴 순 없어, 없다고. 정말 미안해..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerLumpy_AD_Mourning
#. Speaker = Welso
#. NodeID = df3e084e-65f2-1a95-f970-c688b4623302
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[2]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerLumpy_AD_Mourning:df3e084e-65f2-1a95-f970-c688b4623302
msgctxt "hfd2e9755gba0cg41f0ga453gcddf06c51f71"
msgid "Please, no. Meerna... it can't be."
msgstr "제발, 안 돼. 미르나... 이럴 수는 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerLumpy_AD_Mourning
#. Speaker = Welso
#. NodeID = df3e084e-65f2-1a95-f970-c688b4623302
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[3]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerLumpy_AD_Mourning:df3e084e-65f2-1a95-f970-c688b4623302
msgctxt "ha0757d1agbdc6g42c9g958agd74a74099d8c"
msgid "No. No no no..."
msgstr "안 돼. 안 돼 안 돼 안 돼..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerLumpy_AD_Mourning
#. Speaker = Welso
#. NodeID = df3e084e-65f2-1a95-f970-c688b4623302
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[4]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerLumpy_AD_Mourning:df3e084e-65f2-1a95-f970-c688b4623302
msgctxt "h083b4748gd1c1g4e8dgaadbgb054333c64bc"
msgid "Damned drow. He did this to you..."
msgstr "망할 드로우 놈. 네게 이런 짓을..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerSillyAndForeman_AD_Reunited
#. Speaker = Beldron
#. NodeID = 4672b0c3-43b5-b66b-b8d0-c307114a9ca2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerSillyAndForeman_AD_Reunited:4672b0c3-43b5-b66b-b8d0-c307114a9ca2
msgctxt "h70ff3634g24fcg447agace0gd88a934d1013"
msgid "Stop fussing. It's nothing, I swear."
msgstr "호들갑 떨지 마. 별 거 아냐, 맹세코."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerSillyAndForeman_AD_Reunited
#. Speaker = Beldron
#. NodeID = 48d86a62-0395-1415-e185-11babe1b5aad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerSillyAndForeman_AD_Reunited:48d86a62-0395-1415-e185-11babe1b5aad
msgctxt "h08606b94g324dg4af0g9ad1gebc48f73e500"
msgid "I wouldn't have it any other way."
msgstr "어쩔 수 없는 일이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerSillyAndForeman_AD_Reunited
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 7042c90f-94a9-468d-43ec-a0ad211a5ffe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerSillyAndForeman_AD_Reunited:7042c90f-94a9-468d-43ec-a0ad211a5ffe
msgctxt "h02e84bb4g073fg468eg85d1gfacb337d9592"
msgid "It could have been you. I can't bear to think about it."
msgstr "너일 수도 있었다고. 생각을 멈출 수가 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerSillyAndForeman_AD_Reunited
#. Speaker = Beldron
#. NodeID = 77f8dfd7-e647-c40c-e9ec-b7dbae5e3755
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerSillyAndForeman_AD_Reunited:77f8dfd7-e647-c40c-e9ec-b7dbae5e3755
msgctxt "h9b7bb38dgf2d4g4283ga272g300cdf9833ee"
msgid "Lunkbug! Better now that I'm with you."
msgstr "렁크벅! 너랑 함께 있으니 훨씬 나아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerSillyAndForeman_AD_Reunited
#. Speaker = Beldron
#. NodeID = 8dffc2d6-9b02-13a7-883e-5db7f180ac24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerSillyAndForeman_AD_Reunited:8dffc2d6-9b02-13a7-883e-5db7f180ac24
msgctxt "hf8bff6b6gf389g4be7g8169g217a24be4870"
msgid "Shh. Put it out of your mind. I'm here now."
msgstr "쉬잇. 그건 이제 잊어버려. 난 여기 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerSillyAndForeman_AD_Reunited
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 9e1f410b-67d9-e314-9e31-2babc1b6df59
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 15cb055e-c38d-4485-97ee-a48f86a3d1c1_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 15cb055e-c38d-4485-97ee-a48f86a3d1c1_B = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerSillyAndForeman_AD_Reunited:9e1f410b-67d9-e314-9e31-2babc1b6df59
msgctxt "h2be87c92ge71fg4317g9457g760ed9e1600d"
msgid "Meerna and Wicky. Did they... suffer?"
msgstr "미르나와 윅키는. ...고통스러웠을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerSillyAndForeman_AD_Reunited
#. Speaker = Beldron
#. NodeID = b8ecb3a5-7315-d6f2-b072-de8e2c224e40
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerSillyAndForeman_AD_Reunited:b8ecb3a5-7315-d6f2-b072-de8e2c224e40
msgctxt "h11fc1147gb2f1g46ebgb524gd8ae906ad27f"
msgid "You don't need to. We're together. That's what matters."
msgstr "그럴 필요 없어. 함께 있잖아. 그게 중요해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerSillyAndForeman_AD_Reunited
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = c1489c2b-570e-4fb6-7cc9-ceb723899592
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 15cb055e-c38d-4485-97ee-a48f86a3d1c1_A = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerSillyAndForeman_AD_Reunited:c1489c2b-570e-4fb6-7cc9-ceb723899592
msgctxt "hce844424g8bd8g4583ga979g46e484bc5b77"
msgid "Beldron! Are you all right?"
msgstr "벨드론! 괜찮아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerSillyAndForeman_AD_Reunited
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = c9e6b1ec-f5c7-8e06-406f-1b4d69301813
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerSillyAndForeman_AD_Reunited:c9e6b1ec-f5c7-8e06-406f-1b4d69301813
msgctxt "hd7307fb8gaa44g49fbg9672gc177abe02a85"
msgid "I'm your husband. It's my job."
msgstr "난 네 남편이야. 내가 해야하는 일이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerSillyAndForeman_AD_Reunited
#. Speaker = Beldron
#. NodeID = ceb99c1a-e348-1647-337c-73346de12d85
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerSillyAndForeman_AD_Reunited:ceb99c1a-e348-1647-337c-73346de12d85
msgctxt "hcc882f53g751bg455bg826cg4f74b0c6f7ba"
msgid "It was over in a flash. They're at peace now, praise Ironhand."
msgstr "순식간에 끝난 일이야. 지금은 편히 잠들었겠지. 아이언핸드께 기도하자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerSillyAndForeman_AD_Reunited
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = dfcbb4ce-d88a-ca63-920f-6005d51237ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 15cb055e-c38d-4485-97ee-a48f86a3d1c1_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 15cb055e-c38d-4485-97ee-a48f86a3d1c1_B = False
#.     - 15cb055e-c38d-4485-97ee-a48f86a3d1c1_A = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerSillyAndForeman_AD_Reunited:dfcbb4ce-d88a-ca63-920f-6005d51237ce
msgctxt "h54c0fb2dg8e2eg4ef4ga96ag3f6ddc61c1c7"
msgid "You're covered in dust and... wait. Is that a bruise there?"
msgstr "먼지투성이네... 잠깐. 그거 멍든 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerSillyAndForeman_AD_Reunited
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = f937d708-09f4-47c7-f08e-de10e053a8ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerSillyAndForeman_AD_Reunited:f937d708-09f4-47c7-f08e-de10e053a8ad
msgctxt "h22e79035g78e7g401egaff7g1b4ea717120b"
msgid "Gods - when Nere... when Nere..."
msgstr "세상에, 그 때 니어가... 니어가..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerSilly_AD_CaveInDestroyed
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = f5e674a7-ba90-4b58-bf87-806dba53df89
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_GnomeWorkerSilly_AD_CaveInDestroyed:f5e674a7-ba90-4b58-bf87-806dba53df89
msgctxt "hff4be077g78d2g4131g9457g50837f893b31"
msgid "Finally! Beldron - can you hear me? Beldron!"
msgstr "드디어! 벨드론 - 내 말 들려? 벨드론!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_KethericCity_NavigationPlaques_AD_Docks
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 38e85850-e785-4f28-ab4f-5293884e9af3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_KethericCity_NavigationPlaques_AD_Docks:38e85850-e785-4f28-ab4f-5293884e9af3
msgctxt "hd7fc276fg45cdg4df1g99e4ga81dc213ad43"
msgid "*Come into Her shadow. Let all that is past be forgotten.*"
msgstr "*그녀의 그림자 속으로 들어오라. 모든 과거는 잊어라.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_KethericCity_NavigationPlaques_AD_Forge
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6558b6d2-22ff-458f-8dca-e99adcbfdcfa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_KethericCity_NavigationPlaques_AD_Forge:6558b6d2-22ff-458f-8dca-e99adcbfdcfa
msgctxt "he7d13d17gcb96g4f8dga142g22a72d491cdd"
msgid ""
"*Centuries of blazing heat have smoothed away the plaque's inscription.*"
msgstr "*수 세기에 걸친 강렬한 열기로 명판에 새겨진 글귀가 지워졌습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_KethericCity_NavigationPlaques_AD_ForgeObservingRoom
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 30418770-84e5-41b2-a5a2-e638e28a6e20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_KethericCity_NavigationPlaques_AD_ForgeObservingRoom:30418770-84e5-41b2-a5a2-e638e28a6e20
msgctxt "h39ec6e09g7a70g41d7gb8e6ge8d5e5e1bb78"
msgid "*Forge your blade in the fires, and raise it in the Mistress' name.*"
msgstr "*불길에서 검을 벼리고 여신님의 이름으로 들어 올리라.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_KethericCity_NavigationPlaques_AD_Kitchen
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4ec0098b-0f49-4d6d-8f7d-42a80b55b889
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_KethericCity_NavigationPlaques_AD_Kitchen:4ec0098b-0f49-4d6d-8f7d-42a80b55b889
msgctxt "hb17483afg5a0fg4d76ga871g5fa677c5a4f1"
msgid "*Eat and drink freely, for the Lady doth come.*"
msgstr "*맘껏 먹고 마셔라, 여신께서 오시리라.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_KethericCity_NavigationPlaques_AD_PanicRoom
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = dd36aa3e-f47b-4940-8227-b6a6e2ffaabc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_KethericCity_NavigationPlaques_AD_PanicRoom:dd36aa3e-f47b-4940-8227-b6a6e2ffaabc
msgctxt "hbb2fa012g78a7g4d8cgb94eg8f0619ef9e11"
msgid ""
"*Let feast the eyes of the faithful. Know your Goddess. Know Her command.*"
msgstr "*믿는 자의 눈을 밝혀라. 그대의 여신을 알고, 그녀의 명령을 알지니.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_KethericCity_NavigationPlaques_AD_SleepingQuarters
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d96b37ae-5cc0-4552-928b-154739f964e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_KethericCity_NavigationPlaques_AD_SleepingQuarters:d96b37ae-5cc0-4552-928b-154739f964e9
msgctxt "h1e857188g7c39g474dg94a8g0d4048222a4b"
msgid "*Come all who are weary. Sleep, and forget.*"
msgstr "*지친 자들은 모두 들어오라. 잠에 들고, 잊어버려라.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_MonkAmulet_AD_KethericCityComment
#. Speaker = Monk's Manifestation
#. NodeID = 139db95b-3440-bb66-54ee-af33e951e57e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_MonkAmulet_AD_KethericCityComment:139db95b-3440-bb66-54ee-af33e951e57e
msgctxt "hf1253637g865cg4bd7g9c78gd50a82db5bc3"
msgid "Grymforge - naught born here but tragedy. HahaHEE!"
msgstr "그림포지, 이 곳에서 태어난 것은 비극뿐이니라. 하하히!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_MonkAmulet_AD_PanicRoomComment
#. Speaker = Monk's Manifestation
#. NodeID = 9c6c1bd3-84c7-805a-1d5f-c2ef18ba587b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_MonkAmulet_AD_PanicRoomComment:9c6c1bd3-84c7-805a-1d5f-c2ef18ba587b
msgctxt "ha9faf4c3g6db6g43b6g9bb4g1006038316d5"
msgid "HeHEE! Blood was once spilled here. <i>My</i> blood, no less. HahahaHA."
msgstr "히히! 피는 이미 여기에 흘렀단다. 다름아닌 <i>나의</i> 피 말이야. 하하하하!"

