msgid ""
"A shout for help reverberating through the Underdark. That's going to "
"attract the wrong crowd."
msgstr "저 도움 요청이 언더다크에 울려 퍼지는군. 원치 않은 관객을 불러 모을 수도 있겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_MushroomHunter_PAD_HeardVoice
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2dc31dd5-0cf6-2e77-f814-46e1b6bc0a67
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
