msgstr "도움을 청하는 또 다른 겁쟁이인가? <i>이상해라.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_MushroomHunter_PAD_HeardVoice
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2dc31dd5-0cf6-2e77-f814-46e1b6bc0a67
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
