#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hce66885eg5c0dg4486g8abdgf7a9ba714833"
msgid "Cries for help. And I'm not about to ignore them."
msgstr "누군가 도움이 필요해. 변경의 칼날이 나설 시간이군!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_MushroomHunter_PAD_HeardVoice
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2dc31dd5-0cf6-2e77-f814-46e1b6bc0a67
