msgctxt "hc2444e99gbb68g43e5g8d41gf854c265f74f"
msgid "Ah, cries for help... I must be home."
msgstr "아, 도움을 청하는 소리라... 고향에 돌아온 게 분명해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_MushroomHunter_PAD_HeardVoice
