msgid ""
"I don't know half of what they're saying, but at least they're peaceful."
msgstr "이들이 뭐라고 하는 건지 절반도 못 알아듣겠지만, 적어도 평화롭긴 하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_MyconidCircle_AD_GnomesSaved
