msgid "Lunkbug... the workshop will be a lot quieter without you."
msgstr "렁크벅... 네가 없었다면 훨씬 조용했을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_MyconidCircle_AD_GnomesSaved
