msgctxt "h7648efedg2688g41f5gaddcgbc966c074ec5"
msgid "Torchstalk! Best watch my step - they like to explode."
msgstr "횃불줄기야! 조심하는 게 좋겠어 - 이것들은 잘 폭발하거든."

