msgctxt "h3f221f4cg818dg411eg9653g50337b20d22c"
msgid "Careful! Even the mushrooms down here can't be trusted."
msgstr "조심해! 이 아래선 버섯조차 믿을 수 없다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/ADs/UND_PAD_MushroomClearingNatureCheck
