msgctxt "hfdd55333g3e43g4df4g8658gebb306e290fd"
msgid "A casting mould? I know a forge that would be perfect for you."
msgstr "주형? 내가 너한테 딱 맞는 대장간을 알아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AdamantineForge_AD_FoundKey
