msgctxt "h650bb5d9g647bg4a3ag9dc1geb1f790d45f9"
msgid "A casting mould - and I know just the forge for you."
msgstr "주형이네. 너한테 딱 맞는 대장간이 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AdamantineForge_AD_FoundKey
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cfd78504-a624-89af-8983-952cb9502041
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_AdamantineForge_Knows_SawForge = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_AdamantineForge_Knows_PickedUpMold = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AdamantineForge_AD_FoundKey:cfd78504-a624-89af-8983-952cb9502041
msgctxt "h01dc6600g41d6g4836gb44bg7d15570d243c"
msgid "<i>Chk</i> - what is this? Ah, a mould. Must belong to the forge."
msgstr "<i>츠크</i>, 이게 뭐지? 아, 주형이군. 그 대장간에서 쓸 수 있겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AdamantineForge_AD_FoundKey
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cfd78504-a624-89af-8983-952cb9502041
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_AdamantineForge_Knows_SawForge = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_AdamantineForge_Knows_PickedUpMold = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AdamantineForge_AD_FoundKey:cfd78504-a624-89af-8983-952cb9502041
msgctxt "hf4309443gfde7g41d7g82d4g80e3952658d7"
msgid "A casting mould. Looks like it fits that mechanism from earlier."
msgstr "주형이네. 전에 본 장치에 딱 맞을 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AdamantineForge_AD_FoundKey
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cfd78504-a624-89af-8983-952cb9502041
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_AdamantineForge_Knows_SawForge = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_AdamantineForge_Knows_PickedUpMold = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AdamantineForge_AD_FoundKey:cfd78504-a624-89af-8983-952cb9502041
msgctxt "h7544648cgd423g4118g8d83g488577fd74df"
msgid ""
"Is this a casting mould? Looks like that forge might get some use after all."
msgstr "이거 주형인가? 그 대장간도 쓸모가 있겠는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AdamantineForge_AD_FoundKey
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cfd78504-a624-89af-8983-952cb9502041
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_AdamantineForge_Knows_SawForge = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_AdamantineForge_Knows_PickedUpMold = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AdamantineForge_AD_FoundKey:cfd78504-a624-89af-8983-952cb9502041
msgctxt "h4cfad5e4g564dg469eg83f7g72fa84f4e661"
msgid "A casting mould. Could put this to use at the forge."
msgstr "주형이군. 그 대장간에서 쓸 수 있겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AdamantineForge_AD_FoundKey
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e9001174-0da7-4b6f-afd0-2dbe9436b98a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_AdamantineForge_Knows_SawForge = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_AdamantineForge_Knows_PickedUpMold = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AdamantineForge_AD_FoundKey:e9001174-0da7-4b6f-afd0-2dbe9436b98a
msgctxt "h0cc328b1gfddfg40c6ga914g7f10b55cf8bb"
msgid ""
"What are you - a mould of some sort? Brilliant. Now to find the forge you "
"belong to."
msgstr "이거 봐라, 너 혹시 무슨 주형이니? 아주 좋아. 그럼 너네 대장간을 찾아 봐야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AdamantineForge_AD_FoundKey
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e9001174-0da7-4b6f-afd0-2dbe9436b98a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_AdamantineForge_Knows_SawForge = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_AdamantineForge_Knows_PickedUpMold = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AdamantineForge_AD_FoundKey:e9001174-0da7-4b6f-afd0-2dbe9436b98a
msgctxt "h9069f29bg38f6g49e4ga62bgf0eef0f45a90"
msgid ""
"A steel mould - used for weapons and armour, I reckon. Must be a forge "
"somewhere it can be paired with."
msgstr "무기와 갑옷에 쓰이는 강철 주형일 거야. 그렇다면 어딘가에 대장간이 있는 게 틀림없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AdamantineForge_AD_FoundKey
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e9001174-0da7-4b6f-afd0-2dbe9436b98a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_AdamantineForge_Knows_SawForge = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_AdamantineForge_Knows_PickedUpMold = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AdamantineForge_AD_FoundKey:e9001174-0da7-4b6f-afd0-2dbe9436b98a
msgctxt "hbd15e248g037dg43c1ga67cgf27ddf6c613d"
msgid "Fancy mould. Must be forge this belongs to."
msgstr "멋진 주형이네. 원래 대장간 물건일 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AdamantineForge_AD_FoundKey
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e9001174-0da7-4b6f-afd0-2dbe9436b98a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_AdamantineForge_Knows_SawForge = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_AdamantineForge_Knows_PickedUpMold = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AdamantineForge_AD_FoundKey:e9001174-0da7-4b6f-afd0-2dbe9436b98a
msgctxt "hfdebd06dg442fg4d96g934ag105a805c9b48"
msgid ""
"An elaborate mould - for casting or forging. It belongs to an equally "
"elaborate forge, I expect."
msgstr "정교한 주형이로군. 주조나 단조에 쓰는 거겠지. 아마 이만큼 정교한 대장간의 물건일 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AdamantineForge_AD_FoundKey
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e9001174-0da7-4b6f-afd0-2dbe9436b98a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_AdamantineForge_Knows_SawForge = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_AdamantineForge_Knows_PickedUpMold = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AdamantineForge_AD_FoundKey:e9001174-0da7-4b6f-afd0-2dbe9436b98a
msgctxt "hb01c7dbdg09cfg473fg9184ge0d8b6f2aebe"
msgid "A casting mould. Which means there's a forge nearby."
msgstr "주형이네. 아마 주변에 대장간이 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AdamantineForge_AD_FoundKey
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e9001174-0da7-4b6f-afd0-2dbe9436b98a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_AdamantineForge_Knows_SawForge = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_AdamantineForge_Knows_PickedUpMold = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AdamantineForge_AD_FoundKey:e9001174-0da7-4b6f-afd0-2dbe9436b98a
msgctxt "he761b680ge0a9g4466g81beg9429ec532db5"
msgid ""
"A mould, I'm thinking. Used to cast weapons or armour. Now to find the forge "
"it belongs to."
msgstr "주형이로군. 무기나 갑옷을 주조할 때 쓸 수 있겠지. 그럼 이게 원래 있던 대장간을 찾아봐야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AdamantineForge_AD_FoundKey
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e9001174-0da7-4b6f-afd0-2dbe9436b98a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_AdamantineForge_Knows_SawForge = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_AdamantineForge_Knows_PickedUpMold = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AdamantineForge_AD_FoundKey:e9001174-0da7-4b6f-afd0-2dbe9436b98a
msgctxt "h1e70a6b1gf31cg41bcg88c9g375b377f2a1a"
msgid "Hmm - a steel mould. Used in forges to cast armour and weapons."
msgstr "흠, 강철 주형이군. 대장간에서 갑옷과 무기를 주조하는 데 쓰이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AncientCity_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 123a1f8c-278c-4b9a-baaf-bbc6b30858a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AncientCity_PAD:123a1f8c-278c-4b9a-baaf-bbc6b30858a8
msgctxt "hf7cc91bcg89f1g4c5egab85ge731a0ae425b"
msgid ""
"Ancient history is overhead and underfoot. You just need to know where to "
"look."
msgstr "고대의 역사가 머리 위와 발 아래에 있어. 어디든 단지 눈 둘 곳만 알면 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AncientCity_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 123a1f8c-278c-4b9a-baaf-bbc6b30858a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AncientCity_PAD:123a1f8c-278c-4b9a-baaf-bbc6b30858a8
msgctxt "h4744ae67gf5dfg4ab2g8716ga7807fc602b5"
msgid "Every ancient ruin has a story to tell - that much is true, at least."
msgstr "고대 유적지들은 제 나름의 사연을 간직하고 있지. 그 정도는 상식이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AncientCity_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 123a1f8c-278c-4b9a-baaf-bbc6b30858a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AncientCity_PAD:123a1f8c-278c-4b9a-baaf-bbc6b30858a8
msgctxt "h280d02c7gccdfg4cc8gbfe5g576b6e69f551"
msgid "A Sharran construct? That bears investigating."
msgstr "샤 신도들의 건축물이라고? 조사해 볼 가치가 있겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AncientCity_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 123a1f8c-278c-4b9a-baaf-bbc6b30858a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AncientCity_PAD:123a1f8c-278c-4b9a-baaf-bbc6b30858a8
msgctxt "hdca60f35g56a1g49e7gb4ebg3ca0782f86e1"
msgid "Even on this plane, history is carved in stone and burned in brick."
msgstr "이런 차원에서조차 역사는 석판에 새겨지고 벽돌에 그을음을 남기는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AncientCity_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 123a1f8c-278c-4b9a-baaf-bbc6b30858a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AncientCity_PAD:123a1f8c-278c-4b9a-baaf-bbc6b30858a8
msgctxt "ha2b3642bg9ce9g4fabgab42gd714591e5a16"
msgid "Never was much for history class, but this place has me captivated."
msgstr "역사 수업을 딱히 열심히 듣진 않았지만, 이곳은 정말 눈 돌아가게 만드네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AncientCity_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 123a1f8c-278c-4b9a-baaf-bbc6b30858a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AncientCity_PAD:123a1f8c-278c-4b9a-baaf-bbc6b30858a8
msgctxt "h0d76a642g3ae3g4f25gb34bg52dca6db9089"
msgid ""
"Always a pleasure to meet a fellow academic. And what a subject - this place "
"brims with history."
msgstr "학구적인 동료와의 만남은 언제나 즐거운 법. 그나저나 정말 근사한 작품이야. 이곳엔 역사가 넘쳐흐른다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AncientCity_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 123a1f8c-278c-4b9a-baaf-bbc6b30858a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AncientCity_PAD:123a1f8c-278c-4b9a-baaf-bbc6b30858a8
msgctxt "he189f895g4b5eg4078g96fdg3d30e817020d"
msgid "Incredible. Every rock, every jewel tells a story."
msgstr "놀라워라. 사연 없는 바위도, 사연 없는 보석도 없는 법이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AncientCity_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b6063cc7-20fa-4e32-988e-39df07b7b0a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AncientCity_PAD:b6063cc7-20fa-4e32-988e-39df07b7b0a7
msgctxt "hb28a0adfge441g4dfdg9a58g9c283d04e8b1"
msgid ""
"Incredible, when I think of it. So many legendary tales, lost to deep time."
msgstr "새삼 놀랍네. 수많은 전설들이 모두 저 깊은 시간 속으로 사라져 버렸다고 생각하니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AncientCity_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b6063cc7-20fa-4e32-988e-39df07b7b0a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AncientCity_PAD:b6063cc7-20fa-4e32-988e-39df07b7b0a7
msgctxt "hd9ffce17gfe50g4c41gbd0eg8ddaa8903d48"
msgid ""
"Learn what you can in these grottos. The champions of the past have plenty "
"to teach us."
msgstr "이 공동에서 실천 가능한 교훈을 배워라. 과거의 용사들은 좋은 스승이 되어 줄 터이니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AncientCity_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b6063cc7-20fa-4e32-988e-39df07b7b0a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AncientCity_PAD:b6063cc7-20fa-4e32-988e-39df07b7b0a7
msgctxt "h80841d8bgf5fag4656g8823g15366b228337"
msgid "A rather fascinating history - shame the place is <i>so</i> dusty."
msgstr "제법 매혹적인 역사로군. 먼지가 <i>너무</i> 날린다는 게 흠이지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AncientCity_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b6063cc7-20fa-4e32-988e-39df07b7b0a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AncientCity_PAD:b6063cc7-20fa-4e32-988e-39df07b7b0a7
msgctxt "h1817c2bfg26f9g4462ga8b2g19af904c998c"
msgid "Not sure what to make of this 'hellbeast' talk, though."
msgstr "이 '지옥의 야수' 이야기를 어떻게 받아들여야 할지 확신이 안 서네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AncientCity_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b6063cc7-20fa-4e32-988e-39df07b7b0a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AncientCity_PAD:b6063cc7-20fa-4e32-988e-39df07b7b0a7
msgctxt "hfeb78392g9beag487cgb9fag3cd85ac996a9"
msgid "Storied rocks. Who would've thought."
msgstr "사연 있는 바위라. 누가 생각이나 해 봤겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AncientCity_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b6063cc7-20fa-4e32-988e-39df07b7b0a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AncientCity_PAD:b6063cc7-20fa-4e32-988e-39df07b7b0a7
msgctxt "ha7d43e7cg2084g491egadcdg87d504c3a3f9"
msgid ""
"It would have been quite something in its heyday. But even now, it has much "
"to teach us."
msgstr "전성기에는 제법 웅장했을 거야. 물론 지금도 많은 교훈을 주고 있지만 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AncientCity_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b6063cc7-20fa-4e32-988e-39df07b7b0a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_AncientCity_PAD:b6063cc7-20fa-4e32-988e-39df07b7b0a7
msgctxt "h8ac141b4g85c2g4438gab4bgbdb6ec1d1053"
msgid "The most interesting secrets are alway lurking just under the surface."
msgstr "가장 흥미로운 비밀은 언제나 지표면 아래 도사리고 있단 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_AD_GaleEntrance
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 5917922b-31a5-b893-8bad-2cbfe5f9d929
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_AD_GaleEntrance:5917922b-31a5-b893-8bad-2cbfe5f9d929
msgctxt "h9a744f7dg0064g43a0g85a3gc29eb4d9f2df"
msgid ""
"A wizard's tower is his sanctum, a private place for research and respite. "
"But as this wizard's not home - I say we take a peek."
msgstr ""
"위저드 타워는 위저드의 성소이자 연구와 휴식을 위한 개인적인 공간이야. 하지만 지금은 비어 있는 거 같으니 - 살짝 엿보는 게 어떨까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_AD_GalePowerRestored
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 40b4e676-8aea-442a-8afe-fbd13ed9a5e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_AD_GalePowerRestored:40b4e676-8aea-442a-8afe-fbd13ed9a5e0
msgctxt "h4a24f128gceb3g47c9gaac1gccefac6403c9"
msgid ""
"Ingenious use of the magic in the tower's floral core. Though not ingenius "
"enough to outsmart Gale of Waterdeep."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0fc4e243-cb34-b37a-51e1-47899fbd9af4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:0fc4e243-cb34-b37a-51e1-47899fbd9af4
msgctxt "h5a806d07g4854g4a2eg9283ge616fe48306a"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Bernard
#. NodeID = 13bc0ecd-bb10-f4e2-d34d-7c822927252e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:13bc0ecd-bb10-f4e2-d34d-7c822927252e
msgctxt "hb5b1ba0cge851g4e55g9574g42cd97bcc40d"
msgid "An unbeknownst command by fools that would intrude."
msgstr "어리석은 침입자들이 낯 붉힐 줄 모르고 명령을 내리는구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Bernard
#. NodeID = 17cc5aff-5aec-f8c9-6386-10f826e0184f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:17cc5aff-5aec-f8c9-6386-10f826e0184f
msgctxt "h259fef43ge17dg40d1g82a0ga400bd91f52a"
msgid "Come out of love for me, not love for blood and steel..."
msgstr "피와 강철이 아닌, 나에 대한 사랑으로 온..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Bernard
#. NodeID = 189de097-3c2e-330c-88c0-f187540a0cf6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:189de097-3c2e-330c-88c0-f187540a0cf6
msgctxt "hb3654902g7cd3g4b10gb283ga43be4b566f5"
msgid "Of course, my love. Don't be afraid, sweet girl."
msgstr "물론이죠, 내 사랑. 두려워 마세요, 소녀여."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Bernard
#. NodeID = 1e0a4a9a-2125-4df1-b4ef-a1dbf64fbe8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:1e0a4a9a-2125-4df1-b4ef-a1dbf64fbe8a
msgctxt "hf01a9afcgcc1bg42d3ga67dgef08d451016b"
msgid "You're strong. You're stronger than you ever knew."
msgstr "당신은 강해요. 당신은 당신이 상상하는 이상으로 강인하답니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 20751c62-3b99-7883-4d55-deded80ed893
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:20751c62-3b99-7883-4d55-deded80ed893
msgctxt "h27477ebegb955g4da4gb3b5gdecfff198d10"
msgid "Out of my way. I'm not interested in riddles."
msgstr "내 앞에서 비켜. 수수께끼엔 관심 없으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Bernard
#. NodeID = 2b542b84-f01d-9a1d-8957-05e53853ce51
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:2b542b84-f01d-9a1d-8957-05e53853ce51
msgctxt "heb2cd027g10aag439egb890g1f79fbce3b2c"
msgid "Remember. I am always here for you."
msgstr "기억해요. 내가 항상 그대를 위해 여기 있어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 2df2715e-2445-92f2-ffdd-73cd48889c8e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:2df2715e-2445-92f2-ffdd-73cd48889c8e
msgctxt "hff80ce0dg1b23g4022gaa9fgc4704d75fa80"
msgid ""
"*Long hours spent studying at your college come back to you - this is the "
"opening stanza of an old play, 'The Roads to Darkness'.*"
msgstr "*대학에서 공부했던 오랜 기억이 떠오릅니다. 이것은 오래된 연극 '어둠으로 가는 길'의 시작 구절입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 32584896-f022-dbba-ae69-c09211b90722
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_Automaton_State_Deactivated(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:32584896-f022-dbba-ae69-c09211b90722
msgctxt "ha9f1a7d9g3c9ag4907g887fg01930b41266b"
msgid ""
"*The automaton stands lifeless before you, gears silent, head low and heavy.*"
msgstr "*오토마톤은 생기 없이 당신 앞에 서 있습니다. 톱니바퀴는 조용하고, 머리는 무겁게 숙여져 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Bernard
#. NodeID = 34f85e74-8d5b-1bb9-9df8-07ac478d4f1c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:34f85e74-8d5b-1bb9-9df8-07ac478d4f1c
msgctxt "h77523a78g5fd9g4c5fgb21ag7287ce3ded1a"
msgid "As I already am."
msgstr "제가 이미 그런 것처럼요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 36d020ad-4417-4491-8650-9a0c79f673f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 15b0a2b9-2b22-50ab-70c0-ab3042def597_GaleCommentTried = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:36d020ad-4417-4491-8650-9a0c79f673f2
msgctxt "h6ddcd5ebg2e05g47d6ga83age28c27894d55"
msgid ""
"Don't get me wrong. I love poetry as much as the next wizard, but using it "
"to command an automaton... seems a bit self-indulgent to me."
msgstr ""
"오해하지 마, 나는 위저드 다음으로 시인을 좋아하는 사람이지만, 그걸 오토마톤의 명령어로 사용하는 건... 조금 너무 자유분방한 것 "
"같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Bernard
#. NodeID = 3bfe731d-d896-c315-6362-6979fa81a767
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:3bfe731d-d896-c315-6362-6979fa81a767
msgctxt "hdd6f9f5dg6f72g4ed6g8359g3f1386521c76"
msgid "My fault, my fault - I've nothing left to give."
msgstr "내 탓이오, 내 탓이오 - 내겐 아무것도 남지 않았네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 41f94c3c-ab4b-99b1-7171-53519f20ad62
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ArcaneTower_Knows_PoemGift = True
#.      - UND_Automaton_Knows_AskedPresent = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_Automaton_Knows_AskedPresent = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:41f94c3c-ab4b-99b1-7171-53519f20ad62
msgctxt "h46d79bd0g5ffag45f6ga5cfg4eb86c4ed25b"
msgid ""
"'These empty sheets are all that's left of you. / The last of all the "
"thoughtless gifts you gave.'"
msgstr "'이 빈 종이가 네게서 남은 전부야. / 네가 준 무심한 선물 중 마지막이지.'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 45664d77-bf9a-6160-3dcc-1a1f6b6db6d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:45664d77-bf9a-6160-3dcc-1a1f6b6db6d2
msgctxt "hc8200e70ge53cg4660g93c2g8119ac369df6"
msgid "Yes, please."
msgstr "그럼, 부탁해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Bernard
#. NodeID = 49da7dff-6b36-806a-00a3-89fa5bb02dc7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:49da7dff-6b36-806a-00a3-89fa5bb02dc7
msgctxt "h57626f48gc850g4b3egbaceg0ad3e86f0e39"
msgid "What can I do? Say, would you like a hug?"
msgstr "어떻게 도와드릴까요? 포옹을 원하시나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Bernard
#. NodeID = 4e49e39b-2453-3710-7800-aa1f58816159
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:4e49e39b-2453-3710-7800-aa1f58816159
msgctxt "h55623eefgcdc8g4c7bgb724ga09da4463112"
msgid "An unbeknownst command that I cannot fulfil."
msgstr "제가 수행할 수 없는 미지의 임무입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Bernard
#. NodeID = 553523f4-3c47-9389-91b6-fca3d73c2509
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:553523f4-3c47-9389-91b6-fca3d73c2509
msgctxt "h56c3e244g3126g4659ga588gbdc49e61d32b"
msgid "Remember. I am always here for you."
msgstr "기억해요. 내가 항상 그대를 위해 여기 있어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Bernard
#. NodeID = 57786d1e-e6d1-f9eb-55b1-cbfa390e53b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:57786d1e-e6d1-f9eb-55b1-cbfa390e53b1
msgctxt "h26a9788age15dg45cfg885ege8bbc5a28add"
msgid "As I already am."
msgstr "제가 이미 그런 것처럼요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Bernard
#. NodeID = 58287db0-921d-b637-419f-081dfa09eab5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:58287db0-921d-b637-419f-081dfa09eab5
msgctxt "hf3807c82gc800g4493g9f0bg6984449b4f98"
msgid "Remember: you are loved, Lenore. So much."
msgstr "기억해요: 당신은 사랑받고 있어요, 레노어. 아주 많이요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Bernard
#. NodeID = 5bf02d45-29c3-d45a-d025-0be7840e4b11
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_Automaton_State_Guarding(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:5bf02d45-29c3-d45a-d025-0be7840e4b11
msgctxt "h1496ce6dgc9d9g45f7g9d71ge3c3f310e009"
msgid "Now steel shall ring: false tongue will speak no more!"
msgstr "이제 무쇠가 울릴지니, 거짓된 혀는 더는 지껄이지 못하리라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 62d54ebd-79fa-e929-5a99-f8933f6a2d2a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:62d54ebd-79fa-e929-5a99-f8933f6a2d2a
msgctxt "h51eade16g74a4g41e0g9071g2179338d2620"
msgid "Yes, please."
msgstr "그럼, 부탁해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Bernard
#. NodeID = 69484e27-de58-decc-51b1-0d72694a8a02
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:69484e27-de58-decc-51b1-0d72694a8a02
msgctxt "h696354ebg5f0cg440ega059g69e547ebeb34"
msgid "Come here. For just a moment. Let it out."
msgstr "이리 오세요. 잠시면 괜찮아요. 내려놓으세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Bernard
#. NodeID = 6b68482d-ffbf-d0f4-4fe1-ffa37a66c947
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_Automaton_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:6b68482d-ffbf-d0f4-4fe1-ffa37a66c947
msgctxt "h1d4cbb10ga05eg4cf8g9150g82fd6a9f68c4"
msgid ""
"New sounds through damp and dark oppression break / Is it the foe, that "
"foul, contemptuous heel?"
msgstr "어둡고 축축한 압박을 깨고 나타난 새로운 소리 / 이것은 적인가, 그 더럽고 경멸적인 발걸음은?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Bernard
#. NodeID = 78681179-5c09-01ed-b796-2b6b2a6219fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_Automaton_HasGift(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:78681179-5c09-01ed-b796-2b6b2a6219fb
msgctxt "h503cbcadg599ag4d17gaff9g055d5069d0fd"
msgid ""
"I will hold onto them; it's all that I can do. / I can't throw them away; "
"I've never been that brave."
msgstr "반드시 간직하겠어; 그것이 내가 할 수 있는 전부니까. / 버릴 순 없어; 난 그렇게 용감해본 적이 없으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7b053826-d8ec-7722-698c-ca2f7df7dccc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_Automaton_Knows_AskedPlace(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_Automaton_Knows_AskedPlace(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:7b053826-d8ec-7722-698c-ca2f7df7dccc
msgctxt "h192b3d08g93edg4733g878bg2fe32066ff0b"
msgid "What is this place?"
msgstr "여기는 어디지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7d571f00-6b44-bd35-4ce7-77281c8331b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:7d571f00-6b44-bd35-4ce7-77281c8331b8
msgctxt "hfe0bd13fg4988g414cgab6fgbe527e725fd7"
msgid "I'm not foul or contemptuous, but I <i>am </i>a foe."
msgstr "더럽지도 경멸적이지도 않지만, <i>나</i>는 적이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 821af87e-4de8-0bdb-1ffb-4a0090b4e0cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ArcaneTower_Knows_PoemPeace = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:821af87e-4de8-0bdb-1ffb-4a0090b4e0cb
msgctxt "hf418bc19g1a12g4095gb718gaffaa582f380"
msgid ""
"*You know these words - they are from the opening stanza of a play you found "
"in this very tower.*"
msgstr "*당신은 이 말을 알고 있습니다. 이 탑에서 발견한 연극의 시작 구절에서 나온 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 880531bf-1c7f-b740-e0bc-bec781b0dbd6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_Automaton_Knows_AskedLove = False
#.      - UND_ArcaneTower_Knows_PoemLove = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_Automaton_Knows_AskedLove = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:880531bf-1c7f-b740-e0bc-bec781b0dbd6
msgctxt "h472c0097g0601g42cdga18dg5c51109c64c9"
msgid ""
"'The silence stretches on - I'm all alone. / Please, can I hold your hands, "
"for just a while?'"
msgstr "'침묵이 엄습한다. 난 홀로 남았어. / 제발, 내 손을 잡아주겠어, 잠시 동안이라도?'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Bernard
#. NodeID = 8fad6292-dd18-437b-3be4-4d02429401ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_Automaton_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_Automaton_State_Serving(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:8fad6292-dd18-437b-3be4-4d02429401ec
msgctxt "hdcbd4eb3g6e76g4ecagae68g87f0aa089707"
msgid "Command as you see fit, my lord, my liege."
msgstr "전하, 주인님께서 원하시는 대로 명령하십시오."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 97bcda74-fc61-78b5-b5f8-424ac0bd35b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ArcaneTower_Knows_PoemPeace = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_Automaton_State_Serving(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:97bcda74-fc61-78b5-b5f8-424ac0bd35b8
msgctxt "h5c45880bgbbb6g499egb7b0g3d03c0543d5f"
msgid "'Or art thou friend, a rescue from my lonely wake?'"
msgstr "'아니면 그대는 친구인가, 나를 외로운 잠으로부터 구해 주러 온?'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Bernard
#. NodeID = a2f00d30-6526-dea0-24ea-78709dc9ec11
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:a2f00d30-6526-dea0-24ea-78709dc9ec11
msgctxt "h7202288bge52ag4249g8ca9g55564e24acf3"
msgid "And you will never walk this path alone."
msgstr "당신이 이 길을 혼자 걷게 두지 않아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a54fd6d0-1814-070b-1a14-b6cb4e5835ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ArcaneTower_Knows_PoemSecret = True
#.      - UND_Automaton_Knows_AskedSecret = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_Automaton_Knows_AskedSecret = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:a54fd6d0-1814-070b-1a14-b6cb4e5835ee
msgctxt "h69afdda0gbfc4g4f0dgb7a0g6bb5db9746a9"
msgid ""
"'How can I trust? How will I ever know? / How can I show myself, my darkest "
"me?'"
msgstr "'내가 어떻게 믿을 수 있을까요? 어떻게 알까요? / 어떻게 자신을, 내 가장 어두운 부분을 보여줄까요?'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a78c1684-0d9a-3abb-fd3b-44beba1d185f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:a78c1684-0d9a-3abb-fd3b-44beba1d185f
msgctxt "h0a0ba5dbgaeb8g4e57ga36fga90a3ec0599d"
msgid ""
"*His arms are too tight and too low for a comfortable hug - as if he's meant "
"to be embracing someone slightly shorter.*"
msgstr ""
"*팔이 너무 꽉 조이고 너무 낮아서 편안하게 포옹할 수 없습니다. 마치 이 기계는 조금 더 키가 작은 이를 위한 목적을 가지고 있는 것 "
"같습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Bernard
#. NodeID = ac7bcc85-54c3-0aa7-1fa1-c28787d780f1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_Automaton_State_Serving(0) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_Automaton_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:ac7bcc85-54c3-0aa7-1fa1-c28787d780f1
msgctxt "h512e8a92geefeg4e61gb6eege02c9750bc4d"
msgid "Be welcome in this house. I wait for your commands."
msgstr "이 집에 오신 것을 환영합니다. 당신의 명령을 기다리겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = afa2ece0-2892-9b42-da5e-90e57bbd4713
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_Automaton_State_Guarding(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:afa2ece0-2892-9b42-da5e-90e57bbd4713
msgctxt "h7e343514g8968g44aeg8898gbb1be22a416f"
msgid "<i>Attack it while it waits for an answer.</i>"
msgstr "<i>대답을 기다리는 동안 공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Bernard
#. NodeID = b522d2c7-3407-be4c-809d-52f240f086ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_Automaton_State_Berserk(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:b522d2c7-3407-be4c-809d-52f240f086ab
msgctxt "hacc96815g1639g41cbgaf25g989eee5091e1"
msgid ""
"And in its wake, it tramples everything. / We'll kill the rest, so that the "
"one can thrive."
msgstr "그리고 모든 것을 짓밟지요. / 하나를 번성시키기 위해 우리가 나머지를 죽일게요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bb770ed3-3cae-5a2e-9c6b-b7621af47cf7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:bb770ed3-3cae-5a2e-9c6b-b7621af47cf7
msgctxt "h5554d20dg2737g48bagaa48g5fb6113d1299"
msgid "I'm a friend. I come in peace."
msgstr "나는 친구다. 싸우러 온 게 아니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Bernard
#. NodeID = bcb61eca-671b-cc63-2ec0-6682198a6301
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:bcb61eca-671b-cc63-2ec0-6682198a6301
msgctxt "hb7e7a03cg0da9g4dd7g8ab2ge6da51587fe0"
msgid "Remember: you are loved, Lenore. So much."
msgstr "기억해요: 당신은 사랑받고 있어요, 레노어. 아주 많이요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c0957f56-c6f5-f722-2ec3-ce04687de9df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ArcaneTower_Knows_PoemBerserk = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:c0957f56-c6f5-f722-2ec3-ce04687de9df
msgctxt "h956d0bd5gcd28g4a7bga688g6aa7582c789b"
msgid ""
"'There is a light in every living thing. / It's crawling t'wards the surface "
"to survive.'"
msgstr "'모든 생명은 빛이 있지요. / 그것은 살아남기 위해 표면을 향해 기어가요.'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Bernard
#. NodeID = c386c9ce-02be-24cf-5f57-46285c096c8e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_Automaton_Event_ShowSecret(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:c386c9ce-02be-24cf-5f57-46285c096c8e
msgctxt "hf2ba739dg9567g4e71g98dagc73b22f85b2f"
msgid ""
"If you do not your deepest secrets show? / Reveal your truth, give what you "
"wish to see."
msgstr "당신의 가장 깊은 비밀을 보여주지 않는다면? / 당신의 진실을 드러내고, 당신이 보고 싶은 것을 보여주세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Bernard
#. NodeID = c96d0aa2-cc9b-fdf4-02d1-011686d11854
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:c96d0aa2-cc9b-fdf4-02d1-011686d11854
msgctxt "h54a6475eg43d8g4c60g9d73g06d2b4dd54fa"
msgid "You're doing great. And everyone will be / so proud of you."
msgstr "아주 잘하고 있어요. 모두가 당신을 아주 자랑스러워할 / 거예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Bernard
#. NodeID = d9af2c5a-3010-7e10-742d-1003e7c2dd6d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:d9af2c5a-3010-7e10-742d-1003e7c2dd6d
msgctxt "hfb751402gf948g40e7g9543g099c0f2e020d"
msgid "You're strong. You're stronger than you ever knew."
msgstr "당신은 강해요. 당신은 당신이 상상하는 이상으로 강인하답니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Bernard
#. NodeID = df9d3dc2-9b14-09ec-6e4d-6a913785a1c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:df9d3dc2-9b14-09ec-6e4d-6a913785a1c8
msgctxt "h82ee270fg6210g4f59gbf05gc62bc4c0a421"
msgid "What can I do? Say, would you like a hug?"
msgstr "어떻게 해 드릴까요? 포옹을 원하시나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Bernard
#. NodeID = e557137e-7159-21ae-f425-db902d91efaa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:e557137e-7159-21ae-f425-db902d91efaa
msgctxt "hbea36e47gadbbg45b0gb4b7g1d26cdb0b818"
msgid "Come here. For just a moment. Let it out."
msgstr "이리 오세요. 잠시면 돼요. 다 털어놓으세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e7b92d9e-6b2c-d4ca-973c-02d7bbd09b60
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DUERGARDWARF or DWARF or SHORT
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:e7b92d9e-6b2c-d4ca-973c-02d7bbd09b60
msgctxt "h5c7ca779gba9eg4aa9gaf8ag810a09fed82f"
msgid ""
"*His hands close around the air next to your face, as if he's taking the "
"hands of someone taller.*"
msgstr "*기계 손이 얼굴 옆의 허공을 쥡니다. 마치 더 키가 큰 누군가의 손을 잡는 것처럼.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Bernard
#. NodeID = e99a27bb-f870-3d20-a856-49df57230dd1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:e99a27bb-f870-3d20-a856-49df57230dd1
msgctxt "hb5e63416g3f2dg437dg9cc1g1f87b95649ef"
msgid "And you will never walk this path alone."
msgstr "당신이 이 길을 혼자 걷게 두지 않아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ed268575-50b8-4c71-3a80-a347e4399519
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_Automaton_Knows_AskedWhoAreYou(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_Automaton_Knows_AskedWhoAreYou(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:ed268575-50b8-4c71-3a80-a347e4399519
msgctxt "h003c3571g55e5g40f2g8449g9ad415a499f0"
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr "넌 누구지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ef938063-0e02-5483-3e1d-142c2d03f6d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:ef938063-0e02-5483-3e1d-142c2d03f6d0
msgctxt "h209bd4e2gee17g4ea1gbe34gfbe8975d26f8"
msgid "No, thanks."
msgstr "아니, 괜찮아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f2b61be4-880c-2162-6e3f-08d85d2f2433
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:f2b61be4-880c-2162-6e3f-08d85d2f2433
msgctxt "h6c8d73degb733g48a2g9eb0gcb5809f1dd3f"
msgid "I'm fine. Thanks."
msgstr "난 괜찮아. 고마워."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton
#. Speaker = Bernard
#. NodeID = f44fe3eb-9fe7-345d-ba77-8b3c11469206
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArcaneTower_Automaton:f44fe3eb-9fe7-345d-ba77-8b3c11469206
msgctxt "h306e4ce8gf086g4c0dgb717gb55421605826"
msgid "You're doing great. And everyone will be / so proud of you."
msgstr "아주 잘하고 있어요. 모두가 당신을 아주 자랑스러워할 / 거예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = 01fd8fe3-12aa-4613-82af-a44b6b2969fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:01fd8fe3-12aa-4613-82af-a44b6b2969fd
msgctxt "h0f3c3e65gee98g484ag9da8g9deb4cfa5e86"
msgid "Bug, please. True Soul Nere will - you <i>know</i> what he'll do."
msgstr "벅, 제발. 참된 영혼 니어가... 너도 그 자식이 무슨 짓을 할지 <i>알잖아</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = 0b79bb0e-5939-2ceb-cc57-7adb048b03c1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:0b79bb0e-5939-2ceb-cc57-7adb048b03c1
msgctxt "hd2b79a98gb160g4022ga05fg2c6e20e32221"
msgid "I - all right. Go ahead, Lunkbug. Tell him."
msgstr "난 - 알겠어. 그럼 해, 렁크벅. 그에게 알려줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = 0b79bb0e-5939-2ceb-cc57-7adb048b03c1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:0b79bb0e-5939-2ceb-cc57-7adb048b03c1
msgctxt "h11427108ga9a8g460cgb688g3ac5bdd6d45c"
msgid "I - all right. Go ahead, Lunkbug. Tell her."
msgstr "난 - 알겠어. 그럼 해, 렁크벅. 그녀에게 알려줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = 0c598c2c-1e88-9c45-1459-f6350e93e760
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:0c598c2c-1e88-9c45-1459-f6350e93e760
msgctxt "hcfc4dc02g25e5g4509ga087g6932e106df85"
msgid "Nothing. Just stories, I swear it."
msgstr "아무것도 아니에요. 그냥 이야기일 뿐이에요, 맹세할게요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 0cb4f62d-b5a2-4589-97af-6d1fe2a89a2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_HiddenGnome_HasVial(2) = False
#.   Quest:
#.      - UND_GnomeRescue.GnomeAskedHelp(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - UND_GnomeRescue.GnomeAskedHelp(2) = True
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:0cb4f62d-b5a2-4589-97af-6d1fe2a89a2c
msgctxt "h444923d5ga363g492dg9f09ge2f9f68c07e7"
msgid ""
"Sir, our friends are trapped in that tunnel. My Beldron will... will die "
"without help."
msgstr "선생님, 저희 친구들이 저 터널 안에 갇혔어요. 제 벨드론이... 도움을 주지 않으면 죽을 거예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 0cb4f62d-b5a2-4589-97af-6d1fe2a89a2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_HiddenGnome_HasVial(2) = False
#.   Quest:
#.      - UND_GnomeRescue.GnomeAskedHelp(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - UND_GnomeRescue.GnomeAskedHelp(2) = True
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:0cb4f62d-b5a2-4589-97af-6d1fe2a89a2c
msgctxt "h657a764eg6ff3g46afga8dbg101955118390"
msgid ""
"Ma'am, our friends are trapped in that tunnel. My Beldron will... will die "
"without help."
msgstr "아가씨, 저희 친구들이 저 터널 안에 갇혔어요. 제 벨드론이... 도움을 주지 않으면 죽을 거예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 0cb4f62d-b5a2-4589-97af-6d1fe2a89a2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_HiddenGnome_HasVial(2) = False
#.   Quest:
#.      - UND_GnomeRescue.GnomeAskedHelp(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - UND_GnomeRescue.GnomeAskedHelp(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:0cb4f62d-b5a2-4589-97af-6d1fe2a89a2c
msgctxt "h8d51bf2fg57f1g4bcfg846fg60e0eb0dd1b6"
msgid ""
"Our friends are trapped in that tunnel. My Beldron will... will die without "
"help."
msgstr "저희 친구들이 저 터널 안에 갇혔어요. 제 벨드론이... 도움을 주지 않으면 죽을 거예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 0d954975-edac-48b4-a657-09387a56058e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:0d954975-edac-48b4-a657-09387a56058e
msgctxt "h68da1799g7063g4dcfg8befg523b5be8d995"
msgid "Laridda - I..."
msgstr "라리다 - 난..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 11dd3d81-c874-476f-a1c3-72b99e15d734
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ArguingGnomes_Quest_Refused = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:11dd3d81-c874-476f-a1c3-72b99e15d734
msgctxt "hd9ef8262ga55eg422cg8155g49779090047e"
msgid "Oh Beldron... I'm so sorry. I'll get you out of there. I promise."
msgstr "오 벨드론... 정말 미안해. 거기서 꺼내줄게. 약속이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = 12eb7809-4ae8-4a82-99c4-cf938c360786
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:12eb7809-4ae8-4a82-99c4-cf938c360786
msgctxt "hdfa14066g34acg43d9g967eg4b70b1cb5a62"
msgid "I told you, Bug. At least Phil will be safe."
msgstr "내가 말했잖아, 벅. 적어도 필은 안전하겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 13dbad59-5c03-4877-8dce-0d536da1249a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_ArguingGnomes_Event_FailedPersuasion(2) = True
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:13dbad59-5c03-4877-8dce-0d536da1249a
msgctxt "h196258dag6670g4090ga3ceg560ef84adcdd"
msgid "We're d-digging fast as we can, sir."
msgstr "저, 저희도 최대한 빨리 파고 있습니다, 선생님."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 13dbad59-5c03-4877-8dce-0d536da1249a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_ArguingGnomes_Event_FailedPersuasion(2) = True
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:13dbad59-5c03-4877-8dce-0d536da1249a
msgctxt "h1c086751g35b7g494ag97f9gb97779572e6a"
msgid "We're d-digging fast as we can, ma'am."
msgstr "저, 저희도 최대한 빨리 파고 있습니다, 마님."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 13dbad59-5c03-4877-8dce-0d536da1249a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_ArguingGnomes_Event_FailedPersuasion(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:13dbad59-5c03-4877-8dce-0d536da1249a
msgctxt "h60957473g70f5g4a5cg9017g60e811555959"
msgid "We're d-digging fast as we can. On our honour."
msgstr "저, 저희도 최대한 빨리 파고 있습니다. 저희 명예를 걸고요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 15fab74f-78e7-2245-8ed8-400783ecfa85
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ArguingGnomes_Event_EavesdropSuccess = True
#.      - UND_EscapedGnome_State_GnomeSaved = True
#.      - UND_PanicRoom_State_GnomePermaDefeated = False
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_HiddenGnome_HasVial(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_ArguingGnomes_State_SaidEscapeeSafe = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:15fab74f-78e7-2245-8ed8-400783ecfa85
msgctxt "hb7b9d761gbd19g48b2g9fcegfc260f2fc108"
msgid "Do you mean Philomeen? She's gone now - but she's safe."
msgstr "필로민 말인가? 가버리긴 했지만, 그녀는 안전해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = 183d38fd-6b8f-2992-ee76-53e98efd4374
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:183d38fd-6b8f-2992-ee76-53e98efd4374
msgctxt "h401fbb72g72deg4da0g9cc1g5610dbf8f1a0"
msgid ""
"Forget the smokepowder - there could be more slavers out there. You'd draw "
"them right to her!"
msgstr "화약은 잊어버려, 저 밖에는 더 많은 노예상이 있을지도 몰라. 그녀에게 관심이 끌리게 될 거라고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 1c8f21e9-d545-47f2-1f28-aba167f3c1d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_HiddenGnome_HasVial(2) = False
#.   Quest:
#.      - UND_GnomeRescue.GnomeAskedHelp(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:1c8f21e9-d545-47f2-1f28-aba167f3c1d6
msgctxt "h8c6d4eb2gd07cg44c4g9974gf7d0d08f067f"
msgid "But... what of the powder? Without it, Beldron will die in that tunnel."
msgstr "하지만... 화약은 어쩌고요? 그게 없으면, 벨드론이 저 터널 안에서 죽고 말 거라고요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = 1d965894-0b96-41aa-0ce8-2dd325724171
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:1d965894-0b96-41aa-0ce8-2dd325724171
msgctxt "h01cd24deg20e2g413egbb97ge0f0c8451b5d"
msgid "What? No. Lunkbug, you <i>can't.</i>"
msgstr "뭐? 안 돼. 렁크벅, <i>그럴 순 없어.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 1e37aff5-c4b9-88bc-894a-7e10c2372ef3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:1e37aff5-c4b9-88bc-894a-7e10c2372ef3
msgctxt "h67c71d78g8e7eg4774gbf76g3908fa378e4a"
msgid "Laridda..."
msgstr "라리다..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = 203f07a9-3d02-8c2d-911d-83d74a2c106f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:203f07a9-3d02-8c2d-911d-83d74a2c106f
msgctxt "hb40497c1gff0bg4317g8c69g946ead74ad8c"
msgid "No, no... there must be some mistake. Right, Lunkbug?"
msgstr "아니, 아니... 분명 뭔가 실수가 있었을 거예요. 그렇지, 렁크벅?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 208aa54f-36d2-508b-e087-97ff5d718352
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_ArguingGnomes_Quest_Refused = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:208aa54f-36d2-508b-e087-97ff5d718352
msgctxt "hd097ccadg8a4cg4817gbe1fgefaba7c400c0"
msgid "My hands are full as it is. Ask someone else."
msgstr "내 일도 바빠서. 다른 사람을 찾아봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 25fd0120-d583-4e89-98f1-30bec222889b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(5) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:25fd0120-d583-4e89-98f1-30bec222889b
msgctxt "h5010fffbgefffg49aaga362g9a8ed3f66c27"
msgid "Perfect. Let's get a move on, then."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 2771ac28-3d45-4fa3-ae9f-909051fca071
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_ArguingGnomes_Event_LearnedAboutPhilomeen = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:2771ac28-3d45-4fa3-ae9f-909051fca071
msgctxt "h898f9af9g3564g4807gba38ge48cc6bc46ee"
msgid ""
"A few days back, there was a... a scene. Our friend Philomeen, she's a "
"sapper. Set off a blast and ran off."
msgstr "며칠 전에, 그러니까... 사고가 있었어요. 우리 친구 필로민, 그녀가 공병인데, 폭발을 일으키곤 도망쳐 버렸죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 2ebc0acc-8e13-4c21-a93b-eaa990d744f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:2ebc0acc-8e13-4c21-a93b-eaa990d744f7
msgctxt "h9866549cg0041g451dg889fg97d061bdff45"
msgid ""
"I've no care for these slaves. But explosives that powerful? Those could "
"prove useful."
msgstr "이 노예들에겐 관심 없어. 하지만, 그렇게 강력한 폭발물이 있다고? 유용하게 쓰일 수도 있겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = 31291b89-50b9-764b-fbce-48d1be8b2bb6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:31291b89-50b9-764b-fbce-48d1be8b2bb6
msgctxt "h54072d23g76c7g492eg9f4cg7322dbff5a20"
msgid "Please, stay your cane. We'll have True Soul Nere out in no time."
msgstr "부탁입니다, 채찍질은 하지 말아주세요. 금방 참된 영혼 니어 님을 구해내겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = 34f7baac-e172-2406-94d7-f241fb933b8d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:34f7baac-e172-2406-94d7-f241fb933b8d
msgctxt "h8c204b92g349bg4474gb214g6d9e7562bbb1"
msgid ""
"Move on? I gave her <i>everything.</i> And she has the gall to send <i>you</"
"i> to break me?"
msgstr ""
"미련을 버리라고요? 그녀에게 내 <i>전부</i>를 줬어요. 그런데 뻔뻔하게도 <i>당신</i>을 시켜서 내 마음을 이렇게 부숴버리다니?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = 38603cf4-8e63-2059-3265-77d23dbdf415
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:38603cf4-8e63-2059-3265-77d23dbdf415
msgctxt "h3435a653g530cg4beegb0cdgccd56ca178c2"
msgid ""
"Lunkbug, shush. Don't mind him, sir - just telling stories. We'll have True "
"Soul Nere out in no time."
msgstr ""
"렁크벅, 조용히 해. 녀석은 신경 쓰지 마세요, 선생님. 그냥 이야기하고 있었을 뿐이었어요. 참된 영혼 니어 님을 구해내겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = 38603cf4-8e63-2059-3265-77d23dbdf415
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:38603cf4-8e63-2059-3265-77d23dbdf415
msgctxt "hdd98ebb9g9888g430dgb154gbc9f36c8b591"
msgid ""
"Lunkbug, shush. Don't mind him, madam - just telling stories. We'll have "
"True Soul Nere out in no time."
msgstr "렁크벅, 조용히 해. 녀석은 신경 쓰지 마세요, 마님. 그냥 이야기하고 있었을 뿐이었어요. 참된 영혼 니어 님을 구해내겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = 38603cf4-8e63-2059-3265-77d23dbdf415
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:38603cf4-8e63-2059-3265-77d23dbdf415
msgctxt "hd197ead2g8a8fg449ag9934g3a3b77c63546"
msgid ""
"Lunkbug, shush. Don't mind him - just telling stories. We'll have True Soul "
"Nere out in no time."
msgstr "렁크벅, 조용히 해. 녀석은 신경 쓰지 마세요. 그냥 이야기하고 있었을 뿐이었어요. 참된 영혼 니어 님을 구해내겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3ea70278-2a10-99bf-a7b9-0b4376fe1932
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - HasTaggedItem_EXPLOSIVES(2) = True
#.      - UND_HiddenGnome_HasVial(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_ArguingGnomes_Quest_Accepted = True
#.     - UND_GnomeWorkerSilly_Event_ToldLunkbugHasPowderq = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:3ea70278-2a10-99bf-a7b9-0b4376fe1932
msgctxt "ha845bb95gb2b4g4bcdgba9eg129885765fbc"
msgid "I have some explosive powder. I can use it to get them out."
msgstr "내게 화약이 있어. 이걸로 그들을 구할 수 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 3f3f5067-69b4-30f1-0bed-523519f1529c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(5) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:3f3f5067-69b4-30f1-0bed-523519f1529c
msgctxt "hd3eedc8eg4e8fg4f81g99e3g653441eb57b5"
msgid ""
"Some firepower'll help bust open that wall. Then we can free the poor lads "
"inside."
msgstr "약간의 화약만 있으면 저 벽을 부술 수 있을 거야. 그럼 저 안에 갇힌 불쌍한 애들을 구할 수 있겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = 3f46e100-3b9e-67a8-dc85-633e9e6ee36e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_ArguingGnomes_Event_FailedPersuasion(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:3f46e100-3b9e-67a8-dc85-633e9e6ee36e
msgctxt "hfbcfa929g8b46g4570g8ebag06b177a398ed"
msgid "Just keep digging. We don't want any trouble."
msgstr "그냥 계속 파고 있어. 문제가 벌어지면 안 되니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 3f9e12ae-4c11-418a-b940-0887d599a1b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(7) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:3f9e12ae-4c11-418a-b940-0887d599a1b3
msgctxt "he6419420g09feg4ecdg8c75ge095f05899de"
msgid "The trapped gnomes won't last forever. We've <i>got</i> to help."
msgstr "갇힌 노움들이 평생 버티진 못할 거야. 우리가 도와줘야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = 405399b9-e2b7-4143-a886-e518ba537a3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:405399b9-e2b7-4143-a886-e518ba537a3b
msgctxt "ha3012cafg0c29g426dg8fc2gfad0f2cc702a"
msgid "A hunch? Just... just a guess, then. Maybe they're all right..."
msgstr "예감이라고요? 그럼, 그냥... 그냥 짐작이군요. 그들이 괜찮을지도 몰라요..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 424d5ff6-930a-4dc5-9852-28d98d585904
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:424d5ff6-930a-4dc5-9852-28d98d585904
msgctxt "h37a6a311g5c75g4bb6gbedcgb80f44f7ab94"
msgid ""
"If Philomeen made it, you'll find her there. She'll have the stuff to blow "
"that tunnel wide open and get Beldron and the rest out."
msgstr ""
"필로민이 살아남았다면, 거기서 그녀를 찾을 수 있을 거예요. 그녀라면 이 터널을 부숴버리고 벨드론과 다른 이들을 구할 수 있을 물건을 "
"가지고 있을 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 42b55c31-76cf-fbfa-16cd-ebd093929115
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_PanicRoom_State_GnomePermaDefeated = False
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_HiddenGnome_HasVial(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_ArguingGnomes_State_SaidEscapeeSafe = True
#.     - UND_GnomeWorkerSilly_Event_ToldLunkbugHasPowderq = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:42b55c31-76cf-fbfa-16cd-ebd093929115
msgctxt "h649320ceg5110g4095ga0dbg0f3c20bd4257"
msgid "Philomeen's safe. I have the powder."
msgstr "필로민은 안전해. 내가 가루를 가져왔어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = 4992ff74-441e-0447-86ad-98b64251c629
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:4992ff74-441e-0447-86ad-98b64251c629
msgctxt "hfa8fd7e2gd0e3g47abga583g72c1a8333521"
msgid "Glittering gods - she actually survived...?"
msgstr "눈부신 신들이시여. 그녀가 정말 살아남았다고...?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = 4c99d360-b7b5-864a-fec2-c93fcdebb2b6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:4c99d360-b7b5-864a-fec2-c93fcdebb2b6
msgctxt "h4887be1cg0a47g42c9gbde1gc0fa262ebb28"
msgid ""
"But the others... they'll die in that tunnel. If not by poison, then by "
"Nere's hand."
msgstr "하지만 다른 이들은... 저 터널 안에서 죽을 거예요. 독이 죽이든, 니어의 손에 죽든 말이에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5091d44f-d762-4f4a-ab43-519c49b31f45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:5091d44f-d762-4f4a-ab43-519c49b31f45
msgctxt "hcfd1f934g0a6dg40b7gb79bg45762a3de2bf"
msgid "It doesn't matter. Call it a hunch."
msgstr "그건 상관없어. 그냥 예감이라고 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 5097aa61-8947-4b9d-909f-5a104f592677
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:5097aa61-8947-4b9d-909f-5a104f592677
msgctxt "h11ec81d1gea21g4f09gba32gd3556bdc3419"
msgid ""
"Beldron's trapped with that maniac Nere. If you won't find Philomeen, I will."
msgstr "벨드론이 저 미치광이 니어와 함께 갇혀있어. 네가 필로민을 찾지 않겠다면, 내가 하겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
