msgid "We weren't whispering, sir. Not us."
msgstr "저희가 속삭이고 있던 게 아닙니다, 나으리. 저희는 아니에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = 50c8c57e-c39a-2d8d-a44c-c7197d413c37
