msgctxt "h641d84f5g8262g4f9cga691gd8bd195b4cd0"
msgid "We weren't whispering. Not us."
msgstr "저희가 속삭이고 있던 게 아닙니다. 저희는 아니에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 54347d39-893d-494a-a95a-725c8e5e5250
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:54347d39-893d-494a-a95a-725c8e5e5250
msgctxt "h78aa5b97g22dag42d1gbc2bge70e1f5371c4"
msgid "Hurry. Our people won't last in that cave-in forever."
msgstr "서둘러요. 우리 친구들이 저 안에서 오래 버티진 못할 거예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 57f63bfd-a324-a2a7-00a1-410b548b430c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_GnomeWorkerSilly_Event_ToldLunkbugHasPowderq = True
#.   Object:
#.      - HasTaggedItem_EXPLOSIVES(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:57f63bfd-a324-a2a7-00a1-410b548b430c
msgctxt "h5045bd19g7523g470eg85cegb1d7f92b5924"
msgid "Place the powder and use fire to explode it!"
msgstr "화약을 놓고 불을 붙여서 터뜨려요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5a9517b4-5903-4c28-8dd4-e0459867c679
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_HiddenGnome_Event_BreakingUp = True
#.      - UND_ArguingGnomes_State_SaidEscapeeDead = False
#.      - UND_ArguingGnomes_State_SaidEscapeeSafe = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_ArguingGnomes_State_SaidEscapeeSafe = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:5a9517b4-5903-4c28-8dd4-e0459867c679
msgctxt "heb79e9a3g81a0g492dgbf7cg2b1979e66c3d"
msgid "I found Philomeen. And she wants Laridda to move on."
msgstr "필로민을 찾았어. 그녀가 라리다에게 미련을 버리라고 하더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 60129e37-7c85-2721-a876-cfb8bb701b92
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:60129e37-7c85-2721-a876-cfb8bb701b92
msgctxt "h5f3e785bgbbc8g430fgbb96g9cc2f33492ac"
msgid ""
"When Thulla said to rescue her friends, I suppose she meant all of them. "
"Waste of time, if you ask me."
msgstr "툴라가 자신의 친구를 구출해달라고 했을 때는, 모두를 뜻한 거겠지. 내게 묻는다면, 시간 낭비라고 생각해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 626fe895-2c0b-456d-85ab-917843640387
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_ArguingGnomes_Quest_Accepted = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:626fe895-2c0b-456d-85ab-917843640387
msgctxt "hadd228c4g4b95g4636gafc8g34539fa1eef7"
msgid "I'll do what I can."
msgstr "내가 한번 찾아볼게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 63b80f60-2229-4317-89b3-877a54a28c96
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:63b80f60-2229-4317-89b3-877a54a28c96
msgctxt "h33641a5bge2fcg4414g8820gda1c1bd33be8"
msgid ""
"Sounds like an unnecessary risk to me. Though that hasn't stopped us before."
msgstr "내가 보기엔 감수할만한 위험은 아닌 것 같은데. 전에도 그게 우릴 막진 못했지만 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6539d2ec-2a76-2401-903f-7ffd320e7e2f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:6539d2ec-2a76-2401-903f-7ffd320e7e2f
msgctxt "h0d870dacg18a3g445ag94afgbdc71747caec"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 659ad0e1-485f-6024-44c5-2eb469dfada3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:659ad0e1-485f-6024-44c5-2eb469dfada3
msgctxt "h80705bc0gb540g4bd6g8d10g6e1e173d14af"
msgid "Laridda. I'm so sorry. Truly."
msgstr "라리다. 정말 미안해. 진심으로."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 66f615fb-9102-3c08-9a28-109cc2d1fdca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:66f615fb-9102-3c08-9a28-109cc2d1fdca
msgctxt "h6c06cff4g8939g49c2g8acdg94d8b0ec4429"
msgid "It's my Beldron. He's still back there! I -"
msgstr "내 벨드론이. 그가 아직 저 뒤에 있어요! 난 -"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 683739f6-2fd0-4623-b7b2-d19ff0f97908
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:683739f6-2fd0-4623-b7b2-d19ff0f97908
msgctxt "h621f479aga347g4b6bg80afgcff3438c8995"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = 6c9de38d-b907-41de-98dd-afce48cb5c51
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:6c9de38d-b907-41de-98dd-afce48cb5c51
msgctxt "h9e05b0a2gc20dg448dg8db4ga43551d9c2f7"
msgid "Th-thank you for sharing, sir."
msgstr "아-알려주셔서 감사합니다, 나으리."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = 6c9de38d-b907-41de-98dd-afce48cb5c51
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:6c9de38d-b907-41de-98dd-afce48cb5c51
msgctxt "hd2f5df7fgd205g47e0g8116g8c4623da979f"
msgid "Th-thank you for sharing, ma'am."
msgstr "아-알려주셔서 감사합니다, 마님."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = 6c9de38d-b907-41de-98dd-afce48cb5c51
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:6c9de38d-b907-41de-98dd-afce48cb5c51
msgctxt "he74ebe38g095eg4efdgb765gc9c1c2571f8f"
msgid "Th-thank you for sharing, truly."
msgstr "아-알려주셔서 감사합니다, 진심으로요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 6d145d1b-5fc6-9e27-d0c3-731744df4b1d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_ArguingGnomes_Event_PromisedSafety(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:6d145d1b-5fc6-9e27-d0c3-731744df4b1d
msgctxt "hbfa476fdga12ag4f83g98b8gf99457f3a1af"
msgid "But didn't you say... I was so sure you'd help us..."
msgstr "하지만, 당신이 분명... 우릴 도와줄 거라고 확신했는데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6e8b32aa-52f7-1b2a-1faf-1d69f3dfce71
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ArguingGnomes_Event_EavesdropSuccess = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GNOME(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:6e8b32aa-52f7-1b2a-1faf-1d69f3dfce71
msgctxt "hea187d32g8f36g4197g89a5gcb9e96d1e2e2"
msgid "You can trust me - I'm friendly."
msgstr "날 믿어도 좋아, 난 당신들 편이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 700c833b-fc42-4498-9d00-ef94fe7dabb8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:700c833b-fc42-4498-9d00-ef94fe7dabb8
msgctxt "hd8aa251ag1d96g4c58gb62fg32e7d0ca71cd"
msgid ""
"Please - my Beldron is still trapped. Blow that wall open, I'm begging you."
msgstr "부탁입니다. 제 벨드론이 아직 갇혀있어요. 저 벽을 날려버려 주세요, 이렇게 빌게요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7080fd6c-6555-43f0-b7bc-ea6541c41e32
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_PanicRoom_State_GnomePermaDefeated = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_ArguingGnomes_State_SaidEscapeeDead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:7080fd6c-6555-43f0-b7bc-ea6541c41e32
msgctxt "h960bd7f0ge298g4bd7g8376g4000762573fc"
msgid "Philomeen is - gone."
msgstr "필로민은... 이제 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 744648d6-f933-467d-89d6-10184dff82f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:744648d6-f933-467d-89d6-10184dff82f6
msgctxt "h0ddf3189g6a19g4c3bg9f34gf79b80cc01a2"
msgid "I spoke with their ghosts. Chatty folks, all in all."
msgstr "그들의 유령과 대화했어. 말이 많은 친구들이던데, 대체로 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 749cd775-e64b-daff-6139-fc39a3d653fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ArguingGnomes_Event_EavesdropSuccess = True
#.      - UND_PanicRoom_State_GnomePermaDefeated = True
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_HiddenGnome_HasVial(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_ArguingGnomes_State_SaidEscapeeDead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:749cd775-e64b-daff-6139-fc39a3d653fa
msgctxt "h8b5ddfbfga006g473dgb520g66af76d36797"
msgid "Philomeen is - gone."
msgstr "필로민은... 이제 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 74af9b18-8f00-7fe3-7b3b-c4e0eb00f820
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_EscapedGnome_State_GnomeSaved = True
#.      - UND_PanicRoom_State_GnomePermaDefeated = False
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_HiddenGnome_HasVial(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_ArguingGnomes_State_SaidEscapeeSafe = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:74af9b18-8f00-7fe3-7b3b-c4e0eb00f820
msgctxt "h633d3facg56d9g4c03gbe5dg910d80fd5f18"
msgid "I've spoken to Philomeen. She's gone now - but she's safe."
msgstr "필로민과는 이야기했어요. 그녀는 이제 가버렸지만, 안전해요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 75a8092e-a6f6-b657-5089-f877e13bb0bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - UND_GnomeRescue.GnomeAskedHelp(2) = True
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:75a8092e-a6f6-b657-5089-f877e13bb0bb
msgctxt "h76ae5f98g856fg4040gb142g5b28ba637042"
msgid ""
"Sir - our people are trapped. Phil was a sapper, kept a smokepowder stash. "
"Find it and blow that wall open, I'm begging you."
msgstr ""
"선생님, 저희 동족이 갇혔어요. 필은 공병이었기에, 감춰둔 화약이 있었죠. 그걸 찾아서 저 벽을 날려버려 주세요, 제발, 부탁입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 75a8092e-a6f6-b657-5089-f877e13bb0bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - UND_GnomeRescue.GnomeAskedHelp(2) = True
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:75a8092e-a6f6-b657-5089-f877e13bb0bb
msgctxt "h95b64552gf2c1g4dccgad9bg5e7494cb024e"
msgid ""
"Ma'am - our people are trapped. Phil was a sapper, kept a smokepowder stash. "
"Find it and blow that wall open, I'm begging you."
msgstr ""
"아가씨, 저희 동족이 갇혔어요. 필은 공병이었기에, 감춰둔 화약이 있었죠. 그걸 찾아서 저 벽을 날려버려 주세요, 제발, 부탁입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 75a8092e-a6f6-b657-5089-f877e13bb0bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - UND_GnomeRescue.GnomeAskedHelp(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:75a8092e-a6f6-b657-5089-f877e13bb0bb
msgctxt "h393bb882g72c0g41d3gac38gc9a87c2edd9e"
msgid ""
"Please - our people are trapped. Phil was a sapper, kept a smokepowder "
"stash. Find it and blow that wall open, I'm begging you."
msgstr ""
"부탁드립니다, 저희 동족이 갇혔어요. 필은 공병이었기에, 감춰둔 화약이 있었죠. 그걸 찾아서 저 벽을 날려버려 주세요, 제발, 이렇게 "
"빌게요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 75f77ca5-16a0-48d6-afdc-e128dec107dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GNOME(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:75f77ca5-16a0-48d6-afdc-e128dec107dc
msgctxt "he6a58611g1fd1g4091gb19ag9ab227a5facb"
msgid "Stop whispering - the guards'll notice."
msgstr "그만 속삭여, 간수들이 눈치챌 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 77971888-a063-410a-a88d-7176c5516d78
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_NereMindMeld_Event_SucceededCheck = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:77971888-a063-410a-a88d-7176c5516d78
msgctxt "hb27283b1g8057g4deegbc9aga0b8dad471e6"
msgid "I have news: half the trapped gnomes are already dead."
msgstr "전해줄 소식이 있어: 안에 갇힌 노움 중 절반은 이미 죽었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7a8ccfbf-4a2a-4565-a427-f77c79856d1b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_ArguingGnomes_State_Inconsolable = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:7a8ccfbf-4a2a-4565-a427-f77c79856d1b
msgctxt "hd028c275ge898g4efeg8c11g5114586fba3a"
msgid "Excellent. I can add Philomeen's head to my collection."
msgstr "훌륭해. 필로민의 머리도 내 소장품에 추가할 수 있겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 7a8e02f6-d972-43f5-90a3-03ccfa222f8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:7a8e02f6-d972-43f5-90a3-03ccfa222f8a
msgctxt "hb1b90707g3cb1g4828g8fb3gf481882a9180"
msgid ""
"Piss off, Laridda. Beldron will die in there, and you can't even <i>pretend</"
"i> to care."
msgstr "꺼져, 라리다. 벨드론이 저 안에서 죽을 텐데, 넌 신경 쓰는 <i>척조차</i> 하지 않는구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 7b3ae411-b8fb-4908-b1d8-65a6f99eaec9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ArguingGnomes_State_SaidEscapeeSafe = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:7b3ae411-b8fb-4908-b1d8-65a6f99eaec9
msgctxt "ha7b47aa1ge78bg4542ga626ga7faf894bb91"
msgid "Get Beldron out of there. <i>Please.</i>"
msgstr "벨드론을 저기서 꺼내줘요. <i>제발.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 7c5da62f-41ab-12a1-6ec0-ceef0a874e90
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:7c5da62f-41ab-12a1-6ec0-ceef0a874e90
msgctxt "h3083548dg0059g47c9g82f2g2d147ea8941c"
msgid ""
"Philomeen was a sapper, kept a smokepowder stash. Find it and blow that wall "
"open, I'm begging you."
msgstr "필로민은 공병이었어요. 화약 뭉치를 가지고 있었죠. 그걸 찾아서 저 벽을 날려주세요, 부탁입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 80c0bd66-3317-4773-835f-2d1cad3e93e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:80c0bd66-3317-4773-835f-2d1cad3e93e8
msgctxt "h158584b9g045fg4096g97c3g9983e7769e2e"
msgid "Leave the True Soul to me. Now tell me what you know."
msgstr "참된 영혼은 내게 맡기고, 당신들이 아는 걸 말해 줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 82a19c3d-8f7f-9343-b0b6-fe6e54f448e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:82a19c3d-8f7f-9343-b0b6-fe6e54f448e8
msgctxt "h22ffad62gfaabg4aa9gb203gaebd734e7e9e"
msgid ""
"Sir - you have the powder? My Beldron will die back there. Blow up that "
"wall, I'm begging you."
msgstr "선생님, 가루를 가지고 오셨나요? 제 소중한 벨드론이 저 뒤에서 죽어가고 있어요. 제발 저 벽을 날려주세요, 부탁드립니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 82a19c3d-8f7f-9343-b0b6-fe6e54f448e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:82a19c3d-8f7f-9343-b0b6-fe6e54f448e8
msgctxt "h735f6504ga069g42aeg8e75g618a9e3e0617"
msgid ""
"Ma'am - you have the powder? My Beldron will die back there. Blow up that "
"wall, I'm begging you."
msgstr "마님, 가루를 가지고 오셨나요? 제 소중한 벨드론이 저 뒤에서 죽어가고 있어요. 제발 저 벽을 날려주세요, 부탁드립니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 82a19c3d-8f7f-9343-b0b6-fe6e54f448e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:82a19c3d-8f7f-9343-b0b6-fe6e54f448e8
msgctxt "h5666f18fg01c8g4995g841fgbb051595e04d"
msgid ""
"Please - you have the powder? My Beldron will die back there. Blow up that "
"wall, I'm begging you."
msgstr "제발, 화약을 가지고 오셨나요? 제 벨드론이 저 안에서 죽고 말 거예요. 저 벽을 날려버려 주세요, 이렇게 빌게요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = 85aad0f5-d30e-da5a-08ae-531d814da077
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:85aad0f5-d30e-da5a-08ae-531d814da077
msgctxt "hd3542364gc289g40c3gaabbga186b2b50634"
msgid "She's - she's all right? Thank the Stern himself!"
msgstr "그녀가, 그녀가 괜찮다고요? 스테른이여 감사합니다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 85ffa3b0-13b8-41bb-b8af-b124bd53c88c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(8) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(8) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:85ffa3b0-13b8-41bb-b8af-b124bd53c88c
msgctxt "h385e067bgd006g4a30g8ed9ga54c168dab18"
msgid ""
"Let's give them a hand, shall we? Only decent course of action, if you ask "
"me."
msgstr "그들을 도와주자, 어때? 내 생각엔 그게 옳은 일인 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 86c8b52c-99f0-130d-609c-877306a85bc5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DuergarSergeant_State_PermaDefeated = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:86c8b52c-99f0-130d-609c-877306a85bc5
msgctxt "he958646cgf26ag4359g9b04g0c78af253de6"
msgid "The sergeant's defeated. This is your chance to flee."
msgstr "하사관은 쓰러졌어. 당신들이 도망칠 기회야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8a3db4a8-6039-437c-bde7-fadcc234201e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:8a3db4a8-6039-437c-bde7-fadcc234201e
msgctxt "h7236bb66g01fcg47e8ga5d4gd6ddbcfd8159"
msgid "I'm a True Soul. I saw them through Nere's eyes."
msgstr "난 참된 영혼이야. 니어의 눈을 통해 그들을 봤어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 8e7787cd-e62d-e58e-12a2-557d072b7e1d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:8e7787cd-e62d-e58e-12a2-557d072b7e1d
msgctxt "ha5ac63e0gf6f6g439agaf8dg287096b5cb81"
msgid "We're working as we can, sir. Very hard indeed."
msgstr "최선을 다해서 일하고 있습니다, 나으리. 최대한 열심히요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 8e7787cd-e62d-e58e-12a2-557d072b7e1d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:8e7787cd-e62d-e58e-12a2-557d072b7e1d
msgctxt "hc5acd9dbg9173g4879gab3ag3af0cbb1b934"
msgid "We're working as we can, ma'am. Very hard indeed."
msgstr "최선을 다해서 일하고 있습니다, 마님. 최대한 열심히요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 8e7787cd-e62d-e58e-12a2-557d072b7e1d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:8e7787cd-e62d-e58e-12a2-557d072b7e1d
msgctxt "h20e81fd7ge634g4c0cg9f26gda2bc4d93c7a"
msgid "We're working as we can. Very hard indeed."
msgstr "최선을 다해서 일하고 있습니다. 최대한 열심히요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8e847b44-3425-4115-e2d8-b7389e2f4a8b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:8e847b44-3425-4115-e2d8-b7389e2f4a8b
msgctxt "hccad5580g86e9g4aadgb698g01fa771c977a"
msgid "<i>Clear your throat.</i>"
msgstr "<i>목을 가다듬는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8f74ec4a-ad05-6162-c5a9-8f91b4b3012e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:8f74ec4a-ad05-6162-c5a9-8f91b4b3012e
msgctxt "heb7c05d7g8b7cg4c96gb01agd6765c91900e"
msgid "<i>Eavesdrop on the conversation.</i>"
msgstr "<i>대화 내용을 엿듣는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 8f9f1871-db40-1398-664f-3bdb54c517fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(6) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:8f9f1871-db40-1398-664f-3bdb54c517fb
msgctxt "h6cd3929dgf99bg4a52gbaa2gbfc3e6d24f61"
msgid ""
"Well, some explosives would certainly help us free Thulla's friends. They "
"might even survive the blast."
msgstr "뭐, 폭발물이 좀 있다면 툴라의 친구들을 확실히 도와줄 수 있을 것 같은데. 그들이 폭발에서 살아남을 수 있을지도 몰라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 90efa7a7-9a56-5804-ebf0-1cbf376c15bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(8) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(8) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:90efa7a7-9a56-5804-ebf0-1cbf376c15bd
msgctxt "h4630339dg7974g41e9g9dfag7ea8e4a1c57e"
msgid ""
"If we're to help Thulla, we'll have to breach that wall with explosives and "
"hope the blast doesn't injure anyone. Or worse."
msgstr ""
"툴라를 도우려면, 폭발물로 저 벽을 뚫어야 해. 그리고 그 과정에서 누구도 다치기 않기를 바라야겠지. 더 나빠질 수도 있지만 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 952eede3-0c20-cbdb-d7bd-4b9e1510df28
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:952eede3-0c20-cbdb-d7bd-4b9e1510df28
msgctxt "h6a9eb2bcgf1f2g4d57g85ddg6b960c6a29b0"
msgid "I don't... I don't understand."
msgstr "이해가... 이해가 안 돼요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 97efe96c-4ab1-454d-a914-27b13f07c7a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ArguingGnomes_Event_EavesdropSuccess = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:97efe96c-4ab1-454d-a914-27b13f07c7a4
msgctxt "h7ffcb83bg3111g47c8gb3ebg02fb5b10a1bd"
msgid "You mentioned smokepowder. Details - now."
msgstr "화약에 대해 이야기하는 걸 들었어. 당장, 자세히 설명해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 98e6e54c-93d7-44e3-9ec9-ef41dd50f1c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:98e6e54c-93d7-44e3-9ec9-ef41dd50f1c2
msgctxt "h1efe0098g5a08g4943ga0cag10b196eb99a8"
msgid "Who? There's... there's no one else."
msgstr "누구요? 다른... 다른 이는 아무도 없어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9c804310-8c81-4ea1-ab75-eaea473212f4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:9c804310-8c81-4ea1-ab75-eaea473212f4
msgctxt "h4ea7291dg536fg4a13gb4b9g54321b6b671f"
msgid "A terrible situation. I'm sure you'll pay handsomely if I help."
msgstr "지독한 상황이군. 분명 내가 도움을 준다면 값을 후하게 쳐줄 수 있겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 9cb5a033-95b5-4f39-8ccf-87baf21746d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_GnomeWorkerSilly_HasScroll(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_GnomeWorkerSilly_GiveScroll(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:9cb5a033-95b5-4f39-8ccf-87baf21746d3
msgctxt "h30879fe5gffceg4c84g962ag4b629d18cc72"
msgid "Found it in the ruins. It's all I've got. Please, just listen."
msgstr "폐허에서 찾은 거예요. 이게 제가 가진 전 재산입니다. 제발, 그냥 들어 주세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9e7c7bb6-e235-8a9e-fde1-573f4bb7a30a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_State_GaveQuest = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:9e7c7bb6-e235-8a9e-fde1-573f4bb7a30a
msgctxt "h04a3604bg7f5dg4ce0gba0fg9700892520df"
msgid "I'm a friend - Thulla sent me."
msgstr "난 당신들 편이야, 툴라가 보내서 왔어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 9e81e92a-63e9-4dbb-a314-462d280446b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:9e81e92a-63e9-4dbb-a314-462d280446b1
msgctxt "h06b53640gcd92g46feg9a2dg7a477a22c28b"
msgid "Great gods. How - how could you know that?"
msgstr "위대한 신들이시여. 어떻게 - 어떻게 그걸 아시는 거죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = a0742eda-d8b3-4159-8cc7-8b39e72252a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - UND_GnomeRescue.GnomeAskedHelp(2) = True
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:a0742eda-d8b3-4159-8cc7-8b39e72252a8
msgctxt "hab296f86gec34g4daag87a6g9535a6ac0639"
msgid ""
"Sir - our friends are trapped in the cave-in. And I know a way to get them "
"out."
msgstr "나으리, 저희 친구들이 저 통로 안쪽에 갇혀있어요. 그리고 제가 그들을 구할 방법을 알아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = a0742eda-d8b3-4159-8cc7-8b39e72252a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - UND_GnomeRescue.GnomeAskedHelp(2) = True
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:a0742eda-d8b3-4159-8cc7-8b39e72252a8
msgctxt "ha3973461g342dg41b6gaf49ga3a0bd8ddead"
msgid ""
"Ma'am - our friends are trapped in the cave-in. And I know a way to get them "
"out."
msgstr "아가씨, 저희 친구들이 이 안에 갇혔어요. 그리고 제가 그들을 빼낼 방법을 알아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = a0742eda-d8b3-4159-8cc7-8b39e72252a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - UND_GnomeRescue.GnomeAskedHelp(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:a0742eda-d8b3-4159-8cc7-8b39e72252a8
msgctxt "h36b962e4g9eb6g4abeg8173gdc70b1103234"
msgid ""
"Hear me out - our friends are trapped in the cave-in. And I know a way to "
"get them out."
msgstr "제 말을 들어보세요, 저희 친구들이 이 안에 갇혔어요. 그리고 제가 그들을 빼낼 방법을 알아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = a0780dae-226b-4551-a107-bf4af096917a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ArguingGnomes_State_Inconsolable = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:a0780dae-226b-4551-a107-bf4af096917a
msgctxt "h905dbb0cg0154g4417gab00g1becb5b9017c"
msgid "<i>Monster. </i>Get away from me."
msgstr "<i>괴물. </i>내게서 떨어져."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = a12174b1-0530-bb4f-e43a-6e29cdd5045b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:a12174b1-0530-bb4f-e43a-6e29cdd5045b
msgctxt "h9a547575gc625g4d77g997bg138127df71fd"
msgid "AHHH!"
msgstr "<b>아아아아</b>!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = a3addc62-1b93-40ff-8d89-009332f764d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_ArguingGnomes_HasMet(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:a3addc62-1b93-40ff-8d89-009332f764d6
msgctxt "hcaf23d93g15ecg4a58gb214gc32d1401dc3f"
msgid "Quiet, Lunkbug. The walls have ears."
msgstr "조용히 해, 렁크벅. 벽에도 귀가 있으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a60cca7e-9e9c-85d7-1239-6ee3f9438258
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:a60cca7e-9e9c-85d7-1239-6ee3f9438258
msgctxt "he09251adg2c1bg4f23gaef5gfa996d4bb80b"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = a6e3c43c-e6ca-4cf4-a679-66408ca97348
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ArguingGnomes_Quest_Accepted = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:a6e3c43c-e6ca-4cf4-a679-66408ca97348
msgctxt "hcb138409g2b31g42b2ga8feg0d787bd1f154"
msgid "Beldron's still trapped. Find Philomeen and get that smokepowder!"
msgstr "벨드론이 아직 갇혀있어요. 필로민을 찾아서 화약을 가져오세요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = aa3695f0-537c-32a1-ae2c-d94b14298400
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:aa3695f0-537c-32a1-ae2c-d94b14298400
msgctxt "h16532213g1bf7g4005gb98cg18dbabb98266"
msgid ""
"*The gnomes speak in soft whispers, the words all but lost in the hot air.*"
msgstr "*노움들이 부드럽게 속삭이며 대화하고 있지만, 뜨거운 열기에 묻혀 소리는 들리지 않습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = ab4c3cc7-8974-4526-100e-d42d4111578c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:ab4c3cc7-8974-4526-100e-d42d4111578c
msgctxt "h2c80f797g5293g4dd6ga70ag016bbbfad2b9"
msgid ""
"She can't have taken it all with her, Bug - she must have squirreled some "
"away."
msgstr "그녀 혼자서 그걸 다 가져가지는 못했을 거야, 벅. 분명 조금은 남겨뒀을 거라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aeffde3f-0c7f-4b51-8892-1e42d5050e8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:aeffde3f-0c7f-4b51-8892-1e42d5050e8a
msgctxt "h81f25549gd6d2g4242g844fg9272dd26649f"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = afb96a34-1ee9-42e3-a59a-471f35125eef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:afb96a34-1ee9-42e3-a59a-471f35125eef
msgctxt "hb98421edgafbeg4516g9218g04fc0b5096b3"
msgid "Please, please don't hurt my Phil, I beg you."
msgstr "제발, 제발 필을 해치진 마세요, 부탁이에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = afc5c5af-65c5-f54a-37ac-ba76ebe97d6d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_PanicRoom_State_GnomePermaDefeated = True
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_HiddenGnome_HasVial(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_ArguingGnomes_State_SaidEscapeeDead = True
#.     - UND_GnomeWorkerSilly_Event_ToldLunkbugHasPowderq = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:afc5c5af-65c5-f54a-37ac-ba76ebe97d6d
msgctxt "hcdac4a82g13f4g4b67gbba8gedf20f202912"
msgid "Philomeen's done for. I have the powder."
msgstr "필로민은 이제 끝장났어. 내가 화약 가루를 챙겼지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = afcad4b7-9b91-4958-bd2b-0eb3a3af639d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 21c03dec-2722-a9a6-a95e-75236b3d2e15_LariddaSaidNo = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:afcad4b7-9b91-4958-bd2b-0eb3a3af639d
msgctxt "h2785b1e6g472cg4425gac18gffbb45b62d0e"
msgid "I've... I've got no choice, Laridda. We have to chance it."
msgstr "나... 나도 다른 선택지가 없어, 라리다. 위험을 감수할 수밖에."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = b40cadba-734e-4dec-b958-af12e728cc58
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_GnomeWorkerSilly_HasScroll(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:b40cadba-734e-4dec-b958-af12e728cc58
msgctxt "he4f9daf6gb878g4216g803agfe344f874ddb"
msgid "I - shit. The scroll's gone."
msgstr "난 - 젠장. 두루마리가 사라졌잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b6d68ad4-d730-031d-932a-8a3c7f5221d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_Mutineers_Event_SaidTalkApprentice = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:b6d68ad4-d730-031d-932a-8a3c7f5221d5
msgctxt "h43d1ad9fge4efg4e89g8873g31c3b7791ead"
msgid "I heard a gnome escaped. Tell me what you know."
msgstr "어떤 노움이 탈출했다던데. 아는 바를 말해 줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b7b4c764-7dd3-42a7-b845-a3d5ee132447
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_ArguingGnomes_Event_AskedAboutSituation(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_ArguingGnomes_Event_AskedAboutSituation(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:b7b4c764-7dd3-42a7-b845-a3d5ee132447
msgctxt "h52fc9a37g9e08g4742gbe91g9f5c61cb53d0"
msgid "What's going on here?"
msgstr "뭘 하는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = b8be5a92-11a0-c844-7e10-7eac8b9965db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:b8be5a92-11a0-c844-7e10-7eac8b9965db
msgctxt "he38dffe8g3e22g4decgb7d2ge5d9c9e6a0a3"
msgid "Incredible news. Drop it near the cave-in and set it alight!"
msgstr "정말 좋은 소식이군요. 낙석 근처에 놓고 불을 붙여요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b9f81f36-563f-5e6f-9297-ed154a8c8a4b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_ArguingGnomes_Quest_Accepted = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:b9f81f36-563f-5e6f-9297-ed154a8c8a4b
msgctxt "hbe7cf3d0g2f02g4b8fga659g10e2c3bd2b8f"
msgid "I'll do what I can."
msgstr "내가 한번 찾아볼게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ba96aac5-ea7f-1c6d-28e7-21545cdd001e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:ba96aac5-ea7f-1c6d-28e7-21545cdd001e
msgctxt "h836a2f24g1786g4e2ag8a5dgcd25311bdacd"
msgid "Smokepowder. Information. NOW."
msgstr "화약. 정보. <b>당장</b>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bb550050-cc13-4db2-92eb-4c019ac921ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ArguingGnomes_Event_EavesdropSuccess = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:bb550050-cc13-4db2-92eb-4c019ac921ae
msgctxt "h908198b2gba7ag4457g9877gf7b5cedddfb0"
msgid "Listen - I can help you. Act frightened, or you'll draw suspicion."
msgstr "들어봐, 내가 당신들을 도울 수 있어. 겁에 질린 척을 해, 아니면 저들이 수상하게 여길 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = bf0aa0b6-eb29-c094-fcc3-2ec157b39369
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:bf0aa0b6-eb29-c094-fcc3-2ec157b39369
msgctxt "hb7793965gabdfg4c4cga621g91cf91723fa0"
msgid "Praise Ironhand. Laridda - our prayers are answered!"
msgstr "아이언핸드시여, 만세. 라리다, 우리 기도에 응답하신 거야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = c370bd4c-8a81-268d-3333-a49b5f69d5aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:c370bd4c-8a81-268d-3333-a49b5f69d5aa
msgctxt "h86303917g73d8g48d3g99a9g932c5d6fd323"
msgid "Damn it, Laridda. We've lost enough of us. I'm not losing Beldron, too."
msgstr "망할, 라리다. 이미 많은 이들을 잃었어. 벨드론까지 잃을 수는 없다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = c3febc88-1cbe-454a-bf25-0de6f700431d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:c3febc88-1cbe-454a-bf25-0de6f700431d
msgctxt "hb054beddgfcd2g4114gace2g85cabe35939a"
msgid ""
"I'm... I'm sure Beldron can give you something once he's out. Please, just "
"listen."
msgstr "전... 분명 벨드론이 탈출하면, 당신에게 줄 게 있을 거예요. 제발, 한번 들어봐요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = c4176581-d25b-a3bb-e661-688aaa2427d8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:c4176581-d25b-a3bb-e661-688aaa2427d8
msgctxt "hfd4b7c25gb914g4a82gbd91ga6c872aa3e2e"
msgid ""
"Laridda. We're hardly overburdened with friends down here. Let's hear him "
"out."
msgstr "라리다. 이 아래에 우리 편은 거의 없잖아. 그의 말을 들어보자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = c4176581-d25b-a3bb-e661-688aaa2427d8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:c4176581-d25b-a3bb-e661-688aaa2427d8
msgctxt "h70c7f381gba83g4de7gadb8g698cedfb5780"
msgid ""
"Laridda. We're hardly overburdened with friends down here. Let's hear her "
"out."
msgstr "라리다. 이 아래에 우리 편은 거의 없잖아. 그녀의 말을 들어보자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = c4176581-d25b-a3bb-e661-688aaa2427d8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:c4176581-d25b-a3bb-e661-688aaa2427d8
msgctxt "h26fb62aag69a2g4397gb93bg46173c53f144"
msgid ""
"Laridda. We're hardly overburdened with friends down here. Let's hear them "
"out."
msgstr "라리다. 이 아래에 우리 편은 거의 없잖아. 그들의 말을 들어보자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = c5629218-645b-3cfd-f839-e1ded69425f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:c5629218-645b-3cfd-f839-e1ded69425f2
msgctxt "h71c2543fg8082g4699gb27ag50735d6dc665"
msgid ""
"Get us out of here. <i>All</i> of us. And hope for her sake her path never "
"crosses mine again."
msgstr "우리를 여기서 내보내 줘요. <i>전부</i> 말이에요. 그리고 그녀와 내가 다시는 마주치지 않길 바라요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c9790662-a165-5e92-a350-d3a0ff340197
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_GnomeWorkerSilly_Event_ToldLunkbugHasPowderq = False
#.   Object:
#.      - HasTaggedItem_EXPLOSIVES(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_GnomeWorkerSilly_Event_ToldLunkbugHasPowderq = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:c9790662-a165-5e92-a350-d3a0ff340197
msgctxt "h48c3f2e2g5123g4e40g94e8g7523a5561338"
msgid "I've got explosive powder. That should open the way."
msgstr "화약 가루를 가져왔지. 이거면 열릴 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = cb2b1256-ae01-4e6f-bccb-d7f6e7a82d53
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(6) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:cb2b1256-ae01-4e6f-bccb-d7f6e7a82d53
msgctxt "hc13669c3g1c0dg402bg8852g6d71237c3f77"
msgid ""
"High-powered explosives do sound fun, but must we waste them saving lives?"
msgstr "강력한 화약이라면 재밌을 것 같긴 한데, 그런 걸 꼭 생명을 구하는 데 낭비해야 하나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = cb55fffd-4ba4-699a-92ba-333696bd5cf9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(7) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:cb55fffd-4ba4-699a-92ba-333696bd5cf9
msgctxt "h387f900cg9b07g4430g8912g6bbcfffc01a2"
msgid ""
"Thulla said to free her friends - <i>all</i> of them. We need to bust that "
"wall open. And those explosives will do the trick."
msgstr "툴라가 자기 친구 <i>모두를</i> 구해달라고 했어. 저 벽을 뚫어야 해. 그리고 화약이 그 일에 딱 맞겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce561966-6d81-7d97-18e6-98091fbbf58e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_ArguingGnomes_Event_PromisedSafety(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:ce561966-6d81-7d97-18e6-98091fbbf58e
msgctxt "h1662a20fgac2fg420dgade0g832de2326cff"
msgid "To protect the innocent is my call. Trust me. I won't fail you."
msgstr "무고한 자들을 지키는 것이 내 소명이야. 날 믿어. 당신들을 실망시키지 않을 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = cffe180e-ca6a-6301-2ed2-1481397a6618
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GNOME(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:cffe180e-ca6a-6301-2ed2-1481397a6618
msgctxt "h8304f74eg1b7eg45c2g887cgb175e674342e"
msgid "Laridda. A kindred gnome. Maybe..."
msgstr "라리다. 노움 동족이잖아. 어쩌면..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = d4ff4a37-d1bf-7f94-bd84-0db78281cab4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_ArguingGnomes_HasMet(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:d4ff4a37-d1bf-7f94-bd84-0db78281cab4
msgctxt "h17a5d97bg0b6eg4cd3g8c1cgc00e592ba803"
msgid "Lunkbug, hush. We're being watched."
msgstr "렁크벅, 조용히 해. 우린 감시당하고 있으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = d7899cb8-713f-461d-ab1a-7b9d0656af5f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:d7899cb8-713f-461d-ab1a-7b9d0656af5f
msgctxt "hc662bed9g055dg4665ga540g9808d2c91afe"
msgid "We set a spot for hiding if someone found trouble. I'll mark your map."
msgstr "우리끼리 문제가 생기면 찾아갈 장소를 정해뒀었어요. 당신 지도에 표시해 줄게요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = d7f20e5a-5f8a-406e-b04c-2e1c74a39f70
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:d7f20e5a-5f8a-406e-b04c-2e1c74a39f70
msgctxt "h7cc5c42fgc740g4061g8302g7a187b2bb96f"
msgid ""
"Forget the smokepowder - they'd kill Phil on the spot. I won't let you do it."
msgstr "화약은 잊어버려, 놈들은 필을 보자마자 죽여버릴 거야. 네가 그렇게 하게 둘 수는 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dd190bf1-8940-5f44-aebd-8ddd193d6c97
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_NereMindMeld_Event_SucceededCheck = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:dd190bf1-8940-5f44-aebd-8ddd193d6c97
msgctxt "h4860ad28g6dd2g4a0fg8cd5g54d15b098be3"
msgid "I have news: half the trapped gnomes are already dead."
msgstr "전해줄 소식이 있어: 안에 갇힌 노움 중 절반은 이미 죽었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = dd6ef327-a77d-a52f-dcb0-b5e116a31917
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_ArguingGnomes_Event_FailedPersuasion(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:dd6ef327-a77d-a52f-dcb0-b5e116a31917
msgctxt "h7a4307e2g4774g415fg9817gc518d9e7d483"
msgid ""
"Meaningless words, Lunkbug - that's all they are. Now get back to digging."
msgstr "의미 없는 말이야, 렁크벅. 그것뿐이라고. 이제 다시 파는 데 집중하자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = de825978-e99d-4805-a5a3-7e7e1b1fab9c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:de825978-e99d-4805-a5a3-7e7e1b1fab9c
msgctxt "h9cc58391g58d7g4ca3g8607gd3d2d8e532b4"
msgid "You better not harm a damned hair on her head."
msgstr "그녀의 머리털 하나라도 다치게 하지 말아야 할 거예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = df1d33c5-9e7e-4014-abbb-109aa981cd85
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:df1d33c5-9e7e-4014-abbb-109aa981cd85
msgctxt "hec439c2eg4934g4f68g8f31gb835e254446a"
msgid "No. No - it can't be. I <i>told</i> you, Lunkbug."
msgstr "안 돼. 안 돼 - 그럴 수는 없어. 내가 <i>말했잖아</i>, 렁크벅."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = e01633f2-ddc0-4b08-a0ce-6584766902e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:e01633f2-ddc0-4b08-a0ce-6584766902e2
msgctxt "h4f5fee25g57b3g47b5g8f18g51979f8e75dd"
msgid "Smokepowder? No, no - you misheard..."
msgstr "화약이라고요? 아니, 아니에요, 잘못 들으신 것 같은데요..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = e051d049-897b-6f15-b529-78af2d691433
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_ArguingGnomes_HasMet(2) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_ArguingGnomes_Event_EavesdropSuccess = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:e051d049-897b-6f15-b529-78af2d691433
msgctxt "h193ab511g2ddeg4309g9cb5g05e1d591c6b8"
msgid "We'll never get through. We <i>need</i> that smokepowder."
msgstr "절대 잔해를 다 치울 수 없을 거야. 그 화약이 <i>필요하다고</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e485d8bc-c530-4fb9-ad2d-64c2e71e68bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_ArguingGnomes_Quest_Refused = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:e485d8bc-c530-4fb9-ad2d-64c2e71e68bb
msgctxt "h04820a03g4facg4fd2gb5b8gee6e5a3bf894"
msgid "My hands are full as it is. Ask someone else."
msgstr "내 일도 바빠서. 다른 사람을 찾아봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = e5f29399-92e2-5382-bb4e-8e24f779e442
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_ArguingGnomes_Event_PromisedSafety(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:e5f29399-92e2-5382-bb4e-8e24f779e442
msgctxt "h2d1fbc5ag0479g4713g9a31gff4404133565"
msgid "But you said... oh hells. I told you, Bug!"
msgstr "하지만 당신이... 이런 세상에. 내가 말했잖아, 벅!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e8ae6569-2e87-e4da-72b1-a68936950d6b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ArguingGnomes_Event_EavesdropSuccess = True
#.      - UND_PanicRoom_State_GnomePermaDefeated = False
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_HiddenGnome_HasVial(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_ArguingGnomes_State_SaidEscapeeSafe = True
#.     - UND_GnomeWorkerSilly_Event_ToldLunkbugHasPowderq = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:e8ae6569-2e87-e4da-72b1-a68936950d6b
msgctxt "hf2799a13g2239g4f71gbe30ga299d116265b"
msgid "Do you mean Philomeen? She's safe. I have the powder."
msgstr "필로민 말인가? 그녀라면 안전해. 내가 가루를 가지고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e9d2f409-8a50-3994-b3c1-10cb3feca22b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_ArguingGnomes_Event_PromisedSafety(2) = True
#. TagRule: PALADIN_DEVOTION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:e9d2f409-8a50-3994-b3c1-10cb3feca22b
msgctxt "h96c5790dg423dg4120g94e9gea3d00be9696"
msgid ""
"You have nothing to fear when Lunkbug is such a loyal friend. Let me help."
msgstr "렁크벅이 그렇게 충실한 친구라면 두려운 것이 없겠어. 내가 돕게 해줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e9d2f409-8a50-3994-b3c1-10cb3feca22b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_ArguingGnomes_Event_PromisedSafety(2) = True
#. TagRule: PALADIN_VENGEANCE and NOT_FOR_EA
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:e9d2f409-8a50-3994-b3c1-10cb3feca22b
msgctxt "hca4bf58dgef24g405aga908gde4d22a63d78"
msgid ""
"If Nere does <i>anything</i> to you, I will reply in kind. Tell me what you "
"know."
msgstr "니어가 당신에게 <i>무슨 짓</i>이라도 한다면, 내가 되갚아 줄게. 당신이 아는 걸 말해 줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e9d2f409-8a50-3994-b3c1-10cb3feca22b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_ArguingGnomes_Event_PromisedSafety(2) = True
#. TagRule: OATHBREAKER
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:e9d2f409-8a50-3994-b3c1-10cb3feca22b
msgctxt "ha72baf30g9958g409dg8571ga37e37f55a13"
msgid "I will free you from the yoke of Nere. Tell me what you know."
msgstr "내가 당신을 니어의 멍에에서 해방해 줄게. 당신이 아는 바를 말해 줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e9d2f409-8a50-3994-b3c1-10cb3feca22b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_ArguingGnomes_Event_PromisedSafety(2) = True
#. TagRule: GNOME
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:e9d2f409-8a50-3994-b3c1-10cb3feca22b
msgctxt "h0779a736g18e3g4d33gbadbg875097526aee"
msgid ""
"Fear not, sister. You are under <i>my</i> protection. Tell me what you know."
msgstr "두려워 마, 자매여. 당신은 <i>내</i> 보호 아래 있으니까. 당신이 아는 바를 말해 줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e9d2f409-8a50-3994-b3c1-10cb3feca22b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_ArguingGnomes_Event_PromisedSafety(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:e9d2f409-8a50-3994-b3c1-10cb3feca22b
msgctxt "h3dd5fb35g3406g4e85g9d02ga70ce2f2a8a2"
msgid "Fear not, gnome. I will protect you. Tell me what you know."
msgstr "두려워 마, 노움. 내가 당신을 지켜줄 테니까. 당신이 아는 바를 말해 줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ec8e4417-4024-7f58-aac1-67c7af986c5c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_HiddenGnome_Event_BreakingUp = True
#.      - UND_ArguingGnomes_State_SaidEscapeeDead = False
#.      - UND_ArguingGnomes_State_SaidEscapeeSafe = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_ArguingGnomes_State_SaidEscapeeDead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:ec8e4417-4024-7f58-aac1-67c7af986c5c
msgctxt "h36f4503dg215bg4a97g8e1bg2ed13b74bfab"
msgid "Bad news, I'm afraid. Philomeen is - gone."
msgstr "나쁜 소식이야. 안타깝게도, 필로민은... 끝났어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = ec977866-26ad-40a1-a8cf-b8e6a39febbd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:ec977866-26ad-40a1-a8cf-b8e6a39febbd
msgctxt "hf117a1d0g75acg4adcg8154g6b447c2b052a"
msgid "Philomeen's gone. And if she's smart, she won't be coming back."
msgstr "필로민은 이제 없어. 그리고 그녀가 똑똑하다면, 돌아올 일은 없겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ecf3a7f9-d062-f389-f414-a408a56a083e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_PanicRoom_State_GnomePermaDefeated = True
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_HiddenGnome_HasVial(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_ArguingGnomes_State_SaidEscapeeDead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:ecf3a7f9-d062-f389-f414-a408a56a083e
msgctxt "hf94eac0cgfff6g4d82g9256g3352d2b52ccc"
msgid "Philomeen is - gone."
msgstr "필로민은... 이제 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = ee269a20-0dbf-4c57-848c-ff139c751467
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 21c03dec-2722-a9a6-a95e-75236b3d2e15_LariddaSaidNo = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:ee269a20-0dbf-4c57-848c-ff139c751467
msgctxt "h421e629agacf3g4715ga772g724a95562543"
msgid "Lunkbug, <i>don't.</i>"
msgstr "렁크벅, <i>그러지 마.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ee9f6775-0c65-1e9f-d21b-367a31269af0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 5
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ArguingGnomes_Event_EavesdropSuccess = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GNOME(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:ee9f6775-0c65-1e9f-d21b-367a31269af0
msgctxt "h24c6a6degea31g46eeg92d9g1a2af1218fa6"
msgid ""
"<i>Recite a gnomish call to action. </i>'Carpa bal' -<i> 'Together, "
"mighty.'</i>"
msgstr "<i>노움의 소명을 암송한다. </i>'카르파 발' -<i> '함께라면, 강하다.'</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = efac0b3c-9800-ac81-6d80-abf8cf2b05e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:efac0b3c-9800-ac81-6d80-abf8cf2b05e8
msgctxt "h0d58cd85g12b1g4673gbd50g41b405f1bb43"
msgid "You - you can do that? I mean of course. Of course, True Soul."
msgstr "그런 - 그런 걸 할 수 있다고요? 제 말은, 물론. 물론 할 수 있으시겠죠, 참된 영혼님."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = f1a87ba3-b14b-4491-b5a6-ce3877a47a00
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:f1a87ba3-b14b-4491-b5a6-ce3877a47a00
msgctxt "h06cd50d5g9ee3g4540g87ffgd2940c3514c2"
msgid "Laridda. She speaks the maxim. She can help."
msgstr "라리다. 그녀가 격언을 말하고 있잖아. 그녀가 도울 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = f1a87ba3-b14b-4491-b5a6-ce3877a47a00
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:f1a87ba3-b14b-4491-b5a6-ce3877a47a00
msgctxt "h02a82538g87c0g4710g8df8g7765e9ab88b1"
msgid "Laridda. He speaks the maxim. He can help."
msgstr "라리다. 그가 격언을 말하고 있잖아. 그가 도울 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = f1a87ba3-b14b-4491-b5a6-ce3877a47a00
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:f1a87ba3-b14b-4491-b5a6-ce3877a47a00
msgctxt "hc1390186gf450g4b43ga973g6c3e25d4fb8c"
msgid "Laridda. They speak the maxim. They can help."
msgstr "라리다. 그들이 격언을 말하고 있잖아. 그들이 도울 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f3d148b1-1ff8-40cd-963f-88018f15204c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:f3d148b1-1ff8-40cd-963f-88018f15204c
msgctxt "h95ad6568g4b67g47d4g98a0g9bc3e3890314"
msgid "That sounds like quite the drama. I can't wait to watch."
msgstr "그것참 흥미로울 것 같은데. 빨리 보고 싶은걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = f4942e1a-4b3b-42be-a5f1-48b25f33dea9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DuergarSergeant_State_PermaDefeated = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:f4942e1a-4b3b-42be-a5f1-48b25f33dea9
msgctxt "h4594ffbfg7785g4c85g83a8g110847afee81"
msgid ""
"Tell the sergeant where she went - Beldron's still trapped with that maniac "
"Nere!"
msgstr "하사관에게 그녀가 어디로 갔는지 말하면 되잖아, 벨드론이 아직 저 미치광이 니어와 함께 갇혀있다고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f6f42e2d-056f-c36f-f85c-bbac3cb0abdf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ArguingGnomes_Event_EavesdropSuccess = True
#.      - UND_PanicRoom_State_GnomePermaDefeated = True
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_HiddenGnome_HasVial(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_ArguingGnomes_State_SaidEscapeeDead = True
#.     - UND_GnomeWorkerSilly_Event_ToldLunkbugHasPowderq = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:f6f42e2d-056f-c36f-f85c-bbac3cb0abdf
msgctxt "hf0eeaa4fgacdbg4414g95ffg7fe3aaf43a1b"
msgid "Do you mean Philomeen? She's done for. I have the powder."
msgstr "필로민 말인가? 그 여자는 끝장났어. 내가 화약 가루를 챙겼지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = f7d180ca-febc-45f0-a2e7-169bfc21aeba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:f7d180ca-febc-45f0-a2e7-169bfc21aeba
msgctxt "h9efc0ce0g95f7g434fgaf16g052494103872"
msgid "No! <i>I told you, Bug.</i>"
msgstr "안 돼! <i>내가 말했잖아, 벅.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Apprentice Laridda
#. NodeID = f99a2791-24c5-40ac-8afe-2f69362cdc28
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:f99a2791-24c5-40ac-8afe-2f69362cdc28
msgctxt "h9ac8c75bg3cd6g4e20gb369gec4f9b352441"
msgid "Ghosts? N-no. That can't be. This must be a joke."
msgstr "귀신이라고요? 아-아니. 그럴 리가 없어요. 농담하시는 거겠죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = fddba38f-7d2e-c02e-797a-91b3ef94bcde
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ArguingGnomes:fddba38f-7d2e-c02e-797a-91b3ef94bcde
msgctxt "hadc9acf4gad19g4fb4ga5d8ged632c9e3752"
msgid ""
"If we recovered those explosives, we could free Thulla's friends with one "
"blast, then move on."
msgstr "우리가 그 폭발물을 회수하면, 폭발 한 번으로 툴라의 친구들을 구할 수 있을 거야, 그리고 다시 이동하는 거지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 0c092d75-6cd4-3d11-686f-6f803cd0430c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern:0c092d75-6cd4-3d11-686f-6f803cd0430c
msgctxt "h07a9d7b6g67f9g4a2cga653ge0dc91c0eacb"
msgid "Broken as an old heart, and nothing but dust inside."
msgstr "오래된 심장처럼 망가졌네. 안에 먼지만 가득하고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 11a44fe9-f954-f819-c80c-75d93fb3918e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern:11a44fe9-f954-f819-c80c-75d93fb3918e
msgctxt "h5efb1e45g6e00g43e2g8713g14480ccb43fa"
msgid "Broken trash. It's just full of dust."
msgstr "망가진 쓰레기네. 먼지만 잔뜩 있잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 153a2b47-1815-bc2c-cf1a-2f0248254cfd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern:153a2b47-1815-bc2c-cf1a-2f0248254cfd
msgctxt "hd4a2fe6bg4bd4g4255gbe7fge8f160d4ef12"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 1723dc6a-67cc-315e-824e-75a292457b96
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - UND_BrokenMoonLantern_HasMet(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern:1723dc6a-67cc-315e-824e-75a292457b96
msgctxt "ha6d275fegf68ag4efag8f12g667df3acf5c8"
msgid ""
"*An object catches your eye - a lantern, it seems, though no light flickers "
"within.*"
msgstr "*한 물체가 눈길을 끕니다 - 등불처럼 보이는데, 빛이 깜박이진 않습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 217d66ba-8bd5-7a9d-9a5b-be50d7772673
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_BrokenLantern_State_TriedArcane(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_BrokenLantern_State_TriedArcane(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern:217d66ba-8bd5-7a9d-9a5b-be50d7772673
msgctxt "hf72ebb4eg1f44g4e45g9d14g2edf7f3a7c2d"
msgid "<i>Examine the dust within the lantern.</i>"
msgstr "<i>등불 안에 있는 먼지를 조사한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 2f02caa4-8bbf-7285-a583-50e50a38f839
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(5) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern:2f02caa4-8bbf-7285-a583-50e50a38f839
msgctxt "h439ecabagceedg4d98g900cg5bddf09aab76"
msgid ""
"It's broken. And I'm not sure I want to brave the cursed land without it."
msgstr "부서졌군. 그리고 이 물건 없이 저주받은 땅에 용감하게 들어가고 싶지는 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 36b06f3e-726c-4e7e-ba04-5eae18ffefad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern:36b06f3e-726c-4e7e-ba04-5eae18ffefad
msgctxt "ha1b72a25ga63dg4ca9ga881gfd1eb1e6e16e"
msgid "Wonder if that's one of those Moonlanterns."
msgstr "이게 그 달등불이라는 건지 궁금한걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 3a1f3eca-50cc-083f-0afb-2228f325ccb8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(5) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern:3a1f3eca-50cc-083f-0afb-2228f325ccb8
msgctxt "h65be5398g98d1g47c2ga770g4733f550b772"
msgid ""
"Never seen a lantern like this - just a sprinkling of dust at the bottom."
msgstr "이런 등불은 처음 보는데. 바닥에 먼지만 조금 뿌려져 있을 뿐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 4b23e0cc-a7a2-4158-98aa-15d2322c048b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern:4b23e0cc-a7a2-4158-98aa-15d2322c048b
msgctxt "h3e843356g7d3ag4083ga5bfg0fbb293a99a8"
msgid "The Moonlantern. Not as theatrical as I expected."
msgstr "달등불이야. 예상한 것만큼 극적이진 않네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 56eef273-5445-ba1b-c6c1-2ad6c4b5bcc4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(6) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern:56eef273-5445-ba1b-c6c1-2ad6c4b5bcc4
msgctxt "hc23234f0g9728g4465gb023gb0bf2a1764c0"
msgid "A broken trinket. Beyond repair from the looks of it."
msgstr "부서진 장신구군. 척 보기에도 수리하기엔 글렀어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 58ac49f8-1642-2243-a2de-31c0ca4182b4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern:58ac49f8-1642-2243-a2de-31c0ca4182b4
msgctxt "h6edfd4abg666bg474fg8fc0gc38c8a75b5de"
msgid "Broken. And there's dust inside it..."
msgstr "망가졌어. 안에는 먼지까지 있네..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 592054a6-f8db-a8d1-7705-ec64998f1112
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern:592054a6-f8db-a8d1-7705-ec64998f1112
msgctxt "h07829e9fge20dg4bdegb4a5ga2c40756d71d"
msgid "Damn. Too broken to help us through the shadows."
msgstr "젠장. 그림자를 뚫고 나아가는 데 도움을 줄 수 없을 정도로 망가졌군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 5bcdc8c6-0a7c-4a0d-b5ab-6fee99a361dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(5) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern:5bcdc8c6-0a7c-4a0d-b5ab-6fee99a361dc
msgctxt "h8145b38cgce87g400ag88efg032cee5c4c1b"
msgid "The Moonlantern. It must be."
msgstr "달등불이야. 틀림없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5dc0a5e2-00cf-001e-dc8a-97b883cf09c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern:5dc0a5e2-00cf-001e-dc8a-97b883cf09c2
msgctxt "h7061cbc4gb18ag4f7ag9febgc4174b509e07"
msgid "*Nothing about the lantern strikes you as unusual.*"
msgstr "*등불에서 특이한 점은 보이지 않습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 66fc98dc-a480-7a4d-21ae-494e3c378f79
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_BrokenLantern_State_TriedHistory(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_BrokenLantern_State_TriedHistory(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern:66fc98dc-a480-7a4d-21ae-494e3c378f79
msgctxt "h7e569239g044bg43c3ga1b6g7e380821d3b1"
msgid "<i>Inspect the lantern in more detail.</i>"
msgstr "<i>등불을 더 자세히 조사한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 6dc3c875-c167-90ba-17eb-b5bc6acb7f81
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern:6dc3c875-c167-90ba-17eb-b5bc6acb7f81
msgctxt "h8dc8a438g172ag49b9gac6cg328755a259ad"
msgid "Broken. This might make passing the cursed lands... complicated."
msgstr "부서졌군. 이게 저주받은 땅을 통과할 수 있게 해줘야 하는데... 복잡하게 됐어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 6f1e0a30-a6eb-4ae3-8681-00ce1893f3d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern:6f1e0a30-a6eb-4ae3-8681-00ce1893f3d6
msgctxt "hf7db968bgf754g4235g9e9cg85d2b4648e48"
msgid "Is this the Moonlantern...?"
msgstr "이게 달등불...?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 816800d9-0204-4625-968a-8539c9ec34ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(6) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern:816800d9-0204-4625-968a-8539c9ec34ae
msgctxt "hcbbe509cg58b1g4f0dg8b1bgd6fc2c8a1712"
msgid "Must be the Moonlantern - though it's dark as a moonless night within."
msgstr "달등불이 틀림없어. 안은 달없는 밤처럼 어둡지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 82baffe8-875e-c000-239b-2c2c78a9533e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_GaveMoonlanternToParty = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern:82baffe8-875e-c000-239b-2c2c78a9533e
msgctxt "h19afa611g5c1dg47efg854dgb23ba147150c"
msgid "*A broken Moonlantern catches your eye, its glow now snuffed out.*"
msgstr "*망가져서 이제는 불빛이 꺼진 달등불이 눈길을 끕니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 996d74b2-6b4a-4bb4-4794-d5a5994bbfc5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern:996d74b2-6b4a-4bb4-4794-d5a5994bbfc5
msgctxt "h786ae980ga2a9g4a60gae62g2940e6ac39b9"
msgid "*To all appearances, the dust seems quite ordinary.*"
msgstr "*어느 모로 보나 평범한 가루로군요.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = a4f30b96-292e-8400-3789-fc18be8c36f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern:a4f30b96-292e-8400-3789-fc18be8c36f0
msgctxt "he08aaeb7g3cc2g4242g961agbf7ad8959f6c"
msgid "The light's been snuffed out. Only ash at the bottom."
msgstr "불이 꺼졌어. 바닥에는 잿더미만 남았군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a9157bb0-ffe7-0034-daa7-fe6da799f928
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern:a9157bb0-ffe7-0034-daa7-fe6da799f928
msgctxt "h3249fa80g4022g460ega35dg8f6f69ee1989"
msgid "*A thick layer of dust coats the bottom of the lantern.*"
msgstr "*등불 바닥에 두꺼운 먼지 층이 덮여 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = b4bc8bd7-f879-ce39-e993-6d85d0f4a27a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern:b4bc8bd7-f879-ce39-e993-6d85d0f4a27a
msgctxt "h17f020a6gbe5dg4597g8a68g8e68d06ca82f"
msgid ""
"It's broken - it won't save us from a dusky evening, never mind a curse."
msgstr "이건 망가졌어. 저주는커녕 어스름한 저녁으로부터 우리를 구해주지도 못할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = ccfaa456-541d-2d04-f4c9-32be493945c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern:ccfaa456-541d-2d04-f4c9-32be493945c3
msgctxt "hce59ac4bgbc5cg405cgba81g25cb69ede07a"
msgid "Broken. So much for protection from the shadow curse."
msgstr "부서졌어. 그림자 저주를 막아주지는 못할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = d79d8e31-2fd6-426e-a49f-d68506f821c7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern:d79d8e31-2fd6-426e-a49f-d68506f821c7
msgctxt "h41ba1296gfbbeg4448g90adg6d593e42f0de"
msgid "Is this the Moonlantern we've heard so much about?"
msgstr "이게 그 유명한 달등불이란 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = da322411-8733-45b1-f2db-17f61bdaa5ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(6) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern:da322411-8733-45b1-f2db-17f61bdaa5ea
msgctxt "hddfe247fg039bg42c1g9cbfg50113935afd5"
msgid ""
"It's broken, which means we've nothing to protect ourselves from the curse "
"up above."
msgstr "부서졌어. 즉, 위쪽의 저주로부터 우리를 보호해 줄 게 아무것도 없다는 뜻이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = de1654b6-167b-8522-b283-31c731aec11d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern:de1654b6-167b-8522-b283-31c731aec11d
msgctxt "hefffa19egf845g45bega225gcb54430d9e40"
msgid ""
"*This is pixie dust, used to illuminate a lamp - or left behind after a "
"pixie's death.*"
msgstr "*픽시 가루가 있습니다. 등불을 밝히는 데 사용되거나, 픽시가 죽은 후 남겨집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = de621cf7-d1cd-d0a3-5f07-d47c3d8954a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_BrokenMoonlantern:de621cf7-d1cd-d0a3-5f07-d47c3d8954a2
msgctxt "h5150d0c3g9152g485egb4abg9447d20945f0"
msgid ""
"*You see no burner or wick. It was not fuel that lit this lamp, but magic.*"
msgstr "*점화장치나 심지가 보이지 않습니다. 이 등불을 밝히는 것은 연료가 아닌, 마법입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_Bulette_PAD_Reaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = abfde3c0-8e73-40f1-8406-2cff9ca198ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_Bulette_PAD_Reaction:abfde3c0-8e73-40f1-8406-2cff9ca198ae
msgctxt "hfbad7529g7a04g4422g993aga7ab8a4c83e5"
msgid "Hello again, beautiful. Back for more?"
msgstr "또 만났네, 예쁜이. 원하는 게 더 있니?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_Bulette_PAD_Reaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = abfde3c0-8e73-40f1-8406-2cff9ca198ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_Bulette_PAD_Reaction:abfde3c0-8e73-40f1-8406-2cff9ca198ae
msgctxt "h7b3087fagba15g4bdagb6f4ga47d67d577e1"
msgid "My, my. Second time's the charm."
msgstr "저런, 저런. 두 번째엔 행운이 있는 법이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_Bulette_PAD_Reaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = abfde3c0-8e73-40f1-8406-2cff9ca198ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_Bulette_PAD_Reaction:abfde3c0-8e73-40f1-8406-2cff9ca198ae
msgctxt "hf8724950gc432g46d9g8af3ge3bac05c5b7b"
msgid "Last time I played nice - this time, I'm gonna hurt you."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_Bulette_PAD_Reaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = abfde3c0-8e73-40f1-8406-2cff9ca198ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_Bulette_PAD_Reaction:abfde3c0-8e73-40f1-8406-2cff9ca198ae
msgctxt "h6fb1dfadg871eg4302g9212g48debf52c168"
msgid "Back for another go? <i>Let's get started.</i>"
msgstr "한 번 더 하려고? <i>해 보자꾸나.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_Bulette_PAD_Reaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = abfde3c0-8e73-40f1-8406-2cff9ca198ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_Bulette_PAD_Reaction:abfde3c0-8e73-40f1-8406-2cff9ca198ae
msgctxt "h09367525g8a2cg4c83g9ddcg37ef081ff479"
msgid "The message didn't quite sink in, I see."
msgstr "알겠다, 의도가 별로 잘 전달되지 않은 것 같구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_Bulette_PAD_Reaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = abfde3c0-8e73-40f1-8406-2cff9ca198ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_Bulette_PAD_Reaction:abfde3c0-8e73-40f1-8406-2cff9ca198ae
msgctxt "h58a9694eg2a1cg42dfgb6e8gd4075bf711ba"
msgid "Back again? Let's do this!"
msgstr "또 돌아왔어? 해보자!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_Bulette_PAD_Reaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = abfde3c0-8e73-40f1-8406-2cff9ca198ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_Bulette_PAD_Reaction:abfde3c0-8e73-40f1-8406-2cff9ca198ae
msgctxt "h8a18739agc3dcg4dfag80c3ge2fc7d8f1a4c"
msgid "It's back!"
msgstr "돌아왔다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ClericPetGrave
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 14e6997c-07ea-7bf1-486b-b2bcc548d750
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ArcaneTower_Knows_PetGrave = True
#.   Script:
#.      - UND_ClericPetGrave_HasAutumnCrocus = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ClericPetGrave:14e6997c-07ea-7bf1-486b-b2bcc548d750
msgctxt "h0242715bgb1cag4f4dgbd54gae0cea908dc5"
msgid "<i>Put a bundle of autumncrocus next to the tombstone.</i>"
msgstr "<i>묘비 옆에 가을크로커스 묶음을 놓는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ClericPetGrave
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6bcf63c0-a7a6-a843-03f4-2dda2846f322
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_ClericPetGrave_HasMet(1) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC or DRUID or WIZARD
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ClericPetGrave:6bcf63c0-a7a6-a843-03f4-2dda2846f322
msgctxt "hf84b0ab9g6fd8g4bc3g9ba7geb06802ca91d"
msgid ""
"*The rock under your feet juts upwards, forming a perfectly engraved "
"tombstone with a small epitaph.*"
msgstr "*발치에 솟은 바위엔 작은 비문이 적혀 있습니다. 깔끔하게 새겨진 묘비입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ClericPetGrave
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6ee58fb3-53f5-435f-a35c-dcdb74e90f6d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ClericPetGrave_Event_Dug = False
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Shovel_State_HasShovel(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ClericPetGrave:6ee58fb3-53f5-435f-a35c-dcdb74e90f6d
msgctxt "he221a199g92beg4119g9eeagf7fb54c7578c"
msgid "<i>Dig into the dirt with your hands.</i>"
msgstr "<i>손으로 흙 밑을 파본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ClericPetGrave
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 969b42b4-5a22-4884-9233-aafa2c33f21b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ClericPetGrave_Event_Dug = False
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Shovel_State_HasShovel(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_ClericPetGrave_Event_Dug = True
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_ClericPetGrave_Digger(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ClericPetGrave:969b42b4-5a22-4884-9233-aafa2c33f21b
msgctxt "h7e52d734g4a47g4925gbd6dg0b77adc8f82a"
msgid "<i>Dig up the grave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>묘비를 파낸다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ClericPetGrave
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ba770ca4-9e41-4080-f794-fe9f85ebe878
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ClericPetGrave_Event_Dug = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ClericPetGrave:ba770ca4-9e41-4080-f794-fe9f85ebe878
msgctxt "h13f3225bg0427g42feg8268g7f8ab31d9d2f"
msgid ""
"*The ground in front of this tombstone has been dug up, exposing the "
"scattered skeleton of a large dog.*"
msgstr "*묘비 앞의 땅이 파내져, 커다란 개의 뼈가 흐트러진 채 드러납니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ClericPetGrave
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c66725ba-b813-24f0-6033-67672c44acfa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ClericPetGrave:c66725ba-b813-24f0-6033-67672c44acfa
msgctxt "hd97a2275g6befg4e2dg8d5egab9208e43511"
msgid ""
"*The wind softly rustles the flower petals. Somehow, the grave feels whole "
"again.*"
msgstr "*바람이 꽃잎을 부드럽게 스치며 바스락거리는 소리가 들려옵니다. 왠지 무덤이 다시 온전한 느낌이 듭니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ClericPetGrave
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c6c55e2d-f184-fe17-fe98-5442fb3ad572
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_ClericPetGrave_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ClericPetGrave:c6c55e2d-f184-fe17-fe98-5442fb3ad572
msgctxt "he1bf6576g037fg4fd4gaf49g7678b8564d52"
msgid ""
"*The rock under your feet juts upwards, forming a perfectly engraved "
"tombstone with a small epitaph.*"
msgstr "*발치에 솟은 바위엔 작은 비문이 적혀 있습니다. 깔끔하게 새겨진 묘비입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ClericPetGrave
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = cf203ea0-0540-4624-a8c2-dab802887104
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ClericPetGrave:cf203ea0-0540-4624-a8c2-dab802887104
msgctxt "hc7a9d756gc6f5g4b23g9403gf159fd7d8b39"
msgid ""
"*You realise it was made with Stone Shape - a powerful spell to waste on a "
"grave.*"
msgstr "*당신은 이것이 바위 형성을 통해 만들어졌다는 사실을 알아차립니다. 묘비에 낭비되기에는 과한 주문입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ClericPetGrave
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d09edbd8-9289-b86f-3afe-a0dcf67f0317
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ClericPetGrave:d09edbd8-9289-b86f-3afe-a0dcf67f0317
msgctxt "he79e225egd1aeg4c40g9c95g540e94fe2679"
msgid ""
"*As you dig, you slowly expose the skeletal remains of a large dog wearing a "
"chunky leather collar.*"
msgstr "*땅을 파내자, 천천히 두툼한 가죽 목걸이를 한 커다란 개의 뼈가 드러납니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ClericPetGrave
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d120a907-afd0-4fcf-997f-95ac7adb7e68
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ClericPetGrave:d120a907-afd0-4fcf-997f-95ac7adb7e68
msgctxt "h42165264g39f1g414eg8d47g65777110be23"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ClericPetGrave
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d2a0fa8b-a1f1-419d-b507-28a3f4f55492
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ClericPetGrave:d2a0fa8b-a1f1-419d-b507-28a3f4f55492
msgctxt "h31f373f9gc78bg42fbgb74ag7eb583118b82"
msgid ""
"*Your fingers claw at the dirt, losing purchase. If only you had a tool for "
"this.*"
msgstr "*손가락으로 흙을 긁어내 보지만, 역부족입니다. 적절한 도구만 있었더라면.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ClericPetGrave
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d4f2447b-920d-014c-49ad-4d123f669ae8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ClericPetGrave:d4f2447b-920d-014c-49ad-4d123f669ae8
msgctxt "hd3a55f58ga09dg4505g863bgefeb46bd6e58"
msgid ""
"<i>*In memory of Myrna - a shining light in this dark world. \n"
"May you forever gaze upon the lake you loved to play in.*</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>*미르나를 기리며 - 이 어두운 세상을 밝히던 환한 빛. \n"
"네가 뛰어놀기 좋아하던 호수를 영원히 바라볼 수 있기를.*</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ClericPetGrave
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ff72b8b1-3a76-9057-3eb4-e01d1a67cdc8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_ClericPetGrave_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ClericPetGrave:ff72b8b1-3a76-9057-3eb4-e01d1a67cdc8
msgctxt "hce397528gf6e2g4dd4g8443gbaf36a152d44"
msgid ""
"<i>*In memory of Myrna - a shining light in this dark world. \n"
"May you forever gaze upon the lake you loved to play in.*\n"
"</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>*미르나를 기리며 - 이 어두운 세상을 밝히던 환한 빛. \n"
"네가 뛰어놀기 좋아하던 호수를 영원히 바라볼 수 있기를.*\n"
"</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_CorpseDisposer_Companion
