msgctxt "hd327a019gb718g42fdg87ddg174a7f6ca258"
msgid "<i>Travel to Grymforge.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그림포지로 여정을 떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_DuergarBoatAtCave
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a3e02b44-171a-49bb-8fb0-27872f592f35
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_DuergarBoatAtCave:a3e02b44-171a-49bb-8fb0-27872f592f35
msgctxt "h38e664e0g2e81g42e3g9ad1ge13f3d1c3e68"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0126e9b7-1d89-2c0e-2faf-5c80e6416098
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DarkLake_Knows_GnomeHunt = True
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_State_HasBoots(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_DarkLake_InjuredGnome_KillReported = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent:0126e9b7-1d89-2c0e-2faf-5c80e6416098
msgctxt "h89c1df84g0ff0g44ffg9681g2851faff0fe0"
msgid "I seek the sergeant - I believe she's keen to get these boots back."
msgstr "하사관을 찾고 있어, 이 부츠를 되찾고 싶어 할 것 같아서 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = 0b0fa115-37b4-3036-98a9-a583a37cfcad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent:0b0fa115-37b4-3036-98a9-a583a37cfcad
msgctxt "h871b4eddg2bedg4624g9f8bga9e2194a0ddf"
msgid ""
"You got guts floating out here like this. Where's Gekh? <i>Who are you?</i>"
msgstr "여길 항해해서 나오다니, 배짱이 좋군. 게크는 어디 있지? <i>넌 누구야?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = 1391163a-0db5-61e9-1f58-4c891eb74094
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent:1391163a-0db5-61e9-1f58-4c891eb74094
msgctxt "heb0a86eag13d6g458fg8a5dg20b264cee310"
msgid ""
"Come on - let's get you to shore. You're the one telling the sergeant what "
"happened."
msgstr "가자, 호숫가로 데려가 주지. 네가 하사관한테 무슨 일이 있었는지 설명해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = 187fbc62-d8c4-79f3-1083-fc720db9c7c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent:187fbc62-d8c4-79f3-1083-fc720db9c7c8
msgctxt "h97f7631fg1752g44f2g89b6gaa93fb82ab71"
msgid ""
"Well, come on. Let's get you to shore. You'll need to report to the sergeant."
msgstr "자, 가자고. 호숫가로 데려가 주지. 하사관한테 보고해야 할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 198e0c68-d0c3-27a1-c757-c3762130a6bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_State_HasBoots(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_DarkLake_InjuredGnome_KillReported = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent:198e0c68-d0c3-27a1-c757-c3762130a6bb
msgctxt "hfdf3907bgf8fdg45f9gbeedg9301819a0ab4"
msgid "Here they are, safe and sound."
msgstr "여기 있군, 안전하고 건강하게 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = 1cb133c6-d90c-0bcd-0905-47d86ab25331
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent:1cb133c6-d90c-0bcd-0905-47d86ab25331
msgctxt "h853429d9g6948g4ac4g8cc2ge5a0eca785f6"
msgid "More like avoiding the sergeant, I reckon."
msgstr "내 생각엔 하사관을 피하고 싶어 하는 것 같던데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 268789ea-043a-c69e-53a0-2f5a7a473cae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent:268789ea-043a-c69e-53a0-2f5a7a473cae
msgctxt "h779d8cfdg314ag42d6g9e53g17f3ff1dc4b6"
msgid "<i>Reach out to the duergar's parasite.</i>"
msgstr "<i>듀에르가의 기생충에 접촉한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = 2935fbac-a4aa-c902-e271-273391032a85
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent:2935fbac-a4aa-c902-e271-273391032a85
msgctxt "h33d22c60g0c76g4a45g9fcfgf82bd32b7b33"
msgid ""
"Avoiding the sergeant, is he? Can't blame him. She mentioned something 'bout "
"biting his toes off."
msgstr "녀석은 하사관을 피하고 싶은 것 아닌가? 그 자식 탓을 할 순 없지. 그녀가 녀석의 발가락을 잘라버리겠다고 했으니까 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = 2b43b52a-0ab5-78eb-e040-31c50194018b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent:2b43b52a-0ab5-78eb-e040-31c50194018b
msgctxt "h49b35320ge953g4c2ag99d4g804016a6dc95"
msgid "Come back empty-handed again, and you're feeding the fishes."
msgstr "다시 빈손으로 왔다간, 물고기 밥이 될 줄 알아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = 2eb36768-9b6f-2942-a1b7-410b84ef9c14
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DROWELF(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent:2eb36768-9b6f-2942-a1b7-410b84ef9c14
msgctxt "h715140dagb505g4123g8cdbg01b73ea54ab4"
msgid "You there! Drow! Why are you in Gekh's raft?"
msgstr "어이 거기! 드로우! 왜 네가 게크의 배를 타고 있는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = 2ef48a04-d481-6af3-492a-2b194d911880
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent:2ef48a04-d481-6af3-492a-2b194d911880
msgctxt "h89396b9bgc73dg43e2g9096g705af71dd49f"
msgid ""
"I don't care what you've got scrawled on your skin. I don't like your "
"<i>face</i>."
msgstr "네 피부 속에 뭘 숨겨놨는지 따위는 관심 없어. 그냥 네 <i>얼굴이</i> 마음에 안 드는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = 2fa3b05b-a71f-9a2c-49c9-6650d49c3759
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent:2fa3b05b-a71f-9a2c-49c9-6650d49c3759
msgctxt "h1faf9b76ga10cg4fe5g865dged39375b0a0b"
msgid "We aren't expecting more of you. Where's Gekh? <i>Who are you?</i>"
msgstr "사람이 더 온다는 소리는 못 들었는데. 게크는 어디 있지? <i>넌 누구야?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = 32dfd6d1-2840-03d1-aa4d-ba3ab797ea7b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent:32dfd6d1-2840-03d1-aa4d-ba3ab797ea7b
msgctxt "he66eb637g8451g48d8ga5d6g7056f56d8e36"
msgid "The rest of you - keep patrolling. I'll head back with this one."
msgstr "나머지 인원은 순찰을 계속해. 난 이놈이랑 되돌아갈 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = 37480095-8e26-ee70-4f9e-0795b1d34c48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent:37480095-8e26-ee70-4f9e-0795b1d34c48
msgctxt "h1996f5ccg7478g4ef1g9f4bg1ee8abd3e97b"
msgid "Damn - the sergeant'll be pissed 'bout her boots."
msgstr "젠장, 하사관이 신발 가지고 화를 존나 내겠구만."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 38a6ce0a-f447-b417-92ea-0cadec6d5403
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 20
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_LoneDuergar_Quest_DuergarMet = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_DarkLake_State_ClaimedGekhWasDead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent:38a6ce0a-f447-b417-92ea-0cadec6d5403
msgctxt "hc34eb34bgd313g4a6egb5d3g7960ec80a50c"
msgid "Duergar, like you? Saw his body a way back. Myconids got him."
msgstr "너 같은 듀에르가를 말하는 건가? 아까 그의 시체를 봤어. 마이크니드한테 당한 것 같던데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = 3d4b4cc4-0868-92a7-c684-2f710340c69f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_DarkLake_State_HostileResolution = True
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent:3d4b4cc4-0868-92a7-c684-2f710340c69f
msgctxt "h7220cd48g6b25g4ecfga0e2ge637a690d9e2"
msgid "Did I not warn you? Slice 'im up, fellas!"
msgstr "경고하지 않았나? 얘들아, 이놈을 조각내 버려라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = 3d4b4cc4-0868-92a7-c684-2f710340c69f
