msgctxt "h82649dcdg7e7cg4423g93fag542b297a2ba1"
msgid "The Absolute? Not bloody likely. Get them, fellas!"
msgstr "절대자라고? 아닌 것 같은데. 얘들아, 놈들을 잡아!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6c11bb0c-3abc-b527-5913-f728d8e990a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent:6c11bb0c-3abc-b527-5913-f728d8e990a9
msgctxt "h0bf9bed8g3dd1g4d18ga572gb6f5256a67ef"
msgid ""
"*Your parasite stirs briefly, then goes still. The duergar is not infected.*"
msgstr "*기생충이 잠시 요동치더니, 고요해집니다. 이 듀에르가는 감염되지 않았습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = 74ffcdc7-e01b-1ffa-d076-9751014ab069
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent:74ffcdc7-e01b-1ffa-d076-9751014ab069
msgctxt "h847511b3ge27dg43edgb643g18a36702d410"
msgid "Damn it. The sergeant'll be pissed about her boots."
msgstr "젠장. 하사관이 그년 부츠 가지고 화를 존나 내겠구만."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 76afe20b-872c-8046-53fc-759dbd12cb8d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_State_HasBoots(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent:76afe20b-872c-8046-53fc-759dbd12cb8d
msgctxt "hecebc0cagdd8dg4cfcga19fg8f303d2f91f1"
msgid "I haven't found them yet."
msgstr "아직 못 찾았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = 783a0359-6dac-f0a2-d2d9-e902a5ff896a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DEEPGNOME(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent:783a0359-6dac-f0a2-d2d9-e902a5ff896a
msgctxt "h8f196502g1286g44ebgb4a5g774e84171714"
msgid ""
"But he let you go, eh? Suppose he figured the sergeant could sort you out."
msgstr "그런데 널 보내줬다고? 하사관이 대신 처리해 줄 거라 생각했나 보군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = 7f2fcc4e-a3c9-009d-ece6-e2133a0157bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DROWELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent:7f2fcc4e-a3c9-009d-ece6-e2133a0157bf
msgctxt "h2136b9c8g2772g477fga1a0gaf406d0d8548"
msgid "The rest of you - keep patrolling. I'll be heading back with the drow."
msgstr "나머지 인원은 순찰을 계속해. 난 이 드로우랑 다시 돌아갈 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = 7f2fcc4e-a3c9-009d-ece6-e2133a0157bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent:7f2fcc4e-a3c9-009d-ece6-e2133a0157bf
msgctxt "h69bfa8bbg16a7g4e50g868ag90bc9a687cd4"
msgid ""
"The rest of you - keep patrolling. I'll be heading back with the, uh - with "
"this one."
msgstr "나머지 인원은 순찰을 계속해. 난 이, 어 - 이놈이랑 다시 돌아갈 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = 7f2fcc4e-a3c9-009d-ece6-e2133a0157bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DWARF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent:7f2fcc4e-a3c9-009d-ece6-e2133a0157bf
msgctxt "h49ecb6cdgb769g4f1ega786gc7afbd25f8d1"
msgid ""
"The rest of you - keep patrolling. I'll be heading back with the <i>hoon</i> "
"here."
msgstr "나머지 인원은 순찰을 계속해. 난 이 <i>훈</i>이랑 다시 돌아갈 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = 7f2fcc4e-a3c9-009d-ece6-e2133a0157bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent:7f2fcc4e-a3c9-009d-ece6-e2133a0157bf
msgctxt "h366f04fdg7eefg4007gbe4bga454c057153b"
msgid "The rest of you - keep patrolling. I'll be heading back with this one."
msgstr "나머지 인원은 순찰을 계속해. 난 이놈이랑 다시 돌아갈 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 80c849ed-aab7-10d1-d7c0-8b5938d03029
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
