msgid ""
"Move over - I'll take you to shore. You're the one telling the sergeant what "
"happened."
msgstr "거기에 더해서, 널 호숫가로 데려가 주지. 하사관한테 설명은 네가 해야 할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent
