msgstr "망할 <i>드워프</i>. 게크의 배 위에서 뭐 하는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = b1fd29ec-211b-73a1-767b-54e40903ea89
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent:b1fd29ec-211b-73a1-767b-54e40903ea89
msgctxt "h8d061b62g639eg46aegaf50ge3cedc919a1f"
msgid ""
"I will tell you now what the sergeant told Gekh: until you have the boots, "
"you <i>will</i> not cross."
msgstr "하사관이 게크에게 뭐라 말했는지 그대로 알려주지. '부츠를 되찾을 때까진, 지나가지 못한다'."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = b8307b69-9fbc-ed1a-5d86-fae450a168d8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent:b8307b69-9fbc-ed1a-5d86-fae450a168d8
msgctxt "h57d9ec7eg413dg45f9gb455gd864c1cb6de0"
msgid "What about Gekh? Where's he at?"
msgstr "게크는 어쩌고? 그는 어디 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = b89df686-6afd-af89-ef55-752b233d9d5b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
