msgctxt "h084654efg8325g471dg9f73g90fe62867c2b"
msgid ""
"Come on, <i>hoon</i>. You're coming with me. I won't be the one to tell the "
"sergeant what happened."
msgstr "가자, <i>훈</i>. 넌 나랑 가줘야겠어. 내가 하사관한테 설명할 순 없으니까 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DarkLake_RaftEvent
