msgid "I hope you're checking them for loot first?"
msgstr "시체에서 물건은 좀 건졌어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers
#. Speaker = Brathwen
#. NodeID = c3d30c60-25f7-edb6-0d24-e244e76dd580
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers:c3d30c60-25f7-edb6-0d24-e244e76dd580
msgctxt "hff69fc7bga482g41dbg912cg260a19578308"
msgid "What do we do with runaways, Viss?"
msgstr "도망치는 놈이 있으면 어떻게 하더라, 비스?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers
#. Speaker = Brathwen
#. NodeID = c699e3c1-bf57-1e5b-832d-76e60c8c93f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers:c699e3c1-bf57-1e5b-832d-76e60c8c93f2
msgctxt "h2bb2d3f1g31bag49a5g845cga7b490980a70"
msgid "Well?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers
#. Speaker = Brathwen
#. NodeID = cbbacbac-a29e-5683-eeab-ff6526c1ae8d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers:cbbacbac-a29e-5683-eeab-ff6526c1ae8d
msgctxt "h9724e967g1153g402fg998ag6eef45ecb720"
msgid "Too bad. Offer's expired."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = cd509fea-1182-6d99-429b-a32acfa93021
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(5) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_DeadInTheWater_Event_CompanionIntervened = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers:cd509fea-1182-6d99-429b-a32acfa93021
msgctxt "hdaa277f7g14ebg4bd0gbf23g44da1200be5c"
msgid "Ooh, are we killing slavers? Me first!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = cd712fb4-6ac7-35bb-a6f2-ac3c93be0faa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(7) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_DeadInTheWater_Event_CompanionIntervened = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers:cd712fb4-6ac7-35bb-a6f2-ac3c93be0faa
msgctxt "he17e6faag4a8fg406ag8556g0e30ae8196df"
msgid "Go on - get it done. You've got me at your side."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d2d2041a-cd3c-3119-8a0f-299dd1508285
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DeadInTheWater_State_TrinketIsInCorpse = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers:d2d2041a-cd3c-3119-8a0f-299dd1508285
msgctxt "hbfcc5233gab68g47c8ga0c3g6bf1e80512df"
msgid "*You reach for the trinket, but it's already gone.*"
msgstr "*당신은 장신구에 손을 뻗지만 그건 이미 사라진 이후입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers
#. Speaker = Brathwen
#. NodeID = d6834e03-444b-8c53-ce86-ce90a81bb1e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers:d6834e03-444b-8c53-ce86-ce90a81bb1e7
msgctxt "hba39c139g579fg47d4gba13g374dc4facfd4"
msgid ""
"This ain't no funeral - this is taking out the rubbish. They served their "
"purpose, and now they're fish food."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d89d7c3e-25ce-d7e7-2476-f9549641d89d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DeadInTheWater_State_TrinketIsInCorpse = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers:d89d7c3e-25ce-d7e7-2476-f9549641d89d
msgctxt "he9c6881fge941g44e8gb6a8gf2f61bb14a1f"
msgid ""
"*For a moment you thought you'd seen something shining on one of the "
"corpses. Suddenly, it's vanished.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers
#. Speaker = Viss
#. NodeID = d8f356fa-8d06-c905-c239-eaeb3eb8b58c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers:d8f356fa-8d06-c905-c239-eaeb3eb8b58c
msgctxt "h6b2e2d2dgab55g415bgb4f7gcddc5f141945"
msgid "<i>Hmph.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dd226bc7-355d-d972-9780-e2a661115a26
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers:dd226bc7-355d-d972-9780-e2a661115a26
msgctxt "h3e77271fg8722g4bd6ga7c9gde56b512b242"
msgid "Sounds like a lark. I reckon I could kick a corpse farther than you."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers
#. Speaker = Brathwen
#. NodeID = dea87202-5823-5def-cf39-1bb6a138a956
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DEEPGNOME(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposerCompanion_HasMet(2) = True
#.     - UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposerLeader_HasMet(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers:dea87202-5823-5def-cf39-1bb6a138a956
msgctxt "hb47dfc80gf4e4g4de9g9b9bgc6925f786477"
msgid ""
"'Less you're here to kick some stiffs lake-side, I suggest you bugger off."
msgstr "호숫가에서 뻣뻣한 놈들을 걷어차려고 온 게 아니라면, 꺼지는 게 좋을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers
#. Speaker = Brathwen
#. NodeID = e29c15d9-65a6-11e1-6967-cb68c9810e1c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers:e29c15d9-65a6-11e1-6967-cb68c9810e1c
msgctxt "hea4b5ddbgc35eg4d2fga97fg4c3ab1ea3e63"
msgid "You gotta be kidding. These trash don't have nothing on 'em but rocks."
msgstr "농담하냐? 이 쓰레기들이 가진 건 돌덩이 밖에 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e481e607-c557-5d90-be99-a62b9d020c07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers:e481e607-c557-5d90-be99-a62b9d020c07
msgctxt "hc4d1228fg676eg474bg8105g130f612a59a5"
msgid "I don't have the coin."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e4a3d6a5-c42f-a7cf-fc09-d92dad0d5bcb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DeadInTheWater_State_TrinketIsInCorpse = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers:e4a3d6a5-c42f-a7cf-fc09-d92dad0d5bcb
msgctxt "h4dd11e70gf0cag4600ga815gc3e0efb7bf70"
msgid "*You spot a shiny trinket on one of the corpses.*"
msgstr "*당신은 한 시체에서 빛나는 장신구를 발견합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers
#. Speaker = Viss
#. NodeID = e9d90897-71d5-8483-4677-93564d295c14
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers:e9d90897-71d5-8483-4677-93564d295c14
msgctxt "h16bd582bg79c4g4778g836agf12eeab9f892"
msgid "<i>Rocks.</i>"
msgstr "<i>돌덩이.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ed4259ff-6d9f-2f12-cca6-178a03a5433d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_DeadInTheWater_Event_CorpseToTheWater = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers:ed4259ff-6d9f-2f12-cca6-178a03a5433d
msgctxt "h051009beg067dg42afgb791g857ee4330490"
msgid "<i>Get gone.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers
#. Speaker = Brathwen
#. NodeID = faf42de7-2cec-6b9a-8117-0bb83bfbd1a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers:faf42de7-2cec-6b9a-8117-0bb83bfbd1a2
msgctxt "h5bbdd7a4gc151g4af2gbc52g2c6129dd2266"
msgid "Get on with it then, and keep quiet."
msgstr "그럼 시작해, 그리고 조용히 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fd6e5d4d-252c-e063-9fa8-ccdd6f09f3a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DUERGARDWARF(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers:fd6e5d4d-252c-e063-9fa8-ccdd6f09f3a3
msgctxt "h8f9c3afdg51d1g4642g85bag38e53ff2a05e"
msgid "Put your back into it. Lazy bastards."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers
#. Speaker = Brathwen
#. NodeID = ffc0cd64-a662-f3b1-c527-dc3ab4b9e27a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_DeadInTheWater_Event_CorpseToTheWater = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_CorpseDisposers:ffc0cd64-a662-f3b1-c527-dc3ab4b9e27a
msgctxt "hdeb03ad1ge289g4183gaee0g80ecefcf183a"
msgid "I ain't goin' 'til Thrinn <i>tells</i> me to go."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_LootingCorpse
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0620b1f3-702d-e4c5-6e43-4bd72a86c093
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_LootingCorpse:0620b1f3-702d-e4c5-6e43-4bd72a86c093
msgctxt "haa37654bg08aeg4115gbc80g5fae0797eafd"
msgid "<i>Bow your head in respect.</i>"
msgstr "<i>고개를 숙여 존중을 표한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_LootingCorpse
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 06be9749-9f92-1eda-133e-c5f79a83cdab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_LootingCorpse:06be9749-9f92-1eda-133e-c5f79a83cdab
msgctxt "h8d2b7731gaffdg4788g8d8bg666731177d3a"
msgid ""
"Really? Save your prayers for someone who at least had the spine to fight "
"back."
msgstr "진심이야? 기도는 적어도 맞서 싸우기라도 한 자들에게 하라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_LootingCorpse
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 19479b11-58af-338a-0abb-142d3f2e4778
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(6) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_LootingCorpse:19479b11-58af-338a-0abb-142d3f2e4778
msgctxt "h6572c0fdgd5ddg418eg9092gaf7123923ab3"
msgid ""
"Disposed of like rubbish, like scraps. Are there no limits to people's "
"cruelty?"
msgstr "마치 쓰레기나 고철처럼 버려졌군. 사람들의 잔혹함에 한계는 없는 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_LootingCorpse
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 1dbe4687-d090-21a2-ef97-b532444a8b94
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_LootingCorpse:1dbe4687-d090-21a2-ef97-b532444a8b94
msgctxt "hd0e9749fg3583g4d0bg9030g8ae0fe47eae1"
msgid "*Deep gnomes - killed under the yoke of slavers.*"
msgstr "*노예상들의 굴레 아래 살해당한 딥 노움들입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_LootingCorpse
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 31f9de98-7ba3-8dbe-7e2e-a074090de645
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_LootingCorpse:31f9de98-7ba3-8dbe-7e2e-a074090de645
msgctxt "h3e2f627bg1a58g4f3fgb30cg783b2ce7f046"
msgid "They deserved better than they got. May they rest in peace."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_LootingCorpse
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 41c2830a-de95-6a50-5e6d-b2bca13ba1b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_LootingCorpse:41c2830a-de95-6a50-5e6d-b2bca13ba1b8
msgctxt "h94da8605g3ae2g4c08g9f67g7e179821d483"
msgid "I will take the lives of those who took yours."
msgstr "너희 삶을 앗아간 이들의 생명을 내가 빼앗아 주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_LootingCorpse
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 514bf8c1-a11d-b17c-8e3a-ed4542d067d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_LootingCorpse:514bf8c1-a11d-b17c-8e3a-ed4542d067d3
msgctxt "h5fc975c2g66e3g4de8g89d7g0f57c5c2d628"
msgid "Revolting. Corpses carry disease - they must be buried or burned."
msgstr "역겹군. 시체는 질병을 불러오는 법, 불태우거나 매장해야 한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_LootingCorpse
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = abe5700c-99dc-8fc2-f13f-2f1918f2da34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_LootingCorpse:abe5700c-99dc-8fc2-f13f-2f1918f2da34
msgctxt "h9f024646gbfb4g4322ga36fgf04bbd754635"
msgid "No shops on the Fugue Plane. I might just have a look in your pockets."
msgstr "배회 차원에는 상점이 없어. 너희 주머니를 좀 살펴 봐야겠는걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_LootingCorpse
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = b582deb0-a390-fb03-297d-9cc356b2f583
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(7) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_LootingCorpse:b582deb0-a390-fb03-297d-9cc356b2f583
msgctxt "hf5be7f07g740ag45f3g8e70g72d8009d7240"
msgid "Kill or be killed - so it goes down in the Underdark."
msgstr "죽거나 죽이거나, 언더다크도 똑같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_LootingCorpse
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = cf8a593e-1aca-3cb9-989d-8894511f3f74
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(5) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeadInTheWater_LootingCorpse:cf8a593e-1aca-3cb9-989d-8894511f3f74
msgctxt "h61ad6accg1aacg4800g801fga91dc48ffa19"
msgid ""
"Pray if you want, but they won't thank you for it. The dead are an "
"ungrateful lot."
msgstr "기도하고 싶으면 말리진 않지, 하지만 그들이 감사를 표하진 않을 거야. 죽은 이들은 은혜를 모르는 법이거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeepHole
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 114220dd-8364-f075-ce60-c28ce1a1301f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeepHole:114220dd-8364-f075-ce60-c28ce1a1301f
msgctxt "ha4f2dda0g01bbg4367g824bg0356faced596"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeepHole
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 15baab70-de40-7a60-c5fb-65798adcd7c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeepHole:15baab70-de40-7a60-c5fb-65798adcd7c8
msgctxt "h4288dd24ga094g4496gbf09g9e15cac1bb69"
msgid "Come up here and try it."
msgstr "어디 올라와서 해보시던가."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeepHole
#. Speaker = Voice from the Deep Hole
#. NodeID = 17b1c90b-4b5a-4ad6-b5aa-74698e184eca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeepHole:17b1c90b-4b5a-4ad6-b5aa-74698e184eca
msgctxt "hd6c5c3ddg0b6eg47fag8292g5304a8770321"
msgid "<i>Quiet. </i>Or your meat will fill my belly."
msgstr "<i>조용히 해.</i> 확 배불리 잡아먹어버리기 전에."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DeepHole
#. Speaker = Narrator
