#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hf52eaac6g1614g48cdg82afgbd33082dd847"
msgid ""
"Hang on... <i>High Harper </i>Jaheira?! Saviour of Baldur's Gate? Incredible."
msgstr "잠깐만... <i>고위 하퍼</i> 자헤이라?! 발더스 게이트의 구원자 말이야? 대단하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_HangedDrow_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 75d34c1d-3c5f-4d3c-a08c-a723ed7c32a7
