#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_GroupFollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 111da06d-84b4-f02c-bfcd-a8dc0c7aee98
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_RebelsExtort:316e0180-f5a0-8f9f-cd04-8e41402ba36f
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp:76259315-e078-91c7-5d70-96bee7497543
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_RebelGreedyExtort:7f20fe8a-548a-c52e-a96e-e98431da11e0
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_GroupFollowUp:111da06d-84b4-f02c-bfcd-a8dc0c7aee98
msgctxt "h65a8e3abg8f5fg4502ga5f8gf24be5894a3b"
msgid "Set them free, or I will thrash you like I thrashed Nere."
msgstr "풀어줘, 그렇게 하지 않으면 니어를 작살낸 것처럼 너도 작살내주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Elder Brithvar
#. NodeID = 7a03b04b-aefd-109d-20f4-7fc23698c3e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp:7a03b04b-aefd-109d-20f4-7fc23698c3e5
msgctxt "h1a3cc761g23c0g4312g91a0ge1bd46fb8db1"
msgid ""
"The way I hear tell, some prick there calls the shots. The General, Nere "
"called him."
msgstr "내가 듣기로는, 거기 있는 웬 등신이 대장이라더군. 니어는 놈을 장군이라고 불렀지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Elder Brithvar
#. NodeID = 7ee465c3-3846-bbb8-fac4-4759ed750baa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_Mutineers_Event_FailedtoFreeGnomes = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp:7ee465c3-3846-bbb8-fac4-4759ed750baa
msgctxt "h61ad5141gffcag4cc4g8236g9a986677687a"
msgid ""
"Hardly. They drag their feet, and I'll scorch their arses. Works every time."
msgstr "그럴 리가. 늑장을 부리면 놈들 엉덩이를 불로 태워주지. 그렇게 하면 항상 먹힌다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Elder Brithvar
#. NodeID = 83a9eaf8-7ea6-2537-bcf2-17edc1330392
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp:83a9eaf8-7ea6-2537-bcf2-17edc1330392
msgctxt "h787b09c7gd404g4490ga177g2c441e1cb775"
msgid ""
"Your brain going mushy, <i>jargh? </i>That's where those Absolute-freaks "
"hole up."
msgstr "뇌가 맛이 가버렸냐, <i>자그? </i>거기가 그 절대자 믿는 등신들이 죽치고 있는 곳이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 9d6284ee-534d-f60d-3ab5-b42e80fb5c20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp:9d6284ee-534d-f60d-3ab5-b42e80fb5c20
msgctxt "ha8004a1fg4fe1g4cb3ga1c6gae0741c9685e"
msgid "Have you no heart? They deserved freedom - and you denied it."
msgstr "인정도 없나? 저들은 자유를 누릴 자격이 있는데, 네가 그걸 막다니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Elder Brithvar
#. NodeID = 9da5daff-8718-a278-5b87-e61c5d70336a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DuergarMutineers_State_Alive = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp:9da5daff-8718-a278-5b87-e61c5d70336a
msgctxt "hfd2d941agf8f9g45b1g9dcbgc11dd040485a"
msgid "Clan: grab your gear, wipe your arses."
msgstr "일족 전원: 장비 챙기고, 엉덩이 털어라. 가자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 9eec5b0a-0c63-4f91-894e-7b08a55f5d0b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp:9eec5b0a-0c63-4f91-894e-7b08a55f5d0b
msgctxt "hde60643dg68b6g4ed5gadf5g7ed099faa57b"
msgid "Speak up, chief. You can't just let the clan keep them."
msgstr "말 해, 대장. 그냥 저렇게 잡아가게 둘 수는 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = a064820c-e58c-6c2a-83bd-dd59096a93bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp:a064820c-e58c-6c2a-83bd-dd59096a93bc
msgctxt "h41e61e37gaf37g4df7g97e5ge04f6594550f"
msgid ""
"Brittle are the foundations upon which the houses of tyrants are built. It "
"seems I judged you to be less brittle than you really are."
msgstr "폭군들의 집이 세워지는 토대는 연약하지. 보아하니 내가 너를 덜 연약하다고 과대평가한 거 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Elder Brithvar
#. NodeID = ab213c87-a1c9-42eb-6d3d-4620bd9191c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - UND_GnomeRescue.HostileAgainstMutineers(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp:ab213c87-a1c9-42eb-6d3d-4620bd9191c6
msgctxt "h458a1129gf956g4793g80c5g05bd06cb85c2"
msgid "Then do it, ya shit. We'll see who thrashes who."
msgstr "어디 해봐, 새끼야. 누가 누굴 족치게 되는지 한번 보자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Elder Brithvar
#. NodeID = b173223f-6cbf-9932-3195-7af948b1c5ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - UND_GnomeRescue.HostileAgainstMutineers(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp:b173223f-6cbf-9932-3195-7af948b1c5ef
msgctxt "h52cb4da1g7826g48d9gba4eg772f8454ac25"
msgid "Try it, ya uppity shit, see what happens."
msgstr "한 번 해봐, 건방진 새끼야. 어떻게 되나 보자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b514b897-6aa3-ffd7-bd6c-9971633177ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_GnomeWorkers_State_PermaDefeated = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp:b514b897-6aa3-ffd7-bd6c-9971633177ac
msgctxt "h60705b35g84ffg4967ga5aeg22f20dec8e26"
msgid "Get moving. If I see you slavers again, I'll tear you apart."
msgstr "빨리 가봐. 너희 노예상들이 다시 내 눈에 띄면 갈갈이 찢어줄 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b58ede7e-5211-d1aa-7505-50ab985433de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp:b58ede7e-5211-d1aa-7505-50ab985433de
msgctxt "h75f8e233g52bfg430fg84c3g80e46045b986"
msgid "Good idea. I'll start by adding your corpse to the pile."
msgstr "좋은 생각이야. 네 시체를 제일 먼저 털어주도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Elder Brithvar
#. NodeID = be0b262a-a162-3b76-3852-be8cd06ccae4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp:be0b262a-a162-3b76-3852-be8cd06ccae4
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h4fcdecd3gc0ceg415agbb07g03d69aa7670a"
msgid ""
"Goblins, drow, gnolls, even humans - ain't no one they won't try to turn."
msgstr "고블린, 드로우, 놀에, 심지어 인간까지... 놈들이 죄다 개종시키고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c2c5f44f-1f06-2294-b222-d0d7d4dc0d71
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_GnomeWorkers_State_PermaDefeated = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp:c2c5f44f-1f06-2294-b222-d0d7d4dc0d71
msgctxt "hdb55e842g82d4g4eadga88cg1fd8be8b4881"
msgid "Leave - and take the slaves with you. Before I change my mind."
msgstr "이제 가봐. 노예도 같이 데리고 가. 내 생각이 바뀌기 전에."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Elder Brithvar
#. NodeID = caa1ba8b-e83a-27f4-cc6e-fac99a304d35
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_Mutineers_Event_PromisedHalf = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold_2 = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_Mutineers_State_PaidPlayerReward = True
#.   Object:
#.     - GEN_TransferNPCPayment_2(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp:caa1ba8b-e83a-27f4-cc6e-fac99a304d35
msgctxt "ha8e403c2g7bcag4806gb709gc9ef43f68c04"
msgid ""
"Here's your cut. Extra too, like I promised. ([463b0f43-5410-412d-"
"aba3-875cf81c38ca])"
msgstr "여기 너의 몫이다. 약속한 대로 추가분을 더했다. ([463b0f43-5410-412d-aba3-875cf81c38ca])"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Elder Brithvar
#. NodeID = d3b5a8a3-c083-bff0-666a-d8a3ccc27fb7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp:d3b5a8a3-c083-bff0-666a-d8a3ccc27fb7
msgctxt "h96629b52ge83eg4a07g9534g73850cd0b15d"
msgid "Come at me, ya shit."
msgstr "해보던가, 이 십새끼야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d5f48b68-0a12-68ee-5878-e6b760a37ad0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp:d5f48b68-0a12-68ee-5878-e6b760a37ad0
msgctxt "h939e87begf26ag4927g91bfg97c3fdd828e1"
msgid "Very well. I'll rummage what I can."
msgstr "알겠어. 챙길 수 있는 건 다 가져갈게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Elder Brithvar
#. NodeID = d8a68515-3425-e1be-930f-187be36e9912
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_DuergarMutineerFollowUp_Event_Happened = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp:d8a68515-3425-e1be-930f-187be36e9912
msgctxt "ha07e4417g5e28g4475ga70cgfb01140c38e4"
msgid ""
"Sschindylryn's shithouse - you see it? Cock-stench had a wriggler in his "
"skull. All the more reason to clear out."
msgstr "쉰딜린의 변소 같으니, 봤나? 그 좆같은 냄새 나는 자식 머릿속에 벌레가 있었어. 여기를 떠나야 할 이유가 더 생겼군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = dd6d173c-c6a8-4b31-8a60-a70fd03fb975
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp:dd6d173c-c6a8-4b31-8a60-a70fd03fb975
msgctxt "hf57cf394g6522g4402g961fg0c8b111a7c56"
msgid "No way we're letting these bastards take those gnomes. Right?"
msgstr "저 자식들이 노움들을 데려가게 둘 순 없어, 그치?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e1b84a08-cc3f-4bdb-c560-655247fb04ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_Mutineers_State_PaidPlayerReward = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp:e1b84a08-cc3f-4bdb-c560-655247fb04ce
msgctxt "h78ed39ffg0d07g40e4gb205g286446d4497e"
msgid "And the gold you owe me?"
msgstr "골드는 주고 가야지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Elder Brithvar
#. NodeID = e32bac15-bade-cffc-0aa3-a64e80cb18a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_DuergarMutineers_Event_Leave = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp:e32bac15-bade-cffc-0aa3-a64e80cb18a9
msgctxt "hf781374fgb0ccg4ce5gbb64g7a379cddbc0d"
msgid "Now lug your arse someplace else - I got to get cracking."
msgstr "이제 그 궁둥이 들고 좀 꺼져. 나는 길을 뚫어야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Elder Brithvar
#. NodeID = e4391228-6339-d0e7-5fd9-2958b188fcf5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - UND_GnomeRescue.HostileAgainstMutineers(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp:e4391228-6339-d0e7-5fd9-2958b188fcf5
msgctxt "hcbc3e2f7g88d5g4cbdgb123ge3f5d1672888"
msgid "Your wish is my command, <i>jargh.</i>"
msgstr "내 분부대로 해라, <i>자그.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e632a98c-1593-488a-8ef5-9c137de00f50
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_Mutineers_Event_FailedtoFreeGnomes = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp:e632a98c-1593-488a-8ef5-9c137de00f50
msgctxt "h0227eeaagaaf2g4806gaca2g211a98c2bdb7"
msgid "I am freeing these gnomes. Just try and stop me."
msgstr "이 노움들을 풀어줄 거야. 어디 한 번 막아 보시든가."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Elder Brithvar
#. NodeID = ec8de075-2d17-1ebe-f876-a1bdac7b6d6d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp:ec8de075-2d17-1ebe-f876-a1bdac7b6d6d
msgctxt "h127d7b92gd61ag4f28g9f77gfa2b02256a93"
msgid ""
"Someone's gone pickin' my pockets, ya chaff. You want coin, there's plenty "
"of corpses to sack."
msgstr "누군가 내 주머니를 털어갔군, 개잡놈같으니. 돈을 원하면 여기 시체들이나 뒤져봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_RebelsExtort
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5b1cb59e-9b06-b25c-a62b-03fd33d4e7fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. 
#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarCamp_Mutineers_FollowUp
