msgid "Z'rell... Abolute's favourite... speaks with... General..."
msgstr "즈렐... 절대자의 총아... 장군님과... 대화를..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarGuardSergeant_Dead
