msgid "<i>Drugnin</i>' dwarf. Just what we needed."
msgstr "<i>드루그닌</i> 드워프다. 딱 필요하던 거구만."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalFocused
