msgctxt "h7a6d09b7g7bcbg461bg9e2aga560308784cf"
msgid ""
"They're letting dwarves in, now? You should be with the slaves, diggin'."
msgstr "그 녀석들이 이제 드워프도 들여보내는 건가? 넌 노예놈들과 함께 땅을 파고 있어야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalNervous
#. Speaker = Drar
#. NodeID = 6a44589b-2222-aed9-df75-2e6f0ad7cb34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_DuergarGuardNervous_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalNervous:6a44589b-2222-aed9-df75-2e6f0ad7cb34
msgctxt "h23882977g10ccg4b77gbf36gc7b60e227889"
msgid ""
"Nothing you can do up here. So you can get down by yourself, or I can give "
"you a nice push."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalNervous
#. Speaker = Drar
#. NodeID = c38309ff-4810-add2-46d4-59b77924d439
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DuergarMutineers_State_PermaDefeated = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalNervous:c38309ff-4810-add2-46d4-59b77924d439
msgctxt "h4f53721agf65eg4037ga519g99fe142d9afb"
msgid "You chose right. Absolute'll bless you for it."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01
#. Speaker = Murmath
#. NodeID = 064b860c-b41c-a75d-ecb4-cc0dff3a3cb9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_DuergarPatroller_03_HasMet(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_DuergarPatroller_03_HasMet(1) = True
#. TagRule: DUERGARDWARF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01:064b860c-b41c-a75d-ecb4-cc0dff3a3cb9
msgctxt "h94864072gafacg48eeg94a0gefdc02fba0cd"
msgid "Nothin' amiss."
msgstr "아무 문제 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01
#. Speaker = Murmath
#. NodeID = 064b860c-b41c-a75d-ecb4-cc0dff3a3cb9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_DuergarPatroller_03_HasMet(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_DuergarPatroller_03_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01:064b860c-b41c-a75d-ecb4-cc0dff3a3cb9
msgctxt "h82fa9ab0gb755g46a5g948bgf49a43db0d46"
msgid "Don't like strangers here, but..."
msgstr "여기선 외부인을 환영하지 않는데 말이지..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01
#. Speaker = Murmath
#. NodeID = 0e045ee0-4f33-2515-365d-084ee2d85b22
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01:0e045ee0-4f33-2515-365d-084ee2d85b22
msgctxt "h092d26b1g73ddg4003g8801g2ebf5baf0b6c"
msgid ""
"Caught 'em sniffin' around. Easy marks - had the stench of the top-lands."
msgstr "주변을 얼쩡거리는 걸 잡아 왔지. 쉬운 표적이었어, 지상의 악취를 풀풀 풍기더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 13dc1ba7-3dfa-815f-4192-b9d063dc1707
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_UND_SpiderFight_SpidersLeave = True
#.   Local:
#.      - fe291d09-12ec-fdbf-6488-30a8fb45c801_once = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - fe291d09-12ec-fdbf-6488-30a8fb45c801_once = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01:13dc1ba7-3dfa-815f-4192-b9d063dc1707
msgctxt "hc2740d2eg0065g4637gad62g5b7e33e14100"
msgid "Did you notice your spiders ran off?"
msgstr "네 거미들이 도망친 거 알고 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01
#. Speaker = Murmath
#. NodeID = 1cf50c35-aa10-1b46-c079-fca5dcd1e98a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01:1cf50c35-aa10-1b46-c079-fca5dcd1e98a
msgctxt "h19d12798g7b46g4afdgbec3gce359f886be9"
msgid "Go ahead - try me, ya shit!"
msgstr "어디 해봐, 덤벼 보라고, 이 좆만아!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1da6dd02-2e4d-b748-33c9-e406ffdf56d1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01:1da6dd02-2e4d-b748-33c9-e406ffdf56d1
msgctxt "h9d193dcag73a1g4fbag99c7g7f864363ba7f"
msgid "Where did the drow come from?"
msgstr "이 드로우들은 어디서 온 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01
#. Speaker = Murmath
#. NodeID = 2748402c-781f-421c-7649-c98ecfb2f1b0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01:2748402c-781f-421c-7649-c98ecfb2f1b0
msgctxt "h0b36c755ge589g4378ga295g0ec177539e89"
msgid ""
"No fight in 'em after that. Didn't so much as groan when I snapped their "
"spines."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01
#. Speaker = Murmath
#. NodeID = 27ee3d75-e831-ea82-3489-6bc223a6a4be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_DuergarPatroller_03_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01:27ee3d75-e831-ea82-3489-6bc223a6a4be
msgctxt "h4fa72c12ga789g428bga585gc61b1d463f02"
msgid "Quit distractin' me."
msgstr "그만 방해해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01
#. Speaker = Murmath
#. NodeID = 385cb54d-87b9-2bcf-51f2-ffeaa1621ca8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01:385cb54d-87b9-2bcf-51f2-ffeaa1621ca8
msgctxt "haa465f76gde3ag48eega252g4e2eef03fbab"
msgid ""
"We get into a scrap, I bet they'll run off into the dark. Wastes of space."
msgstr "우리가 다투기 시작하면, 놈들은 어둠 속으로 도망갈 거야. 공간 낭비지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 39c493c4-bb7e-5309-1c40-3ff3967f4105
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_Event_SnappedSpine(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SELDARINEDROWELF(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01:39c493c4-bb7e-5309-1c40-3ff3967f4105
msgctxt "hdba8920ag9154g4c16g9461g9109dcd494a8"
msgid "Gods, that's horrific. I'll have your head!"
msgstr "신이시여, 끔찍한 일이군. 네 머리를 잘라내겠다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3a8380ff-25f2-2fd2-6999-8dddcc24542a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_UND_SpiderFight_Aggro = True
#.   Local:
#.      - fe291d09-12ec-fdbf-6488-30a8fb45c801_once = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - fe291d09-12ec-fdbf-6488-30a8fb45c801_once = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01:3a8380ff-25f2-2fd2-6999-8dddcc24542a
msgctxt "h4dedfcb6g6844g425cgb1e5g74e58ec2399c"
msgid "Did you notice one of your spiders killed the other?"
msgstr "네 거미 중 한 마리가 나머지 한 놈을 죽였다는 거 알고 있어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01
#. Speaker = Murmath
#. NodeID = 430642cd-aaba-72e8-bac9-70b22048430e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_DuergarPatroller_03_HasMet(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_DuergarPatroller_03_HasMet(1) = True
#. TagRule: SELDARINEDROWELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01:430642cd-aaba-72e8-bac9-70b22048430e
msgctxt "h6dd7d29fg73a5g4b32gbd80g7afe4d7d6811"
msgid "Let me see your eyes, underelf. Mm."
msgstr "네 눈을 좀 봐야겠어, 언더엘프. 흠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01
#. Speaker = Murmath
#. NodeID = 430642cd-aaba-72e8-bac9-70b22048430e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_DuergarPatroller_03_HasMet(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_DuergarPatroller_03_HasMet(1) = True
#. TagRule: LOLTHDROWELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01:430642cd-aaba-72e8-bac9-70b22048430e
msgctxt "h09112135g2390g4be5g997eg13c035d6f2c1"
msgid "Red-eyed bastard! Eh... wait a second."
msgstr "이런 빨간 눈 개자식! 에... 잠깐만."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01
#. Speaker = Murmath
#. NodeID = 5cd9c676-de94-e9c2-39b4-a2e8956f8d24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01:5cd9c676-de94-e9c2-39b4-a2e8956f8d24
msgctxt "h888f8f76gd482g4470g8ea4gfe630e97da21"
msgid ""
"Nah - the spiders had already tired them out by the time Nere got his hands "
"on them. Once he broke their brains, their tongues wouldn't stop waggin'."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01
#. Speaker = Murmath
#. NodeID = 61238d4f-2d9e-b13f-957a-3951e3347293
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01:61238d4f-2d9e-b13f-957a-3951e3347293
msgctxt "h6e7aa5eageb6fg4351g814cg727135f408e4"
msgid ""
"Me - who else? My spiders sussed 'em out of hiding, then Nere taught 'em a "
"thing or two, and I let 'em fly."
msgstr ""
"당연히 나지, 누구겠어? 내 거미들이 숨어있는 놈들을 발견했지, 그리곤 니어가 그들에게 가르침을 좀 주고, 내가 끝을 내 준게야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7a77fbd3-53c2-31fa-a441-95e78f6a6487
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LOLTHDROWELF(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01:7a77fbd3-53c2-31fa-a441-95e78f6a6487
msgctxt "h0872df9age131g4972g89ddg45d84ba84d2b"
msgid "Shouldn't have hesitated, greyling. You'll be a fine sacrifice."
msgstr "망설이지 말았어야지, 회색 좆만아. 넌 좋은 희생양이 되겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01
#. Speaker = Murmath
#. NodeID = 84a41cca-566a-5c3b-6b14-2ab809ea00b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01:84a41cca-566a-5c3b-6b14-2ab809ea00b7
msgctxt "h4d952249gbf44g44f7gbd44g504281bf3ed9"
msgid ""
"Hung them here as a warning. Ain't no one <i>drughs</i> with Clan Flameshade."
msgstr "경고의 의미로 놈들을 여기 가져다 놨지. 누구도 플레임셰이드 일족에 맞설 수 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a1b692e4-e51f-52f2-49b2-b4134ea2e167
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_Event_AskedAboutDrow(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01:a1b692e4-e51f-52f2-49b2-b4134ea2e167
msgctxt "hf348c5a1g3c6ag48b9gbf0cg5839ddc5fd86"
msgid "Who hung these drow out to dry?"
msgstr "누가 이 드로우들을 이렇게 널브려 놓은 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = af8d9ff8-b149-f35e-48b5-5894ef1be214
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_Event_AskedAboutDrow(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SELDARINEDROWELF(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_Event_SnappedSpine(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01:af8d9ff8-b149-f35e-48b5-5894ef1be214
msgctxt "h5e0626c7g16a6g4664g80ebg39695ce6d8be"
msgid "Tell me the drow put up a fight, at least."
msgstr "적어도 드로우들이 맞서 싸우긴 했겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01
#. Speaker = Murmath
#. NodeID = b61b8095-93fa-b69f-e742-e6522435aabd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01:b61b8095-93fa-b69f-e742-e6522435aabd
msgctxt "h62eed2bag6c8fg4f93gaaf8gb58e8bb01f7f"
msgid ""
"She was the best at finding hide-aways under all this rubble. The other "
"three combined had half as much brains."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c3350bb9-3971-34d6-a014-bb23a6841ccc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01:c3350bb9-3971-34d6-a014-bb23a6841ccc
msgctxt "h262af65cg37f0g46f7gbb52g56f3b2cb1812"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01
#. Speaker = Murmath
#. NodeID = c962fe0c-da0a-bab8-bb2e-081f14c998de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01:c962fe0c-da0a-bab8-bb2e-081f14c998de
msgctxt "h304ad531gf8c4g4ea3gb9d4gb8d2a32c7aa6"
msgid ""
"Eh? Oh, those worthless bugs. Always were the stupidest ones I ever raised. "
"Hope the minotaurs get 'em."
msgstr "음? 아, 그 쓸모없는 벌레 자식들. 내가 기른 놈들 중에 가장 멍청한 자식들이었지. 미노타우로스한테 죽었으면 좋겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01
#. Speaker = Murmath
#. NodeID = cfb29fae-6bf6-2884-8e62-73f25fa43bef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DuergarMutineers_State_PermaDefeated = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01:cfb29fae-6bf6-2884-8e62-73f25fa43bef
msgctxt "haf818a47g37b0g4f91gb0b4g31669320c9b1"
msgid "Nere's dead. You want a medal, or a chest to pin it on?"
msgstr "니어는 죽었어. 훈장이나 핀이라도 달고 싶나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01
#. Speaker = Murmath
#. NodeID = d4bce6ac-1141-9057-2aca-0072e8d504f4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01:d4bce6ac-1141-9057-2aca-0072e8d504f4
msgctxt "h6998acccg147fg417dg825cg1c1527e6320a"
msgid "I'll gut you, spiderspawn!"
msgstr "배를 갈라주지, 거미 새끼!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01
#. Speaker = Murmath
#. NodeID = de035d85-7a07-099f-67f2-b47ce2e4be84
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01:de035d85-7a07-099f-67f2-b47ce2e4be84
msgctxt "h1cdfd298gb845g4bedg8ba1g4c741998a482"
msgid "Absolute must'a took you in."
msgstr "절대자가 널 받아줬나 보군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01
#. Speaker = Murmath
#. NodeID = fce2d41f-3d6d-482d-d4d7-a92a808b705f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalPatroller_01:fce2d41f-3d6d-482d-d4d7-a92a808b705f
msgctxt "had306deage3d7g4b3ag93e6gac75810a1c7c"
msgid ""
"Eh? Blood-thirsty <i>idiots</i>! Who'd they go after? Xanta? <i>Damn it!</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 02db1127-2cc4-c597-ad3c-d759b1794def
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:02db1127-2cc4-c597-ad3c-d759b1794def
msgctxt "h639fdbb3g7a2eg46a3g98edg3d0ff093cc11"
msgid "Clearing that rubble will be no easy feat. Any ideas?"
msgstr "잔해를 다 치우는 건 쉬운 일이 아닐 것 같은데. 좋은 생각 없나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 05ef67a2-ac75-d9bf-2d5e-b31ac926bb96
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:05ef67a2-ac75-d9bf-2d5e-b31ac926bb96
msgctxt "hd82b3625g1f73g4143g89fdgeaa598ca93fa"
msgid ""
"Let me guess - Brithvar and Kur. They've been a thorn in my arse since Nere "
"hired us."
msgstr "내가 맞춰보지, 브리스바랑 쿠르, 맞지? 그 새끼들은 니어가 우릴 고용했던 그 순간부터 아주 눈엣가시였어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 08a2b8d1-6d2d-d781-15a7-75eed075f10c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:08a2b8d1-6d2d-d781-15a7-75eed075f10c
msgctxt "h9a27082fg0985g4e36gb0e0g107c8603c474"
msgid ""
"That so? Set it near the rubble and ignite it. That'll blow the drow out."
msgstr "그래? 그럼 잔해 근처에 놓고 불을 붙여. 그거면 드로우 녀석을 꺼낼 수 있겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0c2d6960-535a-d34b-accd-d7f2169be8df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_DuergarGuardSergeant_GaveBoots(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DarkLake_Knows_GnomeHunt = False
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_Knows_RunFromDuergar = True
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_State_HasBoots(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_DuergarGuardSergeant_Knows_MoreTalkative(1) = True
#.     - UND_DuergarGuardSergeant_GaveBoots(1) = True
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_InjuredGnome_Event_GiveBoots(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:0c2d6960-535a-d34b-accd-d7f2169be8df
msgctxt "h2465bf12g4769g474ag8401g72db88a54dbe"
msgid ""
"Bare feet, I see. I nabbed these boots from a runaway gnome - yours, perhaps?"
msgstr "맨발이군. 이 부츠를 도주자 노움에게서 가져왔어. 아마 너의 것이겠지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0f32af9b-e6f1-ffd2-7036-4f18928a89b0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_Event_MentionedHiddenGnome(1) = False
#.      - UND_DuergarCamp_Event_LearnedHiddenGnome(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_Event_MentionedHiddenGnome(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:0f32af9b-e6f1-ffd2-7036-4f18928a89b0
msgctxt "hd4e5368fgdbccg4288gbcc5g27cf4d018256"
msgid "I heard a gnome fled the dig. What happened?"
msgstr "한 노움이 탈출했다고 하던데. 어떻게 된 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 196aadaf-f3a6-37f9-b9ba-756cf0811add
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:196aadaf-f3a6-37f9-b9ba-756cf0811add
msgctxt "h110c1376gcfdfg4d13gb170gf16fcf9387e9"
msgid ""
"Moonrise? There's a lot resting on what we find in that place. It had better "
"deliver."
msgstr "문라이즈라고? 그곳에서 알아낼 것들이 아주 많군. 찾아가 보는 게 좋겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 1bd140aa-fcb3-af75-344e-b5a3eb40db62
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:1bd140aa-fcb3-af75-344e-b5a3eb40db62
msgctxt "h7ae859b9g8dfbg43acgb265gb05700965979"
msgid "Never thought I'd see these back. Nasty sneak gave even Gekh the slip."
msgstr "이걸 다시 보게 될 줄은 몰랐군. 그 더러운 도둑년이 게크에게서도 빠져나갈 줄이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1e6ea7e2-0b7f-f79b-c466-cc9711434b88
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DarkLake_State_ClaimedGekhWasDead = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 7da1f45d-e8d0-26c2-1a71-e2103698b218_Reported = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 7da1f45d-e8d0-26c2-1a71-e2103698b218_Reported = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:1e6ea7e2-0b7f-f79b-c466-cc9711434b88
msgctxt "h46828943gfce6g4b04ga801g538b7894cac6"
msgid "I was told to report to you. Gekh Coal is dead."
msgstr "하사관한테 보고하라고 하던데. 게크 콜은 죽었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 21f09eda-f95e-fb4f-44d8-1d82b1162f5c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:21f09eda-f95e-fb4f-44d8-1d82b1162f5c
msgctxt "h5ccdc364gebaag4cfdg99b2g4169d76ade5a"
msgid ""
"Place is older than bonedust. Previous tenants left a trap - dropped a shit-"
"tonne of metal once we'd dug a ways in."
msgstr "여긴 골분보다 오래된 장소야. 전에 살던 이들이 함정을 남겨뒀더군, 중간까지 팠는데 좆같이 많은 철근이 떨어져 내렸어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 23c90564-9a3a-7cc2-c75e-6f4c5e5019a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:23c90564-9a3a-7cc2-c75e-6f4c5e5019a3
msgctxt "hc62e9ed5g3aa6g4101ga54eg6e5070ee06ce"
msgid "Forget the boots. I'm here to check on the dig."
msgstr "부츠는 잊어버려. 작업이 어떻게 되어가고 있나 보러 온 거니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 253360df-917a-01dd-4e84-685cdbdd6038
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_DuergarGuardSergeant_GaveBoots(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DarkLake_Knows_GnomeHunt = False
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_Knows_RunFromDuergar = True
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_State_HasBoots(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_DuergarGuardSergeant_Knows_MoreTalkative(1) = True
#.     - UND_DuergarGuardSergeant_GaveBoots(1) = True
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_InjuredGnome_Event_GiveBoots(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:253360df-917a-01dd-4e84-685cdbdd6038
msgctxt "he055f5d2g2935g4c5agbc93gb04577b6c11e"
msgid ""
"Bare feet, I see. I nabbed these boots from a runaway gnome - yours, perhaps?"
msgstr "맨발이군. 이 부츠를 도주자 노움에게서 가져왔어. 아마 너의 것이겠지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 256caf6d-18ac-630a-313c-8805e6a76448
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_Event_MentionedMindMeld(1) = False
#.      - UND_DuergarGuardSergeant_Knows_TrueSoul(1) = False
#.      - UND_DuergarGuardSergeant_Knows_AskedWhatHappened(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_TheDrowNere_Event_HadMindMeld = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_Event_MentionedMindMeld(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:256caf6d-18ac-630a-313c-8805e6a76448
msgctxt "h09abe47dg950bg41b0g8189g227656182149"
msgid "I had a chat with Nere, and you're in big trouble."
msgstr "니어와 대화해 봤는데, 네게 아주 큰 문제가 생겼어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 2578bd9d-b6b9-43b2-5bce-308ebbd96b5b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:2578bd9d-b6b9-43b2-5bce-308ebbd96b5b
msgctxt "h4f9d4645gb5d0g4783gba56g01c1d510d306"
msgid ""
"<i>Poorly, </i>obviously. Tunnel collapsed on a True Soul. Absolute's going "
"to eat my liver."
msgstr "보다시피, <i>아주 더디지</i>. 참된 영혼이 통로에 갇혔어. 절대자께서 내 간을 먹어버리실 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 2a2f74fa-4722-34cc-f08c-7f8a032c57f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.      - UND_CaveIn.DuergarAskedHelp(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:2a2f74fa-4722-34cc-f08c-7f8a032c57f2
msgctxt "h3be08949ga7beg4c2bgb055g5f43fd09accb"
msgid "Yes, True Soul?"
msgstr "뭐지, 참된 영혼?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 302845a7-d6af-fbfc-0167-6b36b740e62e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:302845a7-d6af-fbfc-0167-6b36b740e62e
msgctxt "h54fd6de9ge196g4917gb454gefa9af8ade06"
msgid ""
"Nere can handle himself. Reason I joined - I know which way the lava flows."
msgstr "니어가 알아서 처리할 거다. 그게 이쪽에 붙은 이유지. 난 용암이 어디로 튈지 잘 알거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 33b5058c-b12c-2cde-8d49-294e879e6ad9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:33b5058c-b12c-2cde-8d49-294e879e6ad9
msgctxt "h62053eeagcf00g4b64g8b6cg0aa5e7be0139"
msgid "They don't get paid soon, I'll have a riot on my hands."
msgstr "급여를 조만간 지급하지 못하면, 반란이 일어날 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 33b9afc2-59ca-9954-41e9-6b036792c212
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:33b9afc2-59ca-9954-41e9-6b036792c212
msgctxt "h74a4fe20g4144g43d3g866eg88158917ec27"
msgid "Then find the thievin' bugger and get them back."
msgstr "그럼 그 도둑 새끼를 찾아서 찾아와."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 3b1523d4-1b55-ddfe-7d69-1a8c6c9c7f8b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DROWELF or DUERGARDWARF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:3b1523d4-1b55-ddfe-7d69-1a8c6c9c7f8b
msgctxt "h4ab44c69g293cg4567g9eecg9c41df8b9097"
msgid "Move. I don't have time for you."
msgstr "움직여. 널 위해 쓸 시간은 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 3b1523d4-1b55-ddfe-7d69-1a8c6c9c7f8b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:3b1523d4-1b55-ddfe-7d69-1a8c6c9c7f8b
msgctxt "h9e7a3fc7g883cg4e55ga3d0g229b76fca59a"
msgid "Move, <i>hoon</i>. I don't have time for <i>drugnin' </i>outsiders."
msgstr "움직여, <i>훈</i>. <i>드루그닌</i> 외부인이나 상대할 시간은 없으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 3d1649dc-1ab8-86ee-e03c-c2700a505775
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:3d1649dc-1ab8-86ee-e03c-c2700a505775
msgctxt "h9ec8c29dgad7ag4236g863cge97ce668ecca"
msgid ""
"Didn't realise we were flirting - just be warned, I hear I taste bitter."
msgstr "우리가 미끼를 흔들고 있는 줄은 몰랐는데. 조심해. 난 좀 비릿한 편이니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 3e7ac28a-a919-b3cc-1e7a-6df8f8ebbf55
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_DuergarGuardSergeant_Knows_TrueSoul(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:3e7ac28a-a919-b3cc-1e7a-6df8f8ebbf55
msgctxt "hc0578e38g5253g4094g8a00gd2d88963c84a"
msgid "A True Soul, eh? Useless <i>rakkah </i>of a lookout could've told me."
msgstr "참된 영혼이군 그래? 쓸모없는 <i>라카</i>가 알려줄 수도 있었을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3efa27c3-e357-ac26-68e0-13d6fdc7b97a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:3efa27c3-e357-ac26-68e0-13d6fdc7b97a
msgctxt "h9577c0b4g3bbfg43d4g9c7fg66b978042088"
msgid "You think your boss will be happy you attacked a True Soul?"
msgstr "네가 참된 영혼을 공격했다는 걸 알면, 네 상사가 가만히 있을 것 같아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 418a4b3e-e680-e49b-44f0-18b6558283d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:418a4b3e-e680-e49b-44f0-18b6558283d2
msgctxt "h41f60db0g7b61g4f9cg82e2gfb366ba4bbe3"
msgid ""
"My arm's near dead from the lashing. The prick-squeaks are digging as fast "
"as I can make them!"
msgstr "채찍질하느라 팔이 저릴 지경이라고. 이 좆만이들은 지금 내가 만들 수 있는 한 최대한 빨리 움직이고 있는 거다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 425694a4-01fb-6983-9248-19716d2b1e0e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_Event_AskedAboutEye(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GNOME(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_Event_AskedAboutEye(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:425694a4-01fb-6983-9248-19716d2b1e0e
msgctxt "h164f1e9dgf1d6g4236g8aa5g1e8594d0342e"
msgid "I noticed an orb floating about. What's it doing?"
msgstr "수정구가 떠다니던데. 그건 뭘 하는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4287471f-e804-a466-65c1-6b53183eeb57
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:4287471f-e804-a466-65c1-6b53183eeb57
msgctxt "hbc3a9085g4a25g4c75g9e2egcb62fe97f9a9"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 4621e59b-ad6c-033b-4206-6daa706a2a61
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:4621e59b-ad6c-033b-4206-6daa706a2a61
msgctxt "hbad0b704g1dd6g49e5g8a0dg5c6186e8ea92"
msgid ""
"Moonrise. We're getting close to the lion's den - and plenty of questions I "
"have for the lion, too."
msgstr "문라이즈라. 사자 굴에 점점 가까워지고 있군. 그리고 사자에게 묻고 싶은 것들도 아주 많고 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4b1656ab-1084-833d-71f0-b57b8a53aa7d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_DuergarGuardSergeant_GaveBoots(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DarkLake_Knows_GnomeHunt = True
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_State_HasBoots(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_DuergarGuardSergeant_GaveBoots(1) = True
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_InjuredGnome_Event_GiveBoots(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:4b1656ab-1084-833d-71f0-b57b8a53aa7d
msgctxt "h419a457bg68f9g48a5gb947g6201e9ef8ffa"
msgid "<i>Give her the gnome's boots.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그녀에게 노움에게 받은 부츠를 준다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 4e435fdf-bc25-7bd4-6ecf-603f136af22d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:4e435fdf-bc25-7bd4-6ecf-603f136af22d
msgctxt "h5da648e3g6cc5g4eecga378gd4e78be3365e"
msgid "Not a one - unless you count tacking aboleth fangs to my whipping cane."
msgstr "한 가지도 없어. 내 채찍에 아볼레스의 송곳니를 붙이는 방법을 제외하면 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 51ff1cd3-144c-7942-0de6-beabe07db246
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:51ff1cd3-144c-7942-0de6-beabe07db246
msgctxt "h1774911bgb641g453fg9b50gdea8bc71c89b"
msgid "Thought you would. True Souls don't abandon their own."
msgstr "그럴 줄 알았지. 참된 영혼은 서로를 버리지 않거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 54c8638b-e4f3-363f-3e04-266f93124184
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_DuergarGuardSergeant_GaveBoots(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_Knows_OutsidersHaveBoots = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:54c8638b-e4f3-363f-3e04-266f93124184
msgctxt "h1db204e9gc4b4g4ce8g9f62gba5e3ce0f0b4"
msgid ""
"You the one Greymon mentioned? Heard you killed that thievin' gnome. Where's "
"my boots?"
msgstr "네가 그레이몬이 말했던 놈인가? 네가 그 노움 도둑년을 죽였다던데. 내 부츠는 어디 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 573aa3bc-ff26-4f1b-8a34-63874d3b134c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 7da1f45d-e8d0-26c2-1a71-e2103698b218_Inclusion = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:573aa3bc-ff26-4f1b-8a34-63874d3b134c
msgctxt "h7094b0a0g3befg4b21gb44egb16f9bbb3b77"
msgid "Hells. How sick must a soul be to take slaves, let alone lash them?"
msgstr "세상에. 얼마나 끔찍한 영혼을 가지고 있어야 노예를 부리는 것도 모자라서 그들에게 채찍질을 할 수 있는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 5bf2e50a-9c74-29ba-7034-9d61406ca303
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:5bf2e50a-9c74-29ba-7034-9d61406ca303
msgctxt "h4974b557g07a0g4e3cg8130g2a3226100240"
msgid "Get Nere out and you'll have the Absolute's blessing, no doubting that."
msgstr "니어를 꺼내주면 절대자님의 은총을 얻게 될 거야, 그건 분명하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 5cbe10a9-3d6f-5a75-7600-df1b2c8d4433
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_DuergarGuardSergeant_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_Knows_OutsidersHaveBoots = True
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_State_HasBoots(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:5cbe10a9-3d6f-5a75-7600-df1b2c8d4433
msgctxt "hb772d516gd703g4474g9e18gd86e1d3cbdd9"
msgid "You got those boots? Or something else eatin' at you?"
msgstr "부츠는 찾았나? 아니면 다른 볼일이라도 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5cf25b40-2ad5-44dd-9cf7-d2e64ad1153d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_Event_AskedAboutCavein(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:5cf25b40-2ad5-44dd-9cf7-d2e64ad1153d
msgctxt "hea0608c3g6e92g407dg99d2g19a630beda6b"
msgid "How did Nere get trapped?"
msgstr "니어는 어쩌다가 안에 갇힌 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 6031aefb-5808-79fd-ac1a-0a83271224fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_Event_MentionedMindMeld(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_DuergarGuardSergeant_Knows_askedToHelp(1) = True
#.     - UND_DuergarGuardSergeant_Knows_TrueSoul(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:6031aefb-5808-79fd-ac1a-0a83271224fc
msgctxt "hb1192b65g21dfg4063g8ac3g3d3a33d0fd00"
msgid "You spoke with him? Then you connected. You are a True Soul."
msgstr "그와 대화를 나눴다고? 서로 연결되었나 보군. 넌 참된 영혼이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 607754a9-db07-44c8-86bc-14ea1066d3f9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 7da1f45d-e8d0-26c2-1a71-e2103698b218_Inclusion = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:607754a9-db07-44c8-86bc-14ea1066d3f9
msgctxt "h41352951g33d0g48a4ga48dgbd67347d48d1"
msgid "Charming. Hell is truly where we make it."
msgstr "매력적이네. 지옥이란 진정으로 우리 손으로 만들어 가는 곳인 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 6553ea04-4069-a601-5d9e-2a42398ae4da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - UND_LoneDuergar.GaveBoots_Reward(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:6553ea04-4069-a601-5d9e-2a42398ae4da
msgctxt "h338aae68ga3e9g49d3g8514ga75f191f0378"
msgid "Here, then - his bounty's yours."
msgstr "자, 그럼. 현상금을 받아가."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6557832a-442b-7f59-4569-c103bbe4d403
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_Event_AskedAboutEye(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_Event_AskedAboutMoonrise(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:6557832a-442b-7f59-4569-c103bbe4d403
msgctxt "h7fb837c8g5f23g43bdg9324gebd26bec4a77"
msgid "I'd like to know more about Moonrise."
msgstr "문라이즈에 대해 더 알고 싶은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6b191f92-f73a-95b2-d286-1c9d23e0bce0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_Event_AskedAboutEye(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GNOME(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_Event_AskedAboutEye(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:6b191f92-f73a-95b2-d286-1c9d23e0bce0
msgctxt "h27eee3c1g59b1g45c4g86c3ge523a11c5c55"
msgid "Who is operating the scrying eye I've seen floating around?"
msgstr "주변에 돌아다니는 수정구는 누가 조종하는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 6c4aae64-a82d-4df0-aff1-b01599dbdecc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:6c4aae64-a82d-4df0-aff1-b01599dbdecc
msgctxt "h1b349afcg6a57g4fdcgac7bg1cc81a52da4e"
msgid ""
"Dead? <i>Drugnin' </i>Gekh - figured I could count on him. Lesson damn well "
"learned."
msgstr "죽었다고? 게크 이 <i>드루그닌 </i>자식. 믿을 만한 놈인 줄 알았더니. 좋은 교훈을 얻었군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 6dec1cee-8ce6-1b84-7e74-24743d38b976
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_DarkJusticiars_Quest_HeardSharTemple = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:6dec1cee-8ce6-1b84-7e74-24743d38b976
msgctxt "hfab8a591g7a91g4044g8f81gc8c350f69907"
msgid ""
"Entrance to an ancient temple. General's orders, Nere said. Must contain "
"somethin' important."
msgstr "고대의 사원으로 향하는 입구가 있어. 니어가 말하길, 장군의 명령이라더군. 분명 뭔가 중요한 게 들어있는 게야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 6e1d5418-f1c7-a9f9-865c-b76d56659859
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:6e1d5418-f1c7-a9f9-865c-b76d56659859
msgctxt "he4221e19g074eg4479ga468gd00e9714dfab"
msgid "Now move. I've got no time for -"
msgstr "이제 움직여. 너한테 쓸 시간이 없..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7052800a-4fee-9c11-e616-3ecac78d2d48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_Event_MentionedMindMeld(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_TheDrowNere_Event_HadMindMeld = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 7da1f45d-e8d0-26c2-1a71-e2103698b218_PlayerSaidHadPowder = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_Event_MentionedMindMeld(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:7052800a-4fee-9c11-e616-3ecac78d2d48
msgctxt "h74ec5b1cg24abg43ceg9195g21d7e7c07798"
msgid "Nere isn't happy. These gnomes better start digging faster."
msgstr "니어가 불만이 많아. 이 노움들이 서두르는 게 좋을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7067de7b-06fc-e69a-fce5-34275ccf8a24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - UND_LoneDuergar.GaveBoots_Attacked(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:7067de7b-06fc-e69a-fce5-34275ccf8a24
msgctxt "h86931de0g953fg422aga049g2faeca3563ee"
msgid "<i>Prepare for a fight.</i>"
msgstr "<i>전투를 준비한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 7931aff8-c314-89e2-17c6-dcfb8fc4caa0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:7931aff8-c314-89e2-17c6-dcfb8fc4caa0
msgctxt "h60d1a7d2g68cdg4eb3g9cb8g45abeb0ff597"
msgid ""
"*The parasite stirs, but it's a mere tickle. You hear no thoughts or "
"memories, just an echo of scars that never healed.*"
msgstr "*기생충이 꿈틀거리지만 간지러움에 불과합니다. 생각이나 기억은 들리지 않고 치유되지 않은 상처의 메아리만이 들려옵니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 7d4e89f2-3e62-43e5-153c-b65bc588654d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_DuergarCamp_Knows_CapturedGnomes = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:7d4e89f2-3e62-43e5-153c-b65bc588654d
msgctxt "hcb5b3c41g6f35g4096ga107g4c9ab608ae74"
msgid ""
"Glad you're here to take responsibility. Tunnel's collapsed, trapped True "
"Soul Nere."
msgstr "네가 책임을 지러 와서 다행이군. 통로가 무너져서, 참된 영혼 니어가 안에 갇혔다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7ff5ecbe-006b-441b-ee0d-c15aee49e9a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_Event_MentionedMindMeld(1) = False
#.      - UND_DuergarGuardSergeant_Knows_askedToHelp(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_TheDrowNere_Event_HadMindMeld = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_Event_MentionedMindMeld(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:7ff5ecbe-006b-441b-ee0d-c15aee49e9a3
msgctxt "h3eb23720g6fd3g4ea0g97c4g9ad718c3db9d"
msgid "Nere spoke to me; our minds connected. And he's <i>not</i> happy."
msgstr "니어가 내게 연결된 정신을 통해 말을 걸었어. 썩 기분이 좋아 보이진 않더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 8110e415-47c7-02cb-b592-41ab6ec9924c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Quest_ToldAboutMoonrise = True
#.      - UND_Event_PartyTalkedAboutMoonrise = False
#.      - UND_Elevator_Event_GotWarning = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:8110e415-47c7-02cb-b592-41ab6ec9924c
msgctxt "h27779ed9g04b0g4a27gbec4g654b2382b17d"
msgid ""
"That's Moonrise, keeping tabs. Nere says they've scryers watching the "
"Absolute's followers for trouble, non-stop."
msgstr "문라이즈가 감시하고 있는 거다. 니어에 따르면 구슬 보는 자들이 절대자님의 추종자를 쉬지 않고 감시하고 있다더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 818de1c1-487c-a1a5-2183-96d9a8a155d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:818de1c1-487c-a1a5-2183-96d9a8a155d9
msgctxt "hc2059793g7746g4ecbgae15g065217824b6f"
msgid ""
"That's not what the lookout told me. Hand 'em over, or I'll take them off "
"your corpse."
msgstr "우리 정찰대가 말한 내용이랑 다른데. 내게 부츠를 넘기지 않으면, 내가 직접 네 시체에서 꺼내 가주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 84e57a06-ad65-db87-2fe7-72db97e88ec6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:84e57a06-ad65-db87-2fe7-72db97e88ec6
msgctxt "h75920b62g6502g4cbdga5c8g82db3a08adaf"
msgid "On the double ya pricks, before I carve my name into your arses."
msgstr "너희 엉덩이에 내 이름을 새겨넣기 전에 더 서둘러 이 좆같은 새끼들아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 8906f777-05ed-4fd3-b042-03c2cec3db29
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(5) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:8906f777-05ed-4fd3-b042-03c2cec3db29
msgctxt "h04372f43g4c81g4b79gaf14g8397d9f658de"
msgid ""
"What is it with these people and <i>heads?</i> Let's get Nere's and get out."
msgstr "이 사람들 죄다 <i>머리</i>가 어떻게 된 거 아니야? 니어 녀석을 구한 다음 빨리 떠나자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 891b60ce-da38-be01-6a7d-f2165dfe7a06
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DuergarMutineers_State_PermaDefeated = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:891b60ce-da38-be01-6a7d-f2165dfe7a06
msgctxt "h869fa0ddg5cfdg43d2gb241gcb795d65db4b"
msgid "Brithvar's dead. I - I proved myself. No way Nere can doubt me now."
msgstr "브리스바는 죽었다. 나 - 난 스스로를 증명했어. 이젠 니어도 날 의심하지 못하겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8e916710-e865-f348-4440-eb4812cff31e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 7da1f45d-e8d0-26c2-1a71-e2103698b218_PlayerSaidHadPowder = False
#.   Object:
#.      - HasTaggedItem_EXPLOSIVES(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 7da1f45d-e8d0-26c2-1a71-e2103698b218_PlayerSaidHadPowder = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:8e916710-e865-f348-4440-eb4812cff31e
msgctxt "h8f12c0a5gcf7cg4c22g908ag7f6a9afe56a8"
msgid "I've got some explosive powder. That should do the trick."
msgstr "내게 화약이 좀 있는데. 그거면 해결할 수 있겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 8fa181a0-203c-4101-a5bf-7e869f4e8358
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(6) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:8fa181a0-203c-4101-a5bf-7e869f4e8358
msgctxt "h2f943747g3333g49c4g957ag3bbd2770358a"
msgid "It is Nere's head that concerns us."
msgstr "우리 문제는 니어의 머리통이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 900c38c4-15e3-4451-81fc-5c2a16a73c06
