msgctxt "h40ff712fg5a78g4fdfg8fa6g4e1502f8902d"
msgid ""
"<i>Drugnin' </i>shitshow, it was. Couple of pricklets figured they'd blow us "
"clear to the topland."
msgstr "아주 <i>드루그닌</i> 개판이었지. 좆만이 몇 명이 그게 우릴 지상까지 날려버릴 줄 알았던 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a1ab3041-b08d-d4c3-2fd1-150c428e7278
