msgctxt "hdba8226ag46d5g407bg9a86g6cf2f8784aa4"
msgid "An escort to Moonrise, huh? Can't be too far off, then."
msgstr "문라이즈로 압송됐다고? 그럼 여기서 멀지 않다는 소린데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
