#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = d5871374-8177-462f-ac5e-cc0035d69fd6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:d5871374-8177-462f-ac5e-cc0035d69fd6
msgctxt "h335797ecg53deg46acg8eb8gf0b2fdba0724"
msgid "The famous Nere - subject of the myconids' ire, no?"
msgstr "그 유명한 니어군. 미이코니드들의 노여움의 대상 아닌가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = da4c4d8b-d273-c0a8-9913-c9fd436902ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(6) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:da4c4d8b-d273-c0a8-9913-c9fd436902ce
msgctxt "he2e51b23ga20ag4f1ag9d0dg2ff61db117db"
msgid "Moonrise? We're nearing the Towers. We're nearing <i>answers</i>."
msgstr "문라이즈라고? 탑에 가까워지고 있군. <i>해답</i>에 가까워지고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = dc08ab1a-fb8f-35be-1286-fee69fe65350
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:dc08ab1a-fb8f-35be-1286-fee69fe65350
msgctxt "ha250203agf3e8g4f3cg89b5gd335c74ee0be"
msgid ""
"You don't know about the seat of the Absolute? No doubt you'll see it for "
"yourself soon enough."
msgstr "절대자님의 자리에 대해서 모른다고? 곧 보게 될 거니 걱정 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = de758922-65e3-4451-b882-845b9fbe2444
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(7) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:de758922-65e3-4451-b882-845b9fbe2444
msgctxt "h11d70221g2341g42f7gbeb4gf1ec98875450"
msgid "No need for that - Nere's is the only head that matters to us."
msgstr "그럴 필요 없어, 우리에게 상관있는 건 니어의 머리뿐이니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = e170412b-c1e3-973a-4c6a-de0962fbc0da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DuergarCamp_State_ExplosivesAtCaveIn = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:e170412b-c1e3-973a-4c6a-de0962fbc0da
msgctxt "h43f094feg7a78g4c3cg9d25g99a87789430e"
msgid "Go on already, ignite the powder!"
msgstr "뭐해, 화약에 불을 붙여!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = e2160d0a-028a-04ff-f566-d8a403f833bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Moonrise_Knows_AbsoluteAtGrymforge = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:e2160d0a-028a-04ff-f566-d8a403f833bd
msgctxt "h5cdc6da1g2605g43fagaf2eg2de0030a80aa"
msgid ""
"Nere caught 'em scheming. Handed a few to an escort - dragged to Moonrise, "
"is my guess."
msgstr "니어가 놈들의 꿍꿍이를 알아채서 망정이지. 몇 놈은 호위를 붙여서 문라이즈로 끌려갔을 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = e57f6eb6-e36f-4db2-93a8-aec3735daf8f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 7da1f45d-e8d0-26c2-1a71-e2103698b218_Inclusion = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:e57f6eb6-e36f-4db2-93a8-aec3735daf8f
msgctxt "h01741de3g3fa9g46e6g94a7g640d1e7c1d91"
msgid ""
"Can't wait to pay these bastards back, lick for lick. Just say the word."
msgstr "이 개자식들에게 본때를 보여줘야겠어. 눈에는 눈 이에는 이라고. 난 준비됐어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = e6a08013-5902-46f4-98e3-b68b90d0979b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 7da1f45d-e8d0-26c2-1a71-e2103698b218_Inclusion = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:e6a08013-5902-46f4-98e3-b68b90d0979b
msgctxt "h34475754g849cg4b4ega363g686bc32edd67"
msgid ""
"Hmph. Not the most sophisticated way of getting what you want from someone, "
"is it?"
msgstr "흠. 누군가에게 원하는 걸 얻어내기에 썩 정교한 방법은 아니네, 그렇지 않아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = e6cfde8b-9ca2-3a39-8e34-f3d9ad0569f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:e6cfde8b-9ca2-3a39-8e34-f3d9ad0569f5
msgctxt "h0461bb2bg4303g4234gb4cag498af0c4f5e2"
msgid ""
"Heat up some rocks. Let's see how the little pricks do when we strap fire to "
"their legs."
msgstr "돌을 좀 달궈줘라. 이 좆만이들 다리에 불이 붙으면 더 서두르는지 보자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = ecf37386-c597-d7c4-2c97-10a62dbafaef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:ecf37386-c597-d7c4-2c97-10a62dbafaef
msgctxt "h5a01a461g8895g4719g9274g0a896db878b5"
msgid ""
"I need labour, not bloody advice. If I don't get this rubble clear and free "
"the True Soul, it'll be my head."
msgstr "난 일꾼이 필요해, 망할 충고가 아니라. 이 잔해를 치우고 참된 영혼을 구하지 못하면, 내 머리통이 날아갈 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = edf649f1-c730-0803-497a-bbd92f525086
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_DuergarGuardSergeant_GaveBoots(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DarkLake_Knows_GnomeHunt = True
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_State_HasBoots(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_DuergarGuardSergeant_Knows_MoreTalkative(1) = True
#.     - UND_DuergarGuardSergeant_GaveBoots(1) = True
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_InjuredGnome_Event_GiveBoots(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:edf649f1-c730-0803-497a-bbd92f525086
msgctxt "ha5fc9317g0ff9g4a7ag8394gfe245e5f1502"
msgid "<i>Give her the gnome's boots.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그녀에게 노움에게 받은 부츠를 준다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = ee6f36f6-09c1-9386-3ea6-890ceecd579e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:ee6f36f6-09c1-9386-3ea6-890ceecd579e
msgctxt "hb26fb2e1g86b9g4942gb3bbgc4623be0f9bf"
msgid "You gonna just leave him in there to choke? <i>Shit.</i>"
msgstr "그를 그냥 질식하게 내버려 두겠다고? <i>제길.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f24270ad-4659-4904-3ec3-56b1dd381eb7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_Event_AskedAboutCavein(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:f24270ad-4659-4904-3ec3-56b1dd381eb7
msgctxt "h6a247417gce61g44f6g98a0g08eb22228e46"
msgid "What are you hoping to find at this dig?"
msgstr "애초에 뭘 찾으려고 파내고 있었던 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = f607db27-abe4-dfa4-4715-2d1ed79729f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:f607db27-abe4-dfa4-4715-2d1ed79729f0
msgctxt "h7a82649cg2fd0g4439gae01g89524f4e790c"
msgid ""
"Crafty little shits, these ones. You need a stiff cane to keep 'em in line."
msgstr "짱구 한번 제대로 굴리는 년이었지. 놈들을 한 줄로 세우려거든 단단한 몽둥이부터 찾아보는 게 좋을걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = f74503cd-90d3-4795-0806-e8db07f0d0fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:f74503cd-90d3-4795-0806-e8db07f0d0fa
msgctxt "h50f4ef53g3022g4f5ega6dbg9fc64e8d0a97"
msgid ""
"He got me to recruit nonbelievers. But not everyone's seein' the Absolute's "
"truth."
msgstr "그가 나더러 불신자들을 모집하라고 하더군. 모든 이들이 절대자님의 진실을 보지는 못하니까 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = f8ada6bd-23ad-be16-30ec-fdcf64ece1d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:f8ada6bd-23ad-be16-30ec-fdcf64ece1d6
msgctxt "h0ad75b80geb68g47e5g950cg15256a48cad2"
msgid ""
"Scrying eye. Nere says the Absolute's scryers see through 'em. Watching. "
"<i>Judging.</i>"
msgstr ""
"감시하는 수정구다. 니어에 따르면 절대자님의 구슬 보는 자들이 그 눈을 통해 바라본다고 하더군. 감시하고. <i>판단한다고.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f8ba9423-b774-0921-175f-0085ed4b95b0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DEEPGNOME(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_DuergarGuardSergeant_Knows_AskedWhatHappened(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_DuergarCamp_Knows_NereIsTrapped = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:f8ba9423-b774-0921-175f-0085ed4b95b0
msgctxt "h1e060fafg3ed8g4c5cgbebfg98c2efc19c2d"
msgid "Judging by the sorry state of your dig, you should."
msgstr "네 안타까운 진행 상황을 보아하니, 그러는 게 좋을 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = f9af87df-de7b-384f-fa7a-88e1757830e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 7da1f45d-e8d0-26c2-1a71-e2103698b218_PlayerSaidHadPowder = True
#.   Object:
#.      - HasTaggedItem_EXPLOSIVES(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:f9af87df-de7b-384f-fa7a-88e1757830e8
msgctxt "ha34b0dc0g7e65g4e42g9aa2g286679e4330d"
msgid "Go on already, ignite the powder!"
msgstr "뭐해, 화약에 불을 붙여!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = faa928e1-4f03-488f-c5dd-fd3f42762e5b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:faa928e1-4f03-488f-c5dd-fd3f42762e5b
msgctxt "hcc6333c8ga80eg4cd9gbc30ga5b817615002"
msgid ""
"I'm no fool, <i>jargh</i>. Hand 'em over, or I'll bring the Absolute's fury."
msgstr "난 바보가 아니다, <i>자그</i>. 당장 그걸 넘겨, 아니면 절대자님의 분노를 맛보게 될 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = fe3a0dc3-e12d-2b66-3c95-f74bedbc9862
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Halsin_Quest_ToldAboutMoonrise = True
#.      - UND_Event_PartyTalkedAboutMoonrise = False
#.      - UND_Elevator_Event_GotWarning = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:fe3a0dc3-e12d-2b66-3c95-f74bedbc9862
msgctxt "h24b44e55ga8fag4148g8b3cg6b092adbea38"
msgid ""
"But one pudge got ballsy, set off a blast and skittered away in the ruckus. "
"And we still haven't found her."
msgstr "와중에 한 녀석이 겁대가리를 상실했는지 폭탄을 터뜨리고는 돌 사이로 숨어버렸어. 그리고 아직 찾지 못했지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = ff5fd2cf-a92e-a508-ddf4-25d7f2b9cdf7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - UND_CaveIn.DuergarAskedHelp(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant:ff5fd2cf-a92e-a508-ddf4-25d7f2b9cdf7
msgctxt "h8f5bc941ga662g4ff4gaac6g1ded9997130c"
msgid ""
"He's stuck in there with poisoned geysers. We don't get him out soon, it's "
"both our heads."
msgstr "안쪽에 독가스 분출구가 있는데 갇혀버렸어. 빨리 그를 꺼내지 못하면, 너와 나 둘 다 머리통이 날아갈 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 03cca3cd-1d8f-e31f-32c9-728cf489d663
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DuergarLoyal_State_Alive = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:03cca3cd-1d8f-e31f-32c9-728cf489d663
msgctxt "hc3078700g84c2g4228gb291gceb4bc6a83aa"
msgid "Death-curse be damned, we're heading to Moonrise."
msgstr "죽음의 저주고 나발이고, 우리는 문라이즈 타워로 간다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 05278a28-d34b-4100-9c39-be9d083dce48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:05278a28-d34b-4100-9c39-be9d083dce48
msgctxt "h0c947fbcg8f20g4165g9c06gda2d7e59e588"
msgid "I... I was wrong. I must free them."
msgstr "내... 내가 틀렸어. 노예들을 풀어줘야해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 05e2a5fd-cea7-4e5c-aa2d-39b8a8fa32c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:05e2a5fd-cea7-4e5c-aa2d-39b8a8fa32c4
msgctxt "hcea7af98g2498g478ega9c0gbe3634baac73"
msgid ""
"*The mark glows, but you feel nothing in response. Your illithid power is "
"beyond reach until you rest.*"
msgstr "*문양이 빛나지만, 어떤 반응도 느껴지지 않습니다. 일리시드 능력을 더 사용하려면 휴식을 취해야 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 060ef741-07bb-4e71-a9df-fb91769b2de7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 20944b51-cb63-849d-c45c-78049f514ea1_MindHasBeenRead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:060ef741-07bb-4e71-a9df-fb91769b2de7
msgctxt "h5c90cbacgad9fg4647g9894g4a51077e5855"
msgid "The gnomes won't survive the curse. What good is a gift of corpses?"
msgstr "노움은 저주를 버티지 못하고 다 죽을 거야. 시체를 선물해서 뭐하게?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 065a3c05-5e9f-8ca1-4afc-36c200a2b723
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BERSERKER(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:065a3c05-5e9f-8ca1-4afc-36c200a2b723
msgctxt "h8e7529efg5c88g4a4bgb4ddg62bd79603f8e"
msgid "FREE THEM, OR <b>ELSE.</b>"
msgstr "<b>풀어 줘. 안 그럼 <i>죽는다.</i></b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 0698db08-f37e-42e4-a28d-afa17bf3c66e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 20944b51-cb63-849d-c45c-78049f514ea1_MindHasBeenRead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:0698db08-f37e-42e4-a28d-afa17bf3c66e
msgctxt "h05bb4907gb89bg4267g88abgd894a37f639e"
msgid ""
"<i>Damn slaves better survive the journey before the death-curse chokes "
"'em.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 0e06cff0-e6c6-cb00-441c-4f905c10412f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:0e06cff0-e6c6-cb00-441c-4f905c10412f
msgctxt "hf0ed456ag381eg4891g8c31g973c620f1eee"
msgid ""
"The gnomes should be able to go where they please. They are not the "
"duergar's to keep."
msgstr "노움들은 가고 싶은 곳으로 갈 자유가 있어. 듀에르가가 붙잡아놓을 수는 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 108d591f-f937-4453-9322-cd98f33ed7fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 0
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 20944b51-cb63-849d-c45c-78049f514ea1_MindHasBeenRead = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CanDetectThoughts_2 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:108d591f-f937-4453-9322-cd98f33ed7fb
msgctxt "h02951c32g94cfg43b0gae1ag40764ef8a418"
msgid "<i>Read Thrinn's thoughts.</i>"
msgstr "<i>쓰린의 생각을 읽는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 1214b3d9-178c-0260-ab36-21b716432157
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:1214b3d9-178c-0260-ab36-21b716432157
msgctxt "h1a5615edgd300g47fagb926g59b072580c0b"
msgid "Speak up, chief. You can't just let the clan keep them."
msgstr "말 해, 대장. 그냥 저렇게 잡아가게 둘 수는 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 12aa7dc7-eec0-4ffa-a0dd-217aab5688d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount3(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount3(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:12aa7dc7-eec0-4ffa-a0dd-217aab5688d0
msgctxt "h1a86f8c8g81f8g480fgbc03ga5a1747e6b74"
msgid "*Your mind lurches, reeling suddenly as if... bitten.*"
msgstr "*뭔가에 깨물린 것처럼 느닷없이 정신이 휘청거립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 161e06c5-bd5b-02ab-8027-98d8af882bec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:161e06c5-bd5b-02ab-8027-98d8af882bec
msgctxt "hd35a974bge016g4b4eg8324gedad2f9f743b"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 2b520b1b-f270-4dd1-a6c5-bda93fb7faab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount2(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount2(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:2b520b1b-f270-4dd1-a6c5-bda93fb7faab
msgctxt "h316f4638g36b6g4554g940fge47de76eb9ef"
msgid ""
"*Something stirs deep within you, hungry and alert... it's taking something "
"you'll never get back.*"
msgstr "*몸 깊숙한 데서 굶주리고 기민한 존재가 꿈틀댑니다... 잃으면 되찾지 못할 뭔가를 좀먹고 있군요.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2d55d0ae-4445-4901-9c15-076b9919cef9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:2d55d0ae-4445-4901-9c15-076b9919cef9
msgctxt "h2af170c3g145dg4aacgb859gfa09c7f46f2c"
msgid ""
"<i>Call on the parasite, connect with Thrinn. 'The gnomes must go free.'</i>"
msgstr "<i>기생충을 불러내, 쓰린의 정신에 연결한다. '노움을 풀어줘야 한다.'</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 2db3b35e-59cf-cce8-25eb-ca3da9a643b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:2db3b35e-59cf-cce8-25eb-ca3da9a643b7
msgctxt "h3be20e77g9481g4ddfg9cc1g9c87304ee211"
msgid "Fine. I'm in no mood to butt heads with another True Soul."
msgstr "그러지. 참된 영혼하고 실랑이할 기분도 아니니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3198c10b-dc48-497a-bcc2-68a6e8fb4794
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_Mutineers_Event_FailedtoFreeGnomes = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:3198c10b-dc48-497a-bcc2-68a6e8fb4794
msgctxt "hef8ed61bg5a80g4293ga55eg8fcb09a945ee"
msgid "You sicken me. It's time I cut you down once and for all."
msgstr "역겹군. 이만 널 끝장낼 때가 됐다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 349b1064-5734-319e-19f3-02323b2f2331
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:349b1064-5734-319e-19f3-02323b2f2331
msgctxt "hfdb285f9g363ag476cg9bb0g9d0a30fc92c4"
msgid ""
"Brittle are the foundations upon which the houses of tyrants are built. It "
"seems I judged you to be less brittle than you really are."
msgstr "폭군들의 집이 세워지는 토대는 연약하지. 보아하니 내가 너를 덜 연약하다고 과대평가한 거 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 39ca6f67-70eb-5208-e473-63cbe0644267
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:39ca6f67-70eb-5208-e473-63cbe0644267
msgctxt "h4047572fg415dg40a9g8b29g087a9eece492"
msgid "But the Absolute's blessed me. She'll guide my steps."
msgstr "하지만 절대자께서 나를 축복해주셨어. 그분이 길을 인도해 주시겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3ac5807b-bb46-7806-0e1a-9eccbf268c5e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:3ac5807b-bb46-7806-0e1a-9eccbf268c5e
msgctxt "h833b346fg636eg4b67gb6ddgfddc976c231c"
msgid "What can you tell me about the General?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 3c6f2f37-12ba-c443-705e-5d5fd8607295
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:3c6f2f37-12ba-c443-705e-5d5fd8607295
msgctxt "h7c19ebffgd154g4f3fgbfbbg6ecf21d6971d"
msgid "Nothing but cursed shadows from here to Moonrise."
msgstr "여기서 문라이즈까진 저주받은 그림자밖에 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 3e3b585d-ba4f-b5b2-9ae2-87b904babc3a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:3e3b585d-ba4f-b5b2-9ae2-87b904babc3a
msgctxt "ha538eecfgf39bg470eg97f4ga9090b9da66b"
msgid "You got it, <i>jargh. </i>In the Absolute's name!"
msgstr "원대로 해 주지, <i>자그.</i> 절대자의 이름으로 막아 주마!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 42d96b34-f402-e372-39c0-46828c04ceb8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:42d96b34-f402-e372-39c0-46828c04ceb8
msgctxt "h949f7ee2g1344g4703gb0e1gc51ecc7f67d9"
msgid "C'mon, then. <i>Try me.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 42dbf567-c4b1-470e-bfc8-2e9b80e22188
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday2(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday2(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:42dbf567-c4b1-470e-bfc8-2e9b80e22188
msgctxt "h72785e0eg63d8g4714ga26eg94ae136b7abe"
msgid "<i>Draw on the power within to enforce your will.</i>"
msgstr "<i>몸 속에 흐르는 힘을 끌어내 본인의 의지를 관철한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5a20db84-8893-45ff-9200-e17450ce385b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount6(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount6(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:5a20db84-8893-45ff-9200-e17450ce385b
msgctxt "h7e6d134eg5ffcg4a5eg84cegaf9b700f037c"
msgid ""
"*The presence deep in your mind is awake, unblinking. This is it. A single "
"word pervades your consciousness: 'Soon'.*"
msgstr ""
"*당신의 정신 속 깊이 자리잡은 존재가 태연스레 깨어납니다. 올 것이 왔군요. 한 단어가 당신의 의식 속으로 스며듭니다. ‘곧’*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5cdd5550-5c7e-c7a8-bea4-97fed53e98e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_Mutineers_Event_FailedtoFreeGnomes = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:5cdd5550-5c7e-c7a8-bea4-97fed53e98e0
msgctxt "he7e85d23ge9b5g4f22ga6f1g58cae34300a0"
msgid "I am freeing these gnomes. Just try and stop me."
msgstr "이 노움들을 풀어줄 거야. 어디 한 번 막아 보시든가."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 5f21d56f-da28-fe0e-e678-76bf32733c20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:5f21d56f-da28-fe0e-e678-76bf32733c20
msgctxt "hf776f0bfg3dd7g4a79g8b67gdcebaecf3565"
msgid ""
"I'll tell him how Nere failed, how the Absolute favoured <i>me</i>. He'll "
"promote me to True Soul - I feel it in my bones."
msgstr ""
"니어가 실패했다는 걸, 절대자께서 총애하신 건 <i>나</i>였다는 걸 알려드릴 거다. 그러면 틀림없이 나를 참된 영혼으로 진급시켜 "
"주시겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 61cd94a8-740f-9b04-c715-004546ef7a6e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:61cd94a8-740f-9b04-c715-004546ef7a6e
msgctxt "hce619b62g3737g498agbae9gaf50f6e04d01"
msgid "I'm going to Moonrise. And that death-curse won't be stopping me."
msgstr "난 문라이즈로 갈 거다. 그 죽음의 저주도 날 막진 못할 테지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 61fa59f9-5d22-918e-53a7-7e2b4a56da3a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_Elevator_Event_GotWarning = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:61fa59f9-5d22-918e-53a7-7e2b4a56da3a
msgctxt "h32257bd7g6801g476ag86dag9c89404a3655"
msgid "You mentioned a death-curse. Is the journey so dangerous?"
msgstr "아까 말한 죽음의 저주라는 것 말인데, 가는 길이 그렇게 위험한가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 6690f5fe-e3d5-780f-b4d5-d3480e5e8344
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:6690f5fe-e3d5-780f-b4d5-d3480e5e8344
msgctxt "h765bdd7cge371g4767gb264gb446267ac489"
msgid "The Absolute will clear my way. Not one shred of doubt."
msgstr "절대자께서 나의 길을 내어주실 것이다. 한 치도 믿어 의심치 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 716de03e-61d0-bef0-e1b0-502a909339f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:716de03e-61d0-bef0-e1b0-502a909339f7
msgctxt "h0fb49d55g742cg47eagac0cgcfab28519b07"
msgid "I'm... speechless. Wow. Just... just wow."
msgstr "난... 할 말이 없네. 와, 그냥... 와..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 762da863-6f2d-492b-9073-62763a71f703
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_State_LeaderFreedGnomes = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:762da863-6f2d-492b-9073-62763a71f703
msgctxt "h16211029g65deg412cg8e72g24b0331d87f8"
msgid "Get out of here, squat-pricks - before I toss you all in the fires."
msgstr "여기서 꺼져, 난쟁이 자식들아 - 너흴 화염에 던져 버리기 전에."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 78a27d95-7ed7-4522-a99c-1c94e0fcfa03
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:78a27d95-7ed7-4522-a99c-1c94e0fcfa03
msgctxt "h2316df13g9ae4g46d3g9b65g7b713de9a247"
msgid "Shit - you're on to something, hate to say."
msgstr "젠장 - 이런 말 하기 싫지만, 네가 감을 잡은 것 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 791afa4f-c5f5-4a3b-b71e-9a6a5f2797a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.     - TRUESOUL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:791afa4f-c5f5-4a3b-b71e-9a6a5f2797a2
msgctxt "h70b0f990gaf94g4375g9146g1853d0bb09a0"
msgid ""
"*Your mind is full, bursting with ecstasy and terror. Finally, it is coming. "
"You are becoming.*"
msgstr "*당신의 정신이 황홀경과 공포로 가득 차오릅니다. 마침내, 때가 됐군요. 당신은 변화 중입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7d672d30-16ec-5b58-14e9-d59daa79f0ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_GnomeWorkers_State_PermaDefeated = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:7d672d30-16ec-5b58-14e9-d59daa79f0ca
msgctxt "h186a5bb7g3c52g4fe7g8e7ega18ccb052baf"
msgid "What about the slaves? What happens to them?"
msgstr "노예들은? 그들은 어떻게 되는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 841d9633-ffa7-42da-a4e0-fd28de99f1f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday2(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#.      - ILLITHID(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday2(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:841d9633-ffa7-42da-a4e0-fd28de99f1f6
msgctxt "hff17d1c3ge316g4cd6g99fbg731fe93984bb"
msgid "<i>Draw on the power within to enforce your will.</i>"
msgstr "<i>몸 속에 흐르는 힘을 끌어내 본인의 의지를 관철한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 8ee0e32a-01c3-ad89-ff6c-8e0232de7e99
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_Mutineers_Event_FailedtoFreeGnomes = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:8ee0e32a-01c3-ad89-ff6c-8e0232de7e99
msgctxt "h7a9f0b9egc6a8g4c44g8a53ga4c200343bf5"
msgid ""
"My arse, She did. If the Absolute wants 'em gone, the General himself will "
"tell me."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 9a915817-8b49-c7c8-0aec-d09910903ff1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:9a915817-8b49-c7c8-0aec-d09910903ff1
msgctxt "h74654f6ege4f8g4a5dg9be4g19010d9c951f"
msgid "Yes. They will serve the Absolute's Chosen."
msgstr "그래, 절대자께 선택받은 분을 모시게 되겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9fc47361-19e9-465d-983d-2c85b99aca90
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#.      - ILLITHID(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:9fc47361-19e9-465d-983d-2c85b99aca90
msgctxt "hfac477f3g5f96g41cdga05egc85e80836ba6"
msgid ""
"<i>Call on the parasite, connect with Thrinn. 'The gnomes must go free.'</i>"
msgstr "<i>기생충을 불러내, 쓰린의 정신에 연결한다. '노움을 풀어줘야 한다.'</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = a1c5a885-154c-5400-aaa1-9b962c64b229
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:a1c5a885-154c-5400-aaa1-9b962c64b229
msgctxt "h23ac920fg7fdbg460dg8258g8c4f807aa142"
msgid ""
"What else? They're coming with us. A gift to the General from his new "
"faithful."
msgstr "어쩌긴? 당연히 데려가야지. 충직한 부하로써 장군께 드릴 선물이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a3643ccd-01bd-4521-8739-4f9cbd1d2873
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - GLO_TadpoleIntro_NPC(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - GLO_TadpoleIntro_NPC(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:a3643ccd-01bd-4521-8739-4f9cbd1d2873
msgctxt "he4091d52gaf36g4a08g8d23g68ac5d7e3b10"
msgid ""
"*A strange symbol glows, marked on their flesh, and something within you "
"stirs in response.*"
msgstr "*그들의 살갗에 새겨진 기묘한 상징이 빛나고, 이에 반응하여 당신 내면의 무언가가 꿈틀거립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = afdbdaaa-3281-5c80-bf57-467f765fa6c1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_DuergarMutineerFollowUp_Event_Happened = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:afdbdaaa-3281-5c80-bf57-467f765fa6c1
msgctxt "hf56f41dagc09fg458eg8601g559270408d84"
msgid "I'll be damned. Nere's gone and kicked it."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b4f390e2-d8eb-4db3-993c-e06f7854d83b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - GLO_TadpoleIntro_NPC(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:b4f390e2-d8eb-4db3-993c-e06f7854d83b
msgctxt "h1576382cgaf18g42e9g9b0bgcfe70ea38dbc"
msgid "*As the symbol glows, power courses through you. <i>Authority</i>.*"
msgstr "*문양이 빛나며, 몸에 흐르는 힘이 느껴집니다. <i>권위</i>.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = b7b482bd-f216-4233-9122-c57482d27f86
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - TemporaryHostilityAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:b7b482bd-f216-4233-9122-c57482d27f86
msgctxt "hc3380ab8gb82cg4180gafe8gcb861d3029b0"
msgid "I know what you're trying. And I won't stand for it, <i>jargh!</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = b8b50e49-55b4-01e7-602e-af5b98b5b142
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Moonrise_Knows_AbsoluteAtGrymforge = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:b8b50e49-55b4-01e7-602e-af5b98b5b142
msgctxt "h6d8e2b45g5170g449agaaebgd5d20d7a2bd8"
msgid "It's time I met the General in the flesh."
msgstr "드디어 장군님을 직접 뵙겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = bc676015-8c20-4a34-a054-337235e08a59
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount4(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount4(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:bc676015-8c20-4a34-a054-337235e08a59
msgctxt "h4646ff81g7816g4c1agab8fg16dde4704502"
msgid ""
"*A shadow swims across your vision, and a familiar voice tells you to be "
"calm. You are loved.*"
msgstr "*그림자가 낀 듯이 눈앞이 흐려지더니, 익숙한 목소리가 당신을 달래줍니다. 사랑이 느껴집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c7674ab7-bb89-4088-9111-24ddac7dd9c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount1(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount1(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:c7674ab7-bb89-4088-9111-24ddac7dd9c6
msgctxt "h7c68bd04g9ccfg461cga83eg06f8422cb083"
msgid "*A shiver runs across your mind... You feel sated.*"
msgstr "*전율이 불현듯 머릿속을 스쳐 지나가고... 만족감이 듭니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c8e1f4eb-1932-4e99-a797-780c13a51703
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:c8e1f4eb-1932-4e99-a797-780c13a51703
msgctxt "h217f1c80g9e5eg4c28g83bagec47c42cc145"
msgid ""
"*You focus on the source of the power, but it is quiet and still. It needs "
"to rest.*"
msgstr "*힘의 원천인 존재에 정신을 집중하지만, 응답이 없습니다. 휴식이 필요한 겁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d0c5e2e1-7ada-118d-8381-ad7a49af48fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:d0c5e2e1-7ada-118d-8381-ad7a49af48fb
msgctxt "hd0225782g26c2g41fdg8d71ga37fa4ba9b2c"
msgid "<i>Attack Thrinn.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = d2aacabf-69e2-d342-52c8-5833fe9ae484
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:d2aacabf-69e2-d342-52c8-5833fe9ae484
msgctxt "h83732116gc4c2g4135g93f7g8bba57e0e3a3"
msgid "Hah. Bastard can dream on. Right?"
msgstr "하, 개자식이 꿈도 크네. 그렇지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d981b3fa-ff00-406d-b79e-591f95d84f63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount5(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount5(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:d981b3fa-ff00-406d-b79e-591f95d84f63
msgctxt "h73175a0fg30ddg4863g94bbg304ef01aa27a"
msgid ""
"*Your blood runs quicker, feeding the gnawing absence at the centre of your "
"mind.*"
msgstr "*피가 더 빨리 흐르면서, 당신의 정신 한가운데를 좀먹는 허전함을 양분으로 채웁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = dac6484e-6c85-53c3-0bd7-8a8635abbeb1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:dac6484e-6c85-53c3-0bd7-8a8635abbeb1
msgctxt "hb6d798cdg728ag4e29g9d86g22f202a6d8c4"
msgid "Don't you get it? Nere fell - and I'm the one standing."
msgstr "아직도 모르겠나? 니어는 죽었어. 살아남은 건 나라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = deb6ef01-e626-fbf9-4914-ea09e6e72aa9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:deb6ef01-e626-fbf9-4914-ea09e6e72aa9
msgctxt "hde43cb26g846ag45c1gb716g22f4f3c087c6"
msgid "Your heart made of stone? They deserved freedom - and you denied it."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = dfb54097-8d74-1012-bd9d-0fbbe305c153
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DuergarLoyal_State_Alive = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:dfb54097-8d74-1012-bd9d-0fbbe305c153
msgctxt "h0cdd2825gfdebg4f14g9708g0232dec09c0d"
msgid "Listen, you pricks. Grab your gear and get ready to move."
msgstr "잘 들어라, 좆만이들아. 장비를 챙기고 떠날 준비를 해라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = e4502f03-0578-4d7c-dc29-1fe18d8175c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:e4502f03-0578-4d7c-dc29-1fe18d8175c4
msgctxt "h01755b94gde1cg4357g9961gdd3be52748b3"
msgid "Try it, <i>jargh. </i>Let's find out who the Absolute favours."
msgstr "덤벼 보시지, <i>자그.</i> 절대자께서 총애하시는 게 누군지 두고 보자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = e65c5289-3f0b-188c-bc86-a701b4f15d06
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:e65c5289-3f0b-188c-bc86-a701b4f15d06
msgctxt "hc4535ac9g2963g42fbg9bd6g630e6827c8b5"
msgid ""
"Absolute's Chosen, Nere said. Building an army at Moonrise - nothing goes "
"without his say-so."
msgstr ""
"절대자의 선택받은 자라고 니어가 말했었지. 문라이즈에서 군대를 양성하고 계신다지, 그분의 허락 없이는 그 어떤 것도 움직이지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = ee556887-fdf8-f6f1-6e07-e20de0d658ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:ee556887-fdf8-f6f1-6e07-e20de0d658ed
msgctxt "h7b0c4b2cgc44ag4acbga209ge21afd0c4dcf"
msgid "Did She now? Well - not the time to go debatin' with a True Soul."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f2f0077d-185b-8c4e-212c-aa38bba73c4c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:f2f0077d-185b-8c4e-212c-aa38bba73c4c
msgctxt "h9e04370fg9739g49e7g94e6g4131863f1f89"
msgid "Good idea. They will make a fine offering."
msgstr "좋은 생각이야. 훌륭한 제물이 될 것 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f655bc01-f5dc-e370-2b16-c59a80d7f472
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_Elevator_Event_GotWarning = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:f655bc01-f5dc-e370-2b16-c59a80d7f472
msgctxt "hd4f1203bg75d3g4514g9347gc6246bcd5ad0"
msgid "The surface is dangerous. Are you sure it's safe to travel?"
msgstr "지면에 위험이 도사리고 있어. 여기로 가도 안전한 거 맞아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = f8b527c7-ce7e-cd33-c595-c60e12445ac1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalSergeant_FollowUp:f8b527c7-ce7e-cd33-c595-c60e12445ac1
msgctxt "ha4a1d9d1gdc4cg4578gbd5bge483c6809a82"
msgid "Then show me. And may the Absolute bless the victor!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalWry
#. Speaker = Mind Master Dunnol
#. NodeID = 0c74b7e0-024f-9116-1cf1-854cc357cbbc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DuergarCamp_State_ExplosivesAtCaveIn = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalWry:0c74b7e0-024f-9116-1cf1-854cc357cbbc
msgctxt "h7c19253ag5171g4063gb0afg0867a496494a"
msgid "Get yourself set before that powder goes <i>boom.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalWry
#. Speaker = Mind Master Dunnol
#. NodeID = 58b5381e-d3bf-dce1-5974-f4d160ea1bf0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DuergarMutineers_State_PermaDefeated = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalWry:58b5381e-d3bf-dce1-5974-f4d160ea1bf0
msgctxt "h22fa6b94g6dc5g4f03g98a9g40964b90815e"
msgid "<i>Drugnin' </i>heathens went asking for it."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalWry
#. Speaker = Mind Master Dunnol
#. NodeID = 8ed756db-f677-eb74-bda1-f93f82722629
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_DuergarGuardWry_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalWry:8ed756db-f677-eb74-bda1-f93f82722629
msgctxt "h72b4ee2agf185g4b8agb235g543b764176a0"
msgid "If the True Soul dies, you're gettin' the blame."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalWry
#. Speaker = Mind Master Dunnol
#. NodeID = a981bdfa-299b-0453-6fbc-2bf040191dfa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_DuergarGuardWry_HasMet(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_DuergarGuardWry_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarLoyalWry:a981bdfa-299b-0453-6fbc-2bf040191dfa
msgctxt "h28c71975g6949g4ab5g8714g9bf5b9a4f247"
msgid "Bugger off. You're distractin' the slaves. They run, you're dead."
msgstr "꺼져. 네가 노예들을 신경 쓰이게 하잖아. 저들이 달아나면, 넌 죽은 목숨인줄 알아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_Camp
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = 05921f21-0f4b-99fc-caaf-b62e2232ea1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_Camp:05921f21-0f4b-99fc-caaf-b62e2232ea1f
msgctxt "h7a3b0fc7g2c27g4315g991fg2fdcbcce6c4e"
msgid "Heh. Likewise. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_Camp
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = 07f0cff1-183d-a0fa-20aa-1b5ab717058e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_HasMet2(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_Camp:07f0cff1-183d-a0fa-20aa-1b5ab717058e
msgctxt "hd478a5b6g3bd3g4042gbf7ag15b155a6a86d"
msgid "Cough up some coin or bugger off. I'm outta nice things to say."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_Camp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3e18620d-2be1-1304-7185-69ddd13c18b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_Camp:3e18620d-2be1-1304-7185-69ddd13c18b1
msgctxt "h1e903b0fg446eg4d38g92ccgb44efc47a111"
msgid "Well, <i>I</i> like you, Greymon."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_Camp
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = 4035cfa5-df1d-f0ff-200d-90e125999411
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DuergarCamp_State_SidedMutineers = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_HasMet2(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_Camp:4035cfa5-df1d-f0ff-200d-90e125999411
msgctxt "h5cc83928g71e7g49f1g94b4g4a7e8ec36276"
msgid "You had our backs. Guess you True Souls ain't all bad."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_Camp
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = 4086b833-c1d5-bbeb-bcaa-999aee9133ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_Camp:4086b833-c1d5-bbeb-bcaa-999aee9133ae
msgctxt "he425a658gd290g40ddgb7b2g49ab3ad77500"
msgid ""
"What <i>you</i> want anyway? Here to yap or looking to buy? Dry land means "
"fresh stock."
msgstr "그래서 <i>넌</i> 원하는 게 뭐야? 지껄이려고 온 거야, 아니면 뭘 사려고 온 거야? 마른 땅은 신선한 재고를 뜻하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_Camp
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = 47681d69-ba29-3eda-0331-239e2e868aba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_TheDrowNere_State_PermaDefeated = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_HasMet2(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_Camp:47681d69-ba29-3eda-0331-239e2e868aba
msgctxt "h8953e1f0gfcc8g4c0fgba02gf9a98f7a555b"
msgid "Thought you were a True Soul - didn't figure you'd off Nere."
msgstr "네가 참된 영혼이라고 생각했는데, 니어를 죽여버릴 줄은 몰랐군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_Camp
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = 7a4a58fe-4a80-5862-89b1-f8d3b527385a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_Camp:7a4a58fe-4a80-5862-89b1-f8d3b527385a
msgctxt "h39acd5a4g5ff9g4346gad0bgcb3dfd53e08e"
msgid ""
"Seeing as I ain't getting paid soon, I need all the coin I can bloody get."
msgstr "월급을 조만간 받기는 그른 것 같으니 최대한 돈을 긁어모아야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_Camp
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = 9b8cff6f-8a22-273f-5732-116c740f0671
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_DuergarGuardSergeant_HasMet(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_DuergarGuardSergeant_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_Camp:9b8cff6f-8a22-273f-5732-116c740f0671
msgctxt "hb4795f08ge5d5g4afbgb247g04fa52de6c7a"
msgid ""
"Thrinn's in a right ball-ache. That rubble ain't budgin' - no matter how "
"hard she whips them gnomes. Nere is gonna be <i>pissed.</i>"
msgstr ""
"쓰린이 아주 좆됐군. 저 잔해는 꼼짝도 안 할 거야. 그녀가 얼마나 열심히 노움에게 채찍질해 대든 말이지. 니어가 아주 <i>화가 "
"머리끝까지 나겠는데. </i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_Camp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a1de6ec8-5e4e-ff6e-913a-746030910ea4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_Camp:a1de6ec8-5e4e-ff6e-913a-746030910ea4
msgctxt "h45cdbbaagcfd0g4caegbfc7g3e22a4b6c860"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_Camp
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = afe986ee-b612-ba76-fefb-2ad76e00dc47
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_Camp:afe986ee-b612-ba76-fefb-2ad76e00dc47
msgctxt "h063b1e19g095fg4715gb455g3a8ed2a25263"
msgid "Either part with coin or jog on. Don't want to miss any of this."
msgstr "동전을 내 놓거나, 가던 길 가. 하나도 놓치고 싶지 않으니까 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_Camp
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = b378475b-9d43-352a-866b-e21dedeb9901
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_Camp:b378475b-9d43-352a-866b-e21dedeb9901
msgctxt "hda710743g205eg4205gbc3fg9df58562e130"
msgid "Urgh. I take it back - you're an <i>absolute </i>gobshite."
msgstr "으윽. 취소하지, 넌 <i>완전 </i>머저리구만."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_Camp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bb227253-e977-d38b-1383-c28dc7d64868
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_Camp:bb227253-e977-d38b-1383-c28dc7d64868
msgctxt "h2ab83745g39f7g413cg83a4gb1ccfcd0c4be"
msgid "Let's see what you have."
msgstr "뭘 가지고 있는지 보여줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_Camp
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = c729693f-3ca4-4f08-d5d6-c30da4b2226c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_Camp:c729693f-3ca4-4f08-d5d6-c30da4b2226c
msgctxt "hb5bf57c3g04dbg419cg8324g25035cff2b66"
msgid ""
"I mean, still don't like ya. But you're not a total gobshite. Bah. You "
"buying?"
msgstr "내 말은, 아직 네가 마음에 들진 않아. 하지만 완전히 머저리도 아니지. 그래서, 살 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_Camp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d89e6828-8aa6-d36d-9209-16b0629eeab9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_Camp:d89e6828-8aa6-d36d-9209-16b0629eeab9
msgctxt "h535ff957g7e8dg4e89g842ag2d17460450cf"
msgid "That's fine. You're shithead anyway."
msgstr "괜찮아. 네가 좆같은 놈인건 똑같으니까 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_Camp
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = e438c7d0-ff7b-cc1c-3ae1-190a8d3c76cf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_TheDrowNere_State_PermaDefeated = False
#.      - UND_DuergarCamp_State_SidedMutineers = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_Camp:e438c7d0-ff7b-cc1c-3ae1-190a8d3c76cf
msgctxt "hda722e67ga749g4732gbea9gd72d2815702a"
msgid "Come back any time. I'll be here - enjoying the show."
msgstr "그럼 언제든 다시 오라고. 난 여기 있을 테니까, 광경을 즐기면서 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_Camp
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = f29596dd-83dd-a10a-39e2-ec73b5fa5d8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_DuergarGuardSergeant_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_Camp:f29596dd-83dd-a10a-39e2-ec73b5fa5d8a
msgctxt "he0fda723g056cg46b4gb9b7g002db713119c"
msgid ""
"Heh. Waitin' for Thrinn to blow a gasket and start kicking the rubble. Best "
"thing I've seen in a tenday."
msgstr "헤. 쓰린이 완전히 폭발해서 잔해를 발로 차기 시작하는 것만 기다리고 있어. 최근에 본 것 중에 가장 재밌는 광경이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Morghal
#. NodeID = 0a4e60fd-8e12-1e7b-b887-ee97c4c60f0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:0a4e60fd-8e12-1e7b-b887-ee97c4c60f0a
msgctxt "h23a591d3g0258g44a2g8567g164f9f0d3b12"
msgid "I call it the True Soul special."
msgstr "난 그걸 참된 영혼 특별요금이라고 불러."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0bb9de66-c1da-f1c1-4f0a-c09512689393
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - d74f3f16-8952-e17f-0c52-5d3a0fbf7bbc_TrueSoulPath = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:0bb9de66-c1da-f1c1-4f0a-c09512689393
msgctxt "hc10a7373gc6fcg4df4g85adg05277fe08c01"
msgid "I am a True Soul. You will treat me with honour."
msgstr "난 참된 영혼이다. 날 명예롭게 대하도록."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Morghal
#. NodeID = 13d3acc4-3d52-fa57-ba2a-82eec7368238
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:13d3acc4-3d52-fa57-ba2a-82eec7368238
msgctxt "h34e4d0e9g8276g4ce4g9d1cg003761790739"
msgid "Clan's on edge - as like to tear a stranger right up."
msgstr "일족은 신경이 날카로운 상태다. 마치 어떤 이방인을 지금이라도 찢어발기고 싶어하는 것 같더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 21c5bed8-30ec-3ed2-2efe-5d6981e1d8df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DarkLake_Knows_GnomeHunt = True
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_State_HasBoots(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:21c5bed8-30ec-3ed2-2efe-5d6981e1d8df
msgctxt "h5f8b3028g4ee0g42e1gaa65gf3b010cfdcd6"
msgid "I'm here to see the sergeant. I have her boots."
msgstr "하사관을 만나러 왔다. 그녀의 부츠를 가지고 있거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 21c5fe78-218f-ee05-d009-58c1836f81d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DarkLake_Knows_GnomeHunt = False
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_State_HasBoots(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:21c5fe78-218f-ee05-d009-58c1836f81d7
msgctxt "hcfbdea95gcf48g4497gb85dg430b11a99e9b"
msgid "I was told to report to the sergeant."
msgstr "하사관한테 보고하라고 하던데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26314d82-db18-e50d-42d6-a195eaabf07a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:26314d82-db18-e50d-42d6-a195eaabf07a
msgctxt "he04e2bbag99a0g4457ga43fg4e2474f82fd7"
msgid "Such insolence. I should take your head for this."
msgstr "아주 무례하군. 이걸로 네 머리를 가져가야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = 35b078e9-e2f4-9218-7710-e8c749220f1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:35b078e9-e2f4-9218-7710-e8c749220f1f
msgctxt "h4bf24a82gd56eg43bbga059g08afc3d90f14"
msgid "I'll be shagged to Shanatar. Shit's looking up."
msgstr "뿅가 죽네. 개 같은 주머니 사정이 좋아지는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4c56f885-b052-f146-42a2-a330006b52dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:4c56f885-b052-f146-42a2-a330006b52dd
msgctxt "h014ca1f4g2d4fg44bbg9e20gda8f1f6a36f7"
msgid "Fine - take this. Consider it a goodwill gesture. |XXX gold|"
msgstr "좋아. 이걸 가져가. 호의의 표시라고 생각해. |XXX gold|"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Morghal
#. NodeID = 5259d613-76db-1e7e-2c80-2026184cbe57
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:5259d613-76db-1e7e-2c80-2026184cbe57
msgctxt "h519462a4g33deg4757g8fe8gfdb99ed635ff"
msgid ""
"You want in? Pay the toll. You'll slip through like a dagger through dung."
msgstr "들어가고 싶어? 그럼 통행료를 내. 그럼 똥을 지나는 단검처럼 들어갈 수 있을 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = 54fbb1ba-74dc-9904-adaa-a25e1fbf0791
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:54fbb1ba-74dc-9904-adaa-a25e1fbf0791
msgctxt "h720206cbgbd24g4a3eg94b6g684870edc1bd"
msgid "Easy to feed, fat thumbs for digging. Won't find none better."
msgstr "먹이기도 쉽고, 손가락이 두꺼워서 파는 것도 잘하지. 이보다 좋은 놈들은 못 찾을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Morghal
#. NodeID = 5bff5588-38b1-3195-3478-195906425080
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_DuergarCamp_State_DocksHostile = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:5bff5588-38b1-3195-3478-195906425080
msgctxt "h8f129dedgd60cg4ba1ga600g67360ac4715f"
msgid "Been wanting a reason to choke the life out of you, shit-for-brains."
msgstr "네 숨통을 끊을 이유만 찾고 있었어, 대가리에 뇌 대신 똥만 있는 놈아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Morghal
#. NodeID = 5fc1f821-519f-4e4a-eb91-28ecb75c0bac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DEEPGNOME
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:5fc1f821-519f-4e4a-eb91-28ecb75c0bac
msgctxt "h89ac80d1g3a8ag42bfg9d5cg8f291d69b272"
msgid "A prick-squeak like you should fit <i>right</i> in."
msgstr "너 같은 좆만한 쥐새끼는 바로 어울릴 수 있겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Morghal
#. NodeID = 5fc1f821-519f-4e4a-eb91-28ecb75c0bac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DUERGARDWARF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:5fc1f821-519f-4e4a-eb91-28ecb75c0bac
msgctxt "h25401969g8d8cg4543gbec2gada2dc072197"
msgid "If you weren't <i>clan-sen</i>, I'd put those fat paws to work."
msgstr "네가 <i>클란센</i>이 아니었다면, 널 당장 노예로 부려 먹었을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Morghal
#. NodeID = 5fc1f821-519f-4e4a-eb91-28ecb75c0bac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DROWELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:5fc1f821-519f-4e4a-eb91-28ecb75c0bac
msgctxt "h047c9648gab6eg4f8eg8c8egab3cac53829d"
msgid "If you weren't a drow-hoon, I'd put those feelers to work."
msgstr "네가 드로우 <i>훈</i>만 아니었으면, 일이나 시켰을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Morghal
#. NodeID = 5fc1f821-519f-4e4a-eb91-28ecb75c0bac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:5fc1f821-519f-4e4a-eb91-28ecb75c0bac
msgctxt "h34263838g6156g4866ga81dg0c8dcac6ded6"
msgid "But your type got their uses. Let's get those meat-paws to work."
msgstr "하지만 너 같은 놈들도 쓸모가 있지. 그 고기덩어리 끌고 일하러 가자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 61e41eec-3383-3a2c-6bd4-def5023b1435
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DarkLake_Knows_GnomeHunt = True
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_State_HasBoots(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:61e41eec-3383-3a2c-6bd4-def5023b1435
msgctxt "h58e775d3g97e5g42bdg9e26g182221ee719b"
msgid "I'm here to see the sergeant. I have her boots."
msgstr "하사관을 만나러 왔다. 그녀의 부츠를 가지고 있거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Morghal
#. NodeID = 6d603521-b799-8092-36d3-7404016d1d5f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:6d603521-b799-8092-36d3-7404016d1d5f
msgctxt "h234e9823g687bg4c11g839cg214cb311ea36"
msgid ""
"<i>Drugh</i> no. The twat-Soul caused a rockfall. Trapped tighter than a "
"ring on a fat finger."
msgstr "<i>지랄</i>, 당연히 아니지. 우리 참된 씹것이 낙석을 일으켜서, 뚱뚱한 손가락에 낀 반지처럼 꽉 갇혀버렸다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Morghal
#. NodeID = 70cc86f7-7a88-b720-4cd1-53a28f28972a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DUERGARDWARF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:70cc86f7-7a88-b720-4cd1-53a28f28972a
msgctxt "h7ff1461eg091cg4bf7gb79bgaee813da80f4"
msgid "Who's the <i>clan-sen</i>, Greymon - another merc for the dig?"
msgstr "저 <i>클란센</i>은 누구야, 그레이몬, 작업에 참여하러 온 다른 용병인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Morghal
#. NodeID = 70cc86f7-7a88-b720-4cd1-53a28f28972a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DROWELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:70cc86f7-7a88-b720-4cd1-53a28f28972a
msgctxt "h1ac619d8g1315g40a9g82bfg2d68b24934f3"
msgid ""
"Who's the <i>hoon</i>, Greymon - friend of Nere's? Or you plowin' drow now?"
msgstr "이 <i>훈</i>은 또 뭐야, 그레이몬. 니어의 친구인가? 아니면 이제 드로우랑 박아대기라도 하는 거냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Morghal
#. NodeID = 70cc86f7-7a88-b720-4cd1-53a28f28972a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:70cc86f7-7a88-b720-4cd1-53a28f28972a
msgctxt "hae308686g28e2g4a72ga4fcge13e985eb27f"
msgid "Who's the <i>hoon</i>, Greymon - another slave for the dig?"
msgstr "이 <i>훈</i>은 또 뭐야, 그레이몬. 땅 파는 노예를 더 데려온 거냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = 72f36804-9063-2fdc-8cf4-a47f315f0a62
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:72f36804-9063-2fdc-8cf4-a47f315f0a62
msgctxt "h027559e8g3fdag4388g972ag59195baa7c89"
msgid "Aye, that he does. Found the <i>hoon</i> sailing Gekh's skiff."
msgstr "그래, 맞아. 이 <i>훈</i>이 게크의 배를 몰고 있더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = 72f36804-9063-2fdc-8cf4-a47f315f0a62
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:72f36804-9063-2fdc-8cf4-a47f315f0a62
msgctxt "h920774b7ge92dg4583ga608gb5e639e76a10"
msgid "Aye, that she does. Found the <i>hoon</i> sailing Gekh's skiff."
msgstr "그래, 맞아. 이 <i>훈</i>이 게크의 배를 몰고 있더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = 72f36804-9063-2fdc-8cf4-a47f315f0a62
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:72f36804-9063-2fdc-8cf4-a47f315f0a62
msgctxt "hd5ca19afg707cg4595g999egbc77734bd27e"
msgid "Aye, that they do. Found the <i>hoon</i> sailing Gekh's skiff."
msgstr "그래, 맞아. 이 <i>훈</i>이 게크의 배를 몰고 있더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8151f72d-c026-070d-2725-c52829bde564
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:8151f72d-c026-070d-2725-c52829bde564
msgctxt "h43b45c83g00adg45e2ga7d7g068a209324fc"
msgid "<i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8663936e-1c29-2da6-2a4e-97bc2b106672
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:8663936e-1c29-2da6-2a4e-97bc2b106672
msgctxt "h703e1841g93dcg4a3ega1c6gf4661f470124"
msgid "You must be joking. I am not giving you a single coin."
msgstr "농담하는 거겠지. 네게 줄 돈은 한 푼도 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8c53d20d-6a36-ee37-8922-1e1dbce58368
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:8c53d20d-6a36-ee37-8922-1e1dbce58368
msgctxt "h51540dffgade9g49e3gbe30g7834a46a9376"
msgid "Did I hear right? You keep gnomes as slaves?"
msgstr "내가 제대로 들은 건가? 노움을 노예로 잡아두고 있다고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = 8d9a90ff-063e-0038-e419-908c715f98b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:8d9a90ff-063e-0038-e419-908c715f98b5
msgctxt "h4ae78890gea9cg4a1fgb5d5g3f475eedb0f7"
msgid "You're shitting me. He pay up?"
msgstr "지랄하지 마. 그 자식이 돈은 다 냈어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Morghal
#. NodeID = 9986259f-82e7-5528-af1a-3f43b5871b3c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:9986259f-82e7-5528-af1a-3f43b5871b3c
msgctxt "h3ad8d61ag4cd6g4afag9605gf4abe34fd6de"
msgid "Now go on, sergeant's above. Can't miss her - just follow the screams."
msgstr "이제 가봐, 하사관은 위에 있으니까. 찾긴 어렵지 않을 거야, 비명 소리만 쫓아가면 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Morghal
#. NodeID = 9bbc1abd-6399-c205-a496-29247f34fee2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:9bbc1abd-6399-c205-a496-29247f34fee2
msgctxt "hdad7dc82g789eg49d8g9bc4g30252730f65c"
msgid "That so?"
msgstr "그래서?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a57ca1f2-e6a6-c49a-bb47-22f4e64b60d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - d74f3f16-8952-e17f-0c52-5d3a0fbf7bbc_TrueSoulPath = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:a57ca1f2-e6a6-c49a-bb47-22f4e64b60d3
msgctxt "h63f3726fg822dg45deg939fg657ca66f89f5"
msgid "I am a True Soul. And you <i>will</i> speak with respect."
msgstr "난 참된 영혼이다. 예를 갖춰 대하도록."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a8d79798-73c1-8562-9cca-efec02bc3ed9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DROWELF(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:a8d79798-73c1-8562-9cca-efec02bc3ed9
msgctxt "h67f28138g0968g4c88g821dg3e89b9424619"
msgid "My reasons for coming are private. Now step aside."
msgstr "난 개인적인 이유로 여기에 왔다. 이제 비켜."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = aacdd38d-38bc-28af-2197-dc4c7a33f056
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_DarkLake_State_CampIntro(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:aacdd38d-38bc-28af-2197-dc4c7a33f056
msgctxt "h395974c5g93fcg4052ga548g857b78e30011"
msgid "Dry land. My guts'll stop churning now."
msgstr "마른 땅이군. 이제 내 내장이 뒤집어 질 일은 없겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Morghal
#. NodeID = b3d4472e-c7ee-bf21-6be6-43abe83227f4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:b3d4472e-c7ee-bf21-6be6-43abe83227f4
msgctxt "h41b697bbg82e5g4cf7g9fbdgbd96f9046cb1"
msgid "Greymon, you shithead - time you showed up. We got trouble."
msgstr "그레이몬, 이 멍청한 새끼. 언제 오나 했다. 문제가 생겼어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Morghal
#. NodeID = c78388f8-dddb-fe91-69fb-65479bfe86b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:c78388f8-dddb-fe91-69fb-65479bfe86b8
msgctxt "h69a92e77gf58eg432cg9bc2gdcc9eaa0965b"
msgid "Unclog your hole - just shitting around."
msgstr "똥구멍에 힘 빼, 그냥 장난친 것뿐이니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d20df039-b411-058b-121f-d5d0e0c4de18
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:d20df039-b411-058b-121f-d5d0e0c4de18
msgctxt "h0a30b7c2g8444g464ega7f9g04774f8e51d0"
msgid "My business is my own. No need to concern yourself with it."
msgstr "내가 왜 왔는지는 네가 알 바 아니니까 신경 꺼."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Morghal
#. NodeID = d2175a9b-69a9-5690-16b9-9489fb653246
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:d2175a9b-69a9-5690-16b9-9489fb653246
msgctxt "h5fad1fb3g97bag44c5g870eg21c63fd25a2b"
msgid "Your Twat-Soul chum owes us a load of coin. You want in? Pay the toll."
msgstr "너희 참된 씹것 친구가 동전을 꽤나 많이 빚졌어. 지나가고 싶나? 통행료를 내."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Morghal
#. NodeID = d431e5b9-456b-d089-9fa6-c6b051a62c64
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - d74f3f16-8952-e17f-0c52-5d3a0fbf7bbc_TrueSoulPath = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:d431e5b9-456b-d089-9fa6-c6b051a62c64
msgctxt "h6dfbfe4bg02fcg4965g8cc7ga9b73b3bc362"
msgid ""
"But I'm warning you - that twat-Soul ain't settle up soon, there'll be hell "
"to pay for the lot of you cult-buggers."
msgstr "하지만 경고 하나 해주지. 그 참된 씹것 일이 빨리 해결되지 않으면, 너희 광신도 새끼들이 갚아야 할 돈이 아주 많아질 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = d91e1a2d-9e25-174e-b41e-e37d30b0294f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DarkLake_State_ClaimedGekhWasDead = True
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:d91e1a2d-9e25-174e-b41e-e37d30b0294f
msgctxt "h58ad8c23gfc15g40d0ga4acgbead6f84cbb0"
msgid ""
"Aye. He sniffed up Gekh's corpse. Found the <i>hoon</i> sailing his skiff."
msgstr "그래. 게크의 시체를 발견했다더군. 이 <i>훈</i>이 그의 배를 몰고 있더라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = d91e1a2d-9e25-174e-b41e-e37d30b0294f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DarkLake_State_ClaimedGekhWasDead = True
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:d91e1a2d-9e25-174e-b41e-e37d30b0294f
msgctxt "h20033493g8246g4ea8ga3a4g2dc9ac906c34"
msgid ""
"Aye. She sniffed up Gekh's corpse. Found the <i>hoon</i> sailing his skiff."
msgstr "그래. 게크의 시체를 발견했다더군. 이 <i>훈</i>이 그의 배를 몰고 있더라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = d91e1a2d-9e25-174e-b41e-e37d30b0294f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DarkLake_State_ClaimedGekhWasDead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:d91e1a2d-9e25-174e-b41e-e37d30b0294f
msgctxt "haa706da1gc4fdg4fe2gaffage213a9eff517"
msgid ""
"Aye. They sniffed up Gekh's corpse. Found the <i>hoon</i> sailing his skiff."
msgstr "그래. 게크의 시체를 발견했다더군. 이 <i>훈</i>이 그의 배를 몰고 있더라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = df9b3a0c-ab00-0bf2-a895-2942286c9909
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DarkLake_Knows_GnomeHunt = False
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_State_HasBoots(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:df9b3a0c-ab00-0bf2-a895-2942286c9909
msgctxt "he6ecbeb5ga719g4f2bg9bc4gd8b8a0c9d05b"
msgid "I was told to report to the sergeant. I have not come to work."
msgstr "하사관한테 보고하라고 하던데. 일하러 온 건 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Morghal
#. NodeID = e05a9d9e-7d65-95a2-5cc1-b97ddc87d848
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:e05a9d9e-7d65-95a2-5cc1-b97ddc87d848
msgctxt "h5480a14fg6cbcg4d89gba3cg7c2bae07565e"
msgid ""
"That's the trouble - he got the gold on him. Thrinn's arm's falling off what "
"with the gnome slaves she been beating."
msgstr "그게 문제야, 돈이 그 자식한테 있거든. 노움 노예들을 채찍질 하느라 쓰린의 팔이 빠질 지경이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = e6d62f5b-73c0-98ec-62e3-944414698fa9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - d74f3f16-8952-e17f-0c52-5d3a0fbf7bbc_TrueSoulPath = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:e6d62f5b-73c0-98ec-62e3-944414698fa9
msgctxt "h2a35e7fcg3bb3g439eg9b78g0ce08770ec1e"
msgid ""
"Aye. One of those Absolute crackpots. Found the <i>hoon</i> sailing Gekh's "
"skiff."
msgstr "그래. 그 절대자 미치광이 놈들 중 하나야. 이 <i>훈</i>이 게크의 배를 몰고 있더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro
#. Speaker = Corsair Greymon
#. NodeID = fc3d4217-f4a5-bdd8-4bfe-95786f89ea22
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRaftCaptain_CampIntro:fc3d4217-f4a5-bdd8-4bfe-95786f89ea22
msgctxt "hf0a2ec7fge487g4db3g807cg96a3889b1f9e"
msgid ""
"Spit it up, Morghal. Or you busy choking on that True Soul Nere's prick with "
"Thrinn?"
msgstr "말해, 모갈. 아니면 참된 영혼 니어의 좆을 쓰린이랑 같이 비벼대느라 바쁘신 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRebelBored
#. Speaker = Stone Guard Kur
#. NodeID = 36a7e044-6754-dd84-ea9b-5d89a7c154b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_DuergarGuardBored_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Tag:
