msgctxt "h6c2bf5ddg7e51g466ega6cfg6555cb3a223d"
msgid "You offed Nere, and I'm still waitin' for pay. <i>Drugnin' </i>waste."
msgstr "넌 니어를 죽였고, 난 여전히 지불금을 기다리고 있어. <i>드루그닌 </i>폐기물아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_DuergarRebelMason_02
