msgctxt "h4933bf73g8c7eg4401g9755gca991622593e"
msgid "Here's to Smug. Nasty prick."
msgstr "샌님을 위해 건배하지. 형편없는 새끼."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ElevatorGuards
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d9c47e58-75f3-f124-b3d5-472e2fc95e31
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_ElevatorGuard001_Event_TookASide(3) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_TheDrowNere_Event_HadMindMeld = True
#.      - UND_DuergarCamp_State_CaveInCleared = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ElevatorGuards:d9c47e58-75f3-f124-b3d5-472e2fc95e31
msgctxt "h67b75c1bgde0eg4cb5gba69g77137328d30a"
msgid "A True Soul is trapped in a cave-in. Shouldn't you be digging him out?"
msgstr "참된 영혼이 낙석에 갇혔다던데. 가서 도와줘야 하는 것 아닌가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ElevatorGuards
#. Speaker = Ward Magmar
#. NodeID = de2a65af-e1ba-1509-3ba8-a3c775e1e432
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ElevatorGuards:de2a65af-e1ba-1509-3ba8-a3c775e1e432
msgctxt "h0b1bb31cg063dg464ag9209g9736d4735969"
msgid ""
"You can't swing a greataxe without hittin' a pocket-runt. Stickshit won't be "
"missed."
msgstr "좆만이 하나 날려버리지도 않고서야 그레이트액스를 휘둘렀다고 할 수 없지. 스틱좆 따위 알 게 뭐냐 이거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ElevatorGuards
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e177ed06-6777-1973-5124-832baf248278
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ElevatorGuards:e177ed06-6777-1973-5124-832baf248278
msgctxt "h2c841da8gdac9g4d2bg97a9g8398603ece11"
msgid "<i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ElevatorGuards
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = e705f356-1108-3ace-e881-b41c6f4472c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ElevatorGuards:e705f356-1108-3ace-e881-b41c6f4472c3
msgctxt "hbfa40858g32f1g4e7bg9ed7g49fb01ae035e"
msgid "Next time your mind sinks that low, keep things to yourself."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ElevatorGuards
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eb91ff06-1902-5c80-9c1d-d08bc1f698ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ElevatorGuards:eb91ff06-1902-5c80-9c1d-d08bc1f698ab
msgctxt "he1a0ee63g88d3g4138gadf1g1cd807199835"
msgid "<i>Frown and keep your hands to yourself.</i>"
msgstr "<i>얼굴을 찌푸리고 요청을 거부한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ElevatorGuards
#. Speaker = Ward Pistle
#. NodeID = ecfb14f9-859d-119f-3dd0-e3d2fd4cfef5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DEEPGNOME(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ElevatorGuards:ecfb14f9-859d-119f-3dd0-e3d2fd4cfef5
msgctxt "h3d9e0f95gaab7g4b84gac5ag3513df7193f4"
msgid "Magmar. We got another one."
msgstr "마그마르. 한 놈 또 왔어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ElevatorGuards
#. Speaker = Ward Magmar
#. NodeID = ee2f23d4-9ab1-cd51-4b97-4695847f8695
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ElevatorGuards:ee2f23d4-9ab1-cd51-4b97-4695847f8695
msgctxt "h132095e8ge41fg48dag921fg9f63ff40f062"
msgid "Stickshit talks like Smug when he wrecked that 'shroom village..."
msgstr "스틱좆은 그 버섯 마을에 처박혀 있던 때처럼 샌님처럼 말한다니까..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ElevatorGuards
#. Speaker = Ward Magmar
#. NodeID = ef6629d5-0d3d-29c6-6cc1-37acc8fc53df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ElevatorGuards:ef6629d5-0d3d-29c6-6cc1-37acc8fc53df
msgctxt "h93bb615cgd11dg437ag8eceg716940e4c6c3"
msgid "They'll squirm a bit, maybe give you some lip."
msgstr "쟤네가 조금 꿈틀대긴 해. 버릇없이 입을 놀리기도 하고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ElevatorGuards
#. Speaker = Ward Pistle
#. NodeID = f2f1467c-08be-e119-d184-7450e4d0a05c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ElevatorGuards:f2f1467c-08be-e119-d184-7450e4d0a05c
msgctxt "hc118f49cg96dbg4f1dg9a3cg0a834f0b0dc9"
msgid "... and then shagged it!"
msgstr "... 거기서 버섯 좆이라도 빨았나 보지!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ElevatorGuards
#. Speaker = Ward Magmar
#. NodeID = f4238424-40db-8967-ade5-05a71898cd31
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DuergarSergeant_State_PermaDefeated = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_ElevatorGuards_State_Did3WayDialogue = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ElevatorGuards:f4238424-40db-8967-ade5-05a71898cd31
msgctxt "hba6c67ddg528bg48a2g8d37g3efaa05c8ce1"
msgid "Prick-squeak - go tell your True Soul chums we won't move a pebble."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ElevatorGuards
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f453d958-9112-3219-8d43-9113d17d7bcc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_ElevatorGuard001_Event_TookASide(3) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DuergarCamp_State_CaveInCleared = False
#. SetFlags:
