msgctxt "h908f9906g295cg4e24g8ce2gbb7fa65fe3fc"
msgid "Your slave was made to toil. You're squandering him on mundane tasks."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ElevatorGuards
#. Speaker = Ward Magmar
#. NodeID = f6018f0f-1395-28bb-e3c0-6b0973f9aff8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DEEPGNOME or GNOME or HALFLING
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ElevatorGuards:f6018f0f-1395-28bb-e3c0-6b0973f9aff8
msgctxt "h13249c1cg6b01g4f58ga382g59297d2e2135"
msgid ""
"'Course at your size, might be tough pinning 'em down. Would pay to see it, "
"not gonna lie."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ElevatorGuards
#. Speaker = Ward Magmar
#. NodeID = f66952e2-d978-75b8-f34f-113f114561ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ElevatorGuards:f66952e2-d978-75b8-f34f-113f114561ae
msgctxt "he9d91ffbg77bfg4af0g8afbgade19aa18fcc"
msgid "All it takes is a stiff crop to get 'em in line."
msgstr "하지만 굵직한 채찍 하나면 고분고분하게 만들 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ElevatorGuards
#. Speaker = Ward Pistle
#. NodeID = f67dc732-144c-70d1-64c7-780225e911b0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ElevatorGuards:f67dc732-144c-70d1-64c7-780225e911b0
msgctxt "hd95a5609ga740g4521gbaa7gc0b85cde0e95"
msgid "Well shit."
msgstr "이런 씨발."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ElevatorGuards
#. Speaker = Ward Magmar
#. NodeID = fc40b36e-dc86-3932-89f7-1ee58fad1f56
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ElevatorGuards:fc40b36e-dc86-3932-89f7-1ee58fad1f56
msgctxt "ha44947edg9cddg4bc3gabdag05365150fbbc"
msgid "You want Nere, you claw him out. My drinking hand's busy."
msgstr "니어를 원하면, 네 손으로 파내. 내 손은 술을 마시느라 바쁘니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ElevatorGuards
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ffc5a6be-2a6a-32b1-6ed9-28f9aa07d11e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_ElevatorGuard001_Event_TookASide(3) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - DEEPGNOME(3) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_ElevatorGuard001_Event_TookASide(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ElevatorGuards:ffc5a6be-2a6a-32b1-6ed9-28f9aa07d11e
msgctxt "h9b78163dgc35fg4362g8f00gfec79cea20b4"
msgid "How dare you enslave my people? They deserve dignity, not servitude."
msgstr "감히 내 동족을 노예로 삼아? 그들은 노예가 아니라 존엄을 누릴 자격이 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_FairyRings_Dead
#. Speaker = Dead Drow
#. NodeID = 1711efcf-e1b4-9c99-4fe8-fb7d7aecd8c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_FairyRings_Dead:1711efcf-e1b4-9c99-4fe8-fb7d7aecd8c0
msgctxt "h1fb571a5ge619g479dga0dfg284a2b0c5227"
msgid "Mushrooms... disappear... guessed wrong..."
msgstr "버섯이... 사라졌어... 잘못 골랐어..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_FairyRings_Dead
