msgctxt "h6fab14a2gda64g446bg933eg09177a44a2a2"
msgid "Got to move rock. Only the rock."
msgstr "바위를 옮겨야 해. 바위 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_FearfulRothe_Rothe_001
#. Speaker = Deep Rothé
#. NodeID = af2beb79-cf96-9370-2a78-8bd8c8b5c018
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FearfulRothe_Event_HasMet2 = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_FearfulRothe_Rothe_001:af2beb79-cf96-9370-2a78-8bd8c8b5c018
msgctxt "h0f5bb725g72d2g49acg9ab6gd7e1088d4b92"
msgid "Will find a safe place. No more hurt."
msgstr "안전한 곳을 찾겠어. 더 이상 고통은 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_FearfulRothe_Rothe_001
#. Speaker = Deep Rothé
#. NodeID = b7fa9e31-24ef-4abb-9ea8-d13bbd5a9615
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_FearfulRothe_HasMet_Rothe_001_SpeakWithAnimals(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_FearfulRothe_HasMet_Rothe_001_SpeakWithAnimals(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_FearfulRothe_Rothe_001:b7fa9e31-24ef-4abb-9ea8-d13bbd5a9615
msgctxt "hcea5953egb398g4384ga47dg6953dea5ea9a"
msgid "No more. No more pain, no more work. All must die!"
msgstr "더는 안 돼. 고통도, 일도 더는 못 견디겠어. 다 죽어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_FearfulRothe_Rothe_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cd0f95f2-26b1-1034-31d1-42f2f8fae3b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FearfulRothe_State_ConvincedRotheToAttackRubble = False
#.      - UND_FearfulRothe_Event_ConvincedRotheToAttackRubble = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_FearfulRothe_Rothe_001:cd0f95f2-26b1-1034-31d1-42f2f8fae3b2
msgctxt "hb331e925g9b4dg4e64g9357gada0f65a7b38"
msgid "<i>Nod to the rubble. Perhaps the creature will break through.</i>"
msgstr "<i>잔해 쪽으로 고개를 젓는다. 어쩌면 이 생명체들이 돌진해서 부숴버릴 수 있을지도 모른다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_FearfulRothe_Rothe_001
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d5d7cd42-f0b0-3b7c-6638-776a3212e179
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_FearfulRothe_Event_ConvincedRotheToAttackDuergar = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_FearfulRothe_Rothe_001:d5d7cd42-f0b0-3b7c-6638-776a3212e179
msgctxt "h66ce9bcag5824g4145ga5a1gb07ec6dce55f"
msgid ""
"*The rothé regards its duergar captors balefully, then utters a deep, angry "
"bellow.*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_FearfulRothe_Rothe_001
#. Speaker = Deep Rothé
#. NodeID = e0f6bc92-cb42-2fa1-e60f-dbd2824d276f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_FearfulRothe_State_BefriendedRothe = True
#.     - UND_FearfulRothe_Event_ConvincedRotheToAttackRubble = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_FearfulRothe_Rothe_001:e0f6bc92-cb42-2fa1-e60f-dbd2824d276f
msgctxt "h9b465f81gd38ag4773gbf10g580c2ae8f48f"
msgid ""
"All right. We will work. We will do as we're told. We will clear the way."
msgstr "알았어. 일할게. 지시받은 대로 일해야지. 우리가 길을 뚫을 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_FearfulRothe_Rothe_001
#. Speaker = Deep Rothé
#. NodeID = e4b18bf6-0fb8-4522-9c7b-d6899e13db67
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_FearfulRothe_HasMet_Rothe_001_SpeakWithAnimals(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_FearfulRothe_Rothe_001:e4b18bf6-0fb8-4522-9c7b-d6899e13db67
msgctxt "h3f4828d8gc4a0g4195g8379gc369b1f73a01"
msgid "Don't want to move rocks. Too much pain, too much noise."
msgstr "바위를 옮기기 싫어. 너무 고통스러워, 너무 시끄러워."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_FearfulRothe_Rothe_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e8a5490c-947f-4e25-a8dd-a92b86d4a8e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FearfulRothe_State_PlayerAttackedRubbleBeforeCalmingDownRothe = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_FearfulRothe_Rothe_001:e8a5490c-947f-4e25-a8dd-a92b86d4a8e7
msgctxt "heb1a5e1eg97beg47fdgb148g72ef82d1a9aa"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_FearfulRothe_Rothe_001
#. Speaker = Deep Rothé
#. NodeID = ee413fdf-acfa-e04a-3b99-e0d49b9527e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_FearfulRothe_Rothe_001:ee413fdf-acfa-e04a-3b99-e0d49b9527e6
msgctxt "h2183d0f9gaf93g483dg8d28g9d3c43b3f206"
msgid ""
"Old death. Fire. I can smell it. It is too much, too much. Anger - can't "
"hold it in!"
msgstr "오래된 죽음. 불. 냄새가 나. 너무 심해, 너무 심하다고. 분노 - 참을 수 없어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_FearfulRothe_Rothe_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eef3fea3-c7cc-01fd-7a98-998c5d558835
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_FearfulRothe_Rothe_001:eef3fea3-c7cc-01fd-7a98-998c5d558835
msgctxt "h8b60e15cgb2e5g43f3g8998ga8f3ab179a29"
msgid ""
"<i>Encourage it to breathe, and get back to work. There is only the work.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_FearfulRothe_Rothe_001
#. Speaker = Deep Rothé
#. NodeID = f0f75933-54fb-59a1-341d-dcf32bb0e956
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_FearfulRothe_Event_FailedToPersuadeRothe = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_FearfulRothe_Rothe_001:f0f75933-54fb-59a1-341d-dcf32bb0e956
msgctxt "h8a7b899agd5b9g455dg8bc4gfaa9d69701f8"
msgid "You're just like them. Won't let you push me around. <i>Any </i>of you."
msgstr "너도 저놈들과 똑같아. 아무도 나를 괴롭힐 순 없어. 너희 중 <i>아무도</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_FearfulRothe_Rothe_001
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f35ce5cf-74ac-81b9-dc13-26ffd4bddb7f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_FearfulRothe_State_BefriendedRothe = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_FearfulRothe_Rothe_001:f35ce5cf-74ac-81b9-dc13-26ffd4bddb7f
msgctxt "h57e6af54g11f2g421eg9fa3g759de931b744"
msgid "*The rothé seems calmer in your presence.*"
msgstr "*당신의 존재에 로테가 안정을 느끼는 것 같습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_FearfulRothe_Rothe_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f57bf215-9537-5a44-6ed7-bd18ec84c040
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_FearfulRothe_Rothe_001:f57bf215-9537-5a44-6ed7-bd18ec84c040
msgctxt "h069b9366ge33cg45baga82aga51b7ef4fc2d"
msgid ""
"Give in to your rage and avenge your pain. Don't strike us all, just your "
"masters."
msgstr "분노를 받아들이고 네 고통의 복수를 해 줘. 우리 모두를 공격하지 말고, 네 주인들을 공격하라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_FearfulRothe_Rothe_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f70fb812-7a51-11d4-8a77-f661d030a39c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
