msgctxt "h632bf5cege652g4ff7g899age1cb0d3a3ed6"
msgid "Grey ones gone. Good. Will stay here, until it's safe to leave."
msgstr "회색 놈들 없어. 좋아. 안전해질 때까지 여기 있을게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_FearfulRothe_Rothe_002
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4ea1768c-a242-2edd-d4f0-1e0487598234
