msgid "A rune sign, but not one I recognise. Its meaning eludes me."
msgstr "룬 기호인데, 뭔지는 모르겠군. 의미를 잘 모르겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_FoundRune
