msgctxt "hd9d14160gc68ag496dg9923g50d3e2f563af"
msgid "Well then. Let's have a peek."
msgstr "그렇다면, 한번 살펴보자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_KnowStashIsHidden
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6c56eaf2-32ad-4491-a838-aa9df958b8ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_HarperSpy_State_RecognisedReplicaChest = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_KnowStashIsHidden:6c56eaf2-32ad-4491-a838-aa9df958b8ab
msgctxt "h664ca463g718dg4ae0g9a77gd47891b6bf30"
msgid "Well then. Let the search begin."
msgstr "그렇다면, 한번 수색해 보지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_KnowStashIsHidden
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6c56eaf2-32ad-4491-a838-aa9df958b8ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_HarperSpy_State_RecognisedReplicaChest = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_KnowStashIsHidden:6c56eaf2-32ad-4491-a838-aa9df958b8ab
msgctxt "hd56a878fg4089g4e77g8cfag38d178ad49bc"
msgid "Must be in one of these chests."
msgstr "분명 이 상자들 중 하나에 들어있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_KnowStashIsHidden
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ff0ccbc1-2066-e1da-8c49-ff22d36d9397
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_HarperSpy_State_RecognisedReplicaChest = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_KnowStashIsHidden:ff0ccbc1-2066-e1da-8c49-ff22d36d9397
msgctxt "ha4662850gcff8g4e88g8e5dgc87810ef3799"
msgid ""
"If I were sensible, I'd lock it in a chest. But if I were <i>clever</i>, I'd "
"put chests everywhere and hide it somewhere else entirely..."
msgstr ""
"생각이 있는 사람이라면, 상자 안에 넣고 잠가놨겠지. 허나 <i>똑똑한</i> 사람이라면, 사방 팔방에 상자를 늘어놓고선 어딘가 완전 "
"다른 곳에 감춰놨을꺼야..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_KnowStashIsHidden
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ff0ccbc1-2066-e1da-8c49-ff22d36d9397
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_HarperSpy_State_RecognisedReplicaChest = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_KnowStashIsHidden:ff0ccbc1-2066-e1da-8c49-ff22d36d9397
msgctxt "h28e52089g98b3g4797g8a2ag0a0e246a48ea"
msgid "Left out in plain sight? I'd rate the Harpers too smart for that."
msgstr "잘 보이는 곳에 뒀을 거라고? 그러기엔 하퍼즈가 너무 똑똑하다고 보는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_KnowStashIsHidden
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ff0ccbc1-2066-e1da-8c49-ff22d36d9397
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_HarperSpy_State_RecognisedReplicaChest = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_KnowStashIsHidden:ff0ccbc1-2066-e1da-8c49-ff22d36d9397
msgctxt "hbe9f4be1gf306g483dgbab0gb67ec4d25d77"
msgid ""
"Something tells me these Harpers wouldn't leave their stash out in the open."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_KnowStashIsHidden
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ff0ccbc1-2066-e1da-8c49-ff22d36d9397
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_HarperSpy_State_RecognisedReplicaChest = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_KnowStashIsHidden:ff0ccbc1-2066-e1da-8c49-ff22d36d9397
msgctxt "h9b37aec0g1d72g408fg91e8g68cef995eefe"
msgid ""
"Either the Harpers are terrible at hiding their stashes - or this is a trap."
msgstr "하퍼즈가 물건 감추는 데 영 꽝인 게 아니라면, 함정이란 거겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_KnowStashIsHidden
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ff0ccbc1-2066-e1da-8c49-ff22d36d9397
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_HarperSpy_State_RecognisedReplicaChest = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_KnowStashIsHidden:ff0ccbc1-2066-e1da-8c49-ff22d36d9397
msgctxt "h07a08f94g0eabg4f49gaf15g1c38a4531ee7"
msgid ""
"A Harper would never leave their stash exposed like that... unless it's a "
"trap."
msgstr "하퍼가 은닉품을 절대로 저런 식으로 내놓진 않지... 함정이 아니고서야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_KnowStashIsHidden
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ff0ccbc1-2066-e1da-8c49-ff22d36d9397
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_HarperSpy_State_RecognisedReplicaChest = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_KnowStashIsHidden:ff0ccbc1-2066-e1da-8c49-ff22d36d9397
msgctxt "h3b3ea243ga17bg4164g9e63g39953bfbf2f1"
msgid "Out in the open, though? Not likely. I smell a trap."
msgstr "그냥 내 놨다고? 그럴 리가. 함정 냄새가 나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_KnowStashIsHidden
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ff0ccbc1-2066-e1da-8c49-ff22d36d9397
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_HarperSpy_State_RecognisedReplicaChest = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_KnowStashIsHidden:ff0ccbc1-2066-e1da-8c49-ff22d36d9397
msgctxt "h699bcd7cgf0b9g4283g8316gf3625621f979"
msgid ""
"Left out in plain sight like that? No - the Harpers are too smart for that."
msgstr "저렇게 잘 보이게 놨다고? 아니, 하퍼즈가 그랬을 리가 없는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseStashLocation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3762a161-0a71-45f3-a6f2-b48d12e8d4a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseStashLocation:3762a161-0a71-45f3-a6f2-b48d12e8d4a3
msgctxt "hd323c067g6198g4db4ga9cbgacff25d975fd"
msgid ""
"If the Dark Justiciar's letter was right, there should be a stash here "
"somewhere."
msgstr "다크 저스티시어의 편지에 적힌 게 맞다면, 이 근처에 은닉처가 있을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseStashLocation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3762a161-0a71-45f3-a6f2-b48d12e8d4a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseStashLocation:3762a161-0a71-45f3-a6f2-b48d12e8d4a3
msgctxt "h5b0aa765gfb29g4b16gae7dg70b38c9f31e8"
msgid "According to that letter, the Harper stash should be hidden close by."
msgstr "그 편지에 따르면, 하퍼의 은닉처는 이 근처에 숨겨져 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseStashLocation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3762a161-0a71-45f3-a6f2-b48d12e8d4a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseStashLocation:3762a161-0a71-45f3-a6f2-b48d12e8d4a3
msgctxt "h8b645015g99d7g4a51g9edcgbedcb92b504a"
msgid "Letter says there's a Harper stash somewhere around here."
msgstr "편지에 적힌 대로 라면 이 근처에 하퍼들이 뭔가 숨겨놨을거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseStashLocation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3762a161-0a71-45f3-a6f2-b48d12e8d4a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseStashLocation:3762a161-0a71-45f3-a6f2-b48d12e8d4a3
msgctxt "hda7d1921g109fg41d2ga2b5g74d5480f7664"
msgid ""
"This must be where the Harper's stockpile is hidden. I should look around."
msgstr "이곳 근처에 하퍼가 무언가를 숨겨 놓았어. 둘러보는 게 좋겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseStashLocation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3762a161-0a71-45f3-a6f2-b48d12e8d4a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseStashLocation:3762a161-0a71-45f3-a6f2-b48d12e8d4a3
msgctxt "hd15d8504gecfbg4e9bga5b4g0beb5bd0fcbf"
msgid ""
"There should be a Harper's stash here someplace, if that letter's to be "
"believed."
msgstr "그 편지에 적힌 게 맞다면, 하퍼의 은닉처가 여기 어딘가 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseStashLocation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3762a161-0a71-45f3-a6f2-b48d12e8d4a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseStashLocation:3762a161-0a71-45f3-a6f2-b48d12e8d4a3
msgctxt "hc5afa22eg6435g4688ga42fg28ccfc0e1e88"
msgid ""
"This is the place, if that letter was right. Now where's that Harper's stash?"
msgstr "편지에 적힌 게 맞다면 여기가 바로 거기야. 그 하퍼의 은닉처는 어디 있는 걸까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseStashLocation
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3762a161-0a71-45f3-a6f2-b48d12e8d4a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseStashLocation:3762a161-0a71-45f3-a6f2-b48d12e8d4a3
msgctxt "h7553ef92g0eb1g495cg8d6cg459739dd8d49"
msgid ""
"Looks like the place the Dark Justiciar's letter mentioned. But where's the "
"stash?"
msgstr "다크 저스티시어의 편지에서 언급된 그 장소 같군. 그런데 은닉처는 어디 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseWatchword
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 32677d29-a3eb-591c-784e-888dfc2235da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_HarperSpy_State_UnderstoodHint = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseWatchword:32677d29-a3eb-591c-784e-888dfc2235da
msgctxt "heef5cfaega0cag42a5gabd9g0e228c6c4ba6"
msgid "A spell. Cast <i>Light </i>on the chest, and we should be all clear."
msgstr "주문이야. <i>빛</i>을 상자에 시전하면 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseWatchword
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 32677d29-a3eb-591c-784e-888dfc2235da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_HarperSpy_State_UnderstoodHint = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseWatchword:32677d29-a3eb-591c-784e-888dfc2235da
msgctxt "he529afb2g0d4eg46daga383g8f5c0c2f8fef"
msgid "In that case, let there be <i>Light</i>."
msgstr "그렇다면, <i>빛</i>이 있으리라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseWatchword
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 32677d29-a3eb-591c-784e-888dfc2235da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_HarperSpy_State_UnderstoodHint = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseWatchword:32677d29-a3eb-591c-784e-888dfc2235da
msgctxt "h27b84034gafb0g45begb509gf88b72ce28cd"
msgid "Try a <i>Light </i>spell. Right?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseWatchword
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 32677d29-a3eb-591c-784e-888dfc2235da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_HarperSpy_State_UnderstoodHint = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseWatchword:32677d29-a3eb-591c-784e-888dfc2235da
msgctxt "he00f37e4gcaafg421fg966cg815574214ec7"
msgid ""
"'Lux'. <i>Light</i>. Casting the right spell on the chest should get us in."
msgstr "'광채'. <i>빛</i>. 상자에 적당한 주문을 시전하면 들어갈 수 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseWatchword
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 32677d29-a3eb-591c-784e-888dfc2235da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_HarperSpy_State_UnderstoodHint = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseWatchword:32677d29-a3eb-591c-784e-888dfc2235da
msgctxt "h02da88c5g0d2dg46ecg9180ga19258770ff5"
msgid "Lux... light. Maybe a <i>Light </i>spell will disarm the chest."
msgstr "광채... 빛. 아마 <i>빛</i> 주문이면 상자가 열릴 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseWatchword
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 32677d29-a3eb-591c-784e-888dfc2235da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_HarperSpy_State_UnderstoodHint = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseWatchword:32677d29-a3eb-591c-784e-888dfc2235da
msgctxt "h90aeec5egeb93g410bg9569g37accae1af95"
msgid "Lux? A <i>Light</i> spell should disarm the chest."
msgstr "광채? <i>빛</i> 주문이면 상자가 분명 열릴 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseWatchword
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 32677d29-a3eb-591c-784e-888dfc2235da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_HarperSpy_State_UnderstoodHint = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseWatchword:32677d29-a3eb-591c-784e-888dfc2235da
msgctxt "hecea90ceg124eg4e6fga313g7b6b74575415"
msgid "Give a <i>Light</i> spell a try. That should get us into that chest."
msgstr "<i>빛</i> 주문으로 해보자. 이거면 상자 안으로 들어갈 수 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseWatchword
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 33016587-46f1-7343-d713-22b244943591
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseWatchword:33016587-46f1-7343-d713-22b244943591
msgctxt "h882741f0gc890g44e8gb537g56db38e4722e"
msgid "What was that watchword? 'Lux splenda.'"
msgstr "그 표어가 무슨 뜻일까? '럭스 스플렌다'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseWatchword
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d3f783fa-f8fa-4a3a-b88b-094f13e9f971
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseWatchword:d3f783fa-f8fa-4a3a-b88b-094f13e9f971
msgctxt "hed7a909bgff5ag4e4bg9dfbga44b4636ab98"
msgid "I'm sure that's very useful if you know what it means. Alas, I don't."
msgstr "무슨 뜻인지 알면 유용할 것이 확실한데. 안타깝게도 나는 모르겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseWatchword
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d3f783fa-f8fa-4a3a-b88b-094f13e9f971
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseWatchword:d3f783fa-f8fa-4a3a-b88b-094f13e9f971
msgctxt "hcf2f9840g12efg43a4ga62fg8bc3121561bd"
msgid "I don't quite see how that's relevant..."
msgstr "그게 어떤 관련이 있는지 잘 모르겠군..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseWatchword
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d3f783fa-f8fa-4a3a-b88b-094f13e9f971
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseWatchword:d3f783fa-f8fa-4a3a-b88b-094f13e9f971
msgctxt "hc4cfdb14g736fg43fcg8250g7a76bac8358e"
msgid "What's it <i>mean </i>though?"
msgstr "하지만 이게 무슨 <i>의미<i>일까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseWatchword
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d3f783fa-f8fa-4a3a-b88b-094f13e9f971
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseWatchword:d3f783fa-f8fa-4a3a-b88b-094f13e9f971
msgctxt "h241d0413g11d1g4b30g81beg31bf2af14738"
msgid "<i>Chk. </i>Those words mean nothing to me."
msgstr "<i>쳇. </i>이 단어들은 내게는 아무 의미도 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_HarperSpy_PAD_RecogniseWatchword
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d3f783fa-f8fa-4a3a-b88b-094f13e9f971
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
