msgctxt "h5f88051egab2fg40d0ga286g46e402e6d032"
msgid "An aspect of the Lady of Loss. Shadowheart may appreciate its finding."
msgstr "상실의 여신의 모습을 하고 있군. 섀도하트가 좋아하겠는걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_IdolOfShar_PAD_IdolLooted
