msgctxt "h497cc83bgba05g4207gb46fg4b3dabfd1aec"
msgid ""
"This idol bears the Dark Lady's likeness. Shadowheart might be interested."
msgstr "어둠의 여신을 닮은 우상이군. 섀도하트가 관심을 가질 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_IdolOfShar_PAD_IdolLooted
