msgctxt "he51968dbg765bg4e84g8f18g71f34267c12a"
msgid ""
"This icon bears Shar's likeness. No doubt Shadowheart will be interested in "
"it."
msgstr "샤를 닮은 신상이네. 섀도하트가 관심을 가질 게 분명해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_IdolOfShar_PAD_IdolLooted
