msgctxt "h0fbedfbag6658g47eeg8137g89848a631df5"
msgid "An icon of Shar? Shadowheart will want to see it."
msgstr "샤의 신상이잖아? 섀도하트가 이걸 보고 싶어 할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_IdolOfShar_PAD_IdolLooted
