msgctxt "h981f9b3cg0400g42d6g830eg46215706a92f"
msgid "That's Shar, right? Shadowheart may want to have a look."
msgstr "이거 샤 맞지? 섀도하트가 한번 보고 싶어 하겠는걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_IdolOfShar_PAD_IdolLooted
