msgctxt "ha933387eg5fccg445eg81abg9129554729a1"
msgid "An Idol of Shar? Shadowheart might want to see this."
msgstr "샤의 우상이잖아? 섀도하트가 이걸 보고 싶어 할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KethericCity_PAD_OnPlatform2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = df2b6b6e-e889-43ae-a686-543602bc822e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KethericCity_PAD_OnPlatform2:df2b6b6e-e889-43ae-a686-543602bc822e
msgctxt "h411d2f4ag1e1fg4cf9g9e0egc9e45ceac209"
msgid "Lovely. Held together by rust and hope."
msgstr "아주 좋구만. 녹과 희망으로 붙들려 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KethericCity_PAD_OnPlatform2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = df2b6b6e-e889-43ae-a686-543602bc822e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KethericCity_PAD_OnPlatform2:df2b6b6e-e889-43ae-a686-543602bc822e
msgctxt "h39c730e8gb701g4b62gb3ddg42fa982b8803"
msgid "Steady... This thing looks more brittle than Szass Tam's bones."
msgstr "조심해... 이것은 스자스 탐의 뼈보다도 더 잘 부서질 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KethericCity_PAD_OnPlatform2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = df2b6b6e-e889-43ae-a686-543602bc822e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KethericCity_PAD_OnPlatform2:df2b6b6e-e889-43ae-a686-543602bc822e
msgctxt "h64b3af0egf0b0g4babg984cgb3d1c8f0dca1"
msgid "I'm not getting on that. Am I?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KethericCity_PAD_OnPlatform2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = df2b6b6e-e889-43ae-a686-543602bc822e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KethericCity_PAD_OnPlatform2:df2b6b6e-e889-43ae-a686-543602bc822e
msgctxt "h086b7d46gbf28g4f16g8120gfefd3992b6e2"
msgid "Small steps - this thing is all but rusted through."
msgstr "조심히 걸어. 이건 온통 녹이 슬어 있으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KethericCity_PAD_OnPlatform2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = df2b6b6e-e889-43ae-a686-543602bc822e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KethericCity_PAD_OnPlatform2:df2b6b6e-e889-43ae-a686-543602bc822e
msgctxt "hb9e4475age8f6g4440g90d5g3136c4b001d3"
msgid "I don't suppose there's a stairs, is there?"
msgstr "계단은 없는 것 같은데, 맞지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KethericCity_PAD_OnPlatform2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = df2b6b6e-e889-43ae-a686-543602bc822e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KethericCity_PAD_OnPlatform2:df2b6b6e-e889-43ae-a686-543602bc822e
msgctxt "h05f98288gdf98g4642g9bafga00051895274"
msgid "This thing's falling apart. It <i>can't</i> be safe - can it?"
msgstr "이건 무너져가고 있어. 안전할 <i>리가 </i> 없지, 그렇지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KethericCity_PAD_OnPlatform2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = df2b6b6e-e889-43ae-a686-543602bc822e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KethericCity_PAD_OnPlatform2:df2b6b6e-e889-43ae-a686-543602bc822e
msgctxt "h1989aec7g1d4ag4189g8464g03485f44f527"
msgid "Platform's covered in rust - must be older than bonedust."
msgstr "발판은 온통 녹이 슬어 있어. 뼛가루보다도 더 오래됐을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_AD_BOOOALAppears
#. Speaker = BOOOAL
#. NodeID = 961c5312-b80e-98aa-f286-a4db50c74857
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_AD_BOOOALAppears:961c5312-b80e-98aa-f286-a4db50c74857
msgctxt "h3df6c2bdg4047g44deg8206g16aad4ecfbee"
msgid "CUT YOU BREAK YOU TASTE YOU!"
msgstr "<b>너를 베어 가르고 부숴버리고 그 피를 맛보겠다!</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_AD_FishChanting
#. Speaker = GROUP_Act1_UND_KuoToa
#. NodeID = 659d16b6-9c9e-2c9b-8187-3dfb4040a8e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_AD_FishChanting:659d16b6-9c9e-2c9b-8187-3dfb4040a8e3
msgctxt "h4d56b55fg02f7g46d3ga7eagc576b6af75e5"
msgid "*Wild chanting.*"
msgstr "*거친 찬송가.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_AD_GodDead
#. Speaker = GROUP_Act1_UND_KuoToa
#. NodeID = ed45de7b-6949-feed-dc19-cd13dfea374b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_AD_GodDead:ed45de7b-6949-feed-dc19-cd13dfea374b
msgctxt "h4a705b6ag20a4g4df9g8b73g86a7307ad8ec"
msgid "BOOOAL! Our Lord has been murdered!"
msgstr "부알이시여! 우리 주군께서 살해당하셨다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_AD_NoAnswerFromGod
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 7fff0145-7c58-36e4-ac6b-163ceb936edf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_AD_NoAnswerFromGod:7fff0145-7c58-36e4-ac6b-163ceb936edf
msgctxt "h0a48d867g1cafg470bga718g49d995fb8849"
msgid "*There is no answer from the presence.*"
msgstr "*영혼은 대답이 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest
#. Speaker = Pooldripp the Zealous
#. NodeID = 2988d6ca-4a0a-4d1b-97f6-37a19a7d3abd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest:2988d6ca-4a0a-4d1b-97f6-37a19a7d3abd
msgctxt "h03b5b125ge698g48bfg856bg27fdede21330"
msgid "But you - we see you. We know you by your true name... MAHKLOOMPAH!"
msgstr "허나 당신은, 우리는 당신을 봅니다. 우리는 당신의 진정한 이름을 압니다... <b>마클룸파</b>님!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 319075fc-702f-4391-bbbb-0a1a07e8d155
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest:319075fc-702f-4391-bbbb-0a1a07e8d155
msgctxt "h5797eeccg9589g4999ga603g5a5d72d0d13b"
msgid "Go out and build me an army."
msgstr "나가서 군대를 만들어라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest
#. Speaker = Pooldripp the Zealous
#. NodeID = 3a5792b6-f638-405e-a611-d4be0a57579e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest:3a5792b6-f638-405e-a611-d4be0a57579e
msgctxt "h5c728882g91eeg4dd8g9b7aga737220d4600"
msgid ""
"We will spread word of Mahkloompah. Your glory will sing from ten thousand "
"throats!"
msgstr "우리는 마클룸파 님의 말씀을 퍼뜨릴 것입니다. 일만의 목구멍이 당신의 영광을 노래할 것입니다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 543dbc64-fa94-4cff-9837-6a574247866c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest:543dbc64-fa94-4cff-9837-6a574247866c
msgctxt "h2d12f87bg785dg4f21g8320gd5758d140a1f"
msgid "PRAISE MAHKLOOMPAH!"
msgstr "<b>마클룸파를 찬양하라!</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 55ebd8a0-454d-4383-84e6-c1848e4bbd60
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest:55ebd8a0-454d-4383-84e6-c1848e4bbd60
msgctxt "h00e7b315g9f12g43fag9ca2g1f3898cc5867"
msgid "A better name than 'Mahkloompah', for one."
msgstr "하나 꼽자면, '마클룸파' 보다 좋은 이름 같은 거."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 57d8ea6a-56b8-42e9-9119-3ac12c2cea09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest:57d8ea6a-56b8-42e9-9119-3ac12c2cea09
msgctxt "h8d8cec2eg290eg4297g8fa6g543b23ee5c27"
msgid "A god to the fishes. A dream come true, is it?"
msgstr "물고기의 신이라. 꿈이 이뤄졌구먼, 그치?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 5e45c6fe-968e-4738-8b7c-61d66d7b9ddd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(6) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest:5e45c6fe-968e-4738-8b7c-61d66d7b9ddd
msgctxt "h82dd2cf1gc849g415fgb048ge23046f524e1"
msgid "Oh hells, why not? All hail MAHKLOOMPAH!"
msgstr "와 나, 안 될 거 있나? 모두 마!클!룸!파! 님을 찬양하라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5f1c176a-8df7-4a7e-ad0d-f8f6fbcc5c4e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest:5f1c176a-8df7-4a7e-ad0d-f8f6fbcc5c4e
msgctxt "h310f066bg0650g4843ga036gfcb53f7aa31f"
msgid "Perhaps you should study the teachings of my god."
msgstr "내가 모시는 신의 가르침을 공부해 보는 게 어때."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 6fa27cf5-961e-49a3-8c11-430c741e39e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest:6fa27cf5-961e-49a3-8c11-430c741e39e0
msgctxt "h9fcfe4aag593cg4d35g93e2g880c9c67779a"
msgid "If you're expecting me to drop to my knees before you, forget it."
msgstr "내가 무릎을 꿇어주길 기대하는 거라면, 꿈 깨."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest
#. Speaker = Pooldripp the Zealous
#. NodeID = 77e743c9-7045-4fe2-bfee-0d06fd1019ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest:77e743c9-7045-4fe2-bfee-0d06fd1019ba
msgctxt "h48bd7affgcacbg46dfg8009g822b8b1c3260"
msgid ""
"Strangulation, perhaps. No matter - your glory will be sung, great "
"Mahkloompah!"
msgstr "아마 목이라도 졸렸나 봅니다. 상관 없습니다. 당신의 영광을 노래할 것입니다, 위대한 마클룸파님!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest
#. Speaker = Pooldripp the Zealous
#. NodeID = 89a51c8b-e9f2-4047-989d-9b1f6e6e4ea4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest:89a51c8b-e9f2-4047-989d-9b1f6e6e4ea4
msgctxt "h48442f6bgcdfdg4e76ga3b4g8d193b8935fb"
msgid "So that, one day... we might <i>destroy</i> them."
msgstr "그러니깐, 언젠가는.... 우리가 저들을 <i>파괴</i>할지도 모른다는 거군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 95981003-a4aa-4d30-9186-13b31a2adb09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(7) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest:95981003-a4aa-4d30-9186-13b31a2adb09
msgctxt "hede6df69gc3c2g4954g91aegc75540c26fcd"
msgid ""
"A great deity needs a great name. Looks like you're off to a good start."
msgstr "위대한 신격에는 위대한 이름이 필요한 법이죠. 좋은 출발이로군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest
#. Speaker = Pooldripp the Zealous
#. NodeID = 966442d0-6577-4b87-a5b8-10272c7f5dbf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_KuoToaGod_HasMetPriest(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest:966442d0-6577-4b87-a5b8-10272c7f5dbf
msgctxt "h5b5f8988g6affg4aa2gbd57g6b6a8bcda1da"
msgid ""
"We know that you must go, great Mahkloompah. We will tend your church down "
"here, and wait... until the time is right."
msgstr "떠나셔야 합니다, 위대한 마클룸파여. 우리가 여기서 당신의 교회를 돌보면서 기다리겠습니다... 적당한 때가 올 때까지 말이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest
#. Speaker = Pooldripp the Zealous
#. NodeID = 966d5dee-03e2-422c-b7bb-da24883d2bf6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest:966d5dee-03e2-422c-b7bb-da24883d2bf6
msgctxt "h06073e58g0af4g4c1agadaegc8a39d29f597"
msgid ""
"You are too modest, great one. This name perfectly captures your essence - "
"your fury."
msgstr "위대한 존재시여, 당신께서는 너무나 겸허하십니다. 이 이름이야말로 당신의 본질인, 분노를 완벽하게 담아내기에 걸맞습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest
#. Speaker = Pooldripp the Zealous
#. NodeID = bb989321-dfde-4f50-b836-90fc31094e1e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MUTED(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest:bb989321-dfde-4f50-b836-90fc31094e1e
msgctxt "h117a6af7g3669g4ba7g96e7g4f0977198e33"
msgid "What is to be your first commandment, oh great god?"
msgstr "오오 위대한 신이시여, 첫 계명으로는 무엇을 하사하시겠나이까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest
#. Speaker = Pooldripp the Zealous
#. NodeID = bd161a7a-f1de-4ecf-b1a8-acc2446fb2a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_KuoToaGod_HasMetPriest(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_KuoToaGod_HasMetPriest(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest:bd161a7a-f1de-4ecf-b1a8-acc2446fb2a2
msgctxt "h991b543egef45g43e8g90a7gb8a903a70bfe"
msgid ""
"You've slain the pretender! We knew in our hearts the god BOOOAL was false."
msgstr "협잡꾼을 죽여버리셨군요! 부우알 신은 가짜라고 모두 속으로는 알고 있었어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c582800c-4021-4695-8b55-5df9a888d1b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest:c582800c-4021-4695-8b55-5df9a888d1b3
msgctxt "hb3acb894g20e4g46f8g98a8g4451336a3372"
msgid "Just keep doing what you're doing."
msgstr "하던 일을 계속 하세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = ca4c3d7a-ba14-44a7-bbf2-17ac6100b6d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(5) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest:ca4c3d7a-ba14-44a7-bbf2-17ac6100b6d9
msgctxt "h9111208bg82c5g4e8cg8c43g01173de8bec0"
msgid ""
"If they ask for a sacrifice, I'd suggest virgins. Young and hot-blooded."
msgstr "만약 제물을 바치라 한다면, 처녀가 좋겠어. 젊고 피도 따끈따끈한 걸로다가."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest
#. Speaker = Pooldripp the Zealous
#. NodeID = d2490976-1573-4473-a75f-b2e3e0ca9f6d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest:d2490976-1573-4473-a75f-b2e3e0ca9f6d
msgctxt "hbfafb0d1g9440g4521g8cabgd732e7e1f903"
msgid "... you test us, great one. There are other ways of showing devotion."
msgstr "...당신께선 우리를 시험에 들게 하시는군요, 위대한 존재시여. 헌신을 증명할 다른 방법들도 있습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest
#. Speaker = Pooldripp the Zealous
#. NodeID = e9f8a869-5c60-4367-a1f6-a7112c03feb2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest:e9f8a869-5c60-4367-a1f6-a7112c03feb2
msgctxt "h9aea6bb0g09f1g42c1g952dg148b65ba2089"
msgid ""
"Yes - yes! We will study this being who claims power over you, great "
"Mahkloompah."
msgstr "그렇습니다, 그렇고 말고요! 당신보다 큰 권능을 가지고 있다는 이 존재를 연구해 보겠습니다, 위대한 마클룸파여."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ed6064e9-e85f-46ee-80db-8820fd25eecd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest:ed6064e9-e85f-46ee-80db-8820fd25eecd
msgctxt "h58951ac5g24c0g4699g88acg9513a966c256"
msgid "No more blood rituals."
msgstr "피의 의식은 이제 끝이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest
#. Speaker = Pooldripp the Zealous
#. NodeID = fa17e813-6148-4151-b1d1-6212b47a22ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_HighPriest:fa17e813-6148-4151-b1d1-6212b47a22ad
msgctxt "h5c86410fg1744g43a2ga64agb331f2e6bfb9"
msgid ""
"Our blood to fill your oceans, great Mahkloompah! Our bones to build your "
"temple in the deep!"
msgstr "우리의 피로 당신의 대해를 채우겠나이다, 위대한 마클룸파여! 깊은 곳에 우리의 뼈로 당신의 성전을 짓겠나이다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_KuoToaMinion
#. Speaker = GROUP_Act1_UND_KuoToa
#. NodeID = 157d72ee-a914-78aa-ecd8-2fa3c09b413c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_KuoToaGod_State_PlayerIsChosen = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_KuoToaMinion:157d72ee-a914-78aa-ecd8-2fa3c09b413c
msgctxt "h6a6ea2bcgfa0eg4f20gaef4g52649e724dad"
msgid "PRAISE BOOOAL! PRAISE BOOOAL'S CHOSEN!"
msgstr "부알을 찬양하라! 부알에게 선택받은 자를 찬양하라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_KuoToaMinion
#. Speaker = GROUP_Act1_UND_KuoToa
#. NodeID = 3c23824b-640d-b296-01c8-18492f82ef32
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_KuoToaGod_State_UsurpedBOOOAL = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_KuoToaMinion:3c23824b-640d-b296-01c8-18492f82ef32
msgctxt "heab64d83g76c5g48fbga895g06636c82f7af"
msgid "PRAISE MAHKLOOMPAH!"
msgstr "<b>마클룸파를 찬양하라!</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_KuoToaMinion
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d68a8672-c131-8741-29ce-42b5400e9b5c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_KuoToaMinion:d68a8672-c131-8741-29ce-42b5400e9b5c
msgctxt "h1a030565gdef1g42f0gb12ag9d114f943521"
msgid "*The creature is lost in devotion. You might as well not exist.*"
msgstr "*생물은 헌신에 빠져들어 무아지경 상태입니다. 당신은 없는 사람 취급입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_PAD_MagicGone
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0bf69341-92e6-e493-f55a-28b932909d85
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_PAD_MagicGone:0bf69341-92e6-e493-f55a-28b932909d85
msgctxt "hec697903g475ag44d9g8934g4179f26b17ed"
msgid ""
"His power died with the fish creatures. I expected more from the 'Lord of "
"Murder'."
msgstr "이 생선 놈들과 함께 그의 힘도 사라졌어. '살인의 군주'라면 뭔가 더 있을 줄 알았는데 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_PAD_MagicGone
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0bf69341-92e6-e493-f55a-28b932909d85
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_PAD_MagicGone:0bf69341-92e6-e493-f55a-28b932909d85
msgctxt "h77654747g7b8bg4971g9c6bgacfc28d55a52"
msgid ""
"Quite a bit less-than-divine for a god, wasn't he? With powers as fleeting "
"as his followers' lives."
msgstr "신 치고는 너무 약하지 않았어? 추종자들의 목숨과 함께 힘이 그렇게 순식간에 사라지다니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_PAD_MagicGone
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0bf69341-92e6-e493-f55a-28b932909d85
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_PAD_MagicGone:0bf69341-92e6-e493-f55a-28b932909d85
msgctxt "hb3a49064gc2c3g4962g995bge3b8f2b6a185"
msgid "Poor old BOOOAL, wasn't long for this world after all."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_PAD_MagicGone
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0bf69341-92e6-e493-f55a-28b932909d85
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_PAD_MagicGone:0bf69341-92e6-e493-f55a-28b932909d85
msgctxt "h1c149f90g427cg460egb134g3acc016b28f5"
msgid "The power has dispersed. He was no god - hardly even an imitation."
msgstr "힘이 사라졌어. 신은 무슨, 모조품이라고 부르기도 힘들어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_PAD_MagicGone
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0bf69341-92e6-e493-f55a-28b932909d85
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_PAD_MagicGone:0bf69341-92e6-e493-f55a-28b932909d85
msgctxt "h60d85cd5g9723g4f7bgb46cg3890d5094d0d"
msgid "Seems like his godlike powers died with his followers."
msgstr "놈의 신적인 힘도 추종자들과 함께 사라진 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_PAD_MagicGone
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0bf69341-92e6-e493-f55a-28b932909d85
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_PAD_MagicGone:0bf69341-92e6-e493-f55a-28b932909d85
msgctxt "hd28340bdga16fg427eg819ag991ef97139ed"
msgid "So much for the 'Lord of Murder'. Pretty fishy, if you ask me."
msgstr "'살인의 군주'도 끝이군. 꽤 비릿한데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_PAD_MagicGone
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0bf69341-92e6-e493-f55a-28b932909d85
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_PAD_MagicGone:0bf69341-92e6-e493-f55a-28b932909d85
msgctxt "h5121b2f1gf63ag4e80g9534g090f77af74d8"
msgid ""
"Not much of a god after all. Whatever power he had, it died with those "
"creatures."
msgstr "대단한 신도 아니네. 어떤 힘이었는진 모르겠지만, 저 물고기 놈들과 함께 사라졌어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL
#. Speaker = BOOOAL
#. NodeID = 011970e3-400d-d943-9a71-803f876d15aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL:011970e3-400d-d943-9a71-803f876d15aa
msgctxt "h6f0cb82fg0ae8g46f0gb902g8d973b9a1f00"
msgid "TALK IS FINE. TASTE IS BETTER. <i>PRIEST!</i>"
msgstr "대화는 괜찮아. 맛보는 건 더 좋지. <i>사제여!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 024a3f05-fdde-e03d-9bea-cd8ed56c3225
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_DARK_URGE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL:024a3f05-fdde-e03d-9bea-cd8ed56c3225
msgctxt "h69f91b2agd3acg4fb6ga2fcgb445379e08c2"
msgid "<i>Show them what a God of Death looks like. Attack!</i>"
msgstr "<i>죽음의 신이 어떤 모습인지 보여준다. 공격!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 024a3f05-fdde-e03d-9bea-cd8ed56c3225
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL:024a3f05-fdde-e03d-9bea-cd8ed56c3225
msgctxt "he864013fg623cg4dc6ga03fg5f24423f8512"
msgid "<i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0902efe8-b026-f8a8-5bb0-81b5f3ffad92
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL:0902efe8-b026-f8a8-5bb0-81b5f3ffad92
msgctxt "h83d2168aga7e2g4f43g86bcg268419a70d71"
msgid ""
"*You feel a swell of power again as the creatures redouble their prayers.*"
msgstr "*이 생물들이 기도를 배가하면서 힘이 다시 솟구치는 것이 느껴집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0e9e3ecc-b5cf-4f9c-8d6b-1b0838923947
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL:0e9e3ecc-b5cf-4f9c-8d6b-1b0838923947
msgctxt "hc1e95ff3g0822g4b9fg90bcgae090e1aa06d"
msgid "I'm no one's offering."
msgstr "나는 누구의 공물도 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL
#. Speaker = BOOOAL
#. NodeID = 0ebdf5af-4b40-b58b-c751-f6ce47a033cf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_KuoToaGod_State_HasSickle(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_KuoToaGod_Event_GiveMagicItem(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL:0ebdf5af-4b40-b58b-c751-f6ce47a033cf
msgctxt "hb77c1a1bgcf50g4648gb24ag49ab97028c88"
msgid "AND CHOSEN... SO YOU DON'T FORGET-"
msgstr "그리고 선택받은 자여... 잊지 말도록-"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL
#. Speaker = BOOOAL
#. NodeID = 0f5216fe-f5ee-b63d-20c5-e0d7628b6f05
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_KuoToaGod_State_HasSickle(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_KuoToaGod_Event_GiveMagicItem(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL:0f5216fe-f5ee-b63d-20c5-e0d7628b6f05
msgctxt "h1b5e2a9fg0b16g4cffga976g5ebce46dbda4"
msgid ""
"GO THEN, CHOSEN. TELL THE SURFACE WORLD BOOOAL IS COMING. AND SO YOU DON'T "
"FORGET -"
msgstr "그럼 가라, 선택받은 자여. 온 세상에 부알이 온다고 전해라. 그리고 이것도 가져가라 -"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0ff129af-7e87-5629-f6a4-fd62b98abc0f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL:0ff129af-7e87-5629-f6a4-fd62b98abc0f
msgctxt "h21860012g5cfcg4c3ega213g97e885f7e393"
msgid "Wait! If it's blood you want, I can make another offer."
msgstr "잠깐! 네가 원하는 게 피라면, 내가 다른 제안을 할 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL
#. Speaker = Pooldripp the Zealous
#. NodeID = 14dcfb94-142e-4eca-9ebf-ae0d9cb5d869
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL:14dcfb94-142e-4eca-9ebf-ae0d9cb5d869
msgctxt "h87d15f07g6355g43eaga97bg90df377eeadf"
msgid ""
"Our blood to fill your oceans, oh blessed BOOOAL! Our bones to build your "
"temple in the deep!"
msgstr "우리의 피로 당신의 대해를 채우겠나이다, 축복 받은 부알이시여! 깊은 곳에 우리의 뼈로 당신의 성전을 짓겠나이다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL
#. Speaker = Pooldripp the Zealous
#. NodeID = 18b09a8e-48ba-8441-13b7-f9630cc4fa9e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN_DEVOTION(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL:18b09a8e-48ba-8441-13b7-f9630cc4fa9e
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hc69dd117gcf25g4d65g805eg370731699456"
msgid ""
"Yes. <i>Yes</i> - I sense justice. <i>Honour.</i> A new god, to show us the "
"way!"
msgstr "그래. <i>이거야</i> - 정의. <i>명예</i>가 느껴져. 우리의 길을 보여줄 새로운 신이다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL
#. Speaker = BOOOAL
#. NodeID = 1d5d9c29-4807-4754-9a58-7871a562a621
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL:1d5d9c29-4807-4754-9a58-7871a562a621
msgctxt "hb23bc8e0gbdc0g4725gb75egda37b593a71c"
msgid "WORDS, PRIEST. PROMISES. YOUR GOD WANTS PROOF. WANTS <i>BLOOD.</i>"
msgstr "말만 많구나, 사제여. 약속하라. 너희 신이 증명을 원한다. <i>피</i>를 원한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL
#. Speaker = BOOOAL
#. NodeID = 1d72aa51-9b3e-464c-a632-5a1f59776a8f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL:1d72aa51-9b3e-464c-a632-5a1f59776a8f
msgctxt "h14d8de17g86adg425fgbf27g3ae86996e496"
msgid "IT'S SIMPLE. MAKE AN OFFERING - OR BECOME ONE."
msgstr "간단하다. 공물을 바치거나, 직접 공물이 돼라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 1ffed784-68ff-7b5d-f237-418bf7f2ced5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_KuoToaGod_State_KnowsGodIsRedcap(2) = True
#.     - UND_KuoToaGod_State_KnowsGodIsFake(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL:1ffed784-68ff-7b5d-f237-418bf7f2ced5
msgctxt "h75913c82g85f6g4644gb605ge1f562d43619"
msgid ""
"*You sense a flicker of doubt - brief, but enough. For an instant, the godly "
"presence falters.*"
msgstr "*당신은 잠깐이지만, 충분히 느껴지는 의심의 깜박임을 감지합니다. 잠깐 동안 신의 존재감이 흔들립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL
#. Speaker = BOOOAL
#. NodeID = 2066cf9c-f9ae-181c-c690-59d11d8b65fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL:2066cf9c-f9ae-181c-c690-59d11d8b65fc
msgctxt "h99bf0c4eg9e2fg4fddg8975gce2d56a2ef4a"
msgid ""
"That depends on the fishfolk, <i>don't</i> it? But <i>plenty to go "
"around.</i>"
msgstr "그건 물고기 놈들의 힘에 달렸지, <i>안 그래</i> ? 하지만 <i>남아돌 정도의 양이야.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 21a960a4-dcb0-4199-ab63-daf46c55fe54
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_KuoToaGod_State_KnowsGodIsRedcap(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL:21a960a4-dcb0-4199-ab63-daf46c55fe54
msgctxt "hb75e0bb7g1d57g4b84ga291gec5f45c68130"
msgid ""
"<i>Redcaps love violence - bait him with an exaggerated tale of battle and "
"bloodshed.</i>"
msgstr "<i>레드캡은 폭력을 좋아한다. 전투와 유혈 사태에 대한 과장된 이야기로 미끼를 던진다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 2483d0af-4c78-41e2-86ec-a709b3c59992
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_KuoToaGod_State_PresentForSacrifice(8) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL:2483d0af-4c78-41e2-86ec-a709b3c59992
msgctxt "h2cf5f9bcgf46ag4947gbfc1ge660a688a1b9"
msgid ""
"Don't look at me. I just got out of devil hell. I'm not going to fishy hell "
"any time soon."
msgstr "쳐다보지 마. 난 방금 악마 지옥에서 나왔다고. 비린내 나는 지옥으로 갈 생각 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 25011126-8389-4555-8665-554a77c18f74
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_KuoToaGod_State_PresentForSacrifice(7) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL:25011126-8389-4555-8665-554a77c18f74
msgctxt "h47b9ba7cg4f85g4a78ga753g3f599e1fc26b"
msgid "Tread carefully, now. Not even a god would survive sacrificing me."
msgstr "지금부터 신중하게 선택하는 게 좋을 거야. 신조차 날 거스르고 살아남지 못할테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL
#. Speaker = Pooldripp the Zealous
#. NodeID = 25f57d97-8e5d-8708-a78a-15777a0d9100
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL:25f57d97-8e5d-8708-a78a-15777a0d9100
msgctxt "hef652715gc3a8g48eeg988dg67abfb509238"
msgid ""
"YOU! Our Lord of Murder demands sacrifice! You will be an offering for the "
"great god BOOOAL!"
msgstr "너! 살인의 군주께서 희생을 원하신다! 위대한 신 부알 님을 위한 공물이 되거라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL
#. Speaker = BOOOAL
#. NodeID = 298e2682-330d-199c-e210-72c66d86d3a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL:298e2682-330d-199c-e210-72c66d86d3a3
msgctxt "hdd293f0dg7f17g4642g919fg08f5a0e5cdfb"
msgid ""
"<i>Shut it, you!</i>  I'm talking to... my Chosen! Chosen got <i>power </i>- "
"you want power, don't ya?"
msgstr ""
"<i>입닥쳐, 너희는!</i>  나는... 내 선택받은 자와 대화하고 있다! 선택받으면 <i>힘</i>을 받지. 너도 힘을 원하잖아. 안 "
"그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL
#. Speaker = BOOOAL
#. NodeID = 2f1b42e0-6725-0e70-59c9-e985bb7fedf1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_KuoToaGod_State_SacrificeComplete = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL:2f1b42e0-6725-0e70-59c9-e985bb7fedf1
msgctxt "h8f01cf4eg97b7g4babg8520gf8b82089393b"
msgid "YOU'VE MADE YOUR OFFERING. EVEN BETTER - YOU MADE A <i>MESS.</i>"
msgstr "너는 공물을 바쳤다. 게다가 더 마음에 드는군. 너는 <i>소동</i>을 일으켰다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 305f847a-bba7-b7a4-ff8f-0d6c13c0ddc8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL:305f847a-bba7-b7a4-ff8f-0d6c13c0ddc8
msgctxt "hbefd623fg6df9g4274g81a5gdd110bbfa251"
msgid ""
"*Mad guilt swills in your swooning, sick body. Today you became the tart of "
"a false God, and your evil pride revolts.*"
msgstr ""
"*미칠 듯 한 죄책감이 당신의 병든 몸을 휘젓습니다. 오늘 당신은 거짓된 신을 섬기게 되었으며, 사악한 자존감이 내면에서 꿈틀댑니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 318a4627-cb56-a3c3-6d46-b09ab101e48b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Strength
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL:318a4627-cb56-a3c3-6d46-b09ab101e48b
msgctxt "h0672af72g0d87g4e8cgaf36g5ca46c172b1e"
msgid "Look at me. If there's any god of death here, it's <i>me.</i>"
msgstr "나를 봐. 만약 죽음의 신이 여기 있다면, 그건<i> 나</i>일 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL
#. Speaker = BOOOAL
#. NodeID = 373b8f8a-f3f6-1167-6bc5-457043f24b56
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL:373b8f8a-f3f6-1167-6bc5-457043f24b56
msgctxt "h2875b59cg3137g47b9gbf86g40261b2f7607"
msgid ""
"Don't do anything hasty, now. The fishfolk got plenty of power - we can "
"<i>share.</i>"
msgstr "당장 성급하게 행동하지 마라. 이 물고기 놈들은 많은 힘을 갖고 있다. 우리끼리 <i>나눌</i> 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL
#. Speaker = BOOOAL
#. NodeID = 3fbdbc6b-1ff8-b2c8-5b22-18e2e894ff07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_KuoToaGod_State_PlayerIsChosen = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL:3fbdbc6b-1ff8-b2c8-5b22-18e2e894ff07
msgctxt "h4c6c18cfg9ba5g4540g931ag05195bfe86d0"
msgid "DON'T WANT PRAYERS FROM YOU, CHOSEN - WANT <i>BLOOD</i>. ON YOU GO."
msgstr "네게서 기도문은 원치 않는다, 선택받은 자여-<i>피</i>를 원한다. 이제 가라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL
#. Speaker = BOOOAL
#. NodeID = 42a2fed3-fd54-205e-7885-cb0fb53376cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL:42a2fed3-fd54-205e-7885-cb0fb53376cb
msgctxt "ha0feb36cg6cffg4ac1g8f87g13718f41da06"
msgid "ARGH! NO! SHUT IT! <i>Shut your rotten mouth!</i>"
msgstr "아악! 안 돼! 닥쳐! <i>그 썩은 입 다물란 말이다!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 4400c9f7-93ec-498f-a967-1ae9961d001d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL:4400c9f7-93ec-498f-a967-1ae9961d001d
msgctxt "h39997f3dg5a99g4b10g826ag2c6e58d66f7c"
msgid "You can sacrifice yourself first, you spineless rat!"
msgstr "너부터 희생해야 할 거다, 이 줏대 없는 쥐새끼야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL
#. Speaker = BOOOAL
#. NodeID = 47bed829-b79a-4e46-8430-bf6593750375
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(8) = False
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(6) = False
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(4) = False
#.      - REALLY_GALE(7) = False
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(5) = False
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(3) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL:47bed829-b79a-4e46-8430-bf6593750375
msgctxt "hbc0a9f3bg2596g443cg9189g89affd627832"
msgid "OH? WHAT'S THAT, THEN? WHAT YOU GOT FOR BLESSED BOOOAL?"
msgstr "오? 그럼 그게 무엇이지? 축복받은 부알을 위해 무엇을 바칠 텐가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 48bd2d2f-037d-d497-7635-e1228cedb169
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL:48bd2d2f-037d-d497-7635-e1228cedb169
msgctxt "h42b64a94gd097g44c5gbf4fge360811e4833"
msgid "What kind of power?"
msgstr "무슨 힘이지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL
#. Speaker = Pooldripp the Zealous
#. NodeID = 4ae1d0aa-d822-487e-94a7-ac9b386fb4d8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL:4ae1d0aa-d822-487e-94a7-ac9b386fb4d8
msgctxt "haa39ee64gb733g43cdgb948g5db712a89bf8"
msgid "Bhaal...? No... we are... we are faithful to Lord <i>BOOOAL</i>..."
msgstr "바알...? 아니... 우리는... 우리는 군주 <i>부알</i>을 섬긴다..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4bbd9c6e-17d6-43bb-e427-13a4e002dc2f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL:4bbd9c6e-17d6-43bb-e427-13a4e002dc2f
msgctxt "hfd4a8ec3gd089g46d0g9b47gcbd9a047f882"
msgid ""
"Seriously - 'BOOOAL'? Whatever this thing is, he didn't even feed you a good "
"lie."
msgstr "진지하게 '부알'이야? 그게 뭔지는 상관없지만, 거짓말도 그럴듯하게 해야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL
#. Speaker = BOOOAL
#. NodeID = 4beebc7d-7ba9-b971-5d4f-01fba471f7e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL:4beebc7d-7ba9-b971-5d4f-01fba471f7e5
msgctxt "h40ea7f82g20fbg4efaga327gd86495cc74b2"
msgid "I THINK I'LL KEEP YOU - <i>CHOSEN.</i>"
msgstr "너를 <i>선택받은 자</i>로 계속 둬도 되겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_KuoToaGod_SpeakWithBOOOAL
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4d0ba93f-922f-4045-b899-33d2f8a94799
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
