msgid "Me... no. Gnomes... were fiddling... with rubble... yonder."
msgstr "난...아냐. 노움들이... 돌무더기에... 장난을 쳤어... 저쪽."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_LoneDuergar_DeadDuergar_Dead
