msgctxt "haa13eceegbb1eg49degba81g52bf8eb5971c"
msgid "*The corpse seems willing to speak - but not to its killer.*"
msgstr "*시체는 말할 의지가 있지만, 자신을 죽인 자와 대화하고 싶지는 않은 듯 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_LoneDuergar_DeadDuergar_Dead
