msgctxt "h2fa2a847gbb7cg4864g9804g8e2064d3a100"
msgid "Could've told me that before. Go ahead."
msgstr "그런 건 미리 말해줬어야지. 지나가."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_LoneDuergar_GCB_ForbiddenRaft
