"*이 영혼이 겪는 광기가 무엇이든 간에, 그것은 라샌더의 적인 샤의 추종자들이 가한 것입니다. 이 광기가 당신의 몸을 통해 흐르게 될지도 "
"모릅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2592ce1a-5aaf-59ce-8bf9-ee770ac31e28
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:2592ce1a-5aaf-59ce-8bf9-ee770ac31e28
msgctxt "h65ff4626gaab6g4cfbg84e2g14d895f5cbf0"
msgid "<i>Quiet your mind. Let everything be still.</i>"
msgstr "<i>마음을 가라앉힌다. 모든 것이 가만히 있도록 한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 294ad78a-9f8c-68b7-de7f-a159df56305a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:294ad78a-9f8c-68b7-de7f-a159df56305a
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h0dfd4343g61efg4208gbae6g1da6b144db67"
msgid "*You stifle a chuckle and drop the amulet. The urge to laugh passes...*"
msgstr "*당신은 웃음을 억누르고 아뮬렛을 떨어뜨립니다. 웃음을 터뜨리고 싶은 충동이 지나갑니다...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2af021b5-cfeb-4055-f364-ccd51bbd8361
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_MonkAmulet_Event_StowedAmulet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:2af021b5-cfeb-4055-f364-ccd51bbd8361
msgctxt "hf880b41fg528ag4abegaca2gd61326c4b073"
msgid "<i>Stow the amulet.</i>"
msgstr "<i>아뮬렛을 집어넣는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 2eedafe9-4a10-fff7-967f-2a8a8cacfcf6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:2eedafe9-4a10-fff7-967f-2a8a8cacfcf6
msgctxt "hf9443ff8g8eb6g4a26g9cdeg70a5d14149d2"
msgid "*Flying machines. <i>Walking brains. </i>It's all so absurd!*"
msgstr "*날으는 기계. <i>걸어다니는 뇌. </i>다 너무 우스꽝스럽습니다!*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Monk's Manifestation
#. NodeID = 3171319e-6191-1bde-2c99-a82c7ee228bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:3171319e-6191-1bde-2c99-a82c7ee228bc
msgctxt "h41a7b1feg2a18g405fg8260gf58007db16da"
msgid "Do not abandon my blessing - hee hee!"
msgstr "나의 축복을 버리지 말거라. 히히!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 330bcad1-a865-e8fd-c202-7fe39ebb3899
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_MonkAmulet_Event_WhatHappened(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_MonkAmulet_Event_WhatHappened(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:330bcad1-a865-e8fd-c202-7fe39ebb3899
msgctxt "h9b95ca82gf7b1g441agb141gd7c2f90cdd73"
msgid "Are you a ghost? What happened to you?"
msgstr "당신은 유령인가? 당신에게 어떤 일이 있었지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Monk's Manifestation
#. NodeID = 35e1d4f7-a7aa-ab7b-d048-ac30aab1f5fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:35e1d4f7-a7aa-ab7b-d048-ac30aab1f5fc
msgctxt "hef91e54egfc16g48b2ga4f5g6a9368b4eb3a"
msgid "Endure!"
msgstr "견디어라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 391fbf88-2e24-511c-7189-10ad99569087
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:391fbf88-2e24-511c-7189-10ad99569087
msgctxt "h1a960134g19e7g4f51g853eg5aaef5a42f7e"
msgid ""
"*You know a fury more beautiful, more devastating than any. It wraps you in "
"a comforting embrace.*"
msgstr "*당신은 그 어느 것보다도 아름답고 파괴적인 분노를 알고 있습니다. 그것은 위안이 되는 포옹으로 당신을 감싸줍니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3b286bb6-e2c2-0524-1dd8-e034331064c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:3b286bb6-e2c2-0524-1dd8-e034331064c4
msgctxt "hce7eed98g9091g46c5g88b6g278ba303d2b6"
msgid "*The urge to laugh intensifies. Talking jewellery? That's hilarious!*"
msgstr "*웃음을 터뜨리고 싶은 충동이 더 강해집니다. 말하는 보석이라니? 정말 웃깁니다!*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Monk's Manifestation
#. NodeID = 4030b02b-cf9a-5768-8655-0990b1348168
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:4030b02b-cf9a-5768-8655-0990b1348168
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h5d99ae95g2579g4acag9675gebc884aa9e3c"
msgid ""
"The Sharrans tormented me. And I laughed at the pain 'til ne'er couldst I "
"stop."
msgstr "샤 신도들이 내게 고통을 주었다네. 그 고통에 나는 멈출 수 없을 때까지 웃었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 42f6d77f-deb8-0224-dc30-c3d4b1629bd7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:42f6d77f-deb8-0224-dc30-c3d4b1629bd7
msgctxt "h24eb9b1cg349ag41a8g87d3g1c76a42a8449"
msgid ""
"*You observe the urge to laugh from afar, letting it fade with each breath.*"
msgstr "*당신은 웃음을 터뜨릴 이 충동을 아득히 지켜보고, 숨을 쉴 때마다 희미해져 사라지게끔 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 483488d5-bb7d-8637-40c0-a9a5eb98d70c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - UND_MONKAMULET_EQUIPPED(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:483488d5-bb7d-8637-40c0-a9a5eb98d70c
msgctxt "he2b33ad4g1440g4afeg87c4gfde6d5905bbd"
msgid "<i>Keep the amulet equipped.</i>"
msgstr "<i>아뮬렛을 계속 착용한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Monk's Manifestation
#. NodeID = 550f631d-4ccc-0974-f151-118d3624f295
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:550f631d-4ccc-0974-f151-118d3624f295
msgctxt "hc384ec99g4d2cg48bbg8e1ag54e372190d43"
msgid ""
"Sharrans broke my body. But my spirit, they could not. Well - not "
"completely. Hee HEE!"
msgstr "샤 신도들이 내 몸을 부수었다네. 하지만 내 영혼은 부수지 못했지. 뭐, 적어도 완전히는 말이야. 히 <b>히</b>!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 55f42c4f-8355-116b-27fe-1a30f429cea2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:55f42c4f-8355-116b-27fe-1a30f429cea2
msgctxt "h5c27db91g34b9g45e6ga54dg0d0c3480ad24"
msgid ""
"*The urge flows into the strands of the Weave, leaving only a sense of calm.*"
msgstr "*충동은 위브의 가닥으로 흘러 들어가, 평온한 감각만을 남깁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 57d05b8c-1996-475f-af36-57407b865368
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 51fdd867-2792-a6bd-ef56-6fbc8927796f_ShadowheartInclusion = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 51fdd867-2792-a6bd-ef56-6fbc8927796f_ShadowheartInclusion = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:57d05b8c-1996-475f-af36-57407b865368
msgctxt "hef874b8eg4e2dg436fga0a2g6e9fb9da3c81"
msgid ""
"That thing's tainted. Better to leave it than bear a dead man's grudges."
msgstr "더렵혀진 물건이야. 망자의 원한을 품고 다니느니 그냥 버리는 게 낫겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 60a796ff-1e3e-c8a5-2b5d-abd83345a3f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:60a796ff-1e3e-c8a5-2b5d-abd83345a3f2
msgctxt "h0e192fc2g7442g4962g92a8gb6823fba310f"
msgid ""
"*Images of illithids torturing and tormenting your people quells the urge to "
"laugh - for now.*"
msgstr "*당신을 고문하고 당신의 동족에게 고통을 주는 일리시드의 모습을 떠올리자, 웃음의 충동이 가라앉습니다. 적어도 지금은 말이죠.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6171fcb3-1938-1a6d-429b-5220ed3c5f6a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:6171fcb3-1938-1a6d-429b-5220ed3c5f6a
msgctxt "h5d807ca7g4566g4eacgadc4gf7975b9b3247"
msgid "*Your power spikes, banishing the urge to laugh in an instant.*"
msgstr "*당신의 힘이 솟구쳐, 웃음의 충동을 즉시 없애버립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6972eacd-be31-d6ed-e1e2-914f33f1c1c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_MonkAmulet_Event_DiscardedAmulet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:6972eacd-be31-d6ed-e1e2-914f33f1c1c4
msgctxt "hc547e42bgdda3g4ab7g9800gf56cffc83540"
msgid "<i>Drop the amulet.</i>"
msgstr "<i>아뮬렛을 떨어뜨린다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6a922f4e-a82f-031d-446e-b756d8076df1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:6a922f4e-a82f-031d-446e-b756d8076df1
msgctxt "hb238e542g34f5g411dga4bbgd59b60ddbf8e"
msgid ""
"*Sheer, unbridled rage floods your veins, obliterating the urge to laugh.*"
msgstr "*억누를 수 없는 순수한 격노가 혈관을 타고 솟구치며, 웃음을 터뜨리고 싶은 충동을 말살해버립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6c229c0f-18ef-e888-3bb1-262b41b740d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:6c229c0f-18ef-e888-3bb1-262b41b740d9
msgctxt "h42e4e8abg1599g4463g8a4cg3ed3f69e3169"
msgid ""
"*Beneath the rampant joy, you sense the monk's fear and sincerity. He "
"doesn't wish to harm you - but that doesn't mean he won't.*"
msgstr ""
"*이 걷잡을 수 없는 기쁨 아래에서, 수도승의 공포와 진심을 느낄 수 있습니다. 당신을 해치려는 의도는 없지만, 해치지 않으리란 법도 "
"없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6d31281d-fb02-da7c-68e4-23ce9741f340
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:6d31281d-fb02-da7c-68e4-23ce9741f340
msgctxt "h9e925b7bg0471g42c5gb028ga2a1bd74e500"
msgid ""
"*Lines and arcs are etched into the metal, but you see no pattern in them.*"
msgstr "*금속에 선과 호가 새겨져 있지만, 눈에 띄는 패턴은 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6e130e18-a45e-4518-f45c-e72087b8e27f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_MonkAmulet_Event_PlayerLaughed(1) = False
#.      - UND_MonkAmulet_Event_WhatHappened(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_MonkAmulet_Event_WhatHappened(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:6e130e18-a45e-4518-f45c-e72087b8e27f
msgctxt "ha23655d4g6815g4811gb3eegcde753b2edf3"
msgid "I could barely hold my laughter. What did you do to me?"
msgstr "웃음을 겨우 참았어. 나에게 무슨 짓을 한 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6fbef28c-259f-c283-87ec-78ccbd0d86eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WARLOCK(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:6fbef28c-259f-c283-87ec-78ccbd0d86eb
msgctxt "he8d18af5g57eeg4e8fga0e8ge79fa48880da"
msgid "<i>Call on the power of your pact and resist the urge.</i>"
msgstr "<i>서약의 힘을 불러내어 충동에 저항한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Monk's Manifestation
#. NodeID = 7139a109-0e8b-b644-e78b-025700484d1e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:7139a109-0e8b-b644-e78b-025700484d1e
msgctxt "hfa0fc16dg2df5g4101g9a15g72de8e3293e0"
msgid "O! Thou shalt be blessed indeed. He he hee!"
msgstr "오! 그대는 축복받을 것이니라. 히 히 히!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 741b54d9-451a-e461-7da0-6a0e134583a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CURRENTREGION_BGO_Main_A = False
#.      - UND_MonkAmulet_Event_OfferedQuest = True
#.      - CURRENTREGION_END_Main = False
#.      - CURRENTREGION_EPI_Main_A = False
#.      - WYR_SentientAmulet_Knows_ShirraIsInCrypt = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:741b54d9-451a-e461-7da0-6a0e134583a6
msgctxt "h6d8e0816gb7ebg40afgbd06gc2f6a6574890"
msgid "I will take you to your granddaughter at Wyrm's Crossing."
msgstr "고룡 다리에 있는 당신 손녀에게 당신을 데려가도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Monk's Manifestation
#. NodeID = 76122d63-7f01-a246-9437-433437099feb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_MonkAmulet_HasMet2(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:76122d63-7f01-a246-9437-433437099feb
msgctxt "ha7c21a29g4a1cg43d0gaf53ge69d470a816c"
msgid "Thou shalt return me, ho HO. Thou shalt have my blessing."
msgstr "그대는 나를 돌려보내 줄 것이니라, 호 호! 그대는 내 축복을 얻을 것이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 77105682-2ccd-3f57-25a3-5f13de815195
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WIZARD(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:77105682-2ccd-3f57-25a3-5f13de815195
msgctxt "h7390b1c9g72f0g4d2eg8c70g99fdf8ba59a9"
msgid "<i>Reach for the Weave. Let it shield you from this impulse.</i>"
msgstr "<i>위브에 손을 뻗는다. 당신의 이 충동을 위브가 막아주도록 해본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Monk's Manifestation
#. NodeID = 788dd579-bd08-176f-5653-4bfdb10c529d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:788dd579-bd08-176f-5653-4bfdb10c529d
msgctxt "h719a700bgadd8g494bg93fegc7f8e62ec4b7"
msgid "Done, it shalt be! Ho HO!"
msgstr "그리, 될 것이니라. 호 호!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 78e69fc3-48ba-990e-24b5-90e6ed1b036d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:78e69fc3-48ba-990e-24b5-90e6ed1b036d
msgctxt "hcbba3f2cgf86eg4734gbc72g3716911cb51a"
msgid "*You feel a chuckle coming on - but it soon fades.*"
msgstr "*당신은 웃음이 올라오는 것을 느끼지만, 곧 사라집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7920b0e7-9527-5b58-e43d-759bf08adbc3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_MonkAmulet_Event_PassedCheckOne(1) = True
#.      - UND_MonkAmulet_Event_PassedCheckTwo(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:7920b0e7-9527-5b58-e43d-759bf08adbc3
msgctxt "h48cc6800g5ddag4283g81d6g60b537d002f4"
msgid "<i>Consider the inscribed image. What could it mean?</i>"
msgstr "<i>새겨진 형태에 대해 생각해본다. 무슨 뜻일까?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7bd52a37-2479-2cef-69cc-f591fd55e451
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:7bd52a37-2479-2cef-69cc-f591fd55e451
msgctxt "h3c7b2aabgdd1fg4e1ega7ffgbf1e3696682f"
msgid "<i>Fight the urge.</i>"
msgstr "<i>충동과 싸운다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Monk's Manifestation
#. NodeID = 7f02846d-ded1-eb8c-0801-4446cbf6b1e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:7f02846d-ded1-eb8c-0801-4446cbf6b1e9
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hffd270bag942fg40adgb3c4g2b811ed18474"
msgid ""
"Thou hast done well. For what is a laugh, if not one step toward "
"<i>madness</i>?"
msgstr "그대는 잘 했느니라. <i>광기</i>를 향해 나아가는 한 걸음이 아니라면, 웃음이란 무엇이겠는가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7f6b1210-3243-d823-e38d-0ed0d79f7904
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. TagRule: CLERIC_EVIL or PALADIN_EVIL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:7f6b1210-3243-d823-e38d-0ed0d79f7904
msgctxt "h1e9cbd18g1108g4e96g926fga3966f9ac8ae"
msgid "<i>Grit your teeth. Summon your god's wrath.</i>"
msgstr "<i>이를 악문다. 당신이 믿는 신의 격노를 불러낸다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 820eaad4-23b7-fff4-b710-a62c50b976e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - UND_MONKAMULET_EQUIPPED(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_MonkAmulet_Event_EquipAmulet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:820eaad4-23b7-fff4-b710-a62c50b976e8
msgctxt "habb1fd3ege4ecg4aefg9605ga82486c2492d"
msgid "<i>Equip the amulet.</i>"
msgstr "<i>아뮬렛을 착용한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Monk's Manifestation
#. NodeID = 83382742-1cd6-505a-be5d-628762740251
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:83382742-1cd6-505a-be5d-628762740251
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "ha945e78eg2ebag4459g9afag0bd2a4406811"
msgid ""
"How unfortunate. Alas, thou must do. Hee. Hee. Hee hee hee <i>hee hee "
"hee</i>!"
msgstr "정말 불운하구나. 안타깝게도 그대는 해야만 한다. 히. 히. 히히히 <i>히히히!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8973b181-85f6-3aa2-beae-c868231d8f7f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:8973b181-85f6-3aa2-beae-c868231d8f7f
msgctxt "h67709e4fg625bg4e8eg83b5gf14de002140b"
msgid "<i>Give in to the laughter.</i>"
msgstr "<i>웃음에 굴복한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8b1eab04-7181-70db-b20a-982a3812915d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:8b1eab04-7181-70db-b20a-982a3812915d
msgctxt "h3245687dg7dcfg43ebgba23g87072305f2ee"
msgid "<i>Kill the mirth. RESIST.</i>"
msgstr "<i>명랑함을 깬다. 저항한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Monk's Manifestation
#. NodeID = 8ec804a6-1b89-3de5-1d39-447bc7f81a2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:8ec804a6-1b89-3de5-1d39-447bc7f81a2c
msgctxt "h7937c559gf25cg43b9gad9ag1ba773472126"
msgid ""
"Is there affliction more terrible than eternal joy? This is my pleasure. "
"This is my curse."
msgstr "영원한 기쁨보다 끔찍한 고통이 있겠는가? 이것은 나의 쾌락이요. 나의 저주이니라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8ed7c904-40ec-49fe-0bd5-440ddb452b6f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. TagRule: CLERIC_GOOD or PALADIN_GOOD
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:8ed7c904-40ec-49fe-0bd5-440ddb452b6f
msgctxt "h73da4911gb87dg4e28gb44dg9cb448bdc312"
msgid "<i>Summon your light and devotion as you push back.</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신의 빛과 헌신을 불러내어 이 충동을 밀쳐낸다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9a78692b-8113-cdf4-dcdc-a2c54b155edc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_MonkAmulet_Event_PlayerLaughed(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:9a78692b-8113-cdf4-dcdc-a2c54b155edc
msgctxt "h1606dbd1g3af5g4481g99d7gc3e1565f9dc4"
msgid "Ha. Ha ha. Ha ha ha ha ha ha ha hee!"
msgstr "하. 하 하. 하 하 하 하하하 히!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9e883803-dfc3-3f9c-6c9e-1e5923bf5e29
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:9e883803-dfc3-3f9c-6c9e-1e5923bf5e29
msgctxt "hfc79795dge74eg4651g9e6fgeee2c45877ca"
msgid ""
"*Suddenly, the metal surges with heat. You feel great power and an "
"overwhelming urge - to laugh.*"
msgstr "*갑자기, 금속에서 열기가 치솟습니다. 당신은 강력한 힘을 느끼며, 그와 함께 웃음을 터뜨리고 싶은 압도적인 충동도 느낍니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a0d37474-6ee4-43a0-70cb-1bab6cca3fd4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_MonkAmulet_Event_PassedCheckOne(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:a0d37474-6ee4-43a0-70cb-1bab6cca3fd4
msgctxt "h82756ad5g7069g4b67g8820g8ad54681f8aa"
msgid "*Etched on its face is an image of the dawning sun.*"
msgstr "*동이 트는 태양의 형상이 새겨져 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a6bc6eee-a2e4-035a-92f5-0d31a4b1c214
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:a6bc6eee-a2e4-035a-92f5-0d31a4b1c214
msgctxt "hb8ef735ag09cfg40fdgb23cg1060320e1089"
msgid ""
"*The amulet is heavy, but holds a subtle warmth, like it was left under the "
"sun.*"
msgstr "*아뮬렛은 무겁지만, 미세한 온기를 담고 있습니다. 마치 햇빛 아래 두었던 것처럼 말입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Monk's Manifestation
#. NodeID = a74b76d5-79bd-2e4b-9899-9d4cafbf3139
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_MonkAmulet_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:a74b76d5-79bd-2e4b-9899-9d4cafbf3139
msgctxt "h474ee67ag6a3ag4d22gbf2ag59f6ee2af5e2"
msgid "Thou hast come. Hee. Hee. Hee-HEE!"
msgstr "그대가 와 주었구나. 히. 히. 히히!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a7c693bf-4bf2-1836-d48a-cddec509f3b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:a7c693bf-4bf2-1836-d48a-cddec509f3b1
msgctxt "hae65414egd8dag465dg8d22g3255418159ab"
msgid "*The image is striking, but you find no meaning in it.*"
msgstr "*그 형상은 인상깊지만, 당신은 그것이 무슨 뜻인지 모릅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Monk's Manifestation
#. NodeID = a8499640-c476-4115-5014-4f263232ea64
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:a8499640-c476-4115-5014-4f263232ea64
msgctxt "hf2e68bc8g9f23g483fg9848g4486bb4d98b4"
msgid "A ghost? Ha HA! I am sunlight on water, dew on grass."
msgstr "유령이라니? 하 하! 나는 물 위에 뜬 햇빛이자, 잔디 위의 이슬이니라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a8f32d7c-f111-485c-a21f-abbb61f97ab0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_MonkAmulet_Event_PassedCheckOne(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:a8f32d7c-f111-485c-a21f-abbb61f97ab0
msgctxt "h4c139d6fge23cg435ag8b1fg467e752383c5"
msgid "<i>Examine the amulet.</i>"
msgstr "<i>아뮬렛을 살펴본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ad58f69b-0a62-f7ea-8b8d-1045782f4fd6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_MonkAmulet_Event_OfferedQuest = True
#.      - CURRENTREGION_END_Main = False
#.      - CURRENTREGION_EPI_Main_A = False
#.      - WYR_SentientAmulet_Knows_ShirraIsInCrypt = True
#.      - WYR_SentientAmulet_Monk_Knows_ShirraIsDead = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - WYR_SentientAmulet_Monk_Knows_ShirraIsDead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:ad58f69b-0a62-f7ea-8b8d-1045782f4fd6
msgctxt "hb34355fcg3317g40d5g89bag8b77f7d1af85"
msgid "I'm afraid your granddaughter has passed away."
msgstr "유감이군. 당신 손녀는 이미 세상을 떠난 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b24b2006-3c80-98a8-a797-013dbb66a023
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:b24b2006-3c80-98a8-a797-013dbb66a023
msgctxt "h132e12c1g3d61g4b16g812fge7b475626a44"
msgid "*Laughter builds, deep in your chest. It is... irresistible.*"
msgstr "*가슴 깊숙한 곳에서부터 웃음이 쌓여 올라옵니다. 그것은... 억누를 수 없는 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b4e9c8f1-4ac9-cc5d-9fa7-6217ae076628
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DUERGARDWARF(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:b4e9c8f1-4ac9-cc5d-9fa7-6217ae076628
msgctxt "h9cb31c37g40e5g4151g9a0fg3cb9ece983ee"
msgid ""
"<i>Squash all cheer and summon memories of your ancestral enemy - the mind "
"flayers.</i>"
msgstr "<i>모든 환호를 억누른다. 당신 선조의 숙적, 마인드 플레이어에 대한 기억을 떠올려본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Monk's Manifestation
#. NodeID = b53a5b52-309a-a8b0-be71-7acbf6934613
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:b53a5b52-309a-a8b0-be71-7acbf6934613
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hc451bf94gefa0g45eegb515g351a5a50937f"
msgid "Hee. Hee. Hee hee hee <i>hee hee hee</i>. Thou art the one!"
msgstr "히. 히. 히히히<i>히히히</i>. 그대가 바로 그 사람이니라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b5f52e4b-aec9-e136-cb2a-e14e63b91328
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_MonkAmulet_Event_PlayerLaughed(1) = True
#.      - UND_MonkAmulet_Event_WhatHappened(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_MonkAmulet_Event_WhatHappened(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:b5f52e4b-aec9-e136-cb2a-e14e63b91328
msgctxt "h5f3ff301gcd78g4f2ag907fg8d854580db95"
msgid "That laughter. What did you do to me?"
msgstr "그 웃음. 내게 무슨 짓을 한 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Monk's Manifestation
#. NodeID = c10383d5-de80-9dc2-1109-63e1fadff7e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:c10383d5-de80-9dc2-1109-63e1fadff7e5
msgctxt "hb0464ec7g667eg4043g8485g6389328567f1"
msgid "Thou shalt return me home. It is written!"
msgstr "그대는 나를 집으로 돌려보내 줄 것이니라. 그것은 정해진 일이니!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Monk's Manifestation
#. NodeID = c9774be7-bc2b-7a91-9170-32db4390d3c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - WYR_SentientAmulet_Monk_Knows_ShirraIsDead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:c9774be7-bc2b-7a91-9170-32db4390d3c9
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h259e3647g47f3g4aa3gb2a7gcd27d6232691"
msgid ""
"Ha ha, hast thou missed me? Take me to my dear Shirra and open her tomb!"
msgstr "하 하, 그대는 내가 그리웠던 것인가? 사랑하는 시라에게 나를 데리고 가 그녀의 무덤을 열게나!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Monk's Manifestation
#. NodeID = d0d2339d-5527-aea6-2566-a3133118cb98
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:d0d2339d-5527-aea6-2566-a3133118cb98
msgctxt "hcd30b402g0ed6g40d1g9f2eg5f65da6969c8"
msgid "I shall walk with thee. I shall grant you my power. He HEE."
msgstr "나는 그대와 함께 걷고, 그대에게 내 힘을 내려줄 것이니라. 히 히."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d8ba61fd-71eb-6ad5-d6ce-89097e769742
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_MonkAmulet_Event_PassedCheckTwo(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:d8ba61fd-71eb-6ad5-d6ce-89097e769742
msgctxt "hc5d63741ge072g4d70ga83fgf9736f6a5ad5"
msgid ""
"*You recognise the symbol: it belongs to those sworn to Lathander, god of "
"dawn and renewal.*"
msgstr "*당신은 이 상징을 알아봅니다. 이것은 여명과 부흥의 신, 라샌더에게 맹세한 자들의 상징입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = da1af01b-01b0-c159-ca35-a36b62d78ed4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_MonkAmulet_Event_OfferedQuest = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:da1af01b-01b0-c159-ca35-a36b62d78ed4
msgctxt "h86e90379g88beg4d44gb3a8g59209be445f4"
msgid "Return you where? To whom?"
msgstr "당신을 돌려보낸다니, 어디로? 누구에게?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Monk's Manifestation
#. NodeID = e6d1e17a-331a-bd05-979a-31f6cd63acd8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:e6d1e17a-331a-bd05-979a-31f6cd63acd8
msgctxt "hb4e211fbg37feg4770ga206g2e0bf85cd7bb"
msgid ""
"Shirra hath devoted her body and soul to Ilmater. Find her at the Open Hand "
"Temple!"
msgstr "시라는 그 육신과 영혼을 모두 일메이터에게 헌신했느니라. 열린 손의 신전에서 그녀를 찾을지니라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e8af82ae-c774-54e0-5e3d-9c486fc8518b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. TagRule: CLERIC_NEUTRAL or PALADIN_NEUTRAL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:e8af82ae-c774-54e0-5e3d-9c486fc8518b
msgctxt "h5546e281g6a4bg4540gbc89g8ac7cf9a457e"
msgid "<i>Whisper a prayer. Quell the feeling with your devotion.</i>"
msgstr "<i>기도를 읊조립니다. 당신의 헌신으로 이 감정을 억눌러봅니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Monk's Manifestation
#. NodeID = e98ce646-6ca4-c987-7190-b2513dc54e7d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:e98ce646-6ca4-c987-7190-b2513dc54e7d
msgctxt "hcd3aa341g8cafg4d9bg9e5agd4df0047d623"
msgid "Prithee, now is not the time for dreaming! Open thine eyes, fair fool!"
msgstr "부디, 지금은 꿈에 잠길 시간이 아니라네! 그대의 눈을 뜨게, 이 어리석은 이여!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Monk's Manifestation
#. NodeID = e9998388-47aa-b2a3-1995-860f0255891a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:e9998388-47aa-b2a3-1995-860f0255891a
msgctxt "h914fa88bg8177g4654g8c65g84fe5996b7bb"
msgid ""
"She waits in Wyrm's Crossing. Take me there, and thou shalt bathe in her "
"golden gifts."
msgstr "그녀는 고룡 다리에서 기다리고 있느니라. 나를 그곳으로 데려가면, 그녀가 주는 황금의 선물에 목욕하게 될 것이니라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ed2a5a0f-06e8-bf30-9ce9-30edd79badf3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:ed2a5a0f-06e8-bf30-9ce9-30edd79badf3
msgctxt "h6363ddb9g1fbcg40e4g9488gb914068fae8d"
msgid ""
"*There is no escaping the laughter. Telepathic mushrooms? <i>Walking brains? "
"</i>It's all so comical!*"
msgstr "*웃음을 멈출 수가 없습니다. 정신 감응하는 버섯? <i>걸어다니는 뇌?</i> 다 너무 웃긴 얘기입니다!*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Monk's Manifestation
#. NodeID = ee8be52a-7f06-ad99-8a1c-1bc94fe7079a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:ee8be52a-7f06-ad99-8a1c-1bc94fe7079a
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "he3b4f220g3ba1g4cc9g8ccbgd39ca1798c60"
msgid ""
"This cannot, must not, shall not be - he HEE. You must open her tomb in the "
"Open Hand Temple, posthaste. She may bless us, even beyond the veil!"
msgstr ""
"아마도, 분명, 절대로 그럴 수 없을 것이니. 히히. 그대는 가급적 신속히 열린 손의 신전에 있는 그녀의 무덤을 열어야 할지어다. 그녀가 "
"죽음의 장막 너머에서조차 우리에게 축복을 내려줄지도 모르는 것이니라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Monk's Manifestation
#. NodeID = ef98c72a-3d11-6e3a-8d9e-ed2641f19c8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_MonkAmulet_State_PlayerSpokeWithAmulet = True
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_MonkAmulet_HasMet2(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:ef98c72a-3d11-6e3a-8d9e-ed2641f19c8a
msgctxt "h4f18f88eg56d0g45aaga044gf1f99f8d40f9"
msgid "Return me, take me home - and thou shalt glow with blessings!"
msgstr "나를 집으로 되돌려보내 다오. 데려가 다오. 그리하면 그대는 축복으로 빛날 것이니라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = efbfcce7-b472-49c7-0f90-fe731b1e544a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:efbfcce7-b472-49c7-0f90-fe731b1e544a
msgctxt "hd879a113gf747g41aag809fg102588a9c19d"
msgid ""
"*Your faith and dedication surrounds you, forming an impenetrable shield.*"
msgstr "*신앙과 헌신이 당신을 감싸, 뚫을 수 없는 방패를 만듭니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Monk's Manifestation
#. NodeID = f2c4745a-d42c-af52-b7fa-3227ff410a19
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:f2c4745a-d42c-af52-b7fa-3227ff410a19
msgctxt "h1c0eedafg35acg46ddgb1ceg91aa63d96151"
msgid "You mustn't! Hee hee HEE."
msgstr "그리 하면 안 되느니라! 히 히 히."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Monk's Manifestation
#. NodeID = f2f3b268-3881-4d9c-1054-a60dd0d3e2bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_MonkAmulet_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:f2f3b268-3881-4d9c-1054-a60dd0d3e2bb
msgctxt "hede57c97g097cg4cd4g92aeg0527c130e3fd"
msgid "Ha. Thou hast come again!"
msgstr "하. 그대는 다시 와 주었구나!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = fbe99d8d-f8e3-bb64-7b05-fb249d60263d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_EquipAmulet:fbe99d8d-f8e3-bb64-7b05-fb249d60263d
msgctxt "hd7e46e91g8b41g42f9g8462g0454c66625e0"
msgid "*Your pure, raw power rips through the urge to laugh.*"
msgstr "*당신의 순수한, 날것의 힘이 웃음을 터뜨리고 싶은 충동을 찢어버립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 01fda207-56af-1ff1-86b2-2f298fa22f06
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SavingThrow
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:01fda207-56af-1ff1-86b2-2f298fa22f06
msgctxt "hde0d35b8g5fa9g4b87gb80dgd42923e49a90"
msgid "<i>Resist happiness.</i>"
msgstr "<i>유쾌함에 저항한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 06e8b064-49cb-5f6e-86bb-806f7e529fac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_MonkAmulet_State_ModerateMadness(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:06e8b064-49cb-5f6e-86bb-806f7e529fac
msgctxt "h7ed00312g968ag404bg9458g1802cd7e6cec"
msgid ""
"*Such unbearable happiness. Laughter bubbles within you, eager to escape.*"
msgstr "*정말 참을 수 없는 유쾌함입니다. 웃음이 안에서부터 거품쳐 올라오며, 빠져나오길 갈망합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Monk's Manifestation
#. NodeID = 12bbcaad-93b1-21bd-4409-914d50c4ee89
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC_SHAR or PALADIN_SHAR
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:12bbcaad-93b1-21bd-4409-914d50c4ee89
msgctxt "hddc692cfg4c43g4a50gab35g5197268a909a"
msgid "Goodness, but what hath come over thee?"
msgstr "세상에, 그대에게 무슨 일이 생긴 것인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Monk's Manifestation
#. NodeID = 12bbcaad-93b1-21bd-4409-914d50c4ee89
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:12bbcaad-93b1-21bd-4409-914d50c4ee89
msgctxt "h7ed322f5g60dcg44bag8fdegaf28342c4e25"
msgid "Mine curse hast become thine. Hehe hehee - alack!"
msgstr "나의 저주가 그대의 것이 되었구나. 히히 히히히. 안타깝구나!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 15578043-6d52-3216-546e-0b4f9182228c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:15578043-6d52-3216-546e-0b4f9182228c
msgctxt "h53b0b7c5g5292g4c77g8ff6g1b8fa3041b65"
msgid "*Your mood levels out. You have found balance.*"
msgstr "*기분이 가라앉습니다. 당신은 균형을 되찾았습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1f349919-898d-ef99-69fa-760b9f686a42
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_MonkAmulet_Event_AskedWhatsHappening(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_MonkAmulet_Event_AskedWhatsHappening(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:1f349919-898d-ef99-69fa-760b9f686a42
msgctxt "h66d3a0dbg2993g4fe4g81a4gc7411ee85dca"
msgid "What's happening? What are you doing to me?"
msgstr "무슨 일이지? 나한테 무슨 짓을 하는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 27822bde-7d69-cd90-2be2-e7cfe227a485
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_MonkAmulet_State_ModerateMadness(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:27822bde-7d69-cd90-2be2-e7cfe227a485
msgctxt "hb3f2115bg2a88g4b4egb755gda071c93096b"
msgid ""
"*A smile reaches your lips, then melts away. A full laugh could be next.*"
msgstr "*당신의 입술에 미소가 지어지더니, 이내 사라집니다. 활짝 웃는 것이 그 다음에 찾아올 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2c10742f-fcd1-861b-7f62-4598df8575ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SavingThrow
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:2c10742f-fcd1-861b-7f62-4598df8575ff
msgctxt "hd5b3c3ffg7225g45a8g859bgaa8f6fe50675"
msgid "<i>Think dark thoughts. Suppress the cheer.</i>"
msgstr "<i>어두운 생각을 한다. 환호를 억누른다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 37c43bde-92b5-7043-ce77-cd894270a21b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 4871c722-28fc-12a5-0bb6-50af6d1d9024_A = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:37c43bde-92b5-7043-ce77-cd894270a21b
msgctxt "hcd74d4d3g1291g4a3fgb699gb438db5166c5"
msgid ""
"*You suddenly feel cheerful. <i>Too</i> cheerful - as if even the grimmest "
"sight might make you laugh.*"
msgstr ""
"*갑자기 당신은 발랄한 기분이 듭니다. <i>너무</i> 발랄한 기분입니다. 아무리 음산한 광경을 보더라도 웃음이 터질 지경입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 46a581a3-b23f-7fd0-ca68-9d568aa9755e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:46a581a3-b23f-7fd0-ca68-9d568aa9755e
msgctxt "h7ca7a535g4deag4ec9ga3fdg6f49a1f78c24"
msgid "*The moment is over. The awful, horrible joy has passed.*"
msgstr "*그 순간은 끝났습니다. 끔찍하고 불쾌한 기쁨은 지나갔습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5499cc06-172f-36b7-c856-493895b71dd1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:5499cc06-172f-36b7-c856-493895b71dd1
msgctxt "h07a10f4agceb5g49c2gafe6gecf4b487fa2b"
msgid "<i>Give in to your joy.</i>"
msgstr "<i>기쁨에 굴복한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Monk's Manifestation
#. NodeID = 54ac97db-ba13-a060-fbdf-ac75c2fe2ad4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: PALADIN_SHAR or SHARK
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:54ac97db-ba13-a060-fbdf-ac75c2fe2ad4
msgctxt "he3f7b6e6gf3f7g45abgb78eg521b3e4aee68"
msgid "Thou think this is mine doing? Ha ha ha! Why, perish the thought!"
msgstr "그대는 내가 이 짓을 한다고 생각하는 것인가? 하 하 하! 내가 왜, 말도 안 되는 것이다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Monk's Manifestation
#. NodeID = 54ac97db-ba13-a060-fbdf-ac75c2fe2ad4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:54ac97db-ba13-a060-fbdf-ac75c2fe2ad4
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h068b1592gdb7bg46c8gb684gd90274639358"
msgid ""
"Ha ha! This is the madness the Sharrans wrought. Whilst thou wearest me, so "
"sharest thou my curse."
msgstr "하하! 이것은 샤 신도들이 내게 일으킨 광기이니라. 그대가 나를 착용하면, 나의 저주 또한 공유하는 것이니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5681f9e2-7228-b96d-7070-5188bff2855b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_MonkAmulet_State_ModerateMadness(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 4871c722-28fc-12a5-0bb6-50af6d1d9024_C = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:5681f9e2-7228-b96d-7070-5188bff2855b
msgctxt "hda2074bfg6754g4186g940dg2c8b18069a6c"
msgid "*You are overcome by irrational cheer, bordering on madness.*"
msgstr "*당신은 이 광기에 가까운, 비이성적인 환호에 압도됩니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5b9e0180-3a6c-3e25-1805-189cd623baa0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SavingThrow
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:5b9e0180-3a6c-3e25-1805-189cd623baa0
msgctxt "hdaf97d41g3d6fg4f7cgbc66gefbbfb9f1e8c"
msgid "<i>Resist happiness.</i>"
msgstr "<i>유쾌함에 저항한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 620cdeba-afa7-e8f9-439f-b7034c243684
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_MonkAmulet_State_MajorMadness(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:620cdeba-afa7-e8f9-439f-b7034c243684
msgctxt "h1dbcb93dg2908g4b0dg965agf4de86cd0335"
msgid ""
"*You are rotted with joy; you are sick with pleasure. This is not happiness -"
" it's an illusion.*"
msgstr "*당신은 기쁨으로 썩어 문드러집니다. 기뻐서 병이 날 지경입니다. 이건 행복이 아니고, 환상일 뿐이지요.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 82439674-33ed-cef9-38d7-4a629aed65db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SavingThrow
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:82439674-33ed-cef9-38d7-4a629aed65db
msgctxt "hd90475dagbb56g4026g9ebdg16d3ecbde8a5"
msgid "<i>Contain your joy.</i>"
msgstr "<i>기쁨을 억누른다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 83cd8936-e490-2912-1963-b1e62de04f32
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:83cd8936-e490-2912-1963-b1e62de04f32
msgctxt "hcb165d22g6f2dg409cgad24g6be8639f6cf5"
msgid "*The maddening cheer withers away, leaving you breathless.*"
msgstr "*미칠 것 같은 환호가 시들어가며 사라지고, 당신은 숨이 턱 막힙니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 8a81451a-d051-881f-f517-f775994b0eab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_MonkAmulet_State_ModerateMadness(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:8a81451a-d051-881f-f517-f775994b0eab
msgctxt "hdf00d80cg7cf2g41d7ga387gcbd27f9ceabb"
msgid ""
"*You are taken by an unnatural, unbidden bliss. You could fall down laughing "
"at any moment.*"
msgstr "*당신은 부자연스러운, 예상 밖의 행복에 사로잡힙니다. 당장이라도 쓰러져 웃음보가 터질 것만 같습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 8d5c2ad6-8dcb-4206-8e8f-8c817c2cb761
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:8d5c2ad6-8dcb-4206-8e8f-8c817c2cb761
msgctxt "h68baa1dcg62bfg4f64ga98fga568c7bc543f"
msgid "*The joy fades as quickly as it came.*"
msgstr "*기쁨은 찾아온 것만큼이나 빠르게 사라집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Monk's Manifestation
#. NodeID = 906d1f2b-c125-6f45-f41f-8e64b233ab4c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC_SHAR or PALADIN_SHAR
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:906d1f2b-c125-6f45-f41f-8e64b233ab4c
msgctxt "h0b87efc0gf007g40b3g8ffdga96c1847c2d7"
msgid "Thou dost look quite jolly. What might this mean? Ho ho hee!"
msgstr "그대는 꽤나 쾌활해 보이는구나. 이게 무슨 뜻일 것 같은가? 호 호 히!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Monk's Manifestation
#. NodeID = 906d1f2b-c125-6f45-f41f-8e64b233ab4c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:906d1f2b-c125-6f45-f41f-8e64b233ab4c
msgctxt "h29545dfbg50a6g4f9ag9237g611060e32a5f"
msgid "The agony of ecstasy - ha ha HEE! Why must pleasure bring such pain?"
msgstr "황홀경의 고통이란다. 하 하 히! 왜 쾌락은 그런 고통을 수반해야만 하는가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Monk's Manifestation
#. NodeID = 9bbc333d-aa79-b410-5337-af9193426b17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC_SHAR or PALADIN_SHAR
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:9bbc333d-aa79-b410-5337-af9193426b17
msgctxt "hde481e1eg4bc7g4015g95fag4daf885b65bf"
msgid "Again? Hehee. Thou art delirious!"
msgstr "또냐? 히히. 그대는 좋아 어쩔 줄 모르는구나!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Monk's Manifestation
#. NodeID = 9bbc333d-aa79-b410-5337-af9193426b17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:9bbc333d-aa79-b410-5337-af9193426b17
msgctxt "h83b5cdd0g9845g4e7eg9d78g757d55ae36ad"
msgid "The madness worsens. Thou must resist. Ha ha HO!"
msgstr "광기가 심해질 것이야. 그대는 저항해야만 한다. 하 하 호!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9c1c2e32-930c-d27c-9659-a123c11c5c41
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:9c1c2e32-930c-d27c-9659-a123c11c5c41
msgctxt "ha7887d85gebd2g40a5g8ca7g250fbd9f87e5"
msgid "<i>Invite the glee into you.</i>"
msgstr "<i>이 환희를 받아들인다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a824f0d0-5364-e535-9fa5-2cb521b479a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:a824f0d0-5364-e535-9fa5-2cb521b479a8
msgctxt "hafeba838gea79g4844g8cccg8378898f0cc5"
msgid "<i>Accept happiness.</i>"
msgstr "<i>유쾌함을 받아들인다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = aad8a65f-c87b-6512-7e45-5b7780adcdc8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 4871c722-28fc-12a5-0bb6-50af6d1d9024_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 4871c722-28fc-12a5-0bb6-50af6d1d9024_B = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:aad8a65f-c87b-6512-7e45-5b7780adcdc8
msgctxt "h1f7451cdgc90cg482cga808ga00418267fbe"
msgid ""
"*A giggle almost erupts from your throat. This moment strikes you as "
"<i>terribly</i> funny.*"
msgstr "*당신의 목구멍에서 킥킥거리는 소리가 터져나올 뻔합니다. 이 순간은 정말 <i>끔찍하리만큼</i> 재미있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Monk's Manifestation
#. NodeID = af13fc28-6a64-67c5-0787-e9ca504d0b0f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC_SHAR or PALADIN_SHAR
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:af13fc28-6a64-67c5-0787-e9ca504d0b0f
msgctxt "h7ce3362bg15c2g4e0cgb252gafc0fb83185c"
msgid "Hehee - methinks thou looks quite mirthful. Is all well with thee?"
msgstr "히히. 내 생각에 그대는 정말 명랑해 보이는구나. 괜찮은 것이냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Monk's Manifestation
#. NodeID = af13fc28-6a64-67c5-0787-e9ca504d0b0f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:af13fc28-6a64-67c5-0787-e9ca504d0b0f
msgctxt "h28e9e96eg24a3g43d4ga6fbg976111750092"
msgid "Hehee - not all is well with thee. Such is the price of mine favours!"
msgstr "히히. 그대는 괜찮지 않구나. 내 호의의 대가가 그것이란다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Monk's Manifestation
#. NodeID = c5ff0acf-99a9-a654-4716-a04c97e2a45d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC_SHAR or PALADIN_SHAR
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:c5ff0acf-99a9-a654-4716-a04c97e2a45d
msgctxt "h94384e04gff3bg4b9egb1cdg949bed1cfbc2"
msgid "Again? Hehee. Thou art delirious!"
msgstr "또냐? 히히. 그대는 좋아 어쩔 줄 모르는구나!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Monk's Manifestation
#. NodeID = c5ff0acf-99a9-a654-4716-a04c97e2a45d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:c5ff0acf-99a9-a654-4716-a04c97e2a45d
msgctxt "haa0c7923g79edg489eg9bd7ga2803ec62a52"
msgid "The madness worsens. Thou must resist. Ha ha HO!"
msgstr "광기가 심해질 것이야. 그대는 저항해야만 한다. 하 하 호!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d229862e-80c1-9008-9a1c-12c2d458569b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SavingThrow
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:d229862e-80c1-9008-9a1c-12c2d458569b
msgctxt "h4138b981g7953g4224gbee5g870707c5d3c7"
msgid "<i>Stifle the strange sense of glee.</i>"
msgstr "<i>이 이상한 환희를 억누른다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eb4ccc21-2522-faba-e8d0-979028da25ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:eb4ccc21-2522-faba-e8d0-979028da25ed
msgctxt "h6e289da1g515eg4c5aga2d8g9679dcaef9b9"
msgid "<i>Accept happiness.</i>"
msgstr "<i>유쾌함을 받아들인다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ee753132-ebac-95dc-10a6-ba1d442031cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 4871c722-28fc-12a5-0bb6-50af6d1d9024_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 4871c722-28fc-12a5-0bb6-50af6d1d9024_A = False
#.     - 4871c722-28fc-12a5-0bb6-50af6d1d9024_B = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:ee753132-ebac-95dc-10a6-ba1d442031cd
msgctxt "ha9e8f151g2663g42dbgb973ga4b96608521d"
msgid "*Your spirits are sky-high, and your steps unreasonably light.*"
msgstr "*당신의 기분은 하늘을 찌를 듯하고, 발걸음은 지나칠 정도로 가볍습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = eea680e4-af35-072b-5698-6e1a227bba2d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:eea680e4-af35-072b-5698-6e1a227bba2d
msgctxt "h840e1d7bg0b07g4889g9a1egd3790b0fc22c"
msgid "*The maddening cheer withers away, leaving you breathless.*"
msgstr "*미칠 것 같은 환호가 시들어가며 사라지고, 당신은 숨이 턱 막힙니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f0a66a84-3a24-5dfc-4b0d-d4822c4bd4d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_MonkAmulet_State_MajorMadness(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:f0a66a84-3a24-5dfc-4b0d-d4822c4bd4d9
msgctxt "h4570e0bcg55e5g4d4agb5e7g803ba38a7ee4"
msgid ""
"*You are rotted with joy, sick with pleasure. This isn't true happiness - "
"it's an illusion.*"
msgstr "*당신은 기쁨으로 썩어 문드러집니다. 기뻐서 병이 날 지경입니다. 이건 행복이 아니고, 환상일 뿐이지요.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f34aada6-f7ca-8337-6c98-8a9c13024539
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:f34aada6-f7ca-8337-6c98-8a9c13024539
msgctxt "ha9548e49g5696g4af9gb934g1eebfbec112c"
msgid "<i>Let the cheer flow through you.</i>"
msgstr "<i>환호가 당신을 타고 흐르게 둔다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = fe72b89b-796f-c176-32c3-c28df4c28159
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 4871c722-28fc-12a5-0bb6-50af6d1d9024_C = True
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_MonkAmulet_State_ModerateMadness(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MonkAmulet_ResistMadness:fe72b89b-796f-c176-32c3-c28df4c28159
msgctxt "h1df298dfg7138g4cc9g99f7g2d1f36ac33a9"
msgid ""
"*You feel a joy so sudden, so intense, that you nearly collapse from the "
"force of it.*"
msgstr "*당신은 갑작스러운 기쁨을 느낍니다. 너무 강렬해서, 거의 쓰러질 정도입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MushroomHunter
#. Speaker = Baelen Bonecloak
#. NodeID = 034cf784-f132-0af1-abde-70877465bd88
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MushroomHunter:034cf784-f132-0af1-abde-70877465bd88
msgctxt "h6132447age68cg4e9aga01fg491c72ad53ec"
msgid "Changed your <i>what</i>...? No! Please!"
msgstr "<i>뭘</i> 바꿨다고...? 안 돼! 제발!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MushroomHunter
#. Speaker = Baelen Bonecloak
#. NodeID = 0656d5af-080d-0508-8189-75b3d2fe8e60
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_MushroomHunter_Saved_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_MushroomHunter_State_DerrythDead = True
#.      - UND_MushroomHunter_State_InVillage = True
#.      - UND_MushroomHunter_State_Saved = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_MushroomHunter_Saved_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MushroomHunter:0656d5af-080d-0508-8189-75b3d2fe8e60
msgctxt "h39e0048dg4566g45dcg937fg85fb39d485f8"
msgid "Derryth..."
msgstr "데리스..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MushroomHunter
#. Speaker = Baelen Bonecloak
#. NodeID = 06bd0a3b-124f-129f-8864-4164cbb2f7f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MushroomHunter:06bd0a3b-124f-129f-8864-4164cbb2f7f7
msgctxt "hbeb2f2a5gaf4cg48a9g8167g964f8ec5e868"
msgid "<i>No...</i>"
msgstr "<i>안 돼...</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MushroomHunter
#. Speaker = Baelen Bonecloak
#. NodeID = 0d9de6e8-755e-d217-b50a-9a1fa00eeecc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MushroomHunter:0d9de6e8-755e-d217-b50a-9a1fa00eeecc
msgctxt "hd3dc3bf6gc540g4ec7g814ag05dd6d452eea"
msgid "Wait! Please, hear me out!"
msgstr "잠깐! 제발, 내 말 좀 들어봐!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MushroomHunter
#. Speaker = Baelen Bonecloak
#. NodeID = 0f1ab0e2-144d-2bbb-267b-5864c8819f0b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MushroomHunter:0f1ab0e2-144d-2bbb-267b-5864c8819f0b
msgctxt "h2bfbcf6cg1047g46f8gbaf2g6fe545037eaa"
msgid "Ta!"
msgstr "고마워!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MushroomHunter
#. Speaker = Baelen Bonecloak
#. NodeID = 12b00766-62ad-0691-e46a-7781ba6fb6df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MushroomHunter:12b00766-62ad-0691-e46a-7781ba6fb6df
msgctxt "hc1c212eeg1113g4886ga5ccg67a1c33d3468"
msgid "Not got it yet! Got stuck here instead!"
msgstr "아직은 없어! 대신 여기 갇혔지!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MushroomHunter
#. Speaker = Baelen Bonecloak
#. NodeID = 12b1692d-6d8a-b462-81a5-528a664aeff7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_MushroomHunter_HasMet(1) = True
#.      - UND_MushroomHunter_AgreedToHelp(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_MushroomHunter_State_Saved = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MushroomHunter:12b1692d-6d8a-b462-81a5-528a664aeff7
msgctxt "h66de2fd4gc52fg407bg9a5egd48c70832a3b"
msgid "My pack! Please!"
msgstr "내 배낭! 제발!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MushroomHunter
#. Speaker = Baelen Bonecloak
#. NodeID = 15effd9d-ad12-46d3-e09a-d58c63f42594
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MushroomHunter:15effd9d-ad12-46d3-e09a-d58c63f42594
msgctxt "h21c80c93g9f30g44d7gbe4ag5b66a93a576e"
msgid "Should've waited for Derryth."
msgstr "데리스를 기다렸어야 했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MushroomHunter
#. Speaker = Baelen Bonecloak
#. NodeID = 1e309911-04cc-f044-34c4-c7eb1264433b
