msgctxt "h11165dd3gaccag422fg8a44g9ff6f363d865"
msgid "Never made a habit of that before. Don't see why you'd start now."
msgstr "예전엔 저런 습관이 없었는데. 왜 지금 생겨났는지 모르겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MushroomHunter_ThreewayDialogAfterBaelenAteMushroom
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 56a1c504-3fe7-8189-e63e-2272f9b682bd
