msgctxt "h7eee21a9gdd35g441ag803agc299bb2dc4f8"
msgid "Lookit, Derryth!"
msgstr "이봐, 데리스!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MushroomHunter_ThreewayDialogAfterBaelenAteMushroom
#. Speaker = Baelen Bonecloak
#. NodeID = 8d6a689c-dd48-6864-eae6-2ec1e6bee183
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MushroomHunter_ThreewayDialogAfterBaelenAteMushroom:8d6a689c-dd48-6864-eae6-2ec1e6bee183
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h09365ad3ge0e7g4090g8f97g09ec0c87e9fb"
msgid ""
"If you hadn't given me that 'shroom, I'd be her doddering old servant 'til "
"my dying day."
msgstr "당신이 그 줄기를 내게 넘기지 않았다면, 난 죽을 때까지 그녀의 시중을 들고 있었겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MushroomHunter_ThreewayDialogAfterBaelenAteMushroom
#. Speaker = Derryth Bonecloak
#. NodeID = bf4ef8de-41a7-b17b-e5b0-dfce135dc6f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MushroomHunter_ThreewayDialogAfterBaelenAteMushroom:bf4ef8de-41a7-b17b-e5b0-dfce135dc6f2
msgctxt "ha2b35f51g13f0g4568gbd6fga20cabd21329"
msgid "Baelen... it's been a good few years. I need a chance to think."
msgstr "베일렌... 오랜 시간이 흘렀어. 좀 생각해봐야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MushroomHunter_ThreewayDialogAfterBaelenAteMushroom
#. Speaker = Derryth Bonecloak
#. NodeID = c4d0d6cc-7797-d0de-54a2-72317f5ae7c6
