msgid "I'm not travelling with some overgrown mushroom."
msgstr "웬 과잉 성장한 버섯을 옆에 끼고 다니긴 싫은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign
