msgctxt "he3e35d7bg8615g4034g9924ge1e038ca45c5"
msgid ""
"((*a Sovereign's fate is to reign. when the day comes, you will "
"<b>grovel</b>*))"
msgstr "((*군주의 운명은 다스리는 것이다. 그 날이 오면, 너는 <b>굽실거릴</b> 것이다*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 1eef7813-24a1-e618-af3d-97622ab22cf1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign:1eef7813-24a1-e618-af3d-97622ab22cf1
msgctxt "ha1456539g0a93g40b5g80a3g121ffdf33d28"
msgid "*Its delicate harmonies turn to scrapes and scratches.*"
msgstr "*그의 섬세한 화음이 긁고 할퀴는 소리로 바뀝니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign
#. Speaker = Sovereign Glut
#. NodeID = 1f94c470-688c-c4f9-e89c-a334e39c8bc2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign:1f94c470-688c-c4f9-e89c-a334e39c8bc2
msgctxt "h2d1c9bf3g8cd3g4940gbf00ge623dbd1b04a"
msgid ""
"((*you have my favour, King-Bringer. but yes - there will be riches as "
"well*))"
msgstr "((*넌 내 호의를 얻었다, 왕위 인도자여. 또한 부도 뒤따를 것이다*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 217cdbed-a852-1167-c96f-9f0a5a3f36ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LOLTHDROWELF(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign:217cdbed-a852-1167-c96f-9f0a5a3f36ef
msgctxt "hadaf666eg2a9fg4828g9f2dg646ff7331e27"
msgid ""
"<i>Envision vast Menzoberranzan, the city awash in Narbondel's heat-glow.</i>"
msgstr "<i>나르본델의 열기로 빛나는, 광대한 멘조베란잔을 떠올려본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 23003450-b021-9cb7-3c6d-8a3aa68617cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign:23003450-b021-9cb7-3c6d-8a3aa68617cb
msgctxt "h935d6983g0f2bg4bccgb1f7g2b0cddc95d15"
msgid ""
"*It reveals its own home in reply: a humid cove filled with decaying myconid "
"corpses.*"
msgstr "*그는 대답으로 자신의 고향을 보여 줍니다. 축축한 만을 따라 썩어 가는 마이코니드 시체가 널브러져 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 23481025-0e91-cd88-86b5-402881e482aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign_State_SawDuergar = True
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign_State_LoneDuergar_IsDead = False
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign_State_AcceptedHelp = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DUERGARDWARF(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign:23481025-0e91-cd88-86b5-402881e482aa
msgctxt "hb924bf25gd36cg45d9gba07g1547419243ee"
msgid "*You consider your kin, defeated at your hand.*"
msgstr "*당신은 당신의 손으로 죽인 혈연을 떠올립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 2a29e332-9b81-d655-0527-cc18c80b401e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign:2a29e332-9b81-d655-0527-cc18c80b401e
msgctxt "h8030149eg0a0fg4ca0gbbdcg742ad7d6a03b"
msgid "*It shivers in response to the deathly tomb.*"
msgstr "*그것은 죽음의 무덤에 반응하여 떨고 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2ba2db8b-b524-7ac3-7515-f166297c8072
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign:2ba2db8b-b524-7ac3-7515-f166297c8072
msgctxt "h074fa6c0g2a4fg44d5gb716gddbfa79bd9cc"
msgid "<i>Turn your mind to the damp floor of your master's crypt.</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신 주인의 지하실, 축축한 바닥을 떠올려본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2de8d031-7f75-400b-33bc-05e5ebd038c1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_UNDERDARK(1) = False
#.      - RANGER(1) = True
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign:2de8d031-7f75-400b-33bc-05e5ebd038c1
msgctxt "h9c735563gd44dg4e68g9dc0g3cedf5530a5f"
msgid ""
"I live at the edges. Wherever there's solitude, there's danger - but peace, "
"too."
msgstr "난 아슬아슬한 삶이 좋아. 고독이 있는 곳이라면, 언제나 위험이 있지 - 하지만 평화 또한 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign
#. Speaker = Sovereign Glut
#. NodeID = 2f5d0a71-1d0a-131b-ca41-cc4e06a5334f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign_State_SawDuergar = True
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign_State_LoneDuergar_IsDead = True
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign_State_AcceptedHelp = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign:2f5d0a71-1d0a-131b-ca41-cc4e06a5334f
msgctxt "h854ccd74gf0b0g4681gab7fg5839ff1e2640"
msgid "((*the tumour is excised. <b>the duergar are dead</b>*))"
msgstr "((*종양이 제거되었다. <b>듀에르가가 죽었다</b>*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign
#. Speaker = Sovereign Glut
#. NodeID = 333c6d02-bd91-4a61-23fa-d8e8fb3a7b09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign:333c6d02-bd91-4a61-23fa-d8e8fb3a7b09
msgctxt "h6c380c45g6414g4de3ga7f4g279cb44a7d73"
msgid "((*it is my right. <b>it is my right!</b>*))"
msgstr "((*그게 내 권리다. <b>내 권리란 말이다!</b>*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign
#. Speaker = Sovereign Glut
#. NodeID = 343c81e3-b5e5-a950-c398-5f0133756ebf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign:343c81e3-b5e5-a950-c398-5f0133756ebf
msgctxt "h9cb4ff10g91f5g43d6ga4begbc0e13d7d9e6"
msgid "((*...so long as you remember that it is the song of <b>Glut</b>*))"
msgstr "((*... <b>글럿</b>의 이 노래를 네가 기억하는 한*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 34d79d06-2d82-b69e-5ba7-34ded60f532d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign:34d79d06-2d82-b69e-5ba7-34ded60f532d
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hdc152168gcf99g4877g9603gd637c026f703"
msgid "<i>Think of the cloister. Your sisters. The teachings. The pain.</i>"
msgstr "<i>수도원을 생각한다. 자매들. 가르침. 고통.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3ed99149-f9fb-65b2-730a-08c129adef0e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign_State_InParty = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign_State_InParty = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign:3ed99149-f9fb-65b2-730a-08c129adef0e
msgctxt "habd54ca9gc14eg4ed8g9bccg06521b6e52c5"
msgid "<i>Invite Glut to your party.</i>"
msgstr "<i>글럿을 일행에 초대한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3fe2a414-b651-a7c8-8492-8436d3a485a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_Sovereign_State_PermaDefeated = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign_Quest_AcceptedCircleWipe = True
#.     - UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign_State_InParty = False
#.   Quest:
#.     - UND_BroodingSovereign.UND_BroodingSovereign_TalkToGlutAtCircle(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign:3fe2a414-b651-a7c8-8492-8436d3a485a9
msgctxt "h44c32757g4d05g4b01g9214gaf1e4eedb58e"
msgid "Spaw is already dead - the circle is no more."
msgstr "스포는 벌써 죽었어. 공동체는 이제 없고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign
#. Speaker = Sovereign Glut
#. NodeID = 435fca21-5b52-8d74-e739-203cfa8b1c75
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DUERGARDWARF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign:435fca21-5b52-8d74-e739-203cfa8b1c75
msgctxt "he6d383c7gab2fg4a6aga9bdgee2fe3adbb6e"
msgid ""
"((*kin-killer - the Grotto may sustain but <b>one Sovereign</b>. in the "
"<b>Age of Glut</b>...*))"
msgstr "((*동족 학살자여, 이 동굴에는 <b>하나의 군주</b>만 남을 것이다. <b>글럿의 시대</b>에...*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign
#. Speaker = Sovereign Glut
#. NodeID = 435fca21-5b52-8d74-e739-203cfa8b1c75
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign:435fca21-5b52-8d74-e739-203cfa8b1c75
msgctxt "hf4371384g8173g417fg8ae4g70cb48857d28"
msgid ""
"((*death-doer - the Grotto may sustain but <b>one Sovereign</b>. in the "
"<b>Age of Glut</b>...*))"
msgstr "((*죽음을 행하는 자여, 이 동굴에는 <b>하나의 군주</b>만 남을 것이다. <b>글럿의 시대</b>에...*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign
#. Speaker = Sovereign Glut
#. NodeID = 44ad11b5-812f-5453-fcf2-1adf43d423ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign:44ad11b5-812f-5453-fcf2-1adf43d423ce
msgctxt "hd5dfdd6eg861cg4465gbdd6g5b4bca515b92"
msgid "((*a tune of division, yours to sing - three scrolls in all*))"
msgstr "((*네가 노래할 수 있는 분열의 곡 - 총 3개의 두루마리*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign
#. Speaker = Sovereign Glut
#. NodeID = 464618b2-fcac-e2d6-7856-92644c55069d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign:464618b2-fcac-e2d6-7856-92644c55069d
msgctxt "h04194e6dg228fg4fabgbed1g38c60936b6c4"
msgid "((*reach into memory. tell me of home*))"
msgstr "((*기억을 더듬어봐라. 너의 고향에 대해 말해다오*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 46b2c2d7-6284-d1dd-4ad3-63c20b67aebf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign_State_InParty = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign:46b2c2d7-6284-d1dd-4ad3-63c20b67aebf
msgctxt "hd7dd4238ge012g45f9gab6bg06bffeef9938"
msgid "If you're so eager for blood, Glut, then let me give it to you."
msgstr "글럿, 피를 그렇게 원한다면, 네 피를 보게 해주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 48aecda0-c906-13ba-32cc-76b90c79539b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_Quest_LoneDuergar_Defeated = True
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign_State_LoneDuergar_IsDead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign:48aecda0-c906-13ba-32cc-76b90c79539b
msgctxt "hb247095egd63cg43d8gb8d5g00caf42f304f"
msgid "It's already done - the duergar are dead."
msgstr "이미 끝났어 - 그 듀에르가는 죽었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign
#. Speaker = Sovereign Glut
#. NodeID = 4986f907-bca8-0728-b0d4-6020a2f34758
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign_State_SawDuergar = False
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign_State_AcceptedHelp = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign:4986f907-bca8-0728-b0d4-6020a2f34758
msgctxt "h4249062fgfaafg4a5dg91d0g6402336bc2bb"
msgid "((*it is time. we take death to the duergar*))"
msgstr "((*때가 왔다. 우리는 듀에르가에게 죽음을 안겨줄 것이다*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign
#. Speaker = Sovereign Glut
#. NodeID = 4ac5a8f7-9080-c75c-a46c-76ce6fe090e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign:4ac5a8f7-9080-c75c-a46c-76ce6fe090e6
msgctxt "ha1b920b4g89b6g4491ga76ag4cf8edbb2b4b"
msgid ""
"((*<b><i>Nere.</i></b> this is the one who brought the duergar blight. bring "
"me his head, so that I know my new Circle is safe*))"
msgstr "((*<b><i>니어.</i></b> 이 자가 듀에르가를 병들게 하였다. 그 머리를 가져와 내 새로운 공동체를 안전케 하라*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign
#. Speaker = Sovereign Glut
#. NodeID = 4ef6bf6b-9a12-a966-e8fc-93f3d98e709e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign:4ef6bf6b-9a12-a966-e8fc-93f3d98e709e
msgctxt "he9c9ba11g50cag43d4g8a39gb0c4cd48d178"
msgid ""
"((*I must see for myself. lead me to the Rot. I wish to see it "
"<b>fester</b>*))"
msgstr "((*내 눈으로 직접 봐야겠다. 나를 썩은 것에게 인도해 줘라. 그것이 <b>부패</b>하는 것을 보고 싶다*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5445467d-418c-9ee7-1c4d-7ba8eaf91311
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign:5445467d-418c-9ee7-1c4d-7ba8eaf91311
msgctxt "h18aab4c7gb740g456bg8c3cg669addabf2ed"
msgid "<i>Fill your heart with memories of your most treasured places.</i>"
msgstr "<i>가장 소중한 장소의 추억으로 마음을 채운다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 555ab679-b14e-e077-1262-86caf568ad03
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_DWARF and !REALLY_DUERGARDWARF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign:555ab679-b14e-e077-1262-86caf568ad03
msgctxt "h4f427af1g77a5g42abg8d33g8aaa4ffac912"
msgid "Join me. An enemy of the duergar is a friend to me."
msgstr "나에게 합류해라. 듀에르가의 적은 내 친구다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 555ab679-b14e-e077-1262-86caf568ad03
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign:555ab679-b14e-e077-1262-86caf568ad03
msgctxt "h7db37577g44f1g4543ga7bfg8b061c0e83b6"
msgid "Very well - you may join me."
msgstr "좋아, 함께 다니도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign
#. Speaker = Sovereign Glut
#. NodeID = 5564c052-a2a5-9921-e7c7-54bb61e0e04e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign:5564c052-a2a5-9921-e7c7-54bb61e0e04e
msgctxt "ha621f7d5g8aebg4776gac2bgfc229d6c3ed2"
msgid ""
"((*...or protect the precious poltroon as it waits for the <b>Circle of "
"Glut</b> to devour it whole*))"
msgstr "((*...<b>글럿의 공동체</b>가 전부 삼킬 때, 그 소중한 겁쟁이를 보호해 보든지*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 564cfbce-07a1-3d1a-4032-38dd4b9ace6c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_Quest_LoneDuergar_Defeated = True
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign_State_LoneDuergar_IsDead = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign:564cfbce-07a1-3d1a-4032-38dd4b9ace6c
msgctxt "hde83c47agcf68g410dg89d4gd50f9fa61c19"
msgid "It's already done - the duergar dealt with."
msgstr "이미 끝난 일이야 - 듀에르가들을 처리했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_BroodingSovereign
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5ac4a279-87b4-af0a-0122-1127d3a544f8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_Quest_LoneDuergar_Defeated = False
#.   Local:
#.      - b8c4620d-f1a4-a9a7-27ae-fc5df8100d88_AcknowledgedDanger = False
#. SetFlags:
