msgctxt "h6459ec89g8831g485dga716g0497f8f424ad"
msgid "I have no 'purpose'. I simply <i>am</i>. That is enough."
msgstr "난 '목적'따윈 없어. 이게 단순히 <i>나란 존재</i>일 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_CheckpointGuard_000
