#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h39325507g0718g438dg8845g7c91ae6d5eae"
msgid ""
"You come across a noblestalk mushroom about, you give it here. Gods know "
"I've earned it."
msgstr "귀족줄기 버섯을 발견하면 여기로 가져다줘. 신들도 내가 받을 자격이 있다는 걸 아실 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_DwarvenAlchemist
#. Speaker = Derryth Bonecloak
#. NodeID = 5ac15657-48c7-d54e-94bd-66b9ccdf140a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_DwarvenAlchemist:5ac15657-48c7-d54e-94bd-66b9ccdf140a
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hb4d3348ag3130g47afg99eagfce50a5f0539"
msgid ""
"If I can put noblestalk on the shelves, it might allow us to hang on a "
"little longer."
msgstr "내가 귀족줄기를 선반에 내놓으면, 우린 조금 더 버틸 수 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_DwarvenAlchemist
#. Speaker = Player
