msgctxt "h1b4a6e58g7cacg478agb947g2c0a9d770532"
msgid "<i>Take the boots.</i>"
msgstr "<i>부츠를 가져간다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a34e8d21-4694-d8a5-5dfd-ed9729e41eff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 5e9c4c72-4f56-2646-ce36-88207d2dc33c_AgreedHelpWithPoison = False
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_Knows_DuergarPoisoned(1) = True
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_Knows_PoisonLore(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:a34e8d21-4694-d8a5-5dfd-ed9729e41eff
msgctxt "h8c8d374dgfeddg4f50g9780g8b4ced1fe285"
msgid "If the duergar poisoned you, perhaps they have the cure."
msgstr "듀에르가가 널 중독시켰다면, 치료제도 그들에게 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Thulla
#. NodeID = a3c179d5-7cc4-106a-40a4-af9bcd7ddbc9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:a3c179d5-7cc4-106a-40a4-af9bcd7ddbc9
msgctxt "ha42e4019g2603g4033g8295gc217398798e4"
msgid ""
"... fine. It's complicated, but my clan has trouble back in the city. A "
"blood-feud."
msgstr "... 알았어. 복잡하긴 하지만, 도시에서 내 클랜에 큰 문제가 생겼어. 내분이었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a4abb8ab-29c2-579f-da28-05acbdae3338
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_State_LeaderFreedGnomes = False
#.      - UND_GnomeWorkers_State_PermaDefeated = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:a4abb8ab-29c2-579f-da28-05acbdae3338
msgctxt "h8512ea5dg4b03g44cfg95fbgaaf5c28468a7"
msgid "Remind me - what do I need to do?"
msgstr "뭘 해야 되는지 다시 한 번 알려줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a518c648-dfca-55ac-e9af-089526b167ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_UNDERDARK and !(REALLY_DUERGARDWARF and REALLY_LOLTHDROWELF)
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:a518c648-dfca-55ac-e9af-089526b167ed
msgctxt "h2aece891gc151g48dfg8e12g28cf180a2d8d"
msgid "No harm in a helping hand between Underdark folk."
msgstr "언더다크 사람끼리 도와줘서 나쁠 건 없잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = a5f0ca16-0266-4b6c-8c12-f0ef49dfedcb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Shadowheart_State_IncurableWound_Unavailable = False
#.      - GLO_Not_For_EA = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:a5f0ca16-0266-4b6c-8c12-f0ef49dfedcb
msgctxt "h980a4df2g0ef2g450egb11aga289a88df7c4"
msgid "<i>Ngh</i>... it hurts..."
msgstr "<i>으</i>...아파..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a768e997-1dd8-be4c-a270-d1e4d3fb0652
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:a768e997-1dd8-be4c-a270-d1e4d3fb0652
msgctxt "ha60bb883gb2efg4c1cgbb1dge1079a409a12"
msgid "*You find nothing of great interest.*"
msgstr "*흥미로운 것은 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Thulla
#. NodeID = aa156e34-7134-e664-a194-35a64c39b3c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:aa156e34-7134-e664-a194-35a64c39b3c9
msgctxt "h4c14543dgc035g4204g8135gb13666c2befd"
msgid ""
"You're faking at being a duergar? In the Underdark? I'm not sure if that's "
"genius or suicide."
msgstr "듀에르가인 척을 하고 있단 말이야? 언더다크에서? 천재적인 건지 자살 행위인지 모르겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ac806dd2-eabe-fdf2-509b-051311c66ed9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_State_LeaderFreedGnomes = False
#.      - UND_GnomeWorkers_State_PermaDefeated = False
#.   Quest:
#.      - UND_GnomeRescue.DealtWithSlavers(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:ac806dd2-eabe-fdf2-509b-051311c66ed9
msgctxt "h22fee558g8866g4d2bgabd0g23a2682d883a"
msgid ""
"I'll send them your way. I already killed the duergar holding them captive."
msgstr "네 쪽으로 보낼게. 이미 노예상 듀에르가들을 죽였거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Thulla
#. NodeID = afec84c9-4f1e-8353-8109-227285ebe1b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:afec84c9-4f1e-8353-8109-227285ebe1b3
msgctxt "hcab75921ga1f3g4455gacc7g3fdcde3723d2"
msgid "Unless... you've changed your mind?"
msgstr "혹은... 마음이 바뀌었다거나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = b16d7de0-a3ad-44b5-aa9c-b1a32b016c2f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(7) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:b16d7de0-a3ad-44b5-aa9c-b1a32b016c2f
msgctxt "hfed3b8c9g13f2g43daga463gb0d0a236207f"
msgid ""
"Charitable bunch, these myconids. At least more so than Kagha and her pet "
"snake."
msgstr "이 마이코니드들은 너그럽네. 적어도 카그하나 그녀의 애완 뱀에 비하면 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Thulla
#. NodeID = b25a1bd1-c13c-ffc7-b9fa-6a71747495ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_Event_StoleBoots(1) = True
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_State_Healed = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:b25a1bd1-c13c-ffc7-b9fa-6a71747495ca
msgctxt "h383627deg743ag4c3bgb388gc78d24e92879"
msgid "Damn thief. Just leave me be."
msgstr "망할 도둑 자식. 날 그냥 내버려 둬."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b61b9aad-e3cf-c36c-4a38-06be00aa3bc6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DROWELF(1) = False
#.      - DROWELF(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 5e9c4c72-4f56-2646-ce36-88207d2dc33c_AdmitDisguise = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:b61b9aad-e3cf-c36c-4a38-06be00aa3bc6
msgctxt "h01fc0cffg4a9cg4152gbcc4g5ddef3407a0a"
msgid "I'm not really a drow - this is just a disguise."
msgstr "난 진짜 드로우가 아니야, 이건 그냥 변장일 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Thulla
#. NodeID = b7282e30-ef51-a7d4-b0ef-31f69365befe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_State_AgreedToHelp = False
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_State_GaveQuest = True
#.      - UND_DuergarCamp_State_GnomeAtMyconids = False
#.   Quest:
#.      - UND_GnomeRescue.ThullaAskedHelp(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:b7282e30-ef51-a7d4-b0ef-31f69365befe
msgctxt "h530ace9bga7cfg43e3g9f51g650bd9e1ecdb"
msgid "What? You see to your affairs, I'll see to mine."
msgstr "뭐라고? 너나 잘해, 난 알아서 할 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Thulla
#. NodeID = b7d4c7fc-b6c1-0050-9b47-4e4adb3c42af
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:b7d4c7fc-b6c1-0050-9b47-4e4adb3c42af
msgctxt "he5980320g0e9ag48f0gb48fgd1f654f7c06b"
msgid "Down here? Tends to be."
msgstr "이 아래에서? 있는 편이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Thulla
#. NodeID = b8b913f3-4b13-fe90-2a38-530cf759653b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:b8b913f3-4b13-fe90-2a38-530cf759653b
msgctxt "hf700c1d5gc678g4e01gac57g11e9caad1952"
msgid "Just mining for materials. Nothing unusual."
msgstr "그냥 광물을 캐려고 했지. 특이할 건 없었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Thulla
#. NodeID = b8c3c7ed-ba6b-db8c-1d2b-816588a823d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:b8c3c7ed-ba6b-db8c-1d2b-816588a823d7
msgctxt "h5583f49fg5297g43bega7c5g98c61e4501c3"
msgid ""
"If you need to go your own way, I respect that. But still... I'm asking."
msgstr "네가 너의 길을 가고 싶다면, 그건 존중해. 하지만 그래도... 부탁할게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Thulla
#. NodeID = bdea4718-a111-a623-34fd-d4a399e52d0b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:bdea4718-a111-a623-34fd-d4a399e52d0b
msgctxt "h1b12ad1dgc83eg4e8fg9c80g55d1920c9c99"
msgid ""
"I don't want your prayers, priest. I know you mean well, but... leave me, "
"please."
msgstr "네 기도는 필요 없어, 사제. 좋은 의도인 건 알지만, 그냥... 날 내버려 둬, 부탁이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Thulla
#. NodeID = c35c4a8f-6eae-3152-c497-891b4b73e81e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: PALADIN
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:c35c4a8f-6eae-3152-c497-891b4b73e81e
msgctxt "h4533f06cg36f3g4d22ga8c9g16d5683beba7"
msgid ""
"Not polite to lay divine hands on a body without asking... but thanks. Now "
"<i>why?</i>"
msgstr "묻지도 않고 신성한 손길을 몸에 대는 건 예의에 어긋난 일이지만... 어쨌든 고마워. 그런데, <i>왜 그랬어?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Thulla
#. NodeID = c35c4a8f-6eae-3152-c497-891b4b73e81e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:c35c4a8f-6eae-3152-c497-891b4b73e81e
msgctxt "hff30b747g4d7cg4c5dg82f1g250d83a6c250"
msgid "Either... I'm finally dead, or you healed me. Why?"
msgstr "내가 드디어 죽었거나... 네가 날 치유한 거겠네. 왜지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c568728d-152a-abb8-c224-448c7bfb1bb9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_HALFLING(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:c568728d-152a-abb8-c224-448c7bfb1bb9
msgctxt "h87299f50g6c84g4611g990dg8c74b66fac71"
msgid "You're not alone. We'll meet again - in better circumstances, I hope."
msgstr "넌 혼자가 아니야. 우린 다시 만나게 될 거야. 바라건대, 더 좋은 상황에서 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ca9c8244-b629-67ae-9a6a-5d01600a95c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_Knows_DuergarPoisoned(1) = True
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_State_TriedMedicineCheck(1) = False
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_Knows_PoisonPassiveSuccess(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DUERGARDWARF(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_InjuredGnome_State_TriedMedicineCheck(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:ca9c8244-b629-67ae-9a6a-5d01600a95c9
msgctxt "hb76964f7ge875g400eg9260g54e20d339c84"
msgid "<i>Consider what you know of duergar poison lore.</i>"
msgstr "<i>듀에르가의 독 지식에 대해 알고 있는 것을 생각해본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cda2ac8a-85c9-1efa-5b2b-6b98042f3560
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:cda2ac8a-85c9-1efa-5b2b-6b98042f3560
msgctxt "h8a3034cdgabd8g4aecga0b7gacbedb952b0b"
msgid "<i>Step back.</i>"
msgstr "<i>물러난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cdcb5d42-e003-b7d6-1dc1-662ce591d6c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_LoneDuergar_Quest_AttackMyconids = False
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_State_TookBootsByForce = False
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_LootingSkillcheckSuccess(1) = False
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_State_TriedLootingSkillcheck(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_InjuredGnome_State_TriedLootingSkillcheck(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:cdcb5d42-e003-b7d6-1dc1-662ce591d6c2
msgctxt "h8067f2e3g2376g4a58g9fcfg1ac686ecf6c1"
msgid "<i>She's helpless. Check if she has anything worth taking.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그녀는 무력하다. 그녀에게 가져갈 만한 것이 있는지 확인해본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce4612c0-7081-d149-3b29-60a76fe7e122
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_Quest_LoneDuergar_Defeated = False
#.      - UND_LoneDuergar_Knows_DuergarHuntGnome = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:ce4612c0-7081-d149-3b29-60a76fe7e122
msgctxt "he743a2e1g1697g417dga600gcdb0f74ea619"
msgid "You're popular. There are some duergar hunters looking for you."
msgstr "인기가 많던데. 널 쫓는 듀에르가 사냥꾼들이 있더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d13643fd-5bc5-83d0-76fa-45689413c946
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_Knows_Poisoned = True
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_Knows_DuergarPoisoned(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:d13643fd-5bc5-83d0-76fa-45689413c946
msgctxt "h09cd3777g925cg48c9gaf82g11c5932e763a"
msgid "Who did this to you?"
msgstr "누가 이런 짓을 했지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d2db00b8-e6ff-8f78-de97-8beb15c0567f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_Knows_KinDead = False
#.      - UND_DuergarGuards_Excavation_State_PermaDefeated = True
#.      - UND_GnomeWorkers_State_PermaDefeated = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_InjuredGnome_Knows_KinDead = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - HIDDEN_WLD_Boosters.UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome_ReportedGrymforgeFate(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:d2db00b8-e6ff-8f78-de97-8beb15c0567f
msgctxt "h49afd1f7gc7e0g4784gac6cgaab80530d8b8"
msgid "The duergar are all dead, but your kin didn't survive."
msgstr "듀에르가는 모두 죽었지만, 네 동족은 살아남지 못했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d3c59935-f55c-8dde-9ee3-2d9a760ab88c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 5e9c4c72-4f56-2646-ce36-88207d2dc33c_CaughtLying = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:d3c59935-f55c-8dde-9ee3-2d9a760ab88c
msgctxt "h9a415650gf3b7g4a19ga0f4gdebb15b34305"
msgid "You're lying."
msgstr "거짓말을 하고 있군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d495837b-f061-aafa-6a89-eeca58cc6674
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ELF(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:d495837b-f061-aafa-6a89-eeca58cc6674
msgctxt "hc881ba37ge038g4b49gb50cg27c3183aea2e"
msgid "Remember them well. The grief will fade, but their memory need not."
msgstr "그들을 잘 기억해 줘. 슬픔은 사라지겠지만, 추억은 그렇지 않을 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Thulla
#. NodeID = d74a0be9-6192-1446-5b08-c8645dd72573
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:d74a0be9-6192-1446-5b08-c8645dd72573
msgctxt "h64dadcf8g3e7dg4410gb7bbga8f26aeae2ce"
msgid "I should've been with them. Should've died with them. Leave me."
msgstr "그들과 함께 있었어야 했어. 함께 죽었어야 했다고. 날 내버려 둬."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d9293e0c-f606-e3dc-80f8-859856837764
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - KELEMVOR(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:d9293e0c-f606-e3dc-80f8-859856837764
msgctxt "h1469016dg5906g4d5agb775g4ac44effdac4"
msgid "You're not alone. Your path home is just a little longer than theirs."
msgstr "넌 혼자가 아니야. 집을 향한 여정이 다른 이들보다 조금 더 길 뿐이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Thulla
#. NodeID = d9745fa1-3122-496a-eaf0-e91c37345a0d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DUERGARDWARF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:d9745fa1-3122-496a-eaf0-e91c37345a0d
msgctxt "hdec8a0f6g36b2g43b3g9ba4g063af6fc2e2d"
msgid "Why're you helping me? You're one of <i>them</i>."
msgstr "날 구해준 이유가 뭐야? 너는 <i>그 자식들</i> 중 한 명이잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Thulla
#. NodeID = d9745fa1-3122-496a-eaf0-e91c37345a0d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DROWELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:d9745fa1-3122-496a-eaf0-e91c37345a0d
msgctxt "h91f59e9dg48f5g4bffgb88agacb5868d1111"
msgid "Why're you helping me? You're a <i>drow</i>."
msgstr "날 구해준 이유가 뭐야? 너는 <i>드로우</i>잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Thulla
#. NodeID = d9745fa1-3122-496a-eaf0-e91c37345a0d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:d9745fa1-3122-496a-eaf0-e91c37345a0d
msgctxt "hc1db29cagbdffg41b4gb8cagb0ace153c58d"
msgid "Why're you helping me?"
msgstr "날 구해준 이유가 뭐야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = d9828c81-b6b0-4796-8d51-588f0badb78b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(5) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:d9828c81-b6b0-4796-8d51-588f0badb78b
msgctxt "h1328a832gaf1fg488eg958bg31129b489c6f"
msgid ""
"Now that's hospitality. The fungus could teach our druid friends a thing or "
"two."
msgstr "이런 게 제대로 된 대접이지. 이 곰팡이들이 우리 드루이드 친구들에게 가르침을 좀 줘야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Thulla
#. NodeID = d9d986e2-2883-a334-c422-519b74aabf67
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:d9d986e2-2883-a334-c422-519b74aabf67
msgctxt "ha24c1b8eg8701g4e02gb6eage552b7e7b1a1"
msgid "Ngh. But I'm nearly good to get on my feet."
msgstr "으윽. 하지만 거의 일어설 수 있을 정도로 몸이 나아졌어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Thulla
#. NodeID = de1cdeb7-dfb3-2a9f-0eed-ea05d6f46c0e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:de1cdeb7-dfb3-2a9f-0eed-ea05d6f46c0e
msgctxt "h7c46ad63gd596g40edg9734g6f97013804fc"
msgid "I'm almost sorry to hear it - I hoped to have the pleasure myself."
msgstr "그건 아쉽네. 내가 직접 그 기쁨을 누리고 싶었는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Thulla
#. NodeID = df58fa1c-7dd2-d94a-6fef-aa527b8dac53
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:df58fa1c-7dd2-d94a-6fef-aa527b8dac53
msgctxt "h00c95731g533fg4e36gbcf6gf01023eeec82"
msgid ""
"We can pay too, don't worry. We're Ironhand clan, best artificers in the "
"city."
msgstr "걱정하지 마, 보답도 할 수 있어. 우리는 아이언핸드 일족이야. 도시에서 제일가는 아티피서들이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dfb9a44b-d5a2-fdf2-aeb8-39865d81d2a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_TIEFLING(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:dfb9a44b-d5a2-fdf2-aeb8-39865d81d2a1
msgctxt "h5242aa03ge7cag4249g88dfg297c3d0e0599"
msgid "You already know how to stand alone. You'll be fine."
msgstr "이미 홀로 서는 법을 배웠잖아. 괜찮을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Thulla
#. NodeID = e0e63e6b-c736-5049-eac2-3087b778bc7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_InjuredGnome_State_GaveQuest = True
#.     - UND_InjuredGnome_Knows_StillRecuperating = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - UND_GnomeRescue.ThullaAskedHelp(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:e0e63e6b-c736-5049-eac2-3087b778bc7e
msgctxt "hdb0fb1a0g2cf7g4d09g8723gde8daf56db79"
msgid ""
"I'll mark where I made my escape. And... wait here, I suppose. Not much "
"choice, eh?"
msgstr "전에 이용했던 탈출로를 표시해 줄게. 그리고... 나는 여기서 기다려야겠지. 선택의 여지가 없으니까, 그치?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e29868b9-9b81-5cf8-c4ed-e79acbf529a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_State_AskedToFinishOff(1) = False
#.   Quest:
#.      - UND_DuergarPoison.LearnedPoisoned(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_InjuredGnome_State_AskedToFinishOff(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:e29868b9-9b81-5cf8-c4ed-e79acbf529a2
msgctxt "h37083346gda68g402egb2a6g4b4c88d94f85"
msgid "You're in a bad way. I could end your suffering, if you want."
msgstr "상태가 몹시 안 좋아. 원한다면 내가 고통을 끝내줄 수도 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Thulla
#. NodeID = e94b571c-f130-b9b1-446c-891753fc39e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - TemporaryHostilityAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:e94b571c-f130-b9b1-446c-891753fc39e5
msgctxt "h8ddfbbe7g0880g41c0g966cg0c41de26b4fe"
msgid "Should've - <i>ngh </i>- known. I'll die before I go one step with you."
msgstr "진작 - <i>윽 </i>-알았어야 했는데. 너와 한 발짝이라도 같이 갈 바에는 차라리 죽겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Thulla
#. NodeID = eb8bb72a-10f8-1871-4712-557244d51276
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_State_Healer(1) = False
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:eb8bb72a-10f8-1871-4712-557244d51276
msgctxt "h2aa6a576g95d7g4087ga683g16f1ecf47ee7"
msgid ""
"On the mend now, thanks to a stranger. Much longer and I'd have been with "
"Earthcaller."
msgstr "낯선 이의 도움 덕분에 낫고 있어. 조금 더 있었다간 어스콜러를 만나러 갈 뻔 했다니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ebd9949f-10f0-bb4e-e04c-85062e81e6e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:ebd9949f-10f0-bb4e-e04c-85062e81e6e0
msgctxt "haadf01cegd932g4393ga0e3g50922f7f35b2"
msgid "*Duergar society is shrouded in mystery. Nothing useful comes to mind.*"
msgstr "*듀에르가 사회에 대해선 알려진 게 거의 없습니다. 쓸만한 정보가 떠오르지 않습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ee0a3149-806e-a71f-90b4-08dc1fbe817b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:ee0a3149-806e-a71f-90b4-08dc1fbe817b
msgctxt "h621091c2ga57cg48b5gb5a4gcd4e4b80ec2c"
msgid "What did you expect? You left them behind."
msgstr "뭘 기대한 거야? 넌 그들을 두고 떠났어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Thulla
#. NodeID = f004d915-7d94-e53a-5daf-8b164de6e0d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_GuardedEntrance_Knows_KaghaHoldsChild = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_InjuredGnome_Knows_RunFromDuergar = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:f004d915-7d94-e53a-5daf-8b164de6e0d9
msgctxt "he9f67a3egd1eag4c24g8ef7gee56de71b673"
msgid ""
"Myconids - agh! - took pity on me. Sound lads - especially since the greys "
"gave 'em hell for it."
msgstr ""
"마이코니드들이 - 아악! - 나를 불쌍히 여겼어. 믿을 만한 친구들이야 - 회색놈들이 날 거둬준 대가로 지옥을 선사해준 이후로는 더 "
"말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Thulla
#. NodeID = f08c0408-2bcc-ba4c-4ebe-39db8353d5f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 5e9c4c72-4f56-2646-ce36-88207d2dc33c_AgreedHelpWithPoison = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:f08c0408-2bcc-ba4c-4ebe-39db8353d5f6
msgctxt "hdc8fa77dgda0cg42c2gb88ege6d77f78d3e1"
msgid "Talking... hurts. Leave me. Please."
msgstr "말하면... 아파. 나를 내버려둬. 부탁이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f205ab08-78a6-ebe3-4f76-84aa3c0eb694
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:f205ab08-78a6-ebe3-4f76-84aa3c0eb694
msgctxt "h2c0641a3g0875g4e25g831agb01f43c8329e"
msgid "What will you do when you return?"
msgstr "돌아가면 뭘 할 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Thulla
#. NodeID = f233e9da-4744-4ac3-2f45-0982b58a4504
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:f233e9da-4744-4ac3-2f45-0982b58a4504
msgctxt "h665f049cg859fg4727ga696g1ea0426255c2"
msgid ""
"It's past time we were back in the city. But if you find yourself there, "
"call on us. The Ironhand Gnomes are good friends to have."
msgstr "도시에서 나온 지도 한참이 지났네. 하지만 네가 도시에 오게 된다면, 우릴 찾아. 아이언핸드 노움은 알아두면 좋은 친구니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f2a53c83-7975-8149-3152-69c53c1fdfa4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_Knows_DuergarPoisoned(1) = True
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_State_TriedMedicineCheck(1) = False
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_Knows_PoisonPassiveSuccess(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DUERGARDWARF(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_InjuredGnome_State_TriedMedicineCheck(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:f2a53c83-7975-8149-3152-69c53c1fdfa4
msgctxt "h65e58901g0324g44e7ga4b5gc3a0bdc0cb2c"
msgid "<i>Consider what you know of duergar poison lore.</i>"
msgstr "<i>듀에르가의 독 지식에 대해 알고 있는 것을 생각해본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f33b16a3-8b57-400c-8897-bc80f8e1156e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:f33b16a3-8b57-400c-8897-bc80f8e1156e
msgctxt "h10072182g8b8dg4dd0g8f04gf66c781704aa"
msgid "<i>Silently petition Lady Shar for guidance.</i>"
msgstr "<i>조용히 샤 여신의 인도를 청원한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f34f5525-4a1a-042a-b7ac-355ecc9450d4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SELDARINEDROWELF(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:f34f5525-4a1a-042a-b7ac-355ecc9450d4
msgctxt "h9fd4eaa2g185dg45c2g910dg6e701757d0f3"
msgid "We're not all zealots - now you know."
msgstr "우리 모두가 광신자는 아니야 - 이제 알겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Thulla
#. NodeID = f60ba434-4dfe-32fb-0527-a1ecc6866cc8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 5e9c4c72-4f56-2646-ce36-88207d2dc33c_AgreedHelpWithPoison = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:f60ba434-4dfe-32fb-0527-a1ecc6866cc8
msgctxt "h122bf618g6534g43d1gb4f3gdee20a5bde5c"
msgid "Not. Going. <i>Anywhere.</i>"
msgstr "<i>아무것도.</i> 움직이지. 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Thulla
#. NodeID = f67dee12-4fc9-a00c-cd82-632b673e16d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:f67dee12-4fc9-a00c-cd82-632b673e16d6
msgctxt "hca54cf6fg0154g46e9g928bgabcbbfa5d8cd"
msgid "I don't want <i>memories.</i> I want... I want them. Leave me, please."
msgstr "난 기억하고 <i>싶지 않아.</i> 난 그들을... 난 그들을 원해. 날 내버려둬, 부탁이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome
#. Speaker = Thulla
#. NodeID = fc7c895f-8cef-686c-2c32-7957fb46c4cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome:fc7c895f-8cef-686c-2c32-7957fb46c4cc
msgctxt "hf735c450g82a7g40bbg985ag072eb582c51d"
msgid ""
"You've made sure his work is done, even if he's not there to see it. He'd be "
"grateful."
msgstr "넌 그가 시작한 일을 끝내려고 하고 있잖아. 그가 직접 보진 못하더라도 분명 감사해 할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome_SporeServant
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 48e31b72-7613-4343-2e97-377e293137d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome_SporeServant:48e31b72-7613-4343-2e97-377e293137d3
msgctxt "h8f14f1a5g9d7eg4313gbac5g8575fe00a423"
msgid "*It stands quietly, awaiting its myconid master's command.*"
msgstr "*그것은 조용히 서 있으면서, 마이코니드 주인의 명령을 기다리고 있다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome_SporeServant
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 527f9155-bad2-4e6f-bb19-55f6299fa045
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_ServantHasMet(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_InjuredGnome_ServantHasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome_SporeServant:527f9155-bad2-4e6f-bb19-55f6299fa045
msgctxt "hacc51a80g8dbdg403ag922dgf0ca6716fb77"
msgid "*It is not a gnome who stands before you, but a mere husk.*"
msgstr "*당신 앞에 서 있는 것은 노움이 아니라 한낱 껍데기일 뿐입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome_SporeServant
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = eb006160-781b-0ac1-4ac1-35edd8cf2afd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_InjuredGnome_ServantHasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_InjuredGnome_SporeServant:eb006160-781b-0ac1-4ac1-35edd8cf2afd
msgctxt "ha8f9341agd128g46f2gb3dcg3916d3e78554"
msgid "*The servant remains silent.*"
msgstr "*종복은 조용히 침묵했습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_MushroomField_Warning
#. Speaker = Restless Myconid
#. NodeID = 0ad89ce3-0a4c-9715-05bd-bcff077a2e56
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_MushroomField_Warning:0ad89ce3-0a4c-9715-05bd-bcff077a2e56
msgctxt "h56c27c08gd6b1g471dgb4a6g0925dd8e986f"
msgid "((*after the light comes the <b>bang</b>. step away. step away*))"
msgstr "((*빛이 있은 후 <b>폭발</b>이 발생 했습니다. 물러 나세요. 물러 나세요*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0062d0ca-951c-a0a6-79e9-3277e6d8c9be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone:0062d0ca-951c-a0a6-79e9-3277e6d8c9be
msgctxt "hd1922014g998eg4520ga385gc6e515eb288a"
msgid ""
"<i>You think of Shar - could she be speaking to you here at last, in the "
"dark...?</i>"
msgstr "<i>샤를 떠올린다 - 그녀가 마침내 여기, 이 어둠 속에서 말을 걸고 있는 걸까...?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 126982ba-9705-7f0f-720c-47de6c0a8dd9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_UNDERDARK(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone:126982ba-9705-7f0f-720c-47de6c0a8dd9
msgctxt "h7a3b41e3g1a2cg4c81ga5eag308f637e4648"
msgid "<i>This feels familiar. Search your memories...</i>"
msgstr "<i>친숙하게 느껴진다. 기억을 되짚는다...</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 2b801b27-b1ce-92fc-633c-02174d9ef3c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone:2b801b27-b1ce-92fc-633c-02174d9ef3c9
msgctxt "h88aaeeb8g89f4g4065gbf96g44f5890aa6fe"
msgid "*Your mind is a canyon, and the words echo from every crevasse.*"
msgstr "*당신의 마음은 협곡이며, 단어들이 모든 크레바스에서 메아리칩니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2cddd4ed-1e5e-6ee3-8435-7b654ec67804
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_UNDERDARK(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone:2cddd4ed-1e5e-6ee3-8435-7b654ec67804
msgctxt "hb603f804g2e3cg4d34g8a21g80ef752cb38b"
msgid "<i>Probe your memories. What magic might this be?</i>"
msgstr "<i>기억을 뒤진다. 이건 무슨 마법이지?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone
#. Speaker = Sovereign Spaw
#. NodeID = 2d571cb3-956b-9507-537e-f501ef98bc06
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_State_FirstGreetingDone = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone:2d571cb3-956b-9507-537e-f501ef98bc06
msgctxt "hb48bf248gb78eg42begb1eeg0fa2b63d9f4a"
msgid "((*who is it. what do they want. are we safe*))"
msgstr "((*누구지. 그들이 원하는 게 뭐지. 우리는 안전한 건가*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 38c2e24e-c92c-b7cf-3ade-1931c830d6f8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC_EVIL or CLERIC_GOOD or CLERIC_NEUTRAL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone:38c2e24e-c92c-b7cf-3ade-1931c830d6f8
msgctxt "h2a4cd317g9656g4473ga523gac334f749b3a"
msgid "<i>Pray for fortitude against this mental trespass.</i>"
msgstr "<i>정신 침입에 맞설 힘을 기원한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 41ae0bb2-f433-fb00-0472-bd7925c31193
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_MyconidCircle_Event_RememberedMyconids(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone:41ae0bb2-f433-fb00-0472-bd7925c31193
msgctxt "hf98228e7gd87fg48d4gad9fg49e7bf18606d"
msgid ""
"*Telepathic mushroom creatures - myconids - inhabit the Underdark. You must "
"be nearing a myconid colony.*"
msgstr "*텔레파시를 쓰는 버섯 생명체들인 마이코니드는 언더다크에 거주합니다. 마이코니드 군락에 가까이 온 것이 분명하군요.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4d8edb64-8e82-22d2-a5c9-f9795df57b7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone:4d8edb64-8e82-22d2-a5c9-f9795df57b7e
msgctxt "h936dd7f5gc7ffg447bg87dag7ed1e72c01a6"
msgid "<i>Fill your mind with the words of your oath. Drown out the voice</i>."
msgstr "<i>머릿속을 맹세로 가득 채운다. 목소리를 흘려보낸다</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 59a01da8-d720-b369-03b3-75a922006dde
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone:59a01da8-d720-b369-03b3-75a922006dde
msgctxt "h6139b5cegd390g4ae7gb5d5gc5b8b1af776f"
msgid "*You cannot identify the voice's origins.*"
msgstr "*당신은 목소리의 근원을 알아낼 수 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 67d6703a-0c18-f501-47dc-d8035bf479af
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone:67d6703a-0c18-f501-47dc-d8035bf479af
msgctxt "h15e4b1b9g36a1g4249ga322g4ece992c1926"
msgid "I don't know who you are, but you're not welcome in my head."
msgstr "네가 누군지 모르지만, 내 머릿속에서 환영받지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 689bf9b2-a61b-bb05-bce1-c6459f1abc4b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone:689bf9b2-a61b-bb05-bce1-c6459f1abc4b
msgctxt "hdde21c60g11a6g487ega01ag48652361b505"
msgid ""
"That voice... it doesn't sound like me. My mind doesn't bother giving "
"warnings..."
msgstr "이 목소리... 이건 내 목소리가 아니야. 내 정신은 고작 경고 따위로 귀찮게 굴지 않는데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone
#. Speaker = Sovereign Spaw
#. NodeID = 6fa757e7-339f-4f10-c95b-323555ad157a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone:6fa757e7-339f-4f10-c95b-323555ad157a
msgctxt "h315e1420g6bf4g4e4cg8381gdcf75545cc38"
msgid "((*they're coming. <i>you're coming</i>*))"
msgstr "((*그들이 온다. <i>네가 온다</i>*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 79495cdf-dd3c-85bf-cd15-89420f914975
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - NIGHT_DarkUrge_ButlerIntro = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone:79495cdf-dd3c-85bf-cd15-89420f914975
msgctxt "hfc4f3c57ga94ag492ega91ag2e63f2a1e475"
msgid ""
"<i>Panic: is the Butler back? You almost feel his beady eye upon your "
"back.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공포: 집사가 돌아왔나? 놈의 두 눈깔이 등뒤에서 반짝이는 것 같다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8393a3ed-9fba-0c02-534b-734af16b804f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone:8393a3ed-9fba-0c02-534b-734af16b804f
msgctxt "heff06bcfg9a70g46acg8f13g8394a2db5c3f"
msgid "<i>Continue forward.</i>"
msgstr "<i>앞으로 계속 나아간다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8cc845f0-06b4-afc4-b356-2a259a1db926
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone:8cc845f0-06b4-afc4-b356-2a259a1db926
msgctxt "h997e9851gf78cg46bcgab21g134cd58bd3e8"
msgid "Who are you? <i>What</i> are you?"
msgstr "당신은 누구지? 당신은 <i>뭐야</i>?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a4a722f3-0274-79e1-676c-2363621c9458
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone:a4a722f3-0274-79e1-676c-2363621c9458
msgctxt "h8c53efb2geba4g43b1ga4ebgf75019937333"
msgid "Who's coming? Cazador's minions? Have they found me?"
msgstr "뭐가 온다는 거야? 카사도어의 하수인인가? 그들이 날 찾은 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = acb1829e-556d-e412-0233-cbe0931883e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone:acb1829e-556d-e412-0233-cbe0931883e5
msgctxt "h46641fafg06c3g4b5fg86a1g04dee69595da"
msgid "<i>Still your thoughts to this new voice intruding on you.</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신을 침범하는 이 새로운 목소리에 대한 당신의 생각은 여전히 남아 있다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone
#. Speaker = Sovereign Spaw
#. NodeID = bbb9199a-93c8-4762-7241-a9322c85b660
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_MyconidCircle_State_FirstGreetingDone = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone:bbb9199a-93c8-4762-7241-a9322c85b660
msgctxt "h025309d6gb512g461fgb1b3g5129b12d2ea9"
msgid "((*more are coming*))"
msgstr "((*더 많이 온다*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c2560fe2-ab3f-e256-ea7e-ff0096bdb4bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_UNDERDARK(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone:c2560fe2-ab3f-e256-ea7e-ff0096bdb4bf
msgctxt "h849464bag3eafg4078g8926g22746bf214d8"
msgid "<i>Consider the voice. What sort of creature speaks this way?</i>"
msgstr "<i>목소리에 대해 생각해본다. 어떤 생명체가 이런 식으로 말을 거는 걸까?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone
#. Speaker = Sovereign Spaw
#. NodeID = d67a03e8-cfbb-caaf-9678-4fbc241a1107
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone:d67a03e8-cfbb-caaf-9678-4fbc241a1107
msgctxt "h10e57a79gca4eg42e6g9021gdd01b0253af5"
msgid "((*closer. they're coming closer*))"
msgstr "((*가까워진다. 그들이 가까워진다*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone
#. Speaker = Sovereign Spaw
#. NodeID = e2e1c33a-6eda-5331-b3d0-45ccb5a643ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone:e2e1c33a-6eda-5331-b3d0-45ccb5a643ed
msgctxt "hdfecaae0ge349g427fga937gc8a17fcc5abe"
msgid "((*they're coming. <i>they're coming</i>*))"
msgstr "((*그들이 온다. <i>그들이 온다</i>*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f051999a-fd7b-fc04-f907-3cc3556da23e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone:f051999a-fd7b-fc04-f907-3cc3556da23e
msgctxt "h21815f15gdd1bg4c6agb4cfgfd8811670679"
msgid ""
"<i>Ignore your tightening chest. Surely the devils hadn't found you down "
"here?</i>"
msgstr "<i>가슴을 옥죄어 오는 고통을 무시한다. 설마 데빌 놈들이 여기까지 쫓아왔으려고?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f30b377b-a036-a88a-d280-672a317f8f3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone:f30b377b-a036-a88a-d280-672a317f8f3b
msgctxt "hfff737f0g26c1g455cgb6d5g5015f1ca3fd7"
msgid ""
"<i>Still your mind. You have heard many voices - but never this one.</i>"
msgstr "<i>마음을 진정시킵니다. 당신은 많은 목소리를 들었지만 - 이것만은 예외입니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f64c6348-aca6-7155-a8c9-d8e7c9669ec0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_Alone:f64c6348-aca6-7155-a8c9-d8e7c9669ec0
msgctxt "h835fa29cg7f0fg400cgb030g44a2c0b38622"
msgid "<i>Ignore the voice.</i>"
msgstr "<i>목소리를 무시한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 00799744-61fb-1043-fde9-4ca4dbb824d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(6) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:00799744-61fb-1043-fde9-4ca4dbb824d6
msgctxt "h6293ac0egec2dg42b8g887ag1cdfcb6d0ee0"
msgid "It said 'they're coming.' But... who?"
msgstr "'그들이 온다'라고 했잖아. 그게... 누구지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 009be2b7-da12-184c-4dbb-0e7954eeb922
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - NIGHT_DarkUrge_ButlerIntro = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:009be2b7-da12-184c-4dbb-0e7954eeb922
msgctxt "he84db16bga40cg4f6fgb8cbg911f9c293a95"
msgid ""
"<i>Panic: is the Butler back? You almost feel his beady eye on your back.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공포: 집사가 돌아왔나? 놈의 두 눈깔이 등뒤에서 반짝이는 것 같다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 0346447c-dbd3-8db5-89af-809e1ac6e3b6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(5) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:0346447c-dbd3-8db5-89af-809e1ac6e3b6
msgctxt "hd699e98eg95fdg402ega438g644337bbfdb5"
msgid ""
"It's never good news with a mysterious voice, is it? Always 'warning, "
"demons', never 'warning, nymphs bathing nearby'."
msgstr ""
"신비로운 목소리로 전하는 소식은 좋았던적이 없었지, 그렇지 않나? 언제나 '데몬 조심'이었지, '근처에서 목욕하는 님프 조심'은 "
"아니었잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0935f457-3454-74a0-255b-3237106faa73
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(1) = True
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:0935f457-3454-74a0-255b-3237106faa73
msgctxt "ha8bdc3a2g8317g42a1g8fadg93aea95a92af"
msgid ""
"<i>You think of Shar - could she be speaking to you here at last, in the "
"dark...?</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신은 샤를 생각하고 있습니다 - 그녀가 마침내 여기, 어둠 속에서 당신에게 말을 걸 수 있을까요...?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 10c1859d-8293-168c-8711-61dac868dd95
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:10c1859d-8293-168c-8711-61dac868dd95
msgctxt "h807342f9g917fg47ecg9ed1gbeb570b32e27"
msgid "Careful... If we can hear it, perhaps it can hear us..."
msgstr "조심해... 우리가 들을 수 있다는 건, 놈도 우릴 들을 수 있을지도 몰라..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1bf56fa6-32d1-b691-2e0b-0e5a56cfe889
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:1bf56fa6-32d1-b691-2e0b-0e5a56cfe889
msgctxt "hadbccdd0g1887g42e8ga34eg74b83ba0a77c"
msgid "<i>Ignore the voice.</i>"
msgstr "<i>목소리를 무시한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 1f504f86-7de9-2594-2951-ff6bf845e3f8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:1f504f86-7de9-2594-2951-ff6bf845e3f8
msgctxt "h308eb894gfe4bg4c01g8b46gefc0235a1f2d"
msgid "Control your thoughts. It seems I'm not the only one listening."
msgstr "생각을 통제해. 나만 듣고 있는 게 아닌 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Sovereign Spaw
#. NodeID = 226b59e2-b412-900a-5b0f-f8c80bd9807b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:226b59e2-b412-900a-5b0f-f8c80bd9807b
msgctxt "h93881c0agc132g439fg8979g36c9ba7ef54d"
msgid "((*they're coming. <i>you're coming</i>*))"
msgstr "((*그들이 온다. <i>네가 온다</i>*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 2640cf9c-5a9a-2466-0f48-ecaad04b0441
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(5) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:2640cf9c-5a9a-2466-0f48-ecaad04b0441
msgctxt "h0e5e870cg1f59g44e6g9a20g9678673881da"
msgid "No, someone's coming. And someone else wants us to know..."
msgstr "아니, 누군가 오고 있어. 그리고 다른 누군가가 우리가 그 사실을 알길 바라는군..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 31663500-f219-1caf-b053-5a8ab6931ab1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(7) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:31663500-f219-1caf-b053-5a8ab6931ab1
msgctxt "hf3e140a0g7d35g490egaf1egc527d333dcc0"
msgid "No devils here. That's a myconid. And it seems to be warning us..."
msgstr "데빌이 아니야. 이건 마이코니드야. 우리에게 경고를 하려는 것 같은데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 32f84061-2513-6e0e-7ef4-5c27bbd2fb02
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:32f84061-2513-6e0e-7ef4-5c27bbd2fb02
msgctxt "hd4838bd3gdd64g4530g8beagdaef1bc1c186"
msgid "That voice... what was that?"
msgstr "방금 목소리... 그건 뭐였지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3511ec40-3ba9-22de-5293-35477aa903b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC_EVIL or CLERIC_GOOD or CLERIC_NEUTRAL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:3511ec40-3ba9-22de-5293-35477aa903b9
msgctxt "h5686f7dbg15adg4a16gbebdg002fa0cc3af8"
msgid "<i>Pray for fortitude against the mental trespass.</i>"
msgstr "<i>정신 침입에 맞설 힘을 기원한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Sovereign Spaw
#. NodeID = 38545410-d202-e557-8f33-cb720c41190c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:38545410-d202-e557-8f33-cb720c41190c
msgctxt "hf3108b95g4d5fg409fgb9b8g2842ecd9c65d"
msgid "((*they're coming. <i>you're coming</i>*))"
msgstr "((*그들이 온다. <i>네가 온다</i>*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 40c91d02-f276-a1a2-1858-df5d1c99e733
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:40c91d02-f276-a1a2-1858-df5d1c99e733
msgctxt "h26a8e537g6ca0g4e52g9e21gd6fe1ad30203"
msgid "Hush. Do you hear it?"
msgstr "쉿. 들려?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 417ecc2c-8ff4-62b9-7338-1da5fbec5809
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:417ecc2c-8ff4-62b9-7338-1da5fbec5809
msgctxt "h396cbdb6g3ecbg4e8bgab70g7c9c1656f86d"
msgid "Tell me I'm not imagining that voice."
msgstr "이 목소리가 내 상상이 아니라고 해줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 4d55b1f0-63b8-725d-c855-9a5b6b90aedc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:4d55b1f0-63b8-725d-c855-9a5b6b90aedc
msgctxt "h10ddbccegf772g40d0gb9b8g8c24650061e9"
msgid "This might be some devil's ploy. Don't listen to it."
msgstr "무슨 데빌의 계략일지도 몰라. 듣지 마라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 51a0fe65-5b29-d403-2997-f64ed7862da4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:51a0fe65-5b29-d403-2997-f64ed7862da4
msgctxt "h411c57a3g748bg4f2bg9013g931816568c8e"
msgid "<i>Still your thoughts to this new voice.</i>"
msgstr "<i>이 새로운 목소리에 생각을 집중한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Sovereign Spaw
#. NodeID = 55d08449-829a-90c1-f8ef-f30592e5275f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:55d08449-829a-90c1-f8ef-f30592e5275f
msgctxt "h6fc6bbd8gde09g4a0egba6fg37b303729f5a"
msgid "((*they're coming. <i>they're coming</i>*))"
msgstr "((*그들이 온다. <i>그들이 온다</i>*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 5d0245d0-43e1-79c1-3a19-29676187f590
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(7) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:5d0245d0-43e1-79c1-3a19-29676187f590
msgctxt "hc7f3eb4dgc4c1g45c8g893eg67283848ceb2"
msgid "That voice... Do you hear it too?"
msgstr "저 목소리... 너도 들려?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 614dea3c-e50e-2725-7e11-52bffb21d647
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:614dea3c-e50e-2725-7e11-52bffb21d647
msgctxt "ha8ce9ea5gf4c7g40beg9248gc22b74fca26f"
msgid "No. And it's unlike any I've yet heard."
msgstr "아니. 그리고 지금까지 들어본 것과는 전혀 달라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 63452f61-4de2-63b7-61ba-ee41fceca811
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:63452f61-4de2-63b7-61ba-ee41fceca811
msgctxt "hf3c72383gfdb0g4566g8052g5036fb442b10"
msgid "What in the Nine Hells is <i>that</i>?"
msgstr "<i>저게</i> 대체 뭐야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7f1b5220-5026-c835-59cb-6d9bf21aa0ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(1) = True
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:7f1b5220-5026-c835-59cb-6d9bf21aa0ae
msgctxt "h38fd0aa1g58b8g48c6gb221g839bee21be7e"
msgid "<i>Stay silent. Could Cazador have found you?</i>"
msgstr "<i>침묵을 유지한다. 카사도어가 당신을 찾은 것일까?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 7fdf0f68-c315-4389-eca9-01560b7cc62b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:7fdf0f68-c315-4389-eca9-01560b7cc62b
msgctxt "haa9afe48g394dg4e8bgb9cfg8e1bd2a6b426"
msgid ""
"Such faculties of observation you possess! I'm ready, whatever's coming..."
msgstr "관찰 능력이 대단하군! 난 준비됐어, 뭐가 오든..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 84616ff6-3ec4-b66d-5ba1-b2fb49b1ded6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(5) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:84616ff6-3ec4-b66d-5ba1-b2fb49b1ded6
msgctxt "h949042d6gcc15g427ag85b5gda5d5d6571cc"
msgid "Who - <i>what</i> in the hells are you?"
msgstr "당신 - 아니 <i>이건</i> 대체 뭐야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 853dec31-91da-6827-8e34-6b1ad8bab5be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:853dec31-91da-6827-8e34-6b1ad8bab5be
msgctxt "h4f25f924ga5b3g464eg82f9gd9564bf63e12"
msgid ""
"Something's coming - and if it lives down here in the dark, it won't be "
"anything good."
msgstr "뭔가 오고 있어 - 게다가 이 어두운 곳의 존재라면, 좋은 것과는 거리가 멀겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 8705d472-d8f9-fa1a-c493-cc97ea81c154
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:8705d472-d8f9-fa1a-c493-cc97ea81c154
msgctxt "hf87f5b78gb6e0g45d8gb1acgcd0efe1e8d41"
msgid "Careful... If we can hear it, perhaps it can hear us..."
msgstr "조심해... 우리가 들을 수 있다는 건, 놈도 우릴 들을 수 있을지도 몰라..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 90d371c8-3b4f-d568-6127-095b180a2810
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:90d371c8-3b4f-d568-6127-095b180a2810
msgctxt "h2ba6b54ag593fg4200g891bg02a7d489dcc0"
msgid "Then control your thoughts, lest your mind be exploited."
msgstr "그렇다면 생각을 통제해, 이용당해선 안 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 90ec2a83-482f-9253-9031-c6f7278e1062
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(6) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:90ec2a83-482f-9253-9031-c6f7278e1062
msgctxt "hee3f1b1ag577eg4bb7g84a7g7fc75a864cbd"
msgid "Tell me you hear that voice."
msgstr "너도 목소리가 들린다고 해줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = a4e943bc-2a32-a46b-86fc-bb4103278f29
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(6) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:a4e943bc-2a32-a46b-86fc-bb4103278f29
msgctxt "h0f116136g3668g45a0gb37ag6de74fbbfc70"
msgid "It said 'they're coming.' But... who?"
msgstr "'그들이 온다'라고 했잖아. 그게... 누구지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = bea942e8-2100-fb13-1f83-48270166bb72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(7) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:bea942e8-2100-fb13-1f83-48270166bb72
msgctxt "h1a9f9077gd9d5g4f4dg8e9cg6f0aa5e83650"
msgid "No, listen! A myconid... it's warning us."
msgstr "아니, 들어봐! 마이코니드야... 우리에게 경고를 하고 있는 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Sovereign Spaw
#. NodeID = bf49ac23-531c-a4dc-ce6e-40863ffeb919
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_MyconidCircle_State_FirstGreetingDone = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:bf49ac23-531c-a4dc-ce6e-40863ffeb919
msgctxt "hc1c19e80gd3dbg4d0aga220ge1f5a1b0b011"
msgid "((*more are coming*))"
msgstr "((*그들이 더 올 거야*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = c8eaf099-8b5c-08dd-0145-33e901a9ab53
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(5) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:c8eaf099-8b5c-08dd-0145-33e901a9ab53
msgctxt "h7342a310g0e3fg406ag9f16gedb85ed523f8"
msgid "You listen all you want - but it can get the hells out of my head."
msgstr "넌 마음껏 들어, 하지만 내 머릿속에선 나가줬으면 좋겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cb856c77-1f91-6338-14c3-ab8a08c28ac0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:cb856c77-1f91-6338-14c3-ab8a08c28ac0
msgctxt "h47b5e644g37fbg4d61g9680ga1f18768b118"
msgid "<i>Still your mind to this unusual voice.</i>"
msgstr "<i>이 특이한 목소리에 차분히 정신을 집중한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d9e960b3-5614-d618-2e49-7f5dc8e143d1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:d9e960b3-5614-d618-2e49-7f5dc8e143d1
msgctxt "h350d5130g4e1eg45cdg9e04g1f6e6f385a7b"
msgid "<i>Fill your mind with the words of your oath. Drown out the voice</i>."
msgstr "<i>머릿속을 맹세로 가득 채운다. 목소리를 흘려보낸다</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ea01b542-e585-a839-8dac-170a07d68ae3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:ea01b542-e585-a839-8dac-170a07d68ae3
msgctxt "h847888fbg572ag4981ga959g4df29b973c94"
msgid ""
"That voice... it doesn't sound like the Urges. The Urges don't give "
"warnings..."
msgstr "이 목소리... 이건 내 마음 속에서 울리는 목소리가 아니야. 어두운 충동은 미리 경고하지 않는데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = ecee966d-d418-ca26-bf82-b144d10d2301
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(7) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:ecee966d-d418-ca26-bf82-b144d10d2301
msgctxt "h3100418bgc234g4354gbbe5g49f5906d1508"
msgid "That's a myconid. And it's warning us..."
msgstr "방금 건 마이코니드였어. 우리에게 경고하고 있군..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = edc9e283-6323-10cd-a128-328f70b02171
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:edc9e283-6323-10cd-a128-328f70b02171
msgctxt "h37db8d08g0357g4a9cgb4a4ga20fce6e2796"
msgid ""
"No. Something's coming - and if it lives down here in the dark, it won't be "
"anything good."
msgstr "아니. 뭔가 오고 있어, 그리고 이 깊은 어둠 속에서 사는 것이라면, 좋은 건 아니겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = f5910c09-6e1d-ed93-5376-0cd0cc8d2bd2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(6) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:f5910c09-6e1d-ed93-5376-0cd0cc8d2bd2
msgctxt "h7416c1c8g291dg49cbg90e3g5667a6106a28"
msgid ""
"Well, when a creepy voice says 'something's coming', it's never <i>good</i>, "
"is it?"
msgstr "뭐, 섬뜩한 목소리가 '무언가 오고 있다'라고 한다면, <i>좋은</i> 것일 리는 없잖아, 안 그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f83f93d8-dfb8-9b2d-7498-3917639e9314
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#.      - AVATAR(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_RapportSpores_WithCompanions:f83f93d8-dfb8-9b2d-7498-3917639e9314
msgctxt "h43d17b86gf888g413fg85feg2b68acfe15ab"
msgid "Something is coming. Has a devil found me at last?"
msgstr "뭔가 오고 있어. 마침내 데빌 놈들이 날 찾아낸 걸까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_ServantDuergar1
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 1a509614-0a40-3dfd-8c26-91652c1091c1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_PlantDuergar3(0) = True
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_PlantDuergarHasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_ServantDuergar1:1a509614-0a40-3dfd-8c26-91652c1091c1
msgctxt "h1d380e75g2540g43d5g8435g688a1bfc37ff"
msgid "*The servant says what it can: absolutely nothing.*"
msgstr "*종복은 할 수 있는 말을 합니다 : 절대 아무것도 아닙니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_ServantDuergar1
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 505dfcae-6944-a994-a565-dbef6967596f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_ServantDuergar1:505dfcae-6944-a994-a565-dbef6967596f
msgctxt "h38f20c05g5c2fg42c3g8b67g9e76e550fd91"
msgid "*It now belongs to the circle. It will obey the sovereign.*"
msgstr "*이것은 이제 공동체의 구성원으로서 군주에게 복종할 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_ServantDuergar1
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 546aff91-d29f-149b-87de-46d45e33e683
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_PlantDuergar2(0) = True
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_PlantDuergarHasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_ServantDuergar1:546aff91-d29f-149b-87de-46d45e33e683
msgctxt "hd0ea7f64gde26g4fa0g90cage2310e1da085"
msgid "*The silent servant awaits its sovereign's orders.*"
msgstr "*조용한 종복이 군주의 명령을 기다립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_ServantDuergar1
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5893392d-947c-7436-75b5-b749489a4b55
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_ServantDuergar1:5893392d-947c-7436-75b5-b749489a4b55
msgctxt "hf6ee2139g430ag458dg9cd6g42bbb9468125"
msgid ""
"*You see a frothing duergar, axe drawn, crazed by bloodlust, bearing down on "
"a young myconid.*"
msgstr "*거품을 문 채 도끼를 든 듀에르가가 피의 욕망에 미쳐서, 어린 마이코니드를 죽이는 모습이 보입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_ServantDuergar1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9aeb2ae9-9d29-9c94-855a-6789b583c7e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_ServantDuergar1:9aeb2ae9-9d29-9c94-855a-6789b583c7e9
msgctxt "hdb9eb572g0f63g4e2fgae33g4882a1a55b5d"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_ServantDuergar1
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = bedc1e22-68fc-6068-957d-1a6ef498f102
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_PlantDuergarHasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_ServantDuergar1:bedc1e22-68fc-6068-957d-1a6ef498f102
msgctxt "h6f715cffg8630g48deg8b98g27cec13aa60b"
msgid "*The servant is silent.*"
msgstr "*종복은 조용했습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_ServantDuergar1
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = dec687a2-b0ff-c340-5f40-043fd654f8a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_ServantDuergar1:dec687a2-b0ff-c340-5f40-043fd654f8a0
msgctxt "hcf9ce3e9gc429g4382gb8acg6b61ecd169ac"
msgid ""
"*The frightened myconid circle conjures mildewed vines. They encircle and "
"transform the duergar.*"
msgstr "*겁에 질린 마이코니드 공동체가 곰팡이 덩굴을 소환합니다. 이 덩굴이 듀에르가를 휘감아서 변형시킵니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_ServantDuergar1
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = df922f71-c829-b619-838e-9f6705def40f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_PlantDuergarHasMet(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_MyconidCircle_PlantDuergarHasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_ServantDuergar1:df922f71-c829-b619-838e-9f6705def40f
msgctxt "h09b5149ag863eg41e9gac10g1b7f4c049376"
msgid ""
"*Fungus and mould glaze the servant's face and body. Through music and "
"vision, the sovereign reveals its origins.*"
msgstr "*진균과 곰팡이가 종복의 얼굴과 몸에 발려 있습니다. 음악과 환상을 통해, 군주가 그 기원을 드러냅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_ServantDuergar1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dfbd4ef1-cee6-800e-8ea6-b2ae80e9ba45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DUERGARDWARF(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_MyconidCircle_State_Hostile = True
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_ServantDuergar1:dfbd4ef1-cee6-800e-8ea6-b2ae80e9ba45
msgctxt "h341a2af9g1c33g4ccdgafcbg6b412c6fb94d"
msgid "<i>Attack the circle. No duergar deserves this fate.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공동체를 공격한다. 어떤 듀에르가도 이런 끔찍한 운명을 맞을 필요는 없다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_ServantHookHorror_01
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 60c721ad-6957-4d2e-4600-0d1bf621fd47
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 03b6aa2e-e805-3a51-6bdb-d92f0b0da84a_UND_MyconidCircle_ServantHookHorror_01_RecognisedMonster = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_ServantHookHorror_01:60c721ad-6957-4d2e-4600-0d1bf621fd47
msgctxt "h12a732eeg98feg418dgb930g76d6dee6acd1"
msgid "*The monstrosity stares blankly forward.*"
msgstr "*괴물은 멍하니 앞만을 바라봅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_ServantHookHorror_01
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 71d92bfa-995b-be5f-021a-e29979976776
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_DirectToSovereign_State_Hasmet(1) = False
#.   Local:
#.      - 03b6aa2e-e805-3a51-6bdb-d92f0b0da84a_UND_MyconidCircle_ServantHookHorror_01_RecognisedMonster = False
#.   User:
#.      - UND_HookHorrors_Knows_SeenHookHorrors(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 03b6aa2e-e805-3a51-6bdb-d92f0b0da84a_UND_MyconidCircle_ServantHookHorror_01_RecognisedMonster = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_ServantHookHorror_01:71d92bfa-995b-be5f-021a-e29979976776
msgctxt "h9abdfd55g4eecg427dg8e89g68a7880652e2"
msgid ""
"*Fungus and mould glaze the grotesque creature's face and body. It doesn't "
"seem to notice you.*"
msgstr "*진균과 곰팡이가 괴생명체의 얼굴과 몸에 발려 있습니다. 이것은 당신을 알아채지 못하는 듯합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_ServantHookHorror_01
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b4569391-47f9-9bc4-1673-2f43f328b996
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 03b6aa2e-e805-3a51-6bdb-d92f0b0da84a_UND_MyconidCircle_ServantHookHorror_01_RecognisedMonster = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_ServantHookHorror_01:b4569391-47f9-9bc4-1673-2f43f328b996
msgctxt "hb7ea3ad8ga26dg4348g9082g7b82d7632456"
msgid "*The creature ignores you.*"
msgstr "*당신을 무시하는 듯합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_ServantHookHorror_01
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = bf4bb2fd-d6d7-99ba-8a4d-be345ad72673
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 03b6aa2e-e805-3a51-6bdb-d92f0b0da84a_UND_MyconidCircle_ServantHookHorror_01_RecognisedMonster = False
#.   User:
#.      - UND_HookHorrors_Knows_SeenHookHorrors(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 03b6aa2e-e805-3a51-6bdb-d92f0b0da84a_UND_MyconidCircle_ServantHookHorror_01_RecognisedMonster = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_ServantHookHorror_01:bf4bb2fd-d6d7-99ba-8a4d-be345ad72673
msgctxt "h0c01c834g28d1g4db4g8f7ege207fbc9e4ed"
msgid "*The monstrosity doesn't seem to notice you.*"
msgstr "*괴물은 당신을 눈치채지 못한 것 같습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 012fc414-8b3a-343b-d10c-6955c2a29022
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:012fc414-8b3a-343b-d10c-6955c2a29022
msgctxt "hb101b0ebg903fg4802gbe7ege43dc498826d"
msgid "<i>Yes. Although it may be a touch cold by now.</i>"
msgstr "<i>맞아요. 지금쯤이면 약간 쌀쌀할지도 몰라요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 016ed114-3c4b-50f6-7ad9-59a14659e505
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:016ed114-3c4b-50f6-7ad9-59a14659e505
msgctxt "h12dc46a9gbb48g48eag8f85g16bb1871c6b1"
msgid "*It feels ten times its size. Alive, awake. Almost <i>smug.</i>*"
msgstr "*마치 열 배는 커진 듯한 기분입니다. 살아 있으며, 깨어 있습니다. 거의 <i>우쭐거리기</i>까지 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 026fbb78-a461-40ad-fba1-49f5180c9b51
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:026fbb78-a461-40ad-fba1-49f5180c9b51
msgctxt "h54090e89g2169g4027gaa11gd8453b404007"
msgid "No, I want this power. Keep your ring."
msgstr "아니, 난 이 힘을 가지겠어. 그 반지는 사양하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0302ab58-7570-1867-2401-617d05917032
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_State_GaveMushrooms = False
#.   Quest:
#.      - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Society.AskedToFind(2) = True
#.      - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Society.AskedToDrink(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:0302ab58-7570-1867-2401-617d05917032
msgctxt "hd84610d7g60ddg40aag8febg8cc7cba3e888"
msgid "Refresh my memory - what do you need for the potion?"
msgstr "다시 알려줘, 물약을 위해 뭐가 필요하다고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 05c28748-1176-b6e5-0420-c61e5b562c8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:05c28748-1176-b6e5-0420-c61e5b562c8a
msgctxt "h943a064dg5780g40b6gb567g05097a8c339d"
msgid ""
"<i>In the beginning, I had an arrangement with a lich. Excellent company, "
"despite what one would expect.</i>"
msgstr "<i>처음에는 리치와 계약을 맺었습니다. 예상과는 다르게 잘 맞는 동업자가 되었죠.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 05d162b9-f00b-ae78-5293-f61589afee79
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:05d162b9-f00b-ae78-5293-f61589afee79
msgctxt "h4a44d6b0g4d10g4a14gad66g8250895f1968"
msgid ""
"<i>But unless you are already a step from death, it will not kill you.</i>"
msgstr "<i>하지만 이미 죽기 일보직전이지 않은 한, 그게 당신을 죽이진 않을 것입니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 072feae7-fbd2-63f5-fdbe-cfee52e636f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:072feae7-fbd2-63f5-fdbe-cfee52e636f5
msgctxt "h32cf71b0g7e10g4a30g9fe6g9d69e5b17c06"
msgid "<i>Of course. Return when you are ready.</i>"
msgstr "<i>물론입니다. 준비가 되시면 언제든 돌아오시죠.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 07bd264d-ddff-e1dc-d068-49061cdf1040
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:07bd264d-ddff-e1dc-d068-49061cdf1040
msgctxt "h1ac1a39eg14c1g44fbga7b2g0c786d7fcdb2"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 08235490-346c-cefe-e022-a9e61087a4d8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:08235490-346c-cefe-e022-a9e61087a4d8
msgctxt "hbf54883fga942g43aeg9abagb4d4c0ad7289"
msgid "You were supposed to make it weaker, not stronger!"
msgstr "약화한다고 했잖아, 강화하는 게 아니라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 096780fc-f5e6-4148-8b4b-21241411f1f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:096780fc-f5e6-4148-8b4b-21241411f1f7
msgctxt "h380af7d6gacd0g4a03ga89dg9beb509adffb"
msgid "What's next? Cutting off my own head?"
msgstr "다음은 뭐지? 내 머리를 스스로 잘라내는 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0ad79d70-5346-9408-6ddc-f19cfdb85326
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:0ad79d70-5346-9408-6ddc-f19cfdb85326
msgctxt "h09002f65g06c2g4855g84e2g7f183345140a"
msgid ""
"*Omeluum watches you with cautious intensity. It expects doubt. It expects "
"fear.*"
msgstr "*오멜룸은 신중히 당신을 지켜봅니다. 의심과 두려움을 예상하고 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 0c1b4bad-360a-658f-5917-4b64df6260a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:0c1b4bad-360a-658f-5917-4b64df6260a3
msgctxt "h9b5132d1g70cfg45fega75eg360b407b114a"
msgid ""
"<i>I cannot change my appetites. Although I am experimenting in reducing "
"them with magic.</i>"
msgstr "<i>제 식단을 바꿀 순 없습니다. 하지만 마법을 통해 식사량을 줄이는 방법을 실험하고 있죠.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 118b7d2a-0b81-57ec-c436-a02730e64051
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:118b7d2a-0b81-57ec-c436-a02730e64051
msgctxt "h6ac6532bgc91ag48dagaee4gbf685768d839"
msgid ""
"<i>Perhaps the peoples of the Underdark will be less inclined to violence if "
"they comprehend the cost, yes?</i>"
msgstr "<i>언더다크의 주민들이 그 대가를 이해한다면 폭력을 휘두르는 경향이 줄어들지 않겠습니까?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1278770d-2359-4a6e-7417-2f9633451178
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:1278770d-2359-4a6e-7417-2f9633451178
msgctxt "h7047d3c1gdd72g4880gbe35gd9174473e0f9"
msgid "I suppose it's not all bad. More power is better than less."
msgstr "그렇게 나쁘진 않을지도. 힘은 많을수록 좋으니까 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1382b0a4-1ad4-882b-7138-42295bc5c23d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SavingThrow
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:1382b0a4-1ad4-882b-7138-42295bc5c23d
msgctxt "h50cbbaaag6161g4f7ag90ecg18781902abf9"
msgid "<i>Drown out the tadpole by focusing on a tune.</i>"
msgstr "<i>선율을 떠올려 올챙이의 기척을 무시한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 16d66b28-0056-94d4-a234-3fe4e4fdc631
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:16d66b28-0056-94d4-a234-3fe4e4fdc631
msgctxt "h125f23d7g69ddg4a3bga4dfgcaf5568e0cb5"
msgid "<i>Drink the potion.</i>"
msgstr "<i>물약을 마신다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 1852b28f-5ca1-4605-d53c-b40058ae6b14
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:1852b28f-5ca1-4605-d53c-b40058ae6b14
msgctxt "h1c891037g9f47g499fg9266gfda0789a4543"
msgid "<i>Extracting the larva would kill you. Immediately.</i>"
msgstr "<i>유충을 추출하면 당신은 사망할 것입니다. 즉시 말이죠.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1ad9b08b-dc1b-a618-3ddd-813ac03aca29
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 20
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(2) = True
#. TagRule: BERSERKER
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:1ad9b08b-dc1b-a618-3ddd-813ac03aca29
msgctxt "h27772be2ge692g483bga694gcb8cea6064d8"
msgid "<b>YOUR</b> <b>LIFE. GIVE IT.</b>"
msgstr "<b>네 생명. 그걸 내놔.</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1ad9b08b-dc1b-a618-3ddd-813ac03aca29
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 20
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:1ad9b08b-dc1b-a618-3ddd-813ac03aca29
msgctxt "hebd53659g87c8g4566g8a8ege86a83d1b884"
msgid "Something of little value - <b>your life.</b>"
msgstr "가치가 작은 걸 가져가겠어 - <b>네 생명.</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 1c6a8d83-0395-5c9e-b4fd-57903d715dbb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:1c6a8d83-0395-5c9e-b4fd-57903d715dbb
msgctxt "hb7424e97g6c55g46dcgbd71gc165fcde1a7c"
msgid "<i>Because removal seemed preferable to negation.</i>"
msgstr "<i>제거하는 것이 무력화하는 것보다 나아 보였기 때문입니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 1d53b715-6b23-16c8-8a29-029e250ba270
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:1d53b715-6b23-16c8-8a29-029e250ba270
msgctxt "h3a32b336g20d1g49f8g839fgf093b7551846"
msgid ""
"*The world loses its edges, its finer boundaries. You are fluid but trapped, "
"like a creature suspended in amber.*"
msgstr "*세상의 미세한 경계가 사라집니다. 당신은 호박에 갇힌 생명체가 된 듯, 유동적이지만 갇혀 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 1dfb2972-b167-3ef0-0578-9c2ce7c2587f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:1dfb2972-b167-3ef0-0578-9c2ce7c2587f
msgctxt "h67e07e19gc8bdg479agb872g271a3c8c9f79"
msgid ""
"<i>I intend no disrespect, but one can only heal so much of their own brain "
"tissue.</i>"
msgstr "<i>무시하려는 건 아니지만, 뇌 조직은 한정된 양밖에 회복할 수 없습니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 1e77bcea-2826-e9f8-1bf2-136a7361d92d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:1e77bcea-2826-e9f8-1bf2-136a7361d92d
msgctxt "hd3d5becaga182g47acg95c5g5bc119146654"
msgid ""
"<i>Understandable. If you change your mind in the future, say as such. I "
"will perform the experiment then.</i>"
msgstr "<i>이해합니다. 앞으로 생각이 바뀌게 된다면, 언제든 말씀하시죠. 실험을 진행할 테니 말입니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 1fba1aa1-526a-432e-4fea-6fa0ad0f2292
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:1fba1aa1-526a-432e-4fea-6fa0ad0f2292
msgctxt "hda1ab1ffg3f82g4b59gad45gc0d2e020f03a"
msgid ""
"<i>But not to worry. Should you transform, I will happily perform a new "
"examination.</i>"
msgstr "<i>하지만 걱정하지 마십시오. 당신이 변이한다면, 전 기쁘게 새로운 조사를 진행할 것이니 말입니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2217294d-e6dd-cb3e-8daf-9fd3f7108f0d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SavingThrow
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:2217294d-e6dd-cb3e-8daf-9fd3f7108f0d
msgctxt "h139faaa1g1ea9g4ce4gbdeeg68b76f72f386"
msgid "<i>Wall off your mind from the psionic seizure.</i>"
msgstr "<i>사이오닉 발작으로부터 정신을 차단한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 233cc2c2-ba24-e410-f179-91bfca562d00
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:233cc2c2-ba24-e410-f179-91bfca562d00
msgctxt "h0911ee0cgd713g4e8fg895fg179a5b688265"
msgid "<i>That is not a story I share with strangers.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그건 제가 낯선 분들이랑 얘기하고 싶은 주제는 아니군요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 23cc45df-aa75-4d26-c888-b472d061652d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:23cc45df-aa75-4d26-c888-b472d061652d
msgctxt "h4d1a7632g408dg46e2gb2ffg3e6fa4bcbd07"
msgid "<i>I do not intend to shatter its protection. </i>"
msgstr "<i>이 보호막을 깨려는 것은 아닙니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 25df5256-c46f-22a9-48c0-e1529c962b5b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:25df5256-c46f-22a9-48c0-e1529c962b5b
msgctxt "h2a1bd288g577bg414fgb3dfg649f7c6fc604"
msgid "I felt it grow inside me. There's more power than ever."
msgstr "그게 내 안에서 자라는 걸 느꼈어. 그 어느 때보다 강한 힘이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2a10f8e1-1328-38e3-06ec-df00b6197e50
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_State_AskedAboutExtraction(2) = True
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFLayer_State_ToldAboutNautiloid(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:2a10f8e1-1328-38e3-06ec-df00b6197e50
msgctxt "h7693393bg355fg42f4g97a5gd6f0f26ac002"
msgid "<i>Tell Omeluum about the strange mind flayer ship you were on.</i>"
msgstr "<i>오멜룸에게 지난 번 올라탔던 낯선 마인드 플레이어 함선에 대해 얘기한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2dd59c01-8686-1a05-6a61-eb774bfb3bd2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:2dd59c01-8686-1a05-6a61-eb774bfb3bd2
msgctxt "h4d592e87g355eg47e2g83f8g7f0b032b30e0"
msgid "That's too risky of an experiment for me. Count me out."
msgstr "그건 너무 위험한 실험인 것 같군. 난 빠지겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 2e977583-bef4-7ed5-1ef7-776fa1c4270c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_HasMet(2) = True
#.   Quest:
#.      - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Society.AskedToFind(2) = True
#.      - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Society.AskedToDrink(2) = False
#. TagRule: GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:2e977583-bef4-7ed5-1ef7-776fa1c4270c
msgctxt "hb8ad981dg81ddg4412g81degd8520eec93bd"
msgid ""
"<i>I greet you, child of the stars. How has your search for the mushrooms "
"fared?</i>"
msgstr "<i>반갑습니다, 별의 자식이여. 버섯 수색은 어떻게 되었습니까?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 2e977583-bef4-7ed5-1ef7-776fa1c4270c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_HasMet(2) = True
#.   Quest:
#.      - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Society.AskedToFind(2) = True
#.      - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Society.AskedToDrink(2) = False
#. TagRule: ASTARION or UNDERDARK
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:2e977583-bef4-7ed5-1ef7-776fa1c4270c
msgctxt "h16b57e6ag73ddg4a51gaf7cg93fc9ad7d784"
msgid ""
"<i>I greet you, child of the dark. How has your search for the mushrooms "
"fared?</i>"
msgstr "<i>반갑습니다, 어둠의 자식이여. 버섯 수색은 어떻게 되어가고 있습니까?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 2e977583-bef4-7ed5-1ef7-776fa1c4270c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_HasMet(2) = True
#.   Quest:
#.      - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Society.AskedToFind(2) = True
#.      - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Society.AskedToDrink(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:2e977583-bef4-7ed5-1ef7-776fa1c4270c
msgctxt "he79f7821ga9b0g4009g8650g04eb032fc5c3"
msgid ""
"<i>I greet you, child of the sun. How has your search for the mushrooms "
"fared?</i>"
msgstr "<i>반갑습니다, 태양의 자식이여. 버섯 수색은 어떻게 되어가고 있습니까?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3191d6fc-7e5a-53aa-ed1e-2085f2d86ae0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.      - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Society.ToldAboutRing(2) = True
#.      - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Society.GotTheRing(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:3191d6fc-7e5a-53aa-ed1e-2085f2d86ae0
msgctxt "h369dba7dg1922g4b8cg8deeg6b0f5e46ee28"
msgid "I want that ring to protect my mind."
msgstr "그 반지로 내 정신을 보호하고 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 32e96440-3366-e49b-bfb1-6195fe24f100
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:32e96440-3366-e49b-bfb1-6195fe24f100
msgctxt "hbf9413cfgc920g47d1ga373gff218e562b75"
msgid "<i>If you require it on another occasion, merely ask.</i>"
msgstr "<i>다른 이유로 반지가 필요하시다면, 말씀만 하십시오.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 338e86da-60a9-3877-1a8b-dbca9f8272ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_State_Hostile = True
#.   Object:
#.     - TemporaryHostilityAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:338e86da-60a9-3877-1a8b-dbca9f8272ea
msgctxt "h9494ee3bgf290g47d7ga0eegcd0ff8e52ee6"
msgid "<i>How disappointing.</i>"
msgstr "<i>아주 실망스럽군요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 33c331e0-738b-6ec5-7d55-e5188b2fc709
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:33c331e0-738b-6ec5-7d55-e5188b2fc709
msgctxt "hb19bb5c6g9f14g4177g9b0cgc6227d13c113"
msgid ""
"<i>I enslaved no one, and stand against such practice. I cannot surrender my "
"own shield for nothing.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>전 그 누구도 노예로 삼은 적이 없습니다. 그리고 그러한 행위에 대해 반대하죠. 제 보호 장치를 그냥 내어드릴 수는 없습니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 340b4391-a8d3-0b2c-b104-560019e6ba8b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:340b4391-a8d3-0b2c-b104-560019e6ba8b
msgctxt "h17419739g51d3g433bg8d68g2b6239898376"
msgid "That's disgusting. You're a monster."
msgstr "역겹군. 넌 괴물이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 345d13fe-1060-0ee9-8661-71628895ea7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:345d13fe-1060-0ee9-8661-71628895ea7c
msgctxt "hb7bb4aa4gaa58g462ega986gdf226fbea54e"
msgid ""
"<i>Indeed. Although I may have another solution, albeit a temporary one.</i>"
msgstr "<i>물론입니다. 비록 임시방편에 불과합니다만, 제게 다른 해결책이 있어요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 34a6a2ec-33a2-c792-bc3d-f0269bb10dba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:34a6a2ec-33a2-c792-bc3d-f0269bb10dba
msgctxt "h8a4b7f73g0f39g4f8cg867bg69d6fd653022"
msgid ""
"<i>Only in that you may be a danger to yourself. What the potion may make "
"you see or feel - I cannot determine.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>그저 당신 자신이 본인에게 위험이 될지도 모른다는 점만 알려드리지 않았습니다. 그 물약이 당신에게 뭘 보여줄지, 뭘 느끼게 할지는 "
"저도 알 수 없어요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 3527038f-cabe-6314-a7f7-5ab7882c6401
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:3527038f-cabe-6314-a7f7-5ab7882c6401
msgctxt "h71bc3b2bg44f2g4776ga190g76cc4c24d459"
msgid ""
"<i>The larva is not the only creature that has been inside this brain. But "
"at present it is the sole resident.</i>"
msgstr "<i>유충이 이 뇌 속에 들어온 유일한 생물은 아닙니다. 하지만 현재로서는 유일한 거주자죠.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 37335c2c-4ccf-4485-3329-14e72bcfe5d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:37335c2c-4ccf-4485-3329-14e72bcfe5d3
msgctxt "h9fe5d3f9gd260g4900g807cg481827c57657"
msgid "Is this enough gold for it?"
msgstr "이 정도 금화면 되겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3755c173-8d4e-1154-0f51-3dbcc88d311f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:3755c173-8d4e-1154-0f51-3dbcc88d311f
msgctxt "ha47c7b83g1f3ag4a65g982eg632bcd20c30e"
msgid "Don't waste my time. Say what you mean."
msgstr "내 시간을 낭비하지 마. 무슨 뜻인지 말해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 38a57b79-4a7a-9dcf-bcd8-fc6dcfdbd32f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:38a57b79-4a7a-9dcf-bcd8-fc6dcfdbd32f
msgctxt "hd2ff6a0dg4126g48dag9c0dg00198e5f5ef4"
msgid ""
"*A few sparks and colours dance around Omeluum, but you stay steady and "
"staring ahead.*"
msgstr "*오멜룸 주변에서 몇 가지 스파크와 색이 춤을 추지만, 당신은 흔들리지 않고 정면을 응시합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 39bb97c2-cf19-1ca8-ef82-25165eea8b8c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:39bb97c2-cf19-1ca8-ef82-25165eea8b8c
msgctxt "h0fa3f3dbg1e40g404egaa49g79f318a9c63c"
msgid "Eating those doesn't sound like a great idea."
msgstr "그걸 먹는 건 딱히 좋은 생각 같지 않은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 3b51592a-375d-2b9d-eab9-6ba3b2563a9a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:3b51592a-375d-2b9d-eab9-6ba3b2563a9a
msgctxt "h2bd82af8g7819g4e0cgb75cg20eeab6acf95"
msgid "<i>A fascinating topic indeed. What can you tell me?</i>"
msgstr "<i>아주 환상적인 주제군요. 어떤 걸 말해줄 수 있습니까?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 3cadd0e9-6315-6bd4-ac9f-2b3d44bcb925
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_State_ConnectionPerformed = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:3cadd0e9-6315-6bd4-ac9f-2b3d44bcb925
msgctxt "ha914ad20ge3f5g4a0dg9ef8g2245d8deaad8"
msgid ""
"<i>I was born with a propensity for arcane magic my people despise. It gave "
"me the strength to resist the elder brain.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>전 비전 마법의 성향을 타고났습니다. 제 동족이 혐오하는 것이지요. 그 힘을 통해 전 엘더 브레인에게 저항할 수 있었습니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3cf2a64c-7f7d-6eb3-d061-68922d0f8068
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:3cf2a64c-7f7d-6eb3-d061-68922d0f8068
msgctxt "hd57aa96fg1110g45e6g8723gadaa3c1671c4"
msgid ""
"<i>Perform the tale of your adventures so far: 'The Ballad of Brains, Brine "
"Pools and Balderdash.'</i>"
msgstr "<i>지금까지의 모험을 요약한 이야기를 들려준다: '뇌의 발라드, 뇌수와 헛소리 '</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 3d97a7f7-107e-437b-9d3c-310f704c5371
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(5) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:3d97a7f7-107e-437b-9d3c-310f704c5371
msgctxt "hf9fe8ec6g0031g4d65ga61ege2254c4947ee"
msgid "Nice. Helps not to judge a book by its cover, doesn't it."
msgstr "잘됐어. 이래서 겉모습만 보고 판단하지 말라나 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3e365d83-8811-a000-ee44-fc6da11eb283
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:3e365d83-8811-a000-ee44-fc6da11eb283
msgctxt "hff7cc1ebgd0b8g44e0gabe3gc9566c731950"
msgid "<i>Relax and allow Omeluum's mind to search yours.</i>"
msgstr "<i>긴장을 풀고 오멜룸이 당신의 정신을 살피도록 허락한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3edccdb5-9f10-ccf9-aa26-514231e115b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckHasItemTemplate = True
#.      - GEN_CheckHasItemTemplate_2 = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Event_GiveMushrooms(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:3edccdb5-9f10-ccf9-aa26-514231e115b3
msgctxt "h23d6d8fdgd2eeg4d48gb163g5d164431674f"
msgid "I think I already have what you're looking for."
msgstr "당신이 찾는 걸 내가 이미 들고 있는 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 443d14d3-e305-3538-de55-162b76576934
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DUERGARDWARF(2) = True
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:443d14d3-e305-3538-de55-162b76576934
msgctxt "h75f14553g5aabg4bd7g8862g26fe767d8052"
msgid ""
"I wouldn't be in this situation if it wasn't for a mind flayer. You owe me."
msgstr "애초에 마인드 플레이어가 아니었다면 이 상황에 부닥치지도 않았을 거야. 당신은 내게 빚진 거라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 44413330-b724-5841-4f0e-beb208f0a4f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:44413330-b724-5841-4f0e-beb208f0a4f6
msgctxt "h186de2ccgb423g458ag8ecfg7c75af91d6f2"
msgid "What exactly is this going to do to me?"
msgstr "이게 정확히 내게 뭘 하는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 46f2e578-1c44-9f31-425c-cf44bd4865dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:46f2e578-1c44-9f31-425c-cf44bd4865dd
msgctxt "hfde7edbdgc71dg458agb9baga8adfe014bda"
msgid ""
"<i>There may be a way to bypass that stasis. There are many alchemical "
"substances that can influence the mind.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그 정지장을 우회할 방법이 있을지도 모릅니다. 정신에 영향을 끼치는 연금술 물질은 아주 다양하니까요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 4708e1f7-c701-4745-a766-37ec28931ff0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:4708e1f7-c701-4745-a766-37ec28931ff0
msgctxt "h6f8b9175gc44bg4563gb239g44913b6a2f41"
msgid ""
"To deal with this abomination? Nigh unthinkable. Yet even Vlaakith herself "
"could not deny the ring's merit."
msgstr "이 흉물과 거래하자고? 상상조차 할 수 없는 일이다. 하지만 이 반지의 혜택은 블라키스 본인께서도 부인하지 못하시겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 48937042-57c5-a90b-423e-159e5c602f20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:48937042-57c5-a90b-423e-159e5c602f20
msgctxt "h439305b7gf3c0g4832gb7efgafcc13ce9d91"
msgid "No, I'm done with all this."
msgstr "아니, 이제 이 모든 일에서 손 떼겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 49085c08-d041-b3db-befc-f13a2d872ede
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:49085c08-d041-b3db-befc-f13a2d872ede
msgctxt "h14821439g9491g45eegb306g96212fa3a2e2"
msgid "<i>A tongue of madness and the spores from a timmask mushroom.</i>"
msgstr "<i>광기의 혓바닥과 티마스크 버섯의 포자입니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4b8dd111-f7a6-3792-388a-fdcd3f21fd57
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_State_GaveMushrooms = True
#.   Quest:
#.      - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Society.AskedToFind(2) = True
#.      - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Society.AskedToDrink(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:4b8dd111-f7a6-3792-388a-fdcd3f21fd57
msgctxt "h9f399a06g720eg4e07g9fcdga96919517b75"
msgid "Take a look at those mushrooms yet?"
msgstr "그 버섯은 다 살펴봤나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 4d08085e-acb7-78cc-7bac-ed4883876091
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_State_ConnectionPerformed = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Society.ToldAboutNullify(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:4d08085e-acb7-78cc-7bac-ed4883876091
msgctxt "hde3214c1ge6c1g42a8g9414gd42d4a33bd12"
msgid "<i>But I have... an idea.</i>"
msgstr "<i>하지만 제게... 생각이 하나 있습니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 5094ceda-7929-64c1-0571-eb0c3f6ad672
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Event_TriedNautiloidStory(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:5094ceda-7929-64c1-0571-eb0c3f6ad672
msgctxt "hd438a3e6g7c3eg45c1gab06gbaa41cae913d"
msgid ""
"<i>Hm. I am afraid you have not offered any information I do not already "
"possess.</i>"
msgstr "<i>흠. 죄송하지만 제가 아직 알지 못하는 정보는 전혀 알려주실 수 없는 것 같군요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 50c8b25a-e66e-c70f-8300-e8c3a7c953b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:50c8b25a-e66e-c70f-8300-e8c3a7c953b2
msgctxt "hd4593497gd004g41bdg9f7bg3bb98444078f"
msgid "<i>Of course, the larva remains. Be ever-vigilant of its growth.</i>"
msgstr "<i>물론, 유충은 남아 있을 것입니다. 유충의 성장을 항상 경계하세요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 50e3607f-470c-06c8-82fd-93161a6a8c52
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SavingThrow
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. TagRule: CLERIC
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:50e3607f-470c-06c8-82fd-93161a6a8c52
msgctxt "h1796c420g7349g42acg8ce3gf48483a0f40b"
msgid "<i>Call to your god for protection.</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신의 신에게 기도해 보호를 부탁한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 51bba357-7e5d-46e1-078d-21923fae74db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:51bba357-7e5d-46e1-078d-21923fae74db
msgctxt "he7796149g82e3g4592gbd1dg22a1a2690a3d"
msgid ""
"<i>So I left his company, and thus I now feed from those who... act against "
"the Society's goals.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그리하여 저는 그를 떠났고, 이제 저는 광명회에... 반하는 이들을 식사로 삼습니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5223e941-1a5d-11c9-bd87-e4c57f41204a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:5223e941-1a5d-11c9-bd87-e4c57f41204a
msgctxt "h9712598dg85aag45a1g9007ge40ed909b3fb"
msgid "My mind is all addled, can you tell why?"
msgstr "머릿속이 너무 복잡해. 왜 그런 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 546ceab2-4ff9-0cbc-9849-6b8669be13af
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:546ceab2-4ff9-0cbc-9849-6b8669be13af
msgctxt "hd13f3e40gfbc2g4f60gbb6fg728f65e3d8b6"
msgid ""
"<i>Such crude destruction may not waylay a larva like this. But there is "
"another possibility.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그런 조잡한 파괴로는 유충을 잡을 수 없을지도 모릅니다. 하지만 다른 가능성도 있어요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 56c4d910-abac-2548-e3c5-54dd94e5370f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:56c4d910-abac-2548-e3c5-54dd94e5370f
msgctxt "h4a825559g3bfdg4dc2g83ccg6ee3de21c612"
msgid ""
"<i>I need only bypass the interference that prevents me from communicating "
"with the larva.</i>"
msgstr "<i>유충과의 통신을 방해하는 간섭을 우회하기만 하면 됩니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 58cd4c17-6040-2546-8e5e-11df2aa76294
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:58cd4c17-6040-2546-8e5e-11df2aa76294
msgctxt "he7ce0899ge6f4g486fg8a7cg62e70235e699"
msgid ""
"<i>My formula will hamper the more harmful effects once the mushrooms are "
"brewed into a potion.</i>"
msgstr "<i>제 조제법으로 그 버섯들을 물약으로 끓여내면, 해로운 효과를 방지할 수 있을 거예요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 59b94229-5cc0-4a60-18a0-84b82064a308
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:59b94229-5cc0-4a60-18a0-84b82064a308
msgctxt "h1bfea92agbdf6g4f16ga1a1g069f01495002"
msgid ""
"<i>This is most unusual. The incubation period should be complete, as should "
"your transformation.</i>"
msgstr "<i>아주 특이하군요. 이미 배양 단계는 완료되었어야 정상입니다. 당신의 변이도 말이죠.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 5d054fae-6f99-bb26-a502-41c3faf51814
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_State_HasRing(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:5d054fae-6f99-bb26-a502-41c3faf51814
msgctxt "hc3acb65eg32b9g43eeg92d0gdbedd17c8647"
msgid ""
"<i>Except... it does not seem to be on my person. Did I leave it on that "
"last expedition somewhere? Hm.</i>"
msgstr "<i>다만... 제겐 없는 것 같군요. 지난 탐험 때 어딘가 두고 온 건가? 흠.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 5e172179-096b-497b-c51d-7e3819640bbc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Inclusion_Scholar(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:5e172179-096b-497b-c51d-7e3819640bbc
msgctxt "h502e2932g123fg43cfg8f8bg3f4dc55362ee"
msgid ""
"<i>But the larva is infused with strange magic. It appears to be in some "
"form of stasis.</i>"
msgstr "<i>하지만 유충에 어떤 기묘한 마법이 깃들어 있습니다. 어떤 형태의 정지장인 것 같군요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 60395013-05e1-1b85-31de-7085ab5e017d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Event_TriedNautiloidStory(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:60395013-05e1-1b85-31de-7085ab5e017d
msgctxt "h9d46b528gbe76g477fga0d3g794647c9d4b6"
msgid "<i>Give a dramatic retelling of your time on the mind flayer ship.</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신이 마인드 플레이어 함선에서 탈출한 이야기를 극적으로 설명한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 65417902-738f-bba3-a064-638360765513
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:65417902-738f-bba3-a064-638360765513
msgctxt "h568c77e3g7239g4a6egb621g4819e19c3054"
msgid "<i>I would require a fresh tongue of madness and timmask spores.</i>"
msgstr "<i>신선한 광기의 혓바닥과 티마스크 포자가 필요해요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 669a3bd7-bb18-ca80-cbb1-f7f04415de24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:669a3bd7-bb18-ca80-cbb1-f7f04415de24
msgctxt "hab682b1cgddc9g4584gb6adg5d971a1efb8f"
msgid "<i>It seems as if someone did not want you to.</i>"
msgstr "<i>누군가가 그러길 원하지 않는 것 같군요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 672fd7dd-9a31-2b08-e7c1-45faa4826891
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:672fd7dd-9a31-2b08-e7c1-45faa4826891
msgctxt "h8738671age3ccg4187g8e3dgd59b633d1377"
msgid ""
"<i>These are fine specimens. It will only take me a moment to brew them to "
"proper potency.</i>"
msgstr "<i>아주 훌륭한 표본이군요. 적절하게 추출해서 조제하는 일은 금방 끝날 겁니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 685e8d31-217a-a049-47a7-026d61f9f0d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:685e8d31-217a-a049-47a7-026d61f9f0d7
msgctxt "h6f3695cdg0806g426aga512g3f7016b13371"
msgid "Lovely. So where do I find these mushrooms?"
msgstr "완벽하군. 그럼 이 버섯들은 어디서 찾을 수 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6892778f-25b2-ddf9-0743-dc0bd1dbc7e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFLayer_State_ToldAboutNautiloid(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:6892778f-25b2-ddf9-0743-dc0bd1dbc7e1
msgctxt "hfc6d4a92g3adfg45d0gacb4g733bc8f102cd"
msgid "How about I tell you more about that nautiloid? Every last detail."
msgstr "그 노틸로이드에 대해서 더 자세히 설명해 주는 건 어때? 모든 세세한 부분까지 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 69038d0d-3326-223c-b018-3eef70e107a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:69038d0d-3326-223c-b018-3eef70e107a9
msgctxt "h713bee5dg910bg4b73gb0ccg0451c2476d01"
msgid "<i>Of course. I am sorry I cannot assist you in its removal.</i>"
msgstr "<i>물론입니다. 제거를 도와드릴 수 없어 유감이군요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 6ac1ac73-0d82-7da1-2b2a-bce0a0dbe864
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:6ac1ac73-0d82-7da1-2b2a-bce0a0dbe864
msgctxt "hce95e388ga0adg43bdga7a6g169e142dc567"
msgid "<i>My apologies. I cannot trade what I do not possess.</i>"
msgstr "<i>사과드리죠. 제가 가지고 있지 않은 것을 거래할 수는 없습니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6b41a771-ef4a-d639-cd05-09fce0aa34a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:6b41a771-ef4a-d639-cd05-09fce0aa34a1
msgctxt "h8b514117g14c0g4462g8e2agf45e5c57c57d"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6ee4716b-2a71-398f-efeb-4ba971fbe3a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:6ee4716b-2a71-398f-efeb-4ba971fbe3a1
msgctxt "h10057fd3g4b62g4188gbf76gcede2ec6bde2"
msgid "<i>Offer a detailed, logical analysis of the nautiloid.</i>"
msgstr "<i>노틸로이드에 대해 자세하고 논리적인 설명을 제공한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 705a0579-d883-af16-1b9b-8e206f0a54f9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:705a0579-d883-af16-1b9b-8e206f0a54f9
msgctxt "heff955e0ge529g48c3g80a5g7ea209dd89cb"
msgid "Die, abomination! <i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "죽어라, 이 흉물! <i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 705a0579-d883-af16-1b9b-8e206f0a54f9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:705a0579-d883-af16-1b9b-8e206f0a54f9
msgctxt "h8f196762ga4d9g42d9gbd45g729e251959ed"
msgid "There's no trusting a mind flayer. <i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "마인드 플레이어를 믿을 수는 없다. <i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 707ac758-9c57-eaa1-3664-d3e9e0282435
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_State_HasRing(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:707ac758-9c57-eaa1-3664-d3e9e0282435
msgctxt "h8f89458fge315g4989g809egd122011e220a"
msgid ""
"<i>My research is in perpetual need of funding. Yes, I am willing to accept "
"your coin.</i>"
msgstr "<i>제 연구에는 끊임없는 자금 지원이 필요하지요. 물론, 당신의 동전을 받아들이겠습니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 708e0e4f-8d10-a1fa-6ded-da366a7e7788
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. TagRule: REALLY_DUERGARDWARF or REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:708e0e4f-8d10-a1fa-6ded-da366a7e7788
msgctxt "ha2d1e636g01adg4be5gb076g75b8a4450175"
msgid "Your people enslaved mine. The debt is yours to repay."
msgstr "네 동족은 내 동족을 노예로 삼았었지. 네겐 아직 그 빚이 남아 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 713ea203-c5cb-0623-cd6d-03c48935c633
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.      - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Society.ToldAboutRing(2) = False
#.      - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Society.AskedToDrink(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:713ea203-c5cb-0623-cd6d-03c48935c633
msgctxt "h22825f34g8b33g4e49ga6f6gc79a88f96da0"
msgid "Do you still have that potion? I'm ready."
msgstr "그 물약 아직도 가지고 있나? 난 준비됐어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 71c39e24-319c-b9ed-53a6-9882d96b3ba3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:71c39e24-319c-b9ed-53a6-9882d96b3ba3
msgctxt "he3f6231ag2aadg409ag9f01g1069567f7b53"
msgid ""
"Ahem. Death. It means you would have to die first to extract the tadpole."
msgstr "으흠. 죽음이죠. 올챙이를 빼내려면 먼저 당신이 죽어야한다는 뜻입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 71da57a8-af71-b5f8-0378-979bfa20aec8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_State_ConnectionRefused = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:71da57a8-af71-b5f8-0378-979bfa20aec8
msgctxt "h2b19249dg0010g41edga699g33386c98469a"
msgid "Never mind. I'm done with mind flayers touching me."
msgstr "관심 꺼. 마인드 플레이어가 내 몸을 만지는 건 이제 진저리가 난다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 7226c990-b4ec-858a-c8c8-ebc42ff06fd1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:7226c990-b4ec-858a-c8c8-ebc42ff06fd1
msgctxt "h119fb5b6gd970g4161gb69bg78088847a84d"
msgid "Oh? Perhaps I should start taking notes."
msgstr "오? 받아 적어야겠는걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 750c8093-3bcb-d9b2-fd81-57d1f0cac364
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:750c8093-3bcb-d9b2-fd81-57d1f0cac364
msgctxt "h3b4328cbgff99g46a1gb974g080d68d8e23d"
msgid "*As Omeluum's mind pierces yours, the tadpole pulses with power.*"
msgstr "*오멜룸의 정신이 당신의 것을 꿰뚫자, 올챙이에서 힘의 파동이 느껴집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 7c987965-9ec2-e671-09d0-fdfa33600e43
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:7c987965-9ec2-e671-09d0-fdfa33600e43
msgctxt "h9666c21bgf7e1g4e6ag8d5fge7543f22ab73"
msgid ""
"<i>I understand the potion has put you in a... precarious condition. But I "
"will not respond to such threats.</i>"
msgstr "<i>물약이 당신을... 불안정한 상태에 몰아넣었다는 것은 알지만, 그런 위협에는 반응하지 않겠습니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 7dc41fc9-69e1-4b9a-bba3-ebafdf20b0d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(7) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:7dc41fc9-69e1-4b9a-bba3-ebafdf20b0d6
msgctxt "h74caf2f3g2dfeg453fg9a96gdfa62d8d32ef"
msgid ""
"I never thought we'd bargain with an illithid. Let's hope this ring proves "
"invaluable."
msgstr "일리시드와 거래를 하게 될 줄은 몰랐군. 이 반지에 그만한 가치가 있길 기대해 보자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 7ed85cf8-849b-98de-311a-1040347f6a2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Society.AskedToDrink(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:7ed85cf8-849b-98de-311a-1040347f6a2c
msgctxt "h7282e2aagaf85g4bd2g926ag9a6217976e3f"
msgid ""
"<i>You must drink the entire draught. I can make no promises as to its "
"taste.</i>"
msgstr "<i>이걸 전부 다 드셔야 합니다. 맛은 장담하지 못하겠군요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 7f77a3e3-7025-e127-df87-f303bab4ce22
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFLayer_State_ToldAboutNautiloid(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:7f77a3e3-7025-e127-df87-f303bab4ce22
msgctxt "hfe0ba830gb292g444cg8fe8gd8a7aaee0161"
msgid "<i>A nautiloid? Fascinating. I have never set foot on one myself.</i>"
msgstr "<i>노틸로이드라? 흥미롭군요. 저는 한 번도 올라타본 적이 없는데 말이죠.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 7fb621bb-2028-6e69-b1f4-bb96ca7fbe39
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_HasMet(2) = True
#. TagRule: ASTARION or UNDERDARK
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:7fb621bb-2028-6e69-b1f4-bb96ca7fbe39
msgctxt "h937c155egbde0g40cdg840bg05153ca0cc07"
msgid "<i>I greet you, friend of the dark.</i>"
msgstr "<i>환영합니다, 어둠의 친구여.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 80f15138-3f3f-1ba4-f073-d555248dc30a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:80f15138-3f3f-1ba4-f073-d555248dc30a
msgctxt "h3fdb5c24g3082g4c65gbfa0ga095f65a354c"
msgid ""
"<i>Such an outcome was not in my calculations. There is more to this being "
"than mere stasis.</i>"
msgstr "<i>이런 결과는 제 계산 범위 밖이에요. 그저 정지 상태에 있는 것이 아닌 것 같군요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 81d31ef6-085c-c9ce-2cff-d2b806c1de10
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:81d31ef6-085c-c9ce-2cff-d2b806c1de10
msgctxt "h6e594d76g940dg4ffbgac90gd98848d820e0"
msgid ""
"<i>Every waking hour, I pushed back against its dire hold. My wizardry "
"empowered me.</i>"
msgstr "<i>깨어 있는 내내, 저는 그 끔찍한 지배에 맞서 싸웠습니다. 제 마법이 힘을 주었지요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 827105dd-d148-4a1f-6d7b-2449c8364cd8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_HasMet(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_HasMet(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:827105dd-d148-4a1f-6d7b-2449c8364cd8
msgctxt "h446d2a2dg1229g451fga72fg88447fec2c4c"
msgid "<i>Greetings. What knowledge do you seek?</i>"
msgstr "<i>반갑습니다. 당신은 어떤 지식을 찾고 계십니까?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 83232990-31f1-84d2-a017-6cc9535bcb27
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:83232990-31f1-84d2-a017-6cc9535bcb27
msgctxt "h87bb4700g17f6g4f9agb1cdgc1e291e6192c"
msgid "I have gold. Will that suit?"
msgstr "금화가 좀 있어. 그거면 될까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 833c0acb-83b0-05f5-8979-8371feeb4fd6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:833c0acb-83b0-05f5-8979-8371feeb4fd6
msgctxt "h8df3e7d1gf572g41a2gbcb7g7604a6121ff5"
msgid ""
"We shouldn't cause trouble, Omeluum. There are enough threats down here in "
"the Underdark."
msgstr "문제를 일으켜선 안 돼, 오멜룸. 이미 이 언더다크에는 위협이 넘쳐나니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 8603cb7e-b632-b6c1-df03-5b688006a1ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:8603cb7e-b632-b6c1-df03-5b688006a1ce
msgctxt "h38487b5dg080dg47dbg81d5g17c5e3f64837"
msgid ""
"*The parasite swells with power - more power than you have ever felt before.*"
msgstr "*기생충이 당신이 전에 느껴본 적 없는 힘으로 부풀어 오릅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 861eb54a-aa5f-7bc8-3d6c-ec3b6c1ccace
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:861eb54a-aa5f-7bc8-3d6c-ec3b6c1ccace
msgctxt "h7557afefg22e2g4c24g840fgaa15f6b4e89b"
msgid "I need some time to prepare."
msgstr "준비할 시간이 필요해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 867e10e3-f56a-9dca-7e41-b6ccd174f877
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:867e10e3-f56a-9dca-7e41-b6ccd174f877
msgctxt "hf733d433gb447g4e25g8b6ag86bd766aabeb"
msgid "<i>It is not ideal. The process would surely kill you.</i>"
msgstr "<i>이상적이진 않죠. 그 과정은 당신을 확실한 죽음으로 이끌 것입니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 87087f84-c35c-36e0-7a45-d3d19d4d6f79
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:87087f84-c35c-36e0-7a45-d3d19d4d6f79
msgctxt "hfbbbce55gc39cg4415gbff8g22ee93a98715"
msgid "<i>Are you so keen to know my pain, young gith?</i>"
msgstr "<i>제 고통이 그렇게도 궁금하나요, 어린 기스여?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8b355afa-04a3-a1a2-673f-5be32659e32f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_State_AskedAboutStasis(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:8b355afa-04a3-a1a2-673f-5be32659e32f
msgctxt "ha5a7c0a7ge523g47adgb4cega996e912c8de"
msgid "What happens if that stasis goes away?"
msgstr "그 정지장이 사라진다면 어떻게 되지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 8b4c1a16-18a5-641d-550e-ff21adf8e338
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Society.LearnedCleric(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:8b4c1a16-18a5-641d-550e-ff21adf8e338
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h67de1803g74bcg40a3gba41gcfae3c1709e8"
msgid ""
"I offered her the chance to join the Society, but she refused. Her "
"experiments on sussur bark took priority."
msgstr "그녀에게 광명회에 합류하도록 권유했지만, 거절당했어요. 수서르 껍질에 대한 실험이 더 중요했거든요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8c366608-e8e2-a49e-ab9b-c3e6b0751ec1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:8c366608-e8e2-a49e-ab9b-c3e6b0751ec1
msgctxt "hf6be58d7ge027g48b8g8242gafab38d7422a"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 8d7b7d2d-409b-e249-9ad2-9899781a842b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:8d7b7d2d-409b-e249-9ad2-9899781a842b
msgctxt "h530dcd6bg0811g428dgaeecg9f7d7bfe6cb2"
msgid ""
"<i>It will not remove the larva, but it will limit its influence, both "
"positive and negative.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그게 유충을 제거하진 못하겠지만, 그 영향을 줄여줄 테지요. 긍정적인 것이든, 부정적인 것이든 말입니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8e185b0f-3e6d-e8fd-b648-0aaa450efe1c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:8e185b0f-3e6d-e8fd-b648-0aaa450efe1c
msgctxt "hef4f7585g7cefg4351gbf8bg7850dca69291"
msgid "Bashing my skull is just part of a day's work."
msgstr "내 머리를 때려대는 게 일상이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 8e86a88b-1e28-e965-a719-f1d6b168e21d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_HasMet(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:8e86a88b-1e28-e965-a719-f1d6b168e21d
msgctxt "hf36749a7gfa46g42b6gad63g176b30eea124"
msgid "<i>I greet you, child of the stars.</i>"
msgstr "<i>환영합니다, 별의 아이여.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8fa33b5f-5aa5-b61a-a7bf-9b59d4649eb2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:8fa33b5f-5aa5-b61a-a7bf-9b59d4649eb2
msgctxt "h2a674623gdedeg43bcgad23g54602c5c8eb2"
msgid "Why didn't you mention the ring before this potion debacle?"
msgstr "이 물약이 완전히 실패하기 전에 왜 그 반지 이야기를 꺼내지 않은 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 90a9dd9d-95c1-cdbf-ea43-6b9fa5f75e01
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:90a9dd9d-95c1-cdbf-ea43-6b9fa5f75e01
msgctxt "h97ecb719g63b1g4d10g995eg8cba8f6ec64b"
msgid ""
"*The tadpole spasms, seizes. It's fighting the potion even harder than you "
"are.*"
msgstr "*올챙이가 경련을 일으키며 발작합니다. 당신보다 격렬히 물약에 저항하고 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 913b8194-1c94-12c1-f1e1-78ffee0ee97d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:913b8194-1c94-12c1-f1e1-78ffee0ee97d
msgctxt "h6acded35g8935g406bgab59g3da06013899b"
msgid ""
"<i>But our ambitions eventually splintered. I wished to better the world, "
"and he preferred its rot.</i>"
msgstr "<i>하지만 저희 야망은 결국 갈라지고 말았습니다. 저는 더 나은 세상을 원했지만 그는 썩어가는 세상을 바랐으니까요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 92bea15d-d991-bd0a-be2c-c3576d5298d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:92bea15d-d991-bd0a-be2c-c3576d5298d0
msgctxt "h869b3433g4fe5g41c6gb578gdf33c0fec5aa"
msgid "What aren't you telling me? Is this experiment dangerous?"
msgstr "뭘 알려주지 않고 있는 거지? 이 실험이 위험한 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 934ec15a-c478-ddd8-2b4f-70d24df6b46b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:934ec15a-c478-ddd8-2b4f-70d24df6b46b
msgctxt "h6fda2dd8g5843g4889g8c68g086362cd5dfb"
msgid ""
"<i>You have my deepest apologies. The larva did not care for my "
"intentions.</i>"
msgstr "<i>정말 깊은 사과의 말씀을 드리지요. 유충이 제가 예상했던 것과 다르게 반응하는군요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 94f50d3b-b49b-b562-5aa5-53e83891bb8b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:94f50d3b-b49b-b562-5aa5-53e83891bb8b
msgctxt "h260f038dgd89fg4830gb2cbgbed98ac3a3e5"
msgid ""
"*The potion is disgusting beyond description. The only mercy is that it goes "
"down quickly.*"
msgstr "*물약은 이루 설명할 수 없을 정도로 역겹습니다. 그저 빨리 목을 넘어가길 바랄 수밖에 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 96a2a9e3-6292-af51-0d38-cf5bcc23c927
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:96a2a9e3-6292-af51-0d38-cf5bcc23c927
msgctxt "hb752a98bgf4d9g4b81g912cg56a41c707f3c"
msgid "<i>I required brains, he required souls. A perfect symbiosis.</i>"
msgstr "<i>저에게는 뇌가, 리치에게는 영혼이 필요했습니다. 완벽한 공생 관계였지요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 9789e859-9feb-11ad-1688-87bef6a37f14
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:9789e859-9feb-11ad-1688-87bef6a37f14
msgctxt "hfddfa196g5802g404cg98ceg2d6a47c70c1b"
msgid ""
"The Underdark, of course. Although they are quite rare, and their "
"discovery... perilous."
msgstr "물론, 언더다크에서 찾으실 수 있을 거예요. 그것들이 아주 희귀하고, 또 굉장히... 위험할 수 있긴 하지만 말이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 98c3c79d-5e72-3568-2a38-395e326ccd0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Event_FailedMadness(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:98c3c79d-5e72-3568-2a38-395e326ccd0a
msgctxt "h56482391gccc5g4045g93bbgd4a455252eff"
msgid ""
"*You're sinking - sinking into a starless void that has no end. The "
"connection between mind and body draws thin and tight.*"
msgstr "*당신은 끝없는 심연 속으로 가라앉습니다. 육체와 정신의 연결이 점점 약해지고 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 98c87d06-8dbd-66c1-07bc-e3c1756e92af
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Society.ToldAboutRing(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:98c87d06-8dbd-66c1-07bc-e3c1756e92af
msgctxt "h75fb0802g46b2g4808ga651g050bdc69c3b7"
msgid ""
"<i>I possess a Ring of Mind-Shielding. It prevents elder brains from "
"noticing my presence.</i>"
msgstr "<i>제게 정신 보호의 반지가 있습니다. 이게 있으면 엘더 브레인의 감시망에서 벗어날 수 있죠.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 98d37cec-e998-72d0-b2a2-005eba3f5658
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SavingThrow
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(2) = True
#. TagRule: BERSERKER
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:98d37cec-e998-72d0-b2a2-005eba3f5658
msgctxt "haaf11b12g5974g4e9cg8b79g8d75553a0a30"
msgid "<b><i>No fear. ONLY FURY!</i></b>"
msgstr "<b><i>공포는 없다. 오직 분노뿐이다!</i></b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 98d37cec-e998-72d0-b2a2-005eba3f5658
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SavingThrow
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:98d37cec-e998-72d0-b2a2-005eba3f5658
msgctxt "h07877a1ag7bdbg402dg90e7gf62afd219c75"
msgid "<i>Fear? <b>What's that?</b></i>"
msgstr "<i>두려움? <b>그게 뭐지?</b></i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 98d7629f-9979-b081-1f17-fad20a5a6ad7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:98d7629f-9979-b081-1f17-fad20a5a6ad7
msgctxt "h1b55f492g6dc1g4c57gaf60g16164c310540"
msgid "*An almost childlike joy enters Omeluum's ichor-laced eyes.*"
msgstr "*거의 아이와 같은 기쁨이 오멜룸의 수액 같은 눈에 들어옵니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 9a84d695-7623-67d6-fd87-99196d4551b4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:9a84d695-7623-67d6-fd87-99196d4551b4
msgctxt "h49696f30gc50ag4aa5ga97cg3b3badd8f2a5"
msgid "Omeluum! Are you well?"
msgstr "오멜룸! 자네 괜찮은가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9bb19d06-3493-0952-dc98-934db537b502
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:9bb19d06-3493-0952-dc98-934db537b502
msgctxt "hca8853e6gb125g44eag9c51g1a4015b44e66"
msgid "Oh Gods, what do you mean?"
msgstr "세상에, 방금 그거 무슨 뜻이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 9c42b6a6-879f-ffe8-eb61-57cdc86d631e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:9c42b6a6-879f-ffe8-eb61-57cdc86d631e
msgctxt "h34f0cb19gbf13g42afg8758g9214b39390cc"
msgid "<i>Not a drop left. Very good.</i>"
msgstr "<i>한 방울도 남기지 않으셨군요. 아주 좋아요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9ca3696f-bb17-213a-4dae-887e1c2a16ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_State_GaveMushrooms = False
#.   Quest:
#.      - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Society.AskedToFind(2) = True
#.      - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Society.AskedToDrink(2) = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckHasItemTemplate_5 = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_State_GaveMushrooms = True
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Event_GivePotion(2) = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Society.AskedToDrink(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:9ca3696f-bb17-213a-4dae-887e1c2a16ed
msgctxt "h68df5bd3gb550g4e43ga1cagb623cb44a5db"
msgid "Here. I made a potion of those mushrooms. Will this work?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a08d2748-0c91-7fb3-cbf8-965038368e53
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:a08d2748-0c91-7fb3-cbf8-965038368e53
msgctxt "he1ca4f56g2e1bg45d3g9557gd56cf828c69b"
msgid "Bypass? What kind of alchemy are we talking about?"
msgstr "우회한다고? 그걸 어떤 방법으로 하겠다는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = a44cce01-777f-1ff8-12f6-3958e32f7166
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:a44cce01-777f-1ff8-12f6-3958e32f7166
msgctxt "h288c4832g555eg4e0ag99a7g39de4708f05a"
msgid ""
"<i>Perhaps with time, it can be one brain a year instead of one a "
"month...</i>"
msgstr "<i>시간만 충분하다면, 한달이 아니라 일년에 뇌 하나일수도...</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a4a7bc60-359a-4759-fbe6-71dbf616b328
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:a4a7bc60-359a-4759-fbe6-71dbf616b328
msgctxt "h29beefdbgebb1g4108ga4cbg807e0e4354c8"
msgid ""
"*Dark holes bite at the edges of your vision, but the void cannot draw you "
"in.*"
msgstr "*시야의 가장자리에 어두운 반점이 뚫리기 시작하지만, 공허가 당신을 집어삼킬 수는 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a636da4e-20cb-c460-efb4-63773cd73a87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.      - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Society.GotTheRing(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:a636da4e-20cb-c460-efb4-63773cd73a87
msgctxt "ha16fe5acgea89g4cd2ga3b0gb391e56adeef"
msgid "Let me see your wares."
msgstr "뭘 파는지 보여줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = a6b788ac-dd0f-eafd-5731-bb2a42f7ee30
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Daisy_State_TriggerDaisyMissionStatement = True
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Event_UnlockSkill(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:a6b788ac-dd0f-eafd-5731-bb2a42f7ee30
msgctxt "h4f4ee7d6g8cc8g4d33gb6f6ge94e21d07fa6"
msgid ""
"<i>That larva is like nothing I have ever observed before. Its power is... "
"unsettling.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그 유충은 제가 이전에 봤던 어떤 것과도 달라요. 그것의 힘은... 매우 불안하군요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a7c076dd-3de1-2a8c-eb67-aaaf6770bed4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 20
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:a7c076dd-3de1-2a8c-eb67-aaaf6770bed4
msgctxt "h6b88017dg546ag451fgba31g6c07357395cc"
msgid "Either give me the ring, or I'll run you through."
msgstr "그 반지를 그냥 내놓지 않으면, 네 목숨과 함께 가져가겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a854649b-f504-5e3f-3683-09a988c7f698
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:a854649b-f504-5e3f-3683-09a988c7f698
msgctxt "h60a70c4agd832g4718ga905g701bd0d4c61f"
msgid "<i>Let the terror take you.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공포에 굴복한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a9444d08-32e5-dd7c-d67f-d04d5d07bb39
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:a9444d08-32e5-dd7c-d67f-d04d5d07bb39
msgctxt "h1ad023f4g6698g45e2g859fg68c0aa360e1d"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a973f5e0-af3a-d22b-590d-31bfcca66135
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_State_GaveMushrooms = False
#.   Quest:
#.      - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Society.AskedToFind(2) = True
#.      - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Society.AskedToDrink(2) = False
#.   Script:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_CheckHasMushroomTemplates = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_State_GaveMushrooms = True
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Event_GiveMushrooms(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:a973f5e0-af3a-d22b-590d-31bfcca66135
msgctxt "h2ab2c988g32a8g42cdgbf65ga6ce88c0f6fb"
msgid "I found those mushrooms you were looking for."
msgstr "당신이 찾던 그 버섯들을 찾았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a9d092e5-d732-1476-1127-b0926b9e2453
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:a9d092e5-d732-1476-1127-b0926b9e2453
msgctxt "h70b2c737gfa01g47cdg8121g754faf3b05fc"
msgid "Thanks for the information."
msgstr "정보 고마워."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = aab19206-4690-f9c4-6755-c74a8744233a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:aab19206-4690-f9c4-6755-c74a8744233a
msgctxt "h909d1655gad3fg49a7g82e3g8186a674681b"
msgid ""
"<i>The moment its control shattered, I fled before the colony discovered I "
"had defected.</i>"
msgstr "<i>지배에서 벗어나는 순간, 저는 군락이 제 변절을 알아차리기 전에 도망쳤습니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = aadb9f92-f107-904a-d1a3-cd98fb170902
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:aadb9f92-f107-904a-d1a3-cd98fb170902
msgctxt "h29dafcc3ga9f0g4505g9f09gc518e7d24053"
msgid "<i>I see. I will remain here if you decide otherwise.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그렇군요. 전 여기 있을 테니 생각이 바뀌면 말씀하세요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aadd78a5-c4e6-ed67-d291-2f8f36bc5117
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:aadd78a5-c4e6-ed67-d291-2f8f36bc5117
msgctxt "ha7548449gecccg4b16g800bg3d5162962a67"
msgid "Best way to deal with that sort of hunger, I suppose."
msgstr "그런 허기를 채우는 방법으론 최선이겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ab1e8a92-5744-b42c-22b7-d0ef313e097e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:ab1e8a92-5744-b42c-22b7-d0ef313e097e
msgctxt "h1820d753gaf52g42f7g9ff7geb7015f16e42"
msgid "That doesn't sound ideal."
msgstr "이상적으로 들리지는 않는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = abbf947d-03f2-fe25-1bec-6a65f29578f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:abbf947d-03f2-fe25-1bec-6a65f29578f6
msgctxt "h795396eegfb43g4602gac43gdc52a48aa4ae"
msgid ""
"<i>You may find them in nature, or the nearby cleric's tower. Be cautious - "
"those that have taken root are quite dangerous.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>야생이나 근처에 있는 클레릭의 탑에서 찾으실 수 있을 겁니다. 하지만 주의하세요, 뿌리를 깊게 박고 있는 것들은 꽤 위험할 수 "
"있으니 말이에요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = ac0dc363-8f56-65bd-907a-deeeaa7a2f40
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:ac0dc363-8f56-65bd-907a-deeeaa7a2f40
msgctxt "hd2198497gbf99g48cfgab48g149365634123"
msgid ""
"<i>But be warned. In their natural state, both of these mushrooms can be "
"quite dangerous.</i>"
msgstr "<i>하지만 조심하세요. 자연 상태에서는, 두 버섯 모두 꽤 위험할 수 있으니 말이죠.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = ac8cd50d-bf64-a192-f5b8-0452b6cea01b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_HasMet(2) = True
#.   Quest:
#.      - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Society.ToldAboutRing(2) = True
#.      - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Society.GotTheRing(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:ac8cd50d-bf64-a192-f5b8-0452b6cea01b
msgctxt "ha04f042cg99f6g4c09ga0f1gcfa2f959426b"
msgid "<i>You return. Have you changed your mind about the ring?</i>"
msgstr "<i>돌아오셨군요. 반지에 대한 생각은 바뀌셨습니까?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = adc7902d-dc92-7b56-8a81-8212ce9c30e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:adc7902d-dc92-7b56-8a81-8212ce9c30e6
msgctxt "h9e156ec6gbd9dg4a34g8d19g1fd26329c572"
msgid ""
"She is quite fond of her garden. Lenore has always been a lonely sort - "
"nature was her only companion."
msgstr "그녀는 정원을 가꾸는 걸 꽤 좋아하거든요. 레노어는 언제나 외로운 사람이었죠, 그녀의 동료는 자연뿐이었어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = af0f26d6-052d-d61e-b9ba-7c5840242b76
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_State_MentionedMushrooms(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:af0f26d6-052d-d61e-b9ba-7c5840242b76
msgctxt "h19a68de8g76bfg470fgae65gf8bfc7ec0f57"
msgid "All right. I'll come back when I find the mushrooms."
msgstr "알았어. 버섯을 찾으면 돌아오지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = b16c6a54-dab5-611a-0e65-94e846e6c92a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:b16c6a54-dab5-611a-0e65-94e846e6c92a
msgctxt "h9f63bed2gcddag4f81g85d3g6000ab10b321"
msgid "<i>My apologies. I hope the experience was not too unpleasant.</i>"
msgstr "<i>사과드리죠. 과정이 너무 불쾌하시진 않았기를 바랍니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b5d79643-c071-dbec-e299-f4153230c2e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:b5d79643-c071-dbec-e299-f4153230c2e2
msgctxt "h506f5c34gd417g4f49gb929g11d4adadd802"
msgid ""
"*As Omeluum watches your performance, something stirs in his mind, unusual "
"for an illithid: joy.*"
msgstr ""
"*당신의 공연을 지켜보던 오멜룸의 정신에서, 뭔가 소용돌이치고 있습니다. 일리시드에게는 흔치 않은 감정입니다: 즐거움이 느껴집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = b6ad99fa-3174-2f99-3979-4a618fd5661b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:b6ad99fa-3174-2f99-3979-4a618fd5661b
msgctxt "h55f96064g44b2g4c9dg8f2agc5cb1d39b2f6"
msgid ""
"<i>As the potion influences your mind, you may find yourself acting "
"irrationally. Try and stay focused.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>물약이 당신의 정신에 영향을 끼치기 시작하면, 자신도 모르게 비이성적으로 행동하기 시작할 수 있습니다. 집중하려고 노력해 "
"보세요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = b6de0da2-7a3f-fff1-c0c4-29df00090455
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:b6de0da2-7a3f-fff1-c0c4-29df00090455
msgctxt "h24ee837dgd911g490ega8e7gf6032976fc38"
msgid ""
"<i>I would offer it as a gift, but in truth, the ring is priceless. Is there "
"anything you could offer me in turn?</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>선물로 드리고 싶지만, 사실, 이 반지의 가치는 이루 말할 수 없는 수준입니다. 혹시 대가로 제공해 주실 수 있는 것이 "
"있을까요?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b715813d-7d4b-a451-3996-8797a762b5eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:b715813d-7d4b-a451-3996-8797a762b5eb
msgctxt "h2d9d8951g1de7g49e9g8195gf23c62b39948"
msgid ""
"*The cold blades lose their edge. You are stalwart, turning that tide of "
"fear against itself.*"
msgstr "*얼음 같은 칼날이 무뎌집니다. 당신은 두려움의 흐름을 거스르며 꿋꿋하게 맞서고 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = b7b91f80-d14d-1115-57b2-871af78e85a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:b7b91f80-d14d-1115-57b2-871af78e85a1
msgctxt "h76a5e226g6cfag4662g9f9cg1cb0ee4a09d1"
msgid "<i>Your sanity, however much you possess, should remain intact.</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신의 정신이 얼마나 남아 있는지 모르겠지만, 약으로 손상되지는 않을 겁니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = b80b38ad-8129-f25b-9e25-7517d0d1e0e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:b80b38ad-8129-f25b-9e25-7517d0d1e0e2
msgctxt "h424f97c4g235eg4f1dgabb5g31531b3ce803"
msgid ""
"<i>It holds far more power than it should. For the larva to react to my "
"manipulations in such a way is beyond my ken.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>본디 지니고 있어야 할 것보다 훨씬 큰 힘을 지니고 있군요. 유충이 제 조작에 그런 방식으로 반응하는 것은 제 지식을 넘어서는 "
"일이에요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = b8b3f692-7821-848c-1a7d-b0c9198ddf9f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:b8b3f692-7821-848c-1a7d-b0c9198ddf9f
msgctxt "h0a3a33e5g2183g424fgb9ecgefdb1bb62f91"
msgid "<i>A bold strategy. It is not many that can defeat their own minds.</i>"
msgstr "<i>대담한 전략이군요. 자신의 정신을 이겨낼 수 있는 이들은 많지 않은데 말이죠.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = b9f348f8-620b-4483-cfe2-ce9af4711879
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:b9f348f8-620b-4483-cfe2-ce9af4711879
msgctxt "h8d4aafd3gae08g45bbgb596g3549fdbba7bd"
msgid ""
"<i>They were our warships during the greatest eras of the Illithid Empire. "
"We ruled the entire Astral Plane from their decks.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>그것들은 일리시드 제국이 전성기를 누리는 동안 전함으로 사용되었습니다. 우리는 그 함교 위에서 아스트랄 차원 전체를 "
"지배했었죠.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = ba577189-0478-42ec-a289-1d866df920e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:ba577189-0478-42ec-a289-1d866df920e9
msgctxt "hb31178cdg291bg441fg8ab1gc9ec4a0287f2"
msgid ""
"That thing better work. If it doesn't, I doubt you'll be in any position to "
"complain..."
msgstr "제대로 돼야 할 거야. 그렇지 않다면, 당신은 불평할 처지가 아니게 될테니까..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = bb641ba7-7214-83e3-fc5f-a08d5bc54006
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Event_FailedDazed(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:bb641ba7-7214-83e3-fc5f-a08d5bc54006
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h76d23886g26fag4407gb73fgdfa249aa3df8"
msgid ""
"*A wave of psychic force batters your mind, cruel and calculating. You are "
"nothing to it. You are <i>small</i>.*"
msgstr ""
"*잔인하고 계산적인 사이오닉 물결이 당신의 정신을 강타합니다. 그에 비하면 당신은 아무것도 아닙니다. 당신은 <i>작은 존재에 "
"불과합니다.</i>*<i></i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bc2fd367-2b61-882d-9b3e-4842be7759c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:bc2fd367-2b61-882d-9b3e-4842be7759c0
msgctxt "h35e2bf15g77b9g404dga40eg5bba6bafa5c8"
msgid "<i>Stare into the swirling abyss.</i>"
msgstr "<i>요동치는 심연 속을 응시한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bc3a401d-04ce-61a9-f13d-0b5a4f94d519
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:bc3a401d-04ce-61a9-f13d-0b5a4f94d519
msgctxt "h7c4853d0g8677g4d06g8c3bg56100dfcc3f8"
msgid "I assumed as much..."
msgstr "그럴 줄 알았어..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = bd5c6570-9df5-48f6-9c21-92b494fa7205
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(8) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(8) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:bd5c6570-9df5-48f6-9c21-92b494fa7205
msgctxt "h00b0fbdagf123g45f5g90b2g3e0147982e16"
msgid "That could mean any number of things."
msgstr "그건 여러가지를 의미할 수 있겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bee8ed73-3992-cb48-1d10-6a1a33d3d91a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SavingThrow
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:bee8ed73-3992-cb48-1d10-6a1a33d3d91a
msgctxt "h9ef958d1g4c83g4dcdga93fgc85fd4c745d5"
msgid "<i>Use meditation to clear your mind.</i>"
msgstr "<i>명상을 통해 마음을 비운다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c05fa0f7-6809-2f94-4c2a-d1cc1e56cda1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:c05fa0f7-6809-2f94-4c2a-d1cc1e56cda1
msgctxt "hdd8077bcgaf99g40d1g882cge6e4429f0625"
msgid "Good to know. I have other priorities right now."
msgstr "잘됐네. 마침 급한 일이 있었거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = c0f3b690-aabc-3948-84a8-37e38e97d6c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:c0f3b690-aabc-3948-84a8-37e38e97d6c4
msgctxt "hda34e6a4gbdb7g42bdga74fg10350dd08cf1"
msgid ""
"<i>Very well. I abhor violence, and would rather prevent it where "
"possible.</i>"
msgstr "<i>알겠습니다. 저는 폭력을 혐오하고 가능하다면 막는 편입니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = c1058f2c-caf1-b3b4-f6f9-1e30793d012d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:c1058f2c-caf1-b3b4-f6f9-1e30793d012d
msgctxt "hca192592g3c2fg4a1cg93ffg40412437d488"
msgid ""
"<i>You would not survive the outcome. The tadpole must be completely "
"crushed, and your skull along with it.</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신은 그 결과를 견디지 못할 겁니다. 기생충은 완전히 분쇄되어야 합니다, 당신의 두개골도 함께 말이죠.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = c18dfd36-e199-5a9b-c7c8-923fa8150c91
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_HasMet(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:c18dfd36-e199-5a9b-c7c8-923fa8150c91
msgctxt "h02678795g901fg4a45gadd2gf11191cf3c7a"
msgid "<i>I greet you, sun child.</i>"
msgstr "<i>환영합니다. 태양의 아이여.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c32fe192-7eb2-f2c3-d150-f21e0b0dddbe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_State_ConnectionPerformed = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:c32fe192-7eb2-f2c3-d150-f21e0b0dddbe
msgctxt "hed593ad2g3b2cg4c1bg80a4g93ec992cafe8"
msgid "I'd like to learn more about the tadpole."
msgstr "올챙이에 대해서 더 알고 싶습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c33ff4aa-d09f-930e-0a92-721e7fa074ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.      - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Society.AskedToFind(2) = False
#.      - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Society.ToldAboutNullify(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Inclusion_Scholar(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:c33ff4aa-d09f-930e-0a92-721e7fa074ea
msgctxt "h8d8249c8g7bb4g42beg8595g1f842cd6d02a"
msgid "I changed my mind. What do you need to experiment on the tadpole?"
msgstr "생각이 바뀌었어. 기생충에 실험을 하려면 어떤 게 필요하지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c6198fb4-f41d-fa44-3226-b73ae76d39ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:c6198fb4-f41d-fa44-3226-b73ae76d39ab
msgctxt "hfeff2102gc5fag4002g9512g0a1a64dd876c"
msgid "So I went through all this and the tadpole's still lodged in my brain?"
msgstr "그래서 이 모든 걸 견뎠는데, 아직도 내 머릿속에 기생충이 박혀있다는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c66ea81e-9b67-c646-b611-1f88e06bd3b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:c66ea81e-9b67-c646-b611-1f88e06bd3b3
msgctxt "he56ede30gce2cg4879g850fg9902a4cffb29"
msgid "<i>Swallow your disgust and permit the</i> ghaik's <i>search.</i>"
msgstr "<i>역겨움을 참고 게이크가</i> <i>수색하는 것을 허용한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = c9f1415c-9e54-2c73-aa49-262ad9e1e958
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:c9f1415c-9e54-2c73-aa49-262ad9e1e958
msgctxt "h0499a3cdg26bag4b12gb247ge62b1a82cfb4"
msgid ""
"The southwest, when I last saw her. Although her tower does have a "
"tendency... to move."
msgstr "제가 그녀를 마지막으로 본 것은, 남서쪽이었어요. 비록 그녀가 지내는 탑의 위치가... 자주 바뀌는 경향이 있긴 하지만요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = cab37622-2502-5b04-d79e-ec7cfc14d715
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:cab37622-2502-5b04-d79e-ec7cfc14d715
msgctxt "h245617e4gcc7eg47ffgb15fg985d2a2975f4"
msgid "<i>What shall you offer in exchange? </i>"
msgstr "<i>그 대가로 뭘 제공하시겠습니까?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cbee36eb-b729-0276-eaf4-a660f538bf8c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SavingThrow
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(2) = False
#.      - CLERIC(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:cbee36eb-b729-0276-eaf4-a660f538bf8c
msgctxt "h5c4d197ag236ag4aa3g82b5g18fe964a461a"
msgid "<i>Resist the panic from within.</i>"
msgstr "<i>내면의 공황에 저항한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = cd81c7fe-5569-b3f1-1297-a155484c3e2b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:cd81c7fe-5569-b3f1-1297-a155484c3e2b
msgctxt "h7ced46b9gb1c2g4f00gb7b2g55bf0518ee35"
msgid ""
"<i>Your flesh has been burrowed into. Your flesh has been excavated. A "
"tadpole need not tunnel when they greet their host.</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신의 살점이 파였습니다. 파헤쳐졌고요. 올챙이는 숙주를 맞이할 때 살을 뚫을 필요가 없거든요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cd9ac954-c428-7a5a-224c-6e47db478bf2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:cd9ac954-c428-7a5a-224c-6e47db478bf2
msgctxt "h05171473g4880g468dg9bfag7315d69e8e05"
msgid "Damn it all, why can't I remember?"
msgstr "젠장할, 왜 기억이 나질 않는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = cda326c1-e587-eecd-c7bd-b6df4b585509
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_State_ConnectionAsked = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:cda326c1-e587-eecd-c7bd-b6df4b585509
msgctxt "h0ae2678cgae8bg4592gb631gd967e0baedfd"
msgid "<i>Open your mind to me, friend. Let us see what lurks within.</i>"
msgstr "<i>마음을 열어보시오, 친구여. 그 안에 무엇이 숨어있는지 봅시다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = cdee7c81-c7bf-2f90-183e-b48f1c4f4d0f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:cdee7c81-c7bf-2f90-183e-b48f1c4f4d0f
msgctxt "h6629227cg6027g4b47g9bb0gad6e42bf3af0"
msgid ""
"<i>A tincture distilled from a collection of rare mushrooms. They have "
"subtle psionic influence.</i>"
msgstr "<i>희귀한 버섯 몇 가지를 섞어 만든 팅크제가 있으면 될 거예요. 그것들은 미묘한 사이오닉 효과가 있으니 말이죠.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ce4c89b9-a589-03b6-cc80-9031a3ab9cc6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:ce4c89b9-a589-03b6-cc80-9031a3ab9cc6
msgctxt "hf586f7fcg039ag4884g8b77g887e6ac821dd"
msgid "*The parasite in your mind quiets, pleased with itself.*"
msgstr "*스스로 만족한 듯, 머릿속의 기생충이 조용해집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = d042d0c4-372d-bf8c-34fb-4f54dd5f2b4c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_State_Hostile = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:d042d0c4-372d-bf8c-34fb-4f54dd5f2b4c
msgctxt "hbf3befe9ga2f1g443bg99feg573f8254ed82"
msgid "<i>I will not reward your hostility. Begone!</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신의 적개심에 보상을 주진 않겠습니다. 떠나세요!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d0954c9e-1b0b-a4df-5b3f-0c2e320fdd10
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:d0954c9e-1b0b-a4df-5b3f-0c2e320fdd10
msgctxt "he4f01d34g60dag4ae5g8a27g1183b27cd8a3"
msgid "Where does this Lenore live?"
msgstr "이 레노어라는 자는 어디에 살지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d0afc2e8-8666-ebf8-0b5b-9f401fdbf29d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Event_FailedPoisoned(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:d0afc2e8-8666-ebf8-0b5b-9f401fdbf29d
msgctxt "h25ecad21gfc3eg41f6gba75gefeafb8b16c6"
msgid ""
"*The acidic liquid tightens your throat, burning on the way down. It's a "
"bolt of agony straight to your stomach.*"
msgstr "*산성 용액이 목을 조여 내려가며, 타는 듯한 느낌이 전해집니다. 마치 뱃속으로 직행하는 고통의 화살 같습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = d182e56b-56b1-5bfc-4aea-91d4636ab823
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:d182e56b-56b1-5bfc-4aea-91d4636ab823
msgctxt "hd66c6cb1g82dag40e1gb756gefb41509c63c"
msgid ""
"<i>It will lower the psionic defences around the larva. If I cannot remove "
"it, I may still be able to tell you more about its origin.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>유충을 감싸고 있는 사이오닉 방어막을 잠시 해제해 줄 겁니다. 제거할 수 없더라도, 그 기원에 대해 더 알아낼 수는 있을지도 "
"모르지요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d3be4b80-c730-5f3d-2830-873567cfb28c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_State_AskedAboutExtraction(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:d3be4b80-c730-5f3d-2830-873567cfb28c
msgctxt "h26f07f99g00dfg45bbgb29bg8e32735b17f7"
msgid "Can you extract the tadpole?"
msgstr "올챙이를 빼줄 수 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = d4150cd3-0211-5cf7-02f5-219c14b056e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Event_SoldRing(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:d4150cd3-0211-5cf7-02f5-219c14b056e6
msgctxt "hfff8505dg78a6g419aga147g40dec59f2fa4"
msgid "<i>If you wish to acquire the ring later, you need only ask.</i>"
msgstr "<i>언제라도 반지를 받고 싶다면, 말씀만 하시지요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d75098ea-f15b-580d-3e5a-adf0938089ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:d75098ea-f15b-580d-3e5a-adf0938089ff
msgctxt "h138c3328gb1c0g43a5g9f2fgb5db77b0d056"
msgid ""
"*It surges and twists, lashing out against that which would dare to intrude.*"
msgstr "*감히 침범하려는 자에게 분노를 표출하며 솟구치고 일그러집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = d945ea83-ed42-d590-0e12-6b16638953b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_State_MentionedMushrooms(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:d945ea83-ed42-d590-0e12-6b16638953b7
msgctxt "he108547egb592g4921g8656g805d2195ee79"
msgid ""
"<i>The occupant was obsessed with magical plants. Sussur bark and the like. "
"But no matter their source, I will take the mushrooms.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>그곳의 거주자는 마법적인 식물에 집착했지요. 수서르 나무와 같은 것들 말입니다. 하지만 출처가 어떻게 되었든, 버섯은 "
"받겠습니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = db4915d6-07bc-e864-abe5-5bdd8bd31d00
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:db4915d6-07bc-e864-abe5-5bdd8bd31d00
msgctxt "h3d65fac1gbb9bg48f6ga960ga9672cc8772a"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = db5bba2a-9d4d-862e-01d3-e0fef3ed5f15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_State_MindFlayerFeeding(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_State_MindFlayerFeeding(2) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:db5bba2a-9d4d-862e-01d3-e0fef3ed5f15
msgctxt "hd3691799g2083g42d3gbd8fg7535aab53865"
msgid "How do you survive? Your kind must feast on sentient minds."
msgstr "어떻게 생존하는 거지? 네 종은 지능을 가진 뇌를 먹고 살아야 하잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = db5bba2a-9d4d-862e-01d3-e0fef3ed5f15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_State_MindFlayerFeeding(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_State_MindFlayerFeeding(2) = True
#. TagRule: BARD
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:db5bba2a-9d4d-862e-01d3-e0fef3ed5f15
msgctxt "hcf612c4eg392ag433fga37bge2878d734636"
msgid "So, are the tales of slavering, brain-lusting mind flayers exaggerated?"
msgstr "그럼, 노예를 부리고, 뇌를 탐닉하는 마인드 플레이어 이야기는 과장된 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = db5bba2a-9d4d-862e-01d3-e0fef3ed5f15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_State_MindFlayerFeeding(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_State_MindFlayerFeeding(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:db5bba2a-9d4d-862e-01d3-e0fef3ed5f15
msgctxt "h46a71839g8106g4171gb9b0ge28906abb69e"
msgid "How do you survive? Don't you need... brains?"
msgstr "어떻게 살아있는 거지? 뇌를... 먹고 살아야 하는 거 아닌가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dcefbd25-4a62-5efa-0845-76e47d592d18
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:dcefbd25-4a62-5efa-0845-76e47d592d18
msgctxt "hdf048bb2g4c03g482cg8712g5b09a76f8527"
msgid "Never mind. I'm not in the mood for sharing."
msgstr "됐어. 지금은 뭘 알려줄 기분이 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = dd9cbc55-f6c1-292a-46ea-5a8fafc66487
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:dd9cbc55-f6c1-292a-46ea-5a8fafc66487
msgctxt "h4251681dg853eg4ec0g8288g11e10590bea9"
msgid ""
"<i>Yet that power may grow beyond your control. I have another intermediate "
"solution, if you are in need.</i>"
msgstr "<i>하지만 그 힘은 당신의 통제를 넘어설지도 모릅니다. 당신이 필요하다면, 제게 다른 중간 해결책이 있어요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = de7c846b-c787-046e-5c91-071ad1484fe0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_State_AskedAboutEscape(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_State_AskedAboutEscape(2) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:de7c846b-c787-046e-5c91-071ad1484fe0
msgctxt "h4b501181g9147g4deagb4b7g8caa38bf8f2d"
msgid "How could a <i>ghaik</i> ever leave its colony?"
msgstr "어떻게 <i>게이크가</i> 엘더 브레인에게서 벗어난 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = de7c846b-c787-046e-5c91-071ad1484fe0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_State_AskedAboutEscape(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_State_AskedAboutEscape(2) = True
#. TagRule: BARD
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:de7c846b-c787-046e-5c91-071ad1484fe0
msgctxt "h1c79f8b6g03d6g4120ga61dg8b17975e6cbf"
msgid ""
"You've certainly got a lot more individual ambition than your kin. Why is "
"that?"
msgstr "당신은 동족과 달리 분명한 개인의 야망이 있군. 어째서지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = de7c846b-c787-046e-5c91-071ad1484fe0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_State_AskedAboutEscape(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_State_AskedAboutEscape(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:de7c846b-c787-046e-5c91-071ad1484fe0
msgctxt "h40b8d3bbg6240g4fe8g855eg689cb60a53a8"
msgid "How did you escape your colony?"
msgstr "군락에서는 어떻게 탈출한 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = def06fbd-dc15-aa80-b67f-32adc8b02f34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Event_PersuadedNautiloid = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:def06fbd-dc15-aa80-b67f-32adc8b02f34
msgctxt "haec0020egda4eg4984gaefcg1e596a194741"
msgid ""
"<i>What a brilliant experience. To feel one step closer to my ancestors is a "
"fine gift indeed.</i>"
msgstr "<i>아주 눈부신 경험이군요. 제 선조들에 한 발 더 다가가는 것은 분명 좋은 선물이지요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = df8f2720-be96-d3ef-5d0d-ab52de073287
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:df8f2720-be96-d3ef-5d0d-ab52de073287
msgctxt "h737a1ebdgf3b3g4c11gba79g808377770b4a"
msgid ""
"*Drawing on a lifetime of practice, you centre yourself. Your body is an "
"anchor, implacable and calm.*"
msgstr "*평생의 수련을 바탕으로 중심을 잡습니다. 당신의 육체는 흔들리지 않고 평온한 닻과 같습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = e1d239aa-19cf-36f6-8dd9-8ef6c0cfbf11
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:e1d239aa-19cf-36f6-8dd9-8ef6c0cfbf11
msgctxt "ha8f797bbg4a9fg4af3g9897g2f7ee254fc87"
msgid ""
"<i>Your conflict is with one I have never met. This ring protects me. I "
"cannot surrender it for free.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>당신의 분쟁은 제가 한 번도 만난 적 없는 이들과의 것입니다. 이 반지가 저를 보호하고 있어요. 공짜로 넘길 수는 없죠.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e1f769cb-12ef-6bf6-5fd7-8595139a95e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SavingThrow
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:e1f769cb-12ef-6bf6-5fd7-8595139a95e9
msgctxt "h5ccd3b03g9d05g4d14g9e25gb528ec08d0cc"
msgid "<i>Draw on your willpower and resist.</i>"
msgstr "<i>의지를 모아 저항한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = e20acd85-03fd-2a61-7368-a4cd9cc624b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Inclusion_End_Scholar(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:e20acd85-03fd-2a61-7368-a4cd9cc624b9
msgctxt "h5222ab77ge0b2g4660g8992gdcdfc977ae68"
msgid "<i>May your travels be safe and swift.</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신의 여정이 안전하고 신속하게 이루어지기를.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = e4422acb-90e6-bb62-73d6-f6fec58166a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:e4422acb-90e6-bb62-73d6-f6fec58166a0
msgctxt "hd9cbab73g8542g4a6agae4fg343052ef4fe0"
msgid ""
"<i>In nature, of course. But I imagine the nearby cleric's tower may also "
"grow them.</i>"
msgstr "<i>자연에서 찾는다면, 그렇겠죠. 하지만 제가 알기로 근처에 있는 클레릭의 탑에서 그걸 기를 거예요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = e60855ba-f18f-037c-e1bc-1bbc9e498705
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Inclusion_Scholar(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:e60855ba-f18f-037c-e1bc-1bbc9e498705
msgctxt "hb0d348bag19d9g4081ga9a3g9841c50bfe83"
msgid "<i>Ah!</i>"
msgstr "<i>아!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = e7b1fcae-8580-c6bb-a5c4-de42f07a9598
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:e7b1fcae-8580-c6bb-a5c4-de42f07a9598
msgctxt "hbb9b963eg1632g43b2g842cg5f97253bf398"
msgid "I thought it was always agonising, Omeluum."
msgstr "고통스러운 것은 언제나 그렇다고 생각했는데 말이야, 오멜룸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = e7c54811-5ab1-a683-000a-f8c0cdd37251
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_State_MentionedMushrooms(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:e7c54811-5ab1-a683-000a-f8c0cdd37251
msgctxt "h53398e56gcc2dg41bfga01egd7903a9d22e4"
msgid ""
"Hm. I imagine Lenore would have them in her possession. She served Mystra as "
"a cleric."
msgstr "흠. 아마도 레노어라면 그것들을 지니고 있었을지도요. 그녀는 클레릭으로서 미스트라를 섬겼으니 말이에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = e7f95dd5-6cb5-efe5-d9e9-2f470d7d8a0d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:e7f95dd5-6cb5-efe5-d9e9-2f470d7d8a0d
msgctxt "h90134c6cg52c1g4a63gb3b7g637e45414e27"
msgid "<i>Well, yes, but that wasn't my point.</i>"
msgstr "<i>물론, 맞는 말이지만, 제 요점은 그게 아니어요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ea1ef049-3ec8-2d46-bee0-d15994eb885a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:ea1ef049-3ec8-2d46-bee0-d15994eb885a
msgctxt "h9ab1f095gb990g44eeg8001gad9a49a9b130"
msgid ""
"That potion of yours could have killed me. The tadpole almost did the same."
msgstr "당신이 준 그 물약 때문에 거의 죽을 뻔했어. 기생충도 내게 같은 짓을 했고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = eb02aa72-57f9-3ec4-ab8c-ea42005452b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_State_AskedAboutStasis(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:eb02aa72-57f9-3ec4-ab8c-ea42005452b1
msgctxt "hf110e9f3g2f51g42b8g8907g41b6b13df204"
msgid ""
"<i>I can only theorise, but I suspect your transformation would be both "
"agonising and instantaneous.</i>"
msgstr "<i>이론일 뿐이지만, 그렇게 된다면 당신의 변이가 아주 고통스러움과 동시에 즉각적으로 일어날지도 모르겠군요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = ecdc6b11-2db5-4c7b-bedd-65d2aa750f23
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(6) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:ecdc6b11-2db5-4c7b-bedd-65d2aa750f23
msgctxt "h36d3ac6dg252ag4742gab61gc836925b28ca"
msgid ""
"A pretty thing. And at least it offers us some protection from the tadpole."
msgstr "예쁜 물건이군. 그리고 최소한 올챙이로부터 약간의 보호도 제공하고 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ed8490f2-868e-9ffa-10ad-a54926974518
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:ed8490f2-868e-9ffa-10ad-a54926974518
msgctxt "h579cb34cg9434g4f03g8828g6b0285d45eb7"
msgid ""
"*Fear pierces your mind like knives of ice. The parasite digs deeper, as if "
"it means to hollow out your skull.*"
msgstr ""
"*얼음 칼날 같은 두려움이 당신의 정신을 꿰뚫습니다. 기생충이 마치 당신의 머릿속을 텅 비워버리기라도 하겠다는 듯, 더 깊이 파고듭니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = ee2f0296-bc5d-17b5-2392-38841a9d5106
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_State_AskedAboutExtraction(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:ee2f0296-bc5d-17b5-2392-38841a9d5106
msgctxt "hb82a84b7g69bfg4e93gb053g73fa3f6528b3"
msgid ""
"<i>No. It appears to be shielded from physical and magical influence.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그럴 순 없어요. 보아하니, 물리적이면서 동시에 마법적인 영향으로 보호받고 있는 것 같습니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f04dfa41-3eb5-a796-3a5a-882636053022
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:f04dfa41-3eb5-a796-3a5a-882636053022
msgctxt "hf8712226g37c3g46f5g83cdgd94c5a026e4b"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = f0a1f45b-f8bd-9091-bbdd-c2b93aabf67e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_State_AskedAboutStasis(2) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_DARK_URGE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:f0a1f45b-f8bd-9091-bbdd-c2b93aabf67e
msgctxt "haf16ce4eg4becg483eg88bbg2cfc69811d11"
msgid ""
"<i>Moreover, the cranium has undergone severe trauma. It is a miracle the "
"brain functions at all. Extraction would risk much.</i>"
msgstr "<i>게다가, 두개골에 심각한 외상을 입었군요. 뇌가 기능한다는 것 자체가 기적이에요. 추출 과정은 매우 위험할 겁니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = f0a1f45b-f8bd-9091-bbdd-c2b93aabf67e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_State_AskedAboutStasis(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:f0a1f45b-f8bd-9091-bbdd-c2b93aabf67e
msgctxt "hdb32c1eag5a61g44b0gadaag8166a54ae56b"
msgid ""
"<i>And even without the shield, the extraction would involve severe cranial "
"trauma.</i>"
msgstr "<i>게다가, 그 보호 없이도, 추출 과정은 당신의 두개골에 심각한 외상을 남기게 될 겁니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f133d30f-71ec-0799-954b-7ffa3449006b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:f133d30f-71ec-0799-954b-7ffa3449006b
msgctxt "h9ac27429g04feg447bgbb11g8ab7d1311e4a"
msgid "All that probing was useless in the end."
msgstr "결국 그 모든 조사가 아무 의미도 없었군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = f4841dd2-5370-3a11-39b9-aeb1e30b381f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:f4841dd2-5370-3a11-39b9-aeb1e30b381f
msgctxt "h104f82b1gbe00g4682ga8daga1d2065672fa"
msgid "<i>And I must admit, I was curious to study the tadpole myself.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그리고 솔직히 말씀드리자면, 그 기생충을 직접 연구하고 싶었습니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = f49a2123-a586-c7a3-0cf5-38a41ffa9cd0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Event_SoldRing(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:f49a2123-a586-c7a3-0cf5-38a41ffa9cd0
msgctxt "h8319e887g1315g4cf8g9e2fg58fb51488484"
msgid "<i>May it serve you as well as it has served me.</i>"
msgstr "<i>제게 도움이 되었던 만큼 당신에게도 도움이 되길 바라지요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = f658441e-6091-0496-236e-7417f8bdd0fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:f658441e-6091-0496-236e-7417f8bdd0fa
msgctxt "ha4b5ec8dge785g412ega146gc3440d2fdc6d"
msgid ""
"<i>That... is true. And I cannot imagine many other mind flayers will offer "
"restitution.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그것은... 사실이지요. 그리고 다른 마인드 플레이어가 배상을 해줄 것이라는 것은 상상할 수도 없습니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = f6f8d9b7-aa0c-bf83-9aeb-4f8256831191
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:f6f8d9b7-aa0c-bf83-9aeb-4f8256831191
msgctxt "h66d0ddf8g0a87g4a74g9594g417d93e77971"
msgid ""
"<i>The design was lost when the gith rebelled and ended our dominion.</i>"
msgstr "<i>하지만 기스의 반란이 일어나고, 그들이 우리 통치를 끝내면서, 원대한 계획도 사라지고 말았습니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = f7b1f4d7-c02b-47a8-2524-ce5b9a4f8642
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_State_HasRing(0) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Event_GiveRing(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:f7b1f4d7-c02b-47a8-2524-ce5b9a4f8642
msgctxt "h961f5370g8bc5g4d43g8de1gbf8c76e5703e"
msgid "<i>Here. It is yours.</i>"
msgstr "<i>여기. 가져가세요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = f9a7c051-dd80-94aa-b705-01c4556578b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Society.AskedToFind(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:f9a7c051-dd80-94aa-b705-01c4556578b2
msgctxt "he9b154cfg1937g40d4ga68eg9eeeb0738ecb"
msgid ""
"<i>Timmasks cause confusion in those that approach them. The tongue is... "
"self-explanatory.</i>"
msgstr "<i>티마스크는 근처에 혼란을 유발합니다. 그리고 혓바닥은... 이름을 보면 유추하실 수 있겠죠.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fa28b29f-758a-3eb8-7a95-c96d70adf1ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SavingThrow
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:fa28b29f-758a-3eb8-7a95-c96d70adf1ab
msgctxt "h5ae90970g7d88g4b27g9485g190054835270"
msgid "<i>Focus on the present, not the illusions.</i>"
msgstr "<i>환영이 아닌 현재에 집중한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = fa551606-4d3a-53f5-52dc-d7771090cfcf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:fa551606-4d3a-53f5-52dc-d7771090cfcf
msgctxt "h1131f88agf131g4cf4g95e7gda5cf3b3dafa"
msgid ""
"<i>Unfortunately, beyond the assessment of my own kind, I cannot speculate "
"what has passed through your cerebrum.</i>"
msgstr "<i>안타깝게도, 저만의 고찰 외에 당신의 대뇌를 통과한 것이 무엇인지는 추측할 수 없습니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fa737631-79c7-3b9e-6e4c-882fdda678b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: PALADIN
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:fa737631-79c7-3b9e-6e4c-882fdda678b1
msgctxt "h8dd9e18ag7337g47cbga9cag3184b737c62e"
msgid "How severe? I have healing magic."
msgstr "얼마나 심각하지? 치유 마법을 좀 알고 있는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fa737631-79c7-3b9e-6e4c-882fdda678b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:fa737631-79c7-3b9e-6e4c-882fdda678b1
msgctxt "h2c32454bg440dg4d71ga4b9ge4358f5039ad"
msgid "How severe? I have healing magic."
msgstr "얼마나 심각하지? 치유 마법을 좀 알고 있는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fc6ed3eb-2198-2b10-cecc-4787e3a92a07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:fc6ed3eb-2198-2b10-cecc-4787e3a92a07
msgctxt "hd69c2e24g4dc7g4404g865bg2acd513543e3"
msgid "Why would a cleric have a bunch of dangerous mushrooms?"
msgstr "클레릭이 왜 그런 위험한 버섯을 잔뜩 가지고 있는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fe1fc62a-4b60-c247-4d1c-9b422272a98d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_State_AskedAboutStasis(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:fe1fc62a-4b60-c247-4d1c-9b422272a98d
msgctxt "h1e043a6eg779eg4a8dga29bg6f5cb7c8b902"
msgid "Isn't the stasis why the tadpole hasn't killed me yet?"
msgstr "그 정지장 덕분에 아직 그 올챙이가 날 죽이지 않은 것 아닌가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = fe3e1dc7-86d3-e750-cd88-bd4d7774a6c1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer:fe3e1dc7-86d3-e750-cd88-bd4d7774a6c1
msgctxt "h81eff086g1d8eg4bafg9debgeb65c95679b7"
msgid "*Omeluum turns away to prepare the potion, lost in its own musings.*"
msgstr "*오멜룸이 뒤돌아 물약을 준비하며, 혼자만의 사색에 잠겨 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 001c7eed-004c-b84b-006a-42ffda445602
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:001c7eed-004c-b84b-006a-42ffda445602
msgctxt "h8be6fc71g875dg4affgabe7g6e7b6a52e36d"
msgid ""
"You scoundrels attacked these peaceful villagers completely unprovoked! "
"Filthy, dim-witted..."
msgstr "너희 악당들은 이 평화로운 마을을 아무 이유도 없이 공격했다! 추잡하고 멍청한 놈들 같으니..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 023fb1e1-daca-7e13-47f4-4c1bd961d622
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:023fb1e1-daca-7e13-47f4-4c1bd961d622
msgctxt "hecea6634gc4d5g4378g8e0eg688640931a0d"
msgid "<i>Omeluum!</i>"
msgstr "<i>오멜룸!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 0357d301-9d53-e1f5-c103-5b5a1ad76671
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_State_AllowedTrading = True
#. TagRule: GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:0357d301-9d53-e1f5-c103-5b5a1ad76671
msgctxt "hfa50d459g2098g4c05ga67eg2760a0f24a65"
msgid ""
"The feeling is mutual, friend. I have only passing familiarity with astral "
"travellers."
msgstr "나도 마찬가지입니다, 친구여. 아스트랄 차원의 여행자들과는 스쳐 지나간 적만 있을 뿐이지요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 0357d301-9d53-e1f5-c103-5b5a1ad76671
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_State_AllowedTrading = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:0357d301-9d53-e1f5-c103-5b5a1ad76671
msgctxt "h0b86eed2g4d53g45f4g9efdge16a71c125c6"
msgid ""
"The feeling is mutual, friend. I have only passing familiarity with the "
"surface races."
msgstr "나도 마찬가지입니다, 친구여. 지상의 종족과는 스쳐 지나간 적만 있을 뿐이지요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 0371ec37-cba0-352a-97a8-a203eed992db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:0371ec37-cba0-352a-97a8-a203eed992db
msgctxt "hcf3299d0g1084g4d2fgaab1g79edbf1ef1d1"
msgid ""
"Then you've come to the right place. The hybridisation among fungi in this "
"circle is truly unique."
msgstr "그렇다면 딱 맞는 곳에 오셨군요. 이 공동체에서 발생하는 균류 간 교배 현상은 정말로 독특한 것이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 05ad8d0a-b049-2fe3-4aa3-fd3496ef1a25
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_State_ConnectionRefused = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:05ad8d0a-b049-2fe3-4aa3-fd3496ef1a25
msgctxt "h7090a8fdg17aeg407bga14bg0a7d480df27d"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 06161201-d3ff-9b71-a0c0-4c14f7990561
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_State_Hostile = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:06161201-d3ff-9b71-a0c0-4c14f7990561
msgctxt "hd50c9a12g403eg4a7egad56gaf0d692233c2"
msgid "The myconids wouldn't appreciate us fighting here. I'll listen."
msgstr "마이코니드들은 우리가 여기서 싸우는 걸 좋아하지 않겠지. 얘기해 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 0655987b-d50d-3427-3518-5be391340983
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:0655987b-d50d-3427-3518-5be391340983
msgctxt "hf22217cdgbf7dg4f2fga804g409124fc6111"
msgid ""
"You were infected by an illithid tadpole? It's a miracle you're still intact!"
msgstr "일리시드 올챙이에 감염되었다고요? 아직 멀쩡하다니 기적이군요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 08890d00-ee93-65d5-9e23-18050c696710
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_State_AskedOurMission(2) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_State_MindFlayerPresent = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - UNDERDARK(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_State_AskedOurMission(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:08890d00-ee93-65d5-9e23-18050c696710
msgctxt "hc7a70ab7gb131g4421g80e3g270bd063adc0"
msgid ""
"Our kind has suffered needlessly for generations. Do you also seek peace "
"among the myconids?"
msgstr "저희 종족은 수 세대에 걸쳐 불필요한 고통을 겪어왔습니다. 당신도 마이코니드 사이에서 평화를 추구하시나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 0e1c2c92-b88b-e609-c45d-b2e0a9d617d4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Event_SummonMindFlayer(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:0e1c2c92-b88b-e609-c45d-b2e0a9d617d4
msgctxt "h221f82f0g3b93g479agbc62g541401d851ec"
msgid "Let me see if it will answer my summons a second time."
msgstr "제 부름에 다시 응할지 보겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0eca7cc9-b397-689e-7697-2e5939a10c55
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:0eca7cc9-b397-689e-7697-2e5939a10c55
msgctxt "h3da0619bg3790g43d4gb6d4g7496c74b8671"
msgid "*As Omeluum's mind pierces yours, the tadpole pulses with power.*"
msgstr "*오멜룸의 정신이 당신의 것을 꿰뚫자, 올챙이에서 힘의 파동이 느껴집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0f5d0c25-7866-3615-638a-0e02d2392dce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_WeDidntTellAboutTadpole(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:0f5d0c25-7866-3615-638a-0e02d2392dce
msgctxt "hbf51e1c5ga5bag4da9gbed9gec94feff456f"
msgid "That's not your business."
msgstr "그건 당신이 알 바 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 10ce3ddb-0f46-df9e-308d-d8d6359b9d10
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:10ce3ddb-0f46-df9e-308d-d8d6359b9d10
msgctxt "he34ba347g2bcbg4180g80c4gfd37cad73ed1"
msgid ""
"Truly remarkable! But why come to the Underdark, where they hold so much "
"power?"
msgstr "정말 놀랍군요! 하지만 그렇다면 어째서 언더다크로 오신 거죠? 그들은 이곳에 엄청난 세를 이루고 있다는 걸 아시지 않습니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 12776fe5-c425-32b8-a6f9-b596b67dc6a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DUERGARDWARF(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:12776fe5-c425-32b8-a6f9-b596b67dc6a3
msgctxt "h73ca299ag012bg49bag9543g2918f00a7baa"
msgid "Ah... wait. You're not with that damned raiding party. Apologies."
msgstr "아... 잠깐. 당신은 그 빌어먹을 습격 무리들과 동행이 아니로군요. 사과드리지요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 16786cfc-4a6d-67b7-af61-cb9a273569be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:16786cfc-4a6d-67b7-af61-cb9a273569be
msgctxt "h6446d38cgb01eg4ab9gbb22g47603f316e90"
msgid ""
"It is my hope that my research will lead to liberation and peace for my "
"people."
msgstr "제 연구가 동족들을 해방하고 평화를 줄 수 있도록 이끄는 것이 제 희망입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 17e6843c-1ebd-9f78-498c-3f0c10d8d998
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_UNDERDARK(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:17e6843c-1ebd-9f78-498c-3f0c10d8d998
msgctxt "h9e853517g6affg4f2ega4a7g4755e80a22c8"
msgid "This is where I belong, but right now I can't stay."
msgstr "여기가 내가 있어야 할 곳인 것 같군. 하지만 당장은 머무를 수 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 188da916-5781-a4e1-8c0d-85b51692290f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:188da916-5781-a4e1-8c0d-85b51692290f
msgctxt "h8ea8dac1gbd6cg46b1ga345gcaa441fa2150"
msgid "You betray the very reason you were hatched into this plane."
msgstr "넌 네가 이 차원에 부화한 이유 그 자체를 배신하는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 188da916-5781-a4e1-8c0d-85b51692290f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:188da916-5781-a4e1-8c0d-85b51692290f
msgctxt "h702af31dge0b4g44ddgbb1dgee6bcc7ef796"
msgid ""
"They infest your head and invade your dreams, and <i>still</i> you would "
"parley?"
msgstr "놈들이 네 머리를 감염시키고 꿈을 침공했는데, <i>여전히</i> 교섭을 하겠다고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 18c8ae0a-cf00-bdab-81aa-2b4c137cbf1e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:18c8ae0a-cf00-bdab-81aa-2b4c137cbf1e
msgctxt "h06b7829fg0cafg4266g9e44ga8adbbd793f3"
msgid ""
"*The scholar's brow tenses. His voice spills into your skull, the spores "
"connecting mind to mind.*"
msgstr "*학자가 눈썹을 찡그립니다. 포자로 연결된 서로의 마음으로 인해, 그의 목소리가 당신의 머리 속으로 들어옵니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1ddac773-2b8f-042a-1e2c-2a101ce354c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_State_MindFlayerPresent = True
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_State_ConnectionPerformed = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:1ddac773-2b8f-042a-1e2c-2a101ce354c9
msgctxt "h39f37c00gef7fg44c9ga109g13f47cacab89"
msgid "Can you tell me more about ceremorphosis?"
msgstr "뇌변이에 대해서 말해 주겠어요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1f432a42-c220-2867-e5a4-43bf18ad131b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:1f432a42-c220-2867-e5a4-43bf18ad131b
msgctxt "h66cdebe8g0fe0g45a8g8713g64e039a571e7"
msgid "Running this <i>ghaik</i> through would be a privilege. <i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "이 <i>게이크</i>를 썰어버리는 것은 특혜가 되겠어. <i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1f432a42-c220-2867-e5a4-43bf18ad131b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:1f432a42-c220-2867-e5a4-43bf18ad131b
msgctxt "h7f70ea35gea1bg4eaegbd89g6d32e4db7b81"
msgid "I'd never trust a mind flayer. <i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "난 마인드 플레이어 따위 절대 믿지 않아. <i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 26fef666-06b5-a590-7e6e-42d57dc22a76
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:26fef666-06b5-a590-7e6e-42d57dc22a76
msgctxt "h29fb5433g63a6g4155g937cga95c65749a5e"
msgid "<i>Please, hold. I understand your rage against my kin.</i>"
msgstr "<i>잠시만요. 나의 동족을 향한 그대의 분노는 이해합니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 2a10f0ee-d047-1eb6-005d-9158da5cdcfb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:2a10f0ee-d047-1eb6-005d-9158da5cdcfb
msgctxt "hc2bb5376g5536g4f7ag8218g6e5cef90f534"
msgid "Could I ask what you were searching for to begin with?"
msgstr "애초에 뭘 찾으시려고 나선 건지 여쭤봐도 될까요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2abc9f75-070f-946b-9cda-9ae5b8889b10
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_State_WeLiedAboutMission(2) = True
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_State_AskedOurMission(2) = True
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_WeDidntTellAboutTadpole(2) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_State_MindFlayerPresent = False
#.   Local:
#.      - f82ad8fc-1a31-d801-c6d6-0e0ec9c540c3_GreetingHasmet = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:2abc9f75-070f-946b-9cda-9ae5b8889b10
msgctxt "had823657g0230g4724gbbc1g6f795f27b886"
msgid "Do you know anything about ceremorphosis?"
msgstr "뇌변이에 대해서 아는 것이 있나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 2bccbca9-8bec-c774-0995-f030afbebd36
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:2bccbca9-8bec-c774-0995-f030afbebd36
msgctxt "h98f8b63eg6394g47c5gbbf4gaee992305540"
msgid "A common phenomenon in the Underdark, I'm afraid."
msgstr "언더다크에서 흔히 볼 수 있는 현상이군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 2feeef85-3f54-3d09-30aa-9e644a3f83fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:2feeef85-3f54-3d09-30aa-9e644a3f83fe
msgctxt "ha794c1bcge649g4db5ga686gef98eae52048"
msgid ""
"<i>But I assure you, I stand with the Society of Brilliance, not the "
"colonies of my people.</i>"
msgstr "<i>하지만 장담하건대, 저는 제 동족이 아닌 광명회와 함께합니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 3066f5e2-ca5d-a019-a5b5-a2e2f352f845
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:3066f5e2-ca5d-a019-a5b5-a2e2f352f845
msgctxt "h9d05173ag2b7fg42b6gbd1ag7b4b63074404"
msgid ""
"So it is with the myconids: they live in harmonious unity, but each has a "
"unique personality."
msgstr "마이코니드들도 마찬가지이지요: 이들은 조화로운 통일성을 이루며 살아가지만, 개개인 또한 독특한 개성을 지니고 있습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 320e1966-c1a2-ed40-790b-ee504805d7c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_State_WeLiedAboutMission(2) = False
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_HasMet(2) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_State_MindFlayerPresent = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - f82ad8fc-1a31-d801-c6d6-0e0ec9c540c3_GreetingHasmet = True
#.     - f82ad8fc-1a31-d801-c6d6-0e0ec9c540c3_GreetingIntro = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:320e1966-c1a2-ed40-790b-ee504805d7c6
msgctxt "hb5256659g6c49g4422ga867g786534578333"
msgid "Welcome back. Have you made any new discoveries?"
msgstr "환영합니다. 새로운 발견은 없으셨나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 3220dd5f-3656-8e3c-0816-1b1944a903cf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_State_ToldAboutColleagues(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_State_ToldAboutColleagues(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:3220dd5f-3656-8e3c-0816-1b1944a903cf
msgctxt "h5220bdeag2fa5g4ec4g8aa0ge9adb5a55e80"
msgid ""
"My colleagues and I are working to improve conditions in the Underdark. This "
"need not be such a dire, hostile place."
msgstr "저와 제 동료들이 언더다크의 환경을 개선하기 위해 노력하는 중입니다. 여기가 꼭 위험하고 나쁜 곳일 필요는 없잖아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 39eda005-68e4-db2b-4ce0-c33a9287e72b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_State_ConnectionRefused = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:39eda005-68e4-db2b-4ce0-c33a9287e72b
msgctxt "he26093f0g513cg4497gadc3g93f03c92ee8f"
msgid "Sorry, Omeluum. I'd rather not."
msgstr "미안, 오멜룸. 그러지 않는 편이 좋겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 40154224-6a0a-24d5-0a31-c83ac3b56ab2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:40154224-6a0a-24d5-0a31-c83ac3b56ab2
msgctxt "haaca2714g34cdg4723g8430g82119e9d871c"
msgid "Exactly! It's such a relief to meet another sensible mind."
msgstr "바로 그거예요! 또 다른 현명한 분을 만나게 되어 정말 안심이 되는군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 437b883e-c842-6694-0d4f-c356e25025b0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DRUID(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:437b883e-c842-6694-0d4f-c356e25025b0
msgctxt "hac5bdbaega51bg4c07g9576g593c8cbeb35c"
msgid "Such is nature's balance: life thriving under adversity."
msgstr "역경 속에서 번성하는 생명, 이것이 자연의 균형이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 44dc4b1a-94fd-0df8-3ee3-d7d213b0c03d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:44dc4b1a-94fd-0df8-3ee3-d7d213b0c03d
msgctxt "h736098degf9f4g40b5gaf22ga034d74d2e48"
msgid ""
"<i>Blurg, proud member of the Society of Brilliance, at your service.</i>"
msgstr "<i>블러그, 자랑스러운 광명회의 일원이 인사드립니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 479b7563-3d70-7a86-85d5-381bda73567b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:479b7563-3d70-7a86-85d5-381bda73567b
msgctxt "h33d17ce7gea3eg475bg8a54g452aebff244d"
msgid "I see! Well, it is the central act of mind flayer reproduction."
msgstr "그렇군요! 뭐, 그건 마인드 플레이어가 번식하는 주요 수단입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4811d57b-91df-45b0-11f6-b53eca81f18f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:4811d57b-91df-45b0-11f6-b53eca81f18f
msgctxt "h8a08f78dg7f15g49b8g91d4g0f4080bbf953"
msgid "I am trying to return to my people."
msgstr "내 동족에게 돌아가려 하고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4ae88bb3-9ce9-2b66-8d7c-79155e4b14d1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - LOW_TheLodge_Knows_SocietyWantsGithEgg = False
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_State_WeAskedAboutSoB(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_State_WeAskedAboutSoB(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:4ae88bb3-9ce9-2b66-8d7c-79155e4b14d1
msgctxt "h38762f95g0463g48fbg8e82g39e211c5c80f"
msgid "I've never heard of the Society of Brilliance."
msgstr "광명회라는 이름은 처음 듣는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 4ec800fd-60c1-f841-4bfe-297f67cee17f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_HasMet(2) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_State_MindFlayerPresent = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - f82ad8fc-1a31-d801-c6d6-0e0ec9c540c3_GreetingHasmet = True
#.     - f82ad8fc-1a31-d801-c6d6-0e0ec9c540c3_GreetingIntro = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:4ec800fd-60c1-f841-4bfe-297f67cee17f
msgctxt "h2635600ag03c3g4673g935fg865b29fcdc15"
msgid "Welcome back. Have you made any new discoveries?"
msgstr "환영합니다. 새로운 발견은 없으셨나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 4eff728a-6274-7258-4452-4538eba552de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_State_AskedOurMission(2) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_State_MindFlayerPresent = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - UNDERDARK(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_State_AskedOurMission(2) = True
#. TagRule: GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:4eff728a-6274-7258-4452-4538eba552de
msgctxt "h0901d537g4a6fg4d8cgb4a8g540bfa7d3c2a"
msgid ""
"It's curious to find a githyanki here. What has brought you down so deep?"
msgstr "여기서 기스양키를 만나다니 흥미롭군요. 어쩌다 이 깊은 곳까지 내려오게 됐나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 4eff728a-6274-7258-4452-4538eba552de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_State_AskedOurMission(2) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_State_MindFlayerPresent = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - UNDERDARK(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_State_AskedOurMission(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:4eff728a-6274-7258-4452-4538eba552de
msgctxt "h50dfb11cgc876g4e25ga270g1f4a2ada1f03"
msgid ""
"It's curious to find a surface dweller here. What has brought you down so "
"deep?"
msgstr "여기서 지상 거주민을 만나다니 흥미롭군요. 어쩌다 이 깊은 곳까지 내려오게 됐나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 4fa7aea7-39f1-baa8-7878-b01ca6e7ae8e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:4fa7aea7-39f1-baa8-7878-b01ca6e7ae8e
msgctxt "hd446f1fegf397g4cf8g9ce2gc0a386f8e596"
msgid ""
"This is not a wasteland: it is a glorious ecosystem. Every civilisation here "
"could thrive without conflict!"
msgstr "이곳은 황무지가 아닙니다: 장엄한 생태계죠. 이곳의 모든 문명은 갈등 없이 번성할 수 있을 겁니다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 53eb8d26-608f-c14d-91bf-40f4edffb22c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:53eb8d26-608f-c14d-91bf-40f4edffb22c
msgctxt "h5c50a226g4e80g4d36gbfb4g8df5b57dbc96"
msgid ""
"Understandable. We are small in number, and rarely stay in one place for "
"long."
msgstr "그럴만하죠. 소속된 인원 수도 적고, 한 곳에 오래 머무르지 않으니까요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 54775f7a-f284-7e32-ed05-f4d9a44b1cfe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_UserShortcut(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:54775f7a-f284-7e32-ed05-f4d9a44b1cfe
msgctxt "h33c30912g556ag4e68g8232ga6ceea158e49"
msgid ""
"<i>Hgh--nzzt.</i> Or perhaps not. Your mind is far more complex than that of "
"the fungi."
msgstr "<i>으으으윽.</i> 안 하는 게 나을 지도요. 당신의 마음은 균류 친구들보다 훨씬 복잡하게 형성돼 있어서요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 56d599a8-e678-78d7-e100-fee15509b6f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_State_OfferedQuest = True
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_State_WeAskedAboutDuergars(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:56d599a8-e678-78d7-e100-fee15509b6f2
msgctxt "hf2f7bb43g9e0dg4029g8c6eg9fdcf648f46e"
msgid "Were you here when the duergar attacked?"
msgstr "듀에르가의 습격이 있었을 때 여기 있었나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 5bd88ed5-a5a7-3eef-2af4-845e2c2f70f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:5bd88ed5-a5a7-3eef-2af4-845e2c2f70f5
msgctxt "hd0baf309g091bg4ddbgb87dg880cfdd36813"
msgid ""
"It is! This adventurer has an illithid tadpole inside her head. But she "
"hasn't turned."
msgstr "중요한 건이야! 여기 모험가 분의 머리에 일리시드 올챙이가 들어갔는데, 아직도 변이가 안 됐다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 5bd88ed5-a5a7-3eef-2af4-845e2c2f70f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:5bd88ed5-a5a7-3eef-2af4-845e2c2f70f5
msgctxt "h1d79ebaag109cg4eaag8a23g39c8928162ae"
msgid ""
"It is! This adventurer has an illithid tadpole inside his head. But he "
"hasn't turned."
msgstr "중요한 건이야! 여기 모험가 분의 머리에 일리시드 올챙이가 들어갔는데, 아직도 변이가 안 됐다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 5bd88ed5-a5a7-3eef-2af4-845e2c2f70f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:5bd88ed5-a5a7-3eef-2af4-845e2c2f70f5
msgctxt "h75da8c22g2548g405cg88a8g8cd6937159b1"
msgid ""
"It is! This adventurer has an illithid tadpole inside their head. But they "
"haven't turned."
msgstr "중요한 건이야! 여기 모험가 분의 머리에 일리시드 올챙이가 들어갔는데, 아직도 변이가 안 됐다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 65f51b96-9efd-750b-15b0-4acbe12cd376
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_HasMet(2) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Emperor_State_MetMindFlayerBefore = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:65f51b96-9efd-750b-15b0-4acbe12cd376
msgctxt "ha8a8778eg1d03g4a5fg8d01g2b2622a54e58"
msgid ""
"<i>I hope this is important, Blurg. My zurkhwood samples need constant "
"attention.</i>"
msgstr "<i>중요한 일이길 바라지, 블러그. 저크우드 표본은 지속적인 관리가 필요하다는 걸 알 텐데.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 69a7bee6-53d5-b4dd-ba87-244deae74920
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:69a7bee6-53d5-b4dd-ba87-244deae74920
msgctxt "hb643216cg6429g4d8bgbf92gf36328b2e4fe"
msgid ""
"*Omeluum's tentacles flutter in what appears to be the mind flayer's "
"approximation of a smile.*"
msgstr "*오멜룸의 촉수들이 파닥거립니다. 마인드 플레이어 식의 미소인 것 같습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 6b98e8d6-2199-b659-aacf-9ab0b2045e82
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Inclusion_End_MindFlayer(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:6b98e8d6-2199-b659-aacf-9ab0b2045e82
msgctxt "h75fe4f60g2521g4fafga68cgd083c541247a"
msgid "<i>I see. I will remain here if you change your mind.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그렇군요. 생각이 바뀌신다면 전 여기 있겠습니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6c2ceba5-d4eb-5cfd-7ad4-722a9b83bd19
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:6c2ceba5-d4eb-5cfd-7ad4-722a9b83bd19
msgctxt "h4521c253gaeebg4f42gaa93gb104a489daea"
msgid ""
"<i>Leave.\n"
"</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 6cf97dd4-7e74-b69f-cd13-2564611ea4ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DUERGARDWARF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:6cf97dd4-7e74-b69f-cd13-2564611ea4ed
msgctxt "h6bfae646g57b4g4e3dga295g243f245d1dfc"
msgid "Pardon. Sometimes my temper gets the better of me."
msgstr "죄송합니다. 가끔 제 성질을 못 이길 때가 있거든요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 6e29668c-3ee3-20ab-39fe-0ee155fef1b6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:6e29668c-3ee3-20ab-39fe-0ee155fef1b6
msgctxt "he60a0d04gbc95g42ecg9487g7a58f8d92737"
msgid ""
"Such designs are part of why I've devoted myself to studying the myconids."
msgstr "그런 형태들이 제가 마이코니드 연구에 열정을 쏟은 이유 중 하나입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 6e6e52c2-953b-bfff-e613-b64db54435a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:6e6e52c2-953b-bfff-e613-b64db54435a0
msgctxt "h70af3a53g1294g4c05gbc60g2f56378aa5e2"
msgid "Forgive me. Being inquisitive is in my nature."
msgstr "실례했습니다. 호기심은 제 천성이라서요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6ec5fc53-a087-f5f4-a0d7-cfac06cb90a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:6ec5fc53-a087-f5f4-a0d7-cfac06cb90a1
msgctxt "h714933e2g67c4g4af9g8e3fg6f60cef2b258"
msgid "Yes. Absolutely."
msgstr "물론이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 73d045b6-0927-e1bb-2a18-d31994280860
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:73d045b6-0927-e1bb-2a18-d31994280860
msgctxt "h69140d1fg9058g4e27gbedcg5966a6aa4c72"
msgid ""
"But I've found that there is as much to learn from an individual as there is "
"from a community."
msgstr "하지만 저는 공동체에서만큼이나 개인에게서도 배울 점이 많다는 사실을 깨달았습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 755e854a-1d05-83aa-1611-bb1b1441b8ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Event_AutoStartMindFlayerDialog(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:755e854a-1d05-83aa-1611-bb1b1441b8ad
msgctxt "h42a7a008g786ag4821g9261gdd8ba48ccf16"
msgid "*It feels ten times its size. Alive, awake. Almost <i>smug</i>.*"
msgstr "*마치 열 배는 커진 듯한 기분입니다. 살아 있으며, 깨어 있습니다. 거의 <i>우쭐거리기</i>까지 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 799751c5-4b90-893e-20d4-9fdc8933e87a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_State_WeAskedAboutRace(2) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - UNDERDARK(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_State_WeAskedAboutRace(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:799751c5-4b90-893e-20d4-9fdc8933e87a
msgctxt "h51b5fc3bg5213g4bd0gb372g87900c0e0ffa"
msgid "I've never seen a hobgoblin like you before."
msgstr "당신 같은 홉고블린은 처음 보는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 79ec8c8c-ff1c-6685-ca95-0a4fe0b251ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Quest:
#.     - GLO_Tadpole_SUB_Society.AskedToCheck(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:79ec8c8c-ff1c-6685-ca95-0a4fe0b251ab
msgctxt "h3a104a2ag625eg4471g9d82geee5fdd22ecf"
msgid "<i>Are you looking to have it extracted?</i>"
msgstr "<i>추출을 원하시는 건가요?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 7a7ddcd8-d852-c001-095b-ca91493ebf3a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:7a7ddcd8-d852-c001-095b-ca91493ebf3a
msgctxt "h4931eac5gfbb4g4754g8235g24799a5a6d17"
msgid "I have a friend who may be able to assist."
msgstr "도움이 될 법한 친구를 하나 알고 있죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 8057bad5-7c0b-2fde-138a-8afe02ff3a98
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:8057bad5-7c0b-2fde-138a-8afe02ff3a98
msgctxt "h540a3377g4282g4b61gb8d3gf9267d47dd2f"
msgid "You must be worried sick, but have no fear."
msgstr "걱정이 많으시겠지만 두려워 마세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 80d139cb-f155-ae53-4726-5cc273b54fcc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:80d139cb-f155-ae53-4726-5cc273b54fcc
msgctxt "h15bb6175g016dg42degae09g6d7fd9df4f0c"
msgid "Ah... wait. You're not with that damned raiding party. Apologies."
msgstr "아... 잠깐. 당신은 그 빌어먹을 습격 무리들과 동행이 아니로군요. 사과드리지요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 8169e47b-d564-4c52-572e-451ea74c5afd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_HasMet(2) = False
#.   User:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_UserShortcut(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_HasMet(2) = True
#.   Local:
#.     - f82ad8fc-1a31-d801-c6d6-0e0ec9c540c3_GreetingHasmet = False
#.     - f82ad8fc-1a31-d801-c6d6-0e0ec9c540c3_GreetingIntro = True
#. TagRule: DUERGARDWARF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:8169e47b-d564-4c52-572e-451ea74c5afd
msgctxt "h65e0092fg4c1cg4317g842cge8d2ba1a760f"
msgid "The duergar are back! Run, little mushrooms!"
msgstr "듀에르가가 돌아왔어요! 도망치세요, 버섯 여러분!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 8169e47b-d564-4c52-572e-451ea74c5afd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_HasMet(2) = False
#.   User:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_UserShortcut(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_HasMet(2) = True
#.   Local:
#.     - f82ad8fc-1a31-d801-c6d6-0e0ec9c540c3_GreetingHasmet = False
#.     - f82ad8fc-1a31-d801-c6d6-0e0ec9c540c3_GreetingIntro = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:8169e47b-d564-4c52-572e-451ea74c5afd
msgctxt "h8931443dgb67cg457bga392g5d450928ac24"
msgid "Ah, a visitor! You're a welcome sight."
msgstr "아, 손님이 오셨네! 정말 반가워요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 83a64de0-7f61-43fe-3444-1d1b1d0a8bd3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_State_ConnectionAsked = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:83a64de0-7f61-43fe-3444-1d1b1d0a8bd3
msgctxt "hff2f9fb3g519dg4046gb946ge86b9411018a"
msgid "<i>Open your mind to me. Let us see what lurks within.</i>"
msgstr "<i>제게 정신을 열어 주십시오. 안에 뭐가 잠복해 있는지 보도록 하지요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 83e0a067-7d43-5397-52c3-2a6f6cee51c1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:83e0a067-7d43-5397-52c3-2a6f6cee51c1
msgctxt "h06255bd2g288ag4da3g94efgfa1d6e566a3c"
msgid "You'll die choking on your own bile, <i>ghaik</i>!"
msgstr "네 담즙에 질식해 죽을 거다, <i>게이크</i>!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 8520a89e-a8a6-0cec-2e8c-208f35b658e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:8520a89e-a8a6-0cec-2e8c-208f35b658e5
msgctxt "ha73eb030g883bg4eb3ga7d8gd3f79f791843"
msgid ""
"<i>A collective quest to eliminate the gith and enslave all other "
"humanoids.</i>"
msgstr "<i>기스를 제거하고, 다른 모든 인간형 생명체들을 노예로 삼겠다는 공동의 임무입니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8522470b-adc5-94cf-38c6-700cdb0947d8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_WeDidntTellAboutTadpole(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:8522470b-adc5-94cf-38c6-700cdb0947d8
msgctxt "h1ad14548g51ecg42f7ga20eg7847b0fd62cc"
msgid "We all have our unique interests. Mind flayers are mine."
msgstr "우리 모두 각자의 고유한 관심사가 있죠. 제 경우에는 마인드 플레이어입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 88154d72-eb38-1728-c9fb-3d477b1f8264
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:88154d72-eb38-1728-c9fb-3d477b1f8264
msgctxt "h32623b04g323dg4d68g9a47ge97edee50370"
msgid ""
"<i>If that settles matters for the time being... would you like a "
"diagnosis?</i>"
msgstr "<i>이걸로 당장의 궁금증이 해결되었다면... 진단을 받아보시겠습니까?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 88972218-edd5-c473-2785-3ed6d755b91f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:88972218-edd5-c473-2785-3ed6d755b91f
msgctxt "h5c8465a1g33c7g4f2bgbd61ga45915a9587d"
msgid "Honestly? I kind of got lost down here."
msgstr "솔직히? 여기서 길을 잃었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8917be0c-b188-8ee7-90d0-fe7a90ab3634
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:8917be0c-b188-8ee7-90d0-fe7a90ab3634
msgctxt "h151c238eg0856g441dga4b4g977384dc7e09"
msgid "<i>Swallow your disgust and permit the </i>ghaik<i>'s search.</i>"
msgstr "<i>역겨움을 참고 </i>게이크가 <i>살펴보도록 내버려둔다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 8a2cb7f6-5289-c8a0-945a-987259a8bbe5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(3) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:8a2cb7f6-5289-c8a0-945a-987259a8bbe5
msgctxt "h13967614g3ebdg4790g8a0cge39a00bc5527"
msgid "<i>Traitor.</i>"
msgstr "<i>배신자.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 8a2cb7f6-5289-c8a0-945a-987259a8bbe5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:8a2cb7f6-5289-c8a0-945a-987259a8bbe5
msgctxt "h4acea433gc30ag463egbb58g71a16f076c65"
msgid "<i>Fool.</i>"
msgstr "<i>멍청이.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = 8edf2b3c-2091-a145-308c-4d02fa3f0d2a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:8edf2b3c-2091-a145-308c-4d02fa3f0d2a
msgctxt "hdaee1ad7g6dd1g4f75gb4fcg9547d303326e"
msgid "You may have trouble reaching the Astral Plane from here, young gith."
msgstr "이곳에서 아스트랄 차원까지 가려면 어려움이 많겠군요, 어린 기스여."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 94c815d4-ff0d-1794-0696-7f14ab810cb1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:94c815d4-ff0d-1794-0696-7f14ab810cb1
msgctxt "hfd45d9e1g4b13g4b78gb50ag2e239288014b"
msgid "<i>Stifle your revulsion and listen to the mind flayer.</i>"
msgstr "<i>혐오감을 억누르고 마인드 플레이어의 말을 듣는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = 94ec41c3-1910-9d9d-681a-7f47f6579e58
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:94ec41c3-1910-9d9d-681a-7f47f6579e58
msgctxt "h3997fd4bgbdb7g442fg856eg96a879e16137"
msgid ""
"<i>I ask only that you refrain from violence. I respect that your opinion of "
"my kind may be... charged.</i>"
msgstr "<i>폭력은 삼가시길 부탁드립니다. 제 동족에 대한 생각이... 다소 격양되어 계실 수 있다는 점은 존중합니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 94f96cad-3f2e-fb21-0462-34fdf44be23a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:94f96cad-3f2e-fb21-0462-34fdf44be23a
msgctxt "hf4202b22gf1f4g48d7g9dd5g32db4e98de89"
msgid "How could a <i>ghaik </i>be anyone's ally?"
msgstr "어떻게 <i>게이크</i>가 누군가의 아군이 될 수 있다는 거죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 94f96cad-3f2e-fb21-0462-34fdf44be23a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:94f96cad-3f2e-fb21-0462-34fdf44be23a
msgctxt "hb0978c5cgf299g4396g8ecfg3abb1384fcf2"
msgid "An illithid is your friend? How is that possible?"
msgstr "당신의 친구가 일리시드라고? 이게 어떻게 가능해?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 953dfbe8-c8ae-aa6d-7e62-0755323b2b4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:953dfbe8-c8ae-aa6d-7e62-0755323b2b4f
msgctxt "h2d2e12c9g92bbg4ad8g80a7gd8b0ab1739b2"
msgid "I'm not refraining from anything. You'll die like the rest."
msgstr "난 아무것도 삼가지 않아. 넌 나머지처럼 죽게될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9579f847-fd97-c59b-4516-1f71b7985f13
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:9579f847-fd97-c59b-4516-1f71b7985f13
msgctxt "ha1c43f78g5dbag4072ga8edgf6a724dfd866"
msgid "What is the Grand Design?"
msgstr "원대한 설계라는 게 뭐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 95b79a83-4515-527c-1335-df57b11119fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:95b79a83-4515-527c-1335-df57b11119fe
msgctxt "h730cbdb7g1350g4051gb882gd930afa8a751"
msgid "A mind flayer infected me with a tadpole."
msgstr "마인드 플레이어가 내게 올챙이를 심었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 96bb7d7b-3bed-9bfc-a920-e36d7fbd9214
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_State_WeLiedAboutMission(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:96bb7d7b-3bed-9bfc-a920-e36d7fbd9214
msgctxt "h845586d0g1a94g45fega9fdgf0230db13e72"
msgid "I collect mushrooms to sell on the surface."
msgstr "지상에서 팔 버섯을 모으고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9757884f-35c3-3863-caa8-ea53c130d065
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:9757884f-35c3-3863-caa8-ea53c130d065
msgctxt "hc33966f7g0c0bg4c98g9685g4e6c234f863a"
msgid "What have your studies uncovered?"
msgstr "그 연구로 뭘 밝혀냈지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9bc02a34-7f72-7dd4-a17c-7f5607c52a99
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_State_ToldAboutColleagues(2) = True
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_State_WeAskedAboutMyconids(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_State_WeAskedAboutMyconids(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:9bc02a34-7f72-7dd4-a17c-7f5607c52a99
msgctxt "hffbd9e15g6f24g4b3dg87d6gf69b6868f94c"
msgid "Research in the Underdark sounds like a dangerous prospect."
msgstr "언더다크에서 연구 활동을 벌이는 건 꽤 위험할 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9d84a60b-2640-697b-7fd5-32be0e0da47c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:9d84a60b-2640-697b-7fd5-32be0e0da47c
msgctxt "heeb79aa2g137bg45b1gbdb1g5301c78cd387"
msgid "<i>Relax and let Omeluum's mind search your own.</i>"
msgstr "<i>긴장을 풀고 오멜룸이 당신의 정신을 살펴보도록 허용한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = a6105664-21a5-566f-04cd-635ebf240001
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_State_WeLiedAboutMission(2) = True
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_HasMet(2) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_State_MindFlayerPresent = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - f82ad8fc-1a31-d801-c6d6-0e0ec9c540c3_GreetingHasmet = True
#.     - f82ad8fc-1a31-d801-c6d6-0e0ec9c540c3_GreetingIntro = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:a6105664-21a5-566f-04cd-635ebf240001
msgctxt "h804d1bb2g5317g41f1gaa51geff233b1790f"
msgid "Ah, the mushroom hunter! Have you made any new discoveries?"
msgstr "아, 버섯 사냥꾼 님이시군요! 새로운 발견은 있으셨습니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ac44d068-111a-0019-1efd-759884bdced6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_State_AskedOurMission(2) = True
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_WeDidntTellAboutTadpole(2) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_State_MindFlayerPresent = False
#.   Local:
#.      - f82ad8fc-1a31-d801-c6d6-0e0ec9c540c3_GreetingHasmet = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:ac44d068-111a-0019-1efd-759884bdced6
msgctxt "hed38168fg1313g4d39ga1f2gd547c4c57d6b"
msgid "<i>Tell Blurg about the tadpole.</i>"
msgstr "<i>블러그에게 올챙이에 관해 얘기해준다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = acb403c2-ba3e-7c8d-e903-6b608746dc58
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:acb403c2-ba3e-7c8d-e903-6b608746dc58
msgctxt "h61fba7bcg8244g4366gb45dgdaf1a6c50b83"
msgid "A fascinating process, if a touch grim."
msgstr "대단히 흥미로운 과정이죠, 좀 우울하긴 합니다만."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = acd6f44f-fdab-dff7-68fd-ace22c2c1220
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:acd6f44f-fdab-dff7-68fd-ace22c2c1220
msgctxt "h36dbf6bdg0463g47dega17fgb45d8bd2bc49"
msgid ""
"And yet, we are all in need. Imagine what creativity would bloom if no "
"craftsman starved. If every wizard had spell materials!"
msgstr ""
"하지만, 결국 우리는 모두 필요의 존재 아니겠습니까. 어떤 장인도 굶주리지 않는다면 어떤 상상력이 발휘될지 생각해 보세요. 모든 위저드가 "
"주문 재료를 가지게 된다면!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = ae3d0073-df7c-0ae2-dae3-5f35b1332322
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_HasMet(2) = False
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_HasMet(2) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - DUERGARDWARF(2) = False
#.   User:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_UserShortcut(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_HasMet(2) = True
#.   Local:
#.     - f82ad8fc-1a31-d801-c6d6-0e0ec9c540c3_GreetingHasmet = False
#.     - f82ad8fc-1a31-d801-c6d6-0e0ec9c540c3_GreetingIntro = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:ae3d0073-df7c-0ae2-dae3-5f35b1332322
msgctxt "h120497bdg134eg4029gacb0g06e80ddc8073"
msgid "Ah, a visitor! You're a welcome sight."
msgstr "아, 손님이 오셨네! 정말 반가워요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = afdef0cf-60d9-187b-d776-8bed1041ea25
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_State_WeAskedAboutRace(2) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_UNDERDARK(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_State_WeAskedAboutRace(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:afdef0cf-60d9-187b-d776-8bed1041ea25
msgctxt "hb8016df2gc96dg460ag9ffdgcfe105411d7f"
msgid "Your kind tend to be slaves down here."
msgstr "당신 부류는 이 아래에서 보통 노예로 부려지던데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = b0769f57-9e60-4745-b917-8aea9f1af51e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_State_WeAskedAboutDuergars(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:b0769f57-9e60-4745-b917-8aea9f1af51e
msgctxt "h482aa913g8782g41d3gb3f9gbb283968d590"
msgid ""
"I observed the fight from a distance. Combat is not my field of expertise, "
"but the myconids handled themselves well enough."
msgstr "전 싸움을 멀리서 관찰했습니다. 전투는 제 전문 분야가 아니라서요, 하지만 마이코니드들이 잘 감당하더군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = b4664023-7095-8cc6-a7b5-c9826c7ca830
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(3) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - f82ad8fc-1a31-d801-c6d6-0e0ec9c540c3_LaezelAggressive = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:b4664023-7095-8cc6-a7b5-c9826c7ca830
msgctxt "ha5ebc30fg9479g44bdga3cfg1a585af698bb"
msgid "<i>Ghaik.</i> Your head will make a fine trophy for my queen!"
msgstr "<i>게이크.</i> 네놈의 머리통을 여왕님께 진상하겠다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = b7715348-6522-b265-4341-7322dc8c69a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:b7715348-6522-b265-4341-7322dc8c69a6
msgctxt "h821d682ag28e5g408eg97e5g39e382144509"
msgid ""
"<i>One of my brethren forced a tadpole into your eye. Or ear, perhaps?</i>"
msgstr "<i>제 동족 중 하나가 당신의 눈에 올챙이를 강제로 넣었겠죠. 아니면, 귀인가요?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b7809318-ea43-49da-952a-44ab3c77f7c5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:b7809318-ea43-49da-952a-44ab3c77f7c5
msgctxt "h4e8d4387gc4ceg4929g944eg1a2cf2f1a678"
msgid "A <i>ghaik</i>! Die."
msgstr "<i>게이크</i>로군! 죽어라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b7809318-ea43-49da-952a-44ab3c77f7c5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:b7809318-ea43-49da-952a-44ab3c77f7c5
msgctxt "h2868412cgd8c7g478dgb0c7gfa999c7ad2f5"
msgid "A mind flayer?! Die."
msgstr "마인드 플레이어잖아?! 죽어라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bac1712a-c50a-5133-d520-637078c24abc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WARLOCK(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:bac1712a-c50a-5133-d520-637078c24abc
msgctxt "h3338fb26gb8c6g4daag8b10g87bac4791b0d"
msgid "I've made a lot of strange allies for information. Let's hear it."
msgstr "저도 정보를 위해서라면 얼마든지 이상한 동맹 관계를 만들어왔죠. 들어보겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = bca0e1b5-d9be-9a2f-f32c-0a4937416b83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:bca0e1b5-d9be-9a2f-f32c-0a4937416b83
msgctxt "h89da23e0gf297g405cg8a92g8a92e9538ca1"
msgid ""
"<i>I have broken free from the elder brain's yoke. I no longer serve the "
"Grand Design.</i>"
msgstr "<i>저는 엘더 브레인의 멍에에서 해방되었습니다. 전 더 이상 원대한 설계를 따르지 않지요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = c56f9a00-aea2-51c8-2865-8401bef56db7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:c56f9a00-aea2-51c8-2865-8401bef56db7
msgctxt "hce57c695g39e3g4c22g9d2eg6fe2bc50f683"
msgid ""
"I do enjoy a good bargain, if anything in my private collection is to your "
"liking."
msgstr "좋은 거래라면 저도 환영입니다. 제 소유물 중에 마음에 드시는 것이 있다면 말이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = c6e08015-c16c-70eb-22e6-1f3e91eb8d23
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_UserShortcut(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:c6e08015-c16c-70eb-22e6-1f3e91eb8d23
msgctxt "hb8087a07gf87bg4ff2g99bbg7249eae8ca28"
msgid "But let us observe the customs of the locals."
msgstr "잠깐 이곳의 관습에 따르도록 하죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = c7297789-6782-2981-7ac8-d80931aa8fa3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_State_AllowedTrading = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:c7297789-6782-2981-7ac8-d80931aa8fa3
msgctxt "hbabe3802g5beag41a4gb11bgc257491e65b7"
msgid ""
"It's true that many of my brethren are enslaved here, but my intellect has "
"secured my freedom."
msgstr "동족들이 종종 이곳에서 노예로 부려진다는 것은 사실입니다만, 제 지성으로 자유를 지킬 수 있었습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = c7b4b632-57c6-89bd-fe22-35ebfbbb464a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:c7b4b632-57c6-89bd-fe22-35ebfbbb464a
msgctxt "h3e52c220gccfag466dgb733g183d01156d96"
msgid "I know the feeling well. What has driven you from home?"
msgstr "그 느낌이라면 저도 잘 압니다. 어쩌다 고향을 떠나 이곳으로 오게 되셨습니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = c9c11cd8-90b4-28bb-1249-5caecacea2a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_State_WeLiedAboutMission(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:c9c11cd8-90b4-28bb-1249-5caecacea2a0
msgctxt "h6f2a55cegfde7g45f9ga532g0c9192c9cd79"
msgid "A fascinating topic. May I ask the reason for your interest?"
msgstr "대단히 흥미로운 주제군요. 어째서 그 분야에 관심을 두시는 건지 여쭈어도 될까요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ceec7d9c-d9c9-636a-6ef8-dbb364ef6a91
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:ceec7d9c-d9c9-636a-6ef8-dbb364ef6a91
msgctxt "h64c66d03g91e5g4e4cg8ae1ga5372ce91d16"
msgid "I'd never trust a mind flayer. <i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "난 마인드 플레이어 따위 절대 믿지 않아. <i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d0324c91-7656-4e1a-ca20-9b70893f09f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:d0324c91-7656-4e1a-ca20-9b70893f09f7
msgctxt "hca47b6afg130ag4022gbf20gf9947f60a970"
msgid "<i>Explain the whole story.</i>"
msgstr "<i>어떻게 된 일인지 자초지종을 들려준다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d04df975-c874-94fb-8160-949e5814fa8e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_UNDERDARK(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:d04df975-c874-94fb-8160-949e5814fa8e
msgctxt "h7b8f7412g6ebfg4e2agaf47g3ce73fd0e71a"
msgid "Our peoples aren't exactly inclined to share with each other."
msgstr "우리 종족이 딱히 터놓고 말하는 편은 아니라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = d0b28802-3101-dc1d-51ec-5e435b948afd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:d0b28802-3101-dc1d-51ec-5e435b948afd
msgctxt "h71a543fcgf13eg449cg92a4g862672598196"
msgid ""
"A tadpole is inserted into a living humanoid, and in seven days, the host is "
"consumed to produce a new illithid."
msgstr "살아있는 인간형 종족에 올챙이가 삽입되면, 7일 안에 숙주는 흡수당하고 새 일리시드가 태어납니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = d0b8a6c7-2ac0-c9b8-f9cc-3ada2429b7bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: UNDERDARK
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:d0b8a6c7-2ac0-c9b8-f9cc-3ada2429b7bb
msgctxt "h7fe204d8g5fe0g42a0ga8e9g2a2816749081"
msgid ""
"<i>My species has terrorised the Underdark for countless generations.</i>"
msgstr "<i>제 종족은 수없이 많은 세대 동안 언더다크를 공포로 몰아넣었습니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = d0b8a6c7-2ac0-c9b8-f9cc-3ada2429b7bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:d0b8a6c7-2ac0-c9b8-f9cc-3ada2429b7bb
msgctxt "h7ca593ffg5878g4b22gb170gd286257c6b30"
msgid "<i>My species devastated and enslaved yours. It is unforgivable.</i>"
msgstr "<i>제 종족은 당신의 동족을 비탄에 빠뜨리고 노예로 삼았습니다. 그건 용서받을 수 없는 일이지요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d27e4187-ad2b-b286-ee7d-99c822f6e903
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - f82ad8fc-1a31-d801-c6d6-0e0ec9c540c3_LaezelAggressive = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_State_ConnectionRefused = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:d27e4187-ad2b-b286-ee7d-99c822f6e903
msgctxt "h4a54b83agfe6cg4009g9573g38a69346a2c4"
msgid "I want nothing to do with you."
msgstr "너와는 상종할 일 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d9f37eef-88be-5f61-e18e-7b604fadb6d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:d9f37eef-88be-5f61-e18e-7b604fadb6d2
msgctxt "hf1924a38g664fg45a4g8ef4g89bba2453f17"
msgid "Do you have anything interesting to trade?"
msgstr "거래할 만한 것이 있나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = da2afa4c-ef47-9fed-67b3-f89d358a3e0b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:da2afa4c-ef47-9fed-67b3-f89d358a3e0b
msgctxt "h67aae1fdgb903g44begb179gb04811e080be"
msgid "Excellent! Omeluum will be happy to answer all of your questions."
msgstr "훌륭하군요! 오멜룸은 당신의 모든 질문에 기꺼이 대답해 줄 거예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = deac8f5e-2a3a-deca-7c69-bcd848eb3839
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_DROWELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:deac8f5e-2a3a-deca-7c69-bcd848eb3839
msgctxt "h18bf6fcfg7dcag42adg9410gb28aa6b4494f"
msgid "I have felt the shame of Lolth herself. I understand, Omeluum."
msgstr "나 또한 롤쓰의 수치를 경험했어. 이해해, 오멜룸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = deac8f5e-2a3a-deca-7c69-bcd848eb3839
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_DUERGARDWARF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:deac8f5e-2a3a-deca-7c69-bcd848eb3839
msgctxt "h96c45c93g615bg413eg9aaeg41d3c477d50a"
msgid "I know what it's like to be shunned. I understand, Omeluum."
msgstr "따돌림 당하는 것이 어떤 느낌인지 나도 잘 알아. 이해해, 오멜룸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = df68462b-41d4-9815-6576-d1d7f61b6613
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_State_OfferedQuest = False
#.   Local:
#.      - f82ad8fc-1a31-d801-c6d6-0e0ec9c540c3_GreetingIntro = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - DUERGARDWARF(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_State_WeAskedAboutDuergars(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:df68462b-41d4-9815-6576-d1d7f61b6613
msgctxt "h44949406gd2feg4981g9d44g5e9c69ea527b"
msgid "Seems like you've had a run-in with my people before."
msgstr "내 동족과 전에 언쟁을 벌인 적이 있는 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = e4056f28-dd84-338d-f8ff-91ec738bfbc2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_State_Hostile = True
#.   Object:
#.     - TemporaryHostilityAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:e4056f28-dd84-338d-f8ff-91ec738bfbc2
msgctxt "h012726c4ge3c5g4954gacf8ga2a0577116f6"
msgid "<i>This is pointless.</i>"
msgstr "<i>이건 무의미해.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = e4fd5402-db6a-efb3-73d3-d66f3294600e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:e4fd5402-db6a-efb3-73d3-d66f3294600e
msgctxt "h438a1b5bg6c5eg4547gb961g34b36e3044b0"
msgid ""
"<i>I ask that you refrain from violence, while I respect that your opinion "
"of my kind may not change.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>폭력은 삼가시길 부탁드리죠, 저도 제 동족에 대한 당신의 생각이... 다소 격양되어 있을 수 있다는 점은 존중합니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = e6ddd00a-2408-13a1-bf95-c66263f64673
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:e6ddd00a-2408-13a1-bf95-c66263f64673
msgctxt "hc2e82818gfa6bg4f90g81fdg694debc5f04d"
msgid "I... see. A fine way to make a living."
msgstr "그렇... 군요. 생계를 꾸리기에 좋은 방법입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e99f8e9a-e408-a307-6762-6b42ddfe6b89
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:e99f8e9a-e408-a307-6762-6b42ddfe6b89
msgctxt "h78f9d6ebgba63g4b63gbc97ga45579dce724"
msgid ""
"*There is rare magic in the Underdark too. <i>Faerzress.</i> It radiates "
"from the earth, warping teleportation and divination magic.*"
msgstr "*언더다크에는 희귀한 마법도 있습니다. <i>페어즈레스.</i> 그것은 대지에서 발산되어, 순간이동과 신성 마법을 비틉니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f1096598-a8ea-436a-0423-436d18032e80
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_MindFlayer_State_ConnectionRefused = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:f1096598-a8ea-436a-0423-436d18032e80
msgctxt "h7e64de69gdb75g40b9ga6f7ga91a36cc5997"
msgid "Never mind. I'm done with mind flayers touching me."
msgstr "관심 꺼. 마인드 플레이어가 내 몸을 만지는 건 이제 진저리가 난다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f17264b2-00da-467e-c31d-1b6d93363a6a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_State_MindFlayerPresent = False
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_State_MindFlayerWasSummoned = True
#.   Local:
#.      - f82ad8fc-1a31-d801-c6d6-0e0ec9c540c3_GreetingHasmet = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:f17264b2-00da-467e-c31d-1b6d93363a6a
msgctxt "h3e8fbf38gc780g4bcag9fe8g5e9d1975e47f"
msgid "Can I talk to Omeluum again?"
msgstr "오멜룸과 다시 이야기할 수 있을까요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = f24a9d9d-d7b4-6f81-3133-927ed934d54c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:f24a9d9d-d7b4-6f81-3133-927ed934d54c
msgctxt "hffb244b5gdaa7g4259g9d24ga6ccf00e071b"
msgid "Why do you not seek refuge among your own on the surface?"
msgstr "어째서 지상에 있는 당신 동족에게 돌아가 도움을 청하지 않는 겁니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = f33ea663-b6b9-eb54-5686-370fbcbb1a94
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar_State_AllowedTrading = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:f33ea663-b6b9-eb54-5686-370fbcbb1a94
msgctxt "ha3feacf2g2e7fg40abgb7f1g7c1df3c6cb07"
msgid ""
"Yes, but it has abundant natural resources. Spores, waterorbs, trillimac! "
"I've studied them for years."
msgstr "맞습니다. 하지만 이곳에는 풍부한 자원이 있지요. 포자, 워터오브, 트릴리막까지! 전 그것들을 수년 동안 연구해 왔습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = f51d143b-c71d-8edc-da95-782c0c75c219
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_SocietyOfBrilliance_State_Hostile = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:f51d143b-c71d-8edc-da95-782c0c75c219
msgctxt "ha5467bdag238fg43d9gacadga4027260cf7c"
msgid "I must complete this study. Entertain yourself elsewhere."
msgstr "연구가 바빠서 말입니다. 다른 곳에서 재미를 찾으시죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Blurg
#. NodeID = f88b1799-4d59-f09a-60ec-86e50194a110
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:f88b1799-4d59-f09a-60ec-86e50194a110
msgctxt "hc75fbeadgf30bg4ee6g944ag84db22ca032b"
msgid "Very well. I have mushrooms to catalogue."
msgstr "아주 좋습니다. 이만, 버섯을 분류해야 해서요."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar
#. Speaker = Omeluum
#. NodeID = fe0e1c24-6c40-df70-07f0-13c278ba887e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_SocietyOfBrilliance_Scholar:fe0e1c24-6c40-df70-07f0-13c278ba887e
msgctxt "ha932fd5cg9777g4be3g83b7ge441b83967e2"
msgid "<i>No ceremorphosis? That's impossible! But intriguing.</i>"
msgstr "<i>뇌변이가 일어나지 않는다니? 그건 불가능해! 그렇지만 흥미로운 현상이야.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_1P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9f154943-5db2-4cda-96c6-927fd839e1df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_1P:9f154943-5db2-4cda-96c6-927fd839e1df
msgctxt "hce877864g54f4g417bg8240g2f7ac466167a"
msgid "So much for Glut. Ashes to ashes, mulch to mulch."
msgstr "글럿은 끝났다. 재는 재로, 거름은 거름으로."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_1P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9f154943-5db2-4cda-96c6-927fd839e1df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_1P:9f154943-5db2-4cda-96c6-927fd839e1df
msgctxt "h2fe337d8g3654g4797g90bfga32fcc1701b9"
msgid ""
"Glut's ambition comes full circle: from foolish inception to foolish demise. "
"Good riddance."
msgstr "글럿의 야망은 원점으로 돌아왔어. 어리석은 계획에서 어리석은 죽음으로. 잘됐지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_1P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9f154943-5db2-4cda-96c6-927fd839e1df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_1P:9f154943-5db2-4cda-96c6-927fd839e1df
msgctxt "h7bcc2addgfe9eg4e37g9219g4edf5edd13ad"
msgid "Well, that's it for old Glut. He gave it his best shot, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_1P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9f154943-5db2-4cda-96c6-927fd839e1df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_1P:9f154943-5db2-4cda-96c6-927fd839e1df
msgctxt "h3b5d8e77g0640g4d4fgbfa5g49c84bb79407"
msgid "This 'Glut' was a demanding sort. But I cannot fault its ambition."
msgstr "'글럿'은 원하는 게 참 많아. 그 야망이 잘못은 아니지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_1P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9f154943-5db2-4cda-96c6-927fd839e1df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_1P:9f154943-5db2-4cda-96c6-927fd839e1df
msgctxt "habb9dc36g6baeg4310g91deg41306abe0d8c"
msgid "Glut will have to settle for being mulch instead of ruler."
msgstr "글럿은 지배자가 아닌, 거름의 운명을 받아들여야 할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_1P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9f154943-5db2-4cda-96c6-927fd839e1df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_1P:9f154943-5db2-4cda-96c6-927fd839e1df
msgctxt "h9f0de398gb541g4b71ga4ffgb1114f26950c"
msgid "Good riddance, Glut. No good could have come from your reign."
msgstr "잘 죽었어, 글럿. 네 통치가 좋지는 않았을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_1P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9f154943-5db2-4cda-96c6-927fd839e1df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: PALADIN_ANCIENTS
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_1P:9f154943-5db2-4cda-96c6-927fd839e1df
msgctxt "h98a58cb4gb135g47c1ga818g12881dd06c1c"
msgid "A usurper falls, another rot cleansed."
msgstr "찬탈자가 죽었군, 또 하나의 부패가 정화되었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_1P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9f154943-5db2-4cda-96c6-927fd839e1df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: PALADIN_DEVOTION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_1P:9f154943-5db2-4cda-96c6-927fd839e1df
msgctxt "h391385b6gcd9eg4a95g9390gd3afb8838e15"
msgid "It seems loyalty only stretches so far in this forsaken place."
msgstr "이 버림받은 곳에선 충성심이 그리 오래가지 않나 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_1P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9f154943-5db2-4cda-96c6-927fd839e1df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: PALADIN_VENGEANCE and NOT_FOR_EA
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_1P:9f154943-5db2-4cda-96c6-927fd839e1df
msgctxt "hb99bd4c4g4711g4417g9aaag8b69b925204a"
msgid "He'd have betrayed the Circle. Same as the duergar - coward."
msgstr "그는 공동체를 배신했어. 듀에르가와 똑같아. 겁쟁이."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_1P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9f154943-5db2-4cda-96c6-927fd839e1df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[9].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_1P:9f154943-5db2-4cda-96c6-927fd839e1df
msgctxt "h4827f067g9d53g4937g92cfga643d1094652"
msgid "The usurper is dead. So much for 'Circle Glut'."
msgstr "찬탈자는 죽었어. '글럿의 공동체'도 끝이고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 747880ea-453c-7f8d-7220-3643d2fb90e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_2P:747880ea-453c-7f8d-7220-3643d2fb90e3
msgctxt "hb8d88878g651eg49e6gb283g6f20b60365ad"
msgid "Poor Glut. All ambition, no competence."
msgstr "불쌍한 글럿. 야심만 많고, 능력이 없네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 747880ea-453c-7f8d-7220-3643d2fb90e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_2P:747880ea-453c-7f8d-7220-3643d2fb90e3
msgctxt "h7b974798g303dg4893gbeebgb33114b2e1b2"
msgid ""
"Glut's ambition comes full circle: from foolish inception to foolish demise."
msgstr "글럿의 야망이 원점으로 돌아왔군. 어리석은 계획에서 어리석은 죽음으로."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 747880ea-453c-7f8d-7220-3643d2fb90e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_2P:747880ea-453c-7f8d-7220-3643d2fb90e3
msgctxt "h534c58bbg06c9g4670gb616g758567d8af44"
msgid "Well, it's lights out for old Glut. He gave it his best shot, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 747880ea-453c-7f8d-7220-3643d2fb90e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_2P:747880ea-453c-7f8d-7220-3643d2fb90e3
msgctxt "h90eafb2cga902g406bgb600g0c68cc420035"
msgid "'Circle Glut' was not meant to be. We saw to that."
msgstr "'글럿의 공동체'는 안될 일이었어. 우린 알았지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 747880ea-453c-7f8d-7220-3643d2fb90e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_2P:747880ea-453c-7f8d-7220-3643d2fb90e3
msgctxt "h8a18653fg04adg4f62gb7c6g4a59377d5d9d"
msgid "Glut will have to settle for being mulch instead of ruler."
msgstr "글럿은 지배자가 아니라, 거름이 되는 운명을 받아들여야 할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 747880ea-453c-7f8d-7220-3643d2fb90e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_2P:747880ea-453c-7f8d-7220-3643d2fb90e3
msgctxt "h4ce0f16dg0630g4fcegadeeg28d75f101b64"
msgid "The Blade always strikes true. There will be no 'Circle Glut'."
msgstr "변경의 칼날은 빗나가지 않아. '글럿의 공동체' 는 없을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 747880ea-453c-7f8d-7220-3643d2fb90e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_2P:747880ea-453c-7f8d-7220-3643d2fb90e3
msgctxt "he5575b10gb071g439cg8794g2103a140afc7"
msgid "The usurper is dead. So much for 'Circle Glut'."
msgstr "찬탈자는 죽었어. '글럿의 공동체'도 끝이고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cc1e1c6f-8c67-4790-9646-4b24ea0242a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_2P:cc1e1c6f-8c67-4790-9646-4b24ea0242a8
msgctxt "h597b56e8ge485g414cg8187gdff31ef7b925"
msgid "I doubt any tears will be shed. Or... secreted? Whatever mushrooms do."
msgstr "그들이 눈물을 흘릴지는 모르겠군. 정확히는...즙이 나온다 해야 하나? 버섯들이 뭘 흘리는지는 모르겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cc1e1c6f-8c67-4790-9646-4b24ea0242a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_2P:cc1e1c6f-8c67-4790-9646-4b24ea0242a8
msgctxt "h23ace1fegf5e6g4b4cga66ag1203d9ef2f82"
msgid "A petty kingdom undone, already lost to history."
msgstr "하찮은 왕국이 멸망했어, 이미 역사 속으로 잊혔군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cc1e1c6f-8c67-4790-9646-4b24ea0242a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_2P:cc1e1c6f-8c67-4790-9646-4b24ea0242a8
msgctxt "h9b87d567g96d6g4803g9f55g0db1adbf476f"
msgid "At least he died doing what he loved: usurping."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cc1e1c6f-8c67-4790-9646-4b24ea0242a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_2P:cc1e1c6f-8c67-4790-9646-4b24ea0242a8
msgctxt "hd48256abg4d2eg4c2fg8827gf385950ba9d9"
msgid "A fitting end for such a craven creature."
msgstr "그런 끔찍한 존재에게 어울리는 결말이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cc1e1c6f-8c67-4790-9646-4b24ea0242a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_2P:cc1e1c6f-8c67-4790-9646-4b24ea0242a8
msgctxt "h2bd47ea8gba90g4ff0g8a64g3b06203ca943"
msgid "I'm not sure I know how to eulogise a giant mushroom. Can we leave?"
msgstr "나는 거대 버섯에게 어떻게 명복을 비는지 모르겠어. 그냥 떠나도 될까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cc1e1c6f-8c67-4790-9646-4b24ea0242a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_2P:cc1e1c6f-8c67-4790-9646-4b24ea0242a8
msgctxt "h878862a5g0d88g42c4ga3fbg2a7f123b433e"
msgid "Good riddance. No good could come of its reign."
msgstr "잘 죽었군. 이런 지배 아래에서는 좋은 일이 일어날 수 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cc1e1c6f-8c67-4790-9646-4b24ea0242a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_GlutDead_2P:cc1e1c6f-8c67-4790-9646-4b24ea0242a8
msgctxt "hff97c066g9daag4f1fgb1deg0481e07b618f"
msgid "A sovereign with no subjects. Glut won't be mourned."
msgstr "백성 없는 군주라. 아무도 글럿을 애도하지 않겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCurious
#. Speaker = Mossy Myconid
#. NodeID = 3d2a1bea-5700-b99f-a840-23ed587fb150
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_MyconidSovereignReward = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCurious:3d2a1bea-5700-b99f-a840-23ed587fb150
msgctxt "hab346417g9b71g4041gae2eg8919a22da41a"
msgid "((*no peace*))"
msgstr "((*평온함 부재*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCurious
#. Speaker = Mossy Myconid
#. NodeID = 7fd1966f-a2d7-8a15-7060-cad7389eed6b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_MyconidSovereignReward = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidCurious:7fd1966f-a2d7-8a15-7060-cad7389eed6b
msgctxt "h48f9acf5g9d8bg4928ga73bg69f953c04f89"
msgid "((*the Circle lauds you. be welcome*))"
msgstr "((*공동체가 그대를 찬미한다. 환영을 받으라*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidFoolhardy
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 03317a47-ced8-6516-5786-006c128884f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_MyconidFoolhardyHasmet(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_MyconidCircle_MyconidFoolhardyHasmet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidFoolhardy:03317a47-ced8-6516-5786-006c128884f7
msgctxt "hae22827fga825g41begb984g0d4422eaf349"
msgid ""
"*Angry trills and tremors shake your skull - cries of anguish to its mycelic "
"god.*"
msgstr "*분노에 찬 울림과 떨림이 당신의 두개골을 뒤흔들며 균사체 신을 향한 고뇌의 외침이 울려 퍼집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidFoolhardy
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 312dd545-85da-9d37-12e4-215e36bd0750
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_MyconidSovereignReward = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidFoolhardy:312dd545-85da-9d37-12e4-215e36bd0750
msgctxt "h9128a7d5g328ag49fcga4eeg12cc78f3aa64"
msgid "*The myconid soothes you with hums and whistles.*"
msgstr "*마이코니드가 콧노래와 휘파람으로 당신을 진정시킵니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidFoolhardy
#. Speaker = Mossy Myconid
#. NodeID = 4c7189e7-3e64-b02a-e869-79b4ea6d7956
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_MyconidFoolhardyHasmet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidFoolhardy:4c7189e7-3e64-b02a-e869-79b4ea6d7956
msgctxt "h57e16028ge85dg498egbcc7g84fb73e9e117"
msgid "((*why. <i>why</i>*))"
msgstr "((*어째서.<i>어째서</i>*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidMelancholic
#. Speaker = Restless Myconid
#. NodeID = 384b4736-dc79-d0b3-f245-9a5f55679e24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_MyconidSovereignReward = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidMelancholic:384b4736-dc79-d0b3-f245-9a5f55679e24
msgctxt "he1d6c39dgea46g4a3agb97bg1c2ed9d6f86f"
msgid "((*cleanse the <b>Rot</b>*))"
msgstr "((*<b>부패를</b> 정화한다*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidMelancholic
#. Speaker = Restless Myconid
#. NodeID = 8a3cf9ac-1af6-eff1-edcf-3e43b8624504
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_MyconidSovereignReward = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidMelancholic:8a3cf9ac-1af6-eff1-edcf-3e43b8624504
msgctxt "h12fafda7g1196g469fga0cdg1096295f4fc8"
msgid "((*the Rot is cleansed*))"
msgstr "((*부패는 정화되었다*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidNaive
#. Speaker = Restless Myconid
#. NodeID = 0ddedef2-b620-cc5f-7747-1808d5700327
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_MyconidCricle_MyconidNaiveHasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidNaive:0ddedef2-b620-cc5f-7747-1808d5700327
msgctxt "h655d8b2dg5a5cg4b6bgb365gb87bd76ab096"
msgid "((*we will find truth in dream*))"
msgstr "((*우린 꿈속에서 진실을 찾을 겁니다.*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidNaive
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 97b5bc34-2048-6c2d-fc78-9a89c071d532
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_MyconidCricle_MyconidNaiveHasMet(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_MyconidCricle_MyconidNaiveHasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidNaive:97b5bc34-2048-6c2d-fc78-9a89c071d532
msgctxt "h8da1388cgae90g4326gb60fg9c741d6fcc41"
msgid "*The creature's inner song breathes hope into the myconid meld.*"
msgstr "*그 크리쳐의 내면의 노래는 마이코니드 멜드에 희망을 불어넣습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidNaive
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = aa6ce351-16d7-22e1-b0fe-deaf8ef72929
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_MyconidSovereignReward = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidNaive:aa6ce351-16d7-22e1-b0fe-deaf8ef72929
msgctxt "hff09c3ecg8ea7g4d6ag9936g53674558a85a"
msgid ""
"*The myconid greets you with pure sensation: sadness and joy, intermingled.*"
msgstr "*마이코니드가 당신을 순수한 느낌으로 반깁니다: 슬픔 그리고 기쁨이 섞인 느낌*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidRevenge_NereHeadLoot
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 180a8c13-a030-4c12-bd79-03a84ef164c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidRevenge_NereHeadLoot:180a8c13-a030-4c12-bd79-03a84ef164c3
msgctxt "hf6501324g8edag42a0gb60eg8c95168f764e"
msgid "*The decaying corpse lies before you.*"
msgstr "*썩어가는 시체가 당신 앞에 놓여 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidRevenge_NereHeadLoot
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 1c950961-e41c-4a73-a473-0dd9dc8e3812
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidRevenge_NereHeadLoot:1c950961-e41c-4a73-a473-0dd9dc8e3812
msgctxt "h8ee894b2g2ce0g48aag84f0ga9d50587111b"
msgid "Like watching a lemure eat porridge. Messy and unsettling."
msgstr "레무어의 곤죽 파티라도 보는 것 같아, 더럽고 끔찍하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidRevenge_NereHeadLoot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1cab96e6-19e5-cf4b-f67e-67919a19a901
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Strength
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidRevenge_NereHeadLoot:1cab96e6-19e5-cf4b-f67e-67919a19a901
msgctxt "h2d145beagab0dg482fg8b30g427396d1c0b9"
msgid "<i>Remove its head.</i>"
msgstr "<i>머리를 제거한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidRevenge_NereHeadLoot
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 1f1cfde4-ef34-4ed9-8c68-4f7f2de694ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidRevenge_NereHeadLoot:1f1cfde4-ef34-4ed9-8c68-4f7f2de694ca
msgctxt "h691c8871g3474g48e1g8436g72736ba1a110"
msgid "Bah - a pathetic show. Yet undeniably satisfying to watch."
msgstr "쳇- 한심한 광경이야. 하지만 확실히 만족스럽군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidRevenge_NereHeadLoot
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 2a59f0d7-d8b2-4110-9f62-43c9fc2a4e31
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(6) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidRevenge_NereHeadLoot:2a59f0d7-d8b2-4110-9f62-43c9fc2a4e31
msgctxt "h2477bc3eg598dg4c0dgb0f5g65229de711d0"
msgid "Ugh - more blood than an abattoir."
msgstr "우웩 - 도축장보다 피가 많아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidRevenge_NereHeadLoot
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 6d8cea69-45e7-4833-9cf2-6738b8d96f73
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidRevenge_NereHeadLoot:6d8cea69-45e7-4833-9cf2-6738b8d96f73
msgctxt "h4b322d98gdedag4a4cga7bcg3f2cc9781fe0"
msgid "I sincerely hope you never find employment as an executioner."
msgstr "사형집행인을 직업으로 가지지 않기를 진심으로 바라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidRevenge_NereHeadLoot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 79614551-686b-4835-8306-5dd2917277f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_HeadRemoval_Event_OpenLoot(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidRevenge_NereHeadLoot:79614551-686b-4835-8306-5dd2917277f6
msgctxt "h31f534a3g4fe0g4d8dgae39geb614bf23360"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidRevenge_NereHeadLoot
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 7ea0d40c-c740-8eb8-4a83-606874dd1cb2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_MyconidRevenge_Event_FailedRemoval(1) = True
#.     - GLO_HeadRemoval_Event_HeadToInventory(1) = True
#.     - UND_MyconidRevenge_Event_TakeHead(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidRevenge_NereHeadLoot:7ea0d40c-c740-8eb8-4a83-606874dd1cb2
msgctxt "hab31c955gbb57g4c19gaa32g65b94667c108"
msgid "*You finish wresting the head from the drow's twisted neck.*"
msgstr "*당신은 드로우의 뒤틀린 목에서 머리를 뽑는 것을 마무리합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidRevenge_NereHeadLoot
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = a8a9246a-8f99-4b0d-b189-9c04b064a69e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(7) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidRevenge_NereHeadLoot:a8a9246a-8f99-4b0d-b189-9c04b064a69e
msgctxt "h21f71293g2012g4e80gab21gab26fd9ea2f7"
msgid "I can lend you a third left hand if you need one."
msgstr "필요하면 세번째 왼손 하나를 더 빌려줄 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidRevenge_NereHeadLoot
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = bb768115-d9d6-41be-88ab-6f3d3f581614
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(5) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidRevenge_NereHeadLoot:bb768115-d9d6-41be-88ab-6f3d3f581614
msgctxt "h3261b3e2g267cg4639ga192g3180f53974e9"
msgid ""
"What are you - have you never decapitated a corpse before?! Urgh, what a "
"waste..."
msgstr "뭐야 - 시체 목을 잘라 본적 없어?! 으으, 쓸모 없는 것 같으니..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidRevenge_NereHeadLoot
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e84f2c83-d9ae-4f6c-be86-c06b57b2c965
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_HeadRemoval_Event_HeadToInventory(1) = True
#.     - UND_MyconidRevenge_Event_TakeHead(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidRevenge_NereHeadLoot:e84f2c83-d9ae-4f6c-be86-c06b57b2c965
msgctxt "h5da36cf9gf65cg4a7aga51cgdeaf59c701f8"
msgid "*The head breaks off cleanly from the drow's body.*"
msgstr "*머리가 드로우의 몸에서 깔끔하게 분리됩니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 001b02cd-e9c2-1c80-7e02-01939cc0aa07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_DUERGARDWARF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:001b02cd-e9c2-1c80-7e02-01939cc0aa07
msgctxt "h1c384efagd6f0g451egb96cg76e75dc8bcf2"
msgid ""
"*Then, you see visions. Duergar like yourself, chopping myconid remains with "
"their axes.*"
msgstr "*그리고는, 환영이 보입니다. 당신과 같은 듀에르가가 그들의 도끼로 마이코니드 시체에서 머리를 잘라내는 광경입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 001b02cd-e9c2-1c80-7e02-01939cc0aa07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:001b02cd-e9c2-1c80-7e02-01939cc0aa07
msgctxt "hb56bf424g22b9g43ecg9f2fg11375284a41e"
msgid ""
"*Then, you see visions. Dark dwarves - duergar - chopping myconid remains "
"with their axes.*"
msgstr "*그리고 당신에게 광경이 보입니다. 어두운 드워프들인 듀에르가가 마이코니드 유해를 도끼로 썰고 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Sovereign Spaw
#. NodeID = 03ea9f67-4d14-c096-bbc8-8c96a5ad4d41
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_MyconidSovereignReward = True
#.      - UND_MyconidRevenge_State_SentKillNere = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:03ea9f67-4d14-c096-bbc8-8c96a5ad4d41
msgctxt "hfcf65750g1e45g4eb7g9a47g133e5c9b4c96"
msgid ""
"((*the songs we sing now carry your spirit. I first named you <b>Peace-"
"Bringer</b>. I now name you <b>Kin Spirit</b>*))"
msgstr ""
"((*우리가 지금 부르는 노래는 너의 영혼을 담고 있다. 나는 너를 <b>평화 인도자</b>라는 이름으로 불렀다. 지금부터는 <b>동지 "
"영혼</b>이라는 이름으로 부르겠다*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 049d63ae-2283-bf46-6209-8a29c8cddb90
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:049d63ae-2283-bf46-6209-8a29c8cddb90
msgctxt "ha27c0f13g72a7g4cc1g924dgc22929ec4f33"
msgid "This Nere sounds like bad news. I guess we could lend a hand, right?"
msgstr "니어라는 드로우는 좋아 보이지 않는군. 우리가 도와줄 수 있겠지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Sovereign Glut
#. NodeID = 0520f01d-6a6f-9f82-d10f-71ec3ba13904
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:0520f01d-6a6f-9f82-d10f-71ec3ba13904
msgctxt "h1311a564gebadg4480g97f5g36e608c9e0bd"
msgid "((*you give us <b>nothing</b>. we will take <b>everything</b>*))"
msgstr "((*넌 우리에게 <b>아무것도 주지 않는다</b>. 우린 <b>모든 걸 가져가겠다</b>*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Sovereign Spaw
#. NodeID = 054754a2-0ae9-efae-3494-5c21213ce54b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:054754a2-0ae9-efae-3494-5c21213ce54b
msgctxt "h9eea166bg0c74g4392g959fg9ca83734e40b"
msgid "((*from there, your choices are your own*))"
msgstr "((*거기서부터 무엇을 할지 택하는 건 너의 몫이다*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 069af61b-a38f-ad46-accb-2cfedf1760c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:069af61b-a38f-ad46-accb-2cfedf1760c3
msgctxt "h805af719g74a5g44b6g80abgcb6fdbe7fc97"
msgid "*The music shifts - still melancholic, but now streaked with hope.*"
msgstr "*음악이 바뀝니다. 여전히 우울하지만, 이제는 희망이 섞여 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 06bb13e8-08f1-2379-a464-5cb5ea801312
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DRAGONBORN(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:06bb13e8-08f1-2379-a464-5cb5ea801312
msgctxt "hb442ec8ag2982g495bg9626g7783872986b4"
msgid "I know the value of clan. Let me enter, so I may help yours."
msgstr "난 무리의 가치를 이해해. 너희를 도울 수 있게 나를 받아들여 줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 07a16557-f567-7c63-81a8-0cb0e797c884
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_Event_AskedAboutDuergar = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_MyconidCircle_Event_AskedAboutDuergar = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:07a16557-f567-7c63-81a8-0cb0e797c884
msgctxt "h4d9f7cb8g25dag41c7gba1fg10f60a8aeabe"
msgid "The duergar attacked you in those visions - why?"
msgstr "그 환상 속의 듀에르가는 너희를 공격했어. 어째서지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 07ea9d27-7e1d-67eb-9605-c08469275bfa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_MyconidRevenge_State_HeadInaccessible = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:07ea9d27-7e1d-67eb-9605-c08469275bfa
msgctxt "h347aeb6egd654g4eb9gb117g26075ddb8ad5"
msgid "There'll be another reward for this, I hope."
msgstr "이 일에 대한 보상이 있었으면 좋겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0b4075ce-0e8b-56d1-2b9b-fb0bc2e2352f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DUERGARDWARF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:0b4075ce-0e8b-56d1-2b9b-fb0bc2e2352f
msgctxt "h4d120b1bg3ce9g449dg818cg721d7a9395d8"
msgid ""
"*The sovereign shows one more vision: a wall of vines parting to reveal "
"glowing light.*"
msgstr "*군주가 또 하나의 환영을 보여줍니다: 덩굴 벽이 갈라지며 번쩍이는 빛을 드러냅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0b4075ce-0e8b-56d1-2b9b-fb0bc2e2352f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:0b4075ce-0e8b-56d1-2b9b-fb0bc2e2352f
msgctxt "hb89a23a2gdf14g4305ga71ag742a30be9dac"
msgid ""
"*The sovereign gifts you one more vision: a wall of vines parting to reveal "
"glowing light.*"
msgstr "*군주가 또 하나의 환영을 선사합니다: 덩굴 벽이 갈라지며 번쩍이는 빛을 드러냅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Sovereign Spaw
#. NodeID = 0beef4f0-f25a-dc58-b2b5-41a5fdf202ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_MyconidRevenge_State_QuestCompleted = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - UND_MyconidRevenge.Rewarded(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:0beef4f0-f25a-dc58-b2b5-41a5fdf202ea
msgctxt "hddb2b8efg7534g4d59g98c5g38117b954e4f"
msgid ""
"((*the drow sought to shatter our Circle. now his flesh may feed its "
"growth*))"
msgstr "((*이 드로우는 우리 공동체를 산산조각내려 했다. 이제 그의 살이 공동체의 성장에 영양분을 공급할 것이다*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0d87d892-a85e-6b6f-65a7-1605f2eeeb01
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_MyconidCircle_State_GainedAccess = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:0d87d892-a85e-6b6f-65a7-1605f2eeeb01
msgctxt "hb59f3cc9g95a8g4f93ga1f6g48b2a148ec8b"
msgid "*Fungal roots weave through your mind, seeking your true intent.*"
msgstr "*포자 뿌리들이 당신 내면을 휘저으며 속마음을 알아내려 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0f6fd874-2b25-aa82-5b6a-db0d762550ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:0f6fd874-2b25-aa82-5b6a-db0d762550ed
msgctxt "h485beda5gdbc5g4c39g9992g10e561679c5c"
msgid "I think I've had enough of running your errands."
msgstr "너희 심부름은 충분히 했다고 생각해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 106a2d0f-0f2b-7c6d-18fd-734de745e40f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:106a2d0f-0f2b-7c6d-18fd-734de745e40f
msgctxt "h055df989g99c5g4485gade5gbdb3d3178fd4"
msgid ""
"*You are one with Spaw. Your throat tightens, then relaxes. The air is "
"serene, your mind untroubled.*"
msgstr "*당신은 스포와 하나가 됩니다. 목이 조였다 이완됩니다. 공기는 고요하고, 마음은 평온합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 12f575b3-bbdd-8128-f811-48aa9b7bbdf1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:12f575b3-bbdd-8128-f811-48aa9b7bbdf1
msgctxt "h605bf7b8g7bedg4130g994agfa9ceff82155"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1321061e-601c-da4f-0f22-b9e9d3d7dad0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:1321061e-601c-da4f-0f22-b9e9d3d7dad0
msgctxt "h560d6fa4g26e8g43f4g9340g8410e919a22f"
msgid "<i>Conjure tranquil memories in hopes of calming the sovereign.</i>"
msgstr "<i>군주를 진정시키기 위해 평온한 기억을 떠올린다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 1533d2af-fe19-d531-30c8-6e0013ea7f15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - c9645362-c2d9-4642-459f-b28f474f8241_ShadowheartInclusion = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:1533d2af-fe19-d531-30c8-6e0013ea7f15
msgctxt "h76c3dd9egebc3g4548gb90fgb9f5cebd3543"
msgid "Don't worry. I wouldn't hesitate."
msgstr "걱정 마라. 조금도 망설이지 않을 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 187e9dee-c09d-8cb2-1b44-0ebe72687b68
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_MyconidRevenge_State_HeadInaccessible = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:187e9dee-c09d-8cb2-1b44-0ebe72687b68
msgctxt "hbca8b403gc2bag4ffag91ccgd690cb48e58a"
msgid "Nere is dead, but his head is lost to me."
msgstr "니어는 죽었지만, 그의 머리는 사라졌어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1a33808a-1f8f-e3f0-a705-a4219636367a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_Event_AskedAboutDuergar = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_MyconidCircle_AcceptedQuest = True
#.     - UND_MyconidCircle_Event_AskedAboutDuergar = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:1a33808a-1f8f-e3f0-a705-a4219636367a
msgctxt "h25f5d555g319dg43cfg945fg815af5fa9e45"
msgid ""
"<i>Reply in kind. </i>((*tell me of the invaders. how the scourge moves, "
"fights. how it will crumble*))"
msgstr "<i>친절하게 답한다. </i>((*침입자들에 대해 말해줘. 녀석들이 어떻게 싸웠는지, 어떻게 무너질지*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 1b25ce96-46f7-40fa-a28b-06a0c14560af
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(7) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:1b25ce96-46f7-40fa-a28b-06a0c14560af
msgctxt "h31538f45ga151g4469g8f10g6bd46a905432"
msgid "My, but this sovereign likes to delegate."
msgstr "이런, 이 군주는 위임하는 걸 좋아하는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Sovereign Spaw
#. NodeID = 1b5ec4f4-6363-5d16-58fc-0dc673e99fe7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:1b5ec4f4-6363-5d16-58fc-0dc673e99fe7
msgctxt "h68551846ga256g4ad8gba70g282da66c28fc"
msgid "((*I ask a boon, and will give one in return*))"
msgstr "((*나는 요청하면, 그 보답을 준다*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Sovereign Spaw
#. NodeID = 1dcc36cc-9d53-e9a3-ece2-3992fc9e9c09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_DUERGARDWARF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:1dcc36cc-9d53-e9a3-ece2-3992fc9e9c09
msgctxt "h1dfe857cg4341g4cd2gbe03g5c320da1bb8a"
msgid "((*your kind <b>broke</b> our peace. they <b>killed our young</b>*))"
msgstr "((*너의 동족이 우리 평화를 <b>깨뜨렸다</b>. 그들이 <b>우리 젊은이들을 죽였다</b>*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Sovereign Spaw
#. NodeID = 1dcc36cc-9d53-e9a3-ece2-3992fc9e9c09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:1dcc36cc-9d53-e9a3-ece2-3992fc9e9c09
msgctxt "hc63b5bfcgbe01g4d0agb334g131c9825360f"
msgid "((*they <b>broke</b> our peace. they <b>killed our young</b>*))"
msgstr "((*이 자들은 우리 평화를 <b>깨뜨렸다</b>. 그들이 <b>우리 젊은이들을 죽였다</b>*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Sovereign Spaw
#. NodeID = 1eb3486d-0c3f-5010-b7fd-f9a488938428
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:1eb3486d-0c3f-5010-b7fd-f9a488938428
msgctxt "h696f39a8g4f88g4bf1g866dg4afc2e3f4f3c"
msgid ""
"((*the songs we sing now carry your spirit. you shall now be called <b>Kin "
"Spirit</b>*))"
msgstr "((*우리가 지금 부르는 노래에는 너의 영혼이 담겨 있다. 이제부터 너는 <b>동지 영혼</b>이라 불릴 것이다.*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1f6f8d78-a8e5-f8e4-2ca0-da379f9b225e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_MyconidSovereign_State_PlayerSawResurrection = True
#.      - UND_MyconidSovereign_Event_ResurrectedDead = False
#.   Local:
#.      - c9645362-c2d9-4642-459f-b28f474f8241_AskedAboutCorpse = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC(1) = False
#.      - REALLY_UNDERDARK(1) = False
#.      - PALADIN(1) = False
#.      - BARD(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - c9645362-c2d9-4642-459f-b28f474f8241_AskedAboutCorpse = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:1f6f8d78-a8e5-f8e4-2ca0-da379f9b225e
msgctxt "h7b1fa902g5f30g491eg8d22g38c9bb44d0bb"
msgid "What in the hells did you do to that corpse?"
msgstr "그 시체에 도대체 무슨 짓을 한 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Sovereign Spaw
#. NodeID = 1f8fe68c-37e3-f591-0b07-007f84fb3d24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_MyconidRevenge_State_SentKillNere = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - UND_MyconidRevenge.AcceptedSpaw(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:1f8fe68c-37e3-f591-0b07-007f84fb3d24
msgctxt "h9080211dgba2ag48fagbba7g2de8f9891640"
msgid ""
"((*<b>Nere</b>, this one is called. he hunted us - hunt him in turn. bring "
"me his head, and I will know my Circle is safe*))"
msgstr ""
"((*이자는 <b>니어</b>이니라. 놈이 우리를 사냥했으니, 이제 놈이 사냥당할 차례다. 네가 놈의 머리를 가져오면, 내 공동체가 "
"안전해졌다는 뜻으로 받아들이겠다*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 222ab3d4-0100-23e3-c092-17155e36a237
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_MyconidCircle_Event_BetraySpaw = True
#.     - UND_MyconidCircle_State_Hostile = True
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:222ab3d4-0100-23e3-c092-17155e36a237
msgctxt "h2c891836gf8cdg415ag9ba0ga6eb441cb4d1"
msgid "You named me poorly, Spaw. I bring you death."
msgstr "이름을 잘못 지었어, 스포. 널 죽일 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Sovereign Spaw
#. NodeID = 223b5d98-1609-8636-781b-99efed2f1e09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_MyconidCircle_State_Hostile = True
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:223b5d98-1609-8636-781b-99efed2f1e09
msgctxt "h92b22719g670fg45f0g99f5g2ee5c8c3e206"
msgid "((*vile beast. cure the Rot. <b>end it</b>*))"
msgstr "((*추악한 짐승이군. 부패를 치유해라. <b>저것을 끝내라</b>*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 25c1fa02-bc07-fc59-1663-a9e2b9486f8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:25c1fa02-bc07-fc59-1663-a9e2b9486f8a
msgctxt "hade3a486gc3f1g4053g8507g11b37988ea8e"
msgid "These spores hold such power. How might I gain this knowledge?"
msgstr "이 포자들에 그런 힘이 담겼구나. 내가 어떻게 하면 이 지식을 얻을 수 있을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 261f1752-ac83-3a7c-6a85-30859cc7680c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 20
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BERSERKER(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:261f1752-ac83-3a7c-6a85-30859cc7680c
msgctxt "h970af8eegfc32g4695g9f0ag8f29b917271d"
msgid "Do you truly wish to do battle with a great warrior?"
msgstr "진정으로 위대한 전사와 전투를 벌이기 원하는가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Sovereign Spaw
#. NodeID = 29b6697c-0ab6-1bcb-ec31-8849ee62053b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_Quest_LoneDuergar_Defeated = True
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_MyconidSovereignReward = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:29b6697c-0ab6-1bcb-ec31-8849ee62053b
msgctxt "h85209a52g5a71g4cbdgb6f7g4cf410334b38"
msgid ""
"((*and I sense only silence from the duergar hunters - the Rot is cleansed*))"
msgstr "((*듀에르가 사냥꾼들에게도 침묵만이 느껴지는군. 부패는 정화되었다*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Sovereign Spaw
#. NodeID = 2e55ab66-4419-be52-b461-ded6e22ca54c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:2e55ab66-4419-be52-b461-ded6e22ca54c
msgctxt "h8dbf6dbagf2cdg437dga6bdg4ba77c4c4143"
msgid ""
"((*I can only ask, and reward in return. if your path takes you to the ruins "
"beyond the lake, you will find the drow*))"
msgstr ""
"((*나는 요청하고, 처리해 주면 보답할 뿐이다. 너의 길을 호수 너머 폐허로 정했다면, 그곳에서 그 드로우도 만나게 될 것이다*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 2ee7817e-84a2-24c8-c47c-8ed9d0953fe4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:2ee7817e-84a2-24c8-c47c-8ed9d0953fe4
msgctxt "h56e184c4g7dd4g41a2g9a94g1ebc25d0a746"
msgid ""
"*The sovereign's song slows to the pace of a dirge. It is still in mourning.*"
msgstr "*군주의 노래가 장송곡의 속도로 느려집니다. 그는 지금도 애도하고 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Sovereign Spaw
#. NodeID = 2f334178-0224-ed62-55be-bc13fc9807ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:2f334178-0224-ed62-55be-bc13fc9807ba
msgctxt "hdca3c507gf1f3g4e5ag8466gd1d79e596466"
msgid ""
"((*we laid waste to many. you bring yet another. you bring us <b>the "
"Rot</b>*))"
msgstr "((*우리는 그들 중 다수를 죽였다. 그런데도 너희는 또 다른 <b>썩은 자</b>를 데려왔군*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Sovereign Spaw
#. NodeID = 33eabd68-cbf1-b2f5-b5d7-c0114fcf7f4e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:33eabd68-cbf1-b2f5-b5d7-c0114fcf7f4e
msgctxt "h4971e77ag2a6cg4a0fg8eebg6587cd0f24dd"
msgid ""
"((*the drow lurks in the ruins beyond the lake. bring him death, and "
"return*))"
msgstr "((*호수 너머 폐허에 드로우가 숨어있다. 그에게 죽음을 인도하고 돌아와라*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 342c9a76-8f0a-12ec-dd6f-1e970cca8cad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_Event_AskedAboutDuergar = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_MyconidCircle_Event_AskedAboutDuergar = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_DUERGARDWARF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:342c9a76-8f0a-12ec-dd6f-1e970cca8cad
msgctxt "h403dfde3g96a3g44b2g8313g45badea057f4"
msgid "Why did this clan attack?"
msgstr "그들이 왜 공격한 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 342c9a76-8f0a-12ec-dd6f-1e970cca8cad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_MyconidCircle_Event_AskedAboutDuergar = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_MyconidCircle_Event_AskedAboutDuergar = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:342c9a76-8f0a-12ec-dd6f-1e970cca8cad
msgctxt "h2658f02bgb8a0g4d76ga402gfaf9ab6c9049"
msgid "Why did these duergar attack?"
msgstr "그 듀에르가는 왜 공격한 것이지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 35942605-8ec7-9846-9bb1-fad59870f3a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:35942605-8ec7-9846-9bb1-fad59870f3a7
msgctxt "h19f12423g3bb6g4a53g9f51g031b39671caa"
msgid ""
"*The sovereign's song twists into images: duergar changing size. Slipping in "
"and out of invisibility. Invoking craven divinity.*"
msgstr ""
"*군주의 노래가 뒤틀리며 형상을 보여줍니다: 듀에르가가 크기를 바꾸고. 투명화를 해제하며. 비겁한 신성 주문을 외우고 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 375e4476-4291-9407-ed61-c20ebb91dc8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:375e4476-4291-9407-ed61-c20ebb91dc8a
msgctxt "hfb06bf23gf658g47c6g9827gc5afa5bac52f"
msgid ""
"*An illusion comes over you: a duergar, choking on a cloud of gleaming dust.*"
msgstr "*환영이 나타납니다: 듀에르가 한 명이 빛나는 먼지 구름에 질식하고 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Sovereign Spaw
#. NodeID = 38416e17-12f9-ce11-e99b-a207d56fee06
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign:38416e17-12f9-ce11-e99b-a207d56fee06
msgctxt "h1f68c0f8gf6e0g4e1cg87cdg57f4df8f465c"
msgid "((*freely you have given to us. freely you may take*))"
msgstr "((*네가 자의로 우리에게 도움을 주었으니, 자유롭게 가져가도 좋다*))"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_MyconidSovereign
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 38d4f1a7-574d-e595-fa8e-0e3b0264ba11
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
