msgid "Father Murmath. Father Murmath. Father Murmath."
msgstr "파더 무르마스. 파더 무르마스. 파더 무르마스."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SpiderFight_Spider04
#. Speaker = Lur Fu
#. NodeID = a77eb24f-5078-4c78-a272-193d4820b1ad
