msgctxt "h1dd65babg1c2fg4fc7gbb20g6c530a291c40"
msgid "No Spider Queen. No Spider Queen. Father Murmath."
msgstr "거미 여왕은 안 돼. 거미 여왕은 안 돼. 파더 무르마스."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SpiderFight_Spider04
