msgid "*KRSK!*"
msgstr "*키이익!*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SporeServant_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b0377182-a1d9-4d9c-8c59-6118b1b0394f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SporeServant_PAD:b0377182-a1d9-4d9c-8c59-6118b1b0394f
msgctxt "heb211e07g962fg47c4g99c5g5a3151525f7d"
msgid "Looks like I'm swearing off mushroom soup."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SporeServant_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b0377182-a1d9-4d9c-8c59-6118b1b0394f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SporeServant_PAD:b0377182-a1d9-4d9c-8c59-6118b1b0394f
msgctxt "hc861a0cdgc4c6g47eegb30dg990134048347"
msgid ""
"They could barely hold staves, let alone greatswords. Raising warriors to "
"fight for them - ingenious."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SporeServant_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b0377182-a1d9-4d9c-8c59-6118b1b0394f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SporeServant_PAD:b0377182-a1d9-4d9c-8c59-6118b1b0394f
msgctxt "h8e838eb5ga54fg48cdga1c5gaba78d21fb3f"
msgid ""
"They're just husks. I couldn't care less if they're slaves or building "
"material."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SporeServant_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b0377182-a1d9-4d9c-8c59-6118b1b0394f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SporeServant_PAD:b0377182-a1d9-4d9c-8c59-6118b1b0394f
msgctxt "h09c7388agf4f0g4c3eg8703gc4b0896a208c"
msgid "What's a little stench in exchange for a lot of power?"
msgstr "큰 힘을 대가로 그깟 악취가 별거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SporeServant_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b0377182-a1d9-4d9c-8c59-6118b1b0394f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SporeServant_PAD:b0377182-a1d9-4d9c-8c59-6118b1b0394f
msgctxt "h108da6b5g716ag4b03g8e04gab9e8e05dd2e"
msgid "Why fight yourself if you can get someone else to do it for you, right?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SporeServant_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b0377182-a1d9-4d9c-8c59-6118b1b0394f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SporeServant_PAD:b0377182-a1d9-4d9c-8c59-6118b1b0394f
msgctxt "h85ff8a96g49cag443cga5c2g13136291e989"
msgid ""
"In such environs, their efficiency is to be admired. Nothing goes to waste."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SporeServant_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b0377182-a1d9-4d9c-8c59-6118b1b0394f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SporeServant_PAD:b0377182-a1d9-4d9c-8c59-6118b1b0394f
msgctxt "hd085cb97ga115g458fgb7d2ga1cb8e1e3841"
msgid "Handy magic, that. Maybe it'll be of use to us."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SporeServant_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eb32ab98-61db-4b79-98e2-aaa74531435d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SporeServant_PAD:eb32ab98-61db-4b79-98e2-aaa74531435d
msgctxt "h816d308agd402g4b4eg8614ge2ea961f3bf0"
msgid "I'd heard myconids were peaceful. I say it's time for a rethink."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SporeServant_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eb32ab98-61db-4b79-98e2-aaa74531435d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SporeServant_PAD:eb32ab98-61db-4b79-98e2-aaa74531435d
msgctxt "hf0706ab2g90b5g4a68gb844g79c8e7299e23"
msgid ""
"Raising the dead is easier than capturing slaves. The drow in Menzoberranzan "
"could learn something."
msgstr "죽은 자를 되살리는 게 노예를 잡는 것보다 쉬운 편이지. 멘조베란잔의 드로우도 뭔가 배워야 했는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SporeServant_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eb32ab98-61db-4b79-98e2-aaa74531435d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SporeServant_PAD:eb32ab98-61db-4b79-98e2-aaa74531435d
msgctxt "h4d99bfdbg5919g4e01gb907g8baf41c6e258"
msgid "Bringing back slain foes as your lackeys? Clever."
msgstr "죽인 적들을 종으로 되살린 건가? 영리하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SporeServant_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eb32ab98-61db-4b79-98e2-aaa74531435d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SporeServant_PAD:eb32ab98-61db-4b79-98e2-aaa74531435d
msgctxt "h7d6a828ag88bfg476fg9246g3faff1bd0d43"
msgid "So much for harmony. These creatures <i>sting.</i>"
msgstr "조화가 지나치군. 이 생물들은 <i>불쾌해.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SporeServant_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eb32ab98-61db-4b79-98e2-aaa74531435d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SporeServant_PAD:eb32ab98-61db-4b79-98e2-aaa74531435d
msgctxt "h629a037egd9e0g4be5gb2b9gef26da0253d8"
msgid ""
"Spores that can raise the dead... These myconids certainly are fascinating "
"creatures."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SporeServant_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eb32ab98-61db-4b79-98e2-aaa74531435d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SporeServant_PAD:eb32ab98-61db-4b79-98e2-aaa74531435d
msgctxt "h83c8acfagaac4g4562gb646g67115756ad75"
msgid "Now that's a good use of a spent soldier."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SporeServant_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eb32ab98-61db-4b79-98e2-aaa74531435d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GENERIC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SporeServant_PAD:eb32ab98-61db-4b79-98e2-aaa74531435d
msgctxt "h0d10cd1ag6d1bg44d2ga4efge35acd9e9e9a"
msgid "So those mushrooms can raise the dead? That's... interesting."
msgstr "이 버섯들이 죽은 자를 일으켜 세울 수 있다고? 그건... 재밌네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 004c15fa-bd17-a034-e85e-25df406f9eb0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:004c15fa-bd17-a034-e85e-25df406f9eb0
msgctxt "h9ed21fdcgcea9g4ebfgb9e3ge7d5c83c145e"
msgid "I'm more than my magic. Right?"
msgstr "나는 내 마법 이상의 의미가 있어. 그렇지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 004d9327-6f1f-b552-fffd-b4afb4892a2d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(5) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:004d9327-6f1f-b552-fffd-b4afb4892a2d
msgctxt "hf6ba207egd774g4949g82deg9981dfcca5cf"
msgid ""
"An owlbear's pissed in your porridge, from the sounds of it. Just remember: "
"I'm not your enemy here."
msgstr "말투가, 아울베어가 네 밥에 오줌이라도 쌌나 봐? 명심해, 여기서 나는 네 적이 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0431884d-bc1e-8908-579a-245f3bd88102
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:0431884d-bc1e-8908-579a-245f3bd88102
msgctxt "h7c31db65g00e8g4227gb882ge3398cafb11b"
msgid "Yes - I need my powers back <i>now.</i>"
msgstr "그래, 내 힘을 돌려 받고 싶어, <i>당장이라도.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 04d96890-a27d-1b6b-c913-74324e4ff6d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SORCERER_DRACONIC(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:04d96890-a27d-1b6b-c913-74324e4ff6d2
msgctxt "h6d4c7623g23ecg4609gad79gda60ef2148dc"
msgid "<i>Call on your ancestor. You will not submit!</i>"
msgstr "<i>선조의 힘을 끌어낸다. 굴복하지 않을 것이다!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 071f3d7e-6ba0-4e14-c908-72772b1d03a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:071f3d7e-6ba0-4e14-c908-72772b1d03a7
msgctxt "hbb0a0f34ge781g4c35g8de1g173b09a47547"
msgid ""
"Your business is mine, and vice versa. We're relying on each other, remember?"
msgstr "네 일은 곧 내 일이야, 반대도 마찬가지고. 우린 서로에게 의존하고 있잖아, 알지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0936dca7-7c01-a01d-b6d7-2c02411e502d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:0936dca7-7c01-a01d-b6d7-2c02411e502d
msgctxt "he597ac34g37a6g48d5gab65g48f27ba4fb2d"
msgid "<i>Close your eyes. Breathe into the feeling.</i>"
msgstr "<i>눈을 감는다. 느낌을 받아들인다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 0a3b456a-3441-72a1-c302-0a7972bb235a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:0a3b456a-3441-72a1-c302-0a7972bb235a
msgctxt "hc56a373fg9879g4ff3g9538g4b05c292e8fe"
msgid "Or perhaps they found a better life with a new owner. Time will tell."
msgstr "아니면 새 삶을 찾아서 다른 주인을 찾아갔을지도 모르지. 시간이 지나봐야 알 수 있겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0ffe88aa-7fc7-f58e-00dc-40e01931a82b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:0ffe88aa-7fc7-f58e-00dc-40e01931a82b
msgctxt "h1ac357c9gdb1fg4222g911bg109c11d329c6"
msgid "Magic's a part of me - it'll come back when it's ready."
msgstr "마법은 내 일부야, 준비가 되면 돌아오겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 10fab09a-2ca5-b57a-0096-4f34c42eb065
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:10fab09a-2ca5-b57a-0096-4f34c42eb065
msgctxt "h6e92082dgb4b5g4880g8c13g22717ea527ee"
msgid "You're right. We've survived worse problems than this."
msgstr "네 말이 맞아. 이보다 심각한 문제도 극복했잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 15b7e60b-8e55-e1da-b2ea-1b343288d192
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_5_For_Sp2(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:15b7e60b-8e55-e1da-b2ea-1b343288d192
msgctxt "h0be4b93fga234g4d82ga7d9gf7bbed20d52d"
msgid ""
"Finely spotted. I've developed a taste for this pastime you call 'humour'."
msgstr "좋은 지적이야. 네 '유머'에 어느 정도 취미가 생긴 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 1751157d-fb04-bc50-8066-155d922382c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:1751157d-fb04-bc50-8066-155d922382c0
msgctxt "h1b127054g19e1g4c8fg9e23g68632f17dcae"
msgid "'Nothing' is doing a number on you, then, but suit yourself."
msgstr "그렇다면 '아무것도'에 당하고 있는 건가 보네, 좋을 대로 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1ef71075-0f39-cdb4-f487-b4a483cb455f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:1ef71075-0f39-cdb4-f487-b4a483cb455f
msgctxt "hb2e7bf66g2905g49f7ga7c5g28db18123ad8"
msgid "And if I'm not?"
msgstr "그렇지 않다면?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2281f610-6bad-2886-1f97-f37c0013951e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:2281f610-6bad-2886-1f97-f37c0013951e
msgctxt "h38cf894cge629g4bf2g9917gbb13dcdd1d8d"
msgid "You are as modest as you are warm, Lae'zel."
msgstr "네 체온만큼이나 겸손하구나, 레이젤."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 23f8b019-fd71-0e44-4ffd-3706d6eb751b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:23f8b019-fd71-0e44-4ffd-3706d6eb751b
msgctxt "h3ab5ca8eg5e15g4f72g842bgc1c18d130df8"
msgid "And I'll be delighted to see you try - from a safe distance."
msgstr "네가 노력하는 걸 보는 것도 재밌겠네, 안전한 거리에서 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 25761e68-e118-514c-f301-31f5f42bb8be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_5_For_Sp2(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:25761e68-e118-514c-f301-31f5f42bb8be
msgctxt "heb314a51g7feag4227ga119g2b0fa10d3d2c"
msgid "Your confidence grows. I'd almost think you believed your own words."
msgstr "네 자신감이 커지는군. 거의 너도 네 말을 믿는다고 생각할 뻔했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 2909855a-3a60-4c7b-b807-48094b84258f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - UND_SUSSURTREEANTIMAGIC(0) = False
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:2909855a-3a60-4c7b-b807-48094b84258f
msgctxt "h16dc61d8g42eag47c9g94e3ge4196da93972"
msgid "Your pace has slowed. Are you unwell?"
msgstr "움직임이 느려졌는데. 괜찮은 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 2989ab6c-54a3-2426-0a51-1489f1b63278
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:2989ab6c-54a3-2426-0a51-1489f1b63278
msgctxt "haa039cc2g0c49g4f3agbc26g313c48995c3a"
msgid "Now come, and be heedful. The shadows are watching."
msgstr "이제 가자, 그리고 조심해. 그림자가 지켜보고 있으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 2998c13d-4c37-ab03-ad9d-b66b79de2e00
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(6) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:2998c13d-4c37-ab03-ad9d-b66b79de2e00
msgctxt "h821711a8g500dg45c6g9d50g8b9666a1d713"
msgid ""
"It is the same for me. We're sitting ducks among sussur flowers, you and I."
msgstr "내게도 똑같아. 우리 둘 다 수서르 꽃 주변에선 손쉬운 표적일 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 29de66a6-9658-7d0c-71d6-a7b263423d4b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:29de66a6-9658-7d0c-71d6-a7b263423d4b
msgctxt "hb45724d1g1a15g49b0ga0f2g7e4a8eb17a36"
msgid ""
"It's the bloody Underdark. Never know what mad shit you're gonna run into "
"down here."
msgstr "빌어먹을 언더다크. 여기서는 무슨 지랄맞은 상황과 마주칠지 모르겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2dcab1ba-6406-b970-fddc-8cb9d6d089c5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:2dcab1ba-6406-b970-fddc-8cb9d6d089c5
msgctxt "h89e98c92g6044g4105g845ag35832f3e0b04"
msgid ""
"True. My powers will return if they're meant to - like a pet cat. Or maybe a "
"feral one."
msgstr "그래. 때가 되면 내 힘이 돌아올 거야, 애완 고양이처럼 말이지. 길고양이일지도 모르지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 313d4cf7-629e-bf4a-fa17-b9ca6c5e1a0c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:313d4cf7-629e-bf4a-fa17-b9ca6c5e1a0c
msgctxt "h1d2fe81eg4605g40a2gb72bg98b6891fc0b3"
msgid ""
"Then I'll have your back. When my allies are in danger, I'm not in the habit "
"of turning away."
msgstr "그럼 내가 네 뒤를 봐줄게. 우리 편이 위험에 처해 있을 때, 나는 모른 척할 사람이 아니라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 364bebce-4999-d996-c144-d8d0d78b2489
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_30_For_Sp6(0) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:364bebce-4999-d996-c144-d8d0d78b2489
msgctxt "h2a8f6f13g80cdg483cgb693gec7b1ec998ed"
msgid ""
"Might I suggest getting it back? We can't have anything happen to our "
"favourite sorcerer now, can we?"
msgstr "다시 돌려놓는 건 어때? 우리 최애 소서러에게 무슨 일이 생기면 안 되잖아, 그렇지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 3821e5a8-36a4-2c54-10ab-2c2f3c345171
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(2) = True
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_0_For_Sp1(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:3821e5a8-36a4-2c54-10ab-2c2f3c345171
msgctxt "hb5cf76a6gf187g4c70gbafbga71b840834d3"
msgid ""
"So what do you have left to contribute? Your personality? Let's just hope "
"those powers return soon."
msgstr "그럼 이제 네게 남은 게 뭐야? 네 성격? 어서 힘이 돌아오길 바라자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3ac016f9-51b5-bfd7-f658-c3d96a8fcc9b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:3ac016f9-51b5-bfd7-f658-c3d96a8fcc9b
msgctxt "h011c8620g766eg443eg8b10gcdd87652e7c0"
msgid "The feeling is very mutual, my friend."
msgstr "나도 같은 느낌이야, 친구."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3fdd7b37-8b4a-20c9-132e-127a03c0db77
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:3fdd7b37-8b4a-20c9-132e-127a03c0db77
msgctxt "hbb050f6bgbc8bg43d2gb34eg11115cc18513"
msgid ""
"*Your magic gently and effortlessly flows from you - and into the sussur "
"flower.*"
msgstr "*당신의 마법은 당신에게서 수서르 꽃으로 부드럽게 흘러들어갑니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 45aec435-194c-830f-75eb-cd7388d2ad8b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:45aec435-194c-830f-75eb-cd7388d2ad8b
msgctxt "hd4fc9f77g1694g4096gb96ag2f44ef0ba0f9"
msgid "It's the flower - my magic is gone."
msgstr "꽃 때문이야, 내 마법이 사라졌어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 473968d1-00ba-1efe-cb91-4a3ead9febf0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_30_For_Sp6(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:473968d1-00ba-1efe-cb91-4a3ead9febf0
msgctxt "hf084c99ag19b5g44a6gb849g015921175638"
msgid "I... forgive me."
msgstr "난... 용서해 줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 47a9fd65-bd33-db02-c77d-f948364317c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_10_For_Sp8(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:47a9fd65-bd33-db02-c77d-f948364317c9
msgctxt "h1af71023g7bb7g4ad0g9ba6gdf8f8da12158"
msgid "Then I'll have your back. Isn't that what friends do?"
msgstr "그럼 내가 뒤를 봐줄게. 친구란 게 그런 거 아니겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 49283697-e1c5-5fdd-f7af-acd88ee389b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_0_For_Sp1(2) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:49283697-e1c5-5fdd-f7af-acd88ee389b3
msgctxt "hed17dc8ega6cbg4c16ga2c4gca6214f027c1"
msgid "Perhaps this will cure you of some self-delusion then. Come on."
msgstr "그렇다면 그게 네 자기기만을 좀 치료해 줄지도 모르겠네. 가자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4ab0fe3a-8928-e17d-4b6f-b7f233a54bed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:4ab0fe3a-8928-e17d-4b6f-b7f233a54bed
msgctxt "hff6495dcg79f9g48aag880agf26d0e154db4"
msgid "I really hope you're right."
msgstr "네가 정말 괜찮았으면 좋겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 4f8cb009-e35b-ed89-d730-b2aeaa7f7d05
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:4f8cb009-e35b-ed89-d730-b2aeaa7f7d05
msgctxt "h6f4b4bd6ge755g49dagbc13gc429f8565d2a"
msgid "Have you known me to joke?"
msgstr "내가 농담하는 거 봤어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 508dbbfe-8021-5404-ba9e-c821a99647d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SORCERER_DRACONIC(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:508dbbfe-8021-5404-ba9e-c821a99647d3
msgctxt "h9bfae0bcg49abg4abfg9ad0g07560b8551df"
msgid ""
"<i>Like you've lost a friend. Without your ancestor, it's too quiet. </i>"
msgstr "<i>마치 친구를 잃은 것 같습니다. 선조가 없으니, 너무나 조용합니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5108e172-cb2c-ca05-b63d-dc376a02d812
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:5108e172-cb2c-ca05-b63d-dc376a02d812
msgctxt "h49284fd4g3ee2g414bg9184g5739dee41dd2"
msgid "More than you."
msgstr "너보다 더."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 5206c8b1-47d7-c159-8e12-0cd0e618769e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:5206c8b1-47d7-c159-8e12-0cd0e618769e
msgctxt "h9f174c8agffc3g43d1g9a78g1ec8f8fcb35a"
msgid "Then I shall make up for your shortcomings. As I have all along."
msgstr "그렇다면 내가 네 결점을 보완해 줄게. 지금까지 그래왔던 것처럼 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5283e95e-0fe1-8037-c814-e97eacbf09b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:5283e95e-0fe1-8037-c814-e97eacbf09b3
msgctxt "h979b5ce9g01b4g4b6agb32bga2002966b5d5"
msgid "Mind your own damn business."
msgstr "네 망할 일에나 신경 써."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 57f084e6-297c-0356-f3b6-82240f86f8b6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SORCERER_WILDMAGIC(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:57f084e6-297c-0356-f3b6-82240f86f8b6
msgctxt "h57db4010gcaebg4ef8g9641g8d7cdaf13220"
msgid "<i>Disturbed. No chaos? No thank you.</i>"
msgstr "<i>혼란스럽다. 혼돈이 없다고? 사양할게.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 5945ca38-a3cd-0aac-e19b-f5ce67f80a4b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:5945ca38-a3cd-0aac-e19b-f5ce67f80a4b
msgctxt "h176cab70geb46g4f5aga80bg6c6eb903df8d"
msgid "From this angle, there's nothing you can't endure."
msgstr "이런 시점에서 보면, 네가 극복하지 못할 건 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5afeec76-4940-51d5-f670-14f1b9f6ea32
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:5afeec76-4940-51d5-f670-14f1b9f6ea32
msgctxt "h56f95745g3d7bg4eddgbc23g58a18650c54f"
msgid "<i>Indifferent. If your power is truly yours it will return to you.</i>"
msgstr "<i>바뀐 것이 없다. 당신의 힘이 진정 본인의 것이라면, 결국 돌아올 것이다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 5cf5ab4a-e94a-3989-3499-0e6cd4243557
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(5) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:5cf5ab4a-e94a-3989-3499-0e6cd4243557
msgctxt "hfa11d1bcg9f05g423dga3d7g35c8454bc408"
msgid ""
"From what I've seen, your talents extend well beyond magic. Trust me - "
"you'll be fine."
msgstr "내가 지금껏 본 바로, 네 재능은 마법뿐만이 아니야. 날 믿어, 넌 괜찮을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 5dfca652-1a3c-eed7-363e-fc061d31eafb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:5dfca652-1a3c-eed7-363e-fc061d31eafb
msgctxt "h1b283979g6109g41aegbe81g2b84d2e0ab5d"
msgid "Oh don't be such a pill, darling. We're just having a little fun."
msgstr "바보같이 굴지 마, 자기. 그냥 재미 좀 본 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5e7dbac3-fb20-ee5f-8452-9332eed897e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:5e7dbac3-fb20-ee5f-8452-9332eed897e2
msgctxt "h7caced20g428fg470eg84c2g3886a61bd792"
msgid "Speak for yourself. I hate sitting, and I never quack in public."
msgstr "난 그렇지 않아. 난 앉아있는 걸 싫어하고, 절대 공공장소에서 꽥꽥거리지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5ff3e88c-cff3-9976-7363-14676d2a13f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:5ff3e88c-cff3-9976-7363-14676d2a13f7
msgctxt "hf1901246g7c08g4cc2g9f2cga1bf309a05fd"
msgid "Yes, I'll just 'get it back' - what a helpful suggestion, thank you!"
msgstr "그래, 그냥 '돌려놓을게' - 아주 유용한 제안이구나, 고마워!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 6239d87d-f66b-7ac5-dce7-d098dce77bfe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_0_For_Sp1(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:6239d87d-f66b-7ac5-dce7-d098dce77bfe
msgctxt "h362ff9cbgb3d4g4700gac53g75394cb05542"
msgid "No harm in a brief dose of perspective. It'll pass, I'm sure."
msgstr "잠깐 관점의 변화를 갖는 것도 나쁘지 않지. 금방 지나갈 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 632a3f08-d785-4f69-097d-123d2492c696
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_10_For_Sp2(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:632a3f08-d785-4f69-097d-123d2492c696
msgctxt "h7a211b4egcb92g4d7fgbaa2gf3f70f7faebf"
msgid "Well done. You're beginning to trust your convictions."
msgstr "잘했어. 이제 네 신념을 믿기 시작했구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 6e72e923-9427-465a-382d-ef78810a1ce4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:6e72e923-9427-465a-382d-ef78810a1ce4
msgctxt "he32fd235g179ag4958g9d21gaaff834a93ce"
msgid ""
"That's the spirit. Now let's get moving, before anything else goes missing."
msgstr "바로 그거지. 이제 움직이자고, 또 다른 게 사라지기 전에 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 7739c3f1-b31f-3a1e-fd41-92ffce6f505b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(2) = True
#.      - Approval_AtLeast_0_For_Sp1(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:7739c3f1-b31f-3a1e-fd41-92ffce6f505b
msgctxt "hae9d3628g4f11g4c33g80bbg90fc3de94e24"
msgid ""
"Chin up - I'll wager they'll come back as soon as we move away from here."
msgstr "기운 내, 분명 우리가 이곳을 벗어나자 마자 돌아올 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 784f7af2-6f9e-64b3-5fce-11f08002c6d1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(5) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:784f7af2-6f9e-64b3-5fce-11f08002c6d1
msgctxt "hf73e1594ga409g435ag8bdegf8b0b4c79735"
msgid ""
"That 'nothing' sure looks like something to me. If you need to rest, just "
"say the word."
msgstr "그 '아무것도'라는 게 내겐 뭔가 있어 보이는데. 쉬고 싶은 거라면, 말만 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 78ffe4c8-1be5-13a0-0a3e-501ac537429c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:78ffe4c8-1be5-13a0-0a3e-501ac537429c
msgctxt "hd033bb96gf1e2g4186g81b4geac3579d35ca"
msgid ""
"*You have been alone before, but this isolation is <i>alien</i>. The sooner "
"you get away from this flower, the better.*"
msgstr "*전에도 홀로 있었던 적은 있지만, 이런 고립은 <i>생전 처음</i>입니다. 빨리 이 꽃에서 멀어져야 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 7c2c9948-482f-14be-0ea6-18dce0f9db32
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(5) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:7c2c9948-482f-14be-0ea6-18dce0f9db32
msgctxt "hf74f8067g958dg4a9egb982gc78db0f0ae6b"
msgid ""
"What's wrong - is the plant getting to you? You look sicker than a drunk "
"derro."
msgstr "왜 그래. 그 식물이 네게 무슨 짓을 한 거야? 술 취한 부랑자보다 상태가 안 좋아 보이는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 7d7d104e-1ca4-b0c4-b605-6ef16f2589a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:7d7d104e-1ca4-b0c4-b605-6ef16f2589a1
msgctxt "he17c4103gc6cbg448fgb6f9g176c52652309"
msgid "In that case, I've got just one thing to say - 'Meow'."
msgstr "그렇다면, 내가 할 말은 하나밖에 없네. '야옹'."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 82f122be-8272-e3b4-2e4d-36a1ecc30af6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:82f122be-8272-e3b4-2e4d-36a1ecc30af6
msgctxt "hac1a97b1gd4cbg4668g97b5gdca2c9f30812"
msgid "No, you don't get it - this is really bad."
msgstr "아니, 이해를 못하는군. 이건 진짜 심각한 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 83586bcf-a0a6-9b54-ddd1-7f46b5ff9b41
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:83586bcf-a0a6-9b54-ddd1-7f46b5ff9b41
msgctxt "h04a82082g8c62g48b5g8942gd4ec4f2176a2"
msgid "This is serious. I feel terrible. <i>Empty.</i>"
msgstr "진짜 심각해. 끔찍한 기분이야. <i>공허해.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 83a6bb84-afac-4a15-1f49-5d0881da24e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:83a6bb84-afac-4a15-1f49-5d0881da24e4
msgctxt "h9d394c7cg7fc6g4811gb9b2g9615ba06cef4"
msgid "<i>Furious. How dare a wretched flower take what is yours?</i>"
msgstr "<i>분노한다. 어떻게 감히 형편없는 꽃 따위가 당신의 힘을 앗아갈 수 있는가?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 89ad1b3c-a055-f2c6-0d4d-e435515b72aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:89ad1b3c-a055-f2c6-0d4d-e435515b72aa
msgctxt "hcb338abega58fg469dgb48bg618d98c87959"
msgid ""
"*With or without your powers you're at ease. Magic cannot be tamed - not "
"even by you.*"
msgstr "*힘이 있든 없든, 당신은 아무렇지 않습니다. 마법은 길들일 수 없습니다. 그게 당신일지라도 말입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8a898547-f81b-faac-c93f-eb213194ea94
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:8a898547-f81b-faac-c93f-eb213194ea94
msgctxt "h6e041acegd237g4686gab9bgb5f7a7a3b5a6"
msgid "Please. I'm every bit the combatant you claim to be."
msgstr "제발. 나도 너 만큼 잘 싸울 수 있다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8b194504-f10c-ace2-dc54-5fc4ed0e4b7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:8b194504-f10c-ace2-dc54-5fc4ed0e4b7e
msgctxt "h0038668fga9b9g4cb0gabb8gc39ac6942a62"
msgid ""
"They'll return if they're meant to - like a pet cat. Or maybe a feral one."
msgstr "때가 되면 돌아올 거야. 애완 고양이처럼. 길고양이일지도 모르지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 8d5961db-5552-2a42-b2ab-43e476f2ae13
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:8d5961db-5552-2a42-b2ab-43e476f2ae13
msgctxt "hbcecb47ag6355g4fcbgb018gb653065d66de"
msgid "Hardly. But go on, live your fantasy. I am not about to stop you."
msgstr "전혀. 하지만 마음대로 해라, 환상 속을 살아가라. 막을 생각은 없으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 8e79d17e-89e0-7a8c-b60f-995865aa9387
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:8e79d17e-89e0-7a8c-b60f-995865aa9387
msgctxt "h950865d1g0e0cg466cg9f75g4d00abfc1e7b"
msgid "'Mind your own damn business, I'm busy inserting my head into my arse.'"
msgstr "'네 망할 일에나 신경 써, 난 내 머리를 내 엉덩이에 박느라 바쁘니까.'"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8f3352d3-bbca-15cf-8f4a-99b4898cf062
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:8f3352d3-bbca-15cf-8f4a-99b4898cf062
msgctxt "h989c2c7bgf0d9g47ecg96d9g98f523ae38a6"
msgid "<i>Try to cast a simple cantrip.</i>"
msgstr "<i>간단한 소마법을 시도해 본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8f872f80-bd63-4d64-3eed-683cd78fc6d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SORCERER_DRACONIC(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:8f872f80-bd63-4d64-3eed-683cd78fc6d9
msgctxt "h8adbe830gcd92g48b3gb96dgd5b14fc9f52b"
msgid "<i>Fight it. You need your magic. You need it!</i>"
msgstr "<i>저항한다. 마법은 필수적이다. 반드시 필요하다!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 8fba5d16-2559-939f-dadc-577f37bb553a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(6) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:8fba5d16-2559-939f-dadc-577f37bb553a
msgctxt "hb924a5dfgc606g41f7g8ba8g64ee425141e7"
msgid ""
"Need I remind you you're addressing a wizard? I know what's going on - it's "
"happening to me as well."
msgstr "내가 굳이 스스로가 위저드라고 설명해 줘야 해? 나도 무슨 일이 일어나고 있는지 알아, 나도 똑같은 일을 겪고 있다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 914806fa-1c59-dd60-ddcf-44a7a122b9c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:914806fa-1c59-dd60-ddcf-44a7a122b9c3
msgctxt "hbe73dd6bgf02ag4950g9d16g3847f742c234"
msgid "Your sense of humour is still intact, at least."
msgstr "적어도 유머감각은 여전하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 955cdfa2-873a-9a9b-8509-84695133eaac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:955cdfa2-873a-9a9b-8509-84695133eaac
msgctxt "hc38c2eb2g6981g4685gb748g36c57efeaffe"
msgid "I can swing a sword too if I must."
msgstr "그래야만 한다면 검도 휘두를 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9a0f8d9b-0edd-a237-9f60-7fca69707fe5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:9a0f8d9b-0edd-a237-9f60-7fca69707fe5
msgctxt "h15ae5974gc6a8g4356g9c3bgc1a2c42015f6"
msgid "Then let's watch each other's backs."
msgstr "그렇다면 서로의 뒤를 봐주자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 9c2ef880-c5b4-5e93-bfa5-7c596c6b427c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:9c2ef880-c5b4-5e93-bfa5-7c596c6b427c
msgctxt "ha27bd17bgf2c9g4e20g844cged0a54d5ab0b"
msgid ""
"Our backs are very much prone to stabbing in this environment. So by all "
"means - let's."
msgstr "이런 곳에선 언제나 등을 찔릴 위험이 있지. 그러니 물론, 그렇게 하자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 9e33c0bf-9777-baa5-cf4c-a4fc4d6581f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:9e33c0bf-9777-baa5-cf4c-a4fc4d6581f7
msgctxt "h57fb450dg3abdg4679gb4c9g735d6fa4e850"
msgid "And I'm the queen of Baldur's Gate. But all right - let's move."
msgstr "그럼 난 발더스 게이트의 여왕이다. 말로는 뭔 말을 못 해. 가자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = a2b0d0d1-3734-ea0e-3135-4f64b038cbb3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:a2b0d0d1-3734-ea0e-3135-4f64b038cbb3
msgctxt "he7a1fb1bg0d8fg410bgbc51ge104635b5451"
msgid "Sarcasm. <i>Magnificent.</i>"
msgstr "냉소라. <i>아주 훌륭하군.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a43ad58d-6adc-6fda-d946-70d1242ff40b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:a43ad58d-6adc-6fda-d946-70d1242ff40b
msgctxt "h87a7a458gc8f4g46d2g9b71ge80fd372be03"
msgid ""
"*The boredom is like an itch you cannot scratch. The sooner you deal with "
"this flower, the better.*"
msgstr "*지루함이 마치 긁을 수 없는 가려움 같습니다. 이 꽃을 최대한 빨리 처리해야 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = a7f8cc7e-d353-c107-f622-ebe6669ae16d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:a7f8cc7e-d353-c107-f622-ebe6669ae16d
msgctxt "h5f63711fg00beg4d20ga29aga2f7e329aa3e"
msgid ""
"Your good health <i>is</i> our business - our alliance depends on it. I "
"suggest you remember that."
msgstr "네 건강은 <i>우리의 일</i>이다. 우리 동맹이 그 일에 걸려있어. 그 점을 기억하기를 바라지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = a87444aa-28ec-b715-51dd-a012f94e50b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:a87444aa-28ec-b715-51dd-a012f94e50b5
msgctxt "h68246e41ga97cg4f9fg94a9gbeb7fa4cdb70"
msgid "We'll work it out. We always do."
msgstr "우린 해낼거야. 항상 그러듯이."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = aad2336f-8d3b-6276-393b-9d7801784838
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:aad2336f-8d3b-6276-393b-9d7801784838
msgctxt "h40cca539gef84g44c7gbb1ag18bdf4b18391"
msgid "Hey - what's wrong? You look spooked."
msgstr "어이, 뭐가 잘못됐어? 너 겁먹은 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ae04db56-71cb-a702-8020-1577635addf7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:ae04db56-71cb-a702-8020-1577635addf7
msgctxt "h019c2b61g78aag4cfbgbfd1g9dcb8e0c0660"
msgid "You must be joking."
msgstr "농담하는 거겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = aef3131c-f9ba-5d6d-dbaf-f89eb1bd226b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(6) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:aef3131c-f9ba-5d6d-dbaf-f89eb1bd226b
msgctxt "h7b6d5233g44d3g4c9bgb5dfg17148a35628c"
msgid ""
"Fear is a normal response when one feels one's magic slipping away. No need "
"to lash out."
msgstr "누구든 자신의 마법이 빠져나가는 기분이 들 때 두려워하는 건 당연한 반응이지. 비난할 필요는 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = af2acca0-bb52-71b3-1884-0581013fbcfa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:af2acca0-bb52-71b3-1884-0581013fbcfa
msgctxt "hc32c97e0g8f28g4689g87f7gf274fe62082c"
msgid ""
"Let's finish up here quickly - the sooner we can get your magic back, the "
"safer we'll be. Until then, try not to die."
msgstr "여기서 빨리 끝내자. 빨리 네가 마법을 되찾을수록 우리는 더 안전할 거야. 그때까지 죽지 않도록 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b7dced01-3a33-39a3-3fe8-a5b8d6e55f34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:b7dced01-3a33-39a3-3fe8-a5b8d6e55f34
msgctxt "h85ef817aga0bfg49bfg8954g16fa67158609"
msgid ""
"*Your magic erupts, violent and powerful, but is snuffed out by the sussur "
"flower - vanishing like embers in the wind.*"
msgstr "*당신의 마법이 폭발합니다. 폭력적이고 강력하지만, 수서르 꽃에 의해 소멸되며, 바람에 흩날리는 불씨처럼 사라집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = b93fce8a-faf3-f4ce-acdf-a00913385bff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:b93fce8a-faf3-f4ce-acdf-a00913385bff
msgctxt "h65a89251gc34dg47bfg9149g7d31bfb79a72"
msgid "Then gather your wits - these amateur dramatics wear thin."
msgstr "그럼 정신 차려라. 이런 아마추어 같은 행동은 이제 지겨우니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = bbc63e1a-f3a1-b438-0f18-4b7e2b36bdea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:bbc63e1a-f3a1-b438-0f18-4b7e2b36bdea
msgctxt "h0a79d9a1gf124g4469gbb97gcc7995772c46"
msgid "*For the first time in memory, you're without magic. You feel...*"
msgstr "*처음으로 마법이 없다는 걸 느낍니다. 당신이 느끼는 것은...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = bc5133eb-c0a6-ed3c-db6d-69cdd326caef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:bc5133eb-c0a6-ed3c-db6d-69cdd326caef
msgctxt "h9d3f63f9g865ag4aeeg9fc1g5a358ed51f79"
msgid "Oh, pardon. I'll leave you to drop dead in your own time, then."
msgstr "아, 실례했군. 그럼 당신이 제 시간에 죽도록 내버려 두지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = be466562-3519-8b16-1a64-1a7a9e99ebf2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:be466562-3519-8b16-1a64-1a7a9e99ebf2
msgctxt "haa6cdbb7g7363g4148ga553g77b1780b481c"
msgid ""
"If you say so, soldier. Might want to start learning to swing a sword. Stay "
"behind me until then - I'll crack anyone who messes with you."
msgstr ""
"그렇게 말한다면, 뭐. 어쩌면 검을 쓰는 법을 배우는 게 좋을 거야. 그때까지는 내 뒤에 있어. 널 건드리는 놈은 내가 박살내줄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = c595aba3-6f0b-5d98-4234-c530f635ff5e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:c595aba3-6f0b-5d98-4234-c530f635ff5e
msgctxt "h1d526df2g0c6bg4b97g80c6gf9e34cc8d665"
msgid "What's the matter? I could swear this plant's got you flush."
msgstr "뭐가 문제야? 이 식물이 너를 화려하게 만들었다고 맹세할 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c7c45123-4ddb-763d-5250-12cba6627f35
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:c7c45123-4ddb-763d-5250-12cba6627f35
msgctxt "h8ee22208g7111g44eag80dfg51f9fd9c2e7a"
msgid ""
"*The magic in your fingers sparks but your spells fail again and again - "
"consumed by the sussur flower.*"
msgstr "*손가락에서 마법이 번쩍거리지만 주문이 계속해서 실패합니다 - 수서르꽃에 의해 마법이 흡수되고 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = cb8e81b3-d849-609e-1ef0-fe7eac518f11
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:cb8e81b3-d849-609e-1ef0-fe7eac518f11
msgctxt "h6e95ad20g3c5eg4d30g9dd9g6bbdbe7d41b4"
msgid ""
"Mind flayers buried tadpoles in our brains, and then we crashed to the "
"ground on the banks of the Chionthar."
msgstr "마인드 플레이어가 너의 뇌에 올챙이를 심었을 때, 그리고 나서 치온타르 강둑의 땅에 추락했을 때 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = cdea4fc4-bda3-3810-77b0-7291e6feadbe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:cdea4fc4-bda3-3810-77b0-7291e6feadbe
msgctxt "h0d1dff3ag85c4g4f80g8d16g5ab72402f8fb"
msgid ""
"You've no flair for insults. Let's go, before I'm tempted to give you a "
"lesson."
msgstr "너는 모욕에 재능이 없구나. 가자, 내가 너에게 가르침을 주기 전에."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = d293c742-b13b-9e44-59d7-b1c2b18e684e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:d293c742-b13b-9e44-59d7-b1c2b18e684e
msgctxt "hb15a2a87g937ag437ag8380g76eedf089104"
msgid ""
"Of course I am. You're not going to be undone by a <i>flower</i>, are you?"
msgstr "물론이지. 너 <i>꽃</i> 같은 거에 당하진 않겠지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d72a6b7c-c0ca-b305-141e-76677fd6476b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:d72a6b7c-c0ca-b305-141e-76677fd6476b
msgctxt "h848be4e7gf5bfg46aeg9acdg77f42008615e"
msgid "A temporary setback - I'm sure my powers will be back soon."
msgstr "일시적인 장애일 뿐, 곧 다시 힘을 되찾을 수 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d81669e9-48e7-e503-8174-df1a10627782
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:d81669e9-48e7-e503-8174-df1a10627782
msgctxt "h06c5e9fdgb905g428cg8fb7gf702b2b7f1c9"
msgid ""
"*A quiet contentment settles in your chest. Perhaps a life without power "
"would not be so terrible.*"
msgstr "*가슴 속에 조용한 만족감이 차오릅니다. 어쩌면 힘 없는 삶도 괜찮을지도 모릅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = d84c73c7-5d3e-a511-0692-d620932deceb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !SORCERER
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:d84c73c7-5d3e-a511-0692-d620932deceb
msgctxt "hfb443628g0ea5g44acga03dg9124cb32997b"
msgid "If you say so. You're the conduit for raw, cosmic power after all."
msgstr "네 말이 맞는 것 같군. 너는 결국 날것 그대로의 우주적 힘을 전달하는 통로니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = d84c73c7-5d3e-a511-0692-d620932deceb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:d84c73c7-5d3e-a511-0692-d620932deceb
msgctxt "h6de3c8cag32b6g4bd8g8091gee7d10fa14de"
msgid "All right, if you say so."
msgstr "알았어. 네 말대로 할게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = dd8d0331-a65e-d122-fd1b-d9e7b509abf5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(6) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:dd8d0331-a65e-d122-fd1b-d9e7b509abf5
msgctxt "ha2682a17gb3fdg427eg9f50g7e9f1ff69244"
msgid ""
"That flower isn't agreeing with you, is it? Doesn't sit well with me either."
msgstr "그 꽃이 너랑 안 맞는 것 같지? 나도 별로 안 좋아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = decaec71-6e2f-cac4-afb3-b758afb1cc88
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:decaec71-6e2f-cac4-afb3-b758afb1cc88
msgctxt "he6ca8a31g7ea7g4ffdgb233g5f5c22096ac4"
msgid "Don't flatter yourself."
msgstr "네 자신을 과대평가하지 마라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = dfb13897-4863-2a64-1e84-445079acff56
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:dfb13897-4863-2a64-1e84-445079acff56
msgctxt "h223483d5ga818g4f14gb9b6g8cbb74cbc269"
msgid "Quack."
msgstr "돌팔이."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = dfbbd29a-4107-48b0-b2d9-122dc555bbe1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SORCERER(0) = True
#.      - UND_SUSSURTREEANTIMAGIC(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:dfbbd29a-4107-48b0-b2d9-122dc555bbe1
msgctxt "hbd89766bg00b1g4278gb503g26840cfdb477"
msgid ""
"*A chill runs through you. Your magic - the fire that burns within is... "
"fading.*"
msgstr "*한기가 당신을 스쳐 지나갑니다. 당신의 마법 - 그 안에서 타오르는 불길이...희미해지고 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = dfeefa17-fbb9-69be-a6d0-90531b3ddecc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:dfeefa17-fbb9-69be-a6d0-90531b3ddecc
msgctxt "h82f3c02ag41b0g46bdgb8a2g136e4d1d5775"
msgid ""
"Something's wrong - your manner betrays you. What curse has this plant "
"wrought?"
msgstr "무언가 잘못됐군. 솔직히 말해라. 이 식물이 어떤 저주를 내렸지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e0d68b4a-7edd-4510-43d3-896d3fdc3bbc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:e0d68b4a-7edd-4510-43d3-896d3fdc3bbc
msgctxt "h55bd9d0bg3f92g4232gb527g905428cef934"
msgid "That's not funny. It feels like I've lost a limb."
msgstr "그건 재미없어. 마치 팔다리를 잃은 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = e12bed8d-2558-e541-2eae-0c0cddf20400
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:e12bed8d-2558-e541-2eae-0c0cddf20400
msgctxt "h62fdef76g688fg4f13g8446gebdb2e297c87"
msgid "It took your power and your sense of humour? How wretched."
msgstr "그게 너의 힘과 유머 감각까지 앗아갔어? 얼마나 비참한 일인지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = e1eca1a7-8b6d-b5e5-d59c-2f5000aee493
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:e1eca1a7-8b6d-b5e5-d59c-2f5000aee493
msgctxt "ha3f43739ge4c6g4dfegbfc4gf8a952893619"
msgid ""
"No worse than having mind flayers bury a tadpole your brain, or crashing to "
"the ground on the banks of the Chionthar."
msgstr "마인드 플레이어가 너의 뇌에 올챙이를 심었을 때, 혹은 치온타르 강둑의 땅에 추락했을 때 보다 안 좋지는 않을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = e556c3e2-904b-6412-ecfb-83c427d2bc75
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:e556c3e2-904b-6412-ecfb-83c427d2bc75
msgctxt "h34d9648egf959g4692g974dgde7bcff669d2"
msgid ""
"That's usually my line. Suddenly seems unconvincing, hearing it from someone "
"else."
msgstr "그건 보통 내가 하는 말이야. 다른 사람한테서 들으니 갑자기 설득력이 없어 보이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e85a96a0-0304-6219-21a5-b72650b10e39
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:e85a96a0-0304-6219-21a5-b72650b10e39
msgctxt "h90b6b1e5gef9cg44b7gbda0g2fef21a04943"
msgid "Just my good looks, then."
msgstr "그럼 내 외모뿐이겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f04b5190-7375-2354-f468-d05a40bfe845
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:f04b5190-7375-2354-f468-d05a40bfe845
msgctxt "had91d024g1fffg4223g847bgd96beb0e14cf"
msgid ""
"*Your magic is gone, replaced by fury. You and your powers are one - this "
"<i>will</i> be temporary.*"
msgstr "*당신의 마법은 사라지고, 분노로 대체되었습니다. 당신과 당신의 힘은 하나입니다. - 이건 <i>일시적일 것</i>입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f1ec3f73-d345-a629-c7b1-fae0366ff8de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:f1ec3f73-d345-a629-c7b1-fae0366ff8de
msgctxt "h496a432dg0d06g427dgb869g30b47b866bfa"
msgid "<i>At ease. Without magic things feels so peaceful.</i>"
msgstr "<i>마음을 다잡는다. 마법이 없으니 모든 게 평화롭게 느껴진다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = f222772d-a474-cc45-8b63-dda6163868b4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:f222772d-a474-cc45-8b63-dda6163868b4
msgctxt "h0c76fbcbgfe7dg4267g905eg896efcd2c253"
msgid "You look drained, and I know it wasn't me. Is the plant bothering you?"
msgstr "너 피곤해 보이는데, 나 때문은 아닌 것 같고. 그 식물 때문에 괴로운거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = f2302547-439d-bfb4-3b8e-49dde738ccd4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:f2302547-439d-bfb4-3b8e-49dde738ccd4
msgctxt "hd702966egc992g4154gba63g3a238ad1af4f"
msgid ""
"Might I suggest getting it back? I don't travel with you for your "
"personality, you know."
msgstr "마법을 되찾아야 할 것 같은데? 알고 있겠지만, 너의 인품 때문에 같이 여행하는 게 아니라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = f39eaa5b-0d4e-3153-ff7c-a1c9fa772d17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:f39eaa5b-0d4e-3153-ff7c-a1c9fa772d17
msgctxt "h0997f309g672eg48ecgbfffg8f3b6690ee00"
msgid "<i>Gone </i>gone? But... you're a sorcerer. Isn't magic... <i>you?</i>"
msgstr "<i>완전히 사라졌다고?</i> 그치만... 너는 소서러잖아. 마법 자체가 곧... <i>너잖아?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f55ef23d-77fc-2560-f047-c927e6d2074d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:f55ef23d-77fc-2560-f047-c927e6d2074d
msgctxt "h0d95d491g2072g4b9dgb01cg8cb05d5b3a25"
msgid "I'm not worried. My powers will return if they're meant to."
msgstr "걱정 안 해. 내 힘이 돌아올 거야. 그럴 운명이라면 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = f63c63ba-db75-fbc3-3db5-48b99d856343
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:f63c63ba-db75-fbc3-3db5-48b99d856343
msgctxt "h32bf42b5gf842g4b9bg8d2bgcb9015288f97"
msgid ""
"Let's finish up here and then get away from that damned plant. Until then, "
"we'll keep you safe."
msgstr "여기서 마무리하고 그 망할 식물에서 멀리 떨어져. 그때까지 우리가 안전하게 지켜줄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = fbd90232-8208-1b05-ad8f-f50e393f3439
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:fbd90232-8208-1b05-ad8f-f50e393f3439
msgctxt "h99ccb959g199dg4ad4gba0eg636308c56496"
msgid ""
"Until then, let me lead the way. Anything pops out from under a mushroom, "
"and I'll make sure it doesn't grab my poor powerless pal."
msgstr "그때까지는 내가 앞장서도록 하지. 버섯 아래에서 튀어나오는 게 어떤 것이든, 내 불쌍하고 힘없는 친구를 잡아채지 못하게 할거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fc829bcb-aa8a-07fc-fe67-78ded5fdebee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SussurTree_IVB_Aura_Sorcerer:fc829bcb-aa8a-07fc-fe67-78ded5fdebee
msgctxt "h3f2778e3g3e53g486bga086g0383c1be0ec5"
msgid "I'm fine. It's nothing."
msgstr "난 괜찮아. 아무것도 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 231a7020-1278-ee6b-3773-1d413b23d7d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone:231a7020-1278-ee6b-3773-1d413b23d7d6
msgctxt "hac997bb8g4fe7g43a6g8f5agb83aa46cfb53"
msgid ""
"*A slender drow blade impales the stone before you, keeping a silent vigil.*"
msgstr "*얇은 드로우 검이 고요한 침묵을 유지하며 바위에 박혀 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 28004e60-c859-6c83-e5fa-4dcb0a3b56a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Strength
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_SwordInStone_State_PullFailed(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone:28004e60-c859-6c83-e5fa-4dcb0a3b56a1
msgctxt "hfad88f37g6b09g4968gaf84g0beaf540c618"
msgid "<i>Grab the sword with both hands and pull.</i>"
msgstr "<i>양손으로 검을 잡고 끌어당긴다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 40ab45b1-5be4-3cd8-e9de-7111e5fef51b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_SwordInStone_State_ReligionSuccess = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_EILISTRAEE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone:40ab45b1-5be4-3cd8-e9de-7111e5fef51b
msgctxt "h6d41a7feg3366g4b16ga7d9g413842b7a10e"
msgid ""
"*You recognise your goddess' rite - a warrior's sacrifice. Only blood, "
"freely given, will honour the fallen.*"
msgstr ""
"*당신은 여신의 의식을 알아봅니다. 전사의 공물입니다. 오직 자신의 의지로 흘린 피만이, 쓰러진 이들을 기릴 수 있을 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4e8008e5-9829-3769-ba91-c8117b2ca920
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SwordInStone_State_PullFailed(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone:4e8008e5-9829-3769-ba91-c8117b2ca920
msgctxt "h56366947gc37bg43b5gae2fgc01a369f3812"
msgid ""
"*No matter how you grip or tug, the sword remains firmly lodged in the "
"stone.*"
msgstr "*쥐는 방법을 아무리 바꾸고 당겨봐도, 검은 목석처럼 바위에 박혀 꿈쩍도 하지 않습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 54fce05a-94c7-5213-e4e8-d65a12f222fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_SwordInStone_State_SwordUnlocked = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone:54fce05a-94c7-5213-e4e8-d65a12f222fb
msgctxt "hf6acef24g69a7g41c4gb90bgede424739d12"
msgid "*Blood touches steel, and the sword reacts.*"
msgstr "*피가 강철에 닿자, 검이 반응합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5cf7697c-600e-db25-8383-dfb68b8d56fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_SwordInStone_State_RewardGiven = True
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SwordInStone_Event_GiveReward(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone:5cf7697c-600e-db25-8383-dfb68b8d56fb
msgctxt "hadab0eecga813g4c86gba6cg060d7474c5d1"
msgid ""
"*It feels like you're warring with ten people for the blade, but with "
"another hard yank, the weapon slips free from the stone.*"
msgstr ""
"*마치 검을 위해 열 명의 사람과 싸움을 벌이는 듯한 느낌이 전해집니다. 하지만 다시 강하게 당기자, 검이 바위에서 뽑혀 나옵니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7ce7e79a-9783-ffa1-a543-03ff7efdb956
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_SwordInStone_State_ReligionSuccess = False
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_SwordInStone_State_ReligionFailed(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(1) = False
#.      - CLERIC_LOLTH(1) = False
#.      - CLERIC_EILISTRAEE(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone:7ce7e79a-9783-ffa1-a543-03ff7efdb956
msgctxt "hb01497a4g0208g46e7g9946gfe83c68dc47d"
msgid "<i>This feels holy. Consider what the appropriate ritual might be.</i>"
msgstr "<i>신성한 느낌이 든다. 어떤 의식이 적절할지 생각해 본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7e12aa8e-befe-f289-0729-9e0d9d57950b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone:7e12aa8e-befe-f289-0729-9e0d9d57950b
msgctxt "h65cee13cg9922g45a7g937ag01585f1e1928"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 8ba5aa32-7f48-e80a-e7be-0d0572ecfb7d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC_LOLTH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone:8ba5aa32-7f48-e80a-e7be-0d0572ecfb7d
msgctxt "h67e53ebcg93e9g4fe5g9cd1g36f248e8e14e"
msgid ""
"*Suddenly, you feel hundreds of spiders crawl down your spine - a warning "
"from Lolth not to displease her again.*"
msgstr ""
"*갑자기, 당신의 척추를 따라 수백 마리의 거미가 기어가는 듯한 감각이 느껴집니다. 다시는 그녀를 불쾌하게 만들지 말라는 롤쓰의 "
"경고입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b75273b3-d72a-181e-2bb6-772d36861776
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_SwordInStone_State_ReligionSuccess = False
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_SwordInStone_State_ReligionFailed(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone:b75273b3-d72a-181e-2bb6-772d36861776
msgctxt "h324ef869g0682g4d13g9789ge7533f581f20"
msgid "<i>Consider what the appropriate ritual might be.</i>"
msgstr "<i>어떤 의식이 적절할지 고민한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cada0cad-24e6-73c6-b324-54a0d716c951
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_SwordInStone_State_ReligionSuccess = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_SwordInStone_State_SwordUnlocked = True
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SwordInStone_Event_GiveBlood(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone:cada0cad-24e6-73c6-b324-54a0d716c951
msgctxt "h90e78035g3cabg4b69gbfb9gaf444632b25b"
msgid "<i>Shed a few drops of blood onto the stone.</i>"
msgstr "<i>바위에 피 몇 방울을 떨어뜨린다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = cd0e4b30-76f0-7cf5-92c6-27d0ab35b1ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC_EILISTRAEE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone:cd0e4b30-76f0-7cf5-92c6-27d0ab35b1ca
msgctxt "h3be1db06gaebag4582g876eg725d0006c5d8"
msgid ""
"*A soft melody resounds through your head - Eilistraee's divine gratitude.*"
msgstr "*머릿속에 부드러운 멜로디가 울려 퍼집니다. 에일리스트레이의 신성한 호의입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d315a082-99ce-5bf4-69fa-d1146b2608e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SwordInStone_State_ReligionFailed(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone:d315a082-99ce-5bf4-69fa-d1146b2608e7
msgctxt "h7b7eb865g93eeg41ffga6b2ge86f0c440997"
msgid ""
"*You can't recall anything this esoteric. There are too many rituals about "
"swords to count.*"
msgstr "*이 비전 의식에 대해 떠올릴 수 없습니다. 검에 관한 의례는 너무나 많습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d835de3b-de55-4610-05e0-a95e367667e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_LOLTH(1) = False
#.      - CLERIC_EILISTRAEE(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_SwordInStone_State_RewardGiven = True
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_SwordInStone_Event_GiveReward(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone:d835de3b-de55-4610-05e0-a95e367667e8
msgctxt "hc1c18562g7e4cg4e77g8e1egf3d1d739c0f2"
msgid ""
"*The drow script inscribed on the blade flickers and glows. It rises from "
"the stone, hanging in the air in silent offering.*"
msgstr "*칼날에 새겨진 드로우 문자가 깜빡이며 빛납니다. 돌에서 솟아오른 검은 조용한 제안을 하며 공중에 떠 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ec6252fb-077a-436f-2af0-5191225b47a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_SwordInStone_State_ReligionSuccess = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(1) = True
#.      - OATHBREAKER(1) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_LOLTHDROWELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone:ec6252fb-077a-436f-2af0-5191225b47a4
msgctxt "h7fcee26cgdd3eg43c0gb851g4495332c32a6"
msgid ""
"<i>There is no need for bloodshed. Bring your honourable deeds to mind as "
"you grip the sword.</i>"
msgstr "<i>피를 흘릴 필요는 없다. 명예로운 행동을 떠올리며 검을 집는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ec6252fb-077a-436f-2af0-5191225b47a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_SwordInStone_State_ReligionSuccess = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(1) = True
#.      - OATHBREAKER(1) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone:ec6252fb-077a-436f-2af0-5191225b47a4
msgctxt "h8e9b2d30g4994g4e53g95a9g2711844bce4a"
msgid ""
"<i>Let your embodied oath pour through you. Grip the sword. Prove your "
"worth.</i>"
msgstr "<i>구체화된 맹세를 뿜어낸다. 검을 집는다. 자신의 가치를 증명한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ed765bb6-1506-735b-f5c7-e02bb7bf0024
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_SwordInStone_State_ReligionSuccess = False
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_SwordInStone_State_ReligionFailed(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_EILISTRAEE(1) = False
#. TagRule: CLERIC_LOLTH or PALADIN_LOLTH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone:ed765bb6-1506-735b-f5c7-e02bb7bf0024
msgctxt "h24034d72g48e2g4b30gbab2g05252cfc1ff9"
msgid "<i>This feels holy. Consider what the appropriate ritual might be.</i>"
msgstr "<i>신성한 느낌이 든다. 어떤 의식이 적절할지 생각해 본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ff974d01-047f-3bfb-c6fc-48e12f495fe5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_SwordInStone_State_ReligionSuccess = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_LOLTH or REALLY_LOLTHDROWELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone:ff974d01-047f-3bfb-c6fc-48e12f495fe5
msgctxt "h06278daegd354g4fa8gbe40ga7a0c355300d"
msgid ""
"*You know this rite - a blasphemous ritual that desecrates Lolth by offering "
"your blood to honour the weak.*"
msgstr "*당신은 이 의례를 알고 있습니다. 약자를 기리기 위해 피를 바침으로써 롤쓰를 모독하는 불경스러운 의식입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ff974d01-047f-3bfb-c6fc-48e12f495fe5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_SwordInStone_State_ReligionSuccess = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_SwordInStone:ff974d01-047f-3bfb-c6fc-48e12f495fe5
msgctxt "h5edbd2b3g3004g47c9g8163g03c1dff8e8d7"
msgid ""
"*This blade was a warrior's sacrifice to Eilistraee. Blood can only be "
"honoured with blood.*"
msgstr "*이 검은 에일리스트레이에게 바쳐진 전사의 공물이었습니다. 피를 기릴 방법은 피 뿐입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 50ea8c66-e62f-d6df-0969-82a2b4a25b72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp_ToldGoToKetheric(1) = True
#.      - UND_TheDrowNere_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere:50ea8c66-e62f-d6df-0969-82a2b4a25b72
msgctxt "h92c461d9gcfb8g4457g9168g5d022da3e8ee"
msgid ""
"Didn't I tell you to go to Moonrise Towers? The General must be told of my "
"situation."
msgstr "너에게 문라이즈에 가라고 말하지 않았나? 장군님이 내 상황을 보고받아야 한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 991841ee-9cf4-84d4-d9b1-db5b9c80672a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp_ToldGoToKetheric(1) = False
#.      - UND_TheDrowNere_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere:991841ee-9cf4-84d4-d9b1-db5b9c80672a
msgctxt "h96e3231fg153dg41begad70g031a51840e49"
msgid "Leave me be. You've done enough."
msgstr "날 내버려 둬라. 이제 그만."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = eeb56d95-9f56-dff4-e629-8e5aae78aa08
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_TheDrowNere_HasMet(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_TheDrowNere_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere:eeb56d95-9f56-dff4-e629-8e5aae78aa08
msgctxt "hc5e4a9ddg823bg4454g839ag97622f935e01"
msgid "Why are you still here? Go!"
msgstr "왜 아직도 이곳에 있는 것이지? 떠나라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 02627792-decd-480c-9496-1432145c79d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_TheDrowNere_Dead_Knows_MoonriseTowers(1) = True
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead:02627792-decd-480c-9496-1432145c79d2
msgctxt "hd367b2f0g92d2g450cg9003g2b17e608b81f"
msgid "How can I get to Moonrise Towers?"
msgstr "문라이즈 타워로 어떻게 갈 수 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 0fec4d89-a94a-470c-857c-6929a2e8b315
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_DarkJusticiars_Quest_HeardSharTemple = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead:0fec4d89-a94a-470c-857c-6929a2e8b315
msgctxt "h9ebbffd0g71efg45efgbac5g287c5c21af66"
msgid "Find... path to temple... orders of General..."
msgstr "신전으로 향하는 길을... 찾으려... 장군님의 명령..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 10db24ec-bf7d-455d-8cf6-9b68de1bcf38
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead:10db24ec-bf7d-455d-8cf6-9b68de1bcf38
msgctxt "hd7adca3ag49f6g4d6bgaa3eg6cc8deb833a0"
msgid "General's necromancer... Balthazar..."
msgstr "장군님의 사령술사... 발타자르..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 194ccf62-bd66-4a6b-938c-1b8bb34fd3c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead:194ccf62-bd66-4a6b-938c-1b8bb34fd3c8
msgctxt "h2fa41c0eg2cf8g48ccg9ef8g54948b22ab35"
msgid "True Soul... Nere..."
msgstr "참된 영혼... 니어..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 208a5d9b-7cc1-4460-85dc-a37e2b0e6b71
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_TheDrowNere_Dead_Knows_MoonriseTowers(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Moonrise_Knows_AbsoluteAtGrymforge = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead:208a5d9b-7cc1-4460-85dc-a37e2b0e6b71
msgctxt "h3fe78ad2g9309g447egbea5g3a7b81882430"
msgid "Moonrise... Towers..."
msgstr "문라이즈... 타워..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 37192815-e57a-40bb-a0bf-1c2282d09403
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead:37192815-e57a-40bb-a0bf-1c2282d09403
msgctxt "h2f8e5d44g9092g4e44g9486g168b8ba0fb2a"
msgid "*The corpse does not stir. It will answer no more questions.*"
msgstr "*시체는 움직이지 않습니다. 더 이상 질문을 받지 않을 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 49060876-15a6-4bc3-af4b-ffdaf14ee8a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead:49060876-15a6-4bc3-af4b-ffdaf14ee8a4
msgctxt "hc0eec3bbgf7e6g4d60gaca1gf65e4d2edfce"
msgid "Safe passage... Moonlantern... drider..."
msgstr "안전한 길... 달등불... 드라이더..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 58178cf2-8658-4b4a-a878-8b347925efcf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead:58178cf2-8658-4b4a-a878-8b347925efcf
msgctxt "h542f0e41ge8b8g43ecg8b62g9e34cdb580ae"
msgid "Mercenaries... Absolute unites..."
msgstr "용병들... 절대자께서 규합하신..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63b16d3e-0510-496b-bf39-be42d709a611
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead:63b16d3e-0510-496b-bf39-be42d709a611
msgctxt "hacce5e9fg2e77g441cga96cg315a17a8f55d"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 677f835c-0dc4-40c1-9d9a-f4282b6f0677
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead:677f835c-0dc4-40c1-9d9a-f4282b6f0677
msgctxt "h8f80ffdbgf87fg4315g9e31g64355d96bede"
msgid "*The spell's power wanes. You can ask no more questions.*"
msgstr "*주문의 힘이 약해집니다. 더 이상 질문을 할 수 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 79307c79-771e-00af-557e-3db5d793672d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_TheDrowNereDead_Event_MentionedTemple(1) = True
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead:79307c79-771e-00af-557e-3db5d793672d
msgctxt "hea30c25fg9bb6g4886gb9e0g01114e969622"
msgid "Tell me more about this General."
msgstr "이 장군에 대해 더 말해 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 7ff12685-2a51-4654-a227-6847d9aff3b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead:7ff12685-2a51-4654-a227-6847d9aff3b7
msgctxt "hed6f65feg96c1g4394gb368g90844db508ea"
msgid "Corridor... triggered old trap... cave-in..."
msgstr "복도의... 오래된 함정을 건드려서... 무너졌어..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 86833011-9abe-4055-be21-8a3c93a7863d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead:86833011-9abe-4055-be21-8a3c93a7863d
msgctxt "h27a76f00g4b0cg4d09ga44egf797610b30ea"
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr "너는 누구지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 86bd5ba7-f3ef-4ec5-8dec-a8f85808d6fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead:86bd5ba7-f3ef-4ec5-8dec-a8f85808d6fd
msgctxt "h3f0c8455g7c73g464cg9f8dg52c091869dee"
msgid "Where did you come from?"
msgstr "어디서 왔지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8854f278-123e-434b-b09e-30e07bf03283
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead:8854f278-123e-434b-b09e-30e07bf03283
msgctxt "hd04824adg21f2g413cg8a84g8a84a7bfa5e1"
msgid "How did you get trapped?"
msgstr "어쩌다가 갇혔지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9945d30b-8573-4841-a9a3-322d191e36e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_TheDrowNereDead_Event_MentionedTemple(1) = True
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead:9945d30b-8573-4841-a9a3-322d191e36e8
msgctxt "h9e17a1c3g804eg4dbbgae38ga2d850a25be4"
msgid "What were you doing here?"
msgstr "여기서 뭘 하고 있었지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bc08dbb5-7741-432b-9a65-96848fdefb63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead:bc08dbb5-7741-432b-9a65-96848fdefb63
msgctxt "hb002a9fbge26fg43ecg9f34g0ef6ab9a30f1"
msgid "Did you come here with the duergar?"
msgstr "듀에르가와 함께 여기로 왔나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c59aaf0c-a05c-4ffe-8feb-5b8426da6b5a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_TheDrowNereDead_Event_MentionedTemple(1) = True
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead:c59aaf0c-a05c-4ffe-8feb-5b8426da6b5a
msgctxt "ha70cde02g690dg4a19g8664g89b93aa2fcac"
msgid "What about this temple is so important?"
msgstr "이 신전이 왜 그렇게 중요한 건데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = dc37d8fe-083a-4f0f-b7f5-43ddfaf55521
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead:dc37d8fe-083a-4f0f-b7f5-43ddfaf55521
msgctxt "h3ab26396g73fbg4cc2gb913g73233890ae0d"
msgid "*The corpse regards you lifelessly.*"
msgstr "*시체가 생기 없는 모습으로 당신을 맞이합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = f55b1bcd-3f6e-76d3-c141-4938a1551b7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_TheDrowNere_Dead_Knows_MoonriseTowers(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Absolute_Knows_MoonriseTowers = True
#.     - UND_TheDrowNere_Event_DeadToldGeneral = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Dead:f55b1bcd-3f6e-76d3-c141-4938a1551b7c
msgctxt "h23c85055ga3b0g4fadg8df7gec7a2e926b88"
msgid "Absolute's Chosen... Moonrise Towers..."
msgstr "절대자에게 선택받은 자... 문라이즈 타워에..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 07a9deaf-9602-c088-4140-aa2fb56de035
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 1ec94658-421e-3c38-2c3c-547567487fd5_InclusionHappened = True
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HasNereSpidersLyre(0) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_TheDrowNere_Event_GiveSpidersLyre(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:07a9deaf-9602-c088-4140-aa2fb56de035
msgctxt "h496b7e54g573bg44c9g8e56gfdb0c3ce5aa9"
msgid ""
"Calm yourself - we have allies on the surface. Seek them out, and play this "
"lyre to call on their guide."
msgstr "진정해라, 지상에 아군이 있으니까. 그들을 찾아가 이 리라를 연주하면 안내받을 수 있을 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 12b193fa-fb22-c100-182c-8a3ae2f5a71b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:12b193fa-fb22-c100-182c-8a3ae2f5a71b
msgctxt "h49d67d06gee5cg4082ga3cag2d2eb5119d6a"
msgid ""
"<i>Explain that the Absolute is a front for mind flayers - you're protected "
"from them.</i>"
msgstr "<i>'절대자는 마인드 플레이어의 위장에 불과하며, 나는 그 영향에서 보호받고 있다'고 설명한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 182eb70f-69e5-53fe-535d-4798c238fb25
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Absolute_Knows_MoonriseTowers = True
#.     - UND_TheDrowNere_Event_ToldGeneral = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:182eb70f-69e5-53fe-535d-4798c238fb25
msgctxt "h2d161ec6gb151g4ddcg886eg21de53ea0956"
msgid ""
"The General resides at Moonrise Towers, but you cannot simply travel there. "
"The land surrounding the Towers is blighted by a deadly curse."
msgstr ""
"장군님은 문라이즈 타워에 거주하고 계시지만, 네가 그곳을 간단히 여행할 수는 없을 것이다. 타워 주변 지역은 치명적인 저주로 오염되었다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 1be43a5d-5ace-1679-429d-bb68149b64ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:1be43a5d-5ace-1679-429d-bb68149b64ea
msgctxt "h2109b93dgffbcg4389g84bfg42903e993689"
msgid ""
"When the General entrusted me with this mission, he warned there may be some "
"damage caused by a monster let loose in the temple."
msgstr "장군님이 내게 이 임무를 맡기시면서, 사원에 풀린 괴물 때문에 피해가 발생할 수 있다고 경고하셨다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 1d0f53c6-9abc-2d67-9124-fa4f57d7ba43
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:1d0f53c6-9abc-2d67-9124-fa4f57d7ba43
msgctxt "h64bc6232g8b13g4e37g9f5eg82fadca91b67"
msgid ""
"I will tear your heart from your chest. And I will hear Her voice again."
msgstr "네 심장을 뽑아내 주겠다. 그렇게 하면 다시 그분의 목소리를 들을 수 있겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 1e6c046b-ffbe-9e3f-f547-da6bd9ba73c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_TheDrowNere_Event_Leave = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - UND_CaveIn.FreedNere(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:1e6c046b-ffbe-9e3f-f547-da6bd9ba73c3
msgctxt "h445fe02bg2a15g40c6ga22fgc50883658ed5"
msgid ""
"I - never mind. Go to the General at Moonrise. There's little time to waste."
msgstr "나는 - 신경 쓰지 마라. 문라이즈에 있는 장군님께 가라. 낭비할 시간 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2050a3af-b386-afc9-90c6-7b5d5f0f6eef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:2050a3af-b386-afc9-90c6-7b5d5f0f6eef
msgctxt "h5815470dgf2a5g4b39gb4ceg29d82d58afc1"
msgid ""
"It's true - it's a shadowy conspiracy headed by mind flayers and... tax "
"collectors."
msgstr "사실이야. 마인드 플레이어와... 세금 징수원들이 꾸미는 어두운 음모지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 21f3f850-be4b-25ed-b452-a607490cfcf7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:21f3f850-be4b-25ed-b452-a607490cfcf7
msgctxt "h4f4d9d90g0f23g499bgb3c1g98be8e69dc7a"
msgid ""
"<i>The </i>favourite. Nothing is done in these lands without his knowledge."
msgstr "총아<i>님</i>이다. 이 지역에서 그분의 지식 없이는 아무 것도 할 수 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 253df179-d5fb-6419-291b-bfcbeb4f50fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:253df179-d5fb-6419-291b-bfcbeb4f50fc
msgctxt "h3f9059e6g2174g4ea0gaedcg254652a4e73d"
msgid "No, it's not true - you're here to test my faith. And I will not fail."
msgstr "아니, 그건 사실이 아니야. 넌 이곳에 내 신앙심을 시험하러 왔군. 난 실패하지 않을 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 25a64c65-5284-aad1-cba0-556c5561560d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:25a64c65-5284-aad1-cba0-556c5561560d
msgctxt "h2c373fd4gfc27g4620gb6dbga4f1615c2f39"
msgid ""
"I was abducted by mind flayers. That was when I began to hear the Absolute."
msgstr "나는 마인드 플레이어들에게 납치되었어. 그때부터 절대자님의 목소리를 듣기 시작했지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 29aae6c5-0529-0f99-e183-1b1b210774f3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:29aae6c5-0529-0f99-e183-1b1b210774f3
msgctxt "h16f57b27gd5b6g4eecg8b59g2026c9eb5d07"
msgid "Impossible. I should slit your throat for speaking such blasphemy."
msgstr "불가능한 일이야. 이런 신성 모독을 한 네 목을 베어야겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 29bdf896-f31f-15d7-acf9-c9ee77bf9641
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_TheDrowNere_State_LeftAbsolute = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:29bdf896-f31f-15d7-acf9-c9ee77bf9641
msgctxt "h6bb0fb17g3256g4830ga1c2gcba33e4ced14"
msgid ""
"Dying for a cause is one thing, but for a mind flayer? For filth like that? "
"No."
msgstr "대의를 위해 죽는 건 그렇다 쳐도, 마인드 플레이어를 위해 죽으라고? 그런 불결한 것을 위해? 싫어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2a93c796-baee-e55b-0d83-eab5716b4f59
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_DrowCommander_Quest_AskedAboutPassage = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:2a93c796-baee-e55b-0d83-eab5716b4f59
msgctxt "h07f161afg04b8g446fg93f8g35c656736bcf"
msgid "Minthara already offered to help me."
msgstr "민타라는 이미 돕기로 했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2bb7a53e-cdd7-7614-833d-a1318f63843e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:2bb7a53e-cdd7-7614-833d-a1318f63843e
msgctxt "he9040cb4g151fg4f74gb4f0g07f0796770c4"
msgid "You don't have to. Run - abandon the Absolute."
msgstr "그러지 않아도 돼. 절대자를 버리고 떠나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3248f1de-e586-df20-1bca-f4ea38977586
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:3248f1de-e586-df20-1bca-f4ea38977586
msgctxt "h21867b38g4b97g4048g990cg98c1d25ab596"
msgid "I'm not risking a curse for you, the General, or anyone else."
msgstr "장군이든 너든, 다른 사람을 위해 저주를 무릅쓰진 않을 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 34d1a6bc-32f9-54c6-cbe8-d8a839f84fcd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_TheDrowNere_State_MentionedBalthazar = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:34d1a6bc-32f9-54c6-cbe8-d8a839f84fcd
msgctxt "h0b137bffgd18fg4f2cg8b9dg478aa1224a8b"
msgid ""
"I can still reach the temple and fulfil the General's orders. His advisor, "
"Balthazar, also sought a way."
msgstr "난 여전히 신전에 도달해 장군님의 명령을 이행할 수 있을 거다. 보좌관인 발타자르도 길을 찾아나섰지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 34ed214a-5c20-ea70-7dc5-f76caddc2fa2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:34ed214a-5c20-ea70-7dc5-f76caddc2fa2
msgctxt "h2b955233gaf9ag4ab5g9237g64b451d17ee3"
msgid "Perhaps you're right. Perhaps I should."
msgstr "어쩌면 네 말이 맞을지도. 나는 떠나야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 36d8cc4d-2564-a6ad-4d3d-a98c93ff2c02
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp_ToldGoToKetheric(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_TheDrowNere_Event_Leave = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - UND_CaveIn.FreedNere(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:36d8cc4d-2564-a6ad-4d3d-a98c93ff2c02
msgctxt "hc9ca3c98g476cg488bg9dcbgb950ba8481a8"
msgid ""
"I am generous to those who aid him. When I return to Moonrise, I will be "
"triumphant, and you will share in my victory."
msgstr "난 날 돕는 이에게 관대하다. 성공한 내가 문라이즈로 돌아가면 너 또한 내 승리의 과실을 나누게 해 주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 40dac44c-8efc-0fb6-7703-24f7b6594484
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:40dac44c-8efc-0fb6-7703-24f7b6594484
msgctxt "h3e049badgb71bg4dfegbf89gf2798377bbda"
msgid ""
"No - the General will understand that none of this was my fault. He will "
"understand, because <i>you</i> will tell him."
msgstr "아니, 내 잘못은 하나도 없다는 것을 장군님도 이해해 주실 거다. 왜냐하면, <i>네가</i> 직접 해명할 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 412223db-333c-65d3-2841-52d40224b304
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:412223db-333c-65d3-2841-52d40224b304
msgctxt "h69a2e5c5g6340g4638g8df4g157ddff53fef"
msgid "Whatever it is, I'll set it right. I'll cut you down in Her name!"
msgstr "그게 무엇이든, 내가 바로잡겠어. 그분의 이름으로 너를 절단내주겠다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 42da05fd-5043-6b87-ff77-f088e1cb6000
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_State_LeaderFreedGnomes = False
#.      - UND_GnomeWorkers_State_PermaDefeated = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:42da05fd-5043-6b87-ff77-f088e1cb6000
msgctxt "h6701792fg3bffg4df3gb88ag9e1ed96123c5"
msgid "You worthless, treacherous little rats."
msgstr "이 쓸모없고, 기만적인 쥐새끼 놈들."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 440f657f-d266-29ee-5c7d-9bc05dc66e95
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 1ec94658-421e-3c38-2c3c-547567487fd5_MindHasBeenRead = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LOLTHDROWELF(1) = True
#.      - LOLTHDROWELF(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:440f657f-d266-29ee-5c7d-9bc05dc66e95
msgctxt "h6bd1de80g524bg4565gac1eg8e8d0fdadd85"
msgid "Your faith in Lolth faltered. It is not too late to reclaim it."
msgstr "롤쓰에 대한 너의 믿음이 잠시 흔들렸지만, 아직 믿음을 되찾기에는 늦지 않았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 46691d75-4426-1e1e-df7f-851889205293
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:46691d75-4426-1e1e-df7f-851889205293
msgctxt "h125a3252g605dg4854g8226gb531d1d5837c"
msgid "Yes, I bet you're feeling pretty stupid right now, aren't you?"
msgstr "그래, 지금 꽤 멍청한 기분이 들지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 46f6fbf3-eb28-469b-a4a0-96ff59328709
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(4) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 1ec94658-421e-3c38-2c3c-547567487fd5_InclusionHappened = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:46f6fbf3-eb28-469b-a4a0-96ff59328709
msgctxt "hbde2e423g3815g4fd4g9670g31779438a1ed"
msgid "It's broken?! Argh, you've <i>got </i>to be kidding!"
msgstr "망가졌어?! 아오, <i>진짜</i> 장난하자는 거냐고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 470c560c-4546-816a-b051-28f8488d4cf5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:470c560c-4546-816a-b051-28f8488d4cf5
msgctxt "h64690cb3g2b11g42b3g8e54gd0e8286e5312"
msgid "You can report your own failures."
msgstr "네가 실패했으니 네가 직접 보고해야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 48d78bf4-a1ef-06d0-abf6-47636cf47962
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:48d78bf4-a1ef-06d0-abf6-47636cf47962
msgctxt "h747cb85cga82eg4a0cg9591ga7a104670041"
msgid "You expect me to believe such madness?"
msgstr "그런 광기를 믿으라는 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 49e0711c-2f20-43e7-91ee-40c68c52a158
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 1ec94658-421e-3c38-2c3c-547567487fd5_InclusionHappened = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:49e0711c-2f20-43e7-91ee-40c68c52a158
msgctxt "h7f0c5d11gec47g4522g9210g5d7eb60d79d9"
msgid "Broken. We meddled in these paltry affairs, and for <i>what</i>?"
msgstr "망가졌다고. 우리가 이런 쓸데없는 일에 그렇게 관여했는데, <i>헛수고였나</i>?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 4a06fb70-f7d4-4529-122b-6c94f4d0df0d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:4a06fb70-f7d4-4529-122b-6c94f4d0df0d
msgctxt "hb46e28a6g9b56g4a42gaecagdbda65228388"
msgid "I... yes. It will be so."
msgstr "난... 그래. 그렇게 하겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 4b43f5d1-94f5-e43b-a2bf-fd021f4970e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HasNereSpidersLyre(0) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_TheDrowNere_Event_GiveSpidersLyre(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:4b43f5d1-94f5-e43b-a2bf-fd021f4970e5
msgctxt "he9b70b27g75bdg4219g843aga2094da3a46f"
msgid ""
"There is another way, though - we have allies on the surface. Seek them out, "
"and play this lyre to call on their guide."
msgstr "하지만 다른 길도 존재한다. 지상에 아군이 있지. 그들을 찾아가 이 리라를 연주하면 안내받을 수 있을 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 4e88dacb-f203-c799-6ed5-e6fac6ab7d9d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:4e88dacb-f203-c799-6ed5-e6fac6ab7d9d
msgctxt "hb6c6cb99gbe20g4aa3gb6d2g2416ad2d189f"
msgid "What's going on? What have you done?"
msgstr "무슨 일이 있었던 거지? 무슨 짓을 한 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 4ef418c0-1595-bbd6-c007-1588c1624c11
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_DarkJusticiars_Quest_HeardSharTempleBlocked = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:4ef418c0-1595-bbd6-c007-1588c1624c11
msgctxt "hd4689799g0bd3g463cgb100gfa361f6d893f"
msgid "Important business. My orders come from General Thorm himself."
msgstr "중요한 일이다. 내 임무는 쏨 장군 본인이 직접 내리신 것이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 4ffa19d3-0861-4791-b259-d5a7e62adedd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(6) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 1ec94658-421e-3c38-2c3c-547567487fd5_InclusionHappened = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:4ffa19d3-0861-4791-b259-d5a7e62adedd
msgctxt "hd42b797fg3d03g4c34g8400g3e5c650ab81c"
msgid "The Moonlantern's broken? Just our luck."
msgstr "달등불이 망가졌다고? 우리 운이 그렇지 뭐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 50431163-cccd-55a6-b6c4-151e98228e87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:50431163-cccd-55a6-b6c4-151e98228e87
msgctxt "h731013aeg5d51g4a47g88d6g96151b2de775"
msgid "As for the rest of you slave-worms - you've caused enough trouble."
msgstr "나머지 노예 벌레 놈들. 너흰 이미 너무 많은 문제를 일으켰다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 515156a9-6d5a-76fa-4660-925056d946a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:515156a9-6d5a-76fa-4660-925056d946a3
msgctxt "h8fa5c241ga4a8g4bb7gb17bgb28d1ac8f1f8"
msgid ""
"No. You have a trick - an enchantment. If it can protect you, it'll protect "
"me. All I have to do is take it."
msgstr ""
"아니야. 네게 요령이 있겠지. 뭔가 마법이. 그게 널 지켜줄 수 있다면, 나도 지켜줄 것이다. 내가 할 일은 그걸 가져가는 것뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 533b79a8-d6b4-6266-3cb8-674132a7f008
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:533b79a8-d6b4-6266-3cb8-674132a7f008
msgctxt "hba5e3949g5ad7g4edfg82e9g728f8152ac34"
msgid "It's you, it must be. You've done something to anger Her."
msgstr "너로군, 틀림없어. 네가 무슨 짓을 해서 그분을 화나게 한 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 54966a44-b43f-759d-364c-16c07fa26768
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:54966a44-b43f-759d-364c-16c07fa26768
msgctxt "h73385c0cg22f0g4f8cgbcbegdf52c7f48d60"
msgid "If that's the case, how do I reach it safely?"
msgstr "그럼 그곳에 어떻게 무사히 도착할 수 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 58e1c650-7b8c-efc4-dd52-3becb131d23c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:58e1c650-7b8c-efc4-dd52-3becb131d23c
msgctxt "h3a4ba13eg64f5g43a1g8dc9g2fe101cf6467"
msgid "I'll do it. Where can I find the General?"
msgstr "그러지. 장군은 어디에서 찾을 수 있는데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 59ad123c-a7ac-6189-11fd-2c1c776e905e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:59ad123c-a7ac-6189-11fd-2c1c776e905e
msgctxt "h1d0841f3g0a1ag4589gb681g3ea42845d828"
msgid "I haven't done anything, but I don't hear Her either."
msgstr "아무 짓도 안했지만, 나도 그분의 목소리가 들리지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5c833636-06b9-4130-a5ba-f3d185d75379
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 1ec94658-421e-3c38-2c3c-547567487fd5_MindHasBeenRead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:5c833636-06b9-4130-a5ba-f3d185d75379
msgctxt "h83e47792g1a6cg47a2gb912g19625e93d577"
msgid "Your faith in Lolth faltered. It is not too late to reclaim it."
msgstr "롤쓰에 대한 너의 믿음이 잠시 흔들렸지만, 아직 믿음을 되찾기에는 늦지 않았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 5d1b6937-773c-4287-a2d3-d3f679dce408
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 1ec94658-421e-3c38-2c3c-547567487fd5_MindHasBeenRead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:5d1b6937-773c-4287-a2d3-d3f679dce408
msgctxt "hba810cc8gbe7eg4aeegb227g050b49f37a04"
msgid "<i>It cannot be. Have I betrayed Lolth for an impostor?</i>"
msgstr "<i>이럴 리가 없어. 내가 사기꾼을 위해 롤쓰님을 저벼렸다고?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 62ae47be-ce28-baca-fa8d-1ca4c936ed10
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_TheDrowNere_HasDagger(0) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_TheDrowNere_Event_Leave = True
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_TheDrowNere_GiveDagger(1) = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - UND_CaveIn.RevealedAbsolute(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:62ae47be-ce28-baca-fa8d-1ca4c936ed10
msgctxt "h47ce8f87g911bg40d2g97bdg3346396dda85"
msgid "Take this - a personal blessing. I pray we don't meet again."
msgstr "이걸 가져가라. 개인적인 축복이다. 우리가 다시 만나진 않기를 빌지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 63a96bb7-e9ad-0bc6-1227-5407cbf5e058
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_DarkJusticiars_Quest_HeardSharTemple = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:63a96bb7-e9ad-0bc6-1227-5407cbf5e058
msgctxt "h9312dde5gce2ag44d6gabeeg09c135c27369"
msgid ""
"This was meant to be a simple operation - I arrive, those pack animals clear "
"the debris, and I walk into the temple."
msgstr "원래는 간단한 작업이었다. 내가 도착하면, 이 무리의 동물들이 잔해를 치우고, 나는 사원 안으로 들어가는 것이었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63c2883e-5173-4876-8d34-f50d2bcd33c5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 0
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 1ec94658-421e-3c38-2c3c-547567487fd5_MindHasBeenRead = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CanDetectThoughts_2 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:63c2883e-5173-4876-8d34-f50d2bcd33c5
msgctxt "h42cf8708g3c02g4605gb2bfgb00729940553"
msgid "<i>Cast Detect Thoughts.</i>"
msgstr "<i>생각 탐지를 시전한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 69235f64-4238-b3cb-42d1-db3f695caa48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:69235f64-4238-b3cb-42d1-db3f695caa48
msgctxt "hd49d0499g356eg4bf4gb38eg8a77932e8d57"
msgid ""
"The Absolute is no mere <i>cult</i> - it is a calling. And you are here to "
"test my faith."
msgstr "절대자님은 <i>사이비 종교</i> 따위가 아니라 소명이다. 그리고 너는 내 신앙심을 시험하기 위해 여기 있는 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 69f3c76d-bd57-93cb-15a5-a8d8ff515408
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Player_Knows_NereToldAboutMoonlantern = True
#.     - GLO_Player_Knows_MoonlanternExists = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:69f3c76d-bd57-93cb-15a5-a8d8ff515408
msgctxt "hb125d85bg1d0bg44d7g9701g2472899b3871"
msgid ""
"I had a Moonlantern to keep the curse at bay. Alas, the rocks did it in."
msgstr "내가 저주를 막아줄 달등불을 가지고 있었다. 아아, 바위에 부딪히지만 않았어도."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6c727466-7e04-5257-2a47-c7b95c83ce1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:6c727466-7e04-5257-2a47-c7b95c83ce1f
msgctxt "h0d8d80f2g160dg48aag9ee2g0e82c86a99c0"
msgid "I'd rather make my own way than rely on your help."
msgstr "네 도움에 의존하느니 내 힘으로 가겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7dec34e2-76e8-a1b2-9447-536478f9627e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:7dec34e2-76e8-a1b2-9447-536478f9627e
msgctxt "hb1a6b542g3735g4bb4ga032g6e51cf54ede6"
msgid "First tell me what happened to this place."
msgstr "먼저 이곳에서 무슨 일이 벌어졌는지 설명해 줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7f2d2dc9-05b4-11f9-c0b9-564bdb032376
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:7f2d2dc9-05b4-11f9-c0b9-564bdb032376
msgctxt "h20705adegd717g4cefg969eg8ada34894405"
msgid "Whoever sent you isn't going to be very happy."
msgstr "너를 보낸 사람이 누구든 별로 만족스러워하지는 않겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 7fa09d3c-787c-4e83-868e-880fb6929690
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:7fa09d3c-787c-4e83-868e-880fb6929690
msgctxt "hcac27955g6732g47b7g9f9eg2179c2d11879"
msgid "Was I so weak as to betray the Weaver?"
msgstr "내가 롤쓰님을 저버릴 만큼 나약한 존재였나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 7fe4a4a3-717a-6fdb-068e-04f11d1aa381
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:7fe4a4a3-717a-6fdb-068e-04f11d1aa381
msgctxt "hd01c4a4dgf12cg4093g8016gba84b1588b94"
msgid "But I know you are a traitor - and I will show no mercy!"
msgstr "하지만 네가 배신자라는 건 알겠군 - 네게 보여줄 자비 따위는 없다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 806463d9-d486-4752-bb32-3b0547e8b102
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(3) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 1ec94658-421e-3c38-2c3c-547567487fd5_InclusionHappened = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:806463d9-d486-4752-bb32-3b0547e8b102
msgctxt "h2de7158agddb9g478fga188g1f3007ea0b79"
msgid "Damn it. So much for using that thing to protect us."
msgstr "젠장. 그걸 써서는 우리를 보호할 수 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 80d7562e-c70a-3b4f-d0e6-25dbfe1112a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:80d7562e-c70a-3b4f-d0e6-25dbfe1112a3
msgctxt "hc01f38c2ga6b3g44c6gb65dgfa1a2464105b"
msgid "The General? Is he a favourite of the Absolute?"
msgstr "장군? 그가 절대자의 총아인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 83c4da82-277a-5457-0add-cc81a6932b6a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_TheDrowNere_Quest_SentToMinthara = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:83c4da82-277a-5457-0add-cc81a6932b6a
msgctxt "h7fe3e83ag092dg4486g9de8g0ce7492e14ba"
msgid ""
"Minthara? I'm surprised she hasn't got herself killed on one of her reckless "
"raids."
msgstr "민타라? 그 여자가 그 아직도 무모한 돌격을 하다가 죽지 않았다니 놀랍군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 8a085d3a-94e8-094e-7fdd-58e31ec08c03
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_State_LeaderFreedGnomes = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:8a085d3a-94e8-094e-7fdd-58e31ec08c03
msgctxt "hc58eade2g797bg4effg9571gc3b2a8a722ab"
msgid ""
"Gnomes, you are slaves no longer. The Absolute may have use for you yet."
msgstr "노움들이여, 너희는 이제 노예가 아니다. 절대자께서 너희를 쓰실 곳이 아직 남았나 보구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 8f861681-986c-ce45-abd6-170d644e0b1e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:8f861681-986c-ce45-abd6-170d644e0b1e
msgctxt "hd906e4c5g9bcbg4fc4g8f3cg8d414e670232"
msgid "Do not tarry. I will see you again, but only when my work is done."
msgstr "지체하지 말도록. 내 일이 끝나고 난 후에 다시 보도록 하겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 8fae79a9-d985-930b-37d4-4d64fcbb8cce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp_CalledUngrateful(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:8fae79a9-d985-930b-37d4-4d64fcbb8cce
msgctxt "h6cba224fg7cbfg4209gabebg462621025c81"
msgid "I owe you a debt. And I would hate to be ungrateful."
msgstr "네게 빚을 졌군. 그리고 난 배은망덕한 자가 되고 싶지 않다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 9344deb8-d5c3-b594-c8ff-a15973f252b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:9344deb8-d5c3-b594-c8ff-a15973f252b7
msgctxt "hf1d00675g1f50g4c71g8406gf2708937e9b6"
msgid "I'll pick up his trail and follow him. Prove myself his superior."
msgstr "그놈의 흔적을 찾아내 따라가야겠다. 내가 더 뛰어나다는 것을 증명해줘야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 9532a5ef-26ed-5fd2-0bcb-0b03b7075b34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:9532a5ef-26ed-5fd2-0bcb-0b03b7075b34
msgctxt "h32c161degd021g470cgb453g3f5107195dc7"
msgid ""
"This is not a failure, it's only a setback. I have been entrusted with a "
"sacred mission - I cannot fail."
msgstr "이건 실패가 아니라 장애물일 뿐이다. 나는 신성한 사명을 맡았으니 실패할 수 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 96763c43-e024-20aa-466e-264c3f1126f8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_TheDrowNere_State_LeftAbsolute = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:96763c43-e024-20aa-466e-264c3f1126f8
msgctxt "h490f456ag533bg4787gb980gb6a65434591a"
msgid ""
"I will take word to the Order of Soul Spiders. They must know of the "
"Absolute threat."
msgstr "영혼 거미 교단에 말을 전하겠다. 그들도 절대자의 위협에 대해 알아야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 96be5e5e-7b4a-f682-16c9-608943a9cd7f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:96be5e5e-7b4a-f682-16c9-608943a9cd7f
msgctxt "h50ec8605ge200g4d44gbf5dgb15242ff3709"
msgid "You traitorous little maggot!"
msgstr "이 배신자 새끼가!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 999dc4b9-8a7e-eecb-59f9-75da983097e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:999dc4b9-8a7e-eecb-59f9-75da983097e3
msgctxt "h137162f6g4fcdg4563gb2a2g83f07eb338eb"
msgid "Liar. I've seen no such creatures."
msgstr "거짓말. 그런 생명체 따위는 본 적이 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 9a7161b5-3a2e-48b8-9b78-5084af751c73
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:9a7161b5-3a2e-48b8-9b78-5084af751c73
msgctxt "h81b32510gffb5g4ce9g86a1g574586efb267"
msgid "Fool. My mind is not your playground."
msgstr "바보 같으니. 내 정신은 네 놀이터가 아니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 9b0e8a27-3da6-b61c-1994-233bc59850a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:9b0e8a27-3da6-b61c-1994-233bc59850a3
msgctxt "h607e44bcg3a12g4574g95d4g008ec8d44dbc"
msgid ""
"You would be wiser to align yourself with me than her. Few earn the "
"General's favour - I am sure to be among them."
msgstr ""
"민타라보다는 내 쪽으로 줄을 서는 것이 현명할 거다. 장군의 호의를 살 수 있는 자는 얼마 없지만, 내가 곧 그 영광을 누릴 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9ced95bb-c405-7f5f-bbf8-e96d940891f4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:9ced95bb-c405-7f5f-bbf8-e96d940891f4
msgctxt "h739f2278g7729g46fdgb686gd1e51a8d8318"
msgid "What are you talking about? I can hear Her just fine."
msgstr "무슨 말을 하는 거야? 나는 그분의 말이 잘 들리는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a2af773b-0192-675a-5ced-4f0001a232a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:a2af773b-0192-675a-5ced-4f0001a232a3
msgctxt "h10c04151gd1b4g4cb4g9585g719ae7e15a1f"
msgid "<i>Say nothing.</i>"
msgstr "<i>아무 말도 하지 않는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = ad491405-5758-7c22-cfb2-6cd3d63a6df9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:ad491405-5758-7c22-cfb2-6cd3d63a6df9
msgctxt "h4444d781g0511g4addg8d7egc1dbb0e20bc0"
msgid "You're right. I'm a fool for not seeing it before now."
msgstr "맞는 말이다. 그걸 이제야 안 내가 바보지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = add76e35-4ec6-b9e1-bcf9-1e9a0d81efa4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:add76e35-4ec6-b9e1-bcf9-1e9a0d81efa4
msgctxt "hc4cfd445g29b5g41d3g8afag35128e5693cd"
msgid "And what business is that, exactly?"
msgstr "그 계획은 정확히 뭐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = b2cf1a5d-497a-eba2-3381-8ae1524b210f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:b2cf1a5d-497a-eba2-3381-8ae1524b210f
msgctxt "hf3eb04f0gb51cg4f1cgac4cg3cfbfc9b6f76"
msgid ""
"Whatever you do - do not attempt the journey to Moonrise without his "
"protection. I promise you, it will not end well."
msgstr "네가 무엇을 하든, 절대 안내원의 보호 없이 문라이즈로 여정하려 들지 마라. 장담컨대 결말이 좋지 않을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = ba8c33da-e49a-40f3-8d40-85025da46d6d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(7) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 1ec94658-421e-3c38-2c3c-547567487fd5_InclusionHappened = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:ba8c33da-e49a-40f3-8d40-85025da46d6d
msgctxt "h8f44d2b2g0b26g470agaf50g0432c529ee87"
msgid "A broken Moonlantern? They say that's ten years of bad luck."
msgstr "부서진 달등불? 그런 건 10년의 불운이라고 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = be49871a-f1e5-3d44-d277-4c83937129bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:be49871a-f1e5-3d44-d277-4c83937129bc
msgctxt "h9072a835g647cg462ag8defg167f6b15bf38"
msgid "I - I don't understand. I've been following those wretched beasts?"
msgstr "나- 나는 이해가 안 된다. 내가 그런 불쾌한 짐승들을 따르고 있었단 말인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = c07db91b-0993-f872-a037-58eab28137e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:c07db91b-0993-f872-a037-58eab28137e3
msgctxt "h895cc918g351ag4c62g92f1g4a86ab611278"
msgid "You don't deserve the death you got. I should have made it last."
msgstr "그 죽음조차 네겐 사치야. 내가 끝장을 내 줬어야 하는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c39cb2fc-d047-ae23-809a-e4e1637881cf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:c39cb2fc-d047-ae23-809a-e4e1637881cf
msgctxt "h26286d9cg72dag4de2g8fa2gc45895137378"
msgid "Go ahead - try it."
msgstr "그럼 해봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c845bb1b-7fe5-735d-c17f-ee082f756816
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:c845bb1b-7fe5-735d-c17f-ee082f756816
msgctxt "hb917e1f4g5c2cg4523g9462gfaeac12a9cfd"
msgid "All right, I'll tell the General what happened here."
msgstr "알았다, 내가 그 장군에게 여기서 무슨 일이 일어났는지 전하겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = c84bd7c6-b9d6-d020-4a7c-19ba3bfbb5a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:c84bd7c6-b9d6-d020-4a7c-19ba3bfbb5a5
msgctxt "h4f850ad1g5c72g458dg9e46gfed26cee40a1"
msgid "I don't know what you are, that you can defy the Absolute's will."
msgstr "네가 뭐라고 생각하길래 절대자님의 뜻을 거스를 수 있을 거라 생각하는지 모르겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = ca408b3c-14fd-447f-8234-cd3810235cb7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(5) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 1ec94658-421e-3c38-2c3c-547567487fd5_InclusionHappened = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:ca408b3c-14fd-447f-8234-cd3810235cb7
msgctxt "h666a6bbcg7bdcg4574g9c91g1968edbe308d"
msgid "Of course they did. Why would anything go our way?"
msgstr "당연히 그랬겠지. 우리 뜻대로 되는 일이 뭐가 있겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ca5f0d54-154d-b18e-ee71-7af1b60fcc87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:ca5f0d54-154d-b18e-ee71-7af1b60fcc87
msgctxt "hff235c05g4132g440bg98ecg5217f00786a6"
msgid "Unfortunate - but how does this concern me?"
msgstr "불운하군. 그런데 나와 무슨 상관이지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = cf4b4410-a9bd-813b-f543-c27809ac1645
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:cf4b4410-a9bd-813b-f543-c27809ac1645
msgctxt "h83dc2ee3gc329g4d4eg9c3eg1ebf2f35185b"
msgid ""
"Abandon the Absolute? After everything I've done for Her? Everything She's "
"done for me?"
msgstr "절대자님을 버리라고? 내가 그녀에게 바친 모든 것을 두고? 그분께서 내게 해주신 모든 것을 두고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = dbbcacfc-3936-b56e-9ef1-27717a21d167
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_InfernalBox_State_TeamHasBox = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:dbbcacfc-3936-b56e-9ef1-27717a21d167
msgctxt "h8d3d8370ge1e2g4f4bg823bg70cd13a0af64"
msgid ""
"The Absolute should be demanding I take your head for insolence like that, "
"but I can't hear Her voice."
msgstr "원래라면 절대자께서 네 언사를 듣고 목을 자르라 명령하셨을 텐데, 그분의 목소리가 들리지 않는다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = df8ce5b7-25f1-738f-8159-5d53bad45b54
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:df8ce5b7-25f1-738f-8159-5d53bad45b54
msgctxt "h79e23d88g59deg420ag9475g0b4a447aec09"
msgid "People have followed cults for a long time. You're just another victim."
msgstr "사람들이 오랫동안 사이비 종교를 따라왔어. 너도 또 다른 피해자일 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e028362d-122f-4a12-41d2-f5abd4aed698
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:e028362d-122f-4a12-41d2-f5abd4aed698
msgctxt "hd6adef49gf4b2g433eg9803g3fce40f006c9"
msgid "<i>Attack Nere.</i>"
msgstr "<i>니어를 공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = e17fbed5-720f-af7a-b949-f8a32a62a940
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:e17fbed5-720f-af7a-b949-f8a32a62a940
msgctxt "haaf90f8eg5d70g405ag8169g99c9f4a412b8"
msgid "He never mentioned this."
msgstr "이런 건 말씀 안해 주셨어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e28f6c59-f731-3ef9-211b-3bdfc38d7a66
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:e28f6c59-f731-3ef9-211b-3bdfc38d7a66
msgctxt "h56b65d92g14e2g466bg894bgb6504dc2f05d"
msgid "Forget it. I was merely testing your faith."
msgstr "잊어버려. 그냥 너의 신앙심을 시험한 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = e452325e-2cdf-54f8-e1f9-e8aad7803c20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_InfernalBox_State_TeamHasBox = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:e452325e-2cdf-54f8-e1f9-e8aad7803c20
msgctxt "h736cad96g516eg44fdg855fg87cd2efac6c3"
msgid "You insolent worm. You would refuse Nere? Refuse the Absolute?"
msgstr "이 무례한 벌레 자식이. 니어의 말을 거부해? 절대자님을 거부해?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = e89e07d3-7dbc-d6a6-60ae-ec90bccae5bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:e89e07d3-7dbc-d6a6-60ae-ec90bccae5bc
msgctxt "h5396d8ebgca62g4c15g834cg0120ab488c2d"
msgid ""
"Instead, I've been beset by incompetence, treachery, and now <i>this</i>. "
"The Absolute's business remains unfinished."
msgstr "그러기는 커녕, 나는 무능과 배신에 시달리고, 이제는 <i>이런 일</i>까지 벌어지다니. 절대자님의 계획도 완수하지 못했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = f35e388b-7227-b687-06e7-885db35b146c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:f35e388b-7227-b687-06e7-885db35b146c
msgctxt "h9b75392fg0f42g407cg8957gd82c68fc7439"
msgid ""
"I owe you a debt, it seems. You've saved me from worse than the duergar."
msgstr "너에게 빚을 진 것 같군. 너는 듀에르가보다 심각한 위협에서 나를 구해줬어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = f7689073-7968-f718-04ec-66ea461c4700
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_TheDrowNere_Event_MentionedKethericChosen(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:f7689073-7968-f718-04ec-66ea461c4700
msgctxt "h5c7a0957g5c9fg4b57ga845g97f1a9579c75"
msgid ""
"I need you to deliver a message to him. Tell the General that I did what I "
"could, but that the route through Grymforge is impassable."
msgstr "네가 소식을 전해 줘야겠어. 장군님께 가서 내가 최선을 다했으나, 그림포지를 통한 경로는 통행이 불가능했다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fa9acda7-c018-ea2f-2219-9facb26a2726
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:fa9acda7-c018-ea2f-2219-9facb26a2726
msgctxt "hbe010278gc931g42dagaad6gc4308fcf2b54"
msgid "If you survived, I'm sure I will."
msgstr "네가 살아남았다면, 나도 살 수 있겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = fb9f227e-9977-1e3d-1428-e16692846e87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:fb9f227e-9977-1e3d-1428-e16692846e87
msgctxt "h0e5b9382g635ag47c9g9b37g49990c59ab66"
msgid "Let it be done."
msgstr "그렇게 하도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = fbe3156b-3b22-2d76-310c-00b0f2564f51
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_FollowUp:fbe3156b-3b22-2d76-310c-00b0f2564f51
msgctxt "h04ac5dd2g3aa0g464fga4fdg60598cd34910"
msgid "If you won't help me, I may as well enjoy this."
msgstr "네가 날 돕지 않겠다면, 나도 좀 즐길 수 있겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1478aa62-39d3-d768-cd92-efc8d755407b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld:1478aa62-39d3-d768-cd92-efc8d755407b
msgctxt "h09a9471cg4783g4484g82d1g640c7945da06"
msgid "Stay still. I'll do what I can."
msgstr "가만히 있어. 뭘 할 수 있는지 보지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 176b751b-78db-cd65-f88f-906eb83d5244
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld:176b751b-78db-cd65-f88f-906eb83d5244
msgctxt "h5ca62641g9948g4856ga238g5e769a5328d5"
msgid ""
"*The harder you look, the fuzzier the images become, until there is only "
"grey.*"
msgstr "*열심히 보려고 할수록, 더 흐릿해지더니 회색만이 보입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 1aec0dda-f715-e880-56d7-37323b110456
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld:1aec0dda-f715-e880-56d7-37323b110456
msgctxt "h8dee74d7gb233g4519g88f7gbd54c7bfc105"
msgid ""
"*You sense Nere's frustration, tinged with rage, as the connection fades.*"
msgstr "*연결이 끊어지면서 분노로 물든 니어의 좌절감이 느껴집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 20100a86-4f83-541b-0661-236868fb2bbd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld:20100a86-4f83-541b-0661-236868fb2bbd
msgctxt "hc74133afg2c91g4c5cg8685g8cd092e54a42"
msgid "...it quick or... head! Careful... mercs... on the edge..."
msgstr "...서두르... 날려주지! 외곽에 있는... 용병... 조심..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 25a708e0-d12f-fd35-f352-d5fa800ddec3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld:25a708e0-d12f-fd35-f352-d5fa800ddec3
msgctxt "hde6c3735g9194g45e7g9c65g06b14e1d007c"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 4132bea1-ab73-9613-e15b-ce1ef79dc342
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld:4132bea1-ab73-9613-e15b-ce1ef79dc342
msgctxt "hab6c0761gaab5g4d9egae19gf192fcda6500"
msgid "...Get me OUT!"
msgstr "... 날 <b>꺼내줘</b>!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 58edeff3-2c55-81ac-1391-1602c48e99cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_TheDrowNere_Event_HadMindMeld = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld:58edeff3-2c55-81ac-1391-1602c48e99cb
msgctxt "hcc2175f4gec25g43bbgb237g649c8f257b7e"
msgid "Choking... dig... out of here!"
msgstr "숨이 막혀... 파내... 여기서!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63025c06-5da4-bece-e385-31a0c7c320f4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld:63025c06-5da4-bece-e385-31a0c7c320f4
msgctxt "h3e7144dcg9659g498cg833dge11b8c176880"
msgid "Are you Nere? What happened here?"
msgstr "네가 니어인가? 무슨 일이 있었던 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6770c8ff-851b-b0e6-6285-f8a211d533ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_NereMindMeld_Event_AttemptedCheck(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_NereMindMeld_Event_SucceededCheck = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld:6770c8ff-851b-b0e6-6285-f8a211d533ef
msgctxt "hb35b3b27gb4e6g46e6gb8e4g51a2d6a11eef"
msgid ""
"*You make out only a few faint figures and scattered debris through Nere's "
"eyes.*"
msgstr "*니어의 눈을 통해 그저 실루엣과 널브러진 잔해만이 보입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6b60f923-a1c3-3530-3218-58fe5d51429a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_TheDrowNere_Event_HadMindMeld = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld:6b60f923-a1c3-3530-3218-58fe5d51429a
msgctxt "h01f5224agcb9dg4449gb9fbg46f1de2efef4"
msgid "*As you near the rubble, a fragmented voice clutches at your mind.*"
msgstr "*잔해에 가까이 다가가자, 목소리의 파편이 당신의 정신에 들려옵니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 71857f64-ff53-3119-b257-042924d4338e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld:71857f64-ff53-3119-b257-042924d4338e
msgctxt "he6733cacg1fdbg4203gbf4bgf1e05544ac80"
msgid "Finally! You must clear... rubble. Filling... poison!"
msgstr "마침내! 잔해... 반드시... 치워야. 독... 차올라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 83ee8e6b-2bd0-df2e-d82d-61f30e465679
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld:83ee8e6b-2bd0-df2e-d82d-61f30e465679
msgctxt "hbe090b39g32d2g4373g8477gc00dc53c7422"
msgid "Gnome slaves... passage trapped. Careful of... mercs..."
msgstr "노움 노예... 길목에 갇혔다. 용병... 조심해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 8ba8a0dc-88c6-cd24-e4c1-f85e8fc49aab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_NereMindMeld_Event_SucceededCheck = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld:8ba8a0dc-88c6-cd24-e4c1-f85e8fc49aab
msgctxt "h7b2c9cb9ga3ecg4452g9c49g312b0318efbc"
msgid ""
"*The blur resolves into an image. Two gnomes feverishly removing debris...*"
msgstr "*흐릿한 시야가 또렷하게 보입니다. 노움 두 명이 온 힘을 다해 잔해를 치우고 있습니다...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 96b0147a-c1c2-007c-9616-9a6a311d72bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld:96b0147a-c1c2-007c-9616-9a6a311d72bc
msgctxt "h8a6409eagcc97g46e7g9c1ag7e438c9864fd"
msgid ""
"*The view through Nere's eyes is a blur. You only make out a bit of rubble "
"and few moving figures.*"
msgstr "*니어의 눈을 통해 보이는 풍경은 흐릿합니다. 약간의 잔해와 움직이는 인물만 겨우 식별할 수 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a62126a2-0230-03fa-bada-8ea7da8dabb6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - UND_NereMindMeld_Event_AttemptedCheck(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_NereMindMeld_Event_SucceededCheck = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - UND_NereMindMeld_Event_AttemptedCheck(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld:a62126a2-0230-03fa-bada-8ea7da8dabb6
msgctxt "h20ad47a7g2154g4ac5g83e1g224b72e9a74a"
msgid "<i>Try to focus. What more can you see?</i>"
msgstr "<i>집중한다. 뭐가 보이지?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = aa1812e9-571a-83ed-1415-93f4e54cd534
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld:aa1812e9-571a-83ed-1415-93f4e54cd534
msgctxt "h4cc22adegf4bcg4baag8178g5bffbe6af234"
msgid ""
"Expedition... passage trapped. Gnomes... <i>Useless.</i> Don't trust... "
"mercs..."
msgstr "원정... 통로에 갇혔어. 노움... <i>쓸모없어.</i> 용병... 믿지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bde18827-6542-bafa-981b-e7b14572ccd1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld:bde18827-6542-bafa-981b-e7b14572ccd1
msgctxt "h7285f9e9gdd28g4ac0g8851g52f11dc7b17d"
msgid "Is anyone else in there?"
msgstr "거기 다른 이들도 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = dedf9acf-b810-88f7-ca74-1bfdb1989e07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld:dedf9acf-b810-88f7-ca74-1bfdb1989e07
msgctxt "h43f4e240g9a12g4fd9gbccfgf4b3228c2792"
msgid ""
"*...while two others lie dead at Nere's feet, their flesh scorched by "
"powerful magic.*"
msgstr "*...다른 두 명은 니어의 발 아래 죽어 있습니다. 강력한 마법에 의해 불태워진 듯 보입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f395b639-a8c7-4af2-f2a1-2f3a9171f7ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld:f395b639-a8c7-4af2-f2a1-2f3a9171f7ee
msgctxt "hb26c1e0cg412dg4c5ag9683gd4f40f8c2cc2"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = f5b2509c-19be-846e-8d74-c46cbe2216e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_DuergarCamp_Knows_NereIsTrapped = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld:f5b2509c-19be-846e-8d74-c46cbe2216e3
msgctxt "h93021d51g194bg4fd5gae12g4265fd5913e2"
msgid "A Tru... Sou... True Soul?"
msgstr "참... 영... 참된 영혼?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld_LeavingRegion
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 53ccea2a-641e-595f-db86-d47d699b299b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld_LeavingRegion:53ccea2a-641e-595f-db86-d47d699b299b
msgctxt "h51632a4ag7d5fg40afg8105g58799e8f9b87"
msgid "*A faint voice echoes in your mind.*"
msgstr "*희미한 목소리가 당신의 마음속에 울려 퍼집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld_LeavingRegion
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 5a5bedf6-af5f-29ca-d279-66698a43cf38
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld_LeavingRegion:5a5bedf6-af5f-29ca-d279-66698a43cf38
msgctxt "h045fddc4g7642g4f3fgad66g7b398e3f5bb9"
msgid ""
"I sense you, True Soul... come to me, come to Nere... the poison spreads."
msgstr "너의 존재가 느껴진다, 참된 영혼... 나에게 와라, 니어에게 와라... 독이 퍼지고 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld_LeavingRegion
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 69c4d0b6-a1d1-4093-a834-f2a2d6e701af
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(4) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld_LeavingRegion:69c4d0b6-a1d1-4093-a834-f2a2d6e701af
msgctxt "h6f8b36c2g9048g48d1g9b4bged5f4a07ccc4"
msgid "Did you hear that? The poor evil cultist needs our help."
msgstr "들었어? 그 불쌍하고 사악한 컬티스트가 우리의 도움이 필요하대."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld_LeavingRegion
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 7dab61d6-56a7-4fd6-9e8f-864e415c6a56
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(2) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld_LeavingRegion:7dab61d6-56a7-4fd6-9e8f-864e415c6a56
msgctxt "h7091c264gad16g42cag9756g05956b03366b"
msgid ""
"<i>Chk. </i>The trapped drow will die if we leave. Forgive me if I have no "
"tears to shed."
msgstr "<i>츠크. </i>우리가 떠나면 저 갇힌 드로우는 죽겠지. 내가 흘릴 눈물이 없더라도 이해해라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld_LeavingRegion
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 7e17e682-b2a8-46a6-ae29-af9055f2c7b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_GnomeWorkers_State_PermaDefeated = True
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(6) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld_LeavingRegion:7e17e682-b2a8-46a6-ae29-af9055f2c7b9
msgctxt "hd6eeadf8ga33dg4476g8de6geb7e20d0e8cd"
msgid ""
"Hells - Nere'll die if we leave. What becomes of the slaves <i>then?</i>"
msgstr "젠장, 우리가 떠나면 니어는 죽게 될 거야. <i>그 뒤에</i> 노예들은 어떻게 될까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld_LeavingRegion
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 940786bd-62be-40bb-ad0f-bb47e4faa876
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld_LeavingRegion:940786bd-62be-40bb-ad0f-bb47e4faa876
msgctxt "h892c39bag0800g4e26gae6fg7d81185e0e52"
msgid ""
"Nere's as good as dead without us... let's just hope his whispers don't "
"reach any True Souls."
msgstr "니어는 우리 도움 없이는 죽은 목숨이나 다름 없어... 녀석의 속삭임이 다른 참된 영혼에게 닿지 않기를 바라자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld_LeavingRegion
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 97c7b8f2-cb94-4181-8deb-1856fc1d62cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(7) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld_LeavingRegion:97c7b8f2-cb94-4181-8deb-1856fc1d62cd
msgctxt "h2475049ege939g43eaga484g244d8019eec9"
msgid ""
"You hear him too, don't you? Nere is not long for this world unless we get "
"him out of there."
msgstr "너도 들었지, 그렇지? 우리가 빨리 꺼내주지 않으면 니어는 죽게 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld_LeavingRegion
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 9ab7a353-916f-47ee-f26c-730758f9372b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_GnomeWorkers_State_PermaDefeated = False
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(6) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld_LeavingRegion:9ab7a353-916f-47ee-f26c-730758f9372b
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h578a26ecg2465g4c85g9694g693d86482f2a"
msgid "Nere'll die if we leave. Is that a chance you want to take?"
msgstr "우리가 떠나면 니어는 죽을 거야. 감수할 수 있겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld_LeavingRegion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = db26e7b8-681a-4d60-933f-0c6ba1d5daa7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(5) = True
#. TagRule: !(REALLY_DROWELF and REALLY_DROWHALFELF)
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld_LeavingRegion:db26e7b8-681a-4d60-933f-0c6ba1d5daa7
msgctxt "hc6fb44a1g08cag4f39gb2a0g4ac37042338c"
msgid "Hear that? Our drow friend won't last long. Pity."
msgstr "들었어? 우리 드로우 친구는 오래 못 버티겠군. 안됐네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld_LeavingRegion
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = db26e7b8-681a-4d60-933f-0c6ba1d5daa7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(5) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld_LeavingRegion:db26e7b8-681a-4d60-933f-0c6ba1d5daa7
msgctxt "hae8d0a00g047eg438fg97a4gefe9444c84ed"
msgid "Hear that? Our friend Nere won't last long. Pity."
msgstr "들었어? 우리 드로우 친구는 오래 못 버티겠군. 안됐네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld_LeavingRegion
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ed809ddb-ec28-d145-354a-721070e8425f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_DuergarCamp_State_TriedLeavingOnce = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mindmeld_LeavingRegion:ed809ddb-ec28-d145-354a-721070e8425f
msgctxt "h2811d404gfc0cg4be6g920cg970092d07c57"
msgid ""
"*Nere's voice fades, but your head still tingles with his anger... and fear.*"
msgstr "*니어의 목소리는 희미해졌지만, 그의 분노와 두려움으로 당신의 머리가 여전히 따끔거립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 00c5b103-52d0-a788-20b2-a34b66dfa42e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_MyconidRevenge_State_SentKillNere = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:00c5b103-52d0-a788-20b2-a34b66dfa42e
msgctxt "hacaab966ga59ag4897g8db1g4c9567443359"
msgid "I came on the myconid sovereign's behalf. It demands revenge."
msgstr "나는 마이코니드 군주를 대신해서 왔다. 그가 복수를 원하더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 04100cb8-f501-2d53-7441-cb8dcdfe91be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:04100cb8-f501-2d53-7441-cb8dcdfe91be
msgctxt "h78701efdg0377g428fg8a4dg8d4149ecc1ae"
msgid "I see your idiocy is only surpassed by your <i>ego.</i>"
msgstr "너의 어리석음을 능가하는 건 너의 <i>자존심</i>밖에 없구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 04f470be-ac48-0661-2f06-8842e11ced7a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FIGHTER(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:04f470be-ac48-0661-2f06-8842e11ced7a
msgctxt "h0bdcb605geed5g492bg81d5g68808dd8569b"
msgid "You command with the gravitas of a spoiled child. Pathetic."
msgstr "너는 버릇없는 아이처럼 명령하는군. 한심하기는."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 050fdc7a-25eb-164d-93a0-85a65ebf52aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:050fdc7a-25eb-164d-93a0-85a65ebf52aa
msgctxt "h90777ee6g7071g473egb52cg6a5d3f5650f0"
msgid "Finish the slaves, True Soul. For the Absolute."
msgstr "노예들을 끝장내버려라, 참된 영혼. 절대자님을 위하여."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Elder Brithvar
#. NodeID = 05b4856a-b617-0f65-ab5d-7bdda5e81cf7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:05b4856a-b617-0f65-ab5d-7bdda5e81cf7
msgctxt "hee78f6c8ge175g47deg9894g1d28ba600f32"
msgid ""
"You been a shit since I laid eyes on you, red-eye. Go on, try and gut me. I "
"ain't going down easy."
msgstr "넌 처음 봤을 때부터 줄곧 똥덩어리였어, 이 빨간 눈아. 자, 이 내장을 꺼내봐라. 나는 쉽게 쓰러지지 않는다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 0739cf21-9a4b-a7df-b6c0-fcc8bf0c43ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:0739cf21-9a4b-a7df-b6c0-fcc8bf0c43ef
msgctxt "hf3358649g2173g4d93gadaegd89bcf1890a6"
msgid "True Soul - take their heads. The Absolute commands it!"
msgstr "참된 영혼 - 그들의 머리를 취해라. 절대자님의 명령이다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 085de677-b53a-fe97-7aa5-7f36fdda9dd9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:085de677-b53a-fe97-7aa5-7f36fdda9dd9
msgctxt "h7f342fd5g2712g441cg818fg788c90397d3c"
msgid "Of course I care. I can't let these gnomes suffer."
msgstr "물론 신경 쓰지. 이 노움들이 고통받게 둘 수는 없으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 0a82079f-95c2-6275-c861-f6dea5188c8f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:0a82079f-95c2-6275-c861-f6dea5188c8f
msgctxt "h18f5b5d2ga853g4f0fg8caeg4acd81e2604f"
msgid "Heretics. Let Nere be your end."
msgstr "이단자들. 니어가 너희에게 최후를 선사하겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0aab39cb-5241-73f6-aa09-283aceaa7582
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DEEPGNOME(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:0aab39cb-5241-73f6-aa09-283aceaa7582
msgctxt "h5ba5a686gecddg425fga232g4946e714e77f"
msgid ""
"If you'd <i>listened</i> to those gnomes, maybe you wouldn't have been "
"trapped."
msgstr "그 노움들의 말을 들었다면, 아마 애초에 갇히지도 않았을걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 0e03977e-4d09-05d8-36b5-8c267cc76a26
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:0e03977e-4d09-05d8-36b5-8c267cc76a26
msgctxt "hf64197d3g87cfg44dagabf6gea5149534d39"
msgid "You bargained with this wretch? How <i>vexing.</i>"
msgstr "네가 이 불량배와 거래를 했단 말인가? 정말 <i>성가시군.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 0e1809df-9aed-77da-3216-2c11f47ef1cf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:0e1809df-9aed-77da-3216-2c11f47ef1cf
msgctxt "h9ba5c06cg57a7g490bga6d7gc274047f348d"
msgid ""
"... yet a True Soul still lives. I am sure there's a <i>sane</i> explanation."
msgstr "... 아직 참된 영혼이 살아있군. 분명 <i>합당한</i> 이유가 있겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0e269c8e-02ac-484b-8667-db256fe3c91d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 416cef75-7cd0-791a-e997-e5fa27120efa_MindHasBeenRead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:0e269c8e-02ac-484b-8667-db256fe3c91d
msgctxt "hfc6c69ddg09c0g481ag86cag88b7ebc144a7"
msgid "Those duergar were thorns in our sides, so I removed them."
msgstr "저 듀에르가들은 안쪽에서 자라난 가시였어, 난 그걸 제거했을 뿐이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 131a2d43-1b03-9abc-2a21-56adb891a7f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_DuergarCamp_State_SidedMutineers = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:131a2d43-1b03-9abc-2a21-56adb891a7f0
msgctxt "h54eb6d19g23eag47cdgb0d4g315ac2bd8d23"
msgid "<i>Side with Brithvar and the rebels.</i>"
msgstr "<i>브리스바와 반란군의 편에 선다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1396e978-f540-cf38-3dc7-9039a5954917
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DRAGONBORN(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:1396e978-f540-cf38-3dc7-9039a5954917
msgctxt "hc4dc0eb2g0bdeg4a88g8f91ge24d4aabb72d"
msgid "This battle will make a good story. Come, then."
msgstr "이 전투는 좋은 이야깃거리가 되겠군. 그럼, 덤벼라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 13a6639a-1478-8171-25fc-01b80debed21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DROWELF(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:13a6639a-1478-8171-25fc-01b80debed21
msgctxt "hfbe8c8a0g9fd6g46a8gb69dgb881e5285a67"
msgid "The only weakness I see here is you."
msgstr "이곳에서 나약한 것은 너뿐인 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 14e19591-9094-fbbd-a7e5-6695134182a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:14e19591-9094-fbbd-a7e5-6695134182a5
msgctxt "he77bb44eg5c90g4feagb728gd8ddf578cf53"
msgid "<i>Say nothing.</i>"
msgstr "<i>아무 말도 하지 않는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 16149cd5-560e-41da-53b5-960912f66075
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:16149cd5-560e-41da-53b5-960912f66075
msgctxt "hfc39e82dge646g473aga3f5gd34761b03cfa"
msgid ""
"You dare speak to me without due reverence? That was your first and last "
"mistake."
msgstr "감히 내게 마땅한 공경도 없이 말하다니? 그게 너의 처음이자 마지막 실수야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Elder Brithvar
#. NodeID = 1651b7c3-54bf-aa45-d36e-5e0f3e86ba61
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_Mutineers_Quest_Accepted = True
#.      - UND_ScryingEye_State_PermaDefeated = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:1651b7c3-54bf-aa45-d36e-5e0f3e86ba61
msgctxt "hb97d8e25g3ca5g438cgbc79gb2cdcd3fbbb1"
msgid "Bloody hells, had <i>enough</i> of your shit."
msgstr "빌어먹을, 네 똥은 <i>충분히</i> 처먹었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 171387a7-16c6-a70c-c3a4-2796effe2fc1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 416cef75-7cd0-791a-e997-e5fa27120efa_MentionedHead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:171387a7-16c6-a70c-c3a4-2796effe2fc1
msgctxt "h3a41ec1eg5bc2g430fgb181g80a59717d4da"
msgid "... you've one final chance to prove your allegiance."
msgstr "... 네 충성심을 증명할 마지막 기회다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1859118b-67ab-d3ab-869e-33f78280bc7d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:1859118b-67ab-d3ab-869e-33f78280bc7d
msgctxt "h24bd0092g8f96g4085g8261g03ee9fbb30f4"
msgid "And yet I don't care a jot for you. Now that's curious."
msgstr "하지만 난 널 전혀 신경 쓰지 않는다. 그것 참 흥미롭군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 19518a5c-3e01-5251-1209-7326be4e553d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_MyconidRevenge_State_SentKillNere = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:19518a5c-3e01-5251-1209-7326be4e553d
msgctxt "h69b4c6e0gbf53g4676gaa32gf6ab6823c7cb"
msgid ""
"The myconid sovereign wants the rot cleansed - and you're last on the list."
msgstr "마이코니드 군주가 부패를 정화하길 원해 - 그리고 네가 목록의 마지막이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1b14ca17-dbfa-4217-d590-f3a3710169cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:1b14ca17-dbfa-4217-d590-f3a3710169cb
msgctxt "hceff6217g52d2g4321g9d36g5b43cf2a5677"
msgid "It's true - you did your best."
msgstr "사실이야. 너는 최선을 다했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 1d56f43f-b700-7b4b-3e1e-63234adce09e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:1d56f43f-b700-7b4b-3e1e-63234adce09e
msgctxt "h22d1dac6gbeb3g4014gb3d7g3f1877bcb46e"
msgid "... yet the faithless yet stand. Isn't that right, Brithvar?"
msgstr "... 하지만 불신자들이 아직 서 있군. 그렇지 않나, 브리스바?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 211bd26f-344b-6b76-a2d3-683b7c293db0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:211bd26f-344b-6b76-a2d3-683b7c293db0
msgctxt "haddfc885g6712g4033g9438g24bd0ecd8e11"
msgid "Thrinn. Carve out her heart and serve it to the rothé."
msgstr "쓰린. 그녀의 심장을 도려내서 로테 먹이로 뿌려줘라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 211bd26f-344b-6b76-a2d3-683b7c293db0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:211bd26f-344b-6b76-a2d3-683b7c293db0
msgctxt "h54516e6ag80cdg4574gbf9cgf0e7626e4a1f"
msgid "Thrinn. Carve out his heart and serve it to the rothé."
msgstr "쓰린. 그의 심장을 도려내서 로테 먹이로 뿌려줘라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 211bd26f-344b-6b76-a2d3-683b7c293db0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:211bd26f-344b-6b76-a2d3-683b7c293db0
msgctxt "h8052f152ge32bg46d2g81fcg554a5092aa3f"
msgid "Thrinn. Carve out their heart and serve it to the rothé."
msgstr "쓰린. 저들의 심장을 도려내서 로테 먹이로 뿌려줘라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 21d94421-b730-1b4b-980f-f876ab315809
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:21d94421-b730-1b4b-980f-f876ab315809
msgctxt "hf886b2e5gfdc2g444ag9a9bgddf56114e71c"
msgid "You so much as touch me, and I'll tear you from limb to limb."
msgstr "날 조금이라도 건드리면, 너의 사지를 찢어버리겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 22adea50-4584-a1a2-7f12-f94ee1365ccb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ScryingEye_State_PermaDefeated = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:22adea50-4584-a1a2-7f12-f94ee1365ccb
msgctxt "ha9ff653ag35e1g4adfg807bg83420e52e7f7"
msgid ""
"*Nere sifts through your memories - and a new presence clouds your mind. The "
"duergar elder.*"
msgstr "*니어가 당신의 기억을 살핍니다. 그리고 새로운 존재가 당신의 정신을 흐립니다. 듀에르가 엘더입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 2350a669-4474-5735-b150-8f8222e4250b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_Mutineers_Quest_Accepted = True
#.      - UND_ScryingEye_State_PermaDefeated = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:2350a669-4474-5735-b150-8f8222e4250b
msgctxt "h38127332g0817g4acbg93daga2b67882b6eb"
msgid ""
"*Your scalp buzzes as Nere's mind reaches out - not to you, but to the "
"duergar elder.*"
msgstr "*니어의 정신이 당신이 아닌 듀에르가 장로에게 퍼지자, 당신의 두피가 떨립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 247c452b-c781-ca68-bec3-5be281465e0c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:247c452b-c781-ca68-bec3-5be281465e0c
msgctxt "h50a26c9eg9328g46b7g8b3agb499b17a0499"
msgid "Yet the Absolute saw fit to bless you? I don't understand..."
msgstr "그런데도 절대자께서 네게 축복을 내리셨다고? 이해할 수가 없군..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 271ad74c-4f7a-5f94-0b07-3007fe4ed4bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:271ad74c-4f7a-5f94-0b07-3007fe4ed4bd
msgctxt "hc6b50fb7g6c55g482cg8e95g31f9256c58db"
msgid "A slave uprising. They slaughtered every last one of their masters."
msgstr "노예들이 반란을 일으켰어. 그들이 자신들의 주인을 모조리 죽여버렸지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2d260025-b034-d38e-9923-349ea467b153
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:2d260025-b034-d38e-9923-349ea467b153
msgctxt "hc68ba428g24a6g4410g8335g6b5c9425a944"
msgid "Try it. I'll cut you all down."
msgstr "해 보시지. 내가 너희 모두를 베어버리겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 2dfdc3e1-7f84-477d-8a72-618feae2abef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 416cef75-7cd0-791a-e997-e5fa27120efa_MindHasBeenRead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:2dfdc3e1-7f84-477d-8a72-618feae2abef
msgctxt "h3c19e110g562eg401cga72ega419c549e18a"
msgid ""
"<i>The outsider did me a favour. The duergar were trouble from the start.</i>"
msgstr "<i>이 외부인이 내게 좋은 일을 했군. 이 듀에르가는 처음부터 골칫거리였어.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 2eeb4df2-891b-de71-5762-00d5ca0fe228
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:2eeb4df2-891b-de71-5762-00d5ca0fe228
msgctxt "hff65cfb1g798cg4e95g81c2g07162a3d76b9"
msgid "True Soul - prove your faith. <i>Strike him down.</i>"
msgstr "참된 영혼, 너의 충성심을 증명해라. <i>그를 죽이도록.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Elder Brithvar
#. NodeID = 310069ca-41dd-389f-eaac-e8ce2a63b6f8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:310069ca-41dd-389f-eaac-e8ce2a63b6f8
msgctxt "hf78f9134gbeacg4018g899ag242fa14d6986"
msgid "If it means getting paid, my blade's yours!"
msgstr "돈을 받을 수 있다는 뜻이라면, 내 검은 네 것이다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 320089d5-481f-46c4-dc88-27b24c283a0d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:320089d5-481f-46c4-dc88-27b24c283a0d
msgctxt "hd5a802a5g601bg4a62gadcdge75ee1dab9fe"
msgid "Worthless slaves. Your incompetence has been my <i>ruin.</i>"
msgstr "쓸모없는 노예 녀석들. 너희의 무능함이 내 <i>파멸</i>을 초래했다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 37e53771-5f89-d664-9c79-d63b0433535c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:37e53771-5f89-d664-9c79-d63b0433535c
msgctxt "hfe3f699eg2b31g4b8ag9792g130c31714048"
msgid "The slavers turned on each other - mutineers versus Absolute loyalists."
msgstr "노예상들 사이에 불화가 있었어, 반역자들과 절대자에게 충성을 맹세한 이들 사이에 싸움이 벌어졌지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3bebbe86-d2aa-a895-2d31-be4fe3dae4d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:3bebbe86-d2aa-a895-2d31-be4fe3dae4d2
msgctxt "h4c306caag6727g49a1ga82dg2dad771a0659"
msgid "I only see weakness in the cowardly slaver standing before me."
msgstr "내 앞에 있는 겁쟁이 노예상에게선 나약함밖에 보이지 않는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 40799a5c-e4a3-5d52-795d-eb6b7ecb0d26
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DuergarRebelGreedy_State_PermaDefeated = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:40799a5c-e4a3-5d52-795d-eb6b7ecb0d26
msgctxt "h73eb1b84gf827g4faag9754g3d194df07265"
msgid "*Your head tingles as Nere scans the room.*"
msgstr "*니어가 방을 천천히 살피자 당신의 머리가 따끔거립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 44019a0c-1a89-c6ba-87f8-e7961b5532b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:44019a0c-1a89-c6ba-87f8-e7961b5532b7
msgctxt "hb2fbb524g3cbbg4e7fg8c76g5bf7596a4c4c"
msgid ""
"Nere is not without mercy, True Soul. The rat has given you a chance to earn "
"my favour."
msgstr "니어에게 자비가 없는 건 아니다, 참된 영혼. 이 쥐새끼가 너에게 내 호의를 얻을 기회를 줬어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 44480bee-187e-e15e-34a0-4ff593aed8fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 416cef75-7cd0-791a-e997-e5fa27120efa_PlayerClaimedTrueSoul = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:44480bee-187e-e15e-34a0-4ff593aed8fc
msgctxt "h0a550c76g2ff4g4c2cga751gaa689cb6c348"
msgid "So you say. And yet the Absolute demands that I cull them."
msgstr "너는 그렇게 주장하지만 절대자께서는 저들을 도태시키라고 요구하신다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 4570317d-588b-9d74-8121-a324574afb12
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:4570317d-588b-9d74-8121-a324574afb12
msgctxt "h8307a722g0631g4bbbgb1bagb9d07ed73f6c"
msgid "A test - yes, you must be. The Absolute bade you to try Nere's faith."
msgstr "너는 시험이야 - 그래, 틀림없어. 절대자께서 너에게 니어의 신앙심을 시험하라고 명하셨겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 4611164d-99c4-f473-0c6a-afbbba35e412
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:4611164d-99c4-f473-0c6a-afbbba35e412
msgctxt "h83156127g2dcfg42a5gaa84gb28002aa7736"
msgid "Strike them down. <i>Prove your faith.</i>"
msgstr "저들을 죽여서 <i>너의 충성심을 증명해라.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 463194e7-f561-1946-d49c-1bfa4058afc5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_DuergarCamp_State_SidedDrow = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:463194e7-f561-1946-d49c-1bfa4058afc5
msgctxt "ha242fb00g51dbg4a82gbf24g3a434063b46f"
msgid "As for you, our charge is clear - there is more we must do."
msgstr "너의 경우엔, 우리 책임은 명확하다. 아직 할 일이 남았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 46966dc9-fe6b-75b3-502b-a55dc74b45b4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:46966dc9-fe6b-75b3-502b-a55dc74b45b4
msgctxt "hdf51c090gba8bg451cg821fgfebd80e4e118"
msgid "If she indeed is a True Soul, let the Absolute save her."
msgstr "만약 그녀가 정녕 참된 영혼이라면, 절대자께서 구해 주실 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 46966dc9-fe6b-75b3-502b-a55dc74b45b4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:46966dc9-fe6b-75b3-502b-a55dc74b45b4
msgctxt "h908e062agcb8bg4446ga0dbgf89501b0fa1d"
msgid "If he indeed is a True Soul, let the Absolute save him."
msgstr "만약 그가 정녕 참된 영혼이라면, 절대자께서 구해 주실 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 46966dc9-fe6b-75b3-502b-a55dc74b45b4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:46966dc9-fe6b-75b3-502b-a55dc74b45b4
msgctxt "h95b16f7eg1f65g4771gb1e4g975ede5ee401"
msgid "If they are indeed a True Soul, let the Absolute save them."
msgstr "만약 그들이 정녕 참된 영혼이라면, 절대자께서 구해 주실 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Elder Brithvar
#. NodeID = 4738e812-345f-9db8-da7a-d63e1a8bc13c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_Mutineers_Quest_Accepted = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:4738e812-345f-9db8-da7a-d63e1a8bc13c
msgctxt "hdf68f557g4f9cg4d8cg9b11ge56fdf6dc43c"
msgid ""
"You're damned right I'll have it. Me and that one, we got a deal. We beat "
"your arse and dig the dues out from your carcass."
msgstr "네 말이 맞아. 당연히 받아야지. 나랑 저놈은 거래했어. 우리는 네 엉덩이를 때리고 네 시체에서 회비를 꺼낼 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 473bd5c1-3313-f1e8-f50d-f9e40f8454d8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:473bd5c1-3313-f1e8-f50d-f9e40f8454d8
msgctxt "hd7249275gf7b0g41fega105gd9edaed747f6"
msgid "I won't do it."
msgstr "그렇겐 못 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Elder Brithvar
#. NodeID = 47e1f25f-2a58-e733-089c-613d137ebdc2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:47e1f25f-2a58-e733-089c-613d137ebdc2
msgctxt "h8b41794bg0869g4f24gbd97g041cd30af873"
msgid "Damn it. I'll rip your flesh clean off!"
msgstr "젠장. 네 살을 발라버리겠어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 49331b5e-54a8-5082-f6f1-393b83a9c44a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:49331b5e-54a8-5082-f6f1-393b83a9c44a
msgctxt "h5a674becgcc8fg4593ga4f0g0abe26852b79"
msgid "For the Absolute!"
msgstr "절대자님을 위하여!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4961830e-6392-e356-f683-7ee9475b75d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:4961830e-6392-e356-f683-7ee9475b75d7
msgctxt "h790fb302gd9a3g463cg9e23gd19a2148759b"
msgid "In your eulogy, I'm going to call you a 'Twat-Soul'."
msgstr "네 추도사에서 널 '참된 씹것'이라고 불러주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4ba8b7e3-e79b-7d7b-7051-30d865412d21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:4ba8b7e3-e79b-7d7b-7051-30d865412d21
msgctxt "h82db7b41g7075g488fg9d8eg4f3b0ec697ec"
msgid "*A fire blazes in your head, then spreads through your blood.*"
msgstr "*불꽃이 머릿속에 타오르더니, 피를 따라 흐릅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4cbacf13-1291-87a1-5e8e-f9cdee70aab1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_DuergarCamp_State_SidedLoyal = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:4cbacf13-1291-87a1-5e8e-f9cdee70aab1
msgctxt "hddf3bf43gb812g438fg8d19ga408f106ac52"
msgid "<i>Side with Nere and the Absolutists.</i>"
msgstr "<i>니어와 절대자 교단 편에 선다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 4f1847dc-fdf3-7c82-7a0d-6c2cacccf9ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:4f1847dc-fdf3-7c82-7a0d-6c2cacccf9ca
msgctxt "hf6b389f2g31bdg4561g80b1g1298e1fa27e7"
msgid "Traitor. You have breathed your last!"
msgstr "배신자. 네 숨통을 끊어주지!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 4f6ce1d1-cb19-e802-a94e-cc87166c826c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:4f6ce1d1-cb19-e802-a94e-cc87166c826c
msgctxt "he241e8c5gc24ag4cbcg8806g7b528e3bbb86"
msgid "... they've outlived their usefulness."
msgstr "... 그들은 쓸모에 비해 오래 살았다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4f6cf930-815b-3b95-93a7-444532a114ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:4f6cf930-815b-3b95-93a7-444532a114ba
msgctxt "he35f633bg65d9g4aabg82d3g090a3e9c510b"
msgid ""
"Try winning the argument by yourself, why don't you. It'll build character."
msgstr "논쟁을 알아서 이겨보는 건 어때. 그래야 성장하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Elder Brithvar
#. NodeID = 5046d189-8538-0df6-c946-8698bce3af27
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:5046d189-8538-0df6-c946-8698bce3af27
msgctxt "h3b4596a0g489eg4f24gaa43gd77f75208af6"
msgid ""
"Damn right it's time. You owe my crew a tenday's worth o' coin, Nere - and "
"the reckoning's come."
msgstr "때가 됐고말고. 너 때문에 우리 대원들이 일주일 넘게 돈을 못 받았다, 니어. 이제 빚을 갚을 때야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 520d65a8-144d-4d37-94d5-262556058f59
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:520d65a8-144d-4d37-94d5-262556058f59
msgctxt "hdcad9fdeg3437g4a8cg95b2g018fa3f01071"
msgid "Nere will <i>not</i> be refused!"
msgstr "<i>감히</i> 니어의 말을 거부하고도 무사할 것 같으냐!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Elder Brithvar
#. NodeID = 525f426a-981c-e8d9-e7f3-3622a3ea5a3c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:525f426a-981c-e8d9-e7f3-3622a3ea5a3c
msgctxt "h1e2de3c8gd0deg492bga980g5a6aeae1cb02"
msgid "Damn right I'll have it - straight off your rotted corpse."
msgstr "가져가고말고, 바로 네 썩은 시체에서 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5652fe79-b6bf-a162-d2e4-e18bd063ff56
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:5652fe79-b6bf-a162-d2e4-e18bd063ff56
msgctxt "h4abcdd05gbc6fg4348ga97agf91b68d079ec"
msgid "You wouldn't dare. I'm faithful to the Absolute."
msgstr "감히 그럴 순 없을 걸. 나는 절대자님께 충성한다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 57de1002-f7de-1389-06dc-138577ea5317
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_DuergarCamp_State_SidedLoyal = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:57de1002-f7de-1389-06dc-138577ea5317
msgctxt "hc70c8731gf2f6g4170gbcb5g5337516c88ec"
msgid "<i>Attack Brithvar and the duergar rebels.</i>"
msgstr "<i>브리스바와 듀에르가 반란군을 공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5875b4fd-10d3-e23a-469b-39e929353e76
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_MyconidRevenge_State_SentKillNere = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 416cef75-7cd0-791a-e997-e5fa27120efa_MentionedHead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:5875b4fd-10d3-e23a-469b-39e929353e76
msgctxt "hb7e52df6g749ag4465gb497gc6a797ffe075"
msgid "I don't care about your squabble. I just want Nere's head."
msgstr "너희 다툼에는 관심 없어. 그저 니어의 목을 원할 뿐이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5d2cf125-aee4-db4b-ca1e-e6851f4a087e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_DuergarCamp_State_SidedMutineers = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:5d2cf125-aee4-db4b-ca1e-e6851f4a087e
msgctxt "h3803c8eega011g4a02gb73dgf6156e5b1120"
msgid "<i>Do nothing.</i>"
msgstr "<i>아무것도 하지 않는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5d59e544-2922-beb1-5f31-1cbfedcc5aba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_DuergarCamp_State_SidedMutineers = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:5d59e544-2922-beb1-5f31-1cbfedcc5aba
msgctxt "h790f462cgabd7g4d69gbaa1gedac152ffd02"
msgid "<i>Side with the duergar mercenaries.</i>"
msgstr "<i>듀에르가 용병 편에 선다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 60101b4e-9d10-40ca-a280-820b9e690c6d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 0
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 416cef75-7cd0-791a-e997-e5fa27120efa_MindHasBeenRead = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CanDetectThoughts_4 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:60101b4e-9d10-40ca-a280-820b9e690c6d
msgctxt "hb23c8afdge37bg4b56g80cegd53350d79374"
msgid "<i>Cast Detect Thoughts.</i>"
msgstr "<i>생각 탐지를 시전한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 60984a5a-7842-3922-747e-83c1698d3956
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ScryingEye_State_PermaDefeated = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:60984a5a-7842-3922-747e-83c1698d3956
msgctxt "h7339fdf8g215cg475bga6bfga38580a574a6"
msgid "Brithvar. Did you think you could keep your plot a secret?"
msgstr "브리스바. 네 음모를 계속 비밀로 지킬 수 있을 것이라 생각했나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63077041-0cc9-19c5-3963-2909fa0813bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_DuergarCamp_State_SidedMutineers = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:63077041-0cc9-19c5-3963-2909fa0813bb
msgctxt "h0c6ad2bfg3a25g4045g8d11g01323feb74d7"
msgid "<i>Attack Nere.</i>"
msgstr "<i>니어를 공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 6714edbf-1aaf-ec26-68bc-cb7356145f32
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:6714edbf-1aaf-ec26-68bc-cb7356145f32
msgctxt "h73980df0g09e2g4c3ag81daga5525125f765"
msgid "Nere pities you, Thrinn. Your errors and excuses. And your sorry end."
msgstr "니어는 너를 애처롭게 여긴다, 쓰린. 네 수많은 실수와 변명, 그리고 하찮은 최후를."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 67d769ec-39ba-4b57-e692-cefb3b03cba5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:67d769ec-39ba-4b57-e692-cefb3b03cba5
msgctxt "h2c741c4fg4b11g45bag96d1gbe2c275f4a74"
msgid "I killed your friends - and you're next."
msgstr "네 친구들은 내가 죽였다. 그리고 이젠 네 차례야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6966a543-7cd4-9988-9e91-5d657fb97b85
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:6966a543-7cd4-9988-9e91-5d657fb97b85
msgctxt "hcdde1beag612fg419eg92f4g92a706212200"
msgid "I act on orders of the Absolute."
msgstr "나는 절대자님의 명에 따라 행동한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6995b1ba-646f-fde2-d09b-80110cdc35ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:6995b1ba-646f-fde2-d09b-80110cdc35ab
msgctxt "h5824255eg9720g4b05g951fgb9c41026885f"
msgid "This isn't about them. I just can't stand your face."
msgstr "저들 때문이 아니야. 그냥 네 면상만 보면 화가 치밀어서 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6b917a4a-6307-fa8f-377a-814c6f98d687
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:6b917a4a-6307-fa8f-377a-814c6f98d687
msgctxt "h80c08fceg32f4g4cbfgb166g4be7fee77341"
msgid "You would question me, drow? I should slit your throat for it."
msgstr "내게 의문을 품는 건가, 드로우? 목이 아깝지 않나 보군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 70893292-6a4e-f3aa-aa6c-f4ca89d23e89
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:70893292-6a4e-f3aa-aa6c-f4ca89d23e89
msgctxt "h83091022g033ag466cg8ac8g9722a639ace8"
msgid "Worthless, every last one. Their failures must be punished."
msgstr "하나같이 쓸모없기 그지없군. 이들의 실패에는 처벌이 따라야 한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 74c26e1b-3819-5051-d096-0c91f40897fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:74c26e1b-3819-5051-d096-0c91f40897fb
msgctxt "h08759aedgc6b9g497bg8508g053bf6c9a58b"
msgid "Drop the blade, duergar. You shall have your coin."
msgstr "칼을 버려라, 듀에르가. 너는 동전을 받을 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 75395c09-100e-220b-d2f8-9d870c3a8055
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_TheDrowNere_State_KilledGnomeSerene = True
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny_InclusionStart_GnomeSilly(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:75395c09-100e-220b-d2f8-9d870c3a8055
msgctxt "hd153df85g76dcg45b2g86c9g457bc6691381"
msgid "Nere. Does. Not. Fail."
msgstr "니어는. 실패하지. 않는다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 7775c6d1-55c9-9b00-8340-39ad79d0efa0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny_InclusionEnd_GnomeSilly(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:7775c6d1-55c9-9b00-8340-39ad79d0efa0
msgctxt "hf3e385c0g6ba4g4caeg8d29gcf3b94ec34d3"
msgid "As you say. <i>Ghil lu'nin!</i>"
msgstr "네 말대로. <i>질 루닌!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 79e7b3f7-cf5c-bd26-215c-e73bce68fa31
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:79e7b3f7-cf5c-bd26-215c-e73bce68fa31
msgctxt "h07074c4dg25b5g4c50g89d7g173fc392318f"
msgid "You heed an overgrown toadstool, yet defy a True Soul?"
msgstr "마구 자란 독버섯의 말을 들으면서, 참된 영혼을 거스른단 말인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 7cc4e378-b79c-76bb-51c5-645f3ddc16ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ScryingEye_State_PermaDefeated = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:7cc4e378-b79c-76bb-51c5-645f3ddc16ae
msgctxt "hf16c3737g33b2g427fg8afdgd9ab46133703"
msgid "Direct your blade at the heretic, duergar. You shall have your coin."
msgstr "이단자에게 칼을 겨누어라, 듀에르가. 너는 동전을 받을 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7cc7dfc8-8381-1588-e56d-d4ab87adc033
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DWARF(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:7cc7dfc8-8381-1588-e56d-d4ab87adc033
msgctxt "h27d44fb1gf05ag41cag9b22ge47d2b4025be"
msgid ""
"Says the idiot who got himself buried. Look at the stone - it was <i>clearly "
"</i>a trap."
msgstr "스스로 돌에 파묻힌 멍청이가 할 말인가. 이 돌을 봐. <i>딱 봐도</i> 함정이잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7d3d69d1-f389-4a69-5a2c-09009ddc66ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:7d3d69d1-f389-4a69-5a2c-09009ddc66ca
msgctxt "he25242a5g934cg4abag84fagfcee6b4fd9b3"
msgid "Your god. My oath. Let us see which prevails."
msgstr "너의 신과 내 맹세 중 누가 이길지 보자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 803f2354-4e48-aaa5-e225-0784da3970b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:803f2354-4e48-aaa5-e225-0784da3970b2
msgctxt "hb00b0455g19e7g4412gbba5gf77d2e683955"
msgid "*Your skull buzzes, and you see your own face through Nere's eyes.*"
msgstr "*머릿속이 울리며, 니어의 눈을 통해 당신의 얼굴이 보입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Elder Brithvar
#. NodeID = 810417f2-4dbc-5ac8-8606-dc955fe5f36a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:810417f2-4dbc-5ac8-8606-dc955fe5f36a
msgctxt "h71b53ac2geb8cg4edag8b4dgc02f5551a9e3"
msgid ""
"You been a shit since I laid eyes on you, red-eye. Go on, try and gut me. I "
"ain't going down easy."
msgstr "넌 처음 봤을 때부터 줄곧 똥덩어리였어, 이 빨간 눈아. 자, 이 내장을 꺼내봐라. 나는 쉽게 쓰러지지 않는다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 8258198a-ab17-d2ff-9a19-5489e93a61f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:8258198a-ab17-d2ff-9a19-5489e93a61f7
msgctxt "heac04477gb63ag4e45gad53g585f6108f73c"
msgid "Insufferable, insolent, scum. I'm going to enjoy this."
msgstr "참을 수 없이, 건방진, 쓰레기 자식. 내 이 일을 즐겨주마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 83ebe8f0-999e-e65b-d8e8-0248a4f1e987
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:83ebe8f0-999e-e65b-d8e8-0248a4f1e987
msgctxt "ha0c1f883g7bc4g4726ga042g4b20abdb2933"
msgid "Fool. Your silence speaks to your heresy. For the Absolute!"
msgstr "멍청한 것. 너의 침묵이 네가 이단자임을 증명하는구나. 절대자님을 위하여!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 887a4a34-db7b-f699-3e14-cedd9e66c5be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_DuergarCamp_State_SidedDrow = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:887a4a34-db7b-f699-3e14-cedd9e66c5be
msgctxt "h3e66f54fgaa98g4c9cg98f7g3433f75a06ce"
msgid ""
"Show them no mercy. Their corpses will make a fine offering to our mistress!"
msgstr "놈들에게 자비를 보이지 마라. 그들의 시체는 우리 여신님을 위한 좋은 공물이 될 테니!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 8a8ff799-f0fd-4fc4-bd1b-0cdce16b65f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:8a8ff799-f0fd-4fc4-bd1b-0cdce16b65f5
msgctxt "h35690266g8fdfg45eegb511g0d14f83fda6d"
msgid "An efficient solution. Sensible, even."
msgstr "효율적인 해결책이군. 합리적이기까지 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 8ba06cb0-f27e-5cd2-957c-8c239c61efab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_TheDrowNere_State_GnomesExecuted = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:8ba06cb0-f27e-5cd2-957c-8c239c61efab
msgctxt "h11a7ca3ag38deg4d94g9a18g2cbb4c293335"
msgid "Vermin to the last. I might have guessed."
msgstr "끝까지 해충이로군. 예상한 대로야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Lunkbug
#. NodeID = 8c8e0086-a429-0aa6-5148-111ecc5ebbf2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:8c8e0086-a429-0aa6-5148-111ecc5ebbf2
msgctxt "h9bffb2e8g177fg49e6g9779g2c80eaeda9d8"
msgid "Beldron. No!"
msgstr "벨드론. 안 돼!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Elder Brithvar
#. NodeID = 8d3b32ef-be6a-13b5-69a1-91c5b2b3e8de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DuergarRebelGreedy_State_PermaDefeated = False
#.      - UND_ScryingEye_State_PermaDefeated = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:8d3b32ef-be6a-13b5-69a1-91c5b2b3e8de
msgctxt "h482c4914g9488g492dgac76gd053bd10105c"
msgid ""
"Shut your shitholes, both of yeh. You owe my crew a tenday's worth o' coin, "
"Nere - and it's time you shell out."
msgstr "너네 둘 다 주둥이 닥쳐! 넌 내 부하들에게 십일 치 동전을 빚졌어, 니어. 이제 뱉어낼 시간이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Elder Brithvar
#. NodeID = 8e3ddb84-794f-af27-1c1b-1683184de28d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:8e3ddb84-794f-af27-1c1b-1683184de28d
msgctxt "hb18ae777g4f6eg48a9gaba1gefcf9cb00df1"
msgid "Hells..."
msgstr "젠장..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 8e7fe865-3c15-a61b-7df7-1839b3184245
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:8e7fe865-3c15-a61b-7df7-1839b3184245
msgctxt "hfe7da487g2534g4186g9207ga6e2ca830995"
msgid ""
"Ah - I see treachery at every turn. Not every duergar proves faithful to the "
"Absolute."
msgstr "아, 사방에서 배신이 도사리고 있군. 모든 듀에르가가 절대자께 충성심을 보이진 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 90f0101e-7682-4c2f-3f85-4ae0c3118341
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:90f0101e-7682-4c2f-3f85-4ae0c3118341
msgctxt "h8df5bd2dgac39g4724g99cegedeb63c22ed3"
msgid ""
"Nere is not without mercy, True Soul. These overgrown rats have given you a "
"chance to earn my favour."
msgstr "니어에게 자비가 없는 건 아니다, 참된 영혼. 이 배가 불룩해진 쥐새끼들이 너에게 내 호의를 얻을 기회를 줬어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = 930dd161-4d2f-cb6e-cf5a-45d2197a2a4a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:930dd161-4d2f-cb6e-cf5a-45d2197a2a4a
msgctxt "h80e8c2a8gde83g4310g9d15gb75105931f8b"
msgid "Useless!"
msgstr "쓸모없는 놈!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9603c4cc-cb0f-fd05-3cc2-b8e097602b12
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DuergarRebelGreedy_State_PermaDefeated = False
#.      - UND_Mutineers_Quest_Accepted = True
#.      - UND_ScryingEye_State_PermaDefeated = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:9603c4cc-cb0f-fd05-3cc2-b8e097602b12
msgctxt "hb2ecf743gb742g4a45gb965gf53b4c3c5c85"
msgid ""
"*The elder's disgust grips your head like a vice - yet he remains silent.*"
msgstr "*엘더의 역겨운 손아귀가 당신의 머리를 꽉 쥐지만, 여전히 침묵을 유지합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 97d23384-7ca6-3298-a095-60b4849f8edc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:97d23384-7ca6-3298-a095-60b4849f8edc
msgctxt "h1768e87bge5a7g4e68g8e31g7a0d7672a6cc"
msgid "You were lazy, Thrinn. Without me, Nere would be dead."
msgstr "너는 게을렀어, 쓰린. 내가 없었으면, 니어는 죽었을걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 9944e8d8-619b-7f51-1f6b-7ae2401b9693
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:9944e8d8-619b-7f51-1f6b-7ae2401b9693
msgctxt "h7dc70253gb391g4702gbe74gd830c6a0d0ef"
msgid "Fool. Did you think I wouldn't notice your intrusion?"
msgstr "멍청하긴. 내가 네 침입을 눈치채지 못할 거라고 생각했나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = 9b5a27b0-2a97-b8a6-17c9-482be1880c35
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:9b5a27b0-2a97-b8a6-17c9-482be1880c35
msgctxt "h041387c0g4a32g4ee3ga5d1gbba48955425e"
msgid "You're clearly a fool. Yet you saw fit to aid me?"
msgstr "넌 확실히 멍청하군. 그런데 네가 날 도울 자격이 있을 거라고 생각했나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9ffa48fd-1b53-ccae-c395-98d4284eb75d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:9ffa48fd-1b53-ccae-c395-98d4284eb75d
msgctxt "h091c64e7gfa85g4f8egaa05g70ad03f4224d"
msgid "If you insist."
msgstr "네가 그렇게 원한다면."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = a09700ce-c3a8-a862-2516-25b3ba838812
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:a09700ce-c3a8-a862-2516-25b3ba838812
msgctxt "h5884fcaag73d5g4691ga486g05dc5034811c"
msgid "You care for the weak, True Soul. Most <i>curious.</i>"
msgstr "너는 약자를 신경 쓰는구나, 참된 영혼. <i>아주 흥미로워.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = a1d5f382-2a7e-65d4-eb6a-59d88d259e16
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:a1d5f382-2a7e-65d4-eb6a-59d88d259e16
msgctxt "h0d6e209cgad94g4ec5g888egb717b86aa668"
msgid "And yet you came to my aid."
msgstr "그런데도 나를 도와준 건가."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = a2cf52fa-e2ea-a92b-8a14-da64eb05f7e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:a2cf52fa-e2ea-a92b-8a14-da64eb05f7e3
msgctxt "hb0532e16ge72eg4722gae44g60bfff3390ae"
msgid "Heathen. You shame the Absolute!"
msgstr "이단. 네가 절대자님을 더럽히는구나!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a5028677-6eea-2b48-94c9-706042e434ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_DuergarCamp_State_GnomesHostile = True
#.     - UND_DuergarCamp_State_SidedLoyal = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:a5028677-6eea-2b48-94c9-706042e434ca
msgctxt "h49283a36g0158g4c19g9c85gc64f8633714c"
msgid "<i>Attack the deep gnomes.</i>"
msgstr "<i>딥 노움들을 공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a5290208-ca21-e6eb-ad77-f8c4d813b2aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:a5290208-ca21-e6eb-ad77-f8c4d813b2aa
msgctxt "hac1fd29bg056eg478dg8790g7975696984d4"
msgid "Touch another innocent and I'll take your head, Nere."
msgstr "한 번만 더 무고한 자들을 건드렸다간 네놈의 목이 날아갈 거다, 니어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a6a77754-9a2e-c15d-36a3-e6cc0e8f4345
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:a6a77754-9a2e-c15d-36a3-e6cc0e8f4345
msgctxt "h0f5c3373gcb2eg4eceg80a4ga4376116e948"
msgid "I'm not here to judge."
msgstr "난 판단하러 온 게 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = a7f462b7-30ae-96bd-9b39-1f4f43c24b32
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:a7f462b7-30ae-96bd-9b39-1f4f43c24b32
msgctxt "h0082143bg0103g4909g9682gbac41ba8c28a"
msgid "Strike him down. <i>Prove your faith.</i>"
msgstr "놈을 공격해라. <i>충성심을 증명해라.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a82d05c7-1afd-0747-1731-5f5f12c19243
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_DuergarCamp_State_SidedLoyal = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:a82d05c7-1afd-0747-1731-5f5f12c19243
msgctxt "hb72ad6ebge0bdg40f5ga397ge01294f06e50"
msgid "<i>Side with Nere.</i>"
msgstr "<i>니어의 편에 선다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Elder Brithvar
#. NodeID = a95794f7-0c2e-4d0a-e87e-9929241dea5f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:a95794f7-0c2e-4d0a-e87e-9929241dea5f
msgctxt "h71014c2egbf7bg433egbe44g03b9c7e5fc87"
msgid "Shit."
msgstr "씨발."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = a960e02c-6a8b-ba0d-2083-d8eeaab3d4a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:a960e02c-6a8b-ba0d-2083-d8eeaab3d4a0
msgctxt "h7681ab15gfc83g49d1g9bf7gbe180d022ca4"
msgid "The Absolute guides my hand. You've chosen a battle you cannot win."
msgstr "절대자께서 날 인도하신다. 넌 이길 수 없는 싸움을 선택한 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a98cd0b5-5665-dbb9-560b-cb50ac4828aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:a98cd0b5-5665-dbb9-560b-cb50ac4828aa
msgctxt "h5ba777d9g3369g4ed5g9246g24ad96a4c195"
msgid ""
"You were left helpless by some rubble. You're hardly in a position to call "
"anyone weak."
msgstr "넌 돌무더기에 갇혀 도움을 청하고 있었잖아. 누군가를 약하다고 부를 입장은 아닌 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = abb1dec0-6b73-b6e4-a680-a6bf92accf04
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:abb1dec0-6b73-b6e4-a680-a6bf92accf04
msgctxt "h6bfe3139g701eg45b3gb781g7473ed9ab9a7"
msgid "<i>My</i> head? I walk among <i>traitors.</i>"
msgstr "<i>내</i> 머리? 사방에 온통 <i>배신자들이군.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = ac093fd7-63da-b490-8cb6-04e6a568694d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:ac093fd7-63da-b490-8cb6-04e6a568694d
msgctxt "h77ea40ffg2bcfg4bb2g81c1g9dc133f54ea1"
msgid ""
"The Absolute demands their slaughter. Yet here you stand, in bold defiance."
msgstr "절대자께서 그들을 학살하길 원하신다. 하지만 네놈은 여기 서서 저항하고 있군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = ac9c997d-23ff-440b-3062-baa04572b552
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:ac9c997d-23ff-440b-3062-baa04572b552
msgctxt "hc845cb8bg621dg434fg80aagcfc8fa33eab9"
msgid "No - no! I did everything right!"
msgstr "아냐 - 아냐! 나는 모든 일을 제대로 했다고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ad36e845-26bf-6445-3c5a-64eea25be527
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:ad36e845-26bf-6445-3c5a-64eea25be527
msgctxt "h394185b6ga4c7g46fcg9a57g2e5daf43a0c8"
msgid "<i>Say nothing.</i>"
msgstr "<i>아무 말도 하지 않는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = b32e46b5-ada0-a230-151c-7c31eb45a616
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 416cef75-7cd0-791a-e997-e5fa27120efa_MentionedHead = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:b32e46b5-ada0-a230-151c-7c31eb45a616
msgctxt "ha67c8d8fg5f56g4c2fg996dgd75ea49f33c2"
msgid "As for you, True Soul..."
msgstr "네 경우에는, 참된 영혼..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = b3396a07-49de-a580-db09-d6bc8c5ba726
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DuergarSergeant_State_PermaDefeated = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:b3396a07-49de-a580-db09-d6bc8c5ba726
msgctxt "hfc86e962ge8aag461bgaf25gb27b540c954b"
msgid "I will tear out your heart and feed it to the rats."
msgstr "네 심장을 뽑아내 쥐새끼에게 먹이로 던져 주마."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b3922633-bf4c-9329-497d-79f1d3d1ae12
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DuergarRebelGreedy_State_PermaDefeated = False
#.      - UND_Mutineers_Quest_Accepted = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 416cef75-7cd0-791a-e997-e5fa27120efa_CuedBrithvar = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:b3922633-bf4c-9329-497d-79f1d3d1ae12
msgctxt "h85624deegbf42g4e25ga08cg98721f9f1eb4"
msgid "That's your cue, Brithvar. It's time you got paid."
msgstr "네 차례가 왔어, 브리스바. 이제 빚을 받을 시간이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = b3c89650-844a-04a4-49c9-ed565d00ee67
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DuergarSergeant_State_PermaDefeated = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:b3c89650-844a-04a4-49c9-ed565d00ee67
msgctxt "h88fe525egecbbg48d3gbb83g0c6522a9d932"
msgid ""
"Thrinn. The Absolute gave you <i>everything</i>. And this fiasco is how you "
"reward Her?"
msgstr "쓰린. 절대자께서 네게 <i>모든 것을</i> 하사하셨다. 그런데 감히 이런 식으로 되갚아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = b905c166-d752-f4b9-2802-f7791e56e84e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:b905c166-d752-f4b9-2802-f7791e56e84e
msgctxt "hbbacc499g3a6ag499ega1bdgc0bace7c7aea"
msgid "But you are a traitor. And I will have your head!"
msgstr "하지만 너는 배신자다. 네 목을 잘라내겠어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b968a247-2048-0d21-e259-44633a3f4373
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_DuergarCamp_State_SidedMutineers = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:b968a247-2048-0d21-e259-44633a3f4373
msgctxt "hda27c257g9e4fg45dcgb77ag2de0723c8449"
msgid "<i>Do nothing.</i>"
msgstr "<i>아무것도 하지 않는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = be1f6d17-a98f-a6f8-7b2c-5ccbf283fd79
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:be1f6d17-a98f-a6f8-7b2c-5ccbf283fd79
msgctxt "hfa990fe8ge930g4e40ga782ga01d7b915bd7"
msgid "Vermin. As feral as they are useless."
msgstr "해충. 쓸모 없는 만큼 야성만 넘치는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c2de426b-ec71-a944-8755-6acd9b0d90c1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:c2de426b-ec71-a944-8755-6acd9b0d90c1
msgctxt "h004aa83dg08c6g45a1gbe4cg0df4d7460a0b"
msgid "You're the only one suffering today, Nere."
msgstr "오늘 고통 받을 사람은 너뿐이다, 니어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c4a2f457-9b57-e526-9854-379e58516f8c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC_EVIL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:c4a2f457-9b57-e526-9854-379e58516f8c
msgctxt "hd531df44g39d9g4baega62cg6afda8a74f5e"
msgid "I'll offer up your guts, ingrates."
msgstr "네 내장을 제물로 바치겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = c871eacc-edc1-c5ff-f490-dc7cf5b54561
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:c871eacc-edc1-c5ff-f490-dc7cf5b54561
msgctxt "hac9a0387g4100g4daaga4e8g5d7fd374e843"
msgid ""
"Ah - another treacherous soul walks among us. Isn't that right, Brithvar?"
msgstr "아, 또 다른 배신자가 우리 곁에 있군. 그렇지 않나, 브리스바?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = c9b3c717-1e18-b5b5-f2f1-7437875adbda
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:c9b3c717-1e18-b5b5-f2f1-7437875adbda
msgctxt "hff3a4412g4ff0g42c1g950fg4f25a1abb992"
msgid "I don't know what you are, that you can defy the Absolute's will."
msgstr "네가 뭐라고 생각하길래 절대자님의 뜻을 거스를 수 있을 거라 생각하는지 모르겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = cccdc2a4-9f11-585b-87e0-fb9c7d25e336
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:cccdc2a4-9f11-585b-87e0-fb9c7d25e336
msgctxt "h4a2579dbg35f9g4d82ga035g6016aa997c28"
msgid "<i>Finally.</i>"
msgstr "<i>마침내.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = ce850a0b-b6b9-4ab7-b195-ed92fc2552a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - TemporaryHostilityAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:ce850a0b-b6b9-4ab7-b195-ed92fc2552a7
msgctxt "h2e49ce64g8068g4e5eg84e8g3d8083b8f96f"
msgid "You are a liar - and a fool. Nere suffers neither!"
msgstr "넌 배신자인데다 멍청하기까지 하군. 니어는 그 둘 모두를 견딜 수 없다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Sergeant Thrinn
#. NodeID = cee27831-f864-ca0e-df8a-bf0de14a5e64
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:cee27831-f864-ca0e-df8a-bf0de14a5e64
msgctxt "he2c71007g7911g47a9g80d8g203545a9ffd2"
msgid ""
"Me and mine worked flat out. I was cracking the whip day and night! Tell "
"him, True Soul!"
msgstr "저와 제 노예들은 정말 열심히 일했습니다. 저는 밤낮으로 채찍을 휘둘렀습니다! 그에게 말해 줘, 참된 영혼!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d03538db-8026-0502-1ea0-9f0abc293708
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:d03538db-8026-0502-1ea0-9f0abc293708
msgctxt "h35ddbea7gb517g48bbgb68dg71e13a2e6124"
msgid "Hmm? What? Sorry, I wasn't paying attention."
msgstr "흐음? 뭐라고? 미안해, 전혀 듣고 있지 않았거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = d05ecd80-dde2-152a-de31-d5db18a903f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DuergarRebelGreedy_State_PermaDefeated = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_DuergarCamp_State_SidedNone = True
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:d05ecd80-dde2-152a-de31-d5db18a903f7
msgctxt "hb1e12ac8g411ag4f80g8726gaab23c41f6cd"
msgid ""
"Duergar - this True Soul has betrayed us. Let his blood prove your devotion!"
msgstr "듀에르가, 이 참된 영혼이 우리를 배신했다. 그의 피를 흘려 네 헌신을 증명해라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = d05ecd80-dde2-152a-de31-d5db18a903f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DuergarRebelGreedy_State_PermaDefeated = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_DuergarCamp_State_SidedNone = True
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:d05ecd80-dde2-152a-de31-d5db18a903f7
msgctxt "ha35c3a51gabadg48f1gb235g28618b13a8b8"
msgid ""
"Duergar - this True Soul has betrayed us. Let her blood prove your devotion!"
msgstr "듀에르가, 이 참된 영혼이 우리를 배신했다. 그녀의 피를 흘려 네 헌신을 증명해라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = d05ecd80-dde2-152a-de31-d5db18a903f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DuergarRebelGreedy_State_PermaDefeated = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_DuergarCamp_State_SidedNone = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:d05ecd80-dde2-152a-de31-d5db18a903f7
msgctxt "h20504ff9g3e29g44f5gb14dgb72b23406c5f"
msgid ""
"Duergar - this True Soul has betrayed us. Let their blood prove your "
"devotion!"
msgstr "듀에르가, 이 참된 영혼이 우리를 배신했다. 그들의 피를 흘려 네 헌신을 증명해라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d39b331f-5d04-606a-8b66-9a2578e64fe4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:d39b331f-5d04-606a-8b66-9a2578e64fe4
msgctxt "h48331599gc3afg40c6gb6b3g87b29c0d0608"
msgid "<i>Plant a thought in Nere's mind. 'The gnomes must be set free.'</i>"
msgstr "<i>니어의 정신에 생각을 심는다. '노움들을 풀어줘야 한다.'</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d3a648fb-88d5-c9e2-b3f4-0af47977d4df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:d3a648fb-88d5-c9e2-b3f4-0af47977d4df
msgctxt "hb6f9d159g3b08g4d86g8b31g869b7507de82"
msgid "Stop! No more innocents will die today, Nere."
msgstr "그만! 더 이상 무고한 자들을 학살하도록 내버려 두지 않겠다, 니어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = d52d778a-c88a-4b06-fcf4-95c30c97aebe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:d52d778a-c88a-4b06-fcf4-95c30c97aebe
msgctxt "ha5de6121ga8c6g4677gb565g67595c03b27b"
msgid "Cut down the duergar - every last one. The Absolute commands it!"
msgstr "듀에르가들을 한 놈도 빼놓지 말고 모조리 쓸어버려라. 절대자님의 명령이니!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d5dba458-5bf0-4e6c-e2af-436e4159e563
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:d5dba458-5bf0-4e6c-e2af-436e4159e563
msgctxt "h86b598fbgd8c3g46e4ga726g33c555ff2618"
msgid "<i>Say nothing.</i>"
msgstr "<i>아무 말도 하지 않는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d90e9db0-5eda-2a34-a22e-c8e4bf679d4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DuergarRebelGreedy_State_PermaDefeated = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:d90e9db0-5eda-2a34-a22e-c8e4bf679d4f
msgctxt "h6b7d6f90gcd91g4615gbcf2g7bfff44322a0"
msgid ""
"*Your scalp buzzes as Nere's mind reaches out - not to you, but to the "
"nearby duergar.*"
msgstr "*니어의 정신이 당신이 아닌, 가까이 있는 듀에르가에게 퍼지자, 당신의 두피가 떨립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = db13143b-c92c-50cf-219c-7c3937d1f65d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:db13143b-c92c-50cf-219c-7c3937d1f65d
msgctxt "h713456dag645dg44b5g88a2gd416cdafee91"
msgid ""
"True Soul. Was it your hand that slayed Thrinn? No, of course not. There "
"must be a <i>sane</i> explanation."
msgstr "참된 영혼이여. 네 손으로 쓰린을 죽인 건가? 물론 아니겠지. 분명 <i>합당한</i> 설명이 있을 것이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = db5bf718-cea1-bf0c-4efc-7bef8737e9fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_TheDrowNere_State_GnomesExecuted = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:db5bf718-cea1-bf0c-4efc-7bef8737e9fd
msgctxt "h2e5ebb90gef4fg4f75g810cg41a95f15d19b"
msgid "As for these vermin..."
msgstr "이 해충들은..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = deafa58b-3df6-2f49-b21a-7cdf88965c32
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:deafa58b-3df6-2f49-b21a-7cdf88965c32
msgctxt "hb837a000g0610g490agbb95g74ef2fc5eb3a"
msgid "... yes. It will be so."
msgstr "... 그래. 그거면 되겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e22e7c63-074f-094e-e053-a71ce7d8a08d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:e22e7c63-074f-094e-e053-a71ce7d8a08d
msgctxt "h068fe286ga965g45dega8acge679cdf9bdd9"
msgid "My cares are none of your concern."
msgstr "내 걱정은 네가 상관할 바가 아니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = e2fe2fd3-593c-ac86-4535-0c06f53eb3c7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:e2fe2fd3-593c-ac86-4535-0c06f53eb3c7
msgctxt "h4f31c079gbac6g4118g8c7fg492300470389"
msgid ""
"Tensions were high - I am hardly surprised. The novices were lost without me "
"to guide them."
msgstr "이미 갈등이 깊었지, 놀랍진 않군. 수련사들은 내 지도 없이 길을 잃었으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e30d8d1b-a512-852a-87a4-3b966061f6f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:e30d8d1b-a512-852a-87a4-3b966061f6f5
msgctxt "h514aefcdg3a05g4c98gb316gb7de3d6c5ace"
msgid "The only head I mean to take is yours, Nere."
msgstr "내가 가져갈 머리는 네 것뿐이다, 니어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e55b3f9b-c1b7-6575-2269-46f027a0eb0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:e55b3f9b-c1b7-6575-2269-46f027a0eb0a
msgctxt "h9a1418c5gc3ccg4bc3gaa86gae1d308fbbfd"
msgid "And you waste your time persecuting them. That is <i>true </i>weakness."
msgstr "그리고 넌 그들을 박해하는 데 시간을 허비하는군. 그거야말로 <i>진정한 </i>나약함이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = e6c96efb-6468-1271-b419-16ffa0b9d620
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_State_LeaderFreedGnomes = True
#.   Quest:
#.     - UND_GnomeRescue.DealtWithSlavers(1) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:e6c96efb-6468-1271-b419-16ffa0b9d620
msgctxt "h4e0109dcg6a6eg446aga60cgb41e3b128afe"
msgid ""
"Gnomes, you are slaves no longer. The Absolute may have use for you yet."
msgstr "노움들이여, 너희는 이제 노예가 아니다. 절대자께서 너희를 쓰실 곳이 아직 남았나 보구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = e75be669-b1e8-6e83-989c-d20818446252
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:e75be669-b1e8-6e83-989c-d20818446252
msgctxt "h123fed52g0440g43f8g9e40gaccad87c0a38"
msgid "You are a traitor."
msgstr "넌 배신자야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = e835dfba-bf28-bfcc-e2d8-0d185355827f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:e835dfba-bf28-bfcc-e2d8-0d185355827f
msgctxt "h8e9cc613g046eg4c10ga959gf59193f024d5"
msgid ""
"You've a chance yet to prove your faith. Kill the slaves. Let Nere see them "
"suffer."
msgstr "아직 너의 충성심을 증명할 기회는 남아있다. 노예들을 죽여라. 니어에게 그들이 고통받는 것을 보여줘라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e9166847-57c6-5f0e-3614-d4437dc55ed2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:e9166847-57c6-5f0e-3614-d4437dc55ed2
msgctxt "h3218a155gacbbg4c7eg8108gb74dc6a23517"
msgid "Your incompetence speaks for itself, duergar."
msgstr "네 무능은 단번에 알아보겠군, 듀에르가."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = e953df48-a9ce-b7a2-6982-af4d5a0a4522
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - TemporaryHostilityAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:e953df48-a9ce-b7a2-6982-af4d5a0a4522
msgctxt "hc09f0569g3049g431eg9320ge8633c2463c1"
msgid "<i>Nere is your death. </i>The Absolute wills it!"
msgstr "<i>니어가 네 죽음이다. </i>그것이 절대자님의 의지다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eaebb22d-2f37-5cc7-a35a-d7b59f4d8047
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:eaebb22d-2f37-5cc7-a35a-d7b59f4d8047
msgctxt "hd30380b4g948bg48aegb2d7gaa60122ae319"
msgid "You were needlessly cruel, Thrinn. You must pay the price."
msgstr "넌 쓸데없이 잔혹했다, 쓰린. 그 대가를 치러야겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = f051a5e3-6afb-fa98-1f51-915beb4b3ae0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DuergarLoyal_State_PermaDefeated = True
#.      - UND_DuergarMutineers_State_PermaDefeated = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:f051a5e3-6afb-fa98-1f51-915beb4b3ae0
msgctxt "hce9768c3g2e59g4c7bg8886g2f36a185ca60"
msgid "What is this, then? The Absolute's servants. Dead..."
msgstr "그렇다면 이건 뭐지? 절대자의 종복. 죽은..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = f2a979ea-5e92-2165-436f-3961e470d60a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:f2a979ea-5e92-2165-436f-3961e470d60a
msgctxt "hb3043393ge676g4507g8ce3g294099c81ab4"
msgid "Your <i>best </i>was not good <i>enough</i>."
msgstr "너의 <i>최선</i>으로는 <i>부족했다</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = f5642952-d5a1-0004-fcde-0c29ebe5c3d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:f5642952-d5a1-0004-fcde-0c29ebe5c3d3
msgctxt "h37e2c749gae5ag402bg94d3g6eabef1c797a"
msgid "Ah, so you didn't come to my aid. You came to <i>theirs.</i>"
msgstr "아, 그럼 넌 날 도우러 온 것이 아니군. <i>저들을</i> 위해 온 것이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f97b0999-b5b5-f5d2-9615-9d8c2845f2a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(3) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:f97b0999-b5b5-f5d2-9615-9d8c2845f2a4
msgctxt "h7e779816ga538g4a0bga85eg6dc7e21a2b56"
msgid "I'll slit your throats before you can blink."
msgstr "네가 눈도 깜빡하기 전에 목을 베어주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Elder Brithvar
#. NodeID = fa13acfa-bf61-07a6-6e91-94108e377e5f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ScryingEye_State_PermaDefeated = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:fa13acfa-bf61-07a6-6e91-94108e377e5f
msgctxt "h96adf0c3g6ecfg48d4g81f9ga57d1266ac46"
msgid ""
"You come turnin' my people, strikin' Thrinn dead - and you still ain't paid "
"up. Shell it out, ya prickhole!"
msgstr "네놈은 내 부하들을 부려먹고, 쓰린을 죽이고도 빚을 한 푼도 갚지 않았어. 다 뱉어내, 이 호로 자식아!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny
#. Speaker = Nere
#. NodeID = fff1e171-1c83-1617-2ccd-36a2a91866f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DuergarLoyal_State_PermaDefeated = True
#.      - UND_DuergarMutineers_State_PermaDefeated = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_TheDrowNere_Mutiny:fff1e171-1c83-1617-2ccd-36a2a91866f5
msgctxt "hcfc07b6egfe75g42edgbca8ga67aeb01febc"
msgid ""
"So you care for the <i>weak</i>, True Soul. Was it your hand that slayed "
"Nere's servants? Or is there a <i>sane</i> explanation?"
msgstr ""
"<i>약자들을</i> 신경 쓰는군, 참된 영혼. 네가 니어의 종복들을 살해한 건가? 아니면 <i>이성적인</i> 설명이라도 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ThullaHint_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8c45ade2-cf10-462c-9abc-6e034e76e74a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ThullaHint_PAD:8c45ade2-cf10-462c-9abc-6e034e76e74a
msgctxt "h7fa4a69dg96cbg414cga0ecg01868d82461a"
msgid "What's that? Blood on the ground..."
msgstr "저게 뭐지? 바닥에 피가 묻어 있잖아..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ThullaHint_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8c45ade2-cf10-462c-9abc-6e034e76e74a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ThullaHint_PAD:8c45ade2-cf10-462c-9abc-6e034e76e74a
msgctxt "he3c471e1g72e2g4447g8305gf63edde1e32c"
msgid ""
"There are some markings on the ground here - not that they tell me much."
msgstr "바닥에 뭔가 문양이 남아있어, 뭔진 모르겠지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ThullaHint_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8c45ade2-cf10-462c-9abc-6e034e76e74a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ThullaHint_PAD:8c45ade2-cf10-462c-9abc-6e034e76e74a
msgctxt "h174fcf16gecd5g4de5g959fgea1b01cca149"
msgid "What are those marks on the ground?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ThullaHint_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8c45ade2-cf10-462c-9abc-6e034e76e74a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ThullaHint_PAD:8c45ade2-cf10-462c-9abc-6e034e76e74a
msgctxt "hf58a844dg1b37g4298gaf09gbe003d6f2f5f"
msgid "The ground is scuffed. It might be worth checking."
msgstr "바닥에 흔적이 있어. 확인해 보는 편이 좋겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ThullaHint_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8c45ade2-cf10-462c-9abc-6e034e76e74a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ThullaHint_PAD:8c45ade2-cf10-462c-9abc-6e034e76e74a
msgctxt "h119cd200g25a1g41b8g86b2g118bd3bc9682"
msgid "Marks on the ground. What happened here?"
msgstr "바닥에 흔적이 있어. 여기서 무슨 일이 있었던 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ThullaHint_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8c45ade2-cf10-462c-9abc-6e034e76e74a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ThullaHint_PAD:8c45ade2-cf10-462c-9abc-6e034e76e74a
msgctxt "hf2a367f8g795fg4960g8040ge46f999c033c"
msgid "Marks on the ground. I should look closer."
msgstr "바닥에 흔적이 있어. 조금 더 자세히 살펴야겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ThullaHint_PAD
