msgctxt "h5b6773cbg500eg4eadg980eg0f15cfee44fa"
msgid "Arrows and the bloody tracks of short legs. Someone went gnome-hunting."
msgstr "화살들과 짧은 다리의 피 묻은 흔적들. 누군가 노움 사냥을 했군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/UND_ThullaHint_SurvivalCheck_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6425661c-45c8-ae57-71f6-6b57423098a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
