msgid "Magic-eating flowers as a light source. Ingenious."
msgstr "마법을 삼키는 꽃을 불빛으로 쓰다니. 독창적이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ArcaneTower_PAD_Lights
