msgctxt "hd55127cegd2adg4769g9cb2g999ca160bd6f"
msgid "<i>Chk</i> - such tedium. No blades, no battle cries."
msgstr "<i>츠크</i>, 지루해 빠졌군. 칼날도, 전투의 함성도 없잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ArcaneTower_PAD_Poems
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 83839bf1-cce1-4457-ab2f-082b4d446929
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ArcaneTower_PAD_Poems:83839bf1-cce1-4457-ab2f-082b4d446929
msgctxt "h12ad7898gfcedg4059gb43cga0abac3aead1"
msgid ""
"Hmm. I can think of better places to enjoy literature than in the depths of "
"the Underdark..."
msgstr "흠. 이런 언더다크의 어둠 속은 딱히 문학을 즐기기 좋은 장소가 아닌데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ArcaneTower_PAD_Poems
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 83839bf1-cce1-4457-ab2f-082b4d446929
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ArcaneTower_PAD_Poems:83839bf1-cce1-4457-ab2f-082b4d446929
msgctxt "h2880dba2g9951g4995gb058g58497c57f60f"
msgid "Pleasant enough. But I'm partial to heroic sagas myself."
msgstr "적당히 즐겁네. 하지만 내 자신이 바로 영웅담이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ArcaneTower_PAD_Poems
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 83839bf1-cce1-4457-ab2f-082b4d446929
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ArcaneTower_PAD_Poems:83839bf1-cce1-4457-ab2f-082b4d446929
