msgctxt "h6187e8f2g48c2g4d92gb457gdcdca02a2293"
msgid "We are not welcome here - this much is clear."
msgstr "이것 하나는 확실하네, 우릴 환영하지 않는다는 사실 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_BlockpostTraps_VB_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c7bd0489-5d8c-44f5-57bf-4bcac1514f06
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_BlockpostTraps_VB_2P:c7bd0489-5d8c-44f5-57bf-4bcac1514f06
msgctxt "h676c0e85ga4d8g49baga97dg177d1b5f0422"
msgid "More effort than a pit of spikes. Credit where it's due."
msgstr "꼬챙이를 깔아둔 구덩이 보단 노력했네. 그건 인정해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_BlockpostTraps_VB_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c7bd0489-5d8c-44f5-57bf-4bcac1514f06
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_BlockpostTraps_VB_2P:c7bd0489-5d8c-44f5-57bf-4bcac1514f06
msgctxt "hc39497ceged5cg4525g83ceg04a482bd7b03"
msgid "<i>Someone's</i> laid out the unwelcome mat."
msgstr "<i>누군가</i> '안'환영 카펫을 깔아놨어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_BlockpostTraps_VB_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c7bd0489-5d8c-44f5-57bf-4bcac1514f06
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_BlockpostTraps_VB_2P:c7bd0489-5d8c-44f5-57bf-4bcac1514f06
msgctxt "h877f89fagf81dg4206g855dg81ddccf490ff"
msgid "Hells, I wouldn't want to get hit by that."
msgstr "세상에, 저걸로 맞고 싶진 않은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_BuletteHoles_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9fad7453-c0db-4921-bde6-360be3b867bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_BuletteHoles_PAD:9fad7453-c0db-4921-bde6-360be3b867bf
msgctxt "heb147d05g28b3g4179g9559g1d8a3c7bc158"
msgid "Bulette burrows. Best step lightly - there's a land shark about."
msgstr "불레트가 판 땅굴이다. 조심하는 게 좋겠어, 땅 상어가 근처에 있는 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_BuletteHoles_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9fad7453-c0db-4921-bde6-360be3b867bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_BuletteHoles_PAD:9fad7453-c0db-4921-bde6-360be3b867bf
msgctxt "he3a7961fg62d9g4c53g82d1gd026e76b1135"
msgid ""
"These burrow holes have all the markings of having been dug by bulettes. "
"There's trouble afoot."
msgstr "이 구멍은 불레트가 판 것 같은데. 곤란한 상황이 생기겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_BuletteHoles_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9fad7453-c0db-4921-bde6-360be3b867bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_BuletteHoles_PAD:9fad7453-c0db-4921-bde6-360be3b867bf
msgctxt "h8acf1aceg2114g47dfga9b3g96f1ff46c2bb"
msgid "This is the work of a bulette. A land shark."
msgstr "불레트가 한 짓이군. 지하 상어 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_BuletteHoles_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9fad7453-c0db-4921-bde6-360be3b867bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_BuletteHoles_PAD:9fad7453-c0db-4921-bde6-360be3b867bf
msgctxt "h9347cef4g251eg4f18ga63fg6f2d9d756df3"
msgid "Burrows? The work of a bulette, I believe. A <i>land shark.</i>"
msgstr "굴이잖아? 불레트의 짓인 것 같은데. <i>지하 상어</i> 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_BuletteHoles_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9fad7453-c0db-4921-bde6-360be3b867bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_BuletteHoles_PAD:9fad7453-c0db-4921-bde6-360be3b867bf
msgctxt "he8849aafg8fefg4fc9g951dg8a55559912d0"
msgid "Quite the burrow-hole. I'd rather not meet its maker."
msgstr "엄청난 굴이군. 만든 녀석을 만나고 싶진 않은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_BuletteHoles_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9fad7453-c0db-4921-bde6-360be3b867bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_BuletteHoles_PAD:9fad7453-c0db-4921-bde6-360be3b867bf
msgctxt "hc43e3564ga821g4245gb79dge1215a0b731b"
msgid "Hells - these are bulette burrows. <i>Land sharks.</i>"
msgstr "젠장, 이건 불레트 굴이야. <i>지하 상어지.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_BuletteHoles_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9fad7453-c0db-4921-bde6-360be3b867bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_BuletteHoles_PAD:9fad7453-c0db-4921-bde6-360be3b867bf
msgctxt "hb6a0ea18g5fb3g4374g9accg0c257fd0f9c8"
msgid "Something's burrowed in there - something big."
msgstr "뭔가 이 아래에 잠복하고 있어, 큰 놈이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_BuletteHoles_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ddc5ae4b-5cf5-2411-0759-8f969c6b9617
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ExplosiveMushrooms_Event_NatureCheckSuccess = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_UNDERDARK(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_BuletteHoles_PAD:ddc5ae4b-5cf5-2411-0759-8f969c6b9617
msgctxt "hbfde44f1g4047g4b02gbd59g9d9979d1efbc"
msgid "Must be one hell of a mole."
msgstr "엄청 큰 두더지겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_BuletteHoles_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ddc5ae4b-5cf5-2411-0759-8f969c6b9617
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ExplosiveMushrooms_Event_NatureCheckSuccess = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_UNDERDARK(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_BuletteHoles_PAD:ddc5ae4b-5cf5-2411-0759-8f969c6b9617
msgctxt "hc92d0f7fg7cdeg475ag931ag4074326e9d9d"
msgid ""
"These burrow holes must have been dug by some creature. Most likely not a "
"creature I'd like to meet."
msgstr "어떤 생명체가 판 굴 같은데. 만나보고 싶진 않군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_BuletteHoles_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ddc5ae4b-5cf5-2411-0759-8f969c6b9617
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ExplosiveMushrooms_Event_NatureCheckSuccess = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_UNDERDARK(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_BuletteHoles_PAD:ddc5ae4b-5cf5-2411-0759-8f969c6b9617
msgctxt "h08ee58d1g9e16g41d1gb112gee72e3847068"
msgid "Who the hell dug this out?\n"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_BuletteHoles_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ddc5ae4b-5cf5-2411-0759-8f969c6b9617
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ExplosiveMushrooms_Event_NatureCheckSuccess = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_UNDERDARK(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_BuletteHoles_PAD:ddc5ae4b-5cf5-2411-0759-8f969c6b9617
msgctxt "h0e767071gd2d8g4219g9f70gd6128d1b514c"
msgid "Someone - or some<i>thing</i> - has been digging here..."
msgstr "누군가, 아니면 <i>무엇인가</i> 여기 굴을 파고 있었어..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_BuletteHoles_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ddc5ae4b-5cf5-2411-0759-8f969c6b9617
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ExplosiveMushrooms_Event_NatureCheckSuccess = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_UNDERDARK(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_BuletteHoles_PAD:ddc5ae4b-5cf5-2411-0759-8f969c6b9617
msgctxt "hd1a7d392ge93dg47adgbbb0g063d7a327eda"
msgid "Did something dig this...?"
msgstr "뭔가가 판 굴인가...?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_BuletteHoles_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ddc5ae4b-5cf5-2411-0759-8f969c6b9617
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ExplosiveMushrooms_Event_NatureCheckSuccess = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_UNDERDARK(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_BuletteHoles_PAD:ddc5ae4b-5cf5-2411-0759-8f969c6b9617
msgctxt "h1d39d323ge6feg46d9g8d2bgf49eeb4047e5"
msgid "Tunnels everywhere. Not sure I want to know what dug them."
msgstr "사방에 굴이 있어. 뭐가 땅굴을 파는지 알고 싶지 않군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_BuletteHoles_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ddc5ae4b-5cf5-2411-0759-8f969c6b9617
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ExplosiveMushrooms_Event_NatureCheckSuccess = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_UNDERDARK(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_BuletteHoles_PAD:ddc5ae4b-5cf5-2411-0759-8f969c6b9617
msgctxt "h32d1604fg6278g44ecg8ec5gf10c1bc59a81"
msgid "There's tunnels everywhere - who would dig these? And why here?"
msgstr "사방에 굴이 있어. 누가 파는 거지? 그리고 왜 이곳일까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_Bulette_PAD_NatureCheckOutcome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a0e1d6b5-7814-4872-ad7c-78bdaab89b6a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_Bulette_Knows_Bulette = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_Bulette_PAD_NatureCheckOutcome:a0e1d6b5-7814-4872-ad7c-78bdaab89b6a
msgctxt "hc2a9796eg7ac2g4d25g9b17g67f18321f2df"
msgid "Was that a bulette? Best watch my step or I'll be lunch."
msgstr "방금 그거 불레트였나? 발밑을 조심하지 않으면 점심거리가 되겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_Bulette_PAD_NatureCheckOutcome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a0e1d6b5-7814-4872-ad7c-78bdaab89b6a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_Bulette_Knows_Bulette = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_Bulette_PAD_NatureCheckOutcome:a0e1d6b5-7814-4872-ad7c-78bdaab89b6a
msgctxt "h865f84ceg167fg434ega635g1141357d29f3"
msgid "A bulette... Best brace for a vicious battle."
msgstr "불레트라... 격렬한 전투를 대비해야겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_Bulette_PAD_NatureCheckOutcome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a0e1d6b5-7814-4872-ad7c-78bdaab89b6a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_Bulette_Knows_Bulette = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_Bulette_PAD_NatureCheckOutcome:a0e1d6b5-7814-4872-ad7c-78bdaab89b6a
msgctxt "hdce2ff46g39f1g4693g8f11gdca518d326f7"
msgid "Holy shit. A bulette. That thing could chomp me in two."
msgstr "젠장. 불레트잖아. 놈은 한 번 깨물면 나를 반으로 잘라버릴 수도 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_Bulette_PAD_NatureCheckOutcome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a0e1d6b5-7814-4872-ad7c-78bdaab89b6a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_Bulette_Knows_Bulette = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_Bulette_PAD_NatureCheckOutcome:a0e1d6b5-7814-4872-ad7c-78bdaab89b6a
msgctxt "h96180b4cg56d4g4ef5gb118gb206d8ce9676"
msgid "Was that... a bulette? I've heard tales of their viciousness."
msgstr "방금 그거... 불레트였나? 놈들의 포악함에 대한 이야기를 들어본 적이 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_Bulette_PAD_NatureCheckOutcome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a0e1d6b5-7814-4872-ad7c-78bdaab89b6a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_Bulette_Knows_Bulette = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_Bulette_PAD_NatureCheckOutcome:a0e1d6b5-7814-4872-ad7c-78bdaab89b6a
msgctxt "hc4e7a31dgd29eg485eg8d1bg469ce715f4a6"
msgid "A bulette. Those things are vicious."
msgstr "불레트군. 놈들은 아주 포악해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_Bulette_PAD_NatureCheckOutcome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a0e1d6b5-7814-4872-ad7c-78bdaab89b6a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_Bulette_Knows_Bulette = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_Bulette_PAD_NatureCheckOutcome:a0e1d6b5-7814-4872-ad7c-78bdaab89b6a
msgctxt "h4a557980g7c9cg4858gb090g62fa6d185991"
msgid "I think that was... a bulette! Never faced one. Not yet, anyway."
msgstr "방금 그건... 불레트였던 것 같군! 처음 봐. 지금까지는 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_Bulette_PAD_NatureCheckOutcome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a0e1d6b5-7814-4872-ad7c-78bdaab89b6a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_Bulette_Knows_Bulette = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_Bulette_PAD_NatureCheckOutcome:a0e1d6b5-7814-4872-ad7c-78bdaab89b6a
msgctxt "h575fb714g14c0g4188gaa8eg2431afc7a7ef"
msgid "That wasn't a bulette... was it?"
msgstr "방금 그거... 불레트는 아니었겠지, 그렇지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_Bulette_PAD_NatureCheckOutcome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c2e13878-6ed5-243b-1449-6c29d7902e34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_Bulette_Knows_Bulette = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_Bulette_PAD_NatureCheckOutcome:c2e13878-6ed5-243b-1449-6c29d7902e34
msgctxt "hcfd17d40g31ddg4904gbb2eg9e8c1a269295"
msgid "I don't know what that was, and I don't care to."
msgstr "뭐였는지도 모르겠고, 딱히 알고 싶지도 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_Bulette_PAD_NatureCheckOutcome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c2e13878-6ed5-243b-1449-6c29d7902e34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_Bulette_Knows_Bulette = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_Bulette_PAD_NatureCheckOutcome:c2e13878-6ed5-243b-1449-6c29d7902e34
msgctxt "h069b7f26gaf22g4fcbg9ca7g07587ce175f2"
msgid "Whatever that was, it looks mightily unpleasant."
msgstr "뭐였는지는 모르겠지만, 아주 불쾌해 보이던데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_Bulette_PAD_NatureCheckOutcome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c2e13878-6ed5-243b-1449-6c29d7902e34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_Bulette_Knows_Bulette = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_Bulette_PAD_NatureCheckOutcome:c2e13878-6ed5-243b-1449-6c29d7902e34
msgctxt "h933c8ce5g19c9g4eacg9d12gf685b2b01685"
msgid "What the hell was that thing?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_Bulette_PAD_NatureCheckOutcome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c2e13878-6ed5-243b-1449-6c29d7902e34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_Bulette_Knows_Bulette = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_Bulette_PAD_NatureCheckOutcome:c2e13878-6ed5-243b-1449-6c29d7902e34
msgctxt "h8242d751g78d1g476bga6a9gd8d703ea83eb"
msgid "Whatever it was, I stand at the ready."
msgstr "뭐였는진 모르겠지만, 난 준비됐어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_Bulette_PAD_NatureCheckOutcome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c2e13878-6ed5-243b-1449-6c29d7902e34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_Bulette_Knows_Bulette = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_Bulette_PAD_NatureCheckOutcome:c2e13878-6ed5-243b-1449-6c29d7902e34
msgctxt "hf6552913g8ef2g4b11ga60fga2b30b0ec161"
msgid "That thing didn't look friendly, whatever it is."
msgstr "뭐였는지는 모르겠지만, 우호적으로 보이지는 않던데."

