#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 636da97b-e9d3-4091-bd67-6780155912dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DarkJusticiarCorpse_PAD_Recognized:636da97b-e9d3-4091-bd67-6780155912dd
msgctxt "he66d7cc0gf181g4a57g9977g683c8f70c9af"
msgid ""
"Either way, these corpses prove one thing: this is the city Halsin mentioned."
msgstr "어느 쪽이든, 이 시체가 한 가지 사실은 확실히 드러내는군: 이곳이 할신이 말했던 도시야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DarkLake_VB_FoundBoat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a2186434-4a79-5ed3-47d0-a43260e11441
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DarkLake_VB_FoundBoat:a2186434-4a79-5ed3-47d0-a43260e11441
msgctxt "h619274a9gde0eg4a8fgabc7g7a6d3652fcb3"
msgid "What creatures thrive in a lake this dismal?"
msgstr "이 황량한 호수에는 어떤 생물들이 살고 있을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DarkLake_VB_FoundBoat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a2186434-4a79-5ed3-47d0-a43260e11441
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_UNDERDARK
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DarkLake_VB_FoundBoat:a2186434-4a79-5ed3-47d0-a43260e11441
msgctxt "heb613408gfe85g4e7fg8bebgad8c105894e9"
msgid "The Ebonlake. I wouldn't go sticking your hand in."
msgstr "칠흑호수군. 손을 넣는 건 좋은 생각이 아닐 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DarkLake_VB_FoundBoat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a2186434-4a79-5ed3-47d0-a43260e11441
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DarkLake_VB_FoundBoat:a2186434-4a79-5ed3-47d0-a43260e11441
msgctxt "hf300b316g9f88g45c0ga963g16548a03c571"
msgid "Quite the lake, but I'm not up for a swim."
msgstr "멋진 호수지만, 수영할 기분은 아니네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DarkLake_VB_FoundBoat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a2186434-4a79-5ed3-47d0-a43260e11441
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DarkLake_VB_FoundBoat:a2186434-4a79-5ed3-47d0-a43260e11441
msgctxt "h464d2018gd0abg4590g891dg6699995652cb"
msgid "What creatures live in waters this dark?"
msgstr "이렇게 어두운 물속에는 어떤 생물이 살까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DefacedStatue_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 277416db-d02c-4480-b569-1c48e635ea48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Absolute_Knows_Symbol = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DefacedStatue_PAD:277416db-d02c-4480-b569-1c48e635ea48
msgctxt "he0811836g13afg47fdgb478g08e78302a200"
msgid ""
"The mark of the Absolute. No intention of playing nice with other gods, it "
"seems."
msgstr "절대자의 표식이야. 다른 신들에게 존중을 표할 생각은 없는 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DefacedStatue_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 277416db-d02c-4480-b569-1c48e635ea48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Absolute_Knows_Symbol = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DefacedStatue_PAD:277416db-d02c-4480-b569-1c48e635ea48
msgctxt "haf3d0270g2101g4b02gb19eg58b33e0ae7f9"
msgid ""
"Well, well - he symbolic triumph of the Absolute over the darkness of Shar. "
"Petty vandalism, in my opinion."
msgstr "이런, 이런. 샤의 어둠에 대한 절대자의 상징적인 승리라는 건가. 내가 보기엔 옹졸한 기물파손에 가까운 것 같지만 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DefacedStatue_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 277416db-d02c-4480-b569-1c48e635ea48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Absolute_Knows_Symbol = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DefacedStatue_PAD:277416db-d02c-4480-b569-1c48e635ea48
msgctxt "h80211d9bg423eg40e8ga4b8g2d52b749b4c7"
msgid "The mark of the Absolute. I guess there can be only one."
msgstr "절대자의 표식이야. 하나 밖에 없는 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DefacedStatue_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 277416db-d02c-4480-b569-1c48e635ea48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Absolute_Knows_Symbol = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DefacedStatue_PAD:277416db-d02c-4480-b569-1c48e635ea48
msgctxt "hd8d6a956g6003g4382g8afbga98ddd534741"
msgid ""
"Shar, defaced by the Absolute's mark. I can think of no better target for "
"vandals."
msgstr "절대자의 표식으로 더럽혀진 샤 석상이라니. 딱 부수고 싶게 생겼네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DefacedStatue_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 277416db-d02c-4480-b569-1c48e635ea48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Absolute_Knows_Symbol = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DefacedStatue_PAD:277416db-d02c-4480-b569-1c48e635ea48
msgctxt "h1cc21e24g010fg446ag935eg0b6a0c4d9397"
msgid "Defaced by the Absolute's lackeys. Cowards."
msgstr "절대자의 종들이 더럽혔어. 겁쟁이 놈들."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DefacedStatue_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 277416db-d02c-4480-b569-1c48e635ea48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Absolute_Knows_Symbol = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DefacedStatue_PAD:277416db-d02c-4480-b569-1c48e635ea48
msgctxt "hf638f3ebg2e74g4856g8e4cgdb0ba235e1a7"
msgid ""
"This is the Absolute's symbol. <i>Someone's</i> been marking their territory."
msgstr "이건 절대자의 상징이야. <i>누군가</i> 자기들 영토를 표시해 뒀군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DefacedStatue_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 277416db-d02c-4480-b569-1c48e635ea48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Absolute_Knows_Symbol = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_SHAR or PALADIN_SHAR
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DefacedStatue_PAD:277416db-d02c-4480-b569-1c48e635ea48
msgctxt "h718963a4g1331g4178gb49cge77a16fc3d02"
msgid "The Dark Lady, befouled by the Absolute's mark."
msgstr "어둠의 여인이 절대자의 표식에 덮였군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DefacedStatue_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 277416db-d02c-4480-b569-1c48e635ea48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Absolute_Knows_Symbol = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DefacedStatue_PAD:277416db-d02c-4480-b569-1c48e635ea48
msgctxt "h7b8ff937g9224g46d4gbc9egc0633cd32bd6"
msgid ""
"Looks like someone's not a fan of Shar. Smeared the Absolute's symbol all "
"over her."
msgstr "샤를 싫어하는 이들이 있는 것 같아. 온통 절대자의 표식을 그려놨군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DefacedStatue_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4989156c-8558-4fbd-a42a-a86eac889da1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DefacedStatue_PAD:4989156c-8558-4fbd-a42a-a86eac889da1
msgctxt "h977c70f2g8fb5g43b9g997egf88ada45a36b"
msgid "A little blasphemous graffiti, though I don't recognise the symbol."
msgstr "꽤 불경스러운 그라피티네, 하지만 무슨 상징인지는 모르겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DefacedStatue_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4989156c-8558-4fbd-a42a-a86eac889da1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DefacedStatue_PAD:4989156c-8558-4fbd-a42a-a86eac889da1
msgctxt "hcf39789bg20f3g40cfga8e1g5c51e3e60d5b"
msgid ""
"Someone sought to deface Shar it seems, though not with a symbol I recognise."
msgstr "누군가 샤의 외관을 더럽혔어, 하지만 무슨 상징인지는 모르겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DefacedStatue_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4989156c-8558-4fbd-a42a-a86eac889da1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DefacedStatue_PAD:4989156c-8558-4fbd-a42a-a86eac889da1
msgctxt "h1810565bg3df0g4b33g9fd0gf3d48f936b72"
msgid "Someone didn't like Shar much."
msgstr "샤가 어지간히 싫었나 보군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DefacedStatue_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4989156c-8558-4fbd-a42a-a86eac889da1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DefacedStatue_PAD:4989156c-8558-4fbd-a42a-a86eac889da1
msgctxt "h81560676gbaafg4143g80fcge734e0f6e668"
msgid ""
"<i>Chk</i> - the plain visage of Shar. Were it not already marked by "
"vandals, I might have done it myself."
msgstr "<i>츠크</i>, 샤 에게 어울리는군. 이미 더럽혀지지 않았다면, 내가 직접 했을지도 모르겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DefacedStatue_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4989156c-8558-4fbd-a42a-a86eac889da1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DefacedStatue_PAD:4989156c-8558-4fbd-a42a-a86eac889da1
msgctxt "h2f40799bg1dcag44dcg873ag0276acd6b4d0"
msgid "Desecration. What is this nonsense symbol?"
msgstr "신성 모독이군. 이 바보 같은 상징은 또 뭐야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DefacedStatue_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4989156c-8558-4fbd-a42a-a86eac889da1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DefacedStatue_PAD:4989156c-8558-4fbd-a42a-a86eac889da1
msgctxt "ha5726b79ga3c2g492egade8g15495ec52aff"
msgid "Someone's defaced this Shar statue. Not sure what this is though."
msgstr "누군가 이 샤 석상을 더럽혔어. 뭔지는 모르겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DefacedStatue_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4989156c-8558-4fbd-a42a-a86eac889da1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC_SHAR or PALADIN_SHAR
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DefacedStatue_PAD:4989156c-8558-4fbd-a42a-a86eac889da1
msgctxt "he3713540gceedg4126gb3cegf37345cf7937"
msgid "The Dark Lady, defaced by some foul mark."
msgstr "어둠의 여인이 더러운 표식으로 오염되었군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DefacedStatue_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4989156c-8558-4fbd-a42a-a86eac889da1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DefacedStatue_PAD:4989156c-8558-4fbd-a42a-a86eac889da1
msgctxt "h5cb62bf7gf7ceg4592g8693g5450b54794f6"
msgid "A statue of Shar - but it's been vandalised. What is that symbol?"
msgstr "샤의 석상이야. 하지만 파손되었군. 저게 무슨 상징이지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DrowResupply_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2a35b3b2-f683-3521-b5fb-50667f16b074
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LOLTHDROWELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DrowResupply_PAD:2a35b3b2-f683-3521-b5fb-50667f16b074
msgctxt "h7b7b2dedg63fdg4db4g95aegc6d95069a899"
msgid ""
"Too much dust to be a new outpost. I wonder why my brethren abandoned this "
"place."
msgstr "새 전초기지라고 하기에는 먼지가 너무 많군. 내 동족이 이곳을 왜 버렸을지 궁금한데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DrowResupply_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2a35b3b2-f683-3521-b5fb-50667f16b074
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SELDARINEDROWELF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DrowResupply_PAD:2a35b3b2-f683-3521-b5fb-50667f16b074
msgctxt "h5ed63f01gb24eg49e2gaf7egbf672a4d33c3"
msgid ""
"Lolth's sigils on every box. If this place wasn't already abandoned, I'd set "
"it ablaze."
msgstr "롤쓰의 인장이 모든 상자에 새겨져 있어. 이곳이 이미 버려지지 않았다면, 불태워 버렸을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DrowResupply_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 57a8a0f0-0618-4a3a-95b6-4e110a738d45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DrowResupply_PAD:57a8a0f0-0618-4a3a-95b6-4e110a738d45
msgctxt "h0e341185gedc5g4306g88d2gc5462876bd4c"
msgid "A resupply stash. I wonder if Lolth's pets left anything good."
msgstr "재보급용 은신처로군. 롤쓰의 애완동물이 쓸만한 걸 남겨뒀을지 궁금하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DrowResupply_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 57a8a0f0-0618-4a3a-95b6-4e110a738d45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DrowResupply_PAD:57a8a0f0-0618-4a3a-95b6-4e110a738d45
msgctxt "h4823d6c1g9635g400agb4aage55013701fc8"
msgid ""
"Lolth-sworn drow passed by here, but it seems they never returned. Finders, "
"keepers, I say."
msgstr "롤쓰 스원 드로우가 이곳을 지나가서, 다시는 돌아오지 않은 것 같네. 찾는 사람이 임자지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DrowResupply_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 57a8a0f0-0618-4a3a-95b6-4e110a738d45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DrowResupply_PAD:57a8a0f0-0618-4a3a-95b6-4e110a738d45
msgctxt "hd427ee97g3b0fg4d46g8cafg6fbb640d2002"
msgid "Lolth drow left an old resupply cache here.\n"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DrowResupply_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 57a8a0f0-0618-4a3a-95b6-4e110a738d45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DrowResupply_PAD:57a8a0f0-0618-4a3a-95b6-4e110a738d45
msgctxt "ha10a4a15gfa29g42a2g808cg7911f0b7f7fb"
msgid "An old resupply cache. Lolth's children once tread here."
msgstr "오래된 재보급용 은신처야. 한때 롤쓰의 아이가 이곳에 있었군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DrowResupply_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 57a8a0f0-0618-4a3a-95b6-4e110a738d45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DrowResupply_PAD:57a8a0f0-0618-4a3a-95b6-4e110a738d45
msgctxt "hfd194378g35a6g4ebag9674gc1fcf2ac3e66"
msgid ""
"An old resupply cache. Lolth-sworn drow... hasn't been touched in years."
msgstr "오래된 재보급용 은신처군. 롤쓰 스원 드로우라... 수년동안 버려져 있었던 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DrowResupply_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 57a8a0f0-0618-4a3a-95b6-4e110a738d45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DrowResupply_PAD:57a8a0f0-0618-4a3a-95b6-4e110a738d45
msgctxt "h5e1f0e58g7395g4f2fga14fg3c93d8c9e496"
msgid "Must've been a drow supply cache. Nothing left but some empty boxes."
msgstr "드로우가 이용하던 보급용 은신처였던 것 같군. 빈 상자밖에 남아있지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DrowResupply_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 57a8a0f0-0618-4a3a-95b6-4e110a738d45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DrowResupply_PAD:57a8a0f0-0618-4a3a-95b6-4e110a738d45
msgctxt "h33b026fagbc39g4306gbc36gd183e422264d"
msgid ""
"Bunch of empty boxes and spiderwebs. Guess Lolth's cultists haven't been "
"back here in a while."
msgstr "빈 상자들과 거미줄이라. 롤쓰의 광신자들이 여기 온 지도 꽤 지난 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_Entrance_VB_1P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fc267c36-ae34-ea36-20b1-63511f1ef7f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
