msgctxt "h93b1fd9eg9649g4f33gaa8eg63a640d29232"
msgid "Looks like a military outpost. Best be ready for a fight."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_Entrance_VB_1P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fc267c36-ae34-ea36-20b1-63511f1ef7f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_Entrance_VB_1P:fc267c36-ae34-ea36-20b1-63511f1ef7f6
msgctxt "h758693bfg20c2g454ag9b85g7fb74c0d0b57"
msgid "A military fortress, perhaps. What an odd sight in these dim caverns."
msgstr "군사 요새인 것 같은데. 이런 어두운 동굴에서 이런 광경을 보게 되다니."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_Entrance_VB_1P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fc267c36-ae34-ea36-20b1-63511f1ef7f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_Entrance_VB_1P:fc267c36-ae34-ea36-20b1-63511f1ef7f6
msgctxt "he9f0837bgfe75g4ab1gafd4gaf110a44ed71"
msgid "This is no thrown-together camp... someone built a fortress down here."
msgstr "여긴 급조 야영지 같은 게 아니군... 누군가 이 아래에 요새를 지어놨어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_Entrance_VB_1P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fc267c36-ae34-ea36-20b1-63511f1ef7f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_Entrance_VB_1P:fc267c36-ae34-ea36-20b1-63511f1ef7f6
msgctxt "hea8fb7c9g5f9fg47abga6a7gbd043d31fbea"
msgid ""
"I've seen buildings like this in Flaming Fist outposts. Strange to see them "
"down here."
msgstr "플레이밍 피스트의 전초기지와 닮은 것 같은데. 여기서 이런 구조물을 보게 되다니, 묘하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_Entrance_VB_1P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fc267c36-ae34-ea36-20b1-63511f1ef7f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_UNDERDARK
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_Entrance_VB_1P:fc267c36-ae34-ea36-20b1-63511f1ef7f6
msgctxt "hc2a7e39cgd801g4160g9fd3gea6020e44eea"
msgid "Deep gnome make, but the design is anything but. What was this fort?"
msgstr "딥 노움이 지은 것 같은데, 그들의 양식과는 전혀 다르군. 뭘 위한 요새였을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_Entrance_VB_1P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fc267c36-ae34-ea36-20b1-63511f1ef7f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_Entrance_VB_1P:fc267c36-ae34-ea36-20b1-63511f1ef7f6
msgctxt "h2134dc5cg943fg4f61g9d6egc8f11b5ef1d9"
msgid ""
"Why are all the buildings on this plane so broken? What do they do with them?"
msgstr "왜 이 차원의 건축물들은 다 무너지기 직전인 거지? 이 건물들을 가지고 뭘 하는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_Entrance_VB_1P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fc267c36-ae34-ea36-20b1-63511f1ef7f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_Entrance_VB_1P:fc267c36-ae34-ea36-20b1-63511f1ef7f6
msgctxt "h1a7c7f63g7b17g4be9g8d73g1f10942f7750"
msgid "What's a fort like this doing in the Underdark?"
msgstr "언더다크에 이런 요새가 왜 있는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_Entrance_VB_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9554bdbb-19fc-98b6-2cd7-38ec19cfa07b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_Entrance_VB_2P:9554bdbb-19fc-98b6-2cd7-38ec19cfa07b
msgctxt "hd7fefc0cg1162g461agaf3eg3816d8cd2f60"
msgid ""
"Fascinating architecture. Doesn't match the style of any Underdark "
"civilisation that I know of."
msgstr "환상적인 건축물이야. 내가 아는 언더다크 문명들의 양식과는 전혀 다르군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_Entrance_VB_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9554bdbb-19fc-98b6-2cd7-38ec19cfa07b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_Entrance_VB_2P:9554bdbb-19fc-98b6-2cd7-38ec19cfa07b
msgctxt "h9dfe292cgae63g4f2eg9a4dg63f758ef4468"
msgid "Whoever built it, they've let it rot for ages."
msgstr "누가 지었는진 모르겠지만, 아주 오랫동안 방치해뒀네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_Entrance_VB_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fc3a1ff3-39cf-a7c3-645c-a49fcfbbe574
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_Entrance_VB_2P:fc3a1ff3-39cf-a7c3-645c-a49fcfbbe574
msgctxt "habc74fb7g82edg4e89gb51bgf06a489055b8"
msgid "No duergar built this fort. They don't have the imagination."
msgstr "듀에르가가 이런 요새를 지었을 리가 없어. 놈들에겐 이런 창의력이 없다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_Entrance_VB_2P
