msgctxt "hca412b08g61aeg4ba7g94b1gf0585e5b7aa4"
msgid "A military fortress, perhaps. An odd sight in these dim caverns."
msgstr "군사 요새인 것 같은데. 이런 어두컴컴한 동굴에서 볼 광경은 아니군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_Entrance_VB_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fc3a1ff3-39cf-a7c3-645c-a49fcfbbe574
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_Entrance_VB_2P:fc3a1ff3-39cf-a7c3-645c-a49fcfbbe574
msgctxt "he18de154gda88g4164gb506gd764ea3c2f7b"
msgid ""
"This stonework looks more suited to the surface than the Underdark... who "
"built this?"
msgstr "언더다크보다는 지상의 양식인 것 같은데... 누가 이걸 지은 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_Entrance_VB_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fc3a1ff3-39cf-a7c3-645c-a49fcfbbe574
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_Entrance_VB_2P:fc3a1ff3-39cf-a7c3-645c-a49fcfbbe574
msgctxt "he5893287g0769g419agb73ag8fb458436525"
msgid "Incredible stonework. Nothing like it topside - that I've seen, anyway."
msgstr "믿기 힘들 정도의 건축물이군. 지금껏 봐왔던 것들과는 전혀 달라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_Entrance_VB_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fc3a1ff3-39cf-a7c3-645c-a49fcfbbe574
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_UNDERDARK
