msgctxt "h3c58a6e0g0bc5g45f4gab64g57bc24503f56"
msgid ""
"Hmmm... deep gnome make, but the design is anything but. What was this fort?"
msgstr "흐음... 딥 노움이 지었다고 해도, 그들의 양식과는 전혀 다른데. 뭘 위한 요새였을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_Entrance_VB_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fc3a1ff3-39cf-a7c3-645c-a49fcfbbe574
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
