msgctxt "h02b342ffgfe20g4ba8g88bbg1a76386abf0f"
msgid "What's a fort like this doing in the Underdark?"
msgstr "언더다크에 이런 요새가 왜 있는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_DeadScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c802faa2-e8d2-4887-bed6-fb848142eda2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_DeadScryingEye:c802faa2-e8d2-4887-bed6-fb848142eda2
msgctxt "h870ebc91g07c7g4f72g8f57gddb3f292d060"
msgid "How precious. A scrying eye, forever shut."
msgstr "보기 좋네. 감시하는 수정구가 영원히 닫혔어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_DeadScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c802faa2-e8d2-4887-bed6-fb848142eda2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_DeadScryingEye:c802faa2-e8d2-4887-bed6-fb848142eda2
msgctxt "h5a955be4g53d7g41a0g8a97g5c016d0e78d0"
msgid "You'll turn a blind eye for me, won't you?"
msgstr "날 위해 눈감아 주지 않겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_DeadScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c802faa2-e8d2-4887-bed6-fb848142eda2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_DeadScryingEye:c802faa2-e8d2-4887-bed6-fb848142eda2
msgctxt "hf2e98701gd864g43degac56gdc0439786752"
msgid "A scrying eye - closed forever."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_DeadScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c802faa2-e8d2-4887-bed6-fb848142eda2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_DeadScryingEye:c802faa2-e8d2-4887-bed6-fb848142eda2
msgctxt "h201f4b93g45aag4359gb0b1g326472cde7b1"
msgid "A scrying eye, forever blinded."
msgstr "감시하는 수정구가 영원히 감겼어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_DeadScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c802faa2-e8d2-4887-bed6-fb848142eda2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_DeadScryingEye:c802faa2-e8d2-4887-bed6-fb848142eda2
msgctxt "hd6dfff1bgd941g4d6fga8b3g5ee01cbef5cc"
msgid ""
"A scrying eye. At least this one won't be telling anyone what I've been up "
"to."
msgstr "감시하는 수정구야. 적어도 내가 무슨 짓을 했는지 아무에게도 말하지 않겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_DeadScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c802faa2-e8d2-4887-bed6-fb848142eda2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_DeadScryingEye:c802faa2-e8d2-4887-bed6-fb848142eda2
msgctxt "haacb0d80g8220g487cg867ag39686194b534"
msgid "The eye's scrying days are over."
msgstr "이 수정구가 감시하던 시절은 끝났어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_DeadScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c802faa2-e8d2-4887-bed6-fb848142eda2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_DeadScryingEye:c802faa2-e8d2-4887-bed6-fb848142eda2
msgctxt "h41a7433dga813g4be7g8f62ga3e654737196"
msgid "A scrying eye - or whatever's left of it."
msgstr "감시하는 수정구야, 그 잔해지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_FoundAdamantine
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 593cfe72-d600-fa58-4d7d-bcde379328fd
