#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_FoundAdamantine:593cfe72-d600-fa58-4d7d-bcde379328fd
msgctxt "h671444d9g2605g4092gb5d2gb009d3488e4f"
msgid ""
"It's mostly slag, but something's sparkling in there. Hello! Are you "
"adamantine?"
msgstr "대부분은 찌꺼기지만, 안쪽에 반짝이는 게 있어. 이봐! 너 아다만틴이니?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_FoundAdamantine
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 593cfe72-d600-fa58-4d7d-bcde379328fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_DuergarCamp_State_AdamantineKnowledge = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_FoundAdamantine:593cfe72-d600-fa58-4d7d-bcde379328fd
msgctxt "h38f135c9g4d15g476dg9660ge041d8167b3e"
msgid "The speckles in this slag... That's adamantine, I'm sure of it."
msgstr "이 광재에 남은 반점... 이건 아다만틴이야, 확실해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_FoundAdamantine
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 593cfe72-d600-fa58-4d7d-bcde379328fd
