msgctxt "h5458b9f1g2509g4380gb472ga41e1d205701"
msgid "Huh. This looks familiar, but I can't place why."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_HarperPin
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6a26e383-a2af-480a-8bf4-32f0f9939cc6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_DuergarCamp_HarperPin_HistoryPassed(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_HarperPin:6a26e383-a2af-480a-8bf4-32f0f9939cc6
msgctxt "h16f66b20ga569g45c0g88a8gd01df9ff6f8e"
msgid "Curious emblem on this pin. A guild symbol, perhaps."
msgstr "흥미로운 상징이 그려져 있어. 길드의 상징인 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_HarperPin
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6a26e383-a2af-480a-8bf4-32f0f9939cc6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_DuergarCamp_HarperPin_HistoryPassed(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_HarperPin:6a26e383-a2af-480a-8bf4-32f0f9939cc6
msgctxt "h11107feag1ad5g4573g86a4g0b24508184fc"
msgid "Interesting bauble, but I don't recognise the symbol."
msgstr "신기한 보석이네, 하지만 무슨 상징인지는 모르겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_HarperPin
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6a26e383-a2af-480a-8bf4-32f0f9939cc6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_DuergarCamp_HarperPin_HistoryPassed(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_HarperPin:6a26e383-a2af-480a-8bf4-32f0f9939cc6
msgctxt "h3c43b387g0e75g40bbg81c5g9de9b9fd7b13"
msgid "This pin resembles a harp. I'm sure I've seen this symbol before..."
msgstr "이 핀은 하프를 상징하고 있어. 분명 전에 본 적 있는 상징인 것 같은데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_HarperPin
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6a26e383-a2af-480a-8bf4-32f0f9939cc6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_DuergarCamp_HarperPin_HistoryPassed(0) = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_HarperPin:6a26e383-a2af-480a-8bf4-32f0f9939cc6
msgctxt "hd91c65e0g3c1bg4161ga754g6c09b45e80a6"
msgid "What an odd emblem. Don't think I've seen it before."
msgstr "묘한 상징이군. 처음 보는 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_HarperPin
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ffb413de-ebb8-4b2e-923f-73f1ed70fd21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_DuergarCamp_HarperPin_HistoryPassed(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_HarperPin:ffb413de-ebb8-4b2e-923f-73f1ed70fd21
msgctxt "h28be01e8g986ag4876g8a15gbb7b11e8e383"
msgid ""
"A pin with the Harpers' emblem. Strange to see this all the way down here."
msgstr "하퍼의 상징이 그려진 핀이라. 이 아래에서 이런 걸 보다니 이상하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_HarperPin
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ffb413de-ebb8-4b2e-923f-73f1ed70fd21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_DuergarCamp_HarperPin_HistoryPassed(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_HarperPin:ffb413de-ebb8-4b2e-923f-73f1ed70fd21
msgctxt "ha6ddfb3eg4bbbg4001gbbd4g2912262d04b7"
msgid ""
"That pin... she was a Harper. Strange place for her to be, even if a drow."
msgstr "저 핀... 그녀는 하퍼였어. 드로우라고 해도, 이곳에 있었다니 이상하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_HarperPin
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ffb413de-ebb8-4b2e-923f-73f1ed70fd21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_DuergarCamp_HarperPin_HistoryPassed(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_HarperPin:ffb413de-ebb8-4b2e-923f-73f1ed70fd21
msgctxt "hf8264fc9gbaf3g4802g921fg0f523a3a9c55"
msgid "A Harper pin. Must've been on a covert operation down here."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_HarperPin
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ffb413de-ebb8-4b2e-923f-73f1ed70fd21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_DuergarCamp_HarperPin_HistoryPassed(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_HarperPin:ffb413de-ebb8-4b2e-923f-73f1ed70fd21
msgctxt "h8b3eb87fg08f7g43bdg8312g18b429debdc4"
msgid ""
"I've seen this emblem - a harp and a crescent. What business would bring a "
"Harper here?"
msgstr "이 상징을 본 적 있어, 하프와 초승달. 어떤 일로 하퍼가 이 아래까지 내려온 걸까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_HarperPin
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ffb413de-ebb8-4b2e-923f-73f1ed70fd21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_DuergarCamp_HarperPin_HistoryPassed(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_HarperPin:ffb413de-ebb8-4b2e-923f-73f1ed70fd21
msgctxt "h857fd26bg072dg4dd4g82a5gf1fe4dcbe9fb"
msgid "A Harper pin - how'd it get all the way down here?"
msgstr "하퍼의 핀이잖아 - 어쩌다 이 아래까지 오게 된 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_HarperPin
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ffb413de-ebb8-4b2e-923f-73f1ed70fd21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_DuergarCamp_HarperPin_HistoryPassed(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_HarperPin:ffb413de-ebb8-4b2e-923f-73f1ed70fd21
msgctxt "h7f7e06f7g14b4g4531g853fg7ca17063f6ef"
msgid ""
"A crescent and harp emblem - the drow was a Harper. Why was she here, of all "
"places?"
msgstr "초승달과 하프 상징이야 - 이 드로우는 하퍼였군. 수많은 곳들 중에서, 왜 하필 이곳에 있었던 걸까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_HarperPin
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ffb413de-ebb8-4b2e-923f-73f1ed70fd21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_DuergarCamp_HarperPin_HistoryPassed(0) = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_HarperPin:ffb413de-ebb8-4b2e-923f-73f1ed70fd21
msgctxt "hab66ad8agbf6ag4b60g8d49g0fa40c73390f"
msgid "This is a Harper emblem. What was she doing <i>here?</i>"
msgstr "이건 하퍼의 상징이잖아. <i>여기서 </i>뭘 하고 있었던 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_NereDiedDeserted
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6078e0b8-9f02-42db-a7fe-33eddff71c82
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_NereDiedDeserted:6078e0b8-9f02-42db-a7fe-33eddff71c82
msgctxt "hc33f03d8g5b3dg4be6g9511g63d1aa100204"
msgid "No one's here? Just as well - we can grab Nere's head and go."
msgstr "아무도 없어? 오히려 좋네, 니어의 머리를 챙기고 가자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_NereDiedDeserted
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6078e0b8-9f02-42db-a7fe-33eddff71c82
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_NereDiedDeserted:6078e0b8-9f02-42db-a7fe-33eddff71c82
msgctxt "h128bd6baga432g4dbdg924dgb5f4325440f2"
msgid ""
"Nere must be long dead by now. I suppose that makes it slightly more "
"palatable to sever his head from his body."
msgstr "니어는 지금쯤 영영 죽어버렸을 테지. 그렇다면 머리를 떼어내는 일이 조금 더 수월해졌겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_NereDiedDeserted
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6078e0b8-9f02-42db-a7fe-33eddff71c82
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_NereDiedDeserted:6078e0b8-9f02-42db-a7fe-33eddff71c82
msgctxt "h72a0d218g6e5bg4f51ga40eg6518f798c22e"
msgid "Empty. Guess it'll be easy enough to get Nere's melon now."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_NereDiedDeserted
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6078e0b8-9f02-42db-a7fe-33eddff71c82
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_NereDiedDeserted:6078e0b8-9f02-42db-a7fe-33eddff71c82
msgctxt "h9ff4b867g9e6dg4bb8gb511g0ed7417f4aa3"
msgid "I suppose Nere's dead by now. I just need his head."
msgstr "니어는 이미 죽은 것 같군. 그의 머리만 챙기면 되겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_NereDiedDeserted
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6078e0b8-9f02-42db-a7fe-33eddff71c82
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_NereDiedDeserted:6078e0b8-9f02-42db-a7fe-33eddff71c82
msgctxt "h5adc504fg454ag4936g82cag3a6b11b0f02b"
msgid ""
"All quiet - Nere must've died. Which means he won't be needing his head, of "
"course..."
msgstr "조용하군 - 니어가 죽은 게 분명해. 물론 그렇다는 건, 이제 그에게 머리는 필요 없다는 뜻이겠지..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_NereDiedDeserted
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6078e0b8-9f02-42db-a7fe-33eddff71c82
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_NereDiedDeserted:6078e0b8-9f02-42db-a7fe-33eddff71c82
msgctxt "h471d99a5g7817g4ff7g8333g4cfc56dd35ab"
msgid ""
"Everyone's gone - which means Nere's rotting back there. Might as well grab "
"his head."
msgstr "모두가 사라졌어, 그렇다면 니어는 저 뒤에서 썩어가고 있겠지. 놈의 머리를 챙겨가는 게 좋겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_NereDiedDeserted
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6078e0b8-9f02-42db-a7fe-33eddff71c82
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_NereDiedDeserted:6078e0b8-9f02-42db-a7fe-33eddff71c82
msgctxt "hd25fbab8gb470g4004gb5d7g611c8099f026"
msgid ""
"The slavers are gone - Nere must be dead by now. Just need to grab his head."
msgstr "노예상들이 사라졌어, 니어는 이미 죽었겠군. 놈의 머리만 챙기면 되겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_Plaque_01
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 632402b3-e146-1945-ea1e-d186d74db691
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_Plaque_01:632402b3-e146-1945-ea1e-d186d74db691
msgctxt "hfdce9d4ag2953g4010g899dg04bd7aedd174"
msgid ""
"*In the beginning came morning, then night; two sisters clashed - one dark "
"and one light.*"
msgstr "*태초에 아침이 있었고, 밤이 따랐다; 두 자매가 맞붙으니 - 하나는 어둠이요 하나는 빛이라.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_Plaque_02
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 2f858854-c628-4c8a-9bb0-80d921e3b36e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_Plaque_02:2f858854-c628-4c8a-9bb0-80d921e3b36e
msgctxt "hf622ac2bg1f39g4a63gb699gcca8d048739e"
msgid ""
"*Selûne did call forth the moon and the stars; Shar cloaked them in shadow "
"to cover our scars.*"
msgstr "*셀루네는 달과 별을 불러냈고; 샤께서는 우리 상처를 가리기 위해 그들을 그림자로 감췄다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SawRustyWeapons
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 480d1060-bd87-478b-bf6a-5b1fd8c73c3a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SawRustyWeapons:480d1060-bd87-478b-bf6a-5b1fd8c73c3a
msgctxt "hc88ec601gd9d2g450cga82bgaf63d2d6bad9"
msgid ""
"The weapons here are more rust than steel. How long's it been since they "
"tasted flesh?"
msgstr "이 무기들은 고철이 돼버렸군. 살점을 맛본 지가 얼마나 오래된 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SawRustyWeapons
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 480d1060-bd87-478b-bf6a-5b1fd8c73c3a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SawRustyWeapons:480d1060-bd87-478b-bf6a-5b1fd8c73c3a
msgctxt "hbe267152ga235g4f46g9364gd10f3c22d190"
msgid "Time has rid these weapons of their bite. Must have taken decades."
msgstr "세월에 이 무기들의 이가 다 나갔어. 수십 년은 지났겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SawRustyWeapons
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 480d1060-bd87-478b-bf6a-5b1fd8c73c3a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SawRustyWeapons:480d1060-bd87-478b-bf6a-5b1fd8c73c3a
msgctxt "he1ae3553g2967g4816g977fg606d8004ea30"
msgid "Rust, rust, and more rust. How old are these things?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SawRustyWeapons
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 480d1060-bd87-478b-bf6a-5b1fd8c73c3a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SawRustyWeapons:480d1060-bd87-478b-bf6a-5b1fd8c73c3a
msgctxt "h2e9df101gcb3eg4437g86aag4833f28622f2"
msgid "Useless. Time has ravaged these weapons well beyond repair."
msgstr "쓸모없어. 너무 오랜 시간이 지나 수리하기도 무리야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SawRustyWeapons
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 480d1060-bd87-478b-bf6a-5b1fd8c73c3a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SawRustyWeapons:480d1060-bd87-478b-bf6a-5b1fd8c73c3a
msgctxt "hca501fd1g3d6fg46e9gbbbcgaeaefc872465"
msgid "Covered in rust. Some time's past since this place had its heyday."
msgstr "녹으로 덮여있군. 이 장소의 전성기는 한참 지났어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SawRustyWeapons
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 480d1060-bd87-478b-bf6a-5b1fd8c73c3a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SawRustyWeapons:480d1060-bd87-478b-bf6a-5b1fd8c73c3a
msgctxt "hec294695gf58cg4d26gad64g5622940d487c"
msgid "How old are these weapons? They're as rusty as wet nails."
msgstr "이 무기들이 얼마나 오래된 거야? 젖은 못처럼 녹슬었잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SawRustyWeapons
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 480d1060-bd87-478b-bf6a-5b1fd8c73c3a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SawRustyWeapons:480d1060-bd87-478b-bf6a-5b1fd8c73c3a
msgctxt "h3b5f7b73gaca5g4694gb60agaed96ac201c1"
msgid "Weapons. And time has taken their edge, it seems."
msgstr "무기들이군. 보아하니 세월에 이가 다 나가버린 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SawRustyWeapons
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 480d1060-bd87-478b-bf6a-5b1fd8c73c3a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SawRustyWeapons:480d1060-bd87-478b-bf6a-5b1fd8c73c3a
msgctxt "h3252157cg549cg44c7g80a6geabe4e08bc59"
msgid "Half rust - whoever owned those weapons has been gone for some time."
msgstr "반은 녹이군 - 이 무기의 주인이 누구였든 간에, 한참 전에 떠났군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26433786-603a-2524-00f6-6f67ed21a04a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_State_ScryingEyeSeen = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye:26433786-603a-2524-00f6-6f67ed21a04a
msgctxt "h38dcd2f2ge82cg4a27ga4c7g344afcbed5e6"
msgid ""
"Another scrying eye, same as the one skulking around the goblins' camp. "
"Someone's watching."
msgstr "감시하는 수정구가 더 있어. 고블린 야영지 주변을 돌아다니던 것과 같은 놈이군. 누군가 지켜보고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26433786-603a-2524-00f6-6f67ed21a04a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_State_ScryingEyeSeen = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye:26433786-603a-2524-00f6-6f67ed21a04a
msgctxt "h3b83bdbag872eg4b7fg800fg726c82dd7148"
msgid "Yet another scrying eye. Someone's keeping a close watch on the place."
msgstr "또 다른 감시하는 수정구야. 누군가 이곳을 면밀히 감시하고 있군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26433786-603a-2524-00f6-6f67ed21a04a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_State_ScryingEyeSeen = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye:26433786-603a-2524-00f6-6f67ed21a04a
msgctxt "he732942cg07b0g41eegad24g073dbe66a804"
msgid "Same sort of eye we saw in the goblin camp. Someone's keeping tabs."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26433786-603a-2524-00f6-6f67ed21a04a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_State_ScryingEyeSeen = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye:26433786-603a-2524-00f6-6f67ed21a04a
msgctxt "hdf109befga930g4392gaf20g0470c6ebd59b"
msgid ""
"A scrying eye. One roamed the goblin settlement, if I recall. Someone's "
"watching us."
msgstr "감시하는 수정구야. 내 기억으로는, 고블린 정착지를 배회하던 것인데. 누군가가 우리를 감시하고 있군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26433786-603a-2524-00f6-6f67ed21a04a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_State_ScryingEyeSeen = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye:26433786-603a-2524-00f6-6f67ed21a04a
msgctxt "h0fcd5363gfa89g42d2gb5cegd4edd1e4ed58"
msgid "Another eye - same as in the goblin camp. Someone's watching from afar."
msgstr "수정구가 더 있군. 고블린 야영지에 있던 것과 같은 거야. 누군가 멀리서 지켜보고 있군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26433786-603a-2524-00f6-6f67ed21a04a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_State_ScryingEyeSeen = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye:26433786-603a-2524-00f6-6f67ed21a04a
msgctxt "h46cc7cdcg7735g4fd7g9b66g76f988aa3bfe"
msgid ""
"A scrying eye, just like the goblins had. No telling who's looking through "
"it."
msgstr "감시하는 수정구야. 고블린들이 갖고 있던 것과 같군. 저 뒤에서 누가 지켜보고 있는진 알 수 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26433786-603a-2524-00f6-6f67ed21a04a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_State_ScryingEyeSeen = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye:26433786-603a-2524-00f6-6f67ed21a04a
msgctxt "hc2d6082cg756cg4a08gad6eg2e6e3a8eb1b0"
msgid "Another scrying eye, same as the goblins had. Someone's watching."
msgstr "감시하는 수정구가 더 있어. 고블린 야영지에 있던 것과 같군. 누군가 지켜보고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26a8e5c0-b2e3-4540-a2a5-100bfdb95510
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye:26a8e5c0-b2e3-4540-a2a5-100bfdb95510
msgctxt "h2cfeef2dg55dbg4771ga7f4gf9aa3852d11c"
msgid "A scrying eye. Someone's watching this place."
msgstr "감시하는 수정구군. 누군가 이곳을 지켜보고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26a8e5c0-b2e3-4540-a2a5-100bfdb95510
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye:26a8e5c0-b2e3-4540-a2a5-100bfdb95510
msgctxt "hdb607112g1cc8g4f28gbd0cga1b9f163f82e"
msgid "That's a scrying eye. Someone's monitoring the place."
msgstr "저건 감시하는 수정구야. 누군가 이곳을 감시하고 있군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26a8e5c0-b2e3-4540-a2a5-100bfdb95510
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye:26a8e5c0-b2e3-4540-a2a5-100bfdb95510
msgctxt "h0c9395fagf624g4ee5ga046g6b48912e4c8d"
msgid "Someone's watching us through that scrying eye."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26a8e5c0-b2e3-4540-a2a5-100bfdb95510
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye:26a8e5c0-b2e3-4540-a2a5-100bfdb95510
msgctxt "he2e8efbfgda92g4293ga8fdg46dce1e1a69d"
msgid "There - a scrying eye. Someone's keeping a close watch on this place."
msgstr "저길 봐, 감시하는 수정구야. 누군가 이곳을 면밀히 감시하고 있군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26a8e5c0-b2e3-4540-a2a5-100bfdb95510
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye:26a8e5c0-b2e3-4540-a2a5-100bfdb95510
msgctxt "hf7f98d04g7d14g4d54ga442g106b090d7746"
msgid "A scrying eye - someone's watching through it. Better be careful."
msgstr "감시하는 수정구야, 누군가 저걸 통해 지켜보고 있군. 조심하는 편이 좋겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26a8e5c0-b2e3-4540-a2a5-100bfdb95510
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye:26a8e5c0-b2e3-4540-a2a5-100bfdb95510
msgctxt "ha6fcef24g81a0g49b5ga15egf5da4d5b0ef8"
msgid "That orb - a scrying eye. No telling who's watching through it."
msgstr "저 보주, 저건 감시하는 수정구야. 그 뒤에서 누가 감시하고 있는지는 모르겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26a8e5c0-b2e3-4540-a2a5-100bfdb95510
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye:26a8e5c0-b2e3-4540-a2a5-100bfdb95510
msgctxt "h25acfc91g0cf6g4991gaa7bgf158d403cfea"
msgid "A scrying eye. Wonder who's looking through it."
msgstr "감시하는 수정구군. 저 뒤에서 누가 지켜보고 있을지 궁금한데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6371664b-07df-4706-a81d-22f9286d502f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye:6371664b-07df-4706-a81d-22f9286d502f
msgctxt "h43129154g093cg47fdg9f55g09cea411a020"
msgid "A scrying eye. Someone's watching."
msgstr "감시하는 수정구야. 누군가 지켜보고 있군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6371664b-07df-4706-a81d-22f9286d502f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye:6371664b-07df-4706-a81d-22f9286d502f
msgctxt "h1c31b759ga07bg4bfdg88d0gfd31e358f1b0"
msgid "That's a scrying eye. Someone's monitoring the place."
msgstr "저건 감시하는 수정구야. 누군가 이곳을 감시하고 있군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6371664b-07df-4706-a81d-22f9286d502f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye:6371664b-07df-4706-a81d-22f9286d502f
msgctxt "he2c17d7egc975g450agbee1gbd121eb7d1d3"
msgid ""
"That's no regular floating eyeball. Someone's watching us from the other "
"side."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6371664b-07df-4706-a81d-22f9286d502f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye:6371664b-07df-4706-a81d-22f9286d502f
msgctxt "h1820afbdg8e9bg4bfagbf38g29e3bb4c5b4b"
msgid "See that orb? A scrying eye. Someone's watching us."
msgstr "저 보주 보여? 감시하는 수정구야. 누군가 우릴 지켜보고 있군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6371664b-07df-4706-a81d-22f9286d502f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye:6371664b-07df-4706-a81d-22f9286d502f
msgctxt "h1816d050gd681g4bb8ga9f6gfbdbbc6455cf"
msgid "A scrying eye. Someone's watching from afar."
msgstr "감시하는 수정구야. 누군가 멀리서 우릴 지켜보고 있군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6371664b-07df-4706-a81d-22f9286d502f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye:6371664b-07df-4706-a81d-22f9286d502f
msgctxt "h429a2bbcg9536g42c3ga449ga5c718e89e74"
msgid ""
"Is that a scrying eye floating about? No telling who's looking through it."
msgstr "저기 떠다니는 게 감시하는 수정구인가? 뒤에서 누가 지켜보고 있을진 알 수가 없군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6371664b-07df-4706-a81d-22f9286d502f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye:6371664b-07df-4706-a81d-22f9286d502f
msgctxt "h4ff7c8a2gd5d5g4c3cg8978gfaf2ca58d225"
msgid "That orb - it's a scrying eye. Someone's watching."
msgstr "저 보주 - 저건 감시하는 수정구야. 누군가 지켜보고 있군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7238e632-64ae-a0d3-64ff-33cbbf70028f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye:7238e632-64ae-a0d3-64ff-33cbbf70028f
msgctxt "h93daefdfgd619g4180gb008geed3a93556f0"
msgid "Let's not make a scene, then."
msgstr "그럼 너무 눈에 띄는 짓은 하지 말자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7238e632-64ae-a0d3-64ff-33cbbf70028f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye:7238e632-64ae-a0d3-64ff-33cbbf70028f
msgctxt "he71fea77g0a4cg4237g8791g6a5844d7316d"
msgid "Best be on our guard."
msgstr "경계를 유지해야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7238e632-64ae-a0d3-64ff-33cbbf70028f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye:7238e632-64ae-a0d3-64ff-33cbbf70028f
msgctxt "hefcdcabbgf0bdg4bccg9cbeg84720d38839c"
msgid "Flat to the wall."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7238e632-64ae-a0d3-64ff-33cbbf70028f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye:7238e632-64ae-a0d3-64ff-33cbbf70028f
msgctxt "h6bab2674g1a81g4f1cga355g6628af84d9a5"
msgid "Be wary - and do not draw its attention."
msgstr "조심해, 주의를 끌지 말도록 하자."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7238e632-64ae-a0d3-64ff-33cbbf70028f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye:7238e632-64ae-a0d3-64ff-33cbbf70028f
msgctxt "h6b5d93c0gb1e6g4a68gbeddg2cf2485e8db7"
msgid "Better be careful around it."
msgstr "주변에선 조심해야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7238e632-64ae-a0d3-64ff-33cbbf70028f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye:7238e632-64ae-a0d3-64ff-33cbbf70028f
msgctxt "h6209041dg2b70g46a1g8d15g9dc774b32a19"
msgid "Keep your distance. We don't want more trouble than we can handle."
msgstr "거리를 유지해. 감당할 수 없는 상황을 만들면 안 되니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7238e632-64ae-a0d3-64ff-33cbbf70028f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye:7238e632-64ae-a0d3-64ff-33cbbf70028f
msgctxt "h13a00f5cga5d0g440cgafb6gedb558243671"
msgid "Best to stay out of its way."
msgstr "저 주변에 있으면 안 되겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce718162-5fd2-4830-aeec-f7f89951ed16
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_State_ScryingEyeSeen = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye:ce718162-5fd2-4830-aeec-f7f89951ed16
msgctxt "hf7640d3dg14c9g4955gbfbfg2f6b66e96020"
msgid "Another scrying eye, same as the one skulking around the goblins' camp."
msgstr "또 다른 감시하는 수정구야. 고블린 야영지에 있던 것과 같은 것이로군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce718162-5fd2-4830-aeec-f7f89951ed16
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_State_ScryingEyeSeen = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye:ce718162-5fd2-4830-aeec-f7f89951ed16
msgctxt "h173fbebbg5cfdg4b6fg9a44g9ad0d2e26a77"
msgid ""
"Yet another scrying eye. They were keeping a close watch on the goblins as "
"well."
msgstr "감시하는 수정구가 또 있군. 고블린들도 철저히 감시하고 있었는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce718162-5fd2-4830-aeec-f7f89951ed16
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_State_ScryingEyeSeen = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye:ce718162-5fd2-4830-aeec-f7f89951ed16
msgctxt "hfb771550g938eg483dgbe4bg7d046b378c9c"
msgid "Another big ol' eye. Wonder who's watching?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce718162-5fd2-4830-aeec-f7f89951ed16
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_State_ScryingEyeSeen = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye:ce718162-5fd2-4830-aeec-f7f89951ed16
msgctxt "h78ece09fgf4dcg4e23gaaf2g6d7be4fcfebd"
msgid "Another scrying eye. Someone's keeping a close watch on this place."
msgstr "다른 감시하는 수정구야. 누군가 이 장소를 면밀히 감시하고 있군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce718162-5fd2-4830-aeec-f7f89951ed16
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_State_ScryingEyeSeen = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye:ce718162-5fd2-4830-aeec-f7f89951ed16
msgctxt "h2dce061eg46b5g4ee6g9f50g2e1d16403494"
msgid "Another scrying eye. Better be careful around it."
msgstr "다른 감시하는 수정구야. 주변에선 조심해야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce718162-5fd2-4830-aeec-f7f89951ed16
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_State_ScryingEyeSeen = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye:ce718162-5fd2-4830-aeec-f7f89951ed16
msgctxt "h6bae77cfg3defg4efcg924dg5f54edded19e"
msgid "A scrying eye, just like the goblins had. Who's watching, I wonder."
msgstr "감시하는 수정구야. 고블린들이 갖고 있던 것과 같아. 누가 지켜보고 있는 건지 궁금하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce718162-5fd2-4830-aeec-f7f89951ed16
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_State_ScryingEyeSeen = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SeenScryingEye:ce718162-5fd2-4830-aeec-f7f89951ed16
msgctxt "h840b03ddge819g48adg860eg366deb288de0"
msgid "Another scrying eye. Best to keep my distance."
msgstr "감시하는 수정구가 또 있어. 거리를 유지해야겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SharLift
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63747a9a-c12b-403e-bd3c-4f04a1c87ec4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SharLift:63747a9a-c12b-403e-bd3c-4f04a1c87ec4
msgctxt "h171730e9g8a49g4ad7gb175gc06ada79650d"
msgid "Impressive-looking ruins down there, but well out of reach."
msgstr "저 아래에 엄청난 광경의 폐허가 있군, 하지만 닿기에는 너무 먼 곳이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SharLift
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63747a9a-c12b-403e-bd3c-4f04a1c87ec4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SharLift:63747a9a-c12b-403e-bd3c-4f04a1c87ec4
msgctxt "h43988b21g7b96g49cfga634g0c010589242a"
msgid ""
"What's that down there? A temple? A palace? What a pity it's so hopelessly "
"out of reach..."
msgstr "저 아래엔 뭐가 있는 걸까? 신전? 궁전? 너무 멀어서 못 간다는 사실이 슬프군..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SharLift
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63747a9a-c12b-403e-bd3c-4f04a1c87ec4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SharLift:63747a9a-c12b-403e-bd3c-4f04a1c87ec4
msgctxt "hf0601ac8g019dg4218g9906g52cb3f3a867a"
msgid "Wow - impressive. Too bad we can't get down there."
msgstr "이야, 멋진데. 저 아래로 못 내려간다는 게 아쉬워."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SharLift
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63747a9a-c12b-403e-bd3c-4f04a1c87ec4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SharLift:63747a9a-c12b-403e-bd3c-4f04a1c87ec4
msgctxt "h102b065dgeb7cg471cgb002g58cbc15c15e5"
msgid "Is that a temple down there? A pity I cannot jump further."
msgstr "저 아래에 있는 건 신전인가? 더 멀리 도약할 수 없어서 아쉽네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SharLift
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63747a9a-c12b-403e-bd3c-4f04a1c87ec4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SharLift:63747a9a-c12b-403e-bd3c-4f04a1c87ec4
msgctxt "h8629f5dbg0b30g44bfg8219gfbda7171b93e"
msgid "Quite a sight - but I won't be able to get any closer this way."
msgstr "엄청난 광경이야, 하지만 이 길로는 더 가까이 다가갈 수 없겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SharLift
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63747a9a-c12b-403e-bd3c-4f04a1c87ec4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SharLift:63747a9a-c12b-403e-bd3c-4f04a1c87ec4
msgctxt "h6a2bbed2g18dfg4806ga12agfcf809b9e2d4"
msgid "A dead end by the looks of it - but what a view!"
msgstr "막다른 길인 것 같긴 한데, 저것 참 장관이네!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SharLift
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63747a9a-c12b-403e-bd3c-4f04a1c87ec4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_SharLift:63747a9a-c12b-403e-bd3c-4f04a1c87ec4
msgctxt "heaf0f169g5a40g4069g84edg101ce7fcee4e"
msgid "That's it, then. I can't jump any further."
msgstr "여기가 끝이군. 더 이상 도약할 순 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_TheHangingBridge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fd05f1c1-9642-4610-bba9-5d9f6e32febf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_TheHangingBridge:fd05f1c1-9642-4610-bba9-5d9f6e32febf
msgctxt "h8255e417gf1a6g470fg88bag5de9d4554126"
msgid "These drow are a statement. It's not like duergar to be so bold."
msgstr "이 드로우는 공개 서한이야. 이렇게 대담하다니, 듀에르가 답지 않은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_TheHangingBridge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fd05f1c1-9642-4610-bba9-5d9f6e32febf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_TheHangingBridge:fd05f1c1-9642-4610-bba9-5d9f6e32febf
msgctxt "h75bfde5ag38b8g44a2g8fb2g47beae82988f"
msgid ""
"Drow slaughtered like chickens in a butcher shop. Somebody's making a "
"statement."
msgstr "드로우가 도살장의 닭처럼 학살 당했군. 누군가 할 말이 있는 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_TheHangingBridge
#. Speaker = Player
