msgctxt "h4203814bgcbc7g450bgb22dge86e95447cea"
msgid "Gods, all these drow. Someone's trying to send a message."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_TheHangingBridge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fd05f1c1-9642-4610-bba9-5d9f6e32febf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_TheHangingBridge:fd05f1c1-9642-4610-bba9-5d9f6e32febf
msgctxt "ha44d4624g87ecg4482gaaa6g826b0a487e9f"
msgid "A drow corpse. A trophy - and a warning."
msgstr "드로우 시체군. 전리품이자 경고야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_TheHangingBridge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fd05f1c1-9642-4610-bba9-5d9f6e32febf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_TheHangingBridge:fd05f1c1-9642-4610-bba9-5d9f6e32febf
msgctxt "h72d44745g02e0g477cgb024g1b92143c0319"
msgid ""
"Displaying a drow corpse in the Underdark? Someone's trying to make a "
"statement..."
msgstr "언더다크에서 드로우 시체를 전시한다고? 누군가가 의미를 전달하고 싶었나..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_TheHangingBridge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fd05f1c1-9642-4610-bba9-5d9f6e32febf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_TheHangingBridge:fd05f1c1-9642-4610-bba9-5d9f6e32febf
msgctxt "hb5881e57g30b1g4e69g8f6ag1ec026a6ddd4"
msgid ""
"Holy hells - drow corpses laid out to dry. Message received, loud and clear."
msgstr "이런 젠장할, 드로우 시체를 말려놨어. 무슨 의미인지 아주 잘 알겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_TheHangingBridge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fd05f1c1-9642-4610-bba9-5d9f6e32febf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_DuergarCamp_PAD_TheHangingBridge:fd05f1c1-9642-4610-bba9-5d9f6e32febf
msgctxt "h09aff42bgc1d8g47b6gb123g5aea5d8e8a0e"
msgid "Dead drow, publicly displayed. The duergar are sending a message."
msgstr "드로우 시체군. 공개적으로 전시해 뒀어. 이 듀에르가들이 본보기를 보이는 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_FellDown
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 14240e52-f579-a400-db4b-4ff4f1e5cf72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_FellDown:14240e52-f579-a400-db4b-4ff4f1e5cf72
msgctxt "h0dbeb8e8gcd23g46f8g9dfcg49567021eba4"
msgid "Bloody Underdark. Even the mushrooms are out to get you."
msgstr "빌어먹을 언더다크. 버섯조차도 날 죽이려고 하잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_FellDown
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 14240e52-f579-a400-db4b-4ff4f1e5cf72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_FellDown:14240e52-f579-a400-db4b-4ff4f1e5cf72
msgctxt "h02ea586fgc6d4g4dd3g9f80g15eca544b99e"
msgid ""
"Can't trust one's eyes in the Underdark. Can't trust these mushrooms either."
msgstr "언더다크에선 시야를 믿을 수 없어. 이 버섯도 그렇고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_FellDown
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 14240e52-f579-a400-db4b-4ff4f1e5cf72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_FellDown:14240e52-f579-a400-db4b-4ff4f1e5cf72
msgctxt "hc905d94cg969cg4ec5g8f2dg8a781ba81b5d"
msgid "Fake shrooms! Deceit and danger..."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_FellDown
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 14240e52-f579-a400-db4b-4ff4f1e5cf72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_FellDown:14240e52-f579-a400-db4b-4ff4f1e5cf72
msgctxt "ha64e4b69g4048g49aega26bgcaa04956d019"
msgid "<i>Tsk'va!</i> Best to watch my step."
msgstr "<i>츠크'바!</i> 발 밑을 조심해야겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_FellDown
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 14240e52-f579-a400-db4b-4ff4f1e5cf72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_FellDown:14240e52-f579-a400-db4b-4ff4f1e5cf72
msgctxt "h9513ba6fg439bg44c1g826bg3639a006e1f1"
msgid "An illusion. Better tread carefully."
msgstr "환영이야. 발밑을 조심해야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_FellDown
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 14240e52-f579-a400-db4b-4ff4f1e5cf72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_FellDown:14240e52-f579-a400-db4b-4ff4f1e5cf72
msgctxt "hc680cc5ag6b1cg4233gbbf8gbd833ddcbe53"
msgid "Can't something just be what it appears to be? Just once?"
msgstr "그냥 좀 보이는 그대로면 안 되는 거야? 한 번이라도?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_FellDown
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 14240e52-f579-a400-db4b-4ff4f1e5cf72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_FellDown:14240e52-f579-a400-db4b-4ff4f1e5cf72
msgctxt "h1c57025bg4fa7g40bdg8aa8g8fc1ef7c4731"
msgid "<i>Tsk'va!</i> Best to watch my step."
msgstr "<i>츠크'바!</i> 발 밑을 조심해야겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_FellDown
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 14240e52-f579-a400-db4b-4ff4f1e5cf72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_UNDERDARK
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_FellDown:14240e52-f579-a400-db4b-4ff4f1e5cf72
msgctxt "he4e7c45ege857g4499g8d07g66a98e627f9d"
msgid "Mirror mushrooms. Step on the wrong one - and plummet to your death."
msgstr "거울 버섯이야. 발을 잘못 디뎠다간 지옥으로 곤두박질치겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_FellDown
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 14240e52-f579-a400-db4b-4ff4f1e5cf72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_FellDown:14240e52-f579-a400-db4b-4ff4f1e5cf72
msgctxt "h2bfef888gcf41g409bg8d94g1f12cec3430d"
msgid "Damn. Some of these mushrooms are illusions."
msgstr "망할. 이 버섯 중 일부는 환영이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_InactiveFairyRingApproached
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0674d0ce-2884-44ce-eb2e-004515eabd8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_FairyRings_Knows_Purpose = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_InactiveFairyRingApproached:0674d0ce-2884-44ce-eb2e-004515eabd8a
msgctxt "h61b153c3g58a3g4693g9050g95c17237b916"
msgid "That's not normal, is it? A perfect ring of mushrooms."
msgstr "이건 정상적이지 않지, 그렇지? 완벽한 버섯 고리."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_InactiveFairyRingApproached
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0674d0ce-2884-44ce-eb2e-004515eabd8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_FairyRings_Knows_Purpose = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_InactiveFairyRingApproached:0674d0ce-2884-44ce-eb2e-004515eabd8a
msgctxt "h0a56cc85g7cbag495ag8fefgb0ad9337144c"
msgid "Shroom ring. Do they always grow like that?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_InactiveFairyRingApproached
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0674d0ce-2884-44ce-eb2e-004515eabd8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_FairyRings_Knows_Purpose = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_InactiveFairyRingApproached:0674d0ce-2884-44ce-eb2e-004515eabd8a
msgctxt "h11a47238gc2b4g4991g9533ga09e9633d4db"
msgid "A circle of mushrooms. The teachings made no mention of this."
msgstr "버섯들의 공동체라. 가르침에선 언급하지 않았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_InactiveFairyRingApproached
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0674d0ce-2884-44ce-eb2e-004515eabd8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_FairyRings_Knows_Purpose = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_InactiveFairyRingApproached:0674d0ce-2884-44ce-eb2e-004515eabd8a
msgctxt "h89b28930gdaebg41a2g80ecga0fe7def135a"
msgid "Mushrooms growing in a perfectly neat circle? Curious."
msgstr "버섯이 완벽하게 깔끔한 원형으로 자라고 있다니? 궁금하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_InactiveFairyRingApproached
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0674d0ce-2884-44ce-eb2e-004515eabd8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_FairyRings_Knows_Purpose = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_InactiveFairyRingApproached:0674d0ce-2884-44ce-eb2e-004515eabd8a
msgctxt "h53fed582g7a77g43fcg8914gfebe818e4d3c"
msgid "Hm - those mushrooms are arranged in a circle. Is that normal?"
msgstr "흠 - 저 버섯들이 원형으로 배열되어 있네. 정상인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_InactiveFairyRingApproached
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0674d0ce-2884-44ce-eb2e-004515eabd8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_FairyRings_Knows_Purpose = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_InactiveFairyRingApproached:0674d0ce-2884-44ce-eb2e-004515eabd8a
msgctxt "h1d86e32cg29b4g4971g88e4g2a858527cee0"
msgid "A perfect ring of mushrooms. That can hardly be a coincidence."
msgstr "완벽한 버섯 고리. 그건 우연이 아닐 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_InactiveFairyRingApproached
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0674d0ce-2884-44ce-eb2e-004515eabd8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_FairyRings_Knows_Purpose = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_InactiveFairyRingApproached:0674d0ce-2884-44ce-eb2e-004515eabd8a
msgctxt "hc8e27a58gcf05g4863g9ad4g0f2561cfeb18"
msgid "Those mushrooms have a curious symmetry."
msgstr "저 버섯들은 신기한 대칭을 가지고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_InactiveFairyRingApproached
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0674d0ce-2884-44ce-eb2e-004515eabd8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_FairyRings_Knows_Purpose = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_InactiveFairyRingApproached:0674d0ce-2884-44ce-eb2e-004515eabd8a
msgctxt "h6a70a366gfd59g4bb0gb093ge8ee417a1103"
msgid "A perfect ring of mushrooms. Nature or magic?"
msgstr "완벽한 버섯 고리. 자연적인걸까, 마법일까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_InactiveFairyRingApproached
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ac6c3813-b6d2-7997-ddb3-c0c393770118
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_FairyRings_Knows_Purpose = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_InactiveFairyRingApproached:ac6c3813-b6d2-7997-ddb3-c0c393770118
msgctxt "hc34fb28cg9e1cg4e49ga945ge7f04bae4230"
msgid "No glow? How dull."
msgstr "빛이 안 나? 얼마나 칙칙해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_InactiveFairyRingApproached
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ac6c3813-b6d2-7997-ddb3-c0c393770118
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_FairyRings_Knows_Purpose = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_InactiveFairyRingApproached:ac6c3813-b6d2-7997-ddb3-c0c393770118
msgctxt "h5ec6e8f9gc91cg4207ga216g28a8f983b41d"
msgid "Glow, fairy ring, glow! What's the matter with you?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_InactiveFairyRingApproached
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ac6c3813-b6d2-7997-ddb3-c0c393770118
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_FairyRings_Knows_Purpose = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_InactiveFairyRingApproached:ac6c3813-b6d2-7997-ddb3-c0c393770118
msgctxt "h2ded69fbg0566g42afgbf37g0f0dda35dc4d"
msgid "Another ring - but these mushrooms aren't glowing."
msgstr "또 다른 고리 - 하지만 이 버섯들은 빛나지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_InactiveFairyRingApproached
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ac6c3813-b6d2-7997-ddb3-c0c393770118
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_FairyRings_Knows_Purpose = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_InactiveFairyRingApproached:ac6c3813-b6d2-7997-ddb3-c0c393770118
msgctxt "h0082d3cdg8a2cg42a2g8ebag473ba32f2d36"
msgid "A fairy ring. It doesn't glow like the others though."
msgstr "요정 고리. 다른 것들처럼 빛나지 않네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_InactiveFairyRingApproached
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ac6c3813-b6d2-7997-ddb3-c0c393770118
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_FairyRings_Knows_Purpose = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_InactiveFairyRingApproached:ac6c3813-b6d2-7997-ddb3-c0c393770118
msgctxt "h1b9d6313g155dg4c29gb5b8gf3f73fb226fb"
msgid "These ones aren't glowing like the others. I wonder why."
msgstr "이 버섯들은 다른 것들처럼 빛나지 않네. 왜일까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_InactiveFairyRingApproached
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ac6c3813-b6d2-7997-ddb3-c0c393770118
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_FairyRings_Knows_Purpose = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_InactiveFairyRingApproached:ac6c3813-b6d2-7997-ddb3-c0c393770118
msgctxt "h372abd6cg70b5g49b2g8237gcb453122ef07"
msgid "This fairy ring looks disappointingly dormant."
msgstr "이 요정 고리는 실망스럽게도 휴면 상태로 보인다."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_InactiveFairyRingApproached
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ac6c3813-b6d2-7997-ddb3-c0c393770118
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_FairyRings_Knows_Purpose = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_InactiveFairyRingApproached:ac6c3813-b6d2-7997-ddb3-c0c393770118
msgctxt "h88c327abg6ef0g4ad9g9f9egee8af3e3e0bd"
msgid "Hm. This fairy ring isn't glowing like the rest."
msgstr "흠. 이 요정 고리는 나머지와 달리 빛나지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_InactiveFairyRingEntered
