msgid "Just once, I'd like to teleported to a nice feather bed."
msgstr "한 번이라도 털 침대로 순간이동 됐으면 좋겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_TeleportedFromHagToSwamp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = be90a946-4d97-2658-37f7-b0f2eb401243
