msgctxt "h1c8ca124g6b47g4079g953cg778a313baece"
msgid ""
"And so I'm back in the swamp. If only I could actually pick a destination."
msgstr "결국 다시 늪지대로 왔네. 목적지를 정할 수 있었다면 좋았을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_TeleportedFromHagToSwamp
