msgctxt "h6c4dd7a0g58a2g44a2gbf8fg1c5bcc3b9b15"
msgid "The hag's lair. It's a <i>bit </i>brighter than the Underdark, anyway."
msgstr "해그의 동굴이야. 어쨌건, 언더다크보다 <i>살짝</i> 밝아지긴 했네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_TeleportedFromUnderdarkToHag
