msgctxt "h6c44a9e8g0c9eg481cg9b4cg09ae6f0b3b5c"
msgid "The hag's lair. Would that I could kill her twice over."
msgstr "해그의 동굴이야. 다시 죽일 수 있을 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_TeleportedFromUnderdarkToHag
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e6cbb5cb-6ee2-a6ef-6df4-bad2cc93afaa
