#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_TeleportedFromUnderdarkToHag:e6cbb5cb-6ee2-a6ef-6df4-bad2cc93afaa
msgctxt "he79523eeg130fg412agb8e3g476043ceac0b"
msgid "The hag's lair. She must've had dealings in the Underdark."
msgstr "해그의 굴이야. 언더다크에 볼일이 있었나 보군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_TeleportedFromUnderdarkToHag
