msgctxt "ha51c1e9eg459bg4acbga6d5gc5504be9c7ba"
msgid "The hag's lair. Glad I don't have to deal with <i>her</i> again."
msgstr "해그의 동굴이야. <i>다시 </i>만날 일이 없어서 다행이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_TeleportedFromUnderdarkToHag
