msgctxt "hcd2991a5g3127g407ag8e50g4f7d3479728e"
msgid "Back in the hag's lair. Good thing she's dead."
msgstr "해그의 동굴로 돌아왔군. 그녀가 죽어 있어서 다행이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_TeleportedFromUnderdarkToSwamp
