msgctxt "h3f6e5f46g6d30g44e3g91c6ge0ef251f54d5"
msgid ""
"The hells? What's so important about these wetlands that it would lead here?"
msgstr "이건 도대체? 이 습지가 뭐가 그렇게 중요하길래 이곳으로 연결되는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_TeleportedFromUnderdarkToSwamp
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 056ebdff-ce1a-3a2b-1d28-1334257e07b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_TeleportedFromUnderdarkToSwamp:056ebdff-ce1a-3a2b-1d28-1334257e07b3
msgctxt "h317eb6d6gb1b1g4f2fg821bg557be971c5a8"
msgid ""
"Out of the Underdark and into the marshes - but still standing on this "
"middling rock."
msgstr "언더다크로 나와서 습지로 왔군. 하지만 여전히 이 바위 위에 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_TeleportedFromUnderdarkToSwamp
