msgctxt "h5cc89759g418dg4071g8129gecd47a4f96bd"
msgid "Out of the black and into the wetlands. Quite an improvement."
msgstr "어둠에서 나와 습지로 왔군. 상당히 나아졌어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_TeleportedFromUnderdarkToSwamp
