msgctxt "h4aa04dd5g5a5bg4b0aga632gb464e6bfcecd"
msgid "From the dark to the... damp. An improvement, either way."
msgstr "어둠을 벗어났더니... 축축함이군. 어쨌거나, 나아지긴 했어."

