msgid "Aaand I'm back in the Underdark. A shortcut worth remembering."
msgstr "그리고오 다시 언더다크로 돌아왔군. 간편한 지름길이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_TeleportedToUnderdark
