msgid "Stale air in a grim cave. This must be the Underdark."
msgstr "음산한 동굴에 퀴퀴한 공기라. 분명 언더다크겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FairyRings_PAD_TeleportedToUnderdark
