msgctxt "h8c1f2103g9716g43c5ga0e4g48495b380575"
msgid ""
"Here's the book he mentioned. Disguised by magic as... 'Flumph Mating "
"Rituals'? Hells..."
msgstr "그가 언급했던 책이네. 마법으로... '플럼프 교미 의식'으로 위장되어 있잖아? 망할..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal
