msgctxt "h090ed0f6g9e9cg44cegbcacg8c0033c77c8c"
msgid ""
"Aha! This must be the book that hides a book within. Let's take a closer "
"look."
msgstr "아하! 이게 바로 다른 내용을 숨기고 있다는 그 책이군. 좀 더 자세히 살펴보자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal
