msgctxt "h975c2a4dg8041g40f8gb47agb562aa3a9f36"
msgid ""
"Surely the book the drow corpse mentioned. A spell hides its true nature."
msgstr "이게 드로우가 언급했던 그 책이군. 주문으로 위장되어 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1ba43bda-35be-4bc1-9c84-15a89cf969f8
