msgctxt "hfb038e6fgbd8eg432fg9a0aga63e22a3d48b"
msgid ""
"This must be the book that dead drow spoke of. Magic's hiding its true "
"contents."
msgstr "이게 드로우가 언급했던 그 책인 게 분명해. 마법으로 진짜 내용을 숨겨 놓았군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1ba43bda-35be-4bc1-9c84-15a89cf969f8
