msgctxt "hf876b6d3g0a86g48d3g81d8gf47962512e5a"
msgid ""
"Must be the book the dead drow groaned about. Concealing spell's still "
"holding strong."
msgstr "저 죽은 드로우가 웅얼거렸던 책이 분명해. 위장 마법이 아직 강하게 걸려 있군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal
