msgctxt "hc425f967g5af8g4e1ag95dfg2d24b40f4459"
msgid ""
"The drow was right, it's not 'Flumph Mating Rituals'. Reminds me of 'Fables "
"of Forges Grym.'"
msgstr "그 드로우가 맞았어, 이건 '플럼프 교미 의식'이 아니야. '그림포지의 우화'가 생각나는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1ba43bda-35be-4bc1-9c84-15a89cf969f8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_Knows_JournalDisguised = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal:1ba43bda-35be-4bc1-9c84-15a89cf969f8
msgctxt "hffb89b16g58abg4e05gb149g679cd73d385f"
msgid "Ah - the drow corpse spoke of this book. Disguised by magic, it seems."
msgstr "아, 죽은 드로우가 언급했던 책이군. 보아하니, 마법으로 위장되어 있는 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9a31b6cf-1046-0f38-fe0e-b725931d47fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_Event_SucceedJournalArcana = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_FurnaceSearch_Knows_JournalDisguised = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal:9a31b6cf-1046-0f38-fe0e-b725931d47fe
msgctxt "h7fbd1af0g9ad9g4574ga0cag7d438a065082"
msgid ""
"There's a spell disguising this book. You're not really... 'Flumph Mating "
"Rituals', are you?"
msgstr "어떤 주문이 이 책을 위장하고 있어. 너 정말... '플럼프 교미 의식'이 아니지, 그렇지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9a31b6cf-1046-0f38-fe0e-b725931d47fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_Event_SucceedJournalArcana = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_FurnaceSearch_Knows_JournalDisguised = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal:9a31b6cf-1046-0f38-fe0e-b725931d47fe
msgctxt "hba2a5db3g699ag43d0gacc4g94fdf8bd597d"
msgid ""
"A spell of sorts is masking the book's true meaning. But I'm sure there's a "
"way around that..."
msgstr "어떤 주문이 이 책의 진짜 정체를 숨기고 있어. 하지만 분명 그걸 벗겨낼 방법이 있겠지..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9a31b6cf-1046-0f38-fe0e-b725931d47fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_Event_SucceedJournalArcana = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_FurnaceSearch_Knows_JournalDisguised = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal:9a31b6cf-1046-0f38-fe0e-b725931d47fe
msgctxt "h1b6e0e53g804eg4cf3ga1e2g6424c76aed5b"
msgid "I smell magic. What's this book <i>really?</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9a31b6cf-1046-0f38-fe0e-b725931d47fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_Event_SucceedJournalArcana = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_FurnaceSearch_Knows_JournalDisguised = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal:9a31b6cf-1046-0f38-fe0e-b725931d47fe
msgctxt "he6d7fda7ga59bg4811g9e48g7da17f5d2af2"
msgid ""
"How clever - a spell hides this book's true nature. Perhaps I can dispel it."
msgstr "영리하군, 주문이 이 책의 정체를 숨기고 있어. 내가 해제할 수도 있겠는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9a31b6cf-1046-0f38-fe0e-b725931d47fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_Event_SucceedJournalArcana = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_FurnaceSearch_Knows_JournalDisguised = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal:9a31b6cf-1046-0f38-fe0e-b725931d47fe
msgctxt "h2bfd4f71g5462g4ca3g8fa5g53c71f6ab37e"
msgid ""
"Mating Rituals? No... this book has something even juicier - hidden by a "
"spell."
msgstr "교미 의식이라고? 아니... 이 책은 훨씬 중요한 내용을 담고 있어, 주문으로 숨겨져 있군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9a31b6cf-1046-0f38-fe0e-b725931d47fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_Event_SucceedJournalArcana = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_FurnaceSearch_Knows_JournalDisguised = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal:9a31b6cf-1046-0f38-fe0e-b725931d47fe
msgctxt "h2a88fa0agd9e0g468cgb01bg885791ea41d0"
msgid "'Flumph Mating Rituals'? Not likely - this book's masked by magic."
msgstr "'플럼프 교미 의식'이라고? 그럴 리가 없어, 이 책은 마법으로 위장되어 있군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9a31b6cf-1046-0f38-fe0e-b725931d47fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_Event_SucceedJournalArcana = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_FurnaceSearch_Knows_JournalDisguised = True
#. TagRule: BARD
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal:9a31b6cf-1046-0f38-fe0e-b725931d47fe
msgctxt "h4e7fb2d6g4dc7g4972gbf6fga0eedaa87c23"
msgid ""
"Shame it's only pretending to be 'Flumph Mating Rituals'. That sounds "
"<i>fascinating</i>."
msgstr "'플럼프 교미 의식'이 위장이라니 아쉽네. 아주 <i>끝내줄</i> 것 같은데 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9a31b6cf-1046-0f38-fe0e-b725931d47fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_Event_SucceedJournalArcana = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - UND_FurnaceSearch_Knows_JournalDisguised = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal:9a31b6cf-1046-0f38-fe0e-b725931d47fe
msgctxt "h5f72b4b0g7abfg4cb3g92b3gae235d2a747b"
msgid "I sense magic. This book's not what it appears."
msgstr "마법이 느껴져. 이 책의 진짜 정체는 숨겨져 있군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ba82b29e-731b-3eaa-3f84-5aa222c46388
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal:ba82b29e-731b-3eaa-3f84-5aa222c46388
msgctxt "h526a03ecg7fb7g4592g96b4gae6cb608b793"
msgid "'Flumph Mating Rituals'? Interesting choice, but who am I to judge?"
msgstr "'플럼프 교미 의식'? 흥미로운 선택이네. 다만 내가 판단할 처지는 아니겠지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ba82b29e-731b-3eaa-3f84-5aa222c46388
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal:ba82b29e-731b-3eaa-3f84-5aa222c46388
msgctxt "h3787383bgf62ag4589g81a0gc98e35996a25"
msgid ""
"What's this? 'Flumph Mating Rituals'. Acquired taste, I'm sure, but not "
"mine. Nor a drow's I would have thought..."
msgstr "이건 뭐야? '플럼프 교미 의식'이라. 특이한 취향이네, 내 스타일은 아니야. 드로우의 취향일 것 같지도 않은데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ba82b29e-731b-3eaa-3f84-5aa222c46388
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal:ba82b29e-731b-3eaa-3f84-5aa222c46388
msgctxt "h0f6390c6gedffg4782g955cgf1ef1d312c52"
msgid "'Flumph Mating Rituals,' huh? Interesting."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ba82b29e-731b-3eaa-3f84-5aa222c46388
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal:ba82b29e-731b-3eaa-3f84-5aa222c46388
msgctxt "h9db693deg7ec1g4a39g8af5gdbeed061be27"
msgid ""
"A book on 'flumph' reproduction. The inhabitants of this plane hold peculiar "
"interests."
msgstr "'플럼프'의 재생산에 관한 책이라. 이 차원의 거주민들은 아주 특이한 취향을 지니고 있군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ba82b29e-731b-3eaa-3f84-5aa222c46388
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal:ba82b29e-731b-3eaa-3f84-5aa222c46388
msgctxt "h32573d31g9f65g4293gbcfage9da8c8ded1c"
msgid ""
"'Flumph Mating Rituals'...? That drow must've gotten <i>very</i> lonely down "
"here."
msgstr "'플럼프 교미 의식'...? 저 드로우 녀석 이 아래에서 아주 외로웠나 본데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ba82b29e-731b-3eaa-3f84-5aa222c46388
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal:ba82b29e-731b-3eaa-3f84-5aa222c46388
msgctxt "h50cb7b60g4fafg4705gaef8g4b648cc81766"
msgid "My my - 'Flumph Mating Rituals'? The drow had peculiar taste."
msgstr "이것 봐라, '플럼프 교미 의식'? 저 드로우는 아주 독특한 취향을 지녔군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ba82b29e-731b-3eaa-3f84-5aa222c46388
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal:ba82b29e-731b-3eaa-3f84-5aa222c46388
msgctxt "hbf71d2e1g1061g414egb0abg1587d8d7ad96"
msgid ""
"'Flumph Mating Rituals'? The people of this plane never fail to amuse me."
msgstr "'플럼프 교미 의식'? 이 차원의 사람들은 항상 나를 즐겁게 만드는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ba82b29e-731b-3eaa-3f84-5aa222c46388
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: BARD
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal:ba82b29e-731b-3eaa-3f84-5aa222c46388
msgctxt "hfbce3298g8069g4e61g8973g6ec529feeb9f"
msgid ""
"'Flumph Mating Rituals'? That field research must've been... "
"<i>interesting</i>."
msgstr "'플럼프 교미 의식'? 이 현장 조사는 분명 아주... <i>흥미로웠겠어</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ba82b29e-731b-3eaa-3f84-5aa222c46388
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_DisguisedJournal:ba82b29e-731b-3eaa-3f84-5aa222c46388
msgctxt "h247d0f0agb0dcg4528gb7bega7a13af172c6"
msgid "'Flumph Mating Rituals'. An odd book for a drow to carry."
msgstr "'플럼프 교미 의식'이라. 드로우가 가지고 다니는 책이라고 하기엔 이상하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_JournalTransformed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1073ec61-e8b2-fdbd-9c21-2d6e6ba105cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_Knows_JournalDisguised = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_JournalTransformed:1073ec61-e8b2-fdbd-9c21-2d6e6ba105cc
msgctxt "h97081a87gf36eg400eg9618g2128ee6794a4"
msgid ""
"That book on flumphs - it's changing. What were you hiding, you sneaky "
"little wizard?"
msgstr "플럼프에 관한 저 책, 그게 변하고 있어. 이 교묘한 위저드 녀석, 뭘 숨기고 있던 거냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_JournalTransformed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1073ec61-e8b2-fdbd-9c21-2d6e6ba105cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_Knows_JournalDisguised = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_JournalTransformed:1073ec61-e8b2-fdbd-9c21-2d6e6ba105cc
msgctxt "h3c541f58gc50fg46e7g8077g3abced689675"
msgid ""
"My, my. The tome on flumphs hid truer words behind its impostor ones. What a "
"clever feat of magic."
msgstr "이런, 이런. 플럼프에 관한 책이 진정한 정체를 숨기고 있었군. 아주 교묘한 마법이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_JournalTransformed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1073ec61-e8b2-fdbd-9c21-2d6e6ba105cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_Knows_JournalDisguised = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_JournalTransformed:1073ec61-e8b2-fdbd-9c21-2d6e6ba105cc
msgctxt "hf18a01b9gf573g4601g9d4dg916f1f8deded"
msgid "Well, well, what's this. That book wasn't what it seemed after all."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_JournalTransformed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1073ec61-e8b2-fdbd-9c21-2d6e6ba105cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_Knows_JournalDisguised = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_JournalTransformed:1073ec61-e8b2-fdbd-9c21-2d6e6ba105cc
msgctxt "hd3b34748gf506g406bg8088gcdd0cd6a5bef"
msgid ""
"<i>Chk</i> - seems magic concealed the true nature of 'Flumph Mating "
"Rituals'. Clever - almost."
msgstr "<i>츠크</i>. 이 '플럼프 교미 의식'은 마법으로 위장되어 있었던 것 같군. 영리해, 거의 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_JournalTransformed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1073ec61-e8b2-fdbd-9c21-2d6e6ba105cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_Knows_JournalDisguised = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_JournalTransformed:1073ec61-e8b2-fdbd-9c21-2d6e6ba105cc
msgctxt "h46c35116g9acag4498g8feeg4ee10dd0616f"
msgid ""
"The true contents of that book on flumphs were hidden by magic - ingenious."
msgstr "플럼프에 관한 이 책의 진정한 정체가 마법으로 숨겨져 있었어, 기발하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_JournalTransformed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1073ec61-e8b2-fdbd-9c21-2d6e6ba105cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_Knows_JournalDisguised = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_JournalTransformed:1073ec61-e8b2-fdbd-9c21-2d6e6ba105cc
msgctxt "h644d6ba0g996ag495ag9874g6fe95cda7f87"
msgid ""
"I'll be - 'Flumph Mating Rituals' was more than it appeared. Time for some "
"light reading."
msgstr "이것 봐라, '플럼프 교미 의식'이 보이는 것과는 다른 내용이었군. 잠깐 읽어볼까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_JournalTransformed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1073ec61-e8b2-fdbd-9c21-2d6e6ba105cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_Knows_JournalDisguised = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_JournalTransformed:1073ec61-e8b2-fdbd-9c21-2d6e6ba105cc
msgctxt "hd60ca1ebga081g420eg8f4cg682a9c966bf0"
msgid "Hells - seems that book on flumphs was not all it appeared to be."
msgstr "젠장, 보아하니 이 플럼프 책이 겉보기와는 다른 내용이었던 것 같네."

