msgctxt "h10869500g0d21g49a0gbf7eg7825fadb13bc"
msgid ""
"An adamantine forge? Sounds like the perfect place to find something "
"expensive."
msgstr "아다만틴 대장간이라고? 분명 값비싼 물건을 찾을 수 있을 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_LearnedForge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 85eb99e3-2684-4c11-a08b-1fed98f7bf48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
