msgctxt "h7ba72963g8b71g455dg9756gf212e9b8bfaa"
msgid ""
"There's mention here of an adamantine forge. Such would be a rare and "
"valuable find indeed."
msgstr "이곳에 아다만틴 대장간에 관한 내용이 언급돼 있어. 엄청나게 희귀하고 가치 있는 발견이 되겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_LearnedForge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 85eb99e3-2684-4c11-a08b-1fed98f7bf48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
