msgctxt "hcbb67562gf051g444eg8c81gf01c4ffda9c3"
msgid "What's an adamantine forge, then?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_LearnedForge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 85eb99e3-2684-4c11-a08b-1fed98f7bf48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_LearnedForge:85eb99e3-2684-4c11-a08b-1fed98f7bf48
msgctxt "hcf7ffccbg5592g4a38gab77geb5c2a983e54"
msgid ""
"An adamantine forge? Imagine the blades gith artisans might craft with such "
"a device."
msgstr "아다만틴 대장간이라니? 기스 장인들이 그런 장비가 있다면 얼마나 뛰어난 칼날을 만들어낼지 생각해 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_LearnedForge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 85eb99e3-2684-4c11-a08b-1fed98f7bf48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_LearnedForge:85eb99e3-2684-4c11-a08b-1fed98f7bf48
msgctxt "h90d76011g8ebfg4515gb45dge4c45882d688"
msgid "An adamantine forge? Curious."
msgstr "아다만틴 대장간이라? 흥미롭군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_LearnedForge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 85eb99e3-2684-4c11-a08b-1fed98f7bf48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_LearnedForge:85eb99e3-2684-4c11-a08b-1fed98f7bf48
msgctxt "hcaae9370gadbcg4757g9056g8c612b83a581"
msgid "An adamantine forge - the stuff of legends."
msgstr "아다만틴 대장간... 전설에서나 나오는 곳이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_LearnedForge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 85eb99e3-2684-4c11-a08b-1fed98f7bf48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: BARD
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_LearnedForge:85eb99e3-2684-4c11-a08b-1fed98f7bf48
msgctxt "hbe3509d1g3390g4a0bgbd3fg62d12bb4fbf2"
msgid ""
"I've heard of this forge... Legends reckon it had some sort of 'protector'."
msgstr "이 대장간에 대해서 들어본 적 있어... 전설에 따르면 어떤 '수호자'가 있다고 하던데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_LearnedForge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 85eb99e3-2684-4c11-a08b-1fed98f7bf48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_LearnedForge:85eb99e3-2684-4c11-a08b-1fed98f7bf48
msgctxt "hdd3a46c9gb52cg4dbdgbd81gcbbd2a2eb2ed"
msgid "An adamantine forge? Think of the masterworks that could be made there."
msgstr "아다만틴 대장간이라고? 그곳에서 만들어질 엄청난 장인들의 작품을 상상해 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords
