msgid "Nothing in these notes but nonsensical run-on sentences."
msgstr "여긴 말도 무의미하고 장황한 문장만 적혀있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords
