msgctxt "hd7918ec1gbd10g44d7gae53g459765d80e9d"
msgid "'Protector'? 'Magma'? Doesn't make a lick of sense."
msgstr "'수호자'? '마그마'? 하나도 말이 안 되는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0da9ecb2-23d9-9c87-ea55-573f2365c8f3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_Event_SucceedMadRecords = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords:0da9ecb2-23d9-9c87-ea55-573f2365c8f3
msgctxt "h5dd8ae6eg1efeg4458g89a6g02cbb4d69c5b"
msgid "A bunch of gibberish, as far as I can tell."
msgstr "내가 보기엔 그냥 헛소리 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 19e2aa7d-9d14-8305-5068-de78dfc6386a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_Event_SucceedMadRecords = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords:19e2aa7d-9d14-8305-5068-de78dfc6386a
msgctxt "h16bccb6bg8522g4b71g94deg33472529cf73"
msgid "Pity it's so light on details, mind. Mad gibberish..."
msgstr "세부 사항이 부족해서 아쉽네. 미치광이의 헛소리야..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 19e2aa7d-9d14-8305-5068-de78dfc6386a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
