#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_Event_SucceedMadRecords = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords:19e2aa7d-9d14-8305-5068-de78dfc6386a
msgctxt "h71a48e5ag5d1fg4dfagad73g437c3c8c1a9f"
msgid "But what of this 'hot hammer'? The author was surely mad."
msgstr "하지만 이 '뜨거운 망치'라는 건 뭐야? 저자가 확실히 정신이 나간 사람 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 19e2aa7d-9d14-8305-5068-de78dfc6386a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_Event_SucceedMadRecords = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords:19e2aa7d-9d14-8305-5068-de78dfc6386a
msgctxt "h3fdb4c4eg2084g47b0gbd35g3247d1e344e5"
msgid "There's more written here... no, must be gibberish."
msgstr "뭔가 더 적혀있는데... 아니, 분명 헛소리겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 19e2aa7d-9d14-8305-5068-de78dfc6386a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_Event_SucceedMadRecords = False
