msgctxt "h8c6a81dagf7fag4204ga906g2694b3226790"
msgid "Can't say I understand this bit about a 'hot hammer', though."
msgstr "이 '뜨거운 망치'라는 거에 대해선 하나도 알아들었다고는 못하겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords
