msgctxt "h0a69f669ge36bg4789g80eegd59fe9daea0b"
msgid ""
"A hidden adamantine forge? Imagine the blades you could produce with that."
msgstr "숨겨진 아다만틴 대장간? 이걸로 엄청난 무기들을 만들 수 있겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 42fa9e78-96c2-41c0-9e32-b8604dd0c88d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_State_LearnedForgeFromMadDrowFirst = True
