#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords:42fa9e78-96c2-41c0-9e32-b8604dd0c88d
msgctxt "h57c2e75ag4d2fg4032ga47bgc3dd80307458"
msgid ""
"These papers describe an adamantine forge hidden somewhere deep below. Such "
"a forge is a treasure vault where the treasure's for the making."
msgstr ""
"이 종이들이 저 아래 깊숙이 숨겨진 아다만틴 대장간을 묘사하고 있어. 이런 대장간들은 진정한 보물을 만들어내는 보물 창고나 마찬가지야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 42fa9e78-96c2-41c0-9e32-b8604dd0c88d
