#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_State_LearnedForgeFromMadDrowFirst = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords:42fa9e78-96c2-41c0-9e32-b8604dd0c88d
msgctxt "h253d0295g8bafg48b1g9c62g0e302476f5df"
msgid "According to these notes, there's an adamantine forge down here."
msgstr "이 노트들에 따르면, 이 아래에 아다만틴 대장간이 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5d48e9c6-eb66-6919-9bee-c7c7920c2192
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_Event_SucceedMadRecords = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords:5d48e9c6-eb66-6919-9bee-c7c7920c2192
msgctxt "h266f5cf6gc219g40f0gafd4gbc996bdab621"
msgid ""
"There is a guardian to take care of, of course. But all I need is a... 'hot "
"hammer'?"
msgstr "물론, 처리해야 할 수호병이 있겠지. 그런데... '뜨거운 망치' 가 필요할 거라고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5d48e9c6-eb66-6919-9bee-c7c7920c2192
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_Event_SucceedMadRecords = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords:5d48e9c6-eb66-6919-9bee-c7c7920c2192
msgctxt "hfdb5c24bg2a53g4862ga74cg33373167af8c"
msgid ""
"An adamantine forge is very much a treasure, and any good treasure is "
"protected by a guardian. Looks like we can defeat it with a so-called 'hot "
"hammer'."
msgstr ""
"아다만틴 대장간은 보물 창고나 다름없어, 그리고 모든 보물 창고는 수호병이 지키고 있지. '뜨거운 망치' 라는걸 이용하면 물리칠 수 "
"있다는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5d48e9c6-eb66-6919-9bee-c7c7920c2192
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_Event_SucceedMadRecords = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords:5d48e9c6-eb66-6919-9bee-c7c7920c2192
msgctxt "h5750fe51g561ag4e06gb716gefb064100faf"
msgid ""
"Interesting. Whatever's guarding the forge, a 'hot hammer' can crack it."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5d48e9c6-eb66-6919-9bee-c7c7920c2192
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_Event_SucceedMadRecords = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords:5d48e9c6-eb66-6919-9bee-c7c7920c2192
msgctxt "hc630a77cg0c12g42beg9100g9587c33ca316"
msgid "It boasts a 'protector' of some sort, something weak to a 'hot hammer'."
msgstr "'뜨거운 망치'에 취약하다는 '수호자'인지 뭔지를 자랑하고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5d48e9c6-eb66-6919-9bee-c7c7920c2192
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_Event_SucceedMadRecords = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords:5d48e9c6-eb66-6919-9bee-c7c7920c2192
msgctxt "h55a0a1eag28cdg4584g9d81ge551039faf81"
msgid ""
"Seems it's got a protector... one vulnerable to a 'hot hammer', whatever "
"that is."
msgstr "수호자가 있는 것 같은데... 뭔진 모르겠지만 '뜨거운 망치'라는 거에 취약하다는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5d48e9c6-eb66-6919-9bee-c7c7920c2192
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_Event_SucceedMadRecords = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords:5d48e9c6-eb66-6919-9bee-c7c7920c2192
msgctxt "h55e2b2e3g6d6cg4392ga213g08981f2c824f"
msgid ""
"This 'protector' sounds weak to extreme heat. Something to keep in mind."
msgstr "이 '수호자'가 극한의 열기에 약한 것 같은데. 기억해 두면 쓸만하겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5d48e9c6-eb66-6919-9bee-c7c7920c2192
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_Event_SucceedMadRecords = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords:5d48e9c6-eb66-6919-9bee-c7c7920c2192
msgctxt "h92065eb1g40a9g434eg936agd79d07125288"
msgid ""
"A protector is guarding it, if I'm reading this right. And this 'hot hammer' "
"is key to its downfall."
msgstr "내가 제대로 읽은 거라면, 수호자가 그곳을 지키고 있어. 그리고 이 '뜨거운 망치'가 그걸 쓰러뜨리기 위한 핵심인 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7cdbe985-786e-55a2-e46b-9029241096c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_Event_SucceedMadRecords = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords:7cdbe985-786e-55a2-e46b-9029241096c8
msgctxt "had05499fgf9b1g47d7ga1deg0ac488df7ebe"
msgid ""
"I would've appreciated more details, personally. The rest of the note reads "
"like gibberish."
msgstr "개인적으론 조금 더 상세히 적어뒀으면 좋았을 것 같은데. 나머지 부분은 죄다 헛소리잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7cdbe985-786e-55a2-e46b-9029241096c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_Event_SucceedMadRecords = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords:7cdbe985-786e-55a2-e46b-9029241096c8
msgctxt "h3abb92ebg3a38g49deg8d45gfd212c24d3b5"
msgid ""
"The reference to a 'hot hammer' is rather puzzling though. Whoever wrote "
"these papers must have been rather delirious."
msgstr "하지만 '뜨거운 망치'에 대한 언급은 꽤 의아하네. 이걸 쓴 사람이 누구였는진 모르겠지만, 정신이 나간 사람 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7cdbe985-786e-55a2-e46b-9029241096c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_Event_SucceedMadRecords = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords:7cdbe985-786e-55a2-e46b-9029241096c8
msgctxt "hce5a10e1g26ddg4bd3g89fdg463f5e417e00"
msgid "Can't make heads nor tails of the rest of it."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7cdbe985-786e-55a2-e46b-9029241096c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_Event_SucceedMadRecords = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords:7cdbe985-786e-55a2-e46b-9029241096c8
msgctxt "h3f2e1ffbg9ce2g4e48g9405g3f86cb0d7687"
msgid "But what is this nonsense about a 'hot hammer'? Mad ravings, surely."
msgstr "그런데 이 '뜨거운 망치'라는 건 도대체 뭐야? 확실히 미치광이의 헛소리 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7cdbe985-786e-55a2-e46b-9029241096c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_Event_SucceedMadRecords = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords:7cdbe985-786e-55a2-e46b-9029241096c8
msgctxt "h6b01aa93g081eg4dbegb8b1gb55236db2221"
msgid ""
"There's more written about it... scrawled, more like. I can't figure it out."
msgstr "뭔가 더 적혀 있는데... 거의 낙서로군. 알아볼 수가 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7cdbe985-786e-55a2-e46b-9029241096c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_Event_SucceedMadRecords = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords:7cdbe985-786e-55a2-e46b-9029241096c8
msgctxt "ha8812449g8091g4f3dga036g1fa7a6f0c6eb"
msgid "But what's this about a 'hot hammer'? Doesn't make a lick of sense."
msgstr "그런데 이 '뜨거운 망치'라는 건 도대체 뭐야? 전혀 말이 안 되잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7cdbe985-786e-55a2-e46b-9029241096c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_Event_SucceedMadRecords = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords:7cdbe985-786e-55a2-e46b-9029241096c8
msgctxt "h70ccd8ecg2d73g4a3ag8492g5b01f43ade44"
msgid "The rest of the note is pure gibberish, as far as I can tell."
msgstr "나머지 부분은 완전히 헛소리야, 적어도 내가 보기엔 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = be77f2df-209c-4b69-a5de-c0a61dafe1e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_FurnaceSearch_Event_SucceedMadRecords = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords:be77f2df-209c-4b69-a5de-c0a61dafe1e2
msgctxt "hf52e329bg6135g49d1gbc0agf0ffcd467bd4"
msgid ""
"There is a guardian to take care of, of course. But all we need is a... 'hot "
"hammer'?"
msgstr "처리할 수호자가 있군, 물론 그렇겠지. 하지만 그걸 위해서... '뜨거운 망치'가 필요하다고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = be77f2df-209c-4b69-a5de-c0a61dafe1e2
