msgctxt "h648e38fag954cg4525g86d6g532f6aa40091"
msgid ""
"An adamantine forge is very much a treasure, and any good treasure is "
"protected by a guardian. Looks like we can defeat it with a so-called 'hot "
"hammer'."
msgstr ""
"아다만틴 대장간은 보물 창고나 다름없어, 그리고 모든 보물 창고는 수호병이 지키고 있지. '뜨거운 망치' 라는걸 이용하면 물리칠 수 "
"있다는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_FurnaceSearch_PAD_MadRecords
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = be77f2df-209c-4b69-a5de-c0a61dafe1e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
