msgctxt "hbe2ffaabg0034g4e0dgb09cgaaa8d80d3751"
msgid ""
"A merregon mask, no less. Hells' footsoldiers - their bodies disintegrate, "
"leaving only these behind."
msgstr "메레곤 가면이야, 틀림없어. 지옥의 보병이지, 놈들의 신체가 분해되면, 오직 저 가면만이 남아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MerregonMask_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0f567040-d397-4fc9-8399-0fcca37f407c
