#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MerregonMask_PAD:0f567040-d397-4fc9-8399-0fcca37f407c
msgctxt "h2fbcd778gee68g4546gb1d3g4511d08b06bd"
msgid ""
"It belonged to a merregon. They dissolve upon death, leaving only their "
"masks behind."
msgstr "이건 메레곤의 것이군. 그들은 죽을 때 가면만 남기고 사라져."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MerregonMask_PAD
