msgctxt "h329a3108g918fg4ce3g87b9ga08862b79e28"
msgid ""
"Wait, this is a <i>merregon's </i>mask. Warriors of the Nine Hells - they "
"disintegrate when they die."
msgstr "잠깐, 이건 <i>메레곤의 </i>가면이잖아. 아홉 지옥의 전사들이지, 놈들은 죽으면 분해되어 버려."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MerregonMask_PAD
