#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h5d6c852fg0d81g4f47gb862gdc892f4e9f01"
msgid ""
"A merregon's mask, I wager. Hell's soldiers. When they die, their bodies "
"just... melt away."
msgstr "메레곤의 가면인 것 같은데. 지옥의 병사들이지. 놈들이 죽으면, 몸이 그냥... 녹아버린다던데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MerregonMask_PAD
