msgctxt "h0dbc72abga7c5g4049g9904g2c554a0c9fb1"
msgid "Sadly, 'cute' alone isn't worth much."
msgstr "슬프게도, '귀엽네' 정도론 부족해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MerregonMask_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 348cc34d-c029-4fa0-83f8-2b16044d2a07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MerregonMask_PAD:348cc34d-c029-4fa0-83f8-2b16044d2a07
msgctxt "h3d49a627ge82eg462fg83e7g1dd4c27fb894"
msgid "Oh well, a minor mystery it must remain."
msgstr "할 수 없지, 작은 수수께끼로 남아야겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MerregonMask_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 348cc34d-c029-4fa0-83f8-2b16044d2a07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MerregonMask_PAD:348cc34d-c029-4fa0-83f8-2b16044d2a07
msgctxt "hf679d2d8g615dg4caega7dag1723e11beaec"
msgid "I must have skipped the chapter on these at school."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MerregonMask_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 348cc34d-c029-4fa0-83f8-2b16044d2a07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MerregonMask_PAD:348cc34d-c029-4fa0-83f8-2b16044d2a07
msgctxt "h9c7ff1d7g9c40g4092g9bf3g4f6f12ba1289"
msgid "I've never encountered such a thing, even in wildspace."
msgstr "이런 건 본 적이 없어, 와일드스페이스에서조차 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MerregonMask_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 348cc34d-c029-4fa0-83f8-2b16044d2a07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MerregonMask_PAD:348cc34d-c029-4fa0-83f8-2b16044d2a07
msgctxt "h5e28aa89g2609g463dg94f8ge4f8f8c963b9"
msgid ""
"Perhaps the creatures of the Underdark had a masquerade ball. I'd like to "
"see that."
msgstr "언더다크의 생명체끼리 가면무도회라도 벌였나 보네. 한번 보고 싶은걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MerregonMask_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 348cc34d-c029-4fa0-83f8-2b16044d2a07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MerregonMask_PAD:348cc34d-c029-4fa0-83f8-2b16044d2a07
msgctxt "h6c133c69g26d7g430egbaf6ged80bbe9d235"
msgid "Who would make a metal mask like this? Or wear it?"
msgstr "이런 강철 가면은 누가 만든 거야? 이런 걸 쓰는 사람이 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MerregonMask_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 348cc34d-c029-4fa0-83f8-2b16044d2a07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_UNDERDARK
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MerregonMask_PAD:348cc34d-c029-4fa0-83f8-2b16044d2a07
msgctxt "hcdaa3fdbg5e5bg4679g93dag637029499da2"
msgid "I don't know the alloy. Perhaps it came from the surface."
msgstr "무슨 합금으로 만든 건지 모르겠네. 지상에서 온 것일지도 모르겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MerregonMask_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 348cc34d-c029-4fa0-83f8-2b16044d2a07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MerregonMask_PAD:348cc34d-c029-4fa0-83f8-2b16044d2a07
msgctxt "h58b15e0ag9cb0g4aebg8e17g667c5cfef7e8"
msgid "I've never seen anything like it."
msgstr "이런 건 생전 처음 보는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MerregonMask_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
