#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MerregonMask_PAD:35c67a5f-34d9-4de5-8117-6b6eb0044322
msgctxt "hc6a7be36gccd1g4b5eg9b22gc56701a86608"
msgid "Merely merregons, however. Their commander might still be at large."
msgstr "하지만, 그저 메레곤일 뿐이야. 놈들의 지휘관은 아직 살아있을지도 몰라."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MerregonMask_PAD
