msgid "An unusual metal. Too heavy to wear comfortably."
msgstr "묘한 금속이야. 편히 쓰기엔 너무 무거운데."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MerregonMask_PAD
