msgctxt "ha126a9d0g8f92g45ffg8d26g8592711d7c19"
msgid ""
"Hmm - a merregon's, most likely. An infernal battle was fought here. But "
"what of the commander?"
msgstr "흠, 메레곤인 것 같은데. 이곳에서 지옥의 전투가 벌어졌군. 하지만 지휘관은 어디에 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MerregonMask_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a78b4723-e46b-450f-b7ab-8afd84dd9b30
