msgid "Interesting mask. I quite like the design."
msgstr "흥미로운 가면인데. 디자인이 마음에 들어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MerregonMask_PAD
