msgctxt "hd64aed50gbd80g48a2g90fdg1428f046407a"
msgid "The lava shouldn't be <i>this </i>volatile. Something's wrong."
msgstr "용암은 원래 <i>이렇게까지 </i>불안정하지 않은데. 뭔가 잘못됐어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MonkAmulet_PAD_EnteredLavaLake
