msgctxt "hdc0bc931ge3c7g4564ga80ag022642bed93d"
msgid "Lava doesn't flare up like that for no reason. Something's amiss here."
msgstr "용암은 아무 이유 없이 저렇게 타오르지 않아. 여긴 뭔가 잘못됐어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MonkAmulet_PAD_EnteredLavaLake
