msgctxt "he2360ec3ga8f4g4166g99d3gca8dbbdf8529"
msgid "I'm no expert, but this lava seems particularly... lively."
msgstr "내가 전문가는 아니지만, 이 용암은 뭔가... 생동감이 넘치네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MonkAmulet_PAD_EnteredLavaLake
