msgctxt "h24e339c1gd348g44bagb4a5gb8e049524af5"
msgid "Lava's not supposed to explode, I don't think. Something's igniting it."
msgstr "용암은 원래 폭발하지 않는데, 내 생각엔 말이야. 뭔가 그걸 점화하고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MonkAmulet_PAD_EnteredLavaLake
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c96fc52b-f730-7f60-33b2-f0daac8f1802
