msgctxt "h7f6cecc0g2cbfg47bega077g52dd24e61111"
msgid "That lava lake boils like a good stew. Lovely."
msgstr "저 용암 호수가 잘 끓인 스튜처럼 보글거리네. 아름다워."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MonkAmulet_PAD_EnteredLavaLake
