msgctxt "h1f845de0g4394g4757ga1ecg100e2d0c2922"
msgid "Giant mushrooms? I've never seen anything like them."
msgstr "거대한 버섯들이잖아? 이런 건 본 적이 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_SawCorpse
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 76669d2d-cff7-e67e-ace6-63547e8cb0a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_DUERGARDWARF
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_SawCorpse:76669d2d-cff7-e67e-ace6-63547e8cb0a8
msgctxt "h87a04113g3e61g4b18g9fb3gf2ba4780df02"
msgid "Duergar corpses. What is this beast doing to them?"
msgstr "듀에르가 시체잖아. 이 짐승이 놈들에게 무슨 짓을 하고 있는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_SawCorpse
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 76669d2d-cff7-e67e-ace6-63547e8cb0a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_UNDERDARK or WIZARD
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_SawCorpse:76669d2d-cff7-e67e-ace6-63547e8cb0a8
msgctxt "h662dd0fbg9d31g437agbd59g32c480fadec4"
msgid "Animating spores. The myconid means to raise the dead."
msgstr "살아있는 포자잖아. 마이코니드들이 시체를 일으키려 하고 있군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_SawCorpse
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 76669d2d-cff7-e67e-ace6-63547e8cb0a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_SawCorpse:76669d2d-cff7-e67e-ace6-63547e8cb0a8
msgctxt "hce0781f3g311dg4730g9ce4g58fa844156a2"
msgid "It attends to the corpses. Does it mean to <i>raise</i> them?"
msgstr "시체를 처리하고 있어. <i>일으키려는</i> 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_SawCorpse
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 76669d2d-cff7-e67e-ace6-63547e8cb0a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_SawCorpse:76669d2d-cff7-e67e-ace6-63547e8cb0a8
msgctxt "hdd890afege477g409bg8f96g927e3da0f27e"
msgid "By Balduran's breath, what is that thing up to?"
msgstr "발더란의 불알이여 맙소사! 저게 뭘 하려는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_SawCorpse
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 76669d2d-cff7-e67e-ace6-63547e8cb0a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_SawCorpse:76669d2d-cff7-e67e-ace6-63547e8cb0a8
msgctxt "h12cacadagb311g4270gaec7g0b9b6668447a"
msgid "What's that thing doing? Feeding? Something else?"
msgstr "뭘 하는 거지? 먹고 있나? 뭐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_SawCorpse
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 76669d2d-cff7-e67e-ace6-63547e8cb0a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_SawCorpse:76669d2d-cff7-e67e-ace6-63547e8cb0a8
msgctxt "h441d8606ge9fdg41f3gabf0g1e77b35c8e2d"
msgid "What's it doing? It's not going to eat them, is it?"
msgstr "뭘 하는 거야? 먹으려는 건 아니겠지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_SawCorpse
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 76669d2d-cff7-e67e-ace6-63547e8cb0a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_SawCorpse:76669d2d-cff7-e67e-ace6-63547e8cb0a8
msgctxt "hbdb02ac3gaf22g4be1gbc18g334ddfdda4c5"
msgid "Even the dead are commodities here. Just like Avernus."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_SawCorpse
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 76669d2d-cff7-e67e-ace6-63547e8cb0a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_SawCorpse:76669d2d-cff7-e67e-ace6-63547e8cb0a8
msgctxt "h98d8d2efgccafg4042g80c6g9abaf3bbc585"
msgid ""
"I read about myconids and the manifold properties of their spores. That "
"duergar is about to rise - undead."
msgstr ""
"내가 읽은 바에 따르면 마이코니드들은 그들의 포자로 수많은 일들을 할 수 있다고 했어. 저 듀에르가는 살아나려는 거야, 언데드로."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_SawCorpse
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 76669d2d-cff7-e67e-ace6-63547e8cb0a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_SawCorpse:76669d2d-cff7-e67e-ace6-63547e8cb0a8
msgctxt "h3521983ag23e9g4dacga978g31c2c8677ca0"
msgid "What is the creature doing to those corpses?"
msgstr "저 생물체가 시체로 뭘 하려는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_SawCorpse_Companions
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 58fa604a-a520-cb44-3812-27630e0bfd34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_UNDERDARK or WIZARD
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_SawCorpse_Companions:58fa604a-a520-cb44-3812-27630e0bfd34
msgctxt "h731726eagcc9ag40c5gb5a7gfca8f9d003da"
msgid "It's planting spores. The myconid means to raise the dead."
msgstr "포자를 심고 있잖아. 마이코니드는 망자를 되살리려 하고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_SawCorpse_Companions
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6101eacd-296f-e23e-f154-f0207860abaa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_SawCorpse_Companions:6101eacd-296f-e23e-f154-f0207860abaa
msgctxt "h6b9bdc32gb0efg4fceg9fc0gcbf4c1e723e8"
msgid "Indeed. These creatures are mightier than they look."
msgstr "그러게. 이 생명체들은 보기보다 강력한걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_SawCorpse_Companions
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6101eacd-296f-e23e-f154-f0207860abaa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_UNDERDARK or WIZARD
