msgid "What's that thing doing with the dead? Feeding?"
msgstr "저것들이 시체로 뭘 하는 거야? 먹고 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_SawCorpse_Companions
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fb58fe38-bc09-f6a6-7b21-851b45d16a81
