msgctxt "h79b7829fg4409g47dfg8ea7g3511d220b6af"
msgid "You know, I can't tell if it's mourning, angry, or just hungry."
msgstr "저기, 저게 지금 슬퍼하는 건지, 화가 난 건지, 아니면 그냥 배가 고픈 건지 모르겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_MyconidCircle_VB_SawCorpse_Companions
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fb58fe38-bc09-f6a6-7b21-851b45d16a81
