msgctxt "h26a8cdb6g2b21g4d1egb373gb3562dfc0d28"
msgid ""
"Barrelstalks. Threaten the myconids, and <i>boom</i>: poison everywhere."
msgstr "통줄기야. 마이코니드를 위협하면, <i>뻥</i>. 이곳이 독으로 뒤덮이는 거지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_PAD_BarrelstalkInteraction
