msgctxt "hc44a8e41g3e88g4a6fg9171g08a95160c407"
msgid "Ah, a Nightfall feast. Though I'm not sure it should be quite so ripe."
msgstr "아, 나이트폴 만찬이잖아. 원래 이렇게 고약한 건지는 모르겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 10da965a-5c99-41a2-be33-65aa6c0c38d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_NightfallBanquet_ReligionCheckSuccessful = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD:10da965a-5c99-41a2-be33-65aa6c0c38d3
msgctxt "h7a6a2b1eg96bag4195ga363gafffbf372639"
msgid ""
"An eerily chilling scene, this. I suspect many were present at this blighted "
"Nightfall feast."
msgstr "섬뜩할 정도로 오싹한 장면이네. 이 뒤틀린 나이트폴 만찬에 참석한 이들이 아주 많았나 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 10da965a-5c99-41a2-be33-65aa6c0c38d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_NightfallBanquet_ReligionCheckSuccessful = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD:10da965a-5c99-41a2-be33-65aa6c0c38d3
msgctxt "hcbc69046gda32g4876ga829gf1df0ed0447d"
msgid ""
"I guess these are the dregs of a Nightfall feast. Pity for so much good "
"eating to go to waste."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 10da965a-5c99-41a2-be33-65aa6c0c38d3
