#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD:10da965a-5c99-41a2-be33-65aa6c0c38d3
msgctxt "hc6e06756g06ccg4013g910bgcfc025f08fa8"
msgid "The rotting ritual dregs of a Nightfall feast - a decadent display."
msgstr "나이트폴 만찬의 썩어가는 찌꺼기군, 퇴폐적인 전시물이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 10da965a-5c99-41a2-be33-65aa6c0c38d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_NightfallBanquet_ReligionCheckSuccessful = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD:10da965a-5c99-41a2-be33-65aa6c0c38d3
msgctxt "h99d99388g39b8g49beg8ea4g19731d94c7c5"
msgid "This was a Nightfall ritual. Carried out in Shar's name."
msgstr "이건 나이트폴 의식이었어. 샤의 이름으로 행해졌군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 10da965a-5c99-41a2-be33-65aa6c0c38d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_NightfallBanquet_ReligionCheckSuccessful = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD:10da965a-5c99-41a2-be33-65aa6c0c38d3
msgctxt "h04328621g85beg48eag8481gc68a435ce666"
msgid ""
"That smells <i>rank</i>. The remnants of a Nightfall feast, I'm guessing."
msgstr "<i>끔찍한</i> 냄새가 풍기는데. 나이트폴 만찬의 잔해인 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 10da965a-5c99-41a2-be33-65aa6c0c38d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_NightfallBanquet_ReligionCheckSuccessful = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_SHAR
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD:10da965a-5c99-41a2-be33-65aa6c0c38d3
msgctxt "h44250a55g71aeg4bd9gbcedg16769b4e68a2"
msgid "This wasn't just a feast - it was a <i>Nightfall </i>ritual."
msgstr "이건 그냥 만찬이 아니었어. <i>나이트폴 </i>의식이었군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 10da965a-5c99-41a2-be33-65aa6c0c38d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_NightfallBanquet_ReligionCheckSuccessful = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD:10da965a-5c99-41a2-be33-65aa6c0c38d3
msgctxt "h887f1bc0g10bdg4a7cg9450g8487e081cf2c"
msgid "Ugh - the scraps of a Nightfall feast."
msgstr "으 - 나이트폴 만찬의 부스러기들이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5980797b-551f-74a8-ba6e-aedf404a1172
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD:5980797b-551f-74a8-ba6e-aedf404a1172
msgctxt "hb1987ca2g1112g4a5eg8003ge4b529b6987f"
msgid ""
"I've heard of that - a banquet that ends with you murdering someone in "
"Shar's name. Quite the event."
msgstr "나도 들어 본 적이 있어 - 샤의 이름으로 누군가를 살해하는 것으로 끝나는 만찬이라던데. 엄청난 행사겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5980797b-551f-74a8-ba6e-aedf404a1172
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD:5980797b-551f-74a8-ba6e-aedf404a1172
msgctxt "h24689165gaf0eg4d7fga8bbg2c54f270b400"
msgid "Food and drink, followed by murder in Shar's name. Barbaric."
msgstr "음식과 음료에 샤의 이름으로의 살인이라니. 야만스럽군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5980797b-551f-74a8-ba6e-aedf404a1172
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD:5980797b-551f-74a8-ba6e-aedf404a1172
msgctxt "h754c42e2g6763g45d9g9c92g311ad05fff30"
msgid ""
"Imagine eating all these before murdering people for Shar. Kinda sick, kinda "
"fascinating."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5980797b-551f-74a8-ba6e-aedf404a1172
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD:5980797b-551f-74a8-ba6e-aedf404a1172
msgctxt "haaf7e6cbg23e1g4787gb1b9g6d3bb3b9b420"
msgid ""
"Shar worshippers did this. Why slow the senses with food and drink before a "
"killing? Pointless."
msgstr "샤 숭배자들의 짓이야. 왜 죽이기 전에 음식과 음료로 감각을 둔하게 하는 거지? 의미 없군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5980797b-551f-74a8-ba6e-aedf404a1172
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD:5980797b-551f-74a8-ba6e-aedf404a1172
msgctxt "h712d7683gf0a2g44ecg8edbg73b51c27febd"
msgid ""
"To break bread in Shar's name, then spill blood in her name. A sacred rite."
msgstr "샤님의 이름으로 빵을 찢고, 그분의 이름으로 피를 흘리는 거야. 신성한 의식이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5980797b-551f-74a8-ba6e-aedf404a1172
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD:5980797b-551f-74a8-ba6e-aedf404a1172
msgctxt "h0f4f3e6cgae22g4bbcg8142gba8c01923754"
msgid ""
"To just eat and drink, then finish it all by murdering someone for Shar? "
"These people were monsters."
msgstr "그냥 먹고 마시다가, 샤를 위해 누군가를 살해하는 것으로 마무리한다고? 이들은 괴물이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5980797b-551f-74a8-ba6e-aedf404a1172
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: SHAR
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD:5980797b-551f-74a8-ba6e-aedf404a1172
msgctxt "h5f7c7517g5463g4938gb2ffge0aa521ba606"
msgid ""
"Eating and drinking your fill before a few wicked deeds to Shar... I've "
"missed these."
msgstr "샤님께 바치는 작은 악행을 하기 전에 배불리 먹고 마시는 것... 이게 그리웠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5980797b-551f-74a8-ba6e-aedf404a1172
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD:5980797b-551f-74a8-ba6e-aedf404a1172
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h58feed2fg6803g4b0aga247gfb42c190c92d"
msgid ""
"Gorging on food and drink before killing in honour of Shar - disgusting."
msgstr "샤의 이름으로 누군가를 죽이기 전에 음식과 음료를 게걸스럽게 먹는다니 - 역겹군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63b5def4-a054-d277-fae1-fbb9c6d90c15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_NightfallBanquet_ReligionCheckSuccessful = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD:63b5def4-a054-d277-fae1-fbb9c6d90c15
msgctxt "hed3dde30gc4dfg4c90gae0bgac068c4e2e9e"
msgid ""
"Ah, a Nightfall feast in honour of Shar. An evening of food and merriment "
"before a spot of murder - charming."
msgstr "아, 샤를 기리는 나이트폴 만찬이라... 살인을 앞두고 음식과 유흥의 저녁을 즐긴다니, 참 매력적이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63b5def4-a054-d277-fae1-fbb9c6d90c15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_NightfallBanquet_ReligionCheckSuccessful = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = False
