#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD:63b5def4-a054-d277-fae1-fbb9c6d90c15
msgctxt "hb2e6ee6fg42dag4a82gb7e5g604e0de69ea7"
msgid ""
"I suspect many a Sharran was present at this blighted Nightfall feast. An "
"evening of merriment before the real prize - murder."
msgstr "많은 샤 숭배자들이 이 망할 나이트폴 만찬에 있었겠어. 유흥의 저녁을 즐기며 주요 행사를 기다렸어 - 살인 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63b5def4-a054-d277-fae1-fbb9c6d90c15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_NightfallBanquet_ReligionCheckSuccessful = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD:63b5def4-a054-d277-fae1-fbb9c6d90c15
msgctxt "hca52eff6gefc9g44cbg8667ga1dd206276f8"
msgid ""
"Looks like a Nightfall feast. A Sharran party right before ritual murder."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63b5def4-a054-d277-fae1-fbb9c6d90c15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_NightfallBanquet_ReligionCheckSuccessful = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD:63b5def4-a054-d277-fae1-fbb9c6d90c15
msgctxt "h71102e38g44b3g415cg87feg374c13952a83"
msgid ""
"Shar worshippers left these rotting ritual dregs behind. Why slow the senses "
"with food and drink before a killing? Pointless."
msgstr "샤 숭배자들이 이 썩어가는 의식용 찌꺼기를 남겨두고 갔어. 왜 죽이기 전에 음식과 음료로 감각을 둔하게 하는 거지? 의미 없군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63b5def4-a054-d277-fae1-fbb9c6d90c15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_NightfallBanquet_ReligionCheckSuccessful = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD:63b5def4-a054-d277-fae1-fbb9c6d90c15
msgctxt "h135d4a5ag8517g4394ga6b4g84f259c6aa91"
msgid ""
"This was a Nightfall feast. To break bread in Shar's name, then spill blood "
"in her name. A sacred rite."
msgstr "이건 나이트폴 만찬이었어. 샤님의 이름으로 빵을 찢고, 그분의 이름으로 피를 쏟는 거지. 신성한 의식이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63b5def4-a054-d277-fae1-fbb9c6d90c15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_NightfallBanquet_ReligionCheckSuccessful = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD:63b5def4-a054-d277-fae1-fbb9c6d90c15
msgctxt "ha3b45495g8abdg4dc6g8c88g22438b6c3f89"
msgid ""
"That smells <i>rank</i>. The remnants of a Shar ritual, I'm guessing. To eat "
"and drink your fill before killing another..."
msgstr "<i>역겨운</i> 냄새가 나. 샤 의식의 흔적인 것 같아.. 살인하기 전에 만찬을 즐기다니..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63b5def4-a054-d277-fae1-fbb9c6d90c15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_NightfallBanquet_ReligionCheckSuccessful = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = False
#. TagRule: CLERIC_SHAR and PALADIN_SHAR
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD:63b5def4-a054-d277-fae1-fbb9c6d90c15
msgctxt "h01a12cbeg2083g405fg99c7g5f2b0c5454cd"
msgid ""
"This wasn't just a feast - it was a Nightfall ritual. Eating and drinking "
"your fill before sacrificing an innocent to Shar... I've missed these."
msgstr "단순한 만찬이 아닌, 나이트폴 의식이었어. 연회를 즐기다가 무고한 이를 샤에게 바치는 거야... 이게 그리웠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63b5def4-a054-d277-fae1-fbb9c6d90c15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_NightfallBanquet_ReligionCheckSuccessful = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = False
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD:63b5def4-a054-d277-fae1-fbb9c6d90c15
msgctxt "h333dcfc9g50aeg49bcgbdecg6b07ecfeb770"
msgid ""
"Ugh - a Nightfall ritual. They likely feasted the night away before killing "
"another - all for Shar."
msgstr "윽 - 나이트폴 의식이야. 아마 다른 자를 죽이기 전에 만찬의 밤을 즐겼던 것 같군 - 전부 샤를 위해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e0053b3c-b61a-4714-b64e-10e000b5a98c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD:e0053b3c-b61a-4714-b64e-10e000b5a98c
msgctxt "h219fb54fg54f6g42eagbbe9gca700ac1411d"
msgid "Feeling hungry? I'm decidedly not."
msgstr "혹시 배고픈 사람 없지? 입맛이 확 떨어지네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e0053b3c-b61a-4714-b64e-10e000b5a98c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD:e0053b3c-b61a-4714-b64e-10e000b5a98c
msgctxt "hf5bb754dgd165g4c83g86cegcbd3c465093d"
msgid ""
"An eerily chilling scene, this. I suspect many a spectre was present at this "
"blighted feast."
msgstr "이상하게 소름 돋는 장면이군. 이 망할 축제를 위해 많은 영혼들이 몰려든 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e0053b3c-b61a-4714-b64e-10e000b5a98c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD:e0053b3c-b61a-4714-b64e-10e000b5a98c
msgctxt "h219410a0g8e84g450cgbef0gdbc0a00a5b44"
msgid "This place gives me the creeps."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e0053b3c-b61a-4714-b64e-10e000b5a98c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD:e0053b3c-b61a-4714-b64e-10e000b5a98c
msgctxt "hb6959376g37d3g499fga830gecad92512c68"
msgid "What manner of fiend holds a feast in a place like this?"
msgstr "도대체 어떤 악마 같은 놈이 이런 곳에서 만찬을 여는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e0053b3c-b61a-4714-b64e-10e000b5a98c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD:e0053b3c-b61a-4714-b64e-10e000b5a98c
msgctxt "h026949b8gf384g4148g83beg2b5a579ced0d"
msgid "This wasn't just a feast. More like a ritual... so familiar somehow."
msgstr "이건 단순한 만찬이 아니었어. 의식에 가까운 것 같은데... 그런데 뭔가 익숙하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e0053b3c-b61a-4714-b64e-10e000b5a98c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD:e0053b3c-b61a-4714-b64e-10e000b5a98c
msgctxt "hf7dceb19g0109g406bg86b3g4fd516cba8fe"
msgid ""
"Not an ideal banquet location. I suppose the feast hall was already booked."
msgstr "이상적인 만찬 장소는 아닌 것 같군. 만찬 홀은 전부 예약되어 있었나 보네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e0053b3c-b61a-4714-b64e-10e000b5a98c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_RottenBanquet_PAD:e0053b3c-b61a-4714-b64e-10e000b5a98c
msgctxt "h9fc1d2b8g7607g4ba2g99e2gbbe7417c2be0"
msgid "Rotten food and dried blood. A wild party, or something more sinister?"
msgstr "썩은 음식과 말라붙은 피라. 광란의 파티, 아니면 더 사악한 무언가였을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SadisticPit_PAD_Spot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 40e90790-821a-4c4f-8ee6-8bc18ef71aee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SadisticPit_PAD_Spot:40e90790-821a-4c4f-8ee6-8bc18ef71aee
msgctxt "hde9080f8g2a25g4f0cgaca6gdb0b07597b0a"
msgid "It's deep and dark, but something's twinkling at the bottom."
msgstr "깊고 어두운데, 뭔가 아래에서 빛나고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SadisticPit_PAD_Spot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 40e90790-821a-4c4f-8ee6-8bc18ef71aee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SadisticPit_PAD_Spot:40e90790-821a-4c4f-8ee6-8bc18ef71aee
msgctxt "h59049abdgdaadg42bdga064g1d0f485cc902"
msgid "Say - there's something down there!"
msgstr "잠깐, 저 아래 뭔가 있어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SadisticPit_PAD_Spot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 40e90790-821a-4c4f-8ee6-8bc18ef71aee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SadisticPit_PAD_Spot:40e90790-821a-4c4f-8ee6-8bc18ef71aee
msgctxt "hcf0859cdga550g4442gbf28g0de01299af7b"
msgid "Darkness - and a spot of light. What might be down there?"
msgstr "어둠 속에 반짝임이 보여. 저 아래에 뭐가 있는 걸까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SadisticPit_PAD_Spot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 40e90790-821a-4c4f-8ee6-8bc18ef71aee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SadisticPit_PAD_Spot:40e90790-821a-4c4f-8ee6-8bc18ef71aee
msgctxt "h03bbb055ge507g429cg9b6dg50dda76bc4d9"
msgid ""
"There's something glimmering down there. Could be valuables - or spikes."
msgstr "저 아래 뭔가 빛나고 있는데. 값비싼 물건일지도 몰라, 꼬챙이일지도 모르지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SadisticPit_PAD_Spot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 40e90790-821a-4c4f-8ee6-8bc18ef71aee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SadisticPit_PAD_Spot:40e90790-821a-4c4f-8ee6-8bc18ef71aee
msgctxt "h3f40d6d9g3408g409bga309g61b3e2a4d391"
msgid "Nothing but... wait. What's that, shining in the dark?"
msgstr "아무것도... 잠깐. 저게 뭐야, 어둠 속에서 뭔가 빛나고 있는데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SadisticPit_PAD_Spot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 40e90790-821a-4c4f-8ee6-8bc18ef71aee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SadisticPit_PAD_Spot:40e90790-821a-4c4f-8ee6-8bc18ef71aee
msgctxt "h2564cb8eg8864g4135ga30dgd547ad836139"
msgid "What's that? Something's glittering down there."
msgstr "저게 뭐지? 저 아래에서 뭔가 빛나고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SadisticPit_PAD_Spot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 94f24475-7717-3836-7bfe-1e7f2ff57ad1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SadisticPit_PAD_Spot:94f24475-7717-3836-7bfe-1e7f2ff57ad1
msgctxt "h38eaf2bcg788dg4c1bg80e2gea2518e53b3e"
msgid "What a charming pit. Could be anything down there."
msgstr "정말 매력적인 구덩이네. 저 아래엔 뭐든지 있을 수 있겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SadisticPit_PAD_Spot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 94f24475-7717-3836-7bfe-1e7f2ff57ad1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SadisticPit_PAD_Spot:94f24475-7717-3836-7bfe-1e7f2ff57ad1
msgctxt "haaac74f9g4537g4138g83dbgc8fa27ab1b0a"
msgid "A gaping black hole. Not exactly inviting."
msgstr "벌어진 어두운 구멍이라. 딱히 땡기진 않네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SadisticPit_PAD_Spot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 94f24475-7717-3836-7bfe-1e7f2ff57ad1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SadisticPit_PAD_Spot:94f24475-7717-3836-7bfe-1e7f2ff57ad1
msgctxt "ha0c9dd59g9039g4224gb09bg156a451219b5"
msgid "Blacker than night. What might be down there?"
msgstr "밤하늘보다 어둡군. 저 아래에 뭐가 있을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SadisticPit_PAD_Spot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 94f24475-7717-3836-7bfe-1e7f2ff57ad1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SadisticPit_PAD_Spot:94f24475-7717-3836-7bfe-1e7f2ff57ad1
msgctxt "h2f48eddbg12c4g40bcg9764gc63f44f1fe21"
msgid "Not terribly inviting. Who knows what's at the bottom?"
msgstr "딱히 땡기진 않는데. 바닥에 뭐가 있을지 누가 알겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SadisticPit_PAD_Spot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 94f24475-7717-3836-7bfe-1e7f2ff57ad1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SadisticPit_PAD_Spot:94f24475-7717-3836-7bfe-1e7f2ff57ad1
msgctxt "hf60277f9g112bg4a47g8f24g79b3196ead05"
msgid "Just darkness, near as I can see. Wonder how far down it goes."
msgstr "눈에 보이는 건 어둠뿐이야. 얼마나 깊을지 궁금하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SadisticPit_PAD_Spot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 94f24475-7717-3836-7bfe-1e7f2ff57ad1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SadisticPit_PAD_Spot:94f24475-7717-3836-7bfe-1e7f2ff57ad1
msgctxt "hdcdca582gfbdbg4a10g9a41g7d06d9fb700b"
msgid "Can't make anything out. What's down there, I wonder?"
msgstr "전혀 안 보여. 저 아래 뭐가 있을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SadisticPit_PAD_Spot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 95e32945-1bd0-1800-a005-41cebf9dd28d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SadisticPit_PAD_Spot:95e32945-1bd0-1800-a005-41cebf9dd28d
msgctxt "h227a53f5g2890g401cga0c5ga17abaa5ee84"
msgid "Feel free to throw yourself in. I'll watch."
msgstr "몸을 던지고 싶다면 마음대로 해. 난 지켜볼 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SadisticPit_PAD_Spot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 95e32945-1bd0-1800-a005-41cebf9dd28d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SadisticPit_PAD_Spot:95e32945-1bd0-1800-a005-41cebf9dd28d
msgctxt "hfd3a2abbgaa13g45b3g8ad9g74de6517c8f8"
msgid "I'd take a step back if I were you. Never trust a pit in the Underdark."
msgstr "나라면 한 발짝 물러나겠어. 절대 언더다크에 있는 구덩이를 믿지 말라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SadisticPit_PAD_Spot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 95e32945-1bd0-1800-a005-41cebf9dd28d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SadisticPit_PAD_Spot:95e32945-1bd0-1800-a005-41cebf9dd28d
msgctxt "hc3f4cc31gf0e6g4225g89e2g2c999959356a"
msgid "Nothing waits down there but our own deaths. Put it out of your mind."
msgstr "저 아래에서 기다리는 건 우리 죽음 뿐이야. 그만 잊어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SadisticPit_PAD_Spot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 95e32945-1bd0-1800-a005-41cebf9dd28d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SadisticPit_PAD_Spot:95e32945-1bd0-1800-a005-41cebf9dd28d
msgctxt "h154c9d7bg1421g4d6egbc1dgdb8f3a22ec50"
msgid ""
"I wouldn't venture in. Nothing to be gained from freefalling into a dark "
"hole."
msgstr "들어갈 생각은 없어. 어두운 구멍으로 뛰어들어서 좋을 건 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SadisticPit_PAD_Spot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 95e32945-1bd0-1800-a005-41cebf9dd28d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SadisticPit_PAD_Spot:95e32945-1bd0-1800-a005-41cebf9dd28d
msgctxt "h4ec12e04g9039g4d86gb694g070684f28402"
msgid "Are you thinking of jumping? Not sure it's worth the risk."
msgstr "뛰어내릴 생각이야? 그런 위험을 감수할 만한 일인지 모르겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SadisticPit_PAD_Spot
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 95e32945-1bd0-1800-a005-41cebf9dd28d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SadisticPit_PAD_Spot:95e32945-1bd0-1800-a005-41cebf9dd28d
msgctxt "h5daa814cgdbd8g48bfg8985g367aa529d698"
msgid "I'd rather not jump down murky pits, if it's all the same."
msgstr "내 생각엔, 어두컴컴한 구덩이에 뛰어내리진 않는 게 좋겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SussurTree_PAD_Aura
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7f5964d1-16b2-f671-90da-defcb31daa65
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SussurTree_PAD_Aura:7f5964d1-16b2-f671-90da-defcb31daa65
msgctxt "h6b1aad13g3540g4609g825cg1ab044696330"
msgid "I feel cold. Empty. What are those flowers doing to me?"
msgstr "차가운 느낌이 든다. 공허하다. 이 꽃들이 내게 무슨 짓을 하고 있는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SussurTree_PAD_Aura
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7f5964d1-16b2-f671-90da-defcb31daa65
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SussurTree_PAD_Aura:7f5964d1-16b2-f671-90da-defcb31daa65
msgctxt "h47429d1cg012dg4641ga916g4cc87292abb6"
msgid ""
"By Mystra, what are these accursed flowers? I can feel my magic ebbing away."
msgstr "미스트라시여, 이 저주받은 꽃들은 도대체 뭐야? 내 마법이 깎여 나가는 게 느껴져."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SussurTree_PAD_Aura
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7f5964d1-16b2-f671-90da-defcb31daa65
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SussurTree_PAD_Aura:7f5964d1-16b2-f671-90da-defcb31daa65
msgctxt "hd67ef6f2g2fc6g421cg8ae4g171239422c2d"
msgid "I don't like these flowers. They're bad."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SussurTree_PAD_Aura
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7f5964d1-16b2-f671-90da-defcb31daa65
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SussurTree_PAD_Aura:7f5964d1-16b2-f671-90da-defcb31daa65
msgctxt "h8877beb6gde76g42a5ga80bg2135762b489d"
msgid "What is this? These flowers - they make my blood run as cold as ice."
msgstr "뭐지? 이 꽃들 - 등골이 서늘해져."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_SussurTree_PAD_Aura
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7f5964d1-16b2-f671-90da-defcb31daa65
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
