msgctxt "h8c289542g75abg4787gb900g2757b6558905"
msgid "Nothing left."
msgstr "남은 게 없군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_WormWall_PAD_Empty3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7a77eca7-ed85-87f3-b85d-b638eb2623f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_WormWall_PAD_Empty3:7a77eca7-ed85-87f3-b85d-b638eb2623f0
msgctxt "h3c01a7bagd791g4d12g973fgcbdbe5062e51"
msgid "There's nothing left."
msgstr "남은 것이 없군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ZhentPort_PAD_FromHideout
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2bf44fcd-cd10-e27b-f3b9-1ec4d6037145
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ZhentPort_PAD_FromHideout:2bf44fcd-cd10-e27b-f3b9-1ec4d6037145
msgctxt "h219b5baeg21eeg40f8g93cegc688c70bc9dc"
msgid "Long ride down. Is this... the Underdark?"
msgstr "많이도 내려왔군. 여기는... 언더다크인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ZhentPort_PAD_FromHideout
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 81d2a4f8-a533-4920-b768-f8b567906c09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ZhentPort_PAD_FromHideout:81d2a4f8-a533-4920-b768-f8b567906c09
msgctxt "h533121a4g7ccdg4dcagada4g95a70c87ba76"
msgid "Glowing rocks? Mushrooms? This is no simple storage room."
msgstr "빛나는 광석에, 버섯이라니? 여기는 그냥 창고가 아니군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ZhentPort_PAD_FromHideout
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 81d2a4f8-a533-4920-b768-f8b567906c09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ZhentPort_PAD_FromHideout:81d2a4f8-a533-4920-b768-f8b567906c09
msgctxt "h33074037g433bg4480gb579g7c9beff97b70"
msgid ""
"This is no ordinary storage room. This depth... This feeling of "
"incomprehensible abyss... The Underdark."
msgstr "여기는 그냥 창고가 아니야. 이렇게 깊고... 가늠할 수 없는 심연의 느낌... 언더다크야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ZhentPort_PAD_FromHideout
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 81d2a4f8-a533-4920-b768-f8b567906c09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ZhentPort_PAD_FromHideout:81d2a4f8-a533-4920-b768-f8b567906c09
msgctxt "h52b04309g2fcag4c93g9f7cgd64b24f29d66"
msgid "Chilly down there. Very chilly. I think that's the Underdark."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ZhentPort_PAD_FromHideout
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 81d2a4f8-a533-4920-b768-f8b567906c09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ZhentPort_PAD_FromHideout:81d2a4f8-a533-4920-b768-f8b567906c09
msgctxt "hc59b2c25g5156g4728gb4ceg015130dc35ec"
msgid "Contraband. Why else would so many goods be stored in such depths?"
msgstr "밀수품이군. 이토록 많은 물건이 이렇게 깊은 곳에 왜 보관되어 있을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ZhentPort_PAD_FromHideout
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 81d2a4f8-a533-4920-b768-f8b567906c09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ZhentPort_PAD_FromHideout:81d2a4f8-a533-4920-b768-f8b567906c09
msgctxt "h4c24bdc1gfaf9g4f9dg87e4g9f022178092f"
msgid ""
"Quite a set-up. This takes smuggling to new lengths... or new depths, rather."
msgstr "꽤 근사하네. 밀수의 수준을 끌어올렸군... 깊이 있게 만들었다고 하는 게 맞으려나."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ZhentPort_PAD_FromHideout
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 81d2a4f8-a533-4920-b768-f8b567906c09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ZhentPort_PAD_FromHideout:81d2a4f8-a533-4920-b768-f8b567906c09
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h13a32e3cgb7bag4cf0g938ega72661df5f44"
msgid "Quite a collection. Smugglers' stash, I wager. But so far down..."
msgstr "물건이 꽤 많군. 아마도 밀수꾼이 숨겨 놓은 거겠지. 하지만 이렇게 깊은 곳에..."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ZhentPort_PAD_FromHideout
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 81d2a4f8-a533-4920-b768-f8b567906c09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_UNDERDARK
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ZhentPort_PAD_FromHideout:81d2a4f8-a533-4920-b768-f8b567906c09
msgctxt "hbb94b0a8g6a8eg4941gacafg54e2a00f7559"
msgid "The Underdark - a foolish place to hide contraband, even for a Zhent."
msgstr "언더다크에 밀수품을 숨기는 건 별로 좋은 생각이 아닌데, 아무리 젠타림이라도 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ZhentPort_PAD_FromHideout
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 86922a67-2c64-0ea5-be3c-e289b1ad65ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ZhentPort_PAD_FromHideout:86922a67-2c64-0ea5-be3c-e289b1ad65ae
msgctxt "h6c03d095ge13eg4691g93e2g14c378e33676"
msgid "A dangerous place to stock goods, even for a Zhent."
msgstr "물건을 쌓아놓기에는 위험한 곳인데, 아무리 젠타림이라도 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ZhentPort_PAD_Recognize
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1825cc02-1d6b-47f8-9d28-d4edd31c03ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ZhentPort_PAD_Recognize:1825cc02-1d6b-47f8-9d28-d4edd31c03ee
msgctxt "hd6fa71bag4744g4c2cgbb9bg2f0fbbd5058b"
msgid "The Black Network's mark. Spies, murderers, and thieves ahead, I guess."
msgstr "검은 조직망의 표식이야. 스파이, 살인자 그리고 도적들이 근처에 있는 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ZhentPort_PAD_Recognize
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1825cc02-1d6b-47f8-9d28-d4edd31c03ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ZhentPort_PAD_Recognize:1825cc02-1d6b-47f8-9d28-d4edd31c03ee
msgctxt "h3f7a4547g9fb5g4c78g8718g61e1dd52ec8f"
msgid ""
"The mark of the Zhentarim. Bound to be more to this place than meets the eye."
msgstr "젠타림의 표식이야. 눈에 보이는 것 보다 더 많은 것이 이 곳에 숨겨져 있을 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ZhentPort_PAD_Recognize
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1825cc02-1d6b-47f8-9d28-d4edd31c03ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ZhentPort_PAD_Recognize:1825cc02-1d6b-47f8-9d28-d4edd31c03ee
msgctxt "hb6647ab1g6a3fg4133g8b22g971c7ac73c02"
msgid ""
"That's the mark of the Zhentarim. Wonder if these are spies, murderers, "
"thieves, or a heady combo."
msgstr "젠타림의 표식이야. 이들이 스파이인지, 살인자인지, 도둑인지, 아님 그 모든 것인지 궁금하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ZhentPort_PAD_Recognize
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1825cc02-1d6b-47f8-9d28-d4edd31c03ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ZhentPort_PAD_Recognize:1825cc02-1d6b-47f8-9d28-d4edd31c03ee
msgctxt "habb7237bgfcfag44adgbc9fgc424775c006c"
msgid "The mark of the Zhentarim, I believe - brigands for hire."
msgstr "젠타림의 표식인 것 같아. 용병 강도들이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ZhentPort_PAD_Recognize
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1825cc02-1d6b-47f8-9d28-d4edd31c03ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ZhentPort_PAD_Recognize:1825cc02-1d6b-47f8-9d28-d4edd31c03ee
msgctxt "hb6f55c52g5395g4c77ga0ecgefa16f16d953"
msgid "A Zhentarim symbol. Those outlaws must be operating here."
msgstr "젠타림 상징이야. 그 무법자들이 이곳에서 활동하는 게 분명해."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ZhentPort_PAD_Recognize
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1825cc02-1d6b-47f8-9d28-d4edd31c03ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ZhentPort_PAD_Recognize:1825cc02-1d6b-47f8-9d28-d4edd31c03ee
msgctxt "h311617d6gaa83g40f0g961ag1cd910c1321f"
msgid ""
"That mark - the Zhentarim are here. Thieves and murderers, the whole lot."
msgstr "이 표식은... 젠타림 무리들이 여기 있다는 것이군. 도둑질과 살인, 모두 하는 놈들이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ZhentPort_PAD_Recognize
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1825cc02-1d6b-47f8-9d28-d4edd31c03ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: PALADIN and !OATHBREAKER
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ZhentPort_PAD_Recognize:1825cc02-1d6b-47f8-9d28-d4edd31c03ee
msgctxt "h8a4cb71ag77e6g47efgad02g4178b02943e0"
msgid "Zhentarim thugs passed through here. Oathless curs, the lot of them."
msgstr "젠타림 건달들이 여길 지나갔어. 불경한 똥개 놈들이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ZhentPort_PAD_Recognize
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1825cc02-1d6b-47f8-9d28-d4edd31c03ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ZhentPort_PAD_Recognize:1825cc02-1d6b-47f8-9d28-d4edd31c03ee
msgctxt "h3bd082fbgd3f8g43b2g98c0gfaac50ba0180"
msgid ""
"The Zhentarim - mercenaries and cut-throats. Useful friends, if you can "
"afford them."
msgstr "젠타림 - 용병들과 암살자들이야. 고용할 능력만 있다면 유용한 친구들이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ZhentStash_Skeletons_VB
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5453dfcd-811f-1e80-92ec-d9a1a1d4ed01
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/Gustav/Story/Dialogs/Act1/Underdark/VBs/UND_ZhentStash_Skeletons_VB:5453dfcd-811f-1e80-92ec-d9a1a1d4ed01
msgctxt "h8403b04eg572bg475ega2a6g4ff609b1c23c"
msgid "Broken bones - must have fallen."
msgstr "부러진 뼈네. 분명 추락사했겠지."

