msgctxt "h63e7ddacgfd4bg4194g80c4g85e3a193456f"
msgid ""
"You claim to know a lot about my queen, and yet you present no evidence."
msgstr "여왕에 대해 많은 걸 알고 있다고 주장하면서, 어떤 증거도 내놓지 않는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/AstralPlane/CRE_AstralPrison_Daisy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0af5bd84-ee50-0058-3dd4-440c5cd1374a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/AstralPlane/CRE_AstralPrison_Daisy:0af5bd84-ee50-0058-3dd4-440c5cd1374a
msgctxt "h84e8d5f3gd3b0g426ag80c8g4948d482b92b"
msgid "What a pretty lie."
msgstr "멋진 거짓말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/AstralPlane/CRE_AstralPrison_Daisy
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 0ba6f5d9-cca9-f575-2265-b70040a7660b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(1) = False
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/AstralPlane/CRE_AstralPrison_Daisy:0ba6f5d9-cca9-f575-2265-b70040a7660b
msgctxt "hdf6213f8gce24g487egb698g5af8232045b7"
msgid ""
"Vlaakith is lying to her people. She pretends to know how Gith destroyed the "
"mind flayer empire. In truth, she knows nothing."
msgstr ""
"블라키스는 백성들을 속이고 있어요. 그녀는 기스가 어떻게 마인드 플레이어 제국을 파괴했는지 알고 있는 듯 굴고 있어요. 사실, 전혀 아는 "
"게 없는데도요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/AstralPlane/CRE_AstralPrison_Daisy
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 0ba6f5d9-cca9-f575-2265-b70040a7660b
