msgid "That was uncalled for. Though, a spell well cast."
msgstr "그러실 필요까진 없습니다만. 뭐, 꽤 능숙한 시전이었습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/AstralPlane/CRE_AstralPrison_Daisy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0ee4623f-64a8-f122-86d1-880f945f52d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_ChainOfCommand_State_RefusedVlaakithsOrdersInDialog = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_AstralPrison_State_KilledDaisyDuringDialog = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/AstralPlane/CRE_AstralPrison_Daisy:0ee4623f-64a8-f122-86d1-880f945f52d0
msgctxt "h8fc64b40g8b92g4448gaba3g3e913641e140"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry. I don't want to do this, but I'm more afraid of Vlaakith than I "
"am of you. You have to die."
msgstr "미안해. 난 이러고 싶지 않은데, 블라키스의 분노를 살까 두려워. 이만 죽어줘야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/AstralPlane/CRE_AstralPrison_Daisy
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 11772588-43a9-6c80-d092-69174f68ea5b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/AstralPlane/CRE_AstralPrison_Daisy:11772588-43a9-6c80-d092-69174f68ea5b
msgctxt "h1e78386egfaaag4434g95b7g541da4964033"
msgid "Since you spared me that fate, she will come for you."
msgstr "당신 덕에 그런 운명을 모면했으니, 블라키스가 당신을 찾아갈 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/AstralPlane/CRE_AstralPrison_Daisy
