msgctxt "h6602aba9ga19eg481fga0cdg68cd8bccc13f"
msgid ""
"But unlike you, unlike anyone else in any plane, I know Vlaakith's secret."
msgstr "하지만 당신이나 다른 차원의 그 어떤 이들과는 다르게, 블라키스의 비밀을 알고 있는 사람이랍니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/AstralPlane/CRE_AstralPrison_Daisy
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 3417bf2b-3c7e-7672-6f13-4b942590458c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/AstralPlane/CRE_AstralPrison_Daisy:3417bf2b-3c7e-7672-6f13-4b942590458c
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "I can hear your thoughts. You think I'm lying. Vlaakith warned that I would "
#| "try to deceive you. But consider this - what reason have I to deceive you? I "
#| "want the same thing as you - freedom. "
msgctxt "h5cdc959agd456g4985g851ag2b8b1834b8de"
msgid ""
"I can hear your thoughts. You think I'm lying. Vlaakith warned you that I "
"would try to deceive you. But consider this - what reason have I to deceive "
"you? I want the same thing as you - freedom."
msgstr ""
"당신의 생각이 들려요. 제가 거짓말한다고 생각하시는군요. 블라키스는 제가 당신을 속이려 할 거라고 경고했죠. 하지만 생각해 보세요. 제가 "
"당신을 속일 이유가 뭐가 있겠어요? 저도 당신과 같은 것을 원해요. 자유를."

