msgctxt "h1de9f38fgfe9fg4e0bga598g2d032ff13a1d"
msgid ""
"And if her people found out about her impotence, there would be mutiny, "
"revolution, the end of her rule."
msgstr "백성들이 여왕의 무능을 깨닫고 나면, 곳곳에서 반란과 혁명이 일어나 통치를 끝내고 말겠죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/AstralPlane/CRE_AstralPrison_Daisy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4f40dd0a-c2ab-34c4-3027-3b4744bb4a24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/AstralPlane/CRE_AstralPrison_Daisy:4f40dd0a-c2ab-34c4-3027-3b4744bb4a24
msgctxt "h259a4bc7gbba6g404dgacbbg6287d2fba27b"
msgid "Vlaakith be damned - if she wants you dead, she can kill you herself."
msgstr "블라키스는 저주나 받으라지 - 그렇게나 당신을 죽이고 싶어 한다면, 직접 죽이면 될 일이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/AstralPlane/CRE_AstralPrison_Daisy
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 5113ae66-854d-4199-c281-93e41df9e1db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/AstralPlane/CRE_AstralPrison_Daisy:5113ae66-854d-4199-c281-93e41df9e1db
msgctxt "h56b30932g51a1g4d7bga16dg27323cb937da"
msgid "If this was not enough to convince you, what more is there to say?"
msgstr "이것으로도 납득이 안 된다면 더 이상 무슨 말을 해야 할까요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/AstralPlane/CRE_AstralPrison_Daisy
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 5113ae66-854d-4199-c281-93e41df9e1db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_FEMALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/AstralPlane/CRE_AstralPrison_Daisy:5113ae66-854d-4199-c281-93e41df9e1db
msgctxt "h3e44660fg2730g4ad5g8af4g16ff2794b19b"
msgid "If this was not enough to convince you, what more is there to say?"
msgstr "이것으로도 납득이 안 된다면 더 이상 무슨 말을 해야 할까요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/AstralPlane/CRE_AstralPrison_Daisy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 519acb2f-b96b-e897-df70-316fd11af80e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/AstralPlane/CRE_AstralPrison_Daisy:519acb2f-b96b-e897-df70-316fd11af80e
msgctxt "h97488415g2788g433cgad59g8402081d76e5"
msgid ""
"Queen Vlaakith is a <i>goddess</i>. What could you possibly know that would "
"bring her down?"
msgstr "블라키스 여왕은 <i>여신</i>이야. 무슨 수로 그녀를 무너뜨리겠다는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/AstralPlane/CRE_AstralPrison_Daisy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 519acb2f-b96b-e897-df70-316fd11af80e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/AstralPlane/CRE_AstralPrison_Daisy:519acb2f-b96b-e897-df70-316fd11af80e
msgctxt "h23471e50g7b0bg487ega9c5g639cd4a68865"
msgid ""
"Vlaakith's a<i> goddess</i>. What could you possibly know that would bring "
"down her empire?"
msgstr "블라키스는 <i>여신</i>이야. 무슨 수로 그녀의 제국을 무너뜨리겠다는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/AstralPlane/CRE_AstralPrison_Daisy
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 5a1aab58-7b23-34da-7c23-d6bfbaf4c30f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/AstralPlane/CRE_AstralPrison_Daisy:5a1aab58-7b23-34da-7c23-d6bfbaf4c30f
msgctxt "h7b2e1186g1118g4462gb3eag1341d37a2b74"
msgid "She is trying her <i>very best </i>to kill me. By sending you."
msgstr "이미 저를 죽이려고 <i>최선을 다하고</i> 있습니다. 당신을 이곳으로 들여보냈지 않나요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/AstralPlane/CRE_AstralPrison_Daisy
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 5a1aab58-7b23-34da-7c23-d6bfbaf4c30f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_FEMALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/AstralPlane/CRE_AstralPrison_Daisy:5a1aab58-7b23-34da-7c23-d6bfbaf4c30f
msgctxt "hdf56f897g46b5g498dg8897g4d172038d2c9"
msgid "She is trying her <i>very best </i>to kill me. By sending you."
msgstr "이미 저를 죽이려고 <i>최선을 다하고</i> 있는걸요. 당신을 이곳으로 들여보냈잖아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/AstralPlane/CRE_AstralPrison_Daisy
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 5b52cb70-7514-8b46-fa66-b12b6182b60e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
