#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h7b61c38egb620g4f10g8a4dga49c671a5fa0"
msgid ""
"I suppose I can't blame you. You are threatened by the tadpole and you think "
"I prevented you from being cured."
msgstr "마냥 당신을 탓할 수만은 없겠지요. 올챙이 때문에 생사의 갈림길에 서 있는데 제가 치료를 방해하는 것처럼 보이실 테니까요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/AstralPlane/CRE_AstralPrison_Daisy
