msgid "Your life is over. <i>Ch'mar, zal'a Vlaakith!</i>"
msgstr "네 목숨은 끝이다. <i>츠마르, 잘라 블라키스!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/LowerCreche/CRE_ChainOfCommand_AD_TemplarCombatMindstealLine
