msgctxt "h704393c7g607ag4f45ga20bgf92bf2fd54b9"
msgid ""
"I can tell you more than any amount of skulking around would. Come. Speak."
msgstr "쥐새끼처럼 돌아다녀봤자 알아낼 수 있는 건 없다. 이리 오너라. 말해라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/LowerCreche/CRE_ChainOfCommand_AD_TemplarGreeting
#. Speaker = Ch'r'ai W'wargaz
#. NodeID = 65542574-9973-128b-fd9c-88ee9dce634c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
