#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_ChainOfCommand_AD_EscortingCultistsChatter:9e7fe7d8-d045-b028-882a-0eaf45f2f6b0
msgctxt "h75b4b51agb1cdg4cbdga27bgbdaf8a0a851f"
msgid "See, Add'ath. See how they whimper to their fledgling goddess."
msgstr "놈들 좀 봐, 아다스. 갓난쟁이 여신을 향해 징징거리는 꼬락서니라니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_ChainOfCommand_AD_EscortingCultistsChatter
#. Speaker = Raider Add'ath
#. NodeID = b2d11aeb-b72d-4a45-8ba7-d67ba0491588
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_ChainOfCommand_AD_EscortingCultistsChatter:b2d11aeb-b72d-4a45-8ba7-d67ba0491588
msgctxt "h1bdacac6g0ba3g4b3dg9ebbgb70d2a60c93e"
msgid "We shall see how well your faith persists."
msgstr "네놈들의 신앙이 얼마나 더 지켜질지 두고 보도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_ChainOfCommand_AD_EscortingCultistsChatter
#. Speaker = Burrock
#. NodeID = b87aa656-55b4-d7ab-b546-65b993e9e2e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_ChainOfCommand_AD_EscortingCultistsChatter:b87aa656-55b4-d7ab-b546-65b993e9e2e2
msgctxt "haafe81e2g7149g4550g8671g6a28bb4878b1"
msgid "Of course, the Absolute sees all."
msgstr "얼마든지. 절대자께선 모든 걸 지켜 보실지니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_ChainOfCommand_AD_EscortingCultistsChatter
#. Speaker = Raider Add'ath
#. NodeID = bdcbd831-87e6-cdbd-d338-14dea62c74ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_ChainOfCommand_AD_EscortingCultistsChatter:bdcbd831-87e6-cdbd-d338-14dea62c74ec
msgctxt "hcb8a44d5g0023g41a9gb209g6e72852f8173"
msgid ""
"Foolish <i>istik</i>. There is only one god-queen, and she does <i>not</i> "
"answer prayers."
msgstr "멍청한 <i>이스틱</i> 같으니. 여왕신은 단 한 분뿐이며, 그분께서는 숭배자들에게 응답하지 <i>않으신다</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_ChainOfCommand_AD_EscortingCultistsChatter
#. Speaker = Warrior Ith'dul
#. NodeID = c4ca76f6-f92b-4c3b-947d-58e8d7268627
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_ChainOfCommand_AD_EscortingCultistsChatter:c4ca76f6-f92b-4c3b-947d-58e8d7268627
msgctxt "hec6184beg2032g4751gaa4dgb74768318289"
msgid "Especially when Sa'varsh Kethk uses you as youngling target practice."
msgstr "사바쉬 케스크가 네놈들을 수련생들의 연습용 표적으로 써먹는 상황에서는 더욱 그렇겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_ChainOfCommand_AD_EscortingCultistsChatter
#. Speaker = Warrior Ith'dul
#. NodeID = c51e7f0a-f2c2-4405-9255-4849cc51de8d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 74506ed0-4f42-d979-5696-2bd41c4d9a52_A = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_ChainOfCommand_AD_EscortingCultistsChatter:c51e7f0a-f2c2-4405-9255-4849cc51de8d
msgctxt "h7071bb26gcb85g46b5g9c3eg712750f1fbf1"
msgid "Best hope the captain's wolves have enough kibble,<i> Absolutists</i>."
msgstr "우리 대장의 늑대들이 충분히 배를 불렸기를 기도해라, <i>절대자 신도</i>들아."

