#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_ChainOfCommand_PAD_NearDeadBody:2027ac47-0c85-4024-bfa6-69313736de34
msgctxt "h1355a179gec17g4f73g871ag7c94b61ff9f7"
msgid ""
"So my kin are hunting cultists too. If nothing else, they'll be quick to cut "
"down their numbers."
msgstr "내 동족도 광신도들을 사냥하고 있군. 다른게 하나 있다면, 그들은 광신도 숫자를 빨리 줄일거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_ChainOfCommand_PAD_NearDeadBody
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2027ac47-0c85-4024-bfa6-69313736de34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_ChainOfCommand_PAD_NearDeadBody:2027ac47-0c85-4024-bfa6-69313736de34
msgctxt "h146891ddg8c7eg4df8g8ee5g77456f8ec0c9"
msgid "So the githyanki aren't fond of the cultists. Could be a good thing."
msgstr "기스양키가 광신도를 좋아하지 않는군. 좋은 소식일지도 모르겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Courtyard_PAD_LathanderStatue
#. Speaker = Player
