msgctxt "h3506adb3g1620g4e3ag9c18ge64a4dda3bbc"
msgid "Undead crushed underfoot. I'll try not to take it personally."
msgstr "언데드가 발 밑에 뭉개져 있군. 개인적인 일로 받아들이지 않도록 노력해 봐야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Courtyard_PAD_LathanderStatue
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a098a6d9-c811-480f-ae7d-d10f4a24a52d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
