msgctxt "hd7a97ad4g6e0bg46eag8102g3559b9a63d60"
msgid "Undead trampled to dust. Their dusk is as eternal as Lathander's dawn."
msgstr "언데드가 먼지로 짓밟혀 있어. 라샌더의 새벽처럼, 그들의 황혼도 영원하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Courtyard_PAD_LathanderStatue
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a098a6d9-c811-480f-ae7d-d10f4a24a52d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
