msgctxt "h9faeee5cg6146g445ag89a0g561fd660d8a3"
msgid ""
"The undead, smashed to bone. Lathander's sun does not rise on the soulless."
msgstr "뼈가 으스러질 정도로 죽어버린 언데드들이군. 라샌더의 태양은 영혼 없는 자에게는 떠오르지 않는다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Courtyard_PAD_LathanderStatue
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a098a6d9-c811-480f-ae7d-d10f4a24a52d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
