msgctxt "he713d4d7g6c30g4510ga737g439b08ba4180"
msgid "*The spell's power wanes. You can ask no more questions.*"
msgstr "*주문의 힘이 약해집니다. 더 이상 질문을 할 수 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_CultistsUndead_Zealot_Dead
#. Speaker = Dead Zealot of the Absolute
#. NodeID = dae121cb-f650-2f29-5a64-3f1f13ee9ba5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_CultistsUndead_Zealot_Dead:dae121cb-f650-2f29-5a64-3f1f13ee9ba5
msgctxt "h23f87192gff10g4048gb584g139856643106"
msgid "Stumbled... upon... them... interrupted... training..."
msgstr "훈련 중인... 놈들과... 우연히... 마주쳤다..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_CultistsUndead_Zealot_Dead
#. Speaker = Dead Zealot of the Absolute
#. NodeID = f5cb14bc-439f-c292-1e87-845d00a2f16c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_CultistsUndead_Zealot_Dead:f5cb14bc-439f-c292-1e87-845d00a2f16c
msgctxt "hd1f7a1d7gba5dg47b8gb6c0gb41eb4286e29"
msgid "Didn't... realise... they... were... here..."
msgstr "놈들이... 여기... 있을 줄... 몰랐다..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_CultistsUndead_Zealot_Dead
#. Speaker = Dead Zealot of the Absolute
#. NodeID = f7bc19a2-22ff-f40f-f845-4d7791958892
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_CultistUndead_Event_MentionedMOO = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_CultistsUndead_Zealot_Dead:f7bc19a2-22ff-f40f-f845-4d7791958892
msgctxt "h90b4ff98g9bf9g4eb9ga9a0gd02b07adc367"
msgid "Moonrise... Towers..."
msgstr "문라이즈... 타워..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_CultistsUndead_Zealot_Dead
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = fb5d7834-f288-4412-a1e1-b2634cd6c49c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_Killer(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_CultistsUndead_Zealot_Dead:fb5d7834-f288-4412-a1e1-b2634cd6c49c
msgctxt "h786e8d5cgd149g4864gbbb2gc47b97bef594"
msgid "*The corpse seems willing to speak - but not to its killer.*"
msgstr "*시체는 말할 의지가 있지만, 자신을 죽인 자와 대화하고 싶지는 않은 듯 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 00449a37-fab7-229e-53aa-ed459af44f1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:00449a37-fab7-229e-53aa-ed459af44f1f
msgctxt "h32955f7cg7e44g40fegb8cbgcbd1299b2651"
msgid ""
"Look, I've already been threatened with death today so, relatively speaking, "
"you seem nice. Can you help me?"
msgstr "이봐, 난 오늘 이미 죽음의 위협을 겪었다고, 말하자면 상대적으로, 너는 괜찮아 보이는 거야. 날 좀 도와주겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 02703f40-54c7-1a0f-cf5c-3d73cdf01431
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:02703f40-54c7-1a0f-cf5c-3d73cdf01431
msgctxt "h87281e70g6d1cg4f16ga340g11af8a64acb8"
msgid "You know, killing you is going to be very, very satisfying."
msgstr "있잖아, 널 죽이는 건 매우,매우 만족스러울 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0287c705-c59e-3ba2-d2dc-c33eeb43a1c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 21
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:0287c705-c59e-3ba2-d2dc-c33eeb43a1c2
msgctxt "h6e8d30c3gb8e4g4b78gb95fg5c9aaaf0d6f9"
msgid ""
"Of course not. It's from an owlbear. But I bet your employers won't know the "
"difference."
msgstr "물론 아니지. 이건 아울베어 알이야. 그렇지만 네 고용주들은 차이를 모를걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 02a9db47-5d68-a5f3-e97a-21de05f090cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:02a9db47-5d68-a5f3-e97a-21de05f090cd
msgctxt "hfa680073g018dg4418gae1fgae31cfe6a0a0"
msgid "Oh, gods no. Please."
msgstr "아, 제발, 당연히 아니지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0431a46f-56a7-4c8d-a91c-656d00060b1e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:0431a46f-56a7-4c8d-a91c-656d00060b1e
msgctxt "he650ab4dg6140g441dgbf18g16378b62e95b"
msgid "<i>Leave</i>."
msgstr "<i>떠난다</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 044afc0b-8f1e-0ac3-0a70-1e75e40950b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Laezel_Knows_CrecheLocation = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:044afc0b-8f1e-0ac3-0a70-1e75e40950b8
msgctxt "h44ddae9fg2fcbg47b3gbed4g2f3b67ddb00d"
msgid ""
"Oh it certainly looks that way, but inside it is swarming with brutish, "
"stupid, rude githyanki."
msgstr "아, 확실히 그렇게 보일 수도 있지, 하지만 내부는 야만적이고, 멍청하고, 천박한 기스양키가 득실거린다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 04619ed9-9967-c8aa-25a6-b91e31bb0013
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:04619ed9-9967-c8aa-25a6-b91e31bb0013
msgctxt "he89abc6bgde56g4b49gab06g083f96791ca9"
msgid "I'm amazed you escaped the crèche alive, frankly."
msgstr "솔직히, 양성소를 살아서 탈출한 게 놀랍군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 071a92c2-5a4d-e014-f33b-d46efaebad2b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:071a92c2-5a4d-e014-f33b-d46efaebad2b
msgctxt "h1574ef01g161bg4e86g922ag1b8a5c1378c0"
msgid ""
"Honestly, I was doing them a favour, offering to buy one of their eggs. And "
"how am I repaid? Attacked and run off like some transient."
msgstr "솔직히 나는 그들에게 호의로, 알을 하나 살 수 있냐고 물어봤어. 그랬더니 어떻게 됐게? 공격받고 후다닥 도망갔어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 08345863-4383-6817-8de4-6c42541f7dd4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:08345863-4383-6817-8de4-6c42541f7dd4
msgctxt "hfb6249b4gccd4g4d18gbdd8g77aa9c332bb1"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0852037a-b136-153a-3124-68644c8bed52
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:0852037a-b136-153a-3124-68644c8bed52
msgctxt "h1290c37ag3417g4320ga844g3645293137db"
msgid "No, it's an owlbear's. I just like it."
msgstr "아니, 이건 아울베어 알이야. 그냥 좋아해서."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 09ed6213-774d-9820-f2b7-a4a0331678db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:09ed6213-774d-9820-f2b7-a4a0331678db
msgctxt "h941d75aegd2a5g411ag8781g1770c12c913b"
msgid "I <i>was</i> here on business, before it was blown to Mount Celestia."
msgstr "저곳이 셀레스티아 산까지 날라가기 전에, 업무 차 방문<i>했었지</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0b7d0c27-5610-1d5b-a035-ea31bab9eab7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 448b6dbd-8926-601d-b37b-032a81c58532_CRE_Expeditioner_OurQuestJoke = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:0b7d0c27-5610-1d5b-a035-ea31bab9eab7
msgctxt "h9ebffd63gdaf3g4e22gb420g8daa246f73ad"
msgid "Calling it <i>our</i> project seems like a bit of a stretch."
msgstr "<i>우리의</i> 프로젝트라고 하는 건 좀 과장 같은걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 0bad9964-b3f8-894d-d070-f0e2ad667a31
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:0bad9964-b3f8-894d-d070-f0e2ad667a31
msgctxt "h71b1db44g883eg40fcga3e2g40da313347ae"
msgid "At last. <i>Hta'zith</i>!"
msgstr "마침내. <i>흐타지쓰</i>!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 0f9d669b-e4e2-6f1a-a224-be33ecd2831d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:0f9d669b-e4e2-6f1a-a224-be33ecd2831d
msgctxt "h5fb93104gd889g407ag9f54gbb06722bb7c5"
msgid "So? Where's the egg?"
msgstr "그래서? 알은 어딨어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 12721ebf-29f2-358c-7b79-4bfda3c8e192
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:12721ebf-29f2-358c-7b79-4bfda3c8e192
msgctxt "hfd1f8037gfdf3g44fdgae99g273c4dd9741b"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 13dd8e82-52f8-0d09-652d-0e07e9300d03
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:13dd8e82-52f8-0d09-652d-0e07e9300d03
msgctxt "he610a9ecg7fd4g44d9g874cgb68f9e5a4e89"
msgid "A pleasure to do business with you."
msgstr "너와 같이 일해서 즐거웠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 15610e91-dd03-68f5-7333-76c36322d344
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:15610e91-dd03-68f5-7333-76c36322d344
msgctxt "hef680f13ge2c8g4e91g9026gcb31ec3de4f0"
msgid "Lady, I'm busy. What do you want?"
msgstr "여사님, 전 바빠요. 무슨 일이죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 15a2c89a-d401-dc39-13b8-37c89e7668d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:15a2c89a-d401-dc39-13b8-37c89e7668d9
msgctxt "h630f2b32g20ebg486bg85fbg0179e6946d03"
msgid "Should you change your mind, you know where to find me."
msgstr "마음 바뀌면, 내가 있는 곳으로 다시 오라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 163d1fbe-5e00-724f-bf64-a1138e336d71
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:163d1fbe-5e00-724f-bf64-a1138e336d71
msgctxt "ha68d2f08g4214g409ega233gf5f6d8a75568"
msgid "May I see your wares?"
msgstr "물건 좀 볼까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 17603ba5-643a-2df8-b29a-5156483e0cc4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:17603ba5-643a-2df8-b29a-5156483e0cc4
msgctxt "h3500b4a6ga690g46e5ga0efg1da30620e08a"
msgid "Do you have anything to trade?"
msgstr "거래할 만한 거 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1888628d-d83d-0f64-0a3b-1faba7362331
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:1888628d-d83d-0f64-0a3b-1faba7362331
msgctxt "h671ceea8gceb7g466bgb63fge43edd858b3a"
msgid "And what's this 'good cause', exactly?"
msgstr "그 '좋은 취지'라는 게 정확히 뭐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 18b9bf08-2e36-da14-63cf-6ffeddf1c58f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Laezel_Knows_CrecheLocation = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:18b9bf08-2e36-da14-63cf-6ffeddf1c58f
msgctxt "he77b4ba6gc5e2g47a5ga17fg030e55a134e3"
msgid ""
"Inside that temple is a gith crèche. The githyanki established it in what "
"remained after they slaughtered all of the monks."
msgstr "저 사원 안에는 기스양키 양성소가 있어. 기스양키들이 모든 몽크들을 학살한 뒤 그곳에 세웠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 193ee058-fa26-878b-f054-7be9952bb538
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:193ee058-fa26-878b-f054-7be9952bb538
msgctxt "h5aea74cfgda8bg4580gb654g0500a55bd25c"
msgid ""
"I needed a githyanki egg. Contractual business. That blast probably left it "
"as a rather messy scramble."
msgstr "난 기스양키의 알이 필요했어. 계약상의 업무였다고. 저 폭발로 아마 지저분한 잡동사니만 남았을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 19e6a399-1d75-3202-d30f-b82ca0a2ab08
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:19e6a399-1d75-3202-d30f-b82ca0a2ab08
msgctxt "h60f861fbg918fg4e5bga7d7g2a43c60730cb"
msgid "Well not your eggs specifically, any gith egg..."
msgstr "뭐 엄밀히 말하자면 네 알은 아니지, 아무 기스의 알이지..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 1b4dde35-9a76-89c0-4631-7b39e917368d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:1b4dde35-9a76-89c0-4631-7b39e917368d
msgctxt "hf6834ca2g84d8g4668g985dg5cefe79af9ea"
msgid "Look over there. Do you see that wretched little hive?"
msgstr "저기 좀 봐. 저 진절머리 나는 작은 둥지가 보여?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 1b9330fa-086e-6538-dd75-de233d0e97e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:1b9330fa-086e-6538-dd75-de233d0e97e1
msgctxt "h50b760eag3ab7g49b0g9020g803d1f58dc3f"
msgid ""
"How... <i>Uncouth.</i> You've rather scuppered a project I was working on."
msgstr "이런... <i>무례한.</i> 오히려 내가 일하고 있던 프로젝트를 망친 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 1beb1030-1ef4-ab11-1c2e-e643d72fc079
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:1beb1030-1ef4-ab11-1c2e-e643d72fc079
msgctxt "h6648c212g0155g4782g8948g3f8725b28b69"
msgid "Acutely observed on both counts."
msgstr "두 가지 면이 극명하게 보이긴 하는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1c507fee-256f-9fa4-7163-47e8b27fb169
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:1c507fee-256f-9fa4-7163-47e8b27fb169
msgctxt "h7534b269g919bg4fbbg9e29g9da60b37b67e"
msgid "Who tried to kill you?"
msgstr "누가 당신을 죽이려고 했는데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 1ce0d44f-fe57-d93a-2cc2-2e7b12067500
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:1ce0d44f-fe57-d93a-2cc2-2e7b12067500
msgctxt "h31cd9a85g1e22g44bbg975cgaa42d26157a5"
msgid "...You're not from that crèche, are you?"
msgstr "...너는 양성소에서 온 게 아니구나? 그렇지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 2383adf6-c148-af82-44dc-457d9f672085
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:2383adf6-c148-af82-44dc-457d9f672085
msgctxt "h7c4688begfeb9g48b0gab2dg016a4e5bbd66"
msgid "I suppose there is a reason I'm asking <i>you </i>to do it."
msgstr "<i>네</i>게 해 달라고 부탁하는 거니까 어쩔 수 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 24005fc5-f16b-4093-9ba3-4198ae8a45e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_State_QuestCompleted = True
#.      - CRE_Lance_Event_Exploded = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:24005fc5-f16b-4093-9ba3-4198ae8a45e2
msgctxt "h2550864ag26deg4e26ga572gfc483fdfb79a"
msgid "At least we can preserve <i>something </i>of that unfortunate crèche."
msgstr "적어도 우리가 저 불행한 양성소의 <i>무언가</i>는 보존할 수 있겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 25471452-9dae-d97b-f9b2-aaa280b9bb57
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:25471452-9dae-d97b-f9b2-aaa280b9bb57
msgctxt "h6c2a7939g7d34g46b1g9e65g8e184fcc9ccf"
msgid "An awful proposition that must be disproven once and for all."
msgstr "반드시 틀렸다는 걸 증명해야 하는 끔찍한 문제지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 261359f4-e817-a939-e614-f6ddb1602600
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:261359f4-e817-a939-e614-f6ddb1602600
msgctxt "h86ff57b0g008ag4f94gb640gfa1bdc0bdc32"
msgid "And? How much did you offer?"
msgstr "그리고는? 얼마를 제시했는데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 276deff4-da37-bd28-3857-3b3b0e73df51
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:276deff4-da37-bd28-3857-3b3b0e73df51
msgctxt "h19d476d9gc06bg4fc1g9983g0f5c3c18d8a0"
msgid "<i>Leave</i>."
msgstr "<i>떠난다</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 27dfa5a3-5e21-f1bc-3129-1e6bfb823b41
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:27dfa5a3-5e21-f1bc-3129-1e6bfb823b41
msgctxt "hed09b276g91b1g4541g953dg2bfff46cffc9"
msgid ""
"They may have chased me away, but surely the gith would welcome a person "
"with such sympathetic views to their crèche."
msgstr "기스는 날 쫓아냈지만, 그들의 양성소에 대한 동정 어린 관점을 가진 사람은 분명히 환영해 줄 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 2834f57f-f093-9417-ffb8-6b7f633e75a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:2834f57f-f093-9417-ffb8-6b7f633e75a0
msgctxt "hcc68a9e5g69cdg4e95ga802gfc2537e74347"
msgid "The best cause there is: knowledge!"
msgstr "취지 중 최고는 이거지 : 지식!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 2b031377-76ee-088f-424e-1d192ec5ac8b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_State_Hasmet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_State_QuestAccepted = True
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_State_QuestCompleted = False
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_Event_RewardPaid = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:2b031377-76ee-088f-424e-1d192ec5ac8b
msgctxt "h4a359c59g6115g4ac0g9a35g4af1b5d0048b"
msgid ""
"I trust that an early payment has ensured swift action. What news of the "
"githyanki egg?"
msgstr "선불로 줬으니 신속하게 행동을 취할 거라 믿고 있어. 기스양키 알은 어떻게 됐어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 2b15ae80-aa3a-009d-c4f2-c15eb419627b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_State_QuestCompleted = True
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_State_OwlbearEggGiven = True
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_Event_HandoverOwlbearEgg(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:2b15ae80-aa3a-009d-c4f2-c15eb419627b
msgctxt "h0215fedbg25edg48edgb54agcbeb62ea2528"
msgid "I rather like this plan. You have yourself an accord."
msgstr "오히려 이 계획이 더 맘에 드네. 너도 스스로 동의 한 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 2badb372-c339-6308-ac7f-b8a20a4bad73
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:2badb372-c339-6308-ac7f-b8a20a4bad73
msgctxt "h9ed82338g45b2g497bga39cg344a45e31244"
msgid ""
"Well, I would advise you work on it in the <i>actual crèche</i>. Dawdling "
"here helps no one."
msgstr "글쎄, <i>실제 양성소</i>에 가서 일 하라 말하고 싶네. 여기서 노닥거리는 건 아무 도움 안 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 2dfa0a0b-aa1b-7a05-4bc9-88d587864eda
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:2dfa0a0b-aa1b-7a05-4bc9-88d587864eda
msgctxt "hfa09cb87g2423g4840gaa70gccaa0d8c1ea8"
msgid ""
"They believe a githyanki raised in a peaceful, nurturing environment can "
"overcome its violent nature."
msgstr "그들은 평화로운 환경에서 양육된 기스양키가 그 폭력적인 본성을 극복할 수 있을 거라 믿고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 2f872bae-c051-09b3-9401-c2d408034a09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:2f872bae-c051-09b3-9401-c2d408034a09
msgctxt "h6c7de593g32e0g4a53ga7f1gbe27f139d988"
msgid "All business? Very well, I can respect that."
msgstr "일만 생각하네? 좋아, 존중해 줄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2feb2ac4-0402-5b9d-4760-04e594521509
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:2feb2ac4-0402-5b9d-4760-04e594521509
msgctxt "h231b30e5g0dd5g4cfcgb359g4bfd4e902866"
msgid "I said it's a pity you didn't get the egg."
msgstr "내 말은 알을 얻지 못해 유감이라는 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3146027c-f084-f16a-d505-7f0e25e538f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:3146027c-f084-f16a-d505-7f0e25e538f5
msgctxt "he50f5e2dg23ddg48a9g9a31g152fe735851a"
msgid "Uh... sure."
msgstr "어... 그럼..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 32b044e6-bcd6-7ea7-b335-2101d8c2ca11
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:32b044e6-bcd6-7ea7-b335-2101d8c2ca11
msgctxt "hef5535d7gd2f4g494dga614g5c5531f64960"
msgid ""
"A rapscallion I can have grudging respect for. A bare-faced liar, on the "
"other hand..."
msgstr "난 내키지는 않지만 건달 정도는 정중하게 대해 줄 수 있어. 하지만 뻔뻔한 거짓말쟁이는..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 32d65eb7-42eb-d443-3640-99851aa6ea11
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FIGHTER(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:32d65eb7-42eb-d443-3640-99851aa6ea11
msgctxt "he93a2a1age8e6g48d7g9dd2g4f1d1e054678"
msgid ""
"Violence is taught, not inherited. You don't need to steal a child to know "
"that."
msgstr "폭력은 배우게 되는 것이지, 물려받는 게 아니야. 그건 굳이 아이를 훔치지 않아도 알 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 353ba90d-7f5d-c78c-1697-5bff08be4a56
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:353ba90d-7f5d-c78c-1697-5bff08be4a56
msgctxt "hb1317e08g9a6bg485egb94fg05e34c8f5ebc"
msgid "Please, do enlighten me. What is this 'tradition'?"
msgstr "부디, 깨우쳐 주겠나. 그 '전통'이라는 게 뭐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 361e727d-dd47-9f15-474b-33154fd05494
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:361e727d-dd47-9f15-474b-33154fd05494
msgctxt "h97b91a8age26dg4a98g988aga9dd25a39d86"
msgid "Perhaps. Explain your plight."
msgstr "그럴지도 모르지. 상황을 설명해 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 37134583-1257-f1a0-cc2d-728dba39af46
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:37134583-1257-f1a0-cc2d-728dba39af46
msgctxt "h42b9d159g30dbg4ff9ga70bg3bd8e80ebea9"
msgid ""
"How rude. This is exactly why you people have a bit of a reputation, you "
"know."
msgstr "이렇게 무례할 수가. 이래서 너희 평판이 그 정도밖에 안 되는 거야, 알겠지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3935832e-5365-c969-66ff-68ee19c6abdb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:3935832e-5365-c969-66ff-68ee19c6abdb
msgctxt "hf6042c0bgaec7g4887g82afga08af65d827d"
msgid "Did you have friends in the crèche?"
msgstr "양성소에 친구라도 있어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 3a86f1b3-964a-a88d-6c09-16eae5e91d46
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_Event_RewardPaid = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_State_QuestCompleted = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:3a86f1b3-964a-a88d-6c09-16eae5e91d46
msgctxt "h4dfa905dg84c5g4189g92dagf9e062f26d4f"
msgid "Thank you. Paying upfront seems to have had its benefits."
msgstr "고마워. 선불로 지불한 게 이득이었던 거 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 3b2d339b-0dc6-a53e-e647-385345c8c7a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:3b2d339b-0dc6-a53e-e647-385345c8c7a8
msgctxt "heb3876dbg4f19g4af5gb8abg39e404616df0"
msgid ""
"I was given a task, one surprisingly difficult for someone like me. And yet "
"it would be simplicity itself for you!"
msgstr "일을 하나 받았는데, 나 같은 사람에게는 의외로 어려운 일이지. 하지만 너한테는 단순한 일 그 자체일 거야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 3b83b052-3a7a-3d85-be52-21e261537f5e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:3b83b052-3a7a-3d85-be52-21e261537f5e
msgctxt "hd0b61df6g403cg47f7gb7e4gbac4ba9cba6f"
msgid ""
"The Society believes a githyanki raised in a peaceful, nurturing environment "
"can overcome its violent nature."
msgstr "광명회는 평화로운 환경에서 양육된 기스양키가 그 폭력적인 본성을 극복할 수 있을 거라 믿고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 3b983493-eb6e-b094-2b85-5917ffb7448d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:3b983493-eb6e-b094-2b85-5917ffb7448d
msgctxt "h41b5240cgde9fg478fg8bcfgbd32edb50ee7"
msgid "Not enough, clearly."
msgstr "확실히, 충분하진 않았지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3bef8416-2c2b-6b02-ce17-653d89faeb84
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GNOME(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:3bef8416-2c2b-6b02-ce17-653d89faeb84
msgctxt "h93e2319ag9a30g4e8ag8730g8817c0f7f9ba"
msgid ""
"Well, with the right application of force and lift it <i>could </i>be "
"possible..."
msgstr "글쎄, 힘의 적절한 적용으로 들어 올린다면 <i>가능</i>할지도..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 3ebb0c2e-ce40-0da7-e576-ea4a795199c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 448b6dbd-8926-601d-b37b-032a81c58532_CRE_Expeditioner_OurQuestJoke = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:3ebb0c2e-ce40-0da7-e576-ea4a795199c3
msgctxt "hc38407d8g03e0g4fe3g8453gf0c511790d05"
msgid "Now now, no need to get out of humour. Manners are everything."
msgstr "자자, 유머러스하면 좋잖아. 태도가 전부인데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3fd28588-f0c6-5a08-a907-538c8b35c04c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:3fd28588-f0c6-5a08-a907-538c8b35c04c
msgctxt "h3c7ac063gd2b3g4aacg91c6gbc778a5b9f6a"
msgid "There's a crèche nearby? Direct me there at once."
msgstr "양성소가 근처에 있다고? 날 곧장 그곳으로 안내해라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 402e4c89-f71e-9647-eb2d-986d9012f7a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:402e4c89-f71e-9647-eb2d-986d9012f7a5
msgctxt "hb5edc3d9g7f3eg421bgb4cfgb3536b4c94f9"
msgid "My... eggs?"
msgstr "내... 알이라고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 4169a5c7-103f-ac92-15d8-963855f6a20e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:4169a5c7-103f-ac92-15d8-963855f6a20e
msgctxt "hd8462f95gb144g4aa9gad24g970373a5378e"
msgid ""
"As I was trying to say, this is an entirely benevolent act and all for a "
"very good cause."
msgstr "내가 말하고자 하는 것은, 이것은 전적으로 자비로운 행동이고 매우 좋은 취지를 가지고 있다는 거지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 444f06e3-2415-210f-c389-869675389db2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - LOW_TheLodge_Knows_SocietyWantsGithEgg = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:444f06e3-2415-210f-c389-869675389db2
msgctxt "h7cd1356dge4d0g4e2bg999fg4c7a644f689a"
msgid ""
"The Society of Brilliance supplied me with an ample purse to buy an egg for "
"their studies. Bring me one and that purse is all yours."
msgstr "광명회에서 연구에 쓰기 위한 알을 살 수 있게 두둑한 돈주머니를 줬어. 하나만 가져오면 그 돈주머니는 너 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4620c8e2-d3ec-d8d2-9f9e-6493b0551e19
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 21
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:4620c8e2-d3ec-d8d2-9f9e-6493b0551e19
msgctxt "h7e3252b3ge3b5g4b61g8a87g0f26ac7aea9b"
msgid ""
"No, but this owlbear egg is worth much more. And it can <i>all </i>be yours."
msgstr "아니, 하지만 이 아울베어 알이 훨씬 더 가치 있어. 그리고 <i>전부</i> 네 것이 될 수 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 467f74c9-15cc-8e75-7b5b-f03b0472e427
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_Event_RewardPaid = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_State_QuestCompleted = True
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_Event_RewardPaid = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:467f74c9-15cc-8e75-7b5b-f03b0472e427
msgctxt "h0f8619e5gafd9g4b86g84aeg572b9f0c1925"
msgid "Fortuitous indeed! You shall be rewarded immediately!"
msgstr "운 정말 좋네! 넌 당장 보상을 받을만해!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 475c9e8d-0945-d842-a77b-4a45588d7420
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MONK
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:475c9e8d-0945-d842-a77b-4a45588d7420
msgctxt "h6852e2cega334g48bega625g4a964cdd9dbb"
msgid ""
"It's a Lanthaderian monastery - a site of pilgrimage. How is it wretched?"
msgstr "라센더 수도원 - 순례지잖아. 왜 진절머리 난다는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 475c9e8d-0945-d842-a77b-4a45588d7420
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:475c9e8d-0945-d842-a77b-4a45588d7420
msgctxt "ha585fc2ag77deg4655g8a74g5a276cfa43fc"
msgid ""
"Looks like a monastery to Lathander. What's your problem with the God of the "
"Dawn?"
msgstr "라샌더 수도원 같네. 새벽의 신에게 무슨 문제라도 있어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 481c3eff-90a9-0949-8f99-9836cb5dc2fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:481c3eff-90a9-0949-8f99-9836cb5dc2fd
msgctxt "hfd94c3e5g2bf0g4596gb47fgd75c0dedf1c0"
msgid ""
"Well, yes, but now we know better. Only some of you are bloodthirsty terrors."
msgstr "예전엔 그랬지. 하지만 지금은 깨우쳤잖아. 미친 살인마들은 네 종족 중 일부에 불과하다는 걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4824ec4f-9919-b877-a251-86a20849e09b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:4824ec4f-9919-b877-a251-86a20849e09b
msgctxt "h6cf68e05g2004g46cagae4cgf17f06b150a9"
msgid "<i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4b39b2a1-ab00-5f2c-d454-20ab354a4541
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:4b39b2a1-ab00-5f2c-d454-20ab354a4541
msgctxt "h98422298gb78ag417eg8bbegf4ad4962b5ed"
msgid ""
"You want to steal away our young? Your head is mine for daring to suggest it."
msgstr "우리 아이를 훔치고 싶다고? 감히 내게 그런 제안을 했으니 네 목은 내 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 4eabf526-0dfd-d7b8-678e-d4246159c7ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:4eabf526-0dfd-d7b8-678e-d4246159c7ad
msgctxt "hfa0021bbg6d2fg4d33g83fbgc755afa20ff6"
msgid ""
"Your charming companion would call it a crèche. But it was built on what "
"remained after the githyanki slaughtered all of the monks. I'd call it a "
"murderous training camp."
msgstr ""
"당신의 매력 넘치는 동료는 그걸 양성소라 부르겠지. 그렇지만 그건 기스양키들이 거기 있던 모든 수도사를 학살하고 만들어졌어. 난 그걸 "
"흉악한 훈련소라 부를 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 4f8fa4f0-bdfa-3e83-c691-5397f035d2c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_State_Hasmet(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_State_Hasmet(1) = True
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_State_MetAnyPlayer(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:4f8fa4f0-bdfa-3e83-c691-5397f035d2c4
msgctxt "h69f45c83ge4a6g43c0gb835g12af091a7a64"
msgid "A friendly face! Oh you are a sweet, sweet blessing, my dear."
msgstr "친근한 얼굴! 이 얼마나 달콤한 만남인가, 그대."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 5005ae58-4eea-d991-90de-006c00767a91
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Laezel_Knows_CrecheLocation = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:5005ae58-4eea-d991-90de-006c00767a91
msgctxt "haf8257a8g4f19g42c0g81dagfdbc2ecbaef3"
msgid ""
"Oh I mean no offence to the Morninglord, I simply prefer when his "
"monasteries aren't overrun with brutish, stupid, rude githyanki."
msgstr ""
"오 내 말은 아침군주를 모욕하려는 의미가 아니야, 단지 그분의 수도원이 야만적이고, 멍청하고, 무례한 기스양키가 차지하고 있는 게 "
"못마땅해서 그런 거지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 51773f5b-9bd7-6e79-e5a3-f143c1fe004c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:51773f5b-9bd7-6e79-e5a3-f143c1fe004c
msgctxt "ha21cff34g0d33g4863g88feg2a35f94ef293"
msgid "Happy, are we? Very well, then."
msgstr "만족하지? 그럼 됐네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 519af9ab-f710-159a-7937-25befc990200
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:519af9ab-f710-159a-7937-25befc990200
msgctxt "h286f1e96gc6bag4008ga698ga516e1fc5695"
msgid "Oh you wonder- hold on."
msgstr "오 놀라워라 - 잠깐만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 52210d32-c10b-1003-8389-48a7dd248667
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 21
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_Event_RewardPaid = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:52210d32-c10b-1003-8389-48a7dd248667
msgctxt "h409e3d33g8068g4c2cg9484g21c014058fc1"
msgid "Fine, but I want payment. Up front."
msgstr "좋아, 하지만 먼저 지불해. 선불로."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 554e16a2-b1f6-4c3a-15d6-b44ead869f49
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:554e16a2-b1f6-4c3a-15d6-b44ead869f49
msgctxt "h8277af81g5cbdg4545g8e10gaf6235a24b3d"
msgid "Some things are in our blood - only a fool would deny that."
msgstr "어떤 것들은 우리의 본질이야 - 바보들만이 그것을 부인하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 555574ae-d687-9eb0-96df-c355331b118a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:555574ae-d687-9eb0-96df-c355331b118a
msgctxt "he04cacd8g2869g47b3gbee3g593f66995790"
msgid "What you suggest is revolting. I won't let you do this."
msgstr "당신 제안은 너무 역겨워. 이렇게 하도록 놔두지 않겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 575781ad-8945-09cd-427e-e0916ec6962f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:575781ad-8945-09cd-427e-e0916ec6962f
msgctxt "hb00c3662g78afg41e1g858eg1dffdc3ebee7"
msgid "I am not talking to you."
msgstr "너한테 말하는 거 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 58610198-01a5-9f01-3a7f-8b29b0d4a2fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:58610198-01a5-9f01-3a7f-8b29b0d4a2fc
msgctxt "h78ab4104g5ae3g417egaac5gb4d67d0757bd"
msgid "My friend is right: what you suggest is revolting and you need to die."
msgstr "내 친구 말이 맞아: 네 제안은 역겹고 죽음으로 갚아야 하겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 588ff68a-f6fb-e99e-c129-fa6d14be60b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:588ff68a-f6fb-e99e-c129-fa6d14be60b3
msgctxt "h2d61434fg00ddg46fbga5fdg140827f07a64"
msgid ""
"I'm sure your friend would agree. A githyanki is as likely to forsake its "
"violent nature as a gnome is to fly."
msgstr "분명 당신 친구도 동의할 거야. 그 기스양키가 폭력적인 본성을 극복할 가능성은 노움이 하늘을 날 확률만큼이나 낮아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5db92ad1-f625-618b-d16a-fd7aee2aad24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DROWELF(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:5db92ad1-f625-618b-d16a-fd7aee2aad24
msgctxt "h4f317aa9gf013g422bg8dc8g719bb4261c7b"
msgid "They used to think my people were inherently evil too, you know."
msgstr "알겠지만, 광명회는 내 동족도 본질적으로 악하다고 생각하곤 했지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5e17c464-45a8-0f3e-edff-c497962cbeac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:5e17c464-45a8-0f3e-edff-c497962cbeac
msgctxt "hc405f54eg9c13g45f3g91b2g2cf98cb9bbe4"
msgid "<i>Leave</i>."
msgstr "<i>떠난다</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5eaa836b-4d9b-76d1-4462-40dd19e10a4c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:5eaa836b-4d9b-76d1-4462-40dd19e10a4c
msgctxt "h25a082c9g9b4eg4470ga873g0faed1e5ba50"
msgid "I'm not getting involved in this."
msgstr "난 이 일에 엮이지 않겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 5eac4b30-a737-ef07-035b-abec95e862f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:5eac4b30-a737-ef07-035b-abec95e862f6
msgctxt "heec30357ge99fg4eb0ga54cg52459978e006"
msgid ""
"Steal one of Gith's own? I will slit your throat for even suggesting it."
msgstr "기스의 것을 훔치라고? 그런 제안을 하는 것만으로도 네 목을 벨 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 5fde521e-c85d-3612-37f7-d968ebd31083
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:5fde521e-c85d-3612-37f7-d968ebd31083
msgctxt "h659962a6g658ag4e27ga99egde9d4dc34ecd"
msgid ""
"The gith that inhabit that crèche of course - stupid, brutish creatures. Not "
"like you at all."
msgstr "당연히 그 양성소에 거주하는 기스들이지. 멍청하고, 짐승 같은 크리쳐들. 너랑은 전혀 달라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 628f225b-6fc7-52d4-e954-5cf9b8ae623d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:628f225b-6fc7-52d4-e954-5cf9b8ae623d
msgctxt "h7a3a79c0g516fg4030gae9agd1ccf545e76a"
msgid ""
"Exactly! I knew you were a learned soul from the moment I set eyes on you."
msgstr "정확해! 처음 네 눈을 본 순간부터 배운 사람인 걸 알았지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 63034065-b163-ec1b-28d5-57d764df2234
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_State_QuestAccepted = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:63034065-b163-ec1b-28d5-57d764df2234
msgctxt "hf06fd68dgb43cg4521ga4f4g1578455376ba"
msgid ""
"Such conduct is distasteful. Don't come back without the <i>right </i>egg."
msgstr "그런 행동은 정말 혐오스러워하지. <i>올바른</i>알 없이는 돌아오지도 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 637d3b05-d723-5b9c-7040-5db6222cdd57
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:637d3b05-d723-5b9c-7040-5db6222cdd57
msgctxt "h676cadf5ga4b5g472bg9549gc285b8e2cb35"
msgid "Do you have any equipment worth trading?"
msgstr "거래할 만한 장비가 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 650def19-5a33-0be2-1156-e7512a96faca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:650def19-5a33-0be2-1156-e7512a96faca
msgctxt "h8626bd4ag6f81g42d6g8ac1g2f049752126a"
msgid "No, but I'd be willing to trade - if you have anything worth trading?"
msgstr "아니, 근데 거래할 만한 가치 있는 물건 좀 있나? - 있으면 하고 싶군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 662c5fbc-3856-fbc5-4739-19ee229bc5f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_Event_RewardPaid = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_State_QuestCompleted = True
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_State_OwlbearEggGiven = True
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_Event_HandoverOwlbearEgg(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:662c5fbc-3856-fbc5-4739-19ee229bc5f0
msgctxt "h5d86c19cg2266g4323gb679g5c02681088fd"
msgid ""
"You're right, it does have a rather fabulous sheen. It's surprisingly "
"beautiful."
msgstr "맞네, 꽤 굉장한 광택을 가지고 있어. 놀라울 정도로 아름다워."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 67e4ab2c-03c5-cd63-1c87-e7b68d087402
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:67e4ab2c-03c5-cd63-1c87-e7b68d087402
msgctxt "hb93a065bg11c7g4673ga3cagd0add16cd204"
msgid "Look, it's just an egg."
msgstr "그냥 알이잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 690c14e9-b6f3-91e0-67a8-87b6e8e9416b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CRE_Hatchery_State_HasGithYankiEgg(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_State_GithyankiEggDelivered = True
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_Event_GiveGithEggTo(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:690c14e9-b6f3-91e0-67a8-87b6e8e9416b
msgctxt "hfa2b9f51g8147g4750g9f13gb9adb1e128ec"
msgid "I have the egg - here."
msgstr "알 여기 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6996dea0-7caf-a040-208b-0ce0696a25ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:6996dea0-7caf-a040-208b-0ce0696a25ac
msgctxt "h23874088gf090g4a3bgb22bg118f0721b68e"
msgid "Sorry, who's trying to kill you?"
msgstr "미안하군, 누가 당신을 죽이려고 했지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 6c8d0d6d-19b6-3184-e28f-c49db77b250e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_State_QuestCompleted = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:6c8d0d6d-19b6-3184-e28f-c49db77b250e
msgctxt "hcaf0c854g6ee8g4efbgb4ecgfdb50675a7fe"
msgid ""
"Thank you so much. Do be sure to pop into the Lodge should you ever visit "
"Baldur's Gate."
msgstr "정말 고맙네. 발더스 게이트에 방문할 일이 생기거든 집회소에 꼭 들러 보길."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 6d0ed26d-d1c9-295c-3c0b-0fa962e05ba8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:6d0ed26d-d1c9-295c-3c0b-0fa962e05ba8
msgctxt "h6770e2f1g881dg423bg8c6agdc456b2b0e71"
msgid ""
"You've proven an exceptionally efficient friend today. I hope we can work "
"together again."
msgstr "오늘 너는 특별히 유능한 친구인 걸 입증한 거야. 또다시 같이 일할 날이 있길 바랄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 6f2654ac-be2e-0284-da87-9ef520d1b5ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:6f2654ac-be2e-0284-da87-9ef520d1b5ac
msgctxt "h950ca0d0g1d2dg498fgba2ag0955001efe29"
msgid ""
"I have been... less than successful, and if the gith ever see me again, they "
"will kill me. So, I'm asking you to retrieve an egg for me."
msgstr "그동안... 성공적이진 못했고, 만약 기스가 또 날 본다면, 분명히 죽일 거야. 그래서, 알 좀 회수해달라고 부탁하는 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 6f5d9be1-4a2e-618c-7a5f-82a27d4413da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_State_Hasmet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_State_QuestAccepted = True
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_State_QuestCompleted = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:6f5d9be1-4a2e-618c-7a5f-82a27d4413da
msgctxt "h18ad8ecagb165g45eegad7bg33a0bd59fe01"
msgid "What news of our little project? Have you found the egg?"
msgstr "우리 프로젝트에 새로운 소식은 있나? 알은 찾았고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6fcd8ab2-b1d8-1e3d-811e-31fb64ad206f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:6fcd8ab2-b1d8-1e3d-811e-31fb64ad206f
msgctxt "h6314e5fbg217ag4687ga164g73e45553d8b6"
msgid "I think you're vile and I'd sooner die than see you get that egg."
msgstr "타락한 당신이 알을 얻는 걸 보느니 차라리 내가 빨리 죽는 게 나을 거 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 6ffbdb08-6593-cbce-faa6-a03053df96f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:6ffbdb08-6593-cbce-faa6-a03053df96f6
msgctxt "h090989a8g33e0g4565g9c28gdd7bdf10b2f3"
msgid ""
"But if you believe in this cause so strongly, why not help the society prove "
"your point?"
msgstr "이 원인에 대한 생각이 명확한 거 같은데, 광명회가 그 생각을 증명하는 데 도움을 주는 게 어떨까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 720957c3-247d-ec35-d642-512d93d0f501
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:720957c3-247d-ec35-d642-512d93d0f501
msgctxt "hcbefa00eg4031g45d2g9008g157adacd565f"
msgid "...I beg your pardon?"
msgstr "...뭐라고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 722d84b5-169b-13aa-af1a-c71c8e203316
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_Event_RewardPaid = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_State_QuestCompleted = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:722d84b5-169b-13aa-af1a-c71c8e203316
msgctxt "h300919bag5a14g4abfg8fc2ge3ccc32a95a6"
msgid ""
"You've already been generously compensated, so all I have left to offer is "
"my thanks."
msgstr "넌 이미 후한 보상을 받았으니, 내가 줄 것은 감사의 말뿐이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 73a35079-c42e-57d2-1a25-e004b7024bcb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:73a35079-c42e-57d2-1a25-e004b7024bcb
msgctxt "h33352570g93e4g46f1g8690g61d212d8bc68"
msgid "You've had one the entire time and didn't say a word?"
msgstr "계속 가지고 있었으면서 한마디도 안 한 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 74f4adc9-2bb6-267d-9023-8d9e87ab1c03
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:74f4adc9-2bb6-267d-9023-8d9e87ab1c03
msgctxt "h0cebc675gcfa4g4f07g9f0cg6b91d1d669f8"
msgid "But I'm not here to seek revenge for the deaths they caused."
msgstr "하지만 난 그들이 일으킨 죽음에 복수하러 온 게 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 7a9b32fd-26ee-e65a-3da6-ab1fe5b9aa6f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:7a9b32fd-26ee-e65a-3da6-ab1fe5b9aa6f
msgctxt "h10e3dc18gb25dg4638g9c5cg0bf1604a35c2"
msgid ""
"My, how fortuitous! Jolly good show cracking through that crèche, they had "
"it guarded up to the gizzard!"
msgstr "세상에, 이런 행운이 있나! 철저하게 방어하고 있던 저 양성소에서 이렇게 좋은 소식이 뚫고 나오다니!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 7c115bb0-b0f2-4e08-6837-48b3803d5ff9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:7c115bb0-b0f2-4e08-6837-48b3803d5ff9
msgctxt "ha2517b99g74a2g4acdga3b6gce0176194fe1"
msgid ""
"Bring me an egg I can deliver to the Society and you will be well rewarded."
msgstr "광명회에 전달 할 수 있게 알 하나만 가져와 줘. 보상은 두둑이 해줄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7c5f7cd7-a955-7a25-36ab-8abfe643e55a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CRE_Hatchery_State_HasGithYankiEgg(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:7c5f7cd7-a955-7a25-36ab-8abfe643e55a
msgctxt "h9135819eg148dg4fc9gb546g95e56d65b736"
msgid "Sounds good - I'm in."
msgstr "좋아 - 하겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 7d58571f-2242-ff72-818b-3cb16dcd42b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_State_Hasmet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_State_QuestCompleted = False
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_State_ReactedToExplosion = False
#.      - CRE_Lance_Event_Exploded = True
#.   Object:
#.      - CRE_Hatchery_State_HasGithYankiEgg(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_State_ReactedToExplosion = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:7d58571f-2242-ff72-818b-3cb16dcd42b3
msgctxt "h532d2d43ga1c0g4650ga7e6g45dfdf832a44"
msgid ""
"Shame that monastery had to go up like that - taking my impeccable "
"reputation for success with it."
msgstr "수도원이 저렇게 되다니 치욕스럽네 - 흠잡을 데 없는 내 평판을 위한 성공을 가져가 버리다니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 7df6f552-fdd2-2703-2e5b-e54be035d74a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:7df6f552-fdd2-2703-2e5b-e54be035d74a
msgctxt "h092821efge3cbg4e6fg9d68g499c861415b5"
msgid ""
"Excuse me? Were you not listening? I am on a mission and I will not be "
"stopped by the likes of you or your wretched gith!"
msgstr "뭐라고? 내 말을 듣기는 한 거야? 너나 네 비참한 기스놈한테 내 임무를 방해 받을 순 없어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 7e4510b3-2692-094e-dce0-506955e49fe5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:7e4510b3-2692-094e-dce0-506955e49fe5
msgctxt "h6e0cc0e5g6b47g4d58gb03dg68d7ba0934d4"
msgid "Ah. Yes. That."
msgstr "아. 그렇지. 그건."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 802a7995-5784-6758-9ad7-5404040719ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:802a7995-5784-6758-9ad7-5404040719ab
msgctxt "hfc359989gdc72g44c6gb349gaa5caa86aede"
msgid "Pity. You'd have become rather rich had you the proper sense."
msgstr "안타깝네. 제대로 된 판단력만 있었어도 부자가 됐을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 802a7995-5784-6758-9ad7-5404040719ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:802a7995-5784-6758-9ad7-5404040719ab
msgctxt "h6730674dg26e4g420agbaaeg3bca851f37a7"
msgid "No, of course. Not enough blood letting for your taste, I imagine."
msgstr "그래, 그러시겠지. 너같이 피에 굶주린 괴물의 성미에는 안 맞겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 811ebd69-d870-07fe-9dfe-5eeef6d1f1d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:811ebd69-d870-07fe-9dfe-5eeef6d1f1d9
msgctxt "hb8ab6a87g85d7g4749g83e9gcba069049c92"
msgid "I'm working on it."
msgstr "찾는 중이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 82512f40-596f-d406-9b94-d2b549f43445
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:82512f40-596f-d406-9b94-d2b549f43445
msgctxt "h32b7ccadg4f18g40c1g8bd1g36c7e102d992"
msgid ""
"You know, I've had nothing but trouble all day. I've been accosted, chased, "
"<i>insulted</i>."
msgstr "오늘 아주 고난의 연속이었다니까. 취조를 당하지 않나, 쫓기질 않나, <i>욕까지 먹고</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 847e1137-9ac8-826a-d088-ab5d84031f45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 21
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:847e1137-9ac8-826a-d088-ab5d84031f45
msgctxt "h5db6339ag210ag4c99g9cf1ged8a1b17f0d6"
msgid "The curves, the colouration, the size - looks right to me."
msgstr "굴곡이며, 색감, 크기까지 - 내 눈엔 맞는 거 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 84b2b471-1087-d067-2720-165312199a46
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_State_Hasmet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_State_ReactedToExplosion = False
#.      - CRE_Lance_Event_Exploded = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_State_Hasmet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_State_ReactedToExplosion = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:84b2b471-1087-d067-2720-165312199a46
msgctxt "h2a9b6949g16f2g4b21gb5a0gdff900ccecf3"
msgid ""
"Did you see that? The entire building - rubble! I bet it took the crèche "
"too. This is a disaster!"
msgstr "저거 봤어? 건물 전체가 - 파괴됐어! 양성소도 같이 파괴됐을 거야. 이건 재앙이야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 875089f3-f288-59eb-99d5-81ab17b8716d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:875089f3-f288-59eb-99d5-81ab17b8716d
msgctxt "hff635eb3g060dg4114ga748gead31553370c"
msgid ""
"Brutish and rude by your wretched standards. But stupid? <i>K'chakhi</i>."
msgstr "네 형편없는 기준으로는 야만적이고 천박해 보일 수 있겠지. 그런데 멍청하다고!? <i>크차키</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 898a36d3-c6cf-f06a-ae33-561bea474bac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:898a36d3-c6cf-f06a-ae33-561bea474bac
msgctxt "h7aa047c1g904bg49d7g811bg53429d7d143c"
msgid ""
"The Society of Brilliance believes that it's possible to raise a githyanki "
"to be good."
msgstr "광명회는 기스양키를 선하게 키울 수 있다고 믿고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 8b4b4928-2265-4e1e-03da-343e09e5ef8d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:8b4b4928-2265-4e1e-03da-343e09e5ef8d
msgctxt "heea0cc7bg133bg4bc3gb578gddf88561d47c"
msgid "I need a githyanki egg - which I know may sound a little unsavoury -"
msgstr "난 기스양키의 알이 필요해 - 약간 불쾌하게 들릴 테지만 -"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8d7ea89c-45b4-5bdf-22ce-767898d64fb4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - RANGER(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:8d7ea89c-45b4-5bdf-22ce-767898d64fb4
msgctxt "ha4533966g13f3g4c07gbc56g3778a1eabd70"
msgid ""
"Scalabe architecture, good vantage points. Looks empty - perfect ambush spot."
msgstr "스카라베 건축, 좋은 전망대. 비어있어 보이네. 완벽한 매복 장소야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 8dc1b751-7ce7-80d9-d3c9-002d8f13fdab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Laezel_Knows_CrecheLocation = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:8dc1b751-7ce7-80d9-d3c9-002d8f13fdab
msgctxt "ha0324c0bga270g4d44ga247gb521a54de3a5"
msgid ""
"It may look like a peaceful, ruined temple, but it is overrun with brutish, "
"stupid, rude githyanki."
msgstr "겉보기에는 그냥 폐허가 된 고요한 사원 같지만, 실상은 야만적이고, 멍청하고, 천박한 기스양키들로 들끓고 있다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 8e158713-c6e6-33ab-b653-96169f140ce6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:8e158713-c6e6-33ab-b653-96169f140ce6
msgctxt "h03911377gab0bg412agb1fdg9809d34bbbc8"
msgid ""
"You've been sipping from the same goblet as the Society. Perhaps you'd be "
"willing to help, then? To prove your point."
msgstr "광명회와 술잔을 기울일 만큼 생각이 일치하네. 그럼 도와줄 수 있겠네? 증명해 봐야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8e6141ef-e30b-21dd-d1fa-f4db4bc194c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:8e6141ef-e30b-21dd-d1fa-f4db4bc194c4
msgctxt "h36ac7165g21e2g41bfg8273g11bde2a09ece"
msgid "It looks like a temple?"
msgstr "무슨 사원 같은데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 918ca1e6-a547-dc34-b83b-9f0c9179a8b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:918ca1e6-a547-dc34-b83b-9f0c9179a8b1
msgctxt "h30e454fbg15f9g45dbgbd9dg0802bb6b465c"
msgid "You tried to <i>buy</i> one of their children?"
msgstr "아이들 중 하나를 <i>사려</i> 했다고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 91d11af0-4c5b-c4aa-c447-a89822dcd018
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_State_QuestAccepted = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:91d11af0-4c5b-c4aa-c447-a89822dcd018
msgctxt "h21d307e8ge5a7g4502g99acgc4a22908740e"
msgid "I'm afraid that's not how it works. Egg first - compensation later."
msgstr "유감이지만 그렇게는 안 되지. 알이 먼저 - 보상이 다음이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 93da38eb-0727-67dd-2388-d9783c743a44
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CRE_Hatchery_State_HasGithYankiEgg(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:93da38eb-0727-67dd-2388-d9783c743a44
msgctxt "h3d57889cg7c18g42cbg9322g66d9203cdcaf"
msgid "You can't have the egg - I won't support this revolting experiment."
msgstr "알은 못 넘겨주겠군, 역겨운 실험에 가담하긴 싫거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 96651caa-ab94-da39-dbbc-716a33d2d08b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:96651caa-ab94-da39-dbbc-716a33d2d08b
msgctxt "h636f32fag508dg4cd9gb15fg400a551cce09"
msgid ""
"Perhaps you could help me, then? I may not be welcome there, but surely a "
"person with your charm and worldliness could get into the crèche."
msgstr "그럼 좀 도와주겠어? 난 환영받지 못하겠지만, 너같이 매력적이고 세상 경험이 풍부한 사람은 분명 양성소에 들어갈 수 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 97441576-a763-1580-e6bf-403d39e7eef3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_State_QuestAccepted = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:97441576-a763-1580-e6bf-403d39e7eef3
msgctxt "h04210477g129fg4197gad8bgee6e05937641"
msgid ""
"Everyone needs a hobby, I suppose. But if you find a <i>gith</i> egg, do "
"return it quickly. No matter how much you 'like' it."
msgstr ""
"나도 모든 사람은 취미가 필요하다고는 생각해. 하지만 만약 <i>기스</i>의 알을 찾으면, 그냥 빨리 가져다줘. 네가 아무리 그걸 "
"'좋아한다' 해도 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 97fd3f37-b0b7-e1c6-4d59-38458a862453
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:97fd3f37-b0b7-e1c6-4d59-38458a862453
msgctxt "hc07ca8edg0c77g40dcgbca9ge88b7b1dcabf"
msgid ""
"With a pure will and great courage - anyone can rise above their nature."
msgstr "순수한 의지와 엄청난 용기가 있다면 - 누구든지 본인의 본성을 극복할 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 98809721-4ead-cfd6-e3c1-0930534330e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CRE_Hatchery_State_HasGithYankiEgg(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_Hatchery_State_EggKicked = True
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_PaladinOathbreaker_Event_BrokeOath(1) = True
#.     - ORI_DarkUrge_Event_IndulgedUrge(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:98809721-4ead-cfd6-e3c1-0930534330e1
msgctxt "heb325c17g6545g42dbg8286ga3d43410ce76"
msgid "<i>Punt the egg off the side of the cliff with a hearty kick.</i>"
msgstr "<i>알을 힘껏 걷어차 절벽에서 떨어뜨린다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 994c8d15-c8c3-ca9a-ec9f-3276619f825b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:994c8d15-c8c3-ca9a-ec9f-3276619f825b
msgctxt "h523a63a2g98dcg4101ga243g480ed1958e11"
msgid "Why would you want one of their eggs?"
msgstr "알은 왜 원했던 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 997916ce-c84e-9f55-993a-97dd750d7cf0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:997916ce-c84e-9f55-993a-97dd750d7cf0
msgctxt "ha6cb3898g6245g4d68g88c2g855bce3f8f83"
msgid "Well, you failed to get the egg, so I guess we'll never know."
msgstr "글쎄, 알을 얻지 못했으니, 알 수가 없겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 9bc140ad-27fe-8960-a9c8-80886069431b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:9bc140ad-27fe-8960-a9c8-80886069431b
msgctxt "hb2fd8d45g5739g47c2gadd3g23f5567eda5e"
msgid "Now, I believe you have places to be."
msgstr "자, 이제 너도 할 일을 해야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9d984c37-9bbe-2933-6583-68270d3ac78b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:9d984c37-9bbe-2933-6583-68270d3ac78b
msgctxt "he46b33f1g97efg481cgb701g7a3d210af865"
msgid "Uh huh. And how much will I get?"
msgstr "어 흠. 그래서 난 얼마를 받을 수 있는데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 9e241fbc-09fc-532f-4413-41475c3537e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 448b6dbd-8926-601d-b37b-032a81c58532_SaidHowFortuitous = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:9e241fbc-09fc-532f-4413-41475c3537e7
msgctxt "hfb7518dcge6f2g4e03ga7d3g367cb45faa05"
msgid ""
"Oh how fortuitous! And not just because you're not trying to kill me. I was "
"hoping to meet a friendly gith, actually."
msgstr "오 이런 행운이 있나! 단지 날 죽이려고 한 게 아니라서만이 아냐. 사실, 난 우호적인 기스를 만나길 바랐거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = a00c11ba-186a-1626-838a-23adcc6408cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:a00c11ba-186a-1626-838a-23adcc6408cc
msgctxt "h5d594fe1g3fb2g403agab83gd9a9e1fd9d9a"
msgid ""
"You held my success in your hands only to stomp on it, and report it to me "
"with <i>glee? </i>I will not be mocked!"
msgstr "내 성공을 손에 쥐고 있다가 그걸 짓밟고 <i>실실거리면서</i> 나한테 보고하러 와? 이따위 모욕은 참치 않겠어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = a406c055-3369-27c0-f042-01d2062dc41d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:a406c055-3369-27c0-f042-01d2062dc41d
msgctxt "h92c8ae83g5c86g475dgae8cgfc429feeefb5"
msgid "Excellent."
msgstr "훌륭해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = a41668fa-661e-7585-1be3-c48ba0116d5b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - LOW_TheLodge_Knows_SocietyWantsGithEgg = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:a41668fa-661e-7585-1be3-c48ba0116d5b
msgctxt "h2a2938d7g0874g4f63ga6d0g9df80323eebd"
msgid ""
"The Society of Brilliance tasked me with acquiring one of their eggs in "
"order to settle a dispute."
msgstr "광명회는 논쟁을 해결하기 위해 기스양키 알 하나를 얻는 임무를 내게 맡겼어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = a438be4f-5bdd-440a-42cc-36ade5d5ad58
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:a438be4f-5bdd-440a-42cc-36ade5d5ad58
msgctxt "h771c9b2egc443g4b06ga958g510d7fb4df4b"
msgid "Or... fearsome? Pleasantly fearsome?"
msgstr "아니면... 오싹했나? 유쾌하게 오싹한?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = a574eec9-cfa0-94e1-aedc-f0563737fa55
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:a574eec9-cfa0-94e1-aedc-f0563737fa55
msgctxt "hd9262854gf0b7g4cc5g80f2g2ebff1183e62"
msgid ""
"Hogwash, of course. A githyanki can no more rise above its nature than "
"gnomes can fly."
msgstr "헛소리지, 당연히. 노움이 날 수 있을리가 없듯이, 기스양키가 본성을 극복하는 건 불가능해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a774e5e0-5119-03b1-3c9d-a6cf300718a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FIGHTER(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:a774e5e0-5119-03b1-3c9d-a6cf300718a6
msgctxt "h44d84a85g381dg45e2gbe0cgd313d8e01489"
msgid ""
"Violence is taught, not inherited. I would know - I received <i>impeccable</"
"i> training."
msgstr "폭력은 배우게 되는 것이지, 물려받는 게 아니야. 난 알 수 있어 - <i>흠잡을 데 없는</i> 훈련을 받았거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a7f91ef1-76bc-736b-72c3-62b73dbb080f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:a7f91ef1-76bc-736b-72c3-62b73dbb080f
msgctxt "haea5cfd4ga5a0g4095gbc65g4ee89e79f9c4"
msgid "And why's that?"
msgstr "그 이유가 뭐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = ab1cc34b-0427-4f89-0aa8-985983ef6b80
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_State_QuestAccepted = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:ab1cc34b-0427-4f89-0aa8-985983ef6b80
msgctxt "hfae25843ge6e9g4c4bgbbe1g9ea31b32d791"
msgid ""
"A word of advice: avoid direct confrontation. Crèche-bound githyanki can be "
"a deadly sort."
msgstr "충고 한마디: 직접적인 대립은 피해야 해. 양성소 구역의 기스양키는 무시무시한 놈들이거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = ac9ed220-6eeb-2af5-3128-c41f0b000db0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_Event_RewardPaid = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_State_QuestCompleted = True
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_Event_RewardPaid = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:ac9ed220-6eeb-2af5-3128-c41f0b000db0
msgctxt "h5d93a3efgfdd2g4194g94b2gd096155b3cb1"
msgid ""
"Well, I suppose a spot of conversation never goes amiss. Here's your reward."
msgstr "뭐, 그동안의 대화가 헛된 것 같지는 않네. 여기 보상받아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ad2b571b-f899-5b5c-d828-c1660b32ecba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:ad2b571b-f899-5b5c-d828-c1660b32ecba
msgctxt "h8725f0aag7cb1g4c67ga2c2g5d9086ddabab"
msgid "I want to trade."
msgstr "거래를 하고 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b27b1a2b-838c-4ac2-d8a3-e746b7b5f2ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:b27b1a2b-838c-4ac2-d8a3-e746b7b5f2ea
msgctxt "ha8397474gb7b4g4dcfgbc01gd8634cf58b02"
msgid ""
"*Using every scrap of your concentration, you kick the egg <i>just </i>hard "
"enough that it doesn't crack, but soars like a red dragon.*"
msgstr "*당신은 모든 집중력을 발휘하여, 알이 깨지지 않을 <i>정도</i>의 힘으로 찼지만, 레드 드래곤처럼 솟구쳐 오릅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = b750740e-0091-66f6-1c09-9813b40abaa4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:b750740e-0091-66f6-1c09-9813b40abaa4
msgctxt "h80249e48g7066g4ed8g8a0dg703cf74eeec6"
msgid ""
"I know! They were pure savages - not like you. I'm sure you would appreciate "
"that this is all in the name of knowledge."
msgstr "알아! 너랑 달리 그들은 완전 야만인들이었어. 너라면 분명 지식이라는 이름하에 있는 이 모든 가치를 이해할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = b79c7d2a-5e2e-2308-d131-d2b2304e3720
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:b79c7d2a-5e2e-2308-d131-d2b2304e3720
msgctxt "ha545bdd4gd680g4d8agb75fg0de91fa72aab"
msgid "In fact, maybe you'd be able to succeed where I... was less successful."
msgstr "사실, 내가 성공하기 어려운 장소이기에... 아마 너는 성공 할 수 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = b7c03d24-489b-8049-a0b0-8e3a17c6b1b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:b7c03d24-489b-8049-a0b0-8e3a17c6b1b1
msgctxt "h6a21372eg2691g4fddgb014g634b30eba73b"
msgid ""
"I should hope so! When adventure calls, I am always thoroughly prepared. "
"Take a look."
msgstr "그랬으면 좋겠네! 모험을 떠날 때면, 난 철저하게 준비하는 편이거든. 한번 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = b8f9f019-fb54-47c4-a624-d93121633b24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:b8f9f019-fb54-47c4-a624-d93121633b24
msgctxt "h7ed88ed6g1ce7g4006ga19cg2ca293a6b061"
msgid ""
"Nod your head, play along. Find out what you can, take her head when it's "
"done."
msgstr "동의하는 척, 고개를 끄덕여라. 할 수 있는 게 뭔지 알아보고, 끝나면 그녀의 머리를 취해라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = ba273a1b-a994-a6f5-766a-8573089c7365
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:ba273a1b-a994-a6f5-766a-8573089c7365
msgctxt "h1a828f81ge3f5g4c79g82dfg610679235436"
msgid ""
"I left your stupid crèche, why are you still chasing me? I don't even want "
"your bloody eggs!"
msgstr "네놈들의 바보 같은 양성소도 떠났는데, 왜 자꾸 뒤쫓는 거야? 너한테 망할 알을 달라고 한 것도 아니잖아!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = bcb64b71-5f5f-e6c3-2b7b-ea62984e70ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 448b6dbd-8926-601d-b37b-032a81c58532_SaidHowFortuitous = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 448b6dbd-8926-601d-b37b-032a81c58532_SaidHowFortuitous = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:bcb64b71-5f5f-e6c3-2b7b-ea62984e70ba
msgctxt "h3ef0031cg9c68g4f33gbbcag95fb6dd47fc3"
msgid ""
"You - you're not from the crèche? Oh, how fortuitous! And not just because "
"you're not trying to kill me."
msgstr "너 - 너는 크례세에서 온 게 아니구나? 오, 이런 행운이 있나! 그뿐만 아니라 날 죽이려는 것도 아니었네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = bd3823d3-aabe-d856-0185-362b5edf958f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Laezel_Knows_CrecheLocation = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:bd3823d3-aabe-d856-0185-362b5edf958f
msgctxt "h2b01e77eg6e9fg46aag91fbg3220b71dde15"
msgid ""
"Inside that temple lies one of your 'crèches', which I gather has its very "
"own hatchery, presumably chock full of eggs."
msgstr ""
"저 신전 안에 너희 '양성소'중 한 곳이 있는데, 모은 정보로는 그곳에 자체 부화장이 있고, 아마 알로 가득 찬 상태인 거 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = be2943c4-2f62-674a-10ea-dca9e7bd1677
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:be2943c4-2f62-674a-10ea-dca9e7bd1677
msgctxt "hcd83288agcbb1g4727g974bg59b3b6fa13d1"
msgid "<i>Leave</i>."
msgstr "<i>떠난다</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = be2cbf58-bbad-938a-cd64-2f7a879969db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:be2cbf58-bbad-938a-cd64-2f7a879969db
msgctxt "h883946fdg9039g491bga6cdg46db235bdecc"
msgid "I might have a few trinkets worth a glance."
msgstr "슬쩍 보니 괜찮은 장신구가 몇 개 있는 거 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = be7b0a41-1dd0-dd75-fd80-dfd8ddb90b47
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_Event_RewardPaid = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_State_QuestCompleted = True
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_Event_RewardPaid = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:be7b0a41-1dd0-dd75-fd80-dfd8ddb90b47
msgctxt "h20f58768g5cffg44c9gb488gb4db97db9985"
msgid "A reward is most assuredly in order."
msgstr "역시 보상을 줘야 가장 확실하겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c0b7b72d-8646-8bdc-4f95-da796f7f505c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:c0b7b72d-8646-8bdc-4f95-da796f7f505c
msgctxt "h8a5a0ef7g1b82g4114gbcf5g7c6d34e26945"
msgid "Why did you want a githyanki egg?"
msgstr "왜 기스양키의 알을 원하는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = c254497c-c05d-f5d3-fc6e-66ba8ebd17e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_Event_RewardPaid = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_State_QuestCompleted = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:c254497c-c05d-f5d3-fc6e-66ba8ebd17e0
msgctxt "ha42d3f7ag8bfag4589gb714g97ae72471798"
msgid "Trusting you with payment up front was a good investment, it seems."
msgstr "선불로 널 믿었던 건 좋은 투자였던 것 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c29a0adc-26de-d18c-8cf9-4f2ae3f5c0cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:c29a0adc-26de-d18c-8cf9-4f2ae3f5c0cb
msgctxt "haf9bc43bg81e3g4f30g90bdg3a39c33f54b2"
msgid "I blew it up. The crèche too."
msgstr "내가 날려버렸지. 양성소도 같이."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = c372ee0f-efa7-7689-e015-a7345446806e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:c372ee0f-efa7-7689-e015-a7345446806e
msgctxt "h8ec86f8dgd425g44efg84efgc40f138b3d9e"
msgid "Alas, I shall have to search for that egg elsewhere now."
msgstr "아아, 이제 다른 곳에서 그 알을 찾아봐야겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c3963513-7a76-ea7a-c1be-60632eb55edf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:c3963513-7a76-ea7a-c1be-60632eb55edf
msgctxt "h61a5f025gd4d8g4469g9223gfb2b8fbd27a1"
msgid "Calm yourself, I am not chasing you."
msgstr "진정해, 당신을 쫓아온 거 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = c6859dbd-0a08-ddc6-cef5-e3852efff70b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:c6859dbd-0a08-ddc6-cef5-e3852efff70b
msgctxt "h30a117e8ge3a4g4044g9bc2gda6aec5a01a1"
msgid ""
"I need a githyanki egg - which may sound a little unsavoury, but I swear "
"this is all for an excellent cause."
msgstr "난 기스양키의 알이 필요해 - 약간 불쾌하게 들리겠지만, 이 모든 것이 훌륭한 목적을 위한 것이라 맹세한다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = c6b286cd-9f94-3ef7-ca92-f81ba5903f56
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_State_Hasmet(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_State_Hasmet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_State_HasSeen = True
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_State_MetAnyPlayer(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:c6b286cd-9f94-3ef7-ca92-f81ba5903f56
msgctxt "h2360499fg2fc5g4cd7g8266g3f5091c09c4c"
msgid "Stop there! Not one step further!"
msgstr "거기 멈춰! 한 발짝도 가까이 오지 마!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c7b62755-d736-b587-c5de-60ba96c86c33
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:c7b62755-d736-b587-c5de-60ba96c86c33
msgctxt "ha79db726gfdcbg4c1ag9fb6g7fe808cc78c0"
msgid "How did you know there was a crèche in there?"
msgstr "저곳에 양성소가 있다는 걸 어떻게 알아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c827fc2d-ca8c-5726-bea9-340da86618fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:c827fc2d-ca8c-5726-bea9-340da86618fb
msgctxt "he708f8c8gb1ccg4f88g9699g58e4e0c83d66"
msgid "Why exactly do you want this egg?"
msgstr "정확히 왜 그 알을 원하는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c9586b0b-f8f1-614d-2b60-76a399fce3ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:c9586b0b-f8f1-614d-2b60-76a399fce3ab
msgctxt "he813ff44gecccg4401g8a75gdb86aaffca28"
msgid "What makes you think I'm friendly?"
msgstr "왜 내가 우호적이라고 생각하는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = c9f6789a-802a-8304-a4f3-c1e405ba6aea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:c9f6789a-802a-8304-a4f3-c1e405ba6aea
msgctxt "h5e5379fcgb5e1g417fg900dg1276da64136b"
msgid "To settle a debate. Nature or nurture."
msgstr "논쟁을 끝내기 위해서. 선천성이냐, 후천성이냐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = cb2551a1-729a-2a4c-3a12-eeba2003cc86
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:cb2551a1-729a-2a4c-3a12-eeba2003cc86
msgctxt "he6280e45g55e9g43fdg9e5bg8e64f9906d5b"
msgid ""
"I would be happy to reveal its extremely secret location if you'd be willing "
"to perform one small favour for me."
msgstr "만약 내게 작은 호의를 베풀어 줄 용의가 있다면, 기꺼이 그 엄청나게 비밀스러운 위치를 알려줄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cb41bdb9-181b-6273-bd07-5bc9091f25df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CRE_Hatchery_State_HasGithYankiEgg(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_State_GithyankiEggDelivered = True
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_Event_GiveGithEggTo(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:cb41bdb9-181b-6273-bd07-5bc9091f25df
msgctxt "h26ae0b3agc8e4g4e10gb075ga8edaa3801c8"
msgid "I have the egg right here. Take it."
msgstr "알 여기 있어, 가져가."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = cc5e0655-b72a-97aa-1461-260e9788ce94
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:cc5e0655-b72a-97aa-1461-260e9788ce94
msgctxt "ha5aea425gf137g435bg8830ge4f658491e90"
msgid "It looks different to what I expected. Are you sure that's a gith egg?"
msgstr "내 예상과는 다르게 생겼네. 기스 알인 게 확실해?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = ce3bb899-7113-7eed-8255-4c6133d92aeb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - LOW_TheLodge_Knows_SocietyWantsGithEgg = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:ce3bb899-7113-7eed-8255-4c6133d92aeb
msgctxt "h4f5eec16g6187g4ac9g8826g1afe7301b4cc"
msgid ""
"It's for the Society of Brilliance. Clever lot, but they're convinced they "
"can raise a githyanki child to be <i>good. </i>"
msgstr "광명회를 위한 거야. 똑똑한 사람들이지만, 기스양키 아이를 <i>선하게</i> 양육할 수 있다고 확신하더라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = d1fb722d-3be9-29e2-f13f-783a4dfb96d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - LOW_TheLodge_Knows_SocietyWantsGithEgg = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:d1fb722d-3be9-29e2-f13f-783a4dfb96d0
msgctxt "h06605ae0gabc3g41d2gb0eagdb41bed07a6a"
msgid ""
"The Society of Brilliance asked me to acquire one of their roe so they can "
"incubate it and, once it hatches, raise the spawn in their tradition."
msgstr "광명회는 내게 기스양키의 알을 구해 달라고 부탁했어. 그 알을 품어서 부화시키고, 태어난 아이를 광명회 전통대로 키우려는 거지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = d37a8573-b228-eaaa-cd46-38e35b3e4ec5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:d37a8573-b228-eaaa-cd46-38e35b3e4ec5
msgctxt "hebe06cebg2cddg444ag84cdg1d41bf6355f8"
msgid "I knew I was right about you beasts."
msgstr "내 생각대로 너희는 그냥 짐승일 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = d37ef3a6-b4c3-4961-9263-3a76752c1fc3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:d37ef3a6-b4c3-4961-9263-3a76752c1fc3
msgctxt "h97a4a327g9f3fg41ebga89bg6821aa1da7c1"
msgid "And once inside, you could simply... purloin an egg."
msgstr "그러고 일단 들어가면, 그냥 간단하게... 알을 훔치면 되는 거지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = d4efcf30-bcf5-0f46-a54a-c7157160764e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:d4efcf30-bcf5-0f46-a54a-c7157160764e
msgctxt "h45d9ce9fg65b3g4828gaeaage379f82a3b1d"
msgid "What? Surrender an egg, and I will <i>not</i> stand for it."
msgstr "뭐라고? 알을 내주겠다니, 난 절대 참지 <i>않을</i> 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = d62026c6-e615-062c-dd02-fc7b21539282
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_Event_RewardPaid = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:d62026c6-e615-062c-dd02-fc7b21539282
msgctxt "h9bc87446g986ag49b5g91aegc255292f0d3c"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry? You think you can take my money and then just back out? I will "
"not be robbed by the likes of you!"
msgstr "뭐? 그냥 그렇게 돈을 받아먹고 가겠다고? 너 같은 놈한테 강도질 당하고 내가 그냥 가만히 있을 것 같아!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d689a533-a175-e77f-ef6b-2331a9d1a3df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_State_GithyankiEggDelivered = True
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_Event_GiveGithEggTo(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:d689a533-a175-e77f-ef6b-2331a9d1a3df
msgctxt "ha2978530g08bdg4aebgaa9dg6ca64a072938"
msgid "You're in luck - I've got the githyanki egg you were looking for."
msgstr "운이 좋네, 당신이 찾는 기스양키 알을 내가 가지고 있거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = d6ea1080-13b5-1e91-2b00-7736622f6222
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:d6ea1080-13b5-1e91-2b00-7736622f6222
msgctxt "h1606b86eg2194g48fagae43g4013084a1693"
msgid ""
"What the Society doesn't know won't hurt it, and we're left handsomely "
"legacied either way."
msgstr "광명회가 모르는 게 해가 되지는 않겠지, 그리고 어느 쪽이든 우리는 훌륭한 유산을 남기게 되는 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = d75ebf67-9636-bcd1-5a8d-da8c4c3b9d33
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_State_Hasmet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_State_QuestAccepted = False
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_State_QuestCompleted = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:d75ebf67-9636-bcd1-5a8d-da8c4c3b9d33
msgctxt "he317c7f1g8c2bg48d0g9be2g1cb9f242288f"
msgid "Have you given any more thought to the retrieval of that githyanki egg?"
msgstr "기스양키 알 회수에 관해 좀 더 생각해 봤어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = d78cdc6f-1921-b5d1-198a-403907d5da26
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_Event_RewardPaid = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:d78cdc6f-1921-b5d1-198a-403907d5da26
msgctxt "h98ea0cc1g15e7g454cg908cg774166a015a1"
msgid "What a creative solution. I hope we can work together again some day."
msgstr "정말 창의적인 해결책이야. 언젠가 또 같이 일할 날이 있길 바랄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = d9a6e336-5a18-c3ca-3765-4fd6402a1bb8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:d9a6e336-5a18-c3ca-3765-4fd6402a1bb8
msgctxt "h36d8b06dgccaag4fd0ga82dgee11416f60c5"
msgid "I - uh - it's simply because you look so... pleasant."
msgstr "난 - 어 - 그냥 그렇게 보이더라고... 유쾌하게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = da79a226-424e-f6df-cf53-1731812fed78
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CRE_Hatchery_State_HasGithYankiEgg(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_State_GithyankiEggDelivered = True
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_Event_GiveGithEggTo(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:da79a226-424e-f6df-cf53-1731812fed78
msgctxt "hb6bd6ae3gc072g4f11g8549ge08f14e6b697"
msgid "I already have an egg - here."
msgstr "이미 내가 알을 가지고 있지, 여기."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = db560050-b838-de8f-c590-0d0daab10954
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:db560050-b838-de8f-c590-0d0daab10954
msgctxt "h5905a19ag8ffdg40afg861egfc82ba71468f"
msgid "...Look, I just need someone to fetch me a gith egg. Can you do that?"
msgstr "...이봐, 단지 난 알을 가져올 누군가가 필요한 거라고. 해 줄 수 있어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = db62fd3f-0623-218b-5535-596ddd330fb3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_Event_RewardPaid = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_Event_RewardPaid = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:db62fd3f-0623-218b-5535-596ddd330fb3
msgctxt "h16998ce0ga0f3g4c96gbc1fg723409ef477a"
msgid ""
"Here's your payment. I'd hope it's enough to warrant your discretion too."
msgstr "보상 여기 있어. 네 재량에 대한 충분한 보장도 됐길 바랄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dc5ee9f1-93df-dcf5-e802-7dd23f688f07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CRE_Hatchery_State_HasGithYankiEgg(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_State_GithyankiEggDelivered = True
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_Event_GiveGithEggTo(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:dc5ee9f1-93df-dcf5-e802-7dd23f688f07
msgctxt "h2171a048g12b6g447cg9b39gf49c2b14c7c6"
msgid "I have your egg. Take it."
msgstr "알 가져왔어, 받아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = de971e9b-5406-9166-ae91-3a38022fc550
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Hatchery_State_EggDestroyed = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:de971e9b-5406-9166-ae91-3a38022fc550
msgctxt "hcd4ed10agbb4bg4577g8a8eg57ffe039ae6a"
msgid "I found an egg, but destroyed it."
msgstr "알 하나 찾았었는데, 깨버렸어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = e0bae39b-96bf-819d-85c0-c3cae88f9236
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_Event_RewardPaid = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_State_QuestCompleted = True
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_Event_RewardPaid = True
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_State_OwlbearEggGiven = True
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_Event_HandoverOwlbearEgg(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:e0bae39b-96bf-819d-85c0-c3cae88f9236
msgctxt "h84fcff97g1142g45f0g94d0g9b04185fa4a6"
msgid "How excellent. Here is, as promised, your reward."
msgstr "정말 훌륭해. 여기, 약속했던 보상이야, 받아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e0eef5c6-bfee-d9f1-a719-cbf6be802163
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:e0eef5c6-bfee-d9f1-a719-cbf6be802163
msgctxt "hff35290egc5d5g4e1egb766gd13fd29db1fd"
msgid ""
"A flying gnome. I'd need an airfoil, of course. And a source of propulsion."
msgstr "하늘을 나는 노움. 물론, 날개와 추진력이 필요하겠지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = e183ebc2-0cd8-0793-c783-679343bd6b12
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:e183ebc2-0cd8-0793-c783-679343bd6b12
msgctxt "h687821e9g407bg4d2ega890gc7754d074116"
msgid "You'll be well compensated, of course. Just bring me an egg."
msgstr "당연히, 보상은 후하게 쳐줄게. 알 하나만 가져와 줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = e183ebc2-0cd8-0793-c783-679343bd6b12
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:e183ebc2-0cd8-0793-c783-679343bd6b12
msgctxt "h247a79f6g1401g4585gaa2ag14b1835bdf78"
msgid "So. What do you say?"
msgstr "그래서, 어떻게 할 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = e472bbda-3a87-8cc8-6de0-da9761c56023
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:e472bbda-3a87-8cc8-6de0-da9761c56023
msgctxt "h0d53083eg9fb2g4e99ga75ag546945affe83"
msgid "You brute, what have you <i>done?</i> You will pay for this!"
msgstr "이 짐승 같은 놈, 무슨 짓을 <i>한 거야?</i> 대가를 치르게 해주마!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = e50ef9f3-85b5-a140-21ca-3e522fb485a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:e50ef9f3-85b5-a140-21ca-3e522fb485a6
msgctxt "h658a8e7fgcbcag4d39ga1a6g5d953d0d16b3"
msgid ""
"They have the audacity to call that hole a crèche, as if it weren't actually "
"a murderous training camp."
msgstr "놈들은 거기가 살인마 양성소가 아니기라도 한 것처럼, 뻔뻔하게도 '양성소'라고 부르고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = e6f6f18c-b488-62d6-1bb1-390800dd9b9b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_State_PaidUpfront = True
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_State_QuestAccepted = True
#.     - CRE_Expeditioner_Event_RewardPaid = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:e6f6f18c-b488-62d6-1bb1-390800dd9b9b
msgctxt "h6d7c476dge932g4f89g83bag8737c8da4b9a"
msgid "Very well, here's the money. Now I expect a speedy delivery."
msgstr "좋아, 여기 돈 받아. 이제 신속한 배달을 기대하겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = e7ddd781-7ddc-4b47-b606-fb7d2636b39f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:e7ddd781-7ddc-4b47-b606-fb7d2636b39f
msgctxt "h0b455592g3549g4601g8c36g5579509d6203"
msgid "<i>Shka'keth</i>! You would steal away one of our children?"
msgstr "<i>쉬카케쓰</i>! 우리 아이들 중 한 명을 훔치겠다고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ea2bffb2-ef74-d572-f365-cd9edfa4b3b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:ea2bffb2-ef74-d572-f365-cd9edfa4b3b9
msgctxt "h26a9683ag3a3eg4cf4gbc11gf29f10a57668"
msgid "Hmm? Oh. Nothing."
msgstr "음? 오. 아무것도 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = ede53b75-bfe2-0fad-bf8c-b0a198a4115c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - LOW_TheLodge_Knows_SocietyWantsGithEgg = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:ede53b75-bfe2-0fad-bf8c-b0a198a4115c
msgctxt "h5892ca35g1ba6g412cga675g05cd64037bc9"
msgid ""
"The Society of Brilliance have asked me to acquire one of your people's roe "
"so they can incubate it and, once it hatches, raise it in their tradition."
msgstr ""
"광명회는 나에게 너희 알 하나를 구해 달라 부탁했어. 그 알을 얻으면 품어서 부화시키고, 태어난 아이를 광명회 전통대로 키우려는 거지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = efc66f19-3955-214d-564b-918e8c193251
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(1) = True
#.      - OATHBREAKER(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:efc66f19-3955-214d-564b-918e8c193251
msgctxt "hbbf77378gccb3g4ebbg83e4g056496aeb902"
msgid "State your cause. I'll be the judge of how 'good' it is."
msgstr "취지를 말해봐. 그게 얼마나 '좋은' 건지 판단해 주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = f56ccb77-a98a-04d5-aa19-29c9ef4e8e7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:f56ccb77-a98a-04d5-aa19-29c9ef4e8e7e
msgctxt "ha22e806agec3fg4f88g8f0bge68137cb6b74"
msgid ""
"Very well, but I'll make note of how much time you waste trawling through "
"baubles."
msgstr "좋아, 하지만 물건 고르는 데 낭비하는 시간은 기록해 두겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = fa3e1f1b-b061-fdcc-2715-272593df349d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:fa3e1f1b-b061-fdcc-2715-272593df349d
msgctxt "h5deb53bag61deg4cffgafbfge0cb09aceb9d"
msgid "I see this being a highly prosperous partnership."
msgstr "우린 분명 매우 번영하는 협력 관계가 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fb9a4abb-d573-a64c-44fe-66f4f70c9f98
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 448b6dbd-8926-601d-b37b-032a81c58532_CRE_Expeditioner_TriedOwlbear = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckHasItemTemplate = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 448b6dbd-8926-601d-b37b-032a81c58532_CRE_Expeditioner_TriedOwlbear = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:fb9a4abb-d573-a64c-44fe-66f4f70c9f98
msgctxt "he0a76775g5ebdg4f6fgaa24gff3005a97ac8"
msgid "<i>Produce the owlbear egg</i>."
msgstr "<i>아울베어의 알을 꺼내 보여준다</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = fde02b24-2ae2-101f-47b8-279f5e9a9e31
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:fde02b24-2ae2-101f-47b8-279f5e9a9e31
msgctxt "hcae07cabgaf5fg477egb522g5f119ecd5ba7"
msgid "What? No, of course not! I was merely - well..."
msgstr "뭐라고? 당연히 아니지! 아니 그냥 - 음..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = ff324d21-887a-833b-142e-c517e5cfaee2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner:ff324d21-887a-833b-142e-c517e5cfaee2
msgctxt "h650d5595g7012g451dgb0d6g448f3efbd4fc"
msgid ""
"This could be an auspicious meeting, come to think of it. I was hoping to "
"meet a friendly gith."
msgstr "생각해보니, 행운의 만남이 될 수도 있겠어. 난 우호적인 기스를 만나길 바랐거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner_AD_Greeting
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 5e604d2f-a32c-1100-920d-063930ff33a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_State_MetAnyPlayer(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner_AD_Greeting:5e604d2f-a32c-1100-920d-063930ff33a5
msgctxt "h550c5afdga765g45bdg91d4g35232152aceb"
msgid "There must be one helpful soul in this desolate wasteland."
msgstr "이 황량한 불모지에도 도움을 줄 선량한 영혼 하나쯤은 있을 터인데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner_AD_Greeting
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 5e604d2f-a32c-1100-920d-063930ff33a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[1]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_State_MetAnyPlayer(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner_AD_Greeting:5e604d2f-a32c-1100-920d-063930ff33a5
msgctxt "hf3a342d3g6dfag4119g8949gd2cc6b8b34cd"
msgid "A curse on every gith. Intransigent louts..."
msgstr "기스들 죄다 저주나 받으라지. 비타협적이고 예의도 없는..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner_AD_Greeting
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 646e2153-1672-1ef3-8675-227f6ae7afb3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_State_QuestCompleted = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner_AD_Greeting:646e2153-1672-1ef3-8675-227f6ae7afb3
msgctxt "h8bc64ea8g5255g4564ga6c2g49f1c8b39ca0"
msgid "Even though there's a killer growing inside, the egg is rather cute..."
msgstr "안에서 살인마가 자라고 있긴 하지만은, 이 알은 그래도 꽤 귀엽구먼..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner_AD_Greeting
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 646e2153-1672-1ef3-8675-227f6ae7afb3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[1]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_State_QuestCompleted = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner_AD_Greeting:646e2153-1672-1ef3-8675-227f6ae7afb3
msgctxt "hbe2a9f34g4d18g4150gb8c9g30e4f8579e81"
msgid "This egg is perfect. The Society will be pleased."
msgstr "완벽한 알이야. 광명회가 기뻐하겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner_AD_Greeting
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 870e5da5-373e-2fc9-0fba-1ddb696de74d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_State_QuestAccepted = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner_AD_Greeting:870e5da5-373e-2fc9-0fba-1ddb696de74d
msgctxt "h7c54582eg9037g4480ga5dbg47cd7ede9d33"
msgid "I am taking such a long bath when I get home."
msgstr "집에 가면 간절히 바라던 목욕부터 해야겠구마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner_AD_Greeting
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 870e5da5-373e-2fc9-0fba-1ddb696de74d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[1]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_State_QuestAccepted = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner_AD_Greeting:870e5da5-373e-2fc9-0fba-1ddb696de74d
msgctxt "h4e67a521g9937g4cc3g979cg3c1febf78e0f"
msgid "All I need is the egg. Then I can forget this whole sorry mess."
msgstr "이 알 때문에 얼마나 고생을 했는지. 이제야 이 난장판을 떠날 수 있겠구먼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner_AD_Greeting
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = 870e5da5-373e-2fc9-0fba-1ddb696de74d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[2]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Expeditioner_State_QuestAccepted = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner_AD_Greeting:870e5da5-373e-2fc9-0fba-1ddb696de74d
msgctxt "h85adac54g81feg4bb8gb042g67354bc99fcc"
msgid "What is taking them so long? Some of us want to leave..."
msgstr "왜 이렇게 오래 걸려? 빨리 가고 싶단 말이여..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner_AD_Greeting
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = f4c652fe-687c-4acf-ad29-e07d88847f6b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner_AD_Greeting:f4c652fe-687c-4acf-ad29-e07d88847f6b
msgctxt "h393c3543g7d18g41ffgbcd5gc83c7c1f8e77"
msgid "Hello? Who's there?"
msgstr "저기? 누구 있나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner_AD_Greeting
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = f4c652fe-687c-4acf-ad29-e07d88847f6b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[1]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner_AD_Greeting:f4c652fe-687c-4acf-ad29-e07d88847f6b
msgctxt "h28c2e0dcg056ag43bbg84feg0bbbac7fbf64"
msgid "I warn you - I'm <i>exceptionally </i>well-armed."
msgstr "경고하건대, 나는 무장 <i>끝내주게 </i> 잘 되어 있다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner_AD_Greeting
#. Speaker = Lady Esther
#. NodeID = f4c652fe-687c-4acf-ad29-e07d88847f6b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[2]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Expeditioner_AD_Greeting:f4c652fe-687c-4acf-ad29-e07d88847f6b
msgctxt "hcdab9d3dge96dg4689gb715g2eaa6334260d"
msgid "Yes? Who goes there?"
msgstr "응? 거기 누구요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_ArrivalStatuePlaque
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = fe9a58db-ac6d-4ce0-8785-6d5baac4fbf5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_ArrivalStatuePlaque:fe9a58db-ac6d-4ce0-8785-6d5baac4fbf5
msgctxt "hd73b7519gdc21g4a18gaf67g63fed9b9d862"
msgid "*Blessed be you, pilgrim. Take respite now in the Dawn's loving gaze.*"
msgstr "*순례자여, 축복이 있기를. 이제 새벽의 사랑스러운 시선 속에서 휴식을 취하십시오.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_FerryResult
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6ddf79ed-db7f-4c4f-ad51-8fa8f1ad57fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Exterior_State_FerryActive = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_FerryResult:6ddf79ed-db7f-4c4f-ad51-8fa8f1ad57fd
msgctxt "hd1c3bc78g4ca1g41e4g814fg7a6e0fe797a2"
msgid "Well that didn't want to move. How long was it stranded there?"
msgstr "휴, 저건 움직이길 원하지 않았던 것 같은데. 저기에 얼마나 오래 묶여 있었던 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_FerryResult
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6ddf79ed-db7f-4c4f-ad51-8fa8f1ad57fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Exterior_State_FerryActive = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_FerryResult:6ddf79ed-db7f-4c4f-ad51-8fa8f1ad57fd
msgctxt "h86fffc6cgeba9g4455ga0e2g9de4937aee93"
msgid ""
"My, took quite the workout to get this moving. Must have been ages since "
"someone last used it."
msgstr "이거, 움직이는 데 아주 많은 노력이 필요하네. 마지막으로 사용된 게 꽤 오래전이었나 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_FerryResult
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6ddf79ed-db7f-4c4f-ad51-8fa8f1ad57fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Exterior_State_FerryActive = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_FerryResult:6ddf79ed-db7f-4c4f-ad51-8fa8f1ad57fd
msgctxt "hfa4004fbg9519g4a67g8595ge3b06cf84bee"
msgid "Must've been out of use for a long old time."
msgstr "오랜 시간 사용되지 않았던 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_FerryResult
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6ddf79ed-db7f-4c4f-ad51-8fa8f1ad57fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Exterior_State_FerryActive = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_FerryResult:6ddf79ed-db7f-4c4f-ad51-8fa8f1ad57fd
msgctxt "ha33a42d6g345bg4e5agb758g234c1dde8ab2"
msgid "Good - with great effort, great reward. Or so I hope."
msgstr "좋아. 엄청난 노력에는 엄청난 보상이 따라야지. 그냥 내 희망일 수도 있지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_FerryResult
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6ddf79ed-db7f-4c4f-ad51-8fa8f1ad57fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Exterior_State_FerryActive = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_FerryResult:6ddf79ed-db7f-4c4f-ad51-8fa8f1ad57fd
msgctxt "hb6aa0a0ag70d6g458cg94c0g4dc363989fea"
msgid "Hard to budge. Good thing I'm stronger than I look."
msgstr "움직이게 하기 힘드네. 내가 겉보기 보다 힘이 세서 다행이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_FerryResult
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6ddf79ed-db7f-4c4f-ad51-8fa8f1ad57fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Exterior_State_FerryActive = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_FerryResult:6ddf79ed-db7f-4c4f-ad51-8fa8f1ad57fd
msgctxt "hdf38a52cgd5feg45eega116gd52757c73c85"
msgid "Ugh - that took some doing. Mechanism must be corroded."
msgstr "으윽, 좀 힘든 일이었군. 장치가 부식된게 분명해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_FerryResult
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6ddf79ed-db7f-4c4f-ad51-8fa8f1ad57fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Exterior_State_FerryActive = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_FerryResult:6ddf79ed-db7f-4c4f-ad51-8fa8f1ad57fd
msgctxt "hdd1237fdgb08eg4637ga5c4g1252f3dae9ce"
msgid "That was tough, this can't have been used in a while."
msgstr "엄청 낡았네. 분명 최근에 사용 되진 않았을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_FerryResult
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9b111b50-11fc-aa2b-edb8-1beecab54110
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Exterior_State_FerryActive = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_FerryResult:9b111b50-11fc-aa2b-edb8-1beecab54110
msgctxt "h9beffe1dgc77fg411cgbeb9ga4476bdaebc4"
msgid "It's stuck fast. How long has this been sitting here?"
msgstr "단단히 끼었군. 대체 언제부터 여기 있었던 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_FerryResult
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9b111b50-11fc-aa2b-edb8-1beecab54110
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Exterior_State_FerryActive = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_FerryResult:9b111b50-11fc-aa2b-edb8-1beecab54110
msgctxt "h3ce2a898gd34cg4dd8g9ad7g37d7aaaeb80a"
msgid ""
"Blast. It'd take a hundred Mage Hands or more to set this thing in motion."
msgstr "놀라워. 이걸 작동시키려면 백개 이상의 마법사의 손이 필요할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_FerryResult
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9b111b50-11fc-aa2b-edb8-1beecab54110
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Exterior_State_FerryActive = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_FerryResult:9b111b50-11fc-aa2b-edb8-1beecab54110
msgctxt "hbd97c47egb92eg4be4g84b9gb4bbc45a0dd5"
msgid "Argh! Stuck. Bloody old thing."
msgstr "악! 걸렸어. 망할놈의 고물."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_FerryResult
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9b111b50-11fc-aa2b-edb8-1beecab54110
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Exterior_State_FerryActive = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_FerryResult:9b111b50-11fc-aa2b-edb8-1beecab54110
msgctxt "h8bedea04g1ba0g4406g8039g815856d00403"
msgid "The thing is older than the Rock of Bral - and just as unyielding."
msgstr "녀석은 브랄의 바위보다 더 오래됐어. 거기다 꼼짝도 하지 않는 점도 마찬가지군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_FerryResult
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9b111b50-11fc-aa2b-edb8-1beecab54110
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Exterior_State_FerryActive = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_FerryResult:9b111b50-11fc-aa2b-edb8-1beecab54110
msgctxt "hced991e6g6fe3g4d6agb82fg0cce7316e644"
msgid "Damn thing won't budge. Hasn't been used in some time."
msgstr "망할 물건이 꿈쩍도 안 해. 꽤 오래 사용되지 않았나 보군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_FerryResult
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9b111b50-11fc-aa2b-edb8-1beecab54110
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Exterior_State_FerryActive = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_FerryResult:9b111b50-11fc-aa2b-edb8-1beecab54110
msgctxt "hb124fefcg173bg4a21g9598ge085264d68e7"
msgid "Ugh - it's stuck. It can never be easy, can it?"
msgstr "윽, 끼어 버렸어. 쉽지 않을 것 같군, 그렇지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_FerryResult
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9b111b50-11fc-aa2b-edb8-1beecab54110
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Exterior_State_FerryActive = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_FerryResult:9b111b50-11fc-aa2b-edb8-1beecab54110
msgctxt "h302aed7cg3db3g4b47gb3f0gca45c006874e"
msgid "Damn, completely stuck. I wonder when it was used last."
msgstr "망할, 완전히 끼었잖아. 이게 마지막으로 사용된게 언젠지 궁금하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_FerrySign
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5d51c52f-60af-dcdd-63d2-5a58925f2655
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_FerrySign:5d51c52f-60af-dcdd-63d2-5a58925f2655
msgctxt "h703bb274g7655g4fa0g9b30g37766ecaa9b2"
msgid ""
"*Approach the ferry in Lathander's grace. May his gaze shine upon you, "
"pilgrim.*"
msgstr "*라샌더의 은총 속에서 선착장에 다가가십시오. 순례자여, 그의 시선이 당신에게 비추기를 기원합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_GraveMarker00
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d6f0659e-8ecd-43b8-a8d7-95005660bcb1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_GraveMarker00:d6f0659e-8ecd-43b8-a8d7-95005660bcb1
msgctxt "hb53a7839g886ag478bg8af5g1ef1f8ae21e5"
msgid "*DO NOT ENTER.*"
msgstr "*<b>들어가지 마세요.</b>*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_GraveMarker01
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 12376ba5-da53-4dbe-857d-079a724d844e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_GraveMarker01:12376ba5-da53-4dbe-857d-079a724d844e
msgctxt "h779a4482g3842g48d1gbd17g711e555f1b51"
msgid "*Pass at your peril.*"
msgstr "*위험을 감수하고 지나가세요.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_GraveMarker02
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4ccafcd7-f649-4460-8aa0-dff847429097
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_GraveMarker02:4ccafcd7-f649-4460-8aa0-dff847429097
msgctxt "h602488ddg998bg497bg9ae5g665c2987ab17"
msgid "*Beware of the shadows.*"
msgstr "*그림자를 조심하라.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_GraveMarker03
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 88a3e777-4941-47c7-a3df-0229acba31c7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_GraveMarker03:88a3e777-4941-47c7-a3df-0229acba31c7
msgctxt "hb99f4052gabaag4bb2g8cf9g84c2eb68cb25"
msgid "*Do not walk in darkness. Turn to the light.*"
msgstr "*어둠 속을 걷지 마라. 빛을 향해 돌아서라.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_Roadsign
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 10429672-c5d3-45a7-a39b-4dbfad58c18c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_Roadsign:10429672-c5d3-45a7-a39b-4dbfad58c18c
msgctxt "hc8b9d6aeg5791g4aebgab8cg6148eb513142"
msgid "*North - Rosymorn Monastery. West - Moonrise Towers.*"
msgstr "*북쪽, 장밋빛 아침 수도원. 서쪽, 문라이즈 타워.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_Roadsign01
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c521b32c-1179-451e-90a0-36579aadb978
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_Roadsign01:c521b32c-1179-451e-90a0-36579aadb978
msgctxt "hb346816cg3586g48f4ga482g7624393e9809"
msgid ""
"*North - Rosymorn Monastery. West - Moonrise Towers. South - Waukeen's Rest.*"
msgstr "*북쪽, 장밋빛 아침 수도원. 서쪽, 문라이즈 타워. 남쪽, 와우킨 쉼터.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_Roadsign02
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e08c39d2-b6d1-496c-bcb8-b330aded7c8f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_Roadsign02:e08c39d2-b6d1-496c-bcb8-b330aded7c8f
msgctxt "h127c8491g3b79g4a85gbc9ag77f9d353b0fc"
msgid "*North - Rosymorn Monastery.*"
msgstr "*북쪽, 장밋빛 아침 수도원.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_SCLSign
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e3b29274-ba35-4e66-93d6-04ef58978c48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_AD_SCLSign:e3b29274-ba35-4e66-93d6-04ef58978c48
msgctxt "hf8319f8bg6c6bg45e0gae44g063f9b1a1ca6"
msgid ""
"*Walk in the way of dawn, for Lathander cannot protect you where the light "
"doth not reach.*"
msgstr "*여명의 길을 따라 걷기를. 빛이 닿지 않는 곳에서는 라샌더께서도 그대를 지키지 못하니.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 02e096ca-1d29-dc8d-1df9-843d708a18ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(2) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait:02e096ca-1d29-dc8d-1df9-843d708a18ce
msgctxt "h0ccf442egff5cg41fcgbbd9g6c9843ae73c3"
msgid "<i>Do you think yourself wiser than Vlaakith herself?</i>"
msgstr "<i>너는 네가 다름 아닌 블라키스 님보다도 더 현명하다고 생각하냔 말이다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 065e4cdf-be2e-d07e-2808-5d7ed561e2fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(2) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait:065e4cdf-be2e-d07e-2808-5d7ed561e2fd
msgctxt "h2b8521e0g78b6g4069gbfbcg7ce34c095646"
msgid "No. Merely the most efficient."
msgstr "아니. 그저 가장 효율적인 수단을 취할 뿐이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 25afb11b-c994-5a94-33c0-2889dc755762
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - d428b460-5dd0-ecf4-4832-aeba12b2da59_AskedAboutGith = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(2) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait:25afb11b-c994-5a94-33c0-2889dc755762
msgctxt "hceeff891ge129g49f4g9307g1568aed273ea"
msgid ""
"That, or enslaved them. <i>Ch'mar, zal'a Vlaakith</i>. 'Vlaakith's will "
"above all.'"
msgstr "그랬거나, 아니면 놈들을 노예로 만들었겠지. <i>츠마르, 잘라 블라키스</i>. '블라키스의 뜻이 그 무엇보다 우선될지니.'"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 3f2f7710-8733-c21b-1a1d-4c8e82608e9e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(2) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait:3f2f7710-8733-c21b-1a1d-4c8e82608e9e
msgctxt "h9d0f2ab1gca6cg428ag8ee4ga44c739ec267"
msgid ""
"<i>Chk. </i>Are you also sorry for the roaches you crush under your feet? "
"For the weeds you pluck, and the vermin you slay?"
msgstr ""
"<i>츠크. </i>너는 네가 발로 짓밟고 다니는 바퀴벌레 따위에게도 연민을 느끼나? 네가 뽑는 잡초 한 줄기마다, 네가 잡아 죽이는 "
"해로운 짐승 하나마다 말이냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 4c27ef1f-b55b-4970-b95f-ce1ace160f4c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_GithCreche_Knows_LathanderArtefact = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(8) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait:4c27ef1f-b55b-4970-b95f-ce1ace160f4c
msgctxt "h3246764bgd64fg4201gad29gb04b2b40894f"
msgid ""
"The Dawnstar. A beacon to Lathander's faithful - and a startlingly potent "
"artefact."
msgstr "여명성이군. 라샌더의 신도들에게는 빛의 봉화이자 놀라울 정도로 강력한 아티팩트이기도 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4e72bfd6-3511-2f2f-571e-60cf9fbb3a43
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait:4e72bfd6-3511-2f2f-571e-60cf9fbb3a43
msgctxt "h943cd9bcg914ag4bd3ga6a2g916a09755a64"
msgid ""
"*A brilliant light shines from the temple's crest - a magical artefact of "
"uncertain power.*"
msgstr "*찬란한 빛이 신전의 가두리에서 뿜어져 나옵니다. 불분명한 힘을 지닌 마법 아티팩트인 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 4ee7d7fe-e6f1-f14c-e7a0-dd6ce4ef2786
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(2) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait:4ee7d7fe-e6f1-f14c-e7a0-dd6ce4ef2786
msgctxt "ha7415ce7g682eg49dcgbb08g0f7c1ec0d221"
msgid ""
"Not to mention a fine site for a crèche, concealed among the peaks and "
"ridges."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5439087a-d85e-8970-e36a-2201c75a0e2e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait:5439087a-d85e-8970-e36a-2201c75a0e2e
msgctxt "h31889d61g4dffg4aa9g92fdg6db7656bdc33"
msgid "Barbaric. Is violence your solution for everything?"
msgstr "야만스러워. 너희 족속은 모든 걸 폭력으로만 해결하려 드나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 5817a619-baa8-ccc8-3548-f32d88b76b76
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(2) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait:5817a619-baa8-ccc8-3548-f32d88b76b76
msgctxt "hf57cb4c6g6897g42dega7b6ga9b15c2a8d1b"
msgid ""
"As it must be. In a crèche, there is purpose. In a temple, only platitudes "
"and unheard prayer."
msgstr "그래야지. 양성소에는 분명한 목적이 존재한다. 그에 반해 신전에는 상투적인 헛말과 응답 없는 기도가 떠돌 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 5aa39821-664c-170b-31b6-eb2c7a5ef4bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(3) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait:5aa39821-664c-170b-31b6-eb2c7a5ef4bb
msgctxt "h4cc16c8egd9edg4c1dg9fcbgef4b4bdc5efa"
msgid ""
"This is a temple of Lathander. Or <i>was</i>, before the githyanki took over."
msgstr "이곳은 라샌더의 신전이야. 정확히는 <i>원래는 그랬다고</i> 해야겠지. 기스양키가 여기를 차지하기 전에 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 5bb56f95-d916-0916-846d-584bd0cd5f51
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(2) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait:5bb56f95-d916-0916-846d-584bd0cd5f51
msgctxt "h2faf0caeg208cg41e5g9cf6g33a1400e8831"
msgid ""
"I fear this rock has twisted your mind more than the parasite ever could."
msgstr "안타깝지만 이 바위가 그 어느 기생충보다도 네 정신을 비틀어버리고 만 모양이로군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5be3e56b-519f-3225-756f-a5b29410e2ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait:5be3e56b-519f-3225-756f-a5b29410e2ca
msgctxt "h896b9107ge4c1g4fc8g8748g489c3d16b3ec"
msgid "<i>Ch'mar, zal'a Vlaakith</i>. 'Vlaakith's will above all.'"
msgstr "<i>츠마르, 잘라 블라키스</i>. '그 무엇보다 블라키스의 뜻을 우선할지니.'"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 63cae484-8390-d417-9e81-fffc0fd1878a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(2) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait:63cae484-8390-d417-9e81-fffc0fd1878a
msgctxt "h7e8dfb99g7bf0g44cdgb810gc5470ceb26fa"
msgid ""
"A temple to a trivial god, nested among the peaks. Fine grounds for a crèche."
msgstr "보잘것없는 신에게 헌사된 신전이구나. 봉우리 사이에 자리잡고 있어. 양성소로 삼기 안성맞춤인 곳이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 820cd3fe-2cb1-a6d9-68ff-84a451fc8747
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(6) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait:820cd3fe-2cb1-a6d9-68ff-84a451fc8747
msgctxt "h855fceccg4887g444bgb9fegf350048b605f"
msgid ""
"Certainly, once you evict the priests. Although I imagine the gith "
"slaughtered them?"
msgstr "그야 물론, 사제들을 내쫓고 터를 차지했다면야 그렇지. 그렇지만 내 짐작에 기스는 그냥 그자들을 도륙해버렸을 것 같은데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = b0668ae6-67ba-45e5-b5c9-d5f8968462be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(8) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait:b0668ae6-67ba-45e5-b5c9-d5f8968462be
msgctxt "h978defa5g6123g44e3g8441g916edb2503a7"
msgid "And what of Lathander's faithful? Did the githyanki cut them down?"
msgstr "라샌더의 신도들은 어쩌고? 기스양키가 그자들을 다 베어 버렸나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b15685d8-cd58-4ecd-a38a-ec4fbe56f71f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait:b15685d8-cd58-4ecd-a38a-ec4fbe56f71f
msgctxt "h2565122fg4a7dg43aegb171g1ab1a12b5e21"
msgid "The gith saw what they wanted and took it. Makes sense to me."
msgstr "기스는 단지 자신들이 원하는 걸 보고 차지했을 뿐이야. 나한테는 문제될 게 없는걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = b3d9839e-ba75-668a-c170-9d9ad2dfbdce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(2) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait:b3d9839e-ba75-668a-c170-9d9ad2dfbdce
msgctxt "h22e2b801gd1edg4475g8606g8b2ab0fc20cd"
msgid "Well spoken, <i>ra'stil.</i>"
msgstr "말 한 번 잘 했다, <i>라스틸.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = b7e65e95-807e-5001-b7ce-89fef5ec46a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(4) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait:b7e65e95-807e-5001-b7ce-89fef5ec46a0
msgctxt "hb940c00dg63c8g497fgbcc4g087700c80b40"
msgid "It's gorgeous. We could <i>use </i>something like that."
msgstr "진짜 멋지네. 우리한테도 저런 게 있다면 딱 좋지 않겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c078713c-5ba7-afc3-7b0e-dd50fa662e67
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_GithCreche_Knows_LathanderArtefact = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait:c078713c-5ba7-afc3-7b0e-dd50fa662e67
msgctxt "h9d90168agd281g4064g9a32g8c4af45ab6d9"
msgid ""
"*Above the temple shines the most radiant of lights: the Dawnstar. A beacon "
"to the god Lathander's faithful - and a startlingly potent weapon.*"
msgstr ""
"*사원 위를 보니 빛 중에서도 가장 찬란한 빛이 발산되고 있습니다. 여명성입니다. 신 라샌더의 신도에게는 빛의 봉화인 동시에, 놀라울 "
"정도로 강력한 무기이기도 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = c1a8de83-3ab2-4e1e-b664-e817402be839
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(7) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - d428b460-5dd0-ecf4-4832-aeba12b2da59_AskedAboutGith = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait:c1a8de83-3ab2-4e1e-b664-e817402be839
msgctxt "habed57c4g0519g4117ga97cgd8cb0581e2fd"
msgid ""
"And Lathander's priests? Did the githyanki just - kill them and take over?"
msgstr "라샌더의 신도들은 어쩌고? 기스양키는 그자들을 그냥 죽이고 신전을 빼앗은 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d070a477-2dd9-fad3-ea3c-3371cbfb8036
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait:d070a477-2dd9-fad3-ea3c-3371cbfb8036
msgctxt "hbf15944fg5275g450fg81aeg0ff811a037d1"
msgid "Vlaakith sounds cruel and opportunistic, if you ask me."
msgstr "블라키스는 사악하고 기회주의적인 작자인 것 같아. 그냥 내 생각인데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = e5498a82-cb80-465a-bb5d-119980a72aec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(3) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - d428b460-5dd0-ecf4-4832-aeba12b2da59_AskedAboutGith = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait:e5498a82-cb80-465a-bb5d-119980a72aec
msgctxt "h1bffea2egf3dag4511gba13g03ae5fe65f04"
msgid ""
"The original occupants might object - unless the gith just slaughtered them?"
msgstr "신전의 본래 주인들이라면 그 말에 반박하고 나설지도 모르지. 기스가 그자들을 모조리 죽여 버렸다면 또 다르겠지만?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e738e92c-9d5a-f17c-1e26-d92f9b6f331c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_CableCarWait:e738e92c-9d5a-f17c-1e26-d92f9b6f331c
msgctxt "hb6b49f86gcde9g420fg9bfcg099ffb5ae660"
msgid "<i>Keep silent.</i>"
msgstr "<i>침묵을 유지한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_BrokenBridgeToSCL
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7e8ee9bd-56cf-413c-89df-ca7eb6ce7642
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_BrokenBridgeToSCL:7e8ee9bd-56cf-413c-89df-ca7eb6ce7642
msgctxt "h52838d71g0014g402fga95cg871d0420a239"
msgid "Yes, it's quite broken. We'll need another way across."
msgstr "그래, 완전히 부서졌어. 다른 길을 찾아야겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_BrokenBridgeToSCL
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7e8ee9bd-56cf-413c-89df-ca7eb6ce7642
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_BrokenBridgeToSCL:7e8ee9bd-56cf-413c-89df-ca7eb6ce7642
msgctxt "h397652a6gf167g4465gb0cfg501593bc84e7"
msgid "The bridge is down. There must be another way through."
msgstr "다리가 무너졌어. 분명 다른 길이 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_BrokenBridgeToSCL
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7e8ee9bd-56cf-413c-89df-ca7eb6ce7642
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_BrokenBridgeToSCL:7e8ee9bd-56cf-413c-89df-ca7eb6ce7642
msgctxt "h8a5b257fgd435g4865ga9d3gc1ffde455816"
msgid ""
"That bridge has long been collapsed. If only we'd arrived a few centuries "
"earlier."
msgstr "그 다리는 오래전에 무너졌어. 우리가 몇 세기만 더 일찍 도착했더라면 좋았을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_BrokenBridgeToSCL
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7e8ee9bd-56cf-413c-89df-ca7eb6ce7642
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_BrokenBridgeToSCL:7e8ee9bd-56cf-413c-89df-ca7eb6ce7642
msgctxt "h9cffa22bg3153g4357g8290g6c3014878c0f"
msgid "Bridge is down. Better look for another way across."
msgstr "다리가 끊겼어. 다른 길을 찾아야겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_BrokenBridgeToSCL
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7e8ee9bd-56cf-413c-89df-ca7eb6ce7642
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_BrokenBridgeToSCL:7e8ee9bd-56cf-413c-89df-ca7eb6ce7642
msgctxt "h0d4dec47ge855g4a34g9391g57f9ae2fa256"
msgid "No getting through that way, is there?"
msgstr "저 너머로는 갈 수 없는 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_BrokenBridgeToSCL
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7e8ee9bd-56cf-413c-89df-ca7eb6ce7642
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_BrokenBridgeToSCL:7e8ee9bd-56cf-413c-89df-ca7eb6ce7642
msgctxt "h72570f8dg3699g4425g9410gda89da70b3f1"
msgid "Broken! Must be another way somewhere."
msgstr "부서졌어! 분명 다른 길이 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_BrokenBridgeToSCL
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7e8ee9bd-56cf-413c-89df-ca7eb6ce7642
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_BrokenBridgeToSCL:7e8ee9bd-56cf-413c-89df-ca7eb6ce7642
msgctxt "h3e01eabcgfb01g466dgabd1gc99b470d4ee7"
msgid "No use. We shall need to find another way across."
msgstr "소용없어. 다른 길을 찾아야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_BrokenBridgeToSCL
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7e8ee9bd-56cf-413c-89df-ca7eb6ce7642
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_BrokenBridgeToSCL:7e8ee9bd-56cf-413c-89df-ca7eb6ce7642
msgctxt "h1e2859b5g4109g4e09g9059gf2cdc48b8fd3"
msgid "Broken. Need to find another way."
msgstr "끊어졌어. 다른 길을 찾자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_LathanderStatueRecognised
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c0c0516b-b7fb-4a3e-af44-f58f162973c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_LathanderStatueRecognised:c0c0516b-b7fb-4a3e-af44-f58f162973c0
msgctxt "hb80af35cg7ff7g4a02g8c53gee20e56aba3c"
msgid "Ah, Lathander - god of dawn's sun. Not exactly favoured by my kind."
msgstr "아, 라샌더라. 여명 햇살의 신이지. 내 족속들이 그다지 좋아하는 신은 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_LathanderStatueRecognised
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c0c0516b-b7fb-4a3e-af44-f58f162973c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_LathanderStatueRecognised:c0c0516b-b7fb-4a3e-af44-f58f162973c0
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hb2c67a5dg69d9g41f2gb773gae2aaf8d0df3"
msgid "Lathander, I do believe. God of the dawning sun."
msgstr "라샌더, 당신을 믿나이다. 동틀녘 태양의 신이여."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_LathanderStatueRecognised
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c0c0516b-b7fb-4a3e-af44-f58f162973c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_LathanderStatueRecognised:c0c0516b-b7fb-4a3e-af44-f58f162973c0
msgctxt "h6c9258a7g2dd2g4b16g9d46g6652284fdbd1"
msgid "Lathander. Sun god, I think. Seems like a good chap."
msgstr "라샌더. 태양의 신인가 그렇지. 좋은 분으로 아는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_LathanderStatueRecognised
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c0c0516b-b7fb-4a3e-af44-f58f162973c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_LathanderStatueRecognised:c0c0516b-b7fb-4a3e-af44-f58f162973c0
msgctxt "h18cdac67gf022g4704ga54ag2aadef1e91c8"
msgid "Lathander, the Morninglord. And self-righteous snob, as I see it."
msgstr "라샌더, 태양의 군주로군. 내가 보기엔 자만심이 가득한 속물이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_LathanderStatueRecognised
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c0c0516b-b7fb-4a3e-af44-f58f162973c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_LathanderStatueRecognised:c0c0516b-b7fb-4a3e-af44-f58f162973c0
msgctxt "h0d4a4e56g8983g46a2g8d75g1a1e4c46e34d"
msgid "Lathander, god of the dawning sun."
msgstr "라샌더, 여명의 태양신이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_LathanderStatueRecognised
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c0c0516b-b7fb-4a3e-af44-f58f162973c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_LathanderStatueRecognised:c0c0516b-b7fb-4a3e-af44-f58f162973c0
msgctxt "h7dd26e26g7152g414egb4bdgf2e74242da68"
msgid "Lathander, god of dawn and renewal."
msgstr "라샌더, 여명과 재탄생의 신이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_LathanderStatueRecognised
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c0c0516b-b7fb-4a3e-af44-f58f162973c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC_HELM or PALADIN_HELM
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_LathanderStatueRecognised:c0c0516b-b7fb-4a3e-af44-f58f162973c0
msgctxt "hf394dd07gf502g4949g9751g63a97c7662c8"
msgid ""
"A monument to Lathander, god of dawn - and killer of Helm's lover. The "
"bastard."
msgstr "여명의 신 라샌더의 기념비야. 헬름의 연인을 죽인 개자식이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_LathanderStatueRecognised
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c0c0516b-b7fb-4a3e-af44-f58f162973c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_LathanderStatueRecognised:c0c0516b-b7fb-4a3e-af44-f58f162973c0
msgctxt "h417cd822g48a3g466cg86d7g88f8632b9953"
msgid "Looks like Lathander, god of the dawning sun."
msgstr "라샌더 같군, 여명의 태양신 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_MonasteryVista
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e6164d11-5bb5-4e20-a7ef-db345efbb115
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_MonasteryVista:e6164d11-5bb5-4e20-a7ef-db345efbb115
msgctxt "hda57ec17gf696g4f40gb8a9g144a4bf3f5bf"
msgid "Monasteries - as gaudy as any noble's palace."
msgstr "수도원이로군. 여느 귀족들의 성만큼이나 화려한걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_MonasteryVista
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e6164d11-5bb5-4e20-a7ef-db345efbb115
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_MonasteryVista:e6164d11-5bb5-4e20-a7ef-db345efbb115
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hff145af3ga161g4dddg909dg766d073d2f02"
msgid ""
"A sight to nourish the soul! Now let's sit down and nourish the stomach."
msgstr "영혼을 채우는 풍경인걸! 이제 잠깐 앉아서 주린 배를 채워 볼까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_MonasteryVista
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e6164d11-5bb5-4e20-a7ef-db345efbb115
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_MonasteryVista:e6164d11-5bb5-4e20-a7ef-db345efbb115
msgctxt "h09be3f4bg8be7g4c2ega39eg01aa5e813b0b"
msgid "Look at that beauty. Ah, I love it here."
msgstr "이 아름다운 풍경 좀 봐. 아, 여기 마음에 드는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_MonasteryVista
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e6164d11-5bb5-4e20-a7ef-db345efbb115
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_MonasteryVista:e6164d11-5bb5-4e20-a7ef-db345efbb115
msgctxt "hac34adfag4e91g4590ga0d1g00e4f9a5f0e4"
msgid ""
"I'm not one to admire a view. This time - well, this time shall be an "
"exception."
msgstr "나는 경치에 감탄하는 법이 없지만, 이건… 음, 이번만큼은 예외로 해야겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_MonasteryVista
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e6164d11-5bb5-4e20-a7ef-db345efbb115
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_MonasteryVista:e6164d11-5bb5-4e20-a7ef-db345efbb115
msgctxt "h842bbc95gf830g4674g91b8gf8c0b051f297"
msgid "View's quite breathtaking - or maybe that was just the climb."
msgstr "너무 아름다워서 숨이 멎을 것 같아. …아니면 오르막길을 걸어와서 그런가."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_MonasteryVista
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e6164d11-5bb5-4e20-a7ef-db345efbb115
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_MonasteryVista:e6164d11-5bb5-4e20-a7ef-db345efbb115
msgctxt "ha166d249g5888g4039g8baeg0886a3a26daa"
msgid ""
"Pretty enough to paint. Too bad I don't have a canvas. Or paints. Or the "
"skills."
msgstr "그림으로 남기고 싶을 만큼 아름답네. 도화지가 없어서 유감이야. 물감도 없고. 물론 그림 실력도 없지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_MonasteryVista
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e6164d11-5bb5-4e20-a7ef-db345efbb115
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Exterior_PAD_MonasteryVista:e6164d11-5bb5-4e20-a7ef-db345efbb115
msgctxt "hbc7edaebg4bdeg4926g8556g329597102fd0"
msgid "This view's almost worth the walk."
msgstr "걸어온 보람이 있는 풍경이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_KethericOrdersRead_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 35ee7ece-d038-ef05-eab4-b616366099f9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Wyll_Knows_RavengardFather = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_Knows_DukeAtTowers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_KethericOrdersRead_PAD:35ee7ece-d038-ef05-eab4-b616366099f9
msgctxt "had015ff5g8bb5g48a5g9783gee6a04d23778"
msgid ""
"Grand Duke Ravengard? Seems Moonrise Towers has acquired a high-value asset."
msgstr "레이븐가드 대공? 문라이즈 타워가 엄청난 인물을 확보한 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_KethericOrdersRead_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 377ef671-78e7-49a5-a522-86ad27d8f71a
