msgid "Who gives a fig? We stopped it - that's all that counts."
msgstr "누가 신경이나 쓰겠어? 멈췄잖아, 그러면 된 거지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Lance_PAD_DeactivateLance
