msgctxt "h038eab57g3c77g4489g8600g4f4a1b95072a"
msgid "At least the statues just talk. With my luck, I was sure they'd attack."
msgstr "적어도 이 동상들은 말만 하는군. 내 팔자라면, 분명 동상들이 공격할 거라고 확신했었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Lance_PAD_MagicMouthKnowledgeCheck
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2420c80f-d697-492d-bac6-7c31ebddded4
