msgctxt "hf5cc1319g5e95g4b69g9d83gc622b1446cad"
msgid "Talking statues often herald trouble, in my experience..."
msgstr "내 경험상, 말하는 동상에서 문제가 일어난 적이 많았는데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Lance_PAD_MagicMouthKnowledgeCheck
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2420c80f-d697-492d-bac6-7c31ebddded4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Lance_State_MagicMouthArcanaCheckPassed = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Lance_PAD_MagicMouthKnowledgeCheck:2420c80f-d697-492d-bac6-7c31ebddded4
msgctxt "h6bdf2db2g7fc4g45aeg8e42g7e9f2b0b6ffc"
msgid "Talking statues. I don't like the sound of that."
msgstr "말하는 동상이라. 그 소리가 별로 마음에 들지 않는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Lance_PAD_MagicMouthKnowledgeCheck
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2420c80f-d697-492d-bac6-7c31ebddded4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
