msgctxt "h91cf4260g4f08g4b83g9c1bg6bea3b5c1753"
msgid "A Magic Mouth spell - whoever owned that voice, they must be long dead."
msgstr "마법의 입 주문이라, 저 목소리 주인이 누구든, 오래전에 죽은 게 분명해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Lance_PAD_MagicMouthKnowledgeCheck
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4047f8e3-f230-4bae-90c9-07c6d2b66613
