msgctxt "h4c270b2eg114ag4a48ga5dega734a5c0e795"
msgid "A Magic Mouth spell - but whoever voiced it is probably long dead."
msgstr "마법의 입 주문이군. 그리고 목소리의 주인공이 누구든 오래 전에 죽은 사람이겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Lance_PAD_MagicMouthKnowledgeCheck
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4047f8e3-f230-4bae-90c9-07c6d2b66613
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Lance_State_MagicMouthArcanaCheckPassed = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Lance_PAD_MagicMouthKnowledgeCheck:4047f8e3-f230-4bae-90c9-07c6d2b66613
msgctxt "hdd84b57agc603g4d47gb863g0330a5209af8"
msgid "A Magic Mouth spell? Whoever spoke those words is long dead, I wager."
msgstr "마법의 입 주문? 그 주문을 말한 사람이 누구든 오래 전에 죽었어, 장담해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Lance_PAD_MagicMouthKnowledgeCheck
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4047f8e3-f230-4bae-90c9-07c6d2b66613
