msgctxt "hbf17ace7gef14g463bgac1fg1c84ea7ab3fd"
msgid "A Magic Mouth spell - so that voice must be from someone long-deceased."
msgstr "마법의 입 주문이군. 저 목소리는 분명 오래 전에 죽은 이가 했던 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Lance_PAD_MagicMouthKnowledgeCheck
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4047f8e3-f230-4bae-90c9-07c6d2b66613
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Lance_State_MagicMouthArcanaCheckPassed = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Lance_PAD_MagicMouthKnowledgeCheck:4047f8e3-f230-4bae-90c9-07c6d2b66613
msgctxt "ha9cce40egee23g4962gbbb2g6f04fc081be0"
msgid "A Magic Mouth spell. That voice belonged to someone long dead now."
msgstr "마법의 입 주문이야. 저 목소리는 이제 죽은 자의 것이 됐군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Lance_PAD_MagicMouthKnowledgeCheck
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4047f8e3-f230-4bae-90c9-07c6d2b66613
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Lance_State_MagicMouthArcanaCheckPassed = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Lance_PAD_MagicMouthKnowledgeCheck:4047f8e3-f230-4bae-90c9-07c6d2b66613
msgctxt "h21c3c5dbg8661g4c8fgab81ge5cb65d952a3"
msgid ""
"Looks like a Magic Mouth spell. That voice probably belongs to someone long "
"gone."
msgstr "마법의 입 주문 같군. 저 목소리는 아마 오래전에 죽은 어떤 사람의 것이겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Lance_PAD_PreventiveDisarmLance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8f092ccb-6680-7ad3-8f46-ffc0cc76c816
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Lance_PAD_PreventiveDisarmLance:8f092ccb-6680-7ad3-8f46-ffc0cc76c816
msgctxt "ha82b82a7gc480g4bdbg8d40g125b3ab89c01"
msgid ""
"The better the protection, the better the prize. The monks must have "
"treasured this."
msgstr "보안이 살벌할수록 보상도 짜릿한 법이지. 수도승들이 아마 목숨 걸고 지키려 했을걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Lance_PAD_PreventiveDisarmLance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8f092ccb-6680-7ad3-8f46-ffc0cc76c816
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Lance_PAD_PreventiveDisarmLance:8f092ccb-6680-7ad3-8f46-ffc0cc76c816
msgctxt "h5f25f9c6gaccag40ddga584g1da455c4c28a"
msgid "The tighter the security, the juicier the prize."
msgstr "보안이 살벌할수록 보상은 달콤한 법이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Lance_PAD_PreventiveDisarmLance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8f092ccb-6680-7ad3-8f46-ffc0cc76c816
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Lance_PAD_PreventiveDisarmLance:8f092ccb-6680-7ad3-8f46-ffc0cc76c816
msgctxt "hfac4c2edg51e2g407agb383g84dfebc82635"
msgid "Must've been a precious artefact."
msgstr "분명 귀중한 유물이었을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Lance_PAD_PreventiveDisarmLance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8f092ccb-6680-7ad3-8f46-ffc0cc76c816
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Lance_PAD_PreventiveDisarmLance:8f092ccb-6680-7ad3-8f46-ffc0cc76c816
msgctxt "h899bb591ge2f8g4d1egac38g7bcef45ee1cd"
msgid "This artefact must have been quite valuable."
msgstr "이 유물은 제법 귀중하게 여겨졌을 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Lance_PAD_PreventiveDisarmLance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8f092ccb-6680-7ad3-8f46-ffc0cc76c816
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Lance_PAD_PreventiveDisarmLance:8f092ccb-6680-7ad3-8f46-ffc0cc76c816
msgctxt "h361dbe2dgf971g4b1agb0d8g75b51571a5d7"
msgid ""
"The monks were intent on keeping their relics safe. They didn't count on us, "
"though."
msgstr "수도승들은 유물을 안전하게 지키려고 애썼어. 물론 우리까지 계산에 넣지는 않았지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Lance_PAD_PreventiveDisarmLance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8f092ccb-6680-7ad3-8f46-ffc0cc76c816
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Lance_PAD_PreventiveDisarmLance:8f092ccb-6680-7ad3-8f46-ffc0cc76c816
msgctxt "h7fb5b4e8ga039g426bg9d9fg8c81a9ae1b34"
msgid "High risk, high reward. This relic must be something special."
msgstr "위험에는 보상이 따르는 법이지. 틀림없이 특별한 유물일 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Lance_PAD_PreventiveDisarmLance
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8f092ccb-6680-7ad3-8f46-ffc0cc76c816
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Lance_PAD_PreventiveDisarmLance:8f092ccb-6680-7ad3-8f46-ffc0cc76c816
msgctxt "h6faf686dgac20g43b7gba74g5920c95def2c"
msgid "This artefact must've been precious to the monks."
msgstr "수도승들이 이 유물을 제법 귀중히 여겼을 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Lance_PAD_PreventiveDisarmLance
