msgctxt "h4e3a5c04gcd05g413fgaff9gb096fbdc6c08"
msgid "Better avoid using magic around those things."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Library_PAD_GremishkaAllergyComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4cbbfb54-b4aa-444d-a258-9ac0b14ecce9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Library_PAD_GremishkaAllergyComment:4cbbfb54-b4aa-444d-a258-9ac0b14ecce9
msgctxt "he9e69fb0ge0c7g4d95gb913g9094db0c5bdb"
msgid "Those things are trouble. The less magic, the better."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Library_PAD_GremishkaAllergyComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4cbbfb54-b4aa-444d-a258-9ac0b14ecce9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Library_PAD_GremishkaAllergyComment:4cbbfb54-b4aa-444d-a258-9ac0b14ecce9
msgctxt "haebf7151g6cffg4911gb93dgd9a6a5185337"
msgid "Damn thing's allergic to magic."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Library_PAD_GremishkaAllergyComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4cbbfb54-b4aa-444d-a258-9ac0b14ecce9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Library_PAD_GremishkaAllergyComment:4cbbfb54-b4aa-444d-a258-9ac0b14ecce9
msgctxt "h363a6d31g6d4ag4612gb58dgdbc3c953d88c"
msgid ""
"Looks like using magic around these things is more trouble than it's worth!"
msgstr "이것들 주변에서 마법을 쓰는 건 오히려 문제가 되는 것 같아!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Library_PAD_GremishkaRecognition
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3a8fdc8b-078f-4eec-a506-73471fe6f6f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Library_PAD_GremishkaRecognition:3a8fdc8b-078f-4eec-a506-73471fe6f6f2
msgctxt "h9920cf1cg3b5cg486eg93b9g59d2ba548697"
msgid ""
"Gremishkas? Those little pussy cats are allergic to magic - better watch my "
"spells."
msgstr "그레미쉬카잖아? 저 작은 고양이들은 마법에 알레르기가 있는 것 같은데 - 내 주문을 조심해야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Library_PAD_GremishkaRecognition
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3a8fdc8b-078f-4eec-a506-73471fe6f6f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Library_PAD_GremishkaRecognition:3a8fdc8b-078f-4eec-a506-73471fe6f6f2
msgctxt "h1eaa19d4g6d21g4189g9049gaa410d5300de"
msgid "Gremishkas? They're no lovers of magic - better watch where I cast."
msgstr "그레미쉬카잖아? 마법을 좋아하진 않는 녀석들이니, 주문을 어디에 걸지 조심해야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Library_PAD_GremishkaRecognition
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3a8fdc8b-078f-4eec-a506-73471fe6f6f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Library_PAD_GremishkaRecognition:3a8fdc8b-078f-4eec-a506-73471fe6f6f2
msgctxt "h2ab436f9g523cg40b9gb962gba0764f70056"
msgid "A gremishka! Careful, these things <i>hate </i>magic."
msgstr "그레미쉬카다! 조심해, 이놈들은 마법을 <i>혐오하거든</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Library_PAD_GremishkaRecognition
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3a8fdc8b-078f-4eec-a506-73471fe6f6f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Library_PAD_GremishkaRecognition:3a8fdc8b-078f-4eec-a506-73471fe6f6f2
msgctxt "h55f178d4g7d24g4488g9526gea0a01fd1346"
msgid ""
"Gremishkas? The less magic the better, or they'll be frenzied - or worse."
msgstr "그레미쉬카잖아? 마법을 자제하지 않으면, 놈들이 광란에 휩싸이거나 더 나빠질 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Library_PAD_GremishkaRecognition
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3a8fdc8b-078f-4eec-a506-73471fe6f6f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Library_PAD_GremishkaRecognition:3a8fdc8b-078f-4eec-a506-73471fe6f6f2
msgctxt "h7270cb32g2de4g43cagad1dg82094e9fedba"
msgid ""
"Gremishkas - they don't react well to magic. Better be careful with my "
"spells."
msgstr "그레미쉬카네. 마법에 반응이 안 좋은 녀석들이지. 주문을 조심히 써야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Library_PAD_GremishkaRecognition
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3a8fdc8b-078f-4eec-a506-73471fe6f6f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Library_PAD_GremishkaRecognition:3a8fdc8b-078f-4eec-a506-73471fe6f6f2
msgctxt "hc1e41ab4g8f97g48c9g90cegfe57ff3ca066"
msgid ""
"Gremishkas? Magic's out of the question, then - no telling how they'll react."
msgstr "그레미쉬카잖아? 마법은 제외해야겠어. 놈들이 어떻게 반응할지 알 수 없으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Library_PAD_GremishkaRecognition
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3a8fdc8b-078f-4eec-a506-73471fe6f6f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Library_PAD_GremishkaRecognition:3a8fdc8b-078f-4eec-a506-73471fe6f6f2
msgctxt "h7cc87419gb930g43c3ga064gcdebe100c8a2"
msgid "Gremishkas? Better be careful with any magic - spells set them off."
msgstr "그레미쉬카잖아? 마법을 사용할 때는 조심해야겠어. 놈들은 주문에 폭주할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Library_PAD_GremiskaCryReaction
