msgctxt "hff3b969bg31c8g4728ga1e9g1d4dc22392fc"
msgid ""
"Not since the bloody eagles turned up and turfed me out of my first nest."
msgstr "망할 독수리들이 내 첫 둥지를 뺏어간 후로는 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_MonasteryApproach_Bird_SWA
