#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_MonasteryApproach_Bird_SWA:095bd6fa-d504-1722-f03b-dd7abb9600fd
msgctxt "h66ea1295gc0deg474cg9ac6g34ce19169246"
msgid ""
"Curses! I was going to ask you to do the same thing, of course that tit got "
"there first!"
msgstr "젠장! 나도 너한테 도와달라고 하려 했는데, 그 박새가 선수를 치다니!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_MonasteryApproach_Bird_SWA
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0b40edbd-2b25-cb46-717e-747a1f5c07f9
