msgctxt "h20d1fec8g54d4g4958g9d0dg9ca1146a231b"
msgid ""
"It's not bloody fair! I got there first! The eagles don't even <i>need</i> "
"it!"
msgstr "엄청 불공평하지! 원래 내 자리였다고! 독수리들한텐 그거 <i>필요</i>하지도 않잖아!"

