msgctxt "h0f35d59bg74fbg435dg9fa7g253c2c431f9e"
msgid "A Guardian of Faith spell. Who knew faith lasted so long?"
msgstr "신앙의 수호자 주문이야. 신앙심이 이렇게 오래 갈 줄은 몰랐는데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Monastery_PAD_GuardianOfFaithReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e502086-b3ef-426d-adc4-75bd90c9c6a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
