msgctxt "hfd985b48g07c5g4d21g9479g782b666ccab1"
msgid ""
"A Guardian of Faith spell. Strong is its faith indeed to linger still in "
"these ancient halls."
msgstr "신앙의 수호자 주문이잖아. 이 고대의 회랑에 머무르는 그 신앙심이 실로 강하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Monastery_PAD_GuardianOfFaithReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e502086-b3ef-426d-adc4-75bd90c9c6a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Monastery_PAD_GuardianOfFaithReaction:2e502086-b3ef-426d-adc4-75bd90c9c6a7
msgctxt "h0cc4643fgb23fg4990g8f55g7d0ef563fe20"
msgid ""
"A Guardian of Faith spell. Must've been real faith to've lasted this long."
msgstr "신앙의 수호자 주문이군. 이 정도로 오래 버틴 걸 보면 진정한 신앙심이었나 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Monastery_PAD_GuardianOfFaithReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e502086-b3ef-426d-adc4-75bd90c9c6a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Monastery_PAD_GuardianOfFaithReaction:2e502086-b3ef-426d-adc4-75bd90c9c6a7
msgctxt "h1bb016a0ge99bg466egabc8gbba2f0039ea0"
msgid ""
"I know this spell - Guardian of Faith. Extraordinary, that it's lasted so "
"long."
msgstr "이 주문을 알아, 신앙의 수호자. 이만큼 버텨온 게 신기할 정도야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Monastery_PAD_GuardianOfFaithReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e502086-b3ef-426d-adc4-75bd90c9c6a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Monastery_PAD_GuardianOfFaithReaction:2e502086-b3ef-426d-adc4-75bd90c9c6a7
msgctxt "h23cb2039gdb33g4d9ag8deagd039defb6ec7"
msgid "A Guardian of Faith spell. All this time, and it still holds strong."
msgstr "신앙의 수호자 주문이군. 지금까지 남아있는데다, 여전히 굳건해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Monastery_PAD_GuardianOfFaithReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e502086-b3ef-426d-adc4-75bd90c9c6a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Monastery_PAD_GuardianOfFaithReaction:2e502086-b3ef-426d-adc4-75bd90c9c6a7
msgctxt "h97fa9b29gdf41g460ag8487g2fc38227d44e"
msgid "Guardian of Faith? That's one powerful spell."
msgstr "신앙의 수호자? 아주 강력한 주문이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Monastery_PAD_GuardianOfFaithReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e502086-b3ef-426d-adc4-75bd90c9c6a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_Monastery_PAD_GuardianOfFaithReaction:2e502086-b3ef-426d-adc4-75bd90c9c6a7
msgctxt "hfc47fd94gb791g4e36g90d3g2778c5e6e974"
msgid "A Guardian of Faith spell, and a remarkably long-lasting one at that."
msgstr "신앙의 수호자 주문, 게다가 굉장히 오래 버티고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_MonkAmulet_AD_BloodOfLathanderBanter
