msgid ""
"The Blood of Lathander, as I barely live and hardly breathe. HahaHAhaha."
msgstr "라샌더의 피잖아. 웃겨서 숨을 못 쉬겠네. 하하<b>하</b>하하."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_MonkAmulet_AD_StatueBanter
