msgctxt "hd3a8b259g0f06g49ceg9376g0bad38179b72"
msgid ""
"I visited this place in a forlorn and forgotten age, to lay mine eyes upon "
"the Blood of Lathander."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_MonkAmulet_AD_StatueBanter
