msgstr "아, 빛을 잃었군. 안 좋은...건가? 아마도?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/Monastery/CRE_WeaponsPuzzle_PAD_RemovedWeaponReaction
