#. TagRule: GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_CaptainGuard:85ce797a-9096-cc3d-04c3-bc28995a7bfd
msgctxt "h4cc85b14g4d20g4c0dg80dfg2f1656696f0c"
msgid ""
"<i>Chk. </i>Another outsider. Make yourself at home. The <i>ch'r'ai</i> "
"certainly has."
msgstr "<i>쳇.</i> 또 외부인이군. 네 집처럼 편히 있으라고. <i>츠라이</i>도 분명 편히 머물고 있으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_CaptainGuard
#. Speaker = Raider Chy'raagh
#. NodeID = d19af005-c122-29dc-2f6d-bc1c9f37c50f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_CaptainGuard_HasMet(1) = True
#. TagRule: !GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_CaptainGuard:d19af005-c122-29dc-2f6d-bc1c9f37c50f
msgctxt "hb5be4149g9ce2g4f29g9cb8gd6e825d2eecf"
msgid ""
"If you walk here unharmed, it is with the captain's blessing. Speak with "
"her, if you must."
msgstr "여기를 무사히 걸어다닌다는 건, 대장님이 허락하셨기 때문이겠지. 필요하다면 그분과 얘기를 나눠보지 그래."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_CaptainGuard
#. Speaker = Raider Chy'raagh
#. NodeID = d19af005-c122-29dc-2f6d-bc1c9f37c50f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_CaptainGuard_HasMet(1) = True
#. TagRule: GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_CaptainGuard:d19af005-c122-29dc-2f6d-bc1c9f37c50f
msgctxt "hb073b15ega712g4df7g9a84g943dd8fb37df"
msgid ""
"I work alone. If you wish to join a patrol, speak to the <i>kith'rak.</i>"
msgstr "나는 혼자 일한다. 같이 정찰을 나가고 싶거든 <i>키스락</i>께 말씀드려라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_ChainOfCommand_AD_CaptainCallsGuards
#. Speaker = Kith'rak Therezzyn
#. NodeID = 1f1683a7-b4fc-6ed6-f20a-0e2826fd9593
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(0) = True
