#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_ChainOfCommand_PAD_OnTheWayToTemplar:b35f0069-9c64-4f36-b416-6711d6e92851
msgctxt "h339309bcg5f26g4c17g9d0ag9c8dfb7a5ae5"
msgid ""
"This Inquisitor sounds like a daunting chap. But who knows? Perhaps he'll "
"answer our questions."
msgstr "이 심문관이란 존재는 무서운 친구처럼 들리네. 하지만 누가 알아? 그가 우리의 의문을 풀어줄지도."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_ChainOfCommand_PAD_OnTheWayToTemplar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b35f0069-9c64-4f36-b416-6711d6e92851
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_ChainOfCommand_PAD_OnTheWayToTemplar:b35f0069-9c64-4f36-b416-6711d6e92851
msgctxt "h7b220f78gd4dfg4f44gbfa6g84fde2fe568d"
msgid "I'm a bit afraid this Inquisitor won't want to say anything useful."
msgstr "이 심문관이란 자가 도움이 되는 걸 알려주지 않을 거 같아 걱정돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_ChainOfCommand_PAD_OnTheWayToTemplar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b35f0069-9c64-4f36-b416-6711d6e92851
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_ChainOfCommand_PAD_OnTheWayToTemplar:b35f0069-9c64-4f36-b416-6711d6e92851
msgctxt "hf234e48fg97f0g47acgbb56g751334fd0810"
msgid "I hope - no, expect - the <i>ch'r'ai</i> will aid us."
msgstr "아마... 아니, 분명히 <i>츠라이</i>께선 우릴 도와주실 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_ChainOfCommand_PAD_OnTheWayToTemplar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b35f0069-9c64-4f36-b416-6711d6e92851
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_ChainOfCommand_PAD_OnTheWayToTemplar:b35f0069-9c64-4f36-b416-6711d6e92851
msgctxt "h26c62058g70f3g4dabgbe45g61b1bade4665"
msgid "Do you think this Inquisitor person is really going to help us?"
msgstr "이 심문관이란 자가 정말로 우릴 도와줄 거라 생각해?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_ChainOfCommand_PAD_OnTheWayToTemplar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b35f0069-9c64-4f36-b416-6711d6e92851
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_ChainOfCommand_PAD_OnTheWayToTemplar:b35f0069-9c64-4f36-b416-6711d6e92851
msgctxt "h17fd2e84g8c49g4766gab8agb5a784f5e8a0"
msgid "I don't suppose this Inquisitor will have plain answers for us."
msgstr "이 심문관이란 자가 우리에게 명쾌한 답을 줄 것 같지는 않은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_ChainOfCommand_PAD_OnTheWayToTemplar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b35f0069-9c64-4f36-b416-6711d6e92851
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_ChainOfCommand_PAD_OnTheWayToTemplar:b35f0069-9c64-4f36-b416-6711d6e92851
msgctxt "h86f2c9cfge75cg4bc1gafbdg70d8ff1b3f10"
msgid ""
"I have not met a <i>ch'r'ai</i> of this rank before. He will still aid us, "
"right?"
msgstr "이 정도 계급의 <i>츠라이</i>는 만나본 적 없는데. 저 분께선 아직 우릴 지원해 주시는 거겠지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_ChainOfCommand_PAD_OnTheWayToTemplar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b35f0069-9c64-4f36-b416-6711d6e92851
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_ChainOfCommand_PAD_OnTheWayToTemplar:b35f0069-9c64-4f36-b416-6711d6e92851
msgctxt "h32d0b4eegcc8ag4eb4g8006g36909e2c42fb"
msgid ""
"This Inquisitor sounds like a real piece of work. Do you think he'll answer "
"our questions?"
msgstr "저 심문관은 아주 대단한 사람인가 봐. 그가 우리 질문에 대한 답을 갖고 있을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_ChainOfCommand_PAD_OnTheWayToTemplar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b63b9d8a-a04a-4b98-978c-21d80994718e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_ChainOfCommand_PAD_OnTheWayToTemplar:b63b9d8a-a04a-4b98-978c-21d80994718e
msgctxt "hc9135b6cgc968g4004gb967gd724ed43c261"
msgid "An 'inquisitor', is it? I never was a fan of inquisitions."
msgstr "'심문관'이시라고? 심문관이란 족속이 마음에 들었던 기억은 없는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_ChainOfCommand_PAD_OnTheWayToTemplar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b63b9d8a-a04a-4b98-978c-21d80994718e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_ChainOfCommand_PAD_OnTheWayToTemplar:b63b9d8a-a04a-4b98-978c-21d80994718e
msgctxt "h22dd043agc838g431eg9320gf1e5ce328e0b"
msgid ""
"I wonder if this Inquisitor is as fearsome as his reputation suggests..."
msgstr "심문관이라는 자가 그 명성만큼이나 무시무시할지 궁금하군그래."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_ChainOfCommand_PAD_OnTheWayToTemplar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b63b9d8a-a04a-4b98-978c-21d80994718e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_ChainOfCommand_PAD_OnTheWayToTemplar:b63b9d8a-a04a-4b98-978c-21d80994718e
msgctxt "ha3437891ge478g4647ga319g4b344f762c83"
msgid "All right, Inquisitor, let's have it out then."
msgstr "좋아, 심문관 양반. 결판을 지어 보자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_ChainOfCommand_PAD_OnTheWayToTemplar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b63b9d8a-a04a-4b98-978c-21d80994718e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_ChainOfCommand_PAD_OnTheWayToTemplar:b63b9d8a-a04a-4b98-978c-21d80994718e
msgctxt "h1037663bg3f17g40d7gab18g69112578ef9f"
msgid "The Inquisitor awaits. I should make haste."
msgstr "심문관님께서 기다리신다. 서두르는 게 좋겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_ChainOfCommand_PAD_OnTheWayToTemplar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b63b9d8a-a04a-4b98-978c-21d80994718e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_ChainOfCommand_PAD_OnTheWayToTemplar:b63b9d8a-a04a-4b98-978c-21d80994718e
msgctxt "h41d17744g7506g4b79gb04cgb51a16abe496"
msgid "The moment of truth draws near. As does this 'Inquisitor'."
msgstr "결말을 지을 시간이 다가오는군. '심문관'에게도 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_ChainOfCommand_PAD_OnTheWayToTemplar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b63b9d8a-a04a-4b98-978c-21d80994718e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_ChainOfCommand_PAD_OnTheWayToTemplar:b63b9d8a-a04a-4b98-978c-21d80994718e
msgctxt "h421f1663g5f72g4e5eg8370g359662d638a9"
msgid "'Inquisitor', hm? Do I bow? Shake his hand? What's the protocol?"
msgstr "'심문관'이라, 흐음? 정중히 인사라도 할까? 악수하는 게 맞나? 예법이 어떻게 되지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_ChainOfCommand_PAD_OnTheWayToTemplar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b63b9d8a-a04a-4b98-978c-21d80994718e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_ChainOfCommand_PAD_OnTheWayToTemplar:b63b9d8a-a04a-4b98-978c-21d80994718e
msgctxt "h369c4984gd56cg4fa0gb886gc3edadb66364"
msgid "The Inquisitor awaits. At last, someone competent."
msgstr "심문관님께서 기다리고 계셔. 드디어 능력 있는 분을 뵙게 되는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_ChainOfCommand_PAD_OnTheWayToTemplar
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b63b9d8a-a04a-4b98-978c-21d80994718e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_ChainOfCommand_PAD_OnTheWayToTemplar:b63b9d8a-a04a-4b98-978c-21d80994718e
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h4f4a0fa8gfa3fg40cdgb83bg3dcd6a6ae248"
msgid "All this fear of an inquisitor. He'd better be worth it."
msgstr "심문관에 대해 만연해 있는 두려움이라. 그만한 능력이 있길 빌지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_CrecheGuard01
#. Speaker = Raider Ra'gur
#. NodeID = 2ed4431e-4df9-ff34-571e-312c3b05768e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_CrecheGuard01(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_General_HasMet_CrecheGuard01(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_CrecheGuard01:2ed4431e-4df9-ff34-571e-312c3b05768e
msgctxt "h19fb00ddg17abg408fgb966g597f81ba2912"
msgid ""
"Now we've got <i>istik</i> poking around here as well as an inquisitor? "
"<i>Chk.</i>"
msgstr "심문관도 납시셨는데 이제는 <i>이스틱</i>까지 싸돌아다니는 건가? <i>츠크.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_CrecheGuard01
#. Speaker = Raider Ra'gur
#. NodeID = 62e4f061-1a13-a866-0e43-4a3d09f1e137
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_CrecheGuard01(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_CrecheGuard01:62e4f061-1a13-a866-0e43-4a3d09f1e137
msgctxt "ha02ee139g144cg4e1bgbf4eg57b1afa6c6f9"
msgid "Don't <i>linger</i>. Whatever you're doing, get on with it."
msgstr "<i>밍기적거리지</i> 마라. 뭘 하고 있었든 간에, 원래 하던 거나 계속해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_CrecheGuard01
#. Speaker = Raider Ra'gur
#. NodeID = bbd80886-a190-4944-8f11-a4fecd76245a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_CrecheGuard01(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_CrecheGuard01:bbd80886-a190-4944-8f11-a4fecd76245a
msgctxt "h0f26876cg0e0dg4e6agab3ag314178ff3c64"
msgid ""
"They need to find this weapon soon so we can return to normal operations."
msgstr "빨리 무기를 찾아야 정상 작전으로 돌아갈 수 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_CrecheGuard01
#. Speaker = Raider Ra'gur
#. NodeID = c5bde5ee-566d-4cfd-b066-7da83bee9ffc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_CrecheGuard01(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_General_HasMet_CrecheGuard01(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_CrecheGuard01:c5bde5ee-566d-4cfd-b066-7da83bee9ffc
msgctxt "he2dcaf74g01f4g4df5g9eedg59aa7eb975d4"
msgid ""
"I'm staying out of Captain Therezzyn's way. At least until the <i>ch'r'ai</"
"i> inquisition is over."
msgstr "나는 테레진 대장님께 가는 길을 지키고 있다. 츠라이의 심문이 끝날 때까지는 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_CrecheGuard02
#. Speaker = Ardent Lin'a'an
#. NodeID = 0f1bd931-6782-49aa-a236-0f73abbb170b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_CrecheGuard02(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_CrecheGuard02:0f1bd931-6782-49aa-a236-0f73abbb170b
msgctxt "h6e3b2b9bg18b2g428ag945fg86dfb9d055cb"
msgid ""
"I find an operation runs much more efficiently under... <i>proper</i> "
"observation."
msgstr "<i>적절한</i> 관찰하에서... 작전을 더 효율적으로 수행한다는 걸 알아냈어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_CrecheGuard02
#. Speaker = Ardent Lin'a'an
#. NodeID = 2c11e04f-b4e6-a8fd-e203-2d498e58eecd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_CrecheGuard02(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_General_HasMet_CrecheGuard02(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_CrecheGuard02:2c11e04f-b4e6-a8fd-e203-2d498e58eecd
msgctxt "h4858417fg19b9g4e96ga500g1260be12c764"
msgid "Stop meddling where you aren't wanted, <i>istik</i>."
msgstr "환영받지 못하는 곳에 끼어들지 말라, <i>이스틱</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_CrecheGuard02
#. Speaker = Ardent Lin'a'an
#. NodeID = 40d8df90-8c1b-4ad4-80c1-f8fbc6b32d43
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_CrecheGuard02(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_General_HasMet_CrecheGuard02(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_CrecheGuard02:40d8df90-8c1b-4ad4-80c1-f8fbc6b32d43
msgctxt "h8311a964gbdf5g4180g80feg94bec16f4d38"
msgid ""
"I suppose you've never seen a crèche under an inquisition before, "
"<i>ra'stil</i>. You are in luck."
msgstr "넌 심문관이 여기 양성소에 있었을 때 온 적이 없나 보군, <i>라스틸</i>. 운이 좋네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_CrecheGuard02
#. Speaker = Ardent Lin'a'an
#. NodeID = 8816044f-0998-4a76-78e2-b435b3e67cbe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_CrecheGuard02(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_CrecheGuard02:8816044f-0998-4a76-78e2-b435b3e67cbe
msgctxt "hf10741d2g28f9g404eg9678ge342bb63f15e"
msgid ""
"Better hope the <i>ch'r'ai</i> doesn't see you wandering around aimlessly."
msgstr "네가 생각 없이 얼쩡거리는 모습을 <i>츠라이</i>가 안 보는 편이 나을걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_CrecheGuard04
#. Speaker = Raider Ahu'u'rag
#. NodeID = 12bc63de-2ef6-45d6-8ff5-7d4065d481aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_CrecheGuard04(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_CrecheGuard04:12bc63de-2ef6-45d6-8ff5-7d4065d481aa
msgctxt "hfdcdf423g6f0bg4910gbecagbb62c238adf6"
msgid "If you can aid our search, kin, seek out Captain Therezzyn."
msgstr "동포여, 우리의 탐색을 도울 생각이 있다면, 테레진 대장님을 찾아가라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_CrecheGuard04
#. Speaker = Raider Ahu'u'rag
#. NodeID = 309388a5-ee49-4f6b-9403-fd72233d4075
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_CrecheGuard04(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_General_HasMet_CrecheGuard04(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_CrecheGuard04:309388a5-ee49-4f6b-9403-fd72233d4075
msgctxt "h5360e9dagda34g4035ga2ddg76514012dffa"
msgid ""
"<i>Kith'rak</i> Therezzyn needs results soon, or the Inquisitor will have "
"<i>all</i> our necks."
msgstr "<i>키스락</i> 테레진께서 서둘러서 결과물을 내지 못하면, 심문관이 우리 <i>모두</i>의 목을 날릴 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_CrecheGuard04
#. Speaker = Raider Ahu'u'rag
#. NodeID = a4cc8775-75ff-2d8b-3310-c396e0796b0e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
