msgid "Hear that, Ra'jak? She wants in!"
msgstr "들었어, 라자크? 그녀가 같이 하고 싶대!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_General_MageHandMain
