msgid "What's in the chest? It's making an <i>awful </i>noise."
msgstr "상자 안에 뭐가 들어있는데? <i>끔찍한</i> 소리가 나는 걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_General_MageHandMain
