msgctxt "hee9785c1gc2b2g4643gafc9g50c60550b74f"
msgid ""
"Urgh. You're boooring. Come on Ra'jak, let's show her how to have some FUN."
msgstr "어휴. 넌 재미없어. 라자크, 재밌게 노는 법을 좀 보여주자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_General_MageHandMain
