msgctxt "hf1c03854g6e67g4b05g8aabga63ad5b06a4d"
msgid ""
"Ooo, the <i>istik </i>wants to play. What do you say, Ra'jak, shall we "
"<i>play</i> with the <i>istik</i>?"
msgstr "오우, <i>이스틱</i>이 놀길 원한다고. 라자크 어떻게 할까, <i>이스틱</i>하고 같이 <i>놀아야</i> 할까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_General_MageHandMain
