msgid "Hells - I've got a bad feeling about this."
msgstr "젠장- 안 좋은 예감이 들기 시작하는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
