#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:a74bf5a9-dd91-bb39-3bcd-b5429b172658
msgctxt "hb5f970cfgdc71g4b35gaba4g6e37c5026ae3"
msgid ""
"*The device is strange, made of taut flesh and pockmarked metal. It "
"<i>waits</i> for something.*"
msgstr "*신전된 살점과 구멍 뚫린 금속으로 만들어진, 생소한 장치입니다. 장치는 무언가를 <i>기다리고</i> 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = a7bd0dcd-b5ce-88db-ff76-0f57aa72c01c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:a7bd0dcd-b5ce-88db-ff76-0f57aa72c01c
msgctxt "h1d092c2cgd667g4396g8582g73aaea43c5fa"
msgid ""
"Really? Then - all this destruction was a symptom of its power... Incredible."
msgstr "그래? 그럼 이 모든 파괴는 그 힘의 영향인 것이군... 놀라워."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = a7e43f5e-ebac-7bde-7572-94d3b215740c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_ResolvedPeacefully = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:a7e43f5e-ebac-7bde-7572-94d3b215740c
msgctxt "h32b59ef5g97feg4b87g9667g047704ccee4e"
msgid ""
"In any case, your problem is resolved. Leave me. I must salvage what I can."
msgstr "어쨌든 네 문제는 해결됐군. 이제 가버려. 난 어떻게든 이걸 수습해야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = aa6e30d0-7436-41d1-1d90-4aa41447f1b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - IMPOSSIBLE = True
#. TagRule: DAISY_DESIRETRACK and DAISY_MALE_VOICE
