msgctxt "hbd228d4bg234ag42f9g9015gc236d438ec32"
msgid "I will save you - again."
msgstr "또, 당신을 구해줄게요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = ac647085-44c0-47a1-6e97-5e1e865ca06b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 7131b9d6-232d-f988-7cff-7d1630dce3c5_DoctorTakesPart = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:ac647085-44c0-47a1-6e97-5e1e865ca06b
msgctxt "h642e148fgd3b0g4715g9054g4413b39691f5"
msgid ""
"You must focus on the parasite at all times. The <i>zaith'isk</i> will do "
"the rest."
msgstr "네 머릿속 기생충에 온 정신을 집중해라. 나머지는 <i>제이트이스크</i>가 처리할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ac9148e0-f47c-6988-69f3-09535d438730
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:ac9148e0-f47c-6988-69f3-09535d438730
msgctxt "hd8d7a9f2gc76cg4c76gb3f8g257508d214bf"
msgid ""
"*The device <i>yearns </i>for the creature, for every part of you tainted by "
"its presence. You will be <i>consumed.</i>*"
msgstr ""
"*장치는 어떤 생물을 <i>갈망하며</i>, 그 생물에 의해 오염된 당신의 모든 부분에 입맛을 다십니다. 당신은 <i>잡아먹힐</i> "
"것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = acea06d1-9d07-4104-beb6-26e1948960a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(6) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:acea06d1-9d07-4104-beb6-26e1948960a7
msgctxt "h3b37ad6cg12dfg40c7gb750ged989853de7b"
msgid "Enough, already - we need to stop this thing!"
msgstr "이제 그만해. 우리가 이걸 막아야 해!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = ad1e8cab-6e5d-3b15-72e9-24e44cbf908a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 7131b9d6-232d-f988-7cff-7d1630dce3c5_DoctorTakesPart = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:ad1e8cab-6e5d-3b15-72e9-24e44cbf908a
msgctxt "h4e6077a3g3377g47e6g894ag7627fbc2b0f7"
msgid "Focus! The procedure is almost complete."
msgstr "집중해라! 절차가 거의 완료되었으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ae7d922a-bd69-dc83-a4ce-9feb114a3134
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:ae7d922a-bd69-dc83-a4ce-9feb114a3134
msgctxt "ha3a1b2dbgee18g4f4bga2b5g827a7aa69e1f"
msgid ""
"*The tadpole senses your interference. It withdraws, coiling the putrid "
"magic tightly within.*"
msgstr "*올챙이가 당신의 간섭을 감지합니다. 그것은 물러나 똬리를 틀고, 부패한 마법을 단단히 감쌉니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aeca424c-180f-76b8-ee27-cab33618939b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 7131b9d6-232d-f988-7cff-7d1630dce3c5_WrongPlayerInDeviceRepeated = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 7131b9d6-232d-f988-7cff-7d1630dce3c5_DoctorTakesPart = True
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_DoctorIsExpectingCharacter(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:aeca424c-180f-76b8-ee27-cab33618939b
msgctxt "ha4733e6cg6aaeg4eadga861gc3d8f1a0dba3"
msgid "I do. Please - get it out of me."
msgstr "있어. 제발 벌레를 빼내 줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = afb5dba3-2552-62e2-8e54-03c3ffccdacb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 7131b9d6-232d-f988-7cff-7d1630dce3c5_TriedToEscapeDevice = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:afb5dba3-2552-62e2-8e54-03c3ffccdacb
msgctxt "h7fe2479dg29a5g40d1g9b74g8dadec688772"
msgid "<i>Get out of the chair.</i>"
msgstr "<i>자리에서 벗어난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b13d24e1-75c1-bc79-2e9a-4280b82b4283
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_UsedDevice = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(2) = True
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_LaezelTookPartInDevice = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:b13d24e1-75c1-bc79-2e9a-4280b82b4283
msgctxt "h6c249d71g1140g4a9bg967fg81f7115a8ee7"
msgid ""
"*To the weak, the <i>zaith'isk</i> may look a horror. To a githyanki, it "
"holds the promise of purity.*"
msgstr "*나약한 자에게는 <i>제이트이스크</i>가 혐오스럽게 보일 것입니다. 그러나 기스양키에게 이것은 정화의 약속입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b7e511c4-6c08-4452-bfa0-3a6ed77711e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SavingThrow
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. TagRule: WARLOCK_ARCHFEY
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:b7e511c4-6c08-4452-bfa0-3a6ed77711e5
msgctxt "h2e97bed4g7505g4723g8e54g54f0d4bc1a05"
msgid ""
"<i>Beseech your patron to lend the tadpole a mote of faerie arcana. </i>"
msgstr "<i>요정 비전의 티끌을 올챙이에게 제공해 달라고, 당신의 후원자에게 간청한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b7e511c4-6c08-4452-bfa0-3a6ed77711e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SavingThrow
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. TagRule: WARLOCK_FIEND
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:b7e511c4-6c08-4452-bfa0-3a6ed77711e5
msgctxt "hff3a9212g50e3g4c34g8c79g98532fc9a943"
msgid "<i>Ask your patron to lend the tadpole some diabolic might.</i>"
msgstr "<i>악마적인 힘을 올챙이에게 제공해 달라고, 당신의 후원자에게 요청한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b7e511c4-6c08-4452-bfa0-3a6ed77711e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SavingThrow
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. TagRule: WARLOCK_GREAT_OLD_ONE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:b7e511c4-6c08-4452-bfa0-3a6ed77711e5
msgctxt "h226864d3g3c2eg4741g997cg6c04eafed7ab"
msgid "<i>Entreat your patron - ask it to lend the tadpole eldritch power.</i>"
msgstr "<i>엘드리치 힘을 올챙이에게 제공해 달라고, 당신의 후원자에게 간청한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b7e511c4-6c08-4452-bfa0-3a6ed77711e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SavingThrow
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. TagRule: BARD
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:b7e511c4-6c08-4452-bfa0-3a6ed77711e5
msgctxt "ha96e6473ga3f8g4f9dg8da2ga6cf401417f9"
msgid "<i>Harmonise with the tadpole's magic. Amplify it.</i>"
msgstr "<i>올챙이의 마법과 조화를 이루고 증폭시킨다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b7e511c4-6c08-4452-bfa0-3a6ed77711e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SavingThrow
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. TagRule: PALADIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:b7e511c4-6c08-4452-bfa0-3a6ed77711e5
msgctxt "h43e0d3bbgd2adg4152ga84eg083ef8c3627c"
msgid "<i>Share your oathbound magics with the tadpole. </i>"
msgstr "<i>맹세에 얽힌 마법을 올챙이와 공유한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b7e511c4-6c08-4452-bfa0-3a6ed77711e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SavingThrow
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. TagRule: SORCERER
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:b7e511c4-6c08-4452-bfa0-3a6ed77711e5
msgctxt "h9779754dg8099g48a3g96e6gd0a10d49efc5"
msgid "<i>Follow the strange magic to its source. </i>"
msgstr "<i>낯선 마법의 근원을 따라가 본다. </i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = b8809e78-1142-2cde-f7d7-fa92b8a6b16e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:b8809e78-1142-2cde-f7d7-fa92b8a6b16e
msgctxt "h713ba259g176eg4479g976ag8658f0c67a36"
msgid "As I suspected. Take a seat."
msgstr "예상대로군. 저기에 누워라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = bc39ae50-b391-f7c7-f814-f690d4a13741
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:bc39ae50-b391-f7c7-f814-f690d4a13741
msgctxt "h0be6a6a2g3f32g4ac3ga819g6ac18ae7503c"
msgid ""
"Hmmm... The <i>zaith'isk</i> must have damaged you when it was destroyed."
msgstr "흠... <i>제이트이스크</i>가 망가지면서 너한테 손상을 입혔나 보군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = bd094f72-efc3-a779-8d1e-8d8816753aaa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - CRE_GithInfirmary_Knows_ToldWhatZaithiskDoes(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:bd094f72-efc3-a779-8d1e-8d8816753aaa
msgctxt "h0ce7c1bfgdbdbg400agb1e3g77e1ee62f847"
msgid ""
"*The device possesses immense, but unfocused, power. If you fail to direct "
"it towards the tadpole, your faculties could face permanent harm.*"
msgstr ""
"*장치는 종잡을 수 없는 힘을 보유하고 있지만, 초점이 엇나가 있습니다. 당신이 올챙이를 정확히 조준하지 못한다면, 영구적인 기능 손상이 "
"초래될 수 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = bd522c96-49d8-b5ed-52b9-e6cbbec24b17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_UsedDevice = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(2) = False
#.   User:
#.      - CRE_GithInfirmary_Knows_ToldWhatZaithiskDoes(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:bd522c96-49d8-b5ed-52b9-e6cbbec24b17
msgctxt "he88bbf20gca61g440fgab63gb4f86764b7fa"
msgid ""
"*The <i>zaith'isk</i>. This unnatural device offers your best chance of "
"purification.*"
msgstr "*<i>제이트이스크</i>. 이 기이한 장치야말로 당신에게 찾아올 최고의 정화 기회입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = be5e17a4-6578-70b7-2ebd-00a1daed4a3e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(7) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:be5e17a4-6578-70b7-2ebd-00a1daed4a3e
msgctxt "h684308afg5047g4303g96fdg6fe963ac4185"
msgid ""
"I don't like the look of this thing. Its 'cure' could be a metal bolt "
"punched through your skull."
msgstr "이거 생긴 게 마음에 안 드는데, '치료'라면서 머리에 쇠 나사를 박을 거 같잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = be9453d0-9bd4-1e40-fb7a-42ff124c4e2f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SavingThrow
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. TagRule: WIZARD
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:be9453d0-9bd4-1e40-fb7a-42ff124c4e2f
msgctxt "h25d71754gca33g445egb138gbbae592ff051"
msgid ""
"<i>Study the ancient magic. Trace its forms. Align yourself with them.</i>"
msgstr "<i>고대 마법을 탐구하고 그 형태를 그려 본다. 당신과 주문을 하나로 조정한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = be9453d0-9bd4-1e40-fb7a-42ff124c4e2f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SavingThrow
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. TagRule: !()
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:be9453d0-9bd4-1e40-fb7a-42ff124c4e2f
msgctxt "h0f3c44efga842g4adagab5ag9f17dc45b6d9"
msgid "<i>Focus on this ancient magic. Feed it with your own.</i>"
msgstr "<i>이 고대 마법에 정신을 집중한다. 당신의 마법으로 그것을 가득 채운다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = c27d6cf4-c0c9-4107-9ef0-d35e761142a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(7) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:c27d6cf4-c0c9-4107-9ef0-d35e761142a9
msgctxt "h965ce11fg0836g4839g8d74gd6c0431bb30f"
msgid "This 'cure' looks set to kill you - get out!"
msgstr "이 '치료'는 널 죽이려는 거야, 나와!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c328a819-f2f8-aadd-46ec-399dd32674f4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:c328a819-f2f8-aadd-46ec-399dd32674f4
msgctxt "h37b50842g779cg4d4ag8901gb7bc71ebea43"
msgid "<i>Lie down in the device. </i>"
msgstr "<i>기계에 눕는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = c3e32c5c-7154-4a67-bb66-62c798d9e93b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:c3e32c5c-7154-4a67-bb66-62c798d9e93b
msgctxt "hd976a81ag0870g49bdg8c94g3bd64c5320af"
msgid "You deny me my due, then seek my comfort? <i>Bah</i>. Sit, and be pure."
msgstr "내 권리를 막아서더니, 이제는 내게서 위안을 찾는 건가? <i>바하</i>. 앉아라, 그리고 정화되어라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c61c617b-a614-d369-e701-90806b625d23
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_Event_DamageBrainCON(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:c61c617b-a614-d369-e701-90806b625d23
msgctxt "h99ff6214g1757g42c8g900eg2ca80257ace9"
msgid "<i>Lash'a'kla! Lash'a'kla! Lash'a'kla!</i>"
msgstr "<i>라샤'클라! 라샤'클라! 라샤'클라!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c637d7d8-cfee-181c-9efe-e0a474c580c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:c637d7d8-cfee-181c-9efe-e0a474c580c9
msgctxt "he1a2972fgb9c4g406dg96e6ge9a3609424dd"
msgid "<i>Step away.</i>"
msgstr "<i>물러난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = c79f8129-e4c5-4dc5-bac1-d4425847139e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_4 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:c79f8129-e4c5-4dc5-bac1-d4425847139e
msgctxt "hd3e99fa2ga6c4g492bgb6acg80b218ca28f8"
msgid "The pain. It's - it's too much. <i>Can't. Endure.</i>"
msgstr "고통이... 너... 너무 심해. <i>못 참겠어.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = c85240e1-102f-43df-a95f-21f6798b8914
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(7) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:c85240e1-102f-43df-a95f-21f6798b8914
msgctxt "h66fbcab4g3da3g47beg8bdagf58fc93bf6ba"
msgid "There's got to be a way to stop this thing!"
msgstr "이걸 막을 방법이 있을 거야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = c85b93fc-3fa8-d64b-d07f-3449df4a6508
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(8) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(8) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:c85b93fc-3fa8-d64b-d07f-3449df4a6508
msgctxt "hc339b03cg7bafg40fcg963bgb18f1186c428"
msgid ""
"Well... could go either way. But we came this far - should at least try."
msgstr "음... 잘 될 수도, 망할 수도 있지. 그래도 여기까지 왔잖아. 최소한 시도는 해봐야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = cb9c6eb0-a27f-0411-b54c-1edc180b4858
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:cb9c6eb0-a27f-0411-b54c-1edc180b4858
msgctxt "h0c3e6805gcca0g4807g894ag0f54f8b8436a"
msgid ""
"*Through waves of torment, you search for the parasite's lurking presence.*"
msgstr "*고통의 파도를 뚫고, 당신은 숨어있는 기생충을 수색합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = cdc5c95e-c83a-40bc-85a1-28b7657e51de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(8) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(8) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:cdc5c95e-c83a-40bc-85a1-28b7657e51de
msgctxt "h5d9131efgb813g475fgbb94g99372cfd68d1"
msgid "That's no cure - it's going to kill you. Get out!"
msgstr "이건 치료가 아니야, 널 죽이려는 거지. 나와!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = cdf9e361-e0b2-452c-9165-4900a81d8db3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:cdf9e361-e0b2-452c-9165-4900a81d8db3
msgctxt "hdfbf0c50gdbd1g4af9gbc90g4b913ea7be18"
msgid "It's too much, you can't take it. Get out of there, now!"
msgstr "이건 너무 과해, 견딜 수 없을 거야. 당장 거기서 나와!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = cf75e9fc-2c4f-a3bb-5bce-068d8b3c5f18
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 7131b9d6-232d-f988-7cff-7d1630dce3c5_DoctorTakesPart = True
#.      - 7131b9d6-232d-f988-7cff-7d1630dce3c5_FailedMindRoll = False
#.   Object:
#.      - CRE_GithInfirmary_Event_GainNewPower(2) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:cf75e9fc-2c4f-a3bb-5bce-068d8b3c5f18
msgctxt "h93aec11eg6d56g49e9gbac4gda74821d766c"
msgid ""
"*The room swims back into focus as sensation returns to your body. You are "
"intact. As is your tadpole.*"
msgstr "*몸의 감각이 돌아오면서, 주위 공간이 서서히 눈에 들어옵니다. 당신은 온전합니다. 올챙이도 온전합니다*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d27ab97f-35f1-762c-5f1a-022f276e654b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:d27ab97f-35f1-762c-5f1a-022f276e654b
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h0ddd82dfg51fcg45a8gb52cgcd8469729fee"
msgid ""
"*Your limbs are unresponsive, cut off by the device's magic. You can't move.*"
msgstr "*장치의 마법에 의해 연결이 차단되어, 당신의 사지가 반응하지 않습니다. 움직일 수 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = d2cc98b4-1364-e16f-a76a-4c7f0adb79ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 7131b9d6-232d-f988-7cff-7d1630dce3c5_DoctorTakesPart = True
#. TagRule: !GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:d2cc98b4-1364-e16f-a76a-4c7f0adb79ae
msgctxt "h4acf1490gadf0g413dg8965ga225a28682cb"
msgid "Once begun, the treatment must be completed."
msgstr "일단 치료를 시작하면 반드시 완료해야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = d2cc98b4-1364-e16f-a76a-4c7f0adb79ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 7131b9d6-232d-f988-7cff-7d1630dce3c5_DoctorTakesPart = True
#. TagRule: GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:d2cc98b4-1364-e16f-a76a-4c7f0adb79ae
msgctxt "h15a86c84ge692g49a3g9d79g55cacc5f56ba"
msgid "The <i>zaith'isk</i> is the only thing that can help you now."
msgstr "지금 널 도울 수 있는 것은 <i>제이트이스크</i>뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = d68a6944-c3f2-6fdf-8377-9001bea2e17a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:d68a6944-c3f2-6fdf-8377-9001bea2e17a
msgctxt "h3738060cg4826g4eeegb390gbf2f71970e7d"
msgid "This childish display is fooling no one."
msgstr "그 누구도 이런 유치한 쇼에 속지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = dba7dadc-e07b-4d01-8b90-20e1e994721f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(8) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(8) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:dba7dadc-e07b-4d01-8b90-20e1e994721f
msgctxt "h01c9e5cfg3d34g4293gab38g0b5722d4fa5a"
msgid "There has to be a way to stop this thing!"
msgstr "이걸 막을 방법이 있을 거야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = dc177fe6-15e4-eff1-99e2-8ed093dcb253
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_Event_GainNewPower(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:dc177fe6-15e4-eff1-99e2-8ed093dcb253
msgctxt "h46fedb7bg154bg4c28gbd76g508a8707f62c"
msgid ""
"*The two forces fuse violently together, your brain their conduit. Your body "
"and mind drift apart - you are being undone.*"
msgstr "*두 힘이 격렬하게 융합되고, 당신의 뇌는 그 통로가 됩니다. 몸과 마음이 멀어집니다. 당신은 부서지고 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = df6c864e-ff37-1be4-ff4a-ceaeca82ba14
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SavingThrow
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 12
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 7131b9d6-232d-f988-7cff-7d1630dce3c5_DoctorTakesPart = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:df6c864e-ff37-1be4-ff4a-ceaeca82ba14
msgctxt "h13e69aeag8618g4092gb189g672cb449bb14"
msgid "<i>Focus the device on your tadpole.</i>"
msgstr "<i>장치의 초점을 올챙이에 맞춘다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e71c0a74-084c-2099-d67c-45aa23e5759b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 7131b9d6-232d-f988-7cff-7d1630dce3c5_TriedToEscapeDevice = True
#.      - 7131b9d6-232d-f988-7cff-7d1630dce3c5_DoctorTakesPart = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:e71c0a74-084c-2099-d67c-45aa23e5759b
msgctxt "h3ddc49a2g33fbg45bcg9492g207a54d59592"
msgid ""
"*The room swims back into focus. Inside your head, you feel a familiar "
"squirm. You escaped, but so did your tadpole.*"
msgstr "*공간이 서서히 눈에 들어옵니다. 당신의 머리에서 익숙한 꿈틀거림이 느껴집니다. 당신은 탈출했지만, 올챙이도 탈출했습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ed23d13f-5b78-ec36-11a2-0f10a70181dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:ed23d13f-5b78-ec36-11a2-0f10a70181dd
msgctxt "h7f4f1cc0gde47g4753g84c3g114c84d7ab5a"
msgid ""
"*You urge your body from the chair with every fibre of your consciousness, "
"but can't lift so much as a finger.*"
msgstr "*의자에서 몸을 떼어내기 위해 온 정신을 집중해 보지만, 손가락 하나 까딱할 수 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = ef1d5b3b-c710-4207-907d-dce44433e448
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:ef1d5b3b-c710-4207-907d-dce44433e448
msgctxt "h40b6271fgbf28g42a2g8070g21b515722c2e"
msgid "What are you doing? Turn it off!"
msgstr "뭐 하는 거야? 기계 꺼!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = eff74e1f-f991-3d6b-51a4-10c18880c80e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:eff74e1f-f991-3d6b-51a4-10c18880c80e
msgctxt "h767250bag497cg4271gb135g3011cc9a0e2c"
msgid "That's it, you're almost there. The <i>zaith'isk</i> never fails."
msgstr "바로 그거다. 거의 다 왔다. <i>제이트이스크</i>는 실패를 모르지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = eff74e1f-f991-3d6b-51a4-10c18880c80e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:eff74e1f-f991-3d6b-51a4-10c18880c80e
msgctxt "h62d1531bg8dc7g4233gb655gc6a2145d293f"
msgid "That's it. Soon your suffering will be over, kin."
msgstr "바로 그거다. 곧 있으면 네 고통도 끝날 것이다, 동포여."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f1cc0c81-1f6e-8b1d-df0b-29abb461b826
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:f1cc0c81-1f6e-8b1d-df0b-29abb461b826
msgctxt "h8c38c5d6gc693g4a7fg8c22g935d6ff03bad"
msgid ""
"*Finally, the device makes contact. You feel your spirit unravelling, drawn "
"from you in sinewy threads.*"
msgstr "*마침내, 장치가 접촉합니다. 억센 실타래가 풀리듯 당신의 정신이 풀어지는 것을 느낍니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = f692e7c2-fdb1-4b77-957d-5eb2ae87c340
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_4 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:f692e7c2-fdb1-4b77-957d-5eb2ae87c340
msgctxt "h0653e03fgd92bg49afgade9g3e2a30561f55"
msgid "This <i>torment</i>. You - you must persist. You must be cleansed!"
msgstr "이 <i>고통</i>을 보라. 넌 - 넌 계속 밀어붙여야 한다. 넌 정화되어야만 해!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f6f9e635-de55-2a74-61cd-f25b88af7f6a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:f6f9e635-de55-2a74-61cd-f25b88af7f6a
msgctxt "he71b244fg0d78g42d8g87e6g6b349f694dde"
msgid "You're wrong. The parasite's dead. I felt it die."
msgstr "틀렸어. 기생충은 죽었어. 죽은 게 느껴져."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = f76e3c00-6ee6-2560-f707-919a277937ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:f76e3c00-6ee6-2560-f707-919a277937ed
msgctxt "h6bf67c01g3c95g4849gbe36g9b8be1b66335"
msgid ""
"The only variable in this experience was you - and your parasite. And I will "
"uncover how this happened."
msgstr "이 경험에 있어서 유일한 변수는 너와 네 올챙이뿐이야. 어떻게 이런 일이 일어났는지 반드시 알아내겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = fa57e629-aab4-417f-aedb-e642eed642fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(9) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_HALSIN(9) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:fa57e629-aab4-417f-aedb-e642eed642fd
msgctxt "hadab64ffgb882g4621g9688gaad1ea8c2726"
msgid ""
"That contraption looks set to kill you, not save you. Get clear of it, at "
"once!"
msgstr "그 기계가 그대를 구하려는 게 아니라, 죽이려 하는 것 같소. 거기서 벗어나시오, 당장!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = fa9698ca-20f5-522b-ca00-d0c8942952a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:fa9698ca-20f5-522b-ca00-d0c8942952a5
msgctxt "h132ec5fdga69eg447cga2d1g71ba051eefec"
msgid "Purification is your duty. The pain is hardly relevant."
msgstr "정화는 너의 의무다. 고통은 별로 중요하지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = fb25394f-f6cf-39c9-4c4a-4b8324b138e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 7131b9d6-232d-f988-7cff-7d1630dce3c5_DoctorTakesPart = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:fb25394f-f6cf-39c9-4c4a-4b8324b138e9
msgctxt "hd084c169g4148g4ec6g9c49gacf42788d5b4"
msgid "Hmm. An unusually stubborn specimen. Don't let it slip away."
msgstr "흐음. 비정상적으로 완고한 표본이로군. 달아나게 두지 마라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = fb8303a9-85ba-4b19-870a-6feb3a4757e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(9) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_HALSIN(9) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:fb8303a9-85ba-4b19-870a-6feb3a4757e7
msgctxt "hd2541640g4f7fg46ccg9b31g8238a2e50c86"
msgid "There must be some way to stop this."
msgstr "이걸 막을 방법이 분명히 있을 거요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fd2c7c90-e7c3-34b5-3a63-d3ea25939855
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SavingThrow
#. RollAbility: Constitution
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. TagRule: !REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:fd2c7c90-e7c3-34b5-3a63-d3ea25939855
msgctxt "h344443d0ga8bcg46acg8935g83b59b777535"
msgid "<i>Keep going. Complete the extraction.</i>"
msgstr "<i>계속 진행한다. 추출 작업을 완료한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fd2c7c90-e7c3-34b5-3a63-d3ea25939855
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SavingThrow
#. RollAbility: Constitution
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Device:fd2c7c90-e7c3-34b5-3a63-d3ea25939855
msgctxt "ha88f8260g5c1cg4818g9b38gce5219e30f5f"
msgid "<i>Complete your purification. Surrender to Vlaakith's will.</i>"
msgstr "<i>정화 작업을 완료한다. 블라키스의 의지에 몸을 맞긴다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_DeviceDoctorInterrupt
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = b69cd7b7-b7da-c3bc-47af-361764a9ad8f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_UsedDeviceBeforeSpeakingToDoctor(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_DeviceDoctorInterrupt:b69cd7b7-b7da-c3bc-47af-361764a9ad8f
msgctxt "h4d759a97ga753g428eg9a35g7452ba15e050"
msgid "Leave it <i>alone</i>."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_DeviceDoctorInterrupt
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = bbb48d54-f914-7a3a-7d09-ba6311f74cb1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_UsedDeviceBeforeSpeakingToDoctor(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_UsedDeviceBeforeSpeakingToDoctor(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_DeviceDoctorInterrupt:bbb48d54-f914-7a3a-7d09-ba6311f74cb1
msgctxt "hadd2ce12g54dbg4fe2gb9adg964d911d0133"
msgid "What are you doing?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_DeviceDoctorInterrupt
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = e11563f7-c0c4-53c7-258d-c38230333cee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_DeviceDoctorInterrupt:e11563f7-c0c4-53c7-258d-c38230333cee
msgctxt "hf691f720g909eg491dgb8c9gbc5d012022a3"
msgid "The <i>zaith'isk</i> is not a child's play thing."
msgstr "<i>제이트이스크</i>는 애들 장난감이 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_DeviceDoctorInterrupt
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = f75bca5e-e111-71db-ee16-60c4a5008541
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_DeviceDoctorInterrupt:f75bca5e-e111-71db-ee16-60c4a5008541
msgctxt "hdce56ea9gb5dcg44abgb605g5b71701e897e"
msgid "If you require its services, speak to me. Otherwise - leave."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 0262b9f1-ebde-e083-aa42-c65f9ad0f759
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:0262b9f1-ebde-e083-aa42-c65f9ad0f759
msgctxt "h645b16bbgd1acg46baga7a0g7fd2b365cb2c"
msgid "<i>Chk. </i>Clearly our schooling is not what it used to be."
msgstr "<i>츠크. </i> 요즘 교육은 예전 같지 않군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 02cce45f-8e16-258e-4a79-6a2552ccabe4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:02cce45f-8e16-258e-4a79-6a2552ccabe4
msgctxt "h5560a10agcd34g4bdagb86fgc10907c03e4a"
msgid ""
"There are more <i>rudimentary </i>methods of extraction, if you find our "
"technology intimidating."
msgstr "추출에는 <i>원초적인</i> 다른 방법도 있다, 우리의 기술을 위협적으로 느낀다면 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 032846f9-0802-5a4a-b568-e0516b3e2ca8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:032846f9-0802-5a4a-b568-e0516b3e2ca8
msgctxt "h0b9e5d40g1c3fg43f9ga225g95456e488836"
msgid ""
"You aren't the first <i>istik</i> to require my treatment - though you're "
"the most lucid by some margin."
msgstr "내게 치료를 요구한 <i>이스틱</i>은 네가 첫 번째가 아니다. 그중에서 가장 정신이 온전한 것 같다만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 059ca488-2573-8913-08c7-819538e72b55
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:059ca488-2573-8913-08c7-819538e72b55
msgctxt "h9f34d6f1gb867g48eag9395g7cbf711ce74c"
msgid ""
"Though I will admit, it's <i>fascinating</i> that you're still able to lie "
"at this stage of infection."
msgstr "그래도 인정하겠어, 감염이 이만큼 진행되었는데도 여전히 거짓말을 할 수 있다는 건 <i>놀라운</i> 일이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0638d974-1b28-7875-5d8d-ae30cbe8d979
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:0638d974-1b28-7875-5d8d-ae30cbe8d979
msgctxt "he8975d20g2a72g46a2gb5e3g0e711039d7bf"
msgid "A day or two. They seem to be fine so far."
msgstr "하루 이틀 정도. 아직은 괜찮아 보여."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 0681d65d-c659-ec1c-2d0d-dc572dad70f3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:0681d65d-c659-ec1c-2d0d-dc572dad70f3
msgctxt "h90a00bc6ge970g478bg9a31g80ba15d7450f"
msgid "If not, I question your choice of 'friends'."
msgstr "그게 아니라면, 누가 그 '동료'인지 궁금하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 07ca7b19-d81e-ed9f-d6a5-5052b0953662
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:07ca7b19-d81e-ed9f-d6a5-5052b0953662
msgctxt "h259661ecgb44fg4d9fga5cagffbdca830da2"
msgid "Infected, and yet capable of maintaining a falsehood. How unusual."
msgstr "감염된 상태라, 그런데도 아직 거짓말을 할 수 있고. 아주 특이하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 08667fa5-d7dd-4ee1-3185-23bf466ef0de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 01b57839-a171-8a20-62bf-1d4465732b5a_TriedFriend = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:08667fa5-d7dd-4ee1-3185-23bf466ef0de
msgctxt "h64ef5f98gc3cfg49b5ga128gc0199991f64a"
msgid ""
"Not me personally, but my friend does. I'm trying to find a way to help them."
msgstr "내 몸에 있는 건 아니고, 내 동료한테 있어. 동료를 도울 방법을 찾는 중이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 088843e7-defc-0451-0996-1851e7c8bd67
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:088843e7-defc-0451-0996-1851e7c8bd67
msgctxt "h979f1189g1d11g4f01g8ce5gf01f8df36253"
msgid "And you expected charity from <i>us</i>?"
msgstr "그래서 <i>우리</i>한테 자선을 바라는 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 0d4d9d1f-c1fb-0bc6-438e-d5d9587aa8b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_PretendedCurious(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:0d4d9d1f-c1fb-0bc6-438e-d5d9587aa8b5
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h6a65586fg52ccg4ddcgb815g23e95317e5ae"
msgid "A facile achievement for those who know so little to begin with."
msgstr "무지렁이들의 손쉬운 성취군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 0d64e55a-126e-683a-70b7-9a5b386333d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:0d64e55a-126e-683a-70b7-9a5b386333d0
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hde938903gdc3fg44f5g8e27g5780c6b2d2e4"
msgid "I can only deduce... you have a parasite of your own."
msgstr "가능한 유일한 추론은... 네 몸 속에 기생충이 있다는 거지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 0d6a791d-e7c8-bbfa-8133-776a676af702
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_Knows_ToldWhatZaithiskDoes(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:0d6a791d-e7c8-bbfa-8133-776a676af702
msgctxt "he4069747g7d18g4745g9971g3ffda1cabbe7"
msgid ""
"It will relieve you of the specimen lodged in your cerebral cortex. What "
"else?"
msgstr "네 두뇌 피질에 자리 잡은 표본을 축출하지. 무슨 용도겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0ea9d007-21df-16cb-842a-d6400b39fb9d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor_LaezelInclusion1 = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:0ea9d007-21df-16cb-842a-d6400b39fb9d
msgctxt "h13558053gc6c6g4059g9ec6g4e6ef590e0c0"
msgid "I'd prefer Lae'zel to speak on my behalf."
msgstr "나 대신 레이젤이 말하게 하고 싶군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0ede556a-6924-e661-f794-f76534da2b76
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 01b57839-a171-8a20-62bf-1d4465732b5a_TriedFriend = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:0ede556a-6924-e661-f794-f76534da2b76
msgctxt "hc3579dc0g21dcg44ccga061ga8803fe12e12"
msgid "I lied, it's me. I'm the one with the tadpole."
msgstr "거짓말을 했어, 나야. 내 머리에 올챙이가 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0fe93120-615f-eacb-25d0-398b963eb23c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_GithInfirmary_Knows_CrecheHasDoctor = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_ToldDoctorAboutTadpoles(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:0fe93120-615f-eacb-25d0-398b963eb23c
msgctxt "h20fa02ecg1682g412cg9eacg583b2a673def"
msgid "I have a tadpole of my own needs removing. Can you help with that?"
msgstr "내 몸의 올챙이를 제거해야 해. 도와줄 수 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 108afdf8-ef4d-777a-8329-98c1d5ca98c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:108afdf8-ef4d-777a-8329-98c1d5ca98c6
msgctxt "h42b3dbceg9f37g46ddgab0bgd91070327480"
msgid "I have first-hand knowledge. I'm infected."
msgstr "경험에서 우러나오는 지식이 있지. 난 감염자거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 1431acc7-52c7-1046-2ce3-22fd32d7c923
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:1431acc7-52c7-1046-2ce3-22fd32d7c923
msgctxt "h3a2df4a5gbcfbg44b2ga71egb63e750c723c"
msgid "Intestinal colouration consistent with samples 231 to 259."
msgstr "장의 착색은 샘플 231번에서 259번과 일치함."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 18e6e540-7e10-83ec-301d-4d7aaa25e907
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:18e6e540-7e10-83ec-301d-4d7aaa25e907
msgctxt "hdda7bad3gaf56g4514gbe8fg66d40074fec5"
msgid "Lae'zel, is it? Fine - and be quick. My work is of vital import."
msgstr "레이젤, 맞나? 좋아, 빨리 말해라. 내 작업은 대단히 중요하다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 190c3563-e3e0-1ab7-717f-d61deb0d2a9e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_Knows_DiscoveredZaithisk = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:190c3563-e3e0-1ab7-717f-d61deb0d2a9e
msgctxt "h6ec9f8ebg34d9g406cga859g651dd44b4b25"
msgid "Go to the <i>zaith'isk</i>. I will ensure you are cured."
msgstr "<i>제이트이스크</i>로 가라. 확실히 치료해 주도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 1c353d9f-624b-522e-1f15-5478d4cdd781
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:1c353d9f-624b-522e-1f15-5478d4cdd781
msgctxt "hb3a54b8fge3a3g4172g9e44g8e4580878749"
msgid ""
"First the nautiloid's arrival, then the <i>ghaik</i> swarming around "
"Moonrise... "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1d25929e-c868-bb84-b4c0-fc91f7891980
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_General_State_WentToMoonriseBeforeCreche = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:1d25929e-c868-bb84-b4c0-fc91f7891980
msgctxt "h998fe37fg9ce5g4b4fgadc5ge46fe01469c4"
msgid "<i>Tell her of the True Souls you've encountered.</i>"
msgstr "<i>지금껏 마주쳤던 참된 영혼에 관해 이야기합니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1ee85659-086a-7865-4130-7ff83d96b70a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:1ee85659-086a-7865-4130-7ff83d96b70a
msgctxt "hbb383eb2g6460g448agacb6g123957c0e266"
msgid "Thanks for that. Learn something new every day."
msgstr "알려줘서 고마워. 매일 새로운 걸 알아가는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 20fbdf54-5fee-080d-43fd-e08f35aa1f63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:20fbdf54-5fee-080d-43fd-e08f35aa1f63
msgctxt "hd9f0e8dfg19dag47dbg88f1g2ff771d08694"
msgid ""
"Best not to delay. They may soon be beyond even my capabilities to save."
msgstr "지체하지 않는 게 좋을 거야. 곧 내 능력으로도 구할 수 없게 될지 모르니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 21308151-b269-d4b1-3751-347a52c341a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:21308151-b269-d4b1-3751-347a52c341a7
msgctxt "hea9f0371g47c1g407bgb707g2a62170e8712"
msgid "All right, I'll go fetch them."
msgstr "알았어, 가서 데려오지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 22feafc5-a164-6ea7-c4f2-754792430383
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:22feafc5-a164-6ea7-c4f2-754792430383
msgctxt "h9132f2fag7e55g49e9gafdfg9fc2f10428d2"
msgid ""
"Longer than you'd expect ceremorphosis to take. And with none of the "
"symptoms."
msgstr "원래라면 뇌변이가 일어났을 시간은 지났어. 어떤 증상도 없었고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 24144f85-64d2-d387-4080-825ed54ba6a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_ToldDoctorAboutTadpoles(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:24144f85-64d2-d387-4080-825ed54ba6a1
msgctxt "hdc6f3eefgffa1g445bg8941gbdf32f8b1af2"
msgid "I am Lae'zel of K'liir. I have come to be purified."
msgstr "나는 클리르의 레이젤이다. 정화를 위해 여기에 왔다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 25bf1734-e67b-ac5c-fd9d-3bc89a4279c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:25bf1734-e67b-ac5c-fd9d-3bc89a4279c2
msgctxt "ha1d06e59gf6e4g4776g9fa5ge7e53a6adfb8"
msgid "Not yet."
msgstr "아직."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 26fafed7-f674-e6bf-07e7-32ea42769fc8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:26fafed7-f674-e6bf-07e7-32ea42769fc8
msgctxt "h33ba34cfg7ebeg493dg9410g6f734ce0b743"
msgid ""
"<i>Fascinating</i>. So you're conscious of your infection, but showing no "
"signs of cerebral impairment."
msgstr "<i>흥미롭군</i>. 그러니까 스스로의 감염을 인지하고 있음에도, 어떤 지능 감퇴의 징후도 보이지 않는다는 건가."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 2886c7b3-ae30-4238-5208-1734ce17e6a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:2886c7b3-ae30-4238-5208-1734ce17e6a6
msgctxt "he4eaa248g0bdag413egac6dg2c3d50237d03"
msgid ""
"Much like your decision to seek aid from us. The infestation at Moonrise has "
"created strange bedfellows indeed.\n"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 2988f307-4ebd-1be1-8075-f575f20a20e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:2988f307-4ebd-1be1-8075-f575f20a20e0
msgctxt "h40350134g4b0ag440agad61g34bb0e27edc1"
msgid ""
"Still, you appear to be functioning far beyond the capacity of others I've "
"observed in your condition. How <i>fascinating.</i>"
msgstr "그래도, 내가 지금까지 본 감염자들보단 훨씬 더 제 모습을 잘 유지하는 것처럼 보여. 정말 <i>흥미롭군.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 2af9a4ae-61a0-9004-3b8a-0261b694756a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:2af9a4ae-61a0-9004-3b8a-0261b694756a
msgctxt "h9032abc8g57d0g4abeg9cfdgcba03cc11c93"
msgid "Tell me, what is your understanding of ceremorphosis?"
msgstr "넌 뇌변이를 얼마만큼 알고 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 2b70b81a-ef73-88bd-542c-4953134d3b3d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 01b57839-a171-8a20-62bf-1d4465732b5a_DrConvincedAboutFriend = True
#.   Object:
#.      - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_TriedFriendProblem(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:2b70b81a-ef73-88bd-542c-4953134d3b3d
msgctxt "h9f277a62g4d9bg492fgb56ag4face771f825"
msgid "Are you the 'friend' with the tadpole problem?"
msgstr "네가 그 올챙이 문제가 있다던 '친구'인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 2c5a5677-b283-affb-9157-dde6bf32c852
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:2c5a5677-b283-affb-9157-dde6bf32c852
msgctxt "h2a72d432ge82cg40a9gae97gee722044c04b"
msgid "So you are not an idiot. But nor are you an intellectual."
msgstr "너는 멍청하지 않지만 그렇다고 똑똑하지도 않구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 2d26dc63-304f-db7f-73bb-535d4bcb002b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:2d26dc63-304f-db7f-73bb-535d4bcb002b
msgctxt "hff134910g6aa8g4e3fgbf17gf5da0b3fcabf"
msgid ""
"Is that so? Conscious of the tadpole's presence, yet able to pretend "
"otherwise. Fascinating."
msgstr "그래? 올챙이의 존재를 지각한 상태로 그렇지 않은 척할 수 있다니. 흥미롭군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 2eb9f799-385d-8be1-9143-da8f0364e372
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:2eb9f799-385d-8be1-9143-da8f0364e372
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h5f49067bg5c84g479fg98ffg3c3911125388"
msgid ""
"If you would prefer another extraction method, kin, you have only to ask."
msgstr "다른 추출 방식을 원한다면, 편하게 말하도록 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 2f04212d-3404-0898-cd8e-32d4188b226e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:2f04212d-3404-0898-cd8e-32d4188b226e
msgctxt "hdf7f2b75g0470g4658g9da6g8f0931eddf6d"
msgid "Either your tadpole is special, or you are. We must find out which."
msgstr "네 올챙이나, 네가 특별한 것이겠지. 어느 것인지 밝혀내야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2f4fcab1-d355-d893-ddd9-2a044b178f85
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:2f4fcab1-d355-d893-ddd9-2a044b178f85
msgctxt "h8c6026f6g7922g457ag9c6cgc7509f99c1e0"
msgid "What are you talking about?"
msgstr "무슨 얘기를 하는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 302f0b8b-2a81-b613-f03b-a0c04c1f4607
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:302f0b8b-2a81-b613-f03b-a0c04c1f4607
msgctxt "h3f7f448fgb583g48b4g91e6g1b357ecf1e20"
msgid ""
"Is that so? Dishonesty towards your superiors is an ill-advised behaviour."
msgstr "그런가? 상관에게 정직하지 못한 건 경솔한 행동인데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 32ad522b-bb76-8980-5341-669caa3e1d83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:32ad522b-bb76-8980-5341-669caa3e1d83
msgctxt "h9b188fb6gdabfg42c8gba30g0fc4164ed8ea"
msgid ""
"Unless you have anything <i>new</i> of your own to share, I must get back to "
"my sample. It's drying out."
msgstr "네가 얘기 해 줄 수 있는 것 중 <i>새로운</i> 것이 없다면, 샘플 작업을 계속해야겠다. 말라가고 있어서 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 330a4a58-bbdf-778c-2ea3-82fb65c3bb44
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:330a4a58-bbdf-778c-2ea3-82fb65c3bb44
msgctxt "h47beed78gb68cg4194g9144g065cfc91d5a0"
msgid ""
"It sounds like they've discovered a way to exist in a state of suspended "
"ceremorphosis."
msgstr "듣자하니 놈들은 뇌변이를 유예하는 법을 찾아낸 모양이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 34111bdf-cf0e-d0e6-e8ec-8b8e94e34d68
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_General_State_WentToMoonriseBeforeCreche = True
#.      - GLO_Ketheric_State_Dead = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:34111bdf-cf0e-d0e6-e8ec-8b8e94e34d68
msgctxt "h9600c79egb81cg4120g861fgd816bd2059d0"
msgid ""
"<i>Tell how you vanquished the tadpoled Absolutists in Moonrise Towers.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 3809a632-caf0-8dea-2134-c31cb7d9b9ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:3809a632-caf0-8dea-2134-c31cb7d9b9ca
msgctxt "h398b4f82g4c18g4d20g8345g3032858ecc18"
msgid "Do you have a question or are you just going to stand there gawking?"
msgstr "질문이 있는 건가, 아니면 그냥 거기 서서 멍하니 바라보는 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 3892263a-2e6b-b100-58fc-0835aea7f44c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:3892263a-2e6b-b100-58fc-0835aea7f44c
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hfbcfedc8gcd59g49dagb87cg2466a8d1f6e3"
msgid ""
"You do not gain true knowledge by demanding it of others. It must be earned."
msgstr "진정한 지식은 남에게 강요해서 얻을 수 없다. 노력해서 얻어야만 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 3901f4af-f84c-fa98-3a91-ffa6442cc834
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:3901f4af-f84c-fa98-3a91-ffa6442cc834
msgctxt "h6e492175gb90bg49dcg82aag150bf6829564"
msgid ""
"If your friend is not capable of asking me directly, I see no reason to get "
"involved."
msgstr "네 친구가 나한테 직접 물어볼 수 없는 거라면, 내가 관여해야 할 이유를 모르겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 39ca7cde-cc67-3edc-c3e5-86611782c01e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:39ca7cde-cc67-3edc-c3e5-86611782c01e
msgctxt "h5777902agff21g4534gb1f5gcc0d4cbef478"
msgid "Guessing is an idiotic habit. Theorise. Postulate. Deduce. Never guess."
msgstr "추측은 멍청한 습관이지. 가설을 세우고. 결과를 상정하고. 연역으로 결론지어. 절대 추측하지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 3ae892c1-9e44-637e-7247-3ad0b3aedbef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_GithInfirmary_HasMet_Doctor(1) = False
#.   Local:
#.      - 01b57839-a171-8a20-62bf-1d4465732b5a_DrConvincedAboutFriend = False
#.   Object:
#.      - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_UsedDeviceBeforeSpeakingToDoctor(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_HasMet_Doctor(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:3ae892c1-9e44-637e-7247-3ad0b3aedbef
msgctxt "h946dfce0ge951g409cgaa6ag1b9f4ee2614a"
msgid "Vertical incision from pineal eye to end of notochord."
msgstr "송과안에서 척삭의 끝까지 수직 절개."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 3b8da4a6-3a39-0128-9f23-4ecdf434d95b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:3b8da4a6-3a39-0128-9f23-4ecdf434d95b
msgctxt "h5c80cfc8g7dc1g4ca1g9c89g463fe93d1227"
msgid ""
"Most of our kin find such work rather tedious. I wonder - what makes you so "
"curious?"
msgstr "우리 동족 대부분이 이런 작업을 다소 따분하다고 생각하지. 궁금하군, 넌 왜 그렇게 관심을 보이는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 3e68e60b-a4ba-1f2b-fe98-3ab4fa3ee494
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:3e68e60b-a4ba-1f2b-fe98-3ab4fa3ee494
msgctxt "hf6f603c2g5d78g4ca5ga714g50f8d2289787"
msgid ""
"Ah. Friendship. A curious burden I confess I have no interest in carrying."
msgstr "아. 우정이라. 난 전혀 짊어질 생각이 없는 기이한 짐이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 3f9ac282-07ee-50e2-1089-6fec72991e8e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:3f9ac282-07ee-50e2-1089-6fec72991e8e
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h2b1f980cga478g48d9ga624g4b8a4d3627f4"
msgid "Operational? It is <i>exemplary</i>. I maintain it myself."
msgstr "작동? 아주 <i>훌륭한</i> 수준이지. 내가 직접 보수하니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 428c13b3-8d5b-a6e9-c53e-c8a54dbf87ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:428c13b3-8d5b-a6e9-c53e-c8a54dbf87ea
msgctxt "h7a51e25cg4328g4830g85aegf9cdc32e1928"
msgid ""
"The stupidity encouraged on this plane never ceases to amaze me. Listen "
"<i>carefully.</i>"
msgstr "이 차원의 멍청이들은 날 끊임없이 놀라게 하는군. <i>잘</i> 들어라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 4447430e-492f-60c9-1d00-e175e9d75aa8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:4447430e-492f-60c9-1d00-e175e9d75aa8
msgctxt "hc485d94eg7e32g4c93g811fg413d775811ad"
msgid "You've spent too much time with <i>istiks</i>, kin. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 450fb5f3-dfbb-0372-6929-c2201c193fba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:450fb5f3-dfbb-0372-6929-c2201c193fba
msgctxt "h5206a81fgfba3g4dbdg8624ge2d49c7e66c9"
msgid ""
"You have my thanks for these <i>observations </i>of yours. It seems you have "
"a scientist's eye after all."
msgstr "<i>관찰 내용 </i>을 알려줘서 고맙군. 넌 과학자의 눈썰미를 갖춘 모양이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 46c52383-e5c4-1fcb-a083-016a73e61c4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:46c52383-e5c4-1fcb-a083-016a73e61c4f
msgctxt "h2d242369ga90cg4adegbc70g8a23006e516f"
msgid "<i>Chk.</i> I am no <i>teacher</i>."
msgstr "<i>츠크.</i> 난 <i>선생</i>이 아니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 48915c26-1b77-c302-52d4-aab500fd093d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:48915c26-1b77-c302-52d4-aab500fd093d
msgctxt "hdb9b7c29ged88g4a9bgab85g506e5571b109"
msgid "Actually... Maybe I'll come back later."
msgstr "저기... 나중에 다시 올게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4a980ae4-dfe2-d3e1-0175-5186ec27df98
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_ToldDoctorAboutTadpoles(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:4a980ae4-dfe2-d3e1-0175-5186ec27df98
msgctxt "h348c78f7gc35bg4909g9c50g78bab935a098"
msgid "A few days? I stopped counting when I ran out of fingers."
msgstr "며칠? 손가락으로 다 못 셀 정도는 됐어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 4b9c3dea-9574-75d1-2407-55e86505bfeb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:4b9c3dea-9574-75d1-2407-55e86505bfeb
msgctxt "h9e86c9a3g1e19g4e4bg980eg53224f9a51b6"
msgid ""
"<i>Chk</i>. I see you're <i>somewhat</i> familiar with the material. Though "
"hardly up to date."
msgstr "<i>츠크</i>. <i>뭘</i> 좀 들어본 것 같긴 하군. 낡아 빠진 것뿐이지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4bbce20b-239b-e20b-cd1f-e126358e4a25
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_ToldDoctorAboutTadpoles(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:4bbce20b-239b-e20b-cd1f-e126358e4a25
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h4f4ffc79g2fbdg466bga3f1g436e85eaf645"
msgid "I have a confession. I've been tadpoled, and I need help."
msgstr "고백할 게 있어. 올챙이에 감염 돼서, 도움이 필요해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 4cd297a0-592f-05a6-6f4e-2f00ad31135f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_Event_ZaithiskKillsPlayer(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:4cd297a0-592f-05a6-6f4e-2f00ad31135f
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hffc0143fgb2a5g4d79gb602g9c6933c801a7"
msgid ""
"The <i>zaith'isk</i> is our last means of defence. It is used for the "
"removal of illithid tadpoles."
msgstr "<i>제이트이스크</i>는 우리의 마지막 방어 수단이다. 일리시드 올챙이를 제거하는데 사용되지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 4d2b02ce-a572-22ed-c0d4-c34a49aa6014
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:4d2b02ce-a572-22ed-c0d4-c34a49aa6014
msgctxt "hc51399c7g776eg4342g97d8gf99e6c15f21c"
msgid ""
"<i>Chk. </i>Curiosity without toil is like a broken viewing glass: unfocused "
"and incapable of insight."
msgstr "<i>츠크. </i>고생 없는 호기심은 깨진 돋보기와 다를 게 없다. 초점이 안 맞고 이해할 수 없으니 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 50231d58-033c-c93a-8daf-da8caf7b16c7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:50231d58-033c-c93a-8daf-da8caf7b16c7
msgctxt "h1a88c60ag6429g4b66g9d4cg93f919d63dd8"
msgid "You have my thanks."
msgstr "감사를 표하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 51a89b52-069e-f16f-377e-b3a166a8ba7b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:51a89b52-069e-f16f-377e-b3a166a8ba7b
msgctxt "h41ae2835gc65bg4a45gbfe3g9fd942555314"
msgid "As you wish."
msgstr "바라는 대로."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 554527a8-1645-c73d-3ee4-1ba9cce7d1d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:554527a8-1645-c73d-3ee4-1ba9cce7d1d5
msgctxt "hd034b065g01cag4f49g9bd2gca95531097b6"
msgid "If you require treatment, take a seat, kin. Or do you have a question?"
msgstr "치료가 필요한 거라면, 자리에 앉도록, 동족이여. 아니면 질문이라도 있는 것인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 56f7443e-2f3d-4d64-e823-7bc414b88b92
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_DoctorTriesToCallGuards = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:56f7443e-2f3d-4d64-e823-7bc414b88b92
msgctxt "h5acdd949g4980g4003ga1degde8d3220ef7d"
msgid "Wait here. I'll require some assistance."
msgstr "여기서 기다려라. 도움을 요청하도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 571ea74d-621c-30f5-f4f1-8fa9312dacc0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:571ea74d-621c-30f5-f4f1-8fa9312dacc0
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h7404da9eg8d6cg4ec8ga109geed2a9372b63"
msgid ""
"Come now, no need to be shy. I assure you I'd be delighted to help this "
"'friend' of yours."
msgstr "자, 자, 부끄러워 할 거 없어. 너도 분명 네 '동료'를 돕게 돼서 기쁠거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 59ef0a36-7081-d08e-f6c1-f573bc227624
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_ToldDoctorAboutTadpoles(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:59ef0a36-7081-d08e-f6c1-f573bc227624
msgctxt "h0d148845gce98g4a9fga3c4gdf4f3fb45909"
msgid "Look, I haven't told you everything. I'm infected..."
msgstr "저기, 내가 밝히지 않은 게 있는데. 난 이미 감염된 상태야..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5ffd5dbc-921e-cba6-7185-41e91b708b24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_ToldDoctorAboutTadpoles(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:5ffd5dbc-921e-cba6-7185-41e91b708b24
msgctxt "heba824afg4e1eg4000gaa9bg97e597d775a6"
msgid "Too long. Just get this thing out of me."
msgstr "엄청 오래됐지. 그냥 이걸 좀 꺼내줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 606a79e3-c67f-e102-470c-4162ce7c045a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_General_State_WentToMoonriseBeforeCreche = True
#.      - GLO_Ketheric_State_Dead = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:606a79e3-c67f-e102-470c-4162ce7c045a
msgctxt "h52fdb4e5gb7d9g44d8gb7f0g3042230ab6e2"
msgid ""
"<i>Give your observations of the tadpoled Absolutists in Moonrise Towers.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 6149d3ed-b9d2-31be-c314-be1207dc4251
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:6149d3ed-b9d2-31be-c314-be1207dc4251
msgctxt "h9fe55e5dgf922g4955g88d5gcba93b635ef7"
msgid ""
"I suspected as much. Though I am <i>fascinated</i> that you've retained the "
"ability to lie about it."
msgstr "그런 것 같았다. 그보다 네가 아직 거짓말을 할 수 있는 상태라는 게 <i>흥미롭구나</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 6257c923-2ad1-266b-0e68-b58d6ce32dee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:6257c923-2ad1-266b-0e68-b58d6ce32dee
msgctxt "h1e7532dcg9f6ag44faga3f3g091b990aff94"
msgid "I see you have some knowledge of the process."
msgstr "변이 과정에 대해 조금 알고 있나 보군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 63abde09-658d-9568-2660-66274e7687af
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:63abde09-658d-9568-2660-66274e7687af
msgctxt "h12827bc6gafe4g4efag921egd70fec920fa0"
msgid ""
"Your assumption is correct. My experiments have been vital in supporting our "
"queen's efforts against the <i>ghaik</i>."
msgstr ""
"네 추정은 정확하다. 내 실험은 우리 여왕님께서 <i>게이크</i>에 맞서 싸우시는 걸 보조 하는 데 필수적인 역할을 맡아왔으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 67ee431e-6013-5047-907f-7eca6e6e21c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:67ee431e-6013-5047-907f-7eca6e6e21c9
msgctxt "hfe89c129g3a97g45afgbb18gcb7b29e9dbb1"
msgid "Let's see what knowledge your labours have borne so far."
msgstr "지금까지의 네 노력이 어떤 지식을 낳았는지 보자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 685db05c-c509-57cb-f648-5885cc617667
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(1) = False
#.   User:
#.      - CRE_GithInfirmary_Knows_FamiliarWithZaithisk(1) = False
#. TagRule: !REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:685db05c-c509-57cb-f648-5885cc617667
msgctxt "hcad2ed9fg890fg494fg9d1cge6c38b96c0bf"
msgid "And the <i>zaith'isk</i> is?"
msgstr "그 <i>제이트이스크</i> 라는 건?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 685db05c-c509-57cb-f648-5885cc617667
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(1) = False
#.   User:
#.      - CRE_GithInfirmary_Knows_FamiliarWithZaithisk(1) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:685db05c-c509-57cb-f648-5885cc617667
msgctxt "h38daa623g32a6g4367g980dg18a715cf8a09"
msgid "I'm not familiar with the term. What's a <i>zaith'isk?</i>"
msgstr "익숙하지 않은 단어군. <i>제이트이스크</i>가 뭐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 693b5100-ae8d-7d91-54ee-c1abd938e3b6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_DoctorWaitsAtDevice = True
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_DoctorIsExpectingCharacter(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:693b5100-ae8d-7d91-54ee-c1abd938e3b6
msgctxt "h72ef681ege63eg4747gb000geba5056616e9"
msgid "Lie down on the <i>zaith'isk</i>, and your troubles will be over."
msgstr "<i>제이트이스크</i> 위에 누워라, 네 문제를 해결해 줄테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6ab8743e-5958-309c-2ac9-9f6de7cb15cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:6ab8743e-5958-309c-2ac9-9f6de7cb15cc
msgctxt "hc0d010bdg643ag4eb1g8e08ga3066c79d25c"
msgid "What are you hoping to learn from dissecting that thing?"
msgstr "저걸 해부해서 뭘 알아내고 싶은 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 6cdac59a-e4dd-ba02-86e7-e9ebd58164ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:6cdac59a-e4dd-ba02-86e7-e9ebd58164ae
msgctxt "hb11ac970g9c1fg4158ga025ge9ece0c38937"
msgid ""
"You appear to have <i>somatic</i> knowledge of the process, and yet you "
"remain in possession of your cerebral faculties."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6d300923-c5da-9897-6f05-4c2a4fe30e7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_ToldDoctorAboutTadpoles(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:6d300923-c5da-9897-6f05-4c2a4fe30e7e
msgctxt "he5b12377g7270g4eafg8e41g509fb6f6f820"
msgid "I am Lae'zel of K'liir. I come to be purified."
msgstr "나는 클리르의 레이젤이다. 정화를 위해 왔다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 6f311b91-eb4e-8105-40bb-693fd7205b2a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !BARD
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:6f311b91-eb4e-8105-40bb-693fd7205b2a
msgctxt "hee5a900eg7a5ag4123g8036g2b0709c597fe"
msgid "Incredible."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 6f311b91-eb4e-8105-40bb-693fd7205b2a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: BARD
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:6f311b91-eb4e-8105-40bb-693fd7205b2a
msgctxt "h624488f6g425dg4e70gbef5g11d4f8b0b502"
msgid "What a bizarre display. And yet, surprisingly accurate."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6fb503f0-f45d-a944-a4d3-3e64f5fd34a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:6fb503f0-f45d-a944-a4d3-3e64f5fd34a8
msgctxt "h63ac8348g6f7ag4236gb66fg829c3441ae42"
msgid "Merely curious. You seem an expert on the subject."
msgstr "그냥 호기심이야. 당신은 이 분야 전문가처럼 보이니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 714130ca-1e29-be7f-fd63-19508bd0a5b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_UsedDeviceBeforeSpeakingToDoctor(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:714130ca-1e29-be7f-fd63-19508bd0a5b8
msgctxt "h21fed26fga1d0g45a3gb5f4g7ea137d9b7ef"
msgid "What does the <i>zaith'isk</i> do?"
msgstr "이 <i>제이트이스크</i>라는 건 뭘 하는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 72f770b6-655f-4d58-747f-6a9e01b0ce22
#. HandlePath = RollAdvantageReason
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Knows_CeremorphosisProcess = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:72f770b6-655f-4d58-747f-6a9e01b0ce22
msgctxt "h3aaed441ga2ecg499aga628gc62982ae6d90"
msgid "CLASS"
msgstr "클래스"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 72f770b6-655f-4d58-747f-6a9e01b0ce22
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Knows_CeremorphosisProcess = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:72f770b6-655f-4d58-747f-6a9e01b0ce22
msgctxt "h6840a9fcg633bg4333gae00gb34a0539880b"
msgid "<i>Relate your 'findings'. Use lots of long, complicated words.</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신의 '발견'을 설명한다. 길고 복잡한 어휘를 사용한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 74437163-2a1d-4650-595a-2206036d9653
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:74437163-2a1d-4650-595a-2206036d9653
msgctxt "h3cda9c23g9174g461eg9bf4g54dfa3639b5a"
msgid ""
"If this friend is kin, their cowardice does little to earn my assistance."
msgstr "네가 말하는 그 동료가 동족이라면, 그 비겁함 때문에 도와줄 수 없겠는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 75532b77-f345-c416-a273-ffa1518202be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:75532b77-f345-c416-a273-ffa1518202be
msgctxt "h4bcc221cg50a7g4190ga92eg015940d5b68f"
msgid ""
"Your knowledge betrays a closer experience than you let on. You're infected."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 7779e157-b9a7-f2ef-1353-9053c2491f9e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:7779e157-b9a7-f2ef-1353-9053c2491f9e
msgctxt "h6b8e945ag7969g4ba0g9a63g18186afed8f5"
msgid ""
"Very good - you've grasped the basic definition. If I ever misplace my "
"dictionary, I'll know who to ask."
msgstr "훌륭하군, 기본적인 정의는 알고 있어. 사전이 없을 때 대신 물어봐도 되겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 7b282386-6f07-d683-d174-f8050e3a48dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:7b282386-6f07-d683-d174-f8050e3a48dd
msgctxt "hf8c2ef20g9b51g4546gbecfg77af2dc8ddfc"
msgid ""
"Only a powerful magic would be able to maintain such a stasis, but the "
"Absolutists we've encountered showed no such ability."
msgstr "강력한 마법만이 그런 정지장을 유지할 수 있다. 하지만 우리가 만난 절대자 신도들에겐 그럴 만한 능력이 없었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 7ec05a0b-e33b-37e0-a0a6-0a01d9cfedc0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_PretendedCurious(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:7ec05a0b-e33b-37e0-a0a6-0a01d9cfedc0
msgctxt "ha0c8d48egbddcg46ebgb2b7g5943565af886"
msgid "A shame. I had hopes for you, <i>istik</i>."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 804dcc36-c826-a77a-51dd-691d81dec755
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:804dcc36-c826-a77a-51dd-691d81dec755
msgctxt "hcd9820cfg5fcbg4facgabfcgb13fca6636af"
msgid "They won't stay that way."
msgstr "곧 괜찮지 않게 될걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 890ad61b-1dc8-9a5e-5013-1906a4af7583
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:890ad61b-1dc8-9a5e-5013-1906a4af7583
msgctxt "h555871ecg471ag4b92ga3a7gb8d97ca5c802"
msgid "Tell me, how long has your friend been infected?"
msgstr "그래, 네 친구가 감염된 지 얼마나 됐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 893775e3-34cb-2f6c-83d9-9f2ec26346d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_DoctorWaitsAtDevice = True
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_DoctorIsExpectingCharacter(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:893775e3-34cb-2f6c-83d9-9f2ec26346d5
msgctxt "h09a127aag3c15g41f1gafccg4cfdcd5cea1b"
msgid "Your gratitude is unnecessary. The procedure brings its own rewards."
msgstr "감사는 필요 없다. 이 수술은 보상을 가져오니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 8d2a9c48-9fea-f8f5-f1d4-b9e0cf493fc5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:8d2a9c48-9fea-f8f5-f1d4-b9e0cf493fc5
msgctxt "h21b12f66g311bg47b8ga6fag04993b2eb06d"
msgid ""
"<i>Chk.</i> I have no desire to teach, though your request is understandable."
msgstr "<i>츠크.</i> 네 요청은 이해되지만, 가르치고 싶은 마음은 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8e7ce56e-a64f-b971-77ca-ab1e44fd9577
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_GithInfirmary_Knows_CrecheHasDoctor = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_ToldDoctorAboutTadpoles(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:8e7ce56e-a64f-b971-77ca-ab1e44fd9577
msgctxt "he90eaf53gf3e4g40dbg9715g59498895e039"
msgid ""
"Are you the <i>ghustil</i>? I've been infected and require purification."
msgstr "당신이 <i>거스틸</i>인가? 올챙이에 감염됐기 때문에 정화가 필요하다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 8f545c04-6523-13b2-55ec-20e6bef0decf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:8f545c04-6523-13b2-55ec-20e6bef0decf
msgctxt "h3cbfc627g06e3g4d60ga903g904e9023d038"
msgid "True curiosity does not demand answers - it finds them for itself."
msgstr "진정한 호기심은 정답을 필요로 하지 않는다. 스스로 그 답을 찾아가지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 8ffb07c1-b928-ace6-db87-d12506b9e304
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:8ffb07c1-b928-ace6-db87-d12506b9e304
msgctxt "h2182b292gfcfbg4a0egb953g3999c6327b66"
msgid ""
"<i>Chk. </i>If you aren't here for treatment, then get out of my infirmary."
msgstr "<i>츠크.</i> 치료를 위해 온 게 아니라면, 내 의무실에서 나가라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 8ffd3601-b213-74ff-aed6-784be0aefc6e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:8ffd3601-b213-74ff-aed6-784be0aefc6e
msgctxt "h9d049aadg73d4g4648g8d9bg77b817b76a55"
msgid ""
"Hmm. A sign that your cognitive abilities are not so robust as they appear."
msgstr "흠. 너의 인지 기능이 네 겉모습만큼 튼튼하지 않다는 징후로군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 91607b45-43f2-04f5-5431-335371c30359
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_GithInfirmary_HasMet_Doctor(1) = False
#.   Local:
#.      - 01b57839-a171-8a20-62bf-1d4465732b5a_DrConvincedAboutFriend = False
#.   Object:
#.      - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_UsedDeviceBeforeSpeakingToDoctor(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_HasMet_Doctor(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_Knows_DiscoveredZaithisk = True
#.   User:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_Knows_FamiliarWithZaithisk(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:91607b45-43f2-04f5-5431-335371c30359
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hc84aa7fbgb5b4g47aagb191ga50e0c873999"
msgid "You were interested in the <i>zaith'isk</i>."
msgstr "<i>제이트이스크</i>에 관심이 있군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 92bf838c-9bb0-29b5-c656-f7637723f366
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:92bf838c-9bb0-29b5-c656-f7637723f366
msgctxt "h07d8b53eg9178g4766gb8d1ge3fea921922f"
msgid ""
"Every fibre, every sinew of your being is torn apart and reformed into the "
"repugnant flesh of a <i>ghaik</i>, or 'illithid'. <i>That </i>is "
"ceremorphosis."
msgstr ""
"네 몸의 모든 조직, 모든 힘줄이 갈가리 찢겨져 <i>게이크</i>, '일리시드'의 혐오스러운 살덩어리로 재구성될 것이야. <i>이것이</"
"i> 뇌변이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 92e096f3-e4b7-c1ef-d32c-5663ae8f9d69
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:92e096f3-e4b7-c1ef-d32c-5663ae8f9d69
msgctxt "h001ead64g9497g45c9g9176gf389ce24eb2e"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 9396e3b2-e372-4224-d2c7-49a335facf64
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:9396e3b2-e372-4224-d2c7-49a335facf64
msgctxt "h3ce0a355g433ag4587gbafbg612d7ea9275b"
msgid "Why do you want to know?"
msgstr "왜 알고 싶어하는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 9397b9b0-974e-bc2e-1822-6e37d2e87da0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:9397b9b0-974e-bc2e-1822-6e37d2e87da0
msgctxt "h41787ae5gcdb5g4d15g8c94g61c915c03fe2"
msgid ""
"You are infected, but showing no signs of cerebral impairment? "
"<i>Fascinating.</i>"
msgstr "감염이 됐는데, 어떤 지능 손상 징후도 보이지 않는다? <i>몹시 흥미롭군.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 93dbfa4b-f4ba-1636-a7c6-0204f07a8ceb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:93dbfa4b-f4ba-1636-a7c6-0204f07a8ceb
msgctxt "h8a744b7fg8c07g41cfgb39dg8186106e242d"
msgid "You <i>are</i> a unique specimen. All right, my curiosity is piqued."
msgstr "<i>넌</i> 특별한 견본이지. 좋아, 내 호기심을 불쾌하게 하는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 97520973-4758-0335-1332-485028b8738e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_DoctorWaitsAtDevice = True
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_DoctorIsExpectingCharacter(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:97520973-4758-0335-1332-485028b8738e
msgctxt "h30fa8a3fg9264g432fgbfb0g16489cc97d3b"
msgid "It will be worth it. I assure you."
msgstr "그만한 가치가 있을 거야. 내가 보증하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 9837ec94-7ef6-0981-f68b-9fd87f32bd12
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_GithInfirmary_HasMet_Doctor(1) = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 01b57839-a171-8a20-62bf-1d4465732b5a_DrConvincedAboutFriend = False
#.   Object:
#.      - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_PretendedCurious(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:9837ec94-7ef6-0981-f68b-9fd87f32bd12
msgctxt "hc6bf0db4ga84cg41d5gbb7bgab24f4477d11"
msgid "Yes, what is it?"
msgstr "그래, 무슨 일이지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 98602526-dbde-42a8-923b-3ae00a3731a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_PretendedCurious(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:98602526-dbde-42a8-923b-3ae00a3731a9
msgctxt "h2986e380g7667g4b8fg96cdga22b566c54b0"
msgid "Come back when you've worked these <i>airs </i>out of your system. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 996cce22-c2da-641f-b7a4-cadb3286e5df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:996cce22-c2da-641f-b7a4-cadb3286e5df
msgctxt "h6a682fbfgba20g4811gbef5geb93381b1bf8"
msgid "My friend is infected - I'm looking for a way to help them."
msgstr "내 친구가 감염되었어 - 돕기 위한 방법을 찾고 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9a7c1e57-ceed-4e71-ff98-7821c9c0bd05
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:9a7c1e57-ceed-4e71-ff98-7821c9c0bd05
msgctxt "h72174065g5ab1g4917g9c29g31a0aee1f87f"
msgid "<i>Stare blankly at her.</i>"
msgstr "<i>초점 없는 눈으로 그녀를 바라본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 9b51d013-f7dd-2bb9-34d3-971fdafc5b73
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_UsedDeviceBeforeSpeakingToDoctor(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 01b57839-a171-8a20-62bf-1d4465732b5a_DrConvincedAboutFriend = True
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_TriedFriendProblem(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:9b51d013-f7dd-2bb9-34d3-971fdafc5b73
msgctxt "h5ed3e011g3833g4ac8g81d7g128ae28fe60e"
msgid ""
"Bring them here, and you'll have a live demonstration of what the "
"<i>zaith'isk </i>can do."
msgstr "동료를 데려와, 그럼 <i>제이트이스크</i>가 뭘 할 수 있는지 생생한 시연으로 볼 수 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 9bc7f9f3-74a3-f699-93cb-14654236b980
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor_LaezelInclusion1 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:9bc7f9f3-74a3-f699-93cb-14654236b980
msgctxt "hcb602ea4gc679g4765gaf65gdfe6c613f055"
msgid "Well then?"
msgstr "그래서?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 9e384af6-83d7-008e-70c8-4079faa28b8e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_UsedDeviceBeforeSpeakingToDoctor(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 01b57839-a171-8a20-62bf-1d4465732b5a_DrConvincedAboutFriend = True
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_TriedFriendProblem(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:9e384af6-83d7-008e-70c8-4079faa28b8e
msgctxt "h8150ef21g91c6g4734g8088g3b29fc74d22f"
msgid "Bring them here for purification. I will be waiting."
msgstr "동료를 정화 해야 하니 여기로 데려와라. 여기서 기다리고 있겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9ed3f741-0933-0ae1-01af-2f55a0337052
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_ToldDoctorAboutTadpoles(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:9ed3f741-0933-0ae1-01af-2f55a0337052
msgctxt "h726d933cge422g4297g9da2g9b4110f03c79"
msgid "I'm not infected. I'm asking for a friend."
msgstr "내가 감염된 게 아냐. 내 동료를 위해 묻고 있는 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a0793af7-467a-7d3e-1252-7065ef9931bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:a0793af7-467a-7d3e-1252-7065ef9931bb
msgctxt "hedf74929gd725g4360g9dfcg3f9294d57f25"
msgid "It was me all along - I'm the one who's infected."
msgstr "처음부터 다 내 얘기였어. 감염된 건 나야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a1eabf8a-61ea-d89e-4f5b-05212ce40ed6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_PretendedCurious(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:a1eabf8a-61ea-d89e-4f5b-05212ce40ed6
msgctxt "h15311bd6g7a94g4f52ga192gd460f70b386d"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = a63cdc6e-5b7e-e886-69af-062135c8ebee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:a63cdc6e-5b7e-e886-69af-062135c8ebee
msgctxt "h3150196eg6d15g4b86gb1dag6196562b8de2"
msgid "So, they are gathering. And in a state of suspended ceremorphosis."
msgstr "그러니까, 놈들은 집결하고 있다는 게로군. 뇌변이가 유예된 채로 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aa624693-9d71-8f9e-83a3-e6ac7dbaf675
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:aa624693-9d71-8f9e-83a3-e6ac7dbaf675
msgctxt "h1941d7d3gba86g40e7g92dfgeb940108b006"
msgid "Is that thing's host still alive?"
msgstr "그 올챙이의 숙주는 아직 살아있는 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = b14d52f8-82af-fdd5-bc3d-94ba50eb350e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:b14d52f8-82af-fdd5-bc3d-94ba50eb350e
msgctxt "hdfc7dfd6g245dg47a5ga7f5g11bb8252da95"
msgid "You must be desperate, to seek my aid."
msgstr "내 도움을 찾을 정도라니. 어지간히도 절박한가 보군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b77d1d97-dc45-2a86-1c5d-64d373d32f0f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:b77d1d97-dc45-2a86-1c5d-64d373d32f0f
msgctxt "h22cc8e43ga7b3g4da9gb057g511a433cdd54"
msgid "Yes, can you help me get rid of it?"
msgstr "맞아, 올챙이를 없애줄 수 있어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = b9963abe-dec8-8d63-cd0a-f36a7b77b66a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:b9963abe-dec8-8d63-cd0a-f36a7b77b66a
msgctxt "h5d89e160gaa94g4110g90fcgdaf97dc85b93"
msgid ""
"The specifics are... complicated. It is not a comfortable process, but a "
"necessary one."
msgstr "구체적인 사항은... 복잡하다. 쾌적하진 않지만, 필요한 절차다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = b99f6e39-a4f4-47be-9ab7-a2bcb1a2ea24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor_LaezelInclusion1 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:b99f6e39-a4f4-47be-9ab7-a2bcb1a2ea24
msgctxt "h71aa552ag4059g482dgb726g3b82ef380cd3"
msgid "Go on. You know what we require."
msgstr "말 해. 우리한테 뭐가 필요한지 알잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = bb67aa36-bade-6c8f-3f81-dfb5c39f0890
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_DoctorWaitsAtDevice = True
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_DoctorIsExpectingCharacter(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:bb67aa36-bade-6c8f-3f81-dfb5c39f0890
msgctxt "ha063728bga548g470cga097g6d91ce7c8b6f"
msgid ""
"The apparatus at the top of those stairs. Quickly now - time is of the "
"essence."
msgstr "저 계단 위에 있는 장치다. 서둘러, 시간을 지체해서는 안 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bc9e8b08-e6db-04e7-3ab0-e7f9c899212e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:bc9e8b08-e6db-04e7-3ab0-e7f9c899212e
msgctxt "h78efe829g301ag41ffga066g0a79c0112dda"
msgid "Fine. I'll leave you to it then."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = bcd948e4-2757-42b5-9861-aae489423d56
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_PretendedCurious(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:bcd948e4-2757-42b5-9861-aae489423d56
msgctxt "h5d5cd3c8g601eg48fag9ed7g27ce95d2dcb5"
msgid ""
"To be expected. We each have our weapons to wield. Some are sharper than "
"others. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = bd09fc8c-4370-82ad-4ad1-cfb6564902d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_GithInfirmary_HasMet_Doctor(1) = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 01b57839-a171-8a20-62bf-1d4465732b5a_DrConvincedAboutFriend = False
#.   Object:
#.      - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_PretendedCurious(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:bd09fc8c-4370-82ad-4ad1-cfb6564902d7
msgctxt "h52906518gb9b9g4c96gb927gd06b445463fd"
msgid "Must you keep bothering me? If you have questions, read a book."
msgstr "계속 날 방해해야 겠나? 질문이 있다면, 책을 읽도록."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = bde476cf-2e4f-5cb8-8058-7f01d0bf6086
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:bde476cf-2e4f-5cb8-8058-7f01d0bf6086
msgctxt "h80fa1c11g34d9g4b47g8bcdg84bbafa93aea"
msgid ""
"The tadpole is a parasite. Once it consumes enough of your brain matter, it "
"instigates an excruciating transformation."
msgstr "이 올챙이는 기생충이다. 녀석이 네 뇌를 충분히 섭취하게 되면, 아주 끔찍한 변이를 촉발하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c0d33f05-f38f-1ea0-da83-2a0804306a4b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_UsedDeviceBeforeSpeakingToDoctor(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:c0d33f05-f38f-1ea0-da83-2a0804306a4b
msgctxt "h422e6849g65d2g4584g9f6agcb86f5e02ff6"
msgid "Is that machine a <i>zaith'isk</i>? Is it operational?"
msgstr "저 기계가 <i>제이트이스크</i>인가? 작동하는 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c19e5e58-a4c7-5502-55ae-c70deb32f4e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_GithInfirmary_Knows_CrecheHasDoctor = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:c19e5e58-a4c7-5502-55ae-c70deb32f4e2
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hfb40a4dcga204g4367g9962g9e964952f4d5"
msgid ""
"I've been told someone here knows how to remove tadpoles. I'm guessing "
"that's you."
msgstr "여기 있는 사람이 올챙이를 제거하는 법을 알고 있다는 얘기를 들었어. 그게 당신인 거 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c2251630-5f7f-2297-fcd0-634efbdbac96
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_UsedDeviceBeforeSpeakingToDoctor(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:c2251630-5f7f-2297-fcd0-634efbdbac96
msgctxt "h4ceca40aga219g4334gad51gcc994ca6891d"
msgid "Is your <i>zaith'isk</i> operational?"
msgstr "네 <i>제이트이스크</i>는 작동하는 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c284ab70-569c-34c3-995c-c69da7eba7e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_ToldDoctorAboutTadpoles(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:c284ab70-569c-34c3-995c-c69da7eba7e3
msgctxt "h8d21cb38g6480g446egbfb5g8d32c9ac4d59"
msgid ""
"Longer than you'd expect ceremorphosis to take. And with none of the "
"symptoms."
msgstr "원래라면 뇌변이가 일어났을 시간은 지났어. 어떤 증상도 없었고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = c294aea0-aca6-1912-463b-5620f2409463
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:c294aea0-aca6-1912-463b-5620f2409463
msgctxt "h3b47bb85ge176g4c70ga225g358bdc38ed79"
msgid ""
"Still, I would not withhold aid if it furthers our collective efforts "
"against the <i>ghaik</i>."
msgstr "하지만, <i>게이크</i>에 맞서는 우리 공동체의 노력을 발전시킨다면 마다할 이유가 없겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = c7514d0d-6605-7bc5-27d9-9ff775e4670f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:c7514d0d-6605-7bc5-27d9-9ff775e4670f
msgctxt "h84cc2306gb89fg4f2cg9851g95044655e001"
msgid ""
"I'm analysing changes in the worm's digestive tract following consumption of "
"cerebral matter."
msgstr "회백질 소모를 추적해 이 벌레의 소화계가 어떻게 변화하는지 분석하는 중이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c8057edf-7544-57ad-b0e9-5599d282b566
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Knows_CeremorphosisProcess = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:c8057edf-7544-57ad-b0e9-5599d282b566
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hc4ec1482g6eeag4730gbcc4gd9bc6fce977e"
msgid ""
"It's the seven day process by which an illithid tadpole eats away the host's "
"brain and takes control of its body."
msgstr "일리시드 올챙이가 숙주의 뇌를 먹어 치우고 신체의 통제권을 가져가는 이레간의 과정이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = cbb0a8d3-ccfd-a6f5-ab66-49de46438aae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:cbb0a8d3-ccfd-a6f5-ab66-49de46438aae
msgctxt "hf69a3591g6317g4244g8308g2999c99ace0e"
msgid ""
"A very <i>specific </i>question, one that speaks of a more <i>personal</i> "
"motivation for asking."
msgstr "굉장히 <i>구체적인</i> 질문이군, 질문에 보다 <i>개인적인</i> 동기가 있다는 걸 말해주는 걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cdd2fddb-6390-7e33-3746-4eaa07de4d39
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:cdd2fddb-6390-7e33-3746-4eaa07de4d39
msgctxt "h5ce27dccge1acg4fd8g9073g9312d3bf0f38"
msgid "I have waited long for this."
msgstr "이걸 고대해 왔다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = ce957a7f-1cbf-6b10-2658-c349114122fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_DoctorWaitsAtDevice = True
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_DoctorIsExpectingCharacter(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:ce957a7f-1cbf-6b10-2658-c349114122fc
msgctxt "h69d1884cg1b86g404cg8251gf0890bebc94a"
msgid ""
"Is that so? Then of course, you will be treated first. Lie down when you're "
"ready."
msgstr "그런가? 그럼 당연히, 널 먼저 치료해주지. 준비되면 눕도록 해라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = cfc6b3f6-e527-cb1c-4e62-f148bbb4f016
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 01b57839-a171-8a20-62bf-1d4465732b5a_DrConvincedAboutFriend = True
#.   Object:
#.      - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_TriedFriendProblem(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:cfc6b3f6-e527-cb1c-4e62-f148bbb4f016
msgctxt "h3ee87c0dg1afeg49c1gb579gb46fac13dfa7"
msgid "Have you brought your friend?"
msgstr "네 친구를 데려왔나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = cfe7878d-2ffc-8b2a-f309-2349506e1cb5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_PretendedCurious(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:cfe7878d-2ffc-8b2a-f309-2349506e1cb5
msgctxt "h644307e3gc840g4bd2gb422g12a2ba244c1b"
msgid ""
"Now go, continue your education elsewhere. You've delayed my work long "
"enough."
msgstr "이제 가서 공부나 해라. 내 연구는 충분히 방해 했으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = d163d9e1-4cf2-4821-32a3-9e6ef9f0d7b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:d163d9e1-4cf2-4821-32a3-9e6ef9f0d7b2
msgctxt "h47e36f53g9942g4588g9374g32585dd07d51"
msgid ""
"Though - you are like nothing I've seen before. You remain lucid, when you "
"should have succumbed."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
