msgctxt "he151a6c9gea40g4d8dgafa0g536a3923eef0"
msgid "I've got a tadpole of my own. I was hoping you could remove it."
msgstr "내 몸에 올챙이가 있어. 당신이 이 올챙이를 제거해 줬으면 한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
