msgctxt "h2349217agaa00g4f0bg9c7fg0ecce01c0db3"
msgid "I require your assistance in removing a tadpole."
msgstr "당신이 올챙이 제거를 도와주길 요청한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = d277d5d9-5289-e8af-182b-5cd709ba2375
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:d277d5d9-5289-e8af-182b-5cd709ba2375
msgctxt "h4651070ege05bg4bcdga45dgc2197a671293"
msgid "Tell me, how long have you been infected?"
msgstr "그래, 감염된 지 얼마나 됐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = d3233f96-d03e-3467-b20d-43247281eb67
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:d3233f96-d03e-3467-b20d-43247281eb67
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h045a5840gb393g4a19gadc3g99835c5fd3c8"
msgid "Nothing your kind is capable of understanding."
msgstr "너희 족속은 아예 이해할 수 없는 것."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = d4e50aef-b6a2-4668-788b-7708e07ff882
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_GithInfirmary_HasMet_Doctor(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_DeviceExplodedWithDoctorInRoom = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:d4e50aef-b6a2-4668-788b-7708e07ff882
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h3be75bc5g798dg4e0bg93f9gd8a740297f68"
msgid "Your presence is not welcome here, <i>k'chakhi</i>."
msgstr "넌 반가운 존재가 아니다, <i>크차키</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d4fa9c04-b7ef-7d3e-69de-44d300a2f6ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:d4fa9c04-b7ef-7d3e-69de-44d300a2f6ac
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h2a18e507g717eg43d9g8c2aga0e66dae65e7"
msgid "What do you hope to gain from dissecting the <i>ghaik</i> spawn?"
msgstr "<i>게이크</i> 새끼를 해부해서 뭘 얻으려는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d75f2feb-03f4-e651-e5dd-8e3cff63c9eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:d75f2feb-03f4-e651-e5dd-8e3cff63c9eb
msgctxt "hb49f7b13g7c02g4874gbb38g8d8558f59f47"
msgid "I shouldn't have said anything. It's not my place."
msgstr "입 다물고 있을걸... 내가 끄집어낼 주제가 아니었는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = d85b2a72-6656-b6f2-394d-e9b025118701
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:d85b2a72-6656-b6f2-394d-e9b025118701
msgctxt "h5cd2b5f2g7afcg4775ga9d9gdc373a586def"
msgid ""
"Few of our kin understand that wars can be fought with science, as well as "
"swords."
msgstr "소수의 동족만이 전쟁에선 검 뿐만 아니라 과학으로도 싸울 수 있다는 걸 이해하곤 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = d92fa3c1-ce73-fddc-14dd-7e31b5ed287d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor_LaezelInclusion1 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:d92fa3c1-ce73-fddc-14dd-7e31b5ed287d
msgctxt "hd2fe1476g74ffg4eebga07dg6bb79c15d8cb"
msgid ""
"Perhaps, perhaps not. Let the <i>istik </i>with you speak, and I will decide "
"what respect you are owed."
msgstr ""
"그래야 할 수도 있고, 아닐 수도 있지. 네 옆의 <i>이스틱</i>이 말하게 두어라. 그러고 나서 네가 내 존중을 받을만한지 아닌지 "
"결정하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = daf7cb46-2721-a7eb-b8e6-3e8559fa4608
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_PretendedCurious(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:daf7cb46-2721-a7eb-b8e6-3e8559fa4608
msgctxt "hb1ccda9bgbeb3g40a5g9509gcf2c50662692"
msgid ""
"If it's an education you seek, go to the training room. I'm sure the "
"<i>sa'varsh</i> will be happy to oblige."
msgstr "네가 찾는 게 교육이라면, 훈련실로 가라. <i>사바쉬</i>는 기꺼이 부탁을 들어줄 게다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = dcabac2f-449a-43cd-8131-06e45174e04b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:dcabac2f-449a-43cd-8131-06e45174e04b
msgctxt "h291eb593gdaeeg46dag8ad4g353f098d090e"
msgid "Well you certainly have a flair for <i>something</i>."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dd1895d9-68ee-5e1b-fc58-fa70f2f8242d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
