msgctxt "h35a44365gd3a1g4bb8ga21eg8a9f70f9005b"
msgid ""
"<i>Mime every disgusting stage of transformation into a mind flayer.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ddc36bba-905a-58ad-87ec-8fd97244591b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_GithInfirmary_Knows_CrecheHasDoctor = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_ToldDoctorAboutTadpoles(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:ddc36bba-905a-58ad-87ec-8fd97244591b
msgctxt "h1903fb71g1f6bg4e40ga176g708a2df665ae"
msgid "I've got a tadpole needs removing. Can you help me?"
msgstr "내 몸의 올챙이를 제거해야 돼. 도와줄 수 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = dee1f7e0-9f8f-33f9-bc1a-af78a5c66fb8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:dee1f7e0-9f8f-33f9-bc1a-af78a5c66fb8
msgctxt "h47368674g7e15g41c4g8dd3gcde1d16c85e0"
msgid "The better question is - what brings an <i>istik</i>  to my infirmary?"
msgstr "더 적절한 질문은 이거야. 왜 <i>이스틱</i>이 내 의무실에 온 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e02b5d46-9fd0-b55f-cc4d-4a4c85ec17f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:e02b5d46-9fd0-b55f-cc4d-4a4c85ec17f0
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hccd2b963gd0fcg4f3fg8919g17c1542e9ebd"
msgid "What will the <i>zaith'isk </i>do to them?"
msgstr "<i>제이트이스크</i>가 그들에게 뭘 하는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = e04b28e1-821c-0131-bb92-1f9a21670288
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:e04b28e1-821c-0131-bb92-1f9a21670288
msgctxt "h58337772g952bg4c99g8c08g220d4989568d"
msgid "Cursed is the day that even <i>we</i> become <i>ghaik</i> incubators."
msgstr "<i>우리들</i>마저 <i>게이크</i>의 배양기가 되는 저주 받을 날이 오다니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = e667c459-475d-a1d1-aabc-82a61c6dcf89
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:e667c459-475d-a1d1-aabc-82a61c6dcf89
msgctxt "hbc4965d0gc9edg4207g92c3g182364e80f55"
msgid "You'll be aware then, that your friend is on borrowed time."
msgstr "그럼 너도 알고 있겠군. 네 동료는 시한부나 다름 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e6bbe2c3-1b10-0d6e-1726-c8e27e16c1d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:e6bbe2c3-1b10-0d6e-1726-c8e27e16c1d6
msgctxt "h99133424ge1e5g4537g80d4g551bf2ceb8ae"
msgid "What will the <i>zaith'isk</i> do?"
msgstr "<i>제이트이스크</i>가 무슨 처치를 해주지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ea235c31-7dce-0f27-cdf8-eeacf70483fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:ea235c31-7dce-0f27-cdf8-eeacf70483fb
msgctxt "h0fa18bc6g937cg4d51ga87fg2f4af62e3d0a"
msgid "Please, explain it to me."
msgstr "제발, 설명해줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = ec3b1589-e910-47ac-b742-e46782111512
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:ec3b1589-e910-47ac-b742-e46782111512
msgctxt "h054ff16bg4a37g4914gaf31gf0a0e201dff6"
msgid ""
"We carry <i>ghaik</i> tadpoles, and have done so for countless days - yet we "
"show no symptoms. We must enter the <i>zaith'isk.</i>"
msgstr ""
"우리는 <i>게이크</i> 올챙이에 감염되었고, 그 뒤로 많은 시간이 흘렀지만 어떤 증상도 없다. 반드시 <i>제이트이스크</i>에 "
"들어가야 한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = ecd5d4ed-6562-e98a-942b-2110af148be4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:ecd5d4ed-6562-e98a-942b-2110af148be4
msgctxt "h5cb94ef6g71a4g4dadg91b6g17497105092c"
msgid ""
"So, they were gathering. And somehow doing so in a state of suspended "
"ceremorphosis."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = f5107d57-7ed9-43ad-b5a5-123c8602ac77
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor_LaezelInclusion1 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:f5107d57-7ed9-43ad-b5a5-123c8602ac77
msgctxt "ha7e4a43cg98e6g42aeg8955gf1dd24596960"
msgid ""
"I am a Child of Gith, not discarded rat-flesh. Am I not due your respect?"
msgstr "난 버려진 쥐고기가 아니라, 기스의 아이야. 나를 존중해줘야 되는 것 아닌가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f65f93c5-f8dd-dd54-0927-1d670bc6f98b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. TagRule: !REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:f65f93c5-f8dd-dd54-0927-1d670bc6f98b
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "he269a98dg63a2g4e7dg983cgde86c5d0c2f6"
msgid "I'm simply keen to learn. And you seem a favourable teacher."
msgstr "그냥 배움에 대한 열망이 큰 거야. 넌 좋은 선생처럼 보였고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f65f93c5-f8dd-dd54-0927-1d670bc6f98b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:f65f93c5-f8dd-dd54-0927-1d670bc6f98b
msgctxt "h9e1b37aeg87bdg4acagad7ega58c33f69ef0"
msgid "I've never seen one up close. And you seem a favourable teacher."
msgstr "이렇게 가까이서 본 적이 없거든. 넌 좋은 선생처럼 보였고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f782fb42-72b5-145e-f3f9-7e63a21f1909
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:f782fb42-72b5-145e-f3f9-7e63a21f1909
msgctxt "hbf0b0831ge022g4ae5gbde9g19dec9ffa148"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = f955d9bb-ff22-7482-2a41-e1af4a784d0f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:f955d9bb-ff22-7482-2a41-e1af4a784d0f
msgctxt "h792d2870gaa22g4f0cg9b03ga8bc9bc83067"
msgid ""
"But I've more interest in substance than... whatever it is you're trying to "
"offer me."
msgstr "하지만 난 네가 제안하려는 그 어떤 것 보다... 물질 적인 것에 관심이 드는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fb297b60-1590-f6b0-3d9e-e8d7aca770fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:fb297b60-1590-f6b0-3d9e-e8d7aca770fe
msgctxt "hbc362317g8e72g49f9g84a9g1cf16f163d5d"
msgid "Fine, you want the truth? I'm infected and I'm trying to find a cure."
msgstr "좋아, 진실을 원하나? 난 감염된 상태고 치료할 방법을 찾고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fb297b60-1590-f6b0-3d9e-e8d7aca770fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:fb297b60-1590-f6b0-3d9e-e8d7aca770fe
msgctxt "he4f81fd1g8618g4244ga0e7g19a83db9c7bc"
msgid "<i>Report the details of your own infection, as protocol dictates. </i>"
msgstr "<i>규정에 따라, 당신의 감염에 대해 상세히 보고합니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = fdaae3a4-a9e3-7658-f3aa-a8ff617d6f50
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_Doctor:fdaae3a4-a9e3-7658-f3aa-a8ff617d6f50
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hc529cc7eg6eaeg402fg88bfgda1d4ce709ca"
msgid ""
"Well, whatever matter your skull contains, it clearly isn't cerebral in "
"nature. Ceremorphosis is no threat to you."
msgstr "그래, 네 머리통의 문제가 뭐든 간에, 두뇌의 문제는 아닐 거다. 뇌 변이는 너랑 상관없는 얘기야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_DoctorWaitsAtDevice
#. Speaker = Ghustil Stornugoss
#. NodeID = 76e874dd-7d1f-8576-536d-07349ee882f3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_DoctorWaitsAtDevice:76e874dd-7d1f-8576-536d-07349ee882f3
msgctxt "h405a8f11ge9d5g45fbg8481g98288dc1141f"
msgid "Go on. My time is vital - do not squander it."
msgstr "들어가 봐. 내 시간은 중요하니, 낭비하지 말고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_OffstageArdent_SentToCaptain
#. Speaker = Githyanki
#. NodeID = 3af1f5b7-4f97-4011-b2b7-5d1cd6494b4c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_Infirmary_Hasmet_OffstageArdent(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_Infirmary_Hasmet_OffstageArdent(0) = True
#. TagRule: GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_OffstageArdent_SentToCaptain:3af1f5b7-4f97-4011-b2b7-5d1cd6494b4c
msgctxt "h1db79dd6gcc66g4cd7g8954gb6de576f89d1"
msgid ""
"It seems you've helped to weed out the weak links, kin. The <i>Kith'rak </"
"i>will thank you - you may see her now. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_OffstageArdent_SentToCaptain
#. Speaker = Githyanki
#. NodeID = 3af1f5b7-4f97-4011-b2b7-5d1cd6494b4c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_Infirmary_Hasmet_OffstageArdent(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_Infirmary_Hasmet_OffstageArdent(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_OffstageArdent_SentToCaptain:3af1f5b7-4f97-4011-b2b7-5d1cd6494b4c
msgctxt "h3653b782g7d2cg4883gaefegb2b5420abd4b"
msgid ""
"This mess - this is your doing? Impressive. Our Captain may have use for you "
"- report to her immediately."
msgstr "이 난장판 좀 보게, 다 네가 한 짓인가? 흥미롭군. 우리 대장이 널 필요로 할지도 모르니 당장 그녀에게 보고해봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_OffstageArdent_SentToCaptain
#. Speaker = Githyanki
#. NodeID = 5353c052-a157-85ae-d28d-98eef19ae739
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_Infirmary_Hasmet_OffstageArdent(0) = True
#. TagRule: GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_OffstageArdent_SentToCaptain:5353c052-a157-85ae-d28d-98eef19ae739
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hfc546981ga74fg4ad9g8a13gf9dcb32068d9"
msgid "I am not in the habit of asking twice, kin. The <i>Kith'rak</i>, now."
msgstr "난 두 번 묻는 건 좋아하지 않아, 친구. <i>키스락</i>, 당장."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_OffstageArdent_SentToCaptain
#. Speaker = Githyanki
#. NodeID = 5353c052-a157-85ae-d28d-98eef19ae739
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_Infirmary_Hasmet_OffstageArdent(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_OffstageArdent_SentToCaptain:5353c052-a157-85ae-d28d-98eef19ae739
msgctxt "h22926d84g67bdg46a4gba60g0a08186b34a6"
msgid "I am not in the habit of asking twice, <i>istik</i>. The Captain, now. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_PAD_DoorIsLocked
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c779b734-c04e-45d8-98dd-18ad469948e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_PAD_DoorIsLocked:c779b734-c04e-45d8-98dd-18ad469948e7
msgctxt "ha3ae6685gd2aeg4c6dg89fbg23b25edaed11"
msgid "He locked us in. That... can't be good."
msgstr "놈이 우릴 가뒀어. 이거...안 좋은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_PAD_DoorIsLocked
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c779b734-c04e-45d8-98dd-18ad469948e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_PAD_DoorIsLocked:c779b734-c04e-45d8-98dd-18ad469948e7
msgctxt "hef794363g27d7g4cf1gafeag300d5040b0ea"
msgid "Locked in. That doesn't bode well."
msgstr "잠겼어. 좋지 않은 징조인데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_PAD_DoorIsLocked
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c779b734-c04e-45d8-98dd-18ad469948e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_PAD_DoorIsLocked:c779b734-c04e-45d8-98dd-18ad469948e7
msgctxt "hc6e191d6gbe1bg43abg83bfg02190b5d9817"
msgid "Locked in. Uh oh."
msgstr "잠겼어. 이런."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_PAD_DoorIsLocked
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c779b734-c04e-45d8-98dd-18ad469948e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_PAD_DoorIsLocked:c779b734-c04e-45d8-98dd-18ad469948e7
msgctxt "hc72b18acg2ecfg46a3gaaa6gf9866485dad9"
msgid "Locked, of course."
msgstr "물론 잠겼겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_PAD_DoorIsLocked
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c779b734-c04e-45d8-98dd-18ad469948e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_PAD_DoorIsLocked:c779b734-c04e-45d8-98dd-18ad469948e7
msgctxt "hb10f6aa1ga8e0g49a8g8fbfg22be58f7c0bc"
msgid "It just <i>had</i> to be locked, didn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_PAD_DoorIsLocked
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c779b734-c04e-45d8-98dd-18ad469948e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_PAD_DoorIsLocked:c779b734-c04e-45d8-98dd-18ad469948e7
msgctxt "hb5a3c7dag042ag4760ga45fgbaffce648415"
msgid "Damn it. It can never be easy, can it?"
msgstr "젠장. 항상 쉽게 가는 법이 없어, 좀 쉽게 가면 안돼?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_PAD_DoorIsLocked
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c779b734-c04e-45d8-98dd-18ad469948e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_GithInfirmary_PAD_DoorIsLocked:c779b734-c04e-45d8-98dd-18ad469948e7
msgctxt "hea26d2d7g756eg4df8g9744ga6e3888e16a5"
msgid "Locked in. That's rarely good news."
msgstr "잠겼어. 듣던 중 반가운 소리군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_InfirmaryAmbushGuard01
#. Speaker = Ardent Kur'ashk
#. NodeID = 7e28f764-fb05-4cbc-80fa-f7fe2292d589
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_InfirmaryAmbushGuard01(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_InfirmaryAmbushGuard01:7e28f764-fb05-4cbc-80fa-f7fe2292d589
msgctxt "hb9c41e8eg60e6g4625ga107g22d649d8613a"
msgid ""
"<i>Kith'rak</i> Therezzyn must be on her last chance by now. The <i>ch'r'ai</"
"i> is not normally so lenient."
msgstr "이번이 <i>키스락</i> 테레진의 마지막 기회일 거다. <i>츠라이</i>는 원래 이렇게 관대하지 않다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_InfirmaryAmbushGuard01
#. Speaker = Ardent Kur'ashk
#. NodeID = b6f65328-06bc-4b82-a12d-a9c1a4db4d60
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_InfirmaryAmbushGuard01(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_General_HasMet_InfirmaryAmbushGuard01(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_InfirmaryAmbushGuard01:b6f65328-06bc-4b82-a12d-a9c1a4db4d60
msgctxt "h90f5d4dfgc362g4e84gb784gbede5f89b160"
msgid ""
"Considering this crèche has a <i>kith'rak</i> under inquisition, there's a "
"lot of idle kin here."
msgstr "이 양성소에서 <i>키스락</i>이 심문 중인 걸 감안해도, 여긴 빈둥거리는 동포가 많군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_InfirmaryAmbushGuard01
#. Speaker = Ardent Kur'ashk
#. NodeID = c0ee638d-1863-8f2a-4ebc-d429964d138b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_InfirmaryAmbushGuard01(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_InfirmaryAmbushGuard01:c0ee638d-1863-8f2a-4ebc-d429964d138b
msgctxt "h6a06dd6fg6715g41cbg8bc5g001d9b198491"
msgid ""
"I don't know why you're here, but I know it's not to talk to me, "
"<i>istik</i>."
msgstr "네놈이 왜 여기 있는지 모르겠지만, 적어도 나와 대화하려는 목적은 아니라는 건 안다, <i>이스틱</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_InfirmaryAmbushGuard01
#. Speaker = Ardent Kur'ashk
#. NodeID = def87de3-20a2-443f-4562-2ba617fcd8fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_InfirmaryAmbushGuard01(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_General_HasMet_InfirmaryAmbushGuard01(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_InfirmaryAmbushGuard01:def87de3-20a2-443f-4562-2ba617fcd8fe
msgctxt "h4cb2fa0eg8f4fg4af7g9a13g9b0f88031810"
msgid "That they let outsiders into the crèche sets a bad precedent."
msgstr "양성소에 외부인을 들인 건 나쁜 선례를 만든 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_InfirmaryAmbushGuard02
#. Speaker = Raider Jy'ir
#. NodeID = 014260fd-56a2-26af-926a-392fde556e7f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_InfirmaryAmbushGuard02(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_General_HasMet_InfirmaryAmbushGuard02(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_InfirmaryAmbushGuard02:014260fd-56a2-26af-926a-392fde556e7f
msgctxt "he8d47046gac54g41a5g883eg46db1e826ddb"
msgid "What business have you in a crèche dormitory, <i>istik</i>? Move along."
msgstr "양성소 거주 구역에는 웬일이냐, <i>이스틱</i>. 냉큼 가라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_InfirmaryAmbushGuard02
#. Speaker = Raider Jy'ir
#. NodeID = 067e4370-60f9-44cb-bdd5-ff296f9cc0b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_InfirmaryAmbushGuard02(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_InfirmaryAmbushGuard02:067e4370-60f9-44cb-bdd5-ff296f9cc0b2
msgctxt "h8f9b8bacg0723g45d0g9074g52f680f8966d"
msgid ""
"The trainee<i> yank</i> fight well already. They will make excellent "
"additions to our ranks. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_InfirmaryAmbushGuard02
#. Speaker = Raider Jy'ir
#. NodeID = 3110cd71-2dff-0aad-e186-dc9d5e273404
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_InfirmaryAmbushGuard02(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_InfirmaryAmbushGuard02:3110cd71-2dff-0aad-e186-dc9d5e273404
msgctxt "h160cd88fg5433g42e2ga812gd8645601db58"
msgid "Leave me be, interloper."
msgstr "날 내버려 둬라, 침입자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_InfirmaryAmbushGuard02
#. Speaker = Raider Jy'ir
#. NodeID = abcc0fac-9442-4d07-8a97-e1937b5245f1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_InfirmaryAmbushGuard02(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_General_HasMet_InfirmaryAmbushGuard02(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_InfirmaryAmbushGuard02:abcc0fac-9442-4d07-8a97-e1937b5245f1
msgctxt "ha06330dfg98b2g4ab1gbc53g389c8317acb3"
msgid ""
"If you're looking for the young ones, they are with the <i>sa'varsh</i> in "
"combat drills."
msgstr "어린 녀석들을 찾는다면, 그 녀석들은 <i>사바쉬</i>와 전투 훈련을 하고 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_InfirmaryAmbushGuard03
#. Speaker = Gish Umr'a'ac
#. NodeID = 57dc6d37-b6fc-43aa-98e3-46e01e96d8d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_InfirmaryAmbushGuard03(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_InfirmaryAmbushGuard03:57dc6d37-b6fc-43aa-98e3-46e01e96d8d7
msgctxt "h1af0cacfg9345g4999ga2b3gcdc20b996163"
msgid ""
"Ren'thil was examined in the <i>zaith'isk </i>recently. Haven't seen him "
"since - perhaps he got sent back to scout Moonrise."
msgstr "렌틸은 최근 <i>제이트이스크</i> 진찰받았다. 그 이후로 본 적이... 아마 문라이즈 정찰하러 돌아갔을 테지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_InfirmaryAmbushGuard03
#. Speaker = Gish Umr'a'ac
#. NodeID = a128c0df-5cb9-4539-831e-f8f7928a053c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_InfirmaryAmbushGuard03(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_General_HasMet_InfirmaryAmbushGuard03(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_InfirmaryAmbushGuard03:a128c0df-5cb9-4539-831e-f8f7928a053c
msgctxt "h177ca993g888bg4276g9ffbg55d0a4747875"
msgid ""
"I know the <i>ghustil</i> does necessary work... but does she have to "
"<i>enjoy</i> it so much?"
msgstr "<i>거스틸</i>이 해야 하는 일을 하는 건 알고 있는데... 저렇게까지 <i>즐길</i> 필요가 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_InfirmaryAmbushGuard03
#. Speaker = Gish Umr'a'ac
#. NodeID = bdc4dcc8-73a4-fc9a-a500-706c8f825be7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_InfirmaryAmbushGuard03(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_General_HasMet_InfirmaryAmbushGuard03(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_InfirmaryAmbushGuard03:bdc4dcc8-73a4-fc9a-a500-706c8f825be7
msgctxt "h0adf684cgdbccg41adg85c4gaac5f1b4b8dc"
msgid ""
"<i>Ghustil </i>Stornugoss employs some <i>intensive</i> methods, for a "
"healer."
msgstr "<i>거스틸</i> 스트로누고스는 치유사를 위한, <i>격렬한</i> 방식을 도입했다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_InfirmaryAmbushGuard03
#. Speaker = Gish Umr'a'ac
#. NodeID = becdb77f-8796-d69b-363f-ebca6a3fdaae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_InfirmaryAmbushGuard03(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_InfirmaryAmbushGuard03:becdb77f-8796-d69b-363f-ebca6a3fdaae
msgctxt "h0f1f0a38g0c47g4952gbdb8g160ec8b96ebd"
msgid "Anyone with a <i>ghaik</i> infection should be obliterated at once."
msgstr "<i>게이크</i>에 오염된 자들은 즉시 없애야 한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_InfirmaryAmbushGuard04
#. Speaker = Youth Pyrindath
#. NodeID = 0aa38ee6-31b9-978e-66a7-30b3d2b5bd2f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_InfirmaryAmbushGuard04(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_General_HasMet_InfirmaryAmbushGuard04(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_InfirmaryAmbushGuard04:0aa38ee6-31b9-978e-66a7-30b3d2b5bd2f
msgctxt "h61a21b24gbcfcg4577ga845gb95c79cc5de7"
msgid ""
"If I'm seen speaking with an <i>istik</i>, Captain Therezzyn will never let "
"me join the patrol."
msgstr "<i>이스틱</i>이랑 말한다는 게 알려지면, 테레진 대장님은 절대 나를 순찰대에 넣어주지 않으실 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_InfirmaryAmbushGuard04
#. Speaker = Youth Pyrindath
#. NodeID = 71879844-23fa-4707-ae76-b195743a7364
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_InfirmaryAmbushGuard04(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_InfirmaryAmbushGuard04:71879844-23fa-4707-ae76-b195743a7364
msgctxt "h62366543g6169g48cega82bgf38c3e1a727b"
msgid ""
"So far not one patrol has found the device. But so far not one patrol has "
"had me in it. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_InfirmaryAmbushGuard04
#. Speaker = Youth Pyrindath
#. NodeID = b6e83eb8-aa6b-330f-df09-edf88ab0d98c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_InfirmaryAmbushGuard04(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_InfirmaryAmbushGuard04:b6e83eb8-aa6b-330f-df09-edf88ab0d98c
msgctxt "h03651df5g12eag4ec1gb225ge47cb92eb2fc"
msgid "Leave me alone! I can't afford to be reported to the Captain. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_InfirmaryAmbushGuard04
#. Speaker = Youth Pyrindath
#. NodeID = f78c631a-c753-4b8e-b966-3f32f0d6e942
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_InfirmaryAmbushGuard04(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_General_HasMet_InfirmaryAmbushGuard04(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_InfirmaryAmbushGuard04:f78c631a-c753-4b8e-b966-3f32f0d6e942
msgctxt "h31e99a62g225fg4bb9g873agb1822ba154e6"
msgid "I hope the <i>kith'rak </i>sends me to help find the artefact next."
msgstr "다음번엔 <i>키스락</i>께서 아티팩트 탐색에 증원을 보내주셨으면 좋겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Infirmary_PAD_ScienceComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d47ff3c8-4c7b-4846-8302-241e9ecaeb2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Infirmary_PAD_ScienceComment:d47ff3c8-4c7b-4846-8302-241e9ecaeb2c
msgctxt "h679d75a9g3b64g458ag82c9g29dc1f2fced0"
msgid "Quite the selection of strange little gadgets."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Infirmary_PAD_ScienceComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d47ff3c8-4c7b-4846-8302-241e9ecaeb2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Infirmary_PAD_ScienceComment:d47ff3c8-4c7b-4846-8302-241e9ecaeb2c
msgctxt "h29757dfeg95dfg4706g8f5bg3a3344afde6e"
msgid ""
"Githyanki scholars study <i>ghaik</i> devices closely. They even incorporate "
"their findings into our own machines and magic."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Infirmary_PAD_ScienceComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d47ff3c8-4c7b-4846-8302-241e9ecaeb2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Infirmary_PAD_ScienceComment:d47ff3c8-4c7b-4846-8302-241e9ecaeb2c
msgctxt "hd6386472gc375g48c9gb66egc491a7c2db97"
msgid ""
"A well-equipped laboratory. This is a place for rigorous study, though I "
"hesitate to ask of what."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Infirmary_PAD_ScienceComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d47ff3c8-4c7b-4846-8302-241e9ecaeb2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Infirmary_PAD_ScienceComment:d47ff3c8-4c7b-4846-8302-241e9ecaeb2c
msgctxt "h568583bbg91c6g45e7gbd77gb4587ef1cd9b"
msgid ""
"Gith contraptions. Curious, imagining them wielding something other than "
"weapons."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Infirmary_PAD_ScienceComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d47ff3c8-4c7b-4846-8302-241e9ecaeb2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Infirmary_PAD_ScienceComment:d47ff3c8-4c7b-4846-8302-241e9ecaeb2c
msgctxt "hbfa17766gfc42g4534gb621g20edb914c974"
msgid "Quite the collection. I wonder what all these contraptions even do."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Infirmary_PAD_ScienceComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d47ff3c8-4c7b-4846-8302-241e9ecaeb2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Infirmary_PAD_ScienceComment:d47ff3c8-4c7b-4846-8302-241e9ecaeb2c
msgctxt "hac42ef11g7a9fg4111gbeb5g0c726b2d9bc8"
msgid "Thingies, yokes, <i>and </i>mabobs."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Infirmary_PAD_ScienceComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d47ff3c8-4c7b-4846-8302-241e9ecaeb2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Infirmary_PAD_ScienceComment:d47ff3c8-4c7b-4846-8302-241e9ecaeb2c
msgctxt "h621aa2b4g6947g45cdgbac1gd52d1e12b62e"
msgid ""
"Curious contraptions. More advanced than what I had at my disposal in the "
"Grove."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Infirmary_PAD_ScienceComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d47ff3c8-4c7b-4846-8302-241e9ecaeb2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Infirmary_PAD_ScienceComment:d47ff3c8-4c7b-4846-8302-241e9ecaeb2c
msgctxt "h8042fedcg6689g4dd6gb5e6ge9170d78ace1"
msgid ""
"Githyanki scholars study <i>ghaik</i> devices closely. They even incorporate "
"their findings into our own machines and magic."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Infirmary_PAD_ScienceComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d47ff3c8-4c7b-4846-8302-241e9ecaeb2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Infirmary_PAD_ScienceComment:d47ff3c8-4c7b-4846-8302-241e9ecaeb2c
msgctxt "h06b1f65eg1dd1g4f64g8839g7c84fa4dcbcb"
msgid "Look at all this stuff..."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_IntelligenceOfficer01
#. Speaker = Ardent G'nuril
#. NodeID = 53949e45-a831-9236-1005-cbd59e520877
