#. TagRule: GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_IntelligenceOfficer01:53949e45-a831-9236-1005-cbd59e520877
msgctxt "h7336047bg4068g4ad3gaea1g752095628730"
msgid "If you've something to say, speak to the <i>kith'rak</i>. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_IntelligenceOfficer01
#. Speaker = Ardent G'nuril
#. NodeID = 53949e45-a831-9236-1005-cbd59e520877
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_IntelligenceOfficer01(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_General_HasMet_IntelligenceOfficer01(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_IntelligenceOfficer01:53949e45-a831-9236-1005-cbd59e520877
msgctxt "hb97d2efag979ag4e07ga2e2g3cdc7d892a02"
msgid ""
"I'm not here. Speak to the captain. Let's see how well she handles "
"<i>this</i>."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_IntelligenceOfficer01
#. Speaker = Ardent G'nuril
#. NodeID = 7fa79180-91c6-f6fa-28ab-93bbbb39dac4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_IntelligenceOfficer01(1) = True
#. TagRule: GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_IntelligenceOfficer01:7fa79180-91c6-f6fa-28ab-93bbbb39dac4
msgctxt "h2da0b9c5g7fe7g4a29gb963g126d6fa5eafa"
msgid "Are you deaf? The <i>kith'rak</i> will gain the measure of you. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_IntelligenceOfficer01
#. Speaker = Ardent G'nuril
#. NodeID = 7fa79180-91c6-f6fa-28ab-93bbbb39dac4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_IntelligenceOfficer01(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_IntelligenceOfficer01:7fa79180-91c6-f6fa-28ab-93bbbb39dac4
msgctxt "h7909dc10geb7bg44d4ga6d6g8bd0c839292d"
msgid "If you're not here to help, you're in the way. Move along. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_IntelligenceOfficer02
#. Speaker = Ardent Vraalsith
#. NodeID = a2c43f4d-fc47-4764-ba1a-bf16b6bff81d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_IntelligenceOfficer02(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_General_HasMet_IntelligenceOfficer02(1) = True
#. TagRule: GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_IntelligenceOfficer02:a2c43f4d-fc47-4764-ba1a-bf16b6bff81d
msgctxt "h78ebb71cg21ecg40c8gaca0gcc02cf1b9b48"
msgid ""
"Go quietly, kin. The <i>sa'varsh</i> here<i> </i>does not like to be "
"interrupted."
msgstr "얌전히 떠나라, 동족. <i>이곳의</i> 사바쉬<i></i>는 방해받는 걸 좋아하지 않는다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_IntelligenceOfficer02
#. Speaker = Ardent Vraalsith
#. NodeID = a2c43f4d-fc47-4764-ba1a-bf16b6bff81d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_IntelligenceOfficer02(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_General_HasMet_IntelligenceOfficer02(1) = True
#. TagRule: !GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_IntelligenceOfficer02:a2c43f4d-fc47-4764-ba1a-bf16b6bff81d
msgctxt "hb45482e2g0750g4064gb77bg8d652357f943"
msgid ""
"Unless you want to be set up as target practice, I suggest you leave, "
"<i>istik.</i>"
msgstr "연습용 표적이 되고 싶은 게 아니라면 얌전히 떠나는 걸 제안하지, <i>이스틱.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_IntelligenceOfficer02
#. Speaker = Ardent Vraalsith
#. NodeID = f6374987-5fd1-4d5e-be53-5cffdd9cb0cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_IntelligenceOfficer02(1) = True
#. TagRule: GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_IntelligenceOfficer02:f6374987-5fd1-4d5e-be53-5cffdd9cb0cc
msgctxt "hf7513c96gf199g4a09g84dcg2ddb013c2f91"
msgid ""
"I'd say your training days are behind you, <i>ra'stil</i>. Leave it to the "
"hatchlings."
msgstr "훈련받을 시기는 진작에 지나지 않았나, <i>라스틸</i>. 수련생들을 방해하지 말도록."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_IntelligenceOfficer02
#. Speaker = Ardent Vraalsith
#. NodeID = f6374987-5fd1-4d5e-be53-5cffdd9cb0cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_IntelligenceOfficer02(1) = True
#. TagRule: !GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_IntelligenceOfficer02:f6374987-5fd1-4d5e-be53-5cffdd9cb0cc
msgctxt "h4272bc0cg9079g4183g9f62g67fd6c4ac688"
msgid "You have no business being here. Leave, before I make you."
msgstr "네놈은 여기 머무를 자격이 없다. 좋은 말로 할 때 떠나라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_IntelligenceOfficer03
