#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_IntelligenceOfficer03:33963106-cfe9-8510-de6d-8592efd7e745
msgctxt "h08a47cc3g1d1bg4570gbe24ge1e10fcf3aea"
msgid ""
"You bore the weapon this far. If it must be purged by your hand, so be it."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_IntelligenceOfficer03
#. Speaker = Ardent Qu'th
#. NodeID = 419fd8db-2a87-301a-b50b-b305c6c64b01
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
