#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_MageHandKid02:13bdcc91-64fd-81e2-77d4-dd87fb131c08
msgctxt "h16072702g55abg4d4ag9cfag24eaeba9bc9f"
msgid "Adults are so rubbish. You never let us have any fun."
msgstr "어른들은 진짜 쓰레기 같아. 우리를 좀 놀게 내버려 두질 않잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_MageHandKid02
