msgid "Why is there blood <i>here?</i>"
msgstr "왜 피가 <i>여기에?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_PortraitKid
#. Speaker = Youth Vis'kiir
#. NodeID = 33c6421f-913b-4bc0-9158-189f16c7e71a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_PortraitKidAfterVandalizing(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_General_State_VlaakithPortraitRuined = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_General_HasMet_PortraitKidAfterVandalizing(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_PortraitKid:33c6421f-913b-4bc0-9158-189f16c7e71a
msgctxt "hf902a736g3f75g4038gbdddg08985e73d7df"
msgid "No, no, no - the Inquisitor will have our necks for this!"
msgstr "안돼, 안돼, 안돼 - 심문관에게 들키면 목이 달아날 거야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_PortraitKid
#. Speaker = Youth Vis'kiir
#. NodeID = 8829e12e-bd62-4a8e-881f-ad4053e6ea06
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_PortraitKidAfterVandalizing(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_General_State_VlaakithPortraitRuined = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_PortraitKid:8829e12e-bd62-4a8e-881f-ad4053e6ea06
msgctxt "ha13fa1d7gd3a2g4eb5gbad1g000a42a163f7"
msgid "Oh <i>Vlaakith gha'g shkath zai</i>, it <i>has </i>to come off!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_PortraitKid
#. Speaker = Youth Vis'kiir
#. NodeID = b72c9334-cd74-45e1-8a72-4ac1ec394f56
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_PortraitKidAfterVandalizing(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_General_State_VlaakithPortraitPlayerFailed = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_General_HasMet_PortraitKidAfterVandalizing(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_PortraitKid:b72c9334-cd74-45e1-8a72-4ac1ec394f56
msgctxt "h56b30016g404fg4394g94abg51b660d24264"
msgid ""
"<i>You </i>did this! The Inquisitor is going to gut us one by one and it's "
"all your fault!"
msgstr "<i>네놈</i> 짓이군! 심문관이 우리 내장을 하나하나 뜯어가면 다 네 놈 탓이야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_PortraitKid
#. Speaker = Youth Vis'kiir
#. NodeID = ca962e2c-b8d7-9af3-00a0-ddc11b0ac1b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_PortraitKid(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_General_HasMet_PortraitKid(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_PortraitKid:ca962e2c-b8d7-9af3-00a0-ddc11b0ac1b3
msgctxt "h75f6a65agba27g42a2g8a23gaca5255b53bd"
msgid ""
"Look, I don't have time to talk to you, <i>istik </i>- this place isn't "
"going to clean itself."
msgstr "이봐, 너한테 이야기할 시간 없다, <i>이스틱.</i> 이곳은 알아서 깨끗해지지 않는다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_PortraitKid
#. Speaker = Youth Vis'kiir
#. NodeID = ff65b056-00f8-2f0b-d430-4baf969b084f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_General_HasMet_PortraitKid(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_General_HasMet_PortraitKid(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_PortraitKid:ff65b056-00f8-2f0b-d430-4baf969b084f
msgctxt "hf99eb6a8g1b2eg43fega1a8g09e7c10cb296"
msgid "Was cleaning duty this awful at your crèche?"
msgstr "청소 임무는 당신 양성소에서 이렇게 끔찍한 일이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 082ba8df-3aa1-8eb4-daf1-d32f2fe79409
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_Quartermistress_State_DefendedIstiks(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress:082ba8df-3aa1-8eb4-daf1-d32f2fe79409
msgctxt "h35febd6fg9d78g4932gab8cg7ab255b3f94f"
msgid "Care to trade? I guarantee all my stuff's spotless."
msgstr "거래 좀 할까? 장담컨대 내 물건들은 흠집 하나 없다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress
#. Speaker = A'jak'nir Jeera
#. NodeID = 0e408860-cf91-f676-6171-416e699840f4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress:0e408860-cf91-f676-6171-416e699840f4
msgctxt "hbcf15e5eg2566g4e6fg8239g3e7c13a04533"
msgid ""
"But if you're so <i>keen </i>to extol their virtues, you can pay accordingly."
msgstr "하지만 네가 놈들의 미덕을 그토록 <i>간절히</i> 찬미하고 싶다면, 그에 맞는 대가를 지불할 수 있겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress
#. Speaker = A'jak'nir Jeera
#. NodeID = 14377b67-de63-7c67-7fc6-4f1fe0c5e166
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress:14377b67-de63-7c67-7fc6-4f1fe0c5e166
msgctxt "h63412da7g1221g4a22ga896gbed157f6c3d9"
msgid "On your way then."
msgstr "그럼 갈 길 가도록."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress
#. Speaker = A'jak'nir Jeera
#. NodeID = 1abb9fc6-b9d7-c7bf-b145-a1ba8671fcee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress:1abb9fc6-b9d7-c7bf-b145-a1ba8671fcee
msgctxt "h948543d5g6b2cg4d19g9c3egb9dfe8e6c25c"
msgid "As long as what you're offering is <i>clean</i>."
msgstr "그대가 제안하는 물품들이 <i>깨끗하기만</i> 하다면야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1eccad55-290f-735b-912b-87d1acc4a0eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress:1eccad55-290f-735b-912b-87d1acc4a0eb
msgctxt "h0dd17297g3529g423bgb0dag8a15adbcf5d2"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress
#. Speaker = A'jak'nir Jeera
#. NodeID = 625ed4c1-7d62-bf77-479f-ea23422ad02e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress:625ed4c1-7d62-bf77-479f-ea23422ad02e
msgctxt "h9a2b8fb9ge3e7g4edfgae73gfc8d7fb9b211"
msgid "The <i>filth </i>of these people. Unbelievable."
msgstr "이 <i>더러운</i> 족속들 좀 봐. 믿기지 않는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 62d015b3-2cc6-a10b-0541-299461602843
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_Quartermistress_State_AgreedWithTrader(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress:62d015b3-2cc6-a10b-0541-299461602843
msgctxt "h0a1b3a64g5b89g49fcg8b64g5a55adee7d94"
msgid "That's an impressive collection, kin - perhaps we might trade?"
msgstr "인상적인 수집품 목록이군, 동포여 - 혹시 거래할 의향 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6ecab1c6-19e6-d15a-3ca6-03ed5086b710
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_Quartermistress_State_AgreedWithTrader(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress:6ecab1c6-19e6-d15a-3ca6-03ed5086b710
msgctxt "h42366324gb99bg4921ga6cfg9a1762557782"
msgid "Still, I'd like to see if there's something worth trading for."
msgstr "그래도 거래할 만한 물건이 있는지 살펴보고 싶군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress
#. Speaker = A'jak'nir Jeera
#. NodeID = 7f5cad8f-f52a-734f-ff86-69d96d177395
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress:7f5cad8f-f52a-734f-ff86-69d96d177395
msgctxt "h2ec531a8g5671g436bg9a23gabdde92f50ec"
msgid ""
"I'd heard this plane was disgusting, but I didn't think it would be like "
"<i>this</i>."
msgstr "이 차원이 역겹다는 사실은 익히 들어왔지만, <i>이 정도</i>일 줄은 몰랐군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress
#. Speaker = A'jak'nir Jeera
#. NodeID = 7fc6bd1e-18f5-5681-a72e-4b64e375fe27
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress:7fc6bd1e-18f5-5681-a72e-4b64e375fe27
msgctxt "hf8e1dabcgfc12g45edg8c5dg1c86594832f7"
msgid "Impressive? Not the word I would use. But to each their own."
msgstr "인상적이라? 내가 쓰는 말은 아니지만, 각자 부르기 나름이겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 810e5bec-2e3f-3a40-5bbe-245ce110b6cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress:810e5bec-2e3f-3a40-5bbe-245ce110b6cb
msgctxt "hf4d98e49g24e3g48b9g8d1bg1e857d70ba6d"
msgid "Let's trade. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress
#. Speaker = A'jak'nir Jeera
#. NodeID = 8581813e-6fbe-82be-f9ef-ae295929b611
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress:8581813e-6fbe-82be-f9ef-ae295929b611
msgctxt "h8472fa7fg508dg45dcgbc29gaa1be7705499"
msgid ""
"If you find anything worthwhile that isn't covered in <i>tsk'va</i>, do let "
"me know."
msgstr "혹시 <i>츠크바</i>로 뒤덮이지 않은 귀중품을 찾게 된다면, 내게 알려라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress
#. Speaker = A'jak'nir Jeera
#. NodeID = 94ed0da5-e876-ae07-7b0f-dba576da48bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_QuarterMistress_Event_TriedSellingIllegalItem = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress:94ed0da5-e876-ae07-7b0f-dba576da48bc
msgctxt "h14b6c5b2gab5fg415fg8c9fgfa1a2923d878"
msgid ""
"You took from us, and thought I wouldn't notice? I will take back what is "
"rightfully ours."
msgstr "우리 것을 훔치고, 내가 그걸 눈치채지 못할 거라 생각했나? 우리의 정당한 소유물을 되찾겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress
#. Speaker = A'jak'nir Jeera
#. NodeID = 9512f25d-1733-d171-6a02-75287edf9717
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_Quartermistress_HasMet(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_Quartermistress_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress:9512f25d-1733-d171-6a02-75287edf9717
msgctxt "hdd87b0d0g594cg4394g8914geaa5e4195e65"
msgid ""
"Blood, rust, <i>tsk'va</i>... Is there no odious substance <i>not </"
"i>smeared on this delivery?"
msgstr "유혈, 녹, <i>츠크바</i>... 정말이지 불결한 물질로 더럽혀지지 <i>않은</i> 물자는 한 개도 없는 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress
#. Speaker = A'jak'nir Jeera
#. NodeID = 9b5c546a-84eb-68d0-eb62-83d707d0198e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress:9b5c546a-84eb-68d0-eb62-83d707d0198e
msgctxt "hf5b7ec75gda42g48c4g8498g222f2e55b6cb"
msgid "Fine. But your paraphernalia had better be <i>pristine</i>."
msgstr "좋다. 하지만 네 소지품들이 웬만큼 <i>새 것</i>같지 않으면 안 될 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress
#. Speaker = A'jak'nir Jeera
#. NodeID = a9a8ec9d-fad0-63b0-bdb2-cb22dab3620d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress:a9a8ec9d-fad0-63b0-bdb2-cb22dab3620d
msgctxt "hd46cd6adg8bcag41f6g8870ge3a3dbeba12e"
msgid "Watch your step. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress
#. Speaker = A'jak'nir Jeera
#. NodeID = a9a8ec9d-fad0-63b0-bdb2-cb22dab3620d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[1]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress:a9a8ec9d-fad0-63b0-bdb2-cb22dab3620d
msgctxt "h6d7cf116g6b7bg444cgadadg7297284744e3"
msgid "Go on then. Be on your way. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress
#. Speaker = A'jak'nir Jeera
#. NodeID = a9a8ec9d-fad0-63b0-bdb2-cb22dab3620d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[2]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress:a9a8ec9d-fad0-63b0-bdb2-cb22dab3620d
msgctxt "h793be4e1gb513g44c0gba28g20d8b2354bbc"
msgid "Remember, clean items only. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress
#. Speaker = A'jak'nir Jeera
#. NodeID = c3d8ad5f-a321-419e-cf95-ceae9550ff0e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress:c3d8ad5f-a321-419e-cf95-ceae9550ff0e
msgctxt "h6ce99464gb14dg45cegaee8g0864f46d4dfd"
msgid ""
"I don't know how you stand it - <i>istiks </i>smell like pigs and die twice "
"as loudly. <i>Ugh</i>."
msgstr ""
"그대가 어떻게 이것들 옆에 서 있을 수 있는지 모르겠군. <i>이스틱</i>들은 돼지처럼 냄새를 풍기고 두 배는 더 소란스럽게 죽지. "
"<i>우욱</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e00c1ce8-c127-107f-96e1-075a0e5e71fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_Quartermistress_State_DefendedIstiks(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress:e00c1ce8-c127-107f-96e1-075a0e5e71fb
msgctxt "h73952003g073dg4730g9b4bgac2337651a89"
msgid ""
"There must be something worthwhile on this plane, or your kind wouldn't be "
"here."
msgstr "이 차원에 분명 가치 있는 게 있을 거다. 그게 아니라면 너희 족속들이 여기 있지도 않았겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress
#. Speaker = A'jak'nir Jeera
#. NodeID = e24e68e1-e32f-5309-4edb-c09304c0b33f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress:e24e68e1-e32f-5309-4edb-c09304c0b33f
msgctxt "hace44c9agf2a7g47b4gb92bg631c8c0eef7d"
msgid ""
"<i>Chk!</i> Most metals here fold like <i>istiks</i>. Much like <i>istiks "
"</i>themselves."
msgstr "<i>츠크!</i> 이 차원의 금속 대부분은 <i>이스틱</i>처럼 구부러져. 모든 면에서 <i>이스틱</i>들과 같지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e44d7b8e-c6b3-8625-b612-be172b8cbc1c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_Quartermistress_State_AgreedWithTrader(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress:e44d7b8e-c6b3-8625-b612-be172b8cbc1c
msgctxt "h924b36b4ged4cg4e8ag9a09g4350d7cea247"
msgid "This plane's squalor is indeed a constant source of discomfort."
msgstr "이 차원의 불결함은 과연 끊임없이 불편함을 불러일으키지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress
#. Speaker = A'jak'nir Jeera
#. NodeID = fabbb1ef-7222-3ec4-cec8-f35c756f7291
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_Quartermistress_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress:fabbb1ef-7222-3ec4-cec8-f35c756f7291
msgctxt "h2ce93c6bg9b5bg49a5gbe8ageee30758e338"
msgid "Back for more?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress
#. Speaker = A'jak'nir Jeera
#. NodeID = fabbb1ef-7222-3ec4-cec8-f35c756f7291
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[1]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_Quartermistress_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_Quartermistress:fabbb1ef-7222-3ec4-cec8-f35c756f7291
msgctxt "h379e7802gd318g404ega782gca19554445bc"
msgid "Back so soon?"
msgstr ""

