"These are the statues of Lathander from the book. Shouldn't they move, then?"
msgstr "책에 적혀있던 라샌더의 신상들이네. 그러면 움직여야 하는 거 아닌가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_StatuePuzzle_PAD_SpottingStatuesPerceptionCheck
