msgctxt "hbcc492b6gb725g4d39gaf6bg02512269bcfd"
msgid "What, will they not heed their <i>jhe'stil?</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_HiddenCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Warrior Qen
#. NodeID = 85bca4e2-eb73-4b95-881b-3863dd64315b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - a18b985a-c6c6-9354-e8f6-51f1bb5b98f2_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - a18b985a-c6c6-9354-e8f6-51f1bb5b98f2_C = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_HiddenCheckpointChatter:85bca4e2-eb73-4b95-881b-3863dd64315b
msgctxt "h090f5fd3g1829g4b8egb7fagf90a95ed1a3d"
msgid "Do you remember that story we were told as <i>yank</i>? "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_HiddenCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Raider G'r'ath
#. NodeID = 946b67b7-3362-4350-8299-b4540d6d4453
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_HiddenCheckpointChatter:946b67b7-3362-4350-8299-b4540d6d4453
msgctxt "hb99ac86ag3179g4ee4gabbcgcaae66957c1a"
msgid "They're not following orders. Poor conduct. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_HiddenCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Raider G'r'ath
#. NodeID = a4b879dc-d5ac-1a9c-b09f-15f7020f30ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_HiddenCheckpointChatter:a4b879dc-d5ac-1a9c-b09f-15f7020f30ef
msgctxt "h92823ed0g493dg42f2g98e4g81d92f1bd03d"
msgid "Used to love those - the ones about Kith'rak Voss were my favourite."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_HiddenCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Raider G'r'ath
#. NodeID = acea34c3-292a-42ab-b93b-0709c4bf2a1c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_HiddenCheckpointChatter:acea34c3-292a-42ab-b93b-0709c4bf2a1c
msgctxt "hca8d6a0dg7e4bg4942gac49g6f61ed62cb8a"
msgid ""
"Which one? 'The Sixth Arm of Tu'narath'? 'Voidseekers'? 'Myth and Gith'?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_HiddenCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Raider G'r'ath
#. NodeID = b9a12faa-93cd-a223-0965-51988f4a2f3e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_HiddenCheckpointChatter:b9a12faa-93cd-a223-0965-51988f4a2f3e
msgctxt "hcf736826g2d20g433egafdfg952b32f03a8a"
msgid "I hope there are no more. This cavern would be the first to collapse. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_HiddenCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Warrior Qen
#. NodeID = c4203696-0e98-4e01-b395-88c0ced3ee8d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_HiddenCheckpointChatter:c4203696-0e98-4e01-b395-88c0ced3ee8d
msgctxt "hde887161g98fag432bg8be7g9ea9af9e1320"
msgid ""
"That's <i>right </i>G'r'ath. You're next on the list. That's why you're "
"here, guarding nothing. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_HiddenCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Raider G'r'ath
#. NodeID = c454f2b6-e245-4724-be84-95fe8e0c2617
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_HiddenCheckpointChatter:c454f2b6-e245-4724-be84-95fe8e0c2617
msgctxt "hb3696d1dgd557g4953gb711g995f9c8a2321"
msgid "Have faith, Qen. One day Vlaakith's light will shine upon us. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_HiddenCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Warrior Qen
#. NodeID = ec355fda-9667-870e-2e98-b5654f25721b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_HiddenCheckpointChatter:ec355fda-9667-870e-2e98-b5654f25721b
msgctxt "hf134c941g60b9g432bg9943g17590c9b8996"
msgid "Might make this watch more exciting. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_HiddenCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Warrior Qen
#. NodeID = fd758290-b5c1-44ec-bc17-63878aac40fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Lance_State_WasActive = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - a18b985a-c6c6-9354-e8f6-51f1bb5b98f2_A = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_HiddenCheckpointChatter:fd758290-b5c1-44ec-bc17-63878aac40fb
msgctxt "h13508703ge5c9g4ab0g913cgbd751976b91a"
msgid "I wasn't much better than the current stock when I was a <i>yank</i>. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Ardent Lin'a'an
#. NodeID = 08ac7151-d2c8-ebcd-a4b0-5444f34df29e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter:08ac7151-d2c8-ebcd-a4b0-5444f34df29e
msgctxt "h98966a5age161g421fg9325gdad59859be77"
msgid "Why, have you anything to hide?"
msgstr "왜, 숨기고 있는 거라도 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Ardent Lin'a'an
#. NodeID = 0adf9068-c6a8-e29f-cd05-fd25934d4481
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter:0adf9068-c6a8-e29f-cd05-fd25934d4481
msgctxt "hac62bdfeg34dfg44afg8acbgd090fb96c8cc"
msgid ""
"I forgot you existed outside of Vlaakith's gaze, <i>ra'stil</i>. You are "
"very lucky."
msgstr "네가 블라키스의 시야 밖에 있는 존재라는 걸 까먹었군, <i>라스틸</i>. 너는 정말 운이 좋은 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Warrior Khunaruth
#. NodeID = 0b76918f-980a-491f-a940-d9e5678003fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Templar_State_Defeated = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter:0b76918f-980a-491f-a940-d9e5678003fd
msgctxt "h831e7bcdgbd7eg4be8g8266g6983786b92bf"
msgid ""
"I'm sure your Inquisition has better things to do than castigate youths in "
"training."
msgstr "네 심문은 훈련 중인 청년들을 징계 하는 것보다 더 중요한 일이 있을 거라 믿는다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Ardent Lin'a'an
#. NodeID = 11488630-fa84-40be-8b1b-3303cda26751
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter:11488630-fa84-40be-8b1b-3303cda26751
msgctxt "h927e8927g1780g44d6ga609gea24e07b6057"
msgid "I would be more <i>concerned</i> than <i>excited</i>."
msgstr "난 <i>들뜨기</i>보단 <i>걱정</i>이 될 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Ardent Lin'a'an
#. NodeID = 19d40a32-2ea7-4e30-a87c-5cf4c981a152
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter:19d40a32-2ea7-4e30-a87c-5cf4c981a152
msgctxt "h6ef6fb80g30dcg4332g953eg9fc30cb4f08c"
msgid ""
"Be calm, <i>ra'stil</i>. Those standing in truth need not fear Vlaakith's "
"gaze."
msgstr "진정해라, <i>라스틸</i>. 진실을 말하는 자들은 블라키스의 시선을 두려워할 필요가 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Ardent Lin'a'an
#. NodeID = 1c36e92b-83c1-4734-a363-71c1f9a1adaa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter:1c36e92b-83c1-4734-a363-71c1f9a1adaa
msgctxt "hd7613158g324fg43dag90c1g655629dfc97d"
msgid "<i>Hero</i>. That could be confused for <i>istik </i>sentimentality."
msgstr "<i>영웅</i>이라. <i>이스틱</i>이나 하는 감상에 빠져 있는 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Ardent Lin'a'an
#. NodeID = 1eb3bbf5-1192-8124-4806-8a58a2f40f0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter:1eb3bbf5-1192-8124-4806-8a58a2f40f0a
msgctxt "hec8093f0g7142g44b8gb824g6637a0b263ad"
msgid ""
"Until the Inquisitor's slayer is found, and <i>destroyed. </i>No sooner."
msgstr "심문관 학살자를 찾아서 <i>죽일 때까지.</i> 그 전까진 안 떠나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Warrior Khunaruth
#. NodeID = 26462c02-3be3-9f1b-6de0-3aafd51ffc40
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter:26462c02-3be3-9f1b-6de0-3aafd51ffc40
msgctxt "heec51c02gb39dg4c39g8c67g570c2c0be3e9"
msgid ""
"Forgive me, we have not been visited by an inquisitor in an age. It is an "
"<i>honour</i>."
msgstr "미안하네, 우리는 한 세대에 걸쳐 심문관의 방문을 받지 못해서 말이야. 이번 방문은 <i>영광</i>이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Warrior Khunaruth
#. NodeID = 2ad7aaf6-7e7d-de78-230a-704b2b3b0441
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Templar_State_Defeated = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter:2ad7aaf6-7e7d-de78-230a-704b2b3b0441
msgctxt "h74bb6f74gcadeg42cag847eg64d7340de847"
msgid "With your inquisitor gone, what authority do you claim over us?"
msgstr "너희 심문관도 없는 마당에, 우리에게 무슨 권위를 요구하는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Warrior Khunaruth
#. NodeID = 329152e8-3f4a-afd1-68b9-b55642ba6bf0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter:329152e8-3f4a-afd1-68b9-b55642ba6bf0
msgctxt "h072d00e4g74a1g4bd4g9fe7g133c1048c7cc"
msgid "What do you mean by that?"
msgstr "그게 무슨 뜻이지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Warrior Khunaruth
#. NodeID = 35278de0-846a-81c9-3a2d-bc82d4f3b413
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter:35278de0-846a-81c9-3a2d-bc82d4f3b413
msgctxt "h240fc33eg2bd2g44dagb2d8g8144ed8e950e"
msgid ""
"Do you have no leads? I thought you ardents were meant to be our "
"<i>intelligentsia</i>."
msgstr "단서라도 잡은 거 없어? 너희 아덴트들은 우리중에서도 <i>엘리트</i>들이라고 생각했는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Warrior Khunaruth
#. NodeID = 3cd0415f-fdc3-43d5-33c1-c519d8fe049c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter:3cd0415f-fdc3-43d5-33c1-c519d8fe049c
msgctxt "h687d7b97g16f7g4ef5g841dge28071855d78"
msgid "No, but he might scour through the whole crèche in his search."
msgstr "아니, 하지만 그가 수색할 때 양성소 전체를 뒤질지도 몰라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Ardent Lin'a'an
#. NodeID = 45391aaa-d953-faf7-193f-ca2bcfe66626
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter:45391aaa-d953-faf7-193f-ca2bcfe66626
msgctxt "he570257fgf645g45cfgbe69g42752a7b1692"
msgid ""
"I am not sure you are in a position to reflect on our motivations, "
"<i>vin'iisk</i>."
msgstr "네가 우리가 하는 일에 대해 이래라 저래라 할 위치인지 잘 모르겠군, <i>비니스크</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Ardent Lin'a'an
#. NodeID = 4abb27bc-db40-0690-65ec-f0b52363925b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter:4abb27bc-db40-0690-65ec-f0b52363925b
msgctxt "h4682f4bfgd9c1g4c58gbc66ge3de439c9e95"
msgid "Hold your tongue, lest I pull it from your skull."
msgstr "말 조심해, 네 머리통에서 혀를 뽑아버리기 전에."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Warrior Khunaruth
#. NodeID = 4f9fed05-13b0-4d1c-a74f-66bd1e1ff026
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Lance_State_WasActive = False
#.   Local:
#.      - 6a1d94e5-b519-3d08-f247-5cf6c5576f53_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 6a1d94e5-b519-3d08-f247-5cf6c5576f53_B = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter:4f9fed05-13b0-4d1c-a74f-66bd1e1ff026
msgctxt "h581a0013gf063g4701g879bg669219ddfd64"
msgid "I hear even Silver Sword Voss has been drafted into the search."
msgstr "심지어 실버 소드 보스도 수색에 투입되었다던데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Warrior Khunaruth
#. NodeID = 55174588-5f23-8cbf-a56e-13e47c6ae3ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter:55174588-5f23-8cbf-a56e-13e47c6ae3ed
msgctxt "h7e01a81eg24d9g4a84g8ec5g055c117f95d3"
msgid "I... forgot myself. I apologise, ardent."
msgstr "난... 나 자신을 까먹고 있었군. 사과하지, 아덴트."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Ardent Lin'a'an
#. NodeID = 6013c471-3f3a-a315-ff72-3330e2961556
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter:6013c471-3f3a-a315-ff72-3330e2961556
msgctxt "h5005a55agc870g41e5gbe63g26721e5eea52"
msgid ""
"Inquisitor or not, we still have a mission. The artefact remains unfound. "
"<i>Focus</i>."
msgstr "심문관이 있든 없든, 우린 여전히 임무를 갖고 있다. 그 아티팩트는 여전히 못 찾았다고. <i>집중해</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Ardent Lin'a'an
#. NodeID = 67517171-19d9-431b-af0e-9fbbb77e2860
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 6a1d94e5-b519-3d08-f247-5cf6c5576f53_C = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 6a1d94e5-b519-3d08-f247-5cf6c5576f53_B = False
#.     - 6a1d94e5-b519-3d08-f247-5cf6c5576f53_C = False
#.     - 6a1d94e5-b519-3d08-f247-5cf6c5576f53_A = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter:67517171-19d9-431b-af0e-9fbbb77e2860
msgctxt "h945c3ae9g79a7g41a5g87e8gf08dc4b18fdb"
msgid ""
"Your latest crop of <i>yanki</i> have been disrespecting their "
"<i>sa'varsh</i>."
msgstr "너희들의 최근 <i>양키</i> 졸업생들은 그들의 <i>사바쉬</i>를 존중하지 않고 있었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Ardent Lin'a'an
#. NodeID = 6cb1f7dd-0f18-1e6d-3c30-e1cabdb09d9a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter:6cb1f7dd-0f18-1e6d-3c30-e1cabdb09d9a
msgctxt "hf5b4b37egb72dg47d2g9e7fgea75d4e49d98"
msgid "Voss? He's just a war myth for <i>sa'varsh </i>to teach the young ones."
msgstr "보스? 그는 <i>사바쉬</i>가 애들을 가르칠 때를 위한 전쟁 신화일 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Warrior Khunaruth
#. NodeID = 6ec46125-696c-96e5-bfe6-a3271534f50d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter:6ec46125-696c-96e5-bfe6-a3271534f50d
msgctxt "ha9f77833ga358g43bdgadbfge4699e516f63"
msgid "Our crèche did not train <i>your</i> inquisitor."
msgstr "우리 양성소는 <i>너의</i> 심문관을 교육시키지 않았다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Warrior Khunaruth
#. NodeID = 86643512-899c-460c-b2cb-db5a062c36a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_UpperGuards_State_ShowedArtefacttoGuard = False
#.      - CRE_Templar_State_Defeated = False
#.   Local:
#.      - 6a1d94e5-b519-3d08-f247-5cf6c5576f53_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 6a1d94e5-b519-3d08-f247-5cf6c5576f53_C = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter:86643512-899c-460c-b2cb-db5a062c36a4
msgctxt "hf946cfbfgd97ag4ea2gb678g567a0471616f"
msgid "Any word on the search for the artefact, <i>ra'stil</i>?"
msgstr "아티팩트 수색에 대한 소식은 없나, <i>라스틸</i>?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Ardent Lin'a'an
#. NodeID = 88e96c65-0092-8f38-4d2a-b8e25ddacd27
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter:88e96c65-0092-8f38-4d2a-b8e25ddacd27
msgctxt "h6f0fedf2gdd40g472bgbc0dg233c9e678aea"
msgid "Do I detect insubordination in your tone, <i>vin'iisk</i>?"
msgstr "네 말투에서 반항심이 느껴지는데, <i>비니스크</i>?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Warrior Khunaruth
#. NodeID = a1ebec67-53e7-6106-92d9-499f01fa9893
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter:a1ebec67-53e7-6106-92d9-499f01fa9893
msgctxt "h7867d2aeg49e8g40b1g9c41gc5cf90ccbaa7"
msgid "No! Kith'rak Voss is a hero."
msgstr "아니! 키스락 보스는 영웅이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Ardent Lin'a'an
#. NodeID = ac5c77c5-11e3-20aa-e1f4-89bae93d44c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter:ac5c77c5-11e3-20aa-e1f4-89bae93d44c3
msgctxt "hdb565a1cgc006g432cga16ag47ef12c0906d"
msgid ""
"Is prattling about tremors when you have a duty not defective, "
"<i>vin'iisk</i>?"
msgstr "네게 본분이 있는데도 겁을 먹고 떠드는 게 결함이 없는 거냐, <i>비니스크</i>?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Warrior Khunaruth
#. NodeID = b1380366-1cee-ff20-83c8-0c80eba808b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Lance_State_WasActive = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 6a1d94e5-b519-3d08-f247-5cf6c5576f53_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 6a1d94e5-b519-3d08-f247-5cf6c5576f53_B = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter:b1380366-1cee-ff20-83c8-0c80eba808b1
msgctxt "h82d3b714g23edg4413g85f0gf2bfae03c239"
msgid "We have remained undisturbed for an age. What was that rumbling?"
msgstr "우리는 한 세대 동안이나 평온하게 지내고 있었어. 저 소란은 뭐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Ardent Lin'a'an
#. NodeID = b89fd67d-2f73-47df-898a-8495ae2001ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter:b89fd67d-2f73-47df-898a-8495ae2001ed
msgctxt "h4dff9006g3ea8g44dcg9f27g81a5551f0cc6"
msgid "Loose words are food for <i>ghaik</i> spies. You should know better."
msgstr "<i>게이크</i> 첩자들이 엿들으면 딱 좋아할 말이군. 언행을 조심하라고 배우지 않았나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Ardent Lin'a'an
#. NodeID = b9110a20-0b36-347d-b3e8-2ceaf8bc0d98
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Templar_State_Defeated = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 6a1d94e5-b519-3d08-f247-5cf6c5576f53_A = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter:b9110a20-0b36-347d-b3e8-2ceaf8bc0d98
msgctxt "h79cde65cg1309g40f6gacfega5bf24924303"
msgid ""
"Your crèche has much to answer for, allowing an inquisitor to be compromised."
msgstr "너의 양성소가 해명해야 할 게 많다. 심문관을 그렇게 무방비로 놔두다니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Warrior Khunaruth
#. NodeID = c3671483-c8d5-9108-8458-3e2012259071
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter:c3671483-c8d5-9108-8458-3e2012259071
msgctxt "hfe444c1eg9a0cg45d4gb25eg488eed7b0adf"
msgid "I'd have never dreamed of such insubordination."
msgstr "그런 반항이 있었다는 건 꿈에도 몰랐어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Ardent Lin'a'an
#. NodeID = cad808b5-42da-5817-6b25-b395e3c492e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter:cad808b5-42da-5817-6b25-b395e3c492e0
msgctxt "h634fd6a5gb056g41bag85cagb2fd1db26616"
msgid "I am not surprised that this crèche has yet another defect."
msgstr "이 양성소에 또 다른 결함이 있었다니 놀랍지도 않군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Warrior Khunaruth
#. NodeID = d2c942d9-1211-49aa-8091-207423bffbd4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Templar_State_Defeated = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 6a1d94e5-b519-3d08-f247-5cf6c5576f53_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 6a1d94e5-b519-3d08-f247-5cf6c5576f53_C = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter:d2c942d9-1211-49aa-8091-207423bffbd4
msgctxt "h62d79de2g5ee1g440cgaf89gfcd1bcf80e4c"
msgid "With your commanding officer dead, how long will you stay here?"
msgstr "네 지휘관이 죽었는데, 여기 얼마나 머무르려는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Ardent Lin'a'an
#. NodeID = ea8fd762-6eca-2241-2ca5-9f3cf699cd62
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter:ea8fd762-6eca-2241-2ca5-9f3cf699cd62
msgctxt "h42d1ce43gdfd8g4ee9ga00egd3547b206738"
msgid ""
"It's an indictment of this entire crèche. It seems your <i>sa'varsh</i> has "
"gotten sloppy."
msgstr "그건 이 양성소 전체에 대한 결함이다. 너의 <i>사바쉬</i>가 칠칠치 못했던 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter
#. Speaker = Warrior Khunaruth
#. NodeID = fdbcbd99-3848-46e5-9830-d20ca1d84ee3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Templar_State_Defeated = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 6a1d94e5-b519-3d08-f247-5cf6c5576f53_A = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter:fdbcbd99-3848-46e5-9830-d20ca1d84ee3
msgctxt "h6cd698b0g9ec8g4bc6g8160gc9e2f29d0931"
msgid "What should I do if the <i>ch'r'ai</i> takes me in for questioning?"
msgstr "<i>츠라이</i>가 심문을 위해 날 데려가면 난 어떻게 해야 하지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_HiddenCheckpointTrespassing
#. Speaker = Raider G'r'ath
#. NodeID = 092b2208-22c9-cd34-726a-fe4636994fe3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_UpperGuards_Event_HiddenCheckpointHostile = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_HiddenCheckpointTrespassing:092b2208-22c9-cd34-726a-fe4636994fe3
msgctxt "hc20fef44g977dg4e53ga3c1g2374c1be76b6"
msgid "<i>Attack</i>."
msgstr "<i>공격한다</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_HiddenCheckpointTrespassing
#. Speaker = Raider G'r'ath
#. NodeID = 0b0c5ccf-c3ec-4349-b5a3-6a065d40a424
