msgctxt "h0ca2445dg3f3dg4bb1ga66bge5a88c40ae4f"
msgid ""
"Seek the Inquisitor within. Step lightly, <i>istik</i> - he's not known for "
"his lenience."
msgstr "안쪽에서 심문관을 찾아봐라. 행동을 삼가라, <i>라스틸</i> - 그는 관대함 따위와는 거리가 먼 사람이니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_MainCheckpointTrespassing
