msgid "An <i>istik</i>? A curious choice, if indeed he sent you."
msgstr "<i>이스틱</i>을? 그가 널 보낸 게 사실이라면, 흥미로운 선택이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_MainCheckpointWarning
