msgctxt "hbe6f5a5ag4ab7g40a1gbe82g6a0158c76512"
msgid ""
"Enter, and seek <i>Kith'rak</i> Therezzyn. If you are lying, you will not "
"return."
msgstr "들어가서 <i>키스락</i> 테레진을 찾아라. 만약 거짓말을 하고 있는 거라면, 살아 나가지 못할 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_UpperGuards_MainCheckpointWarning
