msgctxt "hf97eae95g4706g44c4ga559gb84d36811d50"
msgid ""
"Only through anatomical study do we learn of <i>ghaik</i> weakness. The more "
"we know, the more efficient our kills."
msgstr "해부학을 공부해야만 <i>게이크</i>의 약점을 알 수 있다. 더 많이 알 수록, 더 효율적으로 죽일 수 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_AnatomicalSketchesComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c1bac892-bf49-40cb-965e-8c97c975f0d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_AnatomicalSketchesComment:c1bac892-bf49-40cb-965e-8c97c975f0d2
msgctxt "hbbabed6aga56dg46c1ga4f6g4bb5fbfc0ab0"
msgid ""
"Mind flayer anatomy, rendered in quite disturbing detail. The gith clearly "
"know their enemy inside out."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_AnatomicalSketchesComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c1bac892-bf49-40cb-965e-8c97c975f0d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_AnatomicalSketchesComment:c1bac892-bf49-40cb-965e-8c97c975f0d2
msgctxt "he2dcb85fg358ag4805ga524g0139ea4b4355"
msgid ""
"Anatomical sketches of a mind flayer? Not something to hang over the "
"mantlepiece..."
msgstr "마인드 플레이어 해부학 스케치? 벽난로 위에 걸어둘 만한 건 아니네..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_AnatomicalSketchesComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c1bac892-bf49-40cb-965e-8c97c975f0d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_AnatomicalSketchesComment:c1bac892-bf49-40cb-965e-8c97c975f0d2
msgctxt "h2de2b5a1gc23fg43e8gb75egb5d63a10ba21"
msgid ""
"Oh, well, that is a lot more of the illithid anatomy than I'd ever hoped to "
"see."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_AnatomicalSketchesComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c1bac892-bf49-40cb-965e-8c97c975f0d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_AnatomicalSketchesComment:c1bac892-bf49-40cb-965e-8c97c975f0d2
msgctxt "hdf50a8eegbf48g49b4g8050g6a2654c43bac"
msgid "Highly detailed. Nasty."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_AnatomicalSketchesComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c1bac892-bf49-40cb-965e-8c97c975f0d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_AnatomicalSketchesComment:c1bac892-bf49-40cb-965e-8c97c975f0d2
msgctxt "h2c4d90c8g84d7g45aeg9c58g6b72df0905ff"
msgid ""
"Mind flayer anatomical sketches... wonderful level of detail. Wonderful and "
"appalling."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_AnatomicalSketchesComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c1bac892-bf49-40cb-965e-8c97c975f0d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_AnatomicalSketchesComment:c1bac892-bf49-40cb-965e-8c97c975f0d2
msgctxt "hbf7ab6fdg1178g40e5gb249g164fcce7520b"
msgid ""
"Mind flayer anatomy - an important subject. The best hunters know exactly "
"where to strike their prey."
msgstr "마인드 플레이어 해부학...중요한 과목이다. 최고의 사냥꾼은 사냥감의 어딜 노려야 할 지 정확히 아는 법이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_AnatomicalSketchesComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c1bac892-bf49-40cb-965e-8c97c975f0d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_AnatomicalSketchesComment:c1bac892-bf49-40cb-965e-8c97c975f0d2
msgctxt "h4ab84e41ga7c0g47c4g899bgca3ddc8e94c9"
msgid ""
"Is that what a mind flayer looks like on the inside? As if the outside "
"wasn't disturbing enough."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_Combat_TeacherAbilityReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e1abecb6-6acc-4148-a4c5-25e8343d7053
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_Combat_TeacherAbilityReaction:e1abecb6-6acc-4148-a4c5-25e8343d7053
msgctxt "h04fc1046g232ag4fd4gb9c8gf0d5f2f504b8"
msgid "He's guiding his students. They look sharper now - hungry for blood."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_Combat_TeacherAbilityReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e1abecb6-6acc-4148-a4c5-25e8343d7053
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_Combat_TeacherAbilityReaction:e1abecb6-6acc-4148-a4c5-25e8343d7053
msgctxt "h9eebb4b9g3698g49e0g89c7gd48783c3aa34"
msgid "The pupils hang on his every move. Don't underestimate them."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_Combat_TeacherAbilityReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e1abecb6-6acc-4148-a4c5-25e8343d7053
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_Combat_TeacherAbilityReaction:e1abecb6-6acc-4148-a4c5-25e8343d7053
msgctxt "h7cd37bcfg0cc4g4396gabdeg96df1c0b3fe7"
msgid ""
"There's no sharper foe than an ambitious student. Keep eyes on teacher and "
"pupils alike."
msgstr "야심찬 훈련생들은 가장 예리한 적이지. 교관, 그리고 훈련생들도 잘 주시해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_Combat_TeacherAbilityReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e1abecb6-6acc-4148-a4c5-25e8343d7053
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_Combat_TeacherAbilityReaction:e1abecb6-6acc-4148-a4c5-25e8343d7053
msgctxt "h97d3283dg7ad5g4d64gb919g0d88eef0ac98"
msgid "Those students are under his spell - makes them more dangerous for us."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_Combat_TeacherAbilityReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e1abecb6-6acc-4148-a4c5-25e8343d7053
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_Combat_TeacherAbilityReaction:e1abecb6-6acc-4148-a4c5-25e8343d7053
msgctxt "h4cad8451g2338g44d7gaf4fg6e6c6813fe00"
msgid "Watch it. The students are as fanatical as their teacher."
msgstr "조심해. 훈련생들도 교관만큼이나 광신적이니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_Combat_TeacherAbilityReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e1abecb6-6acc-4148-a4c5-25e8343d7053
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_Combat_TeacherAbilityReaction:e1abecb6-6acc-4148-a4c5-25e8343d7053
msgctxt "hc2954b24g7922g44b9g913eg7dfd62a7e014"
msgid "Loyal pupils - all the more dangerous."
msgstr "충성스러운 훈련생들...더 위험해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_Combat_TeacherAbilityReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e1abecb6-6acc-4148-a4c5-25e8343d7053
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_Combat_TeacherAbilityReaction:e1abecb6-6acc-4148-a4c5-25e8343d7053
msgctxt "hef5a50a5g1ab3g4a3cgbf44g59cac7e7fe62"
msgid "He holds sway over his pupils. They will kill for him - die for him."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_Combat_TeacherAbilityReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e1abecb6-6acc-4148-a4c5-25e8343d7053
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_Combat_TeacherAbilityReaction:e1abecb6-6acc-4148-a4c5-25e8343d7053
msgctxt "h6cc2b831g2771g40c1g81edgf23156323736"
msgid "They'll do their teacher's bidding. Bad for us."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_TrainingDummyComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 36144f8e-f8fb-47b3-83ec-5fc925147c7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_TrainingDummyComment:36144f8e-f8fb-47b3-83ec-5fc925147c7c
msgctxt "h14581cbbgbe38g43a2g87ccg938d728c5252"
msgid ""
"The only doll in a githyanki crèche is an illithid practice dummy.  "
"<i>Shock.</i>"
msgstr "기스양키 클리셰에 있는 유일한 인형이 훈련용 일리시드 모형이라니. <i>충격적이네.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_TrainingDummyComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 36144f8e-f8fb-47b3-83ec-5fc925147c7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_TrainingDummyComment:36144f8e-f8fb-47b3-83ec-5fc925147c7c
msgctxt "h3f81c4eegc062g4a86g8e44gd924486ad2d4"
msgid ""
"We trained on effigies just like this in Crèche K'liir. The reward for "
"destroying one? Crafting a replacement."
msgstr "클리셰 클리르에서도 이런 모형을 가지고 훈련을 했었지. 저걸 파괴하면 어떤 보상을 받았냐고? 하나를 더 만들어야 했다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_TrainingDummyComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 36144f8e-f8fb-47b3-83ec-5fc925147c7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_TrainingDummyComment:36144f8e-f8fb-47b3-83ec-5fc925147c7c
msgctxt "h2ff2c87egf34dg4d9eg9a0bg049466ae794e"
msgid "Not sure a real mind flayer would accept such punishment."
msgstr "진짜 마인드 플레이어도 이런 처벌을 용인할 지 모르겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_TrainingDummyComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 36144f8e-f8fb-47b3-83ec-5fc925147c7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_TrainingDummyComment:36144f8e-f8fb-47b3-83ec-5fc925147c7c
msgctxt "hb361956cgf371g4d94g9517gb70e7df32592"
msgid ""
"A mind flayer target dummy. Not quite as intimidating as the real thing."
msgstr "표적용 마인드 플레이어 모형. 진짜만큼 위협적이지는 않네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_TrainingDummyComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 36144f8e-f8fb-47b3-83ec-5fc925147c7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_TrainingDummyComment:36144f8e-f8fb-47b3-83ec-5fc925147c7c
msgctxt "hade42095ga625g4b43g9a9dgd0522e282667"
msgid ""
"Mind flayer training dummy? Makes sense. The githyanki despise all things "
"illithid."
msgstr "훈련용 마인드 플레이어 모형? 있을 법도 하지. 기스양키들은 일리시드의 모든 것을 경멸하니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_TrainingDummyComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 36144f8e-f8fb-47b3-83ec-5fc925147c7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_TrainingDummyComment:36144f8e-f8fb-47b3-83ec-5fc925147c7c
msgctxt "h1500c217g7dc5g4148g8232gcc42ae6af9e9"
msgid "Hah. It's kind of cute."
msgstr "하, 꽤 귀여운데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_TrainingDummyComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 36144f8e-f8fb-47b3-83ec-5fc925147c7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_TrainingDummyComment:36144f8e-f8fb-47b3-83ec-5fc925147c7c
msgctxt "h8aedb299g2e94g44cdg9b59gbbdecd6ca7c9"
msgid "I assume the genuine article is more intimidating."
msgstr "원본이 아마 더 위협적이겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_TrainingDummyComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 36144f8e-f8fb-47b3-83ec-5fc925147c7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_TrainingDummyComment:36144f8e-f8fb-47b3-83ec-5fc925147c7c
msgctxt "h088e7e7bg6be0g445agbff2g41b437d5ecc7"
msgid ""
"A <i>ghaik</i> training dummy. Practically tore my wrist off practising on "
"one of these as a child. "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_TrainingDummyComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 36144f8e-f8fb-47b3-83ec-5fc925147c7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_PAD_TrainingDummyComment:36144f8e-f8fb-47b3-83ec-5fc925147c7c
msgctxt "h7271f088g8999g4217ga6ddgb36a4550ff16"
msgid "A mind flayer dummy. Good for practising on."
msgstr "마인드 플레이어 모형. 훈련하기에 좋겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student01
#. Speaker = Youth Ba'akreth
#. NodeID = 0da00ae4-0882-7048-cc7b-e6071b4455ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Student01(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BoySpared = True
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BackToClass = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Student01(1) = True
#. TagRule: !GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student01:0da00ae4-0882-7048-cc7b-e6071b4455ee
msgctxt "h320427afg95c5g4b7ag9644ge96c9641d0a2"
msgid "Sa'varsh Kethk always said this plane was full of weaklings. Ha."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student01
#. Speaker = Youth Ba'akreth
#. NodeID = 0da00ae4-0882-7048-cc7b-e6071b4455ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Student01(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BoySpared = True
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BackToClass = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Student01(1) = True
#. TagRule: GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student01:0da00ae4-0882-7048-cc7b-e6071b4455ee
msgctxt "h5e382a26g6e9dg460dg98b5g998ca102c030"
msgid ""
"Is that how the weakest hatchlings are treated in your crèche? I suppose "
"that explains why you made it out alive."
msgstr "너희 양성소에서는 가장 약한 아이를 그렇게 대하나? 그래서 네가 살아남을 수 있었나 보군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student01
#. Speaker = Youth Ba'akreth
#. NodeID = 9273fb2f-8abc-2cd2-1815-7833e6386b61
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Student01(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BoyNonFatal = True
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BackToClass = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Student01(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student01:9273fb2f-8abc-2cd2-1815-7833e6386b61
msgctxt "h0eff4413g491eg44a1ga701g7b81ea6065eb"
msgid "Why didn't you stab him properly? "
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student01
#. Speaker = Youth Ba'akreth
#. NodeID = 9617b71b-9b0c-7395-5157-ec12d900606c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet2_Student01(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BackToClass = False
#. TagRule: !()
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student01:9617b71b-9b0c-7395-5157-ec12d900606c
msgctxt "hb4873b72g1cc6g43e4g9614g1422d1d4cf3b"
msgid "Stop bothering me. I'm trying to concentrate!"
msgstr "나 좀 그만 귀찮게 해. 집중하려고 한다고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student01
#. Speaker = Youth Ba'akreth
#. NodeID = a2b3bb12-9b57-724c-166c-49a0c7b4cdf5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet2_Student01(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BackToClass = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet2_Student01(1) = True
#. TagRule: !GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student01:a2b3bb12-9b57-724c-166c-49a0c7b4cdf5
msgctxt "hc575db37g2af9g4faagbcb8g4c791097e778"
msgid "Stop distracting me, <i>istik. </i>I'm missing the lesson."
msgstr "날 방해하지 마라, <i>이스틱</i>. 너 때문에 수업을 놓치고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student01
#. Speaker = Youth Ba'akreth
#. NodeID = a2b3bb12-9b57-724c-166c-49a0c7b4cdf5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet2_Student01(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BackToClass = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet2_Student01(1) = True
#. TagRule: GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student01:a2b3bb12-9b57-724c-166c-49a0c7b4cdf5
msgctxt "hcf8f66c1g26b4g46e2g8c05ge3c113d1ec42"
msgid ""
"If you're here to see the <i>sa'varsh</i>, you'll have to wait until he's "
"'made his point.'"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student01
#. Speaker = Youth Ba'akreth
#. NodeID = b41bc979-8087-57c5-4d1c-b4a9466af9bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student01:b41bc979-8087-57c5-4d1c-b4a9466af9bb
msgctxt "h1e2041f6g0801g4f6ega63ag7f3f72165cf1"
msgid "All that waiting around, just to watch Varrl take a nap."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student01
#. Speaker = Youth Ba'akreth
#. NodeID = d3c24cff-a08d-4090-add0-7e2a90251f36
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Student01(1) = True
#. TagRule: !GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student01:d3c24cff-a08d-4090-add0-7e2a90251f36
msgctxt "h2a544a31g4c01g4f3bgba57gd54acd441e0b"
msgid ""
"If you keep interrupting me with a dagger in my hand, I might have an "
"accident, <i>istik</i>."
msgstr "손에 단검을 들고 있는 나를 계속 방해한다면, 난 사고를 칠지도 몰라, <i>이스틱</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student01
#. Speaker = Youth Ba'akreth
#. NodeID = d3c24cff-a08d-4090-add0-7e2a90251f36
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Student01(1) = True
#. TagRule: GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student01:d3c24cff-a08d-4090-add0-7e2a90251f36
msgctxt "h240aba0dgbfd5g4652gade1gc7388aca90d4"
msgid ""
"Please. I have a dagger in my hand. I'd hate to injure an honoured guest "
"from another crèche."
msgstr "부탁입니다. 전 단검을 가지고 있습니다. 다른 양성소에서 오신 소중한 손님을 다치게 하고 싶지 않습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student01
#. Speaker = Youth Ba'akreth
#. NodeID = ddca88e1-773f-4ea1-920b-01ae9c24e8ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Student01(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BackToClass = True
#.   Object:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BoyKilledAccidentallyByPlayer(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Student01(1) = True
#. TagRule: !GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student01:ddca88e1-773f-4ea1-920b-01ae9c24e8ee
msgctxt "h5c0e5d0eg9f62g4c73gbfb0ge4db527242e4"
msgid "Not bad, <i>istik</i>. Not good enough to join our ranks though."
msgstr "나쁘지 않군, <i>이스틱</i>. 우리 수준까지 올 정도는 아니지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student01
#. Speaker = Youth Ba'akreth
#. NodeID = ddca88e1-773f-4ea1-920b-01ae9c24e8ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Student01(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BackToClass = True
#.   Object:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BoyKilledAccidentallyByPlayer(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Student01(1) = True
#. TagRule: GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student01:ddca88e1-773f-4ea1-920b-01ae9c24e8ee
msgctxt "ha2de8344gf01ag428cg81e4g023110b47e39"
msgid ""
"I liked your technique. Not how I would have done it, but still quite "
"impressive."
msgstr "내 기술은 맘에 들었어. 나라면 그렇게 안 했겠지만, 그래도 꽤 인상 깊군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student01
#. Speaker = Youth Ba'akreth
#. NodeID = ee0cb143-c48f-9f68-a22f-ddf1f8e1dc87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Student01(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BoyKilledByTeacher = True
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BackToClass = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Student01(1) = True
#. TagRule: !()
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student01:ee0cb143-c48f-9f68-a22f-ddf1f8e1dc87
msgctxt "h73db2076g6b84g49e6ga584g9a128561f275"
msgid "Did you see that? The look on Varrl's face when the blade went in..."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student02
#. Speaker = Youth Astyl
#. NodeID = 0ef5f650-862c-877b-1436-2d73d108b043
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student02:0ef5f650-862c-877b-1436-2d73d108b043
msgctxt "h522d3bafg8cbfg4d28g973fg019482d1906a"
msgid "He's so powerful and wise. No wonder Vlaakith puts such faith in him."
msgstr "그는 정말로 강하고 현명합니다. 블라키스께서 그토록 신뢰하시는 것도 당연하죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student02
#. Speaker = Youth Astyl
#. NodeID = 336ddfcc-9227-9417-eb49-6bea1a186c69
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet2_Student02(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BackToClass = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet2_Student02(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student02:336ddfcc-9227-9417-eb49-6bea1a186c69
msgctxt "h92e713acga9cdg4188g9cebg03ddbde62a9c"
msgid "Are you here to learn from our <i>sa'varsh? </i>"
msgstr "<i>사바쉬 </i>의 가르침을 구하러 오셨습니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student02
#. Speaker = Youth Astyl
#. NodeID = 47af571a-c6ce-68ab-86b0-393984ea2875
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Student02(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student02:47af571a-c6ce-68ab-86b0-393984ea2875
msgctxt "he70defefg3725g4669gbcb5g715457d9abad"
msgid "I have to get on with my drills. I've already lost so much time."
msgstr "훈련을 계속 해야 해. 벌써 많은 시간을 허비했다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student02
#. Speaker = Youth Astyl
#. NodeID = 5fd075b6-40dc-94d2-f227-f953502d8d57
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet2_Student02(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BackToClass = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student02:5fd075b6-40dc-94d2-f227-f953502d8d57
msgctxt "hbad41b73g8935g4d07g9971ga619864500f2"
msgid ""
"Even when we fail, we serve Vlaakith. Varrl's weakness will become our "
"strength."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student02
#. Speaker = Youth Astyl
#. NodeID = 83418c16-f4b2-9152-120c-8ba1c8c6f1bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student02:83418c16-f4b2-9152-120c-8ba1c8c6f1bf
msgctxt "hc43c8e33g9c64g4e03ga128g0f56b3928bcc"
msgid "Thrust, then parry. Or was it parry, then thrust?"
msgstr "찌르고, 그 다음 막기. 아님 막기 다음 찌르기였나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student02
#. Speaker = Youth Astyl
#. NodeID = a26ea0d7-8b07-92b0-1d5e-10170dc57cb0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Student02(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BoyKilledByStudent = False
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BackToClass = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Student02(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student02:a26ea0d7-8b07-92b0-1d5e-10170dc57cb0
msgctxt "h1fd12d92g0c23g41cdgb9b9g90b247ce8aef"
msgid "Sa'varsh Kethk is a wonderful teacher."
msgstr "사바쉬 케틱은 훌륭한 스승이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student02
#. Speaker = Youth Astyl
#. NodeID = a2fec225-202a-ffea-9674-04494c74f2c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student02:a2fec225-202a-ffea-9674-04494c74f2c9
msgctxt "h627b9ce7g7138g4939g8573g110cddd3b638"
msgid "When I get my silver sword, <i>jhe'stil</i>, I'll dedicate it to him."
msgstr "언젠가 <i>제'스틸</i>, 은검을 하사 받으면 그분께 바치리라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student02
#. Speaker = Youth Astyl
#. NodeID = a2fec225-202a-ffea-9674-04494c74f2c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student02:a2fec225-202a-ffea-9674-04494c74f2c9
msgctxt "hc593b534gbd59g43e1gb883g7c08ce7937ec"
msgid "He'd happily help you improve your technique, <i>istik.</i>"
msgstr "그분은 네놈의 기술을 기꺼이 향상시켜주실 것이다, <i>이스틱.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student02
#. Speaker = Youth Astyl
#. NodeID = adcdf3a5-d4d9-53b0-ea07-5f23cb437f78
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Student02(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BoyKilledByStudent = True
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BackToClass = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Student02(1) = True
#. TagRule: !GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student02:adcdf3a5-d4d9-53b0-ea07-5f23cb437f78
msgctxt "hce95fe7dga6eag4f55gbdedg99cf3294fe29"
msgid ""
"My technique let me down. Thank Vlaakith the <i>sa'varsh</i> is here to "
"correct me."
msgstr "제 스스로도 제 기술이 실망스럽습니다. 제 잘못을 고쳐 줄 <i>사바쉬</i>가 계심에 감사합니다. 블라키스여."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student02
#. Speaker = Youth Astyl
#. NodeID = adcdf3a5-d4d9-53b0-ea07-5f23cb437f78
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Student02(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BoyKilledByStudent = True
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BackToClass = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Student02(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student02:adcdf3a5-d4d9-53b0-ea07-5f23cb437f78
msgctxt "h85e7f5aeg7c9cg4c65g9060g6b5ace5cfb94"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry you witnessed my failure, <i>jhe'stil</i>. Thank Vlaakith the "
"<i>sa'varsh</i> is here to correct me."
msgstr ""
"실패하는 걸 보시게 해서 죄송합니다. <i>제'스틸</i>. 제 잘못을 고쳐 줄 <i>사바쉬</i>가 계심에 감사합니다. 블라키스여."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student03
#. Speaker = Youth Zar'a'ath
#. NodeID = 2053df1a-f8bf-4b1b-a6f7-09d2185d4b82
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Student03(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BackToClass = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Student03(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student03:2053df1a-f8bf-4b1b-a6f7-09d2185d4b82
msgctxt "h03da1c9egaecag4551g958dg4662d024b26c"
msgid "I love fighting with daggers. It's so <i>personal</i>."
msgstr "난 단검으로 싸우는 게 좋아. 그건 좀 더 <i>개인적</i>이거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student03
#. Speaker = Youth Zar'a'ath
#. NodeID = 2d605771-7e6e-4d7b-acf7-982c39c27831
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Student03(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = False
#. TagRule: !()
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student03:2d605771-7e6e-4d7b-acf7-982c39c27831
msgctxt "h9d591336g580dg4be4gaa40g25ed8e182125"
msgid ""
"You're not capable of joining our practice <i>istik</i>. Don't even try."
msgstr "넌 우리의 훈련에 어울리지 않아 <i>이스틱</i>. 꿈도 꾸지 말라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student03
#. Speaker = Youth Zar'a'ath
#. NodeID = 32bcea7b-a0ac-cf3a-f0ca-d7bc532d23f4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student03:32bcea7b-a0ac-cf3a-f0ca-d7bc532d23f4
msgctxt "h2534fe9ag773fg4e5bgbe0dgf4dfe11411f9"
msgid "You're close enough to see the light go out behind their eyes."
msgstr "상대의 눈 너머로 빛이 꺼져가는 걸 볼 수 있을 정도로 가까우니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student03
#. Speaker = Youth Zar'a'ath
#. NodeID = 34c84fd9-18c2-d6f3-0d62-9c1314a6b65a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student03:34c84fd9-18c2-d6f3-0d62-9c1314a6b65a
msgctxt "hc0d34290g17e6g43b1gb0f9g96fa9e4b0f2b"
msgid "Wait your turn. If anyone's beating up Varrl next, it's me."
msgstr "순서를 지켜. 다음번에 바를을 꺾는 사람이 나타난다면 바로 나니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student03
#. Speaker = Youth Zar'a'ath
#. NodeID = 3e0a703b-2d57-5c7f-5a82-3d1cc6e6e874
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student03:3e0a703b-2d57-5c7f-5a82-3d1cc6e6e874
msgctxt "h8b2be117g9af9g42a8g99a0g64757ae13eae"
msgid "I'll help you practice if you like. I won't hurt you. Much."
msgstr "원한다면 연습을 도와줄 수도 있어. 봐주면서 할게. 적당히."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student03
#. Speaker = Youth Zar'a'ath
#. NodeID = 6630e872-251a-cd04-9708-57f45f742485
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet2_Student03(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BackToClass = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student03:6630e872-251a-cd04-9708-57f45f742485
msgctxt "hb18b7c6cg29eeg4b4aga1f1g20a3280c2d7a"
msgid "At this rate, there won't be anything left of him."
msgstr "이대로라면 아무것도 건지지 못할걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student03
#. Speaker = Youth Zar'a'ath
#. NodeID = 9025d29e-8b3c-4bc8-5e21-bd71cb03e99d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet2_Student03(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BackToClass = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet2_Student03(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student03:9025d29e-8b3c-4bc8-5e21-bd71cb03e99d
msgctxt "heff85ddbg1c32g45b2g93d6gdb50e31ed336"
msgid "Come to join in the fun?"
msgstr "재미 좀 보러 왔어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student03
#. Speaker = Youth Zar'a'ath
#. NodeID = bb88d75f-52c8-88af-3985-bc0a9a4d390b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Student03(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#. TagRule: !()
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student03:bb88d75f-52c8-88af-3985-bc0a9a4d390b
msgctxt "h7ced1c3fg617bg4ae9gbd1dg4a9c261cf9cc"
msgid "You don't look that strong, for someone who survived their training."
msgstr "훈련을 견디고 살아남은 사람 치고는 그렇게 강해 보이지 않는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student04
#. Speaker = Youth Rheg'zel
#. NodeID = 2dcf49f7-7578-d6c1-1e98-6916f2979cf3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student04:2dcf49f7-7578-d6c1-1e98-6916f2979cf3
msgctxt "h222b7fe1g74f6g45fcg990bgccaa13378532"
msgid ""
"If you see her, tell her I'm training twice as hard. No, three times as hard!"
msgstr "그녀를 보게 되거든, 내가 훈련 강도를 두 배 늘렸다고 전해 줘. 아니, 세 배나 강하게!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student04
#. Speaker = Youth Rheg'zel
#. NodeID = 658564d0-13cf-e0ac-649e-39ab80d3d13a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student04:658564d0-13cf-e0ac-649e-39ab80d3d13a
msgctxt "he5b87d84g3453g4175g8026g4cd64f7092c3"
msgid "I'm going to double my training. No, triple! I won't waste this chance."
msgstr "두 배로 열심히 수련할 거야. 아니, 세 배! 이 기회를 그냥 놓치지 않겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student04
#. Speaker = Youth Rheg'zel
#. NodeID = 67c086bc-0940-4ef3-8328-b1dd7e1a6667
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Student04(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BackToClass = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student04:67c086bc-0940-4ef3-8328-b1dd7e1a6667
msgctxt "hf91f5dd6gc46dg4a73ga71ag02afa6badb4a"
msgid "What if I lose again? I have to train harder."
msgstr "또 지게 되면? 더 열심히 수련에 임해야만 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student04
#. Speaker = Youth Rheg'zel
#. NodeID = 76698a80-4b69-a95a-27e1-90f8fcd9eac0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student04:76698a80-4b69-a95a-27e1-90f8fcd9eac0
msgctxt "ha091b790g7335g4153ga920g5c1c41d558f0"
msgid "The <i>sa'varsh</i> will make our lives miserable."
msgstr "<i>사바쉬</i>는 우리 삶을 비참하게 짓뭉개고 말 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student04
#. Speaker = Youth Rheg'zel
#. NodeID = 84a2f916-2c5c-4591-b046-29fd6c9ca6ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Student04(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BackToClass = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Student04(1) = True
#. TagRule: !GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student04:84a2f916-2c5c-4591-b046-29fd6c9ca6ca
msgctxt "h0374af84gd661g4b4cga6f9g6239eb56e361"
msgid "What do I do? I failed the <i>sa'varsh</i>, I failed Vlaakith herself!"
msgstr "뭘 할 수 있겠어? 난 <i>사바쉬</i>를 실망시켰고, 블라키스 폐하를 실망시켰는데!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student04
#. Speaker = Youth Rheg'zel
#. NodeID = 84a2f916-2c5c-4591-b046-29fd6c9ca6ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Student04(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BackToClass = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Student04(1) = True
#. TagRule: GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student04:84a2f916-2c5c-4591-b046-29fd6c9ca6ca
msgctxt "h3a23c2ebgbcc7g4d64gb4e6g190331210b49"
msgid "Are you from another crèche? Do you know Vlaakith?"
msgstr "다른 양성소에서 왔다고? 그럼 블라키스 알아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student04
#. Speaker = Youth Rheg'zel
#. NodeID = c2e89b28-2cfc-79ee-fab9-57fe47fef790
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet2_Student04(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BackToClass = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student04:c2e89b28-2cfc-79ee-fab9-57fe47fef790
msgctxt "h197980e2ged19g4581g881dg2ad764297598"
msgid "Leave me alone. I need to think."
msgstr "내버려둬. 생각 좀 하게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student04
#. Speaker = Youth Rheg'zel
#. NodeID = ca823904-bfe5-a728-61f0-28f522abd6a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet2_Student04(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BackToClass = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet2_Student04(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Student04:ca823904-bfe5-a728-61f0-28f522abd6a3
msgctxt "h39efe03fg5f6dg4932g9627gc783992bbc3f"
msgid "Stupid Varrl. Why didn't he just kill me?"
msgstr "바를, 멍청한 놈. 왜 그냥 날 죽여버리지 않았지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Youth Varrl
#. NodeID = 02e7daa0-b236-7fbc-0077-be185d04bd72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:02e7daa0-b236-7fbc-0077-be185d04bd72
msgctxt "haf5f0eeeg912fg4ddag864fgdaeb94c69d65"
msgid "I - I refuse. There has to be a better way -"
msgstr "저- 전 거부합니다. 더 나은 방법이 있을 거예요 -"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 07f00c62-0540-5e28-5109-6ab443145b07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_LeftAfterSeeingScene = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:07f00c62-0540-5e28-5109-6ab443145b07
msgctxt "h9c5166bfgeff8g49acgb58cg2a0208433605"
msgid ""
"<i>K'chakhi!</i> We are training to fight <i>ghaik</i>. You think they will "
"hesitate?"
msgstr "<i>크차키!</i> 우린 <i>게이크</i>와의 전투를 대비하는 거다. 그들이 조금이라도 망설일 것 같나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 08b85581-d653-86a8-d009-5c66f9e1c58b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:08b85581-d653-86a8-d009-5c66f9e1c58b
msgctxt "h2cdcd2b2g4e1cg4adbga33bg13943d8d982b"
msgid "An interesting proposition."
msgstr "흥미로운 제안이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 091f3a90-bd7a-4080-b62b-3aee824a46a8
#. HandlePath = RollAdvantageReason
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Dexterity
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:091f3a90-bd7a-4080-b62b-3aee824a46a8
msgctxt "hc0014a3bga8d2g4391g842agac38e4222bcd"
msgid "Githyanki"
msgstr "기스양키"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 091f3a90-bd7a-4080-b62b-3aee824a46a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Dexterity
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(3) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_DARK_URGE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:091f3a90-bd7a-4080-b62b-3aee824a46a8
msgctxt "hef5fb5f7ga58ag4a5dg82a9g1149ef54839d"
msgid "<i>Try to stop yourself. Attack without killing him.</i>"
msgstr "<i>자제력을 발휘합니다. 그가 죽지 않을 정도로만 공격합니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 091f3a90-bd7a-4080-b62b-3aee824a46a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Dexterity
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:091f3a90-bd7a-4080-b62b-3aee824a46a8
msgctxt "h651bf634g3db5g45e3ga44dg8f67df51cf94"
msgid "<i>Make a non-fatal attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>급소만 피해서 공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 0f6f9cd5-91d0-7ca3-b5dd-a2f7fd70029c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:0f6f9cd5-91d0-7ca3-b5dd-a2f7fd70029c
msgctxt "h50aa752bg91b5g4e60gb843g242f7c936bd0"
msgid "Yes, a demonstration may be just what's needed."
msgstr "그래, 시범이 딱 필요할지도 모르겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0fc42407-6b13-937b-dc9a-7c5e1958358d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:0fc42407-6b13-937b-dc9a-7c5e1958358d
msgctxt "h9f341156g15a7g4c53ga648g4a462e20e444"
msgid "<i>End him! Shred him with a daggered dance!</i>"
msgstr "<i>죽인다! 춤추는 듯 한 칼솜씨로 그를 갈가리 찢는다!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 0ffb30a8-6d4a-6c67-36d5-075cbc8d1cc2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BoySpared = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:0ffb30a8-6d4a-6c67-36d5-075cbc8d1cc2
msgctxt "h6629bddbg51eeg4971gad2dgbbf1ae6154a1"
msgid "I suppose your inane spewings have distracted enough from my lesson."
msgstr "네 무례한 말투가 내 수업을 충분히 방해한 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 187c2dae-b71f-efc9-c614-ae3f0e432c44
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(3) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:187c2dae-b71f-efc9-c614-ae3f0e432c44
msgctxt "h7d360bbdge509g4ebdg995egfe2996a4d556"
msgid "There's no honour in killing a defenceless boy."
msgstr "무방비한 소년을 죽이는 건 불명예스러운 일이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 1995c527-a25a-3675-62a0-55b9315fb885
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:1995c527-a25a-3675-62a0-55b9315fb885
msgctxt "hd9bc21b9ga4e0g4290g9579g6e1149c0b6bc"
msgid ""
"*The boy appears considerably less... alive than you were anticipating.*"
msgstr "*소년이 생각한 것보단 훨씬 덜... 괜찮아 보입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 1ca7fb61-a8c1-c775-6356-42e44e4b3681
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_Event_BoyHealedDuringBeating(3) = True
#. TagRule: GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:1ca7fb61-a8c1-c775-6356-42e44e4b3681
msgctxt "he8e17ff0gfa26g4e2fga46fg9fc6a16dfac6"
msgid ""
"This is no concern of yours. I'm simply demonstrating what happens when we "
"fail to follow orders."
msgstr "이건 너와 상관 없는 일이다. 난 단지 우리가 명령을 따르지 않았을 땐 어떤 일이 일어나는지 보여주고 있을 뿐이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 1ca7fb61-a8c1-c775-6356-42e44e4b3681
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_Event_BoyHealedDuringBeating(3) = True
#. TagRule: !GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:1ca7fb61-a8c1-c775-6356-42e44e4b3681
msgctxt "hbd42c506g1e93g4c84g998bg8cb528433a01"
msgid ""
"Stay out of this, <i>istik</i>. They need to learn what happens when they "
"fail to follow orders."
msgstr "개입하지 마라, <i>이스틱</i>. 명령을 따르지 않았을 땐 어떤 일이 일어나는지 배워야 하니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 23e1342b-9469-6157-2a24-c8982285303f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:23e1342b-9469-6157-2a24-c8982285303f
msgctxt "h139d1be7g9d78g4545g93d6g23d992c0d2b9"
msgid "But as we seem so intent on doing things differently today, why not?"
msgstr "하지만 오늘은 상황이 좀 다르게 흘러가는 것 같으니, 왜 안 되겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26b91e4c-c593-e199-23f7-4805ef9cdf5d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_DARK_URGE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:26b91e4c-c593-e199-23f7-4805ef9cdf5d
msgctxt "heb33b1d3gee0fg407bg94c4g9a223e6839a7"
msgid "<i>Stand back and relish the blood-show.</i>"
msgstr "<i>물러서서 피의 공연을 즐긴다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26b91e4c-c593-e199-23f7-4805ef9cdf5d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:26b91e4c-c593-e199-23f7-4805ef9cdf5d
msgctxt "hbdede747gd778g421cg90ceg7916885bee73"
msgid "<i>Watch what happens.</i>"
msgstr "<i>무슨 일이 벌어지는지 지켜본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 27bd9d63-27a0-f346-6058-3e2f70a605fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:27bd9d63-27a0-f346-6058-3e2f70a605fd
msgctxt "h8e46bee8g351cg4c49g8182g597be121d17b"
msgid "Another who lacks the nerve? It seems Varrl's idiocy is contagious."
msgstr "너도 용기가 부족한 게냐? 바를의 멍청함은 전염되는 건가 보군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 29b82529-ed1a-8067-be93-27bbdf5e5244
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:29b82529-ed1a-8067-be93-27bbdf5e5244
msgctxt "hd0a66f5fgfda5g4f3cg8ba2gbfcb3c0c523b"
msgid "Silence! It seems your childish prattling is attracting an audience."
msgstr "닥쳐라! 네 유치한 잡담이 관중을 끌어들인 것 같으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 326cb416-1b06-dd09-39a2-bb75353b0190
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BoyKilledByStudent = True
#.     - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BoyDead = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:326cb416-1b06-dd09-39a2-bb75353b0190
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h80ac6d64g315eg46cbg920agcbf91d6afa82"
msgid ""
"You dropped your guard on your weak side and were completely open to an off-"
"hand counter."
msgstr "넌 약한 쪽의 가드를 놓쳤고, 보조 무기 반격에 완전히 노출되었다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 33ac5264-e58a-4eee-3fcd-17694d1bc7c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - e3e6e6b8-3ef9-e4b2-4feb-b89e31e85db5_LaezelComment = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:33ac5264-e58a-4eee-3fcd-17694d1bc7c6
msgctxt "ha514a4ddg923fg4aa9g84c4gd135a33569d7"
msgid "One bad egg does not reflect the true power of Crèche <i>Y'llek</i>."
msgstr "하나의 못난 알 따위가 양성소 <i>일레크</i>의 진정한 힘을 드러내진 않지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 35ded08a-5187-5432-1608-f9c551df7208
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Dexterity
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(3) = True
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(3) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:35ded08a-5187-5432-1608-f9c551df7208
msgctxt "h93741d88gf07ag4b21gb074ga71b2bbc9c9c"
msgid "<i>Try to stop yourself. Attack without killing him.</i>"
msgstr "<i>자제력을 발휘합니다. 그가 죽지 않을 정도로만 공격합니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 3bf3888e-4b4a-eba2-87ef-c3c7ea15a4a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - CRE_YouthTraining_Event_StudentPicksUpBoy = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:3bf3888e-4b4a-eba2-87ef-c3c7ea15a4a2
msgctxt "ha93fc330gdad7g47adga9c2g0df05086ed27"
msgid "Move him out of the way. We've wasted enough time already."
msgstr "저리 치워버려라. 이미 시간을 너무 많이 낭비했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 401c923d-6cef-f285-c1a5-babb18d24523
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:401c923d-6cef-f285-c1a5-babb18d24523
msgctxt "h9dc5ddd8g21d6g4a57ga437g639f79bbbe77"
msgid ""
"I'd bring him to the edge of death. Leave him asking why he deserves to live."
msgstr "죽음의 문턱까지 데려가 주지. 살아야만 하는 이유를 대야 할 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 41805fc6-b299-e235-c6f2-86a5351f5960
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:41805fc6-b299-e235-c6f2-86a5351f5960
msgctxt "h5e724c20g3cb7g4216g8870geecc8e0500be"
msgid ""
"I hope you do not prove this weak should we share a battlefield, "
"<i>ra'stil</i>."
msgstr "전장에선 이렇게 약한 모습을 보이지 않았으면 좋겠군, <i>라스틸</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Youth Varrl
#. NodeID = 43cba25a-dbc0-932d-2ee2-bcdb013b1594
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:43cba25a-dbc0-932d-2ee2-bcdb013b1594
msgctxt "h22e1ae55g8164g4c2fg8a49geb3e5fa54ab3"
msgid "I - I refuse. There has to be a better way -"
msgstr "저- 전 거부합니다. 더 나은 방법이 있을 거예요 -"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 45e0ac4a-0871-1569-61d4-a434b6f89fe8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Dexterity
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(3) = False
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(3) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:45e0ac4a-0871-1569-61d4-a434b6f89fe8
msgctxt "hcae8b857gfa44g4ca9g8902g42c24844d037"
msgid "<i>Make a non-fatal attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>급소만 피해서 공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4c2bc5fd-da2b-4d62-0ede-b22d1d39e315
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:4c2bc5fd-da2b-4d62-0ede-b22d1d39e315
msgctxt "h50e2208dgd68cg42e5g8d37g5b8a8e3a1ed7"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 53cd248d-56b6-2016-9c16-8c079f7665a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_DarkUrge_Event_ResistedUrge(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:53cd248d-56b6-2016-9c16-8c079f7665a2
msgctxt "h54b86b3agc9b1g406cg9143g148de7cb15a1"
msgid ""
"*You skilfully avoid hitting any major organs, but apparently it was enough. "
"He's out cold.*"
msgstr "*당신은 능숙하게 주요 장기를 피해 타격하지만, 충분히 치명적이었나봅니다. 그는 의식을 잃었습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 5f555e28-6311-484e-8010-1a10fb951ee3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:5f555e28-6311-484e-8010-1a10fb951ee3
msgctxt "he340cc78g3d38g4e6fg8359g39815ea4d1df"
msgid "Well look at you, killer. I didn't know you had it in you."
msgstr "이것 좀 봐, 완전 살인마네. 너한테 그런 면이 있는 줄 몰랐는 걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 61f01e37-216c-613e-15a6-8af72ac66432
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:61f01e37-216c-613e-15a6-8af72ac66432
msgctxt "hdfcd8eaag51abg464fg9de5g1ea59c16011e"
msgid "Who wants to challenge this snivelling <i>is'tark</i>?"
msgstr "누가 이 약해 빠져 보이는 <i>이스탁</i>과 싸우겠느냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 78429703-13fa-eda2-afe0-a35d74e32db6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:78429703-13fa-eda2-afe0-a35d74e32db6
msgctxt "hb6420b08g0639g476dg95f2g2c07f9f460eb"
msgid "What are you waiting for? Begin!"
msgstr "뭘 기다리고 있는 거냐? 시작해!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 7a9f1a7e-a7ed-0b25-9650-9b3cfd3672ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_LeftAfterSeeingScene = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:7a9f1a7e-a7ed-0b25-9650-9b3cfd3672ff
msgctxt "hef3ae624g2c20g4fd1ga4d2g7bb68ee23d31"
msgid ""
"<i>K'chakhi!</i> Why do you keep hesitating? My instructions were clear!"
msgstr "<i> 크차키! </i> 뭘 그렇게 망설이는 거지? 내 지시는 명확했을 텐데!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Youth Varrl
#. NodeID = 801bbbc4-39d4-1f9a-b4e8-d5f7f0ab11ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:801bbbc4-39d4-1f9a-b4e8-d5f7f0ab11ba
msgctxt "ha9d602e1ge87ag4356g9e3eg71642b804d46"
msgid ""
"Because - because they don't make sense! Killing each other like this, it's "
"stupid! Orph-"
msgstr "왜냐면 - 왜냐하면 이상하잖아요! 이렇게 서로 죽이고 있는 건, 바보 같은 짓이에요! 오르페-"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 87a449e8-35be-d225-906a-650a2dab86b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:87a449e8-35be-d225-906a-650a2dab86b7
msgctxt "hfb59a961ge1a8g4523g97fbgab5003221635"
msgid ""
"Go whet the swords. I want them sharp enough to peel a <i>ghaik'</i>s "
"eyeball just by looking at them."
msgstr "가서 검을 갈아라. 쳐다보기만 해도 <i>게이크</i>의 눈깔을 도륙 낼 만큼 날카롭게 만들어 놓거라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 8fec8e22-35d9-c4d7-1eb5-e8bc400d0552
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:8fec8e22-35d9-c4d7-1eb5-e8bc400d0552
msgctxt "h4fe495c4g2c24g4afbg9ebdg95fc1d45283a"
msgid "Yes, let's see how Varrl fares against the skills of a lesser crèche."
msgstr "좋다. 바를이 하급 양성소의 기술을 어떻게 상대하는지 두고 보도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 950b8309-a9da-12d4-a9b5-8b91c37aab2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_DARK_URGE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:950b8309-a9da-12d4-a9b5-8b91c37aab2c
msgctxt "hd03b3eecgc128g4696g9d7dgdcf1746cfd9a"
msgid "<i>Pathetic. He deserves a pathetic death.</i>"
msgstr "<i>애처롭군. 그에겐 애처로운 죽음이 어울립니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 950b8309-a9da-12d4-a9b5-8b91c37aab2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:950b8309-a9da-12d4-a9b5-8b91c37aab2c
msgctxt "h73b6161fgf881g4147gb40egc93042441928"
msgid "<i>The boy's naivety is pathetic. Kill him.</i>"
msgstr "<i>소년의 순진함은 한심할 정도입니다. 그를 죽입니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9825f271-43a6-2b61-3dd9-a1d85c4643c7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(3) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:9825f271-43a6-2b61-3dd9-a1d85c4643c7
msgctxt "hceeffcbag16f7g4980g8cbegebe265142e9e"
msgid "Seems a little murderous to me. I'll pass."
msgstr "나에겐 그냥 살인으로만 느껴지는군. 하지 않겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9c2183c1-28ee-a10b-df42-88542b2795de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:9c2183c1-28ee-a10b-df42-88542b2795de
msgctxt "h3bc539afg57bcg46e7ga71dg0706eb97a1ec"
msgid ""
"If he won't fight, he's useless. Kill him yourself and be done with this."
msgstr "저 녀석이 싸움을 거부한다면, 그야말로 쓸모없는 놈이겠지. 직접 죽여서 끝을 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 9db465ed-1cea-3385-71cb-a9a0ec77f393
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:9db465ed-1cea-3385-71cb-a9a0ec77f393
msgctxt "hcd08ab72ged45g4267gafecg224b2e775d76"
msgid "This is how we deal with a weakened enemy -"
msgstr "약해 빠진 적은 어떻게 처리하는지 보여주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Youth Varrl
#. NodeID = a8186d4c-74f6-133b-818d-9d5382184e4d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:a8186d4c-74f6-133b-818d-9d5382184e4d
msgctxt "he8932ee0gb4d6g4504ga774g804884896577"
msgid ""
"They won't need to, if we keep killing each other for them! It's - it's "
"stupid! Orph-"
msgstr "그들이 왜 망설이겠어요, 우리가 대신 이렇게 서로 죽여주고 있는데! 이- 이건 바보같은 짓이에요! 오르페-"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = a8fc5d9e-6dbb-7e9f-9b4b-4fc4646089ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:a8fc5d9e-6dbb-7e9f-9b4b-4fc4646089ae
msgctxt "hebaf5b11g0781g4bb8gba31ga01a7d2a1d25"
msgid "Why didn't you make the kill? My instructions were clear!"
msgstr "왜 죽이지 않는 것이냐? 내 지시는 명확했을 텐데!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = adaf3694-e23f-7374-5aa5-3c33143d798c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:adaf3694-e23f-7374-5aa5-3c33143d798c
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h5416f7b2gcb2cg445egab81g63a637d0e471"
msgid "And yet here you are, pathetically pleading for the same useless mercy."
msgstr "아직도 그러고 있군, 비참하게 쓸모도 없는 자비를 빌면서 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b1b4d652-1e9b-d9bc-1602-a049db01f853
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 21
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(3) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:b1b4d652-1e9b-d9bc-1602-a049db01f853
msgctxt "h86087b39g9450g4338g8142g120fb5c663b7"
msgid "Leave the boy alone. You made your point."
msgstr "소년은 그만 내버려 두시지. 충분히 알아들었을 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = b2a2e213-7ba3-35fe-397f-c8c84f022ee1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:b2a2e213-7ba3-35fe-397f-c8c84f022ee1
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h6c4b6ee3g6b97g4d34g8af1gfdc202bd9782"
msgid ""
"A true warrior's kill: quick, bloody, and a scream to curdle the stomach "
"juices of Vlaakith herself."
msgstr "이게 진정한 전사의 살육이다: 재빠르게, 피를 뿌리며, 블라키스 님도 놀라실 만한 비명을 지르게 만들지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = bfaad2d0-f824-4bdf-bf0c-f0b17b3971ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:bfaad2d0-f824-4bdf-bf0c-f0b17b3971ab
msgctxt "h29e04643g85e9g4979g9222gc649c7e13526"
msgid "By the good gods, such cruelty. Is your soul truly this sick?"
msgstr "신이시여, 잔혹하기 짝이 없군. 네 영혼은 이렇게도 병들어 있는 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c5774305-d98a-4cc4-dc74-f21d1ec44f2a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 21
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:c5774305-d98a-4cc4-dc74-f21d1ec44f2a
msgctxt "hae46240cg1ef3g4579g831cg9c48ca0f0978"
msgid "No. This is too far. He's learnt his lesson!"
msgstr "안돼. 이건 너무한 것 같아. 그는 이미 교훈을 배웠다고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = c9919727-f2b8-4477-8906-ffd2b30b6346
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e3e6e6b8-3ef9-e4b2-4feb-b89e31e85db5_LaezelComment = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:c9919727-f2b8-4477-8906-ffd2b30b6346
msgctxt "hba32154egc454g4e35gba1fga1a8edb57449"
msgid ""
"Lesser? A Crèche <i>K'liir </i>hatchling would not have <i>dared</i> defy an "
"elder."
msgstr "하급이라고? 양성소 <i>클리르 </i>의 갓난 아이였다면 <i>감히</i> 반항조차 못했을 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Youth Astyl
#. NodeID = cc2de0e9-0f42-48cb-5e37-78f902b20fad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:cc2de0e9-0f42-48cb-5e37-78f902b20fad
msgctxt "h24c95531g3033g40e6g98c5gd4d6fdcd03b2"
msgid "I've been practicing every night, <i>Sa'varsh</i>. Let me have a go."
msgstr "전 매일 밤 연습해왔어요. <i>사바쉬</i>. 제게 기회를 주세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = d285746b-e0a6-a33e-0234-46d8dac62f7a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:d285746b-e0a6-a33e-0234-46d8dac62f7a
msgctxt "h57d0bf64g6c48g4c9ag941dg94da5232a0b8"
msgid ""
"Cowards are not tolerated in our ranks. Though I gather they are welcome in "
"yours."
msgstr "우리 진영에선 겁쟁이들은 용납되지 않는다. 보아하니 너희 무리에겐 환영받는 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = d9f78833-c142-3514-c9fc-15d85d694e35
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(3) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:d9f78833-c142-3514-c9fc-15d85d694e35
msgctxt "h186e960agf474g4fe6gb1f9g6f0f7006de90"
msgid ""
"I hope you prove as weak as this should we meet on the battlefield, "
"<i>istik</i>."
msgstr "전장에서 만나게 되면 지금처럼 약한 모습이길 기대하지, <i>이스틱</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = db404bf3-f525-b3cb-f093-7bab5659f615
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:db404bf3-f525-b3cb-f093-7bab5659f615
msgctxt "h216ef1fag0e25g4aadga95ag69bbca8a67bc"
msgid "<i>G'lyck. </i>Kill him, and put us all out of our misery."
msgstr "<i>길리크</i>. 당장 죽여서, 이 비참함을 좀 끝내거라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = e7c01ebb-fcf3-9937-6b4e-4fbb6381886e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:e7c01ebb-fcf3-9937-6b4e-4fbb6381886e
msgctxt "h6904e5b0g4086g4fd4gbfaegb623cafaf4cb"
msgid ""
"Take a dagger, stranger. This exercise requires nothing more than a blade, "
"and a backbone."
msgstr "단검을 들어라, 이방인. 이 훈련엔 그저 칼과, 결단력만 필요하니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = efc664fe-b92a-7bcd-4362-56416a09f589
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(3) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:efc664fe-b92a-7bcd-4362-56416a09f589
msgctxt "h56e76ca6g5271g4bf2g8c4fg479a7c503729"
msgid "Killing your own soldiers is an odd strategy for winning a war."
msgstr "직접 자기 병사를 죽이는 건 참으로 기묘한 전략이군?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = f5a2a447-27e7-8724-3809-4011a904979a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:f5a2a447-27e7-8724-3809-4011a904979a
msgctxt "h1f0d6193gf7f0g4de4g9782g103b93eb67c1"
msgid ""
"You fight again. This time, daggers only. And to the death as instructed."
msgstr "다시 싸운다! 이번에는, 단검만 사용해라. 그리고 지시한 대로, 죽을 때까지 싸워라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f9e9e35f-c844-01bc-fa52-a85d010dddbc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(3) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:f9e9e35f-c844-01bc-fa52-a85d010dddbc
msgctxt "h401dae9fg6e45g43b2ga156g1f1ebbb39518"
msgid "<i>Offer to fight the boy yourself.</i>"
msgstr "<i>소년에게 직접 싸움을 제안한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = fcd00a9b-8e00-1c28-99d6-5d4c50fb9a6a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:fcd00a9b-8e00-1c28-99d6-5d4c50fb9a6a
msgctxt "ha1a47625g8d98g4f35g9e79ge2993e0ca16f"
msgid "Yet another staggering display of incompetence."
msgstr "또 다른 끔찍한 무능의 표본이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = ffff46e2-93e9-920b-8b88-1f5832a71647
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(3) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_Teacher:ffff46e2-93e9-920b-8b88-1f5832a71647
msgctxt "h9e6013edg5fccg440bg9cc5g769ea422c2bf"
msgid ""
"You? <i>Tsk'va</i>. My students do not waste their time fighting such "
"weaklings."
msgstr "네가? <i>츠크바</i>. 내 학생들은 너같이 약해 빠진 자들에게 시간낭비 하지 않는다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 042ed029-6c29-9285-bfc7-4d192ae643c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Teacher(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:042ed029-6c29-9285-bfc7-4d192ae643c9
msgctxt "h1632f01agb1efg4f1dg9a52gc493816b8d19"
msgid "I must attend to my students. Be on your way."
msgstr "제자 놈들에게 집중해야 한다. 갈 길 가도록."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 06953eb3-a7a4-d876-4346-b3c10228dde1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:06953eb3-a7a4-d876-4346-b3c10228dde1
msgctxt "hb6ed9cd8g078bg413cgb34cgf25eb0d1f8ef"
msgid "For his sake, I hope it was a moment of temporary insanity."
msgstr "녀석을 위해서라도, 일시적으로 혼란스러운 상태였기를 바라마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 07ce1329-f116-7983-7dbe-e89b08ad06f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:07ce1329-f116-7983-7dbe-e89b08ad06f5
msgctxt "hd020113bg39a9g4deegb95dg86ce78702be6"
msgid "Your demonstration was most impressive."
msgstr "인상적인 시범이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 0dae0134-68ec-7807-d267-ea2aefaeb77c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:0dae0134-68ec-7807-d267-ea2aefaeb77c
msgctxt "he62ec095g5379g43fbga723ge0056dbfad55"
msgid ""
"My students earn the most silver swords of any crèche under Vlaakith's "
"command."
msgstr "내 제자들은 블라키스의 명령 아래 어느 양성소보다도 많은 은검을 들어올렸다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0eda9ffd-b075-d86c-1bae-6a9aa5988562
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !()
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:0eda9ffd-b075-d86c-1bae-6a9aa5988562
msgctxt "hedc0f06cg977ag4230ga266g3121fa497bae"
msgid "Your 'lessons' are reprehensible."
msgstr "네 '수업'은 비난받아 마땅하다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 1545ecb9-05d0-7c48-d6cd-4f090988d8bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:1545ecb9-05d0-7c48-d6cd-4f090988d8bf
msgctxt "h0cc693c5g0916g4b64g9680g2ea247af695a"
msgid ""
"If he has not regained his senses by the time he rejoins my training, his "
"return will be a short and painful one."
msgstr "녀석이 내 훈련에 다시 합류할 때까지 제 감각을 회복하지 못하면, 짧고 고통스러운 복귀 과정을 거쳐야 할 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 1aa1b766-9ba1-cb8c-fa1a-3782b4c2f69b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:1aa1b766-9ba1-cb8c-fa1a-3782b4c2f69b
msgctxt "h91044b45g1c24g4751ga6e8gc91dc00c42bd"
msgid ""
"But that is for the <i>kith'rak</i> to worry about. My job is to forge the "
"blade, not to decide how it is wielded."
msgstr "그건 <i>키스락</i>이 걱정할 일이다. 내 일은 검을 제련하는 것이지, 어떻게 휘두를지 결정하는 것이 아닙니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 1c8146f5-d231-bf45-681f-0b103be17a9c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:1c8146f5-d231-bf45-681f-0b103be17a9c
msgctxt "h90416b80g7ab0g4a26ga96bgc51ea3018695"
msgid "I will rectify his behaviour. Swiftly and painfully."
msgstr "놈의 행동을 바로잡을 것이다. 신속하고 고통스럽게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 21038eec-9138-89a6-ed3e-54919e589a56
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:21038eec-9138-89a6-ed3e-54919e589a56
msgctxt "h9e020513gcf5ag49d2ga6a3gfbd61f387e1e"
msgid ""
"That <i>kainchi</i> poet is no more tolerated in my training room than a "
"<i>ghaik </i>would be tolerated on Vlaakith's throne."
msgstr ""
"블라키스의 왕좌에서 <i>게이크 </i>를 묵인할 수는 있어도, 그 <i>케인치</i> 시는 내 훈련장에서 결코 용납되지 않을 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 25316908-678f-09d0-cad3-c0ba384500ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:25316908-678f-09d0-cad3-c0ba384500ea
msgctxt "hf991c384gc1d7g442cg94a8gb85a6a59cdee"
msgid "I have no interests in whatever delusional beliefs the boy harboured."
msgstr "나는 그 소년이 믿는 망상 따위에는 일절 관심 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 27769e02-82bb-8484-e687-9803fe137347
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_Knows_BoyWasReadingOrpheus = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:27769e02-82bb-8484-e687-9803fe137347
msgctxt "h4f8a4f72g35b2g45cag8139gfd088dd7963f"
msgid "Why was the boy refusing to kill?"
msgstr "왜 그 소년이 죽이길 거부했지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 2783f0a8-2d65-4c9d-914d-517ea81b7b1c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:2783f0a8-2d65-4c9d-914d-517ea81b7b1c
msgctxt "h7ff5dad0ga4f2g4eafg80bega311f0184eac"
msgid ""
"<i>Chk. </i>Do not dare speak of that pustulent <i>poet</i> in my training "
"room."
msgstr "<i>츠크. </i> 감히 내 훈련장에서 그 고름덩어리 <i>시</i>를 입에 담지 마라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 29217c94-34da-b915-ac9a-4f14c56eec17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:29217c94-34da-b915-ac9a-4f14c56eec17
msgctxt "h5d7b9619g66d9g4a0fg9ff6g647251b5fac6"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 2ece10b1-545b-6eda-33e6-6b0b38811889
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:2ece10b1-545b-6eda-33e6-6b0b38811889
msgctxt "ha855fd31g0040g4966g9b70gcd1863f6710b"
msgid ""
"There are signs that the <i>ghaik</i> presence here goes beyond their usual "
"predation. They are converging on <i>something</i>."
msgstr ""
"이곳의 <i>게이크</i> 규모가 일반적인 포식 활동의 범주를 넘어선다는 징후가 포착되고 있다. 놈들이 <i>무언가</i>를 향해 "
"정렬하고 있다는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 2f3be704-dd8a-a972-9fe2-65ea4f0f0fcf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:2f3be704-dd8a-a972-9fe2-65ea4f0f0fcf
msgctxt "h4411a5a4g08f4g4241gbc9fgc9383e4ef44e"
msgid ""
"Their potential may not be apparent to your untrained eye, but my methods "
"never fail to extract it."
msgstr "그들의 잠재력이 네 미숙한 눈에는 보이지 않겠지. 내 방식으로는 놓친 적이 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 36a4c6c5-5de1-dad8-ce79-398ee7733630
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:36a4c6c5-5de1-dad8-ce79-398ee7733630
msgctxt "hdb58f7e9g9af8g4412g91c8g815158a32b9c"
msgid "So we ensure that in our ranks, there are no mistakes."
msgstr "그러니 우리 급 정도 되면 실수가 없도록 확실히 해야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 379b7c2a-7789-8ac5-1dcb-bfb605916242
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Teacher(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BoyKilledByStudent = False
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BoyKilledByTeacher = False
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BoyDead = True
#.   Object:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BoyKilledIntentionallyByPlayer(1) = False
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BoyKilledAccidentallyByPlayer(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Teacher(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:379b7c2a-7789-8ac5-1dcb-bfb605916242
msgctxt "h1a2c1d5ag8a1fg427bgadf3g22585d5700ed"
msgid "Ah, our bloodthirsty interlopers."
msgstr "아, 피에 굶주린 침입자 양반 아니신가."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 3978c15f-415b-ad65-b039-f6348f45fe88
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Teacher(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BoyDead = True
#.   Object:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BoyKilledAccidentallyByPlayer(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Teacher(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:3978c15f-415b-ad65-b039-f6348f45fe88
msgctxt "he3468cdegcdf6g4e02ga5e3g17bc36ec5a49"
msgid "Ah, our bloodthirsty interloper."
msgstr "아, 피에 굶주린 침입자 양반 아니신가."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3ece3e5d-5512-cb4b-3eba-b35edaa00d9c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:3ece3e5d-5512-cb4b-3eba-b35edaa00d9c
msgctxt "haf18cb2cgdcf3g4b81g9f4ag2f28ca3a695c"
msgid ""
"If that boy was a 'taste of Vlaakith's power', I don't have much to worry "
"about."
msgstr "그 소년이 '블라키스 힘의 맛보기'였다면, 난 그다지 염려하지 않는다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3ece3e5d-5512-cb4b-3eba-b35edaa00d9c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:3ece3e5d-5512-cb4b-3eba-b35edaa00d9c
msgctxt "h55951df9g7f26g466fgaa72g55f744193903"
msgid ""
"If that display was a 'taste of Crèche Y'llek's power', I've nothing to "
"worry about."
msgstr "그 과시가 '일레크 양성소 힘의 맛보기'라면, 난 걱정할 게 전혀 없군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 405a424b-c2e0-b1b5-ac77-465c2e357f3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:405a424b-c2e0-b1b5-ac77-465c2e357f3b
msgctxt "h51d5e75egf881g4c8cg94d9g492a3dcb6cd5"
msgid "<i>Vlaakith gha'g shkath zai!</i>"
msgstr "<i>블라키스 가그 슈카스 자이!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4373c8e9-eb08-8ba5-50b5-9f061065d6a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:4373c8e9-eb08-8ba5-50b5-9f061065d6a5
msgctxt "hf8af7fffg91ddg4357gaa54g16901ba430f4"
msgid "I'm curious. Why make them fight to the death?"
msgstr "궁금하군. 왜 죽을 때까지 싸우게 하는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 44a2ad8c-c075-de14-5771-7853249a254d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_Knows_BoyWasReadingOrpheus = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:44a2ad8c-c075-de14-5771-7853249a254d
msgctxt "hbec754d8g4218g4b9dgbb2fgd72f5b692c7b"
msgid "Do you know the boy has been reading about Orpheus?"
msgstr "소년이 오르페우스에 대해 읽은 걸 알고 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 48333b68-c338-38c9-9e1c-7a0a2d45cd99
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:48333b68-c338-38c9-9e1c-7a0a2d45cd99
msgctxt "h46757a29g95b7g4cebg9fc2g6647593c3aeb"
msgid ""
"It is up to them to deliver on this potential. They know the punishment if "
"they fail."
msgstr "이 잠재력을 펼쳐 보이는 것은 그들 손에 달려 있다. 실패하면 처벌 받는다는 사실도 잘 알고 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4b6b60ef-a023-b4ca-e9c1-036d2c2c1d79
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_Knows_BoyWasReadingOrpheus = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:4b6b60ef-a023-b4ca-e9c1-036d2c2c1d79
msgctxt "h97abe0a6ge872g475agb037g2677d1b0d429"
msgid "Why was the boy refusing to fight?"
msgstr "왜 싸우기를 거부하는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 52a29a9f-488a-407b-db2d-b8ba0c2f0bd3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:52a29a9f-488a-407b-db2d-b8ba0c2f0bd3
msgctxt "h4f05c307g0411g416dg8c38g49d23db0ad5c"
msgid ""
"<i>Chk. </i>Your pathetic intervention spoke for itself - only a lesser "
"crèche would indulge such lenience."
msgstr "<i>츠크.</i> 네 한심한 개입은 자명한 일이다. 오직 하급 양성소에서만 그따위 관용이 받아들여지겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 552801c0-fed1-50eb-2d7f-730e6be85d9c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:552801c0-fed1-50eb-2d7f-730e6be85d9c
msgctxt "hd27c390dgcadfg455egbef2ge87ee30c48b7"
msgid ""
"You will learn this first-hand, <i>istik</i>, when we finally come to claim "
"it for our own."
msgstr "우리가 이 차원을 마침내 우리 것으로 선포하게 될 때, <i>이스틱</i>, 너는 이 교육을 몸소 깨닫게 될 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 564f663c-c560-a7b1-a70d-1dae4531868e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:564f663c-c560-a7b1-a70d-1dae4531868e
msgctxt "hefb020a6g9703g4a94gaf07g74d6e7a6cbc3"
msgid ""
"Our warriors must possess strength and skill far superior to any spawned "
"from this putrescent plane."
msgstr "우리의 전사들은이 부패한 차원에서 태어난 어떤 것들보다 압도적인 힘과 기량을 갖추어야 한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 56eb27cd-b3e4-8c62-22d6-ef4a81620eb0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:56eb27cd-b3e4-8c62-22d6-ef4a81620eb0
msgctxt "h4a177740gc1a5g4766g87f9gbce79def7721"
msgid ""
"Every bit of waste I trim away brings us closer to victory against the "
"<i>ghaik</i> infesting these lands."
msgstr "불필요한 부산물을 하나하나 잘라내 치울 때마다 이 땅에 뒤끓는 <i>게이크</i>들에 맞서 승리에 다가가는 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 56ec0e93-f394-282a-cf94-34fb60ffc176
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:56ec0e93-f394-282a-cf94-34fb60ffc176
msgctxt "h41bd9cdagfa3eg42fbga0e4g88db6e10832f"
msgid ""
"I've heard reports that <i>ghaik </i>are operating here on an unprecedented "
"scale. They must not be allowed to gain a foothold."
msgstr "<i>게이크 </i>들이 전례 없는 규모로 모이고 있다고 들었다. 놈들이 발을 딛도록 두어선 안 된다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 5d192c31-d46e-9d55-2071-8708e12f1d85
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:5d192c31-d46e-9d55-2071-8708e12f1d85
msgctxt "hcbebad06gbae1g4a31gab1dg05a1ebd880ee"
msgid "<i>Chk</i>! Not just a coward, but a heretic too."
msgstr "<i>칙</i>! 겁쟁이일 뿐만 아니라 이단자였군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5fdb6b17-0ebd-0690-f1b0-a0d734ddde30
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BoyKilledByTeacher = False
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BoyDead = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:5fdb6b17-0ebd-0690-f1b0-a0d734ddde30
msgctxt "habb7a70eg47acg4f5bg8406ga97d95a7642c"
msgid "The boy was a liability. I did what was necessary."
msgstr "이 녀석은 쓸모없었어. 난 필요한 일을 한 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 664ad82d-ce0b-bafc-9ec4-a41ba34875e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_Knows_BoyWasReadingOrpheus = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:664ad82d-ce0b-bafc-9ec4-a41ba34875e1
msgctxt "h9abff169gc2deg499bgae70gf6a5e0a200b1"
msgid ""
"Does your <i>kith'rak </i>know you tolerate your students reading the "
"Orpheus myths?"
msgstr "너의 수업 중에 제자들이 오르페우스 신화를 배운다는 것을 <i>키스락</i>이 알고 있을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 68f2146d-eaee-6269-542c-48969d4cad43
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:68f2146d-eaee-6269-542c-48969d4cad43
msgctxt "h8bee3d65g3d21g4f6fg904eg68c6d9ce2107"
msgid "I am a humble blade tasked with carving out an army."
msgstr "난 겸손하게 군대를 조각하는 칼날과도 같은 존재지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 6a5173ff-a9d3-567e-e880-a7f0717ffc0c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:6a5173ff-a9d3-567e-e880-a7f0717ffc0c
msgctxt "hff925085gc8a0g4306gbe39gc77393804340"
msgid ""
"I wouldn't expect an <i>istik</i> to understand. On this plane, inadequacy "
"is expected."
msgstr "<i>이스틱</i> 나부랭이는 이해하기 어렵겠지. 이 차원에서는 무능함이 당연하게 여겨지니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 74f05417-50fc-18f7-3fb6-738a2a2dac57
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:74f05417-50fc-18f7-3fb6-738a2a2dac57
msgctxt "h623fa654g9d2ag4a93g81c7gd9e3f7b58f1f"
msgid "Did they do things so differently when you were a hatchling?"
msgstr "네가 새끼일 적에 그들이 뭔가 다른 식으로 대했나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 80ca4686-e35a-581f-2c04-285dac89dccb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:80ca4686-e35a-581f-2c04-285dac89dccb
msgctxt "h2017cc01gbec8g4b5cg911fg242353d14ad4"
msgid ""
"I will find out if Varrl has truly succumbed to the vile canker of that "
"heretic's words."
msgstr "바를이 진정 그 이단자의 격설 속 사악한 구더기에 무릎 꿇었는지 내 직접 알아내야겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 836ce293-137b-7bf7-b10b-3adcd66564d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:836ce293-137b-7bf7-b10b-3adcd66564d3
msgctxt "hf2c664fdg8447g47ebgbf96g2a2956ddaea5"
msgid ""
"The slightest mistake, the smallest hesitation, and you die. The warrior "
"next to you dies. A hundred more behind them."
msgstr "사소한 실수, 작은 망설임에 너는 죽을 것이다. 네 옆의 전사도 죽을 것이며 그 뒤의 백명의 전사들이 더 죽어 나갈 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 884309af-39de-d640-3986-f78f1e2b17c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:884309af-39de-d640-3986-f78f1e2b17c9
msgctxt "h698dcf9agfe9dg4915g8a07ga50754f4b30d"
msgid "The hatchlings live to serve Vlaakith, or they do not live at all."
msgstr "아이들은 블라키스 님께 봉사하기 위해 살아간다. 그게 아니라면 살 가치가 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 891ffc75-e422-3204-d017-1c0b059b21f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:891ffc75-e422-3204-d017-1c0b059b21f0
msgctxt "h897dc6fag2973g4d5dgb549g9ae2481c1771"
msgid ""
"Precisely. The foe he spares may be the one to rise up and tear out your "
"gullet."
msgstr "정확하다. 녀석이 살려둔 적이 일어나서 네 목을 찢을 수도 있었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 8b0d0c41-5a6a-973b-ab3e-8e48b348b751
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:8b0d0c41-5a6a-973b-ab3e-8e48b348b751
msgctxt "h4078ef83g0cbbg41e5g95f3g28c7ea801d8d"
msgid "I do what is necessary, and no worse than our enemies would do."
msgstr "나는 필요한 걸 행할 뿐, 적이라면 더 심한 짓도 했을 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 943b3253-08bb-ad8c-5297-e444b582316e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_DARK_URGE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:943b3253-08bb-ad8c-5297-e444b582316e
msgctxt "h8793f253g8c0eg4505gbdf2gdd2bf409ef6f"
msgid "Cruelty carves cunning. It has made me what I am."
msgstr "잔인함이 교활함을 만들어내지. 그게 지금의 나를 만들었다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 943b3253-08bb-ad8c-5297-e444b582316e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:943b3253-08bb-ad8c-5297-e444b582316e
msgctxt "hde1fed14gf7d2g4993gb5f7g912596c0f225"
msgid "Happy to help. The students didn't seem to be learning much from you."
msgstr "도움이 돼서 기쁘군. 학생들이 별로 배워가는 게 없어 보였는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 951e05dd-470b-030b-7665-8ace92cefcdf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:951e05dd-470b-030b-7665-8ace92cefcdf
msgctxt "hce8f22e1g1d7fg4433g80d5g6c032d1d9401"
msgid ""
"If I am not convinced of his loyalty to our glorious queen, then I will cure "
"him."
msgstr "영광스러운 여왕님에 대한 충성심이 느껴지지 않는다면 내 직접 손보도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = 9fbb216e-dab7-4fb6-f07c-ebe758bc8845
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !()
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:9fbb216e-dab7-4fb6-f07c-ebe758bc8845
msgctxt "h58256775g18fdg452fg8226g699517f2f0c6"
msgid ""
"If the boy was too stupid to realise this, his death is a mercy for the "
"warrior next to him."
msgstr "이것도 모를 정도로 멍청하다면 차라리 죽는 게 동료에게 도움이 될 걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a0adf253-fadf-5f59-ad55-dc614c1da32b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_Knows_BoyWasReadingOrpheus = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:a0adf253-fadf-5f59-ad55-dc614c1da32b
msgctxt "heb043690g9460g4d81g8667g02951c14f418"
msgid "Did you know the boy was a believer in Orpheus?"
msgstr "저 아이가 오르페우스의 신자라는 건 알고 있었나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a49bf2ce-e73a-cbd5-6494-e488b8632f39
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:a49bf2ce-e73a-cbd5-6494-e488b8632f39
msgctxt "h9be38b58g6568g43degbbc0g78af0f5010b2"
msgid ""
"I doubt it matters. Based on what I just saw, your students are a lost cause."
msgstr "상관 없을 걸. 방금 본 대로라면 너의 제자들은 가망이 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a49bf2ce-e73a-cbd5-6494-e488b8632f39
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:a49bf2ce-e73a-cbd5-6494-e488b8632f39
msgctxt "h8d1ed93cg7d30g425dgb69eg4dd61ab0be9b"
msgid "I doubt it will matter. Your hatchlings are not fit to serve Vlaakith."
msgstr "상관 없을 걸. 너의 제자들은 블라키스 여왕을 섬길 자격이 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = aeb049e7-6d90-dc8b-8ed9-c2bae5a99081
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - GITHYANKI(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:aeb049e7-6d90-dc8b-8ed9-c2bae5a99081
msgctxt "h4bcd95b6g3ae3g444dgad47g735d6ddd1cf9"
msgid ""
"The illithids infecting this region are not to be reasoned with. They are to "
"be exterminated."
msgstr "이 일리시드 감염은 이해해야 할 것이 아니고, 제거해야 할 대상이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = aee618a9-c4de-af15-4041-b4a1c3876d64
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Teacher(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BoyDead = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Teacher(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:aee618a9-c4de-af15-4041-b4a1c3876d64
msgctxt "h9ad45131g64fag4743g9b6fgffc8fa01522d"
msgid ""
"What is it? These insufferable interruptions are distracting from my lessons."
msgstr "뭐지? 성가시기 짝이 없는 훼방꾼 때문에 수업에 집중할 수가 없군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = ba3f7e31-ee59-5d80-369f-e6563f32c447
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:ba3f7e31-ee59-5d80-369f-e6563f32c447
msgctxt "h3720f962gf074g49c6gbe27gd44dceb0e500"
msgid ""
"There are whispers of <i>ghaik</i> gathering in unusual numbers nearby. They "
"are not here to <i>negotiate.</i>"
msgstr "<i>게이크</i>의 신봉자들이 심상치 않은 수로 모이고 있다. 당연 <i>협상</i>하러 모이고 있는 것은 아니지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = ba8f8ec3-4e52-8431-996f-9a9a03875001
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:ba8f8ec3-4e52-8431-996f-9a9a03875001
msgctxt "h9180f273gf78cg490egb1dcg6bc63b247767"
msgid ""
"We will eradicate them, <i>ra'stil</i>, and when we do, you will be grateful "
"our warriors are so carefully chosen."
msgstr ""
"그것들을 싸그리 박멸해 버릴 것이다, <i>라스틸</i>, 그땐, 너도 우리의 전사들이 이렇게 나 꼼꼼하게 선택된 것을 고마워 할 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = d1f64184-ee75-dc2a-5d1c-11802b90b17e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:d1f64184-ee75-dc2a-5d1c-11802b90b17e
msgctxt "hbbe5314eg1b1cg425ag9d0dgd8b569c60045"
msgid "Our wars are waged against <i>ghaik</i>, not bandits and petty thieves."
msgstr "우리의 전쟁은 <i>게이크</i>를 상대로 벌이는 중이지, 하찮은 좀도둑이나 산적들이 아니고 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = d72fb565-43be-0812-dbac-4ce95eafe69b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Teacher(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BoyKilledByTeacher = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Teacher(1) = True
#. TagRule: !GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:d72fb565-43be-0812-dbac-4ce95eafe69b
msgctxt "h5ec284bcg9ab3g4595g9ad2g7b3373792cf7"
msgid ""
"Did you enjoy our little demonstration? A mere taste of the power Vlaakith "
"commands."
msgstr "우리의 소소한 시범은 좀 즐거웠던가? 블라키스가 거느리는 힘의 일부분에 지나지 않지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = d72fb565-43be-0812-dbac-4ce95eafe69b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Teacher(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_YouthTraining_State_BoyKilledByTeacher = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CRE_YouthTraining_HasMet_Teacher(1) = True
#. TagRule: GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:d72fb565-43be-0812-dbac-4ce95eafe69b
msgctxt "hd0d1c389g5162g491ega0b3gcabdc0a29d9a"
msgid ""
"Did you enjoy our little demonstration? A mere taste of the power Crèche "
"Y'llek commands."
msgstr "우리의 소소한 시범은 좀 즐거웠던가? 우리 일레크 양성소가 거느리는 힘의 일부분에 지나지 않지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = da9e345f-16a6-a0c3-2afb-fcc32b95daae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:da9e345f-16a6-a0c3-2afb-fcc32b95daae
msgctxt "h9c09467dg6604g4150g8a07g9f0a8aff70db"
msgid "The name pollutes the very air expelled in its uttering."
msgstr "그 이름을 소리 내어 부르면 뱉는 공기마저 더럽히지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dd44cf6d-9069-2d2e-53f3-9ec25bb3c7fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:dd44cf6d-9069-2d2e-53f3-9ec25bb3c7fe
msgctxt "hb7efdc52g761fg49b9g85b6g3504cb37b18d"
msgid "Vlaakith would delight in your ruthlessness here, I'm sure."
msgstr "블라키스께선 네 무자비함을 좋아하시겠군, 정말로."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = e1a0af0e-bd6b-9bb4-609b-9ef78e6fd610
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:e1a0af0e-bd6b-9bb4-609b-9ef78e6fd610
msgctxt "hf72d5ab3g8196g453dgbad2gf55207713ccc"
msgid ""
"There should be plenty of heads for my students to take when their final "
"test begins."
msgstr "마지막 시험이 시작되면 나의 학생들이 베어낼 머리통들로 넘쳐 날 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e820e605-bacc-3e3f-5bab-85c733bfcd44
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:e820e605-bacc-3e3f-5bab-85c733bfcd44
msgctxt "h46f813d2g811cg40ccgb832g30825be7fc6c"
msgid "Are your 'demonstrations' usually so fatal?"
msgstr "너의 그 '시범' 이라는 건 항상 이렇게 잔인한가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = f05b400e-c06c-ca88-4a37-8455e26cdc91
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:f05b400e-c06c-ca88-4a37-8455e26cdc91
msgctxt "h740de0d6ge8cbg4b4ag8f04ga40543bdf998"
msgid "I hear they have been gathering nearby in greater numbers than usual."
msgstr "그것들이 평소보다 훨씬 많은 수로 모이기 시작했다는 건 들었다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f1067271-5546-91f7-0af0-f68015a7acd4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:f1067271-5546-91f7-0af0-f68015a7acd4
msgctxt "hec7b2124g4aaag4627ga7c7gad89d418a68c"
msgid "Your 'demonstration' was reprehensible."
msgstr "너의 그 '시범'이라는 건 가만 놔둘 수 없군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene
#. Speaker = Sa'varsh Kethk
#. NodeID = fcd04cf3-acb8-f23a-99d9-05f9133d9a15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/CRE_YouthTraining_TeacherAfterBoyScene:fcd04cf3-acb8-f23a-99d9-05f9133d9a15
msgctxt "h292038e8ge62cg4607gbb15ga2b4c13ee2dd"
msgid ""
"A ridiculous notion. No student of mine would be permitted to indulge such "
"heresies."
msgstr "헛소리로군. 내 학생은 그딴 이단에 빠질 수 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/ORI_Laezel_AD_FightOutOfTheCreche
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 17f4eba3-6365-99dd-dba8-25dd83516e27
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/ORI_Laezel_AD_FightOutOfTheCreche:17f4eba3-6365-99dd-dba8-25dd83516e27
msgctxt "h454c0a3egedf2g4bc3g8d81g6b141a30dc0a"
msgid "<i>Tsk'va</i> - my own people seek my head."
msgstr "<i>츠크바</i> - 내 동족들이 내 목숨을 노리다니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/ORI_Laezel_AD_FightOutOfTheCreche
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = acc5f4cf-9020-633e-f276-a2bd969b197a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/ORI_Laezel_AD_FightOutOfTheCreche:acc5f4cf-9020-633e-f276-a2bd969b197a
msgctxt "hd1078e4eg1668g4ef1ga9e0g60157fc4a833"
msgid "If they will not see sense, then bleed them dry!"
msgstr "말이 통하지 않는다면, 피를 흘리는 수 밖에!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/ORI_Laezel_AD_FightOutOfTheCreche
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = ebbdfb44-6880-125d-7396-1faedc035aea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_GithInfirmary_State_UsedDevice = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act1b/UpperCreche/ORI_Laezel_AD_FightOutOfTheCreche:ebbdfb44-6880-125d-7396-1faedc035aea
msgctxt "h4a7e60f4gfe9eg477bg953eg20571f97bfe8"
msgid "To the <i>zaith'isk</i>. To the cure!"
msgstr "<i>제이트이스크</i>로. 치료를 위해서!"
